#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c61a7d6c-d414-4921-a81d-483c1b5ddf25"
msgid "\"Of course. To beauty!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지. 아름다움을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d1460d82-2dc2-42cc-b3c8-35006c6429c5"
msgid "\"Of course. To my success.\""
msgstr "\"물론이지. 내 성공을 위하여\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "801c27c9-ffe5-4a7d-9204-99fbf2ee64be"
msgid ""
"\"I have yet to become a baron{mf||ess}, and already it seems that someone "
"wishes to poison me...\""
msgstr "\"아직 남작이 된 것도 아닌데, 벌써부터 날 독살하려는 자가 있는 듯하군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "187c4180-ad56-411f-b5af-92cee58a8280"
msgid "\"Do you want to get right to business?\""
msgstr "\"바로 본론으로 넘어가는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "38d90c76-2de8-4926-b335-da641632779a"
msgid ""
"\"No need to apologize – I don't expect everyone I meet to immediately fall "
"under my charms and entrust me with all their secrets!\""
msgstr "\"사과할 필요 없어. 만나는 사람마다 내 매력에 흠뻑 빠져서 자기 사연을 털어놓으려고 하면 곤란할 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "8cd5c219-978a-4501-9b17-2ee57624618d"
msgid "\"Apology accepted. What did you want to tell me?\""
msgstr "\"사과를 받아들이지. 내게 무슨 얘기를 하고 싶은 거였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b54a642d-e9c5-42a1-a680-2001557d1ea5"
msgid ""
"\"You've shown your duplicity once. I don't want to have anything further to "
"do with you.\""
msgstr "\"아무래도 넌 다른 마음을 품고 있는 것 같아. 너랑은 더 이상 엮이고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "2cdaf194-fa54-4fa5-bc5c-90d2e499f803"
msgid ""
"\"First I will listen to what you have to say, and then I will decide what "
"to think of your repentance.\""
msgstr "\"일단 얘기해봐. 사과를 받아줄지는 그때 결정하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "3f0d5ecc-c0a8-4865-abaf-50dcb709c47c"
msgid "\"It sounds tempting, but I'll need to think about it.\""
msgstr "\"솔깃하지만, 한번 생각해 봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "c7e0d56b-dfe3-48bd-ab1b-f69adb2bfe8a"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me if your promises are not reassuring. I've no wish to have "
"anything more to do with you.\""
msgstr "\"네 말을 믿기가 쉽지 않네. 너와 함께하긴 어렵겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "c48830f3-c83e-47e9-a160-d8e76a8673e3"
msgid "\"What could be better than a treasure hunt? I'm ready!\""
msgstr "\"보물찾기 좋지. 난 준비됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a2ed5438-1887-4353-9cf1-80c883048c6d"
msgid ""
"{n}You see {d|Kaessi}Kaessi{/d} approaching – the tiefling you met during "
"the battle at Jamandi Aldori's mansion. As she draws near, she places one of "
"the cups of wine she's holding into your hand.{/n} \"Will you drink with me?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 자만디 알도리의 저택에서 만났던 티플링 {d|Kaessi}카에시{/d}가 다가오는 것을 봅니다. 그녀는 와인 두 잔을 들고 "
"와서는, 한 잔을 당신의 손에 건네줍니다.{/n} \"나와 한 잔 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "76650ab7-8033-42a9-b844-dda381d8c425"
msgid ""
"{n}Kaessi smiles and taps her cup to yours.{/n} \"To beauty! It sweetens our "
"happy days, and brings solace to our dark and sorrowful ones...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카에시는 미소를 지으며 가볍게 잔을 부딪혀 건배합니다.{/n} \"아름다움을 위하여! 아름다움이야말로 행복한 나날을 더욱 달콤하게 "
"만들어주고, 어둡고 슬플 때에는 한 줄기 빛을 더해 주지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b1cfb20c-3e29-4374-bbe3-a5f51914611f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes!\" {n}Kaessi salutes you with her cup.{/n} \"There's no wine in the "
"world that tastes as rich as victory. But still, there's nothing wrong in "
"cheering your successes with wine.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아!\" {n}카에시는 당신과 건배합니다.{/n} \"승리의 깊은 맛에 비할 바는 못되더라도, 축배로 마시는 와인이 떫지는 않을테니."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c143bcfd-44de-4521-8865-68176ae00729"
msgid ""
"\"I'd say you like to walk a straight road, and keep away from roundabouts..."
"\""
msgstr "\"돌려 말하는 것 보다는 직설적인 걸 좋아하시는구만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "b022b341-e72f-474b-a079-4287e80a1368"
msgid ""
"\"You insult me with such suspicions! Only a very foolish poisoner would "
"offer a cup of death with their own hand – and right here, for all to see! "
"If I wished to poison you, I'd surely do it secretly... and with grace.\" {n}"
"Kaessi smiles coyly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나를 바보로 보는거야? 바보가 아니고서야 독이 든 잔을 직접 주겠어? 모두가 보고 있는데! 너를 독살하려 했다면 아주 비밀스럽고... "
"우아하게 했겠지.\" {n}카에시는 싱긋 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b7dea00a-fa06-47df-8e89-324e9f14ae34"
msgid ""
"\"But jokes aside.\" {n}Kaessi stops smiling.{/n} \"I came to... apologize. "
"I know – the words I said in our conversation with Lady Aldori might have "
"offended you, but this was not my intention. The lessons life has dealt me "
"were not easy. I've learned to be wary of new acquaintances – which is why I "
"refused to join your party. I hope you will forgive me for this weakness, "
"and for my harsh words. And I hope you will hear me out – for I have "
"something to tell you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담은 그만하고.\" {n}카에시는 웃음을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"사과할 게 있어. 이전에 알도리와 얘기를 나눌 때, 네 기분을 상하게 "
"해서 미안해. 하지만 고의가 아니었어. 살다 보니 뼈저린 교훈을 얻었거든. 처음 보는 사람을 조심하라는 교훈을 말이야. 그래서 네 초대를 "
"거절했던 거야. 부디 용서해 줘. 무례하게 굴어서 미안해. 그리고 네게 말해줄 게 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "10f1f8fc-bdd0-47d6-8ef4-148f97b622c0"
msgid ""
"\"As it happens, I came across some very valuable information. What brave "
"conqueror of these wild lands wouldn't be intrigued by news of an ancient "
"shrine – possibly full of great treasures? A place such as this was "
"discovered by my old friends from {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g}, and it just so "
"happens to be located in the lands that today become rightfully yours. My "
"friends lack the courage to enter the shrine and seek the treasure. But what "
"will stop us? We, who know the taste of battle, and have been singed by the "
"same fire?\" {n}Kaessi stops, looking at you expectantly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아주 공교롭게도, 정말 귀중한 정보를 가져왔어. 이 야생의 땅을 정복한 용감한 용사님께서 보물이 가득할 것 같은 고대의 신전을 그냥 "
"지나칠 리가 없을 거 아냐? {g|Qadira}카디라{/g}의 내 옛 친구들이 우연히 네 땅에 그런 곳을 발견해서 알려주더라고. 내 "
"친구들은 그런 험지를 탐험하고 보물을 찾을만한 용기가 없었어. 하지만 우리라면 다르지 않을까? 싸우는 법도 알고, 같은 불길 속을 "
"지나왔잖아.\" {n}카에시는 말을 멈추고 기대하듯 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "e8eed487-e138-4220-9bc8-8dd1281ec74e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kaessi bites her lip, preparing to argue, but then shakes her head.{/n} "
"\"Well, it's your decision. Farewell, {name}! May the crown on your head not "
"become a heavy burden.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카에시는 입술을 깨물고 무언가 항변하려는 것 같았지만, 이내 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"그게 네 결정이라면. 안녕히. "
"{name}! 네 머리의 왕관이 짐이 되지 않기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a4e918ad-f50b-43e6-8c9c-1e6f345baf73"
msgid "\"Fair enough. Then listen...\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 들어봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "5c0a9995-13ae-4e8c-a1bc-e13d7ae15232"
msgid ""
"{n}Kaessi looks down at her cup for a moment.{/n} \"How amusing. – Usually, "
"those who don't seek affection are the very ones who receive it... Anyway, "
"enough sweet talk. There is something important I wanted to tell you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카에시는 잠시 자신의 잔으로 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"기쁘네. 보통 호의나 애정은 그걸 갈망하지 않는 자의 손에 쥐어지기 "
"마련인데 말이야... 어쨌든, 달콤한 얘기는 충분해. 너에게 할 중요한 얘기가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "e28f3f1b-c786-47dd-8590-c9bde7c31122"
msgid ""
"{n}Kaessi laughs quietly, fiddling with her cup.{/n} \"I'm sure you'd like "
"to finally gain your official title and celebrate your victory. And I don't "
"like noisy parties and ceremonies... Find me when you return to your "
"dominion. I'll rent a house in your capital. We can discuss the details of "
"our expedition there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카에시가 자기 잔을 만지작거리며 조용히 웃었습니다.{/n} \"너도 빨리 작위를 손에 넣고 승리를 만끽하고 싶겠지. 나 역시 "
"시끄러운 잔치나 행사는 질색이고... 영지로 복귀하면 그때 만나자. 수도에 집을 하나 구해 놓을 테니. 자세한 내용은 거기서 상의하자고."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "e37f1b20-d6a4-4852-bb98-4c9c6239e2f3"
msgid ""
"\"Your caution is reasonable. Well, I'm going to visit the capital of your "
"newborn barony anyway. I might rent a house. Find me there if you decide "
"you're interested in my offer!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 조심하는 것도 당연해. 뭐, 난 새로운 남작령의 수도를 방문할 예정이야. 집도 하나 빌릴 것 같으니까, 내 제안에 관심이 생기면 "
"거기서 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Baronation/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "9fd23bf5-23ab-4924-81af-24371aea8f80"
msgid ""
"\"So long, {name}. I'll call you by your name today – because soon enough "
"all you'll be hearing is 'Your Grace, Your Grace, Your Grace'!\" {n}Saluting "
"you with the cup, the tiefling girl steps back and disappears in the shadows "
"between the columns.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"안녕. {name}. 오늘만 이름으로 불러드릴게. 앞으로는 계속 '남작님, 남작님, 남작님' 소리를 듣고 살 테니까 말이야!\" {n}"
"잔을 들고 티플링은 건배하고는 한걸음 물러서서 기둥 사이의 어둠 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "db4c3996-78f8-41ad-a25f-e29aae3fce52"
msgid "\"I'd like to ask you a few questions about your past.\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 묻고 싶은 것이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7e1650d1-8e0e-4623-9990-d27238ac3fc6"
msgid "\"I wanted to talk to you about what it means to be a tiefling...\""
msgstr "\"티플링으로 사는 건 어떤 기분인지 궁금해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "fdef0775-8003-4866-a8cf-2d49f372cbf4"
msgid "\"Tell me about Qadira.\""
msgstr "\"카디라에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "faad02e2-4624-4234-a205-c075a3bb7988"
msgid "\"I'd like to talk to your sister.\""
msgstr "\"네 자매와 이야기하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c0319544-51e5-4501-857b-b8b643fa4501"
msgid "\"I have to go. So long, Kalikke!\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야겠어. 안녕, 칼리케!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "720b7359-02e6-405a-b09f-4555edf96552"
msgid "\"You know, the Forefather came to talk to me.\""
msgstr "\"선조라는 자가 나를 만나러 왔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e823a353-1899-4871-8568-c97bc674fb43"
msgid ""
"\"I won't let anyone hurt you. We'll deal with the beast if it shows up.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 널 건드리지 못할 거야. 영혼 포식자가 나타나면 나도 함께 싸우겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "6d3a9c5f-4f8c-4d8f-9067-29144293e9d7"
msgid "\"I do. The horns and the tail. They make you special.\""
msgstr "\"뿔이랑 꼬리, 둘 다 마음에 들어. 너한테 아주 잘 어울리거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "28c6cc32-fb70-4fdc-a759-daeeb0f36ae8"
msgid "\"I want to ask you a few questions about your past.\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 묻고 싶은 것이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "cbb88f99-ec4f-46a6-87fe-36d5a778ecac"
msgid "\"I want to talk to you about what it means to be a tiefling.\""
msgstr "\"티플링으로 사는 건 어떤지 얘기를 나눠보고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "8703c6ae-be3a-434c-9774-2a8243ede757"
msgid "\"Tell me about Qadira.\""
msgstr "\"카디라에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fc58d219-479c-4f8d-ac64-fa762fdd708d"
msgid "Told Kanerah that you would never listen to the denizen of Hell."
msgstr "당신은 카네라에게 지옥의 주민이 하는 얘기에는 관심 없다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "c8c2ce52-af65-4856-b5f3-c3e68ac643d3"
msgid "\"Do you really think I'd listen to a spawn of Hell?\""
msgstr "\"내가 지옥의 하수인 말을 믿을 거 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "160c04a7-74ed-4c8e-9355-018c8bb2b1ea"
msgid "\"Let's talk about how you are now.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 묻고 싶어\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f7b1968f-caf2-421f-9102-bc52dda6f2fc"
msgid "\"I'd like to talk to your sister.\""
msgstr "\"네 자매와 이야기하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "10c3b48d-e3a2-43a6-8ff5-f8ae037cb803"
msgid "\"How did you end up living 'in turns'?\""
msgstr "\"몸을 공유하며 사는 건 어떤 기분이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "bcc27fc2-28be-4f18-8add-e29b136ea907"
msgid "\"Thank you for the conversation, Kanerah. So long!\""
msgstr "\"대화해줘서 고마워. 카네라. 또 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "59617af3-ca3f-4d3e-98fd-6cefb5cf1794"
msgid "\"Tell me the story of you and your sister – from the beginning.\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매 얘기를 해줘. 처음부터.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "c5953372-0bff-49ef-985a-2bcf581078cc"
msgid "\"What was it like, living disguised as aasimars?\""
msgstr "\"아시마르로 가장하고 살아보니 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "3ff8f554-7127-4a2e-aeb0-7a0d61298b1e"
msgid "\"How did you end up at Jamandi's mansion?\""
msgstr "\"어쩌다 자만디의 저택에 오게 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0029_yavse_Text_String
msgctxt "1463758e-eb5b-4e5d-a380-90fc475be9dd"
msgid "\"I found out what I wanted, thank you.\""
msgstr "\"궁금한 건 다 물어봤어. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "48da0e30-e1fa-4420-923c-604598cc1524"
msgid "\"How do tieflings come into the world?\""
msgstr "\"티플링은 어떻게 이 세계에 오게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "d6d52ca3-88ab-4478-af22-52f0593228aa"
msgid "\"Tell me the story of you and your sister. From the beginning.\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매에 대해 말해줘. 처음부터.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "538211bd-90a6-43a5-81be-62cd90dda9e7"
msgid "\"What was it like, living disguised as aasimars?\""
msgstr "\"아시마르의 삶은 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "743b5e81-0cc5-4e3b-9d8e-a1efd771a13d"
msgid "\"What happened at Jamandi's mansion?\""
msgstr "\"어쩌다 자만디의 저택에 오게 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "d8c0ddd7-fe4e-486d-9f9e-8801f589ec3e"
msgid "\"How does 'living in turns' with your sister work?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 식으로 자매와 몸을 공유하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "7fcdeff8-93e9-45ec-9881-684b61c887fd"
msgid "\"Do you worship Nethys? Tell me about him.\""
msgstr "\"네서스를 믿어? 네서스에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "ebfea94f-060a-4ac6-a367-578821746241"
msgid "\"Tell me about how you were resurrected.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 부활하게 됐는지 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "7afb8122-90cf-4ff4-bd0a-6adc77327fe3"
msgid "\"I'd like to know more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 더 알고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "31bbab94-a6a8-488f-8438-765b309cf224"
msgid "\"I have no more questions about this.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "25e80ed4-643d-4424-81e4-260bc935c0e1"
msgid "\"What made you flee Qadira?\""
msgstr "\"왜 카디라에서 도망쳤지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "7524d937-501e-4f98-b64c-70bbffc4f686"
msgid "\"How are tieflings born?\""
msgstr "\"티플링은 어떻게 태어나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "34d904cb-fd5a-44b8-9b74-5689e8dbc804"
msgid "\"Which outsider do you and your sister descend from?\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매는 어떤 외차원체의 혈통을 물려받은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "49fc6e70-acca-4614-92da-2cc00263fb95"
msgid "\"Tell me about your sister.\""
msgstr "\"네 자매에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "5910540f-1bcd-4881-887a-0db078de8e8e"
msgid "\"Everything is clear, thank you.\""
msgstr "\"잘 들었어. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "97e3d773-0087-4058-a554-97e12830a689"
msgid ""
"\"Many think that evil literally runs in tiefling blood, owing to the "
"heritage of their ancestors...\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 티플링이 악마의 피를 물려받았기 때문에 사악할 수밖에 없다고 생각해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "edc11238-7e3e-4129-aa75-cb68ca0d4256"
msgid "\"Tell me about your sister.\""
msgstr "\"네 자매에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "49a5a5f7-0b4b-4039-8c2d-7d31e0301eea"
msgid "\"I never wish to see you or your sister in my dominions again.\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매를 다시는 내 영토에서 보고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0093_Text
msgctxt "415f623d-2033-4025-a22b-b901c8e6b9e1"
msgid "\"Yes. Leave!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 떠나줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "d16304bd-b3f8-4d34-93e5-f08705177879"
msgid "\"I might have spoken in haste.\""
msgstr "\"내가 경솔했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "00fe9365-9e93-42c2-969a-47233a4cae9c"
msgid "\"I want you to leave my lands.\""
msgstr "\"내 땅을 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "39aeb630-85c9-474e-9166-442784d92196"
msgid "\"Yes. Leave.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "ce84ed6d-21c3-4e7c-8380-a27622d45f80"
msgid "\"On second thought, no. You can stay.\""
msgstr "\"다시 생각해 봤는데, 그냥 이곳에 남아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "9f5c4333-5ad7-40fd-a7e0-539218aad33e"
msgid ""
"\"Who is this 'illusionist' who Kanerah called upon to change your "
"appearance?\""
msgstr "\"너희 모습을 바꾸기 위해 카네라가 소환했다는 일루저니스트는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0115_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "70b4aef4-5380-45dd-9bd4-14ec72e0634c"
msgid "Showed compassion for Kalikke without taking anyone's side."
msgstr "누군가의 편을 들기보다, 칼리케에게 연민을 표했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0115_Text
msgctxt "b379a77e-d0a9-4f14-8200-29c5727bf4d2"
msgid "\"I sympathize with both of you.\""
msgstr "\"두 사람 다 힘든 일을 겪었구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0116_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "77de218b-c248-4bbc-8384-550316f8adcc"
msgid "Approved Kalikke's decision to save her friends no matter what."
msgstr "친구를 구한 칼리케의 결정에 동의했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0116_Text
msgctxt "bb2d4dd5-2107-4c8c-96cb-86d801649243"
msgid ""
"\"Don't blame yourself! How could you sit at home, knowing that your friends "
"would be captured and dragged to a torture chamber?\""
msgstr "\"자책하지 마! 친구들이 잡혀가 고문당할 수도 있는데, 어떻게 가만히 집에만 앉아 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0117_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "13062df2-7e9d-48f5-9512-a0cb182a7953"
msgid ""
"Didn't approve Kalikke's decision to save her friends, at the risk of her "
"sister's life."
msgstr "친구를 구하기 위해 언니를 위험에 빠트린 칼리케의 결정에 동의하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "6ad3dc55-c761-4cad-b358-5298c97c91e8"
msgid ""
"\"How could you put the life and safety of your sister at risk? – For a "
"bunch of trouble-makers, of all things.\""
msgstr "\"언니가 위험해질지도 모르는데, 너는 말썽이나 부리는 친구들을 구하러 간 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0118_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3dfc0a2f-24e4-405a-8fa1-49a998594be2"
msgid ""
"Concluded that Kanerah's and Kalikke's troubles were caused by their "
"inability to compromise."
msgstr "카네라와 칼리케의 다툼은 서로 양보할 줄 모르는 두 사람의 성격 탓이라고 결론지었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0118_Text
msgctxt "5ef5b5f0-bbf8-4236-a2cf-c8210a3ae732"
msgid ""
"\"You and your sister seem to have done everything you could to destroy each "
"other's lives. All this could have been avoided, if only you were able to "
"agree.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서로의 삶을 망가뜨리지 못해 안달이었구나. 상대방 입장을 조금이라도 이해해보지 그랬어. 그럼 이런 비극까진 일어나지 않았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0119_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3cdaa3cd-a824-48b4-8db8-c566ce3343c9"
msgid ""
"Disapproved of Kalikke's decision to save her friends, considering it "
"foolish."
msgstr "당신은 친구를 구한 칼리케의 결정이 어리석다고 생각하여, 못마땅한 기색을 보였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0119_Text
msgctxt "835dd99a-3e7e-44ef-822b-1e4600bf72c1"
msgid ""
"\"It's hard to imagine a more foolish act. It's a sad outcome, but quite "
"predictable.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 멍청하기도 힘든데. 슬프지만 충분히 예상 가능했던 결말이잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0130_Text
msgctxt "dd6ca34c-08b9-4fbc-833f-f47f1c35a675"
msgid ""
"\"You had me racking my brains! A girl shows up, acting like she wants to be "
"my friend – and the next moment turns her nose up like she's seeing me for "
"the first time...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그때 나도 머리 속이 온통 혼란스러웠지. 갑자기 나타나서 나와 친구가 되고 싶은 것처럼 행동하더니만, 바로 잠시 뒤에는 생전 처음 "
"보는 사람인 것처럼 굴었으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0131_Text
msgctxt "4ba2f355-0deb-4e8f-a1a6-ad0ab3557840"
msgid ""
"\"It was clear from the very beginning that something was up with 'Kaessi'.\""
msgstr "\"확실히 '카에시'는 척 보기에도 어딘가 사연 있는 사람 같았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0138_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f8358fc4-78bf-496f-8ce5-bb0d20a6a9bc"
msgid ""
"Stated that Kanerah's idea to enter a contract with a devil was unacceptable."
msgstr "데블과 계약을 맺는다는 카네라의 발상은 받아들이기 어렵다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0138_Text
msgctxt "aa550aed-d102-47d1-8347-048773a44159"
msgid "\"A contract with a devil?! That cannot stand.\""
msgstr "\"데블과 계약을 맺는다고? 그럴 수는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0139_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d8340ea1-d797-4733-99a3-3e01492891a3"
msgid ""
"Agreed that Kanerah's deal with the devil was partly validated by the "
"injustice that tieflings must face."
msgstr "티플링이 살면서 숱하게 겪는 부당한 대우를 감안하면, 카네라가 데블과 계약을 맺은 심정을 이해할 수 있다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0139_Text
msgctxt "62de1b69-737c-40c4-b84c-706c9019d10d"
msgid ""
"\"You tried to fix an injustice that came upon you as a curse from the "
"cradle. That can be understood and forgiven.\""
msgstr "\"평생 저주처럼 따라붙던 부당한 차별에서 벗어나려고 한 일이었잖아. 충분히 이해할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0140_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cdfc4187-17c5-4c4d-8deb-9cdaa1c42395"
msgid "Didn't judge Kanerah's decision to make a deal with a devil."
msgstr "데블과 계약을 맺기로 한 카네라의 결정을 긍정하지도, 부정하지도 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0140_Text
msgctxt "be273ddc-c7c3-4592-ad9b-f952a48a3687"
msgid "\"No one is inherently good or evil. Only our intentions are.\""
msgstr "\"우리의 본성은 선하지도, 악하지도 않아. 선악은 우리의 의지에 달린 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0141_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a2f7fcfc-c5ec-4d05-972e-a5ad40a8ce44"
msgid ""
"Deemed acceptable Kanerah's decision to make a contract with a devil, "
"considering the benefits it might bring."
msgstr "데블과 계약해서 얻는 이점이 있으니 카네라의 결정은 납득이 간다고 생각했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0141_Text
msgctxt "a28ae5df-4145-41bd-a1b7-0cc651021a38"
msgid "\"I hope you made the most of that contract. That's what matters.\""
msgstr "\"그 계약을 최대한 활용하길 바라. 그게 중요한 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0158_Text
msgctxt "8bbd3531-8bab-47db-b169-bb8f0064fb8e"
msgid "\"I found out what I wanted, thank you!'"
msgstr "\"내가 원하는 걸 알아냈어. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0160_Text
msgctxt "e852030b-3cf2-4d77-9de0-48fa567e299b"
msgid "\"How do you live with these switches?\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 둘의 인격이 바뀌면서 살아가는 삶은 어떻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0162_Text
msgctxt "0878c92b-1aff-42de-8f27-155c9a2c4e54"
msgid "\"Do you like it in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅은 마음에 들어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0165_Text
msgctxt "e4cfec02-1b85-4267-8086-57449a8081c4"
msgid "\"I found a piece of paper with your poems...\""
msgstr "\"네가 쓴 시를 발견했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0168_Text
msgctxt "0c9d6924-6ea0-45c0-98cd-7f79b9cbbefb"
msgid "\"You really aren't a good poet.\""
msgstr "\"시가 썩 좋지는 않네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0169_Text
msgctxt "01cb82c1-b960-44c7-a05d-576702bab08e"
msgid ""
"\"I think your poems beautiful. Do you mind if I read them from time to time?"
"\""
msgstr "\"시가 참 아름다워. 가끔 내가 읽어봐도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0170_Text
msgctxt "a339c5ad-4825-4900-91cf-8d0056df4f1d"
msgid "\"Does Kanerah read them?\""
msgstr "\"카네라가 시를 읽었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0174_Text
msgctxt "f9c6efda-b169-4c5e-89ae-188332a61bfc"
msgid "\"What was the agreement you made with the devil?\""
msgstr "\"데블과 무엇을 계약했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0178_Text
msgctxt "153ed0b3-fa6f-4bc5-8f25-f6af4298f217"
msgid "\"What assignments did the devil give you?\""
msgstr "\"데블이 네게 준 임무는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0184_Text
msgctxt "ade2dca6-49cb-48f8-99b8-54ef04f91ed5"
msgid "\"How does it work, your 'living in turns'?\""
msgstr "\"'자매랑 몸을 공유' 한다는 거, 어떤 원리야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0185_Text
msgctxt "7b655793-c371-4c35-af3f-2ea3010697b0"
msgid "\"Do you like it in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅은 마음에 들어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0188_Text
msgctxt "e26871f4-cd3a-4400-82d2-bc96627101d0"
msgid "\"That road led you to me. And I must admit, I'm glad it did...\""
msgstr "\"그 여정은 너를 내게로 이끌었어. 솔직히 말하면, 나도 이렇게 되어 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0189_Text
msgctxt "6cc809fe-c145-44f5-8a1f-0f20bbdcf6a5"
msgid "\"May it be a road of joy from now on!\""
msgstr "\"앞으로는 기쁨의 여정이 되기를 바랄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0190_Text
msgctxt "8296aa58-e343-46a6-92a6-48ac27782291"
msgid ""
"\"Enough sighing for the old days. There are more meaningful ways to spend "
"your energy.\""
msgstr "\"옛날 일로 한숨은 이제 그만 쉬어. 그럴 힘이 있으면 더 의미있는 일에 써야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0194_Text
msgctxt "e90d4463-2acd-4885-bcab-c176e432acdc"
msgid ""
"\"Why did you decide to remain in my lands? After you found and activated "
"the relic, you could have left...\""
msgstr "\"왜 내 땅에 남기로 했지? 유물을 발견하고 작동시킨 뒤에는 떠날 수도 있었을 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0196_Text
msgctxt "0f993c8c-a0de-4537-a825-b158fa215588"
msgid "\"Tell me, what made you stay here after we found your relic?\""
msgstr "\"말해봐. 유물을 찾은 후 왜 여기에 남기로 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0199_Text
msgctxt "fad80a58-2a68-479d-9e62-26935fbd125e"
msgid "\"And why, I wonder, should I protect you?\""
msgstr "\"그런데 왜 내가 널 보호해줘야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0202_Text
msgctxt "926aa10a-58df-4b0b-8c6e-5b8d804966f6"
msgid "\"You can rely on me. We'll find a way to deal with that devil.\""
msgstr "\"날 믿어. 데블과의 문제도 해결할 방법을 찾을 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0203_Text
msgctxt "cd69afc9-9c7e-4e03-8e89-e6f30604d3e6"
msgid ""
"\"It's very arrogant to think I'm going to jump at a chance to protect you.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 보호해 줄 거라고 생각하다니 거만하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0206_Text
msgctxt "9eca02fd-86a8-4dec-8919-80590f0a601c"
msgid ""
"\"The lives of my companions is more to me than can be expressed in words. I "
"will try to help you.\""
msgstr "\"동료의 삶이 얼마나 중요한지는 말할 것도 없지. 내가 도와줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0208_Text
msgctxt "3a3360fc-d55d-4f0a-8421-d8e28e51e91d"
msgid ""
"\"I have important news for you – the devil known as the Forefather came to "
"me...\""
msgstr "\"중요한 소식이 있어. 자기가 선조라는 데블이 왔었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0211_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "167eb778-ea29-444b-830c-f21121b7c462"
msgid "Told Kalikke that you would never listen to the denizen of Hell."
msgstr "당신은 칼리케에게 지옥에 속한 종족의 말에는 귀 기울이지 않겠다고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0211_Text
msgctxt "697f3736-5765-40d8-b5fb-b8bdb5694c59"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't even listen to the wretch! Unfortunately, he escaped with his "
"life.\""
msgstr "\"그 따위 말은 귀담아들을 가치도 없지! 그놈이 살아서 도망쳤다는 게 아쉬울 뿐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0212_Text
msgctxt "f09851b8-605a-4b5b-8e75-468a59a4a526"
msgid ""
"\"He wants you and I to go to the barrens to deal with the soul eater who "
"killed Kanerah. He says he's ready to help.\""
msgstr "\"놈은 우리 둘이 황야로 가서 카네라를 살해했던 영혼 포식자를 끝장내라고 하더군. 자기가 도와줄 테니 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0213_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0ba0e513-6e47-4f11-88ef-4a718757f219"
msgid "Accepted the devil's offer to save Kanerah and Kalikke."
msgstr "카네라와 칼리케를 구해주겠다는 데블의 제안을 받아들였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0213_Text
msgctxt "f8dc8337-699c-4409-8d64-f4236623a2cd"
msgid ""
"\"He offered his help against the soul eater who killed Kanerah. I'd rather "
"not deal with such a creature, but I fear for your lives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"선조는 카네라를 살해했던 영혼 포식자와 맞서 싸울 수 있게 도와주겠다고 했어. 나도 그런 괴물을 상대하긴 싫지만, 가만히 있다가는 두 "
"사람이 목숨을 잃을까 두려워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0216_Text
msgctxt "e72656f7-da00-459e-a450-33195c356108"
msgid "\"He offered his help against the soul eater that's hunting you.\""
msgstr "\"그는 너희를 추적하는 영혼 포식자와 싸울 수 있게 도와주겠다고 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0217_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3f8489ef-0b04-4162-b3df-ca6c45b7e5c3"
msgid ""
"Stated that any means are acceptable if the reward is reasonable — even "
"accepting a devil's bargain."
msgstr "결과만 만족스럽다면 어떤 방법도, 심지어는 데블과의 계약도 괜찮다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0217_Text
msgctxt "578621d2-8153-4e09-9ef7-0af177b1b9c9"
msgid ""
"\"He wants to help us get rid of the soul eater that's hunting you. We "
"should take whatever advantage of the situation we can, no matter what "
"methods we have to use.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 너희를 쫓는 영혼 포식자를 없애도록 도와주겠다는군. 우리는 수단과 방법을 가리지 않고 최대한 이 상황을 이용해야 할 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0218_Text
msgctxt "c658a9a4-eda2-4839-ac23-7823c8cf217b"
msgid "\"Who is your savior, the Arcanotheign?\""
msgstr "\"너를 구해준 자는 누구지? 아르카노데인?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0220_Text
msgctxt "8815c6a8-e002-47d3-b34a-da6104895098"
msgid "\"Don't you think the Disk of the Eclipse reacted strangely?\""
msgstr "\"해와 달을 삼킨 원반이 이상하게 반응했다고 생각하지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0222_Text
msgctxt "db4c2d0c-745c-4ef9-aadd-fddc35acb51b"
msgid "\"It's strange what happened with the Disk of the Eclipse...\""
msgstr "\"해와 달을 삼킨 원반에 일어난 일은 참으로 이상했어..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0224_Text
msgctxt "321abd74-a046-4988-92f6-08f30c7df54b"
msgid ""
"\"It doesn't matter what he wanted. Talking to devils is too dangerous.\""
msgstr "\"그가 무얼 원하는지는 중요하지 않아. 데블과 대화하는 것은 너무 위험해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0226_Text
msgctxt "84088b4b-2d12-4fa6-aaf1-04e64092d1a8"
msgid "\"It doesn't make sense to communicate with such dangerous creatures.\""
msgstr "\"그런 위험한 크리처와 대화를 나눈다는 것 자체가 말이 안되는 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0228_Text
msgctxt "c9ae5d25-c8ae-4b70-8b05-41e90f396e27"
msgid "\"I wanted to talk about a personal matter regarding your sister...\""
msgstr "\"너와 개인적으로 네 자매에 대해 말하고 싶은게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0231_Text
msgctxt "85fd9b3a-a766-4a69-a9ed-f1334f11db9e"
msgid ""
"\"I told Kanerah that I like her. She reacted – strangely… – She broke off "
"the conversation and ran away. Did I do something wrong?\""
msgstr "\"카네라에게 그녀를 좋아한다고 말했어. 반응이 이상하더군... 그녀는 대화를 멈추더니 도망가버렸어. 내가 뭘 잘못했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0232_Text
msgctxt "10073528-4340-4ec7-875f-c5dde0c8e986"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me if my words offend you, but I like you and your sister – both "
"of you – and not just as my companions. I don't know how you will react, but "
"she behaved... Rather strangely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상처받았다면 미안해. 하지만 너희 둘을 동료 이상으로 좋아해. 네가 어떻게 반응할지는 모르지만 그녀는... 조금 이상했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0239_Text
msgctxt "55606fb4-60f4-4032-99e5-6e8b5e7477c9"
msgid "\"Thank you, Kalikke.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 칼리케.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0240_Text
msgctxt "67d2a03b-49c7-44fc-8c92-290edc1fa2b5"
msgid "\"So what do you propose I do?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 내가 어떻게 하길 바라?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0243_Text
msgctxt "29779d2d-d005-4993-9ec6-264419054830"
msgid "\"I think I scared you during the conversation in my chambers.\""
msgstr "\"내 방에서 한 얘기 때문에 너를 겁먹게 한 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0246_Text
msgctxt "3605574b-a735-4a00-a0ff-259eb31ed651"
msgid "\"Would you like to spend some time together?\""
msgstr "\"잠시 함께 있지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0247_Text
msgctxt "bdbb00fc-c7dc-4387-be28-ec8627457403"
msgid ""
"\"I want to tell you – we'll have no more intimate encounters from now on.\""
msgstr "\"말하고 싶은게 있어. 우리 앞으로 친밀한 관계는 그만 갖자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0251_Text
msgctxt "c4516875-a10d-4646-b576-114d4081d7fa"
msgid "\"I've missed you. I want to spend some time... alone with you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그리웠어. 너와 단둘이... 있고 싶었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0253_Text
msgctxt "46cacf13-61cf-43a5-a51d-35841b311adb"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to pressure you, but please know that everything I said is "
"true.\""
msgstr "\"너를 압박하려는 건 아니지만 내가 말한 건 모두 진실이란 걸 알아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Answer_0254_Text
msgctxt "c2aca062-0074-4f93-be81-f44545aabc9e"
msgid "\"This entire conversation was a mistake. Let's forget about it.\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 대화가 실수였어. 잊어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1b466e90-2387-47f9-9f24-86774167cf55"
msgid ""
"\"With that stiff?\" {n}Kanerah wrinkles her nose, but seems strangely "
"saddened.{/n} \"Very well, I'll get her. So long!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 딱딱하게 말할꺼 까지야..\" {n}카네라는 미간을 찌푸렸지만, 이상하게 슬퍼보이는 표정입니다.{/n} \"알았어. 칼리케를 "
"불러올게. 그럼 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0002_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7bf246b7-bdcd-41a3-80c7-fcda5b7e60a9"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling girl is quietly singing something soft and sorrowful. Seeing "
"you, she nods warmly.{/n} \"I'm Kalikke, in case you're wondering.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링 소녀는 차분하면서도 슬픈 곡조의 노래를 조용히 흥얼거리고 있습니다. 당신을 발견한 그녀는 온화하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} "
"\"나는 칼리케야. 어느 쪽인지 궁금하다면 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0003_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8ec8b07f-9a64-4967-8e91-b78b58c64bae"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling girl looks at you from under her lashes, curling a strand of "
"hair around a finger.{/n} \"Of course you recognize me, but I'm Kanerah.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링 소녀는 손가락으로 자신의 머리카락을 비비 꼬면서, 치켜뜬 속눈썹 아래로 당신을 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n} \"당연히 날 "
"알아봤겠지? 난 카네라야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ab9b0ff8-9fd3-4729-ae95-68701f270ded"
msgid ""
"\"For Kanerah it seemed as easy as changing a dress. For me... it was "
"unusual. So many smiles, so many admiring eyes. Still almost a child, at "
"first I took this warmth for granted. Oh the heady wine of affection – how "
"easy it is to overlook its poisonous nature!\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라 입장에선 옷 갈아입는 것 마냥 쉬워보였어. 나는... 좀 어색했어. 많은 사람들이 보내주는 미소, 감탄하는 눈빛. 그 때 난 "
"어린아이나 다름없을 때였고, 그런 온기가 당연한 것이라고 생각했어. 어머, 나 취했나봐. 술이라는게 이렇다니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "cfb7ef3e-0b90-4953-bbe7-9ec6d3ccff62"
msgid ""
"\"I like your confidence. I have a penchant for the strong and confident...\""
msgstr "\"네 자신감이 좋아. 나는 강하고 자신감 있는 사람이 좋더라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "83131481-415d-4fb6-8f60-7d3e92afbad1"
msgid ""
"\"Ask me anything. We owe you much, and being open with you is the least I "
"can do to repay you.\""
msgstr "\"무엇이든 물어봐. 우린 너에게 많은 빚을 졌고, 네게 최대한 대답해 주는 게 그나마 보답할 수 있는 길이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e00ed20c-d79f-40c4-afaf-6d0c68c18ac4"
msgid ""
"\"My sister and I were born in {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g} – the country of the "
"radiant Sarenrae, where we tieflings are not very welcome. But for my sister "
"this was more a challenge than a barrier. She wanted respect, power, and "
"wealth – things we were unlikely to get, being who we are. But she found a "
"way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 {g|Qadira}카디라{/g}에서 태어났어. 빛나는 서렌레이의 나라, 티플링은 환영받지 못하는 곳이지. 하지만 내 자매에게 "
"이런 불리한 환경은 장애물이라기보다는 도전이었어. 카네라는 존경, 힘, 그리고 부를 원했어. 우리에게는 어울리지 않는 것이었지. 하지만 방법을 "
"찾아내더라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c7b270c4-deb3-4470-ab5e-e51eb5cf8743"
msgid ""
"\"Trouble.\"{n} Kalikke says quietly.{/n} \"My sister and I took different "
"paths. Kanerah was able to earn the trust of a powerful patron, one of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} fanatics – a member of the Cult of the "
"Dawnflower. His mercenaries hunted down secret cults and monsters day and "
"night. Meanwhile, I found a group of castaways, who reminded me of my sister "
"and I as children – tieflings and genie-spawn. We gathered in secret to "
"share our sorrows and dream of finding our place in the sun.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사건이 생겼지.\"{n} 칼리케는 나직이 말합니다.{/n} \"우리는 서로 다른 길을 택했어. 카네라는 우선 아주 강력한 후원자의 "
"신뢰를 손에 넣는데 성공했지. 이 자는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 광신도 집단인 여명꽃 교단의 일원이었고, 그가 고용한 "
"용병들이 밤낮으로 비밀 이교 집단들과 괴물들을 사냥하고 다녔어. 반면 난 낙오자 무리들과 어울리기 시작했지. 사회에서 버림받은 이 "
"아이들은 지니의 자식들과 티플링들이었고, 꼭 우리가 어렸을 때를 보는 것 같았어. 우리는 몰래 모여 사회에서 버림받은 슬픔과, 그럼에도 "
"언젠가는 밝은 태양 아래에서 당당히 살아갈 수 있을거라는 희망을 함께 나누곤 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "371e36da-47c8-4056-9dd1-b73dadd93818"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I cannot answer that question in much detail. The 'Kaessi' you met at "
"the reception in Restov was Kanerah. – At the time, I'd been sleeping in our "
"demiplane for over a month. I didn't even know my sister wanted to join the "
"expedition that Lady Jamandi was sending. And then suddenly I was thrown out "
"into reality – in the middle of a burning mansion with assassins dashing "
"about! And the swordlord fighting monsters in the grand hall.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그 질문에는 자세히 대답하기 힘들어. 네가 레스토프의 연회에서 만난 '카에시'는 카네라였어. 그때 난 준차원에서 한 달 넘게 "
"잠들어 있었지. 자만디님이 후원하는 원정대에 자매가 합류하고 싶어 하는지도 몰랐어. 그러다 갑자기 현실에 던져졌어. 암살자들이 날뛰고 "
"있는 불타는 저택 한복판에서 말이야! 그리고 연회장에서 괴물들과 싸우고 있는 소드로드도 보였지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "139d7677-dd13-46e0-940c-5b8cc53c693d"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4aa7a1df-c81a-48f6-80f4-91a2fa153136"
msgid "\"Oh, I could tell you a lot about it...\""
msgstr "\"그것에 대해 할 말이 많은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fd6f9921-59c3-4a14-8124-414e97c32727"
msgid ""
"\"That's reasonable. Who wouldn't want to know about their subjects and "
"companions?\""
msgstr "\"그럴만하네. 누구든 자기 부하와 동료를 더 자세히 알고 싶어 할테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a7beffb0-aae0-4718-b286-238da56e0b1f"
msgid ""
"\"The beginning of this story is quite unexciting. My sister and I were born "
"in {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g}, a place most unsuitable for tieflings. The people "
"there honor the radiant Sarenrae, and think of themselves as guardians of "
"the good. Of course, no one threw us in a dungeon right away or tried to "
"kill us for no reason. But we could forget about social status. It's "
"impossible to rise from rags in that country, where they value connections "
"and reputation more than gold. Since birth, they looked on us as evil "
"creatures, vicious and unpredictable.\""
msgstr ""
"“우리 이야기의 앞쪽 부분은 별로 재미 없을거야. 우리는 {g|Qadira}카디라{/g}에서 태어났고, 거긴 티플링이 살아가기엔 최악의 "
"장소라고 할 수 있지. 그곳 사람들은 늘 서렌레이의 광휘 앞에 영광을 돌리면서, 자신들을 선의 수호자라고 생각하는 자들이니까. 물론 "
"그렇다고 해서 우리를 당장 감옥에 처넣거나 다짜고짜 죽이려 들었던 건 아니야. 하지만 사회적 지위는 없는 것이나 다름없었지. 금보다 "
"인맥과 평판을 중요시하는 그 나라에서는 미천한 이들이 신분 상승하는 일은 있을 수 없었으니까. 태어날 때부터 그들은 우리를 악랄하고 믿을 "
"수 없는 사악한 존재로 생각했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "accbfa9e-8cd6-46d5-8a79-153fc8b661b9"
msgid ""
"\"We've lived for a few years under this disguise, gaining a certain status, "
"affluence – and crowds of gullible suitors. In time I found a patron from "
"among the followers of the Cult of the Dawnflower. A man of great wealth, "
"with a personal army of mercenaries, who roamed the lands of Qadira night "
"and day, seeking out monsters and those who worship them. I quickly became "
"his confidant and joined that army – all as the Forefather desired. Perhaps "
"this is why the devil agreed to give us the appearance of aasimars.\""
msgstr ""
"\"변장 덕택에, 우리는 수년간 차근차근 신분과 부를 쌓아나갈 수 있었어. 물론 우리 외모에 홀린 남자들도 함께. 나는 어렵잖게 여명꽃 "
"교단의 추종자 중 한 명을 후원자로 낚았지. 엄청난 부자인데다, 그 돈으로 사병 집단을 거느리고는 밤낮없이 카디라에서 괴물들과 그 "
"숭배자들을 색출하는 광신자였어. 나는 금방 그와 절친한 사이가 되었고, 선조가 원하던 대로 그 사병 집단에 가담할 수 있었지. 아마 그 "
"데블이 우리에게 아시마르의 형상을 허락한 것도 이것 때문이었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "391694f2-2838-4f56-9524-0bb8c49d6ec9"
msgid ""
"\"You know the fun part of our story? When Nethys returned me to life, the "
"poor hungry soul eater started following my trail again. He cannot discover "
"me, so long as I live disguised as Kaessi – but he keeps trying. That's one "
"reason why my sister and I never stay in one place for long. We moved north, "
"living here and there until we reached Restov.\""
msgstr ""
"\"재밌는 사실이 뭔지 알아? 네서스가 나를 살려주었을 때 그 불쌍한 영혼 포식자는 나를 다시 쫓기 시작했어. 내가 카에시로 위장한 채 "
"사는 한 나를 발견하지는 못하겠지만, 계속 나를 찾아다니고 있어. 그래서 우리는 한곳에 오래 머무를 수가 없었던 거고. 우리는 북쪽으로 "
"가서 여기저기 떠돌다가 레스토프에 도착했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ca59b724-e28f-411f-9ef9-3d1f44d4fb00"
msgid "\"What, already? How do you resist my charms?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 벌써? 왜 내 매력에 저항하려 드는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "db4acb68-d4f4-4ab2-a43d-394306ca9300"
msgid "\"Admit it, you like my horns. Or is it the tail?\""
msgstr "\"인정해. 너 내 뿔이 마음에 들지? 아니면 꼬리인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b808c40e-d3ad-4c0d-8181-544c4cec6140"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} is the god of magic. There are no limits to his power."
"\"{n} Kalikke speaks with awe.{/n} \"He was born human, but achieved such "
"unparalleled mastery of magic that he gained divine power. He is the "
"embodiment of paradoxes, contradictions, and making the impossible come "
"true. I called on him at the moment of my greatest need, and he — through "
"his Herald — helped me when all the 'kind and merciful' gods fell silent. "
"But I'm no naive worshipper. – The gods, especially him, are powerful and "
"unpredictable. Besides, he's hardly interested in my gratitude. But I do "
"honor those who help me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}는 마법의 신이야. 그의 힘은 무한하지.\"{n} 칼리케는 경외가 담긴 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"그는 인간으로 태어났지만 신의 경지에 달하는 마법을 구사하게 되었어. 역설과 모순, 그리고 불가능한 것을 실현시키는 화신이지. 나는 "
"내가 가장 필요로 하는 순간에 그를 불렀고, 그는 사자를 통해 '친절하고 자비로운' 모든 신들이 침묵할 때 나를 도와주셨어. 하지만 난 "
"마냥 순진한 숭배자는 아니야. 신들, 특히 그는 강력하고 예측할 수 없어. 게다가 그는 내 감사에는 아무런 관심도 없다구. 하지만 난 "
"나를 도와준 그를 존경해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4074c660-e3eb-452d-ad0c-acdee0071e19"
msgid ""
"\"You'd better ask Kalikke about that. When she learned of my death, she "
"pleaded to {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}, the god of unparalleled powers. And his "
"{g|Arcanotheign}Herald{/g} agreed to return me to life, but in the state "
"we're in now: only one of us can be in the Material Plane at a time. "
"Meanwhile, the other sleeps in a special demiplane.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 부분에 대해서는 칼리케에게 물어보는 게 좋을 거야. 그녀가 내 죽음을 알았을 때 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}에게 간청했고, "
"그의 {g|Arcanotheign}사자{/g}가 그 청원을 받아들여 나를 살려주기로 했어. 문제는 그게 지금 우리 상태였다는 거지: 한 "
"명 만이 물질계에 머무를 수 있고, 그 동안 다른 한 명은 다른 세계에서 잠을 자고 있어야 하는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "cb8868be-aecd-413d-bd01-22fd48672bea"
msgid ""
"\"We are what happens when mortals mix their blood with evil outsiders – "
"mostly demons, daemons or, as with me and my sister, devils. This heritage "
"can manifest through many generations, and can be a cruel blow for the "
"parents of a tiefling.\" {n}Kalikke frowns.{/n} \"As you probably know, "
"there's hardly a corner in Golarion where the birth of someone like me is "
"considered a welcome gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 티플링들은 다른 차원의 악한 존재들과 인간의 혼혈이야. 이 다른 차원의 존재들이란 보통 데몬이거나, 다이몬이거나, 아니면 우리의 "
"경우처럼 데블을 말하지. 이 혈통은 여러 세대를 건너뛰어 갑자기 발현되기도 해. 부모들에겐 무척 잔인한 일이겠지.\" {n}칼리케가 "
"얼굴을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"나 같은 티플링들이 태어나는 건 골라리온 어디에서도 환영받지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f56a4049-2e9f-4918-ab5d-cd3d61660c2f"
msgid ""
"\"While one of us is in the Material Plane, the other sleeps in a demiplane "
"created specially for us. There we sleep and sup upon elemental energy. When "
"one of us enters the Material Plane, the other disappears. Until recently we "
"couldn't even control the moment when we switched. – It seemed to happen "
"randomly, usually while we slept, but sometimes in broad daylight. Now, "
"thanks to you, we have a little more control over what's happening. It's "
"been a great relief.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 중 하나는 물질계에 남고 다른 하나는 우리를 위해 만들어진 세계에서 잠을 자. 그곳에서 우리는 잠을 자고 원소 에너지를 "
"공급받지. 우리 중 한 명이 물질계로 가면 다른 한 명은 사라져. 얼마 전까지 우리는 자유롭게 몸을 바꿀 수 없었어. 보통 잠자는 동안 "
"바뀌지만, 어떤 때에는 훤한 대낮에 바뀌기도 했지. 지금은 다행히 네 덕분에 더 많은 통제력이 생겼고. 정말 다행이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0c110880-db0a-4379-9922-53803c433e97"
msgid ""
"\"After my sister almost got my friends killed, and I in my turn brought the "
"wrath of her former patron down upon her. Kanerah died as she fled from him. "
"In terror, I could only pray to the higher powers, and the "
"{g|Arcanotheign}Arcanotheign{/g}, {g|Nethys}Nethys'{/g} Herald, answered "
"this prayer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 자매가 내 친구들을 거의 죽일 뻔 했을 때 나는 그녀의 예전 후원자의 분노를 그녀에게 쏟아내도록 이끌어냈지. 카네라는 그에게서 "
"도망치다가 죽어버렸어. 무서워서 나는 그저 기도했고 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 사자인 "
"{g|Arcanotheign}아르카노데인{/g}이 기도에 응답했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "378b0222-be6d-48cb-a7a4-fc9ae15d3154"
msgid ""
"\"We are born if an ancestor laid with a powerful and evil outsider, be it a "
"devil, a demon or some other dark creature. Many mortals do this, believe me "
"– either for power or pleasure. This heritage can be hidden for many "
"generations. And it can manifest in many ways. – It's difficult to find two "
"similar tieflings.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 조상 중 한 명이 강력하고 악한 외차원체와 관계를 갖게 되어 태어난 존재야. 이 외차원체는 데블이거나, 데몬이거나, 아니면 "
"다른 어둠의 존재일 수도 있지. 믿기 어려운 일이겠지만, 많은 필멸의 인간들이 힘이나, 아니면 단지 쾌락을 얻기 위해 자발적으로 이런 "
"행위를 해. 이런 혈통은 수 세대 동안 드러나지 않을 수도 있고, 외모로 발현될 때엔 제각각 다양한 모습이 되곤 하지. 티플링들이 서로 "
"닮는 건 흔치 않은 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "22b18338-c29b-471d-a3c9-43078897afbf"
msgid ""
"{n}A smile, sincere but sad, appears on Kalikke's face.{/n} \"My sister and "
"I... we are twins, but we're as different as day and night. She was named "
"Kanerah, which means 'Silent Flame' in our tribe's language, and I am named "
"Kalikke, 'Silent Storm'.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 진지하고도 슬픈 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"우리는... 쌍둥이야. 하지만 우리는 밤과 낮처럼 달라. 이름조차도. 카네라는 "
"우리 부족의 언어로 '조용한 불꽃'이라는 뜻이고, 칼리케는 '조용한 폭풍'이라는 뜻이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9cf8816e-479d-4064-9651-c793785e615c"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는 대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0f16f542-107a-4637-a856-73048e3b9a9e"
msgid "\"Of course! Many do...\""
msgstr "\"그렇겠지! 다들 그렇거든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ae76e8a1-6900-495c-b61c-e060d45dab5c"
msgid ""
"\"From a devil. I can even guess which one. Of all the infernal beings "
"worshiped in Qadira, the whore queen Mahathallah is the most venerated – "
"secretly, of course. Servants of her court frequent these lands. And they "
"leave... trails.\""
msgstr ""
"\"데블로부터 온 거야. 누구인지도 짐작이 가. 카디라에서 비밀리에 숭배하는 지옥의 존재 중에서도 가장 열렬한 추종의 대상은 매춘부 여왕 "
"마하살라야. 지옥의 궁정에서 그녀를 섬기는 종복들도 이 땅에 자주 나타났다가 사라지곤 하지… 흔적을 남기고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e90cbd6e-d0d9-44ed-a67e-6c9d08bc70f7"
msgid "\"So the horns? Or the tail?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 뿔이야? 아니면 꼬리야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "70e64516-6d87-4b7f-a390-bff636643a98"
msgid ""
"\"Those who think so are both right and wrong. Your fate is not written by "
"your blood alone. Surrendering to the temptation of evil is a choice every "
"tiefling must make for themselves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞기도 하고 틀리기도 해. 운명이라는게 혈통으로만 결정되는 건 아니지. 악의 유혹에 넘어갈지 말지의 선택은 결국 모든 티플링 자신이 "
"결정해야 하는 문제야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5648d884-404e-4125-a9b7-dfef6a807fee"
msgid ""
"\"It's a beautiful land – but quite unlike the Stolen Lands. My sister and I "
"grew up in a place dominated by the desert. I've often heard from travelers "
"that such landscapes depresses them, but there's nowhere I feel more at "
"home. Sand-drifts under the sun, life hiding where you'd never expect it... "
"The lush green of a suddenly-revealed oasis... They are austere lands, but "
"can be breathtaking.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아름다운 땅이지만 도둑맞은 땅과는 전혀 달라. 우리는 사막 지역에서 태어났어. 여행자들로부터 종종 끝없이 모래로 덮인 풍경들이 자신을 "
"우울하게 만든다는 말을 듣긴 했지만, 내게는 집처럼 편안하게 느껴졌지. 작열하는 태양 아래 흘러내리는 모래 언덕처럼, 전혀 기대치 않던 "
"장소에도 생명은 모습을 숨긴채 살아가고 있어. 갑자기 제 모습을 드러내는 오아시스에 무성한 녹음... 그곳은 분명 혹독한 땅이지만, "
"가끔은 말을 잃을 만큼 아름답기도 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6092af96-0940-4b19-90dc-c9403005e16c"
msgid ""
"\"The cities of {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g} are an endless whirlwind of turmoil and "
"bright colors. Some say the heart and essence of every Qadiran city is its "
"temple to Sarenrae – ever since our country was blessed by the radiant "
"goddess. But I'd put it differently. The heart of every city is a noisy "
"market with its tents in every color you could imagine. Most of the city's "
"life happens at the market. People go there not only to trade, but also to "
"have fun, negotiate, and spin their intrigues. Take away the market – and "
"what's left of Qadira?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Qadira}카디라{/g}의 도시들은 항상 끝도 없는 소란과 선명한 원색에 둘러싸여 있지. 모든 카디라 도시의 핵심이자 본질이 "
"서렌레이의 사원이라고 하는 사람들도 있어. 광휘의 여신의 축복이 카디라와 함께 하고 있으니까. 하지만 내 생각은 달라. 모든 카디라 "
"도시의 중심은 다채로운 색깔의 천막으로 가득 찬 시끄러운 시장이지. 도시에서의 삶은 시장을 빼놓고는 얘기할 수 없어. 단순히 사고 파는 "
"일 뿐 아니라, 즐거움, 협상, 음모 모두가 시장에서 일어나지. 시장을 빼면 카디라에 뭐가 남겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ad30ccbf-c1b5-4099-bd6a-7f439f07e596"
msgid ""
"\"We were at our eighth summer when Kalikke, the spring of my solace, got "
"angry at me and chucked a bunch of desert thistles into my hair. I had to "
"cut them out afterwards! That's what you have to suffer if life 'rewards' "
"you with a sibling. Though I should say – that very evening I burned her "
"favorite dress. With great trouble comes great satisfaction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여덟 번째 여름을 맞이했던 날, 내 마음의 위안인 칼리케가 나한테 화를 내고 사막 엉겅퀴 가지를 내 머리에 던졌어. 나는 결국 머리를 "
"잘라내야 했지! 그래서 형제가 있으면 고통이 있다는 거야. 그래도 나는 그날 밤 칼리케가 가장 좋아하는 드레스를 불태워버렸지. 속이 정말 "
"시원하더라니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "40c2aa10-7c6a-4b3c-993a-2cdbc0e656ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah gives you a wry smile.{/n} \"What a surprise... It's little "
"wonder that he came to you instead of me. – He respects hierarchy, as devils "
"should. So what did he want?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 심술궂게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"어머나, 별로 놀랄 일도 아니네. 데블들은 위계를 중시하니까. 그래서 나 대신 너를 직접 "
"만나러 왔다는 거지. 그래서 뭐가 필요하대?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2f75dcfb-4f21-4410-8d84-75f7567c66da"
msgid ""
"\"Oh goodness, what fatherly commitment! You're right, he might be useful. "
"But dangerous too, like any devil. But since it's my life that's at stake..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이렇게 친절할 데가! 네가 맞아. 그는 쓸모가 있을 거야. 하지만 데블이니 위험하겠지. 하지만 내 목숨이 걸린 문제이니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "75ce531b-29f7-4cef-a77f-9eaade040edf"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish. Now, thanks to you, we can at least switch when we want to..."
"\" {n}Kalikke closes her eyes and focuses, calling to the other plane.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 원하는 대로. 이제 우리는 원하는 대로 몸을 바꿀 수 있어...\" {n}칼리케는 눈을 감고는 다른 세계에 집중합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "841084be-8006-4ffb-a489-6b733b2cf089"
msgid ""
"\"And that's it?\" {n}Kanerah slowly sways her tail.{/n} \"I've been known "
"to spark... curiosity.\""
msgstr "\"그게 다야?\" {n}카네라는 천천히 꼬리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"불타는 줄 알았는데... 호기심이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8f73f635-1ec3-4651-aa77-41d8e8bf42a0"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Qadira}Qadira{/g} is a part of the Padishah Empire of "
"{g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g}, a great, thriving state. Don't think me rude, but the "
"northern states are but a pale shadow of my homeland. Only Taldor at its "
"height could compete with us, though it's long since lost its power. My land "
"is wealthy, powerful, and full of opportunities for anyone cunning enough to "
"seize them. It's a pity they're all devoted to Sarenrae, and the whole array "
"of superstitions that go along with it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Qadira}카디라{/g}는 {g|Kelesh}켈레쉬{/g} 제국에 속한 지역이야. 무례하게 들릴 수도 있겠지만, 이곳 북쪽 "
"지방은 내 고향의 영광과 비교하면 희미한 그림자 정도에 불과해. 탈도르의 전성기 정도나 견줄만 할까? 그나마 그 탈도르도 쇠락한지 이미 "
"오래지. 우리 나라는 부유하고 강력해. 교활한 자들에게는 무한한 기회의 땅이라고나 할까. 딱 하나 안타까운 건 서렌레이를 섬긴답시고 "
"모두가 형편없는 미신에 몰두해 있다는 것 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2286b8ad-aa44-41dd-bad8-0adf2184dc8d"
msgid ""
"\"Look at your golden-haired boy priest, and you'll see at once what exactly "
"makes living in Qadira so unbearable, despite all its grandeur.\" {n}Kanerah "
"wrinkles her little nose.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네 금발의 사제를 봐. 그곳이 웅장한 곳이라지만, 카디라에서 사는것이 왜 그렇게 견디기 힘든 것인지 단번에 알 수 있지.\" {n}"
"카네라는 살짝 찡그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "09387fe2-cf21-478a-b176-5ee37a017694"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not one to judge you, but refusing him might not have been the most "
"sensible thing to do... at least for me and Kanerah. Who knows why the "
"Forefather came to you, and what awaits us, after... But now is not the time "
"for regrets. What's done is done.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 이래라 저래라 할 처지는 아니지만, 그의 제안을 거부하는 건 그다지 현명한 결정은 아닐 것 같아. 적어도 우리 자매에게는. "
"선조가 왜 너를 찾아왔는지, 그래서 우리가 앞으로 어떻게 될 지는 모르는 일이지만... 지금은 후회할 때가 아니야. 지나간 일은 지나간 "
"거니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ed005ac8-f5d7-4907-82bc-de674bf665f5"
msgid ""
"\"The soul eater has returned! I don't know what to do, {name}. I'm worried "
"sick! A devil's guile knows no bounds, but if my sister is in danger... I "
"beg you, at least try to find out what the Forefather is plotting, and "
"whether the soul eater really is once more at our heels...\""
msgstr ""
"\"영혼포식자가 돌아왔구나! 어떻게 해야 될지 모르겠어, {name}. 너무 걱정돼! 데블이 몹시 교활한 건 사실이지만 카네라가 위험에 "
"처해있으니... 적어도 영혼포식자가 정말로 우리 뒤를 쫓고 있는 건지, 그리고 선조는 대체 무슨 꿍꿍인지만 알아봐주면 안될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0084_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b3578e38-773d-4133-adb9-b796c24703d5"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling girl greets you warmly, but seems a little distracted.{/n} "
"\"I'm glad to see you at my hearth!\" {n}She bites her lip and adds in a "
"whisper.{/n} \"Have you seen the Sweet Teeth? I can't get them out of the "
"house, and I'm so scared they'll suspect something and reveal our secret – "
"Kanerah's and mine. I wish I could keep them busy somewhere out of town... "
"But anyway, welcome!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링 소녀는 당신을 따뜻하게 맞이하지만, 약간 산만해 보입니다.{/n} \"내 집에 와줘서 고마워!\" {n}그녀는 입술을 깨물고는 "
"속삭입니다.{/n} \"단것 중독자들 봤어? 그들을 집에서 쫓아낼 수도 없고, 그들이 뭔가를 의심하고 카네라와 나의 비밀이 들통날까 너무 "
"겁나. 마을 밖 어딘가에서 바쁘게 지냈으면 좋겠는데... 어쨌든, 반가워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0085_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6b2e6b16-5d56-4a18-9709-2c902029350f"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling girl taps her foot, irritated, then leans towards you and "
"whispers loudly,{/n} \"Did you see that? My sister has all three of her "
"empty-headed friends right on our tail! They used to follow her around in "
"Qadira. They know both of us very well. Couldn't we just send them away "
"somewhere? Oh, and by the way... hello!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링 여성은 화가 나서 발로 마구 바닥을 쿵쿵대다가, 당신에게 몸을 기울여 귀에 대고 큰 소리로 속삭입니다.{/n} \"봤어? 내 "
"자매가 멍청한 친구 셋을 꽁무니에 달고 왔다고! 쟤네는 카디라에서 그녀를 따라다니곤 해서 우리를 잘 안단 말이야. 그냥 어딘가로 "
"보내버리면 안 될까? 아, 그나저나... 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ebe4935c-e4d1-4a2a-9e37-803ca0f23c85"
msgid ""
"\"Dealing with devils, one must never drop one's guard, not even for a "
"moment. But it's also true that it's best not to ignore them or their "
"warnings. Especially when they involve mortal threats. And when it's your "
"own life in the balance…\""
msgstr ""
"\"데블을 상대할 때 잠시도 방심하면 안 되지만, 그렇다고 그들의 경고를 무시해서도 안 돼. 특히 목숨이 달린 일에 대한 경고라면, "
"그리고 그게 네 자신의 목숨이라면 더욱 더 말이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "20947c89-fcb5-485f-b65b-8fa5dc7116a7"
msgid ""
"\"But you are listening to me.\" {n}Kanerah smiles innocently.{/n} \"I wish "
"I knew what he wanted... You can't just dismiss the words of such a powerful "
"creature, even if you consider him your enemy. But what's done is done. It's "
"not my habit to judge the actions of someone who has granted me their "
"protection.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 내 말을 들었으니까.\" {n}카네라는 천진난만하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그가 원하는 것이 무엇인지 알았으면 좋겠어... 그런 "
"강력한 크리처의 말을 그냥 무시해서는 안 돼. 설령 그게 적이라도 그래. 그래도 이미 끝난 일은 끝난 일이지. 날 보호해 준 사람의 "
"행동을 판단하는 건 내 스타일이 아냐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7b819346-cff5-4a6c-8084-dce52b45e4fb"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke smiles faintly but her eyes remain sad.{/n} \"Ask what you will.\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 희미하게 웃지만 눈은 슬퍼 보입니다.{/n} \"원하는 걸 물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0d2ec191-dc74-444e-948d-4996bc443593"
msgid ""
"\"I think we all have different experiences. What would you like to discuss?"
"\""
msgstr "\"우리는 모두 다른 경험을 가지고 있어. 무슨 얘기를 듣고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1d58e9b8-7a23-4654-9acc-9b962c3169c8"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke's eyes flare but she restrains herself, saying only:{/n} \"Is "
"this your final decision?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케의 눈에서는 불꽃이 튀고 있지만, 그녀는 침착한 태도를 유지하며 입을 열었습니다.{/n} \"정말로 이게 최종 결정인거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8a0c21a3-ef4c-4fe7-a6d9-458844fc2040"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it's not the first – and of course it won't be the last time we're "
"driven away. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"뭐, 우리가 쫓겨나는게 이번이 처음도 아니니까. 물론 마지막도 아닐 거고. 잘 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e6d2c73d-1bd1-4c67-8390-1184b8666285"
msgid "\"Rash decisions – how familiar...\""
msgstr "\"성급한 결정... 참 익숙하네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1792a4c0-caf4-4684-add7-82d1d37f26c1"
msgid ""
"\"I can't imagine a reason that would make you wish to part with me. Are you "
"sure?\""
msgstr "\"네가 왜 나와 헤어지려는지 상상도 할 수 없어. 정말이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0102_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "12a3a7ec-ae3a-43c3-8d5c-c78286716a36"
msgid "\"I never doubted that you would change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"네가 변심할거라고는 생각도 못했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3cbdba00-4f55-4499-8eac-9547833c1916"
msgid ""
"\"Very well, goodbye. I will entertain myself with thoughts of how quickly "
"and bitterly you will regret this decision...\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 잘 있으라고. 네가 머잖아 이 결정을 땅을 치며 후회하는 걸 상상만 해도 즐거울 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "53c3d49c-ffb9-48c5-a4fc-6dbfbb63f600"
msgid ""
"\"But it was not enough to entirely hide our essence and pass as an "
"emberkin. And Kanerah... asked for help. She asked a master of deception and "
"illusion.\" {n}Kalikke frowns. She obviously wishes to get through this part "
"of the story as quickly as possible.{/n} \"We left our native desert, "
"crossed half of the country to avoid accidentally crossing paths with anyone "
"from our tribe, and set off for a new life, in a new 'skin'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 본질을 완전히 숨기고 엠버킨인 척 지내기에는 아무래도 부족했어. 그래서 카네라는... 도움을 요청했지. 속임수와 환상의 "
"대가에게.\" {n}칼리케는 미간을 찌푸립니다. 그녀는 이 이야기를 어서 끝내고 싶어 하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"우리는 같은 부족 "
"사람들과 마주치지 않으려고 고향 사막을 떠나 나라 반대편으로 이주했어. 그리고는 새로운 '피부'를 입고 새로운 삶을 시작했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d930f55c-cb1c-48aa-8c92-72297b82fc82"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah was born a few minutes before me. I suppose she just elbowed me "
"out of the way in our mother's womb, to become the firstborn. Being the "
"first – that's what she always craved. I never felt offended by it, though. "
"Whenever the storm clouds gathered above our heads, heralding danger and "
"trouble, my sister walked forward one step ahead, tightly holding my hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라는 나보다 몇 분 더 빨리 태어났어. 가끔은 카네라가 엄마 뱃속에서 앞에 있던 나를 밀치고 먼저 나온 건 아니었을까 생각도 "
"들어. 뭐든 항상 일등이 되는 게 카네라의 간절한 소망이었거든. 물론 그것 때문에 기분나쁘거나 한 건 아니야. 어떤 위험이나 골칫거리가 "
"우리를 가로막을 때에도, 언니는 늘 내 손을 꼭 잡고는 자기가 먼저 앞으로 나서 맞섰지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9f4690c8-1bd3-4ff7-bf94-2e9ab2b543f1"
msgid ""
"\"I remember the day when I and a company of my friends met three young "
"tieflings trading simple delicacies. As I reached for a coin to buy some "
"food, my friends took me by the arm and led me away, saying a flameborn "
"shouldn't take anything from the hands of unclean beings.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하루는 친구들과 함께 있을 때, 길거리에서 간단한 음식거리를 팔고 있던 티플링 아이 셋과 마주쳤던게 기억나. 내가 그 음식을 사주려고 "
"동전을 건네자, 함께 있던 친구들이 뜯어 말리더니 허둥지둥 날 끌고 가더군. 불꽃의 자손은 더러운 종자들에게서는 아무 것도 받아선 "
"안된다나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d5fcecc1-e20b-48b6-9c1a-c8c27e32b91e"
msgid ""
"\"A flameborn…\"{n} — says Kalikke sullenly.{/n} \"My 'friends' would have "
"been surprised to learn what sort of flame burned in my blood. But enough of "
"this... I deceived them, and they were glad to be deceived, and no one was "
"to blame. There is only one thing I regret – the rage that replaced the joy "
"in my heart. Rage is not the best advisor – as I learned later from a "
"bitter, bitter experience.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불꽃의 자손이라…\"{n} 칼리케가 퉁명스럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"내 혈관에 흐르는 불꽃의 정체를 알았다면 그 '친구'들도 깜짝 "
"놀랐겠지. 이 이야기는 됐어... 친구들은 내 속임수에 기꺼이 넘어가 주었을 뿐이니 누구의 잘못도 아니야. 후회되는 건 하나뿐이야. 내 "
"마음에 기쁨은 사라지고, 분노가 그 자리를 차지했다는 것. 현명한 이는 분노에 귀 기울이지 않지. 쓰디쓴 실수를 저지르고 나서야 알게 된 "
"사실이지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d06545f7-65df-4497-890b-fd9259349faa"
msgid ""
"\"A devil.\" {n}Kalikke answers shortly, and stops gloomily for a moment.{/n}"
" \"A powerful being, mighty and ancient. He made a contract with Kanerah, "
"promising to weave an illusion for us. Luckily, my sister promised him only "
"her service, not her soul. Ask Kanerah about details if you wish. Just "
"remembering that creature's voice makes my skin crawl.\""
msgstr ""
"\"데블이었어.\" {n}칼리케는 짧게 대답하고는 우울하게 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"강력한 고대의 존재였지. 그는 우리를 위해 환상을 "
"만들어주기로 카네라와 계약했어. 다행히 카네라는 영혼을 바치지는 않고, 그에 대한 봉사만 약속했지. 자세한 내용이 듣고 싶으면 카네라에게 "
"물어봐. 그 악마의 목소리를 떠올리기만 해도 오싹하고 불쾌해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "23f31883-03eb-46f1-9982-30151fb179cc"
msgid ""
"\"Time passed, and these gatherings became more bitter. We yearned to prove "
"that monster blood does not make us monsters. We spoke of how we should "
"unite, and enter the great games of Qadiran aristocracy – supporting those "
"who were ready to accept us as equals, and bringing down their opponents. We "
"planned to use me as a cover – 'a beautiful emberkin', who would be the "
"voice of the castaways.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간이 지날수록 모임은 쓰디쓴 결말을 향해갔어. 우리는 괴물의 혈통 때문에 우리를 괴물 취급해서는 안된다는 걸 입증하고 싶었지. "
"우리는 무슨 수단을 써서라도 카디라 상류사회의 거대한 음모에 개입하기로 결의했어. 그들은 상대방을 몰락시키는데 도움만 된다면 얼마든지 "
"우리를 자신들과 동등하게 대우해 줄 준비가 되어 있는 자들이었으니까. 우리는 나를 추방자들을 대변할 '아름다운 엠버킨'으로 위장시키기로 "
"했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1f8b152f-7257-49cd-83ea-3ceda1606797"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl lowers her head.{/n} \"One evening, my sister came to me, full "
"of careless grace. She told me that there was to be a raid on our secret "
"meeting that very night. I had to stay home, and not even think of warning "
"the others. It wasn't hard to guess how she found out. – The raid was to be "
"led by followers of the Cult of the Dawnflower – fanatics who fancy "
"themselves cleansing flames, saving the world from evil. Kanerah's patron, "
"first among them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"어느 날 저녁, 언니가 날 찾아왔어. 바로 그날 밤 우리의 비밀 모임이 습격당할 거라는 사실을 "
"알려주려고 말이야. 어쨋든 그건 언니 나름의 배려였지. 나는 동료들에게 경고할 생각조차 못하고 집에 머물러 있어야 했어. 언니가 어떻게 "
"알아냈지는 뻔했지. 습격해온 건 세계를 악으로부터 구한다는 망상에 취한 여명꽃 교단의 광신도들이었고, 카네라의 후원자가 그들을 이끌고 "
"있었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0112_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9a167180-1ffd-4651-a80d-6f983d906824"
msgid ""
"\"At that moment, I realized my sister loved me so much that she was ready "
"to set aside her aspirations, and warn me of the danger. But I also realized "
"something else – Kanerah was ready to sacrifice any number of innocent lives "
"to get what she wanted. I ran away... after yelling in her face that she was "
"a monster. I left her to warn my friends. – It's the last time I saw my "
"sister alive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 그 때 알고 있었어. 언니가 날 너무나 사랑한다는 걸. 그래서 본인이 너무나 열망하던 신분 상승과 출세, 이 모든 걸 내려놓고 "
"나에게 경고하러 왔다는 걸. 하지만 동시에 카네라가 원하는 것을 얻기 위해서라면 무고한 생명도 거리낌없이 희생시킬 수 있다는 사실도 "
"깨달았지. 나는 카네라의 면전에 대고 언니는 괴물이라고 소리쳤어. 그리고 친구들에게 습격을 경고하기 위해 달려나왔지. 그게 살아있는 "
"언니를 본 마지막 순간이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "18d41566-b09a-4ccd-bd2a-d69bd7cf8c1d"
msgid ""
"\"I tried to save my friends from the raid, but came face-to-face with "
"wizards from the Cult of the Dawnflower. They were able to dispel the "
"illusion that protected me, and found out I was a tiefling. My secret was "
"revealed – along with my sister's. What a shock it must have been for her "
"patron, to find out that a clever tiefling was serving at his side, "
"disguised as a righteous aasimar! There is no worse deed in Qadira than "
"disgracing your patron. Kanerah knew this well, and tried to flee, terrified "
"of his wrath. But she couldn't get away. Trouble came to her from a place "
"she didn't expect. Ask her about the details if you want... I lack strength "
"to talk about it. The truth is, I betrayed our secret, and my sister died "
"because of it. I was able to bring her back to life, but bitterness has "
"scorched my heart, and will be a part of me until my death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 친구들을 습격에서 구하려고 했지만, 막바로 여명꽃 교단의 마법사들과 맞닥뜨리게 되었어. 그들은 나를 보호하던 환영을 "
"깨트려버렸고, 내가 티플링이었다는 게 밝혀지고 말았지. 나 뿐 아니라 언니의 비밀까지 탄로난 거야. 언니의 후원자가 얼마나 놀랐겠어! "
"정의로운 아시마르로 철썩같이 믿고 있던 최측근이 알고 보니 교활하기 짝이 없는 티플링이었으니. 후원자의 명예를 더럽히는 건 카디라에서는 "
"최악의 범죄로 취급받고, 카네라도 그걸 잘 알고 있었지. 그래서 언니는 그의 분노를 피해 달아나려고 했지만, 결국 붙잡히고 말았어. "
"생각도 못한 장소에서 파국을 맞게 된거지. 그 다음 일어난 일은 카네라에게 직접 물어봐. 난 차마 더 설명할 용기가 안나… 아무튼 진실은 "
"간단해. 내가 우리의 비밀 약속을 깨트렸고, 그 때문에 언니가 죽고 만 거지. 겨우 언니를 살려낼 수는 있었지만, 내 마음은 쓰디쓴 "
"비애로 검게 타버렸어. 아마 죽을 때까지 내 가슴에 자리하고 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0120_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "79d88939-5935-44b2-8d2b-3a4d93449032"
msgid "\"Thank you. Your compassion gives me strength.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 네 위로가 힘이 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0121_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3630d339-1603-4348-92d2-395147b2ce75"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know the answer, {name}. But I do see that my 'good heart' led my "
"sister, jewel of my heart, to her death. I still cannot tell whether I was "
"right or not, or how I would act if faced with a similar choice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고 말해야 할지 모르겠어. {name}. 하지만 분명한 건, 친구들을 구하고자 했던 내 선의가 내 마음의 등불이었던 언니를 죽게 "
"만들었다는 거야. 나는 여전히 내가 옳은 결정을 했는지 확신이 없어. 다시 비슷한 상황에 놓여도 같은 선택을 해야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0122_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "56273203-cd98-442a-873b-aaee78f34bdb"
msgid ""
"\"I acted without thinking, I admit. But I wouldn't wish this choice on "
"anyone – to choose between friends and a sister... I often ask myself – what "
"would have I done, if I'd known how great the danger was for Kanerah? And I "
"do not know the answer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 때 나는 생각할 틈도 없이 일을 저질렀어. 하지만 친구들과 쌍둥이 언니 중에 어느 쪽을 골라야 했는가, 이런 문제를 다른 사람과 "
"터놓고 얘기하고 싶지는 않았어. 늘 혼자서 고민해보곤 했지. 카네라가 그렇게 큰 위험에 빠질 줄 미리 알았다면 내가 어떻게 행동했어야 "
"맞는 걸까? 아직도 정답이 뭔지는 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0123_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "25f24402-b411-4cdc-aabd-df0a6e7cfb11"
msgid "\"Perhaps. But can water agree with fire? I do not know the answer.\""
msgstr "\"아마도. 하지만 물과 불이 화해할 수 있을까? 나는 그렇다고는 대답하지 못하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "dc32cffb-87e5-4f42-962f-8d573694e5a8"
msgid ""
"\"You may be right. But how could I have stayed away, and not tried to warn "
"those who trusted me?\""
msgstr "\"네 말이 맞을지도. 하지만 어떻게 나를 신뢰해준 친구들한테 경고조차 하지 않고 가만히 물러서만 있을 수 있었겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0125_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "76b6b92c-160b-400b-83c3-0fafa92370c8"
msgid ""
"\"I wish Kanerah and I were more alike... We nearly destroyed each other, "
"after failing to accept each other's wishes, and the paths we chose. "
"Sometimes I feel that the life we now live is the best we could hope for. We "
"can never meet, can never share each other's sorrows. But at least I don't "
"have to be upset about her cruelty towards others. And she – about my "
"softness and recklessness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라와 내가 서로 더 닮았다면 좋았을 걸... 우리는 서로의 마음 속 바람도, 각자가 선택한 길도 받아들일 수 없었고, 덕분에 "
"서로의 삶을 완전히 파괴할 뻔 했지. 가끔은 우리한테는 지금처럼 사는게 최선이 아닐까도 생각해. 지금 우리는 만나서 서로의 슬픔을 나눌 "
"수도 없지만, 최소한 서로한테 화낼 일도 없잖아. 나는 카네라의 잔인한 성격에, 카네라는 내 유약하면서도 앞뒤 안가리는 성격에 늘 화를 "
"냈는데 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0126_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "df35817c-821f-447b-a9ae-629365f97ff3"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't believe it, when she answered my prayer. She promised to bring "
"Kanerah back to life, on two conditions: we would never be able to meet "
"again, and we must keep secret everything that happened. By Nethys' power, "
"my sister and I received our special connection. We cannot be in the same "
"time and reality simultaneously. While one of us is in the Material Plane, "
"the other one sleeps in a demiplane, one specially created for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 내 기도에 응답했을 때, 난 도저히 그 사실을 믿을 수가 없었어. 그녀는 두 가지 조건을 걸고 카네라를 살려주겠다고 약속했지. "
"다시는 서로 만날 수 없고, 일어난 모든 일들은 비밀로 지켜야 한다는 조건. 네서스의 권능으로, 카네라와 나 사이에는 특별한 연결이 "
"생겼어. 우리는 같은 시간과 공간에 존재할 수 없어. 한 명이 물질계에 있는 동안 다른 쪽은 우리를 위해 만들어진 임시 차원에서 잠들어 "
"있어야 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0128_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "06c7bfcf-d0f7-4594-a003-7e961cc41904"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah and I usually keep a diary, to tell each other in detail what "
"happened during the day. But I didn't exactly have time to read it, and I "
"doubt she had time to write anything during the attack. I ran into the hall "
"and tried to help Jamandi, and then you and your companions appeared. We "
"held back the attack, and you and Tartuccio began accusing each other of "
"spying... Meanwhile, I still couldn't understand what was happening, or "
"where I was. I had to pretend to distrust both sides of your argument, or I "
"might have given myself away too easily. And I had to protect our secret – "
"it was one of the conditions of our agreement with Nethys.\""
msgstr ""
"\"매일 무슨 일이 있었는지를 서로에게 세세하게 전해주어야 하니까, 우리는 늘상 일기를 써. 하지만 전투가 있던 그날은 나도 일기를 읽을 "
"시간이 없었고, 카네라도 뭘 적을 시간이 없었던 것 같아. 나는 연회장으로 뛰어들어 자만디를 도우려 했고 때마침 너희들이 나타난 거야. "
"그렇게 습격을 물리치자마자, 너와 타투치오는 서로를 첩자라고 비난하기 시작했잖아. 나는 사실 그때까지도 무슨 일이 일어난건지, 심지어는 "
"내가 어디 있는지도 정확히 몰랐어. 그러다보니 어느 한 쪽에 휩쓸리지 않으려고 양쪽 다 불신하는 척 한 것 뿐이야. 네서스와의 "
"약속이잖아. 나는 비밀을 지켜야 한다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0132_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a748fcfe-3f28-4a26-8f45-99fd9782e822"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke smiles faintly.{/n} \"Then you can begin to imagine what it's "
"like for us! People approach me all the time, and start talking like they're "
"my friends, and I just stand there, trying to remember lines from the diary. "
"Is it 'the gnome with blue hair, a new admirer who has twice given me "
"flowers' – or 'the gnome banker, who wishes to discuss investments in the "
"Tors of Levenies mines'.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그럼 너도 늘 우리에게 무슨 일이 생기는지 상상할 수 있을거야. 모르는 사람들이 꼭 우리가 "
"친구인 것처럼 말을 건다고 생각해봐. 그럼 난 그 잠깐 사이에 일기장에 써있는 내용을 짜맞추어야 하는 거지. 저 노움은 '나를 졸졸 "
"따라다니며 두 번인가 꽃을 건네준 파란 머리의 노움'일까? 아니면 '광산 투자에 대해 상담하고 싶어하던 노움 은행가'일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0133_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0793000f-1caa-4086-ae47-4e9f2ec28115"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose it was natural to suspect that something was wrong. I'm still "
"guessing why Nethys posed this condition – to keep all this a secret. It "
"seems an impossible secret to keep, and there's little we can do to "
"safeguard it. It could all be more complicated than I know. I simply don't "
"understand his intention...\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 이상하다는 의심이 드는 것도 당연하다고 생각해. 나는 여전히 네서스가 왜 이 모든 것을 비밀로 지키라는 조건을 붙였는지 궁금해. "
"이게 지키기 불가능한 비밀인건 그렇다치고, 따로 우리가 이 비밀을 간수하기 위해 할 수 있는 일도 없었거든. 내 머리로 이해하기엔 너무 "
"복잡한 문제인가봐. 나는 도무지 그 의도를 모르겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0134_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1d826505-b53f-4c0b-80bc-988e9b9363e5"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl lowers her head.{/n} \"Good luck to you in everything you do!\""
msgstr "{n}여성이 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"모든 일에 행운이 함께하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0135_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4213982c-3270-4b3f-93e1-d367b0ebc4a4"
msgid ""
"\"Not that it's entirely false...\" {n}Kanerah smiles coyly.{/n} \"But what "
"is 'truth', generally speaking? I've always known what I was worth, and what "
"lot I deserved. If superstitions stand in the way of achieving a goal, "
"that's no reason to shed a tear. Better to use those same superstitions to "
"your own ends. I must say, in Qadira they idolize aasimars almost as "
"passionately as they hate tieflings. So I thought that with a little effort, "
"I could pass as one, and my mastery of fire could be mistaken for a sign of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} good will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 완전히 잘못된 건 아니지...\" {n}카네라는 수줍게 웃습니다.{/n} \"하지만 흔히들 말하는 '진실'이란게 대체 뭘까? "
"나는 내가 어떤 가치가 있는지, 그래서 어떤 운명을 누려야 하는지 언제나 알고 있었어. 미신이 네 앞길을 막고 있다고 해서 눈물만 흘리고 "
"있어선 안돼. 그 미신을 나에게 유리한 쪽으로 써먹어야지. 카디라 사람들은 티플링을 혐오하는 것 이상으로 아시마르를 광적으로 우상화했어. "
"그래서 나는 머리를 굴렸지. 약간의 노력만 들이면 아시마르로 변장해서, 불을 이용하는 내 능력을 서렌레이의 은총인 것처럼 속일 수 있을 "
"거라 생각했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0136_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "02f3bb03-d7dd-4090-983a-e8a6f3771ec3"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, a masquerade of that sophistication required a little outside "
"help – and I found it. I made a contract with a resourceful devil who calls "
"himself the Forefather. He wove an illusion over me and my sister, hiding "
"our tiefling features from everyone. I hope this doesn't shock you. It's not "
"that I wanted to bind myself to a powerful and devious creature. But what "
"choice did I have? To wash bowls at a caravanserai until the end of my days? "
"That wouldn't just be a waste of the priceless gem that I am. I'd be "
"burdened with caring for Kalikke – that naive walking virtue, who is totally "
"unfit for a hard life...'"
msgstr ""
"\"물론 이 정도로 복잡한 가장에는 약간의 도움이 필요했지. 나는 자신을 선조라고 부르는 유능한 데블과 계약을 맺었어. 그는 티플링의 "
"본모습을 모두에게서 숨겨줄 환영을 우리에게 씌워주었지. 내가 악마랑 계약했다고 놀란 건 아니지? 나라고 데블처럼 강력하고 사악한 생명체와 "
"엮이고 싶었던 건 아니야. 하지만 다른 수가 없었어. 죽을 때까지 접시나 닦고 있어야 할까? 그건 단지 내 재능을 썩히는 따위의 문제가 "
"아니었어. 나는 칼리케를 돌봐야 했다고. 걸어다니는 도덕책 같이 고결한 이 아이를 그런 비천한 환경에 놔둘 순 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0142_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "150f9458-ae5e-4b20-8007-9f5f13f21558"
msgid "\"I'm just the incarnation of goodness and innocence, aren't I?\""
msgstr "\"나는 선의와 순수의 화신이지. 그렇지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0143_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "20be8393-d412-4d5c-b569-12bb479f5bc3"
msgid ""
"\"As a person with principles, I can understand you. I have my own limits. "
"But it was an agreement I found acceptable, though I admit I had my "
"reservations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 도리를 아는 사람이야. 네 말은 충분히 이해하겠어. 나한테도 물론 원칙이 있어. 하지만 내가 봤을 때 그 계약은 충분히 "
"받아들일만 했었다고. 뭐, 약간 주저하는 마음이 들었던 건 인정할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0145_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6faaa343-c6da-46ce-ad44-60dc8e446011"
msgid ""
"\"Wise words. If only there were more in this world who think as you do…\""
msgstr "\"현명하구나. 너처럼 생각하는 사람이 더 있었다면 좋았을 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0146_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "18db2b3d-10cc-4cff-a44d-bfe6c62c730b"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I did. I would have done so much more, but as always, nothing "
"went according to plan.\""
msgstr "\"물론 그렇게 했었지. 더한 일이라도 했겠지만, 늘 그랬듯이 일은 계획대로 되지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0147_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ce6b237b-1ecf-48be-bb31-06f95a758655"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, it's all in the past now. The contract was annulled by my death. "
"Now I'm free to live as I wish.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 이제 모두 지난 일이야. 계약은 내 죽음으로 무효가 되었어. 나는 이제 마음대로 살 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0148_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "361b21e6-7656-41ac-8615-c15af831b4b6"
msgid ""
"\"Everything was going perfectly. But then Kalikke, that silly child, got "
"herself mixed up with a band of tiefling renegades, who were too cowardly "
"and stupid to achieve anything in their lives by their own wits.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 일이 완벽했지. 하지만 그 때, 멍청한 칼리케는 티플링 불량배 패거리들하고나 어울리고 있었어. 너무나 멍청하고 비겁한 나머지 "
"살면서 무엇 하나 자기 손으로 이뤄본 적 없는 녀석들하고 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0149_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2307345d-334a-475a-9a1c-aac17a08317f"
msgid ""
"\"By the power of {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}, my sister and I cannot meet... for "
"as soon as one of us appears in the Material Plane, the other one is "
"immediately spirited away to our demiplane. There we sleep until it's time "
"to switch back. The demiplane, by the way, is full of elemental energy, "
"which is wonderful for restoring our strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 권능이 정해놓은 대로, 우리는 서로 만날 수 없게 되어 있어... 우리 중 한 명이 물질계에 "
"나타나는 순간, 다른 한 명은 우리의 임시 차원으로 즉시 소환돼. 그럼 우리는 서로 바뀔 때까지 거기서 잠을 자고 있는거지. 그 세계는 "
"원소 에너지로 가득해서 힘을 회복하기 좋은 장소야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0150_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a902319c-cddd-4a48-8fd7-b6a7f4d63e93"
msgid ""
"\"They organized something like a secret society, and gathered in the "
"evenings in their huts. They spoke of opening everyone's eyes, and making "
"them treat the outcasts with dignity. Sooner or later, they would have done "
"something stupid and gotten themselves caught – and brought my sister down "
"with them. So I helped them a little... and put my patron's people on their "
"track.\n"
"If only I could have kept Kalikke from her foolishness! On the night of the "
"raid, for some reason I told her the truth. I thought I could explain to her "
"that her actions were threatening our secret. I thought she would see reason."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 비밀 결사 비슷한 걸 만들어서 저녁마다 자신들의 오두막에서 모이곤 했지. 그들은 사람들을 계몽해서 자신같은 낙오자들도 존엄한 "
"존재로 대접받게 해야 한다고 떠들더라고. 가만 놔둬도 머지 않아 멍청한 짓을 저질러서 몽땅 잡혀갈게 뻔한 놈들이었지. 칼리케도 함께 "
"위험에 빠트리고 말이야. 그래서 내가 그들을 조금 도왔지. 내 후원자의 부하들이 그들을 추적할 수 있도록 말이야.\n"
"칼리케가 조금만 덜 멍청했어도 모든게 잘 됐을거야. 습격하기로 한 날 밤, 칼리케에게 사실대로 말했어. 자신의 행동이 우리의 비밀을 "
"위험에 빠트리고 있다는 걸 설명하면 그 애가 납득할 거라고 생각했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0151_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "73612664-76a6-4f11-98d9-a258a2e30abf"
msgid ""
"\"But nothing works out as one plans. – She hurried off to warn her friends, "
"and fell into the hands of the Cult of the Dawnflower. Her disguise was "
"unmasked, and with it, my own as well. Oh, sands and skies, I can't imagine "
"the rage my noble patron felt! His aasimar confidant turned out to be a "
"treacherous tiefling. I had no interest in learning how far he'd go in his "
"rage, and immediately set off to flee. Alas – as soon as they found out what "
"happened, the remaining members of a cult of daemon worshippers, who I'd "
"once helped to disperse, quickly tracked me down. They summoned a soul "
"eater, who cut my life short. And my story was at its end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 계획은 모조리 틀어지고 말았어. 칼리케는 친구들에게 경고한답시고 허둥대다 여명꽃 교단에게 붙잡혔지. 그녀의 위장이 해제된 순간 "
"내 위장 역시 끝장났어. 아, 모래와 하늘에 걸고! 난 귀족 후원자가 느꼈을 분노를 상상할 수도 없어. 친밀한 아시마르 측근이 사악한 "
"티플링이었다니! 난 뒤도 돌아보지 않고 재빨리 도망쳤어. 하지만 슬프게도, 진상이 알려지기가 무섭게 내가 일전에 후원자를 도와 소탕했던 "
"다이몬 광신도들의 잔당이 나를 추적해왔지. 날 끝장낸 영혼 포식자를 소환한게 바로 그 놈들이었어. 내 이야기는 여기서 끝나버리고 만거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0153_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3cfa9c8e-1a1b-49c7-afe0-3fff5514682e"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity this ability came after we'd paid such a heavy price. I would "
"have avoided my painful death, and I long to see my sister again – and singe "
"her hair to show my gratitude for everything.\" {n}Despite her vitriol, "
"Kanerah sighs – with sorrow and seeming tenderness.{/n} \"The demiplane "
"nourishes us, and keeps us from all kinds of trouble. But the price... it's "
"hard to live and make plans, when at any moment you can be pulled from "
"reality, only to return after a few days – or even weeks. I'm glad that, "
"thanks to you, we have now at least learned to control the process a little."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"능력을 얻는 대가가 너무 비쌌던 셈이지. 내가 이 고통스러운 죽음을 피할 수 있다면, 그 다음에는 칼리케가 너무 보고 싶을 것 같아. "
"우리를 이 꼴로 만든데 대한 감사 인사로 머리카락을 전부 태워버릴 거니까.\" {n}신랄한 말투에도 불구하고 그녀는 슬프게 한숨을 "
"쉬었습니다. 그런 그녀의 모습은 일견 온화해 보이기까지 했습니다.{/n} \"우리를 치료하는 다른 세계는 모든 방해로부터 자유로운 "
"곳이야. 하지만 그 대가로... 계획적으로 살아가는 건 불가능해. 언제라도 현실에서 떨어져 나올 수 있고, 그럼 몇일, 심하면 몇 주 "
"후에나 현실로 돌아올 수 있게 되니까. 그나마 네 덕분에 우리가 약간이나마 이 과정을 조절할 수 있게 된 게 다행이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0154_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3b606091-f49f-493a-8670-6318db47f909"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Jamandi's offer was simply too tempting... bring some pathetic "
"bandits to heel, and receive a barony in return? Of course, 'Kaessi' could "
"never be a baroness, but the adventure itself was an intriguing opportunity. "
"Besides, I was in desperate need of distraction! So I showed up at the "
"reception, made some valuable connections...\" {n}Kanerah locks eyes with "
"you.{/n} \"I witnessed the attack of the unlucky assassins, but then – "
"unfortunately, missed out on all the fun! The moment I ran through fire at "
"the mansion, I was carried away to the demiplane, and Kalikke came forth to "
"deal with the consequences. You know the rest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자만디의 제안은 너무나 매혹적이었어... 별 볼 일 없는 도적떼를 퇴치하는 대가로 남작 작위를 준다잖아? 물론 '카에시'는 절대 "
"남작이 될 수 없겠지만 모험은 그 자체로 흥미로운 기회야. 때마침 심심하기도 했고! 그래서 연회에 참석했지. 덕분에 아주 의미 있는 "
"인간관계를 만들 수 있었어...\" {n}카네라는 당신을 똑바로 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"암살자들의 재수 없는 최후를 목격한 것도 나야. "
"재미는 거기까지였으니, 운도 없지. 불길을 뚫고 뛰어든 순간, 저택에 있던 난 다른 세계로 끌려갔거든. 뒷일은 칼리케가 맡아야 했고, "
"다음 이야기는 너도 알 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0155_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6184e034-0129-4296-abbb-0d570e0a53a5"
msgid "\"Our home is always open to you... as am I!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 집은 언제나 너에게 열려있어... 나처럼 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0156_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9ac55f93-3a9a-40da-855c-9e758a49558e"
msgid ""
"\"The people of Qadira revere the blood of the skies with the same "
"fanaticism with which they distrust that the blood of {g|Hell}Hell{/g}. "
"Aasimars, especially emberkin, are welcome guests in any house. Pretend to "
"be one of them – and all doors are open to you. I didn't want to participate "
"in this masquerade, but my sister insisted. We played upon our resistance to "
"fire, and her gift of controlling this force of nature. – Both are often "
"taken as signs of Sarenrae's good will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카디라 사람들은 지옥의 혈통을 증오하는 것 만큼이나 열렬하게 천상의 혈통을 숭배하지. 아시마르, 그 중에서도 특히 엠버킨은 어디에서나 "
"극진하게 환영받는 손님이야. 만약 엠버킨으로 위장한다면? 세상에 못할 게 없는 거지. 나는 이 가장에 끼어들기 싫었지만, 언니가 워낙 "
"강하게 밀어붙였어. 우리는 불에 대한 저항력으로, 언니는 특히 자연의 힘을 조종하는 재능으로 사람들을 속였지. 흔히 이 두 가지 재주를 "
"서렌레이의 은총의 증거로 여겼거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0159_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f17931aa-7d77-4bc3-9447-bb772091f7e5"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"분부대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0161_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "200e83f8-bba6-4e50-ac35-ee3ebc76b37d"
msgid ""
"\"It's not easy. {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} made us agree to keep our story "
"secret. In everyone else's eyes, we must remain one creature, 'Kaessi', a "
"whimsical outlander with strange abilities. We keep a diary, describing our "
"everyday life in detail, telling each other about all our new acquaintances –"
" to help us protect our secret. If someone ever happens to see us 'switch', "
"we say it's a special skill that allows us to travel through the elemental "
"plane to replenish our powers. We're lucky to live in a world full of "
"miracles. – It is not hard to convince people of such magic...\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 쉽지 않지. 네서스는 우리의 이야기를 비밀로 할 것을 다짐시켰어. 남들의 눈에 우리는 반드시 '카에시'라는, 한 사람으로 "
"보여야만 해. 기이한 능력을 가진 별난 방랑자 카에시 말이야. 우리는 매일 있었던 일, 만났던 모든 사람에 대해 아주 자세하게 일기를 "
"써. 비밀을 지키려면 꼭 필요한 일이지. 누군가 우리가 존재를 바꾸는 모습을 보았다면, 그건 힘을 보충하기 위해 잠깐 원소계를 여행하는 "
"특별한 재주였다고 둘러대. 기적이 가득한 세계에 사는 게 다행이지. 사람들이 쉽게 마법이라고 믿어주니까 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0163_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4fb84a64-017b-4690-a28f-fe5ad14130cb"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! I may long for my native country, but this river land brings peace to "
"my soul. I enjoy watching the clumsy ducklings struggling to go down to the "
"lake – and the dragonflies flying over water, as it flashes with glints of "
"sunlight... I'm glad to have seen all this, though the road that brought me "
"here was a road of sorrow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래! 나는 고향이 그리워. 하지만 강이 흐르는 이 땅도 내 마음에 평화를 줘. 나는 새끼 오리들이 서투르게 호수를 항해 걸어가는걸 "
"지켜보는 게 좋아. 반짝이는 햇빛이 반사되는 물 위를 잠자리들이 날아다니는 것도. 이곳에 오기까지의 여정은 슬픔으로 가득했지만, 그래도 "
"이 모든 걸 볼 수 있어서 정말 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0164_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4940b84e-a41c-47af-aed4-1e57668a0756"
msgid ""
"\"The divine creature made us agree to these mysterious conditions. And "
"what's even more mysterious – we weren't punished when you discovered our "
"secret. But I think I can hear a storm murmuring on the horizon. We might "
"yet have to pay for our faults. But come what may – at least I did "
"everything I could to tear my sister from the arms of death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신의 사자가 이 알쏭달쏭한 조건을 내걸었지. 더 이해하기 어려운건 우리가 이미 우리의 비밀을 드러내서 약속을 어겼는데도 아무 징벌이 "
"없었다는 거야. 하지만 난 멀리 지평선 가장자리에서 폭풍 치는 소리가 들려오는 것처럼 두려워. 단지 처벌이 좀 미뤄진 것 뿐일 수도 "
"있으니까. 하지만 어찌 되든 상관 없어. 난 지금껏 저주받은 죽음의 손아귀에서 언니를 구해내기 위해 최선을 다했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0166_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "06b746e3-d3dd-4e2b-8ecb-f63d3c4a1fa3"
msgid ""
"\"Sweet Linzi writes real poems. Mine are... no more than an attempt to talk "
"to myself. And sometimes to the sister that I can no longer hear or see...\""
msgstr ""
"\"시는 린지 같이 사랑스러운 애들이나 쓸 수 있지. 내 시는... 나 자신과 대화하는 수단에 불과해. 가끔은 언니에게 들려주는 시이기도 "
"하고. 다시는 이야기할 수도, 만날 수도 없는 언니 말이야…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0171_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4463b4d9-3fa3-492a-8433-6f75da023f66"
msgid ""
"\"She must. But she doesn't let it show. Still, I often find small gifts "
"next to the notes – a strange flower, or my favorite sweets...\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론. 하지만 그녀는 보여주지 않을 거야. 여전히 나는 가끔 작은 선물을 발견하고는 해. 낯선 꽃이나 내가 좋아하는 사탕이 일기에 "
"꽂혀있는 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0172_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8489b5d9-1426-49cb-b8ca-5488dfbaea20"
msgid ""
"\"Then don't bother reading them. Life is short. Don't waste it on things "
"that don't make you happy.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 읽지 않아도 돼. 삶은 짧으니까. 너를 불행하게 하는 일로 시간을 낭비하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0173_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2a2392bd-d630-47ab-a16d-e03f7eea8b99"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl is a little embarrassed.{/n} \"As you wish. I don't like to hide "
"things from those who are close to me... I have done this too often.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 조금 당황한 것 처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"원하는 대로. 나는 더 이상 가까운 주변 사람들을 속이고 싶지 않아... 너무 "
"자주 그래왔기는 하지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0175_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "aa5dfda8-4b32-4dfa-9dcc-880bdc491d0c"
msgid ""
"\"I'd have to spend the whole evening telling you all the details. Contracts "
"require thoughtfulness and accuracy, especially ones like this. But to put "
"it simply – I was to do as he commanded, and in return he granted me a "
"powerful illusion, which would make my sister and I indistinguishable from "
"emberkin – descendants of {g|peri}peri{/g}\"."
msgstr ""
"\"너에게 시시콜콜한 세부 사항까지 모두 이야기하려면 밤을 새야 할 거야. 모든 계약에는 심사숙고와 정확성이 필요하고, 특히 악마와의 "
"계약이라면 더더욱 그렇겠지? 간단하게 말하자면, 내가 그의 명령에 따르는 대신 그는 나와 칼리케에게 강력한 환영 마법을 걸어서 엠버킨 – "
"{g|peri}페리{/g}의 자손으로 위장하는걸 도와주기로 한 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0176_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "adb05417-7044-40fc-82b5-62414d7cb147"
msgid ""
"\"The contract included a number of caveats and limitations. In particular, "
"the tasks that devil would give me could do me no harm. The contract didn't "
"involve my soul. – On the contrary, it bound me until my death, but no "
"longer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"계약에는 많은 주의 사항과 제한 사항이 포함되어 있어. 구체적인 예를 보면, 데블이 나에게 주는 임무는 나에게 해가 없는 것으로 "
"한정되지. 그리고 내 영혼은 계약 조건에서 자유로운 반면에, 계약의 유효기간은 내가 죽을 때까지야. 즉, 지금은 계약기간이 끝난 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0177_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "26b47e89-efd1-46b8-ba11-76ff821403d1"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing helps to turn souls away from a faith better than fanatics of the "
"faith. You have no idea, {name}, how often a zealous servants of the good, "
"in their struggle against evil, has pushed others in the arms of that very "
"same evil. That's why the Forefather sent me to serve the followers of the "
"Cult of the Dawnflower. – Unlike the old church of Sarenrae, those cultists "
"celebrate the goddess more for her warrior aspect than for her mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 종교를 저버리게 하는 일등공신은 바로 그 종교의 광신도들이지. {name} 너는 잘 모를거야. 자칭 선신의 열성 신도들이 "
"악신에 맞서 싸운다는 미명 하에 얼마나 많은 사람들을 그 악신의 손아귀로 밀어넣고 있는지. 선조가 여명꽃 교단에 나를 파견한 것도 그 "
"때문이었어. 전통적인 서렌레이의 교회와는 달리, 그 광신자들은 여신의 자비심 보다는 전사로서의 면모에만 집중하는 자들이었거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0179_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1aa10250-2693-47f4-a05e-9c3590ead8fa"
msgid ""
"\"You'd be amazed. They included... fighting evil. The Forefather comes from "
"a line of apostate devils or deimaviggas. They live for one goal only – to "
"turn people's souls away from serving any god but {g|Asmodeus}Asmodeus{/g}. "
"Our deimavigga made a nest for himself in Qadira long ago, finding special "
"pleasure in enslaving the servants of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 아마 놀랄걸. 계약에는... 악과 대적해 싸우는 것도 포함되어 있어. 선조는 데이마비가라고도 불리우는 변절한 데블의 일족이지. "
"그들이 존재하는 목적은 단 하나야. 사람들의 영혼을 타락시켜 그들이 섬기던 신들에게서 떠나게 하는 거지. 단 하나, "
"{g|Asmodeus}아스모데우스{/g}만을 제외하고 말이야. 선조는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 종들을 타락시키는 재미에 "
"맛들려 이미 오래 전부터 카디라에 악의 둥지를 틀고 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0180_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ecf98c68-dadf-4d13-8c1d-af3210eedec7"
msgid ""
"\"My duties included seeking out secret cults of demon and daemon "
"worshipers, and other springs of evil in the sunswept land of Qadira – real "
"or imaginary. Questions, suspicions, public trials, one or two exemplary "
"executions – and fear sank its claws into the hearts of the weak and "
"doubtful. 'How can a good goddess allow this? What if I'm next?' Those who "
"entertained such doubts would soon hear a knock on their door from a "
"messenger of {g|Hell}Hell{/g}, offering a simple solution: protection and "
"prosperity, in return for their souls. That's how I aided the legions of "
"hell, by working under Sarenrae's sunny banner.\""
msgstr ""
"\"데몬이나 다이몬 숭배자들, 그리고 기타 비슷한 악의 근원을 색출하는 것이 선조가 준 임무였어. 물론 카디라의 작렬하는 태양 아래를 "
"배회하는 이 악의 무리들은 진짜일 수도 있고, 조작해서 만들어낸 상상의 악일 수도 있었지. 취조, 혐의, 재판, 공개 처형. 이걸 "
"지켜보는 이들의 마음 속에는 당연히 공포가 자라나 신앙을 좀먹고 의심의 씨앗을 뿌렸어. '서렌레이가 정말로 선한 여신이라면 어떻게 이런 "
"일을 용납할 수 있지? 다음에는 내가 저런 꼴을 당할 수도 있는데?' 그럼 곧 지옥의 사자가 이 고뇌하는 사람들의 집에 찾아와서는 보호와 "
"번영을 약속하는 거지. 물론 그들의 영혼을 대가로. 이게 바로 내가 서렌레이의 찬란한 깃발 아래에서 지옥의 군단을 돕는 방법이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0183_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2f8a4b8f-f15e-425c-bcc9-48c3c45a4683"
msgid "\"If you say so...\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇게 말한다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0186_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "487ae6dc-ccb2-47f3-9c26-f4f9fda3e00d"
msgid ""
"\"I prefer large and bustling cities to backwaters. But on the other hand, "
"the chance to build up a whole state from nothing – it's so tempting... I "
"don't like chaos, though I've learned that at times I won't be able to play "
"by the rules. So here is my answer – with some effort and right investments, "
"your dominions might become something, someday.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 보잘 것 없는 촌구석보다는 크고 붐비는 도시가 좋아. 하지만 또 한편으로는 아무 것도 없는 곳에서부터 도시 전체를 새롭게 건설할 "
"수 있는 기회도 무척 마음에 들어... 나는 혼돈을 싫어하지만, 사람이 늘 법과 규칙대로만 살 수는 없다는 사실도 잘 알고 있다고. 내 "
"대답은 이거야. 적당한 노력과 투자만 뒷받침해준다면, 네 영토는 언젠가 아주 위대한 번영을 이룰 수도 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0191_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "af04f464-b88d-4fae-bef8-caefec0efa0e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke casts a quick glance at you, and then sighs faintly.{/n} \"I'm "
"not sure I read your words correctly, but I will ask you not to repeat them. "
"My life hangs by a thread, held by a devious devil and a powerful deity. I "
"do not belong to myself, and I do not wish to become attached to anyone.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 당신을 잠깐 바라보고는 작게 한숨짓습니다.{/n} \"내가 제대로 이해했는지 모르겠지만, 다시 이야기하지는 말았으면 "
"좋겠어. 내 삶은 사악한 데블과 강력한 신격이 쥐고 있는 가는 실 한 올에 대롱대롱 매달려있는 것과 같아. 지금 내 삶은 내 것이 "
"아니니까, 아무에게도 얽메이고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0192_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f549664c-a271-497c-91b2-3671f0f56e23"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. You have no idea how glad I am to be with someone I don't need "
"to hide my secret from, and who supports me...\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 내 비밀을 숨기지 않아도 되고 나를 돕는 사람과 같이 있으니 얼마나 좋은지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0193_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f47d3a79-302c-4b5f-8fcb-c05c89650055"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps. When you walk in the shadow for long enough, it's hard to step "
"into the sun again.\""
msgstr "\"아마도. 네가 오랫동안 어둠의 길을 걸었을 때 빛의 길을 다시 가는 건 쉽지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0195_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "31b02b2c-b529-43f0-a3a3-adfb05a1ef66"
msgid ""
"\"I like living here. For the first time since fleeing Qadira, I feel "
"there's a place in the world I can call home. And besides...\" {n}Kalikke "
"frowns.{/n} \"I probably should have brought this up myself, but I couldn't "
"bring myself to do it. I am very, very worried about the Forefather – the "
"devil my sister made a contract with, long ago in Qadira. Kanerah thinks "
"he's no longer a threat to us, since her death annulled the contract. But I "
"don't believe such a creature can ever leave us in peace. I'd like there to "
"be someone beside me who I can rely on in case he shows up again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여기에 사는 게 좋아. 카디라를 벗어나고 처음으로 집이라고 부를 수 있는 곳을 찾았다고나 할까. 하지만...\" {n}칼리케는 "
"미간을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"나 혼자 해결할 수 없는 어려운 문제가 하나 있어. 나는 카디라에서 언니와 계약했던 데블, 선조가 너무 "
"걱정돼. 카네라는 자신이 죽어서 계약이 무효가 된 이상 데블이 우리에게 위협이 되지 않는다고 생각하지만 나는 그런 사악한 존재가 우리를 "
"가만 내버려 둘 리가 없다고 봐. 데블이 나타났을 때 의지할 수 있는 누군가가 옆에 있었으면 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0197_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fea9640a-cea0-4fa3-8b89-b6f8786f724b"
msgid ""
"\"A fair question. You see... there's an important detail about how I died "
"and returned to life. I was killed by a repulsive creature called a soul "
"eater. After a spell-caster aims it at its victim, the wretch will chase it "
"tirelessly and endlessly. But when I was returned to life, the soul eater "
"lost its prey. But it's still chasing me, and might show up at any time. It "
"would be much easier for me if I could meet it here, surrounded by "
"experienced monster hunters, ready to protect a poor fugitive from danger..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋은 질문이야. 너도 알다시피 내가 죽었다 살아나는 과정에는 꼭 짚고 넘어가야 되는 게 하나 있어. 나는 영혼포식자라는 역겨운 "
"괴물한테 목숨을 잃었지. 마법사가 목표를 정해주면, 그 순간부터 이 괴물은 휴식도 포기도 없이 그 목표를 쫓아가게 돼. 하지만 내가 "
"죽음에서 돌아왔을 때, 이 괴물은 목표였던 나를 놓친 상태였지. 아직 나를 포기하지 않은 건 확실하고, 언제라도 다시 나타날 수 있다고 "
"생각해. 차라리 여기 나타나주면 좋겠네. 지금 내 주변에는 아주 숙련된 괴물 사냥꾼들이 많잖아? 게다가 모두 나처럼 불쌍한 난민을 기꺼이 "
"도울 준비가 되어 있고 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0200_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b26665fb-adb7-41cd-8ea3-3283a9fd9422"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah folds her hands on her chest.{/n} \"It's your choice whether you "
"protect your valuable companions or not... But now I can switch places with "
"Kalikke at any time – and the wretch shouldn't attack her. So in the end, I "
"guess you've already helped...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"우리처럼 귀중한 동료를 도와줄지 말지는 네가 알아서 할 일이야. 하지만 지금은 난 마음대로 "
"칼리케와 자리를 바꿀 수 있어. 영혼 포식자는 자기 목표가 아닌 칼리케를 공격하지는 않을 거니까. 그러니 결국 너는 어떻게든 우리를 "
"도와준 셈이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0204_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6ec20518-ae8b-4c2a-b673-099e7a8d1e29"
msgid ""
"\"If things get bad, we'll have to flee again, or we'll put you and your "
"people at great risk. But I believe it's here that we will find the strength "
"to face Hell's claims on us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상황이 나빠지면 우리는 다시 도망쳐야 해. 그렇지 않으면 너와 너희 백성들이 큰 위험에 처하게 돼. 하지만 또 한편으로는 우리와 함께 "
"지옥에 맞설 사람을 찾을 곳도 여기 밖에 없다고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0205_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e2678a69-684d-4c48-ac7d-d7ad6248a22e"
msgid ""
"\"That is up to you. Send us away if you'd rather avoid this potential "
"threat...\""
msgstr "\"그건 너에게 달렸어. 잠재적인 위험을 원치 않으면 우리를 보내...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0207_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "66d53a14-4a0d-4a56-ac75-6b21defe9374"
msgid "\"Thank you, and rest assured – I'll serve you loyally.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 열과 성을 다해 봉사할테니 안심하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0209_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d2b7956d-cc0f-4e59-82b1-ebad5d7240e3"
msgid "{n}Kalikke turns pale.{/n} \"What... what did he want?\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케의 얼굴이 창백해집니다.{/n} \"잠깐... 그가 무얼 원했던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0214_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fc4f66b5-4709-4bb5-bb24-09a177c1dc3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah shivers and holds her shoulders.{/n} \"The soul eater... no "
"matter how I try, I'm never able to think of our last encounter as 'just "
"another unpleasant episode from my past'. Maybe it's because I understood "
"perfectly well what was happening. I was completely alone, losing a fight, "
"being killed by a monster that would eat my soul. And I would lose "
"everything, even an afterlife.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 몸을 떨며 팔로 어깨를 감쌉니다.{/n} \"영혼 포식자... 아무리 애써봐도 그 괴물과의 만남은 '과거에 있었던 불쾌한 "
"사건' 정도로 넘겨버릴 수가 없어. 그날 무슨 일이 있었는지 아직도 똑똑히 기억나. 싸움에 지고, 내 영혼까지 먹어치울 괴물에게 "
"살해당하고, 나는 철저하게 혼자였지. 모든 것을 잃어버리게 될 처지였어. 심지어는 사후에 남을 영혼까지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0219_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "21274e0d-03b0-4b93-b628-59bae73140ce"
msgid ""
"\"Nethys' Herald and his creation. She's a living whirlwind of magical "
"energy, an amazing and powerful creature. She often takes interest in the "
"business of mortals, and manifests Nethys' will. In our case, I think, she's "
"done both. – The {g|Arcanotheign}Arcanotheign{/g} wanted to intervene and "
"help, but she also told us that Nethys was aware of what happened. It's so "
"strange to think that a deity turned his eyes on you, if only for a moment..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"네서스의 전령이자 피조물이지. 그녀는 소용돌이치는 마법 에너지의 살아있는 현신이야. 놀랍고도 강력한 생명체지. 보통 그녀는 필멸자들 "
"사이에서 일어나는 일에 관심을 가지기도 하고, 네서스의 의지를 표명하는 일을 맡기도 해. 우리의 경우는 두가지 모두에 해당했지. 직접 "
"우리 일에 개입해서 도움을 준 건 {g|Arcanotheign}아르카노데인{/g} 자신의 뜻이었지만, 동시에 그녀는 네서스 역시 무슨 "
"일이 있었는지 잘 알고 있다고도 했어. 잠깐이라도 그런 신적 존재가 우리를 주시하고 있었다니 정말 희한한 일이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0221_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "89cd9e7c-b1b7-459b-9faf-b66a774f393f"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe. My sister and I have tried to figure out what happened, but failed. "
"We need a real specialist in this sort of magic... a specialist like I can't "
"even imagine. I can definitely say that the Disk hasn't been destroyed. – It "
"seems to have become a part of my connection with my sister, helping us to "
"move between the Material Plane and our demiplane. We'll continue to explore "
"this new ability. Maybe we'll learn more at some point...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도. 우리는 무슨 일이 일어났는지 이해해보려고 했지만 실패했어. 아마도 상상할 수 없을 만큼 강력한 마법 전문가의 도움이 필요할 "
"것 같아. 확실한 건 원반은 아직 파괴되지 않았다는 거야. 대신 나와 칼리케를 잇는 연결의 일부가 되어 우리가 물질계와 우리 차원 사이를 "
"오가는 걸 돕고 있는 게 아닌가 싶어. 일단 새로 얻은 이 능력을 좀 더 연구해보겠어. 그럼 언젠가는 무슨 일이 있었는지 더 잘 알게될 "
"수도 있겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0223_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "298ded21-1e38-4c1f-aeb8-155d3d70d70e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke nods.{/n} \"Ancient forces can be mysterious. I thought we'd need "
"to spend a lot of time studying the properties of the Disk before we learned "
"how to use it... But it just worked as soon as we touched it! If I "
"understand its action correctly, it attuned itself to the connection between "
"the Material Plane and our demiplane. Now we can move between them at will, "
"and the rest is handled by our strange inner connection. I step into the "
"demiplane, and Nethys' power transports Kanerah from there to the Material "
"Plane.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"고대의 힘은 신비스러워. 난 원반의 속성을 오래 연구해야만 원반을 사용할 수 있을 거라 생각했어. "
"그런데 실제로 원반은 우리가 손을 대자마자 작동하기 시작했지! 내가 이해한 게 맞다면, 원반은 물질계와 우리 차원 사이의 연결에 맞추어 "
"자신을 동조시켰어. 그래서 이제 우리는 마음만 먹으면 두 차원 사이를 오갈 수 있게 됐지. 우리 사이의 신비한 연결이 알아서 모든 걸 "
"조율해줘. 내가 우리 차원으로 들어가면, 네서스의 권능이 카네라를 물질계로 전송해주는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0225_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "65865c03-4db8-4959-be46-cc7cbbb285de"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I don't remember anyone worrying about me like this, except for "
"my sister... But you're saying the soul eater is back?! What should we do... "
"I'm afraid of the Forefather and his plots, but can we safely dismiss him? "
"We might just bring even more trouble down upon us...\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워. 언니 말고 나를 이렇게 걱정해주는 사람은 없었어... 하지만 영혼 포식자가 돌아왔다고 했지?! 어떻게 해야 할까... 선조와 "
"그의 계획도 두려워. 우리가 무사히 그 악마와의 거래를 정리할 수 있을까? 어쩌면 우리가 더 큰 문제에 휘말려들고 있는 것일 수도 "
"있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0227_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5e4e1a06-2abc-402d-bfd2-c041b84308aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah puts her hands on your shoulders.{/n} \"It's like I feel the "
"desert heat and the cold northern wind at the same time...\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 당신의 어깨에 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"사막의 열기와 북쪽의 추위를 동시에 느끼는 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0229_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8f0b9f6a-7c96-4a5a-aff7-cdbe8c0a1b12"
msgid ""
"\"I knew something happened! There are scorch marks all around the house, as "
"if someone got too anxious and couldn't control herself... Tell me – what "
"happened!?\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 일이 일어났다는 건 알고 있었어! 집 주위에는 누군가 불안해서 자신을 통제 못한 것처럼 탄 흔적이 여기저기 있었어... 무슨 "
"일이 일어났던 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0233_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "61a69e84-3468-4263-a3dd-bd3f26eb57f8"
msgid ""
"\"You know our story. Most of our lives we lived in disguise. Kanerah has "
"always been surrounded by admirers. I can barely remember a week passing "
"without her receiving an invitation to courtship. But who was it that her "
"suitors really pursued? Our whole story was fiction, and our faces were "
"illusions of beautiful aasimars. The lucky ones who my sister allowed to get "
"close – not only could they never look into her soul... They didn't even see "
"her real body.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 이제 우리의 얘기를 잘 알고 있을거야. 대부분의 우리 삶 동안 우리는 변장하며 살았어. 카네라는 항상 그녀를 흠모하는 추종자 "
"무리에 둘러싸여 지냈지. 그녀는 하루가 멀다하고 궁정 모임에 초대받느라 바빴어. 하지만 그 치들이 정말로 쫓아다닌 카네라는 누구였을까? "
"우리의 이야기는 전부 거짓이었고 우리의 모습 역시 아름다운 아시마르의 환영에 불과했지. 카네라에게 가까이 다가갈 수 있었던 운 좋은 "
"녀석들도 그녀의 영혼은 고사하고 그녀의 진짜 육신조차도 보지 못한 셈이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0234_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fd69ddd8-723b-4ce0-94f9-4e201d3626a1"
msgid ""
"\"Please, don't talk to me about that. Not now, when I'm grieving a loss. Or "
"better yet – never. As for Kanerah... it's not so simple with her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나에게 그 이야기는 하지 말아줘. 특히 지금처럼 내가 슬퍼하고 있을 때에는. 아니, 아예 평생 하지 않는 게 좋을 거야. 카네라로 "
"말할 것 같으면... 그게 그렇게 간단하지가 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0235_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "685a4363-ff6e-4ebf-b4f3-aeddffeb9edf"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke pinches the tip of her tail pensively, and her face brightens "
"with a smile for a moment.{/n} \"There are some things that baffle even my "
"cold and rational sister, and she gets lost like a child. Sincere mutual "
"affection – not to mention love – is one of those things.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 자신의 꼬리를 손에 쥐고 생각에 잠겨 있다가, 다시 밝게 웃으며 말합니다.{/n} \"이성적이고 차가운 카네라도 어떤 문제 "
"앞에서는 길 잃은 아이처럼 당황해서 헤맬 때가 있어. 서로를 향한 진실한 감정 — 꼭 사랑은 아니더라도 — 같은 것 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0236_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9a33f65e-2078-4211-a637-1933d9691438"
msgid ""
"{n}There's deep sorrow in Kalikke's eyes.{/n} \"Let's not talk about it. "
"There are those who were born under a lucky star, which brings them love and "
"happiness. But I'm not so blessed, and my path takes me through lonely, dark "
"places. As for Kanerah... it's not so simple with her.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케의 눈에 깊은 슬픔이 어립니다.{/n} \"그 이야기는 하지 말자. 행운의 별 아래 태어나 행복과 사랑 가운데 살아가는 사람도 "
"있지. 하지만 나에게 그런 행운은 주어지지 않았고, 내 인생은 내내 외롭고도 어두컴컴한 길을 걸어가는 것과 같았어. 카네라의 경우에는… "
"그렇게 간단하지만은 않았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0237_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d2de577d-798a-46f0-9a5a-47a1ac4fcee7"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure that her response to your confession would be to sneer, put on "
"airs, or pretend she doesn't care about anything. But in truth I think she's "
"perplexed. She's never been in a situation where someone liked her for what "
"she really is. If you do care about her – then show her. Show her, and earn "
"her trust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마 언니는 네 고백을 듣고 평소처럼 이죽거리면서 아무렇지 않은 척 했을거야. 하지만 난 실제로는 언니가 무척 당황했을 거라고 "
"생각해. 언니는 자기의 진짜 모습을 좋아해주는 사람은 겪어본 적이 없거든. 만약 네가 정말 언니를 좋아한다면, 그걸 더 많이 표현해줘. "
"언니가 그걸 신뢰하게 될 때까지 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0241_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e2d2910b-78dc-4cb7-b9c4-7a3c7dc9d6b2"
msgid ""
"\"Be patient. But don't forget to impress her. Don't let her down. Life with "
"her is chaos and unpredictability. The feeling the has blossomed between you "
"can die just as easily – much more easily. Forgive me if I can't help beyond "
"this simple advice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"인내심이 중요하지. 하지만 언니를 감동하게 만드는 것도 잊지마. 그녀를 실망시켜서는 안돼. 언니와 함께 지내는 건 혼돈의 연속이야. "
"무슨 일이 생길지 예측할 수 없지. 둘 사이에 싹튼 감정이 금방 시들어버릴 수도 있어. 생각도 못한 순간에 말이야. 이런 바보같은 조언 "
"밖에 못하는 날 용서해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0242_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6b979ba1-c955-453e-a50e-d9fa2348be34"
msgid "\"I am glad to help!\""
msgstr "\"도움이 되어서 기뻐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0244_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7026b28e-489e-4994-9f7b-728bc4b0187f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah's cheeks blush again.{/n} \"As you wish. You see, everything is "
"fine. You like me, I like you, and we can keep having a good time and "
"enjoying each other...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라의 뺨은 붉어집니다.{/n} \"원하는 대로. 모든 것이 괜찮아. 너는 나를 좋아하고 나는 너를 좋아하고. 우리는 좋은 시간을 "
"보내고 서로를 즐겁게 하니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0245_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4a1f76d9-3fbe-48a1-9731-c3cabedf242e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah looks at you excitedly, dancing in place.{/n} \"What a fine day, "
"isn't it?\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 제자리에 서서 춤을 추며 신난 듯 당신을 바라봅니다. {/n} \"정말 좋은 날이지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0248_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9d721185-a613-4cf8-8127-dbdf814c71c6"
msgid ""
"\"You do realize – sooner or later, you and I will just burn this house to "
"the ground in the heat of passion – and then the entire capital!"
msgstr "\"곧 알게 될 거야. 우리는 이 집을 열정으로 태워버릴 거야. 그리고 수도 전체도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0249_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b8a87a94-f566-46a7-9ee8-191e964e72ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah exhales loudly, and sweeps her tail along the floor twice, but "
"refrains from saying anything harsh.{/n} \"As you wish.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 숨을 씩씩 내쉬면서 꼬리로 바닥을 두어번 거칠게 쓸어냈지만, 심한 말을 쏟아내는 건 간신히 참아낸 것 같습니다.{/n} "
"\"원하는 대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0250_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3ebd08b5-0b29-4bbe-9236-6f905137c69f"
msgid ""
"\"That was awkward, wasn't it? I'm sorry I ran away, hiding my embarrassment "
"in such an awkward way! It's not like me at all, isn't it?\" {n}Kanerah "
"flashes a perky smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"정말 이상했지? 도망쳐서 미안해. 당황한 걸 감추고 싶어서 그런 이상한 짓을 해버리고 말았어. 나답지 않은 일이었지?\" {n}"
"카네라는 잠시 환하게 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0255_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "add026c6-5e00-471f-b8cd-b1124baf0c85"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah stretches out her willowy body and smiles at you coyly.{/n} "
"\"Hello!\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 그 날씬한 몸을 쭉 뻗어 기지개를 켜고는 당신을 바라보며 수줍게 웃습니다.{/n} \"안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0258_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1e7f39d8-510c-459c-b9dc-e70bbb42bed6"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke is so absentminded that she doesn't notice you at first. She "
"looks into the distance dreamily. But then she shakes herself, shivers and "
"blushes a little.{/n} \"{name}! You... you caught me off guard!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 무언가에 정신이 팔려 당신이 온 것도 알아차리지 못니다. 그녀는 꿈꾸듯 허공을 바라보고 있습니다. 그녀는 이제야 정신을 "
"차린듯, 얼굴을 붉히며 몸을 부들부들 떨고 있습니다.{/n} \"{name}! 너...네가 보고 있는 줄 몰랐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0260_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "29bf63e2-836b-43c7-bebb-c5bfadd51059"
msgid ""
"\"Good luck to you in everything you do! And please, send the Sweet Teeth "
"off on some errand to keep them away from Kanerah.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 하는 모든 일이 잘 되기를! 그리고 단 것 중독자 아이들에게 허드렛일이라도 좀 시켜주길 부탁할게. 그 아이들을 카네라 눈에 띄지 "
"않게 떼어놓아야 하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/CompanionDialog/Cue_0261_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "cbba0890-9621-4e1a-8e7a-3fff6a234054"
msgid ""
"\"Our home is always open to you. And please, do me a favor – send the Sweet "
"Teeth off on some errand so they will stop bothering me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 집에서 넌 언제라도 환영이야. 그리고 부탁 하나만 하자. 단 것 중독자 아이들 좀 어디 먼 데로 심부름 좀 보내버려. 너무 "
"귀찮게 군단 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkePoems_Shadows_name_String
msgctxt "38cc0ecb-5fe7-4be6-b7de-699ea367769e"
msgid "Kalikke's Poems — \"Shadows\""
msgstr "칼리케의 시 - \"그림자\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkePoems_Shadows_text_String
msgctxt "bd099965-9451-47c0-bb64-874b45adbfd3"
msgid ""
"\"This town in a foreign land\n"
"Has a narrow twisting street\n"
"With lanterns hanging on the left and right.\n"
"As I walk the twisting path between,\n"
"And the lanterns shine behind my back,\n"
"I leave one shadow on the wall,\n"
"And leave another on the road.\n"
"Since the day I settled here,\n"
"Every evening when the lanterns shine,\n"
"And the shadows dance in their light,\n"
"I walk this narrow twisting street,\n"
"And you know why.\""
msgstr ""
"\"외국 땅의 이 마을은\n"
"좁고 구불구불한 길이 이어져\n"
"길가에는 등불이 걸려있네.\n"
"내가 등불 사이 구불구불한 곳을 걸어가고\n"
"등불은 내 등을 비쳐주고\n"
"나는 벽에 그림자 하나를 남기네.\n"
"그리고 그림자 하나를 길에 남기네.\n"
"내가 정착한 이후로\n"
"매일 저녁 등불이 빛나면\n"
"등불 안에서 그림자가 춤을 추고\n"
"나는 좁고 구불구불한 길을 걷는데\n"
"당신은 그 이유를 알겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkePoems_Whispers_name_String
msgctxt "4dff7a79-b8f3-4518-895f-1c51d09deeef"
msgid "Kalikke's Poems — \"Echoes\""
msgstr "칼리케의 시 - \"메아리\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkePoems_Whispers_text_String
msgctxt "7912fc9f-14e8-4205-b238-96dd7a63f65c"
msgid ""
"\"If someone asks me\n"
"The saddest things I've seen,\n"
"I'll name a trampled rose,\n"
"A child at a mother's grave,\n"
"And two one-winged birds, locked in the same cage.\n"
"Beauty without future,\n"
"A last goodbye, and freedom lost,\n"
"Wings meant to lift you to the sky,\n"
"Now halved and useless,\n"
"What are they now – the final sadness?\n"
"And yet there's something stronger, deeper,\n"
"That lives despite it.\n"
"Hope.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가 내가 본 것중\n"
"가장 슬픈 것을 묻는다면\n"
"짓밟힌 장미\n"
"어머니 무덤 옆에 선 아이\n"
"그리고 날개 하나뿐인 새 두 마리가 한 새장에 갇힌 것이라 하겠네.\n"
"미래가 없는 아름다움\n"
"작별 인사와 잃어버린 자유\n"
"이제는 반쪽이 되어 쓸모가 없어져\n"
"당신을 하늘로 들어올리던 양 날개\n"
"그것들은 슬픔이 아니고 이제 무엇인가?\n"
"거기에 강하고 깊은 것이 아직 남아있다네.\n"
"슬픔에도 불구하고 그것이 살아있네.\n"
"희망이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkePoems_Winter_name_String
msgctxt "59092248-5774-48a1-b33f-fde730c6b5b3"
msgid "Kalikke's Poems — \"Winter\""
msgstr "칼리케의 시 - \"겨울\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkePoems_Winter_text_String
msgctxt "5d419be2-63ba-42af-9e82-1b344e8022aa"
msgid ""
"\"I learned today that northern skies\n"
"Have a desert sand of their own,\n"
"Called 'snow'.\n"
"Touched by the sunlight,\n"
"It outshines any gem I've ever seen\n"
"With my dazzled eyes.\n"
"Oh, how can all these people live\n"
"With all this beauty, yet pay it no heed,\n"
"When skies throw such treasure\n"
"To their very feet?\n"
"I waited patiently until no one\n"
"Was watching,\n"
"Then stole a handful of this snow,\n"
"And ate it.\n"
"Do you laugh?\n"
"Now I know the taste of the north.\n"
"And I like it.\n"
"(Next I will eat an icicle!)\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 오늘 북쪽의 하늘이\n"
"눈이라 불리는\n"
"사막의 모래를 쏟아내는 것을 보았네.\n"
"햇빛이 어루만져\n"
"그것은 그 어떤 보석보다도 빛났고\n"
"내 눈을 어지럽혔네.\n"
"오, 사람들은 어떻게\n"
"하늘이 이런 보물을\n"
"그들의 발치에 던지는데\n"
"이 아름다운 것에 눈길을 주지 않고 살 수 있단 말인가?\n"
"나는 누구도\n"
"눈길을 주지 않을 때까지\n"
"참을 성 있게 기다리고\n"
"눈 한줌을 쥐고는 먹었네.\n"
"나를 보고 웃었나?\n"
"나는 이제 북쪽의 맛을 알았네.\n"
"그리고 그 맛이 좋다네.\n"
"(다음엔 고드름을 먹어보겠네!)\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkeRomancePoem_name_String
msgctxt "8c5fcc69-4183-400a-bbfb-a2a7bf9c0f4c"
msgid "A Crumpled Sheet"
msgstr "구겨진 종이"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/KalikkeRomancePoem_text_String
msgctxt "3e60dbc3-c517-47c0-800b-7484d98d8647"
msgid ""
"The paper is crumpled, and the writing on it is crossed out and barely "
"readable. You can make out only two lines:\n"
"\"... That's when I learned the bitter truth in all its sweetness:\n"
"The brightest dreams are those that never see the waking day.\""
msgstr ""
"이 종이는 심하게 구겨진데다, 그 위에 적힌 글씨도 덧그려진 X표로 지워져 있어 거의 알아보기 어렵습니다. 노력 끝에 두 줄 정도를 "
"간신히 해독할 수 있었습니다: \n"
"\"... 나는 모든 달콤함 속에는 씁쓸한 진실이 숨어있다는 사실을 그제서야 깨달았다.\n"
"가장 아름다운 꿈은 결코 일어나지 않는 법.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/TwinsDiary_name_String
msgctxt "a5931780-a3b6-40ec-992d-42c5a5251cfd"
msgid "Old Diary"
msgstr "낡은 일기장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Items/TwinsDiary_text_String
msgctxt "1d71e67a-17e5-4cf6-a95e-f4eea7df146a"
msgid ""
"\"I'll try to write down quickly everything that's happened. I awoke in the "
"middle of a burning building. There was no time to look for the diary, let "
"alone read it. I ran towards the voices I heard, and got into a big battle. "
"I'd barely figured out what was going on, when a very strange group "
"appeared. They helped me to fight off the assassins, and then got into a "
"quarrel with each other, right in front of Lady Jamandi. I still hadn't had "
"time to read the diary, so I couldn't understand anything that was "
"happening. I somehow made up an excuse so they'd leave me alone. The strange "
"group split into two parties, and set off for the Stolen Lands. I'm staying "
"in Restov for now. I haven't made any new contacts. And I still haven't "
"figured out your old ones...\"\n"
"(a hand-drawn cloud weeping drops of rain stands in the place of a signature)"
"\n"
"\"You silly goat, YOU RUINED EVERYTHING! I ran off my feet trying to find a "
"way to the Stolen Lands, and get my hands on the Disk of the Eclipse. The "
"expeditions organized by Jamandi would have been perfect. I'd hoped to use "
"them to find reliable companions, who could be talked into accompanying "
"'Kaessi' to Sorrowflow. And now here we are, still stuck in Restov — because "
"of you! Couldn't you have simply asked to go with {name}'s group? You could "
"even have gone with Tartuccio. I'm sure that smug gnome could have been "
"gently steered in the right direction.\n"
"But you refused, and now I don't know what we'll do! The Swordlords are "
"running wild looking for spies. I'm just sitting tight, hoping not to arouse "
"suspicion.\n"
"But all this inconvenience hasn't been a complete loss. Interrogations! Oh, "
"and it was Captain Kesten who personally came to interrogate me. How could "
"someone punish me so, sending that delicious man to press his questions? I "
"bet myself that I could make him blush in under three minutes – and I won, "
"of course! Ha ha!\n"
"Ah, yes, our new contacts. You are unlikely to need them, considering your "
"fecklessness, but still.\n"
"Kassil Aldori, a half-orc Swordlord. He accompanied 'Kaessi' when 'she' came "
"to introduce herself to Jamandi. A boring idealist of little interest, but "
"he was friendly enough. He obviously has nothing against tieflings – "
"presumably because he's a half-breed himself.\n"
"Kesten Garess, captain of the guard, a tall human male, with dark curly "
"hair. He's looking for spies, and doesn't seem to suspect 'Kaessi'.\n"
"Linzi, a halfling bard. Round face, chestnut hair. Kept getting in my way. "
"Unreliable and irritating – you'd get along marvelously, I'm sure. "
"Thankfully, she left with the expedition.\n"
"Tartuccio, a gnome wizard, overly fond of the color purple. Funny, I liked "
"something about him – probably his business sense. He's in charge of one of "
"the expeditions.\n"
"Jaethal, a pale dark-haired elf. A spook with a scythe. Always turning her "
"nose up as if she's a queen, but elven queens don't go on expeditions in "
"backwaters like this.\n"
"Harrim, a dwarf. Shaved head, black beard. Don't come any closer to him than "
"an arrow shot, or you'll die from the gloom.\n"
"Valerie, a human. A fighter with a horrible blonde haircut. Mmm, Valerie! "
"I'd gladly pay some dragon or evil wizard to catch her, pluck her out of her "
"armor, and keep her in a cage for six months, taking care that she doesn't "
"abuse her hair. I might just play the dragon or wizard myself!\n"
"Amiri, a barbarian with a sword the size of a kitchen table. A funny sort. "
"Left with the expedition, along with everyone else.\n"
"{name}, a {mf|male|female} {race}. Forget what I said about Kesten and "
"Valerie. – That's the one to catch and make blush!\n"
"Addition: silly goat, we finally got another chance to get to the Stolen "
"Lands and seek the help from my contacts from the above list. If we switch "
"in the meantime, don't ruin everything again — please!\"\n"
"(a hand-drawn flame stands in the place of a signature)"
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 일이 일어난건지 최대한 빨리 적어 놓을게. 내가 잠에서 깼을 때에는 이미 불타는 건물 한가운데였어. 일기를 찾을 여유도, 읽을 "
"여유도 없었지. 나는 목소리가 들리는 쪽으로 달려갔고, 곧바로 큰 전투에 휘말렸어. 나는 여전히 뭐가 어떻게 돌아가고 있는지 알 수가 "
"없었어. 아주 괴상한 모험가 집단이 나타나서 함께 암살자들과 싸웠는데, 싸움이 끝나기 무섭게 자만디의 면전에서 자기들끼리 편을 갈라 "
"말싸움을 벌이더라고. 여전히 일기를 읽을 시간이 없어서 도무지 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 건지 이해할 수가 없었어. 나는 간신히 핑계를 "
"대서 사람들의 관심에서 벗어났지. 그 이상한 무리는 둘로 나뉘어 도둑맞은 땅으로 향했고, 나는 지금 레스토프에 머물고 있어. 그 동안 새 "
"지인을 만들지는 못했고, 언니가 어떤 사람들을 만났었는지도 모르겠네...\"\n"
"(서명 대신 빗방울을 뿌리고 있는 구름 그림이 그려져 있습니다)\n"
"\"멍청한 염소년아! 네가 다 망쳐버렸어! 어떻게든 도둑맞은 땅으로 가서 해와 달을 삼킨 원반을 찾는게 내 계획이었단 말이야! 자만디가 "
"만들려고 했던 원정대야말로 완벽한 기회였다고. 그들을 구워삶아 '카에시'와 함께 슬픔의 폭포로 가도록 만드는게 내 계획이었단 말이야. "
"그런데 바보같은 너 때문에 우리만 레스토프에 발이 묶였잖아! 그냥 {name}의 무리에 끼워달라고 하지 그랬어? 아니면 타투치오와 함께 "
"가기라도 했어야지. 잘난척하는 그 노움 녀석은 우리 말을 듣도록 구슬리기 어렵지 않았을 것 같은데.\n"
"하지만 너는 그 아무 것도 하지 않았잖아? 이제는 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠다! 지금 소드로드는 첩자를 찾으려고 혈안이 되어 있어. 나는 "
"의심의 눈초리를 피하느라 꼼짝 못하고 앉아만 있다고.\n"
"뭐, 안좋은 일만 있었던 건 아니야! 심문은 정말 최고야! 나를 심문한건 케스턴 대장이었는데, 하늘도 무심하시지, 이런 내 취향의 남자가 "
"나를 직접 취조하러 왔단 말이야? 나는 3분 안에 이 남자의 얼굴을 부끄러움으로 빨갛게 물들이고 말겠다고 다짐했고, 물론 그대로 해내고 "
"말았지! 하하!\n"
"새 지인들이라... 너같이 숫기 없는 사람도 그런게 필요한가? 일단 알려는 줄게.\n"
"카실 알도리는 하프오크 소드로드야. 그는 '카에시'가 자만디에게 처음 인사하러 왔을 때 '카에시'를 자만디에게 데리고 갔었지. 지루한 "
"이상주의자지만 친절한 녀석이야. 그는 티플링에 대해 아무 선입견이나 악감정이 없어. 아마 그도 혼혈이라 그런 거겠지.\n"
"경비대장 케스턴 가레스는 검은 곱슬머리에, 키가 큰 인간 남자야. 그는 지금 첩자를 찾고 있는데, '카에시'를 의심하지는 않는 것 같아."
"\n"
"린지는 동그란 얼굴에, 밤색 머리칼을 한 하플링 바드야. 계속 끼어들고 참견하려 드는게 아주 못미덥고 짜증나는 녀석이지. 장담하건데 "
"너랑은 멋진 한 쌍이 될거야. 천만다행히도 이 녀석은 원정대를 따라 떠나버렸군.\n"
"타투치오는 보라색을 너무나 좋아하는 노움 마법사야. 웃긴 녀석이고 그 사업 수완도 아주 마음에 들어. 똑똑한 노움이지. 두 원정대 중 한 "
"쪽의 대장이기도 해.\n"
"제이탈은 검은 머리카락에, 창백한 얼굴을 한 엘프야. 유령처럼 대낫을 들고 다니는 오싹한 여자지. 자기가 여왕이라도 되는냥 콧대 높게 "
"굴지만, 진짜 엘프 여왕은 이런 깡촌 원정단에 참여하지 않는다는 사실은 짧게 언급만 해두겠어.\n"
"하림은 드워프야. 삭발한 머리에 검은 수염. 그에게서 충분히 멀리 떨어져 있어야 해. 그렇지 않으면 너는 우울해져서 죽고 말거야.\n"
"발레리는 인간이야. 금발을 끔찍하게 짧게 자르고 다니는 여전사지. 음, 발레리! 드래곤이나 사악한 마법사가 그녀를 잡아가서 갑옷에서 "
"뽑아낸 다음 반년 정도 우리에 가둬서 그녀가 자기 머리카락을 학대하지 못하게 막아야만 할 것 같아. 아니면 내가 그렇게 할까봐!\n"
"아미리는 식탁만한 큰 검을 들고 다니는 여자 바바리안이야. 좀 웃기지. 다른 사람들과 마찬가지로 원정대와 함께 떠났어.\n"
"{mf|남자|여자} {race}의 {name}. 케스턴과 발레리에 대해 적은 내용은 잊어버려. 난 꼭 이 녀석을 붙잡아서 얼굴이 "
"빨개지도록 희롱하고 싶어!\n"
"추신: 멍청한 염소년아! 도둑맞은 땅으로 갈 기회를 어렵게 다시 만들어 놨어. 도둑맞은 땅에 가기만 하면 이 사람들의 도움을 받을 수 "
"있다고. 혹시 그 사이에 우리가 바뀌게 되더라도, 제발 부탁인데 이번에는 일 좀 망치지 마!\"\n"
"(서명 대신 손으로 그린 불꽃 그림이 자리하고 있습니다)"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ff84bd23-8a19-4cff-b154-d28c9b37e105"
msgid "\"I think you owe me an explanation.\""
msgstr "\"내게 설명을 해줘야 할 거 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f482ebef-e977-48ca-9ac1-4ab0ec3dc08e"
msgid ""
"\"What just happened? That is surely not regular travel between planes.\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 있었어? 방금은 평소 차원 사이를 오갈 때랑은 달랐는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "67e90624-ac06-4807-9df2-85e5091b1d9c"
msgid ""
"\"I feel almost sure that I've just witnessed some sort of a divine "
"intervention...\""
msgstr "\"신격의 개입이 있었던 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4b288495-7e24-4301-b5f7-f9761ed8a7d4"
msgid "Showed kindness to Kalikke."
msgstr "칼리케에게 친절하게 행동했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5c871086-9dd5-4c59-84e2-cd0e114809a3"
msgid "\"Please don't be afraid. You can tell me the truth. What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"겁내지 마. 나에게는 진실을 말해도 돼. 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "57438d60-671e-4d7b-a80f-6870577c6d6b"
msgid ""
"\"So this is why you 'didn't remember' me when we were talking to Jamandi "
"Aldori...\""
msgstr "\"그래서 우리가 자만디 알도리에게 얘기한 걸 '기억하지 못하는' 거로구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "41dba46f-1799-4b5f-8572-02948d85da26"
msgid "\"And how is it you began to live 'in turns'?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 몸을 공유해서 살게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "77e680b4-58eb-4fdd-aff6-18e0bba360dc"
msgid "\"And you can't control these 'switches'?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 마음대로 몸을 바꿀 수 없다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d4d61bf2-dc4b-41d7-aa14-0bf4ada2a3ed"
msgid "Offered to help Kalikke."
msgstr "칼리케에게 도움을 주겠다고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "42c7df9a-54d3-4c8d-a932-c7f1c6656cac"
msgid "\"What can I do to help?\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "31aa7bb2-610a-4c9e-867a-c0aac5aad053"
msgid "\"Fine, let's go.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "63d65e0a-2364-48d5-9294-d561a34ddafd"
msgid "\"I don't want to hear anything, or see you in my lands again.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 듣기 싫어. 아니면 내 땅에서 다시 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "3318cd4d-442b-4475-a116-4e2318f08ae7"
msgid "\"What do you want from me? You must have come here for a reason.\""
msgstr "\"나에게서 무얼 원하는 거야? 이유가 있어서 왔을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "199ceaa2-3f0a-4491-9461-9fdc3dec3901"
msgid "\"If this can help, then I agree.\""
msgstr "\"그게 도움이 된다면 좋아, 동의해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "9144ab51-f5d6-4bbb-a0bd-1233a706daf4"
msgid "\"If it means profit, then I agree.\""
msgstr "\"그게 돈이 된다면 좋아, 동의해\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "1a156f48-f21e-4717-9075-7862aebe94a6"
msgid "\"I'm not interested.\""
msgstr "\"흥미 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "44044a2e-8137-4338-8c31-cf873a09dbb0"
msgid ""
"\"You are marked by all-seeing Nethys – which means we're going the same way!"
"\""
msgstr "\"모든 걸 알고 있는 네서스가 널 지켜보고 있다니. 그러면 나도 마찬가지라는 거잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "1388d0c8-4372-40f6-80a9-58261e640646"
msgid ""
"\"You revealed your secret to me – it means you broke one of the rules set "
"by the deity's herald...\""
msgstr "\"네가 네 비밀을 나에게 말했으니까 — 그럼 그건 네서스의 전령이 정한 법칙을 어긴 게 되는 거잖아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "3d7ab32c-3f82-4111-9a03-dfcd64a8223d"
msgid "\"And how did this Disk come to be in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"그러면 어떻게 그 원반이 도둑맞은 땅에 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "a8b21db9-78d6-4731-b3c4-752671e1d4ca"
msgid "\"Tell me about the location of the treasury.\""
msgstr "\"그 보물이 있는 곳을 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Capital
msgctxt "61c30dd1-21b3-42e2-9a1f-a3f3ef4081f5"
msgid ""
"{n}A tense silence hangs over the house. {d|Kaessi}Kaessi{/d}, your tiefling "
"friend, emerges from the shadows, but her eyes are staring into the "
"distance. She seems to look right past you.{/n} \"No… Not now!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}팽팽한 침묵이 집안을 감돌고 있습니다. 어둠 속에서 모습을 드러낸 당신의 티플링 친구 {d|Kaessi}카에시{/d}의 눈은 허공을 "
"응시하고 있습니다. 그녀가 바라보는 건 당신이 아니라, 당신 너머에 있는 무언가인 것 같습니다.{/n} \"안 돼... 지금은 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "1bcabb1e-7080-4f9f-9a7a-dfdc8860e197"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl closes her eyes and clenches her fists, obviously in the grip of "
"a strong emotion, but one you cannot read.{/n}\n"
"\"I knew it couldn't last forever. Why did he... why did he even make this "
"rule, if he knew it would be impossible to keep?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 주먹을 꽉 쥔 채 눈을 감고 있습니다. 분명 격한 감정에 사로잡혀 있지만 그 감정이 어떤 것인지 당신으로서는 짐작하기 "
"어렵습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"나조차도 이게 오래갈 수 없을거라는 걸 알고 있었어. 그런데 왜 그는... 지키지 못할 줄 뻔히 알면서도 이런 규칙을 만들었을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "8d65364d-83c8-41d0-8255-8f9d191471a7"
msgid ""
"{n}She takes a deep breath, opens her eyes and speaks with firm resolve.{/n} "
"\"Come what may, you should know, {name}, that the person you know by the "
"name of 'Kaessi' does not exist. My real name is Kalikke, and I... we... "
"Well, it's a long story, and such stories are better told beside a welcoming "
"fire. Will you hear me out?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 깊게 숨을 들이쉬고 나서 눈을 떴습니다. 말투에서는 굳은 결의가 느껴집니다.{/n} \"어쨌든 너도 알아야 해. {name}"
". 네가 아는 카에시라는 사람은 존재하지 않아. 내 진짜 이름은 칼리케야. 그리고 나... 우리는... 음, 긴 이야기가 될 거 같으니까 "
"벽난로 곁에서 불이라도 쬐며 대화를 나누는 게 좋을 것 같아. 내 얘기를 끝까지 들어주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "b74e7ae5-f7a1-4531-8ec4-209fd6522306"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl rests her head on her arm and stares off into the distance, lost "
"in memory.{/n} \"Stories by the fire... in the desert where I was born... My "
"fondest memory. When the day is done, hosts and guests, parents and "
"children, friends and rivals, all gather by the fire under the stars to tell "
"their tales. All they did, all they witnessed, all they heard from other "
"travelers, and the whispers carried by the desert wind…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여성은 고개를 팔에 괴고 기억에 잠겨 먼 곳을 응시합니다.{/n} \"불 가에서 나누는 이야기라... 내가 태어난 사막의 일상 중 "
"내가 가장 좋아하는 기억이지. 하루 일과가 끝나면 주인과 손님, 부모자식, 친구와 경쟁자 구분 없이 모두 별빛 아래, 모닥불 가에 모여 "
"앉아 이야기를 나누곤 했어. 그들이 직접 저지른 일, 혹은 목격한 사건, 다른 여행자로부터 들은 이야기, 그리고 사막의 바람에 실려 온 "
"속삭임들까지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "ff44c80e-1a42-4825-a56c-484f751c2ca9"
msgid ""
"{n}The turmoil is suddenly over, but you see fear in Kaessi's eyes. Her blue "
"eyes...{/n} \"It's you! I wanted to say... I…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소란은 곧 그쳤지만 카에시의 눈에는 두려움이 가득합니다. 그녀의 눈은 파란색입니다...{/n} \"너였구나! 내가 말하고 싶었던 "
"건... 어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "2499be8e-8919-48ca-bf94-8bf9ff36152a"
msgid ""
"\"My sister and I often snuck in to hear these stories, hiding in the "
"shadows just beyond the circle of light and warmth. We are hellspawn, you "
"see. Tieflings are unwelcome guests in {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g}, unblessed by "
"the light of merciful {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. We grew up sleeping in a "
"common tent, scavenging food here and there like orphans, all but outcast "
"and disowned. We were thirteen when we left, and set off to find happiness "
"in the cities – and everyone we left behind sighed with relief.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언니와 나는 이야기가 듣고 싶어서 모닥불의 빛과 온기가 닿지 않는 그림자 속으로 살금살금 숨어 들어가곤 했어. 보다시피, 우린 지옥의 "
"존재들이야. 자비로운 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 내리는 빛의 축복 바깥에 있는 생물인 우리 티플링들은 결코 "
"{g|Qadira}카디라{/g}에서 환영받을 수 없는 존재였지. 우린 공용 천막에서 짐짝처럼 잠을 잤고, 여기저기 남은 음식을 뒤져서 "
"끼니를 해결했어. 고아만도 못한, 내버려진 신세였지. 열세 살이 되던 해에, 우린 행복을 찾아 도시를 향해 떠났어. 남은 사람들은 전부 "
"안도의 한숨을 내쉬었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "71bd5197-b7e8-4158-9fb8-363ae1881957"
msgid ""
"\"My sister and I... we are twins, but as different as the sun and moon. Her "
"name is Kanerah, which means 'Silent Flame'. She is fire – a cold fire, but "
"one that turns everything to ash. I am a river. It brings me joy to give "
"water to tired travelers, and nurture green shoots. But when I flood, I am "
"bound to bring death...\" {n}The girl's eyes are full of sorrow.{/n} "
"\"Despite our differences, we are one. Our lives belong to divine "
"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}, and by his mercy we now live... in turns. While one of "
"us is here, the other sleeps in another plane, and when she wakes up, we "
"switch places. Just as you just witnessed...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는... 우리는 쌍둥이지만 해와 달 만큼이나 달라. 언니의 이름은 '조용한 불꽃'이라는 뜻의 카네라야. 그녀는 불, 차가운 "
"불이지만, 모든 것을 재로 바꿔버리는 불이지. 나는 강이야. 지친 여행자들에게 물을 주고, 초록색 새싹을 틔우는 일은 내게 큰 기쁨을 "
"주지. 하지만 내게 홍수가 일어나면, 반드시 주변에 죽음을 몰고 올 거야...\" {n}그녀의 눈은 슬픔으로 가득합니다.{/n} \"이런 "
"차이점에도 불구하고, 우린 하나야. 우리의 삶은 신성한 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 것이고 그의 자비로 우리는 지금 살고 있어... "
"차례대로. 우리 중 하나가 이곳에 머무르는 동안 다른 한 명은 다른 차원에서 잠자고, 잠에서 깨어나면 다시 자리를 바꾸지. 방금 네가 본 "
"것처럼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "1bc4d810-83ff-4809-a9d1-002d3e4759d4"
msgid ""
"\"How could I remember you? I'd never met you at the time. That was Kanerah. "
"She was the one who talked to you at the reception, and helped you fight off "
"the assassins. We usually write each other notes, recounting in detail all "
"that happened, and describing any friends that 'Kaessi' had made. But that "
"time we switched right in the middle of a mansion engulfed in fire and "
"filled with assassins. Kanerah didn't have the time to write any notes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니 내가 어떻게 너를 기억할 수 있겠어? 그때 나는 아직 너를 만난 적도 없었던 거야. 너를 도와 암살자들과 싸웠던 건 "
"카네라였어. 우리는 서로가 없는 동안 무슨 일이 있었고, 어떤 친구들을 새로 사귀었는지 상세하게 기록한 일기를 적곤 해. 하지만 그 때 "
"우리는 암살자들로 가득 찬데다 화염에 휩싸인 저택 한 가운데서 바뀌고 만거야. 카네라도 메모 한 줄 적어넣을 시간이 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "062ecac3-f5ab-4492-a97e-993d738657f1"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl lowers her head.{/n} \"It's not the first time I've heard "
"something like this. Well, farewell!\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"많이 들어봐서 익숙한 말이군. 그럼, 잘 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "03ceb7ec-6f16-4948-88b6-1090f478b2f1"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke lowers her head.{/n} \"This story... It's one I've never told to "
"anyone before. No one in the whole world. And it's not easy to confide in a "
"stranger. – There's too much grief and guilt in it. If you don't mind, I'd "
"rather not go into all the details.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"이 이야기는... 누구에게도 들려준 적 없는 이야기야. 그 누구에게도. 너무나 많은 슬픔과 "
"죄의식으로 가득한 이야기라, 낯선 사람을 믿고 털어놓기 쉽지 않거든. 너만 괜찮다면, 너무 자세하게는 얘기하지 않는게 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "0ad9bbd6-e4a4-4898-bb53-49a672029dff"
msgid ""
"\"No, we can't. They happen at random, most often while we're sleeping, but "
"sometimes in broad daylight. That's why we can never stay in one place for "
"long. When someone witnesses us switch, we usually tell them tales of 'a "
"special magical way of traveling', but people start noticing strange things "
"and begin to figure things out. Truth be told, I'm so tired of having to "
"pretend. We knew this couldn't last forever, and now the truth is finally "
"out. Ah, what's the point in all this...\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 우리는 마음대로 바꿀 수 없어. 그건 무작위로 일어나. 대부분은 우리가 잘 때이지만 가끔은 낮에 일어나기도 해. 그래서 우리는 "
"한 장소에 오래 머물 수 없었던 거야. 누군가 우리가 바뀌는 모습을 목격하면 우리는 그들에게 이걸 '마법을 이용한 특별한 여행 "
"수단'이라고 둘러대지만, 사람들은 뭔가 이상하다는 걸 점점 눈치채게 되고, 일이 어떻게 된 건지 조금씩 짐작하게 되는 거지. 사실 나는 "
"이제 정체를 숨기는 것도 질렸어. 우리도 이걸 평생 숨길 수는 없다는 것 쯤은 알고 있었는데, 지금에 와서야 모든게 전부 드러나고 "
"말았네. 아, 이게 다 무슨 소용이겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "7bd27055-2d27-43d1-a299-f4d598583e51"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke smiles sadly.{/n} \"You and my sister have much in common... "
"Kanerah also seeks advantage in any situation. I hope the treasures of "
"Sorrowflow's treasury will not disappoint you...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 슬프게 웃습니다.{/n} \"너와 카네라는 공통점이 많아... 카네라도 어떤 상황에서나 이익을 먼저 추구하지. 슬픔의 "
"폭포의 보물이 너를 실망시키지 않았으면 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "41a83b5a-98ad-44d3-a8dd-0116a1d90d70"
msgid ""
"\"According to legend, it gave its owners control over planar travel. But "
"only pairs of wizards bound by unbreakable ties could use it. While one of "
"them traveled the planes, the other was his 'anchor' in our world, and they "
"could switch between. Do you see now why we so desperately wish to find the "
"Disk? It might help us understand how the 'switch' between me and Kanerah "
"works. And it should make our divine patron happy. – Nethys and his "
"assistants value the desire to understand the mysteries of magic above all "
"else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전설에 따르면 원반은 소유자가 차원간 여행을 통제할 수 있게 해준다고 해. 하지만 서로 간에 끊을 수 없는 유대로 묶인 마법사 한 "
"쌍만이 사용할 수 있지. 한 사람이 다른 차원을 여행하는 동안, 다른 사람은 우리 세계에 남아서 상대방의 '닻' 역할을 하는 거야. "
"그러다 둘의 역할을 바꿀 수도 있고. 이제 왜 우리가 그렇게나 간절히 이 원반을 찾고 있는지 알겠지? 원반만 있으면, 우리는 우리의 "
"'자리바꿈'이 대체 어떤 원리로 작동하는 건지 알 수 있을 거야. 그리고 우리의 신격 후원자들도 기뻐하겠지. 네서스와 그의 시종들은 다른 "
"무엇보다도 마법의 비밀을 탐구하고자 하는 열의를 가장 높게 쳐주거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "5160585a-ec3f-444a-aa00-dcd949c4a712"
msgid ""
"\"That's actually what I wanted to talk to you about. Kanerah was supposed "
"to tell you of an ancient treasury that we've been looking for. Gold isn't "
"the only thing of value in this place. It may contain an ancient relic, "
"taken by the {g|Taldor}Taldan{/g} raiders from a respected Qadiran temple of "
"Nethys.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실 그 얘기가 하고 싶었어. 카네라는 우리가 그간 찾아헤맸던 고대 보물에 대해 말하려고 했던 거야. 여기엔 금 말고도 귀중한 게 "
"많아. {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g} 약탈자들이 카디라의 유서깊은 네서스 사원에서 약탈해간 고대의 유물이 있을 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "089f218f-39c1-4784-a7bf-31e398d6c616"
msgid ""
"\"It's an unusual relic, called the Disk of the Eclipse. I once heard a "
"beautiful story that it was created from the shadow that hides the sun and "
"the moon. But I don't think that could be the truth. {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} is "
"the god of magic, who was once a mortal wizard, and relics from his temples "
"are usually very powerful. There are many among his followers who think that "
"solving the mysteries of magic – even rivaling their deity – is the best way "
"to serve him. One such follower created the Disk, long ago in the distant "
"past.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 평범한 유물이 아니고 해와 달을 삼킨 원반이라 불리는 물건이야. 전에 이 원반이 해와 달에 드리워진 그림자로 만들어졌다는 "
"아름다운 이야기를 들은 적도 있는데, 그건 아마 꾸며낸 이야기겠지. 마법의 신 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}는 신격을 얻기 전에는 "
"필멸자 마법사였고, 그의 사원에 보관하고 있던 유물은 대체로 매우 강력한 마법 도구들이었어. 그의 신도들 역시 마법의 비밀을 탐구하는 "
"것이 그에게 바치는 최고의 경배라고 생각해. 그래서 종종 신의 권능에 맞설만한 강력한 마법을 만들어내기도 하고, 이 원반 역시 아주 먼 "
"과거에 그런 신자들 중 한 명이 빚어낸 물건이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "8f5fc4ee-838d-42fa-85ac-aa3d23aca741"
msgid "{n}Kalikke's sad eyes get a little warmer.{/n} \"Thank you.\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케의 슬픈 눈에 약간이나마 온기가 돌아옵니다.{/n} \"고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "9126039c-a789-466f-8e24-06f79f1cb82c"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke looks at you with distrust.{/n} \"So... so I was wrong. In that "
"case farewell, {name} – we will face our fate alone.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 믿지 못하겠다는 듯한 눈빛으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그래... 그럼 내가 틀렸던 거구나. 그렇다면 이대로 작별하자, "
"{name}. 우리 스스로 운명에 맞서겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "9ced4b8c-ef0a-464c-942b-5aac9c6a8256"
msgid ""
"\"I will wait for you there, at Sorrowflow. And please, let's explore the "
"ruins together, just the two of us. I don't want to give myself away again "
"in front of your companions. Breaking the Arcanotheign's conditions once was "
"enough. – I have no wish to anger our god. So long!\""
msgstr ""
"\"슬픔의 폭포에서 너를 기다리겠어. 그리고 그 폐허를 함께 탐험하자. 단 둘이서만. 내 자신을 네 동료 앞에서 드러내고 싶지 않아. "
"아르카노데인과의 조건을 어기는 건 한번으로 충분해. 우리의 신을 화나게 하고 싶지 않으니까. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "2079e080-acaa-4912-9565-095cf9f095f2"
msgid ""
"\"You see, my sister died, and I... couldn't get over it. Kanerah was killed "
"by a soul eater – a monster summoned by secret followers of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon's{/g} archdaemons. Those who summoned him died in the "
"fight, but the beast was too strong for my sister... and I wasn't even there "
"to protect her.\" {n}Kalikke catches her breath.{/n} \"I... we'd just had a "
"fight, and we both did some stupid things just before. But I don't want to "
"talk about that now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언니는 죽었고 나는... 그걸 받아들일 수가 없었어. 카네라는 영혼 포식자에게 살해당했지. {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 "
"아크다이몬을 섬기는 비밀 추종자들이 이 괴물을 소환했어. 광신도들은 전투 중에 모두 죽었지만 이 괴물은 카네라가 혼자 상대하기엔 너무나 "
"강력했고... 언니를 도왔어야 할 나는 그 때 거기에 있지도 않았어..\" {n}칼리케는 잠시 호흡을 가다듬습니다.{/n} \"나는... "
"언니와 난 바로 그 직전까지 서로가 저지른 바보짓 때문에 싸우고 있었거든. 하지만 지금은 그 이야기는 하고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "e63ddfb7-89fc-42df-83b1-3fa9ea8594d5"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke smiles faintly.{/n} \"What follower of Nethys can resist a secret?"
"\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"어떤 네서스의 추종자가 비밀을 참을 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "c3b17a53-bba8-4b0b-aaec-55022884976e"
msgid ""
"\"When I found out what happened to my sister, I was ready to make a deal "
"with any power, if only I could just get her back. And I found such a "
"power... I was contacted by the {g|Arcanotheign}Arcanotheign{/g}, the herald "
"of the god Nethys himself. She promised she would return Kanerah to life, "
"but on two conditions. First, we must both keep the arrangement a secret. "
"Second – we would never be able to meet again. And so our new life began. "
"Now we flee through the world, guarding our secret, always introducing "
"ourselves as 'Kaessi' to hide that there are two of us. And we switch places "
"with each other at random. – While one lives, the other sleeps in a "
"demiplane, one created specially for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라가 어떻게 됐는지 알게 되자, 나는 언니를 되살릴 수 있다면 어떤 대가라도 치를 생각이었어. 강력한 존재와 계약해서라도 말이야. "
"그리고 그런 권능이 곧 나타났어... 네서스의 사자인 {g|Arcanotheign}아르카노데인{/g}이 직접 나를 찾아왔지. 그녀는 "
"카네라를 살려주겠다고 약속했지만, 두 가지 조건을 걸었어. 먼저 우리는 이 약속 전부를 비밀로 지켜야 한다는 것. 그리고 우리는 다시는 "
"서로 만날 수 없다는 것. 그렇게 우리의 새 삶이 시작되었지. 이제 우리는 비밀을 지키기 위해 늘 우리를 '카에시'라는 한 사람으로 "
"소개하며 세계를 떠돌아다니고 있어. 그리고 우리는 시시때때로 서로 위치를 바꾸게 됐어. 우리의 의지와도 관계 없고, 규칙이나 패턴도 없는 "
"방식으로. 한 쪽이 물질계에서 살아가면, 그 동안 다른 한 쪽은 우리를 위해 특별히 만들어진 차원에서 잠을 자고 있는거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "af78cd22-84f6-4eeb-a0bc-63d95a556c7d"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Will you make me regret this, {name}? I just thought... I felt you "
"might be someone who could help my sister and me change our fates.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 내가 이 모든 걸 후회하게 만들어줄래, {name}? 방금 든 생각인데... 너야말로 언니와 내가 우리의 숙명에 도전하는 걸 "
"도와줄 사람일거란 느낌이 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "da420576-f1cd-4896-a3aa-88092ac579d7"
msgid ""
"\"It was brought here by Taldans from the Fifth Army of Exploration. "
"{g|Taldor}Taldor{/g} and {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g} were enemies for ages. "
"Thousands of years ago, a soldier broke into the temple of Nethys and stole "
"the relic, to sell it, or secretly hoard it as an heirloom. Hundreds of "
"years later, his own kin, or the kin of its hundredth buyer, brought the "
"Disk to these strange lands, where the Taldans had come – uninvited, as "
"usual – and which they finally vanished from with little trace. Sometimes, "
"history is as intricate lace – you'd never guess where it begins, and where "
"it ends.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 5차 탐사대로 참가했던 탈도르인들이 그걸 이 곳으로 가지고 왔어. {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}와 {g|Qadira}카디라{/g}"
"는 아주 오랜 숙적이었지. 수 천년 전에 한 탈도르 병사가 네서스의 사원에 침입해서 그 유물을 훔쳤는데, 팔려고 한건지 가보로 물려주려 "
"한건지는 확실치 않아. 수 백년 쯤 지난 뒤에, 그 병사의 자손이었는지 아니면 백 번 째 구매자의 후손이었는지가 원반을 이 낯선 땅까지 "
"가지고 왔지. 탈도르 사람들은 이 땅에 항상 불청객으로 왔다가 결국 흔적도 없이 사라져버리곤 했어. 가끔 역사는 복잡하게 엉킨 실타래와 "
"같아. 어디가 시작인지, 어디가 끝인지도 알 수가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/Kalikke_Home/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "397c93e6-4ddc-4f25-9dc0-4bc35be62e2a"
msgid ""
"\"It was called Sorrowflow in the chronicle we read. It was once a Taldan "
"town, founded by the veterans of the the Fifth Army of Exploration. It stood "
"on the shores of a turbulent river – and that was what destroyed it. One "
"night, a terrible flood devastated the settlement, killing many and driving "
"the rest to flee. Only the tower on the cliff remained, which was too high "
"for the flood to reach. Water covered the ruins for a long time, but last "
"year it receded. My friends found a chronicle, which recounted the "
"destruction of the city, and spoke of the Disk of the Eclipse which was kept "
"there. They managed to track down the ruins, but were frightened away by the "
"monsters and beasts that roam the area.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 곳은 우리가 읽은 연대기에 슬픔의 폭포라고 언급된 곳이었어. 제 5차 탐사대 출신의 탈도르 퇴역병들이 세운 마을이 있었지. 물살이 "
"센 강가에 자리잡고 있었는데, 결국 그 강이 마을을 끝장내고야 만 거야. 어느 날 밤 끔찍한 홍수가 마을을 덮쳐서 수많은 사람이 죽고 "
"살아남은 자들도 모두 도망치고 말았어. 오직 홍수가 닿지 않을 만큼 높은 절벽 위에 세워진 탑 하나만이 남았지. 마을의 폐허는 오랫동안 "
"물에 잠겨있다가, 작년에야 드러났어. 내 친구들이 이 파괴된 마을의 이야기와, 그곳에 해와 달을 삼킨 원반이 보관되어 있었다는 기록을 "
"담은 연대기를 찾아냈지. 친구들은 폐허를 찾아내긴 했지만, 인근을 배회하는 괴물과 괴수들에 겁을 먹고 도망쳐나왔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a87cb6ef-6150-44f1-b1a3-8256997b940c"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah, I sense something strange. As if someone was here right before "
"us, and did something to the Disk...\""
msgstr "\"카네라. 뭔가 이상한 걸 느꼈어. 누군가 바로 직전에 여기 와서 원반에 무슨 짓을 한 거 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "add0ef75-7ba1-4932-9b47-9b7c58780367"
msgid ""
"[Detect Magic] [Examine the magic aura of the artifact and the surrounding "
"area]"
msgstr "[마법 탐지] [아티팩트에 담긴 마법 아우라와 주변 지역을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8a670aeb-dea0-454c-8d6f-f7b0d461a7b3"
msgid "\"Fine. Take the Disk.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 원반을 챙겨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "575b14dd-5ce4-48b8-a6f7-663043a015eb"
msgid "\"I won't give you the Disk.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 원반을 주지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1238b0d8-1ade-41ab-bbc1-5a66a691f782"
msgid ""
"Refused to give the artifact to Kanerah, arguing that it might be dangerous."
msgstr "위험할 수도 있다고 주장하며 카네라에게 원반을 주는 것을 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "25e16970-9f73-43e3-8860-7828739c0d9f"
msgid "\"It could be dangerous. I don't want to risk your life.\""
msgstr "\"위험할 수도 있어. 목숨을 걸 필요는 없잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "242a66a5-7ff0-4842-a7db-b76e83087a9e"
msgid "\"Are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c6bdf134-546e-4e4b-831a-cb7e25160dc3"
msgid "Refused to give the artifact to Kanerah."
msgstr "카네라에게 아티팩트를 주는 것을 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "a4e7eb90-eec6-4de6-bdc2-fe6f1be0a56f"
msgid "\"Nevertheless, I won't let you take it.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 네가 갖게 하지는 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "b4882742-07c6-447c-b445-44ebfe4763b0"
msgid ""
"\"Here we are – we just recovered the artifact, and then lost it already...\""
msgstr "\"결국 이렇게되는군. 아티팩트를 방금 찾아 놓고는 벌써 잃어버리다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "3d5050dd-88d2-49f4-852d-1b5ba8e0bbc6"
msgid "\"I don't know what just happened, but I don't like it!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 일어난건지 모르겠지만 별로 마음에 들지 않는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e6732ccf-df11-48f3-a0d3-8b1fd904ce3f"
msgid "\"You two are going to drive me insane, I swear!\""
msgstr "\"너희 둘은 정말 나를 미치게 만드는구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0028_Text_1
msgctxt "b1afa226-b58d-4ea1-864f-f5bd5c638134"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah and I recovered the Disk of the Eclipse. And it affected her in a "
"strange way...\""
msgstr "\"카네라와 나는 해와 달을 삼킨 원반을 되찾았어. 그게 카네라에게 이상한 방식으로 영향을 준 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "9a0240bc-c02d-49e3-803a-a07e45146cff"
msgid ""
"\"You got your Disk. Now can we put an end to this nonsense and move forward?"
"\""
msgstr "\"이제 원반도 찾았으니 이 바보같은 일은 그만두기로 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "ac9bd596-2b38-4cc5-ab58-a4fa2d556ff8"
msgid "\"Your sister asked me to tell you that you're a foolish goat.\""
msgstr "\"네 언니가 널 보고 염소처럼 바보같은 년이라고 전해달라고 부탁했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fcdd8db6-cf79-40b2-a76a-972e8270751e"
msgid "Tried to cheer up Kalikke, saying that her sister misses her."
msgstr "언니가 칼리케를 그리워하더라고 말해서 그녀의 기운을 북돋아주려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "b5d23a89-7236-4e76-902c-59699a5b6fd3"
msgid "\"Your sister asked me to tell you that she misses you.\""
msgstr "\"카네라가 네가 그립다고 전해달라는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "f6f4b94e-2d7a-438d-b630-f8f12ffffd6a"
msgid ""
"\"Your sister asked me to tell you to give a nice big hug to the wonderful "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} who helped you so much...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 언니가 지금껏 자신을 물심양면 도와주신 위대한 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}님을 네가 한번 꼭 안아주라고 전해달라고 하더라고..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "a5820ccb-22f8-4ff2-aa85-d9f2cd5bad42"
msgid "\"I'm joking!\""
msgstr "\"농담이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "93df6c91-c7f3-446a-987f-d037bf99942e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm only joking, but you know, I'd be happy if you hugged me at some "
"point...\""
msgstr "\"그건 농담이었지만, 네가 정말로 나를 꼭 껴안아준다면 참 좋을 것 같긴 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "86c009a3-e842-47f9-a07c-8fcbf8aac15b"
msgid "\"I'm perfectly comfortable!\""
msgstr "\"나로 말할 것 같으면 전적으로 괜찮아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "9a72581d-f1fb-4bd1-b912-a5c6a3fc47c4"
msgid "\"So you can now switch whenever you want to...\""
msgstr "\"그러니까 이제 원하는 대로 너희들 사이를 바꿀 수 있는 거로구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "78b4d715-4c08-44a7-84c6-0ba9460231be"
msgid "\"You'll be most welcome!\""
msgstr "\"너는 언제든 환영이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "ef26cfa5-4590-4072-b5dd-8340aaa96fe9"
msgid "\"I've no need of you.\""
msgstr "\"너는 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d479e4b5-e850-454a-870e-4bc562dfaf17"
msgid ""
"\"Let's see what we have here...\" {n}Kanerah's tail dances just above the "
"ground, giving away the tiefling's excitement. She's obviously anxious to "
"grab the Disk of the Eclipse, but waits for you to nod.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"한번 살펴볼까...\" {n}카네라의 꼬리가 흥분을 감추지 못하고, 땅을 스치듯 춤추고 있습니다. 원반을 당장에라도 움켜잡고 싶은 "
"기색이 역력하지만, 그녀는 일단 당신의 승낙을 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "e92e956a-7b38-42e6-a24e-95cf1d8db422"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl quickly grabs the artifact with both hands, and that very "
"instant you hear a loud sound, like a clap – and Kanerah is enveloped in a "
"cocoon of white light, which quickly turns to darkness.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 재빨리 양손으로 원반을 거머쥡니다. 그리고 바로 그 순간 마치 박수 치는 것 같은 큰 소리가 울렸고, 하얗게 빛나는 구체가 "
"카네라를 감싸더니 금세 어둠만이 남았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "7060286b-5005-4e9c-a7bf-b86228120d5f"
msgid ""
"{n}You easily find the Disk's aura. It's an intricate artifact, but it "
"doesn't seem especially powerful. But you notice something else – traces of "
"a much stronger aura nearby. It seems that someone very powerful was here "
"before you, and did something to the Disk...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 원반의 기운을 쉽게 찾을 수 있었습니다. 원반은 난해해 보이긴 하지만 특별히 강력해 보이지도 않습니다. 하지만 곧 당신은 "
"근처에서 훨씬 강한 기운의 흔적을 발견합니다. 강력한 힘을 지닌 누군가가 당신보다 먼저 이곳에 와서, 원반에 손을 댄 것 "
"같습니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e539cb32-14b7-42d7-8b09-4c5b87ff3e42"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling seems surprised.{/n} \"Someone was here before us? Found the "
"treasures and the artifact, but didn't take them? So strange... Well, we "
"aren't going to use the Disk right now anyway, are we? We'll just take it to "
"the capital and examine it there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 놀란 것 같습니다.{/n} \"누가 먼저 왔었다고? 원반과 다른 보물을 발견하고도 가져가지 않았다니, 뭔가 이상해... "
"원반을 지금 막바로는 사용하지 않는게 좋겠어. 일단 수도로 가져가서 시험해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e9748052-96fd-45b9-99de-dd3cd5ea4576"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah frowns.{/n} \"We had a deal. The word of a ruler must mean "
"something...\""
msgstr "{n}카네라가 언짢은 듯 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"얘기가 다르잖아. 통치자의 말에는 무게가 있어야 하지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e431c04c-3ec7-40fa-ad43-7beb6dfd14b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah shakes her head.{/n} \"Don't decide for me what's dangerous and "
"what isn't. My sister and I only live a half life. We can't make plans, "
"can't enjoy peace, or grow close to someone we like. The Disk of the Eclipse "
"is our one chance to make things better. And we need it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"뭐가 위험하고 안전한지는 내가 결정해. 나와 동생은 겨우 반쪽짜리 삶을 살고 있어. 미래의 "
"계획도, 평화로운 삶을 누리는 것도, 사랑하는 사람과 가까워질 기회도 없는 그런 삶 말이야. 이 원반은 이 모든 걸 나아지게 할 수 있는 "
"유일한 기회고, 우린 그런 기회를 놓칠 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "085d86c7-14dd-4fb5-9ebd-0cbefbe1c63a"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling snaps her tail in anger and takes a mocking bow.{/n} \"If "
"that's your decision – then good-bye and good luck! Let's see how long your "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} lives if you always handle your "
"responsibilities like this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 분노에 차서 꼬리를 쾅 내려치고는 독설을 퍼붓습니다.{/n} \"네 결정이 그렇다면, 좋아. 잘 먹고 잘 살아라! 너처럼 "
"매사에 무책임한 통치자 아래서 너희 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}이 얼마나 오래 갈 수 있을지 두고 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "8db83403-527d-4823-b65e-b1da7c57a8fc"
msgid ""
"{n}The moment she disappears, you hear a strange rustle and a snap... and "
"the Disk of the Eclipse crumbles into dust before your eyes, and vanishes "
"without a trace.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀가 사라진 바로 그 순간, 당신은 무언가 바스라지는 듯한 이상한 소리를 듣습니다... 그리고 해와 달을 삼킨 원반은 당신의 눈 "
"앞에서 먼지가 되어 흔적도 없이 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "125ab850-c2bb-44f8-a86f-bf1501a5e419"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear voices, whispering and interrupting each other. They seem to be "
"speaking in images, not natural words – 'black', 'white', 'bound', "
"'split'... 'indivisible'.\"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 서로에게 참견하며 대화하는 듯한 속삭임을 듣습니다. 그들은 단어라기보다는 형상을 통해 대화를 나누는 것 같습니다. '흑', "
"'백', '속박', '분리', 그리고 '불가분'.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "c1bd7ac2-e75c-4f36-8207-8ed560abc3b5"
msgid ""
"{n}Then the strange phenomena ends as quickly as it began. The darkness "
"disappears, and Kanerah is standing just where she was, seemingly intact – "
"but the Disk in her hands is gone...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그리고 이 이상한 현상은 시작될 때 만큼이나 갑작스럽게 끝났습니다. 어둠이 사라지고, 카네라는 원래 서 있었던 모습 그대로 서 "
"있습니다. 모든 게 그대로인 것 같지만, 손에 들고 있던 원반만은 사라지고 없습니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a105b77f-27c6-4616-847c-e29fb097a952"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing... I didn't expect this. Listen – the artifact didn't disappear! I "
"can feel it, like it's a part of me now. And I think I… I think I know how "
"to use it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀라워... 예상하지 못했어. 원반은 사라진게 아니야! 마치 그게 내 일부가 된 것 처럼, 그 존재를 느낄 수 있어! 그리고 내 "
"생각에... 그걸 어떻게 사용하는지도 알 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "01ef1378-3f56-45bf-b4a3-7f4d295a845c"
msgid ""
"\"What?\" {n}Kanerah seems to barely hear you. She shakes her head a few "
"times, as if she's emerging from a dream.{/n}"
msgstr "\"뭐라고?\" {n}카네라는 당신의 말을 듣지 못한 것 같습니다. 그녀는 꿈에서 깨려는 듯 고개를 몇 번 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "93f0702c-40f3-47b3-b31b-69d8e41dfc07"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke looks at you in complete astonishment.{/n} \"{name}? What... what "
"just happened? I was sleeping in the demiplane, but this time I wasn't "
"pulled out of it like usual. It's like I heard a voice... Kanerah's voice..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 놀라서 어안이 벙벙한 표정입니다.{/n} \"{name}? 무슨... 무슨 일이 있었던 거야? 나는 우리 차원에서 잠을 "
"자고 있었는데, 이번에는 억지로 끌려온게 아니야. 보통 때와는 달랐어. 카네라의 목소리를 들은 것도 같고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "55acab15-205d-4085-9f3b-9e217056d8b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke extends her hand in a pleading gesture.{/n} \"I think I'm going "
"to lose my mind! And just when I thought my life couldn't get any crazier... "
"So what happened?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 애원하듯 손을 뻗습니다.{/n} \"미쳐버릴 것 같아! 인생이 지금보다 더 미치기도 힘들거라고 생각했던 바로 그 순간에 "
"말이야... 무슨 일이 일어났던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ed6df69c-1842-4ae8-9f4b-4d291379a028"
msgid ""
"\"So what I felt and heard was the influence of the Disk? But it's so "
"strange...\" {n}Kalikke closes her eyes and stands still. Her dark hair "
"moves in the wind, but nothing happens for about a minute. Then, without "
"opening her eyes, she begins to move her hand.{/n} \"Yes... now I understand!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 느끼고 들은 것이 원반의 영향이라고? 하지만 너무 이상해...\" {n}칼리케는 잠시 눈을 감고 조용히 서있습니다. 그녀의 검은 "
"머리카락만이 바람에 찰랑일뿐, 얼마간 아무 일도 일어나지 않습니다. 잠시 후, 눈을 감은 채로 그녀는 손을 움직이기 시작합니다.{/n} "
"\"그래... 이제 이해하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8254f2c7-609b-4870-a4bc-8d02ff6da90e"
msgid ""
"\"Hello again! Ah, are we still here in Sorrowflow? So my sweet sister "
"learned how to use our new ability so quickly? I was sure it would take her "
"a year! I'm going to try to switch us again. Please tell her for me that "
"she's a foolish goat!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 보네! 우리 아직 슬픔의 폭포에 있는 거야? 우리 친절하신 동생이 이 새로운 능력을 그렇게나 빨리 배웠다는 말이지? 난 족히 "
"1년은 걸릴 줄 알았거든! 내가 우리를 다시 한번 바꿔볼께. 동생한테 염소처럼 멍청한 년이라고 전해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "056e68e9-935a-46aa-bda2-2fdb9a9c05dd"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke looks even more stunned.{/n} \"I'm back again... and again I "
"heard my sister calling me! I felt it inside, just like my bond to the "
"elemental forces. – Now we can switch places whenever we wish.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 더 큰 충격을 받은 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"다시 돌아왔어... 그리고 이번에도 카네라가 날 부르는 소리를 들었어! "
"내가 원소의 힘과 맺고 있는 연결과 비슷하게 내 안에서 그 연결이 느껴져. 이제 우리를 우리의 의지대로 바꿀 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7b7800be-2be4-4a8b-a3cc-1681a61da65c"
msgid ""
"\"Really?\" {n}Kalikke looks sincerely surprised and a little "
"embarrassed.{/n} \"I could... if you're comfortable with that, of course...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말?\" {n}칼리케는 진심으로 놀라고 당황한 듯한 표정입니다.{/n} \"해줄 수 있겠지... 너만 괜찮다면 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "82c408bb-203b-48c7-ae84-9c8b4fc825f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke's cheeks blush.{/n} \"Why did you say that?! It's easy to trick "
"me... I'm so gullible...\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케의 뺨이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"왜 그런 말을 했어?! 나는 뭐든지 잘 속는단 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7f2bcc20-d3ee-480d-bb73-c257c65ebc15"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke becomes even more embarrassed.{/n} \"I... You don't mean... Oh, "
"it doesn't matter! Why do I always fall for such obvious jokes...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 더욱 당황합니다.{/n} \"나는... 네가 정말 하려던 건... 에잇, 그게 문제가 아니지! 난 그런 간단한 농담에도 왜 "
"늘 속는 건지 모르겠네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "048695eb-8993-4195-90e5-2c7028717a3b"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke looks at you with suspicion, and then remarks,{/n} \"You're "
"joking, aren't you?\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케가 의심 가득한 표정으로 바라보다가 말합니다.{/n} \"장난하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d12cd50b-2da8-466a-b086-2cb3005b4eaf"
msgid "\"But what happened has changed so much for us... I need to think...\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 일어난 일이 너무나 많은 것을 바꾸었어... 생각해 봐야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f4250aa0-06ed-4395-9114-322c7ce89b05"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Oh, there are so many thoughts in my head! It's a miracle that we "
"found such a rare artifact that could help us – Or perhaps Nethys planned "
"this all along? And what should we do with this new gift... Now my sister "
"and I must decide how to divide the time we share...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 지금 머릿속에는 생각이 너무 많아! 이렇게 희귀한 아티팩트, 그것도 우리에게 큰 도움을 줄 아티팩트를 실제로 찾아낸 건 분명 "
"기적이야. 아니면 이것조차도 네서스의 계획이었을까? 그렇다면 이 선물로 우리는 무엇을 해야 할까... 일단 우리는 물질계에서 공유하는 "
"시간을 어떻게 나눌지부터 결정해야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5b946825-df25-484f-9c9e-8c04d062cdcb"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke laughs.{/n} \"Just a goat? I remember when she used to call me a "
"vicious little crocodile, or a slobbering camelthorn...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 소리내어 웃습니다.{/n} \"겨우 염소라고? 언니가 전에는 나를 사악한 악어 새끼나 음흉한 카멜레온이라고 부르기도 "
"했었는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ef10673b-ba05-49a0-9bfb-90e447d9291f"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt that's exactly what she said... but thanks for trying to cheer me "
"up.\""
msgstr "\"카네라가 정말 그렇게 말하지 않은 건 알아... 어쨋든 날 격려해준 건 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6d9ace47-6ac2-4963-9fc2-312f0fed6466"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke shakes her head.{/n} \"Yes. I'll think about all this and many "
"other things. But for now I wish to thank you, {name}! If a foreign "
"outcast's gratitude means anything to you, you have it. And one more thing – "
"I'd like to remain in your lands and help you with your quests and travels. "
"Now that we can better control our switches, we won't have to keep running "
"from one place to another. I think Kanerah will support my idea... What do "
"you say?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"그래. 일단 난 생각을 좀 정리해봐야 할 것 같아. 일단 지금은 고맙다고 말하고 싶어, "
"{name}! 나같이 근본없는 방랑자의 감사가 너에게 별 것 아닐수도 있겠지만 말이야. 아, 그리고 너만 괜찮다면 이 땅에서의 너의 "
"여정에 함께 하고 싶어. 이제 우리는 어느 정도는 우리를 통제할 수 있으니까, 더 떠돌아다니지는 않아도 될 것 같아. 카네라도 동의할 "
"거라고 생각하거든... 네 생각은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ab5643eb-8c82-4ae2-a2e6-35645188b342"
msgid ""
"\"Such a pity. But still thank you all the same for your help! Our life will "
"become much easier now. I will remember you with kindness, {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 아쉽다. 그래도 우릴 도와준 건 정말 고마워! 우리의 삶은 이제부터는 훨씬 나아질거야. 네가 베풀어준 친절을 잊지 않을게, "
"{name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/ArtifactGain/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "672e0385-29ca-4558-b794-edee52301b91"
msgid "\"May this be the beginning of a wonderful journey!\""
msgstr "\"이것이 우리의 환상적인 여행의 시작이길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kalikke_LoreBark1_String
msgctxt "fc66f346-4796-49e5-bb41-be9df88f5eb5"
msgid ""
"\"Taldor and Qadira were rivals for ages... It's so strange to wander around "
"these ruins.\""
msgstr "\"탈도르와 카디라는 누대에 걸친 숙명의 경쟁자였지... 이 폐허를 돌아다니는 건 정말 이상한 기분이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kalikke_LoreBark2_String
msgctxt "00f82b7d-5bc0-441f-b818-785ae253ad70"
msgid ""
"\"A feud can be stronger than blood ties, and blood ties can be much like a "
"feud.\""
msgstr "\"불화가 혈연을 갈라놓는 건 일도 아니지. 아니, 혈연 자체가 곧 불화와 같을 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kalikke_LoreBark3_String
msgctxt "ec6bbd6d-c065-43f4-95dc-4f2b46bd1698"
msgid ""
"\"An empire once so great... where is your strength? Does the same fate "
"await us? No answer...\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 때 그렇게나 위대했던 제국이여... 네 강대한 힘은 지금 어디에 있는가? 같은 운명이 우리를 기다리고 있는가? 그러나 대답은 들을 "
"수 없구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kalikke_LoreBark_River2_String
msgctxt "f9a9b443-732d-46a2-a3d8-fab6606b7d62"
msgid ""
"\"And a waterfall! Now I see why the Taldans decided to settle here. I'd "
"live here too!\""
msgstr "\"폭포잖아! 왜 탈도르인들이 여기 정착하기로 했는지 알 것 같아. 나라도 여기에 살겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kalikke_LoreBark_River_String
msgctxt "096b1189-2f6b-4bcb-a78a-42f373c29d81"
msgid ""
"\"What a beautiful place! And cozy! – The cliffs seem to embrace this place."
"\""
msgstr "\"정말 아름답고 아늑한 장소야! 이 절벽이 여기를 안아주고 있는 것 같은 느낌이잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kalikke_LoreBark_elemental1_String
msgctxt "7b5db798-9747-45e2-ab8c-0340c80278da"
msgid ""
"\"Something is wrong... I feel a disturbance in the elements of water.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 잘못됐어... 물의 원소에 동요가 느껴져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kanerah_Found_Gem_String
msgctxt "3da5d065-8730-4866-9f6c-08842adb8fed"
msgid "\"The bonfire was great! Look what I found among the ashes.\""
msgstr "\"모닥불은 너무 좋았어! 내가 재에서 무얼 찾았는지 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kanerah_Picnic2_String
msgctxt "adcc8c6c-3b2d-4660-819f-fe96a5847625"
msgid ""
"\"… Especially on romantic encounters. Encounters that might be continued..."
"\""
msgstr "\"… 특히 연애에 대해서는 더욱. 오래 지속되는 관계 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kanerah_Picnic3_String
msgctxt "d625014a-e0f6-4ac7-99b8-e5da3543b790"
msgid "\"Someday I'll tell you how I managed to do it!\""
msgstr "\"언젠가는 말해줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/Kanerah_Picnic_String
msgctxt "15e59612-4a93-4a1b-9a06-375b1990addf"
msgid ""
"\"… well, I had to conceal my tiefling nature. It was so hard to hide my "
"tail!\""
msgstr "\"… 내 티플링 정체를 잠시 숨겨둬야 했어. 내 꼬리를 숨기는게 제일 어렵더라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/LoreBark_BlockageInside_String
msgctxt "41b6c8d7-446b-4b7d-994e-2fe3de56d86f"
msgid ""
"From this point you see the rubble is not so great. You could move it aside."
msgstr "여기서부터는 그저 대단찮은 잡석 더미 밖에 보이지 않습니다. 당신은 그냥 지나치기로 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/LoreBark_BlockageOutside_String
msgctxt "eac655af-0498-4b51-a014-da48cddda808"
msgid ""
"The remains of a Taldan adit. It seems from the outside that the vault caved "
"in, and it's hopeless to move the rubble."
msgstr "탈도르인이 파놓은 갱도의 흔적입니다. 밖에서부터 파내려간 것으로 보이는데, 가로막고 있는 돌무더기를 치우기는 불가능해 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/LoreBark_OreVein_String
msgctxt "5eb8d809-6007-4291-901d-353694a9bf52"
msgid ""
"A vein of ore. The Taldans hadn't finished mining it when the settlement "
"perished."
msgstr "광맥입니다. 탈도르인은 마을이 파괴되었을 때 아직 채광을 마무리짓지 못한 상태였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/LoreBark_gutter_String
msgctxt "e600d547-e435-4d4d-b0b2-d68268e56da7"
msgid ""
"A stone gutter, and the nearly-indistinguishable remains of an old "
"mechanism. Most likely it was once used to bring ore down from the cliff."
msgstr ""
"이 돌로 만든 도랑은 거의 알아볼 수 없을 정도로 오래되긴 했지만, 어떤 장치의 일부로 보입니다. 아마도 절벽 위에서 채굴한 광석을 절벽 "
"아래로 나르는 데 사용된 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/LoreBark_pier_String
msgctxt "e05c5157-013f-4acb-8bb0-087793b751c8"
msgid ""
"The remains of a dock. The Taldans launched barges loaded with ore from here."
msgstr "부두의 잔해입니다. 탈도르인은 여기서 뗏목에 광석을 실어보냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/TechBark_blockage_String
msgctxt "b2aa50f1-85c4-4681-8902-19488f953daf"
msgid "[Clear the rubble]"
msgstr "[돌무더기를 치웁니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Barks/TechBark_mine_String
msgctxt "e4dc5030-6a1e-4ed7-b0fe-8d5d063c731e"
msgid ""
"The old Taldan adit is surprisingly well preserved. The ore mine could be "
"restored here."
msgstr "탈도르인이 파놓은 갱도의 입구는 놀라울 정도로 잘 보존되어 있습니다. 이곳의 광산은 다시 채굴할 수 있을 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "49888452-86ad-40f5-878d-430b09cab12e"
msgid "[Send away your other companions] \"We will go on alone from here.\""
msgstr "[다른 동료를 돌려보냅니다] \"여기서부터는 우리 둘이서 갈게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "649b4e6a-8246-4d19-a50d-ec5287c63e62"
msgid "\"Who were those three tieflings?\""
msgstr "\"그 셋 티플링들은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "1b065a00-d406-4212-ba38-13348b2d342c"
msgid "\"What's our plan?\""
msgstr "\"계획이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "238b5045-0e65-46d6-8169-d8ab23e44f19"
msgid "\"I have other things to do. I'll return later.\""
msgstr "\"다른 일이 있어서. 곧 돌아올게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "068e1aee-ab5c-4816-acaa-ab2d673b74a6"
msgid ""
"\"Please remind me, what is this place and what are we looking for here?\""
msgstr "\"이 장소가 어떤 곳인지, 우리가 찾고 있는 게 무엇인지 다시 말해주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "801e99c1-e941-4927-9f03-8773e6f24703"
msgid "\"I'm ready, let's go!\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐어. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "f18f11ef-335a-42f2-a216-ab46fe701b34"
msgid "\"Wait, one more question...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 질문 하나 더...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "555b80bd-7656-422d-a1e5-af140e4a96da"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke smiles faintly as you approach, but you can't help but notice "
"that she's as tense as a bow string.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 당신이 오자 희미하게 웃었지만, 당신에게는 그녀가 당겨놓은 활시위처럼 팽팽하게 긴장한 것이 뻔히 보였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "447078f9-7e2f-433b-83a2-087d161a401b"
msgid "\"Are you back? Can we proceed?\""
msgstr "\"돌아왔어? 이제 갈까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "a77cd74b-7551-404c-90ff-ec94ed89f2ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Three young tieflings wearing bright clothing, the sort one might find in "
"a harlequin's wardrobe, are gathered near Kalikke, fidgeting from foot to "
"foot. They bow simultaneously. The youngest casts you an inquisitive "
"look.{/n} \"So this is the patron you found, Elder! The "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} of this land! And to think that Kanerah used "
"to say that you don't know how to make connections... Oh! Oh!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어린 티플링 셋이 칼리케 곁에 모여있습니다. 어릿광대처럼 화려한 옷을 입은 이 티플링들은 당신을 보고 동시에 허리 굽혀 절합니다. "
"셋 중 가장 어린아이는 호기심 가득한 눈으로 당신을 살핍니다.{/n} \"누님이 찾았다는 후원자가 이분이구나! 이 땅의 "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이셨어! 이런데도 카네라 누님은 연줄 만들 줄 모른다고 늘 얘기했었다니... 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "fca946b3-b123-4c83-bb6f-6764ba08e7a4"
msgid ""
"{n}The short-haired tiefling girl steps on her friend's tail.{/n} \"Stop it, "
"Naiho! Don't you see you're upsetting her? Forgive him, Elder. And you too, "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. When Naiho was "
"little, a donkey knocked over his crib. His horns got caught on its "
"saddlecloth, and he was dragged for half a block, bumping his head on every "
"corner. Now he's no more clever than the donkey!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}짧은 머리칼의 티플링 여자 아이가 다른 친구의 꼬리를 밟았습니다.{/n} \"그만해. 나이호! 화가 난 거 안 보여? 용서해 줘, "
"언니. 그리고 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}도요. 나이호가 어렸을 때 당나귀 한 마리가 아기 침대를 들이받았는데, 재수없게도 뿔이 "
"나귀 안장에 걸렸지 뭐에요! 그래서 골목 절반을 끌려다니면서 머리를 여기저기 부딪혔더니, 이제 당나귀보다도 멍청해지고 말았죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "1363503f-7e81-476e-b621-7e0667a4dd6c"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke stomps her foot, drawing their attention.{/n} \"Sweet Teeth, "
"that's enough! You're going right back to the city. The "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} and I need to talk in private. And we're "
"going to the Taldan tower without you. – It might be dangerous.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 발을 굴러 아이들을 주목시킵니다.{/n} \"애들아 그만! 이제 도시로 돌아가야지. {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}님과 나는 "
"개인적으로 할 얘기가 있어. 그리고 우리 둘만 탈도르 탑으로 갈 거야. 너희에겐 너무 위험한 곳이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "845b1b12-d5d8-4bc3-98c2-438577aa22ec"
msgid ""
"\"As you say, Elder.\" {n}The last of the three tieflings, who had kept "
"quiet until now, nods and gestures to the others.{/n} \"We'll go to the "
"city. We'll see if three tail-swinging goofs like us can find gainful "
"employment around there. If you decided to settle down in these parts, maybe "
"we can find a place here too. Goodbye, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your "
"Highness|Your Highness}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누님 말대로 할게.\" {n}지금껏 말없이 듣고만 있던 마지막 티플링 아이가 고개를 끄덕이고는 다른 티플링에게 손짓합니다.{/n} "
"\"우리는 도시로 가자. 우리처럼 꼬리나 흔들고 다니는 머저리들도 제대로 된 직업을 구할 수 있는지 확인해보자고. 누님이 정착하기로 "
"마음먹은 땅이 여기라면, 우리도 여기서 보금자리를 찾을 수 있을거야. 그럼 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}도 안녕히 계세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "4616bda8-fe98-4fc3-a32f-47a26533c733"
msgid "\"As you wish. I'll wait here...\""
msgstr "\"원하는 대로. 여기서 기다릴게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "7bc66db9-2ad6-4470-84be-f19e48c9d12e"
msgid ""
"\"My friends from {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g}. Their names are Naiho, Tevi and "
"Elki, but I usually just call them the Sweet Teeth. They're always together, "
"and always act and speak in chorus. It was they who dug up the history of "
"this place, and told me of the treasury. But they never got inside. – They "
"say there's a lot of dangerous beasts ahead...\""
msgstr ""
"\"카디라에서 온 내 친구들이야. 이름은 나이호, 테비, 엘키지만 난 보통 이 아이들을 단 것 중독자들이라고 부르지. 항상 함께 "
"몰려다니는데다, 똑같이 말하고 움직이는 아이들이야. 연대기에서 이 곳의 역사를 찾아내고, 보물에 대해 알려준 것도 이 아이들이었어. "
"하지만 이 아이들도 안에까지는 들어가지 못했지. 위험한 괴물이 너무나 많다고 해서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "4308da1a-7cc5-40d1-8388-8c629cebee7c"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke sighs.{/n} \"I'm happy that at least someone from my past life "
"hasn't abandoned me. But they make me anxious as well. The Sweet Teeth know "
"nothing about what happened after our escape. They think Kanerah died, and I "
"adopted a strange new name to hide from my past. But they know me and my "
"sister well, and could easily uncover the truth. That would breach Nethys' "
"first condition. That's why it would be better for all of us if we met as "
"rarely as possible. Besides, Kanerah nearly fed the poor Sweet Teeth to wild "
"animals. Though it seems now like ages ago...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"내가 지금껏 만났던 사람들 전부가 나에게 등을 돌린건 아니라 다행이지. 하지만 아이들 때문에 "
"불안하기도 해. 이 단 것 중독자들은 언니와 내가 탈출하고 나서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 몰라. 이 아이들은 카네라는 죽었고 내가 새 이름을 "
"쓰는 건 단지 과거를 숨기기 위해서라고 생각하지. 하지만 아이들은 언니와 나를 너무 잘 알고 있어서, 우리의 진상을 쉽게 깨달을지도 "
"몰라. 그럼 네서스가 정한 첫번째 규칙을 어기게 되겠지. 그렇기 때문에 이 아이들과 가급적 드물게 만나는 것이 언니와 나, 둘다에게 "
"좋을꺼야. 게다가 카네라는 이 아이들을 미워해서 거의 짐승 먹잇감으로 만들 뻔한 적도 있지. 이렇게 얘기하니 꼭 아주 옛날 이야기 "
"같네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "4a2f759a-b02c-4ca8-ba07-f7e7d8dc0f98"
msgid ""
"\"There must be a cliff somewhere ahead, where we'll find the remains of the "
"tower. We'll need to climb it and search the ruins. – And be ready for "
"trouble... one can never be too careful. Well, are we ready?\""
msgstr ""
"\"저기 어딘가에 절벽이 있고, 절벽 위에는 폐허가 된 탑이 서있을 거야. 우린 절벽을 올라가서 그 폐허를 살펴봐야 해. 그리고 만일의 "
"사태에 대비해야지... 절대 조심해서 나쁠건 없잖아. 자, 준비는 됐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "28b1816f-f02e-4eb9-80a9-89bdb943f00e"
msgid ""
"{n}Your companions go back down the road, leaving you and Kalikke alone.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 동료들은 당신과 칼리케를 남겨두고 길로 돌아갔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "7916dfd6-8dea-41ff-8320-e6a1ce7ca5b7"
msgid ""
"\"It's an ancient {g|Taldor}Taldan{/g} settlement, long ago ravaged by the "
"elements. They used to mine ore in these rocks. Little is known about what "
"happened here, but according to rumors, a terrible flood devastated the "
"town. Many citizens perished, the others fled. Only the tower remains, "
"standing on the cliff. The flood wasn't able to reach it. The tower may "
"still hold substantial riches, and among them, the Disk of the Eclipse – a "
"relic from a Qadiran temple of {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}. That's what I'm looking "
"for...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 아주 오래 전, 원소들에 의해 파괴된 고대 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}인의 마을이야. 이곳 사람들은 주로 암반에서 광물을 "
"채굴하는 걸 업으로 삼았지. 소문에 따르면 마을을 파괴한건 아주 끔찍한 홍수였다고 해. 많은 주민들이 죽었고, 생존자들도 마을을 버리고 "
"도망쳤지. 오직 절벽 위에 세워진 탑만이 홍수를 피할 수 있었는데, 이 탑에는 여전히 상당한 보물이 남겨져 있다고 해. 그 중에서도 "
"카디라에 있는 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g} 사원에서 유래된 해와 달을 삼킨 원반이라는 유물이 있어. 그게 바로 내가 찾는거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "42f17488-9436-4a31-83be-406ccfba21d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke nods gratefully.{/n} \"Thank you. I'm glad I don't have to walk "
"this road alone...\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 고개를 숙여 감사를 표합니다.{/n} \"고마워. 이 길을 혼자 가지 않아도 된다니 다행이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kaliike_Enter_Dialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Capital
msgctxt "89311b08-6887-4c98-acdb-3b8907334824"
msgid "\"Of course.\""
msgstr "\"물론.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c03ef5b9-55f2-463b-8c93-8b6ee2b422b6"
msgid "[Use the rope]"
msgstr "[로프를 사용합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d0b73580-4156-4fad-860d-f764f05905f4"
msgid "[Start climbing] \"Let's go! To our goal!\""
msgstr "[절벽에 오릅니다] \"가자! 목표를 향해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "21d63287-88bc-49b2-a70e-eb5f5546723c"
msgid "[Leave] \"Perhaps later.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"다음 기회에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "991eecee-8393-4698-aed5-7190025f6574"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke throws back her head and looks upward.{/n} \"Up there! There's a "
"tower there, on the cliff. But it will be difficult to climb such a steep "
"slope.\" {n}Kalikke gives you a pensive and sad smile.{/n} \"My sister and I "
"used to climb cliffs together. She was so angry when I was faster! But she "
"always helped me when she got ahead...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 고개를 젖히고 위를 봅니다.{/n} \"바로 저기야! 저기 절벽 위에 탑이 있어. 하지만 가팔라서 오르기 힘들 거야.\" "
"{n}칼리케는 당신에게 슬픈 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"언니와 나는 함께 절벽을 오르고는 했어. 내가 앞서가면 어찌나 화를 내던지. "
"하지만 언니가 앞에 있을 때에는 언제나 나를 이끌어주곤 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "3d0aa143-1741-4aab-bfac-5f6d966bb4a0"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke climbs the cliff with the dexterity of a lizard, but you go "
"stride for stride with her, easily keeping up. Soon the top of the cliff "
"lays before you...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 마치 도마뱀처럼 민첩하게 절벽을 올라갔지만, 당신도 어렵잖게 따라가고 있습니다. 곧 절벽 꼭대기에 도착합니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2190471c-28e1-4dbc-89b1-898129c36020"
msgid ""
"{n}You begin climbing. At one point you discover that a ledge you meant to "
"step on is not secure. You try to backtrack, but lose your balance.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 절벽을 오르기 시작합니다. 그러던 어느 순간, 당신이 밟으려고 했던 돌출부가 실은 그리 튼튼하지 않았다는 것을 깨달았습니다. "
"당신은 얼른 발을 떼려 했지만 곧 균형을 잃고 말았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "437e9853-7932-4883-9b85-55c1712e1f91"
msgid ""
"{n}Luckily, Kalikke, who is climbing with the dexterity of a lizard, catches "
"your hand just in time and helps you hold on.{/n} \"Look, we're close to the "
"top! Almost there...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다행히 도마뱀처럼 민첩하게 절벽을 올라가던 칼리케가 당신의 손을 간신히 낚아채 다시 균형을 찾게 도왔습니다.{/n} \"꼭대기에 "
"거의 다 왔어! 조금만 더...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_ArmorOff/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ad6f806c-3c6e-4ea7-8b8f-d6e9c52c28f3"
msgid "\"Are you ready for the climb?\""
msgstr "\"오를 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b2726e1f-d04b-43ff-92e6-a943afa91840"
msgid "[Detect Magic] [Examine the elementals and the magic seal]"
msgstr "[마법 탐지] [정령들과 마법 봉인을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "fbb5a464-be0f-4899-835b-375a2079f1b3"
msgid ""
"\"Water elementals, at a settlement that perished from a sudden flood...\""
msgstr "\"갑작스런 홍수로 파괴된 마을에, 물의 정령들이라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a922efb0-0765-4463-afa9-ed3994afe04b"
msgid "\"What will happen if we set the elementals free?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 이 정령들을 풀어주면 무슨 일이 생길까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "2f9036a6-95d4-4d4a-a6e0-3dd8cc29cd23"
msgid "\"I understand. Let's see what we can do...\""
msgstr "\"알겠어. 우리가 무얼 할 수 있는지 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2b65a121-20c8-4255-bb5d-e7729af05122"
msgid ""
"{n}The water elementals whirl anxiously but make no move to attack. Kalikke "
"is obviously commanding their attention. The creatures' bodies ripple, and "
"they freeze and face the girl.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}물의 정령이 불안하게 소용돌이치지만 공격할 기미를 보이지는 않습니다. 칼리케가 확실히 그들의 주의를 끄는데 성공한 것 같습니다. "
"정령들의 몸이 물결치더니, 곧 멈춰서 칼리케와 마주봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9c12e1f0-b84a-49fb-bfcc-2d8a9a425a49"
msgid ""
"\"This is what I felt! These creatures... we belong to the same elemental "
"force.\" {n}The girl leans forward.{/n} \"I could be wrong, but I feel they "
"are seething. As if... as if yearning for freedom. They cannot leave... and "
"they've been trapped in this place for a long time – an incredibly long "
"time...\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 그거였어! 이 생명체들... 이들과 나는 같은 원소의 힘에 속해 있어.\" {n}칼리케가 몸을 앞으로 기울입니다.{/n} \"내가"
" 틀릴 수도 있겠지만, 그들이 들끓고 있는 게 느껴져. 마치... 마치 자유를 갈망하기라도 하듯이. 그들은 떠날 수 없어... 여기에 "
"아주 오랫동안 갇혀 있었어... 믿을 수 없을 만큼 오랜 세월 동안...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "192bf193-0e25-40bd-88d3-37567be5ee20"
msgid ""
"{n}The seal has a strong aura. It appears as though a magical trap has tied "
"the elementals to this place.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}봉인은 강한 기운을 풍깁니다. 마법 덫이 정령들을 이곳에 묶어두고 있는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6cfbbfde-fa43-4201-ac18-edeab2809811"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke's eyes are full of sorrow.{/n} \"Yes. It seems that someone used "
"them to kill the Taldans – and then just abandoned them here. But who? Who "
"would use such powerful magic, only to kill some simple miners? The past "
"hides so many secrets...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케의 눈은 슬픔으로 가득합니다.{/n} \"그래. 누군가 정령들을 이용해 탈도르인들을 죽이고는, 여기에 버려두고 간 것 같아. "
"하지만 대체 누가 그랬을까? 단지 광부 몇 명을 죽이겠다고 이런 강력한 마법을 쓸 사람이 누구일까? 풀리지 않는 비밀이 너무나 많아..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "00b9e486-605b-45b9-9955-70072aa16d56"
msgid ""
"\"Could we? I doubt they would attack. They suffer here, under the ruthless "
"sun, far from their elemental forces. They seem happy to see me... and are "
"pleading for help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래도 될까? 그들이 공격하지는 않을거라고 봐. 그들은 그들 원소의 본원과 단절된 채로 무자비한 태양 아래서 고통받아왔어. 정령들은 "
"나를 만나서 기쁜 거 같아... 나에게 도움을 청하고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "5d0f714a-9691-4a7e-adb3-639572dd93a3"
msgid ""
"{n}The elementals billow and shiver anxiously. They seem distrustful of "
"their newfound freedom. Twisted masses of water resembling arms extend "
"forward, as if pointing to something ahead. Then one of the elementals "
"utters a word in an unfamiliar language, as it reaches out to Kalikke.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}정령들은 몸을 요동치더니 불안하게 떨고 있습니다. 그들은 다시 자유를 찾았다는 것을 믿을 수 없어하는 기색입니다. 정령은 팔 "
"모양으로 꼰 물의 갈래를 앞으로 뻗습니다. 마치 앞쪽에 있는 무언가를 가리키는 것 같습니다. 한 정령이 알아들을 수 없는 언어로 "
"칼리케에게 한 단어를 외칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2ce5ac58-b001-409b-b7ef-6a49f0dedcca"
msgid ""
"\"They seem to be saying, 'Danger ahead!' And they're ready to help us, if "
"we need help... The word he said is some kind of name or call!\""
msgstr ""
"\" '전방에 위험!'이라고 경고하는 것 같아. 우리를 도와주겠대... 정령이 방금 말한 단어는 사람 이름이나 어떤 신호를 뜻하는 것 "
"같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/Kalikke_Elementals/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "c13cdfab-89cd-4849-adb1-2d885e5ffcb8"
msgid ""
"{n}As if knowing their message had been understood, the elementals rush away "
"– to their long-desired freedom.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 그들의 말을 이해한 것을 알기라도 한듯, 정령들은 이제 그토록 갈망하던 자유를 향해 달려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "5b140f55-8f34-4e90-9826-e5229acacadd"
msgid "\"There's no need for the charade. – Your sister told me the truth.\""
msgstr "\"말장난은 이제 그만. 네 동생한테 사실을 벌써 들었다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "2d5e23eb-b8c9-45d9-9ec4-2771212f376a"
msgid "\"It's nice to see you again... Kanerah.\""
msgstr "\"다시 만나 반가워... 카네라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "ad84c012-5fd2-46f9-842d-717eb80340d0"
msgid "\"I guess I'm a {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} of many talents.\""
msgstr "\"나는 재주가 많은 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "bfc68ab0-cd66-44f5-b30c-9a2916edaa63"
msgid "\"Your sister asked me to find an artifact...\""
msgstr "\"네 쌍둥이가 아티팩트를 찾아달라고 부탁했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "08c853d8-4ac8-49cb-8704-40113d853956"
msgid "\"Enough talk. I'm here to win the Taldan treasure and the artifact.\""
msgstr "\"이야기는 그만. 나는 탈도르인의 재화와 그 아티팩트를 찾으러 온거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "0a77198b-980f-4887-abdd-29604cfac8db"
msgid "\"Let's fight it! We'll easily defeat it.\""
msgstr "\"싸우자! 쉽게 이길 수 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "b1358025-3660-489e-891f-b60ca98a7eb2"
msgid ""
"\"Let's try to slip past it and take the Disk and the other valuables.\""
msgstr "\"가고일을 몰래 지나간 후 원반이랑 다른 보물들이나 얼른 챙기자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "7573e349-1326-44c0-a64c-facc8d371feb"
msgid ""
"\"We freed the water elementals, who seem friendly. They will help us defeat "
"the gargoyle.\""
msgstr "\"우리 편이 되어줄 물의 정령들을 풀어주었어. 그들이 가고일을 물리치도록 도와줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f4899f07-47f7-4855-b05d-c3c3de59c61a"
msgid ""
"Refused to leave your allies — the water elementals — to the monstrous "
"gargoyle."
msgstr "잠시나마 당신의 동맹이었던 물의 정령들을 가고일 앞에 남겨두고 떠나는 것을 거절했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "cdfc35c9-f36f-4378-9ae8-f3a1f989d392"
msgid "\"No, we won't abandon them in battle! We'll fight together!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 전장에 그들만 내버려두고 갈 수 없어! 우리는 함께 싸워야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c4b646c4-f9d3-4df6-83b7-80afc26feffd"
msgid ""
"Pitted the water elementals against the monstrous gargoyle, without helping "
"them."
msgstr "정령들을 시켜 가고일과 싸우도록 만들었지만, 그들을 도와 함께 싸우지는 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "b106025d-e368-4a10-a5d3-0a4fca6ff9d2"
msgid ""
"\"Right, let them work for their freedom. Even if they die, we'll easily be "
"able to finish off the weakened gargoyle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 우리가 구해주었으니 자기들 몫은 하라고 하자. 정령들이 모조리 죽더라도 우리는 싸우느라 약해진 가고일을 쉽게 끝장낼 수 "
"있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "211d0171-3390-4f1a-bd82-760ea11a9611"
msgid "\"I am not ready to attack the gargoyle yet.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아직 가고일을 공격할 준비가 안 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "fdef8cbd-2c3c-4bd9-a694-28afab8ee1b2"
msgid ""
"\"We've got a primal elemental gem of fire. Let's summon an elemental to "
"help us defeat the gargoyle.\""
msgstr "\"이건 불 정령의 근원 보석이야. 이걸로 불의 정령을 소환해서 가고일을 물리치자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "52115975-458c-4353-b423-5f76611604a4"
msgid ""
"\"Right. Even if the elemental dies, we'll easily be able to finish off the "
"weakened gargoyle.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 정령들이 죽는다 해도 우리는 약해진 가고일을 쉽게 끝장낼 수 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "249f7f0a-b14f-4738-913c-6cc4b2890966"
msgid "\"I never pass up a good fight.\""
msgstr "\"재미있는 싸움을 그냥 지나칠수야 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "48635c78-b142-4251-bc05-5d700878bfef"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke warily looks around the area.{/n} \"The tower! It's destroyed, "
"and I... I'm afraid...\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 조심스럽게 주변을 살핍니다.{/n} \"탑이! 무너졌어. ...어떻게 하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c7436dbd-22dc-43a6-8511-8a7ecd582126"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke points at the ruins. A frightening gargoyle is sitting among "
"them... Is it even a gargoyle? The jewels the monster has gathered in its "
"nest glimmering here and there. But the brightest treasure of all is a small "
"disk lying at its feet. It glistens white like incandescent metal, but a "
"moment later it is covered by abysmal blackness. Then it flashes white "
"again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 폐허를 가리킵니다. 무시무시한 가고일이 폐허 한가운데에 앉아있습니다... 저게 가고일이 맞기는 할까요? 괴물이 둥지에 "
"모아둔 보석이 곳곳에서 찬란히 빛을 발합니다. 하지만 가장 밝게 빛나는 보물은 그의 발치에 놓여있는 작은 원반입니다. 그것은 타오르는 "
"금속과도 같이 하얗게 번쩍이다 곧바로 끝모를 깊은 어둠에 뒤덮이는가 싶더니, 다시 하얀 광채에 휩싸이기를 반복합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7705fb42-14cb-48de-8499-51466c659191"
msgid ""
"\"The Disk of the Eclipse! That must be it! But how do we...\" {n}The girl "
"freezes midsentence, her eyes wide open. And then...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저게 해와 달을 삼킨 원반이야! 틀림 없어! 하지만 어떻게 해야...\" {n}여성은 눈을 크게 뜨고는, 말을 잇지 못합니다. "
"그리고...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f60083ab-f411-4f3f-8ada-06f3951e8ea7"
msgid ""
"{n}You look in the eyes of a tiefling girl as she emerges from the portal, "
"and she raises her brow expressively.{/n} \"{name}! It's such a wonderful "
"day... and what a view...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 방금 포탈에서 나타난 티플링 여성의 눈을 바라봅니다. 그녀가 맵시있게 눈썹을 치켜뜨며 말합니다.{/n} \"{name}! "
"정말 대단한 날이야... 경치도 멋지고 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "618015df-a9ed-45f3-ad73-b86325af428a"
msgid "\"So, what's our plan?\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 우리의 계획은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e8cdb816-0dee-414a-9187-dfa9c6f37a9e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah keeps silent for a few moments, contemplating her new situation, "
"but then she smiles coyly.{/n} \"Tell me, {name}. Didn't we say goodbye in a "
"luxurious banquet hall in Restov the day you received your barony? And now "
"we're sitting all alone at the top of a cliff in some backwater, surrounded "
"by slimy flesh-eating toads, and other revolting monsters! I don't even know "
"which question to ask first – 'Why?' or 'HOW?!'\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 잠시 침묵을 지키며 자신에게 닥친 새로운 상황에 대해 곰곰이 생각해 보지만, 이내 수줍게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"봐봐. "
"{name}. 네가 남작으로 임명되던 날 우리가 레스토프의 그 호화스러운 연회장에서 작별인사를 하지 않았던가? 그런데 지금 우리는 이런 "
"산골 절벽 꼭대기에 단 둘이 앉아 미끈미끈한 육식 두꺼비와 혐오스러운 괴물들에게 둘러싸여 있지! 어떤 질문을 먼저 해야 할까? 왜? "
"어쩌다?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a7a43084-0be4-41f1-8930-44d3a8c01ade"
msgid ""
"{n}You detect a glimmer of fear in the girl's eyes, but she quickly shakes "
"it off and snaps her tail angrily.{/n} \"Let me guess – my sweet sister "
"couldn't hold her tongue? She broke the god's orders and revealed our "
"secret? To tell you the truth, I was sure all this would come out sooner or "
"later... but it's nice to know I wasn't the fool who let it slip!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 카네라의 눈에 잠깐 두려움이 어리는 것을 느꼈습니다. 하지만 그녀는 금방 감정을 떨쳐내고는 꼬리로 바닥을 거칠게 "
"내리칩니다.{/n} \"어디 보자. 내 귀여운 동생이 결국 입을 놀려버렸구나. 신의 명령을 어기고 우리 비밀을 발설해? 솔직히 언젠가 "
"일어날 일이라고는 생각했지만... 적어도 그런 바보짓을 저지른게 내가 아니어서 다행이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d331dced-5f6d-4f0a-81fb-cf8cbf691a1f"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a glimmer of fear in the girl's almond-shaped eyes, but she "
"quickly gathers herself.{/n} \"It was... to be expected. From the very "
"beginning, I thought the herald of Nethys was just joking with us, making us "
"promise to 'keep everything a secret', while forcing us to switch "
"spontaneously, with no warning, at any moment. I wonder if we will be "
"punished for our failure. Well, what good is it to worry about something you "
"can't change? I'm already living a borrowed life, beyond my time...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 칼리케의 아몬드 모양 눈에서 두려움을 읽었지만, 그녀는 곧 스스로를 다잡습니다.{/n} \"그건... 예상했어. 처음에 나는 "
"네서스의 사자가 농담을 하는 건 줄 알았어. 언제든지, 조그만 경고도 없이 두 사람의 의식이 무작위로 바뀌게 만들어놓고 '모든 것은 "
"비밀로' 하라잖아. 비밀을 지키지 못하면 우리가 벌을 받긴 할까 몰라. 뭐, 우리 힘으로 바꿀 수 없는 일은 걱정해봤자야. 더구나 내 "
"삶은 진작 끝나버렸고, 지금은 빌려온 삶을 사는 것에 불과한데 뭐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "96d2421f-a4cc-440b-a424-5844eae2310d"
msgid ""
"\"An artifact? It doesn't happen to be the Disk of the Eclipse, does it? Of "
"course, it was I who first told you about it... But I imagined us sitting "
"cozy by the fire in your castle, while your servants went off to collect it. "
"But oh well, an adventure it is then! But it seems our treasure been stolen "
"by that ugly gargoyle? So what are we supposed to do now?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아티팩트라고? 그게 설마 해와 달을 삼킨 원반을 말하는 건 아니겠지? 물론 너에게 그 물건에 대해 처음 얘기해준게 나인건 맞지만... "
"나는 너랑 성에 앉아 편안하게 불이나 쪼이면서 부하들이 그걸 찾아오는 걸 기다리고 있을 줄 알았지. 하지만 뭐, 이제 그럼 모험이구나! "
"그런데 저 못생긴 가고일이 우리 보물을 훔쳤다는 거지? 이제 어떻게 할 생각이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "83e371f8-4ede-42d0-8d9b-acecc84a8811"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah rolls her eyes ostentatiously.{/n} \"I thought palace balls and "
"parades were the proper entertainment for nobility... But rock climbing "
"isn't too bad either!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 눈알을 이리저리 굴립니다.{/n} \"궁정 무도회나 퍼레이드가 귀족에게 걸맞는 유희일 거라고 생각했는데... 바위 타기도 "
"나쁘지는 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0027_stones_Text_String
msgctxt "60831693-6476-4a64-9ca5-a75237f0dca9"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah nods.{/n} \"Carrying weights is not my calling. It's Kalikke who "
"can't live without gymnastics... But I'll do what I can. It's always better "
"to deal with enemies from a safe distance!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"무거운 것을 드는 건 내 취미가 아니야. 운동 없이 못 사는 건 칼리케 쪽이지... 하지만 "
"무엇이든 해 볼게. 안전한 원거리에서 적과 상대하는 게 항상 더 좋거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4c0b4bea-c1a2-472b-a7e6-dd0d26699cb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah keeps silent for a few moments, contemplating her new situation, "
"but then she smiles coyly.{/n} \"Tell me, {name}. The last time we met you "
"were sitting on a throne in a great hall, surrounded by guards and advisors. "
"And now we're sitting all alone at the top of a cliff in some backwater, "
"surrounded by slimy flesh-eating toads and other revolting monsters! I don't "
"even know which question to ask first – 'Why?' or 'HOW?!'\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 자신에게 닥친 새로운 상황에 대해 심각하게 고민하는 듯 합니다. 몇 분에 걸친 침묵 끝에, 그녀는 수줍게 "
"웃음짓습니다.{/n} \"봐봐. {name}. 네가 남작으로 서임되던 날 우리가 레스토프의 그 호화스러운 연회장에서 작별인사를 하지 "
"않았던가? 그런데 지금 우리는 이런 산골 절벽 꼭대기에 단 둘이 앉아 미끈미끈한 육식 두꺼비와 혐오스러운 괴물들에게 둘러싸여 있지! 어떤 "
"질문을 먼저 해야 할까? 왜? 어쩌다?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d36f5366-ffcc-47bc-afe5-5bcb96965f17"
msgid ""
"\"So we let them fight instead of us, right? So we can stand back and watch…"
"\" {n}Kanerah smiles coyly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"우리 대신 그것들이 싸우게 할거지? 그러고 우리는 뒤에서 지켜보기만 하자고...\" {n}카네라는 수줍게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c3a8eb2c-46c5-4dc7-81bd-285237244312"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah wrinkles her nose.{/n} \"As you wish, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|"
"Your Highness|Your Highness}. We'll risk our lives for animated puddles. "
"Fine, let's call them...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"분부대로 합죠, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저 살아 움직이는 물덩어리들 때문에 "
"목숨을 내걸고 싶으시다면야. 좋아. 그들을 부르자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7dafe74f-fe5d-4763-90b1-a9522a20110b"
msgid ""
"\"I like your way of thinking... Very well, call forth your water friends!\""
msgstr "\"네가 생각하는 방식이 마음에 들어... 좋아. 네 물 친구들을 부르자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e87c352b-808c-4b9d-a5ea-90a22e74628a"
msgid "\"A reasonable plan. Lead the way. I'll follow you...\""
msgstr "\"합리적인 계획이야. 앞장서. 내가 뒤따라 갈게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "70aa7910-b98d-4fa8-bdb5-7d2362120510"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah squints, then nods.{/n} \"Lead the way. I think I can help by "
"adding some fire to the situation...\""
msgstr "{n}카네라가 눈을 흘기고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"먼저 가. 나는 뒤에서 화력 지원을 하는 편이 낫겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0aeeaf09-ee1e-44a9-be87-198644d4dbf7"
msgid ""
"\"I like your way of thinking... Very well, call forth our fiery friend!\""
msgstr "\"네가 생각하는 방식이 마음에 들어... 좋아. 우리 불 친구들을 부르자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f9095839-74e9-4390-9b22-d8c148fcb304"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah wrinkles her nose.{/n} \"As you wish, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|"
"Your Highness|Your Highness}. Let's summon it...\""
msgstr "{n}카네라가 미간을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"분부대로, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 어디 불러볼까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/TaldorTowerOutdoor/RockSummit/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6525b4d9-ea50-4740-a6df-c8ff614b7cc7"
msgid ""
"\"So we let it fight instead of us, right? So we can just stand back and "
"watch…\" {n}Kanerah smiles coyly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 정령들을 우리 대신 싸우게 하자는 거지? 우리는 뒤에서 그냥 지켜보고만 있고...\" {n}카네라는 요염한 미소를 "
"띄었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "41c96209-c0bf-49c2-bd9e-e71fba82f8a1"
msgid "\"Why don't you just go there yourself?\""
msgstr "\"직접 가보지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "568c7331-5d4f-411c-aca9-1d63906d74c2"
msgid "\"And what kind of treasury is it?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그건 어떤 보물이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "977bb946-178b-4714-9b89-e6c08d9d9efa"
msgid "\"Great, I like adventure.\""
msgstr "\"잘 됐네. 모험은 언제든 환영이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7ee566fa-353f-4bdf-b6d3-97829dc3288f"
msgid "\"I'm not interested.\""
msgstr "\"흥미 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "6390967a-c1c0-4e9e-b2b5-aadef64c840c"
msgid "\"We must discuss dividing the loot before we proceed.\""
msgstr "\"출발하기 전에, 약탈한 보물은 어떻게 나눌지 먼저 정하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "3d5c6c73-7d9a-42a4-86a3-7791022c6ae9"
msgid "\"Fine, I changed my mind. I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 마음을 바꾸었어. 너를 돕겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "41f5e100-bfd2-4026-a4d0-7771f16da1f8"
msgid "\"My decision is final. The audience is over.\""
msgstr "\"이미 최종 결정은 끝났어. 접견은 여기까지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fea3f541-52cc-4e2d-9039-3e5971197655"
msgid ""
"{n}An unusual petitioner approaches you – a tiefling girl, who appears to be "
"a foreigner from the south. She makes a courtly bow but her face betrays a "
"coy smile.{/n} \"Greetings to the ruler of these lands!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}특이한 청원자 한 사람이 당신에게 다가옵니다. 남쪽에서 온 것으로 보이는 젊은 티플링 여성이 당신에게 예의바르게 허리숙여 절합니다. "
"그러나 웃는 얼굴에서 수줍음을 감추지는 못합니다.{/n} \"이 땅의 통치자께 인사 올립니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "8e99fff5-3619-47c0-9229-decbd1212ea5"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Kaessi. I come from the sands of {g|Qadira}Qadira{/g}. A "
"special wind – the wind of opportunity and hidden treasure – has brought me "
"to these lands.\" {n}The tielfing waves her tail in excitement.{/n} \"And "
"without all the polite words, here is what I want to say: I know the "
"location of an ancient treasury, and I'm asking for the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}'s help to reach it and share in the loot!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 이름은 카에시이고, 모래의 땅 {g|Qadira}카디라{/g}에서 왔어요. 아주 특별한 바람이 실어다준 일확천금의 냄새를 맡고 "
"이곳까지 오게 되었죠.\" {n}티플링은 신이 나서 꼬리를 살랑거립니다.{/n} \"단도직입적으로 말할게. 나는 고대 보물의 위치를 "
"알아. 함께 보물을 찾아서 나눠갖는게 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "28380ccf-3f9b-4edd-a6b5-bea00caad314"
msgid ""
"\"The remains of an ancient {g|Taldor}Taldan{/g} settlement, destroyed long "
"ago by the forces of nature. My friends came across an ancient chronicle "
"that referred to this settlement, and managed to locate the ruins. But they "
"couldn't get inside, being too afraid. These lands are dangerous...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}인들이 살던 고대 마을의 폐허인데 자연 재해로 오래 전 파괴되었어. 내 친구들이 고대 연대기를 얻어서 "
"그 위치를 알게 되었어. 하지만 그들은 겁에 질려 들어갈 수가 없었어. 이 땅은 위험한 곳이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "33b84e30-9318-4803-a21a-289cc09a793e"
msgid ""
"\"My friends who visited the place said that it's filled with monsters and "
"wild animals. I shouldn't like going there all alone. Besides, it would be "
"wrong not to tell the ruler of a treasure found in {mf|his|her} lands...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그곳을 방문했던 친구들에 따르면 그곳에는 괴물과 야수들이 가득하다고 했어. 나는 그런 곳에 혼자 가고 싶지 않아. 또, 보물을 찾을 "
"거라면 그 땅의 통치자에게 미리 알리는 게 경우에 맞는 일이기도 하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "71be3f7c-cc2c-41d0-b6f9-de7de0a84c2d"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl nods.{/n} \"Of course. Truth be told, I'm only interested in one "
"thing – an artifact called the Disk of the Eclipse, which is supposed to be "
"in this treasury... if my informants are not mistaken. I claim no rights to "
"the rest of the loot... but who knows – perhaps the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} will have an overwhelming desire to reward "
"their helpful assistant?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링이 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"물론이지. 사실, 나는 해와 달을 삼킨 원반이라는 유물에만 관심이 있어. 친구들이 가져온 "
"정보가 맞다면, 그 보물들 중에 이 원반이 있다고 하거든. 그 밖에 다른 보물에 대해서는 권리를 주장하지 않겠어. 물론 "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}께서 이 쓸모 있는 조력자에게 포상을 내리고픈 열망이 생기실 수도 있겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "667f5027-e33c-4d31-99ea-6923bb220ba3"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling bows again, tracing patterns on the floor with her tail.{/n} "
"\"In that case I will take leave, and prepare for the expedition. I've "
"already rented a house in your wonderful city. The "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} is welcome to visit me any time, when you're "
"ready to discuss our plans.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링은 꼬리로는 바닥의 문양을 따라 짚으면서 허리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 난 이제 그만 가서 탐사를 준비하겠어. 난 이 "
"훌륭한 도시에 벌써 집을 한 채 빌려 놓았지. 계획에 대해 더 논의하고 싶다면, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}님께서 언제든 내키는대로 "
"방문해주시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ec02a903-5e7f-4d38-b868-799c71ccd8c0"
msgid ""
"\"Was I really so unpersuasive? Will I just have to get all those treasures "
"myself?\""
msgstr "\"내가 그렇게 설득력이 없었어? 그럼 내가 이 보물을 독차지해도 상관 없다는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q1_DoingItWrong/ktc-MIDGAME/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "0f30fd05-e9f5-47f3-bab9-72263484566d"
msgid ""
"\"Then I dare not bother you any longer.\" {n}The tiefling bows again and "
"leaves.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그렇다면 더 이상 너를 괴롭히지 않을게.\" {n}티플링은 허리 숙여 인사를 하고는 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/DevilCapitalArsinoe_String
msgctxt "e67d5e7c-711e-4c55-bc64-b124c12f86d5"
msgid ""
"\"O lovely followers of Abadar... when I was a thousand years younger, your "
"souls were like a tempting dessert to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 사랑스러운 아바다르의 추종자들... 젊은 시절에, 너희 영혼은 아주 먹음직스러운 후식이었달까. 비록 천 년 전 이야기이지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/DevilCapitalTrader_String
msgctxt "5ddac336-004c-4b57-8ac9-23f38e9426fc"
msgid ""
"\"Without a doubt, for such prices you're going to Hell. We'll see you there!"
"\""
msgstr "\"의심의 여지 없이, 그런 죄에 어울리는 대가는 지옥 뿐이다. 지옥에서 만나자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/DevilCapital_String
msgctxt "bbe565ef-d590-4252-af98-8977d856d43f"
msgid ""
"\"Interesting architecture. I should visit the cities of the Material Plane "
"more often...\""
msgstr "\"흥미로운 건축물이군. 물질계의 도시에 좀 더 자주 와 봐야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/SweethToothCamping_1_String
msgctxt "b559e3d5-d822-4a35-80a0-5a2f38671254"
msgid ""
"What is this noise, Naiho? Are you trying to annoy me by pounding rocks with "
"a pot?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리지, 나이호? 날 성가시게 하려고 솥으로 바위를 두드리고 있는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/SweethToothCamping_2_String
msgctxt "f6597ee9-7368-4d35-baae-713006a50a55"
msgid "\"I'm not doing anything!\""
msgstr "\"나는 아무 짓도 하지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/SweethToothCamping_3_String
msgctxt "3b8f2b35-5a78-4516-abe1-277ac40ee06b"
msgid "\"But I can hear it!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 분명 소리를 들었거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/MiscBarks/SweethToothCamping_4_String
msgctxt "af4b936d-1884-48ad-8097-8f007659d8cc"
msgid "\"Watch out!\""
msgstr "\"조심해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "68a9e3cf-593f-4d6f-8d55-8227ae3ccd26"
msgid "\"How are you?\""
msgstr "\"기분은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "48f6f879-2afb-49e5-b08d-76d39cc2ac3f"
msgid "\"We have to discuss what happened.\""
msgstr "\"있었던 일에 대해 이야기를 나누자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3620331f-c7fb-447e-b759-4a5291f62933"
msgid "\"I'm sorry we couldn't save everyone.\""
msgstr "\"모두를 구하지 못한 건 유감이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "7decdaa3-0af2-4a6e-b050-42e8406b49f9"
msgid "\"I think Kanerah is very angry with you...\""
msgstr "\"카네라가 너에게 화가 많이 난 거 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "17908102-d687-4538-bd3b-4cbd671639cc"
msgid "\"Will you continue to serve me despite the death of the Sweet Teeth?\""
msgstr "\"단 것 중독자들이 죽었는데도 계속 나를 위해 일해줄거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "2dd20d50-0637-4437-a39a-436ff46dc238"
msgid "\"I need to talk to your sister.\""
msgstr "\"네 쌍둥이와 대화하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9584665d-ef7d-48ed-a30c-985b23efee48"
msgid "\"I have to go. So long!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "11a79cd6-5416-4f06-b3ab-a6acb96da876"
msgid "\"You're fine, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮은거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "30a4d303-c541-4a5b-add5-5120f64915ea"
msgid "\"We need to discuss what happened.\""
msgstr "\"일어났던 일에 대해서 얘기 좀 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "3d00e59a-d104-4c0f-bc38-ba7f5f33ec5c"
msgid "\"Did you understand what the Forefather was trying to achieve?\""
msgstr "\"선조의 목적이 무엇인지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "03fd7da1-77c9-4445-853b-26bd8d21193c"
msgid ""
"\"You seem unhappy that Kalikke and I decided to summon you to save the "
"Sweet Teeth.\""
msgstr "\"칼리케와 내가 단 것 중독자들을 구하기 위해 너를 소환하기로 해서 불만스러웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "147c2a32-b797-482f-a572-6b68804f749f"
msgid "\"I'm surprised you and Kalikke didn't get into a fight...\""
msgstr "\"너와 칼리케가 싸우러들지 않아서 놀랐어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "31a0ff83-0524-4d8c-9e89-07be2c81c174"
msgid "\"I think your sister is in despair. You hurt her feelings.\""
msgstr "\"네 쌍둥이가 절망하고 있는 것 같아. 네가 그녀에게 상처를 주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "9f5d9b21-217e-4d03-8457-4646e2d90ca5"
msgid "\"What can we do?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 무엇을 하면 되지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "942eb70b-0bf4-4de6-9d12-7d80c6c20889"
msgid "\"Did you understand what the Forefather was trying to achieve?\""
msgstr "\"선조의 목적이 무엇인지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "05af2603-c960-4b45-b903-f4d82f1a0a05"
msgid ""
"\"Are you upset that I didn't let you summon Kanerah, and we barely saved "
"the Sweet Teeth?\""
msgstr "\"내가 카네라를 소환하지 못하게 해서 결국 단 것 중독자들을 구하지 못한 것 때문에 화가 났어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "29535458-e417-40af-89c0-51f97d4af02b"
msgid "\"What can we do now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 우리는 무엇을 하면 되지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "5cf4357b-c0fe-49c4-9d6f-2653f3a0931b"
msgid "\"I need to talk to your sister.\""
msgstr "\"네 쌍둥이와 대화하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "f8cf9a6d-6a3c-4c17-bb6b-454b2eabb65f"
msgid "\"I have to go. So long!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0001_Text
#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0001_Text_String
msgctxt "5bd883ae-00a2-42b5-af59-80e742a93259"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah mumbles something with an independent air, then chuckles.{/n} "
"\"Some story, isn't it?\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 허공에 대고 뭐라 중얼거리고는 킬킬 웃습니다.{/n} \"굉장한 이야기네, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0002_Text_String
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "afa9df56-4a00-4d81-921c-d76a72cd4ed8"
msgid ""
"{n}After everything that happened at the Kamelands barrens, Kalikke has kept "
"to herself, while acting as if nothing happened. This time she greets you "
"with almost pointed nonchalance.{/n} \"Hello! Welcome!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케임랜드 황야에서 있었던 일 이후로, 칼리케는 마치 아무 일도 없었다는 듯 모든 것을 혼자만 간직하고 있습니다. 이번에도 그녀의 "
"인사는 냉담함을 가장하고 있습니다만, 어딘가 날이 선 느낌입니다.{/n} \"안녕! 어서 와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0140cfdb-52b8-4091-b270-20a3d2a1294a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke gives you a grateful smile touched with sadness.{/n} \"It's been "
"a difficult time for me. Thank you for asking...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 웃으며 감사를 표하지만, 어딘지 슬픔이 엿보입니다.{/n} \"나에게는 힘든 시간이었어. 물어봐주어 고마워...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "66932e35-7c9a-4328-92ad-235a1b249101"
msgid "\"You have the right to answers. Ask.\""
msgstr "\"너는 답을 들을 권리가 있어. 얼마든지 물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2e37e1b0-5723-43eb-bbf2-142679fdcc3e"
msgid "\"Is that some kind of wicked joke? Don't ask empty questions.\""
msgstr "\"이것도 무슨 못된 농담인거지? 쓸데 없는 질문으로 시간을 낭비하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b0b42af9-6c47-4db6-b399-83644aa682b7"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing, isn't it? Yes, I'm quite all right... for someone who was used as "
"bait for an evil monster from Abaddon...\""
msgstr "\"놀랍지 않아? 그래, 나는 정말 괜찮아... 나락의 괴물을 잡기 위한 미끼로 쓰인 사람 치고는 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4195c765-9ff7-481d-8da4-381a8fa90fbb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm surprised. Between everything that's going on in your lands, you find "
"interest in such a trifle as a devil's plots and the family troubles of two "
"lowly tieflings...\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀랐어. 이 땅에서 일어나는 숱한 일 중에 하필 데블의 음모와 비천한 두 티플링 자매의 가족 문제 같은 시시한 일에 관심을 갖다니 "
"말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f6da8cf1-0da3-488b-adf8-0b49822894c1"
msgid ""
"\"You saw and heard everything. Back then, my heart was like a pot, boiling "
"with scalding poison. I shouldn't be angry at my sister, I know... but I'm "
"so tired. And it seems the nightmare we endured in Qadira has returned to "
"us. Whatever we do, we keep hurting each other.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 모든 걸 보았잖아. 그 때 내 마음은 뜨거운 독물이 끓고 있는 솥단지처럼 속상하고 화가 났어. 나도 알아. 언니에게 화를 내서는 "
"안되는 거였지만... 나도 너무 지쳤어. 카디라에서 겪었던 악몽이 우리에게 다시 돌아온 것 같아. 우리는 하는 일마다 서로에게 상처를 "
"주고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "dc414a5c-ce99-4b32-b0ac-7fe6891d5253"
msgid ""
"\"I... understand why you made this decision. It would be unfair to my "
"sister to use her as bait for the monster. But I can't even think of letting "
"the Forefather feed the Sweet Teeth to that beast. We tried to help everyone "
"without making any sacrifices or putting anyone's life above the others. "
"Something in me rises against this decision, but the more I think about it, "
"the more I see the wisdom in it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 네가 왜 이런 결정을 내렸는지는 알 것 같아. 언니를 괴물을 유인하는 미끼로 삼았다면 그것도 부당한 일이었을 거야. 하지만 "
"선조가 단 것 중독자 아이들을 그 괴물의 먹이로 던져주는 걸 가만 내버려두는 것도 상상할 수 없는 일이야. 우리는 모두를 돕고자 했지만, "
"어디까지나 누군가를 희생하거나, 혹은 누군가의 생명에 다른 이들보다 더 많은 가치를 두지 않는 선에서만 그랬지. 내 안의 무언가가 이 "
"결정을 완강히 거부하고 있고, 생각을 거듭해봐도 이 쪽이 더 지혜롭게 느껴져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7b1e9b33-f6c2-401a-8908-70ff7a74b078"
msgid ""
"\"You are my benefactor and patron. My debt to you has not yet been paid.\" "
"{n}You hear respect in Kalikke's voice, but also detachment.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"너는 나의 은인이자 후원자야. 너에게 진 빚은 아직 다 갚지 못했어.\" {n}칼리케의 목소리에는 당신에 대한 존경심이 담겨 있지만, "
"초연한 태도 역시 명백합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e8bfd847-4a62-403d-9cfa-f1150988aaeb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes – he couldn't help explaining everything in great detail. The "
"patronage that Nethys gave us weighs heavily on him. But despite all his "
"might, the Forefather believes in rules. He imagines that if he forces us to "
"break the deity's conditions, Nethys will turn away from us. Perhaps he's "
"right. But – in spite of everything – I'm grateful for the taste of freedom "
"I've received. I've had enough of pretending. I want to bear my true name, "
"and not have to lie about everything all the time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그래. 그가 모든 것을 자세히 설명하지는 않았지. 네서스가 우리에게 준 후원은 그에게도 역시 무거운 짐이야. 그의 강력한 "
"권능에도 불구하고 선조는 규칙을 신봉하고 있어. 그래서 그는 우리가 신이 정해놓은 규칙을 깨도록 하면 네서스가 우리를 저버릴 거라고 "
"생각하게 된 거야. 아마 그가 맞을 수도 있겠지. 어쨋든 나는 다시 맛보게 된 자유에 감사해. 나는 변장은 이제 질렸어. 이제 모든 것에 "
"대해 거짓말할 필요 없이, 내 진짜 이름으로 살고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fedce1e1-2a66-455c-90de-f2eae77733f8"
msgid "{n}Kalikke nods indifferently and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 무관심하게 끄덕이고는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5f8c2164-e73a-42ad-a113-d9ec9852134f"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. I'm sorry I can't talk to her myself. – I wish we could discuss "
"everything in real life, not on the pages of a diary...\""
msgstr "\"물론. 그녀에게 직접 말하지 못해 미안해. 우리가 일기가 아닌 현실 세계에서 모든 것을 토론했으면 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fda3c610-dab2-4730-9b39-4bc8e8b9cb1e"
msgid ""
"\"Like songs with missing verses... whatever you do, they'll never sound the "
"same...\"{n} Kalikke's voice becomes a whisper.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"마치 중간중간 가사가 빠진 노래처럼... 아무리 애쓰더라도, 결코 같은 소리가 나지 않을 거야...\"{n} 칼리케의 목소리는 점점 "
"낮아져 속삭이듯 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7d8e1770-2a28-487e-b92e-0e9a69503471"
msgid ""
"\"I'd say I'm perfectly fine! Like I've started a new life, ha, ha! But "
"seriously, I do feel better, now that the soul eater is no longer a threat..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"완벽하게 괜찮다고 말해야겠지! 새로운 삶을 시작하기라도 한 것처럼! 하하! 진지하게, 정말 기분이 더 나아졌어. 영혼 포식자를 "
"걱정하지 않아도 된다고 생각하니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "77cb1a32-10c7-4f22-9d52-74b3ad49b20e"
msgid ""
"\"He explained everything – with his devilish dedication to details. He "
"considers his offspring 'a valuable investment', and me – well, I'm his "
"property, and my death didn't annul the contract! But I suspect he has "
"another motive...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 모두 설명해주었어. 데블들은 정말 디테일에 환장한다니까. 그가 보기에 자기 자식들은 일종의 가치있는 투자대상에 불과해. 나도 "
"말하자면 그의 소유물이라, 죽음만 가지고는 계약을 취소할 수가 없었던 거야. 하지만 내 생각에는 그에게 다른 동기가 있는 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7ce8f106-d01b-4ed6-98c2-82a4b61b3b8f"
msgid ""
"\"You know, deimaviggas like the Forefather live for one thing: twisting the "
"souls of believers in other deities, and bringing them under the reign of "
"Asmodeus. Hell does not forgive mistakes, and the Forefather was well "
"regarded there. But his 'valuable investments' slipped his grasp, to be "
"rescued by another deity... That must be unbearable for him, and he will do "
"anything it takes to take us back – or me, at least...\""
msgstr ""
"\"선조와 같은 데이마비가는 오로지 한가지만을 위해 존재해. 다른 신을 믿는 영혼들을 타락시켜 아스모데우스의 영토로 데려오는 거야. "
"지옥은 실수를 용납하지 않고 선조는 그런 지옥에서 아주 높은 대우를 받는 데블이지. 그런데 그의 '가치있는 투자대상'이 그의 손을 "
"빠져나가 다른 신격의 도움을 받아 구조됐다면 어떨까? 그에게는 견딜 수 없는 일이지. 그는 우리를, 아니면 최소한 나라도 되찾을 수 "
"있다면 무슨 짓이든 저지르고도 남을거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d35daa83-8c01-4481-9b73-7e338130c21f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid all we can do is wait. The devil promised it's not yet the end, "
"and that he'll make us break Nethys's other condition. I wish I knew how "
"he's going to do that... because it means Kanerah and I will meet again...\" "
"{n}Kalikke swings her tail nervously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"지금 우리가 할 수 있는 것이라곤 기다리는 것 뿐이야. 데블이 약속하기를, 아직 끝난게 아니고, 네서스의 나머지 규칙도 깨트릴 수 "
"있도록 돕겠다고 했으니까. 도대체 그가 어떻게 하겠다는 건지 알고 싶어... 네서스의 규칙을 깨트린다는 것은 곧 카네라와 내가 다시 만날 "
"수 있게 된다는 뜻이니까...\" {n}칼리케가 꼬리를 신경질적으로 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a5f91879-b93a-4b70-97d2-4c065dd4be7a"
msgid ""
"\"I'd say we should figure out how to stop the Forefather from carrying out "
"his plan. He's stronger than you or I – it's only Nethys's power that keeps "
"him at bay – for now. Only someone with a death wish would stand against a "
"deity, or his herald. But for now, all we can do is wait...\""
msgstr ""
"\"선조의 계획을 막을 방법을 찾아야 해. 그는 너나 나보다 강해. 그가 주저하는건 단지 네서스의 힘을 꺼리기 때문이야. 신이나, 그 "
"전령에 대항한다는 건 어지간한 의지로는 어려운 일이니까. 하지만 지금 우리가 할 수 있는 건 기다리는 것 뿐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "28b4df2f-b820-42a7-98f6-f25f341347b9"
msgid "{n}Kanerah nods wryly but says nothing.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}카네라는 심술궂게 고개를 끄덕이지만 아무 말도 하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "069c1ed9-eebf-4f8e-94d1-b8a298503617"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah sighs.{/n} \"Of course! But cheer her up, would you? She must be "
"all worked up, and she's been through so much...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"물론이지! 하지만 네가 칼리케가 기운을 차리게 좀 도와줬으면 해. 너무나 많은 일을 겪었으니, "
"그 애도 분명 감정을 추스리지 못하고 있을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "55bae4fc-2c4d-4509-a8d2-55c6bf3123eb"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah wrinkles her nose.{/n} \"You are my patron. You have the right to "
"give orders, and decide how to fight your battles. But the same is not true "
"of my sister! She risked my life a second time, and that's not something I "
"take lightly! Let me remind you – the first time I died, it was because of "
"her virtuous trickery. I died alone, desperate, with a clear understanding "
"of what was happening, and what fate awaited me.\" {n}Kanerah's face grows "
"dark, and her tail thrashes the floor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 얼굴을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"너는 내 후원자니까, 나에게 명령을 내릴 수도 있고, 어떻게 싸우라고 지시할 수도 있어. "
"하지만 칼리케는 아니야! 그 애가 날 죽을 위험에 빠트린 건 이번이 벌써 두 번째고, 난 그걸 잊지도 용서하지도 않았어. 다시 말하지만 "
"난 칼리케의 그 고결한 장난질 때문에 절망 속에서 외롭게 죽어가야 했다고. 나에게 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지, 어떤 운명이 기다리는고 "
"있는지 완전히 깨달은 채로 말이야.\" {n}얘기하는 내내 카네라의 얼굴이 점점 어두워지더니, 결국 바닥을 꼬리로 후려칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "57fca5f0-df15-4389-8368-b33c42bb1982"
msgid ""
"\"We can't, thanks to Nethys. It was a wise decision, dividing us with a "
"time-plane wall! But seriously – the Forefather is as devious as they "
"come... He found a way to trick us both. But everything turned out all right "
"in the end... I suppose.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그럴 수 없어. 네서스 덕분이지. 우리를 시간과 차원의 장벽으로 갈라놓은 건 아주 현명한 결정이었어! 하지만 선조는 아주 "
"교묘한 데블이잖아... 그는 우리 둘 모두를 속일 방법을 찾았어. 결국은 모든 게 괜찮은 걸로 밝혀지긴 했지만 말이야... 아마도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/QuestioningBeliefs/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "66edda4e-4ff9-4cbc-8aa4-6f73c219e0f7"
msgid ""
"\"But I didn't do anything! However, were I the one to make this choice... I "
"admit I feel a little sorry for the foolish Sweet Teeth, but I died once "
"before, and I don't want to do it again. And Kalikke might, for once, have "
"put her sister above that riffraff.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 나는 아무 짓도 하지 않았어! 하지만 내가 이 결정을 내렸었다고 치면... 단 것 중독자 아이들에게 약간 미안한 감정은 있었을 "
"거라는 건 인정할게. 하지만 나는 한번 죽었었고 다시는 죽고 싶지 않단 말이야. 칼리케도 이번에는 그런 하찮은 녀석들보다 언니를 더 "
"소중히 여기는 법을 배워야 한다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0a040d4a-31cf-4d38-99f8-f5fc314df72e"
msgid ""
"Decided to risk Kanerah's life in an attempt to save both her and the Sweet "
"Teeth."
msgstr "카네라의 목숨이 위험에 빠지는 한이 있어도 카네라와 단 것 중독자 아이들 모두를 살려보겠다고 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ccb2d412-05fa-4566-aa49-302d2a93a26b"
msgid ""
"\"Summon Kanerah. We'll distract the soul eater from the Sweet Teeth, and "
"then kill it. That way no one will get hurt!\""
msgstr "\"카네라를 불러. 단 것 중독자들에게서 영혼 포식자를 유인해내서 죽여 버리자. 그러면 아무도 다치지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5fd4c44f-df33-4a61-8418-d42f40d661d5"
msgid ""
"Refused to decide whose lives were more important, Kanerah's or the Sweet "
"Teeth's."
msgstr "카네라와 단 것 중독자들의 목숨 중 어느 쪽이 더 중요한지 결정하기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "95f6ce77-ca38-43d2-bc20-f5aabecb685b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't put the lives of the Sweet Teeth above Kanerah's, or vice versa. "
"Let it be decided by combat, come what may!\""
msgstr "\"누구든 어느 한 쪽의 목숨을 더 중요시할 수는 없어. 어떻게 되든지, 싸움으로 결말을 내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a28a8de6-7ecc-4dbc-a2a1-3ca4f9514fbd"
msgid "Agreed to sacrifice the Sweet Teeth."
msgstr "단 것 중독자 아이들을 희생시키는데 동의했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b0c5f167-0424-4e28-a10d-bb6c7d19a8d3"
msgid ""
"\"The Forefather proposed a fine plan, so why interfere? Let the soul eater "
"have the Sweet Teeth. At least Kanerah will survive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"선조가 좋은 계획을 가지고 있는데 왜 방해를 하지? 영혼 포식자가 아이들를 잡게 두자. 적어도 카네라는 살아남을 수 있을테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b78dba58-7f24-4ba6-b035-821b6861a391"
msgid ""
"\"You!\" {n}Kalikke folds her arms on her chest and glares at the devil.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너!\" {n}칼리케는 팔짱을 낀 채 데블을 노려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "8281a22b-48bc-4b62-9cb6-ea86f849913f"
msgid ""
"\"How rude, girl.\" {n}The Forefather doesn't seem insulted.{/n} \"I thought "
"you were old enough to understand what little meaning there is in such "
"labels as 'good' and 'evil'. Didn't the 'evil' devil help you and your "
"sister? Didn't the followers of the 'good' goddess despise you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"무례하구나.\" {n}선조는 특별히 감정을 드러내지 않습니다.{/n} \"선이나 악 같은 헛된 껍데기에 아무 의미도 없다는 것을 알 "
"정도로는 나이를 먹었다고 생각했건만. 악한 데블이 너희를 돕지 않았더냐? 선한 여신의 추종자들이 너희를 경멸하지 않았더냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "3c28cb2c-42c6-49e3-a11d-aec357253c9e"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, now is not the time for long conversations. I promised you a "
"chance to get rid of the soul eater once and for all, without any fuss. That "
"time is now.\" {n}The devil makes a sweeping gesture forward.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든 이제 대화는 그만하자. 나는 영혼 포식자를 영원히, 뒤탈 없이 처리할 기회를 주겠다고 약속했다. 이제 그 때가 온 것이다.\" "
"{n}데블이 팔을 휘둘러 앞쪽을 가리키며 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3cc91d1c-6246-4fbf-b056-97f225f1e996"
msgid "\"The Sweet Teeth! No! No!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 얘들아! 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "18041486-8cf6-4b98-a53d-eb16beaf3eca"
msgid ""
"\"Why so upset, my dear? I used my mastery of illusions to fool the slow-"
"witted soul eater. It will get its victim — three of them in fact... and it "
"will believe that it captured and killed Kanerah. And then it will leave, "
"and your problem is solved.\""
msgstr ""
"\"딸아, 왜 그렇게 화가 난 거냐? 나는 환영을 다루는 나의 기술로 저 멍청한 영혼 포식자를 속였다. 그것은 저 셋 모두를 죽이고는 "
"드디어 자신이 카네라를 잡아 죽였다고 생각할 것이다. 그리고 그것이 떠나면 그걸로 너희 문제는 해결된 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2f88d614-9ca4-4528-9354-3602deb3e724"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke looks at you, eyes filled with despair.{/n} \"Please, {name}, we "
"have to save them! What if we summon Kanerah... the creature will be drawn "
"to her, and we'll be able to kill it... but then... my sister... Oh Nethys, "
"I don't know, I don't know what to do!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 절망에 빠진 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"제발. {name}. 우리는 그들을 구해야 해! 카네라를 소환하면... 저 "
"괴물이 카네라를 쫓아올테고, 그 때 우리가 저놈을 죽일 수 있을지도 몰라... 하지만 그럼... 언니는... 아, 네서스시여, 나는 "
"어떻게 해야 할지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "32ef40ed-3cd7-41cf-8561-8997f4fc7776"
msgid ""
"\"Follow your heart, of course. Isn't that the sort of trite wisdom you all "
"love to repeat?\""
msgstr "\"물론 네 뜻대로 하면 된다. 언제나 그 알량한 지혜에 따라 행동해오지 않았더냐?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "faf4140e-bcad-4ce8-9d2a-d6cc06ddaff4"
msgid ""
"\"All right!\" {n}Wasting no time, Kalikke closes her eyes, using the "
"ability she gained from the Disc of the Eclipse.{/n}"
msgstr "\"좋아!\" {n}칼리케는 즉시 눈을 감고 해와 달을 삼킨 원반으로부터 얻은 능력을 사용합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4f589f63-ce4b-41ea-a6cf-01db7125e4cd"
msgid "\"All right then... let's hurry!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 그럼... 서두르자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3027ae2a-fb4a-4717-ae43-90e4acf1fe16"
msgid ""
"\"No!\" {n}Kalikke prepares to dart off, but only takes a single step.{/n}"
msgstr "\"안 돼!\" {n}칼리케는 뛰쳐나갈 준비를 했지만, 오직 한걸음만을 내딛은 채 멈춰섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "830e0f69-6e1c-444d-b9cd-bf28f502e11b"
msgid ""
"{n}The Forefather holds her in place.{/n} \"Your patron ordered you not to "
"interfere. You must learn submission, child!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}선조가 그녀를 멈춰세웠습니다.{/n} \"네 후원자가 방해하지 말라고 명령하지 않았느냐. 복종하는 법을 먼저 배워야겠구나, 어리석은 "
"것아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/SouthernWasteland/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b6bf38bb-d679-4015-9302-0c78635c922f"
msgid ""
"\"When will I be allowed to get some sleep... What's going on here? Wait... "
"what?!\""
msgstr "\"나 좀 자도록 내버려두면 안될까... 이게 무슨 일이야? 잠깐... 뭐라고?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "705f5603-8d27-40cc-9610-e1f3b9f3e24e"
msgid "\"Kalikke, calm down. Everything ended well.\""
msgstr "\"칼리케, 진정해. 모두 잘 끝났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3f55a162-17b8-4219-b333-c9af2c0806ff"
msgid "\"Kanerah is actually the one with reason to be angry.\""
msgstr "\"화내야 할 사람은 카네라라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "4cdc5e0c-5231-426f-b416-3bdf4260f148"
msgid ""
"\"The Forefather wanted to feed the Sweet Teeth to the soul eater – "
"supposedly to help you. But we interfered.\""
msgstr "\"선조가 단 것 중독자 아이들을 영혼 포식자의 먹이로 주려고 했어. 아마 너를 도우려 했겠지만, 우리가 그걸 가로막았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "dd8cc7b7-3a6a-4446-9973-133b2f43cc9c"
msgid ""
"\"You should never have gotten involved with this devil, Kanerah. He made "
"the soul eater attack the Sweet Teeth.\""
msgstr "\"카네라, 네가 데블과 얽히지 말았어야 했어. 그가 영혼 포식자가 단 것 중독자 아이들을 공격하게 했다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "054aaa91-3664-41cf-9551-ef6cad9c3c31"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing special happened. The Forefather helped save you from the soul "
"eater by feeding the Sweet Teeth to it instead.\""
msgstr "\"별일 아냐. 선조가 너를 구하겠다고 영혼 포식자한테 단 것 중독자들을 먹이로 줬어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5c67c49f-625e-4497-8a38-89a834300c52"
msgid ""
"\"We sacrificed Kalikke's friends for your safety, but it didn't make her "
"happy.\""
msgstr "\"네 안전을 위해 칼리케의 친구들을 희생시켰고, 그래서 칼리케가 슬퍼하고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "8eaedd11-a552-4c8a-9f69-887ae6ba22ed"
msgid "\"Why did you plot all this, Forefather? What's in all this for you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 모든 일을 꾸민 거지, 선조? 네가 얻게 되는 건 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f522b5b5-c4ea-4b4e-aa82-9dea93a6e2c3"
msgid ""
"Told the Forefather that he has no right to treat Kanerah and Kalikke as his "
"possessions."
msgstr "선조에게 카네라와 칼리케를 자신의 소유물인 것처럼 다룰 권리는 없다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "2ced2b5f-d713-49fc-8253-07e880013c6e"
msgid ""
"\"Your treatment of Kanerah and Kalikke as your property is unacceptable.\""
msgstr "\"카네라와 칼리케를 네 재산처럼 다루는 것은 온당치 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "6c2fa813-8e79-4950-91ef-e0394547df86"
msgid "[Attack] \"We should have gotten rid of you the first time we met!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너를 처음 만났을 때 없애버렸어야 했나보군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "51bd3c66-feaa-47a7-95e9-206a6f787e81"
msgid "\"If anyone is to blame for what's happened, it's the Forefather!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 일어난 일은 모두 선조 탓이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0064_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "70826b09-36a8-4be8-adf9-6151ee726838"
msgid ""
"Told the Forefather that you will protect Kanerah and Kalikke no matter what."
msgstr "선조에게 무슨 일이 있어도 칼리케와 카네라를 지키겠다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "91d4abe6-3b9c-49d0-bee5-8360f8b2646a"
msgid "\"Whatever it is you're planning, I'll protect Kanerah and Kalikke!\""
msgstr "\"네 계획이 무엇이던 간에, 나는 칼리케와 카네라를 보호하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0065_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "312f899c-5a0f-4ff3-abed-72aef776d5e4"
msgid ""
"Suggested that you and the Forefather could come to an agreement on "
"Kanerah's and Kalikke's fate."
msgstr "선조에게 카네라와 칼리케의 운명에 대해 당신과 합의를 볼 수 있을 것이라고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "74a1d99e-f555-42f4-9506-226c4e621e70"
msgid ""
"\"The sisters are my servants, and if anyone has a right to them, it's me! "
"However, we could come to a mutually beneficial agreement...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이들 쌍둥이는 내 부하이고, 그들에게 권리를 주장할 수 있는 자는 바로 나 뿐이다! 하지만 우리가 서로 이익이 되는 선에서 합의를 볼 "
"수도 있을 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "1a95037a-f789-4e49-888c-3856250d0d56"
msgid "\"Leave, devil. Our conversation is over.\""
msgstr "\"떠나라. 데블. 대화는 끝났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b2694eee-b76a-41f5-8d0c-87cb17145ec9"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! That crazy goat set me up AGAIN!\" {n}Kanerah seems "
"fit to burst with rage.{/n} \"She risked my life again – for those lowlife "
"simpletons! And in a fight with a beast that KILLED ME ONCE ALREADY!\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿을 수가 없어! 이 미친 염소년이 또 나를 엿먹이다니!\" {n}카네라가 분노를 삭이지 못합니다.{/n} \"이 년이 내 목숨을 "
"다시 불구덩이에 내던졌어. 그깟 멍청이들 때문에! 나를 이미 한번 죽였던 괴물과 싸우던 와중에 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e4ff2468-c676-441a-8e87-9ab524c86c4f"
msgid ""
"\"The Sweet Teeth, you are alive! I was so scared!\" {n}Kalikke steps "
"forward to embrace her friends, but then stops and turns to the Forefather, "
"clenching her fists.{/n} \"Leave us alone. Go away, now! We aren't afraid of "
"your little plots, you see?\""
msgstr ""
"\"얘들아, 이제는 괜찮아! 나도 너무 두려웠단다!\" {n}칼리케는 한 걸음을 내딛어 친구들을 안아주려다 말고, 주먹을 꽉 움켜쥔채 "
"선조를 향해 몸을 돌립니다.{/n} \"우리를 내버려두고, 당장 꺼져! 이제 네 알량한 음모 따위는 두렵지 않으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "253470c8-8da2-4080-ac0f-471692b9b8f0"
msgid ""
"\"The Sweet Teeth... no, no...\" {n}Kalikke drops to her knees, and buries "
"her face in her hands. Her shoulders are shaking with sobs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"얘들아... 안 돼...\" {n}칼리케는 무릎을 꿇고는 손으로 얼굴을 감쌉니다. 그녀의 어깨는 흐느낌으로 들썩입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki
msgctxt "39de2b06-9e18-4714-8d5e-5b12d839405c"
msgid ""
"\"Wait... so you're not Kalikke? Kanerah, you're alive? And what do you "
"mean, 'it killed you once'?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... 칼리케 누님이 아니라고? 카네라 누님, 살아있었구나? 한 번 죽였었다는 건 무슨 뜻이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "70df539c-b1f1-4135-9b4a-b693015a0ec9"
msgid ""
"\"I'll show you your Kalikke... tell her she can wipe your foolish snouts "
"for the rest of her life, if she values you more than me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 칼리케를 다시 불러주지... 그리고 그 년한테 꼭 전해. 자기 언니보다 너를 더 소중히 여길 것 같으면 앞으로는 평생 네 멍청한 "
"코나 닦아주면서 살라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f07c7f80-3a08-4b63-8ee1-b1542f1e8193"
msgid "\"The Sweet Teeth, you're alive! Praise Nethys!\""
msgstr "\"애들아, 살아남았구나! 네서스를 찬미할지어다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki
msgctxt "33f599d9-37b0-48f6-bef2-25b5e9caa1f5"
msgid "\"...Your sister was just here. She's very angry with you...\""
msgstr "\"...카네라 누님이 왔었어. 누님한테 몹시 화가 났던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b09e5612-6881-4db9-94d2-78541cbad828"
msgid ""
"\"Angry with me?! Well then you can tell her I don't have to live with blood "
"on my hands for her sake! If she hadn't made that deal with the devil, if "
"she didn't want to have everything, then this would never have happened! I "
"gave half of my life for her return... but I can't – I won't – give the "
"lives of my friends as well!\""
msgstr ""
"\"화가 났다고?! 그럼 언니 때문에 내 손에 피를 묻히며 살지는 않을거라고 전해줘! 언니가 데블과 계약을 맺지 않았더라면, 또 세상 "
"모든 걸 갖고 싶어하지 않았더라면 애초부터 이 모든 일도 일어나지 않았을거야! 나는 언니의 인생을 되찾기 위해 내 삶 절반을 바쳤어. "
"하지만 절대로 내 친구들의 목숨을 바치지는 않을거야! 절대로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho
msgctxt "a3120566-bdbb-442d-84fa-bc1a98fc5419"
msgid "\"Could someone explain to us what's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일인지 설명해주지 않을래요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1842dad9-e85c-4236-b5c0-7471cf6b6141"
msgid "\"Anyone at all?\""
msgstr "\"설명해줄 사람 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c07b450f-4f4e-4b7a-ad05-412f3de8c5fa"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, I understand – I do! There really are TWO of them! How could we have "
"missed it?!\""
msgstr "\"알았다. 알겠어! 저들은 원래가 두명이었구나! 어떻게 지금껏 모르고 있었을까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2185a444-d53d-434b-9ecd-af2ac80609d8"
msgid ""
"\"My hat's off, young lady. You and your... sister, I take it? – You're "
"quite good actresses. Or perhaps Jubilost Narthropple is just a knucklehead. "
"Not to mention the rest of our party...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 감탄했네, 아가씨. 그러니까 너랑... 쌍둥이 자매였다는 말이지? 정말 훌륭한 연기였어. 아니면 이 주빌로스트 나트로플이 "
"바보였던가. 다른 녀석들은 말할 것도 없겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b5ce0032-931b-4785-aaf4-608a31d3e121"
msgid ""
"\"No, it's hasn't.\" {n}The girl can barely hold back her tears.{/n} \"I "
"can't take it any more. I love my sister but I can't stand her cruelty. If "
"only we could just go our separate ways and never meet again. Forgive me, "
"{name}. I... I...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇지 않아.\" {n}여성은 눈물을 참지 못합니다.{/n} \"더 이상은 못 참겠어. 언니를 사랑하지만 그 잔인한 성격은 못 참아. "
"우리가 헤어져서 다시는 마주치지 않을 수만 있다면. 용서해줘. {name}. 나... 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c4d62f21-713b-448b-b932-e75943601199"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, she has reason. Does that make me feel better? No. I thought "
"something changed... that she wouldn't repeat the fight we had in Qadira, "
"that began all this insanity. And now she thinks I should have agreed to the "
"Forefather's conditions and sacrificed my friends! I can't do this any "
"more...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 카네라에게도 이유는 있지. 그렇다고 내 기분이 나아질까? 아니야. 난 언니가 바뀌었다고 생각했어... 언니와 내가 카디라에서 "
"싸웠던 게 이 모든 미친 짓거리의 시작이었잖아? 난 그런 일은 반복되지 않을 줄 알았어. 그런데 지금 언니의 생각은 뭐지? 친구들을 "
"희생해서라도 선조가 내건 조건을 지켜야했었다는 거잖아! 더 이상 이렇게는 안되겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0020_devilol_Text_String
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "bb792ee1-6436-404e-9893-f5c757f23b35"
msgid ""
"\"What plots, silly child? I only saved your sister. – Do you really not "
"give her a moment's thought?\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 수작인가, 어리석은 아이야? 나는 네 언니의 생명을 구해주었을 뿐이다. 너에게 언니는 그 정도 밖에 안되는 존재인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "48fd112d-3e16-4529-81ba-bcedc20849da"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... I almost dragged Kanerah into this bloodbath without even asking "
"her. But it was {name} who stopped me – while you seem to have been waiting "
"for a chance to push me into the abyss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아... 나는 언니한테 말 한마디도 없이 언니를 이 유혈극에 끌어들일 뻔 했어. 하지만 그 때 나를 멈춰준 건 {name}이었어. "
"나를 저 지옥의 심연으로 빠트릴 기회만 호시탐탐 노리고 있던 네가 아니라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "7d3106f5-1e2e-4c7a-bc0c-a506a9ffac5c"
msgid ""
"{n}The Sweet Teeth are lying on the ground. All three of them are dead...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}단 것 중독자 아이들은 바닥에 누워있습니다. 셋 모두 죽었습니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a5ab422c-df37-4da9-97d6-a4677e313a79"
msgid ""
"{n}Finally Kalikke stands up. Her face is pale, and she looks with rage at "
"the Forefather.{/n} \"You! You and your plots!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마침내 칼리케가 일어섭니다. 창백한 얼굴에는 분노가 가득합니다. 그녀가 선조를 매섭게 노려봅니다.{/n} \"용서하지 않겠어! 너와 "
"네가 꾸민 이 모든 일을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3e4a6f82-402a-4527-82f5-57f70d8ee051"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah raises her brow expressively, eying the scene.{/n} \"So, what did "
"I miss?\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 놀라서 눈을 치켜뜨고 그 장면을 지켜봅니다.{/n} \"대체, 내가 뭘 놓친 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2ae1ef84-18b8-4b79-9ab4-f63e09f5e7fb"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, what happened? Is it just me, or did Kalikke summon me like it's the "
"end, and we need to pay off all our debts?\""
msgstr "\"자, 어떻게 된 거지? 칼리케가 나를 소환해서 카디라에서의 일을 마무리 지으라는 것 같은데, 내 생각이 맞아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fadd6171-64dd-4c66-9de3-12cb72b85d5c"
msgid ""
"\"Really? I'm amazed that it didn't occur to Kalikke to summon me as bait "
"for the soul eater! My sister seems to be growing more mature... I'm almost "
"ready to believe she's not just a silly little fool.\"{n} Kanerah smiles and "
"seems pleased.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"정말이야? 칼리케가 나를 영혼 포식자에게 던질 미끼로 소환하지 않았다니 정말 놀라운데! 칼리케는 더 성숙해지는 거 같아... 이제 "
"칼리케가 더 이상 어리숙한 바보 멍청이는 아니라는 걸 슬슬 믿을 수도 있을 것 같아.\"{n} 미소짓는 카네라는 기분이 "
"좋아보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8ca67b83-5b8e-4dec-a1e0-7763cc053afb"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah frowns indecisively.{/n} \"My sister's silly pets, food for the "
"soul eater? She must have cried a river! How did it not occur to her to "
"summon me during the battle to save those fools? I'm... pleasantly "
"surprised. And I hope you saved the riffraff for her sake?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 어리둥절해하며 눈쌀을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"칼리케의 멍청한 애완동물들을 영혼 포식자의 먹이로 줬다고? 엄청 울었겠구나! "
"그 꼬마들을 구하려고 싸울 때 나를 소환하지 않았단 말이야? 나는... 정말 놀랐어. 기쁘기도 하고. 물론 네가 동생을 위해 그 "
"머저리들을 구해줬겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "70100887-377e-489a-97c1-ee8dc03f8988"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah frowns fretfully.{/n} \"Let me guess – and now my sister blames "
"me for everything? Tell her, when you have a chance, that I died once and "
"I'm not about to do it again. And as for her daft friends... oh well, life "
"is cruel.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 초조한듯 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"칼리케가 모든게 내 탓이라고 원망한다고? 기회가 된다면 칼리케에게 전해줘. 난 이미 "
"한번 죽었고, 다시는 죽을 생각이 없다고 말이야. 그리고 그 애의 바보 친구들은... 뭐, 인생은 원래가 잔인한 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4cff24ff-2ae9-492d-beb3-ddd2db4f0a36"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! If you let her, she'd nurse every scraggy cat and lame bird "
"that crossed her path. And it wouldn't matter who else had to suffer for it!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지! 네가 한눈만 팔았다간, 그 애는 길에서 마주치는 삐쩍 곯은 고양이나, 다리 저는 새를 전부 보살피려 할걸. 그것 때문에 "
"힘든 사람은 상관도 않고 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "74e9fbbc-2731-4912-8787-912f7629ac86"
msgid ""
"\"My poor child. I don't know how something so foolish could have descended "
"from my blood. I wish to see you grow up, lose your childhood fantasies and "
"weaknesses. This will be easier, once I spare you of the strictures imposed "
"by a certain divine force...\""
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍한 아이로구나. 내 핏줄에서 어떻게 이런 멍청한 녀석이 나왔는지 모르겠다. 나는 네가 성장하여 어린아이 같은 망상과 나약함을 "
"버리는 것을 보고 싶은 것이다. 신격의 권능이 너에게 걸어놓은 제약을 내가 해제하기만 하면 훨씬 쉬워질 것이고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2f53d4c3-3cff-4441-9779-dd0a9baa1343"
msgid "\"So that's why... that's why you set all this up!\""
msgstr "\"그래서였어... 그래서 네가 이 모든 일을 꾸민 거였구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "63802d40-5445-4ce0-aecd-28da9ea2d834"
msgid "\"We are not your property.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 네 재산이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "2e57d1b9-9a68-4e93-8067-5898c9fa0e75"
msgid ""
"\"To secure a valuable investment, of course. The mindless monster from "
"Abaddon, in hunting Kanerah, was standing in my way – and I had to get rid "
"of it. But there's more, of course – what kind of a devil makes plans "
"without some sinister ulterier motive? I cannot hope to oppose Nethys, who "
"has taken my girls under his wing. But I can drive them to break the god's "
"conditions, and thus lose his patronage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 귀중한 자산을 지키기 위해서였다. 지성도 없는 저 나락의 괴물은 카네라를 쫓아다닌답시고 내 길을 가로막고 있었다. 나는 녀석을 "
"제거해야 했다. 하지만 말이다, 데블이 계획을 꾸밀 때에는 당연히 사악한 숨은 의도가 있지 않겠느냐? 내 딸들은 네서스의 보호 하에 "
"있었고, 난 감히 신격에 대항할 생각은 없다. 하지만 아이들이 신과의 약속을 어기도록 사주해서 신의 후원을 철회시킬 수는 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "24b0d3e1-916b-4b8b-9f01-35430e5942c7"
msgid ""
"\"And I have succeeded. First, I lured them to these lands with the Disk of "
"the Eclipse. Then I made them reveal themselves to everyone present — "
"Kalikke just couldn't stay and watch her precious Sweet Teeth die, could "
"she? To protect them she only needed to bring Kanerah — right before "
"everyone's eyes! In any case, their vow of secrecy has been broken. Now we "
"only need deal with the second condition – and then I may receive what's "
"been taken from me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 나는 성공했다. 우선 나는 그들에게 해와 달을 삼킨 원반의 정보를 주어 이 땅으로 유인했다. 그리고 그들이 이 자리에 있는 "
"모두에게 모습을 드러내게 했지. 칼리케는 자신의 소중한 단 것 중독자 친구들을 죽도록 내버려둘 수 없었고, 그들을 구하기 위해 모두의 "
"눈앞에서 카네라를 소환하고 말았다! 어떤 관점으로 보아도 비밀의 서약은 확실히 파기되었고, 이제 남은 것은 두번째 조건 뿐이다. 이제 곧 "
"빼앗겼던 나의 재산을 되찾을 수 있을 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "ba828305-5d07-4e6f-9ca5-9ec94160798b"
msgid ""
"\"You can try – but your challenge of combat will have to wait until our "
"next meeting. I have accomplished everything I intended. Now I shall wait. – "
"A new turn is coming!\""
msgstr ""
"\"덤벼 볼 수도 있겠지. 하지만 네 도전은 우리가 다음번 만날 때까지 미뤄두도록 하여라. 나는 오늘 모든 목포를 달성했다. 이제 나는 "
"기다릴 것이다. 새 전환점이 임박했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "104353bd-3dd0-416c-a522-e9b5756c1b9f"
msgid ""
"\"In your case, the matter must still be discussed. But in Kanerah's case, "
"the situation is quite clear. She made a contract with me for a lifetime of "
"service, and she's the only one who thinks a formal death followed by a "
"resurrection can spare her from her contract. But in any case – it's not up "
"to you to decide your fate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 문제는 좀 복잡하지만, 네 언니는 아니다. 매우 명백하지. 그녀는 나와의 계약을 통해 평생 동안의 봉사를 약속했고, 형식상으로만 "
"죽은 다음 막바로 부활한 것으로는 그 계약에서 면책될 수 없다. 그건 오로지 네 언니의 멍청한 생각일 뿐이지. 하지만 분명한 건, 네 "
"운명을 결정하는 것은 네가 아니라는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "86ac4617-a0d6-471d-9953-085d1d740d11"
msgid ""
"{n}The surviving Sweet Teeth are clinging to each other, hesitating to come "
"close.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}살아남은 단 것 중독자 아이들은 서로 바짝 붙어서서, 당신에게 다가오기를 주저하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "3938459a-c1e8-4449-8742-57eae047db60"
msgid ""
"{n}The only surviving Sweet Tooth is wandering nearby, baffled, hesitating "
"to come close.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}유일하게 살아남은 단 것 중독자 아이는 넋이 나간듯 주변을 배회하면서, 당신에게 다가오기를 주저하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f1848dfd-1993-45f0-9fb3-8e58aaec975e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke grows even more pale.{/n} \"You are right in a way. Kanerah is "
"unlikely to blame you for this evil. Why... why did everything have to "
"happen this way... Kanerah died because of me, and now my friends have "
"suffered because of her decision to get involved with you! I can't carry "
"this burden any more... I'd rather just fall asleep and never wake up!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케의 얼굴이 더욱 창백해집니다.{/n} \"어떤 면에서는 네가 맞을 수도. 이런 악행을 저질렀다고 칼리케가 너를 비난하지는 "
"않을거야. 왜... 왜 항상 일은 이렇게 되고 마는 걸까... 카네라는 나 때문에 죽었었고, 이제 내 친구들은 너를 끼어들게 한 언니의 "
"결정 때문에 고통받았어! 나는 더 이상 이런 짐을 지고 살 수는 없어... 차라리 이대로 잠들어서 다시는 깨어나지 않았으면 좋겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "0d2256a1-6d4b-4aec-ad24-65b6a6e38dad"
msgid "\"You sound so confident... but what does Kanerah think of this?\""
msgstr "\"꽤나 자랑스러워 하는구나... 하지만 카네라는 이걸 어떻게 생각하고 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7a8acad9-6276-43c2-9d71-2a3b13692d9d"
msgid "{n}A shadow of doubt runs over the girl's face.{/n} \"Let's ask her!\""
msgstr "{n}의심의 그림자가 그녀의 얼굴에 드리워집니다.{/n} \"그녀에게 물어 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "afbcb19b-1e55-446e-a20a-d51fee60fe6c"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, he arranged all this, but he's not the main reason. I can't do this "
"any more... I can't look the other way while Kanerah is indifferent to the "
"lives of others, and my own feelings. I gave her half of everything that I'd "
"ever have – all for her. But I cannot sacrifice those who depend on me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그가 이 모든걸 꾸몄지. 하지만 그가 이 일의 원인은 아니야. 나는 더 이상은 견딜 수 없어... 카네라가 다른 이들의 "
"생명도, 내 기분도 신경쓰지 않는 걸 이해해보려고 애써봤지만, 더 이상은 안돼. 난 내 생명의 절반을 언니를 위해 바쳤어. 하지만 나를 "
"의지하는 아이들까지 언니를 위해 희생시킬 수는 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "158c75f3-a3eb-4f3b-898a-7a2c8affb0cc"
msgid ""
"\"That's my girl! I'm glad to see such practicality in my offspring. And I "
"will be even happier when I've spare you of the strictures imposed upon you "
"by a certain divine power...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래야 내 딸답지! 네가 이렇게 실질을 중시하는 아이라니 기쁜 일이다. 이제 너를 저 신성한 힘이 걸어놓은 구속에서 구해낼 수만 "
"있다면 더 기쁠 것 같구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a48a5b8d-5259-4048-9234-76c85117bd61"
msgid ""
"\"If you are talking about our contract, it's over. I only had to serve you "
"until I died. And I did. – This conversation is over. Let's play by the "
"rules, Forefather.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 계약을 말하는 거라면 그건 끝났어. 나는 죽을 때까지만 너를 섬기게 되어있었고, 난 죽음으로써 계약에서 자유로워졌다. 이제 "
"대화는 끝이야. 규칙을 따르시지, 선조.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "89df1f85-ddf5-47ba-9377-74de86ff470b"
msgid ""
"{n}A quick succession of thoughts flash behind Kanerah's eyes.{/n} \"So "
"that's what this was all about...\""
msgstr "{n}반짝이는 눈빛 뒤로, 카네라가 재빨리 머리를 굴리는 것이 느껴집니다.{/n} \"그래서 이렇게 된 거로구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "3816aefa-6043-4c04-a35f-d036b095608c"
msgid ""
"\"Obviously. It would be madness – and short-sighted – to argue with a "
"herald of Nethys himself.\" {n}You hear a chuckle from under the iron "
"mask.{/n} \"But it would be pathetic to do nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"분명히, 네서스의 전령 본인과 말다툼을 벌이는 건 정신나간 단견일테지.\" {n}당신은 철가면 아래에서 킬킬거리는 비웃음소리를 "
"듣습니다.{/n} \"하지만 손을 놓고 아무것도 하지 않는 것도 비참한 신세이긴 마찬가지다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "ced92a55-8494-41a1-9efd-8adb4f16f9e4"
msgid ""
"\"You see, girl – and you, {name} – my offspring is a valuable investment in "
"this world, and I wish to secure my interests. For ages I've reaped souls as "
"a sickle reaps grain, turning even the most loyal followers from their "
"service to the 'almighty' gods. And I imagine that all-seeing Nethys decided "
"to make a joke of me, by taking the two souls that are mine by right. But "
"everything will work out just fine. – Soon enough, I will reclaim what's "
"been taken from me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보거라, 내 딸. 그리고 너 {name}도. 나에게 있어 자손이란 이 세계에 대한 값진 투자이고, 나는 내 이익을 지켜낼 것이다. "
"아주 오랫동안 나는 낫으로 곡식을 추수하듯, 전능한 신들의 가장 충성스러운 추종자들조차도 신앙을 저버리게 만들고 그 영혼을 수확했느니라. "
"그런데 모든 것을 꿰뚫어보는 네서스는 나에게 속한 영혼 둘을 빼앗아 나를 웃음거리로 만들었구나. 하지만 모든 것이 잘 되어가고 있다. 곧 "
"나는 빼앗긴 두 영혼을 되찾을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "ea394108-7c8b-469e-932d-ca7ab931bcab"
msgid ""
"\"Do not anger me, child. You are not dead, which means that your service "
"and our contract are still binding. I am here to complete certain "
"formalities and correct any misinterpretations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 화나게 하지 마라. 너는 죽지 않았고 네 의무와 우리 계약은 여전히 유효하다. 나는 형식적인 절차를 마무리짓고, 오해를 바로 "
"잡으러 온 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "da5b17e3-822e-4120-bbc3-d86e637c5af4"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, but I began their story, and I will be the one to finish it. "
"Just you wait. Soon enough I will take another turn in this game…\""
msgstr ""
"\"유감이지만 나로부터 그들의 이야기가 시작되었으니, 그것을 끝내는 것도 내가 될 것이다. 기다리도록 하여라. 곧 이 게임에서 내 차례가 "
"다시 돌아올 것이니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "b28fdeaf-9b2c-4780-99d9-d056aadcfad1"
msgid ""
"\"I admire your approach, but there are too many interested parties in this "
"deal already. Take my advice – when the time comes, do not interfere. It is "
"best to keep clear of games between greater forces!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 접근 방식은 존중하겠지만, 이미 이 일에는 이해당사자가 너무 많다. 내 조언은 이러하다. 제 때가 된 일을 방해하려 들지 말아라. "
"강대한 존재들의 게임에 약자는 끼어들지 않는 것이 현명한 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "2c2512dc-6f61-4d3b-a463-197b20d878d0"
msgid ""
"\"Of course you're welcome to try. But I don't recommend meddling in games "
"of devils and gods. I've made my move – and now I shall wait. Soon enough, "
"the game will continue...\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 시도하는 것은 너의 자유다. 하지만 데블과 신의 게임에 훈수를 두지는 마라. 난 지금 내 수를 두었고, 이제 기다릴 차례다. 이 "
"게임은 계속 진행될 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "4c845235-b5d5-47ce-946a-4ded9c9c1d75"
msgid ""
"\"An amazing agreement, and in a way, a reconciliation. I expected a more "
"emotional reaction. But it doesn't matter. What does matter is that my "
"little play was a success. I hope it will help spare my darling girls from "
"the strictures imposed on them by their divine patron...\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼마나 놀라운 협정이고 또 화해인가. 나는 좀 더 감정적인 반응을 기대했었다만, 이제 상관 없다. 내 작은 연극이 성공했다는 것이 "
"중요하니까. 내 사랑스러운 딸들이 네서스와 그 하수인들이 걸어놓은 제약에서 풀려나는데 도움이 되기를 바랄 뿐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/TwinsQuarrel/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_Q2
msgctxt "1144074f-f990-49c4-ae5e-fd58409427f3"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. We "
"will meet again.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 원하시는 대로. 우리는 다시 만날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "647dfcf4-cee9-4b8d-ae71-dbf08dcf800d"
msgid "Attacked the Forefather, the devil."
msgstr "데블 선조를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a110e59a-4199-4676-a12e-5b84697acfb7"
msgid ""
"\"Guards, to arms! If you think I'm going to give you audience, hellspawn, "
"you are mistaken!\""
msgstr "\"공격 준비! 이 지옥의 종자야! 우리가 순순히 네 말을 들어줄거라고 생각했다면 그건 네 착각일 뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a3f3b751-b8f3-4213-8159-49c8685e038e"
msgid "\"In the name of Asmodeus, our lord, I welcome you!\""
msgstr "\"주인이시여, 아스모데우스의 이름으로 당신을 환영하나이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f680531a-f6f1-454c-aee9-1b0b64e3d2e1"
msgid "\"Right! Now there are devils roaming about my capital...\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 이제 내 수도에 데블들이 돌아다니겠군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3a5f9ee8-6b5c-4612-88f2-6882f05ea43f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I know too well what talking to devils leads to.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"데블과 말을 섞으면 어떤 꼴이 나는지는 충분히 잘 알고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1b4bd13f-b6f3-4b3f-8aeb-449fca7f46d5"
msgid "\"Fine, speak. But don't think you can trick me.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 말해. 하지만 나를 속일 생각 하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "173c9de4-4f20-406c-9728-9ebda558f6f5"
msgid "\"What brings you here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "05d3274a-9802-48c8-924f-1edd051455bd"
msgid "\"What is your interest in Kanerah and Kalikke?\""
msgstr "\"카네라와 칼리케에게 왜 관심을 보이는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "ca459347-9bc0-4a25-b45c-1804650a5faf"
msgid "\"What do you suggest?\""
msgstr "\"무얼 제안할 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "f5ed3d6b-09e8-49f7-940b-d40e3c8f86b9"
msgid "\"Thanks for the warning, now get out.\""
msgstr "\"경고해줘서 고맙다. 이제 가버리라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "9b343886-5f2a-449f-8c10-754a309c81f6"
msgid ""
"\"What's so special about this soul eater? I've killed worse beasts before.\""
msgstr "\"영혼 포식자가 뭐 대단할 거라도 있나? 나는 그보다 더 강한 괴물들도 여럿 죽였었는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "a9709b73-0e89-4113-98ec-7c0feab98cfb"
msgid "\"Fine. I will come to the agreed place.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 약속 장소로 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e47cbbdf-ba60-4266-8ff5-9ed5fd082bd0"
msgid "[Attack] \"You didn't give me any reason not to kill you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너를 죽이지 않을 이유가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "23f098d8-763a-4674-b109-03c98d73442e"
msgid "\"I decline your proposal. This audience is over.\""
msgstr "\"네 제안을 거절한다. 대화는 끝이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d2771069-861f-49e7-86fa-9da1e45476ba"
msgid ""
"{n}A dismal silence hangs in the hall, as the figure of a new visitor "
"appears at the door. He's taller than anyone else present, and seems to be "
"made of subtle folds and sharp angles, from his metal mask to his scarlet "
"cape. And he literally reeks of evil – cold, calculating, unrelenting...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}새로운 방문자가 문 앞에 나타나자 음침한 침묵이 방 안을 잠식합니다. 그는 그곳의 누구보다도 키가 컸고, 철가면과 진홍빛 케이프를 "
"뒤집어 쓴 모습은 마치 미묘한 주름과 날카로운 각을 재료로 빚어낸 듯 합니다. 그리고 그는 말 그대로 악의 증기를 온 몸으로 내뿜고 "
"있습니다. 냉혹하고, 계산적이고, 가차없는...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f76637b0-d7bd-4521-8e0e-1e9aee116de1"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings to the ruler of this land,\" {n} an expressive male voice "
"carries across the hall. The visitor bows politely.{/n} \"I've come from "
"afar to discuss a matter of considerable importance, and I hope for a... "
"civilized conversation. Let me introduce myself. I am called the Forefather, "
"and I serve the illustrious Queen Mahathallah. I am a devil.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅의 통치자에게 인사를 전하겠다.\" {n} 호소력 있는 목소리가 방 안에 퍼집니다. 방문자는 머리숙여 공손히 인사합니다.{/n} "
"\"나는 중요한 문제를 논의하고자 아주 먼 곳에서 왔다. 가급적... 평화로운 대화였으면 좋겠군. 내 소개를 하지. 나는 선조라고 불리는 "
"자로, 환영의 여왕 마하탈라를 섬기고 있다. 나는 데블이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "fc9693ab-c1ba-4b3f-a819-b14d38c2ecdc"
msgid ""
"{n}The devil doesn't move, paying no attention to the guards' bared "
"swords.{/n} \"I wish to warn you against an unforgivable mistake. If you "
"take out your righteous anger out on this 'hellspawn', then you will doom to "
"death an innocent soul – or a few. Now, will you let me speak?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}데블은 경비병이 빼든 칼날에는 눈길 한 번 주지 않고 가만히 서있습니다.{/n} \"용서받지 못할 실수를 저지르지 말라고 경고하고 "
"싶군. 너희가 그 고결한 분노를 지옥의 존재인 이 몸에게 쏟았다가는, 너희 손으로 다른 죄없는 영혼, 아니, 영혼들에게 사형 선고를 "
"내리는 격이 될 것이다. 이제 내가 얘기해도 되겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "4a6fc499-4099-43b3-ac67-0a2dabd003cb"
msgid ""
"\"You have the courage to disregard reason for principles. Will you also "
"have the courage to take responsibility, when innocent blood flows because "
"of what you've done?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그따위 명분 때문에 합당한 이유를 무시하다니 용기가 가상하구나. 하지만 네가 한 짓 때문에 이 땅에 죄 없는 자들의 피가 흐르게 될 "
"때, 그 책임을 질 용기도 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ac0fc0ee-83de-4fce-af2c-561f0fd9fd1e"
msgid ""
"{n}The devil lowers his head.{/n} \"Very well. I've always believed that "
"order and civility make it possible, even for those whose moral views are as "
"different as yours and mine, to reach agreement. And this is why I am here, "
"paying you an official visit.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}데블은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"좋다. 난 질서와 예의만 지킨다면, 너와 나처럼 도덕에 대한 관점이 다른 이들끼리도 얼마든지 "
"의견의 일치를 볼 수 있다고 생각했다. 그래서 이렇게 공식적으로 알현을 청하여 이곳을 방문한 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "2b9f3cdb-0790-4aa6-8f28-69652b6e401a"
msgid ""
"\"In the name of order that will someday triumph, I accept your greeting. "
"May your rule be prosperous!\""
msgstr "\"언젠가는 반드시 승리할 질서의 이름으로, 너의 인사를 받아들이지. 그대의 통치 하에 이곳이 늘 번영하기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "11f443ec-dec2-474b-a02b-b54f58299546"
msgid ""
"{n}The devil makes a few gestures and says something indistinguishable. Both "
"he and you seem to be enclosed in an invisible ring. – The outside world "
"shines through dimly, its sounds are barely audible.{/n} \"A modest "
"precaution. Others should not hear what I have to say. I have news of "
"someone you know, young Kanerah and Kalikke. One of them is in great danger –"
" and they both share a single fate. They must have told you by now of the "
"soul eater who killed Kanerah. I should imagine that by disclosing their "
"secret and true names to you, the poor children deprived Kanerah of "
"protection from this deadly foe. The soul eater has picked up her scent, and "
"will soon be here. You will need my help to deal with it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}데블은 가볍게 손짓하며 무언가 알아들을 수 없는 말을 되뇌입니다. 그와 당신, 둘만이 보이지 않는 고리 안에 갇힌 것 같습니다. "
"고리 밖의 세계는 희미하게 비쳐보일 뿐이고, 소리도 들리지 않습니다.{/n} \"한 가지만 경고하지. 이 곳의 다른 자들은 내가 하는 "
"이야기를 듣지 못한다. 너도 알고 있는, 젊은 카네라와 칼리케 자매에 대한 소식이다. 그들 중 하나가 큰 위험에 처했고, 둘의 운명은 "
"결국 하나이다. 그들은 지금쯤 너에게 카네라를 죽인 영혼 포식자에 대해 말했을 것이다. 자신들의 비밀과 진짜 이름을 너에게 밝힘으로써, "
"이 불쌍한 아이들은 카네라를 불구대천의 적, 영혼 포식자에게도 노출시키고 만 것 같다. 영혼 포식자는 이미 그녀의 냄새를 맡았고, "
"머지않아 이곳에 나타날 것이다. 그것을 처치하려면 나의 도움이 필요할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "baedb557-2552-4a5c-a9ef-a92c525a785d"
msgid ""
"\"My interest in these lost children is special. I would even say – "
"familial... It's my blood that runs in their veins. A long, long time ago, I "
"gave a night of passion to a young follower of Mahathallah's cult. Her soul "
"has writhed in agony in the flames of Hell for many ages, and yet I still "
"feel a vague joy when I see the offspring of our alliance walking the sunlit "
"lands of Qadira. I am their Forefather – and not only by name...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 아이들에 대한 내 관심은 특별한 것이다. 가족적... 이라고도 할 수 있겠지. 그들의 혈관에는 나의 피가 흐른다. 아주 오래 전 "
"나는 마하탈라를 숭배하는 이교 집단의 한 어린 추종자와 뜨거운 밤을 보냈다. 그녀의 영혼은 수백년 동안 지옥의 불꽃에 고통받고 있지만, "
"우리 결합의 결과로 태어난 자식들이 햇빛으로 충만한 카디라의 대지를 걸어다니는 모습을 보면 여전히 희미한 기쁨을 느끼지. 나는 선조이며, "
"실제로 그들의 선조이기도 하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "0f845333-96e6-4a50-8588-cfd4d1c292f2"
msgid ""
"\"How can you be sure of that? Disguise can do wonders.\" {n}You hear a "
"chuckle from under the mask, but then the devil regains his polite and "
"formal tone.{/n} \"I realize that guests like me are somewhat exotic. This "
"is why I chose to come forward boldly in the light of day, as any honest "
"visitor should, to the lands of a lawful ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 확신할 수 있냐고? 변장에는 불가사의한 능력이 있다네.\" {n}당신은 가면 속에서 킬킬거리는 웃음 소리를 들었지만, 데블은 "
"금방 원래의 예의바르고 점잖은 말투를 되찾습니다.{/n} \"나 같은 손님은 꽤나 이목을 끄는 존재라는 걸 깨달았다. 그래서 나는 "
"통치자를 방문하고자 하는 정직한 이라면 응당 그러하듯, 백주 대낮에 당당히 찾아오기로 한 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "26b72855-d567-4a90-b938-c1cc44bda928"
msgid ""
"\"I came simply to pay my regards to a lawful ruler. It is my manner to "
"conduct myself in this way.\""
msgstr "\"나는 단지 이 땅의 적법한 통치자에게 공경을 표하고자 했을 뿐이다. 나 나름의 행동 원칙이라고 해 두지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "d002af99-2c27-4f3a-a741-eb1b48bac6c1"
msgid ""
"\"I can lure the soul eater to appear at the right time and place. I even "
"know a way to be rid of it once and for all, without any fuss. If you are "
"willing, then come with Kalikke to the barrens at the Southern border of the "
"Kamelands. It must be Kalikke. – We cannot risk her sister being found. We "
"will meet there, and resolve the matter once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 영혼 포식자를 유인해 원하는 시간과 장소에 나타나게 할 수 있다. 또한 그 놈을 영원히 없애는 손쉬운 방법도 알고 있지. 네가 "
"원한다면 칼리케와 함께 케임랜드와 접한 남부 국경지대의 황야로 와라. 반드시 칼리케여야 한다. 카네라를 들켜서는 안되니까. 거기서 만나 "
"이 문제를 완전히 해결해버리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "0f848402-f443-48ed-a5ba-ae53c6e61215"
msgid ""
"\"This soul eater is more ancient, and far stronger and more evil than any "
"others like it. It knows Kanerah's name, and will follow her relentlessly. "
"If you refuse my help, both you and the girls will have to remain on close "
"guard day and night, waiting for it to appear, to attack... and believe me,\""
"{n} the devil seems to chuckle,{/n} \"... even so, you will not be prepared "
"when it strikes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영혼 포식자는 비슷한 종류의 고대 괴물들 중에서도 특별히 더 오래되고, 더 강력하며, 더 사악한 놈이다. 카네라의 이름을 알고 있는 "
"한, 그 놈은 그녀를 끈질기게 추적할 것이다. 내 도움을 거절한다면 너와 자매들은 밤낮없이, 경계를 늦추지도 못한 채 그 놈이 나타나 "
"공격하기만을 기다리고 있어야 할 것이다... 그리고 내가 확언하건대...\"{n} 데블은 킬킬거리고 있는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"그 "
"정도로도 절대 그 놈의 공격에 대비할 수 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "fe64f749-c472-432d-aac1-e36f5a050921"
msgid ""
"{n}The devil makes another half-bow.{/n} \"I enjoy dealing with reasonable "
"and civilized mortals. So long!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}데블은 다시 반쯤 허리를 숙여 인사합니다.{/n} \"합리적이고도 문명화된 필멸자와 이야기 나눌 수 있어 즐거웠다. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "e41dc035-e9a1-4bbc-833f-8f2a0f0e373e"
msgid ""
"{n}The devil bows again.{/n} \"Do not refuse my help, if you care about the "
"girls' lives. For now – farewell. I must excuse myself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}데블은 다시 인사합니다.{/n} \"그 아이들을 살리고 싶다면 내 도움을 거절하지 말기를 바란다. 지금은 작별이다. 가 봐야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q2_OnPrinciple/ktc_DevilAudience/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "60f5fa2b-9166-4f4c-bc2a-3206f18bd346"
msgid ""
"\"Most unreasonable... you will regret this, when the blood of innocents "
"stains your hands. You have been warned!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사리분별을 못하는 자로군... 죄 없는 자들의 피로 네 손이 물들게 될 때, 오늘의 결정을 후회할 것이다. 분명히 경고했노라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/Barks/Mercenary_magic_bark_String
msgctxt "50dcf0aa-e34c-475a-9a0c-9622a7f286a4"
msgid "\"What's this madness going on with magic here?\""
msgstr "\"도대체 이 광기는 뭐지? 무슨 마법의 소행인거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/Barks/Octavia_magic_bark_String
msgctxt "68b67f81-06d7-4530-bb62-a896c8e5553b"
msgid ""
"\"Do you feel that? There's something going on with magic! And the tower – "
"what happened to it?\""
msgstr "\"느껴져? 무언가 마법적인게 일어나고 있는 것 같아! 탑에도! 대체 무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/Barks/Regongar_magic_bark_String
msgctxt "18bd78c7-f74e-4400-a412-68f323ac1d9e"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, something very powerful went wild here, it seems. I can feel the "
"aim trembling with power! And the tower has been smashed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하. 무언가 강력한 힘이 여기를 쓸고 지나간 것 같아. 강력한 힘으로 요동치는 의지가 느껴져! 그래서 탑이 파괴된 것이로군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilAtHub/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_CityGatesHub
msgctxt "348c4754-ceb1-4ee1-bbf2-b6841e0c147b"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings. Well, my darlings. You've broken your divine patron's second "
"condition, just as I foretold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다들 반갑군. 그래, 내 딸들아. 내가 예언했던 대로 너희는 방금 너희의 신격 후원자가 내걸었던 두번째 조건을 위반하고 말았구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilAtHub/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f61f298e-ac76-428b-a2ab-6648ac6a9b46"
msgid ""
"\"So you knew what was going to happen to us at the House at the Edge of "
"Time?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 넌 시간의 끝에 선 집에서 우리에게 어떤 일이 일어날 지 알고 있었던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilAtHub/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_CityGatesHub
msgctxt "524b7bca-e59a-40e6-9224-fd96cf9831b6"
msgid ""
"\"I surmised. I led you by the hand through all your adventures in the "
"Stolen Lands. I brought you to the Disk of the Eclipse. I made sure you "
"arrived at just the right place, where the magic of the First World would "
"rid you of the divine curse you've suffered, so you may reunite. Aren't "
"progenitors supposed to look after their offspring? And I am a very caring "
"ancestor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"짐작은 했다. 나는 도둑맞은 땅에서의 너희 모험 전부를 직접 인도했다. 너희가 해와 달을 삼킨 원반을 찾아오도록 이끈 것도 나다. "
"나는 너희가 올바른 때에 올바른 장소, 즉 태초 세계의 마법이 너희들을 괴롭히던 신성한 저주를 없앨 수 있는 곳에 당도하도록 조치했다. "
"너희가 다시 만날 수 있도록 말이다. 조상이라면 응당 자손을 돌보지 않겠느냐? 게다가 나는 특히 더 자손을 아끼는 조상이니라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilAtHub/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "c0d69af0-a377-421b-a9bd-dded39f495ff"
msgid ""
"\"And now, if you'll excuse me, Your Highness. It was a pleasure dealing "
"with you, but there are greater forces than you at work here, and it's time "
"they resolve their differences!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이제는 귀하에게 양해를 구해야겠군. 너와 상대하는 것도 즐거웠지만, 이제 너보다 훨씬 강대한 존재들이 등장할 차례다. 드디어 "
"그간의 견해 차이를 해소할 시간이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilAtHub/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "d2d08843-aef2-4c07-b4c4-c8423c1259dc"
msgid ""
"\"And now, if you'll excuse me.\" {n}You hear undisguised mockery in the "
"devil's voice.{/n} \"I'll leave you to your destroyed kingdom, and the "
"insane fey lord who has seized it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러면 이제, 나는 먼저 실례하겠다.\" {n}데블은 이제 말투에서 비웃음을 숨기지 않습니다.{/n} \"너는 너의 왕국으로 "
"돌아가라. 정신나간 페이 군주의 손에 곧 무너지고 말 왕국으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilAtHub/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_CityGatesHub
msgctxt "e344f826-62f7-4fd0-8b81-aa47bf0d42cf"
msgid ""
"{n}You catch Kalikke's scream and Kanerah's angry hiss. As the portal "
"closes, you discern the familiar silhouette of the ruined Taldan tower, "
"rising above Sorrowflow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 칼리케의 비명과, 카네라가 분노에 차 쉿쉿거리는 소리를 얼핏 들었습니다. 포탈이 닫히자, 슬픔의 폭포 위로 솟은 탑의 친숙한 "
"실루엣이 눈에 들어옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4bac72af-c8ad-4e3d-9457-5a27f679cd62"
msgid "\"Herald of All-Seeing Nethys, I welcome you!\""
msgstr "\"모든 것을 꿰뚫어 보시는 네서스의 사자여, 당신을 환영하나이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cff37d95-a828-42ef-a5b4-2f130840cd89"
msgid "\"Oh, another higher power visiting my kingdom!\""
msgstr "\"아, 내 왕국에 또다른 강력한 권능이 방문하다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "a47599e9-f084-4d26-a548-6f03769bcdd1"
msgid "\"I've come for Kanerah and Kalikke.\""
msgstr "\"나는 카네라와 칼리케를 찾으러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b6c34513-ab05-4740-9472-1e3998ee0b2b"
msgid "\"If there's no other choice, then let Kalikke go with you.\""
msgstr "\"선택의 여지가 없다면, 칼리케와 함께 가도록 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "7fd864ff-acb2-4adf-bb81-76652d9646aa"
msgid "\"Auferon?..\""
msgstr "\"오페론?..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "776c0fac-fee9-4d63-a8f8-a88c6db32830"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, Herald. What did your compact with Kanerah and Kalikke mean, in that "
"case?\""
msgstr "\"기다리시오, 전령이여. 그렇다면 카네라, 칼리케와 맺었던 계약은 이런 경우에는 무슨 의미가 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "9fadc456-9b2a-497d-a2c6-59fc7e9bde35"
msgid ""
"\"You doomed them to a life of exile, torn apart. Is this what you call help?"
"\""
msgstr "\"당신이 그들을 서로 만나지 못하도록 갈라놓고는 추방자의 삶으로 내몰았소. 이러고도 지금 그들을 도왔다고 하는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3146dde6-4d14-477d-ab04-67a3e6dced7d"
msgid "Told Kanerah that you will never risk the lives of innocents."
msgstr "카네라에게 당신은 절대 죄 없는 이의 생명을 위험에 빠트리지 않겠다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "d21bae19-d0f2-4533-80eb-519abdd6b9f2"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, Kanerah, but I do not regret my decision. I couldn't let the "
"innocent die.\""
msgstr "\"용서해. 카네라. 하지만 내 결정을 후회하지 않아. 무고한 이들을 죽게 내버려둘 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0037_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "25f126de-7d17-4abe-9ae8-d9bcc8edd089"
msgid "Told Kalikke that you don't regret sacrificing her friends."
msgstr "칼리케에게 당신은 그녀의 친구들을 희생시킨 것을 후회하지 않는다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "145d7862-7681-4ad0-8ee8-5147e8c78d4e"
msgid ""
"\"Think whatever you want, Kalikke, but I don't regret my decision. "
"Kanerah's life is more precious to me than the lives of your friends.\""
msgstr "\"네 마음대로 생각해, 칼리케. 하지만 난 내 결정을 후회하지 않아. 나에게는 카네라의 생명이 네 친구들보다 소중해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "34e6954e-12fc-4dfe-84bd-87bb80d46ba4"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever decision I made back then, when facing the soul eater, I won't "
"allow you to take either of these sisters, Forefather.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영혼 포식자를 상대했던 그 때 내가 어떤 결정을 내렸었든 상관 없어. 나는 절대로 네가 티플링 쌍둥이를 데려가도록 내버려두지 않을 "
"것이다, 선조.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b2bfb94c-16e7-4844-93d1-6d61bd5b45bb"
msgid "Told Kalikke that her kindness is foolish."
msgstr "칼리케에게 그녀의 친절함은 멍청하다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "ec2dcf0d-6e29-4190-b7f7-ba18fee26f8f"
msgid ""
"[Talk to Kalikke] \"Sometimes heart and its noble impulses are not our best "
"advisors. Think about it, Kalikke. Think what's more important to you – your "
"sister or your so-called kindness.\""
msgstr ""
"[칼리케에게 말합니다] \"심장과 그 고결한 박동이 시키는 대로 하는 게 늘 옳은 일은 아닐 수도 있어. 생각해 봐, 뭐가 너에게 더 "
"중요한 건지. 너희 언니와 너의 그 친절함 중에서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "01144a99-83d8-41f3-b8d2-81aad9ac4362"
msgid ""
"Told Kanerah that she should be kinder and more thoughtful for her sister."
msgstr "카네라에게 그녀는 칼리케에게 더 많은 친절과 배려를 베풀어야 한다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "facc1c08-8022-4114-8e2c-8811e9b932c8"
msgid ""
"[Reason with Kanerah] \"Shrewdness is not the best tool when it comes to "
"dealing with your loved ones. Think about it, Kanerah. And learn to "
"understand and accept your sister's feelings.\""
msgstr ""
"[카네라를 설득합니다] \"사랑하는 사람을 대할 때에는 똑똑하게 구는 게 능사가 아니야. 한번 생각해봐, 카네라. 동생의 감정을 이해하고 "
"받아들이는 법도 배울 필요가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "03c7bbef-972a-4ddd-b720-7982c16e36bb"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I've no wish to prove anything to anyone, but I will defeat you, "
"Forefather, and our problems will be solved.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 무언가를 증명하려고 이러는게 아니야. 하지만 선조, 너를 쓰러트리고 우리의 문제를 해결하고 말겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "7d6e31f8-b721-4441-85c2-b5cef2528801"
msgid ""
"\"There are more important matters before me than dealing with the likes of "
"you, devil. But don't even think about returning to my kingdom!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나에게는 너 같은 데블을 상대하는 것보다 더 중요한 일이 얼마든지 있다. 하지만 다시는 내 왕국으로 돌아올 생각조차 품지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0067_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "33b3178a-5125-4730-8ea0-59e1c372c399"
msgid "Made the Forefather pay for his evil plot."
msgstr "선조에게 그가 꾸민 사악한 음모의 대가를 치르게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "df47e50a-3496-4d0e-915a-930cde55d400"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I fell for your trickery once, and let you leave without a fight. "
"I won't make the same mistake again!\""
msgstr ""
"[공격] \"네 속임수에 한 번은 속았지만, 이번에는 싸워보지도 않고 너를 보내지는 않겠다. 똑같은 실수를 되풀이할 수는 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "5bd19af6-13ee-4947-8c45-4f9f072e53bd"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"No, I will not allow you to leave. Not after what you've done!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"아니. 네가 떠나도록 내버려두지 않겠다. 네가 저지른 이 악행을 두고는 못 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0089_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e087f98b-b500-4a18-9236-7b27c84ac984"
msgid "Assumed the possibility of future deals with the Forefather."
msgstr "미래에 있을지도 모를 선조와의 거래를 염두에 두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "e35597ca-6736-46e5-ac21-a186a45ace3e"
msgid ""
"\"So long, Auferon. I wouldn't mind meeting you again, if you have something "
"interesting to offer.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 안녕히, 오페론. 괜찮은 제안이 있다면 다시 만나는 것도 환영이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "f3a6610d-a2eb-4598-82fe-fb0217d92519"
msgid "\"What if I simply don't like Nethys's faith?\""
msgstr "\"내가 단순히 네서스 신앙이 마음에 들지 않는다면 어떻게 할 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "65b8e85b-63ee-494b-ba96-61c8f5966658"
msgid ""
"\"But I am the {mf|King|Queen}, and patron of the magic arts in my lands.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 나는 {mf|왕|여왕}이며, 내 영지의 마법 사용은 나의 후원과 통제 하에서만 이루어진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "2f63b432-c831-4261-b3b4-1f41b764185d"
msgid "\"It's never too late to learn this art.\""
msgstr "\"그런 기술을 배우는 것은 언제나 환영이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "cb0ac4b6-0e70-4bb7-aedc-4e11cb689963"
msgid ""
"\"Will you spare me some time, Herald? When will I again be witness to such "
"a perfect embodiment of magic thought as you...\""
msgstr "\"전령이여, 잠시만 더 나와 있어주지 않겠소? 당신과 같이 완벽한 마법력의 현신을 목격하게 될 일은 다시 없을테니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "48ec4c5c-3a00-466f-b353-8492826ed402"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your visit. Let's resolve the matter we have gathered here "
"for.\""
msgstr "\"방문해주어 고맙소. 우리가 모인 목적대로, 이제 이 문제를 해결해 봅시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "aa9776cb-bd68-42ef-bc76-04fdd7479e83"
msgid "\"Kanerah, stop! We can still fix everything.\""
msgstr "\"카네라, 멈춰! 우린 아직 일을 바로잡을 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "7b743af0-ece1-4bf4-9f1f-0e723346571f"
msgid "\"This might actually be for the best...\""
msgstr "\"사실 이게 최선일지도 몰라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0116_Text
msgctxt "3b5dfb80-ded7-4b8c-965e-6ced3fb5a6aa"
msgid "\"Kalikke, stop. You don't need to do this.\""
msgstr "\"칼리케. 멈춰! 그럴 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "7812c910-19f3-44d1-9eb3-97c10d493cc9"
msgid "\"Great, everybody gets what they want...\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 모두가 원하는 것을 얻게 되었군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0124_Text
msgctxt "6e0c671b-06ad-4a21-be17-8591f1d8b41f"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"No, never. If I need to use force to stop you, then I will!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"아니, 너를 막기 위해 꼭 싸워야만 한다면 그렇게 하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0125_Text
msgctxt "9a1e3ada-2cb7-44cd-9e45-5d836b2838b3"
msgid "\"If there is no other way. Let Kanerah go with you.\""
msgstr "\"다른 방법이 없다면. 카네라를 데리고 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0138_Text
msgctxt "9ef1d024-4b2b-4d69-ba36-595f8ec65cd4"
msgid ""
"\"I want what's good for you. Listen to my words. Think about what's more "
"important to you – your sister or your ambitions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 네가 잘되기를 바라. 내 말을 들어보라고. 너한테 어떤 것이 더 중요한지 생각해봐. 네 동생과 너의 야망 중에 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0139_Text
msgctxt "b7c08a34-1a43-4d61-9aa4-c8626bc12a99"
msgid "\"You have a chance to change everything – starting with yourself.\""
msgstr "\"모든 것을 바꿀 수 있는 기회야. 너 자신을 바꾸는 것이 그 시작이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0141_Text
msgctxt "c4e6d324-32ab-48d5-ba8b-a16e4ea3a82c"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I do. If you don't learn to think with your head and be more "
"practical, you'll only get your sister into trouble again. Enough is enough."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 만약 네가 머리로 생각하고, 현실적인 선택을 내리는 법을 배우지 못한다면, 다시 너희 언니를 곤경에 빠트리고 말거야. 그 "
"쯤이면 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Answer_0142_Text
msgctxt "27142942-b390-443b-a484-bde72718b987"
msgid ""
"\"When will you learn to listen to those who are older and wiser than you?\""
msgstr "\"언제쯤이나 너보다 현명하고 나이 많은 사람들의 말에 귀를 기울일거니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "bc000612-27d0-43ad-baa4-4ebc7e8b9c70"
msgid ""
"{n}The pulsating magical energy, which so altered the area around the old "
"Taldan tower, is particularly strong here. And it's easy to guess why: like "
"a living heart pumping blood through its veins, a sparking cloud of energy "
"is floating above the ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}탈도르의 탑 주변을 변모시킨 원인인 마법 에너지의 박동이, 이곳에서는 특별히 강하게 느껴집니다. 이유를 짐작하기는 어렵지 않습니다: "
"심장이 동맥으로 혈액을 뿜어내듯, 불꽃 튀는 에너지의 구름이 지면 위를 떠다니고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1ac7843e-1345-4fdc-ba2a-53f5d65ed438"
msgid ""
"\"{name}! You came for us!\" {n}Kalikke's blue eyes sparkle, but her face is "
"tense and exhausted.{/n}"
msgstr "\"{name}! 와주었구나!\" {n}칼리케의 푸른 눈은 기쁨으로 반짝이지만, 긴장한 얼굴에는 피로가 역력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1306fa9e-7087-4c48-afce-4ac65e27b58e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah, disheveled and tired, winks at you and whispers loudly,{/n} \"Our"
" poor great-grandfather is upset... He wanted to resolve the matter quickly "
"and without any fuss, but the {g|Arcanotheign}Herald{/g} didn't even want to "
"talk to him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 엉망진창인 차림으로 피로에 절어있으면서도 당신을 향해 윙크하고는 큰 목소리로 속삭입니다.{/n} \"우리의 불쌍한 "
"고조할아버지께서 화가 나셨대... 우리 문제를 서둘러서 뒤탈없이 해결하고 싶었겠지만, {g|Arcanotheign}아르카노데인{/g}은 "
"그와 얘기하려들지도 않았거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "2604606e-82b3-44e2-8bb3-455576449223"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings.\" {n}The curt salutation betrays more about the Forefather's "
"mood than he intended to reveal. There is no trace of the devil's usual "
"eloquence – and he seems as tense as a predator ready to strike.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"안녕한가.\" {n}선조의 짧은 인사말의 행간에서 미처 숨기지 못한 감정이 엿보입니다. 데블이 평소 뽐내던 유려한 언변은 간 데 "
"없고, 대신 마치 먹이를 덮치려는 순간의 야수처럼 잔뜩 힘을 모으고 있는 것이 느껴집니다.\"{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "74447442-a4e2-4a4c-b7f8-9578df0564c7"
msgid ""
"\"Because I was waiting.\" {n}The numinous voice echoes powerfully the magic "
"cloud, penetrating the area.{/n} \"And my wait is over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 기다리고 있었기 때문이다.\" {n}불가사의한 목소리가 꿰뚫듯 울려퍼지며 마법의 구름을 강하게 진동시킵니다.{/n} \"그리고 "
"기다림은 끝났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "5cd8f10b-1e45-4638-b38d-276fb6f6731f"
msgid ""
"\"...and it seems I was not mistaken. Although without your participation, "
"{name}, this plan would have never worked. One wrong step, and Kalikke's "
"heart would have been broken by the sacrifice of her friends. Or Kanerah "
"might have lost her faith in you, and in her sister, if you'd decided to use "
"her as living bait for the soul eater. The sisters would never have been "
"able to find a common path. – But you led them along the razor's edge, "
"keeping all in perfect {d|TTQ2_TN}balance{/d}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...그리고 내 생각이 틀리지 않은 것 같군. 하지만 {name}, 네 도움이 없었다면 이 계획은 성공하지 못했을 것이다. 단 한 "
"번의 실수로도. 만약 그녀의 친구들을 희생시켰다면 칼리케의 가슴은 찢어졌을 것이다. 만약 영혼 포식자의 미끼로 카네라를 이용했다면 그녀는 "
"너와 동생에 대한 믿음을 잃고 말았을 것이다. 그랬다면 쌍둥이 자매는 절대로 함께 걸어가는 길에 이를 수 없었을 것이다. 그러나 너는 "
"면도날과도 같은 좁은 길에서도 완벽한 {d|TTQ2_TN}균형{/d}을 유지하며 그들을 이끌어주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "447f94ca-fb70-4aaf-96a7-a7277248e71c"
msgid ""
"\"But I was wrong. Nothing worked – one side still tries to defeat the "
"other. They cannot hear each other. They cannot make peace. It would be "
"better for them never to meet, as I planned from the beginning.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 내가 틀렸다. 아무것도 나아지지 않았어. 여전히 서로를 제압하려고만 하고 있지. 그들은 서로의 말을 듣지 않는다. 화해하지도 "
"않아. 내가 처음 계획한 대로, 이 자매들은 다시는 서로 만나지 않는 것이 나을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "476079df-08cd-4c7d-8b2f-9937dddbd0b7"
msgid ""
"{n}The Arcanotheign leans forward a bit, in a gesture of greeting.{/n} "
"\"Hello, loyal mage. Your power is great, I see.. it is a relief to see one "
"who walk so confidently down their path, blessed by my lord and creator. – "
"The path of magical knowledge and power...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르카노데인은 몸을 약간 앞으로 숙여 인사합니다.{/n} \"충성스러운 마법사여, 반갑다. 네 힘은 강력하구나... 자신의 길, "
"나의 창조주가 축복한 길에 자부심을 갖고 살아가는 이를 만나게 되어 다행이다. 바로 마법의 힘과 지식의 길이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "50dd8627-28bc-45fc-9baf-6a6e2f856004"
msgid "\"That's no secret to me.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 그건 비밀이라 할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "0d2d29ee-3a6d-459e-830e-5c00057680fe"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't that supposed to make you happy – or at least curious? Most mortals "
"live so... still, without a chance to ever see so many different forces and "
"creatures, or learn so many new things...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것이 너를 행복하게 해주지 않는가? 아니면 최소한 흥미롭게라도? 대부분의 필멸자는 그저 살아가기만 할 뿐이다... 세계를 움직이는 "
"다양한 원리를, 기묘한 생명체들을, 너무나 많은 새로운 지식을 목격하고 배울 기회를 얻지 못한 채 말이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "a7ec2358-8aa8-4fda-b4f3-7c6b8e66885b"
msgid ""
"\"What a perfect little scene. With the slight stench of a rotten corpse, "
"but who cares. However, I must remind you – the Arcanotheign might have "
"relinquished her claims. But I have not. One of you will come with me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 완벽한 희극이군. 시체 썩는 냄새가 진동하긴 하지만, 무슨 상관인가. 하지만 내가 분명히 강조하겠다. 아르카노데인은 자신의 "
"주장을 철회했을지 몰라도, 나는 아니다. 너희 둘 중 한 명은 나와 함께 가야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "1c4d4baa-db9a-411c-bb45-3f33e0866bc0"
msgid ""
"{n}With a suave gesture, the devil draws attention back to himself.{/n} "
"\"Perhaps now that we're all together, we may discuss the delicate matter "
"for which we are here assembled. Herald, I am aware that you brought Kanerah "
"back to life, making her and her sister agree to some difficult conditions, "
"as payment for your gift of life. And both of these conditions were bro–\""
msgstr ""
"{n}데블은 우아한 손짓으로 다시 자신에게 주의를 돌립니다.{/n} \"아마도 우리가 모두 모인 지금이 복잡한 문제를 논의하기 좋은 때인 "
"것 같군. 어차피 그 문제 때문에 모인 게 아니던가. 전령이여, 나는 그대가 카네라를 되살리면서 그 대가로 그들 쌍둥이 자매에게 두 가지 "
"어려운 조건을 요구한 걸 알고 있다. 그리고 이 두 가지 조건은 모두 깨-\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "399387aa-3f92-4228-89a7-c0cebae5f7ab"
msgid ""
"{n}The god's herald interrupts the devil. You hear surprisingly human "
"astonishment in her numinous voice.{/n} \"You are very wrong, Auferon. "
"Perhaps you have confused me with the Lawgiver, the Herald of "
"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}?\" {n}Judging by her voice, the Arcanotheign finds her "
"final remark incredibly amusing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아르카노데인이 갑자기 데블의 말에 끼어듭니다. 당신은 놀랍게도 그녀의 신비한 목소리에 숨은 인간의 감정을 감지합니다.{/n} \"네 "
"말은 완전히 틀렸다, 오페론이여. 나를 {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}의 전령인 입법자로 착각한 모양이지?\" {n}목소리로 "
"판단하건데, 아르카노데인은 방금 자신이 한 말이 아주 재미있다고 생각하는 모양입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "0370ba0e-d622-46e6-8969-1f92a8045852"
msgid ""
"\"I do not take 'payment' for my deeds, and make no 'conditions'. That is "
"the lot of other gods and their servants, but not of All-Seeing "
"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}. I only heard Kalikke's prayer and desired to help her. "
"My lord and creator approved this decision – it seemed to him a curious "
"magic experiment, a momentary amusement in the vastness of eternity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내 행동에 대해 '대가'를 요구하지도 않고, '조건'을 걸지도 않는다. 그런 것은 다른 신과 그 종복들의 소행일 뿐, "
"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}와는 관계없다. 나는 단지 칼리케의 기도를 듣고 그녀를 돕고 싶었을 뿐이고, 결정을 내린 것은 나의 "
"창조주셨다. 아마도 그에게는 이 마법 실험이 무한의 공허 속에서 잠시 즐길만한 흥미거리였던 것으로 짐작한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ea78e3fd-8b2f-47ec-9e18-124fb8a56ebf"
msgid "\"The true name of the Forefather. Interesting, even I didn't know...\""
msgstr "\"그게 선조의 진짜 이름이야. 흥미롭군, 사실 나도 모르긴 했지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "6e7a61d3-b285-4494-8697-adecad303e56"
msgid "\"I told you – I simply wanted to help them.\""
msgstr "\"말하지 않았느냐. 나는 그저 그들을 돕고 싶었을 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "e9348cdd-b99e-4eb9-91dd-f951e7e06bce"
msgid "{n}The Arcanotheign seems embarrassed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아르카노데인은 당황한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "02b06c03-c126-4c9e-8564-45e1465f8fdb"
msgid ""
"\"Certain energies and substances annihilate each other, if placed in the "
"same vessel. Such are the spirits of Kanerah and Kalikke. So long as they "
"are together, they will continue to hurt each other, pulling each in "
"different directions, tearing themselves to pieces. If I simply returned "
"Kanerah to life, sooner or later they would ruin each other as they did once "
"before. But still I desired to help them. I drew upon the wisdom of Nethys, "
"my lord and creator. He is double-edged, and his two sides are in balance. I "
"thought the sisters might achieve this as well...\""
msgstr ""
"\"같은 그릇에 담아 놓으면 서로를 파괴하려 드는 에너지와 물질들이 있다. 카네라와 칼리케의 영혼들이 바로 그러하다. 함께 있는 한, "
"그들은 늘 서로에게 상처를 줄 것이다. 각자 자신이 가고자 하는 방향으로 상대를 끌고 가려다, 결국 자신들이 조각조각 찢어지기에 이르도록 "
"말이다. 내가 단순히 카네라를 부활시키기만 했다면, 쌍둥이들은 과거에 그리했듯 곧 서로를 파괴하려 들었을 것이다. 하지만 나는 그들을 더 "
"돕고 싶었다. 나는 나의 창조주이신 네서스의 지혜를 빌렸다. 그의 두 속성은 양날의 칼과 같으며, 완벽한 균형을 이루고 있다. 나는 이들 "
"자매도 이러한 균형에 도달할 수 있을 것이라 생각했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "0536625e-3f96-45de-9956-0ae6a1ed36ad"
msgid ""
"\"Your and Kalikke's {d|TTQ2_CG}decision{/d} to use Kanerah as living bait "
"for the soul eater – this was the final brick in the wall that divided these "
"sisters. Kanerah will not say this out loud – she is far too secretive. But "
"deep down, she can no longer fully trust you – or her sister.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라를 영혼 포식자의 미끼로 쓰려던 너와 칼리케의 {d|TTQ2_CG}결정{/d}, 그것이야말로 이들 자매 사이를 영영 갈라놓을 "
"장벽의 마지막 벽돌 한 장이었다. 뭐든지 숨기기 좋아하는 카네라는 앞으로도 이것을 결코 큰소리로 입 밖에 내지 않을 테지. 그러나 "
"본심으로 말하자면, 카네라는 이제 더 이상 너와 칼리케를 전적으로 신뢰할 수 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "ddb1c1a4-44e5-40c0-90ed-d5c7aab9cc28"
msgid ""
"\"The blood of the dead Sweet Teeth is {d|TTQ2_LE}on your hands{/d} – and "
"the ease with which Kanerah accepted this sacrifice was the last brick in "
"the wall that divides these sisters. Kalikke might not say anything – she is "
"used to keeping all her grief shut away. But she has never truly forgiven "
"you, or her sister.\""
msgstr ""
"\"단 것 중독자 아이들의 피가 아직도 {d|TTQ2_LE}네 손에 묻어있다.{/d} 그리고 이러한 희생을 용납하고 만 마음의 빈 틈, "
"그것이야말로 이들 자매 사이를 영영 갈라놓을 장벽의 마지막 벽돌 한 장이었다. 물론 칼리케는 아무 말도 하지 않을 것이다. 그녀는 늘 "
"슬픔을 혼자서만 간직하지 않느냐. 그러나 본심으로는 절대 너와 카네라를 용서하지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "1ea9e4d8-e10d-4b8d-8730-9a87ad97c2cb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, this crisis has been coming for a long time, but I know how to solve "
"it...\" {n}The devil's seductive voice gradually gains strength. {/n}\"An "
"agreement, and experiment, or aid given selflessly — whatever it was, your "
"plan failed, Herald. You admit as much yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 언제나 이런 위기는 있었지만 나는 해결책을 알고 있지...\" {n}데블의 호소력 강한 목소리에 점차 힘이 실립니다. {/n}"
"\"계약, 실험, 대가 없는 도움, 이 중에 뭐가 됐든 너의 계획은 실패했다, 전령이여. 너 스스로도 이미 인정한 것처럼 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "5feeefcd-f149-44d9-8743-53b30b5df177"
msgid ""
"\"But allow me to suggest a solution. I shall take one of the sisters with "
"me to Hell, for all eternity, body, soul and all that she can give. The "
"other will remain here to live out her life howsoever she pleases. If both "
"are doomed, then my suggestion is the best solution.\""
msgstr ""
"\"해결책을 제시하겠다. 나는 자매 가운데 한 명을 지옥으로 데려가겠다. 영혼과 육신, 그에게 속한 모든 것을 영영토록. 나머지 한 명은 "
"지상에 남아 본인이 원하는 대로 살게 될 것이다. 두 자매 모두가 파국을 피할 수 없는 운명이라면, 내 제안을 따르는 것이 최선일 것이다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "11849f88-f9a2-4cd3-ba02-b0895551331e"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps,\"{n} the Arcanotheign agrees with remarkable ease.{/n} \"Or "
"perhaps not. It is time to decide. Let the matter be weighed upon the scales "
"– that's how you mortals evaluate things, is it not? Kanerah, Kalikke and "
"{name} – it is up to you what happens next.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럴지도.\"{n} 아르카노데인은 놀라울 정도로 쉽게 데블의 말에 동의합니다.{/n} \"혹은 아닐지도. 자, 이제 결정할 시간이다. "
"문제를 저울에 달거라. 그것이 너희 필멸자들이 사물의 가치를 평가할 때 쓰는 방법이 아니냐? 카네라, 칼리케, 그리고 {name}. "
"지금부터 무슨 일이 생길지는 너희의 결정에 달렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0033_CG_inQ2_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d97dee85-3f9d-4782-890b-03df1736a304"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah bites her lip, then nods.{/n} \"The Herald is right. Whatever you "
"may think, I can't accept that my patron and my only sister would use me as "
"living bait. I still have nightmares about the soul eater – about how it "
"killed me the first time. I awaken and I wonder – when will be the next time "
"that you risk my life for the sake of your kind and noble deeds?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 입술을 깨물고는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"전령의 말이 맞아. 네가 어떻게 생각하든, 나는 내 후원자와 하나뿐인 동생이 나를 "
"살아있는 미끼로 이용했다는 걸 용납할 수 없어. 나는 여전히 영혼 포식자의 악몽을 꾸곤 해. 그 괴물이 어떻게 나를 살해했는지에 대해서 "
"말이야. 그리고는 잠에서 깨어나 궁금해하지. 다음 번에는 또 언제 네가 내 목숨을 내걸게 될까? 그 선량하고 고결한 행동 때문에?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0034_LE_inQ2_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7a051ebc-cf87-49fd-ac37-6434af972f74"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke takes a deep breath.{/n} \"You are right, wise Herald. I cannot "
"forget my friends. Naiho, Tevi and Elki... I hear their voices in the "
"morning before I awaken, and I cry when I do, when I realize they're gone. I "
"don't know if I can ever get past this. Will I ever stop thinking what my "
"life would be like, if I just shut my eyes and pretend nothing happened? No, "
"I can't. Any fate is better than this torture.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 숨을 깊게 들이쉽니다.{/n} \"당신의 말씀이 옳습니다, 현명하신 전령이시여! 맞아, {name}. 난 결코 친구들을 "
"잊지 못해. 나이호, 테비, 엘키... 매일 눈 뜰 때마다 난 그 아이들의 목소리를 들어. 그리고 그들이 가고 없다는 것을 깨달을 때마다 "
"눈물을 흘리곤 하지. 내가 이걸 극복할 수 있을지도 모르겠어. 내가 눈을 감고 아무 일도 없었던 척 하면 이렇게 회한에 잠기지 않을 수 "
"있을까? 아니, 불가능해. 어떤 끔찍한 운명을 맞더라도 지금의 이 고문보다는 나을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "53ab4b64-af36-44c2-a813-c9d1778e8097"
msgid ""
"\"Really? And how do you intend to stop me, when even the god's Herald "
"confirms the right of my claims. – And even the one you would protect "
"refuses your patronage?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말인가? 신의 전령조차도 내 권리를 인정한 지금, 왜 나를 막으려 드는 건가? 심지어 네가 지금 보호하고자 하는 이도 너의 후원을 "
"거부하고 있지 않느냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "153b5e3e-fb9a-45c2-a49e-514dd56317ec"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to change your fate. But I guess I couldn't. There is nothing for "
"me to do here... and maybe I shouldn't have interfered in the first place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희의 운명을 바꾸고 싶었노라. 하지만 나로선 불가능한 일이었던 것 같구나. 지금 여기서 내가 해줄 수 있는 일은 없다... 아마도 "
"나는 처음부터 너희의 문제에 개입하지 말았어야 할 것 같구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1dec50ab-7062-4af7-80d2-f5ee489f7968"
msgid ""
"{n}A storm troubles Kalikke's eyes.{/n} \"You want me to become colder and "
"more calculating? I guess it's time for me to grow up...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케의 눈빛이 폭풍과도 같이 요동칩니다.{/n} \"내가 더 냉철하고 계산적이기를 바란다고 했지? 지금이 바로 어른이 될 때인 것 "
"같네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "71a87f21-ee2d-4aed-b7a7-917025cb7218"
msgid ""
"\"Do you really think mere words can make me forget the deaths of my "
"friends? I have kept quiet about my grief for too long...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 그 몇 마디 말에 친구들의 죽음을 잊을 수 있을 것 같아? 나는 내 슬픔을 너무나 오랫동안 조용히 간직해야만 했단 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "85c6b741-ffdf-4758-9c3f-047b79275651"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah looks at her sister and back at you with almost childish "
"despair.{/n} \"You're really serious, aren't you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 동생을 바라보다가, 마치 겁먹은 어린 아이와도 같이 절망에 빠져 당신을 돌아봅니다.{/n} \"진심으로 그렇게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4b52d5d5-3f17-42a9-922a-ae6560074a70"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah makes a wry face.{/n} \"Go to Hell and take your condescension "
"with you!\""
msgstr "{n}카네라의 표정이 구겨집니다.{/n} \"지옥에나 가라! 그 잘난 겸손이나 떨면서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "228c35ac-3e02-465d-84cd-dcc954562300"
msgid ""
"\"It's amazing you didn't suggest that I'd happily feed myself to the soul "
"eater! Anyway, that's almost exactly what I'm going to do. Auferon, I am "
"yours. I will join you in Hell. This is my decision.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 나 자신을 기꺼이 영혼 포식자의 먹이로 주었다고는 얘기하지 않았네. 퍽이나 놀라운 일이야! 내가 거의 그렇게 할 뻔 했으니까. "
"오페론, 난 이제 너의 것이야. 너와 함께 지옥에 가겠어. 어디까지나 내 의지로 그렇게 결정한거고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e5e5b776-1818-4e45-8324-f174828cb684"
msgid ""
"\"So what am I supposed to do? I'm not allowed to bear a grudge? Ha! Fine, "
"fine, Kanerah is evil and heartless, and Kanerah will try to be better. "
"Satisfied?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 내가 무얼 해야 하지? 원한을 품는 건 허락 안할테지? 하! 좋아, 좋아. 카네라는 악하고 냉혈한이지. 그리고 카네라는 "
"착해지려고 노력할거야. 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6f6332b7-0a8c-4809-b98c-5ff66916590b"
msgid ""
"\"...Grow up and understand how the world really works. I can see it now – "
"this place is no different than Hell. Evil and deviousness rule here as "
"well. And if that's the case, then why does it matter where I spend my life? "
"Take me, Forefather. This is my decision.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...어른이 되어서 세상이 실제로 어떻게 작동하는지 이해하는 거지. 이제야 알겠어. 여기도 지옥과 다름 없어. 악행과 거짓이 지배하는 "
"곳이지. 그렇다면 어디에서 살아가든 무슨 상관일까? 나를 데려가. 선조. 내 의지로 내린 결정이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "724df508-bb45-4d75-9d65-22501d4beef5"
msgid ""
"\"I must accept this bitter world as it is, and not as I've imagined it to "
"be in my dreams. Very well – you convinced me. I will try to change for you. "
"Perhaps my heart will hurt less this way...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 이 씁쓸한 세계를 있는 그대로 받아들여야겠어. 내가 꿈속에서 상상했던 이상적인 세계 대신에 말이야. 그래, 네가 날 설득시켰네. "
"널 위해 나를 바꿔볼게. 그럼 내 마음도 아마 덜 아프게 되겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "34d270b6-b32d-439a-9640-4521ea5413b0"
msgid ""
"\"No! That's not how I wanted things... I thought you'd understand... and "
"then...\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 난 그런 걸 원했던 게 아니야... 네가 이해해줄 거라고 생각했는데... 그런데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "d66564e6-0d80-48d1-9a0b-466027051c10"
msgid ""
"{n}The Forefather holds his prey tightly by her hand, then looks at her "
"sister.{/n} \"This is called 'accountability', you foolish child. Not "
"everything in the world turns out how you'd like. At least so long as you "
"don't have the power to compel the world to obey.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}선조는 카네라의 손을 꽉 잡은 채, 칼리케를 바라보며 말합니다.{/n} \"이것이 바로 \"책임\"이라는 것이다, 어리석은 아이야. "
"세상 모든 일이 네가 원하는 대로 되는 것은 아니다. 적어도 세상을 네 앞에 복종시킬 힘이 없다면 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "d11ff1f3-e986-4c3c-a046-78c017d05ea6"
msgid ""
"\"This chapter ends in sadness... But I will not stand against a decision "
"made freely. You have given me so many new thoughts, so many ideas. It's "
"enough for an age or two of contemplation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비극적인 결말이로구나... 하지만 나는 각자가 자유 의지에 따라 내린 결정을 가로막지 않겠다. 너희들은 나에게 너무나 많은 생각할 "
"거리를 주었다. 수 십년간 명상하기에 충분할 정도로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "fa78c85a-f876-49c9-a197-8ebb7ea76a44"
msgid "{n}The devil gives a courtly half-bow.{/n} \"Herald.\""
msgstr "{n}데블은 예의바르게 허리를 반쯤 숙여 절합니다.{/n} \"전령이여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "12dc6822-63bc-4b24-a5ff-59ba40316775"
msgid ""
"{n}He looks at you.{/n} \"Sooner or later, the kingdom of Asmodeus will "
"collect your souls as well. But for now – farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그가 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"머지 않아, 너희의 영혼 역시 아스모데우스의 왕국으로 불려가게 될 것이다. 어쨋든 지금은 "
"작별이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f9866977-8ff3-41d5-a17b-cebb67ea6cb3"
msgid "\"No! Kanerah, listen...\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 카네라, 들어봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "4e7199d5-27ce-4f26-9ccf-71a0edb81ac2"
msgid ""
"{n}You sense a note of approval or even respect in the Arcanotheign's "
"otherworldly voice.{/n} \"This universe is built so intricately... Only All-"
"Seeing Nethys knows in advance all the consequences of all decisions, and "
"the outcomes of countless timelines. Even I, his creation and Herald, do not "
"know so much, and every new discovery amazes me more and more. What I have "
"seen watching you and these sisters is one such amazing discovery.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 아르카노데인의 신비로운 목소리에서 당신에 대한 호의, 심지어는 존경심을 느낄 수 있습니다.{/n} \"이 세상은 실로 "
"복잡하게 만들어진 것이로구나... 오로지 모든 것을 꿰뚫어보시는 네서스만이 모든 결정에 뒤따르는 결과를 내다보실 수 있다. 셀 수 없이 "
"복잡하게 얽힌 시간의 흐름과, 그 끝에서 모두를 기다리는 결말까지도. 심지어 그의 피조물이자 전령인 나조차도 매번 새로운 발견에 더욱 "
"놀라게 된다. 너와 쌍둥이 자매를 지켜보며 알게 된 것들처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "ee7face0-1bae-4e8c-a3ca-42b0e1a4dcde"
msgid ""
"\"More amazing still is that my lord and creator momentarily turned his gaze "
"upon you. Nethys does not speak to his followers directly, nor reward their "
"efforts or punish their negligence. But there is nothing to prevent me from "
"presenting you with a token of thanks, for the insights into human nature "
"which you have given me. You may live now as you wish. – I see you've "
"learned to find a balance, and will be able to carry on with your lives "
"without driving each other into madness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 놀라운 것은 나의 창조주께서 일시적으로나마 너희에게로 시선을 돌리셨다는 것이다. 네서스께서는 추종자들과 직접 대화하시지도, 그들의 "
"노력에 상을 주시지도, 불충을 벌하시지도 않는다. 하지만 인간 본성에 대한 통찰력을 준 대가로, 내가 너희에게 작은 감사를 표하는 것 "
"정도는 괜찮을 것이다. 너희는 이제 원하는 대로 살아도 괜찮다. 지금껏 균형을 찾는 법을 배웠으니, 이제는 더 이상 서로간의 불화 없이 "
"잘 살아갈 수 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1490d02a-6ed9-430c-8a07-3a4edea15d3e"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Herald. For this gift and for the new chance we've received.\""
msgstr "\"전령이시여, 우리가 받은 선물과 이 새로운 기회에 감사드립니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4f76ae61-06c9-4f5d-a36e-16947a9fcd42"
msgid ""
"\"It's not enough to receive a gift. What matters is how you use it... But "
"nonetheless – thank you!\""
msgstr "\"선물을 받는 걸로는 충분하지 않아. 그걸 어떻게 사용하느냐가 중요하지... 하지만, 어찌됐든 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0068_TT_TN_fight_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "4abbdd58-6a6b-4cf5-9516-2fbeac2079bf"
msgid ""
"\"You gave me a chance to end this story for my own benefit. Now that the "
"Herald has ceased her meddling...\""
msgstr "\"이 이야기를 내 이익에 부합하는 방향으로 끝낼 수 있도록 내게 기회를 준 셈이다. 이제 전령도 참견을 멈추었으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0069_TT_TN_nofight_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "668d9328-68f3-49f9-9f8c-5fb466412a58"
msgid ""
"\"I too will excuse myself. Many interesting things are happening here. I "
"would stay and watch, but I do not wish to interfere any longer. All that "
"happens next is your story and yours alone. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 역시 실례해야겠다. 과연 여기에서는 흥미로운 일들이 많이 일어나고 있구나. 나도 남아서 지켜보겠지만, 이제 더 이상은 간섭하지 "
"않겠다. 이 다음부터 일어날 일들은 전적으로 너희의 이야기이다. 그럼 이만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "bf6bb465-da78-4804-a170-8efebbdc1a1b"
msgid ""
"\"But you're already having so much fun here, and I have no wish to "
"interfere. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 너는 여기에서 벌써 재미를 많이 보고 있고, 나는 방해하고 싶지 않구나. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "94e8c54c-057e-4c4c-8fa4-888fc1ae1197"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt your kingdom will exist for much longer, so there is no sense in "
"my return. It's a pity I failed to preserve my valuable investment. – "
"Instead, they will die with you, pointlessly and uselessly... But alas. Such "
"modest disappointments merely punctuate the tedium of eternity. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 왕국은 오래가지 못할테니, 내가 굳이 돌아올 필요도 없을 것이다. 단지 내 값진 자산을 보호하지 못한 것이 애석할 뿐이다. 이들은 "
"대신 네 곁에서 죽어갈 것이다. 무의미하고 헛된 죽음이 되겠지. 물론 이 따위 미미한 실망감으로는 영원을 살아가야 하는 지루함에 흠집도 "
"내지 못할 것이다. 잘들 지내도록!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "556fda24-3444-4336-a672-b64805dc1158"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah folds her arms on her chest.{/n} \"It is as I expected. My sister "
"and you are two peas in a pod. But you know what? I'm not mad at you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"예상한 대로야. 칼리케랑 너는 정말 둘이 꼭 닮았다니까. 하지만 말이야. 나는 화가 나지 않았어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3d9700db-5678-411f-b840-7cd02ead04ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke listens to you silently, nods, then turns to the Forefather and "
"says abruptly,{/n} \"Take me, devil.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 말 없이 당신의 말을 듣고 있다가 고개를 끄덕이고는 선조을 향해 돌아섭니다. 그녀가 퉁명스럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"나를 "
"데려가, 데블.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f6f18e27-7482-4a6d-8cc1-97e0f89b1762"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone must choose their own friends and patrons. I simply don't belong "
"in this friendly gang. A good thing I've received an alternative proposal... "
"Forefather, I'm ready to go with you. Of course, we must discuss the terms "
"of our new contract in detail...\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구나 친구와 후원자는 잘 골라야 해. 난 이 친절한 녀석들하고는 맞지 않아. 다른 대안이 생긴게 차라리 잘된 일일지도 몰라. 선조, "
"나는 갈 준비가 됐어. 물론 자세한 계약 조건은 따로 얘기해보자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "704c8de2-44bd-4384-9566-900f0ad3ff74"
msgid "\"No! You silly goat! What's got into your head?\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 이 바보 멍청이! 도대체 머리에 뭐가 든 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b9487ea2-fb90-4e95-8fe3-05fe17bce820"
msgid "\"Kanerah, no! Don't do this!\""
msgstr "\"카네라! 안 돼! 그러지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9354c026-129c-490d-9d8a-180ec3ac7ecc"
msgid ""
"\"I just want to get this over with. You are good here, Kanerah. You and "
"{name} have found a common purpose. But I don't belong here, as everyone can "
"see. I failed to save you from death once, and then I failed to save the "
"Sweet Teeth – all souls who trusted me. All I feel now is tired and sad. If "
"the Hell requires a sacrifice, then let it be me. As for you... be happy, "
"sister.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 단지 이 모든 걸 끝내고 싶을 뿐이야. 언니는 여기 있는게 나아. 언니와 {name}은 공통의 목표가 있잖아. 하지만 봐, 나는 "
"여기에 낄 수 없어. 나는 언니를 죽음에서 구하지도 못했고, 단 것 중독자 아이들도 구하지 못했어. 유일하게 나를 신뢰해준 사람들을 "
"말이야. 나는 슬프고 지쳤어. 지옥의 희생양이 필요하다면, 나한테 양보해줘. 그리고 언니는... 행복해야 해, 카네라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0078_TT_CG_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "86a33d0a-35a1-4b27-90e3-bf0ca40b043a"
msgid ""
"\"And on that splendid note, if you'll excuse me. – This miserable piece of "
"land will soon fall anyway!\""
msgstr "\"멋지군. 괜찮다면 내가 한 줄 보태주마. 이 비천한 땅덩이도 곧 멸망하고 말 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0079_TT_LE_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "bebc1a3c-3595-4175-a7a1-f393059cc633"
msgid ""
"\"However, you and {name} made me happy... first there, at the barrens with "
"the soul eater. And now here, dashing the illusions of poor Kalikke so "
"ruthlessly. How can I leave such a delicious act of indifference and evil "
"without granting you a suitable reward? Accept this gift. And farewell – for "
"now...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 너와 {name}는 내게 즐거움을 주었다... 처음은 영혼포식자들과 황무지에서 있었던 일, 그 다음은 지금 여기서, 불쌍한 "
"칼리케의 환영을 무자비하게 내친 일. 이렇게 악과 무관심으로 가득한, 훌륭한 행동에 내가 포상도 내리지 않고 그냥 갈 수는 없지. 이 "
"선물을 받아주길 바란다. 그럼 잘 있도록, 일단 지금은 말이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "9a020cee-b3a5-41bd-ab39-a8c680388aeb"
msgid ""
"\"Strange, why do I feel so lost? There is nothing else for me to do here. "
"My help led to nothing good... and it's folly to hope it might.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하구나, 이 열패감은 무엇 때문인가? 더 이상 여기에서 내가 할 수 있는 것은 아무 것도 없다. 내가 준 도움은 모두 허사로 "
"끝났고... 잘 될 것이라고 기대했던 것이 참으로 어리석은 일이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "becfb0b7-bd07-46ef-8016-86237d20823c"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it, {name}! You managed to force some reason into my silly "
"sister's head!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어, {name}! 드디어 내 멍청이 동생한테 사리분별을 가르쳐줬나보군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "1ebb6a9e-c84f-4d09-914e-c355af40de75"
msgid ""
"\"How presumptuous. But it only means that I'll get not one, but an entire "
"bouquet of souls...\""
msgstr "\"건방지구나. 하지만 그래봐야 꽃 한 송이 뿐 아니라 영혼의 꽃다발 전부를 나의 손에 바치게 될 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "66afecb4-6eb2-494a-90d0-804b428afe0c"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing else for me to do here. What did my help lead to? This "
"does not seem like balance and peace... Perhaps I should not have interfered "
"in the business of mortals...\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에서 내가 할 일은 없다. 내 도움이 어떤 결과를 낳았는가? 결국 이 것은 균형도, 평화도 아닌 것 같군... 아마도 필멸자의 "
"일에 개입하지 말았어야 할 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b0cdfec8-273b-4ea9-bfb2-0c00cc609cc1"
msgid "\"I knew you'd understand us, sister!\""
msgstr "\"언니가 우리를 이해했을 줄 알았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8f076e38-05c6-4f0f-8d73-23d396025ff9"
msgid ""
"\"...Anyway, why don't I go there? The Forefather's company obviously suits "
"me better than yours!\""
msgstr "\"...근데 왜 나는 가면 안 된다는 거지? 여기서 데블의 하수인이라고 하면 다들 너보단 날 쳐다볼 것 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5c7ccf14-32b8-423d-8dc2-0a4948568af0"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke turns her pale face to the devil.{/n} \"Take me, Forefather. I "
"don't belong here any more.\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 창백한 얼굴로 데블을 돌아봅니다.{/n} \"나를 데려가, 선조. 이제 여기는 내가 있을 곳이 아냐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "54afb73f-dd97-42d1-9db9-2ff2f807ef0c"
msgid ""
"\"Such moving unanimity.\" {n}The devil can barely conceal the venom in his "
"voice.{/n} \"It appears that I should not even consider reclaiming my stolen "
"property. Surely I shouldn't argue with the Herald of the most unpredictable "
"god... And so, if you will excuse me...\""
msgstr ""
"\"퍽이나 감동적인 만장일치로군.\" {n}데블은 악의를 숨기지 못합니다.{/n} \"나보고 도둑맞은 물건을 되찾을 생각은 하지도 말라는 "
"거로군. 가장 예측 불가능한 신의 전령하고는 절대로 말도 섞지 말아야겠어... 자, 난 그럼 이만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "bb8a7184-1a8d-418e-aa2f-36a2507c303c"
msgid ""
"\"Better you should consider whether you'll have anything to offer in "
"return. Considering the state of your kingdom, I am very much doubtful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 그 대가로 제시할 만한 무언가를 갖고 있기나 한지 우선 살펴보는 게 나을거다. 지금 네 왕국의 상태를 생각해보면, 뭐가 나올 것 "
"같지는 않구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1c476e92-2e12-45f2-bfb9-06502c8b7e33"
msgid ""
"\"That's not a wise decision... but fine! Forgive me, great-grandfather, but "
"our dealings are done.\""
msgstr "\"그건 현명한 결정이 아니야... 하지만 괜찮아! 증조 할아버지, 미안하지만 우리의 계약은 끝났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5e263d14-8c2e-4c12-9c40-ae463e360100"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. We are together now, and there is no longer anything you can do to "
"harm us!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 우리는 지금 함께 있어. 너는 더 이상 우리를 해칠 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "2ccf547b-3053-45dd-b7fe-efaa8cb41572"
msgid ""
"{n}The Arcanotheign tilts her head, as if curious.{/n} \"You are an "
"interesting creature, {name}. You venerate the god of magic without wielding "
"it yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르카노데인이 흥미롭다는 듯 고개를 갸웃합니다.{/n} \"너는 참으로 재미있는 생물이다, {name}. 마법을 사용하지도 않으면서 "
"마법의 신을 경배할 줄 아는 자로구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "c672a328-cc1d-4c68-bf65-43437c646049"
msgid ""
"\"Learning new things is priceless. I understand you all too well. Good luck "
"to you in your journey!\""
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 무언가를 배우는 것에는 헤아릴 수 없는 가치가 있다. 나는 이제 너희 모두를 잘 이해하게 되었다. 너희의 여행에 행운이 따르길 "
"바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "66f0c5f4-ccb7-4045-9fac-d265000e300d"
msgid ""
"\"You don't wield the power yourself, but you help others develop it? This "
"is most worthy. To increase magical knowledge in any way is our goal and our "
"reward.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법의 힘을 독차지하는 대신, 다른 이의 발전에 기여하겠다? 몹시 훌륭한 결정이구나. 어떤 식으로든 마법 지식을 함양할 수 있다면 "
"당초 목표를 만족하거니와, 그 자체로 보상이 될 테니 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0100_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "0b22fc1a-e7f9-4d44-a943-fd0024d75d09"
msgid ""
"\"My lord and creator pays no heed to the prayers of those who are not "
"bestowed with magic. You know you will enjoy no profit from this faith, yet "
"still you choose it by your heart's bidding. Interesting. I enjoy "
"contemplating such intricacies...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 창조주께서는 마법의 능력을 부여받지 못한 자들의 기도에는 귀를 기울이시지 않는다. 너는 이 신앙을 통해 얻을 이익이 없다는 것을 "
"알면서도, 단지 내면의 부름에 따라 이 길을 선택한 것이로구나. 흥미롭군. 생각해볼만한 흥미로운 역설이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "62e5b836-8af7-4b40-bdfc-77174c6751f8"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing would please me more!\" {n}You hear honest joy in the "
"Arcanotheign's voice.{/n} \"But it is time we must finish what we have "
"gathered here for. And you must soon set off to solve your other problems. I "
"shouldn't be upset though, if I were you. Is it not a blessing – the Worlds "
"Merger, and all that has happened and will happen? How else could you have "
"seen such magic phenomena? Where else could you truly test your knowledge "
"and power?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 즐겁구나!\" {n}당신은 아르카노데인의 목소리에서 순수한 즐거움을 느낍니다.{/n} \"하지만 이제 우리를 이 곳에 모이게 한 "
"문제를 마무리지어야 할 시간이다. 그리고 너 역시도 곧 다른 문제들을 해결하러 떠나야 할 것이다. 하지만 실망하지 말거라. 세계 "
"합병에서부터 지금까지 일어났던, 그리고 앞으로 일어날 모든 일이 곧 축복 아니겠느냐? 그게 아니라면 어떻게 기이한 마법 현상을 목격할 "
"길이 있었겠느냐? 어디에서 너희의 지식과 힘을 진실로 시험해볼 수 있었겠느냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "c4e2c8f1-9c5d-4c51-8548-2480f81ffac4"
msgid "\"That's what I'm here for.\""
msgstr "\"바로 그것 때문에 이곳에 온 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "255409f8-e10b-4148-aa9c-6e4297dd61f7"
msgid ""
"\"It's too late, you fool. And do you know what? We'll be better off apart. "
"I'm sure I will find a place for myself in Hell. I'll find a way to recover "
"my soul – and find a more suitable use for it. I belong there! And you will "
"stay here, saving silly outcasts who stumble into trouble, and write your "
"poems and live as you like...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 너무 늦었어, 이 바보야. 그리고 있잖아, 우리는 떨어져 지내는 게 더 나아. 나는 지옥에서도 내 몫만큼 잘 지낼 수 있을 "
"거라고. 나는 꼭 내 영혼을 되찾고 말거야. 그러면 지금보다는 더 잘 쓸 수 있겠지. 난 지옥에 있는게 더 잘 어울려! 넌 지상에 남아서 "
"하고 싶은 대로 살아. 늘 사고나 치고 다니는 멍청한 부랑자들을 돕고, 시나 쓰면서 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b81e667b-8f79-4a90-b2cb-5354084e13cd"
msgid "\"I don't think so,\" {n}the tiefling says harshly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"나는 그렇게 생각하지 않아.\" {n}티플링은 거친 말투로 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "740f6b4d-e060-4fed-b9f1-5ea14743f342"
msgid "{n}Kalikke bursts into tears.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 울음을 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0112_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "21c08440-c2eb-401e-b8e7-64a2285e084c"
msgid ""
"\"Nor do I. Allow them to part now, before there's even greater trouble.\""
msgstr "\"나 역시 아니다. 더 큰 문제가 생기기 전에 그들이 헤어지게 두어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d7700908-d16e-4a56-8efb-5a193d6a12cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah hugs her sobbing sister.{/n} \"Don't cry, you silly goat. This "
"has been a long time coming. And it ended the only way it could.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 흐느끼고 있는 칼리케를 안아줍니다.{/n} \"울지 마, 이 멍청아. 원래 이렇게 되었어야 할 일이야. 다른 방법이 없었어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0114_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "0f9265c3-f944-4fc5-9bc6-c1f9401cb6a2"
msgid ""
"\"It's so hard to understand you mortals... or perhaps you simply don't "
"understand yourself? Soon enough you will sigh in relief, Kalikke. You will "
"enjoy life without worrying what darkness your sister will drag you into. To "
"reconcile internal opposites is easy for a god, but too great a burden for "
"your shoulders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 필멸자를 이해하기가 힘들구나... 너희도 너희 자신을 이해하지 못하는 게 아니냐? 곧 너는 안도의 한숨을 쉴 것이다, 칼리케. "
"이제 네 언니가 항상 몰고다니던 어둠을 걱정할 필요 없이 행복하게 살 것이야. 내면의 대립을 중재하는 건 신의 일이다. 너에게는 감당할 "
"수 없는 큰 짐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0118_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ab998a0a-e9e4-42c8-982a-ed34fe63eb87"
msgid ""
"\"Don't try to stop me, {name}. It's too late – besides, you made this "
"decision when you fed the Sweet Teeth to the soul eater.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 막지 마, {name}. 이미 늦었어. 네가 단 것 중독자 아이들을 영혼 포식자에게 제물로 바쳤을 때, 넌 오늘 이 결정까지 "
"내렸던거나 다름없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0119_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "86b1bbd1-5521-4fc1-a7aa-f79ec7b1e042"
msgid ""
"\"You and your silly impulses again! Don't... don't sacrifice yourself, "
"Kalikke!\""
msgstr "\"너 또 충동적으로 행동하는구나! 너... 너 자신을 희생하지 마, 칼리케!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0120_Text
#. Speaker : Arcanotheign
msgctxt "24cac968-f4b6-461e-afb5-2814422051b3"
msgid ""
"\"She does what her nature tells her to do. As do you all. Alas, now I see – "
"a god can reconcile internal opposites. But mortal souls cannot withstand "
"such strain...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 본성대로 행동하고 있는 것이다. 너 역시 언제나 그러하듯이 말이다. 슬프도다, 이제야 알겠구나. 내면의 대립은 오직 신만이 "
"화합시킬 수 있다. 필멸자는 짊어질 수 없는 과업인 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0121_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "444b1429-1a60-4176-95fc-8f96c3beaafc"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke takes a step, touches her sister's cheek for a moment, warmly and "
"wistfully, then turns to the devil.{/n} \"I'm ready.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 한걸음 내딛고는 카네라의 뺨을 잠시 어루만집니다. 그 손길은 따뜻하면서도 간절합니다. 그녀는 데블 쪽으로 돌아섭니다.{/n}"
" \"준비 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0122_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "ada531cd-0c5d-400b-99ed-e0ad590596c1"
msgid ""
"\"Such a moving scene. I'm sorry to leave you here, Kanerah, on this piece "
"of land soon to be devoured by chaos, already nearly consumed by the First "
"World. But I might still collect your soul once you've died trying in vain "
"to protect it. This sweet parting may not last for long.\""
msgstr ""
"\"감동적인 장면이구나. 너만 이곳에 두고 가는 것이 유감이다, 카네라. 곧 혼돈이 이 땅을 집어삼킬 것이다. 이미 태초 세계가 이 땅을 "
"잠식하고 있지. 그리고 네가 이 땅을 지키고자 헛되이 노력하다 죽게 되면, 그 때 너의 영혼을 다시 회수하러 올 것이다. 이별은 잠깐에 "
"불과하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0126_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c38b17b9-6931-40e2-a71c-ef8a07a9b69f"
msgid "\"No!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0127_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ab6d91e9-318d-4c2e-96ef-1184e6f751f1"
msgid "\"No – never! You can't just give her away!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼, 절대로! 칼리케를 이렇게 보낼 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0128_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "ed385098-ce4d-4f7f-a397-05ca810afaab"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful. A claimant to my property removed themselves from the argument. "
"But strange as it may be, I'm not going to remove myself. And I guess I'm "
"going to get an entire bouquet of souls instead of just one...\""
msgstr ""
"\"멋지군. 내 재산을 자기 소유라고 주장하던 자가 드디어 그 주장을 철회했다니 말이야. 이상하게 들릴지 몰라도, 나는 내 주장을 물리지 "
"않을 것이다. 이제 영혼 하나 대신 저 둘 모두의 영혼을 챙길 수 있을 것 같거든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0129_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "945dd470-a993-430d-9fdc-e334ee109571"
msgid ""
"\"Come on, you silly goat. You can't defeat the Forefather, and the Lantern "
"King is drawing near. The kingdom is all but destroyed – there's trouble "
"everywhere... Don't worry, I'll be right at home in Hell!\" {n}Kanerah "
"chuckles boldly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"잘 생각해 봐, 이 멍청아. 너희는 선조를 이길 수 없어. 게다가 등불왕은 이미 목전에 와 있다고. 이 왕국은 파괴되고 말 거야. "
"어딜 가도 결국 말썽은 피할 수 없어... 걱정 마. 지옥이 나한테는 딱 맞을 테니까!\" {n}카네라가 겁없이 낄끽거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0130_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e63d7112-9573-4015-8753-46c269d9f204"
msgid ""
"\"It will be better this way, sister. It will be better. You cannot defeat "
"the Forefather in battle, and the Arcanotheign no longer protects us. The "
"people of this kingdom and {name} must not be made to suffer because of us. "
"Let Hell take me...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이렇게 되는 게 나아, 언니. 훨씬 나을 거야. 우리는 싸움으로는 선조를 이길 수 없어. 아르카노데인은 더 이상 우리를 보호해주지 "
"않고. 우리 때문에 이 왕국의 사람들과 {name}이 고통받게 해서는 안 돼. 그냥 날 지옥으로 가게 해줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0131_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "6db12d4b-236e-440b-8dc7-22b43b0bddbc"
msgid ""
"\"I must say – those who stay in this wasteland to be torn apart by the "
"First World, I do not fancy their chances. Let us go now, child. Many "
"interesting things await...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 장담하지. 이 황무지에 머무는 자들은 태초 세계의 손에 산산조각나고 말 것이다. 살아날 기회도 없이 말이다. 이제 가자, 딸아. "
"지옥에는 재미있는 일이 많단다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0132_Text
#. Speaker : Forefather_TaldanTowerFW
msgctxt "0e372245-f2ea-48ef-8571-7592b1ec4574"
msgid ""
"\"There's no way out, and everyone is unhappy. I couldn't have imagined a "
"better ending myself. Let us go now, child. Hell awaits!\""
msgstr "\"모두가 불행해지는 것 외에, 너희에게 다른 길은 없다. 나에게는 최선의 결말이지. 어서 가자, 딸아. 지옥이 기다린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0133_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "728ad46b-8779-42fd-9c03-82d081b65df5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I don't mind sparing the world of this scumbag. But why did you only "
"decide to do it now, {name}? After letting him kill my friends, being a part "
"of this...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 물론 난 이 엿같은 세상을 구하는데 관심이야 있지. 하지만 {name}, 왜 이제 와서야 그런 마음을 먹는거야? 너도 선조가 내 "
"친구들을 죽게 만든 이 계획에 발을 담갔으면서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0134_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e64ea9e9-5512-400d-b87a-a4805397643b"
msgid ""
"\"I see you like leaping into battle without much thinking. It's a pity "
"neither you or Kalikke think your actions through, risking those who don't "
"deserve it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 생각 없이 전투에 뛰어드는 타입이지. 너나 칼리케나, 죽어도 별 상관 없는 것들을 위한답시고 너희 행동을 그만둘 생각을 못하는 "
"게 안타까울 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0135_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7dbc2255-a1b9-4d3f-ada7-88d65923f32e"
msgid "\"No more tears! As if it was better to feed me to the soul eater!\""
msgstr "\"이제 그만 좀 울어! 차라리 영혼 포식자한테 먹히는게 나았겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0136_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f23a5c65-027a-432c-9136-5138439f777d"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah, please, enough. You survived the fight with the soul eater, "
"everything ended well. And now it will too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라, 부탁이야, 이제 그만! 언니는 영혼 포식자와의 싸움에서도 살아남았어. 모든 게 잘 끝났잖아. 지금도 그렇게 할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0143_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "00c429ac-6649-48e5-92ac-00c953f79836"
msgid ""
"\"Kalikke is just whining, like usual! She'll cry for a while, but the tears "
"will dry. Stop manipulating her, Forefather.\""
msgstr "\"칼리케는 언제나 그렇듯이 훌쩍기리는 것 뿐이야! 잠시는 울지 몰라도, 눈물은 곧 그쳐. 칼리케를 부추기지 마, 선조.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/DevilVsHerald/Cue_0144_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1e55fa08-c1d7-4b7f-a896-0ec16f965660"
msgid ""
"\"Hell no! Kanerah will understand that we did everything right, if you "
"would just stop manipulating her, you devil!\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대 안 돼! 네가 카네라를 조종하지만 않는다면, 이 데블 놈아! 카네라도 우리가 모든 일을 잘 해냈다는 걸 이해해줄거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "72ef3616-fa32-449c-a2be-5953563b3191"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, it's true. The world may be falling to chaos, but you're the one I "
"always want to see next to me. Always.\""
msgstr "\"그래, 맞아. 이 세상은 혼돈에 빠지겠지만, 그 때 내 곁에 네가 있어줬으면 좋겠어. 언제나 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "9f9ffeca-0d4a-4684-8435-87d01a4c57f7"
msgid ""
"You know, the only thing stopping me from asking you to become my wife and "
"consort right now is that I don't have a proper gift or any flowers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"있잖아, 지금 당장 내가 너에게 아내이자 동반자가 되어달라고 청혼하지 못하는 건 단지 적당한 꽃이나 선물이 없기 때문이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "a88848ad-327d-46ca-a071-596bd5f32115"
msgid "\"Forgive me, I can't return your love.\""
msgstr "\"용서해, 네 사랑은 못 돌려주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "0e3575f6-dc0e-43bd-b2aa-4aaa8f6cc0a8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm ready to call both of you my wives and consorts – right now, if you "
"like.\""
msgstr "\"너희 모두를 아내로 삼을 준비가 됐어. 너희가 허락해준다면, 지금 당장이라도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "eb0370e4-450b-44cb-a102-6f28b9478b21"
msgid "\"I can't imagine my life without you two.\""
msgstr "\"너희 없는 삶은 상상할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "935017a8-d388-4f02-8e6f-9de4bcc73378"
msgid "\"I see my future only with you, Kanerah.\""
msgstr "\"내 미래는 전부 네 거야, 카네라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "26e09228-82ef-4d87-ad67-bcfd49345899"
msgid "\"I see my future only with you, Kalikke.\""
msgstr "\"내 미래는 전부 네 거야, 칼리케.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "d618847c-60dd-4d48-ad3c-4d329789bcac"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to upset you, but the two of you and I have different paths "
"to follow.\""
msgstr "\"너희를 화나게 하고 싶지는 않지만, 너희와 나는 이제 다른 길로 갈라서야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "ca55e3f2-7abd-4028-97b7-cb5b057a5100"
msgid "[Kiss Kalikke]"
msgstr "[칼리케에게 키스합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "2a0f79aa-7fd5-4e9f-bbf8-8f937b029158"
msgid "[Hold Kalikke] \"Everything will be fine. I know it.\""
msgstr "[칼리케를 안습니다] \"모두 잘 될거야, 날 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "b3e4c26d-c59c-4237-9850-33a13c2511ee"
msgid "\"I couldn't find anyone better to be my consort, Kanerah.\""
msgstr "\"너야말로 내 아내가 되어 줄 사람이야, 카네라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "2329bddb-d560-4110-846f-cebfd21b845a"
msgid "\"I want you to stay by my side as my dearest treasure.\""
msgstr "\"가장 소중한 보물, 네가 늘 나의 곁에 있어주길 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "1b9aa33d-a371-46d9-b9d1-a4c1665d65aa"
msgid "\"I don't want to continue our relationship.\""
msgstr "\"우리 관계를 계속하고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "d042f287-4772-4b05-88e3-256cb18482af"
msgid "\"Marry me.\""
msgstr "\"나와 결혼해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "5338c638-13f3-46a6-9ead-4a9da78b976d"
msgid "\"I love you and I want us to be together always!\""
msgstr "\"너를 사랑해. 언제나 함께 있고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "76c7ef2b-a079-47f0-a42f-ba20c5a473d1"
msgid "\"Do you think he will really leave us alone?\""
msgstr "\"그가 정말로 우리를 이대로 내버려둘 거라고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c08950c1-8a01-419c-ab76-2e850d870280"
msgid "\"Is everything really... really over? And we are free?\""
msgstr "\"정말 모든게... 정말로 끝난 거야? 우리는 자유야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fe89857c-9680-4ea2-b065-f0f347ffa251"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke closes her eyes and stands still for a minute without saying a "
"word.{/n} \"My sister... my sister... We are now apart. Apart forever.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 눈을 감고 잠시 아무 말 없이 서있습니다.{/n} \"카네라... 언니... 우리는 이제 헤어지는구나. 영원히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5bfa992e-cde9-43b7-9011-cdf0866cbccd"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah stands still, in a daze quite out of character.{/n} \"She's gone! "
"My silly little sister is gone! And I will never see her again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 그녀답지 않게 멍한 눈으로 가만히 서있습니다.{/n} \"칼리케가 없어! 내 멍청한 여동생이 가버리다니! 이제 다시는 만날 "
"수 없겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "083484bf-eeff-4a8b-baa0-ac75fd058d3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke opens her eyes and looks at you.{/n} \"I've always known that "
"Kanerah and her soul belonged to Hell. I truly wish that I could save her "
"from this lot, but one cannot save a river from flowing into the sea. I... "
"well, it doesn't matter. I'm grateful to you, {name}, for everything you've "
"done for me. And more than anything in the world, I want to help you in "
"return. Let's go! The Lantern King and all his curses are nothing to us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 눈을 떠 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"카네라와 그 영혼이 지옥의 운명에서 벗어나지 못했다는 건 언제나 알고 있었어. 난 "
"진심으로 언니를 그 운명에서 구해내고 싶었지만, 강이 바다로 흘러가는 걸 막을 수 있는 사람은 없는 법이지. 나는... 아니, 이젠 "
"됐어. 고마워, {name}. 나에게 해준 모든 것이 말이야. 그리고 이제는 너를 도와주고 싶어. 가자! 등불왕과 그의 저주쯤은 아무 "
"것도 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7a4d5dbd-af81-4823-8bc0-3b743670662d"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke clenches her fists.{/n} \"I'll find a way to fix everything, even "
"if I have to go to Hell to do it! But not now. Now I wish to help you, {name}"
"! You came here to help me – and the least I can do is help you in return, "
"and face the Lantern King and his servants, by your side. Let's go!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 주먹을 쥡니다.{/n} \"난 반드시 모든 걸 바로잡을 방법을 찾고 말테야. 그러기 위해서 지옥에에 가야 한다고 해도! "
"하지만 아직은 아니야. 지금은 너를 돕고 싶어, {name}! 여기까지 나를 도우러 와줬잖아. 이제 나도 그 보답을 해야지. 네 곁에서 "
"등불왕과 그 졸개들에 맞설거야. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7003d637-2e89-46e8-864a-e6c484ea8d69"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah chuckles gloomily.{/n} \"I should have guessed that as soon as we "
"started making sacrifices, like the thick-headed Sweet Teeth, we'd reach a "
"moment like this sooner or later. Well, at least I'm now free from patrons – "
"both Hellish and divine. Now I can decide for myself what to do, the rest of "
"the world be damned. Thank you, {name} – you've risked so much to help me. "
"And I'm grateful for how this turned out!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 우울하게 웃음짓습니다.{/n} \"우리가 자신을 위해 남을, 그러니까 단 것 중독자 아이들 같은 멍청이들을 희생시키기 "
"시작했을 때 언젠가 이런 일이 생길 거라는 걸 짐작했어야 했나봐. 뭐, 적어도 난 지금 후원자들로부터는 해방됐지. 그게 지옥이든 신격이든 "
"말이야. 이제 내 운명은 내가 결정할 수 있어. 망할 놈의 세상은 엿이나 먹으라지. 고마워, {name}. 나를 돕기 위해 정말 많은 걸 "
"감수했잖아. 지금의 결과는 다 네 덕분이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "245340ba-ef33-4e17-b540-6c316c65cf84"
msgid ""
"\"How could we have let this happen? It's all right, I'll find a way to fix "
"everything! But first we must defeat the Lantern King and save your kingdom, "
"{name}...\" {n}Kanerah sighs, gathering herself.{/n} \"I know what gratitude "
"means. You came here for me, risking so much. And I in turn will help you in "
"your hour of need, whatever it takes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩌다 일이 이 지경이 되도록 내버려뒀을까? 괜찮아, 내가 모든 것을 바로잡을 방법을 찾겠어! 하지만 먼저 등불왕을 물리치고 왕국을 "
"구해야 해, {name}...\" {n}카네라는 정신을 가다듬으며 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"얼마나 고마운지 몰라. 네가 이 모든 위험을 "
"무릅쓰고 여기에 와주어서 말이야. 이제 네가 필요로 할 때 내가 너를 도와줄게, 무슨 일이 있더라도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7bcee7f2-4405-4d7c-a086-8598e55c6e58"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah chuckles gloomily.{/n} \"Well that's just great. Our poor great-"
"grandfather is dead! And just when I thought I might be playing him for a "
"new, better contract... Well, it is the end of one tale. But the world is "
"big. I'll find a place where I can be appreciated. Farewell, {name}, and "
"farewell sister! I'm leaving.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 우울하게 웃음짓습니다.{/n} \"정말 대단한 일이야. 우리 가여운 증조부가 드디어 죽었어! 내가 새 계약을 제시해서 "
"가지고 놀 생각을 하자마자 말이야... 자, 이제 이야기 하나가 끝난 것 뿐이야. 세상은 넓고 말이지. 나는 나를 인정해 줄 새로운 "
"장소를 찾을 거야. 고마워, {name}, 그리고 칼리케도 안녕! 난 이제 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "927c45cf-c5ed-4246-a641-cea837ed2f29"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke runs her hand across her forehead and sighs with relief, but "
"something in her manner makes you wary. She turns to her sister.{/n} "
"\"Kanerah, it's over. There is no soul eater, no devil to make our lives "
"miserable, and even the herald of Nethys seems to have lost interest in us. "
"Now you may live as you wish. I'm leaving.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 손으로 머리를 쓸어넘기며 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다. 그러나 당신은 그녀의 행동에서 뭔가 심상찮은 느낌을 받습니다. 그녀가 "
"카네라를 향합니다.{/n} \"카네라, 이제 끝났어. 이제 영혼 포식자도, 우리 인생을 비참하게 만들던 데블도 없지. 심지어 네서스의 "
"전령도 우리한테 흥미를 잃은 것 같으니까. 이제 언니도 원하는 대로 살 수 있어. 난 이제 떠날게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "825d5b3c-d4fa-4dd9-bc18-618c6441953a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah takes her sister by the hand and turns to you.{/n} \"{name}, you "
"followed us here, foregoing your own interests, enduring a curse and an "
"attack on your kingdom! This is... impressive.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 칼리케의 손을 잡고, 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"{name}, 너는 자신의 이익도 내팽개치고, 왕국에 대한 저주와 "
"공격을 견디면서까지 여기에 우리와 함께 해줬어! 이건 정말... 감동적이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2bf24302-68a5-47f7-b823-09f470118145"
msgid ""
"\"Free – what an interesting word! I think I've never even considered its "
"meaning...\""
msgstr "\"자유라, 얼마나 재미있는 단어인지! 난 자유란 말의 뜻도 궁금해본 적이 없는데 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "160fe975-0f5a-4c32-9649-c8424cf55eb4"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah, what are you up to? Everything is better now! The devil is gone, "
"and...\""
msgstr "\"카네라, 왜 그러는 거야? 이제 모든 게 괜찮아졌어! 데블도 없잖아, 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "250f164a-80e6-45ed-bd64-cf092ec22f8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah waves her hand angrily.{/n} \"Do you realize, you fool, that "
"you're still dancing to the tune of the devil we just defeated?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 화가 나서 손을 휘젓습니다.{/n} \"이 바보야, 네가 아직도 우리가 방금 물리친 데블의 손바닥에서 놀아나고 있다는 걸 "
"모르겠니?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "82f2dda3-17dc-4379-841e-48ed7f06075b"
msgid ""
"\"But you two are here.\" {n}Kanerah softens a little and looks at her "
"sister with hint of sadness.{/n} \"Kalikke, the Arcanotheign is right. We "
"are worse together. You have no nerve for my 'cold shrewdness'. And I'm "
"tired of your foolish tricks – which so often hurt me! You have {name}, a "
"wonderful patron who indulges your every whim. I want to find a better life "
"for myself as well. So farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 여기 너희 둘이 있잖아.\" {n}카네라의 말투가 약간 누그러집니다. 그녀는 동생을 슬픈 눈으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"칼리케"
", 아르카노데인이 옳았어. 우리가 함께 있으면 더 힘들어져. 너는 내 '냉철한 통찰력'을 못 견뎌하잖아. 나 역시 네 바보짓에 질렸어. "
"매번 나한테 상처만 주는! 너에겐 이제 {name}이 있잖아. 네 사소한 변덕까지도 받아주는 완벽한 후원자가. 나도 더 나은 삶을 "
"찾아나서겠어. 그럼 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8996f474-05ed-4272-9ac7-406a3870a8cc"
msgid ""
"\"The devil can only drive you in the right direction. But it wasn't he who "
"decided to turn my friends over to Sarenrae's fanatics. And it wasn't he who "
"fed them to the soul eater!\" {n}Kalikke exhales and seems to calm down.{/n} "
"\"I wish you all the best in the world, sister. But the Arcanotheign is "
"right – we're worse together than we are apart. You've found your place "
"here, protected by a mighty patron. And I have not. That's why I'm leaving – "
"to find my own people, and a place I can belong. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"데블은 단지 언니가 갈 방향을 정할 뿐이야. 하지만 내 친구들을 서렌레이의 광신도에게 넘겨주려한 게 데블은 아니었어. 또 내 친구들을 "
"영혼 포식자의 먹이로 던져준 것도 데블의 소행은 아니었지!\" {n}칼리케는 호흡을 가다듬습니다. 다소 진정한 것 같습니다.{/n} "
"\"언니에게 늘 좋은 일만 있기를 바라. 하지만 아르카노데인이 옳아. 우리는 떨어져 지내는 게 나아. 언니는 여기, 강력한 후원자의 보호 "
"아래 지낼 곳을 찾았지. 하지만 난 아니야. 그게 내가 떠나는 이유야. 나의 사람을, 내가 어울릴 수 있는 장소를 찾아나설 거야. 잘 "
"지내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5749e1c5-9728-4d4b-8f81-334146732176"
msgid ""
"\"What else could he do? If the Arcanotheign were merely a powerful "
"supernatural being, he might fight her. But to attack the herald of a god, "
"especially one so unpredictable as Nethys... even so much as to oppose a "
"decision she's made – that's not the smartest move, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 달리 무얼 할 수 있었겠어? 아르카노데인이 단순히 강력한 초자연적 존재에 불과했다면 선조도 싸워봤을 거야. 하지만 신의 전령, "
"그것도 네서스처럼 예측할 수 없는 신의 전령을 공격하는 건... 아니, 공격은 고사하고 그냥 그녀의 결정에 반대하는 것 조차도 영리한 "
"행동은 아니지, 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2448df84-11d8-4141-84f1-8850c43ab50e"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah is trying to say we are forever grateful! From now on, your grief "
"is our grief, and your foe is our foe. – Not because we need a patron, but "
"because no one is dearer to us than you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라가 말하려던 건 우리가 영원히 고마워할거란 거였어! 지금부터, 네 슬픔은 우리의 슬픔이고, 네 원수도 우리의 원수가 될 거야. "
"후원자가 필요해서가 아니라 우리에게 네가 가장 소중하기 때문이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "30ef1df4-9d33-4db8-96f9-85560015c0b9"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah chuckles gloomily.{/n} \"Well, sister. Shall we try to keep on "
"living without gnawing at each other?\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 우울하게 웃음짓습니다.{/n} \"그럼, 동생아. 우리 서로를 괴롭히지 않고 지내도록 노력해볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "aa3d8cde-a9c7-48f7-bb73-904a400f62b4"
msgid ""
"\"Let's do this. {name}, thank you for giving us a chance. It's up to us how "
"we use it. And now – let's go. A far darker battle awaits us...\""
msgstr ""
"\"해보겠어. {name}, 우리에게 기회를 줘서 고마워. 그 기회를 어떻게 사용할지는 이제 우리에게 달린 일이지. 그럼 가자. 훨씬 더 "
"암울한 전투가 우리를 기다리고 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b3a36cbe-3103-4b06-a9bd-55e6c54432cc"
msgid ""
"\"There is something else we need to discuss…\" {n}Kanerah pushes her sister "
"forward expressively.{/n} \"Come on, you silly goat. Speak!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이야기하고 싶은 게 또 있는데...\" {n}카네라가 칼리케를 의미심장하게 앞으로 밉니다.{/n} \"어서, 이 바보 멍청아. "
"말하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d072e97c-f623-49b9-95c9-3ae22824b5c8"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke takes a deep breath, like she's about to dive into frigid "
"water.{/n} \"Listen, {name}... It's probably not the right time for this, "
"but we might never get another chance. Everything around us is falling into "
"chaos, and you probably have other things on your mind...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 마치 차가운 물로 뛰어들기라도 하는 것마냥 숨을 깊이 들이쉽니다.{/n} \"저기, {name}... 이런 얘기를 하기 "
"좋은 때는 아니겠지만, 다음에 얘기할 기회는 없을 것 같아서. 모든 게 혼돈 속으로 빠져들고 있고, 너도 늘 다른 고민거리가 많을 테니까 "
"말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4aaa8533-3f9e-4e51-aec1-8ed1533c3a0d"
msgid ""
"\"What a story! This is madness... Can you take a minute for me, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"대단한 이야기구나! 미쳤어... 잠깐 생각할 시간 좀 줄래, {name}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "361d4a9f-a554-4247-87cf-242e5afab0d1"
msgid "\"No. Why now? I can't, I…\""
msgstr "\"아니. 왜 지금이야? 그럴 수 없어. 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c8ef23ac-7941-453c-81da-91f2a8277f5f"
msgid ""
"\"You silly goat – don't make me mad. We only just patched things up! If you "
"don't say it, I will.\""
msgstr "\"이 멍청이가... 성질나게 하지 마. 우리 방금 화해했잖아! 네가 말 안할거면 내가 할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "91ed8b57-6b37-45c8-b6d0-ea0417d55815"
msgid ""
"\"No! Fine... I'll say it. Listen, {name}. I've stopped myself from thinking "
"about the future for so long that now I can barely find words. But I'm not "
"afraid to admit it – you're more to me than just a friend or patron.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니! 괜찮아... 내가 말할게. {name}, 난 오랫동안 앞날에 대해 생각하는 걸 포기했었어. 그래서 앞날에 대해 뭐라 말해야 "
"할지 잘 모르겠어.하지만 이걸 인정하는 게 두렵진 않아. 너는 나에게 단지 친구나 후원자 이상이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "cfa07019-6b49-44bd-958c-25f48b0c7510"
msgid ""
"\"But I just wanted to say... I've been trying not to think about love, "
"happiness, and the future – for a very long time. But now, thanks to you, "
"the shadows of my past don't own me any more. For years, I felt like I've "
"been living with a noose around my neck, but now it's finally gone. You've "
"told me before that I'm more to you than just a friend and companion. "
"Please, tell me – is it still true?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 내가 말하고 싶던 건... 아주 오랫동안 나는 사랑, 행복, 미래 같은 건 아예 생각하지 않으려 해왔어. 하지만 지금은 너 "
"덕분에 더 이상 과거의 그림자에 연연하지 않게 되었지. 지난 몇 년 동안 내 삶이 꼭 목에 올가미를 채운 것 같은 느낌이었다면, 이제 그 "
"올가미는 모두 사라졌어. 전에 너는 내가 친구나 동료 이상의 존재라고 말해준 적이 있잖아. 궁금해, 지금도 그렇니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2e1b3b1e-c297-4733-9fdf-b2623e2f280a"
msgid ""
"\"But I'll be honest, I don't think we can be close any more. Once we've "
"dealt with the Lantern King, I'll go my separate way. I don't think you'll "
"be too upset about that, will you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 솔직히 말해서, 나는 우리가 더 가까워질 수 없다고 생각해. 우리가 등불왕을 처리하고 나면, 나는 너와는 다른 길로 가겠어. "
"많이 화내지는 않을거지, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b5b94f3d-d4d0-4a21-af9c-ce506eb738f4"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to tell you something, {name}. Since you and Nyrissa are so cozy "
"now, I guess I'll step out of your way. Otherwise I'll wake up one day "
"choked by vines!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네게 말하고 싶은 게 있어, {name}. 너와 나이리사는 이제 친밀한 사이잖아. 내가 빠져줄게. 가 친해진 이후 나는 너에게서 "
"떠나기로 했어.안그랬다가는 자다가 나무덩굴로 목이 졸리기라도 할 것 같단 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "41fe6f52-0ee5-4258-9a7c-aeda15598620"
msgid ""
"\"And where's the poem? I was expecting a poetic declaration of love! Well, "
"{name}, you once told Kalikke you couldn't live without both of us. Now that "
"devils and soul eaters aren't hunting us any more, and we only need to "
"defeat an overreaching fey lord, isn't it time we think about our future "
"together?\""
msgstr ""
"\"시는 도대체 어디 있어? 나는 사랑의 시로 고백하는 걸 기대했단 말이야! {name}, 너는 언젠가 칼리케에게 우리 둘 없이는 살 수 "
"없을 것 같다고 했지. 이제는 더 이상 우리를 쫓는 데블도, 영혼 포식자도 없고, 저 주제넘게 구는 페이 군주만 물리치면 돼. "
"지금이야말로 우리 함께 미래에 대해 생각해볼 시간이 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "545fa036-3a8f-4c0d-af43-fbf32a8440ad"
msgid "{n}Kalikke quivers but finds nothing to say.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 몸을 떨지만 달리 할 말을 찾지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8935ed86-405c-4198-a771-dd3c573c1baa"
msgid ""
"\"Are you serious?! Pff! We'll help you with the Lantern King, like we "
"promised. But don't you come knocking on my bedroom door again! Let's go, "
"silly goat.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진심이야?! 흥! 약속은 약속이니까 등불왕을 물리치는 건 돕겠어. 하지만 다시는 내 침실 문턱을 넘을 생각도 말라고! 가자, 멍청이 "
"동생아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a126a6d3-b758-4ddc-8073-485b23884698"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! You really think you can just blow smoke in my "
"sister's eyes, and then leave her! – And I'll just swallow it?!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어! 방금 내 동생한테 헤어지자 해서 애를 울려 놓고, 나보고 그 자리를 메꾸라고? 진심으로 하는 소리야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "44562347-835e-4cdc-92d2-e48ba57019b5"
msgid ""
"\"And you say this after everything that happened between you and Kanerah?\" "
"{n}Kalikke stops, stunned.{/n} \"Whatever my feelings for you might be, I "
"won't let you treat my sister like this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방금 카네라와 그렇게 되자마자 나한테 이 얘기를 한단 말이야?\" {n}칼리케는 충격을 받은 듯 말을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"너에 대한 "
"내 감정이 어떤지를 떠나서, 네가 우리 언니를 이런 식으로 대하게 할 수는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fa86ea6f-6007-4ac4-8202-e931d2335c0c"
msgid ""
"\"You see, Kalikke, there was nothing to be afraid of!\" {n}Kanerah speaks "
"very confidently, but her eyes flash suspiciously.{/n}"
msgstr "\"봐, 칼리케. 무서워할 것 없다니까!\" {n}카네라는 자신에 차서 말하지만, 눈빛에서 의심을 감추지는 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3bd141b0-4bb2-4bf3-832d-4326c52aec93"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel the tears rolling down Kalikke's cheeks and onto her lips, and "
"yours. But she returns your kiss with tenderness and passion.{/n} \"Let's "
"go. We must fight for our home...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 칼리케의 뺨에 눈물이 흘러 그녀의 입술, 그리고 당신의 입술 위로 흐르는 것을 느낍니다. 하지만 그녀는 부드럽고도 열정적으로 "
"당신의 키스에 답합니다.{/n} \"가자. 이제 우리의 집, 우리의 고향을 위해 싸울 시간이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5f79ecdb-c045-4505-983a-6a438e67f297"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke grasps your hand, and her sister's.{/n} \"We are together, and we "
"will do whatever it takes. There's nothing I'm afraid of now. And you "
"shouldn't be either!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 한 손으로는 당신의 손을, 다른 손으로는 카네라의 손을 쥡니다.{/n} \"우리는 함께야. 그리고 무슨 일이든 견뎌낼 "
"거야. 이제 나는 아무 것도 두렵지 않아. 우리는 두렵지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "97996734-57d1-4ec4-91d7-22bfeeca5bd5"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke buries her face in her hands.{/n} \"I'm going to cry now. Stop "
"it, Kalikke, not now! I'll surely cry later – but only after we've won, and "
"everything is fine.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 손으로 얼굴을 감쌉니다.{/n} \"지금 울어버리고 싶어. 그만, 칼리케, 지금은 아니야! 우는 건 미뤄두겠어. 우리가 "
"승리해서, 모든 것이 괜찮아질 때 까지는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e96b36fc-8b27-4207-8e73-4385e2183550"
msgid ""
"\"That's horrible! A silly goat as consort? I'm terrified to imagine what "
"she'll do with this already miserable kingdom. Go on, you silly goat – say "
"yes! Don't disappoint me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"끔찍하네! 이 바보가 왕후라고? 왕후께서 안 그래도 형편없는 이 왕국에 무슨 짓을 더 저지를지 생각만 해도 겁나는걸. 어서, 이 "
"바보야, 좋다고 해! 날 실망시키지 말고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "df9d91af-632d-4164-9af1-72cb6a15e5ae"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl holds you close.{/n} \"Please, let's not linger! Now that I have "
"something to lose, I'm so scared. I want to see you and our home safe – as "
"soon as possible...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 당신을 끌어안습니다.{/n} \"자, 이제 기뻐하는 건 여기까지만이야. 이제 잃어버릴 무언가가 생겼다는 게 두려워. 너와, "
"함께할 우리의 집이 안전해지는 걸 한시라도 빨리 보고 싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "90420827-0769-4f29-ab13-c02a99894926"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke sighs heavily.{/n} \"It's just as I expected. I'm sorry... sorry "
"for bothering you!\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"예상한 대로구나. 미안해... 귀찮게 해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6191c058-dafe-4eae-8cc9-c8f2d8bf8a72"
msgid ""
"\"It's amazing. There's chaos all around – the First World is devouring your "
"poor kingdom... So why do I feel so incredibly strong and free? Is it "
"because I've finally cast off the burden of the past? Or is it that I'm "
"madly in love?\" {n}Kanerah takes your hand and squeezes until it hurts.{/n} "
"\"Tell me. Say something!\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀랍네. 지금은 혼란의 시기잖아. 태초세계는 가엾은 네 왕국을 집어삼키려 들고 있고... 그런데 왜 나는 더 강해지고 자유로워 진 것 "
"같은 기분이 드는 걸까? 과거의 짐을 떨쳐버려서? 아니면 사랑에 너무나 깊이 빠져서?\" {n}카네라는 당신의 손을 아프도록 "
"움켜쥡니다.{/n} \"말해봐. 아무 말이라도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fa9a0e2a-90c3-47ba-8efa-94e981f6eda2"
msgid ""
"\"I want to discuss something now, because later we'll either be dead and "
"it'll be too late, or we'll be victorious, and then it might seem "
"irrelevant... But I remember our conversation at the capital. You offered me "
"an alliance, and told me how much we would be able to achieve together. Now "
"I'm no longer burdened by my past, and I want to ask you – does that offer "
"still stand? Please know, I'll follow you all the way, regardless of your "
"answer... but fighting a fey lord with some prospects in mind would be much "
"more pleasant!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 좀 이야기하고 싶은게 있어. 우리 둘 다 죽은 뒤라면 너무 늦을 테고, 우리가 완전히 승리한 뒤라면 그것대로 좀 부적절할 것 "
"같거든... 난 수도에서 우리가 이야기했던 걸 기억해. 너는 동료가 되자고 하면서, 우리가 동료가 되면 얼마나 많은 걸 이뤄낼 수 있을지 "
"이야기했었어. 이제 과거의 짐은 떨쳐버렸으니, 너에게 다시 묻고 싶어. 제안은 아직 유효한 거야? 네 대답과 상관 없이, 나는 언제까지나 "
"너를 따를거야... 하지만 페이 군주와 싸울 때 마음 속에 작은 소망이 있다면 훨씬 더 기쁘겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6609d334-5d58-4c96-a995-b75a5cdeb283"
msgid ""
"{n}True Hellish fire flares in Kanerah's eyes.{/n} \"And you only say this "
"now!? All right then. I hope you don't expect me to beg – because I won't. "
"The conversation is over!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라의 눈에서 진짜배기 지옥불이 활활 타오르는 듯 합니다.{/n} \"지금 할 말이 고작 그거야? 좋아. 내가 매달릴 거라고 "
"생각하지는 마, 그럴 일은 없을테니. 대화는 끝이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e3617cf7-d900-4d88-a7ce-d7266af79b10"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling smiles triumphantly.{/n} \"Wonderful. I'll prove that you "
"were right about me. And now let's go fight – for OUR kingdom!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 승리의 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"멋져. 네가 옳았다는 걸 증명하겠어. 이제 가서 싸우자. 우리의 왕국을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2d72bab8-7376-4793-9418-b1a30300d54f"
msgid ""
"\"Then we only have to do one thing – protect our kingdom! And I'm ready. "
"I'll prove that you were right about me!\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 이제 할 일은 하나야. 우리의 왕국을 지키자! 그리고 난 준비됐어. 네가 옳았다는 걸 증명하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f8d25457-40a5-426c-8e9b-00c648fa08bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah opens her eyes wide.{/n} \"Listen, there's just one serious "
"obstacle. A crown would never fit over these horns!\" {n}The girl's "
"glistening eyes give her away, despite the laughter in her voice. She takes "
"a step forward and buries her face in your chest.{/n} \"You'd better not die "
"now and lose everything to that Lantern scumbag. I've died before, so I know "
"what's it like... and I don't want to do it again. So let's go and show him "
"what we can do – for us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 눈을 크게 뜹니다.{/n} \"들어봐, 진짜 문제가 하나 있다니까. 이 뿔에 맞는 왕관은 없을 텐데 어쩌지!\" {n}"
"목소리의 웃음기에도 불구하고, 그녀의 반짝이는 눈빛은 많은 것을 이야기하고 있습니다. 그녀가 한 걸음 다가와 당신의 가슴에 얼굴을 "
"파묻습니다.{/n} \"지금 죽어서는 안 돼. 그 등불왕 개자식에게 모든 걸 빼앗겨서도. 난 전에 한 번 죽어봐서 죽는 기분이 어떤지 잘 "
"알아... 그래서 다시는 죽고 싶지 않아. 그러니, 가서 우리가 할 수 있는 걸 그 녀석에게 보여주자, 우리 자신을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Q3_Ambivalence/TwinsRejoinOrLeave/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "46765862-64f5-4e87-a676-0ce27f11632d"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah sighs loudly, then raises her hand and shoots a torrent of fire "
"into the air.{/n} \"Great. Now I'm ready for that Lantern King! I'll turn "
"him to cinders for daring to hurt you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 크게 한숨을 쉬고는 손을 들어 허공에 연달아 불을 쏟아냅니다.{/n} \"좋아. 이제 등불왕을 상대해야겠지! 감히 너를 "
"해치려드는 그런 녀석은 잿더미로 만들어버리고 말겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7a92fc05-04be-4de6-b11a-91de386a8bea"
msgid "\"Of course. What would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"물론. 알고 싶은게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "bbc590a7-325a-4290-adc2-a71b99dcb779"
msgid "\"I'm sorry, I'm not in the mood to talk.\""
msgstr "\"미안, 나는 얘기할 기분이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "49f73354-02a8-4069-9e91-fe4165187a76"
msgid ""
"\"Kalikke, I would sacrifice much for you – even the 'darkness of the soul' "
"as you put it.\""
msgstr "\"칼리케, 너를 위해서라면 더 많은 것도 희생할 수도 있어. 네가 말한 '영혼의 어둠'까지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "f8f41460-ba3c-49f3-a700-4105e3483738"
msgid ""
"\"Just because I'm cruel to enemies and strangers doesn't mean I treat my "
"companions the same way.\""
msgstr "\"적들에게 잔인하게 군다고 해서 그게 내가 동료한테까지도 잔인하게 대한다는 뜻은 아니잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c1057ed0-8bb5-4b4b-a6e0-15b2bd7989ec"
msgid "Told Kalikke that she is a mere tool to you."
msgstr "당신에게 칼리케는 단지 도구에 불과하다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "bf1e03db-862a-4bc9-b28f-26bca025e34f"
msgid ""
"\"You are useful to me, that's all. I look after you the way one looks after "
"a useful tool.\""
msgstr "\"너는 쓸모가 많지만, 그게 다야. 내가 널 아끼는건 단지 사람들이 유용한 도구를 아끼는 것과 같을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b06a82d0-0ce3-4d68-8f16-bbdf9d99ccd7"
msgid ""
"\"Kalikke, you are precious. I could never let anything bad happen to you. "
"I'd face even the cruelest villain to protect you.\""
msgstr "\"칼리케, 너는 정말 소중해. 너에게 나쁜 일이 일어나게 둘 수 없어. 어떤 잔인한 악당과 맞서서라도 널 지킬게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a988ff55-8b7d-4674-9f05-0a4fafbae9f7"
msgid "Told Kalikke that you count her among your close friends."
msgstr "칼리케에게 그녀는 당신의 가장 소중한 친구 중 하나라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "a9ca4d97-eff1-4e69-a110-e67c43a184a3"
msgid "\"Of course I look after you! We're friends.\""
msgstr "\"물론 나는 너를 도와줄거야. 우리는 친구니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "bf6e2865-74e6-4b0f-b873-68c241e58e10"
msgid "Told Kalikke that you count her among your companions."
msgstr "칼리케에게 그녀는 당신의 동료 중 하나라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "07aec83e-9ead-4fb6-81e5-18a302256c78"
msgid "\"I am loyal to my companions.\""
msgstr "\"나는 동료들에게 신의를 지키는 사람이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "34237f09-b397-4fc7-8b63-e398e3426183"
msgid ""
"\"What if it's because you're special to me? I'd do almost anything for you, "
"Kalikke.\""
msgstr "\"어때, 네가 특별한 존재이기 때문이라면? 널 위해서라면 어떤 일이라도 할 수 있어, 칼리케.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "126dcf4a-ce95-4be0-a6d1-8c3c18320f39"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke approaches you silently, raises her hand to capture your "
"attention, but then stumbles in hesitation.{/n} \"{name}! Not that it's "
"important, but I'd like to ask you something…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 당신에게 조용히 다가옵니다. 그녀는 손을 들어 당신의 주의를 끌려다 잠시 망설입니다.{/n} \"{name}! 그렇게 "
"중요한 건 아니지만, 너에게 묻고 싶은 게 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1c48e26e-9bef-4054-b965-15ba3d852fe9"
msgid ""
"\"It's nothing specific, I just wanted to chat. Oh, I better just start from "
"the beginning! You see, most of my life I used to think my sister and I were "
"special – the kind they write about in books. Sometimes I imagined we were "
"characters in a fairy tale with a happy ending, and at other times I "
"imagined it was a tragedy about proud and downtrodden souls. All the bad "
"things that happened to us as we fled Qadira, they only strengthened these "
"silly thoughts. – It's hard to stop imagining things about yourself, when "
"the Herald of a god answers your call!\""
msgstr ""
"\"별 건 아니고, 그냥 수다나 떨까 해서. 그래도 차근차근 얘기하는 게 낫겠지! 난 오랫동안 언니와 내가 아주 특별한 존재라고 "
"생각해왔어. 옛날 이야기의 주인공들처럼 말이야. 가끔은 우리가 행복한 결말로 끝나는 동화의 주인공이 되는 상상도 하고, 어떤 때에는 "
"당당히 불운에 맞서 싸우는 비극의 주인공이 되는 상상도 했지. 카디라에서 도망치며 많은 불행을 겪고 나니까, 오히려 이런 망상만 더 "
"심해졌어. 청원을 들어주러 현실에 강림한 신의 사자를 만나보고 나면 누구라도 그렇겠지만 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "03429f39-9349-4f60-957c-b3c58b6d7cb0"
msgid ""
"\"But then I met you and…\" {n}Kalikke is obviously embarrassed.{/n} \"You "
"know, now I really see what it means to be an outstanding person. You change "
"the world around you. Thanks to you, an entire country has appeared from "
"nothing. Just think of it – in ten years, there will be children saying, 'I "
"come from {kingdomname}!' Forgive me if I'm babbling on, but I really want "
"to understand – who are you? What drives you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그 때 너를 만났고...\" {n}칼리케는 어딘지 거북해 보입니다.{/n} \"이제는 위대한 사람이 된다는 게 어떤 의미인지 "
"알겠어. 너는 세상을 바꾸고 있잖아. 아예 존재하지 않던 나라가, 오로지 너 덕분에 역사에 등장했지. 생각해 봐. 앞으로 10년이면 "
"이렇게 말할 아이도 자라나 있을거야. '나는 {kingdomname} 사람이야!'라고. 미안, 내가 너무 횡설수설했구나. 하지만 난 정말 "
"궁금해. 너는 대체 어떤 사람이니? 뭐가 이 모든 걸 이뤄내도록 만든거니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f46dbaee-49de-443e-ac30-a2aad21db8d5"
msgid ""
"\"I know you're no stranger to kindness and honor. But still I'm amazed that "
"you would show such kindness to me, a tiefling, a rootless outlander. And "
"not only to me, but also to those who I hold dear. Even though we've brought "
"you so much trouble!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 친절하고 명예를 중시하는 사람이라는 건 당연히 알지. 하지만 네가 나 같은 근본없는 떠돌이 티플링하테까지 그런 친절함을 보여주는 "
"건 정말 놀라워. 나 뿐만 아니라 내가 아끼는 사람들 한테도 그랬고. 심지어는 우리 때문에 이렇게나 많은 문제에 시달렸는데도 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3e9ebcc5-da42-4c83-8a1c-2034d39cdeaa"
msgid ""
"\"I'm amazed that neither darkness nor light prevails in you. – Perhaps "
"that's just an illusion? You were so kind to me and my friends, though we "
"brought you so much trouble…\""
msgstr ""
"\"빛도, 어둠도 모두 너를 사로잡지 못했다는 게 놀라워. 내가 잘 못 본 건 아닐까? 네가 나와 내 친구들에게, 그 모든 골칫거리에도 "
"불구하고 너무 친절히 대해 줘서 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7f43e606-797b-49b8-9b7d-a2a8ecc7ca84"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry if this offends you, but your soul seems dark to me, and your "
"deeds seem cruel. But you're so caring towards me and those who are dear to "
"me. Why is that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"미안. 듣기 불편한 얘기일 수도 있겠지만, 내가 봤을 때 네 영혼은 어둠에 사로잡혀 있고, 네 행동도 잔인하기 짝이 없어. 그런데도 "
"너는 나와 내 친구들에게는 친절하게 대해주잖아. 이유가 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5f14fb62-cae6-4aad-95d9-bf8a6fcc63a4"
msgid "\"Fine.\" {n}Kalikke nods meekly.{/n} \"Forgive me for bothering you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\" {n}칼리케는 온화하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"귀찮게 해서 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "79d525bf-759b-46ce-b56b-96fc99e584d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke smiles a dreamy and sad smile.{/n} \"You really are amazing, "
"{name}. I owe you so much – and I've seen and learned so much, all thanks to "
"you! I could probably even fall in love with you, but... I still remember "
"too well how I brought death to Kanerah, and almost lost the Sweet Teeth. "
"Death follows me wherever I go, and takes away everything I care for. I "
"can't imagine a future in front of me. I remember the past too well. – And "
"it tells me, don't get attached.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 꿈꾸는 것 같은 슬픈 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"너는 정말 놀라워, {name}. 너에게 너무나 많은 빚을 졌고, 너 "
"덕분에 많은 것을 목격하고 또 배울 수 있었어. 심지어 너와 사랑에 빠졌을 수도 있었겠지만... 나 때문에 카네라가 죽고, 단 것 중독자 "
"아이들까지도 거의 잃어버릴 뻔한 기억이 너무나 뚜렷해. 내가 어디를 가든 죽음이 따라와서, 내가 아끼던 모든 걸 앗아가지. 미래는 감히 "
"상상할 수도 없는데, 과거는 내게 너무나 선명해. 그리고 과거가 내게 말하지. 누구와도 관계를 맺지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b15c3820-cae1-47d2-b9e2-e70c414cbb4a"
msgid ""
"{n}A smile blossoms on Kalikke's face.{/n} \"I'm so happy to hear that! Just "
"to know that you have a friend – that's true happiness. Especially when it's "
"someone like you. Thank you for your time. Sometimes I do like to chat!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케의 얼굴에 웃음꽃이 핍니다.{/n} \"그 말을 들으니 너무 기뻐! 친구가 생기는 거야말로 진짜 행복이고, 특히 그게 너 같은 "
"친구라면 더 그렇겠지. 시간 내줘서 고마워. 가끔은 이렇게 수다 떠는게 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8239e95d-386b-41e3-b427-48306a95f2bf"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. Well, I guess I found out what I wanted. Forgive me for "
"bothering you, and thank you for your honesty!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지. 이제 궁금하던 걸 알게 된 것 같아. 괴롭혀서 미안. 그리고 솔직하게 말해줘서 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KalikkeInitialEvent/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3bbe6a3e-30e8-4130-ae73-eb5b44454b56"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your kindness.\" {n}Kalikke opens her mouth, as if meaning "
"to say something else, but doesn't dare, and quietly walks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"친절하게 대해줘서 고마워.\" {n}칼리케는 무언가 더 말하려는 듯 입을 열지만 결국 말을 꺼내지 못하고 조용히 걸어나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "50660ba4-8e56-4a0e-ac7b-84b7ae456ae5"
msgid "\"What were you haggling about?\""
msgstr "\"대체 뭘 흥정하고 있었던거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "892e6ece-0f18-4df3-a9c4-4013874678c1"
msgid ""
"\"I'd think you can find at least one more deserving object of your "
"flirtations around here...\""
msgstr "\"난 네가 이 주변에서 집적거릴 상대 하나 쯤은 더 찾아낼 줄 알고 있었지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "413b5671-d4c2-49b0-9d79-594cf9d627c3"
msgid "\"Will you take a walk with me?\""
msgstr "\"잠시 나와 걷지 않을래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "79b95ce5-29bc-458c-a51e-5ec3d0d5a2d7"
msgid "\"I'm sorry I can't keep you company. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 널 계속 동료로 두지 못하겠어. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "27f74f9d-04e4-46e4-a14d-7d40123753f2"
msgid "\"I definitely do not count modesty among my flaws.\""
msgstr "\"나에게도 결점은 있겠지만, 그 중에도 겸손함 같은 건 절대 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "415abd51-357e-47ae-946e-1f9b661d3dee"
msgid "\"I prefer calling things what they are.\""
msgstr "\"난 뭐든지 사실 그대로 얘기하는게 좋아\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d156cb2e-72aa-4360-a1f4-1e7238b4f35b"
msgid "\"You misunderstood me. Let's end this conversation.\""
msgstr "\"날 오해한 거 같아. 대화는 그만하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a885621d-df5e-41ab-853f-fd2ac3ae9736"
msgid "\"I'd gladly accept the invitation. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"초대를 기꺼이 받아줄게. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "766358c5-e143-489f-9309-3b3163615b35"
msgid "\"But why? I like you. I don't want to keep it a secret.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 왜? 나는 네가 좋아. 그걸 비밀로 하고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "ddc17cb2-8f5e-42d1-ba3c-91257aed670d"
msgid "\"Fine. A secret it is then.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 그럼 비밀로 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "6b67e1d6-182b-4660-86a2-782fac44be44"
msgid "\"I can't have that.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "74ed8dc8-d5b7-449a-a924-8207f598ff69"
msgid ""
"\"It's all because of a certain pretty tiefling lady. For her I'm ready to "
"walk day and night!\""
msgstr "\"어떤 아리따운 티플링 아가씨 때문이야. 그 여성분을 위해서라면 하루 종일이라도 걸을 수 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9792dbb0-9cf5-45dd-bcd3-af3fb85cc467"
msgid ""
"\"Eight coins?! Eight?! Look me in the eye, honorable Hassuf. Like black "
"clouds hide the shining sun, that price steals the joy from my soul and the "
"smile from my face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"동전 여덟 개?! 여덟 개라고?! 내 눈을 잘 보라고, 고귀하신 하수프 양반. 먹구름이 빛나는 태양을 가리듯이, 그 가격이 내 "
"영혼에서 즐거움을 앗아가고, 내 얼굴에서 웃음을 훔쳐가고 있단 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FirstVendor_Prosperous
msgctxt "cebdad08-34fe-4e41-b4f6-7dcfd9af76df"
msgid ""
"\"I would pluck the moon from the sky for your smile, oh beautiful daughter "
"of the desert. But as long as I stand on this side of the counter, no one's "
"charm is going to cloud my judgment. Eight gold coins and not one coin less."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아름다운 사막의 따님, 그대 웃음을 위해서라면 하늘의 달도 따다 주겠소만. 그러나 내가 계산대 이 편에 서있는 한, 누구의 어떠한 "
"매력도 내 판단을 흐리게 할 수는 없지. 동전 여덟 개, 한 푼도 못 깎아드리겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fb55a1b6-4b2b-4987-a4ac-584b9afb966a"
msgid ""
"\"You are so cruel...\" {n}Kanerah notices you and smiles warmly.{/n} \"Now "
"I'll leave you alone to your heartlessness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 잔인하시네...\" {n}카네라는 당신이 온 것을 알아채곤 따뜻하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그럼 나는 이제 가볼테니 잘 먹고 잘 "
"살라고, 장사꾼 양반!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "33c4dea0-6390-4f84-a875-281848b571a5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh Hassuf, shrewdest of merchants! – I like it though. I like people who "
"know which side of their bread is buttered.\" {n}Kanerah almost purrs with "
"pleasure, looking around playfully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하수프, 정말 약삭빠른 장사꾼 같으니! 뭐, 그게 맘에 들기는 해. 나는 자기 빵의 어느 쪽에 버터가 발려 있는지 아는 사람이 좋거든."
"\" {n}카네라는 유쾌하게 주위를 둘러보며, 즐겁게 떠들고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "61f082ac-18ef-4e3d-a68f-0c5adbf94292"
msgid ""
"\"Some trinket – I don't even remember what it looks like! I just like "
"haggling with Hassuf. It's like a little game... and a little like flirting."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그냥 장신구야. 사실은 어떻게 생겼었는지 기억도 잘 안 나! 난 하수프랑 흥정하는게 좋아. 꼭 놀이 같기도 하고... 약간은 서로 "
"추근덕대는 것 같기도 하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4486e036-bb41-46a4-ab89-de43a9e56215"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah looks at you coyly from under her lashes.{/n} \"And who might "
"that be? I'm quite at a loss... Surely you can't mean yourself? That "
"wouldn't be modest at all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 치켜뜬 눈썹 아래로 수줍게 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그럼 누굴 말하는 걸까? 나는 잘 모르겠는걸... 그게 너 자신을 "
"말하는 건 아니겠지? 겸손이라고는 조금도 없으시네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "eeca87c3-e204-43ff-aaa6-c5e464b0135f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah doesn't even try to hide her disappointment.{/n} \"Our "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} is always so busy... Well, I'll go look for "
"someone else to tease!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 실망한 표정을 숨기지 않습니다.{/n} \"우리 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕} 전하께서는 늘 바쁘시다니깐... 그럼 다른 "
"사람이나 괴롭혀야겠네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "70023dda-f421-4627-806b-d59cd8ceb371"
msgid ""
"\"Are you not tired of walking all the time? After chasing all those "
"monsters and bandits through the nearby swamps...\""
msgstr "\"맨날 걸어다니는게 지겹진 않아? 늪지대에서 괴물과 도적들을 추적하고 나서는 특히 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8fa4b7ec-066c-4b9c-99cd-82b10373dd91"
msgid ""
"\"A pity.\" {n}You see sincere regret in Kanerah's eyes.{/n} \"So long, and "
"forgive me for bothering you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안됐구나.\" {n}당신은 카네라의 얼굴에서 진심으로 후회하는 기색을 느낍니다.{/n} \"안녕, 그 동안 괴롭혀서 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c8a161e1-9c64-4385-9e00-fb42eb8e8de1"
msgid "\"You feel no shame at all? Why, how wonderful!\""
msgstr "\"부끄럽지도 않아? 정말 대단하구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4d2e9a7d-3299-4ef4-955b-0135b6d2e8eb"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? Honesty and directness are finer adornments than lace, for those "
"who know how to pursue their goals.\""
msgstr "\"당연하지 않아? 정직함과 직설적인 건 훌륭한 장식이지. 목표를 추구할 줄 아는 사람에게는 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4f0922d1-244b-4784-afe7-65d069cf8aaf"
msgid ""
"\"But we mustn't freeze in the wind here. This northern weather could throw "
"a storm our way any moment! There's a fireplace at my home – and we could "
"make it burn even hotter...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 여기에서 바람에 꽁꽁 얼며 서있을 필요는 없어. 이 북쪽의 날씨는 정말 언제라도 폭풍이 칠 거 같다니깐! 우리 집에 벽난로가 "
"있어. 그럼 더 화끈하게 불태울 수도 있겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4bfc3297-481d-4d56-87bb-e3c931130ce7"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah stops and looks into the fire. Its shadows and flames dancing on "
"her face. She suddenly seems more serious than she was a moment ago in the "
"square.{/n} \"I want to ask you a favor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 멈춰서 불을 바라봅니다. 그림자와 불꽃이 얼굴에 일렁입니다. 그녀는 아까 광장에서 본 모습보다는 한결 진지해 "
"보입니다.{/n} \"너에게 부탁이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "44bdc267-a170-44c1-a454-8aa1140f49c7"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe I'm going to ruin such a wonderful moment with a serious "
"conversation! But still... I think you're interested in me the way I'm "
"interested in you. And if that's true, please keep everything that happens "
"between us a secret. From everyone – even your companions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 완벽한 분위기를 내가 깨고 있다니 믿기 힘든 일이지! 하지만... 내가 너에게 관심이 있는 것처럼 너도 관심이 있다고 생각해. "
"그리고 그게 사실이라면, 우리 사이에 일어난 모든 일은 비밀로 해줘. 모두에게, 그러니까 네 동료들에게도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e83da667-c80b-4c6b-a5dd-d02bebdbd9d0"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to draw too much public attention. My sister and I have "
"already created quite a stir in your lands! Besides... it's hard to explain, "
"but it feels better to stay in the shadows. Secrets hide and protect, and "
"keep you from getting hurt. Kalikke could explain it better – maybe even "
"write a poem about it. I only say it as well as I can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들의 시선을 끌고 싶지 않아. 동생과 나는 벌써 너희 땅에서 적잖은 소란을 일으켰으니까! 그리고... 설명하기는 어렵지만, 난 "
"그늘 속에 숨어지내는 게 더 편안해. 비밀은 너를 숨겨주고 보호해줄 뿐 아니라 상처를 받는 것도 막아주지. 칼리케라면 좀 더 잘 설명했을 "
"것 같은데, 시라도 써서 말이야. 나는 이 정도 밖에는 못 말하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1999d980-a722-4d8e-8ae3-e28b61048250"
msgid ""
"\"For one thing, I don't want to draw too much attention, at least for now. "
"Having too many eyes on me – it's... a little uncomfortable. Plus, I'm still "
"bound by the conditions of the Herald of Nethys, and must try to keep my "
"double identity a secret. If everyone begins whispering that 'Kaessi' has "
"grown close to the {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}, they'll expect her to "
"'behave' in a certain way. And I know my sister. – She won't be able to play "
"along, and the secret won't stay hidden for long.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하나만 말할게. 나는 관심을 끌기 싫어. 적어도 지금은 말이야. 사람들이 나를 주시하는건... 좀 불편해. 게다가, 나는 아직도 "
"네서스의 전령과 맺은 계약 조건에 매여있어서, 우리 정체의 비밀을 지켜야 해. '카에시'가 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}과 친밀한 "
"관계라는 걸 사람들이 수군대기 시작할 즈음이면, 당연히 그에 걸맞는 내 행동에도 관심을 가질거야. 그리고 내가 아는 내 동생은 절대 그 "
"장단에 맞춰주지 않을 거고, 비밀은 머지않아 탄로나고 말거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "399b7b28-bd79-4723-8702-542e33e78d94"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. Then forgive me for wasting your time.\""
msgstr "\"미안해. 괜히 시간만 낭비하게 했네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "60e3ab5f-ad4a-44c3-af51-e68506440049"
msgid "{n}Kanerah's smile seems sincere and grateful.{/n} \"That's perfect.\""
msgstr "{n}카네라의 미소에는 신뢰와 감사가 담겨 있습니다.{/n} \"완벽해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f266e611-fc6b-4676-b6f3-a73b6464bf51"
msgid ""
"{n}She takes a step closer, almost clinging to you, and lights a small fire "
"in her hand.{/n} \"The land where I come from is full of opposites. "
"Sometimes it's so hot during the day that the rocks melt under the sun like "
"snow. But then comes night, and the cold freezes you to the bone. Night is "
"the time when families gather at a fireplace, when parents hold their "
"children – and when lovers share the heat of their bodies, and fill their "
"hearts with each other's heat as they drift into sleep.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀가 당신에게 한 걸음 다가와 바짝 달라붙더니, 손에서는 작은 불꽃을 만들어냅니다.{/n} \"내 고향에는 역설적인 대립이 아주 "
"많았어. 낮에는 바위도 눈녹듯 녹여버릴 폭염이 설치지만, 밤이 되면 뼛속까지 추위가 파고들지. 그럼 가족들은 난롯가에 모여앉아 부모들은 "
"아이를 안아주고, 연인들은 몸으로 온기를 나누지. 그럼 가슴 속까지 스며드는 서로의 온기를 품고 잠드는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3ab3d5c5-3048-431c-bf56-6b304bd3f1c7"
msgid ""
"\"I want to show you how it's done.\" {n}She extinguishes the fire quickly, "
"and takes the final step towards you, wrapping her arms around your neck and "
"kissing you passionately.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 하는 건지 내가 보여줄게.\" {n}그녀는 불을 끄고는 한걸음 더 다가가서 팔로 당신의 목을 끌어안고 열정적으로 "
"키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahInitialEvent/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a6b2fd82-6d9e-4d71-9fca-9cbd2239aead"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah trills with laughter.{/n} \"I especially liked the part about "
"'night'! And you know what I think?\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 깔깔거리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 특히 '밤'에 대한 부분이 좋더라고! 내가 무슨 생각 하게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "443e29aa-b6ff-4ad5-8d86-269f444fc2f7"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me the truth, Kanerah. What do you really want – me or my crown?\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말해줘, 카네라. 정말 원하는 게 뭐야? 나야 아니면 내 왕관이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ae5cb5c6-c49c-4fbe-9a1a-ed06200ae043"
msgid "\"You want to have some fun? Sure, why not!\""
msgstr "\"재미를 좀 보고싶다고? 당연히 좋지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "931ea1ca-73b1-43a1-aeb0-879997c624a5"
msgid ""
"\"I see no point in double talk. You are smart, ambitious, and beautiful. We "
"could achieve so much together.\""
msgstr "\"다시 얘기할 필요는 없어. 너는 똑똑하고, 야심에 찬 미인이지. 우리가 함께 하면 많은 것을 이룰 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "4d978c10-1142-42e6-93ea-a5e0d2583b2a"
msgid "\"I just want you to know – I really like you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 정말 좋아한다는 걸 네가 알아줬으면 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3fdc5c6f-7552-490f-9f2a-4ef9fc2fc355"
msgid ""
"\"It doesn't matter. Forget I asked. We could just have fun, like we "
"normally do.\""
msgstr "\"별 거 아냐. 아까 물어봤던 건 잊어줘. 우리는 그냥 평소처럼 즐기면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "44c5ab6b-51a4-465a-8398-78022f436b06"
msgid ""
"\"As far as you like. The place of my wife and consort is still vacant.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원한다면. 아내이자 왕후의 자리는 아직 비어있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "8b185edf-f5a4-41cc-9ff2-2d6e59384738"
msgid "\"Time will tell.\""
msgstr "\"두고 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "3043515f-273f-40b3-98bb-815cda57842e"
msgid "\"Forget about what I said. There can be nothing serious between us.\""
msgstr "\"내가 말했던 건 잊어버려. 우리는 진지한 관계가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "c785077c-2bcd-4f00-b56e-c0ff3d97142e"
msgid ""
"\"It's about time to say I don't want to meet with you any more. It's over.\""
msgstr "\"이제 너를 더 이상 만나고 싶지 않아. 우리는 끝이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "618f3d96-4b13-4593-b0c4-188446861e29"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah is leaning lazily against the wall. The tiefling's expressive "
"eyes glare at you.{/n} \"I was expecting you. How is my {mf|King|Queen}? I'm "
"sure you must be terribly bored, chasing after monsters and defeating "
"enemies over and over again. Don't you want to take a break from the routine "
"and celebrate your triumphant rise to power?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 느긋하게 벽에 기대어 있습니다. 티플링의 초롱초롱한 눈빛이 당신을 향합니다.{/n} \"기다리고 있었어. 우리 국왕 전하의 "
"기분은 어떠신지? 너도 매일같이 괴물을 쫓고 적을 물리치는 게 지겨웠을 것 같은데. 잠시 그런 일상에서 벗어나 이 영광스러운 왕위 등극을 "
"축하하는 게 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3dfb2d37-ba27-4768-ba1a-fc877bde23e4"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling freezes and looks at you, completely baffled.{/n} \"What do "
"you... why... Isn't that question a little too forward, for an ordinary "
"affair with a passing foreigner?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 꼼짝 못한채 당황한 눈빛으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"너는 대체... 왜... 그저 스쳐가는 이방인과 가볍게 가졌던 "
"관계치고는 너무 멀리 나간 질문이잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5008a699-aabe-455a-8c10-d983b2993dd9"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you ask, anyway?\" {n}Kanerah blushes faintly and bites her lip "
"anxiously.{/n}"
msgstr "\"대체 왜 묻는 거야?\" {n}카네라는 살짝 얼굴을 붉히며 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3188cd05-9664-4ef6-b939-9aaa93d49013"
msgid "\"Especially considering how you go cooing with the boy priest.\""
msgstr "\"특히 네가 얼마나 그 젊은 성직자 녀석과 다정하게 속닥거리고 있는지를 생각하면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d189e5fd-ce4f-438a-aafc-31b02d8c5fd6"
msgid ""
"\"Especially considering how well you get along with that stupid and ill-"
"tempered half-orc.\""
msgstr "\"특히 네가 얼마나 그 멍청하고 성질더러운 하프오크 녀석과 가까이 어울려 지내는지를 생각하면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "db6a518b-fb1f-42f8-aaba-34130284b962"
msgid ""
"\"Especially considering your dazzling Valerie, forthright as her sword and "
"impenetrable as her shield!\""
msgstr "\"특히 너의 눈부시게 빛나는 발레리를 생각하면. 그녀는 자기 검처럼 솔직담백하고 자기 방패처럼 완고하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9fc0908f-754f-4576-a11c-b8c7d53ec3eb"
msgid ""
"\"Especially considering how you lavish affections on that fox Octavia, even "
"in broad daylight.\""
msgstr "\"특히 네가 얼마나 헤프게 그 여우같은 옥타비아 년과 백주대낮부터 애정행각을 벌이고 있는지를 생각하면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "921f71b0-ffc2-4310-b92b-9b0e106c4a93"
msgid ""
"\"Especially considering you've got a half-orc and a half-elf wrapped around "
"each finger.\""
msgstr "\"특히 네가 하프 오크, 하프 엘프와 깍지낀 손을 잡고 있는 걸 생각하면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6db2dcdb-5ed1-4cf9-a089-4daaffa0a317"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah watches you tensely, then lets out a soft sigh of relief.{/n} "
"\"You're so direct and clear – and I like that. I was afraid you'd start "
"talking about, 'undying love' – pardon my language – and other such nonsense!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}긴장해서 당신을 노려보던 카네라가 안도의 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"너는 정말 솔직담백하구나. 마음에 들어. 네가 혹시나 '영원한 "
"사랑' 같은 궤변을 꺼내지나 않을까 걱정했거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a3328bc3-f8cb-48ca-af6f-71604fab3d70"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah opens her eyes wide and keeps silent for a long minute. Then she "
"looks around, as if for a way out, and says hastily,{/n} \"Of course you "
"like me! How could you not? Who could resist these horns and this tail? "
"Surely no one!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 눈을 크게 뜨고는 침묵에 잠깁니다. 그녀는 빠져나갈 곳을 찾기라도 하는 듯 주위를 둘러보고는 급히 말합니다.{/n} \"물론"
" 나를 좋아하겠지! 어떻게 안 그러겠어? 이 뿔과 꼬리에서는 누구도 헤어나지 못할거야. 아무도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "57dc6fee-7089-41d0-a192-804f83ba8011"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah catches her breath.{/n} \"That's more like it! Questions, "
"questions... Who needs questions, right?\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 숨을 들이쉽니다.{/n} \"그럴싸 하네! 질문에 또 질문... 질문은 더 필요없잖아, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "aa47b024-3a58-4fa6-8a46-ae85c625bb08"
msgid ""
"\"But I wonder...\" {n}The girl's cheeks blush a little.{/n} \"...how far "
"does 'together' really get us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 나는 궁금해...\" {n}카네라의 얼굴이 살짝 붉어집니다.{/n} \"...과연 우리가 얼마나 오래 '함께'일 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6153921e-2f97-4af5-8ad3-4a69740f8804"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah's tail snaps twice against the floor, like a whip.{/n} \"I'll "
"admit, I'm flattered. I appreciate your frankness, and your appreciation of "
"my virtues is an honor. And I'm not saying this to flatter you. – If anyone "
"deserves to hear the truth from me, it's you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 마치 채찍처럼 꼬리로 바닥을 두어번 내리칩니다.{/n} \"네 말에 기분이 좋은 건 사실이야. 솔직하게 얘기해줘서 고맙고, "
"내 진가를 이해해준 건 정말 큰 영광이었어. 너 듣기 좋으라고 하는 말이 아니야. 내 입에서 진실을 들을 수 있는 사람은 오직 너 뿐이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ed9f4277-fd42-4309-a68a-a94b65df11f0"
msgid ""
"\"Are you thinking of something like a mutual test? That's quite reasonable. "
"We should see what the future holds before we take any serious steps.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서로 시험 같은 걸 해보자는 거지? 괜찮아 보이네. 진지한 관계가 되기 전에 앞날에 무슨 일이 있을지 먼저 점검해보는 것도 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "304b1e7a-63b1-4d30-939f-f785539db670"
msgid ""
"\"Besides, my fate is still undecided. The Herald of a god, and a very "
"persistent devil, both hold claim to my life and my future. Under the "
"circumstances, it's difficult for me to make plans for myself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"게다가, 내 운명은 아직도 정해지지 않았어. 신의 전령과 끈질긴 데블, 둘 모두가 여전히 내 목숨과 내 미래를 내놓으라고 하고 "
"있다고. 이런 상황에서 나 자신을 위한 계획을 세우는 건 너무나 힘든 일이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "25667f9b-9d5f-498e-b6af-a059262a47b1"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah scoffs.{/n} \"Is that so? I see. As your power how grown, your "
"appetites have grown as well, and your priorities have shifted. Our old fun "
"is not so fun any more... Well, thanks for this little adventure, I'll see "
"you again in a less intimate setting!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"그래? 알겠어. 네 힘이 커진 만큼 네 욕망도 자라났구나. 뭐가 중요한지에 대한 우선순위도 "
"바뀌었고. 우리가 즐거워했던 것도 이제는 지난 일일 뿐인 거구나... 뭐, 여기까지 해온 작은 모험에는 감사하지. 그럼 다음에는 남남으로 "
"만나자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "892ed091-77ab-43e4-b6ea-d53b3a09a391"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah frowns, thinking about something.{/n} \"But I wouldn't rush "
"things. A sweet affair, despite its pleasures, is not exactly a future "
"together.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 생각에 잠겨 얼굴을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"하지만 나는 서두르지 않겠어. 달콤한 연애가 아무리 즐겁다고 해도 함께 걸어갈 "
"미래와는 엄연히 다른 거니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "047df688-6e8f-412c-a337-7a35780ba10a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah takes a step towards you. Her eyes are full of glee, and her "
"confusion is long past.{/n} \"But we have the whole evening together. Let's "
"spend it in a less formal setting!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 당신에게 한걸음 다가섭니다. 환희에 찬 그녀의 눈에서, 혼란스러웠던 과거는 더 이상 찾아볼 수 없습니다.{/n} \"하지만 "
"우리는 벌써 저녁 온종일 함께 있었지. 이제 좀 더 친밀한 시간을 가져보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "22e89609-efe6-44d2-a9b9-fb89a3637050"
msgid "{n}Kanerah smiles coyly.{/n} \"That's what I'm here for...\""
msgstr "{n}카네라가 수줍게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그래서 내가 여기 왔잖아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/KanerahTurningPoint/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0857f647-1b2f-4138-9ec6-33a3652862e6"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, this isn't a good time. You probably want to rest, not talk to "
"some bothersome tiefling. I'll go for a walk, and then I have something to "
"do... So long!\" {n}Kanerah practically runs out as she speaks the last few "
"words.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"있지, 지금은 적당한 때가 아닌 것 같아. 너도 귀찮은 티플링이랑 얘기하는 것보다는 좀 쉬고 싶을 거야. 나는 좀 걷고 올게, 볼 "
"일이 좀 있어서... 그럼 안녕!\" {n}카네라는 말을 다 맺기도 전에 급하게 달려나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/KanerahAfter_1_String
msgctxt "f44dc84e-6a9e-466a-abe6-ac49b5977fbe"
msgid "\"You like playing with fire, don't you?\""
msgstr "\"불장난을 좋아하는구나, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/KanerahAfter_2_String
msgctxt "9674786b-2e44-421a-99e0-2dc4db1690fa"
msgid ""
"\"You know what I feel when I kiss you? I taste mystery. I taste strength, "
"and passion, and sweetness.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 키스할 때 어떤 기분이 드는지 알아? 신비롭고 강하면서도 열정적이고 달콤한 맛이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/KanerahAfter_3_String
msgctxt "c584b24d-388f-452c-9928-d87235d888ea"
msgid ""
"This was... dangerous! You know, I got so carried away I almost set "
"everything around us on fire.\""
msgstr "\"정말... 위험했어! 내가 너무 흥분해서 정신줄을 놓고 주변 모든 걸 불태워버릴 뻔 했다니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/KanerahAfter_4_String
msgctxt "4be8fe72-dcd6-40b1-b675-630ce14d42ba"
msgid "\"The tail makes everything better, doesn't it?\""
msgstr "\"뭐든지 꼬리가 달린 편이 나아, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/KanerahIdle_1_String
msgctxt "5d3e2cef-8c5a-4528-9cc5-371966f8fd74"
msgid "\"We shouldn't be seen together. – You remember that, right?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 함께 있는 걸 사람들이 봐선 안 돼. 너도 알고 있잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/KanerahIdle_2_String
msgctxt "4702b7be-ff39-4d9e-a480-49723a8e04d6"
msgid ""
"\"I'm going to primp, and I'm going to do it for at least an hour. Don't "
"even think about distracting me!\""
msgstr "\"나 좀 꾸미고 올게. 아마 한 시간 이상은 걸릴거야. 그렇다고 내 눈을 피할 생각은 하지도 말라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_1_String
msgctxt "91cb7aa2-faf1-4672-8bfc-ca91b8b037b0"
msgid ""
"\"Finally we're alone. I yearn so much for... Wait – what are you doing "
"here?!\""
msgstr "\"드디어 우리 둘만 남았네. 너무나 기다려 왔지... 잠깐, 너희 여기서 뭐하는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_2_String
msgctxt "3925c849-304d-460a-b530-92ddcd9e07f8"
msgid ""
"\"Our bull mastodon got lost! It was outside by the cart, and got scared and "
"ran away!\""
msgstr "\"우리 마스토돈이 사라졌어! 밖의 수레 옆에 세워놨는데 갑자기 겁에 질려서 달아났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_3_String
msgctxt "805010fe-a5ef-4342-92c0-d3dde2c01298"
msgid "\"Make yourself scarce!\""
msgstr "\"당장 나가지 못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_4_String
msgctxt "80ed0997-285a-4e7b-9e43-c96cd13e06ed"
msgid "\"But it might be here! Under the bed – or behind the curtains!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 여기에 있을 수도 있어! 침대 아래나 커튼 뒤에 있을 수도 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_5_String
msgctxt "829f9ffa-5be1-4cc7-aa74-b21a442e94c7"
msgid "\"It's all alone and scared! We need to look for it!\""
msgstr "\"혼자서 얼마나 무섭겠어! 우리가 빨리 찾아줘야 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_6_String
msgctxt "ffdbdde1-9b09-4b6a-a85c-77f3a32d32e8"
msgid ""
"\"Your hairy monster couldn't be in here! Not unless you gave it an "
"invisibility potion. You didn't, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희의 그 털투성이 짐승이 여기 있을 리가 없어! 너희가 투명 물약이라도 먹인게 아니라면 말이야. 설마 진짜 먹인 건 아니지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_7_String
msgctxt "f4ac5bba-fdde-4f84-b8ca-ee4f2accabb4"
msgid "\"Well...\""
msgstr "\"그게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/MansionCutScenes/SweetToothIntervention_8_String
msgctxt "e38a6b60-c041-435d-a64f-e2f1173c823e"
msgid ""
"\"For the sake of all the gods of Golarion... an INVISIBLE bull mastodon is "
"running around my house!? Forgive me, {name}, I need to look for the beast. "
"Or it'll stomp our bed at the worst possible moment!\""
msgstr ""
"\"골라리온의 신들이시여... 투명한 마스토돈이 돌아다니고 있다고!? 미안, {name}. 그 짐승을 찾아야겠어. 잘못하면 바로 그 "
"최악의 순간에 우리 침대를 짓밟아버릴 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "454295bb-ef75-46ef-aee7-12233be56366"
msgid "\"Sorry to bother you, I'm leaving!\""
msgstr "\"귀찮게 해서 미안, 나 먼저 갈게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9d2dadb7-65b2-47d2-abb4-4769c552804b"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I'm a {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! It's not polite to kick me "
"out when we're in my dominions!\""
msgstr "\"나는 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이야! 내 영토 안에 있으면서도 나를 바람맞히다니 너무 불손하군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b5e6d1e0-550d-4358-bc73-46a06fd29efb"
msgid ""
"\"Watch your tongue. I don't remember giving you permission to take that "
"tone with me.\""
msgstr "\"말조심해. 그런 식으로 말해도 된다고 허락한 적 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "37a7b345-e392-438f-aa92-adbf7aac9c69"
msgid "\"That was a fine way to wake up – for both of us! Well, so long!\""
msgstr "\"잠에서 깨는 획기적인 방법이네, 우리 둘 다 말이야! 그럼, 난 더 잘게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "11ea449e-529e-4f14-8d55-7fbd5e7a802e"
msgid "\"You almost fell on me? Hmm, now that's something I wouldn't mind…\""
msgstr "\"내 위로 넘어질 뻔 한거야? 흠, 그거 참 마음에 드는 방법이네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fa3dbcf7-b3d2-4dc0-ba03-79b933554981"
msgid ""
"{n}Still half-asleep, you slip on your gear and suddenly hear the angry snap "
"of a tail against the bed post. Looking up, you lock eyes with Kalikke, "
"glowering and embarrassed.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옷을 벗은 채 비몽사몽 자고 있던 당신은 갑자기 꼬리로 침대를 후려치는 소리를 들었습니다. 정신을 차려보니, 칼리케가 당황한 눈으로 "
"당신을 노려보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "14830556-7a7d-4fa8-9fa7-1045ce931b0c"
msgid ""
"\"{name}! You and Kanerah... I mean... we suddenly switched, and I... could "
"you please get dressed faster?!\""
msgstr "\"{name}! 너와 카네라가... 내 말은... 우리 갑자기 바뀌어서. 그리고 내가... 옷 좀 빨리 입어주지 않을래?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4a537f74-0952-4a76-85f9-c87a57ea8579"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke turns pale, then nods.{/n} \"As you wish. I'm sorry. And now let "
"me freshen up and clean up the house…\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 창백해지고는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"원하는 대로. 미안해. 이제 집 환기랑 청소 좀 할게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e4009aef-7a9a-4162-a552-1f33881d9957"
msgid ""
"\"If I throw water on you, would it be considered high treason?\" {n}Kalikke "
"covers her mouth and bursts out laughing.{/n} \"We accidentally switched in "
"our sleep! I almost fell on top of you when I came out of the portal! We've "
"never had such a silly switch before…\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너에게 물을 끼얹으면 반역죄가 되는 거야?\" {n}칼리케가 입을 가리고 깔깔 웃기 시작합니다.{/n} \"자는데 갑자기 우리가 "
"바뀌었어! 포탈에서 나오다 네 위로 넘어질 뻔했지! 이렇게 황당한 적은 처음이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e2bb6c9a-5d5e-4866-969f-1abd10ae27bd"
msgid "\"Yeah, right. So you and my sister... ah, doesn't matter! Goodbye!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 맞아. 그럼 너랑 언니는... 아, 신경쓰지 마! 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/Romance/SistersChange/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f366c9d6-a31b-4ddb-ae6a-e3cf664014bd"
msgid ""
"\"You know what, Kanerah is enough for you! Of course, my sister usually "
"shares everything with me... Oh, what am I saying! That's it, goodbye, {mf|"
"Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너에게는 카네라가 있잖아! 물론 언니와 나는 보통 모든 물건을 같이 쓰긴 하지만... 아, 내가 지금 무슨 소리를 하는 거람! "
"아무튼, 나는 가볼게, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "de43d8da-1df9-4232-a583-2a9d928e4e75"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cc12cf4f-24ea-43e2-9555-c579a00546a8"
msgid "\"Let's see if you can complete my task...\""
msgstr "\"내가 준 임무를 너희가 해낼 수 있을지 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "f9cb257b-f1d3-4efe-82f8-7523103ce4cb"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가봐야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "373b1ba4-1a5f-4a73-81d8-c694b872d199"
msgid "\"Who are you to each other? Relatives? Friends?\""
msgstr "\"너희는 어떤 사이지? 친척? 친구?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "19bfc863-3462-4a91-b558-2f63b05fc855"
msgid "\"Tell why you left Qadira...\""
msgstr "\"왜 너희가 카디라를 떠났는지 말해줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "ffdbcac9-3e85-429d-8a60-7b687ef3cc80"
msgid "\"How is life here for you?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 지내는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "42362d06-fa07-4fc5-ac8f-d16ebce10bb5"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers.\""
msgstr "\"말해줘서 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "17c0e28d-71b6-4086-be3e-60294eb6d3a0"
msgid "\"The Narlmarches are overgrown. They need to be weeded!\""
msgstr "\"날마치에 풀이 너무 많이 자랐더라고. 풀베기를 좀 해야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "94a00dc1-b3a6-4ee8-b443-0e48b76ea926"
msgid ""
"\"The linnorm's grave is in terrible condition. Polish all the bones to a "
"shine!\""
msgstr "\"린놈의 무덤이 너무 더럽더라고. 뼈무더기에 광을 좀 내야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "57302fc3-ee55-4a2e-ba66-bc3328dbfa5c"
msgid ""
"\"Take some measurements of Lake Silverstep. I wish to know the exact length "
"of its shoreline!\""
msgstr "\"실버스텝 호수를 좀 측정해줘. 호수 둘레가 정확히 얼마나 되는지 궁금해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "bafd1f42-0bdf-4806-ad7d-2958b0560a89"
msgid ""
"\"The road through Varnhold to Talon Peak is terribly inconvenient. Try to "
"find a better one, past the Shrike Hills!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드를 지나 발톱 봉우리로 가는 길은 정말 불편해. 슈라이크 구릉지를 지나는 더 좋은 길을 찾아봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "40bf07e7-71dd-4537-994e-ddfdbdcffe36"
msgid ""
"\"The picket fence at Oleg's Trading Post is tilted. Go there and fix it!\""
msgstr "\"올렉의 교역소의 목책이 좀 기울어졌더라고. 가서 좀 고쳐주렴!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "0c789421-dff9-409c-814a-511801716df4"
msgid "\"On the other hand, no, I don't have any errands for you.\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 심부름 시킬 일은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "5aef7080-b991-4ed1-b050-ebad2b6cea49"
msgid ""
"\"It would be better for you to stay away from the capital for a while.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐이라도 수도를 떠나 있는게 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "158255f8-6ff1-4935-8d8d-a2f7396af67b"
msgid "\"How do you know Kalikke?\""
msgstr "\"칼리케는 어떻게 알게 됐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "5e5421e9-2d97-4ac3-ac0b-67a8748d78be"
msgid "\"How did you find out about the Disk of the Eclipse?\""
msgstr "\"해와 달을 삼킨 원반에 대한 정보는 어떻게 찾아냈지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "a3984100-796f-430d-939f-8dafc74e81ca"
msgid ""
"\"It looks like you've completed all of my tasks. I have just one last thing "
"to ask of you...\""
msgstr "\"내 일을 모두 끝낸 것 같군. 마지막으로 부탁할 일이 하나 더 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/KaessiHouse_marker_String
msgctxt "ed2af290-ab42-4264-bf20-00b8e1c1584c"
msgid "Kaessi's House"
msgstr "카에시의 집"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/KaneKaliHouse_marker_String
msgctxt "e2db9b00-063e-4488-8065-5d7f72e679d9"
msgid "Kanerah's and Kalikke's House"
msgstr "카네라와 칼리케의 집"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Mammoth_bark_1_String
msgctxt "2526c399-1310-4995-8843-c6659b8714e1"
msgid "*STOMP* *STOMP* *STOMP*"
msgstr "[쿵 쿵 쿵]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Mammoth_bark_2_String
msgctxt "c1adf4fd-9468-49d1-9ea8-828dc73bf121"
msgid "*munch* *munch* *munch*"
msgstr "[쩝 쩝 쩝]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Mammoth_bark_3_String
msgctxt "4977d9c2-f388-433f-8809-129f3f43c76f"
msgid "The mammoth looks at you adorably with its black shiny eyes."
msgstr "이 매머드는 반짝이는 검은 눈에 사랑을 듬뿍 담아 당신을 바라보고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Q2AllAlive_bark1_String
msgctxt "b97ee28e-cf65-4466-ac1e-f7542d1e26ba"
msgid "\"You know what? I really liked that adventure with the soul eater!\""
msgstr "\"그거 아세요? 나는 영혼 포식자 때문에 겪은 모험이 너무 신나고 좋았어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Q2AllAlive_bark2_String
msgctxt "c3d3da59-9612-46dc-b5ff-67a8f34b5e8e"
msgid "\"I'm afraid of Kanerah! She will definitely roast us!\""
msgstr "\"카네라가 무서워요! 누님은 언젠가 우리를 불로 구워버리고 말 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Q2AllAlive_bark3_String
msgctxt "0a9b3639-3b37-4e08-90a7-e2a88749f1d7"
msgid ""
"\"We'll stay here a little while longer, and then we'll go wandering around! "
"We'll see the world!\""
msgstr "\"여기에 조금만 더 머물다가, 다시 여행을 떠나려고요! 우린 세상을 구경할 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Q2SomeoneDead_bark1_String
msgctxt "df378dbc-a4c4-4bfc-9d1c-5117dc839f8d"
msgid "\"I can't stay in this city any longer... too many memories...\""
msgstr "\"이 도시에 더 머물 수는 없어요... 너무 많은 기억이 있어서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Q2SomeoneDead_bark2_String
msgctxt "90dc20e7-e486-44ab-9264-d93ee18e4d60"
msgid "\"I want to go somewhere far away. I hope Our Elder forgives us...\""
msgstr "\"아무데나 좋으니 아주 먼 곳으로 가고 싶어요. 우리 누님이 우리를 용서해 주길...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Barks/Q2SomeoneDead_bark3_String
msgctxt "a84ee329-859b-4fda-b2d0-0a479a0eeb2c"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing but trouble waiting for us at home – and it's not much "
"better here.\""
msgstr "\"고향에서 우리를 기다리는 건 말썽 뿐이었죠. 하지만 여기도 별로 다르지 않네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "8b0c8b68-3657-40fd-bacc-c6d2277a4652"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! Look who it is! If it isn't the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} {mf|himself|herself}! I thought gentlefolks "
"didn't hang around their subjects' homes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿을 수 없어! 누가 오셨나 봐! {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}께서 직접 왕림하셨어! 고귀하신 분들은 평민들의 집에 발을 들이시지도 "
"않을 줄 알았는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "88eca8d3-64a8-41e6-93d7-3eaeb4d46a2c"
msgid ""
"\"Look! We have a noble guest! But come to think of it, it's us who are the "
"guests of the {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}... Anyway, it's a great honor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런! 귀한 손님이 오셨어! 아니면 우리가 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 손님이 되었다고 해야 하나... 아무튼, 모시게 되어 "
"영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "b50be58e-5fe0-4a15-87e5-64f748530370"
msgid ""
"\"We've weeded the Narlmarches! The faraway ones, the nearby ones, and even "
"the in-between ones!\""
msgstr "\"날마치를 말끔히 제초했어요! 먼 곳, 가까운 곳, 그 중간에 있는 곳 전부요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "5499b578-d018-4eec-9568-9784a9df9fcd"
msgid "\"All done! We washed all your bones – to a perfect shine!\""
msgstr "\"다 됐어요! 우리가 뼈들이 전부 반짝반짝 빛날 때까지 광을 냈어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "b522cf59-f685-4533-aac2-3a91a0a4516f"
msgid ""
"\"We've measured the lake! But there was a small problem… The shore is "
"sometimes so wavy, that it's thirty feet to walk, but if you measure every "
"curve, it's two hundred! And if you measure really carefully, it's even a "
"thousand!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 호수를 측정했어요! 하지만 작은 문제가 있는데... 호숫가가 너무 구불구불해서, 걸음걸이로 재면 30피트인데, 구불구불한 "
"길이를 전부 재보면 200피트에요! 좀 더 꼼꼼하게 재보면 1,000피트가 되기도 하구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "b5e8e31f-9ecb-4b26-80e5-78bf863d0b54"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, we found another way to Talon "
"Peak! Now we'll definitely be accepted into the {g|Pathfinder Society}"
"Pathfinder Society{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님, 발톱 봉우리로 가는 다른 길을 발견했어요! 이제 우리도 {g|Pathfinder Society}패스파인더 협회{/g}의 "
"일원이 될 수 있을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "c0322026-59c9-4352-bd97-aa5a0b0930b5"
msgid "\"Oh, that Oleg! Always finding fault with things!\""
msgstr "\"올렉은 정말 지독해요! 언제나 잘못된 걸 찾아서 지적하는 사람이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "a2e57d8b-b2d3-4566-8645-05c2d2ed5f75"
msgid "\"Thanks for stopping by!\""
msgstr "\"들려주셔서 고맙습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "1c0c1afa-cafd-4787-8ff0-d6171931645c"
msgid "\"Any time!\""
msgstr "\"언제든지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "a2bdc508-c632-4c98-907a-67c1194d726a"
msgid ""
"\"Us three were caught by a huge roc. It was so picky, only fed tieflings to "
"its nestlings. So we met in its nest! But we escaped!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 셋은 거대한 로크한테 잡혔던 적이 있어요. 어찌나 까다로운 녀석인지, 새끼들한테는 티플링만 먹이더라고요. 그래서 둥지에서 우리가 "
"만날 수 있었죠! 다행히 탈출할 수도 있었고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "f9e4eafb-0e1e-4f9b-b67a-a2d6f055692c"
msgid ""
"\"It's all because of the Cult of the Dawnflower! – The ones who honor "
"Sarenrae for the scimitar she holds in her hand, not for her kindness and "
"mercy. They look at any tiefling like a hound looks at its prey – like, you "
"know, we can see what's inside you – you're just waiting to do some evil! So "
"we... well, we gathered secretly with other tieflings and genie offspring to "
"discuss how life is not so good for us in Qadira, and how we could change "
"everything... And then they decided we were conspirators!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전부 여명꽃 교단 녀석들 때문이에요! 서렌레이의 친절과 자비가 아니라 손에 든 시미터를 숭배하는 녀석들 말이지요. 그들은 사냥개가 "
"자기 사냥감을 노려보듯이 티플링을 쳐다봐요. 막, 우린 네 본심을 알아, 너희는 늘 사악한 일을 저지를 생각 뿐이지! 하고요. 그래서 "
"저흰... 다른 티플링이랑 지니의 자손들과 비밀리에 모여서 카디라에서 살아가는게 얼마나 힘든 일인지, 그리고 어떻게 해야 이걸 바꿀 수 "
"있을지 얘기하곤 했어요... 그게 그 녀석들이 보기엔 역적모의나 다름 없었던 거죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "dab0204f-d2b9-4261-857a-76ecc16be74f"
msgid ""
"\"Everything is so strange here! The ground is cold, the trees are so green "
"it hurts to look at them, and even the sky is strange. It's like we're in "
"another world! We find something new every day. It's great!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기는 정말 모든 게 이상해요! 대지는 차갑고, 나무는 너무나 푸르러서 쳐다만 봐도 눈이 아플 지경이고, 하늘조차도 이상해요. 마치 "
"다른 세상에 온 것 같아요! 매일 새로운 걸 찾을 수 있죠. 정말 대단해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "f362fdcb-9acf-4df9-8bce-72672dbdccb4"
msgid "\"Ask away, we'll make up some more!\""
msgstr "\"물어보세요. 얼마든지 대답해 드릴게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "869d23f4-ab9c-4700-bd16-951420e5f419"
msgid ""
"\"These two are often mistaken for my brothers. We are in fact a family, but "
"in truth I'm actually their grandmother! What, you don't believe me? I only "
"look young!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 보통 얘네 둘을 제 형제로 착각해요. 우리가 가족인 건 맞아요. 내가 얘네 할머니 뻘이라 그렇지! 잠깐, 지금 못 믿는 "
"거예요? 내가 좀 동안이긴 하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "eeb2334b-5905-4ba7-8917-b6707717f144"
msgid ""
"\"That's right! Hey, who are you?! Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, "
"I give you my word, I'm only seeing these two goofs for the first time in my "
"life! They must be some kind of tricksters!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요! 야, 너희는 누구야?! 영주님, 맹세코 저는 이 두 바보녀석하고는 오늘 처음 만났어요! 이 녀석들이 무슨 마술이라도 "
"부렸나봐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "a671cdf8-94fc-4732-9e76-8a2c2e73c92f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! But the bird chased us through all of Kelesh, asking us to return the "
"treasures we took from its nest. It even tried to sue us, but the judge "
"didn't speak birdish!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요! 하지만 그 새는 둥지에서 우리가 훔쳐간 보물을 내놓으라며 켈레쉬 전역을 가로질러 우리를 쫓아왔어요. 심지어는 우릴 "
"고소하려고도 했는데, 판사가 새가 하는 말을 알아들었을 리가 없지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "864af22c-9061-48e3-a6f6-0b630bc6cd63"
msgid ""
"\"You got everything mixed up, grandma! I'm your grandson, but he's the "
"third great-great-grandson of your nephew's sister-in-law!\""
msgstr "\"할머니, 완전히 뒤죽박죽이네! 나는 손자가 맞는데, 쟤는 할머니 조카의 시누이의 셋째 증손자잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "883a6e34-90cf-4b4e-a978-4953697d5cb2"
msgid ""
"\"How insolent! Keeps following us, then dares to ask who we are! And steals "
"all the flatbread from our bags at night too, by the way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"건방지기는! 우리를 졸졸 따라다니는 주제에 우리가 누구냐고 묻다니! 그리고 밤마다 우리 가방에 든 빵을 모조리 훔쳐가잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "fd95a82b-3ef0-4a65-a68d-1ba261a60045"
msgid ""
"\"It's a shame that it's so cold all the time, though. But then again, it "
"keeps changing – snow, rain, whirlwinds, storms and lightning, and after "
"that – a rainbow. It's beautiful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"늘 춥다는 게 좀 아쉽죠. 하지만 날씨가 계속 바뀌잖아요. 눈, 비, 회오리, 폭풍과 천둥, 그리고 무엇보다도, 무지개. 정말 "
"아름다워요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "271738ef-b6d8-479e-aafb-20975c03c966"
msgid "\"Order us to go collect the moon from the sky – we can do anything!\""
msgstr "\"하늘에서 달을 따오라고 하셔도 좋아요. 시켜만 주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "697aae0a-26bc-4bf5-8372-b1f0a2287605"
msgid ""
"\"Our Elder won't tell you this – she's modest like that – but she's the one "
"who saved us from the raid. She ran to us and fought off the Cult's soldiers "
"so we could get away. The forces of nature have given her quite some power! "
"If it wasn't for her, I don't know what would have happened. Maybe we'd just "
"be exiled... but I don't think so.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 누님은 아마 영주님께 이 얘기는 하지 않을 거예요, 워낙 겸손한 사람이라. 하지만 누님이 우리를 습격에서 구해주셨어요. 누님이 "
"교단의 용병한테 달려들어 싸우는 동안, 우리는 겨우 도망칠 수 있었죠. 누님이 부리는 자연의 힘이 정말 굉장하더라구요! 누님이 아니었다면 "
"무슨 일이 일어났을지 몰라요. 그냥 추방됐을 수도 있지만... 그 정도로 끝났을 것 같지는 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "53dcd8db-ab9d-4217-abaf-bf1dc727ba75"
msgid "\"Give us your orders! We won't let you down!\""
msgstr "\"명령을 내려주세요! 실망시켜드리지 않을게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "507c650a-7ab5-4a4b-b905-f9378b1636d6"
msgid "\"We're ready for anything! And even more!\""
msgstr "\"어떤 일이든 시켜만 주세요! 그보다 더한 일도요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "547bc995-ac2a-4aeb-955c-682f3d8d09f0"
msgid ""
"\"I still can't get used to these swamps everywhere. When I was little, I "
"thought that marches and seas and glaciers were all just stories made up by "
"travelers. But here you just leave the city walls – and you're up to your "
"knees in a real swamp! It's fantastic!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아직도 이곳 어디에나 있는 늪지대는 익숙하지가 않아요. 어렸을 때에는 산맥이나 바다, 빙하 같은 건 여행자들이 지어낸 이야기인 줄 "
"알았어요. 하지만 여기선 도시의 성문만 나서면, 진짜 늪지대에 무릎까지 잠기게 되잖아요! 정말 멋지다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "a402520c-5105-4d75-833a-9dd4795b039b"
msgid "\"Linnorm bones? That's great! Can we take a few as souvenirs?\""
msgstr "\"린놈의 뼈라구요? 대단하다! 올 때 기념으로 좀 챙겨와도 돼요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "c72f488f-d14a-4718-9a86-4a74093ab3f5"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear that? We have an important task, surveying the lake shore! "
"Don't forget your towels!\""
msgstr "\"들었니? 호수를 측량하는 중요한 임무야! 수건도 꼭 챙기고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "f9e045c9-1331-40a7-aff1-df0a48d8f45e"
msgid "\"Looking for new roads? We can do that!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 길을 찾으라고요? 물론 할 수 있죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "f3bbbb0b-a294-4b3c-b5f9-0f918dac8f02"
msgid "\"Tilted? We'll fix it up and paint it in no time!\""
msgstr "\"기울어졌다구요? 지금 바로 가서 고치고 페인트칠까지 새로 해놓을게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "97f75fdd-397e-45b4-87fa-56a4c798c9cd"
msgid "{n}Grabbing their travel bags, the young tieflings run away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}어린 티플링들이 여행가방을 손에 들고 달려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "a8172c9a-94dd-4e2d-9e8c-b3034f191ff2"
msgid ""
"\"But then some fey came and told us that the weeds we pulled out were "
"actually the good ones. Maybe even sacred ones.\""
msgstr "\"그런데 그 때 페이들이 와서 우리가 뽑은 잡초들이 정말 좋은 거라고 말했어요. 신성한 거일 수도 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "b33ff7b7-8fd5-4bad-8ecb-0cd4178699a2"
msgid ""
"\"And a nice fellow followed us back. Can we keep him? He tramps around "
"loudly at night, but we'll make him some soft shoes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 녀석이 우리를 따라오더라구요. 우리가 키워도 될까요? 밤에 좀 쿵쾅대면서 돌아다니긴 하지만 부드러운 신발을 신겨주면 될 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "80928cf3-4acb-419d-a6fa-4a499cdac560"
msgid ""
"\"We argued for a long time what the right way to measure it was, and in the "
"end we decided to take an average. And the figure we got, um... Elki, how "
"long was it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤게 맞는 측정법인지 한참 말다툼을 했고, 결국 그냥 평균으로 하기로 했어요. 그래서 그 값이 그... 엘키, 얼마였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "5e09a2c2-dd1d-4d21-ace1-892fcea91739"
msgid ""
"\"This new road, though... It might not be any more convenient than the one "
"through Varnhold. Probably even less so. But anyone who really wants to can "
"definitely get through it! Here, look!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데 이 새로운 길은... 반홀드를 통과하는 길만큼 접근이 편리하지 않을 지도 몰라요. 오히려 더 번거로울 수도 있겠네요. 그래도 "
"사람들이 지나다닐 수는 있겠죠! 여기, 보세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "63984192-7625-4284-9734-c1516a9f627b"
msgid ""
"\"We straightened up his fence, painted it, and put some wolves' heads on "
"top to scare off enemies! We even started building a catapult along the "
"wall, and then here he comes – running up, waving his hands, yelling his "
"head off!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 보켄 영감의 담벼락을 똑바로 세우고, 적에 대한 경고의 의미로 늑대 머리 몇개를 올려두었어요! 사실 벽을 따라 투석기도 "
"설치하려고 했는데, 마침 그 때 보켄 영감이 손을 흔들고, 고함을 치면서 달려오더라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "d1efeb89-702b-4ff6-bf26-8de650fc1284"
msgid ""
"\"Pity! We're ready for any feat! If you need us to perform a feat, you "
"won't have to ask twice!\""
msgstr "\"아쉽네요! 아무 일이나 맡겨만 주세요! 우리의 솜씨가 필요하면, 두 번 말할 필요도 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "8734fb14-6599-42f2-a1fe-b6db9c3cb440"
msgid ""
"{n}Elki slaps the young tiefling on the side of his head.{/n} \"Forgive him, "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, he's got a big "
"mouth. So big that when he comes to visit someone, his tongue enters first, "
"and talks rubbish for a few minutes before the rest of his head shows up!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘키가 그 티플링 아이의 머리를 후려칩니다.{/n} \"용서하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 말이 많은 녀석이에요. 말이 "
"어찌나 많은지 누구를 만나러 갈 때면 혀만 먼저 와서 몇 분이나 떠들다가 나머지 머리가 찾아올 녀석이거든요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "01480218-9616-4043-b47b-368a2102febc"
msgid ""
"\"These two are trying to say that your visit is a great honor for us! How "
"can we help you? Don't say that we can't! There are many things we can do. – "
"Just try us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 두 녀석이 하려던 말은 와주셔서 영광이라는 거였어요! 뭘 도와드리면 될까요? 도와드릴게 없다고는 하지 말아주세요! 우리는 뭐든지 "
"할 수 있으니까요. 말씀만 하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "d90bd51d-f146-4842-821c-5319ef3af117"
msgid ""
"\"But we've only just arrived! Why would you send us away? We didn't do "
"anything wrong!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 우리는 방금 도착했단 말이에요! 왜 우리를 쫓아내려고 하시는 거죠? 우리는 잘못한 게 없는데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "6f907c05-628d-454a-b5ce-8267c77730b2"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! You must think we're a gang of "
"useless loons...\" {n}The girl looks at Naiho askance.{/n} \"And I can "
"understand why you'd think that... But please, don't send us away! Give us a "
"chance to prove ourselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저희가 쓸모 없는 바보들이라고 생각하시는 거 알아요...\" {n}소녀는 나이호를 "
"째려봅니다.{/n} \"왜 그러시는지는 알겠지만... 그래도 부탁이에요, 우리를 쫓아내지 마세요! 우리에게 기회를 주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "c3db0523-3679-45c2-86be-a461637d539f"
msgid "\"Yes! Just give us a chance – we'll show you!\""
msgstr "\"맞아요! 저희한테 기회를 주세요. 꼭 잘 해낼 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "9e9e8783-47d2-4aaf-bf2b-a9d0d75d8655"
msgid ""
"\"Shame on you! The {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} trusted us with "
"{mf|his|her} bones, and you're not going to steal them! Don't you worry, "
"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, we'll take care of your bones! "
"They'll be as shiny as new!\""
msgstr ""
"\"부끄러운 줄 알아! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서는 우리를 신뢰하고 계시는데, 감히 뼈를 훔치려고 하다니! 걱정 마세요, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 뼈들은 저희한테 맡겨 주세요! 새 것처럼 반짝거리게 닦아 놓을게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "5886d38c-20ad-43c5-801e-9aaac729471c"
msgid "\"If you need anything, just whistle!\""
msgstr "\"필요한 게 있으시면, 휘파람만 불어 주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "1018c730-5268-48c2-87a1-507673e9b39b"
msgid ""
"\"Do you really think {mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} wants "
"us to tell {mf|him|her} about {mf|his|her} lands?\""
msgstr "\"넌 정말로 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 우리가 자기 땅에 대해 설명하는 걸 듣고 싶어 하실거라고 생각하니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "827233a9-5985-4f2b-9838-6709a46daa29"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? The swamps here are – ooh! – so juicy, green, and blooming! And "
"the mosquitoes whistle day and night... The Padishah himself would envy you! "
"All right, enough talk, it's time we get to work!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 아니겠어요? 이곳의 늪지는, 우! 정말 축축하고, 초록색이고, 사방에 꽃이 피어 있지요! 모기들도 밤낮없이 앵앵거리구요... "
"파디샤라도 영주님을 부러워할 거예요! 좋아요, 말씀 감사했어요. 우리는 일하러 가야겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "cf83e9d7-6f39-4e89-8ba4-8ccf380f9a46"
msgid "\"And fishing rods! Don't forget your fishing rods!\""
msgstr "\"낚싯대도! 낚싯대도 잊지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "bb9f71c2-9528-4446-8860-519ed5563fd5"
msgid ""
"\"What are you thinking, you goof-offs! The most important thing is to take "
"a lot of rope, so we have something to measure with!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 생각하는 거야. 멍청이들아! 가장 중요한 건 로프야. 로프를 챙겨야 길이를 잴 수 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "d000edd3-f1b8-4da2-996f-d9e7d94e6422"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe if we found such a road, we'll be accepted into the Pathfinder "
"Society!\""
msgstr "\"만약 우리가 그런 길을 찾아낸다면, 패스파인더 협회에서 일원으로 받아줄지도 몰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "c1abb0f2-8446-4ee3-a663-8008f124bd03"
msgid ""
"\"There's a nice old lady who lives there. – She's green all over, but she's "
"not an orc. And she wears such a weird hat. She poured us some mushroom tea "
"and served us frog-eye cakes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기에 친절한 노부인이 살고 계세요. 그녀는 온통 초록색이지만 오크는 아니에요. 이상한 모자도 쓰고 있구요. 우리에게 버섯차도 "
"따라주고 개구리 눈알 케이크도 대접해주었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "bc08c9ea-bd80-442b-b84c-79208831147d"
msgid ""
"\"But first she asked us to pick some flowers for her, and it turned out "
"they only grow on poisonous shambling mounds... But we couldn't say no to "
"such a kind old lady!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 처음에 그 부인이 우리에게 꽃을 따다달라고 부탁했는데, 알고보니 그 꽃들은 독성을 띤 섐블링 마운드 위에서 자라고 있지 "
"뭐에요... 하지만 그렇게 친절한 노부인의 부탁을 거절할 수는 없었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "4c49d07b-fa17-445e-8e43-161c378e4144"
msgid "\"So we had to put everything back where it was!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 모든 걸 원래대로 돌려놔야만 했어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "7a484451-6ca2-4dd8-871e-3643d8137e0e"
msgid ""
"\"There are so many interesting things in the swamps... Here, look what we "
"found!\""
msgstr "\"늪지에는 흥미로운 것들이 많아요... 여기, 우리가 찾은 것 좀 보세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "08a03c5c-5c04-4477-87e3-98009e016afe"
msgid "\"He's tamed, even potty-trained!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 길들였어요. 심지어 똥오줌도 가린다니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "e9ed3119-e361-4cf7-aa1b-20a879ee8446"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling proudly presents you with a huge skein of wet rope.{/n} "
"\"This long!\""
msgstr "{n}티플링은 당신에게 물에 흠뻑 젖은 거대한 로프 뭉치를 자랑스럽게 건넵니다.{/n} \"둘레는 이만큼이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "903a6092-a82e-4680-ad9b-88cce97f6f07"
msgid ""
"{n}The tieflings unfold a scrawled map in front of you.{/n} \"First here. "
"Then down to the cave, then crawl up to here, and then dive into this "
"underground lake. And you come out of here. Yes, it does seem like you're "
"going the wrong way, but if you climb this rock, throw a rope over to this "
"tree, you can use it to get to the other side, avoiding all the lava down "
"there, and then it's only about forty miles to Talon Peak!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링들은 당신 앞에 개발괴발 그린 지도를 펼쳐 보입니다.{/n} \"우선 여기에요. 그리고 동굴 쪽으로 내려가서 여기로 "
"기어오르고, 이 지하 호수에 뛰어들어요. 그러면 여기로 나오게 되죠. 맞아요, 길을 잘못 든 것 같겠지만, 이 바위에 올라서 이 나무 "
"위로 로프를 던져서 감으면 그걸 잡고 맞은 편으로 건너갈 수 있어요. 아래 깔린 용암들을 피해서요. 그럼 이제 발톱 봉우리까지는 "
"40마일만 더 가면 돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "5bb21746-7aff-48bc-91f0-ef17222ad406"
msgid ""
"\"That's probably the way the ancient cyclops went. Look, we even found some "
"coins there!\""
msgstr "\"거기는 분명 고대 사이클롭스가 다니던 길일 거예요. 보세요, 동전도 발견했다니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "e1ecd11c-dcec-459b-abc1-17d48148e8a6"
msgid ""
"\"He doesn't like the color, the heads will attract flies, and it turns out "
"he wanted to keep the shed that we disassembled to make the catapult. He "
"made us put everything back the way it was.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보켄은 우리가 칠한 색도 마음에 안들고, 늑대 머리가 있으면 파리가 꼬인다고 싫대요. 그리고 우리가 투석기를 만들려고 헐었던 창고도 "
"꼭 있어야 되는 거라고 하더라구요. 결국 모든 걸 원래대로 되돌려 놓으란 얘기였지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "1157f5c4-e4db-4554-b74f-34d31322b35f"
msgid ""
"\"But as we were leaving, he was so happy! He even gave us a little "
"something for the road! There, have some!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 우리가 떠난다니까 그도 좋아했어요! 심지어 가는 길에 먹을 것까지 챙겨줬다니까요! 이거예요, 좀 드셔 보세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "31416083-f09f-4f8c-a947-dd2e033bc527"
msgid ""
"\"Our Elder? She's the best!\" {n}Naiho jumps in place, waving his hands.{/n}"
msgstr "\"우리 누님이요? 정말 최고죠!\" {n}나이호는 손을 흔들면서 제자리에서 펄쩍펄쩍 뜁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "7af7b84a-c4df-41ef-95de-863bb3a9660f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! We've known her for many years. Though at first we didn't know she's "
"a tiefling like us...\""
msgstr "\"맞아요! 우리는 누님이랑 제법 오래 알고 지냈죠. 처음에는 누님이 우리같은 티플링인 줄도 몰랐다니까요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "b8d41131-8392-4bac-9e70-f86bfec8b106"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, if nothing else, we always have a lot of stories! Ask, and we'll tell "
"you anything you like!\""
msgstr "\"맞아요, 다른 일만 없다면, 이야깃거리는 언제나 많아요! 말씀만 하세요, 뭐든지 들려드릴게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "25251d9b-ea1c-401e-80a0-822209986467"
msgid ""
"\"And the people here! In Qadira everyone's face is either servile or "
"arrogant. Everyone is looking for someone to bow to or look down on. It's so "
"different here. Everyone is their own master. Even the bandits on the high "
"road. – Of course they'll take your boots off you, but with respect, from "
"one free person to another!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이곳의 사람들도요! 카디라 사람들의 표정은 아주 거만하거나, 아주 비굴하거나 둘 중 하나예요. 거리에 나가면 다들 엎드려 절할 "
"사람과 깔아보고 업신여길 사람을 구분하느라 정신없지요. 하지만 여긴 달라요. 만인이 자기 자신의 주인이죠. 심지어는 산길에서 마주치는 "
"강도조차 그래요. 물론 강도들이 장화를 벗겨간다는 점은 같지만, 적어도 자유인끼리, 서로 존중하면서 강탈하는 거죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "67e5462c-2655-4dba-a372-3052474fa38c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's some story! We were walking at night in complete darkness "
"through an empty moonlit barren...\""
msgstr "\"아, 그거 정말 대단한 이야기지요! 우리는 캄캄한 한밤중에 달빛만 비추는 황무지를 걸어가고 있었어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "17937229-8634-4471-a0e4-518aae3eb334"
msgid ""
"\"And we got lost, and stumbled into a scary thicket! But then we saw light "
"ahead – a witch's house! As soon as we went inside, she...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 길을 잃어버렸고, 무시무시한 덤불에 발이 묶였지요! 그런데 앞쪽에 빛이 보였어요. 마녀의 집이었죠! 우리가 안으로 들어가자마자 "
"그녀는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "ef7a15e1-c93b-43cb-9623-5c6bc92bb7ea"
msgid ""
"\"… she said we are dummies who couldn't watch our tongues, and threw us "
"out. And the Disk of the Eclipse? We found out about that by accident. – A "
"peddler talked to us on the road, and just gave us an ancient chronicle "
"where we read about it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"… 그녀는 우리가 버릇 없는 얼간이들이라며 우리를 쫓아냈어요. 아, 해와 달을 삼킨 원반이요? 그걸 찾은 건 우연이었어요. 길가에서 "
"행상인이 말을 걸더니, 고대의 연대기를 주더라구요. 원반에 대한 건 그 연대기에서 읽었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "2127aaa3-3ce4-4e12-90a4-cfbdc1e0bf27"
msgid ""
"\"We accidentally used the chronicle for kindling... but we remembered "
"everything we read really well!\""
msgstr "\"실수로 연대기를 불쏘시개로 써버렸지 뭐에요... 하지만 읽은 내용은 똑똑히 기억하고 있었거든요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "2e1152c2-9683-4718-b7ac-3160500dfea5"
msgid ""
"\"One time we prepared a lot of different sweets and wanted to sell them. We "
"were sitting in the street – they don't let you into the market without a "
"fee! Then there they were – boys and girls, in wonderful dress, obviously "
"rich or noble. And with them – an emberkin. So beautiful!!\" {n}Elki sighs "
"dreamily.{/n} \"She wanted to buy some sweets from us, but her friends "
"scoffed at us and took her away. And it was Kalikke! She was only pretending "
"to be an aasimar, using an illusion...\""
msgstr ""
"\"예전에 우리는 사탕을 이것저것 많이 구해서 장사나 해볼까 한 적이 있었어요. 시장에서 장사를 하려면 자리세를 내야했거든요! 그래서 "
"그냥 길거리에 앉아 있었는데, 그 때 그 사람들이 다가왔어요. 훌륭한 옷을 입은 소년 소녀들이었는데, 모두가 부자에 귀족들인게 분명했죠. "
"그리고 그 무리들 안에 엠버킨이 있었어요. 어찌나 아름답던지!!\" {n}엘키는 꿈꾸듯 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"그녀가 우리 사탕을 "
"사려고 했지만 그녀의 친구들이 우리를 비웃고는 서둘러 그녀를 데려갔어요. 그리고 그게 바로 칼리케였던 거죠! 그녀는 환영을 이용해서 "
"아시마르로 위장한 거였어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "d0ebab0a-4eb3-46f9-858e-225f470dd632"
msgid ""
"\"And Elki fell in love right away, ha ha ha! Hey, what are you looking at? "
"It's the truth! Well, she found us later. And bought our sweets, and started "
"to keep an eye on us. She called us the Sweet Teeth ever since! Ah, our "
"Elder... we'd be lost without her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 엘키는 한눈에 반해버렸죠, 하하하! 왜 나를 째려보는 거야? 사실이잖아! 나중에, 칼리케가 우릴 찾아왔어요. 우리 사탕을 좀 "
"팔아주고, 우리에게 관심을 갖기 시작했죠. 우리를 단 것 중독자들이라고 부른 것도 그 때부터였어요! 아, 우리 누님... 누님이 "
"아니었다면 우리도 살아남지 못했을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Naiho_Capital
msgctxt "1b11e7ee-3092-4cbe-8649-0be67ca3ec3a"
msgid "\"Such a shame! We only just got started! Oh, well, that's too bad.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 수가! 우리는 방금 시작한건데 말이에요! 아, 이건 너무 심하네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Elki_Capital
msgctxt "725c234e-3d55-4672-a556-11bea1ce5904"
msgid ""
"\"If you manage to come up with any more tasks for us — feel free to come "
"visit! We're here all the time.\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 맡길 일이 있다면 언제든지 찾아오세요! 우리는 늘 여기에 있으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/SweetTooth/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : TieflingsHobo_Tavi_Capital
msgctxt "58066c37-3a0b-448a-918c-3110b3801aef"
msgid ""
"{n}Tevi lowers her eyes.{/n} \"We promise to keep away from our friend. And "
"I think I know why we're always being sent out on errands.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}테비가 시선을 떨굽니다.{/n} \"우리는 우리 친구 칼리케로부터 떨어져 있겠다고 약속했어. 나는 왜 우리가 항상 심부름을 하러 "
"나도는지 알 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "29c2ccf7-2607-42df-86af-fb76f373ed97"
msgid "\"Kanerah, Kalikke. How can you both be here?\""
msgstr "\"카네라, 칼리케. 어떻게 여기에 둘이 같이 있는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "b2fe0d0f-4ad4-4f68-98f5-a2248b81174a"
msgid "\"We have to go.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8ae6ae35-24ea-442d-abc5-c8ae935250cb"
msgid "\"So you broke Nethys' second condition...\""
msgstr "\"그러니까, 네서스의 두번째 계약 조건을 깬 거구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "df0850b4-e1b6-4d2d-93d6-3a1c1b7d6d92"
msgid ""
"{n}Approaching Kanerah and Kalikke, you see the girls sitting closely and "
"speaking very quietly. A warmth touched with sadness sounds in their "
"voices.{/n} \"And snow? Do you like snow? Oh, what am I thinking... of "
"course you'll say snow is impractical.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라와 칼리케에게 다가가자, 당신은 두 소녀가 가까이 앉아 조용히 대화하는 것을 볼 수 있습니다. 그들의 목소리에는 슬픔과 함께 "
"따스한 온정이 실려 있습니다.{/n} \"그리고 눈은? 눈은 좋아해? 참, 내가 무슨 소리를... 당연히 언니는 눈은 쓸모가 없다고 "
"말하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "371677a0-c8fa-4e3a-bd1a-be90cfe58b8e"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, you hear the sounds of a quarrel.{/n} \"No, this won't "
"do! If you hadn't done such foolish things right from the beginning, I "
"wouldn't have had to do anything cruel! And neither of us would have to deal "
"with the consequences...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가가자 싸우는 소리가 들렸습니다.{/n} \"안 돼, 이건 아니지! 네가 처음부터 그런 멍청한 짓을 하지 않았다면, 내가 "
"그런 잔인한 짓을 할 필요도 없었어! 그 결과 때문에 씨름하지 않아도 됐을 거고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6924e14b-7170-48a2-90fb-68761f26c912"
msgid ""
"\"Kanerah, that's enough. We'll discuss it all later – if we even survive. "
"If you can even resist the temptation to scold and berate me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"카네라, 그만해. 그건 나중에 이야기하자. 우리가 살아남으면, 그리고 언니가 날 혼내고 싶은 유혹을 참아낼 수 있으면 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7e605716-078d-41e6-9302-06e03b87d07f"
msgid "\"You're the one who started it! Oh, look, it's {name}!\""
msgstr "\"네가 먼저 시작한거잖아! 아, 봐라! {name}야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ab4ad8a8-c682-4098-b38d-e71aca504284"
msgid ""
"\"I'll even say I'm ready to listen to your poetic chatter for a while – "
"once we escape from this beautiful but rather dangerous palace... oh, look! "
"There's {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 시적인 수다도 잠깐이라면 들어줄 준비가 되어 있어. 우리가 이 아름답지만 위험한 궁전을 떠나기만 하면 말이야... 아, 봐봐! "
"저기 {name}야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5532b760-7617-4093-aa95-59cbd859ea80"
msgid ""
"\"It's all because of the House at the edge of time.\" {n}Kalikke smiles to "
"you.{/n} \"At least we think that's why. This place... it's like it's split, "
"and exists both here and there, 'today' and 'yesterday'... Even the mirrors "
"here show delayed reflections. I was wandering here alone, passed through "
"the mist, and Kanerah was standing on the other side...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 전부 시간의 끝에 선 집 때문이야.\" {n}칼리케가 당신을 보고 웃습니다.{/n} \"최소한 우리 생각에는 그래. 이 "
"곳은... 둘로 나뉘어진 것들이 동시에 존재하는 곳이야. 여기와 저기, 어제와 오늘에... 심지어 여기서는 거울조차도 시간차를 두고 "
"영상을 비춰주지. 나는 여기에서 안개 속을 홀로 돌아다니고 있었고 카네라는 맞은 편에 서있었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "223b4f24-fae5-4e07-8cff-b1c55f71958e"
msgid "\"We're ready. For anything.\""
msgstr "\"우린 준비 되었어. 무슨 일이든지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "77d2a3d7-a760-4cd3-82f7-6ac2326d1e0e"
msgid ""
"\"It's a good thing I thought of going through the same mist, and caught up "
"with this dreamer! I was right on time for the soul eater. It wasn't real, "
"of course – someone had unleashed an illusion on us. If we didn't know that "
"you helped save us from that creepy fiend, we might have taken the bait!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마침 나도 안개 속을 좀 걸을까 생각했다가, 이 몽유병자를 따라잡을 수 있었던게 다행이었지! 바로 그때 영혼 포식자가 나를 노리고 "
"있었거든. 물론 진짜 영혼 포식자는 아니었고, 누군가가 풀어놓은 환영이었지. 만약에 네가 그 역겨운 악마로부터 우리를 이미 구해줬다는 걸 "
"몰랐더라면 그 미끼를 덥석 물 뻔 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d29a71e6-896f-4aa8-943f-8da86fd33fe8"
msgid "\"Ready or not, but we can roast a few fey along the way! Lead on!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 숨었든, 가는 길에 페이 몇마리는 구워버릴 수 있겠지! 앞장 서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5a3d1662-01d0-4c24-aebd-87a3d01465cc"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... and the Forefather warned us about it. What's going to happen now?\""
msgstr "\"그래... 선조가 이걸 경고했던 적이 있어. 이제 무슨 일이 생길까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "fce8692e-ef9d-4730-b4e8-8d735c34993a"
msgid ""
"\"How about we put off these worries for later? It can wait until we escape "
"the dominion of the insane fey queen.\""
msgstr "\"그런 걱정거리는 좀 미뤄두는게 어떨까? 일단 정신나간 페이 여왕의 영역은 탈출한 다음으로 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "87feac12-d9e0-497d-aeae-1b73da94e80b"
msgid "\"Wait! Can I steal you for a minute?\""
msgstr "\"잠시만! 잠깐 얘기 좀 할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0653f35d-abcd-4099-a96a-fef8b312f321"
msgid ""
"\"Listen. Now may not be the best time, but I wanted to say something to "
"you, before we go marching into the clutches of that insane green fey "
"sorceress. You already have quite a happy relationship, and I don't want to "
"keep playing second fiddle any more. I need to find someone who will be "
"serious about being my partner... if I survive, of course! That's all I "
"wanted to say. Now let's go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어봐. 지금 얘기하기는 좀 그렇지만, 정신나간 초록색 페이 마법사의 손아귀로 걸어들어가기 전에 좀 할 말이 있어. 너는 이미 꽤 "
"행복한 관계를 가지고 있고, 나는 양다리에는 더 이상 흥미 없어. 나도 이제는 나를 진지하게 대해 줄 누군가가 필요해... 물론, 내가 "
"살아남았을 때 말이야! 말하고 싶은 건 이게 다야. 그럼 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "38906cfb-1019-407b-9fc9-4293190500ec"
msgid ""
"\"I might never get a chance, because we'll all die a painful death and so "
"on. But I don't want to die without saying you're the only priceless "
"treasure in this world, one I'd never trade – even for immortality and power!"
"\" {n}She follows her impulses and holds you close, wrapping her arms and "
"tail around you, and kisses you tenderly on the lips.{/n} \"Now we can go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 모두가 고통스럽게 죽게 될테니 아마 나에겐 기회가 없을 것 같아. 하지만 나에게 네가 어떤 것과도 바꿀 수 없는 소중한 "
"보물이라는 건 죽기 전에 꼭 말해주고 싶었어. 설령 불사와 권능을 준다고 해도!\" {n}그녀는 격정적으로 당신을 끌어안습니다. 팔과 "
"꼬리로 당신을 껴안은 그녀가 부드럽게 키스합니다.{/n} \"이제 가도 되겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "251af80a-aac8-4cdb-950a-68020ece0981"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah comes closer and puts her arms on your shoulders.{/n} \"I just "
"have to say that you're the partner I could only dream of. Of course, being "
"with you involves more than a few mortal dangers, and troubles crashing down "
"on our heads. But it's a small price to pay. The more pleasant parts of this "
"relationship more than make up for all that! Now let's go. To our victory!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 다가와 당신의 어깨에 양 팔을 얹습니다.{/n} \"이건 꼭 말해야겠어. 너는 내가 꿈에서나 상상해오던 완벽한 파트너야. "
"물론 너와 함께 하는 길에는 목숨이 여러 번 왔다갔다할 만큼 위험한 말썽도 많았지. 하지만 그 정도는 감수할 수 있어. 너랑 만나는 "
"즐거움이 훨씬 더 크니까! 이제 가자. 우리의 승리를 향해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "1e061b79-465a-4705-b1bd-325d4211b904"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to tell you something, {name}. I've got a feeling that you're "
"working to help a certain green lady for some reason. I feel uneasy — and a "
"little fearful — standing in the way of such an alliance! I don't want to "
"share you with anyone anymore, even with her. And I don't want to find "
"myself strangled to death by vines while I sleep. Forgive me, and good luck "
"with her! I'm afraid you're going to need all the luck in the world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하고 싶은 말이 있어, {name}. 내 생각에 너는 어째선지 그 초록색 마님을 돕기 위해 움직이고 있는 것 같아. 내가 그런 관계의 "
"가운데 서 있다는 건 무섭고도 불편한 일이야. 나는 이제 더 이상 누구와도 널 공유하고 싶지 않아. 잠자는 동안 덩쿨에 목졸려 죽고 "
"싶지도 않고. 미안하지만, 그녀와 잘 해보길 바라! 그녀와 잘 되려면 세계의 모든 행운을 다 끌어다 써도 모자랄까 걱정이지만 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/CutsceneBarks/1TwinsTOS_Kalikke_String
msgctxt "17237cdf-d412-4caf-b206-36ac0bc6fce3"
msgid "\"What a beautiful place... Ah, the way it sings of solitude!\""
msgstr "\"정말 아름다운 곳이구나... 고독을 노래하는 얼마나 우아한 방법인지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/CutsceneBarks/2TwinsTOS_Kanerah_String
msgctxt "2c237b90-50ed-48d1-b1c1-8e5ed7d19bba"
msgid ""
"\"No, just look at her! Walking around the enemy's lair, enjoying the "
"scenery!\""
msgstr "\"아니, 칼리케 좀 봐! 적의 소굴을 걷고 있으면서도 경치를 즐기다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/CutsceneBarks/3TwinsTOS_Kanerah_String
msgctxt "0575f085-765d-4de9-835b-d3a3bf97c9bb"
msgid "\"You're a crazy goat! How do you even survive without me?\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 제정신 아닌 바보라니까! 그 동안 나 없이 목숨은 어떻게 부지했대?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/CutsceneBarks/4TwinsTOS_Kalikke_String
msgctxt "df32f3f8-9831-47cf-8042-bdb0dfe611bd"
msgid "\"Kanerah...\""
msgstr "\"카네라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/CutsceneBarks/5TwinsTOS_Kalikke_String
msgctxt "2af558a6-6a13-45aa-a429-096bbf2093f6"
msgid "\"How... how can both of us be here? Is this a dream?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게... 우리 둘이 여기에 동시에 있지? 꿈인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TestOfLoyalty/CutsceneBarks/6TwinsTOS_Kanerah_String
msgctxt "47df59fd-e93b-4c5b-bb3c-753fcb3deace"
msgid "\"I don't know! Wait... what's that noise?!\""
msgstr "\"모르겠어! 잠깐... 무슨 소리지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f35bbd9f-e6e1-4bea-922d-25410362d9bd"
msgid "\"I'm glad we'll be together for our final battle.\""
msgstr "\"마지막 전투를 우리가 함께 치를 수 있다니 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "3a9266b8-d9e2-4c89-a666-aebace19cbb0"
msgid ""
"\"I nearly lost my crown – and my life – but still you stayed with me until "
"the end, Kanerah. Why? I'm not much of a patron nowadays...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 왕위를 잃을 뻔 했어. 심지어는 목숨까지도 잃을 뻔했지. 그런데도 카네라, 너는 마지막까지 나와 함께 해주는구나. 이유가 뭐야? "
"이제 나는 후원자도 뭣도 아닌데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "db9d3421-da3a-4d4f-b6a1-fd686147518b"
msgid "\"You look so preoccupied, Kalikke. What's on your mind?\""
msgstr "\"칼리케, 너 뭔가 생각에 빠져 있구나. 무슨 일인데 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "5b1f3ec5-b0f2-4f4c-94f3-5701553505ae"
msgid "\"It's time for us to visit the Lantern King.\""
msgstr "\"이제 등불왕을 찾아갈 차례야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c2ad0e75-e95f-4a6c-8e2d-dd439a0dcec0"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke seems deep in thoughts, but gives you a warm and sad smile.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}칼리케는 깊은 생각에 잠겨 있다가, 당신에게 따뜻하고도 슬픈 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "815691f2-22e2-4145-aa29-665a71f738b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah seems to be calculating something in her head, but chuckles when "
"she notices you.{/n} \"I'm ready for battle!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 머리 속으로 무언가를 계산하는 듯 싶더니, 당신이 온 것을 알고는 피식 웃습니다.{/n} \"싸울 준비가 됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2ba77044-2914-47ad-90b9-be2f86cd2d70"
msgid "{n}The sisters stand quietly side by side, focused and resolute.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}두 자매가 어깨를 나란히하고 서 있습니다. 그들의 침묵에서 단호한 결의와 집중력을 읽을 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2ba9e035-26e5-423a-942f-bc2caa96a3fd"
msgid ""
"\"Don't take me for one of those fidgety creatures who change sides at the "
"first sign of danger. That's no way to achieve success in life. And as for "
"you...\" {n}Kanerah winks.{/n} \"Let's say in your case I'm drawn by "
"affection.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 위험을 느끼자마자 배신할 생각부터 하는 그런 겁쟁이가 아니라고. 그건 패배자의 길이지. 그리고 나로 말할 것 같으면...\" "
"{n}카네라는 윙크합니다.{/n} \"너의 매력에 홀딱 빠졌다고 쳐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9a5b4d81-c8c2-4387-857e-b4cbb5ebea9f"
msgid ""
"\"Of course you're glad! What would you do without me!\" {n}Kanerah laughs, "
"letting you know she's joking, then stretches and turns a bit more "
"serious.{/n} \"I can't tell what is to come, and this makes me uneasy. But "
"my gut is telling me we can handle it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연히 좋아해야지! 내가 없으면 안된다니까!\" {n}카네라는 농담이라도 했다는 듯 웃으며 기지개를 켜더니, 약간 진지한 표정을 "
"짓습니다.{/n} \"무슨 일이 일어날 지는 모르는 거고, 솔직히 마음이 영 편치가 않아. 그래도 느낌이 와. 우리는 해낼 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e1d74160-1cb3-499c-94f4-c2739946842e"
msgid ""
"\"This land can only have one ruler!\" {n}Kanerah smiles a predatory "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr "\"이 땅의 지배자는 한 명뿐이야!\" {n}카네라가 음흉하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5ee54baf-4ebc-4839-b619-bdd42d702267"
msgid ""
"\"We'll do whatever it takes, to recover what's been taken from us and save "
"this miserable land.\""
msgstr "\"빼앗긴 것을 되찾고 이 저주받은 땅을 구할 수만 있다면, 무슨 일이든 하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6d006bac-9568-4ba2-bdf8-5d99f5c92966"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke sighs and blushes a little.{/n} \"Just – terribly silly things. I "
"often do this to distract myself from trouble and worry. – I daydream about "
"complete nonsense. Just now I was thinking how wonderful it would be to see "
"the snow and make a snowman... I've never done anything like that before!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케가 한숨 짓고는 얼굴을 살짝 붉힙니다.{/n} \"그냥 골칫거리를 잊고 싶을 때 가끔 하는 바보짓이야. 말도 안 되는 공상을 "
"하는 거지. 지금 생각하던 건 눈이 와서 눈사람을 만들면 얼마나 좋을까 하는 거였어... 한번도 안 해봤었거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7ac87dfa-863c-4b8f-b3f2-522449f125ff"
msgid ""
"\"It turns out that it's not so easy to be the heroes of song and legend... "
"but we can do it. I know it. I believe it.\""
msgstr "\"전설 속의 영웅이 되는 건 쉽지 않구나... 하지만 우리는 할 수 있어. 나는 알아. 나는 믿고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/HubBarks/KalikkeHub_BeforeDevil_bark_String
msgctxt "4d89a4d5-3fe3-4a84-a324-34700bace466"
msgid ""
"\"I have a bad feeling about this. Maybe I'm just tired, but I sense a "
"disaster is coming...\""
msgstr "\"예감이 좋지 않아. 그냥 피곤해서 그런 걸 수도 있지만, 꼭 재앙이 다가오는 것 같은 느낌이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/HubBarks/KalikkeHub_bark_String
msgctxt "5f13246e-2b7e-490d-9ece-18b08799f7e2"
msgid "\"I'm ready for anything, and we'll do whatever it takes.\""
msgstr "\"나는 준비됐어. 뭐든지 해낼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/HubBarks/KanerahHub_BeforeDevil_bark_String
msgctxt "64ac365f-1c8c-4436-a97f-9ca92aacfa94"
msgid "\"I don't like this silence. Something is surely about to happen.\""
msgstr "\"이 정적이 마음에 안 들어. 분명 무언가 곧 일어날 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/1DLC/TwinsPartingWords/HubBarks/KanerahHub_bark_String
msgctxt "fd1ef1da-ad5f-4c0f-90a5-1d9ca092afaf"
msgid "\"Now we're afraid of nothing! Look out, Lantern King...\""
msgstr "\"이제 두려울 게 없다! 등불왕, 기다려라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/03_Jamandi_new_String
msgctxt "7caeb82d-9095-4569-994b-1ffcf90971d1"
msgid ""
"\"The tamer of the Shrike Hills, who put an end to the atrocities of the "
"Stag Lord's bandits!\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주의 폭정을 끝내버리고, 슈라이크 구릉지를 평정한 장본인이시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/03_Jamandi_new_f_String
msgctxt "d1826de4-2e0e-4d60-8486-24d33b26332c"
msgid ""
"\"The tamer of the Shrike Hills, who put an end to the atrocities of the "
"Stag Lord's bandits!\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주의 폭정을 끝내버리고, 슈라이크 구릉지를 평정한 장본인이시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/06_Jamandi_new_String
msgctxt "49a66525-e380-4fad-bda1-2bfc916100d9"
msgid "\"Rise, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"영주여, 일어나시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Arguing_Cephal_1_String
msgctxt "a514df65-bf11-4070-80f7-7f1e9ee41458"
msgid "\"...Maegar, can you even hear yourself? What utter rubbish...\""
msgstr "\"...메이가르, 자네가 무슨 말을 하는지는 알고 있나? 무슨 말도 안되는 헛소리를...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Arguing_Cephal_2_String
msgctxt "d0b17244-1fe5-4fc3-9ffa-ca0041c2d228"
msgid ""
"\"...you are single-handedly destroying everything we've worked so hard for, "
"these many years...\""
msgstr "\"...단 한 순간에 수년 간 우리가 이뤄놓은 모든 것을 박살 내고 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Arguing_Cephal_3_String
msgctxt "9cb38b1a-9203-47f3-9a94-9c086730bf38"
msgid "\"...no, no, and no! You have no idea...\""
msgstr "\"...아니, 아니, 아니! 자네는 아무것도 몰라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Arguing_Varn_1_String
msgctxt "d6723a74-c2d4-4ad3-b776-98e652abad17"
msgid "\"...no, you need to listen to me...\""
msgstr "\"...아니, 자네는 내 말을 들어야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Arguing_Varn_2_String
msgctxt "824e973f-58b8-466c-8889-d395dba85795"
msgid "\"...Don't even start! This is...\""
msgstr "\"...시작하지도 말게! 이건...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Arguing_Varn_3_String
msgctxt "307c4f88-27b1-4572-807a-be2c6c2b6be9"
msgid "\"...say whatever you want, but I will not tolerate...\""
msgstr "\"...마음대로 말하게나, 하지만 더 이상 참지 않겠네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Jamandi_1_String
msgctxt "43a33471-8cfe-4a6a-b97f-1680a85fdfb0"
msgid "\"Step forward.\""
msgstr "\"앞으로 나오시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Jamandi_2_String
msgctxt "c97087c6-c8cd-4b98-8b75-be4c7aec590c"
msgid ""
"\"On behalf of the people of the Free City of Restov, I confer upon you this "
"noble title!\""
msgstr "\"레스토프 자유시의 전 인민을 대표하여, 그대에게 이 고귀한 칭호를 내리노라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Jamandi_3_String
msgctxt "1f9bb127-e3a0-40cc-9422-c6b78c46dcf9"
msgid "\"Rise, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"영주여, 일어나시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Varn_1_String
msgctxt "0fbe47f8-bd2e-458d-981f-b55fca14ccd8"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Lady Aldori, distinguished guests. It's a great honor for me.\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다, 알도리 경. 직접 왕림해주시다니, 큰 영광입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Varn_2_String
msgctxt "4df64135-6798-41c1-8834-ff80bdcfe988"
msgid ""
"\"It is with the greatest joy that I announce the founding of my barony in "
"Dunsward. It shall be called... Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"던스워드에 제 남작령의 설립을 선포하는 것은 매우 즐거운 일입니다. 그 곳은 이렇게 불리게 될 겁니다... 반홀드!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Varn_3_String
msgctxt "f301a70e-a43a-4c90-94e7-c6ec002709f2"
msgid ""
"\"But I must say that this happy event is not mine to claim alone. The "
"Stolen Lands would never have yielded to me, if it weren't for the valor of "
"my friends and companions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 이 행복이 저만의 일이 아니란 것을 말씀드려야겠군요. 제 친우들과 동료들의 용맹이 아니었다면, 도둑맞은 땅은 저의 것이 되지 "
"못했을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ceremony_Varn_4_String
msgctxt "eb2eea41-fb88-483a-a3fe-cfa1e4d0261f"
msgid ""
"\"Now I would like to introduce my right hand – a hero without whose help I "
"wouldn't be standing here now. {Name}, please, step forward!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 제 심복을 소개해드리겠습니다. 이 영웅의 도움이 아니었다면 여기 서있지 못했을겁니다. {Name}, 부디 앞으로 나와주게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Drelev_String
msgctxt "2b01f77d-8cc7-47ee-9c6c-165f6c9c838a"
msgid "\"Pff! Rootless upstarts...\""
msgstr "\"흥! 근본없는 벼락부자같으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ezvanki_String
msgctxt "02da40db-fcbb-4150-aaef-c2d966ee5139"
msgid ""
"\"Building houses, setting hearths, and turning wastelands into bountiful "
"fields – these are all pious acts. May Erastil aid you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"집을 짓는 것, 난로를 설치하는 것, 그리고 황무지를 비옥한 땅으로 바꾸는 것. 이것들은 모두 경건한 행위입니다. 에라스틸께서 그대를 "
"도우시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Ezvanki_reup_String
msgctxt "b23e3db8-deed-4cc9-af7d-4b1bfa3d351b"
msgid ""
"\"Building houses, setting hearths, and turning wastelands into bountiful "
"fields – these are all pious acts. May Erastil aid you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"집을 짓는 것, 난로를 설치하는 것, 그리고 황무지를 비옥한 땅으로 바꾸는 것. 이것들은 모두 경건한 행위입니다. 에라스틸께서 그대를 "
"도우시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Guest_2_new_String
msgctxt "befe4740-20d7-413b-af3b-afbe886f1883"
msgid ""
"\"The civilized world ends at the river to the south. Beyond that are miles "
"upon miles of impassable wilderness. What a relief it is that people will be "
"settling there at last!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남쪽 강이 문명의 경계입니다. 그 너머에는 끝도 없는 미지의 황야가 펼쳐져 있지요. 그곳에 마침내 사람들이 정착하게 된다니, 안심이 "
"되는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Guest_2_new_reup_String
msgctxt "2ebbbb2c-b482-4fd9-88a2-78c818fda297"
msgid ""
"\"The civilized world ends at the river to the south. Beyond that are miles "
"upon miles of impassable wilderness. What a relief it is that people will be "
"settling there at last!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남쪽 강이 문명의 경계입니다. 그 너머에는 끝도 없는 미지의 황야가 펼쳐져 있지요. 그곳에 마침내 사람들이 정착하게 된다니, 안심이 "
"되는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Guest_3_new_String
msgctxt "fa74fc4a-d96c-4628-a652-00978f391555"
msgid ""
"\"Your lord drew a winning ticket! You must be glad that you serve in his "
"army.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 주군이 당첨표를 뽑았소! 분명 그의 군대에서 일하는게 즐겁겠구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Guest_3_new_reup_String
msgctxt "a9249f25-853c-480e-931b-292eacd7eea0"
msgid ""
"\"Your lord drew a winning ticket! You must be glad that you serve in his "
"army.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 주군이 당첨표를 뽑았소! 분명 그의 군대에서 일하는게 즐겁겠구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Guest_4_String
msgctxt "1d2a77bf-88d2-4b80-aac6-8024fa9c7e24"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Aldori doesn't have guests very often, but today's occasion warrants "
"a celebration!\""
msgstr "\"알도리 경은 손님을 자주 받지 않으십니다만, 오늘 같은 날은 기념할만하지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Kassil_String
msgctxt "730941e6-ac9b-4773-9571-8947ae3b1f3c"
msgid ""
"\"It is high time that Varn and his people were rewarded for their many "
"feats. I'm glad the moment has finally come!\""
msgstr "\"반과 그의 사람들의 무수한 재능이 보답받을 딱 좋은 때입니다. 그 순간이 마침내 왔다는 것이 즐겁군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Lander_String
msgctxt "28631633-06ed-4c1b-b21d-00d87cca1286"
msgid ""
"\"Varnhold it is, then. I'll be curious to see what you manage to build "
"there. I might even pay you a visit some time...\""
msgstr "\"반홀드라. 그곳을 어떻게 만들지 궁금해지는군. 조만간 내가 직접 들러볼 지도 모르겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Lander_reup_String
msgctxt "a7fd0f7d-c125-4b0d-af07-6783017a0da4"
msgid ""
"\"Varnhold it is, then. I'll be curious to see what you manage to build "
"there. I might even pay you a visit some time...\""
msgstr "\"반홀드라. 그곳을 어떻게 만들지 궁금해지는군. 조만간 내가 직접 들러볼 지도 모르겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Linzi_String
msgctxt "101e4822-1f6e-4e1f-818a-1f3dbd7b3e53"
msgid ""
"\"My friends went ahead, but I stayed to chat with the heroes of the "
"Varnling Host. Who would have imagined that you've accomplished so many "
"feats! I hope someone makes a song about you too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 친구들은 먼저 갔지만, 저는 반링 호스트의 영웅들과 이야기를 나누려고 기다렸어요. 당신이 그 수많은 위업을 달성할 거라고 그 누가 "
"예상했겠어요! 누가 당신 노래도 좀 만들었으면 좋겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Sellemius_String
msgctxt "c66e5afd-c77c-451e-8819-ff7ce439217c"
msgid ""
"\"Today we raise our cups to Varnhold. I only look forward to the day that "
"we raise them once more to celebrate an independent Rostland!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 우리는 반홀드를 위해 건배할거야. 언젠가 독립 로스틀랜드를 위해 건배할 날이 정말로 기다려지는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Sellemius_reup_String
msgctxt "feabca3c-44eb-4abc-9bc6-f38caa70e626"
msgid ""
"\"Today we raise our cups to Varnhold. I only look forward to the day that "
"we raise them once more to celebrate an independent Rostland!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 우리는 반홀드를 위해 건배할거야. 언젠가 독립 로스틀랜드를 위해 건배할 날이 정말로 기다려지는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Barks/Shandra_String
msgctxt "3b26ce52-85c4-478d-aab2-ac5b93980209"
msgid ""
"\"From mercenaries to barons... Well, there are some noble families with "
"even humbler beginnings!\""
msgstr "\"용병에서 남작까지라... 뭐, 초라하게 시작한 귀족 가문들도 있긴 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "84e19fc6-c494-478c-b1ba-0c0e340835e2"
msgid "\"What do you hold for the future of Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 미래를 어떻게 보시는지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "86b6aff7-dcb5-43ca-a192-ec76d21f26da"
msgid ""
"\"The Varnling Host fought for your interests many times, but we haven't had "
"a chance to meet in person yet.\""
msgstr "\"반링 호스트는 당신을 위해서 수없이 싸웠지만, 당신을 직접 보는 건 처음이군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fbab4e09-7be0-4b46-a911-8173ac8f504a"
msgid "\"I must go.\""
msgstr "\"가보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "e5fe7abb-4714-4473-8167-19b044a3c01c"
msgid "\"New victories and new glory!\""
msgstr "\"앞길에 무궁한 영광 있기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6738dae5-a226-4c48-9a77-d1b1b856c8e0"
msgid ""
"\"Work. Much difficult and dangerous work awaits us – if we are to survive.\""
msgstr "\"일이죠. 어렵고 위험한 일들이 우리를 기다리고 있습니다. 거기서 살아남을 수 있을지 모르겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "3cb022dc-b0c4-4436-9350-f9bb7e11b5e9"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing good. This is a reckless venture, and will only bring trouble to "
"everyone involved.\""
msgstr "\"좋을게 없다고 봅니다. 이건 너무 무모해요. 엮여있는 모두에게 문제만 가져다 줄거라고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d8d16068-8815-4c39-9b9d-25504f6c5b3b"
msgid "\"I wouldn't want to speculate.\""
msgstr "\"짐작하고 싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f2ba914b-e585-49a7-8c1b-4b0df7839310"
msgid ""
"\"I'll be frank. We are braced for the manipulations, guile and treachery of "
"our neighbors.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말씀드리겠습니다. 우리는 이웃들의 기만과, 속임수, 배신에 대비하고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "c9fcb054-8c3f-4ed8-b67d-6b2a72751e78"
msgid "\"We'll be fine, if that is Abadar's will!\""
msgstr "\"우린 괜찮을겁니다. 아바다르께서 살펴주시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "c274230f-c1d2-435e-a13b-345f7ceb0101"
msgid ""
"\"So you're the famous {Name}? I'm pleased to finally meet you in person. "
"{d|Varn}Varn{/d} has told me much of your deeds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아 자네가 그 유명한 {Name}? 직접 만나서 영광이군. {d|Varn}반{/d}에게서 자네의 일처리에 대해 많이 들었다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "0f2135f8-e470-43e1-ae52-f7e876958bb4"
msgid ""
"\"I only wish I knew! We live in a wild time of great changes. The rise of "
"new states in disputed lands will be a shock to the entire region. Of "
"course, I have my own thoughts and plans, as everyone does... But there's "
"only one thing I'm sure of – there will be no risk of a boring future!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 그걸 알고싶다네! 우리는 거대한 변화가 몰아치는 난세속에 살고 있어. 분쟁 지역에 새로운 나라가 건립되면 지역 전체에 영향을 "
"미칠 거야. 물론, 나도 나만의 생각과 계획이 있지. 다들 마찬가지겠지만... 하지만 한 가지만은 내가 장담하지. 미래가 지루할 일은 "
"없을 거라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "725e061e-08dc-4bdb-a2af-988bde87e223"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pleasure doing business with the {g|Varnling Host}Varnling Host{/g}"
". –- You offer honest swords for honest gold. You do charge a fair amount, "
"but this means I won't have to worry about someone else buying you out from "
"under me. Alas, not many mercenary teams can boast your reputation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Varnling Host}반링 호스트{/g}와 함께 일하다니 영광이군. 자네는 정직하게 돈을 받고 정직하게 검을 제공하지. 받은 "
"만큼 일을 하지만, 이건 누군가 자네를 내 아래에서 채가는 것을 걱정하지 않아도 된다는 뜻이고. 그래, 자네 용병단 앞에서 잘난 척을 할 "
"수 있는 용병단은 그리 많지 않을 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "6f270998-a09e-4613-a5da-ea31e835c2cf"
msgid "\"Enjoy the celebration -– you've earned it!\""
msgstr "\"연회를 즐기게나. 자네가 쟁취한 거니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "6304e884-3574-4fab-a13a-5578769b5e70"
msgid ""
"\"Allow me to return the question. What do you think awaits your young "
"barony?\""
msgstr "\"나도 질문 하나 하겠네. 자네의 새 남작령이 무엇을 기다리고 있다고 생각하는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "108b356a-37ed-4ce6-b12e-4f3484bfb336"
msgid ""
"\"Just as your commander might put it! Well, I sincerely hope your optimism "
"pays off.\""
msgstr "\"자네 대장 말과 똑같구만! 하, 부디 자네의 낙관주의가 보답받기를 바라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "9f133651-40a4-4fb4-83da-dfa8801240c1"
msgid ""
"\"You seem to have both your feet on the ground. It's good to see that "
"{d|Varn}Varn{/d} has such people around him. He's never lacked courage, but "
"practicalities have never been his strong suit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네는 현실을 똑바로 보고 있는 것 같군. {d|Varn}반{/d}주위에 그런 사람이 있어서 다행일세. 반은 절대 용기를 잃지 "
"않지만, 현실 감각이 뛰어난 편은 아니지 않은가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "fba9fa65-68d8-4acf-8f64-316b27fe48a6"
msgid ""
"\"A reckless venture perhaps, but {d|Varn}Varn{/d} has often been called a "
"venturer. Though thanks to allies like you, he has so far managed to "
"navigate his dangerous ordeals – and with the lives of his people intact. "
"Yes, reclaiming the Stolen Lands is a dangerous game, but if I didn't "
"believe in you, I wouldn't be betting on your victory!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무모한 도전일세, 하지만 사람들이 말하길 {d|Varn}반{/d}은 모험가라더군. 자네 같은 아군의 도움덕분에, 반은 수많은 위험한 "
"시련을 헤쳐왔네. 죽은 사람도 없이 말이야. 그래, 도둑맞은 땅을 재정복하는 것은 위험한 게임이지, 하지만 내가 자네를 믿지 않았더라면, "
"자네의 승리에 걸지 않았을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "cc8227b6-be8f-4600-81fc-05d07769610b"
msgid ""
"\"And I approve. I have no doubts in you. No matter what challenges tomorrow "
"brings, the {g|Varnling Host}Varnling Host{/g} will surely triumph!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 난 증명해냈지. 난 자네를 믿고 있네. 내일 어떤 도전이 올지라도, {g|Varnling Host}반링 호스트{/g}는 "
"확실하게 승리할거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "96eff0c1-42b1-4ca6-ab94-fac51b88ed12"
msgid ""
"\"I value your frankness. Yes, many rulers fall victim to the ambitions of "
"their neighbors – and their own gullibility... But many more fail from an "
"inability to make reliable alliances. You can't survive without friends – "
"and how can you find them if you see the face of the enemy everywhere you "
"look?\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네의 정직함을 높게 평가하지. 그래, 많은 통치자들이 이웃 나라의 야망에 희생당하곤 하지. 아니면 줏대가 없어서 망하거나… 하지만 "
"믿을 만한 동맹을 만들지 못해 망하는 일이 더 많다네. 자네는 친구 없이 살아남을 수 없어. 만나는 사람 전부를 적으로 본다면 어떻게 "
"친구를 사귈 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "609cbcd3-2201-47d3-8214-d5113caa98f9"
msgid ""
"\"I will pray that the god of cities smiles mercifully upon you. The task "
"before you – to build houses and plow fields where a wild wasteland stood "
"only yesterday – this is the work of the righteous, and promises to be most "
"profitable as well!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도시의 신께서 자네에게 자비롭게 웃어주시기를 기도하겠네. 자네 앞에 놓인 과업, 그러니까 집을 짓고 어제까지만 해도 황야였던 들판을 "
"쟁기질 하고 하는 건, 의로운 일일 뿐더러 장기적으로도 득이 되는 일이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Jamandi/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Baronation
msgctxt "ad11ceeb-a243-43d4-b73e-fabf3fc9ca54"
msgid "\"I wish you luck!\""
msgstr "\"행운이 있기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "80682441-9f0a-4614-b2c1-c2c2826469cc"
msgid ""
"\"I see you've heard of me. But alas, I don't believe I've had the pleasure "
"of meeting you.\""
msgstr "\"나를 아시나본데, 이를 어쩌나. 당신을 만나뵙게 되어서 별로 영광은 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "85afe7d1-1d09-4e16-9dfe-ea3892322993"
msgid ""
"\"And every word of it, the honest truth! The Varnling Host are the best "
"swords for sale this side of the Inner Sea – and I am first among them!\""
msgstr "\"그 말에는 한치의 거짓도 없습니다! 반링 호스트는 내해 최고의 용병단이고, 그중에서도 제가 최고죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6e863809-10c9-4f34-92bd-48f0d95aa947"
msgid "\"People say many things. I prefer actions to words.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 말이 많죠. 저는 말보다는 행동을 선호합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "89556b9d-6a99-413e-8542-739ca4c1b99e"
msgid "[Bow] \"You are too kind, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "[인사한다] \"매우 친절하시군요, 각하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e355dabe-d9b1-4c60-b9e5-76ec2b97009a"
msgid "\"What do you think of today's reception?\""
msgstr "\"오늘 연회를 어떻게 생각하십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "01276c2e-7e09-48b3-8603-365ff8e73944"
msgid "\"What are your thoughts on the future of Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 미래에 대해 고견이 있으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "f61a5c6f-898a-47b7-add3-cf613b57603f"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "dff9bfa4-f3c1-4da8-b5ac-0ac0902940cd"
msgid ""
"\"Do you mean spies and traitors? I'm sorry to disappoint you, but there's "
"no one like that among us.\""
msgstr "\"첩자나 배신자를 말씀하시는 겁니까? 실망시켜드려서 죄송하지만, 그런 종자는 우리 중에 없습니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "1338af6f-b912-4dc9-be78-6489749042e5"
msgid "\"If that is my commander's decision, I can only support it.\""
msgstr "\"그게 대장의 결정이라면, 저는 거기에 따를 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "01263271-985d-467d-9772-037306a622e4"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose such people could be found... But it depends on the sort of "
"diplomacy you have in mind.\""
msgstr "\"그런 사람이 있기는 합니다만... 당신께서 어떤 외교를 하느냐에 따라 달라지겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "7cd0ea3f-73aa-4c01-b67a-1e70cbe380ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} gives you a cool but mildly curious "
"look, as if you were a peculiar animal at a zoo.{/n} \"{Name}, right hand of "
"{d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d}, hero of the legendary {g|Varnling Host}Varnling "
"Host{/g}. They say your courage is only matched by your ingenuity. Is this "
"true?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}는 당신에게 냉랭한 시선을 보내면서도, 마치 당신이 동물원의 특이한 동물인양 "
"조금은 관심 있어합니다.{/n} \"{Name}, {d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}의 심복, {g|Varnling Host}반링 "
"호스트{/g}의 전설적인 영웅. 사람들이 말하기를 자네의 용기에 비할만한 것은 오로지 자네의 기발한 재주 말고는 없다더군요. 그 말이 "
"맞나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "aa1ae6ec-98af-46d8-aa40-6eaab610c270"
msgid ""
"\"How do you like the celebration? In your expeditions and battles you've "
"hardly had the chance to enjoy luxury... Or at least what stands for luxury "
"in these lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"연회는 어떤가요? 당신은 탐험과 전투로 바빠서 이러한 사치를 누려볼 기회가 많지는 않았겠죠... 이 나라에서 말하는 사치가 어느 "
"정도인진 모르겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "fd6e7b57-5910-4a3c-8fb0-abd1fdc8004e"
msgid ""
"\"I see you are cautious. A commendable quality for people of your line of "
"work.\""
msgstr "\"아주 신중하군요. 당신과 같은 부류의 사람이 가져야 하는 좋은 덕목이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "9ff785d8-126c-4824-88cd-4948620ff735"
msgid ""
"\"Bold words! But you've proven you are capable of putting them into action."
"\""
msgstr "\"대담한 언사군요! 하지만 당신이라면 그 말대로 해낼 수 있겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "fdcf712f-c23e-4113-a8ed-7c2bded49c3e"
msgid ""
"{n}There is still a smile on Natala's face, but her eyes and voice become "
"colder than Issian ice.{/n} \"An oversight. People in your trade are wise to "
"know their potential employers... Or enemies.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라의 얼굴에는 아직까지 미소가 감돕니다. 하지만 그녀의 눈길과 목소리는 이시안 빙하만큼이나 차가워집니다.{/n} \"실수하는 "
"거예요. 당신 같은 부류의 사람들은 앞으로 누가 고용인이 될지... 아니면 적이 될지 잘 아는 편이 현명하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "526b52be-4cd0-4fdf-b72e-df875a672eb6"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know why I haven't? Because it would have been a terribly obvious "
"and crude response to {g|Restov}Restov's{/g} maneuverings. On the "
"battlefield, you wouldn't seek to do the very thing that your adversary "
"expects, and has been preparing for, would you? But I assure you, sooner or "
"later we will make our move... Just not today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 내가 그러지 않았는지 알고 싶은가요? 그건 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 수작에 대한 아주 뻔하고 형편없는 대응이기 "
"때문이죠. 당신도 전장에서 적이 뻔히 알고 대비 중인 행동을 해주진 않을 거 아닌가요? 허나 장담컨대, 빠르건 늦건 간에 우리도 행동을 "
"개시할 거예요... 그게 오늘이 아닐 뿐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "276850ff-a9f7-4849-be06-7fcf0caf589b"
msgid ""
"\"I see you are not only daring but well-mannered. A rare combination of "
"virtues, especially among people in your trade!\""
msgstr "\"대담한 데다 정중하기까지. 이런 미덕을 동시에 갖추기는 힘든데 말이죠. 특히 당신 같은 부류의 사람들이라면 더더욱!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "4071f6bc-4a25-4a02-aaa6-f14749aea89f"
msgid ""
"\"You are addressing the ruler of Brevoy. I don't guess anyone's future, I "
"determine it. But as for Varnhold... Truth be told, I am still thinking "
"about what to do with you. We'll see how you deal with the lands you've "
"received.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 브레보이의 지배자에게 말하고 있습니다. 나는 그 누구의 미래도 짐작하지 않아요, 그저 결정하죠. 하지만 반홀드의 경우는... "
"솔직히 말해서, 아직까지 나는 당신들을 어떻게 할지 생각하고 있어요. 당신들이 받을 그 땅을 어떻게 할지 지켜보도록 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "166d2fce-c9ad-41cb-a6fd-de39b823bd37"
msgid "\"Have a safe journey! I wish your barony happiness and prosperity!'"
msgstr "\"안전한 여행길이 되시길! 남작령의 행복과 번영을 기원하죠!'"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "53f3bb53-8905-4f11-9131-0f1ea036ea79"
msgid ""
"\"Your commander is certainly courageous, but doesn't think clearly about "
"certain matters. He's bluntly refused to take envoys with him – as if he "
"thinks his young barony can survive without allies! Do you think there are "
"reasonable people in this new baron's circle, who understand how important "
"diplomacy is for the state?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신 대장은 확실히 용기가 있더군요, 하지만 어떤 사안에 있어서 확실하게 매듭을 짓지는 못하죠. 그는 대놓고 사절의 동행을 "
"거부하더군요. 자기 남작령이 동맹 없이도 살아남을 수 있다고 생각하는 모양이죠! 당신은 이 신생 남작령에 외교가 국가에 얼마나 중요한지 "
"아는 합리적인 사람이 있다고 보나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "b740f5af-a742-45d7-ae9b-5ede4b71dbcb"
msgid ""
"\"I see you are a perfect match for your leader. Well, I can only pray that "
"Varnhold thrives in isolation from the outside world.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 당신의 지도자한테 딱 맞는 사람인것 같군요. 흠, 반홀드가 외부와 단절되고도 살아남기를 바라죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "6b07b4fe-2443-48e9-95b0-2749d689adca"
msgid ""
"\"Loyalty is commendable. But still sometimes it can be useful to look "
"around and see where your lord is leading you. Is it over a cliff?\""
msgstr ""
"\"충성심은 좋은 덕목이예요. 하지만 가끔은 주변을 둘러보면서 당신의 주군이 당신을 어디로 끌고가는지 살펴보는 게 좋을거예요. 혹시 "
"낭떠러지는 아닐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "135deeca-3289-456e-b54e-e5a7faed9960"
msgid ""
"\"A wise commander surrounds himself with people whose strengths compensate "
"for his own weaknesses. It's a pleasure to see at least some of "
"{d|Varn}Varn's{/d} people can boast the foresight that he so sorely lacks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"현명한 지휘관은 주변에 약점을 채워줄 사람을 두죠. 적어도 반 그자에게는 전혀 없는 통찰력을 가진 사람이 {d|Varn}반{/d}의 "
"주변에 있다니 다행이군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "569b2b82-ab64-4442-a3c8-c80c9b93d433"
msgid ""
"\"But in any case, for now this is just empty rhetoric. Your young state "
"must first prove that it is worthy of diplomacy. I suspect we shall revisit "
"this conversation in a year or two. – If, by that time, the name of Varnhold "
"can still be found on the maps.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 누가 뭐래도 아직 이건 공허한 말장난일 뿐이죠. 당신의 신생 영지가 외교를 할 가치가 있는지부터 먼저 증명해야 되니까. 한두 "
"해 안에 이 대화를 다시 할 수 있을지 모르겠군요. 그 때가 되면 반홀드가 지도에 없을 수도 있겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Natala/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_Baronation
msgctxt "d2631d87-16d5-4898-92a7-171b61a0e00c"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose Lady Aldori and Lord Mayor Sellemius are very happy with this "
"affair they've managed to plot behind my back, along with their new toy "
"baronies. Honestly, I should remind them who rules Brevoy, and call an "
"immediate end to the entire farce.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 뒤에서 작당질을 해 새로운 장난감 남작령을 만들어내다니, 알도리 경과 셀레미우스 시장이 아주 좋아하겠군요. 솔직히 말하자면, "
"이들한테 누가 브레보이의 지배자인지 되새겨주고, 이 광대놀음에 당장 종지부를 찍어야겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "18b07bff-5a3e-4a53-8b3c-0eb5fe44105a"
msgid "\"What are you arguing about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 얘기 해요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ffbcc824-adc7-41f6-a1e2-8b611650767e"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar is right. We must claim our rights at once, or we'll never climb "
"out from under Restov's boot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"메이가르가 옳아요. 우리 권리를 곧바로 주장해야 해요, 그렇지 않으면 레스토프의 발 아래서 절대 헤어나오지 못 할 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1ca39bb0-de2b-42eb-a5f3-4379f6208050"
msgid ""
"\"Cephal is right. We must be cautious, or we'll lose Varnhold as quickly as "
"we won it.\""
msgstr "\"케팔이 옳아요. 우리는 조심해야 해요, 안 그러면 순식간에 반홀드를 잃겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "4afc38e6-f97a-4d91-b72b-7b8a16c4f973"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand why you dislike Jamandi Aldori. She's a fine person, "
"and there's nothing wrong in being her ally – in word or in deed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자만디 알도리를 왜 그렇게 싫어하는 지 모르겠는데요. 아주 괜찮은 사람이고, 그 여자의 아군이 되어서 나쁠 게 없잖아요. 말뿐이건 "
"진짜건간에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "1e836070-4ed6-4044-901d-afc729aaa9ee"
msgid "\"Let's stay a little longer. I'd like to talk to the other guests.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만 더 머무르죠. 다른 손님들과 더 이야기 하고 싶어서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "690aaa8c-6f02-430f-9cc5-0f857bf6344d"
msgid "\"Let's go. Varnhold awaits!\""
msgstr "\"가죠. 반홀드가 기다리고 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "118b2826-72fe-4909-b1d9-63b31d37c108"
msgid ""
"{n}As the guests linger and entertain themselves, one hero of the occasion "
"stands aside. {d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d} – the leader of Varnling Host, your "
"direct commander, and henceforth, the undisputed Baron of Varnhold. He's "
"busying himself with one of his favorite pastimes. He's trying very hard not "
"to yell, but he's ferociously arguing about something with the party's co-"
"founder, a wizard named {d|Cephal}Cephal Lorentus{/d} – Varn's oldest "
"companion, and his most uncompromising opponent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}손님으로서 머물고 즐기던 와중, 연회에 참석한 영웅 하나가 자리에서 물러나 있습니다. {d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}, 반링 "
"호스트의 리더, 당신의 대장, 그리고 더 나아가, 의심의 여지가 없는 반홀드의 남작입니다. 반은 그의 좋아하는 소일거리로 바쁩니다. 그는 "
"일행의 공동설립자이자 반의 가장 오래된 동료이며, 가장 단호한 상대인 위자드 케팔 로렌투스와 격렬하게 논쟁을 하면서도, 고성은 내지 "
"않으려 애쓰고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "dee96a30-251d-45b7-92ea-f7a79e821982"
msgid ""
"\"But {d|Varn}Varn{/d}, my dear friend, would you please be so kind as to "
"explain, what, devil take you, you've been doing?! I financed this venture "
"with my own personal funds, not to mention all the effort and time I've "
"invested. And pray tell, what was it all for? For you to assemble the fruits "
"of our labors and pitch the whole lot down the privy?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 {d|Varn}반{/d}, 내 친우여, 부디 친절하게 설명해 주겠나? 무슨 망조가 들어서 그런 짓을 했는지?! 나는 이 모험에 "
"내 개인 재산을 자금으로 댔네, 내가 들인 모든 노력과 시간은 차치하고 말일세. 자 말해보게, 그 모든 게 무엇을 위해서였나? 우리 "
"노동의 결실을 곱게 모아다가 똥통에 다 처박아버리기 위해서였나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "67c1ec1f-6477-45cb-a690-87c3933e6482"
msgid ""
"\"Fruits?! I've been busy guarding these fruits from Brevoy's incessant "
"fruit moths! But I'm a baron now. We finally have our own land. – For the "
"first time in our lives, we're independent! No one can tell us what to do! "
"And you want to destroy everything we've achieved by inviting spies into our "
"house? Of course, why not? Please, do come in, eavesdrop, sniff around, take "
"whatever you please! {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d} is generous, he said make yourself "
"at home!\""
msgstr ""
"\"결실?! 나는 이 결실을 브레보이의 끊임없는 아가리에서 지키느라 엉덩이가 붙어있질 않단 말이오! 그리고 지금 난 남작이오. 드디어 "
"우리 땅을 가지게 됐다고. 우리 생애 처음으로, 자유의 몸이요! 그 누구도 우리에게 이래라저래라 하지 못해! 헌데 당신은 우리 집에 "
"스파이를 초대해서 이 모든 걸 망가뜨리고 싶은거요? 아 그래, 왜 못하겠소? 이렇게 말해주면 되나? 부디 들어오시오, 엿듣고, 냄새 "
"맡고, 원하는 건 다 가져가시오 제발! {d|Cephal}케팔{/d}이 너무나도 관대해서, 당신네 집처럼 여기라는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "164ceebe-b2c2-453f-93d7-b0da66944e9c"
msgid ""
"\"O {g|Asmodeus}Asmodeus{/g}! Please give me the patience to withstand this "
"nonsense – or take my soul already! {d|Varn}Varn{/d}, what are you saying? "
"What is this independence you speak of? We depend on {g|Restov}Restov{/g} "
"for literally everything – from the inflow of settlers to the food to feed "
"them! I like Jamandi no more than you do, but it will take us years to free "
"ourselves from her influence! Right now we must bow to our patron – not brag "
"about a title we received from her very hands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 {g|Asmodeus}아스모데우스{/g}시여! 이 영혼을 거둬가시지 않으려거든, 저 허튼소리를 감내할 수 있게 해 주소서! "
"{d|Varn}반{/d}, 대체 뭐 하자는 겐가? 독립이라니, 말이 되는 소리를 해! 우린 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에 모든 걸 "
"의존하고 있네. 이곳으로 유입되는 이주민부터, 그 사람들을 먹일 식량까지! 나도 자네만큼이나 자만디를 좋은 감정 없네. 하지만 자만디의 "
"영향력에서 벗어나려면 수년이 걸려! 당장은 후원자에게 머리를 숙여야 해. 단순히 작위를 받았다고 끝이 아니라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4e968ba8-48cd-477a-98ca-e6d45074301b"
msgid ""
"\"Listening to you is disgusting! Did we claw away our own piece of land "
"only to keep toiling away for all those... Oh! {Name}, you're right on time! "
"Come, be our arbiter!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신 말을 듣고 있는게 역겨워지기 시작하는군! 그 놈들한테 노역이나 하려고 우리 땅을 그렇게 개고생하면서 얻은 줄... 오! "
"{Name}, 제 때 와줬군! 어서오게, 우리 중재자가 되주게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "79be9437-5a22-46d7-be6c-5102830d3e14"
msgid ""
"\"At issue is the fact that Jamandi Aldori has generously offered to "
"{d|Varn}Maegar{/d} the use of her envoy. And who is Jamandi Aldori? The very "
"same one who created our barony – and who could make it disappear with a "
"flick of her finger. An insignificant figure in the grand scheme of things, "
"no doubt! But good Varn refused her! And to top it all off, he rather "
"suggestively hinted that he considers every single one of Brevoy's diplomats "
"to be spies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"문제는 자만디 알도리가 자비롭게 {d|Varn}메이가르{/d}에게 그녀의 수행원을 사용하게끔 제안했다는 사실일세. 그리고 자만디 "
"알도리가 누군가? 우리 남작령을 만들어준 그 당사자이며, 손가락 한 번 튕기는 걸로 이 모든 걸 없던 일로 만들 수 있는 사람일세. "
"의심의 여지없이, 거대한 책략 속의 아주 중요한 인물일세! 하지만 잘난 반이 그녀를 거부했네! 그리고 설상가상으로, 반이 넌지시 모든 "
"브레보이 외교관들을 스파이로 간주하겠다고 암시했단 말일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "063d44bc-01fa-48e0-aa38-e417650614c2"
msgid ""
"\"What else should I consider them? {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d}, have you grown "
"foggy in your old age? I can hardly recognize you. You've always been a hard-"
"liner. You've always put the interests of our ventures above everything "
"else. And now you want us to roll over on our backs for the Aldori, wiggle "
"our tails and wait to be petted? We're an independent state now. And we "
"shall have it known to all that we won't be ordered about!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 그들을 내가 뭐라고 생각해야 하오? {d|Cephal}케팔{/d}, 말년에 노망이라도 난거요? 당신이 맞기나 한지도 혼란스럽군. "
"당신은 언제나 강경파였잖소. 당신은 언제나 우리 모험의 이득을 그 무엇보다 중하게 여겼지. 그런데 지금은 알도리에게 우리 척추를 갖다 "
"바치고, 꼬리를 흔들면서 이쁨받기를 기다린다고? 우리는 독립된 국가요, 이제. 더 이상 명령을 받지 않는다는 걸 모두가 알아야 한단 "
"말이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "38b956fd-4934-4d90-b9b0-7b4db753c678"
msgid ""
"\"{d|Varn}Maegar{/d}, Maegar! Of course they're spies! You refused the spy "
"in plain sight – congratulations, well done. Now the "
"{g|swordlords}Swordlords{/g} will send other spies, ones we won't even be "
"able to see! {g|restov}Restov{/g} has invested a great deal in our barony. "
"It is ready to invest yet more... – So why bite the hand that feeds us, "
"before the feeding is over? We could at least pretend to be humble, so long "
"as we're still getting something for it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}, 메이가르! 물론 그놈들은 스파이가 맞네! 헌데 자네는 스파이를 대놓고 거절했지, 축하하네, 아주 "
"잘했어. 이제 {g|swordlords}소드로드{/g}는 우리가 눈으로 직접 보지도 못하는 다른 스파이를 보내겠지! "
"{g|restov}레스토프{/g}는 우리 남작령에 큰 투자를 했네. 그리고 더 투자할 준비가 돼있지... 그런데 왜 우리를 먹여주는 손을 "
"물어 뜯으려고 하는건가, 먹여주는 게 끝나지도 않았는데? 우리가 원하는 것을 얻기 위해서라면, 겸손한 척도 할 수 있는 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "9e57944a-482e-4ea3-a3de-8c076839e0bb"
msgid ""
"\"Well for one thing, that's low. By accepting {g|Restov}Restov's{/g} "
"handouts, we're taking on certain obligations. I know you don't care a fig "
"for morality, but think of our reputation! Who will want to deal with us if "
"we steal from our employers and stab them in the back?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하나 말하자면, 그건 비열한거요. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 지원을 받아들임으로써, 우리는 그에 해당하는 의무도 받아들이는 "
"거요. 당신이 도덕성 따위 안중에도 없는 것은 알고 있소, 하지만 우리 명성을 생각해보시오! 우리가 고용인의 재산을 빼앗고 등뒤에서 칼을 "
"찌른다면, 누가 우리하고 상종하려고 하겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "e7d98653-2f24-4c2b-8788-83f3525da4b0"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you keep saying 'us' and 'our'? Do I need to remind you that you're "
"a baron now? That is the difference between you and me. You were born of a "
"noble family, and yet even now, after receiving lands and power, you "
"continue to think like the leader of a band of thugs. While I... My parents "
"plowed the soil, and I learned to read by moonlight. But even as a snot-"
"nosed child, I tried to think like a ruler – a king without a kingdom. After "
"decades, my plans and schemes are finally bearing fruit. I shall not allow "
"you to destroy everything we have created with your stupid pride!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 계속 '우리의' 라던가 '우리'라고 말하는 건가? 자네가 이제 남작이란 것을 상기시켜줘야하나? 이것이 자네와 나 사이의 차이일세. "
"자네는 귀족 태생으로 태어났고, 그리고 심지어 지금, 땅과 권력을 받은 후에도 자네는 도적떼 두목같은 생각을 이어가고 있네. 그 반면에 "
"나는... 내 부모님은 땅을 일궜고, 나는 달빛 아래에서 책을 읽었지. 내가 건방진 꼬맹이었을진 몰라도, 적어도 지배자처럼 생각하려고 "
"노력했단 말일세. 왕국 없는 왕이었지. 수십 년이 흐르고, 내 계획과 생각이 드디어 결실을 맺으려고 하네. 자네의 그 멍청한 자존심이 "
"우리가 일궈놓은 모든 것을 파괴하도록 놔두진 않겠네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "460f41a9-87fa-46ba-a549-86c79463dd77"
msgid ""
"\"Allies? You mean – vassals! Jamandi keeps singing about freedom and "
"independence, but that's only because it's the legal loophole she's using. "
"In truth, she doesn't want Varnhold as an ally. She wants Varnhold as a "
"puppet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"동맹들? 봉신을 잘못 말한 거겠지! 자만디는 자유다 독립이다 노래를 부르지만, 그건 그게 그녀가 합법적으로 빠져나갈 구멍이기 "
"때문이야. 사실은, 그녀는 반홀드를 동맹으로 원하지 않아. 반홀드가 꼭두각시가 되기를 원하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "8bff2567-265f-4ec1-8bc9-9b631024f85e"
msgid ""
"\"For once I will agree with you, {d|Varn}Maegar{/d}. And you, {name}, do "
"not be so naive. – Jamandi is no friend, not to us. Brevoy is on the verge "
"of civil war. When she sends us to die for her ambitions, she will more than "
"recover Brevoy's investment in us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 한 번은 자네에게 동의하겠네, {d|Varn}메이가르{/d}. 그리고 자네, {name}, 순진하게 굴지 말게, 자만디는 자네 "
"친구가 아니야, 우리 친구도 아니고. 브레보이는 내전 직전일세. 알도리는 언젠가 그녀의 야망을 위해 우리보고 죽으라고 할테고, 그녀는 "
"우리에게 들인 브레보이의 투자금 이상을 뽑아내려 할걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7a592491-8552-460f-a302-1dad2b437483"
msgid ""
"\"If you know this, then why would you kowtow to her? You may be an old fox, "
"but she's no little sheep. You think you can deal with the devil, take what "
"you want, and then slip away without paying?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 잘 알고 있으면서, 왜 지금은 그녀에게 굽실거리는거요? 당신이 늙은 여우일지는 모르지만, 그녀도 작은 양이 아니요. 악마로부터 "
"원하는 것을 받은 다음에, 대가를 치루지도 않고 빠져나갈 수 있다 생각하는거요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "e88d8ced-0d0d-4ec1-97ae-f7e191d77e80"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly. {g|Asmodeus}Asmodeus{/g} is my witness, I know more about deals "
"with devils than you. In fact, I am accustomed to playing the devil's role "
"myself, in deals of this sort.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정확하네. {g|Asmodeus}아스모데우스{/g}님이 내 증인이시고, 나는 자네보다 악마와 거래하는 법을 더 잘 알고 있네. 사실 "
"나는 이런 문제에서 악마가 되는것이 더 익숙하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "34a4efd3-7661-468b-823d-040ff27a42b9"
msgid ""
"\"All right, enough arguing. What is done cannot be undone. You spoiled my "
"game quite a bit, {d|Varn}Maegar{/d}, and I will not forget it in a hurry. "
"But we shall try to play with the hand we were dealt. Celebrations are over, "
"it is time for everyday life. I suggest we exchange bows with the respected "
"hosts and set off to Varnhold. We have much work to do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 싸우는건 이제 충분하네. 이미 일어난 일을 돌이킬 수도 없고. {d|Varn}메이가르{/d} 자네가 내 계획을 좀 망쳐버리긴 "
"했지만, 그밖에도 처리할 게 많으니까. 가서 우리가 받은 제안을 고려해 보자고. 축하연이 끝났으니 이젠 일상으로 돌아가야해. 주최자에게 "
"경의를 표하고 반홀드로 떠나도록 하지. 우린 아직 해야할 일이 많다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "6c77165e-afff-4f02-8248-bb0282ebe8c7"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Cephal}Cephal{/d} shakes his head.{/n} \"I will tell you one thing. If "
"you engaged battle as clumsily as you're playing politics, all of us would "
"be long dead by now. Caution, restraint, tactical finesse – when you're on "
"the battlefield, you seem to remember what these things are. How is it that "
"you've forgotten all of it now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Cephal}케팔{/d}이 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"하나 말해주겠네. 자네의 정치실력만큼이나 어설프게 전투를 했었다면, "
"지금 우리는 모두 죽었을 걸세. 경계, 자제, 전술적 수완 – 전장에서 자네는 이 모든 덕목들을 기억하고 있었네. 헌데 왜 지금은 다 "
"까먹어버린 겐가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "3487e39e-01de-47b0-b5dc-e4fffd23c4d8"
msgid ""
"\"With all due respect, {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d}, I'm still the military leader "
"here. You've called me hot-tempered and reckless many times before, pleading "
"that I'll get all of us killed. But look around, we're still alive. Don't be "
"a coward, now. I know what I'm doing!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기분 상하게 하고 싶진 않지만, {d|Cephal}케팔{/d}, 이곳의 군사 지도자는 아직까지 나요. 당신은 내가 다혈질에 무모하다고 "
"수없이 말해왔지, 내가 우리 모두를 죽일거다 빌면서 말이요. 지금 주변을 보시오, 우린 아직까지 살아 있잖소. 겁잽이처럼 굴지 마시오, "
"이제. 난 내가 뭘 하고 있는지 잘 알고 있소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "45b1a3a0-0bcb-4e44-91b1-124dce10bb37"
msgid ""
"\"It won't be my hot temper that ruins us. It'll be your cunning and greed. "
"In any game, the most important thing to know is when it's time to take your "
"winnings and walk away!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리를 파멸시킬 것은 내 다혈질이 아니오. 바로 당신의 속임수와 탐욕이지. 어떤 게임을 하건, 가장 중요한 것은 내 전리품을 가지고 "
"돌아나올 시점을 아는 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "ea44343a-57b3-4a7a-885b-15a6e572d3d0"
msgid ""
"\"But that is where you are so wrong! Do you imagine this is a table we can "
"get up from? No! A mercenary commander can pocket some loot and move to the "
"other side of the continent. In becoming a baron, you have got yourself into "
"a long, long game. You cannot simply leave it, but if you play it well, your "
"children and grandchildren may get a turn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 바로 자네가 잘못 이해하고 있는 부분이야! 이 판이 자네가 원할 때 돌아 나올 수 있는 판인 줄 아는가? 절대 아니야! 용병 "
"대장은 전리품을 챙겨서 대륙의 다른 곳으로 이동할 수 있겠지. 하지만 남작으로서, 자네는 길고 긴 게임에 몸을 담았단 말일세. 그냥 "
"자리를 박차고 나올 수 없어, 하지만 자네가 현명하게 처신한다면, 자네 자식과 손자 대까지 보답 받을걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "5eb950c0-6326-4db9-954e-7c5bc8854848"
msgid "\"Isn't it time we go home?\""
msgstr "\"집에 갈 때가 되지 않았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/1_Baronation/Varn_vs_Cephal/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "176433a6-9c41-414b-958c-f7a403a3554e"
msgid ""
"\"This is true, you have saved us more than once... Apparently in order to "
"valiantly ruin not just a party of mercenaries, but an entire barony!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 맞아. 자네는 우리를 여려 차례 구했지... 이제보니 고작 용병단 대신에, 남작령 전체를 장렬하게 말아먹으려고 그랬구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "154fd37e-3997-4d17-9d90-027fcbe05395"
msgid "\"Is the body of your General here as well?\""
msgstr "\"당신 장군의 몸도 여기 있어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Answer_0007_Text_String
msgctxt "700a3637-6588-4c0d-b9f3-585f3e1b7d7d"
msgid "\"What happened to the portal?\""
msgstr "\"포탈에 무슨 일이 생긴거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Answer_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "955ca182-b5cb-46a7-a0c8-74c0d1f6db8e"
msgid "\"What do you suggest we do next?\""
msgstr "\"다음은 뭘 해야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "cc1f0333-54aa-48ca-a124-d80c0adf0fe3"
msgid "\"This monster was your General?\""
msgstr "\"이 괴물이 당신네 장군인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "6580a3e1-008f-46bb-b1c8-a6b0e035e403"
msgid "\"What happened to your General?\""
msgstr "\"당신네 장군한테 무슨 일이 생긴거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Answer_0042_Text_String
msgctxt "7f874b74-7abb-4a71-b0e1-3f4800b15f54"
msgid "\"And what happened to the other party members?\""
msgstr "\"다른 파티 인원에게는 무슨 일이 생긴거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0001_Text_String
msgctxt "6d6b5cc6-1fc5-4b46-ba73-d26de32c62ba"
msgid ""
"{n}The last monster falls dead, shedding its blood on the stone tiles. The "
"portal, glimmering in the darkness of the dungeon, suddenly closes. Just as "
"it vanishes, you think you hear a vaguely familiar voice coming from it. But "
"maybe it was just your imagination in the heat of battle.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}돌바닥에 피를 흩뿌리면서 마지막 괴물이 쓰러져 죽었습니다. 어두운 던전 안에서 빛나고 있는 포탈은 갑작스럽게 닫힙니다. 포탈이 "
"사라지자마자, 당신은 희미하게 익숙한 목소리가 그것으로부터 들려온다고 생각합니다. 하지만 단지 전투의 열기속에서 빚어낸 당신의 상상일지도 "
"모릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "a2c54926-d1d4-4f7b-8696-a59b71742edd"
msgid ""
"{n}In silence, Maegar examines the dead end. It's painted in blood, and "
"filled with remains, both ancient and fresh. He raises his head.{/n} \"There "
"are bones everywhere... And this broken equipment... I recognize it. They "
"used to belong to my fighters – the ones who...\" {n}His voice breaks.{/n} "
"\"The ones who came here with the... the General that day.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵속에서, 메이가르는 시체의 조사를 마칩니다. 시체는 피로 뒤덮혀 있었고, 고대인과 현대인의 잔재로 차있습니다. 메이가르가 머리를 "
"들어올렸다.{/n} \"온통 뼈 천지구만... 그리고 이 부서진 장비들... 알아볼것 같군. 이 장비들은 내 전사들의 것이오. 전사들..."
"\" {n}메이가르의 목소리가 떨립니다.{/n} \"그 날 장군과... 같이 왔던 전사들 말이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "2a31de78-22e3-4c95-b388-e9ce8c056e0d"
msgid ""
"{n}Varn examines the remains more closely.{/n} \"No... Praise "
"{g|Desna}Desna{/g}, he is not here. But where is he? Crushed under the cave-"
"in? Vanished into a portal? I see no answers here. I'm afraid our expedition "
"was in vain.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}반이 잔해를 더욱 가까이서 조사합니다.{/n} \"안돼... {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여, 그는 여기 없어. 그럼 어디에 "
"있다는 거지? 부서진 동굴 속? 사라진 포탈 안에? 이곳에서 답을 찾을 순 없는 것 같소. 우리 탐험이 헛수고가 된 걸지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "3f87eda6-3d8d-45b9-b2c5-0afc4d394764"
msgid ""
"{n}Varn examines the remains more closely.{/n} \"No... Praise "
"{g|Desna}Desna{/g}, she is not here. But where is she? Crushed under the "
"cave-in? Vanished into the portal? I see no answers here. I'm afraid our "
"expedition was in vain.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}반이 잔해를 더욱 가까이서 조사합니다.{/n} \"아니... 감사합니다 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여, 그녀는 여기 없소. 그럼 "
"어디에 있다는 거지? 부서진 동굴 속? 사라진 포탈 안에? 이곳에서 답을 찾을 순 없는 것 같소. 우리 탐험이 헛수고가 된 걸지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0010_Text_String
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "7dc66f9d-e9f6-4ebb-bcdd-08158ede7f94"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. You saw everything I did! It doesn't seem like we closed it. "
"I thought I heard someone's voice... Maybe it was closed by the same person "
"who opened it... Is that the same person who created this insane fortress?\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 모르겠군. 당신은 내가 한 모든 일을 봤잖소! 우리가 그걸 닫은 것 같지는 않소. 거기서 어떤 사람의 목소리를 들은 것 같소... "
"아마도 포탈을 연 사람과 닫은 사람이 같을지도 모르지... 이 정신나간 요새를 만든 사람과 같은 사람일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "a7d1df23-80c9-4243-8e2e-302d4ef2b465"
msgid ""
"\"If you'll allow it, I'll stay here a while... Alone with my people. To "
"give them their final honors. You, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|"
"Your Highness}, can examine the other rooms, or return to the capital. Don't "
"wait for me, I will follow you soon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 허락한다면, 여기 계속 남아 있고 싶군... 내 사람들과 같이. 마지막 예를 갖춰줘야 하지 않겠소. 당신은 다른 방을 "
"조사하게나, 수도로 되돌아가거나 하시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 나를 기다리지는 마시오, 곧 뒤따라 갈테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "8bc58f76-f756-4e57-b7c2-a978c98b66d1"
msgid ""
"{n}With the final monster slain, the General falls to the ground. Varn "
"rushes to him to catch the limp body. Checking for pulse, he sighs with "
"relief.{/n} \"Alive. Praise {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, he's alive – though "
"exhausted.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막 괴물이 죽자, 장군이 바닥에 쓰러집니다. 반이 달려가 축 처진 장군의 몸을 잡아챕니다. 맥박을 확인하면서, 반은 안도의 "
"한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"살아있소. 감사합니다 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여, 그가 살아있소. 탈진했긴 하지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "16e6e582-1a6b-45ca-8b1d-fd0f6cf7fecc"
msgid ""
"{n}Varn runs to the monster's body.{/n} \"Is that... You? Why, it can't be! "
"What is it? What have they done to you?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"반이 괴물의 몸으로 달려듭니다.{/n} \"너...너야? 어째서, 이럴 순 없어! 이게 뭐야? 그놈들이 네게 무슨 짓을 한거야?!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "7af6b5c9-5345-4852-a8ca-3975d699ee78"
msgid ""
"{n}With the final monster slain, the General falls to the ground. Varn "
"rushes to her to catch her limp body. Checking for pulse, he sighs with "
"relief.{/n} \"Alive. Praise {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, she's alive – though "
"exhausted.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막 괴물이 죽고, 장군이 바닥에 쓰러집니다. 반은 뛰어들어 축 처진 그녀의 몸을 붙잡습니다. 맥박을 확인하면서, 반은 안도의 "
"한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"살아있군, 감사합니다 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여, 탈진했지만 살아있소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "03c16fa3-0991-4ff2-9ace-9d976f07813a"
msgid ""
"{n}With the final monster slain, the General falls to the ground. Varn "
"rushes to her to catch her limp body. Checking for pulse, he sighs with "
"relief.{/n} \"Alive. Praise {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, she's alive – though "
"exhausted. I don't know what I would do if I'd lost her!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막 괴물이 죽고, 장군이 바닥에 쓰러집니다. 반은 뛰어들어가 축처진 그녀의 몸을 붙잡았다. 맥박을 확인하면서, 반은 안도의 "
"한숨을 내쉬었다.{/n} \"살아있군, 감사합니다 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여, 탈진했지만 살아있소. 만약 그녀를 잃었다면 내가 "
"어떻게 했을지 모르겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "b4cab93f-87e9-4f8c-8623-949665b6086b"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. You saw everything I did! It closed when we defeated the "
"monsters... Maybe we broke some spell without knowing it? Or it was closed "
"by the same person who opened it? Is it the same person who created this "
"insane fortress? I thought I heard someone's voice...\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠소. 내가 한 일을 모두 보지 않았소! 그 괴물을 처치하자마자 문이 닫혔소... 미처 모르는 사이에 어떤 주문을 파괴한 건 "
"아닐까? 아니면 문을 연 그 사람이 다시 닫아버린 건? 이 정신나간 요새를 만들어낸 바로 그 사람이? 누군가의 목소리를 들은 것 "
"같았는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "4807c042-a72d-4a56-abca-3bf00a16ac12"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks into his companion's exhausted face.{/n} \"It looks like he "
"stood guard here all this time. Fighting monsters day after day, month after "
"month, without sleep or rest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 동료의 완전히 지쳐버린 얼굴을 들여다보았습니다.{/n} \"지금껏 내내 이 자리를 지키고 서 있던 것 같은데. 자지도, "
"쉬지도 않고 매일매일, 몇 달이 가도록 괴물과 싸워온 거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "331d6367-e3e0-415a-81ef-8fdd09613f63"
msgid ""
"\"We haven't looked through all the rooms. You can search the rest if you "
"like. But if you'll allow me, I will stay here for a while to guard his "
"sleep. He deserves at least a bit of rest. Don't wait for me – return to the "
"capital. We will follow you as soon as he awakens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 모든 방들을 확인하지 않았소. 원한다면 나머지 방들을 조사하시오. 당신만 괜찮다면, 나는 잠시 여기서 그를 지키려 하오. 그는 "
"적어도 조금은 휴식을 취할 자격이 있소. 나를 기다리지 마시오 - 성으로 돌아가시오. 우리는 그가 깨어나는 대로 따라가겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "e677a57c-0e7c-4b61-9d15-5b4774376bb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks into his companion's exhausted face.{/n} \"It looks like she "
"stood guard here all this time. Fighting monsters day after day, month after "
"month, without sleep or rest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 동료의 완전히 지쳐버린 얼굴을 들여다보았습니다.{/n} \"지금껏 내내 이 자리를 지키고 서있던 것 같은데. 자지도, "
"쉬지도 않고 매일매일, 몇 달이 가도록 괴물과 싸워온 거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "cbdd7ed3-6764-40bb-b56d-1149e08a87cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar runs his hand worriedly over his companion's cheek.{/n} \"It looks "
"like she stood guard here all this time. Fighting monsters day after day, "
"month after month, without sleep or rest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 손으로 걱정스럽게 동료의 뺨을 훑었습니다.{/n} \"지금껏 내내 이 자리를 지키고 서있던 것 같은데. 자지도, 쉬지도 "
"않고 매일매일, 몇 달이 가도록 괴물과 싸워온 거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "e514c85a-d9ee-40c6-9bbf-bb84f8602f4a"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know how this is possible, but this insane dungeon is filled with "
"wild, unexplainable magic! In any case, whatever spell was cast on her, I "
"think we've broken it. She's free again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 이런 일이 가능한지는 모르겠지만, 이 미친 던전은 거칠고 설명할 수 없는 마법으로 가득 차 있소! 어쨌든, 난 그녀에게 걸린 "
"주문이 무엇이든 우리가 깨뜨렸다고 생각하오. 그녀는 다시 자유요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "77fd7e17-bd26-43dc-b4cd-8b15cc76a8df"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know how this is possible, but this insane dungeon is filled with "
"wild, unexplainable magic! In any case, whatever spell was cast on him, I "
"think we've broken it. He's free again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 이런 일이 가능한지는 모르겠지만, 이 미친 던전은 거칠고 설명할 수 없는 마법으로 가득 차 있소! 어쨌든, 난 그에게 걸린 "
"주문이 무엇이든 우리가 깨뜨렸다고 생각하오. 그는 다시 자유요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "39d90657-a853-4a3c-9dd2-dbf2d78df211"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know how this is possible, but this insane dungeon is filled with "
"wild, unexplainable magic! In any case, whatever spell was cast on her, I "
"think we've broken it. She's free again... And with me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 이런 일이 가능한지 모르지만 이 미친 던전은 거칠고 설명할 수 없는 마법으로 가득 차 있어! 어쨌든, 난 그녀에게 걸린 주문은 "
"무엇이든 우리가 깨뜨렸다 고 생각해. 그녀는 다시 자유로워졌어... 그리고 나와 함께야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "00de9a19-5514-49c2-8f10-8f8ab547b957"
msgid ""
"\"We haven't looked through all the rooms. You can search the rest if you "
"like. But if you'll allow me, I will stay here for a while to guard her "
"sleep. She deserves at least a bit of rest. Don't wait for me – return to "
"the capital. We will follow you as soon as she awakens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 모든 방들을 확인하지 않았소. 원한다면 나머지 방들을 조사하시오. 자네만 괜찮다면, 나는 잠시 여기서 그녀의 잠을 지키려고 "
"하오. 그는 적어도 조금의 휴식을 취할 자격이 있소. 나를 기다리지 마시오 - 성으로 돌아가시오. 우리는 그녀가 깨어나는 대로 자네를 "
"따라갈 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "f4ebd169-e7a1-4759-b608-87daee5ddb3b"
msgid ""
"\"We haven't looked through all the rooms. You can search the rest if you "
"like. While I...\" {n}Maegar smiles tenderly.{/n} \"I've found everything I "
"was looking for. If you'll allow me, I will stay here for a while to guard "
"her sleep. Don't wait for me – return to the capital. We will follow you as "
"soon as she awakens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 모든 방들을 확인하지 않았소. 원한다면 나머지 방들을 조사하시오. 하지만 난... {n}메이가르는 상냥하게 미소짓는다.{/n} "
"\" 난 찾던걸 모두 찾았소. 자네만 괜찮다면, 나는 잠시 여기서 그녀의 잠을 지키려고 하오. 나를 기다리지 마시오 - 성으로 "
"돌아가시오. 우리는 그녀가 깨어나는 대로 자네를 따라갈 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "ea96549c-81ee-4fa5-9a00-751e8f1eb1c3"
msgid "\"I don't know. It just closed. What does it matter now?\""
msgstr "\"모르겠어. 방금 닫혔어. 지금 그게 무슨 상관이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "c3675c65-495a-4766-adab-6f0a79e54d35"
msgid ""
"\"You can search other rooms if you wish, or return to the capital. Don't "
"wait for me, I... I'll stay here for a while, and give my people their final "
"honors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"원하면 다른 방을 뒤져도 좋고, 수도로 돌아가도 좋소. 나를 기다리지 마시오, 난... 당분간 이곳에 머물면서 나의 백성들에게 마지막 "
"명예를 주도록 하겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "52990242-1921-40a7-8962-d0e459833168"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar shakes his head as though he's lost.{/n} \"Yes. I'd recognize that "
"voice anywhere. But why? How could this happen? How is it possible, my "
"friend?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 길을 잃은 것처럼 고개를 가로젓는다.{/n} \"그래. 난 어디서든 그 목소리를 알아볼 수 있을 거야. 하지만 왜? "
"어떻게 이런 일이 일어날 수 있을까? 어떻게 그럴 수가 있지, 친구?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "f698be35-2939-4bc8-83f3-f15c1c1f3da0"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar hides his face, and his shoulders shake.{/n} \"Yes. I'd... "
"recognize that voice anywhere. How is this possible?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 얼굴을 감추고, 어깨는 흔들린다.{/n} \"그래. 난 어디서든 그 목소리를 알아볼 수 있을 거야. 어떻게 그럴 수가 "
"있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "6f18d977-ffed-4470-bb1e-d05b56619f76"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar grows grim.{/n} \"The bones that are scattered here... This broken "
"equipment... I recognize the armor and swords. Indeed, I bought them myself, "
"for the party that breathed their last breath right here where we stand. I'm "
"afraid no one survived. Before I follow you to the capital, my General and I "
"will give them their final honors.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 암울해집니다.{/n} \"여기 흩어져 있는 뼈들... 이 부서진 장비들... 나는 이 갑옷과 칼들을 알고 있소. 우리가 "
"선 바로 이곳에서 마지막 호흡을 했던 이들을 위해 내가 직접 이것들을 구매했었지. 아무도 살아남지 못한 것 같군. 당신을 따라 성으로 "
"가기 전에 장군과 나는 그들에게 마지막 명예를 주겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "5576817e-e49a-43e2-a438-0c00f7a31d88"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know, and I don't care. Search the other rooms, or return to the "
"capital if you wish. Don't wait for me. I'll... stay here. Alone with her. I "
"must bury her, and what remains of my party.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 모르겠고, 관심도 없소. 다른 방들을 뒤져보거나 원한다면 성으로 돌아가시오. 날 기다리지 마시오. 난... 여기 머물것이오. "
"그녀와 함께. 나는 그녀와 내 일행의 남은 것을 묻어주어야 하오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/After_Boss/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_BackLostLarn
msgctxt "17fb4d98-2a28-40f4-a452-4da1066f0d67"
msgid ""
"\"There are human bones and broken equipment scattered all around. I "
"recognize some of it. – I bought them for the party myself... It appears "
"that no one survived.\""
msgstr ""
"\"인골과 부서진 장비가 사방에 흩어져 있소. 몇몇개는 내가 아는 것들이군. – 내가 직접 사준 것인데... 생존자가 없는 것으로 보이오."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Guard_1_Gen_String
msgctxt "771ecfda-c0af-4a77-aabd-3e43d18d4bc7"
msgid "\"You came after all... May I leave my post?\""
msgstr "\"결국 오셨군요... 자리를 비켜드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Guard_2_Varn_String
msgctxt "00b77aec-948b-4994-a7a6-4daa69e84126"
msgid ""
"\"Post? Sure, whatever that means. We've come for you... Gods, how long have "
"you been here?\""
msgstr "\"포스트? 물론이요, 그게 무슨 뜻이든. 우린 당신을 위해 왔습니다... 신이시여, 여기 얼마나 계셨던 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Guard_3_Gen_String
msgctxt "1fddd8dd-9fe0-41a2-8a20-d87c1b354470"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. It seems like forever... But finally, my guard will be over."
"\""
msgstr "\"모르겠군. 영원할것 같았지... 그러나 마침내 내 임무는 끝날 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Guard_Sleep_F_String
msgctxt "c6b63964-6ac9-42d0-a414-136a859c3c74"
msgid ""
"The exhausted General could easily be taken for dead, though in fact she "
"simply fell soundly asleep the moment she was out of danger."
msgstr "지쳐버린 장군은 쉽게 죽은 것으로 받아들여질 수 있었지만, 사실 그녀는 위험에서 벗어나자마자 푹 잠들었다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Guard_Sleep_M_String
msgctxt "8bfdf614-4a2f-44f7-856a-9a2634a927a9"
msgid ""
"The exhausted General could easily be taken for dead, though in fact he "
"simply fell soundly asleep the moment he was out of danger."
msgstr "지쳐버린 장군은 쉽게 죽은 것으로 받아들여질 수 있었지만, 사실 그는 위험에서 벗어나자마자 푹 잠들었다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Monster_1_Gen_String
msgctxt "cd365bcb-6133-45c4-9a34-7e919f1dba0f"
msgid "\"Maaaaegaaarrr...\""
msgstr "\"메에에이가아아르르르...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/General_Monster_2_Varn_String
msgctxt "df55fb49-c7d9-412a-a527-07d2da587d6e"
msgid "\"What? No! This isn't you! This can't be you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고? 아니야! 이건 네가 아니야! 이건 너일 리가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/GoblinTraderCamp_String
msgctxt "0cf6795f-a638-474e-bc4c-d3fb4d3bb056"
msgid ""
"It seems this campfire was only extinguished recently. There are goblin "
"footprints nearby."
msgstr "이 모닥불은 최근에야 꺼진 것 같다. 근처에 고블린 발자국이 있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Portal_Closed_String
msgctxt "a2216829-44cf-4e4b-9d03-612365ef767c"
msgid ""
"There has just been a portal where the stone is. The place still crackles "
"with sparks of otherworldly energy."
msgstr "방금 돌이 있는 곳에 포탈이 있었다. 그 곳은 아직도 다른 세계의 에너지 불꽃과 함께 지지직거린다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Redcap_1_String
msgctxt "be5d82df-3809-4b86-ad91-990c19372728"
msgid "\"Ours! All this is ours! We won't give it up!\""
msgstr "\"우리 것이다! 이 모든 것은 우리 것이다! 우리는 포기하지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Redcap_2_String
msgctxt "106bc25e-613f-423f-a211-e119db16ed98"
msgid "\"Get out of here, thieves! Or we'll eat you too!\""
msgstr "\"도둑들아, 여기서 나가라! 아니면 너희도 잡아먹을 거이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Redcap_3_String
msgctxt "0177c959-e434-4f1a-bae3-899c62676171"
msgid "\"Who invited you here? This is our castle! Our treasures!\""
msgstr "\"누가 너를 여기에 초대했지? 여긴 우리 성이야! 우리의 보물이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Varn_Afterboss_Alive_NoRomance_String
msgctxt "48ffa29d-d656-4efc-90d9-68ea0d6cc50c"
msgid ""
"\"You see, I came back for you. Everything is different in Varnhold now, but "
"you and I are still a team....\""
msgstr "\"보시다시피, 난 당신을 위해 돌아왔소. 지금 반홀드는 모든 것이 다르지만, 당신과 나는 여전히 한 팀이요....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Varn_Afterboss_Alive_Romance_String
msgctxt "07136f90-3ade-4392-aec3-467752365096"
msgid "\"I found you after all. We will be together...\""
msgstr "\"결국 당신을 찾았소. 우린 함께 할 거요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Varn_Afterboss_Dead_String
msgctxt "f4644f2d-34bb-4d0d-9f4e-2ce907716d6d"
msgid "\"Who did this to you? And why? If I knew, if I could avenge you...\""
msgstr "\"누가 이런 짓을 했지? 그리고 왜? 내가 알았다면, 내가 복수를 할 수 있다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Varn_Afterboss_Lost_String
msgctxt "ce8900f4-9d4e-4204-8e73-db817c99527b"
msgid "\"I let you down. Forgive me. I brought you here to die...\""
msgstr "\"내가 당신을 실망시켰소. 용서해 주시오. 내가 당신을 여기 데려와서 죽게 만들었소...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Varn_Entering_String
msgctxt "a3614325-52f0-400d-9e5f-aa94108b232c"
msgid ""
"\"Be careful — nothing is what it seems here. Especially the chests! And the "
"doors, the doors!\""
msgstr "\"조심하시오. 여기서는 아무것도 보이지 않소. 특히 상자! 그리고 문, 문!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Varn_Warn_String
msgctxt "08df6aa4-6520-46d6-9155-2c3600406c83"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing here is what it seems! You see those vases? They look suspicious – "
"like they're watching us!\""
msgstr "\"여기서는 아무것도 보이는 것이 없소! 저 꽃병들이 보이오? 그들은 우리를 보고 있는 것처같이 의심스럽군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Zone_Bones_String
msgctxt "6a3ffc51-a447-43da-b532-e57b82220b78"
msgid "Gnawed human bones, shreds of clothes and broken weapons."
msgstr "파먹힌 사람의 뼈, 옷 조각들, 그리고 부서진 무기들."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Back_to_Lostlarn/Barks/Zone_Trash_String
msgctxt "ed4a356c-dae1-4907-b1d4-6ed2b83eb0dc"
msgid "A pile of rubbish of unknown origin."
msgstr "출처를 알 수 없는 쓰레기 더미."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_1a_String
msgctxt "dd6d739c-2e2f-4caa-b79b-dbea33d1e08a"
msgid ""
"Dead bodies, preserved well in the cold. Some have been butchered like cows."
msgstr "추위에 잘 보존된 시체들. 몇몇은 소처럼 도살 당했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_1b_String
msgctxt "56e7100a-b4b3-4d99-8521-333c20f53fb2"
msgid ""
"The little chest holds a few empty and unlabeled bottles. Looking closer, "
"you identify the last drops in one of them as a sleeping potion."
msgstr ""
"작은 상자에는 라벨이 붙어 있지 않은 빈 병 몇 개가 들어 있다. 자세히 보면, 그 중 하나에서 수면제 몇 방울이 남아있는 것을 "
"식별했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_1b_failed_String
msgctxt "7e1498a7-01b2-4012-b817-096933cac55c"
msgid "The little chest holds a few empty and unlabeled bottles."
msgstr "작은 상자에는 라벨이 붙어 있지 않은 빈 병 몇 개가 들어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_1c_String
msgctxt "ad3f7dd5-5166-461c-8802-42ff7b968d78"
msgid ""
"Clothes, jewelry, and personal items of different sizes and styles. You see "
"bloodstains on some of them."
msgstr "크기와 스타일이 다른 옷, 보석, 개인 용품들. 그들 중 몇몇에게는 핏자국이 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_2a_String
msgctxt "970fe55b-be39-408e-8b26-921e064ed30e"
msgid ""
"The old couple were killed a day or two ago. Their throats have been ripped "
"out."
msgstr "그 노부부는 하루나 이틀 전에 살해되었습니다. 그들의 목은 찢겨져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_2b_String
msgctxt "90a299ec-84de-479a-9da7-497efd80cf03"
msgid ""
"A wand which allows its user to take on the appearance of a humanoid. Its "
"power is depleted."
msgstr "사용자가 휴머노이드의 모습으로 바꿀 수 있는 지팡이. 그 힘은 고갈되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_2b_failed_String
msgctxt "da750969-3ae8-4e76-b9d1-cc34fb5b6814"
msgid "An unidentified wand. Its power is depleted."
msgstr "정체불명의 지팡이. 그 힘은 고갈되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_2c_String
msgctxt "ea3852c1-1db8-4d27-a4c8-7e1a4c060a7d"
msgid ""
"There's an open book on the ground. You can swear the dog has been intently "
"studying its pages!"
msgstr "땅바닥에 책이 펼쳐져 있습니다. 당신은 그 개가 열심히 그 페이지를 공부하고 있다고 맹세할 수 있습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_3a_String
msgctxt "dee0d4d1-e32b-432f-bfa4-ff9b4e0f95ac"
msgid "A little key, smeared with blood and mud."
msgstr "피와 진흙으로 얼룩진 작은 열쇠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_4a_String
msgctxt "70461c12-99fb-4e01-9615-8d6b2d5464f1"
msgid "The bag holds a Brevic traveler's scroll, issued to Yorgesh Bragic."
msgstr "가방에는 요르헤시 브라직에게 발행된 브레보이 여행자의 두루마리가 들어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_4b_String
msgctxt "8d2a152c-0cbb-4eba-aa6f-5e6800dbd60e"
msgid "The chests in the cart are empty."
msgstr "마차의 상자들이 비어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Clue_4c_String
msgctxt "6e8eb37c-00b1-49d5-9a6b-c7149d33a971"
msgid ""
"A little chest filled with bottles of sleeping potion, or at least so the "
"labels say."
msgstr "수면제 병으로 가득 차 있는 작은 상자, 적어도 라벨에는 그렇게 적혀 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Dog_String
msgctxt "0d5600fc-066c-4a1d-a8bc-1b13aac0ee3f"
msgid "The dog has a large wound, which has barely begun to heal."
msgstr "그 개의 상처는 매우 커서 겨우 낫기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Guest_runaway_String
msgctxt "58a8bb80-9efd-479d-8199-9e23c938c750"
msgid "\"Ouch! Just don't hit me! I didn't do anything!\""
msgstr "\"어이쿠! 때리지 마! 난 아무 짓도 안 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Idle_old-lady_String
msgctxt "ddbe73a5-336d-433a-93bf-03c294f66b48"
msgid "\"Our baron is so kind, so just!\""
msgstr "“우리 남작님은 정말 친절하니까, 그냥!”"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Idle_old-lady_were_String
msgctxt "53a73997-f67d-4694-870b-ae2e2bb31bfd"
msgid "\"Thank you for giving us a chance.\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 기회를 줘서 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Idle_old-man_String
msgctxt "9df61ecd-8269-42c1-9c6c-84d58c43c19e"
msgid "\"I'm glad this little misunderstanding is over!\""
msgstr "\"작은 오해가 풀려서 다행이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Idle_old-man_were_String
msgctxt "4db98d3f-a25a-4a9d-bfa6-2a02f14306f7"
msgid "\"We'll start a new life in your barony!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 당신의 영지에서 새로운 삶을 시작할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Locked_Shelf_String
msgctxt "87562489-3876-4be5-94e2-f0a3aaaf67fe"
msgid "There's a tiny keyhole on the inside of the shelf."
msgstr "선반 안쪽에 작은 열쇠 구멍이 있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/Signpost_String
msgctxt "b2887d29-8bf7-4c99-98b9-93baea93fa4b"
msgid "To Blackstones Ford and inn"
msgstr "검은돌 여울과 여관으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/cephal_wait_String
msgctxt "c7f9d0a7-4c7a-40ff-aa8f-3b6c1b7cdbaf"
msgid ""
"\"No one will move while you're looking for evidence. I promise you that.\""
msgstr "\"자네가 증거를 찾는 동안에는 아무도 움직이지 않을걸세. 그건 약속하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/oldman_wait_String
msgctxt "b2243cff-8446-44d4-bc8b-8c53993fa230"
msgid "\"What's the matter? What happened?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야? 어떻게 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/oldwoman_wait_String
msgctxt "cd732d41-2c39-4c30-8516-1c9a9d881078"
msgid "\"We live quietly, and mind our own business.\""
msgstr "\"우린 조용히 살고 있어요. 그리고 우리 일에만 신경쓰고 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/trader_arrested_String
msgctxt "fdb0955f-30ff-4bfa-872e-5fb3d2ff96c8"
msgid "\"Who are you to judge me? Your own hands are dripping with blood!\""
msgstr "\"누구라고 나를 심판하느냐? 네 손에서 피가 뚝뚝 떨어지는구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/trader_free_String
msgctxt "9e3c4538-102c-4cbc-bb60-1d25d7bf4310"
msgid ""
"\"This is madness! They are monsters – and you're just letting them go?!\""
msgstr "\"이건 미친 짓이야! 그들은 괴물이야. 그냥 그들을 보내준다고? !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Barks/trader_wait_String
msgctxt "022b8cfe-f50a-4596-bf49-513336b28035"
msgid "\"Take a closer look at those two! I don't like them!\""
msgstr "\"저 두 사람을 자세히 봐! 난 그들이 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ad356aac-39bf-472e-b0cf-8908eb2446bc"
msgid "[Talk to the old people] \"Who are you?\""
msgstr "[노인과 대화] \"누구세요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "67f0afb7-1b4e-45eb-8abe-e89c707b00a8"
msgid ""
"[Talk to the young man] \"So who are you, and what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "[젊은 남자와 대화] \"그럼 넌 누구고, 여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "7a3f2e38-397f-486b-98de-81e508174d9f"
msgid "\"I've inspected the area and I'm ready to report my findings.\""
msgstr "\"지역 조사를 마쳤고 발견한 것을 보고할 준비가 됐습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "411cb632-061b-46ff-a0dc-64baaa3dcdf1"
msgid "\"I'll go and see what I can find.\""
msgstr "\"내가 가서 뭐가 있나 살펴볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "f3b803e1-f370-49a0-b40e-eed43cea204f"
msgid ""
"\"I've explored the area and found nothing strange. It seems to be a regular "
"inn.\""
msgstr "\"그 지역을 탐사했지만 특별한 건 없었어요. 평범한 여관같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7b3da1f1-6073-4e63-8b13-13ab16027649"
msgid ""
"{n}Three people are sitting at a table in a tense silence, an old couple and "
"a young man. They turn to you suddenly, making little effort to conceal "
"their dismay.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}긴장이 가득한 침묵속에서 세 사람이 탁자에 앉아있습니다. 노부부와 젊은 남자입니다. 그들은 당신을 향해 몸을 홱 돌리고는, 당혹감을 "
"숨기지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ecf18e01-607a-4303-93d9-80dc554d8398"
msgid "\"Good afternoon! Am I interrupting something?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하시오! 혹시 방해가 됐습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "b5f0411b-de10-4b85-b64e-715429608818"
msgid ""
"\"Em... No, no, not at all! Welcome, dear guests, please sit down! How can "
"we help you? Would you like to have dinner? Or maybe a room for the night?\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 아뇨, 아뇨, 전혀요! 환영합니다, 손님, 편히 앉으세요! 무엇을 도와드릴까요? 식사를 하시겠어요? 아니면 묵을 방이 "
"필요하신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "dd2ca22e-5296-4732-b848-487fee0fc7f1"
msgid "\"Make sure not to order any meat. I heard it's... strange here.\""
msgstr "\"육류는 주문하지 말게. 여기 고기가... 이상하다는 얘기를 들었거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "335fdefe-466d-4509-9dc0-8ada5f0e3949"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid we don't have any meat, only cabbage soup. And bread – but the "
"bread is fresh!\""
msgstr "\"죄송하지만 저희 가게에 육류 요리는 없습니다. 양배추 수프밖에 없지요. 그리고 빵도 있죠 – 그래도 신선한 빵입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "96cb030f-d017-4cdd-ab8d-a9fe7b030bf8"
msgid "\"Are you sure you're all right?\""
msgstr "\"정말 괜찮은거 맞소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "0a454f7b-dae4-4bfe-a7e9-7a1d18235f4e"
msgid "\"Well, have you looked around? Have you found anything?\""
msgstr "\"음, 주변을 둘러봤나? 뭔가 있던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "91afd4d3-4ac6-421a-9278-d6b847266642"
msgid "\"Yes, yes, of course! Don't worry about a thing!\""
msgstr "\" 예, 예, 물론입니다! 전혀 걱정하지 않으셔도 돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "828d65f9-1484-4e4d-8fcf-18867705962e"
msgid ""
"\"Then I suppose you won't mind if my people take a look around your inn? By "
"the way, I forgot to introduce myself. Maegar Varn – the baron of these "
"lands. I've heard rumor that guests at your inn are treated rather badly. "
"But surely this must be idle gossip?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 우리가 자네 여관을 좀 둘러봐도 되겠지? 그나저나, 내 소개가 늦었군. 메이가르 반 – 이 영토의 남작이지. 자네 여관의 "
"손님들이 꽤나 험한 꼴을 당했다는 소문을 들었네. 물론 괜한 소문일거라 생각하네만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "5dbeb245-6824-424e-a8ce-bef011d9fe41"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man looks at the old woman, then you, and then turns his eyes "
"back to Maegar.{/n} \"Em... Yes, yes, of course! Please look around! I "
"assure you, everything here is in order!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 노부인을 쳐다보고, 그 다음엔 당신을, 그리고는 다시 메이가르에게 눈을 돌린다.{/n} \"어... 예, 예, 물론입니다! "
"부디 둘러보세요! 여기엔 아무 문제도 없답니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "58e26eaf-f28d-4873-9776-a48593100200"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar turns to you and winks surreptitiously.{/n} \"Cephal and I will "
"remain here just in case, to keep an eye on everyone. You have a look "
"around. And if you have any questions, I'm sure our dear hosts will be happy "
"to answer them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 몸을 돌려 당신을 보고는 슬쩍 윙크합니다.{/n} \"혹시 모르니까, 케팔과 나는 여기에서 사람들을 지켜보고 있겠네. "
"자네가 조사하고 오게. 그리고 궁금한 게 있다면, 우리 주인장께서 기꺼이 대답해 줄거라 의심치 않네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "594b1824-9066-4fea-b459-37c9346dfcbb"
msgid ""
"\"I am Mytko, Mytko Bragic, and this is my wife, Kalina. We came from... "
"em... Brevoy. Wanted to move someplace new. And we opened this inn...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 밋코, 밋코 브레이직이고, 이쪽은 제 아내 칼리나입니다. 우리는, 저, 브레보이에서 왔구요. 새로운 곳으로 가고 싶었고 이 "
"여관을 열었습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "c077cf1b-eec8-4837-bcb8-c54431dc57f3"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Yorgesh, a simple merchant from {g|Restov}Restov{/g}. I'm on my way to "
"{g|Galt}Galt{/g} to trade... I've been here before, and never had any "
"problems. The beds are warm, the food is good, and the roof doesn't leak!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 요르게쉬입니다. 레스토프의 평범한 상인이구요.. {g|Galt}갈트{/g}로 거래하러 가는 길입니다.. 여기에 몇번 왔었고, "
"아무 문제도 없었어요. 침대는 따뜻하고, 음식은 맛있고, 지붕에서는 물이 새지도 않았죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "70b07122-6e9a-4ac0-a772-4fac34034c7e"
msgid "\"Great! Let's hear what my people managed to find out!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 내 사람들이 무엇을 찾아냈는지 들어봅시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "a2742fb5-c51d-4715-9a94-5a4701f0f21b"
msgid ""
"\"Right, there are lots of passers-by here, settlers, merchants... And we "
"thought an inn by a ford would be sure to have a regular flow of guests!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요, 여기는 많은 사람들이 지나다니니까요. 정착민, 상인 ... 우리는 시내 옆에 여관을 세우면 꾸준히 손님을 모을 거라고 "
"생각했지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "28a628eb-251c-4aab-80d8-be9b6f2df169"
msgid ""
"\"And treating our guests badly? Why, that's slander, I swear by all the "
"gods! We... em... We value our reputation!\""
msgstr ""
"\"손님을 대접하는 태도가 나쁘다고요? 신에게 맹세하건대, 그건 모함입니다! 우리는... 음... 우리는 평판을 중요하게 생각한다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "39b5fafb-0d30-4d38-9bd8-4fc90f322e26"
msgid "\"Keep your eyes peeled – any evidence might be important!\""
msgstr "\"눈을 떼지 마. 어떤 증거든 중요할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "7d11db4c-a480-40f8-9374-f28a1f24dc4e"
msgid "{n}The old people exchange nervous glances.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노인들은 불안한 듯 시선을 교환한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Begin/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "401c2566-c069-4eb4-8bd9-efc9b680aca9"
msgid ""
"\"Really? Well then, forgive us for the intrusion, dear hosts. Thank you for "
"your hospitality. We have to go.\""
msgstr "\"정말이오? 그렇다면 좋소, 우리의 침입을 용서하시오, 주인장. 환대에 감사드리지. 우린 가야 하오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "fe41bc89-ffbd-403c-9b05-44725768f115"
msgid "\"I found proof that guests were robbed and murdered at this inn.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 여관에서 손님들이 강도당하고 살해당한 증거를 찾았어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6854ef5d-a4b9-4474-bf4b-dac54081eb65"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know who these people are, but they're definitely not who they "
"pretend to be.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 사람들이 누군지 모르지만, 이들이 지금 신분을 가장하고 있다는 건 확실히 알겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8279c14f-7d00-4ac4-a650-7a0da57f5d72"
msgid ""
"\"The bodies of guests in a secret larder. Some of them are butchered like "
"cows.\""
msgstr "\"비밀 저장실에 있는 손님들의 시체 말이에요. 그 중에는 소처럼 도살된 자들도 있었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "87e133ed-39a4-4796-8579-fb0230c40267"
msgid ""
"\"There's a chest in the attic filled with clothes and personal effects that "
"obviously used to belong to a variety of different people. Some of them are "
"stained with blood.\""
msgstr "\"다락방에 여러 명의 소유였을 옷과 개인 소지품들로 가득 찬 상자가 있어요. 그 중에는 피칠갑 된 것도 있었고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "96a01d01-1006-4389-9d74-024db1a109df"
msgid ""
"\"There's half a box of bottles with sleeping potion in the kitchen. What "
"use do they have for it, if not to drug their guests?\""
msgstr "\"주방에 수면제가 든 병이 반 박스 정도 있어요. 손님들에게 먹일 용도가 아니면 왜 갖고 있었을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "bae17748-8bd5-435f-a6cf-f89cf77f8abe"
msgid ""
"\"I found the bodies of the real Mytko and Kalina Bragic. Their throats have "
"been torn out.\""
msgstr "\"진짜 밋코와 칼리나 브레이직의 시체를 찾았어요. 목이 찢겨나간채로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "6ebf4aaf-a98b-48f7-a13a-de1334a17cc5"
msgid "\"In the attic I found a wand that can change one's appearance.\""
msgstr "\"다락방에서 외모를 바꿀 수 있는 완드를 발견했어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "57ac4146-4401-4da5-8b14-20ec220c65ee"
msgid ""
"\"The dog in the yard is not what it pretends to be. When I passed by, it "
"was reading a book!\""
msgstr "\"마당에 있는 개는 진짜가 아니에요. 내가 지나갈 때는 그게 책을 읽고 있었다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0015_Text_String
msgctxt "6a577d06-0e22-4773-9144-eb9f13d7525b"
msgid "\"This is all I managed to find.\""
msgstr "\"이게 내가 찾아낸 것 전부에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0042_Text_String
msgctxt "5749c493-523a-42ca-ae52-ab301c3810ca"
msgid ""
"\"This young man is no passing merchant. He's in collusion with the owners "
"of the inn!\""
msgstr "\"이 청년은 지나가던 상인이 아니예요. 여관 주인들과 공모한 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0048_Text_String
msgctxt "f7879689-665e-4827-b8a4-d6a8e4b3efd8"
msgid ""
"\"You hid your surname from us – Yorgesh Bragic! You are related to the "
"owners of this inn!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 우리에게 성을 숨겼어 – 요르게쉬 브레이직! 당신은 이 여관의 주인과 친척이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0049_Text_String
msgctxt "2c9e7b47-0490-4700-bbad-9409bf47b8bd"
msgid ""
"\"There are no goods in his cart, only empty chests. I suspect he came to "
"collect the loot from the chests in the attic and sell it!\""
msgstr "\"그의 수레에는 물건이 없고 빈 상자만 있어요. 다락방의 상자에서 약탈품을 수거해 팔러 온 게 아닌가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0050_Text_String
msgctxt "2da36647-198d-4de9-afee-5af85b920d0d"
msgid ""
"\"There's a little chest full of bottles of sleeping potion in his cart –- "
"the very same sort of bottles as there are here in the kitchen!\""
msgstr "\"그의 수레에는 수면제가 담긴 작은 상자가 있어요 – 여기 부엌에 있는 것과 같은 종류의 병들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "71409459-b966-40ad-b304-060c29fdfafd"
msgid ""
"\"Let's hear the lycanthropes out. I suppose they must have something to say "
"in their defense.\""
msgstr "\"라이칸스로프의 말을 끝까지 들읍시다. 그들이 변호할 말이 있을 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0075_Text_String
msgctxt "c5796183-9157-4330-8724-8cdc426d3f75"
msgid "\"I have nothing more to say about it.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 할 말이 없네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "fe83c4aa-c88a-4cc0-bde9-4354192f7175"
msgid ""
"\"I found the real owner's bodies, and the key to the larder next them. The "
"lycanthropes might not even know anything about the other killings!\""
msgstr ""
"\"진짜 주인의 시체, 그리고 그 옆에 있는 저장실의 열쇠를 찾았어요. 라이칸스로프들은 다른 살인에 대해서는 전혀 모를 수도 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "78238687-0143-497b-b332-3788bf78120d"
msgid ""
"\"I discovered and inspected the bodies in the larder and the corpses of the "
"real owners. The bodies in the larder have been there for many months. "
"Judging by the corpses of the real innkeepers, they only died a day or two "
"ago.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저장실의 시체들과 주인의 시체를 찾아서 검사했어요. 저장실에 있는 시체들은 몇 달 동안 그곳에 있었죠. 진짜 여관 주인의 시체를 보니 "
"하루 이틀 전에 죽었더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0126_Text
msgctxt "13e459e2-a87d-44f4-88ed-bd74c4eeeb3b"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have any grounds to suppose there's anything strange going on at "
"this inn.\""
msgstr "\"이 여관에서 이상한 일이 벌어지고 있다고 할 만한 근거는 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0128_Text
msgctxt "b37e9b89-576c-42e9-a95a-78e1b2220b75"
msgid "\"Maegar, wait! I have other evidence!\""
msgstr "\"기다려요, 메이가르! 다른 증거가 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0129_Text
msgctxt "79a6400d-762f-4739-9ac9-9d59bc5008c2"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않는다.]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Answer_0134_Text
msgctxt "2f97cdab-f0ed-402a-8d4b-f2ade55d2555"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now everything is clear. The former innkeepers used to kill their "
"guests. Their son helped them by selling the loot. And the lycanthropes are "
"only guilty of self-defense.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 이제 모든 것이 명확해졌군. 예전 여관 주인들은 손님들을 죽여왔어요. 그들의 아들은 약탈품을 팔아서 그들을 도왔죠. 그리고 "
"라이칸스로프는 스스로를 방어한 죄밖에 없고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "633d4381-8ad0-4506-bd93-ae5891a65d32"
msgid "\"So, what did you manage to find out?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 무언가 알아냈나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "72f9caed-65fc-4b54-89df-67522bc9b4a6"
msgid "\"A serious accusation. What evidence is this?\""
msgstr "\"심각한 혐의군. 이 증거는 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0006_Text_String
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7a43ae6b-3f22-428f-b3e6-d8d9c11d0131"
msgid "\"Really? What makes you think that?\""
msgstr "\"정말로? 왜 그렇게 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "db403080-a299-420c-b93f-d41b3f8a7124"
msgid ""
"\"How horrible! With such evidence we needn't look any further. You've "
"caught them red-handed!\""
msgstr "\"정말 끔찍하군! 다른 증거는 더 볼 필요가 없다. 현행범을 잡았군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d3abc1ab-81c6-47e5-b2c5-171a4e0c5a6c"
msgid ""
"\"That's only circumstantial evidence. Can you back up your accusation with "
"any other findings?\""
msgstr "\"그건 정황에 불과해. 네가 걸고 있는 혐의를 뒷받침할 다른 근거가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "bcc3079b-685b-4bc2-95d9-17b6e7a06422"
msgid ""
"\"Well, that seems to be a lie. Yes, {Name}, it appears that you've expose "
"them for something worse than a lack of hospitality!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄, 그건 거짓말인 것 같은데. 그래, {Name}, 소홀한 대접보다 더 심각한 혐의를 찾아낸 것 같군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "87cc561f-c22a-4b88-84fe-916af8c1b7f4"
msgid ""
"\"So, the drunken bard wasn't making it up after all – they really do murder "
"guests here. I would have liked to hope that the part about eating their "
"flesh would turn out to be a fool's embellishment... But it's a hope I'm "
"quickly losing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니까, 결국 술취한 바드가 꾸며낸 게 아니었다는 뜻이군. 그들은 정말로 손님을 죽였어. 그들의 식인 행위가 바보의 허풍이길 "
"바랐는데... 그런 희망이 사라져가는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "0e8c7432-9441-45bd-8688-9b925c881063"
msgid ""
"\"I admit, this inn does look rather suspicious, but without hard evidence I "
"can't accuse these people of anything.\""
msgstr "\"나도 동의하건대, 이 여관은 수상해 보이지만 확실한 증거가 없으면 이 사람들을 고발할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e49a763e-fa01-45cf-8836-54a62852ec17"
msgid ""
"\"Really... What sort of monster is capable of murdering people and stealing "
"their faces?\""
msgstr "\"정말로... 어떤 괴물이어야 사람을 죽이고 얼굴을 훔칠 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ca9442ce-ab81-44bf-8a02-5f0d22f77d78"
msgid "\"Quiet!\""
msgstr "\"조용!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "718296fe-1fa4-4114-bc80-2e70fa6ecc83"
msgid ""
"\"That alone doesn't prove anything. Such a serious accusation requires "
"serious proof!\""
msgstr "\"그것만으로는 아무것도 증명할 수 없어. 그런 심각한 혐의는 확실한 증거가 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e11c864b-e3ff-44a6-a4f6-ad0085dc521e"
msgid ""
"\"This adds up in a very strange way... It sounds impossible but...\" {n}"
"Maegar gives the old couple a severe look.{/n} \"So who are you? Will you "
"confess, or shall we simply wait for the illusion to fade?\""
msgstr ""
"\"참 기묘하게도 앞뒤가 맞는군... 믿기는 힘들지만...\" {n}메이가르는 노부부를 혹독하게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그래서 당신들은 "
"누군가? 진실을 말할 것인가, 아니면 환상이 풀릴 때까지 기다릴까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e4823047-5b21-4e5b-b3d3-0e43582f56ca"
msgid ""
"\"I can't accuse these people of anything without sufficient evidence.\""
msgstr "\"충분한 증거 없이는 이 사람들을 고발할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "646d1929-bee6-42e1-8ac9-fe563c9d5ac0"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I suppose the drunken bard was just making up tales about this inn. "
"Forgive us for the intrusion! We are leaving.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄, 그 술 취한 바드는 이 여관에 대해 아무렇게나 지어내고 있었던 모양이군. 방해를 용서하시오! 우리는 이만 가겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f6971f0a-33b3-4135-8d7d-8ae4b5a18578"
msgid ""
"\"I could fall in love with you right now, if I hadn't already... Ahem, all "
"right. Not in public!\""
msgstr "\"이미 그러고 있지 않았다면, 지금 당장 사랑에 빠질 수도 있었을 텐데... 에헴, 알았어. 공공장소에서는 안 되지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0036_Text_String
msgctxt "53e2e9cf-8d65-4b47-b757-d082cafd384d"
msgid "\"Did you manage to find anything else?\""
msgstr "\"다른 것을 찾아냈나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "20ed4d70-dc7a-47f0-872c-976186911353"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar hesitates, but then nods.{/n} \"So, these are lycanthropes... What "
"else did you manage to find out?\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 망설이다가 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래, 이것들은 라이칸스로프들인데... 그 밖에 무엇을 알아냈나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "e8bb0ae1-a5c0-4128-8f4a-5572a2feb95b"
msgid ""
"{n}The old people jump up, dropping their human disguises. The innkeepers "
"are not human –- they're a couple of lycanthropes!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노인들이 변장을 관두고 벌떡 일어납니다. 여관 주인들은 인간이 아닙니다 – 그들은 한 쌍의 라이칸스로프들이었습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0046_Text_String
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "c3a87827-e2bd-4e72-9002-471c0dcac22f"
msgid ""
"\"What?! Me?! How dare you accuse me of such a thing? You can't have any "
"proof!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?! 나?! 내게 그런 혐의를 씌우다니? 당신은 증거도 없잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0052_Text_String
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "363077e2-1edd-49d5-a7bb-6e30ec6a4038"
msgid "\"I'm afraid it's not enough to accuse him of anything.\""
msgstr "\"아무래도 그를 고발하기엔 좀 부족한 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0053_Text_String
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "07075e51-64de-465d-be47-7fd5a7e3a4af"
msgid ""
"\"This is suspicious, but doesn't form sufficient grounds for an arrest. Do "
"you have any other evidence against him?\""
msgstr "\"의심스럽지만, 체포할 만한 증거가 되진 않는군. 그에게 불리한 다른 증거가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0054_Text_String
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "42431290-b568-4825-ac7c-9107316f0525"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, this goes beyond mere coincidence! Will you confess, or shall I give "
"you to my friend Cephal?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 이건 단순한 우연이 아니군! 사실대로 말할 건가, 아니면 내 친구 케팔에게 맡길까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0058_Text_String
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "8310c65a-3ae2-4536-a014-db0fe319e21b"
msgid ""
"\"This is just conjecture! Empty chests are simply empty! Emptiness is not "
"evidence!\""
msgstr "\"이건 추측일 뿐이야! 빈 상자들은 그냥 비어있을 뿐이야! 비어 있는 게 증거가 될 순 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "9d0cf644-612b-4678-bf4b-97cb7227e1b3"
msgid ""
"\"I've little doubt they have something to say! But why do you think we "
"should listen to their excuses, or believe so much as a squeak that comes "
"from their filthy maws?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 할 말이 있다는 건 알고 있어! 그런데 왜 우리가 그들의 변명에 귀를 기울이고, 그 더러운 입에서 나오는 꽥꽥대는 소리들을 "
"믿어줘야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "5cc4fa24-7ee3-4b40-9fa4-b9caa7259b8e"
msgid "\"Hear us out! We...\""
msgstr "\"말을 끝까지 들어! 우린...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "91583a68-b8b4-4ccf-afe5-8fcf92be59eb"
msgid "\"There's no way we're talking to monsters!\""
msgstr "\"괴물들과 대화라니 말도 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "706bb57c-0e5d-416b-a3cb-6f72992afedf"
msgid "{n}The lycanthropes begin to fight with inhuman dexterity.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}라이칸스로프들은 초인적인 날렵함을 보이며 싸움을 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0067_Text_String
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "1ee923c3-f53e-47a8-8b30-83a9c7b225cb"
msgid ""
"\"Sleeping potion sells well! Many suffer from insomnia in this dreadful "
"land! And no wonder – we're surrounded by cyclops cemeteries!\""
msgstr ""
"\"수면제는 잘 팔려! 이 무서운 땅의 많은 사람들이 불면증에 시달린다! 그리고 놀랄 일도 아니지. 우리는 사이클롭스 묘지에 둘러싸여 "
"있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a21533d0-8820-44c1-9959-a17e53b9b3aa"
msgid ""
"\"There is reason in this... But still, it's not enough to believe in the "
"innocence of these human-eating lycanthropes!\""
msgstr "\"그럴듯한데... 하지만 이 사람 잡아먹는 라이칸스로프들의 결백을 믿기에는 좀 부족한 것 같군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "c8d4f699-3ebf-4f13-87f7-a65e31a96d50"
msgid ""
"\"I still don't understand why you're defending these monsters, but your "
"reasoning is sound. Fine, I'll give these creatures a chance. Hey, you two! "
"What can you say in your defense?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 아직도 네가 왜 이 괴물들을 변호하는지 이해가 안 가지만, 너의 추리는 옳다. 좋아, 이 괴물들에게 기회를 주지 이봐, 너희 둘! "
"뭔가 변호할 말이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "dd07cffb-407f-4e85-b4b1-a144c4dfd226"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, but I don't understand why you're trying to protect them. "
"These creatures are murderers, as clear as day!\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만, 그래도 왜 그들을 보호하려고 하는지 이해가 안 가. 이 괴물들은 살인자야, 대낮처럼 훤하다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "1a7a1373-70b8-419a-b26a-38919ac9a56f"
msgid ""
"{n}The man slumps his head down.{/n} \"I admit it! I'm guilty of selling the "
"loot! My parents have been living in this backwater for a long time, hunting "
"and housing travelers. But they got old, lost their strength, couldn't hunt "
"any more. They didn't want to leave, no matter how much I tried to convince "
"them. The lands here are wild, and travelers are rare. If someone goes "
"missing, no one comes looking for them. So they decided to lure passing "
"merchants into spending the night, only to kill them and keep their riches.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자는 고개를 푹 숙입니다.{/n} \"인정한다! 나는 그 약탈품을 판 죄를 지었어! 우리 부모님은 오랫동안 이 벽지에서 사냥 "
"여관업을 하며 살아오셨다. 하지만 그들은 늙고, 노쇠하고, 더 사냥을 할 수 없었다. 내가 아무리 설득을 해도 그들은 떠나고 싶어하지 "
"않았다. 이곳의 땅은 야생이고, 여행자는 드물다. 누군가 실종되면 아무도 찾으러 오지 않아. 그래서 그들은 지나가는 상인들을 꾀어 밤을 "
"보내게 하고, 그들을 죽여 가진 것을 빼앗았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "77c4abc2-cdda-42ad-96c7-75752d78622b"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar nods.{/n} \"Well, lycanthropes, what's your next move? I'm sorry "
"your first attempt at living peacefully alongside people came to such a sad "
"ending.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그럼, 라이칸스로프들, 이제 어떻게 할 거지? 사람들과 함께 평화롭게 살려는 첫 시도가 "
"이런 슬픈 결말로 끝나서 유감이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "1e389922-a239-47ef-abfa-98278b4d04a0"
msgid "\"There are beasts even among ordinary people. We understand.\""
msgstr "\"보통 사람 사이에도 짐승이 있지. 우린 이해한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "86106204-8320-482f-b744-aa07b32dc477"
msgid ""
"\"So be it. When I return to the capital, I'll see to it that you have a "
"roof over your head and a job. Here in the Stolen Lands, even the most "
"unexpected alliances become possible. If you truly want peace, I won't "
"refuse you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 해. 내가 수도로 돌아가면 너희들이 살 집과 일을 찾을 수 있도록 하겠다. 이곳 '도둑맞은 땅'에서는 가장 기상천외한 동맹도 "
"가능하다. 진심으로 평화를 원한다면 거절하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "5831c798-e8f5-4b1e-923a-0f263b501bdc"
msgid ""
"\"And the bodies... they kept them too. They can hardly hunt, you know, my "
"folks...\" {n}The man wipes sweat from his forehead with trembling hands.{/n}"
" \"But I didn't kill anyone, I swear! I only helped them to sell the loot! "
"They're my parents, you know. I couldn't just leave them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 시체... 그들은 그것도 보관했다. 그들은 사냥을 거의 할 수 없어, 알지, 우리 가족들...\" {n}남자는 떨리는 손으로 "
"이마의 땀을 닦습니다.{/n} \"하지만 난 아무도 죽이지 않았어, 맹세해! 난 부모님이 약탈품을 팔도록 도왔을 뿐이야! 우리 "
"부모님이잖아, 그냥 두고 갈 수는 없었다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "d3dd43a4-de07-43f7-b838-ad882db1718e"
msgid ""
"\"It's mine! I have trouble sleeping at night. Insomnia. You know, getting "
"old is no fun...\""
msgstr "\"그건 내 거야! 나는 밤에 잠을 잘 못 자. 불면증. 늙는 건 재미없는 일이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "086fc91f-44e4-4d3c-97de-2163177a5870"
msgid ""
"\"They weren't stolen! Well... not by us at least. I admit, when our guests "
"want to sell something cheaply and quickly, we don't ask too many questions "
"about where it came from. But that doesn't make us robbers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것들은 장물이 아니야! 음... 적어도 우리가 훔친 건 아니지. 인정해, 우리는 손님들이 무언가를 헐값에 급하게 팔면, 그게 어디서 "
"왔는지 굳이 캐묻지 않아. 하지만 그렇다고 우리가 도둑이 되는 건 아냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "872a63e5-e36b-4eed-bc27-4966cfa1f261"
msgid "{n}Yorgesh turns pale.{/n} \"What... What are you?\""
msgstr "{n}요르게쉬가 창백해집니다.{/n} \"무슨... 넌 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0107_Text
msgctxt "7cce57ca-db3f-42ca-abc3-d898aead7e41"
msgid ""
"{n}The old couple exchange glances, then sigh and shed the illusion. The "
"creatures standing in front of you resemble humans only remotely – they are "
"lycanthropes!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노부부는 눈짓을 주고받다가 한숨을 쉬며 환상을 벗습니다. 당신 앞에 서 있는 생명체들은 두 발로 서 있을 뿐 인간과 거의 닮지 "
"않았습니다 – 그것들은 라이칸스로프들입니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0108_Text_String
msgctxt "ba4341c1-6501-451d-896c-d1990f9f0c5d"
msgid "{n}The merchant scoffs, insulted, then gets up and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}상인은 모욕적인 비웃음을 남기고 일어나서 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "32f88c4a-1c8e-48fa-9a2b-5d6b199c8a31"
msgid "\"We... Please hear us out! This is not our fault!\""
msgstr "\"우린… 끝까지 들어줘! 이건 우리가 한 게 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0110_Text_String
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "eff12b2d-d7ab-4a24-9de9-d24770723650"
msgid ""
"\"I am not! It's a very common name! Every third person in "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} is a Bragic!\""
msgstr "\"아니야! 그건 아주 흔한 이름이야! {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 사람들은 셋에 하나가 브레이직이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0111_Text_String
msgctxt "049b9aa0-11f2-4254-a9e8-8f01525283c1"
msgid "\"I see. Well... This is quite enough.\""
msgstr "\"알겠어. 뭐... 이 정도면 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0114_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "16931473-ad3b-435e-9615-558cfa42a8bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Varn shakes his head, astonished.{/n} \"I can't believe my ears... Well! "
"No matter how unbelievable it seems, I must admit that these creatures are "
"innocent.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}반은 깜짝 놀라 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"내 귀가 의심스럽군... 그래! 도저히 믿을 수가 없어 보이지만, 이 생명체들은 "
"결백하다는 것을 인정해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "121ad5ec-526e-4692-a5d3-5fdd5346ab79"
msgid ""
"\"We really did kill the old people... But we had to! We were only defending "
"ourselves!\""
msgstr "\"노인을 죽인 건 우리가 맞아... 하지만 그럴 수밖에 없었어! 우리는 우리 자신을 방어했을 뿐이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0116_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "d5244bfb-e13c-4738-a57d-d6fac1709eb2"
msgid ""
"\"We came here in human form as guests. And they drugged us with a sleeping "
"potion and tried to kill us! Those old people wounded one of us – the one "
"who's pretending to be a dog. We killed them, but only to save ourselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 인간 형태로 손님으로서 이곳에 왔다. 그리고 그들은 우리에게 수면제를 먹이고 우릴 죽이려고 했어! 그 늙은이들은 우리 중 "
"하나에게 상처를 입혔다. 그 다친 녀석은 지금 저 밖에서 개 흉내를 내고 있지. 우리는 그들을 죽였지만, 우리 스스로를 지키려고 했을 "
"뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0117_Text
#. Speaker : CR7_WeretigerOldman
msgctxt "027aa74b-ac88-498b-b4b2-be71cd7bb743"
msgid ""
"\"We believed we could live alongside people in peace. Have you heard about "
"Trobold in the Shrike Hills? Trolls and kobolds have built a kingdom and "
"live next to people as friends and neighbors. Couldn't we do the same?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 평화롭게 사람들과 함께 살 수 있다고 믿었다. 슈라이크 구릉지에 있는 트로볼트에 대해 들어본 적 있나? 트롤과 코볼트는 왕국을 "
"건설했고, 지금은 인간의 친구나 이웃이 됐지. 우리도 그렇게 할 수는 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0118_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "b9f9f69b-1ed0-4018-a57d-1bd3dca16561"
msgid ""
"\"We only stayed here to give our wounded friend a chance to heal. But then "
"guests came. It was probably a bad idea to pretend to be the murdering "
"hosts, but we didn't have the time to think of something better!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 상처 입은 친구를 치료하려고 잠시 머무르는 중이었다. 하필 그 때 손님이 와버렸지. 살인 여관업자인 척하는 건 나쁜 생각이었던 "
"것 같지만, 더 좋은 생각을 할 시간이 없었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0120_Text
#. Speaker : BlackstonesFordTrader
msgctxt "a61ff28a-b543-4851-86aa-12b38fdee532"
msgid ""
"\"But those people are not my parents!\" {n}Yorgesh points at the old "
"couple.{/n} \"They look the same, but they're not, I can feel it in my gut!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 저 사람들은 내 부모가 아니야!\" {n}요르게쉬가 노부부를 가리킨킵니다.{/n} \"겉으로는 똑같아 보이지만, 그렇지 않아. "
"난 알 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : CR2_WereratOldWoman
msgctxt "3763c3c9-adfe-4d70-8db2-f3f779c5ee46"
msgid ""
"\"If you would allow it, baron, we would like to live in your capital. We "
"will maintain our human appearance, and lead human lives... Let's give each "
"other another chance for peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작, 만약 당신이 허락한다면... 우리는 당신의 수도에서 살고 싶다. 우리는 인간의 모습을 하고 인간으로서 살 것이다... 서로 "
"평화의 기회를 갖자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0125_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f8b31287-51e0-4b4b-8b81-1f535e409a5d"
msgid "\"Now let's go. We have a lot of work to do.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가지. 할 일이 많으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0130_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e499ea80-59f3-499e-8796-7b2f4b6e5118"
msgid ""
"\"Meanwhile the confessions of this scumbag have revealed much of interest, "
"haven't they?\""
msgstr "\"한편... 이 쓰레기 같은 놈이 참 흥미로운 고백을 했군, 안 그런가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0133_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7ba3a3ca-e0b8-49fd-bacd-95a12d6ee3ad"
msgid ""
"\"In that case, the picture is complete.\" {n}Maegar draws his sword.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그렇다면 퍼즐이 맞춰졌군.\" {n}메이가르는 칼을 뽑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0135_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "264d2995-7b45-4568-bbdb-eabd76c9d062"
msgid ""
"\"Great work, {name}! You got to the bottom of this complicated story, as if "
"you've been doing it all your life. Well done!\""
msgstr "\"대단히 수고했어, {name}! 이 복잡한 이야기를 낱낱이 밝혀냈군. 거의 평생 지켜봐온 사람 같은데, 잘했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0136_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "55fdbbe5-2321-428e-88cd-47b30efa667d"
msgid ""
"{n}Cephal nods gravely.{/n} \"I strongly recommend the second option. I am "
"sorely lacking in... assistants... for my scientific research.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케팔은 진지하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"두 번째 길을 강력히 추천하네. 나는... 내 연구를 도울 조수가... 몹시 부족하지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Report/Cue_0137_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8f93f3eb-24b1-4a24-ae3e-d911adb38d04"
msgid ""
"\"Abhorrent!\" {n}Maegar barely keeps from spitting on the floor.{/n} \"A "
"trial will determine your guilt, and what punishment you deserve. Cephal, "
"lock this Yorgesh in the attic. Just make sure he has enough food to last a "
"week. We'll collect him on our way back to Varnhold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혐오스럽군!\" {n}메이가르는 간신히 바닥에 침을 뱉지 않고 참습니다.{/n} \"재판이 당신의 유죄를 결정할 것이며, 어떤 처벌을 "
"받을지 정할 거요. 케팔, 요르게쉬를 다락방에 가둬주시오. 다락에 식량이 있는지도 보고, 한 일주일 치 정도면 되겠군. 나중에 반홀드로 "
"돌아가는 길에 들러서 체포해 갈 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Transitions/BlackstonesFord_FromCave_String
msgctxt "83fe15c4-3a1e-4e99-978d-19bbec7efdfa"
msgid "Outside"
msgstr "밖으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Transitions/BlackstonesFord_FromFirstFloor_String
msgctxt "2b27feb0-5237-4e49-862e-5f567c26a160"
msgid "Outside"
msgstr "밖으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Transitions/BlackstonesFord_FromSecondFloor_String
msgctxt "81b1f920-fbf4-4357-a173-9641508fea7e"
msgid "Downstairs"
msgstr "아래층으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Transitions/BlackstonesFord_ToCave_String
msgctxt "57cac1f9-3673-40b8-84ba-cd9d65847209"
msgid "Into the cavern"
msgstr "동굴로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Transitions/BlackstonesFord_ToFirstFloor_String
msgctxt "fe2bc510-f669-410a-986f-fb9e0fde8481"
msgid "Into the house"
msgstr "집 안으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Transitions/BlackstonesFord_ToSecondFloor_String
msgctxt "6b387073-af6c-4fc0-9874-c255027013b7"
msgid "Upstairs"
msgstr "윗층으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Unit_Names/CR2_WereratOldWoman_MonsterForm_String
msgctxt "86855873-f910-4b51-9080-6c172609be7f"
msgid "Wererat"
msgstr "쥐인간"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Unit_Names/CR2_WereratOldWoman_String
msgctxt "c287afb2-b1a5-4c8e-b655-915178859e22"
msgid "Kalina"
msgstr "칼리나"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Unit_Names/CR7_WeretigerOldman_MonsterForm_String
msgctxt "90f0e062-2afa-4759-bf04-0b0a1e811ebc"
msgid "Weretiger"
msgstr "호랑이인간"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Unit_Names/CR7_WeretigerOldman_String
msgctxt "a3a41e6d-fafa-4e75-bfc9-8f9fdef3ba9a"
msgid "Mytko"
msgstr "밋코"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Unit_Names/CR7_WerewolfDog_MonsterForm_String
msgctxt "5dd23646-3406-49bd-bec2-78e1c66f220a"
msgid "Werewolf"
msgstr "늑대인간"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Unit_Names/CR7_WerewolfDog_String
msgctxt "7681945d-854b-4aa1-812c-0fb0e6c436fb"
msgid "Dog"
msgstr "개"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Varn_After_Battle/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "428a2429-be41-4f60-a12d-1eea760162a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks sullenly at the bodies of the lycanthropes.{/n} \"My barony "
"seems to attract not only settlers, but those who prey on them as well. "
"We'll need to be vigilant, or we'll soon be seeing trolls, kobolds and "
"Cayden knows who else, just like our neighbors.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 뚱하게 라이칸스로프들을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"내 남작령이 정착민들뿐만 아니라 그들로 먹고사는 포식자들도 끌어들였군. "
"정신차리지 않으면 곧 트롤, 코볼트, 거기에 케이든께서나 아실 다른 것들이 찾아와 이웃처럼 지내는 걸 보게 되겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Varn_After_Battle/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ab6fddc0-f839-4bf4-99f3-418207c0b57d"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, there's no shortage of monsters among men. As soon as we return to "
"the capital, this scumbag will go on trial, and we're in no mood for mercy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든, 남자들 사이엔 괴물이 부족한 법이 없지. 이 쓰레기 같은 놈은 수도로 돌아가자마자 재판을 받게 될 거고, 우리는 자비를 베풀 "
"기분이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BlackstonesFord/Varn_After_Battle/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "ed57b4cb-d988-4f5b-ba35-693a6dcf2b39"
msgid ""
"\"Well the bard can be happy. What's happened here will be perfect for one "
"of his songs. But now we have to go!\""
msgstr "\"뭐 바드는 만족하겠군. 이곳에서 무슨 일이 있었는지가 완벽한 노래의 소재가 될테니. 어쨌건 우린 가야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ccf19609-e282-4037-811f-51d723f139f0"
msgid ""
"...but the General and Cephal Lorentus shake their heads, and the Baron "
"exhales quietly. The party looks on in silence."
msgstr "...그러나 장군과 케팔 로렌투스는 고개를 젓고 남작은 조용히 한숨을 쉽니다. 일행은 묵묵히 지켜보고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a2be6fc8-f3da-4bf3-98c7-66a0c31913df"
msgid ""
"...Cephal tries to stop him, but then the General nods, and the Baron calls "
"out in his bold voice, drawing the centaur's attention."
msgstr "... 케팔은 그를 말리지만, 장군이 고개를 끄덕이는 것을 본 남작은 대담한 목소리로 외치며 켄타우로스의 주의를 끕니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b5732fb4-7fa5-49b4-b8b1-50d112af275c"
msgid ""
"The General leads the charge, relying on {mf|his|her} vigorous attacking "
"skills and artful maneuvers."
msgstr "장군은 {mf|그의|그녀의}의 활발한 공격 기술과 교묘한 기동력에 의지하여 공격을 지휘합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "ddf11399-4a40-4c83-a797-dd5eb3939b56"
msgid ""
"The General touches the Baron on the sleeve, and quickly whispers "
"{mf|his|her} plan. {mf|He|She} suggests that they approach the monster "
"silently, rather than rush it at full speed."
msgstr ""
"장군은 남작의 소매를 툭 치고, 재빨리 자신의 계획을 속삭입니다. {mf|그는|그녀는} 괴물을 향해 전력으로 돌격하기보다는 은밀하게 "
"다가갈 것을 제안합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "89eaca19-d1a9-48ca-94fe-c92c4a029dd2"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "9c70d97d-e347-47c2-b335-07b7d5cf1b27"
msgid "Luckily, the team has means to aid him."
msgstr "다행히, 일행은 그를 도울 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "e77881dd-b437-49aa-ab76-24be4581fe62"
msgid ""
"[Close] Sadly, the party can't help him. The Baron insists on giving the "
"deceased a proper burial, and then leads his people on to Varnhold."
msgstr ""
"[닫기] 슬프지만, 일행은 그에게 해줄 수 있는 것이 없습니다. 남작은 고인에게 제대로 장례를 치르고 그의 백성들을 반홀드로 인도하자는 "
"주장을 고수합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "4bccf478-1142-4f96-9ad5-bd5e9d28c414"
msgid "...decides that it is the perfect moment to learn more about centaurs."
msgstr "...지금은 켄타우로스에 대해 배울 수 있는 완벽한 기회라고 판단합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "ecaf7085-3ab6-4e8d-836a-bddcf467dbf9"
msgid "...doesn't interfere."
msgstr "...상관하지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "f1d02b1c-8d6e-459d-aae7-b2fcd9486069"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "7f48b5c2-c41a-4097-83e3-20d6d7e9f646"
msgid ""
"The Baron is ready to continue the chase, but the General wisely notes that "
"it would soon perish from its wounds in any case."
msgstr "남작은 추격을 계속할 준비가 되어 있지만, 장군은 어떻게 해도 상처를 극복하지 못하고 죽어버릴 것이라 현명하게 지적합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "3d7702c8-3bdf-4779-9bd4-2279dd2c55a9"
msgid ""
"The General and the Baron exchange glances, nod silently, and attack the "
"beast with a finishing blow!"
msgstr "장군과 남작은 눈짓을 주고받으며 묵묵히 고개를 끄덕이고는 야수에게 마무리 일격을 날립니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "0a59951c-df5d-45bc-9f0e-674dc1380618"
msgid "The General and the Baron eye the battlefield..."
msgstr "장군과 남작은 전장을 주시합니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ed57d8e7-38ef-4167-ba44-19d101af3dbe"
msgid ""
"Now you, my dear readers, have finally learned how I, Willas Gunderson, "
"author of this tale, first entered the acquaintance of Baron Varn and his "
"companions. But as much as I would like to delve into this remarkable "
"meeting, I must remind myself that by no means am I the main character of "
"this book. Perhaps one day it will occur to Baron Varn or the General to "
"mention me in their memoirs... For surely our encounter must have made an "
"impression upon them as well!"
msgstr ""
"독자 여러분, 이제 이 이야기의 저자인 저 윌라스 건더슨이 어떻게 반 남작과 그 동료들과 인연을 맺게 되었는지 알게 되셨을 겁니다. "
"그러나 이 놀라운 만남을 깊이 파고들고 싶은 만큼이나, 제 스스로 이야기의 주인공은 제가 아님을 기억해야 하겠지요. 언젠가는 반 남작이나 "
"장군께서 그들의 회고록에 나를 언급해줄지도 모르지 않겠습니까... 우리의 만남은 분명 그들에게도 뭔가 인상을 남겼을 겁니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "39564723-ff44-48ea-bec3-13ec42ef28ff"
msgid ""
"As fate would have it, the party has another adventure before returning to "
"Varnhold. Having decided to take a shortcut, they find themselves in an area "
"with strange furrows which criss-crossed the ground here and there."
msgstr ""
"운명에 따라, 일행은 반홀드로 돌아가기 전에 또 다른 모험을 하게 됩니다. 지름길을 택하기로 한 그들은 어느새 여기저기 땅을 가로지르는 "
"이상한 고랑들이 있는 지역에 도착했다는 사실을 깨닫습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "540e3f3c-7122-4840-8490-88cf208e5414"
msgid ""
"With barely a glance, the seasoned Varnling Host recognizes the monster as a "
"bulette, a sleek predator which attacks its prey from under the ground."
msgstr "노련한 반링 호스트는 단번에 이 괴물이 땅 밑에서 사냥감을 공격하는 포식자, 뷸렛임을 알아보았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e5811afc-b5d2-43a7-a55c-9b2fcfbdcd15"
msgid ""
"Baron Varn and his companions are cautious, and approach unnoticed as a "
"young centaur whoop and leap from one furrow to another. After a moment, "
"Baron Varn prepares to call out to the creature..."
msgstr ""
"반 남작과 그의 동료들은 조심스럽게, 젊은 켄타우로스가 고랑을 넘는 사이 눈에 띄지 않게 접근합니다. 잠시 후 반 남작은 그를 "
"부르려합니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e0bc322f-5ae0-4755-a3d8-89753a04e78e"
msgid ""
"The centaur frolics down the path — and straight into trouble, as it turns "
"out. Another leap, and the ground explodes in a fountain of dirt and stone, "
"and the muzzle of a great monster suddenly appears straight out of the "
"earth, right under the centaur's tender hooves!"
msgstr ""
"켄타우로스는 즐기듯 뛰어내려가지만, 생각지도 못한 곤경에 빠집니다. 다음 도약에, 느닷없이 흙과 돌이 폭발하듯 분출되고 거대한 괴물의 "
"아가리가 땅 위, 켄타우로스의 발밑으로 모습을 드러냅니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "3500c570-7ec9-42de-91e7-5b2123f201db"
msgid ""
"The call comes just in the nick of time. The centaur freezes and turns "
"towards the party. That very same moment, the jaws of a great monster emerge "
"up from the earth, right where the centaur would have stepped, should he "
"have continued on his way."
msgstr ""
"부름은 아슬아슬하게 그에게 닿습니다. 켄타우로스는 그대로 멈추고 일행에게로 돌아갑니다. 바로 그 순간, 켄타우로스가 다음 발을 내딛으려던 "
"땅으로부터 거대한 괴물의 아가리가 땅을 찢고 튀어나옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "8b62891e-19d4-40a0-9fc1-0d5f87fa81eb"
msgid ""
"Even the seasoned veterans of the Varnling Host have never seen a more "
"menacing beast!"
msgstr "반링 호스트의 고참들도 이런 위험한 괴물은 본 적이 없었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "fd7cf849-9c09-4c57-aa40-7ac2dc0ed469"
msgid ""
"The terrified centaur manages to twist away, and escape with his life. The "
"monstrous jaws have cut deep wounds on his legs and side, but at least it "
"haven't crushed him. The boy's painful scream echoes through the air, while "
"the dull grumbling beast prepares for another attack."
msgstr ""
"겁먹은 켄타우로스는 간신히 몸을 비틀어 목숨을 건져 피합니다. 괴물 같은 턱이 그의 다리와 옆구리에 깊은 상처를 입혔지만, 그래도 그를 "
"뭉개진 못했습니다. 고통스러운 비명이 허공을 울리고, 괴수는 으르렁대며 다음 공격을 준비합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "a85094bf-e05c-43cb-a213-ec5477c26e01"
msgid ""
"Baron Varn takes up his sword, steadfastly set on settling the matter "
"himself."
msgstr "반 남작은 칼을 들고, 직접 문제를 해결하기 위해 계속해서 애를 씁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "2a50570b-95e5-4c1e-a51f-acaaceb14688"
msgid ""
"The team attacks in full force. They surround the monster and take it from "
"all sides, while distracting it from its cloven prey. What a marvelous dance "
"of death it is! Their swords and spells cut through the trembling Dunsward "
"air, like lightning bolts across the stormy sky. But the beast is clever, "
"and quick to realize that the circumstances are turning in its disfavor. It "
"begins to dig once more into the ground."
msgstr ""
"팀은 완벽하게 합을 맞춰 공격했습니다. 그들은 괴물을 둘러싸고 사방에서 공격하면서, 괴물의 상처입은 먹잇감으로 부터 시선을 "
"분산시켰습니다. 이 얼마나 환상적인 죽음의 춤인가! 그들의 검과 마법은 폭풍이 치는 하늘의 번개처럼 던스워드의 떨리는 공기를 "
"잘라내었습니다. 그러나 괴물은 영리했고, 상황이 불리해지고 있다는걸 빠르게 깨달았습니다. 괴물은 한번 더 땅을 파고 들어가기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "b0f51c71-dd28-4f51-a8a2-b6471b8c76d9"
msgid ""
"Reasoning that such a subterranean monster is unlikely to rely on its "
"vision, the warriors of the Varnling Host move silently forward, dancing "
"from one boulder to the next, careful never to touch the soil. The General's "
"plan is a success, and they are able to approach the monster undetected. As "
"they draw near, the warriors strike in unison, throwing all their might into "
"a single, precise and deadly attack. The wounded beast roars, and tries to "
"escape under the ground!"
msgstr ""
"이런 지하에 사는 괴물은 시력에 의존하지 않을 것이라 추측하며, 반링 호스트의 전사는 조용히 앞으로 이동하면서 흙을 절대로 건드리지 "
"않도록 바위와 다음 바위 사이를 춤추듯 건너갑니다. 장군의 계획은 성공했고, 그들은 괴물에게 들키지 않고 접근 할 수 있었습니다. 가까이 "
"접근한다음, 전사들은 동시에 공격했고, 그들의 온 힘을 다해 한 번의 정확하고 치명적인 공격을 가합니다. 상처입은 짐승이 울부짖고, 땅 "
"속으로 도망가려고 시도합니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "01be8586-800c-45bc-a02a-8e1e77b8a2ba"
msgid ""
"Despite their victory, the young centaur is losing blood quickly and has but "
"moments more to live."
msgstr "비록 승리는 했지만, 젊은 켄타우로스는 피를 너무 빠르게 흘리고 있었고, 삶이 얼마 남지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "6ebf8c0a-b22b-479f-a895-6b7a874d1fcb"
msgid ""
"The young centaur approaches the party hesitantly. His young face glows with "
"boundless gratitude, but its curiosity is tinged with fear."
msgstr ""
"젊은 켄타우로스가 망설이며 파티에 접근합니다. 그의 젊은 얼굴은 한없는 고마움을 드러내고 있지만, 두려움이 섞인 호기심도 보이고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "93598440-a454-4c60-b8d5-879e3eec14ac"
msgid ""
"Alas, the party's efforts are not sufficient to save the hapless youth. The "
"beast finishes the poor centaur before the party can save him. The heroes of "
"the Varnling Host attack the beast in rage, but it immediately senses the "
"threat and quickly hides itself back underneath ground before a mortal blow "
"can be dealt. Its flight has the doom of inevitability, and it disappears "
"into the unyielding earth."
msgstr ""
"아아, 파티의 노력은 무력한 젊은이를 구해줄 수 없었습니다. 괴물은 파티가 불쌍한 켄타우로스를 구하기 전에 그를 끝내버렸습니다. 반링 "
"호스트의 영웅들은 격노하여 괴물을 공격 했지만, 괴물은 즉시 위험을 감지하였고, 치명적인 공격이 가해지기 전에 땅 속으로 숨어버렸습니다. "
"괴물은 막지못할 종말로부터 도망쳐 단단한 땅 속으로 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "a6b72e97-a933-4423-8f7e-e7cb0f1bf86a"
msgid ""
"After exchanging a few sharp words with Cephal, Baron Varn insists the poor "
"centaur be given a proper burial. He then delivers his final respects, and "
"leads the party back to Varnhold."
msgstr ""
"케팔과 날카로운 몇마디를 주고받은 뒤, 반 남작은 이 불쌍한 켄타우로스에게 제대로된 장례를 치뤄줘야 한다고 주장합니다. 그리고 그는 "
"마지막으로 망자에 대한 예를 갖춘 뒤, 파티를 이끌고 반홀드로 돌아갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "eb4831f5-2ca5-46fa-b8c3-8bb923fabddb"
msgid ""
"Baron Varn greets the boy and strikes up a conversation. Cephal Lorentus, "
"mumbling something about reckless risks for questionable purposes, "
"approaches the beast's lifeless corpse and starts performing some "
"calculations. Meanwhile, the General..."
msgstr ""
"반 남작은 그 소년을 환대하고 대화를 시작했습니다. 케팔 로렌투스는 미심쩍은 목적으로 무모한 위험을 졌느니 중얼거리면서 괴물의 죽은 "
"시체에 다가가 몇가지를 계산하기 시작합니다. 그러는 동안 장군은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "4ee0a7a2-f061-4528-9fd7-090cd5a3bc4b"
msgid ""
"The General delicately manages to get some further information from him. For "
"the most part, it only amounts to what the team already knows. But they "
"learn that the centaur belongs to the Nomen tribe, and their leader is one "
"Aecora Silverfire, a name Roiko speaks with the fiery awe of youth. The "
"Nomen centaurs consider themselves guardians of this land, and stand ready "
"to defend it from any invasion. Roiko also tells them, with a sigh, that the "
"tribe is very small, unlike in the olden days. War and disaster has taken "
"their toll, and the other tribes no longer want to deal with the Nomen. "
"Roiko's words make it seem as though the other centaur tribes consider his "
"own tribe perhaps a little... mad."
msgstr ""
"장군은 그에게서 몇개의 추가적인 정보를 얻도록 세심히 노력했습니다. 대부분은 일행도 이미 아는 내용이었습니다. 그러나 그들은 켄타우로스가 "
"노멘 부족에 속한다는 것, 그들의 리더가 젊은 로이코의 불타는 존경심을 받아마지않는, 아에코라 실버파이어라는 이름의 켄타우로스라는 것을 "
"알아냈습니다. 노멘 켄타우로스는 그들 스스로를 이 땅의 수호자이자, 그 어떤 침략으로부터도 방어할 준비가 되어 있다고 여깁니다. 로이코가 "
"한숨을 쉬며 덧붙이길, 그들의 부족은 예전과 달리 아주 작다고 말했습니다. 전쟁과 재앙은 사상자를 내고, 다른 부족들은 더이상 노멘과 "
"거래하려 하지 않았습니다. 로이코의 말을 들어보면 다른 켄타우로스 부족들은 그의 부족을 조금... 미쳤다고 생각하는것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "23dc6822-64a5-498d-9bbe-5240401fd1a7"
msgid ""
"The centaur says his name is Roiko, but it sounds more like a nickname than "
"a real one. He is manifestly stunned by the courage of Baron Varn and his "
"people. He hesitantly prepares to go on his way, explaining that the tribe "
"would soon notice his absence, and that he might be punished for talking to "
"the two-legged."
msgstr ""
"그 센타우르스는 자신의 이름이 로이코라고 말했습니다. 그러나 그것은 진짜 이름이 아닌 별명처럼 들립니다. 그는 반 남작과 그의 사람들의 "
"용기에 분명히 감동받은 것처럼 보입니다. 그는 머뭇거리면서 원래 길로 돌아갈 준비를 하며 그의 부족이 그가 없어진걸 곧 알아챌 거라고 "
"설명합니다. 그리고 그가 두다리들과 이야기 한 것에 대해 처벌받을게 분명하다고 이야기 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "5bbd44d7-134d-4cf7-b4af-db79d8c008a7"
msgid ""
"Saying warm goodbyes to the young centaur, Baron Varn nods, content with his "
"own thoughts, and leads the party on to Varnhold."
msgstr ""
"반 남작은 고개를 끄덕이며 자신의 생각을 담아 젊은 켄타우로스에게 따듯한 작별인사를 건넸습니다. 그리고 그는 일행을 반홀드로 이끌었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/BuletteGMBE/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "120555e4-c835-4b71-8f17-4ae64498ce40"
msgid ""
"Could this monster withstand the united attack of these battle-hardened "
"comrades? The answer could but be a decisive no! With this second blow, it "
"roars one final time, and then its lifeless flesh sinks onto the ground. "
"Another glorious victory for the Varnling Host!"
msgstr ""
"괴물이 전투로 단련된 동료들의 연합공격을 견뎌낼 수 있었을까요? 답은 '아니'로 정해져 있었습니다! 두 번째 일격이 가해지자 그것은 "
"최후의 괴성을 내질렀고, 놈의 생기 잃은 몸뚱이는 땅 위로 힘없이 쓰러졌습니다. 반링 호스트가 또다시 영예로운 승리를 거뒀습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "aaa24a44-830f-44b0-85c0-6fb57abd0cd4"
msgid ""
"[Address Aecora] \"Mistress, tell us about what you guard. We wish to know "
"the truth.\""
msgstr "[에코라에게 말을 건다] \"여인이여, 당신이 무엇을 지키고 있는지 알려주십시오. 우리는 진실을 알고 싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "438158d4-3140-4327-ad0d-a08c5461a3d5"
msgid ""
"\"If you want my opinion, commander, we should deal with Aecora. Let the "
"daemon worshipers go back to Abaddon!\""
msgstr "\"내 의견을 묻겠다면 지휘관, 우리는 에코라를 처리해야 합니다. 저 다이몬 숭배자들을 나락으로 돌려 보냅시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "97167975-a0a6-4e0f-bd1c-4afd19143fc6"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, the centaurs stand between us and a threat to Varnhold. They must "
"stand down or die!\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 저 켄타우로스들은 우리와 반홀드 사이에 서서 반홀드를 위협하고 있어요. 그들은 물러나던지 죽어야 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b1078d84-e0ec-4a83-a3fe-1fc99b1618e8"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, I have an extreme suggestion. Why don't we get rid Old Stump of "
"both the centaurs and the cultists?\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 제게 한가지 극약처방이 있습니다. 그냥 저 무리들을 둘 다 없애버리면 안 됩니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ccbb8b24-308e-43ae-9416-7de3fdcf8107"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, we don't need to fight Aecora's tribe. They want peace for this "
"land just as we do.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 에코라의 부족과 싸울 필요는 없습니다. 그들은 우리가 그렇듯 평화를 원합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0b0a600a-707a-4e22-83ef-23f8cc507cc5"
msgid ""
"\"Please, Aecora, listen to my commander. If there is anyone in the world "
"who can lead us against an ancient evil, it is Maegar Varn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"에코라, 부디 내 지휘관의 말을 들어야합니다. 고대의 악에 대항해 우리를 이끌 수 있는 사람은 세상에 메이가르 반 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "8a3d0684-d9b8-4df8-9b5b-2523388a7bdd"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, we should get rid of the centaurs and the cultists too. They are "
"both enemies to Varnhold.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 우리는 켄타우로스와 사교도들 모두를 제거해야 합니다. 둘 모두 반홀드의 적입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "82d36e54-e0a4-4dcd-87d4-c2cb19e60771"
msgid ""
"\"Instead of wasting our efforts fighting each other, we should join forces "
"and go down into the tomb together.\""
msgstr "\"따로 싸워서 우리의 노력을 낭비할 게 아니라, 힘을 합쳐서 함께 이 무덤을 내려가야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "fafc910d-13d2-4f70-83a0-57cc913072db"
msgid ""
"\"You guard a place shown to you in nightmares? But Desna – Mother Moon – is "
"a good goddess of dreams. It is not like her to send nightmares. It seems "
"like something isn't right!\""
msgstr ""
"\"악몽에서 봤던 장소를 지키고 있는 겁니까? 하지만 데스나 - 어머니 달은 선한 꿈의 신 입니다. 악몽을 보내는건 그분이 할일이 "
"아닙니다. 뭔가 잘못되고 있는것 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "84260387-8c09-4e67-a767-9f830b09ccd0"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, we won't be able to persuade the centaurs. I'm sorry, but we have "
"to kill them.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 우리는 그 켄타우로스들을 설득 할 수 없습니다. 유감이지만, 우리는 그들을 죽여야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0001_Text_String
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "d05c48b4-d2de-42c1-a540-991a1f3e695a"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of centaurs stand shoulder to shoulder, grumbling angrily. They "
"surround a stately woman, whose armor is stamped with images of the moon. It "
"is clear that she must be their leader. She looks at your party, her eyes "
"sharp and unkind. On her lips is a challenge, not a greeting.{/n} \"In the "
"name of {g|Desna}Mother Moon{/g}, what are you doing here? You would ruin "
"yourself and my tribe, strangers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n} 한무리의 성난 켄타우로스들이 어깨를 맞대고 서 있습니다. 그들은 한 명의 위풍당당한 여자를 둘러 싸고 있었습니다. 그녀의 갑옷엔 "
"달의 모양이 새겨져 있었습니다. 그녀가 그들의 리더인것은 분명합니다. 그녀는 당신의 일행을 쳐다보더니 눈매가 날카로워지며 불쾌감을 띄기 "
"시작합니다. 그녀의 입은 환영이 아닌 도전적인 말을 꺼냅니다.{/n} \" {g|Desna}어머니 달{/g}의 이름으로, 여기서 뭘 "
"하는거지? 너희는 너희 자신뿐만 아니라 우리까지 파멸로 몰고 있다, 이방인.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurSavedFromBulette
msgctxt "675305cd-5def-40bb-b85e-e83311ceabd8"
msgid ""
"\"We must listen to them!\" {n}A young centaur elbows his way through "
"Aecora's bodyguards.{/n} \"These two-legged saved me from a monster that "
"attacked from up through the ground. They are not our enemies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그들 말을 들어야 합니다!\" {n} 젊은 켄타우르스가 에코라의 경비병들을 밀치고 나왔습니다.{/n} \"이 두다리 들은 "
"지하에서 올라온 괴물로부터 저를 구해줬습니다. 그들은 우리의 적이 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "64def3aa-7282-4ed8-9fee-7a6173605e73"
msgid ""
"\"I agree with the General. I do not like these inconsistencies either. "
"Especially the story that the dwellers of Old Stump are telling us. That an "
"archdaemon would bestow prosperity upon them... It sounds like utter "
"nonsense.\""
msgstr ""
"\"장군의 말에 동의하네. 나 또한 이러한 모순을 좋아하지 않네. 특히 Old Stump의 주민들이 우리에게 들려주고 있는 이야기 같은 "
"것 말일세. archdaemon이 그들에게 번영을 안겨준다니... 말도 안 되는 소리군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "bc3a93a6-8aa9-4bc2-a22a-6f1983d44737"
msgid ""
"\"Are you still talking, you pathetic fools? Enough! Your time is at an end! "
"Your thousand year guard is a sham; Master just didn't want to give his "
"gifts to the worthy until now. But now the moment has come. You cannot bend "
"his will!\""
msgstr ""
"\"딱하고 어리석은 놈, 아직도 할 말이 남았나? 이제 충분하다! 너의 시간은 끝났어! 너의 천년의 감시는 엉터리다. 주인께서 지금까지는 "
"은총을 주지 않으셨지. 그러나 이제 그 시간이 왔도다. 너는 그분의 의지를 꺾지 못할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "b1702295-fc56-4a9c-98eb-18d37b559d61"
msgid ""
"\"So you come here without even knowing what you're dealing with? Are you "
"extremely stupid or extremely desperate? I do not have the time or desire to "
"sing you our songs, as they are passed from generation to generation these "
"many long ages. But I will tell you the story of the Eternal Nomen Guard. As "
"briefly and clearly as I can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 너는 지금까지 네가 뭘 상대하고 있는지도 모르고 여기까지 왔단 말인가? 답도 없이 멍청한 건가, 아니면 그만큼 절박한 건가? "
"나는 원래 너에게 세대와 세대를 거쳐 오랜 시간 내려온 우리의 노래를 불러줄 생각도, 그럴 시간도 없었다. 하지만 네게 영원한 노멘 "
"수호자의 이야기를 말해주기로 하겠다. 최대한 간단하고 알기쉽게 설명해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : CultistChief
msgctxt "6458f4f6-ca63-435a-afb7-c472239d4d88"
msgid ""
"\"But think what you're saying! You refuse the power and eternity that the "
"Master offers!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 네가 말한 것을 생각해봐라! 주인님께서 내려주신 힘과 영원을 거부하다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "114f4f63-aeb6-4faf-92b9-217656bc685e"
msgid ""
"\"You want peace, but how do you know that we are prepared to offer it? I "
"still don't see why I should allow you inside the tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 평화를 말하지만, 우리가 널 평화롭게 대할 것이라고 어떻게 확신하지? 널 무덤 안으로 들여보내야 할 이유를 아직도 모르겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurSavedFromBulette
msgctxt "bf66eced-3b63-4f47-affd-f77d8d698cc4"
msgid ""
"\"Because there are so few of us left. There are less than a dozen like me "
"in our tribe. One way or another, our generation will be the last to stand "
"guard. Everyone knows this, but no one wants to say it out loud! Please, "
"priestess, for Mother Moon – let the two-legged inside the tomb. There's no "
"point in guarding the evil any more. We can only hope to defeat it or die "
"trying.\""
msgstr ""
"\"남아 있는 우리 부족이 너무 적기 때문이지요. 우리 부족에는 나와 같은 자가 열 명도 되지 않습니다. 어떤 식으로든 우리 세대가 이 "
"수호를 수행하는 마지막 세대가 되겠죠. 모두가 이 사실을 알고 있지만 아무도 크게 말하고 싶어하지 않을뿐! 부탁입니다, 여사제여, 어머니 "
"달을 위해 – 두 다리들이 무덤 안으로 들어가도록 해주세요. 더 이상 악을 감시하는 것은 아무런 의미가 없습니다. 우리는 그것을 "
"물리쳐야하고 그렇지 못한다면 죽을 뿐입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurSavedFromBulette
msgctxt "b6aa3cca-98c1-4890-83da-ca1f5b1a0a97"
msgid "\"Did you save me only to slaughter me with your own hands now?\""
msgstr "\"네 손으로 직접 끝장내려고 구해준 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "7d872542-b202-4939-980b-2007d6787706"
msgid ""
"\"The time for words is over, human. I am sorry for you, and sorry for my "
"tribe. Our children die upon this land. But we have a higher purpose. We "
"will bravely stand our eternal guard to the end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"대화의 시간은 끝이다, 인간이여. 너와 나의 부족에게는 유감스럽게 되었군. 우리의 아이들은 이 땅 위에서 죽겠지. 하지만 우리는 더 "
"숭고한 목적이 있다. 우리에게 주어진 영원한 수호의 의무를 마지막까지 용감하게 관철하리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CultistChief
msgctxt "8fb6dcf2-db37-48a7-92de-c83fb444c3b9"
msgid "\"Blind fools! You are unworthy of the Master's gift!\""
msgstr "\"눈먼 멍청이들! 너희는 주인님의 선물을 받을 자격이 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurSavedFromBulette
msgctxt "1ad17657-df69-4247-ae30-8f499b0fa533"
msgid "\"Don't bare your swords, please!\""
msgstr "\"칼을 뽑지 마시오, 제발!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "4e539567-ec41-46dc-b395-6ba50413604b"
msgid ""
"\"No, enough. You've just shown what your 'alliances' are worth, two-legged. "
"I don't believe you. Tribe, to arms! Fight like it's for the last time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만, 이제 충분하다. 두 발로 걷는 자여, 너는 방금 너의 '동맹'이 얼마나 쓸모없는지 보여줬다. 나는 너를 믿지 않아. "
"부족원들이여, 무장하라! 죽을 각오로 싸워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e21f4931-d629-47a0-b46e-ff773fdccec6"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me, Aecora. The cyclopes have already awakened. They're already "
"lurking in the area. That means that their leader isn't sleeping as "
"peacefully as before.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 들으시오, 에코라. 사이클롭스들은 진작에 깨어났고, 이미 주변에 숨어 있소. 그 말은 놈들의 대장이 예전처럼 평화롭게 잠이나 자고 "
"있지 않다는 뜻이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "58754999-89ed-46d3-b0a6-c28a4a2c4663"
msgid ""
"{n}Aecora hesitates.{/n} \"If we go with you, we will be able to see whether "
"you go to seize the evil daemon magic, or to fight the evil that is locked "
"inside. That seems more reasonable than attacking you here and now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에코라는 망설입니다.{/n} \"너와 함께 가면 네가 사악한 악마의 마법을 탐했는지, 아니면 안에 갇힌 악을 물리치러 가는지 알 수 "
"있겠지. 지금 여기서 너를 공격하는 것 보다는 그것이 더 합리적일거 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "4a99795d-4539-4e6c-a0b8-c88bfd403b50"
msgid ""
"\"It is too great a risk, and we have too little trust for you, strangers.\""
msgstr "\"그건 너무 위험해, 그리고 우린 아직 너를 믿지 않는다, 이방인.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "ee93de1b-b126-4f3e-a1cb-af89330d3585"
msgid ""
"{n}A shadow of doubt rushes over the priestess' face.{/n} \"I think you just "
"very politely suggested that my tribe has been guarding this land at an "
"unthinkable cost for thousands of years based on false information. Or is it "
"sheer fantasy? These are brazen words!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}의심의 그림자가 여사제의 얼굴을 스칩니다.{/n} \"네가 정중히 주장하는 바에 의하면, 우리 부족이 거짓 정보에 속아서 상상도 "
"못할 희생을 치르며 이 땅을 수천년 간 수호하고 있단 말인가? 혹은 그냥 환상이라고? 참으로 뻔뻔한 소리로구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "b7866c04-1b8f-4a1b-bd2b-cf5e099e9f40"
msgid ""
"\"Do you really think you understand ancient knowledge better than me and "
"generations of my ancestors? You – a stranger?!\""
msgstr "\"진심으로 네가 고대의 지식에 대해 나나 역대의 우리 조상님들보다 잘 이해하고 있다고 생각하나? 너 같은 이방인이?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "334364c5-5c40-43a2-bc63-9753aa329a5f"
msgid ""
"\"I am not a sage, but I've learned one thing in my life: if a horrible "
"danger is hiding in your cellar, the stupidest thing you can do is sit on "
"the door and hope it never gets out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 현자는 아니지만, 삶의 경험으로 하나 배운 건 있지. 내 집 지하실에 끔찍한 위협이 숨어 있을 때, 그 지하실 문 위에 앉아서 "
"제발 나오지 말라고 기도나 하는 건 가장 멍청한 선택이란 거.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "6c396146-24af-4e76-82cd-cfc2377c136c"
msgid ""
"{n}Somehow, amazingly, the priestess smiles.{/n} \"I know a thousand "
"beautiful songs from the old times, a thousand more prayers and "
"incantations. But this is the first time I sense so much force in such "
"simple and unsophisticated words. All right, Baron Varn. We will follow you "
"into the darkness, if that is what we must do. But first we will clear the "
"land of what remains of the daemon worshipers!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왜인지, 놀랍게도 여사제가 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"옛날부터 내려온 아름다운 노래 천 곡, 천 가지도 넘는 기도와 주문들을 알고 "
"있지만 지금처럼 단순하고 투박한 말에서 이렇게 큰 힘을 느끼기는 처음이군. 좋소, 반 남작. 우리가 해야 할 일이 있다면 그대를 따라 "
"어둠 속으로 들어가겠소. 하지만 먼저 이 땅에 남아 있는 다이몬 숭배자들부터 쓸어버릴 것이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : CultistChief
msgctxt "10fea62f-d2b9-4bfa-bb90-bf295bb5a811"
msgid ""
"\"Baron! I was wrong to think you worthy of the Master's gift! You are the "
"same as other mortals, ordinary and pathetic, and unable to see past your "
"own nose!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작! 네놈이 주인님의 선물을 받을 자격이 있다고 생각한 내가 틀렸다! 너도 평범하고, 한심하고, 한치 앞도 분간할 줄 모르는 다른 "
"놈들과 똑같구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : CultistChief
msgctxt "df85a5d7-4c37-46c2-a522-7ae38128ae1c"
msgid ""
"\"Enough idle talk! Baron Varn, you and your companions have made it clear "
"that you are unworthy of the Master's gift! You will die along with these "
"pathetic creatures. Only the most faithful of the faithful will receive the "
"gift!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쓸데없는 소리! 반 남작, 너와 네 동료들은 주인님의 선물에 걸맞지 않다는게 분명해졌다! 이 한심한 생명체들과 함께 죽어라. 오직 "
"가장 신실한 자만이 그 선물을 받으리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "e41dac60-0557-462d-b4e3-ff2d84719f3a"
msgid ""
"{n}The conversation ends abruptly, and a tense silence hangs in the air, as "
"if each side is waiting for the opponent's move.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}대화는 갑자기 끝나고, 마치 서로 상대가 움직이길 기다리는 것처럼 긴장된 침묵이 허공에 감돕니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a11b0128-1f04-458f-aaab-fd5de551c6b5"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar raises his hand, quieting the angry whispers in the ranks of the "
"centaurs.{/n} \"Lady Aecora, I assume? I am Baron Maegar Varn, ruler of "
"Varnhold. Sky is my witness, I do not want your people to fight my people. "
"Blood has been shed, but we do not need to keep shedding it. All we want is "
"to protect our homes from the attacks of dead cyclopes. And to do that, I "
"need to deal with the tomb...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 손을 들자 켄타우로스 대열에서 들리던 성난 속삭임이 줄어듭니다.{/n} \"에코라 경, 맞소? 나는 반홀드의 통치자 "
"메이가르 반 남작이라 하오. 하늘에 맹세컨데 그대의 백성과 내 백성이 싸우는 것을 원치 않소. 이미 서로 피를 흘렸지만 계속 그럴 필요는 "
"없지 않겠소. 우리가 원하는건 오직 죽은 사이클롭스의 공격으로부터 우리의 집을 지키는 것이오. 그리고 그러기 위해선 그 무덤을 처리해야 "
"하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "bf5868b5-99f9-4afd-87bb-56b50db9a09d"
msgid ""
"{n}A murmur runs through the ranks of the centaurs. Aecora's eyes become "
"fierce and furious.{/n} \"Deal with the tomb!? And I must take your word for "
"this, Baron Varn? Trust you, and lift the guard that the Nomen tribe has "
"stood for thousands of years. I should allow you to approach the thing that "
"mortal hands must never touch?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}켄타우로스 대열 사이로 웅성이는 소리가 흐릅니다. 에코라의 눈이 분노로 험악해집니다.{/n} \"무덤 문제를 해결하겠다고!? 나보고 "
"그 말을 믿으라는 건가, 반 남작? 널 믿고 노멘 부족이 수천 년간 지켜왔던 곳에서 철수하라니? 무덤은 필멸자의 손이 닿아선 안 되는 "
"곳이야. 무슨 이유로 네게 접근을 허락할 것 같나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "433bd874-db29-42e5-93d0-c1b9037015d3"
msgid ""
"\"A long long time ago, a cyclops empire ruled these lands. This was a "
"kingdom of darkness and unimaginable cruelty. But somehow, there was one "
"among them in this ominous place whose soul was filled with such darkness "
"that he terrified even his own kin. This ancient tyrant, whose name we must "
"never speak, built his citadel in these lands. But his disciples and "
"subjects rebelled against him, and sealed him within his own walls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아주 오래 전에 사이클롭스 제국이 이 땅을 지배했다. 어둠과 상상할 수 없는 잔인함의 나라였지. 그러나 어찌된 일인지 이 불길한 "
"곳에는 자신의 혈족까지도 공포에 떨게 할 정도로 어둠으로 가득한 영혼이 하나 있었다. 우리가 결코 이름을 말할 수 없는 이 고대의 "
"폭군은, 이 땅에 그의 요새를 건설했다. 그러나 그의 제자들과 신하들이 그에게 반기를 들고, 그의 성벽 안에 그를 가두었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "d4fc262c-e2f8-4f71-8f8d-f4199bb1d198"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, he is not dead, but only wrapped in a magical sleep. Thousands of "
"years ago, {g|Desna}Mother Moon{/g} sent nightmares to my ancestors, which "
"led them to his resting place. They discovered it and ordered us to stand "
"guard so that no foolish mortals would disturb the monster's sleep. If it "
"awakens, no one will survive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 그는 죽은 것이 아니라 마법적인 잠에 싸여 있을 뿐이다. 수천 년 전 {g|Desna}어머니 달{/g}이 내 조상님들에게 "
"악몽을 보내어 그의 안식처로 안내했다. 그분들은 그것을 발견하고 어리석은 인간들이 괴물의 수면을 방해하지 않도록 우리가 수호하라고 "
"명령하셨다. 그것이 깨어나면 아무도 살아남지 못할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "117efa3d-259a-48fa-9401-9dd2f8f509b1"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, and you insist...\"{n} Cephal's voice drips poison{/n} \"... that you "
"do know what you are dealing with, while we don't? You have just admitted, "
"priestess, that your tribe has been loitering here for thousands of years, "
"gradually becoming savage and dying out, simply because some ancient old men "
"had bad dreams after eating a tainted squirrel?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그리고 당신은...\"{n} Cephal의 목소리에 독기가 묻어납니다{/n} \"...당신이 무엇을 상대하고 있는지 안다고 "
"우기는 거요? 여사제여, 당신네 부족이 수천 년 동안 이곳에서 서성이고 있었다는 것을 방금 인정하셨는데, 단지 어떤 고대의 노인들이 "
"오염된 다람쥐를 주워먹고 나쁜 꿈을 꾸었다는 이유만으로 점점 미개해지고 죽어간다는 거요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4c057779-243d-4099-b643-804fa26205c5"
msgid "\"No! We can still come to an agreement.\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 아직 합의점을 찾을 기회가 있을거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0044_Text_String
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "901a1ff9-b490-41f2-b47b-5491cee7b14d"
msgid ""
"\"And why, pray tell, would you and Cephal drag me into an alliance with "
"daemon worshipers, if now we're going to betray them?\""
msgstr "\"말씀해보시오, 우리가 악마 숭배자들을 배신할 속셈이라면 왜 그대와 Cephal이 나를 그들과의 동맹에 끌어들이려 하겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "06289e7a-93da-48c1-85a3-7272b9f72ed8"
msgid ""
"\"In no way do we mean to insult you or your tribe, Aecora. Please, hear the "
"reason in the idea, not the boldness.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 당신이나 당신 부족을 모욕할 생각은 없소, 에코라. 무례함보다는 제안이 합당한지를 생각해 보길 바라오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "2eacbc1d-7fff-437b-8291-f2711b197bd4"
msgid ""
"\"We didn't want it in the first place. Aecora, listen, we can still...\""
msgstr "\"애초에 우린 그것을 원하지 않았소. 이것 보시오, 에코라, 우리는 여전히...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "1703a0bc-cd24-4e31-a845-4b179833d56a"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar casts a grateful look at you. Soft and almost tender.{/n} \"Your "
"support means the world to me.\" {n}He turns back to Aecora.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신을 고맙다는 듯이 바라본다. 섬세하기까지 한 표정이다.{/n} \"자네가 도와주니 세상 든든하군.\" {n}그는 다시 "
"에코라에게로 돌아선다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8897f171-68a6-446d-bea3-1be9a3ae5799"
msgid "\"I... understand.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 알겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4ec38f6b-8513-4232-a5ac-97f5adf15d84"
msgid ""
"\"First you make me strike an alliance with the daemon worshippers, and now "
"you ask me to commit betrayal? I begin to wonder if making you General was a "
"good idea.\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음엔 다이몬 숭배자들과 연합하자는 충격적인 제안을 하더니, 이젠 배신을 논의하나? 이제 자네를 General로 임명한 게 잘한 "
"일인지도 의심되기 시작하는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/CentaurLeader/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "6ad7948c-f2d0-4037-ab5e-33b48344e7cb"
msgid ""
"\"I... understand. Still I was hoping for a different outcome. This is a "
"failure for both of us, General – we each played our parts in it.\""
msgstr "\"난... 이해해네, 그래도 나는 다른 결과를 바랐지. 이것은 우리 모두에게 실패일세, 장군. 우리는 각자 따로 행동했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "d6544038-3287-414b-91ab-21458cb4b08c"
msgid "\"What will we need to get inside the tomb?\""
msgstr "\"무덤 안으로 들어가려면 뭐가 필요할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "f10c2ff1-cbb7-4337-84fb-de1f8d48e8dd"
msgid "\"Isn't it time we figure out our plan and get moving?\""
msgstr "\"이제 작전을 정하고 움직여야 할 때가 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "101339c9-dc32-4ca2-a3fc-54649b6eefa7"
msgid ""
"{n}With grim thoroughness, Maegar wipes his sword and sheathes it.{/n} \"It "
"is done. More needless carnage for a noble cause.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아주 신중하게, 메이가르는 그의 검을 닦고 칼집에 넣습니다.{/n} \"이제 끝났소. 고귀한 대의를 위한, 더 큰 불필요한 희생이군."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "1e3278e7-589f-4c56-a8ca-0dddc6c92da0"
msgid ""
"\"Asmodeus has heard my prayers and put some reason in your head. Just when "
"I was thought you would take those centaurs into your arms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아스모데우스가 내 기도를 듣고 자네를 일깨워준 게지. 자네가 저 켄타우로스들을 자네 품으로 끌어들이려는 줄 알았을 때 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "0cfc5aea-30fd-4d6e-b9cd-37bea9fca700"
msgid ""
"\"Not the result I was counting on, but not bad overall. At least no one "
"will be there to stab us in the back when we go down to the tomb.\""
msgstr "\"기대했던 결과는 아니군, 하지만 나쁘지만도 않네. 최소한 우리가 무덤 아래로 향할 때 뒤를 걱정할 필요는 없겠으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CultistChief
msgctxt "911c8a17-8626-40e0-91f7-37b6c6721ce2"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! The moment has come! Take this key from my hands, noble Cephal. I may "
"be loyal to the Master, but I doubt that my strength and skill are enough to "
"use it properly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마침내! 케팔 경, 이 키를 받으시오. 나는 내 주인님께 충성하지만, 내 힘과 기술이 적절하게 쓰이고 있는지는 항상 고민이었소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "f0977e16-9966-4a99-8e99-6f7bbaa8dfaf"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe we should have made some use of the carnage, and turned our swords "
"against those who deserved it?\" {n}Cephal seethes.{/n} \"Instead of siding "
"with the humble fools who would be easy for us to control, you allied us "
"with a wild horde, ready to leap to savagery over thousand-year-old tales. "
"You had better be ready when your centaurs strike us in the back when we go "
"down into the tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩌면 이 대학살을 좀 이용하고, 우리 칼은 그렇게 될 자들에게 돌렸어야 할지도 모르겠군.\" {n}케팔은 간신히 분노를 참는 듯 "
"보입니다{/n}. \"다루기 쉬운 그 하찮은 바보들과 연합하는 대신, 자네는 천 년 묵은 미개한 이야기에 뛰어들 난폭한 무리와 동맹했어. "
"그 켄타우로스들이 우리가 무덤에 내려갈 동안 우리 뒤통수를 치는 것을 대비하는 게 좋을 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4ab40a4c-ebfc-4ada-8e04-7ece01709150"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have the strength to resist the pressure of my two closest friends "
"and advisors. Not now, when Varnhold is in peril, and we wander like blind "
"pups, seeking an unknown threat in an unknown land. Rejoice, Cephal! You win."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 두 가장 친한 친구이자 조언자들의 압력에 맞설 수는 없군. 지금은 때가 아니지, 반홀드가 위험에 처했는데 우리가 눈 먼 "
"강아지처럼 낯선 땅에서 낯선 위험을 찾아 헤멜 순 없으니. 기뻐하시오, 케팔! 당신이 이겼소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "1265b320-df12-4a59-a965-8d1a84b75af6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have the strength to argue, my friend. I'll just say I'm willing "
"to rely on those who have guarded this land from threats, to the best of "
"their abilities, even if it's just because of 'thousand-year-old tales'. But "
"I don't want to have anything to do with someone who has heard the same "
"tales and still just waited for their chance to grab power and bring people "
"to their knees. I'm glad we got rid of that filth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 이상 따질 힘은 없군, 친구여. 그저 '천년 묵은 이야기' 때문이라 해도, 이 땅을 위협으로부터 최선을 다해 지켜 온 자들을 믿고 "
"싶소. 그러나 똑같은 이야기를 듣고도, 힘으로 사람들을 굴복시킬 기회만 기다리는 자와는 그 무엇도 함께하고 싶지 않소. 그 추잡한 것들을 "
"치울 수 있어 다행이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f22afd62-e39e-4b22-8f82-c83c2912bc88"
msgid ""
"\"If we left it to you, we'd slaughter every potentially dangerous or "
"willful or just plain independent person we came across.\" {n}Varn smiles "
"grimly.{/n} \"I'm tired of arguing. I need you and {name} now more than "
"ever, so let's do what we have to, and leave discussions about ruling the "
"barony for later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 우리가 그걸 당신에게 맡긴다면, 우리는 잠재적인 위협, 의도적인 위협, 심지어 우연히 만난 평범한 사람도 모조리 도살하게 될 "
"것이오.\" {n}반은 우울하게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"말싸움엔 질렸소. 당신과 {name}이(가) 그 어느 때보다도 지금 필요하니, "
"먼저 우리가 해야 할 일을 하고, 남작령을 다스리는 것에 대한 논의는 미루도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "706d31a4-dc87-4540-aa70-91acfc459b14"
msgid ""
"\"You know what I wonder? If the ones who locked this cyclops tyrant in his "
"tomb didn't want him to get back out, then why did they leave the key so "
"close by? I don't think we'll ever know the answer...\""
msgstr ""
"\"있잖나, 이 사이클롭스 폭군을 무덤에 가둔 사람들이 그가 다시 나오는 것을 원하지 않았다면, 왜 그들은 열쇠를 그렇게 가까이 "
"놔뒀을까? 아마 영원히 그 이유는 알 수 없겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "4b3bbc51-da3e-4ba2-8ce4-815cb7593962"
msgid ""
"\"A ritual, if you can call it that. I've worked it out – it's amazingly "
"simple. The staff of our 'village chief' is a key, which fits perfectly in "
"the lock. One only needs to activate it near the tomb gates, and they will "
"open. But not right away. The protective magic will take half a day to "
"clear, which is normal with spells of this kind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의식, 그렇게 부를 수 있다면 말일세. 나는 그 의식이 놀랍도록 단순하다는 것을 알아냈다네. 우리의 '마을 촌장'의 지팡이가 꼭 맞는 "
"열쇠였네. 입구 근처에서 사용하기만 하면 문이 열릴걸세. 다만 당장은 아니라네. 이런 종류의 보호마법은 해제하는데 보통 한 나절은 "
"걸리거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "25378024-57b7-49d5-a277-cebed973726c"
msgid ""
"\"Let me dwell on this a little before the situation becomes irreversible!\" "
"{n}Maegar shakes his head.{/n} \"Just think of it, a village which has for "
"generations worshipped daemons and their ancient treasure, and a centaur "
"tribe standing vigilant guard for hundreds of years. All on this tiny piece "
"of land! And now we have come to uncover these secrets, which have waited "
"for us here a thousand years, and see what is hidden behind the legends.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상황을 돌이킬 수 없게 되기 전에 좀더 깊이 생각해봅시다!\" {n}메이가르가 고개를 가로저었습니다.{/n} \"여기에 집중해봅시다, "
"다이몬과 고대의 보물을 숭배해온 마을과 수백 년간 이곳을 지켜온 켄타우로스 부족. 이 작은 땅에서 말이오! 그리고 이제 우릴 천 년간 "
"기다려온 이 비밀들을 파해치고 전설 뒤에 무엇이 감춰져 있었는지 보게 되었소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "3104f633-5703-4872-9539-d85d64d5915b"
msgid "\"We're done singing someone else's songs, and ready to make our own.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 다른 이들의 노래를 부르는 것을 끝냈고, 우리 자신의 노래를 만들 준비가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "39aaed11-ac0e-4836-a304-996bb91424f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Cephal seems surprisingly nervous.{/n} \"Just to be clear, I must "
"emphasize – I will hold the ritual, but the protective spell will not lift "
"for half a day. We shall need to set guard and wait. And of course, get some "
"much needed rest. Before we venture down into the tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케팔은 놀랄 만큼 긴장한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"분명하게 말하자면, 의식을 치뤄도 보호 주문은 반 나절 동안은 걷히지 않을걸세. "
"그러니 경비를 세우고 기다리는 게 좋을 걸세. 그리고 당연히 휴식도 취해야지. 무덤 속으로 걸어 들어가기 전에 말이네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "4213cde0-648d-4122-9bb3-ec2bf37a0d87"
msgid ""
"\"I feel like the hero of a prophecy. Or a buffoonery. Well, best not waste "
"time!\""
msgstr "\"내가 예언 속의 영웅이라도 된 것 같군. 아니면 광대거나. 뭐, 시간을 낭비하지 않는게 좋겠네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Discussion_after_battle/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "499a663e-b5a9-4ce4-bfd8-4cf533c71182"
msgid ""
"\"I have the staff key. That fool, Zordesh, obviously has no further use for "
"it.\""
msgstr "\"열쇠 지팡이는 내가 가지고 있네. 조데쉬 그 멍청이에게는 더 이상 쓸모 없을테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/EnterDialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b239c4f5-e566-4de8-82dd-2b31a04cc3a0"
msgid ""
"\"Why don't we wait for reinforcements from Varnhold? There's strength in "
"numbers.\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에서 올 지원군을 기다리는게 어떻습니까? 숫자는 많을수록 좋죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/EnterDialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "59810621-4931-436a-bea8-af3ad1ce92c4"
msgid "\"I'm ready. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"난 준비됐어요. 출발하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/EnterDialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "66fd4d52-4f38-4572-96db-c7708cae8a8e"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar stops, looks over the area and turns to the party.{/n} \"Everyone "
"listen carefully. I don't trust our new 'friends' at all, but right now "
"they're our key to understanding what's happening in these lands. We are "
"here for the safety of Varnhold and our citizens. So we help Zordesh and his "
"people, we keep our eyes open, and we show mercy to the centaurs whenever "
"possible.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 걸음을 멈추고 주변을 둘러본 뒤 일행에게 돌아왔습니다.{/n} \"다들 잘 들으시오. 나는 우리의 새로운 '친구들'을 "
"전혀 믿지 않지만, 그들은 지금 이 땅에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 알려줄 유일한 열쇠요. 우리는 반홀드와 시민들의 안전을 위해 여기 "
"왔소. 그러니 조데쉬와 그의 사람들을 도우면서, 방심은 하지 말고, 켄타우로스에게 가능한 한 자비를 배풀어 줍시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/EnterDialogue/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "5908ca2c-d2a8-488a-9032-a70ec4c6f843"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks over the team and sighs.{/n} \"Listen to me, everyone. We've "
"come here for the sake of Varnhold and our future. It's essential that we "
"find out whose tomb this is, and what's going on inside. I dread to think "
"what might happen if we fail. The ground might burn up right under our feet, "
"and dead cyclopes rise from the graves. Maybe the centaurs' grim prophecies "
"have it just about right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 일행을 둘러보고 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"모두들 들어보게. 우리는 반홀드와 우리의 미래를 위해 여기에 왔네. 이 무덤이 "
"누구의 것인지, 안에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지 알아내는게 필수라네. 우리가 실패했을 때 무슨 일이 벌어질지 생각만 해도 두렵군. 땅이 "
"우리 발 아래에서 불타오를 수도 있고 죽은 사이클롭스들이 무덤에서 일어날지도 모르지. 어쩌면 켄타우로스들의 예언이 옳았을지도 모르네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/EnterDialogue/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f5f4ffe2-c096-45b3-b4ad-855d518252a4"
msgid ""
"\"First, because I'm not about ready to leave the city without its guard. "
"And second – unless we act at once, I'm afraid that the daemon worshipers "
"and centaurs will slaughter each other, and there won't be anyone left to "
"help us figure out how to deal with the tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"첫째, 나는 경비를 두지 않고 그 도시를 떠날 준비가 되어있지 않네. 둘째, 우리가 이번에 일을 끝내지 않으면, 다이몬 숭배자들과 "
"켄타우로스들이 서로를 도륙해서 무덤을 어떻게 처리하면 좋을지 도와줄 사람이 아무도 남지 않을까 두렵네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/EnterDialogue/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7f505b27-9463-43e6-935a-e44f6e2b67d8"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't mind talking to their warrior priestess. She might know more "
"than these daemon worshipers. But if they don't want to talk, we won't have "
"any choice but fight our way to the tomb. Any questions?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들의 전사 여사제와 대화하는 것도 마다하지 않겠네. 그녀가 이 다이몬 숭배자들 보다 더 많은 것을 알고 있을지도 모르니까. 하지만 "
"그들이 대화를 거부한다면, 무덤까지 싸우면서 나아갈 수 밖에 없겠지. 질문 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "16f5bab5-0b96-4363-aeb1-a32aca731597"
msgid "\"We're ready.\""
msgstr "\"우린 준비됐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4f235fca-2b84-4a72-b5bb-eb7483e3f107"
msgid "\"Do I have time to look around?\""
msgstr "\"주변을 둘러봐도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "1b0102df-e7c7-43c2-b462-e4863c86cb4e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, Cephal? Has your magic worked? It doesn't look like anything changed."
"\""
msgstr "\"음, 케팔? 마법이 먹힌 건가? 아무것도 변하지 않은 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "b83d334f-1cce-4b20-b2b3-52b151e97486"
msgid "\"Yes. The gates will open in a moment or two. Be ready!\""
msgstr "\"물론. 곧 문이 열릴 걸세. 준비하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : CultistChief
msgctxt "807533c5-227c-4dd7-9e5b-ad8ebed76084"
msgid ""
"\"The faithful have nothing to fear in the Master's citadel! Except, "
"perhaps, a dead cyclops emperor and his servants, who have no wish to cede "
"His gift, though it was never truly theirs to claim.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신도들은 주인님의 성채에서 두려워할 것이 없다! 자기들 것도 아닌 그분의 선물을 독차지하려고 하는 죽은 사이클롭스 황제와 그의 "
"신하들은 아마도 제외해야겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "e2f2d9de-78ae-4ff6-be9c-b3846246f991"
msgid "\"We do, baron. Darkness awaits us.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다, 남작. 어둠이 우리를 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "f1951985-e68c-47d2-baf1-3f3dd5108f06"
msgid ""
"\"... has it really begun? Well, Torag bless you in all your deeds and ways. "
"So long!\""
msgstr "\"... 정말 시작된건가? 음, 토락께서 너의 모든 행동과 길을 축복하리라. 아주 오랫동안!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "98a00967-b30e-421f-b54d-08b814a919b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Kjerdi's last words are drowned out by a dull moan that rises over the "
"area. The doors of the ancient dungeon slowly open, as if a huge creature is "
"opening its maw. The path in front of you lies open.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}셰르디의 마지막 말은 주변을 휩쓰는 둔탁한 신음소리에 잠겨 사라졌습니다. 마치 거대한 생물체가 아가리를 벌리듯이 고대의 문이 천천히 "
"열립니다. 당신 앞에 길이 열렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "876ec019-cf14-4459-b2ee-ec3b4fc11818"
msgid ""
"\"Keep your weapons and spells at the ready. We don't know what awaits us "
"inside.\""
msgstr "\"무기와 주문을 준비해라. 안에서 무엇이 우리를 기다리고 있는지 모르니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "acb726f3-151b-447f-9bc7-4bd7e8486da2"
msgid "{n}Cephal frowns.{/n} \"Yes, but very little. Get on with it.\""
msgstr "{n}케팔이 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그래, 하지만 많이 부족하지. 어서 가세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Enter_Keep/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "4ceea66b-8f0e-4d32-81af-453b1f69bfb8"
msgid "\"Well, everyone ready?\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 모두 준비 됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "219a6e55-d89d-4bdc-b763-b4a587de89ab"
msgid "Wake up!"
msgstr "일어나!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "27957ce8-b9e4-4fc5-a39c-5c4327769cc4"
msgid "Try to wake up."
msgstr "정신 차리도록 애써봐."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ed343b12-9b84-43c4-8162-a8b0dde2b1a5"
msgid "Listen."
msgstr "들어 봐."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "67d40b6a-24cc-4b97-aa1b-011ab4d7e42d"
msgid "Try to push against the lid of the tomb."
msgstr "무덤의 뚜껑을 밀어 봐."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "6723446d-fb87-4647-a00b-1e7ab7d2114e"
msgid ""
"In the blackest hour of night, the General awakes feeling painfully "
"lethargic. The darkness around is so thick that {mf|he|she} can't even see "
"{mf|his|her} hand in front of {mf|his|her} eyes. The world is silent. "
"{mf|He|She} can't even hear the sound of {mf|his|her} companions breathing. "
"Then suddenly, somewhere off to the right... no, it was probably nothing... "
"now – off to the left! And up. And everywhere around...\n"
"Rustling. Rustling. Rustling."
msgstr ""
"한밤 중, 장군은 극심한 무기력감을 느끼며 깨어납니다. 주변의 어둠이 너무 짙어서 눈앞에 있는 {mf|그의|그녀의} 손도 보이지 "
"않습니다. 세상이 고요합니다. {mf|그의|그녀의} 동료들이 숨쉬는 소리조차 들리지 않습니다. 그런데 갑자기 오른쪽 어딘가에서 "
"소리가... 아니, 아무것도 아니겠죠... 이제 왼쪽에서 들립니다! 그리고 위에서. 그리고 주변 모든 곳에서...\n"
"바스락. 바스락. 바스락."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "7fd8750d-1e1d-4ffe-ac1a-c753e175ede7"
msgid ""
"\"Magic,\" {mf|he|she} realizes.\n"
"This is a magical nightmare, imbued with Abaddon's magic. {mf|He|She} need "
"only wake up, and all this will end!"
msgstr ""
"\"마법,\" {mf|그|그녀}가 깨닫습니다.\n"
"이것은 나락의 마법으로 가득한 마법적인 악몽입니다. {mf|그|그녀}가 잠에서 깨어나기만 하면, 모든게 끝날 겁니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "d365b4b7-d429-4991-8da3-69b24b8e53ae"
msgid ""
"Nearly mad from the pain, the General summons enough sense to realize that "
"everything that's happening is just a dream. {mf|He|She} need only wake up. "
"And everything would stop. {mf|He|She} need only..."
msgstr ""
"고통으로 거의 미칠 뻔 했던 장군은, 지금 일어나고 있는 모든 일이 그저 꿈일 뿐이라는 사실을 깨닫기에 충분한 감각을 일깨웁니다. "
"{mf|그|그녀}가 깨어나기만 하면 됩니다. 그럼 모든 것이 멈출겁니다. {mf|그|그녀}가 깨어나기만 하면..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e2443c65-9d34-4859-9727-63c3f5bb475b"
msgid ""
"The General's fingers touch the cold stone. {mf|He|She} tries to get up but "
"cannot: the ceiling is quite low. It, too, is cold stone, like the floor, "
"and the walls that {mf|he|she} can feel to {mf|his|her} left and right, each "
"wall at only an arm's length.\n"
"Rustling. Rustling and realization. {mf|He|She} is in a stone tomb, and the "
"darkness around is not the night. It's the black darkness of the grave."
msgstr ""
"장군의 손가락이 차가운 돌에 닿았습니다. {mf|그|그녀}가 일어나려고 하지만 실패합니다: 천장이 너무 낮습니다. 사방이 바닥과 같은 "
"차가운 돌이고 {mf|그의|그녀의} 양쪽에서 느껴지는 벽 사이는 겨우 팔 하나 뻗을 만큼의 공간만 있습니다.\n"
"바스락바스락. 바스락거리는 소리와 깨달음. {mf|그|그녀}는 돌로 된 무덤 속에 있습니다. 주변의 어둠은 밤의 어둠이 아니었습니다. "
"바로 묘지 속의 어둠이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "88639e9a-ceb9-46fb-9d3a-09a77c4366a0"
msgid ""
"The sound is coming from all directions at once. Soft, disgusting, "
"maddening. It evoked a legion of grave worms, wriggling on the stone."
msgstr ""
"사방에서 소리가 한번에 들려옵니다. 부드럽고, 역겹고, 미칠듯한. 그 소리는 돌 위에서 꿈틀대는 무덤 벌레 떼를 떠올리게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Nightmare_at_gatesBE/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ecf45946-315b-4192-a8d4-52d0a7ce0b48"
msgid ""
"The General gathers {mf|him|her}self to push against the lid of {mf|his|her} "
"box, but cannot control {mf|his|her} arms. {mf|His|Her} hands reach "
"uncontrollably for {mf|his|her} eyes. First, touching with a strange "
"inquisitive interest. Pressing slightly. Pressing more... Then the nails...\n"
"The General hears {mf|himself|herself} scream."
msgstr ""
"장군은 뚜껑을 열기 위해 팔을 모으지만, 팔이 말을 듣지 않습니다. {mf|그의|그녀의} 손이 멋대로 {mf|그의|그녀의} 눈으로 "
"올라갑니다. 처음엔 낯선 것을 탐색하듯이 눈을 만집니다. 그리곤 살짝 누릅니다. 좀더 깊이 누르기 시작합니다... 그러자 손톱이...\n"
"장군의 비명이 귓가를 때립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7b8dd7e8-89db-454e-9752-0303c24232b9"
msgid "\"Just a bad dream. Don't worry.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 악몽일 뿐입니다. 걱정하지 마시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "11af0157-f662-4ad2-bfa2-6e51dd971337"
msgid "\"This could be a magic-induced nightmare. That's bad.\""
msgstr "\"이건 마법으로 인한 악몽일 수도 있어요. 좋지 않네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "afb7fdf6-8355-4a26-a711-088a487d490d"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not going to try to make you change your mind. If you've decided to "
"end things, then so be it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신의 마음을 바꾸려고 하진 않을 겁니다. 당신이 일을 끝내기로 결정했다면 그렇게 하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "3986adc1-0540-42d9-84be-ccc4c673ee66"
msgid ""
"\"Everything I do, I do for you and for Varnhold. We may have different "
"methods, but don't accuse me of neglecting the interests of the barony."
msgstr ""
"\"내가 하는 모든 일은 당신과 반홀드를 위한 일이예요. 다른 방법도 있을지 모르지만 남작령의 이득을 등한시한다고 뭐라하진 마시죠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8c6a6066-7346-4267-954a-ce9095c81bf2"
msgid ""
"\"'A little' disappointed? That's not the confession of love that I expected!"
"\""
msgstr "\" '조금' 실망한다고요? 이걸 지금 고백이랍시고 하는건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "d9f90bc0-042e-4713-8025-59342d811947"
msgid "\"I don't need anyone except you.\""
msgstr "\"당신 말고는 아무도 필요 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "4f989c4c-9d66-44ea-96fd-e2ca751e99b3"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, but I don't think this is going to work out. And I better say "
"it now.\""
msgstr "\"미안해요, 하지만 일이 잘 풀리지 않을 것 같아요. 지금 말해둬야 할 것 같네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "07c1b83e-d126-4ef5-8c32-eee996f7aed6"
msgid "\"Very well. You are forgiven.\""
msgstr "\"좋아요. 용서할게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5187aee9-8027-45f7-a5e9-12f03f4b2f37"
msgid ""
"\"Never do that again. To be honest, I have no interest in continuing our "
"relationship at all.\""
msgstr "\"다시는 그러지 마세요. 솔직히 말해서 저는 딱히 우리 관계를 지속하거나 하고 싶지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "852866f3-d4a3-4f7a-90a7-9201a717b30f"
msgid ""
"{n}You slowly awaken from a dream, feeling a rough hand carefully shaking "
"your shoulder, and another touching your forehead. Opening your eyes with "
"difficulty, you see an alarmed Maegar leaning over you. He also looks as if "
"he barely slept all night.{/n} \"{name}! Are you all right? You screamed in "
"your sleep, I was afraid I wouldn't be able to wake you. Nightmares, huh?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 거친 손이 조심스럽게 어깨를 흔들고 다른 손이 이마를 만지는 것을 느끼며 천천히 깨어납니다. 어렵게 눈을 뜨니 경각심을 품은 "
"메이가르가 몸을 기대고 있는 것이 보입니다. 그는 또한 밤새 거의 잠을 자지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"{name}! 괜찮아? 네가 "
"잠결에 비명을 질렀는데, 내가 깨우지 못할까봐 걱정되더군. 악몽이지, 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "28c42af7-df08-4cf9-b8ab-1078f0adf160"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar grows grim.{/n} \"I too had dark dreams. And my eyes ached when I "
"awoke, as if scavengers tried to peck them out while I slept. What have we "
"gotten ourselves into?! Let's hope we'll go down into that tomb today and "
"finally get some answers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르의 얼굴이 암울해집니다.{/n} \"나도 어두운 꿈을 꿨어. 그리고 잠에서 깨니까, 내가 잠든 동안 까마귀가 내 눈을 "
"쪼아먹으려 애라도 쓴 것처럼 눈이 아프더군. 우리가 스스로에게 무슨 짓을 한거지?! 오늘이야말로 그 무덤에서 해답을 얻길 바라자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "df50bc24-7999-44ba-8c2b-e84c51d08e5a"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, since we have a moment, I'd like to talk. This might not be the "
"best time, but who knows what awaits us in the dungeon... And I don't like "
"to leave things unfinished. It's amazing how little time has passed since "
"our peaceful walk in Varnhold – and how much has changed! For the worse, and "
"not only for this miserable land.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든, 시간이 좀 있으니 얘기를 나누고 싶군. 지금이 가장 좋은 때는 아니겠만, 저 던전 안에서 무엇이 기다리고 있을지 누가 "
"알겠어... 그리고 나는 일을 마무리 짓지 않고 떠나는걸 좋아하지 않지. 우리가 반홀드에서 평화롭게 산책이나 하고 있었던 때가 바로 얼마 "
"전이라는게, 그리고 그 사이에 얼마나 많은게 변했는지 정말 놀라워! 더 나쁜 건, 이 비참한 땅만 나빴던 게 아니었다는거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "c3e7ee66-1fa7-48d1-b2de-dcf7e3b7848b"
msgid ""
"{n}He sighs, then shakes off his gloomy expression.{/n} \"We haven't really "
"talked since that walk through Varnhold. I can't believe it happened so "
"recently. That was before daily life was filled with Charon's cultists and "
"centaurs, evil legends and ancient threats.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 한숨을 내쉬고 나서 우울한 표정을 털어냅니다.{/n} \"우리가 반홀드를 거닐던 이후 거의 이야기를 나누지 않았지. 얼마전에 "
"그런 일이 있었다니 믿을 수가 없어. 우리 일상이 케런의 사교도들이나 켄타우로스, 사악한 전설과 고대의 위협으로 가득 차기 전의 일이었지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9087dbb9-8e4b-4279-adb8-2029a71e8c44"
msgid ""
"\"Meanwhile you've had several chances to show how you handle yourself in "
"dangerous situations, when Varnhold's fate is on the line. And I didn't like "
"what I saw. The truth is, this hasn't changed how I feel about you. But as a "
"ruler, I have no right to choose a wife based only on what my heart desires. "
"And I respect you too much to invite you to be my mistress. This is why... "
"forgive me. I'm sorry I started that conversation in Varnhold, and that it "
"turned out the way it did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한편으로 네겐 위험한 상황에 스스로를 어떻게 처신하는지 보여줄 기회가 몇 번 있었지, 반홀드의 운명이 위태로울 때 말이야. 그리고 난 "
"그것이 별로 탐탁치 않았어 . 사실, 내가 너에 대해 어떻게 느끼는지는 전혀 변하지 않았어. 그러나 통치자로서 나는 내 마음이 원하는 "
"것만 가지고 아내를 선택할 권리가 없지. 그리고 나는 너를 크게 존중하고 싶으니 정부의 자리도 권하지 않을 거야. 그래서... 날 "
"용서해줘. 반홀드에서 그 얘기를 시작하게 되어 유감이고, 결국 그렇게 되어버린 것도 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "abb103e7-404f-4888-b363-0bd5855ee9c8"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar stares at you for a long time, then sighs.{/n} \"Cephal has talked "
"his head off, beating it into me that I must learn to listen to dissenting "
"opinions. And he might be right. I'm a fool, a boy, and a terrible baron, "
"but at the same time, I'm a man who's almost let happiness slip away.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 한참 동안 당신을 노려보다가 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"케팔은 자기 머리를 쥐어짜면서 내가 반대 의견을 듣는 법을 "
"배워야 한다고 나를 구박하고는 했지. 그리고 그가 맞을지도 몰라. 난 바보에, 철없고, 끔찍한 남작에, 동시에 행복을 거의 놓쳐버린 "
"사람이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "071149ed-78e1-40cd-939e-0d43824b1d55"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar shakes his head bitterly.{/n} \"I don't question your intentions. "
"But our views on ruling are too different for this to lead to anything but "
"quarrels. I don't want to resent you as Varnhold's problems only get worse. "
"So let's go. Let's join together and face this evil – for old times' sake!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 씁쓸하게 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"나는 네 의도를 의심하지 않아. 하지만 결단에 대한 우리의 관점은 너무 달라서 싸울 "
"거리조차 되지 않지. 반홀드의 문제들이 점점 심해지고 있으니 널 원망하지 않아. 그러니 어서 가자. 함께 힘을 합쳐서 이 사악을 상대하자 "
"– 옛정을 생각해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6e8f8be4-4243-4b50-8661-01952623dad9"
msgid ""
"\"Good.\" {n}Maegar nods, heavily and seriously.{/n} \"Now let's go, "
"General. There's no one but us who will save this land.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아.\" {n}메이가르는 묵직하고 진지하게 고개를 끄덕인다.{/n} \"이제 가지, 장군. 이 땅을 구할 사람은 우리 말고는 아무도 "
"없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "12f55d96-49ed-44a6-a1e5-b3d45b532429"
msgid ""
"{n}He takes you by the hand.{/n} \"Let's go, {name}. We'll have time for all "
"this – after we save everyone and destroy the ancient evil that lurks in the "
"dungeon!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 당신의 손을 잡습니다.{/n} \"가자, {name}. 모두를 구하고 지하감옥에 숨어있는 고대의 악을 부숴버리고 나면, "
"우리에게 필요한 시간을 가질 수 있을 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "bf6630c7-da50-4a66-8c86-2ac97fffc58d"
msgid ""
"\"I know it's not the best moment, but we might never get another one! How "
"do you feel about me now, {name}? About us, I mean. Because you see, if I "
"build up this fantasy about gentle nights and blissful embraces, and go off "
"to fight some unknown evil in a dark dungeon? And then, what if we win, and "
"it turns out that none of it is true? In that case I'd be a little "
"disappointed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금의 최적의 때가 아니란 건 알지만, 다시는 이럴 시간이 안 올지도 몰라! {name}, 넌 지금 날 어떻게 생각하지? 우리에 "
"대해서, 그러니까. 왜냐하면, 만약 내가 부드러운 밤과 행복한 포옹에 대한 환상을 품은 채로 어두운 던전에서 미지의 악과 싸우러 간다면? "
"그러고 나서 어떻게 이기고, 그제야 그게 다 환상일 뿐이라는 걸 알아버리면? 그렇게 되면 내가 좀 실망할 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "9ccce413-2ddd-4711-8777-3aa5b365cca2"
msgid ""
"\"How about this, then?\" {n}Maegar leans to you and kisses passionately, as "
"he caresses your cheek with his rough warrior's hand.{/n} \"I've always been "
"better with actions than words.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 이건 어떨까?\" {n} 메이가르는 거친 전사의 손으로 당신의 뺨을 어루만지며 당신에게 기대 열정적으로 키스합니다.{/n} "
"\"항상 말보다 행동이 낫더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "e18365d6-a2a5-42b5-af06-78944fd41665"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar's face turns to stone for a moment, but he gathers himself and "
"speaks calmly.{/n} \"As you wish. Well, it's time we see to our "
"responsibilities, isn't it General? Uncovering ancient secrets, you know – "
"and saving our peaceful lands from the forces of evil.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르의 얼굴이 잠깐 굳지만, 곧 추스르고 태연하게 말합니다.{/n} \"원하는 대로. 이제 우리 책무를 마주할 때가 됐군, 안 "
"그래? 고대의 비밀을 밝혀내고, 우리의 평화로운 땅을 악의 세력으로부터 구해내는 것 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/RomanceAfterNightmare/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "0a720728-9ecf-4f7d-a6e6-c3d595f098de"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful words to begin a heroic journey into darkness!\" {n}Maegar "
"smiles, and then leans towards you and plants a swift but passionate kiss on "
"your lips.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어둠 속으로 뛰어드는 서사시를 위한 멋진 말들!\" {n}메이가르는 미소를 짓고는, 당신 쪽으로 몸을 기울이며 빠르지만 열정적인 "
"키스를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "df63698d-ed86-4287-8914-3cbd2dcd25c6"
msgid ""
"\"What were you saying about the city? What do you mean 'it's stuffy'?\""
msgstr "\"도시에 대해 뭐라고 했어? 답답하다\"니 무슨 말이야? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b1c69954-edfc-4698-8323-ec6c228d70ca"
msgid "\"What is Willas Gunderson doing?\""
msgstr "\"윌라스 건더슨은 뭘 하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "51d21b9e-0ce1-4148-8e92-db467f3acdb2"
msgid "\"Show me the supplies, Kjerdi.\""
msgstr "\"물건을 보여줘, 셰르디.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "43d737f2-4d29-401c-a7f6-4346b6d8bd33"
msgid "\"Have any of the men come with you? We'll need help in the dungeon.\""
msgstr "\"데려온 사람 좀 있어? 무덤에서 도움이 필요할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "271c3086-9f26-4198-8d74-000ae07fc8dd"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "9995b37b-752a-4839-a3b7-e18f9a469055"
msgid ""
"\"Good afternoon, Baron! Sir Cephal summoned me with a sending spell "
"yesterday. – I suppose right at the moment you were setting camp. He asked "
"that reinforcements and supplies be brought from Varnhold. I came as fast as "
"I could.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, 남작님! 케팔 경이 어제 절 부르더군요. - 캠프를 차리고 있던 바로 그 때였던가. 그가 반홀드에서 증원군과 보급품을 "
"가져오라고 했어요. 될 수 있는 대로 빨리 왔죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "10e26e95-9c5b-404a-8f04-3b86b143438d"
msgid "\"Hello again. Are you on business or just want to chat?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, 한 번 더요. 용무가 있으신 겁니까, 아니면 그냥 수다 떨고 싶은 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "329160ef-c53f-498d-9201-66a35e6ea4a6"
msgid ""
"\"If I could explain better, I would. It's bad there, like something is "
"going to happen. I talk to the people – many are having nightmares, always "
"the same. Always about tearing their own eyes out. Fun, isn't it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 더 잘 설명할 수 있었으면, 그렇게 했겠죠. 그 곳은 마치 무슨 일이 터질 것 같습디다. 전 사람들한테 말했어요.— 많은 "
"사람들이 자신들 스스로 자기의 눈을 찢어내는 악몽을 계속 꾼다고. 웃기지, 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "511a88ea-144b-4eb2-a4af-33ca7621d56c"
msgid ""
"\"He's hanging about at the tavern, writing and writing for days on end. "
"He's been stranger than usual lately. Pale as a ghost, dark circles under "
"his eyes, like he hasn't slept for a few nights.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 며칠동안 글을 쓰고 또 쓰면서, 선술집에 아주 살다시피 했죠. 요즘에 그는 유난히 낮설더군요. 귀신처럼 창백하고, 눈 밑에 "
"다크서클이 가득해서, 며칠 밤 동안 잠도 못 잔 것더라구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "e5633708-437d-4ddf-8a64-b4b0e62fbd10"
msgid ""
"\"Go. And speed the Baron's steps. Let him be finished with this backwater "
"quickly and get home.\""
msgstr "\"가십쇼. 그리고 남작의 걸음을 재촉해주세요. 부디 그가 빨리 이 후미진 동네의 일을 끝내고 집으로 돌아오게 해주시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "24570b02-fe8f-463e-976c-d68c990d7822"
msgid ""
"\"Cephal, keen foresight as ever. Good job! Kjerdi, report on the situation "
"in Varnhold.\""
msgstr "\"케팔, 언제나처럼 날카로운 예지력이군. 훌륭하오! 셰르디, 그 상황은 반홀드에서 보고해주게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "493bc781-e09a-4249-92ab-273dfd7cd909"
msgid ""
"\"Everything seems calm, Baron. The Host are standing guard. No one is "
"making any trouble. No sign of cyclopes. Only it's... stuffy, you know. I "
"wish I could explain it better. Like a storm is building over the city. You "
"should return. They need you there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것이 안정되어 보입니다, 남작님. 호스트는 계속 경계중입니다. 문제되는 인원은 없고요. 사이클롭스에 대한 징조도 없습니다. 단지…"
"답답합네요. 제가 더 잘 설명할 수 있으면 좋겠는데. 도시 위에 폭풍이 생기고 있는 느낌이네요. 영주님은 돌아오셔야 돼요. 영지민들이 "
"영주님을 필요로 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a79dbcbf-261e-494f-836a-236985640640"
msgid ""
"\"We are here with the express aim of protecting the city. It's all right, "
"Kjerdi. Wait for us here. {name} and Cephal will go check the supplies "
"you've brought. We might need something for the expedition into the tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 도시를 지키려는 급박한 목표를 가지고 이곳에 왔다. 괜찮아, 셰르디. 여기서 우리를 기다려라. {name}과(와) 케팔은 네가 "
"가져온 보급품을 확인하러 갈 것이다. 무덤으로 들어가는 원정에 뭔가 필요할지도 모르니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/Verda_at_gates/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Verda2
msgctxt "49aefa99-ef9f-4657-937d-2b901160ab44"
msgid "\"Maybe he's pining for someone?\" {n}Kjerdi winks.{/n}"
msgstr "\"누군가를 그리워하는 건 아닐까?\" {n}셰르디가 윙크를 한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cent_barks/Cent_friend1_String
msgctxt "0e762b00-9b91-4d89-b13f-ff13a3bba5ee"
msgid ""
"\"It was time to end the carnage between us and the two-legged. I am glad to "
"see this day.\""
msgstr "\"우리와 두 다리로 걷는 자들 사이의 살육을 끝낼 시간이 됐다. 이런 날을 맞아서 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cent_barks/Cent_friend2_String
msgctxt "d8db9d8e-34d1-4987-8a8e-ca65e4dedbbc"
msgid "\"The Nomen tribe is with you, people of Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 시민이여, 노멘 부족이 그대와 함께한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cent_barks/Cent_friend3_String
msgctxt "295a90cb-4112-4e53-b3bc-f836daa44067"
msgid ""
"\"We have stood guard here for thousands of years. In such times as these, "
"we must become not only guardians, but fighters.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 이곳을 수천년 간 지켜 왔습니다. 이러한 시대에 우리는 단순히 수호자가 될 뿐 아니라 전사가 되어야 했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cent_door_String
msgctxt "a5bf1d85-1815-4222-90ea-45f69e03d4a7"
msgid ""
"\"We will remain here on guard for as long as the magic of the key holds. "
"Rest now. The way will open soon.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 마법의 열쇠가 유지되는 한 이곳을 지킬 것입니다. 휴식을 취하십시오. 곧 길이 열릴 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cephal_open_String
msgctxt "b906acad-b089-4cf4-86c5-07f44fd61ee8"
msgid ""
"\"This spell is so unusual... Not like daemon force at all, or a very "
"ancient one. Well, get out of my way, you silly door!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 주문은 매우 특이하군... 데몬의 힘이나 아주 오래된 힘과는 전혀 다르네. 뭐, 내 앞에서 사라져라, 바보 같은 문짝 같으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cult_barks/Cult_friend1_String
msgctxt "78d2459e-7554-4cd8-9252-f81a29e99963"
msgid "\"Master, watch over us!\""
msgstr "\"주인이시여, 우리를 지켜보소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cult_barks/Cult_friend2_String
msgctxt "0b49f124-b10c-409e-b6c8-69a8fe14b9ef"
msgid ""
"\"Will we really be the first to enter the tomb after thousands of years?\""
msgstr "\"정말 우리가 수천 년 만에 무덤에 들어간 첫 번째 사람이 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cult_barks/Cult_friend3_String
msgctxt "77b61776-ca11-4548-922e-231b787c6fe1"
msgid ""
"\"Centaur blood is our offering for our master, Charon. He is the Horseman "
"of Death, and death is what we bring!\""
msgstr "\"켄타우로스의 피는 우리의 주인, 케런을 위한 공물이다. 케런은 죽음의 기수이며, 우리는 죽음을 몰고 다니니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Cult_door_String
msgctxt "f08aa379-d923-4826-88fb-44876179e63d"
msgid ""
"\"Soon, very soon... Will I really be the one to see... to go to the end?\""
msgstr "\"곧, 아주 조금 뒤에...... 정말 내가... 끝까지 간 사람이 될 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Varn_nightmare_String
msgctxt "f2fa6ae3-6343-4a62-b16d-250a785ffb93"
msgid ""
"\"What a disgusting night... I can't remember the last time I had such "
"terrible nightmares!\""
msgstr "\"정말 역겨운 밤이군... 마지막으로 그런 끔찍한 악몽을 꾼 게 언제였는지 기억이 안 나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CentaurVillage/barks/Verda_hello_String
msgctxt "6b1ff42f-888b-43a9-a3a3-c86bbdb9bddd"
msgid "\"General, looks like you didn't get much sleep.\""
msgstr "\"장군님, 잠을 제대로 못 잔 것처럼 보입니다만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_1_String
msgctxt "30d70e74-21ee-43ed-bdc0-a3014b2571d4"
msgid "\"You've gone clean mad over your faith!\""
msgstr "\"신앙 때문에 완전히 미쳐 버렸군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_2_String
msgctxt "ad14c9de-2ec6-4e2a-966f-df57f3964f8a"
msgid "\"Do we need a master who will bring the undead upon us?\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 언데드를 데려오는 주인이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_3_String
msgctxt "6e9f5691-eaaf-4f89-8000-b2cd688df5f2"
msgid "\"We'll find us a better god!\""
msgstr "\"우린 더 나은 신을 찾을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_4_String
msgctxt "4d5383b8-75cd-46cf-9136-09bdc6da53f1"
msgid ""
"\"So what if our grandfathers believed in it? We can make up our own minds!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 우리 조부들이 믿었으면 뭐? 우린 스스로 결정할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_5_String
msgctxt "8ec74cb8-aac5-4b8f-8688-d643a71d1d00"
msgid "\"We need to think about our family, not about gods!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 신이 아니라 우리 가족을 생각해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_Idle_1_String_1
msgctxt "eea1de3e-a09f-4c13-9236-dc40896210cd"
msgid "\"Such carnage... And for what?!\""
msgstr "\"그런 대학살... 뭘 위해서?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_Idle_2_String_1
msgctxt "7735d807-872a-42bc-a372-e002fd509c67"
msgid "\"Barely survived...\""
msgstr "\"간신히 살아남았어....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Apostate_Idle_3_String_1
msgctxt "b9c09456-1d59-476b-a939-8cafa4e9e080"
msgid "\"Fanatics... May this insane cult be cursed!\""
msgstr "\"광신도들... 이 미친 사이비 종교가 저주 받기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_1_String
msgctxt "e4f701f3-5aa4-421f-8091-1be08abec79e"
msgid "\"This is the faith of our fathers and grandfathers!\""
msgstr "\"이것이 우리 아버지와 조부의 믿음이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_2_String
msgctxt "0b0752f5-056c-4246-bac8-1177f71c3857"
msgid "\"Blasphemers! How could you say that?!\""
msgstr "\"모독자! 어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_3_String
msgctxt "8efd3525-cc6b-416a-93ad-911b3f0122e9"
msgid "\"Our Master will punish you!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 주인께서 너를 벌하리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_4_String
msgctxt "c023f8e8-4f69-4b40-8e1a-cae206fd3542"
msgid "\"Repent, or else!\""
msgstr "\"회개하라 아니하면 파멸할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_5_String
msgctxt "c21e1924-af5b-48a4-b381-e5b774e40829"
msgid "\"We will not let you trample the shrine!\""
msgstr "\"우린 네가 사당을 짓밟게 두지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_Idle_1_String_1
msgctxt "291d726c-f2ca-49ac-b408-4dc8699f107f"
msgid ""
"\"We've chastised the apostates. This will be the fate of any blasphemer!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 변절자들을 채찍질했다. 이후의 어떤 모독도 똑같이 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_Idle_2_String_1
msgctxt "09f479fb-48bc-4bc2-ba3c-46f9b205ab28"
msgid "\"Our Master is pleased with us!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 주인께서 우리에게 만족하고 계신다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Faithful_Idle_3_String_1
msgctxt "ae229612-057d-42e2-a2a5-ccf6e18ea14d"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe those dirty blasphemers pretended to be our brothers!\""
msgstr "\"저 더러운 신성모독자들이 우리 형제인 척하다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Guard_1_String
msgctxt "b168a786-e95e-4ea2-b394-91ef69def9a9"
msgid "\"Who are you? You can't be here!\""
msgstr "\"누구냐? 여긴 오면 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Guard_2_String
msgctxt "5a56b6d8-2a11-4f9d-8f5c-3b16d2344b9c"
msgid ""
"\"Where are you going? That's a shrine! We don't let just anyone in there!\""
msgstr "\"어디로 가나? 저건 사당이야! 우리는 그 안에 아무나 들이지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/NamedCyclops_name_String
msgctxt "4d0f77bc-e30d-4e33-b0e8-4b8d26241292"
msgid "Bloodthirsty Zombie Cyclops Priest"
msgstr "피에 굶주린 좀비 사이클롭스 프리스트"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_cyclops_house_1_String_1
msgctxt "78773127-29d0-4d71-8356-5098223c6e52"
msgid "\"It's breaking the roof!\""
msgstr "\"지붕이 무너진다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_cyclops_house_2_String_1
msgctxt "ccb05467-a892-4a4f-b3ed-646b3b9d7669"
msgid "\"Cover your heads!\""
msgstr "\"머리를 보호해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_cyclops_house_3_String_1
msgctxt "c3d8db55-bd4e-4803-872c-6f44df2504b8"
msgid "\"There's monsters everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"사방이 괴물이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_cyclops_house_4_String_1
msgctxt "01524abf-6e78-4580-8196-1deac7be2309"
msgid "\"Run for your life! Run for your life!\""
msgstr "\"살고 싶으면 도망쳐! 죽기 싫으면 달려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_infighting_1_String_1
msgctxt "4957a8b7-c0c0-4281-9c63-ae633966cc11"
msgid "\"Traitors! How could you forsake your god?!\""
msgstr "\"배신자! 어떻게 너의 신을 저버릴 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_infighting_2_String_1
msgctxt "c98b8b6c-add1-4e0b-a932-080979632086"
msgid "\"What are you doing?! We're neighbors! We don't need to fight!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 짓이야?! 우린 이웃이라고! 싸울 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Barks/Scene_infighting_3_String_1
msgctxt "ffa64ca6-f262-4bdf-a193-1de57d4e9516"
msgid "\"You are apostates! Blasphemers! Return to the true faith or die!\""
msgstr "\"넌 변절자다! 배교자! 신앙을 찾거나, 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b35178d1-eb72-44cc-b856-237709a1935c"
msgid "\"Ready! We're attacking the ones wearing black, right?\""
msgstr "\"준비! 검은 옷 입은 놈들을 치는 거 맞죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "186a394a-9434-4f8c-b449-05b1eb88cc59"
msgid ""
"\"You ask for my opinion, but refuse to listen to it. Do what you want.\""
msgstr "\"제 의견을 묻지만 듣진 않는군요. 뜻대로 하시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "c2d6bd38-777e-46bc-a151-a5d8a7efd321"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, please, don't be rash. This is your barony, and your "
"responsibility. That means you can't afford to solve conflicts without a "
"second thought, or rush into fights without first weighing the odds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"메이가르, 부탁이니 서두르지 마세요. 여긴 당신 영지고, 당신 책임 하에 있어요. 신중히 생각해서 갈등을 해결해야 하고, 승산도 "
"따져보지 않고 전장에 뛰어들면 안 된다는 뜻이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "20ae5def-4b1c-41cb-8992-30ffebfe5095"
msgid "\"Why should we trust a daemon worshiper?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 다이몬 숭배자들을 왜 믿어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "053d4903-6dfa-4834-84ac-1e9f4e5840ea"
msgid ""
"\"Cvetislava, are you prepared to renounce your ancestors' faith so easily?\""
msgstr "\"크베티슬라바, 당신 조상의 신앙을 그렇게 쉽게 저버려도 괜찮은 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "809c8f2c-5b34-47cc-afcb-aa33d4bbc5b2"
msgid ""
"\"I agree with Maegar. Let's slaughter the cultists and leave the apostates "
"be.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르의 말에 동의해요. 사교도는 다 죽이고 변절자들은 그대로 두죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "9e59f0e7-2be6-453f-a28a-02be01b69134"
msgid ""
"\"I agree with Cephal. Let's quash the uprising and gain the allegiance of "
"their headman.\""
msgstr "\"케팔의 말이 맞아요. 반동을 제압하고 우두머리들의 충성을 얻죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "41809bcd-4cf5-4411-b2e6-be84b267d641"
msgid ""
"\"Cultists, liars, rebels... You can't believe anyone in this rotten "
"village. Let's slaughter the lot of them!\""
msgstr "\"사교도, 거짓말쟁이, 반동... 이 썩은 마을엔 믿을 놈이 하나 없군. 그냥 다 죽여요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "87826d73-ee2c-4772-b520-d08ad0237982"
msgid ""
"\"Where did they get the black robes? Did they make them? Under direction by "
"the cyclopes? Something seems wrong here.\""
msgstr "\"저 검은 옷들은 어디서 난 걸까요? 그들이 만들었나? 사이클롭스 무덤에서 난 건가? 여긴 뭔가 잘못됐어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "afd53430-58d2-4257-b04c-0123d07c54d9"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, why should we interfere? We came to battle cyclopes. The "
"infighting of villagers is none of our concern.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 우리가 왜 참견해야 하죠? 우린 사이클롭스와 싸우러 왔어요. 마을의 내분은 우리 관심사가 아니예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "88adc396-efda-4319-81ac-b3b71ea7b9ee"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar, I know you don't want to, but we'd best clear the whole village, "
"just in case. Who knows – maybe all of them are controlled by cyclopes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"메이가르, 그러기 싫은 건 알지만, 이 마을째로 치워버리는 게 좋겠어요. 어쩌면 저들 전부 사이클롭스 손에 놀아나고 있을지도 "
"모르잖아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "35c36376-520c-46d4-92ae-fb56edc2efa6"
msgid "\"Daemon worshipers? Disgusting! Maegar, order them all killed!\""
msgstr "\"악마 숭배자들? 역겹군! 메이가르, 말살 명령을 내려주시죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "0b7a093b-32eb-433e-b4d1-b87b29e95d17"
msgid ""
"\"I knew there was something wrong with this village. Let's kill the whole "
"lot of them – robes or not!\""
msgstr "\"이 동네가 뭔가 잘못돼 있을 줄 알았지. 저것들 전부 치워버리죠 - 로브를 입었든 말든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "eec1c55c-a35a-4fb0-bf4e-aad4a1045186"
msgid ""
"\"Why were you afraid that Maegar would punish everyone? You're not all "
"cultists here, are you?\""
msgstr "\"메이가르가 모두를 벌할 거라고 왜 걱정한 거지? 너희 전부가 사교도는 아닐 텐데, 안 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "4be0c73b-d471-4665-a885-82c12c837ae5"
msgid ""
"\"If they pay their taxes and don't riot, what do we care who they pray to?\""
msgstr "\"저들이 세금 제대로 내고 폭동만 안 일으키면, 저들이 누굴 섬기든 알 바 아니지 않나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "247efb6d-800e-44f2-bf46-b471dfc29d85"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[침묵한다.]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "efa2f73f-91df-4fa3-b790-a5d29611d0cd"
msgid "\"This looks like a cult gathering, nothing more.\""
msgstr "\"사교도 모임처럼 보이는데, 딱 그 정도 같아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Answer_0107_Text
msgctxt "5d07f7cd-acf2-4f5c-8468-e0886a70340f"
msgid ""
"\"This so-called conflict is beneath our attention. Why should we trouble "
"ourselves with the peasants' petty squabbles?\""
msgstr "\"이 갈등이란 건 우리가 관심가질 가치가 없어요. 우리가 왜 농부들 말다툼에 골머리를 앓아야 하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "0b136ad2-7544-45f7-badf-e98f8c9ab09d"
msgid ""
"{n}The village square is noisy and filled with people. A group of villagers "
"in black robes, lead by an old tiefling, is advancing on a group of others "
"wearing simple peasant clothes. Both groups are armed – and it looks like "
"they're about to put their weapons to use!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n} 마을의 광장은 군중들로 가득찼고 소란스럽습니다. 늙은 티플링이 이끄는 검은 로브를 입은 한 무리의 주민들이 평범한 농부 복장을 한 "
"다른 무리에게 다가갑니다. 양쪽 모두 무기를 들고 있었고, 서로를 향해 무기를 사용할 것처럼 보입니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "576078dd-827d-45fb-9462-245ca3aa8d40"
msgid ""
"\"You see, Your Grace? They've donned the black robes! Their minds are under "
"the sway of the cyclopes! Please, do something before anyone else gets hurt!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"보이십니까, 나으리? 저들은 검은 로브를 입었습니다! 사이클롭스들이 저들의 정신을 지배하고 있습니다! 제발, 저들이 다른 사람들을 "
"다치게 하기 전에 뭐든 해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "bce649b9-7421-45bd-8427-19463c299e09"
msgid ""
"\"You godless wretches! You ungrateful pigs! For how many ages have your "
"ancestors enjoyed the gifts of our Master, one generation after another? How "
"could you have renounced His faith? What a pity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 더러운 불신자들! 배은망덕한 돼지들! 너희 조상들 때부터 대를 거쳐서 우리 주인님의 선물을 누려온 세월이 대체 몇년이더냐? 어떻게 "
"그분의 믿음을 져버릴 수 있단 말이냐? 이 불쌍한 놈들아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "6e412e57-a3b0-4deb-a7e3-bfdc5d1b1635"
msgid "\"You finally realized this? What a miracle!\""
msgstr "\"이걸 드디어 깨달았단 말입니까? 기적이군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "8f6bf973-c9f6-4fb9-9988-5052b75b641e"
msgid "\"Have at them, brothers! The baron will help us!\""
msgstr "\"형제들이여, 저놈들을 처리하자! 남작께서 우리를 도우실것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_ApostateBarbarianMeleeLevel5_speaker
msgctxt "f0a5ed8b-4a01-4508-88b6-bd1a9b0ba426"
msgid ""
"\"But what did the Master send our ancestors? Harvests, good weather, "
"healthy children. And now what does he send? Dead cyclopes! What will he "
"send us next? Rocks hurtling down from the sky? No, you can pray to such a "
"god all you want, but we've found another god!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 주인님께서 우리 조상들에게 무엇을 보내셨었나? 수확물들, 좋은 날씨, 건강한 아이들이지. 그리고 지금은 뭘 보냈지? 죽은 "
"사이클롭스들이다! 그럼 그 다음엔 무엇을 보낼 것인가? 하늘에서 쏟아지는 바윗덩이들? 안돼. 어느 신에게 기도해도 좋아, 다만 우리는 "
"다른 신을 찾을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "065f6d40-adc8-4462-8138-3cb72633b5ff"
msgid ""
"{n}The villager is interrupted by a deafening clap of thunder, as a bolt of "
"lightning cracks down and scorches the huge tree in the middle of the "
"village.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}귀청을 찢는 벼락이 마을 한가운데의 거목을 태우며, 마을 사람들을 멈춰세웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "24451b7f-dcd8-4e05-bfbe-7f2e9f5aa490"
msgid ""
"\"There! You see an answer to your blasphemy! I speak the truth: if you "
"renounce the Master, no other god can protect you! You are forever in his "
"hands – in life, and after death! Repent, and return to your true faith! "
"Isn't it madness to choose punishment instead of gifts?\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기 너! 네 모독에 대한 대답은 알겠지! 내가 진실을 말하겠다. 네가 주인을 버린들, 다른 신은 너를 지켜줄 수 없다! 너는 영원히 "
"그의 손아귀에 있다. 살아서도 죽어서도! 회개하고, 진정한 믿음을 되찾아라! 선물 대신 벌을 택하는 것은 미친 짓이 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "824d4182-b21a-47b1-9a78-a07fda04d10d"
msgid ""
"\"In this case, we'll kill the cultists and leave the apostates be. To arms!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이런 상황이면, 우리는 이교도를 죽이고 배교자들은 그대로 두는 것이 맞다. 무장하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "50978a68-09a7-480e-a1ba-a34eb1cf2bdb"
msgid ""
"\"What in hell is going on here?! I am Maegar Varn, the baron of these "
"lands, and your sovereign! I came to help you deal with cyclopes, but it "
"looks like something else is going on here. I demand an explanation!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도대체 여기서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는 거지?! 난 이 땅의 남작이자 너희 영주인 메이가르 반이다! 나는 사이클롭스 처리를 도와주러 "
"왔는데, 여긴 다른 일이 있는 것 같군. 해명을 요구하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "9e4a599d-883e-4948-80d7-3285b7736477"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Your Grace! What an honor it is for you to visit our humble village. I "
"am Zordesh, the headman of this village. In fact, we do have a little "
"problem with cyclopes, but it's nothing to trouble yourself over. Everything "
"is already under control.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 영주님! 우리 보잘것없는 마을을 찾아주시다니, 정말 영광입니다. 전 이곳의 촌장인 조데쉬입니다. 사실, 사이클롭스가 좀 "
"골칫거리인 건 맞습니다만, 그걸로 여기서 고생하실 필요는 없겠습니다. 이미 다 통제하에 해결됐습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "f3f86d94-038c-4e7d-bf44-dce94a17e10a"
msgid ""
"\"Under control? Far from it! Your Grace, you must save us! This maniac "
"venerates {g|Charon}Charon{/g}, the Horseman of Death! He wants to feed us "
"to cyclopes! Forgive me for lying earlier – I was afraid you would punish "
"all of us... But I'm not lying now! He's a cultist, a real cultist!\""
msgstr ""
"\"통제 하에? 어림도 없는 소리! 영주님, 우리를 도와주셔야 합니다! 이 미치광이는 {g|Charon}케런{/g}, 죽음의 기수를 "
"숭배한다구요! 그는 우리를 사이클롭스에게 먹이고 싶어해요! 이전에 거짓말 한 것은 용서해주세요. 전 당신이 우리 전부를 벌하려고 할까봐 "
"겁났어요. 하지만 지금 하는 말은 거짓이 아니에요! 저놈은 사교도, 진성 사교도라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "fd429b24-8a8e-4b50-ae7d-e2116f755084"
msgid ""
"\"Hm.\" {n}Maegar seems embarrassed.{/n} \"You speak like a true baroness, "
"and I seem to be behaving like a fool again. We only know the situation from "
"Cvetislava's words, which means that several unexpected things might yet "
"come to light.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흐음.\" {n}메이가르는 당황한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"내가 바보짓을 하는 중이고, 네가 진정 남작다운 것일지도 모르겠군. 우리는 "
"그 상황을 크베티슬라바의 말로만 알고 있을 뿐인데, 다시 말하면 우리가 모르는 몇 가지가 남아있을 수도 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "0a30172b-179c-4cc0-a77c-644ed8a2de5e"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling lowers his head.{/n} \"I will not lie to you – we are the "
"children of the Horseman of Death. Our village has worshiped him for "
"hundreds of years. But we are not a secret cult. Everyone you see here, as "
"well as their fathers, grandfathers and great grandfathers – and even the "
"lying wretch who led you here! On the last new moon, she stood alongside us "
"in prayer! This is our faith. We would pray to him, and he would help us "
"survive in this dangerous land. But now, as it was foretold, the cyclopes "
"have arisen from their graves. His servants of old bring good news! – But "
"what did these faithless wretches do? They turned their weapons against his "
"heralds, and even against their own neighbors! The Master has given us his "
"sign. He wishes to reward us with his gifts. But they grew frightened and "
"renounced their faith!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티플링이 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"당신에게 거짓말은 하지 않겠습니다. 우리는 죽음의 기수의 자식입니다. 우리 마을은 수백 년 "
"동안 그를 숭배해 왔습니다. 하지만 우리는 비밀스러운 사이비 종교가 아닙니다. 여기 보이는 모든 사람들뿐만 아니라, 그들의 아버지, "
"할아버지, 증조부들, 당신을 이곳으로 인도한 거짓말쟁이들까지도! 마지막 초승달이 떴을 때만 해도, 그녀는 우리와 함께 기도하고 "
"있었습니다! 이건 우리의 믿음입니다. 우리는 그에게 기도할 거고, 그는 우리가 이 위험한 땅에서 살아남을 수 있도록 도와주십니다. 다만 "
"이제 예언된 대로, 사이클롭스가 무덤에서 일어났습니다만. 그의 옛 신하들이 좋은 소식을 가져올 겁니다! – 그런데 이 믿음 없는 자들이 "
"무슨 짓을 했습니까? 그들은 그의 전령에게, 심지어느 그들의 이웃에게도 무기를 들이댔습니다! 주인님이 우리에게 지표를 주셨습니다. 그는 "
"우리에게 그의 선물로 보답하고 싶어한단 말입니다. 그러나 그들은 겁을 먹고 신앙을 포기했습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "caa63969-6027-46f0-8e83-cfa678e03055"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace! We are no villains, and bear no hatred or grudge. We only "
"worship an ancient and wise deity who has kept us safe here for ages. Please "
"help me put down this uprising, and you, too, will partake of His gifts! "
"Fear not the cyclopes. Their appearance is a sign from the Master. They are "
"only a danger to those infirm of faith!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님! 우린 악당이 아니고, 증오나 원한 같은 것도 없습니다. 우리는 오랜 세월 동안 우리를 지켜온 고대의 현명한 신만을 "
"숭배합니다. 제발 제가 이 봉기를 진압하도록 도와주십시오. 그러면 당신도 그의 선물을 가져가게 될 겁니다! 사이클롭스를 두려워 마십시오. "
"그들의 모습은 주인님의 계시입니다. 그들은 오직 믿음이 부족한 이들에게만 위험합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "c80899f5-dd25-43c3-acc5-e9ead3158810"
msgid ""
"\"Don't listen to him! He wants to feed you to the cyclopes too! I beg you, "
"spare us from this cult! We will worship Erastil or Abadar, or whatever you "
"command! But I beg you – save us from this madness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 사람 말 듣지 마세요! 그는 당신도 사이클롭스에게 먹이고 싶어해요! 제발, 우리를 이 사교에서 구해주세요! 에라스틸, 아바다르, "
"당신이 말하는 그 어떤 신으로든 개종할게요! 그러니까 간청드립니다, 제발 우릴 이 광기에서 구해주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "064d8674-e352-4631-97b3-98f187caee7a"
msgid ""
"\"I understand why this woman lied to us, and I've no wish to punish her, or "
"any who've renounced Charon. As for the cultists who've remained faithful to "
"the Horseman... I'm leaning toward destroying the cult and helping the "
"peaceful villagers find another faith. When there are zombie cyclopes "
"lurking about, the followers of such a deity cast black shadows.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 이 여자가 왜 우리에게 거짓말을 했는지 이해하고, 이 여자나 다른 케런의 배교자를 처벌할 마음도 없소. 마부에게 충실했던 사이비 "
"종교인들에 대해서는... 난 이교도 단체를 해산시키고 다른 온화한 마을사람들에게는 새 신앙을 찾아주고 싶군. 좀비 사이클롭스가 돌아다니는 "
"판에, 그런 신의 교도들은 좋은 영향을 끼칠 것 같지가 않은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "2607d691-444c-4829-892e-dc743b7a82a1"
msgid ""
"\"On the other hand, they could prove most useful in this situation. Think, "
"Maegar! Think! If anyone could help us get to the bottom of the cyclopes "
"problem, it is the people who have served their patron for generations! We "
"shall quash this uprising, and then find out what the headman knows.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반면에, 그들은 이 상황에서 가장 유용할 수도 있다네. 생각해 보게, 메이가르! 생각! 우리가 사이클롭스 문제의 진상을 밝히는데 가장 "
"도움을 줄 수 있는 자들이 있다면, 대대로 그들의 후원자를 섬긴 바로 이 사람들일세! 우리는 이 봉기를 진압하고, 그 다음에 우두머리가 "
"알고 있는 것을 알아내야 하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "a5ccbfe0-3794-4932-a343-51254641eb64"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, daemons are not like devils who always stick to the letter of a "
"contract... But neither are they like demons who would harm themselves just "
"to spite the others. Among all the infernal powers, daemons are essentially "
"the most humane: just like regular people, they primarily care about their "
"own interests. With proper care, they can be dealt with.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 다이몬들이 데빌처럼 항상 계약을 고수하는 부류는 아니지... 하지만 데몬처럼 남을 괴롭히려고 제 스스로를 해치는 부류도 "
"아닐세. 모든 악마 중에서 다이몬들은 본질적으로 가장 인간적이지: 그들은 인간처럼 자신들의 이익을 추구하네. 적절한 주의를 기울인다면 "
"그들은 도움이 될걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "17feaca9-8a47-4bea-a57d-a19bb9f8bf13"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, master, that's just so. You must've imagined that there were "
"any ritual atrocities going on in the village. We've had no human sacrifices "
"here, or anything of the sort! No one has been fed to the cyclopes. We are a "
"peaceful people – just like in villages where more common deities are "
"worshipped!\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다, 주인님, 말하신 대로입니다. 마을에서 어떤 의례적인 잔혹행위가 벌어지고 있다고 상상했겠지요. 우린 인신공양을 하지도 "
"않고, 비슷한 부류의 다른 짓도 안 합니다! 사이클롭스에게 먹이를 주는 사람 같은 건 없어요. 우리는 평화로운 사람들입니다 – 다른 "
"평범한 신들을 숭배하는 마을에서처럼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "feef65b4-56da-4484-9443-4c895684da98"
msgid ""
"\"Faith is one thing. Life is another. We prayed to him like everyone else. "
"It's not like we would stand against the entire village! But the "
"prophecies... No one read them except the priests. Who would have thought "
"that he would truly raise these monsters? What good is a god who unleashes "
"the undead upon us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"신앙은 신앙이죠. 삶과는 별개예요. 우리는 다른 사람들처럼 그에게 기도했어요. 마을에 반하고 싶진 않았으니까! 하지만 예언은... "
"사제들 외에는 아무도 읽지 않았어요. 그가 정말로 이 괴물들을 일으킬 거라고 누가 알았겠어요? 언데드를 우리에게 풀어 주는 신이 대체 "
"무슨 소용이죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "985c71c5-e8d6-4835-ab39-baca11ce3a14"
msgid ""
"\"As usual, no one listens to old Cephal, and then everyone wonders why "
"everything turns to chaos!\""
msgstr "\"평소처럼, 아무도 늙은 케팔의 말은 듣지 않는군, 그리고는 모두들 어째서 상황이 혼돈으로 치닫는지를 궁금해하겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "0a5a75be-6313-4e6c-89e1-e64a155dde7d"
msgid "\"Well, I trust your decision. To arms!\""
msgstr "\"뭐, 자네의 결정을 믿네. 무장하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "e95f36a2-135c-48f8-9f54-ab170ba3c2d8"
msgid "\"So that is how the baron protects his subjects?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 그게 남작이 자기 백성을 지키는 방식인가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "7bbb9dfe-f77f-405b-8347-ea30ad665759"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your Grace! Did you hear that, O faithful? Defeat the "
"apostates! When the dust settles, visit the shrine on the mountain. – I "
"shall return there, and protect it from the rebel blasphemers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다, 영주님! 신실한 자들아, 들었는가? 배교자들을 물리쳐라! 소동이 끝나면 산에 있는 사원을 찾아라. – 나는 그곳으로 "
"돌아가 반동 배교자들로부터 그곳을 보호할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "d80a9b9a-c46f-4759-956e-a6c0794f858b"
msgid ""
"\"You are mad! You've no idea the power you've dared to raise your weapons "
"against! Faithful! – Cover my retreat! I must protect the shrine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"미쳤군! 넌 네가 어떤 힘에 대고 무기를 겨눴는지 모를 거다! 신실한 자들아! – 내 퇴로를 엄호해라! 사당을 지켜야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "0a99f19f-065b-451f-b824-fa237e279723"
msgid ""
"\"Do you hear me, apostates? This is your punishment! You've been betrayed "
"by the very baron whose help you relied on! Faithful, cover my retreat! – I "
"must protect the shrine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 좀 내 말이 들리나, 변절자들? 이건 너희의 벌이다! 너희는 너희가 기대려던 바로 그 남작에게 배신당했다! 신실한 자들이여, "
"후퇴를 엄호하라! – 나는 사당을 지켜야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "61c94516-2cbb-4fb7-97c4-c572dbe688e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar reaches for his blade.{/n} \"I've no wish to cross steel with my "
"subjects... But if their minds have been stolen by monsters, it is our duty "
"to protect the innocent. Are you ready?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 칼날을 향해 손을 뻗습니다.{/n} \"나는 백성들과 칼날을 섞고 싶지 않아... 하지만 그들이 괴물들에게 홀려 있다면, "
"무고한 사람들을 보호하는 것이 우리의 의무지. 준비됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "b99fbf7d-740f-4501-ba37-249eb665494f"
msgid ""
"\"How could you say such horrible things?! Why everyone? Not everyone "
"worshi... I mean, not everyone was driven mad by cyclopes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 그런 끔찍한 말을 할 수가 있죠?! 왜 모두를? 모든 숭배자가... 제 말은, 모두가 사이클로프에게 미친 건 아니란 말이에요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "eb617459-d6c1-4c77-ac0f-5954c895fee7"
msgid ""
"\"Don't leave us with them! They'll sacrifice us to their... Ermm... I mean, "
"they'll slaughter us all!\""
msgstr "\"저들과 함께 우리를 남겨두지 말아요! 우릴 희생시켜서... 음... 제 말은, 그들이 우릴 다 죽일 거라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "1d832678-2380-4c42-b208-31aad3775e89"
msgid "\"Sacrifice you to who? What are you still hiding?\""
msgstr "\"누구에 대한 희생이라고? 아직도 숨기는 게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "110d1524-43c2-4c7b-aa07-bd5d0d333ab2"
msgid ""
"\"I suspect the cyclopes have nothing to do with this, and our guest just "
"wants to trick us into solving some local political problems in her favor. "
"And, I might add, she's doing it rather poorly. – And I cannot stand bad "
"liars! Maegar, before we start swinging our swords around, it would be wise "
"to hear the people out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 이 문제가 사이클롭스와는 연관이 없고, 우리 손님이 그저 이 지역의 문제를 자신에게 유리한 방향으로 해결하려 하는 게 아닌가 "
"의심되는군. 덧붙이자면, 꽤 형편없는 솜씨로. 그리고 난 못된 거짓말쟁이는 참을 수 없네! 메이가르, 우리가 칼을 휘두르기 전에 백성들의 "
"말을 끝까지 듣는 것이 현명할 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "9c75249c-f51c-4d1a-8f99-6dad5d2f157f"
msgid "\"What? You meant to say 'worship'? Worships who?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? '숭배'라고 말하려는 건가? 누구에 대한 숭배지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "781aeec4-02b5-4537-99f0-13ffa83cd911"
msgid ""
"\"I think you're onto something. They don't appear to be insane. Not very "
"smart either, of course, but I see no mark of obsession.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 알아챈 것 같군. 그들은 미친 것처럼 보이진 않네. 물론 그리 똑똑해 보이진 않네만, 집착하는 티도 딱히 보이지 않는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "28a8c233-7bb6-4f1a-b959-5d3b4e72af37"
msgid ""
"\"We should... But let them explain themselves first. Hey, headman! Is this "
"true?\""
msgstr "\"우리는... 하지만 그들이 먼저 스스로 해명하도록 하지. 이봐, 촌장! 이게 사실인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "93353241-78ab-4d1b-b200-8daa53ba0c10"
msgid ""
"\"Right you are! They are rioting right now, though... But let us give the "
"villagers a chance to say something in their defense. Zordesh! Do you really "
"worship the Horseman here?\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 그들은 지금 폭동을 일으키고 있지만... 하지만 마을 사람들에게 스스로 변호할 기회를 줘보세. 조데쉬! 정말 여기서는 기수를 "
"숭배하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "bfdeefd1-cd82-4d89-8f3b-6ae9006bc6bc"
msgid ""
"\"As blood-thirsty as ever! I must say, the more I hear, the less I like. "
"Lies, cults, revolts... Headman – what's your name? We need an explanation!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금처럼 피에 굶주린! 들을수록 더 나빠진다고 말할 수밖에 없군. 거짓말, 사이비 종교, 반란... 촌장 - 이름이 뭐지? 설명이 "
"필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "02a3c896-1078-462e-b1ef-d2798b7d6b79"
msgid ""
"\"Well... Not everyone, of course! Just him, the damned headman and his "
"henchmen!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄요... 물론 모두가 다 그런 것은 아니예요! 그 사람, 그 빌어먹을 우두머리와 그 심복들만이예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "9f051827-3484-49d9-9f11-2fd16ffd5f32"
msgid ""
"\"Weaving another web of lies, Cvetislava? Your Grace, would you care to "
"hear the truth now?\""
msgstr "\"또 거짓말의 거미줄을 치는 건가, 크베티슬라바? 영주님, 진실을 들어 주시지 않겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "80febd48-d138-4e1f-8d13-78bdce6fffa9"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to make deals with these cultists... But there's a whiff of "
"sense in your words. {Name}, what do you say?\""
msgstr "\"나는 이런 컬트주의자들과 거래를 하고 싶지 않아... 하지만 그 말에도 일리가 있군. {Name}, 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "6a408b91-7b5e-4072-a0f7-f425b8542cfd"
msgid ""
"\"Faith is a personal matter, but lying to one's sovereign is a matter of "
"state. Zordesh, would you care to explain yourself?\""
msgstr "\"신앙은 개인적인 문제지만, 통치자에게 거짓말을 하는 건 국가적 잘못일세. 조데쉬, 해명할 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "bce29ab9-ca28-4fb7-b474-d7c1a59366cf"
msgid "\"To arms!\""
msgstr "\"전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "cbbe334f-4cee-4435-a33c-a8a1ce0a9519"
msgid ""
"\"That is a rough decision... But you are right. Sometimes one has to resort "
"to harsh measures. To arms!\""
msgstr "\"그건 엉성한 결정이야... 하지만 네 말이 맞아. 잔혹한 조치를 취해야만 할 때도 있겠지. 무장하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a6f34a62-867b-42a1-94dc-af97cd7ef4b5"
msgid "\"Right! To arms!\""
msgstr "\"그 말대로지! 무장하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "c6ef1d66-1c4b-4fa2-aa81-493797d7a0b1"
msgid ""
"\"You think so? Then let's not act rashly! First we must get to the bottom "
"of this.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 생각해? 그럼 경솔한 행동은 삼가지! 우선 이 일의 진상을 규명해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "abb3978f-ba75-4740-83bc-ccf7defbc858"
msgid ""
"\"No we won't. I'm not prepared to slaughter parents in front of their "
"children – not even if you and Cephal convince me that it's the best, "
"smartest, and the most effective solution!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 그렇게는 안 할 거야. 너와 케팔이 그것을 가장 좋고, 똑똑하고, 효과적인 해결책이라고 설득해도 난 자식이 보는 가운데 그 "
"부모를 죽일 준비가 안 됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0097_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "06c1e2dd-7f34-45bf-95da-ead6d00669b8"
msgid ""
"\"All the problems of my subjects are my problems! Doubly so here, since "
"they're infighting because of the cyclopes... Ah, but wait! You're a genius! "
"You're right – why fight the villagers? Let's slaughter the cyclopes "
"instead, and the spell will disperse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 백성의 문제는 곧 내 문제다! 특히나 여기선 사이클롭스 때문에 내분이 일어나고 있으니... 아, 다만 기다려! 넌 천재로군! 네 "
"말이 맞아. 왜 마을 사람들과 싸워야 하지? 대신 사이클롭스들을 죽여버리면, 마법이 흩어지겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "5d8401ef-43e1-43d1-b4b7-e7d144277fee"
msgid ""
"\"Look at the poor wretches! – The cyclopes stole their minds! The butchery "
"is about to begin! We must save whoever we still can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 딱한 자들을 봐! – 사이클롭스들이 저들의 마음을 훔쳤군! 도살이 시작되려 한다! 아직 구할 수 있는 자는 구해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "29fd550b-f856-4ca2-8b65-dbd18d74781c"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't like to resort to such radical measures. However, if you really "
"believe there's no other way...\" {n}Maegar gives the village woman an "
"expressive look.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그런 과격한 조치에 의지하고 싶지 않다. 하지만 다른 방법이 없다고 믿는다면..\" {n}메이가르는 마을 여인에게 티 나게 "
"눈짓합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0101_Text
msgctxt "5677821b-43d6-4135-b06c-1c7531af7ff9"
msgid ""
"{n}Varn's words are punctuated by a deafening rumble, as lightning strikes a "
"great tree in the center of the village.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}Varn의 말은 마을 한가운데에 있는 큰 나무에 벼락이 치듯이 귀청이 터질 듯한 웅성거림으로 구두점을 찍습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0102_Text_String
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "0aaf4167-9844-4545-8a8d-8ddcfa7871a1"
msgid ""
"\"This is the answer to sacrilege and blasphemy! There will be no mercy for "
"the enemies of the Master!\""
msgstr "\"이것이 신성모독과 배교에 대한 해답이다! 주인님의 적들에게 자비는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0103_Text_String
msgctxt "2363b071-9d7e-4cb6-a66c-eb8b12fa99cd"
msgid ""
"{n}The villager's words are punctuated by a deafening rumble, as lightning "
"strikes a great tree in the center of the village.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마을 한가운데에 있는 큰 나무에 벼락이 치듯이, 마을 사람의 말은 귀청이 터질 것 같은 우르릉거리는 소리로 끊깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "c550f73c-8738-43d3-920d-65968aa8d2c0"
msgid ""
"\"They are armed and prepared to shed blood. You call this a petty squabble? "
"If so, when do you suggest we intervene? When the corpse pile numbers one "
"hundred? Or should we wait for a hundred more?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 무장하고 피를 볼 작정이군. 이걸 사소한 말다툼이라고 하나? 그렇다면 언제 개입하는 게 좋겠나? 시체가 한 백 구쯤 쌓일 때? "
"아니면 백 구쯤 더?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Faithful_VS_Apostates/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4c2b1a8f-a884-471b-b0f5-ab3c1c8f44bc"
msgid ""
"\"Cephal is right. Such carelessness is unbecoming of a General. There is "
"unrest on our lands, and unrest must be nipped in the bud!\""
msgstr "\"케팔이 옳소. 그런 부주의는 장군으로서 범할 수 없지. 우리 땅에 불안이 있고, 불안은 싹을 잘라야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "225a1bec-8168-44ca-8c55-826c1be17d51"
msgid "\"You haven't answered the question! What is this gift?\""
msgstr "\"질문에 대답하지 않았군! 선물이란 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "54c8b78b-194a-417c-b63d-2f70bec4b4d4"
msgid "\"Where is the tomb?\""
msgstr "\"무덤은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Answer_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "08fc3f81-8bdb-4488-a37b-e777d38a44bf"
msgid "\"What prevented you from getting this gift earlier?\""
msgstr "\"전에는 왜 이런 선물을 못 받았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Answer_0015_Text_String
msgctxt "bbdce41f-3bca-4800-a170-ee38c7736040"
msgid "\"What are we going to do next?\""
msgstr "\"다음엔 어떻게 하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "5fb22fac-145e-4a54-9a85-1d21f4c8c986"
msgid "\"Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"갑시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "ee55663c-80f2-450e-a2e9-0bcacf8b0b12"
msgid "\"Wait, Maegar, we have unfinished business here in the village.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 메이가르, 아직 이 마을에 일이 남았어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "2932eac6-bc72-4c49-a44f-8ff34eed0b76"
msgid ""
"\"So, the uprising of renegades has been quashed? Praise the Master! Your "
"Grace, allow me to pledge my eternal loyalty to you.\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 반역자들의 봉기는 진압된 건가? 주인님을 찬양하라! 영주님, 영주님께 영원히 충성하도록 허락해 주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "ee2096d7-2b77-48b7-a6b3-a9dd88c998c1"
msgid ""
"\"To perish at the hand of the unfaithful... Now that the prophecy has come "
"to pass, and the divine gift is closer than ever... Why am I found unworthy? "
"Was it all in vain?\""
msgstr ""
"\"배교자의 손에 죽다니... 이제 예언이 이루어지려 하고, 신의 선물은 그 어느 때보다 가까워졌건만... 왜 나에게는 자격이 없는거지? "
"다 헛수고였단 말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "76281936-2637-4a3a-81be-f74edd0193e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar makes a wry face.{/n} \"That's enough flattery. You say you know "
"why the cyclopes rose, and how to stop them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 씁쓸한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"아첨은 그만하면 됐다. 사이클롭스가 왜 일어났는지, 어떻게 막는지 안다고 했었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "16b072f4-6419-425d-96c3-c534a5d35aca"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes! The cyclopes are the former servants of the Master, and they arise "
"as his heralds. They come to test us. They are a sign that the time has come "
"to reach out for the divine gift!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그렇고말고요! 사이클롭스들은 주인님의 옛 종복들입니다. 그리고 지금 주인님의 전령으로 깨어났지요. 사이클롭스는 우리를 시험하러 "
"나타난 겁니다. 사이클롭스야말로 신의 선물이 눈 앞에 있다는 징조란 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "015ff3b1-3d40-4b3e-b9a6-9d57cf75d175"
msgid ""
"\"Start talking straight, now. What is this gift, how do we get it, and what "
"does it have to do with cyclopes?\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히 털어놓아라, 당장. 그 선물이란건 뭐고, 어떻게 얻을 수 있는거지? 그리고 그게 사이클롭스와 무슨 관계가 있는거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0006_Text_String
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "2c778236-cdae-4f57-970c-11e81eec6c8f"
msgid ""
"\"In ancient times, before the Earthfall, a great cyclopes empire ruled "
"these lands. But they were unworthy of the power granted them by the Master. "
"Their emperor took his gift to his grave, and guards it there still, in the "
"depths of his tomb. Now the emperor has awakened, and his cyclopes have "
"arisen. It is time to open his tomb. Go down there and accept the god's gift "
"from his cold fingers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어스폴이 일어나기 전 고대 시대에 위대한 사이클롭스 제국이 이 땅을 지배했습니다. 하지만 사이클롭스들은 주인님이 내리신 힘을 받을 "
"자격이 없는 자들이었지요. 그들의 황제는 주인님의 선물을 무덤까지 가져갔고, 선물은 황제의 무덤 깊숙한 곳에 오늘날까지 파묻혀 있습니다. "
"이제 그 황제가 깨어났고, 그의 종복들도 일어섰습니다. 지금이야말로 황제의 무덤에 들어갈 때입니다. 그곳으로 내려가 황제의 차가운 "
"손아귀에서 신의 선물을 받아내십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0011_Text_String
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "3e96aacd-6b5e-4ab8-b817-bbc9cbdaa5a6"
msgid ""
"\"A sacred artifact of incredible power! The one who accepts it will build "
"such an empire, all the glories of the past will pale!\""
msgstr "\"믿기 힘든 힘을 가진 신성한 유물이지요! 선물을 받은 자는 제국을 세울 것이며, 과거의 모든 영광은 아스라질 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "b8759e9c-5469-42d7-a66a-7ac835fc0362"
msgid ""
"\"It sounds interesting... It's probably too good to be true. But still, "
"it's worth checking.\""
msgstr "\"흥미롭군... 너무 솔깃해서 믿기 어려울 정도일세. 하지만 조사해 볼 가치는 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0013_Text_String
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "bb683317-0974-48b3-8f3d-77771120cfeb"
msgid ""
"\"To the south of here. It is guarded by centaurs –- pathetic creatures "
"always warring with us. They worship Desna –- a powerless goddess, gone "
"insane. They believe she ordered them to guard the cyclopes ruins from us, "
"that it's their sacred mission... It's ridiculous!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳에서 남쪽 방향에 있습니다. 켄타우로스들이 지키고 있지요. 우린 그 한심한 생물들과 쭉 다퉈왔습니다. 그들은 힘없고 미쳐버린 여신 "
"데스나를 섬기는데, 여신이 우리에게서 사이클롭스 유적을 지키라는 계시를 내렸다고 믿고 있지요... 미친 소립니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0014_Text_String
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "310abc48-76f9-4fda-a064-8df61ebebf04"
msgid ""
"\"The Master would be angry if we reached out for his gift before the time "
"was right. Even if we reached the tomb, its doors would be closed to us. "
"This staff is the key. It has slumbered for ages, but now...\" {n}The "
"tiefling shows you his staff, crowned with a metal skull. A greenish flame "
"dances in the single eye socket.{/n} \"The dead eye has opened, the dead "
"fingers move. The gift awaits the worthy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"때가 되지 않았는데 선물에 손을 댄다면 주인님께서 노하실 겁니다. 무덤에 다다른다 해도 유적의 문은 굳게 닫혀있을 것이고요. 이 "
"지팡이가 바로 문의 열쇠입니다. 긴 시간 잠들어 있었지만, 지금이라면...\" {n}티플링이 당신에게 지팡이에 장식된 금속 해골을 "
"보여줍니다. 하나 뿐인 눈구멍 속에서 녹색 불꽃이 일렁입니다.{/n} \"죽은 눈이 열리고, 죽은 손가락이 움직입니다. 선물이 합당한 "
"자를 기다리고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "cb98cadc-9bbb-4286-bf12-03e6d1b8487d"
msgid ""
"\"I don't believe in daemon gifts, but I say this tomb is worth checking. "
"And for now it's our only lead on solving the dead cyclopes problem.\""
msgstr ""
"\"악마의 선물따윈 믿지 않아. 하지만 이 무덤을 조사해볼 가치가 있겠어. 사이클롭스 좀비 문제를 해결할 유일한 실마리니 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "38ee3c49-0c71-4902-ad02-6d8688603c20"
msgid ""
"\"Agreed. Legends don't spring clear out of the blue. Whatever secret this "
"tomb holds, it may prove useful.\""
msgstr "\"동의하네. 전설은 근거없이 전해지진 않는 법이지. 무덤이 어떤 비밀을 품고있던지, 분명 유용할걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "20c1d4a7-425c-4615-a23f-9e46d0fb8e25"
msgid "\"Let's go to the tomb.\""
msgstr "\"무덤으로 가지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "fcc28c91-5308-450b-9d15-1016f7e62e76"
msgid ""
"\"As you command, Your Highness! I've sent our best warriors there – if only "
"they'd been here, the uprising would never have happened! But we'll defeat "
"the centaurs together, and fulfill our destinies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"명령 받들겠습니다, 전하! 그곳에 최고의 전사들을 보내놨습니다 - 그들이 여기 있었다면 지금 상황은 결코 일어나지 않았겠지요. 그래도 "
"이제 우린 함께 켄타우로스들을 물리치고 운명을 이행할 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "acb2aa10-cb7b-4d50-a623-6f9d82e6ea47"
msgid ""
"\"No. Not in vain.\" {n}Cephal withdraws a sacred symbol of Asmodeus from "
"under his cloak – an upside-down pentagram.{/n} \"Your god is weak. Mortals "
"have long forgotten him. In the name of Asmodeus, the Dark Prince, I command "
"you. Tell us now what is this gift, and where we can find it. I shall take "
"it by the right of strength. Speak, or you shall know all the suffering of "
"hell before your miserable soul parts from your body!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 헛되지 않았네.\" {n}케팔은 망토 아래서 아스모데우스의 신성한 상징인 뒤집힌 오망성을 꺼내보입니다.{/n} \"너희 신은 "
"약하다. 필멸자들은 그를 잊은지 오래지. 어둠의 대공 아스모데우스의 이름으로 너에게 명한다. 이 선물이 무엇이고 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 "
"털어놓아라. 내가 힘의 권리로 차지할터이니. 말하라, 그렇지 않으면 네 미천한 영혼이 육신에서 뜯겨나가기 전에 지옥의 모든 고통을 깨닫게 "
"해주리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "b8c6564a-0262-4353-b1da-b9a105d998f8"
msgid ""
"\"Servant of the Dark Prince... Your lord will not rule forever! The "
"Horsemen are strong, and the Horseman of Death is the strongest of all. The "
"day will come when Hell will be but dust under the hooves of the pale "
"horse... But you can have it your way for now. I will tell you of the "
"Master's gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어둠의 대공의 종복이여... 당신의 신이 영원히 군림하진 못할 것이오! 기수는 막강하고, 죽음의 기수는 그 중 으뜸일지니. 언젠간 "
"지옥이 창백한 말들의 말굽에 밟혀 먼지가 될 때가 올지어다... 하지만 당장은 당신 말에 따르겠소. 주인님의 선물에 대해 얘기해드리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "80fe07e6-e8ec-48f7-ac67-94678da35502"
msgid ""
"\"An empire will arise in Dunsward again – not of cyclopes, but of people "
"like you and me! Are you prepared to accept the emperor's title... Your "
"Highness, Maegar Varn the First?\""
msgstr ""
"\"던스워드에 제국이 다시금 일어나는 겁니다 – 사이클롭스가 아니라 당신이나 나같은 인간의 손으로! 황제의 직위를 받아들일 준비가 "
"되셨습니까, 메이가르 반 1세이시여?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "a60bb43d-b234-45e8-8dac-9207eac8a1bf"
msgid ""
"\"Go down! Down to the tomb – and stay there forever! Enter the deadly "
"embrace of a corpse!\""
msgstr "\"꺼지시오! 무덤으로 가서 거기서 영원히 썩어버려! 죽음의 포옹을 맞이할지어니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "32114a5a-0973-4d7e-8dd0-a05e5180d455"
msgid ""
"\"Now you know all. May the Horseman curse your souls!\" {n}With a swift "
"motion, the tiefling pulls out a dagger and slashes his own throat, and "
"abruptly falls to the ground, covered in blood.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 아는 모든걸 말했소. 기수들이 당신의 영혼을 저주하시길!\" {n}티플링은 민첩한 솜씨로 단검을 꺼내 자신의 목을 그어버리고는, "
"피에 젖은 채 땅으로 스러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "ebe619e6-2225-4090-bc1f-f8b6e480bcbb"
msgid ""
"\"I've already sent my best warriors there – to chase off the centaurs, and "
"clear the way to the tomb. Oh, if only they'd been here, no uprising would "
"have happened... And you worthless fools wouldn't have desecrated the "
"Horseman's shrine. But what is done cannot be undone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"켄타우로스를 쫓아내고 무덤을 확보하기 위해 내 최고의 전사들을 보내놨지. 오, 그들이 여기있었다면 이 봉기는 성공할 수 없었을 텐데. "
"그리고 무가치한 당신들이 기수의 성소를 욕보일 일도 없었을테고. 하지만 이미 엎질러진 물이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "d983f186-48e0-48ec-af94-c89b55bd907e"
msgid ""
"\"Now that the Master has sent us a sign, they are just a small thing in our "
"way!\""
msgstr "\"지금 주인님께서 계시를 보내셨으니, 그들은 사소한 문제에 불과할 뿐입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "81c4d61d-dd41-44ce-9bbe-93b52b1d9406"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity that you will descend instead of the worthy... But the Master "
"is not merciful. – He will see that you pay for your blasphemy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"합당한 자 대신 네가 무덤으로 가게 되다니 안타깝군.... 하지만 주인님께선 자비가 없으시다. - 네 불경에 대한 대가를 치르리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "51e39fda-f689-429d-b420-e5383ce4462f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh my... Cephal, that was some speech! But do you really think the Dark "
"Prince would hand you, of all people, an ancient artifact of the Horseman of "
"the Apocalypse?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 이런... 케팔, 대단한 연설이었네만! 정말로 어둠의 대공이 그 많은 사람들 중 자네에게 종말의 기수의 고대 유물을 건내줄거라 "
"생각하는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "2b6d3f9c-2ed1-4602-8474-bc0bf2f2b9c2"
msgid ""
"\"My friend, to be frank, I hold no stock in ancient artifacts of boundless "
"power. All that grand rubbish sounded more like the speech of a market "
"trickster, trying to sell snake oil to the village simpleton. I'm merely "
"good at making deals – even with insane fanatics, when the need arises... "
"Though I suppose legends don't spring clear out of the blue.\" {n}Cephal "
"hefts the cultist's staff.{/n} \"Whatever secret this tomb holds, it may "
"prove useful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 친구여, 솔직히 말하자면, 무한한 힘을 가진 고대유물 따위는 관심없네. 그 장황한 헛소리들이 내겐 동네 얼간이에게 뱀기름을 팔려는 "
"시장꾼의 연설처럼 들렸거든. 난 그저 필요에 따라 -그자가 광신도라 할지라도- 흥정을 했을 뿐이네... 근거없는 전설은 없긴 하네만.\" "
"{n}케팔은 이교도의 지팡이를 들어올립니다.{/n} \"무덤이 어떤 비밀을 품고있던, 분명 우리에게 유용할걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a0e707be-4c40-4503-b337-e624f3ce3083"
msgid ""
"\"In any case, this tomb is worth checking out. And for now it's our only "
"lead on solving the dead cyclopes problem. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"어찌됐든, 이 무덤은 조사해볼만 한 것 같군. 사이클롭스 좀비 문제를 해결한 유일한 단서니 말이야. 가지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "866f9113-b31c-4837-840f-8a9793428ab4"
msgid ""
"\"As you say, but don't be long! The dead cyclopes aren't standing idle!\""
msgstr "\"자네 말대로 하지, 하지만 오래 걸려서는 안 돼! 사이클롭스 좀비 문제가 해결되지 않았으니 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d89440a7-bce2-45a3-978c-9dde95036aca"
msgid "\"I suppose so. {Name}, what say you?\""
msgstr "\"그런 것 같군. {Name}, 자네 의견은 어떤가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Leader_Final/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "420b73ca-2151-4ca6-ac7e-7b2f0f68c3ee"
msgid "\"Oh, I'm dying of fear. {Name}, what say you?\""
msgstr "\"오, 무서워 죽겠군. {Name}, 자네 의견은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5b0f20f8-5015-46bb-9e6d-ba6ef67f09d4"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e0373a3b-c079-4c6e-814f-03ca42ea446b"
msgid "\"We have to go.\""
msgstr "\"우린 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "fc9819b6-9fc0-48bf-9675-a615b771e6b4"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't like you. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"마음에 안 드는군. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "63b74caf-5647-4f7a-ba6b-c9137a5310fe"
msgid ""
"{n}The middle-aged man is hastily packing his wares into his cart. His "
"rugged face and sun-bleached hair show him to be an experienced traveler. He "
"notices you and nods, but continues his work.{/n} \"You chose a bad time to "
"visit this place! I'm getting myself out of here, and I suggest you do the "
"same!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}중년의 남성이 수레를 끌고 분주히 짐을 정리하고 있습니다. 푸석한 피부와 볕에 그슬린 머리카락은 그가 경험 많은 여행자라는 것을 "
"나타냅니다. 그는 당신을 눈치채고 인사하지만, 곧 하던 일을 계속합니다.{/n} \"좋지 않을 때 오셨군요! 전 여기서 떠날 준비 "
"중입니다, 그리고 당신에게도 그 편을 추천하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "0f9b9e6d-9739-4f89-b8ff-d63ddd6c17a1"
msgid ""
"{n}The merchant gathers his things.{/n} \"Are you still here? Don't push "
"your luck!\""
msgstr "{n}상인은 물건을 정리하고 있습니다.{/n} \"아직 여기 있는겁니까? 운을 너무 믿지는 마시지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "1dcb0771-5633-407e-9485-5b42d805cb14"
msgid ""
"\"I am Muan, a merchant of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. I thought I'd seek fortune "
"in the new baronies – but so far I've met only danger and loss. Trolls roam "
"the Shrike Hills, and the situation here is even worse. Drelev seems to have "
"disappeared... Of course, the Swordlords can decide where the borders get "
"drawn here, and who gets to claim which title. But so far these 'rulers of "
"the Stolen Lands' haven't much tamed their claims.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 상인 무안입니다. 새 남작령에서 대박을 터트릴줄 알았는데, 지금까진 손실과 위험만 늘어나고 "
"있지요. 슈라이크 구릉지에선 트롤이 나돌아다녔는데 여기는 상황이 더 나쁘군요. 드렐레프는 사라진것 같고.... 물론 국경과 작위를 "
"결정하는 건 소드로드들이긴 합니다만, 지금까지 봐선 이 '도둑맞은 땅의 지배자'들은 소유지들을 다스리는 덴 실패한 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "be587aec-f349-427c-af18-63f7e559e9b0"
msgid ""
"\"Have a look. But please be quick. I'm trying to get away from here quick.\""
msgstr "\"살펴보세요. 하지만 서두르시죠. 이곳에서 가능한 빨리 달아나고 싶으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "267f2e00-a78c-42e6-afae-aae2da581806"
msgid "\"Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "058b0ee6-26d1-4aed-b817-377aae0e508f"
msgid ""
"{n}The merchant turns pale and reaches for his weapon.{/n} \"Don't you even "
"try it! I'll kill you right where you stand!\""
msgstr "{n}상인은 창백해지더니 무기를 향해 손을 뻗습니다.{/n} \"꿈도 꾸지 마! 그자리에 죽여주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "c5b20bb8-9d61-4392-8946-8967abfb0809"
msgid ""
"\"Enough! Put your weapons away. No one is killing anyone. Forgive my "
"companion, sir!\""
msgstr "\"그만하게! 무기를 치우게. 누구도 죽일 필요 없네. 내 동료를 용서하시구려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "b3bbe7c8-660e-42fa-b2b1-570f0bb7045a"
msgid ""
"\"A fair reproach. Let me introduce myself: Maegar Varn, baron of these "
"lands. I've been called here to help – specifically, to dispose of those "
"monsters that are troubling you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"공정한 비판이군. 내 소개를 하겠소: 메이가르 반, 이 땅의 남작이오. 도움을 요청받아 이곳에 왔소 – 정확히는, 당신을 괴롭히는 이 "
"괴물들을 처리하기 위해서 말이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "2a7a33fb-42b7-4bbd-b9d8-88927d2cd34e"
msgid ""
"\"You're the ba – ! Oh, me and my big mouth! Well, Your Grace, blessings on "
"you and your subjects. I shall hurry home and never set foot in the Stolen "
"Lands again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 남-! 오, 내 주책맞은 주둥이를봐! 이런, 저하, 당신과 당신 백성에게 축복을. 전 집으로 서둘러 돌아가 도둑맞은 땅엔 "
"얼씬도 안할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "7bbb2e3f-b9cb-41a1-823d-dc80577de6eb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, come on now, don't be so dramatic. Monsters are a regular problem in "
"such wild lands, but we've everything well in hand. Believe me, it wouldn't "
"be in your interests to give up on the market now. Though this very moment "
"isn't the best time for negotiations... But if you visit us in the capital, "
"we would be happy to discuss the potential benefits of trade here, and what "
"sorts of benefits we'd both enjoy. – But that will have to wait for another "
"time...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 진정하게, 너무 과장하진 말라고. 이런 황량한 땅에서 괴물은 그저 평범한 문제일 뿐이네만, 모두 잘 해결해내고 있다네. 내말을 "
"믿게, 이 상권을 포기하는 건 자네도 아쉽지 않은가. 지금 당장은 협상을 하기에 좋은 때가 아니네만... 수도에 들른다면, 이곳에서 "
"장사를 함으로써 얻을 잠재적 수익과 우리 모두가 취할수 있는 이득에 대해 의논할 수 있을걸세. – 하지만 지금 당장은 어렵겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "602a44e5-b32e-4b58-9ce9-552ec98d7a54"
msgid ""
"\"No, though I thank you very kindly. But I will try my luck somewhere far "
"away from the Stolen Lands. This place is...\" {n}The merchant waves his "
"hand in the air vaguely.{/n} \"...not good. Like it's cursed or something.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아닙니다, 제안은 감사합니다만 제 운수는 도둑맞은 땅에서 멀리 떨어진 곳에서 시험해보려고합니다. 이 땅은...\" {n}상인은 손을 "
"허공에 젓습니다.{/n} \"...좋지 않아요. 저주라도 받은 것 같다고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_CultistsVillage_vendor
msgctxt "dffe2643-e5f6-4405-82b8-0e435e657e1b"
msgid ""
"{n}The merchant puts away his weapon, mumbling something at you about the "
"groaning gallows. His hand remains ready, and he watches you closely.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 무기를 거두고 신음하는 교수대에 관한 무언가를 당신에게 주절거립니다. 그의 손은 준비만반의 상태고, 당신을 신중히 "
"살핍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "0d591773-2517-4f94-8f4d-b6d10b5944da"
msgid ""
"\"I know there's gloom in the air. – That's why we're here. To whom do I "
"have the honor of speaking?\""
msgstr "\"나도 이곳에 어둠이 도사리는 것을 알고 있소. 그게 이곳에 온 이유지. 이야기하게 되어 영광이오. 당신은 누구신지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Trader/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7a8679db-3bb4-4616-9ee7-a7bc4aa7c839"
msgid ""
"\"Very well, good-bye then. Personally I'm in no mood for trade. {Name}, "
"Cephal, if you need anything, go ahead and buy it, but be quick about it. "
"There's a battle in the air!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 좋소, 잘가시오. 개인적으로 거래를 할 기분은 아니네만. {Name}, 케팔, 필요한게 있으면 구매하게. 하지만 서두르게. "
"전운이 감도는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Varn_Letsgo/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ac672729-be1d-4ac7-92b7-c729f7a8c6d7"
msgid "\"Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"갑시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Varn_Letsgo/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "992eee11-f003-4265-a191-2d5e0a3e1496"
msgid "\"Wait, I need to do something else.\""
msgstr "\"잠시, 다른 볼일이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/CultistsVillage/Varn_Letsgo/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e47e9bca-f8f2-43b1-9b64-bcf173eca488"
msgid ""
"\"Have you finished your business? While we put off dealing with the tomb, "
"our subjects are suffering the horrors of dead cyclopes!\""
msgstr "\"볼일은 다 끝났나? 우리가 무덤 문제를 미루고 있는 동안, 우리 백성들은 사이클롭스 좀비로 고통받고 있네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/FinalDungeonBarks/GeneralFightBark_String
msgctxt "0fa8e45e-9786-446e-9116-414d5a04f1bd"
msgid "\"Damned fey. You just can't get enough!\""
msgstr "\"망할 페이. 정도를 모르지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/FinalDungeonBarks/GeneralHubBark_String
msgctxt "da6f6add-948e-430a-aad6-b417d0d9c7ce"
msgid "\"I can't wait to get to that Eldest and say, 'Guess who's back!'\""
msgstr "\"원로에게 \"누가 돌아왔게!\"라고 말해줄 생각을 하니, 기다릴 수가 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/GeneralCapitalBarks/1GeneralCapital_String
msgctxt "4258d502-3544-4021-881b-c09079dda35d"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! We finally meet in "
"person. It's an honor for me.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 드디어 직접 만났군요. 영광입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/GeneralCapitalBarks/2GeneralCapital_String
msgctxt "bcd0bef9-f6bd-465b-bff5-5b7d1d0af02e"
msgid ""
"\"What a pity I wasn't with you during the expedition to Vordakai's den. "
"That beast owes me much for what he did to Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"보다카이의 무덤 원정대에 당신과 함께하지 못해 안타까웠습니다. 그 짐승이 반홀드에 한 짓에 대한 빚이 남았는데 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/GeneralCapitalBarks/GeneralCentaurs_String
msgctxt "b9a5040a-aa62-4b1f-ad24-65aa9b67a517"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder if any of our centaur allies survived, and where they are now.\""
msgstr "\"우리 켄타우로스 협력자들이 살아남았는지, 어디로 갔는지 궁금하군요 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6dda5a28-dd79-4212-83da-fc5226a90f79"
msgid "\"How is the General?\""
msgstr "\"장군은 어떻습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3a138ed3-5c45-48c0-b964-de671234e018"
msgid "\"Am I invited to your wedding?\""
msgstr "\"저도 결혼식에 초대해줄 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "11497633-574d-4435-8e3b-afc7eda648dc"
msgid "\"Too much magic madness in the area, don't you think?\""
msgstr "\"이곳엔 미친 마법적인 광기가 넘쳐나는군, 그렇지 않소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2f9f580d-4c30-47c2-84fd-4e4f36828991"
msgid "\"Everything is clear. Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"모든 게 명확해졌군요. 고맙습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "be80f34b-3fbb-4536-bad4-e321eff5dd7f"
msgid "\"How is the General?\""
msgstr "\"장군은 어떻습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "6d80b120-754b-47a3-aa47-48ff3a867c05"
msgid ""
"{n}For the first time since being saved from Vordakai, Maegar seems back to "
"his old self.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}!\""
" {n}He greets you warmly.{/n} \"Allow me to thank you once again for your "
"help with Lostlarn Keep! I think you should know what really happened down "
"in that dungeon. A curious picture is beginning to emerge from what I've "
"learned from the General, and from Cephal.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이에게서 구출된 후 처음으로 메이가르는 옛 모습을 되찾은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}"
"그는 당신을 따뜻하게 맞이합니다.{/n} \"로스틀란 성채의 일을 도와준데 대해 다시 한 번 감사를 표하게 해주십시오! 제 생각에는 "
"각하께서 지하 감옥에서 일어났던 진정한 일들에 대해 알아야 할 것 같습니다. 장군과 케팔로부터 내가 알아낸 수상한 정황이 드러나기 "
"시작했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "95609cf5-e95d-4743-830e-7f3d5bd11363"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar frowns, and looks as if he hasn't slept for a few nights.{/n} \""
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, thank you again for "
"agreeing to help. I never imagined that the story with my people and "
"Lostlarn Keep would end this way... but it's better than uncertainty. I "
"would like to share the story of the dungeon with you. It's mostly "
"information I got from Cephal after he returned to Varnhold, along with a "
"few of my own speculations based on our expedition.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 얼굴을 찡그립니다. 마치 며칠 밤을 못 잔 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 도움에 다시 "
"한 번 감사드립니다. 저의 백성과 로스틀란 성채의 이야기가 이렇게 끝날 줄은 몰랐군요... 하지만 불확실게 두는 것 보다는 낫겠죠. "
"각하와 지하 감옥에 대한 이야기를 나누고 싶습니다. 케팔이 반홀드로 돌아온 후 얻은 정보 대부분과, 우리 원정에 근거한 제 나름대로의 "
"추측도 몇 가지 포함해서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "1271df3e-8343-4e11-bd4f-e3158b27efe9"
msgid ""
"\"I think we should blame him, the Horned Hunter, for what happened to my "
"people. Turning a loyal companion into a monster, to be unleashed upon "
"former friends. – This is a cruel joke indeed. I greatly regret falling for "
"the stupid prank, running into the portal and leaving them alone there...\" "
"{n}Varn clenches his fists.{/n} \"There is much I would say to this 'joker'."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"뿔난 사냥꾼, 그자가 모든 일의 원흉이라 생각합니다. 충성스러운 동료들을 괴물로 만들어 서로를 공격하게 만들다니. 무슨 이따위 농담이 "
"있답니까? 몹시 후회하고 있습니다. 어리석은 장난에 속아, 동료들을 남겨둔 채 홀로 포탈에 뛰어들지 않았더라면...\"{n}반은 주먹을 "
"움켜쥡니다.{/n} \"이 '광대'놈에게 해줄 말이 많아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "bb93b7d6-1db3-4ed3-9402-fd75bb48d9e6"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe the Horned Hunter is responsible for the General's disappearance? "
"It's a nasty joke, and he is called the Horned Hunter for a reason – he "
"needs his prey. I was a fool to fall for his trickery and leave my people "
"there... helping neither them nor Varnhold in the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"장군의 실종은 뿔난 사냥꾼이 벌인 일일 수도 있지 않겠습니까? 고약한 장난이군요. 그가 뿔난 사냥꾼이라 불리는 건 다 이유가 "
"있습니다. 사냥꾼은 사냥감이 필요한 법이지요. 전 그의 수작에 넘어가 제 백성들을 남겨두고.... 결국 동료들도, 반홀드도 돕지 "
"못했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "a80f357e-ab9b-49ae-a0fe-21a0615116db"
msgid ""
"\"This place used to be a Taldan castle, until the fey arrived. The "
"sorceress who lived there summoned a being from the First World, who cursed "
"and imprisoned her, then sank the entire castle under the ground and "
"transformed it into an entertainment arena. The being called itself the "
"Horned Hunter, but none of who have heard this story can even vaguely "
"imagine what he really is. Not even that Taldan sorceress, who Cephal talked "
"to before he was driven from the dungeon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 페이가 나타나기 전까진 탈도르 인들이 성채로 쓰던 곳입니다. 그곳에 살던 소서리스가 태초 세계의 존재를 소환했습니다. 그 "
"존재는 그녀를 저주하고 투옥한 후 성 전체를 땅속에 가라앉혔지요. 그리고 그곳을 지하 투기장으로 만들어버렸습니다. 이 존재는 스스로를 "
"뿔난 사냥꾼이라 자칭합니다만, 이 소문을 전해들은 사람 중 그 누구도 그자의 정체가 무엇인지 전혀 아는 바가 없다더군요. 케팔이 던전으로 "
"쫓기기 전에 얘기를 나눈 탈도르 소서리스마저도 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "286bf660-5427-49c8-b8a4-6fe99998180f"
msgid ""
"\"As for the Horned Hunter... he appeared in person before the General, and "
"played a cruel joke, forcing the General to become the 'eternal guardian' of "
"Varnhold, to fight tirelessly for days.\" {n}Varn's eyes flare up grimly.{/n}"
" \"He also claimed that it was he who deluded Willas Gunderson, and sent him "
"to Vordakai's tomb. I'd like to find that worm and discuss his sense of "
"humor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뿔난 사냥꾼으로 말할 것 같으면... 그는 장군 앞에 홀로 나타나 잔인한 농담을 늘어놓고 반홀드의 '영원한 수호자'가 되어 쉼없이 "
"싸우라며 강요했습니다.\"{n}반의 눈빛이 무섭게 타오릅니다.{/n} \"또한 윌라스 건더슨을 속여 보다카이의 무덤에 보낸 것도 모두 "
"자신이라고 하더군요. 이 벌레 같은 놈을 찾아서 놈의 유머감각에 대해 한 소리 해주고 말 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "0d13c81a-b71d-4852-aaf3-fd92a2490002"
msgid ""
"\"Fortunately or not, the Horned Hunter is no longer in the dungeon, and the "
"portal to the First World has been closed. I think this is where the story "
"of Lostlarn Keep ends.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다행인지 불행인지, 뿔난 사냥꾼은 이제 이곳에 없고 태초세계로의 포탈은 닫혔습니다. 로스틀란 성채 이야기가 결말에 이른 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "93179e54-c1b7-40e0-bdca-f8997e840a25"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar smiles.{/n} \"I certainly hope so! I haven't talked to her about "
"it yet. The moment isn't right. I'm not yet done apologizing for being taken "
"in by the fey's deceptions, and leaving them in the dungeon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"바라는 바입니다! 아직 그녀에게 얘기하진 않았습니다. 때가 좋지 않으니까. 페이의 기만에 속아서 "
"백성들을 던전에 버려둔 일에 대한 속죄는 아직 끝나지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "60e6db35-67aa-40c1-bb86-2572fb434b2e"
msgid ""
"\"Not fully recovered yet. – We've no expeditions and adventures planned for "
"the immediate future. But I'm seeing to the recovery process. Making myself "
"useful.\" {n}Maegar makes a helpless gesture.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"완전히 복구되진 않았습니다 – 지금 당장은 원정이나 모험이 계획된 바 없소만 복구 작업에 참여하고 있지요. 쓸모있는 사람이 되려고 "
"노력중입니다. \" {n}메이가르는 어쩔 수 없다는 몸짓을 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "923d400b-f4ba-49dc-af65-dbdbd0abac5e"
msgid ""
"\"It's so strange...\" {n}Maegar says pensively, as if half to himself.{/n} "
"\"Varnhold was to be the place where I could finally settle down, and cast "
"in my lot with someone. I thought the life of a mercenary to be unsuitable "
"for love. I thought that once I had land, a house, a title – then I could "
"find happiness and true companionship. But now that I've lost everything, "
"I'm starting to understand how wrong I was.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거참 모를 일이군...\"{n}메이가르는 생각에 잠겨 반쯤은 자신에게 얘기하듯 말합니다.{/n} \"반홀드는 내가 마침내 정착해 "
"누군가와 운명을 함께할 곳이었습니다. 용병의 삶은 사랑에 어울리지 않다고 생각했으니까. 땅, 저택, 작위를 가진 후에야 행복과 진정한 "
"연인을 찾을 수 있다고 생각했습니다. 허나 모든 걸 잃은 지금, 그게 얼마나 잘못된 생각이었는지 알 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "23c4a0ae-2c11-4312-8068-37da36d10a58"
msgid ""
"\"I no longer have a title nor lands, but I do have a woman I love, and that "
"is all I need to be happy. Never again will I have to turn my back on her "
"and step into a demon's portal. It would be nice to travel back a few years "
"and tell my former self, 'What are you doing, fool? Act now, it's no use "
"waiting!' But alas, the past is the past, though we carry its lessons "
"through our life. At least in my case everything ended well. Thanks to you, "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이젠 작위도 땅도 없지만 사랑하는 여인을 곁에 두었고 그것으로 충분히 행복합니다. 다시는 그녀를 저버리고 악마의 포탈에 발들이는 일은 "
"하지 않을 겁니다. 몇 년 전으로 돌아가 내 자신에게 '뭐하는 거야, 너 바보야? 당장 실천하라고, 기다려봐야 소용없어!'라고 "
"얘기해줬으면 좋으련만. 아, 과거는 과거일뿐, 인생을 통해 얻은 교훈을 짊어지고 살아야겠지요. 적어도 제 입장에선 결국 모든게 잘풀렸으니 "
"말입니다. 이 모든 것이 전부 도와주신 덕분입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "20f48923-ae3b-4660-aa33-5a5b72b10e1a"
msgid ""
"\"I owe you. Again. And again I don't know how to repay you, except with my "
"loyalty and service – which you already have of course.\""
msgstr "\"다시금 신세를 졌습니다. 이번에도 제 충성과 봉사말고는 이 은혜를 갚을 길이 없군요 - 둘 다 이미 갖고 계십니다만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "d0fff6d3-a2e4-4b16-963d-c6904e5c4c8d"
msgid ""
"\"These are the Stolen Lands.\" {n}Maegar chuckles gloomily.{/n} \"There's "
"good reason that not a single kingdom has survived here for thousands of "
"years. Becoming barons here was some luck, wouldn't you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이래야 도둑맞은 땅답지.\" {n}메이가르가 침울하게 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n} \"여기서 수천 년 동안 단 하나의 왕국도 살아남지 못한 "
"데는 그럴 만한 이유가 있지요. 여기서 남작이 된 것은 꽤 운이 좋았습니다. 그렇지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "50480b3c-46fa-4a3e-b01c-b96e2abde13f"
msgid ""
"{n}For the first time since being saved from Vordakai, Maegar seems back to "
"his old self.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}!\""
" {n}He greets you warmly.{/n} \"Allow me to thank you once again for your "
"help with Lostlarn Keep! I think you should know what really happened down "
"in that dungeon. A curious picture is beginning to emerge from what I've "
"learned from the General, and from Cephal.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이에게서 구출된 후 처음으로 메이가르는 옛 모습을 되찾은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}"
"그는 당신을 따뜻하게 맞이합니다.{/n} \"로스틀란 성채의 일을 도와준데 대해 다시 한 번 감사를 표하게 해주십시오! 제 생각에는 "
"각하께서 지하 감옥에서 일어났던 진정한 일들에 대해 알아야 할 것 같습니다. 장군과 케팔로부터 내가 알아낸 수상한 정황이 드러나기 "
"시작했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "f48f9f69-343e-4613-aaf7-310a43e4a4a0"
msgid ""
"\"I think we should blame him, the Horned Hunter, for what happened to my "
"people. Turning a loyal companion into a monster, to be unleashed upon "
"former friends. – This is a cruel joke indeed. I greatly regret falling for "
"the stupid prank, running into the portal and leaving them alone there...\" "
"{n}Varn clenches his fists.{/n} \"There is much I would say to this 'joker'."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"뿔난 사냥꾼, 그자가 모든 일의 원흉이라 생각합니다. 충성스러운 동료들을 괴물로 만들어 서로를 공격하게 만들다니. 무슨 이따위 농담이 "
"있답니까? 몹시 후회하고 있습니다. 어리석은 장난에 속아, 동료들을 남겨둔 채 홀로 포탈에 뛰어들지 않았더라면...\"{n}반은 주먹을 "
"움켜쥡니다.{/n} \"이 '광대'놈에게 해줄 말이 많아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "3f4d774a-cfae-4610-b0c1-abef95df532e"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe the Horned Hunter is responsible for the General's disappearance? "
"It's a nasty joke, and he is called the Horned Hunter for a reason – he "
"needs his prey. I was a fool to fall for his trickery and leave my people "
"there... helping neither them nor Varnhold in the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"장군의 실종은 뿔난 사냥꾼이 벌인 일일 수도 있지 않겠습니까? 고약한 장난이군요. 그가 뿔난 사냥꾼이라 불리는 건 다 이유가 "
"있습니다. 사냥꾼은 사냥감이 필요한 법이지요. 전 그의 수작에 넘어가 제 백성들을 남겨두고.... 결국 동료들도, 반홀드도 돕지 "
"못했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnExplains/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Capital
msgctxt "d722065d-ca53-426f-8e59-d97b421c747f"
msgid ""
"\"As for the Horned Hunter... he appeared in person before the General, and "
"played a cruel joke, forcing the General to become the 'eternal guardian' of "
"Varnhold, to fight tirelessly for days.\" {n}Varn's eyes flare up grimly.{/n}"
" \"He also claimed that it was he who deluded Willas Gunderson, and sent him "
"to Vordakai's tomb. I'd like to find that worm and discuss his sense of "
"humor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뿔난 사냥꾼으로 말할 것 같으면... 그는 장군 앞에 홀로 나타나 잔인한 농담을 늘어놓고 반홀드의 '영원한 수호자'가 되어 쉼없이 "
"싸우라며 강요했습니다.\"{n}반의 눈빛이 무섭게 타오릅니다.{/n} \"또한 윌라스 건더슨을 속여 보다카이의 무덤에 보낸 것도 모두 "
"자신이라고 하더군요. 이 벌레 같은 놈을 찾아서 놈의 유머감각에 대해 한 소리 해주고 말 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/0BarkIfSaved_String
msgctxt "800413c7-233f-4c62-af7e-38f7bb1e74c2"
msgid ""
"\"I was disappointed that I missed battling the cyclops lich who decimated "
"Varnhold. But look – I still have a chance to join the fray!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드를 망쳐놓은 사이클롭스 리치와 싸우는 것을 놓쳐서 아쉽군요. 하지만 보십시오! 전 아직 싸울 수 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/0BarkIfSaved_after_String
msgctxt "e92d6420-ad28-401a-8110-5b73decf5f46"
msgid ""
"\"The lich seems even more dead than before, although that scarcely seems "
"possible...\""
msgstr "\"이 리치는 전보다 더 죽은 것처럼 보이는군요, 말은 안 되지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/1GeneralShowsUp_general_String
msgctxt "f349ab8e-ff2d-40b3-9b40-92b1c51c646a"
msgid ""
"\"Your face, commander! You didn't expect to see your General again, did you?"
"\""
msgstr "\"표정관리좀 하세요, 대장! 당신의 장군을 다시 볼거라곤 생각 못했나보죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/2GeneralShowsUp_varn_String
msgctxt "c71cb099-71db-4508-8af3-d69c602095a5"
msgid "\"I can't believe it! You...\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없군! 넌...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/3GeneralShowsUp_general_String
msgctxt "fb9bd959-19c1-4082-bcdd-3454f2b388ed"
msgid ""
"\"Save the talk for later! The shadow of a cyclops lich is lurking here. I "
"never got a chance to fight him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대화는 나중에 해요! 사이클롭스 리치의 그림자가 아직 이곳에 도사리고 있으니까요. 그와 싸울 기회를 이번에도 놓칠 순 없죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/4GeneralShowsUp_general_String
msgctxt "84f420d6-737a-4b3e-b94b-2774f2ebc1cd"
msgid "\"Let's go. For Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"가자. 반홀드를 위해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralBetrays_1general_String
msgctxt "76345910-b847-463c-9b49-8ba71e15bfb0"
msgid ""
"\"You didn't expect this, did you, commander? You see, my new patron, let's "
"call him the Horned Hunter... promised Varnhold to me.\""
msgstr "\"이런 상황은 생각 못했나보군요, 사령관? 보다시피, 내 새 후원자인 뿔난 사냥꾼이 내게 반홀드를 주기로 약속했거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralBetrays_2general_String
msgctxt "5b5c932e-0790-4ee4-8486-efc130b00bc8"
msgid ""
"\"And I will get it, and perhaps more besides. And the shadows from the Cup "
"will help me do it.\""
msgstr "\"난 기꺼이 받아들일 거예요, 그에 따를 더한 보상도. 그리고 잔으로 부터 나온 그림자들이 날 도울꺼에요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralExplains_1varn_String
msgctxt "91def508-ef28-4d59-925b-3c2084a8f2bb"
msgid ""
"\"What are you doing here? We searched the entire dungeon and found no trace "
"of you!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어요? 당신 흔적을 쫓으려고 지하 감옥을 다 뒤졌다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralExplains_2general_String
msgctxt "82b8af27-1b17-429a-9545-6af40b594ce1"
msgid ""
"\"It's a long story, but the Horned Hunter, that monster who toyed with us "
"in Lostlarn Keep, is the very same creature that now torments the kingdom.\""
msgstr "\"긴 얘기지만, 로스트란 요새에서 우릴 가지고 놀았던 뿔난 사냥꾼은 바로 이 왕국에 고통을 일으키는 이와 동일한 존재에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralExplains_3general_String
msgctxt "0705d5bd-07cd-4983-8cd5-15637270752f"
msgid ""
"\"The Lantern King. He failed to trick me, but he managed to cast me into "
"the depths of the First World. It's not so easy to find one's way out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 등불왕이죠. 그는 날 속이는 덴 실패했지만, 대신 태초 세계 심부로 날 던져버릴 능력은 있더군요. 빠져나오기가 그리 쉬운 곳은 "
"아니죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralExplains_4general_String
msgctxt "a91a6ded-babb-40bf-bc44-a5fd5aa5727b"
msgid ""
"\"But since the First World has come knocking on the gates of our home, I "
"managed to find a way to sneak out. And so here I am, eager to get even with "
"that jester.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 태초세계와 물질계를 잇는 관문이 열려서, 나는 어떻게든 슬그머니 빠져나갈 방법을 찾아냈어요. 그래서 여기 왔고, 그 광대놈에게 "
"간절하게 앙갚음하고 싶네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/VarnholdFWBarks/GeneralExplains_5general_romance_String
msgctxt "c40ffb8d-cce9-4fb4-8350-f1c995343cc3"
msgid "\"I missed you, Maegar.\""
msgstr "\"보고 싶었어요, 메이가르.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a66e7c7a-cfd7-47bc-b1cb-1f0a0d701437"
msgid "\"What is this person of special value you mentioned?\""
msgstr "\"당신이 특별하다고 말한 이 사람은 어떤 사람이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "71ed46ad-aff9-4297-878c-1e753d608f7d"
msgid "\"I will do what I can. Where is this dungeon?\""
msgstr "\" 내가 할 수 있는 일은 해 보죠. 이 지하감옥이 어디있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "79ab6cb3-1f9d-4674-83b5-262b0d8289a4"
msgid "\"I won't do it.\""
msgstr "\"난 안 할 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "bde1c331-d391-4516-b20c-b18cad2cc97c"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! I know I already "
"owe you so much, and shouldn't bother you with any further requests – and I "
"would hold my tongue if only my own interests were on the line. However this "
"matter I need help with involves the fate of my people, and a certain person "
"of special value to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 제가 이미 당신에게 많은 빚을 졌고, 더 이상 당신을 귀찮게 해서는 안 된다는 것을 알고 "
"있습니다. 저 혼자만의 이익만 걸려 있었다면 저도 잠자코 있을 것입니다. 그러나 제 도움이 필요한 이 문제는 제 백성의 운명과, 제게 "
"특별한 가치를 지닌 어떤 사람의 운명과 관련이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c89b487e-985e-46f2-9c3f-45bec5e5641b"
msgid ""
"\"You see, when strange events started to occur in Varnhold and its "
"environs, we started our own investigation. We discovered a certain "
"mysterious dungeon – the locals say it was the tomb of an ancient creature "
"of great power. Alas, this turned out to be a false lead, and the dungeon "
"was a trap. Meanwhile, the real Vordakai continued to commit outrages in his "
"real tomb, and then attacked Varnhold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알다시피, 반홀드와 그 주변 지역에서 이상한 사건들이 일어나기 시작했을 때, 우리는 자체 조사를 시작했습니다. 우리는 어떤 불가사의한 "
"지하감옥을 발견했지요 – 현지인들은 이 지하감옥이 거대한 힘을 가진 고대 생물의 무덤이라고 말합니다. 아아, 이것은 거짓으로 유도한 "
"것으로 판명되었고, 그 지하감옥은 함정이었습니다. 한편 진짜 보다카이는 자신의 진짜 무덤에서 계속 잔악무도한 일을 저지르고 나서 반홀드를 "
"공격했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "5ec4ddd0-de36-45eb-81cc-df475ea2418c"
msgid ""
"\"As fate would have it, at the moment of the magical attack on the town, a "
"party of my people was inside this false dungeon. And I have yet to learn "
"anything of their fate. This is my request: help me go down into the "
"dungeon, and find out what happened to my people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행히도, 마을에 마법이 덮친 순간, 이 가짜 지하감옥 안에 내 백성들이 있었습니다. 그리고 나는 아직 그들의 운명을 알지 못합니다. "
"한 가지 부탁을 하자면, 내가 이 지하감옥으로 내려가서, 내 백성들에게 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알도록 도와 주셨으면 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "54c44e84-2924-415a-8465-c2ee9413189c"
msgid ""
"\"My General and my right hand.\" {n}Maegar grows grim.{/n} \"To think that "
"I, as a leader, brought trouble upon my most loyal people. To be honest, I "
"don't believe I'll find them alive. But I must at least try to find out what "
"happened there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 오른팔이자 장군입니다.\"{n}메이가르는 울적해합니다.{/n} \"생각해보면 가장 충실한 이들을 곤궁에 쳐하게 한 건 지도자인 "
"나의 탓입니다. 솔직히 말해 그들이 살아있을 거라 생각지는 않습니다. 하지만 적어도 무슨 일이 있었는지는 반드시 알아내야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "88cb9b4b-3781-464f-8111-7dee29fe55ea"
msgid ""
"\"The woman who I hope may become my wife.\" {n}Maegar's eyes grow dark, "
"giving away a storm of hidden emotions.{/n} \"She led the party that "
"disappeared into the dungeon. My 'brilliant' orders landed her in trouble, "
"and I still don't even know what happened down there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠간 나의 아내가 되길 바랬던 여인이지요.\"{n}메이가르의 눈엔 감춰졌던 감정의 폭풍이 드러나며 어둠이 감돕니다.{/n} \"그녀는"
" 지하감옥으로 실종된 일행들을 이끌던 사람이었습니다. 저의 '기발한' 명령이 그녀를 곤경에 빠뜨렸는데, 전 아직도 그 아래에서 무슨 일이 "
"일어났는지도 모릅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "efca6aeb-36f8-43f5-9a72-82c2ce96cfe6"
msgid ""
"\"I will mark it on a map.\" {n}Maegar nods shortly and gratefully.{/n} \"I "
"will meet you on the road, if you decide to go. Thank you, {mf|Your Grace|"
"Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. This mission... is very important "
"to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지도에 표시해 드리지요.\" {n}메이가르는 감사를 표하며 고개를 끄덕입니다. {/n} \"가시겠다면 그곳으로 향하는 길에서 "
"뵙겠습니다. 감사합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 이 일은... 내게 매우 중요합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b90225a9-b230-4e74-9142-90173f3e05cf"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar frowns, but answers calmly in a neutral tone.{/n} \"That is your "
"right. I cannot leave this issue unattended, and will try to organize an "
"expedition into the dungeon on my own. But I won't disturb you with this any "
"further. Have a good day, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 인상을 찌푸리지만 감정없는 어조로 태연히 대답합니다.{/n} \"어찌 결정하건 그건 당신의 권리이겠지요. 하지만 난 이 "
"문제를 좌시할 수 없습니다. 나 스스로 원정대를 조직해 던전으로 갈 겁니다. 더이상 당신에게 불편을 끼치지 않겠습니다. 좋은 하루 "
"되십시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/ForMainGame/ktc-VarnLostlarn/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "2138b5e0-8f4e-4224-8be1-3b129e0fc92b"
msgid ""
"\"My General and my right hand.\" {n}Maegar grows grim.{/n} \"To think that "
"I, as a leader, brought trouble upon my most loyal people. To be honest, I "
"don't believe I'll find them alive. But I must at least try to find out what "
"happened there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 오른팔이자 장군입니다.\"{n}메이가르는 울적해합니다.{/n} \"생각해보면 가장 충실한 이들을 곤궁에 쳐하게 한 건 지도자인 "
"나의 탓입니다. 솔직히 말해 그들이 살아있을 거라 생각지는 않습니다. 하지만 적어도 무슨 일이 있었는지는 반드시 알아내야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "005521b0-9a24-4a6e-bfe2-e58d84f8a163"
msgid "[Look closer at the traveler]"
msgstr "[여행자를 유심히 살펴본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "364e3f30-cc57-4091-835a-c02765879748"
msgid ""
"[Stealthily draw Cephal and Maegar's attention, and nod towards the bracelet]"
msgstr "[은밀하게 케팔과 메이가르의 이목을 끌고 팔찌 쪽으로 고개를 끄덕인다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "66b8f092-d1d8-41dd-be45-9cea190c76b5"
msgid "[Try to determine the origin of the bracelet]"
msgstr "[팔찌의 출처를 알아본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "813d8b5d-112d-455d-b7fe-feb32a22ae25"
msgid "\"Enough small talk! Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"잡담은 그만! 이제 가요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "5f9a6c45-e5bc-4ac6-8bc5-8378f40701e4"
msgid ""
"[Give the traveler a particularly interested look] \"Willas, aren't you, em, "
"cold in those clothes? Not that I don't enjoy the view...\""
msgstr ""
"[여행자에게 특별한 관심이 있는 듯한 모습을 보입니다] \"윌라스, 당신, 음, 그렇게 입고 있으면 춥지 않나요? 보기 나쁘다는 건 "
"아니지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "f45edac8-7df8-41e8-8a00-8d4d624367ff"
msgid ""
"\"So you're an antiquity specialist, Sir Gunderson? That bracelet you're "
"wearing is certainly ancient, isn't it?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 당신은 골동품 전문가란 말이군요, 건더슨 경? 당신이 차고 있는 그 팔찌, 정말로 오래된 물건 아닌가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "b135ab33-0650-4ec7-97bd-1a79928990fe"
msgid ""
"\"So, my friend. Why don't you tell us about that bracelet you're wearing. "
"You wouldn't lie to the Baron and his men, would you?\""
msgstr "\"그러니, 친구. 당신이 차고 있는 팔찌에 대해 얘기해 주는 게 어때요. 남작과 그 수하들에게 거짓말 할 생각은 아니겠죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "54c115ce-6042-49e3-9088-050935087bb9"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like the way you're fidgeting, lad. Tell me where you got the "
"bracelet or else.\""
msgstr "\"입고 있는 차림새가 맘에 안드는데요, 친구. 어디서 팔찌를 얻었는지 얘기해봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "f5793814-11d8-458f-97f0-85dfd6f0e6f3"
msgid ""
"\"So you are a specialist in antiquities? What a coincidence, I am also "
"quite interested in them.\""
msgstr "\"골동품 전문가라고요? 이런 우연의 일치가, 나도 그쪽엔 좀 관심이 있거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "db51dd0f-89f8-464a-8aea-18749b1a4c6d"
msgid ""
"\"I suspect that Gunderson lied about finding it by the river. He'd clearly "
"been wandering for days – through dungeons, by the look of him.\""
msgstr "\"강가에서 팔찌를 찾았다는 건 거짓말 같아요. 모양새를 보면 던전에서 몇일간 떠돌아 다닌게 분명해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "dc09b960-78a3-41ba-ba9d-eb969010bfa2"
msgid ""
"\"The bracelet is an ancient cyclops relic. It doesn't take a specialist to "
"see that.\""
msgstr "\"이 팔찌는 고대의 사이클롭스 유물이예요. 전문가가 아니라도 알아볼 수 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "ef72576e-00aa-439a-977e-d3484107688f"
msgid ""
"\"The lad finds an ancient cyclops relic in a dungeon, runs out with a "
"zombie cyclops at his heels. I see no mystery in what happened here...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 친구는 던전에서 고대 사이클롭스 유물을 발견하곤 사이클롭스 좀비에 쫓겨서 발에 불이 나게 달아난 거예요. 불보듯 뻔하죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "bdbb5ec0-d25f-4a8f-9045-8340512e1973"
msgid "\"Shall we go then?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이제 갈까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "ee636a67-8467-49eb-bb93-3a9e3271b405"
msgid "\"These are my claws. I do whatever I want with them.\""
msgstr "\"이건 내 발톱이예요. 내 마음대로 할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "98d0fb0b-02e8-4306-a39a-303387198649"
msgid ""
"\"And my daring companions are trying to avoid 'claws' at all costs...\""
msgstr "\"내 용감한 동료들이 '발톱'을 쓰지 않으려고 무진 애를 쓰고 있지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Barks/GundersonBark_Running_String
msgctxt "c53cefc1-1c04-49d5-bc5e-b5632c8518de"
msgid "\"Get your paws off me, carrion!\""
msgstr "\"그 발 치워, 이 짐승같은 놈아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "739b2cb3-e0ef-4e35-ab1d-5355ee13b99e"
msgid ""
"{n}The man you've just saved catches his breath and smiles brightly, as if "
"he hadn't just been zigzagging away from his pursuers. His clothing and "
"equipment are an odd mix of quality, durable items and pompous, decorative "
"elements. Even his shirt seems cut specially to provide an unobstructed view "
"of his chest, which is adorned with two golden chains.{/n} \"Baron Varn, "
"Your Grace! What fortune meeting you here. Until now, I've met only "
"unpleasant guests on my morning escapades…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 방금 구한 남자는 호흡을 고르더니, 방금 전까지 추적자들에게 쫓겼던 사람이 아닌 듯 밝게 웃습니다. 그의 의복과 장비들은 질 "
"좋고 내구성이 좋은 물건과 화려하고 장식적인 요소들이 이상하게 뒤섞여 있습니다. 심지어 그의 셔츠도 특별히 두 개의 황금 사슬로 장식되어 "
"있는 것이 가슴이 드러나게 특별히 재단된 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"반 남작, 전하! 여기서 만나뵙다니 이런 행운이. 지금까지, 오전 "
"동안의 탈출 내내 불쾌한 손님들만 만났거든요…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "b718cecb-5a03-4fdf-a4a1-507e7478e12a"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar smiles warmly at the stranger, and extends his hand in friendship, "
"as to an equal. He also stands in such a way as to capture the stranger's "
"attention, while not blocking your view, or Cephal's.{/n} \"Greetings! And "
"you are...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 낯선 이방인을 향해 따뜻하게 미소짓고, 똑같이 우호의 손길을 뻗습니다. 그는 또한 당신, 또는 케팔의 시야를 막지 "
"않으면서도 이방인의 주목을 끌수 있도록 자리를 잡고 섭니다.{/n} \"반갑소! 그리고 당신은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "a5648161-75d5-4bd4-b3eb-aaa94f5a43e4"
msgid ""
"\"Willas Gunderson, Your Grace!\" {n}Apparently flattered by the attention, "
"the peculiar man strikes a proud pose.{/n} \"Scientist, traveler, and "
"researcher of antiquities. At your service!\""
msgstr ""
"\"윌라스 건더슨입니다, 전하!\" {n}관심을 끈 것에 분명히 우쭐해하는 듯 하면서 그 특이한 남자는 자랑스러운 포즈를 취합니다.{/n}"
" \"과학자이자 여행자, 고대유물 연구가. 당신의 명을 받들겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "352f96ac-a182-494f-b019-02b4aebbf834"
msgid ""
"\"It is a pleasure to see that my barony attracts such educated people. And "
"it is most regrettable that they must face such difficulties.\" {n}Maegar "
"nods towards the dead – now entirely dead – cyclops.{/n} \"Where did that "
"creature come from?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 영지가 그런 교양있는 이들의 관심을 끄는 것을 보니 기쁘군. 그리고 이런 자들이 그러한 어려움에 직면해야 한다는 것은 크게 "
"유감스러운 일이네.\" {n}메이가르는 이제 완전히 죽어버린 사이클롭스를 향해 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"저 생물은 어디서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "f5551313-705b-42a2-895c-ba22f7783f3e"
msgid ""
"\"I've no idea!\" {n}Willas' voice seems tranquil.{/n} \"I was enjoying the "
"view and taking notes when an ill-mannered simpleton stepped into my light. "
"I politely asked him to step aside and allow me to finish, but he wouldn't "
"listen. And when I turned around, I knew he couldn't have, for zombies have "
"as much reason as manners!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠습니다!\" {n}윌라스의 목소리는 평온하게 들립니다.{/n} \"경치를 즐기며 메모를 하는데 버릇없는 얼간이가 내 눈 앞에 "
"들어왔습니다. 저는 정중하게 그에게 옆으로 비켜서서 제 일을 끝내도록 부탁했지만 그는 들으려 하지 않았습니다. 그리고 돌아섰을 때, 저는 "
"그가 그럴 수 없다는 것을 알았지요. 좀비들은 그들의 예절 수준 정도의 이성밖에 없으니 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "88b85c59-e52b-44d2-bab8-f5911afd10ea"
msgid ""
"{n}While Maegar entertains the traveler in conversation, you carefully "
"examine his gear and clothes. The first thing that strikes your attention is "
"an intricate yellowish jade bracelet on his wrist. You can tell by his "
"ragged state that Willas has been on the road for at least a few days, and "
"indeed, from all appearances, mostly off road.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 여행자와 대화하며 여흥을 즐기는 동안 당신은 여행자의 장비와 옷을 주의 깊게 살펴봅니다. 가장 먼저 눈에 띄는 것은 "
"손목에 찬 복잡한 무늬의 노란 옥팔찌입니다. 또한 남루한 복장으로 보아, 윌라스는 적어도 여러 날 노숙한 것 같습니다. 도로를 따라 "
"여행했다고는 볼 수 없는 행색이었기 때문입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ceb4a16f-8220-4f70-af1d-b25114352944"
msgid ""
"{n}You study the traveler while Maegar entertains him in conversation, and "
"sense there's something unusual about his gear and clothes. But your "
"examination yields nothing you can use. The one detail that captures your "
"attention is the yellowish jade bracelet on Willas' wrist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 여행자의 대화를 즐기는 동안 당신은 여행자를 연구하고, 그의 장비와 옷에 뭔가 특이한 점이 있다는 것을 포착합니다. "
"하지만 당신의 조사는 쓸만한 결과를 얻지는 못했습니다. 시선을 사로잡는 한 가지 요소는 윌라스의 손목에 채워진, 노랗게 빛나는 "
"옥팔찌입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "534f5913-2568-4c13-9f68-8913f9a50c97"
msgid ""
"{n}The bracelet looks carved of a whole piece of jade, of unusual hue. Even "
"from a distance you can see the patterns that decorate it, obviously signs "
"of the relic's origin. This item came from the ancient cyclops empire. But "
"what is it doing here, and how did this hapless traveler acquire it?{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}팔찌는 온전한 옥조각 전체를 조각한 것 같으로 평범하지 않은 빛깔을 띱니다. 멀리서도 그것을 장식하는 무늬를 볼 수 있는데, 분명히 "
"유물의 기원을 나타내는 표식들입니다. 이 물건은 고대 사이클롭스 제국으로부터 온 것입니다. 그런데 그것은 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거고, "
"그리고 이 불운한 여행자는 어떻게 그것을 얻었을까요?{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6b3771c1-55c0-4a21-afd3-63ea09e4caac"
msgid ""
"{n}The examination yields nothing. – The bracelet looks expensive and "
"ornate, but that's all there is to it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}검사는 아무 성과가 없습니다. – 팔찌는 비싸보이고 화려해 보이지만, 그뿐입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "7d133da0-c48e-4d16-a22a-3a00373858ab"
msgid ""
"{n}The gray wizard, listening closely to the conversation, notices your "
"gesture, casts a quick glance at the bracelet and then nods.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}회색 마법사는 대화를 자세히 듣고 있다가 당신의 몸짓을 알아차리고는, 팔찌를 재빨리 훑어보고 나서 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f76c0db4-ac82-4a27-b98a-03c60a3afbe3"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now this cyclops is much more polite, isn't he?\" {n}Maegar falls "
"quiet for a moment, allowing you to add a few words to the conversation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄, 이제 이 사이클롭스들이 훨씬 더 정중하군. 그렇지 않소?\" {n}메이가르는 잠시 말을 멈추고 당신으로 하여금 대화에 몇 마디 "
"첨언토록 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "296a1b46-1592-4621-bdff-e698d28670b6"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, you {mf|tiger|tigress}! We barely saved the lad, and you're "
"already sinking your claws into him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}, 이 {mf|호랑이 같은 친구야|암호랑이 같으니}! 우리는 간신히 그 청년을 구했는데, 너는 벌써 그 청년에게 발톱을 "
"들이대고 있군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "40fcb50b-c0c1-492e-888c-137b6dc9c756"
msgid ""
"\"And such wickedly sharp claws... anyone would be smitten!\" {n}Willas "
"Gunderson returns your interested look, obviously flattered by your "
"attention.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 그렇게 사악하게 날카로운 발톱이라면...... 누구라도 크게 깨지겠군요!\" {n}윌라스 건더슨은 분명하게 당신의 관심에 "
"우쭐해하며 흥미롭다는 표정으로 바라보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "3b426901-3d56-4b2c-8cff-5a7a5d477257"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! Would you like to look at an amusing item from my collection?\" "
"{n}Willas takes off the bracelet and presents it to you, while carefully "
"standing so the light flatters him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론이죠! 제 수집품 중 가장 재미있는 물건인데 한 번 보시겠습니까?\" {n}윌라스는 팔찌를 벗어서 당신에게 건넵니다. 동시에 빛이 "
"자신을 조명하게끔 조심스럽게 자세를 취합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "8cce8977-3688-4bd8-8275-a55f6d3a25a7"
msgid ""
"\"This knickknack is my latest find. I... I found it on the river shore. It "
"would seem the water washed it out of some ancient burial mound! No doubt it "
"is very ancient, and may have serious scientific value. I haven't dated it "
"precisely yet. You must understand such things take time... But I swear, "
"Desna herself guided my hand!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 장신구가 내가 가장 최근에 찾은 물건입니다. 강가에서 찾았죠. 고대 무덤에서 물이 그것을 씻어낸 것처럼 보이더군요! 딱 봐도 매우 "
"오래되었고, 엄청난 과학적 가치를 가지고 있을 겁니다. 아직 정확한 연대 측정은 못했습니다. 그런 일에는 시간이 걸린다는 걸 이해하셔야 "
"합니다... 하지만 맹세코 데스나께서 절 인도하신 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a7f8596f-7e98-4dcd-9e5a-d89098c8af88"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar approaches and pats the lad on the shoulder, gently taking the "
"bracelet from Willas' hands before he can object.{/n} \"This is quite "
"interesting! The barony doesn't yet boast of its scientific achievements, "
"but I think we can find a specialist who should be able to determine the "
"bracelet's origin. If this is a precious item, your efforts in finding it "
"will be generously rewarded. Here, take this as an advance.\" {n}He takes a "
"purse from his belt and hands it to Willas.{/n} \"Where did you say you "
"found it?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 다가와 사내의 어깨를 두드리며 거부할 틈도 없이 윌라스의 손에서 팔찌를 살며시 빼냅니다.{/n} \"이건 꽤 흥미롭군! "
"우리 남작령은 아직 과학적인 성과를 뽐낼 정도는 아니지만, 내 생각에 우리가 팔찌의 기원을 파악할 만한 전문가를 찾을 수 있을 것 같군. "
"만약 이것이 중요한 보물이라면, 이것을 찾아낸 자네의 노력은 후하게 보상받을 걸세. 자, 이걸 선불로 받게.\" {n}그는 벨트에서 "
"지갑을 꺼내 윌라스에게 건네줍니다.{/n} \"자네, 그걸 어디서 찾았다고 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "c7d48faf-4f32-4bb9-a647-d9d267a0b4b4"
msgid ""
"\"By the river...\" {n}Willas seems taken aback by expropriation of the "
"bracelet, but regains his smile when he feels the weight of the purse he'd "
"just been handed.{/n} \"I'm only happy to help in any way I can, Baron Varn! "
"With your connections, we'll surely discover the origin of this find. And "
"meanwhile I may employ my time on something just as useful! Did you know "
"that besides scientific articles I also write fiction? And I cannot pass up "
"the opportunity to write about the exploits of the Varnling Host, and "
"chronicle your first steps as a baron! You wouldn't mind, would you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"강변에서입니다...\" {n}윌라스는 팔찌를 빼앗겨 당황한 것 같지만, 방금 건네받은 지갑의 무게를 느끼자 웃음을 되찾습니다.{/n} "
"\"제가 할 수 있는 어떤 방법으로든 기꺼이 돕겠습니다, 반 남작님! 남작님이 도우신다면, 우리는 반드시 이 팔찌의 기원을 찾을 수 있을 "
"겁니다. 그리고 한편으로 제 시간을 유용하게 보낼 기회가 되겠군요! 과학 논문 말고도 제가 소설도 쓴다는 거 아시나요? 반링 호스트의 "
"공훈에 대해 쓸 기회를 놓칠 수는 없죠. 그리고 남작으로서 당신의 첫걸음을 연대기로 남기는 것도! 괜찮으시겠지요, 그죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "73e5b74e-0051-411c-b3e1-07425462a2a4"
msgid ""
"\"So long as they don't ask me to sit for a portrait!\" {n}Maegar laughs "
"infectiously.{/n} \"I was born to a noble family, so my childhood was wasted "
"on sitting with my mother and brothers for a train of grand portraits. I was "
"only spared the torture after I covered my waistcoat in tar and lit my "
"pretty feathered beret on fire. So long as you'll spare me such torments, "
"Willas, I don't mind what you do. You should find someplace to settle in "
"Varnhold and get to work. I will send word when I receive news about the "
"bracelet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 내게 초상화를 그리자고 앉아 있도록 요구하지 않는 한 말이지!\" {n}메이가르의 웃음은 전염성을 띱니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"귀족 집안 출신이라 어머니와 형제들과 함께 웅장한 초상화 대열을 서느라 어린 시절을 허송세월했다네. 조끼에 타르를 끼얹고 예쁘장한 깃털이 "
"달린 베레모에 불을 붙인 후에야 그 고문을 면했지. 윌라스, 나에게 그런 고통을 주지 않는 한 자네가 무엇을 해도 상관없네. 자네는 "
"반홀드에 정착할 곳을 찾아서 할 일을 하게. 팔찌에 대한 소식이 들어오면 전갈을 보낼 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "d6f6f0f7-f2f9-41f7-994f-7b2ad28563ca"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish, Your Grace! It was a pleasure to meet you... and your "
"companions!\" {n}Willas Gunderson gives you a curious look, then turns and "
"walks off in the direction of Varnhold, still hefting the purse in his "
"hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"원하시는 대로 하겠습니다, 각하! 만나뵙게 돼서 반가웠습니다... 그리고 그 동료들도요!\" {n}윌라스 건더슨은 당신에게 의아한 "
"시선을 보내더니 곧 돌아섭니다. 그는 여전히 손에 든 지갑의 무게를 가늠해보며 반홀드 방향으로 걷습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "81ea5c24-9fc5-422f-96ec-a87bb2f37aba"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish, Your Grace! It was a pleasure dealing with you!\" {n}Willas "
"Gunderson hurries off in the direction of Varnhold.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 원하시는 대로 하겠습니다, 전하! 당신과 거래해서 즐거웠습니다!\" {n}윌라스 건더슨은 반홀드 방향으로 서둘러 "
"떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "5a1884d9-a6b1-4fc2-97c0-384f943513d6"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar follows him with his eyes for a time, then scoffs.{/n} \"That went "
"well! Of course, the lad is lying through his teeth, but we got more from "
"him than we might have hoped.\" {n}Varn looks pensively at the bracelet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 잠시 두 눈을 그에게 고정해 쫓더니 이내 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"잘 됐어! 물론 그 사내는 새빨간 거짓말을 하고 "
"있지만, 우리는 그에게서 기대했던 것보다 더 많은 것을 얻어냈어.\" {n}반은 수심어린 눈으로 팔찌를 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "b4a26680-ef25-4c5f-a115-19f5bcc2ddc0"
msgid ""
"\"Why did you invite this Gunderson to Varnhold anyway? Do we really need "
"even more foolish treasure hunters in this backwater?\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든, 왜 건더슨을 반홀드로 초대했나? 이런 후미진 곳에서 심지어 천하의 어리석은 보물사냥꾼 따위가 정말 필요한 겐가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "c5f71d73-deda-4ac8-a5cd-850a80cfea4d"
msgid ""
"\"My mercenary gut! Nine times out of ten, when my gut tells me to keep my "
"eyes peeled, the situation is about to get bad. Of course, there's always "
"the tenth time, and my gut is merely predicting a severe hangover – but I "
"don't think that's the case this time...\" {n}Maegar frowns for a moment.{/n}"
" \"Maybe Gunderson really is just a charming chatterbox, and he ran into "
"that dead cyclops by accident. And maybe this bracelet is a simple piece of "
"jewelry. But something in this story doesn't sit right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 용병으로서의 직감이지! 열에 아홉 번은, 내 직감이 눈을 떼지 말라고 할 때면 그 상황은 악화 일보 직전이오. 물론, 항상 열 "
"번째 경우라는 것도 있고, 내 직감은 그저 심각한 숙취가 올 걸 예측하는 정도야 – 하지만 이번에는 그렇지 않다고 생각하오.\" {n}"
"메이가르는 잠시 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"건더슨은 정말로 매력적인 수다쟁이일 뿐이고, 그 죽은 사이클롭스들과는 우연히 마주쳤는지도 "
"모르지. 그리고 어쩌면 이 팔찌는 단순한 보석일지도 모르고. 하지만 이 이야기 속의 뭔가가 제자리에 박힌 것 같지 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "fe42a097-71ea-40c6-9876-288fb5646642"
msgid "\"Ha! Didn't I tell you, Cephal? There's something wrong here!\""
msgstr "\"하! 내가 말하지 않았소, 케팔? 이건 뭔가 잘못됐소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "5fa06f91-0765-456f-936f-a0fcb25cce62"
msgid ""
"\"I agree. Perhaps we shall find a cyclops treasure around the corner. This "
"does not alter the fact our leader continues to leap at every shadow, and "
"makes a fool of himself for random passing strangers. Instead of focusing on "
"important matters, such as engaging in the barony's politics.\""
msgstr ""
"\"동감일세. 아마도 우리가 모퉁이 언저리에서 사이클롭스의 보물을 찾을 지도 모르지. 이 일이 우리의 지도자께서 매번 음지로 계속해서 "
"뛰어들고, 우연히 지나치는 낯선 사람들 문제로 본인을 바보로 만든다는 사실을 바꾸진 않을 걸세. 중요한 일, 가령 남작령 내의 정치 "
"문제에 집중하는 대신 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4fe509fe-c943-4c94-bcff-dedff315a2a0"
msgid ""
"\"A keen nose and an eagle eye!\" {n}Maegar pats you on the shoulder in "
"approval.{/n} \"I hope that dead cyclops is the only thing that crawled out "
"of wherever the lad stole this bracelet...\""
msgstr ""
"\"예리한 감각이군!\" {n}메이가르가 인정의 뜻으로 당신의 어깨를 토닥입니다.{/n} \"저 사내가 이 팔찌를 훔친 곳이 어디든 죽은 "
"사이클롭스들이 드러난 문제의 전부라면 좋겠군..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "902f6183-3bd1-4d1c-b78f-d532c8f24e0c"
msgid ""
"\"What a story. We've hardly solved our problems with the centaurs, and "
"we've already got a whole new riddle – and a personal chronicler along with "
"it! We should look more closely at his paltry rhymes. Cephal, take the "
"bracelet and see what you can make of it. {name}, keep an eye on our new "
"friend. Visit him in Varnhold when you have the time. Maybe you'll manage to "
"pry something else out of him. That's it, let's move!\""
msgstr ""
"\"대단하군. 켄타우로스들과의 문제도 해결하지 못했는데, 완전히 새로운 수수께끼 하나와 사설 역사가 하나도 덤으로 얻었군! 그의 "
"보잘것없는 운율을 계속 주시할 수밖에 없게 됐어. 케팔, 그 팔찌를 가져가서 뭘로 만들어 졌는지 살펴보시오. {name}, 우리의 새 "
"친구를 주시해. 시간이 나면 반홀드에서 그를 찾아. 어쩌면 네가 그에게서 다른 것을 캐낼 수 있을지도 몰라. 좋아, 움직이자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "6ead4f49-4ee2-41e6-ab56-57080f784e21"
msgid ""
"{n}The joyful mood drops from Gunderson's face. He looks at you askance, and "
"fiddles with his bracelet hesitantly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}건더슨의 얼굴에서 즐거운 기분이 비칩니다. 그는 당신의 부탁에, 팔찌를 만지작대며 머뭇거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "cca44439-14e3-43b4-9bd1-c283cfb7c7e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas frowns.{/n} \"It's only jewelry. What's the problem? Did I break a "
"rule or rob someone?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}윌라스는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그건 단지 보석일 뿐입니다. 뭐가 문제죠? 내가 규칙을 어겼거나 누군가에게 강도 짓을 "
"했습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "995d2fd6-8522-4f8c-9596-5dbe168c0ba3"
msgid ""
"\"You won't find a better specialist in ancient treasures on either side of "
"the Tors of Levenies!\" {n}Willas shows you the bracelet readily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고대의 보물들에 대해 저보다 나은 전문가는 레베니스 바위산맥의 어느 곳에서도 못 찾으실 겁니다!\" {n}윌라스는 팔찌를 선뜻 보여 "
"줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "97dc97b1-1763-4730-a1b8-c0e48e7af36f"
msgid "\"This knickknack? I don't think it's of any interest to you.\""
msgstr "\"이 잡동사니? 당신에겐 흥미를 끌게 없는 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8616c604-0a17-4a29-b988-3b688b05ea1f"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar arches his eyebrow, surprised, and looks at you with slight "
"disapproval.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 눈썹을 치켜 올리는 것이, 놀란 기색으로, 약간 못마땅한 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "232564ff-bdce-4982-b70b-cdc0c5c44122"
msgid ""
"{n}For once, Cephal expresses solidarity with his commander.{/n} \"{name}, "
"you should learn to be more subtle. As for you, Sir Gunderson, you'd better "
"stop playing games and speak plainly.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}일단 케팔은 그의 사령관에 대한 동의를 표합니다.{/n} \"{name}, 좀 더 교묘해지는 법을 배워야 하네. 자네 스스로를 "
"위해서, 건더슨 경, 장난은 그만두고 솔직히 말하는 게 좋겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "f984e850-be49-40f8-a4d7-e8a2a4218462"
msgid ""
"\"Someone is conducting a bit of theatre...\"{n} Cephal mumbles, drawing a "
"sneer from Maegar.{/n}"
msgstr "\"누가 연극이라도 하나...\"{n} 케팔이 중얼거리자 메이가르가 조소합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4fae1c96-9e3d-4e5d-9cb3-2464593da097"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar frowns at you, as if you were ruining his game. Then he turns "
"serious and looks at the traveler.{/n} \"Sir Willas. What is that bracelet "
"you're wearing?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 마치 당신이 그의 게임을 망친 듯 당신을 향해 찡그립니다. 그리고는 몸을 돌려 여행자를 진지하게 바라봅니다.{/n} "
"\"윌라스 경. 자네가 차고 있는 그 팔찌는 뭔가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "058b079e-471b-4bed-a564-fd09d237b640"
msgid ""
"{n}Gunderson grows skittish under the Baron's heavy gaze.{/n} \"I'm... em..."
"\""
msgstr "{n}건더슨은 남작의 무거운 시선에 위축됩니다.{/n} \"저는... 음...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "51809a9e-1751-4ff0-b7ef-b7dac4f7ec7e"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar follows him with his eyes for a time, then turns to you.{/n} \""
"{name}, what got into you? You only made it more difficult to get "
"information from that lad. If that went much worse, we'd have to tie him up "
"and interrogate him properly. And I'm not ready to begin my rule by throwing "
"anyone who draws suspicion into the dungeon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 한동안 눈으로 그를 좇다가 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"{name}, 왜 그랬나? 저자에게서 정보를 얻기가 더 어려워졌네. "
"잘 풀렸기에 망정이지, 안 그랬으면 그를 묶어 놓고 심문해야 했을 거야. 나는 의심된다고 모조리 감옥에 처넣는 지도자가 될 생각은 없단 "
"말이네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8ccb7aa4-d052-4e04-be95-4333c3394e06"
msgid "\"A fair reproach. I feel ashamed!\""
msgstr "\"맞는 지적이야, 부끄럽군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/GundersonSE/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e074ac55-162e-4cd1-8c10-bfb81fab6063"
msgid "\"Forgive my lack of tact. What were we talking about?\""
msgstr "\"내 요령이 부족함을 용서해 주게. 우리가 무슨 얘기를 하고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/InterchapterDLC2/DLC2_after/BookPage_0001_Title
msgctxt "2874045b-0d37-41a2-9b87-b30a38081f1b"
msgid "Varnhold's Lot"
msgstr "반홀드의 운명"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/InterchapterDLC2/DLC2_after/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0a078523-657e-4c8a-ba1c-3f5727089a1e"
msgid ""
"Even as I write these words, the Baron and all of Varnhold await news of the "
"daring General, who marched forth against a dark and mysterious threat, in "
"hopes of saving us all. The city is calm, and I would like to believe this a "
"sign that the evil has been defeated. Varn... V...\n"
"VORDAKAI VORDAKAI VORDA"
msgstr ""
"내가 이 편지를 쓰는 동안에도, 반홀드의 남작과 모두는 어둡고 신비로운 위협에 맞서 전진한, 용맹한 장군의 소식을 기다립니다. 우리 "
"모두를 구해주기를 바라면서. 도시에는 정적이 감돌고 있습니다. 나는 이것을 악이 패배했다는 징조로 믿고 싶습니다. 반... 바... \n"
"보다카이 보다카이 보다ㅋ"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/InterchapterDLC2/DLC2_before/BookPage_0001_Title
msgctxt "03b35cd7-0307-4369-8dfd-606bc362ff25"
msgid "Varnhold's Lot"
msgstr "반홀드의 운명"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/InterchapterDLC2/DLC2_before/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3b9614a6-13b3-4cad-9a15-c93986c7782c"
msgid ""
"There are some stories that resemble the last, fleeting beam of sunlight, as "
"the sun sets in the fog. It gleams and disappears, leaving perhaps a bright "
"trace in someone's memory. One such story is of a town called Varnhold. And "
"I, an author still unknown to you, shall convey it in every truthful and "
"exciting detail!"
msgstr ""
"안개 속에서 해가 지기 직전, 잠깐 동안 비치는 햇살을 닮은 이야기가 있습니다. 반짝이다 사라지지만, 누군가의 기억 속에 밝은 흔적을 "
"남기는 그런 이야기... 이 이야기는 반홀드라는 마을에 대한 이야기입니다. 아직 여러분은 잘 모르시겠지만, 저는 작가로서 이 진실되고 "
"흥미로운 이야기를 세세하게 전해드리도록 하겠습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/InterchapterDLC2/DLC2_timeskip/BookPage_0001_Title
msgctxt "d3e96c4f-f7f4-4861-81df-c877f88b130b"
msgid "Varnhold's Lot"
msgstr "반홀드의 운명"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/InterchapterDLC2/DLC2_timeskip/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "bfd6087d-0cf2-44a3-a3dd-9fe1d0994280"
msgid ""
"After a daring raid into the lands of the wild centaurs, Baron Varn and his "
"companions returned home. And I, Willas Gunderson, had the honor of "
"accompanying them! A time of peace has come at last. Varnhold greets one "
"serene dawn after another. But in this dark land, I dread to think what "
"awaits us..."
msgstr ""
"야생 켄타우로스의 땅으로의 대담한 습격 이후, 반 남작과 그의 동료들은 집으로 돌아왔습니다. 그리고 나 윌라스 건더슨은 그들과 동행하는 "
"영광을 누렸죠! 마침내 평화의 시대가 왔습니다. 반홀드가 평온한 여명을 맞고 있습니다. 하지만 나는 이 어두운 땅에서, 우리를 기다리고 "
"있는 것을 생각하면 두려움을 느낍니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Centaur_1_String
msgctxt "5cbc161d-9240-4219-8054-d7748a4c0bd9"
msgid "\"I don't care who you are! You're finished!\""
msgstr "\"네가 누군지는 관심없다! 넌 끝났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Centaur_2_String
msgctxt "2bb218f2-f810-47da-bf12-d587e7a70de6"
msgid "\"Hundreds of years of lies... You'll pay!\""
msgstr "\"수백 년의 거짓말들... 넌 그 대가를 치를 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Centaur_3_String
msgctxt "c08d78e7-2a54-4e3a-aae2-27238b3d592c"
msgid "\"Our eternal nightmare ends today!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 영원했던 악몽은 오늘로 끝난다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Centaur_Victory_String
msgctxt "c05f86a7-5ce5-4c09-a60a-ffb3b401178f"
msgid "\"We need to dress our wounds. Go, we're right behind you!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 상처를 치료해야 합니다. 가세요, 바로 뒤 따라 가겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Cultist_1_String
msgctxt "9eef6ddf-f896-46d5-886f-5e331b91cee9"
msgid "\"Get out of our way! The divine gift is awaiting us!\""
msgstr "\"내 앞을 막지 마라! 신성한 선물이 우리를 기다리고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Cultist_2_String
msgctxt "d8d7aade-1ce6-4430-9666-9ea282808ea8"
msgid "\"This is all just a test! We will show what we are worth!\""
msgstr "\"이건 모두 시험일뿐입니다! 우리는 스스로의 가치를 보여줄 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Cultist_3_String
msgctxt "e887d0d6-201d-4018-a646-9e74b1f26cd0"
msgid "\"Master, do not leave your loyal servants!\""
msgstr "\"주인이시여, 당신의 충성스러운 종들을 버리지 마소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_Cultist_Victory_String
msgctxt "445e1cab-c3f1-4c5c-bdb1-6850fc14bc34"
msgid ""
"\"Praise the Master! We won! We'll catch our breath and keep going. Onward "
"towards his gift!\""
msgstr "\"주인님을 찬양하라! 우리가 이겼다! 우리는 숨을 고르고 계속 나아갈 것이다. 그의 선물을 향해 나아가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_fooled_Cent_String
msgctxt "f267d7f9-7dc0-4ecc-b3cc-3d52669d0b48"
msgid ""
"\"Impossible! This must be a cyclops trick! Let's push forward and dispel "
"this devilry!\""
msgstr "\"이럴 수는 없어! 이건 사이클롭스의 속임수임에 틀림 없다! 앞으로 나아가서 그 악마를 물리치자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Ally_fooled_Cult_String
msgctxt "d4e46c78-3914-4e95-9acd-1be02dd37c2f"
msgid ""
"\"This cannot be! The Master is just testing us! Do not falter, faithful "
"ones!\""
msgstr "\"이럴 리가 없어! 주인님이 우리를 시험하고 계실 뿐이다! 주저하지 마라, 신실한 자들아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Cephal_First_Flower_1_String
msgctxt "84d32164-931a-4fe5-a831-3bb74b8d46b2"
msgid ""
"\"A most peculiar plant. Everything in this place is imbued with magic, but "
"nothing near as much as this flower.\""
msgstr "\"아주 특이한 식물이군. 이곳의 모든 것에 마법이 부여되어 있지만 이 꽃만큼 많이 된 건은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Cephal_First_Flower_2_String
msgctxt "16fb2f9b-01c7-46e1-b75a-52de6eed5c8c"
msgid ""
"\"I am not yet sure what exactly all this greenery does, but one thing is "
"certain – it did not come from our world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아직 이 모든 녹지가 정확히 무슨 작용을 하는지 확신할 수 없지만, 한 가지는 확실하지 – 그것은 우리 세계에서 온 것이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Cephal_Forcefield_String
msgctxt "688b3fd2-0dd2-40e2-96ca-5efcaa7ba156"
msgid ""
"\"There is no way we can dispel this barrier. We need to find a way to "
"disable it. I suggest searching around these portals — they clearly have a "
"common power source.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 장벽을 해제할 수가 없군. 이걸 무력화할 방법을 찾아야 하네. 이 포탈 주변을 수색할 것을 제안하지. 분명 공통의 동력원이 있을 "
"걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Cephal_no_teleportation_1_String
msgctxt "71a5859b-5113-4534-ba56-8c2aebfcdf87"
msgid ""
"\"Some strange magic permeates this dungeon. Let me check what is "
"happening...\""
msgstr "\"이 지하감옥에는 뭔가 이상한 마법이 서려 있네. 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 확인해 보겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Cephal_no_teleportation_2_String
msgctxt "c3c29cdc-5dcc-434e-bcbc-6be5275c04ef"
msgid ""
"\"So... I see! The masters of this place can cast teleportation spells here, "
"but not the guests. Be careful!\""
msgstr "\"보자... 그렇군! 이곳의 주인들은 여기에서 순간이동을 시전할 수 있지만, 방문자들은 그렇게 할 수 없네. 조심하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Fake_Adventurers_1_String
msgctxt "7e26d3b3-daec-44d0-9f10-647609622a6b"
msgid ""
"\"What a bother! We are heroes! It is our job to desecrate tombs! How are we "
"supposed to work if there are no tombs!?\""
msgstr "\"정말 귀찮군! 우린 영웅이야! 무덤을 터는 게 우리 일이야! 무덤도 없이 어떻게 일을 해!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Fake_Adventurers_2_String
msgctxt "29f17225-b7d4-4e7f-826c-fcfb8c837c93"
msgid ""
"\"And why is there a river under the ground? Are there fish in it? What "
"about mermaids? I'll go look for the mermaids!\""
msgstr "\"그런데 왜 지하에 강이 있지? 안에 물고기가 살까? 인어는? 내가 인어들을 찾아오지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Fake_Adventurers_3_String
msgctxt "dd110f19-4c4d-4f59-9c3c-3e4e1ffa1025"
msgid ""
"\"Hush, focus! I will cast a spell, and find us something to rob or "
"desecrate!\""
msgstr "\"쉿, 집중해! 일단 마법을 걸고, 훔칠만한 걸 찾아볼 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Fake_Adventurers_4_String
msgctxt "fd8995a5-f46d-48bb-b98c-82eaf20a2e32"
msgid ""
"\"You can't cast spells, you're a barbarian! Where is the wizard? Don't we "
"have a wizard in our party?\""
msgstr "\"넌 마법을 걸 수 없어, 넌 바바리안이잖아! 마법사는 어디 있지? 우리 일행에는 마법사가 있지 않았던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Fake_Adventurers_5_String
msgctxt "f6e16849-855a-40ec-91b6-2afae858d14c"
msgid "\"We heroes are all such exceptional fools!\""
msgstr "\"우리 영웅들은 모두 정말 특출난 바보들이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Horror_room_1_String
msgctxt "69e0c714-0e16-455b-a5ab-2d27039322af"
msgid ""
"This room smells like disaster. The books on the shelf tremble and shake, "
"and the letters of the titles spell out threats."
msgstr "이 방에서는 재앙의 냄새가 납니다. 선반 위의 책들은 떨리고 흔들리며, 제목의 글자들로부터 위협이 느껴집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Horror_room_2_String
msgctxt "ba2ef7c9-1324-4b3a-9104-a5c4c7865464"
msgid "The patterns on the carpet shift subtly and unpredictably."
msgstr "카펫의 무늬가 미묘하고 불규칙적으로 바뀝니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Horror_room_3_String
msgctxt "de371005-82fe-45ac-94cd-20450e9ca722"
msgid "The chair creaks as if someone invisible sits on it."
msgstr "의자가 투명한 누군가 앉아 있기라도 한듯 삐걱거립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Horror_room_4_String
msgctxt "81c01b6b-a0d1-4faf-a737-065551eed6da"
msgid ""
"A child's laughter sounds from under the bed, then ends abruptly with a "
"creepy sob."
msgstr "한 아이의 웃음소리가 침대 밑에서 들려오다가 갑자기 소름끼치는 흐느낌으로 끝납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/LK_betray_String
msgctxt "208c2d76-d89f-40e9-8d39-662972d18f2d"
msgid ""
"\"Now what should I do with you, friends of the betrayer? You've outlived "
"your usefulness. Neither {mf|he|she} nor I have any need of you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"배신자의 친구들, 이제 어떻게 하면 좋을까? 넌 네 쓸모보다 오래 살았어. {mf|he|she}나 나나 더이상 네가 필요없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/LK_flee_String
msgctxt "2017981e-463f-4463-ad11-071798e6a2e4"
msgid ""
"\"But I shall keep your friends here. You've paid for your cowardice with "
"their lives.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 네 친구들은 여기에 두겠다. 네 두려움 때문에 그들의 목숨을 지불했군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Making_Illusions_1_String
msgctxt "5cae523c-34a2-49df-bcbd-a0aa3a694645"
msgid ""
"\"All art is illusion, but not every illusion is worthy of being called "
"art...\""
msgstr "\"모든 예술은 환상이지만, 모든 환상이 예술이라고 불릴 가치가 있는 건 아니지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Making_Illusions_2_String
msgctxt "51426a35-460e-482e-84f8-c77c680d7375"
msgid "\"Hey, servants! Those were wise words. Someone write that down!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 하인들! 그건 격언이었어. 누가 받아 적어봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Making_Illusions_3_String
msgctxt "4c6841ec-c380-477d-ad8d-43e63b5ef560"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, my illusions are the art of the highest order. Those "
"cyclopes... Oh, I do love them so much!\""
msgstr "\"물론 나의 환상은 최고 수준의 예술이지. 저 사이클롭스들... 오, 난 저들이 정말 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Prisoner_Ankou_String
msgctxt "42576e14-ba36-4f25-993b-37bf1a0a6690"
msgid "A starved monster devours you with its fiery eyes."
msgstr "굶주린 괴물이 불타는 눈으로 당신을 집어삼킵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Prisoner_Daeva_Freed_String
msgctxt "9d64fc94-9001-4191-a6c5-5e72f3593578"
msgid "\"Free... May Sarenrae bless you!\""
msgstr "\"자유... 서렌레이가 당신을 축복하기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Prisoner_Daeva_Imprisoned_String
msgctxt "a6233964-a3c1-44be-b8e4-ca0fe7821fe2"
msgid ""
"\"People... People! For the mercy of Sarenrae, I beg you, set me free!\""
msgstr "\"여러분... 여러분! 서렌레이의 자비로, 부탁입니다, 절 풀어주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Prisoner_Nightmare_String
msgctxt "855d928a-b6e8-4bbc-a79f-5718511ec539"
msgid "The infernal horse is watching you intently through the magic barrier."
msgstr "그 지옥의 말은 마법의 장벽 너머로 당신을 강렬하게 쳐다봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Redcap_ambush_1_String
msgctxt "cb215762-99a5-40be-9213-3ace67e17da5"
msgid "\"A-a-ah!!! Did not expect this?!\""
msgstr "\"아, 아, 아!!! 이럴 줄 몰랐나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Redcap_ambush_2_String
msgctxt "f51e3752-5adc-432e-923e-a16d54b450a0"
msgid "\"Slaughter the outsiders! Cut them to ribbons!\""
msgstr "\"이방인들을 죽여라! 저들을 갈기갈기 찢어 버려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Redcap_ambush_3_String
msgctxt "615540ba-9739-456e-b741-ef14cd8b7554"
msgid "\"Death to the mortals!\""
msgstr "\"필멸자들에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_Provocation_a1_String
msgctxt "63b927cd-fb54-46ab-a01d-c41d8502b614"
msgid ""
"\"Are you looking for a gift from your god? What if it's been under your bed "
"all this time?\""
msgstr "\"네 신의 선물을 찾고 있나? 지금껏 네 침대 밑에 있었다면 어쩔래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_Provocation_a2_String
msgctxt "47e1472b-deaf-4f20-bc42-b126b8138454"
msgid "\"You won't lead me astray! I will destroy you! I'll pass the test!\""
msgstr "\"넌 나를 잘못된 길로 꾀어낼 수 없어! 난 널 부숴버릴 거다! 이 시험을 통과할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_Provocation_a3_String
msgctxt "17ecec26-e826-43c2-9e58-e2043b9e0bd4"
msgid ""
"\"... and he vanished. What was that about being led astray? He should have "
"watched his step!\""
msgstr "\"... 이러고 사라지네. 잘못된 길로 이끌려간다는 게 뭐였지? 자기 발걸음이나 조심할 것이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_Provocation_b1_String
msgctxt "d5784730-86fb-491b-82ee-656b875bfba9"
msgid ""
"\"Now, where is the cyclopes king? Maybe over there? Or right here? Or maybe "
"he doesn't exist at all!\""
msgstr "\"자, 사이클롭스 왕은 어디 있지? 아마 저쪽? 아니면 여기? 아니면 어디에도 없을지도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_Provocation_b2_String
msgctxt "36aaad2a-98c8-47c0-b0dc-c13366c8aefb"
msgid "\"You won't fool me! Begone!\""
msgstr "\"넌 날 속일수 없어! 사라져 버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_Provocation_b3_String
msgctxt "07073d5f-e321-4dac-9c81-3af0c949f17f"
msgid ""
"\"You won't fool me! Begone!\"\n"
"\"... she said, mere moments before I fooled her again. Oh, mortals, mortals!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 날 속일수 없어! 사라져 버려!\"\n"
"\"... 내가 그녀를 또 속이기 직전에 그녀가 말했지. 오, 필멸자여, 필멸자여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_7_NEW_String
msgctxt "64d736a3-7be6-4c9a-be7d-429e15325ea7"
msgid ""
"\"And here comes the dessert! How delightful! Come, my sweet: I cannot wait "
"to taste your dying pain!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 여기 디저트가 왔군! 이렇게 즐거울 데가! 이리 와, 귀염둥이. 네 죽음의 고통을 맛보고 싶어서 참을 수가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a1_String
msgctxt "c2a30620-874f-4a4e-a3af-c73e30ac4349"
msgid ""
"\"You lying monster! You tricked me into stepping through the portal, but "
"you can't defeat me! The Master sent you to test my faith!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 거짓말쟁이 괴물아! 날 속여서 포탈로 들어오게 만들었을지언정, 날 이길 순 없어! 이건 주인님께서 내 신앙을 시험하려고 널 보내신 "
"거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a2_String
msgctxt "2835f2cb-2942-4957-abac-edde9baf157f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you do have so much faith! Too bad you don't have the brains to match!"
"\""
msgstr "\"오, 참 대단한 믿음이군! 그에 걸맞는 두뇌가 없다니 안됐군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a3_String
msgctxt "fb6b65ed-0045-40c8-935e-52bb71b7d864"
msgid ""
"\"It's been a long, long joke... And you're the punchline! Laugh it up!\""
msgstr "\"긴, 아주 긴 농담이었는데... 그리고 니가 그 펀치라인이야! 웃어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a4_String
msgctxt "ee7e0694-3a06-4a0c-ade6-7b02bd65ee59"
msgid "\"Stop talking! Begone!\""
msgstr "\"얘기는 그만! 꺼져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a5_String
msgctxt "25aac752-73ae-46d0-b140-d56edcaf345b"
msgid "\"Master... I let you down...\""
msgstr "\"주인이시여... 딩신을 실망시켜 드리고 말았습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a6_String
msgctxt "a144b0a8-f808-4cb7-927b-9c478ef3f122"
msgid ""
"\"Such sweet anguish! – A rich, sweet-scented bouquet, with notes of despair!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이토록 달콤한 고통이라니! – 절망의 빛을 띤, 풍성하고 달콤한 향기의 꽃다발이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_a7_String
msgctxt "2b3466f5-23a3-481b-a3b0-4e3e49a3eb28"
msgid "\"And what will your dying pain taste like? Let's find out!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 네 죽어가는 고통은 어떤 맛일까? 한 번 알아보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b1_String
msgctxt "5df7a6a9-ab43-4709-acfa-601d2a3ecd33"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you see? There's no tomb, no cyclopes, no ancient evil. Nothing!\""
msgstr "\"모르겠어? 무덤도 없고, 사이클롭스도 없고, 고대 악도 없다. 아무것도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b2_String
msgctxt "05f45f05-7093-4bf4-a11f-c4eb04731795"
msgid ""
"\"It's been a long, long joke... And you're the punchline! Laugh it up!\""
msgstr "\"긴, 아주 긴 농담이었는데... 그리고 니가 그 펀치라인이야! 웃어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b3_String
msgctxt "ffda9cd0-35a6-405a-9ec3-4ee3ef9f5ca5"
msgid ""
"\"At least there is one ancient evil here – and today I will destroy it!\""
msgstr "\"고대의 악이 적어도 여기 하나는 있군- 그리고 오늘 내가 그 악을 부숴버릴 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b4_String
msgctxt "614f03c7-de09-45aa-a34b-28090e4b5bc8"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Try it!\""
msgstr "\"하하하하하! 어디 해봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b5_String
msgctxt "ef88b762-877e-480d-ba2e-fa0260dfcac8"
msgid "\"Everything... Everything was in vain...\""
msgstr "\"모든 게... 모든 게 다 헛수고였다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b6_String
msgctxt "9e3155ea-f797-4f57-a40c-f0d4ae00b329"
msgid ""
"\"What's the proper name for horse meat? Hoofbeef? Ah, who cares! We're "
"having a dunceflesh stew tonight, my dear!\""
msgstr "\"말고기 이름이 뭐지? 발굽고기? 아, 무슨 상관이야! 우리 오늘 밤 멍청살 스튜를 먹을 거야, 자기!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Ally_vs_Wisp_b7_String
msgctxt "72f62b1e-2f0d-40bc-92d9-45b686c9dc47"
msgid "\"And now... Hello, dessert!\""
msgstr "\"자 이제... 안녕, 내 디저트야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Vs_Wisp_no_Ally_1_String
msgctxt "0a0daaf8-a9d3-4a1d-88b5-22ddce48bad9"
msgid ""
"\"What did you expect to find here? Riches? Power? Answers? Chocolate "
"eclairs, perhaps?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭘 찾을 줄 알았어? 부귀영화? 힘? 정답들? 아님, 초콜릿 에클레어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Vs_Wisp_no_Ally_2_String
msgctxt "0a54ac51-bf0d-4a1c-9caf-24aaebb0576a"
msgid ""
"\"I'll be happy to disappoint you: there's nothing here of the sort! Nothing "
"at all!\""
msgstr "\"내가 널 실망시켜서 기쁘군. 여기에는 그런 종류의 것이 아무것도 없다! 전혀!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Vs_Wisp_no_Ally_3_NEW_String
msgctxt "0df53a68-93e1-4db4-a8eb-bbc9d06d6fc6"
msgid ""
"\"All of this was just a long, long joke... And you're the punch line! Come "
"closer, let's have a laugh together!\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 건 그저 길고 긴 농담일 뿐이었지... 그리고 넌 펀치라인이야! 이리 와, 같이 웃자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Scene_Vs_Wisp_no_Ally_3_String
msgctxt "27e6ad90-e28b-4d01-8a4e-f0fd83e33f7c"
msgid ""
"\"All of this was a long, long joke... And you're the punch line! Let's have "
"a laugh together!\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 건 길고 긴 농담이었지... 그리고 넌 펀치 라인이야! 같이 웃자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Taldor_Illusion_pool_1_String
msgctxt "04ff9969-17b8-4290-9b53-1cef426cc98c"
msgid ""
"\"Glory to the Empire of Taldor, which sent us to the back of the beyond, to "
"die for nothing!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 헛된 죽음의 저 너머로 보내버린 제국, 탈도르에 영광을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Taldor_Illusion_pool_2_String
msgctxt "84e93b3a-2e18-4deb-9f79-611ebe9bf5f0"
msgid ""
"\"We are great Taldan warriors! We are like lions! We even have fleas!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 위대한 탈도르 전사다! 우리는 사자와 같다! 그래서 벼룩도 키우지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Taldor_Illusion_pool_3_String
msgctxt "0f62e928-6218-4de2-b1a2-eab54dd3ba77"
msgid "\"The armies of Taldor are invincible! Innumerable! Imbecilic!\""
msgstr "\"탈도르의 군대는 무적이다! 셀 수 없고! 멍청하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Taldor_Illusion_pool_4_String
msgctxt "f9c027b1-1eb9-4723-94f4-d92067e93c06"
msgid ""
"\"In Taldor, the streets are paved in gold! And roofs are thatched with cow "
"patties!\""
msgstr "\"탈도르의 거리는 금으로 덮여 있다! 지붕은 소고기 파이로 덮었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Taldor_Illusion_pool_5_String
msgctxt "56865d5c-32bd-4286-8f29-654a8a06ccb4"
msgid ""
"\"We are the heroes of Taldor. We heroically arrived! Dropped heroically "
"dead! And heroically decomposed!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 탈도르의 영웅이다. 우리는 영웅적으로 당도했다! 영웅적으로 몰락해 죽었다! 그리고 영웅적으로 산산조각났다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Wisp_henchman_1_String
msgctxt "001527b4-c989-48a9-92e4-5b04e8243f85"
msgid "\"The marquise sends her regards!\""
msgstr "\"후작부인께서 안부 전하신다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Wisp_henchman_2_String
msgctxt "ca7dd018-e284-471e-97a8-336bbb60c22b"
msgid "\"What a party! Let's add some fun!\""
msgstr "\"정말 대단한 파티야! 더 재미있게 해보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Wisp_henchman_3_String
msgctxt "96ed7e93-8200-4464-a836-f7a6d9bfeba5"
msgid "\"What, are you bored? Here, dance a little!\""
msgstr "\"왜, 심심해? 자, 춤 좀 추라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Wisp_summons_monster_1_String
msgctxt "07a3eb36-723d-4bcd-9243-3b7c3f25c0ff"
msgid ""
"\"My new toys, you are so much fun! I will toy with you until you break!\""
msgstr "\"내 새 장난감, 넌 정말 재미있어! 네가 부서질 때까지 갖고 놀 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Wisp_summons_monster_2_String
msgctxt "77143a9e-580b-481d-83f8-346a833a72ec"
msgid ""
"\"We've been preparing this celebration for many centuries. Ah, I am having "
"so much fun! Join us!\""
msgstr "\"우린 몇 세기 동안이나 이 기념 파티를 준비했다고. 아, 정말 재미있군! 우리와 함께해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Zone_Camp_String
msgctxt "3fda697b-b171-4def-8fa7-e2dfa47c68b4"
msgid ""
"Someone has recently set camp here, laid out sleeping bags and cooked "
"supper. It looks suspiciously cozy..."
msgstr "누군가 최근에 이곳에 캠프를 차리고 저녁을 요리했습니다. 의심스러울 정도로 아늑합니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Zone_Paintings_String
msgctxt "bbabf4b9-40ad-4f3a-843b-8c85d4280ed8"
msgid ""
"The beautiful paintings are cracked and peeling, and marred by mildew and "
"moss. Some of them feature additions made by the fey."
msgstr "아름다운 그림들에 금이 가고 벗겨졌으며, 곰팡이와 이끼가 얼룩져 있습니다. 그 중 일부는 페이의 솜씨로 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Zone_TowerGrowth_String
msgctxt "19425c17-ced7-4304-ac43-5016983ec74e"
msgid "The beautiful but creepy plants are obviously not from this world."
msgstr "이 아름답지만 으스스한 식물은 확실히 이 세상의 것이 아닙니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Zone_Tower_String
msgctxt "dbf86320-6599-4f74-b019-df71c92e13fc"
msgid ""
"The tower was well built. There are a few cracks in the brickwork, but "
"overall it's still robust."
msgstr "탑은 잘 지어졌습니다. 벽돌에 약간의 균열이 있지만, 전체적으로 여전히 튼튼합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Barks/Zone_Treasury_String
msgctxt "39a999bf-188d-4803-a20a-77f33dd49283"
msgid ""
"What was once a treasury has turned over the ages into a pile of moldy "
"rubbish."
msgstr "한때 보물들이었던 것들이 오랜 세월을 거쳐 곰팡이 핀 쓰레기 더미로 변모했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Buff/No_dimension_door_description_String
msgctxt "408f8eb6-e8d0-4378-95ed-f3acf4273548"
msgid "Using the dimension door spell is prohibited in this dungeon."
msgstr "이 던전에서는 차원문 마법을 사용할 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Buff/No_dimension_door_name_String
msgctxt "ff2168f5-4acf-4122-b615-194585a52702"
msgid "Astral Barrier"
msgstr "아스트랄 방벽"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Farewell/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "18c3b168-d4db-44ff-bd13-f291ad85d2e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Cephal's magic carries his voice to your ears.{/n} \"I fear I have "
"overestimated the stability of vaults... Oh, what point is making excuses! – "
"I overestimated myself. I am sorry, my friend. I let you down. You will have "
"to go on without me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케팔의 마법이 그의 목소리를 당신에게 전합니다.{/n} \"금고의 안정성을 과대평가한 것 같군... 오, 변명이 무슨 소용이겠나? -"
" 나 자신을 과대평가했네. 미안하네, 친구. 내가 당신을 실망시켰군. 나 없이 계속 가야 할 것 같네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Farewell/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c4d91870-d580-4bdc-927e-e450ed9efb7a"
msgid ""
"\"I will return to Varnhold for reinforcements at once. We will try to dig "
"out the passage. But don't wait for us. Keep going, to the very depths! Find "
"out what secrets this dungeon stores! Perhaps at the bottom you will find "
"the key to saving all of us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 즉시 반홀드로 돌아가 지원군을 요청하겠네. 그 통로를 파낼 수 있도록 노력해 보지. 하지만 우리를 기다리진 말게. 계속 가게, "
"아주 깊은 곳까지! 이 지하감옥이 어떤 비밀을 감췄는지 알아보게! 아마 밑바닥에서 우리 모두를 구할 수 있는 열쇠를 찾을 수 있을 게야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Farewell/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2a80d416-3385-4f2b-a817-c97d1196b787"
msgid "\"Good luck. But not good-bye. So long!\""
msgstr "\"행운을 비네. 작별은 아니네만, 일단 잘 있게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "86830e66-044d-4f96-b4ce-2cae47754584"
msgid "\"What do you find so strange about this place?\""
msgstr "\"이곳의 뭐가 그렇게 이상하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "23318719-6cea-48cd-9ca3-1343a3a6d1b9"
msgid "\"Cast your spells, and open the passage!\""
msgstr "\"마법을 걸고, 통로를 열어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "6d31ebfc-6b4b-41ef-9228-a0af5de5fb3b"
msgid "\"Let's not touch the flower for now.\""
msgstr "\"당분간 꽃은 손대지 말죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "897ee024-7f5f-4e5d-b1c2-b0a570ccfa20"
msgid ""
"{n}The old wizard examines the flower, mumbling some spells. His face is a "
"strange expression of surprise, admiration and incomprehension.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}늙은 마법사는 꽃을 살펴보고, 주문을 읊습니다. 그의 얼굴은 놀라움과 감탄, 의문이 섞인 표정을 하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "7aa4ed86-758f-495c-a966-42b2ec13563d"
msgid ""
"\"I have seen a lot in my time, but this castle is the most incredible thing "
"I have ever encountered. I understand more or less how it was created... But "
"who could have done it? And the real question – why?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 살면서 많은 것을 봤네만, 이 성은 내가 지금까지 본 것 중 가장 놀라운 곳이군. 이곳이 어떻게 만들어졌는지 어느 정도 이해는 "
"하겠네만... 대체 누가 이런 것을 할 수 있었을까? 그리고 진짜 질문은 - 왜 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "392931a7-3acb-4216-9a06-ab0ec82c041a"
msgid ""
"\"What an impossible place! If we survive this, we shall have to return here "
"and examine everything carefully!\""
msgstr "\"정말 불가해한 곳이군! 우리가 여기서 살아남는다면, 나중에 돌아와서 이곳의 모든 것을 세심하게 살펴봐야 할 걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "72358f7d-74d9-4c80-9186-8144aade47b7"
msgid ""
"\"This castle wasn't built as a dungeon. No, it was once an ordinary above-"
"ground stone fortress. Someone spent dozens if not hundreds of years, "
"sinking it slowly and carefully into the ground.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 성은 지하감옥이 아닐세. 아니, 한때는 지상의 평범한 성이었겠지. 누군가가, 수백 년까진 아닐 것 같고, 수십 년에 걸쳐 천천히 "
"조심스럽게 땅속에 가라앉힌 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "2c5ac8a8-5e07-4695-b0ed-2d7507391648"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, the weight of the ground would have crushed it like an egg, "
"which is why its wall had to be strengthened by magic. That is why these "
"flowers are here. – To keep the entire dungeon from crumbling!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 지반의 무게에 달걀처럼 부서질 게 뻔했을 거고, 그래서 마법으로 벽을 보강할 필요가 있던 걸세. 그래서 이 꽃들이 여기 있는 "
"거고 - 던전 전체가 무너져버리지 않게끔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "870b294f-d83e-4d73-bf3f-0618d52ad4b7"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard cracks his fingers.{/n} \"As soon as the passage opens, "
"everyone run inside. The walls are very unstable here!\""
msgstr "{n}마법사가 손가락을 꺾습니다.{/n} \"통로가 열리자마자 모두 안으로 뛰어 들어가게. 이곳의 벽은 매우 불안정해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "17f7b406-6dad-437d-ad0f-1857c851fc36"
msgid ""
"\"But tell me, who could have spent so much resources, time, effort? And "
"mask it to appear like an ordinary cyclops tomb? It would be cheaper to dig "
"a real tomb!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 대답해 보게, 누가 그 많은 자원, 시간, 노력을 들였겠나? 그리고 보통의 사이클롭스 무덤처럼 보이려고 위장을 씌운다? 차라리 "
"진짜 무덤을 파고 말지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "28582e12-1d08-4c93-a02a-5dd537727a23"
msgid ""
"\"This place is incredible. I cannot even imagine what we might find at the "
"bottom!\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 믿기 힘들만큼 훌륭하네. 밑바닥에서 뭐가 나올지 상상도 못하겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6fd42735-e18e-4b46-90f5-e5bb7b8398f2"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6754f886-ac2b-40d4-a05a-af63ebfb2349"
msgid ""
"\"However, that is not important now. We can contemplate the wonders of the "
"magical arts once we are out of danger. For now the important thing is that "
"I know how to clear the passage. I only hope I am skilled enough to keep the "
"entire building from collapsing on our heads! Tell me when you are ready, "
"and I will try to move the flower's roots and open that wall.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만, 지금 그게 중요한 게 아니지. 일단 위험에서 벗어나야 마법적 예술에 대한 경이로움도 곱씹을 수 있네. 일단 중요한 건 내가 "
"그 통로를 어떻게 치울지 안다는 걸세. 내가 이 건물을 우리 머리 위로 무너뜨려버릴까봐 겁나는군! 준비되면 말하게, 그러면 내가 꽃의 "
"뿌리들을 옮겨서 저 벽을 열어 볼 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Cephal_Leaves_Ready/Cue_0016_Text_1
msgctxt "8921f7ac-3a23-46be-be2d-06c699057aef"
msgid ""
"\"However, that is not important now. We can contemplate the wonders of the "
"magical arts once we are out of danger. For now the important thing is that "
"I know how to clear the passage. I only hope I am skilled enough to keep the "
"entire building from collapsing on our heads! Tell me when you are ready, "
"and I will try to move the flower's roots and open that wall neatly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만, 지금 그게 중요한 게 아니지. 일단 위험에서 벗어나야 마법적 예술에 대한 경이로움도 곱씹을 수 있네. 일단 중요한 건 내가 "
"그 통로를 어떻게 치울지 안다는 걸세. 내가 이 건물을 우리 머리 위로 무너뜨려버릴까봐 겁나는군! 준비되면 말하게, 그러면 내가 꽃의 "
"뿌리들을 옮겨서 저 벽을 깔끔하게 열어 볼 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "fbca41fa-639e-46ec-9c41-ba803761fc24"
msgid "\"Do you mean this isn't a cyclops tomb?\""
msgstr "\"여기가 사이클롭스 무덤이 아니라는 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "0dd4fe58-1ac7-4b7a-8ac8-6727039b1166"
msgid ""
"\"We must be careful. Who knows what else is hiding behind the illusions "
"here!\""
msgstr "\"조심해야 해요. 환상 너머에 또 뭐가 숨었는지 누가 알겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "98215658-b73a-44f6-96f4-056b2a3894e0"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Funny!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 재밌네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "fd9b7af2-1902-4008-a724-74d0985365d0"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "dfa0974a-33ed-4211-aed5-b9d6467caff2"
msgid ""
"{n}The cyclops body disappears like a ghost. Cephal frowns, and whispers a "
"spell as he looks around cautiously.{/n} \"I cannot believe...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사이클롭스의 몸이 유령처럼 사라집니다. 케팔은 얼굴을 찡그리며 조심스럽게 주위를 둘러보면서 주문을 속삭입니다.{/n} \"믿을 수 "
"없군....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "332d274a-6b6d-4a90-90a0-31c03612ed4b"
msgid "\"What does that mean? Why did he disappear?\""
msgstr "\"그게 무슨 소리야? 왜 그가 사라진 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "17aa46a8-3adb-4b06-9386-716ceda2894b"
msgid "\"What kind of a devil's spells are these?\""
msgstr "\"이건 무슨 악마의 주문인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "399a6902-7871-45c0-a27f-3fc245fc3801"
msgid "\"What is this? Where did he go? Cephal, what can you tell us?\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭐지? 어디로 갔을까? 케팔, 우리에게 뭔가 할 말이 있소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "8a4c8cca-b53a-4033-ada4-d847b3663e99"
msgid "\"There was no cyclops here. We were fighting an illusion.\""
msgstr "\"여기엔 사이클롭스가 없었어. 우리는 환상과 싸우고 있었네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Boss_CultistNecromancer
msgctxt "bb48db3e-a243-4138-b230-da0fff202a51"
msgid ""
"\"The Master must be testing us. Do not abandon hope, and his reward will be "
"ours!\""
msgstr "\"주인님이 우리를 시험하고 계신 거야. 희망을 버리지 말라. 그러면 그의 보상은 우리의 것이 될 것이다!'"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : CentaurChief
msgctxt "447380e4-04c1-4525-a994-b08054830584"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand. This tomb is full of real cyclopes. Why make illusions "
"too?\""
msgstr "\"이해할 수 없군. 이 무덤은 진짜 사이클로프로 가득 차 있어. 왜 굳이 환상을 만들지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "deecb8b0-a1b3-46b1-a16b-f18286870b73"
msgid ""
"\"This makes no sense. Was the tomb's creator unable to afford real zombie "
"guards, so he created illusions instead? I thought ancient cyclopes were "
"rich!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 말이 안 돼. 이 무덤의 제작자는 진짜 좀비 경비원을 감당할 수 없어서 대신 환상을 만들어 낸 건가? 난 고대 사이클롭스가 "
"부자들인 줄 알았는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "b44ffda4-efc3-498d-8f10-29c20129890e"
msgid "\"Quite possible. Either way, the test goes on.\""
msgstr "\"아주 말이 되네. 어느 쪽이든, 이 시험은 계속되는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "af450785-458b-4ad2-a289-90884d59664f"
msgid "\"I understand less and less. And not just about cyclopes.\""
msgstr "\"점점 이해가 안되는군. 그리고 사이클롭스만 그런 것이 아닐세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "930bbcba-e046-4344-89da-1d530abbfe71"
msgid "\"Possible! But if so, he saved on more than just guards.\""
msgstr "\"가능하지! 하지만 그렇다면 그는 단순한 경비원 이상의 것을 아낀 셈이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "9a2cbf9b-17b0-4d8f-afa8-a31c00da1194"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard touches the wall carving, and his hand passes easily through "
"the stone.{/n} \"These walls are simple decorations. Underneath them there "
"are ordinary brick walls – still ancient, but much younger than the "
"cyclopes. We are surrounded by illusions.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사가 벽 조각에 손을 대니 손이 돌을 쉽게 통과합니다.{/n} \"이 벽들은 단순한 장식일세. 그 아래에는 평범한 벽돌 벽이 "
"있어 – 물론 고대의 것이지만, 그래도 사이클롭스들보다는 훨씬 최근 것이야. 우리는 환상에 둘러싸여 있다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "6c910bf7-10c5-424a-b761-c11dbb7c418f"
msgid "\"I mean I have no idea what it is.\""
msgstr "\"내 말은 이게 뭔지 전혀 모르겠다는 뜻일세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "eef49c7c-a60d-4048-b444-0d3a1bfd42a4"
msgid "\"You're absolutely right. Did everyone hear? Keep your eyes open!\""
msgstr "\"지극히 옳은 말일세. 다들 들으셨나? 계속 눈 뜨고 주의하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "da6c1d79-7ff5-4d00-934f-07d33e0df3d1"
msgid "\"I'm glad at least some of us are in a good mood.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 우리 중 몇몇은 기분이 좋아서 다행이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Discussing_Illusions/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d5e6f597-d4bf-44eb-8565-9bcd88f6877d"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever this means, we can't turn back now. This dungeon may be even more "
"mysterious than we supposed, but we will solve all its riddles. Onward!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것이 무슨 뜻이든지 간에, 우리는 이제 돌이갈 수 없소. 이 지하감옥은 우리가 생각했던 것보다 훨씬 더 의문스러운 곳이지만, 우리는 "
"모든 수수께끼들을 풀 거요. 앞으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/FinalMessage_String
msgctxt "f5003d51-0cec-4c67-a41a-92cd829c5142"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have completed \"Varnhold's Lot\"! Pathfinder: "
"Kingmaker's main story has now been expanded with additional events. To "
"experience them, wait for an audience with Maegar Varn."
msgstr ""
"축하합니다! 당신은\"반홀드의 운명\"을 완료했습니다! Pathfinder:Kingmaker의 중심 이야기가 지금 이벤트 추가로 "
"확장되었습니다. 그것들을 체험하시려면 메이가르 반과의 공식적인 만남을 기다려 주세요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Item/Keystone_Description_String
msgctxt "87856609-ab4b-480b-830d-10739cd8b9ae"
msgid ""
"A magical stone, created by the sorceress who once ruled this castle. It "
"feels like the walls themselves resonate with the energy that pulsates "
"within it."
msgstr "한때 이 성을 지배했던 소서리스가 만든 마법의 돌입니다. 벽 자체가 그 안에서 맥동하는 에너지로 공명하는 느낌입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Item/Keystone_Name_String
msgctxt "fc953a56-b9b4-469e-a8eb-eb7d565b27e8"
msgid "Gemstone of Unseen Paths"
msgstr "비밀 통로의 보석"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Item/Notebook_Description_String
msgctxt "b3289af7-0160-4715-9c27-cdb9df2c12bd"
msgid ""
"The notebook is filled with arcane formulae, sketches and notes. The last "
"page reads:\n"
"\"Problem: the fools I summon keep trying to leave the castle, while "
"uninvited fools keep trying to sneak in.\n"
"Solution: a portal maze. A fool who doesn't know the way can keep wandering "
"forever.\n"
"Observation: fools tend to rush forward blindly. A fool might be so dazzled "
"by an opportunity right in front of him, that he would never think of "
"turning around and looking behind his back.\n"
"Amended solution: anisotropy and nonlinearity of portal pathways. A to B "
"does not mean B to A!\""
msgstr ""
"공책에는 비전(arcane)의 공식과 스케치, 노트가 가득합니다. 마지막 페이지에는 다음의 내용이 적혀 있습니다.\n"
"\"문제점: 내가 소환한 바보들은 계속 성을 떠나려 하고, 초대받지 않은 바보들은 계속 몰래 들어가려 한다.\n"
"해결책: 포탈 미로. 길을 모르는 바보는 영원히 헤멜 수도 있다.\n"
"관찰:바보들은 맹목적으로 전진하는 경향이 있다. 한 바보는 바로 눈앞의 기회에 현혹돼서, 등 뒤를 살펴볼 생각은 하지도 않는 듯하다.\n"
"수정된 솔루션: 포털 경로의 비등각성 및 비선형성. A to B는 B to A를 뜻하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Item/Notebook_Name_String
msgctxt "5189aef9-3849-4a2c-9256-56ee7b482c2b"
msgid "Wizard's Notebook"
msgstr "마법사의 공책"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0228ed51-bcc2-4031-906b-4f5ba7a6db5e"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "fa436f01-0654-46d4-a78b-66bdc9e0ab80"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"여긴 뭐하는 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a5fe041b-407c-409d-a902-342e56fcc9b5"
msgid "\"Why? What is your purpose in this?\""
msgstr "\"왜? 무슨 목적이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "06bd1e67-94c1-4a30-ac96-656d1543ae25"
msgid ""
"\"I'd believe you. The fey are famous for their evil and pointless jokes.\""
msgstr "\"널 믿겠어. 페이는 사악하고 종잡을 수 없는 농담으로 유명하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "6ab7a664-a840-4d2e-968d-b483d0dd7d32"
msgid ""
"\"I don't believe you. All of this must be part of some larger plan – the "
"details of which you've carefully hidden.\""
msgstr "\"난 널 믿지 않아. 이 모든 것이 어떤 더 큰 계획 – 네가 조심스럽게 숨겨왔던 세부 사항들의 일부임에 틀림없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "886c6ecf-761d-45db-9323-02b578e84356"
msgid "\"I don't know what to believe any more.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 뭘 믿어야 할지 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "3834a6f8-7d1b-4105-aa33-e8cc1d90cb73"
msgid ""
"\"So this tomb of the cyclops lord, and the gift of Charon – they never "
"existed?\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 이 사이클롭스 군주의 무덤과 케런의 선물 - 그것들은 존재하지 않았단 말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "95e82158-777d-4009-9a96-f0d12471cdc3"
msgid "\"What did you do to Varnhold? To my companions?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에, 내 동료들에게 무슨 짓을 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "438a4433-19c5-400e-9f6b-51d09b7f00ca"
msgid "\"You've told me about your game. So what do you want from me now?\""
msgstr "\"넌 내게 너의 게임에 대해 말했어. 그래서 이제 나한테 뭘 바라는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "3ce459ec-65ab-4b7e-a0b2-0dec8e659ccd"
msgid "[Step back to the portal] \"Do not come near, monster!\""
msgstr "[포탈 쪽으로 물러난다] \"가까이 오지 마, 괴물아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "a6c49ecf-748e-48d5-b708-27e5f56f73ae"
msgid "[Attack] \"We have nothing to talk about, monster!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"우리는 더 할 얘기가 없다, 괴물아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "846eaa1a-ccd6-4969-b70f-21dbbb681111"
msgid "\"I agree. Give me the power to protect Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"동감이야. 내게 반홀드를 보호할 힘을 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "a88fbdc5-26d7-4913-9398-bd69c54639ce"
msgid "[Enter the portal] \"I seek nothing from you. I am going home.\""
msgstr "[포털로 들어간다] \"나는 너에게 아무것도 바라지 않는다. 난 집에 갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "c2e0d481-d6ab-4d08-bbdf-674171acc336"
msgid "[Attack] \"You are a monster. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"넌 괴물이야. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "64e5d867-383a-47f4-97d9-dd66635bbf5d"
msgid "\"I agree. Give me greatness!\""
msgstr "\"동감이야. 날 위대하게 만들어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "ff39a4f7-fe3c-4bd2-b185-38414ed5c481"
msgid "\"I agree. Make me the ruler of Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"동의해. 나를 반홀드의 통치자로 만들어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "e57fecbe-170b-4079-a863-3b2a58704485"
msgid "\"Maegar Varn?\""
msgstr "\"메이가르 반?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "ab8b3300-5a04-4b87-84db-5167d6449d70"
msgid "\"Cephal Lorentus?\""
msgstr "\"케팔 로렌투스?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "40ac4e01-c70f-495c-9535-61a5a4eed6f8"
msgid "\"Willas Gunderson?\""
msgstr "\"윌라스 건더슨?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "6d747e2d-433d-421a-ac5a-1684b7117980"
msgid "\"Me?\""
msgstr "\"나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "2f0c1793-1efc-4a44-bba2-8f71f150e21f"
msgid "\"I don't know and I don't want to know!\""
msgstr "\"모르겠고 알고 싶지도 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9921e0c8-4af9-451a-88a3-38b0378c8517"
msgid ""
"{n}The monsters are dead, and the sounds of battle have faded. All you hear "
"is the blood rushing in your ears, and the rustling leaves of the unfamiliar "
"plants around you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}괴물은 죽었고, 전투 소리는 잦아듭니다. 들리는 것이라곤 귓전을 때리는 피의 맥동과 주변에 널린 생소한 식물의 바스락거리는 잎사귀 "
"소리뿐입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "faae0bee-ee56-49f2-b4dc-b46d0b76e315"
msgid ""
"{n}The silence is broken by the measured clapping of a heavy pair of hands. "
"Clapping slowly, a human-like creature enters the clearing, wearing a full "
"helmet decorated with heavy horns. You can't see his eyes, but you feel the "
"thick darkness under the helmet studying you with curiosity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}중후한 손뼉소리에 침묵이 깨집니다. 천천히 박수를 치며, 무거워 보이는 뿔로 장식된 투구를 쓴, 인간형의 생물이 빈터로 들어옵니다. "
"당신은 그의 눈은 볼 수 없지만, 헬멧 아래의 짙은 어둠이 호기심으로 당신을 살펴보고 있는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "5c75a8ce-e56d-4546-8c86-c972a4f88afc"
msgid ""
"\"Bravo. That was an exceptional victory. Not many mortals would have "
"managed to get this far – not to mention killing two of my vassals. I am "
"impressed. Such feats deserve a reward.\""
msgstr ""
"\"브라보. 아주 훌륭한 승리였다. 내 신하 두 명을 죽인 것은 말할 것도 없고, 여기까지 올 수 있는 인간도 많지 않았을 것이다. 난 "
"감명받았다. 그런 위업은 보상을 받을 만하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "2173cdf7-cb65-4bb4-939a-12e6292a35fc"
msgid ""
"\"Call me the Horned Hunter. I have other names, but today you'll have to "
"make do with that one. I am the true creator and master of this dungeon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"날 뿔난 사냥꾼이라고 불러라. 내겐 다른 이름이 있지만, 오늘은 그 이름으로 하지. 나는 이 지하감옥의 진정한 창조자이자 주인이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8d1e4126-0f53-4674-8171-a14e73b5bd19"
msgid ""
"\"Is there anything else you wish to ask me? You may do so. You have earned "
"the right.\""
msgstr "\"또 묻고 싶은 것 없나? 그렇게 해도 좋다. 너는 그럴 권리를 얻었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "9fb3f00a-2077-4f14-b825-7c7e22749087"
msgid ""
"\"We are on another plane, the world of fey. It is often called the First "
"World. Or do you mean the dungeon through which you've just passed? This is "
"Lostlarn Keep – my gate between the two worlds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 또 다른 차원, 페이의 세계에 있다. 흔히 태초 세계라고 불린다. 아니면 방금 지나온 지하감옥을 말하는 건가? 여기는 로스틀란 "
"성채 – 두 세계 사이를 잇는 나의 관문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "256850e2-7be3-453c-9cb5-5273bceb007f"
msgid ""
"\"Once it was a castle of the proud Taldan Empire. Then it became the zoo of "
"a sorceress who dreamed of other worlds. And finally it became my toy. I hid "
"it under the ground, and quietly persuaded the locals that this is the "
"resting place of their precious cyclops leader.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옛날에는 자랑스러운 탈도르 제국의 성이었다. 이후에는 다른 세계를 꿈꾸는 소서리스의 동물원이 되었었지. 그리고 마침내 그것은 나의 "
"장난감이 되었다. 나는 그것을 땅 밑에 숨겼고, 이곳이 그들의 소중한 사이클롭스 군주가 잠든 안식처라고 조용히 현지인들을 속였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ac44658a-c01b-429d-957a-87bcfaf3fb89"
msgid ""
"\"Would you believe me if I told you, I did it on a whim? As a joke? Would "
"you believe that I've been playing this game for ages, just to see the "
"expression on your face?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 말해주면 믿겠나, 이걸 그저 변덕으로. 장난 삼아 했다면? 단지 네 얼굴 표정이 어떻게 바뀔는지를 보려고 오랜 세월 이 놀이를 "
"해왔다면, 넌 믿겠니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c65aeacd-e8d6-499f-8dea-82bed2ac5f5a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, this is not at all pointless. You simply cannot appreciate the beauty "
"of the irony. The lives of mortals like you are far too short to enjoy the "
"depths of a truly epic joke!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 이건 전혀 무의미한 일이 아니야. 너는 그저 아이러니의 아름다움을 감상할 줄 모르는 거다. 너 같은 필멸자들의 삶은 진정으로 "
"서사적인 농담의 깊이를 즐기기엔 너무 짧다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "14f60e20-4f56-4d65-846d-bbff346ebaa5"
msgid ""
"\"You are so discerning! Yes, there is a larger game, and you have played "
"your part in it... Nevertheless, I do enjoy this delicious moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 아주 분별력이 깊구나! 그래, 더 큰 게임이 있지. 그리고 넌 그 게임에서 네 역할을 다했어. 그러나, 나는 이 순간을 음미하겠다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "0e2e2d3e-3eb1-4008-abc5-c4949505f305"
msgid ""
"\"Then choose insanity! If your mind has let you down, see what you can do "
"without it. Maybe then you could catch a glimpse of the depths of my joke!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면 광기를 선택하라고! 이성이 날아가 버렸을때 네가 뭘 할 수 있는지 보는거야. 그땐 내 농담의 일부나마 알아먹을지도 모르지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "c1ba76f5-ce64-4a1d-b6e0-135e2db040a9"
msgid ""
"\"My long-term plans are not so distracting that I miss the beauty of "
"fleeting events. I swear, I am enjoying this conversation like a glass of "
"thousand-year-old wine!"
msgstr "\"이 아름다운 순간을 놓칠만큼 내 계획은 허술하지 않아. 맹세컨데 나는 천년묵은 와인만큼이나 이 대화를 즐기고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "057434d9-dc52-4daf-9568-bc864d06fe53"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no! Both exist. They are not far from here – in the mountains to the "
"south-west. I'll tell you more. The dusty lich has already awakened, and the "
"hunt for his treasure begins... But alas, you will not be joining the others."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 아니야! 둘 다 존재한다. 그들은 여기서 멀지 않은 곳에 있다 – 산에서 남서쪽으로. 더 말해주지. 먼지투성이 리치는 이미 "
"깨어났고, 자기 보물을 찾기 위한 사냥이 시작된다... 아아 그러나, 너는 다른 사람들과 합류하지 못할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0023_Text_1
msgctxt "6a410135-95fb-4bb1-b6cc-bf9559f10f46"
msgid ""
"{n}The mocking voice of the Horned Hunter seems to come from nowhere.{/n} \"I"
" had hoped to reward you with a curse for good measure... But you've played "
"quite a fine joke on yourself! Safe travels! We'll see if you can find your "
"way home...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼의 조롱 섞인 목소리가 동떨어진 곳에서 들려오는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"난 네게 저주로 보답하고 싶었는데... 하지만 "
"넌 스스로에게 꽤 멋진 농담을 했구나! 안전한 여행이 되길! 네가 집으로 가는 길을 찾을 수 있다면 우리는 다시 볼 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "63db127b-cbde-4907-8796-842daea4ef00"
msgid ""
"\"Me? Nothing. That horrible vision your commander saw was merely that – a "
"vision. When he returned home, he found Varnhold safe and sound. The wizard "
"followed him. The two were about to muster a force to dig you up... But "
"suddenly changed their minds and went... elsewhere. Indeed, they've only "
"just set off. Many exciting adventures await them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가? 아무것도 안했어. 네 대장이 본 끔찍한 장면은 그저... 장면일뿐이었지. 네 대장은 집으로 돌아가서 반홀드가 안전한 걸 "
"확인했을거야.마법사가 그 뒤를 따랐지. 그 두명은 널 구하려고 사람들을 모으려 했는데... 하지만 갑자기 마음을 바꾸더니... 딴 곳으로 "
"가버리지 뭐야. 물론 그건 시작일뿐이지만. 끝내주는 모험이 그 두 명을 기다리고 있다고 !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0028_Text_1
msgctxt "311e1344-7dc7-4923-8a55-b0a97ec54b9e"
msgid ""
"{n}The mocking voice of the Horned Hunter seems to come from nowhere.{/n} "
"\"As long as there are monsters in the world, it will need a hero. As long "
"as that hero stands guard, the torrent of monsters will be unrelenting. You "
"shall defend Varnhold without rest or sleep, until the master of these lands "
"allows you to leave your post!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼의 조롱 섞인 목소리가 동떨어진 곳에서 들려오는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"세상에 괴물이 있는 한 영웅이 필요할 것이다. "
"저 영웅이 경계를 서고 있는 한, 괴물들의 격류는 그칠 줄 모른다. 이 땅의 주인이, 너희가 요새를 떠나도록 허락할 때까지 너는 쉼도 "
"잠듦도 없이 반홀드를 지키리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0029_Text_1
msgctxt "4dfe3803-1880-42cf-adf6-ac216986038a"
msgid ""
"{n}The last thing you hear is the mocking voice of the Horned Hunter.{/n} "
"\"Oh yes, you will be great. You will instill fear. I am generous! You will "
"have title and dominions! I pronounce you {mf|Marquis|Marquise} Devouratio, "
"the new master of Lostlarn Keep!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막으로 들리는 것은 뿔난 사냥꾼의 조롱 섞인 목소리입니다.{/n} \"오 그래, 넌 크게 될 것이다. 너는 공포를 심을 것이다. "
"나는 관대하다! 넌 작위와 지배권을 갖게 될 거야! 나는 너를 로스트라른 요새의 새 주인, {mf|후작|여후작} 데부라티오라고 명명하노라!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "60f34a7a-ea71-43e8-8a6a-aa75c21174d3"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't found what you seek here, but you still deserve a reward. I "
"know what it is you really want most in your heart. And I will make that "
"wish come true.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 여기서 구하던 것을 찾지 못했지만 그래도 보상을 받을 자격이 있다. 네가 진심으로 원하는 게 뭔지 알아. 그리고 그 소원을 "
"이뤄주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "ad056be1-8866-4830-8712-47629b97773a"
msgid ""
"\"How rude! Farewell, then! But be careful as you go. These portals can be "
"so unreliable. Who knows where you might end up?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 무례하군! 그렇다면 잘 가라! 하지만 갈 때 조심해. 이 포탈들은 믿을 게 못 되니까. 네가 결국 어디로 갈지 누가 알겠나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "584dd5d5-36f2-4803-b57a-675fb24b39f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Bursting into laughter, the Horned Hunter disappears. And with him – the "
"portal behind your back!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}웃음을 터뜨리며 뿔난 사냥꾼은 사라집니다. 그리고 그와 함께 – 당신 뒤의 포탈이!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "410a7ee2-2907-4a7d-948d-f73eab92f898"
msgid ""
"\"Deep down, you truly are a hero, aren't you? You don't like making deals "
"with monsters and the followers of dark gods. You seek power – but not to "
"impose your will onto others. No, you need it to destroy the monsters. Well, "
"I can grant you this power! Take it from my hand, and become the defender "
"that Varnhold deserves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너 정말 골수부터 영웅이구나, 그렇지? 넌 괴물과 악신의 추종자와 상종하고 싶지 않아. 넌 힘을 추구하지만 그 힘으로 남을 겁박하고 "
"싶어하지도 않지. 아니야, 넌 괴물을 죽이기 위해서 힘을 갈구해. 자, 내가 그 힘을 선사하지! 내 손을 잡아 그리고 반홀드가 바라는 "
"수호자가 되는거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "5dd692e5-ef5e-4572-bfd9-4aff3093a78f"
msgid ""
"\"You are not one to settle for less. You seek might, and to obtain it, you "
"are ready to go anywhere, even to the god of death! I respect this. Come, "
"take this might from my hands! Accept it, and achieve such greatness that "
"would even make this land's former masters shudder!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 적은 것에 안주할 사람이 아니다. 넌 힘을 찾고, 힘을 얻으려면 어디든 갈 준비가 되어 있다. 심지어 죽음의 신에게라도. 나는 "
"그 점을 존경한다. 오라, 내게서 이 힘을 가져가라! 그것을 받아들여. 그리고 이 땅의 옛 주인들마저 떨게 만들 위대함을 성취하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "3f20c352-9e6e-4a0f-9616-8666690b8832"
msgid ""
"\"You have served your leader long and faithfully, but you were not born to "
"serve! No, your fate is to rule. That old fool Cephal refused to overthrow "
"his pupil, but not I! I will help you get rid of Maegar Varn, and make you "
"the sole ruler of Varnhold!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 네 지도자를 오래 충실하게 섬겼다. 그렇지만 넌 섬기려고 태어난 것이 아니다! 아니, 너의 운명은 지배하는 것이다. 저 늙은 "
"바보 케팔은 자기 제자를 뒤엎길 거절했지만, 난 아니야! 메이가르 반을 제거하고, 널 반홀드의 유일한 통치자로 만들도록 내가 도와주겠다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "1ff1fe3a-813c-4716-9e76-e3074303a365"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter reaches out his hand, and you feel transported, far "
"away...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뿔난 사냥꾼이 손을 내밀자 당신은 멀리, 멀리, 전송되는 듯한 느낌을 받습니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "9dab2e7f-9ac6-46c7-ba13-7c25266e10ae"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter holds out his hand, and you're bathed in bright "
"light...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뿔난 사냥꾼은 손을 내밀고, 당신은 밝은 빛으로 휩싸입니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "f57749cd-3d1f-4ed5-9e7f-580c5984eebb"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter holds out his hand, and the world goes dark before your "
"eyes...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뿔난 사냥꾼이 손을 내밀자 당신의 눈에 보이는 세상이 어두워집니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "2dc4a6f9-04f9-4c3a-9f2f-a054862578b4"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, if only you knew what a wonderful endgame I have planned... You know "
"what? I guess there's no harm in telling you that secret as well. But first, "
"try to guess, who was the key piece in the game of chess I played at "
"Varnhold?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 내가 얼마나 멋진 마지막 판을 계획했는지 네가 알아만 준다면... 그거 알고 있나? 그 비밀도 말해서 나쁠 건 없을 것 같아. "
"그래도 우선 한 번 맞춰 봐, 내가 반홀드에서 치른 체스게임의 핵심 조각은 누구였을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "b7196a36-000d-4e1f-b1ac-731f00ad0af2"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, that's a pity. Well, this isn't the first secret I'll keep to myself.\""
"\""
msgstr "\"아아, 안됐군. 음, 이것이 내가 혼자 간직할 첫 번째 비밀은 아니다.\"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "7b3cd9dc-a0a0-4dac-9140-f2a85db761aa"
msgid ""
"\"That grey-haired queen who thinks himself a player? No. Though I do enjoy "
"his type. Both far-sighted and near-sighted. A cunning fool, busying himself "
"building houses of cards, which I do so like to blow down. Under different "
"circumstances, I might play a most interesting game with him... But this "
"time he stayed on the sidelines.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자신이 플레이어라고 생각하는 저 잿빛머리 여왕? 아니, 내가 그런 타입을 좋아하긴 하지만 너무 원시안적이면서 동시에 근시안적이야. "
"교활한 바보, 카드로 된 집을 짓느라 바빴다만, 난 그것을 날려버리는 게 좋거든. 다른 상황에서, 나는 그와 가장 재미있는 게임을 할 "
"수도 있겠지... 그러나 그는 이번에는 방관하고 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "6fd8f83a-dd87-4a07-b0ea-51533cd6b244"
msgid "\"Exactly!\""
msgstr "\"정확해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "1e5fa584-ec62-42bb-8c85-c593eba7e5aa"
msgid ""
"\"Don't flatter yourself. You are but a pawn, which got to the end of the "
"board by some chance. Truth be told, you aren't supposed to be here at all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우쭐대지 마라. 너는 일개 폰에 불과하지만, 어쩌다 보니 체스판의 끝까지 당도했다. 사실, 네가 여기 있는 건 전혀 예정에 없었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "102347b2-b6dc-490a-a9ba-ab6c18095585"
msgid ""
"\"No. On a chess board, of course, the king is more important than the other "
"pieces, but only because without him there would be no game. But he rarely "
"expresses the beauty of the game.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 물론 체스판에서는 왕이 다른 기물들보다 더 중요하지만, 그건 그가 없으면 게임이 안 되기 때문이지. 하지만 킹은 좀처럼 게임의 "
"아름다움을 드러내지 않는다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "7d4cc620-6c18-4dad-aba7-db86ed4ab3ab"
msgid ""
"\"The entire chain of events – everything that has happened and what will "
"happen – was put in motion by Gunderson. That tireless knight, small but "
"quick, keeps jumping onto squares where he's not expected!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 사건의 연쇄, 즉 일어난 일과 앞으로 일어날 일은 모두 건더슨이 주도했다. 그 지칠 줄 모르는 나이트는 작지만 재빠르게, 자신이 "
"예상하지 않은 칸으로 계속 뛰어다녔지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "af843ca3-5155-4bff-b520-3dbe9ce8d16e"
msgid ""
"\"It was I who pointed the way to the tomb of the cyclops ruler. Without me, "
"he might have wandered through the mountains for the rest of his life. I "
"summoned the darkness that opened the gates of the tomb. I led him to the "
"treasury, from which he took but one bracelet – or rather a ring – from a "
"sleeping finger. The sleeper immediately felt the thief, awoke from his "
"deathlike slumber, roused his servants and sent them forth on a chase...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사이클롭스 군주의 무덤으로 가는 길을 가리킨 것은 바로 나였다. 내가 없었다면 그는 여생을 산 속을 헤멨을지도 모른다. 나는 어둠을 "
"소환해 무덤의 대문을 열었다. 나는 그를 보물창고로 안내했는데, 그는 그 곳에서 팔찌 한 개, 아니 반지라고 해야 옳지. 잠자는 자의 "
"손가락에서 그걸 뽑아 가져갔다. 잠자는 자는 즉시 도둑의 존재를 느꼈고 죽음같은 깊은 잠에서 깨어나 하인들을 부르고 그를 쫓도록 했다..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "43305437-e2a3-4f4c-8d58-2204ed88e7b0"
msgid ""
"\"Such a knight's move would make any chess master jealous! Just don't ask "
"me why I did it, or what's going to happen next. What kind of player would I "
"be, if I revealed all my plans? But believe me, with each day, the stakes "
"rise higher, and the game grows more and more interesting!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 나이트의 움직임은 어떤 체스 고수라도 질투나게 만들었을 것이다! 내가 왜 그랬는지, 아니면 다음에 무슨 일이 일어날지 묻지 "
"마라. 만약 모든 계획을 스스로 드러낸다면 그게 무슨 선수겠나. 하지만 날 믿어라, 하루가 지날수록 판돈은 더 높이 올라가고, 경기는 더 "
"흥미로워진다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/LK_Final/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "0b73eae0-9b9f-42ac-8f89-9ad223cef7b1"
msgid ""
"{n}The mocking voice of the Horned Hunter seems to echo from nowhere,{/n} "
"\"Enjoy your reward, oh lord of nothing! My parting gift to you is solitude. "
"Will he who has betrayed twice, draw his poison from the chalice? Will he "
"find someone he can trust?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼의 조롱 섞인 목소리가 동떨어진 곳에서 메아리치는 것 같습니다,{/n} \"포상을 즐겨라! 아무것도 아닌 것들의 군주여, "
"너에게 주는 나의 이별 선물은 고독이다. 두 번이나 배반한 사람이, 성배에 독을 뿌릴 것인가? 믿을 만한 누군가를 찾아낼 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Mimic_Boss_name_String
msgctxt "e51fa075-f41b-43cc-96b9-2877c5180eb7"
msgid "Marquis Masticatio"
msgstr "마스티카시오 후작"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Mimic_DLCHero_Female_name_String
msgctxt "23e01699-d0a9-4a5a-856b-b463fff80912"
msgid "Marquise Devouratio"
msgstr "데부라티오 여후작"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Mimic_DLCHero_Male_name_String
msgctxt "549175f0-aed2-45f7-a700-7c2f43c4033f"
msgid "Marquis Devouratio"
msgstr "데부라티오 후작"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Taldor_Lady_String
msgctxt "d1656d1f-372d-449d-af72-29d5dffbd445"
msgid "Taldan Lady"
msgstr "탈도르의 숙녀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Taldor_Noble_String
msgctxt "6a001f12-f2ec-4a40-a07e-81967be54ba0"
msgid "Taldan Noble"
msgstr "탈도르 귀족"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Wisp_Boss_name_String
msgctxt "c9349343-2823-4cc7-8e3d-165874f78c3d"
msgid "Marquise Immolatia"
msgstr "화형 후작"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Wisp_Henchman_1_String
msgctxt "c63fa0ab-f532-403a-a728-d6f2b10ccb1e"
msgid "Marquise's Knight"
msgstr "여후작의 기사"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Wisp_Henchman_2_String
msgctxt "11a9e736-e9a5-4a5a-a8cc-31f7c0b6ddf0"
msgid "Marquise's Valet"
msgstr "여후작의 종자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/MonsterNames/Wisp_Henchman_3_String
msgctxt "c676903a-1af7-4a3f-8ec6-9c0e4f18ebb7"
msgid "Marquise's Jester"
msgstr "여후작의 광대"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Objects/Object_PuzzleTrigger_String
msgctxt "31d12f9c-7e46-430f-90f9-6e95968783ea"
msgid "Panel with a rune"
msgstr "룬이 새겨진 패널"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3e1d0db5-fbd6-4e99-befe-817a55466842"
msgid "\"Splitting up now is unwise!\""
msgstr "\"지금 갈라지는 건 현명하지 않아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2cb0870f-3730-4312-9ad1-7fb725c92433"
msgid "\"Go, commander. I won't let you down!\""
msgstr "\"가세요, 사령관님. 실망시키지 않을 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "8bbb627b-5d08-4031-9554-4fa9170ef8af"
msgid "\"Who are you?!\""
msgstr "\"누구냐?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1ca5cb94-75d6-4ae0-9479-adbd826462c2"
msgid "\"What have you done to Maegar?\""
msgstr "\"메이가르에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "6f9a058f-6bb1-4b83-a55c-86a62904fc92"
msgid "\"What was that, Cephal?\""
msgstr "\"뭐였죠, 케팔?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "5aedc722-9310-41e4-a291-e8f16be25d59"
msgid "\"We must return to Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 반드시 반홀드로 돌아가야 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "d8ef2b74-d94e-461e-9e58-e1b3f03aefa1"
msgid "\"We have been ordered to go onward. We must proceed.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 전진하라는 명령을 받았어요. 계속 가야 해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "f4c0cc94-034f-4a6c-85ea-496ebaa8e208"
msgid ""
"\"Varn, do not be rash. I need time to examine the portal and the magic in "
"the area. I...\""
msgstr "\"반, 경솔하게 굴지 말게. 난 포탈과 그 지역의 마법을 살펴볼 시간이 필요하네. 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "5897b80d-a029-4ec0-86ff-8d90f31153d5"
msgid ""
"\"We're out of time! The citizens of the town can still be saved, but we "
"must act at once. However, we cannot go through the portal together. The "
"greatest danger may still wait for us here, in the dungeon. You, {name}, "
"must take command of the rest of the group. Root out, at any cost, what has "
"been hiding itself away in this dungeon. Varnhold is my town, and my "
"responsibility.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간이 없어! 그 마을 시민들은 아직 구할 수 있지만, 우리는 바로 움직여야 해. 하지만 함께 포털을 통과할 수는 없다. 가장 큰 "
"위험은 여전히 여기 지하감옥에서 우리를 기다리고 있을지도 모른다. {name}, 너는 그룹의 남은 사람들을 지휘해. 무슨 수를 써서라도 "
"이 지하감옥에 숨어 있던 것을 뿌리 뽑아라. 반홀드는 내 마을이고, 내 책임이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d790af89-2042-4e27-83bf-3c8523f1fe63"
msgid "\"Alas, there is no other choice.\""
msgstr "\"아아, 다른 선택의 여지가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4c5d38c5-79ac-4653-98b8-1acd08f7df8e"
msgid "\"I know, I wouldn't be trusting in you if I thought anything else.\""
msgstr "\"알고 있어, 내가 다른 어떤 걸 생각했다면 널 믿지 않았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "78fd0f0a-ba81-4e50-8b20-a5ceb84f7ffe"
msgid ""
"{n}He looks into your eyes and lowers his voice to a whisper.{/n} \"Forgive "
"me for my doubts. You are my heart and soul. f we get out of this alive – if "
"we both overcome this disaster – then I will never let you go!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 당신의 눈을 바라보며 속삭이듯 목소리를 낮춥니다.{/n} \"널 의심한 걸 용서해줘. 너는 나의 심장이고 영혼이야. 만약 "
"우리가 살아서 이 재앙에서 벗어나면, 우리 둘 다 이 재앙을 이겨낸다면, 결코 너를 놓치지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a35680f9-0379-4f49-8d4a-bb8a8a1841f6"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar leans forward, and kisses you like there will be no tomorrow. Then "
"he turns away sharply and dashes into the portal.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 내일이 오지 않을 것처럼, 앞으로 숙여 당신에게 입을 맞춥니다. 그리고는 날카롭게 돌아서, 포탈로 뛰어듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "56413bb5-5782-41f0-9509-5cb66776f7d2"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar disappears into the portal, and it lights up with a bright white "
"and blue light, nearly blinding you for a moment. When the light fades, a "
"regular door remains where the portal once stood.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 포탈로 사라졌습니다. 그것은 밝은 흰색과 파란 불빛으로 빛나면서 잠시나마 거의 눈을 멀게 했습니다. 빛이 바래지면서 한때 "
"포탈이 서 있던 자리에는 보통의 문이 그대로 남아 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "c110e6f5-1ce2-4107-adeb-9d54df76f7ee"
msgid ""
"{n}Then he turns to you and speaks very quietly, so that only you two hear "
"it.{/n} \"I will be waiting for you at the victory celebration in Varnhold. "
"Be sure I will not fail. Not now, when I have something to lose, and "
"something to fight for to my dying breath.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}반이 뒤돌아서 오직 당신과 그만이 들을 수 있도록 속삭입니다.{/n} \"반홀드 승리연회에서 기다릴게. 날 믿어 난 실패하지 않아. "
"그게 지금은 아니야. 난 지금 잃어버려선 안될 것도 있고, 마지막 호흡을 다해 지켜내야 할 것도 있으니까\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "73c4b884-1a60-4ae4-a9e9-67f1216ba568"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar lingers a bit longer, to do what he has never forgotten, over all "
"the years you've known him: to smile and cheer his people up.{/n} \"We've "
"been through worse, right fellows? Good luck to each of you! keep count of "
"how many foes you defeat. When we meet again, we'll boast our tallies, and "
"the loser is buying the drinks!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 뜸을 들입니다. 당신이 그를 알고 지내는 동안 단 한번도 빼먹지 않았던 일을 하기위해서 입니다. 그가 웃으면서 사람들을 "
"다독이기 시작합니다.{/n}\"이 보다 더한 것도 겪어왔잖나, 그렇지 제군들? 모두 행운을 비네! 각자 잡은 놈의 숫자를 기억해두라고. "
"다시 만났을때 숫자를 대보고, 진 사람이 술을 사는거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "e6436b6c-cc5e-46a8-9d2f-1e24e6937de6"
msgid ""
"{n}Shrill, female laughter can be heard from all directions. Then you hear a "
"flirtatious voice, one you've heard before, here in the dungeon.{/n} \"Ah, "
"such a pity! The baron won't be attending the Marquise's reception. But "
"there is another reception awaiting him, yes... The invitations have been "
"sent, and soon, guests will be summoned to the host's door.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}날카롭게 찢어지는 듯한 여성의 웃음소리가 사방에서 들립니다. 그러고나자 당신은 교태로운 목소리를 듣습니다.이 던전속에서 당신이 한 "
"번은 들어봤던 목소리입니다. {/n} \"아아, 정말 안됐군! 남작은 후작부인의 연회에 참석하지 않을 거야. 물론 또 다른 환영회가 그를 "
"기다리고 있지... 초대장은 보냈고, 곧 손님들이 집주인의 문 앞으로 불려나오겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "cd87a038-fc35-432f-b218-cbe647bd0d52"
msgid ""
"\"Marquise, Marquise Immolatia. Be my guests... well, you can't refuse, can "
"you?\""
msgstr "\"후작부인, 후작부인 불멸이라고 불러주렴. 그리고 내 손님이 되는거야... 자, 거절하지는 않겠지, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "d7da2874-1f2d-493e-b668-f0fe3c916de3"
msgid ""
"\"She played us!\" {n}Cephal hisses. So far he'd remained quiet, obviously "
"busy with some magic.{/n} \"All of us! The portal that transported Maegar "
"was real, but what it showed us was an illusion. How are we ever going to "
"find out what is happening to Varnhold? And to that stubborn boy, fool "
"enough to be a Baron!?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리를 가지고 놀았군!\" {n}케팔이 야유합니다. 그간 마법을 신경 쓰느라 바빴는지 이제야 입을 열었습니다./n} \"모두들! "
"포탈은 진짜였지만 메이가르를 전송한 것은 환영이었네. 이래서야 반홀드에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 어떻게 알겠나? 고집쟁이 남작은 또 "
"어떻고!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "163390e7-5a84-4190-a517-7b0953294cd6"
msgid ""
"\"Your frightened confusion is so sweet! Such a delicious feeling. Enjoy it "
"for now. I will meet with you later!\""
msgstr "\"너희들의 겁에 질린 혼란은 너무나 달콤해! 너무 맛있는 느낌이야. 일단은 좀 즐기라고. 나중에 다시 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "1db5613c-a9de-4218-8416-cb63eaf1db34"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot say. Nothing is what it seems in this cursed dungeon. Everything "
"is false. We must get to the bottom of this – and we will! We just need to "
"keep going.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라 말할 수가 없군. 이 저주받은 지하감옥에서 보이는 그대로인 것은 아무것도 없다네. 모든 것이 거짓이야. 우리는 이 일의 진상을 "
"규명해야 하네. 그리고 그렇게 할 걸세! 이대로 쭉 계속 가면 된다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "0478a374-7b0b-406b-9494-efc6deb5a897"
msgid ""
"\"No – by no means! We cannot help Maegar in any way, whatever happens in "
"Varnhold. He is on his own. The dungeon is our task. Well, General – onward! "
"The sooner we finish here, the sooner we will be able to return.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니 – 절대로! 반홀드에서 무슨 일이 일어나든, 우린 메이가르를 도울 수 없네. 그는 혼자야. 지하감옥이 우리 소관이지. 자, "
"장군, 앞으로! 우리가 일을 빨리 끝낼수록 빨리 돌아갈 수 있을걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnLeaves/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "920fe780-119a-4094-b09e-4854b8c3219b"
msgid ""
"\"Quite right. Perhaps Maegar was lured from here with the aim of weakening "
"the group. Or perhaps they hoped we would all dash through the portal to "
"protect the town. But our purpose is true! Whoever is playing these tricks "
"on us, they will not be able to keep it up forever. Onward!\""
msgstr ""
"\"옳지. 아마도 메이가르는 그룹을 약화시킬 목적으로 다른 곳에 유인당한 것인지도 모르네. 아니면 우리 모두가 마을을 지키기 위해 포탈을 "
"통과하기를 바랐을지도 모르지. 하지만 우리의 목적은 진실을 찾는 것이야! 누가 우리에게 이런 장난을 치고 있든간에, 그들이 영원히 그 "
"짓을 계속할 순 없을걸세. 가세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5344fc9d-78b2-4a7c-b65e-49d8fdc26fa3"
msgid "... detects magic."
msgstr "...마법을 탐지한다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ed8c98ec-774b-4911-b512-2542f2d299bf"
msgid "... asks Cephal about the nature of the light."
msgstr "... 케팔에게 빛의 본질에 대해 묻는다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8f1c7606-15d8-4f8f-a3fe-6297a5296c3a"
msgid "... bravely approaches the doorway."
msgstr "… 용감하게 문가로 다가간다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1a84b493-8c2e-49d8-9575-55dbfd2ed7d6"
msgid "... cautiously looks into the doorway from a distance."
msgstr "… 멀리서 조심스럽게 출입구를 들여다본다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "07e0cb6f-0112-4a1d-b6d6-6cd4b0386ad7"
msgid ""
"Beside {mf|him|her}self, the General dashes forward, to the doorway and the "
"people beyond it, possessed by the strange spell."
msgstr "장군은 기이한 주문에 홀린 채로 문간과 그 너머의 사람들을 향해 돌진합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "8f7d226f-d6f5-4af8-9086-8953c3ea499a"
msgid ""
"The General freezes, waiting to see how things unfold, and how {mf|his|her} "
"companions react."
msgstr "장군은 그대로 멈추고 상황이 어떻게 돌아가는지, 그리고 {mf|그|그녀}의 동료들이 어떻게 반응하는지 기다립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "c51e1771-471c-466c-9e61-ed1f1ffdcd37"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c97a2399-a527-476a-844a-fd462f0ab325"
msgid ""
"Baron Varn and his companions move further, as sounds of their voices are "
"lost in noises and whispers that fill the ancient dungeon. It is like a huge "
"animal, sleeping fitfully, grunting, tossing and turning. There's a distant "
"sound of scraping and resounding sighs."
msgstr ""
"반 남작과 그의 동료들이 더 멀리 이동하자, 그들의 목소리들은 고대의 지하감옥을 가득 채우는 소음과 속삭임으로 묻혀버립니다. 그것은 마치 "
"투덜대고 뒤척이며 곤히 잠든 거대한 짐승 같습니다 . 멀리서 긁는 소리, 부스럭거리는 소리와 크게 탄식하는 소리가 들려옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "65cf6c55-090c-42a3-8646-b249ae111f1a"
msgid ""
"The room at the end of the descent seems even more desolate than what came "
"before. As they wade into the darkness that fills the depths, the "
"adventurers freeze before a rectangle of pale light. They stand before a "
"doorway filled with glimmering light. The first to take in the situation, "
"the General..."
msgstr ""
"내리막길의 방은 아까보다 더 황량해 보입니다. 그들이 심부를 가득 채우는 어둠 속을 헤쳐나가고 있던 탓에, 모험가들은 창백한 빛의 "
"직사각형 앞에 멈춰섭니다. 그들은 희미한 빛으로 가득 찬 문 앞에 서 있습니다. 그러한 상황에서 장군이 가장 먼저 한 것은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "31ed7ae1-b5e9-452f-9697-ce44b7d49f72"
msgid ""
"Magic detection quickly makes it clear that this is a portal. But where does "
"it lead? And what was its business in this dungeon, supposedly sealed long "
"ago, for the protection of all Golarion?\n"
"Grasping for an answer to this question, the General..."
msgstr ""
"마법을 탐지하면 이것이 포탈이라는 것을 금방 알 수 있습니다. 하지만 어디로 가는 걸까요? 그리고 골라리온 전역의 보호를 위해 오래전에 "
"봉인된 것으로 추정되는 이 지하감옥에서 무슨 일이 있었던 걸까요?\n"
"이러한 질문과 씨름하던 중, 장군은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "2d84bf25-2ac0-4025-b82b-92e35e454358"
msgid ""
"As if reacting to the presence of living creatures, the light in the doorway "
"dims a little, revealing... a familiar view of Varnhold! It seems so placid "
"at first glance. But then..."
msgstr ""
"마치 살아있는 생명에 반응하듯 문간의 빛이 약간 희미해지고, 곧 드러난 것은 ... 반홀드의 익숙한 풍경입니다! 언뜻 보기에는 더없이 "
"평온해 보입니다. 그러나 그 다음엔..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "cc54ab97-f92f-4886-bfe3-82df08354eb4"
msgid ""
"Beyond the doorway – so closely, it seems you could touch them – townsfolk "
"are leaving their houses. You see Svelid, the cheerful tavern keeper, and "
"behind her walks Karida, swaying like a puppet."
msgstr ""
"출입구 너머에서 – 아주 가까이에서, 그것들을 만질 수도 있을 것처럼 보입니다 – 마을 사람들이 그들의 집을 떠나고 있습니다. 명랑한 "
"선술집 주인인 스벨리드가 보이고, 그녀의 뒤로 카리다가 흔들리는 꼭두각시인형마냥 끌려가고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "c14c105c-fe9a-4927-9539-8fd2b9f205b9"
msgid ""
"They walk to the town cemetery, as you look on through the doorway. It's "
"swarming with people. They're staring blindly in front of them, all the "
"citizens of the town. They're digging holes in the ground, moving "
"monotonously, some using tools, some just their bare hands. Svelid comes "
"close to one such hole, clumsily trips over the edge and disappears. With "
"her usual nonchalance, Karida begins to throw dirt into the hole. Neither of "
"woman screams or yells. It's as if nothing strange is happening.\n"
"When you turn to the others, it becomes clear that their eyes have been "
"poked out."
msgstr ""
"문간 너머로 그들이 공동묘지로 걸어가는 모습이 보입니다. 마을 사람들이 바글바글 모여있는 곳에 멈춰서, 모두가 앞을 멍하니 바라봅니다. "
"땅을 파며 단조롭게 움직이는 사람들이 있는데, 어떤 이는 도구를, 어떤 이는 맨손을 씁니다. 스벨리드는 파놓은 구멍 하나에 가까이 와서 "
"서투르게 넘어집니다. 일상인 듯 태연하게, 카리다가 구덩이에 흙을 채우기 시작합니다. 마치 별 일 아닌 것처럼 두 사람 모두 비명을 "
"지르지 않습니다. \n"
"다른 사람에게로 고개를 돌리니, 눈이 뽑혀나간 얼굴들이 선명하게 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "cd9a3fa3-952d-452a-948e-a896f4a62785"
msgid "\"Stop!\" Baron Varn lays his heavy hand upon the General's shoulder."
msgstr "\"멈춰!\" 반 남작이 그의 무거운 손을 장군의 어깨에 얹습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "29fb8289-967e-401b-808a-a9e6cebeeae1"
msgid ""
"\"This is a portal,\" Cephal remarks, anticipating the Baron's question. "
"\"And as far as I can gather, it does in fact lead to Varnhold.\""
msgstr "\"이것은 포탈이군,\" 케팔은 남작의 질문을 예상하며 말한다. \"그리고 내 의견에 의하면, 그건 반홀드로 이어지네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/VarnholdVanishingBE/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "de327476-283b-42fb-a06f-2e89e355830e"
msgid ""
"Beyond the arc of the portal, the scenery quickly becomes empty. Having "
"completed their horrific work at the cemetery, the remaining citizens walk "
"away and out of sight. Baron Varn reaches for his weapon.\n"
"\"If this dungeon is connected to Varnhold by a portal,\" he says slowly, "
"and his eyes grow darker with each word, \"that means that whatever was "
"locked in here might have gotten out. And right into the center of town!\""
msgstr ""
"포탈의 호를 넘어서면 경치가 금세 허전해집니다. 묘지에서 끔찍한 일을 마친 나머지 시민들은 발길을 돌립니다. 반 남작은 무기를 잡으려고 "
"손을 뻗습니다.\n"
"\"만약 이 지하감옥이 포탈로 반홀드와 연결되어 있다면,\" 그는 천천히 말합니다. 그리고 말 한마디마다 그의 눈속의 어두움은 더 "
"커집니다, \"이 안에 갇혀 있던 무엇이든지 빠져나갔을 수도 있다는 의미야. 그것도 시내 중심부로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "93037817-f30f-4b3e-968f-d6c80fac89f4"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a58d5d37-7fad-49ba-ad2b-a4f193cdb833"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"여긴 뭐하는 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c269145a-20e4-4f65-a8cd-6ef53461dbca"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "1facf564-44fc-4d2a-8dff-cad51ed3bd0e"
msgid "\"Where is the real tomb of the cyclopes ruler?\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스 군주의 진짜 무덤은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "1e469c34-90f8-4136-84ae-154476135ce3"
msgid "\"I don't have any other questions.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "1b2289f4-9395-49cb-924c-b8905562d93f"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think she was lying to us, but she might not have been telling us "
"the whole story.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 우리에게 거짓말을 하진 않았을 거라고 보지만, 그녀가 전부를 말해 주진 않았을지도 몰라요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "536cca11-d34d-4311-bdef-e32bc14688df"
msgid "\"She said she's cursed. What if we fall under her curse?\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 저주받았다고 했어요. 만약 우리가 그녀의 저주에 걸리면 어쩌죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "dd4b00ef-9026-42cc-ba96-c1bf5855b9d2"
msgid ""
"\"We won't. I won't believe anyone or anything in this cursed dungeon!\""
msgstr "\"아뇨. 이 저주받은 지하감옥에서는 아무도 믿지 않겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "27d3e01b-7a6c-4ff8-9286-acde3b7f4dbc"
msgid "\"Of course, why not!\""
msgstr "\"물론, 왜 안 되겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "0b5365e4-9d02-43d9-a50a-049c6c850c5a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm more concerned about this Horned Hunter. Sounds like a creature of "
"divine power, and a nasty sense of humor!\""
msgstr "\"전 이 뿔난 사냥꾼이 더 걱정이예요. 신성한 힘이라도 가진 것 같고, 유머감각이 끔찍해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c0eb3882-f141-45ba-8f5c-13eefd36ebec"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghostly figure of a short, dark-skinned woman in a rich robe appears "
"before you.{/n} \"People?! In the name of Nethys, are you really living "
"people? Or is this just another evil joke? Don't be silent, now – answer me! "
"I order you! I beg you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}불룩한 겉옷을 입은 단신의 까만 피부를 가진 여인의 유령 같은 모습이 눈앞에 나타납니다.{/n} \"사람?! 네티스의 이름으로, "
"너희는 정말 살아 있는 사람들이냐? 아니면 이것도 또 다른 사악한 농담인가? 잠자코 있지 말고, 지금 – 대답해! 명령한다! 아니 "
"간청하마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "c583a235-c791-4ff9-b9ff-a3eaad82e80f"
msgid ""
"\"We are people, ghost. And who are you? And what right do you have to give "
"us orders?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 사람이오, 유령. 그런데 당신은 누구지? 그리고 무슨 권리로 우리에게 명령을?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "a3229ebd-5278-469b-9de4-cbbe6eac28ca"
msgid ""
"\"I am Marcida Vittari, the mistress of this castle... The mistress... Ha ha "
"ha!\" {n}The woman laughs uncontrollably. A bitter laugh with notes of "
"hysteria.{/n} \"I am no ghost. This is only a projection. In fact, I'm quite "
"alive... Woe is me! Still alive! Locked up, cursed, on the verge of madness –"
" but still alive! Oh, if death were possible for me, I would accept it with "
"gratitude!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 성의 여주인 마르시다 비타리... 여주인... 하하하!\" {n}여자는 걷잡을 수 없이 웃습니다. 억울하고도 히스테릭한 "
"웃음입니다.{/n} \"나는 귀신이 아니다. 이건 그냥 투영일 뿐이야 사실, 난 잘 살아있어... 슬프도다! 아직도 살아있다고! 갇히고, "
"저주받고, 미친 듯이 날뛰지만 여전히 살아있다! 오, 만약 내게도 죽음이 허락된다면 감사한 마음으로 받아들이겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "d45fa40c-9d43-4816-b5c3-3bbfe464ee93"
msgid ""
"\"Assume I believe that you aren't another illusion, but a living person, "
"imprisoned here and in need of our help. How much can you pay for it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 당신이 또 다른 환상이 아니라 여기 갇혀서 우리의 도움을 필요로 하는 살아있는 사람이라고 보이는데. 우리의 도움에 뭘 보상할 수 "
"있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "37a502f0-afc1-484d-9348-a335e49587c6"
msgid ""
"\"I swear this is no deceit! I don't know what I can give you. My castle is "
"open for plundering... Oh, but I am locked in my laboratory! I have rare "
"books, scrolls, magic items... Many are rare and precious. I've been "
"collecting them for decades! Release me, and all of this will be yours!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맹세하는데 사기가 아니야! 내가 뭘 줄 수 있을지 모르겠어. 내 성은 약탈에 무방비하게 열려있지... 오, 하지만 난 내 실험실에 "
"갇혀있어! 내겐 희귀한 책, 두루마리, 마법의 물건들이 있어... 대부분 희귀하고 귀중한 것들이다. 수십 년 동안 모아왔어! 날 풀어줘, "
"그러면 이 모든 것이 네 것이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "f2f875b8-0cad-4262-a047-cdf7b19fb56e"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm-m-m... I am intrigued. But first you must answer some questions. "
"Starting with – what is this place? And what is really going on here?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠... 나는 흥미가 가는군. 하지만 먼저 몇 가지 질문에 답해야 해. 먼저 – 여기는 어디요? 그리고 여기서 무슨 일이 일어나고 "
"있는 게요?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "209cb7ea-cd73-4234-abe4-5b29df1f7079"
msgid ""
"\"Anything, just GET ME OUT OF HERE!!\" {n}The voice of the sorceress rises "
"into a scream.{/n}"
msgstr "\"몰라, 그냥 나를 여기서 꺼내줘!!\" {n}소서리스의 목소리가 비명에 휩싸입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "9b6c4d99-d1a2-4bfb-bf52-e0db1c7e46fb"
msgid ""
"\"Hm. I'll tell you what, Marcida. We may or may not be able to help you. "
"What exactly do you want from us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"흐음. 뭐라고 하지, 마르시다. 우리가 당신을 도울 수 있을 수도 있고 없을 수도 있소. 정확히 우리에게 원하는 게 뭐요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "9e34be0c-d198-4ede-a40a-2dd68075fa41"
msgid ""
"\"Somewhere in the castle there's my Gemstone of Unseen Paths – a magic key "
"to the portal that leads to my dungeon. You will find the portal in a secret "
"room next to the library. I beg you, don't abandon me here! Set me free or "
"kill me – anything is better than an eternity here...\" {n}The sobbing voice "
"of the sorceress fades away, and the projection vanishes into thin air.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"성 안 어디엔가 내 보석이 있는데, 그게 내 지하감옥으로 통하는 포탈로 통하는 마법의 열쇠야. 포탈은 도서관 옆에 있는 밀실에서 찾을 "
"수 있을 거야. 제발, 날 여기에 버려두지 마! 날 풀어주든지 죽이든지 뭐든간에 영원히 여기 갇혀 있는 것보단 나아...\" {n}"
"소서리스의 흐느끼는 목소리가 점점 멀어지고, 투영도 가늘어져 허공으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "1542f7c0-e166-49bc-bef1-cdd194167ca6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. The centaurs believe that it's here, but as you've learned, "
"that's just an evil joke. During the days when this fortress was just being "
"built, we often had to fight centaurs, and even then I remember "
"interrogations where they spoke of a cyclops lord buried somewhere in these "
"lands, and an ancient evil. Perhaps the tomb really is nearby? Or maybe it's "
"just the old legends of superstitious half-animals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어. 켄타우로스들은 그것이 여기 있다고 믿지만, 너희가 배운 대로 그건 그냥 악질적인 농담일 뿐이야. 이 요새가 막 지어지던 "
"시절, 우리는 종종 켄타우로스와 싸워야 했고, 그때까지도 그들이 이 땅 어딘가에 묻힌 사이클롭스 군주와 고대 악에 대해 말했던 것을 "
"기억해. 어쩌면 무덤이 정말 근처에 있는 건가? 아니면 미신적인 반인반수들의 옛 전설에 불과할지도 모르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "07755ed9-7740-46a5-952a-8a9a6a8aca33"
msgid ""
"\"It was once a Taldan fortress, an outpost of a great empire. Then it "
"became my shelter – a quiet home for a wizard, far away from the intrusions "
"of lower creatures... Now it is ruled by the fey and other monsters. I heard "
"they call it Lostlarn Keep.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 한 때 탈도르의 요새였다, 대제국의 전초기지였지. 그 다음에는 나의 은신처가 됐고. 마법사의 조용한 보금자리이자, 하급생물의 "
"침입으로부터 멀리 떨어져 있었지. 지금은 페이와 다른 괴물들에게 지배받고 있어. 그들은 이곳을 로스틀란 성채라고 부른다던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "67338808-8542-4f8f-89d6-feee033b6621"
msgid ""
"\"I was once known as Marcida, the Master of Portals. There was no better "
"specialist in conjuration magic in all of Taldor! I'd like to believe that "
"they still use my books to teach students, but... Who knows how many years, "
"or ages, or millennia it's been? I lost track of time long ago!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 한때 포탈의 달인 마르시다로 알려졌지. 탈도르 어디에도 나보다 더 뛰어난 소환술사가 없었어! 학생들을 가르칠 때 여전히 내 책을 "
"쓴다고 믿고 싶지만... 몇 년, 몇 세기, 몇 백만 년이 지났는지 누가 알겠어? 난 오래 전에 시간감각을 잃었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "8d503133-cc4d-4e82-afb2-0ac9b22bb19a"
msgid ""
"\"I am master of the school of Conjuration, so sloth has always been my "
"favorite sin... But that was not what ruined me. The seed of my destruction "
"was the same sin it is for most wizards: pride. I summoned a force I could "
"not control, and I discovered my powerlessness too late!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 소환 학파의 달인이었고, 그래서 나태는 내가 가장 사랑하는 악덕이었지... 하지만 그게 날 망쳤던 건 아니야. 내 파멸의 씨앗은 "
"대부분의 마법사들이 짓는 죄, 다시말해 자만이었지. 통제할 수 없는 병력을 소환했고, 나의 무력함을 너무 늦게 깨달았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0019_Text_1
msgctxt "885f3471-125a-464f-af61-fe1e2d5cef6b"
msgid ""
"\"My own conceit was my ruin. I summoned a force I could not control, and I "
"discovered my powerlessness too late! I was a master of the school of "
"Conjuration. Ordinary people cannot even dream of the planes that opened to "
"me! I summoned outsiders, pried out their secrets, made deals and turned "
"them into my servants... It seemed I could control any otherworldly monster!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 자만이 곧 나의 파멸이었지. 내가 통제할 수 없는 군대를 소환했고, 내 무력함을 너무 늦게 깨달았어! 나는 소환 학파의 "
"달인이었어. 평범한 사람들은 꿈도 꾸지 못할 차원들도 내게는 열려 있었지! 타차원의 존재를 불러내서 비밀을 캐내고, 거래를 해서 내 "
"하인으로 만들었지... 어떤 다른 세상의 괴물도 통제할 수 있을 것만 같았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "76686bbd-91b3-4cc4-a9e9-8d6226bd4acb"
msgid ""
"\"I've come here with the glorious research army of great Taldor. This "
"fortress was built as an outpost for future conquests, but these plans never "
"came to pass. My companions returned home, while I... Why did I need to "
"leave? I remained in my tower, in the environs of the castle, and "
"transformed it into a zoo. There's enough space for all the amazing "
"creatures that I managed to catch during my travels through the other planes!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 위대한 탈도르의 영광스러운 조사단을 이끌고 이곳에 왔다. 이 요새는 미래의 정복을 위한 전초기지로 지어졌지만, 그런 계획들이 "
"결코 승인되진 않았지. 동료들은 집으로 돌아갔지만, 나는... 내가 왜 떠나야 했겠어? 나는 탑, 성 주변에 남아서 이곳을 동물원으로 "
"개조했어. 다른 차원들을 여행하는 동안 포획했던 모든 놀라운 생명체들을 위한 충분한 공간이 여기 있었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "72143949-cd93-42b5-85eb-1a9ea377d0b0"
msgid ""
"\"You came here in search of a cyclops tomb? Alas, you've been deceived. "
"Monsters have created illusions here for ages, playing with the naive "
"centaurs... Why, you ask? Why?!\" {n}The sorceress shakes her head, there "
"are tears in her eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"넌 여기에 사이클롭스의 무덤을 찾으러 왔지? 아아, 넌 속은 거야. 괴물들은 오랫동안 여기서 환상을 만들어왔지. 순진한 켄타우로스들을 "
"가지고 놀았어... 왜냐고, 나한테 묻는 거야? 왜냐고?!\" {n}소서리스가 고개를 가로젓습니다, 그녀의 눈에 눈물이 고입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "8710af62-a19f-43a9-81fe-f50c0d103e0b"
msgid ""
"\"But now... Now I am just a toy in the hands of a monster from the fey "
"world. – Deceived, cursed, and doomed to eternal misery!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 지금은... 이제 난 태초세계에서 온 괴물의 손에 놀아나는 장난감일 뿐이야. – 속고, 저주받고, 영원한 불행 속에 쳐박혔다고!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "04a1e5ed-0827-4cb0-84d4-f9d9109c62d6"
msgid ""
"\"But one day, someone whose true nature I'd never known answered my call. A "
"powerful creature from the fey world, he calls himself the Horned Hunter. "
"Well he lived up to his name, turned me into an animal and put me in a cage! "
"He offered me a deal. He promised to give me an entire world where I would "
"be mistress of all! And I was stupid enough to agree!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데 어느 날, 정체를 전혀 몰랐던 존재가 내 부름에 대답했어. 태초 세계에서 그 강력한 존재는 스스로를 뿔난 사냥꾼이라고 불렀지. "
"글쎄, 그는 자기 이름에 걸맞게 살았어, 나를 동물처럼 우리에 가둬버렸다고! 그는 나에게 거래를 제안했어. 그는 내가 모든 것의 여주인이 "
"될 수 있는 세상을 주겠다고 약속했어! 그리고 나는 멍청하게도 수락했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "d2cb5468-fdbd-43ba-b85d-d4ab72eb1520"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes, he gave me my own world... A tiny plane, the size of my "
"laboratory! He gave me subjects – monsters who torment me day and night! And "
"to make it even worse, he cursed me with eternal life! Century after "
"century, I live on in a tiny room, watching the fey play at being the "
"masters of my castle! Can you imagine it?! Can you?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아 그래, 그는 나만의 세계를 줬어... 내 실험실 크기만한 작은 차원을! 그는 밤낮으로 나를 괴롭히는 괴물들을 보내줬지. 그리고 "
"그것도 모자라서 영생의 저주까지 걸었어! 백년, 또 백년이 지나도록, 난 작은 방에서 페이가 내 성의 주인이 되어 노는 걸 보면서 "
"살아가는 거야! 상상이 가?! 응?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "73e161a5-e350-4f8d-bd46-53f8dfcea7ed"
msgid ""
"\"It's a joke! A joke, you see?! All these horrors, all this suffering – "
"it's all just so they can laugh at mortals. Ha ha ha ha!!!\" {n}Marcida's "
"hysterical laughter turns into sobs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그건 농담이야! 농담이라고, 알아들어?! 그 모든 공포, 고통 – 그게 다 그것들이 필멸자들을 비웃기 위한 것들이었다고. 하하하하!!!"
"\" {n}마르시다의 히스테릭한 웃음소리가 흐느낌으로 변합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "edbfd83a-92ce-41c6-9b49-47e66475742d"
msgid ""
"\"What do you say? Should we take the risk and try to help her, or do you "
"think we're being played again?\""
msgstr "\"어떡하겠나? 위험을 무릅쓰고 그녀를 도와줘야 할까, 아니면 우리가 또 놀아나고 있다고 보나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "c3f1373e-6a26-42c6-99a2-b0a32f5e4c0a"
msgid "\"Good thinking! It's best not to mess around with curses.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각일세! 저주는 함부로 건들지 않는 것이 상책이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "28d4c57a-ee86-46e5-be24-e2f822af7c8d"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps not divine... But it's true about the sense of humor. Even if "
"Marcida herself is being honest with us, she may yet be unwitting bait in "
"his trap!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마 신성은 아닐 테고... 그러나 유머 감각에 대해서는 사실일세. 마르시다 본인은 우리에게 정직하게 말하고 있다고 쳐도, 그녀는 "
"그의 덫에 스스로도 모르는 채 미끼로서 놓여 있는지도 모르지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "52207252-6866-40cf-adac-e358aa0d6b93"
msgid "\"Yes, exactly! I sensed the same thing.\""
msgstr "\"그래, 바로 그거야! 나도 같은 것을 느꼈다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "caea307a-8947-4d21-8b9d-73ee19eabe9d"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose it wouldn't hurt to try helping her... But we must keep our eyes "
"open or we'll end up just like her – or worse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀를 도와줘 보는 것도 나쁘진 않을 것 같은데... 하지만 방심하진 말게. 안 그러면 우리도 그녀와 똑같은 운명이 될 테니까. 더 "
"나빠지던가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Apparition/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "9282ac1e-282b-4c6a-801f-9ebafc7a3df4"
msgid ""
"\"Most reasonable. Well then, we will leave Marcida Vittari alone with her "
"library and collection of precious magical items. And if we change our "
"minds, we'd best be extremely careful. One should watch for tricks from "
"every direction in this place!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 설득력 있군. 뭐 그러면, 우리는 마르시다 비타리를 그녀의 도서관하고 수집품들과 함께 버려두고 가겠군. 혹시 우리가 마음을 "
"바꾼다면, 우리는 극도로 조심하는 것이 좋겠지. 이 곳 사방팔방에 숨어있는 속임수들에 주의를 기울여야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "a114aa09-b14d-4f50-9acd-d33e9797d1e7"
msgid "\"The portal is open. What is keeping you from leaving?\""
msgstr "\"포탈은 열려 있어. 왜 떠나지 못하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "b2318318-a60e-45fc-bc8c-c98cf57f227c"
msgid "\"What curse lies upon you?\""
msgstr "\"당신이 걸린 저주가 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "bf9281cc-33e0-4086-8b65-d239cae7e174"
msgid "[Attack] \"You tried to deceive us? Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"우리를 속이려고 들어? 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2893b17f-c839-42bd-9b7f-882f33d11552"
msgid ""
"\"You said yourself that even death is better than lingering here forever. "
"It's all we can offer you.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 영원히 머무르느니 죽는 게 낫다고 스스로 말했잖아. 우리가 줄 수 있는 건 이것뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "cda7dc73-d04c-4d72-9c45-2cb8593a9a95"
msgid ""
"\"We could sacrifice someone from the party. Who would stop us? Varn? He "
"isn't here.\""
msgstr "\"우리 일행 중 누군가를 희생시킬 수도 있죠. 누가 우리를 말리겠어요? 반? 그는 여기 없죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c019bbad-72d5-43e6-b6d5-1d0c9d1eaf0a"
msgid ""
"{n}Marcida rushes towards you with tears in her eyes, just as you saw her in "
"projection.{/n} \"Thank {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}! Freedom at last! Freedom! "
"Well...\" {n}She points at books on the shelves with a sweeping gesture and "
"offers her hand to Cephal.{/n} \"We have a deal? All of this is yours, in "
"return for my freedom!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마르시다는 투영된 이미지로 봤던 것처럼 눈물을 글썽이며 당신에게 달려듭니다.{/n} \"감사합니다. {g|네서스}Nethys{/g}"
"여! 마침내 자유야! 자유라고! 음...\" {n}그녀는 쓸어담듯 몸짓으로 책꽂이의 책들을 가리키며 케팔에게 손을 내밉니다.{/n} "
"\"우리가 거래를 했었지? 내 자유에 대한 보답으로, 다 너희 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "7f1b69a6-add8-449e-887d-e6e154141ba7"
msgid ""
"{n}Cephal looks greedily over the ancient volumes and reaches out, but then "
"stops. He quickly pulls away his hand and turns to you.{/n} \"Wait a "
"minute... We held up our end of the bargain, did we not? Then what else is "
"there to discuss? You are free, so go!\" {n}He makes an inviting gesture "
"towards the portal.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}케팔은 고대 책들을 탐스럽게 훑어보고 손을 뻗치다가 멈춥니다. 그는 재빨리 손을 떼고 당신에게로 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"잠깐만... "
"우리가 그 거래의 책무를 다했지? 그럼 또 의논할 게 뭐가 있겠소? 당신은 자유요, 그러니 가시오!\" {n}그는 포탈을 가리키며 "
"손짓합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "369a0d3c-ab99-40e3-80df-51809142e1fd"
msgid ""
"{n}The sorceress' face shifts as one emotion dissolves into another – "
"disappointment, resentment, despair, fury, and then panic. She does not "
"answer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}소서리스의 얼굴은 실망, 분함, 절망, 분노를 거쳐 공포로 물듭니다. 그녀는 대답하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "438b3522-72ce-4437-bdc0-b1e3635e19a6"
msgid ""
"\"You can't leave, can you? There's still something you need from us. "
"Something besides the open portal!\""
msgstr "\"떠날 수가 없군, 안 그렇소? 당신은 아직 우리에게 볼일이 있소. 열린 포탈 말고 다른 것 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "40434eeb-7416-4927-9157-52c43f0c9e62"
msgid "\"How... How did you know?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게… 어떻게 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "543f7dfa-8d19-44a0-aa74-284dc2e413e7"
msgid ""
"\"You might be a brilliant sorceress, but your negotiation skills could use "
"some improvement. Back then, you let slip that you were cursed. And "
"anyhow... You were too hasty, too happy about everything. What wizard would "
"be so happy to part with their library?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 뛰어난 소서리스일진 몰라도, 그 협상 능력은 개선을 좀 해야 할 거요. 그때 저주받았다고 실토했잖소. 어쨌든... 당신은 너무 "
"성급했고, 모든 일을 너무 행복해 했소. 자기 서고와 작별하면서 그렇게 기뻐할 마법사가 어딨겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "0374e23a-14f6-4d43-ab31-237981b0a32a"
msgid ""
"\"He said it once in a poem... 'The unlived years hang heavily over a "
"ruler's head...' It was from a long one. I never remember all that fey "
"nonsense, but that line rang true.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 시구로 한 번 읊었어... '불멸의 세월은 통치자의 머리 위에 무겁게 드리워져 있다...' 오래 전이었지. 그 페이의 허튼소리는 "
"전부 기억은 안 나지만, 사실처럼 느껴졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "e0f214b3-8df3-4fa3-ab99-fd7887cf3d59"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing is keeping me from leaving... But I don't want to die! I'm cursed!"
"\""
msgstr "\"날 붙잡는 건 없어... 하지만 난 죽고 싶지 않아! 난 저주받았다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "6dc4c986-900c-4435-bc30-87acb6f99098"
msgid ""
"\"Here is my curse: so long as I remain here, I do not age. But if I go "
"outside, all my past centuries will return in a moment! I will wither to "
"dust! Unless... unless someone takes my place, and agrees to become the new "
"master and prisoner in this tiny world. Then the entire burden of my years "
"will pass on to them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 내 저주야. 여기에 남아 있는 한, 나는 늙지 않아. 밖으로 나가면, 내 지난 세월들이 모두 한순간에 돌아올 거야! 난 시들어서 "
"먼지처럼 부스러져 버릴 거야! 만약... 누군가가 나 대신 이 작은 세상에서 새로운 주인이 되고 포로가 되는 것에 동의해준다면. 그러면 "
"내 세월의 모든 부담이 그들에게 전가될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "fe7f3592-8732-40f9-af5c-7a83b01d67de"
msgid ""
"\"You can't blame me for this little ploy... You see, I only want to live! I "
"can't die! I'm a great sorceress! If I perished – then the world would lose "
"my intellect! Come, don't be stingy! You have so many soldiers, and each "
"looks more oafish than the last! Order the most useless one to take my "
"place! Don't let my genius die!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 작은 계략으로 날 탓하진 않겠지... 너도 알겠지만, 난 그냥 살고 싶어! 난 죽을 수 없어! 난 위대한 소서리스야! 내가 죽으면 "
"- 그러면 세상은 내 지성을 잃게 될 거야! 자, 각박하게 굴지 마! 너희는 병사도 많고, 하나같이 바보같이 생겼잖아! 제일 쓸모없는 "
"녀석에게 내 자리를 대신하라고 해! 내 지성을 죽게 두지 말아줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "7edf8918-8eb5-40c4-ad9b-b194bac858c8"
msgid ""
"{n}The sorceress looks down. After a long silence she nods at last.{/n} \"All"
" right... All right, so be it. At least my suffering will finally come to an "
"end...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소서리스가 아래를 내려다봅니다. 긴 침묵 끝에 그녀는 마침내 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"좋아... 좋아, 그렇게 해. 최소한 내 "
"고통은 드디어 끝나겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "fa13f194-e71e-404b-901d-d7477f4c8398"
msgid ""
"\"So that's how you treat me?! After everything I've done for you! I've "
"shared the secrets of this fortress with you, given you my library, and you, "
"you... Fine! I may die, but you won't live either!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 날 이따위로 대하겠다는 거야?! 난 널 위해 다 해줬는데! 난 너에게 이 요새의 비밀을 공유했고, 내 서고를 줬는데, 그런데 "
"너는, 넌... 좋아! 난 죽겠지만 너도 살지는 못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "85a390da-9702-48f8-8e30-74c00850a268"
msgid ""
"{n}Without looking up, Marcida walks toward the portal but stops a few steps "
"before it.{/n} \"At least avenge me! You cannot overpower the Horned Hunter. "
"If he appears, you must run at once! But the wandering lights that tortured "
"me... This 'marquise' of theirs... They will not easily let you leave. When "
"you fight them, give them a few blows from Marcida Vittari! And now – "
"farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마르시다는 고개 숙인 채 포탈 쪽으로 걸어가지만, 몇 걸음 앞에서 걸음을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"내 복수만이라도 이루어줘! 뿔난 "
"사냥꾼을 제압할 수는 없어. 만약, 그가 나타나면 바로 도망쳐! 하지만 나를 고문했던 떠도는 불빛들... 그 '여후작'은... 그들은 "
"네가 떠나는 걸 그냥 두지 않을 거야. 그것들과 싸울 때 마르시다 비타리의 몫으로 몇 대 날려줘! 그럼 이제 – 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "3060957e-e8f1-4125-8ffd-ed3d558d9ea2"
msgid ""
"\"I am here, and I will not allow it! The Varnling Host does not sell its "
"fighters. Don't ever suggest anything like that – or I will forget we are "
"old friends! Enough. We have opened the portal, Marcida. To continue living "
"here, or to die free – the choice is yours.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 여기 있고, 그러도록 두지도 않을걸세! 반링 호스트는 전사를 팔지 않아. 다시는 그런 말을 꺼내지 말게. 그렇지 않으면 나는 "
"우리가 오랜 친구라는 사실을 지워버릴걸세! 그만두게. 우리는 포탈을 열었소, 마르시다. 여기서 계속 살든지, 아니면 자유롭게 죽든지 – "
"선택은 당신 몫이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level1/Wizard_Freedom/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "ebf3fb97-1f5d-4fa1-8dae-f6c5531ead24"
msgid "\"What? No way! You are the ones who will die!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 말도 안돼! 죽을 사람은 너야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Ball_Guests_1_String
msgctxt "2c202a7a-fa3b-4f4f-a2a2-cf5d4f376690"
msgid "\"Ah, this ball is pure poetry!\""
msgstr "\"아, 이건 순수시야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Ball_Guests_2_String
msgctxt "b7166439-ba7d-4923-b3ef-799ae83643f4"
msgid "\"The marquise is so sweet, and her husband is very charming!\""
msgstr "\"여후작은 너무 아름답고, 그녀의 남편은 매우 매력적이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Ball_Guests_3_String
msgctxt "087276ea-a1cc-436e-ba77-d2b7922c3aef"
msgid "\"Have you heard? New guests have arrived at the ball!\""
msgstr "\"그거 들었어? 무도회에 새 손님들이 왔대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Ball_Guests_4_String
msgctxt "1d50bf84-8bdb-4207-8078-88f2871c73f0"
msgid "\"What?! No new guests have ever come!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?!! 이제껏 새 손님이 온 적은 없었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Ball_Guests_5_String
msgctxt "4202af30-2836-4833-9ced-0bb6f4612173"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks to the marquise! We will dance with them forever, and ever, and "
"ever...\""
msgstr "\"여후작께 감사를! 그들과 함께 영원히 춤출거야, 영원히, 끝없이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_BlockingWall_String
msgctxt "8c1e21cd-e688-489f-9f81-18c3a46f5722"
msgid "The way is blocked by a tangle of thick roots."
msgstr "굵은 뿌리가 엉겨붙어 길이 막혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_CephalLeavingBark1_String
msgctxt "c9f19729-4d06-4ba4-90fb-7f0ec0fc6465"
msgid "\"Well, flower, let's see what's inside you...\""
msgstr "\"자, 꽃아, 네 안에 무엇이 있나 보자..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_CephalLeavingBark2_String
msgctxt "0a601269-7904-468d-9460-df0b53868752"
msgid "Good, good... Stop! Now this is bad!\""
msgstr "좋아, 좋아... 잠깐! 지금 이건 좋지 않군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_CephalLeavingBark3_String
msgctxt "9fd3ca84-bb81-434d-ac63-0009bf171671"
msgid "\"It's getting out of control! The ceiling is barely holding!\""
msgstr "\"통제가 안 돼! 천장이 무너지기 직전일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_CephalLeavingBark4_String
msgctxt "270257ab-e629-411b-9ceb-ad68c11f9d6a"
msgid "\"Get inside, quick! I'll hold it up for as long as I can!\""
msgstr "\"안으로 들어가게, 빨리! 최대한 오래 잡고 있어볼 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_JabberwokWispBark_String
msgctxt "3bb97443-b019-4210-808f-dec0241a3160"
msgid ""
"\"Boo! Scared? Don't be. I'm not a Jabberwock. No, though I'm far worse...\""
msgstr "\"우우! 겁나나? 안심해. 난 재버워크 같은 괴물은 아니야. 아니, 내가 훨씬 더 심하긴 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_WispArtBark1_String
msgctxt "fb566f6a-8e66-41b3-a0df-2b2351a739a1"
msgid "\"Look at this picture. The lines! The colors!\""
msgstr "\"이 그림 좀 봐. 선들. 색채들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_WispArtBark2_String
msgctxt "d77faa4d-0a58-4acf-b4e3-e96580e8abc2"
msgid "\"Sometimes I feel painting touches the true spirit of art!\""
msgstr "\"난 가끔씩 그림들이 진정한 예술혼에 닿는 듯한 느낌이 들어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_WispArtBark3_String
msgctxt "ec09d663-dfea-4857-868a-a01a4109f1a9"
msgid ""
"\"Nonsense! How does such daubery compare to the complexity of chess? To the "
"energy of tag?\""
msgstr "\"말도 안 돼! 그런 서툰 그림이 체스의 복잡성이나 속담의 힘과 어떻게 비교된다는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Bark_WispArtBark4_String
msgctxt "576cfe98-ec84-4b66-8855-6471ff48d843"
msgid "\"Or to the supreme art of the incineration of mortals!\""
msgstr "\"아니면 필멸자를 태워죽이는 최상의 예술 같은 거라던가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Cephal_can_unblock_1_String
msgctxt "4c9ab20f-435a-45ad-b67c-232c3c0981f6"
msgid ""
"\"These roots are woven through the entire castle. They keep the walls from "
"crashing down.\""
msgstr "\"이 뿌리들은 성 전체를 감싸도록 짜여 있네. 벽이 무너지지 않게 막아주는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Cephal_can_unblock_2_String
msgctxt "f8a86aa0-654f-48bc-8974-b9f888d4575f"
msgid ""
"\"It appears that they are connected to that flower... I think I know how to "
"use them to clear our path.\""
msgstr "\"그것들이 저 꽃과 연결되어 있는 것 같군... 길을 뚫으려면 어떻게 해야 할지 알겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/MagicGemPlace_String
msgctxt "5703a217-62b1-45ca-8443-d1b69b7a834f"
msgid ""
"The teleportation circle seems to be dormant. There is a rough recess in the "
"middle of it."
msgstr "순간이동 마법진은 휴면 상태인 것 같습니다. 가운데에 거칠게 패인 곳이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_Kitchen_1_String_1
msgctxt "c1979c94-2a64-44a3-b074-80f45f612f99"
msgid "\"Isn't it time to take them off the fire?\""
msgstr "\"불에서 꺼내줄 때 되지 않았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_Kitchen_2_String_1
msgctxt "56ae214b-a0d5-49d3-9c1d-6421b7ce07fc"
msgid "\"No, no, let them boil a bit more!\""
msgstr "\"아니, 아니, 좀 더 끓게 놔둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_Kitchen_3_String_1
msgctxt "4f0c977b-de9a-4fae-b44e-6edcfd850712"
msgid "\"The main course – hero cutlets. Served with an ally ragout...\""
msgstr "\"메인 코스 – 동료 라구를 곁들인 영웅 커틀렛...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_Kitchen_4_String_1
msgctxt "0034872a-6557-4fe0-a0a1-624405492e33"
msgid "\"... and independent Rostland for desert! Mmm... mouthwatering!\""
msgstr "\"... 그리고 후식으로 독립된 로스틀랜드! 음... 침이 고이는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_VarnCephal_1_String_1
msgctxt "58321dc3-206a-4a2a-bac5-183bc38a8aad"
msgid ""
"\"You understand nothing of town planning! A hospital must be built on a "
"cursed cemetery!\""
msgstr "\"마을 발전계획을 전혀 이해하지 못하는군! 병원은 반드시 저주받은 묘지 위에 지어져야 한다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_VarnCephal_2_String_1
msgctxt "3375f84f-ed1e-4b3f-856e-f0702a8b251e"
msgid ""
"\"Cephal, you're out of your mind! A cursed cemetery is a better place for a "
"mill. The hospital goes in the plague wasteland!\""
msgstr "\"케팔, 넌 미쳤어! 저주받은 공동묘지는 방앗간을 짓기에 딱이야. 병원은 역병 황무지로 가고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_VarnCephal_3_String_1
msgctxt "78b45c05-a929-4dbf-8783-81376b0ebbd6"
msgid "\"All right, but then the castle should go in a feverish swamp!\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 하지만 그렇다면 성은 끓는 수렁에 들어가야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_VarnCephal_4_String_1
msgctxt "7d9edab9-7399-421f-bf93-24a99f8334e2"
msgid "\"But we don't have a feverish swamp!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 우리는 끓는 수렁이 없잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Scene_VarnCephal_5_String_1
msgctxt "e10ddd56-c29b-4bda-b91e-0d2dfecef8bc"
msgid ""
"\"What?! Then we shall have to take one from our neighbors! We must live "
"somewhere!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구?! 그럼 이웃한테 하나 뺏어와야 해! 우리도 어디선가 살아야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Shyka_1_String
msgctxt "339e8d81-754c-47fb-96a3-c66a30995610"
msgid ""
"\"What an impossible encounter! You walked a long road to meet us here and "
"now.\""
msgstr "\"이런 놀라운 만남이라니! 우릴 만나려고 지금까지 멀리도 찾아왔구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Shyka_2_String
msgctxt "7473e415-61f4-44a4-a20f-cbe61831edd5"
msgid ""
"\"But how can we reward you? Would you care to learn a secret? Some of your "
"companions will never reach the end of this keep.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 우리가 어떻게 보답해줘야 할까? 비밀을 알고 싶어? 너희 중에는 절대 이 요새의 끝까지 다다르지 못할 자도 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Shyka_3_String
msgctxt "f1b4631b-dd28-4e23-aac0-3b5865dd7f66"
msgid "\"And now — farewell!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이제 — 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Zone_DragonBones_String
msgctxt "985fdfcd-92c3-48c3-9646-767f7a874f03"
msgid ""
"These bones of an ancient monster are clearly many thousands of years older "
"than the castle."
msgstr "이 고대 괴물의 뼈는 분명 이 성보다도 수천 년 이상 오래된 것들입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Zone_Lion_String
msgctxt "478b8cf4-d704-4902-8dbb-93e409850cf7"
msgid "A proud lion – the ancient symbol of Taldor."
msgstr "긍지높은 사자 – 고대 탈도르의 상징."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Zone_MagicCircle_String
msgctxt "458ee369-f8d9-4a71-9806-e610fade2915"
msgid "The magic circle emanates invisible waves of pulsating energy."
msgstr "마법진은 보이지 않는 에너지의 파동을 내뿜습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Zone_Shelyn_String
msgctxt "f9a87580-43cd-4f6c-ac37-9df716367c1f"
msgid ""
"Ages and evil spells have not affected Shelyn's shrine. The face of the "
"goddess shines clear and beautiful."
msgstr "세월과 사악한 주문들은 셀린의 사당에 영향을 끼치지 못했습니다. 여신의 얼굴이 맑고 아름답게 빛납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/LostlarnKeep_Level2/Barks/Zone_Throne_String
msgctxt "804fadb4-e374-44a7-9dec-2cfb29c24d4a"
msgid ""
"The names and exploits of those who sat on this throne have long since "
"passed into oblivion."
msgstr "이 왕좌에 앉았던 사람들의 이름과 위업은 잊혀진 지 오래입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/BanditAfterDragon_String
msgctxt "866957b0-9342-4e63-9549-bb70b661820f"
msgid "\"Baron! General! It was a pleasure doing business with you!\""
msgstr "\"남작님! 장군! 거래해서 즐거웠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/Crystal_desc_String
msgctxt "b196a49f-ad43-4a74-8559-39db866fa028"
msgid ""
"The scratched crystal looks as if someone forcefully pried it out of its "
"setting not long ago."
msgstr "긁힌 크리스탈은 얼마 전 누군가 원래 자리에서 억지로 빼낸 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/Crystal_name_String
msgctxt "2704c677-bbe3-4386-8fad-de27c5a94ad7"
msgid "Crystal key"
msgstr "수정 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/Deep_bark_String
msgctxt "4e0ba6bd-0755-4c2d-ae2c-896449ebaebc"
msgid ""
"Something glitters in the depths of the water. You see the contours of "
"seemingly hand-made objects."
msgstr "물 속 깊은 곳에서 무엇인가가 반짝입니다. 얼핏 보기에 수공예품으로 보이는 물건들의 윤곽을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/DragonIfNoWand_String
msgctxt "5297c5c1-91d4-4821-983e-ff6359e558b9"
msgid ""
"\"I am still waiting, human. I need a healing artifact from the stash.\""
msgstr "\"인간이여, 난 아직도 기다리고 있다. 나는 상자 속의 치료 아티팩트가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/NewBarkBefore_String
msgctxt "1193eec5-3e32-456c-bbc4-80763a7d1744"
msgid "\"Please, save our children! They're in danger!\""
msgstr "\"제발, 우리 아이들을 살려줘! 그들이 위험해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/NewBarkCultist2_String
msgctxt "72b82c97-a2c9-4295-bfa4-d339130cb83b"
msgid ""
"\"The Baron himself – and his comrades! I never thought I'd meet someone so "
"important.\""
msgstr "\"남작 본인과 그 동료들이라니! 이렇게 중요한 사람을 직접 볼 거라고는 생각도 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/NewBarkCultist_String
msgctxt "4d55ae25-ef97-4786-acdb-858471f60fe6"
msgid ""
"\"The centaurs, those mad beasts! Will we ever be safe so long as they roam "
"these lands?\""
msgstr "\"켄타우로스, 저 미친 짐승놈들! 놈들이 이 땅을 어슬렁대는 한 우리가 안전할 날이 어디 오겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/Stella_bark_String
msgctxt "b932027b-78d5-4546-8d39-86e15879e8e8"
msgid ""
"There are heavy impact marks on the stone surface. Someone recently pried "
"something out of here."
msgstr "돌 표면에 무거운 충격 자국이 있습니다. 최근에 누군가 여기서 뭔가를 캐냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/TechBark_Activate_String
msgctxt "d9604d33-e559-4e97-97fc-e02c74ffea20"
msgid "[Activate the crystal]"
msgstr "[수정을 활성화한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/TechBark_Dive_String
msgctxt "0c5351c4-db99-409c-97f2-f9b0cff454be"
msgid "[Dive]"
msgstr "[잠수한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/TechBark_EnterCrystal_String
msgctxt "344a6a21-971b-4d5a-b144-d0a3a697c023"
msgid "[With a loud click the crystal enters the socket]"
msgstr "[큰 딸깍 소리와 함께 수정이 구멍에 들어갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/TechBark_StellaName_String
msgctxt "215dd6f7-152c-404f-a098-5f42b28cf765"
msgid "The stele has an empty socket in the shape of a crystal."
msgstr "비석에는 수정 모양의 빈 구멍이 나있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/VarnNotGo_String
msgctxt "02954864-e9e9-403d-8770-45f5601a6bc5"
msgid "\"What, General, you wish to go home? Wait, we're not finished yet!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야, 장군, 집에 가고 싶나? 기다려, 아직 볼일이 안 끝났으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/YongSettlerSaved_String
msgctxt "5ff651fc-a73f-4e45-9759-c035c23a6b7b"
msgid "\"Thank you, Your Grace! They would have killed us!\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다, 전하! 그대로 갔다간 그들이 우릴 죽였을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/YoungSettlerSaved2_String
msgctxt "01b0c84b-dce5-4b30-bbf3-0c21583edcda"
msgid ""
"\"We didn't do anything! We just wanted to have a look at these ruins...\""
msgstr "\"우린 아무 짓도 안 했습니다! 단지 이 폐허들을 보고 싶었을 뿐입니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/Barks/YoungSettlersRunning_String
msgctxt "73315268-37a3-4e0a-a748-0a8498ffa9ac"
msgid "\"Help! Help!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘요! 도와줘요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6fea1a27-232d-49a8-a446-448993aade53"
msgid ""
"\"Do you care about your tribe, Nomen warriors? If so, then think! You are "
"about to shed the blood of younglings. They're almost children. It is the "
"same as declaring war.\""
msgstr ""
"\"노멘 전사들이여, 너희 부족을 걱정한다면, 잘 생각해라! 피 흘리는 건 너희 부족의 젊은이들이 될 것이다. 대부분이 아이들이고. 이건 "
"전쟁을 선포하는 것이나 마찬가지다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "af4872cd-d6a6-42b7-82ba-81db5b4adbad"
msgid "[Attack] \"Another moment and they'll kill the hostages!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"다음엔 저들이 인질을 죽이고 말 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "c4d299ba-c375-406a-b6aa-dd578af083f1"
msgid ""
"\"There you are, two-legged. What do you say now? You tried to make us drop "
"our guard, while your spies got inside the tomb?\" {n}The centaur knocks an "
"arrow, holds his bow close at the ready, then aims at a boy of about "
"eighteen, who can barely stand from fear.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"두 다리로 걷는 놈아, 여기 있었구나. 이제 뭐라 말할거지? 네 첩보원들이 무덤에 들어갈 동안 우리 보초를 떨어뜨리려 했나?\" {n}"
"켄타우로스는 화살을 두드리며 활을 준비된 곳에 바짝 갖다 대고는 열여덟 살 정도의 소년을 겨누고 있습니다. 소년은 공포에 질려 거의 "
"쓰러질 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CultistBoy
msgctxt "b60f2367-9713-477b-9733-b3f4e856c0ca"
msgid "\"This is the Baron! Help! Please!\""
msgstr "\" 남작님이다! 도와주세요! 제발!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "616aeaa2-2c15-44e4-9e3f-c86ad092915a"
msgid ""
"\"I did no such thing.\" {n}Maegar is grim and serious.{/n} \"Look at them – "
"they're adolescents, silly youths who snuck into a creepy dungeon. – And "
"they did it before we made our agreement.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 그런 짓을 한 적이 없다.\" {n}메이가르는 음울하고 진지합니다.{/n} \"저들을 봐. 그들은 소름끼치는 지하 유적에 몰래 "
"들어간, 좀 어리석은 청소년들일 뿐이야. – 그들은 우리의 동의 없이 행동했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "3e5894d1-e89f-428a-8ce4-26129aa6796a"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly – they were already on their way. And none of you knew about it? "
"Neither you nor your subjects? The songs that rise inside me were written "
"long ago by the great shamans and warriors of the past. I hear their voices "
"saying 'keep away, don't trust, be vigilant'. And these songs are about you."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"정확하다 – 그들은 이미 들어가 버렸지. 너희 중 누구도 그 사실을 몰랐나? 너나 네 신하도? 내 머릿 속에 떠오르는 노래들은 옛날의 "
"위대한 무당들과 전사들에 의해 쓰여진 것이다. 나는 그들의 목소리가 들려. '가까이 하지 말고, 믿지 말고, 경계하라'고 말하지. 그리고 "
"이 노래들은 너희들에게도 해당된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurSubLeader
msgctxt "2a380e03-8160-4794-a448-1aef77d9cb6f"
msgid ""
"\"Baron? Is this what two-legged call their rulers? Baron, ha! The Nomen "
"tribe has guarded this land for over a thousand years, and the two-legged "
"think they can own everything here because they wrote it on a piece of paper!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작? 두 발로 걷는 자가 군주라고 부르는 자인가? 남작, 하! 노멘 일족은 천 년 넘게 이 땅을 지켜 왔는데, 두 발로 걷는 것들은 "
"종이쪼가리에 써놓으면 뭐든지 가질 수 있는 줄 아는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "ae49c661-03f8-41cc-99df-3f3662a24736"
msgid ""
"\"I warned you. It is impossible to make peace with such creatures. You can "
"lament the bloodshed, but any half measures will only lead to more bloodshed "
"in the end. And then it will be the blood of your subjects, Maegar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 경고했잖나. 그런 생물들과 평화를 이루는 건 불가능하네. 자네가 유혈사태를 한탄할 수는 있겠지만, 반쪽짜리 조치는 결국 더 큰 "
"피를 부를 뿐이네. 그리고 나중에는 자네 신하들의 피가 될 걸세, 메이가르.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "6d05ac4b-b78b-4b8a-ac5a-065d7d6f9da1"
msgid ""
"{n}A whisper runs through the ranks of the centaurs. After a tense pause, "
"they lower their bows.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}켄타우로스의 대열 사이로 속삭임이 오갑니다. 긴장스러운 침묵이 있은 뒤, 그들은 활을 내립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b478c173-0889-44ab-9124-e411dae341f1"
msgid "{n}In an instant the centaurs have readied their weapons.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}켄타우로스들이 즉시 무기를 듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "0bbed91c-2db6-4e59-a1c3-1a7cd0cd1b49"
msgid ""
"\"We will withdraw. But your treachery will not pass without consequences. "
"The warrior priestess Aecora Silverfire will find out about everything, and "
"you will not trick us again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 철수하겠다. 하지만 너희의 배반을 대가 없이 그냥 넘어가진 않을 것이다. 전투사제 아에코라 실버파이어께서 모든 것을 알게 될 "
"것이고, 너희는 다시는 우리를 속이지 못할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurSubLeader
msgctxt "982d6cf2-b5c7-4520-8a06-be5d1b4c7ce3"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, we will go. But we will remember everything, two-legged. Do not "
"think you now own these lands, or that the ancient evil is yours to awaken! "
"The warrior priestess Aecora Silverfire will find out about everything!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 우리는 갈 것이다. 하지만 우린 모든 것을 기억할 것이다, 두발로 걷는 자여. 네가 지금 이 땅을 소유하고 있다고 생각하지 "
"마라. 고대의 악이 깨어나 너의 것이 될거라고 생각하지도 마라. 전투사제 아에코라 실버파이어님이 모든 것을 밝히실 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "6abcf294-1cf4-4d1b-85ce-c0e54bbb5223"
msgid ""
"\"Won-der-ful. This couldn't get any better. We've barely begun the barony, "
"and already we're on the verge of a war with the centaurs. Regent! General! "
"Before we return to Varnhold, we'll need to consider how we'll defend our "
"villages. Maybe there's a way we can repair the damage that's been done. As "
"for you, children – run on home to your parents!\""
msgstr ""
"\"훌-륭-해. 이보다 더 좋을 수 없군. 겨우 남작령 통치를 시작했는데, 벌써부터 켄타우로스들과 전쟁 직전이군. 섭정! 장군! 반홀드로 "
"돌아가기 전에 마을을 어떻게 방어할지 생각해봐야겠어. 어쩌면 우리가 지금까지 받은 손상을 복구할 수 있는 방법이 있을지도 몰라. 아이들은 "
"집으로 돌아가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "6101c9d7-3395-424e-9622-867e01985030"
msgid ""
"\"You lie, and squirm, and now you threaten us. I have heard enough. To "
"arms, brothers and sisters!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말하고, 끙끙대더니 이제는 우리를 협박하는군. 충분히 들었다. 무장하라, 형제자매여!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_end/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurSubLeader
msgctxt "b9606f8d-552d-4b82-a9d2-7f790c2bb351"
msgid "\"You dare to threaten us, two-legged? You will pay for this!\""
msgstr "\"두 다리로 걷는 놈들, 감히 우리를 위협하다니? 대가를 치르게 될 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "766f5619-6e74-417c-b391-ed20b6ab2ed5"
msgid "[Examine the centaurs' gear]"
msgstr "[켄타우로스의 장비를 검사한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c7a12da3-64eb-442b-a715-8871ebd8d289"
msgid ""
"\"I sense Desna's mark upon you, stranger. Does the goddess teach her "
"followers to attack the unarmed and threaten passers-by?\""
msgstr "\"이방인, 너에게서 데즈나의 표식이 보인다. 여신이 추종자들에게 비무장한 자들을 공격하고 행인들을 위협하라고 가르치던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f57d5efb-ba95-412e-8c1f-97986c6b475a"
msgid "\"How about we tame this insolent fellow's tongue?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 이 건방진 놈의 혀를 길들여주면 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "583e4544-c37c-4940-a696-71b97ffa850a"
msgid ""
"\"You worship Desna, stranger, and Desna is a good goddess. Do not discredit "
"her with unworthy actions.\""
msgstr "\"이방인, 너는 데즈나를 숭배하고, 데즈나는 선한 여신이다. 부적절한 행동으로 그녀의 명예를 훼손하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "795081f9-6f17-4f6a-ba03-b6499e5d75b7"
msgid "[Look closer at the symbols that the centaurs are wearing]"
msgstr "[켄타우로스가 지닌 상징들을 자세히 본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "a167726a-432f-43e3-8aad-a77e7fa45799"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "87c3f376-f8c2-441b-a818-08f4fb7af88d"
msgid ""
"\"Be easy, brave protector of the Nomen tribe. I know that you share no "
"bonds of friendship with the 'two-legged', but we are not Taldans. We are "
"not the invaders, who you once fought and killed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정해라, 노멘 일족의 용맹한 수호자여. 나는 네가 '두 다리로 걷는 자'와 우정도 유대도 없다는 걸 알지만, 우리는 탈도르인이 "
"아니다. 우리는 너희가 싸우고 죽였던 그 침략자들이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "feeac1ae-baba-4410-a550-5e2e65497089"
msgid "\"Maegar, we simply can't agree to that.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르, 우리는 거기에 간단히 동의할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "333f3dfe-af9b-4da4-9783-0064f1ee78da"
msgid "\"I don't want bloodshed. We must come to an agreement.\""
msgstr "\"나는 유혈사태를 원치 않는다. 우리는 합의점을 찾아야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "57ce6b6d-d4bb-4a7a-a414-d103680e1fe7"
msgid ""
"\"By any measure, we are newcomers to this land. If we want to remain here, "
"we'll have to respect the wishes and customs of those who've lived here long "
"before us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든 우리는 이 땅에서는 신참이오. 우리가 이곳에 남으려면 우리보다 먼저 이곳에 살았던 이들의 바람과 관습을 존중해야겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "f0237706-a2a6-40c3-98bd-2cbf6be553f9"
msgid ""
"\"Pff, so a tale about ancient evil is going to make us abandon this land, "
"that we worked so hard to win?\""
msgstr "\"흠, 그럼 고대 악에 대한 이야기로 인해 우리가 얻으려고 그렇게 열심히 일한 이 땅을 포기하게 되는건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d596ea5a-7d36-4468-a276-3013ca21914b"
msgid ""
"{n}This once-quiet glade in the heart of the planes of Dunsward now "
"resembles a low rocky shore, braced for the crash of a menacing wave. A team "
"of centaurs tower above a handful of people, scraping the ground and rising "
"to their hind legs from time to time. They seem nearly ready to trample "
"their frightened prey into the mud.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}던스워드 평원 심장부의, 한 때 잠잠했던 이 공터는 지금은 위협적인 파도에 맞서는 바위투성이 해변과 같은 모습입니다. 켄타우로스 한 "
"무리가 몇몇 사람들을 내려다보며 땅을 긁고 이따금씩 뒷다리를 들어올립니다. 그들은 겁에 질린 사냥감을 짓밟아 진창 속에 파묻을 준비가 "
"되어있는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CultistWomanSeekingHelp
msgctxt "88a56b49-f179-4e0f-9168-3992a8f9c3da"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing your party, a woman in simple peasant clothes breaks away from "
"the group and throws herself at Maegar's feet.{/n} \"Your Grace, Baron Varn! "
"Our prayers have been answered! We are the villagers of Old Stump. We wanted "
"to build a farm in these lands, but we barely started digging the cellar "
"when these monsters appeared!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소박한 농민의 옷을 입은 여자가 무리로부터 이탈하고 일행의 주목을 끌면서 메이가르의 발치에 몸을 던집니다.{/n} \"영주님, 반 "
"남작님! 우리의 기도가 이루어졌군요! 우리는 옛 그루터기 마을 사람들입니다. 우리는 이 땅에 농장을 짓고 싶었지만, 겨우 지하실을 파내기 "
"시작하자마자 이 괴물들이 나타났습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "73e64daa-ac94-48c4-8348-e67248bed48d"
msgid ""
"{n}A muscular centaur with black hide and dark hair leans forward, thrusting "
"out his chest and nearly trampling the woman.{/n} \"Howl louder. The more of "
"your kin you call forth, the fewer we'll have to root out from their holes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}검은 몸체와 검은 머리를 한 근육질의 켄타우로스가 상체를 앞으로 기울이고, 가슴을 내민 채 당장이라도 여자를 짓밟을 것처럼 "
"굽니다.{/n} \"더 크게 짖어라. 네 일족을 더 불러낼수록 우리가 구멍에서 뿌리 뽑을 놈들이 줄겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "5f945579-6bcf-4cb4-b632-f716aaa3e4dd"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar raises his hand in a powerful gesture, drawing everyone's "
"attention.{/n} \"What is it you want from these people?\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르가 힘찬 몸짓으로 손을 들자 모두의 시선을 쏠립니다.{/n} \"이 사람들한테 원하는 게 뭔가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "045efbc2-22c1-4cf1-bcf8-257cc4ac3bf5"
msgid ""
"\"What do we want, two-legged? You ask this, after everything your kin have "
"done?! You come to this land uninvited, dig up the ancient graves, and "
"attack us, the guardians of the land. What do we want? We want to clean the "
"world of the dirt you spread.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두 다리로 걷는 놈아, 우리가 원하는 게 뭐냐고? 너희 종족들이 다 저질러놓고 이제와서 묻는 거냐?! 너희는 초대도 없이 이 땅에 "
"와서 고대의 무덤을 파헤치고, 이 땅의 수호자인 우리를 공격하고 있다. 우리가 뭘 원하냐고? 우리는 너희가 뿌린 오물로부터 세상을 깨끗이 "
"하길 원한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "04bdc126-67d8-468a-b3c6-26c5fe31189d"
msgid ""
"{n}By the signs and patterns on their weapons and clothes, you recognize "
"them as belonging to the Nomen tribe – a warlike clan of centaurs that long "
"ago settled in these lands. In ages past, the tribe fought back {g|Taldor}"
"the Taldans{/g} who tried to settle the region – and were almost completely "
"wiped out. The Nomen haven't shown themselves for a long time, but they "
"hardly hold any warm feelings towards you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그들의 무기와 옷에 새겨진 표지와 무늬로 보건대, 그들은 노멘 부족에 속한 자들로 보입니다. 오래 전에 이 땅에 정착했던 호전적인 "
"켄타우로스 부족입니다. 오래 전, 이 부족은 이 지역을 개척하려 했던 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}인과 맞서 싸웠고 거의 전멸했습니다. "
"노멘 부족은 오랫동안 모습을 드러내지 않았지만, 당신에 대한 호의는 거의 없어 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "af3267c6-1a52-423c-811e-2c538c63ea88"
msgid ""
"{n}You manage to spot some symbols and patterns on the centaurs' weapons and "
"clothing, but do not recall anything useful about them. You only vaguely "
"remember that centaurs used to live in this region, long, long ago.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}켄타우로스의 무기와 의복에서 몇 가지 상징과 무늬를 발견하는 데 성공하지만, 그것들에 대해 어떤 유용한 것도 유추하지 못합니다. "
"당신은 켄타우로스들이 이 지역에 오래 전에 살았었다는 것을 어렴풋이 기억할 뿐입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "a9e4dd12-4e44-4bc6-be63-1e1c8442b737"
msgid ""
"{n}All the centaurs have pendants or signs depicting the moon – the symbol "
"of Desna in her aspect known as Mother Moon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}모든 켄타우로스들이 어머니 달로 알려진 데즈나의 상징인 달을 묘사한 펜던트나 표식들을 가지고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "d303ac56-dcf0-4871-8082-57294d3ff5c6"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a few symbols of obviously religious origin, but cannot determine "
"which of the many religions of Golarion they belong to.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 틀림없이 종교적인 것으로 보이는 몇 가지 상징을 확인하지만, 골라리온의 여러 종교 중 어느 종교에 속하는지는 알 수 "
"없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "b7ed0fac-789a-498b-a9d4-9c6cf1f844a2"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar nods in approval.{/n} \"That's right. We walk under the same moon, "
"stranger.\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"맞아. 우리는 같은 달 아래를 걷는다네, 이방인.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "8b3073d3-1f25-4f20-9040-5e46f6ab823b"
msgid ""
"\"I support the General's suggestion. A baron who allows insults and attacks "
"cannot be baron for long.\""
msgstr "\"나는 장군의 제안에 동의하네. 모욕과 공격을 허락하는 남작은 지위를 오래 지킬 수 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "98e99da7-2bd6-4ac9-a58c-cd0607751573"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, and more the pity we are not Taldans. At least they knew how a ruler "
"should behave on territory he plans to continue calling his own.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 그리고 덧붙여서 우리가 탈도르인이 아닌 것이 유감일세. 적어도 그들은 소유권을 주장해야 하는 영토에서 통치자가 어떻게 행동해야 "
"하는지를 알고 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "579035aa-e1b5-41c6-8faf-5d8bbb1f86f4"
msgid ""
"\"I've always thought it a good sign when hostile parties begin with "
"conversation, rather than an arrow in the face. If you will spend your time "
"insulting us, stranger, then you will surely spend a moment more to explain, "
"in detail, what my race – and my subjects – might have done to offend you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 적대적인 대상이 면전에 화살부터 겨누는 대신 대화를 걸어오는 건 언제나 좋은 징후라고 생각해 왔소. 이방인, 만약 너희가 우리를 "
"모욕하는 데 시간을 쓰고 싶다면, 내 종족, 내 백성들이 너희를 어떤 식으로 불쾌하게 만들었는지 설명할 시간도 좀 내주겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "a4c07398-2d40-44a1-83d1-77b5e1583352"
msgid "\"Easy, Cephal. {Name} is right.\""
msgstr "\"진정하시오, 케팔. {Name}이(가) 맞소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "af7b5232-0a25-4ab0-808e-9688d493ad16"
msgid ""
"{n}The centaur grins.{/n} \"You have an easy tongue, two-legged one. You "
"seek to make us drop our guard.\""
msgstr "{n}켄타우로스가 씩 웃습니다.{/n} \"달변가로군, 두 다리로 걷는 놈. 넌 우리를 방심시키려 하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "592d4f97-52d7-48d3-8ad7-a22fa3842488"
msgid ""
"\"What have we here? A two-legged with reason and dignity? Not like these "
"others. They are deaf to our warnings.\" {n}The centaur nods at the "
"settlers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이게 무슨 일인가? 이성과 존엄을 지닌 두 다리라? 여기 있는 것들과는 다르군. 이들은 우리의 경고에 귀 기울이지 않았다.\" {n}"
"켄타우로스는 정착민들을 향해 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "192a8c4c-61ff-4172-b4a2-198c86e81491"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, I will tell you. I will use the words of the ancient songs, and of "
"Aecora Silverfire, who sees far further than any of your sages and rulers. "
"We are the guardians of this land, and it is imbued with evil.\" {n}The "
"centaur speaks in a measured melodic voice, carefully reciting a sacred "
"teaching.{/n} \"Evil sleeps here, under each burial mound, under each "
"obelisk with one-eyed skulls. And you, two-legged, dig this ground like "
"moles, stealing secret treasures from the ancient graves, and tempting their "
"dread magic. You will ruin all. The one who sleeps must continue his "
"slumber. The caged one must remain behind bolt and bar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 말해주지. 고대의 노래와 에코라 실버파이어의 말을 인용하겠다. 너희의 어떤 현자나 군주보다 훨씬 멀리 보는 사람이다. 우리는 "
"이 땅의 수호자이고, 이 땅은 악에 물들어 있다.\" {n}켄타우로스는 침착한 곡조의 음성으로 조심스럽게 신성한 가르침을 읊조리며 "
"말한다.{/n} \"악은 여기, 각각의 무덤 아래, 각각의 첨탑 아래 외눈 해골과 함께 잠들었다. 그리고 너희들, 두 다리로 걷는 "
"자들은, 두더지처럼 땅을 파서 고대 무덤의 비밀스런 보물을 훔치고 그들의 무서운 마법을 탐냈다. 너흰 모든 것을 망칠 거다. 잠든 자는 "
"계속 잠들어 있어야 한다. 갇힌 자는 빗장과 창살 뒤에 있어야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "8f3d057c-50d1-4235-9505-bca4eddd0fc7"
msgid ""
"\"You have been warned. I would sooner believe a liar and a thief than a "
"grave robber like you. Now fight for your lives or run!\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 경고를 들었다. 너 같은 도굴꾼보다는 거짓말쟁이와 도둑놈을 믿는 것이 더 쉬울 거다. 이제 목숨걸고 싸울 건지, 도망칠 건지 "
"결정해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "e186022c-6523-4e96-b1af-ae18c0839efa"
msgid ""
"\"Do you understand, two-legged one? I'm giving you a chance to take this "
"rabble and leave. Go away from the City of Hollow Eyes, away from the burial "
"mounds, away from the obelisks and the other cyclops ruins. If you turn away "
"from the past, the Nomen tribe will leave you in peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두 다리 놈아, 알아들었나? 이 폭도들을 데리고 떠날 기회를 주는 것이다. 텅 빈 눈의 도시에서 멀리, 봉분에서 멀리, 첨탑이나 다른 "
"사이클롭스 유적에서 멀리 떨어져라. 과거로부터 신경을 끄면, 노멘 부족은 평화롭게 너희를 보내줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f16897b3-b5ff-4fea-8c6b-96613c69d3bf"
msgid "\"Quiet, you two! I want to hear what they have to say.\""
msgstr "\"둘 다 조용히! 난 그들이 무슨 말을 하려는지 듣고 싶소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "84f59d34-79a4-45a7-bd86-f621e5e9c142"
msgid ""
"\"Well that's just wonderful. By a rough estimate, he just demanded that we "
"relinquish two thirds of the barony. – Including the most fertile fields and "
"mines. Only the barren rocks in the mountains are free from cyclops ruins.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 정말 멋지군. 어림잡아서 그는 방금 우리에게 남작령의 3분의 2를 포기하라고 요구했네. – 여기에는 가장 비옥한 밭과 광산이 "
"포함되어 있지. 오직 산에 있는 척박한 바위들만이 사이클롭스 유적으로부터 벗어나 있다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8744b34d-f8f7-4dd0-afbf-8fe175e57db3"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar nods.{/n} \"Listen, stranger. We cannot simply leave this land. "
"But if your tribe will stop threatening the settlers, I will forbid them "
"from entering the cyclops tombs. My soldiers will patrol the area and punish "
"any trespassers. I would also like to meet the chiefs of your tribe. We "
"should learn to live side by side. I would also like to learn more about the "
"'evil' that sleeps here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"잘 들어라, 이방인. 우리는 이 땅을 그냥 떠날 수 없다. 하지만 너희 부족이 정착민들을 "
"위협하지 않는다면, 나는 그들이 사이클롭스 무덤에 들어가는 것을 금지할 것이다. 내 병사들이 그 지역을 순찰하고 침입자를 처벌할 것이다. "
"나도 너희 부족의 족장들을 만나보고 싶다. 우리는 함께 사는 법을 배워야 한다. 여기서 잠든 '악'에 대해서도 좀 더 배우고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "2a027ef9-4b3a-46f9-8dc7-9cd72be16444"
msgid ""
"\"The Nomen tribe is led by warrior priestess Aecora Silverfire.\"{n} The "
"centaur speaks boldly, then frowns.{/n} \"I do not believe a word you say, "
"human. But I will give you a chance. If the two-legged keep their noses out "
"of the tombs, then we will let them remain. Let them plant their orchards "
"and build their homes. But if a single one breaks our agreement, there will "
"be trouble. You have been warned. Hunters! Follow me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"노멘 부족은 전사 사제 에코라 실버파이어가 이끈다.\"{n} 켄타우로스는 담대하게 말하고 나서 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"네가 하는 말을 한 마디도 믿지 않는다, 인간. 하지만 너에게 기회를 주겠다. 너희 두 다리들이 무덤에서 떠난다면 그대로 내버려 두겠다. "
"과수원을 일구고 집도 지으라지. 하지만 만약 단 하나라도 우리의 합의를 어긴다면, 문제가 생길 것이다. 너는 경고를 받았다. 사냥꾼들! "
"따라와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "7945f4b1-0d73-47dd-aca9-fd629ad452ee"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar tries to interfere but doesn't get a chance. The centaur's face "
"darkens, and his eyes light up in anger.{/n} \"A tale? I knew I should never "
"have tried talking to you as equals. Hunters, to arms!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 간섭하려 하지만 기회를 잡지 못합니다. 켄타우로스의 얼굴이 어두워지고, 그의 눈은 분노로 이글거립니다.{/n} \"이야기"
"? 네놈과 대등하게 이야기나 나눠서는 안 될 줄 알고 있었다. 사냥꾼들, 공격준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7ef7146e-291a-40d7-a3fa-ec14d8e7e008"
msgid ""
"\"Quiet, Cephal, and you, {name}. I think we can – and must – try to come to "
"some kind of agreement. But of course, without uprooting two thirds of our "
"villagers, and leading them into the mountains where they'll eat moss and "
"stone. Let us talk, stranger. I'm sure we can find agreeable terms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조용히, 케팔, 그리고 자네, {name}. 나는 우리가 어떤 합의에 도달하게끔 노력할 수 있고, 그래야 한다고 생각해. 하지만 "
"물론, 우리 마을 사람들의 3분의 2가 고향땅을 떠나야 한다든지, 이끼, 돌멩이나 먹고 살 산 속으로 끌려가는 일도 없어야겠지. 얘기 좀 "
"하자, 이방인. 난 우리가 동의할 만한 조건을 찾을 수 있을 거라 믿는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardsCentaurLeader
msgctxt "0ce52ccc-7f90-41b4-8af3-5fcabb7cb6c6"
msgid ""
"{n}The centaur shakes his head.{/n} \"Mother Moon is my witness. I wish to "
"avoid bloodshed. But what we guard is more important than any of our lives, "
"two-legged!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}켄타우르스가 고개를 흔든다.{/n} \"어미니 달이 나의 증인이다. 나도 유혈사태를 피하고 싶다. 그러나 우리가 지키는 것은 그 "
"어떤 생명들보다도 중요한 것이다, 두 다리로 걷는 자여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "03e84185-96b8-47c2-a786-6d2d098013dc"
msgid ""
"{n}The moment the centaurs have left, Cephal sheds his nonchalant mask and "
"turns angrily to Maegar.{/n} \"What were you thinking?! These creatures are "
"unpredictable savages, and from what we hear, fanatics as well. As soon as a "
"trade caravan unknowingly stops at a wind-worn cyclops stele, or children "
"run inside a tomb when playing hide-and-seek, they will return, and bring "
"carnage with them. My friend, you can only make deals with equals, with "
"those who think as you do. But not with half-humans, who attack villagers "
"because of their primeval fables.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}켄타우로스가 떠나자마자 케팔은 태연함의 가면을 벗고 메이가르에게 화를 내며 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"무슨 생각을 한 건가! 이 "
"생물들은 예측할 수 없는 야만인이고, 우리가 들은 바로는 광신도들일세. 무역 캐러밴이 자기도 모르게 바람에 닳아 빠진 사이클롭스 비석에 "
"정차하거나, 숨바꼭질 놀이를 하는 아이들이 무덤 안으로 뛰어드는 순간, 그들이 돌아와 대학살을 일으킬걸세. 친구여, 거래는 자네와 "
"비슷하게 생각하는 사람들하고만 하게. 원시적인 우화 때문에 사람을 공격하는 반인반수들은 거래대상이 아닐세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ba0c1660-d94e-40f3-b9fe-d14335d7cd2b"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks down quietly at the dead centaur bodies.{/n} \"This could "
"have been avoided. I hope all their kin aren't such hotheads. I wouldn't "
"want to begin my rule by slaughtering a whole centaur tribe.\" {n}He's "
"growing more gloomy every moment.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 죽은 켄타우로스의 시체를 조용히 내려다봅니다.{/n} \"이 일을 피할 수도 있었을 텐데. 모든 그들의 일족이 이렇게 "
"다혈질은 아니었으면 좋겠군. 켄타우로스 부족을 모조리 도살하는 것으로 내 통치를 시작하고 싶지는 않아.\" {n}그는 매 순간 점점 더 "
"우울해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "28805ca2-7923-48eb-8566-f648498affd0"
msgid ""
"\"And how would you like your rule to begin? With a village slaughtered by "
"centaurs? Like it or not, but we cannot tolerate fanatics like them near our "
"villages. If you are incapable of seeing the great cost they would bring the "
"barony, then think of the safety of your people. Would you want children "
"testing their bravery in a cyclops' tomb to fall victims to these four-"
"legged savages.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 자네의 통치가 어떻게 시작되면 좋겠나? 켄타우로스가 학살한 마을로? 좋든 싫든 간에, 우리 영지 근처에서는 그들 같은 광신도들을 "
"용납할 수 없네. 그들이 남작령에 초래할 엄청난 댓가를 예측할 수 없다면, 자네 사람들의 안전을 생각해보게. 사이클롭스의 무덤에서 자신의 "
"용기를 시험하는 아이들이 이 네발 달린 야만인들의 희생자가 되길 바라나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : CultistWomanSeekingHelp
msgctxt "f0dfa220-ad66-4501-b154-9f88ff8cd3b7"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace... about the tombs... Our younglings did go there! To that huge "
"stone vault sticking out of the ground, to the south!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작님... 무덤 말인데요... 우리 아이들이 거기로 갔습니다! 땅 밖으로 튀어나온 저 거대한 석조 무덤으로요, 여기서 남쪽입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "57523102-df63-4e23-b7b7-39fcbad071ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar curses.{/n} \"When? I've half a mind to tell you about watching "
"your children, but the truth is I was once young and stupid myself, and "
"slipped my caretakers more than once. General! Regent! Let us go to that "
"'huge stone vault' and save the young fools. Drag them home by their ears if "
"needs must.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 욕을 합니다.{/n} \"그게 언젠가? 자네의 애 보는 솜씨에 대해 내심 뭐라 한마디 해주고는 싶네만, 사실 나도 한때는 "
"어리고 멍청했었고, 한 번 이상 보호자들 몰래 빠져나가곤 했지. 장군! 섭정! 저 '거대한 석조 무덤'에 가서 어린 바보들을 구하자. "
"필요하다면 그놈들 귀를 잡아 끌고서라도 집으로 데려와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f717c700-a01f-48b0-8a15-53f487ec09c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar turns pale.{/n} \"When?! Damn it, I only just promised the "
"centaurs that none of us would set foot in the tombs. If they spot those "
"fools poking around, there will be trouble. General! Regent! Let us go to "
"that 'huge stone vault'!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르의 낮빛이 창백해집니다.{/n} \"그게 언젠가?! 젠장, 우리 중 아무도 무덤에 발을 들여놓지 않겠다고 켄타우로스들에게 "
"방금 약조했다고. 만약 이 바보들이 들쑤시고 다니는 걸 그들이 본다면, 문제가 생길 거야. 장군! 섭정! 그 '거대한 돌 무덤'으로 가자!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/CentaursVsSettlers_intro/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "95697fa6-999a-4227-af53-da5df39ff2ce"
msgid ""
"\"And you would prefer to slaughter them all and be done with it? Until we "
"discover their motives and learn their location and numbers, wouldn't you "
"think it wiser to proceed with caution? This doesn't sound like you, old "
"friend. You would execute a small patrol on a whim, to watch all of Varnhold "
"burn tomorrow? No, we must learn what we can of their motives, and determine "
"the need for an armistice. But do not imagine me blind to menace these "
"centaurs pose to our villages. I will take any steps necessary to protect "
"them. But that does not include slaughtering an entire patrol, or ultimately "
"a whole tribe, simply because centaurs lack all skill at diplomacy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면 당신은 그들을 다 도살하고 마무리하길 바라오? 우리가 그들의 동기를 밝혀내고 그들의 위치와 숫자를 알아내기 전까지는, "
"조심해서 움직이는 것이 현명하지 않겠소? 당신답지 않군, 오랜 친구여. 변덕으로 작은 순찰대 하나를 처치하고 내일 반홀드가 불타는 걸 "
"지켜보려는 거요? 아니, 우리는 그들의 동기에 대해 우리가 대응할 수 있는지 보고, 휴전할지 말지 결정해야 하오. 하지만 내가 이 "
"켄타우로스들이 우리 마을을 위협하는 것에 눈감고 있다고 생각하지는 마시오. 나는 그들을 보호하기 위해 필요한 어떤 조치라도 취할 거요. "
"그러나 그 조치에, 단지 켄타우로스들의 외교술이 모자라다고 순찰대 하나, 또는 궁극적으로 부족 전체를 학살하는 건 포함되어 있지 않소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e3c46a99-d684-4ffe-949a-11164b070888"
msgid "[Look closer at the gang]"
msgstr "[그 패거리들을 더 자세히 살펴본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2bfa3cbc-9f26-418e-8d65-b148b45b89c2"
msgid "\"If you want my opinion, commander, I think we should hear them out.\""
msgstr "\"제 의견을 원하신다면, 대장님, 저들의 말을 끝까지 들어봐야 할 것 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b7fcd48a-1291-4770-a796-933707b2ddb0"
msgid ""
"[Draw your weapon] \"We are not bandit scumbags like you, and make no deals "
"with your kind!\""
msgstr "[무기를 뽑는다] \"우리는 너 같은 도적놈도 아니고, 너희 부류와는 거래도 안 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "4e020e50-1645-48a6-9db3-6cb69232082e"
msgid ""
"\"Just to get this straight, some person or creature fried your gang until "
"they sizzled, and now you want our help to get the better of them?\""
msgstr "\"확실히 말해봐, 어떤 사람인지 괴물인지가 너희 패거리들 지글지글 튀겨버렸는데, 우리보고 도와달라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "af62eece-0375-4432-9ca7-f001d6686ef2"
msgid "[Look at your companions]"
msgstr "[당신의 동료들을 본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "ed5265f9-c2c2-4860-90e0-574e05adaf23"
msgid ""
"\"Why should we share the loot with this rabble? Let's kill them, and then "
"the dragon.\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리가 이 하찮은 놈들과 약탈물을 나눠야 하죠? 다 죽이고, 그 다음에 용도 마저 처리하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "93855df2-fb46-4791-a206-b8e00d74b6fa"
msgid ""
"\"Under other circumstances I wouldn't listen to these thugs, but a dragon "
"is far too dangerous. We should unite with them even if only to protect our "
"lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 상황이었으면 이런 깡패들의 말은 안 듣겠지만, 용은 너무 위험해요. 우리 땅을 지키기 위해서라도 저들과 협력해야 돼요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "80ed4d53-05ec-4dc3-9001-09d4a9038ffe"
msgid ""
"\"We can't abandon our principles, no matter what is at stake. No deals with "
"bandits.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 이해관계가 걸려도 원칙을 버릴 수는 없죠. 도적들과 거래는 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "15d61092-32f3-42e9-a06d-22eb8a7029c7"
msgid "\"One should never reject a favorable offer. No matter who makes it.\""
msgstr "\"우호적인 제의는 절대 거절해선 안 돼요. 누가 제안했든지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "9ca07d22-bd0b-469f-8b88-c64cb4348c21"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "74d24ae1-2733-4367-9f42-bbd02cfc4a3f"
msgid ""
"\"I like it when bandits come out on their own, and literally ask to be "
"regaled with a sword.\""
msgstr "\"난 도적들이 제 발로 다가와선, 말 그대로 칼로 대접해달라고 요구해대는 게 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "ff9ec7b0-0d55-445e-9e2e-e11da40a4c14"
msgid ""
"\"We don't need to fight. After all, Yan has come to us to talk openly. Let "
"him take his people from the barony and go his own way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 싸울 필요가 없어요. 어쨌든, 얀이 우리에게 와서 솔직히 얘기했어요. 그가 남작령에서 자기 사람들을 데리고 자기 길을 가도록 "
"하시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "112c7f42-282b-4102-8c23-8e14024281b1"
msgid ""
"{n}A large group of thugs armed to their teeth approaches you openly. The "
"one in front walks with a swagger. He's a tall man, and the right half of "
"his face is covered in an intricate pattern of scars and tattoos.{/n} "
"\"Captain Varn – or rather Baron Varn! I had a feeling that you'd appear "
"here sooner or later. I've been looking forward to this moment. You can call "
"me Pale Yan. I am the leader of this honorable society of freedom-loving "
"travelers, ha ha.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}단단히 무장한 큰 무리의 깡패들이 대놓고 당신에게 다가옵니다. 앞서 나온 사람이 으스대며 걸어옵니다. 그는 키가 큰 남자인데, "
"얼굴의 오른쪽 절반은 흉터와 복잡한 문신으로 덮여 있습니다.{/n} \"반 단장 – 아니 반 남작이려나! 당신이 조만간 여기에 나타날 것 "
"같은 느낌이 들었지. 이 순간을 손꼽아 기다려왔다. 창백한 얀이라고 불러주시오. 나는 자유를 사랑하는 여행자들로 이루어진 이 명예로운 "
"집단의 우두머리라네, 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "9d5e2eec-75be-4ebe-be5d-3e710d4240f4"
msgid ""
"\"It's an amazing place, my barony. Even the bandits here are surprisingly "
"polite and well-spoken.\" {n}Maegar seems completely nonchalant.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 남작령은 참 놀라운 땅이군. 도적들까지도 놀랄 만큼 예의 바르고 말솜씨가 좋은데.\" {n}메이가르는 완전히 태연해 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "8c9dcff7-5bce-4838-bd1b-8a5ad88c0c1b"
msgid ""
"\"A barony usually suits its ruler.\" {n}The bandit smiles broadly, then "
"scoffs.{/n} \"I wouldn't be talking to any of those smug nobles from Brevoy "
"or Pitax. But the glory of Varnling Host precedes you, so I'm making an "
"exception. I have a business proposal for you – information and my lads' "
"swords, in exchange for a share in the loot... and your lady law will turn "
"her blind eyes elsewhere for now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작령은 보통 그곳의 지배자에게 걸맞는 법이지.\" {n}도둑은 활짝 웃다가 조소합니다.{/n} \"나는 브레보이나 피탁스에서 온 저 "
"우쭐대는 귀족들과는 대화하지 않아. 하지만 반링 호스트의 영광은 익히 들었으니, 예외를 두려고 해. 당신에게 사업 제안이 있어. 내 "
"정보와 부하들을 빌려줄 테니, 그 대가로 노획물을 나누는 거야... 그리고 당신네 법의 여신은 이 순간을 못 본 체해야겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "4da5ef46-5a94-4e54-85ca-773b32b8b157"
msgid ""
"{n}The gang appears excellently armed and equipped. However, the bandits "
"have obviously just come from a fight. Most are scratched and wounded, their "
"clothes torn – and what's more interesting, several have burns left by fire "
"or electricity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 패거리들은 훌륭하게 무장하고 있는 것 같습니다. 그러나, 산적들은 분명 막 싸움을 끝냈습니다. 대부분은 긁히고 상처를 입었으며, "
"그들의 옷은 찢어졌습니다 – 더 흥미롭게도, 몇몇 사람에게 불이나 전기로 인한 화상이 남아있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "bbacedec-2873-42f6-9c57-6e7eabdec693"
msgid ""
"{n}The gang is well armed and equipped, but you can tell little more by just "
"looking at them.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}산적들은 무장도 잘 되어 있고 장비도 잘 갖추어져 있지만, 그냥 보기만 해서는 그 이상을 알 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "6142bfe4-c0f4-40b6-af24-56196a71ee17"
msgid ""
"\"In the name of Asmodeus, will we ever be done sorting out the tavern "
"riffraff, who are ready to cross swords over every imagined insult?!\""
msgstr "\"아스모데우스시여, 무슨 말을 하든 욕인 줄 알고 달려드는 저런 선술집 쓰레기들과는 드잡이 좀 안 할 수는 없는 건가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "646df65e-4c3f-48e1-b62b-1215baec39ff"
msgid ""
"\"Under normal circumstances, I would reproach you for insubordination, "
"General. But right now I don't feel the need. To arms!\""
msgstr "\"장군, 평범한 상황이었다면 자네의 불복종을 책망했을거야. 하지만 지금 당장은 그러지 않아도 될 것 같군. 공격 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "a809647b-2172-4796-a725-c27808bd5988"
msgid ""
"\"What a pity. Fine, let's see if you're as good in a fight as they say!\""
msgstr "\"그거 참 유감이군. 좋아, 저들이 스스로 말하는 것처럼 싸움에 능한지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "3575a51c-bfd2-48af-b847-7516f9adf246"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar laughs softly.{/n} \"General, don't swallow him whole right away. "
"Leave a few pieces for the rest of us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"장군, 너무 한 번에 다 처리하려고 하지 말게. 남은 우리들을 위해 몇 조각쯤 남겨 달라고!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "6694f1fd-5786-49ff-ac86-9aa236d37dff"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar makes a wry face but nods.{/n} \"So what did you want to tell me?\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 얼굴을 찡그리지만 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래서 무슨 말을 하고 싶나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "df9e0aaa-4665-46cc-9a76-6f812793b8aa"
msgid ""
"\"You have good eyes, General. I wonder if they see the potential benefits "
"of such an arrangement, or can't you see past my singed pride?\""
msgstr ""
"\"눈썰미가 좋으십니다, 장군. 저들이 이런 협정의 잠재적인 이익을 보는건지 모르겠군, 아니면 과거에 불탄 내 자존심을 모른체 하는건가?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "8104ca46-d89f-426d-b8ed-15ace715d909"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you the whole story. A while ago, a small group of locals were "
"lucky enough to witness the spectacle of a lifetime. – Two dragons fighting "
"above the wastelands. One of them appeared to be the legendary Ilthuliak. "
"That old viper hasn't left her nest for a long time! Of course she won the "
"battle, and her opponent narrowly escaped. Wounded, it struggled eastward, "
"and somehow got over the Tors of Levenies – and finally ended up here! He's "
"been sitting in the middle of the cyclopes' ruins for a few days, and "
"doesn't seem ready to leave.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 모든 이야기를 당신에게 들려주지. 얼마 전, 소수의 현지인들이 운 좋게 일생일대의 광경을 목격했어. – 황무지 위에서 싸우는 용 "
"두 마리. 그 중 하나는 전설적인 일수리악으로 보였어. 저 늙은 독사는 오랫동안 그녀의 둥지를 떠나지 않았지! 물론 그녀는 그 전투에서 "
"이겼고, 그녀의 상대는 가까스로 탈출했어. 부상당했고, 동쪽으로 힘겹게 움직여서, 어떻게든 레베니스 바위산맥을 넘어, 마침내 이곳에 "
"당도했지! 그 녀석은 며칠째 사이클롭스 폐허 한가운데 앉아 있는데, 떠날 준비가 안 된 모양이더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "b8a50715-1f93-4914-9e3b-2fa82156d0a5"
msgid ""
"\"This is an urgent matter, Sir Varn. You have a bloody dragon in your "
"barony. Wounded, but still most deadly. He killed a few centaurs – we saw it "
"with our own eyes. It won't be long before your villagers cross his path, "
"and that will be a bloodbath. My lads wouldn't stand a chance against the "
"monster, although we're ready to fight if we must. You and your current "
"party couldn't beat him either. But if we joined forces, we might take down "
"the beast – and share between us the treasures and artifacts it's taken from "
"the ruins. I promise you, afterwards we will leave your lands and do our "
"work somewhere far, far away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반 남작, 이건 시급한 문제야. 당신은 자기 남작령에 피 흘리는 용을 데리고 있는 거라고. 부상당했지만 여전히 가장 치명적이지. 그는 "
"켄타우로스 몇몇을 죽였어. 우린 그걸 직접 두 눈으로 목격했지. 머지않아 너희 마을 사람들이 그놈 앞을 지나가게 될 것이고, 그럼 그땐 "
"피바다가 될 거야. 우린 싸워야 할 때 싸울 준비가 됐지만, 내 부하놈들은 그 괴물의 상대가 되기 어렵지. 당신과 당신의 지금 일행도 "
"놈을 잡긴 어려울 거야. 하지만 우리가 힘을 합친다면, 그 괴물을 쓰러뜨릴 수 있을지도 몰라 – 그리고 그 괴물이 폐허에서 가져간 "
"보물들과 유물들을 나눠가질 수도 있어. 약속하지, 그 후에 우리는 당신의 땅을 떠나 멀리멀리 떨어진 어딘가에서 우리의 일을 할거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "bce6453e-dc01-4f73-a52b-ad8b09442b8f"
msgid ""
"{n}As the bandit sets out his ideas, Maegar grows darker and darker. There's "
"little doubt – he's preparing to order an attack, and put the gang down here "
"and now.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}산적이 자신의 말을 끝냈을 때부터, 메이가르의 분위기는 점점 어두워집니다. 의심의 여지도 없습니다. 그는 공격을 명령할 준비를 하고 "
"있고, 산적들을 이 자리에서 제압할 참입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "bcd45365-fcfa-4316-9791-e4f7f171aa6a"
msgid ""
"{n}Cephal watches the leader's face closely, and draws himself together – "
"undoubtedly preparing for a bitter dispute, but it would be unseemly to "
"argue in front of the thugs. The sharp words will have to wait until the "
"action is done.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}케팔은 리더의 얼굴을 가까이에서 지켜보고는, 가까이 다가갑니다. 의심의 여지 없이 쓴소리를 준비 중이겠지만, 산적들 앞에서 논쟁하는 "
"것은 꼴불견이 될 겁니다. 날카로운 언동은 조치가 취해질 때까지 보유될 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "e0c7d001-6222-401d-bc3f-9053d7616953"
msgid ""
"{n}Cephal starts to rub his hands together, apparently preparing for a "
"fight.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케팔이 두 손을 비비기 시작합니다. 의심할 여지없는 전투 준비입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "1f1086c2-434a-4c26-8814-1d9d4d5d431d"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to your General, Baron, if you don't want to listen to me.\" {n}The "
"wizard speaks softly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"내 말을 듣기 싫거든 자네 장군의 말을 듣게, 남작.\" {n}마법사가 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ad01b0cf-e272-4531-a11f-bdf25d8b011c"
msgid ""
"\"Captain Varn has spent most of his life fighting bandits and murderers. I "
"wouldn't want Baron Varn to commence his rule with an ill-fated partnership "
"with them. Forgive me, Sir Pale Yan. In appreciation for your politeness, I "
"suppose I shall grant your widow a pension, if you have one!\""
msgstr ""
"\"반 단장은 인생의 대부분을 도적과 살인자들과 싸우며 보냈지. 나는 반 남작은 잘못 점지된 동업으로 통치를 시작하길 원치 않아. "
"용서하게, 창백한 얀 경. 네 예의에 감사하여, 네 과부에게는 연금을 주지. 만약 네가 부인을 뒀다면 말야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "c36837ca-f006-47f0-bdd3-a18db0f5787d"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks at Cephal, then at you, then back at Cephal again.{/n} \"A "
"unified front, huh! I don't like this, but I've grown used to heeding your "
"advice, and I don't doubt you now.\" {n}He turns to the bandit.{/n} \"You "
"have my word, Sir Pale Yan. We will kill the dragon together, and you can "
"leave with half the loot.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 케팔을 바라보다가, 당신을 바라보다가, 다시 케팔에게 눈을 돌립니다.{/n} \"연합 전선이라, 허어! 이런 건 싫지만, "
"당신의 충고에 귀 기울이는 데 익숙해졌고, 이젠 당신을 의심하지 않소.\" {n}그는 산적에게 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"내 약속하지, "
"창백한 얀 경. 우리는 함께 용을 죽일 것이고, 당신은 노획물의 반을 가지고 떠나도 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "93dff829-31f0-46a7-aa7d-33483dc3fe15"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit salutes.{/n} \"The beast lies to the southwest. We will be "
"waiting for you nearby. Come join the fun!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산적이 경례를 합니다.{/n} \"짐승은 남서쪽에 있어. 우리는 근처에서 당신들을 기다리도록 하지. 와서 재미 좀 보라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "fd63e5eb-f36c-4f49-bbf5-2bc33d96589f"
msgid ""
"{n}A tense silence hangs in the air. Maegar doesn't speak, either pondering "
"his thoughts, or awaiting a reaction from you and Cephal.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}긴장된 침묵이 공중에 감돕니다. 메이가르는 좀 더 생각하는건지, 아니면 당신과 케팔의 반응을 기다리는건지 아무 말도 하지 "
"않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "74798770-67f5-43a2-80fc-d9ceb3da7539"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar fakes a friendly smirk.{/n} \"Sir Pale Yan, I'm sure this "
"rehearsed speech is very impressive, but I'm afraid it comes a little late. "
"The dragon is... how do I put it? No longer a problem. Your gang in my "
"lands, on the other hand...\" {n}Maegar stops expressively, as if making "
"room for anyone who wishes to reply.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 다정한 거짓 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"창백한 얀 경, 준비된 연설은 아주 인상적이었네, 그러나 좀 늦은 감이 있어 "
"유감이군. 그 용은... 이걸 어떻게 표현해야 하나? 더 이상은 문제가 아니야. 반면에 내 땅에 있는 당신 패거리들은...\" {n}"
"메이가르는 말을 잠시 멈춥니다. 마치 대꾸하고 싶은 사람을 위해 여지를 주려는 듯 보입니다 .{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "f71643d1-49f2-4a6f-af22-199bd0b76272"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar frowns.{/n} \"So what, we just let them rob people, even on "
"somebody else's lands?\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그래서 뭐, 다른 사람의 땅에서도 강도짓을 하게 놔두자는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "65d0ebd2-b258-45c5-a940-9601b64321fb"
msgid ""
"\"What do you care what happens beyond your borders? Take care of your "
"subjects, don't take extra risks just to play at being magnanimous.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네 국경 너머에서 무슨 일이 일어나든 무슨 상관인가? 자기 신하들을 잘 돌보고, 단순한 영웅놀이로 사서 위험을 감수하지 말게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ad436ef1-0796-4311-8878-2d91e6cdfaa1"
msgid ""
"\"I'm surprised. You and the General present a united front! Fine, I will "
"heed your advice. Do you hear, Sir Pale Yan? Gather your rabble and get out "
"of my lands. If I see you again within the lands my barony, there will be no "
"time for talk!\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀랍군. 당신과 장군이 연합 전선을 제안하다니! 좋아, 당신 충고에 귀를 기울이지. 들었나, 창백한 얀 경? 네 왁자지껄한 산적들을 "
"데리고 이 땅에서 나가라. 내 남작령 안에서 너를 다시 만난다면, 그땐 대화의 시간은 없을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/DunswardGang/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_DunswardBanditsLeader
msgctxt "5c2c6bf6-74a2-4510-8d68-26be1d845ce2"
msgid "{n}The bandit salutes grimly.{/n} \"Have a nice day yourself, baron!\""
msgstr "{n}산적은 음울하게 경례를 합니다.{/n} \"좋은 하루 되시길, 남작!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "143ec388-6f41-425b-8ad6-ce30cd0eb8cd"
msgid ""
"\"To trust a dragon, and an evil one at that? He will attack us as soon as "
"we help him heal!\""
msgstr "\"용, 그것도 악룡을 믿고? 그는 우리한테 치료를 받자마자 우리를 공격할 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1fecd771-2d6a-4cf9-ae2f-f8e8acc02913"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever else he may be, he's a living creature and he's in trouble. It "
"shouldn't be difficult to help him, and if he betrays us – well, we know "
"what to do with traitors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"성향이 어떻든 간에 그는 살아있는 생명체고 곤경에 처해 있어요. 그를 돕는게 어려운 일은 아니고, 만약에 우리를 배신한다면 – 뭐, "
"우리는 배신자들을 어떻게 해야 할지 알죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "eb091948-cb44-431c-82ec-74f2755776d4"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"An artifact would come in handy for us too. And I've always "
"wanted to hang a dragon's skull on my wall!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"유물은 우리에게도 유용하게 쓰일 거야. 그리고 나는 늘 내 벽에 용의 두개골을 걸어두고 싶었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "6750b8c2-302d-4533-8df5-1ef49747d544"
msgid "\"He doesn't need a wife for that. He has you.\""
msgstr "\"그런 일로 아내가 필요하진 않을 겁니다. 당신이 있으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "ad438ca9-005e-4fa2-bd8d-2f5b5493b59b"
msgid ""
"\"A dragon is a living, thinking creature. I'm not saddened that we spared "
"its life.\""
msgstr "\"용은 살아있고, 지각이 있는 생물이죠. 우리가 그것의 목숨을 살려준 게 슬프진 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "cb0daa2f-266c-4943-9068-16324588bd2e"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the best idea to spend all our strength fighting a dragon, when "
"our barony faces so many other problems.\""
msgstr "\"남작령에 다른 문제도 많은 이런 때에, 우리 힘을 용이랑 싸우느라 다 써버리는 건 좋은 생각이 아니예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "c1bab1dd-3d75-450c-8d18-4c222e9342f8"
msgid "[Shrug] \"You know better.\""
msgstr "[어깨를 으슥한다] \"당신이 더 잘 알겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "abd4b02d-81a8-41da-801f-e551b4e79a74"
msgid ""
"\"So the future Lady Varn will put up with your escapades for years, offer a "
"shoulder to lean on when there's trouble, and won't run off, or bite off "
"your head? Are you sure there's another woman like that in all of Golarion, "
"besides me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 미래의 반 부인은 수 년에 걸친 당신의 도피 생활을 견디고, 문제가 있을 때 기댈 수 어깨를 내밀고, 도망가지도 않고, 머리를 "
"물어뜯지도 않으려나? 골라리온 전역에 그런 여자가 있는 게 확실한가요, 나 빼고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "d9faddcb-2c7c-4e1a-a7a1-4578e2ebdae1"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon towers over you like a giant rock. His scales are blue to "
"rival the sky, and the neck proudly arches. But one wing sticks out at a "
"strange angle, and his sides are torn and ragged, covered in acid burns.{/n} "
"\"Oh, guests. Please, come closer, don't fear. We can help each other.\" {n}"
"The dragon utters the words with obvious effort, looking cautiously "
"around.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}용이 거대한 바위마냥 당신의 위에 우뚝 섭니다. 그의 비늘은 하늘과 견줄만큼 파랗고, 목은 당당하게 휘었습니다. 그러나 한쪽 날개는 "
"이상한 각도로 튀어나왔고, 옆구리가 찢어지고 너덜너덜하며 산성 화상으로 뒤덮여 있습니다.{/n} \"오, 손님들. 부디, 가까이 오게. "
"겁내지 말고. 우린 서로 도울 수 있어.\" {n}용은 주위를 조심스럽게 둘러보면서 또박또박 말을 내뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "b67d1e0e-9d01-4d9b-b2c4-77fa242be153"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings to you too, Sir Polite Dragon. What ill fate brings you to my "
"dominions?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하시오, 정중한 용이시여. 도대체 무슨 불운으로 내 영지까지 오셨소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "c4c64a35-ccb8-4c28-ba19-86d7a5980c8b"
msgid ""
"\"Please bear my bluntness, human, but for someone like me, your 'dominions' "
"are just a word. I dash through the sky, cutting across the dominions of "
"princelings and kinglet every moment. And over my lifetime, your borders "
"will change two hundred times, and then two hundred more.\" {n}The dragon "
"snorts loudly – the closest he can come to laughter, given his condition.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나의 무심함을 이해해다오, 인간. 그러나 나 같은 자에게 너의 '영지'는 그저 한마디 개념일 뿐이지. 나는 하늘을 질주하고, 매 순간 "
"소국의 군주들과 왕의 영지를 가로지르지. 그리고 내 평생 동안에도 너희들의 국경은 200번도 넘어서 추가로 200번은 더 변할 게야.\" "
"{n}용이 크게 콧김을 냅니다. 그가 용이란 점에서 볼 때 폭소하는 것에 가깝습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "440e049e-4d05-4e01-8f14-321213b749c9"
msgid ""
"\"A valid point. Then please bear my bluntness as well. Most rulers wouldn't "
"want an unknown dragon in their dominions. Especially a blue one like you. "
"Your kind is not known for its kindness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타당하군. 그럼 내 무심함도 참아주시오. 대부분의 군주들은 그들의 지배하에 미상의 용을 원하지 않을 거요. 특히 당신 같은 "
"파란색말이지. 당신네 종족은 그리 친절하다고 알려지진 않았소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "dac2e131-f1bf-4410-91a5-5a89ef074373"
msgid ""
"\"A polite way to say that we usually exterminate and rob your kin.\" {n}The "
"dragon snorts out another laugh.{/n} \"I would be happy to spare you my "
"presence, but I am unable. Do you see what has happened to my wing? Only my "
"stubbornness got me over the mountains, but it won't take me any further. My "
"wounds... are painful. The acid continues to burn, and the magic stings and "
"stings. Damned Ilthuliak is not above robbing and devouring other dragons! "
"But I escaped, and I'll be healed before she finds me again. All I need is "
"an artifact from the stash here, hidden under these slabs. Bring me its "
"wholesome magic, and I will repay you. And yes, I will take myself far away "
"from here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 평소에 너희를 죽이고 약탈하는 것을 공손히도 말하는군.\" {n}용이 또 한 번 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"네게 기꺼이 "
"자리를 비켜주고 싶지만 그럴 수가 없다. 내 날개에 무슨 일이 일어났는지 보이나? 내 끈기로 산맥은 어찌 넘었지만, 더 이상은 안될 것 "
"같다. 내 상처는... 고통스럽군. 산성이 계속 타오르고 있어. 그리고 마법도 계속 따끔거리게 만드는군. 빌어먹을 일툴리악은 다른 "
"드래곤들을 약탈하고 집어삼키는 걸 멈출 녀석이 아니야! 그래도 난 탈출했고, 그녀가 날 다시 찾기 전에 나을 거야. 내가 필요한 건 상자 "
"안의 한 유물이다. 이 판자 밑에 숨겨져 있지. 내게 이로운 마법 물품을 가져다 주면, 난 너에게 보답하겠다. 그리고 그래, 여기서 멀리 "
"떠나도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7eca8b8d-bcb1-4d89-9233-6acb45ec011b"
msgid "{n}Maegar turns to you and Cephal.{/n} \"What do you say?\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 당신과 세팔에게 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"어떻게 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "739a54d2-b98f-4e3e-b550-8149ebc7a8f1"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like the idea of doing battle with a dragon on a whim. But I don't "
"stand for giving him a precious artifact.\""
msgstr "\"나는 변덕스럽게 용과 전투를 한다는 생각이 마음에 들지 않네. 그러나 그에게 귀중한 유물을 건네주는 것도 찬성하지 않네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "6cbad26d-a322-42a0-b0d9-1436d0eeb09c"
msgid ""
"\"I am not so opinionated about this creature's ability to honor his word. "
"But truth be told, I simply cannot see any reason to let him go – and "
"certainly no reason to give away a precious artifact.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 생물이 약속을 지킬지에 대해선 따로 의견이 없다네. 하지만 솔직히 말해서, 나는 그를 놓아줄 어떠한 이유도 찾을 수 없고 – "
"확실히 귀중한 유물을 나눠줄 이유도 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e72a5cb0-ccd8-468b-b171-326686b3b2d4"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, Sir Polite Dragon, but I don't trust you. And I will sleep "
"better at night, knowing that you won't come back one day to rob my lands "
"and kill my people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용서하시오, 정중한 드래곤이시여, 하지만 나는 당신을 믿지 않소. 그리고 언젠가 당신이 내 땅을 유린하고 내 백성을 죽이기 위해 "
"돌아오거나 할 수 없다는 것을 알면 밤에 더 잠이 잘 올 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "9a578f47-c148-4245-8285-16bbf7a548b5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm in a generous mood, so I'll heed the General. Sir Polite Dragon, what "
"is this artifact you require?\""
msgstr "\"관대하게 나가보고 싶군, 장군 말에 귀기울이겠소. 정중하신 드래곤이여, 당신이 필요로 하는 그 유물은 무엇이오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "e27f31ab-847a-46b7-aa46-3ea3cb38c343"
msgid ""
"\"You have it, oh foolish creatures. You collected it from the charmed "
"treasury. So, will you give it to me?\""
msgstr "\"넌 그걸 갖고 있다, 어리석긴. 너는 매료된 보고에서 그것을 수집했다. 그래, 그걸 나에게 주겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "0d918bb7-4831-4350-a348-048a65db77c3"
msgid ""
"\"It is here, under these slabs. It is guarded by protective magic, but "
"there must be a way to get past. Return to me here. I will be waiting!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기다, 이 나무판자 밑에 있지. 보호마법으로 지키고 있지만 반드시 지나갈 방법이 있을 것이다. 여기로 돌아와라. 기다리고 있을테니!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ce00cafe-14b0-49f0-b675-cb1f5eac25cc"
msgid "\"To hell with you. Take it, and fly away.\""
msgstr "\"지옥에나 가시오. 갖고, 날아가버리시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "91e33257-c735-462b-bac3-bc0ff39b6a57"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you feel vaguely unsatisfied? I do. A little sad. – We could have "
"fought a dragon but didn't...\""
msgstr "\"좀 아쉽지 않나? 난 그래. 좀 슬프군 - 용과 싸울 수도 있었지만...그러지 않았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "f6f62dbd-4c20-4456-a88d-640f81593208"
msgid ""
"\"It is time you get married, my friend. You can battle an angry dragon "
"every evening, if you wish.\""
msgstr "\"이 친구야, 이제 결혼할 때야. 원한다면 매일 저녁 성난 용과 싸울 수 있을걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "6d219058-fb1c-4052-9f7e-d4e5669c3e7a"
msgid "\"You've found it – I can sense it! Give me what you promised, human.\""
msgstr "\"찾았군. 느낄 수 있어! 약속했던 것을 내게 다오, 인간.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "57edb945-97bc-4001-8da1-6356908d9590"
msgid ""
"{n}The artifact disappears from Maegar's hands. The dragon is surrounded by "
"a flash of power, and you watch as his wounds close, and his wing "
"straightens. Entirely healed, he gives Maegar a cruel and clever look.{/n} "
"\"Well, human? You expect a treacherous attack, do you not? And not only "
"expecting, but longing for it. Thus you could boast of your generosity in "
"helping a poor wounded creature, while still making away with the loot.\" {n}"
"The dragon lets out a resonant squawk, seemingly overcome with laughter.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}유물이 메이가르의 손에서 사라집니다. 용은 섬광같은 힘에 둘러싸입니다. 당신은 그의 상처가 닫히고, 날개가 곧게 펴지는 것을 "
"봅니다. 완전히 치유된 후, 그는 메이가르에게 잔인하고 교활한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"자, 인간? 기만적인 공격을 예상하는 것 "
"같군, 안 그런가? 그리고 예상뿐만 아니라, 그렇게 나와주길 바라는가. 그러면 너는 훔치지 않고도 불쌍한 상처입은 짐승을 돕왔다는 "
"관대함을 뽐낼 수 있겠지.\" {n}용은 울리는 듯이 꽥꽥거리는 소리를 내지릅니다. 보아하니 웃음이 터져나오는 걸 참으려는 듯 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "64ecdd24-6878-4798-9b51-bc540b3564a0"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar bends in half in laughter, either at your words or at the "
"indignant expression on Cephal's face.{/n} \"What would we ever do without "
"your jokes, General?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신의 말이나 케팔의 분개해 하는 얼굴 표정을 보고는 웃느라 반쯤 몸을 구부립니다.{/n} \"네 농담이 없이 우리가 "
"어떻게 살까, 장군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "1773332f-234c-4df3-95c2-31a52f35cb5d"
msgid ""
"\"A living, thinking creature the size of a small mountain, possessing "
"impressive strength and magical power. Save your pity for something a little "
"less threatening, {name}\"."
msgstr ""
"\"살아 숨쉬고 생각하는 생물이 덩치는 작은 산만한데다가 힘은 천하장사에 마법까지 부릴줄 아는군. 동정심이란건 이것보단 귀여운 생물을 "
"위해 아껴두게, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "96ca3511-9b96-4beb-a579-a202700b9f30"
msgid "\"I wholeheartedly agree.\""
msgstr "\"전심으로 동의하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "14762891-d6e8-48a4-80d0-f04eb08ab2be"
msgid "\"Fine, that's enough idle talk. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 쓸데없는 얘기는 그만하지. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardBlueDragon
msgctxt "29a3d558-4cc8-4fb9-9576-ee1226a74ce7"
msgid ""
"\"Fortunately for you, I do honor my arrangements. So I am leaving – for "
"now. Take your reward. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"너희에게는 다행히도, 난 내 합의를 존중하지. 그러니 나는 지금 떠나겠다. 보상을 받아라. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "afd809a1-d5e2-4866-b0b8-48e21ecacc65"
msgid ""
"{n}Having finished laughing, he looks at you.{/n} \"As for potential "
"marriage, I humbly hope it may resemble a loyal alliance, and not a battle "
"with a monster.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}웃음을 끝마치고, 그는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"결혼 가능성에 대해서는, 괴물과의 전투가 아닌 충실한 동맹의 모습을 닮았으면 하는 "
"겸허한 바람일세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "bcb36dfd-0efe-4861-a193-95f1bb87254a"
msgid "\"Do you see? Even {name} is tired of your empty rhetoric.\""
msgstr "\"알겠나? {name}도 자네의 공허한 미사여구에는 지치는구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/NewDunswardOutdoor/InjuredDragon/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "625d6404-8db0-40c3-b7ec-2edddb184207"
msgid ""
"\"There is! It's Kjerdi!\" {n}Maegar smiles proudly.{/n} \"However, in her "
"eyes I'm an insolent greenhorn who hasn't even entered my fifth decade. The "
"most I could expect from her is to adopt me. I'm afraid that rather narrows "
"down the list of candidates for the role of Baroness Varn. I'm literally "
"left with no choice!\""
msgstr ""
"\"있지! 셰르디야!\" {n}메이가르는 당당하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"하지만, 그녀의 눈에는 내가 오십 초입에도 채 들어가지 않은 "
"건방진 풋내기로 보이겠지. 내가 그녀에게 그나마 기대할 만한 건 그녀가 날 입양해주는 일일 거야. 그것이 오히려 반 남작 부인 역의 "
"후보자 명단을 좁힐까봐 두렵군. 난 말 그대로 선택의 여지가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/TheLair/Ambush_bark1_String
msgctxt "5c35c859-ebb6-431e-9180-5ad597e1487f"
msgid "\"Yergrace! Chest good, no need kicking!\""
msgstr "\"깍하! 궤짝 좋다, 걷어찰 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/TheLair/Ambush_bark2_String
msgctxt "d001abc3-4518-406a-8bae-6ef46f5e3cf9"
msgid ""
"\"Chests eat goblins s'mtimes! I saw once! If it eats me, you be with no "
"baron no more!\""
msgstr "\"궤짝들이 대때로 고블린을 먹어! 나도 한 번 봤어! 그게 날 먹으면, 넌 더 이상 아무 남작이랑도 못 있게 될거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/TheLair/Ambush_bark3_String
msgctxt "bc511791-62b7-4ddf-a87a-604279232eb3"
msgid "\"Me open it for you, Baron Yergrace!\""
msgstr "\"난 널 위해 그걸 연다, 남작 깍하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/TheLair/Ambush_bark4_String
msgctxt "14342606-8e1b-4631-a669-98c75ce3a12b"
msgid "\"Me be baron, chest be mine! No touching baron's treasure!\""
msgstr "\"나 남작 된다, 궤짝은 내거야! 아무도 남작의 보물에 손 못대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/TheLair/BeforeAmbush_Varn_String
msgctxt "5873494a-2c64-4387-af95-b3c067442be3"
msgid "\"Something is wrong here. Be on your guard!\""
msgstr "\"뭔가가 잘못되었군. 경계하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/TheLair/GoblinBaronName_String
msgctxt "8165c170-bd4b-42ea-b74e-ef1fd142779e"
msgid "Yergrace"
msgstr "깍하"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Rotalquest_fishermen-1_String
msgctxt "b73f86df-08e4-416d-8995-e07971936950"
msgid "\"Doun with the Tyran!\""
msgstr "\"폭구늘 귿장내라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Rotalquest_fishermen-2_String
msgctxt "fc54f0bf-6f0a-4e83-8f94-841dfe760bd9"
msgid "\"Up the Rivalution!\""
msgstr "\"헉멍을 준비해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Rotalquest_fishermen-3_String
msgctxt "20f93208-e428-4021-8113-78216eb6bcc4"
msgid "\"We will Winn!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 이겨어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Rotalquest_granary-1_String
msgctxt "8820bbb3-db60-45cb-b8db-6c61979aaba2"
msgid "The guard has been knocked senseless, but she's all right."
msgstr "경비원이 의식을 잃었지만, 그녀는 괜찮습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Rotalquest_granary-2_String
msgctxt "53cf83c5-d72d-4c79-853c-d30e10b2a646"
msgid ""
"They took the pitchforks, scythes and flails from the barn – anything that "
"could be used as a weapon."
msgstr "그들은 헛간에서 쇠스랑, 낫, 도리깨 등 무기로 사용할 수 있는 모든 것을 가져갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Royalquest_fishermen-after-1_String
msgctxt "3f86de04-401b-44c2-92aa-55e3db9bd62e"
msgid "\"We'll clean this place up! Everything will be good as new!\""
msgstr "\"이곳을 치우자! 모든 게 새것처럼 좋아질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Royalquest_fishermen-after-2_String
msgctxt "8ae54454-45b4-4a1f-84e8-dffb72a2ebd4"
msgid "\"The baron isn't mad at us, is he? We didn't mean any harm!\""
msgstr "\"남작이 우리에게 화난 건 아니겠지? 우리는 아무런 해를 끼치려는 의도도 없었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Royalquest_fishermen-after-3_String
msgctxt "e01a93b3-a5a1-4039-be1c-425b5335abc9"
msgid "\"Ugh, that Galtan snake! She played us for fools!\""
msgstr "\"으윽, 저 갈트의 뱀 녀석! 그녀는 우리를 바보 취급했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Settler_1_String
msgctxt "96e75132-0d9f-47cf-a70f-8cd7686a57a1"
msgid "\"It's warmer here than in Brevoy... But is the soil fertile?\""
msgstr "\"브레보이보다 따뜻하긴 한데... 땅은 비옥한가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Settler_2_String
msgctxt "91a07291-7e51-44f5-8ee8-f9bdc431459e"
msgid "\"A new place – a new life!\""
msgstr "\"새 터전에서 새 삶을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Settler_3_String
msgctxt "db84034b-f9c5-400a-8167-dcc8d387216f"
msgid ""
"\"It's a little bare here for now... But it's all right! If we work hard, in "
"a few years this will be a great town!\""
msgstr "\"지금은 좀 휑하긴 하네요... 하지만 괜찮아요! 열심히 일하면, 몇 년 안에 멋진 마을이 될겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Settler_4_String
msgctxt "ce16806c-6e18-437e-9c34-e13052495592"
msgid ""
"\"All the tombs around the town make me feel uneasy. Like we settled down in "
"a giant cemetery!\""
msgstr "\"마을 주변에 무덤이 널려있어 좀 불안해요. 거대한 공동묘지에 정착한 기분이 들거든요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Settler_5_String
msgctxt "a22e3086-a400-4231-a288-371f77837fcb"
msgid "\"Finally, a place I can call home!\""
msgstr "\"마침내 나한테도 고향이 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Soldier_1_String
msgctxt "0b6f2865-42e0-4b43-abd7-0d88844c254c"
msgid ""
"\"I still can't believe we have our own state. It's a good thing we followed "
"Varn!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 나라를 갖게 되다니 아직도 믿겨지지가 않네요. 반을 따라서 정말 다행입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Soldier_2_String
msgctxt "39dbce40-1153-481e-b72c-9cd9fdcb4b1d"
msgid ""
"\"There's bandits and monsters all over the place. We'll need to double the "
"patrols!\""
msgstr "\"도적과 괴물이 사방에 널려있습니다. 순찰대가 두 배는 더 필요합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Soldier_3_String
msgctxt "30e75c45-172d-4088-af47-792e7c9eaa66"
msgid ""
"\"The settlers aren't hurrying to join the militia. Everyone wants to live "
"in a warm house, but who's going to protect those houses?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정착민들이 별로 민병대에 참여하지 않으려 합니다. 모두들 따뜻한 집안에 있으려고 하죠. 그럼 그 집은 대체 누가 지키란 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Soldier_4_String
msgctxt "9e1eb22f-0527-480b-8583-51bcd067cf67"
msgid ""
"\"We should build a solid stone wall around the town... There are plenty of "
"cyclops tombs all around. Should we take them down for bricks?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 마을에 견고한 돌벽을 둘러야 합니다... 주변에 사이클롭스 무덤이 많은데, 거기서 벽돌을 빼 쓸 순 없을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Soldier_5_String
msgctxt "f33f2205-0aec-4288-8ce8-7c618aa20a7d"
msgid "\"It feels like someone is watching us all the time...\""
msgstr "\"항상 누가 지켜보고 있는 듯한 기분이 드는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barcs_locals/Undertaker_String
msgctxt "6c40b427-4f98-47cb-b4d0-f30c9b0a6018"
msgid "\"A barony of our own? That's quite an – undertaking. Ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"우리 남작령이요? 장래가 아주 기대됩니다. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "08ffa794-4ab0-40ce-afd7-83a76afa1684"
msgid "[Give 5 gold coins] \"Here you are!\""
msgstr "[금화 5개를 준다] \"여기!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3a352d18-de42-4249-b050-534e8db9aabe"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3146fa42-5857-46b4-a07e-e7af4219bb00"
msgid "\"You don't look like a zombie.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 좀비처럼 보이진 않는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "032b8a51-7296-439f-8f4d-80516a95c51b"
msgid "\"What are you singing about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 노래를 부르고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d14daaab-1c89-44b1-86fa-fb05bc264034"
msgid "\"Where did you find an inn like this?\""
msgstr "\"이런 여관은 어디서 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "5ebae20c-3ae1-4585-b43c-9842055248a9"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Barks/Bard_Song_1_String
msgctxt "c11d3833-24f6-4120-9b65-02e4a580ffb3"
msgid ""
"\"...The skull came flying down the hall, as a baneful wrecking ball...\""
msgstr "\"...해골은 괴상한 철구마냥 복도를 날아 내려왔다....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Barks/Bard_Song_2_String
msgctxt "980054e1-2db0-43cc-93a9-59d8f67b5eb6"
msgid ""
"\"...The stranger shook his head – 'my dears, I have been dead for fifteen "
"years!'\""
msgstr "\"...낯선 자는 그 머리를 저었다 – '내 사랑, 난 십오 년을 죽은 채로 지냈다네!'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Barks/Bard_Song_3_String
msgctxt "a074dace-9eab-4b2b-bddc-afe8b60a0309"
msgid ""
"\"...The darkness settled o'er the lad, and on the spot he then went mad!\""
msgstr "\"...어둠이 그를 뒤덮고, 그 순간 남자는 미쳐버렸네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2f76148e-f0cf-45b5-b856-f7bb0d9ee3e8"
msgid ""
"{n}The bard stands before you, looking rather bizarre. He clearly inherited "
"his waistcoat, which was once expensive, but is now worn and tattered, "
"covered in motley patches and embroidered with skulls. The musician's face "
"is covered with white powder, and his eyes and cheekbones accented with "
"black.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}음유시인이 다소 기괴한 모습으로 당신 앞에 섭니다. 물려받은 것이 분명한 조끼는 한때는 비싼 옷이었겠지만 지금은 낡고 너덜너덜해져 "
"천 조각으로 마구 덧대었고, 군데군데 해골이 자수가 보입니다. 분장한 하얀 얼굴은 두 눈과 광대뼈를 뒤덮은 검은 칠이 눈길을 "
"끕니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "7ca396e6-e7dc-4c9c-bb3a-e2153643042e"
msgid ""
"\"So long as my song is not getting old, I'll sing of the fool, humble but "
"bold. You there – General! A coin for the minstrel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 노래가 낡아빠지는 날까지, 바보에게 바치는 노래를 하리라, 겸손하고도 담대한 그를 노래하네. 거기 장군님! 음유시인에게 동전 한 "
"닢 던져 주시지 않겠습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "a435d21b-5a6b-477a-bf14-95890904830c"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, your 'ighness! I swear I'll spend it all in here – and it's "
"enough to last a year!\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다, 나리! 맹세컨대 나는 이 안에서 돈을 몽땅 쓸 겁니다. 그리고 이거면 족히 1년 동안 버틸만큼 충분합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "dc7d6712-2ac6-452c-901f-303ec865bf12"
msgid ""
"\"A raucous rascal of no small fame. – The Zombie Jester is my name! Ha ha "
"ha!\""
msgstr "\"아무런 명성 없는 요란한 악당. – 좀비 어릿광대가 제 이름입니다! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0dd95e25-3a0c-4fd2-949c-f7268313771b"
msgid ""
"\"For now, it seems, I'm still alive – but Cayden only knows what will "
"happen tomorrow! I was given this name for my songs. Other bards sing of "
"heroes and romance, flowers and other such rot. My songs are...\" {n}The "
"bard strikes a low and dissonant chord on his lute.{/n} \"Far more "
"interesting!\""
msgstr ""
"\"현재로서는, 저는 아직 살아 있는 것 같습니다만, 오직 케이든만이 내일 뭐가 일어날지 알 겁니다! 저는 제 노래에 이런 이름을 "
"붙였어요. 다른 음유시인들은 영웅들과 로맨스, 꽃, 그리고 다른 썩을 것들을 노래합니다. 제 노래는..\" {n}그 음유시인은 낮은 "
"불협화음으로 류트를 퉁깁니다.{/n} \"훨씬 더 흥미롭지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "cb08f41f-4fe6-4997-9dd8-7da6c47d2725"
msgid ""
"\"Now I'm writing a new song – it's about an inn where today's travelers are "
"fed meat carved from yesterday's travelers, ha ha! By the way, it's not just "
"a tale, it's the truth! – I've been there, tasted their human meat pies "
"myself – and barely escaped with my skin!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 지금 새로운 곡을 쓰고 있습니다 – 그것은 오늘의 여행자들에게 어제의 여행자들로부터 잘라낸 인육을 먹이는 여관에 관한 이야기에요, "
"하하! 그건 그렇고, 이건 단순한 이야기가 아니라 진실입니다! – 제가 직접 거기 가서 그들의 인육 파이를 맛봤고, 내 껍질만 남겨서 "
"간신히 탈출했어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "d7a0bfcf-e734-44a3-80d5-f3321ffbbd61"
msgid ""
"\"Of horrors and miracles! Of demons and the dead! I'll sing you to sleep, "
"and you'll wet your bed! Here in the Stolen Lands there are horrors "
"everywhere – enough for a new song every day!\""
msgstr ""
"\"공포와 기적! 데몬들과 죽은 자들! 제가 잠 올 때까지 노래로 불러드리죠, 그리고 당신은 자기 침대에 오줌을 지릴 겁니다! 이곳 "
"도둑맞은 땅에는 공포가 도처에 널려 있습죠. 매일 새 노래를 쓸 만큼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "60d21e24-c203-4a8d-809b-580808140a45"
msgid ""
"\"I've been to the Shrike Hills – and returned with a dozen new songs. Songs "
"of the insane Stag Lord, of evil fey pranks and trollish feasts, werewolves "
"and lake dragons and spider dances... And now I'm here to write one about a "
"cyclops.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 슈라이크 구릉지에 가 보았고, 십여 곡의 신곡을 가지고 돌아왔습죠. 미친 수사슴 군주의 노래, 사악한 페이의 장난과 트롤들의 "
"축제, 늑대 인간과 호수의 용, 그리고 거미들의 춤... 그리고 지금은 여기서 사이클롭스에 대한 곡을 쓰고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "238ef514-5a3f-46e7-ba64-11adbbd573a9"
msgid ""
"\"At Blackstones Ford! If you don't believe me, go there yourself, and look "
"what they have in their pots!\""
msgstr "\"검은돌 여울에서요! 제 말을 못 믿겠으면 직접 가서 저들의 솥에 뭐가 들었는지 보십쇼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Bard/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "42602032-0799-4488-ba06-18e6fd555829"
msgid "\"Good riddance! Don't let the skeleton cyclops bite your heels!\""
msgstr "\"속이 다 시원하네! 사이클롭스들 해골들에게 발뒤꿈치를 물리지 않도록 조심하십쇼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Barks_Items/LanderNewLetter_String
msgctxt "b6b87268-1750-4a7d-b178-be54b749c755"
msgid ""
"\"Baron Maegar Varn,\n"
"I am writing to you as your ally and well-wisher. The reason for my letter "
"is the lack of foresight in your actions. You're trying so hard to become "
"friends with the ruler of the Shrike Hills barony. You invite your neighbor "
"to pay you a visit, you even send rich gifts. Have you nothing more to do in "
"your lands? I strongly recommend you to stop flirting with this upstart "
"person and turn your gaze to the affairs of the day. You are trying to cross "
"the path with powerful forces that can reach you even in your own castle. "
"You should know your place.\n"
"With wishes of good health and calm sleep,\n"
"your friend\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작 메이가르 반,\n"
" 나는 너의 동맹이자 너의 행복을 바라는 사람으로서 이 편지를 쓰고 있어. 내가 편지를 쓴 이유는 너의 행동에 선견지명이 부족하기 "
"때문이야. 넌 슈라이크 구릉지의 지배자와 친구가 되려고 애를 쓰고 있어. 이웃을 초대해서 방문하게 하고, 풍성한 선물까지 보내지. 네 "
"땅에는 더 할 일이 없는 거야? 나는 네가 저 졸부놈과 시시덕거리지 말고 당면한 일에 눈을 돌리라고 강력히 추천하겠어. 넌 자기 성에서도 "
"손 닿을 일을 갖고 굳이 길을 건너려고 들고 있는 거라고. 네 입장을 제대로 파악하는 게 좋겠어.\n"
"건강과 평온한 수면을 기원하며,\n"
"너의 친구\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a5c5a6a5-17ba-4207-9ae4-cc7d00917d68"
msgid "\"What do you think about the barony's prospects?\""
msgstr "\"남작령의 전망에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "7d04c569-02a2-4cfb-bff6-a3514b20073a"
msgid ""
"\"It went beautifully! We developed a plan, carried it through, and captured "
"the witch.\""
msgstr "\"실로 완벽했죠! 우린 계획을 세우고, 그대로 실천했고, 마녀를 잡았어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "7ca3e40b-a34b-43fc-b08b-2a2964af7aa9"
msgid ""
"\"The best part was when we slaughtered the witch's henchmen and used their "
"heads to frighten her.\""
msgstr "\"제일 좋은 부분은 마녀의 심복들을 도륙내서 그들의 머리를 마녀 앞에 들이대고 공포에 빠뜨리는 순간이었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "70e69a24-f855-478b-94fc-bc8029254f4d"
msgid ""
"\"Was that the time we defeated a cunning and powerful enemy, using three "
"dozen goat horns and a bucket of phosphorescent paint? Ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"염소 뿔 30개와 인광 페인트 한 통을 가지고 교활하고 강력한 적을 물리쳤던 게 그 때였던가요? 하 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "826ebd0f-fc23-494c-8b68-6a6b879f99c3"
msgid ""
"\"You and Maegar constantly argue about everything. How did you manage to "
"bring the Varnling Host to the victory despite the discord?\""
msgstr "\"당신과 메이가르는 뭐가 됐든 간에 틈만 나면 싸우네요. 이렇게 사이가 나쁜데 어떻게 반링 호스트를 이끌 수 있었던 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "d4abb1e3-aa57-4cc8-9d0d-eeb857649b52"
msgid ""
"\"This is true. And I've managed to convince Maegar that you're right on "
"more than one occasion.\""
msgstr "\"맞아요. 저도 메이가르에게 당신이 옳다고 설득한 적이 여러 번 있었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "ee1483dc-c2ca-465b-a965-278dedc31aa2"
msgid "\"Yes. Maegar is my commander, and I support his decisions.\""
msgstr "\"네. 메이가르는 내 지휘관이고, 나는 그의 결정을 지지해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "b0b54d7c-2701-4e49-8d8a-d8a2b3aabf94"
msgid ""
"\"You both defend your opinions so ardently that you often overlook things.\""
msgstr "\"둘 다 열심히 자기 주장만 하다보니 가끔 놓치는 부분도 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "4cf0367d-f2e6-4c84-9f35-3c04e862dd21"
msgid ""
"\"Making decisions is you and Maegar's responsibility. I only carry things "
"out.\""
msgstr "\"결정을 내리는 건 메이가르의 몫이에요. 나는 그저 따를 뿐이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "e373f99d-fb7a-4f52-8109-7437d6d31367"
msgid "\"You wanted to talk about something.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 얘기하고 싶었던 거 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "cf98f994-49b5-4a55-a77d-df8008b5ea6e"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar's diplomacy may yet play into your plans. If he convinces our "
"neighbor that we're friends, they'll drop their guard, and we can attack by "
"surprise. Or we could even unite and attack Rostland together.\""
msgstr ""
"\"메이가르의 외교가 당신의 계획에 영향을 줄 수도 있죠. 만약 그가 우리 이웃과 친구가 되는 데 성공한다면, 그들은 경계를 풀 것이고, "
"우리는 기습 공격을 할 수 있을 거예요. 아니면 단결해서 함께 로스틀랜드를 공격할 수도 있고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "22080379-9ac5-438c-a0f1-f9386a8eec67"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Jamandi wants to use us, but she makes no secret of her intentions. "
"She is a good ally, and having free Rostland as a neighbor is in our "
"interests.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자만디는 우리를 이용하고 싶어하지만, 자신의 의도를 숨기진 않아요. 그녀는 좋은 동맹이고, 로스트랜드의 해방은 이웃인 우리에게도 "
"이득이 될 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "31029c9d-14fb-40bd-bd8c-a0bb95d29cca"
msgid ""
"\"You say that Maegar is reckless, but in fact you're the one dragging us "
"into a dangerous venture.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 메이가르가 무모하다고 하지만, 사실은 당신도 우리를 이 모험으로 끌어들였죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "1aea812a-2545-48b1-9b49-ec171ae4596f"
msgid ""
"\"I keep thinking, more and more often – do we really need Varn? Maybe you "
"and I could rule Varnhold... without him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 요즘들어 점점 더 자주 이런 생각을 해요 - 우리에게 반이 정말 필요해요? 그 없이... 당신과 내가 반홀드를 지배할 순 "
"없을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "a79ace6f-66b2-4d52-8160-64e43435a1d6"
msgid "\"What do you think about this Gunderson?\""
msgstr "\"건더슨을 어떻게 생각해요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "16a71987-8172-4b9f-95a6-eb29e875cf54"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가야겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "91589482-5e0b-4e0f-b1ba-c7bc29a56cc2"
msgid "\"Tell me, how did you end up in a party of mercenaries?\""
msgstr "\"말해 봐요, 어쩌다 용병단에 흘러 들어온 거예요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "c9381811-4b7d-4636-ba5d-3558c4a9fcb3"
msgid ""
"\"We've fought together for a long time, but I still don't know much about "
"you. Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 같이 싸운지도 오래됐는데, 아직 당신에 대해 아는게 별로 없네요. 어디 출신이죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ecc06c82-77b4-48d8-9473-8a70114830be"
msgid ""
"\"Hello, hello! Come in, sit. I am a little busy just now, but I can make "
"some time for you. You are not bothering me over nothing, are you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 그래! 어서 오게, 이리 앉고. 지금 좀 바쁘긴 하지만, 자네라면 시간을 못 내줄건 없지. 별것도 아닌 일로 날 괴롭히려는건 "
"아니겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "8bb82dfa-c8b6-409a-9ca1-61899df6e519"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that {d|Varn}Maegar{/d}! I am so angry with him! Why do I still "
"bother? I should have left the party after that idiocy in Ustalav! Or at "
"least after the debacle in Mivon! If I had any sense, I would never have "
"gotten involved at all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 저 {d|Varn}메이가르{/d}! 반 때문에 정말 미쳐버리겠군! 왜 내가 여기서 애를 쓰고 있는겐가? 우스탈라브에서 그 바보 "
"같은 짓을 하고 파티에서 나왔어야 했는데! 아니면 최소한 미본에서의 그 실패 이후에라도! 내가 조금만 더 감이 좋았더라면 엮이지 않았을 "
"텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "efefaa82-9949-4a81-8cc6-c9ac5e2b5d27"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. That puffed-up fool {d|Varn}Varn{/d} is destroying this barony faster "
"than we can build it! An alliance with our western neighbor is madness – and "
"now he is sending them gifts! He takes resources we work so hard to obtain, "
"and which are so scarce around here – and gives them away freely to our "
"principle adversary!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 저 거만한 바보 {d|Varn}반{/d}은 우리가 수습하는 것보다 빠르게 남작령을 망치고 있네! 우리의 서쪽 이웃과 동맹을 "
"맺는 것은 미친 짓일세. 그런데 그는 이제 그들에게 선물까지 보내는구만. 우리가 뼈빠지게 일해서 간신히 얻은 이 지역의 귀한 자원들을, "
"잠재적인 적들에게 넘겨주고 있단 말일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "f142c543-0e5f-41c8-992b-0698aeb50acb"
msgid ""
"\"I am none too hopeful – at least not until Varn gets his head straight, "
"and starts learning to see things like a politician, not a brawler. The "
"experience of our shared ventures does not reassure me. Need I remind you "
"how we hunted the Noose, that infamous witch?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 별로 낙관하고 싶지 않네. 반이 정신을 차리고 싸움꾼으로서가 아니라 정치가로서 보는 법을 배울 때까진 말일세. 이건 우리가 모험을 "
"하면서 겪은 사실들에 비추어 봐서도 안심할 수가 없네. 우리가 어떻게 그 악명 높은 마녀인 누스를 사냥했는지 상기시켜 줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "2d8fe8ef-6b83-492f-8d0f-4cb6ac421d2e"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, the part of the operation you were responsible for went perfectly. "
"But let me remind you what had happened before that. Varn got it into his "
"head that we should not wait for support, but instead seize the Noose within "
"days, by any and all means. And what was his ultimate suggestion? To pose "
"himself as bait, to pretend that commander had been 'betrayed' by members of "
"the party, and surrender to the witch.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 자네가 담당한 작전은 완벽하게 진행되었네. 다만 그 전에 무슨 일이 있었는지 되짚게 해주게. 반은 우리가 지원을 기다리는 게 "
"아니라 며칠 내로 어떤 수단을 써서라도 누스를 잡아야 한다고 생각했네. 그리고 그의 궁극적인 제안은 무엇이었겠나? 자신이 미끼를 "
"자처해서, 부하들에게 '배신'당한 지휘관을 가장하고 마녀에게 투항하는 것이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ec2ba7a1-d339-4ee5-8af8-edeb966221c7"
msgid ""
"\"I admit it ended well, considering how foolish the initial plan was. You "
"will recall that I insisted we wait for support from the {g|Galt}Galtan{/g} "
"scouts, before we attacked the witch. But Varn offered to use himself as "
"bait, and put on a bit of theatre. The party's 'betrayal', his 'surrender' "
"to the enemy...\" {n}Cephal shakes his head in disapproval.{/n} \"If you "
"remember, he called you out for the 'carnage', never stopping to consider "
"that his insane plan was the cause!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 일이 잘 끝났다는 건 인정하네. 처음 계획이 얼마나 바보같은 작전이었는지를 생각하면 말이야. 자네도 내가 마녀를 공격하기 전에 "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g} 정찰대의 지원을 기다리자고 주장한 것을 기억할 걸세. 하지만 반은 자신을 미끼로 쓰겠다고 제안했고, 약간의 "
"연극을 했지. 일행의 '배신', 마녀에게로의 '투항'...\" {n}케팔은 못마땅해서 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"자네도 "
"기억하겠지만, 그는 자네를 '학살'로 불렀고, 자신의 미친 계획으로 말미암은 작전을 멈추지 않았네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "2af7d876-cc2b-484f-a0a3-1fbcdc4da728"
msgid ""
"\"It was the time you decided we should rely on a cheap masquerade as a "
"stratagem. Ambushing a witch, after making the entire party look like a "
"horde of horned demons! – I refuse to believe there was any logic behind "
"this. However, Varn's initial plan was so ridiculous that it could hardly "
"have been made any worse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네가 그 싸구려 위장술을 믿기로 결정한 게 그때였지. 마녀를 매복하게 두고, 온 일행을 뿔 달린 악마 무리처럼 꾸며놓고! – 나는 "
"이 작전에서 논리라고는 전혀 찾아볼 수가 없었어. 하지만 반의 초기 계획은 너무 바보같아서 더 이상 나빠질 수도 없었네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "8cc779d7-7b75-4574-9f89-ea0bbce58657"
msgid ""
"\"I have no complaints about you, of course. You strictly adhered to the "
"plan, and indeed we were able to seize the witch. But the plan itself!\""
msgstr "\"물론 자네에겐 불만이 없네. 자네는 그 계획을 철저히 지켰고, 실제로 우린 마녀를 잡을 수 있었지. 하지만 계획 자체가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "abc580c8-14ee-4215-8092-cbf28052db4b"
msgid ""
"\"I will give you credit. You did everything in your power to prevent the "
"insane idea from ending in abject failure. Slaughtering all the witch's "
"henchmen and frightening her was all well-advised. But the initial plan...\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 자네를 신뢰하네. 자네는 그 미친 계획의 실패를 막기 위해 최선을 다했어. 마녀의 심복들을 모두 도살하고 그녀를 겁주는 것은 모두 "
"잘 보완됐지. 하지만 처음 계획은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c024d5c9-39d5-4d58-b9e3-f50a7969ec1c"
msgid ""
"\"A cheap masquerade is no stratagem. Two words he considered before "
"launching into action: 'why not?' In any case, it is difficult to ruin "
"something that is fundamentally beneath criticism – by which I mean Maegar's "
"initial plan.\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸구려 위장술은 계책이라 할 수도 없네. 그가 실천에 옮기기 전에 고려했던 두 단어: '왜 안되지?' 무엇이 되었든 간에 애초부터 "
"비판할 가치도 없는 것을 깎아내리는 건 힘든 일일세, 메이가르의 처음 계획 같은 것 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "03ef5bcb-3873-458d-810a-0f391016f4a2"
msgid ""
"\"By a miracle, no less. {d|Varn}Varn{/d} is a natural tactician, able to "
"turn defeat into victory with a single maneuver. But strategy, long-term "
"planning, politics – the words are meaningless to him. How many times has he "
"won a war only to lose the peace! How many times has everything we've paid "
"for in blood somehow ended up in someone else's vault?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그야말로 기적이지. {d|Varn}반{/d}은 타고난 전술가야. 한 번의 기동으로 패배를 승리로 바꿀 수 있지. 하지만 전략, "
"장기적인 안목, 정치란 단어는 그에게는 아무런 의미조차 없다네. 그저 싸우려고 이긴 싸움이 몇번이나 되는지! 우리가 흘린 피의 대가가 "
"몽땅 남의 손에 들어간 적은 또 몇 번이나 되는지 알고 있나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "927a07a2-4d6f-474f-9b51-02ce5ebe6ed5"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, do not pretend you are a passive bystander to our arguments! "
"Whatever we discuss, you always have an opinion, do you not?\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든, 우리 논쟁에 아무 상관 없는 방관자인 양하지 말게. 우리가 무엇을 논쟁하던 간에 자네도 항상 의견이 있을테니 말이지. 그렇지 "
"않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "2d040dff-4124-44c6-98c5-f9a28c691457"
msgid ""
"\"So you answer your own question! I could not succeed alone, but when our "
"commander hears two voices of reason, sometimes he heeds them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 자네 질문을 자네가 대답했군! 나 혼자서는 해낼 수 없었지만, 이성적인 목소리를 두 배로 들으면 우리 사령관도 가끔은 들어줄 "
"테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "ff77aa14-a92a-499a-9ca1-611931bb0f17"
msgid ""
"\"I would much rather you simply support prudence and common sense. But if "
"the officers of our army lack such virtues, it falls to me to take up the "
"slack.\""
msgstr "\"나는 자네의 단순한 신중함과 상식적인 면모가 좋네. 그러나 대장에게 그런 덕목들이 없으면 그 뒷감당은 내 몫이라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "cb374b44-c78f-4921-b6b1-7a0e19fb3dc8"
msgid ""
"\"Quite right! You often point out something that allows both of us to see a "
"problem from another angle. But let us be honest: regardless of the point of "
"view, {d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d} and I commonly arrive at opposite conclusions!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 그걸세! 자네는 우리가 문제를 다른 관점에서 볼 수 있도록 지적해주곤 하지. 하지만 솔직히 말해 관점은 별 상관 없네. "
"{d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d} 과 나는 보통 정반대의 결론을 내리거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "fd47bd72-d616-48ab-8f30-e0f039f4343c"
msgid ""
"\"Hm! It is your right to say how you wish to be seen. But I know things are "
"not so simple!\""
msgstr "\"흠! 그렇게 생각하는건 자유지만, 사실 그렇게 단순하지가 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "a9e15882-656a-4d85-80d6-13bc2659bf36"
msgid ""
"\"You often back me in arguments. {d|Varn}Maegar{/d} respects your opinion. "
"Perhaps together we can talk some sense into him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네는 종종 말싸움에서 내 편을 들어주었지. {d|varn}메이가르{/d}는 자네의 의견을 존중하네. 어쩌면 함께 그를 좀 분별있게 "
"행동하게끔 설득할 수도 있지 않겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "74ce5feb-b8c8-48bd-8a23-8d9ca591a72e"
msgid ""
"\"True, you usually support {d|Varn}Maegar{/d}, but neither of us are his "
"enemies! You can see that his behavior might cost him his throne!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이지, 자네는 평소 {d|varn}메이가르{/d}의 편에 서지만, 우리 둘 다 그의 적이 아닐세! 자네도 그가 스스로를 권좌에서 "
"끌어내리고 있다는 건 알겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "c21e4916-8c61-4433-a2cd-dcd83238f97a"
msgid ""
"\"You have your own take on everything. Maybe you can see something that I "
"am missing?\""
msgstr "\"자네도 모든 것에 대한 자신만의 판단이 있겠지. 혹시 내가 놓치고 있는 것을 자네가 볼 수도 있을지 누가 아나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "6cb90b68-865c-4628-8258-6979f6f504fc"
msgid ""
"\"You usually keep away from our arguments, but now I want to hear what you "
"have to say.\""
msgstr "\"자네는 보통 우리의 논쟁에서 거리를 두는 편이지, 하지만 이제는 자네의 생각을 듣고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "c55ac247-e32e-405c-baf3-2c354d504521"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, maybe it really is better that I retire. Why should I stand watch, as "
"everything I have built these many years crumbles to ruin? I know not what "
"to do with him, or even how to talk to him. Tell me, what do you think of "
"all this madness?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 어쩌면 은퇴하는 게 차라리 나을 수도 있겠어. 내가 이 많은 세월 동안 쌓아온 모든 것이 무너지고 망하는데 내가 왜 가만히 서 "
"있어야 하나? 나는 그를 어떻게 해야 할지도 모르겠고, 무슨 말을 해줘야 하는지도 모르겠어. 말해보게, 이 미친짓들을 어떻게 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "5b259b90-4a87-4d91-974c-2742af491ed6"
msgid ""
"\"Why, I thought better of you. Let us pretend that you said no such thing, "
"and I heard nothing. No matter how much {d|Varn}Maegar{/d} and I argue, I "
"still consider him my friend.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 자네를 더 좋게 보고 있었는데. 지금 그 말은 못 들은 것으로 하지. 난 아무것도 못 들었네. {d|varn}메이가르{/d}와 "
"내가 아무리 많이 부딪히더라도, 그는 여전히 내 친구일세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "0a99ccc0-3290-45d2-b468-7fff31ff08bc"
msgid ""
"\"Rostland's freedom will be bought with our lives. Yes, Jamandi does not "
"dissemble. She admits that she grows our baronies for the coming bloodbath. "
"An alliance with her is possible, but only on her terms, and it will cost us "
"everything we can ever create here. If we enter the civil war between "
"Rostland and Issia, only tattered pieces of Varnhold will remain. We will "
"never be free of the victor's power, whoever that may be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"로스틀랜드의 자유는 우리 목숨으로 사야 할 걸세. 그래, 자만디는 이 문제를 얼버무리진 않지. 다가오는 피바다를 대비해서 우리 "
"남작령을 키운다고 인정하네. 그녀와의 동맹은 가능하지만, 그녀의 조건 하에서만 될 거고, 우리가 이곳에서 이룬 것을 다 잃게 될 걸세. "
"우리가 로스틀랜드와 이시아의 내전에 돌입하면 반홀드에 남을 것이라곤 누더기 쪼가리 뿐일 게야. 누가 됐든 우린 승자의 힘에 휘둘리게 될 "
"걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "a4929c47-7d0a-4e99-987b-f278661e006a"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, this is true... But if we do enter an alliance with them against the "
"Aldori, then we will never take Silverstep, and I do so wish to have a "
"mansion on its shores! And you know {d|Varn}Varn{/d}. He is not the kind to "
"make alliances only to backstab later. Hmm... Perhaps we should send an "
"instigator to our neighbors, to persuade them to attack us first, to give us "
"cause for annexation? I need to think...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 이건 사실이지... 하지만 우리가 알도리에 맞서 동맹을 맺는다면, 우리는 실버스텝을 취할 수 없을 것이고, 나는 실버스텝의 "
"호숫가에 저택을 짓고 싶네! 자네도 {d|Varn}반{/d}에 대해 알고 있지. 그는 나중에 번복할 동맹을 맺을 사람이 아닐세. 흠... "
"우리 이웃들에게 선동자를 보내서 먼저 우리를 공격하도록 설득하고, 합병의 명분을 줘야 할까? 생각해 봐야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "339fb33e-87d4-4ab2-8f6f-dd7de331ec79"
msgid ""
"\"You and {d|Varn}Maegar{/d} suffer under the same blissful illusion. You "
"imagine that silly old {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d} is plotting some schemes, while "
"you long to live simply and honestly, just like when we were a mercenary "
"army. Well you can put that out of your mind. Those days are long gone. "
"State policy is a world of intrigue, and you are in this world now whether "
"you like it or not. From the day that Varn received his title, there would "
"never be anything simple, clear or honest in our lives again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네와 {d|Varn}메이가르{/d}는 똑같이 형편좋은 착각에 빠져 있네. 늙고 어리석은 {d|Cephal}케팔{/d}이 뭔가 계략을 "
"꾸미고 있다고 상상하면서, 자네는 우리가 용병단이었을 때처럼 단순하고 정직하게 살기를 갈망하지. 그런 날은 잊는 것이 좋을 걸세. 그런 "
"시절은 이미 지나갔네. 국가간 정치는 음모의 세계고, 자네는 좋든 싫든 이 바닥에 있네. 반이 작위를 받은 그날부터 다시는 우리 생활에서 "
"간단하고 명확하거나 정직한 일이 없을걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "273e04c5-9941-40ae-bc80-ff69e9dd84dc"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot see any point in keeping that loafer at the capital. To hear him "
"singing about his questionable feats at the tavern, and flirting with "
"anything that moves. People like him can be helpful – out there, in the "
"ruins, where they crawl around discovering interesting facts and useful "
"items. I would give him a half-empty purse, perhaps even a bit of magical "
"gear, and send him back out on the road. If fortune favored him, he might "
"return with something interesting. If not – then good riddance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그 게으름뱅이를 수도에 붙잡아두는 건 아무 의미도 없다고 보네. 선술집에서 의심스러운 자기 업적을 노래하고, 움직이는 것은 "
"무엇이든 추근대는 소리나 들으려고 말일세. 그와 같은 사람들이 도움이 될 순 있지 – 저 폐허에서, 흥미로운 사실이나 유용한 물건들을 "
"찾으려고 기어다니는 것 같은 일 말일세. 나는 그에게 반쯤 빈 지갑, 어쩌면 약간의 마법 장비도 주고 길바닥으로 돌려보내려 하네. 운이 "
"좋으면 그가 뭔가 흥미로운 것을 찾아낼지도 모르지. 만약 그렇지 않다면 – 속이 참 시원하겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "0c16f9d8-e1e2-4bbf-9f16-8ff2d62df9f8"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, you and I are both busy people now. What a joke! To be advisors to a "
"baron who is doing everything in his power to destroy his own state!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 자네나 나나 바쁜 사람들이지. 말장난이 따로없군! 자기 나라를 파괴하기 위해 뭐든지 하려고 드는 남작의 보좌관이 되다니 말일세!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "d353f37b-6012-47a0-bc83-95ba9ddce71f"
msgid ""
"\"And that bracelet he scrounged up is in fact quite interesting itself. It "
"is not magical, no, but it may point to an ancient cyclops treasure, and "
"riches worth far more than gold. I would like to show this artifact to a "
"knowledgeable historian, but where are we to find one in this backwater?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그자가 얻은 팔찌가 상당히 흥미롭더군. 마법이 걸린 물건은 아니지만, 고대 사이클롭스의 보물이라는 점에서 금보다 훨씬 가치 있을지도 "
"모르지. 역사학자가 있으면 한번 감정을 맡겨보고 싶은데, 이 벽지에 그런 자가 있을 리 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "4128c839-93b5-4bf9-aaf3-4b0d9c6127b2"
msgid ""
"\"Using a party leader as bait, risking havoc in case of his death. – It was "
"completely insane! And that sums up Varn. He is capable of great insights "
"and bright ideas, but he risks too much, and has no sense of consequences. I "
"cannot vouch for the fate of Varnhold, if he does not rein himself in.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 죽으면 벌어질 대혼란을 감수하고, 대장을 미끼로 쓰다니. – 완전히 미쳤군! 반을 요약해보지. 그는 위대한 통찰력과 밝은 생각을 "
"가졌지만, 너무 많은 위험을 감수하고, 결과에 대한 생각이 없네. 그가 스스로를 통제하지 못한다면, 나는 반홀드의 운명을 장담할 수가 "
"없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "acbb0309-a31b-4583-b289-69210e520a9f"
msgid ""
"\"Report your status, General. What else has our precious baron been up to?\""
msgstr "\"상황을 알려주게, 장군. 우리의 소중한 남작이 또 무슨 일을 꾸미고 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "80cfdb7c-092e-49e5-ba18-9efbe8a05326"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I did not 'end up' in one. I created it. I sold everything I had, and "
"combined my efforts with a certain hot-tempered young man, set on advancing "
"his humble glory as much as I was set on increasing my humble savings. As "
"you can see, it was a successful venture. However, I often still ask myself "
"if it was the best decision of my life or the greatest error.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 난 '흘러 들어온'게 아냐. 만들었지. 가진 걸 전부 팔아서 어떤 성질 급한 젊은이와 힘을 합쳤고, 그가 초라한 명성을 쌓아나간 "
"만큼 나도 초라한 재산을 쌓아나갔다네. 보다시피 이렇게 성공을 거뒀네만, 나는 아직도 내 자신에게 그게 내 인생 최고의 결정인지 최대의 "
"실책인지 자주 묻곤 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "4170658e-271d-46b4-8f8a-46fba2d38d63"
msgid ""
"\"People know as much as I allow – which I grant is little. However, a "
"person is defined not by their past, but by their actions. The way they "
"behave when faced with danger and temptation, how they hold up under "
"pressure, and how they spend their leisure. After our many years together, "
"you know me better than most.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알만큼 안다고 생각하네만. 그 정도면 충분하다고 생각하거든. 하지만 사람을 규정하는 것은 행동이지 과거가 아니라네. 위험과 유혹에 "
"어떻게 대처하는지, 압박을 어떻게 견디는지, 여가를 어떻게 보내는지 같은 것 말일세. 우리가 이미 몇 년을 같이 보냈으니, 자네는 "
"대부분의 사람들보다 나를 더 잘 알겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Cephal_Personal/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "0fda163a-bb82-480a-9679-98b6a6494868"
msgid ""
"\"As for my homeland, it is of no importance. They do not miss me, and I "
"have no longing to return.\""
msgstr "\"내 조국은 중요한 게 아닐세. 그들은 나를 그리워하지 않고, 나도 돌아가고 싶은 생각이 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/AfterSex_barks/1After_Innkeeper_1_String
msgctxt "0b945c23-f0b1-4901-8c03-352a519ebb86"
msgid "\"Sir Gunderson! General! I have some questions for you!\""
msgstr "\"건더슨 선생님! 장군님! 물어 볼게 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/AfterSex_barks/2After_Innkeeper_2_String
msgctxt "13bd95a4-f527-462e-9f97-e9e62fcaa277"
msgid ""
"\"I can understand a broken bed and a crushed candelabra. But what, Desna "
"save me, have you done to the window shutters?!\""
msgstr "\"부서진 침대도 찌그러진 촛대도 이해할 수 있어요. 하지만, 데스나여 저를 구하소서, 창 덧문에 무슨 짓을 한겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/AfterSex_barks/3After_Gunderson_1_String
msgctxt "9dc58894-1899-444f-a8c6-ced16e30b197"
msgid ""
"\"You see, my dear hostess, scientific disputes can become rather heated...\""
msgstr "\"알다시피... 친애하는 주인장, 과학적인 논쟁은 가끔 달아오르기도 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/AfterSex_barks/4After_InnKeeper_1_String
msgctxt "936b0b88-6c29-4dc1-9e0a-ea43de0e2bd0"
msgid ""
"\"I'll say! If you decide you'll have another of your disputes, please warn "
"me in advance. I'll hire a carpenter and a roofer to fix the furniture and "
"the holes in the ceiling!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말해두겠어요! 만약 다음에 또 논쟁을 펼치려거든, 미리 나에게 경고해 주십시오. 목수와 지붕 수리공을 고용해서 가구나 천장에 난 "
"구멍을 고쳐야 할테니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "612b81a8-b441-4305-acd3-0384f6878781"
msgid ""
"\"Willas, how about we discuss antiquities and relics in a more private "
"setting? There are quiet rooms upstairs…\""
msgstr "\"윌라스, 좀 더 사적인 환경에서 골동품과 유물에 대해 논하는 것은 어떨까요? 위층에 조용한 방이 있는데요…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "79978e75-1e44-4581-a43d-1946a2f7279f"
msgid ""
"\"So what brings a 'scientist, traveler, and researcher of antiquities' to "
"our savage lands?\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 뭐가 우리의 야만스러운 땅에 '과학자, 여행자, 고대의 연구자'를 데려온 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ee041f94-6ee4-4a7b-bd44-ccb3b9dcd288"
msgid "\"And what was written on the slab?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 판에 뭐라고 써 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d1e50b18-cca5-4e38-bbb4-f8fdd0baa30e"
msgid "\"Thank you for the conversation, I have to go!\""
msgstr "\"대화 고마워요, 이제 가야겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ea048021-0ebb-4383-b377-81208eca3c02"
msgid ""
"[Move closer] \"A conversation about antiquities, of course! About the "
"amazing feeling you get, when you tear off the cover of secrecy, {mf|"
"penetrate its depths|take in its aroma}, tirelessly chase that cherished "
"goal, and finally grasp it! Can anything be more exciting?\""
msgstr ""
"[가까이 다가간다] \"물론 골동품에 관한 대화죠! 비밀을 감싼 표지를 뜯어낼때 당신이 느끼는 놀라운 감정, {mf|그 깊은 곳까지 "
"거침없이 파고들어서|그 향기를 음미하고}, 쉬지 않고 소중한 목표를 쫓아서, 결국은 손안에 움켜쥐는 것! 이보다 더 신나는 일이 있을까요?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "9a4bb4e4-ef13-47c2-89bf-3ff7d348544e"
msgid "\"I think you've misunderstood me.\""
msgstr "\"아무래도 내 말을 오해한 것 같네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "30a6a2cb-8f6c-4f61-b4d8-04dff0ebe32e"
msgid ""
"\"You'll have a chance to learn all about my methods. Wait for me upstairs. "
"And take a bottle of wine with you.\""
msgstr "\"제 방식에 대해 뭐든 알게 될 기회가 올 거예요. 위층에서 기다려요. 와인도 한 병 가지고 가세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "ab61d53e-8ed8-4739-a093-101e1c0954b3"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"당신에 대해 말해주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "d36c46ca-f6a1-4f81-9d82-82eebcaa6fdb"
msgid ""
"\"You called that huge slab a cyclops' notebook. Perhaps your bracelet is "
"not a bracelet at all?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 그 커다란 판을 사이클롭스 기록이라고 불렀어요. 아마 그 팔찌도 사실은 팔찌 따위가 아니겠죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "6e8e8fe1-46ea-45fc-9957-767236abdbac"
msgid "\"I see...\""
msgstr "\"과연...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "ea126c23-b10d-4e4f-9ef4-ca660397dd43"
msgid "\"So you're going to write a book about us?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 우리에 대한 책을 쓰겠다는 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "c923359e-0d96-4ee5-b393-88177b647dd5"
msgid "\"What? Jubilost Narthropple himself, in our lands?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구요? 주빌로스트 본인이, 우리 땅에서?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "f817d8df-c574-43e4-95d4-6a030afbdd8d"
msgid "\"And what kind of character will I be in your book?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 나는 당신의 책에서 어떤 인물이 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "00e41095-c2cf-43c6-b95e-88a307bd0163"
msgid "\"All right, well...\""
msgstr "\"좋아요, 음...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "8ad79894-fe35-4629-b9c4-3252052b19d2"
msgid ""
"\"Have you seen that Galtan troublemaker? The one who started the uprising "
"in the city.\""
msgstr "\"그 갈트의 말썽쟁이를 봤나요? 도시에서 폭동 일으키던 사람이요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6103f3ef-22fc-4d8c-a1e0-14a1205dfd95"
msgid ""
"\"My General!\" {n}Willas takes a mocking bow.{/n} \"Do you think our sweet "
"hostess forgave us for the shutters and candelabra?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 장군님!\" {n}윌라스는 놀리듯 허리숙입니다.{/n} \"우리의 아리따운 주인장이 셔터들과 촛대들 건에서 우리를 용서했다고 "
"보십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "342606f2-43cc-408c-a625-048ce206e11f"
msgid ""
"{n}Dressed in clean clothes, shiny boots and in full accessory, Willas "
"Gunderson looks even more jovial than he did when you met him on the "
"road.{/n} \"Ah, there you are, my {mf|lord|lady}! What a pleasure it is to "
"see you again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}깨끗한 옷과 빛나는 부츠, 그리고 완전한 액세서리로 차려입은 윌라스 건더슨은 길에서 만났을 때보다 훨씬 더 유쾌해 보입니다.{/n} "
"\"아, 여기 계셨군요, 나의 {mf|장군님|장군님}! 다시 만나다니 얼마나 기쁜지 모르겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2f009124-e3e7-4ce1-975c-2fe344771bf8"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas seems strangely pale and absent-minded – to the point that he "
"doesn't notice you until you come very close. There are dark circles under "
"his eyes, as if he's barely slept.{/n} \"{name}, it's you! Good... good "
"afternoon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}윌라스는 이상하게도 창백하고 정신이 멍한 것 같습니다 –당신이 아주 가까이 오기 전까지 당신을 알아채지도 못할 정도로. 그의 눈 "
"밑에는 거의 잠을 자지 못한 듯 다크서클이 깔려 있습니다.{/n} \"{name}, 당신이군요! 좋은... 좋은 날입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "2a79b09c-a300-433f-96dc-c037b4764b4d"
msgid ""
"\"You know, General, scientific discussions are my weakness! You probably "
"meant a conversation about antiquities... or a conversation about "
"antiquities?\" {n}The young man's cheeks slightly blush.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아시겠지만, 장군님, 전 과학적인 토론에는 약합니다! 그러니까 지금 고대 유물에 대한 이야기셨겠죠... 아니면... 고대 유물에 대한 "
"이야기라던가?\" {n}젊은이의 뺨이 살짝 붉어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "863887ce-fd1e-45d5-99f9-ac1216cb7883"
msgid ""
"\"Of course...\" {n}Willas' face drops, and he seems most disappointed.{/n}"
msgstr "\"물론이죠...\"{n}윌라스의 고개가 떨구어지고, 이때까지 본 것 중 가장 실망스러운 모습이 됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "bfbfb922-c3e4-49d8-a2ea-db0a002bca5f"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas arches his brow.{/n} \"Now I'm most curious as to the scientific "
"approach you prefer. Something intricate, perhaps, with lengthy preparation "
"and a wide range of methods? Or does a straightforward approach suit you "
"better?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}윌라스는 미간을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이제 당신이 선호하는 과학적 접근 방식이 가장 궁금해졌습니다. 오랜 준비와 다양한 방법을 "
"모색하는 복잡한 길? 아니면 단도직입적인 접근법 중 어는 게 더 당신에게 맞습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "5cc849d9-d29e-4725-ad8d-459d44eaacfa"
msgid "\"Yes, my General!\""
msgstr "\"예, 장군님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "3743d186-f6b8-4a09-818f-663de7a9a973"
msgid ""
"\"I was led here by some information I discovered while translating the "
"writings on an ancient stone panel.\" {n}Willas' eyes burn with "
"excitement.{/n} \"It was a heavy granite slab the size of a door, but a mere "
"pocket notebook for the ones who made their marks on it, ha ha! Ancient "
"cyclopes. It was they who wrote those inscriptions on the slab. Ancient "
"cyclopes, unlike today's poor savages, were darkly clever. They maintained "
"their brilliant civilization through dreadful magic...\""
msgstr ""
"\"고대 석판에 쓴 글을 번역하다가 발견한 어떤 정보에 이끌려 여기까지 왔습니다.\" {n}윌라스의 눈은 흥분으로 이글거립니다.{/n} "
"\"문 크기만한 무거운 화강암 판이었지만, 그건 사실 문 위에 표시를 남긴 자들을 위한 단순한 수첩이었죠, 하하! 고대 사이클롭스. 판에 "
"새겨진 글씨를 쓴 사람은 바로 그들입니다. 고대 사이클롭스는 오늘날의 가난한 야만인들과 달리 음침하게 영리했죠. 그들은 무서운 마법을 "
"통해 빛나는 문명을 유지했습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "903cb786-6a1e-4296-843c-aba5f0a18a39"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I'm quite a boring person, believe me.\" {n}Willas' tone makes it "
"clear that he's joking.{/n} \"Boredom has led me to learn a dozen ancient "
"languages, decipher a trove of ancient manuscripts and chronicles, and "
"riddle out the locations they mention, and the relics hidden there. In "
"between these rather boring tasks I've written a few brilliant novels and a "
"dozen poems. Indeed, I had to flee to this backwater from my admirers and "
"fans. I do hope no one here knows the name of Willas Gunderson, or I shall "
"have to flee again! Fame, I'm afraid, is the most boring thing in the world."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 전 꽤 지루한 사람입니다, 제 말을 믿으십쇼.\" {n}윌라스의 어조는 농담임이 분명합니다.{/n} \"그 지루함 덕분에 열 "
"개가 넘는 고대 언어를 배워 옛 필사본과 연대기를 해독하고, 거기 언급된 장소에서 숨겨진 유물을 발견할 수 있었지요. 몹시 지루한 "
"과정이었기에 틈 날 때마다 소설이나 시를 끄적이곤 했는데, 그 작품들이 굉장한 성공을 거뒀습니다. 얼마나 성공했느냐면, 저를 흠모하는 "
"팬을 피해 이 후미진 곳으로 도망쳐 와야 할 정도였지요. 정말이지, 이곳엔 윌라스 건더슨을 아는 사람이 없으면 좋겠군요. 안 그럼 다시 "
"도망쳐야 할 테니까! 유감스럽게도, 세상천지에 유명세를 얻는 일만큼 지루한 일도 없더이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "51c040cb-136b-4e4b-a8f0-a53d27250d7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas looks at you askance, evaluating the impression that his speech "
"has made on you. Finally he turns a little morose.{/n} \"Truth be told, my "
"books are not very popular, and the money I received for the relics was "
"hardly enough to replenish my wardrobe. But it's all well. The Grand "
"Expedition to the Tors of Levenies will surely lead me to a marvelous "
"finale. And I've already found something special here.\" {n}He gives you a "
"charming smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}윌라스는 자신의 말이 당신에게 준 인상을 가늠하면서 당신을 불안한 듯 바라봅니다. 조금 뒤, 그는 약간 시무룩해집니다.{/n} "
"\"사실대로 말씀드리자면, 내 책은 그리 인기가 없고, 유물을 댓가로 받은 돈도 옷장을 채우기에는 턱없이 부족했습니다. 하지만 다 "
"괜찮아요. 레베니스 바위 산맥으로의 대원정은 틀림없이 저를 놀라운 피날레로 인도할 겁니다. 그리고 저는 이미 여기서 특별한 것을 "
"발견했습니다.\" {n}그는 당신에게 매력적인 미소를 선사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "a0bea315-1848-4abf-85ad-0f4984537060"
msgid ""
"\"Em, hm... nothing terribly significant. It described cyclops settlements "
"across the Tors of Levenies, and mentioned that 'incredible magic treasures' "
"had been stored here in the past. But that was thousands of years ago. "
"There's scarce a chance that anything remains today. Even that bracelet I "
"found was hardly anything more than a valuable knickknack. But even if I "
"don't find any real artifacts, I will continue my search! In the name of "
"science!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에, 흠... 엄청나게 중요할 것은 없습니다. 거기에는 레베니스 바위 산맥에 걸쳐있는 사이클롭스 정착지가 묘사돼 있고, '믿을 수 "
"없는 마법의 보물'이 과거에 그곳에서 보관되어 있었다고 언급했습니다. 하지만 수천 년 전의 일입니다. 뭐가 됐든 오늘날까지 남아 있을 "
"가능성은 거의 없습니다. 제가 찾은 팔찌조차 푼돈 되는 골동품에 지나지 않았죠. 하지만 진짜 유물을 발견하지 못하더라도, 저는 제 탐색을 "
"계속할 겁니다! 과학의 이름으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "f7696d61-d9ab-49a9-820e-a750ad5f592b"
msgid "\"I'm happy to tell you whatever you like!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 좋아하실 만한 무엇이든 들려드릴 수 있어서 기쁩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "00b31a1a-02c9-471b-a593-8ddaa25b7be0"
msgid ""
"\"But – but how did I not think of that?!\" {n}Willas' eyes open wide.{/n} "
"\"Of course, if you consider the cyclopes size, this is rather a ring. Ugh! "
"An explorer must remain impartial, but to be perfectly honest, everything "
"about these cyclopes repulses me. They were no kind spirits even while they "
"lived. We're lucky not to have lived in the time of their empires!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 – 하지만 내가 왜 그 생각은 못 했지?!\"{n}윌라스의 눈이 크게 뜨입니다.{/n} \"물론, 사이클롭스의 크기를 "
"고려한다면 이것은 차라리 반지라 부르는 게 맞죠. 탐험가는 편견이 없어야 하지만, 솔직히 말해서 이 사이클롭스의 모든 것들이 저를 "
"구역질나게 합니다. 그들은 살아 있는 동안에도 상냥한 편은 아니었습니다. 우리가 그들의 제국 시대에 살지 않은 건 행운입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "fd9ea113-4c7f-43de-a21b-2ffd105fb0f1"
msgid "\"I'm always glad to talk to you!\""
msgstr "\"당신과 이야기하는 건 언제나 즐겁군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "97dca79e-ff55-47ee-abbc-accba156f22c"
msgid "\"Goodbye, my {mf|lord|lady}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 가십시오, {mf|나으리|아가씨}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "96952f35-3590-4d75-9d8e-d3565fd21822"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we're well beyond that – I've already started! Your comrades from the "
"Varnling Host already gave me all the background I'll need to flesh out the "
"first few chapters. I'm still thinking of a title, but the chapter about "
"your encounter with centaurs near the City of Hollow Eyes will be called "
"Ripples on the Water. Poetic, relevant to the location, and it foreshadows "
"mysterious events to come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 우리는 그 이상으로 잘 해내가고 있습니다. 전 이미 시작했어요! 반링 호스트에서 온 당신의 동료들은 이미 처음 몇 장에 살을 "
"붙이는 데 필요한 모든 배경 소재를 제공해 줬습니다. 아직 제목을 생각하고 있지만, 텅 빈 눈의 도시 근처에서 켄타우로스와 만난다는 그 "
"장은 '물 위에 이는 파문'이라 부를 겁니다. 시적이고, 장소와 관련이 있으며, 다가올 신비로운 사건들의 전조가 되지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "a88da58a-ff82-486d-8ee8-87f11b38c045"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas exhales in indignation, then stares at the floor.{/n} \"This was "
"rude, my good {mf|lord|lady}! You might at least have pretended to be just "
"as impressed by me as by him! But fine. As you please. Willas Gunderson has "
"yet to show what he is worth!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}윌라스는 분개하여 가쁘게 숨을 내쉬고 바닥을 응시합니다.{/n} \"이건 무례하군요, {mf|나리|아가씨}! 적어도 그가 한 것처럼 "
"제게 감명받은 척이라도 해주셔야 하는 것 아닙니까! 하지만 좋습니다. 당신 좋을 대로 하십쇼. 윌라스 건더슨이 아직 자신의 가치를 "
"보여주지 못한 것 같군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "d5049a40-cd45-4471-a27e-e55462bf9379"
msgid ""
"\"I heard that Jubilost Narthropple was visiting your western neighbors. I "
"don't know anyone who still attends his lectures or reads his articles. The "
"obnoxious gnome can never manage to do without making sarcastic jokes at the "
"expense of his own audience! But never mind. How unfair would it be if a "
"well-known publicist showed interest in one newborn barony, while leaving "
"its neighbor, our sweet and slightly wild Varnhold, out in the cold. Do you "
"see now how lucky you are that Willas Gunderson himself has paid Varnhold a "
"visit?\""
msgstr ""
"\"주빌로스트 나트로플이 당신의 서쪽 이웃을 방문한다고 들었습니다. 아직도 그의 강의를 듣거나 논문을 읽는 사람이 남아있을지 "
"모르겠습니다. 그 얄미운 노움은 자기 관중을 희생해서 빈정대는 농담을 하지 않고는 직성이 안 풀리죠! 신경쓰지 마십시오. 유명한 평론가가 "
"우리의 아름답고 조금은 야성적인 반홀드를 외면한 채, 신생 남작령에나 관심을 보인다니 얼마나 불공평한지. 이제 윌라스 건더슨 본인이 "
"반홀드를 방문했다는 사실이 얼마나 행운인지 아시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "d0b55a70-e9fa-4494-b04b-c3e8d1382958"
msgid ""
"\"The main character will have to be Baron Varn, of course. But you, my "
"dear, will be the hero's charming assistant, who the audience will love most "
"of all. I expect the book's countless admirers will compose a thousand "
"sequels, entirely devoted to you. And of course, in these apocrypha, your "
"striking beau will strangely resemble none other than the author himself, ha "
"ha! Such is the nature of love in the public eye.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주인공은 당연히 반 남작이 될 겁니다. 그대는 영웅의 매력적인 조력자로, 청중에게 가장 사랑받는 인물이 되겠죠. 팬들이 당신께 "
"헌정하는 외전이 천 편은 생길 겁니다! 오로지 당신만을 위한 속편이지요. 물론, 이 이야기에서 당신은 작가를 투영한 인물과 연인 관계가 "
"됩니다만, 하하! 이런 걸 두고 대중적인 사랑을 받는다는 거겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "667616dc-b1d7-4410-b404-8e274bacc36c"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose you will be the gloomy shadow that stands behind the main "
"character, Baron Varn. Terror to your enemies, and a ruthless avenger. "
"Hmm... But I shall have to ascribe some sort of awkward weakness, or the "
"character just won't be believable. Are you allergic to parsley by any "
"chance?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신에게는 주인공 반 남작의 뒤에 서 있는 음울한 그림자 역을 제안합니다. 당신의 적에게 공포를 안겨주고 무자비한 복수자가 되는. "
"흠... 하지만 뭔가 난감할 만한 약점을 부여해야겠어요. 그렇지 않으면 이런 캐릭터는 현실감이 없을 겁니다. 혹시 조금이라도 파슬리 "
"알레르기가 있으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "380d6a99-fbdb-4e74-aa49-2587b3d489e3"
msgid ""
"\"You will be assistant to the main character, Baron Varn. But don't "
"despair! Usually supporting characters are loved all the more, and they get "
"into all sorts of fun that a main character simply couldn't be forgiven for! "
"You know what, {name}? I think you'll make the most charming character in "
"the book. And after its smashing success, they'll be begging me for more. "
"Perhaps I'll make you the main character in the series!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 주인공 반 남작의 조력자가 될 겁니다. 하지만 절망하지 마세요! 보통 조연 캐릭터는 더욱 사랑받고, 그들은 주인공은 누릴 수 "
"없는 온갖 재미들을 겪게 됩니다! 그거 알아요, {name}? 전 당신이 이 책에서 가장 매력적인 캐릭터가 될 거라고 생각해요. 책이 "
"대성공하고 나면, 독자들은 나에게 더 많은 것을 요청하게될 겁니다. 어쩌면 제가 당신을 시리즈 주인공으로 만들어 줄지도 몰라요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "8f3bf987-a971-4da6-bcbd-b628a4ae8f23"
msgid "\"Don't you have any other questions?\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문은 없으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "1e434d0c-c100-4678-bde8-05b00a5b9702"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed I have! Ha ha! I was just telling my friends here about that "
"touching sign of friendship and affection that Baron Varn showed to me, when "
"these troublemakers came in with their silly talk. I had to spend a few "
"minutes explaining to the lady how ridiculous her messages are, and how "
"disgusting it is how she expresses them. That told her! So then the "
"troublemaker ran out of the tavern. She's not going to risk crossing paths "
"with me again! I suspect she's on her way back to {g|Galt}Galt{/g}.\" {n}"
"Willas toys with a strand of his hair, and smiles cheekily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"실제로 제가 그랬습니다! 하하! 이 말썽꾸러기들이 바보 같은 이야기나 하고 있을 때, 전 제 친구들에게 반 남작이 제게 보여준 그 "
"감동적인 우정과 애정의 표시에 대해 들려주고 있었습니다 . 나는 그 여자에게 그녀의 메시지가 얼마나 우스꽝스럽고, 표현하는 방법이 얼마나 "
"역겨운지를 설명하는 데 몇 분을 할애해야 했죠. 그렇게 말해줬습니다! 그랬더니 그 말썽꾸러기들이 주점에서 다 도망쳐 나갔죠. 그녀는 "
"다시는 나와 마주치려 하지 않을 겁니다! 아마 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}로 돌아가는 중일 겁니다.\" {n}윌라스는 머리 한 가닥을 "
"장난스레 감은 채 뻔뻔스럽게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Gunderson/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "91f8f866-29e3-4dee-84a3-3921e8e2394b"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, there you are, my {mf|lord|lady}! What a pleasure to see you again!\""
msgstr "\"아. 거기 계셨군요, {mf|나리|아가씨}! 다시 뵙게 되어 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/New_unit_names/Citizen_f_String
msgctxt "b4759501-e37a-4dc1-98b1-478b0669ef40"
msgid "Citizen"
msgstr "시민"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/New_unit_names/Citizen_m_String
msgctxt "fb514d3d-25ed-469e-8df5-46b4cefd83d1"
msgid "Citizen"
msgstr "시민"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/New_unit_names/Guard_female_String
msgctxt "8b691b9b-93ca-4eee-9fae-c3e5c3ea2781"
msgid "Guard"
msgstr "경비병"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/New_unit_names/Peasant_f_String
msgctxt "5c9a543d-5f9a-4956-8298-80f20c97f00e"
msgid "Peasant"
msgstr "농민"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/New_unit_names/Peasant_m_String
msgctxt "538a76ed-2b91-4015-ae1c-ef43a8725464"
msgid "Peasant"
msgstr "농민"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/New_unit_names/Undertaker_String
msgctxt "d059e5ae-52f3-4bf0-ac51-7442e93e1fe4"
msgid "Undertaker"
msgstr "장의사"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "10b68eb4-1966-4d0f-a4c2-34e3b9a7bb18"
msgid "\"We're lucky to have a resourceful person like you on our side.\""
msgstr "\"우리한테 너같은 수완가가 있어서 다행이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "cca552b3-813c-418c-b289-4589ccd255af"
msgid "\"You are cheerful as always!\""
msgstr "\"항상 기운이 넘치는구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "76aa90e1-3b07-4ed4-92c9-870f8d47ce8d"
msgid "\"I want to take someone from the team on a raid.\""
msgstr "\"별동대 인원을 차출하고 싶은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "90b0d887-8fdb-43c2-9597-792b51a724e1"
msgid "\"I need some equipment. Show me what you have.\""
msgstr "\"장비가 필요해. 뭐가 있는지 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8439d1df-a656-4637-8ec0-074fe0112b36"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8c5a9a03-c2bc-409e-a91c-37752547e67e"
msgid "\"I need the help of a priest.\""
msgstr "\"사제의 도움이 필요한데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "d70dbe02-cfc1-4cb3-8f69-43ea82c9301c"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll take these three.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 이 셋을 데려가지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "593256a4-df42-4b63-a5be-6db33a222300"
msgid "\"No, I'd rather make my own choice.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 내가 직접 고르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "15ea6c9d-1140-4dca-bde6-4740f629cf15"
msgid ""
"\"I've changed my mind. I'll take Gekkor, Tehara, and the Bruiser with me.\""
msgstr "\"마음이 바뀌었어. 게커, 테하라, 덩치를 데려가겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "52c05170-de83-4282-8029-fd4ced51982d"
msgid ""
"{n}Kjerdi Eisbock, formerly quartermaster and chaplain of the {g|Varnling "
"Host}Varnling Host{/g}, now Treasurer of Varnhold, greets you with a curt "
"nod. Over all the years you've spent in a party with this no-nonsense dwarf, "
"she's only smiled three or four times – and never when she was sober.{/n} "
"\"So, you finished celebrating? Had your fun? Then let's get to business. My "
"gut tells me they aren't going to let us live peacefully in this land!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}전 반링 호스트의 보급관이자 군종 사제, 지금은 반홀드의 재무관인 셰르디 아이스복이 퉁명스럽게 고개를 끄덕이며 당신을 반깁니다. "
"당신이 반링 호스트에서 지낸 수 년을 통틀어서 이 농담이라고는 하나도 모르는 드워프가 웃은 적은 서너 번 밖에 되지 않습니다 – 그나마 "
"취하지 않은 때는 절대 아니었습니다.{/n} \"그래, 축하는 끝났냐? 재미 좀 봤고? 그럼 일이나 하자고. 이 땅이 우릴 평화롭게 "
"살도록 냅두지 않을 거란 느낌이 들어서 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f27ec9bf-f2da-4b34-98df-1a1d7fdcc338"
msgid "\"So, how are we doing? The barony in ruins yet?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 무슨 일인데? 남작령이 아직도 안 망했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "08165bee-931e-41db-a597-093ce49580c3"
msgid ""
"\"Of course you are! Without me, you'd all be paupers! But why are you "
"sucking up to me? You after the beer in my stock? I'm not pouring any today. "
"Don't get your hopes up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇고 말고! 내가 없으면 전부 길바닥에 나앉게 될 걸! 근데 왜 나한테 비비는거지? 내 맥주를 노리고 있나? 오늘은 절대 안 "
"마실거니까 꿈 깨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d9a3fa02-a55c-4e20-a406-15a8738d5c20"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to be cheery about? Of course, a barony is a profitable "
"venture, but do you have any idea what it's like to be Treasurer? The "
"quartermaster's job was a thorn in my butt, but this one is more like a "
"wyvern's claw. Or a whole wyvern!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐가 기운이 넘친다는거야? 물론, 남작령을 운영하는 건 남는 장사긴 하지. 근데 재무관을 하라고? 보급관 자리는 나한테 "
"가시방석이었어. 근데 이건 와이번 발톱 방석, 아니, 와이번이 내 엉덩이를 깨물고 있는 거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "fd3dc993-c72f-448c-8ed0-6a2b62256a57"
msgid ""
"\"Take your pick. Just don't imagine that the General gets whatever "
"{mf|he|she} wants for free! Order is order!\""
msgstr "\"골라봐. 장군이라고 공짜는 없어! 지킬 건 지켜야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5cab087d-7443-4d38-adb9-023939aa50d0"
msgid "\"Right! Our people're no good sitting in a fortress getting fat!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 우리 애들이 요새 안에서 놀고 먹는다고 좋을게 뭐가 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4fafbea9-8a1c-4a06-9569-a9657d13faba"
msgid ""
"\"Why does the {g|Torag}Father of Creation{/g} still tinker with us fools? "
"Mark my word, some day his patience will end, and then all of us will be "
"finished! Fine, you can buy any scroll you need from me. I'll read it. Just "
"don't imagine I'm going to run after you outside the city! When you go off "
"on the march, you'd best take a cleric with you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 {g|Torag}창조의 아버지{/g}께서 우릴 바보로 만드셨을까? 내 말을 명심해, 언젠가 그분의 인내심이 바닥나는 날엔, 우린 "
"모두 끝장이야! 좋아, 필요한 두루마리가 있으면 사가라고. 읽어줄테니. 하지만 내가 도시 밖까지 쫓아다닐 거라곤 기대하지 마셔! 전투에 "
"데리고 다니려면 클레릭이나 찾아보라 이 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3ee34ce9-1f97-4d1f-bc47-9bcbfec7dd37"
msgid "\"Don't get yourself killed!\""
msgstr "\"죽지나 마셔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "4479ca6b-18ea-4c6b-979e-c0ca0565e35e"
msgid ""
"\"I would recommend Gekkor, the Bruiser and Tehara. It's a waste when such a "
"strong priest and fighter, who can tear enemies to pieces with his bare "
"hands, is stuck patrolling the streets. And Tehara, that insolent mug... I'm "
"afraid to keep her cooped up in Varnhold. What if she starts thinking too "
"fondly of the good old times when she was a pirate?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 게커, 덩치, 테하라를 추천할게. 맨손으로 적을 육편으로 만들 만큼 강한 사제와 전사가 거리 순찰이나 하고 있는 건 낭비라고. "
"그리고 테하라 그 무례한 자식... 난 얘를 반홀드에 냅두기가 좀 그래. 갑자기 해적시절이 너무 그리워지면 무슨 짓을 할지 어떻게 알겠어?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Quartermaster/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "3ecd8859-685d-419b-865f-0ee0bf558e58"
msgid "\"That's a deal!\""
msgstr "\"알았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f0802cc4-8e57-4172-802d-53054a789c83"
msgid ""
"\"Cephal, you're not making any sense. You say that an alliance with the "
"Aldori will end in a bloodbath. That surely means that we'd best keep away "
"from them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"케팔, 그건 말이 안 돼요. 알도리와의 동맹은 피바다로 끝날 거라 하셨죠. 그건 분명 그들을 멀리 하는 게 낫다는 뜻이잖아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6fbd8172-6a20-473b-9acf-d89b188d1b31"
msgid ""
"\"You mean we need to wait until they drop their guard. Make them rely on "
"our help... And when civil war does break out in Brevoy, strike them in the "
"back?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 방심할 때까지 기다려야 한다는 말씀이시군요. 우리 도움에 의존하게 만들고... 그리고 브레보이에 내전이 일어나면 그들의 "
"뒤통수를 쳐라?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "3d1e1810-414a-4a14-9817-fe95e8bf1c65"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "915d8cc4-fbf0-4c71-a025-faba938778e7"
msgid ""
"\"You're both wrong. The Aldori are noble. An alliance with them would "
"ensure our common prosperity!\""
msgstr "\"둘 다 틀렸어요. 알도리는 고귀하다구요. 그들과 동맹을 맺으면 우린 모두 번영할 수 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Verda
msgctxt "01e2669b-1654-470c-82f0-2775dc3e8752"
msgid ""
"{n}As Kjerdi approaches Varn, a wince crosses her grim face. But she speaks "
"not a word, and instead hands him a document.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}세르디가 반에게 다가가자 그녀의 음울한 얼굴에 당혹감이 스칩니다. 그러나 그녀는 한마디도 하지 않고, 대신 그에게 서류를 "
"건넵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "15d7560f-5877-4591-9899-dbd867c45319"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Cephal}Cephal{/d} snatches the document from Varn's hands. As he reads "
"it, the old wizard's eyes nearly pop out of his head.{/n} \""
"{d|Varn}Maegar{/d}... What does this mean? Tell me – what I am to make of "
"this!?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Cephal}케팔{/d}이 반의 손에서 그 문서를 잡아챕니다. 그가 문서를 읽자 늙은 마법사의 두 눈이 거의 머리에서 튀어나올 "
"듯 커집니다.{/n} \"{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}... 이게 무슨 의미인가? 말해보게! 내가 이걸 어떻게 생각해야 할지를!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8745f24d-24e2-432b-83ae-3f16f7680dd2"
msgid ""
"\"I sent some much-needed aid to our neighbors in the Shrike Hills. They're "
"our only possible allies in the coming carnage. {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d}, I know "
"your opinion, but be realistic: the Aldori are not our friends. We can't "
"count on them for help if something happens. We're expendable.\""
msgstr ""
"\"슈라이크 구릉지에 있는 우리 이웃에게 절실히 필요한 원조를 보냈소. 그들은 다가오는 대학살에서 우리의 유일한 가망 있는 동맹이오. "
"{d|Cephal}케팔{/d}, 당신의 의견은 알고 있지만 현실적으로 보시오. 알도리는 우리의 친구가 아니오. 우리에게 무슨 일이 생겨도 "
"우린 그들에게 도움을 기대할 수 없소. 우린 소모품이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "a23085d6-6168-475f-b8fd-36c8c68b2b76"
msgid ""
"\"You will not preach realism to me, you naive boy! Yes, we are bargaining "
"chips to them. That is exactly what I am basing my politics on. A delicate "
"contraption which you are smashing to bits! War will come to Brevoy, even "
"you can see that. But as long as it hasn't yet begun, we can scarcely do "
"better than pretending to be the Aldori's most loyal vassals!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자넨 내게 현실론 얘기하지 말게, 이 순진한 소년같으니! 그래, 우린 그들에게 협상 카드 정도지. 그게 바로 내가 정치의 근간으로 "
"삼고 있는 것일세. 자네가 산산조각 내고 있는 섬세한 기계장치 말이야! 브레보이에 전쟁이 닥칠 걸세, 심지어 자네조차도 그건 볼 수 "
"있지. 하지만 그게 아직 시작되지 않은 이상, 알도리의 가장 충실한 신하인 척하는 게 최선이란 말일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8205d104-1546-44ac-b074-d960db3b501c"
msgid ""
"\"They are noble, it's true. But it's the nobility of Brevoy's aristocracy. –"
" Whether they're Issian or Rostlandic, they don't welcome outsiders into "
"their fold. I'm sorry to shatter your dreams of triumphant Aldori knights, "
"my friend, but take this for a fact: our lives are nothing to them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 고귀해, 사실이야. 그러나 그것은 브레보이의 귀족의 고귀함이지. – 그들이 이시아인답든 로스틀랜드인답든, 그들은 외부인들을 "
"수용하지 않아. 알도리 기사들이 승리하는 꿈을 깨버려서 미안한데, 친구여, 그래도 이것을 사실로 받아들이시게. 우리의 삶은 그들에게 아무 "
"것도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "c4635bc9-ceee-4bff-9f98-d2cfef242529"
msgid ""
"\"And how are you going to manage that? Perhaps Varnhold will grow a pair of "
"legs and we shall ride it to the other end of Avistan? Or maybe we'll erect "
"sails across the barony and sail far, far away from Brevoy? No? You don't "
"think it will work? Then stop dreaming of isolating the country. We are "
"already a part of this game, and we will not be able to leave it when the "
"smoke clears from the final battlefield!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 그걸 어떻게 실현할텐가? 반홀드가 다리를 길게 뻗으면 아비스탄의 반대편 끝으로 타고 갈 수 있나? 아니면 돛을 세우고 남작령을 "
"가로질러 브레보이에서 멀리, 멀리 항해해 떠나기라도 할 건가? 안 되겠지? 자넨 그게 될 것 같나? 그렇다면 나라를 분리시키려는 꿈은 "
"접게. 우린 이미 이 게임의 일부분이고, 최후의 전장에서 연기가 걷혀도 거길 떠날 수 없을걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "176510ef-a9a9-4502-9efb-86e14a228448"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly! Praised be Asmodeus, at least someone in this traveling circus "
"can understand me.\""
msgstr "\"정확해! 아스모데우스에게 찬송을, 적어도 이 순회공연 서커스에 있는 누군가는 나를 이해해 주는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "eba4e209-7f8f-427c-ab64-3bb713c4328f"
msgid ""
"\"Well said, {d|Varn}Maegar{/d}. But if you understand this, then why not "
"take the next logical step?\""
msgstr "\"잘 말했네, {d|varn}메이가르{/d}. 그러나 거기까지 이해한다면, 다음 논리적인 단계도 밟는 게 어떤가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "86c5972c-7a56-4234-977f-6038dc58fbd9"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me carefully, you three. Yes, Kjerdi, this involves you too. "
"Things are looking bad. First, the land here is fertile, but its most "
"bountiful crop is cyclopes graves. Second, it shares a border with "
"{g|Iobaria}Iobaria{/g}, well known for its epidemics. – Gods forbid the wind "
"carries the next plague here! Settlers are reluctant to come here as it is, "
"and I can scarcely blame them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네들 셋, 내 말을 잘 듣게. 그래, 세르디, 이건 자네도 관련된 일이야. 상황이 안 좋아 보이네. 첫째, 이곳의 땅은 비옥하지만, "
"가장 풍성한 수확은 사이클롭스 무덤에서 난다네. 둘째, 우린 {g|Iobaria}이오바리아{/g}와 경계를 공유하고 있네. 거긴 전염병이 "
"도는 걸로 잘 알려져 있지. 신이시여, 바람이 다음번 역병을 여기로 옮기지 못하게 하소서! 정착민들이 이곳에 오기를 꺼려하는데, 난 "
"그들을 탓할 수가 없구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "dae75daf-f7b2-46c2-b512-8a35b7fb756a"
msgid "\"Such villainy!\""
msgstr "\"이런 악당 같으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "7f70787e-08e4-4d6d-81ce-241da7495f2c"
msgid ""
"\"Do not interrupt your regent, {d|Varn}Varn{/d}, or relieve me of the "
"position this instant! Now. What is the most important thing here? The "
"Aldori are afraid of unleashing war. They know that if they tried to "
"separate from Brevoy without some kind of outside support, the Surtova would "
"crush them. So we must convince them that we are their most loyal allies. We "
"will stoke the Aldori into an uprising, and when the unrest picks up, we "
"shall strike them in the back, and make them fight on two fronts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네 섭정을 방해하지 말게, {d|Varn}반{/d}, 아니면 즉시 이 직위에서 나를 내려주게! 자, 여기서 가장 중요한 게 뭔가? "
"알도리는 전쟁을 일으키기를 두려워한다네. 그들은 만약 자기들이 외부 지원 없이 브레보이로부터 떨어져 나가려고 하면, 서토바가 그들을 "
"뭉개버리려 들 것을 알고 있네. 그래서 우리는 그들에게 우리가 그들의 가장 충실한 동맹이라고 확신시켜야 하네. 우린 알도리가 봉기하도록 "
"부추기고, 소요사태가 일어나면 그들을 뒤에서 쳐서, 두 전선에서 싸우게 할 걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "5609a06e-5f47-4ea2-b02a-9de16aac6ecd"
msgid ""
"\"While you, your grace, were drinking wine at the feast, I was busy "
"acquiring a map of Nivakta's Crossing. Look at these fortifications. If we "
"could seize this town, we'd win a significant piece of Brevic land along "
"with it! After we've assisted the Surtova in hanging the Aldori on the "
"gates, they will allow us to keep part of what we have seized as a reward. "
"Then we will have peace and prosperity!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네, 영주이신 자네가 잔치에서 포도주를 마시는 동안, 나는 니박타의 건널목 지도를 얻느라 바빴네. 이 요새들 좀 보게. 만약 우리가 "
"이 마을을 점령할 수 있다면, 우리는 그것과 함께 상당한 브레보이 영토를 얻게 될 걸세! 우리가 서토바를 도와서 알도리를 성문에 효수한 "
"다음에는, 그들이 보답으로 우리가 점령한 것의 일부를 갖도록 허락할 걸세. 그러면 우리에게는 평화와 번영이 있을 게야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "2e3ddcd0-ec18-48f6-adb9-23aaaed3d272"
msgid ""
"\"Get out of my sight, {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d}. Get out! Never would the name "
"of {d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d} be tarred with such abominable villainy! It never "
"happened while I was leader of a mercenary party, and won't happen now that "
"I'm Baron!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 앞에서 사라지시오, {d|Cephal}케팔{/d}. 나가시오! {d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}의 이름이 이런 가증스러운 악행으로 "
"더럽혀지는 일은 결코 없을 거요! 용병단 우두머리 시절에도 그런 일은 없었고, 앞으로도 일어나지 않을 거요. 남작은 나요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "a1b990ac-0e3f-4e7a-ab44-401235c14bc8"
msgid ""
"\"Great {g|Asmodeus}Asmodeus{/g}, what did I do to deserve this punishment? "
"Why do I deal with you at all? I should have taken my share and retired a "
"long time ago! I will be off somewhere, soon enough – to "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, or {g|Cheliax}Cheliax{/g}. I shall read books on the "
"porch, and drink wine... while you do whatever you want – burn the city down "
"and get yourself killed!\" {n}As the old wizard storms off in a rage, you "
"hear a magical whisper:{/n} \"Come to me later. We need to talk.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대하신 {g|Asmodeus}아스모데우스{/g}시여, 내가 무슨 짓을 했기에 이런 벌을 받는 겁니까? 내가 왜 자네를 상대하고 있는 "
"거지? 내 몫을 챙기고 오래 전에 은퇴했어야 했어! 난 조만간 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}이나 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g} "
"어디로든 떠날 걸세. 현관 지붕 아래에서 책을 읽고 와인을 마실거야... 그동안 자네는 자네 하고 싶은대로 하게 – 도시를 불태우고 "
"자살하라고! {n}늙은 마법사가 격분해서 뛰쳐나가고, 마법적인 속삭임이 들려옵니다{/n} \"나중에 나 좀 보지. 얘기 좀 하세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "19205bfd-00d3-4fc1-8809-3ff19d7563dc"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe my ears. Must the history of our country begin with such "
"villainy? Oh, {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d}, Cephal... Ah well, let the old devil "
"cool off. I'll talk to him later. Is that all, Kjerdi?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 귀를 믿을 수가 없군. 우리나라의 역사가 그런 악행에서 출발해야 하는건가? 오, {d|Cephal}케팔{/d}, 케팔... 별 수 "
"없지, 우리 늙은 악마가 머리를 식히게 둬. 나중에 따로 그와 말할 테니까. 더 할 말 있나, 셰르디?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "b5bf2080-b0c2-42c9-9872-e6e5d65bf38d"
msgid ""
"\"I see... So, we've got a revolutionary from {g|Galt}Galt{/g} on our hands. "
"A tavern keeper writes us. — She saw the revolutionary walking around "
"stirring up the people for an uprising.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보자... 그래, {g|Galt}갈트{/g}의 혁명가가 우리 손에 있었군. 선술집 주인이 우리에게 편지를 썼네. — 그녀는 그 "
"혁명가가 봉기를 위해 사람들을 휘젓고 다니는 것을 보았다고 하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e6a693cb-95de-4a7a-b216-845dd67cfca4"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you're the General. –- You go and deal with it. Talk to the tavern "
"keeper, find out where to look for this instigator. Well, far be it from me "
"to teach you how to do your job. When you finish, report back to me. By the "
"gods, what a worry! Uprisings, intrigues... These damn letters... That "
"Gunderson and his bracelet... And the baron has to see to all of that, and "
"listen to everyone's complaints while he's at it! What a nuisance...\" {n}"
"Maegar leaves in a cloud of curses.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 자네가 장군이지. 그러니 자네가 가서 처리하게. 선술집 주인과 대화하고, 그 선동가를 어디서 찾아야 하는지 알아봐. 뭐, "
"어떻게 처리해야 할지 자네에게 가르칠 생각은 조금도 없어. 끝나면 나한테 보고하게. 맙소사, 정말 걱정이군! 봉기, 역적모의... 이 "
"빌어먹을 편지들... 건더슨과 그놈의 팔찌... 그리고 남작은 이 모든 것을 살펴야 하고, 그러면서도 모두의 불평을 들어야 한다니. 아 "
"성가셔라..\" {n}메이가르는 욕지거리를 헤대며 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "63575a1a-b11c-49c5-9916-540b97bfb33b"
msgid ""
"\"Do not become too attached to Varnhold. This is but a stepping stone. Our "
"real prize lies to the west. – But what does {d|Varn}Varn{/d} do? He sends "
"them gifts! Better to send them assassins! Without their baron, the Shrike "
"Hills would descend into a struggle for power – and Silverstep and the "
"Kamelands would fall to us soon after!\""
msgstr ""
"\"반홀드에 너무 집착하지 말게. 이곳은 그저 디딤돌에 불과하네. 우리에게 주어질 진정한 상은 서쪽에 있다네. – 그런데 "
"{d|Varn}반{/d}은 무엇을 하는가? 그는 그들에게 선물을 보내는군! 암살자를 보내는 게 낫지! 그들의 남작이 없으면 슈라이크 "
"구릉지는 권력투쟁에 빠져들 것이고, 실버스텝과 케임랜드는 곧 우리에게 떨어질 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Verda
msgctxt "38ff38a1-8832-43a6-a1b0-7482b217a4ee"
msgid "{n}The dwarf shrugs and hands him another paper.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드워프는 어깨를 으쓱하고는 그에게 또 다른 종이를 건네줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Return1_VarnVSCephal/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "92a14dd8-141d-42a7-9ce2-3766b8c2d9e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar glances over the document and his face brightens.{/n} \"Ah-ha... I "
"see you've included everything, just as I asked. Thank you, Kjerdi.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 서류를 훑어보더니 얼굴이 밝아집니다.{/n} \"아하... 내가 부탁한 것들을 전부 넣었구나. 고마워, 셰르디.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9cd40db4-b6b8-47d9-a938-5cc23ce46a4b"
msgid ""
"\"We've known each other for a while. Why haven't you talked about this "
"before?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 서로 안지도 꽤 됐잖아요. 왜 진작 이런 얘기를 하지 않았죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "22c2f935-3ab9-4ddb-8145-c8b938f4e7da"
msgid ""
"\"Scouts report back that the maneuver you were asking about is more than "
"possible.\""
msgstr "\"순찰대가 돌아와서 그러는데 당신이 지시한 공작이 아주 성공적이라네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a7119f17-894a-4941-8f73-3f9f2fa1457e"
msgid ""
"\"Please stop. You are my baron and commander, and I am your companion and "
"General. Let things remain as they are.\""
msgstr "\"그만해 주세요. 당신은 제 남작이자 지휘관이고, 전 당신의 동료이며 장군이예요. 이대로 둬 주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Barks/Soldier_bark_String
msgctxt "a62bbca3-cd1a-4732-b1bc-d0f94ba4ddf1"
msgid "\"Baron! Baron! Kjerdi is looking for you urgently!\""
msgstr "\"남작님! 남작님! 셰르디가 급하게 남작님을 찾고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Barks/Varn_bark_String
msgctxt "ce6d51ce-cc32-4a2b-82f8-b64d1bef5f30"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem. I had a feeling some disaster just bound to happen today. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"에헴. 오늘 뭔가 재앙이 일어날 예정인 것 같은 느낌이 들었지. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9987a4eb-850e-4cca-9308-cd711d7ade96"
msgid ""
"{n}Varnhold is peaceful and sleepy in the early dawn. It is still a small "
"settlement – not quite yet a town, but striving towards it. It seems to be "
"smiling at you and Baron Varn as the window panes flash in the morning sun. "
"But Maegar seems pensive, almost sad.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이른 새벽의 반홀드는 평화롭고 조용합니다. 이곳은 아직 작은 정착지입니다 – 아직 도시라고 할 수는 없는 규모지만, 그렇게 되려고 "
"노력 중입니다. 아침 햇살에 마치 창문이 반쩍이며 당신과 반 남작을 향해 웃는 것 같습니다. 하지만 메이가르는 수심에 잠겨 "
"슬퍼보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ae43b6f3-d63e-4146-b3fc-7b8cbe1665c6"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure if it's the right time for this conversation, but I just feel "
"like chatting today. You know, {name}, while we were living like a gang of "
"mercenaries, I tried never to make any plans for the future. Never even "
"imagine a happy and proud picture, 'myself in ten years', who had made all "
"his dreams come true. I considered it bad luck! I'm a little superstitious "
"like that. And it's easier... when you're not thinking about your future... "
"it's not so scary to dash into risky situations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대화하기 적절한 때인지는 잘 모르겠지만, 오늘은 그냥 수다를 떨고 싶은 기분이야. {name}, 우리가 용병 패거리처럼 생활하는 "
"동안, 나는 미래에 대한 어떤 계획도 세우지 않으려고 노력했어. 자신의 모든 꿈을 실현시킨 행복하고 자랑스러운 그림, '10년 후의 내 "
"모습'을 상상조차 해본 적이 없지. 나는 그게 불운을 부른다고 생각했어! 난 그런 미신을 믿는 경향이 있으니까. 그리고 그게 더 쉬운 "
"편이지... 미래를 생각하지 않으면... 위험한 상황에 뛰어드는 게 그리 무섭지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "7bf872eb-07be-47cc-9a95-0e8e20614238"
msgid ""
"\"But now I have this new title – and Varnhold. Strange how it can change a "
"person. I've started contemplating things I never used to think about "
"before, and ask myself questions I used to never ask. I see my warriors and "
"companions in a new light. And you. I'm boring you, aren't I? Let's consider "
"this a scouting mission. I'm sending out my patrols, trying to figure out if "
"there's a chance that my vis-a-vis might decide to change her disposition "
"towards me. To a... closer one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"허나 내겐 이제 새 작위와 반홀드가 있지. 이런 것이 사람을 바꾸다니 이상한 일이야. 예전에는 생각지도 않던 것들에 대해 고뇌하고, "
"나 스스로에게도 묻지도 않던 것들을 물어보게 되었지. 나의 전사들 그리고 전우들, 그리고 너에 대해서도 새로운 관점으로 생각하게 되었어. "
"따분하게 만든 모양이군, 아닌가? 정찰 임무라고 생각해보자고. 정찰조를 보내서 나와 얼굴을 마주하는 것이 그녀가 내쪽으로의 배치를 바꿀 "
"수 있는지 알아보는거야. 보다... 가까운 쪽으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "1be3fbf1-b46e-439f-903b-56d4717e0b93"
msgid ""
"\"That's a good question.\" {n}Maegar makes a helpless gesture, as if "
"apologizing.{/n} \"Probably because just a year ago we were living from one "
"fight to the next, and the only thing I could offer a woman was a night in "
"my tent and a chance to become a widow before she ever became a wife.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋은 질문이군.\" {n}메이가르는 사과라도 하듯 어쩔 줄 몰라하는 몸짓을 합니다.{/n} \"대략 1년 전만 해도 우리는 이 싸움 "
"저 싸움 옮겨가며 살았고, 내가 한 여자에게 줄 수 있는 유일한 거라고는 내 텐트에서 하룻밤을 보내는 것과 결혼도 하기 전에 과부가 될 "
"기회가 다였으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "856a1807-90e3-4684-a931-d769c641b8fb"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar's eyes grow brighter, and his face relaxes.{/n} \"Not a single "
"report has ever made me so happy.\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르의 눈이 더욱 밝아지고, 얼굴에는 긴장이 풀립니다.{/n} \"지금까지 받은 어떤 보고보다 좋군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "bf8aa7b6-a8ab-4792-a1c1-900451c31c67"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar listens to you with a serious face, than nods abruptly.{/n} \"In "
"that case, I apologize. And I promise not to return to this conversation "
"again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 심각한 얼굴로 당신의 말을 듣다가, 돌연히 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"이건 내 사과하지. 그리고 다시는 이 주제로 "
"대화하지 않겠다고 약속할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/RomancePromenade/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "c2ad9c1e-f8da-4153-a526-2de128ab21ad"
msgid "\"Wait. Who's that running after us?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 우리 뒤를 쫓는 게 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ba359187-bb71-433f-9c62-8750c0ae710c"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d1a1ed1b-2a5e-4354-a20f-662594770618"
msgid "[Address the leader] \"Who are you?\""
msgstr "[지도자에게 직접 말을 걸다] \"누구신지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "90e4c986-723f-4a29-9ed0-8007740709fa"
msgid "[Address the settlers] \"What's the problem here?\""
msgstr "[이주민들에게 직접 말을 건다] \"여기 뭐가 문제죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ae3fdd8d-f3cf-405a-8852-78d2f791e342"
msgid "\"Guards! Seize the troublemaker!\""
msgstr "\"경비병! 저 소란을 일으키는 자를 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "039867f2-dd86-46bc-a20e-5e7017abcf6d"
msgid "\"Those are just generalities. What happened, exactly?\""
msgstr "\"그건 그냥 대략적인 내용이고. 정확히 무슨 일이 있었죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "76976a44-a6c8-4f0d-80f5-10ca95b01580"
msgid ""
"\"Shut your mouth, foreigner. I wasn't talking to you. Citizens of Varnhold! "
"What exactly are you unhappy about?\""
msgstr "\"입 다물어, 이방인. 난 너한테 얘기한 게 아니야. 반홀드 시민 여러분! 정확히 뭐가 불쾌하신 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "121eaa60-ba59-47a7-8227-1daa4bd7d1fb"
msgid ""
"\"The baron is not your enemy, and we don't need to stoop to violence. I "
"will personally see that your troubles get taken care of!\""
msgstr "\"남작은 당신들의 적이 아니고, 우리는 폭력에 굽실거릴 필요가 없어요. 제가 직접 처리하고 당신들 문제를 해결해드리죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "23fcb73e-1855-4157-8b24-530aca68afd5"
msgid ""
"\"This woman is the instigator! She put you up to this. She wants you to "
"fight with the soldiers so that she can play political games while you spill "
"your life's blood!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 여자가 그 선동자야! 그녀가 당신들에게 이 일을 시켰어요. 그 여자는 당신들이 병사들이랑 싸우면서 피흘리는 동안 정치 놀이를 "
"하려는 거라고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "1d22270a-6f81-48d8-a7af-4b95971b0726"
msgid ""
"\"If this comes to blows, you won't stand a chance against Varn's guards. "
"Now give us the instigator and go home.\""
msgstr "\"만약 드잡이질로 번지면, 반의 경비병들은 조금도 봐주지 않을 거예요. 이제 선동자를 내주고 집으로 돌아가요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "ef9c12e4-5cdb-41c5-843e-85a2547ed22c"
msgid ""
"\"And what is this on your belt? Why, it looks like a wand of invisibility! "
"What need do you have of that?\""
msgstr "\"그런데 허리띠에 이게 뭐예요? 왜, 그거 투명술 완드 같은데! 이게 왜 필요하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "dcdf7d50-89cb-4bc3-b58d-1b1e77f86e24"
msgid ""
"\"There's been constant carnage ever since the revolution in Galt. Every "
"day, someone else gets sent to the chopping block. Do you really want the "
"same fate for Varnhold?\""
msgstr ""
"\"갈트 혁명 이후 계속 살육이 있었죠. 매일같이, 누군가가 단두대로 끌려가요. 정말 반홀드에서도 똑같은 일이 벌어지면 좋겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "18e98b76-7901-42a8-b7c1-ac264c06a9cd"
msgid ""
"\"Dull eyes, froth on the lips... That doesn't sound like an ordinary "
"illness. Do you think someone could have poisoned your cows?\""
msgstr "\"흐릿한 눈에, 입에는 거품을 물고... 그건 보통 병 같진 않은데. 누군가 당신 소들에게 독이라도 먹인 거 아니예요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "46a26d81-bc91-4194-a84e-d3c7fb854c56"
msgid ""
"\"I see many of you wearing Abadar's keys. Does the god of civilization "
"approve of such uncivilized methods for solving problems?\""
msgstr "\"당신들 사이에서 아바다르의 열쇠가 좀 보이는데. 문명의 신이 이렇게 야만적으로 문제를 해결하라고 하던가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "b5cb41f6-b810-4dae-a0ca-c0899f4046b4"
msgid "[Grab her hand]"
msgstr "[그녀의 손을 움켜잡는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "69a2ff26-7f08-4cef-a559-34638742e186"
msgid "[Knock the wand out of her hands]"
msgstr "[그녀의 손에서 지팡이를 때려 떨어뜨린다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "412df6b6-569d-4271-9ca0-88fdaae04956"
msgid "[Signal to the guards not to attack]"
msgstr "[경비원들에게 공격하지 말라고 신호한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "23707e23-6645-4ec4-a968-4d9a5270c363"
msgid "[Do nothing]"
msgstr "[아무것도 하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "543adc27-4c7a-41a0-bbbe-3153adef3327"
msgid ""
"\"So are you here to complain about the sick cows, or to demand a people's "
"republic? Make up your minds.\""
msgstr "\"그러니까 병든 소 갖고 따지러 온 거예요, 아니면 사회주의 낙원을 만나겠다고 온 거예요? 하나만 정해봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1b8f94ca-e7bd-454a-96a8-dd4e4a7ce609"
msgid ""
"{n}The situation is growing heated. Varn's guards, their weapons drawn, "
"stand opposite a group of settlers who are yelling revolutionary slogans. "
"You see some of the local fishermen among them. There's a half-orc woman in "
"the front row, wearing a bright cape and shaking her weapon. She's obviously "
"not from around here.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}상황은 점점 가열되고 있습니다. 반의 경비병들은 무기를 뽑아들어 대열을 갖추고 맞은편에는 혁명적인 구호를 외치는 정착민 무리가 서 "
"있습니다. 당신은 그들 중 몇몇 지역 어부들을 볼 수 있습니다. 제일 앞줄에는 밝은 색의 망토를 두르고 무기를 흔드는 하프 오크 여자가 "
"서있습니다. 그녀는 분명히 이 근방 사람이 아닙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "cf7316b4-d812-4b50-8da9-21a85746ae83"
msgid ""
"\"Down with tyranny! We will not be treated like cattle! You can't enslave "
"us!\""
msgstr "\"폭정에 반대한다! 우리는 가축이 되지 않겠다! 우리를 노예로 만들 수는 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : FortGuardRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "90e1d375-b27d-425b-b653-ea02ca0e08bf"
msgid ""
"\"Calm down! Now...\" {n}Noticing you, the guard sighs with relief.{/n} "
"\"Here's {Name}, the General of His Grace {d|Varn}Varn{/d}. I'm sure "
"{mf|he|she} will deal with your problems, so we can all go home peacefully.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좀 진정들 해! 자...\" {n}당신을 눈치챈 경비병은 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"여기 {Name}(이)가 계신다, 남작 "
"{d|Varn}반{/d}의 장군이시다. 나는 {mf|그|그녀}가 너희 문제를 잘 처리해줄 거라고 확신해, 그럼 우리 모두 평화롭게 집으로 "
"돌아갈 수 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "ccc54309-97d2-4db3-8376-214bab3c8314"
msgid ""
"\"I am Leonta Misho of the revolutionary Crimson Swans of {g|Galt}Galt{/g}! "
"We have freed our own home from tyranny, and I will not stand by as your new "
"feudal lord tramples the freedom of these people under his boots!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 온 크림슨 스완스의 혁명가 레온타 미스호다! 우리는 고향을 폭정으로부터 해방시켰고, 당신들의 새 "
"봉건 영주가 장홧발로 이 사람들의 자유를 짓밟는 것을 좌시하지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "891f2a9c-f9f5-4068-a3f7-b25ab26722bd"
msgid ""
"\"Kings, barons, earls... Ordinary people are like cattle to the nobility! "
"We will not allow this new state to become yet another prison for the "
"people, who groan under the yoke of tyranny! We demand that {d|Varn}Maegar "
"Varn{/d} relinquish his power, proclaim these lands a people's republic, and "
"gather a constituent assembly!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕들, 남작들, 백작들... 일반 백성들은 귀족들에겐 가축이나 다름없다! 우리는 폭정의 멍에 아래 놓인 사람들에게 이 새 나라가 또 "
"다른 감옥이 되는 것을 용납하지 않는다! 우리는 {d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}이 그의 권력을 포기하고 이 땅을 인민 공화국이라고 "
"선포할 것, 그리고 제헌 의회를 소집할 것을 요구한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "0469230a-8cb7-4e04-b697-baa51ca07049"
msgid "\"Their problem is the autocracy of the tyrant!\""
msgstr "\"그들의 문제는 폭군의 독재다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "e410f3f7-8014-4d91-8d4d-348db8645db4"
msgid ""
"\"Don't threaten us! We've seen worse than you!\" {n}Settlers draw their "
"weapons, ready to defend their leader.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"협박하지 마! 우리는 너보다 더한 놈도 봤어!\" {n}정착민들은 무기를 뽑아 그들의 지도자를 방어할 태세를 갖춥니다 .{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "5f9dd725-8062-4dde-a654-dccdf720587d"
msgid ""
"\"Here's the whole story, General. We're from Brevoy. We were tired of "
"working for the Surtova, so we decided to try our luck here in this new "
"land. So we built a farm a couple of miles from Varnhold, and started "
"settling in. And it was going pretty well, too! But then a pestilence struck "
"the cows!\""
msgstr ""
"\"장군, 내막을 들려드리지. 우린 브레보이에서 왔소. 우리는 서토바를 위해 일하는 데 지쳤어. 그래서 여기 이 새로운 땅에서 우리의 "
"행운을 시험해 보기로 했지. 그래서 우리는 반홀드에서 2마일 떨어진 곳에 농장을 짓고 정착하기 시작했소. 그리고 꽤 잘 되고 있었지! "
"그런데 역병이 소들을 덮쳤소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "eebec92b-22c9-4e6d-8518-0321585baa1a"
msgid ""
"\"They can't even stand, the poor things. Their eyes are all dull and "
"they're frothing at the lips... We sent word to His Grace – the Baron did "
"promise to help us settlers! But we got no reply. He didn't even send a "
"doctor – or even a bloody scroll!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가엾은 것들, 그것들은 제대로 서지도 못하오. 그것들 모두 눈이 흐리멍텅해지고 입에선 거품을 내고 있소... 우리는 남작께 전갈을 "
"보냈지. 남작은 우리 정착민들을 돕겠다고 약속했소! 그런데 우리는 아무런 회답도 받지 못했소. 그는 의사는 커녕 빌어먹을 마법 스크롤 한 "
"장조차 보내지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "c991a060-fa37-48e0-955e-82c8f7ead2b3"
msgid "\"Aren't your hearts...\""
msgstr "\"너희 심장이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "695ab241-d726-4a07-8931-be583e52ab89"
msgid ""
"\"What's wrong with you? Are you prepared to live your entire lives as "
"slaves to a feudal lord? Whoever still has a living, beating heart in their "
"chest, and not a pile of dung – to arms! For freedom! Against tyranny!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐가 문제인가? 평생을 봉건 영주의 노예로 살 각오가 되어 있는가? 아직 살아서, 가슴에 똥더미 대신 심장이 뛰고 있는 사람들이라면, "
"무기를 들라! 자유를 위하여! 폭정에 대항하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "0ec0e49a-a271-4f1c-abfa-657268aa97e1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes. The henchmen of dictators see evil everywhere, because evil is all "
"they know! But we are not like them! Our hearts are pure, and our intentions "
"are noble! To arms, my friends, to arms for our freedom!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 그래. 독재자의 심복들은 어디에서나 악을 본다.악이 그들이 아는 전부이기 때문이다. 하지만 우리는 그들과 다르다! 우리의 마음은 "
"순수하고, 우리의 뜻은 고귀하다! 무기를 들라, 나의 친구들이여, 무기를 들라, 우리의 자유를 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "b33519b9-797a-4c31-a1f1-b8e362c0b420"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive us. We didn't mean any harm. This damned troublemaker played us "
"for fools! Throw the snake in prison! And we'll, you know.. We'll just go "
"home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리를 용서해 주시오. 우리는 무슨 해를 끼치려고 한 것이 아니오. 이 빌어먹을 선동꾼이 우리를 바보 취급했소! 저 독사를 감옥에 "
"처넣으시오! 그리고 우린, 알잖소.. 우린 그냥 집에 갈 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "6a76ad66-ddb2-4f04-b7d2-446b53dc1ef5"
msgid ""
"\"Do you hear that? Violence is the argument of dictators! They think they "
"can keep us forever enslaved, under threat of their swords! But they are "
"wrong! We are invincible, because the truth is with us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 말이 들리나? 폭력은 독재자들의 수단이다! 그들은 칼의 위협 아래 우리를 영원히 노예로 만들 수 있다고 생각해! 하지만 그들은 "
"틀렸어! 우리는 무적이다. 진실이 우리와 함께하기 때문이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "f03c8246-78db-4f5b-a2e2-8f65ec9005ad"
msgid ""
"\"A wand of invisibility? Old Ignash the sorcerer had one just like that... "
"Now then, let me see it!\""
msgstr "\"투명술 완드? 늙은 마법사 이그내쉬가 그런 걸 가지고 있었어... 그럼, 내가 한번 보겠소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "cce385b6-4cee-4fce-9ff3-b6821e514482"
msgid ""
"\"What wand? We're talking about the cows, and {mf|he|she}'s going on about "
"a wand. {mf|He|She}'s just trying to distract us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 완드? 우리는 소에 대해 얘기하고 있었고, {mf|그|그녀}는 완드에 대해 이야기를 하고 있다. {mf|그|그녀}는 단지 우리의 "
"주의를 딴 데로 돌리려는 것뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "03bf0012-a594-47fe-ba68-1f16abfcfb7d"
msgid ""
"\"Right, who are we listening to? Those revolutionaries ruined everything in "
"{g|Galt}Galt{/g}, and now they want to come here and tell us how to live?\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아, 우리가 누구 말을 듣고 있는 거지? 그런 혁명가들이 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}의 모든 것을 망쳐놨는데, 이제와서 우리에게 "
"어떻게 살아야 하는지 알려주겠다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "a8afd66d-78fa-4f73-9046-30eb37f6d022"
msgid ""
"\"No, no, Leonta told us all about {g|Galt}Galt{/g}! The people rose to "
"power there, but they couldn't save the country from traitors and saboteurs. "
"That's not going to happen here. We've never have any traitors or saboteurs "
"here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 아닙니다, 레온타가 우리에게 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에 대해 다 말해줬어요! 그곳에서는 민중이 권좌에 올랐지만 반역자와 파괴 "
"공작원으로부터 나라를 구할 수는 없었어요. 여기서 그런 일은 없을 겁니다. 여기엔 반역자나 파괴 공작원은 한 명도 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "909530d4-266b-406a-a1c8-e38e5f9b1983"
msgid ""
"\"Poison? Wait a minute, that does sound like poisoning! But who... Em... "
"Leonta! Did you poison our cows just to stir up a riot?!\""
msgstr "\"독? 잠깐만, 그거 진짜 독살 같은데! 하지만 누가... 에... 레온타! 폭동을 일으키려고 우리 소들을 독살한 건가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "760685df-e3c4-49d6-83e9-42a63b801327"
msgid ""
"\"No, why would I? It's only an illness. Or maybe they ate some poisonous "
"grass in the field. Either way, we need help, and the baron sends us nothing!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니야, 내가 왜? 그건 단지 병이다. 아니면 들판에서 독초를 좀 먹었을지도 모른다. 어느 쪽이든 우리는 도움이 필요한데, 남작은 "
"우리에게 아무것도 보내지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "9ed99a72-58c8-4d99-8029-f2b16126e791"
msgid ""
"\"You're right! This doesn't seem right – drawing our weapons at the first "
"sign of trouble. If we grabbed our knives every time there's a problem, what "
"would happen? It wouldn't be a nice place to live, that's for sure!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 이건 잘못됐어 – 갈등 시작부터 무기부터 뽑는 건 곤란해. 문제가 생길 때마다 칼을 빼들면 어떻게 되겠어? 살기 좋은 곳이 "
"되진 않을 거야, 그건 확실해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "a64c6620-c3dc-4a35-9300-e6652bce7039"
msgid ""
"\"Don't try smooth talking us! What Abadar thinks of me is my business. We "
"came here to talk about our dealings with the baron!\""
msgstr ""
"\"적당히 어영부영 넘어가려고 하지 마! 아바다르께서 날 지켜보시는 건 내 문제다. 우리는 남작과의 거래에 대해 이야기하기 위해 여기에 "
"온 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "9c7749cd-571b-4594-997d-4ef6f182dbc3"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice the revolutionary take a magic wand from her belt. She's about "
"to cast a spell!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 혁명가가 그녀의 허리춤에서 마법 완드를 꺼내는 것을 눈치챕니다. 그녀가 주문을 시전하려 합니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "85cb7502-3cc4-4b9a-9ba7-9929c8f65d88"
msgid ""
"{n}The revolutionary grabs a magical wand from her belt. Before you have a "
"chance to react, she casts an invisibility spell and disappears.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}혁명가가 허리띠에서 마법 완드를 꺼내 잡습니다. 당신이 반응할 틈도 없이 그녀는 투명 주문을 시전하고 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "4bec8b74-8793-4472-aa8e-9d2569d3e00f"
msgid ""
"{n}The settler looks more closely at the wand the half-orc is holding, and "
"his faces grow dark with anger.{/n} \"That's the wand of invisibility we "
"took from old Ignash the sorcerer. So that's why you needed it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}정착민들은 하프 오크가 들고 있는 완드를 더 자세히 들여다보고는, 분노로 얼굴이 어두워집니다.{/n} \"저건 우리가 늙은 마법사 "
"이그내쉬에게서 뺏은 투명술 완드야. 그래 그게 네가 그걸 필요로 했던 이유구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "6b6963d9-7950-4668-9149-0b5bccf269bb"
msgid "{n}The revolutionary ducks. Your fingers grab only air.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}혁명가는 몸을 숙여 피합니다. 당신의 손가락은 허공을 잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "e3818085-eefd-4e84-8e12-231107f12292"
msgid ""
"{n}One settler picks up the wand from the ground, and his face grows dark "
"with anger.{/n} \"This is the wand of invisibility we took from old Ignash "
"the sorcerer. So this is why you needed it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}한 정착민이 땅바닥에서 완드를 집어듭니다.그리고 그의 얼굴은 분노로 어두워집니다.{/n} \"저건 우리가 늙은 마법사 이그내쉬에게서 "
"빼앗었던 투명술 완드야. 그래 그게 네가 그걸 필요로 했던 이유구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "fd0d31c0-277c-48ab-acd6-7b7681488ecb"
msgid "{n}The revolutionary gracefully dodges your blow.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}혁명가는 우아하게 당신의 공격을 피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : FortGuardRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "b9adb5d9-4c32-48f0-9c03-9c105f864a04"
msgid "\"Keep back, keep back... We can still avoid bloodshed!\""
msgstr "\"물러서, 물러서... 우리는 아직 피 흘리지 않을 기회가 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "314914e7-eec8-4e7f-8cc1-ecb77f21274e"
msgid ""
"{n}The revolutionary casts an invisibility spell with the wand, and promptly "
"disappears, but only you notice it happen. – Both the guards and the "
"settlers are only concerned about the fight!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}혁명가는 완드로 투명 주문을 시전하고, 즉시 사라지지만, 오직 당신만이 그것을 알아차립니다. – 경비병과 정착민 모두 싸움에만 "
"신경을 쓰고 있습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "2aef1b14-1440-4083-9f7c-66e6dab196ec"
msgid ""
"{n}The guards loose a battle cry and attack the crowd. The first blood drops "
"fall to the ground. Carnage is inevitable!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}경비대가 전투의 함성을 지르며 군중을 공격합니다. 첫 핏방울이 땅에 떨어집니다. 살육은 이제 불가피합니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "f0c717f9-98fd-4d44-be8d-0ce3f00d814f"
msgid ""
"\"We wanted to forget it and seek our fortune elsewhere, but then this one "
"came. Her name is Leonta Misho. She's from {g|Galt}Galt{/g}. She said the "
"Baron didn't care about us, and wasn't going to help. That all he's good for "
"is taking taxes. She said we should go make some noise, stomp our feet. Then "
"maybe His Grace will pay heed to our troubles!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그것을 잊고 어딘가 다른 곳에서 우리의 재산을 만회하고 싶었지만, 그 때 이 사람이 왔소. 그녀의 이름은 레온타 미스호. "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g} 출신이오. 그녀가 말하길 남작은 우리를 신경쓰지 않고, 도와주지도 않을 거라고 했소. 그가 잘 하는 건 세금을 "
"걷는 것뿐이라더군. 가서 시끄럽게 하고 발을 구르라고 했지. 어쩌면 폐하께서 우리의 어려움에 주의를 기울이실지도 모른다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "a8473b6a-87b5-4e5a-8c69-da3e9a1b9fe5"
msgid ""
"{n}Baffled, the settlers stare into the empty space where she was just a "
"moment ago. Rage fills their faces.{/n} \"What is this? She brought us here, "
"set the soldiers on us... And disappears? The Galtan snake!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당혹스럽게도, 정착민들은 조금 전 그녀가 있던 빈 공간을 응시합니다. 분노가 그들의 얼굴에 가득합니다.{/n} \"이게 뭐야? 우릴 "
"여기로 데려와서 병사들을 우리랑 맞붙게 하고... 그러고 사라진다고? 이 갈트의 독사년!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "6e8e902f-173f-4911-a1ac-81f2076d7d40"
msgid ""
"\"So that's your plan? Bring us here, set the soldiers on us... And "
"disappear? You Galtan snake! Tie her up! Throw her in prison – or lead her "
"to the chopping block. It's not our business any more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 그게 네 계획이냐? 우릴 여기로 데려와서, 병사들을 우리랑 싸움붙여 놓고... 그러고 사라진다? 이 갈트의 독사년아! 그녀를 "
"묶어라! 그녀를 감옥에 쳐넣던지 아니면 단두대 위에 올려놓든지. 더 이상 우리 일이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "53f8390d-1c17-4fad-93de-3ac01261cdc9"
msgid ""
"{n}The settlers exchange looks.{/n} \"Yes, about the republic... We went a "
"little overboard...\""
msgstr "{n}정착민들은 시선을 교환합니다.{/n} \"그래, 공화국에 대해서...우리가 좀 선을 넘었군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "dde91f29-8741-484b-a576-36ec829f22ad"
msgid ""
"\"Citizens, don't listen to the tyrant's henchman! Don't give up! Fight for "
"your rights! Don't you see? So long as a sovereign rules over you, no one "
"will care about your suffering? Your cows, your fields, your homes – all of "
"this is at risk, until you become your own masters! Down with the baron! The "
"time of the people has come!\""
msgstr ""
"\"시민들이여, 폭군의 심복의 말을 듣지 마십시오! 포기하지 마십시오! 당신의 권리를 위해 싸우십시오! 모르겠습니까? 군주가 당신들을 "
"다스리는 한 아무도 당신들의 고통을 신경 쓰지 않는다는 걸? 여러분의 소, 밭, 집 등 – 여러분이 스스로의 주인이 될 때까지는 이 모든 "
"게 다 위험합니다! 남작에 반대합시다! 백성의 시대가 왔습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "0070b4c4-9314-44ff-a9db-a38697e24d7e"
msgid ""
"{n}Inspired by the revolutionary's speech, the settlers draw their weapons "
"and move towards the guards. The latter raise their weapons and grit their "
"teeth. A bloodbath seems inevitable!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}혁명가의 연설에 고무된 정착민들은 무기를 꺼내 경비병들을 향해 움직입니다. 몇몇은 무기를 들어올리며 이를 갑니다. 유혈사태는 "
"불가피해 보입니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "96af22fa-f2c6-49fe-a438-aaa3a43d01e5"
msgid ""
"\"But come to think of it... Please send us a doctor, or a healing scroll. "
"Our cows keep getting ill, and the baron doesn't help, or even reply... If "
"it weren't for the cows, we wouldn't have caused any trouble! All right, so "
"long!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 생각해 보면... 그냥 우리에게 의사나 치료용 두루마리를 보내주십쇼. 우리 소들은 계속 병이 나는데, 남작은 돕지도 않고 "
"대답도 하지 않습니다... 소가 아니었다면, 우리는 문제를 일으키지 않았을 겁니다! 좋아요, 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "3480d90f-c6a9-4379-8980-b4006ae0c9f9"
msgid ""
"\"Let's go, everyone, before the baron's guards cut us to pieces! I guess "
"there's no luck for us in Varnhold. We'll try to settle somewhere else. "
"Maybe things will be better in Shrike Hills...\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두들 돌아갑시다, 남작의 경비병들이 우리를 갈기갈기 찢어놓기 전에! 우린 운이 반홀드에서는 없는 것 같아. 다른 곳에 정착하도록 "
"해봅시다. 아마 슈라이크 구릉지에선 일이 잘 풀릴지도 모르니까..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "33042b91-bc9f-47cc-87e4-1d956b77d4b7"
msgid "\"Keep quiet, you've had your say. Folks, tie her up!\""
msgstr "\"조용히 해, 할 말은 끝이겠지. 모두들, 그녀를 묶으시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : FortGuardRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "90071ab1-8c6b-4f4a-a93b-b79d01291222"
msgid ""
"\"You better surrender while you still can! Or we'll slaughter the lot of "
"you!\"\n"
"{n}The soldiers approach the crowd. They obviously don't want to fight the "
"settlers, but they won't disobey your orders either.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아직 할 수 있을 때 항복하는 게 좋을 거야! 아니면 너희들을 모조리 도살할 테다!\"\n"
"{n}군인들은 군중을 향해 다가간다. 그들은 분명히 정착민들과 싸우고 싶지 않지만, 당신의 명령을 거역하지도 않을 것이다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Revolutionary
msgctxt "6cb617ad-12bf-426f-a706-00404c044d4d"
msgid ""
"{n}The revolutionary casts an invisibility spell with her wand, and vanishes "
"right in front of everyone.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}혁명가는 완드로 투명 주문을 시전하고, 모두의 앞에서 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : FishermanRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "3c5ca7ce-0986-40d9-8e6d-ea9efb52404f"
msgid ""
"{n}The fishermen exchange apprehensive looks.{/n} \"We'll, you know... We'll "
"go too, all right? We have some silly things written on our walls. We'll "
"wash them off right away!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어부들은 걱정스러운 표정을 교환합니다.{/n} \"저기, 있잖습니까... 우리도 가겠습니다, 괜찮겠죠? 우리네 집 벽에 우스꽝스러운 "
"것들이 몇 개 적혀 있어서요. 당장 씻어내겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Royalquest_revolutioner/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : FishermanRevolutionSpeaker
msgctxt "f48dd091-24cc-47a1-bd39-d68b10b9cd52"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! And there's holes in our boats. Can't catch any fish like that! But "
"the Baron doesn't care! He loves to eat fish, I'm sure, but he's never held "
"a fishing pole his whole life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요! 그리고 우린 배에도 구멍이 나 있습니다. 물고기도 하나 못 잡는다고요! 하지만 남작은 상관하지 않으셔! 분명 생선 먹는 걸 "
"좋아하시지만 평생 낚싯대를 잡아본 적은 없을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "908dc0b3-cbb5-4e2d-a417-20ebede1c8a5"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8a1df211-9bd2-408b-9d39-2f6c062b9251"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"물건좀 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ac3ac14c-62c8-4a69-9fb3-d8a242d1df32"
msgid "[Give 5 gold coins] \"Tell my fortune.\""
msgstr "[금화 5닢을 준다] \"점 좀 쳐줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3da01e32-f645-486d-b4f5-40ab44291edb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking for a troublemaker, who has been stirring the people to riot. "
"Have you seen her?\""
msgstr "\"나는 말썽꾼을 찾고있어. 사람들을 선동해 폭동을 일으키고 있는데, 본 적 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "e0ea0a10-ce60-4fe4-a8c4-415c75808998"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "35bd40c2-9aa8-47a4-b366-4d6a6642d954"
msgid ""
"{n}An old man in a threadbare robe squints at you, fiddling with his matted "
"beard.{/n} \"What do you seek, soldier? Oh, I'm sorry — General, of course! "
"So, what'll it be? Spells, magic? Secrets? Old Ignash can do anything, knows "
"everything... I have wands and potions. I can tell you your fortune... It "
"won't cost you much...\" {n}You detect the sour stench of stale alcohol, as "
"the old man mumbles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}낡아빠진 옷을 입은 노인이 헝클어진 턱수염을 만지작 거리며 당신을 빤히 쳐다봅니다. {/n}\"뭘 찾고 있지, 병사? 앗, "
"죄송합니다. 장군님! 그러니까, 무엇을 드릴까요? 주문, 마법? 비밀? 이 늙은 이그내쉬한테는 없는 게 없고 모르는 게 없답니다... "
"완드도 있고 포션도 있고. 점을 봐드릴 수도 있고... 별로 안 비싸요...\"{n}웅얼대는 노인의 입에서 퀴퀴한 술 쉰내가 "
"났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "abe4dc01-c856-4f06-abf3-357d629cedb2"
msgid ""
"\"What does your spirit want? Potions? Wands? Perhaps a reading?\" {n}You "
"detect the sour stench of stale alcohol, as the old man mumbles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 영혼이 바라는 바가 무엇인지요? 완드? 읽을 거리?\" {n}웅얼대는 노인의 입에서 퀴퀴한 술 쉰내가 났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "61c5ca6d-0eb5-49ab-8ff6-1d51a79a1d17"
msgid ""
"\"Go, go, wherever you want. But you can't get away from your fate, no no..."
"\" {n}As you leave, the old man keeps mumbling something incoherent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"가세요, 마음대로 가세요. 하지만 운명에서 벗어날 수는 없지요. 없고 말고...\"{n}당신이 떠나자, 노인은 계속해서 알아 들을 수 "
"없는 말을 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "818c5c5d-46fd-4333-809b-797811db42da"
msgid ""
"{n}With a visible effort, the old man focuses his eyes on you.{/n} \"Me? "
"Ignash the sorcerer. I worked for years, in rain and snow, ne'er a beer, and "
"ne'er any dough! Then one sad day I got myself wasted, and suddenly the gift "
"of magic I tasted. Now I wander, with fortunes to tell and spells to sell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 당신과 시선을 맞추려고 무던히도 애를 썼습니다.{/n} \"저 말입니까? 소서러 이그내쉬입지요. 저는 몇 년 동안 비가 오나 "
"눈이 오나 일했지만, 맥주 한 잔, 빵 한 조각도 못 받았습죠! 어느 날 하도 슬퍼서 술을 잔뜩 마셨는데, 갑자기 마법을 쓸 수 있게 "
"됐지 뭡니까. 이젠 돌아다니면서 점을 봐주고 주문을 팔지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "0f768013-d28e-4591-b41c-1cd51d317be5"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man hides the money away, and takes out a handful of bizarre dice "
"with different numbers of sides, and squiggly marks instead of numbers. He "
"shakes the dice in his wrinkled, trembling hands, casts them, and studies "
"the results for a long time, moving his lips in silence and quietly counting "
"on his fingers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 돈을 재빨리 쑤셔넣고, 옆면에 숫자들이 적힌 이상한 주사위를 한 웅큼 꺼내더니, 숫자위에다 삐뚤빼뚤하게 표시를 남겼습니다. "
"그 주름 많고 덜덜 떠는 손으로 주사위를 굴리다 던지고는, 한참 동안 결과를 들여다보며 소리없이 중얼거리면서 손가락을 꼽았다 "
"폈습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4178cc29-faa1-48ec-b156-b8479621761e"
msgid ""
"\"You will have happiness, and health, and a long life! Now you are a "
"General, but someday you'll be a Marshal! But beware the number eleven, "
"carrot juice, and the song of the chaffinch.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나리는 행복하게 무병장수 하실 겁니다! 지금은 장군이지만, 언젠가는 보안관이 되시겠군요! 하지만 숫자 11, 당근 주스, 되새의 "
"노래를 조심해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "f8701927-6b47-4843-b941-d74f4b77514c"
msgid ""
"\"Empyrean love awaits you! Happiness is passing close by. – Be careful not "
"to miss it!\""
msgstr "\"지고의 사랑이 나리를 기다리고 있습니다! 등잔 밑이 어두운 법. 행복을 놓치지 마십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "58391a89-1819-4b55-81d6-b8be200ca743"
msgid ""
"\"Beware, General. Death walks close behind you. Be vigilant, and do not "
"turn your back upon the dead! If you hope to evade it, you must throw it off "
"your trail. Make yourself a charm of horse's mane and a lizard's tail, and "
"wear it about your neck at all times. But – if instead you wish to meet it "
"on the battlefield, and defeat in a fair fight, then wrap a dog's skin "
"around the handle of your sword!\""
msgstr ""
"\"장군님, 조심하십시오. 죽음이 나리의 뒤를 바짝 쫓고 있습니다. 방심하지 말고, 죽은 이에게 등을 보이지 마십시오! 죽음을 피하려면 "
"왔던 길에 시체를 남겨두지 말아야 합니다. 말의 갈기와 도마뱀 꼬리로 부적을 만들어서 항상 목에 걸고 다니십시오. 하지만 그러지 않고 "
"전장에서 정정당당하게 맞서서 적을 쓰러뜨리고 싶으면, 칼 손잡이를 개가죽으로 감아두십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "7818c700-6c68-40f3-a9b7-8ec8732d7fc4"
msgid ""
"\"Remember, victory belongs to those whose desire for success is stronger "
"than their fear of defeat! Drink at least four cups of water a day! Break "
"big tasks into smaller steps! And eat more vegetables!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기억하십시오, 승리는 패배에 대한 두려움보다도 성공에 대한 갈망이 큰 사람들의 것입니다! 하루에 적어도 네 잔의 물을 드십시오! 큰 "
"일은 작은 단계로 나누십시오! 그리고 야채를 더 많이 드십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "1cee7e74-bc37-4ce3-be82-99dd381cf210"
msgid ""
"\"You walk by secret paths, and will come to a crossing without roads. If "
"you step forward, you will lose your way, if you turn back, you will be "
"lost. But either way, the liar's voice will find you. If you listen, he will "
"deceive you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 비밀 통로를 걷고, 길 없는 건널목에 이르게 되실 겁니다. 앞으로 가도 길을 잃을 것이요, 뒤로 가도 길을 잃습니다. 어느 "
"쪽으로 가든 거짓말쟁이의 목소리가 들릴 것이니, 그 말을 들으면 속을 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "27f17155-130b-4d66-82b8-58aa6ded12cf"
msgid ""
"\"I saw her, yes I did... She picked my pockets clean... But it's all right. "
"A pocket is not a belly. If they cut it, you can stitch it up and fill it "
"again! But the things she stole won't be good for her. No, they won't. She's "
"invited trouble upon herself, silly girl...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러믄요, 봤습죠... 그 여자가 내 주머니를 탈탈 털어갔으니... 근데 괜찮아요. 주머니는 배가 아니니까, 칼로 째도 다시 꿰메서 "
"채울수 있지요! 하지만 그걸 훔쳐가다니, 위험을 자초한 겁니다. 그렇고 말고. 멍청하긴...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Sorcerer/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "637622d2-40b8-4c05-9fcf-c76ae7379f9a"
msgid "\"Here, look. Everything is real. Plenty of magic, but no tricks!\""
msgstr "\"여기, 보세요. 전부 진짭니다. 속임수 없는 진짜 마법이요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3e4bacec-3875-47d1-b5aa-3cd932bd85ba"
msgid "\"How did you end up in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"당신, 반홀드엔 어떻게 온 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e0c29c2e-0518-4af7-841e-9a267ac747b2"
msgid "\"What's on the menu?\""
msgstr "\"메뉴에 뭐가 있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6d69c60c-b7e4-4439-903a-da20ec63b617"
msgid "\"I've had a report that a troublemaker from Galt was seen here.\""
msgstr "\"갈트 출신의 한 선동꾼이 여기서 목격되었다는 보고를 받았어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "be40a9ce-cbea-4809-b239-06b947866e00"
msgid ""
"\"I looked around, but haven't found the troublemaker yet. Do you have any "
"news?\""
msgstr "\"주위를 둘러보았지만 아직 선동꾼은 못 찾았어요. 무슨 소식이라도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "8ad44960-fb28-4c29-8515-df4479d1c851"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가야겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "3675e7eb-f942-4b96-b2a4-152a2c512b50"
msgid ""
"{n}The tavern owner, Svelid, a freckled halfling, waves to you gladly.{/n} "
"\"Oh, I heard, you're the General now? Congratulations! This calls for a "
"celebration! Do you want a drink? Or just water while you're on duty?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주점 주인인 주근깨 난 하플링 스벨리드가 당신을 향해 반갑게 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아, 들었어요, 이제 장군이라고요? "
"축하해요! 이런 건 축하해야지! 한 잔 할래요? 근무 중이면 물만이라도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "f57063b1-8acb-4cec-ad6e-fa7a66729952"
msgid "\"We used to have a tavern in {g|Galt}Galt...{/g} Ha!\""
msgstr "\"우린 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 주점을 열었었지... 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "ae64dc09-4f34-43e5-9751-7a14d71494f7"
msgid "\"Here, take your pick!\""
msgstr "\"여기, 골라보세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "247720df-652a-4bd0-8225-ea04d40db6f9"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! That scumbag! We've seen a lot like her. She wandered in here, "
"talking about tyranny and justice, when really she was just looking for "
"something to steal! She came in with a small group. I think they were from a "
"farm that's near the town. They sat here for a long time, saying things that "
"made me sick to hear!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요! 그 쓰레기 같은 녀석! 우리는 그녀같은 사람을 제법 봐왔어요. 폭정과 정의에 대해 이야기하면서 이곳 저곳을 돌아다니던데, "
"그냥 무언가 훔칠 걸 찾고 있던 거였죠! 그녀는 작은 무리를 거느리고 들어왔어요. 마을 근처에 있는 농장에서 온 것 같아요. 그들은 "
"오랫동안 여기 앉아서 듣기 싫은 소리를 해댔어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "aad97b35-a5bb-4e8c-a0e4-c6a7a807d069"
msgid "\"She never appeared in the tavern again, but people are saying...\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 다시는 주점에 나타나지 않았지만, 사람들이 말하길...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "507f1f2f-8dfe-4ced-8552-a45e0adc6cb8"
msgid ""
"\"Come back any time! We'll save you a bottle of something worthy of a "
"General!\""
msgstr "\"언제든 오세요! 장군에게 걸맞는 걸로 한 병 챙겨놓을게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "abb8c2d3-bd1c-4801-b483-5e43059c634b"
msgid "\"General! Welcome! What will you have?\""
msgstr "\"장군! 어서오세요! 뭘로 드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "ae4bbff3-e824-4053-a28f-885d67060a7c"
msgid ""
"{n}Her wife Karida stops wiping the cups and gives you a wry look.{/n} \"If "
"I had to serve as the General of Varnhold, I'd have to start the day with a "
"glass of gin.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀의 아내 카리다는 컵 닦는 것을 멈추고 씁쓸한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"만약 내가 반홀드 장군으로 복무한다면 진 한 잔으로 "
"하루를 시작할텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "346c442b-bfd0-45ce-83f8-8f41207a6521"
msgid "\"But you do that anyway!\""
msgstr "\"그렇지만 당신은 언제든 그렇게 하잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "d1e106d4-7407-4902-a3cb-a9f82166dc63"
msgid "\"Who said a tavern owner's life is easier than a General's?\""
msgstr "\"선술집 주인의 삶이 장군보다 쉽다고 누가 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "2412b873-c1b9-4e3a-b3f3-d840b2196501"
msgid ""
"\"And then one day we didn't. They confiscated it for the needs of the "
"revolution! But I suppose we should be grateful they let us go alive. They "
"might have finished us off as oppressors and exploiters! Luckily they were "
"too busy enacting revolutionary justice in our wine cellar, and we managed "
"to sneak away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 어느 날 부터는 열지 못하게 되었죠. 그것들이 혁명에 필요하다며 주점을 몰수했어요! 하지만 그들이 우리를 살려준 것에 "
"감사해야겠죠. 그들이 우리를 억압자니 착취자니 몰아서 처형했을 수도 있었으니까요! 다행히 그들은 우리 포도주 저장고에서 혁명적 정의를 "
"법문화하느라 너무 바빴고, 우리는 겨우 도망쳐나올 수 있었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "cf0bc964-e8d0-454b-abda-f1edbbaa694b"
msgid ""
"\"The scumbags took everything we had, except our common sense. Well, we "
"broke our backs for a few years to scrounge up enough to open a new venue.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 쓰레기 같은 놈들은 정도를 넘어서 우리가 가진 모든 것을 가져갔어요. 음, 우리는 새로운 가게를 열 돈을 모으려고 몇 년 동안 "
"등골이 휘도록 일했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "13c5ae06-7bb3-4ac1-b101-25e005bb7b58"
msgid ""
"\"We heard about this new barony, the new town... So we came here! And it's "
"quite a gold mine. The town is growing. There are more and more people, and "
"all of them need to eat and drink! If {g|Desna}Desna{/g} wills it, we'll be "
"rich!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이 새로운 남작령, 새 도시에 대해 들었어요... 그래서 여기 온 거죠! 그리고 여기는 제법 좋은 자리예요. 마을은 성장하고 "
"있어요. 점점 더 많은 사람들이 오고 있고, 그들 모두는 먹고 마셔야 하죠! {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}께서 보살펴주신다면, 우리는 "
"부자가 될 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "6b8ef102-850d-41e1-947c-e03af84b18df"
msgid ""
"\"First they were talking about Ignash the sorcerer, saying he was a "
"bloodsucker, tricking the simple people. Then they talked about how to get "
"into the armory to get some weapons. They decided they couldn't manage it. – "
"Too many guards. But then they remembered there would be pitchforks and "
"scythes in the barn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음에 그들은 마법사 이그나쉬에 대해 말하면서 그가 사람들을 속이는 흡혈귀라고 했습니다. 그런 다음 그들은 무기를 얻기 위해 무기고에 "
"들어가는 방법에 대해 이야기했죠. 그들은 그것이 불가능하다고 결론지었습니다. – 경비대원이 너무 많았으니까요. 하지만 그 이후에 헛간에 "
"갈퀴와 낫이 있을지도 모른다는걸 떠올렸나 봅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "09934707-5e22-456b-b5a2-87f7455b92cd"
msgid ""
"\"In the end they started talking to people, trying to stir them up for a "
"riot. But nobody would listen. I showed them to the door, and sent word to "
"the Treasurer right away. I don't know where they went, I think they said "
"something about fishermen on the river!\""
msgstr ""
"\"결국 그들은 폭동을 일으킬 목적으로 사람들을 선동했죠. 하지만 아무도 귀기울이지 않았어요. 전 그들을 문 밖으로 안내하고, 즉시 "
"재무관에게 전갈을 보냈어요. 그들이 어디로 갔는지는 몰라요, 강 쪽의 어부들에 대해 뭐라고 말한 것 같아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "004d53ad-cd7b-419f-8595-5609255f1345"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear voices and the clanking of iron from outside. It looks like a "
"mob has gathered near the tavern. You hear the familiar voices of your "
"guards, and another voice ringing out, yelling sharp slogans about "
"tyranny.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 밖에서 사람들의 소리와 쇠붙이가 쨍그렁 거리는 소리를 듣습니다. 주점 근처에 군중이 모인 것 같습니다. 친숙한 경비원들의 "
"목소리가 들리고,폭정에 대한 날카로운 구호를 외치는 또 다른 목소리가 울려 퍼집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "49f32b2e-2203-439a-8342-85edfc06ee84"
msgid ""
"\"Do something with her, for Desna's sake! Kick her so hard she rolls back "
"to {g|Galt}Galt{/g}. Otherwise she'll wind up some fools, and they'll burn "
"down the whole town! We'll talk to the people, but you'd best go find out "
"where she is and what she's doing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 여자 좀 어떻게든 해주세요. 아아 데즈나시여! 그녀를 힘껏 걷어차서 다시 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}로 되돌려 버려요. 안 그러면 "
"그녀가 바보들 몇 명을 꼬드겨선, 온 마을을 태워버릴 거예요! 우리도 사람들에게 얘기는 하겠지만 그 여자가 어디 있는지, 뭘 하고 있는지 "
"직접 가서 확인해보시는 게 좋을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "21dd9556-2973-4d03-b4fe-1ebb5f85929f"
msgid ""
"{n}Svelid turns pale and reaches for the crossbow she keeps hidden under the "
"counter.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}스벨리드는 창백해져서 카운터 밑에 숨겨둔 석궁에 손을 뻗습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "ce0e9358-7d40-4407-85e5-1c43c8229e5d"
msgid ""
"\"It looks like you won't have to go looking for her after all. Come on, "
"General. Let's give it to these scoundrels!\""
msgstr "\"굳이 찾으러 갈 필요는 없겠군. 서두르죠, 장군님. 이 악당들을 혼내 주시죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "04391277-cd7a-4c7d-b134-e2dc3f175d71"
msgid "\"Thank you for dealing with that wretch!\""
msgstr "\"그놈을 처리해 주셔서 감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Svelyd
msgctxt "d7f7ca7d-2275-4545-90cb-1d19a1dcfeac"
msgid ""
"\"She's right! I was struck dumb with fear when I heard these screams "
"outside. It was just like when they trashed our tavern in {g|Galt}Galt...{/g}"
"\" {n}The halfling pours herself a shot of something strong and gulps it "
"down.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그녀 말이 맞아요! 밖에서 비명소리가 들리니까 두려워서 얼빠져 있었어요. 그건 {g|갈트}갈트에서 우리 주점을 엉망으로 만들었을 때랑 "
"똑같았어요.{/g}\" {n}하플링은 뭔가 센 술 한 잔을 입에 털어넣고는 그것을 꿀꺽 삼킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Tavern_owner/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Karida
msgctxt "b4f877b9-24f0-4b49-8406-706670a64e74"
msgid ""
"\"She'd better not stick her nose in here again. I won't warn her. – I'll "
"fire my crossbow while she's still at the door!\""
msgstr "\"그년이 여긴 얼쩡대지 않는 게 좋을거야. 난 경고 안할 거거든. – 문짝 앞에 서 있기만 해도 쏴버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Transitions/VarnholdDLC2_ToThroneRoom_String
msgctxt "af649f71-75d7-447c-b491-3c2e494d1485"
msgid "Into the stockade"
msgstr "방책 뒤로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d52d802c-ccd6-42be-ac08-243527f6b99b"
msgid ""
"\"How are you coping with everything crashing down on you, along with the "
"title?\""
msgstr "\"작위와 함께 당신에게 쏟아지는 이 모든 문제들에 어떻게 대처하고 있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "78eac3c8-6210-4ef2-94e9-456fb8342d3f"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't you expect us to follow the plan? We'd spent so much time working "
"on it, deciding exactly how to use the location – and the enemy's weaknesses."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 그 계획을 따르리라고는 예상하지 못했나요? 우린 그 장소와 적의 약점을 정확히 어떻게 써먹을지 결정하는데 많은 시간을 썼어요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "35429c52-9143-4d30-8824-57ae09dbf3df"
msgid ""
"\"Are you judging me? Yes, we slaughtered her people and approached with "
"their heads on spikes. But the best way to face an enemy is to use their own "
"weapon. – Which in her case was fear. We had to show the witch that she was "
"all alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저에 대한 평가인가요? 네, 우린 그녀의 부하들을 죽여서 그들의 머리를 꼬챙이에 꿰어 들고 다가갔죠. 하지만 적과 맞서는 가장 좋은 "
"방법은 그들 자신의 무기를 사용하는 거예요. - 그녀의 경우는 공포였죠. 우리는 그 마녀에게 그녀가 완전히 혼자라는 것을 보여줘야 했어요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "24945cb5-698f-4f52-a23a-2526998cc583"
msgid ""
"\"Are you talking about my idea to make our entire force look like a horde "
"of demons? Admit it, it was a brilliant!\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두를 악마들 무리처럼 보이게 하려던 제 생각을 말하는 건가요? 인정하시죠, 그건 기발한 생각이었다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e0733496-55b3-49fd-afaf-0b53f3387b5a"
msgid "\"What do I need to know about the incident in Dunsward?\""
msgstr "\"던스워드에서 일어난 사건에 대해 내가 알아야 할 게 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4f9c5b6f-e3c7-41c9-92db-daf49dda40d9"
msgid "\"I am ready to set off to Dunsward, and so are our people.\""
msgstr "\"저와 대원들은 던스워드로 출발할 준비가 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "313231d9-f0d1-4c60-85fa-e4592ba41789"
msgid "\"Let's go! Everyone's ready to get back on the road.\""
msgstr "\"가시죠! 모두가 여행 준비를 끝마쳤습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "d6001993-fe04-4888-98fc-17df0271ecf9"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, I'll heed your warning and take a little more time to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"좋아요. 당신이 주의한 대로 준비 시간을 조금 더 갖겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "dcc49727-ce96-47d3-8110-178a93361114"
msgid "\"I have to go. Things to do!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야해. 해야할 일이 있으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "20a13afe-0115-44fa-bd5c-f26ddf0e89a7"
msgid ""
"\"Let me ask you a question. How is it that you're not sick to death of "
"arguing with Cephal. You've done it every day for years!\""
msgstr "\"하나 묻죠. 어떻게 케팔과 그렇게 지치지도 않고 다투는 거죠? 몇 년 동안 그러고 있던데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "dfc0a7cc-cc0a-42c5-8007-f06e8b0f379d"
msgid ""
"\"So you see me as a mediator? I don't agree with Cephal on most things.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 저를 중재자로 보시는 건가요? 저는 대부분의 일에서 케팔과는 의견이 맞지 않는데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "c954d6cd-9331-4eee-bf46-99fb6fd680c1"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange to hear you say this. I often agree with Cephal, and you end "
"up backing off under our combined pressure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 이런 말을 하는 걸 들으니 이상하네요. 저는 종종 케팔의 편을 드는데, 결국 당신이 우리의 압박에 밀려서 물러나잖아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "3e7ec331-f8cf-4efc-9653-1092fee927e1"
msgid ""
"\"Is it all right that most of the time I want to give you both a good "
"beating?\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 대체로 둘 다 두들겨 패주고 싶은데 그래도 괜찮겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "a7b56603-e49b-4bf2-bd72-6ddd36ba7910"
msgid "\"Spare me this fuss. I don't want to take sides.\""
msgstr "\"난 빼줘요. 난 누구를 편들거나 하고 싶지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "5e7a23b1-594f-4491-a01f-4efd98994581"
msgid "\"Yes, I liked him. And?\""
msgstr "\"그래요, 난 그를 좋아했죠. 그런데요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "029810db-fbba-44d5-b234-b3a8c1715faf"
msgid "\"Have you thought about the future? Varnhold's and yours?\""
msgstr "\"미래에 대해 생각해 봤나요? 반홀드와 당신에 대해서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "37eb912b-9a9a-4a8d-a0cf-b158ace30f14"
msgid "\"I don't need to explain myself to you.\""
msgstr "\"당신에게 나 자신을 설명할 필요는 없죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "8166a7e2-a63a-4c45-8127-54f0127ef1b1"
msgid "[Report the results] \"I have handled the troublemakers.\""
msgstr "[결과를 보고한다] \"소란꾼들을 처리했어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "ec7f06aa-8727-49ef-a33c-33d6e63c6ae8"
msgid "\"I am ready to march. Let's go to Old Stump!\""
msgstr "\"행군 준비가 되었어요. 올드 스텀프로 갑시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "88ac9611-26ae-445d-abab-cae28f8e5575"
msgid ""
"\"I heard that the owners of a tavern at Blackstones Ford are murdering "
"their guests. Though the source of information was highly unreliable – a "
"passing bard who reeked of alcohol.\""
msgstr ""
"\"검은돌 여울의 선술집 주인들이 손님들을 살해하고 있다고 들었어요. 정보의 출처는 신뢰하기 매우 힘들지만요, 술 냄새 풍기는 바드였죠."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "3103a1fa-8fe1-42fb-aae5-24bd0dae0390"
msgid "\"Yes. I'm ready to set off at once.\""
msgstr "\"네. 당장 출발할 준비가 됐어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "48f24234-3585-41c1-bfcf-2f58b0734b97"
msgid "\"I suppose I could use a little more time to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"좀 더 시간을 들여서 준비하는 게 좋을 것 같네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "2550f0e7-a41a-4d97-baab-45c7cc6e0d6f"
msgid "\"Now is not the time to reminisce.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 추억에 잠길 때가 아니죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "3f1913e5-87dd-4cdd-954b-11fc15ae9711"
msgid "\"To be honest, Varnhold is not my ultimate dream.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말씀드리면 반홀드는 저의 궁극적인 꿈은 아니예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "d9ba0ef2-5613-4518-be33-6f375c8ac5b3"
msgid ""
"\"What can you say of Willas Gunderson? What does your 'mercenary gut' tell "
"you?\""
msgstr "\"윌라스 건더슨에 대해 어떻게 생각해요? 당신의 '용병으로서의 직감'은 뭐라고 하나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "4e18e2e4-e838-4947-b897-eff6bc6ce5b0"
msgid "\"I won't leave you. No matter what awaits us next.\""
msgstr "\"당신을 버려두지 않을 거예요. 다음에 우리에게 어떤 일이 기다리고 있더라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "b4045f57-c8de-4ac0-98b7-c517b0304944"
msgid "\"You never know. I don't want to make any promises.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 절대 모를걸요. 저는 어떤 약속도 할 수 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "4f3fca65-2e2f-4854-af00-505492322bef"
msgid ""
"\"After the quarrel with Cephal, you mentioned some letters that give you a "
"headache. You mind if I ask what that's about?\""
msgstr "\"케팔과 싸우고, 두통을 일으키는 편지 몇 통을 언급하셨죠. 괜찮으면 그게 무슨 내용인지 물어봐도 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "84139463-14f0-4f85-bb0b-a60e71bf6d1c"
msgid ""
"\"Your own, of course. Who else? Cephal wouldn't talk to you for a month "
"after that.\""
msgstr "\"물론, 당신 몫이죠. 누가 더 있겠어요? 케팔은 그 뒤로 한 달간 당신과는 말도 안 섞었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "d0f724c6-6c53-466d-8811-ae1a5ca072a9"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! It was mine. When would I ever get another chance to see my "
"commander bound and gagged, and packed in a big box of rotten apples?\""
msgstr "\"물론! 그건 제 몫이었죠. 지휘관이 재갈 물고 묶여서 썩은 사과상자 속에 포장되는 걸 언제 또 보겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "61a1a1ab-55c3-49d8-bc6b-75ad7798013c"
msgid "\"I need some more time to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"준비하려면 시간이 좀 더 필요해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "714c099a-357a-44bb-b8bd-5b9fa230efd5"
msgid "\"I would never let some witch hurt you.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 마녀든 당신을 해치게 두진 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "f06f21f1-96f6-469f-a4fb-34ed7e6bfb3a"
msgid "\"This is no more than a one-night stand.\""
msgstr "\"이건 그냥 하룻밤 여흥일 뿐이예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "0127852e-f39b-4a49-b719-974f86227b0e"
msgid "\"All is well that ends well.\""
msgstr "\"끝이 좋으면 다 좋은 거죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "e85dcdbb-fe2d-465b-bc80-4c4cdf580966"
msgid ""
"\"I can wear the horns and demoness costume again. But only on one condition:"
" you play the prisoner again!\""
msgstr "\"다시 뿔 달고 악마 의상을 입을 수야 있죠. 하지만 딱 하나 조건이 있어요. 당신은 다시 죄수 연기를 해야 돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Answer_0104_Text
msgctxt "e12459f4-e7a5-4c72-b7f3-b53d18f24eba"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what I had to go through. All that matters is – you're alive."
"\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일을 겪든 상관없어요. 중요한 건 - 당신이 살아있다는 거죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "05eeaa6b-942e-4360-8d38-c4e130ea8dab"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar stands half-turned to you. There is tension in his pose, though he "
"only stares into the distance. Without turning, he begins to speak.{/n} \""
"{name}, you're right on time. We need to discuss the incident in Dunsward. "
"And about a thousand other things that have come crashing down on us, along "
"with the baronhood.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 당신을 향해 몸을 반쯤 돌려 서 있습니다. 먼 곳을 응시할 뿐이지만 그의 자세에는 긴장감이 감돕니다. 몸을 더 돌리지 "
"않은 채로 그는 말하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"{name}, 제시간에 왔군. 던스워드에서의 그 사건에 대해 의논할 필요가 있어. 그리고 "
"남작의 본분에 따라 우리에게 쏟아지는 천여 가지 다른 문제들도 의논해야겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "2308d303-1747-4eba-a040-c8da731a3972"
msgid ""
"{n}Varn gives you a friendly nod.{/n} \"News? Or are you just here for a "
"chat?\""
msgstr "{n}반은 당신에게 다정하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"무슨 소식이라도? 아니면 그냥 이야기 하러 온 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "5b669f49-6614-43d9-9b37-23d4d8951e36"
msgid ""
"\"Just think of it. I am now – a baron. That's right – 'Your Grace'.\" {n}"
"Maegar smiles through his gloom.{/n} \"I thought, after so many years of "
"leading the party, more responsibility wouldn't be a problem. And I was "
"right. I'm not afraid of responsibility. But I'm afraid how little freedom I "
"have left. Our wild exploits are over, {name}. Of course, I can still steal "
"some time to swing my sword around, but we'll never get back to how it was "
"before…\""
msgstr ""
"\"그냥 생각해 봐. 나는 이제 남작이야. 그래, '영주님'이지.\" {n} 메이가르는 침울함을 뚫고 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그 "
"여러 해 동안 무리를 이끌어 왔으니 더 많은 책임은 문제될 것이 없다고 생각했어. 내가 옳았지. 나는 책임이 두렵지 않아. 하지만 "
"얼마만큼의 자유가 남았을지는 걱정되는군. {name}, 우리의 무모한 위업은 다 끝났어. 물론, 난 아직 칼을 휘둘러 볼 시간을 뺄 수 "
"있지만, 우리는 예전으로 되돌아가진 못하겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "21ec3d3c-5821-4c65-8b5d-7f1467d60a5a"
msgid ""
"\"But we were right about the plan. To make her drop her guard, we'd have to "
"make her feel like the hunter, not the prey. I was the prey. We figured "
"she'll be well distracted by the commander 'betrayed by his own people'. And "
"sure enough, you were able to seize the wretch. You know, I never told you, "
"but for a moment there I wasn't sure I was going to make it. I was all tied "
"up, laying in that stupid box – and then on the altar... All the while "
"wondering whether you'd ever show up. Would you have enough time? But of "
"course I never expected what happened after that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 계획에 대해서는 우리가 옳았어. 그녀에게서 경비원을 떼어놓으려면 그녀 자신이 사냥감이 아니라 사냥꾼처럼 느껴지게 해야 했어. "
"먹잇감은 나였지. 우리는 그녀가 '부하들에게 배신당한' 지휘관에게는 주의가 더 잘 쏠릴 것이라고 생각했어. 그리고 분명히, 넌 그 마녀를 "
"충분히 잡을 수 있었어. 그게, 지금이니까 말하는 건데, 잠깐 동안 내가 해낼 수 있을 지 확신이 안 되더군. 난 그 바보 같은 상자 "
"안에 누워있다가 제단 위로... 그 안에 네가 나타날지 궁금했어. 시간이 충분했을까? 물론 그 뒤에 무슨 일이 일어날지는 전혀 예상도 "
"못했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a80696d3-e896-424a-81d5-953f73d2e7ab"
msgid ""
"\"The fact you followed the plan didn't surprise me. What surprised me is "
"that it worked! Something always has to go wrong, you know. All right, "
"what's wrong with me? It was one of the best pages in the history of the "
"party! – A daring plan, a bold victory!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 그 계획을 따랐다는 사실은 별로 놀랍지 않았어. 나를 놀라게 한 건 그게 먹혔다는 거지! 항상 뭔가 잘못되는 법이거든. 좋아, "
"내가 왜 이러지? 그건 우리 파티 역사상 최고의 페이지 중 하나였지! – 대담한 계획, 대담한 승리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "2f09bc4f-ffb1-4245-8e47-8fa2c8380960"
msgid ""
"\"There were a lot of villagers among the ones you killed – people who were "
"helping the Noose because they feared for their lives and their families. Of "
"course, I'm no righteous priest of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, but I've always "
"thought that people deserve a second chance, especially when they do what "
"they do under threat. And besides, we were there to protect them, {name}. "
"All of them, the brave and the cowardly. The ones who succumbed to the witch "
"and the ones who resisted. Ha, but what's there to talk about now? What's "
"done cannot be undone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 죽인 사람들 중에는 마을 사람들도 많았는데, 그들은 자신과 가족의 목숨이 인질로 잡혀서 그 마녀 누스를 돕고 있었지. 물론 내가 "
"무슨 {g|서렌레이}서렌레이{/g}의 정의로운 사제는 아니지만, 나는 항상 사람들이 유난히 위험한 상황에서 일을 할 때는, 두 번째 "
"기회를 얻을 자격이 있다고 생각했어. 게다가 우리는 그들을 지키려고 그곳에 있는 거였지, {name}. 그들 모두, 용감한 자와 비겁한 "
"자들 모두 말이야. 마녀에게 굴복한 자와 저항한 자. 하, 그런데 지금 무슨 얘기 중이었지? 한 번 한 일은 돌이킬 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "7c930782-e790-4a11-827c-96747c415940"
msgid ""
"\"Of course it was brilliant, but it's on account of that plan – and your "
"ideas in particular, General – that I've got these gray hairs on my head!\" "
"{n}Maegar laughs.{/n} \"I was preparing to meet my fate, when these horned "
"monsters appeared from all around, howling like terror. It's a good thing "
"the witch was as baffled as I was, and you managed to grab her quickly. "
"You'll have to tell me how you got all those goat horns and glowing makeup "
"out in the middle of the forest. By the way, it looked better on you than "
"anyone else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그건 기가 막히게 훌륭하긴 했지만, 건 그 계획- 특히 장군, 자네 아이디어 때문-이었지, 덕분에 아직도 내 머리에 이 회색 "
"털이 남아있군!\" {n}메이가르가 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 운명을 맞을 준비를 하고 있었는데, 이 뿔 달린 괴물들이 곳곳에서 나타나서 "
"공포스럽게 울부짖더군. 마녀가 나처럼 당황해서 다행인데, 네가 그녀를 재빨리 붙잡았지. 숲 한가운데서 어떻게 염소 뿔이 나고 이글거리는 "
"분장을 했는지 말해줘야 할 거야. 그건 그렇고, 누구보다도 너한테 잘 어울리더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "0e82ca2d-e5ad-4996-a881-6bfbba6c16c4"
msgid ""
"\"There is a place in my dominions called the City of Hollow Eyes. Until "
"recently, it was considered quite a peaceful and harmless place, despite its "
"name. But something strange is going on there. Our scouts report that "
"centaurs have attacked the locals, and a gang of cutthroats is wandering in "
"the area. It's a good bet that the centaurs and the bandits were uprooted by "
"something else. Something dangerous. Or perhaps they're drawn to the place "
"by something precious...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 영지에는 텅 빈 눈의 도시라는 장소가 있지. 이전까지, 그 이름치곤 꽤나 평화롭고 안전한 곳이었어. 그러나 괴이한 일이 일어나고 "
"있어. 정찰대가 보고하길, 켄타우로스들이 주민들을 습격하고, 도적 떼가 주변에 나돌고 있다더군. 그 둘이 어느 무언가에 의해 쫓겨났을 "
"가능성이 크지. 어떤 무시무시한 것에 말이야. 아니라면 뭔가 비보에 이끌린 것일지도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "f64ec90e-4686-47a5-afe1-4436c1a38f9e"
msgid "\"All right, General. We're leaving!\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 장군. 이제 가지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "9f76c726-436a-4087-bc25-0513d10fc706"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure? It's your call, but I'm going to ride you hard, just like in "
"the good old days. There won't be time for daydreaming, or replenishing "
"supplies.\""
msgstr "\"확실해? 네 선택이지만, 난 너를 한창 때처럼 굴릴 거야. 넋 놓고 있을 시간도, 물자를 보충할 시간도 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "f27af655-c51d-47ec-9b35-67fbff2acbc4"
msgid "\"I like that attitude. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"그 자세가 마음에 드는군. 출발하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "b6e253cf-2ff3-427b-9ee8-9c83057e2cad"
msgid "\"If you say so. Report back when you're ready.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇다면야. 준비가 되면 말해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "5eca2def-ca4a-4db5-8f33-6d2ae64b053a"
msgid ""
"\"So long, my friend. Come back soon, either on business, or just to chat "
"over a cup of wine!\""
msgstr "\"잘 가라고, 내 친구여. 일이든, 술 한잔 하면서 나누는 이야기든, 조만간 다시 오라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "8f10f809-c7f7-4586-bf25-9d29b9ce6f8c"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar smiles coyly.{/n} \"It's a well-thought-out strategy. No, I mean "
"it seriously. I've seen first hand that the best way to rule is when one "
"person makes the decisions and has the responsibility, but lets everyone "
"else speak and tries to hear them all. No one is perfect, {name}. Especially "
"mercenary captain Maegar Varn, who somehow became a ruler for no good "
"reason. As long as Cephal is with me, as long as I hear him contradicting me "
"at every tiny step – well, I won't risk convincing myself of my own "
"infallibility.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 멋쩍게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"그건 잘 생각해 낸 전략이야. 아니, 진심으로. 나는, 결정은 한 명이 내린다고 해도 "
"다른 사람들에게 발언권을 주고 이야기를 듣는 게 최선의 통치라는 걸 직접 봤지. 완벽한 사람은 없어, {name}. 특히 용병 단장 "
"메이가르 반은, 조금은 부당하게 통치자가 된 사람이지. 케팔이 나와 함께 있는 한, 그가 사소한 것마다 내게 반대하는 걸 듣고 있는 이상 "
"– 글쎄, 내가 틀리지 않았냐고 자문자답하고 싶진 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "5f562e10-5a43-47ba-88d6-51b8aa7915d3"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, there's another side to this. Making decisions nowadays means "
"drowning in endless arguments, and governing is a competition in finding out "
"who's the biggest idiot. That's why you're so important to me,\"{n} Maegar "
"adds much more seriously.{/n} \"Without you, Cephal and I would end up "
"acting like fools because we wouldn't be able to stop arguing at the right "
"time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 이 일에는 또 다른 면도 있지. 요즘에 결정을 내린다는 건 끝없는 논쟁에 빠져든다는 거고, 통치는 누가 가장 바보인가를 "
"알아보는 경쟁이지. 그러니까 네가 나한테 그만큼 중요한 거야.\"{n} 메이가르는 훨씬 더 진지하게 덧붙입니다.{/n} \"네가 없으면 "
"케팔과 나는 결국 바보같은 짓을 하겠지. 우리는 적절한 시기에 논쟁을 멈추질 못하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "a8ebf481-72b2-475b-a6ae-2c47f219c539"
msgid ""
"\"You don't know what a great consolation that is! My hair would already be "
"as white as snow if I had to convince him by myself every time. And most "
"importantly, when even you agree with Cephal, then I'd better think "
"seriously about conceding.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 그게 얼마나 큰 위안이 되는지 모를거야! 만약 매번 케팔을 내가 직접 설득해야 했다면 내 머리는 지금쯤 눈처럼 하얗게 세어버렸을 "
"거야. 그리고 가장 중요한 건, 너마저 케팔에게 동의할 때라면, 나도 진지하게 한 발 물러서는 걸 고려하는 게 낫다는 뜻이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "c9316c5e-c288-4f81-9637-7534108b9c46"
msgid ""
"\"You're right, General. It can be difficult to withstand attacks from two "
"fronts! But it's thanks to our trust that we end up making the right "
"decisions. At least some of the time! Without you, Cephal and I would just "
"stand there arguing 'til death did us part. Besides, like I've told you "
"before – I trust you, and I trust him. The three of us have brought the "
"Varnling Host through all the trouble Golarion can throw at us, and we ended "
"up founding our own Varnhold. If you ask me, that means something!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 말대로야, 장군. 둘 사이에 끼어서 휘말리는 게 난감할 수 있어! 하지만 우리가 올바른 결정을 할 수 있는 건 우리의 신뢰 "
"덕분이지. 적어도 어느 정도는! 네가 없다면, 케팔과 나는 죽음이 우리를 갈라놓을 때까지 거기 서서 논쟁하고 있었을 거야. 게다가, 내가 "
"전에 말했듯이 - 나는 너를 믿고, 그를 믿어. 우리 셋은 골라리온이 우리에게 던져줄 수 있는 온갖 곤란을 뚫고 반링 호스트를 끌고 "
"왔고, 결국 우리만의 반홀드를 설립했지. 말하자면, 그건 특별한 의미가 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "76ab0e65-7656-4d5e-b576-ec329c5d4184"
msgid ""
"\"Someone to talk to doesn't hurt either! Without that, I'd go mad, and "
"Cephal would end up so exhausted he'd have to retreat to some hermitage to "
"honor Asmodeus in the silence of the oak groves. Oh, I'm joking. But still, "
"you do bring harmony to our trio. At least a bit. Though our troupe is never "
"the most harmonious.\""
msgstr ""
"\"둘 다 상처받지 않게 말해줄 사람이지! 그게 없으면 난 미쳐버릴 거고, 케팔은 지쳐서 아스모데우스에게 기도하러 적막한 참나무 숲으로 "
"은둔해버렸을 거야. 아, 그냥 농담이야. 그래도 넌 우리 셋 사이에 화합을 가져다주지. 적어도 조금은. 우리 조합이 최적은 아니지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "789f079c-f179-430c-9c83-95c9881c1777"
msgid ""
"\"Oh well – that's your decision, General. All right, I see I've worn you "
"out. Let's discuss our woes some other time.\""
msgstr "\"오 그래, 그게 너의 결정이군, 장군. 좋아, 내가 지치게 만들었구만. 우리의 고민거리는 다음에 의논하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "213e283b-e202-43a3-829e-f911ab789b5a"
msgid ""
"\"And I know about a dozen unhappy stories that began with 'an unknown "
"ancient relic suddenly appeared'. That's why I'm writing our western "
"neighbor in the Shrike Hills. Maybe they have a good sorcerer or a historian "
"who can help us puzzle out what this bracelet is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 난 '알 수 없는 고대 유물이 갑자기 나타났다'로 시작되는 불행한 이야기를 십여 편이나 알고 있다고. 그게 슈라이크 구릉지에 "
"있는 우리 서쪽 이웃에게 편지를 쓴 이유지. 어쩌면 그들에게는 이 팔찌가 무엇인지 수수께끼를 푸는 데 도움을 줄 수 있는 훌륭한 마법사나 "
"역사학자가 있을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "c1b39d51-36d0-4529-b685-d1c5003aa003"
msgid "\"Or something we draw a moral from.\""
msgstr "\"아니면 뭔가 얻을만한 교훈이라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "63e8777b-6b7d-4167-8133-3720a0278eb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Without waiting for a reaction to his joke, Maegar suddenly looks away, "
"as if studying the play of light and shadow on the floor.{/n} \"Truth be "
"told, I haven't made any real plans for the future. I've barely gotten used "
"to the idea that I'm not a vagrant with a sword, but a baron with my own "
"lands, my own town, and my own home. But what does it mean?\" {n}He stops "
"for a while, and then asks in a calm voice,{/n} \"What about you, {name}? "
"What life do you see for yourself? Do you see yourself settling here, in "
"Varnhold? Or maybe you don't like the town and you're sick of me, and just "
"waiting for a chance to find greater fortunes elsewhere?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 자신의 농담에 대한 반응을 기다리지 않고 눈길을 돌립니다. 마치 바닥의 빛과 그림자의 모습을 살피는 듯합니다.{/n} "
"\"사실, 나는 미래에 대한 어떤 실질적인 계획도 세워두지 않았어. 칼 든 부랑자가 아니라 내 땅, 내 마을, 내 집을 가진 남작이라는 "
"생각에 겨우 익숙해졌지. 그런데 그게 무슨 의미일까?\" {n}그는 잠시 멈추더니 차분한 목소리로 묻습니다.{/n} \" {name}, "
"너는 어때? 어떤 삶을 그리고 있지? 여기에 정착한 모습인가? 아니면 이 동네가 싫고 나도 지긋지긋해서, 다른 데서 더 큰 행운을 찾으려 "
"한다거나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "e59096cd-123e-4fca-bf2b-73e32cd5a1fa"
msgid ""
"\"Hm.\" {n}Maegar seems surprised.{/n} \"So all these lives are the price of "
"my salvation? You've... surprised me. I guess I shouldn't risk my head so "
"much, if it pushes my General to such extreme measures!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흐음.\" {n}메이가르는 놀란 모양입니다.{/n} \"그럼 이 희생이 내 구원의 대가란 말인가? 너는... 날 깜짝 놀라게 만드는 "
"군. 내가 내 장군에게 그런 극단적인 조치를 하게 몰아붙였다면, 그런 위험을 감수하는 건 자제해야겠군 !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "b9ec4d9b-4812-4950-97e6-6ebf3edb3d91"
msgid ""
"\"How do you mean? Tie up my hands and lie graciously on an altar?\" {n}"
"Maegar laughs heartily.{/n} \"Then again, for those little horns…\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 말이야? 좀더 말해봐. 내 손을 묶고 우아하게 제단 위에 눕혀?\" {n}메이가르는 진심으로 웃습니다.{/n} \"그럼 다시, "
"저 작은 뿔들을 위해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "a14a3823-b0cd-4369-af38-06e8b946b50c"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks at you and smiles softly.{/n} \"Poor Noose and lucky me. If "
"the witch really knew who was protecting me, she would probably have "
"surrendered without a fight!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신을 바라보며 부드럽게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"가엾은 누스와 운 좋은 나. 만약 마녀가 정말로 나를 보호하는 게 "
"누구인지 알았다면 아마 싸우지 않고 항복했을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "533f6f50-45e0-4559-b9ae-19fe2f7ced99"
msgid ""
"\"So, did you handle those troublemakers? On top of everything else, an "
"uprising is just what we need!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 그 소란꾼들을 처리했나? 설상가상이라 칭하려면, 폭동 한 번쯤은 필요하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "cfa0a87b-2729-4370-a6ca-eacb01aa62da"
msgid ""
"\"The people have calmed down, and the rabble-rouser is in fetters. "
"Brilliant! – I expected nothing less! I'll draw up an order right away, to "
"help them with the cows.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 진정됐고, 선동꾼에게는 족쇄가 채워졌어. 훌륭해! – 난 바로 그걸 기대했지! 난 그 사람들의 소 문제를 도와주도록 당장 "
"명령서를 작성하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "5fbc7ded-2d83-456b-b294-8847614d9ac9"
msgid ""
"\"Something else has come up. We need to discuss the new trainees. "
"Recruitment needs to be... What's that noise? Who's making trouble?\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 다른 일이 생겼다. 새 훈련병들에 대해 의논할 필요가 있어. 신병 모집이 필요해... 저게 무슨 소리지? 누가 말썽을 부리는 건가?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "560978c2-85dc-4a37-8555-b6f4b332f25f"
msgid ""
"\"Sad to hear that.\" {n}Maegar's tone remains neutral and polite, but the "
"nervous turn of his head gives away his disappointment.{/n} \"Well, I hope "
"my General has no intention of running away from me today. We still have "
"things to do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 말을 들으니 슬프군.\" {n}메이가르의 어조는 중립적이고 공손한 태도를 유지하고 있지만, 신경질적으로 고개를 돌리면서 실망감을 "
"내비칩니다.{/n} \"음, 나의 장군이 오늘은 내게서 떠날 생각이 없으면 좋겠어. 우린 아직 할 일이 많지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "fdbbf119-b905-4d0d-884a-a9c1c0374bbf"
msgid ""
"\"You mean what will happen when all the dust settles, and we straighten "
"things out here?\" {n}Maegar half smiles.{/n} \"That's simple. I'll get old "
"really fast, become a terribly grumpy old man, and spend the rest of my days "
"regaling chance guests of the barony with incredible stories about the feats "
"of my past!\""
msgstr ""
"\"먼지를 다 걷어내고 이곳의 일들을 전부 바로잡고 나면 어떻게 되냐고?\" {n}메이가르는 반쯤 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"간단하지. "
"매우 빠르게 늙어서, 지독하게 투덜대는 노인이 되어 내 과거의 위업에 대한 믿을 수 없는 이야기로 손님들을 대접하면서 여생을 보낼 거야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "6d856fb7-d462-4ced-8bac-b5f060798ede"
msgid ""
"\"Hm.. Not the most suitable name to add to the chronicles. 'The Battle at "
"Old Stump' doesn't sound terribly heroic. Are you quite sure?\""
msgstr ""
"\"흐음.. 연대기에 덧붙일 가장 적당한 이름은 아니군. '오래된 그루터기에서의 전투'는 그다지 영웅적으로 들리지 않아. 안 그런가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "8ce2cfec-229e-4607-9f5f-a1dde9251772"
msgid ""
"\"We didn't clear the monsters out of these lands just so scoundrels could "
"settle here. Let's check this bard's story the next time we pass this place."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이 땅에서 괴물을 몰아내지 않았고, 바로 그래서 악당들이 이곳에 정착할 수 있었지. 다음에 이곳을 지날 때 이 바드의 이야기를 "
"확인해 보자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "b44724a5-5a31-4c92-a493-021fc0e95267"
msgid "\"Fine. Let me know when it's time to march.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 행군할 때가 되면 알려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "d2175147-744a-417b-9324-26beffed9efd"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I suppose your right. I must be getting old, if I all I want to do is "
"talk about the glory days of the past. Fine, let's get down to business "
"then, shall we General?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 네가 맞는 것 같다. 내가 하고 싶은 일이 과거의 영광스러운 날들에 대한 이야기뿐이라면, 나는 분명 늙어가는 거겠지. 좋아, "
"그럼 본론으로 들어가갈까, 장군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "a47c9139-10ca-4f98-abfa-18b58899e755"
msgid ""
"\"Hm.\" {n}Maegar casts an attentive look at you.{/n} \"I would also like to "
"know what you think of him. How much you are... interested.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흐음.\" {n}메이가르가 당신에게 주의깊은 눈빛을 던집니다.{/n} \"그 사람에 대한 네의 생각도 알고 싶군. 얼마나... "
"관심있는지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "6d758fae-148d-4238-beec-e5823aaa5fb5"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you start that again! Those apples were quite fresh. After several "
"hours in that box, I knew the smell quite well! I still can't stomach apples "
"– or even drink cider!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 할 생각은 말아! 그 사과들은 꽤 신선했지. 그 상자 안에 들어가서 몇 시간을 보냈더니, 그 냄새를 꽤 잘 알겠더군! 난 아직도 "
"사과도 못 먹고 사과쥬스도 못 마시겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "df902c30-edea-4864-a32e-3adbc4f7fb7f"
msgid ""
"\"To have him tell it, I'm a reckless boy who puts his heart and his "
"appetite for risk above safety and profit. And I must say, Cephal can be "
"right at times!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 말하기를, 나는 안전과 이익보다 위험에 마음과 욕구가 더 이끌리는 무모한 소년이라 하더군. 그리고 나는 꼭 이렇게 말해야 했어, "
"때로는 케팔의 말이 옳을 수도 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "f4773a8d-cd10-4434-bdeb-eb505e2416ef"
msgid ""
"\"I was lying there wondering what detail of the plan might fall through, "
"and rapidly lead to my tragic death. Maybe our information was wrong? Had we "
"made a mistake in calculating the Noose's favorite spells? Were our "
"protections inadequate, and was the place of the attack correct? But then, "
"suddenly everything went just according to the plan! My dear Varnling Host "
"dashed onto the scene right on time, seized the witch, sliced her henchmen "
"to pieces, and freed their leader! That – is how it's done!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기에 누워 있으면서, 그 계획에 뭔가 세부적인 내용이 빠져서 내 비극적인 죽음으로 빠르게 이어질까 걱정되더군. 혹시 우리 정보가 "
"틀렸을까? 누스가 좋아하는 주문을 계산하는 데 실수가 있었나? 우리의 보호가 불충분했는가, 공격 장소는 정확했는가? 하지만 그때, 갑자기 "
"모든 것이 계획대로 진행된 거야! 나의 사랑하는 반링 호스트는 제시간에 현장으로 달려와서 마녀를 붙잡고, 심복들은 조각조각 썰어주고, "
"그들의 대장을 풀어줬지! 그게 그렇게 된 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "5e662660-295d-4693-9c24-14e2e5752926"
msgid ""
"\"It wasn't the most pleasant sight – those heads you'd sliced off. Of "
"course, I can't judge you harshly for your decision, but still... Half of "
"the people you killed were simple villagers, who only worked for the witch "
"out of fear for their lives and their families. We should have protected "
"them, not slaughtered them. I know the sort of threat we faced, and I "
"understand why you did what you did. But I'll be honest, I still have "
"nightmares about it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 가장 즐거운 모습은 아니었지. 네가 벤 머리들 말이야. 물론 너의 결정에 대해 가혹하게 판단할 수는 없다. 그래도... 네가 "
"죽인 사람들의 절반은 그냥 마을 사람들이었는데, 그들은 그들 자신과 가족들의 안위를 지키려고 마녀를 도왔을 뿐이야. 우리는 그들을 "
"보호했어야지, 도살하진 말아야 했어. 난 우리가 어떤 위협에 처했었는지 알고, 네가 왜 그런 짓을 했는지도 이해해. 하지만 솔직히 "
"말해서, 난 아직도 악몽을 꾸고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "cd8c24ec-f081-44c9-9734-198e7ca38553"
msgid ""
"\"I could just assume you'd jump out of the ambush and capture the witch "
"before she had a chance to kill me. I could just as well imagine that you'd "
"make a mistake, arrive a moment late, and my life would be forfeit. But in "
"the name of {g|Cayden Cailean}Cayden Cailean{/g}, the one thing I could "
"never have imagined was a horde of horned monsters, howling in a hundred "
"voices, pouring down from all directions! But then I looked more closely at "
"their leader and recognized my loyal assistant – and indeed my future "
"General! I couldn't have been happier if you were an angel come down from "
"the skies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 짐작할 수 있던 건 네가 매복에서 뛰쳐나와 그녀가 나를 죽이기도 전에 마녀를 사로잡을 거라고 생각한 정도였어. 난 그냥 네가 "
"실수를 하고, 잠시 늦게 도착해서, 내 목숨이 수확당할 수도 있겠다고 상상했지. 그러나 {g|Cayden Cailean}케이든 "
"케일리엔{/g}의 이름으로, 뿔 달린 괴물 무리들이 사방에서 쏟아질 줄은 상상도 못했어! 하지만 그 때 그들의 우두머리를 더 자세히 "
"살펴보고는 나의 충성스런 조력자 – 그리고 미래의 내 장군임을 깨달았지! 네가 하늘에서 내려온 천사였다면 이보다 더 행복할 수 없었을 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "40865207-c260-415e-886f-9f49022ac7e2"
msgid ""
"\"Gunderson himself doesn't bother me. It can't hurt to have him in the "
"barony. We still don't have much entertainment here, and that lad is a free "
"circus show for anyone who cares to watch. But that bracelet... you know I "
"sent scouts to retrace Gunderson's steps, and they couldn't find any sign of "
"him. That's one hell of a location – hills, mountains, gorges, and a "
"thousand caves. If he lied about where he found it, we'll be looking for its "
"true origin for years. And I don't like it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"건더슨 자체는 나를 괴롭히지 않아. 그가 남작령에 있다는 것이 해가 될 수는 없지. 우린 아직 여흥거리가 별로 없어. 그리고 저 "
"친구는 보고 싶은 사람이라면 누구나 볼 수 있는 무료 서커스 쇼야. 하지만 그 팔찌는... 건더슨의 행적을 되짚어보려고 정찰병을 "
"보냈는데, 건더슨의 흔적을 찾을 수가 없었어. 그곳은 언덕, 산, 협곡, 그리고 천 개의 동굴 등 일종의 지옥 같은 곳이야. 그가 어디서 "
"발견했는지 거짓말을 했다면, 우리는 몇 년 동안은 그것의 진짜 근원을 찾아다녀야겠지. 그리고 난 그게 마음에 안 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "81b3369d-9643-4449-be73-51de5dc3aff0"
msgid ""
"\"It's too bad the settlers decided to leave our lands. Well, at least that "
"troublemaker won't be starting any more riots!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정착민들이 우리 땅을 떠나기로 결정한 것은 유감스러운 일이다. 뭐, 적어도 저 소동꾼들이 더 이상 폭동을 일으키지는 않겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "a20089ae-d862-4d4d-9a4a-2d729795d2c4"
msgid ""
"\"So the troublemaker walks free, and people who suffered her tricks have "
"left Varnhold, so they won't be warning their fellows. This is bad! It means "
"another riot. It's just a matter of time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 소동꾼은 자유롭게 돌아다니고, 그녀의 속임수에 시달린 사람들은 반홀드를 떠났고, 그래서 떠난 자들은 자신의 지인들에게 경고도 "
"못 하게 되겠군. 이건 안 좋아! 그건 또다른 폭동이 일어날 거라는 의미니까. 시간 문제일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "362feea8-f504-4f6e-af67-b64631c05c80"
msgid ""
"\"So our people died at the hands of our soldiers, and the troublemaker who "
"led them to their deaths walks free? What's to stop her from leading another "
"lot of gullible settlers to the slaughter? I never expected such a failure "
"from you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 우리 백성들은 우리 군인들의 손에 죽었고, 그들을 죽음으로 이끈 소동꾼은 자유롭게 돌아다니고 있다? 속기 쉬운 다른 정착민들을 "
"그녀가 학살로 이끌 방법은 그럼 뭐지? 네가 그런 실패를 할 줄은 몰랐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "bd766bae-8b70-4d04-8a2a-8af4a1d1690b"
msgid ""
"\"But yes, it was an insane plan. Of course, we could have listened to "
"Cephal, waited for the scouts from {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, and watched while more "
"and more people went missing... But time was running out, and the Noose was "
"building shrines to demon lords practically out in the open, and doing "
"whatever she pleased. She must have been the most elusive enemy we've ever "
"met. A witch with an incredible talent for conjurations and illusion, and "
"with almost animal cunning. We tracked for over a year, and never caught up "
"to her once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그래, 그건 미친 계획이었어. 물론 케팔의 말을 듣고, {g|Galt}갈트{/g}로부터 정찰병을 기다리고, 점점 더 많은 "
"사람들이 실종되는 걸 지켜 볼 수도 있었겠지... 하지만 시간이 촉박했고, 누스는 사실상 공개적으로 데몬 로드들을 위한 사당을 짓고 "
"있었고, 그녀가 원하는 짓거리는 무엇이든 하고 있었지. 그녀는 우리가 만난 적 중에 가장 파악하기 힘든 적이었어. 소환술과 환영 마법에 "
"놀라운 재능을 가졌고, 거의 동물적인 교활함을 겸비한 마녀였지. 1년 넘게 추적했는데 한 번도 따라잡질 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "ffe74765-6b30-4037-abfd-3bdae75e09f8"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, we won't go so far as to execute her. But keeping her in prison "
"doesn't make any sense either. Let's take her to the border and give her the "
"boot. Let her slink back to {g|Galt}Galt{/g} or wherever else she wants. But "
"if she sets foot in our lands again, she'll have only herself to blame! "
"Although after learning about her tricks, no one else will trust her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 그녀를 처형까지 하진 않을 거야. 하지만 그녀를 감옥에 가두는 것도 말이 안 돼. 국경으로 데리고 가서 쫓아버리자고. 그녀가 "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g} 또는 그녀가 원하는 다른 곳으로 돌아가게 해. 하지만 그녀가 다시 우리 땅에 발을 들여놓으면, 그땐 누구 탓도 "
"할 수 없겠지! 하지만 그녀의 속임수를 알고 나면 아무도 그녀를 믿어주지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "87008c10-7a7a-4c40-959c-35d9c9f9e7e5"
msgid ""
"\"Well, we all make mistakes. The next time she shows up, try not to let her "
"escape!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄, 우리 모두는 실수를 하지. 다음에 그녀가 나타날 때는 놓치지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "d7ddf8b6-5b02-4ee8-8187-6fd8c5615e53"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you all about it, but first pick your people. Three of our most "
"reliable. There's a difficult task ahead of us.\""
msgstr "\"다 말해 주겠지만 우선 네 사람들을 골라 봐. 우리 중 가장 믿을 수 있는 세 명으로. 우리 앞에는 어려운 과제가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "fae5fce2-d786-47e3-a88b-2c97cd9abd45"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks up at you and stares for a long time, as if he's thinking "
"about asking you something else. But in the end he just nods.{/n} \"I... "
"thank you. You have no idea how glad I am to hear this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 다른 것을 부탁할지 말지 당신을 올려다보며 한참을 응시합니다. 그러나 결국 그는 고개를 끄덕일 뿐입니다.{/n} \"나는"
"... 고마워. 이 말을 듣고 내가 얼마나 기쁜지 넌 모를 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "9b5fb484-e3ce-460a-8ac3-55c4886687e3"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar gazes at you, as if trying to read something in your eyes, and "
"then sighs and nods.{/n} \"I will consider that a 'no, commander, I'm not so "
"tired of you that I quit and disappear right here.' That's something at "
"least!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신의 눈에서 무언가를 읽으려는 듯 당신을 향해 시선을 돌립니다. 그리고는 다음 한숨을 쉬며 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} "
"\"나는 '아뇨, 대장. 다 그만두고 여길 떠날만큼 당신에게 질리진 않았어요.'라고 생각하겠네. 최소한은 되는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "a8769947-929d-45b8-b0f5-4a0c28aee5fb"
msgid ""
"\"I received a letter with some threats. You do know how letters with "
"threats make me laugh. Ha. Ha. Ha.\" {n}Maegar doesn't laugh, but sullenly "
"articulates each 'ha', emphasizing his dark mood.{/n} \"As if this whole "
"government headache wasn't enough, now there's another contender from "
"Brevoy, scheming for their own piece of pie. I wonder why he dislikes the "
"alliance between Varnhold and the barony of Shrike Hills. Here, "
"{g|threatsletter}read it{/g} if you like.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 협박이 담긴 편지를 받았다. 협박 편지가 날 얼마나 웃게 하는지 알잖아. 하. 하. 하.\" {n}메이가르는 웃지 않고 "
"시무룩하게 각각의 '하'를 표현하며 어두운 기분을 강조합니다.{/n} \"우리 정권의 이 모든 골칫거리가 충분치 못하다는 듯, 이제 "
"브레보이에서도 또 다른 경쟁자가 자기들 파이를 노리고 있지. 그가 왜 반홀드와 슈라이크 구릉지의 동맹을 싫어하는지 이유가 궁금하군. 자, "
"원한다면 {g|threatsletter}읽어보게{/g}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "58bdd0d1-5755-4f7f-bddd-92404366410e"
msgid ""
"\"One day I will certainly become a decent baron. I'll sit on the throne, "
"sip wine and grow fat. But before that wonderful day comes, I hope to add a "
"few more pages to the adventures of the Varnling Host. So if you're ready, "
"General, say the word. I'm ready to stretch my legs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가는 나도 틀림없이 의젓한 남작이 되겠지. 왕좌에 앉아 포도주를 홀짝홀짝 마시고 살이 찔거야. 하지만 그 멋진 날이 오기 전에, "
"반링 호스트의 모험에 몇 페이지를 더 추가하고 싶군. 그러니 준비가 되면, 장군, 말만 하도록. 난 다리를 쭉 뻗을 준비가 됐으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "e9316838-4793-4c23-a03c-41854f55ed81"
msgid ""
"\"Remember that adventure in the three valleys, on the border between "
"Rostland and Issia? When the Noose witch and her rabble were practically "
"ruling the region, and the Surtovas made it a point to do nothing, waiting "
"for the Aldori to make their move. Jamandi did the wise thing then, and sent "
"a team of mercenaries – that's us – instead of her own warriors. But we... "
"we definitely didn't do a single wise thing, ha ha! You remember whose idea "
"it was to use me as bait?\""
msgstr ""
"\"로스트랜드와 이시아의 국경에 있는 세 계곡에서 있었던 그 모험을 기억하나? 마녀 누스와 그녀의 폭도들이 사실상 그 지역을 지배하고 "
"있을 때, 서토바는 알도리의 움직임을 기다리며 아무것도 하지 않기로 했지. 자만디는 당시로서는 현명한 행동을 했고, 그녀의 전사들 대신에 "
"용병 팀, 즉 우리를 보냈지. 하지만 우린... 하 하 하! 우린 뭐 하나 현명하게 생각한 게 전혀 없어! 날 미끼로 삼은 게 누구의 "
"생각이었는지 기억나나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "d3ff5a3e-46fe-4042-a056-3cf355ad4e2c"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not certain of the author, but I can make a guess. A few years ago, "
"the mother of this little rat hired us to find him, remember? From the "
"moment we met him, I wanted to tie him to a tree in the forest and leave "
"overnight, just to teach him a lesson. If he wasn't heir to one of the great "
"houses of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, I would've done just that. Maybe something "
"good would have come of the little rat.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 보냈는지 확실하지 않지만, 짐작은 할 수 있지. 몇 년 전, 이 쥐새끼의 엄마가 그를 찾기 위해 우리를 고용했었어, 기억나? 그 "
"녀석을 만난 순간부터 나는 놈을 숲 속의 나무에 하룻밤 동안 묶어놓고 싶었어. 그냥 그에게 교훈을 주기 위해서 말이야. 만약 그가 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 위대한 가문들 중 한 곳의 상속자만 아니었으면 바로 그렇게 했을지도 모르지. 어쩌면 그 작은 "
"쥐새끼에게도 좋은 일이 생겼을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "f8cd7824-0982-4c65-863c-bbcc57cbdfb3"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks down for a moment, then speaks in a calm and slightly sad "
"voice.{/n} \"Well, I guess I built some castles in the sky after the talk we "
"had during our walk. Forgive me. Let's not return to this conversation. As "
"for your question...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 잠시 아래를 내려다보다가 차분하고 약간 슬픈 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"글쎄, 우리가 걷는 동안 나눈 대화를 갖고 "
"하늘에 성을 쌓았군. 용서해줘. 이 주제의 대화는 다시 하지 말지. 너의 질문에 대해서는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "6fbc1603-54d0-473d-9ee1-0766bcff0d3a"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks at you searchingly.{/n} \"I'm probably not in a position to "
"be jealous. But I'd still like to understand your priorities. After your "
"answer to my question during our walk, I was picturing... something else.\" "
"{n}Maegar cringes, obviously reluctant to continue the unpleasant "
"conversation, and changes the subject.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 탐색하듯 바라봅니다.{/n} \"내가 질투할 처지는 아니겠지. 하지만 난 여전히 너의 우선순위를 알고 싶어. 우리가 걷는 "
"동안 내 질문에 대답해 준 이후, 나는 뭔가 다른 것을 그리고 있었지.\" {n}메이가르는 분명하게 불쾌한 대화를 계속하기를 꺼려하며 "
"화제를 바꿉니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Varn_Personal/Cue_0108_Text
msgctxt "2ad6e27e-bdef-4b9f-8d02-997685813013"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar casts an attentive look at you.{/n} \"This barony is our common "
"burden, {name}. I hope we have the same understanding of the great "
"responsibility we bear.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신을 주의깊게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"이 남작령은 우리들의 공동책임이야, {name}. 우리가 짊어질 큰 책임에 대해서 "
"이해를 공유했으면 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/01_Soldier_String
msgctxt "c9bc3282-7571-4501-926f-097212761d55"
msgid "\"Are they coming?\""
msgstr "\"오고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/02_Soldier_String
msgctxt "ecb98615-913a-47e3-9ce0-e6a61d2233e2"
msgid "\"They are, they're coming!\""
msgstr "\"온다, 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/03_Varn_String
msgctxt "7f735382-a813-404b-b99d-ee94468be6f0"
msgid "\"Hail, fighters!\""
msgstr "\"전사들이여! 영원하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/04_Soldiers_String
msgctxt "c37c55aa-0634-471a-a077-0b53ec3258fd"
msgid "\"Hail, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"영주님, 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/05_Varn_String
msgctxt "dbecda5c-0785-4f39-aee6-899b29b6897a"
msgid "\"Varnling Host! My eagles!\""
msgstr "\"반링 호스트! 나의 독수리들이여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/06_Varn_String
msgctxt "372de5f6-526e-4ffb-934a-5f241bd01df7"
msgid ""
"\"I've promised for many years that I would lead you to victory. And now I "
"have!\""
msgstr "\"내가 누누히 말했지, 너희들을 승리로 이끌겠다고. 어떠냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/07_Soldiers_String
msgctxt "f44f0c6d-0648-4e2c-92d2-8a3aebbaf8ae"
msgid "\"Hurrraaah!\""
msgstr "\"우와아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/08_Varn_String
msgctxt "c1c0ee94-74f2-4222-b992-52c81f362a99"
msgid ""
"\"You are a mercenary party no more. You are my personal guard, the best of "
"the best!\""
msgstr "\"너희들은 이제 용병단이 아니다. 너희들은 내 근위대다! 최고 중의 최고의 근위대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/09_Varn_String
msgctxt "4f0acc89-c471-403e-9186-825efead038e"
msgid "\"We will never fight for others' gold again.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 다시는 남의 돈을 받고 싸우지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/10_Varn_String
msgctxt "3c5318c1-8599-4a7d-bb5f-f267f409e4f9"
msgid "\"From now on, we fight for what's ours!\""
msgstr "\"지금부터, 우리는 우리를 위해 싸운다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/11_Soldiers_String
msgctxt "196f94db-cdba-4b6f-a54e-db1ecd95c25a"
msgid "\"Hip-hip, hooray!\""
msgstr "\"만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_cutscene/12_Soldiers_String
msgctxt "8f65dc5e-4579-4e71-a18f-e3df4c045234"
msgid "\"Glory to Baron Varn!\""
msgstr "\"반 남작에게 영광 있으라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a64fa7e6-f107-4abd-b3aa-ecabdd682dad"
msgid ""
"\"Sleeping in a tent isn't that bad. It depends who you're sharing it with..."
"\""
msgstr "\"천막에서 자는 것도 나쁘진 않았어. 누구랑 같이 잤느냐에 따라 다르지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "e5e858dc-f698-4bea-b232-ebdf2a4e3ba4"
msgid "\"I think we've fought enough to deserve a little comfort.\""
msgstr "\"이만큼 싸웠으면 이제 좀 쉴때도 된거 아니겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "04601e0b-aa7b-49d1-ad1a-ee79f09e1162"
msgid "\"Are there any orders for me?\""
msgstr "\"내리실 명령이 있으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "44357e9f-b9e9-4254-8064-58c9365f94c3"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, it's wonderful finally getting a place to call home. All one can wish "
"now is to have a family to go with it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 드디어 집이라 부를 수 있는 곳을 갖게 돼서 정말 멋지네. 이제 남은 건 가정을 이뤄 이걸 함께 누리는 것 뿐이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "21d37d25-02c8-4101-bf70-e1b5598b4dc2"
msgid ""
"{n}The soldiers fall out, and only Kjerdi Eisbock remains, looking as gloomy "
"as ever despite the universal jubilation. The sullen dwarf is quartermaster "
"and chaplain of the {g|Varnling Host}Varnling Host{/g}, famous for her skill "
"in dampening the commander's enthusiasm.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}병사들은 물러가고, 셰르디 아이스복만 남았습니다. 모두가 즐거워 하는 가운데 그는 언제나처럼 침울해 보입니다. 이 시무룩한 난쟁이는 "
"{g|Varnling Host}반링 호스트{/g}의 보급관이자 군종 사제로, 지휘관의 열정을 꺾는 능력으로 유명합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Verda
msgctxt "3b2a6404-03f9-4630-a24d-7915e0288a01"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome back, your grace. Did you have fun at the celebration? Have enough "
"to eat? Good, then let's get back to work before you squander the whole "
"barony!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 오셨습니다, 영주님. 축하연은 즐거우셨나요? 먹기는 많이 먹었고요? 좋아, 그럼 네가 남작령을 말아먹기 전에 일이나 하자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "1975b2a0-8ad5-429c-bf70-5a949b364a9f"
msgid "\"You should have gone with us. You would have liked it!\""
msgstr "\"너도 같이 오지 그랬어. 재밌었을 텐데 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Verda
msgctxt "8c2f2763-cae9-425b-9141-962b8aae54c0"
msgid ""
"\"I hate {g|Restov}Restov{/g}. Besides, while you were at the ball, another "
"bandit gang slithered into town. – And who would have taken care of it if I "
"weren't here, hunh? Anyhow, the festivities are over. You're a baron now – "
"get to baroning!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 싫어해. 게다가 네가 무도회를 즐기는 동안, 도적 패거리 하나가 마을에 기어들어왔지. 내가 "
"없었으면 누가 신경이나 썼겠어? 응? 어쨌든, 잔치는 끝났어. 넌 이제 남작이니까, 남작 노릇을 하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d3689b1e-e2c5-458b-9a39-004bd62b88ed"
msgid ""
"\"If you say so. To baroning! Here's my first order. I shall appoint you, "
"Kjerdi, as Treasurer. You, {d|Cephal}Cephal{/d}, will be my Regent, and you, "
"{Name}, my General. Any questions? No? Then get to work!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 말한다면야. 남작 노릇을 하지! 첫 명령이다. 셰르디 너를 재무관으로 임명하겠다. {d|Cephal}케팔{/d} 당신이 나의 "
"섭정이고, {Name} 네가 내 장군이다. 질문 있나? 없다고? 그럼 일이나 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "da800ac9-8bf8-4a91-b538-23f1723a3c54"
msgid ""
"\"Well, General, here's your first order. Talk to Kjerdi and pick three of "
"our lads as your brothers in arms. I can't spare more than three for now. – "
"Someone has to guard the capital! Take the best, whoever will follow you to "
"hell and back! When you've gathered them together, come find me at the fort. "
"There's something I need you to do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 장군, 여기 첫 명령이다. 셰르디와 얘기해서 우리 애들 중 세 명을 네 밑으로 넣어 둬. 당장은 세 명 이상 줄 수가 없군. "
"누군가는 수도를 지켜야 하니까! 제대로 고르라고. 너를 지옥에서 꺼내줄 놈이 있을지도 모르잖아? 다 모이면 요새로 나를 찾아와. 네가 "
"해줘야 할 일이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d81f8d2b-8d54-4882-96b0-82c840c8842a"
msgid ""
"{n}For a few moments, Maegar watches Cephal and Kjerdi go away, then looks "
"at you. There's a mischievous twinkle in his eyes.{/n} \"Hard to believe, "
"isn't it? After so many years of life on the road, nights in barracks and "
"tents, I am now a baron – with my own humble baronial residence.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 케팔과 셰르디가 떠나는 것을 잠시 동안 쳐다보다가 당신을 바라봅니다. 그의 눈에는 장난기 어린 반짝임이 있습니다.{/n} "
"\"믿어져? 오랜 세월 길바닥에서 뒹굴고, 막사와 천막에서 잠을 잤는데, 이제 난 자그만 남작령을 가진 남작이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4392061b-30f3-434d-8495-442a3bb5082f"
msgid ""
"\"That's my most loyal companion! – No idle talk, right to business.\" {n}"
"Maegar chuckles, though he looks a little disappointed that you didn't "
"continue the conversation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이래야 내 오른팔이지! 잡담하지 말고 바로 본론으로 가자고.\" {n}메이가르는 당신이 대화를 계속하지 않은 것에 약간 실망한 "
"듯하지만 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "428e34aa-18cf-410b-959b-34d30347ab29"
msgid ""
"\"Right! Well, we'll try to get used to soft feather-beds, warmth, and a "
"roof over our heads that doesn't leak!\""
msgstr "\"그렇지! 자, 이젠 부드러운 깃털 침대랑 온기랑 물이 안 새는 지붕에 적응해보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "4c96aa5a-4809-4de8-bdc0-3747ce16fad7"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar smiles.{/n} \"You're right. Anyway, we'll have plenty of time to "
"discuss the respective merits of tents and beds, ha ha!\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르가 웃습니다.{/n} \"맞아. 어쨌든 텐트와 침대 중에 뭐가 나은지 얘기할 시간은 충분하겠지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/Velcome_quartermaster/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ebf31b5f-56f5-4ed9-b555-c88d6983687c"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks down and smiles faintly for a moment.{/n} \"Yes. Because who "
"needs an empty house, where your only companion is an echo? Well, our best "
"days are still ahead...\" {n}He becomes silent and grows pensive.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 고개를 숙이고 잠시 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그래. 동반자라고는 메아리밖에 없을 빈집을 누가 원하겠어? 뭐, 우리의 "
"가장 좋은 날들은 아직이겠지...\" {n}그는 말이 없어지고 수심이 커집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4541863f-81d9-45f3-8666-5544e6a27733"
msgid ""
"\"I suggest we let them. What need do we have of subjects who can't stand up "
"for themselves?\""
msgstr "\"내버려두자고 제안하고 싶네요. 스스로 서지도 못하는 자들이 왜 필요하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fb08d6f3-d643-4f76-96e2-a14cf68ef3d1"
msgid "\"Sounds like a job for a General. Shall I deal with this myself?\""
msgstr "\"장군이 나설 때인 것 같네요. 제가 처리해도 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "1191ffab-713f-4d62-a164-ce5b53dc2641"
msgid "\"Willas, you seem nervous. What is it?\""
msgstr "\"윌라스, 긴장한 것 같군요. 뭐죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "d0fcdea3-fdd5-49cc-8cb4-6cb97187435a"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "d65baf6b-142c-4864-8b22-cce57a1351b2"
msgid "\"We march at once!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 즉시 전진한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "fb52a699-8862-42c9-aa1b-0dfa15cf67a6"
msgid "\"I need to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"준비가 필요해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "6697159e-77c7-4855-88df-96566995fa1c"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace! Your hour has come! Err, that didn't sound quite right... I "
"mean, it's your time to shine! To show off a bit, even! Your subjects "
"require your protection. Will you refuse the pitiable creatures a heroic "
"feat?\""
msgstr ""
"\"각하! 당신의 시간이 왔습니다! 에에, 별로 말이 안맞는 것 같은데... 제 말은, 이제 당신이 빛날 때라는 겁니다! 살짝 폼도 "
"나고요! 백성들은 당신의 보호가 필요합니다. 그 가련한 이들에게 영웅적인 위업을 행하길 거절하실 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "29d7802f-a5c8-49e8-a564-41750a026e15"
msgid ""
"\"You're the pitiable creature! Now stop fussing and be quiet, I'll explain "
"everything myself!\" {n}A woman wearing simple peasant clothes steps "
"forward, pushing Gunderson aside.{/n} \"Your Grace! My name is Cvetislava. I "
"am from the village of Old Stump. We've lived here a long time, and always "
"minded our own business... But since you started to rule here, we became, as "
"it turns out, your subjects. Well, we paid our taxes on time, and brought "
"you grain and meat. But now woe has come upon us. So it's your turn to prove "
"that you're good for more than collecting taxes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 한심한 양반이야! 이제 호들갑 떨지 말고 조용히 해, 내가 직접 다 설명하겠어!\" {n}평범한 농민의 옷을 입은 여자가 "
"건더슨을 한쪽으로 밀어내며 앞으로 나섭니다.{/n} \"각하! 제 이름은 크베티슬라바입니다. 저는 오래된 그루터기 마을에서 왔어요. 우린 "
"여기서 오래 살아왔고, 항상 우리 일에만 신경 썼죠... 하지만 당신이 이곳을 통치하기 시작했고, 우린 당신의 백성이 되어 있더군요. "
"뭐, 그래서 제때 세금을 내고 작물과 고기를 갖다 드렸지만요. 하지만 지금 우리에게 불행이 닥쳤어요. 그러니 이제 각하께서 세금 징수 "
"말고도 일을 잘 하실 수 있으시다는 걸 증명할 차례예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "25cc7f24-c6b0-4b46-88fa-a3889acecb0f"
msgid "\"I honor my duties to my subjects. What has happened?\""
msgstr "\"나는 백성에 대한 나의 의무를 존중하지. 무슨 일이 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "bd5f10b5-bfb4-420b-9f16-0f6ef8db8931"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you keep butting in, you rattle-box? You keep quiet. I'm not dumb, "
"I can talk! So, Your Grace, woe has come upon us. Dead cyclopes have risen "
"from their graves and are moving slowly towards our village! If you don't "
"help us, they'll gobble all of us up in no time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 딸랑이 상자 같은 양반아, 왜 자꾸 끼어드는 거야? 조용히 해. 난 바보가 아냐, 말할 수 있다고! 그래서, 각하, 재난이 "
"찾아왔어요. 죽은 사이클롭스들이 무덤에서 올라와서 우리 마을을 향해 천천히 다가오고 있다구요! 당신께서 우리를 돕지 않으면 그들은 "
"순식간에 우리 모두를 집어삼켜 버릴 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e34f78a1-08b5-4091-abd6-a19a0c08ebfc"
msgid ""
"\"If I treated all my subjects that way, I'd soon rule a kingdom of flies "
"and rats. Of course we'll help them! This is not up for discussion!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 백성들을 그런 식으로 대하면, 곧 파리와 쥐의 왕국을 다스리게 되겠지. 당연히 우린 그들을 돕는다! 이건 의논할 일이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "11191630-2c95-48f8-a923-5fb14e437dbf"
msgid "\"Not alone. I will go with you.\""
msgstr "\"혼자가 아니야. 나도 같이 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "a5ccc903-3691-4b4b-81e7-93f0be03a2ca"
msgid "{n}Willas looks away.{/n} \"Well, how do I put this...\""
msgstr "{n}윌라스는 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"글쎄, 이걸 어떻게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "e023a7df-14d6-4b7c-8f5d-926944090868"
msgid ""
"\"I'll lead a party personally. {Name}, choose the best of the Varnling "
"Host. We march at once! The others will remain here, ready for battle – in "
"case these cyclopes come here too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 따로 일행을 꾸리지. {Name}, 반링 호스트 중 최고를 골라. 우리는 즉시 진군한다! 다른 사람들은 여기에 남아서 전투 준비를 "
"한다. 사이클롭스들이 여기로 올지도 모르니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "35e9c52f-b64f-47bc-9bb9-4277be53c955"
msgid ""
"\"Zombie cyclopes... I'd say it's unheard of, but as this young man pointed "
"out, we've already met them once, and that means we might meet them again. "
"If we're to protect the barony, we'll need to find out more about them. I "
"will go with you. We must try to discover where they came from, and what we "
"can do to stop them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좀비 사이클롭스들이라... 전례가 없는 일이라고 말하고 싶지만, 이 젊은이가 지적했듯이 우리는 이미 한 번 그것들을 만났고, 그것은 "
"우리가 그들을 다시 만날 수도 있다는 것을 의미하네. 우리가 남작령을 보호하려면, 그것들에 대해 더 많은 것을 알아내야 하겠지. 내가 "
"자네와 함께 가겠네. 우린 그들이 어디서 왔는지, 그리고 그들을 막기 위해 우리가 무엇을 할 수 있는지 알아내야 하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : DLC2_Cvetislava
msgctxt "2057d80b-67be-4d13-aa0d-91b89bfaba29"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your Grace! There is another problem, though...\" {n}The "
"village woman lowers her voice.{/n} \"These zombie-clopes, they have the "
"power to control a person's mind. When the monsters came, some of our people "
"became insane. – They began to worship them! You must do something about "
"these lunatics, or they'll kill us all themselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다, 각하! 하지만 또 다른 문제가 있어요.\" {n}마을 여자가 목소리를 낮게 깝니다.{/n} \"이 좀비-클롭스들, 그들은 "
"사람의 마음을 조종할 수 있는 힘을 가지고 있어요. 괴물이 왔을 때, 우리 사람들 중 몇몇이 미쳐버렸어요 – 그들은 좀비들을 섬기게 "
"됐어요! 이 미치광이들을 어떻게 좀 해주세요, 그렇지 않으면 그들이 우리 모두를 죽일 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "b3523850-ec9d-4b84-a2a9-d3cc020f04ef"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember, Your Grace, that unforgettable day of our first "
"acquaintance, when we met those terrible, but in a way quite amazing "
"creatures? Well...\""
msgstr ""
"\"각하, 기억하십니까, 우리가 그 끔찍한 생명체들과의 그 잊을 수 없는 첫 대면식을 한 날 말입니다, 그래도 어떻게 보면 꽤 놀라운 "
"생명체들입니다만? 음...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "b2c4769d-2f7f-4b7a-8e1f-69105526ce02"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace, I realize you're incredibly busy, but please, heed the words "
"of your...\""
msgstr "\"각하, 믿기 힘드실만큼 바쁘시다는 것은 알지만, 부디, 주의해 주십시오. 당신의....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "c81b6185-bfea-4945-a33c-9ae9a8d5877e"
msgid ""
"{n}Gunderson looks at you with pleading eyes.{/n} \"Sweetie, please talk his "
"grace into helping them. I know he'll listen to you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}건더슨은 애원하는 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그대여, 제발 각하께 그들을 돕도록 말씀드려 주십쇼. 당신 말은 들으실 "
"겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "935c27a9-e03a-42c0-9e0c-8679f30526b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Gunderson smiles at you gratefully, but looks a little pathetic.{/n} "
"\"Thanks, sweetie. I'm just... You know...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}건더슨은 당신을 보고 상냥하게 웃지만, 좀 애처로워 보입니다.{/n} \"고맙습니다, 그대여. 전 그냥... 아시다시피...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0020_Text_String
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "58ea1ea5-d719-4419-878f-52fd24a29a5c"
msgid "\"Sweetie?\" {n}Cephal raises an eyebrow.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그대여?\" {n}케팔이 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d722d6f0-55e9-411d-92a0-85f57ce0278a"
msgid ""
"\"I don't need to be talked into anything. Of course we're going to help "
"them!\""
msgstr "\"나는 어떤 일로도 화자될 이유가 없다. 우린 당연히 그들을 돕는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "7f0cf59c-fdb5-4c5f-b75e-d28a84d339d2"
msgid ""
"\"I think I... To a certain extent, I may be partially... responsible for "
"what's going on? Metaphorically speaking? Because I was first to be attacked "
"by the cyclopes, you know. What if I'm the one who brought them here?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 말입니다... 어느 정도, 제가 부분적으로... 이 일에 대한 책임이 있는 것이 아닐까요? 비유하자면? 제가 먼저 사이클롭스에게 "
"공격받았으니까 말입니다. 만약 제가 그들을 여기로 데려온 사람이면 어쩌죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "8b8d25c4-173b-4f7e-946b-ab82f35cc035"
msgid ""
"\"It's unlikely, I know. Unless they're here to reclaim that bracelet, ha "
"ha! But calm down, the cyclopes are our problem. And we're going to solve it!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럴 것 같진 않아, 난 알 수 있지. 팔찌를 되찾으러 온 게 아니라면 말이야, 하하! 그래도 진정하게, 그 사이클롭스들은 우리의 "
"문제야. 그리고 우리가 해결할 걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "63c19df0-89aa-4bee-a98e-80b1a7e6c5fc"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for the warning. We'll do whatever it takes to help your "
"village. {Name}, Cephal! Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"경고해 줘서 고맙다. 우린 네 마을을 돕기 위해 무슨 일이든 할 거야. {Name}, 케팔! 준비됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "d232f7a7-6927-444d-9433-1bc633a437da"
msgid "\"Don't take too long!\""
msgstr "\"너무 오래 걸리진 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "9e5ed631-38cd-4b25-a8e0-1698a09d8aab"
msgid "\"We're off!\""
msgstr "\"우린 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "a62fba5a-32e8-43b3-a767-b957689c1015"
msgid "\"What about me?\""
msgstr "\"전 어쩌고요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "b1ede606-8d20-4489-9047-22307efd1d03"
msgid ""
"\"You sit here. If you want to be helpful, keep watch. Or go to Kjerdi. – "
"Maybe she needs help moving some bags. We don't need you fighting cyclopes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자넨 여기 앉아있게. 도움이 되고 싶다면 잘 경계를 서고 있게나. 아니면 셰르디에게 가든지. - 가방을 옮기는 데 도움이 필요할지도 "
"몰라. 사이클롭스들과 싸우라고는 안하겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : WillasGunderson
msgctxt "837bfc45-9f53-4376-9e45-042c112fc2d3"
msgid ""
"\"Fine. If you say so.\" {n}Gunderson looks at you sadly.{/n} \"Take care..."
"\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다, 그렇게 말씀하신다면.\" {n}건더슨은 슬프게 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"몸 조심하십쇼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : CephalLorentus_Companion
msgctxt "4b88aff6-3519-4e5f-a44e-548e3d288d91"
msgid "\"...sweetie.\""
msgstr "\"허...'그대'라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "ca6e31f3-ffed-4f9c-b044-067e5c9bd1d2"
msgid "\"Sweetie?\"{n} echoes Maegar. His eyes make Willas shiver.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그대?\"{n} 메이가르의 외침이 울려퍼집니다. 그의 눈이 윌라스를 오들오들 떨게 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Varnhold/VillageNeedsHelp/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : MaegarVarn_Companion
msgctxt "7a8e0476-6e41-4ce2-a7c3-d084dbe84256"
msgid ""
"\"Sweetie?\" {n}Maegar speaks very calmly, but the sound of his voice makes "
"Willas shiver. After holding a pause, Maegar continues,{/n} \"As for your "
"words, young man, I definitely need not be persuaded to aid my subjects. To "
"protect them is my responsibility.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그대?\"{n} 메이가르는 아주 침착하게 말을 하지만, 그 목소리는 윌라스의 몸을 떨게 합니다. 잠시 뜸을 들인 뒤, 메이가르는 계속 "
"말합니다,{/n} \"젊은이, 자네 말에 대해서는, 내 백성을 돕는데 날 설득할 필요는 없어. 그들을 보호하는 것은 내 책임이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Blizzard_Cephal_1_String
msgctxt "370c98aa-adc3-48da-affd-bb8a055bdd75"
msgid "\"The climate in our land leaves much to be desired.\""
msgstr "\"우리 땅의 기후는 아쉬운 점이 많지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Blizzard_Cephal_2_String
msgctxt "efb8c37b-0aa3-49a8-a647-64bd40bb70b8"
msgid ""
"\"Achoo! It was much easier to walk through knee-deep snow when I was twenty "
"years younger...\""
msgstr "\"에취! 내가 스무 살 더 젊었을 때는 무릎까지 오는 눈 속을 걷는 게 훨씬 쉬웠건만..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Blizzard_Varn_1_String
msgctxt "11e6a16b-914e-4986-bea7-7d703e2cfe07"
msgid "\"Ah, snowfall! I hear it's good for the crops!\""
msgstr "\"아아, 폭설이군! 농사에는 좋다고 하던데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Blizzard_Varn_2_String
msgctxt "dbfac6eb-12e8-4990-a784-e80d5157db02"
msgid "\"Winters are harsh here... But milder than in Brevoy!\""
msgstr "\"여기 겨울은 가혹해... 그래도 브레보이보단 낫군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Storm_Cephal_1_String
msgctxt "8ba13de8-f9d5-4d44-9593-e856d61990e9"
msgid ""
"\"This weather makes me envy my spellbook. It's much better protected from "
"moisture than I am.\""
msgstr "\"이런 날씨에는 내 주문책이 부럽네. 나보다 습기에 훨씬 더 강하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Storm_Cephal_2_String
msgctxt "45c06482-5ded-4c14-87cf-c8fa07eb5804"
msgid ""
"\"I can't wait to retire and recollect these moments as I sit by the fire, "
"with a cup of mulled wine in my hand!\""
msgstr "\" 빨리 은퇴하고 난롯가에 앉아서 멀드 와인이라도 한 잔 들고 이 순간들을 회상하고 싶구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Storm_Varn_1_String
msgctxt "758cfff6-471a-43e9-aad0-30a95dfdec38"
msgid ""
"\"A little more rain like this, and we'll be able to travel the barony by "
"boat!\""
msgstr "\"비가 이렇게만 좀 더 내리면, 보트를 타고 남작령 내를 여행할 수 있겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/2DLC/Weather_Barks/Storm_Varn_2_String
msgctxt "91e019c2-2a21-4f6b-a5d4-e74857ae1102"
msgid ""
"\"I hope lightning doesn't strike a building. I'd hate to see something burn "
"down without an enemy in sight!\""
msgstr "\"건물에 번개가 치지 않았으면 좋겠군. 보이는 적도 없이 뭐가 불타는 걸 보는 건 싫은 일이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/1block_String
msgctxt "3fd3ced6-79be-4ce8-a45f-37561c1f9c2b"
msgid ""
"A shroud of a swirling darkness blocks the path. It is surrounded by "
"maddening voices, whispering, crackling, screaming incoherent phrases in "
"unknown languages."
msgstr ""
"소용돌이치는 어둠의 장막이 오솔길을 가로막습니다. 그것은 미친 듯한 목소리, 속삭임, 딱딱거리는 소리, 알 수 없는 언어의 모순된 "
"구절들로 둘러싸여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleNormal_Start_01_Rovaspawn_String_1
msgctxt "54d883f7-218f-40a4-96fe-3fad01832419"
msgid "\"VVE'zeaWT troMAra! iN ROVAGUG ZEv'roaCH!!!\""
msgstr "\"베'에제웃 트로마아라! 인 로바거그 제브'로아취!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_End_01_Dragon_String_1
msgctxt "b68dd7db-590f-4611-bbe0-66501e228ff7"
msgid "\"My... Head...\""
msgstr "\"내...머리야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_End_02_Dragon_String_1
msgctxt "02f08171-6a81-4ce5-a336-450785b98c4a"
msgid ""
"\"You have won, where I lost in disgrace. You have saved the entire world "
"from a monster – and me, from my pride. I bow to your victory.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 내가 불명예스럽게 패한 곳에서 이겼다. 너는 괴물로부터 온 세상을 구했고, 내 상한 자존심으로부터 나 또한 구했다. 너의 승리에 "
"경의를 표한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_End_03_Dragon_String_1
msgctxt "05ab7a45-b939-4d09-87dc-eb550507fb5d"
msgid ""
"\"And now I shall return to the place of my vigil. These wounds are well-"
"deserved, but they will heal.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 이제 나는 내 경계처로 돌아갈 것이다. 이 상처들은 날만해서 났지만, 그래도 치유될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_Start_01_Dragon_String_1
msgctxt "80278614-35de-4228-8061-e31585562dea"
msgid "\"You have no power over me! I will destroy you! Now!\""
msgstr "\"넌 내 힘을 넘지 못한다! 네놈을 산산조각내주마! 당장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_Start_02_Dragon_String_1
msgctxt "32749cdb-8bbd-4542-b906-6ea98dfb2f67"
msgid "\"Apsu, father... Do not abandon me!\""
msgstr "\"압수, 나의 아버지시여... 나를 버리지 마소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_Start_03_Rovaspawn_String_1
msgctxt "cd279df4-de92-43f4-bf2a-afb35667eb57"
msgid "\"b'ZHVEra'TCH at'SCH'aSCH SviarRA'HKE! VRidShUu ROVAGUG asVVItchi!!!\""
msgstr "\"브'즈뷔라'앗체 앗'스카'아슈 스비아를라'악케! 브리드슈후 로바거그 아아스비치!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/FinalBattleTrue_Start_04_Dragon_String_1
msgctxt "e71b5c03-bd59-4524-9d37-685a176fe0d0"
msgid "\"RovAGUG... mASTer... hunGRY!!!\""
msgstr "\"로바꺼그... 쭈인... 배꼬프다!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/Rovaspawn_Ult1_Waves-DraAnswer_String_1
msgctxt "33535780-73db-490a-9523-ee6a9d37428e"
msgid "\"O, mASTer! tHAnk yOU for The prECIOUS Gift of maDNESs!!!\""
msgstr "\"오, 주인이씨여! 소쭝한 광끼의 선물에 감싸합니따!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/Rovaspawn_Ult1_Waves_String_1
msgctxt "4a63ddcd-478e-4e58-91a5-aef07b864e2a"
msgid "\"tMCHisah'scAA! EEI Hsh'raTZE!!!\""
msgstr "\"툼키사'스카아! 에이 슈'랏체!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/Rovaspawn_Ult2_Drain-DraAnswer_String_1
msgctxt "0035aca0-0ec8-4596-982a-7e03fca5bc5e"
msgid "\"Yes, mASter, yeS! deVOUr my fLESh, ROVAGUG! DeVOUr my lIFe!!!\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다, 주인이씨여, 좋씁니다! 나의 살을 쌈키소써, 로바거그여! 나의 살믈 먹어치우소써!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/Rovaspawn_Ult2_Drain_String_1
msgctxt "545e558e-475a-4eb3-b15b-b7daefcf1846"
msgid "\"UarRRShe! ubU Sh'TkatrAH Bzha!!!\""
msgstr "\"우아르셰! 우브 슈'드카트라아 브자아!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/Rovaspawn_Ult3_Summon-DraAnswer_String_1
msgctxt "26273e15-7095-4a65-8321-e18c5359e586"
msgid "\"moRE sLAVes of The mASTer! MORe mEAt!!!\""
msgstr "\"주인께 떠 많은 노예를! 더 많은 고낏조깍을!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Barks/Rovaspawn_Ult3_Summon_String_1
msgctxt "c16e574b-b135-44dd-8547-23e55ed92812"
msgid "\"DZhiwshe bVERh'oso'vGA! ErHAVAt' bRAttsA!!!\""
msgstr "\"찌쉬 빼르' 오소'브가아! 에르하밧' 브랏사아!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Barks/Duo_Daemon_BattleStart_String_1
msgctxt "5b4d1515-e1e1-4db0-9dc2-0bf9309a1b20"
msgid "\"You're just in time, mortals. I'm hungry!\""
msgstr "\"때맞춰 왔군, 필멸자들아. 나는 굶주렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Barks/Duo_Daemon_dies_String_1
msgctxt "dd6c7317-ce14-429b-a9ec-032c20176ff1"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you mortals so stubborn? Why don't you just surrender and die?\""
msgstr "\"너희 필멸자들은 왜 그렇게 고집이 세지? 그냥 항복하고 죽는 게 어떤가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Barks/Duo_Mage_BattleStart_String_1
msgctxt "3c360c39-dd46-4759-8e16-b7a5ae6422ef"
msgid ""
"\"Heroes who are about to die! How many more fools will the dragon bring "
"here?\""
msgstr "\"죽으려는 영웅들! 용이 바보들을 얼마나 더 데려올까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Barks/Duo_Mage_dies_String_1
msgctxt "6a701e71-b05d-4a74-b40a-9c8be93a3bc1"
msgid "\"To remain true to yourself even in death is a great gift.\""
msgstr "\"죽음에 임박해서도 스스로에게 진실하게 남을 수 있는 것은 위대한 선물이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Item1_description_String
msgctxt "443074e0-e2b4-4528-adff-700896b844fe"
msgid ""
"There is an engraving on the inside of the ring, obviously the beginning of "
"a longer phrase:\n"
"\"My daemon and I have a bond. Almost like...\""
msgstr ""
"반지 안쪽에는 분명히 더 길었을 구절의 도입부가 새겨져 있습니다.\n"
"\"다이몬과 내게는 유대가 있다. 마치...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Item1_name_String
msgctxt "79fa87ef-7b66-417d-ab0e-4cf4449697d8"
msgid "Ring of the Captive"
msgstr "포로의 반지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Item2_description_String
msgctxt "83d2feed-a743-4568-adc0-4b8d80c975fd"
msgid ""
"There is an engraving on the inside of the ring, obviously the ending of a "
"longer phrase:\n"
"\"... Xelliren and the Spawn of Rovagug, which he supposedly wishes to "
"defeat.\""
msgstr ""
"반지 안쪽에는 글이 새겨져 있습니다. 분명히 더 긴 구절의 결말부로 보입니다.\n"
"\"…젤리런과 그가 물리치고 싶어하는 로바거그의 자식들처럼\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Item2_name_String
msgctxt "6191aeb9-4ed6-45f2-9708-9fb9eb821097"
msgid "Ring of the Captor"
msgstr "포획자의 반지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text1_HandwritingPractice_name_String
msgctxt "4af2b4af-052e-4e85-8cde-e1d0ad005416"
msgid "Student's Copybook"
msgstr "학생의 필사본"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text1_HandwritingPractice_text_String
msgctxt "21edea8e-8868-4972-9976-e2784d6fecd8"
msgid ""
"The scroll is filled with diligently scribbled words. The letters are much "
"larger than normal, as if the one who wrote them was quite large themselves, "
"or simply didn't like small print.\n"
"\"Hooman languige is not hard. Soon I will lurn. Here are new wurds I know:\n"
"KI-TY\n"
"HOR-SEY\n"
"CHOKE\n"
"DES-MEM-BER\n"
"DE-VOUR.\"\n"
"There's someone else's much neater handwriting below:\n"
"\"Good, Zirhaische. You learn quickly. Soon you will speak the common "
"language as well as your native Abyssal.\n"
"P.S.: It's spelled 'kitty' and 'dismember'.\""
msgstr ""
"두루마리에는 부지런히 휘갈겨 쓴 글씨가 가득합니다. 글자는 보통 글자보다 훨씬 큰 편인데, 마치 글씨를 쓴 사람 자체가 꽤 크거나, "
"단순히 작은 글씨체를 좋아하지 않는 것 같습니다.\n"
"\"잉간 언어는 어렵지 않다. 나는 곧 배울 것이다. 여기 내가 아는 새 단어가 있다.\n"
"고-냥이\n"
"마알-같은\n"
"쪼르다\n"
"훼-송-하다\n"
"삼-키다.\"\n"
"아래에는 다른 사람의 훨씬 더 깨끗한 필체가 있습니다.\n"
"\"잘했어, 지라이슈. 넌 빨리 배우는구나. 곧 모국어인 심연어 뿐만 아니라 공용어도 잘 말하게 될 거다.\n"
"추신: '고양이'와 '훼손하다'가 맞는 철자야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text2_MageDiary_name_String
msgctxt "718a46f0-b48b-4de2-8ead-970df1a259db"
msgid "The Captor's Diary"
msgstr "포획자의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text2_MageDiary_text_String
msgctxt "3cd18184-4c00-467a-a6f1-718fad9203e3"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know what irony is? It's when you are a dark wizard steeped in "
"blood to the elbows, when suddenly a silver dragon comes to you in your "
"dreams, entreating you to perform a noble feat and save a few feeble "
"kingdoms from the Spawn of Rovagug. At first I couldn't even come up with an "
"answer. I've done many colorful things in my life – mass ritual murders, for "
"example. But not feats. Never feats.\n"
"What made me agree in the end? Curiosity, perhaps. And vanity. The dragon "
"had given me enough information to excite both. The Spawn of Rovagug "
"slumbered in the depths. A sphere of madness surrounded it. Many heroes had "
"been summoned, only to fail in the task. It sounded like a perfect challenge "
"for my skills.\n"
"Besides, I had long desired to test a hypothesis – that kinder, nobler souls "
"are far more susceptible to madness. I have often thought how fragile and "
"cumbersome all these lofty ideals and strict morals must be. How crushing, "
"how blinding, the need to suppress one's selfish impulses – the essence of "
"what others call 'goodness'. Then it all crumbles under external pressures "
"and internal contradictions, and the mind and spirit lie in ruins. 'What "
"have I have to fear?' I asked myself. 'I, who has never been tormented by "
"the pangs of conscience, and always act with cold-blooded premeditation?'\n"
"So I agreed to the dragon's proposal, and took myself down to conquer the "
"Tenebrous Depths.\n"
"My approach is different from the other heroes who came here. There's no "
"point in rushing forward haphazardly, hoping to accomplish the goal in one "
"daring attack. I move slowly, studying the magic background of the dungeon, "
"capturing local creatures and using them for experiments and sacrifices. I "
"must admit, this place is significantly more dangerous than I expected. I've "
"already had to fight for my life twice, and fallen exhausted afterwards.\n"
"I think I shall require an assistant, someone who can drive away the "
"monsters while I'm busy with my research. My skills easily enable me to "
"summon and bind a powerful servant. But will this be enough?\n"
"I've been thinking recently... What if rational, cold-blooded scoundrels "
"like me are nevertheless susceptible to madness? Only for us, madness "
"manifests in needlessly risking everything in noble escapades. – Like my "
"crusade here to this damned dungeon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아이러니한 것이 무엇인지 아는가? 당신이 팔꿈치까지 피칠갑한 암흑의 마법사일 때, 갑자기 꿈속에 실버 드래곤이 찾아와서 고귀한 위업을 "
"행하여 로바거그의 스폰으로부터 몇몇 미약한 왕국을 구하라고 간청하는 순간이다. 처음에 난 대답조차 할 수 없었다. 나는 일생 동안 많은 "
"다채로운 일들을 해왔다. 예를 들어 대규모의 의식 살인 사건 같은 것 말이다. 하지만 그건 위업은 아니다. 절대 아니지.\n"
"무엇이 결국 나를 동의하게 만들었을까? 호기심, 아마도. 그리고 허영심. 그 용은 내게 둘 모두를 불러일으키기에 충분한 정보를 주었다. "
"로바거그의 스폰은 심부에 잠들어 있었다. 광기의 구체가 그것을 에워싸고 있다. 많은 영웅들이 부름에 응했지만, 그 임무에는 실패했다. "
"그것은 내 실력에 대한 완벽한 도전처럼 들렸다.\n"
"게다가, 나는 오랫동안 한 가설 – 친절하고 고상한 영혼은 광기에 훨씬 더 민감하다는 것을 시험해 보고 싶었다 . 나는 종종 이 모든 "
"고결한 이상과 엄격한 도덕이 연약하고 거추장스러운 것이라고 확신해왔다. 얼마나 으스러지고, 얼마나 눈이 멀던지, 자신의 이기적인 충동을 "
"억누를 필요성, 즉 남들이 '선'이라고 부르는 것의 본질. 그것은 모두 외압과 내부의 모순에 의해 무너지고, 마음과 영혼은 황폐하게 "
"된다. '내가 뭘 두려워해야 하지?' 나는 내 자신에게 물었다. '내가, 양심의 괴로움에 시달려 본 적이 없는 내가, 언제나 냉혈한 "
"사고로 행동하는 내가?'\n"
"그래서 나는 드래곤의 제안에 동의하고, 어둠의 심부를 정복하기 위해 내려갔다.\n"
"나의 접근법은 이곳에 온 다른 영웅들과는 다르다. 무모하게 한 번의 공격으로 목표를 달성하기를 바라며 허둥지둥 앞으로 달려가는 것은 "
"의미가 없다. 나는 천천히 움직이며, 지하감옥의 마법의 배경을 연구하고, 지역 생물을 잡아 실험과 희생제물로 이용한다. 내가 예상했던 "
"것보다 훨씬 더 위험한 곳이라는 걸 인정해야겠다. 나는 벌써 두 번이나 목숨을 건 전투를 해야 했고, 기진맥진해졌다.\n"
"내가 연구하느라 바쁜 동안 괴물들을 쫓아낼 수 있는 조수가 필요할 것 같다. 내 실력이라면 쉽게 강력한 하인을 소환하여 속박할 수 있다. "
"하지만 이 정도로 충분할까?\n"
"최근에 생각해봤는데... 나처럼 이성적이고 냉혹한 악당들조차도 쉽게 미쳐버린다면? 우리에겐, 광기란 고결한 도피행각 중 쓸데없이 모든 "
"것을 거는 모험을 할 때 분명하게 나타나는 법이다. 여기 이 빌어먹을 던전까지 온 나의 성전처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text3_DaemonNote_name_String
msgctxt "317106e2-6112-4fd4-9e13-ba2df9fd5f0b"
msgid "Letter of the Captive"
msgstr "포로의 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text3_DaemonNote_text_String
msgctxt "1a823fd1-5ca3-45a1-961f-a2e59c5efccd"
msgid ""
"The paper is covered with large but neat letters.\n"
"\"I know some of you will read this, mortals. That is why I write in your "
"language. I learned it for a for another trick, but to you I will be plain.\n"
"Does the darkness frighten you? Do you feel alone? How many testaments to "
"death will you find before you leave your own?\n"
"This letter is mine.\n"
"I am your worst nightmare, mortal. A soul hunter, slave of the great "
"Horsemen. One who will take not only your lives, but also the thing that "
"comes after. Only the most daring wizard will risk the likes of me. It is "
"thanks to one such fool that I am caught in the Tenebrous Depths. He thinks "
"himself my master, and I have not yet dispelled his illusion. I belong only "
"to Abaddon and the Horsemen, though I lie now in shackles.\n"
"He knows much, my 'master', who calls himself the Captor. He has studied "
"every step, every magic aura in this dungeon, and says that he has found a "
"dire secret. He wrote this secret upon two magic rings, one of which he's "
"given me.\n"
"He is a strange, this mortal. I desired to steal his secret, and asked that "
"he teach me the mortal tongue. But alas, my ring possesses only half of the "
"secret, and makes no sense without its other, written on the Captor's ring.\n"
"He knows much, my 'master', but not all. He does not know that I have found "
"a way to free myself from his power. I only wait for him to leave me on "
"guard, as usual, and fall asleep. With just a little effort, the spell that "
"binds me will fall away. Your soul, 'master', will be a luxurious feast, "
"served just for me. But I will not enjoy it in full. Many others have died "
"in this dungeon, most by eternal imprisonment. They cannot leave, and keep "
"here endless vigil. The power of the Spawn is so great that it defies even "
"the sacred laws of Pharasma and the power of the other gods.\n"
"I am haunted by a strange thought, ever since I learned the secret to my "
"freedom. If I kill you, 'master', and then myself, then we will become "
"eternal prisoners of these Depths, just like the others. And even the great "
"Horsemen, the rulers of Abaddon and my true masters, will not be able to "
"reach me here.\n"
"I will remain forever here with you. So which of us is the Captor, and which "
"the Captive?\""
msgstr ""
"그 종이는 큼직하지만 깔끔한 글자로 적혀 있다.\n"
"\"필멸자들아, 너희 중 몇몇이 이것을 읽을 것을 알고 있다. 그게 내가 너희 언어로 글을 쓰는 이유다. 또 다른 속임수도 배웠지만, "
"나는 너희에게 솔직할 것이다.\n"
"어둠이 너희를 두렵게 하는가? 혼자라고 느끼나? 얼마나 많은 유언을 듣게 될까? 너 자신의 유언을 남길 때까지..\n"
" 이 편지는 내 유언이다.\n"
"난 네 최악의 악몽이다, 필멸자여. 위대한 기수의 노예인 영혼 사냥꾼이지. 너희의 목숨뿐만 아니라 그 뒤에 오는 자들의 것까지도 빼앗을 "
"자. 가장 대담한 마법사만이 나 같은 자를 위협할 수 있다. 내가 어둠의 심부에 붙잡힌 것은 그런 바보 한 사람 덕분이다. 그는 자신이 "
"내 주인이라고 생각하고, 나는 아직 그의 환상을 깨지 않았다. 나는 오직 아바돈과 호스맨에게만 속해 있다. 그러나 나는 지금 족쇄를 차고 "
"거짓말을 하고 있다.\n"
"그는 자신을 포획자라고 부르는 나의 '주인'에 대해 많이 알고 있다. 그는 이 지하 감옥의 모든 단계, 모든 마법의 아우라를 연구해왔고, "
"그는 끔찍한 비밀을 발견했다고 말한다. 그는 이 비밀을 두 개의 마법 반지에 적었는데, 그 중 하나는 나에게 주었다.\n"
"그는 이상한, 필멸자다. 나는 그의 비밀을 훔치고 싶어졌고, 내게 필멸자들의 언어를 가르쳐 달라고 부탁했다. 하지만 아아, 내 반지에는 "
"비밀의 반만 쓰여 있고, 다른 반지가 없으면 말이 안 된다, 그건 포획자의 반지에 쓰여 있다.\n"
"그는 나의 '주인'에 대해 많은 것을 알고 있다. 그러나 전부는 아니다. 그는 내가 그의 마력으로부터 벗어날 방법을 찾아냈다는 것을 "
"모른다. 나는 언제나처럼 그가 나를 보초로 세우고 잠들기를 기다릴 뿐이다. 조금만 노력하면 나를 묶은 마법은 사라질 것이다. 너의 영혼, "
"'주인님'은 나만을 위한 성찬이 될 것이다. 하지만 나는 그것을 온전히 즐기지 못할 것이다. 많은 다른 사람들이 이 지하감옥에서 죽었다. "
"대부분은 영원한 투옥에 의해서였다. 그들은 떠날 수 없고, 여기서 영원히 잠들수 없다. 로바거그의 스폰의 힘은 너무 커서 파라즈마의 "
"신성한 법칙과 다른 신들의 힘마저 거스른다.\n"
"나는 내 자유의 비밀을 알게 된 이후로 이상한 생각에 사로잡혀 있다. 만약 내가 '주인님' 당신을 죽이면, 그리고 나 자신을 죽이면, "
"우리는 다른 사람들과 마찬가지로 이 심부의 영원한 포로가 될 것이다. 그리고 아바돈의 통치자이며 나의 진정한 주인인 위대한 기수조차도 "
"이곳에서는 나와 연락이 닿지 않을 것이다.\n"
"나는 너희들과 함께 영원히 여기 있을 것이다. 그럼 이제 우리 중 누가 포획자이고, 누가 포로인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text4_MageNote_name_String
msgctxt "7e905066-d6e5-4f8c-9d19-b701f7bc480e"
msgid "The Captor's Death Note"
msgstr "포획자의 마지막 기록"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossDuo/Duo_Text4_MageNote_text_String
msgctxt "4e006e36-027c-499d-9f61-80f485a21db8"
msgid ""
"\"After two years in the Tenebrous Depths, I've come further than any before "
"me, and have nearly reached my goal – a passage to the place where the Spawn "
"slumbers. But I fear that I am lost. Not in the dungeon, no. In my own soul."
"\n"
"Two years I have spent in a place imbued with the magic of madness. I have "
"discovered all the strange and horrifying secrets of this place, and now I "
"write in a vain charade, as if anyone will ever read these words. I have "
"summoned a deadly beast from the Abyss, and kept it on a tight leash. It "
"waits in ravenous quiet for the chance to devour my soul. In my spare time "
"I've taught it to read and write in some of the languages I know. The "
"monster's horrible visage is the last thing I see before I sleep, and the "
"first thing I look upon when I awaken.\n"
"What are you contemplating, Zirhaische? When you first appeared inside the "
"summoning circle, when I tore you from the Astral Plane, you shook with rage "
"at the one who would dare subdue you. You were so different then. A wild "
"predator, with but a single thought – the hunting of souls. Now I see "
"something different in your eyes – something I cannot classify.\n"
"Perhaps this final riddle is the last thing keeping me alive. I am among the "
"greatest dark wizards of my age, and here I am, dying in fear.\n"
"Before I ventured into the Tenebrous Depths, I knew exactly who I was and "
"what I wanted. Hundreds of times, I've bathed my hands in blood, feeling no "
"pang of conscience. I've sacrificed a dozen babes, without a care. Many "
"among the hundreds I've killed appeared quite innocent.\n"
"But now... who am I now? Trapped within this crazy scheme, to save the "
"pitiful River Kingdoms. They will be destroyed in one fell swoop, should the "
"Spawn ever awaken. For two years I have wandered this darkness, finding "
"epitaphs of all the other would-be conquerors of the Tenebrous Depths. I "
"have studied each closely, and I scarcely even noticed when I first began "
"to... pity them...\n"
"And most absurd of all – yesterday I risked my life to save my daemon. It is "
"a slave, summoned for the exact purpose of protecting me! I saw Zirhaische "
"facing a horde of beasts from the depths, and I revealed myself to cover him "
"with a magic shield. It was our greatest fight yet in the Tenebrous Depths, "
"and it's a miracle that we both survived.\n"
"It is time for my confession. I recognize what a monster I once was, and "
"repent. I now go to face the Spawn, my head held high, and atone for the "
"evil that I have done.\n"
"But no. It will not be. Yes, I am but one step away from the end of the "
"nightmare from the Tenebrous Depths. But I refuse to awaken! If I cannot be "
"healed and become my former self again, then I will die before becoming "
"someone else.\n"
"Tomorrow I will lift the subduing spell from my daemon. Then we shall see, "
"Zirhaische, how deeply you crave your master's soul. I shall perish utterly, "
"but that will only be the beginning of my story. I will die with a smile on "
"my face, inviting the Spawn of Rovagug to awaken to a feast of blood.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어둠의 심부에서 2년을 보낸 뒤, 나는 내 이전의 누구보다도 더 멀리 왔고, 내 목표, 즉, 로바거그의 자식이 잠든 곳으로 가는 "
"통로에 거의 도달했다. 그러나 나는 길을 잃을까봐 두렵다. 지하감옥 속이 아니다, 아니고말고. 내 영혼의 길을 잃을까봐서.\n"
"광기의 마법이 물든 곳에서 2년을 보냈다. 나는 이 곳의 이상하고 소름끼치는 비밀들을 모두 밝혀냈고, 이제 나는 누구든 읽어주기라고 할 "
"것처럼 허영을 담은 가식으로 글을 쓴다. 심연의 치명적인 짐승 한 마리를 불러들여 단단히 속박해 두었다. 그것은 내 영혼을 집어삼킬 "
"기회를 갈망의 정적 속에서 기다린다. 여가 시간에 나는 내가 아는 몇몇 언어로 읽고 쓰기를 가르쳤다. 괴물의 끔찍한 모습은 내가 잠들기 "
"전에 마지막으로 보는 것이고, 내가 깨어날 때 가장 먼저 보는 것이다.\n"
"뭘 생각하고 있는 거냐, 지라이슈? 네가 처음 소환진 안에 나타났을 때, 내가 아스트랄 차원으로부터 널 찢어내어 데려왔을 때, 너는 감히 "
"너를 제압할 수 있는 자에게 분노로 치를 떨었지. 그때 너는 너무 달랐다. 영혼을 사냥한다는 오직 한 가지 생각만을 가진 야생의 "
"포식자였다. 이제 네 눈에서 뭔가 다른 것이 보인다. 그건 내가 구별할 수 없는 것이다.\n"
"어쩌면 이 마지막 수수께끼가 나를 살아있게 하는 마지막 보루인지도 모른다. 난 내 또래 최고의 어둠의 마법사 중 한 명이고, 여기서 난 "
"두려움에 죽어가고 있다.\n"
"어둠의 심부 속으로 모험을 하기 전에 ,나는 내가 누구며 무엇을 원하는지 정확히 알고 있었다. 수백 번이나 양심의 가책을 느끼지 않고 두 "
"손을 피로 씻은 적이 있었다. 난 아무 고민 없이 수십여 명의 아기들을 희생제물로 바쳤다. 내가 죽인 수백 명 중 많은 사람들이 더없이 "
"무고한 자들이었을 것이다.\n"
"하지만 지금은... 나는 지금 누구인가? 가엾은 강의 왕국들을 구하기 위해 이 미친 계획 안에 갇혔지. 로바거그의 스폰이 깨어나면 그들은 "
"단숨에 멸망할 것이다. 2년 동안 나는 어둠의 심부의 다른 모든 정복자들의 비문을 찾아 이 어둠을 헤멨다. 나는 각각을 자세히 "
"연구해왔고, 내가 처음으로 그들을 불쌍히 여기기... 시작했음을 거의 알아차리지 못했다. \n"
"그리고 무엇보다도 터무니없는 것은 어제 내가 다이몬을 구하기 위해 내 목숨을 걸었다는 사실이다. 그건 노예다. 날 보호하기 위해 소환된 "
"것일텐데! 나는 지라이슈가 심부의 짐승 떼를 마주친 것을 보고, 마법 방패로 그를 덮어주기 위해 내 모습을 드러내고 말았다. 어둠의 "
"심부에서 있었던 우리의 가장 대단한 싸움이었고, 우리 둘 다 살아남은 것은 기적이다.\n"
"내 고해의 시간이다. 한때 내가 얼마나 괴물이었는지 깨달았고 회개한다. 나는 이제 내 머리를 높이 쳐들고, 로바거그의 자식을 마주하러 "
"간다. 그리고 내가 저지른 악에 대해 속죄한다.\n"
"아, 그렇지 않다. 그렇지 않을 것이다. 그래, 나는 어둠의 심부로부터의 악몽의 끝에서 한 발짝 떨어져 있을 뿐이다. 그러나 나는 "
"깨어나길 거부한다! 내가 치유되지 못하고 다시 예전 모습으로 돌아갈 수 없다면 말이다. 그 땐 나는 다른 누군가가 되기 전에 죽음을 "
"택하겠다.\n"
"내일 나는 내 다이몬의 속박 마법을 해제할 것이다. 그러면 우리는 보게 될 것이다, 지라이슈, 네가 얼마나 주인의 영혼을 갈망하는지. "
"나는 완전히 죽겠지만, 그것은 내 이야기의 시작일 뿐이다. 로바거그의 자식을 불러 피의 향연에 눈을 뜨게 하고, 얼굴에 미소를 띤 채 "
"죽을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/Barks/Battle_end_String
msgctxt "6d90fbd4-1f01-45e8-b51c-8c50356c5bbc"
msgid "\"My service... is over. Farewell, Mother...\""
msgstr "\"제 봉사는... 끝났습니다. 안녕히, 어머니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/Barks/Battle_start_String
msgctxt "3ff0e309-fc58-4f05-a3e6-781b189ea352"
msgid "\"Mother Lamashtu! Accept blood that will be now shed, as sacrifice!\""
msgstr "\"어머니 라마슈투여 ! 지금 흘릴 피를 희생으로 받으소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_FinalItem_Name_String
msgctxt "e23f4f81-1956-4a72-8621-79fa7178eab3"
msgid "Robe of the Fallen Priestess"
msgstr "타락한 여사제의 로브"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_FinalItem_Text_String
msgctxt "9d594da6-8195-4d02-99bb-bc8947f84f27"
msgid ""
"An oath, of sorts, is written in blood upon the dirty robe. Although the "
"ancient fabric has grown feeble, the inscription has not worn or faded. Each "
"scarlet letter remains clearly legible.\n"
"\"I, Tioko Sakasama, renounce Desna and all her teachings, and return to the "
"fold of Mother Lamashtu. I swear I will serve her loyally to the end of my "
"days, and if the Mother so pleases, beyond my death as well. I repent of my "
"betrayal, and will gratefully accept any punishment.\n"
"In her mercy, Mother Lamashtu promises to fulfill one single wish. She will "
"deliver my friends from their madness – Rubgen Drass, Manush Vuvk, Smaragda "
"Ferdu, and Liafella Dmerre – and transport them from this dungeon where we "
"wander, trapped. Let them be taken to the place in Sandpoint where first we "
"met, safe and sound.\n"
"O Mother, reverently I deliver my soul into Your hands. I swear to do "
"everything in my power to destroy the abominable Spawn of Rovagug, which "
"corrupts this dungeon with its nightmares, and deliver its slaves to their "
"deaths – especially the silver dragon called Xelliren.\n"
"Tioko Sakasama, loyal child of Lamashtu\""
msgstr ""
"그 더러운 로브에는 일종의 선서가 피로 쓰여 있습니다. 고대의 천은 약해졌지만 거기 적힌 글은 마모되거나 퇴색되지 않았습니다. 각 주홍 "
"글자는 분명하게 또렷히 남아 있습니다.\n"
"\"나, 사카사마 티오코는 데즈나와 그녀의 모든 가르침을 포기하고, 어머니 라마슈투의 무리에게로 돌아간다. 내가 맹세하건대 나는 내 "
"생애를 마감할 때까지 그녀를 충실하게 섬길 것이다. 그리고 만약 어머니께서 그렇게 해서 기뻐하신다면, 내 죽음 이후에도 그러할 것이다. "
"나는 나의 배신을 뉘우치고, 어떠한 처벌도 감사히 받들겠노라.\n"
"어머니 라마슈투는 그녀의 자비로 한 가지 소원을 이루어 주시겠다고 약속하셨다. 그녀는 루브겐 드라스, 마누시 부브크, 스마라크다 페르두, "
"리아펠라 드메르 등 내 친구들을 그들의 광기로부터 구해주실 것이며, 우리가 방황하고 있는 이 지하감옥에서 그들을 데려오실 것이다. 그들을 "
"우리가 처음 만난 샌드 포인트의 장소로 안전하고도 온전하게 데려가실 것이다.\n"
"오 어머니, 경건하게 내 영혼을 당신의 손에 바칩니다. 나는 악몽으로 이 지하감옥을 타락시키는 가공할 로바거그의 자식과, 노예들을 "
"죽음으로 몰아넣는 자들, 특히 젤리런이라는 실버드래곤을 파멸시키기 위해 내 모든 힘을 다 할 것을 맹세합니다.\n"
"라마슈투의 충성스런 자녀, 사카사마 티오코.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text1_TornBook_Name_String
msgctxt "76b384c6-8a65-4044-9d4b-b4b8e86fc05a"
msgid "Book of the Fallen Magus"
msgstr "타락한 메이거스의 책"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text1_TornBook_Text_String
msgctxt "1707da94-8278-441f-a2fb-ae9a90fb8b0b"
msgid ""
"A torn cover is all that remains of this spellbook. A scratched-out name can "
"barely be discerned on the front: 'Liafella Dmerre'. A penciled portrait of "
"a five-member party of adventurers has been pasted to the back, and a title "
"in delicate calligraphy written below: \"Sandpoint Scouts\". In the "
"foreground, a half-elf woman with a scimitar and a human with a bow smile "
"sweetly, their arms wrapped around each other's shoulders. Beside them, a "
"halfling woman, identified by the caption as Smaragda, flashes an ironical "
"grin. A line of vials hangs at her belt, and a portable laboratory upon her "
"back. A dwarf, Rubgen, stands proudly to the side, an axe as large as "
"himself resting heavily on his armored shoulder. Behind the rest stands a "
"woman wearing a robe decorated with Desna's butterfly. She leans upon her "
"staff, as if self-conscious of her presence. The name beneath reads Tioko. "
"Her face is marked with a pox.\n"
"The drawing has been angrily vandalized. All but the half-elf have their "
"eyes scratched out. A scrawling hand has written beside the dwarf, \"Shut up "
"about your treasures already! YOU'RE PISSING ME OFF!\" Next to the archer: "
"\"Keep your trap shut or a black eye will be the least of your troubles!\" "
"Next to the alchemist: \"Eat with the others, fool! No one cares about you "
"enough to poison you!\" The priestess received the greatest abuse: the "
"book's vandal wrote with such passion that the quill tore the paper: \"BITCH"
"! You cast another spell on me, and I'll break both your arms!!\""
msgstr ""
"이 주문책의 남은 것은 찢어진 덮개뿐입니다. 긁힌 이름은 앞면에서는 거의 알아볼 수 없습니다: '리아펠라 드메르'. 연필로 그린 모험가 "
"5명으로 구성된 일행의 초상화가 뒷장에 붙여졌고, 아래에 쓰여진 섬세한 글씨체의 제목은 \"샌드포인트 정찰대\"입니다. 앞면에는 시미터를 "
"든 하프엘프 여자와 활을 든 인간이 서로 어깨를 감싸안고 상냥하게 미소짓습니다. 그들 옆에는 주석으로 스마라그다라고 써 있는 하플링 "
"여자가 의미심장한 미소를 짓습니다. 그녀의 허리띠에는 한 줄의 유리병들이 매달려 있고, 등에는 휴대용 실험기재가 달려 있습니다. 드워프 "
"루브겐은 자신만큼 큰 도끼를 갑옷 어깨장식에 무겁게 얹혀 놓은 채로 옆에 당당히 서 있습니다. 뒤에는 데즈나의 나비 장식을 한 여자가 서 "
"있습니다. 그녀는 마치 자의식이 강한듯 지팡이에 몸을 기울이고 있습니다. 밑에는 티오코라는 이름이 쓰여 있습니다. 그녀의 얼굴에는 "
"수두자국이 났습니다.\n"
"그 그림은 화가 난 듯 훼손되어 있습니다. 하프엘프를 제외한 나머지 사람들은 모두 눈이 긁혔습니다. 드워프 옆에는 휘갈겨 쓴 손글씨가 "
"쓰여 있습니다, \"했던 보물 이야긴 좀 닥쳐! 넌 날 화나게 하고 있어!\" 궁수의 옆에는 \"덫을 놓지 않으면 눈 한짝이 멍드는 "
"정도는 골칫거리 축에도 못 들게 될 거다!\" 알케미스트 옆에는: \"같이 좀 먹어, 멍청아! 아무도 너 따위를 구태여 독살하지 않아!\""
" 여사제는 가장 큰 학대를 받았습니다. 그 책의 훼손자가 열정적으로 휘갈긴 나머지 종이가 찢어졌습니다. \"암캐년! 나한테 또 주문을 "
"걸면, 두 팔을 다 부러뜨려 버릴거야!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text2_Lab_Name_String
msgctxt "bab55252-c0e5-43c1-88e4-82ec142359ce"
msgid "Vials of the Fallen Alchemist"
msgstr "타락한 알케미스트의 시약병들"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text2_Lab_Text_String
msgctxt "4c4af1ce-3a9e-485a-b51a-29d03c39c50a"
msgid ""
"A portable alchemist's laboratory. The name of the owner is engraved on a "
"copper plate: \"Smaragda Ferdu\". The contents of the vials has long "
"evaporated, but some labels are still legible – and rather long.\n"
"\"Antidote to aconite root – though they finally seem to have run out of it."
"\"\n"
"\"Antidote to black lotus extract – yesterday they tried to put some in my "
"bowl. Where could they have got it from?!\"\n"
"\"Antidote to barbadzu mucus concentrate. Praise Desna that barbadzu do not "
"live here. – But Liafella has become so enraged that I wouldn't be surprised "
"if she turns into one of them herself. A concentrated one.\"\n"
"\"Add 3 drops to water from ANY water source. If someone else brought the "
"water, then 9 drops – and still don't drink it!\"\n"
"\"Protection from spells. I don't know what Tioko actually meant to cast on "
"me... (A cure from insanity? Yeah, right! I'm the only sane one left in this "
"party!) In any case, she won't be getting another chance.\"\n"
"\"Smelling salts for Manush. He's so pale, as if he's about to faint! I "
"wonder what has frightened him so much.\"\n"
"\"Potion of numbness. If Rubgen doesn't shut up about his treasures, I'll "
"dump this in his flask.\"\n"
"\"Arsenic. I'll drink it when I've finally had enough of these fools, and "
"all their ridiculous attempts to poison me.\""
msgstr ""
"휴대용 연금술사의 실험기재. 동판에는 주인 이름이 새겨져 있습니다: \"스마라그다 페르두\" 시약병의 내용물은 오래 전에 증발되었지만, "
"일부 라벨은 여전히 읽을 수 있고 다소 깁니다.\n"
"\"부자 뿌리에 대한 해독제 – 그것들은 결국 다 떨어진 것 같다.\"\n"
"\"검은 연꽃 추출물에 대한 해독제 - 어제 그걸 내 약사발에 몇 개를 넣으려고 했다. 어디서 구했더라?!\"\n"
"\"바르바쯔 점액 농축액에 대한 해독제. 바르바쯔가 여기 살지 않는 걸 데즈나께 찬양하라. – 하지만 리아펠라는 너무 격분해서 그녀 "
"자신이 그것들 중 한 명으로 변해도 놀라지 않을 것이다. 농축액 한 개.\"\n"
"\"어떤 곳의 물이든 물에 3방울을 넣을 것. 만약 다른 사람이 물을 가지고 왔다면, 9방울을 넣을 것 – 그리고 아직 마시지 말 것!\""
"\n"
"\"마법으로부터의 보호. 티오코가 실제로 나에게 무슨 주문을 걸려던 건지 모르겠다... (정신병 치료제? 와, 그래! 이 파티에서 나만 "
"제정신이네!) 여하튼 그녀에게 또 다른 기회가 주어지진 않을 거다.\"\n"
"\"마누쉬를 위한 냄새나는 소금. 그는 기절할 것처럼, 너무 창백해! 무엇 때문에 그렇게 겁을 먹었는지 궁금하다.\"\n"
"\"둔감의 물약. 만약 루브겐이 그의 보물들에 대해 입을 다물지 않는다면, 나는 이걸 그의 약병에 부어 버릴 것이다.\"\n"
"\"비소. 이 바보들과 놈들의 날 독살하려는 어처구니없는 시도가 선을 넘으면 난 그걸 마시겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text3_Map_Name_String
msgctxt "e99e4f33-da78-4aa3-9a60-dcf20ffa022c"
msgid "Map of the Fallen Fighter"
msgstr "타락한 전사의 지도"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text3_Map_Text_String
msgctxt "007bd0eb-c915-4751-9c7e-f8192f4f83ca"
msgid ""
"A large-scale, color map of Avistan, labeled: \"Property of Rubgen Drass! If "
"you want one like it, then buy one for yourself!\" It is covered with "
"inscriptions, records of their party's adventures:\n"
"\"Sandpoint forever! Where it all began!\"\n"
"\"This is where Liafella joined us. It's so much more fun together!\"\n"
"\"Troll treasures! That was a fiery party!\"\n"
"\"Our amazing find had us finally accepted into the Pathfinder Society. I "
"cannot write down what it was!\"\n"
"\"Here, a swarm of bugs gnawed my legs to the bone. Thanks to Tioko and her "
"prayers, or I'd surely be dead! I do hate swarming things! Except for "
"fireflies – they're nice.\"\n"
"There's a map of the dungeon scratched on the reverse side, but it's messy, "
"chaotic and barely legible. It boasts similar inscriptions, made by the same "
"hand – though the handwriting has become coarse and unmeasured.\n"
"\"An underground lake of pure water. I'm telling you, Smaragda, it's pure! "
"Calm down, I drank it myself! No one wants to poison you!\"\n"
"\"The treasure must be here.\"\n"
"\"Or here. Or at worst – there.\"\n"
"\"Here, Manush turned around and ran off screaming. We spent three hours "
"looking for him! Don't panic, my friend!\"\n"
"\"I still believe we're going to find it! Tioko can whine as much as she "
"wants, but I'm not turning back. Whatever she says, the treasure exists, and "
"I'm going to prove it!\"\n"
"\"Here Liafella tried to kick me, but only hurt her foot. I'm not giving up, "
"no matter what!\"\n"
"\"Onwards, my friends! Onwards! The treasure is here, I know it! And I'm "
"going to lead you to it! We've been through so much together! – Can we "
"really give up now?\""
msgstr ""
"아비스탄의 대축적 채색 지도에는 다음과 같은 라벨이 붙어 있습니다: \"루브겐 드라스의 것! 이런 게 탐나면 직접 하나 사!\" 그것은 "
"그들 일행이 겪은 모험의 기록들로 덮여 있다.\n"
"\"샌드포인트여 영원하라! 그 모든 것이 시작된 곳!\"\n"
"\"여기가 리아펠라가 합류한 곳. 함께 하는 게 훨씬 더 재미있다!\"\n"
"\"트롤의 보물들! 불꽃 튀는 파티였지!\"\n"
"\"우리의 놀라운 발견은 마침내 패스파인더 협회의 인정을 받았다. 그게 뭐였는지 여기 쓸 수는 없다!\"\n"
"\"여기서는 벌레 떼가 내 다리를 뼛속까지 갉아먹었다. 티오코와 그녀의 기도가 아니었으면 난 틀림없이 죽었을 것이다! 난 우글거리는 "
"것들이 정말 싫어! 반딧불만 빼고 – 개네들은 착하지.\"\n"
"뒷면에 긁힌 지하감옥의 지도가 있지만 지저분하고 혼란스러우며 거의 알아볼 수 없습니다. 글씨가 거칠어지고 읽을 수없지만 같은 손으로 쓴 "
"비슷한 글씨로 보입니다.\n"
"\"정수로 된 지하 호수. 정말이야, 스마라그다, 진짜 깨끗해! 진정해, 내가 직접 마셨어! 아무도 널 독살하려 하지 않아!\"\n"
"\"보물이 여기 있을 거야.\"\n"
"\"아니면 여기에. 아니면 최악의 경우 – 저기에.\"\n"
"\"여기다, 마누쉬는 돌아서서 비명을 지르며 달아났다. 우리는 그를 찾는데 세 시간을 보냈다! 당황하지 마, 친구!\"\n"
"\"난 아직도 우리가 찾을 수 있다고 믿는다! 티오코는 얼마든지 칭얼거릴 수 있지만, 난 돌아가지 않을 거야. 그녀가 무슨 말을 하든 그 "
"보물은 존재하며, 나는 그것을 증명할 것이다!\"\n"
"\"여기서 리아펠라는 나를 걷어차려고 했지만 발만 다쳤다. 무슨 일이 있어도 포기하지 않겠다!\"\n"
"\"앞으로, 친구들! 앞으로! 보물이 여기 있어, 난 알아! 그리고 내가 널 그 곳으로 인도하겠다! 우리는 많은 일을 겪었어! – "
"이제와서 포기한다는게 정말 가능할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text4_Letter_Name_String
msgctxt "48def80c-67c1-4690-891a-3bde103f67f5"
msgid "Letter of the Fallen Ranger"
msgstr "타락한 레인저의 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossFallenPriest/FallenPriest_Text4_Letter_Text_String
msgctxt "491f8961-ea0b-488b-9bd0-09c43205e974"
msgid ""
"A trembling hand has scratched these words upon a soiled sheet of paper:\n"
"\"If you are reading this, then I am surely dead. Please deliver this letter "
"to any Pathfinder lodge, or if that is impossible, to any temple of any "
"deity. Do not allow my death to be in vain!\n"
"My name is Manush Vuvk, and I have been a member of the Pathfinder Society "
"for twelve years. I joined a team of so-called adventurers without having "
"the slightest idea what an abyss of secret wickedness they concealed behind "
"their valiant facades.\n"
"The party is led by a certain Tioko Sakasama. She presents herself as a "
"priestess of Desna, but takes no effort to hide the fact that she once "
"served Lamashtu, and still bears the stamp of her true master upon her face. "
"Why did she have to bring us to this accursed dungeon? It's clear as day! "
"She's preparing a bloody ritual sacrifice. I still don't know who among our "
"party will hold the dagger beside her, and who may lie on the altar next to "
"me.\n"
"But Liafella Dmerre is another servant of evil. Of that there can be no "
"doubt. She and Tioko constantly argue, and their seething spite unites them "
"like nothing else could. Liafella struck me for no reason, and would have "
"killed me for certain, if Tioko hadn't used a spell to paralyze her. Of "
"course, the sacrifice must remain unscathed until the ritual!\n"
"Rubgen Drass is also an apparent cultist. With the tenacity of a maniac, he "
"keeps dragging us further and further into the fetid depths, promising "
"countless treasures – though by now, none in the party believe him... And no "
"one can answer the simple question: why did we come here?\n"
"The only one among them who might not be a dark cultist is Smaragda Ferdu. "
"Like me, she trusts no one, and keeps to herself. She doesn't eat from the "
"common pot, and keeps mumbling something about poison. Could this mean that "
"she's meant to be a sacrifice, like me? Or is she their chief surgeon? Does "
"she feign to earn my trust? Is it all to end in betrayal?\n"
"I have no hope of escaping this dungeon alive. But I cannot accept the "
"atrocities that these three or four villains are committing, to glorify "
"their evil goddess. It must be stopped! Whosoever reads this note, find them "
"and punish them. Do not allow them to discredit the good name of the "
"Pathfinder Society!\""
msgstr ""
"떨리는 손으로 더럽혀진 종이 위에 다음과 같은 말이 할퀴듯 적혀있습니다.\n"
"\"당신이 이 글을 읽고 있다면, 나는 틀림없이 죽었을 것이다. 이 편지를 어느 패스파인더 지부나, 그것이 불가능할 경우, 아무 신의 "
"신전에라도 전해주었으면 한다. 내 죽음이 헛되지 않도록!\n"
"내 이름은 마누시 부브크이고 12년 동안 패스파인더 협회의 회원이었다. 나는 소위 모험가들로 이루어진 팀에 합류했는데, 그들이 용맹스러운 "
"면모 뒤에 얼마나 은밀하고 사악한 심연을 감췄는지 전혀 알 수 없었다.\n"
" 파티는 사카사마 티오코라는 사람이 이끌고 있다. 그녀는 자신을 데즈나의 사제라고 내세우지만, 한때 라마슈투에게 봉사했던 사실을 "
"감추려고도 않고, 여전히 자신의 진정한 주인의 낙인을 얼굴에 간직하고 있다. 왜 그녀는 우리를 이 저주받은 지하감옥으로 데려왔을까? 그건 "
"대낮처럼 훤하다! 그녀는 피비린내 나는 의식 제물을 준비하고 있다. 우리 일행 중에 누가 그녀 옆에 단검을 들고 있을지, 그리고 나 "
"다음에는 누가 제단에 누워 있을지 나는 아직도 알수 없다.\n"
"그러나 리아펠라 드메르는 또 다른 악의 하수인이다. 거기에는 의심의 여지가 없다. 그녀와 티오코는 끊임없이 다투고, 그들의 들끓는 독설은 "
"다른 어떤 것도 할 수 없는 것처럼 그들을 뭉치게 한다. 리아펠라는 이유없이 나를 폭행했고, 만약 티오코가 그녀를 마비시키기 위해 마법을 "
"쓰지 않았다면 확실히 나를 죽였을 것이다. 물론, 제물은 의식의 때까지 다치면 안 되니까!\n"
"루브겐 드라스 역시 명백한 광신자이다. 미치광이 같은 집념으로 그는 무수한 보물들을 약속하면서 우리를 점점 더 악취가 진동하는 깊숙한 "
"곳으로 끌고 가고 있다. 하지만 이제는 파티 중 누구도 그를 믿지 않는다... 그리고 아무도 이 간단한 질문에 대답할 수 없다: 우리가 "
"왜 여기에 왔는가?\n"
"그들 중 어둠의 광신자가 아닐 수도 있는 유일한 사람은 스마라그다 페르두다. 나처럼, 그녀는 아무도 믿지 않고, 혼자 떨어져 지낸다. "
"그녀는 공용 냄비에서 음식을 떠먹지 않고, 독약에 대해 계속 뭐라고 중얼거린다. 나처럼 그녀가 희생양이 될 운명이라는 뜻일까? 아니면 "
"그녀가 그들의 수석 외과의인가? 그녀는 내 신뢰를 얻기 위해 시늉을 하는 건가? 이 모든 게 다 배신으로 끝나는 건가?\n"
"나는 이 지하감옥을 살아서 탈출할 가망이 없다. 그러나 나는 이 서너 명의 악당들이 그들의 사악한 여신을 영화롭게 하려고 저지르고 있는 "
"만행을 받아들일 수 없다. 그건 반드시 멈춰야 한다! 누가 이 쪽지를 읽든, 그들을 찾아서 처치하라. 그들이 패스파인더 협회의 명성을 "
"더럽히지 못하게 하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/Barks/Battle_end_String
msgctxt "f0eee965-3c60-4e75-9466-bf72814b0138"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, I'm... I'm not an emperor! But who am I? Then again... what does it "
"matter now?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 나... 난 황제가 아니야! 하지만 난 누구지? 그리고 또... 지금 그게 무슨 상관이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/Barks/Battle_start_String
msgctxt "3d65bace-652a-460a-a9b2-af6fd602a667"
msgid "\"Kneel, servant! Kiss the ground before a living god!\""
msgstr "\"무릎을 꿇어라, 하인이여! 살아있는 신의 안전에서 땅에 입맞춰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_FinalItem_Name_String
msgctxt "52ffbd58-88df-44e1-86db-ae0bb1df9c66"
msgid "Shield of the Weary Traveler"
msgstr "지친 여행자의 방패"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_FinalItem_Text_String
msgctxt "4e170efb-cc2e-48d0-8322-d1484469dda7"
msgid ""
"There are words scribbled on the inside of the shield.\n"
"\"REMEMBER WHO YOU ARE.\n"
"This dungeon creates illusions of delight. In them you are a divine emperor "
"of the fey world – and I don't judge you for enjoying this. But ALWAYS, "
"ALWAYS COME BACK! You are not a deity. You are Ball Zess, a boy from Oppara. "
"Remember how you ran naked from the dogs! Remember how you were preparing to "
"confess your love to a girl, when you accidentally blew up her pet turtle. "
"Remember what a fool you made of yourself before the academics in Kaer Maga. "
"YOU ARE NOT WITHOUT FAULT.\n"
"Remember who you are, or the illusions will devour you, just as they did "
"that pathetic dragon who imagines himself the guardian and protector of this "
"place. All he's ever done is feed heroes to the Abyss. You must find a way "
"back up, and punch him in his silver snout for what he's done to you and so "
"many others.\n"
"YOU MUST FIND A WAY BACK UP. Maybe not right now, but eventually. DO NOT "
"FORGET.\""
msgstr ""
"방패 안쪽에 갈겨쓴 글씨가 있습니다.\n"
"\"네가 누구인지 기억하라.\n"
"이 던전은 기쁨의 환상을 만들어낸다. 그 안에서 너는 태초 세계의 신성한 황제다. 그리고 나는 네가 이것을 즐긴다고 그걸로 널 비난하지 "
"않는다. 하지만 항상, 언제나 돌아와야 한다! 넌 신이 아니야. 너는 오파라의 아들, 볼 제스다. 네가 개들로부터 발가벗고 도망쳤던 걸 "
"기억해라! 여자애에게 사랑 고백을 준비하던 중 우연히 그 애의 애완 거북이를 날려버린 것을 기억해라. 카에르 마가의 학자들 앞에서 얼마나 "
"바보같이 굴었었는지 기억해라. 너는 흠 없는 자가 아니다.\n"
"네가 누군지 기억해라, 그렇지 않으면 환상이 너를 집어삼킬 것이다, 마치 자신이 이 곳의 수호자이자 보호자라 망상하는 그 한심한 "
"드래곤에게 그들이 한 것처럼 말이다. 그가 한 모든 짓은 영웅들을 심연에 먹인 것이다. 너는 반드시 다시 돌아갈 방법을 찾아야 하고, "
"그가 너를 비롯한 많은 다른 사람들에게 한 짓에 대해 그의 은빛 주둥이에 주먹을 날려야 한다.\n"
"너는 반드시 다시 돌아갈 방법을 찾아야 한다. 지금은 아닐지 몰라도 결국엔 그렇게 될 거야. 잊지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text1_Magazine_Name_String
msgctxt "e2e4df65-8936-4b06-9972-dfea1572d1b8"
msgid "Interview with the Weary Traveler"
msgstr "지친 여행자와의 인터뷰"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text1_Magazine_Text_String
msgctxt "cd78f0bf-764e-4a39-81b1-b98efc3530b7"
msgid ""
"This ragged issue of the popular magazine Absalom Reporter features a gnome "
"on the cover, colorfully dressed and smiling. The artist drew him in a "
"haughty pose: his foot rests on the skull of a great reptile, and he proudly "
"holds aloft a gem the size of his own head. In bold letters, the caption "
"reads: \"An exclusive interview with famous treasure hunter Barandaball "
"Zesselwand!\"\n"
"\"- Sir Zesselwand...\n"
"- Ha ha, why the formality? Please, just call me Ball.\n"
"- All right. Ball. You've recently returned from a long voyage to Garund...\n"
"- Well, not all of Garund. I mostly spent my time in Ossirion and Katapesh, "
"making short trips to Geb, Nex, and Jalmeray.\n"
"- What was the aim of your expedition?\n"
"- That's a fine question! As Desna is my witness, I've asked myself many "
"times, 'what the devil made me go there?' – Especially each time I "
"miraculously managed to extricate myself from yet another predicament... But "
"you know what? The answer to the question is quite irrelevant! Yes, that's "
"right! Let's say that initially I only intended to confirm a certain "
"hypothesis regarding the architecture of pyramids. But before I even reached "
"them, I was lucky to awaken a sphinx who had been sleeping in the sand for "
"centuries – and escape with my skin intact. I discussed philosophy with an "
"oracle of Wadjet, witnessed the rise of the triple sun, tasted nine new "
"dishes, four drinks and two new kinds of tobacco. The pyramid hypothesis "
"turned out to be utter nonsense in the end, but at the moment I learned of "
"this, I was already busily investigating the atrocities of a secret cult "
"that was attempting to resurrect the remains of some ancient monster in the "
"middle of Sothis... As you see, the nominal aim of the voyage scarcely "
"matters at all!\n"
"- Forgive the blunt question, but rumor has it that despite your life of "
"adventure, even you couldn't avoid the eternal bane of gnomes. – The "
"Bleaching...\n"
"- What nonsense! Haha, Bleaching? Me?! That's nothing more than the wishful "
"thinking of those determined to be my adversaries. The southern sun bleached "
"my hair, and as soon as they caught sight of this, the rumors started "
"flying! Make no mistake, if anything kills me, it will be another adventure –"
" and decidedly not a loss of the will to live!\n"
"- That's good to hear! So what are your plans for the future?\n"
"- I will go North, to the River Kingdoms. I've been having very strange "
"dreams lately... I won't share all the details yet, to maintain the "
"intrigue. But if even a part of them is true – then when I return, you'll be "
"printing a tale of incredible adventure!\n"
"- Thank you for the interview, and good luck in your coming journey!\n"
"- Thank you as well!\""
msgstr ""
"인기잡지 압살롬 리포터의 이 너덜너덜한 책은 색색의 옷을 입고 웃고 있는 한 노움을 표지모델로 다뤘습니다. 화가는 그를 거만한 자세로 "
"그렸습니다: 그의 발은 거대한 파충류의 두개골에 놓여있고, 그는 머리 크기만한 보석을 자랑스럽게 들고 있습니다. 굵은 글씨로 된 자막에는 "
"다음과 같이 적혀 있습니다: \"유명한 보물 사냥꾼 바란다볼 제셀완드와의 독점 인터뷰!\"\n"
"\"- 제셀완드 경...\n"
"- 하하, 왠 격식인가. 제발, 그냥 볼이라고 불러주게.\n"
"- 알겠습니다. 공. 최근에 가룬드로의 긴 항해에서 돌아오셨군요...\n"
"- 글쎄, 가룬드가 전부는 아니지. 나는 주로 오시리온과 카타페쉬에서 시간을 보냈어. 게브, 넥스, 잘메레이에도 짧게 다녀왔고.\n"
"- 원정 목적이 무엇이었나요?\n"
"- 좋은 질문이야! 데즈나가 내 증인인 만큼, 나는 스스로에게 '도대체 나를 그곳에 가게 한 것은 무엇인가?'라고 자문해 – 특히 "
"기적적으로 곤경에서 빠져나올 때마다 되묻곤 하지. 그런데 그거 아나? 그 질문에 대한 대답은 전혀 중요치 않아! 그래, 맞아. 처음에 "
"나는 피라미드의 건축에 관한 어떤 가설을 확인하려고 했을 뿐이었지. 하지만 내가 거기 도착하기도 전에, 나는 운좋게도 수 세기 동안 모래 "
"속에서 잠을 자고 있던 스핑크스를 깨우고, 털 끝 하나 안다치고 탈출했네. 나는 와젯의 예언자와 철학을 논했고, 세 개의 태양이 떠오르는 "
"것을 봤고, 아홉 가지 새로운 음식, 네 가지 음료와 두 가지 새로운 종류의 담배를 맛봤어. 피라미드 가설은 결국 완전한 허튼소리로 "
"판명됐지만, 이 사실을 알았을 때, 나는 이미 소티스 한가운데에 있는 어떤 고대 괴물의 유해를 부활시키려는 비밀 컬트의 만행을 바쁘게 "
"조사하고 있었지... 보다시피, 그 항해에 대한 명목상의 목표는 전혀 중요하지 않았어!\n"
"- 직설적인 질문을 용서하세요, 당신의 모험의 인생에도 불구하고, 당신조차도 노움들의 영원한 골칫거리인 백화를 피할 수 없었다는 소문이 "
"있어요.\n"
"- 말도 안 되는 소리! 하하, 백화? 내가?! 그건 나의 적수가 되기로 결심한 사람들의 희망적인 생각에 지나지 않아. 남쪽 태양이 내 "
"머리를 탈색시켰고, 그들이 이걸 보자마자 소문이 돌기 시작했네! 실수하지 말라고, 만약 뭔가가 나를 죽게 한다면, 그것은 또 다른 모험이 "
"될 거야– 그리고 결정적으로 살 의욕을 잃는 건 아니지!\n"
"- 그거 반가운 소리군요! 앞으로의 계획은 무엇인가요?\n"
"- 난 북부로, 강의 왕국들로 갈 거야. 요즘 아주 이상한 꿈을 꾸고 있는데... 모든 세부사항은 재미를 위해 아직 공유하지 않겠네. "
"하지만 그들 중 일부라도 사실이라면 – 내가 돌아왔을 때, 자네는 믿을 수 없는 모험담을 인쇄하고 있겠지!\n"
"- 인터뷰에 감사드리며, 다가오는 여정에 행운을 빕니다!\n"
"- 나도 고맙네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text2_Cup_Name_String
msgctxt "2c9afe42-1533-402f-b437-ed96c36b37da"
msgid "Mug of the Weary Traveler"
msgstr "지친 여행자의 머그잔"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text2_Cup_Text_String
msgctxt "1cfc08fd-2068-495d-beca-3c6456c598a7"
msgid ""
"The name of its former owner – Ball Zess – is embossed on the handle of this "
"old travel mug. It's dented, covered with mud, and some stinky gunk is dried "
"to the bottom. But as soon as you touch it, your mind is overwhelmed with "
"bright, euphoric visions. The mug transforms into a golden cup, filled with "
"fragrant wine. A gemstone inscription encircles the rim: \"Divine Emperor "
"Barandaball Zesselwand, the First and Only\". You hear crystalline laughter "
"and merry song, and frankincense drifts upon the air of violins. Forms of "
"giant flowers surround you, and palaces of jewels and shining towers. This "
"can only be the world of the fey. Figures of their peculiar faces rise in "
"songs of praise for their divine overlord."
msgstr ""
"이전 소유주인 볼 제스의 이름이 이 오래된 여행용 머그잔의 손잡이에 양각되어 있습니다. 움푹 패이고 진흙으로 덮여 있고, 어떤 냄새나는 "
"오물이 바닥에 말라붙어 있습니다. 그러나 그것을 만지는 순간 당신의 마음은 밝고 행복감 넘치는 환상으로 압도됩니다. 머그잔은 향긋한 "
"와인이 가득 담긴 황금잔으로 변합니다. 테두리에 보석 비문이 새겨져 있습니다: \"신성 제국의 황제 바란더볼 제셀완드, 최초이자 유일한 "
"자\" 당신은 수정같이 투명한 웃음과 흥겨운 노래를 들을 수 있고, 유향은 바이올린의 소리를 타고 흐릅니다. 거대한 꽃의 형태들이 당신을 "
"둘러싸고, 보석과 빛나는 탑들의 궁전들이 당신을 둘러싸고 있습니다. 이것은 오직 태초 세계에서만 가능한 일입니다. 독특한 생김새를 가진 "
"인물들이 그들의 신성한 대군주를 향한 찬미의 노래와 함께 나타납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text3_Diary_Name_String
msgctxt "45b621b1-fca4-4c63-b921-43ff0ec87694"
msgid "Diary of the Weary Traveler"
msgstr "지친 여행자의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text3_Diary_Text_String
msgctxt "50447fda-3d2d-460c-a523-1362ebe17aca"
msgid ""
"A well-worn diary with a leather cover. The owner's name is embossed in "
"tarnished silver: \"Ball Zess\".\n"
"\"In youth, our lives are a series of novel impressions. Your first spell, "
"the first kiss, the first taste of victory, the first adventure you set off "
"on, without stopping to ask permission – and the first triumphant return! "
"But then you mature and grow accustomed to every feeling. What was once "
"novel has become mundane, and you reach a plateau. – It's all rather boring, "
"but at least you can pass through life with confidence... But it won't last "
"long. Your well-trodden path begins to circle and descend. It is the "
"beginning of old age – another time of new impressions. The first cracking "
"joint, the first pang in your heart, your failing eyes, your thinning hair. "
"Yes, our mortal bodies are traitors all, just waiting to stab us in the "
"back... But what's truly scary are the other firsts.\n"
"The first funeral of someone you cannot lose. The first compromise with "
"one's conscience. The first friend to say, 'I've no wish to see you again.' "
"The first student who abandons you, or buries his talent, or dies in his "
"prime. – Or turns your lessons to evil ends.\n"
"The first time you look at your travel bag, and desire to throw it into the "
"fire, and leap in behind it.\n"
"I thought the Bleaching couldn't touch me. Boredom? In this beautiful world "
"where there's always a place for new adventures? Impossible! Or so I "
"believed. But it snuck up upon me, from where I least expected. My Bleaching "
"began when my soul grew numb from the number of scars it bears. The body "
"could be rejuvenated by magic. – But where can you hide when you disgust "
"yourself? There's only one thing left, to do as the fey do: turn your heart "
"into a gemstone, on which the past can leave no mark. You'll never change, "
"and remember nothing, but continue in bliss forever... It must be a "
"wonderful existence, though it may appear monstrous from the outside. But "
"the saddest part is this: even if one of the Eldest would come to me and "
"offer a return to the First World, that I may be careless and free... And "
"were I to agree, then the 'me' I am now – this old vagabond, sick of himself "
"– he will be no more. It would be just another death – albeit a pleasant "
"one. I cannot win this game. Even if I somehow slip Pharasma's grasp, I will "
"never trick oblivion.\n"
"And this is as it should be. It means that sooner or later I will escape "
"from the disgusting old man I call myself.\""
msgstr ""
"가죽 커버를 씌운 낡은 일기장. 소유주의 이름은 변색된 은색으로 양각되어 있습니다: \"볼 제스\".\n"
"\"젊은 시절, 우리의 삶은 참신한 인상의 연속이다. 당신의 첫 주문, 첫 키스, 승리의 첫 맛, 당신이 처음으로 출발했던 모험, 허락을 "
"구하며 멈추지 않는, 첫 번째 승리의 귀환! 하지만 그때 그대는 성숙해지고 모든 감정에 익숙해진다. 한때 새로웠던 것이 일상화되어 "
"정체된다. – 모든 것이 다소 지루하지만, 적어도 자신감 있게 삶을 살아갈 수 있다... 하지만 오래가지는 않을 것이다. 당신의 잘 "
"다져진 길이 구불치며 내려오기 시작한다. 그것이 노년의 시작이다 – 새로운 인생의 또 다른 시기지. 첫 번째 삐걱거리는 관절, 가슴의 첫 "
"번째 통증, 침침한 눈, 가늘어지는 머리카락. 그래, 우리의 인체는 모두 배신자다. 우리의 등을 찌르려고 기다리고 있지... 하지만 정말 "
"무서운 것은 다른 첫 번째들이다.\n"
"보낼 수 없는 사람의 첫 장례식. 양심과의 첫 번째 타협. '다신 만나고 싶지 않아'라고 말해버린 첫 번째 친구. 당신을 버리거나, "
"재능을 썩이거나, 전성기에 죽는 첫 번째 학생. - 또는 당신의 가르침을 버리고 악한 결말로 돌아선 첫 번째 학생.\n"
"여행 가방을 처음 볼 때, 그리고 그것을 불 속에 던져 넣고 싶은 욕망이 들고 그 뒤에 뛰어들 때.\n"
"나는 백화가 나를 건드릴 수 없다고 생각했다. 지루하다고? 항상 새로운 모험의 장소가 있는 이 아름다운 세상에서? 말도 안 돼! 아니면 "
"그렇게 믿었다. 그러나 그것은 내가 예상하지 못했던 곳에서 몰래 다가왔다. 내 백화는 내 영혼이 감내해야할 상처의 숫자에 무감각해졌을 때 "
"시작되었다. 신체는 마법으로 회춘할 수 있다. -하지만 자신에 대한 혐오를 어디에 숨길까? 페이가 그렇듯 할 일은 한 가지뿐이다: 마음을 "
"보석으로 바꾸면 과거는 아무런 표식을 남기지 않는다. 변하지도 않고 아무것도 기억할 수 없지만 더없는 행복이 영원히 이어질 것이다... "
"겉으로는 괴상하게 보일지 모르지만, 그것은 분명 경탄스런 존재일 것이다. 하지만 가장 슬픈 점은 이것이다. 원로 중 하나가 나에게 와서 "
"태초 세계로 돌아가게 해주고 그로 인해 내가 경솔하고 자유로운 몸이 된다고 해도... 만약 내가 동의한다면, 지금의 '나' – 이 늙은 "
"방랑자이자 자기 자신에게 질려버린 나, 그는 더 이상 존재하지 않을 것이다. 그것은 그저 또다른 죽음일 뿐이다 – 비록 즐거운 "
"죽음일지라도. 나는 이 게임에서 이길 수 없다. 어쩌다가 파라즈마의 손아귀에서 미끄러져도, 결코 망각을 속이지 않을 것이다.\n"
"그리고 마땅히 그래야 할 것이다. 이건 내가 머지않아 나 자신이라고 부르는 역겨운 노인에게서 벗어나겠다는 뜻이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text4_Order_Name_String
msgctxt "b711a819-daa8-4651-a512-b64d5235ffa4"
msgid "Scribble of the Weary Traveler"
msgstr "지친 여행자의 낙서"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossGodEmperor/GodEmperor_Text4_Order_Text_String
msgctxt "79134e34-f341-4473-9ecd-4007f4f23115"
msgid ""
"The words are barely legible, written as they are with sticky ink, upon a "
"reeking tattered rag:\n"
"\"Decree!\n"
"I, Barandaball Zesselwand the First and Only, Ruler of the Eldest and the "
"Emperor of the First World, Hereby Command the organization of festivities "
"to celebrate the millionth anniversary of My enthronement.\n"
"Dryads and satyrs – deliver provisions of every flora and fauna, to prepare "
"at the celebratory feast. And make sure no one gobbles it all up before the "
"celebration! Have you no shame? Do you care for nothing but food?!\n"
"Redcaps and nixies – bring weapons and musical instruments for a celebratory "
"parade which shall end in a ball. And learn a couple new tunes – you keep "
"playing the same things over and over!\n"
"Leprechauns and nymphs – decorate the woods. Tie pretty ribbons around the "
"branches or something, I don't know. – You figure it out!\n"
"The Jabberwock shall be responsible for the fireworks. He is to puff fire. "
"If he does not know how to puff in different colors, he must learn the art "
"as soon as possible!\n"
"Begin at once. As you work, you may all praise Me, and thank fate for "
"sending you such a great and generous ruler!\""
msgstr ""
"그 글씨들은 거의 읽을 수 없고, 끈적끈적한 잉크로 냄새나는 너덜너덜한 헝겊 위에 쓰여 있습니다.\n"
"\"칙령!\n"
"나, 바란더볼 제셀완드, 최초이자 유일한, 원로들의 통치자, 태초 세계의 황제가 나의 집권 100주년을 기념하기 위하여 축제 행사의 "
"조직을 이에명령한다.\n"
"드라이어드와 사티로스 – 축하연에 대비하여 모든 종류의 음식을 조달한다. 그리고 축하 행사 전에 아무도 그것을 다 먹어 치우지 않도록 "
"하라! 부끄러운 줄도 모르나? 음식밖에 신경 안 쓰냐?!\n"
"레드캡과 닉시 – 무도회장에서 마무리 되는 축하 퍼레이드를 위해 무기와 악기를 가지고 온다. 그리고 새로운 곡 몇 개를 배워 올 것 – "
"너희는 계속, 계속 같은 곡만 연주한다!\n"
"레프리콘과 님프 – 숲을 장식한다. 나뭇가지랑 다른 데에 예쁜 리본을 묶어라, 구체적으로 어떻게 할지는 나도 모른다. - 알아서 해!\n"
"재버워크는 불꽃놀이를 책임져야 한다. 그는 불을 뿜기로 되어있다. 만약 어떻게 다른 색깔로 연기를 내뿜는지 모른다면, 가능한 한 빨리 그 "
"기예를 배워야 한다!\n"
"즉시 시작하라. 모두들 일함과 동시에 나를 찬양하고, 이렇게 위대하고 너그러운 통치자를 너희에게 보내준 운명에 감사해도 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/Barks/WickedChanter_BattleEnd_String
msgctxt "8a7d854c-ecb5-42c5-b28f-708c6ff1b54f"
msgid ""
"\"Sleep, my daughter, sleep.\n"
"Your sleep will be so bright and calm...\n"
"My sleep.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 자라, 딸아, 잘 자거라.\n"
"너의 잠은 아주 밝고 잔잔할 거야...\n"
"내 잠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/Barks/WickedChanter_BattleStart_String
msgctxt "0ecfcc69-1935-4231-84d3-1c81aa878d00"
msgid "\"Sleep, little babe. Sleep.\""
msgstr "\"잘자라, 아가야. 잘자라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/RivelsLullaby_Item_description_String
msgctxt "fe5a4863-0c1a-4f32-988b-651984316e5f"
msgid ""
"This charm, crafted from a seashell, once belonged to a fighter named Rivel. "
"As fate would have it, she was buried alive in the remote halls of the "
"dungeon. How curious that the dragon Xelliren never told future expeditions "
"that she lived. She might have been delivered from her fate.\n"
"Once, this charm could remember the last words whispered to it at the end of "
"the day. It has long since lost this charm, but the shell still remembers a "
"song it heard dozens of years ago. When you hold it close to your ear, you "
"can hear a female voice, trembling with fatigue but full of warmth and hope. "
"It sings a simple lullaby.\n"
"\"Sleep, little babe. Sleep.\n"
"I'll steal the blossom of the spring,\n"
"I'll gather clouds from the sky,\n"
"I'll mix them all with bright sunbeams\n"
"I'll put the bouquet in your dreams.\n"
"Sleep, my daughter. Sleep.\n"
"Your sleep will be so bright and calm\n"
"With laughter, songs and shining sun\n"
"And there, in the land of dreams\n"
"The two of us – we'll be with him.\n"
"Sleep, little babe. Sleep.\""
msgstr ""
"조개껍질로 만든 이 부적은 한때 리벨이라 불렸던 전사의 것이었습니다. 운명이 그녀를 지하감옥의 외딴 홀에 파묻었습니다. 궁금하게도 드래곤 "
"젤리런은 이후의 탐험대에게 그녀가 살아있다는 것을 말하지 않았습니다. 그녀는 자신의 운명에서 벗어났을지도 모릅니다.\n"
"한때, 이 부적은 하루가 끝날무렵 부적에 속삭였던 마지막 단어를 기억할 수 있었습니다. 이 부적이 유실된 지 오랜 시간이 지났지만 조개는 "
"수십 년 전에 들었던 노래를 아직도 기억하고 있습니다. 귀에 바짝 갖다대면 피로로 떨리지만 온기와 희망이 가득한 여성 목소리가 "
"들려옵니다. 그것은 간단한 자장가를 부릅니다.\n"
"\"잘자라, 아가야. 잘자.\n"
"봄의 꽃을 훔치고\n"
"하늘에서 구름을 모으고\n"
"모두 밝은 햇살에 섞을 게.\n"
"네 꿈에 부케를 놓아둘게.\n"
"잘자라, 내딸아. 잘자.\n"
"네 잠은 아주 밝고 잔잔할 거야.\n"
"웃음과 노래와 빛나는 태양으로\n"
"그리고 거기, 꿈의 땅에서\n"
"우리 둘 – 우리는 그와 함께 있을 거야.\n"
"잘자라, 아가야. 잘자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/RivelsLullaby_Item_name_String
msgctxt "c2935b63-e84d-45fa-a3ae-99b344d1dc49"
msgid "Rivel's Lullaby"
msgstr "리벨의 자장가"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText1_RivelLetter_name_String
msgctxt "2ca76d89-ba12-47c5-8bdd-86ff0951b275"
msgid "Rivel's Unsent Letter"
msgstr "리벨의 보내지 못한 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText1_RivelLetter_text_String
msgctxt "6a793838-0f8d-43ca-8686-55c1ea6ed35a"
msgid ""
"\"My dearest sister, do you remember Tiltaren, who these three years ago I "
"had the misfortune of meeting along the pass over the Tors of Levenies? He'd "
"gotten himself into a jam – run straight into a band of thieves that waylaid "
"travelers on mountain roads. His bombs were his only weapon, and he couldn't "
"use them in the snowy mountains without bringing an avalanche down on his "
"own head. By chance I was climbing up the pass from the other side, fleeing "
"a pack of werewolves... and then there was that horrible blizzard... It all "
"ended in quite a mess, ha ha!\n"
"Me and an elf, stuck for three days in that cramped cave, afraid to peek "
"out. Bandits and werewolves stalked the blizzard outside. The occasional "
"sharp cry rang out, and then silence fell again. When we finally escaped "
"that stone hole, we were sick enough of each other to say goodbye through "
"gritted teeth, and parted ways silently hoping that we'd never meet again. "
"Well, that hope's been dashed: we managed to run into each other in the "
"middle of some backwater in the Stolen Lands, only to discover that we were "
"on our way to the same place! Someday I will tell you more of our quest, and "
"the manner of our meeting. But know that it began with 'You again!', and in "
"turn we discovered – what a coincidence! – that we'd been having the same "
"dream, sent to us by a dragon. As you know, everything happens... more "
"quickly in parties of adventurers living from one dangerous expedition to "
"the next. It was like that between me and Till too. On the fifth day of our "
"journey, his blank face began to seem sweet, and the jingle-jangle of his "
"alchemist vials grew soothing.\n"
"Today is the thirty-seventh evening since we reunited, and we're camping "
"inside the cave where the dragon called us. Today Till gave me a special "
"seashell – a protective charm. He said it will help me survive in the most "
"dangerous places, and that it remembers the last words said at the end of "
"the day. You can hear them when you hold the seashell to your ear.\n"
"He gave me this gift, and went out on patrol. It's his turn today. At first "
"I didn't think to listen what the shell had to say; and when I did...\n"
"'Marry me.'\n"
"I know you'll call me a careless fool, sister dear. But I know what my "
"answer will be.\n"
"It's a good thing that Xelliren, the dragon who called us here, is also a "
"priest, though he follows a strange god. You can't have a wedding without a "
"boring speech and a priest's ritual, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"친애하는 자매여, 3년 전 레베니스 바위산맥을 넘다가 운 나쁘게 만난 틸타렌을 기억해? 그는 산길에서 여행자들을 터는 도둑떼와 바로 "
"마주쳤어. 폭탄이 그가 가진 유일한 무기였고, 눈 덮인 산에서 눈사태를 자신의 머리에 퍼붓지 않고는 그걸 사용할 수가 없었지. 우연히 "
"나는 늑대인간 무리를 피해 반대편에서 고갯길을 올라가고 있었어... 그리고는 끔찍한 눈보라가 몰아치고... 모든 게 엉망진창으로 끝났어, "
"하하!\n"
"나와 그 엘프는 밖을 엿보기를 겁내면서 그 비좁은 동굴에 사흘 동안 갇혀있었어. 도적과 늑대인간들이 눈보라를 일으키며 밖으로 나다녔어. "
"이따금 날카롭게 외치는 소리가 울려 퍼지더니 다시 정적이 흘렀지. 마침내 그 돌구멍에서 탈출했을 때, 우리는 이를 악물고 이별을 고할 "
"만큼 서로에게 질려 있었고, 다시는 만나지 않기를 바라며 묵묵히 헤어졌어. 글쎄, 그 희망은 깨졌지. 우리는 도둑맞은 땅 후미진 곳 "
"한가운데서 우연히 마주쳤어. 심지어 서로 같은 데로 가고 있었지! 언젠가 우리의 모험과 모임의 규칙에 대해 더 많이 말해줄게. 하지만 "
"그것이 '또 너!'로 시작되었고, 우리는 차례로 - 이런 우연의 일치가! - 용이 우리에게 보낸 같은 꿈을 꾸고 있었다는 걸 발견했어. "
"알다시피, 위험한 여정에서 다음 여정으로 살아가는 모험가들 파티에선... 모든 일들이... 더 빨리 일어나. 나와 틸 사이도 그랬어. "
"여행 닷새째 되던 날, 그의 무표정한 얼굴이 상냥하게 보이기 시작했고, 연금술사 약병의 징글징글한 소리도 점점 싫지 않아졌어.\n"
"오늘은 우리가 재회한 지 서른일곱 번째 저녁이야, 용이 우리를 불렀던 동굴 안에서 캠핑 중이야. 오늘 틸은 나에게 특별한 조개껍데기 – "
"보호용 부적을 줬어. 그는 그게 내가 가장 위험한 곳에서도 살아남는 데 도움이 될 거고, 하루의 끝에 거기에 대고 한 마지막 말을 "
"기억한다고 알려줬어. 조개를 귀에 대고 있으면 들을 수 있대.\n"
"그는 나에게 이 선물을 주고, 순찰하러 나갔어. 오늘은 그의 차례야. 처음엔 조개껍데기가 뭐라 말하는지 들을 생각이 없었지. 그리고 그걸 "
"들어보니까...\n"
"'결혼해 줘.'\n"
"친애하는 자매, 나를 부주의한 바보라고 할 거 알아. 하지만 난 내 대답이 어떻게 될지 알거 같아.\n"
"우리를 이곳으로 부른 용, 젤리런도 낯선 신을 섬기긴 하지만 사제라는 것은 다행이야. 지루한 연설과 사제 의식 없이는 결혼식을 올릴 수 "
"없어, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText2_Bestiary_name_String
msgctxt "b1f24852-df98-4150-b8d4-220a04bcad36"
msgid "Bestiary of the Tenebrous Depths: Wicked Chanter"
msgstr "어둠의 심부 괴물 도감: 사악한 영창자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText2_Bestiary_text_String
msgctxt "9ed9e5b5-91c3-45b7-87cc-cfdd83a4a767"
msgid ""
"If you look close enough, you can see the dirty prints of thin fingers all "
"around the margins of this paper, as if someone fiddled with it curiously, "
"turning it this way and that.\n"
"\"Note: this article of the Bestiary is the least definitive of all, and "
"cries out for development. It has been recorded as told by a few unlucky "
"souls who survived their encounter with the Wicked Chanter.\n"
"The Chanter is the newest of the known Great Nightmares. There are no "
"testaments of meeting her from the distant centuries, as has been confirmed "
"by the dragon Xelliren himself. We are almost certain that previously the "
"Chanter lived in an isolated part of the dungeon, and a passage leading from "
"her section of the caves to the main labyrinth had been blocked by a rubble "
"for a long time. Then someone – presumably another party of heroes summoned "
"by Xelliren – cleared the rubble, unwittingly setting the monster free.\n"
"We still don't know what the Chanter looks like, but we know well the sound. "
"Her appearance is always announced by singing, vague echoes from deep in the "
"tunnels. They forfeit their lives who follow the sound, hearing in it the "
"cry of a friend.\n"
"It is safe to say that the Chanter is always accompanied by a large pack of "
"various monsters, who would not, under natural circumstances, gather "
"together or act in concert. They protect the Chanter, hunt for her, and "
"attack with vicious force any who enter their territory. But at times they "
"also suddenly spare their victims, without any apparent system or logic. The "
"motives of their unpredictable mistress are entirely unknown. She may simply "
"be mad, like many other creatures of the Tenebrous Depths. It is hard to say "
"whether singing is her way of luring her victims to their doom, or a means "
"by which the Chanter controls her pack of monsters. We may have a chance to "
"find out in the nearest future. – Tonight our expedition's scouts heard her "
"tender voice in a distant corridor, singing a children's lullaby. The "
"Chanter is near.\"\n"
"An ancient drawing decorates the back of the page: a drop of blood, smeared "
"in the shape of a crooked flower and a sun."
msgstr ""
"충분히 가까이 들여다보면 누군가가 기묘하게 만지작댄 것처럼 종이의 여백에 가느다란 손가락의 더러운 지문이 여기저기 널려 있는 것을 볼 수 "
"있습니다.\n"
"\"주: 이 괴물도감은 가장 최종 완성판이 아니며, 개선이 필요하다. 사악한 영창자와의 만남에서 살아남은 몇몇 불운한 영혼들이 들려준 "
"대로 기록되어 있다.\n"
"그 영창자는 알려진 위대한 악몽들 중 가장 최근의 존재다. 드래곤 젤리런이 직접 확인해 주었듯이, 먼 세기까지 거슬러 가보아도 그녀를 "
"만났다는 기록은 찾아볼 수 없다. 거의 확신하건대 이전에 영창자는 던전의 고립된 곳에서 살았고, 동굴 내에 있는 그녀의 구역에서 주요 "
"미로로 이어지는 통로가 오랫동안 돌무더기로 의해 막혀있었던 것으로 보인다. 그리고 누군가 – 아마도 젤리런에 의해 소환된 다른 영웅들이 –"
" 잔해를 치웠고, 자신들도 모르게 괴물을 풀어주었으리라.\n"
"우리는 아직 영창자가 어떻게 생겼는지 모르지만, 소리는 잘 안다. 터널 속 깊은 곳에서 들려오는 막연한 메아리, 언제나 노래소리가 그녀의 "
"외모를 알려주고 있다. 친구의 울음소리를 들고 그 소리를 따라간 사람은 목숨을 잃는다.\n"
"영창자는 항상 다양한 괴물 무리를 동반하고 다니는데, 그들이 자연적으로 모이거나 협력하여 행동하는 것은 아닐 것이다. 그들은 영창자를 "
"보호하고, 그녀를 위해 사냥하며, 자기 영토로 들어오는 누구든 포악한 힘으로 공격한다. 그러나 때때로 그들은 뚜렷한 체계나 논리 없이 "
"갑자기 희생자들을 살려주기도 한다. 그들의 예측할 수 없는 여주인의 동기는 전혀 알려지지 않았다. 그녀는 어둠의 심부의 다른 많은 "
"생물들처럼 단순히 미쳤을지도 모른다. 노래하는 것이 희생자들을 파멸로 유인하는 그녀의 방식인지, 아니면 영창자가 괴물 무리를 통제하는 "
"수단인지는 말하기 어렵다. 가까운 장래에 알아낼 기회가 있을지도 모른다. – 오늘 밤 우리 원정대의 정찰대원들이 먼 복도에서 자장가를 "
"부르는 그녀의 부드러운 목소리를 들었다. 영창자가 가까이 있다.\"\n"
"한 고대의 그림이 페이지 뒷장을 장식하고 있습니다: 구부러진 꽃과 태양 모양으로 얼룩져 스며든 한 방울의 피."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText3_RedheadDiary_name_String
msgctxt "55a72918-e261-455a-88d8-5942b2a7a157"
msgid "Ranger's Diary"
msgstr "레인저의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText3_RedheadDiary_text_String
msgctxt "4c49bc17-dda4-41c6-938e-d93add9d5d4e"
msgid ""
"\"I've got bad news for the elf. I'll have to tell him that his wife was "
"still alive when he blocked that passage and fled the dungeon.\n"
"Our expedition is the third one he gathered to recover his wife's remains "
"from the caves. The first two didn't even reach the rubble. We were the "
"'lucky' ones. We've been wandering these halls and passages for over a "
"month. We fell back when we encountered groups of monsters that were simply "
"too powerful to face, then crept back to pick them off one by one, or look "
"for ways around them. Finally we made it. I don't know how the elf even "
"found this place. – So much time has passed, a few dozen years I believe. "
"But he managed it. He cried out for our kineticist, and nodded to the pile "
"of boulders blocking the passage. \"Clear the path,\" he said, then stepped "
"aside and turned his back. I suppose he was remembering the monsters "
"dragging his wife into the darkness, as he crawled away and blew the passage "
"with his last remaining bomb.\n"
"Once they'd opened a small hole in the rubble, I crawled in to see what was "
"on the other side, as I'm the party's scout. When I reached the other side, "
"I knew right away that something was wrong. Someone had clearly tried to "
"clear the rubble from the other side. I kept exploring, and found signs of "
"an old battle. There were scorch marks on the rocks from alchemical bombs, "
"and the walls were scarred with sword strikes. And then I found it – an "
"abandoned camp with makeshift tools, where whoever had tried to clear the "
"rubble once lived. After exploring the camp and collecting a few things, I'd "
"become almost certain that this was the elf's friend.\n"
"I'm telling you, it's a curse to be a scout. You take the greatest risks, "
"and you're most often the one who delivers bad news to the party. Shame on "
"you, dragon. You might have warned me about this. Or maybe you didn't know..."
"\n"
"***\n"
"The elf seemed to take the news calmly. You can't tell whether he's "
"devastated. – He's just pale and silent. Scarcely says a word. But his black "
"eyes flare from time to time. I call him 'Grandpa', though the elf looks "
"younger than me. He pays me back by calling me 'Red'. Well, at least he "
"talks to me sometimes. He hardly acknowledges the rest of the party. I have "
"a feeling that he's decided to find his wife's bones and then just lie down "
"and die there beside her. He paid us up front, so it shouldn't bother me, I "
"suppose. Should it? We've done clearing the rubble, and we're making our way "
"forward again.\n"
"***\n"
"I found a second camp. I think the woman withdrew here once she realized "
"that she was never going to be able to clear that rubble. This place is "
"situated beside an underground lake, and it's much more comfortable: there's "
"a hearth made of stone, rough shelves, a sleeping nook made to keep away the "
"cold that creeps in from the water. The cave walls are covered with mosaics "
"made of pebbles. The woman made all sorts of things: flowers and figures of "
"animals, the sun and the moon. I looked at it all, and didn't know how I'd "
"ever bring the elf here. Everything here suggested that she survived, and "
"never gave up. She was waiting – and waiting for a long time at that. But "
"the camp was abandoned a very long time. I found many footprints of monsters "
"running through it. And something else, which looked very much like... no, I "
"should banish the thought from my mind.\n"
"When I returned to the others, I heard the scariest sound that one can "
"imagine in these dungeons. A soft, sweet song echoing down the tunnel. I "
"couldn't make out any words at that distance. I ran, glad of my escape. I "
"will tell them I found an empty camp, but we should avoid the place. It's "
"far too dangerous. We don't want to encounter the Wicked Chanter, do we? No, "
"we don't! Even the dragon warned us what a terrible monster it was.\n"
"And if we will stay well away from the underground lake, the elf will never "
"have to see the mosaic on the wall.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 엘프에게 나쁜 소식이 있다. 그가 그 통로를 막고 지하감옥에서 도망쳤을 때 그의 아내가 아직 살아 있었다는 걸 말해야겠다.\n"
"우리 원정대는 그가 동굴에서 아내의 유골을 수습하려고 모은 세 번째 일행이다. 이전의 두 원정대는 잔해더미가 있는 곳까지도 도달하지 "
"못했다. 우리는 운이 좋은 사람들이다. 우리는 한 달 넘게 이 방들과 통로들을 돌아다녔다. 상대하기 너무 강력한 괴물들과 마주쳤을 땐 "
"뒤로 물러났고, 살금살금 뒤로 물러서서 하나씩 무리에서 떼어내거나, 그들 주위를 우회할 방법을 찾아보았다. 드디어 우리가 해냈다. 그 "
"엘프가 어떻게 여길 찾았는지 모르겠다 - 시간이 너무 많이 흘렀다. 몇 십 년은 지난 것 같다. 하지만 그는 그럭저럭 찾아냈다. 그는 "
"우리의 키네시스트를 애타게 찾았고, 통로를 막고 있는 바위더미를 보며 고개를 끄덕였다. \"길을 열어줘.\" 라고 말하고는 옆으로 "
"비켜서서 등을 돌렸다. 기어나와서 마지막 남은 폭탄으로 통로를 날렸을 때 어둠 속으로 아내를 끌고 가는 괴물들을 기억하고 있었던 것 같다."
"\n"
"일단 그들이 잔해 더미에 작은 구멍을 열었을 때, 나는 일행의 정찰대원이기 때문에 반대편에 무엇이 있는지 보려고 기어들어갔다. 반대편에 "
"다다랐을 때, 나는 뭔가 잘못되었다는 것을 바로 알았다. 누군가 분명히 반대편의 잔해를 치우려고 노력했었다. 나는 계속해서 탐험을 했고, "
"오래된 전투의 흔적을 발견했다. 연금술 폭탄으로 인한 그을린 자국이 암석에 남아 있었고, 벽에는 칼부림 자국이 있었다. 그리고 나서 나는 "
"그것을 발견했다. 임시변통으로 만든 도구들이 있는 버려진 캠프였다. 그 캠프에는 잔해를 치우려고 했던 사람이 살고 있었다. 캠프를 "
"탐험하고 몇 가지 물건을 모은 후에 나는 이 사람이 엘프가 빠뜨리고 온 사람이라는 것을 거의 확신하게 되었다.\n"
"정말이지, 스카웃이 된다는 건 저주야. 스카웃은 가장 큰 위험을 감수하고, 파티에 온갖 나쁜 소식을 전하는 사람이다. 부끄러운 줄 "
"알아라, 드래곤. 내게 이걸 경고해야 했어. 아니면 몰랐을 수도 있고...\n"
"***\n"
"엘프는 그 소식을 침착하게 받아들이는 것 같았다. 그가 망연자실했는지는 알 수 없다. - 창백하고 말이 없을 뿐이지. 거의 한마디도 하지 "
"않는다. 그러나 그의 검은 눈은 이따금씩 번뜩인다. 엘프는 나보다 어려 보이지만 나는 그를 '할아버지'라고 부른다. 그는 나를 "
"'빨갱이'라고 되받아쳐 부른다. 뭐, 적어도 그는 가끔 나에게 말을 건다. 그는 나머지 일행을 거의 인정하지 않는다. 나는 그가 아내의 "
"뼈를 찾고 그리고 나서 그냥 누워서 그녀 옆에 죽으려고 결심한 듯한 느낌이 든다. 그는 우리한테 돈을 선지불했으니까, 그게 날 귀찮게 할 "
"일은 아닐 것이다. 그렇겠지? 우리는 잔해 더미를 치우고 다시 앞으로 나아가고 있다.\n"
"***\n"
"나는 두번째 캠프를 찾았다. 내 생각에 그 여자는 그 잔해 더미를 치울 수 없다는 것을 깨닫고는 이곳으로 물러난 것 같다. 이곳은 지하 "
"호수 옆에 위치해 있고, 훨씬 더 편안하다. 돌로 만든 난로, 거친 선반, 물에서 스며드는 추위를 막기 위해 만들어진 잠잘 곳이 있다. "
"동굴 벽은 조약돌로 만든 모자이크로 덮여 있다. 여자는 모든 종류의 것들을 만들었다: 꽃과 동물들의 형상, 태양과 달. 나는 그것을 다 "
"보았고, 엘프를 어떻게 여기로 데려올지 엄두도 안 나게 되었다. 여기 있는 모든 것들이 그녀가 살아남았고, 결코 포기하지 않았음을 "
"암시했다. 그녀는 오랫동안 기다리고-또 기다렸다. 그러나 캠프는 아주 오래 전에 버려졌다. 나는 많은 괴물들의 발자국을 발견했다. 그리고 "
"또 다른 무언가, 모습이 마치... 아니, 나는 그 생각을 내 마음속에서 떨쳐내야 한다.\n"
"내가 다른 사람들에게 돌아갈 때, 나는 이 지하감옥에서 상상할 수 있는 가장 무서운 소리를 들었다. 터널을 따라 울려 퍼지는 부드럽고 "
"달콤한 노래. 그 정도 거리에서는 어떤 말도 알아들을 수가 없었다. 나는 탈출해낸 것에 감사하며 달려갔다. 빈 캠프를 찾았다고 말은 "
"하겠지만, 그 곳은 피해야 한다. 너무 위험해. 우린 사악한 영창자를 만나고 싶지 않잖아, 그렇지? 아니, 안 돼! 용조차도 그게 얼마나 "
"끔찍한 괴물인지 우리에게 경고해 주었다.\n"
"그리고 우리가 지하 호수에서 멀리 떨어진 곳에 머문다면 엘프는 벽에 있는 모자이크를 결코 볼 필요가 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText4_RedheadDiary2_name_String
msgctxt "3cfc1271-d9a4-48f4-ad3a-c64333e772d8"
msgid "Ranger's Diary, the Last Page"
msgstr "레인저의 일기, 마지막 장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/BossWickedChanter/WickedChanterText4_RedheadDiary2_text_String
msgctxt "78df73cf-a68f-4297-9850-2e7d3c493182"
msgid ""
"\"'Grandpa,' I pleaded. 'Leave me.'\n"
"He looked at me and silently shook his head.\n"
"It was a long time coming. I'd gone out to scout as usual, spotted a handful "
"of monsters, quietly turned to head back – only to find a second pack had "
"crept up on me from behind, as I was watching the first. And then things "
"started happening very quickly. I scurried blind into a side tunnel I'd "
"never explored. They follow me down. I scamper somewhere else – and run "
"right back into them. I spin on my heels and bolt for my life, but they get "
"me in the leg so I'm limping. By the time I hear the song... it was way too "
"late. I had nowhere to turn. I saw her, and she saw me. It was a large cave, "
"well-lit by local standards. She stood in the middle and sang, and monsters "
"of all types lay at her feet. Claws, jaws, fangs, stingers – so many that it "
"seemed like one huge beast made of everything that kills. And she was its "
"heart. The Wicked Chanter.\n"
"She is not very Wicked, if you listen closely to what she is singing.\n"
"But then it grew very quiet, and she walked right at me. I pressed my back "
"to the wall, and I'm thinking – 'This is it.' And she comes up to me, tilts "
"her head and sniffs me. There's nothing living in her big black eyes, except "
"for something mean and wild. How could she grow up in pitch black darkness "
"with the beasts, and become anything more? She looked at me and me at her. "
"And I say, 'What are you looking at? Never seen a redhead?' And I'm thinking "
"to myself that I might have one quick shot, but then that'll be it. They'll "
"all attack, and bite and slice, and tear me to ribbons – a pool of gore at "
"her feet.\n"
"She reached out and touched my hair. And then she turned around and walked "
"away, all the monsters with her. I found a little nook, crawled inside and "
"passed out, knowing that if I ever woke up, it would be when something "
"started eating me.\n"
"But no. I opened my eyes and I saw him. The elf. He'd come looking for me, "
"when the others refused.\n"
"The scoundrels. He shouldn't have paid them up front.\n"
"I'd lost so much blood, I thought I'd never make it back up. I kept telling "
"the elf to leave me, but he wouldn't budge. Then I reminded him about his "
"wife's bones, that he wanted so bad to recover. I told him – 'If you try to "
"save me, you'll die. And you won't get what you came here for.' That was "
"when he finally spoke.\n"
"'You're a fool tenderfoot, Red. And I'm a fool too.'\n"
"Then he sat right beside me and looked at me with those same black eyes. "
"'I've come here over and over, gotten two parties wiped out, just to find "
"Rivel's bones. I felt like I'd abandoned her in her moment of need. I know "
"her pendant is still here somewhere... It calls out to me, and led me here. "
"But do you know what? It was all for nothing. All these people died for "
"nothing. I dragged them to their doom just to drown out my own conscience. "
"And it was only when you went missing... only then I realized. I might take "
"this guilt to my grave, but I'll drag that boy alive from the darkness, "
"before I drag out some old bones, even if they are the bones of my beloved!'"
"\n"
"As he was saying all this, his face lightened up a little – for the first "
"time I'd ever seen. It was like he'd found something for himself. Something "
"he could call new. And all I could think of was Her, her wild black eyes, "
"and I knew. I could never tell him now. I'll throw away this book when he's "
"not looking. And I'll never say a word.\n"
"About the song she sang. And the cradle I found at the camp by the lake.\""
msgstr ""
"\"할아버지.\" 난 간청했다. '날 두고가.'\n"
"그는 나를 바라보며 묵묵히 고개를 저었다.\n"
"한참이 지나고 일이 벌어졌다. 나는 평소처럼 정찰하러 나갔다가 몇 마리의 괴물들을 발견했다. 조용히 고개를 뒤로 돌리자 - 내가 첫 번째 "
"무리를 보고 있을 때 뒤에서 두 번째 무리가 슬금슬금 다가오는 것을 발견했다. 그리고 나서는 일이 매우 빠르게 진행되기 시작했다. 나는 "
"한 번도 탐험해 본 적이 없는 옆 터널로 급히 들어갔다. 그들은 나를 따라 쫓아 내려왔다. 나는 어딘가로 잽사게 달려가다가 - 그들과 "
"바로 다시 마주쳤다. 나는 발뒤꿈치를 축으로 빙글 돌아서 내달렸지만, 그들이 내 다리를 잡아서 다리를 절게 되었다. 그 노래를 들었을 "
"때는... 너무 늦었다. 돌아갈 곳이 없었다. 난 그녀를 봤고, 그녀는 나를 봤다. 그곳은 어둠의 심부 기준으로는 제법 환한 큰 "
"동굴이었다. 그녀는 가운데 서서 노래를 불렀고, 온갖 종류의 괴물들이 그녀의 발치에 누워 있었다. 발톱, 턱, 송곳니, 쏘는 것들이 너무 "
"많아서 마치 사람 잡는 모든 것으로 만들어진 하나의 거대한 짐승처럼 보였다. 그리고 그녀는 그것의 심장이었다. 사악한 영창자.\n"
"노래하는 것을 자세히 들어보면, 그녀는 그다지 사악하지 않다.\n"
"그런데 갑자기 조용해졌고, 그녀는 바로 나를 향해 걸어왔다. 나는 벽에 등을 대고 '이제 시작이군'이라고 생각했다. 그리고 그녀는 내게 "
"다가와 고개를 갸우뚱하며 내 냄새를 맡았다. 그녀의 크고 검은 눈동자 속에는 비열하고 야성적인 것 외에는 아무것도 없었다. 그녀는 어떻게 "
"짐승들과 칠흑 같은 어둠 속에서 살고, 그 이상의 무언가가 될 수 있었을까? 그녀는 나를 보고 나는 그녀를 쳐다보았다. 그리고 나는 '뭘 "
"보고 있어? 빨간머리 본 적 없어?'라고 말했다. 그리고 한 번쯤 빠른 사격의 기회가 있을지도 모른다고 혼자 생각하고 있었지만, 그 "
"다음엔 그것으로 끝일거다. 그들 모두가 날 공격하고, 물고, 도륙하고, 갈기갈기 찢어버릴 것이다. 그녀의 발 아래 선혈의 웅덩이가 "
"고이겠지.\n"
"그녀가 손을 뻗어 내 머리를 만졌다. 그리고 나서 그녀는 돌아서서 걸어갔고, 모든 괴물들도 그녀와 함께 갔다. 나는 작은 구석을 발견하고 "
"안으로 기어들어가 기절해 버렸는데, 누가 날 잡아먹기 시작할 때나 깨어날 줄 알았다.\n"
"하지만 아니었다. 눈을 뜨자 그가 보였다. 그 엘프. 다른 사람들은 나를 포기했지만 그는 왔다.\n"
"악당들. 그는 그들에게 돈을 선지불하지 말았어야 했다.\n"
"나는 피를 너무 많이 흘렸고, 돌아갈 수 없음을 알았다. 나는 엘프에게 나를 버리고 떠나라고 계속 말했지만, 그는 꼼짝도 하지 않았다. "
"그러고 나서 나는 그가 그토록 간절히 원하는 아내의 유골에 대해, 상기시켰다. 나는 그에게 말했다 – '날 구하려고 하면, 당신은 죽을 "
"거야. 그러면 이곳에 온 목적을 이룰 수도 없겠지.' 그때 마침내 그가 말을 했다.\n"
"'넌 멍청한 풋내기야, 빨갱아. 그리고 나도 바보지.'\n"
"그리고는 내 바로 옆에 앉아 똑같은 검은 눈으로 나를 바라보았다. '나는 리벨의 유골을 찾으려고 여기 왔다가 모험가 일행을 둘이나 "
"날려먹었어. 그녀가 어려울 때 그녀를 버렸다는 생각이 들었지. 그녀의 펜던트가 아직 여기 어딘가에 있다는 걸 알아... 그게 나를 "
"부르고, 나를 이곳으로 인도해 주었다. 근데 그거 알아? 모두 쓸모없는 짓이었어. 이 사람들은 모두 헛되이 죽었다. 나는 단지 내 양심의 "
"가책을 덜기 위해 그들을 파멸로 끌고 갔어. 그리고 네가 실종되고서야... 그제서야 나는 깨달았다. 이 죄책감 은 내 무덤까지 가져갈지도 "
"모르지만, 그 아이는 살려서 어둠 속에서 끌어 낼 거야, 오래된 뼈 몇 개를 끌고가기 전에 말이다, 그게 내 사랑하는 사람의 뼈라고 "
"해도!'\n"
"그가 이 모든 것을 말하고 있을 때, 그의 얼굴은 전에 없이 밝아졌다. 마치 자신을 위한 무언가를 찾은 것 같았다. 그가 새로운 것이라고 "
"부를 수 있는 것. 그리고 내가 생각할 수 있었던 것은 그녀의 야성적인 검은 눈동자였고, 나는 알고 있었다. 나는 지금 그에게 절대 말할 "
"수 없었다. 그가 보지 않을 때 나는 이 책을 버릴 것이다. 그리고 나는 한 마디도 하지 않을 것이다.\n"
"그녀가 부른 노래에 대해서. 그리고 호수 옆 캠프에서 발견한 요람도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Egg_String_1
msgctxt "f7ac9c44-2a8f-452c-a761-123459c5609e"
msgid ""
"A shell of a monstrous egg that seems to consist entirely of hardened "
"madness."
msgstr "완전히 굳어진 광기로 이루어진 것 같은 괴물 알의 껍데기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendor/Barks/HonestGuy_Alt_UnitName_String
msgctxt "b1ba1f65-d9b2-4277-9ba5-678c5528a40c"
msgid "Polite Honest Guy"
msgstr "예의바른 정직한 남자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendor/Barks/HonestGuy_New_UnitName_String
msgctxt "db30f1a6-864d-414a-ba37-47fcb102b9dd"
msgid "The Most Honest Guy"
msgstr "가장 정직한 남자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendor/Barks/HonestGuy_UnitName_String
msgctxt "a1b38090-ed13-4559-bee3-c2e1c7ab7341"
msgid "Honest Guy"
msgstr "정직한 남자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0004_Text_String
msgctxt "c8a55c80-a9a4-4088-9a8a-e5667b357680"
msgid "\"Let's look at your wares.\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 있는지 좀 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0005_Text_String
msgctxt "78b22b4d-0c4f-4c7d-b89c-b83c2201647e"
msgid "\"And who are you?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 당신은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "32c9dcab-0c2b-4781-b115-2fd793b3d015"
msgid "\"You freely and calmly admit that you pillage corpses.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 거리낌없이 태연하게 시체를 털었다는 걸 인정하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0007_Text_String
msgctxt "54eaceb2-18a3-48ee-96f2-b970b820a5ac"
msgid "\"Does Xelliren allow your pillaging?\""
msgstr "\"젤리런이 당신의 약탈을 허락하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "9cd8f41e-3b46-4808-ab91-360dbd50f25f"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0014_Text_String
msgctxt "ff8a175e-36e2-42a5-8bb2-bc25c54c9503"
msgid ""
"\"At least I don't tell passers by that I'm just waiting for the chance to "
"rob their dead bodies.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 난 지나가는 사람에게 당신 시체를 털 기회를 엿보고 있다고 말하진 않는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0015_Text_String
msgctxt "9f9647dd-7dda-4f00-adf0-1f94d55d6d3a"
msgid ""
"\"Taking the equipment from a defeated enemy is honest. You're just taking "
"advantage of the situation without doing anything to help.\""
msgstr "\"쓰러뜨린 적에게서 장비를 빼앗는 게 정직하지. 넌 아무 도움도 없이 그냥 상황을 이용해먹는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "28f514fa-776b-421a-be08-2fa50c512c02"
msgid "\"I do it for the greater good.\""
msgstr "\"나는 더 큰 선을 위해 그것을 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0019_Text_String
msgctxt "b6dfdba1-e04f-4c63-83ad-fbb62aa4bae3"
msgid "\"Don't change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"화제를 돌리지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0022_Text_String
msgctxt "2d443ba2-d6fe-4125-b1e8-e34d1c5184ca"
msgid "\"Fine, forget I asked.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 내가 부탁한 건 잊어버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0025_Text_String
msgctxt "ee390cc8-7050-4dcd-b687-7f5dd4993957"
msgid ""
"\"Still it's not very nice. We put our lives at risk for everyone else, "
"while you profit from our misfortune.\""
msgstr "\"그래도 별로 좋지 않군. 너는 다른 모든 사람들을 위해 목숨을 걸었지만, 너는 우리의 불행을 통해 이익을 얻는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0026_Text_String
msgctxt "8831c54f-4c42-484e-ad41-b6bfcb8d1a83"
msgid ""
"\"What if you, say, make someone angry and you turn from an Honest Guy into "
"a Dead Guy?\""
msgstr "\"누군가가 열받았고, 네놈이 정직한 남자에서 저승간 남자가 된다면, 어떻게 할래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0030_Text_String
msgctxt "23f67e70-eaf0-436e-95e0-f65fe6c30542"
msgid "\"Why, do you?\""
msgstr "\"넌, 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Answer_0031_Text_String
msgctxt "a798b25d-f9ea-45bb-b02b-3b26962d7ee6"
msgid "\"You just piss me off. Honestly.\""
msgstr "\"넌 그냥 날 화나게 해. 솔직히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0001_Text_String
msgctxt "fd60fb4c-5a0c-49e7-a8d4-087b6c379218"
msgid ""
"{n}A tall bulky fellow with a shaved head studies you closely, paying "
"special attention to your equipment. He grins.{/n} \"Hello, my friend! Do "
"you want to look your finest? I have the best wares and the fairest prices "
"in all the Tenebrous Depths!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}머리에 삭발을 한 키 큰 덩치의 남자가 당신의 장비를 관심있게 쳐다보면서 당신을 자세히 살펴봅니다. 그는 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n} "
"\"이봐, 친구! 멋쟁이가 되고 싶어? 나는 어둠의 심부를 통틀어서 가장 좋은 상품을 가장 공정한 가격에 제공하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0002_Text_String
msgctxt "4593800f-f96c-4d75-9cbe-9ea1cec35a56"
msgid "\"Well hello, hello. The Honest Guy's shop welcomes every guest!\""
msgstr "\"안녕! 정직한 남자의 가게는 모든 손님들을 환영하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "273fc128-e2d0-4bba-ba55-ef2027dd0968"
msgid "\"Good luck. I hope we meet again, one way or another!\""
msgstr "\"행운을 빌어. 다시 만났으면 좋겠군. 어떤 식으로든 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "31f8dd31-c4f0-4344-8f42-bdb61ce42f46"
msgid ""
"\"I am an Honest Guy!\" {n}The lad strikes his chest proudly with his "
"fist.{/n} \"I stand here honestly, welcoming heroes, and seeing them off to "
"their feats of glory. I honestly collect the gear from their breathless "
"corpses. And I honestly sell it to the next heroes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 정직한 사람이야!\" {n}사내는 자랑스럽게 주먹으로 가슴을 칩니다{/n} \"나는 정직하게 이곳에 서서 영웅들을 환영하고, "
"그들이 영광스러운 업적을 향해 가는 걸 배웅해. 그리고 정직하게 그들의 숨이 끊어진 시체로부터 장비를 챙겼고, 정직하게 그것을 다음 "
"영웅들에게 팔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "803b9c73-5be2-43c7-ad17-d6811398ef73"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me my skepticism, but do you really never do that yourself? You've "
"never taken anything from an enemy you've killed or a dead body you've found?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 회의론을 용서해, 하지만 정말 당신 자신은 그런 적이 없어? 죽인 적이나 발견한 시체로부터 아무것도 가져간 적이 없다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0012_Text_String
msgctxt "9da7ec38-7f9f-4f9d-8a8e-8cd245478460"
msgid ""
"\"What could he have a problem with? I'm betraying no one, I attack no one, "
"I just pick up things that belong to no one, and find them new owners. "
"Perfectly honest, isn't it? And besides, that scaly worm would be so bored "
"without me. He never has anyone to talk to!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그에게 문제될 게 뭐겠어? 나는 아무도 배신하지 않고, 아무도 공격하지 않고, 단지 누구의 소유도 아닌 것들을 주워서 새 주인을 "
"찾아내는 거야. 아주 정직하지, 그렇잖아? 게다가 그 도마뱀은 내가 없으면 너무 심심할 거야. 도통 이야기할 사람이 없으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0016_Text_String
msgctxt "a1ac990b-21ea-4125-b186-79462afa7f6b"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm, you just gave me an idea. Maybe I should be called a Smart Guy, not "
"an Honest Guy?\""
msgstr "\"흠, 지금 내게 아이디어를 줬군. 어쩌면 나는 정직한 사람이 아니라 똑똑한 사람이라고 불려야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "7d857c5b-8e45-4fdd-96ca-b9015589f0bd"
msgid "\"That is exactly why I am the Honest Guy, and not you!\""
msgstr "\"그게 바로 내가 정직한 사람인 이유지, 그리고 당신은 아니고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "4e38e1af-45af-415a-b8d7-a10b7e63ec03"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not judging you. I can see you are an honest person. Just like me!\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신을 판단하지 않습니다. 당신이 정직한 사람이라는 걸 알 수 있어요. 나처럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "8dfacc8b-430c-4432-ac15-694a15887f8e"
msgid ""
"\"Why would I?\" {n}The Honest Guy gives you a broad smile.{/n} \"There are "
"no buyers here except for you. Why would I not talk to a client?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 왜 그런 짓을 하겠어?\" {n}정직한 남자가 활짝 웃습니다.{/n} \"여기엔 당신 말고는 구매자가 없어. 내가 왜 고객과 "
"얘기를 안 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0023_Text_String
msgctxt "a6f01663-00c5-459c-8ac7-52a50f583b76"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish. So are you buying anything? Fair trade is my principle!\""
msgstr "\"원하시는대로. 그래서 무엇을 사실 겁니까? 공정 거래는 나의 원칙입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0027_Text_String
msgctxt "3b28ff72-8737-495b-bca6-7d64416d59e7"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hey, my friend, let's not be rude! What did the Honest Guy do to you? "
"Did I attack you? Rob you? Insult your mother?\""
msgstr ""
"\"여, 여, 친구, 무례하게 굴지 마! 정직한 남자가 당신에게 무슨 짓을 했지? 내가 당신을 공격했어? 털었어? 당신 엄마를 모욕했나?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0028_Text_String
msgctxt "49444ba6-948e-44ed-92bb-db0104b66b32"
msgid "\"Are you saying the Honest Guy isn't fair? That I have no shame?!\""
msgstr "\"정직한 사람이 공정하지 않다고 말하려는 거야? 내가 부끄러움이 없다고?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0033_Text_String
msgctxt "50480deb-ac97-46db-a27d-1c6cd9c9d732"
msgid ""
"{n}The plunderer nearly drops his spear in indignation.{/n} \"Of course I "
"do! Maybe I get very sad every time I loot a new corpse! Maybe I'm thinking, "
"you know, 'what a pity, this great hero has perished'... I'll tell you what. "
"I promise you, I'll change. I'll donate a part of my earnings to orphans. "
"And to the Iomedae paladins for their fight against the demons – and to "
"druids, to help preserve the dwindling dinosaurs! I give you my word! I am "
"an Honest Guy! No one is more honest than me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 도적은 분개하여 창을 떨어뜨릴 뻔했습니다.{/n} \"물론이지! 나는 새 시체를 약탈할 때마다 매우 슬픈 것 같다니까! 어쩌면 "
"속으로 '이 위대한 영웅이 죽다니, 정말 안타깝구나'라고 생각하고 있을지도 몰라... 내 말 좀 들어봐. 약속할게, 난 바뀔거야. 나는 "
"내 수입의 일부를 고아들에게 기부하겠어. 그리고 악마에 맞서 싸운 이오메데 팔라딘과 줄어드는 공룡을 보존하는 데 도움을 주는 "
"드루이드에게도! 약속할게! 난 정직한 사람이야! 나보다 더 정직한 사람은 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/HonestGuyVendorTexts/Cue_0034_Text_String
msgctxt "b996ac2b-95c3-4795-8b5f-8e73cb6feb9b"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine. Forgive me if I did anything wrong. Maybe I'll do better. I'll "
"be a different man when the next heroes come, after you've died! Not just an "
"Honest Guy, but a Polite Guy too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 좋아. 내가 잘못한 게 있다면 용서해 줘. 난 더 나아질 수 있을 거야. 다음 영웅들이 오면 난 다른 사람이 되겠어, 네가 "
"죽은 다음에 말이야! 정직한 남자뿐만 아니라 예의 바른 남자까지 될거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "d3080b1f-5a89-4daa-8ffb-36cba6c6e197"
msgid "\"Who are you? Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구야? 너에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "23eb7e10-d5dc-4418-894c-e791ce7655eb"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "c625b0da-2840-4126-b830-d8f84e2f392e"
msgid "\"Apsu? Who is that?\""
msgstr "\"압수? 그자는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0013_Text_String
msgctxt "8bdb4cc6-7e27-473c-99e1-1103a158aee7"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0015_Text_String
msgctxt "26856c92-a175-44d1-84c2-69302e02e794"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers.\""
msgstr "\"대답해 줘서 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "557d5e94-7c10-4413-ab4a-6fd257c79956"
msgid "\"I need supplies.\""
msgstr "\"물자가 필요하다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "d3cdce83-209b-40ef-9128-0367ba95e98b"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "a3c768ce-ba45-4077-a328-91c8674aeb40"
msgid ""
"\"I found something in the dungeon that makes me doubt your sincerity.\""
msgstr "\"난 지하감옥에서 당신의 진정성을 의심하게 만드는 것을 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0023_Text_String
msgctxt "e5334ad6-c187-4296-8250-730ddb547ed6"
msgid "\"What feat do you expect of me?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나에게 어떤 성과를 바라고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0026_Text_String
msgctxt "2b7ae6d2-c5d6-4788-acb0-c34b844bbd57"
msgid "\"What blocks the way to the monster?\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 그 괴물에게 가는 길을 막고 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0027_Text_String
msgctxt "79dc2b63-957c-4d9b-bb67-80a1343816ac"
msgid "\"Why don't you kill these four yourself?\""
msgstr "\"이 네 명을 네가 직접 죽이지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0028_Text_String
msgctxt "142e609c-6b24-472c-870d-8475bd627a78"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Fallen Priestess.\""
msgstr "\"타락한 여사제에 대해 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0029_Text_String
msgctxt "bb4644f1-0a3e-44b3-99f1-659e679ad429"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Weary Traveler.\""
msgstr "\"지친 여행자에 대해 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0030_Text_String
msgctxt "bf5f985f-1712-4e87-8e6a-0201e3571f44"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Wicked Chanter.\""
msgstr "\"사악한 영창자에 대해 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0031_Text_String
msgctxt "5398a5d1-e2dd-42db-9e69-b60aaf22a7a6"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Captor.\""
msgstr "\"포획자에 대해 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0032_Text_String
msgctxt "1f8e6f66-e3d1-4137-9061-fccabfbbc2df"
msgid "\"I see.\""
msgstr "\"알겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0042_Text_String
msgctxt "15f69ffd-f7e7-409e-88e8-f405adb4abf4"
msgid "\"Is it just me, or are you really sad?\""
msgstr "\"나 뿐 아니라 당신도 속상해하고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0049_Text_String
msgctxt "91358a43-d035-4192-9f6d-a9edb9a7ed55"
msgid "\"I've killed the Fallen Priestess.\""
msgstr "\"타락한 여사제를 쓰러뜨렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0051_Text_String
msgctxt "4ea0d221-9579-467e-bc6b-da0d9b98cc3d"
msgid "\"I've handled the Weary Traveler.\""
msgstr "\"지친 여행자를 처리했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0052_Text_String
msgctxt "0aa1bf41-829e-4302-955b-dc9e65a632e0"
msgid "\"I've given peace to the Wicked Chanter.\""
msgstr "\"사악한 영창자에게 안식을 줬다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0053_Text_String
msgctxt "b1a9d1eb-40ab-4fca-bdc9-5a1815edcd34"
msgid "\"I vanquished the Captor and his daemon servant.\""
msgstr "\"포획자와 그의 다이몬 부하를 쓰러뜨렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0054_Text_String
msgctxt "a8bc1167-bc19-4cfc-a41e-d6ebe47bf082"
msgid ""
"\"I killed the four fallen heroes. The path to the Spawn of the Beast is "
"open!\""
msgstr "\"난 타락한 네 영웅을 죽였다. 야수의 자식에게로 가는 길이 열렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0063_Text_String
msgctxt "b23784df-6b39-4f17-9dcc-485a80a3e240"
msgid ""
"\"Read what is written on this robe. The Fallen Priestess didn't kill her "
"friends, she saved them. And she calls you a slave of Rovagug!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 로브에 쓰여 있는 것을 읽어봐. 타락한 여사제는 친구들을 죽인 게 아니라 구원했어. 그리고 그녀는 당신을 로바거그의 노예라고 "
"부르더군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0064_Text_String
msgctxt "a85bb037-a3a9-40cf-979c-51c05276a2be"
msgid ""
"\"Look at this shield. The Weary Traveler believed that you are just another "
"victim of self-delusion, much as he was.\""
msgstr "\"이 방패를 좀 봐. 지친 여행자는 자기만큼이나 당신도 자기 기만의 또 다른 희생자에 불과하다고 믿었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0065_Text_String
msgctxt "b5738756-af45-47da-8ff8-8bbdf4972384"
msgid ""
"\"A woman named Rivel was trapped in the dungeon with her unborn child. The "
"Wicked Chanter is her half-elf daughter. Why didn't you help them, Xelliren, "
"before it was too late?\""
msgstr ""
"\"리벨이라는 여자는 뱃 속의 아이와 함께 지하 감옥에 갇혔다. 사악한 영창자는 그녀의 하프엘프 딸이다. 젤리런, 왜 그들을 제때 "
"도와주지 않은 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0066_Text_String
msgctxt "3ef80a0d-cf3f-433c-a71e-3ca7125fb3d6"
msgid ""
"\"Look at these rings. The Captor thought that you serve the Spawn of "
"Rovagug, just like his pet daemon served him.\""
msgstr "\"이 반지 좀 봐. 포획자는 당신이 로바거그의 자식을 섬긴다고 생각했지, 그의 애완 다이몬이 그를 섬겼듯이 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0067_Text_String
msgctxt "b1a6d081-896c-4400-81ac-94da7cdb8e65"
msgid ""
"\"Look again at the testaments of those you sent to die. They all blame you! "
"Enough excuses! Who are you lying to? – Me or yourself?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 죽으라고 보낸 자들의 유언을 다시 한 번 봐. 그들 모두 당신을 비난하고 있어! 변명은 그만둬! 누구한테 거짓말을 하는거지? "
"나? 아니면 당신 자신인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0068_Text_String
msgctxt "55feae1f-d349-4eb8-8c20-49a8701a4bed"
msgid "\"Maybe I shouldn't have doubted you.\""
msgstr "\"당신을 의심하면 안 됐던 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0074_Text_String
msgctxt "c831f6d5-9ca7-4ad4-974c-1435247df83d"
msgid "\"Who is this fellow here with you?\""
msgstr "\"여기 같이 있는 이 녀석은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0086_Text_String
msgctxt "50fd747d-64a9-4c6d-a2b0-5ab0122ae5b3"
msgid ""
"\"I need companions. Can you summon more heroes?\" [{custom_companion_cost}]"
msgstr "\"동료가 필요합니다. 다른 영웅들을 부를 수 있을까요?\" [{custom_companion_cost}]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0095_Text_String
msgctxt "5843374d-eab3-4c79-baee-a4ca8a7d7b9e"
msgid "\"Can I rest here?\""
msgstr "\"이곳에서 쉬어도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Answer_0097_Text_String
msgctxt "01d4e944-ff4d-493e-8a53-da04a74a0d46"
msgid ""
"\"I've encountered a strange obstacle in the caves. It is made of a swirling "
"darkness. Do you know anything about it?\""
msgstr "\"동굴에서 이상한 장애물을 만난 적이 있어. 소용돌이치는 어둠으로 만들어졌더군. 그 일에 대해 아는 게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0001_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "6c82e3ff-b369-4154-9522-8d0c1fc30baf"
msgid ""
"\"We won. The monster is defeated. So why do I feel that our victory is not "
"complete? I am filled with doubt. Something is wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 이겼어. 괴물은 패배했다. 그런데 나는 왜 승리가 완전하지 않다는 느낌이 들지? 강하게 의심이 든다. 뭔가 잘못됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0002_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "b7dbebaf-6b58-49a6-812f-25a3782440df"
msgid ""
"\"Pride, as you can see, can destroy even a dragon – and even one who serves "
"the most ancient of the kind deities. How blind I have been! How "
"ridiculously stupid! Thank you for opening my eyes. Without you, who knows "
"how many more centuries I'd have driven the world's greatest heroes to their "
"doom, serving evil and all the while imagining that I'm doing good!\""
msgstr ""
"\"교만, 지금 네가 보다시피, 그것은 용이라도 파멸시킬 수 있지. 심지어 가장 오래된 신들을 섬기는 용이라고 해도. 내가 얼마나 "
"장님이었는지! 정말 터무니없이 어리석었구나! 내 눈을 뜨게 해줘서 고맙다. 네가 없었다면, 누가 알겠나. 내가 사악을 섬기는 내내 선행을 "
"하고 있다고 상상하면서 세계 최고의 영웅들을 파멸로 몰아넣기를 몇 세기를 반복했을지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0003_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "15b79aca-b073-4a78-8f91-bed6090f990e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh really? So she sacrificed both her life and her soul for her friends? "
"She compelled an evil goddess to perform a good deed, but in return "
"submitted herself to the power of evil?\" {n}The dragon shakes his scaly "
"head.{/n} \"Oh, mortals... your lives are ephemeral, but capable of holding "
"such nobleness that is hardly imaginable to transcendent beings.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 정말인가? 그럼 그녀는 그녀의 목숨과 영혼을 친구들을 위해 희생했다는 건가? 그녀는 사악한 여신이 선행을 하게 만들었지만 그 "
"대가로 악의 권세에 굴복한 것인가?\" {n}용은 비늘이 덮인 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아, 필멸자들이여... 너희들의 삶은 덧없지만 "
"초월자에게는 상상하기 힘든 그런 고귀함을 간직할 수 있구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0004_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "3d2024ca-0e9e-4f79-8951-4e82d6b5ccb3"
msgid ""
"{n}The silver dragon stares at you for a long time, unblinking. Maybe it's "
"just a trick of the light, but you think you see a heavy mercury teardrop "
"roll from its pearly eye.{/n} \"You have answered my call, protector of "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. I will have you know, no one has ever returned "
"from these caves alive. Many valiant heroes before you have sacrificed their "
"lives, to bring victory one step closer. I have not forgotten their feats, "
"nor will I forget yours.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}실버 드래곤이 눈도 깜빡이지 않은 채로 당신을 응시합니다. 아마도 빛을 이용한 속임수 같지만, 당신은 은색 눈물이 진주빛 눈알에서 "
"떨어진 걸 본 게 생각납니다.{/n}\"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 수호자여, 그대는 나의 부름에 응답하였다. 누구도 이 "
"동굴에서 살아 돌아오지 못했음을 알려주마. 그대가 오기 전 많은 용맹한 영웅들이 승리에 다가가고자 하여 희생당했다. 나는 그들의 위업을 "
"잊지 않았다. 물론 그대의 것도 잊지 않도록 하마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0007_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "dd326223-3d73-42b2-966e-db818a398746"
msgid "\"What do you want to know? I will hide nothing from you.\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 알고 싶으냐? 난 너에게 아무것도 숨기지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0011_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "47be6ec0-3f1d-48fa-90bf-d4d9ceeb875d"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Xelliren. I am a loyal servant of {g|Apsu}Apsu{/g}. Thousands "
"of years ago, my god appointed me to watch over this place, where deep in "
"the depths there hides a great evil. I knew at once the repulsive smell of "
"the {g|Rovagug}Beast{/g}, but it took me centuries to locate the egg that he "
"left. All this time, I've stood guard here, looking for a way to destroy the "
"Spawn before it hatched and brought immeasurable sufferings to those who "
"dwell upon the land.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 젤리런이다. 나는 {g|Apsu}압수{/g}의 충실한 하인이다. 수천 년 전, 나의 신은 심연속에 거대한 악이 도사리고 "
"있는 이 장소를 지켜보도록 하였다. 나는 단번에 역겨운 {g|Rovagug}짐승{/g}의 냄새를 알아차렸지만, 그가 버리고 간 알을 "
"찾아내는 데만 수 세기가 걸렸다. 지금껏 나는 알이 부화해 이 땅의 거주자들에게 수많은 피해를 입히기 전에 파괴할 방법을 찾으며 이 곳을 "
"지키고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0012_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "bb5076f1-bfe2-4306-9fe9-435c681bc3bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon casts a pearly skyward glance.{/n} \"Oh, {g|Apsu}Apsu{/g}... "
"He is more ancient than all the gods whose names you know. He is the Maker "
"of All, who stands at the origin of the multiverse. Few mortals remember "
"him, but we metallic dragons still praise him in our prayers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드래곤이 하늘을 향해 시선을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"오, {g|Apsu}압수{/g}... 그는 그대가 알고있는 모든 신보다도 "
"오래된 존재다. 그는 모든 것의 창조주이며 다중우주의 기원이다. 소수의 필멸자만이 그를 기억하지만, 우리 금속 드래곤은 여전히 기도를 "
"통해 그를 숭배하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0014_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "55a19a32-2bf9-4b0d-a8c8-46084435ca90"
msgid ""
"\"I am guarding the Spawn of {g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g}, that sleeps in the "
"caves beneath us. I summon heroes to help me defeat it. It is a long and "
"joyless vigil, but I believe that it will one day be over. Perhaps you "
"yourself are the hero who will finally achieve this long-awaited victory?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 우리 아래있는 동굴에서 잠자고 있는 {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}의 자식들을 감시하고 있다. 나는 이것들을 소탕하기 위해 "
"영웅들을 소집하였다. 길고 즐겁지 않은 경계이지만, 언젠가 끝날 것이라 믿는다. 혹시 그대가 이 대망의 승리를 이루어 낼 용사일지 어떻게 "
"알겠는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0016_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "b8435180-911a-46a3-a752-146d7644579d"
msgid "\"The truth is the least I can give you for your feat.\""
msgstr "\"진실은 너의 위업에 대해 내가 줄 수 있는 최소한의 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0019_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "587ecfac-df7a-45b9-a38f-a8938faadcfb"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. But forgive me, my treasures are not endless, and I cannot "
"provide you with free supplies. If you require the aid of a priest, select a "
"scroll, and I will read it for you. But be careful. – Down in the labyrinth, "
"you're on your own! Do not go into the depths without a servant to the "
"higher forces in your party!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지. 하지만 용서해라, 내 보물들은 무한하지 않아서 너희에게 무료로 제공해줄 수 없다. 만약 사제의 도움이 필요하다면 주문서를 "
"골라라, 대신 읽어주도록 하마. 하지만 조심하도록. 던전 안에선 직접 해야 할 테니! 사제 없이는 심연에 들어가지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0020_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "13caeca3-2528-4452-a37a-3f65282bb358"
msgid ""
"\"I ask a great sacrifice. No one will dare judge you, if you turn around "
"and leave.\""
msgstr "\"나는 크나큰 희생을 요구했다. 그대가 돌아서 여기를 나간다 하더라도, 누구도 그대를 정죄하지 않으리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0022_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "cc80ec46-b22a-434e-a0bd-c9360e9fccbc"
msgid ""
"{n}You see anxiety in the dragon's pearly eyes.{/n} \"You have the right to "
"doubt, but be assured that my intentions are pure. I hide nothing from you. "
"Tell me what you found, and I will clear away your doubts.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 용의 진주 같은 눈에서 불안을 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 의심할 권리가 있지만, 내 의도는 순수하다는 것을 믿어라. 난 너한테 "
"숨기는 게 없어. 네가 발견한 것을 말해라, 그러면 내가 너의 의심을 말끔히 씻어 주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0024_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "56171876-6ba3-4eef-a244-0f8e21d973d5"
msgid ""
"\"An egg laid by the abominable {g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g} has cursed this "
"dungeon for thousands of years. The larva of the Beast will destroy half of "
"the River Kingdoms if it hatches. The shell that surrounds it is a labyrinth "
"of darkness and madness, inhabited by thousands of its former victims. "
"Hundreds of heroes perished as they sought a way through it. But now I know "
"where the egg is, and the path to it is almost clear. Almost...\""
msgstr ""
"\"가증스러운 {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}가 낳은 알이 수천 년 동안 이 지하감옥을 저주해 왔다. 괴수의 유충이 부화하면 강의 "
"왕국들의 절반을 파괴할 것이다. 그것을 둘러싸고 있는 껍질은 수천 명에 이르는 이전의 희생자들이 거주하고 있는 어둠과 광기의 미로다. "
"수백 명의 영웅들이 길을 찾다가 죽었다. 그러나 이제 알이 어디 있는지 알 수 있게 됐고, 그 알로 가는 길은 거의 분명해졌다. 거의..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0033_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "c586f754-f948-4c5f-894c-76dc53b8c6d9"
msgid ""
"\"The feat I ask of you is most dangerous, almost certainly suicidal. If you "
"agree, I want you to understand what you're getting into.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너에게 부탁하는 위업은 가장 위험하고, 거의 틀림없는 자살행위일 것이다. 네가 동의한다면 네가 어디로 뛰어드는 것인지도 이해해 "
"주었으면 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0034_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "0cbd6547-afaa-4c5f-9756-f091a9d61c50"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that is the saddest and scariest part. The Spawn of the "
"{g|Rovagug}Beast{/g} feeds on nightmares, and its very shell is made of "
"madness. The caves around are filled with insanity. It has flooded them with "
"an ocean of darkness, which distorts the very nature of the multiverse. "
"Heroes who approach grow mad or perish in great suffering... This gives the "
"egg its strength: the monster feeds on their terror and pain.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그것이 가장 슬프고 무서운 부분이다. {g|Rovagug}괴수{/g}의 자식은 악몽을 먹이삼아 살고 있으며, 그 껍질은 광기로 "
"이루어져 있다. 주위의 동굴들은 광기로 가득 차 있다. 그것은 넘쳐흘러 어둠의 대양이 되었고, 다중우주의 본질을 뒤틀고 있다. 접근하는 "
"영웅들은 미치거나 엄청난 고통 속에서 죽는다... 이것이 알에게 힘을 준다. 괴물은 그들의 공포와 고통을 먹고 산다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0035_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "165e43e1-f758-47df-8c99-3b2f8d5c227a"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon's body shudders. It would seem that the thought of what hides "
"in the depths can chill the soul of even a mighty dragon.{/n} \"The egg is "
"surrounded by an ever-shifting labyrinth of insanity and darkness. This "
"insanity which the larva emits is capable of subduing even the most valiant "
"of heroes. I have ventured down before, and it was only by a miracle that I "
"slipped the fate that has ensnared so many other brave heroes. If I tried to "
"vanquish it alone, then sooner or later it would devour me – drink my soul, "
"and add me to the horde of the nightmares that guard it. Who... who would be "
"able to destroy me then?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}용의 몸이 떨립니다. 심부에 숨어 있는 것에 대한 생각이 강대한 용의 영혼조차 오싹하게 만들 수 있는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} "
"\"알은 끊임없이 변하는 광기와 어둠의 미로로 둘러싸여 있다. 유충이 내뿜는 이 광기는 아무리 용맹한 영웅이라도 제압할 힘이 있지. 나는 "
"전에 아래로 모험을 떠났었고, 그 많은 용감한 영웅들을 얽어매었던 운명으로부터 미끄러져 빠져나간 것은 기적이었다. 만약 내가 혼자 그것을 "
"없애려고 하면, 조만간 그것은 나를 집어삼킬 것이다 – 내 영혼을 마시고, 그것을 지키는 악몽의 무리에 나를 더할 것이다. 그땐 "
"누가... 누가 나를 막을 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0036_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "6f2a51ba-c560-4dc2-af18-a60067856418"
msgid ""
"\"Her name is Tioko Sakasama. She led a party of adventurers here, noblest "
"heroes and truest friends. Together they'd defeated many foes... But they'd "
"never faced anything like this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 이름은 사카사마 티오코다. 그녀는 이곳에서 가장 고귀한 영웅이자 진실한 친구로 이루어진 모험가들을 이끌었다. 그들은 "
"함께 많은 적을 물리쳤지만... 그러나 그들은 이제까지 이와 같은 일을 당면해 본 적은 없었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0037_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "190f3df7-b649-4478-9da7-a2b9c233d105"
msgid ""
"He was a gnome named Ball Zess. He was quite a famous traveler, a pathfinder "
"on three continents. But {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} gives no quarter to his "
"people. There came a day when he grew tired of new roads. When he heard my "
"call, he came, knowing it would be his final adventure.\""
msgstr ""
"그는 볼 제스라는 이름의 노움이었다. 그는 꽤 유명한 여행자였고, 세 대륙의 패스파인더였다. 그러나 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}"
"는노움들에게 조금도 틈을 주지 않는다. 그가 새로운 여정에 지치는 날이 왔다. 내 부름을 듣고 왔을 때, 그는 그게 자신의 마지막 모험이 "
"될 줄 알고 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0038_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "5b975f07-6c21-4139-9b75-d635ac28f605"
msgid ""
"\"She is the dungeon's greatest mystery. In the long history of my vigil "
"here, she has but recently appeared. Heroes who set off into the depths "
"began to encounter something quite strange: a woman in rags, who wanders the "
"darkness, accompanied by a horde of monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 던전의 가장 큰 미스터리다. 나는 오랜시간 이곳에서 경계를 수행해왔지만, 그녀는 최근에 등장했다. 심부로 출발한 영웅들은 뭔가 "
"꽤 이상한 것과 조우했지: 누더기를 걸친, 괴물의 무리들과 함께 어둠 속을 헤메이는 여성이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0039_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "783f4f16-adc1-4854-aa8b-f80868d5b863"
msgid ""
"\"The Captor is the greatest wizard I ever managed to talk into visiting "
"this gloomy place. I had high hopes for him, and so I turned a blind eye to "
"the darkness in his soul.\""
msgstr ""
"\"포획자는 이 우울한 곳을 방문하도록 내가 간신히 설득한 가장 위대한 마법사다. 나는 그에게 큰 기대를 걸었고, 그래서 그의 영혼 속에 "
"있는 어둠을 외면했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0040_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "eca2f549-6399-470c-9e06-3dcb2efbb6b2"
msgid ""
"\"Neither alive nor dead, but tormented eternally by their worst nightmares, "
"these brave heroes still wander the labyrinth. Find and destroy four of "
"their strongest, and the power of the Beast's madness will weaken. – Then "
"I'll be able to crack open the shell. We must destroy the monster before it "
"hatches and grows strong!\""
msgstr ""
"\"살아 있는 것도 죽은 것도 아니지만, 최악의 악몽으로 영원히 고통받는 이 용감한 영웅들은 여전히 미로를 헤매고 있다. 그들 중 가장 "
"강한 네 명을 찾아내서 처치하면 야수의 광기의 힘이 약해질 것이다. – 그러면 내가 그 껍질을 깨뜨릴 수 있을 것이다. 괴물이 부화하여 "
"강해지기 전에 파괴해야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0041_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "07579f57-43e3-45d5-8e12-e777556c9e69"
msgid ""
"\"Thus I continue summoning heroes to this place. Many of those who answered "
"my call turn their backs and return to their lives, once they discover how "
"slim are their chances of victory – and I do not blame them. But my vigil is "
"nearing its end. – The hour of the last battle with the monster draws near! "
"If you can manage to weaken its shell, I can crack it, and we will finish it "
"together!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 나는 영웅들을 계속 이곳으로 소환한다. 일단 그들이 승리할 가능성이 얼마나 희박한지 알게 되면, 나의 부름에 응답한 사람들 중 "
"다수가 등을 돌리고 그들의 일상으로 돌아가는데, 나는 그들을 탓하지 않는다. 하지만 내 경계는 거의 끝나가고 있다. – 괴물과의 마지막 "
"전투의 시간이 다가오고 있다! 그 껍데기를 어떻게든 약하게 만들 수 있다면 내가 그걸 깰 수 있다. 그럼 우리가 그것을 함께 끝장내는 "
"것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0043_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "67eeb1ef-4c5c-4a1f-988c-57f02e6ce48e"
msgid ""
"\"So many heroes passed here... The noblest souls of Golarion, selfless "
"protectors of their homeland – ready to sacrifice their lives, to save it "
"from the Spawn of the {g|Rovagug}Beast{/g}. I remember each and every one. "
"Striding fearlessly down into the darkness... Almost none of them have "
"returned. And it's all my fault.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수많은 영웅들이 이곳을 지나갔다... 골라리온의 고귀한 영웅들, 이타적인 고국의 수호자들은 {g|Rovagug}짐승{/g}의 "
"자식들로부터 이곳을 지키기 위해 자신의 목숨을 희생할 준비가 되었다. 나는 그들 모두를 기억한다. 거침 없이 어둠을 향해 내려가는 "
"모습... 그들 대부분은 돌아오지 못했다. 이것은 모두 나의 잘못이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0044_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "f41e8ebe-7ac1-40d0-bdb8-076fdc3011a1"
msgid ""
"\"I fear that the danger has not yet passed. We have postponed the awakening "
"of the monster for centuries, perhaps thousands of years... But I feel its "
"life pulsating in the desecrated depths. The egg still lives. The larva of "
"another nightmare will someday be born.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 아직 위험이 지나가지 않았을까 두렵다. 우리는 수 세기 동안, 어쩌면 수천 년 동안 그 괴물의 각성을 늦춰왔다... 그러나 나는 "
"그것의 생명이 더럽혀진 심부에서 맥동하는 것을 느낀다. 알이 아직 살아 있다. 또 다른 악몽의 유충은 언젠가 태어날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0045_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "4f1766dc-a9b7-41c1-8ea6-fa8f808e880e"
msgid ""
"\"You have accomplished a great feat. I bow to you. Now turn away from this "
"kingdom of darkness, and return home. – The peace that you have won will "
"last for many generations. I will remain here. My duty is not yet fulfilled. "
"My vigil will continue...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 대단한 위업을 이루었다. 나는 너에게 경의를 표한다. 이제 이 어둠의 왕국으로부터 뒤돌아 집으로 가라. – 네가 얻어낸 평화는 "
"여러 세대에 걸쳐 지속될 것이다. 나는 여기에 남을 것이다. 나의 임무는 아직 완수되지 않았다. 나의 경계는 계속될 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0046_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "822b4907-6624-4b91-9475-bf8bf9599855"
msgid ""
"\"The danger has passed. The monster is destroyed. The great shell of its "
"egg still lies under the ground, but its wicked seed will sprout no more. I "
"feel the evil evaporating even now. The darkness lifts with each passing "
"moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위험은 지나갔다. 괴물은 처치되었다. 그 알의 큰 껍질은 아직 땅 밑에 있지만, 그 악한 씨앗은 더 이상 싹을 틔우지 못할 것이다. "
"나는 지금도 악이 증발하고 있는 것을 느낀다. 매 순간 어둠이 걷히고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0047_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "af6a0519-2e6e-4b85-a183-acec54fbc3f4"
msgid ""
"\"Return home. Enjoy the peace that you have won, or go off to face your "
"next foe. I will remain here until the shell has disintegrated, and no trace "
"remains of the Spawn of the Beast. My vigil will continue for a few more "
"centuries, but I am glad to know that soon it will end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"집으로 돌아가 네가 이룩한 평화를 누려라. 물론 다음 적수를 상대하러 떠나도 좋다. 나는 이 조개껍질이 마모되고, 괴물의 하수인이 "
"썩어 없어질 때까지 여기를 지키겠다. 수세기 동안 경계를 서야겠지만, 그 정도 시간은 금방 지나갈 테니 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0048_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "e10932fb-db38-45ab-8401-7dfed1b0ba56"
msgid ""
"{n}The giant reptile lowers his head.{/n} \"I bow to your courage, o "
"fearless mortal. I will never forget it, and I will never forget you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거대한 은룡이 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그대의 용기에 경의를 표한다. 용감한 필멸자여. 나는 이 일을, 그리고 그대를 결코 잊지 "
"않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0050_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "19e95671-70be-4cd5-80e5-c012201a4eff"
msgid "\"Of course. I will help you in any way I can.\""
msgstr "\"물론. 나는 내가 할 수 있는 한 그대를 도울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0055_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "60e3cadd-6537-46ae-a9dd-6f4cab727676"
msgid ""
"\"I remember what she was like when she entered the cave. Quiet but "
"resolute. She radiated the light of a noble heart, which had once lost its "
"virtue, but found the strength to regain it. The darkness of insanity, and "
"the power of evil deities, turned this light to darkness... But I am sure, "
"if her former self had met the monster she'd become, she would have "
"slaughtered it without a qualm, just as you have.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 동굴에 들어갔을 때 어땠는지 기억나는군. 조용하지만 단호했지. 그녀는 고귀한 마음의 빛을 뿜어냈다. 그 빛은 한때 미덕을 "
"잃었지만 다시 되찾을 수 있었지. 광기의 어둠, 그리고 사악한 신들의 힘이 이 빛을 어둠으로 바꾸어 놓았다... 하지만 확신하건데, 만약 "
"이전의 그녀가 과거 자신이었던 괴물을 만났다면, 아무 거리낌 없이 죽여버렸을 것이다. 바로 네가 한 것처럼\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0056_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "a0310cc3-4d8d-4638-8645-82698db03039"
msgid ""
"\"He was a brave one! His mind, so sharp and curious, his soul so noble! "
"What a pathetic creature the cave turned him into! Well, his time of mockery "
"and dishonor is finally at an end. The tired hero finally received what he "
"came here for. – Deathly peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 용감한 자였다! 그의 마음은 너무나 날카롭고 호기심 많으며, 그의 영혼은 너무나 고귀하다! 그 동굴이 그를 얼마나 애처로운 "
"생명체로 변모시켰는가! 흠, 그의 조롱과 불명예의 시대는 마침내 끝났다. 지친 영웅은 마침내 그가 이곳에 온 목적을 이루었다. – 죽음의 "
"평화를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0057_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "58bca865-fa71-409c-a5c7-a3903839b999"
msgid ""
"\"I am glad to know this nightmare will no longer wander the Tenebrous "
"Depths. She was so reckless and evil, and looked and sounded so innocent, "
"the better to draw her prey into her nets.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 악몽이 더 이상 어둠의 심부를 방황하지 않을 것이라는 것을 알게 되어 기쁘군. 그녀는 너무 무모하고 사악했으며, 그토록 순수한 "
"모습과 소리로 먹잇감을 그녀의 그물로 더 쉽게 끌어들이곤 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0058_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "d36ab12a-b34c-4b6c-8ac9-c26762a0a09e"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I wonder which was the servant and which was the master. Well, "
"now both of them have met their end, and what remains of their souls will "
"find their fate in Abaddon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가끔은 어느 쪽이 하인이었고 어느 쪽이 주인이었는지 궁금하다. 자, 이제 둘 다 최후를 맞았고, 그들의 영혼의 잔재가 나락에서 그들의 "
"운명을 찾게 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0059_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "3a9b1707-3a44-4bbd-a613-ddb4bf2a9208"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon smells the air, as if sensing the enemy through the thick of "
"the stone.{/n} \"Indeed! The shell has cracked! The monster is now "
"vulnerable to the vengeful sword! Somewhere in the dungeon, a shroud has "
"opened, leading to the very center of the egg. Go there, find it, and put an "
"end to the ancient nightmare!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}용은 마치 돌무더기를 뚫고 적을 감지하는 것처럼 공기의 냄새를 맡습니다.{/n} \"정말! 껍질이 갈라졌군! 그 괴물은 이제 복수의 "
"검에 취약해졌다! 던전 어딘가에 장막이 열렸고 알이 있는 바로 중심부로 이어졌다. 그리로 가라. 그걸 찾아내어 고대의 악몽을 종식시켜라!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0060_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "dd42c41c-fb4f-4387-99ca-4f8fa7dc73d2"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon lowers his huge head. True repentance can be heard in his "
"thunderous voice.{/n} \"I made a mistake, and they paid dearly for it. You "
"see, I never understood the true nature of the monster. For many years, I "
"and the heroes who answered my call would wander these dungeons, thinking "
"that the monster larva was the greatest threat. It was only when I found the "
"egg and touched its shell that I realized: the Spawn had turned the entire "
"dungeon into its nest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드래곤은 그의 커다란 머리를 숙였습니다. 그의 벼락같은 목소리에서 진실된 후회를 들을 수 있었습니다.{/n} \"내가 실수를 "
"저질렀고 그들이 대가를 치렀다. 나는 사실 괴물의 본성을 이해하지 못했다. 수 년간, 나와 내 부름을 받은 영웅들은 이 지하감옥들을 "
"배회하며 괴물의 유충만이 가장 큰 위협이라 생각했다. 알을 발견하여 껍질을 만졌을 때 깨달았다. 자식들은 던전 전체를 그들의 둥지로 "
"만들었던 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0061_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "92608dfa-e027-471f-9948-1dada47fd5bc"
msgid ""
"\"Madness, mortal. Darkness and madness are the monster's sword and shield, "
"its food and the material that its shell is made of. The heroes I summoned "
"here descended into madness. They lost their minds, and the Spawn of the "
"{g|Rovagug}Beast{/g} fed upon their insanity. Somehow, I avoided the same "
"fate. They went down into the darkness, driven by the noblest of intentions –"
" and were rewarded only with eternal torment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 광기네, 필멸자여. 어둠과 광기는 괴물들의 검과 방패고 먹이와 껍질을 둘러싼 물질 역시 그것으로 이루어졌다. 내가 불러온 "
"영웅들은 모두 광기에 침식당했다. 그들은 자아를 잃고 {g|Rovagug}괴수{/g}의 자식들은 그 광기를 먹이삼았다. 어떻게든 나는 "
"같은 운명에선 벗어났다. 그들은 고귀한 목적을 가지고 어둠속을 내려갔지만, 영원한 고통만이 보상으로 주어졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0069_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "3260d102-b186-42a8-beff-6344125d349e"
msgid ""
"\"Please, if you have any further doubts, do not keep them hidden, but speak "
"openly. I value your trust, as well as your sincerity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부탁하지, 의심스러운 점이 더 있으면 감춰두지 말고 터놓고 말해라. 나는 너의 진심과 더불어 너의 신뢰를 소중하게 여긴다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0070_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "94562b5d-6408-4b17-83c9-342c4cebe05a"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon gives you a long, heavy look. For a moment it seems he will "
"open his maw and breathe death upon you. But instead he casts his eyes "
"down.{/n} \"I admit, I've doubted my mission for a long time. But I try not "
"to think about it. I was sent here by the {g|Apsu}Maker of All{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}용은 오래도록 무거운 시선을 당신에게 보냅니다. 잠시, 그가 자신의 턱을 열고 당신에게 죽음의 숨결을 뿜을 것 같아 보였습니다. "
"그러나 그 대신 그는 눈을 아래로 내리깔았습니다.{/n} \"내가 내 사명을 오랫동안 의심해 온 것은 인정한다. 하지만 나는 그것에 대해 "
"생각하지 않으려고 노력하지. 나는 {g|Apsu}만물의 창조자{/g}에 의해 이곳으로 보내졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0071_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "b2747c9d-b9f4-429f-805d-c1f8c974db06"
msgid ""
"{n}The dragon sighs loudly, filling the air with shivering cold.{/n} \"Look "
"at his handwriting. Look at the large letters and exclamation points. – By "
"the message alone, it is clear: he was already losing his mind. It would "
"seem that when his fantasies of divine greatness released his mind, he "
"descended into paranoid delusion, and he imagined me the cause of all his "
"troubles. Alas! His was an exceptional mind, but at the moment he was "
"writing this, he was already incurably ill.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}용이 크게 한숨을 쉬자 서늘한 냉기가 허공을 채웁니다.{/n} \"그의 수기를 보라. 큰 글자와 느낌표를 보아라. – 그 "
"메시지만으로도, 이는 분명하다: 그는 이미 정신을 잃고 있었던 것이다. 신의 위대함에 대한 환상이 그의 정신줄을 끊어버렸을 때 그는 "
"편집증적 망상에 빠져들었고, 아마도 그가 겪던 모든 문제의 원흉이 나라고 상상했던 것 같다. 아아! 그는 뛰어난 정신의 주인이었지만, 이 "
"글을 쓰고 있던 때에는 그는 이미 돌이킬 수 없는 정신병을 앓고 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0072_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "1a76117b-d956-446a-800d-1335df796d17"
msgid ""
"\"So Rivel was... Trust me, if I'd known, I would certainly have sent help. "
"But I didn't know. I could only vaguely imagine what might have happened to "
"her, and where the Wicked Chanter could have come from. I couldn't leave my "
"post, and I couldn't divert the other heroes, who were risking their lives "
"on the most important quest in all of Golarion, just to check my wild fears!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 리벨은... 날 믿어다오, 내가 알았더라면 분명히 도움을 보냈을 것이다. 그러나 나는 알지 못했다. 그녀에게 무슨 일이 "
"일어났을지, 그리고 사악한 영창자가 어디서 기원한 것인지 어렴풋이 짐작만 할 뿐이었지. 나는 내 자리를 떠날 수도 없었고, 골라리온의 "
"모든 곳에서 가장 중요한 임무에 목숨을 걸고 있는 다른 영웅들을 단지 나의 본능적 공포를 확인하려는 이유만으로 보낼 수가 없었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0073_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "9b0e8f8a-adf9-46ff-ad54-064db309bf7e"
msgid ""
"\"I recognize this sharp mind, and his peculiar wit. This joke has an "
"explanation, and I shall give it to you: the heroes who went down into the "
"dungeon to defeat the Spawn have all died, and it fed upon their pain. In "
"the same way, the Captor nourished the daemon, by serving him his own soul. "
"He wishes on me the same fate, just as he wrote on these rings: that I "
"should go down to fight the Spawn, only to vanish and become its food.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 날카로운 마음과 그의 독특한 재치를 알아볼 수 있다. 이 농담에 대한 해석이 있는데, 너에게 이 말을 전해야겠군. 로바거그의 "
"자식을 물리치기 위해 지하감옥으로 내려간 영웅들은 모두 죽었고, 그들의 고통을 스폰에게 먹이로 주었다. 같은 방식으로 포획자는 다이몬에게 "
"자신의 영혼을 제공해 먹였다. 그는 이 반지에 쓴 것과 같이 나에게도 같은 운명을 바라고 있다: 나도 내려가서 로바거그의 스폰과 싸우고, "
"소멸되어 그것의 먹이가 되어야 한다는 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0075_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "6d9b23e2-bf44-425e-a440-1ae9e9fda9fb"
msgid ""
"\"The abominable embodiment of greed! He has no shame. He plunders the "
"corpses of fallen heroes and sells his prizes. But I cannot forbid him from "
"doing it. He does some good. – He sometimes travels around the area, "
"delivering supplies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"탐욕의 가증스러운 구현이지! 그는 파렴치한 인간이다. 그는 죽은 영웅들의 시체를 약탈하고 그들의 상품을 내다 팔지. 그러나 나는 그의 "
"행위를 금할 수는 없다. 그는 조금이지만 좋은 일을 하도 있다. – 수시로 그 지역을 돌아다니며 물자를 공급하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0076_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "6018d763-e8ea-45db-bb57-3e7b4a575363"
msgid ""
"\"The Fallen Priestess. The Weary Traveler. The Wicked Chanter. The Captor "
"and his horrifying slave. Deliver them into peace, and the path to the enemy "
"will be opened!\""
msgstr ""
"\"타락한 여사제. 지친 여행자. 사악한 영창자. 포획자와 그의 소름끼치는 노예. 그들에게 평화를 다오, 그러면 적에게 가는 길이 열릴 "
"것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0077_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "3292efef-8739-4ffe-a072-da1071f59442"
msgid ""
"\"Tioko once served Lamashtu. Then this brave and wise woman recognized how "
"disgusting her patron was, and gathered the strength to leave her service, "
"finding shelter in the hands of Desna. Alas, Lamashtu is called the Mistress "
"of Insanity for a reason.\""
msgstr ""
"\"티오코는 한 때 라마슈투에게 봉사했던 적이 있다. 이 용감하고 지혜로운 여성은 자신의 후견인이 얼마나 역겨운 존재인가를 알아채고는, "
"데스나의 손에서 피난처를 찾아내어 라마슈투 숭배에서 손 뗄 힘을 모았지. 아아, 라마슈투가 광기의 여주인으로 불리는 건 다 이유가 있는 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0078_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "7d17334c-9f45-4b58-ab4c-3d58a4a89ba6"
msgid ""
"\"The Labyrinth tricked Tioko's mind, and stole from her Desna's "
"protections. When next her reason failed, she returned to Lamashtu, and "
"sacrificed her friends to her cruel mistress, one by one. Ever since, she "
"has lurked in the depths, seeking new gifts for her mistress. Alas, the last "
"embers of good in her soul have long faded. She has become a monster. The "
"Beast has consumed her utterly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"미궁은 티오코의 마음을 기만해, 데스나의 보호로부터 훔쳐냈다. 이후 이성이 제 기능을 못하게 되자, 그녀는 라마슈투에게로 되돌아서 "
"잔인한 여주인에게 친구들을 하나씩 제물로 바쳤다. 그 이후로 그녀는 여주인에게 줄 새로운 선물을 찾으며 심부에 잠복해 있다. 아아, "
"그녀의 영혼에 있는 마지막 선한 불씨는 이미 오래 전에 희미해졌다. 그녀는 괴물이 되었지. 야수가 그녀를 완전히 먹어 치웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0079_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "18c62c10-1ee4-4350-8e4c-8b9a7a0afb93"
msgid ""
"\"He did not anticipate victory, but hoped at least for an honorable death. "
"Alas, the darkness reached out to him from the abominable Spawn of the "
"Beast, and refused him even that. An aura of madness filled the gnome with "
"delusions of grandeur, and transported his mind into the marvelous fey "
"world, where he sits, a godlike ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 승리를 기대하지는 않았지만, 적어도 명예로운 죽음을 희망했다. 아아, 가증스러운 야수의 자식으로부터 어둠이 그에게로 뻗쳐왔고, "
"어둠은 그 희망마저도 부정했다. 광기의 기운이 그 노움을 과대망상으로 가득 채웠고, 그의 정신을 신과 같은 통치자로 군림할 수 있는, "
"기묘한 페이의 세계로 날려버렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0080_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "a18d4c48-7206-4305-ab50-3bfa310f160a"
msgid ""
"\"He has become a frightening, dangerous, and pathetic caricature of his "
"former self. – A king without a kingdom, the god of a rotten soul. Immersed "
"in sweet dreams, he wanders the halls, barking orders at the wandering "
"monsters... A sad sight to behold. His death will bring him not only peace, "
"but also restore the dignity he's lost.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 이전의 자신을 무섭고, 위험하고, 애처롭게 희화화시킨 인물이 되었다. – 왕국이 없는 국왕, 썩어 문드러진 영혼의 신. 달콤한 "
"꿈에 빠져 복도를 배회하며 떠도는 괴물들에게 명령을 외쳐댄다... 보기에도 슬픈 광경이지. 그의 죽음은 그에게 평안을 가져다 줄 뿐만 "
"아니라 잃어버린 존엄성도 되찾아줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0081_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "de361583-febf-4b2c-afd6-e4a2acc0991e"
msgid ""
"\"A rush of madness has passed, and a veil of darkness has been drawn. I "
"managed to go further than before into the dungeon, without the risk of "
"becoming a puppet to the forces of evil. I have returned with some powerful "
"items. I think they will interest you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"광란의 질주가 지나가고, 어둠의 베일이 걷혔다. 나는 악의 꼭두각시가 될 위험 없이 그럭저럭 전보다 지하감옥 안으로 더 멀리 들어갈 "
"수 있었지. 나는 몇 가지 강력한 물건을 가지고 돌아왔다. 내 생각에 이것들이 너의 관심을 끌 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0085_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "2357884d-eff0-403b-b415-cb3787947743"
msgid ""
"\"But her accusation causes you concern. – She calls me a slave of the "
"Beast? I should think that Lamashtu herself twisted her mind towards this "
"lie. If the priestess had only come to me, I would have freed her from her "
"service to the evil goddess. By persuading the poor woman that I was among "
"her enemies, Lamashtu made sure she would never come to me for help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 그녀의 고발이 너의 근심을 이끌었군. - 그녀가 날 괴수의 노예라고 부르나? 당연히 라마슈투 본인이 이러한 거짓된 방향으로 "
"그녀의 마음을 비틀었다고 생각해야겠지. 여사제가 내게 오기만 했더라면 나는 사악한 여신에 대한 숭배로부터 그녀를 해방시켰을 텐데. "
"라마슈투는 내가 적들 중의 하나라고 그 가엾은 여인을 설득해서 절대로 내게 도움을 청하러 오지 않도록 만들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0087_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "98c925bd-a436-4d32-b364-0d509354a59a"
msgid ""
"\"I will summon who I can. Let us see which of them will answer my call...\""
msgstr "\"내가 부를 수 있는 사람을 소환하겠다. 그들 중 누가 내 부름에 응할 지 보자..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0088_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "9f356af9-4df4-4483-8488-ac780b7c1cfd"
msgid ""
"\"No! I must not doubt! I must be strong in my faith. Father! I do not sit "
"here in vain, do I? I am fulfilling your will, am I not? I beg you! Send me "
"a sign!\" {n}The dragon's eyes search the sky. His words sound like thunder, "
"and pound on the rocks... And fade into a depressing silence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"안 돼! 의심은 금물이다! 나는 내 신앙을 굳게 지켜야 한다. 아버지시여! 제가 여기서 헛되이 앉아 있는 건 아니겠지요? 저는 당신의 "
"뜻을 수헹 중입니다. 그렇지 않습니까? 간구합니다! 표식을 보내소서!\" {n}용의 눈이 하늘을 살핍니다. 그의 말은 천둥소리처럼 "
"울리고, 바위를 쾅쾅 두드립니다... 그리고 우울한 침묵 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0089_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "0b94cc6b-ac1d-443e-965d-388c98a52de0"
msgid ""
"\"Father... Have you truly abandoned me? Have I... Fallen? And all these "
"years... All the heroes I summoned here... No, no, it can't be true!\" {n}"
"The dragon's pearly eyes are covered with a dark glaze.{/n} \"Father, I will "
"prove my loyalty to You! Look at me, o great Father! My vigil ends today! I "
"will destroy the spawn of evil myself – here and now, once and for all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아버지... 정녕 나를 버리시나이까? 내가... 타락했다고? 그리고 그 모든 세월들... 내가 여기로 소환한 영웅들은... 아니, "
"아니, 그럴 리가 없어!\" {n}용의 진주 같은 눈동자에는 어두운 눈빛이 묻어 있습니다.{/n} \"아버지, 당신에 대한 저의 충성심을 "
"증명하겠습니다! 절 보십시오, 오 위대한 아버지! 나의 경계는 오늘로써 끝났다! 내가 직접 악마의 자식을 없애버리겠다. 여기에서 지금, "
"완전히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0090_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "fb5c253f-aece-412a-84de-08770b32438d"
msgid ""
"{n}With a mad scream that shakes the rocks, the dragon flies into the depths "
"of the dungeon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바위를 뒤흔드는 미친 듯한 포효와 함께 용은 던전의 심부로 날아듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0091_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "154baf1c-be51-4d68-8f00-b04084c4c38d"
msgid ""
"\"She is known to announce her arrival in song. She sings as she hunts, and "
"sings as she kills. The monsters of the dark serve her loyally and "
"faithfully, protecting her to their dying breath. I know not who the Chanter "
"is. Many brave heroines have disappeared into the dungeon, but none "
"possessed such control over monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 노래로 자신의 존재를 알린다고 한다. 그녀는 사냥할 때 노래를 부르고, 죽일 때도 노래를 부른다. 어둠의 괴물들은 그들의 "
"죽어가는 숨결로 그녀를 지켜주며 충실하게 섬긴다. 난 그 영창자가 누군지 모른다. 많고도 용감한 여걸들(heroines)이 지하감옥 "
"속으로 실종되었지만, 그런 식으로 괴물을 부리는 자는 아무도 없었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0092_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "0bd3fd2e-ee43-4a76-b34c-eaee0e0751c1"
msgid ""
"\"I only know that the Chanter is more insane than the three other "
"nightmares of the dungeon combined. And the terror she carries with her "
"knows no mercy. She must be defeated.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 단지 그 영창자가 던전의 다른 세 악몽을 합친 것보다 더 미쳤다는 것만 안다. 그리고 그녀가 몰고오는 공포는 자비를 모른다. "
"그녀를 반드시 물리쳐야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0093_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "2a3baa00-4caf-426a-8e32-9d5f43d5692b"
msgid ""
"\"I expect he was already insane before he even came here. Nothing else "
"could explain his indifference towards suffering. But he was strong and "
"confident, and managed to get quite close to the spawn – very close – before "
"he met his end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 예상하건데 그는 여기 오기도 전에 이미 제정신이 아니었을 것이다. 다른 어떤 것도 고통에 대한 그의 무관심을 설명할 수 없다. "
"하지만 그는 강하고 자신만만했으며, 그럭저럭 로바거그의 자식에게 아주 가깝게 근접했다. 그가 자신의 마지막을 맞이하기 전에는 매우 "
"가까웠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0094_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "1204c723-ef4c-4811-a800-e973b9c93cfa"
msgid ""
"\"Be warned that the Captor does not appear alone. He is always accompanied "
"by a disgusting beast that he summoned from beyond the world. The two are "
"firmly bound in death, and can revive each other, so they must both be "
"killed at once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"포획자가 혼자 나타나지 않는다는 점을 주의하라. 그는 세상 저편에서 소환한 역겨운 괴물과 늘 함께한다. 두 사람은 굳게 결속되어 "
"있고, 서로 소생시킬 수 있으니 둘 다 한꺼번에 죽여야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0096_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "0fef68cc-a23e-43a3-8f1f-eb237b8e405a"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! My table is set for everyone! Eat and rest as much as you like. "
"Down below, in the darkness, you will have to be at your best.\""
msgstr "\"물론! 내 식탁은 모두를 위한 것이다! 원하는 데로 먹고 쉬도록 하라. 저 아래 어둠 속에서는 최선을 다해야 할 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Lobby-DragonTexts/Cue_0098_Text_String
#. Speaker : SilverDragon
msgctxt "00e187fd-8fb8-40ce-a70e-886803bf6572"
msgid ""
"\"What you describe seems like a palpable shroud of madness. Other heroes "
"sometimes meet such obstacles. Alas, I know not how to pass it. However, the "
"shroud is known to disperse over time. I would advise that you pause your "
"descent for a while and wait.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 묘사한 것은 감지가능한 광기의 장막일 것이다. 다른 영웅들도 가끔 그런 장애물을 만난다. 아아, 난 그걸 어떻게 통과해야 하는지 "
"모른다. 그러나 이 장막은 시간이 흐르면서 흩어지는 것으로 알려져 있다. 탐사를 잠시 멈추고 기다리라고 충고하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Portal_no_open_String_1
msgctxt "1e7fcc7d-6ce3-48f2-ab97-3574d75c0bdc"
msgid ""
"A crack in space – still too narrow for you to enter. It reeks of death, "
"horror and madness."
msgstr "공간의 균열 - 아직 너무 좁아서 들어갈 수 없습니다. 죽음과 공포와 광기의 냄새가 납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Restart_disabled_String_1
msgctxt "35b33008-f32d-4149-bbce-293fa0659fe1"
msgid ""
"It appears to have been a powerful artifact, but its magic has long since "
"dissipated."
msgstr "강력한 유물이었던 것으로 보이지만, 그 마법은 오래 전에 소멸되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/3DLC/Statistics_disabled_String_1
msgctxt "ed30bffb-589a-4e6a-a7bb-2ee66e710767"
msgid "The obelisk is covered with the names of long forgotten heroes."
msgstr "오벨리스크는 오랫동안 잊혀졌던 영웅들의 이름으로 덮여 있습니다."

