#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/After_Gundersen_1_C_String
msgctxt "2dc428de-471d-4d8b-90f3-6a3e3edda1c5"
msgid ""
"\"I do not like that Gunderson. Even if he is not a spy — and mind you, I "
"still have my doubts! — vagabonds like him always bring trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 건더슨 그를 별로 좋아하지 않아. 비록 그가 스파이가 아니라고는 해도 — 그리고 기억해 둬, 나는 여전히 의심중이네! — 그와 "
"같은 부랑자들은 항상 문제를 일으키지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/After_Gundersen_2_V_String
msgctxt "82716ad9-ccf9-4dcb-98ac-af93d22ac753"
msgid ""
"\"Can't keep all the vagabonds from breaking their necks in the ruins! At "
"least if he finds something interesting, he'll bring it to us, not Brevoy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 부랑자들이 폐허 속에서 목이 꺾여죽지 않도록 막을 수는 없겠지! 적어도 그가 재미있는 것을 발견하면, 브레보이가 아니라 우리에게 "
"가져다 줄 걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/BeforeLair_1_V_String
msgctxt "85eed52f-cb95-4e3f-aafe-d8f558ce19c1"
msgid ""
"\"There were complaints about merchants disappearing in this area — along "
"with their goods. We should look into this.\""
msgstr "\"이 지역에서 상인들이 실종되는 것에 대한 불만도 있었고 - 그들의 상품도 함께 말이야. 우리가 이걸 조사해 봐야 하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Brevoy-Varnhold_1_V_String
msgctxt "3b762c78-7494-4890-be49-d7a6460849ab"
msgid ""
"\"If we had a Brevan envoy with us, they'd be spying out the road to "
"Varnhold for Jamandi.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 브레보이 사절을 데려 왔다면 그놈들은 자만디에게 반홀드로 가는 길을 일러바쳤을거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Brevoy-Varnhold_2_C_String
msgctxt "9ac925af-ff97-4d6b-a12e-17c059858c4a"
msgid ""
"\"As if Jamandi best not learn where we live! If there were an envoy was "
"with us, I would already be feeding them misinformation!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자만디가 우리가 어디 사는지 모르는게 최선인 것 같나? 만약 사절을 데리고 왔으면 나는 벌써 그들에게 거짓 정보를 흘리고 있었을 "
"거라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Camp_1_V_String
msgctxt "08cf79d3-f04f-4f2a-aa57-633711285567"
msgid "\"It's time we had a rest.\""
msgstr "\"우린 이제 좀 쉬어야겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Camp_2_V_String
msgctxt "50a7f98d-3740-448b-abb7-7a1c1e1505a8"
msgid "\"Enough marching for today! Set up camp.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 충분히 행군했다! 캠프를 준비해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Camp_3_V_String
msgctxt "9c639f2b-e4cb-4cb1-9178-78ea9b1bd1ba"
msgid "\"Aren't you hungry yet? Let's stop and eat something!\""
msgstr "\"배고프지 않나? 잠깐 멈추고 뭐 좀 먹지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Camp_4_C_String
msgctxt "40436efd-e505-4f2b-90d2-c2ddcf347f5c"
msgid "\"I believe we should set up a camp for the night.\""
msgstr "\"밤을 지내려면 캠프를 차려야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Camp_5_C_String
msgctxt "b0f62026-0047-4ec4-8946-722425cad45d"
msgid ""
"\"Unless you plan to fight the next battle without my best spells, we need "
"to rest.\""
msgstr "\"내 최고의 주문 없이 다음 전투를 치를 계획이 아니라면, 우리는 쉬어야 하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/From_Dunsward_Fight_1_V_String
msgctxt "eccb2d9e-4174-40fe-ae99-9c0a4d0e9e11"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity we had to fight the centaurs. They live in my lands, so "
"they're my subjects too!\""
msgstr "\"켄타우로스들과 싸워야 했던 것이 안타깝군. 그들은 내 땅에 살고 있으니, 그들 역시 내 백성들이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/From_Dunsward_Fight_2_C_String
msgctxt "7ac5aa94-1ff8-4797-b74f-548d9b56819d"
msgid ""
"\"They will never accept you as their ruler, nor will they live peacefully "
"with humans, in lands they deem their own. Do not pity them. They made the "
"choice to reject civilization and continue living as animals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 결코 자네를 자기들의 통치자로 받아들이지 않을 거고, 인간들과 평화롭게 살지도 않을걸세. 그들이 자기 것으로 여기는 땅에선 "
"말이지. 그들을 동정하지 말게. 그들은 문명을 배척하고 계속 짐승으로 살기를 선택했네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/From_Dunsward_No_Fight_1_C_String
msgctxt "12452fb7-444c-4b6d-9a8f-bc90bdaa6a48"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful. Now the centaur barbarians have added themselves to our already "
"too-long list of our problems. We'd best order long pikes for the infantry, "
"and beef up the fortifications...\""
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭하군. 이제 켄타우로스 야만인들이 이미 너무 긴 우리 문제 목록에 그들 스스로를 추가했네. 보병들을 위해 긴 파이크를 주문하고 "
"요새를 강화해야겠어..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/From_Dunsward_No_Fight_2_V_String
msgctxt "d2d21350-f850-4a92-bc93-be8ef94dc53a"
msgid ""
"\"Or we could avoid fighting them, and save the money for something more "
"urgent than battling barbarians!\""
msgstr "\"아니면 그들과 싸우는 것을 피할 수도 있고, 야만인들과 싸우는 것보다 더 급한 일을 위해 그 돈을 아낄 수도 있겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_BlackstFord_1_V_String
msgctxt "a1b9d66a-0577-43fe-856c-90ed5d6b12ff"
msgid ""
"\"Cannibals in my lands! I can't believe it! Just let me get my hands on the "
"scum. I'll have their heads!\""
msgstr "\"내 땅에 식인종이! 믿을 수 없는 일이다! 그 인간쓰레기들 손 좀 보게 해줘. 저놈들의 수급을 가져오겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_BlackstFord_2_C_String
msgctxt "3fa4af71-bb0c-400c-8e0d-b4b206b49ce5"
msgid ""
"\"You are right to withhold judgment on unproven accusations. Your job is to "
"find out the truth, and conduct a fair trial. You cannot pronounce a "
"sentence until you ascertain there was a crime.\""
msgstr ""
"\"검증되지 않은 비난에 대해서는 판단을 유보하는 것이 옳아. 자네의 일은 진실을 알아내고 공정한 재판을 하는 것이네. 범죄가 있었음을 "
"확인하기 전에는 형벌을 내릴 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Cultist_Village_1_V_String
msgctxt "91c13ad6-4603-49f0-9f97-20b41af227e8"
msgid ""
"\"For many centuries, the dead cyclopes have slept peacefully in their "
"graves! Why did they have to wake up now, when we showed up?\""
msgstr "\"수세기 동안 죽은 사이클롭스들은 무덤에서 평화롭게 잠들어 있었어! 왜 그들은 지금 우리가 나타나자마자 일어나야 했을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Cultist_Village_2_C_String
msgctxt "bf322850-4b2e-46fb-ac79-c0b8ff45367a"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like an act of magical sabotage to me. And guess who the prime "
"suspect is! Our dear western neighbor! Now that our wastelands have been "
"turned into farmlands, Dunsward has become a tasty pie, and everyone wants a "
"piece!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 눈에는 마법적 사보타주 행위로 보이네. 그리고 주요 용의자가 누구인지 추측해보게! 우리의 친애하는 서쪽 이웃! 이제 우리 황무지가 "
"농경지로 바뀌었으니 던스워드는 맛있는 파이가 되었고, 모두가 한 조각을 먹길 바라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Tomb_Helped_Apostates_1_C_String
msgctxt "dc69255a-2d8e-47a5-b8e8-41ba5fd485c7"
msgid ""
"\"Religion does not die easily. Today they renounce Charon, and tomorrow "
"they rush back to his embrace. We may only have sown the seeds for a future "
"riot!\""
msgstr ""
"\"종교는 그리 쉽게 죽지 않네. 오늘 그들이 케런을 포기해도, 내일이면 다시 그의 품으로 달려가겠지. 우린 미래에 일어날 폭동의 씨앗만 "
"뿌린 걸지도 모르네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Tomb_Helped_Apostates_2_V_String
msgctxt "adaf7e3f-b3d1-40bf-b12e-ce09fb07bdb7"
msgid ""
"\"We'll appoint a trusted cleric as the new leader of the village. Someone "
"to make sure the cultists don't return to their old ways.\""
msgstr "\"우린 신뢰할 만한 성직자를 마을의 새 지도자로 임명할 거요. 사교도들이 예전의 믿음으로 돌아가지 않도록 할 사람으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Tomb_Helped_Cultists_1_V_String
msgctxt "e9812288-8b5a-4ede-9757-340259d06b4d"
msgid ""
"\"Charon isn't Asmodeus. He's an Apocalypse Rider. His goal is the death of "
"everything! Are you sure his cultists can make decent citizens?\""
msgstr ""
"\"케런은 아스모데우스가 아니야. 그는 종말의 기수라고. 그의 목표는 모든 것의 죽음일세! 그의 사교도들을 버젓한 시민으로 만들 수 "
"있다고 확신하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Tomb_Helped_Cultists_2_C_String
msgctxt "93f0c64d-bec4-4c3d-942d-e013fb541ed8"
msgid ""
"\"We shall watch them closely. But unless their faith demands something "
"outrageous, sacrificing humans or dodging taxes, then I see no reason to "
"suppress it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 그들을 면밀히 주시해야겠지. 그러나 그들의 신앙이 인간을 희생시키거나 세금을 회피하는 등의 터무니없는 것을 요구하지 않는 한, "
"그것을 억누를 이유가 없다고 보오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Tomb_Killed_All_1_V_String
msgctxt "3a797956-b35b-499a-9781-6baccda44cde"
msgid ""
"\"Disgusting... We came to rescue our subjects from the zombies – and ended "
"up murdering all of them with our own hands!\""
msgstr "\"넌더리가 나는군... 우리는 좀비들로부터 우리의 백성들을 구하러 왔지만, 결국 그들 모두를 우리 손으로 살해했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/To_Tomb_Killed_All_2_C_String
msgctxt "09927041-9b9c-4b80-b32b-94251f3f2c37"
msgid ""
"\"If we allowed the cult of an Apocalypse Rider to flourish here, we would "
"have frightened off far more settlers than we killed today. Think of these "
"deaths not as a waste, but an investment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 우리가 이 곳에서 종말의 기수를 숭배하는 교단이 번성하도록 허용했다면, 우리는 오늘 우리가 죽인 것보다 훨씬 더 많은 정착민들을 "
"공포로 몰아넣었을 걸세. 이 죽음들을 낭비가 아닌 투자로 생각하게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Varnhold-Dunsward_1_V_String
msgctxt "62efd287-9674-45fd-9168-013d0ace0a79"
msgid ""
"\"People always invent such creepy names for old ruins. I bet when the "
"cyclopes were alive, they called that place \"Goatsmell Walk\" or something "
"of that sort!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 항상 오래된 유적을 위해 그런 으스스한 이름을 짓지. 사이클롭스들이 살아 있을 때, 그들은 그곳을 \"염소냄새 나는 거리\" "
"또는 그 비슷한 부류의 이름으로 불렀을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/2DLC/Varnhold-Dunsward_2_C_String
msgctxt "cbf4abd6-f9cb-40ba-8fb9-a9b28731fce0"
msgid ""
"\"I highly doubt it. The ancient cyclopes, after all, had far better taste "
"than you.\""
msgstr "\"그 말은 의문스럽군. 고대 사이클롭스들은 어쨋거나 자네보다 훨씬 나은 취향이었을테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0559e5f1-4d0a-4f84-849e-90ec772bac0d"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh, I miss a good fight. I want to hit somebody so hard, my fists are "
"itching.\""
msgstr "\"우으, 좋은 싸움을 놓쳤군. 누구든 정말 흠씬 두들겨 패 주고 싶었는데, 내 주먹이 가렵군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a4a8192c-6f17-49e3-a62e-9364a913b7d9"
msgid ""
"\"Some food would be nice... And some booze! When I get to a tavern, I'll "
"lock myself inside and won't come out until all the barrels are empty!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 음식들은 아주 맛있고...그리고 술도! 내가 술집에 들어서면, 난 내 스스로를 안에 가두고 모든 술통들이 빌 때까지 나오지 "
"않을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f877aae1-6a1d-4afc-b98d-9444c5f3d64f"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, my cape is all worn out... Got to catch a bear. A big one's hide "
"would fit me just right!\""
msgstr "\"헤, 내 망토가 모두 닳아버렸어...곰을 한 마리 잡아야 겠어. 아주 큰 놈의 가죽이면 내 몸에 딱 맞을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "92881c14-c736-4174-a892-0059bd33cebc"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone says brains aren't important for a lass. And they're right!\""
msgstr "\"모두들 어린 처자에게는 뇌가 필요없다고들 하지. 그리고 그들이 맞았군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4e1f8aaf-b1c4-4a7b-bdc7-3d700e858643"
msgid ""
"\"A woman needs a bicep, that's what! A whack in the face will make anyone "
"respect you – that's right.\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 여자들에겐 이두박근이 필요하지. 얼굴에 한방 먹이면 누구든 당신을 존경하게 되거든 - 그렇지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ed914314-37ee-44c4-9d29-1392e7d3a11c"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking at our gang... And I'm wondering. How the hell are we still "
"alive yet?\""
msgstr "\"난 우리 무리를 보고 있었어...그리고 궁금해졌지. 어떻게 우리가 아직까지 살아남은 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAmiri/Banter_AmiriAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0b7116fa-9510-4b9f-aa4f-e6b43bdf66aa"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone's so smart, it makes me sick. Writing smart books, fancy prayers "
"to the gods... I only punch first and then sort it out. I guess that's why "
"we're still alive, haha.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두들 아주 똑똑하지, 그리고 그게 날 역겹게 하고. 유식한 책을 쓰고, 신에게 멋진 기도를 드리고...난 그저 주먹으로 한대 치고 "
"그 다음 정리하거든. 내 생각엔 그게 왜 우리가 여지껏 살아있는 이유야, 하하\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAngel/Banter_AmiriAngel_AmiriTristian1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "92f9a83a-42aa-47ca-9936-f5fd7f83efe6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't get you. You're not a coward in battle. You don't flee from our "
"enemies. So why you always keep sighing and whining like a pup?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 이해가 안되. 넌 싸움을 벌일때 겁장이가 아니야. 적에게서 도망치지도 않지. 그런데 왜 강아지처럼 계속해서 한숨짓고 낑낑거리는거야?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriAngel/Banter_AmiriAngel_AmiriTristian1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "83762cc9-25dd-4e95-b147-4775f3e503f5"
msgid ""
"\"Courage is the hardened end of compassion, Amiri. But I am heartened you "
"do not take me for a coward.\""
msgstr "\"용기란 건 연민의 굳건한 끝이야. 아미리. 하지만 난 네가 날 겁쟁이로 여기지 않는 것이 다행이라고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_AmiriEkun1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "842d06df-3dac-4bca-a8f5-7ad2f94c19de"
msgid ""
"\"Female wolves are as sharp-toothed as the males, and they hunt just as "
"good. Female bears fight like daemons. So why my tribe won't let women lift "
"their heads from the cooking pot?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"늑대 암컷들은 수컷들과 마찬가지로 날까로운 이빨을 가지고 매우 능숙하게 사냥하지. 곰 암컷들은 마치 다이몬처럼 싸우고. 그런데 왜 "
"우리 부족은 여자들에게 요리 냄비에서 머릴 들지 못하게 하는 거지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_AmiriEkun1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "93b0ae0b-cd6f-4392-aa54-ebcc8b34b7e6"
msgid ""
"\"People are not always wise. They act like beasts when it suits them. Or "
"invent foolish things rather than learn what animals know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 언제나 현명한건 아니야. 그들은 동물처럼 행동하는 게 그들에게 어울리면 그렇게 행동해. 아니면 동물들이 알고 있는 것을 "
"배우기 보단 멍청한 짓거리를 발명해 내지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bbc6ffc3-a961-4ca8-83c2-31e65c7a7bb7"
msgid ""
"\"How do you find your way in the forest, huh? All the trees look the same "
"to me!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 숲 속에서 길을 찾아내는 거야, 응? 모든 나무들이 나에겐 똑같아 보여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4059dc39-49e1-4d4a-8722-842e278a1c0d"
msgid ""
"\"People are the same as well. We have two hands, two legs. But you can tell "
"them apart when you meet them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들도 똑같애. 우린 두 손이 있고, 두 다리가 있지. 그렇지만 네가 그들을 만났을 때, 넌 그들을 구분해 낼 수 있잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2de263b6-1ab0-410b-919f-c9a44fbea428"
msgid ""
"\"I hate trolls! After what they did to Ekun's village, I could tear them "
"apart with my teeth!\""
msgstr "\"난 트롤들이 싫어! 그들이 에쿤의 마을에 한 짓을 생각하면, 난 그들을 내 이빨로 갈기갈기 찢어버리고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9af533b5-7c22-49bb-89e7-64d0e90c30fa"
msgid "\"Torag bless you, Amiri. You know how revenge is forged.\""
msgstr "\"토라그(Torag)가 너를 축복하길, 아미리. 너는 어떻게 복수가 완성되는지 알지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9a5cd1bd-2012-4aa9-9e47-cd1472a8bc2f"
msgid "\"Oh, I am so hungry. I could eat a whole mammoth, trunk and all.\""
msgstr "\"오, 정말 배고파. 매머드 한 마리를 통째로, 코까지 먹을 수 있을거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8ddc5148-6725-4f8c-93a5-93bd7f9ce349"
msgid ""
"\"Can't promise a mammoth. Might be able to shoot a deer, though. Would a "
"deer do?\""
msgstr "\"매머드를 약속할 수는 없어, 사슴이라면 쏠 수 있겠지. 사슴이 그래 줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e85275f5-98c2-4ce6-aa7d-f8045e285c83"
msgid "\"Ekun, why is your wolf staring at me? I'm not a chunk of meat!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤, 왜 네 늑대가 날 노려보는 거야? 난 고기덩어리가 아니라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1c54b067-ae69-4741-8670-b55fd15a2505"
msgid "\"He likes you. You have lot in common.\""
msgstr "\"그가 널 좋아해. 넌 공통점이 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e6233ff1-6c20-4639-9423-eb45336d23f4"
msgid ""
"\"You fight pretty good! A bow is no match for a sword, but... Well, you "
"make do all right!\""
msgstr "\"너 아주 잘 싸우는데! 활은 칼에 비할 바가 아니지만, 어쨌든...그래, 넌 정말 잘 하고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ac8036ae-089a-48bc-b996-f1e05c8da9bf"
msgid ""
"\"Even your praise sounds like a challenge to fight. But I understand you. "
"Thank you.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 칭찬조차 싸우자는 것 같지만 당신을 이해합니다. 고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7ed434d7-34aa-4340-bdfd-20b0a939fa71"
msgid ""
"\"Are there mountains where you're from? You seem like a highlander – "
"strong, tough... Not like wusses from the plains!\""
msgstr "\"네가 온 곳도 산들이 있었니? 넌 마치 하이랜더처럼 보여, 강하고, 억센...평원에서 온 사람 같지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5af5d523-22e6-48b6-9979-a5a996111906"
msgid ""
"\"There are mountains, yes, but people don't live there. Minotaurs, harpies –"
" dangerous places. I'm from the city.\""
msgstr "\"그래, 산이 있었지, 그러나 사람들은 거기 살지 않았어. 미노타우르스, 하피...위험한 곳이었지. 난 도시 출신이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "52b6a094-aa59-4464-a849-ea70da662756"
msgid "\"I saw tracks near the camp! I'm telling you it's an ambush!\""
msgstr "\"캠프 근처에서 흔적들을 보았다! 이건 매복이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "49b831f9-240e-4772-8231-bea73c180179"
msgid "\"No ambush. I'd feel it. Just a badger. A fat one.\""
msgstr "\"매복이 아냐. 느껴져. 그냥 오소리로군. 뚱뚱한 녀석이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "964500f8-b33d-4e87-9ff7-81c9ae444ed5"
msgid ""
"\"You're not bad at all! Let's fight one on one! Find out who is the best "
"fighter on this team, huh?\""
msgstr "\"나쁘지 않군! 일 대 일로 붙어보자고! 누가 이 팀에서 최고의 전사인지 가려야 하지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "89680a5e-066e-471a-a2ca-c4fac7f45213"
msgid "\"No need to fight. You are the best.\""
msgstr "\"싸울 필요 없습니다. 당신이 최고입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_9_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "232d5cb3-108d-4d1d-92ea-a252f47fc7ec"
msgid ""
"\"I like your wolf! In the mountains we like them too. A tribe near us used "
"to breed such giant ones – ugh! They'd swallow a man alive! Horse and all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 네 늑대가 좋아! 산 속에서도 우린 그들을 좋아했어. 우리 주변에 있던 어떤 부족은 거대한 놈들을 교배시켰지, 크! 그 녀석들은 "
"사람을 산 채로 삼킬 수 있었어! 말과 함께!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriEkun/Banter_AmiriEkun_Pack2_9_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "76236c30-8421-4468-a0b0-87f220a9198a"
msgid "\"Maybe a whole mammoth too?\""
msgstr "\"매머드 한 마리도 통째로 잡아먹을 수 있었겠네?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_AmiriHarrim1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e1740452-75fa-4cc1-805b-8dab9ce87701"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, dwarf. You ever miss your home and your kin? Sounds from what you've "
"said, your kin is even more crap than mine…\""
msgstr ""
"\"어이, 드워프. 너, 네 고향과 네 친족이 그리워? 네가 말하는 걸 들어보면, 내 친족들보다 네 쪽이 훨씬 엿 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_AmiriHarrim1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "45a15736-2c75-498a-81ab-411050664c12"
msgid "\"Why ask, if you know the answer?\""
msgstr "\"정답을 안다면 왜 물어보는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2445a954-b636-4943-a8c6-1d218f0498dc"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Harrim, how about I give you a nice whack on the dome? All that "
"bull about the end of the end will come flying right out of you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어봐, 하림, 내가 저 돔 위에서 널 한대 후려패면 어떨까? 종말의 끝에 대한 모든 헛소리가 너에게서 날아 떨어지게끔 말야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "922eb932-e757-4cc7-a6b8-cb436497180f"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to kill me – do it. What does it matter when we die – now, or "
"an hour from now, or a year from now? Don't take it wrong, but as long as I "
"live, I will preach.\""
msgstr ""
"\"날 죽이고 싶다면 그렇게 하시오. 우리가 언제 죽는게 무슨 문제입니까, 지금 당장 아니면 지금으로부터 한 시간 뒤 아니면 1년 후? "
"오해하지 마십시오, 내가 살아있는 한 나는 설교할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7f2f8d47-34b1-4092-8d8f-b99ef44b64ba"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, has anyone tried to get Harrim dead drunk? Is he still so boring when "
"he's loaded?\""
msgstr "\"어이, 누구 하림을 죽을 만큼 취하게 한 사람 있어? 이 녀석 술 취해서 엄청 지루한데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "261bcf79-bf34-41c1-93f1-855ae7417ef8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Amiri, Amiri... There were times when I was never sober. This was long "
"ago, before I came to Groetus... And I do not wish to return to those dark "
"days.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 아미리, 아미리...오래 전에 그로투스를 섬기기 전에 나는 결코 술에 취하지 않은 때가 있었지... 그리고 그 어두운 날로 "
"돌아가고 싶지 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7529b5ca-650f-4c25-8bc3-3c623fb71e33"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Harrim, this Broetus of yours, what's he like? Some disgusting "
"slimy monster, sitting in a cave waiting for us all to die, writhing around "
"like a snake?\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어봐, 하림, 너가 얘기하는 브로테우스, 그는 뭐지? 우리 모두가 죽기를 기다리며 뱀처럼 이리저리 기어다니며 동굴에 앉아 있는 "
"역겨운 괴물이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "65f81c6f-c1ce-4826-add3-31d6b21451c0"
msgid ""
"\"It's the opposite, Amiri. Groetus is the beautiful moon shining over "
"Pharasma's Boneyard... Well, not what is normally called beautiful... He "
"does look like a skull.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 반대지, 아미리. 그로투스는 파라즈마의 뼈무덤을 빛나게 하는 아름다운 달이지... 뭐, 일반적으로 아름답다고 하는 건 아니고... "
"두개골처럼 보이긴 하지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e92c7018-3a84-4288-b5d1-b48d09872bc8"
msgid ""
"\"You're strange, Harrim. Dwarves are usually fun. They like the bottle, "
"they like to play and shout. But you just mumble all the time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 이상해, 하림. 드워프는 보통 재밌다고. 그들은 술병을 좋아하고 놀고 소리 지르는 것을 좋아하니까. 하지만 넌 그저 온종일 "
"중얼거릴 뿐이잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f88e74b8-4fc8-4553-942e-9efca778b6cb"
msgid ""
"\"I am called strange by a barbarian who gets into every fight she can, and "
"doesn't believe in the inevitability of death? This is truly amazing.\""
msgstr "\"난 할 수 있는 모든 싸움에 다 끼어들고도 절대 죽지 않을 거라고 생각하는 바바리안이 더 이상하던데? 참으로 놀랍군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "45b8b343-98f1-4686-9060-5ba7d743601c"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, why on earth do you tag along with us, huh? Why do you care where "
"you sit as you wait for your big ending?\""
msgstr "\"하림, 왜 이곳으로 우릴 따라온 거야, 응? 왜 네가 말하는 큰 종말까지 가만히 앉아서 기다리지 않은 거냐고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriHarrim/Banter_AmiriHarrim_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "335fbd6e-14ba-4115-99e7-fef765bc9b36"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I wonder. But I am where Groetus' whisper has brought me, and "
"this place is no worse than any other.\""
msgstr "\"때때로 나도 궁금하군. 하지만 그로투스의 속삭임이 나를 이곳으로 이끌었고, 이 곳은 다른 어느 곳보다 나쁘지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6ce95ac3-3795-43da-aa05-519b8a5d2401"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, stiff, how about you go rot someplace else. I'm sick of even "
"looking at you.\""
msgstr "\"들어봐, 시체, 어디 좀 다른 곳에서 썩어 주면 안될까? 너를 쳐다보기만 해도 역겹거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2d4502f8-e651-4a02-aa31-a7502ba93b28"
msgid ""
"\"Do I remind you of your own imminent death? Or perhaps you are jealous "
"that I have eternity ahead of me? In any case, I couldn't care less about "
"your opinion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너로 하여금 너의 임박한 죽음을 자꾸 상기시키나? 아니 어쩌면 너는 나에게 영원이 내 앞에 펼쳐진 것을 질투하는 것일까? "
"어찌되었든, 나로선 네 의견에 별로 신경을 쓸 수가 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "56ace24e-5219-4d88-8651-5c1cadf2bb5e"
msgid ""
"\"Why couldn't you just stay at home? You were a judge, you had respect!\""
msgstr "\"왜 고향을 떠난 거야? 판사였다며. 존경받는 사람이잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9fdf94b9-0f6b-4b3a-8145-321302b380ff"
msgid ""
"\"Respect has very little intrinsic value. The question is whether it gets "
"you what you want. And I wanted far more than respect could fetch me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"존경은 본질적으로 별 가치가 없지. 그런데 우리는 원하는 것이 있으면 얻어야 하잖아? 난 존경으로 얻을 수 있는 것 이상을 바랐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9222af14-c0c1-46f6-a639-c61aa2199f6a"
msgid "\"You made yourself undead on purpose… Blech, that's disgusting!\""
msgstr "\"자기를 언데드로 만들다니... 으, 역겨워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "679cfab2-511d-4cda-afcd-f851bedc950e"
msgid ""
"\"Judge what you know about – the taste of beer, for example. But keep quiet "
"about things you have no idea about.\""
msgstr "\"네가 아는 얘기만 하지 그래? 가령, 맥주 맛 같은 거. 네가 전혀 모르는 것에 관해선 조용히 하도록 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1835d9d1-6af2-4f0f-9dc8-20fc3684b5b0"
msgid ""
"\"Stay away from me, you spook! I'll tear off your hands before you can "
"blink!\""
msgstr "\"나한테서 떨어져, 귀신! 네가 눈 깜빡이기도 전에 니 손을 찢어놓을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJaethal/Banter_AmiriJaethal_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "569fa72a-4c04-4c20-996a-06749c6608a7"
msgid "\"You flatter yourself. I've no interest in primitive boneheads.\""
msgstr "\"본인이 대단한 줄 아나 봐. 난 본능에 충실한 멍청이한텐 흥미가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "55ce8caa-c6cf-49ee-b7b0-ba7110b3b847"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you wouldn't be so weak if you ever tried to lift something heavier "
"than a leaf.\""
msgstr "\"잎사귀보다 무거운 물건 좀 들지 그랬어. 그럼 이 정도로 약해빠지진 않았을걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5226b375-a68f-4daf-a11f-950cb46ea5a2"
msgid ""
"\"That's why you are here, to do the heavy lifting, and to kill the big "
"monsters. I'm here because of my supreme intellect and impeccable talents.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 거라면 네가 있잖아. 무거운 걸 들고, 커다란 괴물을 죽이지. 난 여기 우월한 지능과 흠잡을 데 없는 재능 때문에 있는 거고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "98134b10-649e-44fb-be1a-38fd2ae3c8fc"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Jubilost, I heard you mumble something about me yesterday, while "
"you were digging in your books.\""
msgstr "\"어이, 주빌로스트, 어제 네가 책에 머리를 박고 나에 대해 뭔가 중얼거리는 소리를 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "33b49415-fa03-41f4-8f97-84abc4e97c08"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, yes, I was just updating my knowledge on trolls, giants and other "
"ogres. I think you've much the same knowledge.\""
msgstr "\"그래, 맞아. 트롤과 거인, 오거에 대한 정보를 수정하고 있었지. 네 얘기라고 생각했던 이유를 알겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9fabdcc8-ec6d-457f-9056-f64dc72e8cd6"
msgid "\"Jubilost, have you ever been to the Realm of the Mammoth Lords?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트, 매머드 군주의 영역에 가본 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "accc433a-1ef3-4c95-a2a3-ef4bd0c0d5a0"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I have! I've written two books about it. A survival guide, and a "
"book of your savage songs. – And an article about cooking a mammoth's trunk!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연하지! 난 그곳을 주제로 책을 두 권이나 썼다고. 생존 안내서 한 권, 야만의 노래를 기록한 책 한 권. 아, 매머드 코 조리법을 "
"잊을 뻔했군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c29fdce0-88b9-461d-86ac-c80e7a708680"
msgid ""
"\"Are you kidding me, pipsqueak? Just so you know, I'm ten times smarter "
"than you!\""
msgstr "\"장난하냐, 찌질아? 너도 알잖아. 내가 너보다 열 배는 똑똑해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "995776dd-1fbc-43e6-b0c8-005ef66235b5"
msgid ""
"\"Ten times? Oh, so you can count to ten? That's an amazing discovery! You "
"really are smarter than you seem.\""
msgstr "\"열 배? 오, 열까지 셀 수는 있었군? 엄청난 발견이야! 너는 정말 보기보다 똑똑하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d6ce91c4-58ed-4e94-9433-5fe0d0f30464"
msgid ""
"\"What did you call me? Perv... Ferv... You think if you use funny words, I "
"won't understand you are making fun of me, huh?!\""
msgstr "\"나한테 뭐라고 했지? 완벽태... 완변태... 그런 이상한 말로 놀리려고 하면 내가 이해 못 할 줄 알았어? 응?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d6002d51-4326-4b3b-b670-27c57711f313"
msgid ""
"\"First, the word 'perfectionism' is not derogatory, and second, the word "
"certainly doesn't apply to you. If I wanted to insult you, I'll choose nice "
"short words so you could understand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"일단 '완벽주의'라는 말은 욕이 아냐. 두 번째로, 너랑은 상관 없는 단어지. 널 모욕할 작정이었다면 네가 이해할 수 있는 수준의 "
"짦은 단어를 골랐을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1c6d955d-f80e-42b9-b219-1cb8cd7a5563"
msgid ""
"\"You keep making jokes, but it's my back that you hide behind in battle!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 계속 나를 놀려봐. 그래 봤자 전투에서 네가 숨을 곳은 바로 내 등 뒤야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7c154b44-9db5-4582-8d42-960c14943948"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not hiding, I'm providing tactical support. If you don't understand "
"the difference, maybe I should just sit still during our next battle. I "
"assure you, you'll feel my absence very quickly!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 숨는 게 아니라 전술적인 지원을 해주는 거다. 그 차이를 모르겠다면 다음 전투에는 그냥 앉아있어야겠군. 나의 부재를 통감하는데 "
"오래 걸리지 않을걸? 내 장담하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b0b4ef40-4ee7-4a43-a6df-aa8c9d6d092c"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you another one! – I usually aim wherever you're yelling. It's "
"the best way to guess where the enemies are!\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 가지 더 있어. 난 보통 네 고함소리가 들려오는 방향을 조준하거든. 적이 있는 곳을 알려주다니, 최고의 전술 지원이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a3b91f63-c2f2-4756-9d4b-bf25e9f9b806"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you another one! – I usually aim wherever you're yelling. It's "
"the best way to guess where the enemies are!\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 가지 더 있어. 난 보통 네 고함소리가 들려오는 방향을 조준하거든. 적이 있는 곳을 알려주다니, 최고의 전술 지원이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4d796650-3533-42a0-861e-7af1c8933c38"
msgid ""
"\"You smell like a warm bed, a cozy home, and food cooked by someone else. "
"What the hell are you doing out here? Civilization has made you too weak.\""
msgstr "\"너한텐 따뜻한 침대, 아늑한 집, 제대로 된 식사 냄새가 나. 여기까지 와서 뭐 하자는 거야? 나약한 문명인 같으니라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriJubilost/Banter_AmiriJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1595e3e0-0184-4f04-8ca4-7e463e850931"
msgid ""
"\"But smart – the smartest. I'm weaker than a bear but I'm smarter. "
"Meanwhile you're about equal to a bear on both counts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래도 똑똑한 문명인이지. 아마 이 중에서 가장 똑똑할 걸. 곰과 겨루기엔 약할지 몰라도 난 영리하잖아. 너야 뭐, 힘과 지능 면에서 "
"곰과 비슷하겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "cba6923f-830e-4a2c-bff9-b74bb1287242"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, book kid! Want to hear a story about hunting a saber-toothed owlbear? "
"That was a good hunt!\""
msgstr "\"어이, 책 꼬맹이! 검치 아울베어를 사냥한 이야기 들어볼래? 괜찮은 사냥이었거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1632d513-35d2-4780-b772-0bf375974b3d"
msgid ""
"\"A saber-toothed owlbear? Hahaha! But Amiri, owlbears don't have teeth – "
"they have beaks!\""
msgstr "\"검치 아울베어? 하하하하! 아미리, 아울베어에겐 이빨이 없어. 부리가 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3da15319-7b60-4144-a94e-14bd06e18100"
msgid ""
"\"Once I killed a whole herd of mammoths. But our camp was too far away! So "
"I tied their trunks together and dragged them home for two days.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 번은 매머드 무리를 전부 죽인 적이 있어. 그런데 야영지가 너무 멀리 있었지! 그래서 난 매머드 코를 한데 묶어서 이틀에 걸려 "
"집까지 끌고 갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4399be1c-1d16-40d2-8997-abde537cd8c4"
msgid "\"Those must have been tiny mammoths! The size of squirrels!\""
msgstr "\"굉장히 작은 매머드였나 보네! 다람쥐 크기 정도였을까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b0ec8913-5790-4170-a240-0c3bd3a42c49"
msgid ""
"\"Book kid, you don't believe my stories?! They're good, interesting stories!"
"\""
msgstr "\"책 꼬맹이, 내 이야기 못 믿어?! 정말 재밌고 끝내주는 얘기잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "13a337ac-ea27-47d2-a831-ec4fc70e6d7c"
msgid ""
"\"You know, we bards sometimes lie a lot in our books too... But we try to "
"not to be so obvious about it.\""
msgstr "\"너도 알겠지만, 바드가 가끔 책에 거짓말을 쓰긴 해도... 너무 뻔한 거짓말은 쓰지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "51a5d359-dccd-43b3-8bb7-74b57ff73447"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Linzi... Can you make up a legend about me? A short one, at least!"
"\""
msgstr "\"들어봐, 린지...너 나로 전설을 만들어 볼래? 짧은 거라도 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriLinzi/Banter_AmiriLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4ff7f2b2-77ba-4daa-a757-0cf78a527566"
msgid ""
"\"About you? A short one?! But your feats would be enough for two heroic "
"epics – with plenty left over for a saga!\""
msgstr "\"네가 주인공인데, 짧은 거라고?! 하지만 네 재능은 영웅적인 서사시를 두 편을 채우고도 하나의 모험담을 만들 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriNokNok/Banter_AmiriNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "23ff276a-e38f-485f-b917-45e1f02c3396"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok, you are so small and feeble, but ferocious like a bear!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹, 넌 작고 연약하지만 곰처럼 사나워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriNokNok/Banter_AmiriNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1ce5c0a8-5ca1-43e1-94c8-a277884d68b3"
msgid ""
"\"I am Lamashtu's favored. Mother likes when stabs and jabs are heartfelt!\""
msgstr "\"난 라마슈투의 은총을 입었다. 어머니께서는 칼로 푹푹 찌르고 쑤시는 걸 좋아하신다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriNokNok/Banter_AmiriNokNok_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "48486363-616c-480d-8949-477d805cc216"
msgid "\"Hey, goblin! I saw you near my things. Tried to steal something?\""
msgstr "\"어이, 고블린! 내 물건 주변을 서성거리더라. 뭘 훔치려는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriNokNok/Banter_AmiriNokNok_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8ac37f81-ba3a-40ff-928a-656d4c721394"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri has strange stabber. Wanted to look closer. Touched nothing! Don't "
"want to get hands slashed with that stabber!\""
msgstr "\"아미리는 이상한 단도를 가졌다. 가까이서 보고 싶다. 만지지는 않았다! 단도에 손을 베이고 싶지 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4cdda6b0-eeef-4942-acc2-b0e3e97b51e9"
msgid "\"I feel so dreary! I want to punch someone so hard!\""
msgstr "\"엄청 따분하네! 아무나 후드려 패고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "781ea234-facf-4330-96be-c5b19c83999f"
msgid ""
"\"Easy, Amiri. There's no one to fight here, nor any reason to. I could read "
"you something for fun if you like.\""
msgstr "\"참아, 아미리. 여긴 싸울 상대도 없고, 싸울 이유도 없어. 원한다면 재미있는 이야기를 읽어줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0d2dbe13-0c86-48ef-bd95-408ec755c6e4"
msgid ""
"\"It's so strange, Amiri. I see no evil in you. But sometimes I think you "
"live only for destruction.\""
msgstr "\"참 이상해, 아미리. 나쁜 사람 같지는 않은데, 어떨 때는 꼭 파괴를 위해서만 살아가는 것 같다니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "02b9ad50-352a-444c-a454-7503691d06f1"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Octavia. Where you're from, do they also treat women like garbage?"
"\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 옥타비아. 네가 온 곳에서도 여자를 쓰레기처럼 취급하니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "71771c4b-5cce-465b-821c-67c423c759d6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't remember my home too well. But in Numeria where I grew up, they "
"treated everyone like dirt, men and women alike. I don't even know which "
"one's worse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 고향을 기억하지 못해. 하지만 내가 자란 누메리아에선 여자 남자 상관없이 사람을 막 다뤘지. 어느 쪽이 더 나쁜지 모르겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ed74652e-e039-459d-8c56-9fa6b6da4c90"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar and you are like two boots that make a pair. Only both are left "
"boots, ha!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르와 넌 꼭 장화 한 쌍 같아. 둘 다 왼쪽 발이지만, 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e9d3bfa3-efd9-462e-b12e-3826453f6b9a"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, that's right! Who else would need us, if we didn't need each other?\""
msgstr "\"맞는 말이네! 누가 한 짝만 남은 장화를 신겠어? 우리끼리 뭉쳐야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "172068ba-858b-477a-a6ea-5a62a7bd419f"
msgid ""
"\"The way you smashed that creep with a spell, ha! Left nothing but smoking "
"boots!\""
msgstr "\"아까 그 녀석을 날려버린 주문 말인데, 하! 연기 나는 장화밖에 안 남았더라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "29ac5785-96d9-4b16-9bc0-ab65264671d9"
msgid ""
"\"And the way you picked up those two and crashed their helmets together! It "
"sounded like the bells were tolling!\""
msgstr "\"네가 두 녀석을 잡아다가 헬멧끼리 박아버린 건 어떻고! 난 어디서 종이 울리는 줄 알았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6bf9cbfb-1cb0-4b0c-aea0-102ec3bf0e1a"
msgid ""
"[sighs] \"And if I didn't 'smash' him so hard, maybe we'd have found "
"something more valuable than boots...\""
msgstr "[한숨]\"그 녀석을 힘껏 '뭉게'버리지만 않았다면 장화보단 값나가는 물건을 찾았을지도 모르는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "61aa2571-c0f9-4977-a980-7f982ec24887"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia, why do you always primp your hair, huh? Why the hell you need to? "
"Who are you going to charm here? Trolls or something?\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아, 왜 넌 항상 머리를 치장하는 거야, 응? 굳이 그럴 필요가 있어? 누구한테 잘 보이려고? 여기 트롤 말고 누가 있는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "72add38f-336b-43ea-a83b-ac42a5685252"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone has their little weaknesses. I like to look pretty. I didn't get "
"a chance to do it much in the slave camp.\""
msgstr "\"사람마다 마음이 약해지는 부분이 다르잖아. 난 예쁘게 보이고 싶어. 노예 수용소에서는 그럴 기회가 없었거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d2106b2d-a387-4e34-ace2-da14a5112713"
msgid ""
"\"This magic all the time... It's all just tricks and fooling around! What "
"if you lost all your books? How'd you fight then? Let me show you a few "
"moves with a sword!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법은 그냥... 속임수에, 멍청한 짓거리야! 주문서를 전부 잃어버리면 어떡해? 내가 칼로 할 수 있는 몇 가지 동작을 보여줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriOctavia/Banter_AmiriOctavia_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2080e43a-3297-46e1-99b5-21ec4ff92fe3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I wouldn't want to steal the great warrior's glory! Let's leave the "
"swordplay to you, and I'll stay behind you with my tricks.\""
msgstr "\"오, 난 위대한 전사의 영광을 훔치고 싶지 않아! 검술은 너한테 맡길게. 그 뒤에 서서 속임수를 쓰면 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "87adc932-d6e8-4b29-a80a-4629e50388d7"
msgid "\"Hey, fangs, how about some wrestling? I'm bored.\""
msgstr "\"어이, 송곳니, 레슬링 한 판 어때? 지루한데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0179040e-0aa1-422f-bbe4-33159774ad0e"
msgid ""
"\"Hand to hand with you? How about we do it inside a sack? I'm always ready "
"for that, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"두 손을 맞잡고? 침낭 안에서 할 수는 있겠는데? 난 항상 준비된 몸이라고, 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bc06956b-bb85-482f-b914-5c6ccee56b59"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, don't your fangs bother you? It must be uncomfortable to have "
"such a snout.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 송곳니가 불편하진 않아? 주둥이가 엄청 불편해 보이는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f97e802a-715a-4a6d-8781-8176d0a70f2d"
msgid "\"Why? I can eat just fine – and kiss. What else is there?\""
msgstr "\"왜? 먹는데 문제없고, 키스도 꽤 해. 더 필요한 데가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3ea599fb-b21b-485a-8a6c-77bd2e345402"
msgid ""
"\"I wish I could just, you know – lightning – and BAM! And there's just "
"smoke and embers left. Will you teach me?\""
msgstr "\"내가 말이지, 그... 번개랑 펑하고 터지는 거. 연기랑 불씨만 남고 괜찮아 보이는데, 가르쳐 줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "85b3ef1e-97cb-459c-832a-65cadf1fccde"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, it's great! But it's inborn – you either have it or you don't. To "
"learn magic you'd have to read books like Octavia!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 내가 좀 대단하지? 근데 이건 타고나는 거라서. 마법을 배우려면 옥타비아처럼 책을 들여다보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "73501019-c98a-4d5d-9412-346ca3818bd3"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, about this Technic Gang or whatever... Did you try just like "
"killing all of them?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 이 기술 어쩌고 하는 놈들 말이야... 전부 잡아다 죽이려고는 해봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8617072a-b775-4fc8-b406-f53320377af8"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, a great plan! Only that there was two of us and thousands of them. "
"Even if they lined up and didn't fight back, we'd be slicing their throats "
"until we were old!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하, 거참 대단한 계획이네! 우린 둘 뿐이고 그놈들은 수천이 넘어. 우리 앞에 한 줄로 서서 목을 긋게 해 준다 해도, 우리가 늙어 "
"죽을 때까지 그 짓을 해야 할 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1dd64d7f-e6c2-47f3-9d42-79bd854f749e"
msgid ""
"\"A pint of beer would be nice. Or a barrel. Or better two! And hit the "
"pillow..."
msgstr "\"맥주 한 잔 하고 싶다. 사실 한 통이면 좋겠어. 두 통이면 더 좋고! 그리고 베개 위에 쓰러지는 거야..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7a3c1848-0287-4a64-b2f8-aa046e8cbade"
msgid ""
"\"The beer will have to wait till we get back. But the pillow doesn't have "
"to, ha ha hmm…\""
msgstr "\"맥주는 돌아가야 마실 수 있지만, 베개는 바로 여기 있거든? 하하 흠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "92e74f3d-9f47-4000-8194-fe65884620e6"
msgid ""
"\"Lightning is good, of course... But still, all this magic is just fooling "
"around. What matters in battle is a sword!\""
msgstr "\"번개 좋지. 근데 마법은 손장난 같은 거잖아. 싸움에서 중요한 건 칼이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e1890bbd-4671-461c-aacc-20207037f5dd"
msgid "\"Ha ha, you're just jealous that I can do it and you can't!\""
msgstr "\"하하, 네가 못하는 걸 나는 하니까 질투하는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "327aab6d-74f8-40bf-ba25-e842346ed97b"
msgid ""
"\"Watch where you're going in battle! If I say a monster is mine, then you "
"find another one, and don't steal my glory!\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸울 때 정신 바짝 차리고 있어! 내가 이 괴물은 내 거라고 외치면, 넌 다른 놈을 찾아. 내 영광을 훔칠 생각하지 말고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "db94b0db-b726-4237-9f70-f23efd230964"
msgid ""
"\"I don't give a damn about glory! I just want the enemies dead – and quick! "
"After that, you can just tell everyone you slaughtered them all by yourself!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"빌어먹을 영광은 무슨! 적이나 '빨리' 죽여줘! 다 죽인 다음에, 네가 다 했다고 말하고 다녀도 아무 상관 안 할 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3b888d45-e647-47ea-8ef3-e6d2c445fd24"
msgid ""
"\"I'd rather make you mad than let a monster kill you — or any of the others."
"\""
msgstr "\"실수로 널 죽이는 것보다 화나게 하는 게 쉽겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "701ff238-9c92-4648-9329-6cf03e93c857"
msgid ""
"\"Will you show me that move? The one you used to slice that creep in half? "
"Hey, what you grinning at? You just dare to make another joke about your "
"tent!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 한 건지 좀 보여줘. 괴물을 반으로 갈라버렸잖아. 야, 왜 히죽거려? 또 텐트 농담하려고 그러지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriRegongar/Banter_AmiriRegongar_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6e68c04d-33c5-4d37-bddb-436ae86ef487"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! You're reading my mind! All right, I'll show you, no problem!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 내 생각을 읽었군! 좋아, 보여줄게. 문제없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "05676054-49fc-4df2-b915-ec960ddf692b"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, why you so boring, huh? I've seen you fight! Sword covered in "
"blood, corpses underneath your feet – but your face is so sad, it's like "
"your favorite uncle's funeral.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안, 재미없게 왜 그래? 난 네가 싸우는 모습을 봤어! 피 묻은 검, 발아래 놓인 시체들. 좋잖아. 근데 왜 얼굴이 죽상이야. "
"삼촌 장례식에 온 것도 아닌데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ff8f5a71-b3e8-4456-9d04-d143a05d1e10"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae teaches us to show mercy to all, even one's enemies. By "
"interrupting their life's journey, I've deprived them of a chance to better "
"themselves and atone for their sins.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이는 모두에게 자비를 보이라 가르치셨습니다. 이는 적에게도 마찬가지입니다. 진정으로 회개하기 전에 목숨을 앗아갔으니, 저는 보다 "
"나은 존재가 될 수 있는 기회를 빼앗은 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1d079a40-c9ba-4e98-a383-e60d0a874f62"
msgid ""
"\"If someone hits you on your cheek, you just need to block it, counter-"
"punch, and hit the bastard so hard his ears fall off! Just listen to "
"yourself: mercy, forgiveness...\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가 뺨을 때리려 하면 일단은 막아야지. 다음엔 귀가 떨어져 나가도록 흠씬 두들겨 패주고! 자비, 용서 같은 소리 하고 있네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "311541d2-6d34-4185-a298-55869cdc5d87"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, you confuse mercy and stupidity. One can be merciful and also able "
"to stand up for oneself.\""
msgstr "\"아미리, 당신은 자비와 어리석음을 혼동하고 있습니다. 어떤 이는 자비로우면서 동시에 스스로를 지킬 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d829f4e2-5c6e-439e-be7f-cc934a1ab080"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Tristian! Want to arm-wrestle? I bet I'll win five out of five!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 트리스티안! 팔씨름 할래? 내가 다섯 판 중 다섯 번 이긴다에 걸지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "75592c83-fc97-4a2d-b292-6b0e33aacbc0"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to show everyone your strength, go wrestle a troll. At least "
"his broken bones will heal quickly.\""
msgstr "\"힘 자랑을 하고 싶으시면 트롤과 싸우세요. 적어도 트롤은 뼈가 부러져도 빨리 회복하겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2e6df0c6-02c0-4eb3-9ffc-9d23037a3e5e"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Tristian, why you always forgive everyone for everything? Punch "
"them once, then they respect you right away!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 트리스티안. 넌 왜 항상 사람들을 용서하는 거야? 한 대 갈기면 널 존중해 줄 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "01135bcf-0d7e-4776-a27b-d159b0117aa9"
msgid ""
"\"I don't need that kind of respect, Amiri. It brings nothing but suppressed "
"anger. Sooner or later, they'll understand they were wrong, and apologize "
"for their carelessness and rash words.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 식으로 존중받고 싶지 않습니다, 아미리. 그건 존중이 아닌 억눌린 분노예요. 용서하면, 사람들은 잘못을 헤아려 알고 본인의 "
"부주의와 성급함을 사과한답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "68fc77ab-8afd-4cb2-88e7-41124d20028f"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, if your Sarenrae forgives everyone and everything, maybe she'll "
"forgive me about the couple of coins I owe you, huh?\""
msgstr "\"들어봐, 서렌레이께서는 모든 이를 용서하라고 하신댔지. 그럼 너한테 동전 몇 개 빚진 것도 용서하시겠네?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "555c6c6e-ce6d-4d16-9e1f-0f10703e8436"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, Amiri... Sarenrae forgives sins, not debts. She gives everyone a "
"chance to atone for their mistakes. So you have a chance to repay me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아미라, 아미리...서렌레이께선 죄를 용서하시지 빚을 용서하시지 않습니다. 서렌레이 님은 모두에게 속죄할 기회를 주십니다. 당신은 "
"제게 빚을 갚을 기회를 얻게 되지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4e477092-0f2e-4e50-bd12-fa7189117516"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you tired of being so polite and soft? Don't you want to let off "
"some steam, huh? Go on, pick up a sword, let's practice! I won't hit you too "
"hard!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맨날 예의만 차리면 피곤하지 않아? 너도 쌓인 걸 풀어내고 싶지, 응? 자, 칼 들어. 연습하자! 너무 세게 때리진 않을게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriTristian/Banter_AmiriTristian_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "73896517-c1fb-42f5-a23f-735da798d40c"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for caring, but I don't want to take up arms. These hands like "
"to heal wounds, not inflict them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신경 써주셔서 감사합니다만, 무기를 들고 싶지는 않습니다. 이 손은 상처를 치료하는 손입니다. 다른 이를 상처 입힐 수는 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_AmiriValerie1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7aec290e-a9e6-4269-b0c7-efec644547f5"
msgid ""
"\"So I pick up my clothes this morning — and see some pictures embroided on "
"it — pine trees, clouds, an owlbear fighting a troll... Spill it out, who "
"did that?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아침에 옷을 입으려고 봤더니, 웬 자수가 놓여있지 뭐야. 소나무와 구름, 트롤과 싸우는 아울베어... 실토해, 누가 이랬어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_AmiriValerie1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3ec45b32-5ac5-42b2-9bd6-2a6998f342e9"
msgid ""
"\"I confess. It was I. — I only meant to patch them up a bit… and got a "
"little carried away.\""
msgstr "\"고백할게, 그거 나야. 구멍만 곳만 메우려고 했는데... 갑자기 열중해버려서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_AmiriValerie2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "faafd71b-03af-4db1-923c-6ca7e0d87806"
msgid "\"Five to five already? Or still four to five?\""
msgstr "\"5대 5 였던가? 아니면 아직 4대 5?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_AmiriValerie2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0765e0bb-e8b7-4e65-bcb1-d9fa8a56cc7d"
msgid "\"I won four times, you won five. A good day for sparring!\""
msgstr "\"내가 네 번 이겼고, 네가 다섯 번 이겼어. 스파링하기 좋은 날이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a58003cc-cf04-4b01-ae20-cd0573745d9f"
msgid ""
"\"You fight good but you're boring. A block, a lunge, all with a shield in "
"your hand – where's the fun in that? Just imagine: hit one in the ear, the "
"other in the jaw, and punch the third one so hard he sees above the clouds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 잘 싸우지만 식상해. 방어, 돌진, 전부 손에 방패가 들려있잖아. 그러면 무슨 재미야? 한번 상상해봐. 한 놈은 귀싸대기를 "
"때리고, 다른 한 놈은 턱주가리를 빠갰지, 세 번째 놈은 주먹을 날려 구름 위로 날려버리는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f566b272-2efb-45d9-abc0-0d391ca26db7"
msgid ""
"\"If it weren't for my shield, the whole party would spend all we have on "
"healing potions. You like cracking skulls, and I'm perfectly content with "
"that, but you'd better let me watch your back. It'll be a lot safer for you!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 방패를 들지 않았다면 우리 일행은 힐링 포션을 다 써야 했을걸. 네가 두개골 부수는 걸 뭐라고 하는 건 아냐. 나는 뒤를 지키는 "
"편이 낫다는 거지. 너도 훨씬 안전할 테고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ebb7602a-b06b-4c68-bbed-fe7e59f64f96"
msgid ""
"\"You practice so much – and always by yourself. Aren't you tired of doing "
"the same lunges over and over again? How about we work together?\""
msgstr "\"넌 항상 혼자 연습하는구나. 계속해서 같은 동작만 반복하면 지겹지 않아? 어때, 같이 해볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c28be583-c29f-4f5e-9b26-64ff9f028734"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, why not. But it won't replace my practice. For me, the most "
"important asset in battle is discipline, self-control and iron will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 안 될 거 없지. 그래도 이거랑 별개로 연습은 할 거야. 전투에 있어 가장 중요한 자산은 규율과, 자기 통제, 그리고 강철 "
"같은 의지니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c17140fe-7a1d-49ee-855b-265025c44414"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, I wish I was born in a noble family. Servants to lick my boots and "
"bring me breakfast in bed. Not like in my tribe. They wake you up with a "
"kick, and hustle you to cook for them – the stinking goats!\""
msgstr ""
"\"헤, 나도 귀족 집안에서 태어났으면 좋았을걸. 하인이 내 장화를 핥아주고 침대로 아침을 가져다주겠지. 우리 부족이랑은 다르게 말이야. "
"네가 부족에서 자랐다면, 놈들은 발로 차서 널 깨운 다음 밥 달라고 부엌으로 떠밀었을걸? 냄새나는 염소 같은 놈들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "985c7d02-d0e7-4b20-8b96-82a72d8c603a"
msgid ""
"\"I bet your time among nobility would be even shorter than mine. You'd jump "
"up the moment you were trying on your third dress, or drinking tea with your "
"auntie. You'd trash the place and run into the forest!\""
msgstr ""
"\"귀족 생활을 오래 하긴 어려울 거야. 드레스를 세 번 넘게 갈아입어야 하고, 숙모님과 티타임을 가져야 한다고 하면 어때? 당장 "
"뛰쳐나가 숲으로 줄행랑치지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "08b40c2c-4944-4e5d-9b50-cf7a416b81b7"
msgid "\"Valerie, what weapon do you like best?\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 네가 가장 좋아하는 무기는 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b3fbeea7-590c-4a8e-a2d1-024e1609191b"
msgid ""
"\"Whichever one I'm holding. I've been trained to fight using any blade. "
"Spears, axes, bludgeons and poleaxes. As well as with no weapon at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 거든 내 손에 들린 무기지. 칼, 창, 도끼, 둔기. 전투에서 사용할 수 있도록 모두 훈련받았어. 무기가 없는 상황도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b4d9e10d-c8c8-4088-a5bd-09d7971380df"
msgid ""
"\"Back home we'd say, 'the thicker the armor, the longer it takes to ready "
"the corpse for the pyre.' That's definitely true about you, Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"고향에선 이렇게들 말했지, '갑옷이 두꺼운 시체는 태우기도 어렵다.' 너한테 딱 맞는 말 아냐, 발레리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AmiriValerie/Banter_AmiriValerie_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f7bd0bbf-e907-4d90-9c7e-c98d61863708"
msgid ""
"\"But you'd be quick. We'd just sew your arms and legs back, so you're more-"
"or-less human shaped.\""
msgstr "\"넌 금방 태울 수 있겠네. 잘린 팔이며, 다리만 다시 꿰매 놓으면 될 테니까. 사람 모양이기만 하면 되잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AngelValerie/Banter_AngelValerie_TristianValerie1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1a83fd8d-97f7-4958-a61e-e15952abed1c"
msgid ""
"\"You are so strong and noble, Valerie. Sometimes when I see you fighting, I "
"think of Sarenrae in her battle against Rovagug.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리, 당신은 정말 강하고 고귀한 사람이군요. 당신이 싸우는 모습을 볼 때면, 서렌레이께서 로바거그와 맞서는 모습을 떠오른답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/AngelValerie/Banter_AngelValerie_TristianValerie1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6290976c-7a13-4941-a67d-8d2fb9796207"
msgid ""
"\"That's… that's the greatest compliment I've ever heard in my life, I swear "
"by it. And I've heard a great many compliments!\""
msgstr "\"그건... 내가 살면서 들어본 중 최고의 칭찬입니다. 수많은 찬사를 들어왔지만, 가장 마음에 듭니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunAmiri/Banter_EkunAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "dbd0fe89-f0f9-4351-9c89-a1b5f6d0ed14"
msgid "\"Amiri, you're sad. Has something happened?\""
msgstr "\"아미리, 너 슬퍼 보여. 무슨 일 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunAmiri/Banter_EkunAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bcf796bf-1c8d-4d4b-9c2b-1bd459b5db4a"
msgid ""
"\"The thing is – nothing happened! I didn't even fight anyone for so long. "
"Bo-o-oring!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일은... 아무 일도 없어서 그래! 싸움을 못한 지가 너무 오래됐어. 지-루-해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunAmiri/Banter_EkunAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ec4450d9-ac0a-4934-9b24-14ba3bfb3e63"
msgid "\"You have the spirit of a wolf, Amiri. I feel it.\""
msgstr "\"당신에겐 늑대의 정령이 있어, 아미리. 느낄 수 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunAmiri/Banter_EkunAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6f41d5d1-8b02-4281-9b43-b99d34aad143"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! That's true! But more like a bear. Big! Scary! Anyone who stands in my "
"way – I'll rip them to pieces!\""
msgstr "\"하! 맞아! 그런데 곰에 더 가깝지. 크고! 사나운! 누구든 내 앞 길을 막으면 내가 조각조각 찢어버릴테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunAngel/Banter_EkunAngel_EkunTristian1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "829c5a99-41d0-41d1-81eb-3a8455803058"
msgid "\"Cleric. You often look at me. But never speak.\""
msgstr "\"성직자 나부랭이. 너 자꾸 날 처다보는데. 아무 말도 안하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunAngel/Banter_EkunAngel_EkunTristian1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "40f54a6c-36b4-4653-8de5-76b6e38bf0bb"
msgid ""
"\"You rarely speak yourself. I… feel your pain. Would that I could ease it. "
"And I am saddened, my friend, that it's beyond my power to console you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"본인에 대한 얘기를 거의 하지 않으시는군요. 저는...당신의 고통을 느낄 수 있습니다. 제가 괴로움을 덜어줄 수 있으면 좋겠습니다만, "
"슬프게도 당신을 위로하는 건 제 능력 밖이로군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4fa27570-0fea-4785-bc1b-01a94c40f9cc"
msgid "\"I should have stayed there. Probably.\""
msgstr "\"거기 남아있는 편이 나았을지도 모르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8b2fec88-1077-4519-90d0-76093df4b27a"
msgid ""
"\"But then who would take revenge? I'll take revenge for as long as I live.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 복수는 누가 할까? 난 살아있는 한 복수를 이어가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "290390c2-016f-45f7-a5ba-b57ded4421da"
msgid ""
"\"Wolves are better than people. Many of them, anyway. They know the value "
"of friendship.\""
msgstr "\"늑대가 사람보다 낫다. 그들 중 대부분은 어쨌거나 우정의 가치를 아니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f1e80f0a-e8f4-4806-a6b1-870b0676d2d4"
msgid ""
"\"People call someone a 'wolf' like it's a bad thing. It should be a word of "
"praise.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 어떤 사람을 나쁘게 말할 때 '늑대'라고 부르곤 해. 그건 칭찬의 말이 되어야 겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "eb320677-c560-46e4-8169-d287fedd8352"
msgid "\"The bowstring came undone again. And the shoulders creak.\""
msgstr "\"활줄이 다시 풀렸다. 그리고 어깨가 삐걱거리는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "526db3c9-6164-4437-99b0-3c33e462569c"
msgid ""
"\"A good, solid bow. It will last for a long time. I'll fix it, and Torag "
"will bless it.\""
msgstr "\"단단하고 좋은 활이군. 아주 오래되었어. 내가 이것을 고치면, 토락(Torag)께선 축복하실 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1da06d17-8579-4da4-9326-7a8cb6f82419"
msgid "\"I should never have come to the Stolen Lands.\""
msgstr "\"결코 도둑맞은 땅(the Stolen Lands)에 발을 들여선 안되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunEkun/Banter_EkunEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e86926dc-63e5-4c62-a0f3-76475e839d7b"
msgid ""
"\"No, not like this. I shouldn't have stayed. But now it's too late to leave."
"\""
msgstr "\"아니, 그렇지 않아. 나는 머무를 수 없었어. 그러나 이젠 떠나기에도 늦어버렸군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_EkunHarrim1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c5166386-bee7-429a-9b5b-470dfb25185f"
msgid "\"Torag is a decent god. It's a pity you don't serve him.\""
msgstr "\"토락(Torag)께선 진실된 신이오. 당신이 그분을 섬기지 않아서 유감이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_EkunHarrim1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "aef96cbe-ae50-4fb8-bd6a-2d33927e0b73"
msgid "\"On the day that he betrays you, you will speak otherwise.\""
msgstr "\"그가 너를 배신하는 날, 넌 달리 말하게 될거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ec490af4-9657-4f5c-b0df-9dccc28d8a0e"
msgid ""
"\"You're a dwarf. How could Torag do this to one of his children? I'm sure "
"he will take you back if you accept him in your heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 드워프야. 아무리 토락이라도 자기 아이에게는 모질게 대하지 못해. 네가 토락을 다시 섬기면 그분께서 다시 널 받아주실 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "485a04c3-9256-4d0e-ba3c-7c744df8cc90"
msgid "\"I'd rather accept a dozen swords in my heart than that traitor god!\""
msgstr "\"내 심장에 수십 개의 칼날이 박히는 한이 있어도, 그 배신자 신은 섬기지 않겠소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "331b65b2-6814-4263-a867-e7b55d115b7c"
msgid "\"Harrim, you are confused. I can feel it.\""
msgstr "\"하림, 혼란스러워하고 있구나. 느껴져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a8b5a2b3-0477-49a1-93c8-3c027a928e82"
msgid ""
"\"Confused? No, Ekun, you don't understand. This is not confusion, it's "
"despair. I've lived in despair for several years and I have no intention of "
"leaving it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혼란? 에쿤, 이해를 못하는군. 난 혼란을 겪는 게 아니라 절망하고 있다네. 이 절망 속에서 수년을 살아왔고, 그 삶에서 벗어날 "
"생각이 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1cad0ba9-0c6d-46c6-be65-8482b04e7072"
msgid "\"Why do you always think about death?\""
msgstr "\"왜 항상 죽음을 염두에 두는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "da635584-9133-4f6c-83ef-ff061f1206da"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, Ekun, Ekun... How can I answer this question? I'm more surprised that "
"none of you think about it much at all!\""
msgstr "\"하, 에쿤, 에쿤... 내가 이 질문에 어떻게 답해야겠소? 다들 죽음에 대해 깊게 생각해본 적이 없다니 놀라울 뿐인데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7ee85482-f142-4cac-8490-28935768d052"
msgid "\"You behave like a dead man. Why?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 곧 죽을 사람처럼 행동하는군. 왜지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunHarrim/Banter_EkunHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6c1c2ff1-b1ca-4b1b-a593-a1467593c448"
msgid ""
"\"I am a dead man, just like us all. We are alive for a moment, and dead for "
"eternity. Which condition do you think more important?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그야 난 죽을 테니까. 우리 모두가 그렇지. 우리가 살아 숨쉬는 건 잠시 뿐이고, 그 후엔 영원토록 죽은 상태야. 그렇다면 삶과 "
"죽음. 둘 중 어느 것이 더 중요하겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "db93e7bf-85d4-4055-8614-d29cf034bba4"
msgid "\"Stay away from me, Jaethal. You smell like the dead.\""
msgstr "\"나에게서 떨어지시오, 제이탈. 당신은 체취는 죽음의 냄새를 닮았소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9ce242e9-e0fe-4f5b-9c5a-799e9e9f5b99"
msgid ""
"\"My perfume smells of lavender, sandalwood and a hint of musk. While you "
"stink of grief and gloom. Which of us is more dead?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내게선 라벤더와 샌달우드, 그리고 사향이 들어간 향수 냄새가 나. 넌 슬픔에 짓눌린 인간의 악취가 풍기고. 어느 쪽이 더 죽은 사람에 "
"가까우려나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a4150f8e-196d-4026-94a6-c4403f21cbdb"
msgid ""
"\"Unlife is worse than death. Death is honest, Jaethal. Why do you fear it "
"so?\""
msgstr "\"불멸의 삶을 사느니 차라리 죽는 게 낫지. 정직한 이는 죽음을 택한다오, 제이탈. 왜 그리 죽음을 두려워하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "26644501-5659-43b2-a685-d3adcac0bd41"
msgid ""
"\"Do you truly think you've no fear of death? What are you waiting for then? "
"A blade is always at hand. Follow your family – no one's going to cry for "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽음이 두렵지 않은가? 그럼 뭘 꾸물거리지? 바로 옆에 칼이 있어. 얼른 가족의 뒤를 따라가. 네가 죽었다고 슬퍼할 이도 남지 "
"않았잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1e829c71-c270-4c65-9e8d-b762e515c33f"
msgid "\"It's too bad our paths lie side by side, Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 같은 길을 걸어야 한다니 몹시 유감이군, 제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "36c1c2f3-c0b7-43f3-84d1-6e86c006467e"
msgid ""
"\"I find no pleasure in bearing you as an ally, either. Perhaps the day will "
"come when you and I settle our arguments once and for all. For now, just "
"stay quiet and do what you must.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 또한 네 존재를 감내하는 데서 어떠한 즐거움도 찾을 수 없군. 언젠가 서로 시비를 가릴 날이 오겠지. 당장은 입 다물고 네 일이나 "
"하렴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "daa2a567-625f-4aea-a8e0-ae1c848fdf7d"
msgid "\"{name} trusts you. I don't. I watch you.\""
msgstr "\"{name}은 널 믿지. 난 아냐. 널 지켜보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "28fa4e3c-7d19-48eb-9955-759bf98d55dc"
msgid ""
"\"What does trust have to do with it? {Name} sees the benefits of our "
"alliance, and knows I see them too. You can watch all you want, but if I "
"decide to turn on you, you'll see it too late to react.\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿음이라? {Name}이나 나나, 서로 이해관계가 성립하니 같이 다니는 것뿐이야. 날 지켜보는 거야 네 할 탓이지만, 내가 정말로 네 "
"뒤를 노려야 할 때가 오면… 너무 늦기 전에 네가 알아챌 수나 있을까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2adf6ced-c120-47f1-a039-1cb1b9ff8a50"
msgid ""
"\"You have the manners of a monster. You are more like a troll than an elf! "
"Where is your pride?\""
msgstr "\"괴물이 따로 없군. 당신 엘프가 아니라 트롤이지? 최소한의 자존심도 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7f949c45-5c87-4eac-a090-458d7fdcb441"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone in the party thinks you're the quiet one. But with me you are "
"surprisingly eloquent. But perhaps you'd be so kind as to show me your "
"legendary reticence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다들 네가 조용한 사람이라던데, 이상하게 내 앞에만 서면 유창하게 혀를 놀린단 말이지. 명망 높은 과묵한 사냥꾼을 나도 만나보고 "
"싶군. 부디 내게 친절을 베풀어 주겠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "97c04fe4-cb38-41ad-8056-eb625daddf8d"
msgid "\"Don't stand behind me. I'll shoot you. I don't trust you.\""
msgstr "\"내 뒤에 서지마. 널 쏘아버릴 테니까. 난 널 믿지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJaethal/Banter_EkunJaethal_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "585070ee-3f16-434c-8190-1bca37745dc4"
msgid ""
"\"And you'd better not stand upwind of me. Your smell makes me want to waste "
"a couple spells to cleanse you. – To the bone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 바람이 부는 방향에 서지나 마. 네 체취 떄문에 얼마 안 남은 주문을 세척 마법으로 쓰고 싶어진다. 뼛속까지 박박 닦으면 "
"없어지긴 하려나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f97e5fbe-7cb9-4798-9499-bfa2175bc528"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost. We are allies, not enemies. Why are you unkind to those who shed "
"their blood with you?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 우린 같은 편이다. 적이 아니지. 함께 피 흘린 이들에게 불친절한 이유가 뭔가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1d84378b-a71c-4ff9-9ca5-c73bfeec0aab"
msgid ""
"\"I'm unkind? Ekun, my dear friend, I'm incredibly kind, tolerant, and "
"placid towards our entire troupe, even to those who may not deserve it! "
"Besides, what you call 'unkindness' I call 'honesty'."
msgstr ""
"\"내가 불친절하다고? 친애하는 친구여, 나는 동료들에게 놀라울 정도로 친절하고 관대하며 온화한 모습을 보여주었네. 그만한 수준이 안 "
"되는 자에게도 말이야! 자네가 느끼기에 ‘불친절’하다는 말인 즉슨, 내가 ‘솔직’했다는 의미겠지."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cfbe746c-b3dc-4402-8be4-ed3e322d677b"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost is never full, no matter how much he eats. How can a tiny body "
"hold such a huge stomach?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트가 배부르다고 하는 걸 들어본 적이 없군. 그 작은 몸에 든 위장이 어떻게 그토록 늘어날 수 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "27cd0610-077b-4341-b576-e6eb6b27ecc5"
msgid ""
"\"I eat as much as I like! I can afford it! You'd better watch your dog, "
"though. – Last night it stole the jerked meat I'd saved for morning!\""
msgstr ""
"\"먹고 싶은 만큼 먹는 거지. 그게 별일인가! 그보다 자네 개나 잘 감시해줬으면 좋겠군. 지난 밤에 그 녀석이 내가 아침에 먹으려고 "
"남겨둔 육포를 훔쳐먹었다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f66f082c-41f6-4325-b205-fa6a3433d308"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost, you've been to many countries. Seen many different customs. "
"There are places where a sharp word nets you a knife in a back...\""
msgstr ""
"\"주빌로스트, 너는 수많은 나라를 여행했지. 다양한 관습을 경험했을 테고. 그중에 가시돋친 말로 싸우는 곳이 있었나 본데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "480a29fb-34b2-43ca-93b0-ddd66af8370b"
msgid ""
"\"Very true! But on the other hand, I'm not helpless either. My words might "
"sometimes be painful, but a vial of alchemical fire hurts a good deal more!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 알고 있군! 그곳에서 잘 나가긴 했지만 다른 곳에서도 속수무책은 아니었지. 왜 그런 줄 아나? 냉소는 때와 장소를 가리지만, "
"연금술사의 폭탄은 그보다 훨씬 아파!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d0dd37c9-0d16-4b74-9511-625c20128185"
msgid "\"I think I've read your book. About dinosaurs. Am I right?\""
msgstr "\"네가 쓴 책을 읽어봤다. 공룡 얘기였지 아마?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a09becc8-2f26-4432-841e-0de93d52f46d"
msgid ""
"\"Ah yes! 'Megafauna And How To Cook It'? Yes, that one wasn't bad! Heh, but "
"will I ever try the tongue of a triceratops again?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아! '거대동물, 어떻게 조리할까'말이지? 그래, 그거 나쁘지 않았지! 헤, 언제 한번 트리케라톱스 혀에 대한 책을 내야하는데 말이지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "21554735-97d5-4e7c-8493-83a5ccfe9e9d"
msgid "\"Sit. Don't attack. I don't like him either, but he's a friend.\""
msgstr "\"앉아. 공격하면 안 돼. 저 사람이 싫기는 나도 마찬가지다만, 그래도 우리 친구란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0627bd80-4ff4-4884-ad51-1d13edc6ae88"
msgid ""
"\"Ha. Tell your beast I don't like it either. I'd tell it myself, but we're "
"not on speaking terms after it gnawed on my field alchemy reference book!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하. 그 짐승한테 나도 널 싫어한다고 전해줘. 평소 같으면 직접 얘기하겠지만 내 연금술 교본을 물어뜯어 놓은 이상 좋은 말이 나가긴 "
"어려울 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8c627a32-be11-4889-b8aa-d1a7bcfc9d2f"
msgid "\"You hurt everyone. Why? Your tongue is like a snake.\""
msgstr "\"왜 상처 주는 말을 하지? 뱀의 혀가 따로 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2a003640-6a49-49e0-baa9-070bb93c416e"
msgid ""
"\"I never hurt anyone without a good reason! I point out people's mistakes "
"for them. It's just that hardly anybody likes to admit they're wrong! – So "
"they get angry at me instead of thanking me and improving themselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 아무 이유 없이 남을 상처입히는 사람이 아냐! 개선할 부분을 짚어준 거라고. 자기 실수를 받아들이는 게 그렇게 어려워? 내게 "
"감사하지 못할 망정 화를 낼 만큼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "395b93d2-41e0-4500-bfca-6140d4820c3f"
msgid "\"Look around. What if someone is following us.\""
msgstr "\"주변을 확인해라. 누군가 우리를 노릴 수도 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f433f0e2-c432-48a3-a837-c01437aeb874"
msgid ""
"\"You're always on the lookout for an attack! But just think about it: who "
"in their right mind would follow a party including the invincible Ekun and a "
"few of his insane friends?\""
msgstr ""
"\"항상 경계를 늦추지 않는군! 그런데 말이지, 정신이 똑바로 박힌 자가 무적의 에쿤과 그에 못지 않게 무서운 친구들을 쫓을 것 같나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5f8324bb-84c6-41e6-bad4-a9f0091e1a7a"
msgid ""
"\"All I do is look around. Everything is so different here, so unlike my "
"homeland. Even the sky seems different!\""
msgstr "“세상은 정말 구경거리가 많은 것 같아. 모든 게 고향과는 다르네. 같은 하늘 마저도 달라보여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunJubilost/Banter_EkunJubilost_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e6afaca7-ae0a-4d41-8eb3-ce7ef3c75014"
msgid "\"Admirers, I suspect. They're hard to lose, even in this backwater!\""
msgstr "\"그저 세상이 아름다운가 봐. 이런 벽지마저도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3fd9c9c8-6e0f-4738-bb50-6bf2f87a846f"
msgid ""
"\"You said Vordakai is screwed? Screwed to what? Why use screws and not "
"nails?\""
msgstr "\"너, 보다카이가 나사라고? 뭘 조일 때 쓰는데? 왜 못이 아니라 나사를 쓰는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8b6f3eb2-7787-45c3-95de-5dbd42bf0ebc"
msgid ""
"\"Because screws are multipurpose tools. You can screw a table, screw up or "
"screw around.\""
msgstr "\"왜냐하면 나사는 다용도 도구니까. 넌 테이블을 조여서 부셔버리거나 거기 대고 박아댈 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7b4eb2c2-343b-4797-95d9-68d6a4e8623c"
msgid "\"Don't look at me, storyteller. I have no stories for your book.\""
msgstr "\"날 보지 마, 이야기꾼. 난 이야깃거리 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "13e92275-eed2-401c-b2d9-d0d54eee99e8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, how come? You can talk about every leaf and bug in the forest! You "
"can't say anything about yourself?\""
msgstr "\"아니, 어째서? 숲의 식물과 벌레 얘기도 괜찮아! 다른 사정이 있는 게 아니라면 네 얘기도 좋고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2c1b4c24-6850-452f-94a8-05822f69d6e9"
msgid "\"If you need stories, ask the others. I've performed no feats.\""
msgstr "\"이야기가 필요하면 다른 사람을 찾아. 내가 대단한 업적을 세운 것도 아니니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3a32bc37-d1a3-472b-8cd8-0551ad7dd68c"
msgid ""
"\"You think I'm only interested in feats? Ha! Any fool can write about "
"feats. But about true life...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 난 대단한 업적에만 관심이 있는 게 아냐! 그런 건 아무나 받아 적을 수 있잖아. 난 누군가의 인생을 생생하게 기록으로 남기고 "
"싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a7f6107b-d525-4a9e-a84a-6fc7f51a9627"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi. I don't want to talk about myself. Or my family. Or my life. I "
"don't.\""
msgstr "\"린지. 난 내 얘길 하고 싶지 않아. 가족이나 내 삶에 대해서. 그냥 그러고 싶지 않네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "03957fe2-362a-4138-a7f3-58d2189b9b66"
msgid ""
"\"I even didn't open my mouth yet, and already you're shutting me up! I just "
"wanted to ask if you had any salt left!\""
msgstr "\"난 아무 말도 안 했는데, 아예 입을 다물길 바라네! 난 그냥 소금 남은 거 있는지 물어보려 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1cedd7b3-27d6-4b18-b23d-81acba2734ca"
msgid "\"You would like it in Absalom. It's a noisy city. Big.\""
msgstr "\"너도 압살롬이 마음에 들 거야. 아주 시끄러운 도시지. 거대하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "70453d40-5451-4672-9882-e4d39a4960b5"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, I wish I could trade my homeland for Absalom! And you'd probably be "
"happy in my quiet village. But now – oh well! Now we both have our home "
"here, in the Stolen Lands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"헤, 압살롬하고 내 고향을 맞바꿨으면 좋겠다! 너도 조용한 우리 마을이 마음에 들 거야. 어쨌든 지금은 우리 둘 다 여기 도둑맞은 땅("
"the Stolen Lands)이 집이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0203bd00-3d39-4ed8-b0f1-35d4d641afb7"
msgid ""
"\"I like visiting cities from time to time, but I'd rather sleep in a tent "
"under the stars, than stare at stone walls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 때때로 도시에 나가는 것이 좋긴 하지만 별 아래 텐트에서 잠드는 것이 더 좋군, 돌벽을 쳐다봐야 하는 것보단 나으니 말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "56d69fe7-be42-426c-b9fd-2a1e0f624d35"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes, I'd like to go there! And maybe take the Test of the Starstone! "
"Just imagine what a goddess I would make!\""
msgstr "\"오, 그래, 나도 밖에 나가고 싶어! 그럼 어쩌면 스타스톤의 시험에 들 수도 있겠지! 상상해봐 내가 어떤 여신이 될지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5c5b28f0-7a92-4b30-b252-76991af2ee5d"
msgid "\"Why do people write everything down? Memory is firmer than paper.\""
msgstr "\"왜 사람들은 모든 것을 기록하는거지? 기억은 종이보다 견고한데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c8456a0b-4e45-474c-a79a-9924c1d7d45a"
msgid ""
"\"You can't borrow someone else's memory and read it in a library! Besides, "
"memories die with their owners, while books keep living... Well, maybe not "
"forever, but definitely longer than their authors!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 다른 사람의 기억을 빌릴 수 없겠지만 도서관에서 읽을 수는 있지! 거기에 기억이란 건 그 주인과 함께 죽어버리지만, 책은 계속 "
"남잖아...그래, 영원히는 아닐지 몰라도, 그것을 기록한 이보다는 적어도 오래갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a3e08471-e652-465b-b6b6-3ee6d0b5cc11"
msgid ""
"\"I find peace in it. Remembering the beauty of a moment is one thing, but "
"describing it in a way that will bring it to life years later — that's "
"something different.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그 안에서 평화를 찾았어. 아름다움의 순간을 기억하는 것은 특별하지만 그것을 묘사하는 것은 전혀 다른 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a68c00f6-fd8c-4c4e-b068-ba6a94f92676"
msgid ""
"\"Most honorable Ekundayo, you used to guard caravans. Do you think your "
"employer's business would have thrived if he only did his accounting in "
"memory, not on paper?\""
msgstr "\"에쿤다요. 카라반을 호위했다고 했지. 네 고용주의 사업이 종이 없이 번창했다고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "736ba269-4138-4d9f-b835-10a456cb1894"
msgid "\"Don't touch those flowers. They're dangerous. Poison.\""
msgstr "\"이 꽃들을 만지지 마. 그들은 위험해. 독이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunLinzi/Banter_EkunLinzi_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "93c5f59d-fe81-4972-8b9d-8484b88f3a56"
msgid ""
"\"Oh! Seriously?! And I was about to pick a bouquet! How can such beautiful "
"flowers be poisonous? Thanks for the warning.\""
msgstr "\"오! 진짜로?! 꽃다발을 만들려고 했는데! 어떻게 이렇게 아름다운 꽃들이 독이 있는거지? 알려줘서 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunNokNok/Banter_EkunNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1dcd4f03-27c4-46f7-bed4-85594a239e90"
msgid "\"Keep your distance, Nok-Nok. We follow different paths.\""
msgstr "\"떨어져라, 녹-녹. 우린 각자의 길을 따른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunNokNok/Banter_EkunNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e54271ea-133e-40e9-983c-0f475961365f"
msgid ""
"\"How so? Will you go separately? Seek your own adventure? If so, farewell "
"then!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게? 따로 갈거야? 너만의 모험을 찾아서? 그렇다면, 이별이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_EkunOctavia1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c27f11f0-bff3-4637-97f0-0d0fef4efe12"
msgid "\"Your heart is kind. But the shackles of slavery leave deep scars.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 진정으로 친절합니다. 그러나 노예의 족쇄는 깊은 상처를 남깁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_EkunOctavia1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "cf88f85c-ed25-49f0-9d70-1f93741611e0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure I take your meaning, Ekun. But being sold into slavery by "
"your own mother — it's true, you can't just forget something like that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 말 뜻을 제대로 이해했는지 모르겠군요, 에쿤. 그러나 당신의 어머니에 의해 노예로 팔리는 건, 그건 그렇게 잊혀질 수가 없지요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "32a3d36c-177b-4c3a-80de-c5143d86dd96"
msgid ""
"\"You are kind, but your kindness misses its target. I will never be the "
"same.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 친절하지만, 당신의 친절이 향하는 대상은 잘못되었어요. 전 그렇게 되지 않을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0fd00da4-bff0-497d-af4b-1ef062897e06"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have any targets! You can be whatever you like. That's true "
"freedom!\""
msgstr "\"나에겐 대상이란 없습니다! 당신은 당신이 하고픈 대로 할 수 있습니다. 그게 바로 진정한 자유입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "82e3bf49-7f81-4acd-803b-534b88339ea1"
msgid "\"Octavia, tell me, did your parents...\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 이야기해줘, 너의 부모님이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3b639e8d-1288-4aab-8312-a3861195db41"
msgid ""
"\"Not another word, all right? I know, I know, your family and everything... "
"But, for the love of the gods, don't mention my parents again, unless you "
"want to hear something you won't like!\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 말하지 마, 알았지? 나는, 나는, 너의 가족과 모든 것에 대해 알아...그렇지만, 제발 나의 부모님에 대해 다시 언급하지 "
"말아줘, 네가 듣고 싶지 않은 것을 듣고 싶어질 때까진!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7da77373-e7c6-4398-ac5e-40180e45e637"
msgid "\"You have a bruise. That will bother you. A leech would help.\""
msgstr "\"멍이 있군. 괴롭겠는걸. 거머리가 도움이 될 수 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunOctavia/Banter_EkunOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e7c50f07-9877-4c89-9e77-49850b7913bc"
msgid ""
"\"What? A leech?! No thank you. It'll somehow have to figure out a way to "
"heal by itself!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 거머리?! 괜찮아. 어떻게든 회복될테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "388a7f91-dd68-456d-b97d-f8646a8812fc"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, you don't value life. Your recklessness will be your undoing.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 넌 니 삶을 소중하게 여기지 않는군. 너의 무모함이 네 무덤을 만들고 말거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1ee9da56-8c2c-4a9c-acb1-7bf555273cc6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't value my life? Ha! I have a fantastic knack for life! A good "
"fight, a hearty meal, a strong drink and a warm bed – now that's life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 내 삶을 소중히 여기지 않는다고? 하! 난 내 삶을 위한 환상적인 요령들이 있지! 잘 싸우는 거, 풍족한 식사, 쎈 술, 그리고 "
"따뜻한 침대. 그게 바로 내 삶이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "855706e6-588e-4ebe-a7f1-ba4b896d893f"
msgid "\"Where's my dagger? Regongar, have you seen it?\""
msgstr "\"내 단검이 어딨지? 레곤가르 본 적 있니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ca7581cd-3145-4112-9c4c-9fe86de7259c"
msgid ""
"\"Your dagger? I think I grabbed a knife to cut myself some bread. It was "
"lying by your knapsack – look over there in the grass.\""
msgstr "\"니 단검? 내 기억엔 빵을 자르려고 칼을 잡았었던 거 같은데. 니 배낭 옆에 놓여있었거든. 한번 저쪽 풀숲을 찾아봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a569f18a-9c63-4c8f-b7ba-66591fc6752c"
msgid ""
"\"You blame the Technic League for what you have become. But a slaver's lash "
"hurts only the body. It was you alone who mangled your soul.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 기술 연맹이 널 그렇게 만든걸 원망하지. 그렇지만 노예 상인들의 채찍은 단지 몸에 상처를 입힐 뿐이야. 니 영혼을 엉망으로 만든 "
"건 바로 너야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "39173f76-0fbd-40a9-bdbd-1ca40ff1bf05"
msgid ""
"\"Sure, well you can go to hell with your philosophy. Some man of wisdom! "
"You pissed away everything you had in life, and now you want to go around "
"teaching others!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 그럼 넌 니 철학이랑 같이 지옥으로 꺼져버려. 아주 대단한 지혜로운 놈아! 넌 니 삶의 모든 걸 낭비해 놓고는 이젠 주변의 "
"다른 사람들을 가르치려 하는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "736e3195-38a5-47e8-815d-235e2bc144d2"
msgid "\"You are lucky, Regongar. You have Octavia. Treasure her.\""
msgstr "\"운이 좋네, 레곤가르. 넌 옥타비아를 가졌잖아. 그녀를 소중히 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0a40f76a-2be4-4120-b322-7e263b995f88"
msgid ""
"\"No way! Without you, I'd never have figured out that I should value the "
"most important person in my life. Thanks, Ekun – you really opened my eyes "
"here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안되! 너 없인, 내 인생에서 가장 중요한 사람을 소중히 해야 한다는 것을 결코 알아차리지 못했을거야. 고마워, 에쿤, 넌 정말로 내 "
"눈을 뜨게 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "90dd8ebc-121f-4c8d-98d3-1841736f2a7b"
msgid ""
"\"You are too cruel. If you do not control the beast in you, you'll become "
"an animal yourself.\""
msgstr "\"넌 너무 잔인해. 니 안에 짐승을 다룰 수 없다면 넌 그저 한 마리 짐승이 되어 버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunRegongar/Banter_EkunRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f43690b1-cf0c-44ca-a6c6-964ab502aea0"
msgid ""
"\"I've always been an animal! They wanted to raise me like a watchdog, but "
"they got themselves a wild wolf, ha ha.\""
msgstr "\"난 언제나 짐승이었어! 그들은 날 감시견으로 키우길 바랬지만, 그들은 야생의 늑대를 두게 된거지, 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunTristian/Banter_EkunTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "eb6ed619-fce7-44f5-8e58-19ffd0445ae2"
msgid "\"Tristian, you're looking at me strangely. What's wrong?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안, 날 이상하게 쳐다보는군? 뭐가 잘못됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunTristian/Banter_EkunTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ac9eed61-ae00-4cc2-8245-b82092fbdede"
msgid ""
"\"I see so much pain and suffering in you... Forgive me for not being able "
"to lighten your burden.\""
msgstr "\"당신에게서 수많은 고통과 괴로움이 보입니다... 그 부담을 덜어드릴 수 없음을 용서하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunTristian/Banter_EkunTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1a8ac29c-56c1-4544-83d5-f69b72a2f2f1"
msgid ""
"\"You can fight. You aren't afraid. I have seen this. So why do you avoid "
"fighting?\""
msgstr "\"넌 싸울 수 있어. 두려워하지도 않고. 내게도 보이는 사실이 이런데, 왜 싸우려 하질 않지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunTristian/Banter_EkunTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0b618298-0434-445a-a2ca-1dbc8c40c50a"
msgid ""
"\"Because every battle, win or lose, is another defeat. Every death is "
"another soul that will never come to repent and be forgiven.\""
msgstr "\"모든 싸움은 이기든 지든, 제게는 패배나 다름없기 때문입니다. 죽은 영혼은 회개할 수도, 용서받을 수도 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2011f4b3-44d8-40f1-9695-d2cb0f4a1eb1"
msgid ""
"\"You seldom utter a rude word, but your words and actions are often cruel. "
"Why is this?\""
msgstr "\"무례한 말조차 하지 않으시는 분이, 때때로 잔인한 행동을 하실 때가 있더군요. 왜 그런 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f54e196a-5621-4d60-a6d6-117b228ab606"
msgid ""
"\"One doesn't exclude the other. My sword always shines, I can't stand dirt "
"on my armor... but when it comes to battle, I slash without mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두 가지가 함께하는 경우는 적지 않습니다. 나의 검이 언제나 날카롭기를, 갑옷에는 먼지 한 점 내려앉지 않기를 바라도... 전투에서는 "
"일격에 자비를 두지 않는 것과 다름없지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "dfbbea4d-4155-469f-9d21-c8cbc741fdda"
msgid "\"It's difficult to live without faith. I couldn't do it.\""
msgstr "\"믿음 없이 살아간다는 것은 어렵습니다. 나는 그렇게 할 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "38a2152a-c054-425a-862e-f6c6bccc68ca"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me if my words seem rude, but... You only need faith because "
"you've survived what you have. You need faith like a lame man needs his "
"crutches. And I need it like a healthy man does.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 말이 무례하게 들렸다면 용서하기를 바라, 하지만...네가 믿음이 필요한 이유는 오로지 네가 그것으로 살아남았기 때문이야. 너의 "
"신앙은 마치 절름발이가 그의 목발이 필요한 것과 같아. 그리고 내게 신앙은 건강한 사람이 그런 것처럼 필요한 거고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "99467f56-5e5e-4086-8c80-572ca20f9580"
msgid "\"I haven't seen many pictures. But those I have seen were beautiful.\""
msgstr "\"난 많은 그림들을 보지 못했어. 하지만 내가 본 그림들은 아름다웠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7649bb46-25bc-4af4-adc4-53b82872f51f"
msgid ""
"\"You would think otherwise if you'd seen as many as I have. They are... "
"Cold. Pretentious. And useless.\""
msgstr "\"만약 내가 본 만큼 너도 봤었다면 너는 다르게 생각했을거야. 그것들은...차갑고, 가식적이며, 쓸모가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b5d272f0-2dbf-4f9a-9ea0-22228e014b7b"
msgid ""
"\"Do you think you are better than others? Is it because your parents are "
"nobles?\""
msgstr "\"네가 다른 사람보다 낫다고 생각해? 네 부모님이 귀족이라서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/EkunValerie/Banter_EkunValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "29e56aea-0897-414e-9be9-1b2451086800"
msgid ""
"\"It's not arrogance, just dignity. Unfortunately, many people – especially "
"among the commoners – are taught from childhood always to doubt themselves. "
"That's why they don't understand the difference.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오만한게 아니라, 품위 있는 겁니다. 불운하게도, 많은 사람들 특히나 평민들 중에서는 어린 시절부터 그들 스스로를 항상 의심하게끔 "
"가르칩니다. 그게 바로 그들이 차이를 이해하지 못하게끔 하는 것이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "44637e6e-4782-440e-9d21-bf46fe384f29"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, I know you must understand that death is inevitable, and eventually "
"you will have to face it...\""
msgstr "\"아미리, 죽음은 피할 수 없거니와 갑작스럽게 맞이해야 한다는 것을 당신이 이해했으면 하오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "64eaab07-19ba-4596-a038-6e659eaacd11"
msgid ""
"\"Are you going to babble on about Broetus again? R-r-r... Do you see that "
"rock? Go and hit your head on it. Or I will!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너 또 브로테우스인가 뭔가에 대해서 지껄이려는 거야? 으으으으...너 저기 바위가 보여? 거기에 머리를 세게 박고 오라고. 아니면 "
"내가 칠테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a734230d-e31d-492d-82a3-dd0c16d7734c"
msgid ""
"\"You have such a huge sword... How is it that you don't tire of swinging "
"it, Amiri?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 정말 거대한 검을 가졌구료...어떻게 그걸 휘두르는데도 지치질 않소, 아미리?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f6bd1378-1f57-4ec0-80a5-c70623d78d11"
msgid ""
"\"You have such a busy tongue... How is it that you don't tire of wagging "
"it, heh, Harrim?\""
msgstr "\"넌 정말 쉼없이 놀리는 혀를 가졌고...어떻게 그걸 그렇게 놀리는데도 지치질 않는거야, 응, 하림?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8cf8eefc-10e2-4e07-9356-8a31df326ee8"
msgid "\"What god do the Six Bears venerate?\""
msgstr "\"여섯 곰 부족(the Six Bears)은 어떤 신을 숭배하오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2c1e87ac-32c7-433b-956b-b1f82bd46383"
msgid ""
"\"The men? Gorum, of course. Because they are all such great warriors, you "
"know. As for the women, they worship either their ancestors or Erastil. They "
"tried to stop me from praying to Gorum, but I smashed a couple of mugs and "
"they left me be!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남자들? 물론, 고룸이겠지. 왜냐면 너도 알겠지만 그들은 전부 대단한 전사들잖아. 아마 여자들은 자신들의 조상이나 에라스틸을 "
"숭배하겠지. 그들은 내가 고룸에게 기도하는 걸 그만두게 하려고 했지만, 내가 술잔 몇개를 날려버리니까 그대로 하게끔 해주더군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "859d6009-9aa7-41fd-9760-412f5b75eaf4"
msgid ""
"\"Drinking and fighting... Amiri, don't you understand how empty and "
"ridiculous all this is?\""
msgstr "\"마시고 싸우고...아미리, 이게 얼마나 우스꽝스럽고 공허한 일인지 모르겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9f0d06ff-9cc2-4750-8bb1-2e505271a762"
msgid ""
"\"Your head is empty! And your face is ridiculous. In fact, you are "
"ridiculous all around. A good fight and some booze – what else do you need "
"to be happy?\""
msgstr ""
"\"니 머리가 비었겠지! 그리고 니 얼굴이 우스꽝스러운거고. 사실, 넌 전부 우스꽝스러워. 멋지게 싸우는거 하고 몇 잔의 술, 이거 말고 "
"뭐가 더 행복해지는데 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fa4bee85-2432-40e2-990e-6743f0ea8cc1"
msgid ""
"\"Haven't you seen enough death – been the cause of so much death – that "
"you've thought about what awaits you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 죽음들이 또 죽음을 불러일으키고 그 많은 죽음이 바로 당신을 기다리고 있는 것이란걸 생각해 볼 정도로 충분히 보지 않았소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAmiri/Banter_HarrimAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "001b7dc3-6b04-4b17-9794-9dcac511e751"
msgid ""
"\"What's there to think about? I'll live while I'm alive, and when I'm dead, "
"it's the end. I'll go to Gorum's feast!\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각해 볼게 뭐가 있어? 내가 살아있는 동안 난 살아있는거지, 그리고 내가 죽으면, 그걸로 끝이고. 난 고룸의 축제로 향하겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAngel/Banter_HarrimAngel_HarrimTristian1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "458d05b5-a48c-4f7e-a693-f3d7bd376239"
msgid ""
"\"So you came to me again. Another attempt to convince me that the world "
"won't end? That I'll not find peace in the teachings of Groetus?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래 다시 내게로 왔구려. 세계가 종말치 않는다는 걸 내게 또 다시 설득하시려고 하는거요? 내가 그로투스의 가르침에서 평화를 찾지 "
"못할 것라는거요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimAngel/Banter_HarrimAngel_HarrimTristian1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "873a0349-d34c-460d-a5f1-501f57990c93"
msgid ""
"\"I just brought you a piece of pie that remained after lunch. Enjoy, and "
"we'll save the arguments for later.\""
msgstr "\"점심 먹고 남은 파이 한 조각 전해주러 왔을뿐이야. 맛있게 들어, 그리고 우리 언쟁은 다음으로 미루자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0ab9aac1-af26-4004-a92e-8b5b985b49b2"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't it ridiculous for people to worship Torag – the god who betrays "
"dwarves?\""
msgstr "\"사람들이 토락을 숭배한다는 게 우습지 않소, 드워프를 배반한 신을?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "772cc573-5ae9-4d03-bf41-28cd6e579526"
msgid "\"It's not. What's ridiculous is to worship destruction and ashes.\""
msgstr "\"우습지 않아. 우스운건 파괴와 재를 숭배하는게 우스운 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c974cb0b-ba01-4452-b27c-814ef0ddeb48"
msgid ""
"\"Torag is the patron of pointless fuss. He teaches the forging of metal, "
"without thinking of the rust that will eventually turn it to sand...\""
msgstr "\"토락은 무의미한 소란의 수호자일 뿐이오. 그는 언젠가 모래로 변해버릴 녹에 대한 생각없이 철을 주조하는 걸 가르쳤소...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5805f7fb-299b-4c6a-9ab2-29516c012d0d"
msgid ""
"\"Then a new blacksmith will forge new metal. Torag will help the grandson "
"the way he helped his grandfather.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 새로운 대장장이가 새로운 철을 주조하겠군. 토락은 할아버지를 도운 것처럼 손자를 도울 것이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d2316211-ed87-496d-a82d-fce66cef6ae5"
msgid "\"What drives you? You of all men must feel the frailty of life.\""
msgstr "\"무엇이 당신을 살아가게끔 하오? 당신과 같은 모든 인간들은 삶의 덧없음을 알아야만 하오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "984e0530-0af2-4dd0-84c7-3be7409cc3f0"
msgid ""
"\"I live while there is something to live for. What about you, priest? What "
"keeps you going?\""
msgstr "\"나는 내가 살아가기 위한 무언가가 있는 동안 살아가지. 사제 너는 어떤데? 무엇이 너를 살아가게끔 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "22c785fc-e74c-48b9-806c-6bd7fce657d2"
msgid ""
"\"Groetus is patient. He scornfully watches this pathetic fuss at his feet, "
"knowing the outcome has already been decided. Isn't that a manifestation of "
"divine wisdom?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그로투스께선 기다리시오. 그분께서는 자신의 발밑에서 일어나는 미약한 소동에 대해서도 어떤 것이 일어날 지 알고 있음에도 조심히 "
"바라보신다오. 그것이 그분의 성스런 지혜를 표현하는게 아니겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a37912a8-8a40-4bc6-887e-f1dc86511d13"
msgid "\"Groetus may be patient. Me – not so much. Spare me your preaching.\""
msgstr "\"그로투스는 그럴지도 모르지. 난, 그렇지 않아. 설교 좀 그만해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b29915ea-a5c6-4653-82f9-18fe081e53cd"
msgid ""
"\"If you worship Torag, why not honor the other dwarven gods? Angradd? "
"Magrim?\""
msgstr "\"당신이 토락을 섬긴다면, 왜 다른 드워프 신들을 존경하지 않는거요? 안그라드나? 마그림같은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimEkun/Banter_HarrimEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "dcdc0467-12cb-4488-86c3-611a0b2cb460"
msgid ""
"\"I respect all gods who are not evil. Even your Groetus. You should do the "
"same.\""
msgstr "\"나는 모든 악하지 않은 신들을 존경합니다. 당신의 그로투스마저도요. 당신 또한 그리해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3f4b4510-0fc1-4db2-be4e-67786212aca0"
msgid ""
"\"People are so busy with pointless worldly vanity... They'd be better off "
"spending their short lives accepting the end with dignity!\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 무의미한 세속적 허영심에 너무 바쁘오...그들은 자신의 짧은 생을 끝내고 존엄하게 끝을 맞이하는 것이 나을거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c71dbce3-50ab-4f60-8271-18489c56a88d"
msgid ""
"[laughs] \"I think, most honorable Harrim, that your dreams of death are "
"like a child, dreaming of becoming an adult and having candy before dinner. "
"Sweet, silly hopes — that pass with time.\""
msgstr ""
"[웃음]\"내 생각엔, 최고로 명예로운 하림께서 꾸고 계신 죽음에 대한 꿈은, 마치 아이가 어른이 되면 저녁을 먹기 전에 사탕을 먹는 걸 "
"꿈꾸는 것 같아. 달콤하고 멍청한 바램이고, 시간과 함께 흘러가지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "54294d6b-677c-4736-929f-11e819a585f6"
msgid ""
"[laughs] \"I think, most honorable Harrim, that your dreams of death are "
"like a child, dreaming of becoming an adult and having candy before dinner. "
"Sweet, silly hopes — that pass with time.\""
msgstr ""
"[웃음]\"내 생각엔, 최고로 명예로운 하림께서 꾸고 계신 죽음에 대한 꿈은, 마치 아이가 어른이 되면 저녁을 먹기 전에 사탕을 먹는 걸 "
"꿈꾸는 것 같아. 달콤하고 멍청한 바램이고, 시간과 함께 흘러가지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "454f5935-2ea8-4ee2-890e-3ae2c69757a1"
msgid ""
"\"I sank to such lows after my exile. I was a pathetic sot, drowning my "
"feelings of uselessness in cheap drinks... How ironic is it that the "
"teaching of Groetus would bring sense to my life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 추방된 이후로 난 최악의 시기로 빠져들었소. 난 한심한 술주정뱅이에, 쓸모없는 싼 술들에 내 감정을 담궈버렸지...그로투스의 "
"가르침이 이런 나의 삶에 의미를 주었다는게 얼마나 아이러니 한지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8f0d0b7c-1027-4f2d-8519-e14a1f2857ba"
msgid "\"The end is inevitable. My end, our end, the entire world's end...\""
msgstr "\"종말은 피할 수 없소. 나의 종말도, 우리의 종말도, 온 세계의 종말도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "78902058-a443-4561-af7b-cf077f48ec72"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so tired... Sometimes I feel like reaching for a rope... But is that a "
"dignified end? No. I suppose I should live a little longer, and see where "
"the world is rolling...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 지쳤소...어쩔때는 밧줄에 손을 뻗치고픈 기분이 들기도 한다오...하지만 그게 위엄있는 끝이겠소? 아니지. 그래 조금만 더 "
"살아보자하곤 세상이 돌아가는 곳을 보는거요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f1681e79-aff8-4602-8abe-ba6ea0224c09"
msgid ""
"\"At least there's something that dispels your gloom, most honorable Harrim. "
"Even if it's a vision of the world rolling into the unknown.\""
msgstr ""
"\"적어도 어딘가에는 너의 그 우울함을 달래줄 것이 있을거야, 최고로 명예로운 하림. 세상이 미지의 곳으로 굴러떨어지는 환상이 보인다고 "
"해도 말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ddf4f25d-0ab1-47a6-abc0-89783c6404ff"
msgid ""
"\"At least there's something that dispels your gloom, most honorable Harrim. "
"Even if it's a vision of the world rolling into the unknown.\""
msgstr ""
"\"적어도 어딘가에는 너의 그 우울함을 달래줄 것이 있을거야, 최고로 명예로운 하림. 세상이 미지의 곳으로 굴러떨어지는 환상이 보인다고 "
"해도 말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7a7bc2e8-bab0-4365-bc7b-ae8bd0b0ef26"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone laughs at me. Some do it kindly, some laugh with contempt. But "
"who will laugh last?\""
msgstr "\"모든 이가 날보고 웃소. 어떤 이들은 친절하게, 어떤 이들은 비웃음으로. 하지만 누가 최후에 웃게 되겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "909a40a6-026a-4de2-be8a-fe61fca16732"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... I suppose they will. But I – I will be proven right when all the "
"laughter fades!\""
msgstr "\"흐음...아마도 그들일거 같은데. 하지만 모든 웃음이 사라지고 나면 내가 옳다는 게 증명될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bc262e41-56a1-430f-b1d5-014eb0adcd6b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I lost a button... Thus the inevitable end of the world is seen even "
"in littlest of things...\""
msgstr "\"오, 단추를 잃어버렸어...이렇게 피할수 없는 종말이 아주 작은 것에서도 보이는구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f716c39d-2e24-4901-9e24-ee5e4fae0708"
msgid ""
"\"My tooth hurts. I should get it healed... Though what's the point if I'll "
"die soon anyway?\""
msgstr "\"내 이가 아프군. 낫게 해야 겠지만...어짜피 내가 곧 죽는다면 무슨 소용이 있겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "08c18cd4-4e43-4909-8ebc-37a741b1f747"
msgid ""
"\"If you heal your toothache, most honorable Harrim, you will be able to die "
"without being distracted by trifles! Toothaches can be an awful distraction, "
"even on one's deathbed...\""
msgstr ""
"\"존경하는 하림, 만약에 치통을 치료한다면, 사소한 일에 신경쓰지 않고 죽을 수 있게 되겠지요! 치통은 심지어 임종시에도 끔찍한 "
"산만함을 만든답니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1c5fdaf9-5ac2-4b58-9133-ae3409f3dacb"
msgid ""
"\"If you heal your toothache, most honorable Harrim, you will be able to die "
"without being distracted by trifles! Toothaches can be an awful distraction, "
"even on one's deathbed...\""
msgstr ""
"\"존경하는 하림, 만약에 치통을 치료한다면, 사소한 일에 신경쓰지 않고 죽을 수 있게 되겠지요! 치통은 심지어 임종시에도 끔찍한 "
"산만함을 만든답니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1bfb7418-bdaa-4ce0-9559-afb848d2db82"
msgid ""
"\"A bottle of wine would be nice... Or maybe two... But no, no, not on a "
"march!\""
msgstr "\"와인 한병이면 딱 좋을 거 같은데...어쩌면 두 병...그렇지만 아니지, 아니지, 행진하는 동안엔 안되지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimHarrim/Banter_HarrimHarrim_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1189390f-1969-43fe-9353-f80cc838b800"
msgid ""
"\"And when we get back to the capital, I better just have a mug of beer. "
"Just one. Don't want to make things worse...\""
msgstr "\"그리고 우리가 수도에 도착하면, 한 잔의 맥주를 마시는 게 좋아. 딱 한잔만. 상황을 악화시키고 싶진 않거든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJaethal/Banter_HarrimJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "dcaa9e90-5ae5-4d76-867b-328725a044b9"
msgid ""
"\"You died but you still cling to your worldly existence. Is there sense in "
"this? The undead exist for a long time, but even they don't last forever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 죽었음에도 여전히 당신의 세속적인 존재에만 매달리는군. 어떠한 연유가 있소? 언데드는 오래동안 존재할 수 있지만, 그들도 "
"영원한 것은 아니오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJaethal/Banter_HarrimJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "11199003-a9a3-4dbb-8568-0d569a6c7dab"
msgid ""
"\"It looks like you don't know much about the undead. For what it's worth, "
"I'm the only one among us who has a chance of witnessing the end of times.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 언데드에 대해서 많이 알지 못하는 것 같군. 그건 그렇다치고, 난 우리들 중 유일하게 시간의 끝을 목격할 기회를 얻은 사람이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJaethal/Banter_HarrimJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d5ee4eb2-352e-4119-b52a-11a65ff1e187"
msgid ""
"\"To reject your former life, your people and their gods, and find yourself "
"in service to another deity... We have much in common, Jaethal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 이전의 삶, 당신의 사람들 그리고 그들의 신을 거부하기 위해, 당신 스스로 섬길 다른 신을 찾기 위해...우리는 공통점이 "
"많소, 자에탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJaethal/Banter_HarrimJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "23171189-702d-41ba-837e-06e43d1e875c"
msgid ""
"\"Don't flatter yourself. You are not my equal in anything, any more than "
"you are equal to me in height.\""
msgstr "\"착각하지마. 넌 나의 어느 면과도 같지 않아, 키조차도 같지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJaethal/Banter_HarrimJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0204688d-4a0e-4d73-977a-28d4c0f861c7"
msgid ""
"\"Your body is neither dead nor alive. It's like you're stuck between two "
"worlds.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 몸은 산 것도 죽은 것도 아니군. 마치 두 세계 사이에 껴 있는거 같소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJaethal/Banter_HarrimJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a953a815-e062-461d-b6fe-4aac5e106c08"
msgid ""
"\"Why does it bother you so much? Is the priest of the world's end still "
"afraid of death?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이렇게 괴롭히는 건지? 세계의 종말의 사제 나리께선 아직도 죽음이 두려우신가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_HarrimJubilost1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "50d18429-1b44-4e39-8a01-a084b546ab2e"
msgid ""
"\"I often wonder that people cling to their false ideals. Whatever is "
"familiar seems right to them. Everything new frightens them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 사람들이 그들의 거짓된 우상에 매달리는 것이 종종 궁금하다오. 익숙한 것은 무엇이든 그들에게 옳은 것으로 보이고, 모든 새로운 "
"것들은 그들을 겁먹게 한다오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_HarrimJubilost1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "32714f2c-c040-4907-96a7-a00bcecc3ae6"
msgid ""
"\"I'd agree with you, but then you'd just launch into another speech about "
"Groetus.\""
msgstr "\"동의해, 그런데말야, 넌 곧바로 그로테우스에 관한 또다른 이야기를 할 거잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5cdd813f-9f6a-42cb-aebb-9e455574750e"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't it folly, trying to recover the gnomes' lost immortality? Nothing is "
"eternal. Is there truly a difference in the face of the oblivion – to live "
"for ten years or a million? The whole First World will come to an end at "
"some point...\""
msgstr ""
"\"놈 종족의 잃어버린 불멸성을 되찾겠다는게 우습지 않소? 어떤것도 영원할 순 없소. 십년을 사는 것이나 일만년을 사는 것, 망각을 "
"대면할 때 진정으로 차이가 있겠소? 태초 세계는 언젠가 끝을 맞이할 것이오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2f5ae50e-ea51-47af-aaf0-a9490fa5b490"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know about the end of the world, but your nagging is certainly "
"endless. This makes you somewhat of a living phenomenon.\""
msgstr "\"난 세계의 종말에 대해선 모르지만, 니 잔소리는 확실히 끝이 없구만. 이게 널 어느정도 살아있는 귀재로 만드나 보군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d269dbdf-8c7d-444e-984e-2b362e9bd93e"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Jubilost, I believe your 'Bleaching' is not a curse but a gift. "
"You live exactly as long as the world seems interesting to you, and then you "
"leave when you tire of it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알겠지만, 주빌로스트, 나는 당신의 '백화'가 저주가 아닌 선물이라 믿소. 당신은 세상에 대해 당신이 가진 흥미가 정확히 계속될 "
"때까지 살 수 있고, 언제든 당신이 질린다면 떠나갈 수 있소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e5b7f8fa-d1e2-4d74-8a82-9c38695916d0"
msgid ""
"\"A curious observation... I admit, I haven't looked at this problem from "
"such a viewpoint! I think I must disagree with you, but you've given me some "
"food for thought!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥미로운 관찰이군...난 그런 관점에서 문제를 바라보려고 하지 않았다는 걸 인정하지! 너와 내 의견을 달리해야 한다고 생각하지만, 넌 "
"내게 사고의 양식을 주었군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3f8b0695-35e6-4c30-ad26-4e5582aef314"
msgid "\"You serve Desna, right?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 데즈나를 섬기는군요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "23131d70-e972-49c6-927d-033258237879"
msgid ""
"\"Not quite... But still, you know, with my way of life you can't have too "
"much luck. Sometimes I donate to a temple of the Great Dreamer. But I don't "
"go overboard!\""
msgstr ""
"\"별로...그렇지만 알다시피 여전히 내가 살아가는 방식과 함께라면 당신의 운도 그리 오래가지 않을 겁니다. 때때로 저는 위대한 몽상가의 "
"사원에 기부하기도 하지요. 그렇지만 열중하지는 않습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f7f2a311-41fc-47c8-a8f8-a5f72d04d36c"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Jubilost, I think you would make a great priest and preacher. "
"Your sense of purpose, and your eloquence...\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트, 내 생각엔 넌 위대한 사제나 설교자가 될 수 있어. 너의 목적 의식과, 너의 웅변은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d273edf7-ecd6-45aa-8633-941cd9894068"
msgid ""
"\"A priest? Me? Pff! I'd die of boredom in a week, if I had to repeat the "
"same cheerless sermons day after day! Or I'd add some new ideas, and in no "
"time I'd be expelled from the priesthood for heresy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사제? 내가? 푸흡! 내가 매일같이 칙칙한 설교 따위를 반복해야 한다면, 일주일만에 지루해서 죽어버리고 말겠지! 아니면 내가 몇 가지 "
"새로운 아이디어를 추가하게 되면서 이단으로서 사제권을 박탈당하던지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "09a4f3a2-54a4-4a56-8ca4-d574766044fa"
msgid ""
"\"How can you be happy, and make plans for your future? Every moment you "
"laugh or peacefully enjoy your life, someone somewhere else is breathing "
"their final breath.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 행복해질 수 있고 미래를 위한 계획을 세울 수가 있지? 네가 삶을 평화로이 즐기고 웃는 모든 순간마다 다른 누군가는 어딘가에서 "
"그들의 마지막 숨을 내뱉고 있는데 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimJubilost/Banter_HarrimJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1480f700-e064-41a0-8fc8-9f3010dfdae1"
msgid ""
"\"Every time you open your mouth, my hope for a relaxing evening fades. "
"Please don't get all wound up.\""
msgstr "\"네가 입을 열 때마다, 나의 안락한 저녁에 대한 희망이 사라지는군. 제발 부탁인데 닥쳐줄래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_HarrimLinzi1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "af1a48ce-a1a6-4da0-a956-c6c5593ec858"
msgid ""
"\"You studied writing for such a long time, put so much effort in your art, "
"and they threw you out of the Academy. Yet in spite of all this, you didn't "
"give up. Why?\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 오랫동안 작문에 대해 공부해왔고, 니 기술에 대해 많은 노력을 기울였는데, 그들은 널 아카데미에서 쫓아냈지. 그런데도 불구하고, "
"넌 포기하지 않는군. 왜지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_HarrimLinzi1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ba066dcf-e7b5-4c96-b248-2577bc4bc887"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe because if I did give up, it would mean they got what they wanted... "
"Or no — maybe because life without writing would be so boring! Hmm… To be "
"honest, I never really thought about it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도 내가 포기해버리면 그건 그들이 바라는 데로 되는 것일 테니까...아니면 글쓰기가 없는 삶이란 지루할거 같아서! "
"흐음...솔직하게 말하면 한번도 그걸 생각해본 적이 없네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e4e61dd1-c894-4f45-8a56-7ace7fd0cef7"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you staring at me? Do you see the shadow of inevitable death "
"behind my shoulder?\""
msgstr "\"왜 날 노려보는거야? 내 어깨 뒤에 피할 수 없는 죽음의 그림자가 보이기라도 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "51181636-fd39-4cd0-ba2e-173d1b82ee92"
msgid ""
"\"No, I saw a spot of soot from the fire on your cheek – looks like a "
"unicorn! Harrim, do you ever wash your face?\""
msgstr "\"아니, 니 얼굴에 묻은 그을음을 본건데 꼭 유니콘처럼 생겼어! 하림, 얼굴을 씻기는 하는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f7b33224-44b4-4c6e-806e-f9f185e1de6e"
msgid ""
"\"You write and you write, Linzi... But what's the point if you will be "
"forgotten after you die?\""
msgstr "\"넌 쓰고 또 쓰는군, 린지...네가 죽은 뒤에 잊힌다면 도대체 뭐 때문에 쓰는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "95200a15-b1a1-4e02-b3c4-4d58b4e25057"
msgid ""
"\"That's why I'm writing, so I won't be forgotten! My stories will belong to "
"the ages! Yes, the ages – I won't accept anything less!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 나는 적어두는거야, 잊혀지지 않기 위해서! 내 이야기들은 세기를 이어갈거야! 그래, 세기를 말이지. 그것 미만으론 받아들이지 "
"않을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "360d5601-f647-4cb6-810a-042a5261efce"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange that you held on to your love of storytelling after you were "
"expelled from the Academy.\""
msgstr "\"아카데미에서 쫓겨난 뒤에도 이야기에 관심을 쏟고 있다니 이상한 일이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9f3e5acd-d3e3-4eb2-8edd-f3558b11f571"
msgid ""
"\"It's not strange at all! I write for myself and for other people – and not "
"for those bloated toads at the Academy! People like my stories – and I "
"couldn't ask for more!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하나도 이상하지 않아! 난 내 스스로에 대해서도 그리고 아카데미의 퉁퉁불은 두꺼비들 빼고 다른 사람들에 대해서도 글을 쓰지! 사람들은 "
"내 이야기를 좋아하고 난 더 이상 바랄것이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d7dc0e6d-e096-410c-96f0-e1e392066eed"
msgid ""
"\"I turned to Groetus when I lost everything. You lost everything too, "
"Linzi. Why do you keep clinging to your old life?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 모든 것을 잃어버렸을 때, 나는 그로투스를 경배하지 않게 되었소. 린지, 당신도 모든 걸 잃어버리지 않았소. 왜 과거의 삶에 "
"얽매이는 것이오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ddf64c61-cac2-4840-8654-490ff5cbc96c"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you ask? – Have my hands withered? Did my eyes fall out? Maybe I "
"forgot all the letters, or got a cursed inkwell that evaporates whenever I "
"reach for it? As long as none of that happens, I'll keep writing, just like "
"always! Why do you think I've lost anything at all?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 물어보는거야? 내 손이 쇠약해져 버렸나? 내 눈이 뽑혀 나갔어? 어쩌면 내가 모든 글자들을 잊어버리거나 저주받은 잉크병이 내가 "
"손을 대려하면 계속 잉크를 증발시켜버리는건가? 그런일이 있기 전엔, 난 언제나 글을 쓸거야, 언제나 처럼! 도대체 왜 내가 모든 걸 "
"잃어버렸다고 생각하는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ea61bb75-9f9b-4a53-918f-f6a2f9056fac"
msgid ""
"\"I'm amazed by your inexhaustible energy. It's seems strange you can be so "
"joyful after everything that happened.\""
msgstr "\"난 당신의 지칠 줄 모르는 원기에 놀랐소. 모든 일이 일어난 후에 그렇게 즐길 수 있다는 것이 내게는 생소하다오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimLinzi/Banter_HarrimLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a0330d50-b2e3-4367-b83d-268d372ab893"
msgid ""
"\"And you're always sullen and pouting, Harrim. Smile a little! If we do die "
"at some point, I'd prefer to be buried with a smile on my face, not with a "
"glum frown.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러는 넌 항상 뚱한데다 뽀루퉁해 있잖아, 하림. 조금 웃어봐! 언젠가 우리가 죽게된다면 난 울적해서 찌뿌린 얼굴로 묻히기 보단 "
"얼굴에 미소를 띈 채가 좋을거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimNokNok/Banter_HarrimNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "891389ec-fc09-4024-9bd9-7dbb1dac7b0f"
msgid ""
"\"Goblins seem as if they would do better to worship Rovagug. You adore "
"destruction and smash everything you can. So why do you and your tribe "
"follow the Mother of Monsters instead?\""
msgstr ""
"\"고블린들은 로바거그를 숭배하는게 훨씬 나을거 같아보이는군. 당신은 당신이 할 수 있는 모든 걸 때리고 부수는 걸 좋아하오. 그런데 왜 "
"당신과 당신 부족은 괴물들의 어머니를 따르는거요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimNokNok/Banter_HarrimNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "babc0726-b615-4f16-b042-9c4650b8d608"
msgid ""
"\"We like breaking others stuff. Things we built — too good to break. And "
"Lamashtu gives tribe hardy babies — hardy enough to survive in their cages!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우린 남들 물건 부수는게 좋다. 우리가 만든 물건 너무 좋아 부술 수 없다. 그리고 라마슈투는 우리 부족에게 강한 아기를 준다. "
"강해서 그들의 감옥에서 살아남을 수 있을 정도다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_HarrinOctavia1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "432c5854-2bb0-4663-98ba-ae5adc8230ad"
msgid ""
"\"I often catch you looking at me sideways with fear in your eyes. You do "
"not want me as a companion?\""
msgstr "\"나는 때때로 당신이 내 주변에서 나를 공포에 질린 눈으로 보는 것을 본다오. 당신은 내가 동료로 있는 것을 원하지 않소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_HarrinOctavia1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "370de6a7-360c-49f6-b17f-20232899c5fa"
msgid ""
"\"No, Harrim, how can you say that!? Your faith frightens me, that's true. "
"But I still like you personally. You're not arrogant — unlike many other "
"clerics — and you have a peculiar view of the world. Traveling with you is "
"always interesting.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 하림, 어떻게 그렇게 말하나!? 네 신앙은 날 두렵게 한다. 그건 사실이다. 하지만 난 여전히 너의 성격을 좋아한다. 넌는 "
"다른 많은 성직자들과 달리 오만하지 않고 너만의 세상을 보는 관점을 보고 있다. 너와 함께 여행하는 건 언제나 흥미롭다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "85635cec-c1f5-42ca-ba78-0c2a9ba884f8"
msgid ""
"\"You've endured no less suffering than I. Haven't you realized by now how "
"pathetic and cruel the world is?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나보다 고통을 견뎌 본 적이 없소. 이제 당신은 우리의 세상이 얼마나 잔혹하고 비극적인지 아시겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "74a5e2ed-72c2-4a8d-b139-0fa3cb1566fb"
msgid ""
"\"It's as bad as we allow it to be. And it's as beautiful as we make it. So "
"stop grumbling and get to work!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 그걸 그렇게 놔둔다는 것은 나쁜일이야. 그리고 우리가 하는 만큼 아름답게 될 수도 있지. 그러니 그만 투덜대고 이제 가서 "
"일하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7ba461c1-a3ba-4875-bb54-c8d994b3d97e"
msgid ""
"\"This world might be full of suffering, but friends like you make me put up "
"with it.\""
msgstr "\"이 세계는 고통으로 가득 차 있소, 그러나 당신 같은 친구가 버티게 만드오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e1dce0a7-83a4-47ed-befc-4a1f9d341292"
msgid "\"Thanks. I value you a lot too, no matter how much you grumble!\""
msgstr "\"고맙군. 나도 너를 높게 평가해, 네가 아무리 투덜거려도 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "eda92c82-33da-41b9-8ad5-dd9efc7f52e8"
msgid ""
"\"My jacket was all torn up, but someone mended it neatly last night. Was it "
"you? Thank you, although I am not worth such efforts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 재킷이 모두 닳아버렸는데, 누군가가 어제 그걸 다시 꿰매었소. 당신인가? 고맙소, 내게 그런 노력을 쏟을 가치는 없었음에도 "
"말이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5d77cc15-51c4-4e1b-8268-05a330da6e7c"
msgid ""
"\"You're welcome! I know the world may crumble to dust sooner or later, but "
"meanwhile your jacket can serve you a bit longer!\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아! 세상이 언젠가 먼지로 부숴져내리더라도, 자켓을 좀 더 오래 입을 수 있게 되었으니 말야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9c8a94bd-68ed-45a1-b7e0-44ce5c9ab357"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity you cannot hear Groetus' whisper. I would so like you to "
"understand what I'm talking about...\""
msgstr "\"그로투스의 속삭임을 듣지 못한다니 애석할 뿐이오. 내가 말하는 것을 당신도 알아차리길 바랬는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimOctavia/Banter_HarrimOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a23f3ebe-7c19-4b10-b580-a19e83f5a066"
msgid ""
"\"But I do understand you – I do! But if I was busy listening to some "
"whisper telling me about death, then who would cheer you up?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래도 난 널 이해할 수 있어, 그렇고 말고! 만약에 내가 죽음에 대해 속삭이는 것에 정신이 팔려 있다면, 누가 널 위로할 수 있겠어?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "111f8e86-9f25-4cf2-baca-b3233e61566c"
msgid ""
"\"You had it tough, enslaved by the Technic League. Tell me, didn't you ever "
"think about putting an end to all the suffering?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 기술 연맹에 의해 노예가 되어 힘든 시기를 보냈소. 말해 보시오, 당신은 한 번이라도 모든 고통을 끝내려고 생각해본 적이 "
"없었소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8f752e2c-ce0d-48d4-a479-a6812466ab7c"
msgid ""
"\"You mean cut my throat? Pff! That's for weaklings. Hell no, I prefer "
"cutting other people's throats!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 목을 긋는 거 말하는 건가? 푸흐흐! 그건 약한 놈이나 하는거지. 절대 아냐, 난 다른 이들의 목을 잘라내는 게 좋거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "78c21a39-70f7-41d7-975f-90ab3980c53d"
msgid "\"Regongar, I...\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 난...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a5220b90-4747-496b-a7ba-48eae1b5cb18"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, shut up, will you?! Every time you open your mouth, some screed "
"comes tumbling out. Go whine to someone else!\""
msgstr "\"하림, 닥쳐줄래? 네가 입을 열 때마다 일장 연설이 쏟아져 나온단 말이지. 딴 놈한테 가서 칭얼거려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9c751ca2-7c31-49f6-9442-766269409fde"
msgid ""
"\"The fierceness of orcs is famous all over the world. But you, Regongar – "
"you're only half-orc. How is it you have so much animal rage?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오크들의 치열함은 세계에 잘 알려져 있소. 하지만 레곤가르여, 당신은 하프 오크입니다. 어떻게 그렇게 원초적인 분노를 가질 수가 있소?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fb0d0dd9-f1ad-4236-ab84-c7ab97b858b0"
msgid "\"What I lacked at birth, the slavers' lashes more than made up for!\""
msgstr "\"내가 태어날 때는 부족했었지, 노예상인들의 채찍질이 그걸 채워줬고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5edb8c6e-8d60-46ff-8f29-a74e32f62418"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand why you entertain your flesh with base pleasures. They "
"fade quickly, leaving only a headache and a bad taste in your mouth. "
"Wouldn't it be better to ponder the eternal?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 당신이 왜 당신의 육신을 미천한 기쁨들로 채우는지 이해할 수 없소. 그들은 빠르게 사라지고, 두통과 당신 입 안에 나쁜 맛만 "
"남기지. 영원을 숙소하는 것이 보다 낫지 않겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "acf4c88a-7216-46ea-a91c-6cbb369450d1"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, I think about eternity! Unless the priests are lying, I'll go to "
"Elysium after I die – to an eternal feast with Calistria! You think I drink "
"too much and sleep around? Imagine what goes on at the feast of the goddess "
"of lust, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐, 나도 영원을 생각한다고! 사제들이 거짓말한게 아니라면 난 죽어서 일리지움에 가게 될거야. 거기서 칼리스트리아와 영원한 축제를 "
"벌이는 거지! 넌 내가 너무 많이 마셔대고 아무대서나 잔다고 생각해? 색욕의 여신의 축제에서 무슨 일이 벌어질지 상상해보라고, 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "78c04e2a-d118-4a0c-b808-91fd30e194f0"
msgid ""
"\"What does it matter if you bring vengeance to your enemies from the "
"Technic League? They'll all die sooner or later anyhow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 기술 연맹에 속한 당신의 적들에게 복수를 한 들 무슨 상관이겠습니까? 그들은 늦으나 빠르나 결국 죽게 될 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "557e471b-9bb3-4c38-bcc4-09784320e843"
msgid ""
"\"You might not care about how your enemies are sent to the hereafter, but I "
"do. I prefer it sooner, and by my hand – not later in a warm bed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 앞으로 니 적들이 어떻게 지내는지 상관안하는지 모르겠지만, 난 아니야. 난 되도록 빨리 그것도 내 손으로 끝내고 싶어. 따뜻한 "
"침대에서 그들이 끝을 맞이할게 아니란 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1e51df81-71d2-4ee1-969b-9a052036580d"
msgid ""
"\"Will you escape from the Technic League's agents? Will they catch you, or "
"will you catch them... Will you die sooner or later than them... This is all "
"happening in a moment before eternity – so what does it matter who wins?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 기술 연맹의 요원들로부터 도망칠 수 있소? 그들이 당신을 잡거나, 또는 당신이 그들을 잡거나..당신은 그들보다 늦으나 빠르나 "
"결국 죽을 것이오...이 모든 일은 영원 앞에서 한 순간이라오. 그런데도 누가 이기는 가가 중요하오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "64c54542-a98a-4b82-a357-29d8f9c103bf"
msgid ""
"\"What is an eternity of dust and ashes worth? That short moment of life "
"that you don't give a damn about – that's all I have! So yes, it does matter "
"how I spend it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"먼지나 재가 영원한 게 무슨 가치가 있지? 네가 좆 만큼도 염려하지 않는 짧은 인생이 말이지. 내겐 전부라고! 그래 맞아, 내가 그걸 "
"어떻게 쓰느냐가 전부야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3aced0f2-4e9d-4b9b-8f6f-f4ffe3ba5278"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I admire you when I watch you fight. It's like you embody the "
"uncontrolled power of chaos, leading the world to its imminent end. Some die "
"from the fire or storm, while others from Regongar's hand...\""
msgstr ""
"\"때로 나는 당신이 싸우는 모습을 볼 때 당신을 존경하게 된다오. 그것은 마치 당신에게 주체못할 혼돈의 힘이 내려, 임박한 종말로 "
"세상을 이끄는 것 같소. 몇몇은 불과 폭풍에 휩쓸려 죽고, 다른 이들은 레곤가르의 손에 의해 죽어나가지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "130ef4b1-a6bc-4128-b48f-07d8d4ed404c"
msgid "\"Ha ha, you got it! Yeah, man, I am what I am!'"
msgstr "\"하하, 맞췄구만 그래! 자식, 그래 그게 바로 나야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4b57c398-4977-44d8-aa44-dae7cd89feda"
msgid "\"You laugh at death, but you will face it someday...\""
msgstr "\"당신은 죽음을 비웃지만, 언젠가 그것이 당신을 마주할거요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimRegongar/Banter_HarrimRegongar_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a0a2e0bd-c7b7-4f87-9e2d-7f96deff6f04"
msgid ""
"\"No I won't! Think about it. So long as I'm alive, there's no death. And "
"then when it comes, I'll already be gone, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 그렇지 않지! 생각해봐. 내가 살아있는 동안 거기엔 죽음이란 없어. 그리고 그것이 오면 난 이미 간 거겠지, 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b2590954-e534-4a08-939e-d12d2d5b48f0"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae teaches mercy. But isn't death the greatest mercy, an end to the "
"suffering of frail flesh and the restless mind?\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이는 자비를 가르치지요. 그러나 죽음이야말로 허약한 육신과 불안한 마음으로부터 받는 고통을 끝내주는 가장 큰 자비가 아니겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3e4b01db-c233-4328-a9e0-926dd7ea56e4"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think so. Death releases us from suffering, it's true... But it "
"also takes away our chance to atone for our sins!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 생각되지 않습니다. 죽음은 우릴 고통에서 벗어나게 하지요, 그것은 사실입니다...그러나 죽음은 또한 우리가 우리의 죄를 속죄할 "
"기회마저 앗아가 버리고 말지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d4de0bbc-065d-40f6-9143-9de9e8f88881"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I ask myself, why does Groetus give me healing spells. What's "
"the point of healing those who are meant to die?\""
msgstr ""
"\"가끔씩 난 내 스스로에게 질문하오, 왜 그로투스께선 내게 회복 주문을 내려 주셨는가. 죽을 수 밖에 없는 자에게 주는 회복은 무슨 "
"의미인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "597d065b-1a14-4df2-ab71-9cf3cfd8edb1"
msgid ""
"\"Why does he give any powers to his followers, if he's entirely impartial "
"to them, as you say? Perhaps this world is important in some ways, even for "
"Groetus?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 그분께선 그를 따르는 자들에게 어떠한 권능을 내리셨을까요? 그분께서 당신이 말한대로 완전히 공정하신 분이라면 말이지요. 아마도 이 "
"세계가 그로투스께도 어떠한 방식으로든 중요하기 때문이 아닐까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2a59e9ae-bcfe-48b4-9a7b-673dd2b6a754"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone is striving somewhere, wanting something, fighting for "
"something... Like the silly fuss of little blind mice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 이가 어딘가에서 분투하고, 무언가를 원하고, 무언가를 위해 투쟁하고...마치 눈 먼 작은 쥐의 어리석은 호들갑 같소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ddaa7fd2-8b4e-4195-821a-a163328cc14f"
msgid ""
"\"But you fight beside us! Is this because you don't understand your own "
"god's teachings? Or perhaps there's wisdom in participating in worldly "
"matters...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇지만 당신께서도 우리 곁에서 싸우고 있습니다! 그건 당신께서 모시는 신의 가르침을 제대로 이해하지 못한 걸까요? 아니면 세속적인 "
"일 가운데에 지혜가 있는걸까요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a1ef159d-213b-46c7-ad49-7fddcea66e6a"
msgid ""
"\"This world is full of filth, anger, and suffering. When it's gone, "
"everyone will feel better.\""
msgstr "\"이 세상은 더러움과 분노와 고통으로 가득 차 있소. 그것들이 모두 사라지면 모두가 낫다고 여길 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1352a919-f18a-4a4c-9314-845870f196b6"
msgid ""
"\"You say strange things. Who is there to feel better, if no one exists? "
"Let's instead try to make the world better for those who are still alive!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상한 말입니다. 아무도 존재하지 않는다면 누가 나아졌다고 느낄 수 있을까요? 살아있는 자들을 위해 세상을 좀 더 좋게 해 보는 것이 "
"어떻겠습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ecbb6f34-4c5f-4630-8b08-17893fec41aa"
msgid ""
"\"Even the gods will disappear sooner or later. What about us? Oblivion even "
"makes gods equal to mortals...\""
msgstr "\"언제고 신들조차도 사라져 갈 것이오. 우리는 어떻소? 망각은 신에게나 필멸자에게나 동일하다오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimTristian/Banter_HarrimTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "097234a7-1f13-4976-870e-712dcb62e7e1"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae does not fear non-existence. Nor am I afraid of death, inevitable "
"as it is. Mortals imitate the gods in many ways – that's the point of faith."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이는 실재하지 않는다는 것을 두려워하지 않으십니다. 저 또한 피할 수 없는 죽음을 두려워하지 않습니다. 필멸자들은 여러 면에서 "
"신들을 모방하지요, 그것이 믿음의 핵심입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "671024fa-3a13-49bc-8aca-ff99aa7cb54d"
msgid ""
"\"You are disappointed in Shelyn, as I am in Torag. Listen closely – maybe "
"you, too, will hear a barely audible whisper... Perhaps Groetus will speak "
"to you too?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 토락 신을 실망시킨 것처럼 당신은 셸린 여신을 실망시켰소. 똑똑히 들으시겠소, 당신도 아마 희미한 속삭임을 들었을 "
"거요...어쩌면 그로테우스께서 당신에게도 말을 건넨 건지도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e88c2f2e-6bad-4df3-ba21-4abae80c893b"
msgid ""
"\"No one is talking to me, Harrim. And if I start hearing whispers, it means "
"I have problems with my head, not with my faith!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구도 내게 말을 건내지 않았어, 하림. 그리고 만약에라도 내가 속삭임을 듣기 시작했다면, 그건 아마도 내 머리에 문제가 생겼다는 "
"거겠지, 내 믿음이 아니라말야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c51e4e95-5a13-41b8-afc3-c6ce1793e41d"
msgid ""
"\"You are very beautiful, Valerie. I will feel regret when such beauty dies."
"\""
msgstr "\"당신은 아름답소, 발레리. 나는 그러한 아름다움이 죽는다는 것이 유감이라오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1e694df9-0b87-4dab-8612-2fceef8c8a60"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... Of all the dubious compliments I've ever heard, this one is "
"probably the most doubtful.\""
msgstr "\"흐음...내가 들었던 모든 애매모호한 칭찬들 가운데, 이게 가장 의심스럽군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1d8a33de-6790-4d13-916c-5ff137be8925"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand you, I'm sorry. How can you live without faith at all?\""
msgstr "\"나는 이해하지 못하겠소, 미안하오. 어떻게 신앙 없이 살아갈 수 있는거요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cb5736fe-8bf2-478c-8b3a-6851f294de4c"
msgid ""
"\"You said yourself that everything in this world is pointless. Do you think "
"faith is an exception?\""
msgstr "\"넌 스스로 이 세상의 모든 것이 부질없다고 이야기했었지. 그런데 신앙은 예외인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d595b6d6-26a0-408c-9666-9d89564f7def"
msgid ""
"\"Had I not met Groetus' followers in my darkest hour, I might have taken "
"the same path as you.\""
msgstr "\"내가 내 가장 어려운 시기에 그로테우스의 추종자들을 만나지 않았다면, 나는 아마도 당신과 같은 길을 걷고 있었을 거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "971b644a-b75a-4337-a304-f9341767fa2c"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think of it as a path. – The gods simply don't have a place in my "
"life, that's all. And if you were disappointed in the gods, you would be "
"preaching atheism as passionately as you preach the teaching of Groetus!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 그걸 길이라고 생각지 않아. 신들은 단지 내 삶에 위치하지 않은 것 뿐이야. 만약에 네가 신들에게 실망했다면, 네가 그로테우스의 "
"가르침을 열정적으로 설교하는 것처럼 무신론을 설파했어야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4fd512f0-1059-4517-99dd-29540179a81e"
msgid ""
"\"Your armor always shines, Valerie. You spend so much time polishing it. "
"But what's the point? Your armor doesn't get any tougher.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리, 그대의 갑옷은 언제나 빛나는구려. 많은 시간을 들여 그것을 손질하겠지. 그대의 갑옷은 더 이상 단단해지지 않을 텐데, 무슨 "
"소용이 있소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/HarrimValerie/Banter_HarrimValerie_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "15b10175-9c4f-4366-8105-4e6122de7a15"
msgid ""
"\"And you spend much time talking about death, even while we're still alive. "
"I'd say you spend your time even less sensibly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 넌 우리가 지금 이렇게 살아있는데도 불구하고 언제나 죽는 것만 떠들지. 네 시간을 그다지 현명하게 쓰는 것 같지 않다고 말하고 "
"싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAmiri/Banter_JaethalAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c5f26a65-c229-4904-b317-af4561a9f024"
msgid ""
"\"It's funny that you and I are so much alike. We both were banished for "
"trying to be ourselves.\""
msgstr "\"너와 내가 참 많이 닮았다는게 우습구려. 우린 둘 다 우리 스스로가 되기 위해 노력했다가 추방당한거요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAmiri/Banter_JaethalAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "80ba287e-7531-47a3-a34f-43f0d29f9e82"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, that's right! I wanted to be a fighter, and I did! And what did you "
"want to be? A rotten fish with bulgy eyes? Well, congratulations!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 맞아! 난 전사가 되길 원했고, 그렇게 되었지! 넌 뭐가 되길 원했지? 죽은 눈을 가진 썩어빠진 물고기? 그래, 축하해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAmiri/Banter_JaethalAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8f433e51-e37b-4b61-bed7-6ce9b8bbba98"
msgid ""
"\"If you lunge into the thick of every battle, why don't you wear armor? At "
"least we could bury you in one piece that way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 매번 전투 때마다 격렬한 곳에 뛰어드는데, 왜 갑옷을 입지 않는 거지? 그렇게 하면 최소한 우리가 네가 죽었을 때 조각들을 찾을 "
"필요가 없잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAmiri/Banter_JaethalAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7217f3ee-3864-4b4f-8406-87318100fcc6"
msgid ""
"\"Here we go, now the dead one is planning on burying me. Not before I bury "
"you!\""
msgstr "\"자, 이제는 죽은 놈이 나를 묻으려 계획하는구만. 내가 널 아직 묻지도 않았는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAmiri/Banter_JaethalAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c2c11066-1e1e-498b-9764-3bd9ca938cfe"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder, is it the constant cold that makes northern barbarian brains "
"work so slowly? – Or is it that the tribes are so secluded that they've "
"become incestuous?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 궁금한게, 북부의 바바리안들의 두뇌가 빨리 안 돌아가는건 추위때문일까? 아니면 그들이 어디 남들 모르는 곳에서 근친 상간이라도 "
"벌이는걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAmiri/Banter_JaethalAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "76d73439-53b1-4437-af15-fd3e02aa777d"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder too. Our old ones start drooling around ninety. But you elves "
"live for hundreds of years. How much idiocy do you save up in your heads "
"over the ages?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 궁금하네. 우리 노인데들은 한 구십쯤 되면 침을 흘리기 시작하거든. 그런데 엘프들은 수백년을 살잖아. 얼마나 많은 멍청한 "
"짓거리들을 머릿 속에 담아두고 사는지 말야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAngel/Banter_JaethalAngel_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1ff41f3a-1af3-48be-94ea-b9e31f2b83ef"
msgid ""
"\"Just imagine, Tristian, how many new opportunities this would bring. Your "
"youth would never fade. You'd never need sleep nor rest. All your time could "
"be devoted to saving innocent lives and praying to Sarenrae.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한번 상상해봐, 트리스티안. 불멸이 주는 수많은 기회를. 젊음은 영원히 빛바래지 않고, 잠들 필요도, 휴식을 취할 필요도 없지. "
"원한다면 평생 무고한 생명을 구하며 보내도 좋아. 서렌레이에게 기도하는데 전념해도 되고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalAngel/Banter_JaethalAngel_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "208ba00a-1eb7-44d7-a44c-d11b033f0ef8"
msgid ""
"\"My answer is 'no' and you know it. Why are you asking me over and over? It "
"seems that you just find pleasure in offending me and Sarenrae, Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"거절할 것을 아시면서 왜 자꾸 물어보시는지요? 저와 서렌레이 님을 모욕하는 데서 즐거움을 찾으시는 것 같습니다, 제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "11ca1d28-52dc-4504-92c9-8406292ab551"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't grieve for your family. The bonds of family is a trap set "
"for fools, a yoke they hang on their necks, to make you slave to, "
"essentially, strangers.\""
msgstr "\"가족 때문에 슬퍼하지 마. 어리석은 이나 혈연관계에 연연하지. 남들이 보기에 넌 가족의 굴레를 그리워하는 노예에 불과해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "412ccc61-e77d-4ca2-9919-b4892b49ef0e"
msgid "\"You know nothing about a family, abomination. You never had one.\""
msgstr "\"가족에 대해 아무것도 모르면서 역겨운 소리를 하는군. 넌 가족이라 부를 사람도 없잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8ad724df-6a01-43e1-a579-8b355c410737"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Ekun, when I gutted my family, I felt great, unparalleled "
"pleasure. It was so wonderful... I wish I could feel that bliss again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에쿤다요, 나는 가족의 배를 갈랐어. 그때 나는 어떤 기쁨에도 견줄 수 없는 거대한 희열을 느꼈지. 정말 굉장했어... 그 축복을 "
"다시 한번 느낄 수 있다면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "106b7d13-b758-44c1-ab51-5618564cbb19"
msgid ""
"\"Are you trying to insult me? I'm not listening. I won't give you the "
"pleasure.\""
msgstr "\"나를 모욕하려는 거야? 더 이상 듣고 싶지 않군. 네게 기쁨을 주고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "72fc90ec-86ae-4ed4-a42e-a913300a6f66"
msgid ""
"\"Urgathoa's gift could return your family to you... Although they probably "
"look terrible by now. But what wouldn't I do to help a friend?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우르가쏘아의 축복으로 가족을 네게 돌려줄 수 있지... 살아생전의 모습이랑은 거리가 멀겠지만. 그래도 친구 좋다는 게 뭐겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "321d02a6-ce29-490a-b464-ee7663affb38"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you dare call me a friend. A gravestone knows more of friendship "
"than you.\""
msgstr "\"감히 친구라는 말을 입에 담다니. 너랑 친구가 되느니 차라리 묘비에 대고 말하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f9f609f4-25a8-46bf-a97e-5f6e693dc4b0"
msgid ""
"You are incredibly boring. You don't live, you merely exist. Like a pebble "
"on the road. Even now, I am more alive than you. I enjoy every moment of my "
"existence!\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 참 지루한 사람이구나. 그건 사는 게 아니라, 그냥 있는 거야. 길가의 조약돌과 다를 바 없지. 지금도 그래. 나를 봐. 너보다 "
"생기가 넘치지. 매 순간 내 존재를 즐기니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "366ed6da-ba0a-4d77-96ab-777c6e8cb70c"
msgid ""
"\"The world is unfair. Otherwise you'd suffer every moment of your existence."
"\""
msgstr "\"세상은 불공평하군. 너 같은 사람은 존재하는 매 순간이 고통이어야 하는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c4aebf3f-b47c-4ab2-bd66-65e6d041cd29"
msgid ""
"\"Would you like to talk to your family? I could call their souls, as a "
"favor.\""
msgstr "\"가족에게 할 말이 있나? 네가 부탁하면 가족의 영혼을 불러주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9e21d120-6682-4414-a5a6-8d0d2c6b75c9"
msgid "\"I won't deal with you. Even the wolf sees your meat is carrion.\""
msgstr "\"상대하고 싶지 않군. 늑대도 네 속이 썩은 건 알 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "30d80b55-513f-4de8-849c-3092cfd0583e"
msgid ""
"\"When you do die – and it will happen sooner or later – I'll probably make "
"a roast of your doggy. For aesthetic reasons.\""
msgstr "\"그 멍멍이는 머지않아 네가 죽고 나면 구워 먹어줄게. 안 그래도 눈에 거슬렸거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "930ac876-b4ea-47f4-a3a1-551fa05466bc"
msgid "\"Fine. When death does come, I'll save my last arrow for you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 죽기 전에 널 위한 화살 한 발은 남겨두마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "efef4b4e-6271-41e1-a49c-fe43eafc1c08"
msgid "\"Hmm.\""
msgstr "\"흠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalEkun/Banter_JaethalEkun_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "133b8fb3-f74e-4124-86c2-646dad051233"
msgid "[Shrugs and turns away]"
msgstr "[어깨를 으쓱하고는 돌아섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "954fb73b-9517-4aeb-8a49-086a9cc9dbdc"
msgid ""
"\"A dwarf and an elf, exiles who've rejected the gods of their people, "
"fighting side by side... How strange! You're like a reflection in a "
"distorting mirror.\""
msgstr "\"그들의 신을 내쫓은 드워프와 엘프가 함께 싸운다니... 정말 이상하구나! 너는 일그러진 얼굴의 환영 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bfd46150-2e38-4d77-b0e6-d494a9278c21"
msgid ""
"\"Too bad your goddess doesn't teach you humility. I'm not anyone's "
"reflection. I am me. And you might have realized over your long life that "
"the world doesn't exist for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 신이 너에게 겸손함을 가르치지 않아서 안타깝구나. 나는 누구의 환영도 아니야. 나는 나다. 그리고 세상이 너를 위해 존재하지 "
"않을 때 네가 오래 살았다고 깨달을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9705b70b-2dd1-481d-8cf7-6ff7d0d5c0fb"
msgid ""
"\"Say, Harrim – wouldn't you like to see the end of times? Serving Urgathoa "
"could offer such an opportunity.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 하림. 세상의 끝을 보고 싶지 않아? 우르가쏘아를 섬기면 그런 기회를 얻을 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f522edf9-5681-461d-8fda-66dded515067"
msgid ""
"\"The end of times will come with or without me. Why multiply my grief, and "
"prolonging suffering in unlife?\""
msgstr "\"시간의 끝은 네가 있던 없던 올 거야. 왜 나를 더 우울하게 하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "92804de3-ce2b-472c-ac65-7e98b1dad3c5"
msgid ""
"\"What will your end of times look like, Harrim? You'll hardly live to see "
"it, and I'd like to know what to prepare for.\""
msgstr "\"네가 생각하는 세상의 끝은 무엇이지, 하림? 너는 그 때까지 살 것 같지는 않은데. 난 뭘 준비해야할지 알고 싶은걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4ef0c446-4ae7-4b4f-83f5-dc7c1a65f89a"
msgid ""
"\"So much arrogance in your words, so much smugness... Do you wish to live "
"forever? Groetus laughs at your plans – for they might be cut short in a "
"day, in an hour, or the very next moment…\""
msgstr ""
"\"오만한 말이로다, 너무 자신만만해 하는구나... 영원히 살고 싶나? 그로투스께서 비웃을 일이군. 자네의 종말은 딱 하루 뒤, 아니면 "
"한 시간 뒤, 어쩌면 바로 다음 순간일 수도 있다네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "946b2ea2-5b27-4195-ab7d-a61ecb9d1edd"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand, what's the point of preparing to die every day. Enjoy "
"life, Harrim! None of it will exist after you die.\""
msgstr "\"이해가 가지 않는군. 죽음을 준비하며 사는 게 무슨 소용이지. 삶을 즐기라고. 하림! 죽으면 아무것도 존재하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8adf56b4-dc36-4e75-8a11-96775dd9b641"
msgid ""
"\"I don't need cheap pleasure to convince me that my life has value. "
"Besides, it's a pleasure to know that every path has an end.\""
msgstr "\"내 삶이 가치있다고 나에게 확신시켜주는 싸구려 기쁨은 원하지 않아. 하지만 모든 길에는 끝이 있다는 걸 알아 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3ada6271-9acd-40de-9d41-e136c65972c7"
msgid "\"It's odd that your fatalism hasn't killed you yet.\""
msgstr "\"그 위험한 생각이 너를 죽이지 않은 것이 이상해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "635aae26-ac93-4c51-9a5d-2e90ab7df21d"
msgid ""
"\"And why should it? Everyone thinks I strive for death... But think about "
"it – why would I force the inevitable?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그래야 하지? 모두 내가 죽음을 갈망한다고 생각하는데... 하지만 왜 내가 죽음을 찾아야 하지? 어차피 오는 것을.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d3588200-556c-4b7b-b6bb-30b9b74ff19b"
msgid ""
"\"We have nothing to talk about. We hold nothing in common. You see no value "
"in life — while I am intoxicated by it.\""
msgstr "\"얘기할 게 없어. 우리는 같은 점이 없어. 너는 생명의 가치를 보지 않아. 나는 생명에 중독되어있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalHarrim/Banter_JaethalHarrim_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8b5fedbc-a33c-447f-ad06-8259df7b20a8"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing. However miserable your being is, you still cling to it. You think "
"you are a free spirit, but you are merely a slave, cherishing her chains for "
"fear of true freedom.\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀랍군. 우리 존재는 먼지만도 못하거늘, 얽매여 헤어 나오질 못하는구나. 넌 자유로운 영혼이 아니야. 진정한 자유 대신 안락한 족쇄에 "
"만족하는 노예일 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fc35bbdb-110f-4891-b2f0-9841c09c5c26"
msgid ""
"\"While I was still alive, I had so many wonderful feelings, but didn't have "
"the strength to achieve my goals.\""
msgstr "\"내가 아직 살아있는 동안 나는 많은 감정을 느끼지만 내 목표를 이루면 힘이 없어져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2daed942-02c1-4777-b4d9-449a804b6fef"
msgid ""
"\"Now I have sufficient strength for anything, but my goals... there are "
"problems with my goals.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이제 힘이 충분하지만 내 목표는... 문제가 생겼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f7207456-c42b-484e-ba36-2757b0e01a96"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I think that my entire existence is one long joke of fate.\""
msgstr "\"가끔 내 존재가 운명의 장난이라는 생각이 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ecc957f1-0e4e-45b1-84bc-2f7e458d5cbf"
msgid ""
"\"But it's all right, even if that is true. I'll still be the one who laughs "
"last.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 괜찮아. 그게 사실이라고 해도 말이야. 나는 마지막에 웃는 사람이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ca62c912-a149-4084-a34b-8ae7af13887c"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps I will return to Kyonin one day... Walk the streets of Iadara...\""
msgstr "\"아마도 언젠가는 쿄닌으로 돌아가서... 아이어다라의 길을 걸을테지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ae3ae071-ff2e-45d4-b147-2aa0f9380a96"
msgid ""
"\"… find the wretch who reported me to the elven eldest, and drain them of "
"their blood, drop by drop!\""
msgstr "\"… 엘프 장로에게 나를 고발한 녀석을 찾아서 피를 한방울씩 흘려 모두 뺄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bc84064f-b588-44f1-8f55-4773fbc66eb2"
msgid ""
"\"Enjoyment is the essence of life. The short-lived make plans, build "
"careers, strive for power – as if they have the time for this!\""
msgstr "\"즐거움은 삶에서 가장 중요한 것이지. 짧게 사는 자는 시간이 있다고 생각하듯 계획을 하고 경력을 쌓고 힘을 위해 살지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d9094b0e-664c-4457-9122-7333d5c9cf12"
msgid ""
"\"If my life were so terrifyingly short, I would think of nothing but "
"pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"내 삶이 짧다면 기쁨을 위해 살겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b78d0150-4e58-4c29-8d57-299b4529105e"
msgid ""
"\"And how do you think we should spend our short lives? With no plans, no "
"struggle for a better lot, no dreams? Ha!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 짧은 삶을 소모해야 한다고 생각하는 거야? 계획 없이 노력 없이 꿈도 없이? 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a16c1156-d028-418d-9adb-6acbb2842009"
msgid ""
"\"And how do you think we should spend our short lives? With no plans, no "
"struggle for a better lot, no dreams? Ha!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 짧은 삶을 소모해야 한다고 생각하는 거야? 계획 없이 노력 없이 꿈도 없이? 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJaethal/Banter_JaethalJaethal_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c5835fee-fc95-4aa3-82d1-19f709450b95"
msgid ""
"\"I've always been annoyed by those around me. But after I died, for some "
"reason they became particularly unbearable!\""
msgstr "\"주변 사람들 때문에 늘 짜증이 났지. 그런데 내가 죽은 뒤에는, 어째선지 아예 작정하고 못살게 굴더군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "90acacbd-156c-4986-aebf-373f263d6ace"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost, you've traveled quite a lot. Haven't you ever met an undead on "
"your journeys?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 너는 여행을 많이 했지. 언데드를 만난 적은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bf502746-cdad-49ba-803d-5a742d3de2f9"
msgid ""
"\"One like you – never. That's why you, Jaethal, are of such serious "
"academic interest to me!\""
msgstr "\"너 같은 녀석은 전혀 못봤어, 제이탈. 그래서 네가 연구 목적으로 정말 흥미롭다고 생각하는거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a442ef48-b081-4af2-bec0-b5656a25f541"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Jubilost, I think I know a way to solve your problem with the "
"Bleaching.\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 백화 현상을 해결할 방법을 찾은 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "dbce4c5c-d013-4682-ad99-c8df07c1df44"
msgid ""
"\"By turning me undead? Pff! 'Jubilost Narthropple, professor of zombology "
"and doctor of otherworldly science!' They'd laugh me out of Absalom.\""
msgstr "\"나를 언데드로 만든다고? 흥! 나는 좀비 의학 교수에 이세계 과학 분야 박사라고! 압살롬의 사람들이 나를 비웃겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "251dc810-71bb-4ed0-82fa-24f9ce6cc46d"
msgid "\"So you traveled a lot... But have you ever been to Kyonin?\""
msgstr "\"여행을 많이 했군... 쿄닌에는 가 본 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0c422416-5960-4de0-9514-7bddc55985b7"
msgid ""
"\"In the land of elves? Of course! I've even had the honor of attending a "
"reception at the capital, Iadara!\""
msgstr "\"엘프의 땅? 물론이지! 심지어 나는 수도 아이어다라에서 환영회에 참석하는 영광을 얻기도 했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "cc79c1ab-9d40-4cdb-bc7d-1b960c8d0390"
msgid ""
"\"I like your acridity. At least one of my companions understands that empty "
"praise and pointless politeness are only for weaklings and fools.\""
msgstr "\"그런 네 모습이 좋아. 쓸데 없는 기도나 의미 없는 친절은 약자나 바보들의 것이라는 걸 이해하는 녀석이 필요했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "800b2023-8895-4d83-8e7a-9fb313ddd93c"
msgid "\"I'm glad we've come to an understanding at least on that matter.\""
msgstr "\"그래도 그 점은 같아서 다행이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d8d089f9-6a54-44e5-8961-53deb1028c27"
msgid ""
"\"You walk on thin ice, when you make jokes at someone who is stronger and "
"more dangerous than you.\""
msgstr "\"이방인이나 위험한 사람에게 농담을 하는 네가 가끔 얼음 위를 걷고 있는 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "98b65366-b749-43b8-8694-20a8d594b5e3"
msgid ""
"\"Quite valuable advice on how to behave in society! Especially pleasant to "
"hear from someone who is being hunted by an army of assassins. – The lengths "
"people will go to, for an etiquette lesson from you.\""
msgstr "\"정말 좋은 행동지침이군! 암살자들에게 쫓기고 있는 녀석에게 그런 얘기를 듣다니 더 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "75c2b423-7ea3-4753-9f8f-aa595c96b29d"
msgid ""
"\"You talk so much, intoxicated by the sound of your own voice. But this is "
"merely a mask, an attempt to deceive even yourself... For deep inside, you "
"greatly fear that you are as boring and insignificant as everyone else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"말이 정말 많구나. 물릴 정도야. 하지만 그건 너 자신을 숨기기 위한 가면일 뿐이지... 내면은 네가 지루한 녀석일까봐 겁내고 있지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalJubilost/Banter_JaethalJubilost_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6d480916-cad3-49c7-a062-3cf4c62fe183"
msgid ""
"\"And who made you the expert? What's next, you ask me about my relationship "
"with my father?\""
msgstr "\"누가 너를 전문가로 만들었지? 이제 그 다음에는 내 아버지와의 관계를 물으려는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "695d8ed4-78ea-4005-82bb-2eab03d8023b"
msgid ""
"\"Would you like me to tell you a couple of tales from my life, Linzi? "
"They'll make your stories much more interesting...\""
msgstr "\"내 얘기 한두개정도 들려줄 수 있어? 린지? 그러면 네 이야기가 더 재미있어질 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "aacadbbd-36bc-4324-a0a3-2737f27a334c"
msgid ""
"\"After stories like yours, mothers will turn gray before their time, and "
"their children will grow up with stammers.\""
msgstr "\"네 이야기를 들려주면 사람들은 지처버릴걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c2f65cc7-553c-46ed-8afc-b9b6eef423ac"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what feeling an undead halfling would evoke from the peasants – "
"fear or laughter?\""
msgstr "\"언데드 하플링으로 만들면 두려워할까 좋아할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "688004ac-5759-4981-a2ae-1a940bc926fa"
msgid "\"I think disgust. But I don't feel like testing the theory.\""
msgstr "\"역겹구나. 그 이야기는 듣고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "744054e1-17d1-409e-a476-4ce05476954f"
msgid ""
"\"Why do the short-lived like books so much? Can't you just speak with your "
"peers about what interests you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이렇게 인기가 사그라드는 책이 많지? 그냥 네가 좋아하는 이야기를 들려주면 안 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "17d2ec8b-aff8-4f94-b494-9723b35fce1b"
msgid ""
"\"Well, we don't have hundreds of years to think about lofty matters under "
"the shady trees, bickering with each other lazily. So I have to commit my "
"thoughts to paper.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 수백년을 살지 못해. 그래서 내 생각을 책에 쓰는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0204df0a-a43c-408c-b45b-106557a2056e"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, I'm telling you for the last time – stop checking whether I'm "
"sleeping or meditating. I've told you a hundred times I don't need sleep.\""
msgstr "\"린지. 마지막으로 말하는데 내가 자는지 명상하는지 확인하지 좀 마. 나는 잘 필요가 없다고 몇번을 말해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d9655437-88f2-43f6-a4ac-9d174876433a"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine... I'm just curious whether you'd snore someday during "
"meditation!\""
msgstr "\"알았어. 알았어... 네가 언젠가 명상하다가 잘지 궁금했을 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5021d149-9e73-4fd9-92ca-6e25299b204f"
msgid ""
"\"When you die, I will miss you, Linzi. Maybe I should make an undead of you?"
"\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽을 때 네가 그리울 거야. 린지. 아니면 너를 언데드로 만들어야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "25c48b3a-905c-47d8-b00e-4e4c9be39185"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal, did Harrim bite you or something? I'm not going to die. And I "
"don't feel the slightest desire to become undead.\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 하림이 너를 깨물기라도 했어? 나는 죽지 않아. 나는 언데드가 되고 싶은 마음은 조금도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4f1316d8-450e-41b7-982e-b9642eb9d8bc"
msgid ""
"\"You are just wasting paper. Who would believe a word from someone like you?"
"\""
msgstr "\"그냥 종이만 낭비하고 있네. 너 같은 녀석이 하는 말을 누가 믿어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalLinzi/Banter_JaethalLinzi_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "052f9d29-7f4f-42ba-a5d1-e20a22b904b9"
msgid ""
"\"Someone will! They'd probably put more faith in an army of immortal elven "
"chroniclers, but I don't see any here. So I'll just have to suffer for all "
"of them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가는 믿겠죠! 불사의 엘프 연대기 작가들이 아마 한 부대는 있을테니, 그들이 쓰면 더 믿음직 하겠죠. 근데 여기에는 한 사람도 "
"보이질 않네요? 그러니까 내가 이렇게 고생하고 있는거죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalNokNok/Banter_JaethalNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d3100dc6-415d-48c1-a564-6b0c1b229ee2"
msgid ""
"\"Who would have thought that I, the former Kyonin judge, will be forced to "
"share company with this… thing.\""
msgstr "\"쿄닌의 심판관이었던 내가 이런 녀석과 동료를 해야 하다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalNokNok/Banter_JaethalNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "60153d93-b518-45eb-b05f-be026d389722"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, need to get used to. But {name} is not that bad actually, quite "
"bearable.\""
msgstr "\"익숙해져야겠지. 하지만 {name}의 성질은 참을 만해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalNokNok/Banter_JaethalNokNok_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2b56cb05-fa62-439e-a50e-9a245a0ff80b"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, if you're going to stare, stare in another direction or I'll "
"pluck out your eyes.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 눈 깔지 않으면 눈알을 뽑아버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalNokNok/Banter_JaethalNokNok_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "cc858fae-a276-4ce5-bc4e-8ee75367c551"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok can't help it, first time see corpse walking around and insulting "
"him. Usually only living do it.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 할 수 없다. 처음으로 나한테 욕하는 걸어다니는 시체 봤다. 살아있는 녀석만 욕한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "815edcdb-38a3-4a0c-b79b-112067cc6554"
msgid ""
"\"Are you putting on makeup again? Commendable. Of course, not everyone has "
"natural beauty, but at least you try.\""
msgstr "\"화장을 다시 고치는 거니? 칭찬해주지. 모두가 타고난 아름다움을 가지지 않으니. 뭐라도 해봐야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9b59b55d-a22b-4f88-98e5-a6cae7322b41"
msgid ""
"\"Look who is talking about beauty! You might have been pretty while you "
"were alive, but now you're only good for scaring crows!\""
msgstr "\"누가 아름다움을 말하는거죠? 살아있을 때는 예뻤을지 몰라도 지금 당신 얼굴을 보면 까마귀도 도망갈걸요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d78a6278-c60b-4d90-97ae-9b63b5d56519"
msgid ""
"\"You have a pretty face. Should I make a zombie out of you? Though you'd "
"cause more laughter than admiration.\""
msgstr "\"너는 얼굴이 예뻐. 너를 좀비로 만들어도 되겠니? 감탄대신 웃음이 터지겠지만 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "92ad8f29-6d47-4c06-a84e-11df8575eb1f"
msgid ""
"\"I like being alive and laughing with my friends! But what feelings do you "
"cause? Retching at best!\""
msgstr "\"저는 살아서 친구들과 웃는 게 좋아요! 당신은 뭘 할 수 있죠? 기껏해야 구토 유발 밖에 더하나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "20af203c-708a-43aa-9d87-8992a64eea2d"
msgid ""
"\"You mother was human, right? So your father must have been very handsome. "
"Too bad he decided to dilute his blood – with an elven mother you might have "
"been a beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어머니가 인간이었군. 맞지? 네 아버지는 아주 잘생겼을 텐데. 네 아버지가 잡종을 낳아서 유감이군. 어머니가 엘프였으면 딸이 더 "
"예뻤을텐데 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "73cdf356-1284-40a4-9603-60126f447379"
msgid ""
"\"What do you care about my family? You got yours killed, and now you gossip "
"about others?\""
msgstr "\"당신이 내 가족을 신경써서 뭐할 건데요? 지금 가족을 죽인 주제에 다른 가족 얘기를 하는 거예요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ab9f00b1-f7d2-4493-b36a-0b50b588a9b4"
msgid "\"You fight pretty well. Keep at it, and you might earn my respect.\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 잘 싸우는구나. 계속해서 그렇게 싸우면 내가 인정하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "279fbbd9-7c72-459d-b9ee-ac900e2ed456"
msgid ""
"\"Like I need it! I have more respect for grave worms than for you. Speaking "
"of which, I think they're calling you!\""
msgstr "\"누가 필요하대요? 당신보다 시체벌레한테 인정받는 게 나아요. 들어보니까 시체벌레가 당신을 찾는다던데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "68cf6d7e-b461-418f-a91c-3967c16aaef9"
msgid ""
"\"It's so amusing how you try to seem beautiful. Who's going to set their "
"eyes on your little painted face? Maybe some half-orc – or a half-troll.\""
msgstr ""
"\"예뻐 보이려고 하는 모습이 정말 재밌구나. 누가 이 작은 도화지에 눈을 맞출까? 하프 오크... 아니면 하프 트롤 정도겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4dc03e52-5e83-4517-b859-83decdc111f4"
msgid ""
"\"You know, whoever killed you, I'd like to find him and shake his hand!\""
msgstr "\"당신을 누가 죽였건 그 사람을 만나 악수하고 싶네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "728d586f-3545-4cbf-8ba2-181071547b1b"
msgid ""
"\"You used to wear slave's shackles, didn't you? That's right. Your sort "
"always benefits from lessons in obedience. With a few lashes to drive the "
"point home.\""
msgstr "\"족쇄를 차고 다녔다는데, 그렇지? 너희 같은 부류는 항상 복종에서 교훈을 얻더군. 채찍 만큼 좋은 교재가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "56f976ac-6cac-4b73-b9a0-a604678b595e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I learned my lessons well. You've no idea how much the one under a "
"whip learns about the one who holds its handle! Make no mistake, I will pass "
"my test.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 제가 교훈을 잘 배우긴 했죠. 당신은 채찍을 맞는 사람이 채찍을 쥔 사람을 얼마나 잘 아는지 모를 껄요? 선 넘지 마세요. 나 "
"지금 참는 중이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1ac16319-cf82-43c6-a8cc-53e26038b173"
msgid "\"How ironic. Of all of us, only the dead can truly judge life.\""
msgstr "\"정말 아이러니하네. 죽은 우리 둘만이 삶을 판단할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "32e18f4e-fa79-4c4b-9734-202883edc573"
msgid "\"You call this life?\""
msgstr "\"이 삶을 말하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5f261efa-7b86-45fd-b4b5-89dcfe1e6a9d"
msgid ""
"\"A life not brightened by attachment and love — such a life has no taste. A "
"taste of decay, perhaps.\""
msgstr "\"사랑이 없는 삶은 재미가 없지. 죽을 맛일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalOctavia/Banter_JaethalOctavia_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5bd822d5-2ffe-4a4d-9fe7-5684fdc06159"
msgid ""
"\"You judged life well enough, while you lived in luxury in the elven "
"capital. Now you're just comforting yourself.\""
msgstr "\"엘프 도시에서 호화롭게 살면서도 삶을 잘 아는구나. 그건 네 생각일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5ac52683-a02a-48cb-99e1-a977ad2b22ff"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, halfbreed, do you think you could ever become more than a raging "
"brute like your ancestors?\""
msgstr "\"너희 조상 만큼 포악해질 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "991d47fe-ccb7-4acc-aa30-c6f9b43cbe94"
msgid "\"At least I'm still alive, you... lich!\""
msgstr "\"살아있으니 가능하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5ca2812b-3cc5-4200-8b48-4bf153224e4a"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, Regongar, how does Octavia, with her noble elven blood, put up "
"with...\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 어떻게 고귀한 엘프 혼혈인 옥타비아와 함께 있을 수 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f334953d-0063-49bf-9b66-8e92e71c3881"
msgid "\"Another word, and I'll rip your head off!\""
msgstr "\"한마디만 더 지껄이면 머리를 뽑아주겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "11e9a6d2-19df-435a-927f-322d4cc929f7"
msgid ""
"\"You have the right view on life. Take whatever you can from it! Enjoy "
"every moment! Perhaps sooner or later you, too, will be touched by "
"Urgathoa's hand?\""
msgstr "\"인생을 잘 아는구나. 할 수 있는 건 다 해 봐! 삶을 즐기라고! 조만간 너도 우르가쏘아의 보살핌을 받을 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2b599beb-5008-4d67-a879-2c59a724d79f"
msgid ""
"\"Calistria save me from that sort of pleasure! Hey, all of you – you hear? "
"If I die, burn my corpse and scatter the ashes! So that none of the undeads "
"get me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"칼리스트리아가 그런 즐거움에서 나를 구했지! 이봐들! 내가 죽으면 내 시체를 화장해줘! 저 언데드가 나에게 손대지 못하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6592c964-64a8-4f84-83dd-272108aa3a6f"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, are your tattoos somehow related to the lightning you cast in "
"battle? Or are they just pointless marring of your skin?\""
msgstr "\"네 문신은 전투에서 사용하는 번개와 연관이 있어? 아니면 그냥 장식인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c81fcb17-795b-4610-accd-e1f648f89454"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you care? If you ask too many questions, I'll give you a brand to "
"match!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 상관이야? 그렇게 자꾸 귀찮게 하면 혼날 줄 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "adf21f24-0a42-4ec6-95a9-d5ca7b56e9bb"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, why do you get so tense when I come close? Are you afraid I'll "
"bite you?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 왜 내가 접근할 때마다 그렇게 긴장하지? 내가 무섭나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f217685f-41b4-4245-b4db-253ce4bdb7b3"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid you'll stick your nose in my business and try to teach me how "
"to live. And I can't kill you yet... Even though sometimes I really, really "
"want to!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 시비를 걸고 이래라 저래라 할까봐 무서운 거야. 그리고 아직은 너를 죽일 수 없으니까... 가끔은 정말 너를 죽이고 싶지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6395548b-b41d-4f76-8a18-4b08f10d0784"
msgid ""
"\"The company of the short-lived is very tiresome. You annoy me more than "
"you know!\""
msgstr "\"오래 못사는 녀석이 귀찮군. 너는 정말 짜증나는 녀석이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "264a9b6c-d7b7-42e3-bc29-16434f0c55cb"
msgid ""
"\"As opposed to the company of noble corpse lovers! Nothing annoying there "
"at all!\""
msgstr "\"시체 애호가가 있으니 그렇지. 그것보다 짜증나는 건 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e4679fd5-a66d-4bc0-a470-cd641c7d1e61"
msgid "\"Oh, say it again. Your sobbing is music to my ears!\""
msgstr "\"다시 말해봐. 네가 질질 짜도 나는 상관 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f6f5e85f-b5ec-47ba-a2da-540cbb0e902d"
msgid "\"Oh, say it again. Your sobbing is music to my ears!\""
msgstr "\"다시 말해봐. 네가 질질 짜도 나는 상관 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3c72d7d9-7f92-40a3-b78b-35a391359439"
msgid ""
"\"You would make a good servant. Strong, and angry. Should I reveal the "
"gifts of Urgathoa to you? Her magic is far deadlier than yours.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너라면 쓸만한 하인이 될 거야. 힘도 세고 성질도 있고. 우르가쏘아의 선물을 네게 주어야 할까? 그녀의 마법이 너의 것보다 강해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "14f5cb16-6ad7-4fff-bcfa-e62bf665ba91"
msgid ""
"\"Won't work, rotten meat, I already pray to Calistria. You think she'd let "
"a handsome boy like me go? Ha! She'll scratch your Urgathoa's face for me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"필요 없어. 나는 이미 칼리스트리아에게 기도를 하니까. 나 같은 미남을 여신님이 버릴 것 같아? 하! 우르가쏘아의 얼굴을 할퀴어주실걸!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "32073764-1624-4314-a6e6-c8c1cdc077ce"
msgid ""
"\"The cruel truth of this world has revealed itself to you. You know that "
"the strong get the most succulent cuts, and the weak had best keep their "
"silence. You are not blind, like the others... So what holds you back? Why "
"don't you seize what is yours?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 세상의 잔인한 진실이 너에게 드러났어. 강자가 모든 걸 갖는 반면 약자는 그저 조용히 있어야 하지. 너는 장님이 아니잖아... "
"등에 있는 건 뭐지? 네 걸 들고 있지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalRegongar/Banter_JaethalRegongar_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4cbd128b-c319-4a8a-8bdd-d12b16a83a02"
msgid ""
"\"That's none of your concern, corpse. If I catch word that you're meddling "
"in my business, all the gods in the world won't be able to dig you up.\""
msgstr "\"네가 상관할 바는 아니다. 네가 나를 귀찮게 한다면 뼈도 못추리게 해주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "981ce0cc-0d1d-4084-a276-e7c4b9e7c3dc"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Tristian, we have much more in common than you think. You say "
"everyone deserves a chance to atone. But isn't life after death such a "
"chance?\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안. 생각보다 우리는 공통점이 많아. 네 입으로 모두에게 기회를 줘야한다고 말했잖아. 죽음 이후의 삶도 일종의 기회 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f224ec81-99c9-41bb-913d-ba99f28b5005"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps. If so, I pray that you do use this chance to atone at last.\""
msgstr "\"아마도. 너에게 진정한 기회가 있기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4d2e8f06-b061-4b15-8487-893a2717bdf1"
msgid ""
"\"You must think yourself a saint. It's ridiculous how meticulous you are "
"about your vows and observations. Is there nothing else in your life?\""
msgstr "\"너 자신이 성자라고 생각하나 본데. 네가 친절하다고 생각하는 게 웃겨. 너는 그렇지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a6239ed1-ec0f-44db-a029-b86dcf502176"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Jaethal, I live to serve Sarenrae, and those who need my help. And "
"what do you live for? Or better yet, why do you persist in your unlife?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 제이탈, 나는 서렌레이를 섬기며 도움이 필요한 사람을 위해 살지. 하지만 너는 무얼 위해 살지? 왜 너는 언데드로서 계속 "
"살아가는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7415a085-0f59-4398-bccd-b05277a4c752"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you understand you can never heal all the sick or console all the "
"afflicted? Learn to enjoy life, not crawl through it like you have a boulder "
"on your shoulders.\""
msgstr "\"병자는 치료할 수 없다는 걸 모르는 거야? 어깨에 짐을 지듯 살지 말고 삶을 즐기는 방법을 배우라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7731a89c-1a94-449d-9370-294cfbf03af6"
msgid ""
"\"My vows are no boulder, but a precious load I carry through my entire "
"life. Living is easy for you, but only because your existence is empty and "
"pointless.\""
msgstr "\"그건 짐이 아니라 내 삶에서 내가 지고 나가야 할 소중한 것이지. 네 존재가 공허하니 너에게 삶은 쉽겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "808cabcd-9d91-463e-96a9-e202d872c422"
msgid ""
"\"You like stories about atrocities, don't you? Listen then to my "
"confession...\""
msgstr "\"너는 잔인한 이야기를 좋아하지? 내 이야기를 들어줘. 그럼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b5dce27a-ccf3-4fd6-ad7f-5dd2f3758f71"
msgid ""
"\"When you are ready to confess, I will hear you. But spare me your boasting."
"\""
msgstr "\"고백할 때가 되면 들어주지. 하지만 자랑은 말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "aa11cf68-b6df-46bc-bfc3-cf4d01f929b5"
msgid ""
"\"You are so kind, so naive... But there are many evil people in the world. "
"Will your goddess be able to protect you from them?\""
msgstr "\"너는 친절하고 순진하구나... 하지만 세상은 악한 사람으로 가득해. 너의 여신이 그들로부터 너를 구할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalTristian/Banter_JaethalTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1c967571-a036-4fdf-91d3-0f075f578ef5"
msgid ""
"\"I pray for her to grant me patience, not protection. One day all this will "
"end, and then you will be the one in need of protection.\""
msgstr "\"보호가 아니라 내게 인내심을 달라고 여신에게 기도하지. 언젠가 모든 것이 끝나면 네가 보호가 필요할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a46cb6c7-7979-488c-89a3-549d1dc6a66d"
msgid ""
"\"You are beautiful, Valerie, especially for a human. This is not meant as a "
"compliment, merely a statement of fact. It would be a pity if this beauty "
"leaves the world.\""
msgstr "\"너를 아름답지. 발레리. 인간임에도. 칭찬은 아니고 그저 사실이야. 이런 미인이 세상을 떠나면 안타깝겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2a1c0b3d-ea51-4695-a770-0b8f613f90a0"
msgid ""
"\"Do you suggest I follow Urgathoa's path and get myself stuck between life "
"and death? I don't think I'd like it.\""
msgstr "\"나보고 우르가쏘아를 믿으라는 겁니까? 삶과 죽음 사이에서 방황하고 싶지는 않군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c933f292-f9b5-49f2-af8b-2bae3034c7f3"
msgid ""
"\"Paladins of Shelyn venerate beauty and art... But the amusing part is that "
"they don't have the slightest clue about either.\""
msgstr "\"셸린의 팔라딘은 미와 예술에 능하지... 하지만 재밌는 사실은 그들이 그 무엇도 관심이 없다는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b647a7c1-b241-49d0-9098-9b70f9cf4ed2"
msgid ""
"\"I'd agree with you here. That's why I left the Order of the Eternal Rose. "
"Behind their colored silks and lofty words hides common gray mediocrity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 말에 동의합니다. 그래서 나는 영원한 장미를 떠났습니다. 화려한 비단과 우아한 언어 뒤에 그들은 흉한 모습을 감췄지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "82890bd6-882e-4805-b2c0-4a81f0b64be6"
msgid ""
"\"Not many can boast both good lineage and true nobility of spirit. Even "
"fewer among your people. It is good to have such a person as a companion.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 혈통과 고귀한 영혼을 가진 자는 많지 않지. 그런 자를 동료로 둔 건 좋은 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "074e1e11-d66f-4a8e-8595-4821513fd477"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for the compliment. There aren't many of the aristocratic class "
"in these lands – and they are not greatly missed.\""
msgstr "\"칭찬은 고맙습니다. 이 땅에 지배 계층은 많지 않습니다. 그리고 환영받는 존재도 아니고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "218f3282-e4fa-4f87-a472-9d8a2e5ed830"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, Valerie, why did you choose the path of a mercenary? Even in self-"
"imposed exile, you could find a more enjoyable pursuits than fighting side-"
"by-side with the common folk.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 왜 용병의 길을 걷는 거지? 스스로 나왔어도 더 재밌는 일을 할 수 있었을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ec08a35b-8d92-4c27-927c-7a06216f3319"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what that might be? Perhaps I should have become a lady of "
"pleasure? Or the mistress to an odd duke? Not a chance! I've no interest in "
"being someone's toy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 일을 말입니까? 몸이라도 팔라는 건가요? 아니면 귀족의 부인이 되라는 건가요? 말도 안 되지요! 나는 그런 장난감이 될 흥미는 "
"없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a4d105e1-1019-4d99-b684-c0f331f7fc3f"
msgid ""
"\"You are beautiful. And young, desired. It's a pity you do not use what "
"gifts fate has bestowed upon you.\""
msgstr "\"너는 아름다워. 그리고 어리지. 네게 주어진 재능을 쓰지 못한다는 게 아쉬워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JaethalValerie/Banter_JaethalValerie_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d7ffa3eb-5472-4505-a488-2140634b33f1"
msgid ""
"\"You know how to fight, your spirit is strong, and you fear neither disease "
"nor age. It's a pity you haven't found better use for your own gifts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 싸울 줄 알고 당신의 영혼은 강하고 병이나 늙음을 두려워할 필요는 없습니다. 당신의 재능을 사용하지 못해서 아쉽군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_JubilostAmiri1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c93a7b3b-a6cb-4c8d-a6f1-3c526b83e5e5"
msgid ""
"\"Rather than snatching my books when no one is watching, you could have "
"just asked.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 보지 않을 때 내 책을 훔치는 것보다 부탁하는 게 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_JubilostAmiri1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0d9be24a-eaed-453c-8ce7-8444b5143626"
msgid ""
"\"I was… I just wanted to look at the pictures! The one with the two swords "
"has many pictures of different battles — all very interesting. And the "
"second has a picture of lady warrior on the cover. I like her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 그림들을 보고 싶었어! 이도류로 싸우는 그림이 많아서. 매우 흥미로웠지. 그리고 겉장에 여성 전사의 모습이 그려졌어. 나는 "
"그게 마음에 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "be8c9d88-e72a-44f3-a3dc-89aa79affcdc"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard a hypothesis that northern barbarians are descended from frost "
"giants. Looking at you, Amiri, I tend to think there's a modicum of truth in "
"this!\""
msgstr "\"북부 야만인들은 서리 거인의 후손이라는데. 너를 보니 그게 사실인 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "55b98480-9aac-4205-ac4e-0e7bc8ab776e"
msgid ""
"\"Giants? Ha! Aim higher. I'll have you know, we descended from the "
"mountains themselves!\""
msgstr "\"거인이라고? 하! 나는 거인보다 더 커. 우리는 산맥의 자손이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "fe18d562-9135-4a17-ba10-daaaf6605fe0"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder why in the vast majority of cases, brains and brawn are "
"reciprocally proportional?\""
msgstr "\"지능과 힘이 왜 비례하는지 알고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "244fe8aa-8146-4ee4-9fda-e435c5586ef3"
msgid ""
"\"Pro-pro-ti-what? Oh, gnome, I feel it in my gut you just said something "
"bad about me! Gods forbid one day I understand what you're babbling!\""
msgstr "\"비... 뭐라고? 나보고 비루하다고 얘기하는 거야? 네 말은 듣기도 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cfb6929f-12ce-4f4d-9ae1-53d0bafaf2d7"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, who touched my 'Monstrum Compendium Universalis'? – With greasy "
"fingers!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 누가 내 괴물 대백과 사전에 손을 댄 거야? 기름이 묻었잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e5f47c28-c2bf-4cb8-b574-8434cbfa07d8"
msgid ""
"\"Em... Well, me. Was I not supposed to? The pictures are funny. And I wiped "
"my hands on a hide first! I did!\""
msgstr "\"음... 그건 나야. 그러면 안 돼? 그림들이 재밌던데. 그리고 가죽으로 내 손을 닦았어! 정말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c63309b7-7717-4b17-8cee-e8c2e36bd7ad"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you need such a huge sword? Have you ever considered that you might "
"be compensating for something?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그런 큰 검이 필요하지? 그런 큰 물건을 들어야 만족하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAmiri/Banter_JubilostAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1bfb960b-91c6-4eac-b15d-25c320bf46f9"
msgid "\"You want to see the view from on top of it?\""
msgstr "\"위에서 내려다보고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAngel/Banter_JubilostAngel_JubilostTristian1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "61876dae-5bf4-45f7-98b2-624fcce70056"
msgid ""
"\"Are you seriously going to accompany my every phrase with a sad sigh and a "
"glance of reproof?\""
msgstr "\"내가 하는 말마다 한숨 쉬고 곁눈질할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostAngel/Banter_JubilostAngel_JubilostTristian1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "361f4f3d-4c63-4815-bdf4-00fe00b357e9"
msgid ""
"\"I'm just trying to understand why you keep hurting people, yet harbor no "
"evil in your heart.\""
msgstr "\"왜 네가 사람들을 상처주는지 이해하려는 거였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_JubilostEkun_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "95b30af6-7cae-4071-9d49-621fa252dc81"
msgid ""
"\"Your wolf seems twice as friendly as you are. And twice as eloquent.\""
msgstr "\"네 늑대가 너보다 두배는 친절한 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_JubilostEkun_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "70ddd85e-d58c-4d33-9e2d-905ab2deecd9"
msgid ""
"\"And I say it would be better if your tongue were dripping wisdom — rather "
"than venom.\""
msgstr "\"독이 아니라 지혜를 쏟아낸다면 더 좋겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7eac6e88-25b7-42ac-a316-57d8d03f217b"
msgid ""
"\"They say pets look like their owners. I always thought this statement was "
"ridiculous until I met you, Ekun – and your wolf. It's as sullen as you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"애완동물은 주인을 닮는다는데. 나는 항상 너를 만나기 전까지는 이 말이 웃기다고 생각했어. 그런데 늑대가 너 만큼이나 못됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cc6dc308-da4e-41d7-9c05-7bbee75ce38e"
msgid "\"You should have a rattlesnake. Noisy and venomous.\""
msgstr "\"방울뱀을 키워야겠군. 시끄럽고 독설을 쏟아내니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "fec773e3-7b02-404b-a684-b57f04ee2fbb"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Ekun, you might be rude, but your traveling experience could "
"save many lives... If only there were someone capable of writing it all down "
"in simple and straightforward terms.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 너는 무례하지만 많은 사람을 구했지... 그런 이야기를 써줄 수 있는 사람이 있다면 좋을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e75c9a4c-a0ab-4d88-a966-4b93573973fd"
msgid ""
"\"Are you hinting at yourself? Don't get your hopes up. I don't think we'll "
"be having any long conversations.\""
msgstr "\"너를 가리키는 건가? 희망은 품지 마라. 우리는 할 얘기가 별로 없는 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bdc22509-3d21-41dc-8956-7c18369ab365"
msgid ""
"\"Ekundayo... This is your full name, right, Ekun? Does it mean something? "
"It's not that it's important that I know it, but you see, curiosity makes me "
"restless.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤다요... 이게 너의 이름이지. 에쿤? 무슨 의미가 있는 거야? 중요한 건 아니지만 궁금해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ba8311c1-f867-4b9d-a4a7-6020bd4c4721"
msgid ""
"\"All names mean something. Yours probably means 'acid-tongued'. Or "
"'pestilence'.\""
msgstr "\"모든 이름에는 의미가 있지. 네 이름의 의미는 독설이거나 주절거림이라는 의미가 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8796af7a-57a4-439f-8456-2fdf22bc1a24"
msgid "\"Ah, rest at last! Finally I can sit and read quietly!\""
msgstr "\"마침내 쉬는구나! 이제 조용히 앉아서 읽을 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6d6b48da-b778-4041-8e54-614636ce94b8"
msgid "\"No. No reading. Fetch water. Or you can read and stay hungry.\""
msgstr "\"읽지 마. 가서 물 떠와. 아니면 굶고 책을 읽던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1d906189-c488-46a2-b53d-327131a8862f"
msgid ""
"\"Why don't you pull your nose out of your books and talk to one of your "
"companions, Jubilost? An evening by the fire is the best time for "
"conversation.\""
msgstr "\"책 말고 주빌로스트와 이야기하지 그래? 모닥불에 앉으면 대화하기 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostEkun/Banter_JubilostEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d6828891-40fb-4853-8fdf-43e93b8eb700"
msgid ""
"\"Why don't you pull your nose out of your books and talk to one of your "
"companions, Jubilost? An evening by the fire is the best time for "
"conversation.\""
msgstr "\"책 말고 주빌로스트와 이야기하지 그래? 모닥불에 앉으면 대화하기 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9979facf-cb1c-42a6-aa6e-80c47ea800a6"
msgid ""
"\"Well, is there any news from Groetus? When should we expect the end of the "
"world? This week – or maybe next?\""
msgstr "\"그로투스에 대해 할 말이 있어? 세계의 종말은 언제일까? 이번주야? 아니면 다음주?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "32249ef0-c032-4bcc-b341-b9f53d0e3229"
msgid ""
"\"Groetus does not speak of his plans. But the end of times is inevitable – "
"does it matter when?\""
msgstr "\"그로투스는 계획을 말해주지 않아. 하지만 종말은 피할 수 없어. 언제가 중요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6960a1ff-5133-49cf-8c30-4fbedbd05757"
msgid ""
"\"I recall a lecture at the College of Mysteries… The professor was well-"
"versed in the brain, and various of its... deviations. He demonstrated a "
"patient who'd begun to hear voices, after being hit by an arrow in the "
"temporal region.\""
msgstr ""
"\"미스터리에 대한 강의가 기억나... 교수는 말을 잘했고 똑똑했지. 뇌에서 기억과 대화를 담당하는 부위에 화살을 맞은 환자가 말을 "
"알아들을 수 있다는 이야기를 해주었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "55319120-e8b1-4b6d-b1a3-de65f1aeb870"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you and the others try so hard to convince me I'm crazy? Is it "
"because you secretly know that I'm right, and you're afraid to admit it, "
"even to yourself?\""
msgstr "\"왜 다들 나보고 미쳤다고 그러는 거야? 내가 옳고 너희는 인정하기 싫은 걸 알아서 그러는 거 아니야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d125a659-99cb-4b59-b7dc-4ba40b0310e2"
msgid ""
"\"You are the only living creature I know, whose entire purpose is its own "
"death. This makes you quite an amusing curiosity, well worth mentioning in "
"one of my works.\""
msgstr "\"너는 살아있어도 삶의 목표가 죽음이라고 생각하는 녀석이지. 그 사실이 너를 정말 흥미롭게 만들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "cedf9400-4190-4122-85a4-c3e3c5eeb3ae"
msgid ""
"\"If you think I will be flattered by this, you are deeply mistaken. I don't "
"care what you write in your books. There are no words that can change the "
"inevitable!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 말을 듣고 내가 좋아할 거라 생각했다면 오산이야. 네가 책에 무얼 쓰던지 관심 없어. 종말을 막을 수 있는 책은 없으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1cb064cf-9d44-43c9-bd4f-50af290c42a5"
msgid ""
"\"You're quite a rarity. A dwarf rejecting Torag, a dwarf unable to forge a "
"nail... I wouldn't be surprised to hear you don't enjoy ale!\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 특이해. 토락을 숭배하지 않고 못도 만들지 못하는 드워프라니... 맥주를 싫어해도 별로 놀랍지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostHarrim/Banter_JubilostHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c83270dd-7f47-4a71-b330-7847b46464d3"
msgid ""
"\"I... No, I sometimes do bend my elbow. But much less now than in my bad "
"days, after I ran away from my home, knowing no purpose, or where I should "
"go. If I had a stronger will, perhaps I would forgo drinking completely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 가끔은 술을 즐기고는 하지. 내 고향으로부터 도망을 나오고 나의 목표를 알게 된 후로는 술을 많이 마시지 않아. 내가 "
"의지가 더 강했다면 술이 없이도 살 수 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e099443a-13f9-465a-bbef-c199f71d75a4"
msgid ""
"\"You are quite an unusual specimen, even by undead standards. Why don't you "
"bequeath your body to science – after your final death, of course?\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 특이해. 언데드로서도 특이할 거야. 네가 죽게 된다면 몸을 과학을 위해 기증하는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ccdecb4a-934c-41e5-aecb-d0ce6f055be6"
msgid ""
"\"In your own mind, at least, you seem to be quite a famous intellectual. "
"Don't you want to bequeath your brain to science? I'd be happy to extract it "
"for you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 유명하고 똑똑하다고 생각하나본데. 네 뇌를 과학을 위해 기증할 생각은 없나? 그러면 기꺼이 뇌를 꺼내주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cdb38667-7277-4f0b-93a5-788447b9be9c"
msgid ""
"\"Indulge my curiosity. After you've become, ahem, undead, what changes "
"would you notice first of all?\""
msgstr "\"호기심을 풀려는 거야. 네가 언데드가 되고 나서 바뀌었다고 가장 먼저 떠오르는 게 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a7d13432-1550-47d1-b3e8-35b62a908dfb"
msgid ""
"\"First of all? Let me think... Your heart isn't beating, blood isn't "
"running through your veins, there's no need to breathe. And insolent gnomes "
"keep stalking you, asking tactless questions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 먼저? 어디 보자... 심장은 뛰지 않고 피는 동맥에서 흐르지 않아. 숨을 쉴 필요가 없지. 그리고 무례한 노움이 계속해서 쓸데 "
"없는 질문을 하며 스토킹하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e4ce3b7d-28ec-4391-8f87-fc010a27773b"
msgid ""
"\"It feels strange to say it, but you and I have more in common than it "
"seems. You live for pleasures, new feelings and sensations... And gnomes "
"live for the same thing – otherwise we're overtaken by the Bleaching, soon "
"followed by death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하게 느낄 수도 있지만 너와 나는 공통점이 많아. 너는 새로운 느낌과 기쁨을 위해 살지... 노움도 같아. 그렇지 않으면 우리는 "
"백화되어 죽게 되니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8e16147e-f1fa-4d5f-810c-9c8a21a92794"
msgid ""
"\"A curious perspective... You might even have a point. If so – why don't "
"you submit to Urgathoa? I guarantee you a host of new sensations!\""
msgstr "\"흥미로운 관점이군... 네 말이 맞아. 그러면 우르가쏘아를 섬기는 것은 어떨까? 새로운 기쁨을 선사해줄 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b2014094-53fc-49ab-82c3-15a88ad73d6c"
msgid ""
"\"After our expedition is over – why don't you come to Absalom with me? Our "
"medics will flood us with gold, for the privilege of studying such a unique "
"undead specimen!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 여행이 끝나면 나와 압살롬에 가는 게 어때? 이쪽의 의사가 특이한 언데드 표본을 얻게 되면 돈을 뿌려댈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7c540027-c07f-433c-95e8-a399cabe94a0"
msgid ""
"\"A flattering proposition, but I think I'll decline. Although if you want "
"to supply your medics with an undead specimen so badly, I could certainly "
"make one of you!\""
msgstr "\"흥미롭지만 거절하겠어. 너희 의사에게 언데드 표본을 가져다주고 싶다면 너를 언데드로 만들어 줄 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b9eb8edf-0805-4a69-bcfe-cc199c234203"
msgid ""
"\"Why, is it fall already? Hay-making time? And I forgot my scythe, today of "
"all days! But we could put yours to proper use!\""
msgstr "\"벌써 끝이야? 건초를 자를 시간인가? 오늘은 내 낫을 잊었군! 하지만 네 것을 사용할 수 있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJaethal/Banter_JubilostJaethal_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e5ed2b32-755f-4790-81e4-7c67d3b95eec"
msgid ""
"\"Your jokes are quite amusing. If you die, I'll have to bring you back. Not "
"in your entirety – just the head. Everything below your clever little head "
"is quite useless anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 농담은 정말 재밌구나. 네가 죽으면 너를 되살릴 거야. 머리만 되살리는 거지. 네 귀여운 머리 아래로는 전혀 쓸모가 없거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0c528d94-54f4-43c6-8c5c-7d5e21283825"
msgid ""
"\"I admit, when I set off on this expedition, I was sure of gaining new "
"discoveries I could write about in my works – and new sensations, capable of "
"reducing the Bleaching...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 여행을 떠났을 때 내 책에 쓸 이야기를 발견할 수 있을 거라 생각했어. 백화를 막고 새로운 기쁨을 얻을 발견을 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5d738828-3f8d-4aba-8e83-546fbc50d5a2"
msgid ""
"\"I'll say nothing about discoveries, but I have had quite a few new "
"sensations! Too bad they're predominantly unpleasant.\""
msgstr "\"발견에 대해서 할 말은 없지만 새로운 기쁨 몇개는 알지. 다른 녀석들은 불쾌해서 안타까울 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "776dc9ed-2069-43bd-b059-f298f2e066b7"
msgid ""
"\"Why did I ever decide to come to this wilderness? I could be sitting at a "
"nice desk, writing a new novel... Or a reference book...\""
msgstr "\"왜 내가 이런 후미진 곳에 오겠다고 했지? 그냥 책상에 앉아서 소설이나 쓸걸...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9e0fb2f1-1d08-4918-bf9d-f74e58db96be"
msgid ""
"\"And local mosquitoes seem to have no idea they're drinking the blood of a "
"famous scientist, writer, and traveler!\""
msgstr "\"모기들이 유명한 과학자이자 작가인 여행가의 피를 빨아먹는 건 꿈에도 모르겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "20462762-8342-4277-9df5-fb58e89a30a7"
msgid "\"An interesting troupe we are...\""
msgstr "\"흥미롭군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cf7c5430-4198-4c6e-8c13-08324eec8ef8"
msgid ""
"\"If I saw us on a forest road, I'd grab my crossbow before someone yelled, "
"'Stand and deliver!'\""
msgstr "\"우리가 숲으로 간다면 누가 말하기도 전에 내 크로스보우를 집겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "82b3bff7-5599-4dcd-a46e-1baf0b818ad8"
msgid "\"The Stolen Lands are a most intriguing place!\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅은 흥미로운 곳이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "89ab74c9-a321-4af6-9b9a-deb04f8bc586"
msgid ""
"\"I think a delicately decorated 'Guide to the Stolen Lands' by Jubilost "
"Narthropple would sell quicker than sobering elixirs after a city festival.\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트께서 쓰진 도둑맞은 땅의 가이드는 도시 축제에서 술이 사라지는 것보다 빨리 팔릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "dddbfae6-a11a-4237-99ce-2cf47fa9cdef"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I feel like it's one big cemetery. There's ruin everywhere we "
"go. Forgotten hopes, buried in the ground. But then I look closer and I see "
"something different – a cradle of new beginnings and daring plans.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가끔 여기가 무덤이라고 생각해. 폐허가 사방에 있지. 희망은 묻혀졌고. 하지만 더 가까이 보면 나는 다른 것을 봐. 새로운 시작과 "
"목표의 요람인 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostJubilost/Banter_JubilostJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8e5d7382-bb51-4225-bb05-7d16c18ac91e"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I feel like it's one big cemetery. There's ruin everywhere we "
"go. Forgotten hopes, buried in the ground. But then I look closer and I see "
"something different – a cradle of new beginnings and daring plans.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가끔 여기가 무덤이라고 생각해. 폐허가 사방에 있지. 희망은 묻혀졌고. 하지만 더 가까이 보면 나는 다른 것을 봐. 새로운 시작과 "
"목표의 요람인 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKalikke/Banter_JubilostKalikke_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ad438fb4-b5d2-4453-b8db-fc1571873f59"
msgid ""
"\"I'm thinking about writing a series of essays about Qadira. It's such an "
"amazing place! An oasis at the border of two civilizations, you might say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카디라에 대한 이야기를 쓸까 생각하고 있어. 정말 놀라운 장소야! 두 문명이 만나는 오아시스와 같은 곳이라고 할 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKalikke/Banter_JubilostKalikke_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e2d9e363-37ec-426c-9444-9a3754dedf81"
msgid ""
"\"What region of Qadira would you like to write about, master Jubilost? Our "
"land is vast and diverse, and there are as many tribes living there as there "
"are in all the River Kingdoms.\""
msgstr "\"카디라의 어느 곳에 대해 쓰고 싶어? 우리의 땅은 넓어서 강의 왕국들처럼 많은 부족이 흩어져 살고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKalikke/Banter_JubilostKalikke_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c0bc3838-cd2d-4a6c-95cc-4424ce4e4df5"
msgid ""
"\"What region of Qadira would you like to write about, master Jubilost? Our "
"land is vast and diverse, and there are as many tribes living there as there "
"are in all the River Kingdoms.\""
msgstr "\"카디라의 어느 곳에 대해 쓰고 싶어? 우리의 땅은 넓어서 강의 왕국들처럼 많은 부족이 흩어져 살고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKalikke/Banter_JubilostKalikke_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "68b5d55e-6e7f-43a9-b30d-84adca0b79ee"
msgid ""
"\"Did I hear that correctly? You never saw snow until you came to the Stolen "
"Lands?\""
msgstr "\"내가 잘 들은 게 맞아? 도둑맞은 땅에 오기 전까지 눈을 못봤단 말이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKalikke/Banter_JubilostKalikke_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8b112437-62b7-4617-98b9-77636a446319"
msgid ""
"\"I did! In my homeland, hoarfrost forms on the stones after cold nights, "
"and wizards cast frost spells — not to mention my own elemental abilities... "
"But true winter and snowfall is something else!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래! 고향에서 밤에 서리가 얼거나 마법사들이 냉기 주문을 사용하는 건 봤어도... 진짜 겨울과 눈이 떨어지는 모습은 정말 대단해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKanerah/Banter_JubilostKanerah_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "661156cd-dbc4-44e2-8567-2c325a2b9276"
msgid ""
"\"We have an extra hour here at camp. How about a short interview for my "
"article on the Qadiran way of life?\""
msgstr "\"캠프에서 한시간 더 머물 수 있어. 카디라 사람들의 삶에 대해서 인터뷰를 하는 건 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKanerah/Banter_JubilostKanerah_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d8cb6a11-b41c-47c0-a7cb-9fd299eed85a"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! Will my name be mentioned in the title? And my portrait on the "
"front page?\""
msgstr "\"물론이지! 내 이름이 제목에 나오는 거야? 내 초상화도 나오고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKanerah/Banter_JubilostKanerah_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a8b07f3a-57ef-49f1-b41a-bd3641fa99a3"
msgid ""
"\"We certainly have much in common, but it saddens me that your interest in "
"map-making and discovery is purely materialistic. While I only care to serve "
"knowledge and science!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공통점이 많지만 지도를 만들고 발견하는 네 취미는 정말 대단해. 나는 지식과 과학을 숭배할 뿐이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostKanerah/Banter_JubilostKanerah_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b90e3674-c249-4b20-8c98-332cd3a34f1d"
msgid ""
"\"So what? Where would your science be without proper financing? You just "
"need a little ingenuity. Turn your gold into discoveries, and your "
"discoveries – into gold!\""
msgstr "\"그래서? 돈이 없으면 과학이 있을 수 있나? 머리를 좀 써봐. 발견에 돈을 쓰고 발견하면 또 돈이 되는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "01eda120-cb85-4fc6-9df5-65f833bcbbc0"
msgid ""
"\"I once met an old man named Ezren, he said he wanted to learn magic and be "
"a Pathfinder chronicler. At his age he should be considering retirement.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ezren이라는 나이든 남자를 만났는데 마법을 배우고 패스파인더 연대기 작가가 되고 싶다고 하더군. 은퇴할 나이가 되었는데도 말이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ce5846fd-311e-4f40-b454-147933a2631c"
msgid "\"I think it's commendable that he wants to try something new.\""
msgstr "\"새로운 걸 시도하려는 게 멋지구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7a4f6dd6-29e0-4cf3-83f8-6244d2cf859b"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Linzi, your writing aspirations are quite commendable. But the "
"way you're going about it... Without a proper academic education – you'll "
"never rise above writing cheap tales for peasants!\""
msgstr "\"린지. 네 글솜씨는 정말 멋져. 하지만 적절한 대학 교육 없이... 네 글은 농민들을 위한 싸구려 이야기가 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "051869e0-b2a8-4c8d-a16a-53cbba02b77b"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen this 'academic education' of yours. A pack of arrogant peacocks "
"trying to outshine each other with their highbrow talk. Hell no, I'd rather "
"write my tales than become a smug toad like those 'professors'!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 받은 대학 교육을 알아. 거만한 자들이 고상한 척하며 뽐내기 바쁘지. 나는 싫어. 나는 그 교수 같은 자들처럼 거만한 두꺼비가 "
"되느니 내 이야기를 쓰겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "af76f0f4-9e63-4392-a166-cbfe45b77fd1"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't have quit the Academy of Grand Arts, Linzi. You definitely "
"have a talent for writing, but talent is like an uncut diamond – worthless "
"without skill.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Academy of Grand Arts에서 도망치지 말았어야 했어. 너는 글쏨씨가 있지만 재능은 다듬어지지 않는 보석과 같지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3e463234-e5fa-4002-bb7f-edf957f38516"
msgid ""
"\"It wasn't me who quit the Academy. The Academy quit me. And I don't regret "
"it a single bit!\""
msgstr "\"아카데미를 그만둔 건 내가 아니야. 아카데미가 나를 쫓아냈지. 나는 후회되지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e31f71b5-2dfe-40ff-afd4-bd82847e72bd"
msgid ""
"\"It's not that I would mind you borrowing my ink and quills, Linzi... But "
"you could at least ask first!\""
msgstr "\"내 잉크와 펜을 마음대로 쓰라고 한 적 없는데... 물어봤어야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "65a72054-4b20-4537-9099-83610851c05c"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you were sleeping, and I didn't want to wake you. And I had such a "
"story in my head!.. I was so excited to write it down, and unfortunately I "
"ran out of paper, too…\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 자고 있어서 깨우고 싶지 않았어. 그리고 이야기가 떠오르려는 순간이었어! 너무 흥분해서 어서 쓰고 싶었지만 종이가 없었지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1777584f-a6fc-4c51-90bd-14d37408e700"
msgid ""
"\"I was thinking, Linzi... Maybe when our journey is over, I'll need, let's "
"say, a secretary. Someone smart who can write down my invaluable thoughts!\""
msgstr "\"생각해봤는데... 여행이 끝나면 나는 비서가 필요해. 내 생각들을 써줄 똑똑한 사람 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4591bd39-f8c5-4577-8bb2-7070bbd9e52a"
msgid ""
"\"You mean me? Oh, I don't know... Of course, you are a bastion of science, "
"master of the quill and so on, but I'm kind of used to writing whatever I "
"want.\""
msgstr "\"나보고 비서를 하라고? 모르겠어... 물론 너는 똑똑하지만 나는 내가 원하는 것을 쓰고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "84ab0bcc-2bfe-4858-8867-63e86daface4"
msgid ""
"\"It's great that at least someone in this party besides me understands the "
"power of words! Perhaps you will really amount to something in time, Linzi.\""
msgstr "\"이 일행에서 글의 힘을 믿는 사람이 있다는 게 정말 다행이야! 너는 잘될 거야. 린지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e9aa3498-d9c8-4b4a-9f1e-1fee05a2ac86"
msgid "\"You really think so? It's... That's very flattering. Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 생각해? 아첨처럼 들리는데... 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ba2161c1-6ad7-4d80-a42c-92e54e578b1b"
msgid ""
"\"Are you writing in your girl's diary again? And of course, I've no doubt "
"you'll picture me as this bilious bully, and an acid-tongued cynic?\""
msgstr "\"또 일기 쓰고 있어? 물론 나는 사악한 깡패에 독설을 쏟아붓는 사람으로 묘사했겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "750e93a4-7362-4d1b-8673-f0a85012c021"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. I wouldn't distort the truth on that score! And besides, you're "
"such a well-known figure! If I depicted you any differently, they'd all "
"notice right away!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지. 나는 사실은 왜곡하지 않아! 게다가 네 성격은 잘 알려져 있지! 너를 다르게 묘사한다면 그들이 알아챌 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9b0ea89e-1e6a-4ce4-9cc7-ed0b92187dd7"
msgid ""
"\"Your Academy might not be the best institution of learning, but you are so "
"greatly lacking in education. Trust me, a career in writing is impossible "
"without it.\""
msgstr "\"네가 다녔던 아카데미가 배우기 가장 좋은 장소가 아닐지라도 너는 교육이 필요해. 글쓰기 경력에서 학력은 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostLinzi/Banter_JubilostLinzi_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6da82fed-08f8-41d0-8202-193919fe6a3d"
msgid ""
"\"So your books are not a reflection of your own merit, but your teachers'? "
"How about that! I never expected such a confession from you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 당신의 책은 당신의 가치가 아니라 당신 스승의 가치가 반영된 건가요? 어떻게 그럴 수 있지! 이런 고백은 예상하지 못했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostNokNok/Banter_JubilostNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "98a8d387-8bc7-483a-af1d-922dbf1aee76"
msgid ""
"\"Somebody broke all my quills! Wait a second… hey, they were chewed! Nok-"
"Nok!\""
msgstr "\"누가 내 펜을 모두 부러뜨렸어! 잠깐만... 녹-녹! 내 펜을 씹지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostNokNok/Banter_JubilostNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "86c3aa97-ef3a-4387-9d06-e7d9b6dab8d3"
msgid "\"Wha? Where? Nok-Nok can't hear, Nok-Nok is very busy!\""
msgstr "\"응? 어디? 녹-녹 안들린다. 녹-녹 바쁘다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostNokNok/Banter_JubilostNokNok_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9a9e21cc-b809-486c-ab1f-4f397ee22315"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps you are not as useless as I first thought, Nok-Nok. If somebody "
"washed and leashed you, you would make an interesting specimen for a "
"gathering of scholars.\""
msgstr "\"너는 생각보다 쓸 만한 녀석이구나. 녹-녹. 누군가 너를 씻기고 목줄을 매어두면 학자들을 위한 좋은 표본이 되겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostNokNok/Banter_JubilostNokNok_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "10d99628-7957-4220-919b-e2fdb870603b"
msgid ""
"\"Jub-Jub with his big words again. Too long! Too hard! And about washing — "
"you go do it yourself. Soap makes you dead, tribe told me so!\""
msgstr "\"줍-줍이가 또 헛소리한다. 지겹다! 너무 어렵다! 너나 가서 씻어라. 비누 묻으면 죽는다고 우리 부족이 그랬다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4d8a81c0-676c-40f4-9d15-f8aacdfb405b"
msgid ""
"\"Curses! How did you get it into your head that I hate everyone?! I'm just "
"making sure everyone does everything right — for the sake of everyone else. "
"For our cause! And what do I get in return?\""
msgstr ""
"\"젠장! 어떻게 내가 싫어하는 모든 걸 머릿속에 넣을 수가 있지? 모두가 잘되기를 바라고 노력했는데. 하지만 내가 그 대가로 받는 건 "
"뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "05804af0-b443-4e49-9dd5-6d618dd803b5"
msgid ""
"\"Me, thinking that you hate everyone? Ha, what nonsense! I know full well "
"that you don't care one whit about anyone besides yourself. And you couldn't "
"care less about our cause — you just like to point out people's mistakes so "
"you can feel superior.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 모두를 싫어한다고 생각한다고? 말도 안 돼! 누가 옆에 있어도 너는 상관하지 않는 걸 잘 알아. 그리고 그건 노력이 아니야. "
"너는 그저 사람들의 실수를 지적하고 똑똑한 척하려는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f3259ef9-94ec-467d-93a9-6e0a77a1c06f"
msgid ""
"\"I once knew a woman who seemed infatuated with my esteemed personality. "
"Although she had the audacity to call me a \"worthy disciple of Irori\"! I "
"couldn't stand being with anyone that ignorant!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 인격에 반했던 여성을 알고 있지. 그녀는 나를 이로리의 충실한 제자라고 불렀지만 말이야! 나는 거만한 녀석과 있고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e96d3683-a944-43da-8216-831d87beb44b"
msgid ""
"\"Do you also make your lovers wear a bridle? Or is kissing your feet enough "
"for you?\""
msgstr "\"네가 사랑했던 사람에게 목줄을 걸었나? 아니면 발에 키스하게 두는 걸로 만족했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "88ec60fe-d7f2-4846-b0d0-525f7bffb203"
msgid ""
"\"But why? You might have helped her — taught her something. What's the "
"point of being knowledgeable if you won't share your knowledge with others?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 왜? 네가 그녀를 돕고 가르칠 수도 있었는데. 지식을 나누지 않을 거라면 똑똑한 게 무슨 소용이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "03814dc3-444d-41cf-8c47-86141608e9ef"
msgid ""
"\"A suitor once confused my favorite wine with one I detest. I threw him out "
"without another thought!\""
msgstr "\"내가 가장 좋아했던 와인을 맛 없다고 혼란스럽게 한 녀석을 말이지. 생각도 하지 않고 쫓아냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "48bad62e-2e59-45eb-bd3b-032d6b57a6ae"
msgid ""
"\"Stop interrupting me all the time! Of everyone in our party, I have the "
"most vast travel experience. I've been to such corners of the world – where "
"you wouldn't have survived even for a minute! So believe me when I say that "
"I know what will be better for all of us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 귀찮게 하지 마! 우리 동료들 중에서 내가 여행 경험이 가장 많아. 나는 세계 구석구석을 돌아다녔고 살아남기 어려운 곳에도 "
"가봤어! 그러니 내가 옳다고 하면 그런 줄 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "03ea296d-a4b9-4bf6-a473-f127ecd768d6"
msgid ""
"\"By 'all of us' you must mean you and the chorus of praise you must "
"constantly hear inside that thick skull of yours.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 잘난 척하는 이유는 네 머릿속에서 누군가 너에게 칭찬해줘서지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ecdddc84-9624-44d2-9216-b900ac9c4727"
msgid ""
"\"I concern myself tirelessly about our mission's success. I think three "
"steps ahead, just so that our expedition can reach its goal. And what do I "
"hear in return? Unprovoked insults!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 임무가 실패할까봐 계속 걱정돼. 세걸음만 더 걸어가면 우리의 여행은 목적지에 갈 수 있어. 하지만 그 보답으로 내가 듣는 건? "
"모욕뿐이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bb19dbfe-4a5f-4401-afe3-67a8906cc851"
msgid ""
"\"All you care about is your hide and your comfort, Jubi. You don't care "
"about anyone else. I've seen too many like you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 신경쓰는 건 너 자신뿐이야. 너는 다른 사람은 상관하지 않지. 너 같은 녀석은 너무 많이 봤어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "94160acb-ea88-46ec-989a-954d42e84ca1"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you what. We've organized our encampment completely wrong. Come "
"here all of you, I'll explain what we need to do...\""
msgstr "\"우리는 캠프를 완전히 잘못 설치했어. 너희 모두 이리로 와봐. 어떻게 해야 할지 알려줄게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dc5d6089-1783-4913-9611-c272d9a44a20"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, and maybe you should buy a drum so it will be easier for us to march "
"to your commands? Who do you think you are, scribbler? We're not your "
"students!\""
msgstr "\"북이라도 하나 사서 이래라 저래라 하면서 북을 치지 그래? 왜 그렇게 잘난 척하지? 우리는 너의 학생이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7724fcba-1f14-46ed-a070-aaf33bdea03c"
msgid "\"Hey! Careful with the spells! Keep your acid away from my writings!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 마법을 잘 사용하라고! 산성이 내 종이에 묻지 않게 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a7002234-0d1d-4d51-8ce8-8ac7f1be7321"
msgid ""
"\"Who cares about any of your piles besides you? Go ahead, waste your paper. "
"– Maybe it'll keep you quiet for a while!\""
msgstr "\"네가 쓴 종이들을 누가 신경이나 쓰겠어? 가서 그 종이들은 버려. 시끄러운 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3300136a-214f-410e-a4d1-eda972909011"
msgid ""
"\"Could you please tell me, out of pure interest, how life was structured "
"during your time with the Technic League?\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹에 있었을 때 너의 삶은 어땠는지 나에게 자세히 말해주지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eabb210c-31f6-4411-8f5e-2f29e1bd2cf9"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, you're interested? I won't just tell you – I'll show you! First I just "
"need to cut a nice, thick rod!\""
msgstr "\"관심 있어? 그냥 말해주지는 않을래. 우선 크고 단단한 가지를 하나 잘라야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "746e114e-688e-4161-9dc2-cec5c3c99eeb"
msgid ""
"\"Numeria is an incredible place. The fragments of the starship lying in its "
"depths generate the most amazing natural and social phenomena...\""
msgstr "\"누메리아는 놀라운 장소야. 먼 곳에서 비행선이 날아오는 걸 보면 정말 놀라운 장소라는 생각이 들어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostOctavia/Banter_JubilostOctavia_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fbc61009-5e94-4580-b510-e66c19a51a97"
msgid ""
"\"It must be great to wander Numeria when you're free and rich, and just "
"enjoy life. But when you're a fugitive without a coin in your pocket, all "
"you want to do is get away.\""
msgstr "\"자유롭고 돈도 많을 때 누메리아를 돌아다니면 좋을 거야. 하지만 돈도 없다면 좋지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_JubilostRegongar1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "40c44602-5397-482b-ba55-c99e2772fcd3"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem. I've... always wanted to draw the symbols that the Technic League "
"tattoo on their sorcerers! I even have money to pay anyone who would agree "
"to sit for me...\""
msgstr "\"에헴. 나는... 항상 기술 연맹 마법사들의 문신을 그리고 싶었어! 모델이 되어주면 돈이라도 줄 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_JubilostRegongar1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "184f8808-846b-4b27-86c6-ddb48b4a29fa"
msgid "\"Bite your tongue, gnome... while you still have teeth to bite with.\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 노움... 강냉이를 털어버리기 전에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "569d4368-1f9d-4f30-aa7d-f2fdb481f3cf"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, are your tattoos just decorations or do they mean something?\""
msgstr "\"네 문신은 그냥 장식이야? 아니면 의미가 있는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "63c96feb-1bb4-434d-be90-646b68a8420b"
msgid ""
"\"Uh huh! This one means a short annoying gnome... And this one shows the "
"place where he can get off, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"음! 정말 짜증나는 노움이네... 이 문신은 말이지. 네가 꺼지면 가야 할 곳이야! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8c96c96a-42f0-4681-83aa-d2864d7c543c"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, I wish I could pore over the Technic League's notes... They've done "
"so many experiments! They must have a trove of scientific data.\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹의 자료들을 보고 싶었는데... 그들은 많은 실험을 했지! 엄청나게 많은 자료가 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1ec20156-afef-46f8-8e68-0b11bf3b20c4"
msgid ""
"\"Experiments? You should try the experiments I had to go through, you "
"wouldn't hold up for an hour! But never mind. We'll meet those experimenters "
"again. And I'm gonna rip them to pieces with my bare hands! Slo-o-o-wly!\""
msgstr ""
"\"실험이라고? 내가 겪은 실험을 너도 겪었어야 했는데. 너라면 한시간도 견디지 못할걸! 상관 없어. 우리는 그 녀석들을 다시 만날 "
"거니까. 그 녀석들을 내 손으로 찢어죽일 거야! 아주 천천히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f02b9695-b49f-4183-bfdf-2779abb73157"
msgid ""
"\"I have to admit, the customs of Numerian nomads may seem horrible to us, "
"but they may be the only way to survive among other hostile peoples.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아의 유목민족 전통은 무시무시한 것 같지만 적대적인 사람들 사이에서 살아남는 유일한 방법이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8286146a-df71-4e8e-9aaa-23c775739320"
msgid ""
"\"I don't give a shit about their customs! Selling your children into "
"slavery is a nasty business, no matter what they're up against!\""
msgstr "\"그들의 전통은 상관 없어! 아이들을 노예로 팔아넘기는 건 무슨 이유가 있어도 더러운 짓이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b9c359d3-d46b-407a-a2e1-80d59d92dbdb"
msgid "\"So, how about a game of dice? A couple of rounds, hunh?\""
msgstr "\"주사위 놀이나 한번 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostRegongar/Banter_JubilostRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "90a8f318-b90a-43df-9e7b-5495577aa71e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no. You're a cheat! And until you teach me how you do your dirty "
"tricks, I'm not letting you clean out my purse.\""
msgstr "\"싫어. 너는 속임수를 쓸 거니까! 그 더러운 수작을 어떻게 부렸는지 알려주지 않으면 주사위 놀이는 하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0044af25-548b-470d-bb39-595fa0a014a6"
msgid ""
"\"There's a riddle inside of you, lad. I don't know what you're hiding, but "
"be sure of this: there's no secret in the world that Jubilost Narthropple "
"cannot reveal!\""
msgstr "\"네가 무얼 숨기고 있는지는 몰라도 이건 잘 알아둬. 주빌로스트님께서 밝히지 못할 비밀은 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "09a64dc9-e672-4511-bb4b-a5e0dc9e6332"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have anything to hide, Jubilost. I am who I am – a humble servant "
"of Sarenrae, and nothing more.\""
msgstr "\"나는 숨기는 게 없어. 나는 나고 서렌레이의 종일 뿐 그 무엇도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d47d00d5-e368-47b9-9099-1f9b1404d661"
msgid ""
"\"You're not from these lands, Tristian. Why don't you tell me about Kelesh? "
"I've always been interested in learning about this land.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이 땅 출신이 아니지, 트리스티안. 케레쉬 얘기를 해줄 수 있나? 항상 궁금했던 곳이거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "dafad019-b0d7-421e-9dd2-20f5c2543f20"
msgid ""
"\"Then why don't you go there yourself? I'm sure you'll be given a warm "
"welcome.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 직접 가보는 게 어때? 너는 환영받을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4f3afab3-f0fa-43b1-9786-de4e7b8a8ccc"
msgid ""
"\"I'm surprised by your kindness and naivety, Tristian. People rarely remain "
"untroubled enough to hold on to such gifts, as they come of age. The world "
"is cruel, you know...\""
msgstr "\"네 친절함과 순수함에 놀랐어. 사람들은 나이가 들면서 그런 면이 사라지지. 세상은 잔인하니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "970f02a3-bed9-4549-b3ff-c5e7218b8bdc"
msgid ""
"\"I guess I'm lucky then. The teachings of the goddess save her servants "
"from all kinds of trouble.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 나는 운이 좋은 것 같군. 여신의 가르침이 세상으로부터 나를 구원했으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3e0f52af-4638-4df5-a748-9eac109d0c3b"
msgid "\"Tristian, do you know what your problem is? You have no ambition!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 네 문제가 뭔지 알아? 너는 야망이 없다는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostTristian/Banter_JubilostTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "cf317e62-2caa-43ba-8ad3-0471ba1034cd"
msgid "\"Is that a problem? I have Sarenrae's mercy. That's all I need.\""
msgstr "\"그게 문제인가? 나는 서렌레이의 자비가 있어. 그거면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_JubilostValerie1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f265ef13-bc42-4ed0-8e75-3b6382f17470"
msgid ""
"\"If you want my opinion, you weren't wrong to tear up your suitor's poem. "
"Some verse deserves nothing better. — The same for their authors.\""
msgstr "\"내 의견을 원한다면 네 시를 찢어버릴 만큼 잘못한 게 없어. 어떤 문장들은 그대로 좋지. 작가에게 맞아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_JubilostValerie1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8c05bb08-6ad2-417c-81dc-457c6230abef"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't control myself, and control is essential for a fighter. But "
"still I do not regret what I did. My place was not with the worshipers of "
"Shelyn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 자신을 통제할 수 없고 통제는 싸움의 근원이야. 하지만 나는 내가 한 짓을 후회하지 않아. 내 장소는 셸린의 숭배자들과 함께하지 "
"않을 거니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "08dfb376-6289-4395-ae82-a49adad282f5"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Valerie, I don't think you should have abandoned the Order of "
"the Eternal Rose. Paladins of Shelyn value beauty over intellect. You would "
"belong there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리. 영원한 장미를 버리지 말았어야 했어. 셸린의 팔라딘들은 지식을 넘어 아름다움을 추구하지. 너는 나오지 말았어야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "64884951-6a23-4d04-8c1e-df0218d88f7b"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like your tone, gnome. I may not be as smart as you, but I can "
"tell a compliment from mockery.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 말투가 마음에 들지 않는군요. 당신처럼 똑똑하지는 않지만 칭찬과 비아냥은 구분할 줄 압니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5c8fbdf6-51ca-4a08-abfd-a90e345550e1"
msgid ""
"\"You're from a noble family. I don't understand why you didn't simply "
"return to your parents' castle, rather than wandering the forests, slaying "
"all manner of monsters.\""
msgstr "\"너는 귀족 출신이지. 왜 부모님의 성에 돌아가지 않고 숲을 돌아다니며 괴물들을 학살하는지 모르겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "598ef0d5-0416-40e5-8c36-71640594cb7e"
msgid ""
"\"It's hard to understand... Here in the Stolen Lands I can be what I am, "
"not who people want to see. Most simply want a beautiful façade, never "
"noticing the human behind it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해하기 어려우시겠습니다만... 여기 도둑맞은 땅에서는 나는 내 모습대로 있을 수 있고 다른 사람들이 원하는 모습으로 살지 않아도 "
"됩니다. 대부분은 사람 뒤에 있는 것이 아니라 아름다운 얼굴만 보거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e522111a-d728-4c7e-b434-f9eca3b56bbf"
msgid ""
"\"Paladins of Shelyn are taught to sing, draw, and play musical instruments. "
"Why don't you sing sometime when we camp?\""
msgstr "\"셸린의 팔라딘은 노래하고 악기를 다루는 법을 배우지. 가끔 캠프에서 노래 하나 불러보는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "55cf3ef4-f1a2-48bb-aaa8-6a6a4a8edc57"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care to. I've had enough of singing and playing music. It's a "
"useless waste of time. – I'd rather hone my sword or check over my armor "
"again. You can't fight off forest bandits with a song!\""
msgstr ""
"\"신경쓰지 않겠습니다. 노래하고 악기를 연주하는 건 이제 충분합니다. 시간 낭비입니다. 내 검이나 갑옷을 닦겠습니다. 노래로는 숲의 "
"산적과 싸울 수 없으니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c7158754-7032-49b9-9f05-08a7ab04d289"
msgid ""
"\"Usually I don't write poetry, but your beauty has inspired even me, to "
"write a little ode. Here it is, listen now...\""
msgstr "\"나는 시를 쓰는 법을 몰랐지만 네 아름다움은 나에게 영감을 불어넣고 시를 쓰게 만들어. 여기 내가 쓴 시를 들어봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/JubilostValerie/Banter_JubilostValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6cc29aa9-1d8a-4ea3-a513-b91d793109dd"
msgid ""
"\"If you're trying to play a joke on me, I'm afraid it's gone lame. You'd "
"better put away your ode before you make me angry. – And if you're "
"serious... Well, my advice is the same.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 가지고 놀려는 거라면 너무 서투르군요. 나를 화나게 하기 전에 시는 집어치우시는 게 낫겠습니다. 그리고 당신이 진지하다면... "
"내 충고는 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeJubilost/Banter_KalikkeJubilost_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a5f17b8c-bec9-48c5-b040-45839726b402"
msgid ""
"\"I see such audacity and nobility in your desire to save your people from "
"Bleaching, master Jubilost. I must say, I admire you.\""
msgstr "\"백화로부터 노움들을 구하려는 네 열망에서 고귀함을 느꼈어. 네가 정말 존경스러워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeJubilost/Banter_KalikkeJubilost_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "89620617-282c-4ee7-b640-bca33f3e0ad0"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem, ahem, hmmm — you make me blush, young lady. Truth be told, I've "
"never shied away from ambitious tasks. So long as I draw breath, I'll keep "
"looking for a solution!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에헴. 에헴. 흠... 나를 부끄럽게 하는군. 어린 아가씨. 사실 나는 열망으로부터 한시도 벗어난 적이 없어. 말한 김에 백화를 "
"해결하는 방법을 찾아봐야겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeJubilost/Banter_KalikkeJubilost_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "789a3b93-9d22-4438-8dac-322f5204d33d"
msgid ""
"\"So you wish to explore the First World, master Jubilost? I'm worried about "
"you. I've heard many tales of wanderers who traveled to the lands of the "
"fey, never to return…\""
msgstr "\"퍼스트 월드를 여행하고 싶다고? 걱정되는데. 페이의 땅을 여행한 많은 사람들이 가서는 돌아오지 못했다고 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeJubilost/Banter_KalikkeJubilost_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "48ee0461-3af6-4af5-bd44-7d56a272015b"
msgid ""
"\"One might perish anywhere. Better by far to die under the ever-changing "
"skies of the First World, than in a cozy bed surrounded by notaries, and "
"heirs with mournful faces!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 실종되는 거야 언제든지 그럴 수 있지. 상속을 바라는 후손들의 슬퍼하는 얼굴을 보며 죽을 바에는 퍼스트 월드의 무수히 변하는 "
"하늘 아래에서 죽고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeKalikke/Banter_KalikkeKalikke_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "52f349b0-cd7b-4430-866d-e8dc42abc276"
msgid ""
"\"Share, share the warmth of the fire,\n"
"Share, share the song of your soul.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가까이 와서 몸 좀 녹여.\n"
"가까이 와서 영혼의 노래를 불러봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeKalikke/Banter_KalikkeKalikke_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8a1d4b2e-892b-4916-a845-33365457eaff"
msgid ""
"\"Those are the treasures you can trust,\n"
"But hide them away — and turn to dust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿을 수 없는 그 보물들은\n"
"사라져서 먼지가 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeKalikke/Banter_KalikkeKalikke_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a5572170-eb6f-4457-bb21-87ca239c8fe4"
msgid ""
"\"Merry winds of the southern lands,\n"
"Come and take me by the hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"남쪽 땅의 바람을 맞으며\n"
"와서 내 손을 잡아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeKalikke/Banter_KalikkeKalikke_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3a2a4669-977e-4895-b33d-6f7a25a34ea6"
msgid ""
"\"In your whispers, in your song\n"
"I hear the echoes of long lost home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 전에 잃어버린 고향의 메아리가\n"
"귓속말과 노래에 들리네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeLinzi/Banter_KalikkeLinzi_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8e8b4933-eb84-40a8-8c80-10aebab82dcd"
msgid "\"I'm dying to know how I come out in your book...\""
msgstr "\"네 책에 내가 어떤 모습으로 나오는지 알고 싶어 죽겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeLinzi/Banter_KalikkeLinzi_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "057538c9-ff68-47b1-9c52-de65b35771c2"
msgid ""
"\"You know... You're so mysterious! And controversial! It's almost like I'm "
"writing two different characters, not one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 너는 신비로운 면이 있잖아! 그래서 논란의 소지도 있고! 너를 묘사할 때면 서로 다른 사람 둘을 묘사하는 것 같다니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeLinzi/Banter_KalikkeLinzi_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "237958cc-c9be-45ae-9d7d-2ac90f922b02"
msgid "\"Right! Who tied a bell to my tail while I was asleep?!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 내가 잘 때 내 꼬리에 방울을 묶은 게 누구였더라?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeLinzi/Banter_KalikkeLinzi_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "83f1eec2-da04-4c70-b190-94e536238dac"
msgid "\"Ha-ha, tee-hee-hee, wah-ha-ha-hm! ... It wasn't me!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 후후후! 헤헤헤! 흠! ... 그건 내가 아니었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "29209640-11c1-4c8e-83e1-9a8ca55bff8f"
msgid ""
"\"What branch of Sarenrae's followers did your temple belong to, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"네가 있던 서렌레이의 사원은 무슨 파였어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2e40be15-d809-4d83-ab6b-bad588339a37"
msgid ""
"\"My temple was far away from others, and didn't belong to any factions — if "
"that's what you mean.\""
msgstr "\"우리 사원은 외딴 곳에 있어서 어느 파벌에도 속하지 않았어. 이걸로 대답이 되었을까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ffea669d-882c-4361-84e6-dc0cfd3626fa"
msgid ""
"\"...You are the first keleshite I've met who doesn't know how to haggle...\""
msgstr "\"...흥정할 줄 모르는 켈레쉬인은 네가 처음이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7f46ff8b-e00f-4f78-a346-987e75de54bb"
msgid ""
"\"I never like crossing words with anyone. Trying to argue over prices is "
"like telling the merchant that you think they're being dishonest. And I "
"believe in the goodness in people.\""
msgstr "\"나는 말다툼을 좋아하지 않거든. 흥정은 상인을 정직하지 않은 사람으로 몰아가는 행위잖아. 나는 인간의 선함을 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9b6e99f4-8a2e-4285-b68e-748ecee5f724"
msgid ""
"\"I used to think there were only fanatics, liars and hypocrites among "
"Sarenrae's mortal followers. Now I know that even her celestial servants are "
"cowards and traitors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 서렌레이 추종자는 죄다 광신도에, 거짓말쟁이에, 위선자라고 생각했어. 알고 보니 서렌레이의 천사도 겁쟁이에 배신자네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "175372e0-e414-46e6-a7dd-efed000fd680"
msgid ""
"\"You are right to judge me, and I deserve these words. But don't judge all "
"my companions and all my faith by my own failings.\""
msgstr "\"네게도 나를 평가할 권리가 있겠지. 난 그런 말을 들을 만해. 다만 내 친구들과 신앙심은 끌어들이지 말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b44f97ef-fcd4-4c50-9262-a51d1d8e3341"
msgid ""
"\"I may say harsh words about your faith, but I don't want to be unfair, "
"Tristian. You are a skilled healer.\""
msgstr "\"네 독실한 신앙심이 마음에 들지 않아도 인정할 건 인정해야겠지, 트리스티안. 너는 능숙한 치료사야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f0f86787-7322-497a-a30c-5ff7525099fe"
msgid ""
"\"I don't hold it against you. There are wounds on your soul that still "
"bleed.\""
msgstr "\"네가 나쁜 사람이라고 생각하지 않아. 아직 아물지 않은 마음의 상처가 있는 거겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9ce47fc3-1b36-460e-9db1-27c42ab5b867"
msgid ""
"\"Life seemed so simple just a few years ago. Be kind to your loved ones, "
"listen to your heart, never leave the golden path — and everything will be "
"fine. Then I learned that good intentions can lead to disaster...\""
msgstr ""
"\"불과 몇 년 전까지만 해도 삶은 단순했어. 사랑하는 사람에게 잘하고, 마음의 소리에 귀 기울이고, 믿음의 길에서 벗어나지 않으면 다 "
"잘될 줄 알았지. 그러다 알게 됐어. 아무리 선한 의도라도 끔찍한 결과를 낳을 수 있다는 걸...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KalikkeTristian/Banter_KalikkeTristian_dlc1_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1ba28563-8041-4f4b-9b05-bc00136f2022"
msgid ""
"\"It's never too late to learn... although the lessons we take from life are "
"often bitter.\""
msgstr "\"삶이 쓰라린 교훈을 안겨주더라도... 배우기에 늦은 때는 없는 법이지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f4a20982-c61b-4b0b-8ef8-a3886413900a"
msgid ""
"\"Most honorable Jubilost, do you mind letting me see your maps? Yesterday I "
"looked over your shoulder in passing, and I noticed a place for a possible "
"new caravan route!\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트, 네 지도를 봐도 될까? 어제 네 어깨 너머로 봤는데 새로운 여행길을 만들 수 있을 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2a876ceb-fa16-4ab6-a75c-1402b173c657"
msgid "\"Ahem, ahem, of course, take them! Finally someone with eyes to see!\""
msgstr "\"에헴. 에헴. 좋아. 가져가! 드디어 눈높이가 맞는 사람을 만났군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "89578083-a93e-4f0d-8120-a04ce1db040e"
msgid ""
"\"I am curious, master Jubilost, how you decided to start making a map of "
"the Stolen Lands — and at such a perfect time? A little-known region, but "
"one ready for intensive development... And whoever makes a good map first, "
"writes his name in history!\""
msgstr ""
"\"궁금한 게 있어. 어쩌다 이렇게 완벽한 때에 도둑맞은 땅의 지도를 제작할 결심을 하게 된 거야? 잘 알려지지 않은 지역이지만, 금방 "
"발전할 수 있는 환경이고, 처음 지도를 제작하는 사람은 역사에 이름이 남을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6afaccfc-80bf-4c76-ad85-8acd7d39c313"
msgid ""
"\"It was a scientist's intuition, young lady. To judge correctly where to "
"invest your talent and resources is a very serious task!\""
msgstr "\"과학자의 직감이지. 주어진 시간과 재능을 어디에 투자할지는 매우 중요한 문제거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c554cd42-a12e-4354-a366-4b12f51505a6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know what to think about all the troubles in the Stolen Lands. On "
"one hand, they open exciting opportunities for us. But all this chaos is "
"killing me. Sometimes literally…\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑맞은 땅에 어떤 인상을 받아야 할지 모르겠어. 흥미로운 기회도 있지만, 대체 앞날이 어떻게 되려나 생각하면 머리가 복잡해 "
"죽겠다니까. 진짜로 죽을지도 모르고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "425181fe-d3b6-4164-b58b-b34ff89adcaa"
msgid ""
"\"I's the price we pay for being the pioneers on the frontier of "
"civilization. There are many things here that threaten our lives. Monsters, "
"bandits… and don't forget the damned mosquitoes!\""
msgstr "\"문명의 선구자가 되는 대가지. 최전방에서 목숨이 위험한 건 당연한 거야. 괴물과 도적이 우글우글하지... 망할 모기도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "05fee613-a1f1-4595-8d0b-d41a595833cb"
msgid ""
"\"Does anybody really understand what Jamandi is fighting for? We've heard "
"many fine words about freedom and independence from Brevoy, but what does "
"she truly hope to gain?\""
msgstr "\"자만디의 진의가 뭘까? 브레보이의 자유와 독립을 지지한다고 하지만, 그 과정에서 정말 얻고 싶은 게 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahJubilost/Banter_KanerahJubilost_dlc1_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "86f92c9b-bad0-48ec-a730-c949396cb4b5"
msgid ""
"\"Not being the puppet of dear Natala Surtova. And protecting her mighty "
"swordlord pride!\""
msgstr "\"나탈라 서토바의 꼭두각시가 되기 싫은 거 아니겠어. 소드로드의 자존심도 지키고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahKanerah/Banter_KanerahKanerah_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c3e9e038-9ac2-40cb-96f3-05bbb6f1e5f5"
msgid ""
"\"I made some valuable acquaintances at the reception in Restov. Maegar Varn "
"I remember well. Truly a lion of a man!\""
msgstr "\"레스토프의 연회에서 대단한 사람들을 만났어. 메이가르 반은 잊을 수 없어. 사자 같은 사람이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahKanerah/Banter_KanerahKanerah_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "bb14de18-f431-4b15-9f09-f9d0a6f3dd6f"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, he doesn't hold a candle to our own leader. Intuition tells me "
"he will rise no higher than a provincial baron. But he has his charms!\""
msgstr "\"뭐, 우리에게 도움이 될 것 같진 않아. 시골 영주 이상의 재목은 아냐. 그래도 매력은 있더라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahLinzi/Banter_KanerahLinzi_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "864440dd-c784-4d65-a35e-acab3a0eb10a"
msgid "\"I'm dying to know how I come out in your book...\""
msgstr "\"네 책에 내가 어떤 모습으로 나오는지 보고 싶어 죽겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahLinzi/Banter_KanerahLinzi_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3a31409e-48ed-43c7-ae8c-b54b03ee1935"
msgid ""
"\"You know... You're so mysterious! And controversial! It's almost like I'm "
"writing two different characters, not one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알잖아... 넌 신비스러운 구석이 있어! 논란의 여지가 있달까! 분명 한 사람인데 서로 다른 두 인물을 묘사하는 것 같거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahLinzi/Banter_KanerahLinzi_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a4b948b9-e5d4-42ad-b425-8f274ed3fbca"
msgid "\"Right! Who tied a bell to my tail while I was asleep?!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 내가 잘 때 내 꼬리에 방울을 묶은 게 누구였더라?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahLinzi/Banter_KanerahLinzi_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1d20aebf-ad7c-4446-b874-84b50c30d529"
msgid "\"Ha-ha, tee-hee-hee, wah-ha-ha-hm! ... It wasn't me!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 후후후! 헤헤헤! 흠! ... 그건 내가 아니었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahLinzi/Banter_KanerahLinzi_dlc1_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e22e4004-7adb-4100-804e-37257f787f40"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so happy I dropped by Lady Jamandi's that evening. We had some fun, "
"burnt a few assassins, and made a valuable acquaintance...\""
msgstr "\"그날 저녁 자만디를 방문해서 정말 행복했어. 재미도 있었고 암살자도 불태우고 흥미로운 사람도 만나고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahLinzi/Banter_KanerahLinzi_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9acd82ce-8754-475a-900a-ccf6669460f0"
msgid ""
"\"What are you so happy about? It's true, we might not have met otherwise, "
"but a lot of people died that night!\""
msgstr "\"행복했다고? 물론 그런 일이 없었더라면 우리가 만나지 못했겠지만, 그래도 사람들이 죽었잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8fff111d-e2d8-4e7d-8419-9a5eb657cf72"
msgid ""
"\"What branch of Sarenrae's followers did your temple belong to, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"네가 있던 서렌레이 사원은 어느 파에 속했어, 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d0c06dbe-3df9-45a6-96bf-24bce20a00ce"
msgid ""
"\"My temple was far away from others, and didn't belong to any factions — if "
"that's what you mean.\""
msgstr "\"네가 묻고 싶은 게 그거라면 내 사원은 다른 사원과 먼 곳에 있어서 정치질을 하지 않았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c3ed19bd-e169-48ec-8655-3abcc6e5e908"
msgid ""
"\"...You are the first keleshite I've met who doesn't know how to haggle...\""
msgstr "\"... 내가 만난 사람들 중 흥정을 할 줄 모르는 켈레쉬 사람은 네가 처음이야....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "efa0323e-196b-43c5-b51f-f4c9d2e0bfa7"
msgid ""
"\"I never like crossing words with anyone. Trying to argue over prices is "
"like telling the merchant that you think they're being dishonest. And I "
"believe in the goodness in people.\""
msgstr "\"가격을 흥정하는 건 상인에게 자신은 부정직하다고 말하는 것과 같지. 그리고 나는 사람들의 선함을 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ce549d35-e094-4c71-a31b-8e1368f18659"
msgid ""
"\"I used to think there were only fanatics, liars and hypocrites among "
"Sarenrae's mortal followers. Now I know that even her celestial servants are "
"cowards and traitors.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 필멸자 추종자들은 광신도에 거짓말쟁이에 위선자들이지. 그녀의 천사도 겁쟁이에 배신자일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2ac6cedc-7fd4-4e1b-96ec-6d3aea948ca7"
msgid ""
"\"You are right to judge me, and I deserve these words. But don't judge all "
"my companions and all my faith by my own failings.\""
msgstr "\"나를 판단해도 상관 없고 네 말도 받아들일게. 하지만 내 동료와 내 믿음을 판단하지는 말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f63365eb-dff0-42d9-aa0e-a7af7f038e72"
msgid ""
"\"Kindness, mercy… Do you know why I despise these things? Because you can "
"never rely on them. Rules and contracts are much better — you know what to "
"expect and you can act accordingly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"친절과 자비... 왜 내가 이것들이 싫은지 알아? 그것들에 의존할 수는 없기 때문이지. 규칙과 계약이 더 나아. 예상 가능하고 규칙에 "
"따라 행동할 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/KanerahTristian/Banter_KanerahTristian_dlc1_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0798e45b-9421-4098-b343-051da1110f40"
msgid ""
"\"You'd like a list of rules and conditions defining mercy? I'm afraid it's "
"not how it works…\""
msgstr "\"규칙과 계약이 좋아? 소용이 없을 것 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a445ffa5-5a28-4fff-ade9-8c7aadc62ca1"
msgid ""
"\"You fight well! Almost as good as Guy Shaseur De Lombair, a hero I've read "
"about. But you lack his style, his dignity. Could you make an epic pose once "
"you have dispatched your wicked opponent? I think that would go a long way "
"to help our group's fame!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너 싸움 잘하는구나! 책에 나오는 기 샤제흐 드 롬배흐만큼 잘하는 것 같아. 멋은 좀 부족하지만. 적을 무찌르고 나서 멋진 포즈를 "
"취하면 어떨까? 우리 명성을 높이는 데 도움될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5919e2f2-9d8b-4aee-8be3-14cde75b4791"
msgid ""
"\"How about I do the killing, and you do the singing and dreaming? And save "
"the speeches for Tristian, I have no interest in your books.\""
msgstr "\"싸움은 내가 알아서 할 테니, 너는 노래하고 몽상이나 하지 그래? 트리스티안은 들어줄 거야. 나는 네 책에 흥미 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_LinziAmiri1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ac82ef6c-a1f6-4b9d-91c9-fa42019c9105"
msgid ""
"\"So, here's what we got so far: 'Today Amiri killed ten kobolds, a troll, a "
"hodag, and more goblins than the fingers on two hands can count!' You "
"know... I don't think our readers are going to believe all this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 오늘은 아미리가 코볼트 열마리와 트롤 한마리 호닥 한마리 그리고 양손가락 개수보다 많은 수의 고블린을 죽였다! 우리의 독자들은 "
"믿지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_LinziAmiri1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "51a71688-dc48-4211-b332-bd791eb46632"
msgid ""
"\"But it's the truth! I could cut them all down easy. We just need to find "
"them!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 사실이라고! 나는 그 녀석들은 쉽게 물리칠 수 있어. 일단 찾기만 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b93f4058-0d3a-4ae0-9ad2-6c7840f60d24"
msgid ""
"\"I heard that in a far away tribe people entertain themselves by throwing "
"huge logs. Whoever throws it the farthest is the strongest.\""
msgstr "\"먼 곳의 부족은 거대한 통나무를 던지며 놀았다고 하던데. 가장 멀리 던지는 사람이 가장 힘이 센 거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4ffba10e-306e-4e5b-ba39-42755ba1f0bf"
msgid ""
"\"Throwing logs? Ha! What weaklings. The Mammoth Lords lift mammoths! I used "
"to lift two at once!\""
msgstr "\"통나무를 던져? 하! 약골들이군. 매머드 군주는 매머드를 들 수 있다고! 나는 한번에 두마리를 들어봤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8bfff3ac-b488-4070-94e7-f284576f21e7"
msgid "\"Amiri, have you ever tried to count how many enemies you've killed?\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 네가 죽인 적의 수를 세어 봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d5b8aee5-55f5-4f66-9bcb-e1564088a0d7"
msgid ""
"\"A lot! There aren't even such high numbers! If someone wanted to count "
"that high, they'd have to start making up new numbers a long time ago!\""
msgstr "\"많이 세어봤지! 엄청나게 많아! 누군가 그 수를 세어보라고 하면 세다가 잊어버릴걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "53cbd3ef-05d5-4795-bd2e-24ee8cb4a7fd"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder, do Mammoth Lords have their own writing system? They must have "
"much to tell...\""
msgstr "\"매머드 군주는 글자를 쓸 수 있어? 할 말이 많을 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3133b9e1-6b66-4138-9619-b74b1d616357"
msgid ""
"\"The legends of my people are passed from generation to generation. If "
"someone doesn't get into a legend – then he's a weakling and there's nothing "
"to talk about.\""
msgstr "\"우리 부족의 전설은 세대를 거쳐 이어져왔지. 전설을 듣지 못하는 녀석은 약골이라서 얘기를 해주지 않은 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4b7dff8e-db01-4475-8653-f889fe5a2376"
msgid "\"Hey, Amiri, what are you thinking about?\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 무슨 생각하고 있어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAmiri/Banter_LinziAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "abc8d87f-4f9a-4095-a7af-a0339c703aaf"
msgid ""
"\"Gr-r-r... I'm thinking, if you tear off a halfling's legs, would she be a "
"quarterling?\""
msgstr "\"그르르... 네가 4등신이 아닐까하고 생각하고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAngel/Banter_LinziAngel_LinziTristian1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8144b45b-6c7b-4c72-93e6-38783f4f1856"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, do you have some horrible secret? Maybe you like to drink, or you "
"used to be an inveterate gambler. It's just that when I'm writing about you, "
"you just come out... flat. It's unnatural.\""
msgstr "\"너 끔찍한 비밀 있어? 네가 술을 좋아한다거나 도박 중독이라거나. 너에 대해 쓰려고 하니... 할 얘기가 없어서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziAngel/Banter_LinziAngel_LinziTristian1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "baf9620f-79b4-4bdc-82be-1804ef7ced5e"
msgid "\"I... truth be told, I don't really understand what you mean.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 솔직히 네가 무슨 말을 하는지 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Archknights1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0cf550b0-923d-427c-9669-15a7bfa7344c"
msgid ""
"\"Guy Shaseur De Lombair was a woodsman not unlike you. However, he favored "
"dual elven curve blades instead of the bow. Beloq-Nur was his fellow "
"Archknight, and he was an expert marksmen. It is said that he could shoot "
"the wings off a stirge at a hundred meters...\""
msgstr ""
"\"샤제흐 드 롬배흐라는 나무꾼이 있었어. 그는 활 대신에 엘프 곡도 두 자루를 사용했지. 벨록 누어는 아크나이트의 동료였는데 "
"명사수였어. 백미터 바깥에서 날아가는 새의 날개를 맞출 수 있었다는군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Archknights1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f0a1af8b-52cc-4223-bff8-0599c7d28550"
msgid ""
"\"Minotaur shit... Even if he was that good with a bow, why not just kill "
"the stirge?\""
msgstr "\"활을 잘 쓰면서 왜 새 같은 걸 맞추지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5f6851b6-e1ba-46cb-9932-92991fd72120"
msgid ""
"\"The way you finished off those trolls was spectacular! You really have "
"what it takes to be a hero just like in the stories. I feel like we are "
"making a difference, just like Guy and the Archknights of Avistan. You sort "
"of remind me of him a little...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 트롤을 죽일 때 멋졌어! 이야기 속의 영웅의 모습과 같았지. 우리는 아비스탄의 아크나이트들처럼 새로운 이야기를 쓸 수 있을 "
"거야. 너를 볼 때 그들이 떠올라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b73a8fb6-b75a-4b9e-986c-bf7a104a01ab"
msgid ""
"\"I did what I had to. They broke the law and now they have paid the price. "
"Here in this wild land, it is as close to justice as we are likely to see. "
"And that is fine by me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 해야 할 일을 했을 뿐이야. 그들은 무법자이니 대가를 치른 거야. 이 땅에서 정의는 우리가 바라는 만큼 실현돼. 하지만 나는 "
"그걸로 족해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "93bbfe02-dd72-45ea-8923-9c8aaa39adc8"
msgid ""
"\"Are you from Thuvia? Is it nice there? What's the culture like? Do you "
"have good food? Special ceremonies? Is it far? Do you have any exotic "
"animals? Any interesting stories?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 쑤비아 출신이야? 거기는 살기 좋아? 거기 문화는 어때? 음식은 맛있어? 특별한 의식은? 멀어? 신기한 동물은? 재밌는 이야기 "
"있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b1152953-970a-4b16-a5e4-3174169e54e1"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_LinziEkun1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c8d5b892-0169-4e68-b392-0f405887401a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Ekun! I still remember that elk you downed for us. I love it when you "
"hunt — you always bring back something delicious!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤! 아직도 네가 잡은 엘크가 기억나. 네가 사냥할 때 좋더라. 너는 항상 맛있는 고기를 가져오잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_LinziEkun1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7972e6a4-427e-4b1d-8823-456649e453b0"
msgid "\"I... mmm... hmmm... hm. Thank you?\""
msgstr "\"나는... 음.... ... 흠. 고맙군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3049ce6e-522f-4bdb-85af-31eb27318081"
msgid "\"Ekun, do you really have nothing left in your soul but revenge?\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 네 영혼에는 복수 말고 없는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "77ccd32b-c308-4c7a-b854-ad2f1d32e585"
msgid "\"It's enough. I don't want anything else.\""
msgstr "\"복수로 충분하다. 다른 건 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8ebcd1ef-2759-4ed1-b155-4856831d45fd"
msgid ""
"\"Ekun, I meant to say... I'm truly sorry all this happened to your family. "
"But life isn't over!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 네 가족에게 일어난 일은 정말 유감이야. 하지만 네 인생은 끝나지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "475ae72a-0028-4d4e-a8c5-d3f1a5d3fd73"
msgid ""
"\"For that Ekun it is. He died that night. The man you're talking to now is "
"a different man. The old Ekun wouldn't even recognize him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가족과 사는 에쿤의 인생은 끝이다. 그 날 밤 에쿤은 죽었다. 네가 말하고 있는 자는 다른 사람이지. 예전의 에쿤은 지금의 모습을 "
"알아보지 못할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ff17a85d-921d-4771-9ef6-b1f5f7594973"
msgid "\"Ekun, the village you lived in... Tell me what it was like!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 네가 살던 마을... 어땠는지 말해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c69190cf-6944-4771-90f9-3a08b224950d"
msgid ""
"\"It was good. Honest people, good food, clean sky... Everything a person "
"needs. You can write that down.\""
msgstr "\"살기 좋았다. 사람들도 착하고 음식도 맛있고 하늘도 깨끗하고... 필요한 건 다 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ae1d392c-19f7-4ecb-91b4-53ea23fe436f"
msgid ""
"\"You're so sullen, quiet... Readers like mysterious characters like you!\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 심술 궃고 말이 없어... 너 같이 미스터리한 캐릭터를 독자들은 좋아할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f0505e9f-b0f4-4722-aa28-6069a00c8b28"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not a character. Not a hero from legend. I just want everything to be "
"over.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 전설의 영웅이 아니다. 나는 그저 복수를 끝내고 싶어하는 사람이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ef5b7a5d-e5a5-4b07-84ef-1bfbc456d475"
msgid "\"You shoot so well! Tell me, what's your secret?\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 활을 잘 쏘는구나! 비결이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "41b13527-0961-4dca-8276-806da3a01cd1"
msgid "\"I take the bow, draw the string, aim. Shoot. No secret.\""
msgstr "\"활을 집고 줄을 당기고 조준한다. 그리고 쏜다. 비밀은 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8eab1f62-5082-44da-b61e-2e9ed40d87bd"
msgid "\"Can I feed your dog? He's so sweet!\""
msgstr "\"네 강아지에게 먹이 줘도 돼? 정말 귀여워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9cfa66e9-1964-43d4-9aa7-3afa7c40cfb1"
msgid ""
"\"He's a wolf, not a dog. And he feeds himself. It's how we do things.\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석은 개가 아니라 늑대다. 먹이는 스스로 구하지. 우리는 그렇게 산다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "339bd12c-3152-4124-a8ae-0777addff40f"
msgid ""
"\"How did you get so good at reading tracks? It's like the ground talks to "
"you! What do you look for? Is it some kind of magic?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 추적을 그렇게 잘해? 마치 땅과 대화하는 것 같아! 추적은 어떻게 해? 마법 같은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8c563afa-a905-4e76-ac71-46e65ebff810"
msgid ""
"\"I look at the ground and everything is clear. Look more and ask less. – "
"Then you'll understand.\""
msgstr "\"땅을 보면 모든 것이 명확하다. 질문은 하지 말고 관찰을 하는 것이지. 그러면 알게 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b719ba8e-303f-443a-b858-9ba9b5a2dd87"
msgid "\"Ekun, you're from Absalom, right? Why do you have an accent?\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 너는 압살롬 출신이지? 왜 사투리를 써?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f8e77932-47bd-453d-b0a2-7a30bfdc68a1"
msgid ""
"\"My homeland is Thuvia. My native language is Osiriani. I moved to Absalom "
"long after I learned how to speak.\""
msgstr "\"내 고향은 쑤비아. 내 모국어는 오시리온어지. 나는 말하는 법을 배우고 압살롬으로 갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_9_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d576c10e-f8f4-4b83-a31d-26f54bf2efeb"
msgid ""
"\"Will you tell me a story from your travels? I'd love to write it down!\""
msgstr "\"네 여행에 관한 이야기를 해주면 안 돼? 이야기에 쓰고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_9_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "58d75715-72e7-4670-b872-c59b6cc09342"
msgid ""
"\"You make a lot of noise. You're liable to draw predators or monsters. "
"Let's save our stories for later, when we are somewhere safe.\""
msgstr "\"너 정말 시끄럽다. 너 때문에 괴물이 듣고 올 거 같아. 이야기는 안전한 곳에서 써야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_9_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e6615e24-4509-4deb-ae42-3426bb574d53"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not such an experienced traveler. There are well-trodden caravan roads "
"from Qadira to Brevoy, and I just followed them, staying here and there "
"along the way.\""
msgstr "\"나는 경험이 많은 여행자는 아니야. 카디라에서 브레보이로 가는 길은 잘 닦여있었고 나는 그저 길을 따라갔으면 되었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziEkun/Banter_LinziEkun_Pack2_9_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "75d95a80-5519-40b2-aeea-a700b1bda7d8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not such an experienced traveler. There are well-trodden caravan roads "
"from Qadira to Brevoy, and I just followed them, staying here and there "
"along the way.\""
msgstr "\"나는 경험이 많은 여행자는 아니야. 카디라에서 브레보이로 가는 길은 잘 닦여있었고 나는 그저 길을 따라갔으면 되었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7d0cac30-10de-4be0-8db3-5ad93189661b"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, do you really prefer to feel insignificant? Like your whole life "
"is useless?\""
msgstr "\"하림. 그냥 그렇게 시무룩하게 있는 게 좋아? 네 쓸모 없는 인생처럼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f5b26917-6aee-4892-97d9-6b3742295a9e"
msgid ""
"\"Do I like it? Hmm-m-m... Does it matter? All that matters is that this is "
"the truth, little storyteller. I came to learn the truth, I humbly accepted "
"it, and now I share it with others. Yet you keep consoling yourself with "
"shallow tales of hope!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 가만히 있는 걸 좋아하냐고? 흠... 그게 상관이 있나? 중요한 건 진실이지. 나는 진실을 겸허하게 배웠고 그것을 동료들과 "
"나누는 거야. 하지만 너는 쓸데 없는 이야기나 쓰고 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3b8614bb-6e1b-4477-923e-c83db670469d"
msgid ""
"\"Who's so sullen there, like a troll after starving for three days? Ha! – "
"It's grumpy old Harrim!\""
msgstr "\"한 사흘은 굶은 트롤 같이 까칠하구나! 늙은 드워프 주제에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1b5bff22-de35-487e-a403-53922a059808"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, Linzi... Someone in this party of dreamers and make-believers must "
"be mindful of the eternal.\""
msgstr "\"... 기도를 하는 누군가는 심술 궂을 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "35b94aa1-9480-444a-8111-e35292be9bc0"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Harrim… I don't think your Groetus cares about his congregation. "
"What's the point in worshipping him?\""
msgstr "\"하림... 그로투스는 신도들을 별로 신경 쓰지 않나봐. 그를 숭배해서 뭐해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "62de4d11-b084-4fbb-a662-2670761a6ffa"
msgid ""
"\"And what's the point in venerating the other gods? All they promise their "
"followers is empty fuss. Pleasure, war, magic... For his part, Groetus "
"teaches us to accept the inevitable with dignity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 신들을 숭배해서 뭐하나? 그들의 신도들은 빈 껍데기야. 쾌락에 전쟁에 마법을 추구하는... 그로투스는 종말을 겸손하게 받아들이는 "
"법을 가르치지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "fa15e317-8238-4e46-8d12-997168e83b6f"
msgid ""
"\"You constantly talk about the end of times, that we'll all die... Don't "
"you ever just want to have some fun?\""
msgstr "\"계속 종말에 대해서 얘기하는데... 미치겠어... 즐겁게 살 수는 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f5119ed3-d9c4-4e94-a613-5aa44a3e482b"
msgid ""
"\"I have fun when I watch your futile attempts to avoid the inevitable. It's "
"truly funny.\""
msgstr "\"종말을 피하려는 네 의미 없는 움직임이 더 재미있지. 정말 재미있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "831bb1c0-bbae-4395-9e33-2e7591fa37a7"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Harrim, would you ever want to return to the Five Kings Mountains? "
"To take up a hammer again? To feel the heat of the furnace?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하림, 다섯 왕의 산맥으로 돌아갈 생각은 해본 적 없어요? 다시 망치를 들고 싶어진다던가, 용광로의 열기를 느끼고 싶다던가 하는 생각 "
"말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "afe6dc56-5a1d-4648-a4eb-6198ab573808"
msgid ""
"\"Don't reopen old wounds. I've found my path, and I'm not turning from it. "
"The mountains are my home no more, even if someone would like to see me "
"there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옛 상처 좀 건들지 마. 나는 내 길을 찾았고 돌아가지 않을 거야. 그곳 드워프가 나를 보고 싶어 한다고 해도 그곳은 더 이상 내 "
"고향이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "70e9a79e-9c87-4ee1-926f-150e174a2ff2"
msgid ""
"\"Have you ever thought about writing down the teachings of Groetus? If it's "
"all so wise, why not share it with others?\""
msgstr "\"그로투스의 가르침을 써 볼 생각은 해 보지 않았어? 그렇게 좋은 가르침이면 남들에게 알려주지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziHarrim/Banter_LinziHarrim_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bf2df73b-e182-44d0-9d23-f9504e0ae772"
msgid ""
"\"What can be written on paper is not the truth, but only the ashes falling "
"from it. Anyone destined to understand Groetus' wisdom will not learn it "
"from a book.\""
msgstr "\"종이에 쓰여진 것은 진실이 아니고 재일 뿐이지. 그로투스의 지혜를 이해하는 자는 책에서 배우지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "894002ae-3bd7-43c3-980f-fa37ffed810e"
msgid ""
"\"I am writing a song about Guy Shaseur De Lombair. He... inspires me.\""
msgstr "\"기 샤제흐 드 롬배흐에 대해 노래를 쓰고 있어. 그는... 나에게 영감을 불어넣어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ab5e5c94-36b3-4cec-ac36-8f51f96f4937"
msgid ""
"\"You sound a bit smitten. I preferred large lovers when my heart still beat "
"for such trysts. Wasn't there a large, axe wielding Kellid that you "
"mentioned? Now he sounds delicious, if you know what I mean...\""
msgstr "\"거대한 도끼를 휘두르는 켈리드를 얘기한 적 있지 않아? 지금은 그가 더 끌리는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b117ec38-0b7b-4bce-b47a-7ad4c5bee00c"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal, you... You're not just cold – you are icy! A winter's night, "
"without the moon and stars!\""
msgstr "\"제이탈... 너는 그냥 차가운 게 아니라 얼음장처럼 차가워! 달도 별도 없는 겨울밤처럼 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2457a422-e8be-4f13-aba7-1fc88da306a9"
msgid ""
"\"Is that an attempted compliment? Girl, I am what I am. The opinions of the "
"short-lived interest me even less than the howling of the wind in the tree "
"branches.\""
msgstr "\"칭찬하려는 거야? 꼬맹이, 나는 나야. 내게 하루살이들의 말은 나뭇가지에 걸린 바람 소리만큼이나 무의미하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c0e1cd4b-11f4-41d5-b4db-38d96ddafe08"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal and the Rivers of Blood... Jaethal and the Broken Hearts... No... "
"She prefers ripping them out over breaking them..."
msgstr "\"제이탈과 피의 강... 제이탈과 상처받은 심장... 아니야... 제이탈은 남들의 심장을 찢는 여자니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ff03d559-9b92-4cac-8772-8792f295d0a2"
msgid ""
"\"If you must mention me in your scribbles, would you care to replace my "
"name? I've no wish to be associated with cheap novels.\""
msgstr "\"나를 묘사하려면 내 이름을 다른 이름으로 바꿔주지? 나는 싸구려 소설에 등장하고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c00cac6c-b37d-43dd-b0a5-196f2391fd49"
msgid ""
"\"How come your goddess made you her servant, but didn't explain what she "
"wanted you to do?\""
msgstr "\"네 여신이 너를 받아들였지만 원하는 걸 설명하지 않았다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "09a18351-3889-49b0-b488-b434a40164ce"
msgid ""
"\"How come you persist in trying my patience with such questions? One "
"shouldn't put one's fingers into a mousetrap, just to learn how their bones "
"crack.\""
msgstr "\"그런 질문으로 내 믿음을 깎아내리려는 거야? 쥐덫에 손을 갖다 대봐야 뼈가 부러지는 기분을 알지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "db08692d-64f3-46de-8b03-8ad0cda424a1"
msgid ""
"\"Look at me, I am Jaethal! Boo! I am a horrifying undead elf – where's my "
"scythe?! Aaaah, Urgathoa will give you the wisdom of death! You are so "
"pathetic, you ridiculous short-lived... Oops.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 봐, 나는 제이탈이야! 우우! 나는 무서운 언데드 엘프야. 내 낫이 어디있지?! 아아! 우르가쏘아가 죽음의 지혜를 너에게 줄 "
"거야! 너는 한심하고 웃기는 하루살이... 오. 이런.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "837543b8-9205-45fc-bf51-04ef789d89be"
msgid ""
"\"Careful. I might make you into my own private jester. You'll be telling me "
"your jokes forever and ever.\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 너를 내 언데드로 만들어버릴 수 있으니까. 그러면 영원히 그렇게 농담을 하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "def2c092-5c6c-4427-9415-0f2563153525"
msgid "\"How do you keep all this in your heart? How could you be so cruel?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 이 모든 걸 마음 속에 담아 둘 수 있지? 어떻게 그렇게 잔인할 수가 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJaethal/Banter_LinziJaethal_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a4c74d7b-0fac-4290-a8cd-357f4ae6c47f"
msgid ""
"\"Cruel? Don't confuse me with monsters and maniacs, girl. I don't enjoy the "
"suffering of others. I don't maim and kill for fun. I just know what I want, "
"and I don't care about the rest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잔인하다고? 나를 괴물이나 미치광이로 오해하지 말아줘. 나는 다른 이들의 고통을 즐기지 않아. 나는 재미로 죽이지 않아. 나는 단지 "
"내가 원하는 것을 알고, 다른 것은 신경 쓰지 않을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_LinziJubilost1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "14bf747a-d1ca-4d42-9b84-f4645b7fedb6"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost, talk to me. What's the secret of the incredible success of your "
"books?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 말해줘. 네 책의 성공 비결은 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_LinziJubilost1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "271799c7-c1a1-4f2a-9e48-55dfff5a70b5"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! You wish to know about sleepless nights, failed experiments, and "
"painstaking work? Well nothing is preventing you from buying 'The Secrets of "
"Writing by Jubilost Narthropple'....\""
msgstr "\"하! 잠을 자지 않고 수많은 실험과 고통스럽게 일해야 하는데? 내가 쓴 글쓰기의 비결을 사 보길 바래...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a5316cb9-690c-4f2e-8efe-d982f97f2285"
msgid ""
"\"Your books are known everywhere, read everywhere – even forbidden in some "
"places... How did you achieve such recognition? Or is it a secret?\""
msgstr "\"네 책은 어디에서든 알려져 있지. 어떻게 명성을 얻게 된 거야? 비결이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0a42ea96-94d0-443a-bf06-ed73c6bfa827"
msgid ""
"\"It's no secret, girl. First of all, it's a lot of hard work. Day and "
"night, without closing your eyes, tireless. And second of all... I'm just "
"talented.\""
msgstr "\"비결은 없어. 우선 엄청난 노력의 결과이지. 밤낮으로 잠도 자지 않고 일했어. 그리고... 나는 재능이 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "56a0b45e-fcbb-43f0-9f9f-08a360007c79"
msgid ""
"\"I've looked through your Essays On Spices... Who is this Guisa Nordequanni "
"and why is her name on the cover next to yours?\""
msgstr "\"향신료에 대한 네 에세이를 훑어봤어... 기사 노르데콰니는 누구고 왜 네 책 겉표지에 그 이름이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7d7d7076-0fc6-4eac-9412-a1767050c1e0"
msgid ""
"\"Because some judges are corrupt scoundrels who know nothing about "
"copyright! Co-author indeed! She scarcely sharpened my quills!\""
msgstr "\"몇몇 판사가 썩어서 저작권은 무시했기 때문이지! 물론 공동 저자야! 하지만 그녀는 펜을 쥐지도 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "47a5bf70-685b-4925-ab73-7e97091eccdf"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost, tell me about the College of Mysteries – what's it like? Do you "
"think I'd like it there?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 미스터리 대학에 대해 말해줘. 그게 뭐야? 거기 가면 재밌을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "77f69446-de24-424e-88b2-072e72acc758"
msgid ""
"\"Would you? Surely. But you know, they don't just accept anyone! Even to "
"get a cleaning job there, you have to submit a list of publications!\""
msgstr "\"네가? 물론이지. 하지만 그들은 아무나 받아들이지 않아! 청소부라도 자신이 출판한 목록을 내야 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a58e7073-8ae8-445f-b81c-628528d9070a"
msgid "\"Heh... Will I really never be as famous as you?\""
msgstr "\"헤... 나는 너처럼 유명해질 수는 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "dc7f334c-e057-4166-ab65-e5d250c6117b"
msgid ""
"\"As famous as me – probably not. But don't despair, you have your whole "
"life ahead of you! Always remember – keep writing! And never for the desk "
"drawer! Write everything for the purposes of being read and discussed! "
"Praised, cursed – that part doesn't matter!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나처럼 유명해지려면 안 되겠지. 하지만 절망하지 마. 아직 네 인생은 너에게 있으니까! 계속해서 적어! 그리고 항상 가지고 다니면서 "
"읽어! 읽고 대화할 내용의 목적을 모두 적어둬! 좋은 내용이건 나쁜 내용이건 상관 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0599811e-8dc4-4f93-a9c3-1e69dcb6f22a"
msgid "\"And what are you doing? Writing notes for a new book?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거야? 새로운 책을 쓰는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "05a48efa-f1c8-4d67-b4d9-072bfde18f99"
msgid ""
"\"I'm drawing a map. Someone needs to know where to go when we finally get "
"lost.\""
msgstr "\"지도를 그리고 있어. 길을 잃어버렸을 때 누군가는 길을 알아야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9fddac59-0263-4d64-bcdb-5f00d6fac398"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me about your past. Where did you grow up, what kind of childhood did "
"you have?\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 말해줘. 어디서 자라고 어릴 때는 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziJubilost/Banter_LinziJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "26b24cac-0f28-45ec-9157-a02bb2c6bc10"
msgid ""
"\"It's all in my autobiography. Look it up in the library. It's in the "
"'Jubilost' section.\""
msgstr "\"내 자서전에 모두 적혀있어. 도서관에 가서 빌려 읽어. 주빌로스트 구간이 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7995b75c-5631-42a0-bb94-73002bb67c49"
msgid ""
"\"I heard you singing as we walked! So beautiful! Why don't you sing for us "
"now?\""
msgstr "\"걸어다닐 때 노래하는 걸 들었어! 정말 아름다워! 우리를 위해 노래를 해줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5cfdeeef-fdb0-4708-9d0c-23eca3884ee4"
msgid ""
"\"My singing is not like yours, sweet Linzi. I sing for myself, as travelers "
"sing in the desert, during a long journey on a camel's back, with my face "
"covered by three layers of cloth, to hold back the sandy wind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 노래는 네 것이 아니야. 린지. 낙타의 등에 타고 모래를 막기 위해 복면을 쓴 여행자들이 사막을 여행할 때 심심해서 노래를 불렀지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6b5666ac-3593-4710-ba0a-c9967ac2dc3e"
msgid ""
"\"Kaessi, what is that trick where you go into a portal and then appear "
"again? I've never seen anything like it!\""
msgstr "\"카에시. 포탈을 들어갔다가 나오는 기술은 뭐야? 그런 건 본 적이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "da2a1875-8ca8-481d-a16a-f938c66fa5a3"
msgid ""
"\"It's... a special magic trick I learned in my homeland. I travel through "
"the elemental plane to renew my strength!\""
msgstr "\"그건... 내 고향에서 배운 특별한 기술이야. 나는 새로운 힘을 찾기 위해 원소계에 가고는 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5d1f8d14-aaa7-4a9a-ae8a-1cd1afe555a6"
msgid ""
"\"It's... a special magic trick I learned in my homeland. I travel through "
"the elemental plane to renew my strength!\""
msgstr "\"그건... 내 고향에서 배운 특별한 기술이야. 나는 새로운 힘을 찾기 위해 원소계에 가고는 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "17a71dd3-841f-4d62-ab50-8f2bd67cf97a"
msgid ""
"\"How could you hide everything from us?! How did you become connected in "
"this strange way? Are you sure there are only two of you, and not, like, "
"four? Do you have one body? Is your grandfather really a devil?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 우리에게서 숨길 수가 있지? 어떻게 그렇게 연결된 거야? 포탈안에 하나가 아니라 셋은 더 있는 거 아니야? 몸은 하나야? 네 "
"할아버지는 정말 데블였어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a4fb18f4-b8fe-4bca-95af-1ad719fc94df"
msgid ""
"\"We aren't always free to choose what to reveal to others and what we must "
"hide, sweet Linzi. But I'm sorry I couldn't tell you the truth.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가끔 어떤 비밀은 밝히지 못해. 린지. 진실을 말해주지 못해 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "940a4bb0-737a-4fb5-b152-35c9d9c681c5"
msgid ""
"\"The waterfall of questions pouring from your mouth is one of the reasons "
"we never tell anyone anything about ourselves.\""
msgstr "\"네 입에서 질문의 폭포가 쏟아지는 이유는 우리가 비밀을 말해주지 않아서겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "eca8c925-5df3-46f6-8eb5-481d54661e10"
msgid "\"Can you butt people with your horns?\""
msgstr "\"뿔로 사람 엉덩이 찔러본 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "64c389f3-6435-4a6e-8198-5e611894478c"
msgid ""
"\"I certainly can. And I'm prepared to demonstrate, with the help of a "
"curious little bard...\""
msgstr "\"할 수는 있어. 호기심 많은 작은 음유시인이 도와준다면 해 볼 수도 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2f67e9c7-8543-43cf-bf27-cb114b1e8799"
msgid ""
"\"I certainly can. And I'm prepared to demonstrate, with the help of a "
"curious little bard...\""
msgstr "\"할 수는 있어. 호기심 많은 작은 음유시인이 도와준다면 해 볼 수도 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "99143a6c-9732-4097-bc25-274ef8e769c1"
msgid ""
"\"The small, red, sweet berries are called strawberries. And the fluffy "
"yellow flower is a dandelion! Oh, I like to explain things to you! I feel so "
"knowledgeable and important!\""
msgstr ""
"\"작고 달콤한 빨간 열매는 딸기라 불려. 그리고 털복숭이로 바뀌는 노란 꽃은 민들레라고 하지! 오! 나는 너에게 설명해주는 게 좋아! "
"내가 정말 중요하고 똑똑한 사람처럼 느껴져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziKalikke/Banter_LinziKalikke_dlc1_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ec014985-e91c-46ab-99af-8071a01cbe30"
msgid "\"Mmm, strawberries! Sweet Linzi, what would I do without you?\""
msgstr "\"음. 딸기라! 린지야. 너 없으면 어떻게 할 뻔했니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "76b3711e-a392-47be-804f-40a2d4110ea7"
msgid ""
"\"All right, new line. 'They walked without fear, hoisting shining steel "
"above their heads…'\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 적어야지. 그들은 용감하게 머리 위로 빛나는 검을 들고 걸어갔다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "684b1a62-c3d4-4251-9fe7-ce0477949247"
msgid ""
"\"And they walked and they walked... Heh, when were they going to get "
"anywhere already, hunh?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 그들은 걸어가고... 걸어가고... 헤. 언제 쯤 도착할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b8f8211e-3fe3-463d-9222-54a287de135d"
msgid ""
"\"Steel? Above their heads? But why? Were they frightened of an aerial "
"assault? Or were they using their blades to flash a signal?\""
msgstr "\"검이라고? 머리 위로? 왜? 하늘에서 공격을 받을 거라 생각해서? 아니면 검을 비춰서 신호를 보내려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "523f6cfe-525a-4691-b14a-c0562da3fd3d"
msgid ""
"\"Steel? Above their heads? But why? Were they frightened of an aerial "
"assault? Or were they using their blades to flash a signal?\""
msgstr "\"검이라고? 머리 위로? 왜? 하늘에서 공격을 받을 거라 생각해서? 아니면 검을 비춰서 신호를 보내려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2db4b403-e711-4fd8-8349-dbf71e0f0ff5"
msgid ""
"\"Someday I will be as famous as Annamede Belavarah herself... No, even more "
"famous! Heh, hoping I live that long!\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 나는 안나미데 빌라바라처럼 유명해질 거야... 아니. 더 유명해질 거야! 헤. 그 때까지 오래 살았으면 좋겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6b9f7628-0041-47b7-a6ad-82ad0dfcbc72"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to sit at a desk in my own library, writing memoirs… with someone "
"bringing me a nice cup of hot tea...\""
msgstr "\"도서관 책상에 앉아 지난 날을 쓰고 싶어... 누군가 나에게 따뜻한 차를 가져다 주고 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1ecbd892-f496-41c6-9a88-75c5b382cc98"
msgid "\"Oh, who am I kidding? I wouldn't be able to sit still for a day.\""
msgstr "\"설마. 아직 나는 하루도 앉아있을 수가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3aad2c03-6106-423c-bf2b-0d9e72fb4d74"
msgid ""
"\"Clashing swords, hours despairing, vows made in silence, hoping and "
"daring...\""
msgstr "\"검을 부딪히고 침묵 속에서 절을 하고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ac72739f-4c9d-49d6-acac-46796b0141e8"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh! That rhyme is rubbish! I know all the words – why's it so hard to put "
"them together?\""
msgstr "\"아! 운율이 안 맞아! 내용은 다 만들었는데 왜 운율을 맞추기가 힘들까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8045bce8-fea7-4e44-89ec-b20e369ebd21"
msgid "\"Heh, I'd give anything for a mug of hot grog. And for two mugs...\""
msgstr "\"따뜻한 술 한잔을 마실 수 있다면 뭐든 주겠어. 두 잔이면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b02dfefb-3bc2-49b2-9484-c5dbf988e8a9"
msgid ""
"\"No, after two mugs they'd kick me out of the tavern. How come I never "
"learned how to drink at the Academy?\""
msgstr "\"안 돼. 두 잔을 마시면 나를 쫓아낼 거야. 아카데미에서 술을 왜 배우지 않았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "da8ed46c-b352-404f-af32-27253ac18978"
msgid ""
"\"It's better not to risk two mugs at camp. – As soon as you relax a little, "
"the monsters are sure to show up. But when we return to the city, we can "
"drop by Elina's tavern. I'll be happy to keep you company!\""
msgstr ""
"\"캠프에서 두잔은 마시지 않는 게 좋아. 안정을 취했을 때 괴물이 나타날 수도 있어. 도시로 돌아갔을 때 엘리나의 술집에 들르자. 그 "
"때는 술친구가 되어줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "84a0b49e-aead-4ff2-b4c1-73ca14b0eacd"
msgid ""
"\"It's better not to risk two mugs at camp. – As soon as you relax a little, "
"the monsters are sure to show up. But when we return to the city, we can "
"drop by Elina's tavern. I'll be happy to keep you company!\""
msgstr ""
"\"캠프에서 두잔은 마시지 않는 게 좋아. 안정을 취했을 때 괴물이 나타날 수도 있어. 도시로 돌아갔을 때 엘리나의 술집에 들르자. 그 "
"때는 술친구가 되어줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_PaizoCollector_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7d247e3c-21a9-4bd4-893b-7be012993685"
msgid ""
"\"Who is this Storyteller, I wonder? He's weird — an elf, but looks old. And "
"he's blind. And he doesn't like to share stories, what a miser!\""
msgstr "\"이 이야기꾼은 누구지? 나이 든 엘프라. 이상하고 장님이야. 그리고 이야기를 말해줄 만큼 친절해 보이지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziLinzi/Banter_LinziLinzi_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cb8cc249-2f4f-40da-ba95-49bdbf8e4a15"
msgid ""
"\"So who is he? The oldest elf on whole Golarion? Or an enchanted prince of "
"Kyonin? Oh, maybe he's a god suffering a memory loss? I'm so excited I won't "
"be able to sleep tonight, damn it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 그가 누구라고? 골라리온에서 가장 나이 많은 엘프라고? 아니면 쿄닌의 왕자인가? 기억을 잃어버린 신이 아닐까? 너무 궁금해서 "
"오늘 밤은 못 자겠군. 젠장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziNokNok/Banter_LinziNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bc112221-1bc3-4a76-bdf8-4d78f9e7c529"
msgid "\"Why, why are you so obnoxious, Nok-Nok! What have I done to you?\""
msgstr "\"너 정말 왜 그렇게 못됐어? 녹-녹! 내가 너에게 어쨌길래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziNokNok/Banter_LinziNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b074beae-8c4f-4395-aab0-b1aad8cb7181"
msgid ""
"\"Linzee talks all the time. Many extra words. Head full of words. Don't "
"want that, so please be quiet please please!\""
msgstr "\"린지 항상 말한다. 수다스럽다. 머리 아프다. 머리 아프니까 제발 조용히 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziNokNok/Banter_LinziNokNok_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4340f491-7b96-4f44-9508-b4449ce02da1"
msgid "\"Oh no! My drafts! They're torn to shreds!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 내 초안이! 갈갈이 찢겨졌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziNokNok/Banter_LinziNokNok_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "212a69ce-7eba-4445-a6fb-769960967478"
msgid ""
"\"Oh noooo! Linzee lost her think-thoughts! Hnh — now know better than keep "
"on paper!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 린지가 생각하는 방법을 잊어버렸다! 흥. 종이에 쓰는 것보다 생각하는 게 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziNokNok/Banter_LinziNokNok_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4e520ce3-7027-420a-bc89-0960e6eb6c95"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, why did you make that hissing sound — and why are your weapons "
"out?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 왜 자꾸 이상한 소리를 내는 거야? 왜 무기는 꺼냈어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziNokNok/Banter_LinziNokNok_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "baf54971-52a8-401e-b565-a4d9f029dc37"
msgid ""
"\"Book. Linzee's book. I see it looking at me, like it about to attack – but "
"not if I get it first.\""
msgstr "\"책 때문에. 린지의 책 때문이다. 그게 나를 보며 공격하려고 했다. 내가 먼저 공격하려고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f8721d44-8719-4c62-b81d-5fbf628ebaa9"
msgid ""
"\"I really admire Guy and the Archknights of Avistan. I hope we can do some "
"good in the world like they did. We just seem so... I don't know. We are not "
"the heroes I imagine the Arch-Knights to have been.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아비스탄의 아크나이트가 정말 멋져. 우리도 그들처럼 세상에 좋은 일을 해야 해. 그렇게 되겠지? 나도 모르겠어. 우리는 내가 상상하던 "
"아크나이트가 아니니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "628c1be4-8a6e-4f4c-a11f-22ed02864a10"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be sad just because we don't measure up to some book. Even if it was "
"based on real people, I am sure they didn't always agree. Don't focus on "
"what we struggle with; write your story about what we do well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 책처럼 될 수 없어도 슬퍼하지 마. 책에 등장하는 사람들이 진짜라도 가끔은 싸웠을 거야. 우리가 싸우는 것에 집중하지 말고 "
"우리가 한 일에 대해 이야기를 써.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "652a1d26-7140-46f6-9dd5-42490923e1ab"
msgid "\"The Age of Destiny was truly fascinating!\""
msgstr "\"운명의 시대는 정말 매력적이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0ca1ccff-b0ec-49ed-8a8b-71fec77f661b"
msgid "\"My favorite age is the saus-age.\""
msgstr "\"내가 가장 좋아하는 시대는 먹기시대지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_LinziOctavia1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7bfd0481-118e-4792-8b04-7e1b9d7af311"
msgid ""
"\"Oh! Another inkblot! And at the very bottom of the page! Now I need to "
"write the whole thing over again!\""
msgstr "\"오! 잉크가 또 번졌어! 마지막 장에서 번지다니! 처음부터 다시 써야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_LinziOctavia1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c4822bf3-8736-4991-85eb-e0abfd7e008c"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! Don't tear it out yet... let me see. You know, we could make a "
"picture from this inkblot! There. A line here and there — and now it's a...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 찢지 마... 어디 보자. 잉크가 번진 곳에서 그림을 그리면 되지! 여기 줄을 긋고 저기에... 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "475070a0-1479-4eac-a892-f949e9571aa7"
msgid ""
"\"And how do you manage to always keep your hair so nice? Mine always sticks "
"out like a nest...\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 머릿결이 항상 그렇게 좋아? 내 것은 항상 새 둥지처럼 떡졌어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "95355790-e88d-449e-a224-17ce236e3571"
msgid ""
"\"It's because you have too many thoughts in your head! They won't even all "
"fit, so you have to write them down.\""
msgstr "\"네가 머릿속에 생각이 너무 많기 때문이야! 생각이 너무 많아 모두 써내려가야 하잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2104be7b-7592-475c-907a-1f7d418cfeba"
msgid ""
"\"You and Regongar are so different... But you know, you're a great couple! "
"I'm even a little jealous.\""
msgstr "\"너와 레곤가르는 너무 달라... 하지만 너희는 좋은 커플이야! 약간은 질투가 나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4733225c-1bea-49a3-ab14-971b3f44ddbe"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be jealous, join us! We're always excited to try new things... Ha ha "
"ha, don't blush, I'm just kidding!\""
msgstr "\"질투하지 마! 너도 같이 사귀자! 우리는 새로운 시도를 해보는 걸 좋아해... 하하하. 얼굴 붉히지 말라고! 농담이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ac42fb28-6612-4e11-8fc7-c46c25c1250f"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia, do you have a few pieces of paper? Some scoundrel stole my spare "
"notebook.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아. 종이 몇장 있어? 어떤 녀석이 내 여분의 노트를 가져갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4ec09f09-4c24-40de-9685-0c26bb994b65"
msgid "\"Oh... So that wasn't kindling? I'm so sorry! Of course I do!\""
msgstr "\"오... 불꽃이 아니었어? 미안해! 기다려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "73bec89d-f771-4390-830b-59afcfaafd76"
msgid ""
"\"It's good that we met. Without you, there wouldn't be anyone to chat with "
"around here!\""
msgstr "\"만나게 되어 정말 좋구나. 네가 없었으면 대화할 사람이 없었을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "427ad05f-6a4f-45f7-a743-f90d66007477"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, you're big on chatting! But I'm glad of it too. My pointy ears are "
"always at your disposal!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 너 정말 말 많더라! 하지만 나도 대화를 해서 즐거웠어. 내 뾰족한 귀는 항상 열려있으니 걱정 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "71b29703-af9e-439f-abc2-1e1f155d151b"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia! Show me that fire trick again, the one you did to entertain the "
"children at the capital!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아! 그 불꽃을 다시 보여줘. 수도에서 아이들에게 보여주었던 그 불꽃 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1772b45f-f7d8-4176-9ae5-58e0a30dbb3e"
msgid ""
"\"Seriously? You're not five, you know... All right, I have to finish "
"something, but then I'll show you.\""
msgstr "\"정말이야? 너는 5살 아이도 아닌데... 좋아. 하던 일 끝내고 보여줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2767d150-f7a5-4651-a71b-fffb53574a4c"
msgid ""
"\"How do you manage to keep your cool in battle? I always get terribly "
"worried! What if something goes wrong and we all get eaten up?\""
msgstr "\"싸울 때 어떻게 그렇게 침착해? 나는 항상 걱정이 되는데! 일이 잘못되어 우리가 잡아먹히면 어떻게 하고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziOctavia/Banter_LinziOctavia_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f7c929a8-9183-4669-b027-8f0bae48bd14"
msgid ""
"\"I'd worry too... But I'm encouraged by the battle songs of brave little "
"bard!\""
msgstr "\"나도 걱정돼... 하지만 용감하고 작은 음유시인의 노래에 힘이 나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d6b771b4-ece7-490f-a596-e8ecfed3b5b5"
msgid ""
"\"This group is shaping up nicely! We just have to try a little harder "
"tomorrow. If I wrote a true account of our battles, people with think we're "
"a bunch of amateurs. Would it hurt to strike a heroic pose now and then, "
"Regongar? You grump.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 잘한다! 내일은 더 열심히 해야 해. 우리의 전투를 사실대로 쓰면 사람들은 우리를 아마추어라고 생각할 거야. 좀 더 멋진 포즈를 "
"취하라고 했잖아. 레곤가르?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7a7c70a4-86b6-4d18-98f1-c499d400714a"
msgid ""
"\"Enough about your hero, Guy-what's-his-face, alright Linzi? It's just a "
"story. No one can be that good. Only idiots and dead men flourish when they "
"fight. Stop with the nonsense already!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영웅 이야기는 그만둬. 그냥 이야기일 뿐이야. 누구도 그렇게 잘할 수가 없다고. 멍청이와 시체들이나 폼을 잡지. 쓸데 없는 얘기는 "
"그만해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_LinziRegongar1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a3d866fc-c486-4426-9062-9d128a14a011"
msgid ""
"\"When I hear thunder in the middle of the fight, I always look around. And "
"each time I see your smiling face, lit by the lightning. And in your eyes — "
"blood, steel and claws. Battle brings you true pleasure...\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸울 때 번개 소리를 들으면 항상 주위를 봐. 그리고 번개에 비치는 네 웃는 얼굴을 보지. 그리고 네 눈은 피에 굶주려있어. 너는 "
"싸움을 즐기는 거 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_LinziRegongar1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "af5e4d00-1b5e-4d89-a421-a4b8859e76c4"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, that's true. I do like slinging lightning! And I like danger. Devil "
"knows why... Sometimes I feel I belong there — in the thick of a battle, "
"among the animals and beasts... Ha, ha, hmm. So, what's for dinner?\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이야. 나는 번개를 던지는 게 정말 좋아! 위험한 것도 좋아하고. 이유는 몰라... 가끔 괴물 사이에 있을 때 전투를 해야 한다는 "
"생각이 들어. 하하. 흠. 오늘 저녁은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "607c808c-5c1c-4537-8856-1e66700ef615"
msgid "\"Regongar, why are you always so mean?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 왜 항상 그렇게 못됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "24e343a3-29f4-4f86-b824-ecf6aac70d7e"
msgid ""
"\"Kindness doesn't survive this world for long. I was taught that lesson "
"under the whip for many, many years. If you want to live, strike first! "
"That's it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"친절하면 이 세상에서 오래 살아남지 못해. 수년 동안 채찍을 맞으니 그런 생각이 들었지. 살고 싶으면 먼저 공격해! 그러면 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d42f7c63-d1f7-4753-8d8d-0be03d737bf4"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Regongar, I think you only try to seem like you're angry and "
"rude. But you're kind on the inside!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 내 생각에 너는 그냥 화가 나고 못되 보이려고 하는 거 같아. 하지만 너의 내면은 친절해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "82b54958-8f9e-40c6-8714-0659d0f78992"
msgid ""
"\"On the inside, baby, I'm the same as everyone – blood, heart, guts, and a "
"little shit.\""
msgstr "\"내면엔 말이지. 나는 남들과 같아. 피화 심장과 내장과 똥이 차있을 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "aaa84cca-1fb9-4d7e-b0be-afa876b77ef5"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, tell me, you and Octavia are so different... What keeps you "
"together?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 말해줘. 너와 옥타비아는 너무 달라... 그런데 왜 같이 다니는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f6924abc-a68e-4cad-900e-29d6407e4c18"
msgid ""
"\"Ask what doesn't! We've been together since we were kids – in chains. And "
"now that we're free, we're together in battle!\""
msgstr "\"그러지 말아야 할 이유가 없지! 우리는 어릴 때부터 같이 지냈어. 그리고 자유가 된 지금은 전투에서 함께 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3f985dd3-3143-4d5d-9b16-9a095a9fbc51"
msgid "\"Regongar, did your tribe have any legends? Myths?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 너희 부족은 전설 없어? 신화라든가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6c54162c-48d4-4f73-bf20-e954504de92c"
msgid ""
"\"They will once I track them down. The Legend About Regongar, Who "
"Slaughtered Everyone. Cool legend, right?\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 내 부족을 쓰러뜨릴 거야. 레곤가르의 전설은 자신의 부족을 살해하는 것이지. 멋진 전설이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c95a12f0-f5fb-4a8b-8222-2881f8c1abae"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, what's that you're chewing? Eww, nasty! What is that, a rat? "
"Raw? Aaaagh, how can I forget that I saw that?!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 네가 씹는 게 뭐야? 으유! 더러워! 그게 뭐야? 쥐? 날고기? 아. 눈 버렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8a183bd4-3d5f-4e9b-8891-30884629fd47"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, you wuss! In Numeria we were glad when we had a rat for supper! "
"Besides they're so fat and tender here in the Stolen Lands – yummy!\""
msgstr "\"비위가 약하구나! 누메리아에서 우리는 출출할 때 쥐를 먹지! 도둑맞은 땅의 쥐는 토실토실하고 부드럽군. 냠냠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f8960967-8a33-48cd-ada7-ef21e9896367"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, could you roast, like, a duck – with your lightning? On a skewer?\""
msgstr "\"저기 네 번개로 오리 같은 거 구워줄 수 있어? 아니면 돼지라던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "afd5b192-2aee-4ca7-8188-8d0f0890c299"
msgid ""
"\"My lightning is for fighting to the death, not for cooking experiments. "
"Although... I could, I guess. Either roast it or burn it to ashes!\""
msgstr "\"내 번개는 요리가 아니라 전투를 위한 거야. 그래도... 가능은 하겠지. 잘 구워지지 않으면 재가 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6705b458-3b23-43ce-9305-0d84fff56d71"
msgid "\"Reg, I need some inspiration. Strike a heroic pose!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 영감을 일으켜줘. 전투가 끝난 후 멋진 포즈 부탁해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziRegongar/Banter_LinziRegongar_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e590b73d-eee7-4013-9423-9e40330a6061"
msgid ""
"\"A pose you say? Ha ha ha... I like poses. The ones I like would inspire "
"you for something quite different, though...\""
msgstr "\"포즈라고? 하하하... 나도 포즈를 좋아해. 약간 다른게 일어나버렸지만 말이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "42cb2949-4dbb-4356-ae1f-4e48d4893e28"
msgid ""
"\"You know, the author of my favorite books was a follower of the "
"Dawnflower. His name was Ash. He wasn't a man of the cloth like you Tristian;"
" he dabbled in the arcane arts. But he did find Sarenrae's teaching an "
"ideology to live by.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그거 알아? 내가 가장 좋아하는 책 작가가 새벽꽃의 신도야. 애쉬라고, 너처럼 사제는 아니지만 비전 예술 얘기를 떠들고 다녀. 삶 "
"속에서 서렌레이의 가르침을 발견했다더라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e119e49e-8363-463b-a702-a47f6721a19d"
msgid ""
"\"I like the sound of this Ash. Perhaps I will have to give those books a "
"read. Legend of the Archknights of Avistan was it?\""
msgstr "\"애쉬라는 사람 마음에 드네. 그 사람이 쓴 책을 읽어봐야겠어. 아비스탄 아크나이트의 전설이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f39d4fb0-75aa-434e-8fa0-dadb4604538b"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing can stop our leader. Though King Irovetti will stop at nothing...\""
msgstr "\"우리 대장을 막을 수 있는 사람은 없을 거야. 이로베티가 막무가내로 유명하긴 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2011435a-2d86-4af5-8cd7-3f2a8ce83516"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, if nothing can stop us — is that the same nothing that he'll stop "
"at? That can't be right...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 아무도 우리를 막을 수 없는데, 이로베티도 누가 막아서든 개의치 않는다고? 안 좋은 예감이 드는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b2ee0071-f6ad-4aa5-b93e-25916f08bdda"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, why are you staring at me like that? Do I have an ink stain on "
"my cheek again?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 왜 그렇게 나를 봐? 내 뺨에 잉크라도 묻었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "158a6f2c-92a8-4aba-962a-bf243eaa77ab"
msgid ""
"\"Um... Yes, actually. But it wasn't about that. I just like to watch you "
"write. You're so... focused. As if you're trying to put a part of yourself "
"down on the pages.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 맞아. 잉크 때문은 아니고. 네가 글 쓰는 모습이 보기 좋아서. 무언가에... 몰두해있잖아. 네가 책의 일부분이 된 것처럼 "
"말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3e721840-07f0-4acd-9bf6-9ed9ccfa25ca"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Tristian, your goddess teaches mercy and forgiveness. But are there "
"things you wouldn't be able to forgive?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 네 신은 자비와 용서를 가르치잖아. 정말 네가 용서 못할 일은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1400d3db-ef6c-42a0-a4c8-8c72a495f582"
msgid "\"Besides your bitter humor?\""
msgstr "\"네 유머 감각?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8b48534c-35d1-49d3-b027-c2848dd3f9f7"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, tell me! Is everyone so boring in Kelesh? Or were you banished "
"from there for your boring sermons?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 말해줘! 케레쉬의 사람들이 그렇게 지루하다며? 혹시 지루한 설교 때문에 쫓겨난 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e8268bfc-6209-42fe-863d-afcb9f770ae5"
msgid ""
"\"I went on this journey of my own free will, with Sarenrae's blessing... "
"Why are you giggling? Did I say something funny?\""
msgstr "\"나는 서렌레이의 축복과 자유의지로 여행을 떠난 거야... 왜 웃어? 내가 무슨 재밌는 말이라도 했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "931d8185-190a-45af-ad4a-b7cc1b636903"
msgid ""
"\"Your native Kelesh is so far away... You must have seen so much in your "
"journeys! Why don't you ever talk about it?\""
msgstr "\"케레쉬는 아주 먼 곳에 있잖아... 여행을 하면서 많은 걸 봤을 거야! 왜 한 번도 얘기해주지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b734a14f-3be6-450d-a11c-9c3b15065d84"
msgid ""
"\"I... Actually I have nothing to tell. Not everyone who travels gets to "
"have adventures.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 사실 말할 게 없어. 여행자라고 다 모험을 겪진 않으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "22f7df05-d644-4d3e-a14f-9498d6cda6fa"
msgid ""
"\"Your faith makes you so... vulnerable. Aren't you afraid that evil people "
"will take advantage of your peaceful disposition, and hurt you?\""
msgstr "\"네 신앙심이 너를... 약하게 만드는 거 같아. 나쁜 사람들이 너를 이용하거나 상처 줄까 봐 걱정되지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "580a919a-c6e9-4bd9-bde9-b67a50b8a748"
msgid ""
"\"Hardly. My vows and faith are a strength, not a weakness. But if evil is "
"done, it won't be my doing.\""
msgstr "\"별로. 내 믿음은 약하지 않고 강해. 하지만 악행이 벌어진다면 그건 나 때문이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8c8e69d3-755a-45da-8293-52a308d009f0"
msgid ""
"\"What brought you to your faith in Sarenrae? Let me guess. You committed a "
"terrible atrocity! And now you're atoning for it. Am I right?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 서렌레이를 믿게 되었어? 내 생각에는 너는 정말 지독한 일을 저질렀어! 그리고 지금은 회개하는 거지. 내가 맞아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziTristian/Banter_LinziTristian_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3818d765-4a33-498b-bd12-5f538d9399e0"
msgid ""
"\"I was just looking at the world. There is such evil in it, and too little "
"mercy. Is it not enough to simply want to change it for the better?\""
msgstr "\"나는 세상에 악이 있지만 자비는 없다고 생각했어. 좋은 세상을 위해 그랬다는 이유로 충분하지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "88a587bb-5eb4-4d67-8778-ad1b5f0035d3"
msgid ""
"\"Our adventures are so great! Soon I will be able to write an epic tale "
"just like my favorite books, Legend of the Archknights of Avistan. You know "
"Valerie, not everyone flails about screaming like you do. Guy Shaseur De "
"Lombair had finesse, style, grace. He danced around his opponents killing "
"only when he had to. You could learn from him, oaf!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 모험은 정말 대단해! 내가 좋아하던 아비스탄의 아크나이트처럼 정말 멋진 이야기를 쓸 수 있을 거야. 발레리. 모든 사람이 너처럼 "
"악착같이 싸우지는 않아. 기 샤제흐 드 롬배흐는 우아하고 멋지지. 그는 적들에 둘러쌓일 때 춤을 추듯이 적을 죽여. 너도 그에게서 배워봐!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c2683201-5d6a-4d20-a2c2-ae4c54cf4c3d"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose he was the greatest swordsman of the age? What a joke. Dancing "
"around the battlefield like a tavern act? I have never seen someone dance "
"during combat little one. Sounds made up...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 위대한 검사였습니까? 웃기는군요. 술집에서 처럼 전장에서 춤을 추라고요? 나는 전투에서 춤을 추는 모습을 한번도 본 적이 "
"없습니다. 지어낸 이야기 같군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_LinziValerie1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b391e6c5-86b8-4893-93ad-33f7857a5126"
msgid ""
"\"You know, sometimes I try to imagine what it's like to be like you. A "
"knight in shining armor — and the queen of hearts, all rolled into one... "
"Your life is like a novel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가끔 너처럼 되면 어떨까 하고 상상하고는 해. 빛나는 갑옷을 입은 기사지만 아름다운 미모를 가진 여성이라니... 네 인생은 마치 "
"소설같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_LinziValerie1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4258f927-5972-4ade-95df-e6a149c5669a"
msgid "\"From a distance it looks like a blessing, does it not?\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람의 눈에는 축복처럼 보이는 것이지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cc9c1785-7e8b-42b0-a488-436bf56c1729"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie, didn't you like stories, even as a child? I can't believe that. "
"All children like stories!\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 이야기는 싫어했어? 어릴 때는? 믿을 수 없어. 아이들도 이야기는 좋아해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a4076a71-76e1-4ab3-8dc6-8e24f0d8d817"
msgid ""
"\"In case you haven't noticed, I'm not a child any more. Maybe you should "
"grow up at last too!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 모르시겠지만 저는 더 이상 아이가 아닙니다. 아마 당신도 더 자라야 하겠군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9ea9a8c5-08dd-405a-8be2-1d8dd8e6aa5f"
msgid ""
"\"Too bad I don't know how to paint. I'd like to draw you... Maybe a "
"portrait, or a caricature!\""
msgstr "\"그림 그리는 방법을 몰라 아쉬워. 너를 그리고 싶어... 초상화가 안 되면 캐리커쳐라도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b6a97fa4-763e-41a1-b297-f90e7a9cb334"
msgid ""
"\"That's something new. I don't think anyone has ever drawn a caricature of "
"me before... Though I think that's for the best.\""
msgstr "\"그건 새롭군요. 전에는 누가 저의 캐리커쳐를 그려본다는 생각을 해보지 않았습니다... 그래봤자 따분하겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "12730f0a-ad38-4780-a9fc-5fb18148eb99"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie, why are you so mean? There's got to be something in this world "
"that you like!\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 왜 그렇게 못됐어? 네가 원하는 세상에서 살고 있으면서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5a6ea640-5cf2-4406-98e0-bd11570dc317"
msgid ""
"\"I like it when you stay silent. If there's anything beautiful in this "
"world, it's silence.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 조용할 때가 저는 좋습니다. 세상에 아름다움이 있다면 그건 침묵이겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "36e5a832-81f2-40b4-975f-7d48ea517014"
msgid ""
"\"Someday I'll write a play about our adventures... And you'll have one of "
"the main parts!\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 우리 모험을 극으로 쓸 거야... 그리고 너는 주인공 중의 하나야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6b1b73de-c180-4627-92ad-09968cbdd305"
msgid ""
"\"Then we'll see if there's at least one actress brave enough to go on stage "
"and impersonate me... Knowing that I'll be sitting in the front row!\""
msgstr "\"그러면 여자 연기자는 저를 감명시킬 수 있을 만큼 연기를 잘해야겠군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "74574699-fd51-4060-9e82-3b6f02ed213b"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you want your name to be glorified through the ages? Without a bard "
"to trumpet your feats, that simply wouldn't happen! But just imagine: noble "
"Valerie, daring protector of the Stolen Lands...\""
msgstr ""
"\"온 세상에 명성을 떨치고 싶지 않으세요? 당신의 위업을 노래할 바드가 없다면 절대 할 수 없는 일이죠. 하지만 상상해보세요! 도둑맞은 "
"땅의 고귀하고 용감한 수호자 발레리...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a1f9e2a4-a283-4796-92fd-04b6b11f7483"
msgid ""
"\"What is that, the title of a poem? Sounds more like an epitaph. I'm "
"starting to think you're not even going to let me rest in peace.\""
msgstr "\"그건 뭐지요? 시의 제목입니까? 마치 묘비에 적힌 글 같군요. 이제는 죽어서도 저를 편히 보내주지 않으려는 겁니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cee08a28-900b-4ee4-bff8-111aec634e49"
msgid ""
"\"You chose a path of a warrior, and now your sword is always wet with "
"blood... What, do you like killing?\""
msgstr "\"너는 전사의 길을 걸으면서 검에 피를 묻혔지... 죽이는 것이 즐거워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/LinziValerie/Banter_LinziValerie_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8d3c61c7-cddf-4b0b-9fef-492410a9b4ce"
msgid ""
"\"War is no less honorable a trade than any others. It's definitely not "
"worse than drawing, or arranging letters into lines! As for my enemies – I'm "
"not the one who puts weapons in their hands. Like me, they've chosen their "
"own path.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전사의 전쟁은 영예로운 것입니다. 화가나 소설가처럼 전사도 직업이지요! 그리고 적의 손에 무기를 쥐어준 것은 제가 아닙니다. 그들도 "
"자신의 길을 선택했을 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8d129f6e-5971-44d1-8047-4ff41fcdb45e"
msgid "\"Amiri eat like Kronkshaft!\""
msgstr "\"아미리가 크롱크샤프트처럼 밥을 먹는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "474faeac-6551-4689-bfa6-6830ec4c5dc5"
msgid "\"I'm hungry... What's a Kronkshaft?\""
msgstr "\"배고파... 크롱크샤프트가 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
msgctxt "1d727245-8886-4982-b2fe-df1151ac5870"
msgid ""
"\"You fight like others, share trophies with everyone, eat a lot! You are "
"just like proper she-goblin!\""
msgstr "\"너는 다른 사람들처럼 싸우고 승리를 모두와 나누고 밥을 엄청 많이 먹는다! 너는 여자 고블린과 똑같다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response_1
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c2ad1ccd-5145-4536-a527-3f7aa5e1625a"
msgid ""
"\"You bet! I'm not some Brevic damsel to whimper and play dress-up! Wait... "
"did you just call me a goblin?!\""
msgstr "\"그럼! 나는 질질 짜고 옷 입기 좋아하는 계집들과 다르다고! 잠깐... 너 나를 고블린이라고 했어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
msgctxt "1c7f5b4c-6c91-4643-9bc5-c7531b1cd722"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! Amiri! Teach me how to slash like you do! Hero will find use for that!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 아미리! 너처럼 칼을 휘두르고 싶어! 영웅이라면 그렇게 휘둘러야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "51a1bb37-8b86-494b-b722-90fe51572056"
msgid "\"Oh boy… You are bold like a Kellid but too weak to fight like us.\""
msgstr "\"오 이런... 너는 켈리드처럼 용감하지만 우리처럼 싸우기에는 너무 약해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
msgctxt "4585cced-c01c-4185-bd0c-69b6db61a16f"
msgid ""
"\"If Nok-Nok had mane like Amiri nobody would notice bumps that others left "
"on Nok-Nok's head!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 아미리처럼 용감했으면 녹-녹 머리 위의 혹을 보는 녀석은 없을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7d12d318-5a83-4845-a51d-9523c868bd89"
msgid ""
"\"Pff! Not a big deal! Find yourself a bear, tear a piece of his fur out, "
"and slap it on your head! Done!\""
msgstr "\"흥! 별 거 아니야! 곰을 찾아서 가죽을 찢어서 머리 위에 뒤집어 써! 됐지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
msgctxt "3ca214d5-f623-41dc-b697-4c7d3e0649ca"
msgid "\"Amiri, who do you worship? Which god likes stabbers like yours?\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 너는 누구를 숭배해? 어떤 신이 너 같이 칼을 휘둘러 대는 여자를 좋아하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "456f71d6-92ee-4c67-87de-6046b1768920"
msgid ""
"\"I worship Gorum, Our Lord in Iron. He laughs at toothpicks like these "
"kukris of yours — he has a better way about a bloodshed!\""
msgstr "\"나는 고룸을 숭배해. 쇠의 신이지. 네가 가진 쿠크리를 그가 보면 비웃을 거야. 그는 더 큰 검을 좋아하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
msgctxt "9b9921a1-ee6c-4951-ad8d-bf20c97824bb"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok have great respect for Amiri. She doesn't even reek like other "
"longshanks.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 아미리 존경한다. 다른 꺽다리처럼 악취 나지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b4d687a8-93e7-4263-af4a-cb6cc7ff8bc6"
msgid ""
"\"Did Nok-Nok just… approve the way I smell? Damn, I need a bath indeed.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이... 나를 닮아가나? 젠장. 목욕해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
msgctxt "494d9d80-a74e-4759-881a-1b8d63c8f636"
msgid ""
"\"Are all longshanks in you homelands like you, Amiri? If so, Nok-Nok would "
"love to go there!\""
msgstr "\"너희 고향 꺽다리들은 다 너랑 비슷하냐? 그러면 녹-녹 거기 가고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokAmiri/Banter_NokNokAmiri_Banter_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "847f689a-8150-4c40-b3b8-0667a552d84e"
msgid ""
"\"Nah. In my lands it's… like in your tribe, Nok-Nok. They don't respect "
"heroes.\""
msgstr "\"내 고향에서는... 너희 부족과 비슷해. 그들은 영웅을 존경하지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ecbf616d-e207-442e-ab44-3be6678183ad"
msgid "\"You shoot well. But bow is a weapon for cowards, not Heroes.\""
msgstr "\"너는 활을 잘 쏘는구나. 하지만 활은 겁쟁이들의 무기다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ae8daab6-4924-44ac-9ba5-d6e791c1acb9"
msgid ""
"\"I saw your kind hiding from enemies in dirt or pretending to be dead. "
"Don't speak to me of cowardice.\""
msgstr "\"네가 적들 앞에서 죽은 척을 하려고 흙을 묻히는 걸 봤다. 나를 겁쟁이라고 부르지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "330bf49f-36ab-4583-9ace-9329cb366d78"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! You shot a deer a while ago, yes? Where are his insides? Longshanks "
"don't eat those, I know that!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 전에 사슴을 쐈지? 사슴 내장 어딨어? 꺽다리들은 내장 안 먹는 거 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2a8e4524-66b4-4763-823c-e98e430007c6"
msgid "\"I used entrails for a stew. You ate with others. So don't beg.\""
msgstr "\"스튜 재료로 썼지. 너도 먹었다. 그러니까 달라고 하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8e2dea3d-8d9b-4276-aaa2-b157956712ee"
msgid ""
"\"I learned what happened to your child, Ekun, a shame. Now if you kept her "
"locked in a cage-\""
msgstr "\"네 아이들에게 무슨 일 일어났는지 안다. 안타깝다. 그러니까 여자를 우리에 가둬...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cdbd37a4-0d9d-4bc2-86d5-4e1a0be81964"
msgid "\"One more word and it'll be your last.\""
msgstr "\"한마디만 더 하면 죽을 줄 알아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d3ff9517-a280-41d5-b279-c76830da0472"
msgid "\"Ekun is not like other longshanks. Talks little. Good.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤은 다른 꺽다리와 다르다. 말 적다. 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6f8cdb8f-3b6b-4dd0-9185-6f1ee85717e9"
msgid "\"Hm.\""
msgstr "\"흠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "2683b566-69ce-4521-a662-f797a8a22442"
msgid "\"Stabber got dull. Nok-Nok needs new one, this one is rubbish.\""
msgstr "\"쑤시개가 무뎌졌다. 녹-녹 새거 필요해. 이건 이제 쓰레기다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d567dc99-94d0-4c3c-b321-cf6427639d2d"
msgid "[Sigh] \"Give your knife to me. Will sharpen it.\""
msgstr "[한숨] \"칼 나에게 줘. 갈아줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_05_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "00809866-593a-4f99-a438-b4bb40238918"
msgid ""
"\"Don't even think about it! I know you — you'll throw away a perfectly good "
"blade, and then steal some rubbish that won't even cut bread.\""
msgstr "\"하지 마라! 나 너 안다. 칼 잘 던지니까 무뎌진 쑤시개 훔쳐가서 쓰려고 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_06_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9f756aaf-956c-4b92-8109-22b28f716106"
msgid "\"Ekun doesn't like goblins. But goblins are not trolls! Why then?\""
msgstr "\"에쿤은 고블린 싫어한다. 하지만 고블린은 트롤 아니다! 왜 고블린 싫어해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokEkun/Banter_NokNokEkun_06_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c4ccee6b-13b1-4bdb-906d-251792545c06"
msgid "\"Because you are all beasts. You're just... tamed.\""
msgstr "\"너희들은 모두 짐승이기 때문이지. 너는... 길들여진 놈이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "03191e98-7197-49b5-b7e7-f69c06cf27c1"
msgid "\"Harrim, what do you mumble about? Want talk, talk loud!\""
msgstr "\"하림. 왜 웅얼거려? 말해라. 크게 말해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bd658f4b-59ce-47cc-b810-414d63d5f2ad"
msgid ""
"\"My words are not for mortal ears, Nok-Nok. I send my prayers beyond this "
"realm.\""
msgstr "\"나는 필멸자들을 위해 말하지 않아. 녹-녹. 나는 기도를 하고 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d50f5a06-88d2-46ff-8c63-05c4232a7be5"
msgid "\"Ahahahahaha, look! Harrim fall asleep! Look, look!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 봐라! 하림 잔다! 봐! 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2aae4534-922e-46a2-b092-bf8bb46aa181"
msgid ""
"\"I do not sleep, Nok-Nok. I am deep in my thoughts. Although I won't try to "
"explain the difference to you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 자는 게 아니야. 녹-녹. 나는 생각에 잠겼지. 그저 너에게 그 차이점을 말해주지 않은 것 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "c176d1e3-8e64-4ae6-8e51-0b315a4100c6"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes Nok-Nok thinks of goblin king and becomes mad! Grrr, want to "
"crush and slam all around! Break everything, burst, burn!\""
msgstr "\"가끔 녹-녹은 고블린 왕이 되고 마음대로 하는 상상을 한다! 다 부수고 내려치고 싶다! 모두 파괴하고 터뜨리고 불태운다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "498e2620-ea52-48ba-9432-bc0c048e7a33"
msgid ""
"\"Hm… now you look more like a follower of Rovagug than Lamashtu. But I like "
"your pursuit of the final end.\""
msgstr "\"흠... 이제는 라마슈투보다는 로바거그의 신도처럼 보이는군. 하지만 네 열정은 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_03_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9121dab0-b6e0-4724-b39b-306cb0e253af"
msgid ""
"\"I know what you mean! If you want, we can find some empty grove or a "
"wooded patch, and we can crush and burn it together!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 말인지 안다! 원한다면 마른 나무나 나뭇가지를 찾아서 불태우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e700a624-e74b-49ff-a56f-2b5d6df78f7b"
msgid ""
"\"There is a nest in Harrim's beard. Soon bird lays eggs. Mmmm, tasty.\""
msgstr "\"하림의 수염에는 둥지가 있다. 새가 알을 낳을 거다. 음. 맛있겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5985aa84-c7f9-4534-aec5-59170abe95fd"
msgid "\"Hm? There is no nest, my beard is just tangled.\""
msgstr "\"응? 둥지는 없어. 내 수염이 복슬한 것 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a62468a8-b663-4fdb-bf3f-efb891d9ef0b"
msgid "\"Harrim doesn't act like others of his kind. Like Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"하림은 드워프들과 다르다. 녹-녹 좋아한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9ef8c085-6a3a-4921-8f64-c3217569bb14"
msgid ""
"\"You are right in your observation. We both became exiles in our own "
"tribes. I don't regret this. Do you?\""
msgstr "\"잘 알아맞췄네. 우리는 부족과는 다른 외톨이들이지. 하지만 후회하지 않아. 너는 어떤가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_06_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fd7b72c3-a382-460c-880d-617a570dacff"
msgid ""
"\"Nobody believe Nok-Nok will become Hero. Even Nok-Nok doesn't sometimes. "
"But every day, remind self to try, and keep at it!\""
msgstr "\"누구도 녹-녹 영웅 될 거라 생각하지 않았다. 녹-녹도 못 믿었다. 하지만 매일 노력한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_06_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9a6d1773-ed31-4ae9-9a30-7dbedc55c387"
msgid ""
"\"Hold on to your values. When the whole world laughs at you, only the "
"strength of your beliefs will let you reach your goal.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 믿으라고. 세상이 너를 보고 웃을 때 네 믿음의 힘이 목적을 이루게 도울 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_06_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "adfb09f8-8174-4df0-9504-49ffac905692"
msgid ""
"\"You need to have a hero's heart to be a hero. But it's not important what "
"others call you. Just believe in yourself!\""
msgstr "\"영웅이 되기 위해서는 영웅처럼 용감해야 한다. 다른 녀석이 뭐라 하던 상관 없다. 너 자신을 믿어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6322f590-f6d5-4d96-97eb-c673070e9608"
msgid "\"Harrim sighs like belly is full. It is good?\""
msgstr "\"하림은 마치 배가 가득 찬 것처럼 한숨을 내쉬어. 그게 좋은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokHarrim/Banter_NokNokHarrim_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2daef409-b794-4da5-a12a-a309fd0dd128"
msgid ""
"\"I sigh for I am contemplating the emptiness which will consumes us all.\""
msgstr "\"내가 한숨을 짓는 건 우리 모두를 집어삼킬 공허를 내가 염려하기 때문이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7b19d30e-ad3a-4027-aedf-c8250cc7765e"
msgid "\"She-dead. Your smell is wide.\""
msgstr "\"시체 냄새. 사방에 썩은 내가 나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fd52475e-9cff-4583-b9bc-724b89c1920d"
msgid ""
"\"And I'm hearing this from somebody whose tribe wallows in the garbage of "
"other nations? Ha.\""
msgstr "\"인간의 나라에서 쓰레기 더미 속에 사는 녀석에게 그런 말을 듣다니? 하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8c2e0077-9ac9-400a-a4a2-e07be4651a98"
msgid ""
"\"Don't like deadshanks. If I die, I die for good. Don't want to be "
"deadshank and work for others.\""
msgstr "\"시체가 싫다. 죽으면 영원히 죽는 거다. 시체가 되어 다른 녀석을 위해 일하기 싫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "65eec009-89c2-4dee-86c6-3f1aea47ecde"
msgid ""
"\"Do not worry, beastling: nobody in his or her right mind will even think "
"of using your corpse.\""
msgstr "\"걱정 마. 누구도 네 시체에는 관심 없을 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4eaf9f4d-9269-49ce-85ad-bac0de1e75bc"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, she-dead. Can I become a lich? A Lich Hero! Servant to nobody, not "
"like some zombie.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 시체. 내가 리치 될 수 있어? 리치 영웅 되고 싶다! 좀비처럼 노예 되기 싫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "30c6c547-b168-4280-b014-31bbc353909a"
msgid ""
"\"The mere thought of such abomination appearing on Golarion fills me with "
"disgust. Or laughter. Can't make up my mind.\""
msgstr "\"그런 흉악한 생각이 역겹구나. 웃기기도 하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "81cb8da7-3897-4eba-bd9a-f448f24d15c0"
msgid ""
"\"Deadshanks… Nok-Nok wonder if dogs ever run off with bits of you. How you "
"get self back if dog bury your arm? Or leg?\""
msgstr "\"이봐... 네 시체를 개들이 물어뜯으면 어떨까. 개가 네 다리나 팔을 물어가면 어떡할래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJaethal/Banter_NokNokJaethal_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "80612e80-63f7-4b13-b430-7da72f5b97d1"
msgid ""
"\"You should be more concerned about what you'll do when I bury you, pest.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 묻어줄 때를 걱정해야 할 거다. 쓰레기 녀석.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7bb02702-5d88-443c-a516-a14c3ff5a9bc"
msgid ""
"\"Greet, word, word, big words, ask, extra words, extra words… ZZzzz-"
"hngGGggh-Ppbhww-ZZzzz… all asleep, but still extra words!\""
msgstr "\"말 정말 많다. 허풍 많고. 또 말한다... 쿨쿨... 드르렁... 퓨... 다 잔다. 근데 또 말한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8f8008b7-1bf4-4d0c-a22d-c8eb9fdb58d9"
msgid ""
"\"If you think this pitiful impersonation will hurt my feelings… hey! Stop "
"doing that! I don't act like this!\""
msgstr "\"그 멍청한 설명으로 내가 기분이 나쁠 거라 생각했다면... 이봐! 그만해! 나는 그렇게 말하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "cbdec7c6-3f91-4a9b-a6cc-5506331ebd54"
msgid ""
"\"You drink too much words. That's why you vomit with them all the time. "
"Drink less, then vomit less!\""
msgstr "\"너 말 너무 많이 들이킨다. 그래서 항상 말 토해낸다. 적게 마시면 토 적게 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "37abd1ce-6f84-4304-9fcb-4340048b1964"
msgid ""
"\"I will… consider your advice, Nok-Nok. Maybe it will come useful as an "
"example of primitive thinking in my future ethnographic guide.\""
msgstr "\"네 조언을... 생각해 보지. 아마도 원시인의 사고 방식을 연구하는 데 도움이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1f314dc7-508a-4fd3-a2c9-9e7b66c64dde"
msgid "\"Jub-Jub talk-talks make others angry. Nok-Nok wants do the same!\""
msgstr "\"줍-줍이 말이 다른 동료 화나게 한다. 녹-녹도 따라하고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2ead4f62-83e4-427d-ad68-27904c2ca629"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, my primitive critter: to achieve such a skill in sarcasm, one needs "
"outstanding talent as well as a brillian intellect, which, I am afraid, is "
"unattainable for those of your kind… hey! Stop pretending to be asleep, you "
"little pest!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 원시인이 지능을 요구하는 비꼬는 방법을 배우고 싶어하네. 너희 종에게는 미안하지만 불가능할 거야... 이봐! 자는 척 하지 마!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9aeb0bc8-24bb-4151-9253-c7e68c4ebc49"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok feels not so good. Nok-Nok will vomit. World is whirling. Head… "
"light…\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 기분 안 좋다. 녹-녹 토한다. 세상이 돈다. 머리가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "24bc65d3-23cd-4a9e-acb9-ec287e1c0d93"
msgid ""
"\"So it was you who stole my glasses! Take them off and give them back "
"before you break them!\""
msgstr "\"내 안경을 훔쳐간 게 너구나! 안경 벗고 다시 고쳐놔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4b23c630-daf9-4471-87a4-fe8a2773ead2"
msgid ""
"\"Jub-Jub, give me one of your glass thingies. I make you some great boom-"
"water. All your enemies will fall once you throw it!\""
msgstr "\"줍-줍아. 네 유리병 하나 줘 봐. 그걸로 폭탄 만들어줄게. 적들은 한번에 쓰러질 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "fcc204ba-37be-467f-ae5a-a37c8a2bcea1"
msgid "\"Do not even think of touching my alchemical bottles, you pest.\""
msgstr "\"내 실험용 플라스크를 만질 생각도 하지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_06_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "3c70fe2a-d519-43f6-913e-d00631c1f665"
msgid ""
"\"When Nok-Bok becomes a Hero, will he need someone to write of his "
"exploits? Like other longshank Heroes do?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 영웅 되면 전기 작가 필요해? 꺽다리 영웅들처럼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_06_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c692443d-277c-42a1-9a60-045da84cfbea"
msgid ""
"\"I would love to meet an author who agrees to this position. Especially "
"considering the fact that the salary consists of chewed bones and bitten off "
"fingers.\""
msgstr "\"그런 일을 하는 사람이 있다면 만나보고 싶군. 특히 월급이 씹힌 뼈와 물어뜯긴 손가락이라면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ba0fe836-8a72-4201-9a72-3b035ca08e3b"
msgid "\"What Jub-Jub doing? It fun? Involve stabbing?\""
msgstr "\"줍-줍이 뭐하냐? 재밌냐? 찌르는 거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c81a29a3-f2ad-4555-982c-bf21938e4361"
msgid ""
"\"Only if I stab you, idiot. Take your smell and… and… stand over there. Way "
"over there. In fact, just keep going, I'll tell you when to stop.\""
msgstr "\"너를 찔렀으면 좋겠다. 냄새 나니까... 저리 가있어. 저 쪽에. 아니면 계속 걸어가. 멈추라고 말할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7a5e8b26-2db8-42c9-99c0-ae298288e575"
msgid "\"Why Jub-Jub chewing backscratcher? Taste good?\""
msgstr "\"줍-줍은 왜 머리 긁개를 씹냐? 맛있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7533696d-690e-47b1-8644-f5c5c164dc47"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't a backscratcher, this is my favorite quill pen, you dolt. Wait… "
"why did you say backscratcher?\""
msgstr "\"그건 머리 긁개가 아니라 내 펜이야. 멍청아. 잠깐... 왜 이걸 머리 긁개라고 말하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4e23dc2e-b605-4efc-a24a-fef14fb45646"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok like camp. There is eating. And sleeping. And dreaming of sleeping "
"and eating.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 캠프 좋아한다. 먹을 거 있다. 잘 수 있다. 자고 먹는 꿈 꿀 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2c923d46-9522-4400-9668-0178d4dfe595"
msgid "\"Simple minds, simple pleasures.\""
msgstr "\"단순한 녀석.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokJubilost/Banter_NokNokJubilost_CBanter3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "47ec3ec3-b218-46d6-bc41-ce857e7fe44c"
msgid ""
"\"You're a lucky little devil. You get to just sit and eat. No one would "
"ever think of asking a goblin to cook...\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 운이 좋은 녀석이야. 그냥 앉아서 먹기만 하면 되잖아. 고블린에게 요리를 하라고 부탁하는 사람은 없지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6c1fb4f3-ce23-4f06-a2df-0736122e6a54"
msgid "\"Linzee writes again. Steals think-thoughts!\""
msgstr "\"린지가 다시 쓰기 시작한다. 생각 훔친다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b03ff298-da97-482d-9559-012acb6d78f7"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, now, now — don't worry, Nok-Nok. I can't steal something you don't "
"have.\""
msgstr "\"걱정마. 녹-녹. 있지도 않은 네 생각은 훔치지 못하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ae015584-6912-4954-998d-a496a484a24b"
msgid ""
"\"Halfshanks mix words worse than longshanks. But I won't help you with your "
"writing, Linzee. Not even if you ask!\""
msgstr "\"반쪽이는 꺽다리보다 말 많다. 하지만 너에게 도움 주지 않을 거다. 부탁도 하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b4a92777-9e29-4e74-bda4-b57171e288fb"
msgid "\"Oh, thank you, merciful Shelyn!\""
msgstr "\"오. 고맙습니다. 셸린님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8bbb1841-0dff-4da2-9ddc-e4033036daf6"
msgid "\"I know why you vomit with words. You are cursed!\""
msgstr "\"왜 네가 말 토해내는지 안다. 너는 저주 받았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e7fce12e-2a35-42ab-a61e-e128df9774e6"
msgid "\"The only thing I am cursed with is your presence!\""
msgstr "\"네가 말을 거니 저주 받은 것처럼 기분이 더러워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5a43c903-7071-4eaf-85ee-b71e0b06d4cf"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, why are you not afraid of Linzee? She writes about you! Steals "
"your think-thoughts!\""
msgstr "\"{name}. 린지가 무섭지 않아? 너에 대해 글을 쓴다! 네 생각 훔친다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "08682c86-2192-46c3-b931-2178adbe97ff"
msgid ""
"\"I don't steal anything! I am trying to describe our adventures for future "
"generations. I even have this part about you… oh! Sorry, I didn't mean to "
"scare you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아무것도 훔치지 않았어! 나는 후손들을 위해 우리의 모험을 쓰는 거야. 너도 이야기에 있다고... 오! 미안. 겁 주려던 건 "
"아니었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a58f291a-4294-4523-87cf-9de18e859cee"
msgid ""
"\"Bad day today. Cought nothing. Ate little. Torn strap. Got blister. Made "
"hole in armor.\""
msgstr "\"운이 나쁜 날이다. 아무것도 못 얻었다. 조금 먹었다. 갑옷 줄 끊어졌다. 갑옷에 구멍났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3d9b092b-b7a3-41f5-98ba-96c48d417706"
msgid ""
"\"Oh well, now I feel sorry for you — even after all those nasty things you "
"told me! Cheer up, Nok-Nok, you'll be alright!\""
msgstr "\"오. 안 됐다! 힘내! 녹-녹! 괜찮을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_06_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "15a6a143-c3f7-49cf-ab9f-abfffade656f"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you not file your teeth, Linzee? Could bite then. Useful in fight. "
"And eating. Both!\""
msgstr "\"왜 이빨 뾰족하게 갈지 않는 거야? 그럼 싸울 때도 먹을 때도 씹기 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_06_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0d6efec3-e662-4194-aee9-37a85e7a7920"
msgid ""
"\"Ew! I don't even want to think about that! If my songs and spells aren't "
"enough for you, go find another bard!\""
msgstr "\"으유! 상상도 하기 싫어! 내 노래와 마법이 충분하지 않다면 다른 바드를 찾아봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "93a3cb79-ceb5-42d7-bfc5-d2097adeb4a9"
msgid ""
"\"Why Linzee smell so bad – ugh, like flowers. Clean flowers. Stings eyes.\""
msgstr "\"왜 린지는 꽃같이 악취가 나지. 꽃 치워라. 눈 아프다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokLinzi/Banter_NokNokLinzi_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cf213ebf-3c3d-4492-a6d4-8b32dca43e39"
msgid ""
"\"I will take that compliment in the spirit it was given. So thank you.\""
msgstr "\"칭찬으로 받아들일게. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "83650632-39db-428b-80a6-cc79747225f8"
msgid ""
"\"When I stayed in village, I saw nothing. With you, Nok-Nok sees more "
"during one day than during the whole life!\""
msgstr "\"내가 마을에 살았을 때 아무 경험도 하지 못했어. 너와 같이 있으면 녹-녹 많이 경험한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "991468bd-e6d1-4c74-9f93-dc6dc562da7b"
msgid ""
"\"That's why goblin king would never become a Hero. He sees nothing beyond "
"his hind!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 고블린 왕이 영웅이 되지 못하는구나. 우물 안 개구리라서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "dbf63b5a-65a4-4e10-a702-d0db33ec5556"
msgid ""
"\"I came from a tribe of nomads. I saw much when I lived with them. — "
"Although not as much as I saw once I set off into the world...\""
msgstr "\"나는 유목 민족 출신이야. 그들과 살 때 많은 것을 보았지. 이 세상에 왔을 때는 더 많이 봤지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "827a73c9-368a-43f0-b1c9-e6a15962da41"
msgid ""
"\"I came from a tribe of nomads. I saw much when I lived with them. — "
"Although not as much as I saw once I set off into the world...\""
msgstr "\"나는 유목 민족 출신이야. 그들과 살 때 많은 것을 보았지. 이 세상에 왔을 때는 더 많이 봤지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8e7cb6b1-99d7-42db-86fc-4db680696669"
msgid ""
"\"Haven't sacrificed anything to Mother in a long time. Need to find "
"someone. Someone… special.\""
msgstr "\"오랫 동안 어머니에게 제물을 바치지 못했다. 찾아야 한다. 뭔가 특별한 걸로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9333d380-a0da-421a-b8a7-2a37aede11f6"
msgid ""
"\"If Linzee disappears everyone notices. Shame. Would make great sacrifice.\""
msgstr "\"린지가 사라지면 모두 알아챈다. 아깝다. 좋은 제물이었는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "3c977b59-c71c-49f3-9589-4587ba55c504"
msgid ""
"\"I heard that once, far away from here, goblins nearly killed all "
"longshanks. Marched from forests, burned down villages, conquered almost "
"everything.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 먼 곳에서 들었는데 고블린이 꺽다리 모두 죽일 뻔했다. 숲에서 몰려나와서 마을 불태우고 모두 정복했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ca30fc29-4b10-4ba7-907c-33142ca1120c"
msgid ""
"\"Although lost all in the end. Longshanks woke up and bashed everyone. As "
"usual.\""
msgstr "\"결국 마지막에 다 잃었지만. 꺽다리 다시 일어서서 반격했다. 언제나 그랬다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b52e442b-9fd3-42b3-b529-f51067c89781"
msgid ""
"\"I need to think of a title for myself. Nok-Nok Allterrifying. Or Nok-Nok "
"Allconquering.\""
msgstr "\"나를 위한 책을 생각해야겠어. 무시무시한 녹-녹. 아니면 정복자 녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "18d062af-3b23-4c05-ab7d-c97361dfd0c4"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok Fearsomefullering? Hmmmm. Needs more think-thoughts.\""
msgstr "\"잔인한 녹-녹? 흠... 생각 더 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "af3b1fbd-fead-471b-a24a-379156ea9913"
msgid ""
"\"I had a dream recently. That I am a Hero already. And battle a dragon! On "
"the back of owlbear!\""
msgstr "\"꿈을 꿨어. 내가 영웅이 되는 꿈. 그리고 용과 싸웠다! 아울베어 등에 타고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokNokNok/Banter_NokNokNokNok_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "60330647-49cc-4553-875f-766b173935cc"
msgid ""
"\"Then I fell off his back and woke up. During the most interesting part!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 이 녀석 등에서 떨어져서 일어났다. 가장 재밌는 부분에서 깼다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6faf6716-ed0c-416a-b89c-be28ae020a57"
msgid "\"Why do you comb your hair, Tavia? Will tangle anyway!\""
msgstr "\"머리를 빗는 게 어때? 옥타비아? 결국에 헝클어지겠지만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "271f3742-7a39-45af-a807-77598f4b814f"
msgid "\"Because I… like it? What kind of question is that anyway?!\""
msgstr "\"내가 좋아해서라고? 무슨 질문이 그래?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "c4c348e8-7aa7-4682-ab8d-7d34cbaa7809"
msgid ""
"\"Tavia likes shiny thingies. On her fingers, in her ears. Nok-Nok likes "
"also. Look, made myself a thingie on a rope.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아 반짝이는 거 좋아한다. 손가락과 귀에 반짝인다. 녹-녹도 좋아한다. 봐라. 내 로프에 반짝이 붙였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "492478ea-8f16-4476-9d8f-1028c9bd4d1c"
msgid "\"If I had kids, I would scare them with goblin jewelry.\""
msgstr "\"내가 자식이 있었다면 고블린 장신구로 겁을 줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1af70592-de73-48e0-9e44-4c06841fed6f"
msgid ""
"\"Yuk! Pshaw! Nasty! Why does Tavia eat this? Smells of flowers! Faugh!\""
msgstr "\"우엑! 더러워! 옥타비아는 어떻게 이런 걸 먹냐? 꽃 냄새 난다! 역겨워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "be2ada0c-905e-4fd9-af26-d13a40593fb1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no! That's my lipstick! From Absalom no less, made with rose oil! And "
"you stole it… from me? No, I don't want it back, you can keep it.\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 그건 내 립스틱이야! 장미 오일로 만든 압살롬제 립스틱이라고! 그걸 훔쳐간 거야? 아니야. 돌려줄 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "16e6dec6-878c-4bc6-90d0-4baf5d3daa32"
msgid ""
"\"You are like Linzee. Also stick your nose in a book. Still better than "
"halfshank.\""
msgstr "\"너는 린지와 비슷하다. 맨날 책 읽는다. 그래도 반쪽이보다는 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8141c4e7-1448-4031-989c-b5434ebbbdb6"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! Don't talk of Linzi like that! Can't stay quiet about her… you are "
"not in love with her, are you?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 린지를 반쪽이라고 부르지마! 계속 그렇게 흉을 보는 이유가... 린지를 좋아하니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "06321c86-6ffa-4061-b3a4-a43c72867846"
msgid ""
"\"Tavia, you smell of soap. Why? If you don't wash yourself you start to "
"smell like surroundings — less noticeable!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아. 비누 냄새 난다. 왜? 씻지 않으면 흙 냄새 나서 위장도 쉬운데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ad91d6f9-0732-4b0c-9ab0-764e4514896d"
msgid ""
"\"How do I explain this? Imagine you were forced to wash yourself all your "
"life. And then suddenly you don't have to! You wouldn't do something you "
"don't like, would you? So it is with me. Only the other way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 설명해야 하지? 매일 씻어야 한다고 생각해봐. 그리고 어느 날 갑자기 씻지 않는다고 생각해 봐. 하던 걸 안하니까 이상하지? "
"나도 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b0cf03a4-6e1b-487c-953e-acea714ec5f0"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok fall when making camp. In big puddle. Got… clean.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 캠프 설치할 때 넘어졌다. 웅덩이에 빠졌다... 깨끗해졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokOctavia/Banter_NokNokOctavia_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "35189ff3-ba8a-4c8a-9473-2a454151b00a"
msgid "\"Maybe the gods do answer our prayers.\""
msgstr "\"신만이 우리의 기도에 답하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "af196a0c-5704-44ec-9bdc-df0e2d5f9eb5"
msgid ""
"\"You speak strange sometimes. Mix up your words. But in a funny way. Is it "
"magic?\""
msgstr "\"가끔 이상한 소리를 하더라. 단어를 웃기게 말하던데. 그거 마법이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e86c695a-9332-4de5-8254-73885e6a2991"
msgid "\"Ha! This fellow has a taste in humor! Not like all of you!\""
msgstr "\"하! 유머 감각이 있구나! 모두 너와 같지는 않지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "766abc5d-8467-412a-b24e-71766945d367"
msgid ""
"\"You nearly cooked my hind, longshank! Watch where you throw your zaps!\""
msgstr "\"감전 될 뻔했잖아! 조심하고 다녀라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "33e68c09-cb2c-436f-87f7-4bde218d2545"
msgid "\"Then don't get in my way, gnat, or I'll fry you for good!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 길 막지 마! 안 그러면 진짜 번개로 튀겨줄 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1e587424-f112-4c42-b9b3-8f7c0354ee85"
msgid ""
"\"Still rings in my ears from Reg-Reg's zaps. Mighty stuff! Want some!\""
msgstr "\"렉 렉이의 손이 아직도 눈에 선하다. 번개로 고기 구워먹고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "047113bd-41f7-4330-be84-86668de73583"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh no. You impose enough risk on all of us already. Would you have "
"lightnings, I wouldn't be able to sleep at all!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼. 그러면 모두 위험해져. 번개가 치면 잠을 잘 수도 없고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1528104c-9f0f-4b3e-b89d-77c019bc364c"
msgid ""
"\"Fought with orcs once. Stupid longshanks. Strong. Stupid. Slide between "
"legs, get behind, stab in back — orc is dead!\""
msgstr "\"한 번은 오크와 싸웠지. 멍청한 꺽다리. 강하고, 멍청하지. 다리 사이로 슬라이드해서 뒤로 가, 찔렀어. 오크는 죽었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2003c838-4e6c-46b3-9949-00400d50b5f0"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't seen real orcs from mighty clans. Those are the worthy "
"opponents! And their backs made from stone you can't stab! What? That's "
"true, I tell you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 진짜 막강한 부족의 오크를 본 적 없을걸. 그것들은 가치있는 적들이야. 그리고 그들의 등짝은 돌로 되어 있어서 찌를 수 없어. "
"뭐? 이건 사실이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "29c9cd34-6f92-4ab5-b53c-639047f05bd7"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar is the best with words among other longshanks. Doesn't mix words "
"as much. Almost as good as goblins from my tribe.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르는 꺽다리 중에서 말 제일 잘한다. 제일 알아듣기 쉽다. 우리 부족의 고블린들처럼 말 잘한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0e7971f9-5146-4bf7-9d88-d8851d1b3c9d"
msgid ""
"\"Did you just, what, complimented me?! Keep your 'praise' to yourself, "
"shatshank!\""
msgstr "\"그거 칭찬이야?! 칭찬은 됐어. shatshank!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_CBanter1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a9461a0e-7892-43c2-a77c-f74df4230a8a"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok like camp. What is in the pot?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 캠프를 좋아해. 냄비에 든 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokRegongar/Banter_NokNokRegongar_CBanter1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e6afdddc-dcbf-494a-9eeb-2e52da21c682"
msgid "\"Goblin, if you keep asking.\""
msgstr "\"고블린.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8f5405fc-e987-4a63-abe7-2c2c033697f7"
msgid "\"Is your Sarenrae better than Lamashtu? Let's compare!\""
msgstr "\"너의 서렌레이가 라마슈투보다 낫다고? 한 번 비교해보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "88a1877f-a67d-4cc2-bb6c-3b8e4e45c37f"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to use my goddess' name in vain, Nok-Nok. Judging by what I "
"know about Lamashtu, you shouldn't as well.\""
msgstr "\"내 여신의 이름을 팔고 싶지 않아. 녹-녹. 너도 네 여신을 팔고 싶지는 않겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6f16c57d-8ff7-40ce-8de8-af347cfb2d03"
msgid ""
"\"Eestian mumbles mumbles mumbles all the time. At dawn. At dusk. Should "
"sacrifice something, would made more sense!\""
msgstr "\"리스티안 하루 종일 중얼댄다. 해 질 때까지. 해 뜰 때까지. 제물 바치면 더 나을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "95c2dc10-43ed-42c5-ae36-6e4f0d1e1017"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Tristian, Nok-Nok. At least learn it before lecturing me about "
"the proper religious rites.\""
msgstr "\"내 이름은 트리스티안이야. 녹-녹. 나한테 종교 의식을 가르치려면 공부를 더 하는 게 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0875a6af-a260-477b-8a0b-d88ae6826abd"
msgid "\"You can heal. That good! Hero needs sidelings like you to help!\""
msgstr "\"너는 치료할 줄 안다. 치료 좋다! 영웅은 너 같은 도우미 필요하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5f493b9a-e5dc-4a05-842c-d1fa1841fe04"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone understands the language of mercy — even such outrageous "
"creatures as goblins.\""
msgstr "\"모두가 자비의 언어를 이해하지. 고블린 같은 흉한 괴물도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5394d175-760b-49aa-9a2a-723263df261b"
msgid "\"Eestian, where does Sarenrae live? On the sun?\""
msgstr "\"리스티안. 서렌레이 어디서 살아? 해 위에서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a923dbdc-7619-4764-9752-ae1e122a939e"
msgid ""
"\"No, Nok-Nok. But once I heard a story of a powerful wizard that made his "
"home on the sun.\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 녹-녹. 하지만 강력한 마법사가 해 위에 집을 만들었다는 이야기는 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "06e4ec9d-e880-436e-be90-8ac092a2530c"
msgid ""
"\"Would I worship fire goddess, I would not heal. I would burn everything! "
"Bam! Whoosh! All become ashes!\""
msgstr "\"불의 여신 숭배하면 나 치료 안 해. 그러면 모두 태워버릴 거야! 쾅! 활활! 모두 재로 만들 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9ede4362-bd8d-4587-a288-082a73dca51a"
msgid ""
"\"There are followers of Sarenrae that prefer… her other aspects. But she "
"definitely won't rejoice at an arsonist joining her worshipers.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 다른 면을 숭배하는 자도 있지. 하지만 그녀는 방화범은 받지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_06_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fbcc197b-ad66-4651-a90b-da417e86b09d"
msgid "\"Look, Eestian! I made Lamashtu symbol! Like yours!\""
msgstr "\"리스티안! 나 라마슈투 상징 만들었다! 너처럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokTristian/Banter_NokNokTristian_06_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d74ba4d6-3ffb-49b0-a3bb-bf9a261dc105"
msgid ""
"\"Very… very beautiful, Nok-Nok. I especially like this piece of glass you "
"plunged in the middle of rat's head. Now would you please take it away from "
"me.\""
msgstr "\"정말... 잘 만들었구나. 쥐의 머리 중앙에 박은 유리조각이 마음에 들어. 이제 저리 치워줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "bc76dee6-0177-46f4-8b25-793f8490e712"
msgid "\"Shiny metals. Shiny hair. Shiny face. Bweh!\""
msgstr "\"빛나는 쇠. 빛나는 머릿결. 빛나는 얼굴. 와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "24fe82b2-cce1-4464-b566-988c45099220"
msgid ""
"\"I wish half of my unwelcome suitors share your disgust with everything you "
"mentioned.\""
msgstr "\"내가 싫어하는 사람들이 당신 말을 들었으면 좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "82283568-94ea-4654-91e8-81af98c98633"
msgid ""
"\"You, like me, wasn't raised in a cage. So you wandered. Adventured. Nok-"
"Nok and strawhead are alike.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나처럼 우리에서 자랐지. 그래서 방랑한다. 모험한다. 녹-녹과 빨대 머리 비슷하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d42cfda7-7ca1-49aa-86eb-a53185494d2b"
msgid "\"Hm. I prefer to think otherwise.\""
msgstr "\"흠. 나는 그렇게 생각하지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_03_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "58382fc7-6b14-4455-80cc-4ed8ee1745ae"
msgid ""
"\"Strawhead wears these metals on herself to hide. Haven't seen such things "
"on goblins. Goblins know how to hide without those.\""
msgstr "\"빨대 머리 쇠판 뒤에 숨으려고 쇠판을 입는다. 고블린은 그런 거 안 입는다. 고블린은 그거 없어도 잘 숨어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_03_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "007eade2-8205-4144-beb7-65d8f6ddf4d3"
msgid ""
"\"Do you mean my armor? It's not for hiding, it's for protection. The same "
"function your thick skull provides.\""
msgstr "\"내 갑옷을 말하는 겁니까? 이건 숨기 위한 게 아니라 보호하기 위한 겁니다. 당신의 두개골도 같은 기능을 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_04_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "252acb82-fd38-4e54-b83c-110a30415a64"
msgid "\"So many metals… would make a lot of stabbers of those!\""
msgstr "\"쇠가 많다... 그걸로 쑤시개 많이 만들 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_04_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6cc2f8fb-18f2-40f8-abfd-912efe94de6c"
msgid ""
"\"I warn you, Nok-Nok… any piece of my armor goes missing, you will regret "
"it!\""
msgstr "\"경고하겠습니다. 녹-녹. 내 갑옷의 어떤 부분이라도 없어진다면 후회할 줄 아십시요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_05_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8f020338-c5b8-4177-957f-46d600093594"
msgid "\"Auch, a bruise. But the ear is still here at least.\""
msgstr "아야. 멍들었네. 최소한 귀는 멀쩡히 있어."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_05_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "10f6a323-6228-4096-81dc-aa824ba2cd95"
msgid ""
"\"I know that I just waste my words… but didn't you think of entering combat "
"with less abandon? You almost got your hand cut off in the last fight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 내가 말을 낭비하고 있다는 걸 알지만, 그렇게 무턱대고 전투에 뛰어들지 않을 수 없어? 너 저번 싸움에선 손이 잘릴 뻔했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/NokNokValerie/Banter_NokNokValerie_05_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "82625f2a-075e-40e0-9aa9-b61761990742"
msgid ""
"\"Let me see to your wound. And don't tear off the dressing, please. And "
"don't hang dead mice on it either.\""
msgstr "\"네 상처를 좀 보자. 그리고 제발 옷은 찢지 마. 그리고 죽은 쥐를 매달아놓지도 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9e74e105-a1ed-41a4-8ff2-ab484d32f76c"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, you are very brave, but why don't you think about what you're doing "
"before you punch someone in the face?\""
msgstr "아미리. 넌 용감해. 하지만 사람의 면상에 주먹질을 하기 전에 네가 뭘 하고 있는지 생각해보는 걸 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6d9c6b22-5ed7-4c95-b92d-420e5471a4fc"
msgid ""
"\"Naah. If I think too much, I get a headache. – And when I punch someone's "
"jaw, it disappears.\""
msgstr "\"에이, 내가 그렇게 생각을 많이 한다면 두통을 느낄 걸. 그리고 내가 누군가의 턱에 주먹질을 하면 그게 사라진다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8861412e-82bc-4f57-ad94-e513f774f53e"
msgid ""
"\"What you've said about your childhood is just mind-boggling! Do all the "
"northern tribes treat their women like that?\""
msgstr "\"네가 네 어린시절에 대해 얘기하는 것은 상상도 안 돼! 모든 북부 부족의 여인들이 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ef746fc1-4e6c-4eb9-919e-6e7b7ac173bc"
msgid ""
"\"Well, no, not all of them. I'm the lucky one – I was born in the most "
"savage tribe in the whole country! Even our neighbors looked at us like "
"we're goblins!\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄, 아니, 모두는 아냐. 난 운이 좋은 편이지. 나는 모든 지역에서 가장 야만스러운 부족에서 태어났어. 우리 이웃들조차도 우릴 "
"무슨 고블린 보듯이 했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6a46ecad-d97a-4969-b492-c2cead8bd402"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Amiri! Why don't we go to a fashionable dress shop once we get to the "
"city. I promise, we'll make a real beauty out of you!\""
msgstr "\"이봐 아미리! 도시에 가면 세련된 옷가게에 가보는 게 어때? 내가 약속하는데, 널 정말 아름답게 꾸밀 수 있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d8dda2ef-7ece-4faa-9b76-d38d7471ced8"
msgid ""
"\"What? You want me to pull on a dress? Maybe I should start brushing my "
"teeth too?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 내가 드레스를 입길 바란다고? 아마 내 이빨도 닦아야겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a4bdaa81-af13-41a0-8127-7745852f70aa"
msgid "\"Have you counted how many you've killed during your journeys?\""
msgstr "\"여행중에 얼마나 많은 것들을 죽였는지 세어본 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "85857712-ed26-42dc-96ec-e2f2fa7aea75"
msgid ""
"\"Um... A lot. Why would I count? My job is to swing my sword. Let Pharasma "
"count the dead.\""
msgstr "\"음... 많이! 내가 그걸 왜 세? 내 일은 검을 휘두르는 거지. 파라스마가 죽은 이들을 세게 두자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fdcdf68c-c593-4d9d-b389-847f656811e3"
msgid "\"Your muscles are to die for! Can I touch them?\""
msgstr "\"네 근육은 정말 끝내준다! 만져바도 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "add180c3-bad0-4bfe-b426-af7311dddf2f"
msgid "\"Hell no! You and Regongar both – keep your hands away from me!\""
msgstr "\"아니, 절대 안돼! 너와 레곤가르 둘 다. 내게서 손 떼라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f706f42c-7751-4f5b-8015-c9a947cac7fa"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, I've been meaning to ask you for a while now. Do you do anything "
"special to style your hair?\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 물어볼 게 있어. 머리에 뭐 바르는 거 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAmiri/Banter_OctaviaAmiri_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "69b1c72b-1bf5-4fc5-ad88-a70294d586f2"
msgid ""
"\"You bet! You grab an enemy, you head-butt him in the stomach — and my "
"style is good and done!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 적을 잡으면 적의 피가 머리에 붙지. 그러면 헤어 스타일의 완성이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAngel/Banter_OctaviaAngel_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "00a1f25d-c117-449d-89e0-caaa6b4167b9"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, you become so thoughtful whenever I speak of freedom. Why is "
"that?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안, 내가 자유 얘기를 하면 항상 생각에 잠기던데. 왜 그런 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaAngel/Banter_OctaviaAngel_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3090b83d-8c91-424d-aa9a-ca2c440600d6"
msgid ""
"\"I often ask myself what freedom means, and what its true value might be. "
"For me, it's the chance to follow my heart and turn away from evil things.\""
msgstr "\"종종 자유의 가치와 의미를 자문하곤 하거든. 내게 자유는, 마음 가는대로 행동하고 악의 유혹에서 벗어날 기회야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "46506b6c-51e5-4631-81aa-2ccd265b578f"
msgid ""
"\"I think your wolf isn't a regular animal. There's so much human in him!\""
msgstr "\"네 늑대는 그냥 동물이 같지가 않아. 안에 사람이라도 들어 있는 것 같다니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b07b0d18-1931-4eec-a5d8-e0bd4854bfb1"
msgid ""
"\"Some believe people can be reborn as animals. Could it be true? I don't "
"know.\""
msgstr "\"사람이 동물로 환생한다고 믿는 이들도 있지. 사실일까? 나도 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "99d4b400-1d95-4788-b0c7-3c7af4ef5b4c"
msgid "\"Ekun, can you smile at all? Try it, it's easy!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤, 웃기가 그렇게 어려워? 한번 해봐! 쉬워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "85ba7bc3-f9dc-4889-a074-b143f22a055c"
msgid "\"I can smile. I just don't see a reason.\""
msgstr "\"웃을 순 있지. 하지만 이유없이 웃지 않을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "76b735ee-0b0c-45aa-95ba-795c952915e6"
msgid ""
"\"You know what I think, Ekun? We need to pick a moment, drag you into the "
"tavern and get you hammered. Maybe you'll stop being so grouchy for a moment."
"\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 내가 무슨 생각하는지 알아? 너를 술집에 데려가서 취할 때까지 먹이는 거야. 그러면 잠시라도 무뚝뚝하지 않겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f013dfa2-20fc-49a2-be05-b0a3c3dbf6a6"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I appreciate your concern. One day I will go to the tavern with "
"you. I promise.\""
msgstr "\"걱정해줘서 고마워. 언젠가 너와 함께 술집에 가지. 약속해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "35f437ec-14e2-47c1-b820-b332bf372ebf"
msgid ""
"\"Enough thinking about bad things! If I'd accepted my fate for even a "
"moment when I was enslaved by the Technic League, I would have been broken "
"and turned into a helpless toy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"끔찍한 생각은 그만하자! 기술 연맹 노예였을 때 운명에 순응했다면 지금쯤 난 폐인이 돼서 주인 말에 복종하는 장난감이 되었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4a7a0e6f-4566-45dd-b73d-e2c3bfa1dcd6"
msgid ""
"\"You've endured much pain, Octavia. Perhaps even more than me. My family "
"died, yes. But at least they didn't betray me.\""
msgstr "\"넌 많은 고통을 견뎌왔지, 옥타비아. 어쩌면 나보다도 더. 내 가족들이 죽었지만 최소한 날 배신하진 않았으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e24f78ac-480b-4791-abb8-1a281e617a8a"
msgid ""
"\"You're both right and wrong, Octavia. One should never lose hope. But "
"unless you think about bad things, and remember the woes that have happened "
"and could happen, then we'll never be able to learn from our mistakes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞는 얘긴데, 틀리기도 해. 옥타비아. 희망을 잃어선 안 되지. 하지만 안 좋은 일을 되새기면서 또 이런 일이 일어나진 않을까 "
"걱정하지 않으면, 우리는 실수로부터 깨닫지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "94994eea-390d-473c-bb91-16de655791b1"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Ekun, I'm glad you're with us. Too bad we never met earlier.\""
msgstr "\"그거 알아, 에쿤? 너와 같이 여행하게 돼서 기뻐. 더 일찍 만나지 못한 게 아쉬울 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b09e6be8-8a2b-4eb6-b94a-4ef881ae51eb"
msgid "\"Me too. You're a good friend.\""
msgstr "\"나도 그래. 너는 좋은 친구야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "88e8a6ff-229c-44dc-8a20-5d6d1ccc6db6"
msgid ""
"\"And have you ever thought about... starting a new family? What if you find "
"another place you could call home?\""
msgstr "\"그런데 새로운... 가족을 꾸릴 생각은 안 들어? 고향이라 부를 만한 곳을 다시 찾아보는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5e1c303e-677b-4689-b019-d927bb480b02"
msgid ""
"\"I've lost much. But I survived. I wouldn't survive again. I'm better off "
"alone.\""
msgstr "\"난 많은 걸 잃었어. 하지만 살아남았지. 그런 일은 다시는 없었으면 해. 난 혼자인 편이 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "24634393-2add-418f-8b8e-d20436edc2f9"
msgid "\"Oh! I think I saw a snake! Careful! Ekun!\""
msgstr "\"어! 뱀을 본 것 같아! 조심해, 에쿤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "734813fb-59e7-4932-b2ce-2bf9d7840dff"
msgid "\"That's a legless lizard, not a snake. No venom.\""
msgstr "\"뱀이 아니라 발 없는 도마뱀일 거야. 독은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "df9a2cb6-1eb7-40d3-9f3d-59fa0b702f2c"
msgid ""
"\"And have you thought about returning to your home town? There must still "
"be people there who you know.\""
msgstr "\"고향에 돌아가겠다는 생각해봤어? 거긴 지인이 있을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaEkun/Banter_OctaviaEkun_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ccc9ab33-f187-49de-849a-be4ad9f101ec"
msgid "\"No. Many died. For others, I died. I couldn't go back.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 대부분이 죽었다. 살아남은 이도 있지만 그들에게 나는 죽은 것으로 알려졌지. 돌아갈 수 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1aaab834-9dc6-4ab1-93fe-167477d9fd81"
msgid "\"Harrim, smile! Your acid looks are going to sour the soup!\""
msgstr "\"하림, 좀 웃어. 네 썩은 표정 때문에 스프도 짜게 식어버릴 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "08c4695c-2211-4170-b254-c8dc9dccee66"
msgid ""
"\"Do you think soup can get better with a smile? If that were true, then "
"next to you it would turn into a roast.\""
msgstr "\"웃으면 스프가 맛있어지나? 그게 진짜면, 네 옆에 있는 고기는 저절로 구워지겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e3ead47f-24b2-4e80-a292-946a61841537"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you so concerned about death? There are so many interesting things "
"in life! I don't understand how one can die without trying Absalom's famous "
"blueberry cakes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 죽음만 생각해? 삶에는 흥미로운 게 많아! 난 어째서 사람들이 압살롬의 유명한 블루베리 케이크를 먹어보지도 않고 죽는지 이해를 "
"못하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "767dc5b2-fbf2-4816-a14a-f49eda8a23ce"
msgid ""
"\"Blueberry cakes as the meaning of life? Hmm... There is something in this. "
"I suppose even the end of times would be more fun with a blueberry cake in "
"your hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"블루베리 케이크가 인생에 무슨 의미가 있나? 흠... 이것엔 뭔가 있군. 내 생각에 네게 블루베리 케이크가 있다면 종말도 더 재밌어 "
"질 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "47d2183f-3bec-48d1-b3be-ae797fa3d90f"
msgid ""
"\"You know, sometimes I think all your gloom and fatalism is just a mask. "
"And underneath it all you're just scared. You're simply afraid to live!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신도 알겠지만, 난 당신의 어둠과 운명론이 모두 가면에 불과하다는 생각해요. 그 가면 밑에서 당신은 모든 것을 두려워하고 있는 "
"거죠. 간단히 말해서 당신은 산다는 것 자체를 두려워하고 있는 거라고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "23cc90d1-b3db-485c-8386-a9ae4998d3e4"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not afraid to live, Octavia. But I'm also not afraid to die. That is "
"the great gift of Groetus. The unfairness and cruelty of this world don't "
"make me sad any more, because I know – sooner or later we all will die.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아, 나는 삶이 두렵지 않네. 그렇다고 죽음이 두려운 것도 아니고. 그것은 그로투스의 위대한 선물이니까 말일세. 이 세계의 "
"불공평함과 잔인함은 이제 더 이상 날 슬프게 하지 않네. 왜냐하면 늦든 이르든 우리 모두 언젠가는 죽을 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "aa9787b5-211f-4b44-b502-fcb11e246ce3"
msgid ""
"\"What do you think, Harrim – if we're all meant to die, how will it happen?"
"\""
msgstr "\"당신은 어떻게 생각해요, 하림. 우리 모두가 죽는 걸 바란다면 어떻게 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "efec75d7-1f5b-417b-8537-42f44c9a1467"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know, I'm not a prophet. I simply follow the will of Groetus. "
"Whatever end is prepared for me, I only hope to face it with dignity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠네, 난 예언자가 아니야. 그저 그로투스의 의지를 따를 뿐이지. 어떤 종말이 나에게 예정되어 있다고 해도, 나는 그저 그 앞에 "
"의연하기를 바랄 뿐이네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "53568025-a27a-4b9b-bd2a-88b2884d32dd"
msgid ""
"\"Do you really not like to have fun – or you just don't know how to? Do you "
"want me to hold a festival for you when we get back to the capital? We can "
"stuff our faces, dance, and get drunk! What do you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 즐기는 걸 싫은 거예요, 아니면 그게 뭔지 모르는 거예요? 아니면 우리가 수도로 돌아갔을 때 축제라도 열어줄까요? 우린 "
"배터지게 먹고, 춤추고, 취할 수 있어요! 어때요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "582ccd66-a192-46b0-837b-deb236e18eed"
msgid ""
"\"I say you are very kind, Octavia, but such help will do me no good. I'll "
"only get a headache from the music and dancing. As for the drinking... Hm, "
"hm... Well, I better keep away from that too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"친절하구만, 옥타비아. 하지만 그런 것들은 내게 그다지 도움이 안 돼네. 음악이나 춤 같은 건 나에겐 두통만 일으킬 뿐이야. 그리고 "
"술은....흠, 흠....그것도 멀리하는 게 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "26433bcc-fba6-4d23-ac77-2981dd21cbbb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry for eavesdropping, but at night you were moaning terribly in "
"your sleep. Did you have a nightmare? I can share my calming herbs with you. "
"They'll help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"엿들을려고 했던 건 아닌데 어제 밤새 끙끙대던데요. 악몽이라도 꿨어요? 안정에 좋은 약초를 나눠줄게요. 도움이 될 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaHarrim/Banter_OctaviaHarrim_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1ddd327c-e44e-4d98-a79b-091ae8fa6952"
msgid ""
"\"Really? Thank you, Octavia, this would be great. I know only one way to "
"fight off nightmares... But I'm trying to cut down on my drinking these days."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그랬나? 고맙네, 옥타비아. 효과가 좋을 것 같구만. 악몽을 떨치는 방법 하나를 알기는 하지만... 내가 요즘 술을 좀 "
"자제하려고 하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fd0097b6-73ba-45dd-af4d-24bc215af46b"
msgid "\"Is it true the undead don't feel anything?\""
msgstr "\"언데드는 아무것도 느끼지 못한다는 게 사실인가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5c8e8bbc-5505-4427-81e3-e2a240ea1ef2"
msgid "\"Right now I feel substantial irritation from your silly questions.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 너의 그 멍청한 질문 때문에 상당한 자극을 받는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e4e74be2-5e08-4701-bb5f-0ea6094e56f1"
msgid ""
"\"If you wanted, I could lend you some of my cosmetics. The color of your "
"skin frightens me sometimes. And not only me!\""
msgstr "\"괜찮으면 내 화장품이라도 빌려줄게요. 가끔 당신 피부색 때문에 깜짝 놀라곤 해요... 나만 그런게 아니에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5cf02a50-fe95-49ed-9739-eda802066453"
msgid ""
"\"You offer me a chance to smear beetroot and ground chalk on my face? No "
"thank you. If I needed makeup, I'd bring a set from Kyonin. My former family "
"knows their way around eye-shadow and frankincense.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비트뿌리와 석회가루를 내 얼굴에 문지를 기회를 주시겠다는 건가? 고맙지만 됐어. 화장이 필요했다면, 쿄닌에서 내 것을 가져왔겠지. "
"예전 가족들이 아이섀도와 유향 바르는 방법은 알았거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "58d77fc3-7100-4666-98c5-58912bad3785"
msgid "\"Why are you so obnoxious and rude – even with your allies?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 불쾌하고 무례하게 구는 거죠? 심지어 같은 편한테까지 그러잖아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0a3ecdd7-e46c-4776-a074-5cb4444ae550"
msgid ""
"\"Allies? I'm afraid you're not going to like my answer, girl. You'll just "
"imagine I have a bad temper.\""
msgstr ""
"\"같은 편? 네가 내 대답이 맘에 들지 않을까 걱정스럽구나, 꼬마야. 넌 그저 내 성격이 고약할 거라고 상상하는 거 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9dc0899e-f056-4521-8a89-fdbe550be43f"
msgid "\"To be neither alive nor dead... What does it feel like?\""
msgstr "\"살아있지도, 죽은 것도 아닌..... 그런 건 무슨 기분이에요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ad598bcb-732f-4852-86ff-4c5b34a54dc2"
msgid ""
"\"Want to try it? I'm afraid you wouldn't make a quality undead specimen – "
"just a zombie with a pretty face. But your thought processes would not "
"change significantly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 한번 느껴보고 싶어? 넌 좋은 언데드 표본이 아니라서 걱정이군. 예쁜 얼굴을 한 좀비는 없으니까. 하지만 사고방식은 안 바뀔테니 "
"걱정마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "612ad92a-120b-470c-92e6-cbfbd9b38fb1"
msgid ""
"\"Do you really like it when everyone looks at you like you're a venomous "
"viper? Stay away, or it'll bite! How could you prefer that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 모든 사람들이 당신을 독 오른 독사처럼 보는 게 정말 좋은 거예요? 떨어지지 않으면 물리고 마는! 어떻게 그런 걸 좋아할 수 "
"있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJaethal/Banter_OctaviaJaethal_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b7da342b-b2e4-4fe1-84ea-9d611b4da747"
msgid ""
"\"You see, my status allows me not to think whether others like me. On the "
"contrary – it's they who must try to be liked by me.\""
msgstr "\"알다시피, 내 지위 덕분에 난 사람들이 날 좋아하는지 생각 안 해도 돼. 반대로 사람들이 내 맘에 들려고 애쓰지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e7dc3bab-003f-4fc4-85e2-4c53f1bca73b"
msgid ""
"\"Too bad you've never been to Numeria. They'd beat your arrogance out of "
"you quickly!\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에 가본 적이 없다니 안타깝네요. 거기 사람들이 당신의 오만함을 순식간에 없애줄 텐데!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7ce781c5-b884-4e02-8d21-bafbf964c98e"
msgid ""
"\"You are wrong here, darling. I've been to Numeria more than once, and had "
"a great time, discussing with their men of science the nuances of politics, "
"culture, and many other things – which you know as much about as a pig knows "
"about cakes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 틀렸어. 나는 누메리아에 때때로 들려서 과학, 정치, 문화 등을 주제로 대화를 나누고는 했어. 돼지 같은 네가 케이크에 대해서 "
"떠벌릴 만큼 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "247a0f65-ce40-41b0-b9a3-4b95349ff4d7"
msgid ""
"\"Jubi, what keeps you in our party, hunh? You just keep nagging and "
"nagging, and you won't shut up. You don't like this, and you really hate "
"that... So pick up your things and get out of here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"주비, 당신은 뭣때문에 우리 일행에 있는 거죠? 당신은 끊임없이 잔소리를 늘어놓으면서, 입 다물 줄을 모르죠. 이 일이 맘에 안 들고 "
"정말 그게 싫으면.....네 짐 싸서 당장 여기서 꺼지라고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f6b4cde0-2e18-46fc-ac68-b8e6628cf2fc"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not nagging, I'm giving valuable recommendations. And luckily, unlike "
"a hysterical vixen I could name, {Name} understands this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 잔소리가 아니라 귀중한 조언이야. 그리고 다행히도 {Name}은(는) 히스테릭하고 심술궂은 어떤 여자와는 다르게 그걸 이해하고!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2b354d03-3b16-4ecc-9d2b-25c53d2e79a6"
msgid ""
"\"Damn it, Jubi! Could you shut up for a minute? I've got a headache from "
"your cleverness.\""
msgstr "\"빌어먹을, 주비! 잠깐이라도 닥쳐줄 수 없어요? 네 교활함에 두통이 생길 지경이라고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "517c8a94-deff-4ef4-ad06-2ccbe5d02b91"
msgid ""
"\"It's because my sagacious remarks have impacted a brain not meant for "
"mental activity. And don't call me Jubi!\""
msgstr "\"내 현명한 발언이 정신이 아니라 뇌에 직접 영향을 줬나 보네. 그리고 날 주비라고 부르지 말라니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e0b0648e-f5a6-49a7-8110-f282f85a2737"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Jubilost, I think you just enjoy annoying people. You do it on "
"purpose, to get bright new emotions out of them, and fend off your Bleaching "
"for another day. Am I right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"주빌로스트, 제 생각엔 당신은 사람들을 짜증나게 하는 걸 즐기는 거 같아요. 그러면서 밝고 새로운 감정들을 얻고, 백화가 되는걸 "
"피하기 위해서요. 내 말이 맞아요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b542ca22-bb4f-42f1-8095-c345b0124719"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... I've never thought about it like that. But it sounds like quite an "
"idea! I think I'll add a little more sarcasm to my conversations! Like you "
"said – for my health!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠....그런 식으로는 생각해본 적 없는데. 하지만 꽤 괜찮은 생각인 거 같네! 아무래로 대화할 때 좀 더 비아냥대야 할 거 같아. "
"당신이 말했듯이 내 건강을 위해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5386637f-336d-4d18-826c-38940a49b78a"
msgid "\"By the way, Jubie, pray tell me...\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든, 주비, 부디 말해줘요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaJubilost/Banter_OctaviaJubilost_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e5c511ce-6e19-4238-ab61-70393cd2cb63"
msgid ""
"\"No, YOU tell me: who gave you the right to address me in such a "
"disrespectful manner?! I certainly don't recall ever letting anyone call me "
"that. So please, do refrain from such vulgar familiarity in the future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 네가 말해봐. 나를 이렇게 무례하게 대할 권리가 당신에게 있나? 난 나를 그런 식으로 간지럽게 부르라고 한 적 없어. 그러니 "
"부디, 앞으로는 그렇게 천박하게 친밀감을 표현하는 건 삼가주지 않겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Archknights_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "335a5ece-219c-4859-93ae-ba94d814a09d"
msgid ""
"\"All those Knights you always talk about are men. Weren't there any women? "
"A band of men sounds pretty sad and depressing...\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 말하는 기사들은 늘 남자들 뿐이죠. 여자들은 없었나요? 시커먼 남자들만 있는 건 너무 슬프고 우울하게 들려요....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Archknights_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "64c2b20b-58ee-4f56-88af-4796294c9d3c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes, there was a Vudrani Tiefling named Vivreal. She was a talented "
"caster who could manifest energy weapons to strike her opponents. She sounds "
"beautiful and deadly. Kind of like you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 맞아, 비브리얼이란 티플링 부드라인 한명이 있었지. 그녀는 에너지 무기를 소환해서 적에게 꽂아넣는 훌륭한 캐스터였어. 그녀는 "
"아름답고 치명적이었지. 마치 당신처럼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e1db2329-dfd2-46b1-b9d1-27165560b6f3"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, why don't you write a fairy tale about us all, huh? Like 'they "
"lived happily ever after and died together on the same day…'\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지, 왜 우리가 주인공으로 나오는 동화는 쓰지 않나요? 이를테면 '다 같이 행복하게 살았고 한날한시에 죽음을 맞이했어요.' 같은 "
"이야기 말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c5955211-4d96-4b87-bc8f-866cd0a6a251"
msgid ""
"\"'… on the battlefield, among numerous corpses of their enemies!' I'm "
"sorry, Octavia, but I can't imagine anyone of our team old, sitting by a "
"fire, and surrounded by great-grandchildren!\""
msgstr ""
"\"'전장 위, 수많은 적들의 시체에 둘러싸여!' 옥타비아, 미안하지만 난 우리 일행 중 그 누구도 늙어서 증손자에 둘러싸여 난로가에 "
"앉아있는 걸 상상할 수가 없다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e6ef63cd-b5d9-499a-929f-d270516dfa68"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, do you have a spare shirt? Mine is just holes after yesterday's "
"brawl.\""
msgstr "\"린지, 혹시 셔츠 남는 거 있어요? 제 셔츠는 어제 싸우다 구멍이 났거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bfc49957-ed5e-4a75-8f1d-a3af81cb9a6d"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I do. But I think it'll be too short for you! Tee-hee. It would "
"be funny to see, but it wouldn't be comfortable for you!\""
msgstr "\"물론 줄 수 있죠. 근데 옥타비아한테는 너무 짧을 텐데요! 히히. 보는 사람은 재미있겠지만, 입는 사람은 불편할 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e075532a-1fbe-4d56-bf08-42fa83e84ddc"
msgid "\"Linzi, what are you writing in there again?\""
msgstr "\"린지, 거기서 또 뭘 쓰고 있는 거예요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8455472a-f1aa-4d9d-be98-8e7aee664f66"
msgid ""
"\"You know, something... About someone... I'll let you read it once I'm "
"finished. It's hilarious!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 누군가에 대한 뭔가를 쓰고 있어요. 다 쓰고 보여줄게요. 진짜 웃겨요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e7f16a1e-bb4a-4f89-8eab-aca3959605e4"
msgid ""
"\"So why didn't you stay at the Academy? You'd be living on easy street, "
"never be hungry or cold. All you'd have to do is just write your poems.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 대학에서 나온 거예요? 편한 길로 갔으면 배를 곯거나 추위에 떨지도 않았을텐데. 당신의 일은 그냥 시를 쓰는 것 뿐이잖아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaLinzi/Banter_OctaviaLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "31cd8883-ccec-4f9c-aea3-34eda633e60c"
msgid ""
"\"In Pitax, easy street is inhabited by those who diligently lick King "
"Irovetti's boots! Or worse. Especially if they do it literally. No thank "
"you, I'd rather sing at a roadside tavern!\""
msgstr ""
"\"피탁스에서 편한 길이란 이로베티 왕의 장화를 핥는 걸 말하죠! 아니면 더 심한 짓을 하던가. 문자 그대로 그들이 행한다면 말이죠. "
"그런 건 사양하겠어요. 저는 차라리 길가에 있는 주점에서 노래하는 걸 택할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaNokNok/Banter_OctaviaNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "18858a20-4010-4320-b44f-b659f4c1d0c7"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, don't you feel… sad? You are the only one of your kind in our "
"midst. I believe you get lonely sometimes.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹, 슬픔을...느끼지 않나요? 당신 종족 중에서 그런 감정을 느끼는 건 당신 뿐이잖아요. 가끔 당신이 외로워보여요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaNokNok/Banter_OctaviaNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b4b271d6-7249-4a75-8cea-363d8bb82ab0"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, being a Hero is tough. Especially with longshanks around. But I stay "
"patient. It's my duty — stay patient with you.\""
msgstr "\"맞다, 영웅이 되는 건 힘들다.특히 롱샤크에서는. 하지만 잘 견디고 있다. 너와 함께 견디는 게 나의 의무니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaNokNok/Banter_OctaviaNokNok_Backer2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "848591d9-504f-4883-833b-5973080eb51f"
msgid "\"I once saw a brownie in a forest. It was kind of cute!\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 숲속에서 브라우니를 본 적이 있어요. 너무 귀여웠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaNokNok/Banter_OctaviaNokNok_Backer2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "77779714-df0f-4f74-914c-c1204518a3d1"
msgid "\"Brownies taste good?\""
msgstr "\"브라우니 맛이 괜찮았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e7aeee1b-b915-4388-bb5a-df728dd8ade2"
msgid ""
"\"What a party we have here! We somehow suit these lands. In a civilized "
"place we'd probably all feud with each other all the time, but here the "
"constant danger keeps us united.\""
msgstr ""
"\"참 대단한 일행인데! 우리는 어찌됐건 이 땅에 적응했다고. 도시였다면 아마 옥신각신 싸우고 있었을 테지만 여기의 위험은 우리를 하나로 "
"뭉치게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d6346773-cf41-47c9-9500-8cfb7382a241"
msgid ""
"\"It's sad that danger and trouble are often the only things that keep us "
"together. Even those who sincerely love each other can sometimes find "
"they're too different to live together in peace.\""
msgstr "\"위험이 우리를 단결해주는 촉매라니 슬픈걸. 진정으로 사랑하는 사람들은 평화로운 사랑을 하기 힘들지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "526e22af-cc66-439f-9faa-ca363eea895b"
msgid ""
"\"It's sad that danger and trouble are often the only things that keep us "
"together. Even those who sincerely love each other can sometimes find "
"they're too different to live together in peace.\""
msgstr "\"위험이 우리를 단결해주는 촉매라니 슬픈걸. 진정으로 사랑하는 사람들은 평화로운 사랑을 하기 힘들지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9a7e1f9e-372d-4044-8547-c3a1c974410f"
msgid ""
"\"Once I return to Numeria... I don't know what I'll do there. Maybe I'll "
"find my former owners and grind them to dust. Or maybe just walk the streets "
"as a free person!\""
msgstr "\"누메리아로 돌아가면... 뭘 해야 할지 모르겠어. 전 주인을 찾아서 가루로 만들어버릴까. 아니면 자유를 누릴까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2a669a0b-d1f6-4f9f-b750-e1f31e40f1ff"
msgid "\"I just need to get back and close that chapter of my life.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 집으로 돌아가서 여생을 보내고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7187f7b9-c345-4eb0-b229-ab98c92cced8"
msgid ""
"\"Why is Regongar so... Regongar?! I love him terribly but... Can he be just "
"a tiny bit less Regongarian?\""
msgstr "\"대체 왜 레곤가르는 행동이 뻔히 보이지?! 사랑하기는 하지만... 조금 얌전하면 좋겠는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "be015352-c985-421a-989d-07188392e7dc"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange to sit like this... Not expecting the lash. Not fearing that "
"your owner might show up, and you'll have to humiliate yourself just to live "
"another day...\""
msgstr "\"이런 식으로 앉아있으니 이상하네... 너의 주인이 나타나도 두려워하지 말고 삶을 연명하는 것을 부끄러워해야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b69a28a3-e1dc-4dab-bfe0-7a6b5db9dc78"
msgid ""
"\"I understand, but stay sharp. Your masters might not be here, but there's "
"sure to be hungry monsters nearby...\""
msgstr "\"알겠어. 하지만 정신 놓지 마. 너희 주인은 여기 없을지도 모르지만 주위에는 굶주린 괴물이 많아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaOctavia/Banter_OctaviaOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "482525ef-2b34-42a4-aafe-eb9f188a42e3"
msgid ""
"\"I understand, but stay sharp. Your masters might not be here, but there's "
"sure to be hungry monsters nearby...\""
msgstr "\"알겠어. 하지만 정신 놓지 마. 너희 주인은 여기 없을지도 모르지만 주위에는 굶주린 괴물이 많아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f23a8d0b-aeac-4610-bff8-7eee5f4d9d28"
msgid "\"I didn't get much sleep again.\""
msgstr "\"잠이 오지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "19cbc9ce-08ea-4f60-9f46-a224661cb4f2"
msgid ""
"\"I know. You were screaming in your sleep. If I could drag your nightmares "
"outside and punch them in the face...\""
msgstr "\"알아. 자면서 비명을 지르던데. 악몽에서 너를 구할 수 있다면 좋았을 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "46e7eb35-a20f-41f0-8e7f-b728ec4b2040"
msgid ""
"\"For a long time, I couldn't believe we were finally free. I can still "
"hardly believe it!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 마침내 자유가 될 거라고 생각지 못했어. 아직도 믿기지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2d0ec10e-6250-413e-92fc-c8a0ae4a7223"
msgid ""
"\"But I believed it at once! And if someone tried to prove otherwise, ha! "
"He'd be a stinky spot on the floor that very instant!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 나는 믿었지! 누군가 아니라고 얘기했다면 당장 혼내줬을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1948c981-65f8-47d8-a119-bd37c4de7ab1"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember the ones we lived with in the same barracks? What do you "
"think... happened to them?\""
msgstr "\"같은 막사에서 함께 살았던 사람들 기억해? 그들은 어떻게 되었을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c06bfedb-c23b-4b51-a105-b2d0ea051d79"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think about them. And I recommend you don't either. We have each "
"other, and I don't care about anyone else.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그들에 대해 생각하지 않아. 너도 생각하지 마. 우리가 함께라면 다른 자는 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "751dfe94-834a-46da-a9a4-0ac97e0a8845"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, you are so moody today. And I can see you didn't get much sleep... "
"What's bothering you?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 기분이 안 좋아 보여. 잠을 못자던 것 같던데... 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "af988c28-bee9-4cb2-8e79-2f7b5952333b"
msgid ""
"\"You don't remember, do you? You woke me up four times last night, kicking "
"and screaming. But I guess you didn't wake up... Ha, what those bastards "
"from the League did to us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기억 안 나? 너 간밤에 발로 나를 차고 소리를 지르면서 내가 잠을 못잤어. 너는 일어나지 않더라고... 기술 연맹 녀석들이 네게 "
"무슨 짓을 한 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "48155cc9-dfcd-4a34-a977-b6784a02c6c8"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, do you know what I want sometimes? To quit all this traveling, settle "
"down somewhere by a river, build a house, make a boat, fish, take care of "
"the garden, watch the sunset, sitting on the stairs...\""
msgstr ""
"\"레곤가르. 가끔 내가 원하는 게 뭔지 알아? 이 여행을 끝마치고 어딘가 강가 주변에 집을 짓고 물고기도 잡고 농사도 짓고... "
"저녁에는 석양을 보는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e16db14d-893f-4311-9e03-6dcb97ee8cdf"
msgid ""
"\"That's a good dream! So cozy. I'm not sure I could live like that, but...\""
msgstr "\"좋은 꿈인데! 우리가 그렇게 살 수 있을지는 모르겠지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f503915e-824f-45b6-95aa-1851f7859d14"
msgid ""
"\"No, Reg, I don't want any of that wine. Didn't I ask you to leave that "
"vendor alone? I know I did. And what did you do? Slashed him!\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 레곤가르. 와인은 충분해. 그 상인을 내버려두라고 했잖아. 무슨 짓을 한 거야? 왜 해치웠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "244b7d91-0327-49e4-bd51-c1bbf551d978"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, so what? I didn't kill him! There there, don't pout. He's richer "
"than both of us, what does he care about a few bottles?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 죽이진 않았어! 에구에구. 삐지지 마. 그 양반은 우리보다 부자야. 병 몇 개가 뭐 대수야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "97530d12-de36-4645-b784-6670557a845b"
msgid ""
"\"The Technic League must be still sending hunters after us. I'm so afraid "
"they'll find us sooner or later and drag back!\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹은 여전히 우리에게 사냥꾼을 보내고 있어. 그들이 곧 찾아올까 두려워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "93875ce1-584d-45ac-b80a-91a7cf4b0fdd"
msgid ""
"\"If they find us – it's their loss! I'll kill as many Technic League snoops "
"as they dare to send us!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 우리를 찾으면 그들 손해야! 보내는 족족 다 죽여버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a06a6039-7948-45b3-8cb0-ad942399506d"
msgid ""
"\"You lazybones, you didn't even try at all during the last battle! Are you "
"feeling all right?\""
msgstr "\"이 게으름뱅이. 저번 전투에서는 시도조차 하지 않았지! 부끄럽지도 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "894e3427-2b79-4a62-83d8-d8a887b1bb63"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, I'm just giving you a chance to get at least one kill for yourself!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네게 죽일 기회를 준 것 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_9_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0680b017-fe69-4196-83ae-1ff6989541f7"
msgid ""
"\"What is that? Chocolate? Mmm... yummy! Why not share it with the others?\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭐야? 초콜릿? 음... 맛있어! 다른 사람들한테도 나눠줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Pack2_9_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7b07a274-d180-4bc5-9eb0-d274060d574b"
msgid "\"Quiet, quiet! No way. They're all right as they are!\""
msgstr "\"쉿! 조용히 해! 절대 안돼. 걔들한텐 안 줘도 괜찮아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "956d62cd-999d-4411-bcf0-b5a46630f939"
msgid ""
"\"You look unhappy today. You need to have some fun. You want me to read to "
"you in bed, the way you like?\""
msgstr "\"오늘 기분이 안 좋아보이네. 재미가 필요해? 침대에서 네가 좋아하는 방식으로 놀아줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaRegongar/Banter_OctaviaRegongar_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a321012b-1627-41b1-aea6-28538f5bdd93"
msgid ""
"\"OCTAVIA! Damn it, not with everyone around... Hmm, never mind. We'll talk "
"about this later.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아! 젠장. 여기에서는... 흠. 신경 쓰지 마. 나중에 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bedfbd31-d34b-456b-867e-830ca5ca46c8"
msgid ""
"\"I marvel at your patience, Tristian. Didn't you ever want to curse, or "
"yell, or smash someone's face?\""
msgstr "\"저는 당신의 인내심이 정말 놀라워요. 트리스티안. 누굴 저주하거나 고함치고, 때리고 싶은 적이 한 번도 없었어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c888fdda-b909-4df1-8fa0-eb422a0128c4"
msgid ""
"\"I have felt those feelings, of course. I'm not a stranger to common human "
"passions. But it doesn't become a servant of Sarenrae to act out his sordid "
"urges.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 저도 그런 생각이 들긴 합니다. 전 다른 분들 처럼 열정에 낯선 사람이 아니지만 그러나 사악한 충동을 행동으로 옮기는 것은 "
"서렌레이의 종으로서 옳지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6a6a0e08-f104-4510-89d3-00ecc781236a"
msgid ""
"\"You are so young, Tristian, but you've seen so much! It must be hard, "
"carrying your faith to all the ends of the world!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 아직 어리지만 많은 일들을 겪었잖아요! 하늘이 무너져도 믿음을 간직해야 하니 정말 힘들겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "325902a4-72fb-4780-b845-92051c4b1a3e"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Octavia, it's a heavy burden. Sometimes I doubt I can handle it. But "
"I close my eyes and appeal to the Healing Light, and I feel the presence of "
"my goddess, and I know – if not me, then who?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇습니다, 옥타비아. 믿음은 무거운 짐입니다. 때때로 감당하기 어려운 순간이 오지만, 치유의 빛에 눈을 감고 기도를 올리면 여신께서 "
"굽어보심이 느껴집니다. 제가 아니면, 누가 제 마음을 다잡을 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eb6a85e4-5cb8-48d4-a19f-b4bcae5a6eff"
msgid ""
"\"When I talk about slavery and freedom, you get that face... Like I saw on "
"the other slaves. But you've never been in shackles, have you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 노예나 자유를 얘기할 때면 항상 그런 표정을 짓네요... 우리 같은 사람들이 지을 법한 표정이에요. 당신은 족쇄를 차 본 적이 "
"없지 않나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "99b457de-bfd9-48b9-a4d3-0bdd400bc1b0"
msgid ""
"\"Each of us is shackled in our own way. Some shackles are just harder to "
"see than others.\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두는 각자의 족쇄가 있습니다. 어떤 족쇄는 눈에 보이지 않기도 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c1e9e153-46b0-459b-be0a-513e0d96a660"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, if you met a dying Technic League henchman, would you heal him?\""
msgstr "\"만약 죽어가는 기술 연맹 사냥꾼을 만난다면 그 녀석을 치료해줄 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b169f26c-2ac8-47c1-8aa8-cdd15eebc105"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Now don't frown – you asked me a question and that's my answer. Then "
"I'd turn him to the light or deliver him to authorities for a trial – or "
"maybe he'd attack me and I'd have to kill him myself. But I would never walk "
"past a dying man indifferently.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네. 그렇게 보지 마십시오. 그리고는 그를 갱생시키거나 재판에 보낼 겁니다. 만약 저를 공격한다면 죽여야겠죠. 하지만 죽어가는 사람은 "
"내버려 두지 않을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "08fcadb3-c2b8-4427-9dff-55f794e9d2e2"
msgid ""
"\"You are strange, Tristian. You put up so patiently with jokes and insults, "
"and you're always ready to hear out and forgive... Some may see this as "
"weakness, but I know that inside you are harder than steel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안, 당신은 참 이상해요. 농담과 모욕에 아무렇지도 않고, 항상 남의 사정을 봐주고 용서하는 것 같아요. 어떤 이들은 무르다 "
"하겠지만 저는 당신 마음이 강철만큼 단단하다고 생각해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaTristian/Banter_OctaviaTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f1af63b9-1219-4c6d-8020-10af9fde440b"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Octavia. Too bad people so seldom recognize the true difference "
"between weakness and strength.\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다, 옥타비아. 사람들이 무름과 단단함의 진정한 차이를 인식하지 못해 안타까울 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dcab8cf8-fd19-4e65-817c-84668750eef3"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't reject everything related to beauty and art. You sew very "
"well! You may not be a paladin of Shelyn any more, but why don't you want to "
"simply do what you're good at?\""
msgstr "\"아름다움과 예술을 외면하지 마. 더 이상 셸린의 성기사가 아니라 해도 잘하는 일을 하고 싶지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d6849c7a-f17c-4aac-84ce-bd86396e703e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm good at fighting, and that's what I do. Everything else I learned at "
"the Order is useless nonsense, and not worth even a moment of my time.\""
msgstr "\"난 싸움에 능숙하고 그게 제 일입니다. 교단에서 배운 것들은 모두 시간낭비였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4f1a5bbe-b5bd-48a3-ab4b-72bc73630566"
msgid ""
"\"I know you cut your hair to make a statement, but... Maybe you should grow "
"it back? You know, for a change?\""
msgstr "\"결심을 보여주려고 머리를 자른 건 알지만... 다시 기르면 안될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "63e614b9-ce98-45dd-8596-c403088c2fab"
msgid ""
"\"I'll think about changing when I'm too old to fight. For now, when I'm "
"deciding between long hair and getting my helmet on quickly, I'll choose the "
"latter.\""
msgstr "\"늙어서 싸울 수 없을 때까지는 계속 이 상태일 겁니다. 투구를 쓸 때 거추장스럽다면 잘라야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "112cbee4-6801-4e7e-95bf-e3edf7dc9edb"
msgid ""
"\"Most nobles I've seen were arrogant, even with their equals. And you "
"aren't ashamed to be sharing a meal with former slaves!\""
msgstr "\"내가 본 귀족들은 대부분 거만했어. 그런데 넌 노예 출신과 밥을 먹어도 괜찮은가 보네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f23a01ae-4f47-4d66-bb26-30a4b1e7a5ca"
msgid ""
"\"I've lived among mercenaries for a long time, and they're a motley bunch – "
"from nobles to branded convicts. In a situation like that, you quickly learn "
"to judge people by what they do, not by the color of their coat of arms or "
"how ancient their lineage is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 용병 생활을 오래 했고 그들은 귀족부터 범죄자까지 다양한 자들이 있었습니다. 그런 상황에서는 겉모습으로 사람을 판단할 것이 "
"아니라 그들의 행동으로 판단하게 됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7e7e0331-6871-4ed0-89bf-a7fb88b7260b"
msgid "\"You smile rarely, Valerie. What troubles you?\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 너는 참 잘 웃지않네. 무슨 문제라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0ec69052-376a-480b-a9c2-04c48cdd2c11"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing. I'll laugh when there is something to laugh about. Right now I'm "
"busy thinking about how we're going to survive these wild lands.\""
msgstr "\"없습니다. 나는 웃을 일이 있을 때만 웃을 겁니다. 지금은 이 땅에서 생존할 방법을 생각해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "79440e8a-9543-450b-9206-b4d61c82f3a0"
msgid ""
"\"It's good you're with us, Valerie. You're like a mighty oak we can lean "
"our backs against... Oh! But I didn't mean you're thickheaded – or thick any "
"other way! Oh no, I put my foot in my mouth again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 우리와 함께하는 것이 좋아. 발레리. 너는 전투에서 등을 맡길 수 있는 거대한 오크와 같아... 오! 네가 두껍다는 것을 "
"의미하지는 않아. 이런. 실수했군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f01b6f62-6694-4547-8115-ce2bba6cb228"
msgid ""
"\"It's all right – I understand your good intentions. I'm glad to be here "
"for my friends.\""
msgstr "\"괜찮습니다. 당신의 좋은 의도를 이해합니다. 친구들을 만나 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f856959f-09f0-41f1-b7f2-e6ad93dc6d33"
msgid ""
"\"You are amazingly beautiful... No, no, I'm not flirting! Although... I'm "
"not saying I wouldn't like it!\""
msgstr "\"너는 놀랍도록 아름다워... 작업 거는 게 아니야! 그래도... 예쁘면 좋잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "38f54242-9b73-494f-b59a-c99a2a5a6f43"
msgid ""
"\"Don't waste your time. Maybe someday I'll find someone to share my life "
"with. But it will definitely be a man!\""
msgstr "\"시간 낭비하지 마십시오. 언젠가 저도 배우자를 찾을 것입니다. 물론 남자로요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Talk1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0a764a4a-4713-43d9-b221-33444f430097"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie, your embroidery is always so beautiful, I just can't take my eyes "
"off your designs! Even the patches on your clothes are always special. I "
"could never do anything like that, even with the help of magic!\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리. 너의 자수는 항상 아름다워. 그 패턴을 보고 있자니 눈을 뗄 수가 없어! 너는 누더기를 걸쳐도 예쁠 거야. 나는 마법을 써도 "
"그렇게 예쁘지는 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/OctaviaValerie/Banter_OctaviaValerie_Talk1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a54639d2-c6a1-46f3-989b-7dc010c8cd8a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it's… nothing special. I never mean to do anything ornate. I just need "
"to keep my hands busy sometimes.\""
msgstr "\"이건... 별 것 아닙니다. 꾸미려는 의도는 없었습니다. 그저 시간 때우기였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "63b66d60-a1d2-43c1-b669-d2ea8534baa6"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, I heard that barbarian women can exhaust even the strongest man in "
"bed...\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 야만인 여자에게는 침대에서 어떤 강한 남자도 맞설 수 없다고 하던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5a4e7055-f539-460f-b58e-3eab4fe10633"
msgid ""
"\"A strong man? Easy! But you, greenhorn – you wouldn't last five minutes!\""
msgstr "\"강한 남자? 나도 여자라고! 하지만 너는 5분도 못버티겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "170ff881-26bc-474a-af18-647a6fa456f0"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Amiri! Want to arm-wrestle? The winner invites the loser into their "
"tent.\""
msgstr "\"아미리! 팔씨름 할까? 진 사람이 이긴 사람과 자는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ab63c39c-759b-4366-b246-e7be921dc80d"
msgid "\"Mmmm... And what are you going to do in my tent with a broken arm?\""
msgstr "\"음... 부러진 팔로 잘 수나 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c99b3cb3-0718-4a9d-b317-5360958a09cd"
msgid "\"Amiri, you have such big... Biceps! Wow, let me touch them!\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 너 정말... 팔뚝이 굵구나! 만져 봐도 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "51395664-5090-474e-9e6a-cacc98de8d91"
msgid ""
"\"Go touch yourself behind your tent, asshole. You're thinking with your "
"wrong parts again.\""
msgstr "\"텐트 가서 네 물건이나 만져. 멍청아. 네 주제를 알라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b93a6e8d-3e84-4a22-bef8-4380f6593029"
msgid ""
"\"Let's see which of us is a more glorious warrior? I'll show you my scars, "
"and you show me yours!\""
msgstr "\"우리 중 누가 더 영광스러운 전사인지 보자. 누가 흉터가 더 많은지 볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9fcf942c-8e33-4687-882e-261b93467a71"
msgid "\"How about I make you some new ones instead?\""
msgstr "\"내가 새로운 흉터 좀 만들어줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4f925b39-f36c-4f53-b459-1293c1f1cfb4"
msgid ""
"\"Your tribe lives in the frozen mountains, right? If you're such strong "
"warriors, why didn't you conquer some better lands for yourself?\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족은 얼어 붙은 산에 살고 있지? 강한 전사들이라면 왜 더 좋은 땅을 정복하지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ef64f367-80ab-4bcd-9706-831372e4573f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, listen to you! Where do you think those tribes in Numeria came from? "
"They came down from the mountains!\""
msgstr "\"하. 잘 들어! 누메리아의 부족들이 어디 출신이라고 생각해? 산에서 온 것 같지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_RegongarAmiri1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d35bb657-81b1-4c0d-804d-6b450cbe4d9f"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm, hmm. Listen, Amiri... I was thinking... I know you're a woman of "
"principle... but maybe you have a barbarian friend...\""
msgstr "\"흠... 있잖아. 아미리... 네가 남자가 없다는 건 알지만... 다른 야만인 친구가 있겠지...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAmiri/Banter_RegongarAmiri_RegongarAmiri1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "85216a21-a3e9-498e-ba56-7bccb5e333c9"
msgid "\"Ha! A barbarian woman will break you in half and not even notice.\""
msgstr "\"하! 야만인 여자들은 너에게 눈길도 주지 않을 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAngel/Banter_RegongarAngel_RegongarTristian1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0a98f115-7cf8-406e-8d42-741861150331"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you what awaits you. You'll grow old and feeble. You'll be bent "
"over double from carrying everyone else's chamber pots — and you'll realize "
"that you never lived a single day in your life... And it will be too late.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 미래를 말해주지. 너는 늙어서 다른 사람 시중이나 들어주고 있을 거야. 그리고 인생을 헛살았다고 생각하겠지. 그 때는 너무 늦은 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarAngel/Banter_RegongarAngel_RegongarTristian1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b4a16ccf-aa60-412c-bcf1-e7ce6ee9d2a4"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha, aah... So that's the end you see for me? Well, we'll see, we'll "
"see...\""
msgstr "\"하하하... 그게 내 미래라고? 한번 두고 보자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5aa0e9e0-4ef6-45db-ac3e-091be8cc926f"
msgid ""
"\"Ekun, have you ever thought about making a coat from your wolf's pelt? "
"It'd be so much more useful as a coat. And we wouldn't have to keep wasting "
"food on it!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 네 애완 늑대의 가죽으로 외투를 만들어 보면 어떨까? 정말 따뜻할 거야. 음식도 아낄 수 있고 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e7a706ca-8aa9-4194-81ab-d40fc8ff4908"
msgid "\"Is that a joke? It's a stupid one. Be quiet.\""
msgstr "\"재미없다. 멍청한 녀석. 조용히 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c1d36f56-6891-48c0-9742-785681adf0d1"
msgid ""
"\"Lighten up, Ekun. Let it go! I've buried so many friends and family that "
"you could fill a whole cemetery with their graves.\""
msgstr "\"농담이야. 에쿤! 잊어버리라고! 나도 공동 묘지에 묻어도 모자랄 많은 친구와 가족이 죽었다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2bad684a-2c33-4501-b9b5-c4bfbecf8630"
msgid ""
"\"Your drunken friends aren't family. You don't respect the dead. Better "
"keep quiet.\""
msgstr "\"네 술 친구들을 말하는 건가. 너는 망자에 대한 존중이 없다. 조용히 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cb3b813b-0370-4464-8162-bf3c97257a19"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you always staring at me? Did I put a toad in your trousers? We're "
"in the same boat, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"왜 항상 나를 쳐다봐? 네 바지에 두꺼비라도 넣었을까봐? 설마 동료인 내가? 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "bbf8c29a-2b2f-4d21-ab21-8f4136b5751f"
msgid "\"We have common enemies, true. That doesn't mean we're friends.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공통의 적을 가지고 있다. 그것은 우리가 친구라는 것을 의미하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3aad87d6-7109-46f2-ad4a-10c9b646ecb2"
msgid ""
"\"Ekun, have you heard about silent hermits? They take a vow of silence and "
"just sit there without moving for days. And at night they quietly gobble up "
"the gifts that the pilgrims bring them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"에쿤. 조용한 은자에 대한 얘기 들어 봤어? 묵언 수행하며 한자리에서 며칠 동안 움직이지 않는다는군. 밤이 돼서야 순례자가 바친 "
"공양을 숨죽인 채 먹는다는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fbea9456-5a98-4caa-9ed9-df2d229b67ce"
msgid ""
"\"What does this have to do with me? I don't sit still. And I talk – to "
"those I have words for.\""
msgstr "\"그게 나랑 무슨 상관이지? 나는 은자가 아니다. 그리고 나는 말도 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bfa9f106-6f61-4999-a17e-0a8ba4beefa9"
msgid ""
"\"Could you hit a deer in the eye from, say, a hundred paces? What about a "
"hundred and fifty? I'd watch that trick!\""
msgstr "\"백보 밖에서 사슴을 맞출 수 있어? 백오십보는 어때? 보여줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "41bc5d9c-0812-4da6-966a-ab9a51a4b8e1"
msgid "\"I don't do tricks. I don't kill for fun.\""
msgstr "\"나는 속임수를 쓰지 않는다. 재미로 죽이지도 않고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ef06d3d3-9f71-44e5-9892-fb4ae3640ac9"
msgid ""
"\"Who chose this route? My feet are killing me. Isn't there a better path?\""
msgstr "\"누가 여기로 가자고 했지? 발 아파 죽겠어. 더 나은 길은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7c48958c-ff45-4518-8235-231588a82c8d"
msgid "\"Next time you lead. I don't care about your feet.\""
msgstr "\"다음에는 네가 인도해라. 네 발이 어떤지는 관심 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7d5c2845-7fed-4abe-b075-f2d152ce20b0"
msgid "\"Not a bad shot! – BAM! Dead! But admit it – you just got lucky!\""
msgstr "\"나쁘지 않았어! 우와! 죽었군. 운이 좋았던 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e56bebdf-76de-46c8-a998-f876ce2d365b"
msgid "\"Not luck. Skill.\""
msgstr "\"행운이 아니다. 기술이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "66637351-34d6-491d-8af5-629864c26f2a"
msgid ""
"\"You're a good shot, but my lightning is better! Rumble, sparks, everyone "
"runs... Jealous, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"잘 쐈지만 내 번개가 더 나아! 불꽃을 보면 모두 도망치지. 부럽지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9300b151-4727-4540-b918-aacbdf6ba813"
msgid ""
"\"No point in being jealous. Everyone does what they can. I do what I can, "
"and I do it well.\""
msgstr "\"질투할 필요가 없다. 모두가 할 수있는 일을 한다. 나는 내가 할 수 있는 일을 하는 것이고. 그리고 잘한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_RegongarEkun1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f8933096-3b19-431c-a18d-3b7fa9a98462"
msgid "\"You're staring at me again! What do you want?\""
msgstr "\"왜 또 보는 거야! 원하는 거라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarEkun/Banter_RegongarEkun_RegongarEkun1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "420dc526-6ffb-4ee7-8c1f-99b3fd077e94"
msgid ""
"\"Deep in your soul, good and evil are fighting. I'm watching to see which "
"one wins.\""
msgstr "\"자네 안에서 선과 악이 싸우고 있군. 나는 누가 이기는지 지켜보고 있네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9f7be21c-bb5f-43c8-8fc6-c6cb8443e06e"
msgid ""
"\"You're so boring! For once in your life, can you forget about the end of "
"all things – and come have a drink with us?\""
msgstr "\"너는 너무 지루해! 한 번이라도 진지함은 잊고 술이나 마실 수 없겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d8ac3558-0142-4301-98b6-4cbe99c9766e"
msgid ""
"\"You think you'll enjoy drunken Harrim better than the sober one? You're "
"wrong, Regongar. You are so wrong. You'd rather not see or hear me like "
"that...\""
msgstr "\"자네는 멀쩡한 놈보다 술취한 하림이 좋다는 건가? 그건 옳지 않네, 레곤가르. 그런건 보지도 듣지도 않는게 나을걸세...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "816e1e14-195a-4312-9d96-c018ec0bebd1"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I think I understand why Torag rejected you. Even the gods can't "
"stand your constant whining!\""
msgstr "\"왜 토락이 너를 져버렸는지 알겠어. 네 고집은 아무도 못막아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fe9344c2-d4d9-4d3b-9b3e-3e31fac297d4"
msgid ""
"\"You're completely right. Torag is deaf to the troubles of his followers. "
"That is why I rejected him. Think, would you pray to Calistria if it was her "
"fault you couldn't do anything in bed – like I can't do anything in the "
"smithy?\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네가 맞아. 토락은 신도들을 돌보지 않네. 그래서 내가 토락을 져버렸지. 자네가 침대에서 쑥맥인 게 칼리스트리아의 탓이라면 믿음이 "
"생기겠는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ff85d332-4ed4-41e1-b89e-0fe11798cd16"
msgid ""
"\"You're so annoying! Yes, we'll all die sooner or later, thanks for the "
"news! Why remind us about it all the time?\""
msgstr "\"넌 정말 짜증나! 그래, 우린 언젠가 모두 죽겠지! 알려줘서 참 고맙네! 왜 항상 그런 걸 굳이 상기하게 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "04b5a490-6289-4a99-89b9-74f5c8c7e604"
msgid ""
"\"You cannot forget about it, Regongar. Every moment you must consider the "
"coming hour of your death, or you will fail to face it with dignity when it "
"does come.\""
msgstr "\"절대 잊지말게. 레곤가르. 죽음에 대한 준비를 해야 초연한 죽음을 맞을 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c5dad3fb-4c6b-4cec-b1aa-c24f80d5b656"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to die so much, why don't you just stop eating? We'll save "
"some food that way too!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 죽고 싶으면 그냥 굶지 그래? 너는 음식이 아까워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0cb12b81-cd25-48d9-8037-b7839e6a13e6"
msgid ""
"\"You eat more than me, and drink enough for three. How do you look, when "
"you talk about the portions of others?\""
msgstr "\"자네는 나보다 더 많이 먹고 술도 세배나 더 마시면서, 어떻게 음식이 아깝다는 소리가 나올 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_RegongarHarrim1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "08871c7f-a4bc-49a0-ac85-cc8511859548"
msgid ""
"\"Damn it all, I've been staring at you since morning, and you haven't "
"smiled even once all day! Don't you ever get tired of yourself?!\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 아침부터 계속 그렇게 울상을 짓기야? 지겹지도 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarHarrim/Banter_RegongarHarrim_RegongarHarrim1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "111e6ae0-4c00-4e3c-b38e-e5f997688607"
msgid ""
"\"I've been tired for a long time. I only wonder when you too will get tired."
"\""
msgstr "\"난 항상 피곤하다네. 너도 언젠가 그렇게 될걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5be346d8-d8fd-42a2-993f-c318b62a85d9"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal, why are you staring at me, hunh? You want to turn me into a "
"zombie? Go bite someone else!\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 왜 째려봐? 나를 좀비로 만드려고 그래? 다른 곳에 가서 찾아 보셔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3157f973-fc09-4b78-9328-802e14d1391b"
msgid ""
"\"You? You wouldn't even make a good skeleton. Although if the undead "
"creature inherited your magical powers, it might not be so bad...\""
msgstr "\"너? 네 몸으로는 좋은 해골도 만들 수 없을 거다. 네 마법을 가진 언데드가 있어도 좋을까 말까 하겠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "aa489aff-36db-4ee9-917c-1163e2413e56"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, dead one, keep away from me. I don't meddle in your business, so "
"don't try getting too close.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 시체. 내게서 떨어져. 너를 괴롭히지 않을 테니까 가까이 오지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e04cc765-2f8f-4b38-ae51-a27d65a5e4cf"
msgid ""
"\"We'll see what you say when life is draining from you, drop by drop. At "
"that moment it becomes an easy choice: become undead, or become worm food.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 생명줄이 조금씩 얇아질 때 무슨 말을 하는지 보자. 그 때는 선택하기 쉬울 거야. 언데드가 되거나. 벌레 밥이 되거나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d286bd16-7eb6-4fc4-b39c-16c16a1c5e77"
msgid ""
"\"A whole crusade must be chasing you! No one likes the undead, especially "
"when they're as insolent as you!\""
msgstr "\"크루세이더들이 너를 잡아가야 했어! 언데드인 것도 모자라 그렇게 인성이 나쁘다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b3f6dda1-ee5a-4f6e-bd1c-d20725cda886"
msgid ""
"\"And half the Technic League is hunting you down. – But so what? I might "
"not like you, but anyone foolish enough to pursue our party will die the "
"instant our paths cross.\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹이 너를 잡아가야 했는데. 나는 너를 좋아하지 않으니 여행을 하다가 죽어도 상관 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7577656a-e0e7-4b64-8e8e-a6035ffc15b4"
msgid ""
"\"You see the way I lopped that guy's head off? Is Regongar awesome or what?"
"\""
msgstr "\"내가 그 놈의 목을 따는 거 못봤어? 내가 그리 우스워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "56e2fd0b-d884-466e-a076-3e8eccea8927"
msgid ""
"\"Your fighting style is efficient, but terribly rude and inelegant. If you "
"were my servant, I'd teach you some manners.\""
msgstr "\"네 싸움 기술은 그럴 듯하지만 무례하고 우왁스러워. 네가 내 하인이었다면 예의를 가르쳤을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "949db3ce-2d2e-4f1a-aa3f-cc5170b91e30"
msgid ""
"\"Oh Regongar, you're so handsome and strong — and you strike without mercy! "
"I melt just watching you...\" [yawns] \"Now what was I talking about? Oh "
"yes. Pass the salt, please.\""
msgstr ""
"\"레곤가르. 너는 너무 잘생기고 강해. 그리고 박력있고! 너를 보면 내가 녹아내릴 거 같아...\" [하품] \"내가 뭐라고 했었지? "
"오. 맞아. 소금 좀 건내줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c4f5fa10-54d9-4e39-8abc-bf5d57270d7a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm getting drunk when we return to the capital! Jaethal, you keeping me "
"company? We'll get drunk together... Dead-drunk, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"수도로 돌아가면 진탕 마셔야지! 제이탈. 우리는 여전히 동료지? 우리 같이 마시자... 송장이 될 때까지 마시자고! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJaethal/Banter_RegongarJaethal_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0dd96b7b-569a-4b08-90f0-a01c92e7bc2b"
msgid ""
"\"Such sophisticated humor. {Name}, why don't you install a strappado in the "
"capital for pun lovers?\""
msgstr "\"정말 저렴한 유머군. {Name}, 술꾼을 위해 수도에 술집을 짓지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a9625e3b-6dcd-4009-abd2-02e958e42e3f"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost, I don't get it – how are you still alive? You're so small – and "
"you always piss everyone off!\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 알려줘. 어떻게 여전히 살아있어? 그렇게 작은 몸집으로 사람들을 열불나게 하는데 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "53c777c4-5fc3-4e63-a7c0-67449f3b770b"
msgid ""
"\"Ah! It's my strategic planning skills! There's always someone big and dumb "
"beside me, who is more convenient to aim at!\""
msgstr "\"아! 그건 내 전략의 일부야! 항상 내 옆에는 덩치 크고 멍청한 녀석이 있어서 좋은 표적이 되거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c9816bd0-a9c2-4259-a56d-ff86378daaa5"
msgid ""
"\"You want some advice, Jubilost? Keep away from the Technic League. Those "
"creeps don't care about your research. For them, you're a... Specimen – "
"that's it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"조언을 듣고 싶어. 주빌로스트? 기술 연맹과 친하게 지내지 마. 그 녀석들은 네 연구는 관심 없어. 너는 뭐랄까... 실험용 쥐야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "819b50a5-060b-4483-8698-2fbdf8198121"
msgid ""
"\"Well... I think a scientist can always come to terms with another "
"scientist, even if some of their research methods are, so to speak, "
"disputable.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 나는 과학자들은 항상 합의에 도달할 수 있다고 생각해. 그들의 연구 주제가 뭐랄까. 논쟁의 여지가 있어도 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "da236df0-961c-4f08-962a-c02ed5e533b8"
msgid ""
"\"And why couldn't you just sit in Absalom? You'd eat grouse from a silver "
"platter, drink expensive wine and keep writing your little books. Why did "
"you have to travel all the way to the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 압살롬에 말뚝박지 않았어? 은수저로 수프를 뜨고 비싼 와인을 마셔가며 책을 쓸 수 있었을 텐데. 왜 도둑맞은 땅을 여행하고 싶었지?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "80450d22-4c7d-4774-8137-a83cdf936437"
msgid ""
"\"You see, to afford grouse and wine, a writer must be successful. And to "
"achieve success, one needs to experience what one writes about!\""
msgstr "\"은수저와 와인을 사려면 성공해야 하기 때문이지. 그리고 성공하려면 소재가 필요하고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8f6f52b9-8c25-4a7c-81e3-3638cbe84a45"
msgid ""
"\"I thought super-clever professors like you don't even take a shit without "
"a crowd of armed guards. Forget about an expedition to the Stolen Lands!\""
msgstr "\"너처럼 무지 똑똑한 교수 나부랭이들은 무장한 경비들은 신경도 안쓸 줄 알았는데. 도둑맞은 땅 여행은 잊어버리라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a394634e-6090-4951-bfd0-905c0086cd37"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I have to admit, coming here may not have been my finest idea. "
"Although the notes I've taken during our travels are quite valuable. It "
"would be a pity if they were never to see the light, because their author "
"ended his journey in a troll's stomach.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 인정해야겠군. 여기 오는 건 사실 계획에 없었어. 우리 여행 중에 쓴 기록이 값지더라도 말이야. 만약 내가 트롤의 밥이 된다면 "
"이 기록들도 빛을 보지 못하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e5b5abbb-e85e-4726-a192-8ec8cbb3c88b"
msgid "\"I think I chipped my tooth in the last battle...\""
msgstr "\"저번 전투에서 이가 부서진 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f2f37804-11d0-4ccb-b64e-f914a88f9719"
msgid ""
"\"Well, maybe you shouldn't yell and curse at your opponents when you fight! "
"And you say I talk a lot!\""
msgstr "\"싸울 때는 나불거리지 말랬지! 그러고도 내가 말이 많다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1c985c7a-e554-49f5-88e7-cbeb06de6f20"
msgid ""
"\"That was a tough day. Want to relax? I have something nice in my flask!\""
msgstr "\"힘든 하루였어. 긴장을 풀고 싶어? 내 플라스크에 멋진 걸 담아왔는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "113fc46a-40b5-44a1-83c3-842808a2be54"
msgid ""
"\"Ughh! 'Nice' for those who want heartburn, an ulcer, and a three-week "
"hangover! Put it away and don't take it back out. When we return to the "
"capital, I'll treat you to something really good!\""
msgstr "\"가슴 앓이, 속쓰림, 숙취에 좋다고! 다시는 꺼내지 마. 수도에 돌아가면 진짜 좋은 걸 보여주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "98c6e39f-c84f-45af-996e-4140f4a34c89"
msgid ""
"\"Knowing you, I would guess it's donkey piss, and as soon as we taste it, "
"you'll laugh, saying, 'I said it was nice! And it's good for you too, ha ha "
"ha hmmm!\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 아는데 맛이 소똥 같겠지. 그걸 먹으면 우릴 비웃을 거 다 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f4698cf0-7c22-4111-8411-e9f268dc118f"
msgid ""
"\"Knowing you, I would guess it's donkey piss, and as soon as we taste it, "
"you'll laugh, saying, 'I said it was nice! And it's good for you too, ha ha "
"ha hmmm!\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 아는데 맛이 소똥 같겠지. 그걸 먹으면 우릴 비웃을 거 다 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2d2c87bb-dbd4-44df-83a7-c9e22c494e1f"
msgid ""
"\"You think you're the most valuable member of the gang? How much good are "
"you in battle, and how much good am I?\""
msgstr "\"네가 일행에서 가장 중요하다고 생각해? 싸움에서 네가 얼마나 잘싸울까? 그리고 나는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarJubilost/Banter_RegongarJubilost_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4b84af0f-7749-4634-b9b1-e680f1257b79"
msgid ""
"\"Harbor no illusions of your importance. You are merely my portable meat "
"shield! It's your job to stand between death and genius. Of course, this is "
"a great honor for you, but you should understand your place!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자신감은 중요하지. 너는 내 고기방패일 뿐이지만! 천재를 위해 죽음을 맞이하는 게 네 일이라고. 주제를 알고 영광으로 아는 게 좋을걸!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ef038700-4102-4b83-b00a-4c1908d0a7fb"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, pip-squeak! What are you writing there, hunh? About how gloriously we "
"kicked their asses in the last brawl?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 쫑알이! 뭘 쓰고 있는 거야? 저번 전투에서 우리의 무용담을 쓰고 있기라도 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7890f711-2e26-41d8-91d8-e6187279c171"
msgid ""
"\"Well... actually I'm writing a tale about a little halfling. But when he "
"grows up, he'll definitely kick someone's butt – just like you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음.. 사실 작은 하플링에 대한 이야기를 쓰고 있어요. 그 하플링이 자라면 당신 같은 녀석의 엉덩이를 두들겨 줄 예정이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ffb02856-2da1-4f40-bd36-cfacb7d4bf05"
msgid "\"Listen, Linzi, how did you learn to lie without ever slowing down?\""
msgstr "\"린지. 어떻게 쉴 새 없이 거짓말을 내뱉는 기술을 얻었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "00ff88a2-5084-4e46-b200-01303ad39fb9"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's no secret. The village I was born in – it was the most boring "
"place in the world! Down to the ditch, to do the daily weeding, I had to "
"make up stories, each one better and better!\""
msgstr "\"별거 없어요. 내가 태어난 마을은 정말 지루했거든요! 매일 잡초나 뽑아야 해서 전 이야기를 만들어 다듬고는 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "619e217d-ef33-4ec2-b1b3-a6012f776bcb"
msgid ""
"\"You know what I like about you? You're almost the only one here who's not "
"trying to tell me that I live the wrong way!\""
msgstr "\"네 장점이 뭔지 알아? 여기서 잔소리 하지 않는 유일한 녀석이라는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1f4d95a1-f04c-425c-b250-e3c46681073c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, live however you like, what do I care? Each of us writes their own "
"story.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 어떻게 살던 나와 관계는 없으니까요. 자기의 이야기는 스스로 써가는 거라구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "13248911-f25c-43ac-a07b-1240e69e2372"
msgid ""
"\"And you know why? I don't see any point in wasting my time on an arrogant "
"bully who never listens to anyone anyway.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 사람의 이야기에 귀기울이지 않는 녀석에게 시간낭비할 틈 없다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9149e21c-aad4-4b30-95f9-b327f1fbb0ba"
msgid ""
"\"And you know why? I don't see any point in wasting my time on an arrogant "
"bully who never listens to anyone anyway.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 사람의 이야기에 귀기울이지 않는 녀석에게 시간낭비할 틈 없다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d384c80a-5236-4ba0-b907-5987a4e310c0"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, got any grub? My stomach is growling like an angry tiger-rat.\""
msgstr "\"린지. 먹을 거 있어? 뱃속에서 화난 호랑이쥐가 우는 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7624d7c0-705f-4981-8496-de9954afe067"
msgid ""
"\"But tiger-rats don't exist! Although from the sound of your stomach, I'd "
"have guessed you'd caught one and swallowed it whole!\""
msgstr "\"그런 동물은 존재하지 않아요. 하지만 당신이라면 쥐 한마리 쯤은 한번에 삼키겠는걸요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "23fe6d07-58e2-4541-98d5-a910e99759cd"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Linzi, can you write a story about me? One where I'm bursting into "
"a crowd of enemies, lopping off their heads, and then kicking their corpses "
"and laughing like a madman?\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지. 나에 대한 이야기좀 써주겠어? 적군의 한가운데에 뛰어들어 머리를 베고 그들의 시체를 밟으며 광인처럼 웃는다... 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0dc81fce-f347-4aa0-9050-c570008d96ee"
msgid "\"What kind of story is that? That's your biographer's job.\""
msgstr "\"무슨 이야기가 그래요? 그런건 직접 쓰세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2e8b2738-deca-4d05-a396-7000a77b073b"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, are you writing about our last brawl? What are you saying about me?\""
msgstr "\"저번 전투에 대해 쓰고 있는 거야? 나는 어떻게 썼어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d535cb85-ab8b-4f84-9a66-648cf802ffb3"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you were... horrible. You shot lightning. And just cursed. Regongar, "
"please say something heroic in battle at least once! I can't write down the "
"stuff you say! And I can't lie that you were fighting in silence, now can I?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 당신은 끔찍했어요. 번개를 쏘고는 욕을 했죠. 레곤가르. 싸울 때 멋진 대사 하나 쯤은 준비하세요. 당신 말은 순화하기가 "
"어렵다구요! 싸울 때 묵묵하게 싸웠다고 쓸 수도 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "75745d78-6c57-4a68-83fe-7a4bc38ecc6d"
msgid ""
"\"You're the perfect height for stabbing someone in the groin! Why don't you "
"do it? That's a winning move in any battle!\""
msgstr "\"네 키면 적의 사타구니를 난도질하기 좋을 텐데! 그래 본 적 있어? 최고의 전략 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarLinzi/Banter_RegongarLinzi_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "38536ed6-56ad-460d-b4d0-cf8cf19a1ed8"
msgid ""
"\"Well... it doesn't sound very heroic! None of the heroes from the books "
"I've read ever did this!\""
msgstr "\"음... 별로 멋지진 않네요! 영웅들은 그런 짓을 하지 않는다구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarNokNok/Banter_RegongarNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b100d4f6-0f08-41a2-bb9d-db67075c7e88"
msgid "\"Hey, gnat! Sing us one of your goblin songs!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 꼬맹이! 고블린 노래 하나만 불러줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarNokNok/Banter_RegongarNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6ddc3158-5e13-414a-a59d-a0f772a6d526"
msgid "\"Let me think. Hmmm. No. You stink.\""
msgstr "\"생각해 볼께요. 흠. 싫어요. 당신 냄새나요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "997425b0-875a-4970-a801-9df24f42be96"
msgid ""
"\"It's so great to be free! To breath deep, without a collar around your "
"throat! Not to fear the whip, and go wherever you like... Right, my Octavia?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"자유가 되어 너무 기뻐! 족쇄 없이 숨을 쉬는 이 기쁨이란! 채찍질도 두려워하지 않고 말이야. 아무데나 갈 수도 있고... 그렇지. "
"나의 옥타비아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "abd8ba60-b400-460a-b12a-55e7331c1dd2"
msgid ""
"\"Reg... I've asked you, don't call me 'yours'. Every time you say that, you "
"make me feel like I'm back in chains!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르... 말했잖아. 나는 너의 것이 아니라고. 네가 그렇게 말할 때마다 내 기분이 답답해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "efb892b6-deac-495c-85a6-cf0401224c45"
msgid ""
"\"I saw a book here... It was quite interesting – with pictures! I think it "
"was called 'Jade Wand Unlocks Jasper Gates'. Too bad I couldn't steal it. "
"But I remember a few pictures!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥미로운 책을 봤는데... 그림도 있고 말이야! '제이드 완드가 야스퍼 게이츠의 자물쇠를 열었다'라고 쓰여있었어. 훔쳐오지 못해서 "
"안타까워. 지금은 그림도 기억이 가물가물해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "82ce108d-7c8a-45ac-ba93-450ab7c59544"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... I think I know which book you're talking about. Are you suggesting "
"we try it?\""
msgstr "\"음... 무슨 책을 말하는지 알겠다. 그대로 한번 해 보자는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0497fe90-5593-4d63-b94d-c5aac9881554"
msgid ""
"\"Remember that day in Starfall? I was laying there with broken ribs and my "
"face all smashed up, and you rocked my head on your knees and wiped the "
"blood from my face...\""
msgstr ""
"\"스타폴에서 그날을 기억해? 내 얼굴은 엉망이 되었고 내 갈비뼈가 부러져 누워 있었는데 나를 무릎에 앉히고 피를 닦아주었잖아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f5ff5a1e-f73c-4e3d-ae5c-0f4ecdac60a9"
msgid ""
"\"I remember, Reg. I do, and I'll never forget it. But that's all over, "
"forever.\""
msgstr "\"기억해. 레그. 생생히. 그리고 잊지 않을 거야. 하지만 이제 그런 일은 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f7da5e15-f0d1-4c10-a0d8-ef4c25f61436"
msgid ""
"\"If it wasn't for you, I wouldn't have survived there. I'd have died under "
"the lash, or jumped on a guard's spear.\""
msgstr "\"네가 아니었다면 살아남지 못했을 거야. 매맞아 죽었거나 경비병의 창에 달려들어 죽었겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f482fbb2-1b94-42f2-81b1-a6951c859aa9"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't have survived without you either. Your rage gave me hope, even "
"on the edge of despair.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너 없인 살아남을 수 없을 거야. 너의 분노가 항상 나의 희망이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a8b4883b-744b-4f8e-8d45-7b9c219ef257"
msgid "\"How is it you have time to put on makeup every morning?\""
msgstr "\"매일 아침 화장하느라 바쁘지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2c61cbdd-e02e-4089-af52-ffa3cf92a7fd"
msgid ""
"\"If you didn't sleep until midday, you'd at least have time to wash your "
"face!\""
msgstr "\"늦잠만 자지 않는다면 얼굴 씻을 시간은 있을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e65d02d5-2669-4bd8-8708-f6a564470948"
msgid "\"Tell me, my Octavia...\""
msgstr "\"말해줘. 나의 옥타비아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ad83f963-a02e-429e-aedc-3b6b0b318752"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, I... I don't want to yell at you again. I'll just tell you calmly, "
"for the five-hundredth time: Don't. Call. Me. That.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 나... 더 화내기는 싫어. 같은 말을 몇번이나 반복해야 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_RegongarOctavia1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ee7fdb7d-dff7-4704-abf3-a669f3ae71c2"
msgid "\"Rrrrrrr...\""
msgstr "\"윽...!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarOctavia/Banter_RegongarOctavia_RegongarOctavia1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "cad2311d-37b4-42d7-b504-215449b96575"
msgid "\"Re-e-g, you silly goose... What's up with you? Ha, ha, ha...\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 이 바보... 뭐하는 거야? 하하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c43caa04-4f6f-4638-a051-a908dbc4a02b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, the Technic League... We'll even the score – I swear to Calistria!\""
msgstr "\"오. 기술 연맹 녀석들... 똑같이 되갚아주겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c17174a3-d656-4705-ba13-836c97089e88"
msgid ""
"\"I hope they send more of their agents for us. It feels so good to wipe the "
"ground with them!\""
msgstr "\"계속 우리를 쫓으라지. 오는 녀석들은 모두 해치워줄 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a449c58c-0e41-4ef4-8412-b9ea844a3015"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, Octavia, my Octavia... You said we'd get out and live! And you were "
"right – we got out, and we're living!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤. 옥타비아. 나가서 살아남자고 했잖아! 네가 맞았어. 우리는 자유롭게 살고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0f8e3b89-0dc0-41c5-970a-d0877b9e206d"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, I'd like to punch someone in the face right now. And watch the blood "
"splash everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"흠. 내 옆에 오면 가만 안둬. 피를 보게 될걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3772aa5d-667a-4b30-a972-34fcf7c4b0c1"
msgid ""
"\"The only thing better than a good fight is a fight that you're still "
"standing afterwards, ha ha.\""
msgstr "\"싸움에서 가장 좋은 보상은 멀쩡하게 살아있는 거지. 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b650df01-e296-4824-8622-e83bbebaa3af"
msgid ""
"\"You really don't care who you 'punch' and why? Nethys save me from this "
"world.\""
msgstr "\"가만두지 않겠다고? 왜? 네시스가 나를 보호할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ecb2f74d-b676-45ad-a81b-298a25408a2b"
msgid "\"So why is everyone staring at me like that, hunh?\""
msgstr "\"왜 모두 나를 그렇게 보는 거야. 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c1b848fe-bf49-4745-84f5-fbca62ec4813"
msgid ""
"\"Did I forget to wash my face after I ripped out that creep's throat?\""
msgstr "\"내 얼굴에 피라도 묻었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b162c907-c8c6-42f0-9b7d-e14711c05b95"
msgid ""
"\"Who will remember me when I die, hunh? Who's going to cry? Just my "
"Octavia... Or would she...\""
msgstr "\"내가 죽을 때 누가 나를 기억해줄까? 누가 울어줄까? 나의 옥타비아일 거야... 아니면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b6dc3a57-cc7c-4898-961d-d30dc7dcde2a"
msgid "\"Hey, who's that?!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 그게 누구야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarRegongar/Banter_RegongarRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ec026a86-5289-467b-8404-1150f31ca70c"
msgid ""
"\"I thought I saw someone. Heh, I've been free for a long time, but I still "
"see an assassin in every shadow!\""
msgstr "\"누군가를 본 줄 알았어. 오랫동안 자유의 몸이었지만 암살자는 잘 볼 수 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8be35a51-fa62-42c0-bc9b-a935509c200b"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, you're such a wet rag! I'm messing with you, and you just back "
"down. Don't be such a coward – hit me in the face!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 이 겁쟁아! 장난 좀 치려는데 내빼기야. 어서 나에게 한방 먹이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9ed4a14a-c630-4c68-ad33-5486fb6e2c94"
msgid ""
"\"You think you can prove something by hitting someone in the face? That's "
"just silly.\""
msgstr "\"누군가와 싸워야만 가치를 입증할 수 있을 것 같나요? 그건 그냥 어리석은 짓입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "dfc0e240-ba1a-49fd-b66a-005ed2de7a03"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you tired of pretending to be a saint? I know deep inside you're "
"just like us!\""
msgstr "\"착한 척하는 거 지겹지 않아? 네 속이 우리와 다를 바 없다는 거 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9a18d25e-de52-4828-815a-48f425083cd1"
msgid ""
"\"You mean I have the same red blood flowing through my veins? Yes, in that "
"way I'm no different from you. But as for the rest...\""
msgstr "\"당신도 붉은 피를 흘리십니까? 그렇다면 맞는 말입니다만, 나머지는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2902898a-3e18-45b1-94b4-a808689665a0"
msgid ""
"\"Mercy, forgiveness... It's all nonsense. People don't change. If you've "
"been a cutthroat all your life, you can't just donate a sack of gold to the "
"temple and suddenly you're redeemed!\""
msgstr "\"자비, 용서... 모두 헛소리야. 사람은 바뀌지 않아. 거만하게 살다가 죽기 전에 기부해서 구원받으면 모두 괜찮은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9c9721f5-f033-49be-81e2-914943bb684d"
msgid ""
"\"Atonement cannot be bought, you're right about that. It can only be "
"realized by righteous action. And every one of us can reform and become "
"better than we were before!\""
msgstr ""
"\"속죄는 돈으로 살 수 없습니다. 그건 옳은 말씀이십니다. 선행으로 속죄를 깨달을 수 있겠죠. 마음이 있다면 뉘우칠 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3eae6f6a-e91d-4c4f-b446-f00f84ee7997"
msgid ""
"\"You keep babbling on and on about forgiveness, but I've seen you in "
"battle! Standing there covered in blood from head to toe, the look of doom "
"on your face. Is that what forgiveness looks like?\""
msgstr ""
"\"계속 용서에 대해 지껄이지만 네가 싸울 때 자비는 없던걸? 머리부터 발끝까지 피로 뒤집어써서 얼굴은 무표정하고 말이야. 자비가 그런 "
"거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fa5e7614-86b8-4d40-9e97-0a4144893f9b"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae grants healing to those who can be healed, and interrupts the "
"life journey of those who are too late repenting their sins. I am just her "
"humble instrument.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 치유가 가능한 사람을 치유하고, 죄를 뉘우치지 않는 자를 벌합니다. 저는 그분의 도구일 뿐이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "650e3dcd-d6af-4f5c-ad72-fa1a9fd2950c"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, are all of Sarenrae's priests this boring? With preachers like "
"you, she must not have many followers!\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 사제들은 모두 그렇게 지루해? 너 같이 지루하면 신도들도 별로 없겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2052c88e-b3b6-4dc0-9cf1-27aa59ff13ab"
msgid ""
"\"The Healing Light burns in the hearts of thousands upon thousands of "
"believers. In trying to insult my goddess, you're only displaying your own "
"ignorance.\""
msgstr "\"치유의 빛은 수천 명의 신자들의 가슴에서 불타오르고 있습니다. 당신의 모욕은 자신의 무지를 드러낼 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "61ee06d0-800b-4294-b468-45d1f96d663d"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, pushover priest! Can you do anything at all, or is wagging your "
"tongue the only thing you're good at?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 사제! 혀놀리는 것 말고 잘하는 게 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0933de77-f1ad-4029-b1c9-07dcd0d1f00a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm no pushover. In fact I find it difficult to contain myself when I hear "
"your foul words. It requires strength. But you just try to insult an "
"innocent in my presence, and you'll see what I'm capable of.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 시비를 들을 때마다 제 자신을 억누르기가 힘들군요. 당신 덕에 인내심이 강해지고 있어요. 계속 그렇게 나의 순수함을 욕보이면 "
"제가 잘하는 걸 보게 될 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f19d4620-e0d9-4721-99a2-d1a7d8853e88"
msgid ""
"\"Your Sarenrae is a real hypocrite! Forgive this one, punish that one... "
"Calistria's teachings are simple and fair: you get offended – you get "
"revenge! It's all honest, no tricks or pretense!\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이는 위선자야! 이놈은 용서하고 저놈은 처벌하고... 칼리스트리아의 가르침은 단순명료하지. 맞으면 되갚아줘라! 속임수도 허위도 "
"없잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "54dab8f4-d721-42ae-917b-dfa546c37e91"
msgid ""
"\"The debate between mercy and revenge has gone on for thousands of years. "
"Do you really think you and I are going to settle it now? You and your "
"goddess have chosen your path. I follow my goddess a different way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자비와 복수의 관한 논쟁은 수천년 동안 계속되어 왔지요. 그렇게 결론내기 수운 게 아닙니다. 우리의 신은 서로 다른 길을 걷고 있을 "
"뿐이고, 저는 저의 길을 걷는 것 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fba74d60-51d7-4613-8160-164fffebf8ca"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Tristian! Did you by any chance make a vow of celibacy? If not, maybe "
"you should come show me some love... the love of your goddess, haha! You "
"might just turn me to the light!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안! 혹시 독신 서약 했어? 아니라면 나는 어때? 하하! 나도 서렌레이를 믿을 거 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarTristian/Banter_RegongarTristian_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4e7f11a2-c368-4c15-9362-7837a604d0cd"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you dare mistake your debauched lust for love. That's disgusting!\""
msgstr "\"욕정으로 사랑을 욕보이지 마십시오. 그건 옳지 않은 일입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "62495653-7a38-4a40-baea-07be363f3d74"
msgid ""
"\"How do you live like this, hunh? Do something stupid for once in your "
"life! Get drunk, go sleep with a stranger, get into a fight – and not for "
"honor, just because you feel like it! Show us you're a living person!\""
msgstr "\"그게 사는 거야? 살면서 깨끗한 척만 했겠지? 술에 취해서 떡도 치는 게 네 입맛에는 안맞겠지! 사람답게 살아 보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bf19484a-6883-41cb-aa35-2f59f67abd23"
msgid ""
"\"I live like a person. What you describe sounds more like living as an "
"animal. Thanks for your concern, but I can do without such 'pleasures'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 인간답게 살고 있습니다. 당신이 얘기하는 건 짐승의 삶이죠. 걱정해줘서 고맙지만 그런 기쁨 없이도 잘 살 수 있숩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "925098a7-9e32-4731-a59f-19fbe99b896c"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie, I have a hole in my shirt again. Could you mend it for me? You "
"know your way around a needle.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 셔츠에 구멍이 났는데. 좀 꿰메주겠어? 바느질 잘하잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "05283224-8fbe-49b8-8818-a0ea9fcd3bdc"
msgid ""
"\"If I pick up a needle for you, it'll be for sewing your dirty mouth shut.\""
msgstr "\"당신을 위해 바늘을 집어들었다면 그건 당신의 입을 꿰메기 위한 것이겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d197db38-01a1-42d9-bc2e-52d6c07f25cf"
msgid ""
"\"You're such a prude! But I know, deep down, you're dreaming of spending a "
"night with me!\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 예뻐! 나도 알아. 네 진심은 나와 자 보는 게 소원이라는 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7484ca63-6418-45e8-b9e8-45ff5a67624f"
msgid ""
"\"I'd be happy to spend a night alone with you... Burying your corpse "
"somewhere deep in the woods.\""
msgstr "\"정말 그런 밤이 왔으면 좋겠군요. 당신의 시체를 숲 속 땅에 묻을 수 있으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0fb702b7-9152-4636-b485-4f0970b70bb0"
msgid ""
"\"All I'm dreaming of is a bath, hot spiced tea, and the sound of rain "
"outside the window. And sweets... Oh, sorry for not properly appreciating "
"your embarrassing little delusions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 꿈꾸고 있는 건 목욕과 뜨거운 차 그리고 창 밖에서 들려오는 빗소리야. 다과도 있으면 더 좋고... 오. 너의 부끄러운 상상을 "
"알아봐주지 못해서 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3f637188-2b88-464f-9c65-829abfbdd3a5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, what is it I hear, a bruised ego? It must be so hard for you, mighty "
"Regongar, to walk beside someone with no interest in your charms…\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 방금 뭐지? 당신 자존심 부숴지는 소리 아녜요? 레곤가르, 이해합니다. 자기한테 관심 없는 사람이랑 걷는건 힘들겠죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ee728b7e-0225-4913-b6ea-4d6a2ef043d5"
msgid ""
"\"Look at that. You're so noble, dressed in your shining armor. I'm a "
"hedgeborn scum wearing rubbish. What do you think, the ones we gut and "
"behead – you think they appreciate the difference?\""
msgstr "\"봐. 너는 빛나는 갑옷을 우아하게 입고 있어. 나는 누더기를 걸친 거지꼴이고. 우리가 죽인 자들은 다름을 인정할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "11e07708-e25d-49fd-a635-0c2f910eaf56"
msgid ""
"\"A worthy man would surely be happy to fall in battle to a worthy opponent. "
"And as for the likes of you – their feelings are of no interest to me.\""
msgstr "\"실력있는 자는 적수를 만나게 되면 행복해 할겁니다. 당신같은 사람들의 생각은 관심도 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c3eafa93-3286-4caa-b72e-422689d6b044"
msgid ""
"\"You did the right thing telling those goody-goodies to get lost. But are "
"you really liberated? Look at you. You don't pray to anyone, but you toe the "
"line like a soldier on the training grounds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 옳은 일을 했단걸 알아. 착한체하는 것들이 까먹은걸 말해줬지. 하지만 너는 정말 자유일까? 너는 신을 믿지 않는다고 하지만, 네 "
"꼴은 훈련장의 병사 같다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dc54646a-8997-47f9-bd0b-23acc5334dc5"
msgid ""
"\"It's called discipline and dignity. They are precisely what liberates me. "
"I'm afraid you wouldn't understand.\""
msgstr "\"제가 규율과 존엄성을 따라서이겠지요. 저는 그것들 안에서 자유를 얻습니다. 당신이 이해하지 못할까 두렵군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0ac49d56-1523-437e-a6a8-2cf59dfd4067"
msgid ""
"\"What a beautiful sky. I remember a similar sky in Hajoth Hakados, when "
"Octavia and I hid on a roof, escaping from the Technic League's agents.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 아름다운 하늘이야. 이런 날이면 옥타비아와 함께 기술 연맹에서 도망칠 때 하조스 하카도스에서 지붕 위에 숨던 때가 떠오른 단 "
"말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6b44ad89-6918-4272-bdbe-28f28592ec21"
msgid ""
"\"What is this I hear – Regongar talking about beauty? I was hoping at least "
"this one vice was alien to you! Well, now I guess you embody absolutely "
"everything I hate!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 방금 뭘 들은 거죠? 레곤가르가 아름다움에 대해 얘기하다니! 적어도 그 말은 안했으면 했는데, 이제 제가 싫어하는 모든 걸 "
"갖추셨군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b2332beb-87ec-4727-82d9-3d3ef0166c88"
msgid ""
"\"It's surprising to hear you speak of the beauty of the sky. You seem more "
"like someone who kicks people for admiring the sky, not doing it yourself.\""
msgstr "\"네가 하늘이 아름답다는 소리를 들으니 놀랍다. 너는 사람을 걷어차서 하늘로 보내버릴 줄 알았는데 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4b6b6fae-b76b-456e-9b91-109fb454dfb6"
msgid ""
"\"You know what surprises me most about your stories? How — how did the "
"Technic League let you escape so many times? If the resources and people "
"they assigned to catching slaves were instead focused on guarding them in "
"the first place, their problems would be solved...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 이야기가 놀라운 점이 무언지 알아? 기술 연맹에게서 어떻게 그리 자주 도망칠 수 있었던 거야? 노예 감독관들이 없고 추격자만 "
"있다면 이해가 가지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "628bd959-24bf-4f82-a5f1-e575ac94c189"
msgid "\"Valerie, do you want to practice? How about a little one on one?\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 훈련하고 싶어? 대련해 볼래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "52dee4a0-ebf2-4f56-9bef-cc20780c60c4"
msgid ""
"\"I accepted your offer once. The entire fight, instead of fencing honestly, "
"you just tried to grab me. Thank you very much, but I can do without such "
"practice.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 제안을 받아들였습니다. 싸우는 도중 당신은 저를 잡으려고만 하더군요. 대련은 고맙지만 이렇게라면 사양하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_RegongarValerie1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "644a2dc6-7084-4c6d-9d4d-2c9a238de560"
msgid ""
"\"Looking down on me? Sure — do that! Ha, ha, hmm. Soon enough you'll get "
"yourself in trouble again, and then...\""
msgstr "\"나를 무시해? 마음대로 해! 하하. 나중에 후회할 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/RegongarValerie/Banter_RegongarValerie_RegongarValerie1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8e57ed5f-ffb2-48a9-84f2-8b29e487e159"
msgid ""
"\"Then what?! You make absolutely no sense. If one of us is to save the "
"other, it'll be me saving you. I've studied your technique — elbows too "
"wide, stride too long — and besides... what are you always laughing at?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩌라는 겁니까?! 말도 안되는 소리입니다. 우리 둘 중에 한명이 위험에 빠진다면 구해주는 사람은 저일 것입니다. 당신의 기술을 "
"연구해봤는데 팔꿈치를 너무 뻗고, 보폭도 너무 길다구요! 그리고... 왜 그렇게 항상 실실 웃는 겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "64b5498d-90fe-456e-9590-228ae810454b"
msgid ""
"\"Don't get me wrong, knowing how to forgive is as important as knowing how "
"to fight. Without mercy for the defeated, the victor wins no glory!\""
msgstr "\"오해하지 말라고. 용서하는 법이 싸우는 법 만큼 중요하니까. 자비가 없다면 승자에게는 명예도 없는 법이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3bfb5d21-c4d3-4884-b6ed-7191de6f3c62"
msgid ""
"\"What do you know about glory?! The one who defeats everyone else is the "
"most glorious. And the best mercy is killing fast, without suffering.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 명예에 대해서 뭘 알아?! 승자는 항상 명예롭다고. 최고의 자비는 고통 없는 죽음이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "268d3418-0a9a-4c15-9490-6f9b487e4371"
msgid ""
"\"You're sweet, Amiri. I'm sure you have a kind heart. If only you learned "
"to control your passions...\""
msgstr "\"당신은 다정한 분이십니다, 아미리. 친절한 마음씨를 갖고 계시죠. 분노를 다스리는 법만 배우신다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a3a95011-4959-4a76-a76b-5c5adbac5137"
msgid ""
"\"A barbarian without passions is like without... hmm... – without guts, "
"that's it! If I lose my rage, who will fight for you while you babble your "
"prayers, hunh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"분노 없는 야만인이라... 흠... 그래, 내장이 없는거나 마찬가지야! 내가 화를 내지 않으면 네가 기도할 때 누가 너를 위해 "
"싸워주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fb686315-4fa3-42a3-ab35-6ab43ccda6b3"
msgid ""
"\"The trials and tribulations of your fruitless land have hardened you, "
"Amiri.\""
msgstr "\"척박한 땅에서의 시련이 당신을 단련시켰군요. 아미리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "285e31d8-5779-488f-baa0-2b320c5e5286"
msgid ""
"\"That's right! A southern boy like you, wouldn't last a day with us. – "
"You'd either freeze or someone would eat you for a snack!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 너 같은 남부 녀석은 하루도 못견디겠지. 아마 얼어 죽거나 냉동 식품이 되겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "45538727-c268-4ce2-b015-ec52d840a9f3"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't treat Sarenrae with such disdain. She's a great goddess, who "
"has defeated many horrible monsters. Her shining sword has wiped whole "
"cities from the face of the world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이님을 모독하지 마십시오. 위대한 신이시며, 무시무시한 괴물을 수도 없이 물리치셨어요. 잘 벼른 시미터로 도시 정도는 흔적도 "
"없이 사라지게 만들 수 있는 분입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c2b4d553-35dd-4eb1-9eb4-2dd039332ae4"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, not bad! Then why do you keep nagging about mercy and forgiveness? "
"Tell me about how she slaughtered her enemies!\""
msgstr "\"하. 나쁘지 않군! 그렇다면 왜 자비에 대해서 그렇게 나불거리는 거야? 그녀가 얼마나 많은 적을 도륙했는지나 말해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "97c6fd51-faf7-4ada-9ddd-b24df07c9996"
msgid ""
"\"Merciful doesn't mean spineless. In one hand, Sarenrae holds a healing "
"light, in the other – a killing sword!\""
msgstr "\"자비는 약함을 의미하지 않습니다. 서렌레이는 한 손에 치유의 빛을 다른 손에는 시미터를 들고 계시지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "24ba65c6-4a84-4ee8-b63b-c9a3a0a7ee17"
msgid ""
"\"I know you are good with your little sword. And you don't run away in a "
"fight. But after a battle you always have that face, like you just swallowed "
"a hedgehog. What's the point of fighting if you don't enjoy it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 그 작은 칼을 잘 다루는 것은 알아. 그리고 겁쟁이가 아니라는 것도. 하지만 왜 전투가 끝나면 왜 항상 울상인 거야? 싸움을 "
"즐기라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "04d73fe9-b0b5-4f8c-8b84-40a9f9bc5c51"
msgid ""
"\"You might be surprised to hear this, boy-priest, but I was that sword, and "
"I've cut down many. Perhaps even more than you.\""
msgstr "\"별 것도 아니군. 내가 더 많은 적들을 해치웠어. 너보다 더 많이 해치웠을걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b06f755f-b8a3-44ac-9c18-90aca99c8d01"
msgid ""
"\"Have you ever thought of leaving the warrior's path? Finding a new task? "
"Putting away your sword?\""
msgstr "\"전사의 길을 그만두는 거에 대해 생각해봤습니까? 새로운 일을 찾는 거죠. 검을 버리고 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianAmiri/Banter_TristianAmiri_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0806d12c-1020-4b32-90fe-a86fa017eb8e"
msgid ""
"\"Putting away? Yeah, right. It would get stolen right away! And it's pretty "
"valuable!\""
msgstr "\"검을 버려? 흠. 맞아. 내 검은 귀중하니까 도둑맞기 쉬울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e61223df-dcf1-4cf7-a617-6fabc2ca9d8f"
msgid "\"I'm sorry that I cannot relieve your pain, Ekun...\""
msgstr "\"당신의 고통을 나눌 수 없어 미안합니다. 에쿤...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ac6dc88e-49b9-4118-b3e2-70c4356b289b"
msgid "\"Don't blame yourself. It is my burden.\""
msgstr "\"자신을 비난하지 마라. 그건 내 짐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c957221d-efd6-4c67-b180-d0a0c0bf6ad2"
msgid ""
"\"Why don't you tell us about your family, Ekun? Everyone needs to get "
"things off their chest sometimes...\""
msgstr "\"왜 가족에 대해 말하지 않는 거야? 마음에 있는 무언가를 끄집어내야 할 때가 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0c1c25af-3784-46d2-b3be-059b44fd6249"
msgid ""
"\"Words will not bring them back. You can't help me. Accept this, as I have."
"\""
msgstr "\"말한다고 그들이 돌아오나? 그건 도움이 되지 않아. 이건 내 책임이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "60abc377-c753-4a51-bfec-38ddcc27cc29"
msgid "\"Maybe you'd feel better if you found someone?\""
msgstr "\"다른 여자를 만들면 기분이 괜찮아지지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "db1270f9-f182-41c6-b758-e752b5ec2e38"
msgid ""
"\"I have you. That makes me feel better. Killing trolls – that makes me feel "
"better too. It's enough.\""
msgstr "\"내겐 동료들이 있다. 덕분에 이미 한결 나아졌어. 트롤을 죽이는 것도 나쁘지 않지. 그거면 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2b51f25a-8cdf-4c43-ae2e-99f86554665c"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae grants mercy to all. But the ones who did this to your village... "
"I think even my goddess wouldn't find words of forgiveness for them.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 모두에게 자비를 베푸시지. 하지만 네 마을을 그런 꼴로 만든 자들은... 우리의 여신은 용서치 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f2dd2bef-5471-4c47-9a53-8bcca5305a59"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Not everything can be forgiven. And there are some things that "
"shouldn't be.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 모두가 용서받을 수는 없지. 용서가 아까운 자들도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "48587704-2e6d-4318-b0da-02120df5669c"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Ekun, perhaps you should join those who venerate Sarenrae. She "
"could heal the wounds on your heart.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 너도 서렌레이를 믿어야 해. 그녀가 너의 상처를 치유해줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "17480861-b94f-4173-993c-c63f41bd9909"
msgid ""
"\"Torag is a good god. He was with me when I was at my weakest. When I was "
"dying. Why should I turn away from him now?\""
msgstr "\"토락은 좋은 신이야. 그는 내가 힘든 시기를 보낼 때 함께 해주었어. 나는 그를 계속 믿고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "779be549-99f8-48ad-8967-9f211c2d8502"
msgid ""
"\"I see how you care about your wolf. This is very noble and merciful.\""
msgstr "\"늑대를 많이 아끼던데. 정말 고상하고 자비로운 행동이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "44061947-d0f5-46d2-954c-a91c7b707e2b"
msgid ""
"\"We take care of each other. That's how it is in a pack. It's nothing to do "
"with nobleness.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 서로를 돌본다. 이것이 우리의 삶이지. 고상함과는 관계가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a80bb5d0-7a4f-4050-8c95-c61ddd7c18fc"
msgid ""
"\"You keep your distance, and don't get close to anyone. This keeps your "
"soul's wounds from healing. Forgive yourself and sit at the fire with the "
"rest of us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거리를 유지하고 가까워지는 걸 경계하지 마. 마음의 상처가 나아지지 않을 거야. 우리와 모닥불에 앉아있으면 기분이 나아질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianEkun/Banter_TristianEkun_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6077922d-aba2-47b7-9930-9ff973c4fc0a"
msgid "\"Attachment is dangerous. I could not endure further losses.\""
msgstr "\"애착은 위험하지. 나는 더 이상의 상실의 고통은 견딜 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c09aa9da-3d97-41f4-94de-3572c0b2a932"
msgid ""
"\"What's the point in worshipping Groetus? You've said it yourself: when the "
"moment comes, he will destroy everyone, including his congregation!\""
msgstr "\"그로투스를 숭배하는 게 무슨 소용이야? 그 순간이 오면 그가 신자를 포함해 모두를 파멸할 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0203b838-f4ee-42cf-8ed8-b31f0cf698b1"
msgid ""
"\"That's exactly why, Tristian. In the face of Groetus, everyone is equal – "
"believers and non-believers, people and gods. Only he is worth venerating, "
"because everything else is empty and meaningless!\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 그거야. 트리스티안. 그로투스의 앞에서 모두는 공평하지. 믿든 믿지 않든 간에 말이야. 모든 것은 헛되기 때문에 그로투스를 믿는 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "cde3d80c-404e-41cb-8b5e-34b31b054765"
msgid ""
"\"Are you happy that the world will cease to exist? What if there was a way "
"to stop Groetus from coming? Would you do it?\""
msgstr "\"세상이 멸망한다는 사실이 그렇게 좋습니까? 그로투스의 도래를 막을 방법이 있다면 어쩌시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f348004d-5d64-495b-b7dd-4686855ded4f"
msgid ""
"\"You don't understand... Groetus is not a destructor like Rovagug. He is "
"merely the herald of the fact that the world and everyone in it are mortal "
"by their nature. Everything carries inside it the seed of its own "
"destruction. It can be delayed, but never prevented.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해하지 못하는구만... 그로투스는 로바거그 같은 파괴신이 아니야. 모든 것은 유한하다는 사실을 알려주는 신일 뿐이지. 모든 것은 "
"파멸의 씨앗을 가지고 있다네. 지연할 수는 있지만 언젠가는 죽게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e2748e72-9a6c-4917-a166-3d90b43b5c84"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid for you, Harrim. This whisper... I fear it might do terrible "
"harm to your mind.\""
msgstr "\"저는 당신이 걱정됩니다, 하림. 이 속삭임... 그게 당신의 정신에 심각한 해를 끼칠까 봐 염려스러워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e0139485-b440-44b2-b65c-606c1c4b798d"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, Tristian... I understand when others talk to me about insanity, "
"but you are a priest – anointed to mysteries of your deity! Would you reject "
"the revelations of Sarenrae, if they would cost you your mind?\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안, 트리스티안... 사람들이 날 보고 미쳤다고 해도 나는 이해한다네, 하지만 자네는 신의 선택을 받은 사제 아닌가! 자네라면 "
"그게 정신을 좀 해친다 해서, 서렌레이의 계시를 거부하겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9f9cba02-697f-4b1c-8331-467ff9510e76"
msgid "\"Sometimes I feel our arguments about religion are pointless...\""
msgstr "\"가끔 우리의 종교적 논쟁이 무의미하다는 생각이 드는 군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "54d9c333-46c0-4f70-831d-ab98ae5554a1"
msgid ""
"\"Of course they are, Tristian! Of course. Everything is vanity and fuss. "
"Our conversations are nothing more than the rustling of leaves... And yet, "
"admit it, you do enjoy our little talks!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무의미 하고 말고! 결국에 모든 건 무의미하다네. 우리의 대화는 찻잔 속의 태풍에 불과하지... 그래도 인정해야 할걸세. 자네도 이 "
"담소를 즐기지 않았나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2d814f48-73e3-4dfd-8154-0f92f434099b"
msgid ""
"\"I just hope your strange god will never demand that you take your own life."
"\""
msgstr "\"당신의 이상한 신이 당신의 목숨을 바라지 않길 바라겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianHarrim/Banter_TristianHarrim_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a9ca94cd-7fc2-46e0-99c2-d18ee6d65a45"
msgid ""
"\"Of course not. Why would he? He doesn't need sacrifices. He doesn't demand "
"that his followers carry out what is in any case inevitable anyhow. The path "
"to Groetus is the path of contemplation, not destruction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럴리가. 왜 내 목숨을 원하시겠나? 그분에게는 제물이 필요 없다네. 어떤 경우에도 어찌 할 수 없는 필연을 뭣하러 굳이 행하라 "
"하시겠나? 그로투스께 가는 길은 파괴가 아니라 사색이라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJaethal/Banter_TristianJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "be2f0732-50da-4f04-9617-0555a6f45cfd"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps with divine assistance you could be healed of your unnatural "
"unlife? Do you really prefer to be a walking corpse?\""
msgstr "\"신성 마법으로 너의 삶을 치유하는 건 어떨까? 너 걸어다니는 시체 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJaethal/Banter_TristianJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "cb59ae1c-4b2f-41a5-865c-50963d93f1ed"
msgid ""
"\"Who are you lying to, priest? – Me or yourself? The only 'healing' your "
"goddess can offer me is a final death.\""
msgstr "\"치유라고? 나를 치유하겠다는 거야? 너희 신이 주는 치유 마법은 내게는 사형선고야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJaethal/Banter_TristianJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e50ffdeb-9456-4c57-94a2-d2f8ae952b40"
msgid ""
"\"I swear, there will be a day, Jaethal, that the healing light of Sarenrae "
"touches you too.\""
msgstr "\"걱정 마. 제이탈. 언젠가 서렌레이의 빛이 네게도 닿을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJaethal/Banter_TristianJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1fcfcd5d-e5ff-492a-ac25-bb3c2f877355"
msgid ""
"\"I could joke that your sermons are so bad that they might drive me from "
"the world... If I paid them more attention than I pay the buzzing of flies.\""
msgstr "\"농담인데 너의 설교가 너무 형편 없어서 나는 끝장날 거야. 네 설교를 듣느니 모기소리를 듣겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJaethal/Banter_TristianJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c9facd55-af24-4227-8fb3-5f68818cf252"
msgid ""
"\"I saw how after a battle you were leaning over one of the dead. What did "
"you do to him? Some kind of dark magic? Answer me!\""
msgstr "\"전투 중에 시체에게 무언가를 하는 것을 봤어. 무슨 짓을 한 거야? 어둠의 의식인가? 대답해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJaethal/Banter_TristianJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7769cbc5-f3db-447e-b6c4-2da3b82b05c3"
msgid ""
"\"You think you have the right to demand something from me? Well, I don't "
"mind satisfying your curiosity. I spoke with his passing spirit. Would you "
"like to know what about? I could send you to him, and you could ask him "
"yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 내게 명령할 수 없어. 네 호기심을 풀어주지. 그의 영혼과 대화를 했어. 무슨 내용인지 궁금해? 그렇다면 직접 물어보게 너도 "
"저세상으로 보내주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "80ec36d0-da83-49b9-bf3c-9aaf5e843250"
msgid ""
"\"Every time I turn away, I feel your eyes boring a hole in my back. Is "
"there something wrong?\""
msgstr "\"내가 뒤를 볼 때마다 너는 지루해 죽겠다는 듯이 쳐다보더군. 무슨 문제라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "292e2ec4-89a7-4809-84b9-353b340a39b5"
msgid ""
"\"No, it's fine. I just don't understand you, young man. And when Jubilost "
"Narthropple doesn't understand something, he tries to get to the bottom of "
"it. And he succeeds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 괜찮아. 오해를 했던 것 같아. 주빌로스트 나트로플이 모르는 게 있다면 처음부터 알려고 하지. 결국에 그가 모르는 건 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ac6fef5b-1161-4be0-a04e-fdfbf8b40257"
msgid ""
"\"I noticed you looking at a map of Kelesh. Are you trying to find where I'm "
"from? I can show you if you'd like.\""
msgstr "\"Kelesh의 지도를 보던데. 내가 어디 출신인지 궁금한 거야? 궁금하면 알려줄 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ff2ab809-2bd1-43d8-bdfb-74f2e1c66425"
msgid ""
"\"Of course you can... But that's not what I was looking for. You see, I "
"know a few things about the customs of Kelesh, and... Anyway, it doesn't "
"matter. I'll get to the bottom of this, be sure of that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고맙지만 별로 알고 싶지 않아. 나는 Kelesh에 대해서 아는 게 많지 않아서... 어쨌든 상관 없어. 나는 결국 다 알게 될 "
"거니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8087db7d-4cef-4b05-b85e-0d1d40d3e275"
msgid ""
"\"I've met some grumpy men in life, but you are the gold standard of "
"grumpiness!'"
msgstr "\"인생에서 심술 궂은 녀석들을 만났지만 네가 그 중에 최고야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "091e036c-ea48-4075-a181-d354cba7bf8b"
msgid ""
"\"And you are the very model of hair-splitting! You know, I've seen many "
"things – and I'm talking with the benefit of experience and education! "
"Instead of complaining, you'd better just listen. You might learn something!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 너는 상식 좀 배우라고. 나는 경험도 많고 배우기도 많이 배웠지. 내 말을 새겨듣는 게 좋을 거야. 뼈가 되고 살이 되는 "
"말이니 잘 들어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3601f1f3-e36f-41e7-913b-6bdf80a26225"
msgid ""
"\"You're constantly unhappy, always complaining... But you never threaten to "
"leave the party.\""
msgstr "\"불평 좀 그만할 수 없어? 그래도 일행을 떠나라는 소리를 안해서 좋군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ecf318b1-7c43-437e-a827-af7a8fcea395"
msgid ""
"\"Discontent is the normal condition of a sound mind! Comfort and "
"contentment lead one to grow fat and stupid – and even cause gnomes to "
"bleach. I may not be entirely warmhearted, but I'm never at a loss for new "
"experiences!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불만은 건전한 마음의 정상적인 상태이지. 편안함과 만족감은 사람을 바보로 만들 뿐이야. 그래서 노움들이 백화하게 된다고. 내가 정이 "
"없지만 호기심은 누구보다 많아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e060eba0-15c2-4a27-bb82-b9c34d4613e5"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you ever ashamed of all the nasty things you say to those around "
"you?\""
msgstr "\"항상 잔소리하는 게 힘들지도 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "db96fe2d-432b-4e87-9468-32d0a07ce60d"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you, demonstrate your famous mercy and spare me the lecture! In the "
"name of Sarenrae!\""
msgstr "\"부탁인데 자비를 베풀며 살아. 내가 서렌레이의 말씀을 전해줄 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "55b59b18-63e5-4b76-ada8-48d9cdee13d3"
msgid ""
"\"Your head is like an attic – so stuffed with books and trophies that "
"there's no place left for simple compassion!\""
msgstr "\"네 머릿속은 책과 잘난 상들로 가득 차있어서 남의 감정을 느끼지 못하는 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianJubilost/Banter_TristianJubilost_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c86abac5-4c7b-432e-94a5-da3833b5e315"
msgid ""
"\"And your head is like a temple of Sarenrae – beautiful, roomy, and filled "
"with incense and sunlight!\""
msgstr "\"당신의 머리는 서렌레이의 사원과 같군요. 아름답고, 풍부한, 향과 햇빛으로 가득차 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5e0e1366-9a69-49c7-afc1-de739c1c16f0"
msgid ""
"\"I know you've endured much at the hands of my brothers in faith. But this "
"doesn't mean you should be wary of me, Kaessi.\""
msgstr "\"내 형제들을 도와준 것은 알아. 하지만 내게 잔소리는 하지마. 카에시.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1caaa533-b112-4d32-8afe-cbeb40f32f6a"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you think it's because of your faith that I don't trust you? You "
"have the eyes of a snake, priest.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 믿지 못하는 게 네 믿음 때문이라 생각해? 오해하지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c8aa9e14-6dd3-4a92-b22a-40f2d8cc9c34"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you think it's because of your faith that I don't trust you? You "
"have the eyes of a snake, priest.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 믿지 못하는 게 네 믿음 때문이라 생각해? 오해하지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4f6f285d-3796-4671-8c7f-8df254cca917"
msgid ""
"\"You've accused me so many times of hypocrisy and lies. But you've been "
"hiding no less than I.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나를 겁쟁이에 위선자라고 하지만 너도 다를 게 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6b83c797-fbef-4398-bfbd-d9d99d039764"
msgid ""
"\"My sister and I are nothing like you. We were forced to hide our true "
"nature, and we never betrayed our companions.\""
msgstr "\"우리와 너는 달라. 우리는 자연으로부터 숨었지만 동료를 배신하지는 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_2_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "bfa52f54-6130-490f-9a99-6c224a807169"
msgid ""
"\"My sister and I are nothing like you. We were forced to hide our true "
"nature, and we never betrayed our companions.\""
msgstr "\"우리와 너는 달라. 우리는 자연으로부터 숨었지만 동료를 배신하지는 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1ed18e12-81f8-457e-82df-f135d2c558ea"
msgid ""
"\"Is it right to turn against an entire faith because of its most misguided "
"adherents? While you lived in Qadira, you must have had friends and loved "
"ones who followed the path of Sarenrae.\""
msgstr "\"이단아 하나 때문에 믿음을 져버린다는 게 말이 돼? 네가 카디라에 살았을 때 서렌레이의 신도와 친구가 되었어야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b2ca17fd-a889-4e74-affa-80c98cef5c3c"
msgid ""
"\"This is true. But it was not Sarenrae's teachings that made my friends "
"kind and just.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 하지만 서렌레이의 가르침으로 내 친구들이 친절한 건 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianKalikke/Banter_TristianKalikke_dlc1_3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e82c3286-546b-4ed8-b91c-e9513757cba1"
msgid ""
"\"You don't think I'm that stupid, do you? I'm sure we could find kindness "
"among the worshippers of Lamashtu, and abstainers among the followers of "
"Cayden Cailean. But I've seen enough zealous servants of Sarenrae to suspect "
"them of the worst. Call it prudent caution, if you wish.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 바보라고 생각하는 거야? 라마슈투를 숭배하는 사람이나 케이든 케일리엔의 신도 중에서도 친절한 사람은 많아. 그리고 질투하는 "
"서렌레이 신도들도 많이 봤지. 네 눈에는 질투가 아니겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "42b44e23-7b38-4919-a626-3347b7c7a289"
msgid "\"You bow before Shelyn, right? For how long?\""
msgstr "\"셸린에게 절하면서 얼마나 섬겼어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5ab51b7c-66bb-465e-8803-0604a0636af8"
msgid ""
"\"Bow? Yeah, right! As short as I am? – When I bow, I disappear into the "
"grass. I'll pray standing up, thank you. I started praying to Shelyn when I "
"was young. Everyone else in our village worshipped Erastil, but that's so "
"boring!\""
msgstr ""
"\"절한다고? 하하. 내가 허리를 숙이면 수풀 속으로 사라져버리기는 하지. 앞으로는 서서 기도해야겠어. 나는 어렸을 때 셸린을 섬겼어. "
"우리 마을 사람들은 에라스틸을 섬겼는데 정말 지겨웠다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d3fa2de0-5e07-4e4c-8378-389494599866"
msgid ""
"\"I like your stories – and it doesn't matter how much truth there is in "
"them. They bring peace and give us hope – something so many of us lack.\""
msgstr "\"너의 이야기가 마음에 들어. 얼마나 믿느냐는 중요치 않아. 그들로 인해 평화가 찾아오고 희망을 갖게 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f71c1bd5-8b37-4138-a5fd-c261e8e1dc2c"
msgid ""
"\"There! At least someone understands the true benefit of storytelling! "
"Everyone keeps saying it's 'genre work' or 'escapist'… Thank you, your words "
"are like an elixir to my soul!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 적어도 이야기의 힘을 믿는 사람이 있었다니 기뻐! 남들은 내게 숨어서 글이나 쓴다고 말하지만... 네 말을 들으니 힘이 나는걸!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "64c4793a-1379-4d17-8a54-8b28a9d1b56e"
msgid ""
"\"I like reading books. Back at the temple I spent many hours among dusty "
"folios and ragged manuscripts.\""
msgstr "\"나는 독서를 좋아해. 신전에 있던 시절에는 오랫동안 원고와 두루마리 더미에 파묻혀 살기도 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4fdf1ec9-98cf-4899-a1ac-e43959c897fe"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, the books you have there must be so boring. Biographies of saints, the "
"teachings of the enlightened... Boooring! Legends and sagas are completely "
"different!\""
msgstr "\"정말 지겨웠겠어. 성자들의 전기나 계몽 따위는... 너무 지루해! 전설이나 서사시는 정말 재밌는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a79336a6-1c5b-400a-ae6d-fcebda888928"
msgid ""
"\"Have you ever thought of joining Sarenrae's followers? You are merciful "
"and your soul is pure. You would enjoy our sunlit temples.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 신도가 되어 볼 생각 안해 봤어? 너의 영혼은 자비롭고 선하지. 햇볕이 잘드는 우리 사원을 좋아할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7a700934-498d-4934-952e-43178b1fec3d"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, but that's not going to work. I'm allergic to temples. "
"Seriously! As soon as I enter one, I start laughing so hard that the candles "
"go out.\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 그건 통하지 않아. 나는 사원이 싫어. 정말로! 내가 사원에서 웃으면 촛불이 다 꺼져버려서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7e452139-7782-4b52-9047-26611c0b97de"
msgid ""
"\"You amaze me, Linzi. You've seen so many gruesome, vulgar, and disgusting "
"things, but kept your childlike joyfulness and spontaneity. It's such a "
"beautiful gift!\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 대단해. 린지. 역겹고 저속한 녀석들을 상대해도 항상 순진한 애처럼 밝잖아. 그건 정말 좋은 성격이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b74fc81c-f715-42be-8445-a1127f0c2fa2"
msgid "\"I couldn't understand that. Was it a praise or a subtle insult?\""
msgstr "\"이해를 못하겠네. 칭찬인 거야. 아니면 욕이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e1b05b3f-2d6e-47c2-abdc-b0970db82baa"
msgid "\"There must have been many others of your faith at the Academy...\""
msgstr "\"아카데미에서 너와 같은 신앙을 따르는 이들이 많았을 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianLinzi/Banter_TristianLinzi_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5433ced1-a25e-427f-a998-719c9fc94009"
msgid ""
"\"You'd be surprised, but no! It's called the Academy of Grand Arts, but the "
"goddess of beauty isn't widely honored there. Calistria and Desna are much "
"more common!\""
msgstr "\"놀랍지만 아니라구! 미의 여신은 그곳에서 숭배의 대상이 아니었어. 칼리스트리아나 데즈나가 더 흔했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianNokNok/Banter_TristianNokNok_01_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c6663e5f-19cb-43fc-8bba-231faca10256"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't you ever think about changing your ways, Nok-Nok? To be a bit less "
"savage than your wild brethren?\""
msgstr "\"길을 바꿔 볼 생각은 안해 봤어. 녹-녹? 조금 점잖게 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianNokNok/Banter_TristianNokNok_01_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "12a2bfeb-234d-4148-b9f5-ece9bd2e6cc0"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok is not like the others. Nok-Nok wants to be a Hero! Others don't. "
"That's enough difference, why more?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 다른 고블린과 다르다. 녹-녹은 영웅 될 거다! 다른 녀석은 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianNokNok/Banter_TristianNokNok_02_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "af87d39e-1422-476f-b407-54ea7ebd140d"
msgid ""
"\"It always appears to me that Nok-Nok is too skinny even for his own kind. "
"But when I see how much he eats I know that he is fine.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 다른 고블린보다 더 마른 것 같아. 하지만 먹는 양을 보면 걱정할 필요가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianNokNok/Banter_TristianNokNok_02_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "200ae52b-8318-4572-9493-695cc624cdaa"
msgid "\"No! Nok-Nok starves! Give me your ration! I need it more than you!\""
msgstr "\"아니다! 녹-녹 배고프다! 네 식량 넘겨라! 너보다 많이 먹는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "387e987c-7725-4068-9047-4467eb85da6e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad you are with us. You are like a ray of sunshine – you make even "
"sad days more joyful.\""
msgstr "\"함께 해주셔서 기쁩니다. 정말로 한줄기 빛과 같으시군요. 슬픈 날도 즐겁게 만들어주시니 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fcb06c19-d3de-4589-921f-0dcb7d724018"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, enough! I'm lucky to have you. If it weren't for you, I'd still be in "
"the Technic League's chains!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 있어서 다행이에요. 당신이 없었다면 아직도 기술 연맹의 노예였을테니 말이죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "20131256-d870-4dc7-af3f-86cbfee0626b"
msgid "\"You look tired. I think you should rest.\""
msgstr "\"피곤해 보이는데, 좀 쉬시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fa27f900-4008-4651-9d34-a1bc8a381c36"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for caring. I'm sure you're right. But there's so much to do!\""
msgstr "\"걱정해줘서 고마워요. 맞는 말이긴 하지만 할 일이 너무 많아서요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5267ff53-ebfe-4ebd-995f-c425442be444"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad that being a slave didn't harden your heart. You are very strong."
"\""
msgstr "\"노예 생활로 감정이 무뎌지지 않아서 다행입니다. 정말 강하시군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "68a554d6-24cc-43ab-bba2-102462118cb9"
msgid ""
"\"I... I'm just the way I am. I think my owners wanted me to become as "
"wicked as they were… So I did the opposite out of spite!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저... 저는 그냥 자연스럽게 하고 있는 거예요. 옛 주인들은 절 자기네들 만치나 사악하게 행동하길 바랐죠... 그래서 반감에 반대로 "
"행동했지만요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6aac2280-8202-4d58-aeab-346739e85755"
msgid "\"If you want, I could try to heal the scars on your back.\""
msgstr "\"원한다면 제가 등에 있는 흉터를 치료해드릴 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8538d7ba-7db0-42f4-81eb-91f6099e385e"
msgid ""
"\"That would be nice! But I'm afraid it wouldn't work. Some scars are... "
"It's like they're just a reflection on my skin, you know? But you can't "
"remove the real scar, that's on my soul.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아요! 하지만 안 될 거 같아요. 그거 알아요? 어떤 흉터는 그냥 피부에 남아있는 것이지만, 마음에 난 흉터는 제거할 수 없다는 거."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3bc81f22-d06f-4f1a-8b19-954623855513"
msgid ""
"\"Slavery didn't break you. But could you forgive those who hurt you, and "
"give them a chance to atone?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 노예 생활에도 무너지지 않았습니다. 하지만 당신을 해친 사람들을 용서하고, 그들에게 속죄의 기회를 줄 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianOctavia/Banter_TristianOctavia_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ea65162b-7fb4-464c-811a-5351908ec627"
msgid ""
"\"Hell no! These wretches had a hundred chances. A thousand! Millions! I'll "
"think about forgiving them when they set all their other slaves free.\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대 안 돼요! 수백 번은! 수천 번은! 수만 번은 기회가 있었어요! 저들이 모든 노예를 풀어준다면 한 번 용서를 생각해보죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_10_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7c8e1e75-9df5-4224-b166-bddfe033331b"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't there anything that could set you free of your hatred, and let you "
"forgive your tormentors?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 증오를 누그러뜨리고, 죄 지은 자들을 용서할 수 있는 방법은 없겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_10_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1a3f6d45-3c62-4751-b7cd-431579b58d17"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I would definitely forgive all of them... When I wrapped their guts "
"around my fists!\""
msgstr "\"오, 물론 용서해줄 수 있지... 저놈들의 창자를 내 손에 두르게 해준다면 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a104d048-857e-4835-89d9-ed10566cdff8"
msgid "\"Regongar, listen...\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 들어주세요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "de5cdab1-c10a-4804-832f-30ef64aced3f"
msgid ""
"\"No! I'm not going to listen! I've heard enough preaching! Go bother "
"someone else!\""
msgstr "\"아니! 안 듣겠어! 설교는 이제 지긋지긋해! 다른 사람이나 알아봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8033f168-6a84-45bb-a154-de510019d8ca"
msgid ""
"\"I realize you don't like me, Regongar. But don't forget, we share in the "
"common cause!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 절 좋아하지 않는다는 건 압니다, 레곤가르. 하지만 잊지 마십시오. 우린 같은 목표를 가지고 있다는 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "75f6bfcd-7d51-4b1e-9979-eb4dc2e53858"
msgid ""
"\"Someone is sharing in it, while someone else is cowering in the bushes. "
"What, goody-goody, are you afraid of getting blood on your little hands?\""
msgstr ""
"\"공유야 하지. 어떤 놈은 숨어계시지만 말이야. 왜 그러시나, 착해 빠진 양반. 그 작은 손에 피를 묻히기가 그리 겁나시나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "76776f55-554d-4b6c-81bc-a536a0d03cbf"
msgid ""
"\"You can say any awful thing you want about me, Regongar. Sarenrae teaches "
"me to forgive. Insulting words spoken behind someone's back come from "
"helplessness, not from anger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제게 무슨 말을 해도 좋습니다, 레곤가르. 서렌레이께서는 제게 관용을 가르쳐주셨습니다. 누군가를 흉보는 건 분노가 아닌, 무력감에서 "
"나타나는 것이니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4c1e5270-3076-4d0b-b547-24d7fd57639d"
msgid ""
"\"Behind your back? I say everything I can think of to your face. Every "
"chance I get, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"내가 뒤에서 말한다 이 말인가? 난 뭐든 네 면전에 대고 말하고 있어. 언제나 말이야, 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fee24be3-448f-4455-9c22-4f6c923fdefb"
msgid ""
"\"Slavery maimed your soul more than your body, Regongar. Why don't you wish "
"to be healed?\""
msgstr "\"노예 생활이 그대의 육신과 영혼을 병들게 한 모양이군요, 레곤가르. 왜 치료받지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "25312026-e400-436a-ae55-fda34a22bfdf"
msgid ""
"\"Because I'm already healthy, you fool. And full of healthy anger towards "
"those who kept me in chains. And I have two healthy hands that I'm gonna use "
"to rip them to pieces. What do I need healing for?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜냐면 이미 건강한 몸이니까, 이 머저리야. 그리고 날 사슬에 묶어놓은 놈들을 향한 건전한 분노를 품고 있거든. 게다가 놈들을 "
"조각조각 찢어버릴 건강한 양 손도 있고 말이지. 내가 뭣 때문에 치료를 받아야 한단 말이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e4698891-d10d-497e-b4a0-1e2da3d1dbab"
msgid ""
"\"You must think I'm a coward because I encourage showing mercy where you "
"show everyone animal rage? But I am no coward!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 야만적으로 분노하는 것에 자비를 요구한다고 제가 겁쟁이처럼 보이는 겁니까? 전 겁쟁이가 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d55e9783-89c0-4275-9343-4af7fb42bf3b"
msgid ""
"\"Well, a coward wouldn't come bugging a dangerous fellow like me, preaching "
"absolution! So you're not a coward. But you're still a boring goody-goody!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐, 겁쟁이라면 나 같은 성질 더러운 놈한테 관용이나 설교하면서 자빠져있진 않으셨겠지! 자넨 겁쟁이가 아니야. 하지만 따분할 정도로 "
"착해 빠진 놈인 건 확실하긴 하군! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c75fff58-3c3e-45a0-8938-348f6f5b05db"
msgid ""
"\"You've done so many cruel things, so many atrocities... If you want to get "
"anything off your chest, I'm always ready to listen to your confession.\""
msgstr "\"그대는 이미 잔혹한 짓을 많이 저질렀습니다... 가슴 속에서 무언가 내려놓고 싶다면, 언제든 회개를 들어드리지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7e14289b-6dc3-45b0-be8c-f5eef434df75"
msgid "\"If I come to your tent, it'll be to sin, not to confess, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"네놈 텐트에 내가 간다면 또 다른 죄나 짓겠지, 고해성사가 아니라 말이야, 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a9425b6a-b558-4bb4-9d07-6c73179e0280"
msgid ""
"\"Are we too cruel to our enemies? Perhaps some of them could still have "
"been turned to the light.\""
msgstr "\"적에게 너무 잔인한 거 아닙니까? 어쩌면 어떤 이들은 빛으로 전향할 수 있었을텐데 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e366ebe5-03bc-4416-821c-92847300a8c5"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean 'we'? I'm the one who's cruel to our enemies. You're the "
"one who stands there babbling your prayers!\""
msgstr "\"'우리' 라니 무슨 말씀이신가? 적에게 잔인한 건 나야. 자넨 저기서 기도나 주절거리고 있었잖나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "17e61121-ddb4-4e5c-8c72-eef84bc2506c"
msgid ""
"\"You can fool the others, but not me. Your big show of anger is just a "
"mask. Deep down you're just a scared little boy who needs warmth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 사람은 속여도, 저를 속일 순 없습니다. 그대가 보여주는 분노는 가면에 불과해요. 가면 뒤에는 사람의 온기를 그리워하는 겁에 "
"질린 소년이 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5b8c1494-eca3-4f50-a59c-564f4026f657"
msgid ""
"\"That's true, I like warmth... Why don't you visit me tonight and warm my "
"bed, hunh? Ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"맞아, 따뜻한 걸 좋아하긴 해... 그런 김에 오늘 밤 와서 내 침대나 덥혀주는 건 어떠신가? 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_9_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4e91375a-cb5d-4af9-92b6-dd52172b9d73"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand Calistria's teaching. How can you see virtue in hatred, "
"the poisoning of the soul?\""
msgstr "\"칼리스트리아의 가르침은 이해하지 못하겠군요. 영혼을 중독시키는, 증오로부터 어떻게 미덕을 찾는단 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianRegongar/Banter_TristianRegongar_Pack2_9_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "937276f3-9356-416b-9294-805b76187552"
msgid ""
"\"If you don't understand it, don't talk about it. Calistria doesn't teach "
"hatred. She teaches revenge! Big difference, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해 못 하면, 말도 꺼내지 마. 칼리스트리아는 증오를 가르치는 게 아니야. 복수를 가르치시는 거라고! 차이가 크단 말이야, 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "cfc9ee63-4325-467c-9900-5f2f74afb946"
msgid ""
"\"All life is a succession of tests... Sarenrae, grant me the strength to "
"pass them all with dignity!\""
msgstr "\"모든 것이 시험의 연속이군요... 서렌레이시여. 이 위기를 헤쳐나갈 힘을 주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ff5e0acc-9180-4927-baf3-ab34f5815899"
msgid ""
"\"At least it's good to know you doubt your ability to face trials with "
"dignity.\""
msgstr "\"최소한 점잖게 능력 부족을 인정하는 건 보기 좋네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "360139c7-265c-4439-a991-9a489b891079"
msgid ""
"\"At least it's good to know you doubt your ability to face trials with "
"dignity.\""
msgstr "\"최소한 점잖게 능력 부족을 인정하는 건 보기 좋네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2040cc1b-310a-4cfe-98c7-7189b9feb1fa"
msgid ""
"\"There is so much pain, so much suffering in the world... Why can't we all "
"live in peace? Why are we so bad at forgiving?\""
msgstr "\"세상에는 너무나 많은 고통이 있습니다... 왜 평화롭게 살지 않는 걸까요? 왜 그렇게 용서에 인색한 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f072124e-01ce-49d7-9180-1298face8e6c"
msgid ""
"\"And why do I feel that those whose conscience is darkest, are the ones who "
"complain the loudest about forgiveness?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 용서 좀 하라고 아우성 치는 녀석들을 보면 꼭 양심에 털난 놈들이 그러던데, 내 기분 탓일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "49552788-1d26-4bb5-973f-17c7886abdf5"
msgid ""
"\"And why do I feel that those whose conscience is darkest, are the ones who "
"complain the loudest about forgiveness?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 용서 좀 하라고 아우성 치는 녀석들을 보면 꼭 양심에 털난 놈들이 그러던데, 내 기분 탓일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "cdc524f6-d5b1-4ec1-be3c-f14a4ca0a83b"
msgid "\"Healing is my goddess' greatest gift.\""
msgstr "\"치유는 내 여신의 위대한 선물이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "74ab2f84-a483-4d8d-a063-2d9ff9a9a9db"
msgid "\"If only I didn't have to use it so often...\""
msgstr "\"너무 자주 사용하지만 않으면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8ac02889-183f-4f19-b5d4-64c7b2be2d2b"
msgid ""
"\"The Stolen Lands are a very strange place. There is so much injustice and "
"pain here...\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅은 아주 이상한 곳이야. 불공평과 고통이 너무 많지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f3fa3ac2-4ce7-40dc-908b-71041f5dc2f4"
msgid ""
"\"But then there is honor, pride, valor, forgiveness and atonement. "
"Everything twisted up in a tight ball.\""
msgstr "\"그러나 명예, 자존심, 용맹, 용서와 속죄도 있어. 세상은 복잡하게 뒤얽혀있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4cada944-3fd9-4eb6-b393-34ecc1fa3cb3"
msgid ""
"\"I hope my goddess hears me. Without her favor, we won't make it through "
"these lands.\""
msgstr "\"여신이 내 기도를 듣길. 여신님 없이 우리는 여기서 살아남지 못한다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c3733377-ab0e-4269-b564-fde3b5ae3540"
msgid ""
"\"She hears nothing, or she wouldn't allow the things that fanatics do in "
"her name. Or more likely – she simply doesn't care.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 네 말을 무시하던가 아니면 듣지를 못하는 거야. 아니면 관심이 없던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianTristian/Banter_TristianTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9722bfd4-7e78-4edc-b709-0df5b399d775"
msgid ""
"\"She hears nothing, or she wouldn't allow the things that fanatics do in "
"her name. Or more likely – she simply doesn't care.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 네 말을 무시하던가 아니면 듣지를 못하는 거야. 아니면 관심이 없던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianValerie/Banter_TristianValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "55a9a94a-1384-4163-af18-72cd34164760"
msgid "\"Most nobles are noble only in words. But you have a noble heart.\""
msgstr "\"대부분의 귀족들은 말로만 귀족이지만 너는 고귀한 마음을 가지고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianValerie/Banter_TristianValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "99776385-c28a-4587-9663-817a9b5ee8c2"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. Truth be told, the false nobleness you mean was precisely what "
"I ran away from. To someplace where people are tested by their deeds, not by "
"their words.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 사실 그러한 귀족이 되지 않으려 하고 있어. 말이 아니라 행동으로 평가받는 세상이 오기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianValerie/Banter_TristianValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "774e2348-3a67-400c-b63a-3ec38f8e79a3"
msgid "\"Was it that bad at the Order of Shelyn?\""
msgstr "\"셸린 교단이 그렇게 싫었습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianValerie/Banter_TristianValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cdbf4593-f850-4767-944d-acab0528ac3b"
msgid ""
"\"For some it was probably quite good, but for me – it was just a waste of "
"time. What they call high art makes me yawn. The only art that interests me "
"is the art of wielding a sword!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 사람들에게는 꽤 좋았겠지만 나에게는 시간 낭비였습니다. 그들이 예술이라 부르는 것들은 지루할 뿐이었습니다. 내가 관심을 둔 "
"유일한 예술은 검술입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianValerie/Banter_TristianValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "15e92d10-2f38-46f0-952e-dc5819ab4c09"
msgid ""
"\"If you'd remained a paladin, you would have gained many powers. You could "
"heal wounds, banish the undead...\""
msgstr "\"당신이 아직도 성기사였다면 많은 권능을 가졌겠지요. 상처를 치료하고, 언데드를 퇴치하고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/TristianValerie/Banter_TristianValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "348d0658-b4f7-457e-b81b-eb399eb18eb0"
msgid ""
"\"No offense, but the powers a deity grants in return for your service is "
"like a cape your master doesn't need and casts aside for you. I might not be "
"able to claim much, but I owe all my abilities to myself only. And no one is "
"going to take them away for disobeying.\""
msgstr ""
"\"미안하지만 여신이 주신 힘은 애물단지일 뿐이었습니다. 저의 능력은 온전히 저의 것이었습니다. 파문을 당한다고 해서 능력도 빼앗길 수는 "
"없지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "892052a8-25b1-4637-9b58-786d24d2c8dd"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, why don't you wear serious armor? Your entire body is covered in "
"scars!\""
msgstr "\"아미리, 갑옷을 입어 보는건 어떠십니까? 그러다 흉터가 더 많아지겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "214eaae4-8d10-4c4c-bb47-acd78863ec3d"
msgid ""
"\"So what? I'm a barbarian, not some princess. It's like that with us: the "
"more scars, the better!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 뭐? 난 바바리안이지, 공주님이 아니다. 상처는 많을수록 좋지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1390b18e-1dcb-41e6-8ab7-28df4acea560"
msgid ""
"\"Your sword is so amazing. I could never have imagined someone wielding "
"such a huge blade.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 검은 정말 놀랍습니다. 그런 거대한 검을 휘두르는 사람은 못봤어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b97b65a9-f9de-448b-bf68-b947ca16c40a"
msgid ""
"\"Right! I took it from a frost giant – as a trophy! I slaughtered so many "
"of them giants with it! Now when they hear my name, they shit their pants!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 서리 거인에게서 빼앗았지! 이걸로 서리 거인을 수 없이 죽였어. 그 녀석들이 내 이름을 들으면 오줌을 지릴걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7e19e64d-5125-4f34-85be-58093bde1836"
msgid ""
"\"Do you miss your tribe? Don't you ever want to go back to your homeland?\""
msgstr "\"부족이 그리우십니까? 고향에 가고싶다는 생각 해본 적 없으신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a718b890-f058-4696-8c56-5881462c44e4"
msgid ""
"\"Why the hell? To freeze my ass off on a glacier? Look at their pig snouts? "
"No, you are my tribe now.\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜? 눈바닥에 앉으면 엉덩이가 차갑기만 하다고. 그 녀석들을 보고 싶지 않아. 너희가 나의 부족이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5f10f57d-f5fe-431f-ad0a-2f4eb1fe9f1e"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, aren't you cold just wearing those hides? They cover almost nothing."
"\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 그런 쪼가리를 입으면 춥지 않아? 살이 그대로 드러나는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3cbd49e3-bd50-4d91-8bb5-6b4ac15a4d54"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, is it ever cold here? You could walk around naked bouncing your boobs. "
"In my homeland – that's where it's cold! Spit freezes before it hits the "
"ground!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 추위인가? 가슴을 덜렁이면서 벗고 돌아다녀도 괜찮을 날씨다. 우리 고향에서는 땅 바닥에 침이 떨어지기도 전에 얼어붙는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "602e41cf-feb5-4f68-859a-9843bda40333"
msgid ""
"\"You're always the first to get into fights – as if there are no fighters "
"in the party except you.\""
msgstr "\"너는 항상 전투를 할 때 맨 앞에 있지. 그럴 때면 전사는 네가 유일한 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "78dd5ef5-7848-4ada-ad22-3e2724b28806"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? I know there are others. But it's the custom – the best fighter "
"is always in the front row!\""
msgstr "\"물론 다른 전사들도 있지. 하지만 최고의 전사가 선두를 차지하는 건 우리 부족의 전통이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e7f3eba6-0357-46de-969f-6cae98548c7f"
msgid ""
"\"Your sword is so heavy. Maybe you should carry a smaller weapon and wear "
"more serious armor?\""
msgstr "\"너의 검은 너무 무거워. 좀 가벼운 검과 갑옷을 입으면 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieAmiri/Banter_ValerieAmiri_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "eca29975-b766-4c93-a6e0-c17ccc0ed15c"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah right! Why do I need armor? My enemies can barely raise their hands "
"before they fall on the ground! That wouldn't be so easy if I was swinging a "
"toothpick!\""
msgstr "\"갑옷이 왜 필요하지? 적들은 내 몸에 손 대기도 전에 쓰러질 텐데! 내가 그런 얄팍한 검을 좋아하는 것도 아니고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6671761f-7e7f-4bcf-8ab5-4d0b8564449b"
msgid ""
"\"I feel nobleness in your words and deeds. I do not think you are from a "
"common family.\""
msgstr "\"너의 말과 행동이 귀품이 있어. 평민 출신이 아니지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ec56f13e-550b-4347-bf34-c113262e8cd0"
msgid "\"Does lineage mean anything? I'm the one who made myself.\""
msgstr "\"혈통이 중요해? 내 자신이 중요하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "956c6bab-9f50-422c-8dd7-840f29b869b7"
msgid ""
"\"You are wrong. I am from a very common family, and even they rejected me.\""
msgstr "\"틀렸어. 나는 평민 출신에 쫓겨났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0d996626-34e7-47d6-bf4b-3dc878ab12fb"
msgid ""
"\"You are wrong, I'm from a very common family. I've worked hard and come a "
"long way — from a wandering nomad to a ruler's respectable companion.\""
msgstr "\"틀렸어. 나는 평민 출신에 쫓겨났어. 나는 유목민부터 통치자까지 여러 사람들을 만났지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a54929ac-119e-454d-af7e-f94db841de44"
msgid "\"You don't talk about yourself too much. Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"너는 말수가 너무 없어. 어디 출신이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3eb773b2-8c75-4f73-8030-ef4c758098e5"
msgid ""
"\"Born in Thuvia, but raised in Absalom. A city of hundreds of peoples, "
"hundreds of languages, hundreds of faiths... But too bright and noisy for me."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Thuvia에서 태어났지만 압살롬에서 자랐어. 수백명이 살지만 언어와 종교가 수백가지에 이르지... 나에게는 너무나 시끄러운 곳이었어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8e4f2a58-20fc-46e6-94e7-95f7a1cf8d2a"
msgid ""
"\"You must have seen much in your journeys. Do you have any useful advice to "
"share?\""
msgstr "\"여행 중에 경험을 많이 했을 테지. 좋은 조언 하나 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c12dc434-1149-41c5-ba27-1a07f7a1ef88"
msgid ""
"\"My advice is to avoid traveling. Find your home and live with dignity.\""
msgstr "\"여행하지 않는 게 좋아. 집에서 얌전히 사는 것이 편하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6387f518-721b-4bed-992b-38ce14b44f5b"
msgid "\"I've always liked wolves. They are noble predators!\""
msgstr "\"나는 항상 늑대를 좋아했어. 그들은 고귀한 포식자거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d3ee26d5-85e3-4002-88eb-6873607fd936"
msgid ""
"\"Nobleness was invented by people. Animals are a part of nature. They "
"simply live as they do.\""
msgstr "\"그 고귀함은 인간에 의해 만들어진 거지. 동물은 자연의 일부야. 그들은 고귀함 따위는 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f970876d-abba-4cfb-a4b3-dabbd6f90ab4"
msgid ""
"\"Ekun, we will definitely track down those killer trolls. No monster can "
"escape fair revenge!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤. 그 트롤을 반드시 찾자고. 찾아서 공평하게 복수하는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2b7f6d3f-5af3-4ca8-818b-43f080e431ca"
msgid ""
"\"Is revenge fair? Or merely cruel? I do not know. Nor do I even care "
"anymore.\""
msgstr "\"복수가 공정한가? 잔인한 것이 아니라? 나는 모르겠군. 이제는 신경쓰지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_6_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9c4c535b-0ba1-414e-a1b1-afd9677315f8"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you watching me stitch? Do you think such a pastime unbecoming for "
"a warrior?\""
msgstr "\"왜 바느질 하는 걸 그렇게 쳐다보는 거죠? 전사에게는 어울리지 않는다고 생각하십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_6_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b6d58368-c21b-4652-9c4b-c45c85d28421"
msgid ""
"\"You stitch like you fight. A steady hand. A neat seam. It's good to watch."
"\""
msgstr "\"몰두하는 모습이 보기 좋아. 그 단단한 손으로 깔끔하게 마무리를 하고. 마치 싸움과 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_7_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "be326744-1d84-408f-a8a6-8d4baa3998fe"
msgid ""
"\"Your wolf is quite obedient. How did you manage to train him so well?\""
msgstr "\"늑대가 아주 순종적이군. 어떻게 길들인 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_7_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "839a12ee-0d96-45f5-b371-84f495f52638"
msgid "\"I didn't. It's intelligence, not obedience.\""
msgstr "\"길들이지 않았다. 순해서 그런 것이 아니라 똑똑한 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_8_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "050ea028-657e-429f-91ea-415d52f043c1"
msgid ""
"\"You're a skilled warrior, but sometimes you seem to forget about the team "
"and fight like you're alone against everybody.\""
msgstr "\"너는 숙련된 전사이지만 너는 동료들을 잊고 혼자가 된 것처럼 싸울 때가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_Pack2_8_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "04fa3988-9b31-4d1a-93ff-96cdc67ec62e"
msgid ""
"\"It's all true. Old habits don't easily die. I've fought alone all my life."
"\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 오래된 습관은 고치기 어렵지. 나는 평생 혼자 싸웠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_ValerieEkun1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "46de29f6-3a97-44ab-a3d7-2b7e15093e5d"
msgid ""
"\"I love to watch your wolf playing. That animal is full of dignity and "
"nobility.\""
msgstr "\"늑대가 재롱피우는 게 귀여워. 친근하고 충성심이 보인달까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieEkun/Banter_ValerieEkun_ValerieEkun1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d5010d98-676f-4900-9c33-11dbe522efb9"
msgid ""
"\"It's just an animal. All an animal knows is loyalty to its pack. The rest "
"is just human invention.\""
msgstr "\"단지 짐승일 뿐이다. 모든 짐승은 자기 무리에 충성한다. 절도있는 건 훈련의 결과다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3b194ccf-5ad3-48b5-903c-f6164dfc0f79"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, I know what you wanted to tell me. Don't even try. I'm not going "
"to bow to your Groetus – or to anyone else!\""
msgstr "\"하림. 무슨 말을 하려는 건지 알아. 하지만 꿈도 꾸지마. 나는 그로투스나 다른 신은 믿지 않을 거니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6862a6fa-bfa6-4b93-a1ff-9ea591b01723"
msgid ""
"\"But you are wrong. Everyone needs a name to call on in the hour when all "
"things come to an end!\""
msgstr "\"그래도 믿어야 한다네. 종말의 순간에 찾게 될 이름은 누구에게나 필요한 법이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f00010ff-3ff9-403d-97e1-0b4cb9cfd32b"
msgid ""
"\"Your religion is insane. How could you pray to someone who wants to kill "
"us all?\""
msgstr "\"네 종교는 사이비야. 어떻게 종말을 가져오는 신을 믿을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "eab73513-b8aa-4f21-aa0b-fc9c21b7151f"
msgid ""
"\"Groetus does not want anything. This pathetic world will come to an end – "
"one way or another. My god just patiently waits for that day. His path is "
"patience, and humility in the face of the inevitable...\""
msgstr "\"그로투스는 아무것도 원하지 않아. 이 불쌍한 세상도 결국끝이 날 거야. 나의 신은 그저 조용히 기다릴 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d8d51625-8654-4f71-bdd2-3760e6bc8e41"
msgid ""
"\"Those voices you hear... I'm sorry, but are you sure it's really your god? "
"Maybe you should think about your health?\""
msgstr "\"네가 들은 그 목소리... 미안하지만 정말로 신의 목소리야? 너 어디 아픈 거 아니지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e4e237b0-0f3b-441e-a1a3-52177afb0916"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I hear the voice of Groetus, although I don't always understand what "
"he says, or where he calls me... But is it insanity? Isn't it more insane to "
"cover your ears and deny the truth about what's coming?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론. 나는 그로투스의 목소리를 듣는다. 항상 그의 말을 이해하는 건 아니지만... 미쳤다고 생각하겠지만 귀를 닫고 진실을 감추는 "
"것이 더 미친짓이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_ValerieHarrim_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c9c8795e-b90e-4aa2-915c-7ecc0d7ddfd4"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose we have something in common, sir dwarf. In the past we both "
"served deities unworthy of our loyalty.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공통점이 있다고 생각해. 우리는 과거에 같은 신을 섬겼지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieHarrim/Banter_ValerieHarrim_ValerieHarrim_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "09b1d671-5061-40a7-b108-cfde2e07dfc4"
msgid ""
"\"The difference is you never found a new faith or a new reason to live. I "
"did.\""
msgstr "\"차이점은 네가 새로운 믿음을 찾지 못했다는 것이지. 나는 새롭게 살 이유를 찾았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJaethal/Banter_ValerieJaethal_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6d741848-7a2c-42a4-9d23-17cedc272da7"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal, you were a judge for many years in your homeland. I don't "
"understand – what made you turn against the law?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 예전에 판사였다고 했지. 하지만 왜 법을 어긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJaethal/Banter_ValerieJaethal_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d66c468e-2d10-4c9e-a54d-bf4f45c5316b"
msgid ""
"\"Laws are written by those in power – and not to constrain themselves, but "
"to dominate the powerless. He who respects the law, is worthy of contempt, "
"like a slave who honors his shackles.\""
msgstr "\"법은 권력을 가진 자들의 것이다. 힘 없는 자를 지배하기 위한 것이지. 법을 존중하는 녀석들은 노예나 다를 바 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJaethal/Banter_ValerieJaethal_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ac836bec-ae0c-4cae-962f-d3efbe1d4c36"
msgid ""
"\"What is it like, being Urgathoa's inquisitor? I thought elves who've lived "
"for centuries would value life, not despise it.\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아의 심문관이 된다는 건 어떤 느낌입니까? 수백년의 수명을 갖는 엘프는 생명을 소중히 여길 거 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJaethal/Banter_ValerieJaethal_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fcede525-55ba-4bd2-8dbf-bb0bf1a84491"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, believe me, Valerie, no one values life more than the long-lived. "
"Their own, that is.\""
msgstr "\"오. 그건 사실이 아니야. 그들은 자신들의 삶을 소중히 여길 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJaethal/Banter_ValerieJaethal_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "99951af0-0b35-4261-a7aa-22c4842960d9"
msgid ""
"\"So you never change at all, Jaethal? You're like a fly stuck in amber? No "
"wrinkles, no scars, even your hair is always the same length... That's so "
"strange...\""
msgstr ""
"\"제이탈 너는 변함이 없다는 거야? 호박에 갇힌 파리처럼? 주름도 흉터도 없다니... 머리카락도 자라지 않고 그대로라니 이상해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJaethal/Banter_ValerieJaethal_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "36f89e27-e5d6-46f6-9347-5d073459ff33"
msgid ""
"\"But you change, Valerie. Your beauty fades by the day. Don't you want to "
"hold on to it forever? I could help...\""
msgstr "\"너는 인간이야. 너의 아름다움은 훗날 사라지겠지. 아름다움을 유지하고 싶지 않아? 내가 도와줄 수도 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9ea01b43-e81c-4f56-b39e-8dd0ebb0f404"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost, why are you so arrogant? Our party has a commander, and it's not "
"you.\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 왜 그렇게 오만한 거야? 네가 우리의 리더는 아니라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "49214308-c914-4262-a99d-7dd6f9e3d049"
msgid ""
"\"Because there's more knowledge in my head than in all of yours combined. "
"Of course, I do as {Name} says... But don't expect me to keep my opinions to "
"myself about what we should do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 머리 속에는 너희 머릿 속에 있는 것보다 더 많은 지식이 있기 때문이지. 물론 나는 {Name}의 명령을 듣지... 하지만 나의 "
"의견을 말하지 않는 건 아니라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d7c287c0-6dfd-461f-9ddc-125192df84d4"
msgid ""
"\"I don't detract from your merits, but you are too arrogant. No matter how "
"many books you've written, it doesn't give you the right to look down on "
"others.\""
msgstr "\"네가 형편 없다는 건 아니지만 너무 오만해. 책을 몇권 썼던 간에 다른 사람을 깔볼 이유가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4b401ef1-0783-4777-a268-4abbd4504a87"
msgid ""
"\"I'm a gnome, if you haven't noticed. I'd need a ladder to look down on "
"anyone at all!\""
msgstr "\"나는 노움이야. 너희를 깔보려면 사다리가 필요할걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c6de8467-ec57-4aa3-8acc-a0e761d136b2"
msgid ""
"\"I'm starting to grow tired of your constant sarcasm. One day my patience "
"will run out, and then you'll regret it.\""
msgstr "\"너의 끊임없는 투덜거림이 질리기 시작했어. 내 인내심이 바닥나는 순간을 조심해야 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "83565d84-1b41-4057-ae29-8c5e762b3438"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, what do we have here? Threats? If you only knew how many of those I've "
"heard! But they're worth nothing. The people you really need to be afraid of "
"don't make threats – they act.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 어떻게 할 건데? 그런 소리는 지겹게 들었다고. 하지만 모두 헛소리였지. 정말로 무서워해야 할 녀석들은 위협하지 않는 녀석들이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4de424ad-0138-4f86-87f5-721df4ebcdd3"
msgid ""
"\"Your tone gets on everyone's nerves. Isn't it difficult to keep your acid-"
"tongued remarks to yourself?\""
msgstr "\"네 말투가 참 거슬려. 말 좀 곱게 하면 안될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "97084fa7-98e7-47b3-997b-53d84b45a444"
msgid ""
"\"It's called honesty. When I don't like something, I'm not ashamed of "
"saying it. It's much better than spreading fake smiles and pretending "
"everything's fine, while secretly harboring nasty thoughts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 정직한 것일 뿐이야. 내가 싫어하는 걸 말하는 것이지. 가식 웃음을 짓고 속은 썩어가며 괜찮은 척하는 것보다 훨씬 나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "55fc464e-9aad-45e6-83df-f85abd24fb99"
msgid ""
"\"How can you be so arrogant? Could the simple science of common decency be "
"too complicated for such a learned man?\""
msgstr "\"너는 왜 그렇게 교만해? 배운 녀석이 예절 같은 건 배우지도 않은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieJubilost/Banter_ValerieJubilost_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1daad5cc-039a-4a13-bf04-a5c322c89e10"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not arrogant at all! On the contrary, I'm open to everyone. I just "
"don't see the point in faking amiability. But it's rich to hear about "
"arrogance from the noble born. You were taught from a young age to stick up "
"their nose and avoid the truth like some oily mess that might smear your "
"doublet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 오만한 게 아니야! 오히려 개방적인 태도인 거지. 나는 친근한 척하지 못하는 거라고. 하지만 교만함의 원조인 귀족에게 그런 "
"이야기를 듣다니 충격이군. 너희는 어렸을 때부터 턱을 치켜들고 진실을 듣지 않는 태도를 배우기로 유명하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieLinzi/Banter_ValerieLinzi_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "acf50fb0-2f8b-41dd-8cd6-8a918bd0ce70"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, what are you writing so diligently there – and why are you looking "
"at me like that? Did you decide to write me an ode too?\""
msgstr "\"린지. 왜 그렇게 열심히 쓰고 있지? 왜 나를 그렇게 보는 거야? 나에 관한 노래라도 쓰는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieLinzi/Banter_ValerieLinzi_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7b98ba68-948a-43f8-bb4e-d87cbafe8f91"
msgid ""
"\"You got it! Here it is, listen: 'There once lived a paladin of Shelyn, "
"whose courage was so unfailin'...' Hey, hey, that's my ink-pot! Don't throw "
"it at me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 알았어? 자. 들어 봐. 예전에 셀린의 성기사가 살았는데 정말 쪼잔했데요... 이봐! 그건 내 잉크병이야! 내게 던지지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieLinzi/Banter_ValerieLinzi_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6bdb486f-5fa4-4df1-bb1f-6939b02f3b02"
msgid ""
"\"I respect useful books, but who needs shallow stories? Fables about a "
"knight who slew a dragon won't help you, if you meet a dragon in real life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"유용한 서적은 존중하지만 얕은 이야기에 무슨 쓸모가 있겠어? 드래곤을 죽인 기사에 대한 이야기가 실제로 드래곤을 만났을 때 별로 "
"도움이 되진 않을거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieLinzi/Banter_ValerieLinzi_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f03fd080-a958-4456-a2ec-02be6f1bd517"
msgid ""
"\"Then they'll write books about me! 'Linzi the Dragon Slayer'! Or no, more "
"like, 'Linzi, Who Was Not Afraid To Challenge a Dragon, And Got Heroically "
"Eaten In Her Prime!' Sounds good, huh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러면 나에 대한 책을 쓰면 되겠네! 드래곤 슬레이어 린지! 아니야. 그보다는 '드래곤에게 용감하게 도전해서, 전성기에 영웅적으로 "
"먹혀버린 린지'! 괜찮은데, 그치?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieLinzi/Banter_ValerieLinzi_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f539f3dc-28e0-4bb5-8e50-5823f9270434"
msgid ""
"\"Why did you leave your home? Do any traveling bards ever live happily ever "
"after? Or did you hope to earn your glory, singing songs in taverns?\""
msgstr "\"왜 집을 떠난 거야? 방랑 음유시인의 끝은 별로 좋지 않은데. 아니면 선술집에서 부를 노래를 만들려고 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieLinzi/Banter_ValerieLinzi_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b7d26251-b6d9-4d9a-80e6-073df98c49a8"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, you don't appreciate your happiness! You've been surrounded by books, "
"paintings, poets and singers since you were a child... In our village the "
"only entertainments we had were tavern fights and harvest dance parties! I'd "
"have died of boredom if I'd stayed there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자신의 행복을 소중히 여기라고! 너는 어렸을 때부터 양서들을 가지고 살았겠지... 우리 마을에서 즐길거리라고는 선술집 난투와 추수 "
"감사 춤뿐이었어! 거기에 있었다간 지루해서 죽었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "57d995d2-e38e-4eae-b9f6-8924c7095787"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia, what are you thinking about? Your face says you're plotting some "
"trick.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아. 무슨 생각을 하는 거야? 얼굴에 꿍꿍이가 가득한데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eb65df9b-d94f-4950-9376-5e945cd24005"
msgid ""
"\"I'm wondering whether I'll have time to make it to the border of the "
"Stolen Lands, before Reg notices that I put a stag-beetle in his boot!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르 장화에 사슴벌레를 집어 넣고 도둑맞은 땅 경계로 도망치는 생각했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b52e3137-2049-4380-9f9b-f21ae7db130f"
msgid ""
"\"I admire your optimism. Even when the situation seems desperate, your "
"smile never leaves your face!\""
msgstr "\"너 정말 낙천적이다. 절망적인 상황이어도 얼굴에 웃음이 사라지질 않으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d69aaddc-9cb6-4bba-a2f4-74c9a1c7ffdd"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know how many desperate situations Reg and I survived in Numeria? "
"And we're all right – we got out of all of them! We'll handle whatever comes."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"누메리아에서 나와 레곤가르가 얼마나 많은 시련을 겪었는지 알아? 하지만 우리는 결국 해냈어! 무슨 일이 닥쳐도 우리는 해결할 수 있어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a9091816-3af8-43fc-bb83-edb619da0c44"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange to remember how, as a child, I enjoyed all the bright "
"dresses, bows and ruffles...\""
msgstr "\"어린 시절이 기억이 나질 않아... 밝은 드레스를 참 좋아했는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5204ebf0-28a8-4083-bf67-fe5e46c562b4"
msgid ""
"\"And I like them all so much! Too bad I don't often get a chance to dress "
"up.\""
msgstr "\"나도 정말 좋아해! 드레스를 자주 입지 못해서 아쉬워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "993639bb-eba1-4bad-8466-ae1fca0f1051"
msgid ""
"\"I still love them, even now. What's wrong with that? A bird's bright "
"feathers don't interfere with its talons, if it decides to use them.\""
msgstr "\"나도 정말 좋아해! 하지만 그게 어때서? 까마귀들 속에 꾀꼬리가 끼지 않는 법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "14d7f850-4236-4bdf-b160-54bc4d89cdfd"
msgid ""
"\"I still love them, even now. What's wrong with that? A bird's bright "
"feathers don't interfere with its talons, if it decides to use them.\""
msgstr "\"나도 정말 좋아해! 하지만 그게 어때서? 까마귀들 속에 꾀꼬리가 끼지 않는 법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0ceb9e0b-190c-4240-a6d5-24ad2fd2acd5"
msgid "\"Octavia, do you think I should cut my hair even shorter?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아. 나 머리카락을 좀 더 짧게 깎아야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieOctavia/Banter_ValerieOctavia_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b3490eba-fae7-42b0-9365-12e9050408ce"
msgid ""
"\"I think you'll look great with any haircut. Even if you shaved your head "
"bald! Maybe we should try that!\""
msgstr "\"대머리가 되어도 너는 멋질 거야! 우리 한번 대머리로 바꿔볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d012c412-7aa7-49fc-a498-c6f08c600be0"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, you act like an animal. Are you capable of thinking about "
"anything besides food, drinking and fighting?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 짐승처럼 굴지 마. 머리 속에 음식, 술, 싸움 말고 든 게 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9ae82ae7-cfd5-47df-bb2c-710c155466b2"
msgid ""
"\"Sure! I think about pretty lasses, and lads... Especially after a good "
"drink or a good fight!\""
msgstr "\"물론 있지. 예쁜 계집이나 사내도 있다고. 특히 진창 마시고 싸우고 난 뒤에 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "70dd4e81-604f-4ad8-8b34-bac4bbff798c"
msgid ""
"\"I swear, Regongar, if it weren't for our common cause, I'd challenge you "
"to a duel and wipe that smug sneer off your face!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 동료들에게 피해가 가지 않는다면 너에게 결투를 신청하고 싶어. 그 낯짝에 웃음기를 사라지게 해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "102dcfca-ec25-4593-82a1-0a7ac1ffaa1f"
msgid ""
"\"Why, Your Nobleness, you mustn't challenge the peasantry to duels! How "
"unseemly it would be if they spanked you! No, you rather must spank them! "
"Spank them with a whip! I'm taking off my pants right now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어이구. 나으리. 천한 백성과 결투하시면 안됩니다. 천민에게 볼기짝을 맞으면 쪽팔리지 않을까요? 차라리 그들의 볼기짝을 때리라고요! "
"채찍으로! 내 엉덩이를 찰싹 때려준다면 더 좋고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a7197d1e-9359-49fc-b46b-7a7a3ca403b8"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand what Octavia sees in you. She's a good and kind girl, "
"and you're a rude and uncouth bumpkin, desperate and obsessed with killing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아가 왜 너를 좋아하는지 모르겠어. 옥타비아처럼 친절하고 예쁜 여자가 너처럼 무례하고 괴팍한 변태 살인마를 좋아하다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8d3c7cd5-e472-42bc-b5ad-e34aa23ab86e"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you know? Good girls like bad boys. It's because bad boys know how "
"to make girls feel good. I could show you. Come to my tent tonight.\""
msgstr "\"예쁜 애들은 원래 나쁜 남자를 좋아해. 나쁜 남자는 여자를 기분 좋게 하는 방법을 알거든. 궁금해? 너도 내 텐트로 와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2c9eabea-b166-4163-929d-d9100b1d2f0f"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, you stand as proof of all the worst rumors about your people.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 너는 하프오크 중에서도 최고의 저질이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8862d629-3e93-4319-bffc-bf4824c90adc"
msgid ""
"\"And you'd rather I disprove them? Ha! I just give the people what they "
"want.\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭐 어때서? 나는 그저 사람들이 원하는 걸 해줄 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e46aa592-e4c1-448f-98d0-4320813fd2f1"
msgid ""
"\"It's amazing how such a powerful magic gift could be bestowed upon one so "
"lowly in all other respects.\""
msgstr "\"이런 저질이 마법 재능이 뛰어나다는 건 놀랄 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieRegongar/Banter_ValerieRegongar_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "50bbb2e9-02b7-4690-8cdc-18c329f85e83"
msgid ""
"\"Jealous? Want to trade fates with me? Fine! Just don't forget that the "
"magic gift comes with years of slavery, beatings and humiliation!\""
msgstr "\"질투 나? 내가 비결을 알려줄까? 우선 노예가 되어 맞고 굴욕을 당해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cc3234d2-004b-4b5c-874a-c17b060db33a"
msgid "\"Sir Tristian... Sounds like the name of a knight in a ballad!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안 경이라... 발라드에 나오는 기사의 이름처럼 들리는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "68aa0e1a-dddb-47e0-9fe4-13a17c7cf249"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Valerie, but I could hardly be a knight. I don't like fighting, "
"and even less do I like fighting for sport.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 고마워. 하지만 나는 기사가 아니야. 검술은 좋아하지만 전쟁은 싫다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cba5242c-9b04-4550-8b5f-44130f34e2dc"
msgid ""
"\"You pray to your goddess with such devotion… But you never accused me of "
"apostasy, like other priests. I appreciate that.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 여신에게 바치는 기도와 헌신이 정말 대단하군요... 그러면서도 저를 배교자라고 비난하지도 않고요. 고맙습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a11493f6-f797-4ed9-bb0a-1ae597aa5377"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing to be ashamed of. It's better you leave, than to stay and "
"lie to yourself and your deity.\""
msgstr "\"부끄러워 할 것 없습니다. 신을 거짓으로 믿을 바에는 안 믿는 편이 낫지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7bfd129c-d5e2-4279-adbc-413f011c7647"
msgid "\"My elbow hurts...\""
msgstr "\"내 팔꿈치가 아파...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5a39af36-a446-46fc-8bd6-43336321bf2f"
msgid ""
"\"It's because you're so hard on yourself. Try to rest sometimes. You don't "
"have to practice every spare minute.\""
msgstr "\"너무 열심히 해서 그래. 조금 휴식을 가지라고. 매일 매순간마다 훈련할 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8293ded8-e2d0-4013-bff8-98b2d4962cea"
msgid ""
"\"You're a kind person, Tristian. It must be hard for you to witness all the "
"atrocities that go on around here.\""
msgstr "\"너는 친절해. 트리스티안. 그래서 주위에서 일어나는 갈등을 보고 지나칠 수 없겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "31d074ba-6de5-43d6-b339-2efb470711df"
msgid ""
"\"I draw strength from my goddess. If I begin to feel sad, I turn to "
"Sarenrae in my prayers, and she gives me solace.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여신에게서 힘을 얻어. 기분이 슬플 때 서렌레이께 기도를 드리면 마음이 평온해져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "946aa207-0163-4c1e-9633-392fa52fff03"
msgid ""
"\"I respect your faith, but I can't agree with it. An atrocity is an "
"atrocity, and it cannot be fixed with repentance. Everyone must pay for "
"their misdeeds.\""
msgstr "\"네 믿음은 존중하지만 동의는 못하겠어. 잔학 행위를 회개로 뉘우칠 수는 없어. 죄를 지었다면 죗값을 치뤄야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieTristian/Banter_ValerieTristian_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "cb6a983e-c0fc-43e8-890a-4957d76c85f3"
msgid ""
"\"Of course they must. He who truly repents will do everything in their "
"power to repair the harm he's done. – That is his only path.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 하지만 자신의 죄를 진실로 회개한 사람은 자신의 잘못을 고칠 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "17cb893d-c0ce-4b90-8920-e2feb542a5da"
msgid "\"There is a nick in my sword again. Where's my whetstone...\""
msgstr "\"칼에 흠이 다시 생겼네. 숫돌이 어디에 있더라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7afc08c9-9e60-4e3d-bc5d-ea553816eac7"
msgid ""
"\"Nooo, not that sound again, please! Look me in the eyes, noble Valerie. "
"Are you prepared to murder your companion with your 'Shink! Shink! Shink!'?\""
msgstr "\"그 끔찍한 소리는 싫어! 사실대로 말해. 발레리. 칼 가는 소리로 동료를 죽이려는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e54df55a-daf8-4269-93fc-25ac0c2c0e86"
msgid ""
"\"Nooo, not that sound again, please! Look me in the eyes, noble Valerie. "
"Are you prepared to murder your companion with your 'Shink! Shink! Shink!'?\""
msgstr "\"그 끔찍한 소리는 싫어! 사실대로 말해. 발레리. 칼 가는 소리로 동료를 죽이려는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_2_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0aab5d5e-d937-400d-8c20-3f9152c9be45"
msgid ""
"\"We're a strange group. More like a handful of outcasts than an army of "
"heroes.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 참 이상해. 영웅이라기 보다는 이상한 녀석들 집단인 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_2_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e4caa84d-ee74-4e22-a854-1de3477d052d"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway... They say even the first Aldori Swordlord was an outcast. Are we "
"any worse than him?\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든... 알도리 소드도 처음에는 유명하지 않았다고. 우리도 그렇잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_3_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "67a3a806-5fbf-4890-a2fa-5c2dc30d20db"
msgid ""
"\"Why does every noble who so much as glances at me deem it necessary to "
"compose embarrassing odes to me? Why not give me a new pair of boots, for "
"instance?\""
msgstr "\"왜 고귀한 자들은 나를 계속 쳐다보면서 불쾌감을 주는 거지? 말이라도 해주면 덧나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_3_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1c6aa633-e217-418e-92c6-4ef384f5a795"
msgid ""
"\"You obviously mean something more personal, but I do agree! One can accept "
"odes from a poor joyful bard, but a noble should give precious gifts, or one "
"doubts their generosity.\""
msgstr "\"공감은 가지 않지만 동의해! 음유시인의 음악을 즐겁게 듣는 사람이 있지만 귀족은 의심의 눈초리를 보내지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_4_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3aaeb39f-4681-4cf3-8ab0-82ed5178e336"
msgid ""
"\"The more I travel, the more I'm sure: true nobleness is not inherited.\""
msgstr "\"여행하면서 한 가지 확신한 게 있다면, 태어날 때부터 고귀한 사람은 없다는 사실이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_4_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "efe5dd4a-35f6-41eb-ad31-3f8c504c5af5"
msgid ""
"\"Every other smug dimwit with a marquis title has worse manners than his "
"horse.\""
msgstr "\"후작이라고 우쭐대는 놈을 보면, 하나 같이 자기가 타는 말보다 버릇이 없다니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_5_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1296b697-12e8-4ecc-bacb-d6102eb947db"
msgid "\"Armor must be sturdy and heavy. The heavier, the better.\""
msgstr "\"갑옷은 튼튼하고 무거워야 해. 무거울수록 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Banter/ValerieValerie/Banter_ValerieValerie_Pack2_5_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7de8f723-443b-4845-a1c2-bedfb118b30f"
msgid ""
"\"And if there's a good shield to add to the armor – then you feel like a "
"whole fortress, not just a fighter.\""
msgstr "\"갑옷에 튼튼한 방패까지 있다면 전사가 아니라 요새가 된 기분이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a9acf1ce-2519-4275-89fb-b029f0634465"
msgid "\"To die in battle is a true honor.\""
msgstr "\"전투에서 죽는 것은 진정한 영예다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "18e84e05-bc7e-4d69-8d27-5e2f565d3980"
msgid "\"There is no better death than death in battle.\""
msgstr "\"전투에서의 죽음보다 더 좋은 죽음은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c54cdfd8-42c0-4707-8e87-8c5fd684da7f"
msgid ""
"\"Death comes to us all. The real question is how we live — with honor, or "
"with shame.\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두는 죽어. 중요한 건 부끄럽지 않고 영예롭게 사는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fa9f44fe-3cce-48bc-9a64-43a1a5ca618e"
msgid "\"Once I sought death. No more. Something has changed.\""
msgstr "\"한 때 나는 죽으려고 했어. 하지만 상황이 변했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e792ad9e-8777-4a20-84a2-3fc67f04c152"
msgid ""
"\"I confess, I do not understand that sentiment. Death means pain, and "
"separation from loved ones. Why should someone feel good about it?\""
msgstr "\"고백하는데 그런 감정은 이해하지 못하겠어. 죽음은 고통과 이별일 뿐이야. 그게 기분이 좋다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f3a68b54-0a18-4e55-aea4-00381b75402d"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it might be an honor for the dead person. But it still makes me sad!"
"\""
msgstr "\"죽은 자에게는 영예이겠지. 하지만 슬픈 것은 어쩔 수 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f47c96fa-b12a-4e20-a8da-5fa541349956"
msgid ""
"\"There is nothing good about death. Heroic words cannot heal wounds. They "
"only numb the pain.\""
msgstr "\"죽어 봤자 좋은 것 없어. 영예가 사람을 살리지는 못해. 그저 고통을 잊게할 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1e73ddaa-53c8-4e22-ac96-c9a4007b5579"
msgid "\"Ugh… I feel like I'm ready to drop…\""
msgstr "\"어... 포기하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d25564b3-f081-41ff-b7e0-f7c6bcdcd92d"
msgid "\"My hide is intact, but I feel like crap…\""
msgstr "\"내 가죽은 멀쩡하지만 기분이 안좋아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c898fa8f-2716-4733-a2a6-10f6288f94b8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry we can't do anything for you right now. Maybe we'll find you "
"some help in town...\""
msgstr "\"너를 도울 수 없어 유감이야. 마을에서 도와줄 사람을 찾게 해줄까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "94af6826-c23e-4e3d-97dc-e7f3fea8f261"
msgid ""
"\"Such a familiar feeling… wait, were you speaking of bodily suffering? For "
"a moment I thought you meant your haggard soul.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 익숙해... 육신의 고통을 말하는 거야? 시달린 영혼을 말하는 거라 생각했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "92f6a4cf-ce58-4207-9867-ca6e77527069"
msgid ""
"\"Don't forget to call me if you decide you're ready to die. I wouldn't want "
"to miss a show like that!\""
msgstr "\"죽을 준비 되었다면 잊지말고 얘기해. 그런 볼거리를 놓칠 수야 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "94147901-dd62-4786-8b41-63411227155d"
msgid "\"Quite some stamina... for a creature so short-lived.\""
msgstr "\"수명도 짧은데... 참 왕성하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "3284117b-b93d-42ba-ba67-b62725a013d9"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe ate something? Nok-Nok once ate a fish he kept in earth for a week — "
"nearly sick to death!\""
msgstr "\"뭐 먹었어? 녹-녹은 일주일 된 물고기 먹었다. 그래서 죽을 뻔했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9a379313-c8a2-4c8f-9761-12041123de0f"
msgid "\"Ohhhh… I'm dog-tired.\""
msgstr "\"아... 개피곤해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "567aa047-755a-4ca9-b773-359b0a66b8a4"
msgid "\"I'm so tired, just dead on my feet.\""
msgstr "\"피곤해 죽을 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5f95166a-7bd7-4380-be3c-afd364638bed"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't know you could ever get tired. This is a rare sight indeed!\""
msgstr "\"네가 피곤할 줄은 몰랐는데. 참 드문 광경이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2aad5ba6-2e6d-4212-98bc-1c31b15b543f"
msgid "\"You are stronger than most. Others would fall long before you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 가장 강하잖아. 다른 녀석들은 이미 쓰러졌고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "50ec7ae2-2c4d-4c07-8e4c-04d487a5f3f6"
msgid ""
"\"I know you won't heed my advice, Amiri. But you really must take care of "
"yourself. Everyone has limits.\""
msgstr "\"내 충고는 듣지 않을 테지. 아미리. 하지만 건강 챙겨. 인간은 한계가 있는 법이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e8413160-e5b4-4baa-bb66-43179c754944"
msgid ""
"[Writing in her notebook, and mumbling to herself] \"This longsome journey "
"depleted my strength — it's time to lay our heads! The beasts of the night "
"shall not disturb your peace, my friends! said the tireless warrior...\""
msgstr ""
"[노트에 무언가를 적으며 중얼거립니다] \"이 긴 여정으로 힘이 바닥났어. 이제 쉬어야겠어! 밤의 야수가 평화를 방해하지 않기를. 라고 "
"지치지 않는 전사가 말했습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3af2ace5-7771-46af-80f1-d05e529308f3"
msgid ""
"You exert yourself carelessly, without thinking of tomorrow... You are like "
"a candle lit on both ends. – You shine brightly, but you burn quickly!\""
msgstr "\"내일 생각해서라도 쉬어... 너 심지가 거의 타버린 양초 같아. 꺼지기 전에 밝게 빛나니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "eab2d228-0eab-410e-8669-aefd93553537"
msgid ""
"You exert yourself carelessly, without thinking of tomorrow... You are like "
"a candle lit on both ends. – You shine brightly, but you burn quickly!\""
msgstr "\"내일 생각해서라도 쉬어... 너 심지가 거의 타버린 양초 같아. 꺼지기 전에 밝게 빛나니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0ee6faaa-2578-4116-b0f1-277917df3d6c"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh, what a stench… though I smelled a lot of crappy stuff in my time!\""
msgstr "\"아이고. 냄새야... 맡아 본 것 중에 최악이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0e3916e4-1d15-4aa1-b28f-07da8d3426c0"
msgid ""
"\"It smells like someone taked a huge crap nearby! Couldn't we find a better "
"place for camp?\""
msgstr "\"누가 근처에 크게 질러놓은 거 같아! 다른 곳에서 야영하면 안될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e510da5a-58f1-4714-95d2-4739a0bcc815"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Be grateful we're not in Abaddon, the native plane of daemons! "
"According to what I've read, it smells of cinders, swamp gas, feces — and "
"things far worse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 나락에 있지 않은 걸 감사하게 생각해. 책에서 읽었는데 데몬들에게서 하수구 악취, 대변보다 더 더러운 냄새가 난다더라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "16de1dc9-d8a5-4c6b-84bb-83a9fd862d11"
msgid ""
"\"Seems like an animal died nearby… perhaps if we bury it, the smell will go "
"away?\""
msgstr "\"동물 시체 냄새가 나... 묻어주면 냄새가 좀 가라앉을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "412eac54-d5b7-4372-91cf-a72fc8cb817d"
msgid ""
"\"In moments like this I regret not carrying a flask of perfume with me, "
"like so many other paladins of Shelyn!\""
msgstr "\"이럴 때 하필이면 향수 병을 놓고 올 줄이야. 셸린의 팔라딘과 다를 바 없구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fd35deba-462f-43bf-8183-eecce1cbaa57"
msgid ""
"\"And I am once again grateful that fate has spared me such distractions...\""
msgstr "\"그런 산만함 속에서 살아남은 걸 다시 한번 감사해야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6a96f6cd-a98e-47cd-8d6a-107b0d6d5257"
msgid ""
"\"There's no water, and nothing to start a fire. – It's all just dirt and "
"smoke...\""
msgstr "\"물도 없고 불쏘시개도 없어. 흙과 연기 뿐이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a7fc3fa2-4e43-4705-988d-f6d3e0cfdaf0"
msgid "\"What, you thought I was going to bite the dust? No way!\""
msgstr "\"흙이라도 먹으라는 거야? 웃기지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4d798f14-8005-4e2a-b84e-5b225f4d768e"
msgid "\"No one beats me. I always survive. Always.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 나를 쓰러뜨리지 못해. 나는 항상 생존하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "acd2ceeb-2883-4af4-8827-3b01788f9b8f"
msgid ""
"\"I got really scared when I saw you fall. Please try to be more careful "
"next time!\""
msgstr "\"네가 쓰러질까 너무 겁나. 다음에는 조금 더 조심하도록 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0d561fc6-b162-4363-bfe9-3b6f4f77a805"
msgid ""
"\"That's nothing more than brazen vanity. Give up your pride, Amiri, and "
"accept the inevitability of the end!\""
msgstr "\"그건 허영심일 뿐이야. 자존심을 버리고 받아들여야 해. 아미리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5a46dc0c-cac8-4e84-acca-eccae23afd51"
msgid "\"I admire your strength of spirit, Amiri. I wish I had the same.\""
msgstr "\"네 강한 영혼에 감탄했어. 나도 그랬다면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c1f77db3-4421-408c-ba54-4bcdfceb3ffd"
msgid ""
"\"You're so obsessed in battle! Your eyes shine and your cheeks are on fire! "
"The look on your face in the heat of battle – it makes me wish I'd been a "
"painter!\""
msgstr "\"너는 전투에 사로잡혔어! 그렇게 달아오르는 게 말이 돼? 전투에서 네 표정을 보면 그려서 보여주고 싶을 정도야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "687242cb-ed98-4f4c-aace-d5111c26e757"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri is almost Hero! Strong as beast! When you die, can I have your "
"stabber?\""
msgstr "\"아미리는 진정한 영웅이지! 짐승처럼 힘도 세고! 너 죽으면 그 칼 가져도 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fde57bc5-e646-499b-a891-123fc1bb4129"
msgid ""
"\"You are a good fighter, but please, don't sadden me with visions of your "
"early death.\""
msgstr "\"너는 강한 전사이지만 그런 얘기를 해서 나를 슬프게 하지는 말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8eca9666-94bb-4190-ba41-500fe6e8c869"
msgid ""
"\"You are a good fighter, but please, don't sadden me with visions of your "
"early death.\""
msgstr "\"너는 강한 전사이지만 그런 얘기를 해서 나를 슬프게 하지는 말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5e7a281e-14b1-48f3-97c9-d22e50912e92"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, I'm outta rations! I got to hit the sack hungry tonight, or what?!\""
msgstr "\"나 식량 바닥났어! 오늘 저녁은 굶어야겠네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "fba53dd3-9c2e-464a-8674-b45a2342c932"
msgid "\"Hey, I got no more chow! Anyone has an extra ration? Want to share?\""
msgstr "\"먹을 게 없어! 누구 식량 남는 사람? 좀 나눠줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "67c85e7d-3747-4627-a7c7-96013e12556a"
msgid "\"Take mine. I don't feel hungry today.\""
msgstr "\"내꺼 먹어. 배가 고프지 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fb94b53f-77c6-4c35-92e6-029c3fd791f9"
msgid ""
"\"I'll gladly share my rations with you, Amiri. After all, I'm trying to "
"watch my figure!\""
msgstr "\"기꺼이 아미리와 식량을 나누지. 잘 보이려는 것 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "03662c56-a730-4d21-a3ba-becc7bd81092"
msgid ""
"\"I'm feeling generous tonight. You can take my ration. Don't forget to say "
"thank you — and don't try to eat my stationery.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 기분이 좋아. 내 식량을 가져가. 고맙다는 인사는 꼭하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "556ed760-ca88-4333-b3b4-0ec0d7799181"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing improves one's appetite more than the envious looks of the "
"starving.\""
msgstr "\"굶주린 녀석 앞에서 먹는 밥이 최고지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0abdedd6-d2c0-4688-bfa1-f7f2b5f97109"
msgid "\"Spells all almost wasted… Pointless stuff, anyway, right?\""
msgstr "\"마법을 허무하게 써버렸어... 다 쓸모 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c7feefa7-36f8-4555-ae11-b2ce1d469747"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know why I got involved in this crappy magic… it's as useful as "
"nipples on a breastplate!\""
msgstr "\"왜 이딴 마법에 신경써야 하는지 모르겠어... 갑옷에 젖꼭지 보호대를 만들고 말지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "dbe7e04b-a691-4114-a6a1-c10441506801"
msgid ""
"\"In your case, I suppose so. You should stick to your giant sword, and "
"leave magic to those you have a talent for it.\""
msgstr "\"너라면 이해가 가. 그냥 칼이나 쓰고 마법은 다른 사람에게 맡기라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "07eceb32-b02b-4dc7-b5c7-41d7cd46ca0e"
msgid ""
"\"Don't give up on magic so soon. It's more powerful than it seems at first."
"\""
msgstr "\"포기하지 마. 배우면 강해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "48e35254-e030-4315-ba91-7739d32224ba"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, not at all! Magic is a wonderful power — if you use it wisely and put "
"time and effort into learning it.\""
msgstr "\"걱정 마! 마법은 강력한 힘을 지니고 있어. 꾸준히 배워서 현명하게 쓰면 정말 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c09a6f19-1808-4087-84b6-889550c8394c"
msgid ""
"\"Don't sweat it! Only a select few can master both magic and the sword! Ha, "
"ha, ha, hmm...\""
msgstr "\"헛고생하지 마! 검과 마법을 모두 터득하는 사람은 드물다고! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1331ab15-0720-4106-a000-e2796c5b4e85"
msgid "\"So, we're playing monster bait tonight, eh?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 오늘 저녁에 괴물 미끼를 사용하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bd1d4293-3192-4e6f-a7bf-81c3a3b463ca"
msgid ""
"\"We're definitely getting ambushed someday, if we keep camping with our "
"butts out like this.\""
msgstr "\"이런 식으로 야영했다간 기습당하고 말걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9120da14-7f38-41b7-88bf-2509786fbfe7"
msgid ""
"\"I appreciate your courage, Amiri, but I wouldn't like it if something "
"nasty disturbed our rest.\""
msgstr "\"용기내주어 고마워. 아미리. 하지만 귀찮은 일이 생기면 슬플 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3496d4a7-39c3-48af-b041-c7a0175e9a15"
msgid ""
"\"You yearn for death. Not many accept the inevitability of the end. I like "
"this side of you.\""
msgstr "\"죽고 싶구나. 누구도 죽음을 거부할 수 없지. 나는 너의 그런 면이 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6c2c28c7-d98c-4a3e-99d3-202e92175830"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps tonight, for a change, someone else will come instead of monsters? "
"Someone friendly, charming, and carrying a basket of cookies…\""
msgstr "\"어쩌면 오늘 저녁 괴물 대신 누군가 올까? 상냥하고 매력적이고 쿠키 바구니도 가져오면 더 좋고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "dbfacee0-ee9a-4bde-bf67-39a68990bad7"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! The fearless Amiri is scared we're not disguising the camp? Don't be "
"afraid, if someone attacks us at night, just hide in your tent. — I'll "
"handle it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 아미리가 야영지를 숨기지 않아서 두려워하는 거야? 걱정 마. 습격이라도 당하면 텐트에 숨어있으라고. 내가 해결할 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c77657c3-a0c3-443f-915a-584e1ccaadf4"
msgid "\"Why we don't have no fresh meat today?\""
msgstr "\"왜 오늘은 신선한 고기가 없지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3118c40d-7166-4c29-9f5d-741cfce2662f"
msgid "\"I didn't get it. Why no one is hunting some meat?!\""
msgstr "\"정말 모르겠네. 왜 고기를 구하지 않는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "13d7ee1b-760b-451d-a793-4638b318e640"
msgid ""
"\"No one wants to go hunting. That includes me. You can do it yourself if "
"you wish.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 사냥하려 하지 않아. 고기 먹고 싶으면 네가 가던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a4803caf-6884-4c20-9005-d95171d8e227"
msgid ""
"\"We have some ration packs stored, Amiri. We shouldn't expose ourselves to "
"risk by wandering here alone.\""
msgstr "\"아직 식량이 조금 있어. 아미리. 이곳을 떠돌다가 위험에 처하면 안된다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0e35faa6-bce2-4f49-be74-dd4a7830201c"
msgid "\"Soooo sleeeeepy!\" [Octavia yawns deeply]"
msgstr "\"으하암. 졸려!\" [옥타비아가 하품을 자지러지게 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "67b5a2f9-e142-4874-b66d-e1dfce772c84"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I'd just love some meat! I'd go myself, but I'm no good as a hunter..."
"\""
msgstr "\"고기 먹고 싶어! 하지만 나는 사냥 실력이 별로라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "89cc84b7-d4e2-40ef-8a03-f3fc95109a2c"
msgid "\"As we walk in light, we shall not forget those lost in darkness.\""
msgstr "\"빛 속을 걸으면 어둠 속의 그들을 놓치지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "035ee949-75bb-4a12-a1ab-78ac4545bfb3"
msgid "\"I pray for peace, and an easy path for the fallen.\""
msgstr "\"평화를 위해 기도하고 타락한 자들에게 구원의 길을 주기를 바라지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b5b71fbd-947e-4aa5-a02e-ef02b907593f"
msgid ""
"\"Speak slowly, I'm writing it down. I shall cite your prayers in my essay "
"on the cult of Sarenrae.\""
msgstr "\"천천히 말하라구. 적고 있으니까. 서렌레이 숭배 단락을 만들어 네 기도문을 적을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d8962f24-fc0a-4f45-8df4-d40f5e142c30"
msgid ""
"\"Let us remember the fallen with dignity! Our sorrow, and our pride in "
"them, shall live on in our hearts.\""
msgstr "\"타락한자를 품위있게 기억하자! 우리의 슬픔과 자긍심이 마음 속에 간직될 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b408368b-d13a-4fe9-bc3d-5f26bec17d3d"
msgid "\"Your words heap sadness upon my soul, but relieve it as well.\""
msgstr "\"네 기도는 정말 슬프지만 위로가 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9e324d67-71d3-495c-a5f4-bf3cc7e96749"
msgid ""
"\"They stopped caring about your sermons long ago. Just like everyone else.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 네 설교에 관심 끈지 오래야. 누구나 그렇지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9e5ba4f2-5079-499e-9466-510796527ca4"
msgid ""
"\"My spirit is stronger than any illness. By the light I shall cleanse "
"myself of all filth, and with the new dawn I shall rise like the Sun.\""
msgstr "\"내 영혼은 어떤 병보다 강해. 나는 빛으로 오물을 씻어내 여명 속의 태양처럼 솟아오를 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "083124a4-a714-4048-9430-5549c1d2f269"
msgid ""
"\"Merciful Sarenrae, I humbly beg you, hear my prayers and help me heal "
"myself.\""
msgstr "\"자비로운 Sarenrae시여. 바라건데 제 기도를 들어 저를 치유하소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "54a19eb5-6bb8-40e4-a7b9-ed133a9cd6b8"
msgid "\"You'd better resort to surer remedies. You're not looking so good.\""
msgstr "\"확실한 치료법에 의지하라고. 네 상태가 안좋아보여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5c9be22e-99cb-410d-8079-9b7e97e455a7"
msgid ""
"\"Buck up! Go pump some iron, or let's say... carry some sacks around. Helps "
"me every time!\""
msgstr "\"물러서! 가서 철이나 자루를 옮기라고. 그게 도움이 돼니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "13a7d2bd-504a-4422-99b2-872bd6ce0eb6"
msgid "\"Tristian, you look so pale… but you know, it suits you well!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 창백해 보여. 그런데 말이야. 정말 잘어울리네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e99e8f5f-9067-4123-9e02-749ca2e30f6f"
msgid ""
"\"Just don't pray all night this time, and get some sleep. You need your "
"strength. — If not for you, then think of the others.\""
msgstr "\"기도하며 밤새지 말고 가서 좀 자. 힘을 회복해야지. 남들을 생각해서라도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "bbc21d09-acba-46a3-9dc4-a45e2934e6a3"
msgid ""
"\"And I'd so hoped that I'd never again have to fall asleep listening to the "
"sounds of prayers to Sarenrae...\""
msgstr "\"만약 서렌레이의 기도를 다시 들으면 나는 자지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6ae50131-e7b0-4fef-b65d-3563cd8540d6"
msgid ""
"\"And I'd so hoped that I'd never again have to fall asleep listening to the "
"sounds of prayers to Sarenrae...\""
msgstr "\"만약 서렌레이의 기도를 다시 들으면 나는 자지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "29f2dcad-8c33-4df2-aa1c-fc5758385a4e"
msgid ""
"\"I feel I've spent a dozen years in a cold dungeon, without a single ray of "
"sunlight.\""
msgstr "\"나는 햇빛 한줄기 없는 차가운 던전에서 12년을 살았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "916d1afc-4383-4424-aade-ebcec155ff08"
msgid ""
"\"It's been a long time since I felt so fatigued. Like I've spent four "
"seasons in a windowless cell.\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 피곤함을 느낀 건 정말 오랜만이야. 마치 창문 없는 독방에서 사계절을 보낸 거 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f8ec123b-38a7-4069-b012-ef1a86321896"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae's clerics are like flowers — they wilt without the sun! The good "
"thing is, unlike flowers, they don't attract bees.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 성직자는 꽃과 같아. 태양이 없다면 시들지. 그래도 다행히 벌이 꼬이지는 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "77c9fc8a-f858-4698-8820-09ca908e690d"
msgid ""
"\"Please have a good rest, Tristian. I'll take your place keeping watch, if "
"you like.\""
msgstr "\"잘 쉬어. 트리스티안. 원한다면 주위를 지켜줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "527022d7-7604-4296-8bfd-a562c7458d25"
msgid ""
"\"I wish I could switch places with you. One's suffering is another's "
"blessing.\""
msgstr "\"너와 자리를 바꿀 수 있었다면 좋겠어. 누군가의 고통은 타인의 축복이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1e320128-1734-447b-8866-3db5dfa2faed"
msgid "\"You're making my jaw hurt. I wonder — is it laughter or disgust?\""
msgstr "\"내가 무슨 표정을 지어야 할지 모르겠어. 웃어야하나 경멸해야 하나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5baaa083-124a-4532-bfba-e8f964fa283e"
msgid ""
"\"I like it better without sun. Goblins like it best in dark. More sneaking, "
"better ambushes!\""
msgstr "\"나는 태양 없는 것이 더 좋다. 고블린은 어둠 좋아한다. 몰래 움직이고 매복하기 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2aa43439-2cbd-4252-b985-3a0bf9abbb17"
msgid "\"This is an ominous place. Let us keep together, friends.\""
msgstr "\"여기는 불길해. 어디 멀리 가지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e2d0964d-3683-414c-957e-dfa1c25ad866"
msgid "\"Don't go too far. This place can be dangerous.\""
msgstr "\"너무 멀리 가지 마. 이 곳은 위험해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5287f9b8-5eba-4777-9d64-aabc311a5681"
msgid ""
"\"More clerical whining. I've survived alone in worse places than this!\""
msgstr "\"성직자 다운 소리구만. 나는 여기보다 더 험한 곳에서도 살아남았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5e9effe5-22e6-49a6-b67b-c219f846b7c5"
msgid "\"Wise words. Unity feeds our strength.\""
msgstr "\"현명하군. 함께 있어야 강하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "261203d2-9b09-476c-aa33-1c721bde9417"
msgid ""
"\"Fine by me, I love it when we sit together by the fire. And I always worry "
"when one of us wanders off somewhere all by himself.\""
msgstr "\"함께 캠프파이어 주위에 앉아있을 때가 좋아. 누군가 떠돌고 있다면 걱정돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1410a384-e16f-401f-812b-2b1c3495e480"
msgid "\"By the gods, what a coward...\""
msgstr "\"맙소사. 이런 겁쟁이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d4ba7317-214c-407d-a2b5-a8426cdeba55"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't say your company gives me any sense of safety. I think I'm "
"going to lie down wa-a-ay over there.\""
msgstr "\"너의 동료가 마음이 놓이지는 않아. 나는 저 만큼 떨어진 곳에 누워야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e70bd855-9ff8-41c3-92dc-8d049662e569"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't say your company gives me any sense of safety. I think I'm "
"going to lie down wa-a-ay over there.\""
msgstr "\"너의 동료가 마음이 놓이지는 않아. 나는 저 만큼 떨어진 곳에 누워야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d2882aba-4e37-470a-af1a-e9c9904b09b7"
msgid "\"Don't look at me like that. — I'm fine!\""
msgstr "\"나를 그렇게 보지 마. 나는 괜찮아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "eaaf76de-fc6a-4f06-ae50-097fec976360"
msgid "\"Everything's fine. I can take care of myself, and the others.\""
msgstr "\"다 괜찮아. 내 몸은 내가 챙겨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9ac3bc88-584c-4f9c-abf2-f383cc992fe3"
msgid ""
"\"Another hero who keeps claiming he's fine, even as he bleeds to death.\""
msgstr "\"피를 흘리며 죽을 거 같은 영웅이 또 허풍을 떠는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "15c6d9d0-40a7-4dd6-ae59-b9dab3f6ab2e"
msgid ""
"\"You're not a sissy, I give you that. And you're right! Those scratches are "
"nothing!\""
msgstr "\"너는 어리석은 녀석이 아니야. 네가 맞았어! 흉터는 아무것도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3d9ca313-9517-4dc4-b499-f48601d3ba3e"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you the one who always says I should take better care of myself? "
"Don't be so stubborn, Tristian, and let us check your wounds.\""
msgstr "\"자기 자신은 스스로 챙겨야 한다고 하지 않았어? 고집부리지 마. 트리스티안. 상처를 봐줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2142cc33-c8d1-462f-b8d0-bce4c8373493"
msgid ""
"\"You're going to fall over, if anyone so much as taps you on the shoulder. "
"Though I guess that's true even on your good days, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"너는 토닥이기만 해도 넘어질걸. 약골이 될 거야. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fc28eddc-c68c-4a29-8dd1-ccf88a6dfd49"
msgid ""
"\"We're running out of food. I'd go hunting myself, but I lack the talent "
"for it…\""
msgstr "\"식량이 부족해. 나는 사냥을 가겠지만 잘 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0480499b-2268-49e5-b960-9d0e954ddcff"
msgid ""
"\"We must replenish our stocks. I'm not sure I can do it, though. I'm not "
"much of a hunter.\""
msgstr "\"식량을 보충해야 해. 나는 사냥꾼이 아니라서 식량을 구할지는 모르겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "cd5130ce-cad0-4e7b-b02a-08ca8416e4b1"
msgid ""
"\"Couldn't you ask Jhod to teach you a thing or two about the Stag God's "
"hunting tricks? You tagged along with him for long enough.\""
msgstr "\"조드에게 사슴신 사냥 방식을 배우지 않았어? 그와 함께 오래 있었잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0679b39a-ac88-417c-921d-e0f27585fe70"
msgid ""
"\"If you wish to learn, you need only ask. Everyone should know how to hunt."
"\""
msgstr "\"배우고 싶으면 물어 봐. 사냥은 모두 배워야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "09f5927e-091d-4f24-9ab3-ee925861c70a"
msgid ""
"\"I knew we should have taken more rations with us. With hunters like this "
"we'll soon be starving.\""
msgstr "\"더 많은 식량이 있어야 해. 이런 식이라면 곧 굶주릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5615ff2b-a96f-49fa-a7c9-77e645f0ef76"
msgid ""
"\"I remember how I used to sing for food on the streets, and in the pubs — "
"back when I was at the Academy. Truth be told, I wasn't very good at it. I "
"do hope it doesn't come to that...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아카데미 시절에 주점과 길거리에서 음식을 구걸할 때가 생각나. 솔직히 나는 잘 못했거든. 이런 일이 오지 않기를 기대했는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowRation_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fa689251-59bd-4f33-9089-61e0bbe7c9a8"
msgid ""
"\"Hunting is simple. I teach you! But first we need bait for snare. Linzee "
"will do.\""
msgstr "\"사냥은 간단해. 가르쳐줄게! 하지만 미끼가 먼저 필요해. 린지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8e674e9f-ad8d-4b10-8c3c-29d11510eba6"
msgid ""
"\"Dawnflower, don't turn your gaze from me! I need your power to help those "
"who suffer.\""
msgstr "\"다른 곳 보지 마! 네 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a9bc4d1e-1f96-417d-904a-d17bbd32bbd9"
msgid ""
"\"The fire of my prayers has fallen to embers. I address my plea to you, "
"Dawnflower — grant me the strength to serve you.\""
msgstr "\"기도의 불씨가 바닥났어. Dawnflower. 나에게 힘을 주소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ece812e5-eba5-44e7-8f18-2cd0f22eb270"
msgid "\"I like to listen when you pray. A pure voice, and a pure soul.\""
msgstr "\"네가 기도할 때가 좋더라. 순수한 목소리와 순수한 영혼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "97cb15a3-da34-43a6-b8d7-18cb05d40202"
msgid ""
"\"You wasted all your prayers again? Good. Now you'll need to learn how to "
"use weapons properly.\""
msgstr "\"또 기도가 바닥났어? 이제 무기사용하는 법도 배워야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "09144645-727c-43e8-a113-d395a17a8c35"
msgid ""
"\"All your prayers are always about serving, and helping others. This… "
"brings to my mind many things. I think upon those things that separate "
"sincerity and vanity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"항상 다른 사람들을 돕겠다는 기도만 하잖아... 그게 나에게 많은 의미가 돼. 나는 성실에서 허영심을 분리하는 방법을 배워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ed80ccac-a5f8-4499-b574-ed86a71b0980"
msgid ""
"\"Oh goddess, give me your strength... Because I have none of my own, ha, "
"ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"오. 여신님. 힘을 주세요... 힘이 없어요. 여신님. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7fb31654-6e1b-4449-b13f-aa550b8ce450"
msgid "\"It's unsafe to set up camp in the open like this.\""
msgstr "\"이런 곳에 야영지를 세우다니 미쳤군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fcefb538-ec45-4559-b47d-996a8afcafb8"
msgid "\"Being this careless could cost us dearly.\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 생각 없이 행동하면 타격을 입을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "982bcadc-fab0-4328-adfb-e52d23fa75fb"
msgid ""
"\"Stop your whining, cleric. If someone jumps us, I'll save your hide!\""
msgstr "\"그만 징징대. 기습당하면 내가 구해줄 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "70848791-b3ae-47e1-a2f2-05138a7d3e59"
msgid ""
"\"Each careless step taken is one step closer to Groetus. Surely you "
"understand that everyone shall rest in his embrace in the end, no matter how "
"carefully they try to delay the final moment?\""
msgstr "\"무의미한 짓은 그로투스에게 가까워지는 한 방법이지. 곧 멸망의 순간에 그로투스의 품에서 안식을 취하게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a16045d7-9a3c-41cc-9088-10f5f7675d36"
msgid ""
"\"You are right. The art of camouflage has been developed over many "
"centuries. It's unwise to neglect it!\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 위장술은 수세기에 걸쳐 발전했어. 그걸 활용해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "da4d4892-e48b-4eca-93a6-53e737806f7b"
msgid ""
"\"You complain as though you'll be the one slicing up the monsters if they "
"attack us, ha, ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"기습당하면 먼저 괴물을 공격할 것처럼 불평하네? 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5a649b23-3ab3-4d3a-a852-0b25080b8cf7"
msgid ""
"\"At least the local rabbits will rest easy, if we don't go hunting tonight. "
"And we still have some rations.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 사냥하지 않으니 토끼가 쉴 수 있겠군. 식량은 아직 넉넉하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "32928778-df41-4de7-baed-bdedbb403b75"
msgid ""
"\"So no one's going to hunt tonight? Well, at least that's good for some "
"rabbit or deer, who will live to see another dawn.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 밤에 아무도 사냥가지 않는 거야? 토끼나 사슴은 오늘 편히 잘 수 있겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3dc873b2-3a07-4741-a161-768ac24f34c2"
msgid ""
"\"I pity the rabbits, of course, but I'd prefer one or two hop into our stew "
"pot. A fresh meal is always healthier.\""
msgstr "\"토끼에게 미안한 일이지만 스튜에 넣을 재료가 필요해. 신선한 식사는 몸에 좋다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a7f17dc3-889c-4f49-a1fa-4c61b50567a8"
msgid ""
"\"Damn it, cleric. Hunting is fun and meat is tasty. But you're just a "
"rabbit lover who likes chewing ration packs!\""
msgstr "\"사냥은 재밌고 고기는 맛있는데 토끼를 잡지 말자는 거야? 동물 애호가 녀석.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5dc7f581-8b47-4454-a3c0-98d729d06673"
msgid ""
"\"Rabbits are so cute! But so tasty too! — I can't tell which one's more "
"important.\""
msgstr "\"토끼는 너무 귀엽지만 너무 맛있어! 뭐가 더 중요한 지 말할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "99f5d054-0a81-4dad-a61d-f49d9bcbfb11"
msgid ""
"\"Ha. You put an animal higher than yourself. You think almost as little of "
"yourself as I do...\""
msgstr "\"하하. 자신을 살피지 않는구만. 동물이 더 소중하다는 건가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e76ac827-b6be-4678-b77a-ce06dad03343"
msgid ""
"\"You care so much for those who are unable to protect themselves! It's a "
"shame your brothers in faith didn't show me the same mercy.\""
msgstr "\"항상 약자만 생각하는구나! 네 형제가 그런 자비를 보여주지 않아 안타깝군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Angel/Banter_Angel_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a5110b46-e518-4b93-a39f-750423f5b048"
msgid ""
"\"You care so much for those who are unable to protect themselves! It's a "
"shame your brothers in faith didn't show me the same mercy.\""
msgstr "\"항상 약자만 생각하는구나! 네 형제가 그런 자비를 보여주지 않아 안타깝군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "695236b4-1b0c-48ed-843d-74497bd6ebdc"
msgid "\"Death reminds me of things I'd rather forget.\""
msgstr "\"죽음을 목격하면 잊어버려야 한다는 생각이 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3b8504f5-0204-4ca4-8301-ba0d64847861"
msgid "\"One more death… I've seen far too much of it.\""
msgstr "\"한번 더 죽었어... 너무나 많은 것을 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4e8bb934-2714-411a-ad09-a96c0f6ca413"
msgid ""
"\"You could find consolation in my faith… but you are not yet ready, if you "
"still try to avoid the inevitable.\""
msgstr "\"내 믿음으로 위안을 찾았다고 해도 멸망을 피하려 한다면 아직 준비가 안된 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "06aae040-5e93-4321-997e-c557af0acbe4"
msgid ""
"\"We all have bad memories that come to us in nightmares. Or in times like "
"this.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 악몽으로부터 오는 나쁜 추억을 가지고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a368fc2d-bad1-431d-8629-b582b39ef583"
msgid ""
"\"You carry a heavy burden of loss, but you still stand strong. Don't lose "
"that now. The deaths of our friends must never break our spirit!\""
msgstr "\"너는 상실의 아픔이 크겠지만 버텨야 해. 자신을 잃어버리지 마. 친구의 죽음으로 우리는 무너질 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0ffd7981-764a-486d-b38d-2b0dfa348d29"
msgid ""
"\"Those who constantly grieve over others never live for themselves. You're "
"merely wasting time that you don't have much of. Such wasted life is worse "
"by far than death.\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람을 위해 울어주는 사람은 스스로를 행복하게 할 수 없어. 그런 삶은 죽음보다 낫지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ec3ff95a-7172-4bbf-a88e-d4f5c4b523ef"
msgid ""
"\"I know this pain. When it grips my heart with its cold hand, I look for "
"solace in the song of the wind and the dancing clouds.\""
msgstr "\"나도 그 고통을 알아. 차가운 손으로 심장을 쥐는 것 같은 고통이 오면 바람 소리와 왈츠를 추는 구름에 위안을 얻지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "362c5f71-1496-4631-af8c-f9c172847629"
msgid "[Utters a muffled cough and spits aside]"
msgstr "[기침을 하고는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "07681ace-6fd9-48a3-9469-337c08994bd6"
msgid "[Wipes the sweat from his pale forehead]"
msgstr "[창백한 이마의 땀을 닦습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fc7b0ec3-c125-4299-9066-474bad8b5c97"
msgid "\"Stop pretending you're fine! You need help!\""
msgstr "\"괜찮은 척 하지마! 너는 도움이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "68f68d51-f39d-4705-b05b-9afba660866b"
msgid ""
"\"You have proven you can endure pain without complaint. Now be kind enough "
"to consider healing.\""
msgstr "\"불평 없이 고통을 참아냈구만. 그렇게 웃는 걸 보니 치료가 필요하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f53d376d-eee7-49f8-9bb9-0072b4d8ba6f"
msgid ""
"\"You see now what serving Torag has brought you to? Forget him, he's not a "
"god worthy of worship!\""
msgstr "\"토락이 네게 준 것을 이제는 보겠어? 토락은 좋은 신이 아니라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b44da1ae-3d2a-44f9-b4d5-1ef85b8da833"
msgid ""
"\"If you won't let yourself be healed, that's your choice, I suppose. But "
"think about poor wolfy! He will worry about you — he'll whine and grow "
"restless. This kind of trouble is definitely no good for him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"스스로 치유되지 못하는 것도 너의 선택 같군. 하지만 불쌍한 늑대를 생각해! 네 걱정을 하며 울고 있다고. 늑대도 좋아하지 않을 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8065be8e-7adb-4f1a-8062-fc5adbe221a9"
msgid ""
"\"You are like an ancient rock: indestructible on the surface, but inside "
"there are caves and chasms. Know this: there is no shame in opening your "
"heart to friends.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 바위산 같구나. 겉은 단단하지만 안은 동굴이 있어 보금자리가 되어주지. 친구에게 마음을 열어도 부끄러운 일이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "16f17f49-841f-40c6-ae92-83e175ef6abd"
msgid ""
"\"My eyelids are heavy as stones. Don't know if I can guard the camp tonight."
"\""
msgstr "\"눈꺼풀이 돌처럼 무겁다. 오늘 밤 야영지를 지킬 수 있는지 모르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d5bee4bc-443e-4dde-8a79-1659deeddbed"
msgid "\"So exhausted. I must sleep. Could you look after the camp?\""
msgstr "\"너무 피곤해. 자야겠어. 내 대신 야영지를 지켜주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "08926dfa-6b8c-4bbb-b228-d0be7069f034"
msgid ""
"\"I must raise my prayers to Groetus, so I'll be too busy to help. Ask "
"someone who's more concerned with worldly things.\""
msgstr "\"그로투스에게 기도를 해서 시간이라도 보내야겠어. 세속적인 일은 다른 사람에게 물어 보라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e10de29d-6d78-45da-9ed3-99e447ed9881"
msgid ""
"\"No way! I have to finish the draft of my new chapter. Someone who can't "
"write should guard the camp. — There's enough illiterates among us.\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 새로운 원고를 마쳐야 한다구. 글 못쓰는 사람이 야영지를 지켜야 해. 우리 중에 문맹자는 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e2c5756f-15c7-4ca6-93b7-5741c053361b"
msgid "\"I'm ready to keep watch. Don't worry about that.\""
msgstr "\"나는 지킬 수 있어. 걱정 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8be6d3b7-c668-4e7a-b488-15bf441c7842"
msgid "\"Pff.\""
msgstr "\"흥.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5a701278-7c10-4df9-82b7-27a14947bc46"
msgid "\"Then sleep well. The swords of your friends will keep you safe.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 잘자. 네 친구의 검이 너를 지켜줄 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "64eebfcc-a21a-42ea-8723-7da422c32a8a"
msgid "\"We must set patrols. Preferably in groups of two.\""
msgstr "\"순찰을 해야 해. 두 그룹으로 나누자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "091f7293-4910-4cdf-b53e-699500855144"
msgid "\"Bad place for a camp. We'd best not linger here long.\""
msgstr "\"야영하기에 나쁜 장소야. 여기에 오래 머물면 좋지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f4279984-038a-4ae5-a8ad-14f61520ab44"
msgid ""
"\"Cool it, tough guy. If anyone attacks, we'll calm 'em down in a heartbeat."
"\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 터프가이. 누군가 공격하면 제압해버릴게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "88244249-29c7-4f6e-a13b-c5146a29da2e"
msgid ""
"\"I'd better chance my luck and go to sleep. I don't want blue rings around "
"my eyes tomorrow!\""
msgstr "\"운에 맡기고 잠이나 자야겠어. 내일 내 눈가에 멍이 들지는 않겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7b37e641-626f-4bac-b266-b704476c0f1f"
msgid ""
"\"The closer we get to the danger, the sooner we'll put an end to it. We "
"just have to stay on guard. — Wise caution is not contrary to valor.\""
msgstr "\"위험에 가까워질 수록 끝도 가까워지지. 우리는 주의하면 돼. 현명한 주의는 용기에 위배되지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c64bec0e-ecc0-4650-84eb-f9d4c4860589"
msgid "\"Thank you, but I don't plan to spend all night outside.\""
msgstr "\"고맙지만 밖에서 밤을 지세울 생각은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "72d5e69c-8df6-4c2c-b934-d2106ad81203"
msgid ""
"\"I will do like this. I hide and wait until you are attacked. Then I run "
"away.\""
msgstr "\"내 계획을 말해줄게. 나는 숨어서 네가 공격당할 때까지 기다릴 꺼야. 그리고는 도망가야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6079d965-b9b8-427d-8ded-63bf8a335a3e"
msgid "\"When I fell… I saw the faces of those I've lost…\""
msgstr "\"내가 쓰러졌을 때 잃어버린 사람들의 얼굴을 보았어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1e765230-3a0a-4595-a160-7d9fe620a6cc"
msgid ""
"\"When death draws near, you start to wonder — is it possible to reunite "
"with your lost family, somewhere beyond life?\""
msgstr "\"죽음이 가까이 오면 어딘가에서 다른 삶을 살고 있을 가족들과 다시 함께할 수 있을까라는 생각을 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f5caca70-afba-4f5a-b2be-5fd616d6eb84"
msgid ""
"\"Those dear to us who we've lost — they're always with us, in our thoughts "
"and in our grief. They'll always be there for you, Ekun.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 잃어버린 사람들은 항상 슬픔과 기억 속에서 살고 있어. 너를 기다리고 있을 거야. 에쿤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "61a1327d-dabe-40de-bd8a-441d22082210"
msgid ""
"\"You still breathe, but you dream of meeting dead people! Stop talking crap!"
"\""
msgstr "\"살아있는데 죽은 사람들을 만날 꿈을 꾸다니. 헛소리 그만둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4e3ec064-4177-40bc-9c5f-f7fcb18aa264"
msgid ""
"\"Your losses were terrible, yet you remain strong. When I see this, my own "
"grief and sorrow seems to lessen.\""
msgstr "\"네 가족을 잃은 일은 슬프지만 너는 여전히 살아있어. 너를 볼 때면 내 슬픔은 별거 아니라는 생각이 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8d1d9dd9-3693-417d-b5c3-5ca70458c8f2"
msgid "\"When you die, you will see and feel nothing. Trust my experience.\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽을 때면 아무것도 느끼거나 보지 못할 거야. 내 경험을 믿으라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2a2a7d04-0017-436e-a93e-dbbab999e833"
msgid ""
"\"I know these thoughts... But what could they say to you, if you met them "
"before your time? 'Go back, and return only when you are a gray old man!'\""
msgstr "\"네가 살아 있을 때 그들을 만나면 뭐라고 말할까? 다시 돌아가라고 말할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "944c4f87-8aca-464e-9029-44172320c8e7"
msgid ""
"\"I know these thoughts... But what could they say to you, if you met them "
"before your time? 'Go back, and return only when you are a gray old man!'\""
msgstr "\"네가 살아 있을 때 그들을 만나면 뭐라고 말할까? 다시 돌아가라고 말할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d37aa018-9c11-4bc1-913d-db92fcb2080d"
msgid "\"Our supplies grow thin. We'll have to go hunting.\""
msgstr "\"식량 배급이 줄어들고 있어. 사냥을 해야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2173e193-81fb-4205-8ae8-0b313eed7a2d"
msgid "\"We are running short of rations. We'll have to rely on the hunt.\""
msgstr "\"식량이 부족해. 이제 사냥으로 먹을 것을 구해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e6fb5a67-7ea0-4d42-8555-12e1b1161194"
msgid "\"That's good! I'm tired of nibbling dry food every day!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이야! 나는 전투 식량 먹는 데 질렸다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "55f3283f-c6f0-4c95-aa48-acf570fd2b3f"
msgid ""
"\"You can count me out. But I shall stand ready to support you with wisdom "
"and advice.\""
msgstr "\"나를 믿어도 돼. 나는 지해와 충고로 너를 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9466a908-8e7d-4ba1-aa0c-bd457ebf1e51"
msgid ""
"\"It would be so nice to teach your wolf to go hunting alone, and bring meat "
"back to us! We could just sit here, and — here comes our lunch!\""
msgstr "\"늑대에게 혼자 사냥해서 고기를 물어오는 훈련을 시키자! 여기 앉아서 점심 배달하는 걸 기다리면 땡이잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "01e8b841-afbe-4a30-a6a7-9d31b80ffabf"
msgid "\"Knock yourself out! Don't forget your bow! Ha, ha, ha, hmm...\""
msgstr "\"조심해! 활 챙기고! 하하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "30e8535a-16e1-486d-9615-c9630244c106"
msgid "\"My spells must be replenished. I feel uncomfortable without them.\""
msgstr "\"주문을 다시 충전해둬야겠어. 안그러면 불안하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9b0cbafc-038a-4ea7-a43f-7aa99f8c68c0"
msgid ""
"\"It was a hard day. My spells must be restored, so we're prepared for "
"tomorrow.\""
msgstr "\"힘든 하루였어. 마법을 충전해서 내일을 준비해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "30f6d70a-093e-4c3e-b09a-d0eb72e4fec6"
msgid ""
"\"At least you can always rely on your weapons if magic fails you… If the "
"same thing happens to me, all I can do is hide behind my companions!\""
msgstr "\"마법이 바닥나면 무기에 의지할 수 있어야 해... 나 같은 경우는 동료들 뒤에 숨지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "40aac418-8828-417c-bb1d-c52e65efb986"
msgid ""
"\"You'd better sharpen your blade, instead of wasting time on that crap!\""
msgstr "\"시간 낭비하지 말고 칼이나 갈아둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6215573e-db37-4af5-b0b6-a7a6adf0331d"
msgid ""
"\"You're rather well-stocked — your weapons, your magic, and your wolf. It's "
"no wonder you sometimes forget to replenish your spells.\""
msgstr "\"무기며 마법이며 늑대 챙기느라 바쁘겠어. 마법 충전하는 걸 잊는 것도 예상못할 바는 아니지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1051e287-cebf-4523-a15f-2934317b6b6d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, oh, can I play with wolfy while you're busy? He's so sweet — such a "
"fluffy head, and that soft fur! I just love it when you summon him!\""
msgstr "\"와! 바쁠 때 늑대랑 놀래! 머리는 복슬복슬하고 털은 부드러워! 늑대를 소환할 때 어찌나 좋은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fb80657b-37ca-4691-918c-d89efbe2c619"
msgid ""
"\"We should make sure it's safe. Something dangerous may be stalking us "
"nearby.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 안전한지 먼저 확인해야 해. 위험한 것이 우리를 따라올지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c1cc7c85-f883-44cd-b3a1-e3fc1fabc438"
msgid "\"We should look around first. Be sure the camp is secure.\""
msgstr "\"먼저 주위를 둘러보자. 야영지가 안전한지 확인하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "520f60d5-8ebc-4514-8a04-83bfe80ebd61"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, easy for you! You got that dog following you around, barking if "
"anything is off. Too bad it don't talk.\""
msgstr "\"그게 낫겠다! 그 개를 데리고 다니면서 뭔가 있다면 짖으라고 해. 말도 할 수 있다면 좋으련만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "43dbf7fa-96d8-4ccc-9929-88c1a27b2ccb"
msgid ""
"\"We'd better stay together. — If someone attacks, we might be too far away "
"to help.\""
msgstr "\"같이 머무는 게 낫겠어. 누군가 공격할 때 떨어져있다면 곤란하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8a0fe1e4-5d90-4b26-a0fc-2f2d895c1a8c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no. We'll do like all smart adventurers do. — We'll just sit here "
"quietly, and let the adventures come to us!\""
msgstr "\"똑똑한 모험가처럼 행동하자고. 여기에 조용히 앉아서 똑똑한 모험가가 올 때까지 기다리는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a640fd29-43de-48bc-b1b2-72aa917d7b79"
msgid ""
"\"I admit, it worries me a little too, when we camp in the open for all to "
"see. But then I can play the lute — and the light from our campfire can be "
"seen from afar anyway.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 이렇게 트인 곳에 야영지를 설치해서 조금 걱정이 돼. 캠프파이어의 빛이 먼 곳에서도 보일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "abfaba6b-f577-480d-a7b7-ddaa6a3a5a62"
msgid ""
"\"I can go with you! I will ride your beast! Why you looking at me funny? "
"Fine then. Now I'm not going!\""
msgstr "\"너와 함께 가겠어! 네 짐승을 타고 가지 뭐! 왜 그렇게 쳐다봐? 좋아. 가지 않겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "33a73e12-9be4-4f78-bf11-3075601a5fd7"
msgid ""
"\"My wife would cook venison stew like no one else in the world. And now my "
"life is reduced to eating dry rations.\""
msgstr "\"내 아내는 세상에 하나뿐인 사슴 고기 스튜를 요리했을 거야. 지금은 마른 식량이나 씹고 있어야 하다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ae8fccd1-0c0e-4c66-83a8-4f2f61e48976"
msgid ""
"\"Once, hot homemade meals awaited me every time I returned home. Now I "
"choke on dry rations.\""
msgstr "\"집에 돌아올 때마다 뜨거운 집밥을 먹었는데. 마른 식량에 목이 메인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6b949ce4-e242-440c-a836-7ef40a497bb6"
msgid ""
"\"I know you've been through a lot, but don't be so gloomy! You may yet meet "
"that special someone who cares about you!\""
msgstr "\"지겹다는 거 알지만 우울해하지 마! 언젠가 짝을 만나겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0c649a8a-18d0-42fb-9f4e-b654a959efc5"
msgid ""
"\"Will you ever stop whimpering? Finish your crackers and get some sleep!\""
msgstr "\"그만 징징대. 마저 먹고 가서 잠이나 자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e4ac7f30-6627-4337-b802-fcb7b3c01fe6"
msgid ""
"\"It feels strange to hear stories about such comforts. Home-made meals… "
"Things familiar to everyone, but unknown to me.\""
msgstr "\"그런 이야기를 듣자니 기분이 이상해. 집밥이라... 다 아는데 나만 모르는 느낌이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a4d190ff-ff7b-4da6-807b-316d06b26aca"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand widowers. Spare a slave his chains, and he will mourn them "
"to the end of his life.\""
msgstr "\"나는 홀애비가 될 수는 없어. 노예가 있다면 마지막 순간에 슬퍼라도 해주겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "41ebc2a0-e6bc-48a5-add2-bd72d2aea53f"
msgid ""
"\"Fate is unpredictable. She who spent the night at home yesterday, may "
"sleep in a dirty gutter tonight, and in a palace tomorrow.\""
msgstr "\"운명을 예측할 수는 없어. 어제 집에서 자던 여자가 오늘 저녁에는 흙바닥에서 자다가 내일은 궁전에서 잘지 누가 알겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a60a7041-a1b5-457f-b399-d0ffb16151be"
msgid ""
"\"We are all just ashes and dust that hasn't yet attained eternal rest. "
"Remember this, and no tragedy can shatter your calmness.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 영원한 평온을 얻게 되면 먼지에 지나지 않아. 이런 말을 들으면 비참한 상황이라도 평온할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "92f32db7-1cd4-4e43-8aff-dd093e47ccd6"
msgid ""
"\"Death is inevitable. All that exists must perish. Why mourn that which is "
"already written? Why ponder ways to fend off the inevitable? Accept death "
"for what it is, and you will gain true serenity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽음은 필연적이야. 모든 존재는 소멸하지. 당연한 결말인데 슬퍼할 필요 있나? 불가피한 일을 고민해서 뭐해? 모든 이는 죽는다는 "
"사실을 받아들여. 그럼 진정한 평온을 얻을 수 있네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b6ab0b6d-1d7b-4b53-af8c-e2250ca8abd4"
msgid "\"Your words sound… comforting. Strangely enough.\""
msgstr "\"네 말을 들으니... 기분이 편해진다. 정말 이상하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "091c84cb-4df7-476a-a0fc-7f6794d03cb9"
msgid ""
"\"Say no more. No one can truly prepare for death. Neither one's own nor "
"another's.\""
msgstr "\"더는 말하지 마. 아무도 죽음을 준비할 수는 없어. 자기 자신의 죽음도. 타인의 죽음도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "40d64763-e3a0-4039-bd66-7aa998b94817"
msgid ""
"\"'Fall down and die, all of you!' — Is that what you're trying to say?!\""
msgstr "\"모두 죽어버려! 라고 말하고 싶은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9e48d816-9bd7-45b8-ad9e-4590f3df7933"
msgid ""
"\"No, Harrim. Life always defeats death — time after time, again and again. "
"It is especially important to remember that truth in times like this!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 하림. 삶은 항상 죽음을 이겨. 몇번이고 반복해서 말이야. 이런 상황에 깨달아야 할 사실이랄까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7b064746-b72e-4b9f-8cb9-2d7499dc4092"
msgid ""
"\"You again! With all your extra words! Stop! Now! Nok-Nok will sleep "
"instead.\""
msgstr "\"또 너야? 말이 정말 많구나. 좀 닥쳐. 녹-녹 잘 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e04768b1-8951-4099-850e-6739fd27a91f"
msgid ""
"\"We have a saying: 'it's better to be rich and healthy than poor and sick'. "
"But your faith seems to teach otherwise, doesn't it?\""
msgstr "\"상식적으로 건강하고 부유한 게 아프고 병든 것보다 낫지. 그런데 너는 그 반대 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e3c2413c-ba60-4622-bb45-f0c9d5550938"
msgid ""
"\"We have a saying: 'it's better to be rich and healthy than poor and sick'. "
"But your faith seems to teach otherwise, doesn't it?\""
msgstr "\"상식적으로 건강하고 부유한 게 아프고 병든 것보다 낫지. 그런데 너는 그 반대 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5795abf3-77c8-4c30-8b35-d8d032a8b974"
msgid "\"I feel the touch of Groetus.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그로투스의 손길을 느낀다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4437877f-88e5-4f38-a12a-9a0e33515c8a"
msgid "\"I feel the breath of the Great God. He is near. He is here!\""
msgstr "\"나는 위대한 하나님의 호흡을 느낀다. 그는 가까이 있다. 그는 여기있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b1ab07d7-176d-4c3a-8861-8546f2895425"
msgid ""
"\"You usually just talk rubbish, this time I'm inclined to agree — you look "
"worse than ever.\""
msgstr "\"너는 헛소리만 지껄이지만 이번에는 인정해야겠군. 이번이 최악이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "36f87652-718e-4fc6-b4d0-b1ce3dc94e23"
msgid "\"You are pale. You need medicine. Or a blessing.\""
msgstr "\"너 창백해 보여. 약이나 축복이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bfe9c31d-5e4e-4525-8aff-7a3a80a1e2ce"
msgid ""
"\"I just itch to yell, \"Leave our friend alone, you graverot!\" — But "
"you're the one who keeps calling him, dwarf.\""
msgstr "\"소리지르고 싶어 죽겠어. 제발 우리 동료를 내버려둬! 라고 말이야. 하지만 성가시게 하는 건 드워프 네놈이잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6a106927-e6ea-4696-9775-8ad4a7a9c63f"
msgid "\"You should rest, Harrim. You don't look well!\""
msgstr "\"쉬어. 하림. 안색이 안좋아보여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "83562613-9063-4539-ac9d-09e786ff3ff7"
msgid ""
"\"You ask for trouble all the time. Should you be surprised when it finally "
"arrives?\""
msgstr "\"항상 문제가 있기를 바라면서 막상 닥치니 놀라워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a80d4882-1d2e-4027-9dac-5653782095df"
msgid "\"I need rest.\""
msgstr "\"나는 휴식이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b2bbc1d0-21f4-4080-b865-1c2890634c5b"
msgid "\"I must sleep.\""
msgstr "\"나는 자야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bb38d02a-fa81-409d-9e3d-672ca7b54d6f"
msgid "\"Maybe some sleep will cheer you up a little?\""
msgstr "\"잠을 좀 자면 나아지지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "348cd5ed-98b7-43ae-be02-7d1a15e77896"
msgid "\"Go get some rest. Without you, we'll have a hard time in battle.\""
msgstr "\"가서 좀 쉬라고. 너 없이 전투는 힘들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b1974370-f83f-41dc-9071-acc85f831168"
msgid ""
"\"Find a good dream, and draw some strength from it. There is much to do "
"tomorrow.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 잘 자고 피로 좀 회복하라고. 내일 할 일이 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3c806528-7dc0-403b-97a3-2337c6c3aaee"
msgid "\"What? Ha, ha. You got tired of constantly wailing?"
msgstr "\"뭐라구? 하하. 우는 것도 지쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1afb2f9f-1f44-499b-830d-6695713c17fe"
msgid "\"I like it in here. This place calms my soul.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여기에 있는 게 좋아. 기분이 편안해져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d53805f5-d636-4a51-939b-0119beed4169"
msgid "\"In such a dark place, my rest will be calm and deep.\""
msgstr "\"어두운 장소에서 기분이 편해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3756ab2f-da6b-4852-b329-237c2bf89c90"
msgid ""
"\"You manage to see something good even in creepy places like this. I admire "
"that about you.\""
msgstr "\"이런 소름 끼치는 장소에서도 좋은 점을 찾는구나. 존경스러워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a086631b-136a-4240-806d-fcf16d380467"
msgid ""
"\"Which calm you talkin' about, for demons' sake! I feel danger! My blood is "
"about to boil — and I can almost make out clanging steel!\""
msgstr "\"평온 같은 소리하고 있네. 위험한 장소라고! 나는 지금 피가 끓어서 싸워야 할 거 같다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "19840b8a-ecae-411d-95a0-00564d2dcc22"
msgid ""
"\"It's a rare occasion when we can learn some optimism from Harrim. "
"Optimism! — From Harrim!\""
msgstr "\"하림에게서 긍정적인 모습을 보다니. 대단하군. 하림에게서 긍정적인 모습이라니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "421ba65a-7110-4d74-afd7-b6674c17c065"
msgid "\"I care not where we camp, so long as no one troubles me at night.\""
msgstr "\"저녁에 괴롭히는 녀석이 없다면 아무래도 괜찮아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8cc62fa2-12ee-4df4-ae26-4b541919205e"
msgid "\"Groetus calls me… I feel his pale glow upon my face…\""
msgstr "\"그로투스가 나를 부른다... 나는 얼굴에서 그의 시선을 느껴...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e19dc20b-cf30-4e5d-bee0-27e96cadea5e"
msgid ""
"\"I grow closer to my god than ever… A moment more, and I shall see his "
"image looking down upon the Boneyard!\""
msgstr "\"신과 어느 때보다도 더 가까워... 조금 더 있으면 뼈무덤 위의 그의 모습을 보겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6d32b930-604d-4cc2-aabc-33876373c58d"
msgid ""
"\"Your time hasn't come yet, Harrim — don't hurry towards your end! You "
"still have much to do here, among the living.\""
msgstr "\"아직은 아니야. 하림. 서두르지 마! 아직 할 일이 많아. 살아있어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "69a3a24e-5074-4b74-a389-aa1782d6abcd"
msgid "\"Your faith is strange, dwarf. Strange and confusing to me.\""
msgstr "\"네 신앙은 이상해. 이상한 드워프 녀석.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "eb997d12-97f2-44e8-be4b-bc49378a500c"
msgid "\"There now, let me help you this time. Groetus can wait.\""
msgstr "\"이번에는 내가 너를 돕지. 그로투스는 기다릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "98816765-7f84-4919-8cd8-8ed16b610ea3"
msgid ""
"\"So why don't you rush to meet your master? If you love him so much, then "
"what's stopping you?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 어서 주인을 만나지 그래? 그가 그렇게 좋으면 어서 가버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "65362914-3e01-430a-bb61-22def64d9cb9"
msgid "\"Starving to death is a fine sacrifice to Groetus…\""
msgstr "\"굶어 죽는 것도 그로투스에게 훌륭한 희생이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2c9a6549-388d-4b35-9730-a1cd39ddb6ed"
msgid ""
"\"Only by starving myself to death and rejecting this mortal flesh shall I "
"perceive the divine wisdom of my Lord…\""
msgstr "\"굶어 죽어 필멸자의 몸을 거부하는 것이 나의 신을 이해하는 유일한 방법이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "477cc1a9-7b67-426d-9a69-3f5ff2528dfa"
msgid ""
"\"Think again, sir dwarf! We're not in a desert — there's plenty of game "
"about, and a town not far away. No one's going to starve to death!\""
msgstr "\"생각해봐! 우리는 사막에 있는 게 아니라 멀지 않은 곳에 마을이 있어. 여기서 굶어죽을 수는 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bd53ddb2-f243-40a4-921b-8028e2906cd8"
msgid ""
"\"All this drama because we're running a bit low on rations… You know, "
"Harrim, if you had the slightest hint of talent, you might become a decent "
"tragedy poet. Or a professional mourner.\""
msgstr "\"다 식량이 부족해서 이런 일이 벌어지는 거야... 하림. 너 비극 시인이나 전문 조문객이 되면 딱이겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "684cffc9-b9d9-4fdc-a103-9f28e9e5b10a"
msgid ""
"\"I've always respected the religious beliefs of others, but it's still "
"disturbing to hear someone call upon death for no particular reason.\""
msgstr "\"다른 이들의 종교적인 믿음을 항상 존중했지만 아무 이유도 없이 죽으려는 녀석을 보자니 짜증이 나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "efc7a227-59a3-481e-99f2-56f6da33053d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, now even I will say you're overreacting. We'll chance across some "
"peddler and buy something to eat. Or one of us will go out to set some traps."
"\""
msgstr "\"너 과민 반응 하는 거야. 곧 행상인을 만나 먹을 것을 살 수 있을 거야. 아니면 가서 덫을 놓아 사냥하자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "55b160d5-f478-4229-b562-e04c8d2e0811"
msgid ""
"\"Fearsomeful words! Need to find food fast, before your terrible words "
"completely kill us all!\""
msgstr "\"정말 소름끼치는 말만 하는군! 빨리 음식을 구하지 않으면 저 녀석의 말 때문에 짜증나 죽겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "535fe0a9-9ad1-4439-bdd8-a481b872ad8a"
msgid "\"Oh Great Groetus, don't abandon me, your miserable servant…\""
msgstr "\"오. 그로투스시여. 나를 버리지 마소서. 저는 당신의 미천한 종입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "033c1ae6-972c-4fa4-8aef-fa501ea0ea2c"
msgid "\"Oh Harbinger of Last Days, heed my prayer…\""
msgstr "\"오. 최후의 날의 신이시여. 내 기도를 들어주십시오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a5bcdfe7-c474-4f4e-81ad-4153317aaf6d"
msgid ""
"\"What a lovely paradox: a deity whose only ambition is the end of all "
"existence, nevertheless grants his servant the power to create!\""
msgstr "\"종말의 여신이 신도에게 창조의 힘을 주다니. 이런 역설이 어디있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3b6bff90-8e9d-494e-b8b3-bff4268d1dfa"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim's prayers give me the creeps. The way they sound makes my skin "
"crawl! Brrrrr!\""
msgstr "\"하림의 기도 때문에 소름이 돋아. 팔에 닭살이 돋았다고! 으으!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c82be8c7-b3bd-4d20-857f-e7cbef48b4a2"
msgid ""
"\"I felt a cold chill. I wonder at the vast difference between our two "
"deities and their faiths..\""
msgstr "\"기분이 오싹해. 두 여신의 차이점이 무엇인지 궁금해졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f6cc55e4-4fa8-4b58-b8bb-7e72e8cbd83c"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't say what makes me more weary, his preaching or his prayers.\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석의 설교 때문인지 기도인지 모르겠는데 힘이 빠진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "69d1ee97-d138-4008-a9a1-81eb3e5b9a33"
msgid ""
"\"Don't despair. Your friends are with you. We won't leave you in trouble.\""
msgstr "\"절망하지 마. 친구들이 있으니. 설마 버리기야 하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "32fe4997-0c03-47c0-b64d-b6f16d3fedbb"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear that? Sounded like someone prowling about near the campsite. "
"But perhaps I'm just hearing things…\""
msgstr "\"들었어? 누군가 야영지를 어슬렁거리는 거 같아. 아마 그냥 지나가는 것일까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8de5841e-1731-4e13-9e5a-5f08b83648b2"
msgid ""
"\"I think I heard something over there. Listen! Can you hear it? No? Strange…"
"\""
msgstr "\"저기 뭔가 있는 것 같아. 들어 봐! 들려? 안들린다구? 이상하군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ac60be2e-b958-46b1-85ca-3cc3ca238f57"
msgid ""
"\"It's our fault we forewent the proper precautions and didn't conceal the "
"camp. If we really are in danger, you'd better prepare one of your spells.\""
msgstr "\"미리 경고하지 않고 야영지를 엄페하지 않은 우리 잘못이다. 우리가 위험에 처한다 치면 주문을 준비하는 편이 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2e6d84c0-717e-4552-86df-0abaf6c8f3f8"
msgid "[Pulls out his weapons and looks around sharply]"
msgstr "[무기를 꺼내 날을 확인합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b6a1b546-67dd-47a0-92d0-ec72da413e53"
msgid ""
"\"If this is a false alarm, I'll give you a good punch! I'm telling you!\""
msgstr "\"거짓 경보라면 한대 맞을 줄 알아! 나 화났다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0ca6381f-900b-406c-a157-556148ca976c"
msgid ""
"\"You keep hearing and seeing things. When Torag cursed you, is it possible "
"that he accidentally hit you on the head with his hammer?\""
msgstr "\"계속 경계해. 토락이 너를 저주할 때 그가 망치로 네 머리를 후려칠지 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f5a49e92-37ec-431e-aea8-ac7d694e05c8"
msgid ""
"\"One evening without fresh meat, and everyone becomes desperate. Your grip "
"upon life is so easily loosened!\""
msgstr "\"고기 없는 저녁을 보내니 모두 지쳤어. 의욕이 떨어진다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "50a012bf-c783-437b-88cf-af658e3acee2"
msgid ""
"\"Judging by the wry faces around me, no one went hunting today. Well, "
"perhaps at least this will help you see how frail our existence is...\""
msgstr "\"시무룩한 얼굴들을 보아하니 아무도 사냥을 가지 않을 것 같군. 먹지 못하면 약해지는 우리 모습이 참...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1981d3d2-5da9-41c9-ab2e-9c68477a8cea"
msgid "\"It's only food. Find another reason to moan.\""
msgstr "\"음식이 부족할 뿐이야. 울려면 다른 이유를 만들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "94b8e75d-e428-4f86-ade9-04be1cba73e2"
msgid ""
"\"Eat quietly! Can't spit around here without hitting a fanatic. Can't I eat "
"without a sermon?!\""
msgstr "\"조용히 먹기나 해! 미친놈처럼 파편 튀지 말고. 나도 조용히 먹어 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3a8b94f2-2bf7-472b-bf0e-77b08d3157d1"
msgid ""
"\"Some day death will find us all. But so what? Life's cruelty is neither a "
"divine revelation nor cause to lament.\""
msgstr "\"언젠가는 죽음이 우리 모두를 찾을 거야. 그래서 뭐 어쩌라고? 삶이 잔인한 건 신의 탓도 슬프서도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "046c843c-e82e-41d8-a951-d152d4fba1e1"
msgid ""
"\"I'd fight a giant over a piece of meat right now — and I wouldn't turn "
"away from a stale piece of bread either. Slavery will do that to you, ha, "
"ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"고기 한점 먹을 수 있다면 거인과도 싸우겠어. 쉰 빵도 지금은 먹겠어. 노예로 살다 보면 이것도 익숙해져. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a64428b1-3883-4001-9637-fe4757fbe1cc"
msgid ""
"\"Does anyone wish to learn how to extract information from the dead? This "
"is your last chance to get to know your companions better...\""
msgstr "\"죽은 사람으로부터 정보를 추출하는 법을 배우고 싶은 사람? 동료를 이해할 수 있는 좋은 기회야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0ee54db6-7475-48b0-a08f-11d141c024eb"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I could... resurrect... your dead friends. So you wouldn't have "
"to carry anyone...\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 너도 알다시피... 나는 너의 죽은 친구들을 부활시킬 수있어. 그러면 시체를 안옮겨도 되고 편하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ff3e62f3-bc73-4313-bc89-72c27775069e"
msgid "\"Don't. Even. Think. About it.\""
msgstr "\"생각. 조차. 하지. 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "68385fc4-73cd-48a2-8fc2-4a5b21b81da8"
msgid ""
"\"To prolong life's emptiness, and breathe a semblance of life into the "
"corpse of one who has finally found peace... This shows a lack of wisdom.\""
msgstr "\"공허한 삶을 연장시키며 마침내 평온을 찾은 망자에게 숨을 불어넣는다... 정말 무식하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "dde45b18-6861-4272-be2d-d889a63bcdb7"
msgid ""
"\"I warn you, Jaethal. I will not allow such blasphemy — even if I must use "
"force to prevent it.\""
msgstr "\"경고하지. 제이탈. 그런 짓은 용납하지 않겠다. 무력을 써서라도 막을 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1a881a5f-de99-4233-8df4-ae0a23f4258d"
msgid ""
"\"If I go down and she messes with my corpse, someone better knock her one "
"in the jaw!\""
msgstr "\"내가 죽고 그녀가 나를 가지고 장난친다면 저 년을 뭉게주길 바라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ad605480-1003-4881-b838-0810466c714c"
msgid "\"I don't need your compassion.\""
msgstr "\"네 연민은 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9dde81d3-9779-4162-b1f4-34d6d275fd74"
msgid ""
"\"Don't deceive yourself. I shall live longer than all of you combined.\""
msgstr "\"자신을 속이지 마라. 나는 너보다 더 오래 살 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "af5b68c2-2024-41ae-9ce3-37592965f2db"
msgid ""
"\"I regret that I cannot help you... and I don't mean just your bodily "
"wounds.\""
msgstr "\"너를 도울 수 없어 후회되는군... 네 몸 말고 네 정신 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "515e38de-3047-4d5f-b675-5d80ee05a52f"
msgid "\"Hm.\""
msgstr "\"흠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8ddc94cc-2227-416f-b864-f858f59280f9"
msgid ""
"\"No one is questioning your strength. Why do you always behave as if "
"someone's trying to offend you?\""
msgstr "\"아무도 네 힘에 의문을 제기하지 않아. 왜 항상 그렇게 공격적으로 행동해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b0f16f18-4280-4e93-95f4-fedab5e65240"
msgid ""
"\"You've a sharp wit. You better rest a bit though, or we'll be piecing you "
"together tomorrow, ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"너는 똑똑해. 그러니 쉬는 게 낫다는 거 알지. 아니면 너를 내일 꿰어버릴 테야. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "861adb55-5ef2-4842-9acb-4bcda8de67e1"
msgid ""
"\"Admit it, you're only saying that because you miss pain as much as "
"pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"인정하라고. 고통의 즐거움이 그리웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c8ac6823-9826-4fa0-bfa6-9633f6a7daf3"
msgid "\"Why does everyone look even more miserable than usual?\""
msgstr "\"왜 모두 평소보다 더 우울해보이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "53e54c84-e452-44cd-968f-d3d122cf8bd8"
msgid ""
"\"You're quiet today. In case you're wondering, that wasn't a complaint.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 꽤 조용하네. 오해하지마. 불평은 아니고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "91dc3071-89d2-4293-a379-f889d09b841c"
msgid "\"It is so cold, so damp... Why did we decide to camp here?\""
msgstr "\"너무 차갑고 습기가 많아... 왜 여기에 야영을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "41db1fac-8006-4b07-97b6-4fb9fd4da921"
msgid ""
"\"It smells like a troll's armpit here. What the hell is that — did {name} "
"take off {mf|his|her} boots, or is there a rotting corpse nearby...\""
msgstr "\"트롤의 암내가 난다. 도대체 {name}의 발에서 나는 냄새는 뭐야? 아니면 시체라도 썩는 건가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "30f0aa3b-0f51-476c-ab76-a7b7be9c1481"
msgid ""
"\"Don't gloat. You know full well how such an environment affects the "
"party's morale.\""
msgstr "\"하지 마. 열악한 환경은 일행의 사기에 영향을 미친다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "dc812441-6340-460a-8ac2-ab3c6c3a2d23"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm? You think so? I thought our companions were enjoying the spirit of "
"this place...\""
msgstr "\"응? 그렇게 생각해? 나는 동료들이 여기를 즐기고 있다고 생각했는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "02597e69-3cb1-4d03-a472-89331716fb52"
msgid "\"What are you looking at?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 보고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fac6da00-3f43-4b5e-b477-09247f62887a"
msgid "\"Got nothing else to look at?\""
msgstr "\"볼만한 게 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b211d5e1-8a17-49b6-b4b4-3b28ecd692de"
msgid ""
"\"I saw what a terrible blow you suffered in that fight. Are you sure you're "
"all right?\""
msgstr "\"그 싸움에서 심각한 타격을 입었던데. 정말 괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1aa511fa-0da6-414d-9066-91a413eba412"
msgid ""
"\"It's not often that one gets to see a walking corpse so close... And one "
"that's barely standing, at that. You should heal yourself, or whatever you "
"call it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"걸어다니는 시체를 볼 기회는 쉽지 않아... 거의 쓰러질랑 말랑하거든. 치료를 하던가 아니면 네가 치료라 부르는 걸 하던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "77fb23f1-409c-4258-82a3-50d95751960a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, Jaethal. You were... gravely wounded today. Several times. They "
"knocked the living daylights out of you! Ah, ha, ha, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 오늘 상처를 많이 입었던데. 오늘 죽도록 맞지 않았어? 이미 죽었지만. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2700040f-38f7-42ef-809c-9c7e9ec60bf5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, but your wounds... They still haven't healed. It's a horrible "
"sight, but I can't look away.\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 네 상처... 아직 치유되지 않았어. 끔찍하지만 한번 봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e07b8c28-3064-48fc-9196-0f04db7ff8e5"
msgid "\"I wait when you become deadmeat. Dead deadmeat. Soon.\""
msgstr "\"네가 고깃덩어리가 될 때까지 기다린다. 썩은 고깃덩어리가 되겠군. 곧.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "22e2fc89-bb6b-489a-945b-c59423f77273"
msgid ""
"\"It's true, I don't need food to survive. But I hope I've made myself "
"clear. I'll not be changing my habits for your sake.\""
msgstr "\"사실 나는 생존을 위한 음식이 필요 없다. 하지만 분명히 해두지. 내 식습관은 바꾸지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "604d1b48-28ce-437a-bb9d-1505b71923a0"
msgid ""
"\"It's amusing to be the last sober guest at a feast. It's even better to be "
"the only one in the party who isn't afraid of starving to death!\""
msgstr "\"잔치에 마지막까지 먹는 손님이 되는 건 즐겁지. 굶어죽지 않는 일행의 일원이 되는 건 더 좋고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a6bb05ec-eff9-4c26-9a18-170234cae7a7"
msgid ""
"\"If it were up to me, you wouldn't set foot on this land. But the word of "
"the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} is law.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 내게 달렸다면 너는 여기에 오지 못했겠지. 하지만 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 말이 법이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "39c748a2-9882-40c4-b5ec-105bd8803ddf"
msgid "[Sighs gravely, shaking his head]"
msgstr "[머리를 가로저으며 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b7200ff1-f1f6-4f2e-8430-207dfff21024"
msgid ""
"\"I realize we don't have to be friends to travel together, but can't we at "
"least be cordial?\""
msgstr "\"여행 동무가 필요 없다는 걸 알았지만 그래도 친근하면 좋을텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c80970a5-04a0-4542-ba6e-98ed1e206ca3"
msgid "\"Don't worry, we don't need your charity.\""
msgstr "\"걱정 마. 네 도움 따위는 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "88afff9c-4c1d-4b68-a0ae-656e2deac727"
msgid ""
"\"Very dignified. Only animals eat to be full. For people, food is always a "
"ritual.\""
msgstr "\"동물만이 배부르기 위하여 먹지. 인간에게 음식은 하나의 의식이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ba09d197-18e2-4552-97fa-b7169d3b30b5"
msgid ""
"\"Bless us, oh goddess. Give us wings, and your blight shall soar. Give us "
"power, and all shall fulfill your will...\""
msgstr "\"신이시여. 우리를 축복하소서. 우리에게 날개를 주어 당신의 병이 퍼지게 하소서. 우리에게 힘을 주시어 당신의 의지가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2ac6d3bd-93c1-4e6d-9834-b9a36d65b2cf"
msgid ""
"\"I eat and drink to the glory of Lady Despair. I take from life, to give to "
"death. I take from the poor, to feed the sated...\""
msgstr "\"나는 절망의 여신을 위해 먹고 마시지. 생명을 착취해서 죽음에게 바치는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "73136bc8-8717-4771-90b4-72cd8e49e4b6"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh... By the gods... Ahem, friends, I'm not hungry at all today! Who "
"wants my share?\""
msgstr "\"아... 맙소사. 이봐. 나는 배고프지 않아. 내가 좀 나눠줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9220f200-823e-4c2a-acd0-1f946fec561a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh. And I thought that after that giant centipede dissection nothing would "
"ever ruin my appetite again...\""
msgstr "\"네 지네 해부가 내 입맛을 빼앗지 않기를 바랬는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "48a15f93-2f0e-4271-b9f6-ad7dea9f9500"
msgid "\"What a... peculiar... ritual.\""
msgstr "\"정말... 이상한 의식이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e4883763-3ad8-4276-ba01-08dd500a02bf"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it's bad luck to keep company with the dead. And having one of those "
"in a party...\""
msgstr "\"시체와 동료를 하는 건 정말 불행한 일이야. 일행에 이런 녀석이 있다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fa2c988a-1388-46f3-a3e5-3f1b4b7786f8"
msgid "\"Chomp chomp chomp... What? She-dead wasn't eating hers anyway!\""
msgstr "\"우걱 우걱 우걱... 왜? 그녀는 자기 것은 먹지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "59803d53-b327-4fa0-a40b-d776a31d4cc0"
msgid "\"If my own servants were so careless in setting camp...\""
msgstr "\"내 종들이 야영지를 대충 설치했다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "760e8274-2077-4b61-9147-801be3cccb7b"
msgid "\"You can't even conceal a camp. What good are you at all, then?\""
msgstr "\"너는 야영지 엄폐도 못하면서. 잘하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e363a9a5-7ad4-4ff5-bbc2-945a0520190d"
msgid "\"She deliberately taunts you. Pay her no heed.\""
msgstr "\"네가 화를 내게 놀리는 거야. 관심 주지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c1c11a97-12f7-48f9-8d24-9c6547fbae1f"
msgid ""
"\"When this is over, I'll twist your head off. If I can wait that long.\""
msgstr "\"이 일이 끝나면 네 모가지를 비틀어버릴 거야. 그 때까지 기다리기도 힘들군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f5b46e6e-496b-4554-ac93-465b500339ae"
msgid ""
"\"There are no servants and no masters here, damn it all! If you want "
"something, you can do it yourself.\""
msgstr "\"하인도없고 주인도 없어. 제기랄! 원하는 게 있다면 직접 하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "476ab781-2493-47c5-a69a-d3afe9fed96c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, one day I will just walk up to that arrogant, snobbish waif and give "
"her SUCH a slap upside her head...\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 저 거만한 녀석에게 걸어가서 얼굴에 싸대기 한방을 갈굴 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "94b48b60-2246-4d48-9c00-cd9f76122815"
msgid "\"Do you still dream of the days when you had servants?\""
msgstr "\"노예 갖는 꿈을 아직도 갖고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7368db89-3000-49d4-8ccc-ee2187338ee5"
msgid ""
"\"Another rest without fresh meat! {name}, isn't it time you send some of "
"your people hunting?\""
msgstr "\"고기 없는 휴식이라니! {name}. 사람을 보내 사냥을 시키는 게 좋지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e48e34dd-f1d6-45b0-a097-e669babaa7f2"
msgid "\"Why are you sitting there? Your meat isn't going to hunt itself!\""
msgstr "\"왜 거기에 앉아 있어? 고기가 갑자기 튀어나오지는 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a0b67ea7-a38d-4b4a-acda-8c0678d3cc0e"
msgid "\"Watch your tone. I shan't tolerate such ill manners.\""
msgstr "\"말 조심해. 그런 태도 용납할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9060cdf8-e9ae-4fc6-a7c9-17005eac501d"
msgid ""
"\"I would be happy to set snares, to feed my friends and companions — but I "
"shall not take orders from anyone.\""
msgstr "\"친구들을 먹여살리기 위해 올무를 쓴다면 괜찮지만 누구의 명령도 듣지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5d2bebcb-b297-4a55-91dd-6c3c5e9b5a8b"
msgid ""
"\"I don't approve of Jaethal's tone, but without meat I'll be out of shape, "
"lose my focus — and then only the gods know which of us will survive the "
"next battle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제이탈의 말투가 마음에 들지는 않지만 고기가 없으면 나는 기운이 없어. 다음 전투에서 살아남을지도 모르는 판에 이건 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b155ce77-d0da-440a-b5f6-420b1c18a500"
msgid ""
"\"You often complain when you're sent out to hunt. And you always complain "
"if no one else goes.\""
msgstr "\"사냥 가라고 할 때 너 가끔 불평하더라. 아무도 가지 않아도 불평하고 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e39aeb22-5406-4161-a52b-35022a066dff"
msgid ""
"\"If you were better at protecting each other's backs, then you-know-who "
"would still be alive.\""
msgstr "\"서로의 등을 맡기면 정말 좋을 텐데. 어느 녀석이 살아남을지는 뻔하지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4337f6ee-e2f6-4bf0-8004-ab4d25b4ec51"
msgid ""
"\"I know I did everything I could to save the member of our company. But "
"what did you do, hunh?\""
msgstr "\"우리 동료들을 구하기 위해 최선을 다했어. 그런데 너는 무슨 짓이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9407147e-c546-4973-8960-1f258c048e7c"
msgid ""
"\"How can such a feeble body contain so much scorn? Please, Jubilost... "
"let's not get into this. Not now.\""
msgstr "\"연약한 몸에서 어떻게 그런 생각을 할 수 있어? 주빌로스트... 들어가지 말자. 지금은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "42b6e7ef-79a5-4030-83fb-743b6ccd61bf"
msgid ""
"\"Have you no respect for the fallen?! Do everyone a favor — keep your mouth "
"shut and let us mourn.\""
msgstr "\"쓰러진 녀석들에게 존경심도 없어?! 입이나 닥치고 우리가 애도하도록 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e00a38f8-bd5f-4e53-8d67-cdb831a4fbe7"
msgid ""
"\"I don't deny my part in this. But please, next time think before saying "
"things like that. Everyone feels sad and bitter enough already.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 내 역할을 부정하지는 않겠어. 하지만 다음에 이런 말을 하지 않았으면 해. 모두 슬퍼하고 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bf0c4785-b522-457b-84ed-b5f5b8ffb33c"
msgid "\"Shush, or I'll send you to join them.\""
msgstr "\"저리 가. 아니면 너를 저 쪽으로 보내버린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "dddd1cf3-9ad2-43c7-a15c-19be401dcdf3"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe things would have turned out differently if you spent as much effort "
"helping your friends as you do finding fault with them.\""
msgstr "\"그들의 잘못을 찾으며 친구들을 도와주려고 한다면 상황이 다를 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "13cfb650-6b66-40c8-bc8a-e7c85a6ff701"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe things would have turned out differently if you spent as much effort "
"helping your friends as you do finding fault with them.\""
msgstr "\"그들의 잘못을 찾으며 친구들을 도와주려고 한다면 상황이 다를 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8af7df15-128c-46df-aa32-f41be1ee80bd"
msgid "\"Oh… It's been a long time since I felt this rotten…\""
msgstr "\"기분이 잡치는 기분은 정말 오랜만이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e2e058d7-4767-402b-96b0-c8ec4229ab67"
msgid "\"I need to go lie down. Or better, see the healer.\""
msgstr "\"누워있어야겠어. 아니면 치료사에게 진료를 받던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e97ccc4c-f13e-4f61-8add-f3a81a7957e3"
msgid "\"Go to sleep. Tomorrow you'll have strength enough to find help.\""
msgstr "\"가서 좀 자. 내일 도움을 얻으려면 힘을 비축해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d2ebf5ba-4a67-4491-bc7a-a515d360ffb3"
msgid ""
"\"If I were in our enemies' shoes, I'd hit you with the nastiest stuff I "
"have. Oh, who am I kidding — I'm thinking of hitting you with something "
"nasty right now…\""
msgstr "\"내가 적이라면 머리통을 후려갈겼을 거야. 사실 지금 네 머리통을 후려갈기고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "88b985f7-bc09-41c6-a8e9-f5056c6748b0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid I cannot help you just now. But we'll certainly figure "
"something out tomorrow.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 너를 도울 수 없어. 하지만 내일 방법을 찾을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e9bee267-3002-40f2-81c9-ede7daef08cc"
msgid ""
"\"When the veil of life is lifted, and in an instant the endless darkness "
"reveals itself — then all arrogance crumbles to dust.\""
msgstr "\"삶을 감싼 베일이 풀리자 끝 없는 어둠이 드러났어. 모든 오만함은 헛될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "beab55ab-75cf-4e50-8fd2-31b3478bf77e"
msgid "\"Oh. Jub-Jub doesn't vomit extra words. Jub-Jub must be almost done!\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 그만 좀 지껄여. 지겹지도 않냐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f0eb3d9f-6069-4309-8ba6-abfadd0e0603"
msgid ""
"\"I must sleep. And don't you dare wake me up — even if my clothes suddenly "
"catch fire.\""
msgstr "\"좀 자야겠다. 나 깨울 생각하지 말라고. 불이 나도 나는 상관 안할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "94883c8d-1a0d-4ba8-a7a0-35c764f912dc"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose I shall bid you goodnight, and depart your enlightened company. "
"I need some sleep.\""
msgstr "\"잘 잘거라고 믿어. 네 똑똑한 동료를 보내야겠어. 나는 자야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "52208ba9-1838-486e-a232-3d3b2d47191e"
msgid ""
"\"This will not do, sir gnome: you may need to stay on guard. Just don't "
"sleep too soundly.\""
msgstr "\"노움 나으리. 그렇지는 않을 것입니다요. 잘 때도 방심하면 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "545ec996-1f29-44a2-94a4-2b15b43b37b3"
msgid ""
"\"I remember last time. You snored so loudly no one but you could sleep at "
"all.\""
msgstr "\"지난 번의 일이 기억나. 네가 코를 너무 크게 골아서 모두 잠이 달아났다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "aff0feec-0b9d-4ded-97e4-c0bea21b9436"
msgid ""
"\"Great! But while the buffoon is away, who will sit here with a smug face "
"and order people around? I'll do it if you like!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 솔직히 누가 여기 앉아서 이래라 저래라하겠어? 바로 내가 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9052e7c8-f7e8-44c7-80ff-19d8eaa430a4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I better get to sleep before he does! How is it that some gnomes snore "
"louder than orcs?!\""
msgstr "\"오. 나 먼저 잘래! 오크보다 코를 크게 고는 노움이 어디있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6962acb4-9c80-4d86-80c6-0d406dc406d6"
msgid "\"Peace. At last.\""
msgstr "\"마침내 평화가 왔군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f7fa9288-2bb8-405f-8b2a-188ea04fc906"
msgid ""
"\"A brook doesn't tire of babbling, and Jubilost doesn't tire of lecturing!\""
msgstr "\"저 녀석은 나불대느라 정신이 없고 주빌로스트는 꼰대 노릇하느라 바쁘구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f4c74a37-eb34-4aaf-a3b8-ff28502efe9f"
msgid ""
"\"A brook doesn't tire of babbling, and Jubilost doesn't tire of lecturing!\""
msgstr "\"저 녀석은 나불대느라 정신이 없고 주빌로스트는 꼰대 노릇하느라 바쁘구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "968829d8-1b1b-4b77-9343-ccf31219e4c2"
msgid "\"Couldn't we find a better place to rest?\""
msgstr "\"휴식을 할만한 더 좋은 곳은 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "da4a1055-a47d-4a05-b4ad-6cd223504a18"
msgid ""
"\"Apparently, trying to get ourselves killed by monsters and bandits is no "
"longer exciting enough. Now we're spending our nights in their lairs!\""
msgstr "\"도적이나 괴물에게 죽는 건 재미 없다고. 도적 소굴에서 자는 것은 더더욱.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b4ddee3a-f36d-4d68-afcf-c7e6775ce695"
msgid ""
"\"Just try not to think about it. Tell us about your adventures instead!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 무시해. 네 모험담이나 들려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d848c810-0610-4a4c-b50d-cf0775f0e9dc"
msgid ""
"\"Couldn't you keep your mouth shut just once? Stop your complaining and "
"pretend you have some shred of dignity.\""
msgstr "\"제발 잠시라도 입을 다물 수는 없어? 그만 불평하고 얌전히 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "448b730c-b260-4a53-843b-b118d59cddc0"
msgid "\"This crappy place fits you better than anything else, gnome.\""
msgstr "\"이 으스스한 곳은 네게 가장 어울린다. 노움 녀석아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "822c5a72-1975-4651-b1e2-069531bcf877"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't get enough walking today already? Ready to gather your things, move "
"the tents and make a fire someplace more to your liking? Go ahead then! Be "
"my guest!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 많이 걷지 않았어? 어서 부지런히 텐트를 옮기고 야영지를 준비하자고. 서둘러!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7eec61bf-c53f-493c-8515-d28efd172663"
msgid ""
"\"Seems that today Pharasma was hoping I'd drop by for a cup of tea… I do so "
"hate to disappoint women.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 파라즈마가 차 한잔 하기를 바라나 보군... 기대에 부응해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "eabf2559-67bf-4b55-a500-250f9b89ba69"
msgid ""
"\"I remember one other time I barely escaped death. It happened somewhere in "
"Varisia, as I recall. Seems destiny is out of new tricks, so she starts "
"repeating her old favorites.\""
msgstr "\"죽을 뻔한 날들이 기억나. 바리시아에서였지. 새로운 장난이 바닥나서 그녀는 계속해서 같은 것만 반복했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bae4131e-23ed-4634-adb9-d5d60565f43a"
msgid ""
"\"Hahaha! That's the right way to talk about death — jokes and scoffs!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 죽음에 관한 얘기는 농담으로 흘려버리라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ec6e1d8b-9ddc-494d-9cc6-c8d54697def9"
msgid ""
"\"I bet Jubilost has been racking his brains for three nights straight, "
"trying to come up with that joke... And spent the next three waiting for an "
"opportunity to tell it.\""
msgstr "\"그런 농담을 주빌로스트가 3일 밤낮으로 얘기하기를 준비한 거 같아. 한 3일은 계속 얘기할걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8bd0ff6a-c194-4de5-9ecd-a0ba7b58518b"
msgid ""
"\"Today your witty lines encourage rather than hurt people's feelings. We "
"could use more of that!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 네 농담이 재밌는데. 유행어가 되겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "111f4fec-f089-412b-9cd2-e9b1685901ac"
msgid ""
"\"Putting on a brave face? Well, the same fate awaits both the cowardly and "
"the fearless... Although some meet their ends sooner than others.\""
msgstr "\"용감한 얼굴을 하고서? 겁쟁이에게도 같은 운명이 기다리고 있어... 그 녀석들은 자기의 끝을 보기 쉽지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4448bca2-2444-4f27-86af-ea48579e6229"
msgid ""
"\"I know some of us would benefit from losing some weight, but I'm not about "
"to starve with the rest!\""
msgstr "\"누구는 살을 빼서 좋겠지만 나는 굶기 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "031f6c50-52cc-424c-a7d9-9a47096f24c6"
msgid ""
"\"Who is responsible for our rations? The poor dimwit should learn to count! "
"We're running out of food again!\""
msgstr "\"식량 담당이 누구야? 멍청한 녀석이 식량을 잘 비축해뒀어야지! 또 음식이 바닥났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c5724ede-cd85-4829-88ef-f4443deb0d9b"
msgid "\"You pay too much attention to mundane things.\""
msgstr "\"사소한 것에 정신 팔지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7e4332dd-db78-4af9-a498-867d81df8324"
msgid ""
"\"Make a snare. Put it over there — look, where I'm pointing. And wait. "
"Perhaps lunch will visit us soon.\""
msgstr "\"올가미를 만들어. 그리고 저기에 놓으라고. 기다리면 점심 식사가 올 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ec4e080e-58a6-40d6-bcd1-092c52dc0b68"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps if someone didn't gorge himself at every stop… On second thought, "
"no — please, keep stuffing your face as always. Otherwise we might not be "
"able to shut you up at all!\""
msgstr "\"아마 누가 많이 못먹었나보군... 제발 좀 조용히 해. 입을 다물게 할 수도 없고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "770a5717-c2a4-421c-ba1c-1dd94307b6d0"
msgid ""
"\"'We're running out of food!', 'I am so tired! I need to go to bed!', 'Oh, "
"there's a plague going around, I'm so afraid! I might get sick!' — The "
"living do nothing but whine.\""
msgstr "\"식량이 바닥났어! 피곤해! 자야겠어! 여기 위생이 끔찍해! 나 배가 아파!...라니. 살아있는 것들은 징징대기만 하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "74815561-cbbf-441f-b464-69c6a6da74ea"
msgid ""
"\"How so, master Jubilost?! Doesn't the great discoverer have a resourceful "
"plan for such eventualities?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 주빌로스트 선생? 이 상황에 대한 놀라운 계획이라도 있으실까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "708e5d19-e9b9-479c-8ed5-ee16d003d7ec"
msgid ""
"\"How so, master Jubilost?! Doesn't the great discoverer have a resourceful "
"plan for such eventualities?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 주빌로스트 선생? 이 상황에 대한 놀라운 계획이라도 있으실까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2ed6197e-b425-4860-a26d-65cd69c35c4c"
msgid ""
"\"I've used nearly all my spells. It seems that when we fight, you all just "
"hide behind me and watch while I do everything!\""
msgstr "\"나는 거의 모든 주문을 사용했어. 싸울 때 너는 내 뒤에 서서 아무것도 안했잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "fd63caa7-dac8-4200-a30a-90dccd41cbf8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm almost out of spells… Sometimes I feel I'm the only one who does "
"anything useful during our battles!\""
msgstr "\"나는 거의 모든 주문을 사용했어. 전투에서 싸운 사람은 나밖에 없었다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b67803b6-6d8e-4cd6-9dd3-2115d8a3ddaf"
msgid ""
"\"Am I wrong, or is Sir Jubilost truly accusing us of cowardice? Why don't "
"you speak your mind plainly — and afterwards defend your words in a proper "
"duel?\""
msgstr "\"우리를 겁쟁이로 모는 거야. 주빌로스트? 솔직히 말하지 그래? 그리고 결투로 결단을 내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b0f27ffa-f147-4ebe-83ec-51270c11908e"
msgid ""
"\"So much pride, so much empty boasting! It's sad that such a talented gnome "
"as yourself would waste his breath on such petty ranting!\""
msgstr "\"자존심이 너무 세고 허풍도 심한 녀석! 그렇게 잘난 녀석이 불평으로 힘이나 빼고 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "dfad45e3-74af-4887-9139-25a4ff9d2305"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Everyone — in the next battle we should just sit on the grass and "
"watch this gnome deal with the enemies on his own. — And he'd better not yap "
"a single word about needing our help!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 다음 전투에서 풀밭에 앉아 노움 녀석이 싸우는 거나 봐야겠어. 어디 도움이 필요 없나 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "596ca372-d298-40eb-b22b-a633b439190f"
msgid "\"An empty vessel makes louder sounds than a full barrel.\""
msgstr "\"빈 수레가 요란하다더니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8db053f5-0dc8-4037-b30e-0822acf84ac8"
msgid ""
"\"I see our travels have taught us nothing at all. Failing to conceal your "
"camp is a novice's error.\""
msgstr "\"여행을 하면서 아무것도 배우지 못하다니. 야영지를 숨기는 것도 못하는 건 초보자의 실수야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e9ea4c5b-a245-4352-a15c-6cb07dbc76cd"
msgid ""
"\"Tonight we'll drown if even the slightest rain picks up. — That's if a "
"light breeze doesn't blow our tents away first.\""
msgstr "\"비라도 내리면 잠겨버리겠군. 바람에 불려 텐트가 날아가지나 않으면 다행이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5820b079-9d85-48d1-8700-5787c056a145"
msgid ""
"\"Quit your whining! You was the first who planted your sorry ass by the "
"fire, so shut your mouth closed!\""
msgstr "\"그만 징징거려! 불가에 엉덩이 들이밀어 앉은 녀석이 누군데. 입 닥쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "249a5dc0-bb3c-428f-a67c-4e98788b3974"
msgid ""
"\"I think it's best I stay put and don't touch anything. Unless you wish to "
"see me accidentally bring down every single tent.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 머물러 아무것도 하지 않는 게 상책이야. 내가 텐트를 모두 쓰러뜨리는 모습을 보고 싶지는 않겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "459e2c05-f1d8-4cde-9461-6e8ec890dbd4"
msgid ""
"\"It's too late for regret now. We should have concealed the camp while we "
"were setting up.\""
msgstr "\"후회하기에는 너무 늦었어. 짓기 전에 야영지를 엄페했어야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a20440d9-f54f-40f0-8619-25063aaddb70"
msgid ""
"\"Why, look at that! Our Lord Alchemist here is scared of monsters! "
"Unprepared to meet a wyvern face to face, ha, ha? Have no fear, we'll "
"protect you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아이고. 우리 연금술사 나으리께서 괴물을 무서워하시네? 와이번을 보면 질질 싸겠어? 하하! 걱정마. 우리가 지켜줄 테니깐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "85187b8b-c872-4e8c-bc40-4ae2537f78a5"
msgid ""
"\"Since none of you is going hunting, let's buy some decent rations next "
"time. I've grown sick of this muck!\""
msgstr "\"아무도 사냥을 가지 않으니까 다음에는 식량을 충분히 사두자. 이제는 질린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0daa85cb-356c-44b8-b6ff-a756e24ad897"
msgid ""
"\"So, instead of fresh game we'll have dry rations for lunch again? If "
"you're all too lazy to fetch us some decent meat, at least you could follow "
"the example of the dwarves. They add sausage and dried meat to every ration!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"신선한 사냥감 대신에 이제는 점심에 마른 식량을 먹게 생겼네? 사냥을 보내지 않을 거라면 드워프를 본받아 봐. 식량에 소시지며 말린 "
"고기며 넣어두잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5022b9b1-3f5d-4258-a5d3-068bb0e34883"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing better than a fresh meal cooked by an experienced chef.\""
msgstr "\"경험 많은 요리사가 만든 신선한 식사보다 더 좋은 것은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "055358e2-daa7-4a5d-a8d1-a866a4d19bc6"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, poor little Jubie! His mean companions won't feed him! No one "
"understands how exceptional he is! If only he could, oh, I don't know, lift "
"up his saggy butt and go hunting for himself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 불쌍한 주빌로스트! 동료들이 밥을 안줬어요? 우리 주빌로스트가 입맛이 얼마나 까다로운데! 키가 조금만 더 컸으면 가서 직접 "
"사냥할 텐데 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4cb6f784-a520-4e55-8d9b-003d0422730e"
msgid ""
"\"Right! Wow, did you really just say something useful? Something that don't "
"make people want to punch you in the nose! That's new!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 말은 제대로 하네? 사람들이 네 얼굴에 주먹질하지 않게 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e4e78f5c-dee1-4f6e-815b-abf89f1fea11"
msgid ""
"\"Field rations sap all my inspiration. You want real poetry? Then give me "
"real food!\""
msgstr "\"저질 음식으로는 영감을 발휘할 수 없어. 진짜 시를 원해? 그러면 진짜 음식을 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f5e33f06-244e-4be3-a334-d2c90e44346b"
msgid ""
"\"It hurts to lose friends... And it hurts even more when it's not the first "
"time.\""
msgstr "\"친구를 잃는다는 건 슬픈 일이야... 언제나 슬픈 일이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "548c1c11-dfe4-454f-9d8d-59255dfb122f"
msgid ""
"\"I was almost about to cry already, and now thanks to you I'm definitely "
"going to!\""
msgstr "\"거의 울 뻔했지만 지금은 나를 보내주어 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0bf235f5-914e-4b2f-99aa-212d61b8dc1f"
msgid ""
"\"I don't feel well... I'll have some water – it might make me feel better.\""
msgstr "\"기분이 좋지 않아... 물 좀 마셔야지. 기분이 좀 괜찮아지겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "df6dd8cd-9be6-4d36-9550-59afdb742c5b"
msgid ""
"\"Contact with the elements is good for you, but I don't know... I don't "
"know. You might need help from someone more competent.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 좋은 원소와 만나... 모르겠어. 너에게는 더 편한 사람이 필요할지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "aa27a377-0d2f-4ba7-9264-5c11bf7d8fb8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so tired... I hope this is a calm night, and the darkness will hide us "
"from any enemies.\""
msgstr "\"피곤해... 오늘 저녁은 아무 일도 없었으면 좋겠군. 어둠 속에 있으면 괜찮을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "25856ecc-c7ba-431b-aead-012355d8c44a"
msgid ""
"\"I can try to mix up some medicine, but I think what you really need is "
"rest.\""
msgstr "\"약을 좀 배합해 볼게. 하지만 너는 휴식이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1f571386-bab0-4313-a81d-4354236c5bec"
msgid ""
"\"It's not safe here. Who knows what's hiding in these dark depths? But at "
"least it promises to be interesting!\""
msgstr "\"여기는 안전하지 않아. 이 어둠 속에 뭐가 있을지 누가 알아? 뭐 그래도 재미는 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8735d38f-a0ee-4629-a86a-0ecc2fe83fd8"
msgid "\"Today was hard... But I'm alive – and that means hope still lives.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 어렵군... 하지만 살아남았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b1c52064-9dab-4529-8607-af4b9e6870a2"
msgid ""
"\"I could heal you, but you keep shunning me and looking at me sideways.\""
msgstr "\"너를 치유할 수는 있지만 아직도 나를 그렇게 무시하기야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2c97f2b0-48d9-40d0-955b-3c68a1a74865"
msgid ""
"\"Poor thing! How can I help? I could sit beside you and sigh "
"compassionately.\""
msgstr "\"아이고 불쌍해라! 어떻게 도와줄까? 네 옆에 앉아 같이 한탄해줄 수는 있는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4a9c43bb-ffa5-4925-b95f-f9a5b4421754"
msgid ""
"\"We are running out of supplies... But no problem. In this land of bursting "
"rivers and lush greenery, we'll have no trouble finding food!\""
msgstr "\"식량이 부족해... 하지만 걱정마. 여기는 강도 있고 수풀지대이니 음식을 찾는 데 어려움은 없을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9aa04992-ad01-404c-97c1-c9801ebc3d28"
msgid "\"You're always so delighted with every green bush! It's so sweet!\""
msgstr "\"덤불만 보면 그렇게 좋아? 정말 귀엽다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bf8815e5-810c-4867-91ac-6667519033f0"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, the variety of edible life forms is usually found near life forms "
"ready to eat us...\""
msgstr "\"때때로 먹을 만한 것 주위에 우리의 천적이 있기 마련이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "736c7e80-988b-4f85-84c5-04bb647f7d32"
msgid ""
"\"These spells have a mind of their own... My inherent elemental powers are "
"another thing. – They will never leave me!\""
msgstr "\"이 주문은 그들의 정신이 깃들었어. 내가 가진 원소 능력과는 다른 종류야. 내가 이걸 못쓰게 될 일은 없을 걸!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7822c178-2964-41f9-a32c-336808ab1f92"
msgid ""
"\"Don't rely on false hope. Nothing in this world lasts forever, even things "
"you think are rock-solid.\""
msgstr "\"헛된 희망을 가지지 마. 이 세상에 영원한 것은 없어. 네가 굳게 믿던 것도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "90e33eed-56be-4e9e-b7f0-a5bd247b0e96"
msgid ""
"\"We're out here like a piece of bread, cast aside by a careless traveler — "
"with a flock of birds circling overhead.\""
msgstr "\"우리 여기에 헌신짝처럼 버려져서... 머리 위에는 새들이 멤돌며 날고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "fdf91527-2495-4ef0-bcde-ad244b9c1810"
msgid ""
"\"It's good to see reasonable companions in this party. Some of us simply "
"cannot understand reason.\""
msgstr "\"일행에 합리적인 동료가 있다니 다행이야. 우리 중 일부는 이해 능력이 부족한 녀석들이 있어서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2b67d460-a428-491f-ab82-c169f0425118"
msgid ""
"\"We can make do with rations in the desert. But in these fertile lands, one "
"need only reach out a hand to find fresh food!\""
msgstr "\"사막에서 식량으로 어떻게든 할 수 있어. 하지만 비옥한 땅에서는 손만 뻗으면 음식이니 얼마나 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "36b2e93f-c4f0-47a0-81c1-a8bd2d7f5f51"
msgid ""
"\"It's called forethought. Supplies will keep us from starving in case a "
"hunt ends in failure!\""
msgstr "\"유비무환이라고... 사냥이 실패해도 식량이 있으니 괜찮아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "313f6c54-f532-43af-a850-c25f684fef97"
msgid "\"The smaller the party, the more vulnerable are the ones who remain…\""
msgstr "\"일행이 작을 수록 서로에게 영향을 미치기 쉽지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "edd92c96-03fb-49b8-8499-6cbf6c9cec6a"
msgid ""
"\"Your words are full of indifference to the deaths of others. We'll take "
"care of ourselves — but let us show some compassion, and grieve our losses.\""
msgstr "\"네 말은 다른 사람의 죽음에 관심이 없는 것 같군. 우리는 알아서 챙길 테니 연민을 보이건 슬퍼하건 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "748ca4eb-fac1-49cb-8d8f-15e1e22a917b"
msgid ""
"\"The flames of my spirit flicker and burn low... I'll lie next to the fire."
"\""
msgstr "\"내 영혼이 불타고 있다... 나는 그 옆에 눕겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2ee17b80-bfde-45e5-a2e1-5fb93706481f"
msgid "\"Everyone wants to be next to the fire! Scoot over, you!\""
msgstr "\"모두가 그 불 옆에 있기를 원해. 웃기지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "17e62a10-3b04-4e88-bd53-3184d1cad593"
msgid ""
"\"I shouldn't have exerted myself so much today. If any enemies attack us "
"tonight, I'll beg them, 'Come back later. — I need another half hour of "
"sleep!'\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 힘들겠군. 적이 기습이라도 하면 제발 내일 와달라고 빌어야겠어. 잠 좀 더 자게 해달라고 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6ab26d21-109a-4c8e-897a-d06910202af9"
msgid ""
"\"I'm quite sure, young lady, that you will speak those words in such a "
"voice that will make our enemies rightly ashamed of themselves! They'll bow "
"their heads and quietly crawl back to wherever they came from!\""
msgstr "\"확실해. 네 말투로 적들은 부끄러움을 느꼈을 거야. 그들은 머리를 조아리고 꽁무니를 뺄걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "89d5ee3d-d322-4a76-b532-b038d7965a3f"
msgid ""
"\"An interesting place to sleep. We need not fear rain, at least. – Only the "
"gods of the underworld could tell us what we should be afraid of instead!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 자라는 거야? 그래도 빗물은 안새겠군. 무서운 녀석이 나타날까 봐 걱정된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1b791ac3-772e-449d-b016-770a51267a1e"
msgid ""
"\"Easy there, young lady! Where is your optimism? Or at least your love of "
"gold? Wherever there is danger, there may also be riches to be found... "
"Though of course we might also find nothing but monsters, dust, and spiders!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정해. 그 밝은 성격은 어디로 갔어? 돈 밝히는 성격은 어디로 갔고? 위험이 있으면 돈도 따르는 법이야... 여지껏 괴물과 먼지밖에 "
"나오지 않았지만 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3d71aad8-781b-4319-a53e-33fd12039e77"
msgid ""
"\"I was careless. — And those jackals made me pay for it. But we made them "
"pay more dearly!\""
msgstr "\"내가 부주의했어. 그 개자식들 때문에 값을 치뤘지. 하지만 그 녀석들 피해가 더 심각할걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "79aaf8d9-c175-4dad-8eff-643545cb3b16"
msgid "\"You call that 'carelessness'? I call it 'outright foolishness!'\""
msgstr "\"고작 부주의라는 거야? 멍청해서 그런 거겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1189936b-dbba-40d6-b851-83362834ecd2"
msgid ""
"\"Our food stores are as empty as a church at dinner time. I hope we have a "
"plan for replenishing our supplies!\""
msgstr "\"음식 저장고가 텅텅 비었어. 저녁 무렵의 교회도 아니고 식량 보급 계획이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ccb41f22-56f8-4984-8d5f-eb4fb4789d67"
msgid "\"Churches often feed the hungry, and are full during dinner time.\""
msgstr "\"교회는 굶주린 자들을 먹이기라도 하지. 저녁에는 음식이 가득하다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9cdc12de-9285-48e3-a566-476b89bbcc44"
msgid ""
"\"Magic is a lazy friend, and a treacherous ally. I shouldn't have relied on "
"it, when my elemental powers are always with me!\""
msgstr "\"마법이란 녀석은 게으른 배신자 녀석이지. 나의 원소 마법이 있는 한 마법에 의지하지는 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1ad15c13-74da-474f-a359-eabcca610d10"
msgid ""
"\"Ooh, can I write that down? It's perfect for an idea I'm working on!\""
msgstr "\"오. 방금 한 말 책에 써도 돼? 지금 쓰고 있는 책에 딱 어울리거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "212c3d32-fd70-4f11-a89e-869dabdd2555"
msgid ""
"\"We're out here in the open, for all to see. I hope those keeping watch "
"don't let their minds wander!\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 트인 곳에 있다니. 이곳을 보는 녀석들이 호기심을 가지지 않길 바라야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5b11bc9c-5a71-49dc-af25-487342d0aadc"
msgid "\"You cannot hide from your own fate. But we will keep our eyes open.\""
msgstr "\"운명에게서 숨을 수는 없어. 하지만 정신을 똑바로 차리면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "89b7527b-43e9-40d0-b4ee-65fdcf8194d5"
msgid ""
"\"Someone needs to go hunting... But don't look at me. — In the desert where "
"I'm from, there's nothing to hunt but tumbleweed!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 사냥을 가야겠어... 하지만 나를 보지는 말라구. 내가 온 사막에서 사냥거리는 약초가 전부였으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ddfac8c7-3d83-47be-a430-389be4e042a9"
msgid "\"I have faith in your ingenuity — and your gut instincts, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"네 순진함이 대단하다. 네 본능은 어떻고. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2c5c841e-7bf6-4f9a-9ba1-37e72e773bad"
msgid ""
"\"Now that there are fewer of us, it's so... cold. So empty. I don't want to "
"talk.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 수도 많지 않아. 여기는... 춥고 텅 비었어. 말하기도 싫어진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d035b45b-a47b-4b09-97cf-387e9dcc20ed"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know how I'll write today. I don't want to write about death at "
"all!\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 어떻게 써야할까... 죽음에 대해서 쓰기는 싫은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "72e80cbb-c170-433c-9817-0854db2b6414"
msgid ""
"\"The dead live on in stories of the living. And if you have nothing good to "
"say about the dead... they don't deserve us missing them!\""
msgstr "\"산 자들의 이야기에서 죽은 자들이 살아간다. 망자에 대해서 할 말이 없어도 그들을 잊지 말아야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "35cd6e12-abc2-45be-9912-a2361dd42864"
msgid ""
"\"Patience. It's hard to get used to it... but it's easier if you don't talk "
"about it.\""
msgstr "\"인내심을 가져. 적응하기 힘들 거야... 하지만 말을 안하면 괜찮아져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3a30d5d3-9d1e-4309-9e5a-28bea405cd67"
msgid ""
"\"Don't force yourself to speak, if you've nothing to say. Let us instead "
"just sit in silence.\""
msgstr "\"할 말이 없다면 억지로 말하지 마. 조용히 앉아있자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3de67f58-93e7-414a-9e0f-282cb2c33bbb"
msgid ""
"\"'I fear I'm going to cry.' Just brush it off, child... the same lot awaits "
"you all.\""
msgstr "\"울꺼 같아 두려워. 그냥 잊어버려. 운명이 너를 기다리고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7e6fc8e8-97f0-485e-8858-1afd5df4c16d"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, my friends... but today I will not be able to entertain you "
"with song and story... I'm going to need to lie down.\""
msgstr "\"용서해. 오늘은 노래나 이야기를 하지 못하겠어... 누워야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ee542b31-9b8c-4639-a77b-0faca47def4a"
msgid ""
"\"I don't... feel well... forgive me, friends... today you'll have to while "
"away the evening without me.\""
msgstr "\"기분이 좋지 않아... 미안해... 나 없이 저녁을 보내야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "48400d4e-1948-460b-bbee-fac6c9664fd6"
msgid ""
"How sad! I will pray to Sarenrae for your quick recovery. But don't linger — "
"go, lie down. You need rest...\""
msgstr "\"저런! 서렌레이께 기도를 드려 네가 회복하길 바랄게. 가서 좀 누워. 휴식이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d3fe54e0-ce03-4d2d-9872-748afe3e71f1"
msgid "\"No, don't worry! Rest as much as you need!\""
msgstr "\"걱정하지 마! 푹 쉬라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "cab3dd1e-033e-4f83-bc5f-bb638382d88c"
msgid ""
"[Mumbles, putting his hands together]\"…blessed be the silence we are "
"granted by night…\""
msgstr "[손을 모으며 중얼거립니다] \"... 저녁에 침묵하는 자들에게 축복을...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f2ec6bf2-c1bb-481d-9968-cdc1b34bdfb8"
msgid "\"Praised be Urgathoa, a few hours of peace...\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아시여. 몇시간만이라도 휴식을...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8a2f44e2-d5ea-4eee-9b7e-39caeedec931"
msgid ""
"\"Go. Will be ok without you. Yes. Without Linzee. Hm. But come back later. "
"Nok-Nok needs someone to laugh at.\""
msgstr "\"가. 너 없이 괜찮을 거야. 린지가 없어도 돼. 흠. 하지만 다음에 돌아와. 녹-녹 놀릴 사람 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "65fb1c05-fb2c-47c4-876b-a49bb44e9710"
msgid ""
"\"Lie down and close your eyes. Would you like to hear a Kelish tale? You "
"definitely haven't heard it before!\""
msgstr "\"누워서 눈 좀 붙여. 켈리쉬 이야기 해줄까? 처음 들어 봤을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "933146f1-b8f7-4591-b86e-ab8029a606ea"
msgid ""
"\"I do so love traveling! All the magnificent sights, our adventures, the "
"people we meet... I just wish we didn't have to walk so much!\""
msgstr "\"나는 여행이 좋아! 멋진 광경에 모험에 새로운 사람들... 많이 걷는 것만 빼면 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f286dfc8-7ba0-4b24-99d0-6fd6251ecb4c"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I regret that the gods didn't make my companions the same size "
"as me — with the same stride, at least…\""
msgstr "\"가끔 신이 내 동료들을 나와 같은 크기로 만들지 않아서 슬퍼... 보폭이 너무 넓단 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "706ffed0-30ac-402c-ba0d-681b6db53c1f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, we are not walking that far! Many of my fellow travelers come back "
"taller — on account of the extra calluses on their feet.\""
msgstr "\"그리 많이 걷지도 않았어! 내 동료들은 여행을 다녀오면 키가 컸어. 발바닥에 굳은살이 박혀서 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f47b39fa-01f0-4276-9416-4d83d5555761"
msgid "\"Be glad you don't have to carry most of the weight.\""
msgstr "\"몸무게가 그리 무겁지 않아서 다행이라고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "df6de7df-6fad-41d8-aca0-e714de6eee3d"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem. There is no request too small for a servant of Sarenrae. If you "
"wish, I could take a look at your calluses...\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 종에게 불가능함이란 없어. 바란다면 네 굳은살을 좀 봐주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "76b65012-10d2-49a4-b497-4138d8fba588"
msgid ""
"\"Just five hundred gold coins a day — and I'll carry you myself. What, too "
"stingy? Suit yourself, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"하루에 500골드만 내. 그러면 너를 짊어주지. 왜. 냄새나? 너에게 걸맞는데? 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "55662e37-902a-48c4-b93a-2dd9d73eb543"
msgid ""
"\"Somehow this gloomy place reminds me of the nights I spent in the fields "
"of Galt as a back-country girl. The babbling brooks, grass caressing your "
"face, and the stars smiling down upon you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 우울한 곳은 내가 갈트의 시골 소녀였을 때를 기억나게 한단 말이지. 졸졸거리는 시냇물에 얼굴을 간지럽히는 풀들과 하늘에 반짝이는 "
"별들이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "417c051d-1aa5-49cf-bdf3-4501e9f0d380"
msgid ""
"\"When I'm afraid to fall asleep, I like pretending that I'm high in the "
"mountains. The proud, snow-covered peaks, lofty pines — and not a soul in "
"sight...\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠드는 게 두려울 때 산 중턱에 있다는 상상을 해. 눈으로 덮인 봉우리가 우뚝 솟아있고 소나무가 있지. 그리 멋진 광경은 아니야..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3bebf001-b61d-41c5-b19f-4bf790d9d48f"
msgid "\"Sounds magical! I'd love to visit such a place someday...\""
msgstr "\"멋지게 들리는데! 언젠가 한번 가 보고 싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "83701d3a-acc4-4f5d-b538-744c3e7a8fdd"
msgid ""
"\"You should go to my homeland. No place in the world are there stars and "
"mountains like those... Although the people, like my family — there's no "
"place in the world that has them either. I'm glad about that!\""
msgstr "\"내 고향에 꼭 들러 봐. 세상에 별이 그렇게 많은 곳은 없을 거야... 사람들은 가족처럼 친근해서 집 같은 곳이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1db135f6-b14d-4fd3-b4f2-c8992900875b"
msgid "[Listens with his eyes closed, with a smile on his face]"
msgstr "[눈을 감고 미소를 띈 채 듣고 있습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "41e0c3ea-ba46-4c8f-8ae7-f94a58a32a89"
msgid "\"Yeah. Ha, ha, ha, hmm... You've got some imagination.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 하하하. 상상력이 좋구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "371c7162-7c4e-4296-91a5-9707b8aedee1"
msgid ""
"\"I guess I should think about what will happen to my book, if I don't get "
"to finish it...\""
msgstr "\"책의 결말을 내지 않으면 어떤 일이 일어날지 생각해둬야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f63bdd47-aa35-44f9-b3f3-37de82495f8b"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I knew that adventures were dangerous affairs, but I didn't "
"expect them to be so... dangerous...\""
msgstr "\"모험이 위험한 건 알지만 이렇게 위험할 줄은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5c15f4eb-d555-4890-8628-89d1a806cbda"
msgid ""
"\"Next time stay away from the middle of the fight. Best to stay behind me! "
"Remember, in a battle, just like in a book, everyone has their role and "
"place!\""
msgstr "\"다음 번엔 싸울 때 떨어져있으라고. 내 뒤에 숨는 게 가장 안전해. 싸움이 벌어지면 모두가 각자의 역할과 자리가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7e5153b7-41aa-4169-95a5-ee7762ec1eca"
msgid ""
"\"Pff, you call those wounds? It's just a scratch. You'll be fine, you hear "
"me? Don't even think about dying here.\""
msgstr "\"칫. 그걸 상처라고 부르는 거야? 그냥 스쳤군. 괜찮을 거야. 여기서 죽을 생각 말아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a9143218-79ee-4f50-bcd3-621d312a45ff"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be afraid, Linzi. I will fight for you. — You didn't finish writing "
"about my feats!\""
msgstr "\"두려워하지 마. 린지. 너를 위해 싸워줄게. 아직 내 얘기는 쓰지도 않았잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e4cf05d0-ac1b-4ec7-a47b-73581f80dc45"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you must be careful, Linzi! I understand why you'd want to get a "
"better look, but you really must stay back...\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 린지! 좋은 책을 쓰고 싶은 건 알겠지만 뒤에 물러나있으라고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0f341839-1dbc-4f9d-9ec6-b5918f5fa4ad"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, Linzi, it was our fault. Friends, we must take care of our "
"little songbird – what would we do without her?\""
msgstr "\"미안해. 린지. 우리 잘못이었어. 우리 음유시인을 지켰어야 했는데. 린지가 없으면 어떡하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c006286e-325c-4742-8df4-2de20196a467"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, Linzi, it was our fault. Friends, we must take care of our "
"little songbird – what would we do without her?\""
msgstr "\"미안해. 린지. 우리 잘못이었어. 우리 음유시인을 지켰어야 했는데. 린지가 없으면 어떡하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6bc0ca75-fe5b-4483-bf70-9db5cc070513"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem. 'On the one hand, the threat of famine took a toll on the party's "
"morale. But on the other hand, their growling stomachs scared away all the "
"monsters and bandits in the area...'\""
msgstr "\"기근의 위협이 일행의 사기에 영향을 미치지. 한편 꼬르륵거리는 소리에 괴물며 도적들이 놀라 도망쳤다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "fdb496e4-b328-4c81-b2f9-f83678e172b7"
msgid ""
"\"'After looking through their dwindling supplies, the party had a sinking "
"feeling in their stomachs. We were about to find out whether fasting is "
"truly good for one's health!' How's that sound?\""
msgstr ""
"\"식량 공급이 점점 줄어드는데 우리는 배고파서 기운이 빠지고 있어. 책에는 금식이 건강에 좋은지 알아보려 했던 것 뿐입니다.라고 쓰면 "
"어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4bced697-0d96-4483-b832-c20cabc3d246"
msgid "\"I'm so happy I no longer pursue art...\""
msgstr "\"예술을 그만둬서 너무 행복해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0a2cce2f-c26f-4842-9253-8848f16b3279"
msgid ""
"\"You better write that we fight like devils in the day, and feast like "
"kings at night. People sing songs about great heroes, not snot-nosed hungry "
"tramps.\""
msgstr "\"낮에는 악귀처럼 싸우고 저녁에는 왕처럼 먹었다고 적어. 사람들은 영웅 이야기를 좋아하지 배고픈 거지 이야기는 싫어하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "da3a1109-80a2-4935-884c-c64a33e5639e"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, well said! But we do actually have enough supplies, right "
"friends? Right?\""
msgstr "\"하하하. 재밌었어! 하지만 식량은 충분한 거지? 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1ae3a401-2ebe-4ff4-86d5-18ca2287b9bc"
msgid ""
"\"Why don't you read the part where I sink my teeth into a juicy gammon. Or "
"fry a wyvern with lightning, ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"훈제 햄을 한입 베어물었다는 부분부터 읽어 봐. 아니면 와이번을 번개로 튀겼다는 부분을 읽던가. 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "43238b84-a835-4663-a103-24e13d13a6af"
msgid ""
"\"Kha-Kha, it was a good day today! I almost ran out of spells, and my voice "
"is so hoarse! Any longer, and I'd be reduced to fighting hand to hand!\""
msgstr "\"하하. 오늘 정말 즐거웠어! 마법이 모두 바닥났고 목소리는 쉬었지만. 그래서 결국 백병전을 치뤄야 했지만 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "582599d4-373c-47c9-9daa-5cb844c31bc4"
msgid ""
"\"Whew! I almost lost my voice today. Don't think I've ever cast so many "
"spells!\""
msgstr "\"휴! 목소리가 쉬어버렸어. 이렇게 마법을 많이 외울줄은!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "afb74d50-5175-4c79-ba72-7d14428da089"
msgid ""
"\"That's right! By the way, in the future could you perhaps cast them a "
"little... softer? I'm inspired by the sound of your voice, but... I find it "
"harder to concentrate when it's so... you know...\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 다음에는 주문을 좀 살살 외우지 그래? 네 목소리는 멋지지만 소리가 커서 집중하기 힘들다고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "189d9b78-5dad-4abe-93dc-01d91622ee2e"
msgid ""
"\"Next time try to whack someone on the head with that tome of yours. I'll "
"wager ten gold coins that you could crack even a troll's skull with that "
"thing.\""
msgstr "\"다음에는 네 책으로 적들의 머리를 날려버려. 그 책으로 트롤의 해골도 박살낸다에 10골드 걸지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fa89a2ba-5c79-4f5b-83cc-3a05dd5ebe0e"
msgid "\"I am astonished time and again, how... hmm... strong your voice is!\""
msgstr "\"몇번이고 놀라... 네 목소리 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f4efa604-08a2-4baa-a190-548559696dbf"
msgid ""
"\"You should scream even louder, when you cast. — A few days later and you "
"won't be able to say a word! And we'll all go deaf on day one, ha, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"주문을 외울 때는 소리를 지르라고. 며칠 뒤에는 말을 한마디도 못하겠지만. 우리도 귀머거리가 되겠지. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6486b839-4ec9-4037-a851-ead04d77c384"
msgid ""
"\"There is magic in everything – stones, books, trees... But the magic of "
"song might be the most amazing of all!\""
msgstr "\"마법은 어디에나 있어. 돌, 책, 나무... 하지만 노래의 마법이야말로 가장 멋지지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "23d9328e-e1ff-427d-b640-ba1a67870132"
msgid ""
"\"Is it just me who can't fall asleep at night? I'm scared that some "
"uninvited guests might show up...\""
msgstr "\"밤에 잠들 수 없는 사람은 나뿐인가? 불청객이 올까 걱정돼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c5999a2d-d228-4e87-a5f6-9c53fd60ea27"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like tonight something might happen that will be worth writing "
"about...\""
msgstr "\"오늘 저녁 무슨 일이 일어나서 좋은 소재 거리가 될 거 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ab7b9e69-e303-4006-85fd-20b98d93d241"
msgid ""
"\"We should try to avoid unexpected engagements. Although sometimes they're "
"unavoidable.\""
msgstr "\"예기치 않은 전투를 피해야 해. 그들이 피할 수 없는 적이라도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7eb331ed-e642-4a73-8326-332f528d190c"
msgid "\"I understand you! But don't let such thoughts keep you awake.\""
msgstr "\"알겠어! 하지만 그런 생각으로 잠못들면 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "cb2c6f0f-c613-429a-94cf-599d25c42fe3"
msgid ""
"\"He who fears nothing sleeps tight... and he who sleeps tight, is fearing "
"nothing! Hah, did you hear? Write that down, what I just said. Before we "
"forget!\""
msgstr ""
"\"숙면을 취하지 않는 것을 부끄러워하지 않는 자와 숙면을 취하는 자는 두려울 것이 없다! 오. 내가 생각해도 명언인데? 어서 받아적어. "
"잊어버리기 전에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fa99dac0-2a90-4259-b1f2-d85f0724d994"
msgid ""
"\"I'm bored to death with crawling through bushes, gathering branches and "
"fetching armfuls of leaves. If someone's interested — be my guest. But you "
"can do it without me this time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"덤불 속을 기어다니다 나뭇가지와 잎들을 휩쓸고 다니는 것도 질렸어. 관심있으면 가르쳐주지. 하지만 시범 보여달라고 하지는 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "09e05269-925b-43e8-955e-7a7c019acb91"
msgid "\"If Linzee keeps talk-talking, we will miss the whole greatbeast!\""
msgstr "\"린지가 계속 수다를 떠는 것도 듣기 싫어진다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "32ff4dbd-6ece-47dd-989e-a6e985ae434a"
msgid ""
"\"Someday I will write an 'Ode Against the Field Ration.' It's not food, "
"it's a crime against all decency.\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 야외 식량에 관한 글을 쓸 거야. 이건 음식에 대한 모독이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c21a0e65-4f84-4ef5-8499-5f53c503b969"
msgid ""
"\"If someone agrees to go and fetch some meat for us, I'll... I'll dedicate "
"the first volume of my book to them! Oh gods, even the whole book! Just "
"bring us something fresh to eat...\""
msgstr "\"누가 가서 고기를 구해준다면... 가장 먼저 쓴 책을 줄 거야! 그게 전부라고 할지라도! 제발 누가 고기 좀 가져와...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c080df1e-0c28-46d5-9338-32825ba2ed10"
msgid ""
"\"The lot of all books is to turn to dust and be forgotten. It's the way of "
"all things...\""
msgstr "\"모든 책은 결국 잊혀져 먼지에 뒤덮이겠지. 그게 책의 인생이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "48382e76-1ba6-4fcb-b253-9e9ce15b0b5d"
msgid ""
"\"You are such a child sometimes! I'd be happy to give you my share, if we "
"had anything to share...\""
msgstr "\"어린애처럼 굴지마! 나도 줄 게 있다면 기꺼이 주고싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0220cbf4-fc63-4f7d-8823-d245f0d2be28"
msgid ""
"\"As an author, I cannot approve of such a foolish artistic solution. On the "
"other hand, as a hungry traveler...\""
msgstr "\"작가로서 나는 이런 멍청한 생각에 동의할 수 없어. 하지만 배고픈 여행자로서는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2f63409d-e9d0-4788-8aa2-808b4f458160"
msgid ""
"\"Very well! I'll go then. Hunt, shoot some deer... Ah, ha, ha! Did you buy "
"it? Oh, oh, your eyes are blazing, ha, ha! Don't pout, you'll have your "
"deer... just not tonight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 그럼 내가 가지. 사냥 가서 사슴을 쏘아야지... 하하하! 진심이냐고? 오. 눈이 불타오르고 있네? 삐지지 말라고. 사슴을 "
"구해줄 테니... 오늘 저녁 말고. 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5f4b5b34-89c9-4590-9bf0-507a38190f70"
msgid ""
"\"Why is everyone so glum? As if longshanks and halfshanks don't kick it as "
"much as goblins.\""
msgstr "\"왜 모두 우울해? 꺽다리와 반쪽이들이 모두 시무룩하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0e24a51c-2ad0-49ea-8e06-0e01ab45044d"
msgid ""
"\"Once we get to your stinky city we'll find five more adventurers, instead "
"of dead ones.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 네 더러운 도시에 도착하면 모험가 다섯을 더 찾을 거야. 시체들 대신에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "edb2966f-0659-4c26-9cae-e31d5d0fe466"
msgid ""
"\"You are a strange creature, Nok-Nok. You don't cling to your life and you "
"don't weep for the dead. It seems that you, unknowingly, attained the wisdom "
"of Groetus' teaching.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 이상한 고블린이야. 녹-녹. 삶에 집착도 하지 않고 죽은 사람을 위해 슬퍼하지도 않다니. 놀랍게도 너는 그로투스의 가르침을 "
"완벽히 이해한 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bb301ba9-9c4b-4d06-af88-fdac38532aa2"
msgid ""
"\"How can somebody be so nasty? Nasty, stupid, senseless scoundrel! It "
"disgusts me to even share the same bonfire with you!\""
msgstr "\"누가 이렇게 심술궃게 구는 거야? 멍청하고 고지식한 녀석! 같은 자리에 앉아있는 게 부끄럽다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7faac6f9-52da-4b5c-8457-0084c02a8fae"
msgid ""
"\"Good you've mentioned that. Means you won't cover my back. Better to know "
"beforehand.\""
msgstr "\"말 잘했다. 네게 내 등을 맡기지는 않을 거야. 잘 알아두라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fc755357-0c75-40b3-a893-44700f7bb70d"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you even a little bit sad about the fallen? Even a teeny tiny bit?\""
msgstr "\"죽은 동료 때문에 슬프지 않아? 조금도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "241df4c1-aae9-4fed-997c-f60e729eee12"
msgid "\"I'll manage anyway. Nok-Nok is a Hero, Nok-Nok can!\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 해낼 거다. 녹-녹은 영웅이다. 녹-녹 할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "dfbf4053-d687-4d8b-8e74-6242a62cf46c"
msgid "\"I am fine. Don't worry. Nok-Nok will protect you anyway.\""
msgstr "\"괜찮다. 걱정 마라. 녹-녹 너를 보호할 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a56a3af5-09f9-42a7-b9df-647d3315f6c2"
msgid ""
"\"Just look at this gnat! Barely alive and still tries to be a hero! Ha!\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석 보게! 죽지 않는 게 신기한데 영웅이 되려 하네. 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a172bf74-65ea-49a9-8994-2d7f3a07170f"
msgid ""
"\"That's the spirit! Even goblins are braver than some southern warriors!\""
msgstr "\"장하다! 고블린이 남쪽 전사 녀석들보다 더 용감한데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1931248c-0604-4900-9475-3a1636929066"
msgid ""
"\"I can't afford you to get hurt because of your boldness. So try to keep "
"behind our backs until you feel better, please.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 나대다 다쳐도 나는 몰라. 그냥 기분이 나아질 때까지 우리 뒤에 있으라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ac1e0451-1b6a-49db-b2f0-23bf4820e7ad"
msgid ""
"\"I would be able to make an entertaining little zombie when this creature "
"perishes. I doubt we'll need to wait long.\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석이 사라지면 작은 좀비를 만들고 놀아야겠군. 머지않아 죽겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fb1569de-1154-4343-a608-71f15ad037ed"
msgid "\"No... strength... at all...\""
msgstr "\"힘이... 없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b83531cb-568f-4281-b3b1-91a396d8a711"
msgid "\"Tired. Will someone carry me?\""
msgstr "\"피곤하다. 누가 나 좀 업어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a795cac5-805c-4a25-b437-f5a34b492226"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe, if we pick up and move right now, he will fall behind and leave us "
"in peace? Does somebody else like this plan like I do?\""
msgstr "\"지금 이동하면 이 녀석이 뒤쳐져서 귀찮은 게 해결되지 않을까? 이 계획 마음에 드는 사람?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b7f2e4fe-5677-49b9-878e-a4ba83c5b9d0"
msgid ""
"\"Do not yawn in my direction, goblin. The stench of your breath can knock "
"out some Shelyn followers!\""
msgstr "\"내 앞에서 하품하지 마라. 고블린. 네 입냄새 때문에 죽겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4a790faa-2740-4aa8-8810-df57ca595fab"
msgid ""
"\"When you yawn like that and rub your eyes, you look like a child! Small... "
"carnivorous... hideous child.\""
msgstr "\"하품하고 눈 비비는 모습을 보면 아이 같단 말이야! 작고... 동족을 먹는... 끔찍한 아이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4d853f14-a13f-4088-9f87-d6eb9bffbfec"
msgid ""
"\"Bhahahaha, look at him! So exhausted he's about to plant himself in the "
"ground!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 저 녀석 봐! 지쳐서 땅 속으로 꺼지겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1e00d49e-56d2-47e7-ab21-3062ecd597cf"
msgid ""
"\"I don't worry about beasts. I will run away while they eat all of you.\""
msgstr "\"짐승은 걱정하지 않아. 녀석들이 너를 잡아먹으려 하면 도망갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a2b087b8-fee0-465c-89d2-03d9429aae59"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok is sly, Nok-Nok is fast. Nok-Nok will flee if beast attacks!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 교활하다. 녹-녹은 빠르다. 짐승이 공격하면 녹-녹 도망간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2a482703-4d16-4411-8da6-c8834a8d7cd7"
msgid "\"At least you don't try to pretend that you value our lives.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 우리 목숨이 소중하다면 그러지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "41ad1372-bfcb-4842-9c5c-87249a051e6c"
msgid ""
"\"I promise you won't get too far! Just try and you'll get a lightning bolt "
"in your hind!\""
msgstr "\"멀리 도망가지 못할걸! 도망가기만 하면 뒷다리에 번개를 꽂아주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7c9280c5-4f98-4f67-959a-3b18488b0985"
msgid "\"We'll manage. Then I will track you.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 괜찮을 거야. 살아남으면 너를 추적해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bd69c733-e9dd-4364-87d4-6304cc245c88"
msgid "\"Perfect! The farther the better for all of us!\""
msgstr "\"완벽해! 좋은 게 좋은 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fcc2a096-fe93-4ca7-81b2-6aa01773bc97"
msgid ""
"\"Last time I got beat up this bad was when I disagreed with chief "
"shatshank. Bones sticking through skin, just like now!\""
msgstr "\"족장의 말을 듣지 않아 엄청나게 맞은 적이 있지. 지금처럼 뼈가 피부를 뚫어버렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8927e6e5-a49c-4a3c-a418-72e3b9d9db8d"
msgid ""
"\"Ow, almost got an eye out. Is it pricey to get a new one? Nah, don't need "
"it, eyeless Hero is better than intact Hero!\""
msgstr "\"눈알이 빠질 뻔했어. 새로운 눈을 사려면 비싸겠지? 아. 필요없어. 외눈 영웅이 더 멋있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8eef4132-5229-4334-901e-f2e79dfb07d8"
msgid "\"You worry me when you talk like that. Let me tend to your wounds.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 말할 때 얼마나 걱정되는지. 내가 상처를 봐줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ec5d5064-28dc-4ac8-ab53-aea3ab7c8a45"
msgid "\"Too much hassle for the one who is so close to his end.\""
msgstr "\"다 죽어가는 사람에게 너무 잘해주는 거 아닌가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "fa1bed6e-6ec7-4e17-87ca-388a9025181b"
msgid ""
"\"Scars are valuable trophies! You should be proud when you get new ones "
"from a great fight!\""
msgstr "\"흉터는 가치있는 훈장이야. 싸움에서 하나 생길 때마다 기뻐해야 한다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bcb510ad-9a97-4183-a4ec-508384a9a6d6"
msgid ""
"\"Stop showing me every last of your bruises! I will be seeing nightmares "
"after these demonstrations!\""
msgstr "\"네가 다친 곳을 왜 자랑하는 거야? 그런 모습을 볼 때마다 악몽을 꿀 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7c9e4102-95f5-4fad-a914-dce55a065e6d"
msgid "\"Hey! Where is food in the bag? Used to be a lot.\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 가방에 식량은 어디있어? 엄청 많았는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1f6b11d0-ac72-4571-856f-a592b244a3e3"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok hungry. Got a ration?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 배고프다. 음식 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4901541e-d5ae-44f5-b32f-7cde031c52ee"
msgid ""
"\"You ate three times your weight today! Just what happens to all those "
"rations you toss in your maw?\""
msgstr "\"너 오늘 몸무게의 3배를 먹었어! 도대체 식량에 무슨 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "10ccf7ae-9a55-4c9f-9031-0e5208274862"
msgid ""
"\"I, of course, am aware that goblins are famous for their unsatiable "
"hunger... but I certainly wasn't aware that I'll have one of those beasts in "
"my group and will suffer as a result!\""
msgstr "\"고블린이 식성이 왕성하다는 건 알고 있었지만... 일행에 이런 짐승 새끼가 있을 줄은 몰랐지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "98b386a6-23f2-41d8-b85a-6f5e91a1ffef"
msgid ""
"\"Urgathoa would have been pleased with your gluttony. Would have — if you "
"weren't Lamashtu scum.\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아는 너의 식탐에 기뻐할 거다. 네가 라마슈투의 쓰레기가 아니었다면 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6d3f5576-0f53-4ca4-8fd6-f347204263b8"
msgid ""
"\"If you will keep eating like that, hunt for yourself. I am running out of "
"arrows.\""
msgstr "\"그런 식으로 먹으면 사냥도 네가 해라. 나는 화살이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6f8d71db-096a-4f1a-9965-7f0ab1433664"
msgid "\"Spells out. Need to rest.\""
msgstr "\"주문이 필요해. 쉬어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6e977d23-c009-4233-bed5-910818d46027"
msgid "\"Spent all magic again. Almost nothing left.\""
msgstr "\"모든 마법을 사용했다. 아무 마법도 남아있지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8804d2cc-38e5-422f-9060-735c172b88bb"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe we can plant Nok-Nok in the Technic League? He will run away anyway, "
"but before that those bastards will get enough trouble to cease dealing with "
"spellcasting slaves forever!\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹에 녹-녹을 보낼까? 어쨌든 사고를 쳐서 도망치면 마법 주문 노예를 쫓지 않을지도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b26ed893-15c7-4fbc-b831-aa04d14f5277"
msgid ""
"\"Heh. Nok-Nok and magic. He-he-he-he... oh, don't give me that look! It "
"even sounds hilarious, aha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤. 녹-녹과 마법. 헤헤헤... 그렇게 보지 마라! 헤헤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cb52f04d-4546-46a6-aeff-5adbc1034c19"
msgid ""
"\"A goblin mage... another oddity for my collection of Things-That-Should-"
"Never-Be!\""
msgstr "\"고블린 마법사라니... 기상천외한 콜렉션에 또 하나 추가할 게 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fce8fb03-4049-4e8b-b548-9e52c2a72aaa"
msgid ""
"\"You hasten your undoing by dealing with the powers you can't comprehend. "
"However, I am not the one to be unhappy because you chose this path.\""
msgstr "\"제어할 수 없는 힘을 쓰다니. 이런 길을 선택하다니 나는 기쁘지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "cbc0a95c-860a-4210-9731-32e56f435a27"
msgid ""
"\"A goblin wielding magic is like a kitten with the head of a dragon: funny —"
" but deadly nonetheless!\""
msgstr "\"마법을 쓰는 고블린은 드래곤 머리 위에 앉은 고양이 같아. 웃기지만 위험하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_LowSpell_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a31ddcb2-756b-4d07-9908-5e3cc561bae9"
msgid ""
"\"A goblin wielding magic is like a kitten with the head of a dragon: funny —"
" but deadly nonetheless!\""
msgstr "\"마법을 쓰는 고블린은 드래곤 머리 위에 앉은 고양이 같아. 웃기지만 위험하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e2c6f3a4-29c8-4c96-b2c2-4f95b020723a"
msgid ""
"\"Our kind knows how to hide. Longshanks don't. Why do you rest like this, "
"then, without cover? Not afraid?\""
msgstr "\"우리 종족은 숨는 법을 안다. 꺽다리들 모른다. 왜 가릴 것도 없이 이렇게 쉬는 거지? 두렵지도 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "022f8555-ec1a-4ae1-b7fd-120b2b434c25"
msgid ""
"\"You longshanks and halfshanks build your cities, with walls around them... "
"and here you sit without any protection in the clear sight. Strange.\""
msgstr "\"너희 꺽다리와 반쪽이들 벽으로 도시 건설했다... 그리고 너희들 여기 탁 트인 곳에 아무것도 안 쳤다. 이상하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5573c481-71e9-4bb4-8db0-9535a9c9af46"
msgid ""
"\"What can be worse than goblin's nagging? Only when he is right. Somebody "
"should have cared about the camp's protection.\""
msgstr "\"고블린 잔소리보다 나쁜 게 뭔지 알아? 고블린 잔소리가 옳다는 사실이야. 야영지에 신경 좀 써.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "16263224-0010-409c-a70b-f63c91b6c7f0"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have to hide. Somebody trying to eat me will learn to regret it, I "
"promise you that!\""
msgstr "\"나는 숨을 필요가 없어. 나를 잡아먹으려는 녀석은 나중에 후회하게 해줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b8eaa184-7534-4ccf-bf57-ed69d1c4be14"
msgid ""
"\"Honestly... Nok-Nok is right. But, considering him being around, even "
"protected camp isn't safe enough.\""
msgstr "\"사실 녹-녹이 맞아. 엄폐된 야영지도 안전하지 않은 판에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "06522a4d-56f5-47b2-b73a-811f10cf49c2"
msgid ""
"\"We count on our companions, Nok-Nok. Someone will raise an alert and warn "
"the others if anything goes wrong.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 동료에 의지한다. 녹-녹. 적이 나타나거나 상황이 안 좋으면 동료가 경보를 울릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fd37255c-884d-47c9-9b45-1b6134390976"
msgid ""
"\"Even if you can't hide, you should at least get some rest, so you'll be "
"ready to face any enemies who come by.\""
msgstr "\"숨을 수 없어도 최소한 쉬어야 해. 그래야 적들이 오면 준비를 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "000dfd74-30d4-47e7-a42c-ea7a43dbdf5c"
msgid ""
"\"Even if you can't hide, you should at least get some rest, so you'll be "
"ready to face any enemies who come by.\""
msgstr "\"숨을 수 없어도 최소한 쉬어야 해. 그래야 적들이 오면 준비를 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d7f9627a-a270-4471-8e70-e9c5e668a46c"
msgid "\"I saw bird nest on my way. Tender meat... bones go crunch...\""
msgstr "\"오다가 새 둥지를 봤다. 맛있는 고기... 뼈가 바삭해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "aa6308a2-b96e-497d-8980-fd2b9c6a39df"
msgid "\"I caught a rat! Mine! Won't share, don't ask!\""
msgstr "\"나 쥐 잡았어! 내꺼! 안 나눠줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "82fefed8-f32a-4d2a-8687-3b6fc4c0ce05"
msgid "\"Ew! Spare me your thoughts!\""
msgstr "\"으유! 무슨 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b07ed973-f540-4d77-b68c-ea4c3a91ee24"
msgid "\"Yeah, fresh meat would be nice. Too bad nobody hunts today.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 신선한 고기가 좋을 거야. 아무도 사냥을 안하다니. 너무해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4ab427b8-ebfa-44c6-b1f0-5979ec351011"
msgid ""
"\"If only my family tutor who nagged me about the importance of each set of "
"cutlery could hear you... yes, wouldn't mind the pleasure of seeing his face "
"at the sound of your babbling!\""
msgstr "\"나이프와 포크의 중요함을 알려준 가정 교사가 네 말을 들었다면... 아마 네가 지껄이는 소리를 듣고 기분이 나빠할 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c4224bd0-d2ab-4ac8-9b16-be0418853923"
msgid "\"Goblins eat garbage they find. No need to feed you.\""
msgstr "\"고블린들은 쓰레기를 먹지. 먹일 필요가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4f57ea8e-e596-4f37-92a9-b2096bf8cf2a"
msgid "\"You could survive in the desert, that's for sure!\""
msgstr "\"너는 사막에서도 살아남을 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9ce31ca8-dfa7-4b69-afed-9b6a2fa288de"
msgid "\"You could survive in the desert, that's for sure!\""
msgstr "\"너는 사막에서도 살아남을 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dd55a5f3-5e3b-43ec-b33f-565feec0d8f1"
msgid "\"It hurts so deeply to lose a friend…\""
msgstr "\"친구를 잃은 게 너무 아파...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "97357e18-0567-4fe2-bce5-99842081da25"
msgid ""
"\"Life is so fragile, isn't it? One moment you live, the next you're gone..."
"\""
msgstr "\"인생은 너무 연약하지 않니? 한순간 살다가, 다음엔 죽겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9025b18f-34f5-419a-9db3-b6239b44baf1"
msgid ""
"\"One more spark, extinguished… One more soul gone to Pharasma's trial, in "
"my god's pale gloam…\""
msgstr "\"한 번 더 불꽃을 내뿜으면 죽이겠다. 영혼 하나가 파라즈마의 심판대에 서겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "423b6b72-5bf7-4d9a-91cc-e20ec7af524d"
msgid "\"Don't cry. Seeing you crying makes me feel empty inside.\""
msgstr "\"울지 마. 네가 울고있으니 내 기분이 쓸쓸해져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b38aa366-22fa-4bcb-889e-8b738aa2e7e6"
msgid ""
"\"I know not how to comfort you. But if you don't mind, I'll just sit here "
"with you. Do you know how the saying goes? A sorrow shared is half a sorrow, "
"a hope shared is hope twice over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 위로하는 법을 몰라. 하지만 네 옆에 앉아있을 수는 있어. 이런 말이 있다. 슬픔을 나누면 반이 되고 기쁨을 나누면 배가 된다고."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "38912aa4-53ba-48a4-a1a2-2672f1277d6a"
msgid ""
"\"Stop whining. — I said, stop whining! When you're so upset, I grow "
"restless!\""
msgstr "\"그만 징징거려. 그만 징징거리랬잖아! 네가 울면 정신이 얼마나 사나운데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "cde74232-9a3b-4a7c-806d-1b91f8922635"
msgid "\"Naaa. Life is for tough stuff. If you survive — then you are worth!\""
msgstr "\"하. 인생은 힘든 것이야. 네가 살아남으면 대단한 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "43b7e415-3f4e-4d02-8d62-498b26ed5602"
msgid "\"I know you've had your share of bitter losses in your life...\""
msgstr "\"네 삶이 힘든 건 알고 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "53bf2bf3-7fd5-4960-b84e-4107e3881504"
msgid "\"I know you've had your share of bitter losses in your life...\""
msgstr "\"네 삶이 힘든 건 알고 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4679a4d7-c308-415f-9218-126d5974fe21"
msgid "\"I… I don't feel well…\""
msgstr "\"나는... 기분이 좋지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "adaa3ba3-edb1-4251-802c-7533de26e255"
msgid "\"I barely survived this day… I hope tomorrow I'll feel better.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 죽을 뻔했어. 내일은 괜찮을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "052c5f08-12d3-44d2-85a2-8034917efb8d"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen these symptoms before… in the red-light district in Absalom. I "
"must say, it wouldn't hurt if you got checked every once in a while, just "
"for good measure.\""
msgstr "\"압살롬의 홍등가에서 이러한 증상을 보았어. 검사를 받지 않으면 괜찮을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b8abbb92-fe9f-4b61-8239-b927359aaa5d"
msgid ""
"\"Such suffering will not fade on its own. You must find someone who can "
"deal with this.\""
msgstr "\"그런 고통은 사라지지 않아. 같이 나눌 사람이 필요하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b859fce3-ab03-4448-bf78-7697435bdaa9"
msgid ""
"\"It's unusual to see you so… quiet. You're closer to Groetus now, but are "
"you ready to meet Him?\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 조용한 걸 보니 이상해. 너 점점 그로투스에 가까워지고 있지만 그를 만날 준비가 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "79891401-fd53-488c-95be-3307335ba4f3"
msgid ""
"\"Knock it off! Shoulders back, chest up! Finish your dinner and go get some "
"sleep. I don't want to see that attitude tomorrow!\""
msgstr "\"그만 둬! 어깨 펴고 고개 들어! 저녁 마저 먹고 잠이나 좀 자. 내일은 기분 풀라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "67973f50-93d3-46f4-8d80-b38e2c2350e6"
msgid "\"I'd so much like to discuss our day... but I'm… so… worn out…\""
msgstr "\"오늘 할 말이 너무 많아... 하지만 지쳤어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "940a7b10-07c2-4e63-a288-48540f5eb5f9"
msgid ""
"\"I can barely keep my eyes open. I might just fall asleep where I stand!\""
msgstr "\"눈이 감긴다. 서 있을 때도 잘 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1a72cad7-e04a-432d-8a2a-ce37d2392e76"
msgid "\"That's a welcome change: finally some much needed quiet!\""
msgstr "\"그건 좋은 소식인데. 어떤 녀석은 너무 시끄럽거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e906f36e-632b-4f0d-9d16-84ccf91d3c86"
msgid ""
"\"I could use some shut-eye too. But it's wrong to go sleep early. I don't "
"want to get all softie!\""
msgstr "\"나도 눈 좀 붙여야겠어. 하지만 일찍 자는 건 좋지 않아. 너무 무른 것도 좋지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4f4940cb-025a-42be-8c9d-c8652b1e12b0"
msgid "\"The evening's quiet. Get some rest. Restore your strength.\""
msgstr "\"저녁은 조용해. 휴식을 취하고 힘을 회복해둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "918687c0-bb11-4211-81d4-7a9416e72658"
msgid "\"Starting tomorrow I'll carry half of your things. All right?"
msgstr "\"내일부터는 네 짐의 절반을 들어줄게. 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "916e67af-c6ad-4ce4-b73e-b400f5d46873"
msgid "\"It's so dark in here... This place gives me creeps! \""
msgstr "\"여기 너무 어두워... 기분이 섬뜩해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8da772dc-13d2-4b0e-aaec-521244e76f14"
msgid "\"I feel uncomfortable… I'm not sure we're safe here. \""
msgstr "\"기분이 불편해... 여기는 안전하지 않은 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bbe9b168-a548-42b6-9cb9-521954756f21"
msgid ""
"\"It's beautiful, isn't it? It is in places like this that the frailty of "
"faltering life grows clear!\""
msgstr "\"아름다운 곳이지? 이런 곳에 있으면 기분이 좋아져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2fca5e33-2c32-422b-aaae-b7c7b1a74077"
msgid ""
"\"Pull yourself together! Monsters can smell your fear. If you whine and "
"moan, they'll eat you first!\""
msgstr "\"정신 차려! 괴물이 공포에 젖은 네 숨소리를 맡을 거야. 네가 울면 너부터 잡아먹을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "254d8d9a-dc24-4eef-91cc-2c8b0d4dca82"
msgid ""
"\"I too feel disquieted. But together we're strong enough to stand against "
"any danger.\""
msgstr "\"너무 불안해. 하지만 함께라면 어떤 위험도 맞설 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "14573a00-2b9d-4f6c-b477-3e86d98aeb4b"
msgid "\"Don't be a chicken. I'll be right here.\""
msgstr "\"겁내지 마. 내가 여기 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ce9e21e-4d32-4cad-9042-0b925ce3faf4"
msgid "\"I think I've lost an earring in all the tumult. Has anyone seen it?\""
msgstr "\"전투에서 귀걸이를 잃은 거 같아. 누구 본 사람 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b6ec734b-6c82-45e6-b3e4-01ad91d57894"
msgid ""
"\"Oh! I think I got my cheek scratched in that last fight! I hope it won't "
"leave a scar!\""
msgstr "\"오! 마지막 싸움에서 뺨을 긁힌 것 같아! 흉터지면 안되는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response_2
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5376cae3-77bb-43c6-bee3-f107d9cff9ee"
msgid ""
"\"You were barely standing for pain, and now your thoughts go to such petty "
"things? You might be a trifle more serious!\""
msgstr "\"너는 고통스러워 간신히 서 있더니 이제는 그런 투정이나 하고 있어? 더 유치해질까 봐 걱정된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response_1
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "65d78385-502e-49bf-a644-1211eaa3e45a"
msgid ""
"\"She cannot go an hour without looking in a mirror. — A sure sign of feeble-"
"mindedness!\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 거울을 보지 않고 한 시간도 버틸 수 없어. 공주병인가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c8866f07-2aed-47fc-aca1-0360cf5d79db"
msgid ""
"\"Are you serious? Or just putting on a brave face, so we won't see you "
"barely can stand?\""
msgstr "\"진심이야? 아니면 안괜찮으면서 괜찮은 척하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "733f1fb6-b208-4044-b7a8-5aef2426739d"
msgid "\"Ha! You see that? My Octavia sure is tough!\""
msgstr "\"하하 봤지? 내 옥타비아는 역시 매서워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3106322c-bea0-4903-9203-cc11eda4e16e"
msgid ""
"\"Our backpacks grow more empty by the day. We should replenish our supplies!"
"\""
msgstr "\"배낭이 하루가 지날 수록 가벼워져. 보급품을 보충해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2e5ec1cd-c034-4bfe-9bd3-f080dffcd6bb"
msgid "\"Guess we'll need to cut our rations soon!\""
msgstr "\"배급량을 곧 줄여야 할 것 같네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5d49a211-66b7-4605-a70d-7d5e7f6d3533"
msgid "\"Don't worry: even if we're out of rations, we can always hunt.\""
msgstr "\"걱정하지 마. 식량이 바닥나도 사냥하면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "37d23e19-cc79-4968-8ecb-3e09ba23200f"
msgid ""
"\"Your false optimism makes me sick. Why must you pretend? Do you fear that "
"no one will like you if you show your true face?\""
msgstr "\"네 허세는 이제 지긋지긋해. 왜 자꾸 그리 허세를 부려? 네 진짜 모습을 보고 아무도 좋아하지 않을까 봐 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "05f45c02-bc5f-4d2e-af72-c04f2a68f1d4"
msgid ""
"\"Seems to me you don't eat nothing anyway. I wonder how you keep going!\""
msgstr "\"너 아무것도 먹지 않는 거 같은데. 어떻게 걷는 건지 궁금하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8e5bcae3-3cbc-4626-917f-a2ba92cc7043"
msgid ""
"\"At least our backpacks are lighter now, ha, ha. But tomorrow someone will "
"have to go hunting.\""
msgstr "\"그래도 배낭이 가벼워졌으니까. 하하. 내일 누군가 사냥을 해야만 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "93d6554a-e8a1-4846-a979-ea108eb5acfc"
msgid ""
"\"I have idea: let's get rid of the one who eat the most! Huh? Good idea? "
"Why you look at Nok-Nok like that?\""
msgstr "\"내가 생각이 있어. 가장 많이 먹는 녀석을 죽이자. 어때? 좋은 생각이지? 왜 녹-녹을 쳐다봐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f8cd155e-b3a3-4144-9871-83a42bd47405"
msgid ""
"\"This is no desert. It's surely easy to find food... For someone familiar "
"with these lands, of course.\""
msgstr "\"여기는 사막이 아니야. 음식을 찾기는 쉬워... 물론 여기에 익숙한 사람에게는 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1ef41e84-3d74-44c0-bb01-965ab32ee1d8"
msgid ""
"\"This is no desert. It's surely easy to find food... For someone familiar "
"with these lands, of course.\""
msgstr "\"여기는 사막이 아니야. 음식을 찾기는 쉬워... 물론 여기에 익숙한 사람에게는 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e3be737f-2034-47b6-86cc-6239bdcd9d12"
msgid ""
"[Pages through the spellbook] \"I wonder — which of these will I need "
"tomorrow? \""
msgstr "[마법책을 살펴봅니다] \"어느 마법이 내일 필요할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b3e4e6c7-5b93-49dd-8e51-5e4555c3dffb"
msgid ""
"[Pages through the spellbook] \"Anyone have a suggestion which spells I "
"should prepare for tomorrow?\""
msgstr "[마법책을 살펴봅니다] \"내일 어느 마법을 쓸지 추천해줄 사람?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c3888dc2-37fa-4d99-9825-614b24f38001"
msgid ""
"\"If you are interested in my opinion, you should choose the spells "
"yourself. 'Tis unlikely that someone else knows better than you.\""
msgstr "\"내 의견에 관심이 있다면 스스로 마법을 선택해. 믿기지 않겠지만 진짜야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b9315c6b-142e-4462-aca1-b0d9659b07e0"
msgid "\"Something to fry our enemies' asses! Or freeze 'em. Or both!\""
msgstr "\"적을 튀겨버리거나 얼려버릴 수 있는 걸로. 아니면 둘 다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4f96ec71-22c6-443c-a8b8-dbd4d7cd9a6f"
msgid ""
"\"You page through your book with such determination. You chase your powers "
"so. But it's all for nothing. In the end you'll be left alone with the "
"silence of eternity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 열심히도 책을 찾는구나. 힘에 대한 갈망도 그렇고. 하지만 다 필요 없어. 결국 너는 영원의 침묵과 함께 홀로 남을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e0818755-13ac-4be9-b396-c5c68720367a"
msgid ""
"\"By thunder, I'm glad I don't have to study each night, or be left without "
"spells the next day! Sometimes you just can't lift your eyes from your book."
"\""
msgstr "\"매일 저녁 공부 안해도 돼고 다음 날에는 마법이 부족할 걱정도 없어 다행이야! 책을 보면 눈꺼풀이 무거줘진단 말씀이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6645fbe6-536a-49c4-91e1-6db9584a42e5"
msgid ""
"\"Spells you can get from a book are like powers borrowed from a crafty "
"moneylender.\""
msgstr "\"책에서 마법을 얻는 것은 대부업자에게 돈을 빌리는 것과 비슷하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1a3c7bb7-ef21-4159-9b1d-3ad6cf566bd6"
msgid ""
"\"Spells you can get from a book are like powers borrowed from a crafty "
"moneylender.\""
msgstr "\"책에서 마법을 얻는 것은 대부업자에게 돈을 빌리는 것과 비슷하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "236ad340-587a-45d0-9390-05417b962a11"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad of a chance to relax a little, but… shouldn't we be busy hiding "
"our tents? Or are we just going to leave it to luck?\""
msgstr "\"쉴 기회를 얻어 기뻐... 하지만 텐트를 그냥 내버려둬도 괜찮을까? 아니면 운에 맡기고 지낼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "05c03454-a24c-4a52-a740-146e27c635b0"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder — what if someone happens to walk past us tonight? Won't it be "
"easy to find our camp, since we didn't bother to hide it?\""
msgstr "\"저녁에 누군가 지나가면 어떡하지? 은폐를 안해서 야영지가 너무 눈에 잘띄는 거 아니야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "74dab38e-c135-4b72-905d-ed1ba3612160"
msgid ""
"\"I could explain how we might best conceal our camp, if such is your wish. "
"I learned much while commanding a squad.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇게 바란다면 야영지를 숨기는 방법을 알려주지. 분대를 지휘하면서 많이 배워서 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "79d996c4-b188-43a9-9a7f-57b61f1d4c35"
msgid ""
"\"I advised that we hide the camp. Monsters can be a problem, as are evil-"
"minded people.\""
msgstr "\"야영지를 숨겨야 한다고 말했잖아. 괴물나 마음을 잘못 먹은 사람 때문에 위험할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c1fd6887-02b7-46e3-bcb8-66dea8e2cbcf"
msgid ""
"\"Why hide from monsters anyway? If you don't kill one tonight, you'll be "
"fighting it tomorrow along with its friends.\""
msgstr "\"왜 괴물들로부터 숨는 거야? 오늘 저녁에 죽이지 않는다면 내일 친구들과 죽이면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "87a1edfd-03ce-404c-b69c-16266956309e"
msgid ""
"\"I agree. I've no concern for sleep, but I require silence and repose no "
"less than the rest of you.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 자는 건 걱정하지 않지만 너희 누구보다도 더 조용한 걸 좋아해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "01d191f5-0706-4bd2-b05e-733e3a934806"
msgid "\"So, rations for lunch today? — Great! I've got dried apples!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 점심 식사로 식량 먹는 거야? 야호! 마른 사과를 먹겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "148a61d0-cfbb-4f6f-a711-34f6589b2c23"
msgid ""
"\"Why is everyone so gloomy? So we have rations for supper, big deal. Is "
"that really a good reason to be so sad?\""
msgstr "\"왜 모두 그렇게 우울해? 저녁 식량은 있다고. 왜 슬퍼하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6f70a023-4cf0-44a8-97a8-f4673b9e1b8a"
msgid "\"Without fresh meat it's not a meal. It's just crap!\""
msgstr "\"신선한 고기가 없으면 식사가 아니야. 그냥 쓰레기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "865b1e37-3334-405c-88ff-201d74ea1abe"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, times like these I miss the good old days, when a proper chef cooked "
"for me.\""
msgstr "\"오. 쉐프가 요리해줄 때가 그리워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ea02dd35-7332-459f-a325-d37aebf6c58b"
msgid ""
"\"Good grief! Even Octavia can see how many rations we've got left. I guess "
"that must mean you could count them on one hand.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 수 있어! 옥타비아도 식량이 없다고 말할 정도니. 식량이 손가락으로 셀 수 있을 정도면 말 다했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "dbec63f2-a9eb-4aa0-a096-8e043c196f40"
msgid ""
"\"The light of your heart warms those around you. Traveling with you is a "
"true pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"너는 마음이 정말 따뜻하구나. 너와 여행해서 기뻐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a83862eb-d1e9-4bd8-b585-12e1eb34729f"
msgid ""
"\"Don't let it get you down. Life is short — tomorrow any of us might be "
"joining them in the ground... Enjoy life while you can. If you're crying "
"over someone's grave, it means that no one's dancing on yours.\""
msgstr ""
"\"실망하지 마. 인생은 짧다고. 내일은 저 세상으로 갈 수도 있어. 될 수 있으면 삶을 즐겨. 누군가를 위해 울어주면 그걸로 족해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e665cde0-cb00-4ceb-aa32-c4404c860542"
msgid ""
"\"By the devil, when it's my turn to kiss the dirt, one thing will make me "
"happy. I won't have to listen to your whining, or look at your sad muzzles "
"any more! By the gods, I need a drink...\""
msgstr ""
"\"눈에 흙이 들어갈 때가 되면 한가지 사실로 행복할 거야. 네가 징징거리는 소리나 눈물흘리는 모습을 보지 않아도 된다는 사실 말이야. "
"술이 마시고 싶어지네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5c227452-7fcb-4ded-a0bf-a74be9988991"
msgid "\"Ha, well said! Sadness can take a walk. Somebody hand me a bottle!\""
msgstr "\"하. 말은 잘하네! 누가 나에게 술 좀 건네줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f2b20f9f-a24b-49a3-ab35-ebb57764e20c"
msgid "\"Your words bring only more pain. And I see that was your intent.\""
msgstr "\"네 말은 고통을 가져올 뿐이야. 하지만 네가 그러고 싶다면야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2cd6e512-f87c-44b0-b0aa-d3ad719faa31"
msgid ""
"\"Here's to death — our gracious lady! The one who will never deny you. In "
"her house, everyone has a place.\""
msgstr "\"죽음을 위해 건배! 우리 여신님은 너를 거부하지 않을 거야. 그녀의 집에는 모두에게 자리가 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "67606339-5969-47e5-b9f4-9fbe933790e7"
msgid ""
"\"Very true. It is well to hear a touch of reason from the mouths of the "
"short-lived.\""
msgstr "\"사실이야. 단명하는 사람이 하는 말 치고는 매우 맞는 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "75ebf2b9-05c0-4db9-899c-c2db01ab8e80"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh... it's like they aim at me specifically when they're sharing their "
"disgusting muck...\""
msgstr "\"그 녀석들이 역겨운 소리를 하고 있을 때 나를 두고 한 얘기 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bb3bd713-cf81-42c4-a1f7-6f49f657fdfd"
msgid ""
"\"I'm feeling sick, like I drank a barrel of trollish homebrew all by "
"myself...\""
msgstr "\"트롤이 담근 술 한 통을 마신 것처럼 머리가 아파...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ebf4fee7-cbc2-4cdd-bb37-638aa7bebbd4"
msgid ""
"\"I know you don't like it when I say this — but perhaps you'll let me "
"examine you?\""
msgstr "\"이 말을 듣기 싫어하는 건 알지만... 너를 시험해 봐도 되겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0d114e08-c362-4612-bfc6-9eec6941b7b3"
msgid "\"Save your strength. Tomorrow we move.\""
msgstr "\"힘을 비축해둬. 내일은 움직여야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3abc5155-bc8b-4375-8ca6-1998a7abd795"
msgid "\"This too shall pass.\""
msgstr "\"이 또한 지나가리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ac45b38b-3c2d-4644-955f-2d2e32ec572e"
msgid "\"Take an early night, warrior. You should get some sleep.\""
msgstr "\"일찍 자라고. 잠이 필요할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cba25e17-c0a2-4437-beb8-dc023e4cdc4d"
msgid "\"Yeah, haven't done that much in quite a while...\""
msgstr "\"그래. 잠을 잔 지 꽤 오래 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0a75d3e4-5199-454a-8246-74419b39c05e"
msgid ""
"\"I feel like I've been carrying bricks all day... And I thought I'd never "
"be a slave again, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"하루 종일 벽돌을 나른 거 같은 기분이야... 하지만 절대로 노예가 될 수는 없지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3dae882f-24be-4a3f-8a2e-7c8d16bdc2c4"
msgid "\"Don't worry about him. He's a big boy. He can take care of himself.\""
msgstr "\"그는 걱정하지 마. 다 큰 성인이니까. 자기가 알아서 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e4648e48-6dcb-4647-bfbc-06dac3090241"
msgid "\"And yet so many have it worse than we!\""
msgstr "\"그나마 우리가 나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3c0eb05a-b3f5-4432-b03f-02ae109e1bc9"
msgid ""
"\"You don't say! But all the beautiful scenery, exciting events, the people "
"we meet... All this is more than enough reward for our struggles! Right, "
"friends?\""
msgstr "\"아름다운 경치, 흥미로운 사건들과 사람들... 힘든 모험을 겪은 후의 보상이랄까! 그렇지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e7419c6b-b789-4d50-a453-a9643a859330"
msgid "\"On such days I'm glad the dead feel nothing... including fatigue.\""
msgstr "\"죽은 자는 느낄 수 없어서 기쁘다고 생각했지... 피로도 느끼지 않으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5f9da496-c118-4ba3-bdb5-47dfcc07f561"
msgid ""
"\"Ye-e-eah, ha, ha, ha, hmm... I've never spent a night in such a hellhole — "
"even when Octavia and I were on the run from the Technic League...\""
msgstr "\"그으래. 하하하. 이런 거지 같은 곳에서 자 본 적은 한번도 없는데. 기술연맹 녀석들에게서 도망칠 때도 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "03ad3077-be5e-44d2-be13-cdd2615d3fb3"
msgid ""
"\"An atmospheric place. I wouldn't recommend it to my friends though. Ha!\""
msgstr "\"분위기있는 장소인걸. 그래도 친구들에게 추천하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "87570c7c-66b5-4a33-a85e-26cdbca8488e"
msgid ""
"\"Pff. What, want a feather-bed? You should see the places I sleeped in...\""
msgstr "\"깃털 침대라도 원해? 내 잠자리를 네가 봤어야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e623013e-c85a-412f-aba2-3e60865ec1e9"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think I would choose to camp here... But {name} decided we should. "
"No doubt, {mf|he|she} had {mf|his|her} reasons.\""
msgstr "\"야영지를 선택하리라 기대하지는 않았지만... {name}이 결정자니까. 다 이유가 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "11d56140-3604-4ed2-93da-3584b4155301"
msgid ""
"\"I have no quarrel with dirt and damp. But keep your weapons close tonight."
"\""
msgstr "\"축축한 흙바닥에서 자도 뭐라 하진 않겠어. 하지만 무기는 가지고 자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1e351784-a8cf-41cf-b75b-a996709f457a"
msgid ""
"\"In times like this, I imagine that I am far, far away. Or that my friends "
"are with me — and what could be better than that?\""
msgstr "\"이런 상황이면 먼 곳에 있는 상상을 해. 아니면 친구들과 있는 상상을 하지. 이렇게라도 위안을 삼아야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "289dc8aa-bc42-4993-b496-22c0287fb40f"
msgid ""
"\"You should have seen where our camp was. So cozy! Smells there strong. "
"Lots of us always sleep because of fumes!\""
msgstr "\"우리 야영지의 위치를 네가 봤어야 했어. 정말 아늑하니까! 향기가 났어. 그 연기 때문에 거기서 잤었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b5120fbc-00a0-4dfd-ad39-9bf7402d7e7c"
msgid ""
"\"Ach... they knocked me around a bit today! But they got it far worse than "
"I did.\""
msgstr "\"어... 오늘은 그 녀석들에게 당했군. 하지만 나보다 상태가 더 안좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "54977822-cf52-457d-a73c-00acc1ad8675"
msgid "\"I got pretty thrashed today. But so did our enemies, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 꽤 심하게 맞았지만 녀석들도 엄청 당했지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6e8da7f6-e439-4403-80f1-c24b36fb3edb"
msgid ""
"\"Still, you must be more careful, Reg... I'm the one who has to mend your "
"clothes afterwards.\""
msgstr "\"그래도 더 조심해야 해. 레곤가르... 내가 네 옷을 기워서 입힌다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2fa3efc6-b56c-49de-ace4-02e109a6c19d"
msgid ""
"\"No doubt you're good in hand-to-hand. But your defense leaves much to be "
"desired. You can't stand long against an attack. You mustn't always push "
"forward, but look for the better angle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"백병전은 잘했어. 하지만 방어에 조금 더 신경을 써야 한다고. 공격을 오래 버틸 수는 없으니까. 앞으로 무리하게 나가지 말고 기회를 "
"엿보라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6386db03-24e6-4403-af35-d8a3135af7a1"
msgid "\"Don't joke with death. It never jokes with anyone.\""
msgstr "\"죽음으로 농담하지 마. 나는 누구와도 농담을 하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "337dcdc7-fa04-4a18-902b-95e4e800dd2b"
msgid ""
"\"Your courage has no rival! Truth be told, sometimes it feels not like "
"courage, but folly...\""
msgstr "\"네 용기는 가상하구나! 솔직히 용기라기보다는 만용으로 느껴져...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "14b98f89-773e-4c04-b7c6-d7abd3bba93f"
msgid ""
"\"You fought brave as greatbeast! For a longshanks, of course — no one more "
"fierce than when goblins attack!\""
msgstr "\"용감하게 싸웠다! 꺽다리 치고는 말이다. 하지만 고블린보다 더 잘 찌르는 녀석 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e62f89a7-84f8-459f-9208-b855d9bb4fd3"
msgid ""
"\"You exhaust yourself. – But it's your life and your death. But think about "
"what the party would do if it lost a fighter.\""
msgstr "\"혼자 힘빼고 있네. 하지만 죽느냐 사느냐는 네 문제야. 하지만 일행에 동료가 빠지면 전력 손실이 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2f860999-651e-4ff3-8cc3-b4807319d980"
msgid ""
"\"You exhaust yourself. – But it's your life and your death. But think about "
"what the party would do if it lost a fighter.\""
msgstr "\"혼자 힘빼고 있네. 하지만 죽느냐 사느냐는 네 문제야. 하지만 일행에 동료가 빠지면 전력 손실이 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6d3f4b9a-819d-473b-813b-cbe95cf40447"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear that, boys and girls? A few more days — and we're on a diet. "
"We're running out of food!\""
msgstr "\"방금 들었어? 며칠 뒤면 강제 다이어트야. 식량이 바닥나고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6c3f8f8a-5f7b-4efa-9593-ad00ea989a93"
msgid ""
"\"Our chief doesn't care about us — and soon we'll be walking around "
"hungry...\""
msgstr "\"우리 대장은 우리를 걱정하지 않아. 이제 점점 배고파지겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8816f7a2-f8bd-4d92-a53a-ba3f49d19bc3"
msgid ""
"\"A hungry traveler is a traveler in peril. If I'm not well-fed, I won't be "
"able to solve all the problems the world keeps dumping on us!\""
msgstr "\"배고픈 여행자는 위험에 처한 여행자야. 내가 굶으면 어려움에 처했을 때 해결할 마음이 생기지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1af761ce-85d3-4ffa-8647-bdb1ea192025"
msgid ""
"\"If we run out of meals — I can always just eat you. Ah ha ha ha hah!\""
msgstr "\"식량이 바닥나면 너를 먹으면 돼. 하하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "49f765e2-a4cd-4559-8bf2-20d63f1ea96f"
msgid "\"If you're hungry, just tell me. I'll share whatever I have.\""
msgstr "\"배가 고프면 말해. 내가 가진 것을 나눠 줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f7ac6efb-3c26-401a-8968-5abf86e1b4ed"
msgid ""
"\"Why be sad, friend? The spirit is stronger than the flesh. You of all "
"people must know this, Regongar.\""
msgstr "\"왜 슬퍼하고 있어? 육신은 영혼보다 약해. 너희 모두 알고 있어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "650bd752-5eb7-4fb1-99ac-12dd4ee1f4f3"
msgid "How could you go hungry in a land covered with lush greenery?\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 비옥한 땅에서 굶는 게 말이 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "55ad2ebb-2403-43e8-8536-0c1b67a83075"
msgid "How could you go hungry in a land covered with lush greenery?\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 비옥한 땅에서 굶는 게 말이 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1c11f0fe-b559-4673-a037-fc97d4f33337"
msgid ""
"\"A hot day. I don't remember the last time I had to cast so many spells!\""
msgstr "\"덥군. 마법을 난사했을 때도 기억이 나지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "439236df-c64c-4dd9-81fa-70587e0eff12"
msgid ""
"\"On days like this, I'm grateful to the Technic League overseers, who "
"taught me how to fight head-to-head. At least I can fight my way out of a "
"tangle, on the days that I run out of magic!\""
msgstr "\"이런 날에는 기술 연맹 녀석들에게 감사해야겠어. 육탄전하는 방법을 배운 덕에 마법이 바닥나면 대충 싸울 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a81b548a-05a2-43c1-a82a-59d7b0d7b84a"
msgid "\"I too must prepare my spells for tomorrow. Will you sit with me?\""
msgstr "\"내일을 위해 마법을 준비해야겠어. 내 옆에 앉을래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "94a86e11-b7d9-4778-9ca2-17c7b9b0767e"
msgid ""
"\"Luckily, the true traveler's arsenal includes many inexhaustible resources "
"— will power, acumen, courage... and a sense of humor, for that matter!\""
msgstr "\"다행히도 진정한 여행자는 바닥나지 않는 기운이 있어. 의지와 유머, 그리고 용기 같은 것들 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "28a5977c-bf33-497c-85ca-bfed6d21c1ec"
msgid ""
"\"From my experience, being without magic is trouble by half. But being "
"stuck without a rope or a pole in the middle of a river... That's trouble in "
"full!\""
msgstr "\"경험상 마법이 없어도 그럭저럭 견뎌. 하지만 로프 없이 강이나 구멍에 빠지면 아주 힘들어지지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b141ff80-882e-49a3-afee-48420adfd879"
msgid ""
"\"I don't complain about having to pray every day. I'm always happy to talk "
"to my god. But he answers me so rarely...\""
msgstr "\"매일 기도해도 불만하지 않아. 신에 대해 이야기하는 건 즐거워. 하지만 그는 응답을 자주 하시지는 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7e826380-a265-4d3d-bbfd-d226d618008e"
msgid ""
"\"Today our camp sits in plain view. We might get uninvited guests. Got it? "
"Don't walk around your tents naked, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 우리 야영지는 주위 경치가 좋네. 불청객이 오겠어. 그렇지? 텐트 주위에서 발가벗고 다니지 말라고. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0ed7ed26-f069-4a69-944e-77ea81a0bd31"
msgid ""
"\"You didn't disguise the camp tonight? Well, if you hear any scary sounds — "
"don't just assume it's me having fun in my tent. It might be some kind of "
"beast.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘 저녁 야영지를 은전하지 않을 거야? 이상한 소리가 들리면 내가 텐트에서 재미보고 있는 거라고 생각하지 말라구. 짐승이 소리를 "
"지르는 거일 수도 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6184b107-5a81-4d12-ac4f-8aa107966922"
msgid "[Rolls her eyes with a deep sigh]"
msgstr "[깊은 한숨을 쉬며 시선을 피합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0367023e-54cd-4578-92e9-19f41ac6b9b7"
msgid "\"Reg!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f28d21ae-2958-4bc6-ba94-2edcda09489c"
msgid "[Blushes]"
msgstr "[얼굴이 붉어집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4007f8c3-35f4-4d53-b761-ae1910beb5e7"
msgid "\"Ha.\""
msgstr "\"하아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9c3b7125-ac90-4600-9e1a-6de725b9e3da"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing to be afraid of. Any enemy who sees you naked will run for "
"the hills — and never look back!\""
msgstr "\"무서워할 것 없어. 네 발가벗은 모습을 본 적은 뒤도 보지 않고 도망칠 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5afc6a91-92f3-4551-96d7-28a27c89b177"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing to be afraid of. Any enemy who sees you naked will run for "
"the hills — and never look back!\""
msgstr "\"무서워할 것 없어. 네 발가벗은 모습을 본 적은 뒤도 보지 않고 도망칠 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0061654c-72ca-4871-99c0-d4863f1797f6"
msgid "\"Well, is anyone going hunting. We on hare diet again?\""
msgstr "\"음. 사냥하러 갈 사람 있어? 아니면 오늘도 다이어트해야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5bf198f0-9f0e-45f9-a8cf-f6e713d86b69"
msgid "\"Well, who's for dinner, ha, ha, hmm... I want meat...\""
msgstr "\"오늘 식사 담당이 누굴까. 하하하... 고기 먹고 싶다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "21fb0a67-4037-47c9-89d6-ff8c594a686a"
msgid "\"Ha. Joker. Why don't you go fry some wild boar for us.\""
msgstr "\"하하. 야생 멧돼지라도 구워주지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e7febad5-fa68-41b0-9200-8a007b7f74cf"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you think there's already enough death and pain in the world? Even "
"without killing someone just to fill your stomach?\""
msgstr "\"세상에 이미 충분한 죽음과 고통이 있다고 생각하지 않아? 뱃속을 채우기 위해 살생을 벌이겠다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b3dffdc9-c746-472d-9140-c4b7b7e40ecb"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, SO funny. It doesn't mean you're wrong though. {name}, these "
"meals stick in my throat.\""
msgstr "\"하하하. 재밌네. 그래도 네가 틀렸다는 뜻은 아니야. {name}. 이 음식들은 내 목구멍에 달라 붙어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eb4389b6-44f1-4ccb-b39a-050f1064698a"
msgid ""
"\"Chin up, Reg. These meals aren't so bad. Better than the slop we ate as "
"children...\""
msgstr "\"투정부리지 마. 레곤가르. 그렇게 맛이 나쁜 것도 아니야. 어렸을 때 먹던 거보다는 낫잖아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0846976a-a62f-4950-b4a1-02287384f65e"
msgid ""
"\"Let us raise a toast to those who fought bravely, and died a glorious "
"death.\""
msgstr "\"용감하게 싸우고 영광스러운 죽음을 맞은 이들을 위해 건배하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_DeadInParty_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "064a0afd-1ad6-44b1-be29-7ea1354a37fc"
msgid ""
"\"We should honor the memory of those who are no longer with us. Let us "
"raise our goblets.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 우리와 함께 있지 않은 사람들의 기억을 존중해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a82abf83-6fe8-4b29-a607-892f80231fc8"
msgid "\"The dead don't care what toasts we make.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 축배를 들건 말건 죽은 사람들은 상관하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c1a16ced-a0e2-487f-878d-bbae3a0421e8"
msgid ""
"\"I could tell you a few things about this peculiar ritual. But perhaps this "
"time I'd better just join the toast.\""
msgstr "\"특별한 의식에 대해 몇가지 말할 수 있지. 하지만 이번에는 그냥 건배할래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "610c824a-71f8-4f21-87f2-b5df0d4a3039"
msgid ""
"\"That's right. Here's how we honor the fallen fighters. Not with whining. "
"If I drop dead one day, drink in my honor 'til the mountains shake!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 전사한 자들을 기려야지. 슬퍼할 게 아니라. 누군가 오늘 죽었다면 코가 비뚤어질 때까지 마실 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_DeadInParty_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "49dcd222-4970-4d32-a736-7db09ecc7fcf"
msgid "\"Their feats will not be forgotten! I'll make sure of that!\""
msgstr "\"그들의 업적은 잊혀지지 않을 거야! 나는 확신해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6aa1b33e-d42d-49e9-b4aa-11870655eafc"
msgid ""
"\"I'm perfectly fine, just a bit tired. A little sleep and I'll be back on "
"my feet again.\""
msgstr "\"나는 괜찮아. 조금 피곤할 뿐이야. 조금 더 자면 기분이 괜찮아질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Debuffed_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a27ad923-2c40-4e7c-8773-62c783440061"
msgid "\"Don't look at me like that. I'm just a little out of sorts.\""
msgstr "\"그런 식으로 나를 보지 마. 조금 무리한 것 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c80d7b59-39d8-4a21-9cce-3222e393d975"
msgid ""
"\"You need help, Valerie. Stop being so proud — we can all see you're "
"suffering!\""
msgstr "\"너는 도움이 필요해. 발레리. 잘난 척 하지마. 네가 뻔히 아파보이는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c2ec7b55-7726-4321-a32c-3b159f6615a3"
msgid ""
"\"That's the spirit! Not like those southern wussies who run to the healer "
"after every sneeze!\""
msgstr "\"장하다! 기침할 때마다 치료사에게 달려가는 남부 녀석들에게서는 볼 수 없는 정신이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "48bdfd31-eb15-48ea-be98-056ca00ef04a"
msgid ""
"\"Show yourself some mercy, Valerie. Sometimes it's more important to be "
"honest about your weaknesses than it is to be brave.\""
msgstr "\"자신에게 관대해져야 해. 발레리. 가끔은 용기보다 약함을 인정하는 것이 현명해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Debuffed_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c38ed027-6efb-4cb7-8b2a-16f76cfc78de"
msgid "\"Well, you have a strong character, that's for sure.\""
msgstr "\"정신력 하나는 강하구나. 인정하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5eaa3484-b6e5-4d5a-a0e0-7d13b3bc060f"
msgid "\"It's time to lay down our heads and get some rest.\""
msgstr "\"이제 머리를 뉘이고 쉴 때다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0d596b4b-8c4d-4663-a441-a8ceaef3fbc7"
msgid "\"I'm completely exhausted.\""
msgstr "\"나는 완전히 지쳤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "35d0e50e-da7e-4954-95c2-9a3d83e20eaf"
msgid "\"It's good we can rest while our friends watch the camp.\""
msgstr "\"친구들이 야영지를 경계하고 있으니 쉬는 것이 편해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9402294b-246d-4039-96a9-947028b372ef"
msgid ""
"\"Exhaustion is good for meditation. When the body is weak, the soul is more "
"attuned.\""
msgstr "\"고갈은 명상에 좋지. 신체가 약하면 영혼이 더욱 조율돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "40472dfd-22ea-4ada-b2c7-9a2bd0119d68"
msgid ""
"\"I recommend you to start reading before you go to sleep. And for the sake "
"of all the gods of Golarion, choose some serious reading!\""
msgstr "\"잠자리에 들기 전에 독서를 하는 것이 좋아. 시간 때우지 말고 진지한 책을 읽도록.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6f69e98d-1e47-4bb9-ad7b-708cc9f3c8e1"
msgid ""
"\"I've no idea how you manage. Wearing that heavy armor all day — and you "
"always walk in front!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 어떻게 하루를 보냈는지 모르겠군. 그렇게 무거운 갑옷을 입고 앞장 서서 걷다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Fatigued_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "2a33fa94-8ba1-46ed-b155-457c61c362d5"
msgid ""
"\"You get tired so fast! That's because you longshanks. You spend too much "
"strength to move those big long legs of yours!\""
msgstr "\"너는 너무 빨리 지쳐! 그래서 네가 꺽다리라는 거다. 긴 다리로 움직이는 데 힘을 빼서 그렇다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "efd80487-2879-4b36-a6fd-a2bea6b03a17"
msgid ""
"\"We should be doubly watchful, if we're to rest in so dangerous a place.\""
msgstr "\"위험한 곳에서 쉬고 싶다면 두 배로 조심해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_InDungeon_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "48fa939e-e46a-423a-8cda-d73a7061e367"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the safest place to set camp. Keep your weapons close and your "
"eyes open.\""
msgstr "\"야영지를 설치하기에 좋은 장소는 아니군. 무기를 가까이하고 눈을 떼지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "63033c0a-85a8-469d-935f-10c2e76ff8da"
msgid ""
"\"If you care so much about our safety, wouldn't it be better if you stopped "
"talking? Who knows what attention you're attracting?\""
msgstr "\"안전이 그렇게 신경 쓰인다면 그만 지껄이지 그래? 네가 주의를 끄는 것일 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "258a49fd-6fda-45d2-8b21-20747a14f710"
msgid "\"We should choose better places for camp from now on.\""
msgstr "\"이제 야영하기에 좋은 장소를 잘 골라야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b1a9a287-c38a-49d4-b741-15658ac92078"
msgid ""
"\"A bad place for camp is where pine cones sting your butt when you sit. But "
"a dangerous place surrounded by enemies — that's a good one!\""
msgstr "\"앉을 때 엉덩이 밑에 소나무 그루터기가 찔려서 좋지 않은 야영지야. 하지만 적으로 둘러싸인 장소가 더 위험하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_InDungeon_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7ee9edf7-cbd3-4303-93fe-0de91247494d"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa! Well, if the general herself is worried, then there's sure to be "
"trouble, ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"네가 다 걱정을 하다니. 무슨 문제가 생기겠군. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6924d688-a8a7-4c0d-af03-a45e569e01cd"
msgid ""
"\"During that last fight, I barely parried a hit which might have killed me. "
"I should work more on my defensive techniques.\""
msgstr "\"저번 전투에서 치명상을 피하지 못했어. 방어 기술에 조금 더 신경 써야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowHealth_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8f97a7da-e860-4ac2-918f-639fcfb4d302"
msgid ""
"\"Many of the nobles I've had the pleasure to speak with believe that real "
"fighting is something like jousting. They wouldn't survive a minute in "
"actual battle.\""
msgstr "\"나와 친한 귀족들은 진정한 싸움이 마상 경기와 비슷하다고 생각하지. 하지만 그들은 실전에서 곧 죽어버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6420ae3d-bd76-4c5a-9332-6f7df61d4d5d"
msgid ""
"\"When you're feeling very serious, this tiny wrinkle appears on your "
"forehead… but still you remain unbelievably beautiful!\""
msgstr "\"심각하다고 생각되면 네 이마에 잔주름이 생겨... 하지만 너는 여전히 아름다워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "015b9361-6044-434a-81bf-61a4c4b770a1"
msgid ""
"\"People are so absurd! They're proud of their military valor, but still "
"afraid of death. They go to battle voluntarily — and then they beg for "
"healing, hoping that someone like me will save them from the very thing that "
"every warrior seems to crave!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 너무 어리석어! 용맹함을 자랑스러워하지만 죽음은 두려워하지. 전투에 기꺼이 나서지만 치료사에게 매달리고 나 같은 전사를 보면 "
"구해달라고 애원을 하니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b37a8a28-692c-4968-a175-01a82c821752"
msgid ""
"\"Life is a priceless gift, Valerie. You should take care of yourself — if "
"not for yourself, then at least for the sake of those who rely on you.\""
msgstr "\"인생은 귀중한 선물이야. 발레리. 네게 의존하는 사람들을 위해서라도 몸은 알아서 챙겨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowHealth_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7068d48b-c560-474e-87a8-dadb185d8e48"
msgid ""
"\"Be careful Valerie, please! Your strength and stamina are second to none, "
"but think how much a single mistake might cost!\""
msgstr "\"제발 조심해. 발레리! 네 힘과 지구력이 뛰어난 건 알겠지만 실수 하나하나가 쌓이면 피해가 크다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e86b35d0-ef19-49de-9264-1f0071a73bb7"
msgid ""
"\"We are running short of supplies. I hope there are people in this party "
"ready to hunt — or ready to go without food until we replenish our stocks.\""
msgstr "\"식량이 부족해. 일행에 사냥을 갈 사람이 필요한데. 아니면 식량 없이 공급이 올 때까지 버텨야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowRations_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "72de3822-7f29-4555-beff-ea0ffa4e127f"
msgid ""
"\"Our supplies are running low. Either we find a way to replenish our "
"provisions, or we'll have to tighten our belts.\""
msgstr "\"공급이 적어지고 있어. 식량을 보충할 방법을 찾거나 허리띠를 졸라매야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0aa030a0-7325-4010-aac6-4446cdea5fa3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I can do without food for a long time! Sometimes no one fed us slaves "
"for several days in a row!\""
msgstr "\"음식 없이 오래 버틸 수 있어! 예전에 노예일 때 며칠 동안 굶어 봤거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "710aa70c-de7d-4ae8-bb8b-2c3008f5ba27"
msgid "\"It's no fun with no chow. We should bring more next time.\""
msgstr "\"음식이 없어서 재미 없어. 다음에는 더 가져와야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f0ac124d-261d-4bb4-b48c-b39911bb659e"
msgid "\"The food will come. By the hunt or by trade.\""
msgstr "\"음식이 올 거야. 사냥이나 무역으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowRations_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3d0e87c1-624a-416f-8dbc-6d73d0fb5d54"
msgid ""
"\"The general speaks the truth. A few more days, and we'll be drinking pine "
"bark soup.\""
msgstr "\"사실을 말하고 있는 거야. 며칠 더 있으면 우리는 소나무 껍질로 만든 스프를 마셔야 하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ff00d507-da81-4fd6-aa2d-628f040c8d4e"
msgid ""
"\"Magic is such a strange thing… If you don't keep an eye on your spells, "
"the next day you may find yourself without any!\""
msgstr "\"마법은 이상한 것이야... 마법에 신경 쓰지 않으면 그 다음날에 바닥이 난다니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "16fd4ca8-2e80-421f-bcc4-cb58565b904c"
msgid ""
"\"Magic is like armor and weapons: if you don't look after it, it will "
"eventually fail you!\""
msgstr "\"마법은 갑옷과 무기와 같아. 손질하지 않으면 녹스는 것처럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6d1cb9f1-9076-4bbc-8026-ec06d9d51e22"
msgid ""
"\"Trust me, it becomes a habit in no time! Preparing your spells will be "
"routine before you know it!\""
msgstr "\"이제 곧 습관이 될걸. 마법을 준비하는 것이 일상이 되어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bab0d277-3d29-45c6-90ad-226d13797984"
msgid ""
"\"Magic is a bizarre and mysterious thing. It comes to its adepts in such "
"strange and unusual ways…\""
msgstr "\"마법은 기괴하고 신비로운 것이지. 이상한 방식으로 익숙해지지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e389ffb1-8bcb-4fd8-86cb-25b6386d7811"
msgid ""
"\"Magic, bodily strength, even faith demand constant dedication. The moment "
"you turn your back on them, they falter. It's true of all that exists in "
"this world.\""
msgstr "\"마법과 육체의 힘, 심지어 신앙도 끊임없는 헌신을 요구하지. 등을 돌리는 순간 머릿속에서 가물가물해져. 그게 진리야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5f937414-49dd-4482-9ebf-a1f2af8ead3b"
msgid ""
"\"You know, before sleep I like to recall verses from my favorite songs. "
"It's like a little ritual, and very soothing!\""
msgstr "\"저기. 잠을 자기 전에 가장 좋아하는 노래 가사를 떠올리고 싶어. 나에게는 의식을 치루는 것과 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "52dab33c-efc7-477b-a143-afcbb2699ed6"
msgid ""
"\"I never expected you to take up studying the magical arts... But you're "
"making progress!\""
msgstr "\"네가 마법 기술을 공부하리라고 기대하지는 않았어... 하지만 잘하고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_LowSpells_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3998872d-eb7b-45e7-9810-56a6d36f2117"
msgid ""
"\"I never expected you to take up studying the magical arts... But you're "
"making progress!\""
msgstr "\"네가 마법 기술을 공부하리라고 기대하지는 않았어... 하지만 잘하고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a49a1662-aad4-48a4-a0ed-2965fa3953a1"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes the carelessness of this party is cause for great concern. No "
"one even tried to hide the camp!\""
msgstr "\"때로는 부주의하는 게 이 일행의 큰 단점이야. 아무도 야영지를 은전하려 하지 않다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a196369f-9ecc-4c1d-80c3-8be486570c39"
msgid ""
"\"I once served the Swordlords. I must admit, their people would never leave "
"their camps out in the open like this!\""
msgstr "\"나는 한 때 소드로드를 섬겼어. 그들은 이렇게 개방된 장소에 야영지를 설치하지는 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "192fa03b-ce1a-4e05-835f-7eb651469022"
msgid ""
"\"You're right, it is unwise. But perhaps this is the will of Sarenrae, and "
"the light of our fire shall lead some poor soul to salvation...\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 현명하지 못한 짓이지. 하지만 이것도 서렌레이의 의지일지도. 그녀의 빛이 불쌍한 영혼들을 이끌어 구원을 얻게 하려는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f1c760ff-eba1-4110-bebf-841669871e0f"
msgid ""
"\"Screw it! I laugh in danger's face. Let 'em come — I'll knock their teeth "
"in!\""
msgstr "\"웃기지 말라고 해! 그 녀석들이 오면 비웃어주고 강냉이를 뽑아버릴 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a91756e3-a85f-440d-88ce-e8a440b32b69"
msgid ""
"\"Alright, I'll play scribe. We'll lodge your formal complaint properly, and "
"pass it on to the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}'s chancery. We do have a "
"chancery in the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}, don't we?\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 나는 글을 쓸게. 우리는 네게 불만을 적절하게 표출했고 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 법원 에게 전달했어. 도시에 가면 "
"처리해 줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "45e4761d-5e1c-4c42-8d92-6daa26363b55"
msgid ""
"\"Ha. Give those war dogs free rein, and they'll give us military order "
"every waking moment. You'll have us doing drills on the training ground!\""
msgstr "\"하. 그 전쟁에 미친 개들을 자유롭게 풀어줘. 우리는 군대에 비상이라고 전달할 테니. 이것도 다 훈련이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c7f3b676-f72b-436d-ad9f-286d0a633384"
msgid ""
"\"Bravery and carelessness are two sides of the same coin. Maybe our leader "
"thinks we can handle whatever comes our way!\""
msgstr "\"용기와 부주의는 동전의 양면과 같지. 아마 우리 지도자는 우리가 무슨 일이 있어도 괜찮을 거라 생각하나봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoBuilding_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1a672044-72be-4b21-a946-486412852ad3"
msgid ""
"\"Bravery and carelessness are two sides of the same coin. Maybe our leader "
"thinks we can handle whatever comes our way!\""
msgstr "\"용기와 부주의는 동전의 양면과 같지. 아마 우리 지도자는 우리가 무슨 일이 있어도 괜찮을 거라 생각하나봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e961edb4-7c72-423d-9cc5-123c58b8b27f"
msgid ""
"\"Why does no one go hunting? If someone is expecting me to do it, they'll "
"be sorely disappointed!\""
msgstr "\"왜 아무도 사냥을 가지 않지? 내가 사냥을 갈 거라고 생각하나본데 웃기지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_FirstPhrase.Array.data[1]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d0203c83-9b86-4d6a-9df4-5b3644bf4d37"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't say no to a bowl of tasty stew. It's a shame no one is going to "
"hunt.\""
msgstr "\"맛있는 스튜가 있다면 묵묵히 있겠어. 아무도 사냥을 가지 않다니 실망스럽군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "15564bad-b16f-4dfd-b78b-274710346304"
msgid ""
"\"I've more important thing to do than crawl through the brush in search of "
"rabbits and deer!\""
msgstr "\"나는 돌아다니며 토끼나 사슴을 찾는 일보다 중요한 용무가 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0c16daf5-ef82-43ff-8c2c-a32a5fd61fdd"
msgid ""
"\"We could set a snare. Though I doubt we could ever actually catch anything "
"here.\""
msgstr "\"올가미를 놓자. 이런 곳에서 효과가 있을지는 모르지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d3efd4d0-0056-477d-976a-8bff9ce1f33b"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like it when you behave like this. We're your friends, not your "
"servants or slaves.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이런 식으로 행동할 때가 싫더라. 우리는 네 친구지 종이나 노예가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f8201500-957c-471b-b70a-f45dcf72f8c6"
msgid "\"Affirmative! I'll get right on it, Your Excellency...\""
msgstr "\"인정! 맞사옵니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "604295e8-ecc7-4a8b-a31e-49ad04883877"
msgid ""
"\"Not me! That last time when I brought that fat tasty toad, you all made "
"mean faces... Nok-Nok never good hunter!\""
msgstr "\"나 말고! 내가 저 뚱뚱한 두꺼비를 데려왔을 때 네 표정이 어땠는지 너는 모르겠지... 녹-녹은 좋은 사냥꾼이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "245f8c94-969b-4eeb-a427-9296428ccf2a"
msgid ""
"\"Agreed! Can't any of you find food? It must be plentiful in such fertile "
"lands!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 누가 가서 음식 좀 구해오지? 이런 비옥한 땅에서 음식도 많을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Mechanics/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_NoHunting_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c35a8f24-32b2-486c-b8d0-0f45ff59f9a5"
msgid ""
"\"Agreed! Can't any of you find food? It must be plentiful in such fertile "
"lands!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 누가 가서 음식 좀 구해오지? 이런 비옥한 땅에서 음식도 많을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_1H_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "df68e4a0-9ddd-47ba-b8da-41540b06a51c"
msgid ""
"\"Another button's lost… And this patch — it just won't hold, the threads "
"are already wearing out… Torag, oh, Torag, why do you treat mortals in such "
"a malevolent way...\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 버튼을 잃어버리다니... 이 꿰맨 곳에 실이 또 풀렸네... 토락이시여. 오. 토락이시여. 왜 이렇게 필멸자를 괴롭히시나이까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_2A_String
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6304ddad-fa1a-4cd3-be29-621fd057da76"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, baldy! Which god do you worship, Torag or this skull crap of yours?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 대머리! 누구를 섬기는 거야? 토락이야 아니면 이 해골바가지야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_3H_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "acf16c28-5379-4ec4-a229-3d64132d60e2"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean? What are you talking about, wild woman? Of course, I "
"worship Groetus — he's the closure of all beginnings, he sums up all the "
"efforts, he forebodes the end times!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 소리야? 네가 무슨 말을 하는지 알기나 해? 물론 나는 그로투스를 숭배하지. 그는 시작을 끝내고 모든 노력의 결과물이며 종말을 "
"예언하니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_4A_String
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e5bba9b6-6878-4f7c-a722-ee7a50e15022"
msgid ""
"\"Then why do you keep bleating about Torag? It's sickening! You whine about "
"him, like a lad about the girl who dumped him! And nothing about your "
"Groetus!\""
msgstr "\"그런데 왜 토락을 지껄이는 거야? 지겨워 죽겠네! 마치 사랑에 빠진 애송이처럼 지껄이잖아! 그로투스에게 기도는 안하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_5H_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f58de5f7-9ed5-4743-850d-a705f9e0f6e5"
msgid ""
"\"Groetus does not care to be talked about, Amiri. He waits in silence, "
"quiet and relentless.\""
msgstr "\"그로투스는 자신의 이름이 언급되는 것을 싫어해. 그저 침묵 속에서 조용히 기다릴 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_6A_String
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e1f3ee40-29b4-4a22-b071-3ed17f5a199d"
msgid ""
"\"No wonder barely a handful of freaks worship him in all Golarion. What "
"kind of a god sits on his ass in some remote corner of the universe? Gorum's "
"much better! His children bring thunder and fun!\""
msgstr ""
"\"골라리온에서 그런 사이비를 믿는 녀석은 없을 거야. 무슨 신이 한구석에 앉아서 질펀히 기다리고 있지? 고룸이 훨씬 나아. 그의 자손은 "
"번개를 쓰고 아주 멋지지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_7H_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d2849a90-6a61-441d-9d10-e5f9ade2f469"
msgid ""
"\"The thunder subsides and those having fun pass away… What do they leave "
"behind? Just ashes and bones... So in the end your Gorum doesn't differ much "
"from my Groetus.\""
msgstr "\"벼락이 치고 멋있어 봐야... 어디에 쓸 건데? 그냥 찌릿할 뿐이지. 고름과 그로투스는 다르지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/OldBigBanter/Harrim_Amiri/Cue_AH_8A_String
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7f6a6243-c2a3-4caa-980b-a3f886c67478"
msgid ""
"\"No, but… Well, he… To hells with you and your babble! Ugh! No sense "
"arguing with a cleric!\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 하지만... 웃기지마! 이 성직자 놈이랑 얘기하는 것도 질리는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_AfterOldCyclopsTomb_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "cf909a0d-37f8-434a-a1a5-84aeacb8468e"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like Tartuccio wasn't here for the Stag Lord. I don't know what he "
"is up to, but I know what I'll do when I catch that snotty little saucebox..."
"\""
msgstr "\"타투치오가 수사슴 군주를 기다린 것 같지는 않아. 무얼 하려는지는 모르겠지만 그 조그만 녀석을 잡고 싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_AfterOldCyclopsTomb_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0748c6f6-23e6-4956-bce0-a2a9b2723396"
msgid ""
"\"It's curious that he wasn't concerned about the bandits and their chief. "
"Something's wrong here...\""
msgstr "\"그가 산적이나 그의 대장을 두려워하지 않는지 궁금하군. 뭔가 이상해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_AfterOldCyclopsTomb_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "81d17463-be4d-4d1b-a277-ec43c9bf98c8"
msgid "\"Whatever he's up to, we should stop him.\""
msgstr "\"그가 무엇을 하든지 우리는 그를 막아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_AfterOldCyclopsTomb_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f791bef7-b6e4-4635-a910-701374a3d648"
msgid ""
"\"That gnome is a slippery snake. But spineless sneaks rarely work for "
"themselves. They always need someone to take orders from...\""
msgstr "\"그 움은 미꾸라지 같은 녀석이야. 하지만 그들을 위해서 행동하지는 않아. 그들은 항상 명령을 해야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_StaglordHelmet_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e37c6134-3409-4dec-bb4e-eec4eccdcd6f"
msgid ""
"\"...bite me, you greedy bastards! I don't care. I never wanted your crappy "
"helmet!\""
msgstr "\"... 웃기지 마. 이 욕심쟁이들! 나는 상관 없어. 네 요상한 투구 따위는 더더욱!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_StaglordHelmet_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ac5b3e21-8b67-4b0c-9d2f-f501f375ef8e"
msgid ""
"\"There's no point in being bitter, Amiri. {name} will decide who will wear "
"the Stag Lord's helm. {mf|He|She} is our leader. It's up to {mf|him|her}\"."
msgstr ""
"\"신경 쓰지 마. 아미리. {name}의 결정으로 수사슴 군주의 투구를 쓸 자가 선택될 거야. 우리 지도자의 말을 기다리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_StaglordHelmet_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f225b70a-1915-4d3d-978a-24971ff3228d"
msgid ""
"\"Aha, ha, ha! Don't sulk, Amiri! I'm sure {name} will hear your wishes "
"about the Stag Lord's helm.\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 삐지지 마. 아미리! {name}에게 말하면 수사슴 군주의 투구를 줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C11_StaglordHelmet_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c101ecbc-f463-46e3-9b41-f44490392832"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, why the devil should we argue over who will get the Stag Lord's "
"helmet?! We haven't even defeated him yet!\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 왜 우리가 수사슴 군주의 투구를 가지고 싸워야 하지? 아직 쓰러뜨리지도 않았는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_AfterDelicateSituation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d9fb2480-bdbf-49cb-b42a-3c2dbd5f6d00"
msgid ""
"\"That frog thing in the lake... watcha call it... it's weird — something "
"green and slimy messing with so many people's heads!\""
msgstr "\"호수에 있는 그 개구리는... 뭐랄까... 녹색에 수많은 사람들의 머리가 비비면서 기분 나쁘게 미끈거렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_AfterDelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8ffd3cf3-defd-4d36-a04f-5f8782075d2a"
msgid ""
"\"The fey have their own ways of dealing with mortals. Take care not to get "
"caught by such a frog yourself!\""
msgstr "\"fey는 필멸자를 다루는 방법을 알지. 그런 개구리가 있다면 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_AfterDelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ce85c754-5ea4-4aa7-8675-ebfde7103231"
msgid ""
"\"Nixies are famous tricksters. And I've heard they drown any victims who "
"resist their tricks.\""
msgstr "\"닉시는 유명한 장난꾸러기들이지. 그들은 장난을 받아들이지 않는 녀석들을 괴롭힌다고 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_AfterDelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5c2e02e1-a8f1-4195-bdc2-ef9d07d3f003"
msgid ""
"\"The nixie's ridiculous appearance has always filled me with disgust and "
"curiosity at the same time. I wonder what kind of zombies they'd make...\""
msgstr "\"닉시의 우스꽝스러운 모습은 항상 역겨우면서 호기심을 일으켰지. 좀비로 만들면 어떻게 생겼을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_AfterDelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f95f31ae-206c-45b7-88dc-2c8196d4cab9"
msgid ""
"\"I've never met a fey before – but now I see they're more dangerous than "
"genies. That tiny water girl subdued those wood-cutters so easily!\""
msgstr "\"fey를 만나 본 적은 없지만 정령보다 더 위험하다는 걸 알겠어. 그 조그만 녀석이 우드커터를 손쉽게 이기다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_AfterDelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ef16a986-8833-4669-8daf-33800d63988c"
msgid ""
"\"I've never met a fey before – but now I see they're more dangerous than "
"genies. That tiny water girl subdued those wood-cutters so easily!\""
msgstr "\"fey를 만나 본 적은 없지만 정령보다 더 위험하다는 걸 알겠어. 그 조그만 녀석이 우드커터를 손쉽게 이기다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_HodagDefeat_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "611c3ab6-1944-442d-b5c3-eb54c908c634"
msgid ""
"\"Actually, that hodag wasn't so tough. — Though it was fat like a beached "
"whale. But compared to giants it was just a pile of crap.\""
msgstr "\"그 녀석은 그렇게 강한 녀석이 아니었어. 해수 고래처럼 뚱뚱했어도 약골이었지. 거인에 비교하면 별것 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_HodagDefeat_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ab45432b-f441-4264-b3fa-705723122519"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think we'll find many giants in these parts. But you know what — "
"trolls are their distant relatives. You could certainly practice killing "
"them.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 많은 거인을 찾을 수 있을지 모르겠군. 트롤은 그들의 먼 친척이다. 그들을 죽이며 연습을 해도 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_HodagDefeat_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6b35d739-6c2f-4e82-b803-5d5619db6d2f"
msgid "\"I'd love to see a real giant! But fight one? I think I'll pass!\""
msgstr "\"진짜 거인을 보고 싶어! 하지만 싸워야 해? 나는 괜찮아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_HodagDefeat_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "29bc563e-1a38-49e9-ac38-ab8d97e47f9f"
msgid ""
"\"By the way, you promised me two weeks ago that you'd tell me everything "
"about your fight with the giants! Now don't think you'll get away with "
"changing the subject like the last time. Go on! Start talking... Amiri? "
"Amiri?! Ugh, damn stubborn barbarians!\""
msgstr ""
"\"2주 전에 거인과의 싸웠던 이야기를 해주겠다고 했잖아! 저번처럼 대화 주제를 바꿀 생각은 마. 어서 이야기를 해 보실까? "
"아미리...? 아미리?! 고집불통 야만인 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_RiverFreedoms_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3fb812cf-770c-4dec-907e-b7f248ed28fa"
msgid "\"I've heard the locals talking 'bout some Water Rules.\""
msgstr "\"여기 주민들이 물의 규칙에 대해 말하는 것을 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_RiverFreedoms_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b0486601-139a-4cad-b842-1dfbc912cf15"
msgid ""
"\"You're talking about River Freedoms, Amiri. It's the unified set of "
"unwritten laws that the people of the Stolen Lands live by. I've heard the "
"locals talking about them too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 강의 자유예요, 아미리. 도둑맞은 땅에 사는 사람들이 지키는 불문율을 모아놓은 거죠. 저도 주민들이 얘기하는 걸 들어봤어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_RiverFreedoms_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "04711766-c379-4ce4-8c9d-437dc0fff196"
msgid ""
"\"The Six River Freedoms, the laws of the Stolen Lands. It's a curious "
"example of self-imposed legislation. For example, sneaky burglary here is "
"considered a much more serious felony than honest robbery. A tough place "
"makes for a tough people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"강의 여섯 자유, 도둑맞은 땅의 법이야. 자연스럽게 법이 생겨난 흥미로운 예이지. 예를 들어 여기에서 주거 침입 도둑은 강탈죄를 "
"저지른 강도보다 더 심한 벌을 받아. 험한 지형에서 사람들이 험해진 경우야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C21_RiverFreedoms_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3979b01f-0b55-4543-9231-3f8982e49ba4"
msgid ""
"\"You probably mean the River Freedoms. They're the traditional laws of the "
"River Kingdoms. By the way, the first of them guarantees freedom of speech — "
"though some rulers don't give a damn about it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"강의 왕국들의 자유의 법을 말하는 것이겠지. 강의 왕국들의 전통법이야. 몇몇 통치자는 신경쓰지 않더라도 처음의 법은 자유를 보장했어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_AfterGoblinVillage_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a9aec7a3-741b-4478-9983-86875ce856e1"
msgid "\"Did you see that goblin king's wolf? That was one impressive beast!\""
msgstr "\"고블린 왕의 늑대를 보았어? 정말 인상적이던데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_AfterGoblinVillage_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3f8fbb83-76d4-41f3-bf03-13aea1f32c7d"
msgid ""
"\"Hm... The beast's hide would make a luxurious carpet! Too bad I have no "
"place to put it, or I'd think very carefully on the matter...\""
msgstr "\"그 짐승의 가죽은 고급 카펫의 재료로 딱이겠던데. 카펫을 놓을 거실이 없어서 안타깝군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_AfterGoblinVillage_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e058094f-9b8f-4c17-9a81-814f33307e54"
msgid "\"I wonder about its favorite food. Disobedient relatives, perhaps?\""
msgstr "\"가장 좋아하는 음식이 뭘까? 말을 듣지 않는 친척일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_AfterGoblinVillage_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "37bd7f6c-b944-4c42-ab4d-2e1e6161067b"
msgid ""
"\"I haven't the slightest idea how the goblins tame them! Where did they get "
"the sense to do it? One can only imagine it was some sort of divine "
"intervention...\""
msgstr "\"고블린들이 그들을 어떻게 길들였을까! 어떻게 그럴 생각을 할 수가 있지? 아마도 신이 돕지 않고서야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_AfterGoblinVillage_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "78cd6401-9ff7-45a2-8a09-aeb6429ad82c"
msgid ""
"\"Great beast all right! A Hero should ride it, not some shatshank like "
"goblin king!\""
msgstr "\"정말 대단한 짐승이야! 고블린 같은 반쪽 짜리가 아니라 영웅이 타야 어울릴 짐승인데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "43d04c5e-0fae-45eb-aa0f-62ef9f8b5a31"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone keeps talking about monsters! Talk, talk, talk. Me — I can't wait "
"for another fight!\""
msgstr "\"모두가 괴물에 대해 이야기하고 있어! 그만 나불대면 좋겠다. 어서 다음 싸움이 시작되었으면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e245011c-36ab-4ac7-b546-0aed725e9e5e"
msgid ""
"\"The more troubles fate deals us, the merrier you become. Such unrivaled "
"harmony you share with these treacherous lands.\""
msgstr "\"운명에 시련이 많을 수록 더 행복한 거야. 비할데 없는 조화를 이런 위험한 땅에서 누리는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dab38a4f-eb71-497a-81d5-2b762114b493"
msgid ""
"\"I'm ready as well. Protecting the barony from all manner of threats is "
"truly a noble calling.\""
msgstr "\"나도 준비가 됐어. 모든 위험으로부터 남작을 지키는 건 고귀한 임무야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "19ebfc51-e2cb-4fa2-b5d2-b94c9426d4ee"
msgid "\"Ha. Barbarians.\""
msgstr "\"하하. 야만인들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c40f14db-67f7-485f-a347-8768697b6f59"
msgid ""
"\"The monsters are probably telling their little children frightening tales "
"about you!\""
msgstr "\"괴물들이 자기 자식들에게 너에 대한 무시무시한 이야기를 들려줄 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "cba3f757-25d0-4026-b893-bf9c22e503d6"
msgid ""
"\"The monsters are probably telling their little children frightening tales "
"about you!\""
msgstr "\"괴물들이 자기 자식들에게 너에 대한 무시무시한 이야기를 들려줄 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "24a557dd-e554-4d82-85e2-a02025595585"
msgid ""
"\"Ughhh, I didn't like that masked witch. Who are these Defaced Sisters, "
"anyway? Why would fierce warriors crawl through dungeons on their say, "
"instead of fighting and hunting?\""
msgstr ""
"\"어차피 그 가면 쓴 마녀 맘에 안 들었어. 얼굴 잃은 자매. 그게 대체 뭔데? 사나운 전사들한테 던전 탐험이나 시키고. 싸움이나 "
"사냥에 보낼 것이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "622c7f0f-e47f-4994-a2b6-c54ad25e2fd5"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard of them before either. Perhaps they're some new religious "
"order? It is indeed strange that the barbarians would obey them.\""
msgstr "\"그들에 대해 들어 본 적이 없어. 아마도 새로운 종교 단체인가? 야만인들이 그들을 섬긴다는 게 정말 이상해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6f8e938a-91c9-42c9-a74a-98f1a64aa5a0"
msgid ""
"\"She gave the feeling of something... familiar to me. Grief, and darkness.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 나에게 익숙한 느낌을 주었어. 슬픔과 어둠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c62fed90-8340-4b26-902b-a41504eddb3a"
msgid "\"One thing is sure. They did not tell us all they know.\""
msgstr "\"한 가지는 확실해. 그들은 모든 사실을 우리에게 말하지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7fe4b891-fe37-48d1-b1a2-bc4c27762525"
msgid ""
"\"I feel the Defaced Sisters share some terrible grief. What could make "
"these women reject their names and their faces?\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매들은 끔찍한 슬픔을 공유하는 거 같아. 어째서 자신의 이름과 얼굴을 버렸을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "227891cf-2b4c-46e0-b089-c544644f712d"
msgid ""
"\"I feel the Defaced Sisters share some terrible grief. What could make "
"these women reject their names and their faces?\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매들은 끔찍한 슬픔을 공유하는 거 같아. 어째서 자신의 이름과 얼굴을 버렸을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c124edad-1aca-4441-a73d-abac956b166e"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like this whole Bloom Season! What if that scoundrel we saw in the "
"First World wants to grow another flower?\""
msgstr "\"나는 이렇게 꽃피는 계절이 싫어! 태초 세계에서 봤던 악당들이 다른 꽃을 기르고 싶어한다면 어떻게 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "475e6592-bb48-472e-aac6-8b80b4d328ab"
msgid ""
"\"I... don't think that is likely to happen. Creating a second Everblooming "
"Flower would require far too much effort.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 일어날 가능성이 희박하다고 생각해. 또 다시 영원히 피는 꽃을 키운다는 건 불가능에 가까워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4cde1de8-5cb3-4a00-881c-03f61cea9981"
msgid ""
"\"I agree. I prefer an honest fight — and I dislike the unknown. Enemies who "
"stab you in the back, with the help of alien magic.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 나라면 정정당당히 싸우겠어. 그 녀석들이 싫어. 이상한 마법의 도움으로 네 등에 칼을 꽂은 녀석들 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0d4e989f-57b0-4488-adba-158a866d598c"
msgid "\"It would be less amusing, the second time.\""
msgstr "\"또 그러면 별로 재미있지는 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ba414757-1231-425f-9b4a-b2784e7bab37"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about his motives. Snot-nosed Tristian betrayed us. I'll "
"never forget it.\""
msgstr "\"그의 동기는 신경 쓰지 않아. 트리스티안이 우리를 배신했어. 나는 잊지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "641b42e9-21b0-4628-abbb-385d75a07f88"
msgid "\"Your anger is fully justified. A traitor can have no forgiveness.\""
msgstr "\"네가 화낼 만도 해. 그런 반역자에게 용서는 사치야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "aa759d89-51a9-4f7c-9fd1-54b955711dcc"
msgid ""
"\"It's no surprise his vaunted principles were meaningless even to him.\""
msgstr "\"그가 자랑하던 원칙들이 이제 그에게는 무의미하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1445b663-50d5-498b-9e98-a3df4d3401ca"
msgid ""
"\"He's walked a difficult road. If fate brought you or me to such a place — "
"who knows if we could do any better.\""
msgstr "\"그는 어려운 길을 걸었어. 운명이 너나 나를 이렇게 이끌었다면 노력으로 바꿀 수도 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "89b147a7-4ab6-4e22-b898-6ea53b643b3d"
msgid ""
"\"Pffft! Betrayed, schmetrayed... our kind betrays each other three times "
"before dinner!\""
msgstr "\"쳇! 배신자 녀석. 우리 종족은 저녁을 먹기 전에 세번은 배신하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "bfaea503-be48-4b75-97c1-a04312ddd72c"
msgid ""
"\"It's no wonder he betrayed us. What's surprising is that we trusted him in "
"the first place!\""
msgstr "\"그가 우리를 배신한 건 분명해. 처음에 그를 믿었다니. 우리는 바보야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_AfterTristiansBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "568000d1-82f8-4b9e-aada-6dd3abe1e08f"
msgid ""
"\"It's no wonder he betrayed us. What's surprising is that we trusted him in "
"the first place!\""
msgstr "\"그가 우리를 배신한 건 분명해. 처음에 그를 믿었다니. 우리는 바보야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "50badd46-09a1-4700-8ed0-e816c7dfb88c"
msgid ""
"\"Damn it! It's like I never left the tribe. How far do I have to go before "
"I'm not running into Kellids on every hill?!\""
msgstr "\"젠장! 내가 부족 놈들과 계속 함께했었군. 켈리드를 찾으러 모든 산을 뒤져야 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0a598b5a-0916-46f8-866f-7720bf96139a"
msgid ""
"\"The past is an enchanted place. Those who run from it, run in circles. "
"Those who would leave it behind, flee into it as it chases them.\""
msgstr "\"과거는 매혹적인 공간이지. 도망치려고 해도 쳇바퀴 돌듯 돌 뿐이야. 과거를 묻으려는 녀석들은 과거에 오히려 쫓기게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c65a17cd-0709-46bf-b52b-9d938bbd3414"
msgid ""
"\"The more you think about it, the more confused you get. Why don't you have "
"a drink and get some sleep. And when someone reminds you of something you'd "
"rather forget, twist their heads off. Let them run from you, ha ha...\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각을 많이 하면 더 복잡해지기 마련이야. 냉수 좀 마시고 잠 좀 자. 네가 잊으려 하는 걸 남이 기억하면 그들도 돌아버릴 거야. "
"알아서 도망가게 두라고. 하하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ec47fdaf-3d85-4870-94cf-53bfaa434714"
msgid ""
"\"I tried to escape my past for a time, but I couldn't take a single step "
"away. Until I realized no actual walking was necessary.\""
msgstr "\"나는 한 동안 과거를 피하려고 했지만 한 걸음도 물러 설 수 없었어. 하지만 피할 필요가 전혀 없었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "bc10e8d6-63e8-4599-8e3a-d34078df3595"
msgid ""
"\"You wouldn't meet any in Kelesh. But I don't think you'd like my tribe any "
"better than your own.\""
msgstr "\"케레시에서 사람을 만나지 않는 게 좋아. 우리 부족을 만나면 싫어할걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C41_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "24b51f7c-f3ef-4968-8eb2-d6aeb393d4b7"
msgid ""
"\"You wouldn't meet any in Kelesh. But I don't think you'd like my tribe any "
"better than your own.\""
msgstr "\"케레시에서 사람을 만나지 않는 게 좋아. 우리 부족을 만나면 싫어할걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "87c69d1f-e0de-4d4e-b32a-6bdaa4946efa"
msgid ""
"\"A true warrior fights in the open. Irovetti attacks on the sly — this "
"means he is afraid!\""
msgstr "\"진정한 전사는 트인 곳에서 싸우지. 이로베티가 기습을 하곤 하는데 그녀석이 겁쟁이라서 그런 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6ed80d07-26fc-4b79-a38e-fff6805f711b"
msgid "\"Or he has more than two wrinkles on his brain...\""
msgstr "\"아니면 두뇌에 주름을 다림질하듯 펴버린 것이거나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "522e86b1-3efc-4d42-982f-7af3256461aa"
msgid "\"Right. He knows his troops won't hold up in a major battle.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 그의 군대가 대규모 전투에서 멈추지 않을 것을 그는 알고 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "048b0c96-34c7-4088-a5c2-84365dedc835"
msgid "\"A true warrior is the one who always wins. Whatever it takes.\""
msgstr "\"진정한 전사는 패배를 모르는 법이지. 어떤 상황이라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_RushlightTournament_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c974243f-dcad-4a0d-8e15-ca9bb56a2f88"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah! They know how to feast at the Rushlight Tournament! When's the next "
"one?!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 러시라이트 토너먼트를 즐길 줄 아는 녀석들이군! 다음은 언제야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_RushlightTournament_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "57408f5f-17a9-414a-924f-d24c364a380b"
msgid "\"Too soon...\""
msgstr "\"너무 빨리...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_RushlightTournament_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "98afce8f-354e-4846-8d19-3ce09c2f95ad"
msgid "\"Primitive entertainment for peasantry and savages.\""
msgstr "\"농민과 야만인을 위한 원시적인 오락.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_RushlightTournament_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "671d9a6a-797f-43a5-bef0-90c2d0a9e603"
msgid "\"Whenever it is, I'm definitely coming with you!\""
msgstr "\"나는 항상 너를 따라다닐 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_RushlightTournament_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2dde8d63-c266-4045-8220-742c6710b008"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti's entertainments are crude... But still, I must admit, they are "
"not without a certain barbaric charm. When will we attend another holiday in "
"these lands so full of life?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 취미는 고약해... 그들은 야만적인 것을 좋아해. 언제 이렇게 삶으로 가득한 휴일을 즐겨보겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_C51_RushlightTournament_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "809e6311-69e1-4bfb-a88c-8f6ba1a59201"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti's entertainments are crude... But still, I must admit, they are "
"not without a certain barbaric charm. When will we attend another holiday in "
"these lands so full of life?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 취미는 고약해... 그들은 야만적인 것을 좋아해. 언제 이렇게 삶으로 가득한 휴일을 즐겨보겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "185f57b9-9eca-4032-b7c7-45320e25ab23"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Why is it so quiet? Aren't we going to toast and drink in the name of "
"our chief?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이렇게 조용해? 족장의 이름으로 건배를 하자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Amiri/Banter_Amiri_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9af4ee17-35a7-405c-bc89-c4c457e98985"
msgid ""
"\"A birthday is a good day, {name}! Time to count all the great fights you "
"had this year, all the beasts and monsters you've killed! I wish you one "
"thing: may you never see a day when you turn around and there's nothing "
"exciting to remember!\""
msgstr ""
"\"생일은 좋은 날이야. {name}! 올해 네가 치룬 모든 싸움과 해치운 모든 괴물을 기념하며! 언제나 즐거움만을 기억하기를 바랄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_AfterTartukAndTrollsEvent_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2074ac8e-0795-47aa-93a8-4025d82ffeb2"
msgid ""
"\"Knew all my life that trolls fear fire. One more thing that's changed.\""
msgstr "\"트롤들이 불을 두려워한다는 것을 오래 전에 알았지. 하지만 그것도 옛날 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_AfterTartukAndTrollsEvent_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "846e042f-8f71-4e9b-aba2-5dad9bf1324a"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry on that account — we always can resort to acid. We just have "
"to make sure we keep enough among our supplies.\""
msgstr "\"걱정하지 마. 우리는 산성에 의지하면 돼. 보급만 충분히 보충하면 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_AfterTartukAndTrollsEvent_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "50268c5b-6f78-4c90-8225-eac67885d40c"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder how will this influence their culture... Will they begin cooking "
"on open fires? Or gather around the bonfire to sit and chat in the evening, "
"like we do? I've a scientist friend who'd be thrilled at such questions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것이 그들의 문화에 어떤 영향을 미칠지 궁금하군... 그들은 모닥불에 요리를 했을까? 아니면 옹기종기 모여서 수다를 떨며 요리를 "
"했을까? 이런 걸 연구하는 친구가 하나 있는데 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_AfterTartukAndTrollsEvent_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0d0cd21d-5bfd-462e-bba4-0c9e33e5f3e1"
msgid ""
"\"Almost invincible... They know no pity, need no food — until there are "
"enough enemy corpses around... Such warriors are priceless.\""
msgstr "\"무적이군... 자비도 없고 식량도 필요 없고. 주위에는 적들의 시체가 쌓여있고... 대단한 전사다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_AfterTartukAndTrollsEvent_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b5fce390-e227-4b3e-b563-cc40d538e8a9"
msgid ""
"\"Only one who carries fire inside them can truly learn not to fear it. And "
"as for trolls... We just need more fire, that's all.\""
msgstr "\"내면에 불을 지닌 자들이 두려워하지 않는 법을 배워. 트롤들에게 맞서기 위해... 우리는 불이 더 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_AfterTartukAndTrollsEvent_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "168ae98a-3ef1-4daa-ab58-03b3624413ed"
msgid ""
"\"Only one who carries fire inside them can truly learn not to fear it. And "
"as for trolls... We just need more fire, that's all.\""
msgstr "\"내면에 불을 지닌 자들이 두려워하지 않는 법을 배워. 트롤들에게 맞서기 위해... 우리는 불이 더 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_QuestLostChild_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e819ae18-ed35-4b58-9454-be96b707015a"
msgid "\"The Narlmarches is no place for a little boy. Too many dangers.\""
msgstr "\"날마치는 꼬맹이에겐 너무 위험한 장소다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_QuestLostChild_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6ad938f6-5371-4f2c-8330-9822f67e2e68"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what's hidden in the heart of these swamps... Will we ever know?\""
msgstr "\"이 늪의 중심부에 숨어있는 것이 무엇인지 궁금해. 우리가 알 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_QuestLostChild_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0ca9ded5-df56-452c-9efd-050ff080b975"
msgid ""
"\"Keep your spirits up, Ekun. Soon we'll come to the unfortunate child's "
"rescue.\""
msgstr "\"기운 차려. 에쿤. 곧 우리는 그 불운한 아이를 구할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_QuestLostChild_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5967fa7a-2f72-46a0-b368-519213ee2c71"
msgid ""
"\"He'll be all right, you'll see! Children aren't nearly as helpless as some "
"adults — and they often think much faster.\""
msgstr "\"그는 괜찮을거야. 어떤 아이들은 어른처럼 대견해서 판단이 빠르기도 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b801a771-2417-496d-b192-2ef044922343"
msgid ""
"\"I heard that somewhere, in other lands, there live kobolds with golden "
"scales.\""
msgstr "\"나는 어딘가에서 황금 피부 코볼트가 살고 있다고 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8a1c31a7-ea09-4193-9c8b-b769cadf56fe"
msgid ""
"\"Gold, blue, red... who cares? They are all the same: little gutless beasts!"
"\""
msgstr "\"황금이던 파랗던 뻘겋던... 무슨 상관이야? 다 똑같이 겁 없는 짐승일 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response_1
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "72324406-757d-4468-b3fb-8ec71c0644fa"
msgid ""
"\"Golden kobolds? Could they be distant relatives of golden dragons? What do "
"you think?\""
msgstr "\"황금 코볼트? 골드 드래곤의 먼 친척일까? 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response_1
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f5abf655-e342-41ca-a376-74045ce141e8"
msgid ""
"\"You know, just because you heard it in a song... you know... You can't "
"trust all the bards, Ekun. Some of us get carried away and just say whatever "
"sounds good. But of course I myself always mind what I write!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 노래에서 들었다시피... 모든 음유시인을 믿을 수는 없어. 에쿤. 우리는 노래를 잘 꾸며야 하거든. 하지만 나는 사실대로 쓰려고 "
"노력하고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "cf012b5f-1ffe-4403-a994-fbc24da1e2f9"
msgid ""
"\"The miracles they recount in distant lands... The farther the land is, the "
"more amazing its wonders!\""
msgstr "\"먼 땅에서 벌어진 기적들... 먼 곳일 수록 불가사의한 일이 더 많이 일어나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "bec518a4-2222-4c14-8683-2810629c105a"
msgid ""
"\"The miracles they recount in distant lands... The farther the land is, the "
"more amazing its wonders!\""
msgstr "\"먼 땅에서 벌어진 기적들... 먼 곳일 수록 불가사의한 일이 더 많이 일어나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "dfb75d62-040a-42a9-9920-d109127d5352"
msgid ""
"\"I've always believed that everyone carries an animal inside. Now I see "
"these animals struggling to come out.\""
msgstr "\"나는 모든 사람이 내면에 동물이 있다고 믿어. 그런 동물들이 내면에서 빠져나오려고 할 때가 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "521f52a9-785d-4659-a2df-06454ecd2150"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you don't see it as a philosophical problem. Obviously, we're "
"dealing with some evil magic here, and we'll have to remember that when we "
"confront it.\""
msgstr "\"철학적인 문제로 보지 말았으면 해. 우리는 악한 마법을 상대하고 있으니 정신을 바짝 차려야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "eb314cba-cc1d-4164-a8e7-02103ae59639"
msgid ""
"\"The animal inside? You may be right about that, but what we're fighting "
"now is not some inner monster of the soul.\""
msgstr "\"내면의 동물? 네가 맞을지도 몰라. 하지만 우리가 싸우고 있는 건 영혼을 갉아먹는 내면의 괴물이 아니라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "cb08ff9c-84f7-4112-b7e8-355a32e0c591"
msgid "\"Hah. Like the butterfly from its cocoon.\""
msgstr "\"하. 누에 고치에서 나온 나비같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "bd3c5117-ead0-4ee7-a3ca-f98d389723b0"
msgid ""
"\"Would be awesome if greatbeast was inside Nok-Nok. But maybe not come out "
"yet. Nok-Nok still have plans...\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 내면에 대괴수가 있다면 놀랍겠지. 하지만 나오지 않은 것 같아. 녹-녹은 계획이 있으니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0491ab01-de5c-4593-ab6c-0880e9994a28"
msgid ""
"\"In order for a monster to break out, it needs to have been put inside in "
"the first place.\""
msgstr "\"괴물이 나오기 위해서는 우선 존재부터 해야 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e5013662-d6f1-4560-bf2f-227afc5b44ad"
msgid ""
"\"In order for a monster to break out, it needs to have been put inside in "
"the first place.\""
msgstr "\"괴물이 나오기 위해서는 우선 존재부터 해야 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fcdbc704-f65c-4072-97e8-25cb232445f3"
msgid "\"Monsters near peaceful villages. That's bad. Very bad.\""
msgstr "\"평화로운 마을 근처에 괴물들이 있다니. 정말 끔찍하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7aa39285-178c-4bd4-98df-9d005d857896"
msgid ""
"\"I wish I knew where they came from. It might be some magical phenomenon, "
"or a great migration brought on by natural causes.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 어디에서 왔는지 알고 싶었어. 아마 마법적인 현상으로 탄생하거나 자연적인 현상으로 이주를 한 것일 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1b1d2dfe-0aec-48c0-830e-650d4030708b"
msgid ""
"\"Life can be cruel and we all face our share of tragedy. But we'll do "
"everything we can to defeat this menace!\""
msgstr "\"삶은 잔인하고 우리 모두는 비극을 공유해. 하지만 우리는 이 위협을 물리치기 위해 최선을 다할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7e7ba6f7-9383-44d5-b987-9c8f547303cf"
msgid ""
"\"Peasants certainly sate the appetite! And they're easy to cook, ha ha! "
"They even bring their own cutlery — axes to cut them up with, and pitchforks "
"to eat from.\""
msgstr "\"농민들은 아주 좋은 음식이지. 요리하기도 쉽고. 하하! 심지어 칼과 포크도 가지고 다녀서 도시락이라고나 할까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fb739be7-11b0-4ead-9056-e48ee27d3386"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters prowling openly among the houses of the peaceful peasants. This "
"cannot be a natural event. There's an evil will at work.\""
msgstr "\"평화로운 농가에서 돌아다니는 괴물들이라. 이건 자연적인 현상이 아니야. 악이 저지른 짓이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f181a613-9044-483d-922a-80c0404278ec"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters prowling openly among the houses of the peaceful peasants. This "
"cannot be a natural event. There's an evil will at work.\""
msgstr "\"평화로운 농가에서 돌아다니는 괴물들이라. 이건 자연적인 현상이 아니야. 악이 저지른 짓이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_AfterRavenFirstDialog_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2e69c4f7-ce0f-4b75-9e2d-aa38269d4bf8"
msgid ""
"\"How odd. I know much about birds. Seen a lot of them. Never seen one that "
"was sentient.\""
msgstr "\"정말 이상하군. 나는 새에 대해 많은 것을 알아. 많은 새를 봤지만 이렇게 감각적인 새는 처음이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_AfterRavenFirstDialog_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "064496fa-2234-4448-bea4-c9444d24b4be"
msgid ""
"\"If there be men with the minds of pigeons, there must be birds with the "
"minds of men!\""
msgstr "\"비둘기의 마음을 가진 사람들이 있다면 사람들의 마음을 가진 새가 있어야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_AfterRavenFirstDialog_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "be8e82fc-59f5-4c20-b8d7-6ae8cbb99a9e"
msgid ""
"\"Magic can do many things. But this raven seems unusual even for a magical "
"creature.\""
msgstr "\"마법은 많은 것을 할 수 있어. 하지만 이 까마귀는 마법 생물에게조차 특이하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_AfterRavenFirstDialog_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8f279737-f67d-4dc6-8040-2a16ab047cd6"
msgid ""
"\"Is it 'sentient' to insult the local ruler? One might instead say "
"'foolhardy'.\""
msgstr "\"감각적이라니 지역 통치자를 모욕하는 거야? 바보라는 말을 잘못한 거 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_AfterRavenFirstDialog_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "28eee2e9-3cb6-49d6-8a23-a78cd54fc3c4"
msgid ""
"\"What a strange bird this raven is! Who is he? A spirit of these lands? Or "
"someone's messenger? Or perhaps another fey who changed their appearance to "
"play a cruel joke?\""
msgstr "\"이상한 까마귀구만! 그는 누구지? 이 땅의 영혼인가? 아니면 메신저일까? 아니면 장난을 치는 fey일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_AfterRavenFirstDialog_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5977af47-1264-466e-a147-fa25cfd5c55b"
msgid ""
"\"What a strange bird this raven is! Who is he? A spirit of these lands? Or "
"someone's messenger? Or perhaps another fey who changed their appearance to "
"play a cruel joke?\""
msgstr "\"이상한 까마귀구만! 그는 누구지? 이 땅의 영혼인가? 아니면 메신저일까? 아니면 장난을 치는 fey일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_VoiceOgAdventures_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "abb9a8d6-b25b-4727-881a-a52cdf3a3e0c"
msgid ""
"\"Far-away lands, dangerous places, ancient mysteries. Each has its own "
"voice. Some hear that call and seek after it, while others are deaf to it. "
"Of those who go, many perish.\""
msgstr ""
"\"멀리 떨어진 땅, 위험한 지역, 고대의 미스터리. 모두 특징이 있어. 누군가는 그 특징에 이끌리지만 보통은 관심조차 없지. 이끌린 "
"자들은 사라지고는 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_VoiceOgAdventures_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8fdfbcbd-f65d-4e45-ba4c-81199f69c7b7"
msgid ""
"\"But others will follow. After all, we came here too. And we most certainly "
"will not perish!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 결국엔 모두 따라갈 거야. 우리도 여기에 있어. 우리는 사라지지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_VoiceOgAdventures_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6edd6b11-8d01-478c-9d05-9f9a0fedbd80"
msgid ""
"\"Foolishness. A righteous cause is worth dying for. A thirst for adventures "
"is not.\""
msgstr "\"멍청하군. 정당한 이유가 있다면 그것을 위해 죽어도 좋아. 모험에 대한 갈증은 이유가 될 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C31_VoiceOgAdventures_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a3c6d1ee-0383-4b6b-95a4-6c45e5828d6d"
msgid ""
"\"...and then there's those who are most tempted by the sounds of clinking "
"glasses and moaning whores at the roadside inn. Speaking of which, when are "
"we heading back to the capital?\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 그리고 길가의 매춘부와 술집의 잔을 부딪히는 소리에 이끌리는 사람들이 있지. 말이 나와서 말인데 언제 수도로 돌아갈 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "22f58b3d-5270-401d-a610-dd8156761d1e"
msgid ""
"\"My heart says Tristian is not gone forever. What will we learn about him, "
"when we meet again?\""
msgstr "\"내 마음은 트리스티안이 영원히 떠나지 않았다고 말해. 그에 대해 우리가 무엇을 배우고 언제 다시 만날까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f861f608-04a0-4e77-9762-c494b546b7ce"
msgid "\"What's the difference? Nothing will change what he's done!\""
msgstr "\"차이점은 무엇이야? 그가 한 일로 아무것도 바뀌지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "29c00178-6f54-4a60-85a3-3a3e38255b3d"
msgid ""
"\"My attitude towards him has not changed. He is but a prisoner of this sick "
"world, just like us all.\""
msgstr "\"그에게 대한 나의 태도는 변함이 없어. 그는 이 미친 세상의 죄수일 뿐이야. 우리와 다를 바 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5c3bccdf-533b-4ede-b5bf-e53c46986381"
msgid ""
"\"What are you talking about, Ekun? Are you thinking he might have something "
"to do with our other trouble?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리하는 거야. 에쿤? 그가 우리에게 다른 불만이라도 있었다는 얘기야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "98273a3f-e7be-4849-a009-10e403e481d8"
msgid ""
"\"There is much cruelty in the world. But still people start wars with each "
"other. Haven't they suffered enough?\""
msgstr "\"세상은 잔인해. 여전히 사람들은 전쟁을 하지. 충분히 고통을 받았음에도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6792ff0e-d3a9-4a4c-987b-54fe8011f95c"
msgid "\"Don't look for sense in people's behavior — there is none.\""
msgstr "\"사람들의 행동에 상식을 기대하지 마. 그런 것은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8dbcb56f-52ea-463b-8805-0ee0d1e0260f"
msgid ""
"\"A barbarian sees we have a big warm house — and comes here to take it. "
"What he doesn't see is that we're carrying a big heavy stick behind our "
"back, ha ha ha hmm...\""
msgstr ""
"\"야만인은 우리가 거대하고 따뜻한 집이 있는 줄 알지. 그래서 침략을 하는 거고. 하지만 우리가 등에 지고 다니는 크고 무거운 막대를 "
"보지는 못했나봐... 하하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5ee166b8-714b-4bf7-98c9-7d4bacc855b0"
msgid ""
"\"What do you want from Kellids? I'm telling you — if you crack open skulls "
"of the whole tribe, and scrape out what's inside, it won't be enough to fill "
"even one normal head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"켈리드에게서 무엇을 원해? 이봐. 네가 부족들의 머리통을 부수어 안에 있는 것을 모두 긁어 모아도 한 사람 분량도 안될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C41_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c920da4f-3867-4379-8326-849242d5ad8f"
msgid ""
"\"Nature knows neither cruelty nor mercy. Only people make deals with devils."
"\""
msgstr "\"자연은 잔혹함이나 자비 따위는 몰라. 오직 사람들이 데블과 거래를 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "46c1e798-e44f-463c-ba0b-dbf5196b1a8a"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti is a major threat. We need to move fast. The people are worried.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티는 악당이야. 우리는 어서 움직여야 해. 사람들은 겁에 질렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "71d0627f-8b48-4b3e-a167-645d170c8a75"
msgid ""
"\"This is precisely why plebeians shouldn't know how to read. Propaganda "
"leaflets wouldn't confuse people, if there weren't anyone to read them.\""
msgstr "\"읽는 법을 가르쳐주지 말아야 할 사람들이 있지. 읽지 못한다면 선전 찌라시에 사람들이 넘어가는 일도 없겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "73211aee-4353-4ef8-b609-b03380b7bf6c"
msgid ""
"\"The quiet one is right. The longer we sit pretty, the more violent the "
"riots get.\""
msgstr "\"조용한 녀석의 말이 옳아. 오래 앉아있을 수록 폭동은 더 심해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "897fba48-1beb-4528-a3de-511fefbe9df7"
msgid ""
"\"How do we respond to such an unusual threat? We can't appoint a general "
"and send troops — they'd have no one to fight!\""
msgstr "\"그런 비정상적인 위협에 어떻게 대처해야 하지? 우리는 싸울 사람도 없어서 장군을 임명해서 군대를 보낼 수도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b2a7dd04-4d33-45cf-9ba2-2a34a42e90ba"
msgid "\"Yes! More enemies! Nok-Nok stabs, Nok-Nok kills!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 적 많아! 녹-녹 찌른다. 녹-녹 죽인다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_MonsterCampVisited_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0f8e700d-5bf7-4df2-8285-8a495a8524c9"
msgid ""
"\"A monster does not think. It kills because it doesn't know any better. "
"There is no sense in hating it. I know this... It doesn't help.\""
msgstr "\"괴물은 생각하지 않아. 그것은 살생 밖에 모르지. 그들에게 증오는 의미가 없어. 그건... 도움이 되지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_MonsterCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b9203f8e-136a-4487-906c-da33d57134f5"
msgid ""
"\"Thinking, knowing... What's the damn difference? You look at someone's mug "
"and your blood starts to boil. Crack his skull and keep on walking. You've "
"got to enjoy life, you know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각하는 것과 아는 것... 차이점이 있나? 누군가의 면상을 보고 분노가 끓어오를 수 있어. 머리를 깨부수고 가던 길을 갈 수 있지. "
"그렇게 삶을 즐겨야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_MonsterCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "360e0411-6cd4-489d-86ba-9c0d3c0e684f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I don't know. Do they really not think at all? Trolls even have some "
"sort of religion. I think every living creature chooses how to live — and "
"how to behave.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄... 그들이 생각이 없을까? 트롤은 종교도 있어. 모든 생물들은 살아갈 방법과 행동 방식을 스스로 결정하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_C51_MonsterCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8b6f27b4-fcc9-4a92-a770-679cee4a26e3"
msgid ""
"\"You cannot stop hating the monsters — the same way you cannot stop loving "
"your family. Both feelings torment you, both bind your spirit, but still you "
"are not ready to give them up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴물을 증오하는 것을 멈출 수가 없어. 가족을 사랑하듯이 말이야. 두 감정을 멈출 수 없는 건 그것이 네 영혼의 일부이기 때문이야. "
"네가 받아들일 준비가 안되어서 그렇지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1e115cc2-a008-4174-8eae-d8214efca39e"
msgid ""
"\"It's your day, {name}. Time for your friends to say their well-wishes.\""
msgstr "\"네가 활약할 시간이야. {name}. 친구들의 소원을 들어줄 시간이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Ekun/Banter_Ekun_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3f16a9e5-9b7b-42b6-969b-fe0ca1d084ea"
msgid ""
"\"Here's my wish: always have a purpose, and never lose sight of it. Those "
"who possess a guiding light are never lost. Be well, live happily. That is "
"what I have to say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 소원은 말이지. 항상 목적을 가지고 그것을 놓치지 않는 거야. 그래서 빛을 따라가는 길을 잃지 않는 거야. 건강하고 행복하게 사는 "
"거지. 이게 내 소원이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "af053787-0bdd-4938-80e8-436d145cd6aa"
msgid ""
"\"Do not be set aback by how quietly I keep to my thoughts. Come to me and I "
"will discuss with you the frailty of life, the whisper of the night, the "
"great god...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 고뇌한다고 방해하기 싫어하는 것은 아니겠지? 이리로 와서 삶의 덧없음과 밤의 속삭임, 위대한 신에 대해 얘기하자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "02f7da3e-d09e-4871-9562-8f81f017e4c0"
msgid ""
"\"'Quietly keep your thoughts?' You mean how you act like a coffin stuffer? "
"No thanks!\""
msgstr "\"고뇌한다고? 관에 들어간 사람이 하는 거 말이야? 사양하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2f2ed25f-105a-4e4e-8c90-6f672e137ff3"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly, I'll talk to you. I don't think we'll influence each other's "
"opinion... But that doesn't mean we shouldn't try, right?\""
msgstr "\"사실 우리는 서로의 의견을 듣지 않는 거 같아... 하지만 시도는 해 봐야 하지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0da9c161-00a8-4b48-bb47-effafe0a65f9"
msgid ""
"\"There's something funny about your incessant gloominess. I'll be happy to "
"take you up on your offer. — After all, I need to understand you well, so I "
"can depict you accurately in my book!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 우울함에 대한 재밌는 사실이 있는데 말이지. 사실 너와 함께 있어서 기뻐. 너를 이해해야 내 책에 제대로 묘사할 수 있으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_TempleOfTheElk_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "38a087ac-20c8-4989-9df5-9d3291d77936"
msgid ""
"\"The deserted temple was peaceful. Serene. The followers of Groetus do not "
"build their own shrines, but gather to worship on the ruins of the other "
"gods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"버려진 사원이 평화롭네. 서렌레이의 사원이야. 그로투스의 추종자들은 성소를 건설하지 않지만 다른 신들의 파괴된 사원에서 숭배를 하고는 "
"하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_TempleOfTheElk_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "323a1074-0aa5-40db-9c7c-8a9acc32c34c"
msgid ""
"\"What an amazing tradition! But I imagine that makes Groetus unpopular "
"among the followers of other gods...\""
msgstr "\"정말 신기한 전통이네! 하지만 다른 신의 사원에서 숭배를 하다니 보기에는 좋지 않은걸...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_TempleOfTheElk_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8db998ad-4507-461f-8498-6266760129b0"
msgid ""
"\"The rat god waits until other gods leave their old houses. Then he moves "
"in and rules them himself. Ha!\""
msgstr "\"쥐새끼 신이 다른 신의 집에서 집주인이 나갈 때까지 기다리는군. 빈집털이범이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C11_TempleOfTheElk_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1973a4ca-78c9-4a3b-80e8-0ca9dc8f8fc3"
msgid ""
"\"'The look of the deserted temple pleased me, because I feel like dying of "
"boredom in it!' — Well, I'm not surprised at all by that, ha, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"버려진 사원의 모습이 흥미로워. 마침 지루해 죽을 뻔했어!라니. 나는 놀랍지도 않다. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_FromMiddle_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f1074c2f-cd14-4d89-a981-9734bf3c8c61"
msgid ""
"\"Submit! Submit to the inevitable! Open your souls to Groetus, renounce the "
"illusion of hope, and embrace the despair my faith promises!\""
msgstr "\"숭배해라! 종말을 받아들여야 해. 그로투스를 믿어 희망의 환영을 포기하고 절망을 받아들여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_FromMiddle_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "84c578eb-ddc1-4473-91a8-5baefd0dbf43"
msgid ""
"\"When I still served Shelyn, my codex prohibited me from attacking first. "
"Fortunately, I serve Shelyn no longer. Think on this, Harrim, before you "
"preach your depressing sermons to me again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 셸린을 섬겼을 때 저는 항상 방어를 하는 방법을 배웠습니다. 다행이 이제는 셸린을 섬기지 않지요. 그 말은 이제 제가 마음 놓고 "
"공격을 해도 된다는 얘기입니다. 하림.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_FromMiddle_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "855afbcc-7b7a-4a84-b6f8-0693f925606b"
msgid ""
"\"You seem happy that everything and everyone must die. You disgust my soul."
"\""
msgstr "\"사람들이 죽게 된다는 걸 믿어야 행복하겠어? 참 역겹구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_FromMiddle_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "699a242b-0670-4799-94f5-e3ff219a0c49"
msgid ""
"\"Wherever there is life, there is hope. So long as we yet live, we must "
"hope for the best and never give up — for ourselves, and for those we hold "
"dear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"삶이 있는 곳마다 희망이 있어. 우리가 아직 살고 있는 한 우리는 절대로 포기하지 않아야 해. 우리 자신과 사랑하는 이들을 위해서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_FromMiddle_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4f358bc1-32df-410d-a158-6c3c88ea2e15"
msgid ""
"\"You try so desperately to convince us, most honorable Harrim. I'm on the "
"verge of being convinced – or at least, playing along.\""
msgstr "\"우리를 설득하느라 고생이 많네. 하림. 나는 거의 넘어갈 뻔했어. 나라도 놀아주니 얼마나 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_FromMiddle_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2a46aa30-fc84-4ad4-9387-088c9e7df75e"
msgid ""
"\"You try so desperately to convince us, most honorable Harrim. I'm on the "
"verge of being convinced – or at least, playing along.\""
msgstr "\"우리를 설득하느라 고생이 많네. 하림. 나는 거의 넘어갈 뻔했어. 나라도 놀아주니 얼마나 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_TrollsNotAfraid_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "354bc843-ef4c-42e7-86df-7b7f1301121b"
msgid ""
"\"Trolls stopped fearing fire. It takes courage to change one's essence, "
"even with the aid of magic.\""
msgstr "\"트롤들은 이제 불을 두려워하지 않아. 마법의 도움을 받아 본성을 바꾸게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_TrollsNotAfraid_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "61749a40-0eb5-46d8-9d6c-30e36602e173"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps in time they could change yet more. They might even learn to "
"coexist in peace with the other races.\""
msgstr "\"아마 시간이 지나면 그들은 더 많이 바뀔 수 있어. 아마 다른 종족과 평화롭게 공존하는 법을 배울 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_TrollsNotAfraid_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "187e2d87-33a9-42ed-8d0a-26ef94130cc2"
msgid ""
"\"I prefer to cut off their heads first, and think about the rest later.\""
msgstr "\"일단 만나면 머리통을 베어주고나서 생각해 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C21_TrollsNotAfraid_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "90bc935e-275a-4980-a9aa-24b7e4e74086"
msgid "\"People don't change. Animals don't either.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 변하지 않고 동물도 마찬가지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_AfterCapitalAttack_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fe0c50a7-73aa-4680-b98f-4885217cbdd0"
msgid ""
"\"Chaos, insanity, blood. The will of the gods comes to pass in strange ways."
"\""
msgstr "\"혼돈, 광기, 피. 신의 의지가 어긋나고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_AfterCapitalAttack_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9bdbfa4f-4aa9-4242-8822-f34b781654b3"
msgid ""
"\"Sounds like you're unhappy about it. The teaching of Groetus is all slow "
"and quiet decay, whereas what we have here is bloody pandemonium!\""
msgstr "\"기분이 안좋아 보이는데. 그로투스의 가르침은 조용한 파괴와 같아서 결국에 모든 것은 종말하게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_AfterCapitalAttack_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fcde3f37-76e6-4a21-a744-433dfc72627d"
msgid ""
"\"The gods' will or not, we defended the city and put an end to this Bloom.\""
msgstr "\"신의 의지이건 아니건 우리는 도시를 수호하고 이 역병을 끝낸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_AfterCapitalAttack_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "52cdf9e1-751f-4404-a4a2-d8c6c20220c8"
msgid "\"The gods are cruel. But who wouldn't be, possessing such power?\""
msgstr "\"신은 잔인해. 하지만 그런 힘을 가진 자는 누구일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_OldDwarfCastle_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d191b613-90bc-4a04-bb4b-a886de6f0f6b"
msgid ""
"\"If we may, I would like to return once more to that forsaken fortress. To "
"walk below its arches... to feel the tranquility of its halls and arcades... "
"to listen to the silence...\""
msgstr ""
"\"할 수 있다면 버려진 요새로 다시 한번 돌아가고 싶어. 그곳의 구조물을 보며 조화를 느끼고 싶어... 침묵에 귀를 기울이며...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_OldDwarfCastle_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a6e3805b-ec29-492f-9f8a-c642693b1e4a"
msgid "\"Do as you wish, but you can do it without me. Dirt, ruins... Ughhh!\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로 해. 하지만 나 없어도 할 수 있어. 폐허는 지겨워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_OldDwarfCastle_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8b6b24b1-9787-4675-9f2c-072d41c58fea"
msgid ""
"\"I find your notions of tranquility and silence rather strange. For me, I'm "
"content with the calmness of my tent.\""
msgstr "\"네가 좋아하는 침묵과 평온이 이상해. 나는 텐트에서 편히 쉬는 걸로 만족해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C22_OldDwarfCastle_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "31f577c5-c027-44c4-b7b7-4e2b52ad958a"
msgid ""
"\"It might do you good. Such places seem to lift the gloom from your brow..."
"\""
msgstr "\"너는 잘할 거야. 그런 곳에서 우울함을 떨쳐버릴 수 있겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_CyclopusTomb_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5afc871c-c21b-4aaa-a768-26365b138c15"
msgid ""
"\"Cyclopes... A great empire, great power, so many lives. Now, all gone — "
"and all that remains are tombs and graves. I see the hand of Groetus in this."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸이클롭스... 위대한 제국과 위대한 힘, 수많은 생명들. 지금은 모두 사라졌어. 남아있는 것은 무덤과 묘비일 뿐. 모두 그로투스의 "
"작품이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_CyclopusTomb_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bd465fa2-d38b-42db-b5a9-8115bf9f36f1"
msgid ""
"\"They must have been weaklings, so they all died out. If you want to "
"survive, you must fight no matter what.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 약점이 틀림 없이 있어서 죽은 거겠지. 살고 싶으면 싸워야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_CyclopusTomb_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "56b98f0f-abd5-4597-90b3-a9440722293a"
msgid ""
"\"But here we are, long after they're gone. Life, and the struggle for good —"
" this will always return and prevail in the end.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 사라지고 오랜 세월 후에 우리가 나타났어. 삶과 분투는 우리와 언제나 함께하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_CyclopusTomb_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5429591d-45bd-4bd8-b3c8-c7bf3abe1157"
msgid ""
"\"They grew callous, overwhelmed by their darkest passions — and died. Thus "
"is the fate of all who sink into insanity and evil.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 무섭게 자랐고 가장 어두운 열망에 의해 압도당해 죽었어. 광기와 악에 물든 자들의 최후야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_CyclopusTomb_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "113d5062-4964-41bc-b902-644fba92fcc8"
msgid ""
"\"What's so great about some dead meat? Goblins are great! — You can kill us "
"all you want. We will sneak, hide and survive!\""
msgstr "\"죽은 고기에 신경써서 뭐해? 고블린은 위대해! 원한다면 우리를 죽이라고 해라. 우리는 숨어서 살아남을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_FirstWorldFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1c4d429a-47ac-458a-ab62-535fab5d4f57"
msgid ""
"\"A whole world free of wilting and sorrow. A world untouched by Groetus! "
"What we have seen is truly impressive.\""
msgstr "\"세계는 슬픔으로 가득해. 그로투스가 오지 않은 세계들이 그렇지. 하지만 여기는 정말 인상적이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_FirstWorldFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cb280bc6-ca0c-4afa-b9ef-df1e7723186b"
msgid ""
"\"He's impressed! As if you'd found an eye-witness to the greatest event in "
"the history of your people, and all you managed to get out of him was some "
"disjointed gibberish!\""
msgstr "\"감동이라도 했나. 마치 멸망을 본 것처럼 말하는구나. 언제나 그로투스를 붙이면 되는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_FirstWorldFeedback_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cf13d0fb-59c7-4fd8-b94f-1294a836db11"
msgid ""
"\"Hope you found food for thought, and not another field to sow your dark "
"ideas.\""
msgstr "\"식량이라도 찾아 보라고. 그리고 다른 곳에서는 그런 암울한 생각은 접어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C31_FirstWorldFeedback_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ab6c376d-c5c2-4bd9-aaad-e7705e29cf74"
msgid ""
"\"An amazing place... and equally amazing inhabitants. Well, now I know "
"where I'll set off to, once I've grown hopelessly bored of everything here.\""
msgstr "\"놀라운 곳이야... 그리고 주민들도 놀라워. 여기서 지겨운 하루를 보냈으니 이제 어디로 가야할지 알겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_AfterTristiansReturn_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b1e69b8c-9198-4510-a5f9-b4cb895548a6"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae's loyal servant was captured — and the goddess left him to the "
"mercy of fate. Are gods of light as kind as their priests say? Or did she "
"reject him as Torag rejected me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이의 충직한 하인이 붙잡혔어. 그리고 여신은 그에게 자비를 보였어. 빛의 신은 사제들에게 그렇게 관대한 거야? 아니면 토락이 "
"나를 내치듯이 그를 내친 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_AfterTristiansReturn_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "515c417e-9328-445c-9fc6-a38fee7f658f"
msgid ""
"\"Loving parents don't solve all their children's problems. They teach them "
"to do it themselves. That is what Torag wanted, and for that, you rejected "
"him. Not the other way around.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부모를 사랑한다고 해서 자녀들의 문제를 해결할 수는 없어. 그들이 스스로 해결하게 두어야지. 그게 토락이 원하는 것이고 그래서 너도 "
"쫓겨난 거야. 다른 길은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_AfterTristiansReturn_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f43aadda-4720-4bc2-b312-3da6d97c09ed"
msgid "\"Ha! Some discovery.\""
msgstr "\"하! 무언가 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_AfterTristiansReturn_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7de1bbae-3160-49d7-9d48-7e1d9c780e9e"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand. If he served some mysterious dark power, why didn't "
"Sarenrae take away his magic?\""
msgstr "\"나는 모르겠어. 그가 어둠의 힘을 숭배했다면 왜 서렌레이가 그의 마법을 앗아가지 않았을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_AfterTristiansReturn_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0e5cd480-dfb1-4a97-9477-700b713ba498"
msgid ""
"\"Is that surprise I hear in your voice? You must know little of this "
"goddess, aside from rumors.\""
msgstr "\"네 목소리를 들은 게 신기해? 너는 여신에 대해서 아무것도 모르는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_AfterTristiansReturn_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1a4f2f4c-86ee-4d43-a708-c01374bc557e"
msgid ""
"\"Is that surprise I hear in your voice? You must know little of this "
"goddess, aside from rumors.\""
msgstr "\"네 목소리를 들은 게 신기해? 너는 여신에 대해서 아무것도 모르는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "607b422f-5ff0-47b7-9261-9f46f07f41f0"
msgid ""
"\"Vordakai filled a sepulcher – a place of peace and contemplation – with "
"passion and pointless vanity. I found it… disturbing.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이는 열정과 무의미한 허영으로 무덤을 채웠어. 나는 그것이 파괴된 것을 발견했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e991dee1-3169-4bf5-a0a1-55a925f8a86f"
msgid "\"For once we think alike — Vordakai got what he deserved!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 같은 생각을 하는 거 같은데. 보다카이는 그렇게 되어도 싸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "38f51ab9-27c1-432e-822c-de6a3d299dfd"
msgid "\"Right feelings. Wrong reasons.\""
msgstr "\"옳은 감정이지만 이유가 틀렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "dfeb20e5-5ccc-4f27-ba0e-2d752bfcaead"
msgid "\"And we kicked his ass. Damn, we're good!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 그 녀석을 쫓아냈지. 그 녀석은 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "543ad39d-a447-4e6c-82ca-1ca53c067b8d"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it's his sepulcher. Anyone is free to do whatever they wish in their "
"own house. – Even if they're dead!\""
msgstr "\"여긴 그의 무덤이야. 자기 집에서 주인이 마음대로 해도 상관 없지. 주인이 죽었어도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C41_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "318e7a88-84f9-4c63-9f01-78198fa739d4"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it's his sepulcher. Anyone is free to do whatever they wish in their "
"own house. – Even if they're dead!\""
msgstr "\"여긴 그의 무덤이야. 자기 집에서 주인이 마음대로 해도 상관 없지. 주인이 죽었어도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_AfterWatStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "81f51556-81e1-4ba4-9533-6cb0cffdbcce"
msgid ""
"\"Rulers make war, fight for their lands and subjects, only to realize much "
"later that their hands can grasp nothing but ashes.\""
msgstr "\"통치자들은 자신의 땅과 백성을 위해 전쟁을 하다가 결국 자기에게 돌아오는 건 한줌의 재라는 사실을 깨닫게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_AfterWatStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "80c411f5-0735-4cf2-b942-cd822194ce06"
msgid ""
"\"I agree with you, Harrim. War is pointless. Although I don't come to such "
"pessimistic conclusions as you do...\""
msgstr "\"네 말에 동의해. 하림. 전쟁은 헛되지. 너처럼 결론이 비관적이지는 않더라도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_AfterWatStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "38d1382d-c639-4085-8bfe-e4ccb5c6c56e"
msgid "\"Haha! Because if you don't fight, you become the ashes.\""
msgstr "\"하하! 그건 싸우지 않으면 재가 되기 때문이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_AfterWatStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "34b027cf-615b-4590-9a46-97265ce4a392"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, you're a true poet! Maybe you should consider changing occupations?"
"\""
msgstr "\"하림. 말 한번 멋지게 한다! 시인으로 전직할 생각 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9553d463-b6d6-4c3e-98d5-4352180a8aff"
msgid ""
"\"To forge a spirit into a sword! The things mortals do to prolong their "
"useless struggle to remain in this sick world...\""
msgstr "\"영혼을 벼려 칼로 만들자! 필멸자이 하는 행동은 이 헛된 세상에 살아남기 위한 발악이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "890a2779-b6df-465d-a55b-ffb9d4588e05"
msgid ""
"\"Armag's was a sad fate, you're right. But how does that prove we should "
"all just give up and accept the inevitability of the end?\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 슬픈 운명을 타고났어. 하지만 어떻게 모든 것을 포기하고 종말을 받아들이라는 결론을 낼 수가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0db0b4ff-9b2d-483a-b442-f7a02d0fd3e7"
msgid ""
"\"There is good and bad in the world. You just can't take your eyes off the "
"bad.\""
msgstr "\"세상에는 선과 악이 있어. 단지 악에게서 눈을 떼지 않으면 되는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d1677ea4-c134-4a2f-a4f7-78f5246a2d67"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think Armag fully understood what fate Gorum had prepared for him."
"\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 고룸이 그를 위해 준비한 운명을 받아들이지 못한 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_C51_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4bac2219-106d-40a5-8421-528fd9cb689a"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think he just wanted to stay. I think he wanted keep killing until "
"the end of everything.\""
msgstr "\"그는 그저 머물고 싶은 게 아닌 거 같아. 그는 모든 것이 끝날 때까지 살생을 계속하고 싶었던 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "585f6213-514b-47e2-99b1-a87ec565b45c"
msgid ""
"\"Today is the special day for you, {name}. One year older, one step closer "
"to the end of all the vanity and trouble…\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 네게 특별한 날이야. {name}. 1년 더 늙을 때마다 모든 허영과 혼돈의 끝으로 한걸음 더 가까워지지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Harrim/Banter_Harrim_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a549649b-59c5-4234-a62d-18127940446a"
msgid ""
"\"You have my deepest congratulations. The thought that you approach the "
"Boneyard must be a relief…\""
msgstr "\"정말 축하해. 뼈무덤에 네 생각이 가까워질 수록 안도하게 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bbea4b40-f071-4019-8cef-a7cef26518f9"
msgid ""
"\"It is amazing what the Stag Lord has achieved with such crude methods. "
"Imagine what we might do, with lawful power in our hands...\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 신이 그런 조잡한 방법으로 성취한 게 놀라워. 우리가 합법적인 힘으로 할 수 있는 것들을 생각해 봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Fog_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "198bd6b9-5973-4b03-a294-271a3fee866a"
msgid ""
"\"This fog... it's here for a reason. I've seen much subterfuge, hearing "
"cases at Kyonin's courts. I don't know how these dimwit bandits managed to "
"do it, but they use the fog to hide their trails.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 안개... 다 이유가 있어. 나는 쿄닌의 법정에서 많은 도둑들을 보았지. 어떻게 그 멍청이들이 할 수 있었는지 모르지만 안개를 "
"이용해 길을 숨겼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Fog_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "14ce06ae-bcf6-4dbd-9a88-902eddcae65c"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe the fog has nothing to do with the bandits, and has a completely "
"different origin?\""
msgstr "\"아마 안개는 도적과 아무 관련이 없고 완전히 다르게 만들어진 것이 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Fog_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "621c14f5-6368-46d3-90b8-ebe264dd960f"
msgid ""
"\"No matter where it came from, we won't be able to leave these lands until "
"it clears away.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 어디에서 왔는지에 상관없이 안개가 사라질 때까지 우리는 떠날 수 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Fog_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ffd18e59-982a-4315-9592-1d33794f0647"
msgid ""
"\"Hah. I doubt they could afford to hire a wizard capable of such magic.\""
msgstr "\"하하. 그런 녀석들이 마법을 걸 수있는 마법사를 고용할 여력은 없는 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "988fb0f6-0bdd-4b88-8d44-92903b7cca7e"
msgid "\"Worms fighting over a decaying corpse. Pointless.\""
msgstr "\"벌레들이 부패한 시체를 두고 싸우고 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a216d90f-8507-4110-9f59-10f2ebb6b8cd"
msgid ""
"\"The bandits prey on the weak and flee from the strong. We'll kill them in "
"no time.\""
msgstr "\"도적은 약자를 강탈하고 강자로부터 도망치지. 우리는 그들을 죽여야 해\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C11_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "49710462-3eb4-4107-9923-94a533d1e80f"
msgid ""
"\"Power is lawful when it obeys the laws. — Evil, when it twists them to "
"fill the treasury with gold."
msgstr "\"권력은 법에 복종할 때 합법적이다. 법을 왜곡해 국고에 금을 채운다면 불법이 되는 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5d6660a4-25a8-4338-b09f-7d7313957ea8"
msgid ""
"\"I hope {name} realizes what... amazing... new paths are open to "
"{mf|him|her} now.\""
msgstr "\"{name}에게 새로운 길이 열린 것을 알았으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "96fc2034-9a8a-4b5e-8939-e3671a4adf38"
msgid "\"That's right! All roads are open to us now!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 모든 길은 우리에게 열려있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "db29389a-bb9b-4143-a933-4139e76ecc3b"
msgid ""
"\"For some, power is a way to line one's pockets. For others, a grave "
"responsibility.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 사람들에게는 권력이 주머니를 채우는 수단이지만 어떤 이들에게는 중대한 책임이라고 할 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e59562c0-a5e1-4ab5-8d12-74889f4f2d51"
msgid "\"I wouldn't want to see what you might do with such power...\""
msgstr "\"그런 권력으로 무엇을 할지 보고 싶지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Trobold_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "eb533f9f-3905-41bf-b609-fb7654c7265b"
msgid ""
"\"An empire of kobolds and trolls, unafraid of fire. They would make fine "
"allies.\""
msgstr "\"불을 두려워하지 않는 코볼트와 트롤의 제국이라. 훌륭한 동맹이 되겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Trobold_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "aac243cf-3fc9-41d1-a4ae-bd30fabcdeea"
msgid ""
"\"Some allies. Turn your back and get half of your ass bitten off. Ha!\""
msgstr "\"굉장한 동맹이지. 등 돌리는 순간, 궁둥이 한쪽을 물어 뜯길 테니까. 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Trobold_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8bf241d9-95cd-4ab4-951d-05c8862b003b"
msgid ""
"\"Then they make allies with stinky mites to avoid war. Peg them to the "
"ground and be done with it.\""
msgstr "\"전쟁을 피하겠다고 냄새나는 녀석들이랑 동맹을 맺다니. 땅바닥에 꽂아버리고 얼른 끝내고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Trobold_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8d223cdd-2449-49f8-ac0b-0e73f9599faa"
msgid ""
"\"It would mean an alliance with evil. Hearing you speak the words, it "
"becomes all the clearer.\""
msgstr "\"그래봤자 악의 연대지. 네 말을 들으니 우리가 무슨 짓을 했는지 확 와닿는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C21_Trobold_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ca6ccb3f-19a8-4e1b-8edf-648d6dd7aafe"
msgid ""
"\"Well, if an undead elf can be an ally, then why not kobolds and trolls as "
"well?\""
msgstr "\"언데드 엘프와 동료가 될 수 있으면, 코볼트랑 트롤과도 동맹을 맺을 수 있는 것 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b5e2f07f-5162-4dda-8992-353eed2bdffd"
msgid ""
"\"We could lock all the ill in one place, and the problem would soon solve "
"itself...\""
msgstr "\"모든 환자를 한곳에 모으면 문제는 해결될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response_2
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "817261c6-dfca-47d0-ba74-6d2b5545b3e1"
msgid ""
"\"Even such measures might not help. We've no certainty how the disease "
"spreads — from one person to another, or in some other way.\""
msgstr "\"그런 조치도 도움이 되지 않을 거야. 우리는 이 병이 전염병인지 무엇인지도 알지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6738df0e-c209-4d46-a924-8fdf3778d51d"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit that limiting the movements of those who are sick would "
"indeed slow the disease's spread. But it doesn't follow that we should leave "
"them without help.\""
msgstr "\"병자들의 활동을 제한하면 병의 확산 속도를 늦출 수 있을 거야. 그리고 우리가 그들을 치료해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom1_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bcaa27eb-6759-4685-93e1-04a1085f9436"
msgid ""
"\"That's easy for you to say. Nothing sick will happen to your stinky dead "
"face! But what if one of us gets sick?!\""
msgstr "\"말은 쉽지. 고깃덩이가 된 네 코는 아무것도 맡지 못할 테니까. 우리 중 누가 병이라도 걸리면 어떻게 하려고?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom1_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a9a826d5-c088-459d-9cd1-758593a5e3b4"
msgid ""
"\"Your lips drip poison. You utter cruelties just to amuse yourself. But you "
"do understand that this curse didn't begin with the sick, and it won't end "
"with their deaths either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"말 한번 독하게 하는구나. 재미로 말을 그렇게 잔인하게 하다니. 하지만 이 저주가 병으로 시작된 것이 아니고 환자들이 죽어야 끝나는 "
"것도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0a815a2a-e7ef-4ca4-82fa-e2a22d2cfac3"
msgid ""
"\"I find no pleasure in blood and gore. But it's amusing to see so many "
"mowed down by plague, knowing I myself have nothing to fear.\""
msgstr "\"나는 피와 살육이 전혀 즐겁지 않아. 하지만 역병으로 사람들이 쓰러지는 모습을 보면 즐겁지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b6579046-6dbf-4bcf-bb5b-3ba1656d8cc8"
msgid ""
"\"Is there no limit to how far your soul may fall? Is there any vice your "
"dark heart will not indulge?\""
msgstr "\"네 영혼은 어디까지 타락할 수 있을까? 네 어두운 영혼은 언제 쯤 만족할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bfeb0bb7-9688-42b2-aa2c-15e9673b817f"
msgid ""
"\"There is an end to everything. You only delay the inevitable, and prolong "
"your suffering.\""
msgstr "\"모든 일에는 끝이 있어. 그저 종말을 늦추고 고통을 지속할 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C22_Bloom_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e6cf1fc9-2b52-4063-8bc5-d096b47474e9"
msgid ""
"\"Incidentally, we're not sure of that. Certain diseases and parasites "
"absolutely thrive in a cadaver.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 우리는 확신하지 못해. 어떤 질병과 기생충은 사체에서 번성하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "dedb5268-0dfc-47bd-9170-a328f851ebd0"
msgid ""
"\"I grow tired of dirty tents and thick-skulled barbarians. The First World "
"was by far more interesting...\""
msgstr "\"나는 무식한 야만인과 더러운 천막에 질렸어. 태초 세계가 훨씬 더 재밌어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9a6088ec-6b07-4a4e-b88b-83f24b99dd2c"
msgid "\"Their... simplicity is truly tiresome.\""
msgstr "\"그들의 단순함은 귀찮은 면이 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ead2d5e8-9325-4aeb-9d78-27ce94ee51b1"
msgid ""
"\"Every place is better than a stinking barbarian camp. Well... almost any "
"place.\""
msgstr "\"이 더러운 야만인 야영지를 벗어나면 좋겠어. 어디든 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4fe21f54-4a98-4bf6-821a-2acee10cb0b4"
msgid ""
"\"But those barbarians do know how to have fun, hehe! — At least the ones "
"who haven't thrown in with the damn cultists.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 이 야만족들은 놀 줄 아는데! 그 저주받은 이교도들과 함께 하지 않은 녀석들 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "52b07a7f-0447-481b-9a49-987dab73b47d"
msgid "\"At least barbarians stink less than Fistword – or your cities!\""
msgstr "\"야만인들은 적어도 Fistword나 네 도시보다 더 깔끔해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "99da6ee7-2aac-4782-8547-2432b695f897"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, it's a magical place! But I'm afraid we'll grow bored of its vistas, "
"and in the end miss our simple lands, where people don't keep changing their "
"appearance!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 놀라운 곳이야! 하지만 풍경도 지겨워지고 결국 익숙했던 고향이 그리워지겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e2825b7d-6a72-4a2f-9c3c-13d6b2956745"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, it's a magical place! But I'm afraid we'll grow bored of its vistas, "
"and in the end miss our simple lands, where people don't keep changing their "
"appearance!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 놀라운 곳이야! 하지만 풍경도 지겨워지고 결국 익숙했던 고향이 그리워지겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6f247636-1095-4cbc-962c-710fad41c180"
msgid ""
"\"Say what you will, but the disease's creator deserves credit for his "
"ingenuity. It's hard to imagine a more frightening death... and a more "
"effective means of enthralling the population.\""
msgstr ""
"\"말은 마음대로 해. 하지만 이 병을 만든 녀석은 정말 독창적이야. 이 보다 더 끔찍한 죽음을 상상하기가 쉽지 않아. 그리고 군중을 "
"공포에 빠지게 하는 데 효율적이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e9d58780-74f0-4e21-8b6a-99c5cc46e9b3"
msgid ""
"\"I hear a touch of approval in your voice, and I'm not even surprised. How "
"bitterly sad...\""
msgstr "\"그걸 동조하는 네 목소리를 듣는 나는 놀랍지도 않다니. 슬프다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "913cbeb8-d454-4ced-92c3-53a53f59f57d"
msgid ""
"\"Far better to direct this seething ingenuity onto some healthy course. Why "
"not invent an unsinkable cart? Or if he cares not for practical tasks... "
"Perhaps invent a new color!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 건강한 것에 놀라운 독창성을 더하니 더 낫다. 밑도 끝도 없이 깊은 장바구니를 만드는 건 어때? 실용적이지는 않지만... 새로운 "
"색을 입혀보는 건?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C31_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4b23a720-03f7-4711-9411-6fe0a1fa85f9"
msgid "\"Damn it, you are insane. You do realize that, don't you?\""
msgstr "\"너 정말 미쳤구나. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6da3be2d-8ff0-44fa-97d6-90b9d5b63548"
msgid ""
"\"The lesson of Tristian's story is simple: never trust the one who declares "
"their righteousness most loudly.\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안의 이야기에 대한 교훈은 간단해. 그들의 정의를 가장 큰 소리로 말하는 자들을 믿지 말아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1a93dc8f-d154-4664-b22b-c7ec6e95885a"
msgid "\"You think everyone's hearts are as rotten as yours? Not a chance.\""
msgstr "\"모든 사람이 너처럼 썩은 거 같아? 절대 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "71b3a9c2-bb1d-4654-901d-5c91dbd8eabd"
msgid ""
"\"Nicely put! Now you just have to learn to listen to me, when I tell you "
"the exact same things long beforehand, and then you'll be in fine shape!\""
msgstr "\"말 잘했어! 이제 듣는 방법만 배우고 내가 한 말들을 잘 기억하면 더 괜찮아질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "98c36698-08b2-4192-ab78-0f025d1c1e43"
msgid "\"You sound like there's someone in this world you trust, ha ha...\""
msgstr "\"너를 믿는 녀석이 있는 듯이 말하는구나. 하하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a6d03ccd-7f4e-4528-ae32-b685c86d21a9"
msgid ""
"\"Vordakai's plan could have worked. He was just unlucky to be on the wrong "
"side of the barricades.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이의 계획은 효과가 있었을 거야. 그는 바리케이드의 반대편에 있어 운이 좋지 않았을 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7e745f7b-3854-4fd8-96f3-58d0ef375458"
msgid "\"Exactly. No one stands a chance against us, ha ha ha...\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 아무도 우리를 맞설 기회가 없었어. 하하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9c2c380c-ff3d-453d-b37d-a4395389d3fe"
msgid ""
"\"How could you say that? Vordakai was a monster and he got what he deserved!"
"\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있어? 보다카이는 괴물이었고 그렇게 되어도 싸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e4160ee2-b46a-4fc6-ad9d-9d57a2cc8b45"
msgid "\"Why does {name} put up with you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 {name}이 너와 함께 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterCoronation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9d5f9aa4-9a4d-4214-9e67-e5ce987aba4c"
msgid ""
"\"Now the rulers of all the neighboring lands will have to sit up and take "
"note. Your power grows, {name}. And with it — new opportunities open before "
"you...\""
msgstr "\"이웃 국가들의 통치자는 잘 알아야 할 거야. 네 힘은 강해지고 있어, {name}. 새로운 기회가 네게 펼쳐질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "54c938ea-a4aa-437d-af7b-6f019f5c6268"
msgid ""
"\"Power whispers and tempts. One who listens for too long becomes its slave."
"\""
msgstr "\"힘은 속삭이고 유혹하지. 힘에 휘둘리면 그것의 노예가 되버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "086b84df-3a8c-4f10-bfa0-c45165d24f4a"
msgid "\"Power is merely a tool. What matters is how you use it.\""
msgstr "\"힘은 단지 도구일 뿐이야. 중요한 건 어떻게 사용하느냐지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "11c03489-7c9c-4ca1-9919-50a4909869a6"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to see a few of these opportunities, come with me to a brothel "
"in the capital, ha ha hmmm... Hey, wait — did Jaethal mean they'll be giving "
"us top-class service abroad too?\""
msgstr ""
"\"기회를 엿보고 있다면 나와 함께 수도의 매음글로 가 보자고. 하하하! 잠깐. 제이탈이 그들은 해외에서 최고의 서비스를 제공한다고 "
"말했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "214f3236-a87a-4029-806f-3d26c8ad2136"
msgid ""
"\"Pitax's attack is a boon for the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}. It's "
"the perfect opportunity to expand your territories and not be taken as an "
"aggressor.\""
msgstr "\"피탁스의 공격은 지금이 적기야. 지금 공격하면 침략자로 받아들이지 않고 자연스럽게 영토를 넓힐 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c54988b4-addf-44b4-a8fc-a2e48f5522ae"
msgid ""
"\"How could you say that?! No government's ambitions could justify the "
"terrors of war! Can't you see that?!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있지? 어떤 정부의 야심도 전쟁의 공포를 정당화할 수 없어. 모르겠어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "555f59bd-40d1-42bc-a13b-f0ff2b6d8341"
msgid ""
"\"Like spiders in a jar. All this fuss only lowers the veil over your "
"mind... Like smoking, or wine.\""
msgstr "\"항아리에 있는 거미 같군. 이 모든 것이 그저 네 마음의 어두움을 완전히 지우지는 못해. 흡연이나 음주와 같지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "eee90942-45a8-4e13-bfd1-550a95a9df84"
msgid "\"Poisoned arrows, not words.\""
msgstr "\"단어가 아니라 독이 발린 화살이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a50d920d-2074-48c7-9dd3-367e551affbe"
msgid ""
"\"Are you prepared to risk our own kingdom, just for a chance to conquer "
"another one? There's a reason they say there's a reckless gambler in every "
"calculating strategist!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 왕국을 담보로 다른 나라를 얻으려는 기회를 얻겠다고? 도박 노름에서 무모한 녀석은 하나둘있기 마련이지만 그게 너일줄은!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "472a703e-2c40-4025-bafa-321e8acf5694"
msgid ""
"\"Are you prepared to risk our own kingdom, just for a chance to conquer "
"another one? There's a reason they say there's a reckless gambler in every "
"calculating strategist!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 왕국을 담보로 다른 나라를 얻으려는 기회를 얻겠다고? 도박 노름에서 무모한 녀석은 하나둘있기 마련이지만 그게 너일줄은!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c4e58f15-a2e7-435a-95d9-497b67b4cfb5"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to make a toast. A toast to {name}, our leader and patron. May "
"you enjoy all life's brightest pleasures in your many years to come.\""
msgstr "\"건배를 하고 싶다. {name}. 우리의 지도자이자 후원자에게. 앞으로 몇 년 동안 즐거움을 한껏 누리길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "22c168e5-6168-473b-814c-b14334a0f84b"
msgid ""
"\"And may the weaklings and the rabble envy you, as they always do their "
"superiors.\""
msgstr "\"약자와 군중들은 항상 그렇듯이 너를 부러워할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_KassilAldori_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8460b176-4b58-47f3-a4e6-45ed7b621fe8"
msgid ""
"\"Kassil Aldori is a bad choice — a boring, spineless idealist. How will he "
"defend the interests of the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}, if he can't "
"even stand on his own?\""
msgstr "\"카실 알도리는 지루하고 이상한 이상주의자 녀석이야. 자기 자신도 챙기지 못하면서 국가의 이익을 어떻게 지키겠다는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_KassilAldori_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "582788b4-90cf-40e2-ba61-379ce810f8a5"
msgid ""
"\"He's certainly lacking in artifice and wit — much needed qualities in a "
"diplomat.\""
msgstr "\"그는 확실히 외교적 재능이 부족해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_KassilAldori_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "77bc8189-c1ec-4c1c-b992-215475f31e2f"
msgid ""
"\"What kind of advice is that? Hire a dishonest servant, to better deceive "
"one's neighbors?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 충고가 그래? 이웃들을 잘 속이기 위해 부정직한 종을 고용하라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jaethal/Banter_Jaethal_KassilAldori_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8ec87aa6-0bcb-4b7e-995b-43798b68d29e"
msgid ""
"\"He's not lacking in valor and honor, the most important qualities for any "
"person.\""
msgstr "\"그는 가장 중요한 자질인 용기와 명예가 부족하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_AfterCandlemere_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6bcccddd-78d2-42ff-9e9d-c25f1f360ad5"
msgid ""
"\"Candlemere is shrouded by mystery. Perhaps I should recount the history of "
"this place in an article... or even an entire book!\""
msgstr "\"캔들미어는 수수께끼를 감추고 있어. 아마 신문이나 책을 보며 이곳의 역사를 찾아 봐야 할 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_AfterCandlemere_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8a3d2ae4-6516-4af4-af39-ab030aa58411"
msgid ""
"\"The real mystery is how the hell we continue to put up with such an "
"unbearable, pompous buffoon. Or why, for that matter.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 저렇게 잘난 체하고 뻔뻔한 녀석과 함께 있었는지 궁금해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_AfterCandlemere_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "41a7e92b-3ba9-499b-abb1-26bae9a6e531"
msgid ""
"\"Stupid ruins, freaking lights... This is total bullshit. Better you write "
"about our war with those stinky trolls.\""
msgstr "\"쓸모없는 폐허와 이상한 빛들... 다 필요 없어. 트롤과 싸운 우리 전쟁에 대한 이야기를 쓰는 게 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_AfterCandlemere_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "147cdcaf-afa6-4e93-8732-a6d519272fa4"
msgid ""
"\"A fine idea, Jubilost! Let us join forces and write that book together! "
"But not just a single book — we could pen a whole series!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이야. 주빌로스트! 책을 같이 쓰자! 시리즈로 책을 내는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_BeforeTrollLair_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4fa1effc-782e-44ad-ab79-867e18bc49e1"
msgid ""
"\"Damnable kobolds! What a pleasure it would be to settle the score with "
"Tartuk, that foul scaly bastard!\""
msgstr "\"지독한 코볼트! 그 더러운 타툭 녀석에 대해서 쓰는 게 얼마나 기쁜지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_BeforeTrollLair_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0c91a972-491e-442a-a722-2d41cb670944"
msgid ""
"\"This Tartuk is rumored to be different from his kin... and I mean not only "
"the color of his scales.\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 동족과는 다르다고 하더군... 피부 색깔을 말하는 게 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_BeforeTrollLair_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "db01f535-18bb-4168-85e4-7e987d48fcb7"
msgid ""
"\"Your hatred for kobolds is like mine for trolls. It's... understandable.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트에 대한 네 증오는 트롤에 대한 나의 증오와 비슷하군... 이해한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_BeforeTrollLair_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4b2da0f2-a532-485b-8e1b-a3d70dd2808e"
msgid "\"Don't let personal quarrels cloud your judgment, Jubilost.\""
msgstr "\"개인적인 감정으로 너의 판단을 흐리게 하지 마라. 주빌로스트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_Tristian_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a199b43c-af0f-470b-b603-f2254b3df8df"
msgid ""
"\"Am I the only one who finds it strange that Tristian can't tell us "
"anything about life in Kelesh? – On top of the fact that he does not appear "
"to be of native stock.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안이 Kelesh에서의 삶에 관해서 우리에게 아무것도 말할 수 없다는 것을 이상하게 여기는 게 나 뿐이야? 그리고 그는 그곳 "
"원주민과는 다르게 생겼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "731a9c7b-691c-4f42-ba4f-fadfe41b6ef7"
msgid ""
"\"Well... he lived in a monastery — that's why he never saw anything. And he "
"mentioned that his parents weren't from around there — hence his appearance."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 그는 수도원에 살았는데 그래서 아무것도 보지 못한 것일지도. 그리고 자신의 부모님이 그곳 사람이 아니라고 하지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "eab94eac-909a-4ef5-8dd4-eb891ebcbdd8"
msgid ""
"\"He just doesn't like talking about himself. There's nothing strange in it."
"\""
msgstr "\"그는 단지 자신에 대해 말하는 것을 좋아하지 않아. 이상한 점은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6f6f4f5f-8c45-45a0-adf4-456ebe4706bd"
msgid "\"Does he have anything to say at all, except about his Sarenrae?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이를 제외하고는 다른 말은 언급을 한 적이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ebc78952-ad42-4590-9659-da4fe5deaa91"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to ask him in detail about who he is and where he's from... But "
"on the other hand, no – I've no interest in speaking with him at all.\""
msgstr "\"그에게 자신이 누구이고 어디에서 왔는지 자세히 물어보고 싶어. 하지만 나는 그에게 아무런 관심이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C21_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6fd6b8bd-3e0b-43df-b8d5-84ebd574e14c"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to ask him in detail about who he is and where he's from... But "
"on the other hand, no – I've no interest in speaking with him at all.\""
msgstr "\"그에게 자신이 누구이고 어디에서 왔는지 자세히 물어보고 싶어. 하지만 나는 그에게 아무런 관심이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Seeds_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "df081079-6132-432d-9cbe-6cbe48cd86df"
msgid ""
"\"All these strange happenings fill me with both terror and curiosity. I've "
"never heard of such seeds — or anything remotely like them! We must be on "
"the verge of an immense discovery.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 모든 이상한 일들이 나를 두려움과 호기심으로 채우고 있어. 나는 그런 씨앗에 대해 들어 본 적이 없어. 반드시 엄청난 사실이 "
"숨겨져 있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Seeds_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e63fbce0-df36-46c4-ac43-def4d76bac93"
msgid ""
"\"I could tell ya what verge we're on, but you won't want to hear it! We can "
"all drop dead before we figure out what's going on. Just sip some water with "
"a seed in it — and you're as good as dead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 엄청난 사실인지 대강 말해줄 수 있지만 듣고 싶지 않을걸! 사실을 알아내기도 전에 우리 모두 죽을 수 있어. 그냥 물한모금하고 "
"씨를 삼키면 너는 죽은 목숨이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Seeds_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e0f73f1f-f1e3-446b-b466-be683e6a50ad"
msgid ""
"\"You sound like you're imagining a new book in your mind, along with what "
"fame it may bring. Your ambition will be your undoing, Jubilost.\""
msgstr "\"새로운 책을 쓰려는 기대를 하나 본데 아마 네가 먼저 죽을 거야. 주빌로스트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Seeds_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a14e6d6b-5d20-43e2-8bae-e51472a9491a"
msgid ""
"\"You might save hundreds of lives, if you use your knowledge and experience "
"to find a cure for this pestilence.\""
msgstr "\"이 역병에 대한 치료법을 찾기 위해 지식과 경험을 사용하면 수백 명의 생명을 구할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "52b5bfb4-d1d7-42c8-9f61-b49487d78941"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose I'll head to Numeria when I grow tired of this lands. There are "
"enough mysteries there to captivate my inquisitive mind.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅이 지겨워지면 누메리아로 갈 것 같아. 그곳에는 내 호기심을 사로잡을 많은 모험이 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0ea5d624-6c52-4ef0-8301-85dcebf871de"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you should most certainly go! I can almost picture the Technic League "
"maniacs clapping you in chains and making you their guinea pig. Though "
"something tells me that you couldn't survive it for long.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 가버려! 기술 연맹 녀석들에게 잡혀 쇠사슬에 묶인 기니피그 꼴이 날걸. 그리 오래 살 것 같지는 않지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6c75fa48-9705-4529-9d01-66bf83ba26ae"
msgid ""
"\"I imagine the local barbarians wouldn't fully appreciate your signature "
"condescension.\""
msgstr "\"지역 야만인들은 네 서명을 완전히 이해하지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d0a3a987-983f-48e2-b10f-21e37ebc9252"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha, ha! I'd love to watch as you flee the barbarians, the Technic "
"Leagues' thugs — and the little furry animals!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 네가 야만족, 기술 연맹 녀석들을 피해 동망가는 꼴을 보고 싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Cyclops_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3348da05-547a-4e85-8eef-a06f6d4ac02d"
msgid ""
"\"Finally we set our efforts to something useful! Rather than crawling "
"around swamps and battling boneheaded bandits, we turn to exploring ancient "
"places where the undiscovered tombs of ancient cyclopes may be found.\""
msgstr ""
"\"드디어 우리의 노력이 빛을 보겠군! 늪을 돌아다니며 도적들과 싸우는 것보다는 고대의 유적을 찾아 고대 싸이클롭스의 무덤을 발견하는 게 "
"더 값지지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Cyclops_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ca3aada-e573-428e-a0c8-8fc30aa71445"
msgid ""
"\"Oh su-u-ure! Putting an end to the Stag Lord's oppressive rule, protecting "
"the innocents from monsters, fighting off deadly diseases — that's all "
"completely pointless. But helping Jubie find material for his next potboiler "
"— now we're on to something!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지! 수사슴 군주를 끝장내고 괴물로부터 무고한 사람을 지키고 역병을 물리치는 건 모두 의미 없었어. 하지만 주빌로스트를 도와 "
"다음 재료를 찾도록 돕는 건 의미있는 일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Cyclops_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a78fd6b0-2ec5-457f-9a0b-96a105f794b1"
msgid ""
"\"It saddens me that these tombs may be the only remaining trace of an "
"entire lost civilization...\""
msgstr "\"이 무덤이 잃어버린 문명이 남긴 유일한 흔적이라 슬프다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Cyclops_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "911ec20e-64c9-42d7-83be-a9e3bd86204e"
msgid "\"Well, I might see something new here.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 새로운 무언가를 발견할 수 있겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Tristian_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9cad7b26-f19c-4147-b823-b92a2d367e66"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe that none of you see how unnatural Tristian's behavior is! "
"No one is a saint. — He's obviously holding something back!\""
msgstr "\"너희 모두 트리스티안의 행동을 보고 아무렇지도 않다니 믿기지 않다. 그는 무언가를 숨기고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0de61529-5b5f-4b4f-b3a0-507cb007f4e4"
msgid ""
"\"Why, you can't believe that everyone else isn't as self-centered as you?\""
msgstr "\"다른 이가 너와 달리 이타적인 모습을 보니 믿을 수가 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "702b3182-874d-4edd-8848-9ee89863571c"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, like Harrim is anywhere close to normal. We're quite a circus. — "
"Clowns, freaks, and magicians.\""
msgstr "\"하. 하림이 가장 정상인 것 같군. 우리는 서커스 단원이나 다름 없어. 광대와, 괴물에, 마술사에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C31_Tristian_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "af49ce38-8a64-43c1-b01a-3d3d276f4a4a"
msgid "\"I doubt the snotnose could hide anything from me.\""
msgstr "\"그 녀석이 내게서 무엇을 숨겼을까 의심돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "92cfe422-75b8-4ed7-ba6a-f20aaa98b939"
msgid ""
"\"Well? Didn't I tell you that no one's so saintly? Tristian was definitely "
"hiding something? Ring any bells? Ah, but you never listen, as usual...\""
msgstr "\"내가 전에도 말하지 않았어? 트리스티안이 무언가를 숨기고 있다고. 하지만 너는 절대 듣지 않았지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3c1ca784-fd34-4854-973b-dc678119ad74"
msgid "\"If we listened to everything you said, our heads would burst.\""
msgstr "\"네가 말한 것을 우리가 들었다면 우리 머리는 터져버렸을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "47988ee8-15f9-4089-8641-3d07bd2cbfb8"
msgid ""
"\"And how many of your predictions and premonitions in the same period were "
"false?\""
msgstr "\"같은 기간에 네 예언이 얼마나 많이 틀렸어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5ac82436-5ccb-4844-ade4-9a2edc1124ca"
msgid ""
"\"Don't pout — you were right, you were, ha ha hmm. I never thought that "
"snotnose could pull such a trick.\""
msgstr "\"삐지지 마. 네가 맞았어. 하하하. 그 녀석이 거짓말을 할 줄은 몰랐지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6a6bc88a-4562-4dd4-bec4-5158eec9aae6"
msgid "\"I don't drink your wordy vomits, no! Too much of those!\""
msgstr "\"네 말 따위는 믿지 않아. 절대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "e19d5777-baea-4ccc-86bf-1f52fbf00844"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit, I didn't expect such a monstrous lie, even from him. I "
"sensed there was a scorpion in the party, but I never suspected a giant "
"manticore!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그에게서 그런 거대한 거짓말을 들으리라고는 믿지 않았어. 우리 일행에 쥐새끼가 있으리라고 짐작했지만 거대 만티코어일 줄은 몰랐지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_AfterTristianBetrayal_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b64ca4a3-0acb-4a53-8863-ec5426883fea"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit, I didn't expect such a monstrous lie, even from him. I "
"sensed there was a scorpion in the party, but I never suspected a giant "
"manticore!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그에게서 그런 거대한 거짓말을 들으리라고는 믿지 않았어. 우리 일행에 쥐새끼가 있으리라고 짐작했지만 거대 만티코어일 줄은 몰랐지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a7ced3fb-2cba-4626-bdaa-1396c74236b4"
msgid ""
"\"And still — how do great empires decay? How does their fall begin? This is "
"a mystery worthy of a great mind...\""
msgstr "\"위대한 제국은 어떻게 부패하지? 어떻게 쇠퇴를 할까? 정말 궁금하군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b0b5bfe0-1132-4e69-b176-bb639ec3c4b1"
msgid "\"The cyclopes were destroyed by cruelty. And debauchery.\""
msgstr "\"사이클론은 그들의 잔인함과 방탕함에 의해서 쇠퇴했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1fdc215e-830e-40cf-908c-bdd2d12e5ba0"
msgid ""
"\"In the north, every fool knows the answer. The end is near when a great "
"chief who has conquered all the neighboring tribes, starts to eat more than "
"hunt and sleep more than fight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"북부에서는 바보들조차 그 답을 알고 있어. 위대한 족장이 이웃 부족을 모두 지배하면 싸움을 끝내고 먹는 것과 자는 것으로 하루를 "
"보내게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "53016877-17cb-43c0-a0db-45edde3e1ff3"
msgid ""
"\"That's simple — someone gets used to blabbing and stops keeping their eyes "
"open, ha ha ha hmm...\""
msgstr "\"그야 간단하지. 우두머리 녀석이 느슨해지면 그렇게 되겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e1a39ae9-456a-4c9a-8dbf-db85abcce955"
msgid ""
"\"I must give Irovetti his due — he's a cunning and resourceful devil. A "
"three-pronged attack, but with no fronts or generals. Without declaring war "
"or assembling any troops, he's shaken our kingdom to the ground.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티는 교활하고 수완 좋은 악당이야. 3 지점을 공격했지만 전면전을 피하고 있어. 전쟁을 선포하거나 군대를 조직하지 않고 그는 "
"우리 왕국을 흔들고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "07f46731-7790-4600-a10b-fd5b7b4472cf"
msgid "\"What? Whose side are you on?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 너는 대체 누구 편이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "067be336-7294-41f9-aa80-35ffdf06f768"
msgid ""
"\"What, too bad you weren't the first to think of it? You can't read this "
"stuff in books or hear it from fat lecturers. — Some things can be only "
"learned in the streets.\""
msgstr "\"왜? 내가 똑똑해서 화가 나? 이런 건 책이나 뚱뚱한 강사들에게 배울 수 없는 것들이야. 실전에서 배울 수 있는 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9858b12d-be3a-4ee7-bbdc-b9e455fd1634"
msgid ""
"\"And now monsters are killing our elderly and our children, and bandits are "
"cutting down unarmed peasants. All this needless suffering could have been "
"avoided, if only Irovetti fought honestly, as it befits a king.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 괴물들이 노인들과 우리 아이들을 죽이고 도둑은 비무장 농민들을 죽이고 있어. 이로베티가 왕답게 정직하게 싸웠다면 이런 일은 "
"일어나지 않았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8acfec6a-7748-4408-af6c-40cc0836522c"
msgid ""
"\"Just think of it — hordes of barbarians, destroyed. Civilization and "
"reason for once claiming victory over savagery and brute force. It almost "
"makes me feel optimistic!\""
msgstr "\"생각해 봐. 야만인 군단이 파멸했어. 문명인이 야만인들과의 전쟁에서 승리한 건 이유가 있을 거야. 정말 잘된 일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c9e7f927-05f4-4881-9f6e-611a6c8ed3e1"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be afraid for your own sake. — Pure bile runs in your veins instead "
"of blood. This fate will surely spare you!\""
msgstr "\"두려워하지 마. 심장이 뛰고 미치겠지만 운명은 너의 편이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "32363f1d-7003-4a8a-87f7-df0c2e6133a5"
msgid ""
"\"You disappoint me. Don't you see that victory has merely doomed us to "
"further torment and trials, while the barbarians have found their eternal "
"peace?\""
msgstr "\"나를 실망시키지 말라고. 야만인들이 영원한 평화를 찾는 동안 승리로 인해 우리가 시련을 겪는 것이 안보여?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "29b4ce0a-9776-4aec-8102-9df5fb44f74a"
msgid ""
"\"Civilization and order always prevail against savagery and chaos. They may "
"lose a battle or two, but they win the war.\""
msgstr "\"문명과 질서는 항상 야만과 혼돈을 앞섰지. 한두번의 전투에서는 질지 모르지만 최종적으로 승리하는 쪽은 문명이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "afeec504-5b84-4f28-9f92-e33298e16e3e"
msgid ""
"\"In this game, the barbarians were only pawns. It's good that our kingdom's "
"ruler saved us from the same lot.\""
msgstr "\"이 게임에서 야만족은 졸병일 뿐이었어. 우리 왕국의 통치자가 우리를 그러한 운명에서 구한 것이 다행이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_C51_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "372e5514-e6b0-4e83-9ecb-df4da72cf289"
msgid ""
"\"In this game, the barbarians were only pawns. It's good that our kingdom's "
"ruler saved us from the same lot.\""
msgstr "\"이 게임에서 야만족은 졸병일 뿐이었어. 우리 왕국의 통치자가 우리를 그러한 운명에서 구한 것이 다행이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bb1af832-bdf0-4eb6-8988-22793cbd9228"
msgid ""
"\"It's a special day for a special person. You know I wouldn't be hanging "
"around someone unworthy, right? {name}, you've already achieved more than "
"most dare dream of.\""
msgstr ""
"\"특별한 사람을 위한 특별한 날이야. 내가 아무나하고 어울리지 않는 것 알지? {name}. 너는 모든 이들의 꿈 이상의 것을 성취했어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b873355a-b2e2-403d-8a97-df36cf62d2a9"
msgid ""
"\"Your birth date is enshrined in the chronicles, and some poor scholar "
"somewhere will have to memorize it if he wants to pass his Northern Avistan "
"History exam. So, Happy Birthday, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|"
"Your Highness}! Be well – and don't forget to update those chronicles with "
"one or two heroic deeds. Each year.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 생일은 연대기에 기록되고 북부 아비스탄의 역사에 실릴 거야. 생일 축하해 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} . 건강을 잃지 말고 "
"해마다 업적 한개씩 달성해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Kassil_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "04f85809-5a5f-4f36-a4a6-34a4bb7aca3a"
msgid ""
"\"Envoy Aldori is a curious type. I never expected to see a half-orc among "
"the Swordlords.\""
msgstr "\"알도리 특사는 호기심 많은 타입이다. 소드로드가 하프오크를 만날 거라곤 생각하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Kassil_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0c6196a0-1dc9-469e-a38f-4c853e05a6c5"
msgid ""
"\"A noble and brave heart makes for a true knight, not a person's ancestry. "
"And Sir Kassil possesses those virtues without a doubt.\""
msgstr "\"가계도가 아니라 귀함과 용맹함 만이 진정한 기사의 가치야. 카실은 그러한 덕목을 가지고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Kassil_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3cdddea2-9f86-4b78-9ce3-03a0e69dcb99"
msgid ""
"\"He was able to change a destiny that was written upon him by his very "
"birth. He was able to find his own way. This is admirable.\""
msgstr "\"그는 자신의 운명을 바꿀 수 있었어. 그리고 자신의 길을 찾아갔지. 대단한 인재야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_Kassil_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5997aeda-5003-4109-8ced-f95a38956daa"
msgid ""
"\"Kassil is a sweetheart. But he should smile more often — then he'd be "
"priceless!\""
msgstr "\"카실은 귀여워. 하지만 더 자주 웃으면 정말 괜찮을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_c31_FirstWorldFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5e156dba-c6a2-46a6-aac0-1ceca7c7c212"
msgid ""
"\"I'm fairly certain that the old man who helped us to destroy the Flower "
"knew something of the gnomes' migration from the First World. I still can't "
"believe he refused to give me any answers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"꽃을 없애도록 우리를 도운 그 늙은 남자는 태초 세계로부터의 노움의 대이주에 관한 사실을 알지도 몰라. 그는 왜 내게 말하지 않았을까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_c31_FirstWorldFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ba06e12c-ed53-49ed-b78c-ca368d4aa144"
msgid ""
"\"We visited another world, learned an unbelievable secret, won an "
"unprecedented victory and brought peace to our lands. Yet still all you care "
"about is gnomes! Gnomes! Gnomes! Gnomes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 다른 세계를 방문해서 놀라운 비밀을 배우고 전례없는 승리를 거두어 우리 땅에 평화를 가져왔어. 하지만 너는 아직도 노움 생각 "
"뿐이야. 그놈의 노움! 노움!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_c31_FirstWorldFeedback_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a5fc13ea-0ab0-404f-ab68-07bd4c25a86b"
msgid ""
"\"You've seen people torn apart by monsters, from the inside out — and your "
"reaction is to wallow in self-pity?!\""
msgstr "\"괴물이 사람들의 살을 찢고 나오는 모습을 봤지? 그런데 너는 고작 네 걱정이나 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Jubilost/Banter_Jubilost_c31_FirstWorldFeedback_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b6201f7b-7922-4ba7-be25-60907fe06538"
msgid ""
"\"Searching for knowledge is as vain and futile as accumulating worldly "
"goods.\""
msgstr "\"지식 추구는 수집품을 모으는 것만큼이나 쓸모없는 짓이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_C31_FWFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b88f78c8-f5fc-4ddd-947d-1eacc5baef6c"
msgid ""
"\"So strange. The First World reminds me of an oasis in the middle of the "
"desert, a riot of life. But there's madness in its power. It frightens me.\""
msgstr "\"이상하군. 태초 세계는 사막의 오아시스 같은 곳이었는데. 하지만 광기를 숨기고 있었어. 두렵다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_C31_FWFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5305335e-afce-4ba4-ba62-515bf3a87a22"
msgid ""
"\"The universe is vast, and there are places we will find hard to "
"understand, no matter how hard we try. The First World is such a place.\""
msgstr "\"우주는 광활하고 이해하지 못할 일들이 펼쳐지고는 하지. 태초 세계도 그런 장소야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_C5_Evindra_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b3854c06-7926-4b2e-a1cc-e609e2b283bc"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stop thinking about what we learned from Evindra the nereid. She "
"and the Defaced Sisters loved and trusted the one who deceived them.\""
msgstr "\"네레이드 에빈드라에게 배운 사실을 잊을 수 없어. 그녀와 얼굴 잃은 자매들은 자신들을 기만한 자를 사랑하고 믿었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_C5_Evindra_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "53d20b92-a3b0-4d0c-b49e-c5033df17f59"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa has her charm. But she's pure evil, a destructive force of nature "
"made flesh.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 초월적인 아름다움을 지녔으니까요. 비록 자연의 순수한 파괴력을 한데 빚은 사악한 존재일지라도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b17007e8-1dbb-44e5-a266-70e528adf6ff"
msgid ""
"\"My friends! Today is the birthday of the one who brought us together, and "
"who leads us forward, from one victory to the next.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 우리를 여기로 이끈 우리 지도자의 생일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "935a7cf8-5832-4f36-9d74-645dfd18b3e8"
msgid ""
"\"Your path climbs ever upward, to the heights of fame and greatness. But "
"let me wish that this path is never lonely! May your loyal friends be with "
"you even at the top of the world – those who've walked beside you from the "
"very beginning!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 운명은 상승가도를 달리고 있어. 하지만 결코 외로운 운명이 아닐 거야! 네 충성스러운 친구들이 언제나 그랬듯이 너와 함께 할 "
"테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_Kassil_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a932e653-a8c4-4c75-8e73-105add2be66e"
msgid ""
"\"Kassil Aldori is an amazing creature. I talked to him the other day... I "
"was surprised to discover that we had so much in common.\""
msgstr "\"카실 알도리는 놀라운 녀석이야. 언젠가는 대화를 나눴는데 많은 공통점이 있어서 놀랐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kalikke/Banter_Kalikke_Kassil_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "42279c01-d206-4fc1-9d14-224d627c18a7"
msgid ""
"\"Well, at least someone enjoys the company of that buttoned-up Swordlord. I "
"also tried talking to him not long ago – but fell asleep after the third "
"'Aldori, Aldori, Aldori'.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 녀석은 소드로드도 해 보고 좋겠네. 나도 얼마 전에 그 녀석과 대화를 했었는데 알도리 얘기만 해서 곯아떨어졌지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_C2_Lebeda_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "aa9692cb-5aa0-44b8-9728-a6f409d139c4"
msgid ""
"\"So, Lander Lebeda. Young and arrogant, naive heir to a rich and noble "
"family. Excellent prey for a skilled hunter... or huntress.\""
msgstr "\"랜더 레베다. 젊고 거만한 귀족가의 상속자야. 숙련된 사냥꾼의 먹잇감이랄까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_C2_Lebeda_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "11132765-4b44-4b77-b473-b0f1f931e4af"
msgid ""
"\"I want to punch him in the nose every time I see him. Next time I might "
"just bring a stool to the throne room and do it!\""
msgstr "\"그 녀석을 볼 때마다 얼굴에 한방 먹여주고 싶어. 다음에 만나면 의자를 집어던져줘야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_C31_FWFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "37725abf-3962-4d30-b07d-ca78cc34e733"
msgid ""
"\"So strange. The First World reminds me of an oasis in the middle of the "
"desert, a riot of life. But there's madness in its power. It frightens me.\""
msgstr "\"이상하군. 태초 세계는 사막의 오아시스 같은 곳이었는데. 하지만 광기를 숨기고 있었어. 두렵다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_C31_FWFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0a9494d3-33f0-43a5-b622-098c4a94ea09"
msgid ""
"\"The universe is vast, and there are places we will find hard to "
"understand, no matter how hard we try. The First World is such a place.\""
msgstr "\"우주는 광활하고 이해하지 못할 일들이 펼쳐지고는 하지. 태초 세계도 그런 장소야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_C5_Evindra_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1158a8b4-8208-4375-8be0-07f4737ee2e4"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stop thinking about what we learned from Evindra the nereid. She "
"and the Defaced Sisters loved and trusted the one who deceived them.\""
msgstr "\"네레이드 에빈드라에게 배운 사실을 잊을 수 없어. 그녀와 얼굴 잃은 자매들은 자신들을 기만한 자를 사랑하고 믿었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_C5_Evindra_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6bdb9dd8-3fa6-45cb-8a03-fd8af5f9dfb4"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa has her charm. But she's pure evil, a destructive force of nature "
"made flesh.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 초월적인 아름다움을 지녔으니까요. 비록 자연의 순수한 파괴력을 한데 빚은 사악한 존재일지라도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0c84f554-dd33-413f-9cdd-3a917b5caaf6"
msgid ""
"\"Let us raise our flasks! On this day the one who gathered us here was born!"
"\""
msgstr "\"술 가져와! 이 날 우리를 한곳으로 모은 녀석이 태어난 날이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d98f3bd0-f391-4489-89d7-8978a464a0ad"
msgid ""
"\"You climbed the heights of power. – Now allow me to wish you be spared "
"loneliness, the bane of monarchs! Even the most luxurious palace will seem a "
"dreary hut, if you've no one to share it with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 권력을 얻기 위해 노력했지. 지금은 네 왕좌에서 내가 말벗이 되어주다니! 나 같은 사람이 없었으면 아무리 우아한 궁전이라도 "
"쓸쓸했을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_Shandra_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f454f137-ad20-48a8-8b24-4516e60e33e0"
msgid ""
"\"Our Brevan emissary, Shandra Mervey, is quite incredible. What a steely "
"grip, and what a cold mind! I'd fall in love if she were twenty years "
"younger. Although I might murder her quietly and secretly, just in case.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 브레보이 사절 샨드라 머비는 정말 대단해. 냉철한 머리의 행동파라고 할까. 그녀가 20년만 더 젊었으면 사랑에 빠졌을지도 "
"몰라. 작업을 걸었다가 소리소문 없이 살해를 당할지도 모르겠지만 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Kanerah/Banter_Kanerah_Shandra_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e97b5113-4047-4383-be5e-9b78ceca27a0"
msgid "\"But she is our ally! Isn't she? Isn't she?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 그녀는 우리 동료야! 그렇지? 그렇겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Bokken_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ac642fa7-a011-4464-a088-b9b387b2456a"
msgid ""
"\"And I like Bokken. He reminds me of a book seller I know... Cold and tart "
"at first, but if he likes someone, it's forever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 보큰이 맘에 들어요. 제가 알던 책장수를 생각나게 해요... 처음에는 냉담하고 신랄하지만 한번 정을 주면 끝까지 주는 그런 "
"사람이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Bokken_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "38620865-c79c-4037-9a46-6cf467bb18fa"
msgid ""
"\"It was so good of Oleg and Svetlana to help him. I think he'd have a tough "
"time without them.\""
msgstr "\"올렉과 스베틀라나가 그를 돕다니 정말 잘되었어. 그들이 없었다면 힘들었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Bokken_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "084db046-2c50-4f11-982c-c54e00a09e72"
msgid "\"Many girls are like that, ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"많은 소녀들이 그렇지. 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Bokken_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e2c3ab10-15b7-4ccf-8d9e-fe5b337c4903"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, one must make allowances for his age. But he'd be better off if "
"he learned some manners.\""
msgstr "\"물론 나이에 맞는 수당을 받아야 하지. 하지만 예절을 안다면 좋은 대우를 받아도 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ee8d0076-847a-438c-901e-f8373d0d66bf"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe our adventure finally begins! I'm so happy to be here! And "
"I do hope we will become trusted companions... and perhaps even true friends!"
"\""
msgstr "\"우리의 모험이 마침내 시작되었다니 믿을 수 없어! 여기에 와서 너무 기뻐. 우리가 진정한 동료가 된다면 얼마나 좋을까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fd8d0cc5-7f74-4b77-9e61-0f84a059b16d"
msgid "\"Slay me now.\""
msgstr "\"이제 날 죽여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7a687633-4e3b-42ac-a79a-7c523760801a"
msgid "\"Oh, yes, certainly. Could you pass the salt?\""
msgstr "\"오. 그래. 소금 좀 줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C11_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d2547011-ad46-4eab-af14-f158b2fa8654"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, that's the spirit! Well I for one am glad to be here too. Maybe "
"this truly is the beginning of something wonderful!\""
msgstr "\"하하하. 잘했어! 나도 영웅이 되어 기쁘구만. 어쩌면 이게 정말로 멋진 무언가의 시작일 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_DelicateSituation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6aa1aa82-40e2-48b4-9548-801d74338eea"
msgid ""
"\"The things one sees! Huge, hairy woodsmen at the mercy of a small but "
"daring fey... What a vivid image! That just begs to be included in a book!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 들었는데 말이지! 거대하고 털복숭이 나무꾼이 작지만 무서운 fey에게 자비를 구했다는군. 정말 우습지 않아! 책에 쓰였으면 "
"재밌을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_DelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "297bd2e0-1756-4d26-a46e-f21c336ed0aa"
msgid ""
"\"We shall see who writes of this episode first — and who publishes it first!"
"\""
msgstr "\"누가 처음 이 에피소드를 써서 출판할지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_DelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7aaabebc-7292-4458-8a51-b441237799cd"
msgid "\"How easily you are impressed.\""
msgstr "\"정말 쉽게 갑동받는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_DelicateSituation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e1bab5f7-3ae7-4706-a93f-f0f040bbd368"
msgid ""
"\"I'm truly sorry for the woodsmen's trouble. But I can also sympathize with "
"the fey's suffering. Her grove was about to be destroyed!\""
msgstr "\"나무꾼들의 일은 안됐지만, 페이의 고통도 이해가 가. 그녀의 숲이 없어질 뻔했잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "30c63ea6-a3f7-4755-a6dc-7bf8573d0b19"
msgid ""
"\"All right, I need your ideas! Who is that Storyteller who's living in the "
"capital? How could an elf look so old? It shouldn't be possible!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아, 너의 생각이 필요해! 수도에 살고 있는 이야기꾼은 누구야? 어떻게 엘프가 그렇게 나이들어보일 수 있지? 그건 불가능할 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ad79caac-a87d-465a-9540-89514500917d"
msgid "\"You meet all kinds of freaks. He's not nearly the worst.\""
msgstr "\"세상에 미친놈은 많지만 그는 그리 나쁜 사람은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ef371131-218b-42e7-a80e-2df961d9acd7"
msgid ""
"\"I thought about that. Did he find a way to prolong his life, but paid for "
"it with his youth and beauty? Death is more merciful than life, in such an "
"ugly old body. I could never stand it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것에 대해 생각해 봤어. 그는 자신의 삶을 연명할 방법을 찾았지만 젊음과 아름다움을 대가로 바쳐야 했지? 그런 추하고 늙은 몸이라면 "
"죽는 편이 나아. 나라면 못참을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5da466b8-4c07-4642-92e7-ec263d35560d"
msgid ""
"\"He's a Storyteller, is he not? He has many stories to tell. This may be "
"one of them. Meanwhile, I'd say he's just a common half-elf, plain and "
"simple.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 이야기꾼이지? 그는 많은 이야기를 알고 있어. 이것도 그것들 중의 하나지. 하지만 그는 그저 평범하고 단순한 하프엘프야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0cb92030-1f5f-40c1-8b4d-9b0c610a4d9c"
msgid ""
"\"I feel that he's much more than he appears. I sense true power within him, "
"but not power corrupted by evil. Whoever he is, he might make a valuable "
"ally.\""
msgstr "\"그는 생각보다 나이가 많은 거 같아. 그의 힘은 악에 물들지는 않았어. 그가 누구던 좋은 동료가 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0bb640c4-0d6a-4782-8d4f-59af8373a8ed"
msgid ""
"\"I've been asking myself the same question. No scientific treatises hold "
"any solid information about the aging of elves. Either our Storyteller has "
"fallen victim to a powerful magic, or he's a liar, plain and simple.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 같은 생각을 해 봤어. 엘프의 고령화에 관한 확고한 정보를 과학적으로 다루는 논문은 없지. 그 이야기꾼이 강력한 마술에 "
"희생되었거나 평범하고 단순한 거짓말쟁이던 상관 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9ce8f744-26a7-46b0-90b4-d2e7685df5d3"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe he's a spirit pretending to be mortal so he can watch us? But is he "
"a good spirit, or an evil one...\""
msgstr "\"아마 그는 우리를 감시하려고 필멸자인 척하는 녀석이 아닐까? 착한 녀석일까 나쁜 녀석일까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_PaizoCollector_Responses.Array.data[6].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "36eabcba-de35-46a3-8c4e-019123352953"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe he's a spirit pretending to be mortal so he can watch us? But is he "
"a good spirit, or an evil one...\""
msgstr "\"아마 그는 우리를 감시하려고 필멸자인 척하는 녀석이 아닐까? 착한 녀석일까 나쁜 녀석일까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3d6300c8-390a-4f3c-93ea-82f850435457"
msgid ""
"\"Just imagine! Only a short while ago I was expelled and my works censored —"
" and now I'm a court chronicler! I wonder what more awaits!\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각해 봐! 얼마 전까지 나는 추방되었고 내 작품은 검열되었어. 그런제 지금은 왕의 연대기 작가야! 내 인생이 어떻게 될지 궁금해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ca2d2a27-9983-42cd-a64e-952ac1ddefc5"
msgid "\"A new beginning?\""
msgstr "\"새로운 시작?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2fc80952-78eb-44c1-b176-eb417486bed8"
msgid ""
"\"Don't let these changes make your head spin. You have a great "
"responsibility now.\""
msgstr "\"새로운 변화에 어서 적응해야 해. 지금 네 어깨는 무거워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f8d85a0a-18d9-4965-95fc-0412b8811714"
msgid ""
"\"You? That's nothing special. But the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} has "
"created some rather interesting opportunities...\""
msgstr "\"너? 별로 특별한 건 없어. 하지만 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 흥미로운 기회를 만들었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterDialogueLynching_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b88d679d-604a-424f-8482-b76eb780c323"
msgid ""
"\"A gloomy crowd, angry cries, axes and pitchforks... I can't but recall my "
"younger years in Galt.\""
msgstr "\"도탄에 빠진 백성과 아우성, 도끼와 갈퀴... 갈트에서의 기억을 잊을 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterDialogueLynching_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7423dabc-7aa0-4355-abbe-85aedc5f9112"
msgid ""
"\"It was our duty to give them a chance to change their minds. But the "
"terrible events of the past days have stoked their minds to a fevered pitch."
"\""
msgstr "\"그들의 생각을 바꿀 기회를 주는 것이 우리 임무였어. 하지만 과거의 끔찍한 사건들은 그들의 이상에 찬물을 끼얹었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterDialogueLynching_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e7b4d522-6d04-4a6a-b845-22c3167f6cb4"
msgid ""
"\"I don't judge... but if they jump at me with weapons, I make my answer "
"quick.\""
msgstr "\"판단하지 않겠어... 하지만 그들이 무기를 들고 나에게 뛰어들어서 반격해야만 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterDialogueLynching_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6e5736ea-4b9b-468e-9c61-695b4e871e84"
msgid "\"Like a bustling ant-hill in the face of a wild fire.\""
msgstr "\"마치 숲이 불타면서 개미가 만든 언덕도 불타는 듯이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterDialogueLynching_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c6e8c543-a18e-44ea-aa5d-97b02281ffbe"
msgid ""
"\"People have different faces, skin and eyes... But the vicious cries of the "
"crowd are the same in every country!\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 얼굴, 피부, 눈이 달라... 하지만 어느 나라던 군중의 비명소리는 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterDialogueLynching_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9d9d8db4-cf2a-417f-89d9-1c8bc5e24c78"
msgid ""
"\"People have different faces, skin and eyes... But the vicious cries of the "
"crowd are the same in every country!\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 얼굴, 피부, 눈이 달라... 하지만 어느 나라던 군중의 비명소리는 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterKtc22threequests_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f3e6162c-5262-4a77-b4b2-d3aed7670182"
msgid ""
"\"When I imagined adventures and heroes, this is not what I expected. Of "
"course there were exciting battles... But not terrible disease... And gods, "
"so much blood...\""
msgstr ""
"\"모험과 영웅을 상상했을 때 이것은 기대했던 것이 아니었어. 물론 흥미진진한 전투가 있었지만... 끔찍한 질병은 아니었어... "
"그리고... 피가 넘쳐흘렀어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterKtc22threequests_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f4ddb58e-b02d-435e-a902-1a060a3263b3"
msgid "\"Sarenrae have mercy on their souls.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이여. 그들에게 자비를 베푸소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterKtc22threequests_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "38124afa-b0dc-4eea-b067-2982a5e4aed5"
msgid ""
"\"Life is cruel. Kill or be killed. There is usually no time for pity.\""
msgstr "\"인생은 잔인해. 죽이지 않으면 죽임을 당하지. 동정할 여유가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C22_AfterKtc22threequests_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2f3bbf52-9f23-4f4c-9e74-f3130463895a"
msgid ""
"\"'Tis the sad lot of the short-lived. To tremble over half a dozen years, "
"like a miser with a scant handful of coins.\""
msgstr "\"단명한 사람들의 슬픈 운명이야. 수중에 몇푼 가지고 몇년을 발악했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_AfterBarbieCamp_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c6c7e3a5-504a-4846-94fc-94a421062569"
msgid ""
"\"These barbarians make marvelous characters... All we need is some savage "
"with a high sense of honor!\""
msgstr "\"이 야만족들은 놀라운 자들이야... 우리는 명예로운 야만인이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_AfterBarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e18fa403-6e5d-41b2-8c6a-8455c5975b0d"
msgid ""
"\"Do you ever talk about anything besides your book? Life is so much bigger "
"than art can ever portray. People are so much more complicated than any "
"sketch conveys...\""
msgstr "\"네 책 말고 다른 이야기를 한 적 있어? 삶은 묘사할 수 없을 만큼 커. 사람들은 책의 내용보다 훨씬 복잡하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_AfterBarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "53e24667-0afe-432c-a2fe-56641944b334"
msgid "\"Trust me, you don't want to know them better...\""
msgstr "\"날 믿어. 그들에 대해 알고 싶지 않을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_AfterBarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "49f4e921-8cb0-41ad-be33-9d21292b9d5a"
msgid ""
"\"Take me for example! You see every day how honorable I can be. And you "
"hear every night how savage, ha, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"예를 들면? 나는 매일 명예로운 삶을 살아. 그리고 매일 밤마다 나의 야만스러운 소리를 들을 텐데. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_Anytime_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "53454141-f3e9-40fa-b21f-4c80e552e15d"
msgid ""
"\"The crushing defeat of the bandit king and his countless forces! A mighty "
"troll empire invading the kobolds. Disease. Conquering half of the world — "
"and now this... I won't even have to make anything up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도적들과 그들의 왕의 패배! 코볼트를 습격하는 트롤 제국. 질병. 세계의 절반을 지배... 그리고 지금... 나는 무엇도 만들어낼 "
"필요가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3bb5a3bc-380a-4263-91db-948ee4f52865"
msgid ""
"\"I will never understand how danger and death make for entertainment.\""
msgstr "\"나는 위험과 죽음이 어떻게 즐거움을 선사하는지 이해하지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5c69addb-eb64-4bec-ba56-16c62c1b2e51"
msgid ""
"\"Romantic maximalism and vulgar hyperbole are stock and trade of amateurs "
"and graphomaniacs. Oh, who am I talking to... no one here even understands "
"these words...\""
msgstr "\"낭만주의의 도배와 저속한 과장은 아마추어의 특징이지. 오. 맞아. 너는 이해하지 못하지... 미안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fd1c3a3c-f634-4bc3-8b9d-2927298f2399"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes even I can scarcely believe that so many exciting things can "
"happen to the same people in such a short time! Imagine the readers of your "
"book...\""
msgstr "\"짧은 기간에 같은 사람에게 흥미로운 사건들이 연달아 일어나는 모습이 놀랍기만 해. 그걸 읽는 독자를 생각해 봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C31_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8e3813fa-f27d-4088-b243-714122fc7715"
msgid "\"Better just make up. Don't write about us. Me ever.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 지어내. 우리에 대해 쓰지 말고. 나는 더더욱.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C41_BeforeTristianReturns_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "468f6f3c-b881-4e5f-93f5-ec6e6541bb53"
msgid ""
"\"I can't imagine what Tristian must be feeling right now! The gods only "
"know what he's had to go through...\""
msgstr "\"지금 트리스티안의 기분이 어떨지 상상이 안가! 그가 어떤 일을 겪을지 신만이 알겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C41_BeforeTristianReturns_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ffaea52f-af94-4df4-bb6f-a7e7fdb1bbea"
msgid ""
"\"And even gods afraid to think about what I'll do to him if we meet him "
"again!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 그를 다시 만나면 신들도 무슨 일이 일어날지 걱정할걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C41_BeforeTristianReturns_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ed08aa23-c04b-44da-b2ab-fef84fab3b64"
msgid ""
"\"Something tells me that an incredible power was involved with this story — "
"something that could challenge Sarenrae herself...\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없는 힘이 이 이야기에 연루되어있는 느낌이 들어. 서렌레이에게 도전하는 무언가가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C41_BeforeTristianReturns_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "662e2cd6-5833-403b-92a2-fec98649d17a"
msgid "\"Suffering changes people. Not always for the better.\""
msgstr "\"고난은 사람들을 변화시키지. 항상 좋은 쪽은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C41_BeforeTristianReturns_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "0d6af8d0-5e9c-44ca-83cb-4eb01efd92e5"
msgid ""
"\"Have no sympathy for traitors, Linzi. Especially those who wear the white "
"robes of the righteous.\""
msgstr "\"그 반역자들을 동정하지마. 린지. 특히 정의의 백색 로브를 입은 자 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C41_BeforeTristianReturns_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "eed68cf5-7391-432c-b8b1-a1fa7709d653"
msgid ""
"\"Have no sympathy for traitors, Linzi. Especially those who wear the white "
"robes of the righteous.\""
msgstr "\"그 반역자들을 동정하지마. 린지. 특히 정의의 백색 로브를 입은 자 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterCoronation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "30b3082d-4d95-4cf4-953e-a9beced84b42"
msgid ""
"\"My friends! We had a glorious feast after the coronation, but I'd still "
"like to propose another toast to our friend! To you, {name}! May "
"{kingdomname} stand for a thousand years!\""
msgstr ""
"\"친구들이여! 우리는 대관식을 끝내고 멋진 연회를 가졌지만 나는 여전히 우리의 친구에게 건배를 제의하고 싶어! {name}을 위해! "
"{kingdomname}이 영원히 번영하기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "445978de-fc0c-4881-8fe5-ae6b5d858cdd"
msgid "\"To the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "229acb05-d44c-4e5e-84c1-bb02f742a7f9"
msgid "\"To you, {name}! You deserve it!\""
msgstr "\"{name}을 위해! 네가 최고야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f5943115-272e-4378-8b1d-d9d3a00752a0"
msgid "\"Bottoms up!\""
msgstr "\"죽 마셔!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ca4b23ff-3692-4706-87ce-e08c910b6f26"
msgid ""
"\"Have you heard the garbage that the bards of Pitax are composing on "
"Irovetti's orders? It's vile slander! And it's written so dreadfully!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 명령에 따라 피탁스의 음유시인들이 작곡을 한다는 소문 들었어? 미치지 않고서야! 엄청나게 정성을 들였다는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f05cb912-ab36-4881-887c-0627abaa029a"
msgid ""
"\"So why don't you fight back? Or maybe I should be the court versemaker "
"instead of you, ha ha! 'Irovetti, just in case, I will punch you in the "
"face!'\""
msgstr "\"왜 싸우지 않는 거야? 아니면 너 대신에 궁중 음유시인이 되어 볼까? 하하하! 이로베티 님. 네 낯짝에 한방 갈겨드릴게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "768f4e4b-dec2-4b16-9c5f-e761665753d6"
msgid "\"When do you have time to read all that?\""
msgstr "\"언제까지 읽을 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0e37147b-b3a6-4195-85a4-225859d17687"
msgid ""
"\"Fighting a war by the most underhanded methods, while avoiding honest "
"battle — that's exactly his style.\""
msgstr "\"전면전을 피하면서 부작용이 가장 적은 방법으로 싸우는 것이 그의 특징이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a1c31cf7-44d3-4ca7-b5fd-be02c15bf205"
msgid ""
"\"Let them write! Write it all! Then we steal aaaall their papers — and then "
"we get their think-thoughts! Great plan, right?\""
msgstr "\"쓰게 내버려둬. 모두 쓰라고 해! 모두 쓰면 원고를 훔쳐 보자. 좋은 계획이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_BardCampVisited_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ad2ee9ab-18c4-46d2-816a-5100b7ba7242"
msgid ""
"\"I should have guessed that this unbearable minion, Trebricent, would be "
"chief among Irovetti's bards! I remember being sickened by his verses even "
"back at the Academy...\""
msgstr "\"Trebricent가 이로베티의 바드들 중 우두머리라고 생각해! 아카데미에서도 그 녀석의 작품은 정말 짜증났거든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_BardCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "eb1669d0-48ec-43ab-ac61-885c9fd5ef93"
msgid "\"Another useful idiot who chose the wrong ruler.\""
msgstr "\"통치자를 잘못 선택한 또 다른 바보로군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_BardCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "57e24613-5402-4065-998e-cbdb4a48b892"
msgid ""
"\"For the life of me, I can't understand it. — Was he really that crazy "
"about Irovetti? Or was he so used to licking his boots that couldn't "
"straighten up even before his death?\""
msgstr "\"내 삶에 반영할 때 이해할 수 없어. 정말 이로베티에 환장한 거 아닌가? 아니면 그의 장화를 핥는 데에 익숙해져버렸나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_C_51_BardCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "64b57fc4-87f3-4bec-a104-18d1b74c7826"
msgid ""
"\"I thought his kind would be scared, wouldn't want to die. Would betray his "
"master and beg to join us. But he fought until the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그라면 두려워서 죽고 싶지 않았을 거야. 그의 주인을 배반하고 우리에게 합류할 수도 있었을걸. 하지만 그는 끝까지 싸웠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "57222b68-6778-4180-8ca2-a46d330c8240"
msgid ""
"\"It's today, right? I made a note so I won't forget, but then I forgot "
"where I put the note!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 맞지? 잊지 않으려고 적어두었지만 메모를 어디에 두었는지 잊어버렸어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d1a814f4-231a-4646-af25-cc9f285bbf49"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, here it is… Our {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} has a very special day "
"today! I wish you many new adventures and exciting events! Because what "
"could be better than adventures? Happy Birthday!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 여기 있네... 우리 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 특별한 날이야! 앞으로도 새로운 모험과 흥미로운 일들이 일어나길 바랄게요! "
"모험보다 좋은 게 어디있겠어요? 생일 축하해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LanderLebeda_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "314f3b0a-6d3b-472e-8eb1-614482546237"
msgid ""
"\"This Lander Lebeda... He's a shady fellow! I wouldn't risk setting out on "
"a crusade with him.\""
msgstr "\"랜더 레베다... 정말 음침한 녀석이야! 그 녀석과 전투에 나가는 위험을 나라면 감당하지는 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LanderLebeda_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "770c4748-c2d9-4d9a-96ea-922b107cf684"
msgid ""
"\"You're just realizing that now?! I don't know what's more amazing — the "
"fact that you see this about him right away, or the fact I can still be "
"surprised by people's naivete...\""
msgstr "\"이제 알았어? 도대체 너는... 이제서야 그를 제대로 알았다니. 아니면 보통 사람이라면 몰랐으려나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LanderLebeda_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6bdca6f3-6f27-47f3-ac69-c1a190984f7f"
msgid ""
"\"When an animal flees its own pack, it's been chased away. When a man sets "
"out on his own, he's running only from himself…\""
msgstr "\"짐승이 자신의 무리에게서 도망칠 때 자신의 무리에게서 추적을 당할 거야. 인간이 떠날 때는 아무도 쫓지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Linzi/Banter_Linzi_LanderLebeda_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f082d916-7f7d-40ec-84bb-e3217f70c63d"
msgid ""
"\"Ha. His vile intent was written in red upon his forehead. I've seen enough "
"such adventurers in the courts of Kyonin. But I suppose this only makes it "
"easier to use him for our benefit...\""
msgstr "\"그의 이마에 적혀진 붉은 인장은 쿄닌의 법정에서 많이 사용되던 것이다. 그를 이용하기 쉽겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C22_AfterGoblinKingDefeat_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b91a6941-5a52-46d8-9801-649d70aa3925"
msgid ""
"\"Without the king, goblins need their own hero. Not longshank or halfshank. "
"Their own. Like me.\""
msgstr "\"왕이 없으면 고블린은 그들의 영웅이 필요해. 꺽다리도 반쪽이도 될 수 없다. 오직 고블린만. 나 같은 고블린 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C22_AfterGoblinKingDefeat_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e69c405e-1748-4001-a9d1-e12cb6ccd24c"
msgid ""
"\"That's great, Nok-Nok, keep it up! Maybe someday you'll grow some spine... "
"instead of warts, ha!\""
msgstr "\"그거 괜찮네. 녹-녹. 언젠가 너도 허리를 펴고 살 날이 올 거야. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C22_AfterGoblinKingDefeat_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "add26f34-b89b-4ec9-86bb-ef7f2a96d08f"
msgid "\"Pathetic.\""
msgstr "\"한심하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C22_AfterGoblinKingDefeat_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1aabcdfc-7acb-4090-abda-ceed16a3a919"
msgid ""
"\"After the fall of the king the whole tribe should have been gone, like the "
"last breath of life leaving a corpse's lungs. Yet goblins tend to defy "
"universal laws.\""
msgstr "\"왕의 몰락 이후 모든 종족은 시체의 마지막 숨결처럼 사라진다. 그러나 고블린은 상식을 벗어나고는 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterFirstRavenTalk_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5fc8c893-b567-4859-a546-14abb00fb034"
msgid ""
"\"Mother of Monsters doesn't give voice to simple critters. Gives fangs. "
"Gives talons. Gives extra limbs. But not voice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴물들의 어머니는 단순한 동물들에게 목소리 주지 못한다. 송곳니 준다. 발톱 준다. 여분의 팔다리 준다. 하지만 목소리 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterFirstRavenTalk_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "dfd56b45-dada-4aaf-9547-c1b58046dbc5"
msgid ""
"\"I am afraid that the bird we met is a herald of another kind of evil. "
"Perhaps Sarenrae herself sends me this ominous premonition as a warning.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 만난 새가 악의 징조일까 두렵다. 아마 서렌레이가 나에게 불길한 경고를 하는 것일지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterFirstRavenTalk_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "935f2903-3870-461c-a264-4baa811debcf"
msgid ""
"\"If you mean that raven, then the source of its capabilities could be not "
"the goddess, but any spellbinder. I hope we won't have to deal with another "
"follower of Lamashtu.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 까마귀 말하는 거라면 그 마법의 원천은 신이 아니라 마법사일 거야. 라마슈투의 다른 추종자를 상대하지 않아야 할 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterFirstRavenTalk_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "159cd145-68ae-4108-ad37-000c3f5624c6"
msgid ""
"\"You mean that winged rat in Varnhold? Just forget it! Should have kicked "
"the life out of it when we had a chance!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 날개달린 쥐를 말하는 거야? 이제 그만해! 기회가 생겼을 때 그 녀석을 내쫓아야 했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterFirstRavenTalk_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "eaf43c71-9fba-469b-a98c-f56ee226e835"
msgid ""
"\"There are many monsters besides the children of your goddess. Some of them "
"are quite eloquent, and even polite!\""
msgstr "\"네 여신의 자식들 주위에는 많은 괴물이 있어. 몇몇은 아주 예의바르기도 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterFirstRavenTalk_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0ee12d24-7253-4343-83cc-f801af546052"
msgid ""
"\"There are many monsters besides the children of your goddess. Some of them "
"are quite eloquent, and even polite!\""
msgstr "\"네 여신의 자식들 주위에는 많은 괴물이 있어. 몇몇은 아주 예의바르기도 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterMeetingSister_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "164a05fe-a8d6-46a2-b9a7-12652472859c"
msgid ""
"\"That female back at the barbarian camp... strange. Smells funny. Walks "
"funny. As if broken.\""
msgstr "\"야만인 야영지의 그 여자... 이상했어. 냄새도 이상하고. 걸음걸이도 웃기고 말이야. 미친 여자 같았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterMeetingSister_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b4ebe6c6-b740-4b79-91e0-e49ffc1111f2"
msgid ""
"\"I... well, it's a strange to say, but I agree. When I stood next to her I "
"got goosebumps all over!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄... 이상한 건 맞아. 그녀 옆에 있을 때 닭살이 돋더라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterMeetingSister_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a08b3df7-e644-4be5-a2ae-e12e405f4d87"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't like that witch either. I don't care what she smells like, but I "
"don't trust those who hide their faces.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그 마녀를 좋아하지 않았어. 냄새는 상관 없지만 그 얼굴 뒤에 감춰진 본성을 믿지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_AfterMeetingSister_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e411e7c4-947a-4857-8b30-3a36770ad28f"
msgid ""
"\"Broken. Hmmm... that's an interesting notion from a degenerate pet like "
"you. I wonder how close to the truth that is...\""
msgstr "\"미쳤다니... 너처럼 퇴화한 애완 동물의 관점이란 재밌구나. 진실이 얼마나 가까운지 궁금한데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_WhenReceivedVordakaiInvitation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "bdacd4cf-9e76-4f5c-99c9-202468990a34"
msgid "\"We shan't go to Vordakai. It's a trap. I knew it right away.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이에게 가지 마. 함정이야. 나는 알고 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_WhenReceivedVordakaiInvitation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6ffa7af6-2df3-4738-b82d-504c26d7ce14"
msgid ""
"\"Erm... I thought traps should be unexpected? This looked more like an "
"invitation.\""
msgstr "\"음... 그걸 함정이라고 생각했어? 나는 초대장이라고 생각했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_WhenReceivedVordakaiInvitation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "84497395-183a-4ab8-8ce3-3063ebcc32b3"
msgid ""
"\"It's not a trap, Nok-Nok. It's just another step to oblivion that awaits "
"us all... or a chance to return a thing that denied its own end to where it "
"belongs.\""
msgstr "\"그건 함정이 아니야. 녹-녹. 우리를 기다리고 있는 망각의 첫 단계일 뿐이지. 아니면 종말로 되돌아갈 기회일지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C31_WhenReceivedVordakaiInvitation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2bde1063-37ff-4b34-8e14-fdd3d003118a"
msgid ""
"\"Hells no! We go and wipe the floor with this Vordakai, and make soup out "
"of this bird! I am sick of this mysterious \"masterrr\" that is so afraid of "
"us that he hides away in his lair and trembles shitless!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안돼! 우리는 보다카이와 가서 바닥을 닦고 새를 잡아 수프를 만들어야 해! 나는 수수께끼는 질렸어. 그건 우리가 두려운 나머지 자기 "
"집으로 숨어서 덜덜 떨고 있었을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_AfterBorderlands_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "89fd20a2-2ee3-44b9-b3bf-8052038a6f6e"
msgid ""
"\"Soon {name} will become a true {mf|king|queen}. Finally {mf|he|she} will "
"measure to that old goblin king we smacked!\""
msgstr "\"{name}은 진정한 왕이 될 거야. 마침내 우리가 쓰러뜨린 고블린 왕처럼 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_AfterBorderlands_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ab594226-bad6-4bfb-b789-81b8431bb1ca"
msgid "\"Measure to goblin. That's some compliment. Are you happy, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"고블린 왕이라. 어울리네. 행복해? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_AfterBorderlands_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "be9deaeb-5627-455e-a4e7-404d3beace1f"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't even dream of seeing your coronation, {name}. Couldn't even "
"dream of still being here with you...\""
msgstr "\"너의 대관식을 보리라고는 꿈에도 생각 못했어. {name}. 그리고 내가 너와 함께 있다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_AfterBorderlands_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3e4914ba-c9f2-4c8a-a2ab-d717bc4f0804"
msgid ""
"\"How can one compare pathetic savage to the lawful monarch? Well, I can't "
"expect much from a beast like goblin.\""
msgstr "\"합법적인 군주와 한심한 야만인을 어떻게 비교할 수 있어? 고블린 같은 짐승에게서 뭘 기대하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_Start_Candlemere_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a42ba2e6-9f9d-47b1-8b62-ce9c0a2e7816"
msgid ""
"\"Greatbeasts rough the land again. Everyone blames Mother again. But that "
"is not her! She would have told me!\""
msgstr "\"괴물들이 다시 땅에 나타났다. 모두 어머니를 욕한다. 하지만 그녀가 아니다! 그랬다면 내가 알았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_Start_Candlemere_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9df7f61a-6ea8-4642-84e8-fce5483a630f"
msgid ""
"\"Judging by your words Lamashtu whispers her visions to you like Groetus "
"whispers prophecies to me. Who would have thought that goblin will "
"understand me better than anyone else...\""
msgstr "\"네 말로 판단하건데 그로투스가 나에게 속삭이든 라마슈투가 너에게 속삭이나보군. 다름아닌 고블린을 이해할 줄이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_Start_Candlemere_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c902e705-e19f-484b-ad35-0aa111e30ccd"
msgid ""
"\"Whoever is to blame, I pity the simple folk that will become beasts' prey. "
"They just began forgetting about that terrible Bloom — and now it strikes "
"again!\""
msgstr "\"누구를 비난하던 괴물의 먹이가 될 사람들이 불쌍해. 역병이 지난지 얼마나 되었다고 괴물에게 당해?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_Start_Candlemere_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9a4e2ea9-96d9-452f-9bed-f8febe33143b"
msgid ""
"\"Hm... maybe we should start drinking only rain water again? Just as a "
"preventive measure!\""
msgstr "\"흠... 빗물을 마시는 것부터 다시 시작해야 할까? 예방 조치로 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_Start_Candlemere_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f027edf3-60fc-4f59-90cf-7eb13a099fb6"
msgid ""
"\"Such are the Stolen Lands. One disaster follows another, and we never know "
"which ancient evil to blame. There are so many that call this place their "
"home!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑맞은 땅이 뭐 그렇지. 재앙이 휩쓸고 가도 어떤 고대의 악이 그랬는지 누가 알겠어. 여기를 자기 집이라고 말하는 자들이 많구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C41_Start_Candlemere_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e67f85c0-7644-4657-b565-cd957fa552bc"
msgid ""
"\"Such are the Stolen Lands. One disaster follows another, and we never know "
"which ancient evil to blame. There are so many that call this place their "
"home!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑맞은 땅이 뭐 그렇지. 재앙이 휩쓸고 가도 어떤 고대의 악이 그랬는지 누가 알겠어. 여기를 자기 집이라고 말하는 자들이 많구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterMeetingEvindra_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "13d6e03d-2c9b-46b2-a4c5-ccd7083cbe94"
msgid ""
"\"Vindra is nasty! Scary! Should have stayed in her hole forever. But noooo, "
"we just couldn't help ourselves!\""
msgstr "\"Vindra는 심술 궂다! 무섭다! 자기 안식처에 머물렀어야 했다. 우리는 모두 끝났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterMeetingEvindra_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "68233716-fa27-4bb2-8aa9-8e28cf345db9"
msgid ""
"\"Who do you mean? Evindra? But she is a beauty! A poor thing none the less "
"although...\""
msgstr "\"누구를 말하는 거야? 에빈드라? 하지만 그녀는 아름다워! 불쌍하지만서도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterMeetingEvindra_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ed5d4db9-9e25-45f6-b199-8ab451404cac"
msgid ""
"\"The famous misperception of reality, ladies and gentlemen, in all its "
"glory! I wonder what would happened if that nereid would smell of lilies. "
"Maybe our toothy friend would die from shock!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영광스러운 현실을 이해하지 못하는구나! 그 네레이드가 백합 냄새가 나면 어떨지 궁금해. 아마 우리 우울한 녀석이 충격으로 죽어버리겠지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterMeetingEvindra_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "92cc0871-7cfe-41d4-8d7d-bd6f9a4a9147"
msgid ""
"\"Poor fey... Not only was she hidden away — she had to deal with that "
"horrible Gardener as well!\""
msgstr "\"불쌍한 fey... 숨어있을 뿐만 아니라 그 끔찍한 정원사와도 거래해야 했다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterRushlight_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e6c9e3ef-7696-45f0-bb86-9f2e14c5c56b"
msgid ""
"\"That longshank tournament was meh. Goblin holidays are another thing! The "
"last one I visited, they brought a herald of Lamashtu, greatbeast! Ate all "
"guests!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 꺽다리들의 토너먼트는 형편 없었어. 고블린의 휴일은 더 근사해! 내가 마지막으로 방문했을 때에는 라마슈투의 사자인 커다란 괴물을 "
"보냈다! 거기서 손님 모두 먹었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterRushlight_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "79f5be17-68c6-417a-b68e-e6e7c22cb420"
msgid "\"I would like to participate. Need to train my aim.\""
msgstr "\"나는 참가하고 싶어. 내 목표를 훈련할 필요가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterRushlight_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "867803c1-e8a2-4fe7-91e2-545b439f5d8e"
msgid ""
"\"Pacify your beastling, {name}. I am fed up with the screeches of those "
"talentless bards from the tournament. I need some silence.\""
msgstr "\"네 짐승을 안정시켜. {name}. 나는 토너먼트에서 나온 그 형편 없는 음유시인에 질렸어. 조용히 있고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterRushlight_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "90bcb2f0-852a-46a1-b800-fad3e9d19b8a"
msgid ""
"\"I saw the planes where this kind of \"fun\" was perceived not as a "
"barbarity but a natural thing. If I had a chance to visit those places "
"again... I would gladly pass on it.\""
msgstr "\"이런 게 야만스러운 것이 아니라 재미있고 자연스러운 것이라니. 다시 참가한다면... 거부하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterRushlight_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "70484551-9f83-48de-a823-fc1c7fdb6857"
msgid ""
"\"It would be interesting to witness your holidays! But only from afar, of "
"course, and only from upwind.\""
msgstr "\"너희 휴일이 어떤지 궁금해! 아. 물론 참가하지는 않고 그냥 멀리서 보기만 할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_C51_AfterRushlight_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4b25aaf6-3141-425a-81b6-93a9dbb6cccf"
msgid ""
"\"It would be interesting to witness your holidays! But only from afar, of "
"course, and only from upwind.\""
msgstr "\"너희 휴일이 어떤지 궁금해! 아. 물론 참가하지는 않고 그냥 멀리서 보기만 할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d6b4c843-5e67-4c63-b6de-67ad373c4f6b"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok the Big Hero wants a word! I know what the day is. It's the day "
"when little Hero spawn into world!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 약속 원한다! 나 언제인지 안다. 작은 영웅들이 세계에서 태어나는 날이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/NokNok/Banter_NokNok_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0325dec1-2c91-4ceb-b878-0381542568bd"
msgid ""
"\"I wish you good treasures, and all the tasty things to eat. – And some "
"scary monsters to slice. That's how one Hero honors another hero!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희가 즐겁게 여행하고 맛있는 것을 먹기를 바랄 뿐이야. 그리고 괴물이 나오면 썰어주고 말이야. 이렇게 서로 영웅끼리 대접하는 거지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8d60fb03-c188-4856-94ca-476c811b06a9"
msgid "\"Does anyone else want tea? It's growing quite chilly this evening!\""
msgstr "\"차 마시고 싶은 사람? 저녁이 되니 슬슬 추워지네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Oleg_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "378fa973-8bb2-448f-913e-f847c5d21951"
msgid ""
"\"Svetlana and Oleg are a fine couple. Though sometimes I feel he mistakes "
"her for a child...\""
msgstr "\"스베틀라나와 올렉은 훌륭한 커플이야. 가끔 그가 그녀를 아이로 착각하기도 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Oleg_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "41694d5e-f032-4e12-b028-5376842e2287"
msgid "\"Ha. He's simply protecting what's most important to him.\""
msgstr "\"하. 저자는 자기한테 가장 소중한 존재를 지키고 싶었던 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Oleg_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "efb3a7fd-f4b9-4d97-b9de-62de416eb4f7"
msgid ""
"\"They also have a fine trading post, though a bit neglected of recent. By "
"my calculations, it will be a part of our {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} "
"— if we win, that is...\""
msgstr ""
"\"최근에 소홀했어도 그들은 물론 좋은 교역소도 있어. 내 계산에 따르면 그건 우리 영토의 일부가 될 거야. 우리가 이긴다면 말이지..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Oleg_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "465a42ef-47f8-40dd-baa0-7f446e11fe00"
msgid "\"You're right. And men like him are more common than you think.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 그와 같은 자들은 생각보다 흔해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e4a10391-e182-44df-ab46-ff1e6f0ec1d2"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Octavia, your tea is magical! I mean — I didn't mean you used "
"magic to make it... Although you might have, of course... I mean you could "
"have, but not necessarily... That is to say... Thank you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워. 옥타비아. 차가 정말 주옥같아! 내 말은... 마법이라도 부린 것처럼 맛있다는 얘기지. 그랬을지도 모르지만... 내 "
"말은... 꼭 그러지는 않아도 된다는 얘기야... 그러니까... 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d557d015-a285-4802-83d6-31dd6d80f267"
msgid "\"No thank you. I am quite content with the cold. And the darkness.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 나는 추위가 편해졌어. 어둠도 편하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C11_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0cc1cd35-2113-4082-8b86-d108dddf3a39"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, thank you, Octavia! This reminds me of our classes at the Academy of "
"Arts — some teachers would often make tea for students. And others sometimes "
"even opened a bottle, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 고마워. 옥타비아! 아카데미에서 들었던 수업이 생각나네. 어떤 선생들은 가끔 차를 만들어주고는 했어. 어떤 선생들은 술병을 "
"따기도 했지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_BeforeTrollLair_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0c9e16bf-eec0-42e3-8461-6b1e4b8ac546"
msgid ""
"\"What might we find in a troll lair, do you think? Treasures perhaps? Or "
"abducted wretches, stolen away from their people?\""
msgstr "\"트롤 은신처에서 무엇을 발견하게 될까? 보물? 아니면 마을에서 납치당한 사람들?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_BeforeTrollLair_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "eb757ae5-cc49-4c3a-9b66-c7d689821fb0"
msgid ""
"\"Bitten off heads, torn off arms and the like. The usual signs of trollish "
"friendliness. But they might take us for their own — if we let you go first."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"머리를 부수고 팔을 찢어버렸을지도 몰라. 트롤이 친근함을 표시할 때는 보통 그래. 우리를 잡으면... 네가 먼저 잡히겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_BeforeTrollLair_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7e2e8856-d5a2-40cc-99ca-005400d0a53a"
msgid ""
"\"A freakin' pile of trolls, that's what! So get ready for a real slaughter!"
"\""
msgstr "\"미친 트롤들이 어쨌다고! 내게는 살육의 시간이 왔을 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_BeforeTrollLair_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0100e9de-6bfa-470a-bdd2-dee5e7336c85"
msgid "\"Oh, I can't wait to see! I hope we go first thing tomorrow!\""
msgstr "\"오. 정말 기대돼! 내일 우리가 먼저 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "47b87ade-7db5-4a81-9b46-9edd6c518f9e"
msgid ""
"\"I still dream of Numeria sometimes... the places I've been to, when... "
"while I was still in chains. I hope I'll be rid of those memories some day.\""
msgstr "\"가끔 누메리아의 꿈을 꿔... 내가 노예로 있었던 곳이지. 언젠가 이 기억이 사라지길 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4e26c16b-fbc9-472a-87b7-4fcdec604b58"
msgid ""
"\"Chin up, Octavia! No matter what troubles your heart — no one must see you "
"feeding those thoughts!\""
msgstr "\"기운 내. 옥타비아! 어떤 어려움이라도 너는 어두운 생각을 떨쳐버려야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "21656faa-d7b8-42db-97fd-fd74b2a3e754"
msgid ""
"\"Memory always remains. You cannot toss it away. All you can do is learn to "
"live alongside it.\""
msgstr "\"기억은 항상 남아있어. 버릴 수는 없지. 그저 그것과 함께 사는 법을 배워야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "748f2660-d270-4c88-a092-a1e07ad777e0"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I'd give an arm to have those images burned from my mind. But "
"then I think — is it really better to remember nothing at all?\""
msgstr "\"가끔 그 기억을 머릿속에서 끄집어내서 태우고 싶어. 하지만 그 때 생각하지. 그냥 잊어버려도 괜찮은 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b52583ab-722b-4684-94d7-1794683e7616"
msgid ""
"\"Every outcast dreams of their homeland. For some these are happy dreams, "
"and for others, they're nightmares...\""
msgstr "\"모든 추방자는 자신들의 고향을 꿈꿔. 누군가에게는 달콤한 꿈이지만 다른 누군가에게는 악몽이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e4ac2ad2-e061-49e9-a570-7ae315f5d3c2"
msgid ""
"\"Every outcast dreams of their homeland. For some these are happy dreams, "
"and for others, they're nightmares...\""
msgstr "\"모든 추방자는 자신들의 고향을 꿈꿔. 누군가에게는 달콤한 꿈이지만 다른 누군가에게는 악몽이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_AfterPandmic_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "254799ca-dedb-4856-81ce-d59f1c925f3a"
msgid ""
"\"The people are complaining. They wish to see their ruler looking after "
"their safety, rather than merely enjoying the comforts of rule.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 언제나 싫은 소리를 하지. 통치자가 권력욕을 채우게 두지 않고 자신들의 안전을 돌봐주길 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_AfterPandmic_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5dde8d54-b73a-414f-af33-5dce81c966b2"
msgid ""
"\"They shall have to steel themselves with patience. We shall protect the "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}, but wars are not won overnight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 인내심을 가지고 스스로를 담금질해야 해. 우리는 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}을 지켜야 하지만 전쟁은 하루 아침에 이길 수 "
"없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_AfterPandmic_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7d5c558d-0832-4d92-a56e-05e99da133c7"
msgid ""
"\"Funny peoples. A chieftain sets an example, but if a tribe can't stand up "
"for itself, what good is it?\""
msgstr "\"웃기는 인간들이군. 족장이 실수를 할 수도 있지만 스스로 자립할 수 없는 부족은 존재할 가치가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_AfterPandmic_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c6c33127-0b3c-403c-91cd-7b38caba6235"
msgid ""
"\"In other words, they desire to see that {mf|he|she} is ruling to their "
"pleasure, not {mf|his|her} own.\""
msgstr "\"다시 말하자면 사람들은 자신들을 위해 통치하길 바라지 왕의 만족을 위해 통치하는 것을 바라지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e952976e-51c9-46de-8b99-536eabcfd33c"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard much about the lands to the east. Dunsward — that's what those "
"lands are called, right? I'd like to go there once — to walk its endless "
"expanse, under an eternal sky...\""
msgstr ""
"\"동쪽 땅 얘기를 많이 들었어요. 던스워드라고 한다면서요? 그곳에 가서 드높은 하늘 아래 끝없이 펼쳐진 평야를 걸어 보고 싶네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7cd98b66-2a10-4ebd-ba6a-e9f36694c1e0"
msgid ""
"\"A land chock-full of ancient ruins and crypts. You'd probably be bored out "
"of your mind though — there aren't any fancy trinkets or mirrors there. And "
"the moist air would savage your tresses.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고대의 유적과 납골당으로 가득한 곳이지. 아마 지루해서 죽을지도 몰라. 거기에는 예쁜 장신구나 거울이 없으니까. 그리고 습한 공기로 "
"털이 곤두설 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2f568262-b077-4564-a961-e496d5bf2fcc"
msgid ""
"\"Dunsward? 'Tis unlikely you would enjoy it there. Those dusty and deserted "
"planes hold little interest for a mage.\""
msgstr "\"던스워드? 당신한텐 재미 없을 겁니다. 먼지 투성이에 황량한 벌판 뿐인 땅은 마법사에게 흥미로운 땅이 아닐테지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6a797a12-d914-44c1-a8b0-d48499472706"
msgid ""
"\"'A Dunswardish dwarf once decided, to wee in a bucket — and hide it! "
"Despite his display, having caused such dismay, he never felt guilt — or "
"denied it!' I came up with that while I was at the Academy. Too bad there "
"are no dwarves in Dunsward to appreciate the piece...\""
msgstr ""
"\"'던스워드의 드워프가 양동이 안에 숨은 적이 있다네. 낙담했지만 그는 죄책감을 느끼지 못했다지.' 아카데미에서 읽은 작품인데 같이 "
"읽을 드워프가 없어서 아쉽다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d939c28e-408d-4bc2-aff8-050ca70f3ea3"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen an atlas of these lands. Dunsward is a dry, barren land, with "
"nothing like the lush greenery we have here. But it's not blessed by the "
"endless beauty of desert sands either. What is there to look at?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 땅을 본 적이 있어. 던스워드는 건조하고 황량한 땅이지. 끝 없는 사막이 아름답기는 하지만 저주받은 땅이야. 그다지 볼 것도 "
"없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "51a574b8-c88d-4b3f-a195-f7bfae2ac300"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen an atlas of these lands. Dunsward is a dry, barren land, with "
"nothing like the lush greenery we have here. But it's not blessed by the "
"endless beauty of desert sands either. What is there to look at?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 땅을 본 적이 있어. 던스워드는 건조하고 황량한 땅이지. 끝 없는 사막이 아름답기는 하지만 저주받은 땅이야. 그다지 볼 것도 "
"없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "aa4d1810-d3ae-43c5-b6b4-bcdd1fdd6d30"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stop thinking about that woman, the Defaced Sister! So fascinating "
"— both she herself, and her magic. I wish I could find out more from her...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 여자에 대해 생각하는 것을 멈출 수 없어. 얼굴 잃은 자매 말이야! 둘 다 너무 매력적이야. 마법도 그렇고. 그들에 대해서 더 알고 "
"싶다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "34cc4831-4826-4af4-b0f0-3a31df78b77a"
msgid ""
"\"She fills me with unease. One who tells the truth has no need to hide "
"their face. One who hides their face hides something else as well.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 나를 불안하게 해. 진실을 말하는 자는 얼굴을 숨길 필요가 없지. 그 말은 그들이 무언가를 숨기고 있다는 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "85de0579-c5ef-435e-b3e2-8efee444c2b2"
msgid ""
"\"To hide one's face and to reject one's very name — all in service to a "
"higher power... Such a fascinating and dignified idea. I must think on this "
"further...\""
msgstr "\"얼굴을 가리고 이름을 숨긴다. 더 높은 자를 섬기기 위해... 매력적이야. 그들에 대해 더 알고 싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterBarbarianCamp_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "fce87d8b-f119-482f-8a00-1373fc40b573"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I don't know, she just scares me. I've little wish to see her again!\""
msgstr "\"나는 모르겠어. 그녀는 무섭다고. 다시는 보고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterSeasonOfBloom_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "cda7438c-001d-41b8-b997-46876101a6ba"
msgid ""
"\"I just keep thinking about the story we learned while we were searching "
"for the Flower — the story of the fallen goddess. I feel pity for her... it "
"seems she was punished not for being evil, but for rebelling against rules "
"set by someone else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 꽃을 찾을 때 타락한 신에 대한 이야기를 계속해서 생각하고 있어. 그 신이 불쌍하더군. 악해서가 아니라 어떤 규칙을 지키지 "
"않아 벌을 받은 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterSeasonOfBloom_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0f01acd2-f316-430e-8f77-77e7a2d144d6"
msgid ""
"\"Many poor souls lost their lives to the Bloom. Direct your pity toward "
"them.\""
msgstr "\"많은 불쌍한 영혼들이 역병으로 생명을 잃었어. 그들을 불쌍해 해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterSeasonOfBloom_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cba7642a-b0af-40d7-82b9-0ddc1c979bd9"
msgid ""
"\"Even if she set out with good intentions, there's no honor in leveling her "
"wrath upon the heads of the innocent!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 의도로 출발했다 할지라도 죄 없는 자들에게 분노를 쏟은 것은 옳지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterSeasonOfBloom_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3b03c5d6-9ac9-471f-8aaf-954473289c6b"
msgid ""
"\"Those who rebel against the majority will always be punished. There is "
"only one way to maintain one's freedom — to strike first.\""
msgstr "\"다수에게 반항하는 자들은 항상 벌을 받게 되어있지. 선공하는 게 자신들의 자유를 지키는 유일한 길이기 때문이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C31_AfterSeasonOfBloom_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0d4bf89c-2a27-4935-84b0-5cd88755d6cd"
msgid ""
"\"Normal thing for gods. Always punishing and stabbing, all of them. "
"Lamashtu became goddess because she was better at it.\""
msgstr "\"신들에게는 항상 있는 일이다. 벌을 주는 것. 라마슈트는 벌을 잘 줘서 신이 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6e30b505-3a73-4f56-a7fc-8a29c4a3b9c8"
msgid ""
"\"My blood still boils when I remember what Tristian did at Vordakai's tomb! "
"But still... the suffering on his face was so deep, so sincere...\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안이 보다카이의 무덤에서 한 일을 생각하면 아직도 피가 끓어! 하지만... 그의 얼굴에 맺힌 고통은 너무나 깊어보였지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "92b16e08-9230-4757-a369-ad681b2110de"
msgid ""
"\"That's for sure! I don't know what to think! On the one hand, I want so "
"badly just to swat him on the head... On the other hand — what if he had a "
"good reason for doing what he did?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론! 그런데 어떻게 말해야 할지 모르겠어. 한편으로는 그 녀석을 한대 갈겨주고 싶어... 그런데 그가 다 이유가 있어서 그런거라는 "
"생각이 들기도 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "36b66621-732d-4248-b06e-a973279d049a"
msgid "\"Don't deceive yourself. He who betrays once will betray again.\""
msgstr "\"자신을 속이지 마. 한번 배반한 사람은 다시 배반할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7fe2b683-2c91-451d-81dc-168aecaeabd4"
msgid ""
"\"He's the only thing we ever talk about lately! Maybe he just needed more "
"attention, ha ha ha hmm?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 최근에서야 그에 대해 얘기했잖아? 아마 우리는 그에게 더 관심을 기울여야 하지 않을까? 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5e94914b-fb9f-4044-a574-62e57275b570"
msgid ""
"\"Let me get this straight: you're talking about his spiritual suffering, "
"right? I find it hard to feel compassion for someone whose brothers in faith "
"so much enjoy the torment of others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한가지는 분명히 해두자. 그가 겪는 내적 고통을 말하고 있었지? 하지만 형제와 같은 동료를 신나게 고문하는 녀석에게 느껴야 할 연민은 "
"아니라고 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b3dbf0f0-34a6-4681-804d-ac7c7b794c3e"
msgid ""
"\"Let me get this straight: you're talking about his spiritual suffering, "
"right? I find it hard to feel compassion for someone whose brothers in faith "
"so much enjoy the torment of others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한가지는 분명히 해두자. 그가 겪는 내적 고통을 말하고 있었지? 하지만 형제와 같은 동료를 신나게 고문하는 녀석에게 느껴야 할 연민은 "
"아니라고 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "762876cd-5fe2-4795-8f00-81c01516cc38"
msgid ""
"\"Poor Willas Gunderson! If only he knew where his thirst for adventure "
"would lead him...\""
msgstr "\"불쌍한 윌라스 건더슨! 모험에 대한 갈증을 채울 수 있는 곳을 알았더라면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "691edb79-ea8b-44b5-b945-4c46f9322af0"
msgid ""
"\"The thirst for adventure is not inherently dangerous. But together with "
"dilettantism and a rare lack of ingenuity...\""
msgstr "\"모험에 대한 목마름은 위험한 것이 아니야. 하지만 허영과 부족한 순수함이 있다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4ddcda0c-4a79-4f6a-bc31-1dd315b035ff"
msgid ""
"\"I often ponder this at night. How can you avoid trouble, if you don't know "
"what it might be?\""
msgstr "\"가끔 저녁에 생각하고는 해. 예측할 수 없다면 어떻게 문제를 피할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e06b705b-1bca-4be7-a832-fd4643f92612"
msgid ""
"\"If it wasn't him, it would have been someone else. And if not — then "
"Vordakai's role would have been served by plague, or war, or simple famine.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 사람이 아니었다면 다른 사람이었을 거야. 아니더라도 보다카이의 역할은 전염병이나 전쟁, 기근에 의해 영향을 받았을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C41_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b350982c-53b4-4dd9-a6c1-41b7259f362f"
msgid ""
"\"Fearsomeful! Don't want to be like that, ever. Better stay dead for good. "
"Even better stay alive for good!\""
msgstr "\"무시무시하군! 그렇게 되고 싶진 않아. 차라리 죽고 말지. 산다면 더욱 좋고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterCoronation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8a0f7673-8236-405f-bcb6-50a4274c42ea"
msgid ""
"\"I still can't believe it — {name}, you are now a {mf|king|queen}! And you "
"have a whole kingdom... I wonder how this change will alter the fate of "
"these lands...\""
msgstr "\"아직도 믿을 수 없어. {name}. 네가 왕이라니! 왕국이 네 것이잖아... 이 땅의 운명이 어떻게 변할지 궁금해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a9c47307-591c-4d6b-a77e-7eb48d24d305"
msgid ""
"\"Well, if you need it to be explained... It will primarily change the "
"nature of our relationship with our neighbors. We've become equal to them in "
"terms of status — and thus we will be able to dictate certain terms during "
"negotiations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"설명이 필요하다면... 우리 이웃 국가와의 관계가 변할 거야. 우리는 그들과 동등해지지. 그리고 협상을 통해 어떤 조건을 요구할 수 "
"있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0d0278a3-cde6-4b51-94d0-84ced46f0ed6"
msgid ""
"\"It's about time. The barony's status didn't reflect our true power, and "
"only restrained our growth. In so many regards we already surpass both the "
"foolish Aldori and the spineless Surtova.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간이 되었어. 영지의 상태는 우리의 힘을 반영하지 않지만 우리의 성장을 억제할 뿐이야. 우리는 이미 알도리 녀석들과 뱀 같은 서토바 "
"녀석들의 힘을 능가했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e56d1e9a-3adb-4874-8894-3504db27c55c"
msgid ""
"\"News of a new kingdom will travel across Avistan quickly, through the "
"tales of merchants and travelers, and in the reports of spies.\""
msgstr "\"새로운 왕국의 소식이 상인, 여행자, 첩자들에 의해 아비스탄에 빠르게 퍼질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "dff9157d-03ad-457c-a7a4-883e04375add"
msgid ""
"\"A monarch's crown is a worthy reward for your feats. But remember: history "
"speaks of many for whom the crown was simply too heavy!\""
msgstr "\"왕관은 너의 새로운 보상에 걸맞아. 하지만 기억해둬. 역사는 왕관의 무게를 감당하는 자들을 기록하니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8f54dc2c-3044-48a3-9524-9e87ba1297d3"
msgid ""
"\"A monarch's crown is a worthy reward for your feats. But remember: history "
"speaks of many for whom the crown was simply too heavy!\""
msgstr "\"왕관은 너의 새로운 보상에 걸맞아. 하지만 기억해둬. 역사는 왕관의 무게를 감당하는 자들을 기록하니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6b439415-d382-4c61-b05c-0fe075d37ed5"
msgid ""
"\"Wars are fought between states, but it's the common people who suffer. The "
"world isn't fair...\""
msgstr "\"전쟁은 국가 사이에서 벌어지지만 고통받는 건 국민들이야. 세상은 불공평하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5e1b0802-3d21-41e1-9ed4-5db32e79d9f3"
msgid ""
"\"And what's the answer? To overthrow the rulers and destroy the states? "
"Complete anarchy? Do you really think that would mean fewer wars?\""
msgstr ""
"\"대답은 뭐지? 통치자를 무너뜨리고 국가를 파괴하기 위해? 무정부 상태인 세상을 통일하기 위해? 정말로 그렇게 되면 전쟁이 줄어들 거라 "
"생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1d616360-ffbb-4162-9466-999ebffd9230"
msgid "\"Wise words.\""
msgstr "\"현명하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c4d73b72-4a15-48bf-a12b-04c3ab3c1aac"
msgid ""
"\"This is why one must do all one can to become the one who commands, not "
"the one who suffers under the yoke. Such is the order of the world — either "
"you win or you lose.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 모든 것을 장악해서 명령을 내려야 하는 거야. 고통받으며 통치 받는 자가 명령을 내리는 것은 아니지. 그게 세상의 순리야. "
"이기든 지든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7cb231fd-e43c-4d3a-b994-2af28f309013"
msgid ""
"\"There is no 'world' – there are only people. The world is only cruel where "
"the cruel are allowed to rule. Do you want justice? Then make it – if you "
"have the strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진리란 없어. 그저 사람만이 있을 뿐. 세상은 잔인한 자가 지배하기 때문에 잔인한 거야. 정의를 원해? 그러면 힘을 길러서 정의를 "
"구현해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e10440dd-fd0b-45e6-b018-915381a2e954"
msgid ""
"\"There is no 'world' – there are only people. The world is only cruel where "
"the cruel are allowed to rule. Do you want justice? Then make it – if you "
"have the strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진리란 없어. 그저 사람만이 있을 뿐. 세상은 잔인한 자가 지배하기 때문에 잔인한 거야. 정의를 원해? 그러면 힘을 길러서 정의를 "
"구현해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d79b5726-3730-41a0-9c93-ec20ebbc821c"
msgid ""
"\"Am I to be the first to say \"Happy Birthday!\" to our "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}?\""
msgstr "\"생일 축하한다고 말하는 첫번째 사람이 되고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7a7cf07f-cfaf-41be-9b22-0fb16d6decb8"
msgid ""
"\"Be happy. Follow your dreams. And inspire us to follow ours. I'm so glad I "
"met you, so we can share this journey together! Happy Birthday!\""
msgstr ""
"\"행복해야 해. 네 꿈을 쫓고. 그리고 우리에게 영감을 불어넣어 이끌어줘. 너를 만나 기뻤고 우리가 함께 여행을 해서 기뻐! 생일 "
"축하해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Shandra_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "152093e1-1fbd-4720-9190-6e3cfe1c21cd"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Shandra Mervey makes my skin crawl. What do you think about her?\""
msgstr "\"샨드라 머비 때문에 소름이 돋아. 그녀를 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Shandra_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6e3c27d1-47a3-42ea-a397-0f3cd069681d"
msgid "\"Her years have woven silver in her hair, and wisdom in her mind.\""
msgstr "\"세월이 지나 그녀의 머리가 바랬고 지혜도 풍부해졌지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Shandra_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d27d7b96-354e-41b8-92ea-d0a73e0bc104"
msgid ""
"\"The way she talks suggests that 'freedom of speech' is not exactly a "
"prized commodity at Surtova's court. — And don't ask me to explain what "
"'freedom of speech' is. You wouldn't understand anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 말하는 언론의 자유가 단순히 서토바 궁전의 선물이 아니라는 사실을 기억해. 언론의 자유를 내게 묻지는 마. 말해도 너는 이해 "
"못 할 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Octavia/Banter_Octavia_Shandra_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "03bcf567-37e9-4f55-923f-3284d280ad4a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha. You should see what hundreds of years of political games and behind-"
"the-scenes intrigue do to a soul... That's where the real monsters are born."
"\""
msgstr "\"너는 권력 암투가 한 개인에 수백년에 걸쳐 미치는 영향을 보았어야 한다. 그 결과로 괴물이 태어났지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_AfterStaglordOldHouse_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5f65a318-03a8-472a-a0d6-e0890e8fcc5a"
msgid ""
"\"The Stag Lord drew the short straw with his old man. It's better to be an "
"orphan than born to such a house! Ha, ha, hmm.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주는 자신의 심복과 세월을 보냈지. 차라리 그런 집에서 보내느니 고아가 되겠어. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_AfterStaglordOldHouse_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "952175d2-aef6-412f-a23d-741345857aa6"
msgid ""
"\"There are no worse tyrants than cruel parents. And there wasn't a more "
"powerless and unhappy creature than their child.\""
msgstr "\"잔인한 부모보다 더 나쁜 폭군은 없어. 그들의 자식보다 불행한 존재도 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_AfterStaglordOldHouse_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8df835be-b42c-4fa4-b0c7-57557a1454f6"
msgid ""
"\"I can never understand how seeing a helpless and fragile creature can "
"inspire a wish to beat them, rather than protect and help them.\""
msgstr "\"그런 연약한 생물이 그들을 돕기를 원하지 않고 파괴하길 원했다니 이해할 수가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_AfterStaglordOldHouse_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0f246136-cc3e-4d63-9c0f-aa666edfb147"
msgid ""
"\"That's the cruelty of life. No one hurts us more than those who are "
"closest to us.\""
msgstr "\"삶이란 그렇게 잔인한 거지. 가까운 사이보다 더 치명적인 관계는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_RadishErrand_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5d7422be-fdb6-47f8-9907-3589afdd5cb5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure, but I heard they use moon radish to make homebrew, or some "
"kind of powder. No wonder Bokken didn't tell us why he needed it, ha, ha, "
"hmm.\""
msgstr ""
"\"확실하진 않지만, 그들은 달 무를 이용하여 '어떤' 가루를 만든다고 들었어. 보큰이 왜 그게 필요한지 얘기 안 해주는 것도 당연하군. "
"하하, 흠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_RadishErrand_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b0cd1936-59a9-488e-ae32-111efabffb8d"
msgid ""
"\"More nonsense! 'Go there, bring that!' When will the real feats begin? I "
"can't wait to break someone's neck!\""
msgstr "\"말도 안되는 소리! 이래라. 저래라. 언제 싸움이 시작되는 거야? 누군가의 목을 부러뜨리고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_RadishErrand_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "bb60051b-6174-44d7-96de-87ff872e220e"
msgid ""
"\"The same ingredients might be used to prepare a healing potion. You "
"shouldn't draw conclusions about those you don't know.\""
msgstr "\"같은 재료로 치유 물약을 준비할 수 있어. 모르는 것에 대해 아는 척하면 좋지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C11_RadishErrand_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "de76f6a9-caf0-48dd-aae0-7e3aa54fad66"
msgid ""
"\"Wha-a-at?! But then... Oh, right! Oleg and Svetlana are in on it too! "
"Otherwise, why would they tolerate him?! And the Stag Lord is just fighting "
"for his corner of the black market! That's the story! A half-dead old "
"smuggler! Bandits! And a criminal couple!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 하지만... 맞아! 올렉과 스베틀라나도 거기에 있었어! 그렇지 않다면 왜 그를 받아들였겠어?! 그리고 수사슴 군주는 자신의 "
"암거래 시장을 지키기 위해 싸운 거야! 그렇게 된 거군! 죽을 뻔한 밀수꾼과 도적, 그리고 범죄자 커플까지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Anytime_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5ff04a0e-e2e8-49b5-882f-9cdf82c5d85f"
msgid ""
"\"When we were slaves of the Technic League, they taught us that kobolds are "
"descended from dragons. I still don't know whether or not it's true.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 기술 연맹의 노예였을 때 우리는 코볼트가 드래곤의 후손이라고 배웠어. 아직도 그게 사실인지 거짓인지 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bbc4ebc5-50bf-4f9d-a08a-7b11405ceac5"
msgid ""
"\"I can't imagine that something as magnificent and menacing as a dragon "
"could spawn something so small and ridiculous as a kobold!\""
msgstr "\"용처럼 웅장하고 커다란 생물이 작고 우스꽝스러운 코볼트를 낳았다니 상상할 수가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b6ff4e08-cf92-474d-b922-c5d7aee2771e"
msgid ""
"\"It's true. Even today, kobolds still speak Draconic. I was once even going "
"to write a monograph about them... until some social climber from Absalom "
"beat me to it, blast him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이야. 오늘날에도 코볼트는 항상 용을 언급하지. 나는 한 때 그들에 관한 글을 쓴 적이 있는데... 압살롬의 등반가가 방해해서 "
"그만두었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "370f9d6a-22d9-4451-9b15-b21b76e7bb67"
msgid ""
"\"A life devoid of higher goals leads only to the degeneration of the "
"spirit. — In their case, both the spirit and the body.\""
msgstr "\"높은 목표 없는 삶은 정신의 퇴보로 이어진다. 그들의 경우에는 영과 육체 모두였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "7f6f1163-2ca8-4ff3-9cfb-ca4533d34453"
msgid ""
"\"Who knows... But wait! What if it's the other way around, and dragons are "
"descended from kobolds?\""
msgstr "\"누가 알겠어... 잠깐! 혹시 드래곤이 코볼트의 후손이 아닐까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Anytime_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "40c25f2e-f9b0-47b4-9e06-7611221bc1b8"
msgid ""
"\"Who knows... But wait! What if it's the other way around, and dragons are "
"descended from kobolds?\""
msgstr "\"누가 알겠어... 잠깐! 혹시 드래곤이 코볼트의 후손이 아닐까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2385541b-a874-4840-a914-88de41b02cee"
msgid ""
"\"That's the life — your own castle, your own lands... No one to tell you "
"what to do... In fact, it's the opposite — you just open your mouth, and a "
"bunch of people come running to lick off your boots. This is great!\""
msgstr ""
"\"삶은 그런 거지. 성도 갖고 땅도 갖고... 아무도 뭐라 하는 사람 없고... 사실은 그 반대야. 입만 열었다 하면 사람들이 달려와서 "
"네 신발을 핥지. 대단하지 않아?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "81514c03-c6c9-4138-9d73-2db34dcd84b1"
msgid ""
"\"It's impossible to find a moment of peace. There's no time to walk through "
"the fields at night in the solace of silence. So many happenings, and all of "
"them requiring your attention... no, I would not like to be a ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"\"평화로운 순간을 가지는 것은 불가능해. 조용한 저녁에 들판을 걸어갈 시간은 없어. 너무 많은 일이 일어나 주의를 기울일 시간도 "
"없지... 나는 통치자가 되지 않을래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "97f3fa25-852b-45c8-bd36-fe63228e25cf"
msgid ""
"\"The throne room's decorations were obviously crafted by a one-armed one-"
"eyed woodworker from a desolate Brevic village, who's never seen anything he "
"liked better than a roadside inn or a shopkeeper's hut. But other than that —"
" not bad.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여관과 구멍 가게가 전부인 외딴 브레빅 마을 출신인 외팔이 외눈 가구 장인이 알현실의 장식을 만들었지. 그런데 그 장식이 썩 괜찮아."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "81e7d6d1-fdec-4c9e-8c3e-9cafaf1676b7"
msgid ""
"\"Fortune has smiled upon the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. Power holds "
"many pleasures... for those who know how to wield it.\""
msgstr "\"행운의 여신이 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 편을 들어주었군. 권력은 그것을 잘 이용하는 자에게 기쁨을 가져다주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21ktcDoomsayer_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6c0a6c83-9c79-4312-8962-b4757a9b92d1"
msgid ""
"\"That Remus... He's not as simple as he looks. I'm not sure why, but I just "
"look at him and know something is wrong.\""
msgstr "\"그 레무스... 그는 보이는 것처럼 단순하지 않아. 왜 그런지 모르겠지만 그가 잘못되었다는 것을 알고 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21ktcDoomsayer_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5222c602-255e-4caa-ab5c-9e7050236aaa"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't know you had such keen eyesight. But yes, I believe you're right."
"\""
msgstr "\"그런 예리한 관찰력을 가질줄이야. 네가 맞는 거 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21ktcDoomsayer_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "656214f7-619b-40f9-8f55-f2623561d7ee"
msgid ""
"\"At his age, fear of death drives many to madness. Although I cannot say "
"that Remus truly understands what death really means...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 나이를 먹어 죽음에 대한 두려움이 광기로 찾아오지. 레무스가 죽음의 진정한 의미를 이해하지 못했다고 얘기할 수는 없지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C21ktcDoomsayer_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "98933cfe-0007-498b-a43c-16213546ce5e"
msgid ""
"\"I saw something sad in his eyes... no, maybe it was something sly... or "
"was it mysterious? Oh, don't listen to me. I'm just confused.\""
msgstr "\"그의 눈에서 슬픔을 보았어... 아마 악어의 눈물일까... 아니면? 그냥 잊어줘. 잠깐 혼란스러웠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C22_ktc22_2threeQuests_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "59fa7a9c-03de-449b-9fd2-c4417d6b957b"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid of catching that rubbish. When you go near the sick, don't let "
"them breathe on you!\""
msgstr "\"그 쓰레기를 잡을까 두려워. 네가 아프게 된다면 그들을 네 방에 들이지도 말라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C22_ktc22_2threeQuests_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "91549c42-8fbf-4464-be7f-43fcfeca5240"
msgid "\"By the goddess, are some people just incapable of compassion?\""
msgstr "\"연민을 모르는 사람들이군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C22_ktc22_2threeQuests_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "12e1e5e2-2934-4ab8-a29b-ac3c38e2bd88"
msgid ""
"\"We know to a certainty that it isn't the plague. The symptoms are "
"different. And you might remember for future reference that even the plague "
"is not contracted through breath.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그것이 전염병이 아니라는 것을 확실하게 알고 있어. 증상이 다르지. 역병은 호흡기로 감염되지 않는다는 사실을 기억해두라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C22_ktc22_2threeQuests_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3a783dcf-0172-4460-9ea1-35875ffd4df1"
msgid ""
"\"I am saddened by your stubbornness. You may clench at every grain of sand "
"that passes through the hourglass, but you only increase your suffering. Let "
"go of life, with all its passions — and you will find the peace that your "
"restless spirit longs for.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 완고함에 슬퍼진다. 모래 시계를 통과하는 모래알을 하나하나 잡을 수는 있지만 고통만 커질 뿐이야. 열정을 삶에서 해방시켜. 그러면 "
"영혼이 갈망하는 평화를 찾을 수 있으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_BarbieCamp_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5634eba5-1810-4844-b61a-85ed7d84944e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad I didn't grow up among the barbarians. Look at them! Childhood in "
"the tribe is almost worse than slavery!\""
msgstr "\"야만족들 사이에서 자라지 않아서 기쁘다. 네가 노예보다 못한 야만족들의 아이들을 봤어야 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4cbcb49e-c1dc-4061-8fee-79bcbf7656c9"
msgid ""
"\"You talk about things you don't know anything about... but I don't have "
"nothing to compare it with either.\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭘 안다고 지껄이는 것이지... 나는 어떤 것도 비교할 것이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ab76b674-d787-4210-b0c9-9f4ddfd378c7"
msgid ""
"\"Let's leave the past in the past. Whatever has happened, it's given us "
"what we have now... and we're all right now, aren't we?\""
msgstr "\"과거는 과거로 남겨두자구. 무슨 일이 일어났건 우리는 여기에 있어. 그렇지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "aa433ebc-6dba-4387-bd2a-64abe31ca95d"
msgid ""
"\"Childhood is the time of powerlessness, helplessness, and naivety. But the "
"days of youth...\""
msgstr "\"어린 시절은 무력감, 순수의 시대야. 하지만 사춘기는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c9cd1d6f-d3ca-4aa3-802b-0cc9002e9260"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know what's worse – to lose one's tribe as a young child, or to "
"grow up in it as an outsider.\""
msgstr "\"어린 아이를 잃어버리거나 그 아이가 외부인으로 자라는 것 중에 어느 것이 더 나쁜지 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_BarbieCamp_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0c67e8bb-dbf0-416b-8416-66614e623adc"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know what's worse – to lose one's tribe as a young child, or to "
"grow up in it as an outsider.\""
msgstr "\"어린 아이를 잃어버리거나 그 아이가 외부인으로 자라는 것 중에 어느 것이 더 나쁜지 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_Cyclops_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "daacedca-3645-4a9b-8a13-6f99df7b5de7"
msgid ""
"\"I've never understood what drives fools to collect ancient trinkets, "
"things belonging to cyclopes and such. An entertainment to those whose "
"hearts pump sweetened milk instead of blood.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 멍청이들이 고대의 장신구나 사이클롭스의 물건을 탐하는 이유를 몰랐어. 그런 녀석들은 피가 아니라 달콤한 우유가 핏줄에 흐르나 "
"보지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_Cyclops_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4f68cb9c-4c7f-43e5-bf1c-0696d2da0b50"
msgid ""
"\"I think it's exciting — the traces of creatures who roamed these same "
"lands, under the same sun, thousands of years ago! How did they live? What "
"became of them? How did their cities fall to ruin?\""
msgstr ""
"\"수천 년 전에 같은 태양 아래 똑같은 땅을 배회했던 생물의 흔적이라니. 흥미롭지 않아? 어떻게 살았을까? 어떤 문명을 이뤘을까? "
"그리고 왜 도시가 폐허가 되었을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_Cyclops_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cc1c1a5b-9e5d-454d-8d44-2a4b3cdf2071"
msgid ""
"\"I have unraveled the secret of your magical powers! There are two stones "
"in your head, constantly striking each other, trying to spawn a single "
"thought. But instead they just make the sparks you emit from your fingers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 마법의 힘에 대한 비밀을 밝혀냈어! 너의 머리에는 두개의 돌이 들어있어서 끊임 없이 부딪혀 생각을 만들어내지. 그래서 네 "
"손가락에서 번개를 뿜어내게 하는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C31_Cyclops_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4aeb645e-498d-4d34-9b81-23d49749acd9"
msgid ""
"\"The ruins of the ancients are pleasant to the eye, Regongar, for they "
"remind us of the frailty of life. Those who left them are gone, and now we "
"follow in their footsteps. Listen to the silence that remains — does it not "
"fill your spirit with calm?\""
msgstr ""
"\"고대인들의 폐허가 눈을 즐겁게 하는군. 레곤가르. 저것을 보면 삶의 덧없음을 알게 돼. 이 유적을 지은 자들은 사라졌고 우리도 언젠가 "
"그들처럼 될 거야. 유적의 침묵에 귀를 기울여 봐. 평온으로 영혼이 정화되지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_AfterBetrayersFlight_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "123b7ef6-ff9c-42e6-bd94-b8c55f73ffd3"
msgid ""
"\"Prophecies again. You want to control someone, tell them that they're "
"chosen, and then tell them what to do.\""
msgstr "\"또 다시 예언이군. 그렇게 사람을 통제하고 선택되었다고 구슬려서 마음대로 조종하기 위해서지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_AfterBetrayersFlight_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3959d711-e832-41c1-9dd6-ba6da6fb3a8c"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing allows such complete power over another person as his vanity.\""
msgstr "\"그 무엇도 타인을 통제하는 힘을 주지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_AfterBetrayersFlight_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2e3363ae-9cec-4bef-84c6-3b69df38b757"
msgid ""
"\"That's exactly why it's dangerous to listen to someone for too long! They "
"trick you and use you...\""
msgstr "\"그래서 다른 사람의 이야기에 너무 귀를 기울이면 안돼! 그들은 너를 속여서 이용했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_AfterBetrayersFlight_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e83e93b8-c03c-44da-b901-9ccb4b56e07b"
msgid ""
"\"There is great power in legends. However it never occurred to me that it "
"could be used for such purposes...\""
msgstr "\"전설에는 큰 권력이 있어. 하지만 나는 절대 어떤 목적으로 사용하지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_AfterBetrayersFlight_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5632b797-3a7a-4611-9644-36f84344fdaa"
msgid ""
"\"That's right! Nobody should say you are chosen — only you can decide! And "
"then become!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 타인을 구슬리는 짓은 나쁜 짓이야. 선택은 네가 하고 결과도 네 책임이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "668d7dbb-758b-4c16-b1bc-c4a699541419"
msgid ""
"\"Well, ladies and gentlemen! Want to place any bets on whether our wet-"
"nosed Sarenrae follower will ever put in an appearance?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 추종자가 모습을 드러낸다는 데에 돈을 걸 사람 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e56f7e36-d9d0-4c19-8aec-0bf520aac06c"
msgid ""
"\"He hurt me so much... but I still hope we see him again! At least to hear "
"his explanation.\""
msgstr "\"그는 나에게 너무나 많은 상처를 주었어. 하지만 아직도 그를 다시 만났으면 해. 최소한 변명은 들어 봐야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d40e8d66-3289-47ab-ad11-920146c56747"
msgid ""
"\"There is only one thing that is certain in this life. And I think you know "
"what I'm talking about...\""
msgstr "\"이 생에서 확실한 것은 오직 한 가지 뿐이야. 무슨 말인지 짐작 가지...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b8c9b231-c781-4ec2-b760-0fdb0a0b2dbd"
msgid ""
"\"He will hardly have the nerve to stand before us, after what he's done. "
"Anyway, you should never underestimate traitors.\""
msgstr "\"그는 자신이 벌인 일 때문에 우리에게 돌아오지 않을 거야. 어쨌건 반역자들을 과소 평가해서는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "c41c923b-76a7-411e-8c7f-85c600dd83d0"
msgid ""
"\"I hope he has enough decency never to show his face again... But on the "
"other hand, I don't suppose he has any decency.\""
msgstr "\"여기에 나타날 정도로 낯짝이 두껍지 않기를 바라... 하지만 염치라고는 모르는 녀석이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1e44c469-44c1-4208-810e-26bd43187b55"
msgid ""
"\"I hope he has enough decency never to show his face again... But on the "
"other hand, I don't suppose he has any decency.\""
msgstr "\"여기에 나타날 정도로 낯짝이 두껍지 않기를 바라... 하지만 염치라고는 모르는 녀석이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterIrovettiDefeat_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c3087d16-c380-467a-8f75-c884198a941f"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti had everything! Money, power, women... If he kept still and "
"didn't stick out so much, he'd still be alive. Nothing kills a person as "
"fast as greed. And stupidity, ha ha hmm.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티는 모든 것을 가지고 있었어! 돈, 권력, 여자... 그렇게 집착하지만 않았어도 여전히 살아있었을 거야. 탐욕 만큼 사람에게 "
"위험한 건 없지. 그리고 멍청함도 그렇고. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterIrovettiDefeat_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c9607722-0b38-4f18-ad85-b2733b05dba0"
msgid "\"Ha. A worthy epitaph for the departed.\""
msgstr "\"죽은 사람들을 위한 귀중한 비문이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterIrovettiDefeat_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "84169bcb-99b3-43b5-89eb-19619ec6c8b3"
msgid ""
"\"The wheel of fate keeps spinning. No one can stop it. Those at the top "
"will be at the bottom... and so the other way around.\""
msgstr ""
"\"운명의 바퀴는 계속 회전하지. 아무도 그것을 막을 수 없다. 꼭대기에 있던 것이 밑바닥으로 가고... 계속해서 반복될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterIrovettiDefeat_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "02b8cf63-4e82-416a-a4df-fbbc3be8fa6e"
msgid ""
"\"Something tells me that the likes of him simply cannot keep still and not "
"stick out.\""
msgstr "\"그런 부류의 인간은 탐욕을 부리지 않을 수가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5290c6c3-f338-4583-8355-5eb47e1dbf5c"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear? A water mill has broken down on the Shrike River. The miller "
"woke up when his millstones stopped moving. He ran out and found a drowned "
"troll, dressed in armor – stuck in the wheel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들었어? 슈라이크 강의 방아간이 부셔졌다는군. 방아 소리가 들리지 않길래 나가 봤더니 갑옷을 입은 트롤이 익사해서 바퀴에 끼어있다는 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "22bfe481-f2d7-4481-9724-230a5a86058d"
msgid "\"Buy a city drunkard a mug of beer — you'll hear all about it.\""
msgstr "\"도시에서 맥주 한잔 사면 그런 이야기를 들을 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4b90f9a2-60c6-46a3-bdf8-6284512ace20"
msgid ""
"\"I've learned of similar cases. Trolls stuck at the top of a city hall, a "
"dead wyvern mysteriously appearing in a brewer's vat... Will wonders never "
"cease?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 비슷한 사건을 알아. 트롤이 시청 꼭대기에 끼었다거나 죽은 와이번이 맥주 공방에 나타났다던지... 세상은 기상천외해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "05ff0b9b-d3a2-4f17-bf1a-f6091aa0fff9"
msgid ""
"\"Obviously, this has something to do with teleportation. But how? Who? And "
"where are these creatures being sent from?\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 이건 텔레포트와 연관이 있어. 하지만 어떻게? 누가 그 괴물들을 어디서 보낸 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "805b027e-0375-4f4d-9efd-2ada5c14365c"
msgid ""
"\"I once saw the air open up, and a dead long-shank fall out! Well, not "
"completely dead — Nok-Nok had to finish him off, hehehe.\""
msgstr "\"나는 하늘이 열려서 죽은 꺽다리가 떨어지는 것 봤다! 완전히 죽지는 않았었다. 그래서 녹-녹이 끝장냈다. 헤헤헤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f6ebb52c-36d2-464a-a6d8-dc2b3f9ff787"
msgid ""
"\"A toast! Let's drink to our ringleader! It's {mf|his|her} birthday after "
"all!\""
msgstr "\"건배! 우리의 리더를 위해 마시자! {mf|그의|그녀의} 생일 하루종일!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "33b21ad0-8212-4532-a629-ebee6d2bc5f2"
msgid ""
"\"May each battle you fight be tougher than the last, and each kiss hotter! "
"Ha, ha, hmm!\""
msgstr "\"전투를 치루면서 너는 계속 강해지고 키스도 더 잘하는군나! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_KassilAldori_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8c654c0d-bb03-457e-9dde-d0e458e1dcc3"
msgid ""
"\"Half-orcs are lately flooding our barony... Any moment now, trolls will "
"start swearing fealty to the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, ha, ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하프오크들이 최근에 우리의 영지에 범람하고 있어... 트롤이 이제 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 영지에 침을 뱉을 거야! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_KassilAldori_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "acbffd11-187f-4cf9-9023-1a5ff79e67f0"
msgid ""
"\"Frightened of a little competition? Fear not — when it comes to tasteless "
"foolery, even trolls can't keep up with you... Most of them.\""
msgstr "\"경쟁에서 겁을 먹었어? 두려워말아. 무미 건조한 녀석은 트롤도 쫓아오지 않아... 대부분은 그렇지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_KassilAldori_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4634b8dd-256c-4580-8b39-32937f12bbbf"
msgid "\"Kassil is a loyal soul. This was the right decision.\""
msgstr "\"카실은 충직한 녀석이야. 올바른 결정이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Regongar/Banter_Regongar_KassilAldori_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "281863f2-3451-4101-af80-9500ebd677aa"
msgid ""
"\"A most boring character. Even knowing I have eternity before me, I regret "
"every moment spent in the company of that arrogant snob.\""
msgstr "\"지루한 녀석이야. 그를 평생 알아왔어도 그 거만한 녀석의 동료였다는 게 항상 후회돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_JhodKavken_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e2ddc576-69a5-4749-a341-35e17a4cb599"
msgid ""
"\"Jhod Kavken is too hard on himself. He has a kind soul, and I thank "
"providence for our meeting.\""
msgstr "\"조드 카브켄은 자신에게 엄격한 자이지. 친절한 자이고 그를 알게되어 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_JhodKavken_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "510d8d6e-cb22-446a-8f9a-660b31a27855"
msgid "\"He has a very pretty smile! It's a shame we see it so rarely.\""
msgstr "\"그는 아주 예쁜 웃음을 지니고 있지. 자주 보지 못한다는 게 아쉬워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_JhodKavken_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "76898ff8-849f-495c-93a7-684652d9dabb"
msgid ""
"\"It was lucky we met him. Suspicious, too... But he couldn't deceive a baby "
"with that face. He's absolutely harmless, and hence — entirely useless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그를 만난 것은 행운이었어. 의심스럽기도 하지... 하지만 그런 얼굴을 가진 아기를 속일 수 없었어. 그는 전혀 위험하지 않지만 쓸 "
"모 없기도 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_JhodKavken_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3227d0a7-627d-46b4-a081-3dbf8714639e"
msgid "\"His head looks like a potato. A potatohead! Ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"그의 머리는 감자 같아. 감자 머리! 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_TartukTartuccio_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ee714409-1a06-4d88-89ee-21502a4f13b5"
msgid ""
"\"A gnome turning into a kobold, to lead a whole tribe of these creatures! "
"Sound like one of the stories I heard from the caravaners in Kelesh.\""
msgstr "\"노움이 코볼트로 변해서 부족을 이끌었다! Kelesh의 캐러밴에게서 들었던 이야기 중 하나처럼 들리네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_TartukTartuccio_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ba072ab0-929b-4f40-83fe-42cff2361b91"
msgid "\"This book is writing itself! What a marvelous narrative!\""
msgstr "\"책이 자기 이야기를 써 내려가고 있어요! 묘사가 굉장한데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_TartukTartuccio_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6e47793d-434f-4b96-8131-6e64e6553b9c"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, you should hear the stories they tell over beer! Though you're a "
"little too young for them, ha, ha, ha...\""
msgstr "\"너희들도 맥주를 마시면서 그들이 하는 얘기를 들었어야 했는데! 너는 술 마시기엔 조금 어리겠다. 하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C11_TartukTartuccio_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "03946484-d09d-48a2-b3c3-81788197ef9a"
msgid ""
"\"Stupid gnome. He used to be a disgusting little beast, and now — he still "
"is.\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 노움. 그는 한 때 역겨운 작은 짐승이었는데. 지금도 그렇군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_AfterSadisticMage_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "511b93e2-6a05-46b1-b6f2-86413d4d279b"
msgid ""
"\"That poor troll still haunts my mind. — The one who played subject of "
"those experiments. Trolls bring so much evil, but still... I don't know if "
"there is a goal righteous enough to justify torture.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 불쌍한 트롤 때문에 여전히 내 마음이 괴로워. — 실험체였던 녀석이 있었지. 트롤은 악한 존재지만... 그런 악행에도 정당화할 "
"목표가 있을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_AfterSadisticMage_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "47fe6824-e125-4c5a-9942-1f76d5741c6b"
msgid ""
"\"What if these experiments led a wizard, for instance, to discover a cure "
"for the mortally wounded? Life is not so simple, my friend.\""
msgstr "\"만약 상처받은 환자를 치료하기 위해서 어떤 마법사가 그 실험을 하는 거라면? 삶은 그렇게 간단하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_AfterSadisticMage_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6d7e2c16-5ce2-4bb0-ab0c-fd1b675fd35d"
msgid ""
"\"That's base emotion talking. Better to heed the voice of reason, and "
"remember that the wizard was breaking no laws, and had a good cause — thus "
"he cannot be convicted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 기본적인 감정이야. 이성의 목소리에 귀를 기울여. 마법사는 무법자가 아니고 좋은 목적을 가지고 있다는 걸 기억해. 그래서 그는 "
"유죄가 될 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_AfterSadisticMage_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5c075119-8add-44bd-a8f0-a4e79778b7c1"
msgid ""
"\"Something tells me it wasn't about the cause, but the pleasure he got from "
"the process, ha, ha.\""
msgstr "\"목적이 문제가 아니라 그가 그 과정을 즐기고 있다는 게 문제지. 하하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_AfterSadisticMage_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3bf04508-a024-4e5a-a1b0-c3941e121c23"
msgid ""
"\"Wouldn't your goddess hear heresy in your words? She blesses all kinds of "
"evil deeds, whenever she imagines there's a greater good.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이단이 하는 말을 한다고 여신이 노하지는 않을까? 그녀는 더 대의가 있다고 생각할 때 모든 악행을 축복하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_AfterSadisticMage_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6960d958-20f6-48c6-b32e-723a277e6bc2"
msgid ""
"\"Wouldn't your goddess hear heresy in your words? She blesses all kinds of "
"evil deeds, whenever she imagines there's a greater good.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이단이 하는 말을 한다고 여신이 노하지는 않을까? 그녀는 더 대의가 있다고 생각할 때 모든 악행을 축복하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5b33e3b7-cc17-4fb7-a1e5-9772c63a4e65"
msgid ""
"\"This world is full of wonderful things, wonderful places and wonderful "
"people. I'm grateful for all I can learn.\""
msgstr "\"이 세상은 멋진 것들, 멋진 장소들, 멋진 사람들로 가득해. 그 모든 것을 경험할 기회를 가져 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7bec262e-f837-47f0-a1d1-1580e08bc16c"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, I'm so glad you're with us! I'd hate to think what might have "
"happened if our {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} hadn't come to your aid back "
"at the Temple.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안. 네가 우리와 함께 있어 너무 기뻐! 네가 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}에게 도움을 주기 위해 사원을 떠나지 않았을까 "
"걱정했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "10c61dc4-7bde-4f80-a9fb-fa9f7b9c871b"
msgid ""
"\"This world is filled with darkness and pain. But the ways that complex, "
"living things fall and decay back into nothingness — this amazes me as well. "
"Watching it happen, I sense true wonder.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 세상은 어둠과 고통으로 가득 차 있어. 하지만 복잡한 세상과 살아있는 것들은 결국 쇠락해 사라지지. 그게 정말 대단한 거야. 그런 "
"과정을 보면 나는 호기심을 느껴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b4480d38-9dba-4dd5-b93d-e4ff08724af5"
msgid "[Grinds her teeth and rolls her eyes]"
msgstr "[이를 갈고 눈알을 굴립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_AfterPandemic_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "382e060b-ac62-4708-a5d4-e46371d2f211"
msgid "\"So much suffering... I can't bear to see them!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 많은 고통을... 나는 차마 그들을 볼 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_AfterPandemic_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "32cb2ced-b7bb-48f3-b417-1c6a3506ae47"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't been yourself lately, Tristian. Stop punishing yourself. You "
"do all you can. Surely you know this.\""
msgstr "\"요즘 너 답지 않아. 트리스티안. 무리하지 마. 너는 최선을 다하고 있으니까. 우리도 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_AfterPandemic_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8abf86ee-8235-4808-87ea-9576fe4bde59"
msgid ""
"\"You burden is heavy. To attempt to save someone, yet fail... I know well "
"that feeling.\""
msgstr "\"네 짐은 무거워. 누군가를 구하려고 했지만 실패했지... 그 기분 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_AfterPandemic_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "34cee582-6137-4452-b36d-98e47a713ecd"
msgid "\"Pff.\""
msgstr "\"흥.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_AfterPandemic_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a295937c-810f-4387-a3b3-36e166170700"
msgid ""
"\"It's touching to see you care so much. You must be really sorry for anyone "
"who dies without a chance of becoming a servant of your goddess!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 신경을 쓰다니 감동했어. 여신의 종이 될 기회를 잃고 죽는 이가 있다면 안타깝겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_AfterPandemic_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1c4cc923-606f-4020-a30e-a84018ba609e"
msgid ""
"\"It's touching to see you care so much. You must be really sorry for anyone "
"who dies without a chance of becoming a servant of your goddess!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 신경을 쓰다니 감동했어. 여신의 종이 될 기회를 잃고 죽는 이가 있다면 안타깝겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "185398f5-75a5-4ac6-a06e-3f746da367ae"
msgid ""
"\"The news about these monsters is troubling. We must... find the root cause "
"of this invasion, as soon as possible.\""
msgstr "\"이 괴물들에 관한 소식은 문제로군. 우리는... 침공의 근원을 어서 찾아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "fb635ad4-f293-4e70-8a25-b497295f0988"
msgid ""
"\"There's a good fight ahead of us! We should be glad instead of whining!\""
msgstr "\"우리 앞에 전투가 있다! 질질 짜지 말고 기뻐하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6322ce4e-50d2-4fbc-8696-4f5ed722f133"
msgid ""
"\"These lands are full of danger, and monsters are no rarity here. Putting "
"an end to them will provide a fair challenge.\""
msgstr "\"이 토지는 위험으로 가득 차있고 괴물은 여기에 흔해. 그들을 끝내는 건 좋은 도전일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f3db96de-f30b-4d33-8c48-f2f363af2645"
msgid ""
"\"I share Tristian's apprehension, friends. Anything could have driven them "
"from the woods... Assuming they even came from the woods, of course.\""
msgstr "\"나는 트리스티안의 우려에 공감이 가. 무엇이든 숲에서 그들을 몰아 낼 수 있었어... 그들이 숲에서 왔다고 가정한다면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Tsanna_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e9dae8fa-f57f-476a-b7e1-7b945077633c"
msgid "\"How could we allow a priestess of Lamashtu into our ranks...\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 여사제를 우리 계급에 넣는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Tsanna_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "84343d12-9270-4439-9144-e8c50d132a12"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange, but I didn't find her that repulsive. There's a place in "
"Lamashtu's teachings for caring for your own, and for creation...\""
msgstr "\"이상해. 하지만 그녀가 거부하지는 않은 거 같아. 라마슈투의 가르침을 전파할 자리가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C22_Tsanna_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e3895beb-05c3-4a78-8074-f34af9b708b1"
msgid ""
"\"In this rare case, I agree with you, though not for the sake of squeamish "
"righteousness. On the other hand, there's always a chance you'll end up "
"crossing swords, and spare the rest of us your company.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아주 희귀한 경우인데 정의로운 일을 위한 일이 아닐지라도 네 말에 동의해. 한편 결국 싸움으로 끝이 나고 남은 동료들을 구하게 될 "
"기회도 항상 존재해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1d414a51-8f17-4757-b76c-9fbc1d0632b6"
msgid "\"So much evil... so much evil caused by a single flower...\""
msgstr "\"너무 많은 악이... 너무 많은 악이 하나의 꽃에서 생겨났어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e5d17b4f-22bb-467e-b8db-c2678c7563a9"
msgid ""
"\"I wish I could find whoever made it, and pluck them off at the stem!\""
msgstr "\"누가 만들었는지 몰라도 찾아내서 줄기에서 뜯어버리자구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3f408827-89ca-4bc9-88d3-b270630d38b0"
msgid ""
"\"You seem not yourself since we returned. Gather your courage, Tristian — "
"we shall need it!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 돌아온 후로 너답지 않아보여. 정신 차려. 트리스티안. 우리는 네가 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a432fd61-2870-483f-8517-75771d1a5aa7"
msgid ""
"\"And yet the Flower is only a tool. But what evil must seethe in the heart "
"of the one who planned all this!\""
msgstr "\"꽃은 단지 도구일 뿐이야. 하지만 이걸 계획한 자의 마음은 악으로 물들어있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_VarnholdVanished_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d904f3ac-fb22-4c9d-a3ec-3960256ba3c7"
msgid "\"The fate of Varnhold haunts me. I pray its people are unharmed.\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 운명이 저를 괴롭히네요. 모든 사람들이 무사해야 할 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_VarnholdVanished_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5c4a6d00-bf85-4731-886d-788d590e3063"
msgid ""
"\"My prayers fly with yours. Been thinking about those people, too. Don't "
"want it to end as it did with my village. Would that we can help...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 기도가 너에게 닿기를. 사람들에게도 기도했어. 우리 마을 사람들과 같은 운명을 맞지 않기를 바라. 우리가 도울 수 있는 건 별로 "
"없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_VarnholdVanished_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "32794eeb-2332-4ba4-ad45-3c135f2d4561"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, these are the Stolen Lands. Time and again people disappear here "
"without a trace, whole groups, and even whole settlements.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 도둑맞은 땅에 있어. 사람들은 흔적도 없이 몇 사람이 혹은 마을 사람 모두가 사라지고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C31_VarnholdVanished_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "72c2cd51-cab1-42bc-9759-c0665bd7c582"
msgid ""
"\"I don't envy that Sarenrae of yours — you pray so much her head must hurt, "
"ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"너의 서렌레이가 그다지 부럽지는 않아. 네가 너무 많이 기도를 해서 그녀의 귀에 딱지가 가라앉겠어. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_1_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "13eb310f-c91b-46cf-a314-344d5a7d2866"
msgid "\"I am so grateful to fate for giving me a chance to repent...\""
msgstr "\"회개할 수 있는 기회를 주신 것에 대해 너무나 감사해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_1_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7a76842d-0d0a-4dd3-8f93-c4064347af0e"
msgid ""
"\"Repent? Why do you imagine treachery is something that can be repented?\""
msgstr "\"회개? 왜 배신은 회개로 용서받을 수 있다고 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_1_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f31332e6-a637-4d99-a340-513b04fba3f1"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone makes mistakes sometimes, Tristian. But not everyone is ready to "
"accept and try to fix their mistakes.\""
msgstr "\"모두 실수를 해. 트리스티안. 하지만 모든 사람이 자신의 실수를 고칠 수 있는 기회를 갖지는 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_1_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "fa1a9eab-c403-4784-96bb-40112000800b"
msgid ""
"\"You should thank {name} for not letting me do all I'm supposed to do to "
"you by the laws of the tribe…\""
msgstr "\"{name}에게 감사를 해야 해. 부족의 규칙대로 너를 처리하지 않게 해주었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "63ff47b9-fedc-4c13-ba25-6d69520f0599"
msgid ""
"\"I understand, how... difficult it is to forgive me, and accept me into "
"your circle again. I'm not asking or expecting this from you.\""
msgstr "\"이해해... 나를 용서하고 다시 일원으로 받아들이기가 쉽지는 않았겠지. 부탁도 기대도 하지 않았지만 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3082de5f-d34f-41fc-bb88-6aff80152e82"
msgid "\"And right. Now you better keep quiet while you are still alive.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 맞아. 이제 살아있는 동안은 조용히 하는 게 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "785471d9-9394-4b18-9897-6a4fcc5e1243"
msgid ""
"\"I've been wondering why you did what you did. It's an understatement to "
"say that we were all stunned! You can't undo what you've done, but still... "
"You know, I'm glad you're back with us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 왜 그랬는지 궁금했어. 우리는 충격을 받는 것 이상이었으니까. 네가 한 일을 되돌릴 수 없지만... 네가 돌아와서 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c837a2e8-85f5-4bf1-8169-5c827060fa66"
msgid ""
"\"It's easier to fix a broken egg than return the trust you've lost. But "
"time can do strange things.\""
msgstr "\"잃어버린 신뢰를 되찾는 것보다 부서진 달걀을 고치는 것이 더 쉽겠어. 하지만 시간은 가끔 이상한 짓을 하고는 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "df924989-d1d3-4777-9c0a-89b1b78a8b7a"
msgid ""
"\"Eh, don't worry. You showed me that if I stab someone in the back, they'll "
"let me back in! Longshanks and halfshanks – ha! So gullible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"걱정마. 내가 누군가의 등에 칼을 꽂았다면 그들도 내 등에 칼을 꽂을 테니까! 꺽다리든 반쪽이든 말이야. 모두 너무 잘 속아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "2c5993b5-cac1-4f31-99bb-f8b299c78fa5"
msgid "[Turns away without saying a word]"
msgstr "[말 없이 등 돌립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C41_Responses.Array.data[5].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "6eba3f15-2b26-4b56-89b5-d10fb9e04175"
msgid "[Turns away without saying a word]"
msgstr "[말 없이 등 돌립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_AfterCoronation_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "56bea2f4-35f6-4143-acc2-69e2762b80c6"
msgid ""
"\"You've become a {mf|king|queen}, {name}. Now your feats will surely ring "
"around the world. My congratulations! It is a well-deserved reward.\""
msgstr "\"너는 {mf|왕|여왕}이 되었어. {name}. 이제 너의 업적은 세계에 퍼질 거야. 축하해! 당연히 그래야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "06926e92-9769-4e86-8fe0-eb63322048c1"
msgid ""
"\"Self-praise is unseemly... but still – what a nice coronation ceremony we "
"held, don't you think? And the feast afterwards!\""
msgstr "\"자기 칭찬은 보기 좋지 않지만... 대관식이 얼마나 보기 좋았어? 연회는 또 어떻고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "19fc74b2-a4e8-4ed7-947c-92e9eca1ab0b"
msgid ""
"\"Nice lies, traitor. – 'Congratulations, {name}, you somehow made it — no "
"matter how hard I tried to help our enemies and get everyone killed!'\""
msgstr "\"좋은 거짓말이군. 반역자. 축하해. {name}. 네가 해냈어. 시련이 닥쳐도, 모두가 죽었어도 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_AfterCoronation_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1316c3a6-1320-482c-9584-f948bf7700e3"
msgid "\"Is it a reward or a burden?\""
msgstr "\"이건 보상인가 짐인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_RushlightTournamentAnnounced_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d09ab29b-d643-4b64-b921-7e8ddd79363d"
msgid ""
"\"This Rushlight tournament is such a wonderful idea. I'm so amazed – "
"ravished by the celebrations people hold!\""
msgstr "\"러시라이트 토너먼트는 정말 멋진 생각이야. 이 축하연을 보고 정말 놀랐다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_RushlightTournamentAnnounced_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "45e163b9-13c4-4b0a-90f3-739ece2f7f2c"
msgid ""
"\"A deva, who has looked upon the gods with his own eyes, and traveled "
"freely between the planes, is 'ravished' by the sight of a drunken crowd. "
"Delightful.\""
msgstr "\"자신의 눈으로 신을 바라보고 행성 사이를 자유자재로 날아다니는 디바가 술취한 군중들을 보고 놀랐군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_RushlightTournamentAnnounced_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cf96953b-71cf-4753-aaa6-dff9441e2f59"
msgid ""
"\"I still can't believe you're a real deva! That's so interesting! How "
"mysterious it all is, and what happens there, beyond the boundary of death…\""
msgstr "\"네가 디바라니 믿을 수가 없어! 정말 흥미로워. 무슨 일이 일어날지 죽음의 경계 너머에서 어떻게 될지 궁금해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_C51_RushlightTournamentAnnounced_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ee2fe4a4-56c0-4f37-91c3-42d615824e6f"
msgid ""
"\"I have no idea what such a neatly-dressed fellow like yourself could find "
"so interesting about a bunch of drunken mugs at a festival.\""
msgstr "\"너처럼 깔끔하게 차려 입은 동료가 축제에서 술취한 인간들을 볼 생각을 하니 상상이 가질 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d3f94cc4-252f-4577-8361-ac86f2709bd2"
msgid "\"Finally some leisure time. We can celebrate our leader's birthday!\""
msgstr "\"드디어 여가 시간이 생겼군. 우리 지도자의 생일을 축하하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Tristian/Banter_Tristian_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c6d13b30-4972-4168-bcc2-cc86d02ed7eb"
msgid ""
"\"You know I'm no good at speeches. All I can say is: be happy and inspire "
"the people who follow you. May the light of Sarenrae guide your way!\""
msgstr "\"나는 연설을 잘하지 못해. 그저 모두 행복하고 네 백성들에게 영감을 불어넣길 바라. 서렌레이가 너의 길에 빛을 비추기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_Bandit_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dccb0b0d-2bae-41e6-b511-7e0fac7787ad"
msgid ""
"\"Such sad, deserted lands. Lawlessness always leads to desolation and "
"emptiness.\""
msgstr "\"슬프고 황량한 땅이군. 무법은 언제나 황폐와 공허로 이어진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_Bandit_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3ff3050f-de0a-48f1-9de7-ce1dbd4f1ed5"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't know. Galt is no more orderly — but it's nowhere near as "
"desolate.\""
msgstr "\"모르겠어. 갈트는 혼란스러워. 이제 그곳 만큼 황량한 곳은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_Bandit_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7bd9ec2e-7ac2-4889-b082-5d23d59e0b24"
msgid ""
"\"Trust me, law and order can be twisted into the service of evil, and spawn "
"even more cruelty and suffering.\""
msgstr "\"나를 믿어. 법과 질서가 악과 함께 뒤틀려 더 잔인하고 고통스러울 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_Bandit_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6258f05a-1f97-423d-bf6e-bb17dbfae4f1"
msgid ""
"\"Law and freedom balance each other like two ends of the scales. Both can "
"lead to evil, unless tempered with compassion.\""
msgstr "\"법과 자유는 서로의 균형을 맞추지. 둘 모두 자칫 잘못하면 악으로 인도할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_SycamoreWar_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0c8e6d71-2cec-48a5-baf6-ffde85edf75f"
msgid ""
"\"Unbelievable! A war between kobolds and mites! You can't read about that "
"in a book!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어! 코볼트와 마이트 사이의 전쟁이라니! 책에서도 나오지 않는 이야기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_SycamoreWar_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b959f1ec-747b-4dfb-b847-65f514f9685a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, I guess you haven't spent much time in libraries! There is one Qadiran "
"novel... on the whole rather frivolous, I must say... where kobolds and "
"mites not only fight, but, hm, do a few other things as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 도서관에서 많은 시간을 보내지 않았을 테지! 카디란 소설이라는 책이 있어... 이 이야기를 꼭 말해주고 싶었어... 코볼트와 "
"마이트가 전쟁을 하는 이야기지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_SycamoreWar_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "00577a46-c4da-4126-8853-327a7543f6f3"
msgid ""
"\"It's sad to see their hundred-year peace broken over such a trifle! But "
"there's nothing to be done: nature didn't bless either of them with much "
"wit...\""
msgstr "\"100년의 평화가 이처럼 사소한 일로 깨지다니 슬픈 일이야! 하지만 자연은 그 누구의 손도 들어주지 못했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C11_SycamoreWar_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "25ee6337-eda7-4a8d-94d8-585e1bdfa57e"
msgid ""
"\"It was as good as a circus, when they started tearing out each other's "
"throats, ha, ha, hmm! So small, but full of spit and rage!\""
msgstr "\"서커스처럼 재밌었어. 서로 목을 찢으려고 할 때 말이지. 하하하! 작은 녀석들이 화를 어찌나 그렇게 내던지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_Start_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fe70bbf9-8086-499d-b520-c576ca223550"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know if it's true, but... have you heard what the local villagers "
"say about a dragon in these woods? It would make a fine hunting trophy!\""
msgstr "\"사실인지는 모르겠지만... 주민들이 숲에 있는 용에 관해 뭐라 말했는지 들었어? 좋은 사냥감이 생길지도 몰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4ff6d35f-4848-4ce3-9355-3b3b963f5608"
msgid ""
"\"No, not dragon. There are no dragons in these lands. Could be a wyvern.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 용이 아니야. 이 땅에는 용들이 없어. 와이번일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "eeaa5f74-2353-4ba4-9aa5-b4882da52f2f"
msgid ""
"\"It would surely be a fine trophy indeed, if trophies could be forged of "
"empty gossip. If a real dragon lived anywhere nearby, everyone would learn "
"of it — in a most unpleasant manner!\""
msgstr "\"헛소문이라면 참 좋은 사냥을 하겠다. 주변에 정말 용이 산다면 모두 무서워 달아나지 않았을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "71938f44-bbec-49ca-91ad-08f0d4e0d210"
msgid ""
"\"Just thinking about it, I'm ready to fight! Why are we babbling here?! "
"It's time we go and tear off that lizard's wings!\""
msgstr "\"생각해 봤는데 나는 싸우고 싶어! 왜 여기서 떠들고만 있는 거야?! 가서 그 도마뱀의 날개를 찢어버리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6140b92f-3e56-4f9a-a7db-b53988e554cc"
msgid ""
"\"I hope it's just idle talk. A dragon is not prey for a joyful hunt. It "
"would mean disaster for the entire barony!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 헛소문이길 바래야지. 용은 재미로 사냥할 수 있는 존재가 아니야. 남작령이 파멸할 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_Start_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "3ec262be-5964-48c5-9a67-671042cdc9e4"
msgid ""
"\"I hope it's just idle talk. A dragon is not prey for a joyful hunt. It "
"would mean disaster for the entire barony!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 헛소문이길 바래야지. 용은 재미로 사냥할 수 있는 존재가 아니야. 남작령이 파멸할 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_TartukAndTrolls_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "15e3560d-b58c-4afb-9755-498539c8780f"
msgid ""
"\"Trolls usually treat kobolds like annoying moths... I wonder what that "
"Tartuccio could have told them?\""
msgstr "\"트롤들은 보통 코볼트를 성가신 나방처럼 취급하지... 타투치오가 그들에게 무엇을 말했을지 궁금하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_TartukAndTrolls_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8079b1fe-8359-43ec-a9f6-7a7c1e7bcbdc"
msgid ""
"\"In the end, he's a magician. Magic trickery can make an unforgettable "
"impression on the uneducated barbarian mind.\""
msgstr "\"결국 그는 마법사였어. 무식한 야만인에게 마법사의 속임수는 잊을 수 없는 인상을 남길 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_TartukAndTrolls_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "02bf95e7-3017-4e84-beb9-eab3949dd96d"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever it is, an alliance like this is bad news for everyone else.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 무엇이든 이런 소문은 모두에게 나쁜 소식이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C21_TartukAndTrolls_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "67580a28-8981-414a-b0df-e1ecf78d3057"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe they just like the color purple? Or was he able to offer them "
"something they truly desire? Or perhaps he's the first kobold clever enough "
"to learn the language of the giants!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도 그들은 보라색을 좋아할까? 아니면 그가 정말 바라는 것을 주었을까? 아니면 그가 정말로 거인의 언어를 배울 정도로 똑똑했을지도!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MivonVsBrevoy_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d2f48b0e-1652-49d1-981f-5ec1e16dcc23"
msgid ""
"\"I've met a lot of people. Fought side by side with many of them. The best "
"allies in the Stolen Lands are the steadfast Mivoni. They're always reliable "
"— unlike Brevans.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 많은 사람들을 만났어. 많은 사람들과 함께 싸웠지. 도둑맞은 땅에서 최고의 동맹은 미본 사람들이야. 브래반 녀석들과 달리 그들은 "
"항상 신뢰할 만하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MivonVsBrevoy_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9084a83b-d185-4359-be05-d2bf9cc3af4f"
msgid ""
"\"Brevan families specialize in scheming and treachery. It would seem even "
"commoners of those parts possess the same dishonest instincts as their "
"rulers.\""
msgstr "\"브레보이 가문은 음모와 반역 꾸미기가 특기야. 주인을 닮아서 그런가, 거기 출신은 툭하면 배신이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MivonVsBrevoy_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "91912b0d-630e-477c-995b-a551bb82d27b"
msgid "\"Southerners are all the same. — Cowards with no pride or courage.\""
msgstr "\"남부 녀석들은 모두 같아. 겁쟁이에 자부심은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MivonVsBrevoy_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8780704e-b7a0-4c76-9da5-080f828dd921"
msgid "\"There's only one whose word you can always trust: yourself.\""
msgstr "\"항상 자신의 말을 신뢰할 수있는 사람이 한명 있지. 바로 자기 자신이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MivonVsBrevoy_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "047e8f78-8dd6-4a7f-b898-6f0d50fada0d"
msgid ""
"\"In other words, you'd prefer a sword in the chest to a dagger in the back."
"\""
msgstr "\"등에 칼을 꽂히기 보다는 가슴에 칼을 꽂히는 걸 좋아하는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MivonVsBrevoy_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "78505544-62a4-4c1c-b0aa-3707ef59b9a9"
msgid ""
"\"In other words, you'd prefer a sword in the chest to a dagger in the back."
"\""
msgstr "\"등에 칼을 꽂히기 보다는 가슴에 칼을 꽂히는 걸 좋아하는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8cf0c3fa-afc1-489f-aa93-83be70aadf48"
msgid ""
"\"How could it be possible? Monsters appearing from inside a person, tearing "
"the poor soul apart! Every monster we slay is one more life we failed to "
"save...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 어떻게 가능하지? 사람 안에서 괴물이 자라나 영혼을 찢고 나오는 거라니! 우리가 죽인 괴물들은 목숨이 하나 더 있나봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "139f8f61-0ef6-4c4a-a813-f186080a2dfc"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome to real life. This is how it really looks on the ground, unlike "
"the pages of heroic legends, or the songs of bards.\""
msgstr "\"현실에 온 걸 환영해. 책에서 보던 영웅담이나 음유시인의 노래와는 다르지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6e364bb9-de2b-4bda-ab9d-dbc917b067f5"
msgid ""
"\"The eyes of those poor people who recognized what was about to happen — "
"they shall haunt me in my nightmares. We must find a way to stop this "
"madness!\""
msgstr "\"죽기 직전의 사람들의 눈을 보았던 기억이 아직도 가끔 악몽으로 나타나. 이 광기를 멈출 방법을 찾아야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C22_MonstersOutOfPeople_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3f4078bb-cda6-4769-ad2a-3c253b890d77"
msgid ""
"\"This terrible tragedy only brings into relief something we try to forget "
"every day. Every wasted hour costs someone their life. Every moment someone "
"reaches out to a passers-by, begging for salvation... and dying of "
"unkindness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 끔찍한 비극은 우리가 잊고 지내려던 나날들의 일부야. 외면하며 지나친 시간은 누군가에게 절박한 삶의 순간이지. 누군가 행인에게 "
"구걸을 할 때마다... 소외로 죽어가고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_DeadDefacedSister_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f64ef61b-131d-496c-93f5-2abcad72ead5"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stop thinking about the face of that poor woman we found in the "
"cyclops' tomb. A 'Defaced' Sister indeed! Who could have done that to her?\""
msgstr ""
"\"사이클롭스의 무덤에서 찾은 그 불쌍한 여인의 얼굴을 잊을 수가 없어. 정말 얼굴 잃은 자매가 맞았지! 그녀에게 무슨 일이 일어난 걸까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_DeadDefacedSister_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5c5e1314-7335-4e3d-a17b-7837aa86253b"
msgid ""
"\"A perverse religious practice of some fanatic cult. Priests of many dark "
"religions self-mutilate voluntarily.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 광신도들이 벌이는 종교 의식이겠지. 어둠의 종교의식을 행하는 사제들은 가끔 자해를 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_DeadDefacedSister_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "887979af-930c-4021-9d9a-7a1ed54c1774"
msgid ""
"\"It doesn't matter much now, anyway. You don't need a face to lay in a "
"grave.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 지금은 별로 중요하지 않아. 무덤에서는 얼굴이 필요 없으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_DeadDefacedSister_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a8f20dad-b3f8-405c-beda-a6b79c7e1906"
msgid ""
"\"The world is full of such terrors. Life is cruel. What is more surprising "
"is the way you cling to it.\""
msgstr "\"세상은 공포로 가득 차있어. 삶은 잔인하지. 더 놀라운 것은 삶에 매달리는 방식이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_DeadDefacedSister_Responses.Array.data[3].Response
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "506723d6-d313-4cf3-89d5-033bb01aff7c"
msgid ""
"\"For some reason I feel they really are sisters... From a very unhappy "
"family.\""
msgstr "\"왠지 모르지만 그들이 정말로 자매라고 느꼈어... 아주 불행한 가족의 자매 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_DeadDefacedSister_Responses.Array.data[4].Response
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7707fa77-6cd7-4601-887c-559c93190a92"
msgid ""
"\"For some reason I feel they really are sisters... From a very unhappy "
"family.\""
msgstr "\"왠지 모르지만 그들이 정말로 자매라고 느꼈어... 아주 불행한 가족의 자매 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "43433bb8-100e-4255-adfd-88f5f2642598"
msgid ""
"\"At first I thought the Bloom just another wonder of nature, which causes "
"evil unwillingly — like poisonous plants, or droughts and storms. But now we "
"know there's a wicked will at the root of all this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음에 나는 역병이 인간에게 유해한 자연 현상의 일부라고 생각했어. 독성 식물이나 가뭄, 벼락 같이 말이야. 하지만 이제 사악한 자의 "
"짓이라는 걸 알게 됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4935f49f-de8c-4778-a0a1-2596e7a256a9"
msgid ""
"\"As should have been expected. Behind great disasters there's often "
"someone's wicked will.\""
msgstr "\"예상했던대로 큰 재난의 배후에는 종종 사악한 자가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f57601c4-3930-4874-97d7-5cdf36929444"
msgid ""
"\"Great evil. Innocent victims. This must never be forgiven and forgotten.\""
msgstr "\"거대한 악. 무고한 희생자들. 용서 받을 수 없는 자들이고 잊을 수 없는 자들이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C31_SeasonOfBloomFeedback_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e4b61b4c-f40a-4d88-9829-0325b15a064f"
msgid ""
"\"How horrible. How could anyone be capable of such things? I will never "
"understand what drives such monsters. How can their minds and souls become "
"so twisted?\""
msgstr ""
"\"끔찍하군. 어떻게 이런 짓을 벌일 수가 있지? 그런 괴물을 불러들여서 무얼 할지 이해할 수가 없군. 어떻게 본성이 그렇게 악할 수가 "
"있을까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "31e55ee6-cb01-483b-a560-17e778bbd95b"
msgid ""
"\"I never expected this from Tristian... but now he's shown his true colors."
"\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안이 이러리라고는... 이제 그는 본모습을 보여주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1c0323ed-eca7-461d-9dc3-2d03860551ab"
msgid ""
"\"I'd hunt down the rat and choke him, but I don't want to get my hands "
"dirty.\""
msgstr "\"쥐를 사냥해서 그 녀석 목구멍에 넣어주고 싶지만 지금은 손을 더럽히고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c597f820-b297-4ec0-b44d-59c2cb661126"
msgid ""
"\"But how did he come to this?! Why did he betray us? I had no idea! Aren't "
"you the least bit interested?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 그는 어떻게 이렇게 되었지?! 왜 우리를 배신했을까? 모르겠어. 너는 조금도 관심이 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_BeforeTristianReturn_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "57e87a1b-3c3d-44c1-a393-ce71200caf1e"
msgid ""
"\"Well I had an idea! I always thought, and often said, that there was "
"something wrong with him — and I was right!\""
msgstr "\"내 말이 맞지! 나는 항상 그가 이상하다고 생각해서 말했지. 그런데 내가 맞았잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dfd0e229-102b-47ce-aa07-a0b2c4226ced"
msgid ""
"\"As expected, the Kellids know nothing about strategy and maneuvers. "
"However, one can't deny they possess a certain... resourcefulness and "
"tactical ingenuity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"예상대로 켈리즈는 전략과 기동에 대해 아무것도 모르고 있었어. 하지만 그들이 일련의 재능과 전술적 독창성을 소유한 것은 확실해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f61977b4-f7ab-462f-83ae-15a638ae30f5"
msgid "\"Animal craftiness, not more than that.\""
msgstr "\"짐승 같은 교활함. 그 이상도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "555bd0d7-31a0-4788-bde5-5bb7c0dbbea3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be fooled. They are counting on their opponent taking them for "
"idiots. Underestimating them is a mistake you only do once.\""
msgstr "\"속지마. 그들은 적들에게 허점을 일부러 드러내는 거야. 그들을 과소평가하는 것이야말로 실수인 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C41_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "96a44034-7d37-4cea-88d6-f5e32cb1b382"
msgid ""
"\"It's all about resolution and improvisation. You've got something to learn "
"from them here, ha ha.\""
msgstr "\"해결책을 배우고 바로 써먹는 것이 중요하지. 그들에게서 배웠군. 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "869d5209-21c9-43ba-aba0-6c13be03c40d"
msgid ""
"\"I always knew Irovetti wasn't fit to be a king. Well, maybe this is our "
"chance to correct history's mistake.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티가 왕의 자격이 없다고 생각했어. 우리에게 역사의 실수를 바로잡을 기회가 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c431418e-16dc-405d-8030-8affa8419ef4"
msgid "\"Ha! How nicely put! Where's my notebook...\""
msgstr "\"하! 멋진 말인데! 내 책이 어디에 있더라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "824892ef-fc75-4dbc-a67e-f2252ffcc679"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? We've already tried putting someone on a throne. Now let's try "
"throwing someone off one, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"왜? 우리는 이미 어떤 녀석을 왕좌에 앉혔지. 그러니 이번에는 왕좌에서 쫓아내 보자고! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AfterWarStartKtc_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ff5556c8-391c-415d-91df-49159de59402"
msgid ""
"\"He who searches for fairness in this world only walks the path of "
"disappointment.\""
msgstr "\"세상에서 공평함만을 찾는 사람은 실망의 길을 걷게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AssCampVisited_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9abf5989-6e04-4395-b45f-d8e99bd2cdc2"
msgid ""
"\"Ilora Nuski's camp was more a thieves' nest than a general's headquarters. "
"They stood no chance.\""
msgstr "\"일로라 누스키의 야영지는 장군의 본부라기보다는 도둑 소굴 같았지. 그들은 바빴거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AssCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "53f6e7d8-f9b8-4ae6-a277-743fd9aae692"
msgid "\"Ha! As if anyone could stand a chance against us!\""
msgstr "\"하! 마치 누구나 우리에게 대적할 수 있다는 듯이 말하는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AssCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "38fdae11-485d-415d-b6c9-7a76cd36ae93"
msgid "\"Similarities attract.\""
msgstr "\"유사성이 매력적이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_C51_AssCampVisited_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "38f01df7-8ea6-4ea9-a731-de8f4398559d"
msgid ""
"\"But they received such terrible orders. — Take everything, and leave "
"nothing behind but scorched earth!\""
msgstr "\"그러나 그들은 끔찍한 명령을 받았어. 아무것도 남기지 않고 모두 불태워버리라고 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_HBB_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a4dd25a5-f4f7-46de-a048-ff15e927923d"
msgid ""
"\"It's our {mf|baron's|baroness's|King's|Queen's} birthday, and I have a "
"word to say! This date is special for all of those who follow you today – "
"and to the many others who will join you in the years to come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘은 우리 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 생일이죠. 그러니까 제가 한마디 하겠습니다! 오늘은 당신을 섬기는 자들, 그리고 미래에 "
"당신에게 합류할 이들에게 특별한 날입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_HBB_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b00f9413-2b90-483f-ab80-5c6ef82ede0d"
msgid ""
"\"You are our leader, and the one who will decide the fate of this land – "
"and its people. It's a great honor, and a great responsibility. Remain "
"strong and worthy, and lead us forward!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 우리의 지도자이자 이 땅과 사람들의 운명을 결정할 사람입니다. 그것은 큰 명예이고 큰 책임이죠. 언제나 힘과 명예를 잃지 말고 "
"우리를 인도해 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Lebeda_FirstPhrase.Array.data[0]
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9c209a3c-ddf8-43ef-a8f3-24e6f6d93e54"
msgid ""
"\"The virtues of a noble chevalier are entirely foreign to Sir Lebeda. He "
"kept inviting me on a date so persistently — and behaved as though he was "
"deaf to my objections!\""
msgstr "\"레베다 경은 고귀한 슈발리에의 미덕과 거리가 먼 사람이다. 내 거절은 들은 척도 안하고 계속해서 내게 초대장을 보내더군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Lebeda_Responses.Array.data[0].Response
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "65bd256f-f597-4b54-a0a2-9856d1a9b69f"
msgid ""
"\"Just say that you will meet him in some quiet place... and I'll show up "
"instead of you. I will give him more than he ever bargained for!\""
msgstr "\"조용한 곳에서 만나자고 해... 너 대신 내가 나갈 테니까. 그놈한테 기대 이상의 만남을 선사해주지. 어때!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Lebeda_Responses.Array.data[1].Response
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "86b6b274-07ac-4a18-ad71-5043a1c91bb9"
msgid ""
"\"I should talk to him. About the void, and the ashes and the end of all "
"that exists. About the pointlessness of life. And he will see that spoiling "
"the lives of others is doubly pointless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그자와 얘기해보지. 이 삶은 공허하며, 존재는 한 줌 재가 되어 종말을 맞이할 거라고. 인생의 덧없음을 알려주겠네. 타인의 "
"일상에 침범하는 것이 얼마나 무의미한지 깨달을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/BarkoBanters/Story/Valerie/Banter_Valerie_Lebeda_Responses.Array.data[2].Response
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "868b7ae6-2c0b-4c2b-8ea6-43bef2add74d"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha. Some find it difficult to own defeat and stand back... Even when "
"everyone around can see it's a lost cause.\""
msgstr "\"하하. 거절을 받아들이지 못하는 사람이 가끔 있지... 이루어질 확률이 요만큼도 없다는 걸 그놈만 빼고 다 아는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "ad4c7f9e-440c-4f8f-8f71-60243151ab76"
msgid "\"I could use the help of a cleric.\""
msgstr "\"성직자의 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0412ba10-0cd1-4298-9e2e-7795a5353468"
msgid "\"I also follow Abadar's path. Welcome to my lands, colleague!\""
msgstr "\"나는 또한 아바다르의 길을 따른다. 내 땅에 온 것을 환영한다. 동료!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d50d2501-5248-4d52-8f8a-8955fc2e626b"
msgid "\"Tell me about Abadar.\""
msgstr "\"아바다르에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "9f7c7b59-d192-4574-b4e6-cf150a531881"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "161f1f73-5666-4d0d-9cf3-3e782bfe094f"
msgid "\"You're an aasimar, if I'm not mistaken.\""
msgstr "\"내가 잘못 본게 아니라면, 넌 아시마르 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9f70fa8e-8dec-4745-8e54-86788133de7b"
msgid "\"How did you come to be in my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 내 {mf|영지|영지|나라|나라}로 들어왔지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "92bd971d-6bc6-4261-a496-439605e153c2"
msgid ""
"\"If you're so eager to help the citizens, why do you charge for your "
"services?\""
msgstr "\"시민들을 도우려고 한다면 왜 댓가를 바라는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d889686a-ef50-4d65-acc4-4af70852cd80"
msgid ""
"{n}Arsinoe stares at you for a moment, then adds with noticeable warmth,{/n} "
"\"I'm glad to meet another person marked by celestial blood here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르시노는 잠시 당신을 보고는 눈에 띄게 온화하게 대합니다.{/n} \"이곳에서 천족 혈통의 상징을 지닌 사람을 만나게되어 기쁩니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "defcefd9-b3d5-44e2-8bbe-d02344d03e2e"
msgid ""
"{n}A woman in rich, gold-embroidered clothes greets you with a polite bow. "
"Her eyes, the color of molten gold, shine brightly in her dusky face.{/n} "
"\"Greetings, noble ruler of these lands! My name is Arsinoe. I'm a messenger "
"from the temple of {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, and I "
"came here assuming the citizens of your young "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} could use the services of a priest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}화려한 금으로 수놓은 옷을 입은 한 여인이 당신에게 예의 바른 인사를 합니다. 그녀의 눈은 금이 녹아내린 색이고 어두운 피부색은 "
"밝게 빛납니다.{/n} \"이 땅의 고귀한 통치자를 만나 뵙게 되어 영광입니다! 제 이름은 아르시노입니다. "
"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}의 {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g} 성전에서 온 메신저이고 당신 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}의 "
"백성들에게 사제의 도움이 필요할 것이라 생각하고 이곳에 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "765db28f-1ddc-450a-9ec9-21d02322e73a"
msgid ""
"{n}Arsinoe lets out a sigh of relief as you approach.{/n} \"Praise "
"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}! The ruler has returned to {mf|his|her} tormented land! "
"I hope you can put an end to all this chaos. It pains me to see what's "
"become of your young kingdom...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르시노는 당신이 다가올 때 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}를 찬양하라! 통치자가 고통받는 "
"자신의 영토로 돌아왔습니다! 전 이 모든 혼란이 끝나기를 바랍니다. 당신의 왕국이 처한 상황이 제 마음을 괴롭게 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "bd6ea029-a685-4277-9fff-cccce184b4b4"
msgid "\"How can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요하신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "c32ec6d5-4720-4ed2-939d-c605e5fe63cb"
msgid "\"That is precisely why I am here.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 제가 여기 있는 이유입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "40155052-2c27-4282-9311-9fd0f50da639"
msgid ""
"\"With pleasure! {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} is the god of cities, law, merchants, "
"and wealth. The core of his teachings is simple: law and order allows "
"civilization to develop, which allows people to live in peace and "
"prosperity. If {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} favors old customs, small settlements, "
"and simple trades like hunting, then Abadar patronizes development, complex "
"trades, order, and entrepreneurship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"기꺼이! {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}는 도시, 법률, 상인 및 부의 신이십니다. 그의 가르침의 핵심은 간단합니다. 법과 질서는 "
"문명을 발전시켜 사람들이 평화와 번영 속에 살 수 있도록 하죠. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 작은 관습, 사냥과 같은 단순한 "
"거래를 선호한다면 아바다르는 개발, 복잡한 거래, 주문 및 기업가 정신을 후원하십니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "6598fc9b-5e36-4c82-a016-1a3ca933dcdb"
msgid ""
"\"Each priest of {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} finds something personal in serving "
"him. Some believe that law is the main aspect of their faith, and they guard "
"it zealously. Others put the well-being of their society above all. I "
"personally follow Abadar's teachings that say civilization must penetrate "
"the wildest savage lands and help people live in comfort and safety.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}의 성직자는 봉사를 하면서 개인적 진리를 가집니다. 어떤 이들은 율법이 신앙의 주요 측면이라고 믿으며 "
"그것을 열렬히 지키지요. 다른 사람들은 무엇보다도 사회의 안녕을 중요시합니다. 저는 개인적으로 문명이 거친 야만의 땅을 계몽하고 사람들을 "
"편안하고 안전하게 살 수 있도록 도우라는 아바다르의 가르침을 따릅니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "97483dbe-1838-462b-a7a4-3b7fac817106"
msgid ""
"\"That's a long story, and not a terribly exciting one. I was born and "
"raised in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, but I saw little point in staying there — "
"what's the purpose in promoting the faith of Abadar in a city already so "
"large and well developed? No, I was drawn to backwater places, where "
"civilization was just beginning to emerge. It gives me such joy to see the "
"first stones of a new settlement being laid, or to see wilderness that once "
"harbored monsters and criminals become a safe, cozy home for people!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좀 긴 이야기이고, 별로 재밌는 이야기는 아닙니다. 나는 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에서 태어나고 자랐지만, 그곳에 계속 "
"머무르는 것은 별 의미가 없다고 보았습니다. 이미 크고 잘 발달된 도시에서 아바다르의 신앙을 퍼뜨릴 이유가 있을까요? 저는 이제 막 "
"문명이 발달하기 시작한 곳들에 끌렸죠. 새로운 정착지에 초석을 놓거나, 한때 괴물들과 범죄자가 바글바글했던 곳이 문명화되는 것을 보는 건 "
"제게 큰 기쁨입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "bd59ac13-4052-45a4-8cda-b050d57db0f5"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose it's easy to tell, isn't it? Yes, I'm an aasimar, though I'm not "
"sure how or when the blood of celestials appeared in my family. Among all my "
"relatives and known ancestors, I'm the only one who inherited it. I must "
"admit, I'm glad this lot fell to me — it draws more attention to me, a "
"useful trait for a priest who wishes to gather a congregation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 쉽게 눈치채셨네요? 전 아시마르입니다. 하지만 제 조상 중에 천족의 피가 언제, 어떻게 섞였는지는 잘 모르겠네요. 모든 친척들과 "
"조상들 중에서 저만 유일하게 발현됐습니다. 나는 이 혈통이 내게 이어져서 기뻐요. 제 외모는 시선을 모으기 때문에 신도들을 모을 때 좋은 "
"장점이 됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "94805456-0437-4863-8b62-185f90f38798"
msgid ""
"\"I've devoted my life to my travels, choosing to visit places like your "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}. Allow me to say, it's a place after my "
"own heart. A city growing over the remains of a bandit lord's lair is "
"exactly the sort of triumph of civilization Abadar prescribes. I hope my "
"skills as a priest will be of service to these lands and their denizens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 일생을 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국} 같은 장소를 여행하는 데에 쏟았습니다. 한데 이곳만큼 제 마음을 사로잡는 곳은 "
"없었지요. 폐허가 된 도적 소굴을 딛고 일어난 도시라니. 아바다르께서 말씀하신 문명의 승리가 제 눈앞에 있군요. 그분의 사제로서 이 땅의 "
"백성을 돕고자 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "e97898ae-33f3-4724-87cd-0e703bbcc25a"
msgid ""
"\"It's part of Abadar's philosophy. The rules of trade and exchange "
"developed for a reason — they help bring order to our world, and they "
"mustn't be broken without need. The opportunity to get what one desires for "
"no effort has a corrupting effect on souls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아바다르 철학의 일부분입니다. 무역 및 교환의 규칙이 발전한 것은 필연적이었죠. 그것들은 우리 세계에 질서를 가져오는 데 도움을 "
"주고, 이유 없이 멈춰 선 안됩니다. 노력 없이 원하는 것을 얻을 수 있는 기회는 영혼의 타락을 불러일으키지요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "7825c0af-4357-4f2f-9f59-9d5473773840"
msgid ""
"{n}Arsinoe bows ceremoniously. Despite the standoffish nature of the "
"gesture, it's easy to see that she's gladdened by your words.{/n} \"With a "
"ruler who follows {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}'s path, this "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} will certainly thrive. May our god help "
"you in your efforts!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르시노는 격식을 갖추어 인사합니다. 격식에 어울리는 딱딱함에도 불구하고, 그녀가 당신의 말이 기뻐하고 있다는 사실을 쉽게 알 수 "
"있습니다.{/n} \"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}의 길을 따르는 통치자와 함께 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}은 확실히 번성할 "
"것입니다. 우리 신께서 당신의 노력에 도움을 주시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Hint_DivineService_Answer_String
msgctxt "80a4627e-9bfa-4f3d-8766-fdcc236b13e5"
msgid "\"What services do you offer?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 서비스를 제공하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Arsinoe(DivineService)/Hint_DivineService_Cue_String
msgctxt "19b2bc32-d8a2-4311-8177-c92ea3147a23"
msgid ""
"\"I can sell you various divine spell scrolls. They're quite useful, even if "
"you don't have anyone in your party who can read them! While you're in this "
"settlement — or, indeed, any place with a cleric willing to help — you need "
"only open your bag and choose the scroll you wish to cast. I'll be happy to "
"read it for you. However, take care out there in the wilderness: a scroll is "
"useless without someone who can read it! To use a scroll on your journeys, "
"you'll need a spellcaster whose magical training covers such spells, or "
"someone skilled in magical devices.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여러 가지 신성 주문 두루마리를 팔고 있습니다. 그룹에 읽을 수 있는 자가 없어도 꽤 유용하실 겁니다! 이 정착지 안에서나 주변에 "
"당신을 기꺼이 도와줄 사제가 있는 곳이라면 가방을 열고 사용하고자 하는 두루마리를 선택만 해주시면 됩니다. 기꺼이 읽어 드리겠습니다! "
"하지만 밖에서는 조심하십시오. 읽을 수 있는 사람이 없으면 두루마리는 쓸모가 없습니다! 여행 중에 스크롤을 쓰려면 마법 시전자 또는 마법 "
"장비를 사용하는 데 익숙한 사람이 필요합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex1_1settler_String
msgctxt "4ce4b541-90d6-4b00-a4ea-856f08ef0538"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, Your Grace! We are... well... your new subjects. We're "
"selecting a site to build our house.\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, 나으리! 저희는... 음.. 나으리의 백성들입니다. 지금 집을 지을만한 부지를 찾고 있습니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex1_2settler_String
msgctxt "0c4ea2dc-cd69-4a8d-b697-51d8a9604806"
msgid ""
"\"It's wet near the lake and windy up here on the hill. A fine place to "
"throw garbage at your neighbors' heads though. Ouch!\""
msgstr ""
"\"호수 근처는 축축하고 언덕 위에는 바람이 심해 난리도 아닙니다요. 쓰레기를 던져서 이웃 머리에 맞추기에는 최적의 장소죠. 어휴!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex1_3settler_String
msgctxt "6812b532-9470-4967-a2c0-acf3c2188454"
msgid ""
"\"It's a good thing you got rid of those monsters and bandits, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"괴물이나 도적들이 없었으면 좋겠어요, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex2_StagFortGone2_String
msgctxt "c10c5762-d684-40fc-bedc-9b753870cd9e"
msgid ""
"\"Our workers did a fine job turning this bandit den into the heart of the "
"town.\""
msgstr "\"저희 일꾼들은 이 산적 소굴을 마을의 중심으로 바꾸는 훌륭한 일을 해냈지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex2_StagFortGone_String
msgctxt "bcdc66bb-09d0-4595-b1ca-22ad1e610a41"
msgid ""
"\"Do you recognize this place, Your Grace? This is where the Stag Lord's "
"fortress wall used to be. Not that it saved him in the end, hunh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나리, 이곳에 대해 알고 계십니까? 이곳은 한때 수사슴 군주의 요새가 있던 자리입니다. 결국 이 요새가 그를 지키지는 못했습니다만.."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex3_1kesten_String
msgctxt "9983efbc-3338-4e11-87ee-b688861a8c2f"
msgid ""
"\"The heart of every town is its main square. We plan to hold street "
"festivities and fairs here. Look — we already have our first vendor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 도시의 주거지는 광장입니다. 우리는 많은 길거리 행사와 축제를 개최할 생각입니다. 보십시오! 벌써 첫 상인이 생겼군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex3_2vendor_String
msgctxt "e5913cb2-3750-4ae4-beb6-abfc17782e8c"
msgid "\"Greetings, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, 나리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex3_3kesten_String
msgctxt "a4dc5dd1-f8a6-41db-a7dc-3d59419a5f3c"
msgid ""
"\"If you turn to the right from the square — you'll end up straight in our "
"tavern.\""
msgstr "\"광장에서 우회전하면 바로 선술집을 마주하게 되실 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex3_4kesten_String
msgctxt "fb96d281-f7d7-450d-bcc2-0b74c22ca00e"
msgid ""
"\"The tavern's ale is blessed by Cayden Cailean himself, I swear! — And the "
"lady who owns it is a gem.\""
msgstr "\"그 술집의 에일은 케이든 케일리엔의 축복을 받은게 분명합니다. 맹세하죠! 그리고 그 여주인은 우리의 보배입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex4_1guard_String
msgctxt "807cdc96-9451-4892-b417-821251da0551"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard our baron{mf||ess} is tall as a troll, has hair of pure gold "
"and can breath fire!\""
msgstr "\"우리 {mf||여}남작님은 트롤처럼 키가 크고 황금 머리카락이 자라고 불을 뿜는대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex4_2guard_String
msgctxt "cef0678f-b844-497c-bc58-01a8e864c5a4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's all nonsense. Well, except for the part about breathing fire. "
"All barons can breathe fire, trust me.\""
msgstr "\"오, 말도 안돼! 물론, 불을 내뿜는다는 얘기는 빼고. 모든 남작들은 불을 뿜을 수 있지. 날 믿으라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex4_3kesten_String
msgctxt "16bbe60d-0bcc-4efc-9b69-34e80a91a74c"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace, those are our guards. They keep order in the city — or keep "
"their mouths busy with gossip. Their commander is Captain Hyland. He must be "
"nearby.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님, 그들은 저희의 경비병들입니다. 그들은 도시의 질서를 지키거나.. 잡담거리로 떠들기 바쁘죠. 지휘관은 하일랜드 대장입니다. "
"분명 근처에 있을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex4_4guard_String
msgctxt "5560b37b-d586-4ced-ba72-2386d8a3a4b6"
msgid "\"W-welcome, Your Grace! Glad to serve you!\""
msgstr "\"어.. 어서 오십시오, 나리! 만나서 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex5_sight_String
msgctxt "100a52c6-0fa0-4176-9c57-adb871e6d729"
msgid ""
"\"Here's the observation platform. I hope one day your capital will grow "
"large enough that we won't be able to see to its full extent from this perch."
"\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 전망대입니다. 언젠가 이곳에서 전부 둘러볼 수 없을 만큼 수도가 커졌으면 하는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Ex6_palace_String
msgctxt "0f80c2bd-029c-4325-87fb-19fe0137e059"
msgid ""
"\"The building in front of us is your residence. That's where we'll head to "
"now.\""
msgstr "\"앞에 보이는 이 건물은 나리께서 머무르실 곳입니다. 이제 그곳에 가보도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Excursion1_String
msgctxt "5936ff66-a7a8-4998-b137-b1ced2bb49d9"
msgid ""
"\"The heart of every city is its main square. We plan to hold street "
"festivities and fairs here. Look — we already have our first vendor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 도시의 심장은 주 광장입니다. 우리는 많은 길거리 행사와 축제를 개최할 생각입니다. 보십시오! 벌써 첫 상인이 생겼군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Excursion2_String
msgctxt "a9482785-ecf1-4456-b54a-f738cdebbe28"
msgid ""
"\"If you turn to the right from the square — you'll end up straight in our "
"tavern. The food tastes good, and the lady who owns it is a gem.\""
msgstr "\"광장에서 우회전하면 바로 선술집을 마주하게 되실 겁니다. 음식은 훌륭하고요, 그리고 여주인은 우리의 보배입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Excursion3_String
msgctxt "faff24f4-6585-4fb0-b862-78bc40faebb4"
msgid ""
"\"To the left there's an observation platform — one can take in the whole "
"city from there. You might be curious to see it for yourself, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"여기 왼쪽에는 전망대가 있습니다. 도시가 한눈에 들어오는 곳이죠. 분명 직접 보고 싶으실 겁니다, 나리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/ExcursionCutscene/Excursion4_String
msgctxt "8c1bf5b7-a913-40c9-a5e4-ee5a9b948cef"
msgid ""
"\"And the building in front of us is your residence. That's where we'll head "
"to now.\""
msgstr "\"앞에 보이는 이 건물은 나리께서 머무르실 곳입니다. 이제 그곳에 가보도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "efd0b758-f101-43a3-a0f5-d84b9d621264"
msgid "\"I'm ready to look around the city! Lead the way!\""
msgstr "\"나는 도시를 둘러볼 준비가 되어있다. 안내하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "7a12d041-f5f0-4aca-8fe9-240c378fd02b"
msgid ""
"\"The main question is: where can I get a drink or three? It's time to toast "
"my victory!\""
msgstr "\"가장 중요한 질문이 있다. 어디에서 한 잔 마실 수 있지? 내 승리를 축하할 시간이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c33073a8-18a1-4313-80a3-e6e362fe82b1"
msgid "\"Where are my companions?\""
msgstr "\"내 동료들은 어디있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "27404d0e-c581-45ce-936a-f24497a33c03"
msgid "\"Are there any citizens I should know about?\""
msgstr "\"내가 알아야 할 시민이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "371dfdb5-e897-44bc-b798-d9b24478ea52"
msgid "\"What's the mood of the people here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 사람들의 분위기는 어떻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ad4945c8-60ec-4ac4-b6e8-5903c41ae582"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome, Your Grace!\" {n}Kesten salutes you. You can see he's a bit "
"anxious, and it seems he'd rehearsed his speech many times.{/n} \"Let me "
"once again congratulate you on your victory, and your new title. Lady "
"Jamandi transferred me here. I am at your disposal. I'm not one to bestow "
"honors... but I want you to know: I'm glad to serve you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어서 오십시오, 영주님!\" {n}케스턴이 당신에게 경의를 표합니다. 그는 약간 긴장되어 보이고, 연설 연습을 여러 번 한 "
"듯합니다.{/n} \"승리와 새로운 작위를 얻으신 것을 축하드립니다. 자만디님께서 이곳에서 당신을 모시라고 명령하셨습니다. 당신의 명을 "
"받들게 되어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "2c73e187-3b1d-4da3-937b-95993078bf53"
msgid ""
"\"I'm here to welcome you on behalf of your new capital's citizens. The Stag "
"Lord's former stronghold will soon be a thriving city. Word travels fast, "
"and the first settlers have already arrived, with new ones approaching as we "
"speak.\""
msgstr ""
"\"새 수도의 시민들을 대표해서 당신을 맞이하러 왔습니다. 수사슴 군주의 옛 요새는 이제 곧 번영하는 도시가 될 것입니다. 소문이 빠르게 "
"퍼져나가, 첫 정착민들이 이미 도착했고, 우리가 얘기하는 도중에도 새로운 정착민들이 몰려오고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "438b3b10-743c-479e-8a39-b9a2a66ea8e4"
msgid ""
"\"While you were visiting {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, much has been done here. "
"Your benefactors — the Aldori — invested a great deal of resources in "
"rebuilding the city. I stand ready to answer your questions and to show you "
"around the most important sites.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 방문하는 동안 많은 일이 여기에서 벌어졌습니다. 당신의 후원자인 알도리가 도시 재건에 많은 "
"자원을 투자했습니다. 이제 당신의 질문에 대해 대답해드리고 가장 중요한 장소들을 소개해 드릴 준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "39baec80-4edd-4f09-9570-c0ed962d5d17"
msgid ""
"\"While you were visiting {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, much has been done here. "
"Your benefactors — the {g|House Surtova}Surtovas{/g} — invested a great deal "
"of resources in rebuilding the city. I stand ready to answer your questions "
"and to show you around the most important sites.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 방문하는 동안 많은 일이 여기에서 벌어졌습니다. 당신의 후원자인 {g|House "
"Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}이 도시 재건에 많은 자원을 투자했습니다. 이제 당신의 질문에 대해 대답해드리고 가장 중요한 장소들을 "
"소개해 드릴 준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "fa0bf976-0d33-46ae-a712-42ca8e978dfd"
msgid ""
"\"While you were visiting {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, much has been done here. "
"Your ally from {g|House Lebeda}House Lebeda{/g} invested a great deal of "
"resources rebuilding the city. I stand ready to answer your questions and to "
"show you around the most important sites.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 방문하는 동안 많은 일이 여기에서 벌어졌습니다. 당신의 동맹인 {g|House Lebeda}"
"레베다 가문{/g}이 도시 재건에 많은 자원을 투자했습니다. 이제 당신의 질문에 대해 대답해드리고 가장 중요한 장소들을 소개해 드릴 "
"준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "4ffed5e4-685e-4290-86a1-db30a5907b8a"
msgid "\"Follow me, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"따라오십시오, 영주님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "fb27e2f6-7a6d-4ab1-bd3e-422d502073c0"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten hesitates a brief moment, then laughs.{/n} \"I'll make sure to "
"show you, the moment we enter the city. The tavern was the first business "
"that opened — building a city is thirsty work. And, erm, I beg your "
"forgiveness for my behavior during your reception. I drank a little too "
"much. It is a day for celebration!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 짧은 순간을 망설이고는 웃습니다.{/n} \"도시에 들어가면 꼭 보여드리겠습니다. 선술집은 도시에서 지어진 첫 건물입니다. "
"아시다시피 도시를 짓는 일은 목마른 일이었잖습니까. 음, 그리고 당신을 모시는 데에 사과드리겠습니다. 사실 이미 술을 좀 많이 "
"먹었습니다. 오늘은 경사스런 날이니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "25784c73-59c2-4c13-ad0e-bce08e168a8d"
msgid ""
"\"They are all somewhere around here, but I never kept an eye on who went "
"where exactly... Well, I assume Tristian is with Jhod, and you can always "
"find Linzi — just follow the noise and turmoil.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두 이 근처에 있겠지만, 정확히 누가 어디에 있는지는 잘 모르겠습니다. 트리스티안은 조드와 함께 있고 린지는 소음과 혼란스러운 곳을 "
"따라가면 찾을 수 있으리라 생각됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "81a7effb-c473-4709-8a07-81159a565712"
msgid ""
"\"Our old acquaintance Jhod is right here. {g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} clerics "
"normally don't like cities much, but he's eager to serve you. Also, the "
"emissary from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} is here, waiting for you in the throne "
"room. There's also this curious matter: an elf has paid us a visit. A blind "
"elf. {g|Desna}Desna{/g} only knows how he managed to get here. He seems a "
"peaceful, even pleasant fellow, though naturally a little odd, so I let him "
"stay a while. It's up to you to decide what to do with him now. That's about "
"it, I guess...\" {n}Kesten scratches his head.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"조드가 이곳으로 왔습니다. {g|Erastil} 에라스틸{/g} 성직자들은 일반적으로 도시를 별로 좋아하지 않지만 그는 당신을 "
"섬기기를 바라고 있습니다. 또한 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 특사가 알현실에서 당신을 기다리고 있습니다. 그리고 기이한 문제가 "
"있습니다. 엘프가 방문했습니다. 눈먼 엘프가 말입니다. {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}만이 그가 어떻게 여기까지 왔는지 알고 계시겠지요. "
"조금 이상해 보이긴 하지만, 평화롭고, 심지어 유쾌한 사람으로 보여서 잠시 그를 머물게 했습니다. 이제 그를 어떻게 할지는 당신의 "
"선택입니다. 아마 지금은 이게 다인 것 같군요.\" {n}케스턴이 그의 머리를 긁습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0878cdf3-9612-4d27-88ad-2e8342b1cdd6"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit, I've never seen anything like that my whole life. A city — a "
"whole barony, born right in front of our eyes. The people sense the moment, "
"and today we're feeling proud. As a rule, I'm not too cheerful or chatty... "
"I'd normally feel out of place among all the rejoicing, but today is just "
"one of those days!\""
msgstr ""
"\"평생 이런 것을 본 적이 없다는 것을 인정할 수 밖에 없겠습니다. 우리의 눈앞에서 영지 전체가 만들어지는 모습을 말입니다. 사람들은 "
"이 순간을 느끼고, 오늘 우리는 자부심을 느낍니다. 보통 저는 밝거나 수다스러운 성격은 아니지만... 오늘은 무척이나 기쁜 날입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KestenEntranceDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9ec8b32a-b929-4c69-84ae-a11181252874"
msgid ""
"\"They scattered around, each finding their own place to stay. I guess "
"Tristian is with Jhod somewhere.\""
msgstr "\"각자 흩어져서 머물 곳을 찾아다녔습니다. 트리스티안은 조드와 함꼐 있는 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "72ce0fb2-215b-4b75-9574-3e25ed8c91ea"
msgid ""
"\"So now we've reached the main chambers. This is the throne room, where "
"you'll hold court and receive visitors. Let me draw your attention to this "
"large map, depicting your barony and its surroundings. We'll mark all the "
"important scout reports, and other news worthy of Your Grace's attention.\" "
"{n}Having finished his speech, Kesten tucks his thumbs under his belt and "
"stands quietly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"드디어 본관에 이르렀군요. 이곳은 알현실입니다. 이곳에서 법정을 열거나, 방문객을 맞이하게 되실 겁니다. 이 큰 지도에 남작령과 그 "
"인근에 영주님께서 주목하실만한 것들을 그려두겠습니다. 중요한 정찰 보고서나 그 외에 보실만한 소식들 말입니다.\" {n}말을 끝낸 "
"케스턴은 허리띠에 엄지손가락을 걸친 채 조용히 서있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Kassil
msgctxt "e09b5a63-0cb3-420e-8058-6fe27092df9a"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness},\" {n}Kassil, Lady "
"Jamandi's ward, gives a polite bow.{/n} \"It was a pleasure to {d|c11 "
"Kassil}meet{/d} you at the {g|Restov}Restov{/g} reception. On behalf of your "
"allies and benefactors, the Aldori {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}, I'd like to "
"offer you some advice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}자만디의 양자 카실이 예의 바르게 인사합니다.{/n} \" "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 연회장에서 당신을 뵙게되어 {d|c11 Kassil}영광이었습니다{/d}. 당신의 동맹국이자 후원자 "
"알도리 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}를 대표하여 당신께 조언을 드리고 싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Shandra
msgctxt "f7a5cd22-bfc9-4691-9066-ec227e867bfc"
msgid ""
"\"It is good to see you, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\" {n}"
"Shandra Mervey, the {d|c11 Shandra}emissary{/d} of Natala Surtova, greets "
"you with a brief bow.{/n} \"Let's dispense with the formalities and get "
"straight to business. As emissary of the royal {g|House Surtova}House "
"Surtova{/g}, I am here to offer you advice — and make sure you don't do "
"anything reckless. I hope my experience in diplomacy and policy will be of "
"some aid, as you make your first steps as a ruler of the barony.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만나서 반갑습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}나탈라 서토바의 {d|c11 Shandra}특사{/d} 샨드라 머비가 "
"짧은 인사와 함께 당신을 환영합니다.{/n} \"공식 절차는 생략하고 바로 본론으로 들어가시죠. 저는 {g|House Surtova}"
"서토바 가문{/g}의 특사로서 당신에게 조언을 드리러 왔습니다. 무모한 짓을 하지 않으시게끔 말입니다. 제 외교와 정치적 경험들이 당신의 "
"통치자로서의 첫걸음에 도움이 되었으면 좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Lander
msgctxt "1b82a317-6c15-4a3c-af86-851fad0fa047"
msgid ""
"\"Hello, my dear friend!\" {n}Lander {g|House Lebeda}Lebeda{/g}, the young "
"noble from Brevoy who you've {d|c11 Lander}chosen{/d} as an emissary, greets "
"you with a distracted nod.{/n} \"I am glad to see you in good health. I "
"don't see how you remain so steady in these circumstances.\" {n}He makes a "
"wide gesture with his hand, obviously meaning something larger than your "
"throne room.{/n} \"But in truth I shouldn't worry. A little effort — and "
"this barony will become a rich and prosperous land, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하신가, 친애하는 친구여!\" {n}당신이 {d|c11 Lander}선택한{/d} 특사인 브레보이의 젊은 귀족 랜더 {g|"
"House Lebeda}레베다{/g}는 산만하게 고개를 끄덕이며 인사합니다.{/n} \"건강한 너를 보게 되어 기쁘군. 이런 상황에서 "
"어떻게 그렇게 한결같은지 모르겠어.\" {n}그는 손으로 넓은 몸짓을 하는데 알현실의 일 보다 큰 일일 것이라고 생각하는 것 "
"같습니다.{/n} \"그러나 나는 걱정하지 않아. 조금만 노력하면 이 남작령은 부유하고 풍요로운 땅이 될 거야. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Kassil
msgctxt "50ad3788-82c9-4390-bd45-a7e2c17c2d89"
msgid ""
"\"You can solve most of your barony's problems by granting appointments to "
"the right people — responsible people. But certain state business will "
"demand your personal attention, as will the visits of especially important "
"guests. Reports of such outstanding events will be marked on your map. You "
"can always check it while considering your plans.\""
msgstr ""
"\"책임감 있는 사람들을 적절하게 임명하면 대부분의 귀찮은 문제를 해결할 수 있습니다. 하지만 특히 중요 인물의 방문과 마찬가지로 특정 "
"지역의 일은 관심을 가지고 보셔야 할 겁니다. 그러한 이벤트는 지도에 표시됩니다. 계획을 고려하면서 언제든지 확인할 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Kassil
msgctxt "ff863b7f-bb53-495c-bc99-3cd602fed8db"
msgid ""
"\"According to the ancient traditions of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} and most of "
"the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, rulers address affairs of state "
"and receive visitors at the beginning of the month. My advice to you is to "
"maintain this tradition, and regularly visit your capital when needed. The "
"first thing you should do as a ruler is assign loyal people to all the "
"important positions in your barony.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}와 대부분의 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 고대 전통에 따르면 월초에 통치자는 "
"국사를 다루며 방문객을 맞이하라고 했습니다. 정기적으로 수도를 방문하시라는 조언이지요. 통치자로서 해야 할 첫 번째 일은 충성스러운 "
"사람들을 요직에 배치하는 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Lander
msgctxt "342d45a1-393f-4c6f-b435-29cb96822b60"
msgid ""
"\"Since ruling seems to be a new thing for you, I'll put the matter simply. "
"There are two kinds of issues that the {mf|baron|baroness} must address: "
"boring ones and amusing ones. You have servants and advisors to handle all "
"the boring problems, and you can give them orders from wherever it pleases "
"you. But sometimes an urgent matter will arise: a dragon attack, or the "
"visit of some noble dignitary like myself. Events like these demand the "
"{mf|baron's|baroness's} personal presence in the capital. We'll mark these "
"events on the map, too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"통치는 네게 처음 해보는 일인 듯하니, 간단히 설명해 주지. 통치자가 관심을 기울여야 이슈는 두 가지, 지루한 문제와 재미있는 문제가 "
"있어. 다행인 건 모든 지루한 문제를 다뤄줄 보좌관들이 있어서 어디서든지 명령을 내릴 수 있다는 거지. 하지만 종종 시급한 일도 생길 "
"거야. 드래곤의 공격이라든지, 나 같은 귀족 고위 관리가 방문한다든지. 이러한 사건들은 무조건 {mf|남작|여남작}이 수도로 올 것을 필요로 해. 이런 "
"일들은 지도에 표시해 줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Lander
msgctxt "e5a39f25-f047-4dcf-9624-4d80af13cfe2"
msgid ""
"\"According to ancient tradition of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} and most of the {g|"
"River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, rulers in these parts find it convenient "
"to receive visitors and chop off heads at the beginning of each month. I "
"know well that traditions can be tedius, but nevertheless I advise you to "
"visit the capital on important days. But here's the main thing: you should "
"start choosing people to fill the key positions right away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}와 대부분의 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 고대의 전통에 따르면 통치자는 "
"월초에 방문객을 맞이하고 처형을 시키라고 하더군. 이 전통이 지루하다는 것을 알고 있겠지만 그럼에도 불구하고 중요한 날에는 수도를 "
"방문해야 해. 그래도 결국 중요한 것은 이제 핵심 요직을 채울 사람을 골라야 한다는 거지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Shandra
msgctxt "0756f130-468a-4e74-9629-f04b64e188e2"
msgid ""
"\"The main thing you should know is that the {mf|baron|baroness} can solve "
"some of the problems by giving orders to their representatives and advisors. "
"But there are some things you simply can't delegate. Issues of special "
"import, such as complicated court hearings or serious threats to security, "
"will demand your personal presence at the capital. Information about these "
"kinds of events will always appear on the map.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 알아야 할 중요한 것은 {mf|남작|여남작}이 대리인이나 보좌관에게 명령을 내려 문제를 해결할 수 있다는 것입니다. 그러나 "
"단순히 위임할 수 없는 것들도 있지요. 복잡한 공청회나 심각한 보안 위협과 같은 특히 중요한 문제들은 수도에서 당신의 개인적인 알현을 "
"요구할 겁니다. 이러한 종류의 이벤트에 대한 정보는 항상 지도에 표시될 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Shandra
msgctxt "11de7a11-eb97-40e1-b10a-a133c02bbf35"
msgid ""
"\"Remember that you should visit the capital personally at the beginning of "
"each month. By tradition of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} and most of the {g|River "
"Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, it is then that rulers address the day's most "
"important issues and receive visitors. Today you should choose candidates "
"for the highest positions in the barony. It is not my place to offer my own "
"thoughts in this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"매월 초 직접 수도를 방문해야 한다는 것을 기억하십시오. {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}와 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 "
"왕국들{/g} 대부분이 따르는 전통에 의해, 통치자들이 가장 중요한 쟁점을 다루고 방문객을 받는 시기입니다. 오늘 당신은 남작령의 요직을 "
"맡을 후보를 선택하셔야 합니다. 이 부분에서는 제가 개입하지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Kassil
msgctxt "58acaf58-1a6c-409b-be65-cbac7352177b"
msgid ""
"\"Your clerics — Jhod and Tristian — were the first to seek an audience. I "
"won't distract you further, and I'll leave you to consider. Once again, my "
"congratulations. May your rule be long and prosperous!\""
msgstr ""
"\"성직자 조드와 트리스티안이 처음으로 당신께 알현을 요청하였습니다. 당신의 판단을 흐리지 않도록, 저는 잠시 물러서 있겠습니다. 그리고 "
"다시 한번 축하드립니다! 당신의 통치가 길어지고 번영하기를 빌겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Shandra
msgctxt "5820449f-f51f-4726-a2ca-4ddd6226921f"
msgid ""
"\"Your clerics — Jhod and Tristian — were the first to ask for an audience. "
"I shall leave you to your capable judgment. Be wise, and your rule shall be "
"long and fruitful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"성직자 조드와 트리스티안이 당신에게 처음으로 알현을 요청하였습니다. 당신의 유능한 판단에 맡기겠습니다. 당신이 지혜로울수록, 당신의 "
"통치는 길고 가치 있을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/BaronyWelcome/KingdomMechanicsTalk/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Lander
msgctxt "ef544834-fc57-46f2-b8bb-8ab7d32802a6"
msgid ""
"\"Your clerics — Jhod and Tristian — were the first to beg for an audience. "
"I'll leave you to your thoughts for now. I'm sure you'll make wise decisions "
"— of that, I have no doubt.\""
msgstr ""
"\"성직자 조드와 트리스티안이 네게 첫 알현을 요청했어. 네 판단에 맡기도록 하지. 네가 현명한 판단을 내릴 것을 믿어 의심치 않으니까."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d65d827f-6ef9-4dc1-94ac-3d0f3f3e1488"
msgid "\"How do you like living in the capital?\""
msgstr "\"수도에 사는 것은 살 만한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3d4c4f55-9980-436f-bf04-711ccc994eed"
msgid ""
"\"What of your experiments? Have you abandoned your scientific studies?\""
msgstr "\"자네 실험은 어찌되는가? 자네의 과학적 연구들을 포기했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b7b9ce9c-ab81-4e46-8af0-dfc9bfb24b64"
msgid "\"Do you like your current position?\""
msgstr "\"현재 위치가 마음에 드나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3151a80d-fe5f-462e-a04d-a83489459ae0"
msgid ""
"\"I bet it feels good to crawl out of nowhere and find yourself amidst "
"civilized people.\""
msgstr "\"어디든 돌아다니면서 문명화된 사람들과 만난다면 기분이 좋을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "12b25c67-cc01-4601-8c2b-eaecabef7276"
msgid "\"Perhaps you'd like to take another position?\""
msgstr "\"아마 다른 직책을 하고 싶나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "b10cfe23-86c1-44c2-a6ea-558700ca0fdd"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "7e433e26-c98f-4ea9-82dd-a49f7993917c"
msgid "\"How well are you handling your responsibilities?\""
msgstr "\"맡긴 일들은 얼마나 잘 처리하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e57ca477-2c83-430d-bc55-2017a2dc8199"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew has changed a great deal since you last saw him. Now he wears "
"a new fancy jacket with shiny buttons, and boots made of soft leather. His "
"moustache and sideburns are waxed and perfectly trimmed.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막으로 그를 본 이후 바솔로뮤는 많은 변화를 겪었습니다. 이제 그는 반짝이는 버튼이 달린 멋진 재킷과 부드러운 가죽으로 만든 "
"장화를 입습니다. 그의 콧수염과 구레나룻이 왁스 칠되어 완벽하게 정돈되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "418eb428-ca10-43b8-94b1-8365cb4bdde1"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew gives you a low bow.{/n} \"Greetings, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! To what do I owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 당신에게 가볍게 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 무슨 일로 이렇게 오셨습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "9e97ebee-6cc9-4a18-b383-c495d68808f7"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! I'm glad you've found time to "
"honor me with your attention. How may I serve you?\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저를 찾아주어 기쁩니다. 제가 도울 일이라도 있나요? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "000efeba-23ac-4540-b052-6569aa4f5a61"
msgid ""
"{n}An expression of disgust briefly appears on Bartholomew's face.{/n} \"Not "
"all of the people I deal with are pleasant and polite. But I'm not "
"complaining, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤의 얼굴에는 혐오감이 잠깐 나타납니다.{/n} \"제가 만나야 할 사람들이 모두 즐겁고 예절 바른 것은 아니지만 불평하지 "
"않겠습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "00789460-f261-4eb5-b377-41e332b34bfe"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew squints his eyes dreamily.{/n} \"You wish to know if I like "
"to spend my days counting the treasures of your country, and doing my best "
"to multiply them? I most certainly do, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 몽상하듯 눈을 가늘게 뜹니다.{/n} \"제가 당신의 나라의 국고를 계수하며 그걸 열심히 불리기는데 시간을 쏟는 걸 "
"좋아할지 알고 싶으셨습니까? 저는 아주 틀림없이 그렇습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "64efe510-50d1-4ef2-9f9b-9a3037c6ae01"
msgid ""
"\"Everything is excellent, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Behind "
"these thick walls — and far from the dirt, bad weather and bandits, I can "
"finally stop worrying about the traps around my house and dedicate myself to "
"something truly important — honing my mind, solving problems of state for "
"the sake of your prosperity!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것이 훌륭합니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 이 두꺼운 방벽 뒤에서 흙먼지가 날리고 나쁜 날씨와 도적들에 시달리는 "
"일로부터 멀리 떠나 저는 드디어 집 주변의 함정 걱정을 멈추고 당신의 번영을 위해 국가적 문제를 해결하는 일에 제 마음을 갈고 닦으며 "
"헌신하게 되었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "59988038-a28b-411e-9475-bfb66f394b8c"
msgid ""
"\"I must say, it won't be an easy task for your lands to achieve a good "
"reputation among your neighbors. It will take some time before the stench of "
"banditry is washed from the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. But I'm sure "
"your wisdom and insight will lead us overcome these problems in the near "
"future!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 이야기를 꼭 드려야 겠군요. 이웃 나라들 사이에서 좋은 평판을 얻는 것이 쉬운 일이 아닙니다. {g|Stolen Lands}"
"도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 도적들의 악취가 씻기기까지는 시간이 걸릴 겁니다. 그러나 저는 당신의 지혜와 통찰력이 가까운 미래에 이러한 "
"문제들을 극복하도록 우리를 이끌 것이라고 확신합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "15a19952-57c8-42b0-a506-60874172b659"
msgid ""
"\"Only temporarily, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. I couldn't "
"reject the offer to serve such an important person as yourself, but it would "
"have been unwise to drag my entire laboratory to the capital. My tools and "
"instruments shall remain hidden in boxes for a while, until such time as I "
"may take leave my duties here and return to my research.\""
msgstr ""
"\"단지 일시적일 것일 뿐입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 당신과 같은 중요한 사람에게 봉사하라는 제안을 거절할 수 "
"없었습니다. 하지만 제 실험실 전체를 수도로 끌고오는 것은 현명한 일이 아니었을 겁니다. 제 의무를 마치고 연구로 돌아갈 때까지, 제 "
"실험 도구들은 상자 안에 넣어 둘 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "6a3cd18f-98da-4fc3-b90c-21bc0e723015"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew frowns for a moment.{/n} \"Perhaps you're right, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}... but, frankly speaking, sometimes I "
"miss my hut and the quietness that surrounded it. I suppose deep inside I "
"remain a regular scholar, who prefers scientific research to high society. I "
"only beg you not to take this confession for a complaint! I remain loyal to "
"you and to my vow to serve your country.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 잠시 찡그립니다.{/n} \"아마 당신 말씀이 맞을 겁니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 솔직히 말하자면 때로는 "
"제 오두막과 그 주위의 조용했던 때가 그립네요. 저의 깊숙한 곳에서는 사회를 위한 과학적 연구를 하는 평범한 학자의 모습이 남아있는 것 "
"같습니다. 이 고백을 불평으로 받아들이진 말았으면 합니다! 당신과 당신의 나라에 봉사하겠다는 저의 맹세는 충실하게 남아있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "1bfb39fe-d2f6-47fd-9f42-dda0feee09ef"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit, a great many have shown interest in your treasure chests. "
"Your other advisors come to the treasury time and again — always with some "
"issue or other. Soldier salaries, palace candles... But don't you worry "
"about all that — without my knowledge and permission, not a single coin "
"leaves the treasury.\" {n}Bartholomew rubs his palms together.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"인정하지 않을 수 없겠지요. 많은 사람들이 당신의 보물 창고에 관심을 보입니다. 당신의 다른 보좌관은 언제든지 문제들을 들고 당신의 "
"금고로 찾아올 겁니다. 병사의 급여, 궁전에 쓸 양초... 하지만 이런 것들은 걱정하지 마십시오. 제가 모르게 허락없이는 동전 한닢도 "
"금고에서 빠져나가지 못할 겁니다.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 손바닥을 문지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "81bfaede-ceee-4148-b048-d183ebe30cf4"
msgid ""
"\"To be sincere, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, diplomacy has "
"always fascinated me. Perhaps you might consider whether my talents would be "
"more useful to you in this sphere?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 솔직히 말씀드리면, 외교는 항상 저를 매료시켰지요. 아마 제 재능이 이 영역에서 당신께 더욱 "
"유용할 수 있을지 고려해 보시지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "a789720e-ab33-4690-b6c6-ee4cf1f3401c"
msgid ""
"\"I excel in money matters… Which is to say, I can make money multiply "
"rather than disappear. So I suppose I might serve well as a treasurer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 돈 문제에 능하답니다. 말하자면 저는 돈을 써버리기 보다는 불릴 수 있습니다. 그래서 저는 재무관으로 잘 봉사할 수 있다고 "
"생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Bartolomew/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "dccecfc6-2ed1-49f4-9e05-19aadf38de7c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, I'm perfectly content with "
"my lot.\""
msgstr "\"오. 아니요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 제 운명에 완전히 만족합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f2fd0c7d-445c-41d0-9bec-b83c3945a2d8"
msgid "\"Who gave you the authority to beat and intimidate my subjects?!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 내 백성을 때리고 위협할 권한을 준 게 누구지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7ceff7d6-ed93-410b-9228-7942d172e2e5"
msgid ""
"\"You may continue your investigation, but use humane methods while you do.\""
msgstr "\"조사를 계속할 수는 있지만 자비로운 방법을 사용해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "da3b8113-277b-426c-97c8-2b829ad157c2"
msgid "\"Get out of my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}!\""
msgstr "\"내 왕국에서 나가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "e4b91673-b6eb-464e-b54a-0ac7755c610b"
msgid "\"Guards! Seize her!\""
msgstr "\"경비원! 그녀를 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c784aff2-1f35-4dfa-a923-f7d6f9defdcc"
msgid ""
"\"It seems {d|Linxia}I was right{/d} in my suspicions. The rule of law in "
"these lands is just a bunch of empty words, worth no more than a wooden "
"coin. It's not surprising, seeing their ruler's weak will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{d|린시아}내 의혹이 옳았다.{/d} 이 땅에서 법은 마치 나무로 된 동전처럼 가치가 없듯이 공허한 말이다. 통치자의 약한 의지를 "
"보면 사실 놀라운 일도 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "20d384f4-80ef-4300-a58c-927cecbae1aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Linxia gives you a scoffing half-smile.{/n} \"Certainly not you. You "
"don't have the guts for that. You'd prefer just sitting on your throne and "
"benevolently looking on, while your so-called 'subjects' set your fortress "
"on fire.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린시아는 콧방귀를 끼며 입꼬리를 올립니다.{/n} \"너는 분명히 아니다. 너는 그럴 배짱이 없다. 소위 너의 '백성'들이 너의 "
"요새를 불태우는 순간에 너는 그저 왕좌에 앉아 자애롭게 바라볼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "f52ad858-6a58-4703-aa58-f783668bb54b"
msgid ""
"{n}If a gaze could incinerate, there would be a handful of smoldering ash "
"right where you stand.{/n} \"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}! We're leaving! "
"We'll continue our investigation somewhere else!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}눈빛으로 무언가를 태울 수 있다면 당신이 서있는 곳에서 약간의 연기가 올라갔을 것입니다.{/n} \"{g|Hellknights} 헬 "
"나이츠{/g}! 철수하라! 우리는 다른 곳에서 조사를 계속할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0c776446-210f-44bd-9dcb-aa7b99a75a27"
msgid ""
"{n}Linxia's face remains emotionless, but her voice shakes with barely "
"hidden contempt.{/n} \"Thank you, but I must refuse. I despise weak "
"authorities. It's a blessing that such rulers rarely cling to the throne for "
"very long.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린시아의 얼굴은 감정이 없지만 그녀의 목소리는 간신히 숨겨진 경멸로 흔들립니다.{/n} 고맙다. 하지만 거절해야겠다. 나는 약한 "
"왕은 경멸한다. 그러한 통치자들이 오랫동안 왕좌에 머물지 못하는 것이 축복이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "71975727-b61e-4e6d-a718-840589283ea7"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we'll leave, don't you worry about that. I knew from the very "
"beginning that you and the Order follow different paths. Weak rulers don't "
"deserve our attention. But no matter. They generally don't live long enough "
"to be taken seriously.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 떠날 거다. 걱정 말아라. 나는 처음부터 너와 '그 명령'이 다른 길을 따른다는 것을 알았다. 약한 통치자들은 우리의 주의를 "
"끌만한 가치가 없다. 그러나 상관 없다. 그들이 심각하게 받아들여질 만큼 오래 살지는 않다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/AngryLinxiaArrives/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "1cb019c4-e519-481f-b7fb-af91996bf89d"
msgid ""
"\"Don't get in the way of the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the Rack{/g}, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. This is my final warning.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}의 길을 방해하지 마라. {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. 이것은 나의 마지막 "
"경고이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/CitizenInvestigation_1_String
msgctxt "e2a15b00-e589-4310-bef6-c8fa4ad5d610"
msgid "\"I don't know! I don't know anything!\""
msgstr "\"나는 모른다! 나는 아무것도 모른다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/CitizenInvestigation_2_String
msgctxt "18451400-40b1-4407-85c5-c7680609abf0"
msgid "\"Help! Anyone! — They'll kill me!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 누구든지! 그들은 나를 죽일 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/CitizenInvestigation_3_String
msgctxt "711908df-997a-455e-b244-34ac193c4681"
msgid "\"Don't beat me again! I can't take it any more!\""
msgstr "\"때리지 마! 더 이상 참을 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/HellknightInvestigation_1_String
msgctxt "c533a24a-7681-4a64-9edb-d1cbef617e1c"
msgid "\"Where is Darven now? Speak!\""
msgstr "\"지금 다르벤은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/HellknightInvestigation_2_String
msgctxt "8b8d07e4-4949-4d2b-883b-fe2553037dfa"
msgid "\"Speak, or I'll flay you!\""
msgstr "\"말하지 않으면 가죽을 산 채로 벗겨주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/HellknightInvestigation_3_String
msgctxt "51bed009-5bd0-4c41-8b84-ab5a25f020f0"
msgid "\"Where is Darven? Where did he go? What did he say to you?\""
msgstr "\"다르벤은 어디 있지? 그는 어디로 갔어? 그가 너에게 뭐라고 말했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/Hellknight_1_String
msgctxt "c5a96ddf-cd98-40bc-8c14-5dcb55c4d0cc"
msgid "\"Everything is under control. There's nothing to worry about.\""
msgstr "\"모든 것이 통제 하에 있다. 걱정할 것 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/Hellknight_2_String
msgctxt "bf132f13-2215-481b-baa4-08d4ccbda777"
msgid ""
"\"We can handle the investigation. You can count on us, {mf|Your Grace|Your "
"Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 조사를 맡겠다. 우리를 믿어라. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/Barks/Hellknight_3_String
msgctxt "4357431e-6323-46af-921d-e6e0406a63b8"
msgid "\"No one will be left unpunished.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 처벌받지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b937ac84-d8ea-4d89-a30e-bb224627eeb9"
msgid "\"Darven? The rebellious murderer Linxia is searching for?\""
msgstr "\"다르벤? 린시아가 찾고 있던 그 반역자에 살인자?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7ace19ce-ad86-45c7-a818-3ebad704a19d"
msgid "\"So, what do you want, Darven?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 원하는 게 뭐야? 다르벤?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3c1d5b40-c2c2-4e9e-a4f6-f78dd561d559"
msgid "\"Guards! Seize this half-elf!\""
msgstr "\"경비원! 이 하프엘프를 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6e38807a-72c6-46c0-a3d4-e81846351e56"
msgid "\"Tell me your story.\""
msgstr "\"네 이야기를 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "5c546618-e74c-4345-b694-efcab83ee34e"
msgid "\"So what did this Chelish noble do to make you so angry?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 첼리악스 귀족이 어떻게 너를 화나게 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b17c1873-db1e-4198-977e-f56851229516"
msgid "\"What do you want from me, Darven?\""
msgstr "\"나한테 원하는게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "178631c1-5332-415c-9910-0cd22b1be077"
msgid "\"You aren't convincing me.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나를 납득시키지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "b4abedf0-ddfd-45b5-aa42-3c94a11bbc69"
msgid "\"You figured you'll buy me?\""
msgstr "\"날 매수할 수 있을 줄 알았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "c98e5271-afb4-4071-9f98-1bf56d5b749c"
msgid "\"I have no wish to fight with Linxia.\""
msgstr "\"나는 린시아와 싸우고 싶지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dd13b9a3-4429-4120-8027-f952b49c0818"
msgid "Lied to Darven about helping him."
msgstr "다르벤에게 도와주겠다고 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "7fe0fa03-71c7-46a1-bd96-cdddc6cf476d"
msgid "[Lie] \"Deal. I'll help you.\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"좋아. 너를 도울거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "707c90cb-802c-4d99-b207-a381727bdf34"
msgid "Agreed to help Darven."
msgstr "다르벤을 돕기로 동의했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "10870181-dcbe-4c4b-94f1-2c26b3e860af"
msgid "\"Deal. I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너를 도울거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2fbe5739-fa4a-4413-a4a9-fc151379e56c"
msgid "Tried to stay out of the conflict between Darven and Linxia."
msgstr "다르벤과 린샤 사이의 갈등에서 벗어나려고 노력했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "645ac734-e092-4410-bf4f-c5cdaf3d1d36"
msgid ""
"\"I won't take sides — neither yours, nor hers. You can figure this out "
"among yourselves.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 편도 그녀의 편도 아니다. 너희 스스로 해결해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5b335eb5-0438-4150-b05a-68833f0bca21"
msgid "Accused Darven of being a criminal and attacked him."
msgstr "다르벤을 범인이라고 비난하고 그를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "447f19d4-0d68-42c6-bc8c-29d742d25941"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're a criminal. You belong on the gallows!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 범죄자이다. 교수대로 가야할 녀석이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "6f4dfa90-8c24-4c8c-b389-f0a30def8ad8"
msgid "\"So, how much do I cost, by your estimations?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 얼마까지 알아보고 오셨나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "a5c67105-360d-411d-9f33-bb9f8bd2076f"
msgid "\"Absolutely!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "964d0798-416f-4e27-a74a-7b5819b08e82"
msgid "\"Make it 15000. Then we'll talk.\""
msgstr "\"15000으로 하자. 그러면 이야기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "25053613-116c-46e1-867a-f72a30a2ad47"
msgid "\"20000. I won't take any less than that.\""
msgstr "\"20000. 나는 그 이하는 받지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8a1df00b-2b95-451d-b496-b2d0f3b270e0"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g} are not the most courteous guests, are "
"they? And the hellknights from the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the Rack{/g}"
" are the vilest of them all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}는 정중한 손님은 아니지, 안그래? 그리고 {g|Order of the Rack}형벌 "
"기사단{/g}의 헬나이트는 그들 중에서도 가장 악질이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ec425a6d-bd3f-4b94-9fe1-9ced40bc40ed"
msgid ""
"{n}A tanned-skin half-elf with green eyes looks at you respectfully, but "
"with a smile on his face.{/n} \"My name is Darven.\""
msgstr "{n}녹색 눈을 가진 그을린 피부의 하프엘프는 당신을 정중하게 바라보지만 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"내 이름은 다르벤이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "3c65523f-98c5-41ec-8a7c-89a586dfe3c9"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I'm a rebel, a murderer, a pirate, a renegade, a smuggler — and I "
"have lots of other scary titles.\" {n}The half-elf laughs lightly, but "
"watching you closely at the same time.{/n} \"If you listen to Linxia, I'm "
"evil incarnate, baby-eater — your worst nightmare came true. If the end of "
"times should ever come, it will be because of me, and me alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래 ,나는 반역자, 살인자, 해적, 배신자, 밀수꾼이지. 그리고 다른 많은 무서운 칭호도 가지고 있어.\" {n}하프엘프는 가볍게 "
"웃지만 동시에 당신을 가까이서 지켜봅니다.{/n} \"린샤의 말만 들으면 나는 악의 화신이자 아기를 먹는 사람이겠지. 그 악독한 인간이 "
"바로 나야. 언젠가 세상의 종말이 온다면 그것도 나때문이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "378ece00-522b-42c0-9ab4-1ddad692e84f"
msgid ""
"\"First of all — I should explain myself.\" {n}You hear the note of guilt in "
"the half-elf's voice.{/n} \"After all, I was the reason this crazy zealot "
"stormed upon your lands. She won't stop until she turns every house in the "
"neighborhood upside down, hoping to find my hat, my sock, or a flea that had "
"my passing acquaintance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우선 나를 소개하지.\" {n}하프엘프의 목소리에 죄책감이 들립니다.{/n} \"결국 너의 땅에 몰려든 미친 광신도들은 나 때문이다. "
"그녀는 모든 집을 샅샅히 뒤져서라도 내 모자, 양말, 내 옆사람에게 옮은 내 몸의 벼룩이라도 찾을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "904766ce-a095-4019-854a-71e2617ee7d0"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf takes a step back, obviously frightened.{/n} \"Hold on, I "
"beg you. Let me at least make a statement in my defense. I assure you — you "
"time will not be wasted.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프엘프는 한발 뒤로 물러났는데 분명히 두려워 보입니다.{/n} \"잠깐만. 너에게 간청한다. 적어도 나를 변호하도록 해줘. 나는 "
"너의 시간을 낭비하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "4915b5f1-c076-4464-bf84-8a1c870c8909"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven utters a sad sigh.{/n} \"Of course, all of Linxia's accusations "
"are false. That is to say, they are not entirely true. It's true I am "
"involved in this story, but my sins are not so great as they are thought to "
"be.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤은 슬픈 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"당연히 린시아의 모든 비난은 거짓말이야. 그것들은 전혀 사실이 아니지. 내가 이 사건에 "
"연루되어있는 것은 사실이지만 나의 죄는 생각보다 그렇게 심각하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0014_Text_String
msgctxt "dc813287-4a59-4cf3-9e1a-c43dd22e4893"
msgid ""
"\"It's so long, I don't even know where to begin.\" {n}Darven grins.{/n} "
"\"Although, I guess, you're only interested in the things I've been accused "
"of. I... I did, in fact, kill a {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} noble, and I "
"participated in a rebellion. But all of this happened by total accident!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 길어 어디서부터 시작해야 할지조차 모르겠군.\" {n}다르벤이 웃습니다.{/n} \"분명 너는 내가 받은 혐의에 관심이 "
"있겠지... 사실 내가 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g} 의 귀족 한 명을 죽인 건 맞아. 반란에도 참여했어. 그러나 이 모든 일은 "
"사고로 일어났을 뿐이야!. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0015_Text_String
msgctxt "4516097a-145a-4fe7-964e-c8e865877d1d"
msgid ""
"\"I was captain of a ship that sailed the {g|Inner Sea}Inner Sea{/g}. We "
"traded with those who were stronger than us, and raided those who were "
"weaker. Just regular life for a man of my profession. One day we stopped at "
"one of the {g|Cheliax}Cheliax{/g} ports and... that's when it all started.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Inner Sea} 내해{/g}를 항해했던 배의 선장이었다. 우리는 강자와 거래를 하고 약자를 습격했지. 내 직업에 충실한 "
"삶이었어. 어느 날 우리는 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g}의 항구에 정박했고... 그것이 모든 일의 시작이었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0016_Text_String
msgctxt "93c8c34a-8ff8-462e-914a-d700565fba9e"
msgid ""
"\"I caught sight of a certain {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} noble, who for a long "
"time been number one on my \"kill-on-sight\" list. So I challenged him to a "
"duel, and he was too stupid to refuse. I dispatched him, only then to learn "
"that he was a distant relative of Cheliax's crown prince, and besides that, "
"the lord of the surrounding lands. And of course, no one in the area was at "
"all fond of him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 한 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g}의 귀족을 찾아냈는데 그는 오랫동안 내 \"살생부\"목록에서 1 위를 차지한 놈이었어. "
"그래서 나는 놈에게 정정당당하게 결투를 신청했고 녀석은 거절하기에는 너무 어리석었지. 나는 놈을 죽이고난 후에야 그 정체가 첼리악스의 "
"왕세자의 먼 친척이었음을 알았고 한편으로는 그가 그 지역의 군주임을 알았다. 물론 그 지역의 누구도 놈을 좋아하지는 않았지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "2c2fab3e-1223-437d-89cd-8ab7cc31f0c4"
msgid ""
"\"After his death, a rebellion broke out. — That's nothing new for "
"{g|Cheliax}Cheliax{/g}. As his accidental killer, I was named the "
"rebellion's leader. But I assure you I fled the first moment I could — leapt "
"upon my ship and set sail. A month later I found out I'd become the main "
"reason for a great tragedy, and an enemy of the Chelish people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"놈이 죽은 직후에 반란이 일어났어. {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g}에서는 흔한 일이었지. 놈을 우연찮게 죽인 나는 반란군의 "
"지도자로 지명되었고. 하지만 분명히 말해두겠는데, 나는 초장부터 도망갔어. 배에 올라 다시 항해를 시작했더니 한 달 후에 나는 거대한 "
"비극의 원흉이자 첼리악스 사람들의 공공의 적이 되어 있던 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "9f9e7719-6ea3-491e-a9cc-8ebb3cef4edc"
msgid ""
"\"Once long ago, long before all this rebellion nonsense, I used to be a "
"simple sailor who served the {g|Taldor}Taldorian{/g} merchant fleet. Good "
"old times!\" {n}Darven squints dreamily, continuing to watch you closely "
"from under his half-closed eyelids.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오래전에, 이 모든 사건들이 있기 훨씬 전에 나는 {g|Taldor} 탈도르{/g} 상인 함대의 단순한 선원이었어. 좋은 시절이었지."
"\" {n}다르벤은 꿈꾸듯이 반쯤 감은 눈으로 당신을 면밀히 관찰합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "06b72eeb-68bc-4f65-8ac3-c21ba072e6ea"
msgid ""
"\"The blazing sun overhead, a salty taste on your lips, the squawk of "
"seagulls, calling you forwards. Ropes squeaking in the storm, as you fight "
"against the sea itself — winning in the end. And, of course, the line of the "
"land on the horizon, when you know that tonight you'll have a mug of rum in "
"one hand and a smiling girl to share it with.\" {n}Darven gives you a sly "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"태양이 불타 올랐고 입술에는 짠 내가 느껴지고 갈매기가 끼룩거리며 앞으로 나아가라고 말하는 것 같았어. 폭풍 속에서 밧줄이 삐걱거리며 "
"바다와 싸우고는 했는데 결국에는 이겨내고. 육지의 지평선이 보이면 그 날 저녁에는 럼주 한 잔을 한 손에 들고 활기차게 웃는 소녀와 함께 "
"즐거운 시간을 보낼 생각에 웃음이 절로 나왔지.\" {n}다르벤은 당신에게 교활한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0022_Text_String
msgctxt "9c963b5e-da61-4864-9c13-c8d8b1c910da"
msgid ""
"\"But all that came to an end, when once a certain {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} "
"noble decided that he liked our goods, but didn't like our fleet. I survived "
"the battle — barely. Clinging to a piece of driftwood, lost on the open sea "
"like me, I swore I'd have my revenge. So I decided to become a pirate "
"myself. A pirate captain, as need be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 모든 것에는 끝이 있는 법이지. {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g} 귀족은 우리 상품을 좋아하지만 우리 배는 마음에 들지 "
"않았던 모양이야. 나는 전투에서 겨우 살아 남았지. 나무 한 조각에 매달려 망망대해에서 조난된 나는 복수를 하겠다고 맹세했어. 그리고 "
"해적이 되기로 결심했지. 필요하다면 선장까지 되려고 했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0023_Text_String
msgctxt "15ad7ae8-6cd6-4042-9776-ecc9d00c05f7"
msgid ""
"\"You can't always get what you want, you know. Unless you're me.\" {n}"
"Darven gives you a smug smile.{/n}"
msgstr "\"원하는 것을 항상 얻을 수는 없다. 내가 아니라면 말이다.\" {n}다르벤은 당신에게 뽐내는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "cfc2d026-b979-41ec-985d-d996b1deee1a"
msgid "\"Ah, I'm glad you asked. I've so much to offer!\""
msgstr "\"물어봐주어 고맙군. 너무나 많아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "3045ac3b-48b8-4f56-9d06-372faa6d85bd"
msgid ""
"\"You see, I'm rich. And I don't mind sharing my riches with those who can "
"help me with my troubles. Linxia, on the other hand, will give you nothing. "
"I doubt she'd even say 'thank you'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보면 알 수 있듯이, 나는 부자야. 내 문제를 해결해주는 사람과 부를 나누는 것이 아깝지 않아. 린시아는 너에게 아무것도 주지 않을 "
"거야. 그 년이 '감사합니다.'라고 말할지 조차 모르겠군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "d8a9d8a7-9592-46d2-83a6-8b6308881ef2"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you want even hear what I have to offer?\" {n}Darven looks slightly "
"worried.{/n}"
msgstr "\"내가 무엇을 줄지 궁금하지도 않나?\" {n}다르벤은 약간 걱정되어 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "971dae72-7bd4-4b52-838a-6615939b84be"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? Everything, and everyone, has a price. It's just a matter of "
"negotiation.\""
msgstr "\"왜? 모든 사람과 모든 것들은 가격이 있다. 협상의 문제일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "235a675f-104c-4de5-a7ca-e6126cdf99ff"
msgid ""
"\"I know where Linxia has set up her temporary camp — in a Secluded Lodge on "
"the edge of the southern {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}. Go there. Convince "
"her to stop chasing me. Order her. Kill her, if needed. It shouldn't be "
"difficult. So what do you say? Do we have a deal?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 린시아가 임시 야영지를 세운 곳을 알고 있어. {g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g} 남부의 가장자리에 있는 외딴 산장이야. "
"거기로 가서 그녀가 나를 쫓는 것을 그만 두도록 설득시켜줘. 그녀에게 명령을 내리든가 필요한 경우 그 년을 죽여줘. 어렵지 않은 일이야. "
"그래서 네 대답은 뭐지? 거래 성사인가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "d08e73e3-172a-4b8c-a859-136777d8b2e6"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps you'll manage to convince her to leave peacefully... Though I "
"won't count on that.\""
msgstr "\"아마도 그녀가 평화롭게 떠도록 납득할 수 있을 것이다. 기대하던 모습은 아니더라도 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "29d62963-fdc0-4815-8fd8-ffc20e60bc87"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so glad to hear it!\" {n}Darven's smile remains as smug as before, but "
"you feel a hint of relief behind it.{/n} \"Please, deal with Linxia as soon "
"as possible. I'll find you after you resolve the situation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 기쁜 얘기로군!\" {n}다르벤의 미소는 이전처럼 거만하지만 그 뒤에 숨어있는 안도감을 느낍니다.{/n} \"가능한 빨리 "
"린시아를 처리해줘. 상황을 해결하면 내가 찾아 갈게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "4f522fa2-3041-4c47-801a-c66885438cae"
msgid ""
"\"A pity. Such a pity.\" {n}Darven sighs.{/n} \"Still, if I were you, I "
"would go talk to Linxia. She'll never get me, but her zeal will continue "
"causing trouble for your subjects. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍하다. 정말 불쌍하다.\" {n}다르벤은 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"그래도 내가 너라면 린시아와 얘기하러 갈 거야. 그녀는 "
"절대로 나를 잡을 수 없겠지만 그녀의 열정은 계속해서 너의 백성들과 문제를 일으킬 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "b7339797-822d-4636-8db7-7e6c0a7113b3"
msgid ""
"\"So, that's how it is? Most unpleasant, but not entirely unexpected.\" {n}"
"Darven raises his eyebrow and dissipates into thin air. It turns out you've "
"been talking with his illusion all along.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 이렇게 하겠다? 불쾌하지만 예상했다.\" {n}다르벤은 눈썹을 들어올리고는 허공으로 사라집니다. 당신은 그의 환영과 함께 계속 "
"이야기했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "9c071562-381a-4d04-8c74-e78c66592173"
msgid ""
"\"That's a fine question! I suppose... 10000 gold coins will be a "
"satisfactory amount for you?\""
msgstr "\"그건 좋은 질문이다. 10000개의 금화가 너에게 만족할 만한 금액이 될 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "17d5ea71-f40e-4840-941d-f49aed6e712c"
msgid "\"I'm glad I wasn't mistaken about you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 제대로 본 것이 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "92964bf3-6c49-43eb-b4a8-e411c3365d48"
msgid ""
"\"You're very good at haggling, I'll give you that. Well, I have respect for "
"honest negotiations. Let it be 15000. Do we have a deal?\""
msgstr "\"너는 입씨름을 아주 잘한다. 네가 옳다. 나는 정직한 협상을 존중한다. 15000으로 하자. 거래 성사인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "39f0a661-31a5-4c5b-a2e2-e65965a4f8eb"
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately, at the moment I can't afford to pay more. Let's agree on "
"10000, and put the rest on my tab?\" {n}Darven gives you a disarming "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"불행히도 지금은 더 많은 돈을 지불할 여력이 없다. 10000에 동의하고 나머지는 외상으로 하지?\" {n}다르벤은 마음을 "
"누그러뜨리는 미소를 지었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/DarvenCapital/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "78ac270f-15f2-4134-89ad-49678a470380"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven forces himself to smile.{/n} \"Oh, if only my situation weren't so "
"critical… But I accept your terms. So, do we have a deal?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤은 억지 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"내 상황이 그렇게 어렵지 않다면... 하지만 너의 조건을 받아들이겠다. 거래 성사인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b984a2f4-9607-427a-878f-31c70b136dba"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c908424b-c0b5-47fa-b808-4bd13c2efedf"
msgid "Stopped the Hellknight investigation."
msgstr "헬나이츠의 수사를 중단했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "23b6b3f9-5eb2-40c6-b907-d723c5245072"
msgid ""
"\"Stop this immediately! I didn't give you my permission to beat my subjects!"
"\""
msgstr "\"당장 그만둬! 너에게 내 백성을 때릴 권한을 주지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "70bd96f1-dfae-492b-8856-3380f7f91d02"
msgid "Allowed the Hellknight investigation to continue."
msgstr "헬나이츠의 수사를 계속하도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6f89c9c6-82cb-46b7-9eba-ce9487827068"
msgid "\"Do your job. I won't get in your way.\""
msgstr "\"하던 일을 해라. 나는 막지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : HellknightEvent1_Speaker
msgctxt "81231a94-7528-423e-89dd-13c218ffaaae"
msgid ""
"\"Where did you meet {d|Darven}Darven{/d}?! Speak, or I'll skin you alive!\""
msgstr "\"{d|Darven}다르벤{/d}은 어디서 만났지?! 말하지 않으면 너의 껍질을 벗기겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : VictimEven1
msgctxt "c6da1e60-20fc-40ac-8eae-a978f4c9e741"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know! I don't know anything, I swear! I've never heard that name "
"before! Please don't beat me anymore!\""
msgstr "\"나는 몰라! 나는 아무것도 모른다. 맹세한다. 그 이름을 결코 들어본 적이 없다! 더 이상 나를 때리지 말아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : HellknightEvent1_Speaker
msgctxt "94182d93-4d79-4c08-8f6c-6ade84e80d1c"
msgid ""
"\"This woman is suspected of having links with Darven. We know that he "
"bought food from her.\""
msgstr "\"이 여성은 다르벤과의 연관성이 의심된다. 우리는 그가 그녀에게서 음식을 사온 사실을 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : VictimEven1
msgctxt "4fa11190-00e8-4102-8679-ca9a6c35cb58"
msgid ""
"\"I'm telling you, I don't know who that is! I've never seen him before in "
"my life! Please, save me from them!\""
msgstr "\"정말로 나는 그가 누구인지 모른다! 내 인생에서 그를 본 적이 없다! 제발 그들로부터 나를 구해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent1/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : HellknightEvent1_Speaker
msgctxt "961a8b6a-8a99-4a30-8627-2c8dd2eb6eea"
msgid "\"One way or another, I'll soon find out everything I need.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 방법으로든 곧 내가 필요한 모든 것을 알아낼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "147c29da-7437-4105-ac19-d15f4aa453de"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5b9551a4-ef21-475f-a0bf-df73e2b59ba8"
msgid "Stopped the Hellknight investigation."
msgstr "헬나이츠의 수사를 중단했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ee71f07c-dd35-4178-9bdf-316618fdcae7"
msgid "\"I demand you to stop intimidating my subjects immediately!\""
msgstr "\"즉시 내 백성을 협박하는 것을 멈춰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "87aec18b-936b-4957-8978-11ef17c51cec"
msgid "Allowed the Hellknight investigation to continue."
msgstr "헬나이츠의 수사를 계속하도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "706f9d50-3a08-434f-bd99-dd0a87bb047c"
msgid "\"I won't get in your way. Continue your investigation.\""
msgstr "\"나는 막지 않을 것이다. 수사를 계속해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : HellknightEvent2_Speaker
msgctxt "17d36bc7-056b-491d-a0ee-cc68d0bb838f"
msgid "\"Where is {d|Darven}Darven{/d} now? Speak up, or else!\""
msgstr "\"지금 {d|다르벤}다르벤{/d}은 어디 있지? 대답해. 그렇지 않으면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : VictimEven2
msgctxt "2e28f90a-e61f-4d3e-9a5a-15c1117377f5"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know who you're talking about! Let me go! What do you think you're "
"doing?!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 누구에 대해 말하는지 모르겠다! 나를 보내 줘! 무슨 짓이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : HellknightEvent2_Speaker
msgctxt "bfaed8fa-ec9b-406d-894d-e4b0f6283281"
msgid ""
"\"The man who spent last night at your place is a fugitive and a criminal!\""
msgstr "\"너희 집에서 지난 밤을 보낸 사람은 도망자이자 범죄자이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : VictimEven2
msgctxt "1fd737cf-b80d-4ce7-a956-0483c6b3af6a"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't know he was a criminal! He asked to spend a night on my floor, "
"then he left in the morning! I don't know anything else!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그가 범죄자라는 것을 몰랐다. 그는 마루에서 밤을 보내는 것을 허락해달라고 부탁했다. 그리고 아침에 떠났다. 나는 아무것도 "
"모른다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : VictimEven2
msgctxt "d048510d-ddea-4b92-b173-fdc42061e3c7"
msgid ""
"\"I let the traveler inside for the night, that's all. He paid me, and left "
"in the morning! I didn't talk with him, and I didn't know who he was! "
"Please, help me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 밤에 여행객을 들였다. 그게 다야. 그는 돈을 내고 아침에 나갔다. 나는 그와 이야기하지 않았고 그가 누군지 몰랐다. 제발 "
"살려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/DealWithDevil/LinxiaInvestigationEvent2/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : HellknightEvent2_Speaker
msgctxt "c641982c-0f82-4443-a5cb-b10ad95d48db"
msgid "\"Maybe, he's telling the truth. Or maybe not. Soon we'll find out.\""
msgstr "\"아마 진실을 말하고 있는 것일 수도 있고 그렇지 않을 수도 있다. 곧 알게 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "321ccbb7-00f4-467d-bff6-74d24134f4b5"
msgid "\"I command you: leave this place immediately!\""
msgstr "\"나는 명령한다. 즉시 이곳을 떠나라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ac3ac116-a51a-455f-a278-7ea961865728"
msgid "\"Silence! Please, let us speak. Tell me what brings you to my door.\""
msgstr "\"제발 조용히! 우리 이야기를 하자. 다들 무슨 일로 성 문앞까지 오게 되었는지 말해봐라\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "672ec216-5553-45dc-8800-9d2168ec7579"
msgid "[Let Jhod speak]"
msgstr "[조드가 말하게 둡니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a5de3aa7-dbe0-452a-a6c4-e933327082b6"
msgid "\"Keep this up, and you'll all regret coming here.\""
msgstr "\"어디 계속해봐라, 이곳에 모인것을 후회하게 해줄테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "391a1e5a-c462-4d63-8994-3573f117676b"
msgid "\"Jhod, can you try to reason with them?\""
msgstr "\"조드. 저들을 설득해 볼 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "e5deff53-567f-478f-a251-d66ec5a95830"
msgid "[To Remus] \"I ordered you executed!\""
msgstr "[레무스에게] \"나는 네게 처형 명령을 내렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "0369f68a-a0bf-4df3-a9f3-ff0585b827ad"
msgid "[To Remus] \"You're supposed to be in a cell!\""
msgstr "[Remus에게] \"너는 감옥에 있어야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "96a6b2a8-67b3-4292-8ce4-a11b2244d8e4"
msgid ""
"\"People aren't dying from some curse, it's from strange magical seeds that "
"carry a fatal disease. We just need to find out where they're coming from, "
"then...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 어떤 저주로 죽은 것이 아니라 치명적인 질병을 옮기는 이상한 마법의 씨앗으로 죽은 것이다. 우리는 그것들이 어디에서 왔는지 "
"알아내야 한다. 그 후에..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0041_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3a3f2e30-83c8-43ee-8881-9f2824d3a8b9"
msgid "Decided not to influence the rioters' opinions."
msgstr "폭도의 의견에 영향을 미치지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "f3550983-4251-45c2-b369-9c8b2ce14275"
msgid ""
"\"It's not worth arguing with them. Let them come to their own conclusions.\""
msgstr "\"그들과 논쟁할 가치가 없다. 그들 자신이 결론을 짓도록 하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0056_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f6a3ea5c-d7da-45cc-80f0-e6b7cab29b1f"
msgid "Refused to argue with the rioters."
msgstr "폭도들과 논쟁하기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "fbaaca86-5c9a-4eb9-8888-006e854cb597"
msgid ""
"\"I refuse to get involved in this. Let them believe whatever they want.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 일에 관여하지 않겠다. 그들이 원하는 것을 믿게 두어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0070_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "92a8dd0f-3d82-4c7d-ae73-ce4470df526c"
msgid "Refused to justify yourself to the rioters."
msgstr "폭도들에게 설득 당하는 것을 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "be3147c1-4eaf-4872-9a5c-2eaf6a680f63"
msgid "\"I don't need to justify myself to anyone!\""
msgstr "\"난 누구에게도 내 자신을 해명할 필요가 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0098_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7fb22cf7-ba91-487d-adcb-957349c24d64"
msgid "Threatened the rioters with violence."
msgstr "폭력으로 폭도들을 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "d423f549-b626-47ac-9dcd-19d98de6df59"
msgid ""
"\"In times like these, a ruler should be able to rely on {mf|his|her} "
"people, but I seem to have only ill-equipped vagrants who insist on "
"threatening me. Return to your homes, before I decide to give you a sample "
"of what I have in store for those who dare to send a magic disease into MY "
"lands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 때일수록 통치자는 백성들에게 의지할 수 있어야 하는데, 내 주변엔 나를 협박하는 부랑자들만 있는 것 같다. 너희 집으로 "
"돌아가라! 내 땅에 감히 마법의 질병을 보낸 놈들을 위해 준비한걸 너희들에게 먼저 시범으로 보여주기 전에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0099_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3410ef1a-947b-40e9-a6a9-81e0b885bf54"
msgid "Scoffed at the rioters' misfortunes."
msgstr "폭도들의 불행을 조롱합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "fae6864d-2325-4afb-9e8b-645237fe8a75"
msgid ""
"\"I have no time for your wailing and threats — take your pleas to another.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너희들의 투덜거림과 협박을 들어줄 시간이 없어. 다른 사람에게 가서 해줄래?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0102_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "132b54c1-be45-4a2c-a0ac-657c38bc9bc4"
msgid "Calmed the rioters with promises of protection."
msgstr "폭도들에게 보호해주겠다는 약속으로 진정시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "45536a71-5e85-4d1c-b12c-023d34d2ab1d"
msgid ""
"\"Please, give me more time! I won't let any disaster, natural or magical, "
"overcome our strength! Trust in me, your rightful liege, and I WILL find a "
"way to protect you and those you love!\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간이 더 필요하다! 나는 자연적이든 마법적이든 어떠한 재앙도 우리의 힘을 이겨내지 못하게 하겠다! 너희의 합법적인 영주를 믿어라. "
"나는 너희와 네 가족들을 보호할 방법을 반드시 찾을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0103_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0cbdddc5-6298-40f8-ab96-264981f19b9e"
msgid "Declared your commitment to law and order during the riot."
msgstr "폭도들에게 법과 질서를 지키겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "e05dec19-6474-4a9b-b9ba-2a7927f20f0a"
msgid ""
"\"Not long ago, the Stolen Lands were little more than a haven for "
"cutthroats and bandits. If the fine, upstanding citizens abandon me, who "
"will I have left to rely on? It's you who are the true foundation of this "
"barony — a fact I've never forgotten!\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼마 전까지 도둑맞은 땅은 살인자들과 도적들의 안식처였다. 정직하고 훌륭한 시민들이 나를 버린다면, 나는 누구를 의지할 것인가? 이 "
"영지의 진정한 근간은 바로 너희들이다. 나는 이 사실을 한순간도 잊지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0104_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4561ba2e-d617-4a88-ab5f-503330fcb154"
msgid "Denounced the rioters as hypocrites."
msgstr "폭도들을 위선자라고 비난했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0104_Text
msgctxt "c14a3d8a-699b-4c15-b7f4-c1f580a95a7f"
msgid ""
"\"You ungrateful rabble, dare judge me, the one charged with protecting this "
"barony? You're still here, so I must be doing something right!\""
msgstr ""
"\"배은망덕한 폭도놈들, 감히 이 영지를 보호해주는 나를 심판해? 너희들이 멀쩡히 여기 있는걸보니, 난 너희를 제대로 보호해준게 틀림없다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0105_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d3e8e9d1-78e0-43a2-8108-379a549f3c8a"
msgid "Dismissed the rioters as whiners."
msgstr "폭도들의 하소연을 일축했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0105_Text
msgctxt "950882ec-ac37-484f-a25b-3686abd66505"
msgid ""
"\"Your whining sickens me. How much longer must I put up with this farce?\""
msgstr "\"너희들 징징거리는 소리에 속이 다 메스껍다. 내가 이 웃긴 짓거리를 얼마나 더 참아야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0108_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3680bba8-7ee7-4166-bab4-554a00253c03"
msgid ""
"Reminded the rioters of your obedience to the law and the prohibition of "
"Lamashtu's cult."
msgstr "폭도들에게 법에 대한 당신의 순종과 라마슈투의 숭배 금지에 대해 상기시켜 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "71743623-3070-47d3-b7fb-a8a3708f559e"
msgid ""
"\"Lamashtu's cult is outlawed in these lands, like everywhere else. Keeping "
"the reign of law in the Stolen Lands is my top priority, and I'll defend it "
"to my dying breath!\""
msgstr ""
"\"라마슈투의 종교 숭배는 다른 곳과 마찬가지로 이 땅에서 금지되어 있다. 도둑맞은 땅에서 법을 지키는 것이 최우선 과제이며 나는 죽을 "
"때까지 이를 지키겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0109_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dc1e9af9-a23d-4845-8080-751ca1d8c2d6"
msgid "Threatened the rioters with a religious purge."
msgstr "마녀 사냥을 하겠다고 폭도들을 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "5f0ae645-6104-4643-bbce-5fce5f799730"
msgid ""
"\"If you care so much about my beliefs, maybe it's time we examine YOUR "
"altars of worship! Let me see your paragons of virtue who have the right to "
"reproach me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희가 내 신앙에 그렇게 신경을 쓴다면, 아마도 지금이 너희들의 신앙을 시험할 때다! 너희가 나를 비난할 권리가 있는지 신앙의 귀감을 "
"나에게 지금 보여봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0110_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "90a2974f-d8f3-423d-9a83-3437671707bc"
msgid "Insulted the rioters."
msgstr "폭도들을 모욕했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0110_Text
msgctxt "b70f225b-2dc5-444d-a2b3-7b592219c0f7"
msgid ""
"\"To think these miserable imbeciles are allowed to roam free in my lands..."
"\""
msgstr "\"이 비참한 멍청이들을 내 땅에서 자유롭게 돌아다니도록 허락했다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0111_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "49adaeb5-2f68-4314-9c0e-22e71fb49402"
msgid "Attacked the rioters and killed them all."
msgstr "폭도들을 공격하고 그들을 모두 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0111_Text
msgctxt "febce508-cbcc-4f69-96b1-0af80588aabc"
msgid "[Attack] \"I can certainly try! Guards, forward!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"시도해 볼수야 있지! 경비대! 앞으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0112_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4e26a8c8-8e2e-4c9a-9f3d-3c5287326333"
msgid "Attacked and killed the rioters."
msgstr "폭도들을 공격하고 살해했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0112_Text
msgctxt "8c02df96-52e5-41bf-b503-a91732f55411"
msgid "[Attack] \"Death to the insurgents!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"저항 세력에 대한 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0113_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ba0e3e49-6bbc-47fe-9ae6-174e168e1b9e"
msgid "Promised the rioters that you would deal with the sickness."
msgstr "폭도들에게 병을 고치겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0113_Text
msgctxt "2ef2f58e-c62f-4390-8285-70cd023933f8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm doing all in my power to protect this realm from the evils besieging "
"it. I swear to you, we'll soon discover the truth and put an end to this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 곳을 둘러싸고 있는 악으로부터 우리 영지를 보호하기 위해 모든 힘을 다하고 있다. 너희에게 맹세하건데, 우리는 곧 진실을 "
"발견하고 이 모든 것을 끝낼 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0114_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e734f78b-ed81-4b6f-8162-274da2964193"
msgid "Attacked the rioters and killed them all."
msgstr "폭도들을 공격하고 그들을 모두 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0114_Text
msgctxt "89e95bd3-6bbd-4ed1-98c5-9b1ee4c219a4"
msgid "[Attack] \"I will have order!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 질서를 찾을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0115_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "17627e05-5462-431d-bf58-8e064a29b837"
msgid "Pledged loyalty to your subjects during the riot."
msgstr "폭동 사태 중 백성에게 충성을 다짐했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0115_Text
msgctxt "67b5ac3f-c8de-43f7-8083-f4aebb8b9363"
msgid ""
"\"Put your faith in me, stand with me to overcome this ordeal, and I promise "
"I will not let you down!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희의 믿음을 내게 맡기고, 이 시련을 극복하기 위해 내 옆에 서있어 주겠나! 나는 너희를 실망시키지 않을 것을 약속한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0116_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d82c5b86-0f11-43b2-8f82-55a9b5cbe691"
msgid "Attacked the rioters and killed them all."
msgstr "폭도들을 공격하고 그들을 모두 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0116_Text
msgctxt "3ea197ff-a6ef-4c0c-9367-5cea8a981733"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough! Guards, scatter this rabble.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그만! 경비병! 이 거지들을 쓸어버려라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0117_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "73cbfb31-bb85-4d5c-9615-dd87f7f3e3af"
msgid "Denied allegiance to Lamashtu."
msgstr "라마슈투에 대한 충성을 부인했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "d35adeb5-b1b5-4cdf-a88c-46b193f4fd42"
msgid ""
"\"The mere thought of following Lamashtu disgusts me. I would never put the "
"lives of those entrusted to me in such danger.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투를 숭배한다는건 생각만으로도 혐오스럽다. 내게 맡겨진 백성들의 목숨을 결코 그런 위험에 빠뜨리지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0118_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fc2664e7-f1de-40dd-8092-a0fa7e2ff1b9"
msgid "Attacked the rioters and killed them all."
msgstr "폭도들을 공격하고 그들을 모두 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0118_Text
msgctxt "ca96f117-fd55-4d6c-8b48-2e748cba4df9"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough! I'm sick of this rabble's threats.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그만! 이 폭도들의 협박에 진절머리가 난다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0119_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "58d5a3ad-7cdc-459f-ad15-81b155b3b674"
msgid "Publicly confirmed your worship of Lamashtu."
msgstr "라마슈투를 숭배한다고 공개적으로 밝혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0119_Text
msgctxt "5204e27b-5763-4cb0-aa44-3c6b5ce66a62"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"Yes, I worship Lamashtu. If you have a problem with that, why not "
"step forward so we can discuss it face-to-face?\""
msgstr ""
"[거짓] \"그렇다. 나는 라마슈투를 경배한다. 그게 문제 된다면, 우리 서로 직접 얼굴 맞대고 의논할 수 있게 앞으로 나와보지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0120_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f06da725-77d8-4f9e-b3fc-6731fc8013c3"
msgid "Ordered the execution of half the rioters to suppress rebellion."
msgstr "폭동을 억제하기 위해 폭도의 절반을 처형하라는 명령을 내립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0120_Text
msgctxt "7b9f74bd-4129-4195-9bb8-6eecfcca4bd3"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have time for this 'revolt' nonsense. Guards, lock these mongrels "
"up, and hang every second one of them — if any others persist, break them on "
"the wheel. These people need to be taught to respect the law of their "
"{mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 말도 안돼는 반란에 들일 시간이 없다. 경비원. 이 놈들을 가두고 한놈씩 교수형에 처해라. 저항하는 자가 있다면 능지처참해라. "
"이 사람들은 영주의 법을 존중하도록 가르칠 필요가 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0121_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4c70cfca-fcdb-4047-bef8-7fe9412c58b4"
msgid "Found a peaceful solution to stop rebellion."
msgstr "반란을 막을 평화로운 해결책을 찾았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0121_Text
msgctxt "9cbdd7ef-3b04-44d1-9fe7-db0b5fb0f549"
msgid ""
"\"Please hear me out before you lynch me. I know you're tired and "
"disgruntled — I am too. Day after day I and my companions seek a solution to "
"your misfortunes. We've saved so many from this fatal disease, and if the "
"gods have mercy, we can save even more! So please, let us do what we can — "
"return to your homes, to your loved ones. They need you, just as I need your "
"patience and good faith.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 처단하기 전에 먼저 내 말을 들어주겠나? 너희가 지치고 불만을 품은 것은 알고있다. 나 역시 마찬가지다. 매일 나와 동료들은 "
"너희 불행에 대한 해결책을 찾고있다. 우리는 이 치명적인 질병으로부터 많은 사람들을 구했고, 신들께서 자비를 베푼다면 우리는 더 많은 "
"사람을 구할 수 있다! 그러니 부디, 우리가 할 수있는 일을 계속 하도록 해주겠나? 너희 가정과 사랑하는 사람들에게 돌아가라. 내가 "
"너희의 인내와 신앙이 필요하듯이 그들도 네가 필요하다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Answer_0135_Text
msgctxt "03ae2591-4ed7-4ebc-b12d-01a066e555a6"
msgid "[To Remus] \"You're supposed to be banished from my lands!\""
msgstr "[Remus에게] \"너는 내 땅에서 사라졌어야 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/Jhod_Afterfight_1_String
msgctxt "8b895505-b6d9-4887-b9b0-07185b2118ef"
msgid ""
"\"Such a tragedy... I must pray for the souls of the deceased. Go now — your "
"duties cannot wait.\""
msgstr "\"비극이로군... 나는 고인의 영혼을 위해 기도해야겠다. 어서 가라. 네 임무는 기다려주지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/Jhod_Peaceful_1_String
msgctxt "9cca367f-b363-4486-b4b1-b9903d74ef05"
msgid ""
"\"Praise be to Erastil! The bloodshed has been prevented. I have to get back "
"to the hospital, and you should hurry as well — sail up the river!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸에게 찬양하라! 유혈 사태가 멈추었다. 나는 병원에 가야 하니 너는 어서 강을 따라 항해해야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/Kesten_Afterfight_String
msgctxt "1067f2c0-3a4a-45a8-8abb-2016d776dc43"
msgid ""
"\"I'll give the order to reinforce the castle guard, and then I'll sail up "
"the river. Don't delay, Your Grace — join me as soon as you're able!\""
msgstr "\"성의 경비를 강화하라는 명령을 내리고 강을 항해할 것이다. 지체하지 말아라. 가능한 한 빨리 나와 합류하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/Kesten_Peaceful_String
msgctxt "a6ce71bd-4725-4039-8295-a2c4c18af47a"
msgid ""
"\"Well, at least we had some luck here... I'll sail upstream, Your Grace. I "
"hope you'll join me soon!\""
msgstr "\"적어도 우리는 운이 있었다... 나는 상류로 항해하겠다. 곧 나와 같이 합류하길 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/Kesten_Riotersattack_String
msgctxt "2b6746ac-0abd-4886-8582-77e50d3452b1"
msgid "\"Protect the {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작|여남작}을 보호해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/ReinforcedEvil_Guard_String
msgctxt "0b08e496-edaf-4b64-92a7-645e57a257ac"
msgid "\"Get 'em!\""
msgstr "\"잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/ReinforcedEvil_Rioter1_String
msgctxt "7e6be697-fc84-48b6-a744-1dba87638aea"
msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/ReinforcedEvil_Rioter2_String
msgctxt "3a486645-17ae-4442-9c39-6048bfc70479"
msgid "\"Run!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersAttack_1_String
msgctxt "67622a45-6386-4228-b602-e8febe1c1f5c"
msgid "\"I've had enough! Die!\""
msgstr "\"이제 그만하자! 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersAttack_2_String
msgctxt "861029c1-5935-46e8-bc11-c6c61494ee40"
msgid "\"We've seen enough horrors! Die!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 충분한 공포를 보았다! 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersAttack_3_String
msgctxt "34c41038-5f3c-4960-9ad8-724b1e247bd8"
msgid "\"Death to the tyrant!\""
msgstr "\"폭군에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersBaronattacks_1_String
msgctxt "05271405-e485-4372-a5c5-1ea72b1b8fb7"
msgid "\"Erastil save us!\""
msgstr "\"Erastil이 우리를 구하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersBaronattacks_2_String
msgctxt "569ec38c-07ce-4894-b600-36c0f5f15d5f"
msgid "\"Hit 'em hard! Pile on!\""
msgstr "\"열심히 때려라! 쌓아올려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersBefore_1_String
msgctxt "d5a17dff-2716-4706-8ff2-086d8f31eb90"
msgid "\"We want to see the {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 {mf|남작|여남작}에게 가서 얘기하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersBefore_2_String
msgctxt "9df33a9d-d6ee-4570-a517-03a5bc73d362"
msgid "\"Look, there {mf|he|she} is!\""
msgstr "\"저길 봐! {mf|그|그녀}다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersGoaway_1_String
msgctxt "eed8cd64-ee11-4402-a4fe-2c309890ae8a"
msgid "\"Come on, let's go. Nothing to see here.\""
msgstr "\"어서 가자. 여기는 볼 일이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Barks/RiotersGoaway_2_String
msgctxt "c5bf77ac-ac75-4463-93cf-93a9328f6e50"
msgid "\"That's it... I have enough trouble already.\""
msgstr "\"그게... 문제가 이미 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "f682f637-8df9-4c75-81df-350d76990d1a"
msgid ""
"{n}The murmuring crowd takes up almost the entire square. The murmuring "
"turns to shouts at your arrival, and a stone flies out of the crowd and "
"strikes the cobbles at your feet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}불평하는 군중이 거의 모든 광장을 차지합니다. 불평은 당신이 도착하자 외침으로 변합니다. 그리고 돌 하나가 군중들에게서 날아와 당신 "
"발치의 자갈을 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "9355b5f1-4e74-4903-b998-871fe4b449cb"
msgid "\"There {mf|he|she} is! Out at last, damn {mf|his|her} eyes!\""
msgstr "\"저기 있다! 마침내 낯짝을 드러내셨구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "a60b8f0b-d590-4d46-8d26-0c41467376a2"
msgid ""
"\"People, please hear me!\" {n}Jhod steps forward and raises his hands.{/n} "
"\"Quiet down!\" {n}His voice thunders over the crowd, and the people fall "
"silent, waiting.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"백성들이여. 내 말을 들어보시오!\" {n}조드는 앞으로 나아가 손을 들어 올립니다.{/n} \"조용히!\" {n}그의 목소리가 "
"군중들에게 쩌렁쩌렁 울렸고 백성들은 침묵하며 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "5d455e7f-9b15-4bf2-8acc-d681b250a34b"
msgid ""
"\"Lies! This 'ruler' is the source of all our suffering! Once we get rid of "
"{mf|him|her}, the curse will be lifted!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말! 이 '통치자'는 우리의 모든 고통의 원천이다! 우리가 일단 {mf|그|그녀}를 제거하면 저주가 풀릴 꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "72a8243d-1e05-4510-b069-75bd0541140c"
msgid "\"Is that right?! You can't silence us all!\""
msgstr "\"그게 옳은 소리냐?! 우리 모두를 침묵시킬 수는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Doomsayer
msgctxt "39d67146-d801-4c22-9f34-d2398b3e6d21"
msgid ""
"{n}Suddenly, an old man dressed in rags steps from the crowd — or the crowd "
"parts for him, it's difficult to tell. As he gets closer, you recognize him —"
" it is the prophet, {d|Remus}Remus{/d}. His eyes fall on the crowd.{/n} "
"\"Repent, fools! This is your last chance to appease the Goddess.\" {n}He "
"turns and points at you, his eyes afire.{/n} \"By killing the one who dared "
"lay claim to our Mistress's lands!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}갑자기 넝마를 입은 한 노인이 군중에서 걸어나옵니다. 혹은 군중들이 그에게 길을 내어주었는지 설명하기 어렵습니다. 그가 가까이 오자 "
"당신은 그를 봅니다. 그는 선지자 {d|Remus} 레무스 {/d}입니다. 그의 눈은 군중을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"회개하라! 어리석은 "
"자들이여! 여신님을 달래는 마지막 기회다.\" {n}그는 돌아서 당신을 가리키는데 그의 눈은 불타오릅니다.{/n} \"우리 여주인의 땅을 "
"감히 자기 땅이라 주장하는 자를 죽임으로써 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "8feaa368-41a6-42aa-88fa-a13a4921b9a2"
msgid ""
"\"Curse? There is no curse, you fool! Are you so afraid that you'll take "
"every rumor you hear as truth?\""
msgstr "\"저주? 저주 같은건 없어, 멍청이들! 얼마나 두려우면 소문을 진실로 듣는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Doomsayer
msgctxt "56a355f3-9549-486d-a14e-d9909937a9c3"
msgid ""
"\"Goddess sent me a {d|c21 Remus Executed}reprieve{/d}! Goddess protects "
"those who hear her whispers! Goddess led me here to reveal the beast that "
"destroys her kingdom and poisons her land!\" {n}Remus lifts his hand and "
"points his finger at you.{/n} \"Your baron{mf||ess} will not receive the "
"mercy {mf|he|she} is so eager to deny! {mf|He|She} laughs at omens and "
"prophets without knowing what forces {mf|he|she} is meddling with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여신께서 나를 {d|c21 Remus Executed}살려주셨다! 여신께서는 자신의 속삭임을 듣는 자를 보호하시지! 여신님은 오늘 이 "
"자리에서, 우리의 왕국을 파괴하고, 땅을 오염시키는 괴물의 정체를 드러내고자 하신다!\" {n}레무스는 손을 들어 당신을 "
"가리킵니다.{/n} \"여신님께서 고개를 돌리신 바, 너희 {mf||여}남작은 자비를 손길을 받지 못할 것이다. 저자는 자신이 더럽힌 "
"힘의 진가도 모른 채, 전조와 선지자를 비웃었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Doomsayer
msgctxt "2a90f91c-7572-417c-80dd-59769ae0300b"
msgid ""
"\"Can {d|c21 Remus Imprisoned}locks{/d} and latches stop the primal force? "
"What doors can withstand Nature itself that strucks those who are guilty?\" "
"{n}Remus smiles, showing his rotten teeth.{/n} \"You have no idea what "
"forces you are trying to oppose! Repent, accept your faith and claim your "
"reward — quick demise!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{d|c21 Remus Imprisoned} 자물쇠 {/d}와 걸쇠 따위로 원초적인 힘을 멈춘다고? 죄인들을 벌하는 자연을 어느 문이 "
"견딜 수 있겠나? \" {n}Remus는 미소를 지으며 그의 썩은 이빨을 보여줍니다.{/n} \"네가 어떤 세력을 반대하는지 너는 전혀 "
"알지 못한다! 회개하고 믿음을 받아들여 고통 없는 죽음을 요구하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "57d39fe0-db8a-4315-8fb4-50724783c0ec"
msgid ""
"\"Do you wish to know where to find safe haven in dark times? In faith, "
"strong and pure! Pray to {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, or your own gods! Cast away "
"the wicked, lazy thinking that brought you to this point. Only together can "
"we purge the evil seeking to take root in our hearts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어두운 시기에 안전한 피난처를 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 알고 싶은가? 실로, 강하고 진정한 안식처 말이다! "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g} 또는 너의 신에게 기도하라! 너희를 여기까지 오게한 사악하고 게으른 사고를 버려라. 오직 함께 해야 "
"우리 마음에 뿌리를 내리려는 악을 제거할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "20ff8cf7-1ac5-4e1b-97da-74834931cf59"
msgid ""
"{n}People in the crowd look at each other uncertainly. Some close their eyes "
"and put their hands to the holy symbols at their necks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중 속에 있는 사람들은 서로를 불확실하게 바라봅니다. 어떤 사람들은 눈을 감고 목에 걸린 거룩한 상징에 손을 댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "06cc96c0-64de-4b31-b54d-1bd40e04d948"
msgid ""
"\"A disease? Why would you {d|c22 hide truth}hide{/d} that from us, keep "
"silent as monsters tore apart our loved ones? No, you're just trying to hide "
"the truth about your curse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"질병? 왜 그 사실을 {d|c22 hide truth}숨기고{/d} 괴물들이 사랑하는 사람들을 찢어발길 때까지 침묵하고 있는거지? "
"아니야, 당신은 단지 자신이 저주 받았다는 진실을 숨기려는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K3
msgctxt "dff80dd1-9420-4367-aab9-8ac6d27dbf70"
msgid ""
"\"The {mf|baron|baroness} is telling the truth, and always has! How many of "
"us were saved by being {d|c22 tell truth}warned{/d} of the coming disaster?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|남작|여남작}은 진실을 말하고 있고, 언제나 진실을 말해왔다! 우린 다가올 재앙에 대해 남작의 {d|c22 tell truth}"
"경고를 받고{/d} 많은 사람들을 살릴 수 있었잖은가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "c3b7f565-1dad-48a5-bae7-dd2b923be914"
msgid ""
"\"{d|MadlaStasek}Madla Stasek{/d}! She believed these lies about a disease, "
"too, and she went to you in hopes of finding a cure! Well, where is she, "
"{mf|baron|baroness}? Likely buried in an unmarked grave!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {d|MadlaStasek}마들라 스타섹{/d}! 그녀도 역시 질병에 대한 이 거짓말을 믿었고, 치료법을 찾기 위해 당신을 "
"찾아갔었다! 그녀는 어디 있지, {mf|남작|여남작}? 아마 어딘가에 묻혀있는 것 같군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_RillaVilsen
msgctxt "e0561aab-6719-4808-9606-246c6925daff"
msgid ""
"\"Are you all mad? I myself came to the {mf|baron|baroness} for a cure! If "
"you'd only seen the foulness they took out of me, you'd know this is not "
"some curse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다들 정신나갔어요? 나도 치료를 받기위해 내 발로 {mf|영주님을|영주님을} 찾아갔었어요! 이분들께서 제 몸에서 빼내준 "
"그 사악한 것을 당신들도 봤다면, 이건 저주 같은게 아니란 걸 알게 됐을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "25557aa1-d75b-42c5-b124-1c2d3048666d"
msgid ""
"{n}The people exchange looks and nod slowly. It seems your words have calmed "
"them somewhat.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사람들이 눈빛을 교환하고 천천히 끄덕입니다. 당신의 말로 다소 그들을 진정시킨 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "2e47d0f8-2ac4-4cb4-b358-321570f3b406"
msgid ""
"{n}Your words are met with cold silence. The crowd gives each other dark "
"looks and tighten their grips on their torches.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신 말의 반응은 차가운 침묵이었습니다. 군중들은 서로 어두운 시선을 교환하고는 횃불을 더욱 세게 쥡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "79cff526-8f4b-408f-8765-438ebf1219e1"
msgid ""
"\"Enough! You don't care about us! You hole up in your castle in fear, and "
"refuse to lift a finger while us simple folk die like animals!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만! 넌 우리는 신경도 안쓰는군! 너는 그저 겁에 질린 채, 네 성에 숨어서 백성들이 짐승처럼 죽는 동안에도 손가락 하나 까딱하지 "
"않지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_Refudgee
msgctxt "94e3949f-1198-41c9-b74b-d3e783f9150f"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|He|She} won't even let us {d|c22 Refugees Capital}leave{/d}! Made us "
"turn back — it'd be bad for business if any other rich folk heard that "
"people were fleeing the lands like rats from a sinking ship!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작은 백성들이 이곳을 {d|c22 Refugees Capital}떠나지도{/d} 못하게할꺼야! 피난가던 우리를 되돌려 보냈었다구. "
"백성들이 침몰하는 배에서 쥐처럼 이 땅을 탈출한다는 말을 다른 부자들이 듣게되면 사업에 좋을게 없을테니까 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K4
msgctxt "8e540a46-5335-4a3b-9769-ff83f8cdc15b"
msgid ""
"\"If all you care about is your own hide, then go on, flee with your tail "
"between your legs! My neighbors may have fled like cowards, but the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} is still here — {mf|he|she} refuses to leave {mf|his|her}"
" people!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 신경쓰는 것이 오로지 자신의 안전이라면, 어서 떠나. 꼬리 빠지게 도망이나 치라구! 내 이웃들은 겁쟁이처럼 도망쳤을지 몰라도, "
"{mf|남작|여남작}은 여전히 이곳에 남아있어. {mf|그|그녀}는 자기 백성들을 버리고 떠나지 않는다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "0acb18ed-a098-4caa-a7ed-fdcdc215c337"
msgid ""
"\"Bah, only {d|c21 Bandits Evil}thugs{/d} in {mf|his|her} service! They're "
"locking up roads and bridges! You want to cross? Better pay up! People are "
"running for their lives, and {mf|he|she}'s lining {mf|his|her} pockets!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하. {mf|그|그녀}를 섬기는 {d|c21 Bandits Evil}심복{/d}뿐이다! 그들은 길과 다리를 점거했어! 건너고 "
"싶나? 더 많은 지불을 해라! 사람들이 먹고 살기 위해 도망치면 {mf|그|그녀}는 돈을 끌어모은다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K3
msgctxt "b81948f7-44e1-407b-83cf-e256b25a751a"
msgid ""
"\"You heard of the new Stag Lord yet? No? That's because the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} took {d|c22 Fake Killed}care{/d} of him, just like the "
"one before that! The roads are safer, thanks to {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 수사슴 군주에 대해서 아직 안들었나? 전혀? 그건 {mf|남작|여남작}께서 그를 {d|c22 Fake Killed}처리했기{/d} "
"때문이다. 그 전에 그랬던 다른 것들처럼! {mf|그|그녀} 덕분에 도로가 더 안전해졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_OldManFromBridge
msgctxt "4dd676b1-6918-49f8-97d1-97a07ee11163"
msgid ""
"\"Let an old man speak! I'll have you know I was {d|c22 GoTo Jhod}sent{/d} "
"by the {mf|baron|baroness} {mf|himself|herself} to see this here priest of "
"Erastil. And he cured me! So prattle all you want about some curse, but "
"don't you spread lies about our {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 늙은이가 말하게 해주게! 내가 너희들이 알게 해 줄게. {mf|남작님|여남작님}에 의해 에라스틸의 사제를 여기서 만나라고 나를 "
"{d|c22 GoTo Jhod}보냈던{/d} 사실을 말해주겠다. 그리고 그는 나를 치료했어! 그래 저주에 대해 원하는 어떤 소리든지 "
"지껄여라. 하지만 우리의 {mf|남작|여남작}님에 대한 거짓말은 퍼뜨리지 말아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "21f338e6-4efb-46db-9ab8-0262673d6031"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|He|She} don't give a damn about us! I know it for sure — a fellow of "
"mine met this scoundrel for a {d|c22 Peasants Left}chat{/d} near the castle. "
"Know what happened after that? He took his family and left for good, because "
"it was clear {mf|His|Her} Grace cares nothing for the troubles of "
"{mf|his|her} subjects!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {mf|그|그녀}는 우리를 걱정하지도 않았다! 나는 그것을 잘 안다. 내 동료가 성 근처에서 이 악당과 {d|c22 Peasants "
"Left} 잡담 {/d}을 나눴다. 그 후에 무슨 일이 있었는지 아나? 우리 군주는 백성들은 전혀 신경쓰지 않기에 그는 가족을 데리고 "
"영영 떠났다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_PeasantInDoubt
msgctxt "faa2da1d-7c6e-49a3-b832-a95432cd9635"
msgid ""
"\"Enough, all of you! The {mf|baron|baroness} has been fighting to protect "
"us! I've {d|c22 Peasants Stayed}talked{/d} to {mf|him|her} personally! I've "
"seen how much {mf|he|she} cares! If we turn against each other, we're lost!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두들 그만해! {mf|남작|여남작}님은 우리를 보호하기 위해 싸워왔어! 내가 직접 {mf|그|그녀}와 {d|c22 Peasants Stayed}대화를{/d} "
"해봤다구! 그리고 난 남작님께서 우리를 얼마나 신경쓰시는지 알게됐어! 우리가 서로 대립한다면 우리는 길을 잃을 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_BridgeWoman
msgctxt "aac7c3f8-450c-411c-82a0-5ad56313e67b"
msgid ""
"\"You leave the {mf|baron|baroness} be! {mf|He|She} didn't even hesitate to "
"help out poor folk like me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님을|영주님을} 내버려 둬! {mf|그|그녀}는 나처럼 가난한 사람들을 돕는 일조차 "
"서슴지 않았다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "ff8ffe95-177d-4740-9eef-2e47383a3ccc"
msgid ""
"{n}The people before you look around at each other, nodding. You see a few "
"peasants turn and leave quietly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신 앞에 있는 사람들은 서로를 보며 끄덕입니다. 당신은 몇 명의 농민이 돌아서 조용히 나가는 것을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "764afbbe-0d53-45f7-9972-b5905cacf6b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Angry murmuring runs through the crowd. Some shake their fists at you, "
"others their weapons into the air.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}성난 불평 소리가 군중 속에서 나옵니다. 어떤 사람들은 주먹을 흔들고 다른 사람들은 무기를 허공에 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "072ff44b-52c9-4cc4-9c57-55b92540002d"
msgid ""
"\"A serpent's tongue! Clear sign of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}! Did she grant "
"you such cunning and hypocrisy in return for our lives?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뱀의 혀를 가졌구나! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 모습이 분명하다! 교활한 위선자여, 여신께서 뱀의 축복을 대가로 우리를 "
"제물로 요구하셨나!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K4
msgctxt "866e3af4-fe12-442e-b22f-5753095d95bd"
msgid ""
"\"It's true! {d|c22 Goblins Live}Goblins{/d} dart about everywhere, putting "
"up their filthy totems, and without a bit of fear! But it doesn't trouble "
"our {mf|baron|baroness} — no, they can just put up their vile idols anywhere "
"they want and carve honest people up for their wretched gods!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이다! {d|c22 Goblins Live}고블린들{/d}이 여기저기를 쏘다니며 두려움 없이 더러운 고블린 토템을 올리고 있어! "
"하지만 그런 건 우리 남작에겐 아무 문제꺼리도 되지 않는다. 아니, 오히려 고블린들이 원하는 곳 어디든 사악한 우상을 세우게 해주고 그 "
"끔직한 여신을 위해 우리 백성들을 분열시키고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K4
msgctxt "9975df34-233c-4b7e-8003-0037b9a2e7b3"
msgid ""
"\"You bite your tongue! Ever since our {mf|baron|baroness} {d|c22 Goblins "
"Killed}scattered{/d} the goblin tribe and stomped out their vile cult, "
"there's been not a word of the vermin!\""
msgstr ""
"\"닥쳐라! {mf|남작|여남작}의 공적으로 고블린 부족이 {d|c22 Goblins Killed} 뿔뿔이 흩어지고 {/d} 그들의 "
"사악한 숭배물은 부숴버렸고 그런 말은 나오지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K3
msgctxt "68df9a3b-ddbc-4384-b6ef-623cf67d1307"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear about the human cult of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}? They say "
"the {mf|baron|baroness} gave them {mf|his|her} {d|c22 Tsanna Lives}favor{/d} "
"and panders to their every whim!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 사교도들 얘기들었어? 남작이 그들에게 {d|c22 Tsanna Lives}호의{/d}를 "
"베풀고는 그들 기분이나 맞춰주고 있대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K3
msgctxt "5d3b5f81-0f2e-4ac6-abca-e0f6a5c84ac6"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear about the human cult of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}? The "
"{mf|baron|baroness} declared {d|c22 Tsanna Exiled}war{/d} on them! Our lands "
"are no place for wicked gods and their minions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 사교도들 얘기들었어? 남작이 그들에게 {d|c22 Tsanna Exiled}전쟁{/d}을 "
"선포했다구! 우리의 땅은 사악한 신들과 그 수하들을 위한 곳이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "5d506164-d595-4817-84a6-7c9372e25910"
msgid ""
"\"Just look at {mf|him|her}! Got a goblin right at {mf|his|her} side! Has "
"{mf|he|she} no shame, taking beasts like that into {mf|his|her} service?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|그|그녀}의 모습을 보아라! 바로 옆에 고블린 동료가 있다. 임무에 그런 짐승을 데리고 다니다니 부끄러운 줄 모르는군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "6db9bf17-2485-406f-b921-9db3f77f4b13"
msgid ""
"{n}As they listen to you, some of the people edge closer. Many nod in "
"agreement, and those who were shouting the loudest accusations turn their "
"eyes away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그들이 당신 말을 듣고 있을 때 일부 사람들은 더 가깝게 다가옵니다. 많은 사람들이 동의하며 가장 큰 비난을 외치던 사람들도 "
"수그러들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "9200e3ef-8b70-4b34-9090-44dadf51464a"
msgid ""
"{n}Angry murmuring runs through the crowd. It looks like it might erupt at "
"any moment.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}성난 불평 소리가 군중 속에서 나옵니다. 언제든지 분노가 폭발할 듯이 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "1f939a2c-706f-4ce4-84b2-a60cbbc1bdd3"
msgid ""
"{n}...which gives way to some awkward coughing and the shuffle of feet as "
"the crowd begins to disperse. Some risk a glance at you as they go, others "
"hide their faces as they hastily leave the square.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중들이 흩어지기 시작하자 어색한 기침 소리와 발걸음이 뒤섞인 소리가 들립니다. 어떤 이들은 가면서 위험을 무릅쓰고 당신을 흘끗 "
"쳐다보는가 하면, 또 어떤 이들은 서둘러 광장을 떠나면서 그들의 얼굴을 가리기도 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "a1cabf2f-77c7-4c6b-870a-4df42b409f0e"
msgid ""
"{n}...and then the people begin arguing among themselves. You manage to "
"catch bits and pieces of their conversations — some have given up on the "
"revolt, while others demand it continue. After a while, it becomes clear the "
"crowd has lost its fire. The people turn and leave, continuing to argue as "
"they do.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}... 사람들이 웅성거립니다. 들려오는 말로는 반란을 지지하는 사람 반, 포기하겠다는 사람이 반입니다. 얼마지 않아 군중의 기세가 "
"잠잠해집니다. 사람들은 돌아서 자리를 떠납니다. 반란을 계속할지 결론이 나지 않았기 때문입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "0d44c7aa-676f-4c57-a56e-fa07569e02f9"
msgid ""
"{n}...which explodes into furious shouting.{/n} \"Down with the "
"{mf|baron|baroness}! Death to the cursed fiend!\" {n}Waving clubs and "
"torches, the crowd turns on you to attack.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}... 그러다 누군가 분노에 차 외칩니다.{/n} \" 영주를 끌어내려라! 저주받은 악마에게 죽음을!\" {n}성난 군중이 몽둥이와 "
"횃불을 들고 파도처럼 몰려와 당신을 공격하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "4ab72ecb-c46d-473c-b82c-abc234b009c2"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod leans in.{/n} \"We've done all we can.\" {n} He turns to the crowd, "
"then presses his hands together in prayer.{/n} \"In the name of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, I beseech you — return to your homes, your families! "
"You've suffered enough — do not bring more strife upon yourselves!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드가 몸을 기울입니다.{/n} \"우리는 최선의 조치를 취했습니다.\" {n}그는 군중을 향해 손을 모으고 기도합니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 이름으로 간청합니다. 집으로 돌아가세요. 가족의 곁으로 돌아가 주십시오. 당신들이 겪은 슬픔과 "
"고초를 이해합니다. 반란은 지금보다 더한 불행을 불러올 뿐이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "e2e3ff71-429a-4048-b2cb-e1b6a0f7003e"
msgid ""
"\"Would you look at that! The {mf|baron|baroness} is trying to order us "
"around, what a surprise! Well, we're fed up with you and your orders! Get "
"off our lands while you're still in one piece!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 모습을 봐라! 우리에게 명령을 내리려는 {mf|남작|여남작}의 모습을. 놀랍군! 우린 너의 명령에 지긋지긋해! 팔다리가 붙어있을 "
"때 어서우리 땅을 떠나라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "c899b557-0994-4ae7-b386-33bf464299f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Your voice is drowned out by the crowd's uproar. The peasants in front "
"raise their torches, pitchforks, and clubs as they shout at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 목소리는 군중의 소동에 의해 묻힙니다. 농민들은 앞에서 횃불, 갈퀴, 몽둥이를 들고 소리칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "9c5545bb-62ad-4674-8bd8-c5093ebd93c7"
msgid ""
"\"I am Jhod Kavken, humble servant of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}. I may be "
"{mf|His|Her} Grace's confidant, but I am also one of you, the people of this "
"realm. The {mf|baron|baroness} is deeply concerned by your suffering, and "
"{mf|he|she} is doing everything in {mf|his|her} power to...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 종 조드 카브켄이다. 나는 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 측근이지만 또한 이 영지에서 "
"살아가는 너희와 같은 백성 중 한명이기도하다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서는 너희들의 고통을 깊이 걱정하고 계시며, 가능한 모든 "
"힘을 다해..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Doomsayer
msgctxt "2b93fe35-097b-46e8-89e5-9d439f4e51bb"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd is getting louder and louder. The people in front seem to be "
"slowly edging toward you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}군중의 목소리가 점점 더 커지고 있습니다. 앞에 있는 사람들이 당신쪽으로 천천히 다가오는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "ec1b212a-4421-4863-b7d4-8418db73b002"
msgid ""
"\"Silence! Let your ruler speak!\" {n}Jhod nods at you.{/n} \"Please go on, "
"Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조용! 통치자가 말씀할 기회를 드리자! {n}조드는 당신에게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"말씀하시죠, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "4f3aa4c5-b278-448c-8b80-fb31b7a0b829"
msgid ""
"\"Did you come here to hear yourselves talk? For shame! While you try to "
"figure out why you all gathered here, at least let the {mf|baron|baroness} "
"speak!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희들끼리 얘기하기 위해 이곳에 모인 건가? 수치스러운 줄 알아라! 너희들끼리 이곳에 왜 모인건지 논의를 할때 하더라도, 최소한 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 말씀도 들어봐야 하지 않겠나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "6ed297d0-edd3-4f4e-9593-bcf5b9456ac0"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} the merciful! Forgive them, they are caught up in "
"their own anger! Your Grace, they don't know what they're saying!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자비로운 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여! 저들을 용서하십시오. 군중들은 자신의 분노에 사로 잡혀있습니다! "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저들은 자신들이 무슨 말을 하는지도 모르고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "ce9e5933-8d6f-437f-8ef9-605e303adb08"
msgid ""
"{n}As the priest's speech comes to an end, a silence fills the air...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사제의 연설이 끝나고 침묵이 공기를 가득 채웁니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "15d35d1b-0be9-4c13-b197-4df2d01fadc4"
msgid ""
"{n}You look around in search of Remus, the mysterious old man who managed to "
"show up despite your best efforts to get rid of the instigator. It seems the "
"mad preacher managed to disappear in all the commotion.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}선동자를 없애기 위해 최선을 다했음에도 나타났던 신비한 노인 Remus를 찾아 주변을 둘러봅니다. 미친 설교자는 소동 속에서 사라진 "
"것으로 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0097_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "24959ec7-0742-4d5f-8af5-c05383682310"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, the crowd is silent. Then people start exchanging glances "
"and whispers. Some give you looks filled with fear and hate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 군중은 침묵합니다. 그런 다음 서로 시선과 속삭임을 교환하기 시작합니다. 어떤 사람들은 두려움과 증오로 가득 찬 모습을 "
"당신에게 보여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0101_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "161bd8ed-c003-4aae-b217-331d62e1cb29"
msgid ""
"{n}The people in the front row step back, pushing their companions backward "
"as well. Those who meet your gaze look away quickly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}앞줄에 있는 사람들은 뒤로 물러서서 동료들을 뒤쪽으로 밀어냅니다. 당신과 시선을 마주치는 사람들은 고개를 돌려버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "a9fce2c0-90dc-44c9-8b5f-a7ef87e1de3d"
msgid ""
"{n}The people before you exchange wary looks and back away. You notice a few "
"peasants hastily turn and leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞의 사람들이 조심스럽게 시선을 교환하고 물러납니다. 당신은 몇 명의 농민이 서둘러 돌아서 떠나는 것을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0123_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "af52f80d-4e82-4e23-b8b6-be72cb3e87d3"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd before you sways and mumbles: people look at one another, talk "
"in a hushed tone, shake their heads and frown. It seems rebels who were "
"screaming and jeering a minute ago alost all their confidence. Finally, one "
"of the peasants opens his mouth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 있는 군중들은 동요하며 웅성거립니다. 군중들은 서로를 바라보며 고개를 가로젓기도하고 숨죽여 말하듯 수근거립니다. 방금 "
"전만 해도 고함을 지르며 경멸을 보내던 군중들은 모두 기세를 잃은듯 했습니다. 마침내 농민 중 한 명이 입을 엽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "14a71312-aa48-4e3e-9566-7d814d50c4d4"
msgid "\"... The {mf|baron|baroness} is right.\""
msgstr "\"... {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 말이 옳아. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0125_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "6d6dffb9-f41a-4a43-809a-f9b9b4f01434"
msgid "\"You really believe this? It's pure nonsense!\""
msgstr "\"정말 이딴 말을 믿는 거야? 말도 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0126_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "c758d2de-49d5-40d2-b50d-d990fc6f12bb"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you get it? We could run the {mf|baron|baroness} through, but it "
"wouldn't change a thing! {mf|He's|She's} of more use alive than dead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어? 우리는 {mf|남작|여남작}의 몸에 칼을 꽂을 수 있지만, 그걸로는 변하지 않을 거야! 이 사람은 죽이는 것보다 살려두는게 "
"더 쓸모 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0127_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K1
msgctxt "3b8d531f-f23c-4d1f-b2dd-523d74e54b14"
msgid ""
"\"So be it, {mf|baron|baroness}, we'll let you pass. But don't forget — "
"we're trusting you with our lives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩔 수 없지. 남작, 우리는 당신을 보내드리죠. 하지만 잊지 마십시오. 우리의 목숨을 걸고 당신을 믿기로 한 거라는걸. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0128_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K3
msgctxt "773609e7-d240-474a-b0c3-0914b5872096"
msgid "\"Find the source! Save our children from this terrible sickness!\""
msgstr "\"근원을 찾아내! 우리 아이들을 이 끔찍한 병에서 구해내라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0129_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K2
msgctxt "fbd035b7-0dce-4a48-a01b-72bb00ee2b54"
msgid ""
"\"The old man's right! The {mf|baron|baroness} is cursed! If we let "
"{mf|him|her} go now, we'll all find our graves tomorrow!\""
msgstr ""
"\"노인이 옳다! {mf|남작|여남작}은 저주받았다! {mf|그|그녀}가 가도록 두면 우리는 모두 무덤에 묻히는 신세가 될 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0130_Text
#. Speaker : AngryMob_K3
msgctxt "eacdf141-08ff-47b4-98de-45301a01d939"
msgid ""
"\"An if we don't let {mf|him|her} go, we'll be mangled one by one by them "
"beasts that tear out of the sick! This goddess of yours no one's seen — what "
"help will she be then?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 {mf|그|그녀}를 보내지 않으면 질병에서 생겨난 괴물들이 우리를 갈가리 찢어놓을 것이다! 아무도 보지 못한 너희 여신은 어떤 "
"도움을 주겠나?! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0131_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Doomsayer
msgctxt "6da83750-16d2-429d-9287-3ed9b9b237fe"
msgid ""
"\"Pitiful fools! You doom yourselves by entrusting yourselves to the one who "
"angered the great goddess!\""
msgstr "\"불쌍한 바보들이여! 위대한 여신을 분노시킨 자에게 자신을 맡기다니 파멸할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0133_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_AngryMob
msgctxt "cf46043e-5d11-46ed-9b4f-6f2ecd0160e1"
msgid "\"Are you out of your mind, Your Grace?! This is inhuman!\""
msgstr "\"정신나가셨습니까, {mf|영주님|영주님}? 이건 인간이 할 짓이 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0134_Text
#. Speaker : Kesten_AngryMob
msgctxt "2fdd5ff3-9222-4c54-b598-ab14647899ff"
msgid ""
"\"Jhod, the time for words is done. Guards! Didn't you hear your "
"{mf|baron|baroness}? Carry out your orders!\""
msgstr "\"조드. 말로 통할 시간은 지났습니다. 경비대! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 말이 안들리나? 명령을 수행하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_Lynching/Cue_0136_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Doomsayer
msgctxt "3b4b11de-87f7-4a56-a115-474b616d78a2"
msgid ""
"\"I am the voice and sight of the goddess, Her loyal servant and herald of "
"Her will! Your words are nothing against Her commands! Your orders are ashes "
"against Her prophecies. The day is nigh when this disgusting city will be "
"swallowed by the other world, and I cry out to all who can hear me: Repent, "
"fools! Repent, for the reckoning of your avarice is nigh! None of you know "
"the forces you're dealing with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여신의 목소리이자 눈인 그녀의 충성스러운 종이자 그녀의 뜻을 알리는 전령관이다. 너의 말은 그녀의 명령에 어긋나지 않는다. 너의 "
"명령은 그녀의 예언에 대한 재이다. 이 역겨운 도시가 다른 세계에 의해 삼켜 질 날이 가까워지니 내 말을 들을 수 있는 모든 사람들에게 "
"부르짖어야겠다. 회개하라! 어리석은 자들아! 회개하라. 너의 욕망을 치룰 때가 가까워졌다! 네가 마주친 것이 누구인지 너희는 모른다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5e73d46b-cbed-4d0d-837d-a07be5bb75de"
msgid ""
"Killed the peasants after hearing their conversation about leaving the "
"barony."
msgstr "남작령을 떠나는 것에 대한 대화를 듣고 농민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "892a13c1-f0d3-4a8f-8783-a3ef5976e31d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll teach you some manners!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너에게 예절을 가르쳐 주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c07333ac-e2ef-4d45-94ea-f5b184fe9efd"
msgid "Convinced the peasants to stay in the barony."
msgstr "농민들이 영지에 머물 것을 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "bdd9b31d-84de-4eaa-b9c1-2eafc1cb79b8"
msgid ""
"\"I understand that you are worried about your close ones and yourself. But "
"hear me — without loyal, upstanding people by my side, I can never rescue "
"this realm from the evils plaguing it. If you stay, I swear — I'll do "
"everything in my power to put an end to this madness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희들이 자신과 주변 사람들을 걱정하고 있다는 걸 잘 알고 있다. 하지만 잘 들어라. 내 옆에 충실하고 정직한 사람들이 없다면 나는 "
"악의 괴롭힘으로부터 이 땅을 결코 구해낼 수 없다. 만약 너희들이 이 땅에 남겠다면, 난 맹세코 이 광기를 끝내기 위해 모든 힘을 "
"다하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8eba00c5-55a9-4b7c-96a8-54bf499003da"
msgid "Decided not to get involved in your subjects' decisions."
msgstr "백성의 결정에 연루하지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ffb0ffdf-35d3-441e-9e99-8b48915f9566"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot make this decision for you. As the ruler of this realm, I do all "
"I can to keep you and your families from harm's way. These are troubled "
"times, and we are all working hard to restore order and bring peace. "
"However, only you can decide whether you will stay, for I have no power over "
"the hearts of others, nor seek to command them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너희들을 위해 대신 결정을 내려줄 수는 없다. 난 이 영지의 통치자로서, 너와 네 가족들이 위험에 빠지지 않도록 내가 할 수 "
"있는 모든 일을 하고있다. 지금은 어려운 시기이고, 우리는 질서를 회복하고 평화를 가져오기 위해 열심히 노력하고 있다. 하지만 이곳에 "
"남을것인지는 오직 너 자신만이 결정할 수 있다. 나는 다른 이들의 마음을 지배할 수도 없을 뿐더러, 그들에게 명령을 하길 원치도 않는다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5a66dbd9-c8f7-4dd7-9d80-d456a18da101"
msgid "Dismissed the concerns your subjects had about staying in the barony."
msgstr "영지에 머무르는 것에 대해 걱정하는 백성들의 우려를 일축했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "a4347c7b-d5e2-4b97-af70-43d257035024"
msgid ""
"\"Enough! You wish to flee — then go! The less cowards among my subjects, "
"the better!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 도망가기를 원한다면 가라! 나의 백성 중에 겁쟁이는 적을 수록 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "84458e19-f97d-439d-b849-0ab25ac91899"
msgid ""
"\"Stop yelling and listen to me! I'm trying to talk some sense into you!\""
msgstr "\"그만 말대꾸 하고 내 말을 들어! 너를 설득하려 노력하고 있잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt2
msgctxt "c709e1dd-c42d-4eae-8887-caa7ca944515"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing to talk about, Alov! This is my home! Here I was born, and "
"it is here I die!\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 말해 봐야 소용 없어. 알로브! 여기가 내 고향이야! 나는 여기서 태어났고 여기서 죽을꺼라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "e58cd21e-d35c-464f-9161-5b39a59cd14f"
msgid ""
"\"You dolt! That's what I'm saying — you stay, and you'll die before your "
"time! Can't you see what's going on? Monsters, goblins, and bandits! Turn "
"your back for a moment, and there's some fiend crawling right out of your "
"neighbor's entrails!\""
msgstr ""
"\"멍청아! 내 말이 바로 그거야. 네가 여기서 계속 머무른다면 제 명에 못 살아! 무슨 일이 일어나는지 모르겠어? 괴물, 고블린, "
"도적들이 사방에 판을 치고 있어! 게다가 이젠 뒤돌아보면, 이웃들 창자를 찢고 기어나오는 악마들까지 있다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt2
msgctxt "15577076-f88e-440e-af07-255b1b7aaea1"
msgid ""
"\"You talk too much. Just do your work, pray to {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, and "
"stay close to your home and family — that's all there is to it. We've seen "
"worse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 말이 너무 많아. 가서 네 일이나 하고 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}에게 기도하면서 집과 가족들 옆에 있어 주기나 해. "
"할일은 그게 전부라고. 우리는 더 심한 것도 봐왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "76d0c021-4209-483a-a6b5-4246ad6461cf"
msgid ""
"\"Aye, back when you were half your age and unmarried! Erick, old friend, "
"think of Jenni and your little ones. What if some beast comes knocking at "
"your door? You're a woodcutter, not a swordsman. We have to leave the barony "
"while we still can!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 결혼도 안했던 젊었을때 처럼 얘기하는군! 에릭. 이 친구야. 제니와 어린 자식들을 생각해 봐. 왠 짐승이 너희 집 문을 "
"두드리면 어쩔셈인가? 너는 병사가 아니라 나무꾼이야. 도망칠 수 있을 때 남작령을 떠나야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt2
msgctxt "2727b18c-d55d-4404-9a26-c1dade076dbb"
msgid "\"I... Erastil have mercy! Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"난...에라스틸이시여 자비를 베풀길! 영주님 아니십니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "aa7b33df-e8b6-4b10-98a1-a56a6fd6122c"
msgid ""
"\"F-forgiveness, Your Grace! We were... we were just discussing the crops..."
"\""
msgstr "\"용, 용서하십시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저희는 단지 농작물에 대해 얘기하고 있었습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "85df53d6-5b57-4356-a701-029eeb1fcb8d"
msgid ""
"{n}Both men listen to you quietly, then look to each other, then clumsily "
"bow to you.{/n} \"We... understand, Your Grace. These are tough times, "
"indeed, and there are things... all sorts of things you have to deal with. "
"Don't you go listening to fools — the loyal and true will stand by your side!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두 사람은 당신 말을 경청하다가 서로를 멀뚱히 바라보고는 어색한 동작으로 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"저희는... 이해합니다, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 힘든 시기죠... 별의별 일이 다 있었고요. 중요한 일이 산더미처럼 있으실 텐데 멋모르는 무지렁이 "
"떠드는 소리는 귀 담아 듣지 마십시오. 진실로 충성하는 백성들은 전하 편에 설 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt2
msgctxt "e24c66f4-36f3-4558-8a05-df450656f7e1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh... Your Grace... How could we ever leave you, when we see how hard you "
"work?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아... {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}... 당신께서 얼마나 열심히 일하는지 저희가 아는데, 우리가 어떻게 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 곁을 떠날 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "af7aa584-0c20-488f-9d75-53f6e4c3b0ef"
msgid "{n}The men glare at you, but they hold their tongues.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그 남자들은 당신을 말 없이 보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "3950e929-18f6-402e-bbb2-d17d5dda138e"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive my words, Your Grace... I'm a simple man... {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} "
"didn't see fit to grant me courage, so off I go, blabbering about Erastil "
"knows what... You know how it is...\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 한말을 용서해주십시오. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}... 저는 단순한 사람입니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}은 "
"제게 용기를 주지 않았고, 그래서 저는 밖에서, 에라스틸에 대해서 아는 것을 지껄였던... 뭔지 아시지 않습니까... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt2
msgctxt "2a202972-090a-4b77-a123-cd6a10a083ab"
msgid ""
"\"Let's go. Let the baron{mf||ess} go about {mf|his|her} business. We've got "
"our own jobs to do. Don't you worry, Your Grace! I don't know about the "
"others, but we'll be by you to the end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가자. {mf||여}남작께서 일하시게 나가 드리자구. 우린 우리대로 할 일이 있잖아. 걱정하지 마십시오. "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 다른 사람들은 몰라도 저희는 끝까지 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 곁에 있을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PeasantArgument/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : PeasantInDoubt1
msgctxt "d7c6bbad-db23-4d5f-a840-441f0812172e"
msgid ""
"{n}The men exchange glances, and after a moment they nod at you — but their "
"faces are troubled and uncertain.{/n} \"As you wish, Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자들은 시선을 교환하고 잠시 후 당신에게 끄덕입니다. 그러나 그들의 얼굴은 불안하고 불확실합니다.{/n} \"물론입죠, 영주님.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "2ad2e006-5357-4e10-869a-1446784152c8"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6fff547d-928c-4c2a-b782-c83d97dbddf2"
msgid "\"I'm so happy to see you again, Lady Belavarah!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 다시 만나서 너무 기쁘다. 빌라바라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "621aa7a1-66d4-4e5f-9be6-33c716cc6ce0"
msgid "Ordered guards to stop bard's Annamede performance."
msgstr "경비병에게 음유시인 안나미데의 공연을 멈추라고 지시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4b9829b3-ec7e-4341-bd23-533537b1390a"
msgid "\"Guards! Put an end to this illegal gathering immediately.\""
msgstr "\"경비원들! 이 불법 집회를 즉시 끝내라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "7c80c755-8b70-43f6-b004-b1859f2afa27"
msgid "[Watch and do not get involved]"
msgstr "[감시하지만 개입하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1ee67585-9d9f-486c-a294-85150aba3a76"
msgid "Asked bard Annamede to be more close tongued in her songs."
msgstr "음유 시인 안나미데에게 입조심하라고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "21f67efa-d7de-47d1-b918-9619048ae1ec"
msgid "\"Lady Belavarah, you should be more respectful in your statements.\""
msgstr "\"레이디 빌라바라. 당신의 언사에 좀 더 존중을 담아 주셔야 겠소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b3ad83cf-9d13-42df-a632-09c1f0b89556"
msgid "Approved bard's Annamede sarcastic song."
msgstr "음유시인 안나미데의 풍자시를 허용합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "2e708651-decc-4ce1-9c81-e89352a216f1"
msgid "\"And in my opinion the song is great!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 내 생각에 그 노래는 훌륭하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6b5cc0ce-fc38-41ea-b2a6-1b88217897b0"
msgid "Supported bard's freedom of singing any songs they want."
msgstr "바드가 원하는 노래를 자유롭게 노래할 수 있도록 지원했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "be8540b5-0e97-44c9-aa2e-f56637c03fd6"
msgid "\"Bards can sing whatever they like. We cannot punish them for that.\""
msgstr "\"음유 시인은 좋아하는 것을 노래할 수 있다. 우리는 그걸로 그들을 처벌할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0831dce0-cce8-4ec7-9d1f-3507c88b883a"
msgid "Ordered guards to arrest bard Annamede."
msgstr "경비에게 안나미데를 체포하라고 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "8677ef3d-82ac-47b0-9ba6-1c29fe8f8263"
msgid "\"I won't tolerate that! Guards, seize her!\""
msgstr "\"참아주기 힘들군! 경비대! 그녀를 체포하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "69aa0da8-5dfe-4264-b175-e10c72b0ac4c"
msgid "\"It would be my pleasure to visit this tournament.\""
msgstr "\"기꺼이 토너먼트에 들르도록 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "da09bfc7-42eb-44eb-90b2-96fd8d30b0ed"
msgid "\"I'll think about your offer.\""
msgstr "\"고려해 보겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "38ad1b8c-6f60-4e69-9fbe-f2965a7ac4bc"
msgid "\"What is this Rushlight Tournament?\""
msgstr "\"러시라이트 토너먼트가 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "1513a418-ce81-413b-a8d9-5b5e0a411fdc"
msgid "\"I'm afraid I must decline the invitation.\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 초대를 거절해야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3ea3547a-d278-4c54-96fd-4edc2af00882"
msgid "Ordered guards to arrest bard Annamede."
msgstr "경비에게 안나미데를 체포하라고 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "c3fc2385-3d2d-4864-9d5d-2731075d2d37"
msgid "\"Your insolence grows tiresome. Guards, arrest her!\""
msgstr "\"너의 무례함에 지쳤다. 경비원. 그녀를 체포하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e2b96fed-4702-489a-9909-54dd1bc11fff"
msgid "Attacked Annamede in public."
msgstr "사람들이 보는 앞에서 안나미데를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "2b581490-c1d7-4351-bdd0-3a12c1bdf3b3"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Who wanted a performance? I've got one for you — and it's going "
"to be bloody!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"공연을 하고싶나? 너에게 공연을 하나 맡기지. 피로 물든 공연을 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/BardDisap_Citizen1_String
msgctxt "04fc8482-743b-4d88-8fc7-991deed95ee1"
msgid "\"So where did she go?\""
msgstr "\"어디갔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/BardDisap_Citizen2_String
msgctxt "601fd30b-feca-48b6-b154-3e2c78259e10"
msgid "\"Wow, that was some trick!\""
msgstr "\"신출귀몰하군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/BardDisap_Citizen3_String
msgctxt "65211443-2e34-456d-bc8c-11910c478b63"
msgid "\"I wish I could disappear like that… when I'm returning home drunk!\""
msgstr "\"나도 저렇게 사라지고 싶다... 술마시고 집에 갈때 편할텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/BardGoodbuy_citizen1_String
msgctxt "07fe5203-d21e-4e16-9fda-3c67d7ed4d55"
msgid "\"So, everything's over already? And I just got here!\""
msgstr "\"벌써 끝났어? 나는 이제 왔는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/BardGoodbuy_citizen2_String
msgctxt "b4f85564-baa8-4f20-9615-e7f3152c7816"
msgid ""
"\"Come back again, sweet nightingale! I'd be happy to listen to you every "
"day!\""
msgstr "\"돌아와 주오, 달콤한 꾀꼬리여! 당신의 목소리를 매일 듣고 싶소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/BardGoodbuy_citizen3_String
msgctxt "50e8eafd-12d6-417c-9f80-fa4fd43b6c92"
msgid "\"And she didn't do a single love ballad! Damn.\""
msgstr "\"아직 사랑노래는 한 곡도 안 불렀는데! 젠장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/Start_Annameda_String
msgctxt "9f634049-9184-4038-9a87-5cb23e264815"
msgid ""
"\"Though trickery fills our stories and lines,\n"
"What lies between them is not always a lie!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기만으로 채워버린 이야기와 가사지만,\n"
"거짓으로 치부하긴 아까운 것도 있는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/Start_citizen1_String
msgctxt "30f3a941-e07e-4ac9-b1f6-88405aebc890"
msgid "\"Such a good singer!\""
msgstr "\"대단한 가수야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/Start_citizen2_String
msgctxt "4bedaa62-6282-4807-9178-55400e210622"
msgid "\"And what about a love song? Something to make our souls weep!\""
msgstr "\"사랑노래는 또 어떻고? 심금을 울리는 뭔가가 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Barks/Start_citizen3_String
msgctxt "0498bbf7-ccb3-4a15-a88e-debca8857c92"
msgid "\"More! Give us more! I haven't laughed so hard in a long time!\""
msgstr "\"더! 더 불러줘! 이렇게 웃어본게 얼마만인지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8e148f27-f745-4ee3-b266-64fdeeea6681"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede Belavarah, the charming bard from {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, stands "
"before you with a lute in her hands, surrounded by a crowd of the capital's "
"citizens. In a moment she notices you, and blows you a kiss.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}수도 시민들이 몰려든 곳에는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 매력적인 음유시인 안나미데 빌라바라가 류트를 들고 서 있었습니다. "
"당신이 그녀 앞에 서자 그녀는 당신을 알아보더니 키스를 날려 보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "e3b602f5-8b77-45fc-bb4e-ce9bc14c0260"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede gives you a warm smile.{/n} \"Your Grace, you're so preoccupied "
"with matters of war and state, but someone has to think about spiritual "
"matters as well. None of the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} can match "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} in the fields of art. Who better than our bards and "
"artists, to bring the gift of song to the people of this young barony?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데는 당신에게 따뜻한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"남작님, 전쟁과 국정에만 너무 몰두하셨네요. 영적인 문제도 신경쓰셨어야죠. "
"예술에서라면 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 중 어디라도 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와 견줄수 없답니다. 이 젊은 "
"남작령의 백성들에게 노래의 즐거움을 선사하는데 우리 음유시인과 예술가들 보다 나은 사람이 과연 누가 있을련지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "30712ead-12cf-4217-86b0-d10ade41ee5d"
msgid ""
"\"The feeling is mutual, Your Grace! Our last meeting was so… unforgettable."
"\" {n}Annamede smiles with the corner of her lips.{/n} \"I'm happy to visit "
"your lands once again, and bring the gift of art to your people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"동감이에요, 남작님! 우리의 지난번 만남은 정말... 잊을 수 없었어요.\" {n}안나미데는 입꼬리를 올려 미소를 지었습니다.{/n} "
"\"다시 한번 당신의 땅을 다시 방문하게 되어, 그리고 당신의 백성들에게 예술의 선물을 선사해주게 되어 기쁘네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d493afdd-99a5-47b6-b381-a6ca135c92d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi blushes.{/n} \"M-m-maestro Belavarah! I'm so happy to see you here! "
"But... Why are your songs so cruel?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지의 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"마에스트로 빌라바라! 만나서 너무 기뻐요! 하지만... 왜 이렇게 신랄한 노래를 부르는 거죠?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Kassil
msgctxt "2e551778-38c3-486f-a18f-32ff7360f2a4"
msgid ""
"\"Our charming Annamede might wish to tell the {mf|baron|baroness} what kind "
"of so-called \"art\" she's chosen to entertain {mf|his|her} subjects with. "
"In her first song, she praised King Irovetti — and the second song was about "
"a certain lady from {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, who fostered a street pup, dressed "
"it in lace and velvet, and trained it to mimic the manners of court. I find "
"these allusions inappropriate and offensive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 아름다운 안나미데는 {mf|남작|여남작}님의 영지에서 그녀가 소위 \"예술\"이라 부르는 것을 백성들에게 알려주고자 합니다. "
"첫 번째 노래에서 그녀는 이로베티 왕을 칭송했습니다. 그리고 두 번째 노래는 어릴 때 거리를 떠돌다 레이스와 벨벳으로 옷을 입고 궁정의 "
"예절을 배운 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 어느 여자에 대한 이야기입니다. 저는 이 암시가 부적절하고 공격적이라고 생각합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Shandra
msgctxt "4df4feb5-40de-40c3-a562-bf2618fd36a5"
msgid ""
"\"Our esteemed {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} guest should be more moderate in "
"singing the praises of her sovereign. — Let alone the songs hinting at the "
"life of {g|King Noleski Surtova}King Noleski{/g} and his unwillingness to "
"marry! The alliance between our barony and {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} is "
"inviolable, and it mustn't be put into question by offending the royal "
"person from {g|House Surtova}House Surtova{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 존경하는 {g|pitax} 피탁스{/g} 손님은 자기 주군을 올바르게 찬양하는 법을 배워야 겠습니다. 감히 {g|King "
"Noleski Surtova}놀레스키 전하{/g}의 삶과 비혼주의를 빗댄 노래를 부르다니요! 우리 남작령과 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 동맹을 흔들게 두어선 안 됩니다. {g|House Surtova} 서토바 {/g} 왕실 모독을 "
"방치하는 건 문제가 될 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Lander
msgctxt "f9e1e4e1-d96a-4349-ab52-b7d378b4eda5"
msgid ""
"\"Let her tell us all about her so called \"art\"! She began her performance "
"with hails to King Irovetti, and continued with a song about a certain young "
"noble from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, who searched the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} in hopes of finding a potion of wisdom, which was supposed to make "
"him smarter — but instead, by mistake he always found and drank potions of "
"conceit! The name of the hero in the song was Rander Rebeda.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 여자가 소위 \"예술 \"을 하게 내버려 두자고! 처음엔 이로베티 찬양으로 공연을 시작하더니, 곧이어 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 어떤 젊은 귀족에 관한 노래를 부르더군. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 헤매며 "
"지혜의 물약을 찾으려다 실수로 기만의 물약을 발견하고 마신 이야기였는데, 글쎄 그 노래의 주인공의 이름이 바로 랜더 레베다라던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "a7b0ba81-dd7a-4fcc-8d80-43098e1ecdbb"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede doesn't seem too eager to continue her show.{/n} \"Your Grace, "
"it's such a pleasure to see you! Today is a beautiful day, and I've decided "
"to add to it with a pinch of poetry.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데는 그다지 공연을 계속하려는 생각이 없는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"남작님, 뵙게되서 기뻐요! 이 아름다운 날에 제가 시 한 "
"구절 얹어 보도록 할게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "7c74de42-264c-401a-929f-5a7e60060e00"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede gives you a graceful bow.{/n} \"I will be happy to perform this "
"song personally for Your Grace — if you would honor the Rushlight Tournament "
"in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} with your presence!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데는 당신에게 우아한 인사를 올립니다.{/n} \"이 노래를 남작님께 직접 들려드릴 수 있다면 기쁠 거예요. "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 러시라이트 토너먼트에 참가해주신다면 그리 되겠지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "baba3db8-83b4-4676-b853-e6bc8f816a58"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede gives you a graceful bow.{/n} \"These are the words of a true "
"ruler! Your Grace, you should visit the Rushlight Tournament in "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. You can see for yourself what freedom and esteem our "
"bards enjoy in my homeland. And, of course, your subjects will be able to "
"prove themselves in various competitions!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데는 당신에게 우아한 인사를 올립니다.{/n} \"그야말로 진정한 통치자의 언사시네요! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 "
"러시라이트 토너먼트에 꼭 와주셔야 해요. 우리 음유시인이 피탁스에서 누리는 자유와 존경이 어느 정도인지 보실 수 있을테니. 물론, "
"신하들로 하여금 다양한 대회에서 그 능력을 선보이도록 하실 수도 있고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "356795b9-668c-4867-9f73-ddfa63edefa1"
msgid ""
"\"My dear {mf|Baron|Baroness}, I'm just a humble bard, and my songs are just "
"an innocent way to make people smile and lighten their moods. Though if "
"someone feels offended by my show, that \"someone\" can always demand "
"satisfaction from me at the Rushlight Tournament in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. It's "
"an honest competition — words against words, talent against talent. That's "
"the place where one may demonstrate his or her prowess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"친애하는 남작님. 저는 단지 하찮은 음유시인이며 제 노래는 사람들을 미소 짓고 기분을 밝게 해줄 뿐이랍니다. 누군가 제 쇼에 불쾌감을 "
"느낀다면 그 \"누군가\"는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 러시라이트 토너먼트에서 만족스러운 공연을 요구할 수 있어요. 이건 말 대 "
"말, 재능 대 재능의 정정당당한 경쟁이에요. 이곳은 자신의 실력을 뽐낼 수 있는 장소죠. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "e7439348-f2b2-4f27-b3ec-5c880926e9f3"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede takes a step back and looks at you with disapproval.{/n} \"Is "
"that all you can do? Pitting your fighters against a lonely bard? I wish I "
"could see your heroes perform at the Rushlight Tournament in "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데는 한 발 뒤로 물러나서 동의하지 않는다는 의미로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"이게게 당신이 할 수 있는 전부인가요? "
"음유시인 홀로 병사들과 싸우게 하는 것이? 당신의 영웅들이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 열리는 러시라이트 토너먼트에서 활약할 모습을 "
"보기를 바랬는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "732cb6e8-fe32-4f13-b93c-507de45acfbe"
msgid ""
"\"I still hope you'll change your mind, Your Grace. You'll truly be welcome "
"in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\" {n}Annamede sighs with the genuine regret and bids "
"you farewell.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나중에라도 마음을 바꾸셨으면 좋겠네요. 분명 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 환영받으실 거예요!\" {n}안나미데는 진심 어린 "
"안타까움을 내비치며 작별 인사를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "5ea7db46-7631-46cb-9644-66a171de9e8d"
msgid ""
"\"How could you not know? This is one of the greatest {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} "
"traditions! Once every few years the king announces the date of the "
"tournament. We greet guests from all around the {g|River Kingdoms}River "
"Kingdoms{/g} on the banks of the {g|Rushlight river}Rushlight River{/g}. The "
"whole day of the Tournament is full of mirth and the spirit of competition. "
"Everyone has a chance to prove themselves: fighters, archers, singers, "
"storytellers, and even fans of strong drinks — the drinking competition is "
"an important part of the program!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 모를 수 있죠? {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 가장 위대한 전통 중 하나에요! 수년에 한 번 왕은 토너먼트 날짜를 발표해요. "
"우리는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 전역에서 찾아온 손님들을 {g|Rushlight river}러시라이트 강{/g}"
"가에서 맞이해요. 토너먼트 기간은 환희와 경쟁 정신으로 가득하죠. 싸움꾼, 궁수, 가수, 이야기꾼, 심지어 술을 좋아하는 사람들까지 "
"모두가 자신을 증명할 기회가 있어요. 특히 술마시기 대회는 토너먼트에서 상당히 중요한 부분이고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "fbbf272d-8456-4838-a4c7-99d4a3c84183"
msgid ""
"\"King Irovetti will be happy to hear this! See you in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, "
"then, Your Grace.\" {n}The bard gives you a teasing glance from under her "
"eyelashes, and then she bows and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티 왕이 이 소식을 듣게 되어 기쁘실 겁니다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 봐요, 전하!\" {n}바드는 속눈썹 아래에서 "
"매혹적인 눈길을 던져 주고는 절을 하고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "39daa25f-ab56-41ed-a1d3-53313704a723"
msgid ""
"\"I still hope to see you again — in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! Until we meet "
"again, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"저는 아직도 당신을 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 다시 만날 수 있기를 바래요! 우리가 다시 만날 때까지 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogue_PitaxBard/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "c74f11e9-2d27-493e-831e-557a5e4eb7d3"
msgid ""
"{n}The bard shakes her head in disapproval.{/n} \"Pitting your fighters "
"against a lonely bard? You should find another way to show your prowess, "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}음유시인은 거절의 뜻으로 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"음유시인을 홀로 전사들과 싸우게 한다고요? 당신은 실력을 보여줄 다른 방법을 "
"찾아야겠어요. {mf|남작|여남작}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/TableDenied_String
msgctxt "68716f5c-fd36-4614-8537-44427deb69ad"
msgid "Now is not the time for kingdom management!"
msgstr "지금은 왕국을 통치할 적절한 때가 아닙니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f3069b02-ab4b-47be-88ed-41270c119960"
msgid "Received the crown for granted."
msgstr "왕관을 당연한 듯이 받았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d42f4a2e-9d58-4937-b258-95604187a139"
msgid ""
"\"I can't wait to finally wear the crown, and claim everything that "
"rightfully belongs to me.\""
msgstr "\"어서 왕관을 쓰고, 마땅히 내게 속해야 할 모든 것에 대한 주권을 선포하고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "71048a52-c3ef-4086-acd3-cdac0b708268"
msgid "Received the crown indifferently."
msgstr "왕관을 무심하게 받았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "8b4f6cbf-8d70-413d-9e23-0d010365426f"
msgid ""
"\"Will anything really change? I will continue to personally fight bandits "
"and kill monsters, protecting my lands from demon knows what troubles.\""
msgstr "\"왕이 된다고 달라질 게 있나? 나는 앞으로도 직접 도적과 싸우고 괴물을 죽이고, 골칫거리 악마들로부터 내 땅을 지킬텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "017e5fbc-3e35-4216-b692-e991c7e8faa9"
msgid "Brushed coronation aside."
msgstr "대관식은 제쳐둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "b22ff694-a86d-470c-9301-2dc8f9d9f1a9"
msgid "\"The whole coronation is just a stupid formality.\""
msgstr "\"대관식은 단지 쓸 데없는 겉치레일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e0a19276-83b6-448f-a5b3-cbd6aeda76c5"
msgid ""
"\"Our alliance is just a formality, fixed on a piece of paper. Let's not "
"bother each other, and mind our own business.\""
msgstr "\"공식 문서에는 동맹이라 적어두겠지만, 그냥 서로 괴롭히지 말고 자기 일이나 신경씁시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0054_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0ca5f90d-16da-4483-865c-a4c7ee8c2a01"
msgid "Received the crown as an honorable burden."
msgstr "왕관을 영예로운 의무로 받았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "ee0be8e3-bec0-401b-ba8d-6cbd92817981"
msgid "\"I will accept this crown, and rule for the benefit of my subjects.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 왕관을 받아들이고 내 백성의 이익을 위해 통치하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "59b6fa74-79b4-4668-9f8a-b779bb709e9c"
msgid ""
"\"I promised to act as a mediating power between Surtova and Aldori, and I "
"shall keep my word. I have many ideas on how we can strengthen our alliance —"
" we can discuss them later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 서토바와 알도리 사이의 중재자 역할을 하겠다고 약속했고 그 말을 지킬 것이오. 우리 동맹을 강화하는 방법에 많이 생각해두었지. "
"이건 나중에 얘기합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Courtier_01_String
msgctxt "acc5c687-8b98-431b-b82a-814d73b2689e"
msgid "\"Your Grace, hurry! Your people await!\""
msgstr "\"남작님! 서두르십시오! 백성들이 기다리고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Courtier_02_String
msgctxt "cb080fc7-5aa0-40b1-84ee-bfe7c3794dc8"
msgid "\"We are ready for the coronation. They wait for you outside!\""
msgstr "\"대관식 준비가 끝났습니다. 밖에 기다리는 사람이 많습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Courtier_03_String
msgctxt "5ed3ff9e-b272-4b40-9211-3e18bf73b5ef"
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations, Your Grace! There's a huge crowd gathered outside. — It "
"is time you address them!\""
msgstr "\"경하드립니다! 남작님! 사람들이 아주 많이 모였습니다. 남작님의 연설을 기다리고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Jamandi_String
msgctxt "effe19de-c3d4-4884-a554-671926b8680e"
msgid "\"Well, don't be shy! Go, and meet your subjects!\""
msgstr "\"자, 부끄러워하지 마시오! 가서 당신의 백성들을 맞이합시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Jhod_String
msgctxt "ad8e931e-9d60-4ab5-b90c-630fcdad8853"
msgid "\"Enough stalling, Your Grace. The people won't wait for you forever!\""
msgstr "\"머뭇거리지 마십시오. 백성들을 영원히 세워둘 수는 없잖습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Kesten_String
msgctxt "66620e68-ee19-465b-bd9a-9c5e5db21daf"
msgid ""
"\"I can't wait to see the ceremony! I've never attended a coronation before."
"\""
msgstr "\"어서 대관식을 보고 싶습니다! 대관식에 참석하는 건 난생 처음입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Barks/Surtova_String
msgctxt "6017c295-3097-48f0-8e08-f3ad34eabf7f"
msgid "\"Enough talk. It's time for the ceremony to commence.\""
msgstr "\"얘기는 그만하고. 대관식을 시작합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "f42626ce-5d7e-4df8-a1cd-8a6c2d48cd9a"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi Aldori gazes at the throne room, as if taking in every detail.{/n}"
" \"A feast in the royal hall is a welcome {d|c41 Choose Aldori}change{/d} "
"after so many blood-soaked battlefields. It appears everyone is going above "
"and beyond to ensure your coronation ceremony is as fine as we have in "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디 알도리는 마치 하나하나 뜯어보듯 알현실을 응시합니다.{/n} \"수많은 피를 흘렸던 전쟁이 끝나고 왕궁에서 잔치를 벌이는 건 "
"환영할 만한 {d|c41 Choose Aldori}변화{/d}지. 수많은 사람이 우리가 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 치렀던 "
"것처럼 훌륭한 대관식이 되리라 확신하고 있소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "ddd01867-7ede-46ae-9238-ae9041f4596a"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} gives you a subtle smile.{/n} \"I'm "
"lucky to bear witness to such great events! Not so long ago, you {d|c41 "
"Choose Surtova}served{/d} the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}, and now you're "
"preparing to ascend your own throne.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}는 미묘한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"이토록 훌륭한 행사를 보게되다니 참으로 "
"행운이군! 자네가 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}에게 {d|c41 Choose Surtova}봉사했던{/d} 것이 그리 오래되지 "
"않았는데, 이제는 스스로 왕좌에 오를 준비를 하고 있으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "ea38e83f-389c-4f55-a96d-705d75d3de17"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi Aldori and Natala {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} keep at a "
"respectful distance from each other. Finally, Jamandi clears her throat.{/n} "
"\"So, {name}. You have achieved what you wanted: your kingdom will be our "
"common ally, and a guarantor of {d|c41 Brevoy Neutral} future peace{/d}. "
"It's an unusual twist, but it's not the first unusual thing to happen since "
"your appearance in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}'s political arena.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디 알도리와 나탈라 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}는 서로 점잖게 거리를 두고 있습니다. 마침내 자만디가 기침을 "
"합니다.{/n} \"그래, {name}. 당신이 원하던 것을 얻었군. 당신의 왕국은 우리의 공통 동맹이 될 것이며, {d|c41 "
"Brevoy Neutral}미래의 평화{/d}의 보증인이 될 것이오. 이례적인 전개이지만, 당신이 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 "
"정치 무대에 등장한 뒤로 처음 일어난 이례적인 일은 아니지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "9c030f2a-6338-4970-8aa9-5798dab8e906"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala sighs softly.{/n} \"Sometimes it's better to set aside needless "
"scruples, and concentrate on building a better future for your subjects. I "
"know not what this will come to in the end, but let us try. — We may never "
"have another mediator like you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 부드럽게 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"때로는 쓸데없는 거리낌을 버리고 더 나은 미래를 건설하는 데 집중하는 것이야 말로 "
"진정 백성을 위하는 길이지. 이 일이 어떻게 끝날지는 모르겠지만, 한 번 해보도록 합세. 우리도 자네 같은 중재자는 두 번 다시 만날 수 "
"없을 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "fa4f1080-5484-4d72-9c98-3ed935b7a504"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi grins and shakes her head.{/n} \"Believe it or not, I agree. "
"You've become a symbol of great change, {name}, and you shall make a fine "
"{mf|king|queen}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 웃으며 그녀의 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"믿을진 몰라도, 나도 마찬가지요. 당신은 큰 변화의 상징이 되었소, {name}"
". 그리고 당신은 훌륭한 {mf|왕|여왕}이 될 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "013fa31b-f59c-46d4-9d68-b19fe7fe6e1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi eyes you up and down with a grin.{/n} \"These are bold words, but "
"not as bold as your deeds! I hope you see your subjects as something more "
"than mere toys — or I fear you'll lose them all very soon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 미소를 짓고 당신을 위아래로 살핍니다.{/n} \"대담한 말이지만, 당신의 업적만큼 대담하지는 않군! 나는 당신이 백성들을 "
"단순한 장난감 이상으로 바라보길 바라오. 그러지 않으면 금방 그들 전부를 잃게 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "a1742ae3-1490-4172-ac51-3e3466df838c"
msgid ""
"\"Such rhetoric! Though perhaps your hot temper is a clue to your success: "
"someone less self-confident would have failed to gain control over the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뛰어난 웅변술이군! 그 열정이 자네를 성공으로 이끌었겠지. 그 정도의 자신감이 없었다면 어찌 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}을 평정했겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "9b7e5abb-549f-4708-8ec8-743214d44741"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi raises her eyebrow.{/n} \"Do you think so? You may be right! In "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, power belongs to the ones strong "
"enough to wield it — not to those who can only strut around in fancy "
"clothes. Nevertheless, sometimes it's good to celebrate a little — a welcome "
"change after the never-ending hunt for monsters and barbarians within your "
"lands.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 그녀의 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"그렇게 생각하시오? 그럴 수도 있지! {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}"
"에서, 힘은 그것을 휘두를 수 있는 자의 것이오. 멋진 옷을 입고 돌아다니는 자들에게는 힘이 없지. 그래도 이 변화를 조금은 축하하는 게 "
"낫지 않겠소? 당신의 땅에서 괴물과 야만인들을 끝도 없이 사냥한 끝에 얻어낸 것이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "0cc8cea8-1fd9-4fc9-8be1-1b5e45f7d734"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala smiles and shakes her head.{/n} \"Well, well. You shouldn't be "
"like that, {name}. Don't you desire to become a real ruler, vested with true "
"power? Trust me, you'll like the feeling.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 웃으며 그녀의 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"이런, 이런. 이러지 마시게, {name}. 진정한 힘을 가진 진정한 통치자가 "
"되고 싶지 않나? 내 말 듣게. 분명 자네 마음에도 들테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "cafeac51-45a8-4784-a355-fb9fe25127f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi stifles a laugh.{/n} \"Honesty is one virtue the "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} have always appreciated. Nevertheless, you've "
"chosen your own fate. It's too late to reject it now, so just try to relax "
"and enjoy it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 웃음을 참습니다.{/n} \"정직은 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}가 항상 추구하는 미덕 중 하나요. 어쨌든 "
"주사위는 던져졌으니, 이제와서 되돌릴 순 없는 노릇이지. 긴장을 풀고 즐기시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "de9fd0b9-c8f0-4e63-9da0-f2fead83c53d"
msgid ""
"\"I have no doubt about that. You're the first to truly tame the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} — and now these lands belong to you, by the power of "
"royal authority.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의심할 여지가 없지. 자네는 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 길들인 최초의 인물이라네. 그리고 이 땅은 이제 왕권에 "
"따라 자네의 것이 되었고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "729d908e-fd74-4421-86f1-3158bf0b250e"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi can't suppress her laugh.{/n} \"The {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} have turned you into a cynic, I see! Of course, your lands will "
"never be lacking in bandits and monsters — don't even hope for that. But "
"think about it this way: you won't be stuck in some dusty room with endless "
"piles of papers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 웃음을 참지 못합니다.{/n} \"{g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이 당신을 냉소적으로 만들었군! 물론 "
"당신의 땅에 도적과 괴물의 씨가 마르는 건 꿈도 꾸기 힘들지. 헌데, 이렇게 생각하는건 어떻소? 그건 적어도 지저분한 방에 갇혀서 끝도 "
"없는 서류와 씨름할 일은 없단 얘기요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "0bba5b1e-efd4-400e-8b4a-9b9be1475b05"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala eyes you intently.{/n} \"Such is the fate of every leader who "
"rules the edges of the civilized world. Trust me, the intrigues of court and "
"its wolfish diplomacy is something far worse — and you won't have to worry "
"about that.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 당신을 뚫어져라 보았습니다.{/n} \"그건 문명 세계의 가장자리를 지배하는 지도자라면 누구나 받아들여야 할 운명이야. "
"궁중 모략과 승냥이떼 사이의 정치질보다야 훨씬 낫지. 적어도 자넨 그 걱정은 안해도 되지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "beefc15e-9369-4625-b520-b59f78c011a8"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi shrugs.{/n} \"It's impossible to pacify all the {g|Stolen Lands}"
"Stolen Lands{/g} in but a few years: chaos has reigned here from the "
"beginning of time. But you will manage. I'm sure of it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"누구도 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g} 전역에 수 년 이상 안정시키지 "
"못했지. 혼돈이 태초부터 이곳에 군림해왔으니. 그러나 당신은 해낼 것이라 믿소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "8de8942a-9760-419a-b597-723f82314986"
msgid ""
"\"One way or another, the decisive moment has come. Before you appear before "
"your people and accept your crown, let's deal with one final issue.\""
msgstr "\"이러든 저러든, 결정의 때가 왔다. 백성들 앞에서 왕관을 수여받기 전에 마지막으로 남은 문제를 해결하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0024_Text_String
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "1a730158-627e-44c3-96d4-fd975f9100c0"
msgid ""
"\"Our states are related, today and for years to come. I support your ascent "
"to the throne, but you must understand that this imposes upon you some "
"obligations as well. Think carefully before you answer: your words will "
"define how close our states become in the future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘부로 향후 몇년간 우린 동맹국이다. 나는 자네의 왕위 수여를 지지하지만, 자네에게도 의무가 부과됨을 알아두게. 신중하게 대답해야 "
"할걸세. 자네의 말로 우리의 미래가 결정될 것이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "f066d7d8-5bfa-43d9-8427-72b5e4dac4c4"
msgid ""
"\"Hm. Your suggestions make much more sense than I expected. Of course, "
"we'll need to settle certain details, but this is something our advisors can "
"attend to.\" {n}Natala nods her head in contemplation.{/n} \"So, this is "
"really happening: {g|House Surtova}House Surtova{/g} is forging a pact with "
"the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}. Who could ever have imagined...\""
msgstr ""
"\"흐음. 내가 예상한 것보다 더 나은 제안을 하는군. 물론, 우리는 다듬을 부분은 있겠지만, 그런 것은 보좌관들이 처리하도록 하고.\" "
"{n}나탈라가 생각에 잠긴 채 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래, 이런 일이 실제로 일어날 줄이야. {g|House Surtova}"
"서토바 가문{/g}이 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}와 협약을 맺는다니. 누가 상상할 수 있었을까... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "ab4bf736-1e87-4666-bfc5-ee3d78f859b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala nods and gives you a subtle smile.{/n} \"I knew you wouldn't "
"reject the benefits that an alliance with the rulers of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} "
"would provide. Send your emissaries with details about the deal — and "
"together we'll make our plans a reality.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 고개를 끄덕이며 미묘한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"자네가 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 통치자와의 동맹이 주는 "
"혜택을 거부하지 않을 것임을 알고 있었지. 협약에 관한 세부 사항을 논의할 사절을 보내게. 손을 잡고 우리의 계획을 현실로 만들도록 "
"하자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "7600d10f-295d-4f9f-a859-b214f355ad3b"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi shrugs.{/n} \"I see no obstacle to that. {g|Rostland}Rostland{/g} "
"will be satisfied by a peace treaty with our southern neighbor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"문제 될 사항이 아무것도 없군. {g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}는 남부 이웃 국가와의 "
"평화 조약에 동의할 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "eaa673b4-ee90-4048-b166-caf080f5e813"
msgid ""
"\"I'd never imagined that after all you've done to gain my favor, you would "
"decline my further support. You are unpredictable — a good feature in a "
"ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 호의를 얻기 위해 그 모든 일을 하고도 나의 지원을 거절하다니, 상상도 못했다. 자네는 정말 예측할 수 없군. 통치자로선 장점이지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "55f03629-f327-471a-9a63-e6eb08ea0ebf"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala looks at you intently.{/n} \"So that's how you see it? You've "
"bound yourself by alliance with two states, yet you seek no benefits from "
"it? It's an unexpected decision, but if this is your wish...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라가 당신을 뚫어져라 봅니다.{/n} \"그런 식으로 보겠다? 두 국가와 동맹을 맺으면서도 아무런 이득도 얻지 않겠다고? 예기치 "
"않은 결정이지만, 그러길 원한다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "2a17611c-b4a2-4c57-96ab-369b9a5a17ce"
msgid ""
"\"We are decided, then. We have lingered too long already. Your people await "
"you outside, Your Highness. — It is time you emerge and greet your subjects."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러면, 결정되었군. 우리는 이미 너무 오래 머물렀소. 당신의 백성들이 바깥에서 기다리고 있으니, 이제 그들을 맞이하러 갑시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "23020828-c640-4b16-a491-54384af396ea"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose that's all I wanted to know. Now it's time for the official "
"part. Can you hear this noise outside? It's your subjects, ready to witness "
"their {mf|King|Queen}'s coronation. Go and greet them… Your Highness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알아둬야 할 건 이정돈 거 같군. 이제 공식 행사를 할 차례다. 바깥의 소란이 느껴지나? {mf|왕|여왕}의 대관식을 보러온 자네의 "
"백성들이야. 가서 인사해주게... {mf|왕|여왕}이여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "4dd018f3-0be8-415c-aa60-76818f599c68"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi turns to you with the hint of a smile.{/n} \"Trust my expertise: "
"high-society events quickly become boring, and you'll be thanking the gods "
"for every opportunity to flex your muscles. You'll learn this on your own "
"soon enough. So, now you're but a few mere paces away from the crown. — How "
"does it feel?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 미소를 띄고 당신에게 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"내가 잘 알지. 상류 사회의 행사는 지겹기 짝이 없어서, 당신은 몸을 "
"움직인다는게 얼마나 소중한 것인지 신께 감사를 드리게 될 거요. 곧 있으면 뼈저리게 느낄테지. 어쨌든, 이젠 정말 왕관이 바로 눈 앞에 "
"있구만. 소감이 어떻소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_Kassil
msgctxt "b29e88eb-c6d5-4093-bb07-c095e64b7ba3"
msgid ""
"\"And you more than deserve a lavish celebration! If you hadn't arrived in "
"time, and intervened on the battlefield, many would be dead today!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작님의 공을 생각하면 이런 성대한 기념식을 치르고도 남지요! 남작님이 제 때에 도착해 전장에 개입하지 않았다면 많은 사람들이 죽었을 "
"겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "b7f2f95b-2cc5-4cdd-875c-c22ada0d1986"
msgid ""
"\"Answer one question for me, {name}: how does it feel to be the first in "
"your own royal line? What captures your thoughts now, when you're mere steps "
"away from the throne?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하나만 묻겠다. {name}. 왕가의 시조가 된 기분이 어떤가? 이제 왕좌를 바로 코 앞에 두고, 무슨 생각에 사로잡혀 있는지 "
"궁금하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_Shandra
msgctxt "5b939c52-6eb1-4e93-93d8-29aad7836fcc"
msgid ""
"\"I had no doubt in your success, when I left you on the dawn of war against "
"the barbarians. I'm sure you've realized this by now — it was all a test: "
"would you choose the right ally and find your own path to glory?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 자네를 야만족과의 전쟁에 내버려 둔 건, 자네가 성공하리라 믿어 의심치 않았기 때문이라네. 이젠 알았겠지? 그게 모두 "
"시험이었다는걸. 스스로 영광을 개척하고 올바른 동맹을 선택하는 시험 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0055_Text_String
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "ab85c613-5732-4038-b8e4-25c04382314d"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? I hope you will rule your lands with the same resolve you show "
"today. When I decided to ally with the mayor of {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, I was "
"confident in my resolution. In time I grew to question my decision, but of "
"course we must look always forward. Never let doubt shake your determination!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇소? 오늘과 같은 기백으로 나라를 다스리기를 바라오. 내가 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 총독과 동맹을 맺을 때 나는 한치의 "
"망설임도 없었지. 지금은 내 결정에 의문이 들때도 있지만, 이제와 뒤를 돌아 봐서는 안되지 않겠소? 의심하지 말고 흔들림 없이 앞으로 "
"나아가시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "615fe792-b2e9-422a-bac6-cbea0f3598c6"
msgid ""
"\"I never expected you'd answer anything else. You're establishing a new "
"royal bloodline — and I would hazard, with a founder like this, your line is "
"destined for greatness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 대답은 기대도 안했다. 자네는 새로운 왕조를 개창하였지. 나는 감히 이렇게 말하겠네. 이런 개창자의 혈통이라면, 그 혈통은 "
"위대한 운명을 타고났다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "fee13288-b617-4fe2-8874-604146ffdfea"
msgid ""
"\"Let's get to the point, {name}. As a Swordlord and a defender of "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} and its lands, I want to clarify one thing before your "
"subjects steal you from me: how do you see your alliance with "
"{g|Rostland}Rostland{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"본론으로 갑시다. {name}. 소드로드와 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}와 이 땅의 수호자로서, 당신이 나의 백성을 훔치기 전에 "
"한 가지 분명히 해두고 싶은 게 있소. {g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}와의 동맹을 어떻게 생각하시오? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "711cb6f3-7fd9-4666-be3d-adbbe56fa10b"
msgid ""
"\"Our states are related, today and for the years to come. I support your "
"ascent to the throne, but you must understand that this imposes upon you "
"some obligations as well. Think carefully before you answer: your words may "
"determine how close our states will be in the future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘부로 향후 몇년간 우린 동맹국이오. 나는 당신의 왕위 수여를 지지하지만, 당신에게도 의무가 부과됨을 알아두시오. 신중하게 대답해야 "
"할 것이오. 당신의 말로 우리의 미래가 결정될 것이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "e9729c24-14e7-46d6-b2df-e9a894323325"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, it's time we discuss what benefits we may reap from this unusual "
"situation. I'm sure you have some ideas on how we might strengthen this "
"three-way alliance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든, 우리가 이 흔치않은 상황에서 얻을 수 있는 이익에 대해 논의해 봅시다. 당신이라면 우리의 삼자 동맹을 강화할 방법에 생각해둔 "
"게 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "03f47f27-fbc0-4c6c-b2bb-acd5d57c809d"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi slaps her fist against her palm.{/n} \"Then it is decided! I like "
"it when people get straight to business, rather than wasting time in idle "
"chat. Our advisors will discuss the specifics of our alliance in greater "
"detail, but I already like what I hear.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디가 주먹으로 자기 손바닥을 칩니다.{/n} \"그럼 결정된거요! 한가하게 수다 떨며 시간을 낭비하기 보다는 업무에 집중하는 게 "
"낫지. 우리 보좌관들이 우리 동맹의 세부 사항에 대해 더 자세히 논의하겠지만, 지금 들은 것만 해도 마음에 드는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_Shandra
msgctxt "f6b010e6-f311-4821-9860-518bf9f531d5"
msgid ""
"\"Now that you have proved your loyalty, I am prepared to continue serving "
"you as a royal advisor.\" {n}Shandra gives a short bow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"당신께서 충성을 보이셨으니, 저 또한 왕의 보좌관으로서 계속 당신께 봉사할 준비가 되었습니다.\" {n}샨드라는 짧은 인사를 "
"합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_JamandiAldori
msgctxt "5dda0c7e-d497-4060-9679-be2261b19083"
msgid ""
"\"Before I forget. Kassil is ready to return to duty and assist you in "
"governing the country. He is eager to see what the Stolen Lands would become "
"under your rule — you must have made an impression on him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잊기 전에 말하지. 카실은 임무를 속행하여 통치에 도움을 줄 것이오. 도둑맞은 땅이 당신의 통치 하에 어떻게 변하게 될지 보고 "
"싶어하더군. 카실이 당신에게 깊은 인상을 받았나 보오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_NatalaSurtova
msgctxt "0943247b-31d8-458e-8492-d737ffe707b4"
msgid ""
"\"Shandra Mervey will help you with that. She may return to your service. "
"Don't say no to her wisdom! The crown on your head will triple your "
"responsibilities she can help you with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"샨드라 머비가 다시 자네를 돕도록 하겠네. 그녀의 말을 새겨들으시게나! 이제 왕관을 썼으니 그 책임이 여태의 세 배는 될 텐데, "
"그녀의 도움이 요긴할 걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Coronation_Kassil
msgctxt "18f27db0-ae87-4e4f-8ca5-266001d2bfca"
msgid ""
"\"I would be honored to help you govern the kingdom. Should you need my "
"service, I will immediately answer your call!\""
msgstr "\"왕국을 통치할 수 있도록 돕게 되어 영광으로 생각합니다. 제 힘을 필요로 한다면 곧바로 부름에 응하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Indoor_Surtova_Jamandi/Shared_StrongTies_String
msgctxt "fe673435-ec20-47d2-90b2-a96fa7050735"
msgid ""
"\"I wish to unite our powers — and make our enemies tremble at the very "
"mention of our names. Together we will make our nations the greatest allies "
"of Avistan!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 우리의 힘을 결집하여 적들을 우리의 이름 앞에 떨게하고 싶다. 우리가 함께하면 아비스탄 전역에서 가장 위대한 동맹이 될 것이다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d8f486aa-939f-4535-b424-a17b07c1756e"
msgid "Promised to be a merciful ruler."
msgstr "자비로운 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "1d5a305e-ca39-43ff-9a0d-d086a7891986"
msgid "\"I will not deny help to anyone in trouble who comes to me for aid.\""
msgstr "\"나는 곤경에 빠진 사람이 도움을 청할 때 그 누구라도 내치지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "519e88db-1827-45ad-a0e1-09c9310b9284"
msgid "Promised to be a reasonable ruler."
msgstr "합리적인 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "e5bea311-e408-49e4-ad4b-d5241bef58ff"
msgid "\"I will be merciful to those who deserve it!\""
msgstr "\"나는 자격이 있는 자들에게 자비를 베풀겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ef885875-63ae-4726-b7af-b09ea3ddedbb"
msgid "Didn't promise to rule in any certain way."
msgstr "어떻게 통치할 것인지 말해주지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "178a282d-0ae1-44bc-bf14-b34bdbd45ecd"
msgid "\"Perhaps with benevolence. Or perhaps harshly. We'll wait and see.\""
msgstr "\"자비로울 수도, 가혹할 수도 있다. 어떻게 될 것인지는 앞으로 알게 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "83dbfe57-4d90-45ae-b3f6-3aba6da04015"
msgid "Promised to be a harsh ruler."
msgstr "가혹한 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "0e52c3e9-c089-4edd-a6c2-343dd217cf0b"
msgid ""
"\"I will destroy the unworthy, but as for those who are suffering — let them "
"solve their own problems.\""
msgstr "\"나는 자격없는 자들을 멸할 것이지만, 고통받는 자를 돕지는 않겠다. 자기 문제는 자기가 해결하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4af07e6d-86b4-4b4a-9225-3f076af9d8fd"
msgid "Promised to rule by laws."
msgstr "법률로 통치하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "7b987daf-c414-47a9-bb43-e86f7ddf66ee"
msgid "\"All who abide by my laws may rely on my mercy.\""
msgstr "\"내 법을 지키는 자들에겐 모두 자비를 베풀 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e79808b8-a772-42dc-a5af-61c65a5bb21f"
msgid "Promised to follow reasonable laws."
msgstr "합리적인 법을 준수하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "4b14302b-0d32-4d56-bead-830ec3060fda"
msgid "\"Only if it is wise and serves our larger goals.\""
msgstr "\"현명하고 더 큰 목표를 달성할 때에만 법을 지킬 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "64713e86-fefd-492c-80d7-e1cbb62f9c85"
msgid "Promised to follow noble laws."
msgstr "고귀한 법을 따르겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "b3b3bef0-7c63-415e-88a9-663dfa9aba7c"
msgid "\"I will abide the laws which benefit my subjects and my lands.\""
msgstr "\"나는 나의 백성과 나의 땅에 이로운 법을 지키겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a0bb201b-d885-4a11-9f4e-a30e73918f98"
msgid "Promised to punish for breaking laws."
msgstr "법 위반자는 처벌하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "1bf62972-bb16-4847-a156-3aed845da1d1"
msgid ""
"\"This country will live under the rule of law, and those who break the law "
"will be severely punished.\""
msgstr "\"이 나라를 법의 지배하에 둘 것이며, 법을 어기는 자들은 엄중히 처벌할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b6826520-60ed-4fe9-a534-c4b6c8a85e3a"
msgid "Refused to follow laws and promised to do what is best for yourself."
msgstr "법을 따르기를 거부하고 오직 내 맘대로 할 것을 선언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "b2453135-5207-4091-a023-69a221783b76"
msgid ""
"\"Laws? I don't give a fig about laws. I am the power and I am the law: if "
"during breakfast I wish to hear innocents screaming on the rack — then I "
"will hear it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"법? 나는 법 따위는 안중에도 없다. 내가 바로 힘이요. 바로 법이다. 아침 식사 때 무고한 자의 비명을 듣고 싶어지면, 기꺼이 "
"무고한 자를 형벌대에 세울 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4c263ba8-8fb7-480b-b847-1433670176bd"
msgid "Refused to follow laws and promised to do what is best for the people."
msgstr "법을 따르기를 거부하고 백성을 위해 최선을 다할 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "9b8ab584-2b16-4dfa-8254-1fab480fba79"
msgid ""
"\"I don't need outdated traditions or stupid laws! The will of the "
"{mf|King|Queen} is above all: I know what my subjects require for their "
"happiness and prosperity!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 오래된 전통이나 어리석은 법이 필요하지 않다. 왕의 의지가 무엇보다도 중요하다. 나는 백성들의 행복과 번영을 무엇이 필요한지 "
"알고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "30bbd23f-dcf6-4e08-8bd7-cf4593bc4b46"
msgid "\"Fine, I shall speak.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 이제 연설을 시작하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ca7889c4-c410-42e9-833f-9bf4a3596b27"
msgid "Decided not to bother your subjects with a speech."
msgstr "백성들을 연설로 괴롭히지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "fdc34898-5bcc-4f10-91e2-325d2af2f59e"
msgid ""
"\"That's quite enough for today, Linzi. The people want to celebrate, not "
"listen to my pompous babbling.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 이걸로 충분해. 린지. 사람들은 축하하고 싶어하는 거지 내가 잘난 척하는 소리를 듣고 싶은게 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a6fd0dd8-b91a-4baa-8a51-a48d2de26843"
msgid "Announced that law will be at the heart of the future kingdom."
msgstr "법이 장차 왕국의 중심이 될 것임을 공포했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "0386562c-4137-4c9a-935e-60c72c52ceae"
msgid ""
"\"My loyal subjects! Today is the day when law finally comes to the Stolen "
"Lands…\""
msgstr "\"나의 충직한 백성들이여! 오늘은 마침내 도둑맞은 땅에 법이 도래하는 날이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0044_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "254ddf86-ad40-408b-9580-347d125e1505"
msgid ""
"Announced that righteousness will be at the heart of the future kingdom."
msgstr "정의가 장차 왕국의 중심이 될 것임을 공포했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "a59814ea-9805-43eb-a546-693d8b181363"
msgid ""
"\"My good subjects! My only dream is to deliver peace and safety to those "
"who have put their trust in me — something you have so desperately needed, "
"for so long...\""
msgstr "\"나의 훌륭한 백성들이여! 내 유일한 꿈은 나를 믿어준 사람들에게 그토록 오래토록 원하던 평화와 안전을 찾아주는 것이다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0045_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c0c1929a-aad0-4cd7-8178-ac26fd1e9358"
msgid ""
"Announced that the {mf|King's|Queen's} own interests will determine the path "
"of the kingdom."
msgstr "오로지 {mf|왕|여왕}의 의중으로 왕국이 나아갈 길을 결정할 것이라고 선언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "888b9c88-2496-4bd9-95a8-ca890dadc164"
msgid ""
"\"Now listen to me, my subjects! From this day forth, I am your sovereign "
"and your master. My word is a law, and my will is your command…\""
msgstr "\"잘 들어라! 백성들이여! 오늘부터 나는 너희의 지배자이며 주인이다. 나의 말은 법이고 나의 의지는 명령이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b2729786-126d-4200-bf8c-b399db318015"
msgid "Announced that freedom will be at the heart of the future kingdom."
msgstr "자유가 장차 왕국의 중심이 될 것임을 공포했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "4f675ae2-efa9-4e8d-ac41-3aa977645520"
msgid ""
"\"Brothers and sisters! The very essence of the Stolen Lands is freedom! No "
"longer will the powerful dominate the weak. I swear to defend your freedom "
"to my last breath...\""
msgstr ""
"\"형제 자매여! 도둑맞은 땅의 본질은 자유다! 더 이상 강자가 약자를 지배하지 않을 것이다. 나는 마지막 숨을 쉴 때까지 너희의 자유를 "
"지키겠다고 맹세한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0072_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0758f4e3-8812-4ffb-8989-62168357040a"
msgid "Promised to be a righteous ruler."
msgstr "의로운 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0075_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cfd74ef1-daa3-4eef-9f51-d614983e3353"
msgid "Promised to be a just and harsh ruler."
msgstr "정의롭고 가혹한 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0076_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "89a632f3-0ab6-4846-983c-e5d5c30dca26"
msgid "Decided not to bother subjects with a speech."
msgstr "백성들을 연설로 괴롭히지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0077_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "72e21023-8ba4-473c-8c44-0bcbd609f1d6"
msgid "Promised to be a merciful ruler."
msgstr "자비로운 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0078_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bbc6d83e-8023-4224-a772-ce1c45aae7d0"
msgid "Promised to be a violent ruler."
msgstr "폭력적인 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0079_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9d61b126-6988-41c3-aff0-73229c741bf8"
msgid "Decided not to bother subjects with a speech."
msgstr "백성들을 연설로 괴롭히지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_0082_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c71b01b6-0369-4009-9148-a1374239c3b6"
msgid "Decided not to bother subjects with a speech."
msgstr "백성들을 연설로 괴롭히지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_CoronationSpeakInterrupt_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7166199b-dd16-4f59-88d6-3f3580073af7"
msgid "Decided not to bother subjects with a speech."
msgstr "백성들을 연설로 괴롭히지 않기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_CoronationSpeakInterrupt_Text_String
msgctxt "d79b3f3a-092c-4c68-9918-ba9df90e479c"
msgid "[Address Linzi] \"I've said enough.\""
msgstr "[린지에게 말합니다] \"이정도면 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_CE_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "640bfbb1-1464-48b6-9c64-47df25fa465b"
msgid "Promised to be a violent ruler."
msgstr "폭력적인 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_CE_Text_String
msgctxt "ab9c2edb-2441-4a71-92f4-eeeabe600a3a"
msgid ""
"\"Don't forget: you belong to me now. So you'd better pray that I wake up in "
"a good mood every morning — or you'll stand gaping while I burn your homes "
"and execute your families for my own pleasure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잊지 마라. 너희는 내 속민이다. 그러니 내가 아침마다 기분 좋게 일어날 수 있도록 기도해야 할 것이다. 그렇지 않으면 내가 너희 "
"집을 불태우며 가족을 사형시키는 즐거움을 만끽하는 모습을 입을 벌리고 봐야 할 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_CG_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3b8d5514-9356-4650-adeb-b20f616f0c87"
msgid "Promised to be a merciful ruler."
msgstr "자비로운 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_CG_Text_String
msgctxt "609e53cc-82a0-4645-b027-aeb899daa491"
msgid ""
"\"I will make sure that goodness prevails — every time! Nothing will stop us "
"on our way to a life of happiness and prosperity. We'll create a state where "
"there's no room for evil, poverty, or sorrow!\""
msgstr ""
"\"언제나 선이 승리함을 보장하겠다! 행복과 번영의 삶을 사는 길에 우리를 멈추게 할 것은 없다. 우리는 악, 빈곤, 슬픔의 여지가 없는 "
"국가를 만들 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_LE_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b36386a0-da34-4d6d-83f6-9f44a7cbeb04"
msgid "Promised to be a just and harsh ruler."
msgstr "정의롭고 가혹한 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_LE_Text_String
msgctxt "c4d4214d-3698-4c38-8bac-79e3f49c9a71"
msgid ""
"\"Law is the gateway to civilization — and many are the sacrifices we shall "
"gladly make in its name. From now on, the state is your {mf|father|mother} "
"and your god. Serve the law — and it will protect you. Reject the law — and "
"your life will be as smoke in the wind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"법률은 문명의 관문이다. 많은 것이 법의 이름으로 기꺼이 희생될 것이다. 이제부터는 국가는 너의 어버이이자 신이 될 것이다. 법을 "
"지켜라. 그러면 너를 보호할 것이다. 법을 거부하면 너의 삶은 바람 앞의 등불이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_LG_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f1d62806-b439-403b-848a-c9b67d17a2ff"
msgid "Promised to be a righteous ruler."
msgstr "의로운 통치자가 될 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Crntn_LG_Text_String
msgctxt "945b7ffb-b982-4ada-86f4-812d3a9ab6c1"
msgid ""
"\"I believe with all my heart that justice and prosperity are rooted in the "
"law. I swear before you this day, that I shall rule in accordance with the "
"traditions and laws that serve what is good and right!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 정의와 번영이 법의 뿌리임을 온 마음으로 믿는다. 나는 오늘 너희에게 선포하리라. 선하고 옳은 것에 기여하는 전통과 법으로 "
"통치하겠노라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto01_LG_Text_String
msgctxt "d42792c5-5fd0-4322-a1e1-60e35db55a64"
msgid "\"Honor and law.\""
msgstr "\"명예와 법.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto02_NG_Text_String
msgctxt "255962bf-7a72-407f-b0cb-595d5c3c74ea"
msgid "\"Hope will prevail.\""
msgstr "\"희망이 승리 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto03_CG_Text_String
msgctxt "2377ea25-c8d7-4dbd-be07-3b1159c32daa"
msgid "\"Mercy before law.\""
msgstr "\"법 앞에는 자비가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto04_LN_Text_String
msgctxt "1cefce16-e778-49cf-8eea-e2037d11e809"
msgid "\"The oath is sacred.\""
msgstr "\"맹세는 신성하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto05_N_Text_String
msgctxt "dbac1f65-538c-459b-b724-00a6fa633316"
msgid "\"Truth in temperance.\""
msgstr "\"진실은 절제 안에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto06_CN_Text_String
msgctxt "beb9cb91-dcaf-47ec-89a0-f2faf7875406"
msgid "\"Freedom above all.\""
msgstr "\"무엇보다 자유가 중요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto07_LE_Text_String
msgctxt "99e2743a-39cf-4c8e-af0e-b57ba08712c5"
msgid "\"Life is fleeting, but law is forever.\""
msgstr "\"삶은 순간이지만 법은 영원하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto08_NE_Text_String
msgctxt "7f7b1977-a1cc-4e57-ae75-47304fc7f344"
msgid "\"The {mf|King's|Queen's} wills the way.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}의 의지가 곧 길이니. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto09_CE_Text_String
msgctxt "c35254fd-8fa7-40ff-9352-5b5563ea456b"
msgid "\"Death to dissent.\""
msgstr "\"반대는 곧 죽음이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Answer_Motto0_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "510c2e39-a644-4c52-bf79-3772cce85cb6"
msgid "Picked your motto during the coronation."
msgstr "대관식에서 국시를 정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Barks/Joyous screams_01_String
msgctxt "fb73df0c-8276-4cad-bc89-801e6d928691"
msgid "\"Long live the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Barks/Joyous screams_02_String
msgctxt "0622ab30-ae3a-406e-96e3-2c6dd7f30b70"
msgid "\"Hurrrayyyy!\""
msgstr "\"만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Barks/Joyous screams_03_String
msgctxt "9f14bffc-bd6e-498f-a7b7-c5bba23ca82b"
msgid "\"A toast to {mf|His|Her} Highness!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|전하|전하}를 위해 건배!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Barks/Joyous screams_04_String
msgctxt "a0680432-a533-473b-b257-b81a7aed5964"
msgid "\"Hip-hip!\""
msgstr "\"만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Barks/Joyous screams_05_String
msgctxt "d5d6f9bf-78ef-48eb-baab-dcebf1a2477a"
msgid "\"Hail to {mf|His|Her} Highness!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}에게 환호를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f4bb7d7a-e82c-4321-9af0-922cbaf8e21c"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi is almost jumping in excitement, clutching in her hands a scroll "
"covered with solemn oaths.{/n} \"{mf|Baron|Baroness}, what took you so long? "
"Everybody has been waiting for you! Hurry up!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 엄숙한 맹세로 덮인 두루마리를 손에 들고 흥분 속에 거의 뛰고 있습니다.{/n} \" 왜 그렇게 늦었어요? 모두가 기다려요! "
"서두르세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f59a2e1f-e78f-464d-ad0c-6435f63d91ba"
msgid ""
"{n}She proudly demonstrates a parchment scroll covered with scribbles.{/n} "
"\"I've searched all the books, but I couldn't find anything that resembled a "
"coronation protocol for the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. So I took the "
"liberty of penning the program myself! Don't worry, I did the very best I "
"could!\" {n}Linzi clears her throat and turns to the crowd.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 휘갈겨 쓴 양피지 두루마리를 자랑스럽게 보여줍니다.{/n} \"모든 책을 찾아봤지만 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}의 대관식과 비슷한 건 찾을 수 없었어요. 그래서 제가 맘대로 써 봤죠! 걱정 마세요. 최선을 다했으니!\" {n}린지는 목을 "
"가다듬고 군중에게 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "558d31c3-7321-40be-8913-3ae3fb5c8c73"
msgid ""
"\"Citizens of the Kingdom! Ladies and gentlemen! It is with great excitement "
"and indescribable awe that I, Linzi, official chronicler of the hero who "
"stands beside me, hereby declare the beginning of a sacred ceremony — the "
"coronation of the first legitimate ruler in the history of the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}! By the power of the representatives of the other "
"royal houses, who recognize {mf|him|her} as their equal, and according to "
"the will of the people, who accepted {mf|his|her} rule, {mf|he|she} now "
"ascends the throne, which has been waiting empty for so long, for such a "
"worthy ruler!\""
msgstr ""
"\"국민 여러분! 신사 숙녀 여러분! 내 옆에 서 계신 영웅의 옆에 선 나 연대기 작성자 린지가 신성한 의식의 시작을 선언합니다. {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g} 최초의 합법적인 통치자의 대관식을 시작하겠습니다. {mf|그|그녀}를 동등한 지위로 인정한 "
"다른 왕가 대표자들의 힘과, {mf|그|그녀}의 통치를 인정한 국민의 의지에 따라, 합당한 통치자를 오랫동안 공허하게 기다리고 있던 "
"왕위에 {mf|그|그녀}가 오르게 되었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bf0dead5-8322-49a9-afca-105291ea5564"
msgid ""
"\"My fellow citizens! I hereby introduce {name}, your {mf|King|Queen} and "
"your undisputed leader! Now {mf|he|she} stands before you, ready to accept "
"your will! Everyone who has gathered here — are you ready to swear fealty to "
"your new ruler?\""
msgstr ""
"\"친애하는 국민 여러분! 나는 여기서 여러분의 왕이자 확실한 지도자인 {name}을 소개합니다! 지금 {name}은 여러분 앞에서 "
"여러분의 의지를 받아들일 준비가 되었습니다. 여기에 모인 여러분은 새로운 통치자에 대한 충성을 맹세하겠습니까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e9a78f0f-509b-49bf-8443-f743dd9d9c31"
msgid ""
"\"So, it is decided. And now...\" {n}Linzi turns to you.{/n} \"It's your "
"turn, Your Highness!\" {n}The bard clears her throat and solemnly reads her "
"words from the page.{/n} \"Into your hands we commend our lives, and humbly "
"request you address the fate that awaits for us under your rule. Please now "
"answer...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 결정되었습니다. 그리고 이제...\" {n}린지가 당신에게 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"네 차례야!\" {n}음유시인은 목을 가다듬고 "
"엄숙하게 자신의 글을 읽습니다.{/n} \"우리의 삶을 당신의 손에 맡기고 당신의 통치 하에 우리에게 다가올 운명을 겸허하게 요구합니다. "
"이제 대답하십시오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "defde008-6f5d-4b77-b5c7-ccdbd1a49af0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not subject to anyone, so I cannot swear fealty, but I have nothing to "
"say against a {mf|king|queen} such as this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 누구의 지배도 받지 않기 때문에 충성을 맹세할 수는 없지만, 이런 {mf|왕|여왕}에게는 어떤 이의도 제기하지 않겠소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Peasant3
msgctxt "180a30a0-33b2-407b-a323-520d75f24739"
msgid "\"Erastil save the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이시여 {mf|왕|여왕}을 보우하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_WarriorDwarf
msgctxt "420bb1ca-1572-40ff-8fda-5d29c9a26ef2"
msgid "\"Hail to the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕} 전하를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "60883e3b-b079-4bd8-8f79-f2611f28808a"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, yeah, sure! How much longer are you going to wag your tongues? It's "
"time we start feasting in the chieftain's name!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 그래, 좋아! 얼마나 오래 혀를 놀릴 생각이지? 이제 족장의 이름으로 잔치를 시작하자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianFemale_RangerElf
msgctxt "f4af88aa-52a7-4eda-8d8e-05cda394ab87"
msgid "\"We pledge our loyalty!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕} 전하께 충성을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dd08c88b-686a-4199-9ece-cac2543a6e03"
msgid "\"Long live the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕} 전하 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ed18d191-c506-41d3-a4bf-ef158cd86d8d"
msgid "\"I swear.\""
msgstr "\"맹세한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f6b9cf54-4f4f-4d17-996f-10b8a75bc654"
msgid ""
"\"How do you intend to rule this land and its people? With benevolence and "
"care for those who suffer, or with strength — and severity for the unworthy?"
"\""
msgstr "\"이 땅과 백성을 어떻게 통치할 것인가? 고통받는 사람들을 위해 자비와 보살핌으로? 아니면 자비 없이 힘과 엄격함으로?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2aa5a1f9-a47a-4c28-b34a-d80b8c711f8b"
msgid ""
"\"Will you honor the old ways and traditions, which spread through these "
"lands long before your time, and will you abide its laws, which all accept?\""
msgstr "\"오래전부터 이 땅에 퍼져있던 옛 방식과 전통을 존중할 것인가? 그리고 모두가 동의한 법을 따를 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1fe681d4-18fc-4662-b5ea-90570da23dbd"
msgid ""
"\"And finally: what will be the motto under which you shall rule? Proclaim "
"it now for us to witness, and we shall etch this solemn moment into our "
"hearts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 마지막으로 나라를 통치함에 있어 그 국시는 무엇으로 할 것인가? 우리가 보는 이 자리에서 지금 선포하면 이 엄숙한 순간을 우리 "
"마음에 새기리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0c8dae8f-796d-45dc-aecc-5224296fa122"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi glances at the last few lines of her manuscript.{/n} \"Well now...\""
" {n}She clears her throat and turns to the crowd.{/n} \"Esteemed gentlemen! "
"Fair ladies! The ceremony is complete, and now the long-awaited moment has "
"arrived!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 그녀의 원고 마지막 몇 줄을 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"그럼 이제...\" {n}그녀는 목을 가다듬고 군중에게 향합니다.{/n} "
"\"신사 숙녀 여러분! 행사가 끝났고 이제 기다려온 순간이 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bf83083f-7ff2-44e3-a06d-ad27de9eb53e"
msgid "\"Let us bow together, and witness this solemn moment! The crown!\""
msgstr "\"함께 절하고 이 엄숙한 순간을 목격합시다! 왕관을 가져오십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "004657ce-5b7f-4712-b216-f7469f1dffc0"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi leans towards you and whispers urgently:{/n} \"Speech, Your "
"Highness! According to tradition we need a speech!\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 당신을 향해 몸을 기울이고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"연설하세요! 전통에 따르면 우리는 연설이 필요해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4069bb7b-a06c-4064-a618-da4a3dc5d7a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi claps her hands in joy and turns to the crowd.{/n} \"Ladies and "
"gentlemen! {mf|His|Her} Highness wishes to give a speech!\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 기쁨에 넘쳐 손뼉을 치고 군중들에게 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"신사 숙녀 여러분! 전하께서 연설하고자 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "59fac5b3-6996-4b6d-a185-3cd43bbd2736"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi sighs in disappointment.{/n} \"This isn't how the ceremony is "
"supposed to go… but all right! You never promised anything — and after all, "
"it's your kingdom and your rules!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 실망스러워 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"원래 의식은 이렇게 하는게 아닌데... 괜찮아요! 연설하겠다고 약속한 적은 없으니까. "
"그 다음엔, 왕국을 어떻게 다스릴지 말해주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c6ee43a6-87ff-45b2-97ea-c32d8a09d269"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me! By {mf|His|Her} Highness's declaration, the celebration has "
"begun! We've heard enough speeches — now let us enjoy the feast, and raise a "
"toast to the health of our {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"주목해주세요! 전하의 선언으로, 식이 시작되었습니다! 우리는 연설을 충분히 들었습니다. 이제 잔치를 즐기고 {mf|왕|여왕}의 안녕을 "
"위해 축배를 들도록 하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "40873daa-002e-487b-89bd-3fff6a31bb1c"
msgid ""
"{n}You step forward. The countless faces of the crowd, so noisy just a "
"moment ago, now become still, their eyes all upon you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 발을 내딛자, 방금 전까지 아주 소란스럽던 무수한 군중의 눈이 당신에게 향합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "4b1c2ae7-ca68-4c9e-95dc-216d4b17c3ee"
msgid ""
"{n}Your words flow as a river — sincere, benevolent and warm. The faces in "
"the crowd light up — as if a timid sunray peeked out from behind the clouds. "
"One onlooker, then another, wipes her eyes with a stealthy gesture, as "
"others smile and nod with manful dignity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말은 청산유수와 같고 자비롭고 따뜻합니다. 군중의 얼굴에 빛이 드리웁니다. 마치 수줍은 태양빛이 구름 뒤에서 살짝 비쳐나온 "
"것처럼. 한 구경꾼은 웃음 짓고 근엄하게 고개를 끄덕이고 또 다른 한 사람은 조용한 손길로 눈물을 닦습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "18524ba3-79e1-475d-b4bb-a8091aed5185"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd heeds your words with servile expression. Some shake their "
"heads, but most look at you as they should look upon their {mf|King|Queen} — "
"with reverence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중들이 당신의 말에 귀를 기울이는 모습이 선합니다. 어떤 사람들은 머리를 흔들지만 대부분의 사람들은 존경에 찬 눈빛으로 왕을 "
"바라보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "220fccf8-96c5-45d1-81d8-bcf92c8c734d"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems your every word falls upon the crowd as a heavy stone — so "
"terrifying is the power of your voice. The people gathered in the square "
"look frightened by the picture you describe — but more than that, they are "
"afraid to move, lest they incur your wrath.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말 하나 하나가 바위처럼 군중을 짓누르는 듯합니다. 당신의 말에 담긴 힘에 두려워합니다. 광장에 모인 군중은 당신이 묘사한 "
"미래에 겁을 먹었습니다. 그러나 당신의 진노를 살까 두려워 감히 움직이지도 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "e5d665fe-fdc8-4b02-9dfa-73a1e3bbdbad"
msgid ""
"{n}You barely manage to finish your inspiring speech, before the air is "
"filled with shouts and whistles from the happy crowd.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 영감에 찬 연설은 광장을 행복한 군중의 환호와 휘파람으로 가득 채웠고, 덕분에 연설을 끝내는 데 오랜 시간이 "
"걸렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f7f08163-190c-446c-ba05-db9e0061008c"
msgid ""
"\"My goodness, Your Highness! I always knew you were a {mf|man|woman} of "
"many talents, but your gift of eloquence is without equal!\" {n}The bard "
"turns to the crowd and shouts as loudly as she can:{/n} \"The {mf|King|Queen}"
" has spoken! Hail to the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 이런, 전하! 당신께서 많은 재능을 지닌건 알고 있었지만 웅변에 대한 재능은 정말 타고나셨네요!\" {n}음유 시인은 군중에게로 "
"향하더니 낼 수 있는 최대한 큰 소리로 외칩니다.{/n} \"{mf|왕|여왕}의 연설이 끝났습니다! {mf|왕|여왕} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : AnnamedeBelavarah
msgctxt "ca466a91-9364-41d3-b4f0-250baf4bde00"
msgid ""
"\"What passion, what intensity! Indeed, the Rushlight Tournament would be "
"incomplete without your participation!\""
msgstr "\"이 열정, 이 강렬함! 전하께서 러시라이트 토너먼트에 와주시지 않으면 정말 허전할 것 같네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_Jhod
msgctxt "196fae23-5f16-452a-bfda-4dad5ff6ce2d"
msgid ""
"\"That's right, every word you said was perfect! With a ruler like this, the "
"future of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} is looking bright!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요, 하신 말씀 하나 하나가 버릴게 없었습니다! 이런 통치자와 함께라면 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 내일은 "
"밝아 보입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "33f068da-25b7-409c-a499-9ef4ba5f880f"
msgid ""
"\"Always knew {mf|he|she} will make a good {mf|king|queen}! Now I am not "
"ashamed to keep {mf|him|her} in my Hero party!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 처음부터 {mf|그|그녀가} 훌륭한 {mf|왕|여왕}이 될 걸 알고 있었다! 이제 내 영웅 일행에 넣어도 쪽팔리지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Julia
msgctxt "69dea2c6-6834-4cd7-b0ef-8d98d4745e8b"
msgid "\"Hail to the generous {mf|King|Queen}! Long live {name}!\""
msgstr "\"성은이 망극하나이다! {name} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxNoble
msgctxt "d51a827e-9771-4812-b01a-22cf96bc7786"
msgid ""
"\"That's what I call a true ruler! Hail to the {mf|King|Queen}! Hail to "
"freedom!\""
msgstr "\"이게 바로 진정한 통치자지! {mf|왕|여왕} 만세! 자유여, 영원하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "087e1f1d-4525-45bb-9e93-f50a510a2e9b"
msgid ""
"\"One more stronghold for freedom of speech! I could never have imagined I'd "
"someday be saying these words about this place, so grim it once seemed…\""
msgstr ""
"\"언론의 자유를 위한 또 하나의 거점이군! 그렇게 으스스했던 곳을 두고 이런 말을 하게 될 줄이야... 정말 상상도 못했던 일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "64619162-81d6-4b57-9822-338afe3148fe"
msgid ""
"\"With such a {mf|King|Queen} ruling here, even these lands — so mired in "
"crime and corruption — stand a chance of becoming worthy of their ruler! "
"Hurray!\""
msgstr ""
"\"범죄와 부패에 잠식당한 이 땅도, 이런 {mf|왕|여왕}의 다스림 아래에서라면 그 통치자에 걸맞은 땅이 될 수 있을테지! "
"{mf|왕|여왕} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a89147ca-d086-4a52-bde9-acc7e279de60"
msgid "\"Hail to the kindest ruler in all the lands!\""
msgstr "\"세상에서 가장 온화한 통치자를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b55ea8e9-4eec-42ec-a07b-27915103733f"
msgid "\"These are the words of a true leader! All hail!\""
msgstr "\"진정한 지도자의 연설이라면 이래야지! 모두 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "d312fa84-af6c-41bd-bc2e-92012670fb01"
msgid "\"Hail to the {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕} 전하를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : CivilianFemale_Rogue
msgctxt "40658c5e-889d-45d1-8b31-1aefdb01ff04"
msgid ""
"\"Let {mf|His|Her} Highness' name be praised throughout the centuries!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|국왕|여왕} 전하의 이름은 수 세기 동안 칭송받아야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9f2964e1-49fe-4227-a4b9-f047b8a207df"
msgid ""
"\"Those are the words of a true ruler, not some sweet crowd-pleasing lies.\""
msgstr "\"군중을 현혹하는 거짓이 아닌 진정한 통치자의 말이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f97b2f1d-b65b-4c88-a9b1-22d4b65a0ee1"
msgid ""
"\"Future wonders and amazing deeds echo in the {mf|King's|Queen's} words. "
"And to think – I'll see them with my own eyes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"굉장한 미래와 놀라운 행보가 {mf|왕|여왕}의 말에 메아리 치는 걸. 듣고나니 그걸 내 눈으로 직접 봐야겠단 생각이 드는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_CE_Reaction_Text_String
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "c0ecc93f-5b7d-45b8-9579-15b84129b1b3"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear several cries of woe, and someone bolts away in terror. The "
"whole crowd takes several steps back, clearly frightened — while their "
"hundreds of heads quickly bow before you, in humble acceptance of their "
"fate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여기 저기서 참담한 울음소리가 들리고, 몇몇은 공포에 질려 달아납니다. 군중 전체가 완연히 겁에 질려 몇 발짝 뒷걸음질 치면서도, "
"수백의 고개가 당신 앞에서 황급히 땅을 향합니다. 그들은 체념 속에 그들의 운명을 받아들이기로 했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_CG_Reaction_Text_String
msgctxt "017fe0f1-8bb0-4066-a00b-58fab50f2733"
msgid ""
"{n}Smiles light up the people's faces, and you can hear merry laughter and "
"shouts of approval. You see a few sarcastic grins as you speak, but these "
"grins are easily lost among the sea of smiling faces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}미소가 사람들의 얼굴을 밝히고 명랑한 웃음 소리와 찬성의 환호 소리가 들립니다. 연설 중에 드문드문 빈정대는 웃음이 보이긴 했지만, "
"그 비웃음은 웃음띤 얼굴의 바다에 묻혀 이내 사라졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_LE_Reaction_Text_String
#. Speaker : CapitalCivilianMale_Merchant
msgctxt "4bdbf4b6-7bc2-48d4-a80b-f7256914285b"
msgid ""
"{n}Cautious silence engulfs the crowd: the people look upon you with "
"respect, and apprehension. You see several elbowing their way through the "
"crowd — trying to escape in fear. But the rest listen in reverence, and none "
"dare attempt to interrupt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}조심스러운 침묵이 군중을 집어삼킵니다. 사람들은 존경의 눈으로, 그와 동시에 두려움의 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다. 몇몇이 두려움을 "
"이기지 못하고 군중을 헤치며 자리를 빠져나가는 모습이 보입니다. 그러나 대부분은 경외 속에 귀를 기울이며 감히 연설에 방해가 될 어떤 "
"행동도 하지 못합니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalEvents/Dialogues_Coronation/ktc41-Coronation_Outdoor/Cue_LG_Reaction_Text_String
msgctxt "d3b878f7-e7ed-4d46-a496-f44497563c74"
msgid ""
"{n}Several people glance at you grimly and turn away in haste, trying to "
"fade into a crowd. Most exchange quick looks and nod to each other, their "
"faces solemn and sedate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}몇몇 사람들이 당신을 두려운 눈빛으로 쳐다보더니 서둘러 군중 속으로 사라지려고 합니다. 대부분의 사람들은 엄숙하고 진지한 표정으로 "
"주변 사람들과 짧게 시선을 교환하고 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

