msgctxt "dd8cb376-7b10-4a92-b6a3-cdaa9cfc94cf"
msgid ""
"\"The Codex\"\n"
"This mysterious book, written in an unknown language, is thought to be the "
"codex of some secret society. The abbreviation \"RPG\" on its cover does "
"nothing to illuminate this mystery."
msgstr ""
"\"Codex\"\n"
"알려지지 않은 언어로 쓰여진 이 신비한 책은 비밀스런 사회의 고문서로 여겨집니다. 표지에 있는 약어 \"RPG\"는 이 수수께끼를 밝히는 "
"데 아무런 도움이 되지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/Barks/Bark_FaceCreator_Book_String
msgctxt "6d030770-4f8e-472c-a6e0-47d0b1a9c72f"
msgid ""
"\"Great Kings and Queens of the Past: Warren Blake\"\n"
"King Warren inspired numerous artists to paint portraits of His Highness. "
"Thanks to these portraits, his special \"royal\" mustache style became "
"extremely popular in countries across Golarion."
msgstr ""
"\"과거의 위대한 왕과 여왕: 워렌 블레이크\"\n"
"워렌 왕은 수많은 예술가들에게 영웅의 초상화를 그리도록 영감을 불어넣었습니다. 이 초상화 덕분에 그의 특별한 \"왕\"의 콧수염 스타일은 "
"골라리온 전역의 국가에서 매우 인기가 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/Barks/Bark_NPCcreator_Book_String
msgctxt "244495e9-4a56-4e67-9cd8-c8afcf439044"
msgid ""
"\"Great Kings and Queens of the Past: Joel McGillivray-Bove\"\n"
"It is rumored that King Joel was a pirate and an adventurer in his youth. "
"Joel raised his own kingdom from nothing, and he was well-loved by his "
"people. He often joked about getting back to sailing the open seas, and his "
"advisors constantly worried that it wasn't a joke."
msgstr ""
"\"과거의 위대한 왕과 여왕: 조엘 맥길리브 레이-보브\"\n"
"조엘 왕은 어린 시절 해적이었고 모험가였다는 소문이 돌았습니다. 조엘은 자신의 왕국을 빈손으로 시작해 세웠고 그의 백성들에게 "
"사랑받았습니다. 그는 종종 외딴 바다를 항해하겠다는 농담을했고 그의 보좌관은 그것이 농담이 아니란 것을 계속 걱정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/Barks/Bark_PartyBanter1_Book_String
msgctxt "65ed0eff-531f-4b47-bdf3-dc37ee71ad95"
msgid ""
"\"Great Kings and Queens of the Past: Magnus Borge\"\n"
"King Magnus was a prominent ruler and a famous collector of folklore. He "
"gathered, studied, and published many books of fairy tales and ballads of "
"various creatures that lived in the Stolen lands. His \"Goblin Poetry "
"Collection\" soon became an international best seller."
msgstr ""
"\"과거의 위대한 왕과 여왕: Magnus Borge\" \n"
"Magnus 왕은 저명한 통치자이자 민속학의 고명한 수집가였습니다. 그는 도둑맞은 땅에 살았던 다양한 동물들의 동화책과 발라드를 모아서 "
"연구하고 출판했습니다. 그의 \"고블린 시집\"은 곧 국제적인 베스트셀러가 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/Barks/Bark_PartyBanter2_Book_String
msgctxt "d8faa6b6-aa13-4067-8ba2-c42f1974917e"
msgid ""
"\"Great Kings and Queens of the Past: Jason Scott\"\n"
"King Jason Scott was undoubtedly enthralled with the mystery surrounding the "
"disappearance of Aroden, the Living God. He organized several expeditions, "
"searching for any clues that might shed some light on the mystery, and he's "
"said to give inspiration to the Archknights of Avistan themselves."
msgstr ""
"\"과거의 위대한 왕과 여왕: 제이슨 스콧\" \n"
"제이슨 스콧 왕은 의심할 여지없이 살아있는 신 아로덴의 실종을 둘러싼 수수께끼에 매료되었습니다. 그는 여러 탐험대를 조직하여 신비에 대해 "
"밝힐 수있는 단서를 찾았으며 아비스탄의 아크나이트에게 영감을 불어 넣었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/Barks/Bark_QuestCreator_Book_String
msgctxt "9703e6ad-fb30-40a0-8f0f-f2f4f229edf5"
msgid ""
"\"Great Kings and Queens of the Past: John Spiropulos\"\n"
"King John is remembered and respected across Golarion as a noble peacemaker. "
"Rumors say he was one of the patrons of the Suramgamin and a close friend to "
"their founder, Avalo himself."
msgstr ""
"\"과거의 위대한 왕과 여왕: 존 스피로풀로스\"\n"
"존 왕은 골라리온 전역에서 고상한 평화 주의자로 기억되고 존중받습니다. 소문에는 그가 수람가민의 후원자 중 한 사람이고 창업자인 아발로의 "
"친한 친구라고 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/LibrarianFemaleName_String
msgctxt "f843bc80-c4d1-4b7f-a711-8be19d9f743f"
msgid "Librarian"
msgstr "사서"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/LibrarianMaleName_String
msgctxt "86b67ce7-835d-4c84-8a1c-ba448123f797"
msgid "Head Librarian"
msgstr "수석 사서"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/NPCBarks/LibFemale1_String
msgctxt "ccfd13d1-fb24-46c1-8fc6-4dec78a88204"
msgid ""
"\"You know what I hate? Mummies. Perhaps it's because I'm the librarian.\""
msgstr "\"제가 싫어하는 게 뭔지 아십니까? 미이라입니다. 아마 제가 사서라서 그런게 아닐까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/NPCBarks/LibFemale2_String
msgctxt "9dcf7225-dc0e-4808-87bc-9cadabf41b91"
msgid ""
"\"I used to be a library keeper in Mivon. One day, I looked around and found "
"there were no more books to read. And so here I am! New library, new life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 원래 미본 도서관의 사서였습니다. 어느 날 주변을 둘러보니 더 이상 읽을 책이 없더군요. 그래서 이 새로운 도서관에서 새 삶은 "
"살기로 했죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/NPCBarks/LibFemale3_String
msgctxt "5bcd59e0-c612-4bef-be74-4529a0dd1a0f"
msgid ""
"\"Numerous books around, and very few people. That's what I call a perfect "
"job!\""
msgstr "\"책은 엄청나게 많은데, 사람은 거의 없죠. 이게 바로 완벽한 직업 아니겠습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/NPCBarks/LibMale1_String
msgctxt "6557aa93-f9f4-4900-ba4e-fc4033673754"
msgid "\"Sssh! Silence in the library. And best not blink.\""
msgstr "\"쉿! 도서관에선 조용히 하셔야 합니다. 눈 깜빡이는 소리도 자제해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/NPCBarks/LibMale2_String
msgctxt "76085ec5-59a0-4ffd-b110-50dd4442de7e"
msgid ""
"\"What do I like about libraries? The order! All the books are in their "
"proper places, all the shelves numbered and accounted...\""
msgstr ""
"\"도서관이 뭐가 좋냐구요? 그야 질서정연함이죠! 모든 책들이 제자리에 놓여 있고, 모든 책꽂이에는 번호가 매겨져 있고, 모든게 장부에 "
"기록되어 있습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalLibrary/NPCBarks/LibMale3_String
msgctxt "9dbc7139-a3af-475a-9468-6e335681a794"
msgid ""
"\"There's only one thing I hate about libraries. The visitors... Uh, except "
"for educated patrons of scholarship like yourself, of course.\""
msgstr "\"제가 도서관에 있어서 싫은 점은 딱 하나입니다. 방문객... 아, 물론 당신처럼 학식을 갖춘 후원자는 예외지만 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail1_String
msgctxt "6d525449-41e3-494c-94fa-952d0ba2adb5"
msgid "\"Greetings, {mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail2_String
msgctxt "5afcb2bf-1ed5-4f3c-a152-f515631389ff"
msgid "\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail3_String
msgctxt "fca12d23-3058-4567-8c25-fc7c011a59b7"
msgid "\"It's you! Good day, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"당신이시군요! 좋은 하루 보내십시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail4_String
msgctxt "81be62fa-42e3-4831-b991-fc70ecf264dd"
msgid ""
"\"The {mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen} {mf|him|her}self! Greetings, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}, 안녕하십니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail_Prosperous1_String
msgctxt "ae6dc569-e4c9-4eaf-9e56-33e0f013fb98"
msgid "\"Good day, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 보내세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail_Prosperous2_String
msgctxt "ef143874-5ac4-4fb2-8fff-35b0c8195ea2"
msgid "\"My regards, {mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 가세요. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|여왕 전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail_Prosperous3_String
msgctxt "9d250450-86c1-4f73-af03-9bf1c6245ee9"
msgid "\"What an honor to meet you today!\""
msgstr "\"뵙게되어 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_BaronHail_Prosperous4_String
msgctxt "f962adc0-5f39-4797-ac96-ac9e919433d6"
msgid "\"Greetings, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하신지요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_HailFromGuard1_String
msgctxt "4e6ac666-81b6-4a19-a73a-7f6238044436"
msgid "\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_HailFromGuard2_String
msgctxt "5af12ef1-ac68-4c23-9c7c-7bc333e34b5f"
msgid "\"Serving Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님을|영주님을|전하를|전하를} 모십니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_HailFromGuard3_String
msgctxt "597c5308-9707-4b4b-a4bc-8243d1860d47"
msgid "\"Greetings, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_HailFromGuard4_String
msgctxt "d110be1c-238b-49ed-ba3c-6e196b91e26e"
msgid "\"All clear, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"아무 문제 없습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_HailFromGuard5_String
msgctxt "f2487243-dbed-49ea-880f-d66449fe34d1"
msgid "\"Quite an honor!\""
msgstr "\"영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_HailFromGuard6_String
msgctxt "26c0c00c-18cb-4325-b7c2-4206ccf9e19b"
msgid "\"Good day, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 보내세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail1_String
msgctxt "4ab3e480-65e6-435c-a70f-8611c81bd68b"
msgid "\"Hail to the {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|전하|여왕 전하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail2_String
msgctxt "a20e203d-5a6f-4019-af75-318020cc3913"
msgid "\"Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail3_String
msgctxt "27e84fd6-049a-4aca-9c67-8f2e48eaf59c"
msgid "\"Hail to {mf|His|Her} Highness!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|전하|여왕 전하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail4_String
msgctxt "a6f51710-5393-4913-9d10-a4d7dcf9ba8c"
msgid "\"Your Royal Highness! What an honor!\""
msgstr "\"고귀하신 전하! 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail_Prosperous1_String
msgctxt "389bde8b-820e-4c65-afb1-82038a5b7f4a"
msgid "\"Meeting the {mf|king|queen} {mf|him|her}self! What a lucky day!\""
msgstr "\"전하를 뵙다니! 오늘은 운이 좋은 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail_Prosperous2_String
msgctxt "b8ac7351-1b96-4b53-9a2c-9cf969560292"
msgid "\"My {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}이시여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail_Prosperous3_String
msgctxt "d3728c73-5f79-4ab5-a99d-4604baeb9194"
msgid "\"My deepest regards, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"경의를 표합니다, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/Bark_Generic_KingHail_Prosperous4_String
msgctxt "24e86e3f-ac0e-4ccb-b0c6-f69665a0f64b"
msgid "\"May the gods bless your rule!\""
msgstr "\"당신의 통치에 신의 축복이 함께 하시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_01_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "43ee17cb-8bfe-4385-a2ee-703fcec924a3"
msgid ""
"\"Just like that. Took 'em down nice and easy. Whoa, pal — you sure you "
"wanna be walking around in a dead man's clothes?\""
msgstr "\"그냥 숨쉬듯이, 편하게 해치웠지. 워, 친구. 진짜 죽은 사람의 옷을 입고 다니고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_02_Bandit2_String
msgctxt "909bf418-4a2f-45aa-b17a-e420398849cd"
msgid ""
"\"No worries. I ain't superstitious. Just gotta think on your feet, that's "
"all. Look at these two — they weren't paying attention, and now they're dead."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"걱정 마. 미신 따위 믿지 않아. 그냥 잠깐 추억할 뿐, 그게 다야. 이 두 사람은 주의를 기울이지 않았고, 그래서 죽었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_03_Bandit2_String
msgctxt "5729504e-df06-4573-9e3a-96176855dae4"
msgid ""
"\"And us being quick and smart, their stuff's now ours. Clothes and all.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 빠르고 똑똑하며 그들의 물건은 이제 우리의 것이다. 옷과 모든 것들이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_04_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "9173acb1-9199-4ec8-8151-3c2773d21a55"
msgid ""
"\"Makes sense. Heh, look at this — I look just like one of them nobles! Just "
"yesterday we were tramping through mud, and now we're all dressed up!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 하. 이거 봐라. 나는 귀족 같아. 어제 우리는 진흙 투성이였었는데 이제 우리 모두 차려 입었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_05_Bandit2_String
msgctxt "447439d5-8402-464d-934a-a0e1091780c5"
msgid ""
"\"Yep. All that thieving and robbery — that's all behind us. From now on, "
"we'll be livin' like magnets! Er, magnates? Whatever, you know what I mean.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그 모든 도둑질과 강도 사건은 뒤에 우리가 있다. 이제부터 우리는 고물처럼 살 거야! 거물이였던가? 뭐든간에 내가 무슨 말 "
"하는지 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_06_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "cd27222b-79e3-4c57-934c-b23083c2e0cc"
msgid ""
"\"Yup, we'll be living the good life. I'm gonna buy myself a little tavern, "
"keep myself fat, drunk, and happy.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 우리는 좋은 삶을 살거야. 나는 작은 주점을 사서 배불리 먹고 술 마시면서 행복하게 지낼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_07_Bandit2_String
msgctxt "47bac277-fe27-4a22-82e8-048b51876d05"
msgid ""
"\"Think I might find myself a better wench. Who knows, maybe I'll even have "
"some kids...\""
msgstr "\"내가 더 어린 처녀라고 생각해 봐. 누가 알겠어. 어쩌면 애들도 가질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_08_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "0bdcf9b9-d947-4000-b6e8-faf69be5cb6e"
msgid ""
"\"A wench? You? You're gonna need way more money than that to make up for "
"that foul mug of yours...\""
msgstr "\"처녀? 네가? 네 더러운 낯짝을 꾸미기 위해 돈이 더 많이 필요할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_09_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "b6e7b10e-984a-4b9e-ad5c-f105bdbdba01"
msgid "\"Those merchants had deep pockets, but not THAT deep!\""
msgstr "\"그 상인들은 깊은 주머니가 있었지만 텅 비어있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_10_Bandit2_String
msgctxt "68c23918-e314-4a74-8af6-13a5744bd1e9"
msgid ""
"\"If we share the money with the rest of the gang, maybe. But if we keep the "
"split between just you and me...\""
msgstr "\"우리가 나머지 갱들과 돈을 나누면 말이야. 하지만 너와 내가 계속 분열하면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_11_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "5dca7509-c801-48ce-b535-d0f1a3ba20bc"
msgid ""
"\"They sure as hell wouldn't like that. You thinkin' we should croak 'em, "
"then?\""
msgstr "\"그들은 그것을 좋아하지 않을 것이다. 우리가 그들을 꺾어야 한다고 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_12_Bandit2_String
msgctxt "32b3793c-e615-4431-87be-f8ad24c24eb5"
msgid ""
"\"Sure. We cut down those merchants — we get to keep their stuff. What's to "
"share?\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다. 우리는 상점을 줄출발했습니니다. 우리는 물건을 가지고 있습니다. 무엇을 나누어야합니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Bandits_DeadBody_13_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "87bea6cc-0bc9-4eae-99a3-18dcd15c26c9"
msgid ""
"\"You said it. I'm a magnate now, after all — I got a fortune to keep. The "
"others can bite it. Damn, I just can't stop looking at this fine suit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 말했어. 난 결국엔 거물이야. 나는 계속 돈을 갖고 있고, 다른 사람들은 그것을 물을 수있다. 나는 이 멋진 옷을 보는 것을 "
"그만 둘 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_10_Complainer_String
msgctxt "5a3881c3-75f4-41cf-b7e1-c4bfa7bd5112"
msgid "\"In that case, I'll complain about you!\""
msgstr "\"그럴 경우 나는 너에 대해 불평 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_11_Clerk_String
msgctxt "0817d4f2-a8a9-4de2-9681-55870689326d"
msgid "\"And to whom will you be complaining?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 누구에게 불평할 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_12_Complainer_String
msgctxt "fe344c15-2bf2-4704-9ae3-9cb621aff722"
msgid "\"The guards!\""
msgstr "\"경비원들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_13_Clerk_String
msgctxt "00f2a93e-8b5a-4543-a724-ebce01e05fcb"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! And how do you intend to get them to listen? They cost even more than "
"I do!\""
msgstr "\"하! 어떻게 들었지? 그들은 나보다 더 많은 비용이 들었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_14_Clerk_String
msgctxt "58df648a-e66f-4ec1-b181-a7757cf2c003"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to get anywhere, you have to grease the wheels. And you seem "
"to be all out of grease!\""
msgstr "\"어디든 가고 싶으면 바퀴에 윤활유를 칠해야 한다. 그런데 너는 기름이 다 떨어진 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_1_Complainer_String
msgctxt "51eb4777-7854-4176-b29c-15a1d4ebb7c6"
msgid "\"Please, master secretary, just accept my complaint!\""
msgstr "\"제발. 총무 비서. 그냥 내 불만을 받아들여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_2_Clerk_String
msgctxt "7d8675ef-f875-4e9b-87fd-d7923e322b99"
msgid ""
"\"I've told you a dozen times now, you nitwit — you pay the fee, I register "
"your complaint. If you don't have the money, then get lost.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 12번이나 말했어. 너는 돈을 지불하면 나는 너의 불만을 등록한다. 돈이 없다면 꺼져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_3_Complainer_String
msgctxt "7ed5883d-8040-4794-aec8-1aa0b06ccaf9"
msgid ""
"\"But where am I supposed to get the money? They tricked me! Stole "
"everything I had!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 돈은 어디서 가져가지? 그들은 나를 속였어! 내가 가진 모든 것을 훔쳐갔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_4_Clerk_String
msgctxt "e606fbf1-190b-46af-bb3c-9ecb9a6954a7"
msgid "\"And how is that MY problem?\""
msgstr "\"이게 왜 '내' 문제야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_5_Complainer_String
msgctxt "f3f24af3-dd03-4ad8-851b-2f52fb8d2d33"
msgid "\"But... you're the secretary!\""
msgstr "\"하지만... 너는 비서야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_6_Clerk_String
msgctxt "18a6b12c-8947-4107-af69-3728eded36f1"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. And the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} pays me to perform my "
"duties.\""
msgstr "\"그렇지. 하지만 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 내가 임무 수행을 하도록 돈을 준다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_7_Clerk_String
msgctxt "9ac9d7c2-2056-4d10-b6f7-21a41d11e98d"
msgid "\"None of which include sorting out your petty problems!\""
msgstr "\"어느 누구도 너의 사소한 문제를 해결하지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_8_Complainer_String
msgctxt "f89d0a08-568f-4cef-bf49-8abed2691bfe"
msgid ""
"\"What ARE your duties, then? Isn't the secretary supposed to register "
"complaints?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 네 의무는 도대체 뭐야? 비서가 불만을 등록하는 것이 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Clerk_Complainer_9_Clerk_String
msgctxt "28a5399f-a604-4e00-bfb3-62f2b47b74a4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you think you're smart? I suppose those fellows must have been "
"geniuses to trick a smart guy like you! Or maybe you're not that smart, and "
"you're just being disrespectful. Do I need to call the guards?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 똑똑하다고 생각해? 너 같은 똑똑한 사람을 속이려 하다니 이 사람들 천재일 것 같아! 아니면 똑똑하지 않고 그저 무례한 행동을 "
"하는 거야. 내가 경비를 불러야 하나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_10_Monk_String
msgctxt "f3768e1e-d46c-47f9-a46f-cfc55bb63e9f"
msgid "\"That sounds horrible! How could you even think-\""
msgstr "\"그건 끔찍한 소리야! 어떻게 그런 말을?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_11_Bully1_String
msgctxt "75b8f073-86a9-4269-9bde-59a1a3f37f9a"
msgid "\"Didn't you want to feed the hungry? Those rats are VERY hungry!\""
msgstr "\"굶주린 사람들에게 밥을 주고 싶지 않았어? 그 쥐들은 매우 배가 고팠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_12_Monk_String
msgctxt "49d1b0dd-645b-44ad-bb4f-3b6d021d2538"
msgid "\"Help! Help!\""
msgstr "\"도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_13_Bully3_String
msgctxt "d44c9271-8f54-44ea-b785-d7b8d7239480"
msgid "\"No one's coming to help you. No one cares.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 너를 도우려고 하지 않는다. 아무도 신경 쓰지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_14_Guard_String
msgctxt "52515854-70d0-4265-9d3f-f4573ab531e2"
msgid "\"Hey, you there! What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"이봐 거기! 여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_15_Monk_String
msgctxt "2130735a-3f17-4239-8007-ba2e34573c99"
msgid "\"Khhh... Help...\""
msgstr "\"큭... 도와줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_16_Bully1_String
msgctxt "efd82b88-fde3-4649-b0d9-312114e0a342"
msgid "\"The fool was begging on our turf. 'For Desna's grace!' Ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"저 바보가 우리 땅에서 구걸했다. '데즈나의 은혜를 위해서!' 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_17_Guard_String
msgctxt "3225be33-bffd-4f16-9662-fa5d35fdd4d6"
msgid "\"Leave the poor sod alone, you hear?\""
msgstr "\"그 불쌍한 자를 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_18_Bully2_String
msgctxt "c836e9b3-e0c4-478f-88a4-5f93d6898920"
msgid ""
"\"What, you think you can tell us what to do? You interested in taking a "
"dirt nap next to your new best friend?\""
msgstr "\"네가 우리더러 이래라 저래라 할 수 있다고 생각하나? 새 친구 옆에서 낮잠을 자고 싶은 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_19_Guard_String
msgctxt "f65be6c6-7f5e-4b87-96d4-3bd4ed7d59cc"
msgid ""
"\"Look, I meant no disrespect, all right? Just... try to avoid killing "
"anyone this time — please. Cleaning up corpses is a real hassle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 무례한 뜻이 아니야. 이 시간에 누군가를 죽이는 것을 피하려는 거지. 부탁이야. 시체를 청소하는 것은 정말 번거로운 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_1_Bully1_String
msgctxt "affbef52-8e41-4f3f-a744-773ec8caae34"
msgid "\"Hey, you vagrant! Get lost!\""
msgstr "\"개뼉다구 같은 것! 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_20_Bully3_String
msgctxt "c653d68b-b049-4ed9-ae2e-9e1982f2fcd3"
msgid "\"Whatever. Get out of here. Go guard something.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든. 여기서 나가. 뭐든 지켜.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_21_Monk_String
msgctxt "c8d1de9d-b2d2-4d08-b557-74ea26f422a4"
msgid "\"Wait... Where are you...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... 너 어디서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_22_Bully1_String
msgctxt "2e9ea2ef-c530-4953-84b3-f2a72cc27e2c"
msgid ""
"\"Lucky day for you, vagrant. You get to keep begging another day — but "
"somewhere else, got it?\""
msgstr "\"운 좋은 날인줄 알아. 계속 구걸이나 하며 살아. 그러나 다른 곳에서 하라고. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_2_Monk_String
msgctxt "7b0b8c64-cc82-4130-980c-8149e23d9d28"
msgid "\"What are you doing? Stop!\""
msgstr "\"뭐하고 있어? 그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_3_Bully2_String
msgctxt "178b7921-4458-4438-b0c3-19fc303a12a9"
msgid ""
"\"You're sitting on OUR street begging for money! Who said you could do "
"that? Who'd you pay for the rights?\""
msgstr "\"네가 돈을 구걸하고 있는 거리는 우리의 거리다! 누가 그래도 된다고 했지? 권리금을 지불했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_4_Monk_String
msgctxt "5392ef75-c985-4bdb-aa46-8674bd573242"
msgid ""
"\"It's not for me, it's for the hungry! I'm collecting donations for those "
"who can't make it on their own. It's for Desna's grace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 나를 위한 것이 아니라 배고픈 사람들을 위한 것이다. 나는 스스로 벌 수 없는 사람들을 위해 기부금을 모으고 있다. 그것은 "
"데즈나의 은혜를 위한 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_5_Bully3_String
msgctxt "9ad868c8-815d-4f5e-bd71-9a567438c966"
msgid ""
"\"I don't give a shit about Desna's grace. This is Gorum's district, get me?"
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 데즈나의 은혜는 모른다. 이곳은 고룸의 구역이다. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_6_Monk_String
msgctxt "c367447c-0edd-40ee-8898-75a979fca02e"
msgid "\"Don't hurt me! Please!\""
msgstr "\"나를 해치지 마! 제발!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_7_Bully2_String
msgctxt "bd0224e1-d971-4a24-9fdb-edfa59cfe197"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! I think he's gonna cry! Why don't we teach him a lesson? I heard of "
"a fun new trick the other day...\""
msgstr "\"하하! 저녀석 울 것 같아! 그에게 교훈을 가르쳐주지 않을래? 나는 요즘 재밌는 트릭에 대해 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_8_Bully2_String
msgctxt "55a65770-ad50-470e-8e32-dedfd9f512d2"
msgid ""
"\"See, you tie a guy up and put a pot on his stomach, bottom up. Here's the "
"thing — the pot's full of rats!\""
msgstr "\"남자를 묶어 배 위에 냄비를 뒤집어 놓는다. 하지만 냄비에 쥐가 가득한 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/Monk_Bullies_9_Bully2_String
msgctxt "414022d5-ce2a-42f8-8271-916fedd00c8b"
msgid ""
"\"So you light a fire on top of the pot. When it gets hot, the rats go crazy "
"and try to tear their way out through the guy's guts!\""
msgstr "\"냄비 위에 불을 붙이면 뜨거워 질 거야. 쥐들은 미쳐서 남자의 배를 찢어 나오려고 하는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_10_OldThief_String
msgctxt "72f88ac7-4044-48bf-9861-f189b67b8e62"
msgid ""
"\"Last group of idiots who paid me to escort them was planning to raid a "
"wyvern's nest. When they got there, I kept to a corner and didn't lift a "
"finger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들을 호위하기 위해 나에게 돈을 지불한 마지막 바보들은 와이번의 둥지를 습격할 계획이었다. 그들이 거기에 도착했을 때 나는 구석에 "
"있었고 손가락 하나도 들지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_11_OldThief_String
msgctxt "ebfd1f61-8454-4557-bbec-ed0e701a19e2"
msgid "\"Half the party got mauled to death. Not me.\""
msgstr "\"일행의 반은 살이 찢겨 죽었어. 내가 아니라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_12_YoungThief_String
msgctxt "33aaf65b-d3a3-4fb9-9e41-fee6d735c804"
msgid "\"What about the other half?\""
msgstr "\"나머지 절반은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_13_OldThief_String
msgctxt "5fe5f03b-85bb-4fb4-875c-a8bc1a42a792"
msgid "\"Eaten by goblins.\""
msgstr "\"고블린에게 먹혔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_14_YoungThief_String
msgctxt "bddbe5dc-b41f-4c96-94c2-7bd77b1a4047"
msgid "\"Why didn't the goblins eat you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 고블린들이 너를 먹지 않았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_15_OldThief_String
msgctxt "d5621c40-fe59-4074-8c21-f0d2d6baf1ca"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I was long gone. See, that night I collected all the loot — and their "
"weapons and money.\""
msgstr "\"나는 오래전에 떠나 갔다. 그날 밤 나는 전리품과 무기와 돈을 챙겼다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_16_OldThief_String
msgctxt "48c07c4c-fd64-4d6c-9bd7-d115ced798ff"
msgid "\"I left behind a freshly dressed rabbit — kind of a parting gift.\""
msgstr "\"나는 예쁘게 옷을 입힌 토끼를 남겨 두었다. 작별 선물이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_17_OldThief_String
msgctxt "dd7d1c60-58fe-4885-82ed-72385fa9526e"
msgid ""
"\"Once the goblins smelled the blood, they attacked. The scatterbrains in "
"the camp didn't have a single knife to fight them off with.\""
msgstr "\"고블린이 피 냄새를 맡으면 공격을 한다. 수용소의 멍청이들은 칼도 하나 가지고 있지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_18_YoungThief_String
msgctxt "243a1127-c856-491e-bd41-88dead15057f"
msgid "\"That's disgusting!\""
msgstr "\"참 역겹다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_19_OldThief_String
msgctxt "7c9915f9-cae5-4f50-996a-7292f20e114d"
msgid ""
"\"It's smart. Now shut your trap and bring me something to eat, dear "
"apprentice.\""
msgstr "\"똑똑한 거야. 이제 함정을 닫고 나에게 무언가를 가져다 줘. 사랑하는 제자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_1_YoungThief_String
msgctxt "53d341e3-aef1-4e80-889a-b5d8d9ff4055"
msgid ""
"\"I still can't believe you took me on as your apprentice. You're a legend!\""
msgstr "\"나는 아직도 네가 견습생으로 나를 데려갔다는 것을 믿을 수 없다. 너는 전설이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_2_OldThief_String
msgctxt "52ac422a-ae1e-40f9-bd38-30ba9e5364db"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it won't be long before you learn the ropes. You seem like a bright "
"lad. Brighter than I was.\""
msgstr "\"흠. 너는 로프를 금방 배울 거야. 너는 똑똑한 청년처럼 보여. 나보다 더.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_3_OldThief_String
msgctxt "c82ee829-24dc-409d-a6c5-50ed17978c37"
msgid ""
"\"I used to have ideals like honor, valor, and justice. Wised up eventually, "
"though.\""
msgstr "\"나는 영예, 용맹, 정의와 같은 이상을 가졌지. 결국에는 현실을 알게 되었지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_4_YoungThief_String
msgctxt "1457222b-2cd3-4fb6-bca7-33f7086bf76e"
msgid "\"But what about the rogue's code? Honor among thieves?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 도둑들의 암호는 뭐야? 도둑들 사이의 명예?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_5_OldThief_String
msgctxt "c29b3fef-5ef4-4877-9dd8-bcab147db3cd"
msgid ""
"\"The craft has no place for codes or other trade lies that limit your "
"options.\""
msgstr "\"너의 선택을 제한하는 암호 또는 다른 거짓말 따위를 할 장소가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_6_OldThief_String
msgctxt "2e750544-fda6-4c7e-af13-c7781cbaf333"
msgid ""
"\"What good is sticking to some code if a simple backstab gets the job done "
"better?\""
msgstr "\"간단히 뒤에서 찔러 작업이 잘된다면 암호에 집착해 봐야 뭐가 좋겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_7_OldThief_String
msgctxt "124eb7ce-282b-4668-ab8c-b7ab3e7f8a34"
msgid ""
"\"Why fight someone face-to-face when you could just slit their throat while "
"they sleep?\""
msgstr "\"잠자는 동안 목을 베면 될 일이지 얼굴을 마주 보며 싸우는 이유는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_8_YoungThief_String
msgctxt "871111c3-f85d-4d46-86dc-e5e6cd697a01"
msgid "\"Well... what about your reputation?\""
msgstr "\"음... 네 평판은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CE/TwoThieves_9_OldThief_String
msgctxt "03a5cfbb-0c3a-4d1f-b418-95c7aca261dc"
msgid ""
"\"Survival's more important. A reputation's more trouble than it's worth.\""
msgstr "\"생존은 더 중요하다. 명성은 그 가치보다 더 골치 아프다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_10_Bard_String
msgctxt "6bacfead-7ea7-490d-8af4-6cef8886e1bb"
msgid ""
"\"You're nothing but a greedy, money-grubbing tyrant. You couldn't care less "
"for your daughter's happiness!\""
msgstr "\"너는 탐욕스럽고 돈벌레 같은 폭군일 뿐이다. 너는 딸의 행복을 신경도 쓰지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_11_Merchant_String
msgctxt "9b6f9c41-768f-4bc6-81ef-7bd0cdb5c9e8"
msgid ""
"\"I only wanted the best for her! For all of us, the whole family! Boys, I "
"think it's time you dusted this scoundrel's jacket.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그녀를 위해 최선을 다하고 싶었어! 우리 모두 가족를 위해서! 애들아. 이 악당의 재킷의 먼지를 털 때가 된 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_12_Bard_String
msgctxt "2f33ed2d-485d-49bf-ba09-d38d777e6c6a"
msgid "\"Stop! Not one more step! I'm no rich man, but I have friends, too!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 다가오지 마! 나는 부자가 아니고 친구도 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_13_Bard_String
msgctxt "e36df35c-036f-4766-9677-77085618c471"
msgid ""
"\"With just a whistle, this whole street — guards included — will fly to my "
"side! Then, it'll be you and your thugs getting a proper beating!\""
msgstr ""
"\"호루라기를 불기만 해도 경비원을 포함해 이 모든 길의 사람들이 내 편으로 붙을 것이다! 그러면 얻어맏는 쪽은 너와 네 깡패들일 거야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_14_Bard_String
msgctxt "ba036545-5d95-4781-bd10-f12c6ea5db5c"
msgid "\"My songs and ballads are more popular than your money, here!\""
msgstr "\"내 노래와 발라드가 너의 돈보다 인기있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_15_Merchant_String
msgctxt "027b3df1-3003-40f0-8367-7442572f98e6"
msgid "\"...All right, boys. Back off. But you, you lowlife...\""
msgstr "\"... 좋아. 이봐. 물러서라. 하지만 너. 하찮은 녀석...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_16_Bard_String
msgctxt "65e3409f-02c9-4231-a727-e945c4dd6a63"
msgid ""
"\"You'll never crush the spirit of freedom! It shall always live on — in me, "
"and in your daughter!\""
msgstr "\"너는 자유의 정신을 결코 꺾지 못할 것이다! 그것은 항상 나와 너의 딸 안에서 살 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_1_Bard_String
msgctxt "d41714b4-4ce5-4856-ba2d-56ddc3fdee5b"
msgid "\"Keep your dogs away from me! I'm a man of the arts!\""
msgstr "\"너의 개들을 치워! 나는 예술가야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_2_Merchant_String
msgctxt "7c90e98b-a812-4ce6-b232-d59cc82e632e"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know what you've done?! My own daughter, run off with some good-for-"
"nothing, lowlife huckster!\""
msgstr "\"네가 한 짓을 아느냐? 내 딸은 쓸모없는 녀석을 데리고 도망갔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_3_Merchant_String
msgctxt "262d6f80-e526-4314-9356-92e9dd78fd8d"
msgid "\"And you... You...!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너... 너...!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_4_Bard_String
msgctxt "30bc2064-168d-4f6c-9df3-cb774d257946"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I helped them! And I'd do it again! Their love is stronger than your "
"petty prejudice!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 나는 그들을 도왔다! 그리고 나는 다시 그것을 할 것이다! 그들의 사랑은 너의 사소한 편견보다 강할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_5_Merchant_String
msgctxt "d7973398-9acf-41e1-8980-eaf22876b840"
msgid ""
"\"You idiot! That was nothing more than a young girl's whim! How could she "
"ever love some threadbare beggar?!\""
msgstr "\"바보야! 그건 어린 소녀의 변덕일 뿐이야! 어떻게 그녀가 뻔한 거지를 사랑할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_6_Bard_String
msgctxt "4598b696-a23b-43da-a769-826c779796f1"
msgid ""
"\"Let's see — he's smart, he's handsome, and he loves your daughter with all "
"his heart. That seems like a good start!\""
msgstr "\"보자. 그는 똑똑하고 잘 생겼고 너의 딸을 온 마음으로 사랑한다. 좋은 시작인 것 같군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_7_Merchant_String
msgctxt "37902fee-9380-4893-bf8c-009a3fdc8ac2"
msgid "\"But she was already betrothed! To the son of my business partner!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 그녀는 이미 약혼했다! 나의 사업 파트너의 아들에게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_8_Merchant_String
msgctxt "6eeec1b1-6ddd-4045-a2a6-cc5eb88ee45a"
msgid ""
"\"We've been waiting so long — we were finally going to found a dynasty! A "
"trade empire!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 오랫동안 기다려 마침내 왕조를 설립하게 되었다! 무역 제국을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/BardMerchant_9_Merchant_String
msgctxt "eb18bf3b-0733-4350-a932-08d758fe3732"
msgid "\"And then you...\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_10_String
msgctxt "ab0a0dd1-f36b-438e-aa89-2c0173bc1871"
msgid "\"A fire's burning inside me! Who wants to share in it?\""
msgstr "\"내 안에서 불이 타오르고 있어! 나와 공유하고 싶은 자가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_1_String
msgctxt "835a910e-f5c3-45f4-9cde-6bf6ee000bf6"
msgid "\"Today's a great day for a feast!\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 잔치를 위한 좋은 날이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_2_String
msgctxt "4dfc1c25-cd3a-4c84-a2f7-e331f5342181"
msgid "\"Praise be to Cayden Cailean!\""
msgstr "\"케이든 케일리엔에게 찬양을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_3_String
msgctxt "39e04153-973c-4484-ad87-3708f34d07cf"
msgid "\"Praise to the Drunken God!\""
msgstr "\"술취한 신에게 찬양을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_4_String
msgctxt "cce223d4-d4e7-4c34-b358-dc49f291025f"
msgid "\"Come with us!\""
msgstr "\"우리와 함께 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_5_String
msgctxt "6cab7359-c594-4870-b35b-4ba3c4381283"
msgid "\"Drink with us, friend!\""
msgstr "\"우리와 함께 마셔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_6_String
msgctxt "481e56f2-0ea6-4a23-a465-de02f0cf2391"
msgid "\"I'm having fun today!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 재미있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_7_String
msgctxt "c1290d02-cc5c-479b-b650-ff00d0b50d66"
msgid "\"Forget your worries! Tonight, it's gonna get loud!\""
msgstr "\"너의 걱정을 잊어. 오늘 밤 소란스러울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_8_String
msgctxt "fd339fdf-2109-4423-a971-46ec8892ffce"
msgid "\"Don't be such a bore! Come on!\""
msgstr "\"지루하게 만들지 마라. 마시라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/FunnyCrowd_9_String
msgctxt "bbae8279-ed50-448c-98ca-13ee4b43c495"
msgid "\"Only a drunk can go on a real adventure!\""
msgstr "\"취한 사람만이 진짜 모험을 할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_10_Healer_String
msgctxt "6f5f8949-4240-4609-90c2-e8af11079c1e"
msgid "\"I don't have any permits. I'm an herbalist, not an apothecary.\""
msgstr "\"나는 허가증이 없다. 나는 약초꾼이고 약사는 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_11_Guard_String
msgctxt "7f421eda-e283-4983-b257-15f435b6c88f"
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately, that's not a distinction for you to make. You do know "
"unlicensed medicinal trade is against the law, right?\""
msgstr "\"유감스럽게도 그걸로 너의 행위를 증빙할 수는 없다. 무면허 의약품 거래가 법에 위배된다는 것을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_12_Healer_String
msgctxt "726ff1ac-629f-4a61-829c-413e603e8d49"
msgid ""
"\"Do YOU know that I help scores of people who don't have the gold for those "
"fancy clerics and licensed doctors?\""
msgstr "\"그 멋진 성직자와 면허있는 의사들에게 금을 주지 못하는 수많은 사람들을 내가 돕는다는 것을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_13_Healer_String
msgctxt "ab9a8783-de4d-4888-a6b0-23a76b0e690d"
msgid ""
"\"Not to mention the ones who get thrown out before they're even seen, just "
"because they smell? Did you know that, Mr. 'unlicensed medicinal trade'?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 냄새가 나기 때문에 보여지기 전에 사람들은 쫓는 것은 말할 것도 없다는 건가? '무면허 의약품 무역인'씨는 그것을 알고 있었나?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_14_Guard_String
msgctxt "bb219867-8e02-4146-93b2-32393a7d288a"
msgid "\"Hey, easy now...\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 진정해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_15_Healer_String
msgctxt "e9fe8eea-2cb8-4269-9252-47e8f49e37a6"
msgid "\"Go on, then! Take me away to prison!\""
msgstr "\"어서! 나를 감옥에 처 넣어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_16_Beggar_String
msgctxt "ff3ff4b9-9713-4f5f-a224-c45dc3f7ddcb"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you dare! She saved my life, and my child's! She's helped all of us!"
"\""
msgstr "\"어디서 감히! 그녀는 내 목숨과 내 아이를 구했다! 그녀는 우리 모두를 도왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_17_Guard_String
msgctxt "e071adbb-4fc4-4861-947a-295c84f857a3"
msgid "\"Hey, settle down, now. I'm not taking anyone anywhere.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 진정해. 나는 누구도 아무데도 데리고 가지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_18_Guard_String
msgctxt "3d4d4d66-5197-455b-8325-019edfaca6e6"
msgid "\"I just think you should be more cautious, ma'am.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 좀 더 신중해야 한다고 생각했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_19_Healer_String
msgctxt "53fed19a-510e-4ef3-8b3f-32467626e8b0"
msgid "\"What do you mean?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 뜻이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_1_Healer_String
msgctxt "1a3d6cdc-51d0-462e-b411-2bddbeedb7eb"
msgid ""
"\"So remember, one tablespoon from this flask every morning, and take two of "
"these pills each day after eating a meal.\""
msgstr "\"매일 아침 이 플라스크에서 한 스푼을 챙겨 먹고 식사를 한 후에 매일 알약 두 개를 복용해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_20_Guard_String
msgctxt "86288b5f-3713-430d-be00-9a6a44f088b4"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't the first time I've seen you here. What if someone else notices "
"and decides to report you?\""
msgstr "\"너를 본 건 처음이 아니다. 누군가 너를 보고 신고하기로 마음 먹는다면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_21_Healer_String
msgctxt "35c7033c-cdf0-40f7-a118-d8541a987f3f"
msgid "\"They won't. We don't have anyone like that in the city.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 그렇게 하지 않을 것이다. 우리 도시에는 그런 사람이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_22_Guard_String
msgctxt "beb63d2c-aa24-4c2b-bda8-c3bfd522328e"
msgid "\"You're a brave one. What's your name?\""
msgstr "\"너는 용감하군. 이름이 뭐니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_23_Healer_String
msgctxt "7f9d4313-8466-4dd8-8994-387977cbeb02"
msgid "\"Why do you ask?\""
msgstr "\"왜 물어보지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_24_Guard_String
msgctxt "ee197796-278e-4ffe-9b6f-16ebac8aa5a9"
msgid "\"Well, it's harder to ask you out if I don't know your name.\""
msgstr "\"내가 네 이름을 모르는지 물어 보는 건 더 힘들다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_25_Healer_String
msgctxt "ffc83cad-1b57-44de-ab77-f78e7c723c42"
msgid ""
"\"Stow it, lover boy. Come back when you're a few years older. Unless you're "
"desperate enough to help me feed the beggars this evening — then maybe we "
"could talk.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넣어둬. 몇 년 후에 돌아와. 내가 오늘 거지에게 먹을 것을 주는 것을 네가 도울 정도로 절박하지 않다면 그 때 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_2_Beggar_String
msgctxt "18163d56-2023-40c7-bc66-f49be6fcb526"
msgid "\"Thank you, ma'am! If not for you, we'd all be dead!\""
msgstr "\"고마워! 네가 아니라면 우리 모두 죽을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_3_Healer_String
msgctxt "54d4e5a7-62d5-4ea2-9016-a6ee45706dab"
msgid "\"No need to thank me. It's not your fault you got sick.\""
msgstr "\"고마워 할 필요가 없다. 아프다는 것은 네 잘못이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_4_Beggar_String
msgctxt "681e499b-a488-4981-bf41-39281078aa56"
msgid "\"Thank you, ma'am!\""
msgstr "\"고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_5_Guard_String
msgctxt "ff03d2fd-03e4-4c37-96e1-eb226500a33f"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_6_Beggar_String
msgctxt "17c494db-a18c-4344-96af-1d4aa65812d1"
msgid "\"N-nothing, sir. I was just leaving.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 아니야. 그냥 떠나고 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_7_Guard_String
msgctxt "edcfb641-c861-4f88-b409-23cd51784141"
msgid "\"Hold on. What's that you have, there? Show me.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만. 네가 가진 것은 뭐지? 나에게 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_8_Beggar_String
msgctxt "c3f2eb81-e439-4dd0-bab8-80af11d239e1"
msgid "\"It's... it's medicine, sir.\""
msgstr "\"그건... 약이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/HealerGuard_9_Guard_String
msgctxt "772f87c8-9928-42d2-bb0c-779f3f61d58b"
msgid ""
"\"Medicine, huh? And were you the one that gave it to him? I'm sure you have "
"a license to sell that, right?\""
msgstr "\"약? 그에게 약을 준 게 너야? 그걸 팔 수 있는 면허가 있겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_10_FirstDrunker_String
msgctxt "cb710e28-2a77-44b1-969b-ac4a8f7de6df"
msgid ""
"\"Right, and you should have seen her chase the old fool down the street — "
"all the way back to their house! His reputation's ruined.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 너는 그녀가 길가에서 늙은 바보를 쫓아다니는 것을 보았어야 했다. 그들의 집까지 말이야! 그의 평판은 망했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_11_ThirdDrunker_String
msgctxt "64b45111-3871-4832-b66d-ba0c89614b71"
msgid "\"So who is this Sharp-eye fellow?\""
msgstr "\"이 '매의 눈'은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_12_FirstDrunker_String
msgctxt "a832a319-051c-4833-922e-f30dca104615"
msgid "\"No one knows! That's why he's got that nickname.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 몰라! 그래서 그 별명을 얻었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_13_ThirdDrunker_String
msgctxt "4ca4d424-3643-4e63-9a43-49334bb77d0c"
msgid ""
"\"What if it's the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} {mf|him|her}self? Or maybe "
"one of {mf|his|her} advisors!\""
msgstr "\"만약 그것이 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이라면? 아니면 {mf|그의|그녀의}의 보좌관일지도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_14_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "16f34399-5205-4298-b11c-db6a40b05be7"
msgid ""
"\"My brother met him once. He was out on patrol, and a group of bandits "
"ambushed them!\""
msgstr "\"내 형제가 한 번 그를 만났다. 그는 순찰 중이었고 한 무리의 도둑이 그를 습격했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_15_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "8a84c4fc-e64d-4b79-887a-63c0b89d08a3"
msgid ""
"\"The guards were losing pretty badly, then — bam! Sharp-eye. He saved their "
"skins that day.\""
msgstr "\"경비원은 거의 지고 있었다. 그 때 '매의 눈'이 나타났다. 그는 그들을 구했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_16_FirstDrunker_String
msgctxt "ec14cff2-9428-48ae-92d0-f3d7152296b3"
msgid ""
"\"And they didn't arrest him? I mean, isn't he technically a criminal?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 그들은 그를 체포하지 않았나? 엄연한 범죄자가 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_17_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "79d0395a-9d26-43d9-8455-a8ded5cb3939"
msgid "\"Would you arrest someone who just saved your life?\""
msgstr "\"너라면 목숨을 구한 사람을 체포하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_18_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "386381ec-17ac-420e-ac7a-17e370e26cca"
msgid ""
"\"Not a chance. In fact, my brother just shook his hand and thanked him!\""
msgstr "\"어림도 없다. 사실 내 형제는 악수를 하고 고맙다고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_1_FirstDrunker_String
msgctxt "5b6d7cca-8a45-46f1-9937-23a457ed9ede"
msgid "\"Did you hear? Sharp-eye strikes again! It was a massacre!\""
msgstr "\"들었어? '매의 눈'이 또 한바탕 했다는 군! 그것은 학살이었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_2_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "793a3ab9-f811-463d-ac99-299adfa7a2aa"
msgid ""
"\"It wasn't a massacre — it was justice! Everyone knows that judge always "
"ruled in favor of the rich!\""
msgstr "\"그것은 학살이 아니었어. 그것은 정의였다! 모두가 유전무죄라는 것을 알고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_3_ThirdDrunker_String
msgctxt "41e4e685-d69e-48f3-9e84-b86929cbb398"
msgid "\"Who's Sharp-eye?\""
msgstr "\"'매의 눈'이 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_4_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "42a5b242-bfa5-48e3-9413-08e15231c5b9"
msgid ""
"\"Not from these parts, huh? He's a local hero! Protector of the people.\""
msgstr "\"그런 부류가 아니라고. 그는 이 지역의 영웅이다. 시민의 수호자이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_5_FirstDrunker_String
msgctxt "99d39131-8346-4840-9367-e30e788bf7a9"
msgid ""
"\"He avenges the simple folk. They say he's the best bowman in the world.\""
msgstr "\"그는 민초들을 위해 보복한다. 그들은 그를 세계에서 가장 좋은 궁수라고 말한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_6_ThirdDrunker_String
msgctxt "0aa766b2-dcd2-4136-b2c0-963cade314d2"
msgid "\"So, he kills people for justice?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그는 정의를 위해 사람들을 죽이나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_7_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "a7f81827-f937-45f1-8ded-a402c395867a"
msgid ""
"\"No, his arrows strike their pride, not their hearts. A while back, the "
"judge's wife got a note from a secret well-wisher telling her she should go "
"out for dinner at a local tavern.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 그의 화살은 그들의 심장이 아닌 그들의 자부심을 찌른다. 수 개월 전에 재판관의 아내는 의문의 사람으로부터 현지 선술집에서 "
"저녁 식사를 해야 한다는 쪽지를 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_8_FirstDrunker_String
msgctxt "fc06cec7-1994-4671-971c-529acc988ac4"
msgid ""
"\"She did, and what did she see? Her husband, sitting at a table with his "
"arms around two fun-loving girls...\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 식사를 했고 그녀는 무엇을 보았는지 알아? 그녀의 남편이 양 팔에 술집 여자를 끼고 탁자에 앉아있었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CG/SharkEye_9_SecondDrunker_String
msgctxt "69a29c3d-3351-4d5e-bc6a-ca74d3dede9b"
msgid ""
"\"It was a scandal! The judge had to leave his post after that, of course. "
"How can someone who was caught cheating on his own wife be trusted to judge "
"others?\""
msgstr ""
"\"스캔들이었지! 판사는 그 후 자신의 직위를 떠나야만 했다. 바람을 피운 사람이 어떻게 다른 사람을 판단할 수 있는 신뢰를 얻을 수 "
"있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_10_Dealer_String
msgctxt "978c632c-e732-4666-9752-f5bb473f0962"
msgid ""
"\"Again, that was you, not me. I'm just supplying a demand, got that? All "
"right, lads, get him out of here already!\""
msgstr "\"다시 한번 말하는데 그건 내가 아니고 너야. 난 단지 수요가 있어 공급을 하고 있어. 좋아. 애들아. 그를 쫓아내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_11_Junky_String
msgctxt "a4883231-43cf-4d33-9baa-0a10505516a9"
msgid ""
"\"Hey — hey, I'm sorry, man! I'm just a little crazy without the stuff, is "
"all. Please, just a taste'll set me right...\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 미안해! 나는 물건이 없으면 조금 미친다고. 제발 조금만 맛보게 해줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_1_Junky_String
msgctxt "6b8ba93d-c221-4b5f-8a29-425120ffd196"
msgid "\"Please, just gimme one more hit of the stuff. Please!\""
msgstr "\"제발. 제발 한방만 더 줘봐. 제발!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_2_Dealer_String
msgctxt "21f73b7b-d10d-48c8-913a-54f9eae56680"
msgid "\"Money first. This ain't a charity.\""
msgstr "\"돈이 먼저다. 여긴 자선 단체가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_3_Junky_String
msgctxt "3fd96c37-c1c8-4e82-88d2-3255826ed230"
msgid "\"Come on, you know me! I'll pay ya back!\""
msgstr "\"왜 이래. 나를 알잖아! 나는 다시 돈을 지불할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_4_Dealer_String
msgctxt "50444c7d-7b86-4eb0-9c72-9c1ccd1991c6"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, I know you — just like I know all the rest of the scum around here. "
"I still got more than enough sense not to trust any of you on your word.\""
msgstr "\"너를 알지. 이 주변의 쓰레기들을 모두 알고 있는 것처럼. 너의 말은 믿지 않을 정도로 충분한 지각력을 가지고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_5_Junky_String
msgctxt "e0a1698d-d00c-4fb0-9f52-7d291dbe909d"
msgid ""
"\"Please, I'm begging you! You know how it makes you feel — like you're a "
"feather, and the wind is whisking you far away... and away... and away...\""
msgstr "\"제발 부탁해! 네 기분이 어떤지 알아. 너는 깃털처럼 바람에 날리고 있어. 멀리 그리고 멀리...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_6_Dealer_String
msgctxt "87eca84e-7e00-4f17-850f-797678ac8f30"
msgid "\"I don't know. No way I'm putting that rot in my body.\""
msgstr "\"나는 모르겠다. 나는 내 몸에 그 썩은 것을 넣지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_7_Junky_String
msgctxt "85047b3e-9e8a-431f-8bca-4387cce3390c"
msgid ""
"\"Rot?! That's what you think, and you sell it to us anyway?! ...Come on, "
"just give me the stuff! I don't have any more money — I've already given you "
"everything I had!\""
msgstr ""
"\"썩었다고?! 그게 네가 생각하는 거야? 그걸 팔겠다고?! ... 나에게 그 물건을 줘. 나는 돈이 없다. 이미 내가 가진 모든 것을 "
"너에게 주었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_8_Dealer_String
msgctxt "bdd8124d-9b2c-44ec-bac9-3544f8c797b1"
msgid ""
"\"And did I make you try it? Did I make you pawn everything you own? No, "
"that was you. It's your problem, not mine.\""
msgstr "\"누가 해보라고 했어? 내가 너의 모든 것을 저당 잡게 했나? 아니지. 네가 그랬다. 너의 문제야. 내 것이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Drugs_9_Junky_String
msgctxt "0124299d-b5a5-437f-8cc1-389f1f5d30f9"
msgid "\"Damn you, you bastard! You broke my life to pieces!\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 개자식! 네 인생은 망칠 줄 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_10_Merchant_String
msgctxt "131f2440-8488-4bef-bad5-a18f7ef20a35"
msgid "\"What have you done?!\""
msgstr "\"너 뭐한 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_11_Guard_String
msgctxt "4262b1e3-e85a-4bef-b604-bf7e80e1cc6a"
msgid ""
"\"Listen close, now. I don't give a damn how much you had to pay for that "
"piece of paper.\""
msgstr "\"들어라. 나는 그 종이 쪼가리에 얼마를 지불해야 하는지에 대해선 관심도 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_12_Guard_String
msgctxt "307af26f-dd4e-44c5-a564-0b0e5277df68"
msgid "\"You're going to jail. Right now.\""
msgstr "\"너는 감옥에 갈거야. 당장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_13_Merchant_String
msgctxt "92fd39b6-12df-43d0-b116-b92e674e56b3"
msgid "\"But that's against the law!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 그건 법에 위배된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_14_Guard_String
msgctxt "59d74357-ebc8-4bc5-b73a-be6ee304a3a2"
msgid ""
"\"Screw the law. No one's making my neighbors drink this strange slop, "
"especially for their own money.\""
msgstr "\"법은 개나 줘. 아무도 내 이웃들이 이 이상한 물약을 특히 돈을 내고 마시지 못하게 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_15_Merchant_String
msgctxt "ba9970ba-2a3a-4272-926b-edf2013c0d4a"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, good sir... Perhaps we could... strike an agreement? I can be very "
"generous!\""
msgstr "\"들어 봐... 아마도 합의를 볼 수 있을까? 나는 아주 친절하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_16_Guard_String
msgctxt "c09fdc58-6f8d-4686-a192-d7a6b50aeedd"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now you're selling to the right market. Let's see what you have... "
"Heh, not bad for a day's work!\""
msgstr "\"지금 너는 옳은 거래를 하는 중이다. 네가 가진 것을 보자... 하루 일 치고 나쁘지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_17_Merchant_String
msgctxt "9b252bfb-a1e8-454a-9fad-2c60eba63a78"
msgid ""
"\"Would you... like to try the oil anyway? It's a most incredible medicine!\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 이 기름을 시험해보고 싶어? 이것은 가장 놀라운 약이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_18_Guard_String
msgctxt "82db222e-cf23-4404-97f0-c2a615d1420e"
msgid ""
"\"Don't push your luck. I'm still not convinced you wouldn't look better "
"behind bars. Now listen up — I'll be back again later today, and you better "
"be sure you got the same amount you just gave me. Got it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 운을 시험하지 마라. 나는 여전히 네가 철창행이라 생각하는 중이니. 그러니 들어라. 나는 오늘 중에 다시 돌아올 것이고 너는 "
"나에게 준 같은 양을 주어야 할 거야. 알겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_1_Merchant_String
msgctxt "06217079-b04a-46bb-a827-a183a18e6262"
msgid ""
"\"Get it while you can! Manticore gland oil, a wonder from faraway lands! "
"Cures any ailment, eliminates hernia and gout, brings back youth and "
"virility!\""
msgstr ""
"\"할 수있는 동안 그것을 얻으라! 만티코어 오일은 머나먼 땅에서 들여온 것이다! 질병을 치료하고 탈장과 통풍을 제거하고 젊음과 정력을 "
"되찾는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_2.1_Crowd_String
msgctxt "30cee2f0-fcae-42e8-8bf3-076ff659c818"
msgid "\"I'll buy some!\""
msgstr "\"내가 살 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_2.2_Crowd_String
msgctxt "d095db86-5a7f-4302-ae42-f9ada254d45a"
msgid "\"Three bottles here!\""
msgstr "\"여기 세 병!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_2.3_Crowd_String
msgctxt "1f59d13e-0972-44f9-83ae-725c829b0990"
msgid "\"Stop pushing!\""
msgstr "\"밀지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_2.4_Crowd_String
msgctxt "8fd34bc9-54a2-4a63-8412-2e6124c4f736"
msgid "\"Here, here!\""
msgstr "\"여기, 여기!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_2.5_Crowd_String
msgctxt "f57ce487-56bb-433e-abfa-2cc87d0f1246"
msgid "\"I should get some for my father...\""
msgstr "\"내 아버지를 위해 좀 가져가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_3_Merchant_String
msgctxt "bee26978-410f-48ce-8802-edab39f787ba"
msgid "\"Almost gone, don't miss your chance!\""
msgstr "\"거의 사라졌어. 기회를 놓치지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_4_Guard_String
msgctxt "39e3b7e2-c5ac-45d8-a79b-da8e677ded87"
msgid "\"Make way, make way! All right, what's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"비켜. 비켜! 여기에 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_5_Merchant_String
msgctxt "e31d5ca4-e247-4f65-8b6c-24bbb1f85121"
msgid ""
"\"Manticore gland oil, sir! A wondrous tincture, and much cheaper than a "
"mage's services. Try it — I guarantee you won't regret your purchase!\""
msgstr "\"만티코어 기름을 판다! 마법사의 서비스보다 훨씬 저렴한 약제다. 한번 먹어봐. 구매한 것이 후회되지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_6_Guard_String
msgctxt "8cbe2bdf-ee15-4996-9138-2d85db61e66a"
msgid "\"No way am I trying this sludge. You're nothing but a charlatan!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 쓰레기를 시험하려는 것이 아니다. 너는 돌팔이에 불과하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_7_Merchant_String
msgctxt "2dc45432-ea3b-49c3-990e-bd5aa7a829ad"
msgid ""
"\"How could you say such a thing, sir? I'm no charlatan — I even have a "
"license!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있지? 나는 돌팔이가 아니다. 나는 면허가 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_8_Guard_String
msgctxt "9840d99d-eb45-49d6-91b1-09a1cf023581"
msgid "\"A license, huh? Show me.\""
msgstr "\"면허라고? 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/FakeMerchant_9_Guard_String
msgctxt "d10afd12-8c3b-495f-85a1-e06dcabe34cf"
msgid "\"Aaannd, there you go. No more license.\""
msgstr "\"봐. 역시나. 면허증이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_10_Father_String
msgctxt "92b25200-689e-413c-9551-a20686653980"
msgid "\"You make a living by robbing people!\""
msgstr "\"사람들을 등쳐먹다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_11_Bandit_String
msgctxt "974385a5-e4d6-4ad2-ab3d-dafc9ec65817"
msgid ""
"\"Well, we might shake down a foreign merchant every once in a while, but "
"we've never laid a finger on one of our own. And as you can see, we always "
"pay for our drinks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 한 번씩 외국 상인을 수색할 수도 있지만 우리는 결코 우리 상인에게 손가락 하나 대지 않았다. 그리고 네가 볼 수 있듯이 "
"우리는 항상 값을 지불한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_12_Bandit_String
msgctxt "f005b48d-11ca-408d-bd1e-f3a93ebe4ed9"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, kid, you have quick hands — no problem at all catching that coin. "
"Happen to know anything about locks? Wanna join us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 꼬마야. 너는 빠른 손을 가지고 있구나. 저 동전을 집는데 전혀 문제가 없겠다. 자물쇠에 대해 알고 싶어? 우리와 함께하고 "
"싶니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_13_Father_String
msgctxt "002d9e8c-0bf3-4c1b-9f02-d68a8b5faa4e"
msgid "\"You stay away from him!\""
msgstr "\"그에게서 떨어져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_1_YoungMan_String
msgctxt "b299e70f-a200-46db-83f1-4c8bb35bb3db"
msgid "\"Who are they, Father?\""
msgstr "\"그들은 누구죠. 아버지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_2_Father_String
msgctxt "4c6581d9-2f42-4941-860a-1861981bb321"
msgid "\"Look away, boy! You keep away from them, hear? Those are bandits.\""
msgstr "\"고개 돌려. 꼬마야! 그들을 보지 말라고. 알겠어? 저들은 도둑이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_3_Bandit_String
msgctxt "28b7d941-eded-4e17-8e59-209cdef48b42"
msgid "\"Bandits? Nonsense! We're the Free Forest Brotherhood!\""
msgstr "\"도적? 말도 안돼! 우리는 자유로운 숲의 형제단이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_4_Father_String
msgctxt "73bb5124-67c9-481b-9481-c2f863effa85"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, brotherhood, sure. Got nothing better to do than prowl the wilds, huh? "
"Could've had a normal life, earning your bread with honest work like us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"형제단이라고. 그러시겠지. 야생을 배회하는 것 말고는 할 일이 없겠지? 우리와 같이 정직한 일을 하며 벌어 먹고 사는 정상적인 삶을 "
"누릴수 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_5_Bandit_String
msgctxt "51eb76a7-a75e-4630-9c19-4493307b1e03"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you tell us how to live, mister. Go home and preach to your wife, if "
"you want. We do what we want. Here, kid — go buy yourself something nice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이래라 저래라 하지 말아라. 하고 싶으면 집에 가서 너의 아내에게 설교해라. 우리는 원하는 것을 하겠다. 여기. 사고 싶은 물건을 "
"사거라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_6_YoungMan_String
msgctxt "1bb4c4f6-fb10-446e-97ef-f3ddcbf9615e"
msgid "\"Thanks!\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_7_Father_String
msgctxt "96dca9e0-7052-4611-a6e8-b2a9b720731a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, sure, you do what you want — unless you want to say some choice words "
"to that wretch who bosses you around!\""
msgstr "\"물론 원하는 것을 하겠지. 너를 괴롭히는 그 비참한 사람들에게 막말을 하려는 거라면 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_8_Bandit_String
msgctxt "e106b5c4-4f6e-4a33-b83e-24c68c213446"
msgid ""
"\"Wrong again, mister. Whatever we do, we make sure it's fair. You work "
"more, you earn more. You got the most respect, you get to be the boss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"틀렸어. 우리가 무엇을 하든 간에 우리는 공정하다는 것을 확신한다. 너는 일하고 벌면서 살아라. 너는 가장 존경을 받고 가장이 되면 "
"된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/ForestBrothers_9_Bandit_String
msgctxt "93beef53-9936-4add-9fe0-9f16e9d60302"
msgid ""
"\"And you don't like it, you're free to go. We're truly free — no one tells "
"us what to do.\""
msgstr "\"좋아하지 않으면 자유롭게 가도 된다. 우리는 진정으로 자유롭다. 아무도 우리에게 무엇을 명령하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_10_Farmer_String
msgctxt "d5b9dfcd-84e9-418f-8a6b-a67174bda249"
msgid "\"Why are you so cruel? You'll ruin us...\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 잔인해? 너는 우리를 망칠 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_11_Priest_String
msgctxt "cfbae86b-aa6a-44c0-86c8-5ac6c15d8553"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone wants to eat or drink — preferably in exchange for silver or "
"gold. And frankly, your plight is your own. You came to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두 먹거나 마시고 싶어한다. 은이나 금과 교환하는 것이 바람직하다. 솔직히 말해서 네 문제는 너의 것이다. 너는 나에게 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_12_Priest_String
msgctxt "3bb7dd0c-c560-4f66-8ce4-2512841e1ec6"
msgid "\"You want my help. I want my services to be handsomely rewarded.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 도움이 필요하다. 나의 봉사가 훌륭하게 보상 받기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_13_Farmer_String
msgctxt "660f708d-e22b-4217-88a4-907a325f6f16"
msgid "\"I guess I have no choice... You're sure you can cure him, right?\""
msgstr "\"나는 선택의 여지가 없어... 그를 치료할 수 있다고 확신하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_1_Priest_String
msgctxt "4dcff5e6-02fb-49ab-9e8e-51abec8b69fd"
msgid ""
"\"It's true, I could help you with your plight. It is within my power to "
"cure your husband's ailment. However, I cannot do so for free.\""
msgstr "\"너를 도울 수 있는 것은 사실이다. 네 남편의 병을 치료할 능력이 있다. 그러나 나는 공짜로는 할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_2_Farmer_String
msgctxt "bc756722-80b5-47c1-9735-8c26e8b2b621"
msgid "\"Please, you're our last hope! What do you want in return?\""
msgstr "\"너는 우리의 마지막 희망이다! 무엇을 대가로 원하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_3_Priest_String
msgctxt "fac8b016-1b54-44b2-b819-47f7a19024c8"
msgid ""
"\"Well, people say your daughter has grown into quite the beautiful young "
"lady...\""
msgstr "\"글쎄 사람들은 네 딸이 꽤 아름다운 젊은 아가씨로 성장했다고 하던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_4_Farmer_String
msgctxt "3d2dbec3-42c2-43eb-819f-6918ab761097"
msgid "\"Oh, no, no! Not my daughter!\""
msgstr "\"오. 안돼! 내 딸만은!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_5_Priest_String
msgctxt "74a4d39e-4839-4e36-91fb-cb925437060f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I knew you'd fall for that. No, gold is what I'm after. With gold, "
"getting anything else I want is easy.\""
msgstr "\"하하! 네가 속을 줄 알았어. 금이 내가 원하는 거야. 금이 있다면 다른 것을 얻는 것이 쉽다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_6_Farmer_String
msgctxt "c39a0c80-ecc1-4812-863c-50e38adb3e66"
msgid "\"...How much?\""
msgstr "\"...얼마나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_7_Priest_String
msgctxt "b614e496-8354-4176-9ba3-3bcbd37c8a57"
msgid ""
"\"Everything you have. Sell the farm. Sell the cattle. Sell your daughter's "
"jewelry. Bring it all to me.\""
msgstr "\"네가 가지고 있는 모든 것. 농장을 팔고 소를 팔아라. 딸의 보석을 팔아서 모두 내게 가져와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_8_Farmer_String
msgctxt "b3f7a0b1-3df6-492b-91fd-6b091cf9936d"
msgid "\"But... but we'd be left with nothing...\""
msgstr "\"하지만... 우리는 아무것도 남지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/CN/Priest_9_Priest_String
msgctxt "0b98ecfa-8192-4942-8323-b6d0a952f249"
msgid "\"Nothing but your husband's life. What's worth more to you?\""
msgstr "\"너의 남편의 삶만 빼고. 그보다 가치있는 것이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_10_Merch_String
msgctxt "501b9d04-b93e-4983-80f5-084af619b53b"
msgid "\"Is he some kind of maniac or something?\""
msgstr "\"그는 일종의 미치광이인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_11_Gagdet_String
msgctxt "fa3f205f-99f6-4066-85cf-653bb6b792be"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa, watch it. He's a professional. Look, don't be mad — things got a "
"little out of hand. But we got the job done, right?\""
msgstr "\"말 조심해. 그는 전문가야. 화내지 마라. 일이 좀 귀찮아졌어. 하지만 우린 끝냈어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_12_Gagdet_String
msgctxt "9498ab38-97c9-4601-b11e-78200890a57b"
msgid "\"And a deal's a deal. So cough up our money, sweetheart.\""
msgstr "\"협상은 협상이다. 그러니 우리 돈을 뱉어내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_1_Gagdet_String
msgctxt "818ac39f-32db-4ec5-b34e-f72315603f49"
msgid "\"We're here for our money, sweetheart. Now cough it up.\""
msgstr "\"우린 돈 때문에 온 거야. 이제 내놔.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_2_Merch_String
msgctxt "7b7590e0-6a88-47a0-b733-800e0ca027df"
msgid ""
"\"Your money?! You screwed things up so badly, you should be paying me! You "
"ruined everything, you nitwits!\""
msgstr "\"네 돈이라고?! 너 일을 너무 심하게 망쳤으니 나에게 돈을 줘야 해! 너는 모든 것을 망쳤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_3_Kid_String
msgctxt "72aa378b-4ac4-4d78-be50-d5c009bdaf95"
msgid "\"Mmm. You're rude...\""
msgstr "\"무례하다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_4_Gagdet_String
msgctxt "a389d0c8-ae57-4a73-b3e8-83a444643906"
msgid ""
"\"Easy there, little one. Listen, sweetheart, how has anything been "
"'ruined,' exactly? The target's dead. Job's done. Cough up our money.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 들어 봐. 망가졌다니 무슨 의미야? 목표물은 죽었어. 일은 끝났어. 우리 돈을 뱉어내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_5_Kid_String
msgctxt "8a3f0416-dc3b-4c4f-86f6-fd023a3e4c73"
msgid "\"Elv... No like elvs. Cut their throat...\""
msgstr "\"엘프... 누구도 엘프를 좋아하지 않아. 목을 그어야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_6_Merch_String
msgctxt "8a572bee-5147-44f8-9749-75471d50a7d9"
msgid ""
"\"But why did you make it such a bloodbath? It was just supposed to be a "
"simple hit!\""
msgstr "\"그런데 왜 그렇게 어지럽혀졌지? 단순한 청부암살이었을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_7_Gagdet_String
msgctxt "56ce6891-4cdc-4747-84a7-bcabdf778c4d"
msgid ""
"\"That was you, sweetheart. You said in the job description, and I quote, "
"'No witnesses.'\""
msgstr "\"너 때문이야. 네가 요청해서 나는 그대로 했지. '목격자가 없게 하라'고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_8_Merch_String
msgctxt "05f1dce0-3e2a-4996-8cfe-08e16dbfa018"
msgid ""
"\"Eight corpses! Eight, damn you to hell! The cook, the maid, the valet, "
"even the shoe shiner — he was a blind dwarf!\""
msgstr "\"시체가 여덟이야! 여덟이라고! 망할 자식아! 요리사, 하녀, 하인, 심지어 맹인 드워프 구두닦이도 죽었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Assasins_9_Kid_String
msgctxt "1184d914-1f83-42b5-84d2-3618b0d6a615"
msgid "\"Dwarv... Dwarvs no like either. Cut throats. Yes...\""
msgstr "\"드워프... 드워프도 마찬가지야. 목을 베어야 해. 그래...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_10_Guard1_String
msgctxt "3de55ad7-a405-41e0-a304-28253b7b6b1d"
msgid "\"Wasn't ordered to feed you. Now get up, you wimp!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 마음껏 먹으라고 명령하지 않았어. 정신 차려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_11_Monk_String
msgctxt "c23288a8-67da-4c5e-9a53-b2232859d51f"
msgid "\"How can you be so merciless? Have you no heart?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그렇게 무자비 할 수 있지? 동정심도 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_12_Guard1_String
msgctxt "7932cfd1-3b50-4714-bd78-81893a514a92"
msgid ""
"\"Heart's got nothing to do with it. I'm just doing my job. You're barking "
"up the wrong tree.\""
msgstr "\"동정심은 아무 상관이 없다. 나는 단지 내 일을 하고 있다. 너는 헛다리 짚고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_13_Monk_String
msgctxt "e382387d-1728-47c5-92cb-96b79816f571"
msgid "\"I refuse to go!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가지 않겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_14_Guard2_String
msgctxt "d613e055-18cc-45c4-b7fe-fab07a39fc00"
msgid "\"You asked for it, vagrant.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그것을 요구했다. 방랑자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_15_Monk_String
msgctxt "d9032a7f-e68a-4a98-8a09-7f15eaf240ce"
msgid "\"Ow! My leg, my leg!\""
msgstr "\"아야! 내 다리. 내 다리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_1_Guard1_String
msgctxt "2fdee9de-15ae-4afd-be86-0ddea67c3be8"
msgid "\"Get up, vagrant.\""
msgstr "\"정신 차려. 방랑자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_2_Monk_String
msgctxt "98a881fb-5ba2-4c09-bd14-46a611491c59"
msgid "\"I'm no vagrant! I'm an ascetic monk!\""
msgstr "\"나는 방랑자가 아니다. 나는 고행 몽크이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_3_Guard1_String
msgctxt "4fe25a3c-78be-4add-8d68-180928a58fc3"
msgid ""
"\"I don't give an ascetic damn. All vagrants are to be removed from city "
"streets.\""
msgstr "\"고행이던 신경쓰지 않아. 모든 방랑자들은 도시 거리에서 없어져야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_4_Monk_String
msgctxt "0137834b-fe1b-47bb-bf6d-1456d8858723"
msgid "\"But I am...\""
msgstr "\"하지만 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_5_Guard2_String
msgctxt "5809231e-adcf-42c2-b1e7-27a34786a238"
msgid "\"Government order. All vagrants are to be imprisoned.\""
msgstr "\"정부의 명령이다. 모든 방랑자들은 투옥될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_6_Monk_String
msgctxt "a2dacd67-95c6-4f6c-936e-9aa8e68541a0"
msgid "\"Mercy! This is needless cruelty!\""
msgstr "\"부탁이다. 이건 불필요한 잔인한 짓이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_7_Guard2_String
msgctxt "060bd75f-7603-481a-9cde-6accacca27b1"
msgid ""
"\"You want to complain about the law, you're looking at the wrong guy.\""
msgstr "\"법에 대해 불평하고 싶다면 너는 잘못된 사람을 찾아왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_8_Guard1_String
msgctxt "03025cad-d6d6-4b66-bb32-9f7a4c8b97b7"
msgid ""
"\"The city's chock full of you lot. Can't take a step without someone "
"tugging your sleeve!\""
msgstr "\"이 도시는 꽉 찼다. 누군가 붙잡지 않고서 한 걸음도 걸을 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/CleaningStreet_9_Monk_String
msgctxt "ef41601b-8b2e-4ee9-863f-467b732d61a4"
msgid "\"So instead of feeding us, you throw us behind bars?!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 우리에게 음식을 주는 대신에 우리를 철창에 가두겠다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_10_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "78de07fe-eb11-4479-996c-3292dee9fffb"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? Two dirty vagabonds leeched themselves onto my caravan, and "
"now they're asking to be paid. Did we forge a binding contract of some sort?"
"\""
msgstr "\"그런가? 더러운 방랑자 둘이 내 캐러밴에 달라붙어 돈을 요구하고 있다. 우리가 계약이라도 맺었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_11_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "bcea6fde-65c1-43b0-acc2-6afb077018eb"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps you have some form of written agreement, signed by both parties, "
"of which I'm unaware? Do you have any proof at all that I've ever met you "
"people?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도 너는 양 당사자가 서명한 어떤 형태의 서면 합의서를 가지고 있을 것이다. 내가 너희를 만난 적이 있다는 증거가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_12_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "ec25ee3e-02f3-46a2-b14d-6e5393b6add3"
msgid "\"No? Then get lost, you panhandlers!\""
msgstr "\"없다고? 그럼 꺼져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_13_HElf_String
msgctxt "6fb89139-e52e-48ce-9e5a-0007a0fa9b42"
msgid "\"Bastard!\""
msgstr "\"개자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_14_Dwarf_String
msgctxt "0d8b21f9-121b-4c1e-8b4f-c1bfbcb19319"
msgid "\"I'm not moving an inch until I get what's mine!\""
msgstr "\"내 것을 얻을 때까지 한발자국도 움직이지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_1_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "20e2e253-e3f8-44af-bfe8-b7dfb84404da"
msgid ""
"\"I already told you, you won't get one coin from me! Now get out of my "
"sight!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이미 너에게 말했다. 너는 나에게서 동전 하나도 얻지 못할 것이다. 이제 내 눈앞에서 사라져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_2_Dwarf_String
msgctxt "dc3a67e6-62d4-4e40-b78d-fc30257cc893"
msgid "\"But we had a deal!\""
msgstr "\"그러나 우리는 거래를 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_3_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "347fce59-8408-4574-85eb-58be59449f66"
msgid "\"A deal? What deal would that be?\""
msgstr "\"거래? 어떤 거래를 말하는 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_4_HElf_String
msgctxt "0ca79ffd-5af1-46f6-b3ad-fe102d6c41bb"
msgid ""
"\"You said you'd pay us to protect the caravan! And we made sure it arrived "
"safe and sound.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 캐러밴을 보호하면 돈을 지불하겠다고 말했다! 우리는 안전하고 건강하게 도착하게 도왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_5_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "277f4f15-15f6-46ad-8415-e7de34e6fb04"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, the caravan sure was lucky no one attacked them. A rare thing in "
"these parts!\""
msgstr "\"아무도 캐러반을 공격하지 않았기 때문에 운이 좋았다. 이 곳에서는 드문 일이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_6_HElf_String
msgctxt "1d4aa323-3001-42ad-a84b-07c43ee9148e"
msgid ""
"\"As if! We fought off bandits twice to protect your wares! Barely made it "
"out alive, but all your cargo's intact. And now you want to cheat us?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말 마라! 너의 물건을 보호하기 위해 우리는 도둑과 두 번 싸웠다! 그들을 해치우고 화물은 손상되지 않았다. 그리고 이제 우리를 "
"속이기를 원하나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_7_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "53027ada-9e06-4ec5-b9a5-10757f6d3b66"
msgid "\"Me? Cheating you?\""
msgstr "\"내가? 너를 속인다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_8_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "b895a2da-0e24-4dd9-ad02-5f62919e3ff5"
msgid ""
"\"You've got nothing to support your case apart from accusations and "
"threats. I'm calling the guards — this is blatant extortion!\""
msgstr "\"비난과 위협을 제외하고는 네 사건을 뒷받침할 것이 아무것도 없어. 나는 경비원을 부르겠다. 이것은 뻔뻔스러운 강탈이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Discrim_9_Dwarf_String
msgctxt "a3ce1689-695a-4e8e-9c11-7ae065c8aa2d"
msgid ""
"\"Go ahead, call 'em! The truth's on our side! You're refusing to pay us for "
"services rendered!\""
msgstr "\"불러 봐라! 진실은 우리쪽에 있다! 너는 우리에게 받은 서비스를 지불하기를 거부하고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_10_Guard2_String
msgctxt "6208da6a-f31e-4b1a-ae32-5b37f12b2e1a"
msgid "\"Calm down. I believe you.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 너를 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_11_Guard1_String
msgctxt "3e36a91c-a631-41be-84af-c70587bb67c4"
msgid ""
"\"In that case, you won't mind if we carry out a brief inspection of your "
"personal effects, would you?\""
msgstr "\"이럴 경우 우리는 너의 개인 물품에 대한 간략한 조사를 실시할 건데 괜찮겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_12_Guard2_String
msgctxt "98d93981-501b-4609-8fd4-ee35a3889c4e"
msgid "\"As proof of your unfaltering loyalty?\""
msgstr "\"너의 고귀한 충성심을 증거로?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_13_Merch_String
msgctxt "e07d28df-046c-41dc-aba2-66370a4ea7c4"
msgid "\"Uhh... Yes. Of course.\""
msgstr "\"어... 물론이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_14_Guard1_String
msgctxt "23e6b5af-8f0d-4762-ad7a-c2ea874e7d4a"
msgid ""
"\"Let's see... Well, what do we have here? A book? A literature fan, huh?\""
msgstr "\"어디 보자... 여기에 뭐가 있을까? 책? 문학을 좋아하나 보지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_15_Guard2_String
msgctxt "6a6821de-500c-4060-bcfb-7e2ffbd8c5e7"
msgid "\"Wait, isn't this illegal propaganda?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 이건 불법 선전물 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_16_Merch_String
msgctxt "cead86a7-0b83-46a5-9a00-64b2a6e37d8f"
msgid ""
"\"That's not mine! You planted it on me! This is a blatant abuse of power!\""
msgstr "\"그건 내 것이 아니야! 네가 나한테 심어줬어! 이건 뻔뻔스러운 권력 남용이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_17_Guard1_String
msgctxt "d5272c5c-86d6-4ede-9e61-bfd0a120af45"
msgid ""
"\"That's what they all say, citizen. Looks like we're going to have to have "
"a little chat about loyalty and patriotism after all.\""
msgstr "\"그걸 시민권이라 부르지. 우리는 충성심과 애국심에 관해 약간의 대화를 해야할 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_1_Guard1_String
msgctxt "112476b7-1a98-4dcb-9dea-bfad418d40ff"
msgid "\"Documents, please.\""
msgstr "\"문서를 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_2_Merch_String
msgctxt "8382f259-8f8f-44b0-861e-e643bbee2d5d"
msgid "\"Of course. Here you are. Is something going on?\""
msgstr "\"물론. 여기 있다. 뭔가 진행되고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_3_Guard2_String
msgctxt "2aee2209-e4f0-4d27-8e1d-27787299b54e"
msgid "\"Something IS going on, yes. Someone's reported you to the guard.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 벌어지고 있다. 누군가 너를 경비원에게 신고했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_4_Merch_String
msgctxt "cfb31015-d5a4-416f-b9a8-0ef9cc89f7de"
msgid "\"What?! Who? I've done nothing wrong!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구?! 누구? 나는 잘못한 게 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_5_Guard1_String
msgctxt "24f13ef3-3931-49a5-8ee2-8b9fd8e9d9ff"
msgid ""
"\"Calm down, now. According to information we've received, you've shown "
"gross disrespect by speaking ill of our beloved "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 받은 정보에 따르면 너는 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 지겹다고 말하며 심한 불경을 표시했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_6_Merch_String
msgctxt "8580a045-8d3d-47d9-826e-3c6c444d3e4d"
msgid "\"I would never! How can you even suggest such a thing?!\""
msgstr "\"나는 결코 그런 말을 한 적이 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_7_Guard2_String
msgctxt "1c0778d1-87ef-4ad8-9bd5-b150d2d4811c"
msgid ""
"\"We've also been told you're a troublemaker — just one step from becoming a "
"rebel, in fact.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 또한 네가 문제를 일으켰다고 들었다. 사실 거의 반역이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_8_Guard1_String
msgctxt "2198ed1b-7dbb-4278-8ae2-0b61c9c755b3"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, dear citizen, do you want this fine nation to become another Galt? "
"Do you want everyone to live like THEY do? Do you want your children to "
"starve?\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐. 너는 정말 이 국가가 또 다른 Galt가 되기를 바라나? 정말 그들처럼 살기를 원하는가? 아이들이 굶어 죽기를 바라나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/Patrol_9_Merch_String
msgctxt "efa95cc5-5b29-4cb2-9a2f-6a047208e026"
msgid ""
"\"No, of course not! I'm a patriot! I wholeheartedly support our government! "
"Please don't hurt my children!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 당연히 아니야! 나는 애국자다! 나는 진심으로 우리 정부를 지지한다! 내 아이들을 해치지 말아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_10_TaxCollector_String
msgctxt "299f00d3-adf8-418a-9ff2-6078388cf15e"
msgid ""
"\"And you're already familiar with every nook and cranny here, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너는 이곳의 모든 곳에 익숙해. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_1_Farmer_String
msgctxt "bdd3e10d-bd7a-4f6d-b5c8-5e040a77a5d5"
msgid ""
"\"What do you think you're doing, you pigs?! My family's lived on this farm "
"for ten generations!\""
msgstr "\"도대체 무슨 말을 하는 거야? 우리 가족은 10대 전부터 이 농장에서 살았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_2_TaxCollector_String
msgctxt "ce208a10-9ee3-4330-94b5-578d70c5a85d"
msgid ""
"\"Doesn't matter. You haven't paid the crown in over two months. We're "
"taking the farm.\""
msgstr "\"문제가 되지 않는다. 너는 2달 넘게 세금을 지불하지 않았다. 우리는 농장을 압류하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_3_Farmer_String
msgctxt "9447b371-64b5-4a7e-9da1-db89ae5b805e"
msgid "\"But this farm's worth fifty times what I owe!\""
msgstr "\"그러나 이 농장은 내가 빚진 것의 50배에 해당한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_4_TaxCollector_String
msgctxt "d3ab5d7f-be15-46d8-9ea2-f747c25b976c"
msgid ""
"\"Since you're incapable of paying off your debt, it's up to the crown to "
"set the price of your farm.\""
msgstr "\"네가 빚을 갚을 능력이 없기 때문에 농장의 가격을 정하는 것은 우리 책임이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_5_Farmer_String
msgctxt "a0f793d9-84f8-4a85-a2d3-edd8acd05627"
msgid "\"That's robbery!\""
msgstr "\"그건 강도짓이나 다름없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_6_TaxCollector_String
msgctxt "08b0dc8e-0e09-49a0-8c06-60c4abe045e9"
msgid "\"That's the law.\""
msgstr "\"그건 법이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_7_Farmer_String
msgctxt "f9c6789e-b462-4123-9d7f-ad1ce9b3e5a8"
msgid ""
"\"Please, hear me out! I'm innocent. That merchant sold me rotten grain — "
"that's why it won't grow! How could I possibly pay you with nothing to sell?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 말 좀 들어봐! 나는 무죄다. 상인은 나에게 썩은 곡물을 팔았다. 그래서 그것이 자랄 수 없었다! 어떻게 팔지도 않고 돈을 지불 "
"할 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_8_TaxCollector_String
msgctxt "7a38c2e8-025c-4495-99ab-f4d5a7a383eb"
msgid ""
"\"The law says differently. You still owe that merchant, by the way. You'll "
"have to work off your debt on his farm.\""
msgstr "\"법 문제는 다르다. 그러나저러나, 너는그 상인에게 빚이 있다. 너는 그의 농장에서 빚을 갚아야한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LE/TaxCollect_9_TaxCollector_String
msgctxt "c9c5c0bd-d7e0-4629-9b47-490f63650e82"
msgid ""
"\"It should be an easy transition, though — after all, he already purchased "
"your former property from the crown.\""
msgstr "\"그것은 쉽게 전환되어야 한다. 결국 그는 이미 정부에서 너의 재산을 구입했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_10_Mage_String
msgctxt "51aa5f1d-21f6-44fc-9d5d-c1227179f32b"
msgid ""
"\"I'll come as well. My magic can make us invisible as we approach them.\""
msgstr "\"나도 갈 거야. 내 마법으로 우리가 투명인간이 되어 그들에게 접근할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_11_Fighter_String
msgctxt "ae47432f-dd0a-43d0-af87-c408b74fe61e"
msgid "\"Lead on, chief. Let's show those bandits a good time.\""
msgstr "\"앞장 서. 대장. 그 도적놈들을 혼쭐내 주자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_12_Guard_String
msgctxt "d3740d23-a4fc-4e1c-b9ba-31192c91eac1"
msgid ""
"\"Hold on — let me get you on the books, then you can get your volunteer "
"badges.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만. 명부에 너를 올릴게. 그러면 너는 자원 봉사자 배지를 받을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_13_Guard_String
msgctxt "df7a0772-72aa-40ad-af30-7bb459002223"
msgid ""
"\"Wouldn't want to have mobs of disorganized vigilantes wandering the "
"forest, now would we?\""
msgstr "\"숲을 방황하고 있는 무질서한 자경단의 폭도들을 이제는 만나야 한다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_1_Guard_String
msgctxt "8e31a0a1-8495-4e13-81c5-3cb66d8e74fa"
msgid ""
"\"Fair folk of this city! We have need of a few brave hearts who are willing "
"to be part of a dangerous undertaking!\""
msgstr "\"이 도시의 공정한 사람들이군! 우리는 위험한 사업에 참여할 몇 명의 용감한 사람이 필요하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_2_Ranger_String
msgctxt "11a80470-f1ba-4b33-92a9-9f305fc18f34"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_3_Guard_String
msgctxt "ed1851f5-9a5b-4d82-853d-a764d798b0ea"
msgid ""
"\"We've received reports that a dangerous criminal is hiding in the nearby "
"forest.\""
msgstr "\"위험한 범죄자가 인근 숲에 숨어 있다는 보고를 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_4_Guard_String
msgctxt "35586f98-14ed-4907-979a-261c44d3ffee"
msgid ""
"\"Times are tough, and the guard is stretched thin. We need the aid of brave "
"volunteers!\""
msgstr "\"힘든 시기이고 경비원도 힘들어하고 있다. 우리는 용감한 자원 봉사자들의 도움이 필요하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_5_Fighter_String
msgctxt "d55dce5c-4389-458e-a605-d772f19146ee"
msgid "\"What's the job, then? Bash his head in?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 하면 되지? 머리를 부숴버리면 되나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_6_Guard_String
msgctxt "8911c796-6d8f-4b14-9bab-a210740650c0"
msgid ""
"\"Arrest him and deliver him to the judge for trial. His gang won't give up "
"without a fight, so we're permitted to use force where necessary, but there "
"will be no mob justice!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그를 체포해서 재판을 위해 판사에게 넘겨라. 그의 패거리는 싸움 없이 포기하지 않을 것이다. 그래서 필요하면 무력을 사용할 수 있지만 "
"폭도에게 정의는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_7_Mage_String
msgctxt "61ed44d4-1f42-4ac4-8a53-b6b3f3b9a09d"
msgid "\"And what did this criminal do, exactly?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 이 범죄자는 정확히 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_8_Guard_String
msgctxt "e0059cc2-f575-4db4-85a4-6de1a7f05b97"
msgid ""
"\"Robbery and murder. He even gutted his victims just to make sure they "
"hadn't swallowed anything valuable. He showed no mercy.\""
msgstr "\"강도와 살인. 그는 심지어 귀중품을 삼키지 않았는지 희생자들의 배를 갈랐다. 그는 무자비했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/HuntParty_9_Ranger_String
msgctxt "13021046-29ee-453d-b272-75747c462537"
msgid ""
"\"Scum of the earth. Count me in! I know these forests like the back of my "
"hand — I'll lead the way.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅의 쓰레기들. 나도 참여하겠다! 이 숲은 내가 훤히 꿰고 있다. 나는 길을 인도할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_10_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "e0c8e29c-04b4-414d-8540-0f4c019b63c3"
msgid "\"What's my cellar got to do with it?! We just play cards there!\""
msgstr "\"내 저장고에서 무슨 일이 벌어졌지?! 우리는 그저 거기서 카드놀이를 했을 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_11_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "697e4a57-663e-4983-aa1b-fc4d78c888c3"
msgid ""
"\"And I'd like to know the names of all your players. Do you have any idea "
"how dangerous demons can be?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너랑 게임을 한 모든 사람들의 이름을 알고 싶어. 얼마나 위험한 데몬이 있을 수 있는지 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_12_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "90e60784-0ca7-43aa-b355-9b06597af053"
msgid ""
"\"Fine. You want names, I'll give 'em to you. I understand. I'm no fool — I "
"can look out for myself.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 이름을 원하면 줄 거야. 이해해. 나는 바보가 아냐. 난 스스로를 지킬 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_13_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "1af3558d-e430-45ba-97af-179dc926d561"
msgid ""
"\"You're sure there's nothing you'd like to confess? Nothing you might want "
"to ask forgiveness for?\""
msgstr "\"내게 고해하고 싶지 않은 것이 없나? 용서를 구하고 싶은 것이 없는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_14_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "e21615e6-97d3-46c0-80b8-bd7fd04fbdb7"
msgid ""
"\"Please, don't ruin me! There's nothing to confess! I'm a faithful follower "
"of Abadar!\""
msgstr "\"좀, 나를 괴롭히지 마라. 고해할 것은 없어! 나는 아바다르의 신실한 추종자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_1_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "b75e0a13-be05-4878-84a5-daeced5ac50a"
msgid "\"Look at me. Don't turn away. Why so silent all of a sudden?\""
msgstr "\"날 봐. 고개 돌리지 말고. 왜 갑자기 침묵하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_2_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "c526222e-7803-4f27-a009-68fbcf316d83"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean? Are you accusing me of something, madam inquisitor?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 뜻이야? 나에게 뒤집어 씌우려고? 조사관 나으리?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_3_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "5449a114-0472-4fbf-b2a7-5a5cc279fca1"
msgid "\"Your gold smells funny, friend.\""
msgstr "\"네 금에서는 재미있는 냄새가 나는군, 친구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_4_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "9f300a6a-b2dc-43e5-aa8b-6ee797b9202a"
msgid ""
"\"It doesn't smell at all! And even if it did, how's that my fault? This is "
"a pub, for gods' sake — we get all sorts here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 전혀 냄새같은 건 나지 않아! 그리고 만약 그렇다고 치더라도 어떻게 그게 내 잘못이야? 여긴 술집이야. 아 제발 좀 - 여기에는 "
"온갖 종류의 놈들이 다 온다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_5_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "dc98319e-c694-4cfe-83cc-0dd6dac0b105"
msgid "\"If someone slipped me a fake coin, I had no idea!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 가짜 동전을 줬다고 해도 난 전혀 모르는 일이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_6_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "4562a42b-fdb0-4eeb-878f-26e615ca99da"
msgid "\"It's not that the money's fake — it bears traces of another world.\""
msgstr "\"돈이 가짜라는게 아니야 - 그건 다른 차원의 세계의 흔적을 담고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_7_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "51ce319d-068e-4a41-b470-127101df90d7"
msgid ""
"\"How did you come into possession of gold that had been touched by a demon?"
"\""
msgstr "\"데몬의 손길이 닿았던 금을 어떻게 소유하게 된거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_8_Barkeeper_String
msgctxt "96e868c5-ed35-4223-bc58-4fd76f2b9e22"
msgid "\"A demon?! That's impossible!\""
msgstr "\"데몬?! 그건 불가능해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Inquisitrix_9_Inquisitrix_String
msgctxt "7e0a840f-7c9d-4e27-8c2b-80f5d59642de"
msgid ""
"\"What's more, the traces are fresh. So either one of your guests is from "
"another world, or you've got something very interesting going on in your "
"cellar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무엇보다, 흔적이 오래되지 않았어. 그러니까 너의 손님들 중 누군가가 다른 차원에서 왔거나, 지하실에서 아주 재밌는 일이 벌어지고 "
"있는거 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_10_Son_String
msgctxt "80db5098-07dc-4bdb-b93c-147c34a0ca2b"
msgid "\"Dad... I didn't want to...\""
msgstr "\"아빠... 나는 싫어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_11_Father_String
msgctxt "16f0c6a8-1024-4210-8d36-c74a0370e818"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, my poor heart can't take it anymore... Run home, you fool. I'm going "
"to the captain of the guard to beg on your behalf.\""
msgstr "\"내 여린 마음으로는 더 이상 참을 수 없어... 집에 가라. 바보야. 내가 경비 대장에게 가서 너를 위해 빌러 갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_12_Father_String
msgctxt "d874b252-75f3-44ac-a39f-a1cfe45c334c"
msgid ""
"\"I'll fall at his feet, and beg him to take mercy on my young, stupid son. "
"I'll plead for you, since you came clean — even brought everything you stole "
"along with you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그의 발 앞에 엎드려 어리석은 아들에게 자비를 베풀어달라고 간청할 것이다. 네가 훔친 것을 가지고 깨끗하게 왔으니 너에게 "
"간청하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_13_Son_String
msgctxt "667b2348-a6f4-4fac-a3ac-3cecbc6da18d"
msgid "\"Dad, don't! Not the guard! Please, don't tell them!\""
msgstr "\"아빠. 하지 마! 경비가 아니야! 그들에게 말하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_14_Father_String
msgctxt "f3813208-bb8c-4e57-aba1-b5a90f5e08ea"
msgid "\"You idiot! Have you learned nothing?!\""
msgstr "\"바보야! 아무것도 못배웠어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_1_Father_String
msgctxt "f08c27ca-7481-4cbd-82c8-3e6071b07c69"
msgid ""
"\"Like it or not, I'm turning you in to the guard! After what you've done, "
"you're no son of mine!\""
msgstr "\"좋든 싫든간에 나는 너를 경비원에게 고발하겠다! 네가 무슨 짓을 하건 너는 내 아들이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_2_Son_String
msgctxt "86a27fab-b450-4d57-8123-7d07a56278a7"
msgid ""
"\"Dad, no! Please forgive me! I was stupid! The neighbor said it wouldn't be "
"a big deal, just shaking down a few merchants...\""
msgstr "\"아빠. 안돼! 제발 용서해줘! 나는 바보 같았어! 이웃 사람이 큰일이 아닐 거라고 말해서 그냥 상인 몇 명을 혼내줬어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_3_Father_String
msgctxt "e164fd0c-09e6-4702-99c3-590e5b01a394"
msgid ""
"\"Shaking down? Shaking down?! Is that how I raised you?! Your whole life, "
"I've worked my fingers to the bone to make sure you had everything!\""
msgstr "\"혼내줘? 큰일이 아니라고?! 내가 너를 이렇게 키웠냐? 나는 너에게 모든 것을 주려고 등골이 휘게 일했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_4_Father_String
msgctxt "2c93509c-a0e7-4933-9f0a-74c339b40031"
msgid "\"And you... You become just like those murderers and thieves!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너는... 너는 살인자와 도둑과 다름없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_5_Son_String
msgctxt "78a0da5e-dde4-4f81-8c85-674267732ff5"
msgid "\"But Dad, the merchants weren't even from around here...\""
msgstr "\"하지만 아빠. 상인들은 여기 출신이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_6_Father_String
msgctxt "b6261029-d887-41ef-82d7-e0632c59ebf7"
msgid ""
"\"What difference does that make? Honest, hardworking folk are the same "
"everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"그 차이는 무엇인가? 정직하고 근면한 사람들은 어디서나 같다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_7_Son_String
msgctxt "72c67c96-104a-4a61-b7eb-393b9fb8d622"
msgid ""
"\"But you said you did it yourself, back when you were young! Said you had "
"to take up a knife and a crossbow, and...\""
msgstr "\"하지만 아빠도 어렸을 때 그렇게 했다고 했잖아! 칼과 쇠뇌가 있어야 했다고 말했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_8_Father_String
msgctxt "43ca2a1a-fbf4-4651-8f54-262f490d2b52"
msgid ""
"\"Those were different times, boy. Dark times! Nowadays, we've got a new "
"ruler, praise the gods, and no one has to take such sins upon their souls. "
"We've got plenty of food on the table.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시대가 다르다. 아들아. 어둠의 시간이었다. 오늘날에는 새로운 통치자가 있고 신을 찬양하고 그들의 영혼에 그런 죄를 지을 사람이 "
"없다. 우리는 식탁에 음식을 많이 가지고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/Son_and_Dad_9_Father_String
msgctxt "661c22e9-53e4-4702-9dc5-e54e06d12840"
msgid "\"I paid for my crimes, and I'm ashamed of my old self!\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 죄값을 치렀다. 옛날의 나를 부끄럽게 생각한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_10_Commoner2_String
msgctxt "fe131156-af25-4f41-af85-64023e20985a"
msgid ""
"\"Would you listen to that? Guess these young ones are growing up just "
"fine...\""
msgstr "\"그 말을 들어보겠나? 이 젊은 애들은 잘 자라서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_11_Paladin_String
msgctxt "ddbaa0f2-f0db-412d-9cac-0978d52a3c09"
msgid "\"Think carefully, boy. Serving Iomedae is no joke.\""
msgstr "\"신중하게 생각해라. 소년. 아이오메데를 섬기는 것은 장난이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_12_Paladin_String
msgctxt "e7d71fd9-3217-425f-b299-cb2e1e78c6a2"
msgid ""
"\"However, if you still wish to join us once you come of age, the order "
"could always use such a fine young man.\""
msgstr "\"허나, 어른이 되어서도 여전히 우리와 함께하고 싶다면, 교단에서 이렇게 훌륭한 청년을 마다할 이유가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_13_Mother_String
msgctxt "18bb6486-78f7-4302-97fa-490341d6b14f"
msgid ""
"\"Son, but why? You could get yourself killed! What about us? What about the "
"farm?\""
msgstr "\"아들아, 도대체 왜 그러니? 너 죽을 수도 있어! 우리는 어쩌고? 농장은 어떡하고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_14_Youngman_String
msgctxt "6f89359e-6971-41d4-8505-01bb688266aa"
msgid "\"Mother, they're protecting all of us. Don't you see?\""
msgstr "\"엄마. 그들이 우리를 지켜주고 있잖아요. 아직도 모르겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_15_Youngman_String
msgctxt "3d761950-21d8-404d-9d25-641cdce019bb"
msgid ""
"\"What family will I have left if the darkness wins? What good is working "
"the farm if the enemy comes after us?\""
msgstr "\"어둠이 이기면 제 곁에 가족이 남아 있을까요? 농장에서 일 하고 있다가 적들이 코앞까지 오면 대체 뭘 할 수 있겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_16_Mother_String
msgctxt "2ba9f043-0cc5-4415-88ab-816f816f94b4"
msgid "\"Oh, my dear boy...\""
msgstr "\"오. 아들아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_17_Youngman_String
msgctxt "12098c8f-f969-45b3-a902-9e2a03e94661"
msgid ""
"\"Please go on, sir! What happened next during the battle? You said you were "
"seven, right?\""
msgstr "\"계속 말해주세요, 선생님! 다음 전투에서 무슨 일이 있었죠? 그 때 일곱 명이었다고 하셨죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_18_Paladin_String
msgctxt "c6db9b1e-c9fe-4f9b-90b7-92fbae32e7c2"
msgid "\"Hmm... Yes, that's right.\""
msgstr "\"음... 맞다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_1_Paladin_String
msgctxt "ce893376-9c71-451c-996e-8d3348b6e9e4"
msgid "\"And then, we were seven. Seven paladins of Iomedae.\""
msgstr "\"그러니까, 우리는 일곱 명이었다. 일곱 명의 아이오메데 성기사들이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_2_Paladin_String
msgctxt "37764da3-2cc5-498f-a304-a7a238fd2d67"
msgid ""
"\"Untold swarms of demons descended upon us. But die we falter? Not a bit!\""
msgstr "\"셀 수 없이 많은 데몬 무리가 우리에게 몰려들었다. 하지만 우리가 벌벌 떨었을까? 천만에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_3_Commoner_String
msgctxt "64cd83fd-7bd9-40a2-bba1-526538b90027"
msgid ""
"\"So, what... the seven of you stopped an entire army of demons? That's a "
"tall tale, mate!\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 뭐... 너희 일곱 명이 악마의 군대를 막았단 말이야? 허풍도 정도껏 치게, 친구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_4_Commoner2_String
msgctxt "295a3ef2-21e2-4ca8-a8aa-523562b1a51c"
msgid ""
"\"Think before you speak! 'A tall tale...' A paladin of Iomedae never lies!\""
msgstr "\"생각부터 하고 말을 하라! '헛소리'라니... 아이오메데의 팔라딘은 거짓말하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_5_Paladin_String
msgctxt "24b5ed4e-cf21-4839-9d81-b2e72d7699a6"
msgid ""
"\"I speak no lie. In truth, we were not seven that day — we were eight.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말하겠다. 사실 우리는 그날 7명이 아니었다. 우리는 8명이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_6_Paladin_String
msgctxt "5e8f6a13-912b-41d6-98a9-636ca5d50cb1"
msgid ""
"\"The seven paladins, and their lady Iomedae. She herself was there among us."
"\""
msgstr "\"일곱 명의 팔라딘과 그들의 여신 아이오메데. 그분도 우리와 함께 하셨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_7_Paladin_String
msgctxt "813e80a4-1141-43c9-9169-584b461c3401"
msgid ""
"\"Not in body, of course. But I felt her presence — she was near, and her "
"divine aura protected me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 육신에 임하시진 않으셨다. 하지만 나는 그분 존재를 느꼈다. 그분은 가까이에 있었고 그분의 신성함이 나를 보호해 주셨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_8_Paladin_String
msgctxt "94f42316-4ad2-442f-aaf4-e4ad873a7c41"
msgid ""
"\"She gave me strength when the other six had fallen. She led us to victory "
"that day.\""
msgstr "\"다른 여섯 명이 쓰러졌을 때 그녀는 나에게 힘을 주셨다. 그녀는 그날 우리를 승리로 이끌었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LG/VetPaladin_9_Youngman_String
msgctxt "30fef854-f508-4c71-9d93-631ff1692c16"
msgid ""
"\"I... I want to be a paladin, too! To act in the face of danger and defend "
"the light!\""
msgstr "\"저도... 저도 성기사가 되고 싶어요! 정의의 편에 서서 위험에 맞설래요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_01_Woman_String
msgctxt "f2ad3943-5796-4651-bcf8-f807583b3a58"
msgid "\"Miserable scumbag! You rotten, rotten little man!\""
msgstr "\"비참한 쓰레기 녀석! 빌어먹을. 빌어먹을 새끼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_02_Woman_String
msgctxt "8cdbc17d-4d99-4eaa-81f5-6b690e9a8e6c"
msgid "\"I hope the devils gut you in your sleep!\""
msgstr "\"자다가 데블에게 죽어버려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_03_Attorney_String
msgctxt "7ebe30a7-eab2-449d-88be-4820d4029742"
msgid "\"I was just fulfilling my duties.\""
msgstr "\"나는 단지 내 임무를 수행하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_04_Woman_String
msgctxt "afdc82cb-6aa4-46cb-90a7-3cab30617cb1"
msgid ""
"\"You tore my family apart! Put my husband behind bars — my only support, "
"the last helping hand I had!\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 가족을 찢어 버렸다. 내 남편을 감옥에 보냈다. 나의 유일한 후원자이자 내가 가진 마지막 도움의 손길을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_05_Woman_String
msgctxt "1d6d76e3-393d-451b-ad09-65faada0c8d1"
msgid ""
"\"I've got three mouths to feed! How am I to raise them all alone, with no "
"one to go to?!\""
msgstr "\"나는 3명을 먹여살린다! 아무도 없다면 어떻게 그들을 혼자서 키울 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_06_Attorney_String
msgctxt "8e480316-921b-4c0d-bdaa-2eb3d260a3fc"
msgid ""
"\"Your spouse robbed an innocent passer-by, seriously wounding him in the "
"process. I see no reason the law should make an exception for him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 배우자가 무고한 행인을 강탈하여 그 과정에서 그를 심각하게 상처를 입혔다. 법이 그에게 예외를 만들어야 할 이유가 없다고 "
"생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_07_Woman_String
msgctxt "e287d3c4-45d2-401d-a7f5-dc201324ab3f"
msgid ""
"\"But he's a father! I've got my hands full with the little one, and the "
"other two aren't old enough to work yet! We'll starve!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 그는 가장이야! 나는 아이를 키우느라 바쁘고 다른 두 녀석은 일하기엔 어리다! 우리는 굶어 죽을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_08_Attorney_String
msgctxt "d88cdddd-c1db-4a6f-9047-90f5553b876e"
msgid ""
"\"You can always move to one of the communal farms on the outskirts of the "
"city. There your children will be taken care of while you fend for your "
"family.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도시의 외곽에 있는 공동 농장 중 하나로 언제든지 이동할 수 있다. 네가 가족들을 위해 일하는 동안 아이들을 돌보아줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_09_Woman_String
msgctxt "6865cb9a-400d-40e7-8ed4-941ee9549041"
msgid ""
"\"And leave the city for that gods-forsaken bog?! If you wish to scramble in "
"the dirt to the end of your life, you can go there yourself, thank you very "
"much!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 이 도시를 떠나?! 만일 인생의 끝까지 더러운 곳에서 기어다니기를 원한다면 마음대로 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_10_Attorney_String
msgctxt "8ddca6e1-8631-4f62-a6f6-d3d3ce06c4a3"
msgid ""
"\"In that case, I shall leave it up to you to decide the fate of your "
"children — just as long as your behavior doesn't become a threat to them, "
"that is.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 경우 너의 행동이 자녀들에게 위협이되지 않는 자녀의 운명을 결정을 네게 맡길 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_11_Attorney_String
msgctxt "30146112-4b1b-4d3e-9685-a640294ccac2"
msgid ""
"\"If it ever comes to that, their future shall be decided by the court.\""
msgstr "\"만약 그렇게 된다면 그들의 미래는 법정에서 결정될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_12_Woman_String
msgctxt "64a18231-5a38-471c-b78a-cd2dd93fa836"
msgid "\"What?! You vile wretch!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구?! 이 더러운 자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_13_Attorney_String
msgctxt "5d9632be-ad0a-4c90-9d20-bc3637abf1f6"
msgid ""
"\"You... are aware that insulting a representative of the law is a finable "
"offense, right?\""
msgstr "\"너... 법의 대리인을 모욕하는 것은 중죄인 걸 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_14_Woman_String
msgctxt "4486b6c7-484b-47bb-8202-ebbc606213df"
msgid "\"You... You'll pay for this...\""
msgstr "\"너... 너 후회하게 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Attorney_15_Attorney_String
msgctxt "398cdcb9-7314-4f8e-9ba5-5c5b61fd9f69"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the first time I've heard that, and I'm sure it won't be the last."
"\""
msgstr "\"처음 들어 본 것은 아니지만 마지막이 아닐 것이라고 확신한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_01_Man1_String
msgctxt "ac697a11-bcfb-4918-afbc-ac287a8dac09"
msgid ""
"\"I've been trying to get permission to build my stables for three weeks "
"now! Can you believe it?!\""
msgstr "\"나는 마구간 공사 허가를 얻기 위해 3주 동안이나 노력하는 중이다! 믿겨지냐?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_02_Man1_String
msgctxt "2ba685ce-9ed2-47fe-ab3d-1bc2737ad657"
msgid ""
"\"I filed all the necessary paperwork, waited for a couple days, and then "
"decided to check on things in person.\""
msgstr "\"모든 필수 서류를 작성했고, 며칠 기다리다가 결국 직접 확인하기로 결정했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_03_Man1_String
msgctxt "9809b90a-04c0-4836-8739-618b385f8fac"
msgid ""
"\"Turns out, you also need to provide the deed to the land, a renovation "
"permit, and Abadar knows what else!\""
msgstr "\"알고보니 땅문서와 개보수 허가증, 그리고 아바다르께서만 아실 다른 것들까지 갖다 줘야 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_04_Man1_String
msgctxt "cd636c86-3aaa-4167-a74c-2e366a8e8dcb"
msgid ""
"\"Spent a whole week gathering all the papers and taking them to the "
"magistrate.\""
msgstr "\"일주일 내내 모든 서류를 모아 치안 판사에게 가져갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_05_Man1_String
msgctxt "7cd7b80a-f32e-483e-adf1-ff4c7fe874a1"
msgid ""
"\"Then came the land surveyor, to make sure my extension wouldn't 'impede "
"street movement.'\""
msgstr "\"그러자 확장 공사가 거리의 통행을 방해하진 않는가 확인하기 위해 토지 측량자가 찾아왔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_06_Man1_String
msgctxt "4e7cd1d3-3206-4384-8e38-3f74b4dc8f9b"
msgid "\"And what do you know?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 어떻게 됐는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_07_Man1_String
msgctxt "08b7d4b1-07e0-46f0-bed7-5ed3d4fd468d"
msgid ""
"\"Now they want to know how I plan to dispose of all the manure the stables "
"are expected to produce!\""
msgstr "\"이제는 놈들이 마굿간에서 나올걸로 예측되는 오물을 어떻게 처분할 것인지 계획을 물어보고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_08_Man1_String
msgctxt "36ebb1c4-d7e6-4dc8-991a-08f8e6c0e831"
msgid "\"What do they care about a load of horse crap?!\""
msgstr "\"대체 왜 말 똥까지 신경 쓰는거지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_09_Man2_String
msgctxt "22d10e55-3ef0-4b88-97a9-370bf3e7bad6"
msgid ""
"\"I can tell you're angry, but I'll say it anyway — they're doing the right "
"thing.\""
msgstr "\"네가 화가났다는건 알지만 어쨌든 이거 하나는 말해야 겠네. 그들은 일을 똑바로 하고 있는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_10_Man1_String
msgctxt "8d1d1c7a-c9f2-4337-b162-de69f75b2dcd"
msgid "\"What?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_11_Man2_String
msgctxt "5ca1dcae-dc81-4742-8ef6-eab7fb9577ad"
msgid ""
"\"You know, how they're running things now. The strict laws, the ordered "
"procedures, how you need to get approval for everything.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 일을 처리하는 방법은 너도 알잖아. 엄격한 법률, 일련의 절차, 어째서 모든 일에 승인을 받아야 하는가 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_12_Woman_String
msgctxt "2942815d-ccc4-494d-a86c-68215fd6a736"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm, it's true the capital would end up a bloody mess without the rules.\""
msgstr "\"흐음. 법이 없다면 수도가 난장판 꼴이 되리라는 점은 인정해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_13_Woman_String
msgctxt "fe13ff83-03ba-46ee-9ac3-4f047252a0f4"
msgid ""
"\"If they let everyone build whatever they wanted, there'd be no streets "
"left within the year.\""
msgstr "\"모든 사람들이 무엇이든 지을 수 있도록 허가한다면, 일 년 안에 거리까지 꽉 막히고 말걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_14_Man2_String
msgctxt "00b7fbef-f56a-4292-9ea8-94aae6135e67"
msgid ""
"\"Or the streets would become streams of... that material you need to show "
"your plan for disposing of.\""
msgstr "\"아니면 거리가... 네가 처분 계획을 세워 없애야 했던 물체로 강을 이뤘겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_15_Man2_String
msgctxt "63f72e82-ac78-4076-b0e4-04527fc67aeb"
msgid ""
"\"And now that you've got all your papers in order, you can build and extend "
"to your heart's content!\""
msgstr "\"이제 모든 서류를 정리했으니, 네 맘대로 건물을 짓고 확장할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_16_Man1_String
msgctxt "9c0f6815-4308-4e0f-8fbc-d294feca6875"
msgid ""
"\"Right... I haven't gotten to telling you about signing the contract with "
"the builders yet, have I?\""
msgstr "\"아, 그래... 아직 건설업자와 시공 계약을 맺는 건에 관해선 말하지 않았군. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Burocracy_17_Woman_String
msgctxt "67bab6d5-c917-4155-92f3-114a2b3e6e47"
msgid "\"Oh, dear... This is going to take a while...\""
msgstr "\"오, 맙소사... 시간이 좀 걸릴 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_01_Fighter1_String
msgctxt "d25cd772-4a5d-48df-bdfc-ff668e897b20"
msgid "\"You watch your words...\""
msgstr "\"말 조심해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_02_Fighter2_String
msgctxt "1edc3e42-3eb4-4fa7-9c1f-f106b6d4e0ea"
msgid "\"What, you gonna cry now?\""
msgstr "\"이제는 우는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_03_Fighter1_String
msgctxt "97b3ed22-b0be-4b70-8211-79ea944c0f8f"
msgid "\"Shut your trap, frog-face!\""
msgstr "\"멍청아. 아가리 닥쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_04_Fighter2_String
msgctxt "48d077d4-f6bf-4cca-83fd-8c880b2acb32"
msgid "\"You dumb little shit...\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 녀석...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_05_GuardLead_String
msgctxt "50576d87-3648-4163-98da-9c58a7820e58"
msgid "\"Enough of this! Stop them, now!\""
msgstr "\"이것으로 충분해! 그만해. 당장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_06_GuardLead_String
msgctxt "549b8321-c198-42e4-bb14-946c04480b06"
msgid "\"Just what do you think you're doing?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 짓을 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_07_Fighter1_String
msgctxt "166fe6c3-2cd6-4461-abdd-7ef69088f659"
msgid "\"That lout insulted my mother!\""
msgstr "\"그 자식이 내 어머니를 모욕했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_08_Fighter1_String
msgctxt "81b010fb-33f8-4a55-a7e8-1d9a5dbfb71b"
msgid "\"I'll show him...\""
msgstr "\"나는 그에게 보여줄거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_09_GuardLead_String
msgctxt "1cf5cdef-ab6f-41df-8f37-e684351f8ba2"
msgid "\"Quit it, both of you! You're breaking the law!\""
msgstr "\"둘 다 그만 둬! 너희 법을 어기고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_10_Fighter2_String
msgctxt "7874fd48-8248-47a1-afd0-07ad8cd9f769"
msgid ""
"\"No, let him go. I'll make sure this wimp doesn't cause any more trouble!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그를 내버려 둬. 이 겁쟁이가 더 이상 문제를 일으키지 않게 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_11_GuardLead_String
msgctxt "86244b16-b3dc-497c-a1a6-ea844e64f624"
msgid ""
"\"Seems like words won't be enough for you two. Hope you're ready to spend "
"the night in jail, then.\""
msgstr "\"단어 2개로 충분하지 않을 것 같아. 감옥에서 밤을 보낼 준비가 됐으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_12_Fighter2_String
msgctxt "e3abda36-8324-4818-a1b3-cbe1740402c7"
msgid "\"Hey, now! What for? Some measly fight?!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 왜 그래? 귀찮은 일 만들 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_13_GuardLead_String
msgctxt "01f9c309-d32e-4b77-9b18-d92b617a7b68"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't the Stag Lord's nest anymore. Your behavior is against the law, "
"and the punishment is a stint in jail. So, you wanna learn what prison food "
"tastes like?\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기는 이제 수사슴 군주의 안식처가 아니다. 너의 행동은 법에 어긋나는 것이며 처벌은 감옥행이다. 감옥 음식의 맛을 알고 싶나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_14_Fighter2_String
msgctxt "7c9253d3-8171-4b85-a476-b1fb7d5d232f"
msgid "\"No, no. Don't judge us so hastily... We're already...\""
msgstr "\"아니. 우리를 너무 성급하게 판단하지 마라. 우리는 벌써...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_15_Fighter1_String
msgctxt "2e06f08d-5571-4eaf-a297-835a2616c3ba"
msgid "\"The matter's settled!\""
msgstr "\"문제가 해결되었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/Fight_16_GuardLead_String
msgctxt "8a71ca1e-21f1-4370-b501-c367f5f52961"
msgid "\"That's more like it.\""
msgstr "\"그게 더 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_01_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "51d12f6d-98ad-4d86-96d6-dbddaa01f780"
msgid "\"Well, what do we have here? Where are you headed from?\""
msgstr "\"이제 우리가 여기에서 뭘 하지? 너는 어디에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_02_Fisherman_String
msgctxt "3d39914e-d182-4005-b45d-aaa3096d7c1e"
msgid "\"Lake Silverstep, my lord. I bring fresh fish for sale!\""
msgstr "\"Silverstep 호수다. 나는 신선한 생선을 판매하기 위해 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_03_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "4d436ce6-8f5b-46ce-bac8-ae2ceacf3cde"
msgid "\"I'm sure you have your trade permit with you, of course.\""
msgstr "\"물론 무역 허가를 받았겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_04_Fisherman_String
msgctxt "3ad3ebbc-0771-4d56-b74a-c9efbae5bdff"
msgid "\"Yes, of course! Here are my papers.\""
msgstr "\"물론! 서류가 여기 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_05_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "d314f249-9e8c-4fcb-a2d9-5358510154a5"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, everything seems to be in order... Wait, why is the seal cracked?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 틀림 없군... 잠깐. 왜 봉인에 금이 갔나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_06_Fisherman_String
msgctxt "bb9df11d-4b7d-4945-a529-f8db8637f127"
msgid "\"Oh, dear... I must have put something heavy on it.\""
msgstr "\"오... 무언가를 무거운 걸 올려놓았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_07_Fisherman_String
msgctxt "07b031cb-8270-4961-b4b2-9e051cfcbc29"
msgid "\"But, you said it yourself — everything else is in order!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 네가 스스로 그렇게 말했어. 틀림 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_08_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "2f98f421-b59d-47f2-9b85-cabf027cf247"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe, maybe not... Let me see your other papers — everything you've got.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 수도. 아닐 수도 있지... 다른 서류를 보도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsFisherman_09_Fisherman_String
msgctxt "7f33fe2d-4dbe-4c78-a158-2f0f4bb5c386"
msgid "\"Just let me... Damn, where are they...\""
msgstr "\"그냥 좀 보내줘... 젠장. 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_01_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "c7a493c3-b67a-4854-837b-c7b921e34445"
msgid "\"Who are you, and where are you headed?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구고 어디로 가고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_02_Refugee_String
msgctxt "b1f54451-2585-4325-b6de-b9f251204800"
msgid "\"We hail from Galt. Moving north to find work.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 갈트 출신이다. 북쪽으로 가서 일을 찾을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_03_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "c09c62ce-400f-4c1a-81a5-5cbb61e51273"
msgid "\"I see. Let's see your passage documents, then.\""
msgstr "\"알겠어. 그럼 통행증을 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_04_Refugee_String
msgctxt "3879ede6-3b54-4936-847b-e14cd925e8dd"
msgid "\"Documents?\""
msgstr "\"통행증?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_05_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "6129251c-9816-406f-b943-7475b5b0b3a5"
msgid "\"Your entry permit. That you received when you crossed the border?\""
msgstr "\"네 입국 허가서 말이다. 국경을 넘었을 때 받았을 텐데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_06_Refugee_String
msgctxt "3380a077-8275-4e2c-82db-00ef4e77bdaf"
msgid "\"We... we didn't cross at a border guard posting!\""
msgstr "\"우리는... 국경 수비대를 통과하지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_07_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "8938bcc1-9bcd-440a-b830-da9986ffea78"
msgid "\"Really? So, you admit to illegally sneaking into the country?\""
msgstr "\"정말? 그럼 불법 입국을 인정하는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_08_Refugee_String
msgctxt "b67978b9-99fe-4aac-99bb-6ce2a3975437"
msgid ""
"\"What? No! Since when is it against the law to travel across the River "
"Kingdoms?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 안돼! 강의 왕국들을 통과해 여행하는 것은 언제부터 법에 어긋나는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_09_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "368af842-509d-451c-b37d-7924a1618164"
msgid "\"Traveling is not against the law.\""
msgstr "\"여행은 법을 어기는 것이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_10_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "45512b84-53d0-47a2-85d4-5b47385a7ebb"
msgid ""
"\"Traveling within a foreign state without proper documents, however, is.\""
msgstr "\"그러나 적절한 서류없이 외국을 여행을 하는 것은 불법이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_11_MainGuard_String
msgctxt "d2bd6065-e69e-424b-81be-4cdc86a93466"
msgid ""
"\"So, either you show me your entry permit, or we take this conversation to "
"the interrogation room.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 입국 허가증을 보여 주지 않으면 이 대화를 심문실에서 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/LN/GuardsRefugees_12_Refugee_String
msgctxt "3b66dc74-18c1-461d-9178-1d9973c22b94"
msgid "\"Please, have mercy! Just a moment...\""
msgstr "\"제발. 자비를 베풀어줘! 잠시만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_01Victim_String
msgctxt "ece51235-7c34-4f57-8cbe-2af326fe364c"
msgid "\"I have no idea what you're on about! Just leave me alone!\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭘하고 있는지 모르겠다. 날 그냥 내버려둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_02Guard1_String
msgctxt "0b98d0ba-c3ea-4975-8250-10b6a3f24d53"
msgid "\"That so? Seems our friend here wants to play a game with fate.\""
msgstr "\"그런가? 여기에 있는 우리의 친구는 운명을 건 게임을 하고 싶어한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_03Victim_String
msgctxt "4cea6c85-c371-4257-87b7-8d75c7737c18"
msgid "\"What? What do you mean?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 무슨 의미지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_04Guard1_String
msgctxt "5ca0c62b-afdd-4a51-b1c9-4d16ece2d452"
msgid ""
"\"We all know how it happens. You're living your life, minding your own "
"business...\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두는 그것이 어떻게 일어날지 안다. 너는 네 삶을 살면서 네 일이나 신경쓰다가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_05Guard2_String
msgctxt "ca8fc4cd-37d4-4a52-9933-fb79e4c281c9"
msgid "\"Then, all of a sudden, you get stabbed in a dark alley one evening.\""
msgstr "\"어느 날 저녁 갑자기 어두운 골목에서 찔려 죽을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_06Guard1_String
msgctxt "3f4fe542-f846-4603-aa53-6d8cb9f59413"
msgid "\"Or your shop gets robbed, and you lose everything you had.\""
msgstr "\"아니면 네 가게가 강도를 당하고 가진 모든 것을 잃어버리겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_07Guard2_String
msgctxt "d1991d7e-4d93-4797-8340-57db2bd9c1a5"
msgid ""
"\"Or your sweet, innocent little daughter goes outside to play with her "
"friends, and then...\""
msgstr "\"아니면 네 감미롭고 순수한 딸이 밖에 나가서 친구들과 놀다가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_08Victim_String
msgctxt "09c133f2-59c9-4601-99b8-1fb6ec0c98b6"
msgid "\"Enough! I get it. I'll... I'll pay, all right?\""
msgstr "\"그만! 알았다... 지불할게. 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_09Guard1_String
msgctxt "1b1f0936-f4ef-4918-a003-56bfbe0d1826"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa, what's this now? You're trying to bribe a member of the city guard?\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭐야? 도시 경비원한테 뇌물을 주려고 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_10Victim_String
msgctxt "981ce3b4-0175-4a5c-a8da-e40991611fba"
msgid "\"I'll pay... the security tax.\""
msgstr "\"나는.. 보안세를 지불할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_11Guard1_String
msgctxt "79e6e306-00fa-4b45-bb94-3d0e97dac683"
msgid "\"Better.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_12Guard2_String
msgctxt "f91babfb-c982-4496-ad91-accf7916036f"
msgid "\"I knew we could come to an understanding!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 잘 될 줄 알았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Corruption_13Victim_String
msgctxt "24d93fe8-fd54-4c03-b428-0b11c3815987"
msgid "\"Scoundrels...\""
msgstr "\"악당들...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_01_Beggar_String
msgctxt "087adc93-c8f3-41d6-a0d9-c9727d892bbc"
msgid "\"You! You ruined me!\""
msgstr "\"너! 너는 나를 망쳤어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_02_Merchant_String
msgctxt "00fc2053-9250-4738-b046-46766a87e8a0"
msgid "\"Huh? Do I know you?\""
msgstr "\"응? 내가 너를 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_03_Beggar_String
msgctxt "1a3bec1f-d741-432c-b2a8-e10b6e30b4f2"
msgid "\"Don't you pretend you don't recognize me!\""
msgstr "\"날 못알아보는 척 하지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_04_Merchant_String
msgctxt "3860fbb9-7bd3-49ee-8fab-6435c861e422"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Could be my own mother hiding under those dirty rags, and I still "
"wouldn't recognize her! Get out of here, you panhandler!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 더러운 누더기를 입은 우리 어머니를 내가 못알아봤나! 여기서 나가. 거지야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_05_Beggar_String
msgctxt "24084ad4-58c6-49ba-a55e-5cab2a503a87"
msgid ""
"\"I owned the ironmonger's! The one across the street from your damned store!"
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 철물점 주인이다! 길 건너편에 있는 가게이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_06_Beggar_String
msgctxt "b5708b11-6740-4c25-8409-0c0b11f89cb0"
msgid "\"You hired someone to burn down my shop! You bankrupted me!\""
msgstr "\"내 가게를 태워버릴 사람을 고용했지! 너 때문에 나는 파산했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_07_Merchant_String
msgctxt "f0cb926a-0f21-4f16-ba9e-cd93c664fbcc"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that was YOUR miserable hut that went up in flames the other day?\""
msgstr "\"오. 그날은 화염에 휩싸인 그 비참한 오두막집이 너의 것이었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_08_Merchant_String
msgctxt "f77e0d1e-5282-40e1-9e3d-bd6848d68c1d"
msgid ""
"\"Should've been more careful with your candles. You never know what might "
"happen.\""
msgstr "\"촛불을 더 조심하지 그랬나. 무슨 일이 일어날지 모르잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_09_Beggar_String
msgctxt "18c871e7-39f9-4398-8eb2-061fedb6ffd5"
msgid ""
"\"It was arson! You orchestrated the whole thing! It had to be magic — no "
"ordinary flame could burn so hot!\""
msgstr "\"그건 방화였어! 네가 모든 것을 계획했어! 마법을 썼겠지. 보통 불꽃은 그렇게 뜨거울 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_10_Beggar_String
msgctxt "c181c1bf-d587-4090-b177-b108b78f6764"
msgid ""
"\"My family's been thrown out into the streets! My children have to beg on "
"the corners!\""
msgstr "\"우리 가족은 길거리에 버려졌다! 내 아이들은 모퉁이에서 구걸해야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_11_Beggar_String
msgctxt "dccb8b34-f71b-49b3-9822-54af98aa0d66"
msgid "\"Have you no shame, you wretch?!\""
msgstr "\"수치스럽지도 않나. 비참한 자군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/EvilMerchant_12_Merchant_String
msgctxt "4f9c8386-ff8d-4741-bcfd-1c8de6400349"
msgid ""
"\"What I've had is enough of this farce. Get lost, you bumbling fool, before "
"I call the guards!\""
msgstr "\"이 걸로 충분하다. 꺼져. 바보 같은 소리 하지 말고! 경비를 부르겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_01BadMan1_String
msgctxt "3383c2ae-cf49-4d1e-a1db-8ee25e7feaec"
msgid "\"My patience is at an end. Where's our money?\""
msgstr "\"내 인내심이 바닥났다. 돈은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_02Victim_String
msgctxt "261da77f-1a10-42f0-bbc3-18fba0aef0b3"
msgid "\"I don't have it! The taxes cut deep into it, and...\""
msgstr "\"나는 없다! 세금으로 돈이 바닥나서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_03BadMan_String
msgctxt "da84a50b-c8cb-4d60-9a3f-b62d27f03281"
msgid "\"I don't like what I'm hearing.\""
msgstr "\"그게 무슨 소리야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_04Victim_String
msgctxt "943d1fa6-c930-4a4a-ac26-fc225cbb6326"
msgid "\"Aaaahhh!\""
msgstr "\"아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_05BadMan_String
msgctxt "26527b78-d7a4-4b47-9b1b-0eb20bfeb7a4"
msgid "\"Now, let's try this again. Where's our money?\""
msgstr "\"자. 다시 해보자. 돈은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_06BadWoman_String
msgctxt "305c70f1-82de-4407-90c1-13facbc39536"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm, maybe there's something wrong with your eye that's making it "
"difficult for you to think. Perhaps if we just took that out...\""
msgstr "\"어쩌면 너의 눈에 문제가 있어 생각을 못하는 것 같군. 우리가 꺼내도록 도와주지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_07Victim_String
msgctxt "c7c5a917-33d3-4d5e-b928-1f906324587d"
msgid "\"No! Wait! I know!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 잠깐! 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_08Victim_String
msgctxt "4d59528b-20e4-4278-b271-04de946955dd"
msgid ""
"\"I've got no money, and I'm too old, but... I have a son! He's strong, and "
"healthy...\""
msgstr "\"나는 돈이 없다. 나는 너무 늙었다... 하지만 아들이 있다. 그는 강하고 건강하다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_09Victim_String
msgctxt "5a5f2905-2cd9-46e1-acba-cf511ce3f34e"
msgid "\"He could work off my debts!\""
msgstr "\"그는 내 빚을 갚을 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_10BadMan_String
msgctxt "8bea978b-551f-4e9a-ac46-71a22d41d893"
msgid "\"Idiot. Your pup's of no use to us.\""
msgstr "\"멍청이. 네 자식은 쓸모가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_11BadWoman_String
msgctxt "ea1b0c6d-99d0-487e-9d9d-42e98f80345d"
msgid ""
"\"Hold on... This one's a goner anyway — he doesn't just owe money to the "
"boss, he's been borrowing all around town.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만... 이 사람은 어쨌든 가망이 없다. 그는 대장에게 돈을 빚진 것이 아니라 마을 곳곳에서 돈을 빌려왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_12BadWoman_String
msgctxt "90961b0d-213e-4bdf-8286-e4988c578049"
msgid ""
"\"If we don't do him in, someone else will. Why not let the young one pay "
"off the debt?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 안하면 다른 사람이 할 것이다. 젊은이가 빚을 갚게 하면 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_13Victim_String
msgctxt "43608a25-76df-4ea8-831f-1c2fc0da8474"
msgid "\"Don't kill me! I beg of you!\""
msgstr "\"나를 죽이지 마라. 너에게 간청한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_14BadMan_String
msgctxt "228e1a96-02b8-449a-b71d-c0161edf9b05"
msgid "\"Hmm...\""
msgstr "\"흠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/Extortion_15BadMan_String
msgctxt "1a6865ec-67da-4ba1-ab28-d65f93fb2a72"
msgid "\"I'll consider it. The boss may not like it, though...\""
msgstr "\"나는 그것을 고려할 것이다. 대장은 좋아하지 않을지도 모른다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_01Man_String
msgctxt "eb551f46-a3d2-4cd6-aad0-78c716d886f7"
msgid "\"Give me back my money, you swindler!\""
msgstr "\"내 돈을 돌려줘. 이 사기꾼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_02Woman_String
msgctxt "c159c09f-4053-4080-a27a-9c28c75181d8"
msgid ""
"\"Why should I? You saw what you were paying for — no point complaining now!"
"\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜? 네가 지불한 것을 보았다. 지금 불평해 봐야 소용 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_03Man_String
msgctxt "6983bed9-214f-46e0-acac-c0d1ff03eb24"
msgid "\"You said the rod was magical!\""
msgstr "\"너는 이 지팡이가 마법 물품이라고 했잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_04Woman_String
msgctxt "67562814-8168-406b-80ed-030d441d857c"
msgid "\"And it is! See, those there are magic runes...\""
msgstr "\"그렇다! 봐. 거기에는 마법 룬이 새겨져 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_05Man_String
msgctxt "4c68146a-aa43-4f37-bee0-8cd5a68f901e"
msgid "\"But it's empty! It's got no charges left!\""
msgstr "\"그러나 그것은 비어있다! 한 방도 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_06Man_String
msgctxt "87ddca19-8a31-47dc-a306-bb40f886a851"
msgid "\"Why on earth would I want an empty magic rod?!\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜 비어있는 마법 지팡이를 원하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_07Woman_String
msgctxt "6a270025-8453-4d31-8fa3-867d810f2862"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, hon. You wanted a magic rod — I sold you a magic rod. If you "
"wanted a magic rod that still had charges left, you should've said so.\""
msgstr "\"들어 봐. 너는 마법 지팡이를 원했어. 나는 팔았고. 네가 충전이 된 마법 지팡이를 원한다면 그렇게 말했어야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_08Bystander_String
msgctxt "5611fca2-299c-47c3-a169-adcf8908aa14"
msgid "\"Ha! Would you look at this simpleton?\""
msgstr "\"하하! 이 멍청이가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_09Bystander2_String
msgctxt "d95adede-cba2-495f-8e25-d6538b493558"
msgid "\"What a nitwit!\""
msgstr "\"이런 멍청이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_10Man_String
msgctxt "bd5b09ab-68c2-4234-b086-e3864809227d"
msgid "\"Stop it! She tricked me!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 그녀가 나를 속였어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_11Bystander2_String
msgctxt "fc8d3a06-b3da-48db-99b6-7dc846c1b219"
msgid ""
"\"Should've been more careful. You gotta pay attention to what you're buying!"
"\""
msgstr "\"조심해야 했어. 네가 사는 물건에 집중해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MagicRod_12Bystander_String
msgctxt "5671ed86-1bdd-4308-8f82-0a020f124f75"
msgid "\"The lady was within her rights — it's not a crime to fool an idiot!\""
msgstr "\"그 여인은 그녀의 권리가 있다. 바보를 속이는 것은 범죄가 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_01_Customer_String
msgctxt "8e2a7eee-3d75-4216-b645-f39ec038bfd6"
msgid "\"How much?! Just where did that price come from?\""
msgstr "\"얼마야?! 그 가격은 도대체 어디에서 왔는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_02_Customer_String
msgctxt "fb213505-e282-4efc-9881-f8a53b5b7862"
msgid "\"It was half that price last week!\""
msgstr "\"지난주에는 그 가격의 절반이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_03_Trader_String
msgctxt "17e8b66c-aa7a-46f6-bf29-18770f5d98d3"
msgid ""
"\"The ferrymen have increased the fee for transporting goods across the "
"river — again. I had to raise prices to compensate.\""
msgstr "\"강을 가로 질러 물건을 운송하는 유람선이 비용을 인상했다. 어쩔 수 없이 가격을 인상해야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_04_Customer_String
msgctxt "abee305c-cf0b-4b96-91ac-5b6431beffbf"
msgid ""
"\"You're robbing me blind! What, you think I have a money tree or something?"
"\""
msgstr "\"대놓고 도둑질이군! 내가 돈나무 같은 것을 가지고 있다고 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_05_Trader_String
msgctxt "abdbabcb-b5f9-4c87-9f8d-6b3ea28ac0e1"
msgid ""
"\"Cry all you want; the price is set. I've got no intention of going broke "
"like you have.\""
msgstr "\"원하는 모든 것을 불러라. 가격은 정해졌다. 나는 너처럼 파산할 생각이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_06_Trader_String
msgctxt "a5df9f65-07a9-4817-bd17-a42c490004af"
msgid "\"Pay what I'm asking, or you can go search through the trash.\""
msgstr "\"내가 요청한 가격을 지불하거나 쓰레기통을 찾아 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_07_Bystander1_String
msgctxt "8e61741c-e79b-4082-8591-9d78407385bf"
msgid "\"Hey, how long are we supposed to be waiting here?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 얼마나 오래 여기서 기다려야 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_08_Bystander2_String
msgctxt "390ab7e8-5c1e-40d6-a619-3698f4064556"
msgid "\"Move it, will ya!\""
msgstr "\"움직여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NE/MarketTrader_09_Bystander3_String
msgctxt "c8aa4080-1df2-4cbb-bb9c-082ac0d0fcf7"
msgid ""
"\"Someone's bound to cut my purse while I'm standing in this damn line...\""
msgstr "\"내가 줄에 서있는 동안 누군가가 내 지갑을 갈랐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_01First_String
msgctxt "1a7204ff-33a5-4ea6-9268-92ba379f49ae"
msgid ""
"\"I'd never heard of {mf|him|her} before! {mf|He|She} just came outta "
"nowhere!\""
msgstr "\"나는 {mf|그|그녀}를 전에 들어 본 적이 없다! {mf|그|그녀}는 방금 갑자기 튀어나왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_02Second_String
msgctxt "25d3e4c0-28ab-4e55-9b1e-7c8be67176c3"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now, not out of NOWHERE... {mf|He|She} came from Brevoy! Sent by the "
"Swordlords themselves!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄. 갑자기 튀어나온 건 아니지. {mf|그|그녀}는 브레보이에서 왔다! 소드로드가 보낸 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_03Third_String
msgctxt "c187aff7-2beb-4b16-9cdd-3de0e180254e"
msgid ""
"\"Doesn't matter who sent {mf|him|her}. Before {mf||s}he showed up, no one "
"would even dare to oppose the Stag Lord!\""
msgstr "\"누가 보냈건 상관 없어. 이 자가 나타나기 전에는 아무도 감히 수사슴 군주를 반대하지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_04Second_String
msgctxt "7c309359-bd2c-4eb3-9ff8-a807ef205072"
msgid ""
"\"Damn, I wish I was here for that. His thugs wouldn't get off my back — "
"almost squeezed me dry, the assholes!\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 나는 그 이유로 여기에 있었으면 좋겠다. 그 깡패들은 나를 괴롭힐 뿐만 아니라 나를 쥐어짰어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_05Second_String
msgctxt "5f6e89a5-e0af-4831-9e41-73915377fa2b"
msgid ""
"\"My farm's a long way from here, and they still got their greedy mitts on "
"it... Had to flee in the night so they wouldn't notice. We left everything, "
"hoping they wouldn't come looking for us...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 농장은 여기에서 먼 길이고 그들은 여전히 우리를 수탈했다... 밤에 도망쳐야 그들이 알아볼 수 없었을 것이다. 우리를 찾아 오지 "
"않기를 바라면서 우리는 모든 것을 버렸다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_06Second_String
msgctxt "a4e437ba-7aad-4c6b-a385-5276c127a676"
msgid ""
"\"There was nowhere to go, really... rough times. But then, one day, I come "
"to the market, and what do I hear? The Stag Lord's no more, and now a real "
"baron{mf||ess} has the crown!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 갈 곳이 없었다. 정말로... 힘든 시기였다. 결국 나는 시장에 나왔는데 내가 듣는 것은 뭐지? 수사슴 군주는 이제 없고 진짜 "
"남작이 왕관을 썼다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_07Second_String
msgctxt "632fc338-a83c-4c5c-86c4-5e52502d11c5"
msgid ""
"\"Soon as I told my wife, we decided to return home. I mean, hell, maybe "
"things got better after all...\""
msgstr "\"내 아내에게 말했을 때 우리는 집에 돌아가기로 결심했다. 젠장. 어쩌면 상황이 좋을지도 몰랐기에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_08First_String
msgctxt "13f7f1e6-1731-486c-88a3-7473bea9d65f"
msgid "\"Just spit it out already! What'd you find when you got back?\""
msgstr "\"어서 말해! 돌아왔을 때 무엇을 찾았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_09Second_String
msgctxt "8e844a04-fa47-4fbd-9f7d-785f2e98f9a8"
msgid ""
"\"Well, the cattle were gone, which is to be expected, but the house was "
"practically untouched! Too far from the Stag Lord's fort for them to bother "
"with, I guess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음. 가축이 없어졌는데 예상은 했었지만 집은 변함이 없었다! 수사슴 군주의 요새에서 너무 멀리 떨어져 있어서 그런 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_10Second_String
msgctxt "df57ae83-22f5-47c3-b9e5-73f8e75e5f24"
msgid ""
"\"We had to start over from scratch... but that's a whole lot easier when "
"you don't have thugs shaking you down every week. See for yourself — now I "
"can bring my goods all the way to the capital itself to trade!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 처음부터 다시 시작해야 하지만... 매주 우리를 괴롭히는 깡패가 없어서 훨씬 쉬워졌다. 봐. 이제는 물품을 수도로 가져 와서 "
"무역을 할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/AboutBaron_11Third_String
msgctxt "9bc8be83-c130-4662-93da-a2733d47096a"
msgid ""
"\"It's true, life's gotten better for everyone with the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} on the throne!\""
msgstr "\"사실이다. {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 지배 후로 모든 사람들이 더 나은 삶을 얻었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_01_Priestess_String
msgctxt "f666cc77-a93b-4e8b-bd03-da1bf11750c7"
msgid "\"Listen to me! It's wrong to cling to your dishonorable behavior!\""
msgstr "\"내 말을 들어! 너의 불명예스러운 행동에 집착하는 것은 잘못된 일이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_02_Man_String
msgctxt "91182141-4b86-4d00-9e2b-0284a7781faa"
msgid "\"Leave me alone! I'll deal with my problems myself!\""
msgstr "\"나를 내버려둬! 내가 직접 문제를 다룰 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_03_Priestess_String
msgctxt "aeb4619e-e430-432c-a696-3656b5b6f0b5"
msgid ""
"\"Problems? You're going to be a father! How can you just wave off a gift "
"like that?\""
msgstr "\"문제가 있나요? 너는 아버지가 될거야! 어떻게 그런 선물을 거절할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_04_Man_String
msgctxt "0b3cd217-e652-49d2-aa0e-4f0c1620502e"
msgid "\"You know only too well where... where this 'gift' came from!\""
msgstr "\"이 '선물'이... 어디에서 왔는지 잘 알 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_05_Priestess_String
msgctxt "9269b454-5d2b-4ae0-9425-3f0e618b7465"
msgid ""
"\"Infidelity is the parents' sin, not the child's! Consider how kind the "
"gods are to you — even in your dishonor, you're granted a gift of joy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불신앙은 자녀의 것이 아니라 부모의 죄이다! 신이 네게 얼마나 친절한지 생각해 봐라. 네가 믿지 않아도 너는 기쁨의 선물을 받는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_06_Man_String
msgctxt "6ef82fc8-31d6-42f6-8e89-3144707c0859"
msgid ""
"\"And what'll I do with it?! My wife'll kill me if she finds out I knocked "
"up a maid!\""
msgstr "\"내가 그걸로 무엇을 하지? 하녀가 내 아이를 가진 사실을 안다면 내 아내가 날 죽일 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_07_Priestess_String
msgctxt "48220b62-c0cd-4707-a86a-f2725cb7d808"
msgid "\"Why do you so fear the truth? Will this lie bring you deliverance?\""
msgstr "\"왜 진실을 두려워하지? 거짓말이 너에게 구원을 가져다줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_08_Man_String
msgctxt "ff0fa51e-c334-4137-9820-217123e56b20"
msgid "\"At least I'll still be alive.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 나는 살아있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_09_Priestess_String
msgctxt "738e6b15-33f1-45e7-aebc-cb35da7ef436"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, why didn't the gods gift you and your wife with a child? After "
"all the years you've been together?\""
msgstr "\"말해 봐. 왜 신이 너와 너의 아내에게 아이를 주지 않았을까? 몇년을 함께 살았는데도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_10_Man_String
msgctxt "8e80f367-9eb7-4218-a064-6d28f3a2f05d"
msgid ""
"\"We... we haven't lived like a husband and wife for a long time. The love "
"that once bound us has cooled.\""
msgstr "\"우리는... 오랫동안 남편과 아내처럼 살지 않았다. 우리의 사랑은 곧 식었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_11_Priestess_String
msgctxt "a7b33c1d-0cc3-4a42-a0a3-02f1e9663dbf"
msgid ""
"\"Then let her go. Stop clinging to something that doesn't exist anymore — "
"you only hurt everyone involved. Free the one suffering from your "
"indifference, and care for your child and its mother.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니 그녀를 놓아줘. 더 이상 존재하지 않는 것에 집착하지 마라. 관련된 모든 사람들에게 상처를 줄 뿐이다. 무관심으로부터 사람을 "
"해방시키고 아이와 그 어머니를 돌봐야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_12_Man_String
msgctxt "ccb96e7f-367a-4e24-beed-b6395cb6502e"
msgid "\"You're... probably right. But it's so hard to take that plunge!\""
msgstr "\"네 말이... 맞아. 하지만 그렇게 하기에는 너무 어렵다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BetrayerPriestess_13_Priestess_String
msgctxt "591569a6-168a-42f6-b1fc-466fbf34af35"
msgid ""
"\"I understand. We're all weak. But it's never too late to do the right "
"thing.\""
msgstr "\"이해한다. 우리는 모두 약하다. 하지만 옳은 일을 하기에 늦은 때는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_01_FirstMan_String
msgctxt "3b0bdb8a-3ede-4b4d-9f58-a83b4489831b"
msgid "\"You hear about what the Surtovans did at the border?\""
msgstr "\"서토바 가문이 국경에서 한 일에 대해 들었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_02_SecondMan_String
msgctxt "b5a9834b-1b5b-4c1c-a8d6-f1522b55d4cb"
msgid ""
"\"Another brawl with the Swordlords? When are they going to give it up?\""
msgstr "\"소드로드와의 또 다른 싸움인가? 그들은 언제 포기할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_03_FirstMan_String
msgctxt "f94bb87d-41a4-407b-abf0-e2f71815483a"
msgid ""
"\"It's a shame — all these years, and they still can't come to terms. "
"They're in the same country! What if they get attacked?\""
msgstr "\"유감스럽게도 그들은 수년 동안 그들은 타협하지 못했다. 그들은 같은 국가에 있다! 그들이 공격을 받으면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_04_ThirdMan_String
msgctxt "fce0573c-2b56-4ae4-9128-db73f45089a2"
msgid ""
"\"Well, the Surtovans I can understand — they're the lawful heirs to the "
"lands, not those sword-swinging upstarts. When the Rogarvians...\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄 내가 아는 서토바 가문은 검을 휘두르는 신흥 귀족이 아니라 이 땅의 합법적인 상속인이다. 로가비아 가문이 한 때...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_05_FirstMan_String
msgctxt "44d6e689-3097-4ff6-9024-4987a9b07178"
msgid ""
"\"When the Rogarvians appeared, the Surtovans dropped on their backs and "
"exposed their throats! They're pathetic cowards. At least the Aldori tried "
"to fight back!\""
msgstr ""
"\"로가비아 가문이 한 때 등장했고 서토바 가문은 자리를 내어주고 무기를 내렸다! 그들은 냉담한 겁쟁이이다. 적어도 알도리는 "
"반격하려고 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_06_SecondMan_String
msgctxt "47991bab-2d69-42d3-b9d3-be0d2785d6e3"
msgid ""
"\"And what'd that get them, huh? Hundreds of deaths, maybe more! No, no "
"one's right in this feud, no matter what you say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 그들이 무엇을 얻었지? 수백명의 사망자가... 어쩌면 더 많았을 거다! 네가 말하는 것에 상관없이 이 불화에서 맞는 것은 "
"아무것도 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/BrevoyDiscussion_07_SecondMan_String
msgctxt "79ce6338-0c18-4d84-908b-b73e3ed5d903"
msgid ""
"\"They both think only of themselves — not a thought for those who toil "
"under them!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 둘 다 자기 자신만 생각한다. 자기 밑에서 수고를 하는 사람들을 위한다면 그런 생각을 할 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_01Poor_String
msgctxt "ee946275-ecf7-430c-81de-bdb2c4779f99"
msgid "\"Melisandra? You are Melisandra Daveon, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"멜리산드라? 너 Melisandra Daveon지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_02Rich_String
msgctxt "11cd1645-98a0-4e8b-873c-294f96c2819a"
msgid "\"Yes. And you are...?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 너는...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_03Poor_String
msgctxt "f898a36c-37af-4d23-89b6-7ccaf30f298c"
msgid ""
"\"My lady, I'm the wife of Gurt, who serves as groom for your beloved "
"husband!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 남편의 마부로 봉사하는 Gurt의 아내야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_04Rich_String
msgctxt "aa019032-3706-4cdc-b57f-d9650754c4f4"
msgid "\"Oh! Of course, I...\""
msgstr "\"오! 맞아. 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_05Poor_String
msgctxt "82a52d6a-ef09-4ed0-be7e-c092dc656ecc"
msgid ""
"\"My lady, you saved us! Your dear husband forgave my husband's debt over "
"the ruined harness gear. And it was expensive — had brasses and everything!\""
msgstr "\"네가 우리를 구했다! 너의 남편이 망가진 마구로 빚진 내 남편을 용서했다. 마구는 비쌌다. 놋쇠로 만들어진 고급품이었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_06Rich_String
msgctxt "f521c1b6-9cd6-4ec2-ab78-add6e1c75cea"
msgid "\"Listen, good lady... Forgive me, what is your name?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... 용서해. 네 이름이 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_07Poor_String
msgctxt "4aed51e7-47b3-413c-916c-f03e57b886bf"
msgid "\"Gina, my lady.\""
msgstr "\"지나야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_08Rich_String
msgctxt "32b77a55-0672-4647-ba11-a2aa1ccc4380"
msgid ""
"\"Gina, please stop bowing and scraping to me. It was my husband's actions, "
"not mine. And besides, who would have done otherwise?\""
msgstr "\"지나. 제발 그만 절하고 수다는 그만 떨어라. 그건 내 남편의 행동이지. 내 것이 아니다. 누구라도 그렇게 했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_09Rich_String
msgctxt "b2926a3b-f644-488a-8d51-6750b6cc5096"
msgid ""
"\"I know what you and your family have gone through, and no one wanted to "
"make things worse over some stupid harness!\""
msgstr "\"너와 네 가족이 무엇을 겪었는지 알고 있고, 누구도 바보같은 마구 때문에 상황을 악화시키고 싶지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_10Poor_String
msgctxt "0046861a-2003-4dc4-a3f1-778b95723743"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, thank you my lady! Thank you so much! Is there anything I can do for "
"you? Please, I want to thank your family, any way I can!\""
msgstr "\"오. 고마워! 내가 할 수 있는 일이 있을까? 감사의 표시를 어떻게든 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_11Rich_String
msgctxt "d52ab7a9-5d82-458e-819e-f1300d8d71ab"
msgid "\"Actually... there is something...\""
msgstr "\"사실... 부탁이 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_12Rich_String
msgctxt "48a8cf62-53fb-4a22-91fe-4777557249e4"
msgid "\"Have you ever considered your son's future, Gina?\""
msgstr "\"아들의 미래를 생각해 본 적이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_13Poor_String
msgctxt "a5fa629b-5945-4eaf-bde9-f145805b3807"
msgid ""
"\"Oh... Well, I thought he might follow in his father's footsteps. Or maybe "
"become a plowman — my father-in-law has a small plot of land...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오... 글쎄. 나는 그가 아버지의 발자취를 따라갈 수도 있다고 생각했어. 어쩌면 농부가 될 수도 나의 시아버지에게는 작은 땅이 "
"있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_14Rich_String
msgctxt "dee57ec3-ab2a-403c-9739-55328d3c608f"
msgid ""
"\"Gina, next year, we're going to be sending Ronald to Absalom to study, and "
"I'm afraid my son will be lonely, especially at first.\""
msgstr "\"Gina. 내년에는 로널드를 압살롬으로 유학을 보내는데 초반에 아들이 외로워질까 두려워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_15Rich_String
msgctxt "60a53515-0f35-495f-97ff-16da8f476dce"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I saw how wonderfully he plays with Kyt, and I thought... Maybe your "
"son would be amenable to accompanying Ronald on his journey?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그가 카이트와 함께 잘 노는 것을 보았고 내 생각에 아마 네 아들이 로널드를 여정 동안 동행할 수 있을 것 같은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_16Rich_String
msgctxt "4368f235-9c55-4bba-acf9-175926a19bd1"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, I'm ready and willing to cover all the expenses for Kyt's "
"education — in return for ensuring that Ronald will be under the watchful "
"eye of an older peer.\""
msgstr "\"물론 나는 카이트의 교육 비용을 모두 충당할 준비가 되어있다. 로널드가 선배들의 감시를 받는 보답으로 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_17Poor_String
msgctxt "1b1100a0-eb29-4b23-92a7-2f1da2f8aa27"
msgid ""
"\"I... I don't know what to say! I'm sure he'll agree! I'll ask him today!\""
msgstr "\"나는... 무슨 말을해야 할지 모르겠다! 나는 그가 동의 할 것이라고 확신한다. 나는 오늘 그에게 물을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Rich&Poor_18Poor_String
msgctxt "74d699d7-bc6a-4d2b-9bd2-315c3cf281cb"
msgid "\"There is no limit to your kindness, my lady!\""
msgstr "\"너의 친절함에는 한계가 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_01_Priestess_String
msgctxt "fec31204-99f6-48cc-8fff-aef59828582a"
msgid ""
"\"The divine fire accepts any sin — and burns it away! There is hope for "
"everyone!\""
msgstr "\"신성한 불은 모든 죄를 받아들이고 그것을 태워 버린다! 모두에게 희망이 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_02_Man_String
msgctxt "dc0dacd2-369c-4da0-b755-198e6a8faa11"
msgid ""
"\"What are you talking about, you fool? How can you forgive an evil deed?\""
msgstr "\"너 무슨 소리하는 거야? 어떻게 그런 사악한 짓을 용서할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_03_Priestess_String
msgctxt "f90b7ccd-81d6-43e1-9f00-ee8506a4ba61"
msgid ""
"\"It is all in the radiant Sarenrae's power! She teaches us to show mercy to "
"all — even the most terrible of criminals.\""
msgstr "\"모두 빛나는 서렌레이의 힘이다! 그녀는 우리에게 자비를 보여줄 것을 가르친다. 심지어 가장 무서운 범죄자조차도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_04_Priestess_String
msgctxt "7359eccd-4637-47a7-afb0-7174d6d6574c"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever you've done in life, you can always have hope — hope in "
"repentance and the return to virtue!\""
msgstr "\"네가 인생에서 한 일이 무엇이든 너는 언제나 희망을 가질 수있다. 회개와 덕으로 돌아가는 희망을 가질 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_05_Bystander_String
msgctxt "7eb22270-a1d8-498b-b13b-bba1c0ebbd4b"
msgid ""
"\"I've never even heard of Sarenrae... Tell me about her. What's she like?\""
msgstr "\"나는 서렌레이에 대해 들어 보지 못했다... 그녀에 대해 말해 봐라. 그녀는 무슨 신이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_06_Priestess_String
msgctxt "c5de6332-5902-4127-aa9a-a2f121cbe9d4"
msgid "\"Sarenrae is a divine flame, cleansing all vice.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 모든 악을 정결케하는 신성한 불꽃이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_07_Priestess_String
msgctxt "2358c75d-1f60-4a34-a7ff-411ede5b0e95"
msgid ""
"\"Her name is the Healing Light, for my goddess brings relief from suffering "
"and wounds.\""
msgstr "\"고통과 상처로부터 구제를 가져와 그녀의 이름의 의미는 '치유의 빛'이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_08_Priestess_String
msgctxt "da13f206-ea1e-48d9-8d72-205421e46cd3"
msgid ""
"\"Her name is the Dawnflower, for her boundless patience is like the warm "
"light of the sun.\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 끝없는 인내는 태양의 따뜻한 빛과 같아 그녀의 이름은 새벽의 꽃이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_09_Man_String
msgctxt "e2322b97-cb33-4458-a2ab-07f0ed228a8a"
msgid ""
"\"Lies, all of it! Some sins can't be forgiven. What's the point if a "
"murderer repents? It won't bring back the dead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두 거짓말이다! 어떤 죄는 용서받을 수 없다. 살인자가 회개하면 무슨 소용이 있느냐? 죽은 사람은 돌아오지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_10_Priestess_String
msgctxt "3f5ba732-066b-454a-8f81-2565a66f2056"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, we cannot change what's done, and some evil deeds cannot be "
"remedied. But even dark evil can be atoned for with good acts — a barren "
"desert can still give way to a lush garden, and a soul suffering in darkness "
"can still find its way to light.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 행해진 것을 바꿀 수 없으며 어떤 악행은 치료받을 수 없다. 그러나 심지어 어두운 악의조차도 좋은 행동으로 인해 속죄될 수 "
"있다. 불모의 사막은 여전히 푸른 정원에 가는 길이 있고 어둠 속에서 고통받는 영혼은 여전히 빛의 길을 찾을 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_11_Priestess_String
msgctxt "8db0ac32-b73d-4a0a-87c0-e09cee0d5cd0"
msgid ""
"\"Is there not virtue in lending a merciful hand to someone who's been "
"damned by all? Just as I now lend mercy to you, who lost yourself to anger?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 이에게 손가락질 당한 자에게 자비의 손길을 건내는 것은 미덕이 아닐까? 분노로 자신을 잃은 너에게 자비를 베푸는 것처럼 말이다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_12_Man_String
msgctxt "d7ea097b-efd8-4621-98cb-859d02ad8cc2"
msgid ""
"\"What? But, I... I... I don't need your damn mercy! Stay away from me!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 하지만 나.. 나... 나는 너의 빌어먹을 동정은 필요 없어! 나에게서 떨어져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/NG/Sarenrae_13_Priestess_String
msgctxt "dc7c9627-8457-4dcd-a6b8-6faa60b226f2"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish. But know this: no matter what shadow darkens your soul, there "
"are those unafraid to enter it and reach toward the kindness you hide in "
"your wounded heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 원하는대로. 그러나 이것을 알아둬라. 그림자가 너의 영혼을 어둡게 만든다 할지라도 너의 상처 입은 마음에 숨어있는 친절함에 "
"도달하여 들어가는 용기의 길이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_01_First_String
msgctxt "caf43f9d-4f2a-41d1-b234-dec9dc335c39"
msgid ""
"\"There's unrest in the north. They say the Surtovans and the Swordlords are "
"at it again.\""
msgstr "\"북쪽에는 불안함이 있다. 서토바와 소드로드가 다시 갈등에 빠졌다고 말한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_02_Second_String
msgctxt "7209984f-2f0b-480c-afe7-cffb57d648cd"
msgid "\"Unbelievable. Have any fights broken out?\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없군. 어떤 싸움이라도 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_03_First_String
msgctxt "b1f83073-c1b6-4f3b-8760-26135b2fbd41"
msgid ""
"\"Not yet, but if nothing's done, they're on track to have a civil war on "
"their hands soon.\""
msgstr "\"아직은 아니지만 아무것도 끝나지 않았다면 그들은 곧 내전을 벌일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_04_Third_String
msgctxt "2e7967b5-3aae-483a-aaa3-6af9b0214829"
msgid ""
"\"I feel for the poor sods living there. It's like sitting on top of a "
"powder keg.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그곳에 살고 있는 가난한 사람들의 기분을 알겠다. 마치 파우더 통 꼭대기에 앉아있는 것과 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_05_Fourth_String
msgctxt "4cef78db-57d0-4468-820e-ed54824ccb5a"
msgid "\"Never sure whom to bow to and whom to spit at...\""
msgstr "\"누구에게 절을 하고 누구에게 침을 뱉을지 확신하지 못할 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_06_Second_String
msgctxt "361d8e95-30cb-443a-8cfc-4eb363c478ac"
msgid "\"Why can't the Surtovans and the Aldori just make up?\""
msgstr "\"왜 서토바와 알도리는 화해할 수 없지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_07_Second_String
msgctxt "1e582ad7-c623-41d0-b22e-6f0978afe838"
msgid ""
"\"They had a rocky past, but so what? All their bickering is tearing their "
"country apart!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 과거의 암울한 과거를 가지고 있었지만 어쩌라고? 그들의 모든 논쟁이 그들의 나라를 찢어버리고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_08_First_String
msgctxt "dc1baa84-0c21-41bb-be0a-7108f9614581"
msgid ""
"\"It's not just them, either — none of Brevoy's noble houses are "
"particularly friendly with each other at the moment.\""
msgstr "\"그들 누구도 아니다. 브레보이의 귀족들 중 어느 누구도 지금은 서로에게 우호적이지 못하다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_09_First_String
msgctxt "213c5744-978c-4e2a-9b3e-b8b6f9ed489d"
msgid ""
"\"So things aren't as simple as just 'making up.' It'd take the help of the "
"gods themselves to make peace in Brevoy.\""
msgstr "\"그저 '화해'하는 것 만큼 단순하지 않다. 브레보이에서 평화를 만들기 위해서는 신들의 도움을 받아야 한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/BrevoyPeace_10_Third_String
msgctxt "d23040dd-b982-4da1-8e76-c416ff024d81"
msgid ""
"\"It's a shame. Think what life in Brevoy would be like if they could just "
"stop all the infighting!\""
msgstr "\"안타깝다. 브레보이의 모든 내분을 막을 수 있는 삶을 생각해 봐라. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_01_Widow_String
msgctxt "2c1fe6f4-c27a-4a2a-b72c-71c674e23bbf"
msgid "\"My love... Why did you leave me...? How could this have happened...\""
msgstr "\"내 사랑... 왜 날 떠났어?... 어떻게 이런 일이 일어날 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_02_Friend_String
msgctxt "e471ef5a-9631-4803-abc8-db9de95c6816"
msgid "\"Take heart, dear. Try to make your peace with it...\""
msgstr "\"힘내. 마음의 평온을 가져라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_03_Widow_String
msgctxt "197c534c-cf08-4cae-83c4-79ec7c737d83"
msgid "\"He was my pride and joy...\""
msgstr "\"그는 내 자존심과 기쁨이었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_04_Friend_String
msgctxt "a3418397-8284-4312-a4f3-1d0d66811eb8"
msgid ""
"\"The gods deemed your husband's time had come. You should thank "
"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} for the happiness he bestowed upon your family all "
"these years.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신이 네 남편의 때가 온 것으로 생각했다. 항상 너의 가족에게 행복을 준 {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}에게 감사해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_05_Friend_String
msgctxt "9440ec8d-0627-4cf6-b849-c9efc2bf71b2"
msgid "\"And to die at such an old age, peacefully, asleep in his own bed...\""
msgstr "\"그런 노년에 평화롭게 자기 침대에서 자면서 떠나다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_06_Widow_String
msgctxt "11120774-aa1d-480c-939e-feb6fc21047f"
msgid "\"What difference does that make?! I can't live without him!\""
msgstr "\"그게 무슨 차이가 있어? 나는 그 사람 없이는 살 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_07_Widow_String
msgctxt "4d300b54-22d4-4e95-8802-4b1ad1f8640b"
msgid ""
"\"I would give anything to rip him back from the claws of Pharasma and her "
"minions!\""
msgstr "\"나는 파라즈마와 그의 부하들의 발톱에서 그를 되살려내기 위해 무엇이라도 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_08_Friend_String
msgctxt "6a1c8852-7e0d-4b34-a2c9-0626972e8f3f"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to yourself, dear! One should never risk angering the Lady of "
"Graves, even if out of grief!\""
msgstr "\"네 마음의 소리에 귀기울여! 슬픔에서 벗어날지라도 무덤의 여인을 분노하게 하지 않아야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_09_Friend_String
msgctxt "b8ccd013-79a8-4508-a4c0-6013a2ecc0e0"
msgid ""
"\"It's the natural order of things. It's how the world has been since it was "
"born, and how it will continue to be until it, too, makes that final journey."
"\""
msgstr "\"그것은 자연스런 질서이다. 세상이 태어난 이래 이렇게 되어 왔으며 그것이 마지막 여행이 될 때까지 계속될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Funeral_10_Friend_String
msgctxt "8e95cdc7-705f-4a46-abfb-aab6cef2c28a"
msgid ""
"\"You, me... All of us will find ourselves on the path to the Boneyard. So "
"let us pray that we'll be met by our loved ones after Pharasma has passed "
"judgment upon us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 나는... 우리 모두는 뼈무덤의 길에서 스스로를 찾을 것이다. 그래서 파라즈마의 심판을 통과한 후에 우리가 사랑하는 사람들과 "
"만날 수 있도록 기도하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_01_Mage_String
msgctxt "30c4897a-1069-4720-a5ed-3d551436cfed"
msgid ""
"\"The art of weaving spells, more so than any other, requires maintaining a "
"strict internal balance.\""
msgstr "\"마법을 만드는 기술은 다른 어떤 것보다 더 엄격한 내부 균형을 유지해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_02_Mage_String
msgctxt "b57bc92e-970a-4e5c-beaa-6d54a1e297e7"
msgid ""
"\"If your soul is in turmoil, if your mind wanders, then your knowledge and "
"skill shall yet fail you.\""
msgstr "\"너의 영혼이 혼란에 빠지거나 마음이 방황한다면 너의 지식과 기술은 실패할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_03_Pupil1_String
msgctxt "bf160d5f-4d44-4cdf-b5cb-fe080dcc5dfb"
msgid "\"How do I find that balance, teacher?\""
msgstr "\"균형을 어떻게 찾아야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_04_Mage_String
msgctxt "8adfbc3b-131a-4349-855b-ff4210dd5ff0"
msgid ""
"\"You must search the depths of your heart, as well as the depths of your "
"mind.\""
msgstr "\"정신의 깊은 곳 뿐만 아니라 너의 마음 속 깊은 곳도 탐구해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_05_Mage_String
msgctxt "16a3337b-009f-4a92-90f3-867acb3fbdc5"
msgid ""
"\"Just as a farmer tends his land, providing shade to spots with too much "
"sun or water to soil that is too dry, you must be attentive to the movements "
"and condition of your heart and soul.\""
msgstr ""
"\"농부가 햇볕이 많이 드는 곳에 그늘을 대고 마른 토양에 물을 주는 것처럼 너의 마음과 영혼의 상태와 움직임에 주의를 기울여야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_06_Mage_String
msgctxt "fa54db5a-19aa-4871-96dc-66f763c90722"
msgid ""
"\"Do not allow weeds to take root in the garden of your soul — whether it be "
"by pride or impatience...\""
msgstr "\"너의 영혼의 정원에서 자존심이나 조급함이든 잡초가 뿌리내리지 않도록 해라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_07_Pupil2_String
msgctxt "86ddb280-02fd-4d78-a27f-153834b08d5a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, teacher, but how are we supposed to just wait and stay patient "
"with the knowledge sitting right at our fingertips?\""
msgstr "\"미안하다. 스승님. 어떻게 지식이 우리의 손끝에 앉아있기를 참을성있게 기다리고 기다릴 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_08_Pupil2_String
msgctxt "f3538947-6d5f-4c23-95c1-0184aaf8d794"
msgid ""
"\"Just yesterday, you took the book I was studying from — it seemed to have "
"some powerful spells!\""
msgstr "\"어제 너는 내가 공부하고 있던 책을 가져갔다. 강력한 마법 주문이 적힌 것 같았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_09_Pupil2_String
msgctxt "17195284-39b6-4f82-9519-ff7a7af7f269"
msgid "\"But now you're telling us that knowledge is good!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 이제는 지식이 좋다는 말을 하고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_10_Mage_String
msgctxt "9fab2fc4-9c45-416b-8aeb-7b55da7ed291"
msgid "\"You have my thanks, my pupil.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 제자야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_11_Pupil2_String
msgctxt "31d430f8-514f-497e-a2f9-be507e1832a1"
msgid "\"...What for, teacher?\""
msgstr "\"... 무엇이?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_12_Mage_String
msgctxt "df4c7ac8-9aaf-49f9-a82e-f6a3ec0b3da9"
msgid ""
"\"For becoming an excellent example of that which I was just warning you "
"against.\""
msgstr "\"내가 되지 말라고 경고하는 훌륭한 예가 되어줘서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_13_Pupil3_String
msgctxt "b80c9282-5955-4a13-a1e3-7ba4b6929502"
msgid "\"Hee hee!\""
msgstr "\"히히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_14_Pupil1_String
msgctxt "1155a421-7474-4afa-86df-82690121b64d"
msgid "\"Ha!\""
msgstr "\"하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_15_Pupil4_String
msgctxt "389d1743-94ae-4c27-907e-b9381e560543"
msgid "\"Ah ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"아하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_16_Mage_String
msgctxt "ed18b209-3d34-4fe2-99ef-ba86fd17970e"
msgid ""
"\"So quick to laugh! And yet, one who discovers their impatience early may "
"yet leave it early, then able to search for true harmony within "
"themselves... and perhaps find true enlightenment sooner than their peers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"빨리도 웃는군! 그러나 조급함을 초기에 발견한 사람은 초기에 그것을 남겨두고 자신의 진정한 조화를 찾을 수 있으며 동료들보다 더 빨리 "
"진정한 깨달음을 찾을 수 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/MageLecture_17_Mage_String
msgctxt "8a43ffe7-b4cc-4b28-bd2c-17c378b56fec"
msgid ""
"\"Continue your search for inner balance, and perhaps you shall see that "
"book again sooner than you think.\""
msgstr "\"내면 균형에 대한 탐구를 계속하면 아마도 너는 생각보다 빨리 책을 보게 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_01HalflingWoman_String
msgctxt "1b16dc32-6fc9-4f36-80ae-bcc7911419d0"
msgid "\"Why do we need to have all these weird rules?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리는 이 모든 이상한 규칙들을 지켜야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_02Speaker_String
msgctxt "c1f35092-4b4d-4b96-bb32-7d5bc76851e4"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you can't let just anyone work in the mines — that'd be a recipe for "
"disaster!\""
msgstr "\"아무나 광산에서 일하게 둘 수는 없어. 재앙을 위한 조리법이 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_03Speaker_String
msgctxt "d8faef42-3855-4fcd-bea6-4e10ea22c556"
msgid ""
"\"Dwarves are the best miners, and so most mining crews are made up of "
"dwarves.\""
msgstr "\"드워프는 최고의 광부이기 때문에 대부분의 광부는 드워프들로 구성되어 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_04HalflingWoman_String
msgctxt "a1c10552-8817-4c9a-ae39-f87f27421a39"
msgid ""
"\"It's just not right. What if my son feels drawn to mining? He's a "
"halfling, so he won't be allowed — what do I tell him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 게 아니야. 내 아들이 광산 채굴에 끌려간다고 느끼면 어떨까? 그는 하플링이고 허가 받지 못할 것이다. 내가 그에게 무엇을 "
"말해야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_05Speaker_String
msgctxt "4e4c087b-d783-4353-9537-4e7f54360968"
msgid ""
"\"Well... I mean, what's a halfling going to do underground? You're so... "
"small... And...\""
msgstr "\"음... 내 말은 하플링이 지하에서 할 일은 무엇일까? 너는 너무... 작아... 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_06HalflingWoman_String
msgctxt "26018666-846b-493f-a629-764e68e8b52e"
msgid ""
"\"And what? Why should someone else be deciding what my child can or can't "
"do for a career?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 뭐? 왜 다른 사람이 내 아이의 장래를 결정해야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_07HalflingWoman_String
msgctxt "6ae727d0-3abb-4c54-8848-096c5c1dd39d"
msgid "\"My son's quick, thinks on his feet — and miners make good money!\""
msgstr "\"내 아들은 빠르다. 그 발을 생각해 봐라. 광부들은 돈을 많이 번다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_08Speaker_String
msgctxt "24f9836e-7039-4fbf-8c46-4d3547cbd439"
msgid ""
"\"It sounds like your son's not the one dreaming of working in the mines. "
"You seem to be the one invested in that 'good money,' lady!\""
msgstr "\"너의 아들은 광산에서 일하는 꿈을 꾸지는 않은 것 같다. 그 돈에 투자한 사람은 너 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_09Arbiter_String
msgctxt "a56f238c-113b-4976-a3ac-165c29b1d00e"
msgid ""
"\"All right, cut it out. You should settle down as well, neighbor. Let your "
"son grow up and make his own decisions. Maybe they'll let him work "
"underground after all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 그만해. 너도 정착해야 한다. 너희 아들도 아들을 자라면 자기가 결정을 내리게 하자. 결국 그도 지하에서 일하게 될지도 몰라!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Miners_10Arbiter_String
msgctxt "d25f9da4-f8a8-49aa-b791-4c2f40b13c4b"
msgid ""
"\"The miners know best on matters of who and what's safe in the tunnels — "
"they don't need us harping on them about it.\""
msgstr "\"광부들은 누가 터널에서 누가 그리고 무엇이 안전한지에 대해 잘 알고 있다. 그들은 단번에 알아보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_01_First_String
msgctxt "e46197c6-49e6-494b-915a-afd1e614002c"
msgid ""
"\"And remember the Blacksoul Tomb? That gods-forsaken cave in Varisia?\""
msgstr "\"블랙 소울 무덤을 기억해? 바리시아에 있는 신이 버린 동굴은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_02_Second_String
msgctxt "5cbda0cf-9f6a-446f-9e7f-a11a726404ad"
msgid "\"Of course! I'll remember that place till the day I die!\""
msgstr "\"물론! 내가 죽을 때까지 그 장소를 잊지 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_03_Second_String
msgctxt "0e9b1950-e4fb-4cf1-9290-756e91dde127"
msgid "\"I can still see the face of the guide we hired to take us there!\""
msgstr "\"나는 거기에 가기 위해 우리가 고용한 가이드의 얼굴을 여전히 기억한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_04_First_String
msgctxt "09e7bbce-4ea2-4f7a-ab0c-afb0a96cdd7d"
msgid "\"Oh, right! I can't remember his name...\""
msgstr "\"오. 맞아! 나는 그의 이름을 기억할 수 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_05_Second_String
msgctxt "ac6015d5-70b2-42f2-a8de-4cf5c8240188"
msgid "\"I can't, either...\""
msgstr "\"나도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_06_First_String
msgctxt "d16ab19d-8ed3-4b03-8b5e-f56aa346be69"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, poor guy almost soiled his pants — must've been terrified by his "
"own tall tales!\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 그 불쌍한 사람이 바지에 지릴 뻔했어. 자기 이야기가 무서웠을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_07_Second_String
msgctxt "15a230eb-5567-427a-afee-bd0a1478adb9"
msgid ""
"\"Heh! And that shriek that came out of the cave — remember how he ran when "
"he heard it? He practically vanished!\""
msgstr "\"하! 그리고 비명 소리가 동굴에서 나왔지. 그가 그것을 들었을 때 어떻게 달렸는지 기억해? 그는 완전히 사라졌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_08_Third_String
msgctxt "6489ffa0-61ca-458a-b795-8af5e0ed4c80"
msgid ""
"\"Aw, cut him some slack. Everyone who lived there was scared of that hole.\""
msgstr "\"아. 그를 좀 봐주자. 거기에 사는 사람들은 모두 그 구멍을 두려워했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_09_Fourth_String
msgctxt "901f1ebc-0a02-4dce-bdd3-42d5070c5482"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, that illusionist really knew how to make sure everyone gave his "
"laboratory wide berth!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 그 마법사는 모든 사람들이 그의 실험실에 얼씬도 하지 않게 할 방법을 알고 있었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_10_First_String
msgctxt "9acf6152-6708-4bf3-b9cb-f3a2bf1d8a7d"
msgid ""
"\"And that day, nary a single lich sitting atop piles of treasure was "
"found...\""
msgstr "\"그리고 그날 보물 더미 꼭대기에 외로운 리치가 발견되었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_11_Third_String
msgctxt "4bb67f3d-f138-46d6-9447-6de4905b9219"
msgid ""
"\"Well, at least we got the chance to explore the region. And the locals "
"were happy to learn they didn't have an evil undead neighbor after all.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 우리는 이 지역을 탐험 할 수있는 기회를 얻었다. 주민들은 결국 언데드 이웃이 없다는 것을 알게 되어 기뻐했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_12_Fourth_String
msgctxt "033bc915-a975-4eab-a6c7-be1001419a46"
msgid ""
"\"Praised be Desna, the society doesn't make us write up reports. Would've "
"taken forever to explain why we went out after a lich and came back with a "
"runaway swindler...\""
msgstr ""
"\"데즈나가 우리를 보호했어. 사회는 우리가 보고서를 작성하도록 하지 않았다. 우리가 리치를 찾아 떠나 도망자 사기꾼과 함께 돌아온 "
"이유는 절대 밝혀지지 않을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_13_Third_String
msgctxt "70fdab3c-b2cf-4bd1-bce2-497e388fb30d"
msgid ""
"\"Don't forget the cherry on top: remember the captain's face when we dumped "
"that gnome out of the sack...?\""
msgstr "\"가장 재밌던 이야기를 잊지 마라. 그 노움을 자루에서 버릴 때 선장의 얼굴을 기억하라고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_14_First_String
msgctxt "95621fc4-a925-4ea3-b1b8-d33b2c6c774c"
msgid "\"HA HA HA HA!\""
msgstr "\"하하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_15_Second_String
msgctxt "6524cc12-5625-4680-99be-3b013bad84b3"
msgid "\"AH, HA HA!\""
msgstr "\"아하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks/TN/Pathfinders_16_Fourth_String
msgctxt "6fb54d74-006a-447d-8d03-1dcbdcc23353"
msgid "\"HA HA HA HA HA!\""
msgstr "\"하하하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/citizen_about_goblin1_String
msgctxt "c1d36d5e-acce-4b4c-a389-a147e1da78d4"
msgid ""
"\"One disaster after another, and now goblins are running the streets... "
"It's time to leave this city!\""
msgstr "\"설상 가상이라더니 이제는 고블린들이 거리를 달리고 있다... 이 도시를 떠날 때이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/citizen_about_goblin2_String
msgctxt "8b607aef-84c4-49ab-88fd-68b7ba3823dc"
msgid ""
"\"It might sound surprising, but I like goblins. They're fun to be around.\""
msgstr "\"믿기지 않겠지만 나는 고블린을 좋아한다. 그들 주변에 있는 것은 재미있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/goblin1_String
msgctxt "c29807b6-10bf-4510-bb81-aa4a856aa514"
msgid "\"It clean here, and air fresh. I fix that!\""
msgstr "\"여기는 깨끗하고 공기가 신선해. 내가 그걸 고쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/goblin2_String
msgctxt "9893ad5c-0db5-4c64-965d-77277dd1dea4"
msgid "\"I not steal, I swear!\""
msgstr "\"나는 훔치지 않았다. 맹세한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/goblin3_String
msgctxt "f4ac5aa7-e06f-4b97-9e26-113e6a0ad54e"
msgid ""
"\"You be good {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! Goblins will make great songs "
"about you when you die!\""
msgstr "\"여기 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}에게 환호를 해라! 고블린은 네가 죽을 때 너에 관한 훌륭한 노래를 만들어낼 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/goblin4_String
msgctxt "266afa28-9a20-4758-bd9f-6594f976aed2"
msgid "\"Spare a chicken for poor hungry goblin.\""
msgstr "\"가난하고 배고픈 고블린을 위해 닭고기를 나눠줘라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Goblins/goblin5_String
msgctxt "b957cd30-17e6-4e5d-8d3b-05b732646909"
msgid "*burp*"
msgstr "*꺼억*"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Golems/citizen_about_golem1_String
msgctxt "db83d1cb-23a8-44b0-9866-41f77d9be7ee"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like those golems around here. You never know what it's... well, "
"thinking.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 골렘을 좋아하지 않아. 너는 그게 무엇인지 절대 모른다... 잘 생각해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Golems/citizen_about_golem2_String
msgctxt "4be1e140-9ebe-4675-b5be-5ad7e1440108"
msgid "\"Golems walking the streets! Isn't that fascinating?\""
msgstr "\"골렘들이 길을 걷고 있어! 매력적이지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Golems/golem1_String
msgctxt "dd77e7b2-2643-4dde-b277-206610a4febc"
msgid "\"Commencing command: Protect.\""
msgstr "\"명령 시작: 보호.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Golems/golem2_String
msgctxt "29b96784-0ed9-4f90-b6d6-f6b9d3258887"
msgid "The golem towers above you silently."
msgstr "골렘이 당신 위를 조용히 올라갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Golems/golem3_String
msgctxt "06bb74ab-731e-4620-8089-f844b9bd1a5c"
msgid "\"Commencing command: Greet the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}.\""
msgstr "\"명령 시작: {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}께 인사. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Hellknights/citizen_about_hellknight1_String
msgctxt "f8f63b4c-28a2-437d-8c62-2177bcb4372a"
msgid "\"Hellknights are tough people. But it feels safer with them around.\""
msgstr "\"헬나이츠는 거친 사람들이다. 하지만 그들 주위에 있으면 더 안전해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Hellknights/citizen_about_hellknight2_String
msgctxt "bf7b6276-bb69-41d0-876e-6d5316d1b871"
msgid ""
"\"The Hellknights are scary. What if they found out... Oh, uh, never mind!\""
msgstr "\"헬나이츠는 무서워. 만약 그들이 그걸 찾아낸다면... 오. 신경 쓰지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Hellknights/hellknight1_String
msgctxt "5b84becb-5631-4db2-a243-8e608c776002"
msgid "\"I am the law, the judge, and the executioner.\""
msgstr "\"나는 법이자 재판관이자 사형 집행자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Hellknights/hellknight2_String
msgctxt "e3024faf-4847-4c8b-940d-8881769b8be0"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing to report, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. "
"A pity.\""
msgstr "\"보고 할 것이 없다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 유감이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Hellknights/hellknight3_String
msgctxt "58c53c49-ec01-46db-a307-7200124b87c7"
msgid "\"Justice will prevail.\""
msgstr "\"정의가 승리 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Hellknights/hellknight4_String
msgctxt "6b909347-ad3c-4f2f-a2d4-60a2f27ac257"
msgid ""
"\"Everything is under control, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"모든 것이 통제하에 있다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Kobolds/citizen_about_kobold1_String
msgctxt "c8a01b71-f8df-457d-9a8a-f9e3905e10e1"
msgid "\"Greetingsss! Ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까아! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Kobolds/citizen_about_kobold2_String
msgctxt "d29fa734-70f2-498a-bb56-2807d067c6ee"
msgid ""
"\"They're so weird, those kobolds. I get goosebumps just looking at them.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 너무 이상해. 그 코볼트들 말이다. 그들을 보면 소름이 돋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Kobolds/kobold1_String
msgctxt "dee150f4-117e-4843-ab0d-bcad87f74c71"
msgid "\"Greetingsss.\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Kobolds/kobold2_String
msgctxt "7f1e9612-1a68-4947-888a-ee365601a6b8"
msgid "The kobold looks at you without any interest and turns away."
msgstr "코볼트는 아무런 관심도 없이 당신을 쳐다보고는 등을 돌립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Kobolds/kobold3_String
msgctxt "2f0dc548-03a1-4aff-8a57-8e3b1cb21834"
msgid "\"Tartuk, king, friendsss.\""
msgstr "\"Tartuk. 왕. 친구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Kobolds/kobold4_String
msgctxt "027335bb-75c9-4303-9feb-c955f85c1481"
msgid "The kobold stares in front of him. He doesn't seem to notice you."
msgstr "코볼트는 그 앞에서 쳐다봅니다. 그는 당신을 알아차리지 못하는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Trolls/citizen_about_troll1_String
msgctxt "406f6022-8a23-4d90-afc3-efeac81d58db"
msgid "\"I now know how I'll die. Trolls will eat me.\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 죽을지 알고 있다. 트롤들이 나를 먹을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Trolls/citizen_about_troll2_String
msgctxt "70ef0e2d-7f76-4a13-b158-79cd22dab0a2"
msgid ""
"\"I'll learn the trolls' language, and then I'll befriend one of them!\""
msgstr "\"나는 트롤의 언어를 배울 것이고 나는 한 녀석과 친구가 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Trolls/troll1_String
msgctxt "c0134060-4e70-4bf6-a6ff-5b30f3f58791"
msgid "\"Me eat no borba today!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 나 보바 먹지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Trolls/troll2_String
msgctxt "4ace2e8a-fea2-469e-b878-71b48e0ba8fb"
msgid "\"Me learn cooking at tavern!\""
msgstr "\"나 선술집에서 요리하는 법을 배운다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Trolls/troll3_String
msgctxt "9716bfa4-115b-4595-9b0a-71614a4ec910"
msgid "\"Me hungry...\""
msgstr "\"나 배고프다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Trolls/troll4_String
msgctxt "2636070d-283d-4cd9-9e27-414e42a7d1e1"
msgid "\"City good, but all houses too small.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 도시지만 집들이 너무 작다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Undead/citizen_about_undead1_String
msgctxt "228098ae-cb5c-47dc-8f76-11f6780e4e52"
msgid "\"I don't want to end up one of those undead when I die.\""
msgstr "\"내가 죽을 때 언데드가 되고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Undead/citizen_about_undead2_String
msgctxt "4a43c52a-0abf-4651-9c41-9bf37242dd43"
msgid ""
"\"The undead are loyal, reliable, quiet... Everything one could wish of a "
"servant.\""
msgstr "\"언데드들은 충성스럽고 믿음직스럽고 조용합니다... 하인이 될 수 있는 모든 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Undead/undead1_String
msgctxt "d4b9a6fa-7470-4283-88d4-b6d0da618b67"
msgid "The skeleton looks at you with empty eyes, then snaps."
msgstr "해골이 텅 빈 눈으로 당신을 보고는 손가락을 튕깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Undead/undead2_String
msgctxt "a373608e-c277-450e-81df-1a4d6772650a"
msgid "This skeleton lost half its teeth."
msgstr "이 해골은 이빨의 절반을 잃어버렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquare/Barks_newRaces/Undead/undead3_String
msgctxt "c0319197-2579-495c-8ff7-3123d3781c09"
msgid ""
"The skull of this skeleton holds a wide crack. You are sure you know the "
"cause of death of its original owner."
msgstr "이 해골의 두개골은 넓은 균열을 가지고 있습니다. 원래 소유자의 사망 원인이 짐작됩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder1_String
msgctxt "b9190939-53ba-461e-9bde-0069907774f3"
msgid "\"We'll rebuild everything — even better than before!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 모든 것을 다시 지을 것이다. 이전보다 훨씬 좋을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder2_String
msgctxt "6a8eb44b-9dea-462d-a5e8-8ebb33136c7c"
msgid "\"My legs are killing me... when's supper?\""
msgstr "\"내 다리가 너무 아파... 저녁은 언제지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder3_String
msgctxt "fff9fcda-33de-4562-bef8-71e84c85be17"
msgid "\"Hey, no idling! To work now!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 게으름은 안돼! 지금 당장 일해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder4_String
msgctxt "31c767b5-d90e-4324-bff3-d8b7ccde16d8"
msgid "\"We're still finding bodies in the rubble...\""
msgstr "\"우리는 여전히 잔해에서 시신을 찾고 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder5_String
msgctxt "920b8ce8-f7f8-44d5-be53-de3f5555870d"
msgid "\"We build the place up — then it's time to do it all over again...\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그 장소를 지었다. 하지만 전부 다시 지어야 한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder6_String
msgctxt "fb9e9134-6870-45ed-b0bc-6fb9e162fb95"
msgid "\"There's still so much to do...\""
msgstr "\"할 일이 너무 많아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Builder7_String
msgctxt "75574a32-8de7-459e-a71b-ba42e845cd37"
msgid "\"Where's my trowel? Which one of you took it again?\""
msgstr "\"내 모종삽은 어딨어? 누가 다시 가져간 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard1_String
msgctxt "a1eda9b3-76ac-4830-a6a8-f3dc0a463b8a"
msgid "\"The baron{mf||ess} is here! Hang on! Help is on the way!\""
msgstr "\"남작님께서 도착하셨다! 다들 버텨라! 곧 지원이 갈 것이다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard2_String
msgctxt "17a9d74f-fa0c-48b2-93f6-fba6dd0fe1f8"
msgid "\"Don't give up!\""
msgstr "\"포기하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard3_String
msgctxt "e8773198-a095-4b69-a4fd-bb81806ad448"
msgid "\"Hit 'em hard!\""
msgstr "\"열심히 쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard4_String
msgctxt "ae56cdb1-032c-4798-adec-3932c052af7e"
msgid "\"Smash those critters!\""
msgstr "\"그것들을 부숴라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard5_String
msgctxt "86553087-28a6-41f3-8eb2-d9b7bd5f510b"
msgid "\"Erastil help us...\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이 우리를 도우길...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard6_String
msgctxt "c210f067-75a7-4947-bb71-06d80e6eb110"
msgid "\"By Abadar, hold fast!\""
msgstr "\"아바다르께 맹세코, 현 위치를 고수하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FightingGuard7_String
msgctxt "f3019ccc-ab0a-4b86-b3c5-7aed5d155785"
msgid "\"If we make it today, first round's on me!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 우리가 승리한다면, 1차는 내가 쏘겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen1_String
msgctxt "1b58a316-4c94-430c-8006-2fb219667f99"
msgid "\"Leg it!\""
msgstr "\"달려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen2_String
msgctxt "57064027-465d-450e-9188-d96e1fb2af8a"
msgid "\"Don't leave me!\""
msgstr "\"저를 두고 떠나지마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen3_String
msgctxt "054e3c11-dae6-4523-bc21-f6dfc3d8ec4b"
msgid "\"The beasts are everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"짐승들이 도처에 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen4_String
msgctxt "465ba010-c70e-4c6a-bf12-25ae289b5949"
msgid "\"Guards! Anyone! Help!\""
msgstr "\"경비원! 누구 없어! 도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen5_String
msgctxt "65e9c717-8321-4b06-8836-7959c078cf71"
msgid "\"Run for your lives!\""
msgstr "\"살고 싶으면 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen6_String
msgctxt "1b33bd07-eff5-4bfa-9346-dd72a1a0d8f1"
msgid "\"Where are they coming from?\""
msgstr "\"도대체 어디서들 나타난거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_FleeingCitizen7_String
msgctxt "7cda98aa-adc1-44aa-be8a-baff3fb542d7"
msgid "\"Your Grace, save us!\""
msgstr "\"영주님! 저희를 구해주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulCaptain1_String
msgctxt "ec993a26-3cb2-44d5-b978-b6c9afe58f1a"
msgid "\"Peace and order in the capital!\""
msgstr "\"수도의 평화와 질서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulCaptain2_String
msgctxt "16a95a61-b572-49b4-900f-4d4966c864d1"
msgid "\"Maintain order! Watch for looters!\""
msgstr "\"명령을 이행해라! 약탈자를 감시해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulCaptain3_String
msgctxt "0fecfa4c-d54a-48e6-adb0-7950f1f6654d"
msgid "\"Soon, there won't be any trace of the devastation!\""
msgstr "\"곧 황폐의 흔적은 없어질 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard1_String
msgctxt "0a1f2381-1d11-4ae8-b0cb-11d5145fe3f9"
msgid "\"The captain has ordered to guard tripled... what use is it now?\""
msgstr "\"대장이 병력을 3배로 늘리라고 명령했다. 그게 다 무슨 소용이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard2_String
msgctxt "281a0601-bceb-44a5-9aa1-3c76365123a9"
msgid ""
"\"All day on the watch... could really go for a pint right about now...\""
msgstr "\"하루 종일 보초를 섰어... 지금은 정말로 맥주 한잔 하고 싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard3_String
msgctxt "973dcb13-3131-44d7-b28a-9239042b1744"
msgid "\"That one, with the mop of red hair, see? He takin' others' tools!\""
msgstr "\"빨간 고수 머리 말인가? 그는 다른 사람들의 도구를 훔쳐갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard4_String
msgctxt "225a4551-2efc-4366-af97-79fa3e3747ba"
msgid "\"All day in the sun... when's the next shift already?\""
msgstr "\"하루 종일 태양 아래 서있었어... 다음 보초는 언제 오는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard5_String
msgctxt "bf6735e4-d38a-496d-81b1-cb6a5239c57d"
msgid "\"Wish the tavern was rebuilt already.\""
msgstr "\"선술집 재건축이 벌써 완료되었으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard6_String
msgctxt "069ae3a8-c89b-4590-9f1d-c3e6e5b42680"
msgid "\"Those beasts hit us bad!\""
msgstr "\"그 짐승들이 우리를 때렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_PeacefulGuard7_String
msgctxt "5ce6b7d9-4db9-4b11-a28c-48b0840b97d3"
msgid "\"Caught another looter. Haven't they learned their lesson yet…?\""
msgstr "\"다른 약탈자를 잡았어. 그들이 아직 느낀 게 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Sick1_String
msgctxt "9ace2ad1-cd1d-49b5-abd1-1d5c80bbbbf3"
msgid "\"I don't feel well... No, please... Don't...\""
msgstr "\"몸이 좋지 않아... 아니. 제발... 안돼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Sick2_String
msgctxt "5d086478-b410-4a96-abc6-debd9bc16db7"
msgid "\"Get away! Everyone, run! Now!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐! 모두들 달려! 지금 당장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Sick3_String
msgctxt "73da58d9-17fb-4371-90da-035f9ae21900"
msgid "\"Khh, khh... Something's... wrong with me... Feels like...\""
msgstr "\"큭... 무엇인가... 잘못됐어... 느낌이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone10_String
msgctxt "92aa45d1-532c-42a5-b028-8cb758cac5ce"
msgid "A body torn apart by huge teeth."
msgstr "거대한 이빨에 찢어진 시체입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone1_String
msgctxt "bd4e0451-85ec-41d6-9faa-f9a7d9cb4a3c"
msgid "The beasts have crushed everything in their path."
msgstr "짐승들은 그 길에서 모든 것을 뭉개 버렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone2_String
msgctxt "9cdc97e9-9dd0-4d99-888a-5d560f83872c"
msgid "Hard work will be needed to rebuild all of this."
msgstr "이 모든 것을 재생하기 위해서는 열심히 노력해야 할 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone3_String
msgctxt "69aa9d5b-08b9-4af6-aeb8-5a2eb28be9ca"
msgid "The town has turned into a battlefield."
msgstr "마을은 전쟁터로 변했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone4_String
msgctxt "ab6cb280-1658-4eba-83a7-291dc5fd1b64"
msgid "Hastily-barricaded streets blunted the beasts' attack."
msgstr "급히 세운 바리케이드 거리가 짐승의 공격을 약화시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone5_String
msgctxt "8bfa180a-b851-4fe5-937c-f64b7365316f"
msgid "This creature will never hurt anyone again."
msgstr "이 생물은 누구에게도 다시는 상처를 주지 않을 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone6_String
msgctxt "61b1c103-7a78-4fd6-8c88-707600d81d5a"
msgid "The beast's fangs and claws are stained red with blood."
msgstr "짐승의 송곳니와 발톱은 피로 빨갛게 얼룩져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone7_String
msgctxt "bbcc69c4-bbca-45a9-b884-5d761fffc0b1"
msgid "One of the town's defenders, died carrying out their duty."
msgstr "마을의 경비 중 한 명은 자신의 의무를 다하고 사망했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone8_String
msgctxt "90a8d2ac-1118-4ebd-a188-d4bccaa7f885"
msgid "She gave her life to shield the people."
msgstr "그녀는 사람들을 보호하기 위해 목숨을 바쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Barks/Bark_Zone9_String
msgctxt "a477c7c5-8ff8-46b3-b374-6c684cd8a0f0"
msgid "This peasant's body is mutilated beyond recognition."
msgstr "이 농민의 시체는 알아볼 수 없게 절단되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "aa29ee85-92d6-4a89-bf54-31428ab0d175"
msgid "Helped the blacksmith save the wounded guard."
msgstr "대장장이가 부상당한 경비를 구할 수 있도록 도와주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3035d0da-c59d-4aae-bd13-b4246e2e43f0"
msgid "[Help the blacksmith] \"All right, on three. One, two...\""
msgstr "[대장장이를 도웁니다] \"좋아. 하나에 들어. 셋, 둘, 하나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6c7e9af0-e604-4e80-a792-e5dfd3518c23"
msgid "Refused to help the blacksmith save the wounded guard."
msgstr "대장장이가 부상당한 병사를 구하는 것을 거절했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0005_Text_String
msgctxt "cdd08f0f-e02a-43a4-bceb-4b89734b2501"
msgid "[Leave] \"I don't have time for this!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 이럴 시간이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7bf80055-f4d0-4716-8829-0ee3f832981b"
msgid "Healed the wounded guard."
msgstr "부상당한 병사를 고쳐주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a72c506c-c49c-4129-952e-f3868e2c975d"
msgid "[Heal the guard] \"I'll tend his wounds.\""
msgstr "[경비를 치료합니다] \"내가 상처를 치유하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ae8fd45b-b214-473e-ae94-e262b5a6bf47"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 된 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "30856e77-56d0-472f-bfc8-84e48cdbb41c"
msgid "\"You killed this beast on your own? I'm impressed.\""
msgstr "\"이 짐승을 자네 혼자 죽였다는건가? 대단한걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "251e0bcb-67f8-4141-bcb5-a715a57a9e91"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "c2b9696e-7658-4c66-9835-8de2ad3e8d88"
msgid ""
"\"It's fortunate we're by your smithy. I have an urgent purchase to make.\""
msgstr "\"마침 너의 대장간에 들리게되어 다행이군. 급히 사야할 것들이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "944b05a0-145c-42ec-9e97-89d22d71b618"
msgid ""
"{n}Beneath the crushing weight of a monster carcass lies a guard — "
"unconscious and bleeding, but still alive.{/n} \"Your Grace! He's wounded. "
"Help me get him out before he loses too much blood!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}집채만한 괴물의 시체에 깔려있는 경비원은 출혈과 함께 의식이 없었지만, 여전히 살아있습니다.{/n} \"영주님! 이자는 "
"부상당했습니다. 피를 너무 많이 흘리기 전에 그를 꺼내도록 도와주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "191b0123-c1c1-42bb-a943-76f945dff706"
msgid ""
"{n}Gathering all your strength, you and the blacksmith manage to lift the "
"monster's bulk off the ground and drag the guard out from beneath it.{/n} "
"\"Phew... Lad's been within a hair's breadth of dyin'. He makes it to end of "
"the battle, he should call this his second birthday!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}모든 힘을 모아서 당신과 대장장이는 괴물의 몸을 땅바닥에서 들어 올리고 경비원을 그 아래에서 끌어냅니다.{/n} \"휴... 이 "
"자는 거의 죽을 뻔 했습니다. 전투가 끝나고 살아남았으니 오늘은 그의 두 번째 생일이라고 불러야겠군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "7a08166c-61c0-4203-8daf-a9d28a71ba4a"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't you hear? The man's wounded! You got a stone where your heart "
"should be?\""
msgstr "\"못 들었어? 부상을 당했다잖아! 이런 인정머리 없는 자식을 보았나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ad073934-1fb5-4054-a8ca-5ac185444f09"
msgid ""
"{n}The guard's wounds rapidly close. The blacksmith nods in gratitude.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}경비원의 상처가 빠르게 아뭅니다. 대장장이는 감사를 표합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "762b498c-772f-4687-8073-15f55d670a61"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I was sittin' in my smithy. I heard some shoutin' in the street, so "
"I grabbed my maul and headed out. Saw THIS ugly mug throw that poor guard to "
"the ground and get a huge bite in, so I gave it a good whack to the head. "
"Then another, and another, and so on until it stopped movin'. Wasn't strong "
"enough to pull the lad free from under its fat belly, though — good thing "
"you showed up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 대장간에 앉아 있었습니다. 거리에서 비명 소리가 들려서, 내 망치를 움켜쥐고 밖으로 향했죠. 이 못생긴 녀석이 그 불쌍한 "
"경비원을 땅에 던져서 크게 한입 베어무는 모습을 보고는, 저는 그 녀석의 머리통을 후려쳤죠. 그리고 한방 더, 한방 더, 움직이지 않을 "
"때까지 휘둘렀습니다. 저 뚱뚱한 아랫배에서 경비를 자유롭게 끌어낼 정도로 제가 강하지는 않았습니다. 마침 영주님께서 오셔서 천만다행입니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b19c5468-a522-4bb7-a36b-72b3d52f7429"
msgid ""
"{n}The blacksmith's face twists in distaste.{/n} \"Aye, I can fight all "
"right. Just don't like to.\""
msgstr "{n}대장장이의 얼굴이 일그러집니다.{/n} \"맞습니다. 저는 그럭저럭 싸울 수 있습니다. 그냥 싸움을 싫어할 뿐이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "79a41303-e6f3-4713-ac21-c74bf05fec0b"
msgid "\"Thanks for the help! I'll get him somewhere safe.\""
msgstr "\"도와줘서 고맙습니다! 그를 안전한 곳으로 옮기겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Blacksmith/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6eb14812-4a5d-4d36-93ab-e2f374ddcf20"
msgid "\"So you decided to help me after all?\""
msgstr "\"예, 영주님?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83893_Text
msgctxt "a35f0a7e-0482-407d-a882-13faaa948901"
msgid "\"Who's attacking us?\""
msgstr "\"누가 우리를 공격하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83894_Text
msgctxt "19820540-cc7d-4202-8742-e3577538a892"
msgid "\"Report.\""
msgstr "\"상황 보고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83895_Text
msgctxt "27dd3c3f-a10a-418e-b7e0-ed95bf7a5366"
msgid "[Leave] \"I don't have time to waste.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"서둘러야 할것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83900_Text
msgctxt "444decbb-e7d2-471f-96ac-68bc1346f406"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있던 중이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83902_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d7608faf-a3d2-4098-bf1f-7bd2cf72733e"
msgid "Healed the wounded guard."
msgstr "부상당한 병사를 고쳐주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83902_Text
msgctxt "68b05008-916b-40be-a6f9-4529e721ca6e"
msgid "[Heal the guard] \"Let me help you.\""
msgstr "[경비를 치료합니다]\"내가 치료해 줄께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Answer_83905_Text
msgctxt "9d9bc8f2-14a1-47cc-b67c-1d4e52fbcf19"
msgid "\"Is Kesten here?\""
msgstr "\"케스턴은 여기 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83889_Text
msgctxt "b4e0194e-d055-45d9-afca-54dfd657a418"
msgid ""
"{n}The young guard is holding her weapon with limp hands as blood streams "
"down her bent and broken armor.{/n} \"Your Grace, at last! I'm not sure how "
"much longer we'd have made it without you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이 젊은 경비대원은 구부러지고 부서진 갑옷 아래로 피가 흘러내리고, 절뚝거리는 손으로 그녀의 무기를 움켜쥐고 있습니다.{/n} "
"\"드디어 오셨군요! 영주님 없이 더이상 버티기 어려운 상황이었습니다 !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83896_Text
msgctxt "d8bbd832-8d4e-42b3-9327-bdf41c09fe73"
msgid ""
"\"Despite the dire situation, we're holding on. There have been casualties, "
"but we're evacuating as many civilians as we can to safe locations... You "
"made it just in time, Your Grace. You can still save your people and your "
"capital!\""
msgstr ""
"\"참담한 상황에도 불구하고 우리는 계속 버티고 있는 중입니다. 사상자가 발생했지만 최대한 많은 민간인을 안전한 위치에 대피시키고 "
"있습니다... 제시간에 와주셨습니다, 영주님. 아직 백성들과 수도를 구할 수 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83897_Text
msgctxt "f4b9277f-37ce-40f7-b951-0842705bfa4b"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters, Your Grace! Hydras, manticores, some sort of creatures like "
"bears but with bird heads... At first we thought it was an enemy army, but "
"there are no humans among them! They don't seem to be led by anyone! They "
"just keep coming and coming and coming... like an avalanche!\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴물들입니다, 영주님! 히드라, 만티코어, 새의 머리를 하고 있는 곰 비슷한 짐승도 있습니다.. 처음에 우리는 그것들이 적 부대라고 "
"생각했지만 그들 중에 인간은 없었습니다! 그들은 누군가의 명령을 받는것 같지 않았습니다. 그들은 계속 끊임없이 쏟아져 오고있습니다. 마치 "
"눈사태처럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83899_Text
msgctxt "6526c6c3-63b4-4612-ad26-cb19e93b2e4e"
msgid ""
"\"It's a disaster. Most of the guards have fallen. There are heavy — "
"enormous — casualties among the civilians... I don't even know what kind of "
"miracle we'd need to turn the course of this battle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"재앙이다. 경비원 대부분이 쓰러졌다. 민간인들 사이에 중상자가 상당수 있다... 이 전투의 양상을 바꾸기 위해 기적이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83901_Text
msgctxt "8d55b14f-1d9a-410b-8c22-b9bf47fffede"
msgid ""
"\"I'm wounded. The captain ordered me to stand guard here to help civilians "
"flee and await your arrival. By {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}, I'm so glad you "
"finally made it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 부상을 입었습니다. 대장은 저에게 이곳을 지키며 민간인이 피신하도록 돕고 영주님의 도착을 기다리라고 명령했습니다. "
"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}가 도우셔서 마침내 영주님 일행이 도착하시니 매우 기쁩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83903_Text
msgctxt "b08650d8-4d17-44bf-ac4b-f582a0ae4110"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your Grace! {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} willing, we'll show these "
"beasts what we're made of!\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다, 영주님! {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}의 의지로 이 짐승들에게 본때를 보여줄 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83904_Text
msgctxt "91de0a39-d7fd-4d6d-a061-7a0fa05925ef"
msgid "\"Yes, Your Grace?\""
msgstr "\"네, 영주님?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptain1/Cue_83906_Text
msgctxt "b8d82161-bd33-4fd1-9386-a1d3c96ea32e"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I just saw him! He ran past with a group of reinforcements, cursing "
"up hill and down dale. I'm not sure where he was headed, though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"예, 방금 전에 봤습니다! 지원군을 이끌고 도처에 욕을 헤대며 달려갔습니다. 하지만 어디로 향했는지는 확실하지는 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptainFinal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "35594c57-cc92-4143-b498-ec359514f93b"
msgid ""
"\"Phew, looks like we've got a breather. If you don't mind me saying, you're "
"an exceptional warrior, Your Grace! I'm not sure you even need the city "
"guard.\" {n}Hyland tries to smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"휴. 숨을 돌릴 여유가 생긴 것 같군요. 솔직히 말하자면 영주님은 뛰어난 전사이십니다. 도시 경비대가 과연 필요한지 의문이 들 "
"정도군요.\" {n}하이랜드는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptainFinal/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "72a77803-72ca-4c02-9c80-7f4e6b8ee558"
msgid ""
"\"We'll hold the city. You can trust in us. Focus on finding the heart of "
"this disease — you're our best hope.\""
msgstr "\"저희는 도시를 지킬 것입니다. 저희를 믿으십시오. 이 질병의 핵심을 찾는 데 집중해십시오. 영주님은 우리의 희망입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/GuardCaptainFinal/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "14de810b-719e-49a1-ac11-77873e69624d"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it's all finally over! Please, proceed to the throne room, "
"Your Grace. We'll start cleaning up this mess and restoring order to the "
"streets.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마침내 끝났다는 게 믿기지 않습니다! 알현실로 가십시오. 우리는 이 난장판을 치우고 거리의 질서를 복구하기 시작할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a129bde3-e8ba-4e0f-ab2f-2415fa1cdb5a"
msgid "\"What are you doing there?\""
msgstr "\"너희 거기서 뭐하는 중이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6a9c4b65-ba58-4a3f-bb5a-00c6850b43e8"
msgid "Executed the pillagers."
msgstr "약탈자를 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8d5e89fa-7a5d-484f-987f-3d361472c206"
msgid "[Attack] \"The penalty for looting is death.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"약탈에 대한 처벌은 죽음이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a29774d6-9dc3-49e5-9826-dfbba09b6c99"
msgid "Exiled the pillagers."
msgstr "약탈자를 추방했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3af6b82a-a97b-4ff6-87b9-29745524f13a"
msgid ""
"\"Drop everything you've looted and get out of my city. If I see you again, "
"I'll execute you myself.\""
msgstr "\"네가 약탈 한 모든 것을 버리고 내 도시에서 떠나라. 너를 다시 보게 되면 그땐 내가 직접 너를 처형하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c934e470-7562-4c02-a4d8-6963f423232d"
msgid "Gave the pillagers a chance to redeem themselves."
msgstr "약탈자에게 죄를 만회할 기회를 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f402f8a4-e357-43f9-b80e-e2e885880d3b"
msgid ""
"\"You have a choice: either I execute you here and now, or you voluntarily "
"submit yourselves to the captain of the guard and follow his every command.\""
msgstr "\"선택해라. 내가 너를 지금 처형하거나 아니면 자진해서 경비 대장에게 복종하고 그의 모든 명령을 따라 움직이던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8f6ad38e-d6cf-49d4-9f28-cd5cd9870518"
msgid "Let the pillagers go with their loot."
msgstr "약탈자가 노획물을 가져가도록 눈감아줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1aca1e5c-16b5-422c-96b6-1d1831079568"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, I've never seen such clumsy thieves! Look, I'll cut you some "
"slack — I'm going to close my eyes and count to three, and when I open them, "
"you'll be long gone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하! 이런 서투른 도둑들은 본 적이 없어! 너를 풀어 주겠다. 나는 눈을 감고 셋을 셀 거야. 내가 눈을 뜰땐, 너는 이미 멀리 "
"사라져 있어야 할꺼야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2b8ac0d6-0afd-4e1b-8c4f-4783a0c04449"
msgid "Took a share of the pillagers' loot."
msgstr "약탈자의 노획물을 공유합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d3b6dcb7-032d-4418-b312-6e7ea2f5a9a8"
msgid ""
"\"Give me all the gold you've gathered and I'll pretend I never saw you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 모은 금을 다 내 놓는다면, 너를 못본 척 해 주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "87f2543d-2044-4a33-81d1-08dd557297c9"
msgid "Brutally executed the pillagers."
msgstr "잔인하게 약탈자들을 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "4999a59e-e275-43d0-b957-48ed60cc67ab"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I'll post your heads above the city gates as a lesson to everyone "
"else.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 다른 사람들에게 교훈으로 네 머리를 도시 문 위에 걸어둘 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "91a6c5d6-dc32-4d4c-98fe-da94bef0bb5d"
msgid "Approved of the pillagers' actions."
msgstr "약탈자의 행동을 허락합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "3773ec82-2b8e-4a48-8ebd-90f65942c346"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"If the owners really valued their possessions, they'd have "
"protected them better. I have more important matters to attend to.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"소유자가 정말로 자신의 소유물을 소중히 여긴다면 알아서 보호했겠지. 나는 더 중요한 일이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9ce06890-7b14-4e39-aeff-f703d2058e34"
msgid "Ignored the pillagers."
msgstr "약탈자를 무시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "4009d817-e7f6-413f-b2d7-361295a323fd"
msgid "[Leave] \"This is none of my concern.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"내 알 바가 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e8e8d28b-c692-456b-92c1-40be22fd302d"
msgid ""
"{n}While the fierce battle rages, these people aren't fighting or fleeing. "
"Rather, they've entered one of the ruined buildings and seem to be filling "
"their sacks with whatever goods have been left behind. Noticing you, one of "
"the marauders turns pale and drops his bag.{/n} \"Gah! Damn...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}치열한 전투가 벌어지는 동안 이 사람들은 싸우거나 도망가지 않습니다. 오히려 그들은 파괴된 건물 중 하나에 들어가 어떤 물건이 남아 "
"있든지 간에 자루를 채우고 있는 것처럼 보입니다. 당신을 알아차리자 약탈자 중의 한명은 창백해지고 그의 자루를 떨어뜨립니다.{/n} \"앗"
"! 젠장...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "af3b624c-6926-41ef-a1ce-3174801cd926"
msgid ""
"\"We're, uhhh... Well... Don't s'pose you'd believe we're pickin' up lost "
"goods to return to their owners, would you?\""
msgstr "\"우린... 음... 그게.. 주인에게 잃어버린 물건을 돌려주려는 거라고 말한다면 믿지 않겠죠. 그렇죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "15469203-e3cf-4c0c-b056-68e82a1adbf4"
msgid ""
"{n}Looking back and forth between themselves, the pale-faced marauders "
"eventually nod, drop their bags, and make their way to the captain of the "
"guard under your watchful eye.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}서로를 보며 두리번거리고 창백한 얼굴을 한 약탈자는 마침내 고개를 끄덕이고 자루를 버리고는 조심스럽게 경비 대장에게 향합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "673fccee-8323-494c-9b1b-c9661476e82d"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace... Thank you for your mercy. You'll never hear from us "
"again, I swear it!\""
msgstr "\"그래... 자비를 베풀어 고맙다. 안좋은 소식을 다시는 듣지 않을 것이다. 맹세코!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "17c11948-caf6-4373-8efd-4603d23a7997"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your Grace! Your land, your right... and here's your share!\" "
"{n}The marauders hand over a pouch of gold before picking up their bags and "
"hastily leaving.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고맙다! 너의 땅, 권리... 그리고 여기 너의 몫이 있다!\" {n}약탈자는 골드 한 덩어리를 주고는 자루를 집어들고 서둘러 "
"떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "f0f5883e-d99e-4196-8bde-6294c7c6bbc3"
msgid "{n}The marauders quickly pick up their bags and disappear.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}약탈자는 빨리 그들의 자루를 집어들고 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/Marauders/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "865c30dd-6454-45e2-b7ff-14c40fcf1837"
msgid ""
"\"Such filth!\"{n} – Kanerah almost sings the words.{/n} \"After our "
"victory, they should be publicly executed in the main square. But since "
"we're a little busy to deal with criminals, I suggest we just kill them "
"right here. We must get rid of these parasites!\""
msgstr ""
"\"더러운 자식!\"{n} 카네라는 마치 노래를 부르는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"우리가 승리한 후 그들은 광장에서 처형당해야 해. 하지만 "
"범죄자를 손보기에 바쁘기에 바로 여기서 처형하는 것을 권할게. 우리는 이 기생충들을 반드시 제거해야 되!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37504_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "84aa305f-aba0-4798-b687-87fda592e731"
msgid "Comforted the dying Jhod Kavken."
msgstr "죽어가는 조드 카브켄을 편안하게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37504_Text
msgctxt "5381c2ed-91b5-4148-9706-b84db4e5e445"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Jhod. We found the source of the infection and destroyed it once and "
"for all. They won't be back.\""
msgstr "\"그래. Jhod. 우리는 감염의 근원을 발견하고 그것을 단번에 파괴했다. 그들은 되돌아오지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37506_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fb09abbc-fb94-4f8e-b6ac-b65b830de83d"
msgid "Humiliated the dying Jhod Kavken."
msgstr "죽어가는 조드 카브켄을 수치스럽게 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37506_Text
msgctxt "9bb70535-fb5c-4b04-9806-9eb602d02143"
msgid ""
"\"What difference does that make, you weakling? You're just going to die on "
"me now? You're such a letdown, to me and the entire town!\""
msgstr "\"그게 무슨 차이가 있나. 이 나약한 자여? 지금 내 품에서 죽을 거야? 너는 나랑 마을 전체에 실망을 안겨주었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37507_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0636cfc5-dcd4-42df-8650-7e38d557a57b"
msgid "Made the dying Jhod Kavken laugh."
msgstr "죽어가는 Jhod Kavken 웃음거리로 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37507_Text
msgctxt "b4225656-2201-4013-95ff-78a1b3051174"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Jhod, what do you think you're doing? If you're thinking of hopping "
"the twig, you'd best think again, old man! I need someone around who can "
"cure the immense hangover I'll have after tomorrow's feast, you know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"조드. 뭐하고 있는거야? 도망갈 생각이라면 다시 생각해 보는게 좋을 거야. 노인네! 나는 내일 후에 있을 숙취를 치료할 수 있는 "
"사람이 필요해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37514_Text
msgctxt "4dd51e52-0905-40f4-963b-91094885e10f"
msgid "\"Are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37515_Text
msgctxt "1a29f676-7c97-4e83-89de-133675cf75f0"
msgid "\"How bad is the wound?\""
msgstr "\"상처가 얼마나 안좋은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37516_Text
msgctxt "bc72cb04-bab9-4eef-9642-2cc5cb1dd4c3"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37521_Text
msgctxt "0b2cab25-be83-4c82-bfef-7e4bc3736965"
msgid "\"What will you do next?\""
msgstr "\"다음으로 너는 무엇을 할 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37522_Text
msgctxt "c81f2c03-cf80-4df4-b3bb-b798cfa91bbb"
msgid "[Leave] \"I need to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37527_Text
msgctxt "2c1775ba-04ac-4285-b752-bf85ada3845e"
msgid "\"I'm in need of healing.\""
msgstr "\"나는 치유가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37530_Text
msgctxt "f74dee81-713c-4c03-ada0-46b66b98ac14"
msgid ""
"\"We found where the fiends are coming from. Now we just need to pay them a "
"visit and dispose of this threat.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 악마가 어디에서 왔는지를 발견했다. 이제 우리는 그들을 찾아 위협을 처리할 필요가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Answer_37531_Text
msgctxt "41405c31-b1f2-4f50-a1b0-c17c3d15e2cc"
msgid ""
"\"We found and destroyed the source of the infection. There won't be anymore "
"seeds.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 감염원을 찾아 내고 파괴했다. 이제 씨앗은 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37500_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "668a2e3f-7666-49ee-a576-27417c8c01c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod Kavken lies on the ground, broken and bloody. When he sees you, he "
"groans quietly. You can tell there's no saving the old priest.{/n} \"The "
"city...\" {n}he whispers.{/n} \"Is the city... safe?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드 카브켄은 상처를 입고 피투성이가 되어 누워 있습니다. 그가 당신을 보았을 때 그는 조용히 탄식합니다. 늙은 성직자를 구해줄 "
"무엇도 없음을 당신은 알 수 있습니다.{/n} \"도시...\" {n}그는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"도시가... 안전한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37501_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "c76408d9-a4b4-4b88-9c1d-97a614050695"
msgid ""
"{n}The old priest winces. He's holding his side, and while bloodstains are "
"slowly spreading on his clothes, it's clear that his life isn't in "
"danger.{/n} \"You came! I prayed to {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} that you would "
"make it in time!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 사제가 찡그립니다. 그는 옆구리를 움켜쥐고 있지만, 목숨이 위중한 상태는 아닌 듯 옷에 번진 핏자국이 그리 크지 "
"않습니다.{/n} \"돌아오셨군요! 때맞춰 와 주시길 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g} 님께 기도한 보람이 있었네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37502_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "dff2862e-55f0-4b79-afa0-3980b0116ac1"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest whispers a prayer and touches the wound on the warrior's hip, "
"then the wound immediately begins to close. Jhod lifts his eyes and notices "
"you.{/n} \"Praised be {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, you made it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사제는 기도를 속삭이고 전사의 엉덩이에 난 상처를 만지고 난 후 상처가 즉시 닫히기 시작합니다. 조드는 눈을 들어 당신을 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여. 감사합니다! 네가 해냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37505_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "fa7dd524-5046-4b93-acb6-c849e8be3cdd"
msgid ""
"\"You're the best thing... these lands have seen... in centuries... Take "
"care of yourself... And take care of them...\""
msgstr "\"수세기에 걸쳐... 이 땅에 온 영웅 중... 너는 최고야. 너 자신을 돌봐. 그리고 그들을 돌봐줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37508_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "d2f06e11-12e7-4cc2-9937-fc20ee623068"
msgid ""
"\"You're... an evil {mf|man|woman}...\" {n}Jhod coughs wetly, and blood runs "
"down his chin.{/n} \"But these lands... have no other protector... It falls "
"to you... There is... no one else...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는... 나쁜 사람이야...\" {n}조드는 젖은 기침을 하고 피가 그의 턱 아래로 흐릅니다.{/n} \"하지만 이 땅에는... "
"다른 보호자가 없어... 너 뿐이야... 아무도 없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37509_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "643b2de7-bb43-481b-9f01-e80ffaf1d9e0"
msgid "{n}The priest's eyes roll back. He dies with a grimace on his face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사제의 눈은 돌아갑니다. 그는 고통에 찬 얼굴로 죽습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37510_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "27c29ec8-65f6-486c-a2ea-27dabe8aec14"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod laughs sharply, but it immediately becomes a wet cough, and blood "
"runs down his chin.{/n} \"Yes... you are mad after all... But I wouldn't "
"want... anyone else... protecting these lands... Take care of them...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 크게 웃습니다. 그러나 곧바로 젖은 기침을 하고 피가 그의 턱 아래로 흐릅니다.{/n} \"그렇다... 결국 화를 "
"내는군...하지만 나는... 다른 누구도 원치 않아...이 땅을 보호하는 건... 너야... 그들을 돌봐줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37511_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "b9799a4b-70f6-4dd7-9b4f-9fe3e5c34202"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest's eyes roll back. He dies with a smile on his broken lips.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사제의 눈은 돌아갑니다. 그의 상처입은 입술은 웃음을 머금었고 그는 죽었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37512_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodDying
msgctxt "89db562a-b126-412f-b6e1-4f3bb8480106"
msgid "{n}Jhod's eyes roll back. His bloodied face looks almost serene.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사제의 눈은 돌아갑니다. 피로 덮인 그의 얼굴은 평온해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37517_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "28a034ca-3cb9-4ca1-a6ec-fa00b5b0ba7c"
msgid ""
"A trifle... Nothing a prayer to {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} couldn't cure. But my "
"wound can wait — the townsfolk are in greater need of divine aid than I am.\""
msgstr ""
"긁힌 상처입니다... {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 치료할 수 없는 것은 없습니다. 제 상처는 나중에 고쳐도 됩니다. 저보다는 "
"도시 사람들에게 기적의 힘이 필요합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37520_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "ee587ff7-03d4-4d74-b923-1c3969123bc3"
msgid ""
"\"I had just finished an operation and was preparing for the next one when "
"all the remaining patients... bloomed. There were no survivors. I managed to "
"fight my way to the street — and landed straight in this monster's claws! I "
"was running out of spells and stamina... If it weren't for you, I'd have met "
"my end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수술을 막 끝내고 다음 환자를 기다릴 때 갑자기 다른 사람들이... 개화되었습니다. 생존자는 없었고. 저는 싸우러 거리로 나섰습니다. "
"그리고는 이 괴물의 발톱에 당해버렸지요! 마법과 체력이 바닥 났던 상황이었습니다. 영주님이 아니었다면 제 인생은 끝장났을 것입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37523_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "25e123d3-41b8-4283-a392-56883b027a01"
msgid ""
"\"There are still many wounded in the city streets. I aim to help everyone I "
"can.\""
msgstr "\"도시에는 여전히 많은 부상자가 있습니다. 저는 되도록 많은 사람들을 돕겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37524_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "4e41abd8-bb87-430a-a67a-017ff02ab6c5"
msgid ""
"\"Go, Your Grace. I must leave as well — the battle isn't over yet. "
"Horrendous creatures prowl the streets, and there are wounded in need of "
"aid. {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} save us all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어서 가십시오. 전투는 아직 끝나지 않았습니다. 끔찍한 생물들이 거리를 헤매고 도움이 필요한 부상자가 있습니다. "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여. 우리 모두를 구해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37526_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "57c490ce-67c5-4491-8eb8-11b0913bca95"
msgid ""
"\"Hardly a scratch, Your Grace. I'm afraid the same can't be said of many of "
"the townsfolk...\""
msgstr "\"거의 상처를 입지 않았습니다. 도시의 많은 사람들은 그렇지 않을 것입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37528_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "84d5e6bd-add8-4665-a032-8ae17ef5f7c6"
msgid "{n}The priest clutches his holy symbol and whispers a prayer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사제는 그의 거룩한 상징을 움켜잡고 기도를 속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37529_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_KestenGaress
msgctxt "1fb44cf8-bd8a-46e3-8b38-0580f3f9db8f"
msgid ""
"\"Right, all hail me... Thanks for knocking some sense back into me. Not "
"sure I could live with myself if Jhod had been gobbled up while I was "
"playing hero out there.\""
msgstr "\"맞습니다. 일깨워주셔서 감사합니다.. 내가 영웅이 되고 있는 동안 조드가 잡아먹혔다면 저는 견디지 못했을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37532_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "84e2db66-be0e-42bd-a6ab-dedeb2554c55"
msgid ""
"\"Praise to {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, shield of these lands! Once the battle "
"is over, you must make your way there and destroy the source of this plague! "
"Burn everything in your sight, if need be!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여! 이 땅을 지켜주소서! 전투가 끝나면 가서 전염병의 근원을 파괴해야 합니다! 필요한 경우 "
"눈에 보이는 모든 것을 구워버리십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37533_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_JhodAlive
msgctxt "69ab35d5-0afc-4d4c-b568-3b08b4245003"
msgid ""
"\"This is joyous news... or would be, in most any other situation... Still, "
"praised be your name, our deliverer. You've saved your realm and rescued the "
"people!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 기쁜 소식이다... 다른 어떤 상황에서도... 그래도 여전히 너는 우리의 구원자가 되었다. 너는 영토를 구하고 사람들을 "
"구해줬다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/OwlbearAttack_Jhod/Cue_37534_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_KestenGaress
msgctxt "2ef703d0-0a4e-453f-acb3-7e2c2cc8f87e"
msgid "{n}Kesten gives a short bow and follows Jhod out.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 짧은 인사를 하고 조드를 따라갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0002_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "aa714623-1ebb-4dbf-a3f1-ae3c90a78ee4"
msgid "Comforted the scared innkeeper."
msgstr "겁내는 주인을 위로했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "11c3124d-3417-465d-92a2-c3f25ffb40d9"
msgid ""
"\"Calm down — everything's under control. Just follow those guards there, "
"and they'll take you to safety.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 모든 것이 통제되고 있다. 이 경비대원들을 따라가면 너를 안전한 곳에 데려갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "216497b1-2e47-4aa7-90b3-f729db28135b"
msgid "Ignored the scared innkeeper."
msgstr "겁내는 주인을 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c7cc056e-6040-4678-b6c7-afe54c95cfe8"
msgid "\"Can't you see I'm busy here?! Stay out of the way!\""
msgstr "\"바쁜 것 안보여? 길을 막지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e199b81f-ed24-4d4f-a914-181238ef4cc3"
msgid "Demanded money from the scared innkeeper."
msgstr "겁내는 주인에게서 돈을 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0e12fba1-d5aa-4bc7-8062-fa203f743634"
msgid ""
"\"Have you heard about the new levy to boost our town's defenses? I do hope "
"you've already chipped in.\""
msgstr "\"우리 마을의 방위력을 높이기 위한 새로운 징수에 대해 들어보았나? 너는 이미 돈을 냈기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2edb58c7-4bd3-4b24-a580-1ad8382de1f9"
msgid "Laughed at the scared innkeeper."
msgstr "무서워하는 주인을 비웃습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a08d66dd-dd76-4f6d-a2b9-f89783b810bc"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! A great day, isn't it? We're having a ball!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 좋은 하루야. 그렇지? 재밌게 놀라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "694c4c7c-1e7a-4dfd-bd3a-ccaad256ecc3"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina, the local tavern keeper, runs up to you. Her face is pale, and "
"she's shaking with fear.{/n} \"Your Grace, wh-wh-what's happening? There are "
"monsters... {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, save our souls... Is this the end? Is "
"the town lost?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}선술집 주인 엘리나가 당신에게 달려옵니다. 그녀의 얼굴은 창백하고 두려움에 떨고 있습니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 도, 도대체 무슨 일이죠? 괴물들이에요.. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여. 우리 영혼을 "
"구해주세요.. 이제 끝인가요? 마을을 잃는 건가요? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "d0856cef-95c1-4623-8829-fc4d70351985"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina takes a deep breath and exhales loudly a few times before looking "
"back to you, devotion in her eyes.{/n} \"Thank you, my baron{mf||ess}! I "
"know you'll protect us!\" {n}She gives you a quick bow before hastily "
"walking toward the guards.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나는 심호흡을 몇번 크게하고는 헌신이 가득한 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다 .{/n} \"고맙습니다. 영주님. 전 영주님께서 저희를 "
"지켜줄 거란걸 알아요!\" {n}그녀는 빠르게 인사하고는 경비대를 향해 황급히 걸어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "e7c8b1ce-6cc5-4f64-9be0-864646f0eb5f"
msgid ""
"\"Y-yes, of c-course, Your Grace! Forgive me...\" {n}Continuing to mutter "
"apologies, Elina runs away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네. 무..물론이죠. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 용서해 주세요..\" {n}계속 사과를 중얼거리며 엘리나는 도망칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "97d7b7bf-f714-42d9-8070-7421a967815e"
msgid ""
"\"N-no, Your Grace... Here, please... Just protect us, I beg you!\" {n}Elina "
"hands you her money pouch and runs away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아, 아니. 여기. 제발... 우리를 지켜줘. 간청할게!\" {n}엘리나가 돈 주머니를 건내주고는 도망갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ScaredCitizen/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "836fc288-f315-4a9e-8d3b-b2b96d10527c"
msgid ""
"\"A... a b-ball? Ha... Ha ha. Oh... Ha ha ha!\" {n}Alternating delirious "
"laughter with wails of terror, Elina runs away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"... 재, 재미라고? 하... 하하. 오... 하하하!\" {n}공포의 울부짖음과 불쾌한 웃음을 번갈아가며 엘리나는 "
"도망갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95256_Text
msgctxt "9ba41496-fdde-48b7-9d83-a632b8916216"
msgid "\"What have we learned of our attackers?\""
msgstr "\"공격자들에 대해 뭔가 알아낸것이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95257_Text
msgctxt "59acf0b4-3785-4eb6-934a-7a55cf4993f4"
msgid "\"How bad are casualties among the guards and the civilians?\""
msgstr "\"경비대과 민간인들 사이에 사상자가 얼마나 심한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95258_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4b236e5c-6b75-40f0-89b5-b67ff4db50ff"
msgid "Praised the guard captain for excellent service."
msgstr "훌륭하게 임무를 수행한 경비 대장을 칭찬합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95258_Text
msgctxt "acf54cf3-92b6-4aee-a5d9-fcd8a7cfd1dc"
msgid "\"Fine work. You are fighting heroically.\""
msgstr "\"잘 했어. 너는 영웅적으로 싸우고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95263_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b5f48928-94bf-489b-8686-a83105e083e9"
msgid "Made the guard captain laugh with a dark joke."
msgstr "어두운 농담으로 경비 대장을 웃게 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95263_Text
msgctxt "8adb1daa-83c9-41d3-8086-eafdb5469e4c"
msgid ""
"\"A fine day today, isn't it? Last time we had a party like this was our "
"fight with the Stag Lord!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 였지. 그렇지 않나? 지난번에 이런 파티를 열었을때는 수사슴 군주와의 전투때였지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95264_Text
msgctxt "a32f40e4-a7e7-4cb8-b141-d49829aa8e82"
msgid "[Leave] \"Stay vigilant — the fight is far from over.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"다들 경계하도록. 싸움이 끝나려면 멀었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Answer_95266_Text
msgctxt "27812cd7-edc6-49c6-8580-30918335a39e"
msgid "\"Have you seen Kesten?\""
msgstr "\"케스턴을 보았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_86577_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_CapitalGuardCaptain
msgctxt "f24b5754-dc28-48e0-b8a6-21af9779f6cc"
msgid ""
"{n}The captain removes his helmet and wipes the sweat from his brow.{/n} "
"\"Praise all the good gods. I'm not sure we could have held out much longer "
"without you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}대장은 헬멧을 벗고 그의 이마에서 땀을 닦습니다.{/n} \"선한 모든 신들께 찬양하라. 우리가 영주님 없이 더 오래 끌 수 있을지 "
"모르는 상황이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_95252_Text
#. Speaker : OwlbearAttack_CapitalGuardCaptain
msgctxt "06f593c9-d375-4702-a125-d6bacfb6c81f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Gra-\" {n}A thunderous rumble sounds from not far off. Something "
"humongous is approaching, crushing buildings along its path.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"알겠습니다, 영...\" {n}치명적인 우르르 소리가 멀지 않은 곳에서 들립니다. 거대한 무언가가 다가오고 있으며 건물은 길을 따라 "
"부서져 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_95259_Text
msgctxt "11ad93fe-4bcf-46af-ab3e-e30335d47592"
msgid ""
"\"Substantial, Your Grace. If you'd arrived much later, I've no doubt the "
"capital would have been lost.\""
msgstr "\"상당히 피해가 큽니다. 영주님께서 늦게 도착하셨다면 수도는 사라졌음이 틀림 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_95261_Text
msgctxt "268326ab-7935-439b-aa77-a844b3ade5e6"
msgid ""
"\"Very little. Some of the monsters erupted from the patients in Kavken's "
"hospital, while others seem to have come straight out of the woods. There "
"are no people among them, and they don't seem to have a commander. They "
"fight more like raging beasts than an army. That's all we know right now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거의 없습니다. 카브켄의 병원에 있던 환자가 일부 괴물로 변했고, 다른 괴물은 숲에서 공격해왔습니다. 괴물 사이에 사람이 섞여 "
"있다거나 하지는 않았습니다. 괴물 무리를 지휘하는 이는 없었으니까요. 확실히 군대라기보단 짐승이 날뛰는 모양새였지요. 지금 저희가 아는 "
"건 이것뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_95262_Text
msgctxt "4d7dabeb-c688-4d70-9270-8c0f4766d343"
msgid "{n}The captain salutes you.{/n} \"Thank you, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "{n}대장이 당신에게 경의를 표합니다.{/n} \"감사드립니다, 영주님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_95265_Text
msgctxt "3cf0e25b-85fc-48a9-b747-e5493fedd37c"
msgid ""
"{n}A grin crosses the fighter's solemn face.{/n} \"Quite the party indeed. A "
"shame there's no music.\""
msgstr "{n}미소가 전사의 엄숙한 얼굴에 교차합니다.{/n} \"꽤 거창한 파티입니다. 바드의 연주가 없는 게 아쉽군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareOwlbearAttack/ViewpointPlatformFinal/Cue_95267_Text
msgctxt "0a34d32a-e1b8-418d-8e34-1417afe46c46"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I saw him fighting his way toward the town center not long ago.\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다. 저는 얼마 전에 그가 시내 중심가로 가는 것을 보았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion10_String
msgctxt "9466aa4e-b819-4b2a-ace5-edd466cf59c1"
msgid ""
"\"We had to start all over... but you know, without bandits shaking you down "
"every week, things go a hundred times faster. I even travel to the capital "
"to trade now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 처음부터 다시 시작해야했지만... 매주 괴롭히는 도둑이 없으니 일이 수 백배는 빨라. 심지어 나는 지금 수도로 여행도 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion11_String
msgctxt "3ddf53c0-2c87-4ef8-8ab3-4d0b8a935fb2"
msgid "\"Yes! All our lives have changed under the baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 우리의 삶은 모두 남작 덕분에 바뀌었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion1_String
msgctxt "45f36093-f94d-4feb-9d04-c7e8a52c56f0"
msgid ""
"\"I'd never heard about {mf|him|her} before! Just appeared out of nowhere!\""
msgstr "\"나는 결코 {mf|그|그녀}에 대해 들어본 적이 없다! 그런데 혜성처럼 나타났다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion2_String
msgctxt "e1cf953c-7bde-49bb-b366-3b37ac490cea"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, out of nowhere? It was out of Brevoy! The Swordlords "
"themselves sent {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"혜성처럼이라니? 그는 브레보이에서 왔어! 소드로드가 그를 보낸 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion3_String
msgctxt "9b96d985-8b2b-4083-b623-35c66d4fc5e9"
msgid ""
"\"And thanks to whoever did — before {mf|him|her}, no one could even hope to "
"fight the Stag Lord's power!\""
msgstr "\"그를 보낸 사람이 정말 고맙다. 이전에는 아무도 수사슴의 권력에 맞서지 못했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion4_String
msgctxt "bfc5315f-ecef-4404-a71c-97ba857bca76"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, too bad I wasn't there. The Stag Lord's gang's been thrashing me — "
"used to take my last coin, the villains!\""
msgstr "\"내가 거기에 없어서 아쉽다. Stag Lord의 갱단이 나를 괴롭혔다. 동전 한닢까지 털어갔지. 악당들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion5_String
msgctxt "e2e72d13-de3b-48c8-a3b2-a32c31ed3850"
msgid ""
"\"My farm's far from here, and they got their greedy paws on it... Had to "
"escape at night so they wouldn't notice. Left everything, hoping they "
"wouldn't come looking for us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 농장은 여기에서 먼 길이고 그들은 여전히 우리를 수탈했다... 밤에 도망쳐야 그들이 알아볼 수 없었을 것이다. 우리를 찾아 오지 "
"않기를 바라면서 우리는 모든 것을 버렸다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion6_String
msgctxt "940286e0-5883-4da1-aa1e-25ffe51993a3"
msgid ""
"\"We had to knock about, of course. Had some bad times — then suddenly, we "
"heard at the market that they Stag Lord was overthrown, and now there's a "
"real baron{mf||ess} instead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 물론 두려워했다. 나쁜시기를 맞았었다. 그런데 갑자기 우리는 시장에서 수사슴 군주가 타도되었다고 들었고 지금은 진짜 남작이 "
"있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion7_String
msgctxt "aaaa3c02-3841-4145-afb8-909ff52d488a"
msgid ""
"\"So my wife and I decided — what the hell, what if it really had gotten "
"better? So we came back...\""
msgstr "\"그래서 내 아내와 나는 결정했다. 도대체 어떻게 되었을까? 정말로 좋아졌다면... 그래서 우리는 돌아왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion8_String
msgctxt "f72840b5-a25e-472d-b61d-ee3d6cdefc1b"
msgid "\"Oh, come on! What happened next?\""
msgstr "\"말해줘! 다음에 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BaronDiscussion9_String
msgctxt "b3a7b0fd-6923-4ae2-941d-a19eae29cee1"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, they took our cattle, but the house still stood! I guess they "
"gave up on it — too far from the Stag Lord's fort!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 가축이 없어졌는데 예상은 했었지만 집은 변함이 없었다! 수사슴 군주의 요새에서 너무 멀리 떨어져 있어서 그런 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics1_String
msgctxt "e5ff48f4-ae03-4157-b8be-27597a4ad4bb"
msgid "\"You hear about what the Surtovans did at the border?\""
msgstr "\"서토바 가문이 국경에서 한 일에 대해 들었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics2_String
msgctxt "b1536a78-f3d9-4e5b-9610-c6a9d8040486"
msgid ""
"\"Another brawl with the Swordlords? When are they going to give it up?\""
msgstr "\"소드로드와의 또 다른 싸움인가? 그들은 언제 포기할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics3_String
msgctxt "3f5087e5-4143-4b8b-8fcc-61680e21b422"
msgid ""
"\"It's a shame — all these years, and they still can't come to terms. "
"They're in the same country! What if they get attacked?\""
msgstr "\"유감스럽게도 그들은 수년 동안 그들은 타협하지 못했다. 그들은 같은 국가에 있다! 그들이 공격을 받으면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics4_String
msgctxt "4736473d-bd1c-40dc-a0d4-4865bc33a4a9"
msgid ""
"\"Well, the Surtovans I can understand — they're the lawful heirs to the "
"lands, not those sword-swinging upstarts. When the Rogarvians...\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄 내가 아는 서토바 가문은 검을 휘두르는 신흥 귀족이 아니라 이 땅의 합법적인 상속인이다. 로가비아 가문이 한 때...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics5_String
msgctxt "65c094c8-74b0-40c5-9981-28821475ba43"
msgid ""
"\"When the Rogarvians appeared, the Surtovans dropped on their backs and "
"exposed their throats! They're pathetic cowards. At least the Aldori tried "
"to fight back!\""
msgstr ""
"\"로가비아 가문이 한 때 등장했고 서토바 가문은 자리를 내어주고 무기를 내렸다! 그들은 냉담한 겁쟁이이다. 적어도 알도리는 "
"반격하려고 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics6_String
msgctxt "36697c13-7c7d-41b1-bcb2-698d74097a0b"
msgid ""
"\"And what'd that get them, huh? Hundreds of deaths, maybe more! No, no "
"one's right in this feud, no matter what you say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 그들이 무엇을 얻었지? 수백명의 사망자가... 어쩌면 더 많았을 거다! 네가 말하는 것에 상관없이 이 불화에서 맞는 것은 "
"아무것도 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_BrevoyPolitics7_String
msgctxt "c6a4be37-2ec2-4f36-ba37-45e3587064a1"
msgid ""
"\"They both think only of themselves — not a thought for those who toil "
"under them!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 둘 다 자기 자신만 생각한다. 자기 밑에서 수고를 하는 사람들을 위한다면 그런 생각을 할 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan10_String
msgctxt "8028c8a9-836e-4e70-a44a-4535566c290e"
msgid ""
"\"We... we haven't lived like a husband and wife for a long time. The love "
"that once bound us has cooled.\""
msgstr "\"우리는... 오랫동안 남편과 아내처럼 살지 않았다. 우리의 사랑은 곧 식었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan11_String
msgctxt "86a288ad-9e1a-4410-ad83-b220e224a15c"
msgid ""
"\"Then let her go. Stop clinging to something that doesn't exist anymore — "
"you only hurt everyone involved. Free the one suffering from your "
"indifference, and care for your child and its mother.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니 그녀를 놓아줘. 더 이상 존재하지 않는 것에 집착하지 마라. 관련된 모든 사람들에게 상처를 줄 뿐이다. 무관심으로부터 사람을 "
"해방시키고 아이와 그 어머니를 돌봐야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan12_String
msgctxt "1c68ffd6-4bd4-48a1-b89e-79d455126f3a"
msgid "\"You're... probably right. But it's so hard to take that plunge!\""
msgstr "\"네 말이... 맞아. 하지만 그렇게 하기에는 너무 어렵다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan13_String
msgctxt "d9490a26-c57c-432e-a341-541b4e6fa5db"
msgid ""
"\"I understand. We're all weak. But it's never too late to do the right "
"thing.\""
msgstr "\"이해한다. 우리는 모두 약하다. 하지만 옳은 일을 하기에 늦은 때는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan1_String
msgctxt "a7ae07e7-076e-42a9-a276-21f47cdad03f"
msgid "\"Listen to me! It's wrong to cling to your dishonorable behavior!\""
msgstr "\"내 말을 들어! 너의 불명예스러운 행동에 집착하는 것은 잘못된 일이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan2_String
msgctxt "1f0ef984-4dac-44fd-be88-f501a71fe133"
msgid "\"Leave me alone! I'll deal with my problems myself!\""
msgstr "\"나를 내버려둬! 내가 직접 문제를 다룰 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan3_String
msgctxt "bc19294b-2aac-475d-9c99-53abd3af7e26"
msgid ""
"\"Problems? You're going to be a father! How can you just wave off a gift "
"like that?\""
msgstr "\"문제가 있나요? 너는 아버지가 될거야! 어떻게 그런 선물을 거절할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan4_String
msgctxt "27625165-7009-4efe-b790-f976eea8bb0d"
msgid "\"You know only too well where... where this 'gift' came from!\""
msgstr "\"이 '선물'이... 어디에서 왔는지 잘 알 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan5_String
msgctxt "a619312d-5fb2-4a72-ba9b-3c106e6ac138"
msgid ""
"\"Infidelity is the parents' sin, not the child's! Consider how kind the "
"gods are to you — even in your dishonor, you're granted a gift of joy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불신앙은 자녀의 것이 아니라 부모의 죄이다! 신이 네게 얼마나 친절한지 생각해 봐라. 네가 믿지 않아도 너는 기쁨의 선물을 받는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan6_String
msgctxt "df6a472a-1765-4f1a-8fb1-01182fd9b31f"
msgid ""
"\"And what'll I do with it?! My wife'll kill me if she finds out I knocked "
"up a maid!\""
msgstr "\"내가 그걸로 무엇을 하지? 하녀가 내 아이를 가진 사실을 안다면 내 아내가 날 죽일 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan7_String
msgctxt "cd7950c6-0234-48c1-8075-f0c4b351ed48"
msgid "\"Why do you so fear the truth? Will this lie bring you deliverance?\""
msgstr "\"왜 진실을 두려워하지? 거짓말이 너에게 구원을 가져다줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan8_String
msgctxt "4ca58cef-c3cd-48f2-9101-f556ae46c457"
msgid "\"At least I'll still be alive.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 나는 살아있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_PriestessAndMistakenMan9_String
msgctxt "cae202bd-3612-4df4-8cfe-2f4059ca14c3"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, why didn't the gods gift you and your wife with a child? After "
"all the years you've been together?\""
msgstr "\"말해 봐. 왜 신이 너와 너의 아내에게 아이를 주지 않았을까? 몇년을 함께 살았는데도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls10_String
msgctxt "bf26613c-3fd2-4a75-bfed-1dcae3ebbfde"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, thank you my lady! Thank you so much! Is there anything I can do for "
"you? Please, I want to thank your family, any way I can!\""
msgstr "\"오. 고마워! 내가 할 수 있는 일이 있을까? 감사의 표시를 어떻게든 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls11_String
msgctxt "62479d40-fb94-4872-8430-150451077106"
msgid "\"Actually... there is something...\""
msgstr "\"사실... 부탁이 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls12_String
msgctxt "53c7184a-4a4a-4f20-ba3b-f0cbf8b289b5"
msgid "\"Have you ever considered your son's future, Gina?\""
msgstr "\"아들의 미래를 생각해 본 적이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls13_String
msgctxt "60434e5f-b289-4395-aeff-4c7060fdc47b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh... Well, I thought he might follow in his father's footsteps. Or maybe "
"become a plowman — my father-in-law has a small plot of land...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오... 글쎄. 나는 그가 아버지의 발자취를 따라갈 수도 있다고 생각했어. 어쩌면 농부가 될 수도 나의 시아버지에게는 작은 땅이 "
"있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls14_String
msgctxt "933dadaf-bedf-4a58-95a2-ba6a3ebdd9c6"
msgid ""
"\"Gina, next year, we're going to be sending Ronald to Absalom to study, and "
"I'm afraid my son will be lonely, especially at first.\""
msgstr "\"Gina. 내년에는 로널드를 압살롬으로 유학을 보내는데 초반에 아들이 외로워질까 두려워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls15_String
msgctxt "58f07362-b552-4184-a76a-769a4ba8ba03"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I saw how wonderfully he plays with Kyt, and I thought... Maybe your "
"son would be amenable to accompanying Ronald on his journey?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그가 카이트와 함께 잘 노는 것을 보았고 내 생각에 아마 네 아들이 로널드를 여정 동안 동행할 수 있을 것 같은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls16_String
msgctxt "bc5da24b-6126-4576-96cf-d7db1afae854"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, I'm ready and willing to cover all the expenses for Kyt's "
"education — in return for ensuring that Ronald will be under the watchful "
"eye of an older peer.\""
msgstr "\"물론 나는 카이트의 교육 비용을 모두 충당할 준비가 되어있다. 로널드가 선배들의 감시를 받는 보답으로 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls17_String
msgctxt "e15269fc-c998-4f7d-ad81-b2b0be288639"
msgid ""
"\"I... I don't know what to say! I'm sure he'll agree! I'll ask him today!\""
msgstr "\"나는... 무슨 말을해야 할지 모르겠다! 나는 그가 동의 할 것이라고 확신한다. 나는 오늘 그에게 물을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls18_String
msgctxt "a5b1be08-10ca-490c-88e0-cf2f108fb8c7"
msgid "\"There is no limit to your kindness, my lady!\""
msgstr "\"너의 친절함에는 한계가 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls1_String
msgctxt "356e3cb3-8569-4f70-90c4-36fc67cbb138"
msgid "\"Melisandra? You are Melisandra Daveon, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"멜리산드라? 너 Melisandra Daveon지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls2_String
msgctxt "81f55167-870e-4cf8-8c1d-b0eb8bf9608b"
msgid "\"Yes. And you are...?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 너는...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls3_String
msgctxt "9056e006-ad15-4b01-96b6-6a3e4960949b"
msgid ""
"\"My lady, I'm the wife of Gurt, who serves as groom for your beloved "
"husband!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 남편의 마부로 봉사하는 Gurt의 아내야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls4_String
msgctxt "95859493-6a24-4a2b-8434-0392a7570ae2"
msgid "\"Oh! Of course, I...\""
msgstr "\"오! 맞아. 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls5_String
msgctxt "f8f546f4-68a8-4846-900f-b8353c2dff10"
msgid ""
"\"My lady, you saved us! Your dear husband forgave my husband's debt over "
"the ruined harness gear. And it was expensive — had brasses and everything!\""
msgstr "\"네가 우리를 구했다! 너의 남편이 망가진 마구로 빚진 내 남편을 용서했다. 마구는 비쌌다. 놋쇠로 만들어진 고급품이었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls6_String
msgctxt "8d8a9453-c7b5-4ff0-b67a-000d940f1fc8"
msgid "\"Listen, good lady... Forgive me, what is your name?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... 용서해. 네 이름이 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls7_String
msgctxt "b93b1dab-1e26-4c18-a6ee-500ca17d5a56"
msgid "\"Gina, my lady.\""
msgstr "\"지나야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls8_String
msgctxt "18f05f79-19a1-4a39-bcf1-657ce8f8a75a"
msgid ""
"\"Gina, please stop bowing and scraping to me. It was my husband's actions, "
"not mine. And besides, who would have done otherwise?\""
msgstr "\"지나. 제발 그만 절하고 수다는 그만 떨어라. 그건 내 남편의 행동이지. 내 것이 아니다. 누구라도 그렇게 했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_RichAndPoorGirls9_String
msgctxt "787fe697-44bb-42a3-99b2-1db547173082"
msgid ""
"\"I know what you and your family have gone through, and no one wanted to "
"make things worse over some stupid harness!\""
msgstr "\"너와 네 가족이 무엇을 겪었는지 알고 있고, 누구도 바보같은 마구 때문에 상황을 악화시키고 싶지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess10_String
msgctxt "4be58ab1-e697-446d-b31f-906cc9c779f3"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, those who've left for Pharasma's chambers are eternally separated "
"from the living. But there is still one more soul that cries out for "
"salvation — the wounded soul of the murderer who committed such a dark act.\""
msgstr ""
"\"파라즈마의 방으로 떠난 사람들은 영원히 살아있는 사람들을 떠나게 되어있다. 하지만 구원을 부르짖는 또 다른 영혼이 있다. 어두운 "
"행동을 저지른 살인자의 상처받은 영혼이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess11_String
msgctxt "544a720c-f5ba-4cf3-bf58-2e9af33dffca"
msgid ""
"\"Is there not virtue in lending a merciful hand to someone who's been "
"damned by all? Just as I now lend mercy to you, who lost yourself to anger?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 이에게 손가락질 당한 자에게 자비의 손길을 건내는 것은 미덕이 아닐까? 분노로 자신을 잃은 너에게 자비를 베푸는 것처럼 말이다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess12_String
msgctxt "44e9d651-7b65-44bc-a04c-442dc1c68efd"
msgid ""
"\"What? But, I... I... I don't need your damn mercy! Stay away from me!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 하지만 나.. 나... 나는 너의 빌어먹을 동정은 필요 없어! 나에게서 떨어져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess13_String
msgctxt "31f6882f-3477-4d40-a184-dccba4958018"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish. But know this: no matter what shadow darkens your soul, there "
"are those unafraid to enter it and reach toward the kindness you hide in "
"your wounded heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 원하는대로. 그러나 이것을 알아둬라. 그림자가 너의 영혼을 어둡게 만든다 할지라도 너의 상처 입은 마음에 숨어있는 친절함에 "
"도달하여 들어가는 용기의 길이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess14_String
msgctxt "efb8cc44-9f30-4aab-bf5d-16f3237ca497"
msgid "\"I... Hmm.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 흠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess15_String
msgctxt "3e223d55-c670-47cc-9847-fe4bf0663a44"
msgid "\"I'll... think on your words.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 너의 말을 생각해 볼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess1_String
msgctxt "43cbca78-ae85-4f08-afe7-3939d5ae627d"
msgid ""
"\"The divine fire accepts any sin — and burns it away! There is hope for "
"everyone!\""
msgstr "\"신성한 불은 모든 죄를 받아들이고 그것을 태워 버린다! 모두에게 희망이 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess2_String
msgctxt "3baff151-beae-4ff4-8fe5-fbeee1e5ecb5"
msgid ""
"\"What are you talking about, you fool? How can you forgive an evil deed?\""
msgstr "\"너 무슨 소리하는 거야? 어떻게 그런 사악한 짓을 용서할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess3_String
msgctxt "246a15a8-7951-4681-b3e6-66a98889ae0e"
msgid ""
"\"It is all in the radiant Sarenrae's power! She teaches us to show mercy to "
"all — even the most terrible of criminals.\""
msgstr "\"모두 빛나는 서렌레이의 힘이다! 그녀는 우리에게 자비를 보여줄 것을 가르친다. 심지어 가장 무서운 범죄자조차도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess4_String
msgctxt "570c2631-0c23-4639-a068-bdd4ff728713"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever you've done in life, you can always have hope — hope in "
"repentance and the return to virtue!\""
msgstr "\"네가 인생에서 한 일이 무엇이든 너는 언제나 희망을 가질 수있다. 회개와 덕으로 돌아가는 희망을 가질 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess5_String
msgctxt "0dd8be5f-0e01-4a14-a0d4-f4dcb2a1f2b6"
msgid ""
"\"I've never even heard of Sarenrae... Tell me about her. What's she like?\""
msgstr "\"나는 서렌레이에 대해 들어 보지 못했다... 그녀에 대해 말해 봐라. 그녀는 무슨 신이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess6_String
msgctxt "f16aedc6-1df4-4380-8b17-92ff9d0a1667"
msgid "\"Sarenrae is a divine flame, cleansing all vice.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 모든 악을 정결케하는 신성한 불꽃이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess7_String
msgctxt "2635632b-23e2-4697-814d-5abf5035f270"
msgid ""
"\"Her name is the Healing Light, for my goddess brings relief from suffering "
"and wounds.\""
msgstr "\"고통과 상처로부터 구제를 가져와 그녀의 이름의 의미는 '치유의 빛'이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess8_String
msgctxt "8e6998de-3da3-4197-9bd6-e58eba1ea2ef"
msgid ""
"\"Her name is the Dawnflower, for her boundless patience is like the warm "
"light of the sun.\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 끝없는 인내는 태양의 따뜻한 빛과 같아 그녀의 이름은 새벽의 꽃이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CapitalSquareVillage/Barks/Bark_NG_SarenraePriestess9_String
msgctxt "f1521086-b0fb-4618-8e14-136ee4fb53d5"
msgid ""
"\"Lies, all of it! Some sins can't be forgiven. What's the point if a "
"murderer repents? It won't bring back the dead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두 거짓말이다! 어떤 죄는 용서받을 수 없다. 살인자가 회개하면 무슨 소용이 있느냐? 죽은 사람은 돌아오지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "16cd397c-4cd2-4ad0-afdb-64bdea4f9b1d"
msgid "\"Linzi said it was you who discovered that the throne was missing.\""
msgstr "\"왕좌가 실종됐다는 것을 발견한 사람은 너라고 린지가 말했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0a40ebd7-ed9c-4680-b6b9-f1ca59a18fae"
msgid ""
"\"I don't remember hiring a guard captain... or any guards, for that matter."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 경비 대장이나 경비대를 고용한 기억이 없는걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d2b2ed83-80dd-4b35-80f9-b98bc6ef2fe3"
msgid "\"I like to learn something about those who serve me.\""
msgstr "\"나를 섬긴다면 나도 너희들에 대해 알아갔으면 좋겠군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1463ee2c-8c04-4353-b4d4-a2078588ba4a"
msgid "\"Hyland, do the guards have everything they need?\""
msgstr "\"하이랜드. 경비대가 필요한 건 다 갖추고 있나\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "90f4112a-a83c-4e5f-9e03-1a4871dda403"
msgid "\"I have to go. Have a quiet shift!\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어. 교대들 잘하게\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "254e0462-a9ae-42a6-bc42-f3414702c3a4"
msgid "\"How did your folks feel about the Irovetti story?\""
msgstr "\"너희 사람들은 이베로티의 이야기에 대해 어떻게 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Barks/GuardGirl1_String
msgctxt "e46fbf91-152b-49fc-94b2-b5edfe01f765"
msgid "\"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"네 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Barks/GuardGirl2_String
msgctxt "b2a9c679-5140-4cd0-90d6-6dc915a147b1"
msgid "\"To guard the peace and protect our citizens is an honor for me!\""
msgstr "\"평화를 지키고 시민들을 보호하는 것은 나의 영광이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Barks/GuardGirl3_String
msgctxt "338c4e9e-b4af-4971-8fe9-1d8317854aa2"
msgid "The young guard smiles faintly, busily examining her armor."
msgstr "젊은 여자 경비원은 희미하게 웃으며 바쁘게 그녀의 갑옷을 검사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b0778a7d-310a-43a1-b9eb-c0a2d75256e9"
msgid ""
"{n}The captain of the guard nods to you.{/n} \"Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "{n}경비 대장이 당신에게 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"네 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "b5178659-f1da-40f6-b59f-be2389284596"
msgid ""
"{n}The captain grows gloomy.{/n} \"Yes, Your Highness.\" {n}He keeps silence "
"for a moment, and continues, obviously embarrassed.{/n} \"Actually, Your "
"Highness... Please don't think me a fool or a drunkard...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}경비 대장은 우울한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"네 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}그는 잠시 침묵하더니 계속 "
"침묵하기에는 당혹스러운 듯한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"사실, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 드릴 말씀이 있습니다. 술 취한 "
"사람으로 생각 말아 주십시오\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "4858e7f0-7927-452c-9cf9-44490b0c9f63"
msgid ""
"\"As I walked to the throne room... at first I thought it was a vision, and "
"didn't think much of it. Well, I thought I saw your throne in the corridor. "
"And it was... running away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 알현실로 걸어갔을 때... 처음엔 그것이 환영을 본 줄 알고 신경을 쓰지 않았습니다. 제가 당신의 왕좌를 복도에서 보았다고 "
"생각한거죠. 그런데 그게... 뛰쳐나갔습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "48decaed-013e-4656-a3da-18fac027215e"
msgid ""
"\"Not by itself, of course! I just couldn't see who was carrying it. Perhaps "
"someone really tiny had got underneath it. And my — how they and ran! It "
"seemed the throne turned the corner by itself. But the sight was strange "
"beyond belief, so I thought I was simply too tired and had started seeing "
"things. A moment later, when I discovered it was really missing, I rushed "
"after it — but it had vanished into thin air. Maybe it was... you know... "
"magic?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 스스로는 아니겠죠! 저는 누가 그것을 운반하고 있는지를 볼 수 없었을 뿐입니다. 아마도 아주 작은 누군가가 짊어지고 있었겠죠. "
"그리고 — 젠장, 놈들이 무슨 짓을 한건지! 왕좌가 스스로 모퉁이를 도는 것처럼 보였습니다. 하지만 그 광경을 보고도 믿기지 않았고, "
"저는 너무 피곤해서 환각을 보기 시작한거라 생각했죠. 잠시 후, 정말로 왕좌가 실종되었다는 것을 알았을 때 저는 왕좌를 찾으러 "
"뛰어갔습니다... 만, 그게 허공에서 사라지더군요. 아마도 그건... 마법 같았습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "683234e5-0aaf-4a21-954f-62c3dd2be5d9"
msgid ""
"\"I came here from {g|Restov}Restov{/g} with a dozen of my best guards, by "
"order of Lady Jamandi Aldori, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}. I hired the rest from among the locals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 자만디 알도리의 명령에 따라 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 최고의 경호대 십여명과 함께 이곳으로 왔습니다. "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 나머지는 현지인 중에서 고용했습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "d1378e47-650e-4b16-a34c-6f7646c38cf9"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. I have "
"been a guard all my life — I started a snot-nosed runt in the night watch. "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} is famous for its fencing schools. Young people from "
"all the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} come to study there. It seems "
"every other person has a sword... and every third thinks they know how to "
"use it better than all the rest! A misspoken word or drunken fight can "
"quickly lead to a stabbing rampage. That's why there are so many guards in "
"the city — and they don't accept just anyone. Lady Jamandi took note of my "
"achievements and marked me for advancement. That's why I'm here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 코흘리개 시절, 야간 경비대부터 시작하여 지금까지 평생 경비대로 살아왔습니다. "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}는 펜싱 학교로 유명해서 모든 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 젊은이들이 검술을 "
"익히기 위해 그곳으로 몰려듭니다. 다들 칼 하나씩은 지니고 있고 그 중 3분의 1은 꽤나 잘 사용하는편입니다. 간단한 말실수나 술에 "
"취해서 다투는 것만으로도 순식간에 흉기난동으로 이어지기도 합니다. 그래서 도시에 그렇게 많은 경비대가 있는 것이고 어지간한 실력으로는 "
"경비대로 받아들이지 않습니다. 자만디 공께서는 저의 업적을 눈여겨 보시고 승진감으로 점 찍어놓으셨습니다. 그게 제가 이곳에 있는 "
"이유입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "b529174a-db63-4078-ad03-e11ac541b45e"
msgid ""
"\"There are sufficient munitions and supplies, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|"
"Your Highness|Your Highness}. The salary is fair: we've enough to buy toys "
"for the kids and a jug of beer when the shift is done. Of course, the town "
"is growing — it would be nice to expand the ranks... but we can manage that "
"ourselves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"충분한 보급품과 무기가 준비되어 있습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 급여도 적당합니다. 교대 근무가 끝나면 아이들 장난감과 "
"맥주 한병 살 수 있는 정도는 충분히 됩니다. 물론, 마을은 성장중이니만큼 병력을 확장하면 더 좋겠지만.. 현재까진 우리 스스로 해결해 "
"나갈 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptainAssistant
msgctxt "277f83e2-5877-42db-b08d-5baa655fd538"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you worry, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! "
"We are now the subjects of the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}. We've "
"sworn to serve you faithfully and loyally, and you can count on us! Besides, "
"we draw our salary from your chests...\""
msgstr ""
"\"걱정마십시오. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 이제 우리는 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}의 백성입니다. 저희는 신의와 충성 "
"가지고 주군을 섬기기로 맹세했으며 앞으로 기대해 주셔도 좋습니다! 게다가 저희는 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 금고에서 봉급을 "
"받습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "71631c79-bb29-4edb-9c48-aff5051d053f"
msgid ""
"{n}The captain looks at the female guard, raising his brow, then sighs and "
"looks at you.{/n} \"Of course. Every one of us is ready to die to protecting "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}... but there's still "
"some work to be done when it comes to discipline. You know that dwarven "
"author… Baldric Zebras? Garlic Tundras? The name escapes me... My boneheads "
"use to read his books about guard's duty right on guard duty. I'll have to "
"teach them lesson or two!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}경비 대장은 눈썹을 올리며 여성 경비병을 보더니 이내 한숨을 쉬며 당신을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"물론입니다. 우리 모두는 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}을 지키기위해 죽을 준비가 되어 있습니다. 하지만 훈육에 관해서는 아직 해야 할 일이 좀 있습니다. 그 "
"드워프 작가를 아십니까? 이름이 뭐였더라. 발드릭 제브라스? 갈릭 툰드라스? 기억이 안나네요..아무튼. 그 드워프 작가가 쓴 경비대의 "
"올바른 의무라는 책을 좀 읽고 경비대에 한두가지 좀 가르쳐야 겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "5566f1a6-e5b3-40fa-8903-b373c106bc25"
msgid ""
"\"Hyland, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. Captain of "
"the city guard.\""
msgstr "\"하이랜드입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 도시 경비 대장입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptainAssistant
msgctxt "1ce92aaf-5ba5-4e60-8ef5-f28f792643c9"
msgid ""
"{n}A young dwarf girl salutes you awkwardly.{/n} \"Delia, assistant to the "
"captain. Happy to serve {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}젊은 드워프 소녀가 어색하게 경례합니다.{/n} \"대장의 조수 델리아입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 봉사하게되어 "
"기쁩니다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "5c53f3d9-70c8-405e-8693-959c69efe8be"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a stout man, suited in well-worn armor. His face is framed with "
"silvery stubble, and his fleshy nose is red and pock-marked. He radiates "
"perfect calm. As you approach, he bows — respectfully and with dignity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}갑옷을 입은 튼튼한 남자가 보입니다. 그의 얼굴은 까칠한 은빛 수염으로 덮여있고 그의 두툼한 코는 딸기코입니다. 그는 완벽한 평온을 "
"발산합니다. 당신이 다가 갈수록 그는 존경과 존엄으로 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "8807efa0-af18-4bbb-a3fb-eba238006ca5"
msgid ""
"\"As for Delia, I found her on the street. About a decade ago. I remember "
"vividly — a tiny dwarf girl sitting on the temple steps. Dirty face, "
"barefoot, feeding a piece of bread to a stray cat. I saw her and my heart "
"missed a beat...\" {n}The captain looks away.{/n} \"Where she's from, who "
"left her alone and why — only {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} knows. As she grew, I "
"tried to send her to learn a craft — but who can talk sense into a dwarf?! "
"She wanted to be a guard, and that's that. So now I'm teaching her myself. "
"Lucky she has a head on her shoulders, and a fair bit of strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"델리아에 대해 말씀드리자면, 그녀는 거리에서 발견했습니다. 한 10년 전이었습니다. 사원 계단에 앉아 있던 작은 드워프 소녀가 "
"생생하게 기억납니다. 더러운 얼굴에 맨발로 길 잃은 고양이에게 빵 조각을 먹이고 있었습니다. 그녀를 봤을 때 심장이 멎는줄 알았습니다\" "
"{n}대장이 눈길을 돌립니다.{/n} \"그녀가 어디서 왔는지, 누가, 왜 아이 혼자 내버려 두었는지는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}"
"께서만 아실겁니다. 그녀가 자라면서, 제작 기술을 배우도록 해볼까 했습니다. 하지만 누가 드워프에게 센스를 논할 수 있겠습니까? 그녀는 "
"경비대가 되고 싶었고, 그게 다입니다. 지금은 제가 직접 가르치고 있습니다. 운 좋게도 그녀는 머리를 쓸줄도 알고, 힘도 상당한 편입니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptainAssistant
msgctxt "9161ff52-6a1b-47ac-a9f8-addf7eb6e23c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, uncle, when are you going to change that old armor! The magic beasts "
"crumpled it so badly, it makes me cry to look at it!\""
msgstr "\"삼촌, 그 오래된 갑옷은 언제 갈아치울 거야? 환수 때문에 너무 심하게 구겨져서, 그걸 보면 눈물이 나온다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "3b6d574e-a967-4fd2-a140-3a253d9202c4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you still have a lot to learn. If only you knew how many times it "
"saved my life in that battle...\" {n}Hyland turns to you.{/n} \"Greetings, "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 아직도 배워야 할 것이 많다. 이것이 전투에서 얼마나 많이 내 생명을 구했는지 네가 안다면...\" {n}하이랜드가 당신에게 "
"돌아섭니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "0f20d64d-2f6a-49ef-bfee-ceaaa2956b14"
msgid ""
"\"How's one supposed to feel? He was a crook and a trickster, and everyone "
"knew it. He got what he deserved, and it's all for the good — for "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and for all their neighbors. Everyone sleeps better now."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"기분이 어떨까? 그는 사기꾼이자 협잡꾼이었고 모두가 그것을 알고 있었다. 그는 응당한 대가를 치렀고 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와 "
"그의 이웃에게는 좋은 일이다. 사람들은 편히 잘 수 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptainAssistant
msgctxt "8dd9b10e-0e2b-4bb4-8c90-3913707370d1"
msgid ""
"\"We didn't believe for a moment all the dirty rumors he spread about you!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그가 너에 대해 퍼뜨린 더러운 소문을 하나도 믿지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/CaptainGuards/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Capital_GuardCaptain
msgctxt "36883b46-29b3-4a4e-af83-8bbd92cc5cf0"
msgid "\"...why don't you explain why you're staring at me like that?\""
msgstr "\"... 왜 그렇게 쳐다보는지 설명해주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_01_String
msgctxt "acad4f79-1da5-41af-bf24-0ef6441dcaa3"
msgid "\"To our {mf|lord|lady}!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 왕을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_02_String
msgctxt "58f8ff9a-e529-43dd-9492-f279a0904ee7"
msgid "\"Hic...!\""
msgstr "\"힉...!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_03_String
msgctxt "21cf9deb-2573-40ec-91f6-5dd71dae8409"
msgid "\"Yuck! Is that a fly in my mug?\""
msgstr "\"웩! 내 잔에 파리가 날라들었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_04_String
msgctxt "de195b7b-5f2b-4578-8e1e-0fcf98c4630f"
msgid "\"I'll hate myself in the morning...\""
msgstr "\"아침의 내 모습이 싫어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_05_String
msgctxt "390bb37f-6d06-48f2-ac99-81f3b3ec7ba0"
msgid "\"Cheers!\""
msgstr "\"건배!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_06_String
msgctxt "c971f221-5b55-4b8e-9e8c-32412ed5afa3"
msgid "\"Pour me another!\""
msgstr "\"한잔 더!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_07_String
msgctxt "3ea1d1cf-703a-4d5e-b33b-6175a4044022"
msgid "\"Did I drink too much...? Nah, let's get more!\""
msgstr "\"내가 너무 많이 마셨나...? 더 마셔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_08_String
msgctxt "91c5ba13-2a9d-4f59-8f37-293d40950e93"
msgid "\"H-how does that s-song go...?\""
msgstr "\"그 노래는 어떻게 불렀더라...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_09_String
msgctxt "55cc0af1-eb9a-4dce-9c24-bc06ac30ad4e"
msgid "\"Bottoms up!\""
msgstr "\"건배!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_10_String
msgctxt "09a7399e-fb17-4d6d-839c-e263bac6dede"
msgid "\"Nice wine, nice company... What else could we wish for?\""
msgstr "\"좋은 술과 좋은 친구... 우리가 또 무얼 바랄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_11_String
msgctxt "59b6cc66-95eb-4bae-84f7-4f8a0cbbcd61"
msgid "\"Who's still sober here? Let's fix that!\""
msgstr "\"누가 아직도 술에 취해 있어? 내가 고쳐 주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_12_String
msgctxt "9caac178-7d14-4649-84be-0ec6cc8cc409"
msgid "\"Now that's what I call revelry!\""
msgstr "\"이제 흥청망청 마시자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_13_String
msgctxt "e4be1a3c-8e5c-45f4-8724-ddd60517b21d"
msgid "\"Forget about tomorrow! Have fun!\""
msgstr "\"내일은 잊고 즐겨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_14_String
msgctxt "121b6d65-2797-43c1-b3ae-f0016a732fee"
msgid "\"I feel dizzy...\""
msgstr "\"어지러워...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_15_String
msgctxt "a90db639-8446-435d-8324-3bdc43d550a0"
msgid "\"Where are the best parties? Right here, on the Tuskwater's shores!\""
msgstr "\"최고의 잔치는 어디 있지? 바로 여기 터스크워터의 해안에 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_16_String
msgctxt "2c6c7905-957d-4847-98d0-3d9f47014cc0"
msgid "\"Is {Name} here? Is {mf|he|she} drinking with {mf|his|her} people?\""
msgstr "\"여기에 {Name}의 모습이 있네? 신하들과 술을 마셔?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_17_String
msgctxt "c44f9aeb-54bc-4d6e-aeb9-302a9493a353"
msgid "\"Let's have one more! And then two more!\""
msgstr "\"한잔 더! 그리고 두잔 더!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_18_String
msgctxt "0fd0b528-a435-4e98-9f6a-eb1c34bbc864"
msgid "\"Don't mix those! You'll have a bad time, I'm telling you!\""
msgstr "\"그걸 섞어서는 안돼! 너 내일 힘든 시간을 보내겠다. 내가 장담해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_19_String
msgctxt "338849f9-a89d-47cc-a2ac-ddb3509b0837"
msgid "\"I don't usually drink... But today's an exception!\""
msgstr "\"나는 보통 마시지 않는다... 그러나 오늘은 예외다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/DrunkPeople/DrunkPeople_20_String
msgctxt "f937c381-3648-4f40-93ae-e30aff8ff789"
msgid "\"A-and then I told him... Uh... Yeah, so h-he told me...\""
msgstr "\"그리고 나는 그에게 말했다... 어... 그래. 그가 나에게 말했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9c9dfffc-1a8a-4cf7-9f3a-ee33f929f69e"
msgid "\"Show us what treats you have.\""
msgstr "\"뭘 팔고 있는 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5f994b1a-78e9-40b6-bc67-ac3c6700e250"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "09180db1-974f-4a77-be63-818a8a8628d6"
msgid ""
"\"All the news in the whole region must pass through this inn. What rumors "
"have you heard?\""
msgstr "\"아마 전 지역 모든 소식들이 이 선술집을 통하겠지. 어떤 소문들을 들었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5d7721e2-63d9-4875-a523-143a67d9c448"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ad1fca8b-7994-4ff6-b446-7dd38bb500ca"
msgid "\"Where are you from? What land, which family?\""
msgstr "\"어디서 왔어? 어느 가문 출신이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "c2bc6e37-bd95-490a-994d-2880cc2ca294"
msgid "\"Why did you decide to become an innkeeper?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여관 주인이 되기로 결심했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "ed1aef67-bb37-41f7-a370-e5a0b29bdfb3"
msgid "\"Tell me about the River Kingdoms.\""
msgstr "\"강의 왕국들에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "14b501eb-3089-4c0f-aff7-485d65a29454"
msgid "\"The Six River Freedoms?\""
msgstr "\"여섯 강의 자유??\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "585ea945-2743-438c-9fec-83e9bdbc19e6"
msgid "\"Where does the inn's name come from?\""
msgstr "\"여관의 이름은 어디에서 따 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "37cd1bef-3e35-488a-a308-141c32205084"
msgid "\"What's the news around here?\""
msgstr "\"근방에 새로운 소식은 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "be60c7ec-6d50-4593-ac12-0f31252dca7d"
msgid ""
"\"Please tell me what other news you've heard. Your stories are so "
"interesting — and useful.\""
msgstr "\"또 무슨 소식들을 들었는지 말해주겠어? 네 이야기들은 너무 흥미로운데다가 유용하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5c11257d-f8b1-47b6-a315-562947baa55b"
msgid "\"I am curious what the people are talking about.\""
msgstr "\"사람들이 요즘 무슨 얘기들을 하는지 알려주겠어?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "4f7e615c-1295-480b-8f3a-b3623f3ffc3b"
msgid "\"What's new around here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 뭐 새로운 것 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "1ac98d70-88d6-481e-bcdb-6fdbd1a9232e"
msgid "\"Elina, do you have anything to tell me?\""
msgstr "\"엘리나. 나에게 할 말 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "661ff737-e6a4-4e21-9871-557f04dc380e"
msgid "\"Thank you, Elina. We will discuss it another time.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 엘리나. 다음에 또 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "0b4277d5-475c-43c6-8f35-b6cd2eb7456d"
msgid "\"What did you want to ask me, Elina?\""
msgstr "\"나한테 묻고싶은게 뭐였지. 엘리나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "a36d41c9-0852-4caf-87e9-46bb539c602e"
msgid "\"A fine idea! I will try to get you such an egg.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이야! 머지 않아 좋은 소식을 알려주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "54d5bf53-014e-41d1-a5eb-3a2f305c188e"
msgid "\"Please remind me what you'd asked me for...\""
msgstr "\"네가 나한테 부탁한게 뭐였더라..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "07777903-ad69-456c-a420-8e64d6305bd4"
msgid ""
"\"I have more serious things to do than gather groceries for your kitchen.\""
msgstr "\"부엌의 식료품을 모으는 것보다 더 심각한 일이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "4cac95cb-4295-452d-8794-621025a13021"
msgid ""
"\"Elina, I have a giant bird's egg. I thought you might be interested.\""
msgstr "\"엘리나. 나는 거대한 새 알을 가지고있어. 네가 관심 있을 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "108e33e5-9fe4-4565-a31b-03ffc3313fee"
msgid "\"I have that roc's egg!\""
msgstr "\"난 로크의 알을 가지고있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "f35b60bc-1455-4763-9cf0-0f002a24ea1b"
msgid ""
"\"I heard there's been a number of thefts in town. Do you know anything "
"about it?\""
msgstr "\"마을에 많은 도둑이 있다는 소식을 들었다. 그것에 대해 아는 것이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "62751d99-b2e4-4afc-bb44-99a54547b78c"
msgid ""
"\"During the celebration in the forest, you kept staring at Ekun, giving him "
"a certain look...\""
msgstr "\"숲에서 파티하는 동안, 에쿤에게서 눈을 떼지않고, 바라보던 표정이 남다르던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "680ff81c-d12b-4d92-802f-a47661c7d7e6"
msgid ""
"\"Elina, I need to find a rare book. Do you know where in the city I should "
"look?\""
msgstr "\"엘리나. 나는 희귀한 책을 찾아야 해. 내가 도시의 어디를 찾아야 하는지 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "babbe9f9-79f2-462f-8d19-fb9232c73415"
msgid ""
"{n}Behind the inn's bar stands a young woman with curly red hair, a round "
"face and rosy cheeks. She gives you a friendly smile, fixing her cap.{/n} "
"\"It's so nice of you to stop by, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! "
"I'm Elina, the innkeeper.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여관에는 곱슬 머리, 둥근 얼굴, 장미빛 뺨을 한 젊은 여성이 있습니다. 그녀는 친절한 미소를 지으며 그녀의 모자를 손봅니다.{/n}"
" \"들러주셔서 감사합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저는 엘리나. 여관 주인이랍니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "776cdfc2-425c-42d3-8302-c6f4d476a468"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina makes a curtsy, like a lady in waiting.{/n} \"Welcome, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "{n}엘리나는 시녀처럼 인사합니다.{/n} \"어서오세요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "afeedb60-8539-410b-919a-60c2ea060d6b"
msgid ""
"\"I'd be happy to, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! I love to talk, "
"especially about myself!\""
msgstr "\"좋아요! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저는 얘기하는걸 무척 좋아합니다. 특히 제 얘기요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "6b7132ae-6b7f-4f90-bd27-c81517ed3f8c"
msgid ""
"\"An old man came through, an odd-looking fellow. Talked about some goddess "
"that was going to come and sweep away the city, as I sweep bread crumbs from "
"the table. He spoke of other, beautiful things, something about magic, "
"forests, forces of nature, but he made it sound scary! We should make a "
"toast and pray to {g|Cayden Cailean}Cayden{/g} — may he protect us from this "
"evil Goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴상하게 생긴 노인이 왔었어요. 마침 전 테이블 위 빵부스러기를 쓸어버리고 있었는데, 어떤 여신이 도래하여 도시를 쓸어버릴꺼라는 "
"얘기들을 하기 시작했어요. 그 노인은 아름다운 것들에 대해서도 이것저것 얘기했는데, 마법, 숲, 자연의 힘 이런것들이었죠. 근데 뭔가 "
"무섭게 들렸어요. 아무래도 {g|Cayden Cailean}케이든{/g}이 이 사악한 여신으로부터 우리를 보호해주시길 기도하며 축배라도 "
"들어줘야 할꺼같아요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "d7a76fd9-21d4-4afd-b446-d7b824ee9bd2"
msgid ""
"\"Lately everyone's been talking about the tower at the "
"{g|Candlemere}Candlemere{/g}. They say lights were dancing around it like a "
"busy cook's stove. Everyone who saw it says different things. Some witnessed "
"a dragon, and some, glowing hamsters crawling from the lake! They're "
"probably all lying, but the place is definitely spooky. And mysterious.\""
msgstr ""
"\"최근엔 다들 {g|Candlemere}캔들미어{/g}의 탑에 대해서 얘기들을 해요. 말하길, 마치 바쁜 주방 화로처럼 불빛이 탑 "
"주위에서 춤추고 있다고 해요. 다들 본 것을 다 다르게 얘기해요. 어떤 사람들은 용을 보았다고 하고 어떤 사람은 호수에서 헤엄치는 빛나는 "
"햄스터들을 봤다고 해요. 아마 모두 거짓말이겠지만, 그 장소는 확실히 으스스하고 뭔가 신비로운 기운이 있어요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a231057d-0d23-4a13-9512-0f24273099ad"
msgid ""
"\"The whole town is talking about that Stefano — a lord from "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! It seems there isn't a single man who this arrogant fool "
"hasn't annoyed. He came here too! Mitty, the kitchen boy, admitted to me "
"that he spat in his soup. I usually come down like a load of bricks for such "
"things, but this time I couldn't even give him a scolding.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마을 전체가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 온 스테파노 경에 대해 이야기하고 있어요! 이 오만한 바보가 괴롭히지 않은 사람이 "
"없는거 같아요. 그는 여기에도 왔었어요! 주방에서 일하는 소년 미티는 그의 수프에 침을 뱉었다고 이실직고하더라구요. 저는 보통 그런 "
"행위에 불같이 화를내지만 이번에는 꾸짖을 수도 없었어요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "aedec6f9-5e54-43ad-b1d8-cf906c65b4f8"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing new, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. People talk of the "
"harvest, the weather, and their pretty, well-knit children.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐, 더 새로운 것은 없어요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 사람들은 주로 추수, 날씨, 그리고 귀여운 자녀들 얘기를 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "f722e9a9-c15d-44d0-9e0f-f33f92b28f94"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't want to court disaster, baron{mf||ess}, but the people are "
"talking about you... Someone said you're cursed, like it's your fate to call "
"down all the troubles that were supposed to hit the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} over the next hundred years. You know how it can be — some people "
"just attract bad things all at once, right? Like the fellow who stumbles "
"over a barrel of fish, steps in a fire, knocks over a wasp nest, and runs "
"blind into a bull field. That's how people are talking about you! Only "
"you're a baron{mf||ess}, so the trouble you get into is more serious...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저도 재앙을 원치 않지만 사람들이 영주님에 대해서 수근대고 있어요.. 어떤 사람은 영주님이 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}에 수백년 동안 있을 재앙들을 모두 불러내는 저주를 받은거라고 해요. 그게 어떤건지 대충 아시죠? 어떤 사람들은 주변에 모든 "
"나쁜일을 몰고 다니잖아요. 하필 생선 가득 담긴 통으로 넘어지고, 불길을 밟고, 와스프 둥지를 건드리거나, 황소 사육장에 뛰어들거나.. "
"사람들이 그렇게 영주님에 대해 말하고 있어요! 영주님 이라서 문제가 점점 더 악화되어 가고 있다고.. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "53eeea58-fc24-4fc5-bbbb-aeade8cb95c6"
msgid ""
"\"The best fish gets brought in from {g|Lake Silverstep}Silverstep Lake{/g}. "
"But there's been trouble out there. They saw a strange boat on the lake, and "
"the bandits are fooling around again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"최고의 생선은 {g|Lake Silverstep}실버스텝{/g}에서 들여와요. 근데 그곳에 문제가 있었나봐요. 호수에 수상한 배가 "
"나타나고는, 도적들이 다시 활개를 치고 있다고 해요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "26d1e9d5-1fa5-4c7d-b963-6b6bdbd0ab27"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing new, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Almost every day "
"we're crying over another victim of the monsters. It seems there's no end in "
"sight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 새로운 것은 없어요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 요즘 다들 매일 괴물에게 희생당한 사람들을 추모하고 있어요. 정말이지 "
"끝이 안보여요! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "e25fbed2-374d-4a91-85c1-a8611669e72f"
msgid ""
"\"I heard from a neighbor, who heard from her child's godmother, who heard "
"from... oh dear, listen to me rattling on. Anyhow, there are rumors of a "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} priestess in our lands. Those priestesses are "
"dreadful frightening, but women sometimes go to them, if they cannot "
"conceive or carry a child. Don't get me wrong, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, no one from our town would do that, but "
"they're happy to talk about it. They'll be talking for days about what kind "
"of children a Lamashtu ritual can bring — with three rat tails, or three cat "
"eyes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저도 이웃에게 들은건데요. 그 이웃은 그의 아들 대모에게서 들었대요. 그 대모는 또 누구한테 들었다더라..어머, 나 좀봐. 혼자 "
"떠들고 있네요..아무튼, 소문에는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제들이 우리 영지에 와있다고 해요. 그 여사제들은 꽤 무서워 "
"보이지만 임신을 원하거나 아이를 가지지 못하는 여성들이 그 사제들을 찾아간다고 해요. 아 오해하지 마세요. "
"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 우리 마을 여성들이 그랬다는거는 아니고, 사람들은 그저 이런 얘기하는걸 좋아하잖아요. 사람들은 "
"라마슈투의 의식에 바칠 제물이 쥐꼬리 3개인지 고양이 눈 3개인지, 그 제물에 따라 어떤 아이를 임신할 수 있는지에 대해 며칠내내 "
"수근거리고 있어요!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "b90032dc-1a0f-436b-998e-51bc1465c0c6"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, stop, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! You know the news "
"around here: nothing strange is happening, we're rebuilding the city, "
"getting back on our feet. Oh, and we've changed the name of the inn, did you "
"see?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그만하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 이상한 일은 없고 도시를 재건하고 다시 일어서는 중입니다. "
"아, 그리고 여관 이름도 바꿨어요, 보셨어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "72bcdebb-b76a-4867-9522-0939ae4d806c"
msgid ""
"\"Everything seems calm, it's just that... There was a hunter from "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, used to come in every week — don't know, if he "
"fancies me or our groom... But now he stopped showing up. Matter of fact, "
"there's been no news at all from Varnhold lately. Most peculiar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것이 평온하지만 단지... {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}에서 사냥꾼 한 명이 매주 오곤 했어요 — 그가 저를 흠모하는지 "
"아니면 우리 급사를 좋아하는진 모르겠지만요... 하지만 최근엔 그가 도통 나타나질 않네요. 사실, 요즘엔 반홀드에서 오는 소식이 전혀 "
"없어요. 정말 이상하기도 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "61eeec02-774a-44d7-9dab-1fe102776b63"
msgid ""
"\"Travelers coming in from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, have run across groups of "
"barbarians a few times. They're quite some ways from their own lands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 오는 여행자들이 몇 차례 야만족 무리를 만났다고 해요. 그들은 그들의 땅에서 꽤 멀리 떨어져 있었다네요! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "918f5a1e-f183-44ab-ac23-994962a5011d"
msgid ""
"\"Absolutely nothing new. I'll tell you this month's topic of debate... What "
"color is the best one for fences.\""
msgstr "\"전혀 새로운 것이 없어요. 이번 달의 토론 주제는... 울타리에 가장 적합한 색은 무엇일까 였어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "f0cb861f-3b9e-4eef-866c-2c82b2fd3b6f"
msgid ""
"\"Again that tower on the {g|Candlemere}Candlemere{/g}, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! A fishermen saw monsters on the island. "
"{g|Cayden Cailean}Cayden{/g} forbid they're meddling with us again. You "
"know, there are bad people, and there are bad places — and nastiness just "
"keeps sticking right to them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 {g|Candlemere} 캔들미어{/g}의 탑이다! 어부가 섬에서 괴물을 보았다. {g|Cayden Cailean} "
"케이든{/g}은 그들을 마주치는 것을 금지했다. 위험한 곳에는 나쁜 사람들이 있다. 그들은 불결한 곳을 좋아하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "a6eea2a4-c9ae-4edf-911c-037c1fff3db2"
msgid ""
"\"Refugees are coming in from around {g|Restov}Restov{/g}! Poor things... "
"They say there's a whole horde of barbarians attacking them! The people of "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} used to be the unfortunates. And now "
"they are running to us — for your protection, baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난민들이 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 주변에서 오는 중이다... 불쌍한 것... 야만족 군대가 그들을 공격한다고 말한다! {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 사람들은 한 때 불행했다. 그리고 지금은 그들이 우리에게 도망오고 있다. 너의 보호를 받기 "
"위해서 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "f94f54a4-5c63-4b60-8801-a86ff2fb8426"
msgid ""
"\"They say Annamede Belavarah is here on a tour of the barony. She's a "
"famous bard, who they call no less than {g|Pitax}Pitax'{/g} Pride! I'm dying "
"to hear her — though truth be told, King Irovetti's subjects are more like "
"foxes than people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안나미데 빌라바라가 남작령에 여행왔다고 해요. 그녀는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 자부심이나 다름없는 유명한 "
"바드라고 하네요! 저는 그녀의 노래를 너무나 듣고 싶어요. 비록 이로베티의 신하는 사람이기보다 교활한 여우와 같지만요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "6fe8c695-82a5-4cbe-a766-0414edff5de7"
msgid ""
"\"No other news, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. The people are "
"recounting your past victories for the hundredth time, out of sheer boredom."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 소식은 없어요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 영웅담이 몇 개나 되는지 세어보고 있는데, 백 개가 넘네요. 다들 지루한가 "
"봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "c06ef3bb-ca48-4a2b-beac-cb4fb395a49d"
msgid ""
"\"Our local flower man has been happy as a prince, since Lady Valerie "
"appeared in our city. His business wasn't going so good, but now not a day "
"passes without some unlucky admirer buying a basket of roses or a bouquet of "
"lilies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"꽃집 총각은 행복해 하는데 발레리가 우리 도시에 나타났기 때문이다. 그의 사업은 그리 좋지 않았지만 이제는 장미 바구니나 백합 "
"꽃다발을 사는 불운한 남자들이 매일 같이 나타나기 때문이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "db861a78-fb63-46d3-8cb6-b8328bdfc828"
msgid ""
"\"It's enough to make a cat laugh, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. "
"A little bird told me that a few young lasses pretended to be sick, just to "
"visit the clinic of Jhod and Tristian. And it's all on account of your "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} priest being so handsome!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 웃긴 일이 일어나고 있어요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 소문에 의하면 몇몇 젊은 아가씨들이 아픈 척을 하고 있다고해요. "
"단지 조드와 트리스티안의 진료소를 방문하기 위해서요. 그게 다 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g} "
"사제가 너무 잘 생겼기 때문이라구요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "f19cb973-1e87-4cae-914d-331f44a21d02"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, I'm telling you, soon they'll be "
"banning Sir Jubilost from all the neighborhood taverns. The inns and pubs "
"too! Whenever he comes in, he starts shouting that we aren't cooking right, "
"and he knows the right way, and he even has a book about it. Oh, something "
"tells me Sir Jubilost can't tell one end of a ladle from the other — yet "
"there he is, writing cookbooks!\""
msgstr ""
"\"곧 그들은 모든 선술집에서 주빌로스트 경이 출입하는 것을 금지할 것이다. 여관과 술집도 그렇다! 그가 들어올 때마다 그는 요리가 "
"맛이 없다고 소리를 지르고는 자신이 요리하는 방법을 알고 심지어 요리책도 있다고 말한다. 누군가 주빌로스트 경은 국자를 놓고 "
"손잡이가 어딘지도 모른다고 한다. 그런 그가 요리 책을 쓰고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "6474641a-eaf3-4e3c-be97-504e3852273e"
msgid ""
"\"There's a new saying in the barony. 'Wherever Sir Harrim walks, rye won't "
"sprout and milk will sour.'\""
msgstr "\"이런 말이 영지에서 떠돌고 있다. '하림 경이 걸어 오는 곳마다 호밀은 싹이 나지 않으며 우유도 시큼해진다.'라고. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "0040f672-e994-4541-8625-40a40739ffbd"
msgid ""
"\"After seeing your warriors, the local folks came up with a new saying. "
"They used to say 'wide as a road' or 'wide as a river', but now they say "
"'wide as Amiri's sword'!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님의 전사들을 보고 주민들이 신조어를 만들고 있어요. 평소에는 '길처럼 넓다' 또는 '강처럼 넓다'라고 말했지만 이제는 '아미리의 "
"검처럼 넓다'고 말한다는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "7ed215fe-ee95-4bee-a9ea-ae67e6d66954"
msgid ""
"\"One villager named her newborn daughter 'Octavia' after your companion. "
"She says lady Octavia is kind, and she wants her daughter to grow up like "
"that too! That'd be fine, but her neighbor called her cat 'Octavia' too. She "
"says that when she saw the way that beast's eye were blazing, it reminded "
"her of the lady magess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 마을 사람이 새로 태어난 딸의 이름을 영주님 동료의 이름을 따서 '옥타비아'라고 이름을 지었다네요. 그녀는 옥타비아 아가씨가 친절하다고 말하면서 딸도 그렇게 자랐으면 "
"한데요! 괜찮겠지만, 그녀의 이웃도 그녀의 고양이를 '옥타비아'라고 부른다네요. 그 고양이의 눈이 타오르는 것을 보았을 때, 마치 그녀의 "
"마법을 떠올리게 된다네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "d0f545ab-34e0-42ff-8441-69d6baec7fc8"
msgid ""
"\"A local hunter came up to me, pointed at the wolf that walks beside that "
"silent friend of yours, and asked me whether I wanted a coat made from its "
"hide. I told him I'd tear out his beard and make nests for my hens, if he so "
"much as touches that wolfy! I can't believe someone could harm such a smart "
"and friendly animal! Stupid and shameless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 사냥꾼이 나한테 와서는 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 말없는 친구 곁을 지키는 늑대를 가리키더니, 이놈 가죽으로 만든 외투를 "
"줄까 하고 묻는 거예요. 그래서, 늑대를 건드리면 니 수염을 다 뜯어다가 암탉 둥지로 만들어버리겠다고 했어요! 늑대처럼 똑똑하고 친절한 "
"동물을 해칠 생각을 하다니 믿을 수가 없네요! 멍청한 걸로 모자라 창피한 줄도 모르나 봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "7d0fa95e-c3c5-4169-88e7-03a225765c20"
msgid ""
"\"I hail from the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} — Artume, to be "
"precise. I'm from a farming family, like just about everybody from around "
"there. There's more fertile land and pasture there than anywhere in the "
"River Kingdoms, except for maybe Sevenarches. The folks who grow crops and "
"tend cattle are well respected there. But at the same time they live in "
"constant danger — there's too many bad people, too lazy to work all day, but "
"don't mind taking other people's things.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 출신이랍니다. 정확히는 아르투메(Artume) 출신이지요. 아르투메 사람이 "
"다들 그렇듯, 농가에서 자랐고요. 어느 왕국과 비교해도 그만큼 비옥한 토지와 목초지가 없었죠. 음, 세븐아치스(Sevenarches)는 "
"빼야하려나. 아무튼 그곳에선 작물 재배하고 가축을 기르는 사람도 마땅히 존중을 받아요. 그러다 보니 나쁜 사람들의 위협도 끊이지 않았죠. "
"게을러 빠져서는 남이 하루종일 일해서 모은 재산을 빼앗아가는 놈들 말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "5253f68a-328f-4dab-828f-73c2c1e34a23"
msgid ""
"\"I was bored! Please don't get me wrong, I was fine at father's farm, and "
"I've got nothing but respect for farmers' work. But in our back country you "
"could go half a year without seeing one new face. No news, nothing "
"happening... I've dreamed of working at an inn since I was a child. That's "
"the kind of place where there's always lots of guests and stories!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지루했거든요! 아, 오해하진 마세요. 저는 아버지 농장에서 잘 지냈고 농부의 일을 항상 존경했어요. 하지만 우리 고국에서는 아마 "
"6개월 동안 단 한명의 새로운 얼굴을 볼 기회도 없을꺼에요 . 언제나 아무 소식도 없고 그러니 아무 일도 일어나지 않죠. 그래서 어렸을 "
"때부터 여관에서 일하는 것을 꿈꿨어요. 언제나 손님이 많고 이야기가 끊이지 않으니까요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "05952f9b-9472-450e-8c0e-9fa7f1368094"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, don't ask, it's too funny! I kept thinking about what name to pick... "
"choosing just the right one... but not one to waste time, I drew a beer mug "
"on the door — I figured folks would just see it and come on in. So the "
"locals got used to calling the place 'The Beer Mug Inn' — so the name stuck."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 말도 마세요. 너무 재미있었어요! 저는 어떤 이름으로 정할까 항상 생각했어요.. 어떻게하면 시간 낭비없이 딱 좋은 이름을 정할 "
"수 있을까.. 일단 여관 문에 맥주잔을 그려봤어요. 왠지 사람들이 그걸 보고 들어올꺼라 생각했거든요. 그래서 주민들은 이곳을 '맥주잔 "
"여관'이라 부르기 시작했어요. 그렇게 이름이 정해졌죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "057c72b8-c7ee-481d-b7f8-0cf528f3600e"
msgid ""
"\"A month wouldn't be long enough to tell it all, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Each kingdom is a special place all its "
"own. Elves live in one of them. Another one, half of the country belongs to "
"the Murderers' Guild, and the other half gives them their orders — they say "
"they even get locals' discounts! There's just one thing that unites us all, "
"like a strong thread keeps a quilt together. It's the Six River Freedoms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한달 내내 말해도 모자를 껄요! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 제가 예전 강의 왕국들에 있었을때...{g|River "
"Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 각 왕국은 각각의 특별한 점을 지니고 있어요 . 엘프들이 살고 있는 곳도 있구요. 또 어떤 나라는 "
"절반이 살인자 길드고 다른 절반은 그들에게 명령을 내려요. 하다못해 지역민 할인까지 있데요! 튼튼한 실이 여러개의 천을 하나로 이어주듯, "
"이 왕국들을 하나로 묶어주는 한 가지가 있는데 그것이 바로 '여섯 강의 자유'라는 규율이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "2068c9ee-55b3-4466-a0fd-23eb398f6a1a"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. The First Freedom — 'Say What you Will, I Live Free.' It doesn't mean "
"you won't get beaten up for what you say, though! The Second Freedom — well, "
"if you can call it a freedom! — 'Oathbreakers Die.' Those who break oaths "
"get killed just like that. So people prefer not making any oaths at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요. 첫 번째 자유는 '원하대로 말하고 자유롭게 살아라.'에요. 그렇다고 해서 당신이 아무말이나 해도 안 두들겨 맞는다는 뜻이 "
"아닙니다! 두 번째 자유는..이걸 자유라 부를 수 있을지 모르겠지만, '맹세를 어기는 자는 죽는다.'에요. 맹세를 어긴 사람들은 간단히 "
"죽임을 당해요. 그래서 사람들은 어지간해선 맹세를 절대 하지 않아요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "d2365303-822c-46a3-a66f-712786f39dc7"
msgid ""
"\"The Third Freedom — 'Walk Any Road, Float Any River.' Once the ruler of "
"Heibarr decided to build a gate across the river and collect a fee from each "
"passing boat. Well, there's no more Heibarr. The Fourth Freedom is even "
"worse than the second one — 'Courts Are for Kings'. Whatever a king says, "
"goes — well, as long as he doesn't say to build a gate across a river...\""
msgstr ""
"\"세 번째 자유는 '어느 길이든 어느 강이든 가라.'에요. 한때 헤이바르의 통치자는 강을 가로짓는 수문을 짓고 지나가는 배마다 요금을 "
"징수하기로 결정 했다고 해요. 뭐, 그 이후로 헤이바르는 더 이상 존재하지 않게 되었어요. 네 번째 자유는 두 번째보다 더 심각해요. "
"'법정은 왕을 위한 곳이다.' 왕은 무슨말을 하던, 그대로 다 이뤄져요. 음, 강을 가로짓는 수문을 지어야겠다고 말하지 않는 한요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "5a4ac252-f2dd-4a9a-8e5c-8028d77590ac"
msgid ""
"\"Now for the Fifth. 'Slavery Is an Abomination'. Nothing to explain there. "
"Runaway slaves from all over come to us for a reason. And the Sixth: 'You "
"Have What You Hold'. It means that theft is a much worse crime than robbery, "
"if you catch my drift. You can honestly beat a robber and keep what's yours, "
"but a thief acts on the quiet. Shame on him — that's just disrespectful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다섯 번째는 '노예제는 혐오스런 것이다'에요. 설명이 필요없죠. 이 규범으로 인해 각지에서 탈주한 노예들이 저희에게 오죠. 그리고 "
"마지막 여섯 번째는 '너의 것을 지켜라.'에요. 대략 말 뜻이 이해가신다면 이건 결국 강도질 보다 절도가 더 악질적인 범죄라는 뜻이나 "
"다름없어요. 강도라면 정정당당하게 두들겨패서 당신 재산을 지킬 수 있지만 도둑들은 몰래 훔쳐가니까요. 부끄러운줄 알아야지말야. 그건 그냥 "
"비겁한거라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "6edfc780-7981-48d1-9883-7472e59eb839"
msgid ""
"\"I'm talking too much, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\" {n}Elina "
"sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너무 말을 많이했나봐요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}엘리나가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "56362faa-7393-47cd-a348-28406ef3b815"
msgid ""
"\"Almost no news. We're explaining to travelers and guests from the farthest "
"settlements that we're not a barony any more, but a kingdom! Every chance I "
"get, I let it drop that {mf|His|Her} Highness visits my inn from time to "
"time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"딱히 새로운 소식은 없어요. 우리는 타지에서 온 여행자와 손님들에게 이 땅은 더이상 남작령이 아니라 왕국이라고 설명하고 있어요! "
"그리고 기회가 될 때마다 전하께서 저희 여관에 간간히 찾아주신다고 얘기하고 있구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "8cfb92b1-5dc4-45c2-a8e3-3f08ad0e8535"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I was right when I said that {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} is full of shameless "
"foxes dressed like people! Lately there's so many folks from Pitax — more "
"than mosquitoes in the spring. And they're sticking their noses in "
"everywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"\"역시 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에는 사람의 탈을 쓴 뻔뻔한 여우로 가득 차있다는 내 말이 맞았어요! 최근에는 봄에 모기보다 많은 "
"피탁스의 사람들이 많이 왔어요. 그리고 그들은 어디든 들쑤시고 다닌답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "936cc322-aa95-4085-9c65-9af7cda06d4f"
msgid ""
"\"It's probably you who can tell us the news. Our regulars keep talking "
"about the Rushlight Tournament! I really wanted to go, but I don't have "
"anyone to look after the inn. Your Highness, maybe we could have something "
"like it in our own capital?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 소식을 말할 수 있는 사람은 아마 당신일 겁니다. 우리 단골 손님은 러시라이트 토너먼트에 대해 계속 이야기하고 있어요! 정말 가고 "
"싶었지만 여관을 돌볼 사람이 없네요. 저기 우리 도시에도 그런 축제를 여는 게 어떨까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "4fabb081-b668-4113-ac37-ed605db8e65f"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing but trouble and sorrow. Those {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} snakes keep "
"talking, and folks either listen to them or get scared and start grumbling. "
"They even started claiming Pitax beer tastes better, and they cook better "
"eggs and crispy bacon. Well, I'd serve our eggs and bacon to the gods "
"themselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"문제와 슬픔 외엔 아무 것도 없어요. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 뱀같은 놈들은 계속 말하고 사람들은 귀 기울이고는 무서워져서 "
"불평을 하기 시작합니다. 그들은 심지어 피탁스의 맥주 맛이 더 좋고 에그 스크램블과 바삭한 베이컨을 더 잘 요리한다고 말해요. 흥, 내가 "
"요리한 달걀과 베이컨은 신들께도 대접할 수 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "bb899832-8fcd-44be-87ba-f27229a12a8d"
msgid ""
"\"Come back soon, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! No one can treat "
"you better than me.\""
msgstr "\"또 오세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 저희만한데가 또 없다니깐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "2a63c7c2-a30e-48dd-a177-0478444926c3"
msgid ""
"\"What's there to talk about, Your Highness? Trouble, trouble everywhere. "
"Monsters, natural disasters, monsters again... Seems like the end times have "
"come. But if someone can save us, it's you. Here's some advice — take a "
"closer look at your companions. In times like these, between the epochs, "
"people always have to make choices. Sometimes it's tough, and sometimes it "
"works out just right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 얘기였지요, 전하? 어디를 봐도 사고가 일어납니다. 괴물, 자연 재해, 또 다른 괴물 등... 마치 종말이 다가온 것처럼 "
"보입니다. 누군가가 우리를 구할 수 있다면 그건 당신입니다. 조언을 하자면 동료들를 더 가까이서 살펴 보세요. 이런 시대에 사람들은 "
"언제나 선택을 해야 하지요. 때로는 힘들지만 때로는 올바른 선택이었다는게 밝혀지죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "fb214fac-1dc3-4ad2-b815-22d84b555a19"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina seems to be brooding. She tugs at the seam of her apron and looks "
"at you with uncertainty.{/n} \"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! I "
"wouldn't want to bother you, but if you have a spare moment, I'd like to ask "
"you something...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나가 우울한 것 같습니다. 그녀는 앞치마의 솔기를 잡아 당기고는 확신이 없는 듯 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 당신을 귀찮게 할 생각은 없지만, 당신께서 시간이 많이 남으신다면, 한 가지 여쭙고 싶은 일이 "
"있습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "03ff8f59-f6dd-4e4e-8a3e-d01185c235a8"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, the city is getting rebuilt after "
"the Bloom. But the people survived such terror! I know almost all of them, "
"and I see in their eyes what that nightmare did to them. And I thought...\" "
"{n}Elina sighs.{/n} \"I thought we should cheer them up somehow! I can make "
"a special treat for everyone. But I can't do it alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 도시는 개화 이후로 다시 재건되고 있습니다. 하지만 사람들은 그런 공포 속에서 살아남았죠! 저는 "
"시민들 거의 모두를 알고 있고, 그들의 눈만 봐도 이번 악몽이 그들에게 무엇을 남겼는지 볼 수 있어요. 그리고 제가 생각한건... \" "
"{n}엘리나가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"저는 어떻게든 시민들을 응원해야된다고 생각했습니다. 저는 모두를 위해 특별한 상을 차릴 수 "
"있어요. 하지만 저 혼자서는 할 수 없는 일이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "fea87aec-249b-49e4-acd5-23b710a75eff"
msgid ""
"\"I know there's a Roc that lives on {g|Talon Peak}Talon Peak{/g}. But it is "
"a dangerous place. I offered a reward, but none of the hunters I know will "
"risk going there. But I know you could handle it, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}...\" {n}Elina raises her eyes timidly.{/n}"
" \"I know it's no task for a {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, but there's no "
"one else to ask...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Talon Peak}발톱 봉우리{/g}에 로크 한 마리가 살고 있다고 들었어요. 위험한 곳이죠. 로크 사냥에 후한 보상을 "
"걸었는데도, 사냥꾼들은 그만한 위험을 무릅쓸 가치가 없다고 생각하나 봐요. 하지만 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서는 그 정도 일은 "
"손쉽게 처리할 수 있으시겠죠...\" {n}엘리나는 겁 먹은 듯 시선을 들어 올립니다.{/n} \"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}님께 이런 "
"일을 맡겨선 안 되겠지만, 달리 부탁할 사람이 없어서요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "f4eef6c5-6ff8-46d7-b09e-08b8db130b74"
msgid ""
"\"To get an egg from the roc, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. The "
"roc lives on {g|Talon Peak}Talon Peak{/g}, and that bird is scary — big and "
"angry!\""
msgstr ""
"\"로크의 알을 구하기 위해서입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 로크는 {g|Talon Peak}발톱 봉우리{/g}에 사는데, "
"아주아주 무섭죠, 거대하고 성질이 잔뜩 나있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "643de159-a498-4271-a668-0b39d92e9fe0"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina is glowing.{/n} \"Thank you so much! I am sure you can handle it "
"easily!\""
msgstr "{n}엘리나의 눈빛이 빛납니다.{/n} \"정말 감사합니다! 당신이라면 쉽게 처리 하실 수 있을 거라 확신합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "d854e245-29b8-456c-81a5-4aa672589da9"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina sighs again.{/n} \"Of course, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "{n}엘리나가 다시 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"어쩔 수 없죠, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "38bc29ae-bc58-4e46-8086-ae400438a6df"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina throws up her hands.{/n} \"This is a roc's egg! Our family has an "
"ancient recipe for how to cook it! It's amazing that you brought it, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Let me give you something in return. No, "
"don't you argue! Merchants will pay a lot for these eggs, and you must have "
"taken a risk in getting it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나가 손을 휘저어 댑니다.{/n} \"이건 로크의 알이에요! 우리 가족은 그걸 요리하는 고대 조리법을 가지고 있거든요! 당신께서 "
"이걸 가져오시다니 놀라울 뿐이에요. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 제가 보답으로 뭔가 드릴께요. 사양하시면 안돼요! 상인들이 이 "
"알을 비싼 값에 쳐줬을텐데, 게다가 이걸 얻는데 큰 위험을 감수하셨잖아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "d04d9a3f-f9b2-4d0d-8fce-79c9e3088a14"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina throws up her hands.{/n} \"You've no idea how thankful I am, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! All my life I've dreamed of cooking one "
"of these eggs, and the timing couldn't be better!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나가 손을 휘저어 댑니다.{/n} \"제가 얼마나 감사하고 있는지 모르실꺼에요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 이 알을 "
"요리하는게 평생의 내 꿈이었는데, 이보다 더 완벽할 수는 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "a316912d-5302-4629-9217-0daad45881a9"
msgid ""
"\"People say different things, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. One "
"says he turned away for a moment, and someone stole the ham from his table! "
"Another one is missing his sausages. A third one says someone locked all his "
"hens in the attic, and ate all their eggs — raw! So far I haven't noticed "
"anything missing around here. Knock on wood. Knock-knock...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 죄다 다른 이야기를 합니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 어떤 사람은 눈 깜빡할 사이에 누군가 테이블에서 햄을 "
"훔쳐갔다고 말하죠! 또 다른 사람은 소시지를 잃어버렸다고 하고요. 세 번째 사람은 어떤 놈이 다락방에 모든 암탉들을 몰아넣어 잠그고는, "
"모든 달걀을 날로 깨쳐 먹었다고 한탄했죠! 저에 대해 말하시라면, 지금까진 여기서 사라진 건 없는것 같아요. 부정타진 않았겠죠. 설마, "
"설마...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "a281c110-5440-410e-8779-bbc6e76474c7"
msgid ""
"\"Every local resident is very, very concerned about one thing. Will lady "
"Linzi mention them in her book?! I'd settle for just one line... although a "
"page would be better!\""
msgstr ""
"\"온 국민의 관심사는 이거예요. 린지 양이 책에 내 얘기를 써줄까?! 저는 한 줄로 만족할 거예요... 물론 한 쪽을 할애해주겠다면 "
"사양 않겠지만요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "b01aecca-8d89-4cf1-a61b-75a286ae540e"
msgid ""
"\"The thing is, I have a very special family recipe, which I'm sure the "
"locals would love. It's... now don't laugh! ... it's an omelette. Made from "
"a Roc's egg. This bird is not really a bird, but a huge monster that lays "
"eggs very rarely. They're considered a royal treat, only a few people in all "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} have ever tried one. If we treat the "
"people to this delicacy, the whole neighborhood will be buzzing about it for "
"months! And what could be better medicine for their fear and sorrow, than "
"something fresh to boast about?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 말이죠, 제게는 가족 대대로 전해져 내려오는 아주 특별한 요리법이 있답니다. 누구나 맛을 보면 이 요리와 사랑에 빠지죠. "
"그러니까... 웃지 마세요! ...바로 오믈렛이에요. 대신 로크의 알로 만드는 거죠. 로크는 새라기보단 커다란 괴물에 가까워서 알을 거의 "
"낳지 않아요. 그런 이유로 로크의 알은 왕가에만 진상되는 특산물이죠. 아마 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g} 전역을 통틀어 "
"먹어본 사람이 얼마 없을 거예요. 그런 진미를 사람들에게 대접하면, 한동안 만났다 하면 그 얘기만 하고 다니겠죠! 게다가 두려움과 슬픔을 "
"이겨내는 데 새로운 자랑거리보다 더 좋은 처방이 어디 있겠어요? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "ee1b223b-d7c4-4d7d-9e9b-7be4515e1b10"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I heard about it, Your Highness! Many houses have been robbed. "
"And here's what's strange — no picked locks, no broken windows. How do the "
"scoundrels get inside, hunh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그런 소문을 들었습니다, 전하! 많은 집들이 도둑 맞았대요. 하지만 이상한 점이 하나 있는데, 어떤 자물쇠도 열리지 않았고, "
"어떤 창문도 깨지지 않았다고 합니다. 허어, 그 무뢰배들이 어떻게 침입했을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "b312e179-44a6-4cab-989a-4d505fc47b65"
msgid ""
"\"Those thieves are real masters of getting into other people's houses — and "
"they steal whatever they find. At one house they stole the silverware, and "
"at another one they left the money, but took the children's toys. Strange "
"thieves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 도둑들은 주거 무단침입의 진정한 대가였어요 — 그들이 보는건 뭐든지 훔치죠. 어떤 집에선 은제 물건을 훔쳐갔고, 다른 집에서는 "
"돈을 남겨두는 대신 아이들의 장난감을 가져갔대요. 이상한 도둑들이죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "828d85db-3d6c-4d32-98ae-b16d60139bcd"
msgid ""
"{n}After a brief moment of confusion, Elina answers easily,{/n} \"Of course "
"I did. Ekun's a handsome man! And he's hardworking, he's got no bad habits, "
"he's got friends in high places... and his gaze is so mysterious! And he's "
"so quiet... If you could only imagine, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|HIghness|Highness}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{n}잠시 혼란스러워하던 엘리나는, 쉽사리 대답합니다.{/n} \"물론 그랬죠. 에쿤은 잘 생겼잖아요! 일도 열심히 하고, 나쁜 "
"버릇도 없고, 높은 자리에 있는 친구들도 있죠... 게다가 그의 시선은 정말 신비로워요! 그리고 너무 "
"조용하구요...{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}도 상상이 가시지 않나요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ElinaInnkeeper/Cue_0085_Text
msgctxt "24a80089-7631-44b6-bccb-694ab1151b17"
msgid ""
"\"You've probably asked the vendors, haven't you? If not, then do that, and "
"if you have... um... Oh – I know who you should ask! Talk to Verdel, the "
"blacksmith. He's quite a reader. Can't live a day without a book.\""
msgstr ""
"\"행상인들에게 물어 보셨겠죠, 안그런가요? 만약 아직이시라면, 물어보셔야 할겁니다, 그리고 만약 당신께서... 음... 아, 누구에게 "
"물어야 할지 알겠네요! 대장장이 버델과 얘기해보세요. 그는 독서광이에요. 책 없이는 하루도 못 살죠. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "673d766d-b547-4719-bcd5-fdebec9dca39"
msgid "\"Let's see what you have.\""
msgstr "\"뭘 팔고있는지 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "bff3ac39-f437-463d-959c-3f34246baf5a"
msgid "\"Perhaps another time. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"다음에 또 보도록 할게. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ab0a630e-eb65-4226-985e-2cbd5144513a"
msgid "\"Do you know where stolen goods are sold?\""
msgstr "\"훔친 장물을 어디에 파는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8b3f2cd1-0fb4-4c25-9541-c9c61432f818"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "dfefd73b-2d42-4e43-81d8-db17287ea833"
msgid "\"What is the secret of your success, Hassuf?\""
msgstr "\"성공의 비결은 무엇이지? 하수프?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "30542310-c3cb-4386-9ec1-4ea9e027f52c"
msgid ""
"\"Why did you leave Absalom, the center of global trade, for some young "
"barony in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"왜 세계 무역의 중심지인 압살롬을 떠나 신생 남작령인 도둑맞은 땅으로 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "79ea7c0e-d9fc-4180-be44-1149a6472a62"
msgid "\"Come, come. Tell me why you left Absalom. I insist.\""
msgstr "\"어서. 왜 압살롬을 떠났는지 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "8518de70-ea54-43a8-a82c-f10f38056a33"
msgid "\"Has trade recovered from all the hardships the town has endured?\""
msgstr "\"마을이 겪은 재난이후 장사는 잘 복구 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "543045a9-7e1d-45eb-a848-8354e4aef3e0"
msgid ""
"\"The guards were told that a half-elf named Sharel robbed you. Is this true?"
"\""
msgstr "\"경비병에게 샤렐이라는 하프엘프가 당신을 강탈했다고 들었다. 사실인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3b6b757e-fb17-4825-a4c4-64ce44de5032"
msgid ""
"\"A Vudrani asked us to give you this letter. She claimed that your families "
"know each other.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 부드라인이 너에게 이 편지를 전해달라고 부탁했어. 그녀는 당신 가족들과 서로 아는 사이라고 하던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "96d6c61d-804f-4abe-8448-3b4368ebf390"
msgid ""
"{n}The man bows to you, spreading his arms a little.{/n} \"Hassuf from "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} is happy to welcome you, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Come, take a look at the best wares we "
"traveling merchants have to offer. Please, come, take a look.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이 남자는 살짝 팔을 벌리고 당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에서 온 하수프가 당신을 기쁘게 "
"맞이합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 여행 상인들이 제공하는 최고의 상품을 보십시오! 얼른, 얼른 보십시오!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "5db4aef3-99b0-46ba-a901-9380a21b9c7a"
msgid ""
"{n}Hassuf squints cunningly.{/n} \"How very polite — you do not ask me "
"directly! But no, I am not involved in such shady dealings. Although the "
"local traders sometimes claim otherwise...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하수프는 교활하게 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 있습니다.{/n} \"정말 정중하시군요! 제게 직설적으로 물어보지 않다니! 하지만 저는 그런 "
"수상한 거래에는 관여하지 않습니다. 지역 상인들은 가끔 딴소리를 하지만요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "27c9564a-d5ca-42c3-afae-2ec7ab2af28d"
msgid ""
"\"Some say that anything that's lying about will be stolen in this city — "
"but then cannot be found for sale! You are not the first to ask after stolen "
"goods: many hope to find on the black market what precious things were "
"stolen from their homes. But alas! It would seem the thieves have their own "
"ways of getting rid of the stolen goods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 사람들은 이 도시 여기저기 흩어진 물건들이 도난당할 것이라고 말하지만, 그 물건을 판매할 수는 없습니다. 당신이 장물에 대해 "
"물어보는 첫 번째 사람은 아닙니다. 많은 사람들이 자신의 집에서 도둑맞은 귀중품이 암시장에서 거래되었는지 알고 싶어 하지요. 하지만 "
"아아! 안타깝게도 도둑들은 장물을 처리하는 그들만의 방법이 있는 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "0cea4718-7f85-4b78-aa5d-0304e094384b"
msgid ""
"\"My pleasure, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\" {n}The merchant "
"smoothes his mustache and commences his story with an air of importance, "
"speaking in a sonorous voice, gesturing widely.{/n} \"Hassuf's family was "
"not rich, and he, as many in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, had to start from the "
"very bottom. As a child, while his peers chased pigeons and stole apples at "
"the market, he worked at a tannery... Oh, I can still smell this disgusting "
"stench...\" {n}The man pulls out a heavily perfumed handkerchief and waves "
"it in the air.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"기쁜 마음으로 말씀드리지요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}상인은 그의 콧수염을 부드럽게 만지고 폭넓은 몸짓과 거창한 "
"목소리로 중요한 이야기를 하듯 그의 이야기를 시작합니다.{/n} \"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}의 누구나처럼 하수프의 가족은 부자가 "
"아니었고 맨 밑바닥부터 시작해야 했습니다. 어렸을 때 그의 또래들은 비둘기를 쫓아다니고 시장에서 사과를 훔쳐 갔지만 그는 제혁소에서 일을 "
"했지요... 아, 아직도 그 역겨운 냄새가 기억나는군요... \" {n}남자는 짙은 향수 냄새가 밴 손수건을 꺼내 허공에 흔들어 "
"댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "2a44c375-0793-4d36-b148-be5f9676a588"
msgid ""
"\"There is no secret! Perseverance, strength of character, attention to "
"detail, the gift of persuasion, charm... all this among many other things "
"are key to success in my profession. But if I did have a secret, who would I "
"be to share it with anyone?\" {n}The merchant laughs merrily, his hands "
"rubbing his sides.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"비밀은 없습니다! 끈기, 특유의 기운, 세심한 관찰력, 설득의 재능, 매력... 이 모든 것들이 제 직업에서 성공하기 위한 열쇠지요. "
"하지만 만약 제게 비밀이 있다면, 누구와 그것을 공유하겠습니까? \" {n}상인은 기분 좋게 웃으며 손은 그의 턱을 문지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "599bd561-ccdd-43e0-a79b-e03c0856227b"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a dark-skinned wiry man with a weather-beaten face and a happy "
"smile on his face. He is dressed luxuriously, and his dark hair and neat "
"mustache are exquisitely coiffured.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}햇볕에 거칠어진 얼굴에 행복한 미소를 띤 어두운 피부의 남자가 나타납니다. 그는 화려하게 옷을 입고 그의 검은 머리카락과 깔끔한 "
"콧수염은 절묘하게 손질되어 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e1b55b58-eba9-42ff-9bea-49a268fee29b"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, this is a long story... I don't think Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} would be interested!\""
msgstr "\"하하하. 좀 긴 이야기입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 별로 흥미로워 하실만한 이야기도 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "1e979567-4536-4e9e-a28f-332b4cd6eea4"
msgid ""
"{n}The merchant groans theatrically.{/n} \"Very well, as you wish, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}... It was about a woman. When I was still "
"young, I fell in love with the daughter of a judge — an important person in "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}. For many years I tried to win her heart, but she was "
"cold as stone. I should have given up... but this is not in my character. In "
"the end I did manage to win her love — but I was unready for it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 과장되게 신음합니다.{/n} \"잘 알겠습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 원하신다면야... 이것은 한 여자에 "
"대한 이야기입니다. 제가 아직 어렸을 때, 저는 판사의 딸에게 사랑에 빠졌습니다. {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}의 고위층이었지요. "
"여러 해 동안 그녀의 마음을 얻으려고 노력했지만, 그녀는 차가웠습니다. 포기해야만 했지요... 하지만 그런 건 제 성격에 맞지 "
"않았습니다! 결국 그녀의 사랑을 얻는데 성공했지만, 저는 아직 준비가 되어 있지 않았지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a0dbb016-c0cc-4bfc-9a6e-fe5639a86b58"
msgid ""
"{n}Hassuf swallows and rubs the back of his head.{/n} \"As "
"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} is my witness, the flames of hell burn inside this "
"woman... I could not live with her for even six months! Tenderness and "
"passion one day — screaming and scandal the next. Sometimes she would break "
"into my office during business meetings to make a jealous scene — and "
"sometimes pulled me by my collar from the finest taverns in town! I couldn't "
"sleep! I was nervous all the time — and it started to affect my business. I "
"realized there was nothing else to do but run... Leaving her and remaining "
"in the city would be impossible. Even in such a city as "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하수프는 침을 삼키고 머리를 문지릅니다.{/n} \"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}께서 제 증인입니다. 지옥의 불길이 그 여자 "
"안에 타올랐지요. 저는 심지어 6개월도 채 그녀와 함께 살 수 없었습니다! 어느 날엔 부드럽고 욕정적이었다가, 그 다음날엔 비명을 "
"질러대고 수치스러워했습니다. 가끔은 제가 사업적인 얘기를 하던 중에 끼어들어선 질투를 해대기도 하고, 때때로 도시에서 가장 유명한 "
"선술집에서 제 멱살을 잡아당기며 고래고래 소리를 질렀죠! 저는 잠을 잘 수가 없었습니다. 항상 긴장하고 있어야만 했고, 그것이 제 사업에 "
"영향을 미치기 시작했습니다. 끝내 도망치는 수밖에 없다는 걸 깨달았습니다. 그녀와 헤어지고 도시에 계속 남아있는 것은 불가능할 겁니다. "
"하물며 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}같은 도시에서는 더욱 그렇지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "1135f740-9946-45f3-b745-8da617b3abde"
msgid ""
"\"I decided never to return. And I still fear that wildcat of a woman will "
"follow my trail!\" {n}Hassuf stops talking and stares into space without "
"blinking.{/n} \"Although sometimes, after a couple of jars of wine, I still "
"remember her... Perhaps it was I who unleashed this tornado in her? If "
"somehow I'd behaved differently...\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 돌아가지 않기로 마음먹었습니다. 아직도 그 여자가 제 뒤를 따라올까 무서워요!\" {n}하수프는 말하기를 멈추고 깜박임 없이 "
"허공을 응시합니다.{/n} \"때로는 몇 잔의 와인을 마신 후에 여전히 그녀를 생각해요... 아마 그녀 안의 폭풍을 풀어 놓은 장본인은 "
"저였을까요? 어떻게든 제가 다르게 행동했다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "2552e8ac-a4b3-408c-b8e3-87fda5feedee"
msgid ""
"\"It's been a terrible tragedy. But we've stood our ground and overcome it. "
"We now sell almost as many goods as we did before the catastrophe. And we're "
"even lacking in timber, stone and construction tools — the prices are sky "
"high!\""
msgstr ""
"\"끔찍한 비극이었습니다. 하지만 우리는 굳건히 서서 극복해냈지요. 지금음 재난이 발생하기 전처럼 많은 물품을 판매합니다. 게다가 목재, "
"석재를 비롯한 건축 자재가 부족해서 가격이 치솟고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "e0409347-c078-4f52-b113-308f2239e1bd"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem. Well, the young apprentice worked hard, saved every coin, and soon "
"managed to purchase that tannery from his former master. Then, as soon as he "
"had enough money, he opened his own trading agency. After ten years, "
"countless deals, and many tours in his caravan, Hassuf was one of the most "
"successful merchants in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} — thus writing his name "
"indelibly in the history of the great city!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에헴. 어린 수습생은 열심히 일했고 한 푼 한 푼 모아서 조만간 그 주인에게서 제혁소를 구입할 수 있었습니다. 그리고 돈이 충분히 "
"생기자마자 그는 자신의 무역소를 열었지요. 10년 후 수많은 거래를 하며 캐러밴으로 많은 여행을 하고 하수프는 "
"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에서 가장 성공적인 상인 중 한 명이 되어 그 위대한 도시의 역사에 지울 수 없는 한 획을 그었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "e9a1ab6e-8ce9-409d-b4d4-d0cb207b1214"
msgid ""
"{n}The merchant looks at you with pleasure.{/n} \"Well, how was that? I'm "
"looking for a writer so I can dictate my memoirs, ha ha. I think many would "
"find it interesting — and useful — to learn more about me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 당신을 즐겁게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"어떠십니까? 제 회고록을 받아쓰게 하려고 작가를 구하고 있습니다. 하하, 제 생각엔 "
"많은 사람들이 저에 대해 더 많이 알게 되면 재밌고 유용할 것 같더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "479d9f3f-e33d-4ee5-9a80-0499dcbe0e6f"
msgid ""
"{n}Hassuf shakes his head, surprised.{/n} \"Sharel? Robbed? Can't be! He is "
"a great young man, and a capable tailor! We agreed I will lend him money to "
"start a shop, at a humble rate of interest. But he didn't steal a single "
"coin from me! I can vouch for him — give me one moment!\" {n}Hassuf pulls "
"out a sheet of paper and scrawls out a short letter, adds his sprawling "
"signature, then hands the letter to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하수프는 놀라 그의 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"샤렐이? 도둑질을요? 그럴 리가 없어요! 그는 훌륭한 젊은이이며 유능한 "
"재단사입니다! 저희는 그가 가게를 차릴 수 있도록 적은 이자율로 돈을 빌려주기로 합의했습니다. 하지만 그는 제게 동전 한 닢도 훔치지 "
"않았습니다! 제가 그를 보증할 수 있습니다. 잠시만 기다려 주세요!\" {n}하수프는 한 장의 종이를 꺼내어 짧은 편지를 휘갈겨 쓰고 "
"거대한 서명을 추가한 다음 편지를 전달합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "9067c603-1566-4c97-8109-5de37772b9a7"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as you finish speaking, Hassuf snatches the letter from your "
"hands and immediately breaks the seal, quickly running his eyes along the "
"lines. His face grows pale, and his hands clench. He takes his time ripping "
"the letter into tiny pieces, enjoying the process.{/n} \"Damn that "
"disgusting wretch and that entire family! They decide to send me a letter, "
"as though I don't know that only poison trickles from their mouths?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 말을 마치자마자 하수프는 손에서 편지를 낚아채 즉시 인장을 떼어내고 재빨리 내용을 따라 눈을 굴립니다. 그의 얼굴은 "
"창백해지고, 손을 꽉 쥐었습니다. 그는 시간을 들여가며, 그 편지를 작은 조각까지 잘게잘게 찢어버립니다.{/n} \"이런 역겨운 자식과 "
"가족이 있나! 마치 내가 지들 입에서 독이 흐르는 걸 모르는 것 마냥 내게 편지를 보내다니?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/FirstVendor/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "d952f148-c0e9-4a3d-898a-2f80cb385e7e"
msgid ""
"{n}After calming down a bit, Hassuf turns to you.{/n} \"You probably did not "
"know what was in the letter — all the better. You shouldn't burden yourself "
"with a feud between families living on opposite sides of the world. You did "
"your part, and I am grateful to you — at least for caring to deliver this "
"letter to me, though it was written by traitors. Your intentions were pure, "
"of that I am certain.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조금 진정한 후 하수프는 당신에게로 몸을 돌립니다.{/n} \"편지에 무엇이 들어 있었는지 아마 모르셨을 겁니다. 그편이 훨씬 "
"낫죠. 세상 반대편에 사는 가족들 사이의 불화로 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 부담을 드리고 싶지는 않습니다. 당신은 당신의 역할을 "
"해주셨고, 그 점에 저는 감사를 드립니다. 비록 이 편지는 반역자들에 의해 쓰였지만, 분명 편지를 전해주신 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 의도는 순수했을거라고 확신합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_32687_Text
msgctxt "8b937fc6-1e75-49ac-a546-b30f5daab63c"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself, Jhod.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해줘, 조드.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_36403_Text
msgctxt "d3353660-d962-4466-977b-8257b50d3b10"
msgid "\"Thank you for the story. We may speak more later. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"이야기를 해줘서 고마워. 나중에 더 이야기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_36533_Text
msgctxt "edcd64bb-6aad-4001-8c18-d8819dd2f181"
msgid "\"What did you do to anger Erastil?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 에라스틸을 화나게 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_37536_Text
msgctxt "9f109dc2-df78-411a-a5c4-d2a6f53f7c94"
msgid "\"To each their own. I wanted to ask you about something else.\""
msgstr "\"사람마다 다르지. 네게 다른 것에 대해 물어보고 싶었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_40169_Text
msgctxt "3a99ba29-0674-48d9-8c48-48c6e24d64ce"
msgid "\"I see. Please continue.\""
msgstr "\"알았어. 계속 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_42918_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "508d3f42-5dfc-4750-b2bb-85b940ec8f10"
msgid "Approved of Jhod's vigilantism."
msgstr "조드의 경계심에 찬성했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_42918_Text
msgctxt "039844af-979a-44df-9fe7-c373f6ad08c0"
msgid "\"Still, you saved the village from another danger, did you not?\""
msgstr "\"그래도 너는 마을을 다른 위험에서 구했잖아. 안 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_55883_Text
msgctxt "33586a13-0fbb-4b78-a54d-6c1e00044ddd"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about your homeland, Galt?\""
msgstr "\"너의 조국, 갈트에 대해 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_66964_Text
msgctxt "6c129054-ae9e-4bb5-88ee-02c47f99331d"
msgid "\"Tell me about Erastil.\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_67507_Text
msgctxt "2463767e-7ce0-49e1-a2cb-5b1276ff9ebf"
msgid ""
"\"Wait a moment — cities have their strengths as well, don't they? "
"Civilization fosters science, trade and invention, and in that it often "
"improves life for all of us.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만. 도시는 도시만의 장점이 있어. 문명은 과학, 무역, 발명을 육성하여 우리 모두의 삶을 향상시키는 경우가 많지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_76637_Text
msgctxt "55a82ab4-acce-45ff-be1f-9a1595ff3439"
msgid "\"Enough stories for today.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 이걸로 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_81209_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1958dda3-f1ef-4835-899d-17e23e2aa394"
msgid "Disapproved of Jhod's vigilantism."
msgstr "조드의 경계심에 반대했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_81209_Text
msgctxt "6c62a5c0-c65a-45f3-ae87-56afe38cfb2e"
msgid ""
"\"You should have stayed your hand and discovered the truth before you acted."
"\""
msgstr "\"행동하기 전에 진실을 알아야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90466_Text
msgctxt "1a7c6880-b1ab-4f3f-bac3-8b2dfc5c1c97"
msgid ""
"\"I don't share your opinion. My future capital will be no village, whether "
"you like it or not. One day it will rival Absalom itself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 의견에 동의하지 않는다. 내 미래의 수도는 너가 좋아하든 말든 간에 마을이 되지는 않을 것이다. 언젠가 그것은 압살롬과 "
"경쟁할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90480_Text
msgctxt "735006f2-a22f-473e-8721-dffccdac0127"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you do have a point. Indeed, cities can be places of evil and "
"wrongdoing.\""
msgstr "\"너는 요점을 짚었다. 실제로 도시는 사악하고 잘못한 곳이 될 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90484_Text
msgctxt "a8772388-6147-4002-81cd-48eb971c5e66"
msgid "\"Do you understand the true meaning of your visions now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 네가 본 환상의 진정한 의미를 이해하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90485_Text
msgctxt "c104855f-8c36-42b0-aae8-57714e146dc7"
msgid "\"I've always had respect for Erastil and his priests.\""
msgstr "\"나는 항상 에라스틸과 사제를 존경했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90486_Text
msgctxt "b5b50eab-f0c3-47a5-a312-5cbc625be1e4"
msgid ""
"\"I've long felt that Erastil was a worthless god, and now you've made me "
"even more certain.\""
msgstr "\"나는 오랫동안 에라스틸이 무가치한 신이었다고 느꼈다. 그리고 너는 내 믿음을 더 확실하게 만들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90492_Text
msgctxt "040f4539-9924-4f1f-b704-f6e452cc9f02"
msgid "\"I see no point in arguing.\""
msgstr "\"논쟁의 여지가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90494_Text
msgctxt "126a9a5c-3ffa-431f-aba2-cfabc6bcfdbb"
msgid "\"What does Erastil demand of his faithful?\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸은 충실한 사람들에게 무엇을 요구하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90500_Text
msgctxt "816078ff-82fd-4466-b30c-04e013fc4e1f"
msgid "\"Tell me about your past.\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90501_Text
msgctxt "76649991-e983-4849-90a8-2665623857bd"
msgid "\"That's enough for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90507_Text
msgctxt "f9b55dda-8384-41bd-8497-db2348f78c90"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard of the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g} from a local "
"nymph. She believes a mad druid, who served the Stag Lord, once performed "
"his rituals there. It seems that's where the magic mist comes from.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}에 대한 이야기를 님프에게 들었다. 그녀는 사슴 군주를 섬긴 미친 드루이드가 "
"예전에 의식을 수행했다고 한다. 그곳에서 마법의 안개가 나오는 것 같다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90508_Text
msgctxt "688dc80d-7d18-45fe-a1f5-97b313b395a5"
msgid ""
"\"I went to this temple of yours, but found nothing special. Just ruins, "
"dust and desolation.\""
msgstr "\"네가 얘기했던 신전에 갔는데 특별한 것은 아무것도 발견하지 못했다. 그저 폐허와 먼지와 황무지일 뿐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90509_Text
msgctxt "dfebbb5d-15f9-4f68-902a-1d4bb1e426c1"
msgid "\"Tell me about the visions that led you to the Temple of the Elk.\""
msgstr "\"너를 엘크 신전으로 인도한 환상에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90516_Text
msgctxt "094e29be-36a0-42c2-8cdd-1e123bc6e856"
msgid ""
"\"It seems that Tristian has already told you about our adventures in the "
"Temple. Do you have any advice on what we might do next?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안이 이미 성전에서 우리의 모험에 대해 이야기한 것 같군. 우리가 다음에 할 일에 대해 조언을 해 줄 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90519_Text
msgctxt "eeb09335-bd42-4631-915e-7042b677c4bd"
msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"나한테 원하는게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90520_Text
msgctxt "a2e486e5-487a-4970-920a-157f3f5f5664"
msgid "\"That's enough about this for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 이것으로 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90522_Text
msgctxt "9c9dbfa0-2329-4315-bfcc-e9d6ce255fd8"
msgid "\"Why do you need to find this temple?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 신전을 찾으려 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90526_Text
msgctxt "32ceb4f3-79cc-404d-a709-e73f52a07ead"
msgid "\"What role might you play in my government?\""
msgstr "\"내 정부에서 너는 어떤 역할을 할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90527_Text
msgctxt "0b05ff53-b3b8-4cf5-9291-ec212ed22acc"
msgid "\"How are you enjoying your duties as the High Priest?\""
msgstr "\"대사제로서 어떻게 너의 임무를 즐기고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90533_Text
msgctxt "f35ff61e-f275-4a43-ab03-c436db3ef269"
msgid ""
"\"It's hard to tell you this, but that vision that led you to the Stolen "
"Lands...\""
msgstr "\"말하기 어렵지만... 너를 도둑 맞은 땅으로 인도한 그 비전은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90536_Text
msgctxt "14ee60e4-47ff-4ce5-a8e3-d05da9493168"
msgid "\"I need the help of a cleric.\""
msgstr "\"나는 성직자의 도움이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Answer_90537_Text
msgctxt "a9a38e2e-e3f6-4171-85ba-e9f128cce646"
msgid "\"I found the Temple of the Elk and killed the beasts there.\""
msgstr "\"나는 엘크의 신전을 발견하고 거기에 있던 짐승을 죽였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_05758_Text
msgctxt "837f2e93-23c2-4b45-a50d-5d76707c3abd"
msgid ""
"\"Of course.\" {n}Jhod nods.{/n} \"The story is a long one. Few would care "
"to listen to it all at once.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다.\" {n}조드는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"꽤 긴 이야기입니다. 누구도 한번에 듣고 싶지 않겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_05900_Text
msgctxt "93f19adb-f375-4ee9-93b9-668feeab88c4"
msgid ""
"\"Tell that to the peasant robbed of all he owns, spending his nights in the "
"gutter, hoping to live to see the sunrise. You won't see such things in a "
"village.\" {n}Jhod mournfully shakes his head.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"자기가 소유한 모든 것을 빼앗겨 배수로에서 잠을 청하고 일출을 보기 위해 사는 농민에게 말하십시오. 마을에서는 그런 일을 보지 못할 "
"것이라고.\" {n}조드는 슬퍼하며 그의 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_09852_Text
msgctxt "09b3d928-cb3c-4c67-8eb2-520ba33540de"
msgid ""
"\"My story… Why not. You deserve to know it. I am a priest of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, and {g|Galt}Galt{/g} is my homeland. You can imagine "
"what it's like — following the teachings of the Stag God in a realm torn by "
"discord and strife.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이야기라... 물론. 당신은 그걸 알 권리가 있습니다. 저는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 사제이고 "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 왔습니다. 불화와 다툼으로 찢어진 영역에서 수사슴 신의 가르침을 따르는 것이 어떤 것인지 짐작하실 수 "
"있을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_11896_Text
msgctxt "8519867d-897c-48c7-a01d-a0dc4ea04cff"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. I remind myself of this every day when I awaken, and again when I "
"go to sleep. I, who'd admonished my fellow citizens for the chaos they "
"spread and the transgressions they made. But then I myself…\" {n}Jhod "
"frowns.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그렇습니다. 저는 일어날 때마다 그리고 잠을 잘 때마다 그것에 대해 떠올리지요. 저는 자신들이 퍼뜨린 혼란과 그들이 저지른 부도덕에 "
"대해 시민들을 훈계했습니다. 그러나 제 자신은...\" {n}조드는 찡그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_12101_Text
msgctxt "2e5fd0ab-ed6e-4df3-bb1b-bcdf46b19434"
msgid ""
"\"That's still no excuse for my actions. I was a fool. I made a grave "
"mistake, and what's worse — in the eyes of my flock, I cast doubt over "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} greatness. A priest who can barely hear the voice "
"of his god is a disgrace to his Lord and himself — and corrupts the very "
"people he would save.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 행동에 대한 변명이 아닙니다. 저는 바보였지요. 저는 심각한 실수를 했습니다. 그리고 더욱 나쁜 것은 제 눈에 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 위대함에 대한 의심의 빛이 서렸다는 것입니다. 신의 목소리를 들을 수 없는 사제는 그의 신과 "
"자신에게 불명예스럽고 그가 구해야 할 사람들을 타락시킵니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_12981_Text
msgctxt "545e6efe-bd6a-4d2a-bbc7-53c3aaab2e8a"
msgid ""
"\"And so I left, and traveled far, seeking myself, and a way back into the "
"favor of the {g|Erastil}Stag God{/g}. And thus I found you, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, and thus Erastil has returned to me.\" "
"{n}Jhod sighs.{/n} \"For that blessing, I shall be forever grateful to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 저는 떠났고 멀리 여행하면서 자신을 찾으며 {g|Erastil}수사슴 신{/g}의 호의를 찾아다녔습니다. 그리고 당신을 "
"만났지요. 그리하여 에라스틸께서 제게로 돌아오셨습니다. \" {n}조드는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"그 축복을 받아 저는 당신께 영원히 "
"감사할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_15959_Text
msgctxt "fb6a4e73-e87f-4395-92f7-00bf4d9b07b2"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever the case, I knew that {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} was no longer "
"pleased with me. It was… terrifying.\" {n}Jhod's voice wavers. Even now, one "
"can glimpse inside him the remnants of the horror he lived through.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 경우든 저는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 더 이상 저와 함께 하지 않을 것을 깨달았습니다. 그것은... 무서웠습니다. "
"\" {n}조드의 목소리가 흔들립니다. 지금까지 그가 살며 겪어왔던 공포의 잔재를 그 안에서 들여다 볼 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_22559_Text
msgctxt "109b529f-3c7b-447d-93ce-3d6599a5b5ad"
msgid "\"How may I serve you, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}?\""
msgstr "\"제가 도울 일이라도 있으십니까? {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_23997_Text
msgctxt "48a297a7-27e1-482b-95d0-80b60564295b"
msgid ""
"\"For me, it is a place inhabited by the frightened and the desperate, "
"always suspicious, watchful for trickery. All too often they are deaf to the "
"voice of reason. They cannot grasp that chaos and lawlessness lead only to "
"yet more chaos and lawlessness. All my life I've tried to break through to "
"these poor people, but alas, I don't seem to have made much progress.\" {n}"
"Jhod is visibly upset, and grows silent for a while.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"제게 그곳은, 겁에 질린 자들과 절망에 빠진 자들이 사는 곳이고, 항상 의심스러우며, 서로 속이지 않을까 의심이 만연한 곳입니다. "
"그들은 이성에 귀기울이지 않습니다. 혼돈과 불법이 더 많은 혼돈과 불법을 부른다는 사실을 깨닫지 못하고 있지요. 제 평생 동안 저는 이 "
"가난한 사람들을 바꾸려 노력했지만 슬프게도 많은 진전을 이루지 못했습니다. \" {n}조드는 화가 나 보이지만 점점 조용해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_49919_Text
msgctxt "11379c3f-8d7f-4b31-be31-f89fae8f90f4"
msgid ""
"\"Led by providence, I left to gather my flock, and we surrounded the "
"tavern. The retribution...\" {n}Jhod clearly has no wish to go into "
"detail.{/n} \"The retribution was swift. However, I was tragically mistaken. "
"The young man was no werewolf. He was a bandit, sent to spy on the village "
"by one of the local gangs. We only found out after, when we went through his "
"things.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신의 섭리로 저는 양떼를 모으러 떠났고, 우리는 주점을 에워 쌌습니다. 그 보복은...\" {n}조드는 자세히 설명하고 싶어하지 않아 "
"보입니다.{/n} \"...보복은 신속했습니다. 하지만 비극적인 실수를 저질렀지요. 그 젊은이는 늑대 인간이 아니었습니다. 그는 "
"산적이었고 지역 산적이 마을을 감시하기 위해 보낸 자였습니다. 우리는 그의 몸을 꿰뚫고 나서야 그 사실을 발견했지요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_57354_Text
msgctxt "b02d38e5-53ea-4670-8860-eeb3552fd563"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod lets out a deep sigh.{/n} \"Well, if you truly wish to know… I'll "
"have to start from a long time back. Werewolves preyed upon the lands around "
"my village. They murdered people for fun or sport, and left the corpses to "
"rot on the roads. One night, they broke into a young woman's house and "
"dragged her into the streets.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"글쎄 당신이 진정으로 알고 싶다면... 아주 예전 일부터 말씀드려야 겠군요. 늑대 인간이 "
"마을 주변을 습격했었습니다. 그들은 재미로 사람들을 죽였고 시체를 길에 방치해 썩게 놔두었습니다. 어느날 밤 그들은 젊은 여성의 집에 "
"침입하여 그녀를 거리로 끌고 갔지요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_65287_Text
msgctxt "59caaacd-423f-4be5-8aa8-2098b36f90a5"
msgid ""
"\"For some, it is a land of freedom, where power belongs to the people, not "
"to lords or kings. For others, it's a land of never-ending revolution. — A "
"realm surrendered to anarchy. It depends on who you ask.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가에게는 주권이 영주가 아니라 국민에게 있는 자유로운 나라입니다. 하지만 다른 누군가에게는 끝 없는 혁명의 땅입니다. 무정부 "
"상태의 땅처럼 말이죠. 묻는 사람마다 다르게 대답할 것입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_73092_Text
msgctxt "b9101f15-95b1-45a3-aa3d-3f2040faccb1"
msgid ""
"\"For me, I found {g|Galt}Galt{/g} a…\" {n}He shakes his head.{/n} \"A "
"violent place. Crowds eager to lynch a stranger for their accent or "
"appearance. Where a single word, uttered at the wrong time or place, can "
"spark the people to riot and cities to burn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제게 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}는…\" {n}그는 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"폭력적인 장소였습니다. 억양이나 외모가 낯선 사람을 "
"린치하는 사람들이 있는 곳이었습니다. 잘못 말한 한마디가 사람들로 하여금 폭동을 일으켜 불타 버리게 하는 곳입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_73860_Text
msgctxt "66eacb4b-b1fd-488e-ae15-5d63a1862920"
msgid ""
"{n}A dark-haired man stands stooping before you. He's in his forties, but at "
"first glance he could easily be mistaken for much older. His weary face is "
"crisscrossed with innumerable wrinkles. His weak eyes squint at the light, "
"and moves his lips silently as if talking to an invisible companion. He "
"raises his head as you approach.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}검은 머리 남자가 당신 앞에서 몸을 굽히고 서 있습니다. 그는 40대 정도 되어 보였지만 언뜻보기에는 훨씬 더 나이 많은 사람으로 "
"착각 할 수 있습니다. 그의 피곤한 얼굴은 무수한 주름과 교차합니다. 그의 약한 눈은 빛을 보며 찡그렸고 입술은 보이지 않는 동행자와 "
"이야기하는 것처럼 조용히 움직입니다. 당신이 접근할 때 그는 머리를 들어올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_78754_Text
msgctxt "d68dd373-7273-4357-9fc4-0cceded24713"
msgid ""
"\"Of course!\" {n}Jhod's smile widens.{/n} \"It would be my pleasure. "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} is one of the eldest gods of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}"
". His faith emerged when the first people appeared upon the land. Erastil "
"helped our ancestors cultivate the land and hunt. Even now, his blessing "
"lies with those who uphold the old traditions and keep to simpler ways, far "
"from civilization and the noise of the city.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연하지요!\" {n}조드의 미소가 넓어집니다.{/n} \"제 기쁨이 될 것입니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}은 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 가장 오래된 신들 중 하나이지요. 태초의 사람들이 그 땅에 나타날 때 그의 신앙도 "
"시작되었습니다. 에라스틸은 우리의 조상이 땅을 기르고 사냥을 하도록 도와주었습니다. 지금도 그의 축복은 오래된 전통을 유지하고 도시의 "
"문명과는 거리가 먼 더 소박한 삶을 사는 사람들과 함께하고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_79011_Text
msgctxt "a629d301-aa36-4d9d-b36b-7d44d3b8a128"
msgid ""
"\"Rebellion and suspicion are the pillars of {g|Galt}Galt{/g}. Led by "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, I tried to guide my flock to embrace tranquility and "
"balance, and guard them from hasty judgment. — Until I fell from grace "
"myself. Foolish, foolish old Jhod!\""
msgstr ""
"\"반역과 의삼은 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 흔한 일입니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 이끄셔서 저는 저의 무리가 평온과 "
"균형을 받아들이도록 인도하려고 애썼지요... 신임을 잃을 때까지는 말입니다. 바보처럼 말이죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_87107_Text
msgctxt "b4866941-20e8-435f-9a0c-7a6d514d68f6"
msgid ""
"\"One evening, a traveler came to our tavern — tattered and dirty from days "
"on the road — like so many others roaming {g|Galt}Galt{/g}. He sat quietly "
"in the corner of the tavern, drinking cheap ale, and in an instant I knew he "
"was a werewolf. I felt it in my soul — it was like {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} "
"himself had whispered it into my ear.\" {n}Jhod smiles, but his eyes are "
"dead as stones.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어느 날 저녁, 여행자가 우리 주점에 왔습니다. 그는 길에서 며칠 동안 떠돌아 너덜너덜하고 더러워져있었지요. {g|Galt}갈트{/g}"
"의 많은 사람들이 보통인 곳입니다. 그는 싸구려 에일을 마시며 선술집 구석에 조용히 앉아 있었고 그 순간 저는 그가 늑대 인간이라는 것을 "
"느꼈습니다. 제 영혼 속에서 그것을 느꼈지요. 마치 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 내 귀에 속삭인 것 같았습니다. \" {n}"
"조드는 웃지만 그의 눈은 석상처럼 죽어있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90467_Text
msgctxt "54491498-86f2-4570-98a0-3b92323f903b"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod looks saddened.{/n} \"As you wish. Still, lend your ear to this old "
"man's words — don't brush away the wisdom of ages past. I came here to "
"spread the kindness of simple village life, which is often lost and "
"forgotten in the noise of an indifferent city.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 슬퍼 보입니다.{/n} \"당신께서 원하는대로. 그래도 이 노인의 말에 귀를 기울여 주십시오. 과거의 지혜를 외면하지 "
"마시길. 저는 소박한 마을 생활의 친절함을 전하기 위해 이곳에 왔고 무관심이 팽배한 도시에서는 소음에 그것이 잊히곤 합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90481_Text
msgctxt "8704e1eb-ca02-4295-910c-1581095b044c"
msgid ""
"\"I am glad to hear you agree. These days many are deaf to the wisdom of "
"generations.\""
msgstr "\"당신께서 동의해서 기쁩니다. 요즘 많은 사람들이 늙은이의 말에 귀를 기울이지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90482_Text
msgctxt "0bf87c0b-6c8a-4814-9aaf-ed40b7cf38ad"
msgid "\"I am happy to help.\""
msgstr "\"도울 수 있어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90487_Text
msgctxt "5f0dc9b4-8bf5-4666-9b82-9ab2f573e5e6"
msgid ""
"{n}A smile lights up Jhod's face.{/n} \"I see it more clearly every day. — "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} himself led me to meet you. Your keen spirit will "
"serve you well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}미소가 조드의 얼굴을 밝게합니다.{/n} \"저는 매일 그것을 더 선명하게 봅니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 인도하여 "
"당신을 만나게 했습니다. 당신의 날카로운 정신은 축복받았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90488_Text
msgctxt "50dc0fc8-f76c-48a6-8d5b-6a89060029a0"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod sorrowfully shakes his head.{/n} \"Alas, I must truly be an inept "
"servant, for I have failed once more to convey the wisdom of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}. I only hope that someday in the future you will "
"allow me the chance to change your mind.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 그의 머리를 슬프게 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아아. 저는 정말 몹쓸 종입니다. 또 다시 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 "
"지혜를 전하지 못하다니. 언젠가는 당신의 마음을 바꿀 수 있는 기회가 오기를 바랍니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90489_Text
msgctxt "6e823bd9-18a3-4d68-a1db-1550a842c085"
msgid ""
"\"I trust in their truth. These visions... they were the voice of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} himself, quiet, but clear.\" {n}Jhod speaks with "
"reverent awe.{/n} \"Before all this happened, I believed Erastil had turned "
"his back to me. But now I see clearly — he has shown me divine mercy, for he "
"has led me to you — and invited me to aid in a fellow priest's deliverance. "
"Lady {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} and Erastil walk the paths of the gods, hand "
"in hand, and so must their servants as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그 진실을 믿습니다. 이 환상들... 그것은 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g} 그분의 목소리입니다. 조용하지만, 명확하지요. "
"\" {n}조드는 경외심으로 말합니다.{/n} \"이런 일이 일어나기 전까지 저는 에라스틸께서 등을 돌렸다고 생각했습니다. 그러나 이제는 "
"분명해졌지요. 신의 자비를 보여주어 저를 당신께 인도해 주셨고 동료 사제의 구출을 돕게 했습니다. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}와 "
"에라스틸께서는 손을 맞잡고 신들의 길을 걸으니, 그들의 하인도 그리해야 할것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90490_Text
msgctxt "262606ea-a3d2-4211-8986-1ee08f788a13"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian is, undoubtedly, still very young, and youth is a time of naiveté "
"and confusion.\" {n}An amiable grin appears on Jhod's face.{/n} \"But I see "
"kindness and strength of spirit in him, traits indispensable to a priest. I "
"sense that all that's transpired thus far is only the beginning, and the "
"future promises great things for Tristian — and for you. This is why "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} led me to the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the "
"Elk{/g}. Day and night I pray for you, and for my young friend. May the Stag "
"God lead you down the true path!\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안은 의심의 여지없이 여전히 매우 젊고 젊음은 순수함과 혼란의 시기이지요.\" {n}조드의 얼굴에는 상냥한 미소가 "
"나타납니다.{/n} \"그러나 저는 그에게서 친절함과 강인한 정신력을 보았습니다. 사제에게 없어서는 안되는 자질이지요. 저는 지금까지 "
"일어났던 모든 것은 시작일 뿐이며 미래에 트리스티안, 그리고 당신에게 위대한 일들이 약속되어 있다는걸 느꼈습니다. 그래서 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 저를 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}으로 이끈 것이지요. 밤낮으로 당신과 "
"나의 젊은 친구를 위해 기도하겠습니다. 수사슴 신이 당신을 진실의 길로 인도하시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90493_Text
msgctxt "446a6aae-817a-4011-9390-9a627089783e"
msgid ""
"\"As you say,\" {n}replies Jhod, with just a hint of grumpiness in his "
"voice.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신의 뜻대로.\" {n}조드는 심술 궂은 목소리만 남겼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90495_Text
msgctxt "e61428b3-6ef9-441e-b20c-211697f2956b"
msgid ""
"\"My misdeeds cast a shadow over my life and service. In search of "
"redemption, and a balm for my soul, I took to the road. I had come nearly to "
"despair when {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} sent me a vision of the {g|Temple of the "
"Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g}. I knew that very moment that the Stag God had "
"shown me the way to redemption.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제의 실책은 제 삶과 봉사에 그림자를 드리웠다. 구원을 찾아 영혼의 치유를 위해 저는 길을 떠났습니다. "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서는 제가 절망에 빠져있을 때 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}의 환영을 "
"보여주셨습니다. 저는 수사슴 신께서 제게 구원의 길을 보여준 것이라는 걸 알았습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90496_Text
msgctxt "1c3337d0-1943-48bc-a453-86fd82c93ce1"
msgid ""
"\"The word 'demand' does not befit the {g|Erastil}Stag God{/g}. Honesty and "
"friendship, loving families, merry weddings and newborn children in their "
"mothers' arms — they bring a smile to Erastil's face. He loves his people, "
"and rewards them with fortunate hunts and plentiful harvests. But he has no "
"temper for sloth and vanity. He never bestows gifts upon his faithful "
"without first measuring their worthiness. We ourselves must win our daily "
"bread. But the Stag God comes to our aid in times of need and strife.\""
msgstr ""
"\" '요구'라는 말은 {g|Erastil}수사슴 신{/g}에게 어울리지 않습니다. 정직과 우정, 사랑하는 가족, 기쁜 결혼과 어머니의 "
"품에 안긴 아기와 같은 말이 에라스틸의 얼굴에 미소를 짓게 하지요. 그는 그의 백성을 사랑하며 행운의 사냥과 풍성한 수확으로 그들을 "
"보상하십니다. 그러나 그는 게으름과 허영심에 대한 자비는 없습니다. 그는 가치를 가늠하지 않고는 충실한 사람들에게 은사를 베풀지 "
"않으십니다. 우리는 매일 먹고 살아야 합니다. 그러나 수사슴 신은 필요할 때에 우리를 도우시지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90498_Text
msgctxt "57646987-76ae-4c50-bd8c-821f50c0e4ec"
msgid "\"What exactly would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 알고 싶은 게 무엇이십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90502_Text
msgctxt "459c9e00-f732-471b-b8b6-bd70a12bd5a1"
msgid "\"As you wish!\""
msgstr "\"원하시는대로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90504_Text
msgctxt "705d76a6-ff4a-48ad-8ad9-cf12ebdbd7c9"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, good traveler! My name is Jhod Kavken, I am a cleric of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, from {g|Galt}Galt{/g}. I was led to these wild lands "
"by the Stag God in a vision. He led me through the magic mist, and showed me "
"the location of an ancient forsaken site, the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of "
"the Elk{/g}. Give me a moment of your time. I would speak with you of this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반갑습니다, 친절한 여행자여! 제 이름은 조드 카브켄입니다. 저는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 성직자이자 "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g} 출신이지요. 저는 수사슴 신의 인도 아래 이 야생의 땅으로 인도되었습니다. 그는 마법의 안개를 통해 나를 "
"인도하셨고 고대의 버림받은 장소인 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}을 보여주셨습니다. 제게 시간을 준다면 설명해 "
"드리겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90510_Text
msgctxt "437b97c5-1f63-4895-9345-256920d23a7a"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod looks at you with disbelief.{/n} \"It's... Odd. Perhaps "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} requires my personal presence at the Temple... But "
"I'm sure he pointed to this place for a reason. Please, check it once more, "
"at least for my peace of mind!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 당신을 믿지 않는다든 듯 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그게... 이상하군요. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서는 제가 신전에 "
"직접 가기를 원하십니다... 하지만 분명 이유가 있어서 이곳을 기리키셨을 것입니다. 부디, 제 마음의 평화를 위해서 다시 한 번 확인해 "
"주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90511_Text
msgctxt "a197e409-9865-48dc-b08f-4f07eeca315f"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod groans with indignation.{/n} \"To defile the ancient shrine of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}! And with such unnatural magic! How could it be that "
"this druid wasn't completely exhausted?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 분노로 신음합니다.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 고대 신전을 더럽히다니! 그따위 이상한 마법으로! 어떻게 "
"이 드루이드가 탈진하지 않은 거지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90513_Text
msgctxt "64e199fc-ffca-45ef-af19-492aceb28a8c"
msgid "{d|Jhod}Jhod{/d} {n}nods warmly.{/n} \"How may I serve you?\""
msgstr "{d|Jhod}조드{/d}{n}는 따뜻하게 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"어떻게 도와드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90514_Text
msgctxt "5c959832-f7f7-4c6b-b118-3e29efd901ed"
msgid ""
"\"Imagine how my mind raced, when here, in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g}, I heard the voice of the Stag God once again! He gave me another "
"chance at service, to atone for my guilt. Now I have regained hope, and that "
"very hope is my most precious possession.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 왔을 때 수사슴 신의 목소리를 다시 한번 들은 제 기분을 상상해 보십시오! "
"그는 저의 죄를 면해주기 위해 봉사 할 기회를 다시 주셨습니다. 이제 저는 희망을 되찾았고 바로 그 소망이 내 소중한 재산입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90518_Text
msgctxt "01ed14ea-35e4-4457-97e3-eb9eb366a208"
msgid "\"That's why I'm here!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 제가 여기로 온 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90521_Text
msgctxt "4aa61e58-446d-4ee6-b6c6-1909668b0ca3"
msgid "\"As you wish,\" {n}Jhod says with a hint of grumpiness.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신의 뜻대로.\" {n}조드는 심술 궂은 목소리로 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90523_Text
msgctxt "8d208905-8781-460a-9018-05d32b17f9e1"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to understand? The gods do not send us visions for no reason."
"\" {n}Jhod folds his arms over his chest.{/n} \"We must go to the Temple. "
"Then, I believe, we shall discover the true meaning and wisdom of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해해야 할 것이 있습니까? 신께서는 아무 이유 없이 우리에게 환영을 보내지는 않으십니다.\" {n}조드는 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} "
"\"우리는 신전에 가야 합니다. 그러면 우리는 진리의 의미와 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 지혜를 발견할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90524_Text
msgctxt "36b6d771-b86f-4985-8936-4fcc54f83935"
msgid "\"I'm always glad to speak of the Stag God's teachings.\""
msgstr "\"항상 수사슴 신의 가르침을 전할 수 있어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90526_Text
msgctxt "833c1663-341f-49a6-bf0c-39aec03dfc2b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes!\" {n}Jhod shakes his head in contemplation.{/n} \"This has given "
"me much to think about. It is another confirmation that our meeting was "
"ordained by {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}. Your victory over the bandit leader has "
"only strengthened me in this belief. People like the Stag Lord disgust my "
"god. I must continue helping you as well as I can, for as long as I am able. "
"Perhaps that's why I was granted these visions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 그래!\" {n}조드는 묵상을 하다 그의 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"이 일로 많은 생각을 하게 되었습니다. 그것은 우리의 "
"만남을 미리 정한 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 계시입니다. 당신이 도적들을 토벌한 뒤로 이것에 대한 제 믿음은 더욱 강해졌지요. "
"수사슴 군주와 같은 악당은 저의 신을 싫어합니다. 제가 할 수 있는한 계속 당신을 도와야만 합니다. 아마 그것이 에라스틸께서 바라는 "
"것일테지요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90529_Text
msgctxt "f59e1fe6-33e8-4a94-8603-8899e9f3efdf"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, if there's one thing I know, it "
"is matters of faith — whether it is my own god or some other deity. If you "
"appoint me as High Priest, I'd be able to do much good. On the other hand, "
"politics, or questions of trade — I know little of such things.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 아는 것이 하나 있다면, 신앙의 문제에 대해서는 남들보다 조금 더 알 것입니다. 저를 대사제로 임명하신다면 도움이 되실 겁니다. "
"반면에 정치나 경제에 대한 질문들은... 문외한입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90531_Text
msgctxt "2b0b3f99-852a-4477-8f30-d14dad3ba652"
msgid ""
"\"Oh.\" {n}Jhod opens his mouth to say something but then changes his mind "
"and just waves his hand.{/n} \"Everything is all well, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. I just keep forgetting what a mess it is "
"in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, and how troubled are the minds of "
"its people. Sometimes I must listen to such nonsense from my visitors... "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} forgive them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오.\" {n}조드는 입을 열어 무언가를 말하려 하지만 마음을 바꾸고 손사래를 칩니다.{/n} \"모든 것이 다 잘 되고 있습니다. "
"저는 그저 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 혼란과 사람들의 괴로운 마음을 자꾸 잊어버립니다. 가끔은 제 방문객에게서 "
"그런 헛소리를 듣지 않으면 안됩니다... {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여. 그들을 용서하십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90532_Text
msgctxt "310a14f6-2704-427a-8172-6df93be691ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod shakes his head in a slow motion.{/n} \"No, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. I cannot picture myself as your advisor. "
"We disagreed too often while I was still in your service.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 천천히 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"아니요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 당신의 보좌관이 될 수 없습니다. "
"그동안 우리는 너무 맞지 않았으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90534_Text
msgctxt "0007e47c-ec14-411e-a96e-7b4943a0ac59"
msgid ""
"\"...was merely the trick of some wicked fey from the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g}.\" {n}For a second, Jhod knits his brows, but then sighs and "
"shakes his head.{/n} \"Tristian told me already, Your Grace. Looking like a "
"beaten puppy all the while. I cannot say that this late confession brought "
"me much solace…\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 단지 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 사악한 페이의 속임수에 지나지 않았습니다. \" {n}잠시 동안 조드는 "
"그의 미간을 좁히고는 한숨을 쉬며 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"트리스티안이 제게 한대 두들겨맞은 강아지같다고 얘기하더군요. 나는 이 늦은 "
"자백이 제게 위안이 된다고는 할 수 없겠군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_90535_Text
msgctxt "91aa4cd4-02c1-4535-bd55-65db1618c787"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod looks straight at you.{/n} \"Damn it all! So what if "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} didn't lead me here? I didn't do all this traveling "
"for naught. And yes, I forgave Tristian, have no doubt of that. Last thing I "
"need is to bear a grudge against that dunce.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 당신을 똑바로 봅니다.{/n} \"젠장! {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 저를 여기 이끌지 않았다면 어떻게 "
"되었을까요? 저는 무가치한 여행을 한 것이 아닙니다. 그리고 트리스티안을 용서했습니다. 완전하게 말입니다. 그 녀석을 원망해선 안되요. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_AddGoToTemple_Text
msgctxt "2acf3475-6325-4945-bfdd-4177ced57099"
msgid ""
"\"Find the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g}!\" {n}Jhod frowns.{/n} "
"\"I've pieced together its location from what I can remember of my visions. "
"I have a rough idea of where to look for the sanctuary — somewhere in the "
"North Narlmarches. However, I don't possess the strength to walk this path "
"myself. Do not reject my plea, good traveler, and I'll repay you as best I "
"can. In these dark times, people rarely help each other without "
"compensation, may {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} forgive us all. But I am sure my "
"healing abilities will be useful to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}을 찾으십시오!\" {n}조드는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"저는 제 환영에 대한 "
"기억을 더듬어 그 위치를 알아냈습니다. 날마치 북쪽 어딘가의 성소의 위치를 대강 알고 있습니다. 그러나 제가 직접 갈 여력이 없습니다. "
"좋은 여행자여, 부디 제 간청을 거절하지 마십시오. 제가 할 수 있는 한 최선을 다 하겠습니다. 이런 어두운 시기에 보상 없이 누군가를 "
"돕는 일은 드물지요. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여. 우리 모두를 용서해주십시오. 하지만 저는 제 치유 능력이 여러분에게 "
"유용할 것이라고 확신합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_ObjWeWait_Text
msgctxt "72fa4e10-cb4e-43f7-8f76-b34fd6819170"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I know, your next target looks to be the Stag Lord himself. With "
"the Temple of the Elk cleansed of evil, the fog surrounding us should "
"disperse to reveal the path to the brute's lair. Of course, magic so "
"powerful is unlikely to disappear all at once. Bide your time — follow up on "
"other concerns while you wait. I will gladly aid you on your noble quest. "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} himself foresaw our meeting.\" {n}Jhod bows "
"piously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"제가 아는 한 당신의 다음 목표는 수사슴 군주가 될 것 같군요. 엘크 신전이 악으로부터 정화되면서 우리를 둘러싼 안개가 흩어져 짐승의 "
"은신처로 가는 길을 밝혀줄 것입니다. 물론 강력한 마법은 한 번에 모두 사라지지 않을테지요. 기다리시는 동안 다른 우려 사항에 조치를 "
"취하시는게 좋을 것 같습니다. 당신의 숭고한 임무를 기꺼이 돕겠습니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 우리의 만남을 "
"예견하셨으니까요. \" {n}조드는 경건하게 경의를 표합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_TrisRescued_1_Text
msgctxt "a44b28d7-5aad-4876-9a18-fdbb2f5140ce"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} be praised, you've finally returned, my good "
"friend! Tristian told me how you helped him at the {g|Temple of the Elk}"
"Temple of the Elk{/g}. Thank you for heeding my request. My heart is calm "
"and filled with confidence that I've followed the will of my god. I would "
"like to reward your bravery. I possess no treasure, but please, take this as "
"a token of appreciation...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여 감사합니다. 마침내 돌아오셨군요, 나의 친구여! 트리스티안이 {g|Temple of the "
"Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}에서 당신이 어떤 도움을 주었는지 전해줬습니다. 제 요청을 들어주셔서 감사합니다. 제 마음은 이제 평온하고 신의 "
"뜻을 이행했다는 확신으로 가득 차 있습니다. 당신의 용기에 보답하고 싶습니다. 제게 진귀한 보물은 없지만, 부디 이것을 감사의 표시로 "
"받아주십시오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Jhod/Cue_TrisRescued_2_Text
msgctxt "4c387f25-bf56-465f-8185-df667eada356"
msgid ""
"\"I wish only thank you! You helped Tristian at the {g|Temple of the Elk}"
"Temple of the Elk{/g}. {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} teaches us to esteem those who "
"help each other, though today such unity is sadly rare — especially here in "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\" {n}Jhod shakes his head in "
"disappointment.{/n} \"I would like to reward your bravery. I possess no "
"treasure, so let my knowledge as healer serve your good cause.\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사하다는 말 밖에 할 수가 없군요! 당신은 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}에서 트리스티안을 도와주셨습니다. "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서는 서로를 도우라 가르치시지만 그러한 일은 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서는 "
"애석하게도 드문 일이지요.\" {n}조드는 실망으로 그의 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"당신의 용기에 보답하고 싶습니다. 보물은 없지만 "
"치유사로서 제 지식이 당신을 위해 쓰일 수 있도록 해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "84b29768-a721-4b87-a32c-edbd749af936"
msgid "\"I'd like to know more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 더 얘기해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "957dc2c4-d6db-473f-b14b-2cebf1790f0f"
msgid "\"A half-orc among the Brevic aristocracy is a rare sight indeed.\""
msgstr "\"브레보이의 귀족들 사이에 하프 오크는 참으로 보기 드문 인종이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4425d1ef-27e3-4d6b-a078-d05cea586578"
msgid "\"Tell me of your origins.\""
msgstr "\"너의 출신에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "90374c90-b94f-4d04-af42-d665344e4f29"
msgid "\"What's it like for you, living among humans?\""
msgstr "\"인간 사이에서 사는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "98083f42-cb7f-4680-a971-4051bbf01749"
msgid ""
"\"I need to discuss politics and affairs of the "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} with you.\""
msgstr "\"정치와 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}의 일들에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "825c3acf-fcca-4946-b5af-0d4ad07ad6be"
msgid ""
"\"You must know much of the history of Brevoy and the neighboring lands.\""
msgstr "\"넌 분명 브레보이와 이웃 나라의 역사를 많이 알고 있을텐데..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0019_Text_1
msgctxt "32ada20d-d852-465e-90bc-44c6be7f7611"
msgid ""
"\"What's the situation between the Aldori and the Royal House Surtova?\""
msgstr "\"알도리와 서토바 가문 사이의 상황은 어떠한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0022_Text_1
msgctxt "9b7dca86-f6eb-4ddf-848e-427c509c5617"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about the River Kingdoms?\""
msgstr "\"강의 왕국들에 관해 나에게 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "49e6efb9-041c-4aa0-af58-3a682f2a83dd"
msgid "\"I have questions on another topic.\""
msgstr "\"다른 주제에 대해 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "ebb741cc-64f4-4544-a7d4-b4d270439cb6"
msgid "\"I'd like to hear about the early history of Brevoy.\""
msgstr "\"브레보이의 초기 역사에 대해 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "4356c556-4650-4c6a-9e07-ec198cbf7a81"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Swordlords.\""
msgstr "\"소드로드에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "f32b0196-b754-4dea-989a-03f202b2fd34"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "f86ccdee-09de-4627-ab04-061fb57d16c4"
msgid "\"Thank you. Let's discuss something less personal.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 사적인 이야기 말고 다른 이야기를 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "6c9b8458-4517-4282-ba76-206bc706ad7f"
msgid "\"Thank you. I've learned what I needed.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 충분히 들은거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "40d50088-3340-4b02-8c4a-68797f3b4423"
msgid "\"So the baron was the first Swordlord?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그 남작은 첫 번째 소드로드가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0045_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f3637888-3eda-4125-96a4-b58ad13b80b0"
msgid ""
"Sympathized with the half-orc Kassil Aldori after hearing how society treats "
"him."
msgstr "사회가 그를 어떻게 대우하는지 듣고 하프오크 카실 알도리에게 공감했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "f9c8a2f9-c540-40c9-b915-18fd4ba3a77f"
msgid "\"I understand. It's a true shame.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이해한다. 정말 안타까운 일이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0046_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "45a55b53-48e0-428e-8082-44ea0ad24ccb"
msgid "Suggested that Kassil Aldori should accept his half-orc origins."
msgstr "카실 알도리에게 하프오크의 정체성을 받아들일 것을 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "2a6e4367-29f8-4633-82ca-e52376b43be9"
msgid "\"Wouldn't it be better to accept yourself completely as you are?\""
msgstr "\"너 자신을 받아들이는 것이 낫지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c7c624d9-1ce6-4bf0-8b65-60e652e3b461"
msgid ""
"Told Kassil Aldori that humans will never accept a half-orc as one of their "
"own."
msgstr "인간이 하프오크를 받아들일 수는 없다고 카실 알도리에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "21d29fbc-3524-4aa3-95c0-ca575f12850e"
msgid "\"People will never truly accept those like us as their own.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 우리 같은 종족들을 진정으로 받아들이지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "4fba7b0b-8a25-480f-a938-f1ea365d345b"
msgid "\"Can I rely on you in matters of state?\""
msgstr "\"국가 문제를 네게 의지할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "453b320f-20c2-4da4-9cc6-576245c8d812"
msgid "\"How do you like being General?\""
msgstr "\"장군이 된 기분은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "37794506-86cb-4881-a27f-4e36cca0a733"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil Aldori, elegantly dressed in formal clothes as always, welcomes "
"you with a courteous half bow.{/n} \"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}언제나처럼 격식 차린 옷을 품위있게 입은 카실 알도리는 정중한 인사로 당신을 맞이합니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까. "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "e7c30065-e4db-4efc-8446-aaba0e341f94"
msgid ""
"\"Happy to serve, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\" {n}Kassil bows "
"courteously.{/n}"
msgstr "\"봉사하게 되어 기쁩니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}카실은 정중히 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "e11910cd-7832-43fd-aa6c-c0af11b52d4e"
msgid ""
"\"I grew up alone on the streets of {g|Restov}Restov{/g} — I know nothing of "
"my parents. It's more than likely that my mother just wanted to be rid of me "
"— probably left me somewhere in an alley as a baby. And I don't feel I have "
"the right to blame her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 거리에서 혼자 자랐습니다. 부모님에 대해서는 아무것도 모릅니다. 우리 어머니는 제가 그냥 "
"없었으면 하셨겠지요. 아마 아기일 때 골목에 저를 버리고 떠났을 것입니다. 그리고 저 역시 어머니를 비난할 권리는 없다고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "6f7a68d6-ea85-45ab-9540-0ff0137385c5"
msgid ""
"\"I don't remember how I survived. My first memory is of sneaking into "
"someone's backyard — I must have been three or four — and trying to steal "
"food from a cat.\" {n}Kassil smiles sadly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 살아남았는지 기억은 나지 않습니다. 제 첫 기억은 서너 살 때쯤 누군가의 뒷마당에 몰래 들어가 고양이 먹이를 훔치려고 했던 "
"것입니다.\" {n}카실은 슬프게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "69a3ba3b-f71c-45e4-a8c9-6b812d2a7727"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Jamandi Aldori herself brought me into the family. She picked me up "
"off the streets when I was about fourteen. I was fighting some lord's "
"guardsmen — their master had expressed his wish, in a most inappropriate "
"manner, to acquaint me with his female wolfhound in the hopes of producing "
"offspring.\" {n}Kassil's lips turn up slightly at the corners, stopping just "
"short of looking sinister. No other sign of emotion crosses his face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"자만디 알도리님께서 직접 저를 집안으로 데려와주셨지요. 제가 열네 살쯤 되었을 때 그녀는 저를 거리에서 데리러 왔습니다. 저는 어떤 "
"귀족의 호위병들과 싸우고 있었지요. 그 영주는 저를 암컷 울프하운드와 짝짓기 시키고 싶다고 했었습니다. 어떤 새끼를 낳는지 궁금했던 "
"것이겠지요\" {n}카실의 입술은 구석에서 약간 위로 올라와 불길한 표정을 짓지 못하게 막습니다. 다른 감정의 징후는 그의 얼굴에 "
"나타나지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "aff889ce-a7e2-4ae7-ad44-f969707cc844"
msgid ""
"\"I was at what would politely be called a disadvantage when I saw a "
"flashing beam of light reflect off a lone sword. What happened next was too "
"fast for me to follow, but all three of my torturers fell to the ground, a "
"single woman standing above them. She turned to the lord and coldly asked "
"him, 'And just what is it you're doing in here?'\" {n}Kassil speaks almost "
"reverently, genuine awe in his voice.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"제가 불리한 와중에 갑자기 나타난 빛의 광선을 담은 고독한 검을 보았습니다. 그다음 일은 눈 깜짝할 사이에 일어났고 어느새 쓰러진 세 "
"명의 병사 위로 한 명의 여성이 서 계셨습니다. 그리고 그녀는 귀족에게 고개를 돌리며 차갑게 물으셨죠. '여기서 무엇을 하고 있지?' "
"{n}카실의 목소리에 경외심이 담겼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "28381511-3b67-4b0f-b191-7c871f5ccf41"
msgid ""
"\"It isn't easy, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. I was born and "
"raised in {g|Restov}Restov{/g} — I don't know a single word of Orc. I "
"devoted my entire life to proving myself worthy to bear the name Aldori. But "
"to most people, I'm still a half-orc first and foremost — anything else is "
"secondary.\""
msgstr ""
"\"쉬운 일은 아닙니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에서 태어나고 자랐습니다. 오크어는 한 "
"마디도 모르죠. 그저 알도리라는 이름에 걸맞은 사람이 되기 위해 전념했습니다. 그러나 대부분의 사람들에게 저는 여전히 하프 오크이고 다른 "
"것은 눈에 들어오지도 않을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "f1f9a225-7f38-4325-ac86-f353e53bbd81"
msgid "\"How may I be of service, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}?\""
msgstr "\"제가 어떻게 도와드리면 되겠습니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "0668d165-3ccc-4333-b0b8-ede8a5c82e3e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil's eyes light up.{/n} \"In {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, I spent nearly as "
"much time studying historical chronicles as I did training with the sword. "
"What would you like to discuss, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실의 눈빛이 빛납니다.{/n} \"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에서 검술 훈련 만큼이나 역사 연구에 시간을 쏟았습니다. 무엇을 "
"토론하고 싶으싶니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0020_Text_1
msgctxt "b9f6a523-63e8-4ef3-8c0a-a44484ce7011"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil's face remains impassive, but his speech becomes slower, more "
"deliberate.{/n} \"The {g|House Surtova}Surtovas{/g} and the Aldori are... "
"different in nature and spirit. They are as water and stone — a snake and an "
"eagle. When {g|Choral}Choral the Conqueror{/g} came to our lands, the "
"Surtovas didn't even attempt to defend themselves — they gave up the crown "
"in exchange for positions of power in the new court, along with the safety "
"of their lands.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실의 얼굴은 여전히 무표정이지만 그의 연설은 더 천천히 신중해집니다.{/n} \"{g|House Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}"
"과 알도리는... 본성과 정신이 다릅니다. 그들은 물과 돌, 뱀과 독수리이다. {g|Choral}정복자 코랄{/g}이 우리 땅에 왔을 때 "
"서토바 가문은 방어하려고 시도조차 하지 않았습니다. 그들은 왕관을 넘기는 대신 궁정에서 새로운 권력을 얻고 그들 영토의 안전을 얻었지요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0021_Text_1
msgctxt "cb0fa79e-a8d8-4a93-83cb-41e1949c92fa"
msgid ""
"\"For two centuries we've fought for survival, while the Surtovas have "
"flourished and grown stronger at the side of the throne. Needless to say, "
"now that {g|King Noleski Surtova}King Noleski Surtova{/g} and his sister "
"Natala rule over {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, our relationship hasn't improved. The "
"{g|House Surtova}Surtovas{/g} fear the Aldori, and the Aldori don't trust "
"the Surtovas — that's the current situation between our houses.\""
msgstr ""
"\"2세기 동안 우리는 생존을 위해 투쟁해 왔고, 반면에 서토바 가문은 번영하고 왕의 편에서 권력을 강화했습니다. 말할 것도 없이 {g|"
"King Noleski Surtova}놀레스키 서토바 왕{/g}과 그의 누이 나탈라가 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}를 지배하고 있는 "
"지금, 우리 관계는 나아지지 않고 있습니다. {g|House Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}은 알도리를 두려워하고, 알도리는 서토바를 "
"신뢰하지 않습니다. 이것이 우리 가문들 사이의 현재 상황입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "a5fd337b-ac68-4ad7-9168-0731996b3575"
msgid ""
"\"That's a story written in blood — Aldori blood, mostly. In the beginning, "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} was two independent lands — {g|House Surtova}House "
"Surtova{/g} reigned over {g|Issia}Issia{/g}, and the Aldori ruled "
"{g|Rostland}Rostland{/g}. They were not peaceable neighbors. Issia's soil "
"was too poor to sustain its population, and its people were too cruel and "
"proud to simply stand by and watch as their neighbors prospered.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 알도리의 피로 쓰여진 이야기입니다. 처음에 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}는 2개의 독립적인 땅이었습니다. {g|House "
"Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}은 {g|Issia}이시아{/g}를 지배했고, 알도리는 {g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}를 "
"지배했죠. 그때에도 평화로운 관계는 아니었습니다. 이시아의 토양은 너무 척박해서 인구를 지탱할 수 없었고, 사람들은 잔인하고 거만해서 "
"이웃들이 번창하는 것을 구경할 수 없었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "a97e828a-bcac-435b-b3c1-e34f219565fa"
msgid ""
"\"I'd be willing to bet that {g|Restov}Restov's{/g} northern walls still "
"hold a few marks left by {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} soldiers during their "
"frequent raids from ages past. It was {g|Choral}Choral{/g} {g|House "
"Rogarvia}Rogarvia{/g} — later known as Choral the Conqueror — who put an end "
"to all that. He brought each realm to its knees. Only, one side knelt "
"willingly — the other ended up first paying a devastating toll.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 기꺼이 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 북쪽 장벽에 {g|House Surtova}서토바 가문{/g} 병사들이 과거에 수시로 "
"기습했던 흔적들이 남아있을 거라 장담할 수 있습니다. 그것은 후에 정복자 코랄이라고 불리는 {g|Choral}코랄{/g} {g|House "
"Rogarvia}로가비아{/g}에 의해 종결되었지요. 그는 각 영역을 굴복시켰습니다. 단지 한쪽은 기꺼이 무릎을 꿇었고, 한쪽은 엄청난 "
"피해를 입었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "1c68e9de-343c-474e-ad91-6f5593b6559e"
msgid ""
"\"I could speak for days about the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}, but I'll "
"try to condense things so as not to bore Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Our history goes back to ancient times, "
"when {g|Rostland}Rostland{/g} was ruled by Baron Sirian First. He was a "
"notorious squabbler and duelist, but at the time, he wasn't as skillful as "
"he thought. After losing a fight against a local gang leader — the baron was "
"the one who issued the challenge — he went into exile to hide his shame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"충분히 며칠 동안 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}에 대해 얘기할 수 있지만 지루하지 않으시도록 간단히 말하겠습니다, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 우리의 역사는 먼저 고대에 시리안 남작이 {g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}를 지배하던 때로 "
"거슬러 올라갑니다. 그는 악명 높은 싸움꾼이자 결투가 였지만, 당시에 그는 자신의 생각 만큼 능숙하지는 않았습니다. 그는 자신이 결투를 "
"신청했던 도적 두목에게 패했고, 수치심을 감추기 위해 망명길에 올랐지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "f138f47c-3a07-464d-aa34-71565e678c45"
msgid "\"If it pleases Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 기뻐하신다면,. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "0c0e96d2-67f2-4c2f-9fc9-05208338a930"
msgid ""
"\"In times past, they were little more than a nest of bandits. Frankly, that "
"hasn't really changed.\" {n}Kassil frowns disapprovingly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"과거에 그들은 도적떼의 둥지에 지나지 않았습니다. 솔직히 지금도 별반 다르지 않지요.\" {n}카실은 못마땅하다는 듯이 얼굴을 "
"찡그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "a9845eae-d62f-492e-9a12-6ab05f0b9d22"
msgid "\"Of course, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "53413a79-cffb-4385-b6cc-f541519315de"
msgid ""
"\"But that was just the beginning! No one knows where Sirian wandered, but a "
"few years later, he returned to {g|Rostland}Rostland{/g} a changed man. He "
"challenged that same gang leader to another duel and bested him handily. The "
"baron then declared an open challenge: anyone who could defeat him would be "
"rewarded handsomely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그것은 시작에 불과했습니다! 시리안이 어디를 돌아다녔는지는 아무도 모르지만, 몇 년 후 그는 완전 다른 사람이 돼서 "
"{g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}에 돌아왔습니다. 그는 같은 도적 두목에게 또다시 결투를 신청했고 그를 이겼습니다. 그 후에 남작은 "
"공개 도전을 선언했지요. 자신을 이기는 자는 후한 보상을 받을 것이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "9da02841-ecf0-4c59-8f1d-6a27efabc3c0"
msgid ""
"\"After that, not a month would pass without Sirian seeing another "
"challenger. Renowned fighters and experienced warriors came and went, but "
"none — not a single one! — could best the baron. In those years, Sirian took "
"on his new name — Aldori. But many people preferred to call him simply 'the "
"Sword Baron.'\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 후, 시리안은 한 도전자를 상대하고 한 달도 채 되지 않아 또 다른 도전자를 맞이하였습니다. 유명한 전사와 경험 많은 투사들이 "
"수시로 왔다 갔지만, 그 누구도 시리안을 이길 수 없었습니다. 단 한 명도요! 그 해에 남작은 새로운 이름인 알도리를 사용했습니다. "
"하지만 많은 사람들은 그를 그저 '검의 남작'이라고 불렀지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "8977c4cc-53ba-4e0e-9764-d7ad02abbd23"
msgid ""
"\"The very same. His heirs inherited the secrets of his dueling style, along "
"with the name 'Aldori'. Ever since, the name has been passed down from "
"master to student along with the title {g|Swordlords}'Swordlord'{/g}. The "
"Aldori are simultaneously a family and an alliance. Swordlords will usually "
"teach their own children, but many of us were brought in from outside the "
"family. Occasionally, you can even find a half-orc fosterling or two.\" {n}"
"Kassil gives a slight bow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"거의 그렇습니다. 그의 후손들은 '알도리'라는 이름과 함께 그의 결투 스타일, 그리고 비법을 물려받았습니다. 그 이후로 그 이름은 "
"{g|Swordlords}'소드로드'{/g}라는 칭호와 함께 스승에게서 제자로 전해져 내려왔지요. 알도리는 가족이자 맹우입니다. "
"소드로드는 보통 자신의 자녀를 가르치지만, 우리 중 많은 이들이 직계 가문이 아닌 외부에서 들어온 사람들입니다. 때로는 하프오크 양자 한 "
"두명 정도는 보실 수 있지요.\" {n}카실은 가볍게 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "9555ffa6-9dea-40e6-b254-0fd186144b56"
msgid "\"My pleasure, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "3d74b652-7b16-4729-8408-0eb8e4d984f2"
msgid ""
"\"I had never seen a {g|Restov}Restovic{/g} noble so afraid — but he was "
"also almost reverent. And this lord was a close companion to the mayor, at "
"that! At the time, I had no idea who this woman was, but I couldn't keep "
"myself from rushing after her — well, hobbling, really — and pleading with "
"her, 'Teach me! Please, teach me!'\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 그 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 귀족이 두려움에 떠는 것을 보지 못했습니다만, 그때의 그는 거의 떠받드는 듯한 "
"모습이었습니다. 이 귀족은 시장과 가까운 사이였는데도 말입니다. 그리고 그때! 저는 그 여자가 누구인지 전혀 몰랐지만, 급히 그녀를 "
"절뚝거리며 쫓아갔습니다. 그리고 그녀에게 빌었죠. '제게 가르침을 주세요! 제발! 가르쳐 주세요!' 하고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "24baed85-8739-4735-9720-47e91b8379c3"
msgid ""
"\"The Aldori went to war — and lost. I dare not even say 'valiantly lost.' "
"The damage inflicted on {g|Rostland}Rostland{/g}'s armies by the red dragons "
"of {g|Choral}Choral the Conqueror{/g}... Well, it was a slaughter. A "
"crushing defeat.\" {n}A barely noticeable frown darkens Kassil's face.{/n} "
"\"Even with two centuries of effort, the Aldori and Rostland have yet to "
"fully recover.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알도리는 전쟁에서 패배했습니다. 어찌 제가 감히 '실망스러운 패배'라고 말할 수 있겠습니까만, {g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}"
"의 군대가 {g|Choral}정복자{/g}의 레드 드래곤에게 입은 피해는... 그것은 학살이었습니다. 참패였지요.\" {n}간신히 눈에 "
"띄는 찡그림은 카실의 얼굴을 어둡게 합니다.{/n} \"2세기 동안의 노력에도 불구하고 알도리 가문과 로스틀랜드는 아직 완전히 회복하지 "
"못했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "4917d8cb-4cfe-43a9-9457-a6847f96c028"
msgid ""
"\"It infuriated me when I was younger, but with age, I've learned to accept "
"my fate. To me, I'm simply Kassil, a street urchin from {g|Restov}Restov{/g} "
"who became the student of Swordlord Jamandi Aldori. Nothing more, nothing "
"less.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어렸을 때는 분노에 휘둘렸지만 나이가 들수록 저는 운명에 순응하는 법을 배웠습니다. 전 그저 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 거리의 "
"부랑아에서 소드로드 자만디 알도리의 제자가 된 카실 그 이상도 이하도 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "eeeff191-83ac-42b2-8c5e-975de2a2da46"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil shows a reserved but heartfelt smile.{/n} \"You're the ruler of "
"this realm, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Your example can change "
"the way people see those like me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실은 작게나마 진심 어린 미소를 보여줍니다.{/n} \"당신은 이 지역의 통치자이십니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 예는 "
"당신의 백성들과 신하들에게 큰 영향을 미칠 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "769c8dea-8655-4191-8b88-93b916f61b69"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps. But everyone has to answer the question 'What are you?' on their "
"own, and I have.\""
msgstr "\"아마도 그럴 겁니다. 하지만 모든 사람들이 '나는 무엇인가?'라는 질문에 대답해야 하고, 저는 대답했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "c09947a1-500d-4097-8a81-4c89ff2e64c3"
msgid ""
"\"Be that as it may, there are a select few whose opinions matter to me. I "
"don't concern myself with the opinions of anyone else.\""
msgstr "\"그렇기도 하지만, 제게는 중요한 소수의 의견도 있습니다. 저는 다른 사람의 의견에 개의치 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "7546c216-9236-4410-91cf-c799d9ea48e2"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice Kassil's eyes flash.{/n} \"Certainly, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. To the best of my ability. I've learned "
"from lady Aldori not only the art of the sword, but also the ability to "
"inspire. I could apply myself in the role of military advisor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실의 눈이 번뜩입니다.{/n} \"물론입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 최선을 다하겠습니다. 저는 자만디님에게 검술뿐만 "
"아니라 군사의 사기를 고무하는 능력 역시 배웠습니다. 군사 보좌관 역할을 할 수 있습니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "06228c6c-92a3-4511-b1a8-d6c12ff186a0"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil bows.{/n} \"I thank you for the faith you place in me. I shall do "
"my best to prove worthy of your trust.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실이 인사합니다.{/n} \"제게 믿음을 주셔서 감사합니다. 당신의 신뢰에 합당한 사람이라는 것을 증명해 보이겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "8b8d5c5f-f418-49ab-968d-d3e90fc35e4a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil frowns for a moment.{/n} \"It seems I am ill fit for state "
"service. I suppose it would be better if I continued as an ambassador for "
"Lady Aldori — and no more than that.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실은 잠시 찡그립니다.{/n} \"전 통치 업무에는 적합하지 않은 것 같습니다. 그저 알도리의 특사로서 계속 일한다면 더 좋을 "
"것이라고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/KassilAldori/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "df1ebfa0-e9f4-4ad5-8e07-f13626bd006f"
msgid ""
"\"Of all the kingdoms, {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} is probably of the greatest "
"interest. King Irovetti rose to power too quickly and too easily — I would "
"recommend Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} take great caution with "
"him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 왕국 중에서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 가장 큰 관심사이실 겁니다. 이로베티 왕은 너무도 쉽고 빠르게 권력을 잡았습니다. "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 그를 매우 조심하셔야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_69038_Text
msgctxt "0aae1535-91ff-4584-8462-826046b32b28"
msgid "\"I see. Let's discuss something other than your past.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다. 네 과거 말고 다른 얘기를 해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_84707_Text
msgctxt "38379ebd-d3c0-42c7-9ac5-720fd62930af"
msgid "\"I'll see you later. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 보자. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_85494_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6a127207-4b1a-46b7-8980-e1c77c74a81d"
msgid ""
"Asked Kesten Garess whether the girl was worth all troubles that followed."
msgstr "케스턴 가레스에게 그 여자가 따라오는 모든 문제들을 감수할 가치가 있느냐고 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_85494_Text
msgctxt "c777ccba-219e-48c8-bcf9-32a0140c46ba"
msgid "\"Well, was the girl at least worth it?\""
msgstr "\"흠, 그 여자가 그럴만한 가치가 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_91777_Text
msgctxt "52adef44-355a-4de4-8e36-e28def1b8077"
msgid ""
"\"Garess is the name of a noble house in Brevoy, is it not? You're a noble, "
"then?\""
msgstr "\"가레스는 브레보이의 귀족가의 이름이지. 아닌가? 넌 귀족이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98344_Text
msgctxt "63310c45-a94a-4b16-ba49-c8a0057e7b0a"
msgid ""
"\"Care to tell me why you were exiled? You've asked me a favor. I'd say you "
"owe me an explanation.\""
msgstr "\"왜 가문에서 추방당했는지 말해주겠나? 내게 부탁을 했었지. 그 정도는 말해 줘도 될 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98350_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bcc3cc45-bc55-4d3d-9cc7-cf619896cf02"
msgid "Disapproved Kesten's folly."
msgstr "케스턴의 어리석음을 못마땅해 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98350_Text
msgctxt "b59582d0-29a7-454d-b83a-28b62ffbf5e6"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you regret the things you've done. Duty should stand above emotion."
"\""
msgstr "\"네가 한 일을 후회하길 바란다. 의무는 감정에 치우치지 않아야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98351_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "05b8b6fb-36db-415b-9cce-15fef658c178"
msgid "Expressed no approval nor disapproval over Kesten's folly."
msgstr "케스턴의 어리석음에 동의나 부정을 표현하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98351_Text
msgctxt "6b661851-33c3-4eef-8255-9d1d6ce662fb"
msgid "\"Leave the past in the past and think of it no more.\""
msgstr "\"과거는 과거일 뿐. 더 이상 생각하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98352_Text
msgctxt "e045ccd2-d8f4-40b4-86b4-1151b18733f9"
msgid "\"I would know more of House Garess and your homeland.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가레스 가문과 너의 고향에 대해 더 많이 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98362_Text
msgctxt "9f146448-8afe-4724-bf8c-94d780a134c0"
msgid "\"Tell me of the lands you grew up in.\""
msgstr "\"네가 자란 땅에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98363_Text
msgctxt "7c32a807-185e-4d3b-93b6-6c11fa30e514"
msgid "\"Tell me of House Garess.\""
msgstr "\"가레스 가문에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98364_Text
msgctxt "6abaa078-d228-4622-9db4-6a02ac0a6e80"
msgid "\"Let's finish this conversation some other time.\""
msgstr "\"이 얘기는 다음에 하도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98373_Text
msgctxt "42c2d3f5-67e4-44ba-b2ad-0be594064b0c"
msgid ""
"\"Kesten, I failed to capture Tartuccio alive. He attacked me and was killed."
"\""
msgstr "\"케스턴, 타투치오를 생포하지 못했다. 그가 나를 공격했고, 전투 끝에 그는 죽고 말았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98378_Text
msgctxt "eb62fe18-7d57-4325-9cc1-2b3cbb426ccb"
msgid "\"What can Pitaxian spies hope to find in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스의 스파이가 도둑맞은 땅에서 뭘 찾으려 하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98380_Text
msgctxt "73c083ce-9039-493f-9684-fa6e48f8ea4e"
msgid "\"What did you do to be exiled? I believe I have a right to know.\""
msgstr "\"무엇 때문에 추방을 당했지? 내게 알 권리가 있다고 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98383_Text
msgctxt "3834c3f0-a8d9-4948-afb7-c033287dacb7"
msgid ""
"\"If I were to offer you a public position, what job would you like to do?\""
msgstr "\"네게 공직을 제의한다면, 어떤 일을 하고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98385_Text
msgctxt "6f714d9b-7768-4fc3-bdae-def1f4f7527e"
msgid "\"How are you managing the responsibilities of the main guard?\""
msgstr "\"경비대의 책무는 어떻게 관리하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98389_Text
msgctxt "ba434934-70b2-40d7-b90e-54fa88968c20"
msgid "\"How did Tartuccio manage to fool you?\""
msgstr "\"타투치오가 어떻게 너를 속였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98390_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f9aec881-29f0-45e6-8382-43b68e0ecb7e"
msgid "Showed sympathy to Kesten Garess."
msgstr "케스턴 가레스에게 동정을 보였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Answer_98390_Text
msgctxt "af891a03-7dc2-4fd3-a81e-c57a27b2d3dd"
msgid ""
"\"I'd say you deserved a better fate, Kesten. True love should not be "
"punished.\""
msgstr "\"네가 더 나은 운명을 받을 자격이 있다고 말하고 싶다. 진정한 사랑은 벌을 받아서는 안된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_13573_Text
msgctxt "4a8588a2-af27-4153-96f7-9047269002f3"
msgid ""
"\"How may I serve you, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}?\" {n}Kesten "
"nods at you, pauses a moment, then bows awkwardly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 도와드리면 되겠습니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\" {n}케스턴은 당신에게 고개를 끄덕이며 잠시 멈추고는 어색하게 "
"인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_76773_Text
msgctxt "6e6e3a56-b423-4e1e-9a99-7231d556c7a8"
msgid ""
"\"Used to be.\" {n}Kesten cringes, as if he'd bitten a sour fruit.{/n} \"It"
"'s only a name now, nothing more. The {g|House Garess}Garesses{/g} are a "
"noble family in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, they own several mines in the "
"Golushkin Mountains. My father Evan is cousin to Lord Howlan Garess.\" {n}"
"Kesten frowns.{/n} \"But he's my father no longer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"예전 일입니다.\" {n}케스턴은 신 과일을 베어 문 사람처럼 얼굴을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"지금은 이름 이상의 의미는 없습니다. "
"{g|House Garess}가레스 가문{/g}은 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 귀족이고 골루쉬킨 산에 광산을 몇 개 소유하고 "
"있습니다. 제 아버지 에반 가레스께선 하울런 가레스 경과 사촌 지간입니다.\" {n}케스턴은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"개인적으로 더 이상 "
"아버지라 부르진 않습니다만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_79992_Text
msgctxt "10f56764-379b-4d5f-8cf2-0f6738b630e4"
msgid "\"Thank you,\" {n}sighs Kesten with relief.{/n}"
msgstr "\"감사합니다.\" {n}케스턴은 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_89245_Text
msgctxt "e7713229-5bd0-479e-95e8-7eb04be4de36"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you stands a heavy-set man with grim, determined features. His "
"weathered face is crossed by several scars — yet they do little to mar his "
"appearance. His gaze is heavy, but he avoids eye contact, as if afraid of "
"unwittingly sharing whatever burden weighs so heavily upon him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}건장하고 엄숙한 남자를 마주하기에 앞서, 인생의 풍파를 겪은 그의 얼굴에는 여러 흉터가 남아있지만 그의 외모를 망치는 것 같지는 "
"않습니다. 그의 눈빛은 진지하지만 무엇이든 무의식적으로 나누는 것을 두려워하는 것처럼 눈을 마주치지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98345_Text
msgctxt "83a3421c-b874-4ce6-8b09-a9aeb15fd799"
msgid ""
"\"In any case, I brought shame upon my name, and was punished accordingly. "
"The family disowned me. I fled to {g|Restov}Restov{/g} and took up the life "
"of a simple mercenary — until I received an assignment here, in the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든, 저는 제 가문에 수치를 가져왔고, 그에 따라 벌을 받았습니다. 가문은 저를 추방했습니다. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}로 "
"도망쳐 용병의 삶을 전전했습니다. 여기 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서의 임무를 수행하기 전까지 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98346_Text
msgctxt "cdce36fb-1a4e-4c5c-8501-2024b72e6cae"
msgid ""
"{n}An uneasy grin twists Kesten's lips.{/n} \"Fair enough. For a {g|House "
"Garess}Garess{/g}, the prosperity of the house and the honor of the name "
"stands above all else. And I… I was betrothed to a widow from another noble "
"house. This union was of great importance to the family. However, three "
"months before the wedding I met a commoner girl, gentle and pure, and we "
"fell in love. I would have rather died than leave my Tania, so I decided to "
"break off the engagement with my noble bride. I could never have expected "
"what would follow…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 입술을 일그러뜨리며 불편한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다. {g|House Garess}가레스 가문{/g} "
"사람에게는 집안의 번영과 명예가 무엇보다 중요합니다. 그런 이유로... 저는 한 귀족 가문의 미망인과 약혼을 하게 되었습니다. 이 약혼이 "
"양가의 중대사임을 알고 있었지만... 결혼식 3개월 전, 저는 친절하고 순수한 영혼을 지닌 평민 소녀를 만나 사랑에 빠졌습니다. 정략결혼 "
"때문에 나의 연인, 타니아를 떠날 생각을 하니 차라리 죽는 편이 낫다는 생각이 들었죠. 그래서 약혼을 취소하기로 결심했습니다. 저는 어떤 "
"결과가 따를지 전혀 예상하지 못했고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98347_Text
msgctxt "3c6d55d0-02c2-448b-83c9-91ce395a8cf7"
msgid ""
"\"My father was furious — I'd set a pointless love affair above the "
"interests of the House. He expelled me from the family, and ordered to leave "
"our lands under threat of death. And Tania...\"{n} A shadow of a smile "
"crosses Kesten's face, only to leave it even more grim than before.{/n} \"Her"
" mother was seriously ill, and she stayed behind to care for her, rather "
"than follow me into exile. Thus, I was on my own: disgraced, without a name —"
" and without love.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아버지는 격하게 화내셨습니다. 저는 가문의 이해관계보다 무의미한 연애를 더 중요시했으니까요. 아버지께서는 저를 가문에서 추방하며 죽기 "
"싫으면 고향에서 떠나라고 명하셨습니다. 그리고 타니아는...\" {n}그늘진 미소가 케스턴의 얼굴을 교차하며 이전보다 훨씬 더 "
"암울해집니다.{/n} \"그녀의 어머니는 중병을 앓고 계셨고, 저를 따라 떠나기보다는 어머니를 위해 남았습니다. 그래서, 저는 가문도 "
"잃고, 사랑도 잃고 망신만이 남았지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98348_Text
msgctxt "4602b603-65cc-403d-9628-d468d942ee13"
msgid ""
"\"Don't imagine that I ask for pity,\"{n} Kesten remarks in a somber "
"tone.{/n} \"Everyone gets what they deserve.\""
msgstr ""
"\"동정은 안 하셔도 됩니다.\" {n}케스턴은 침울한 말투로 말했습니다.{/n} \"모든 사람은 자기 분수에 걸맞은 삶을 사니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98353_Text
msgctxt "bcd3cbff-76aa-4628-8b23-0f0101c0b607"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten sighs, then says abruptly:{/n} \"I would never have left her of my "
"own accord.\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 한숨을 쉬고는 갑자기 말합니다.{/n} \"저는 절대 제 의지로 그녀를 떠나지 않았을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98354_Text
msgctxt "a01e3e3e-6f30-476f-8d5e-01f36f5e1675"
msgid ""
"\"Fairness befits a ruler,\" {n}Kesten replies softly.{/n} \"Be sure — I've "
"learned my lesson well.\""
msgstr "\"공정은 지배자에게 걸맞은 덕목이지요.\" {n}케스턴은 부드럽게 대답합니다.{/n} \"확실히 저는 교훈을 얻었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98355_Text
msgctxt "2a1de850-2e8f-4643-93c8-5b7d15a2b0f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten frowns.{/n} \"That's no simple task. It's not only the love of a "
"woman and a family that I've lost. I had a place in life, a purpose. Once "
"such things are lost, they're hard to find again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그리 단순히 말할 일이 아닙니다. 저는 연인과 가족의 사랑만을 잃은게 아닙니다. 저는 삶의 터전, "
"목적을 가지고 있었습니다. 그런 것들은 잃어버리면 다시 찾기가 힘들지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98357_Text
msgctxt "9f039905-72da-49a8-8f70-f58421a8ce3c"
msgid ""
"\"The sly bastard has caused us no little trouble, that's for sure.\" {n}"
"Kesten frowns.{/n} \"When he showed up in {g|Restov}Restov{/g} and announced "
"he's going to join the expedition, nobody suspected a thing. Yes, a gnome. "
"Yes, a sorcerer… But so what? Even after that terrible night some of my "
"people were willing to bet money on you being the spy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 교활한 놈이 우리에게 적지 않은 손실을 끼친 것은 확실합니다.\" .{n}케스턴은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그가 "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에 나타나 원정대에 참여하겠다고 했을 때, 아무도 의심하지 않았습니다. 네, 그 노움 소서러 "
"말입니다... 하지만 그 끔찍한 습격 이후에도 몇몇 사람들은 당신이 스파이라는 데에 기꺼이 돈을 걸었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98358_Text
msgctxt "6f7a4572-f4a7-45e0-b572-a98a4b13497d"
msgid ""
"\"His overconfidence was his downfall. Tartuccio's henchmen, it seems, "
"imagined they could safely meet with {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} spies in the "
"town's seedy underbelly. But {g|Restov}Restov{/g} is the ancestral home of "
"the Aldori, and Lady Jamandi is respected not only by the aristocracy and "
"the common folk, but also by those on the other side of the law.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그의 거만함이 몰락의 원인이었습니다. 타투치오의 부하들은 마을의 빈민굴에서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 첩자들을 안전하게 만날 수 "
"있을 거라 생각한 것 같습니다. 그러나 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}는 알도리 가문의 고향이며 자만디님께서는 귀족과 시민뿐만 아니라 "
"무법자들에게도 존경받고 계시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98359_Text
msgctxt "ccf39807-b0a3-43ad-bd5b-3943008c3a8f"
msgid ""
"\"We received a message from the slums. A good friend, who wished to remain "
"anonymous, suggested the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} take a closer look at "
"a certain guest from {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. Jamandi immediately sent for me, "
"and ordered me to capture the spy — all very quietly, of course. He told us "
"everything — and not only about Tartuccio. I doubt that Irovetti was pleased "
"to hear of his agents' failure.\" {n}A nasty grin crosses Kesten's face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 빈민굴에서 전갈을 받았습니다. 익명의 어떤 친구가 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}께서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 "
"어떤 손님을 주시해야 한다고 제안했지요. 자만디님은 즉시 저를 보내시며 은밀하게 스파이를 잡아오라고 명령하셨습니다. 그 스파이는 우리에게 "
"타투치오뿐만 아니라 모든 것에 대해 얘기해주었습니다. 이로베티가 그의 요원이 실패한 소식을 듣고 기뻐했을지 의문이군요.\" {n}고약한 "
"미소가 케스턴의 얼굴에 나타납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98360_Text
msgctxt "b7baf297-78b0-40f6-82c7-d9ceea82bebc"
msgid "\"Well then, ask away.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 물어보십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98365_Text
msgctxt "341b9a90-5b57-452b-9be4-ae8e2346ae89"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하시는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98366_Text
msgctxt "315bbe32-dd79-412a-b68f-e7f2324b0b58"
msgid ""
"\"{g|House Garess}House Garess{/g} owns a number of valleys and gorges in "
"the Golushkin mountains. The landscape makes these places easily defensible, "
"and they're rich in ores and everything else the depths of the earth have to "
"offer. It is a place of rare beauty,\" {n}Kesten sighs.{/n} \"When I moved "
"to {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, I couldn't get used to it for a long time — there "
"was nothing but sky between the rooves. No mountain peaks anywhere in sight."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|House Garess}가레스 가문{/g}은 골루쉬킨 산의 수많은 계곡과 협곡을 소유하고 있습니다. 그 지역은 천혜의 "
"요새인데다, 지하에 광석이 아주 풍부하고, 이 땅에서 보기 드문 아름다움을 지닌 곳입니다.\" {n}케스턴이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} "
"\"그래서인지 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에 처음 왔을 때 한동안 적응이 힘들더군요. 산봉우리 하나 없이, 지붕 위로 너른 하늘만 "
"보이니 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98367_Text
msgctxt "4a18f950-f316-4306-b9b4-ff6dd8eb588c"
msgid ""
"\"It is an old and renowned family, one of the most influential in "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. A long time ago, the {g|House Garess}Garess house{/g} "
"entered a pact with the dwarven clan of Golka. This proved to be of great "
"benefit to both parties, and they've supplied the ore for our forges ever "
"since. Lord Howlan even took the son of the dwarven leader as his ward. Who "
"would've known where this would lead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"유서 깊은 명문가입니다. {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 가장 영향력 있는 가문 중 하나지요. 오래전 {g|House "
"Garess}가레스 가문{/g}이 골카 클랜의 드워프와 협약을 맺었습니다. 양측에 이익이 되는 거래라, 지금까지도 가레스 가문 대장간에 "
"광석을 공급하고 있습니다. 하울런 경은 드워프 지도자의 아들을 양자로 삼기도 했죠. 상황이 이렇게 될 줄은 몰랐겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98368_Text
msgctxt "b15ff674-5f2a-413c-b0e9-c0a3f9df0488"
msgid ""
"\"The same winter that {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} lost the {g|House "
"Rogarvia}Rogarvia{/g} dynasty, Howlan's only natural son, Bren, went missing "
"in the mountains. Thus, Toval Golka, the lord's dwarven ward, became heir to "
"{g|House Garess}house Garess{/g}. The lad has it tough though. Too many "
"believed Howlan should have chosen someone of his own blood to be the heir. "
"I would imagine my own father had similar plans for me... but we all know "
"how that went.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 {g|House Rogarvia}로가비아{/g} 왕조가 사라졌던 해 겨울에 하울런의 친자, "
"브렌이 산에서 실종되었습니다. 그래서 드워프인 토발 골카를 {g|House Garess}가레스 가문{/g}에 양자로 들였죠. 토발은 힘든 "
"시기를 겪었습니다. 후계자는 하울런의 피를 이은 친자여야 한다고 고집하는 사람이 너무나 많았으니까요. 제 아버지 역시 비슷한 생각을 "
"하셨습니다만... 결국 어떻게 됐는지는 모두가 알고 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98369_Text
msgctxt "5d8a87b2-084c-480c-8b45-4d2db7c05527"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings!\" {n}Kesten Garess, the former captain of Jamandi Aldori's "
"personal guards, nods to you, as though you'd seen each other in Restov only "
"yesterday. He limps noticeably, and his clothes are stained with blood — and "
"looks every bit as grim and focused as when you first met. But this time you "
"also sense a hint of excitement in his eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까!\" {n}자만디 알도리의 경비 대장이었던 케스턴 가레스가 마치 어제 레스토프에서 만난 것처럼 경례합니다. 그는 눈에 "
"띄게 다리를 절뚝거리고, 옷은 피에 물들어 있지만 처음 만난 그날처럼 엄숙한 태도를 유지하고 있습니다. 그러나 이번에는 그의 눈에서 "
"흥분감이 느껴집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98370_Text
msgctxt "e345d2cf-ca8c-472b-9c78-8c2a550574e9"
msgid ""
"\"I have urgent news from {g|Restov}Restov{/g}. The investigation that I've "
"conducted at lady Jamandi's orders have proved your innocence. Tartuccio "
"was, and still is, the {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} spy. That dreadful night, it "
"was him who had opened the gate and let the assassins in. It appears that he "
"planned to gain the barony and Aldori's support, only to later place these "
"lands under the command of his true patron. King Irovetti is no stranger to "
"intrigue, and likes to use others to do his dirty work.\" {n}Kesten "
"winces.{/n} \"Anyway, lady Jamandi sends her apologies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}로부터 긴급한 소식이 있습니다. 자만디님의 명령으로 진행된 조사로 당신의 결백을 확인했습니다. "
"타투치오가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 스파이였습니다. 그날 밤 문을 열어 암살자들을 들여보내 준 사람은 바로 그였습니다. 그는 "
"남작령을 장악하고 알도리의 지원을 받으려 그런 일을 계획한 것 같습니다. 나중에 이 땅을 그의 배후에게 바치고자 그랬던 것이죠. 이로베티 "
"왕은 권모술수에 능한 사람이고 더러운 일에 타인을 이용하기를 좋아합니다.\" {n}케스턴은 움찔합니다.{/n} \"어쨌든 자만디님께서 "
"사과의 뜻을 전하셨습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98371_Text
msgctxt "18323852-e54d-4349-84e0-b004abd70179"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Jamandi ordered me to capture Tartuccio. We were following his trail "
"when that damned mist fell. First we entirely lost our way, and then "
"stumbled right into a bandit ambush. Alas, nearly all my people were "
"wounded, and can go no further. And so I am here, asking for your aid. I'll "
"point out on the map where Tartuccio is supposed to be. Bring that scum to "
"{g|Oleg's Trading Post}Oleg's Trading Post{/g}, dead or alive. "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} will not forget this favor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자만디님은 제게 타투치오를 잡으라고 명령하셨습니다. 그의 뒤를 쫓던 도중, 빌어먹을 안개 속에서 길을 잃었습니다. 그러다 도적떼의 "
"매복을 받게 되었죠. 하아, 제 부하들은 거의 다 부상을 당했고, 더 이상 나아가기 힘든 상황입니다. 그래서 도움을 요청하고자 합니다. "
"타투치오가 있을 법한 장소를 지도에 표시해 드리겠습니다. 죽이던 살리던 그 쓰레기 녀석을 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}올렉의 "
"교역소{/g}로 데려와주십시오. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}는 이 호의를 잊지 않을 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98372_Text
msgctxt "1520ae62-1ccf-4db3-9c06-d8238b3f04e0"
msgid ""
"\"We almost had Tartuccio cornered when this damned mist fell. First we "
"entirely lost our way, and then stumbled right into a bandit ambush.\" {n}In "
"an angry gesture, Kesten chops the air with his hand.{/n} \"My people can "
"barely stand, so I would be grateful if you help us to capture this "
"Tartuccio. He must be somewhere nearby. Bring that scum to {g|Oleg's Trading "
"Post}Oleg's Trading Post{/g}, dead or alive. The {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}"
" will remember this favor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"타투치오를 궁지로 몰아넣기 직전 빌어먹을 안개에 둘러싸였습니다. 처음엔 길을 잃어 버렸고 헤매다 도적에게 습격을 당했습니다.\" {n}"
"성난 몸짓으로 케스턴은 손으로 허공을 칩니다.{/n} \"제 부하들은 더 이상 나아갈 수 없는 상황이니 이 타투치오를 대신 잡아주시면 "
"감사하겠습니다. 죽이든 살리든 그 쓰레기 녀석을 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}올렉의 교역소{/g}로 데려와 주십시오. "
"{g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}는 이 호의를 잊지 않을 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98374_Text
msgctxt "2c336652-256c-46df-83ce-58204700f604"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten sighs.{/n} \"Well, this is not the best outcome, but I think it "
"will be good enough for Jamandi. Take this as a reward for your help. I'll "
"send word to {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, and let them consider how they might "
"return the favor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"이게 최선의 결과는 아니지만 자만디님에겐 충분할 듯합니다. 일단 도움에 대한 보상으로 이것을 "
"드리겠습니다. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에 전령을 보내서 어떻게 제대로 호의에 보답할지 고려하도록 하겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98379_Text
msgctxt "55eb8cbf-7509-411b-b4e2-3a17820fe8ad"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} spies are much like magpies. They'll grab anything "
"that catches their eye. Information, treasure, artifacts. This time King "
"Irovetti had a chance to seize the entire {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} "
"region — and at the Aldori's expense. I'll give you some advice for the "
"future — be wary of the Pitaxian king. He's truly a snake of a man.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 첩자는 까치와 많이 닮았습니다. 눈에 보이는 건 뭐든지 잡아채죠. 정보, 보물, 유물 전부 말입니다. "
"간첩을 통해 이로베티 왕은 알도리의 비용을 이용해 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g} 전 지역을 장악할 기회를 가질 수 "
"있었습니다. 그는 정말로 뱀 같은 자입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98382_Text
msgctxt "c9b8b843-39d1-448d-a6a1-ba86d7ba9d80"
msgid ""
"\"Once again, I thank you for your help. I'll remain here until my men "
"recover from their wounds. Meanwhile, we'll help guard the {g|Oleg's Trading "
"Post}trading post{/g} and fight off any bandits, should they return. Good "
"luck in all your plans and endeavors!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 한번 당신의 도움에 감사드립니다. 전 일단 제 부하들의 부상이 호전될 때까지 여기서 머무를 생각입니다. 그동안 {g|Oleg's "
"Trading Post}교역소{/g}를 지키며 도적을 물리치겠습니다. 당신의 계획과 노력에 행운을 빕니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98386_Text
msgctxt "89c01372-5f21-4ce4-ae53-5be1d9c426f7"
msgid ""
"\"I believe I can manage to uphold the law. Being a Warden would suit me "
"well.\""
msgstr "\"저는 법질서를 유지시키는 데에 도움이 될 것입니다. 감시관이 제게 잘 어울리겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98387_Text
msgctxt "d47bb266-447c-4e0e-8533-e7e41bbb9089"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten hesitates, carefully choosing his words.{/n} \"As you know, this "
"land is quite a troublesome place. But as long as its people trust their "
"guards, at least a bit, and as long as those guards are loyal to their "
"ruler, then we'll be able to deal with any trouble that comes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 신중하게 자신의 말을 고르는 듯 주저합니다.{/n} \"당신도 알다시피, 이 땅은 꽤 골치 아픈 곳입니다. 그러나 사람들이 "
"경비병들을 신뢰하고, 경비병들이 통치자에게 충성하는 한, 우리는 무슨 문제가 닥치든 대처할 수 있을 것입니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98388_Text
msgctxt "8ea2b461-d069-4e15-b198-e1a9e6d67a79"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}…\" {n}Kesten falls silent, trying "
"to choose the right words.{/n} \"I have already failed at keeping this land "
"secure. You'd better find someone who can succeed where I have failed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}... \" {n}케스턴은 침묵하며 올바른 말을 고르려고 노력합니다.{/n} \"저는 이 땅을 "
"안전하게 유지하는 데 이미 실패했습니다. 저 말고 성공할 수 있는 다른 사람을 찾는 것이 좋겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Kesten/Cue_98391_Text
msgctxt "3ab5e24d-f50b-44f0-bc47-1c544f5bd241"
msgid "\"What's done is done.\" {n}Kesten lowers his head.{/n}"
msgstr "\"끝난 일은 이미 끝난 것입니다.\" {n}케스턴이 머리를 숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_15401_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "927423de-7bef-435f-be88-d187df7899fc"
msgid "Let Lander's faux pas slide."
msgstr "렌더의 무례를 내버려 뒀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_15401_Text
msgctxt "f33c67b8-8109-48b2-80e0-6fcd4f95b26a"
msgid "\"You certainly seem to be in high spirits.\""
msgstr "\"기분이 좋아 보인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_21700_Text
msgctxt "dbc0bf8d-a155-4c1b-a1a5-dc86069d04f5"
msgid "\"Any news from Brevoy?\""
msgstr "\"브레보이에서 소식 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_27903_Text
msgctxt "732b734b-c8f8-4a95-9bab-f07a4d7c85d4"
msgid "\"Any advice for me, Lander?\""
msgstr "\"랜더, 나에게 어떤 충고라도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_48279_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e1c83690-36e5-4c3d-971e-df089c7909ab"
msgid "Threatened Lander Lebeda because of his disregard to your title."
msgstr "랜더 레베다가 당신의 작위를 무시했기 때문에 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_48279_Text
msgctxt "a5aba884-9312-4da1-a637-62c83a68c8d9"
msgid ""
"\"You'll address me by my proper title, unless you wish to end up as the "
"court jester.\""
msgstr "\"궁정 광대가 되고 싶지 않으면 나를 제대로 불러라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_62583_Text
msgctxt "1eb49c3c-e001-4371-98ec-ea6a7ef52edd"
msgid "\"We'll speak later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_88328_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "036de267-ae80-4ee0-a34e-a092815f9f11"
msgid "Corrected Lander's faux pas."
msgstr "랜더의 실수를 바로잡았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_88328_Text
msgctxt "d1d8df4e-a503-43e0-a8d3-42798583f681"
msgid "\"Greetings... 'Your Grace.'\""
msgstr "\"예의 바르게 말해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_95563_Text
msgctxt "f8360260-0858-479d-8a0c-ed9491b8fca5"
msgid "\"You will return home eventually, won't you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 결국 집으로 돌아갈 거야. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97146_Text
msgctxt "ff87c4fe-8df0-461a-b384-0c887dd0bf0c"
msgid "\"I'd like to learn more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 더 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97147_Text
msgctxt "6af0421e-c4a9-47d2-8bad-a37b56d220a6"
msgid "\"I need to discuss politics and affairs of the barony with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 정치 문제와 영지에서 벌어진 일들에 대해 너와 의논해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97150_Text
msgctxt "51a98339-43c7-4391-b681-0d4120c6f0ca"
msgid ""
"\"What's going on between the Royal House Surtova and the Aldori Swordlords?"
"\""
msgstr "\"서토바와 알도리 소드로드 사이에서 어떤 일이 벌어지고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97153_Text
msgctxt "a2adeefc-80bc-471a-894b-358e29a43918"
msgid ""
"\"What's my barony's role in the Surtova-Aldori conflict? I'm certain "
"they'll keep trying to win my support.\""
msgstr "\"두 가문의 갈등 속에서 나의 역할은 무엇이지? 그들은 나를 끌어드리려고 계속 노력할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97158_Text
msgctxt "1cc021db-bef1-4b79-a6a0-1fe11291df47"
msgid "\"Tell me about your family.\""
msgstr "\"네 가문에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97159_Text
msgctxt "2c4a528f-00f3-426c-8e36-250510aa7790"
msgid "\"Judging by that story, it seems no one is truly close to you.\""
msgstr "\"그 이야기로 판단하면 아무도 진정으로 너와 가깝지 않은 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97164_Text
msgctxt "a648a986-28b0-4b42-8de3-2575132011b1"
msgid "\"What do you value most in people?\""
msgstr "\"사람들에게 가장 가치있는 것은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97168_Text
msgctxt "2eaf6273-25f0-4e90-b654-fe1d485c3fae"
msgid "\"What can you tell me of the River Kingdoms?\""
msgstr "\"강의 왕국들에 관해 나에게 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97170_Text
msgctxt "d1b2ed20-cb42-4223-8b42-d332f6a45891"
msgid "\"That's enough business for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97172_Text
msgctxt "49d5c120-5172-4597-b691-b6c25fceacce"
msgid "\"Let's return to this conversation later.\""
msgstr "\"다른 시간에 이 대화를 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97174_Text
msgctxt "0390a678-463d-41d3-a375-f29300c1f000"
msgid ""
"\"If I decided to entrust you with some part of the barony's governance, "
"what role would you be able to assume?\""
msgstr "\"만일 내가 영지 통치 구조의 일부를 네게 위탁하기로 결정했다면 너는 어떤 역할을 맡을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97175_Text
msgctxt "f03b6799-6f9d-4030-9598-5cdd3de2f7a1"
msgid "\"How do you like being Regent?\""
msgstr "\"섭정이 된다는 건 어떤 기분이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Answer_97179_Text
msgctxt "26d51725-7360-4004-b370-e9e4459cdb6a"
msgid ""
"\"You came of age two years ago. Why, Lebeda, are you still heir to the "
"throne, and not sitting upon it yourself?\""
msgstr "\"너는 2년 전에 성년이 되었다. 레베다 너는 왜 왕좌에 앉지 않고 여전히 상속인인 것이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_02471_Text
msgctxt "87e6ecb3-36cc-42eb-8fc2-db5f32c7f92a"
msgid ""
"\"Take care around Sir Stefano. On his way from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} to "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and he happens here by chance? Unlikely. Very unlikely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}로 가는 동안 스테파노 경을 주시해라. 그가 여기에 올 확률이 "
"있을까? 아닐 거야. 그렇지 않다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_05233 1_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8b8a6259-ac87-43c1-83b0-202fd9b702c1"
msgid ""
"\"I promised you nothing more than to reflect on your proposal. Now, I've "
"far more compelling business to attend to this evening... as well as those "
"that follow, for that matter.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그저 너의 제안을 검토했을 뿐이다. 이제 나는 오늘 저녁에 치룰 일을 추진하고 있다... 그 문제는 다음이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_05233_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Capital
msgctxt "b312cf5d-67e1-46cb-aa7a-f82011a400c9"
msgid ""
"\"I promised you nothing more than to reflect on your proposal. Now, I've "
"far more compelling business to attend to this evening... as well as those "
"that follow, for that matter.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그저 너의 제안을 검토했을 뿐이다. 이제 나는 오늘 저녁에 치룰 일을 추진하고 있다... 그 문제는 다음이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_08146_Text
msgctxt "2a0e6e1d-9936-4112-ac56-cdfbe8c3ceaf"
msgid ""
"{n}A tall young man of about seventeen stands before you. He's athletic, and "
"his composure and bearing hint at nobility. A faint smile curves his lips, "
"but his gaze remains cold and examining.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}17살 쯤 되어보이는 키가 큰 청년이 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 그는 운동 능력이 뛰어나고 그의 침착함은 귀족임을 암시합니다. 희미한 "
"미소로 그의 입술이 올라가지만 그의 시선은 차갑게 주위를 훑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_09926_Text
msgctxt "63bd2ee6-7f9b-4ceb-b2df-4c046852e250"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! Can't let a throne sit empty, after all. Especially not one so "
"wealthy.\" {n}Lander's eyes gleam.{/n} \"I will return. Someday. But for "
"today, my house can wait.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론! 왕좌를 비워 둘 수는 없다. 그렇게 좋은 자리를 내가 왜?\" {n}랜더의 눈빛이 빛납니다.{/n} \"나는 언젠가 돌아갈 "
"것이다. 하지만 오늘은 기다릴 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_32816_Text
msgctxt "8644eece-5242-402a-ba34-8a79bd80c6da"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, Lander stops studying his fingernails, his broad smile "
"revealing brilliant white teeth.{/n} \"Ah, greetings!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 랜더는 손톱 손질하던 것을 멈추고 빛나는 하얀 이빨을 드러내며 넓은 미소를 보입니다.{/n} \"여어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_41282_Text
msgctxt "0f9cab13-e0e3-41e7-9d4e-64623076bf54"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, apologies! Just where are my manners today?\" {n}Lander laughs, still "
"with no mention of your title.{/n} \"I must have my head in the clouds today."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 미안! 내가 오늘 좀 싸가지가 없었나?\" {n}랜더는 여전히 예의없이 웃습니다.{/n} \"다른 생각을 하다보면 그럴 수도 "
"있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_46843_Text
msgctxt "f3065e81-5891-4705-aa76-a549ff9027d2"
msgid ""
"\"Another time, then — but I shall certainly hold you to your promise when I "
"return.\" {n}Lander bows slightly and winks.{/n} \"And as the poets say, "
"anticipation fuels passion's flame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다음에 내가 돌아올 때는 약속대로 할게.\" {n}랜더는 약간 숙여 인사하고 윙크합니다.{/n} \"시인들의 말처럼 기대는 열정의 "
"불꽃을 불러온다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_48232_Text
msgctxt "ea7332eb-ece2-47c5-a799-8ab21f05fb4a"
msgid ""
"\"Jhod Kavkhen seems like a kindhearted old man, but I'd definitely keep an "
"eye on him. From {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, no? Never much cared for {g|Galt}Galt{/g}"
". Revolution and insubordination runs deep in the blood of its people.\" {n}"
"Lander narrows his eyes.{/n} \"He doesn't look like a spy, though. Seems to "
"lack the subtlety for the job. But does he really?\""
msgstr ""
"\"조드 카브켄은 친절한 노인처럼 보이지만 나라면 그 사람을 주시할 것이다. {g|Galt}갈트{/g} 사람인가? "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}는 절대로 신경 쓰지 않았다. 혁명과 반항의 피가 그 사람들에게 흐르고 있다. \" {n}랜더의 눈이 "
"좁아집니다.{/n} \"그는 스파이처럼 보이지는 않는다. 직업에 대한 미묘함이 부족한 것 같다. 하지만 정말로 부족한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_53069_Text
msgctxt "57b70851-a3a3-4743-9b7c-1d2a925020ea"
msgid ""
"\"I've met Kesten {g|House Garess}Garess{/g} before. He was an amiable, "
"gregarious man — not at all like he is now.\" {n}Lander sighs.{/n} \"Now "
"he's a broken man. And I don't consider it wise to trust broken people with "
"important positions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전에 케스턴 {g|House Garess}가레스{/g}를 만난 적이 있어. 쾌활하고 사교적인 사람이라는 인상을 받았지. 지금은 전혀 "
"아닌 것 같지만.\" {n}랜더가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"케스턴은 가문의 오점이라네. 현명한 사람은 실패자에게 요직을 맡기지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_55422_Text
msgctxt "545d8d9b-0b62-4a5e-ab5a-0dcfb95ec06e"
msgid ""
"\"{g|House Lebeda}House Lebeda{/g} remains neutral — for now, at least. But "
"rest assured, once I return home, we'll wholeheartedly support the "
"friendship between our nations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|House Lebeda} 레베다{/g} 가문은 중립 상태로 남아 있다. 일단은. 그러나 내가 집에 돌아가면 우리 간의 우호를 "
"진심으로 지지할 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_60130 1_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ee47303b-8c3c-4d74-9864-e37095305100"
msgid ""
"\"Or quenches them, I pray.\" {n}Valerie rolls her eyes as she turns "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아니면 수탈하던가.\" {n}발레리가 돌아서면서 무안한듯 눈알을 이리저리 굴립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_60130_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Capital
msgctxt "827801fa-fce2-4de8-abbb-2caa37c0c489"
msgid ""
"\"Or quenches them, I pray.\" {n}Valerie rolls her eyes as she turns "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아니면 수탈하던가.\" {n}발레리가 돌아서면서 무안한듯 눈알을 이리저리 굴립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_62947_Text
msgctxt "c31399ec-8772-4ec3-a468-9ce085ce8f02"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander smiles broadly.{/n} \"Oh, many — and ripe ones, at that. It seems "
"{g|House Surtova}House Surtova{/g} has lost face, my friend. And the reason? "
"Your barony! Created with the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}' and {g|House "
"Lebeda}House Lebeda's{/g} money, it's growing quickly — soon it will become "
"a power all the noble houses will be forced to recognize. A wind of change "
"is blowing across {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, and that wind is us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더는 넓은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"오. 무르익은 녀석들이 많군. {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g} 가문은 체면을 "
"잃은 것 같다. 그 이유는? 네 영지 때문이지! {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}와 {g|House Lebeda}레베다{/g}의 "
"자금력으로 빠르게 성장했다. 모든 귀족들은 우리의 힘을 무시 못할 거다. 변화의 바람이 불고 있다. {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 "
"바람은 우리다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_65151_Text
msgctxt "185fee9b-c0db-4611-a58a-4b003f130dfd"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander's face turns bright red, but his manners prevail as the young "
"aristocrat bows.{/n} \"I had believed that... Well, no matter. I shall never "
"again make such an untoward mistake. Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더의 얼굴은 붉어지지만 젊은 귀족들이 그러하듯 예절을 지킵니다.{/n} \"나는 그걸 믿었다... 상관 없다. 나는 그런 쓸모 "
"없는 실수를 하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_65756_Text
msgctxt "a7639904-7f3c-496b-8e1f-1f09ba655d60"
msgid ""
"\"Truly high spirits, indeed! Just this morning, I received news from "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. My illustrious mother, may the gods prolong her years, "
"is terribly upset by the disappearance of yours truly.\" {n}Lander's smile "
"twists into a sneer.{/n} \"She's dispatched search parties to the "
"neighboring provinces. Discretely, of course — she fears whatever scandal "
"might arise due to my absence.\" {n}Lander sighs.{/n} \"Well, it's not the "
"first time she's gone to such lengths...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말로 고귀하군! 오늘 아침에 나는 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 소식을 들었다. 죽지도 않는 나의 잘난 어머니는 너의 실종으로 "
"몹시 화가났다. \" {n}랜더의 미소는 비웃음 소리와 함께 비틀어집니다.{/n} 그녀는 주변의 지역에 수색대를 파견했다. 물론 그녀는 "
"내 부재로 인해 어떤 문제가 발생할까 두려워한다. \" {n}랜더가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"그녀가 그렇게 애를 쓴 건 처음은 "
"아니야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_67813_Text
msgctxt "25188ebe-8b19-48c5-9d28-9ac28dac65f0"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} of {g|Restov}Restov{/g} are concerned "
"about some of the freedoms you allow yourself, but they're still showing a "
"good face over a bad game.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}는 너의 자유로움에 불안해 하고 있지만 여전히 나쁜 게임에 "
"자신만만해 하고 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_75859_Text
msgctxt "4275c714-5987-4781-adcd-831517763c6c"
msgid ""
"\"Expand. An aggressive, expansionist stance is the order of the day. The "
"bigger the barony, the better, right?\" {n}Lander grins.{/n}"
msgstr "\"넓혀야지. 적극적인 팽창주의는 대세라고. 남작령이 크면 더 좋지.\" {n}랜더는 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_96919_Text
msgctxt "dbb2ec7b-ac35-4cde-8b1e-002d7daa4be0"
msgid ""
"\"{g|House Surtova}House Surtova{/g} openly denounces you and your barony. "
"Nothing more than loud words as yet, though.\""
msgstr "\"{g|House Surtova}서토바{/g} 가문은 공개적으로 너와 네 남작령을 비난한다. 어차피 말 뿐이지만. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97144_Text
msgctxt "ea466dd1-3804-447e-99f3-256c19cb3a83"
msgid ""
"\"And to you, my dear Valerie, a special, heartfelt greeting. I seem to "
"recall a promise of your company for an evening on the river that has yet to "
"be kept... You, me, the moon above us as our boat glides along the river...?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 나의 사랑하는 발레리에게 특별하고 진심 어린 인사를 보낸다. 나는 아직 강가에서 그날 저녁 네 동료가 한 약속을 기억하는 것 "
"같다... 보트 위의 너와 나, 그리고 우리 위에 달이 뜨고 우리는 강을 따라 흘러갔었지... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97145_Text
msgctxt "7a9fb52e-db22-4233-8eeb-c8b64604889e"
msgid ""
"\"Another time, then — but I shall certainly hold you to your promise when I "
"return.\" {n}Lander bows slightly and winks.{/n} \"And as the poets say, "
"anticipation fuels passion's flame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다음에 내가 돌아올 때는 약속대로 할게.\" {n}랜더는 약간 숙여 인사하고 윙크합니다.{/n} \"시인들의 말처럼 기대는 열정의 "
"불꽃을 불러온다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97148_Text
msgctxt "8019ae60-4284-483b-9361-686c9d4c822d"
msgid "\"Always glad to provide counsel.\" {n}Lander smiles.{/n}"
msgstr "\"항상 조언을 제공해 기쁘다.\" {n}랜더가 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97151_Text
msgctxt "a1045dc8-0501-43df-a3d1-6fd44b327271"
msgid ""
"\"To be blunt, sly schemers battling for power against stubborn blusterers. "
"Long ago, both of them ruled a kingdom of their own — the {g|House "
"Surtova}Surtovas{/g} ruled over {g|Issia}Issia{/g}, and the Aldori "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} over {g|Rostland}Rostland{/g}. Then {g|Choral}"
"Choral Rogarvia{/g} came in with his dragons and made it abundantly clear to "
"everyone that everything they saw around them was his.\""
msgstr ""
"\"교활한 음모가들이 싸우다가 폭군에 맞선 상황이나 다름 없다. 오래 전에 그 둘은 자신의 왕국을 통치했다. {g|House "
"Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}는 {g|Issia}이시아{/g}를 지배했고 알도리 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}는 "
"{g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}에 군림했다. 그때 {g|Choral}정복자 가르비아{/g}가 드래곤을 몰고 와서 모든 "
"영토는 자신의 것임을 증명했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97152_Text
msgctxt "162b8ab4-4f85-49c3-b16d-82a0a1ff44e2"
msgid ""
"\"Over the next two centuries, the {g|House Surtova}Surtovas{/g} squeezed "
"everything they could from the benevolence of their rulers. And now, after "
"the Vanishing of the {g|House Rogarvia}Rogarvia{/g} line, Noleski Surtova "
"has seized the throne. But the Surtovas owe a blood debt to half of "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} — it will prove difficult for them to hold on to that "
"power. This makes them paranoid — they see enemies everywhere, and the "
"Aldori are no exception.\""
msgstr ""
"\"앞으로 2세기 동안 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g} 가문은 통치자의 자비로부터 모든 것을 짜낼 것이다. 지금은 {g|"
"House Rogarvia}로가비아{/g}의 혈통이 사라진 후에 놀레스키 서토바가 왕좌를 장악했다. 그러나 "
"서토바 가문은 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}와 사돈 관계를 맺었다. 권력을 장악하는 데 애로사항이 될 것이다. 그래서 그들은 "
"집착이 심해질 것이다. 그들은 주위를 모두 적으로 간주하고 알도리도 예외는 아니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97154_Text
msgctxt "bea6f41e-0705-4eda-bf82-f44b6ff6aa9d"
msgid ""
"\"Who do you think ran quickest to express their deep devotion and loyalty? "
"It certainly wasn't the Aldori. They fought to the last — and they almost "
"died out as a result.\""
msgstr ""
"\"헌신과 충성심 버리고 도망간 것이 누구라고 생각해? 분명히 알도리는 아니었다. 그들은 최후까지 싸웠고 결과적으로 거의 전멸했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97155_Text
msgctxt "53ad2c62-18d2-4044-9e33-bc26460ad2cc"
msgid ""
"\"The Aldori are brave and senseless. You're more likely to pull them out of "
"trouble than be the one receiving aid. And the {g|House Surtova}Surtovas{/g} "
"are smart, but they'll gladly sell you out if they see profit in it. They're "
"also unbearably boring. All of which means you made a wise decision when you "
"picked me as your ally.\" {n}Lander smiles.{/n} \"I wouldn't pander to "
"either of them, but I'd also avoid angering either of them until there's "
"good cause.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알도리는 용감하지만 무모하다. 그들에게 원조를 받기 전에 그들의 문제를 해결해줘야 할 것이다. {g|House Surtova}"
"서토바{/g}는 영리하지만 그들은 잇속을 위해 기꺼이 너를 팔아버릴 것이다. 그들은 또한 엄청나게 지루하다. 그 말은 동맹을 선택할 때 "
"현명한 결정을 내려야 함음을 의미한다. \" {n}랜더가 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"나는 누구도 이용하지 않을 것이지만 쓸모가 있을 "
"때까지는 그들의 화를 돋구지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97156_Text
msgctxt "f19433d4-7879-4e5d-880f-98c6ab0e0978"
msgid ""
"\"Me? But I'm such a bore!\" {n}Lander huffs indignantly, though he's "
"clearly flattered by your attention.{/n} \"What would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"나? 나는 지루해!\" {n}랜더는 당신의 태도에 기쁜 것 같지만 화가난 척 씩씩거립니다.{/n} \"뭘 알고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97160_Text
msgctxt "6b85b6d2-dfa4-4a3b-959d-1522b3a3c0cd"
msgid ""
"\"{g|House Lebeda}House Lebeda{/g} is considered one of the most influential "
"in Brevoy, and rightfully so. We own the fertile lands around {g|Lake Reykal}"
"Lake Reykal{/g} and the castle of {g|Silverhall}Silverhall{/g} — an "
"impressive structure, famous well beyond {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}'s borders. We "
"also control a significant amount of the lake and river shipping trade in "
"the region.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|House Lebeda}레베다 가문{/g}은 브레보이에서 가장 영향력 있는 가문이다. 우리는 {g|Lake Reykal} 레이칼 "
"호수{/g} 주위의 비옥한 토지와 {g|Silverhall} Silverhall{/g} 성을 소유하고 있다. 그 성은 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 국경 너머의 인상적이고 유명한 구조물이다. 우리는 또한 이 지역에서 상당한 양의 호수와 하천 운송 "
"무역을 통제한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97161_Text
msgctxt "c8f28315-563b-4ae7-9f9e-053ee119b282"
msgid ""
"\"And if it's my family that's of interest to you... My father passed away "
"long ago. My mother's spent years attempting to marry my sister Elanna off "
"to our beloved king, {g|King Noleski Surtova}Noleski Surtova{/g}. As for "
"myself, well, the family remembers I exist on the rare — or not so rare! — "
"occasions when I end up causing everyone trouble.\" {n}Lander gives a "
"disarming smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 우리 가문에 관심이 있다면 말해주지... 나의 아버지는 오래 전부터 돌아가셨다. 나의 어머니는 나의 여동생 엘란나를 {g|"
"King Noleski Surtova}놀레스키 서토바{/g} 왕과 결혼시키려고 수년 간 애썼다. 나는... 가족에게 나는 드문 존재다. "
"사고를 치고 돌아다닐 때 말이지! \" {n}랜더는 마음을 누그러뜨리는 미소를 지었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97162_Text
msgctxt "f6054eb0-d785-4446-8581-66f2eac24581"
msgid ""
"\"Close relations are a luxury that some people can't afford.\" {n}Lander "
"looks away for a moment before continuing.{/n} \"I once became close to a "
"man I considered to be a mentor and a friend. I later learned he'd been "
"using me to acquire information on my house's caravans for some local "
"bandits.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴밀한 관계는 일부 사람들이 감당할 수 없는 사치다.\" {n}랜더는 계속하기 전에 잠시 다른 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"한때 멘토와 친구 같은 녀석과 가까워졌다. 나중에 나는 그가 나를 이용해 우리 가문의 캐러밴에 대한 정보를 캐내어 도둑들에게 주려고 "
"한다는 사실을 알게 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97163_Text
msgctxt "a7dbaa47-3f1f-4ffd-a16b-ca3db5a0800e"
msgid ""
"\"I learned much from that experience. And so, I shall watch your entourage "
"with a keen eye — I won't allow any untrustworthy or suspicious people to go "
"unnoticed. You can trust me on that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그 경험에서 많은 것을 배웠다. 그래서 나는 너의 측근을 날카로운 눈으로 바라볼 것이다. 나는 신뢰할 수 없거나 의심스러운 "
"사람들이 정체를 숨기는 것을 용납하지 않을 것이다. 나만 믿으라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97165_Text
msgctxt "6537be28-7474-4014-a8bb-25b451b7b330"
msgid ""
"\"Decisiveness!\" {n}Lander answers immediately, then adds,{/n} \"Well, "
"sensible decisiveness. I've no taste for those who sit and mumble all day "
"when the time to act has come, nor for those who rush in without "
"consideration or planning.\""
msgstr ""
"\"결단력이다!\" {n}랜더가 즉시 응답하고는 덧붙입니다.{/n} \"현명한 결단력이지. 나는 행동하는 시간이 다가왔을 때 온종일 앉아 "
"있거나 자고 있는 녀석들에게는 흥미가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97167_Text
msgctxt "71742afd-d81b-429a-b1b5-3a100d38af2a"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander greets you with a familiar smile and bow.{/n} \"Your Grace, "
"Baron{mf||ess} {name}!\""
msgstr "{n}랜더는 친숙한 미소를 지으며 당신을 환영합니다.{/n} \"안녕하신가! {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97169_Text
msgctxt "918b43a8-7996-4971-b9fc-5b70555ca424"
msgid ""
"\"Have you ever seen a jar full of spiders? It's much the same, only on a "
"greater scale. A plethora of small nations and city-states that form "
"spontaneously and dissipate just as rapidly. Nevertheless, there are those "
"that could potentially pose a serious threat or become a promising ally — "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} makes a fine example, here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거미로 가득 찬 항아리를 본 적이 있어? 이만하지만 조금 더 크지. 작은 국가들이 넘쳐나서 형성과 급속한 소멸을 반복한다. 그럼에도 "
"몇몇은 심각한 위협이되거나 유망한 동료가 된다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 좋은 예가 되겠군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97171_Text
msgctxt "ccdaccc2-f6ad-46b1-ba33-211cf8ab9568"
msgid ""
"\"Of course.\" {n}Lander nods.{/n} \"The world is plenty interesting even "
"without politics, wouldn't you say?\""
msgstr "\"당연하지.\" {n}랜더는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"세계는 정치가 없어도 흥미롭다. 그렇지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97173_Text
msgctxt "4767dd1e-47d7-434c-9c51-0d3b9fafefff"
msgid "\"Why not?\" {n}Lander shrugs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"왜 안돼?\" {n}랜더는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97176_Text
msgctxt "b8d2d460-d634-40b8-903d-ad07f97542c1"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander gives you a subtle smile.{/n} \"My abilities are so remarkable "
"that you shouldn't consider me for anything less than Regent.\""
msgstr "{n}랜더는 미묘한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나의 능력은 너무 뛰어나서 나만한 섭정을 보지는 못할걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97177_Text
msgctxt "5155396a-1e16-4944-bd88-cbe9dd88db99"
msgid ""
"\"It gives me great satisfaction, Your Grace — the very thought of how much "
"I influence the barony. Ah, but you must be asking after my "
"responsibilities? All matters are well in hand — and by no means do they "
"hamper my other affairs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 내게 만족스럽다. 내가 영지에 미치는 영향력을 생각한다면 말이다. 하지만 너는 내가 책임을 다하는지 묻겠지? 모든 일은 잘 "
"진행되고 있다. 하지만 결코 나의 다른 일을 방해하지 않지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97178_Text
msgctxt "a29f2128-dbf7-4a23-b308-47e03ba8278b"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander shakes his head in disapproval.{/n} \"Let's not repeat our "
"previous mistakes, Your Grace. Last time we tried this, we didn't get along "
"very well, remember? Why torture ourselves again? You should find yourself "
"another, more amenable Regent, don't you think?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더가 고개를 절레절레 흔들며 반대합니다.{/n} \"지난 실수를 되풀이하지 맙시다, 영주님. 지난번에 시도했을 때 잘 안 풀렸잖아, "
"기억나? 왜 또 사서 고생하려는 거야? 좀 더 맘에 드는 다른 섭정을 찾아야 하지 않겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97180_Text
msgctxt "7614bf15-a46c-4228-b27a-9292cbff2a0f"
msgid ""
"\"A throne is a curious thing: it owns you more than you own it. My mother "
"bent over backwards to draw me into possession of my father's legacy. But "
"I... I would like Lander to really see and do something in this world, "
"before he becomes Lord {g|House Lebeda}Lebeda{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕좌는 흥미로운 것이야. 그것의 존재가 너의 존재보다 의미가 커. 나의 어머니는 나를 아버지의 유산의 상속자로 만들기 위해 애를 무진 "
"썼다. 하지만 나는... 이 세상을 경험하고 무엇인가를 하고 싶어. {g|House Lebeda} 레베다{/g} 가문의 주인이 되기 "
"전에. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Lebeda/Cue_97181_Text
msgctxt "6bd5d2ad-0747-44cc-a4c3-abff2b9c2d20"
msgid ""
"\"I heard a noble from one of the River Kingdoms, Lord What-His-Name Frey, "
"considered inviting you to his daughter's wedding. I'd advise against "
"accepting a wedding invitation from a man with a last name like that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아무개 프레이라는 강의 왕국들의 귀족을 봤는데 자기 딸의 결혼식에 너를 초대했어. 그런 녀석의 청첩장은 수락하지 않는 것이 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/EnvironmentBark1_String
msgctxt "3119ec1b-f1cb-4e08-a357-837e6047a5cd"
msgid ""
"The doorway is filled in with earth and stone. It doesn't lead anywhere any "
"more."
msgstr "출입구는 흙과 돌로 채워져 있습니다. 더 이상 아무 길도 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/EnvironmentBark2_String
msgctxt "7b354f25-e2b0-4f97-a0ca-c149461cb731"
msgid ""
"The layout of the walls and the room's structure suggest that once it was a "
"part of a larger building, which didn't survive the test of time."
msgstr "벽과 방 구조를 보니 시간의 풍파에서 견디지 못했던 더 큰 건물의 일부 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/EnvironmentBark3_String
msgctxt "a64038ec-7043-418e-83ea-fae489db32f2"
msgid ""
"The water receded only recently, and yet the papers on the table are "
"untouched. It seems they are protected by magic."
msgstr "물은 이제 빠졌지만 테이블 위의 종이는 멀쩡합니다. 마술에 의해 보호받고 있는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/EnvironmentBark4_String
msgctxt "80112b86-e9f7-4df5-8382-f96c7dd6ebfc"
msgid "Rags and pieces of furniture destroyed by time and damp."
msgstr "가구의 넝마와 조각들은 시간과 습기에 의해 파괴되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/EnvironmentBark5_String
msgctxt "5a7d39b2-bcba-47a2-afbd-a004f6da9e39"
msgid ""
"The remains of the well's water. When the well was still full, water dripped "
"down into this room from the vaulted ceiling above."
msgstr "우물 물의 흔적입니다. 우물이 가득 차있을 때 물방울이 아치형 천장에서 떨어졌을 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/FarnirrasDiary_name_String
msgctxt "19f8e081-1eac-46be-b432-7451da37e006"
msgid "Diary of Farnirras the Pensive"
msgstr "수심에 잠긴 파니라스의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/FarnirrasDiary_text_String
msgctxt "134dce5d-cafc-41b8-ae96-fa0ff1ea8341"
msgid ""
"The diary is badly damaged, and some of its pages are torn out. The "
"surviving fragments are written in a neat, large-lettered handwriting.\n"
"\"1.\n"
"With each passing day, I am even more glad of moving to this wild place. "
"Yes, I have none of the comforts of the imperial cities, but the wilderness "
"has its charm! Whenever I go out to the lake, I always witness some "
"picturesque scene — like nixies, playing with a flock of elementals in the "
"coastal waters. When evening comes, parades of will-o'-wisps are pulled to "
"my doorstep, dancing under the windows of the tower, making the night is as "
"bright as the day, and always smelling of a thunderstorm. I can just watch "
"their games, or lazily throw lightning at them from the balcony. It's only "
"just for fun — these creatures are nearly immune to magic, but they are very "
"funny to observe when they sparkle and grow angry, realizing they challenge "
"me at their peril.\"\n"
"\"3.\n"
"Despite all my efforts, the last of the thieves who broke into the tower has "
"died. It is my fault, of course — I must configure the guardian golem "
"better. The thief kept cursing me in three languages to his last breath. I "
"didn't understand half of his threats. Something about the worst enemy that "
"is already at my door. In the name of all the doorsteps of Iobaria, I came "
"to this wilderness to get away from all this! But the hotheads still find "
"you, push themselves into trouble, and then curse you while you try to heal "
"their wounds. It's such a shame.\"\n"
"\"5.\n"
"This is odd, but the guardian golem isn't working. It's not destroyed, but "
"quite disabled. And of course I don't have even a tenth of what I'd need for "
"repairs. What could have happened? I checked the whole tower, and all the "
"protective spells — but I cannot find anything amiss.\"\n"
"\"7.\n"
"The body disappeared. Right from the tower cellar — and the only one who "
"could get down there is me. Well, I can certainly be distracted now and "
"again, but this is still most strange.\"\n"
"\"9.\n"
"I wonder what I shall do with the elven girl who I rescued from the wyvern. "
"Her mind seems to be failing. She follows my every step, asks strange "
"questions, and she always asks if I sleep well at night. Thank you, I'm not "
"complaining! Well, at least her wounds are not so serious. A little more "
"magic, and she'll be as good as new.\"\n"
"\"11.\n"
"I haven't opened this diary for nearly a month. I've been too busy with my "
"investigation. Strange events have followed each other. A fire in my "
"alchemical warehouse. The loss of the artifacts. Again and again, I test new "
"combinations of protective spells, but all in vain. Something is stalking my "
"tower, leaving no trace and easily breaking through every protection. I "
"cannot imagine what skill and power this creature must possess. Also, I "
"cannot comprehend, why — owning such a great power — it still hasn't killed "
"me.\"\n"
"\"13.\n"
"I do not sleep well at night. Sometimes I pass out in the middle of the day, "
"and return to consciousness on the floor of the laboratory, or on the ground "
"just past the doorstep.\"\n"
"\"15.\n"
"...I'm a fool. I should have listened more carefully to what the dying thief "
"said! I know what's after me. And I don't have much time to figure out how "
"to fight it.\""
msgstr ""
"일기가 심하게 손상되고 일부 페이지가 찢겨져 있습니다. 멀쩡한 부분은 깔끔하고 큰 손글씨로 쓰여져 있습니다.\n"
"\"1.\n"
"날이 갈수록 이 야생으로 이사한 것이 기쁘다. 여기는 제국 도시와 같은 안락함은 없지만 매력있다! 내가 호수에 갈 때마다 나는 항상 그림 "
"같은 장면을 목격한다. 마치 닉시처럼 정령 한무리가 물가에서 놀고 있다. 저녁이 되면 위습 무리가 현관 계단으로 퍼레이드를 하고는 탑의 "
"창가 밑에서 춤을 추며 밤을 밝혀 주변이 낮처럼 밝아지고 항상 폭풍우의 냄새를 풍긴다. 나는 유유히 그들의 놀이를 보거나 발코니에서 "
"천천히 라이트닝 볼트를 던져주고는 한다. 단지 장난일 뿐이다. 이 크리처들은 마법에 영향을 받지 않지만 그들이 위협을 받아 화가 나서 "
"반짝이며 달려드는 것을 볼 때 정말 재미있다.\"\n"
"\"3.\n"
"나의 모든 노력에도 불구하고 탑에 침입한 마지막 도둑이 사망했다. 그것은 물론 내 잘못이다. 나는 문지기 골렘을 더 잘 설계해야 했다. "
"도둑은 마지막 숨을 쉬기 전까지 3개 국어로 나를 저주했다. 나는 그의 위협 절반을 이해하지 못했다. 최악의 적은 이미 내 문앞에 있다. "
"Iobaria의 모든 현관 이름을 걸고 나는 그들을 피하려 이 곳으로 왔다! 그러나 그 성급한 녀석은 항상 나를 찾아와 다쳐놓고서는 내가 "
"치료를 할 때 나를 저주한다. 정말 안타까운 일이다. \"\n"
"\"5.\n"
"문지기 골렘이 효과가 없다니 이상한 일이다. 파괴되지는 않았지만 무력화되었다. 수리가 필요한 부분을 조금도 손보지 못했다. 무슨 일이 "
"일어난 걸까? 나는 탑과 모든 보호 주문을 점검했지만 아무것도 발견할 수 없었다. \"\n"
"\"7.\n"
"시체가 사라졌다. 타워 지하실에서 말이다. 그곳에 내려갈 수 있는 유일한 사람은 나 뿐이다. 가끔 헷갈릴 수도 있지만 여전히 수상하다. "
"\"\n"
"\"9.\n"
"어느 날 와이번에게서 한 엘프 소녀를 구출했다. 그녀의 정신은 이상해진 것 같다. 그녀는 나의 모든 걸음걸이를 따라 가고 잠은 잘 "
"자느냐고 항상 이상한 질문을 한다. 친절하지만 조금 불편하다. 그녀의 상처는 그렇게 심각하지 않다. 마법을 조금 쓰면 그녀는 고쳐질 "
"것이다. \"\n"
"\"11.\n"
"나는 이 일기를 거의 한 달 동안 열지 않았다. 조사를 하느라 너무 바빴다. 이상한 사건들이 연이어 일어났다. 나의 연금술 실험실에서 "
"불이났다. 마법 물품이 타버렸다. 계속해서 새로운 보호 주문을 테스트하지만 모두 헛수고다. 누군가 내 탑을 염탐하여 흔적을 남기지 않고 "
"모든 보호 장치를 쉽게 뚫고 있다. 나는 그 생물이 가진 힘과 능력을 상상할 수도 없다. 그리고 또한 그런 힘을 소유한 녀석이 여전히 "
"나를 죽이지 않는지 이해할 수 없다.\"\n"
"\"13.\n"
"저녁에 잠을 잘 자지 않는다. 가끔은 한낮에 기절하고는 실험실 바닥이나 현관 문앞에서 깨어난다. \"\n"
"\"15.\n"
"...나는 바보다. 나는 죽어가는 도둑이 한 말에 더 주의를 기울여야 했다! 나를 쫓고 있는 것이 무엇인지 알았다. 그리고 그것과 싸울 "
"방법을 알아낼 시간이 별로없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/FarnirrasLetter_name_String
msgctxt "574f9f39-0d29-4e71-9b62-87afbb845f6b"
msgid "Message from the laboratory of Farnirras"
msgstr "파니라스의 실험실에서 보낸 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/FarnirrasLetter_text_String
msgctxt "ed2f5ca7-b32a-4f6b-b4af-6f8e371a0b70"
msgid ""
"\"You who reads these lines! Whoever you are, please heed my words. I am in "
"desperate need of help!\n"
"My name is Farnirras the Pensive, and I am a mage from the great empire of "
"Iobaria, may the gods prolong the years of its prosperity. I retired to "
"these wild lands, in the furthest of our provinces, to peacefully engage in "
"magical experiments. But now a terrible danger looms over my work, and even "
"my life itself. I'm not even sure I will have time to finish this message "
"before it takes me. Oh, unknown reader, if this letter is in your hands, I "
"am either dead or trapped in a magical prison in a barrow near the western "
"spurs of Tors of Levenies. If you do not lack virtue, or at least desire to "
"receive a well-deserved reward, then find the dungeon and save me (or "
"recover my mortal remains).\n"
"It will be difficult to open the door. Here in the laboratory I store the "
"magic key you will need for this. But in addition to the key, the door is "
"locked by a mighty spell. The door will open only for the one who defeats "
"forty-five monstrous creatures of all kinds. Magic tags their lairs with a "
"special mark, which you may have already seen on your way.\n"
"It may be foolish to hope there's a daredevil out there, who is capable of "
"overcoming dozens of monsters and combating the terrible power that has "
"ruined me... but still I hope for a miracle.\n"
"F.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 줄을 읽는 너! 네가 누구든지 내 말에 귀 기울여다오. 나는 필사적으로 도움이 필요하다!\n"
"나는 수심에 잠긴 파니라스이며, 위대한 이오바리아 제국의 마법사이다. 나는 평화롭게 마법 실험을 하기 위해 우리 지방에서 가장 후미진 "
"야생의 땅으로 왔다. 하지만 지금은 내 일에 위기가 생겼고, 심지어 내 삶에도 위기가 찾아왔다. 이 편지가 끝나기 전에 무엇을 해야 할지 "
"조차 확신하지 못한다. 이 편지가 당신 손에 있다면 나는 레베니스 바위 산맥 서쪽 도로에 있는 무덤의 마법 감옥에 갖혔거나 죽었을 "
"것이다. 도움을 주고 싶다면, 또는 적어도 상당한 보상을 받고 싶다면 던전을 찾아 나를 구해줘라 (혹은 내 시체라도 수습해 다오).\n"
"문을 여는 일은 어려울 것이다. 실험실에 네가 필요한 마법 열쇠를 보관하고 있다. 그러나 덧붙이자면 문은 강한 주문에 의해 잠겨있다. "
"45종의 괴물을 물리치는 자만이 문을 열 수 있을 것이다. 마법으로 그들의 은신처를 표시했고 아마 오는 도중에 보았을 지도 모른다.\n"
"수십 마리의 괴물을 처치하고 나를 파괴한 마법에 맞설 무모한 사람이 있다는 기대를 가지는 것이 헛될지도 모르지만... 나는 여전히 기적을 "
"바란다.\n"
"F.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/Phylactery_description_String
msgctxt "fdda33fd-4137-47b8-ac6f-efcd60220adf"
msgid ""
"A patterned key you found in the laboratory of Farnirras the Pensive. The "
"letter you've found in Farnirras laboratory suggests that the door to his "
"magical prison won't open until someone defeats forty-five certain powerful "
"creatures. The key has a spell on it that shows the exact number of "
"creatures left. When the number of it's \"charges\" reaches zero, the door "
"could be opened."
msgstr ""
"수심에 잠긴 파니라스의 실험실에서 발견한 무늬가 있는 열쇠입니다. 실험실에서 찾은 편지에 따르면 45마리의 강력한 괴물을 물리칠 때까지는 "
"마법의 문이 열리지 않을 것이라고 합니다. 열쇠에는 남아있는 괴물의 수를 나타내는 마법이 있습니다. 수가 0이 되면 문을 열 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/Phylactery_name_String
msgctxt "41b30ea1-4d11-4f8d-8de8-2ce2b88c0c0c"
msgid "The Key to the Magical Prison"
msgstr "마법 감옥을 여는 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/WaterGone1_String
msgctxt "4a71838a-36ec-492a-b454-6e56e1daae4e"
msgid ""
"\"There was no water in the well yesterday. There is no water in the well "
"today. But my hope is strong. I'll come to check tomorrow!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어제 우물에는 물이 전혀 없었다. 오늘도 우물에 물이 전혀 없다. 하지만 내 희망은 강하다. 나는 내일 확인하러 올 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/WaterGone2_String
msgctxt "4b9ee9f4-6d3e-4947-a07b-5c8a54e78380"
msgid ""
"\"The water is gone… completely gone… Do I really have to go to the "
"neighbor's well now?\""
msgstr "\"물이 사라 졌어... 완전히... 이웃의 우물에 가야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/LichKilichLab/WellBarkBefore_String
msgctxt "c19fb9b3-6add-47a5-ab8d-6fd65dd70f43"
msgid ""
"The well looks quite ordinary, and yet when you approach it you feel a "
"strange tingling in your temples."
msgstr "우물은 꽤 평범해 보이지만 접근하자 당신은 관자놀이에서 따끔거림을 느낍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e1f9dbd9-4d8d-47a2-851b-85e189628254"
msgid "\"How are things in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4a4dda74-657f-45ee-8f60-78f076b469e5"
msgid "\"Have you taken care of Varnhold's defenses?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 방위는 잘 처리했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b7527f91-2b9d-4858-a643-2e3d5b5e63be"
msgid "\"Do you remember anything from when your soul was imprisoned?\""
msgstr "\"영혼이 갇혔을 때 기억나는게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "52ce0401-d88c-4b48-bd09-22e1609cd024"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "952f5b44-081b-4e53-b4f4-db37af4d2a87"
msgid "\"How do you find the capital?\""
msgstr "\"수도에 대한 감상이 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "eb0edf5a-eebf-455f-8e37-5cc748057409"
msgid ""
"\"In your room, I discovered a letter containing threats. Is there something "
"you'd like to discuss with me?\""
msgstr "\"네 방에 협박 편지가 보이더군. 나와 상의할 만한 일인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "cacbf8e7-6b90-484e-b85a-5257f0116a0e"
msgid "\"How did Jamandi react when Varnhold joined my barony?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드가 나의 영지로 합병되었을 때 자만디는 어떻게 반응했지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "580ca85b-01cf-4442-b77b-7510382a3180"
msgid "\"How do you like being Treasurer?\""
msgstr "\"재무관이 된다는 건 어떤 기분이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "7db15f75-6384-4612-bacb-5576302a3fb1"
msgid ""
"\"I'm thinking about offering you an official position. In what way could "
"you help me govern the country?\""
msgstr "\"너에게 공식적인 지위를 제안할 생각이다. 어떤 방법으로 나의 통치를 돕겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "807cc288-d3ba-42f3-b39c-51849e982d77"
msgid "\"Remind me, what did you ask me to do?\""
msgstr "\"다시 말해봐요, 뭘 부탁했었죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7f3d3740-1a0c-43c8-8e7c-3546db07058b"
msgid ""
"{n}When he sees you, Maegar gives you a polite bow.{/n} \"Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Welcome back. How can I serve you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신을 보며 정중히 인사합니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 돌아오신 것을 환영합니다. 내리실 명이 "
"있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "bae396c0-349f-4c5a-b003-11524b9bcbf8"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! To what do I owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 무슨 일로 오셨습니까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "53b38f59-9c3e-4338-b4f1-68eca297328a"
msgid ""
"\"The people have already reconstructed the fort walls, even started digging "
"a moat around the town and organizing patrols. That event was... a real "
"shock to everyone. So now every citizen of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, young "
"or old, has been doing everything in their power to never be caught off "
"guard again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 이미 요새 벽을 재건했고, 심지어 마을 주변의 해자를 파고 순찰대를 조직하기 시작했습니다. 그 사건은... 모든 사람들에게 "
"큰 충격이었습니다. {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 모든 시민은 나이를 따지지 않고 다시는 무방비하게 당하지 않도록 할 수 있는 "
"모든 조치를 취하고있습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "552ee337-5e1d-457b-8dc7-f6cdca08b973"
msgid ""
"\"Excellent, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, everything is "
"excellent. Sure, when everyone returned home, they were a bit uncomfortable. "
"But after appointing a deputy and doubling the guards, the citizens began to "
"calm down, and life started returning to normal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 모든 것이 훌륭합니다. 물론 모두가 고향에 돌아왔을 때는 조금 불편하게 느끼기는 "
"했습니다. 하지만 대리인을 임명하고 경비를 두 배로 늘린 후 시민들은 진정했고 삶은 정상으로 돌아오기 시작했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d7971b88-9702-4fa7-8c0f-c228f7adc72c"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar hesitates a moment, then finally says,{/n} \"You saved us all, "
"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, and I'll never be able to thank you "
"enough for that. All I can do is serve you faithfully and ensure your "
"efforts weren't in vain. {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} will stand strong, no "
"matter what. This, I promise you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 잠시 망설이다 마침내 말합니다.{/n} \"당신은 우리 모두를 구했습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 그에 "
"대해서는 충분히 감사드리지 못할 정도입니다. 제가 할 수 있는 것은 {mf|영주님을|영주님을|전하를|전하를} 충실히 섬기고 "
"{mf|영주님의|영주님의|전하의|전하의} 노력이 헛되지 않도록 하는 것 뿐입니다. {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}는 어떤 일에도 "
"굳건하게 서있을 것입니다. 이는 제가 약속드리는 바입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ec27d847-1bfd-413c-ba0a-bd74e7239339"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar freezes.{/n} \"I'm... n-not sure, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\" {n}The man frowns.{/n} \"It was... "
"dark. Almost no space...\" {n}He closes his eyes and gulps.{/n} \"If... if "
"you don't mind, I'd rather not recall any more.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 얼어붙습니다.{/n} \"잘... 잘 모르겠습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \" {n}그는 찡그립니다.{/n}"
" \"그곳은 어둡고... 비좁았습니다...\" {n}그는 눈을 감고 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \"송구하옵니다만... 더 이상 떠올리고 싶지 "
"않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "445fd10e-3532-4a92-ac9c-19193707b073"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks around the hall, squinting.{/n} \"It's impressive. Still, "
"sometimes I just miss the open spaces of {g|Dunsward}Dunsward{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 홀을 가늘게 뜬 눈으로 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"인상적입니다. 그래도 저는 가끔 {g|Dunsward}던스워드{/g}의 "
"확트인 공간이 그립군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "ade08162-40d0-4e2d-b442-caed8622e19e"
msgid ""
"\"To be blunt, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, who cares? Maybe "
"she's angry back in {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, or crying her head off, or even "
"celebrating. Matters not — the issue's already been settled between the two "
"of us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 솔직히 말씀드리자면 무슨 상관이겠습니까? 아마 그녀는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에 돌아가 "
"화가 났거나 아니면 울음을 터뜨리거나 심지어 축하를 했을지도 모르지요. 그건 상관이 없습니다. 이 일은 이미 우리 둘 사이에서 해결된 "
"문제입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "0db462a4-cc51-44f1-9e06-4fe192590647"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar's face darkens.{/n} \"I didn't want you to know about that. Wanted "
"to spare you from any further worries... I began receiving letters like that "
"one since about when I sent you trading goods.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르의 얼굴이 어두워집니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 알기 바라지 않았습니다. 더 이상 걱정거리를 더하지 "
"않았으면 싶었습니다. 수도로 무역품을 보내기 시작하면서 그런 편지들을 받기 시작했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "8e4c2c8f-6283-4108-a020-378e3784b75f"
msgid ""
"\"Once, my men even interrogated the trader who delivered the mail, but "
"nothing came of it. I have some assumptions of who's behind it, but as long "
"as I have no proof, I don't want to accuse anyone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당시에 제 부하들이 편지를 가져온 무역상을 심문하기도 했지만 아무것도 나오는게 없었습니다. 누가 배후에 있는지 추측은 있습니다만, "
"증거가 없기 때문에 고발하고 싶지는 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "222ed2c3-d6fe-49a6-bd4d-3ef75ed497b7"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar shakes his head.{/n} \"Sometimes it's hard, other times — less so. "
"But overall it's nothing special. The chests in the treasury are fine, all "
"the records are in order, and as for all the pressing issues, I can simply "
"address them to you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"가끔 힘들기는 하지만 그렇지 않을 때에는... 덜 힘든 편입니다. 하지만 전반적으로 특별한 "
"일은 없습니다. 국고의 상자는 괜찮고, 모든 기록도 정리되어 있습니다. 그리고 긴급한 문제에 대해서는 제가 간단하게 말씀드릴 수 있습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "14f95517-17f4-4ec0-9402-f48d8a0fb090"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar gives you a crooked smile, and shakes his head.{/n} \"Eh, no, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. I've been there before, and it seemed my "
"advices didn't do much good. You should find someone else to help you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 비틀린 미소를 지으며 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"으음, 아닙니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 지금까지 경험에 "
"비추어 볼 때, 저는 그런 자리에 어울리지 않더군요. 다른 사람을 구하시는 편이 좋겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "c4951382-e673-41bd-b841-980893c76f49"
msgid ""
"\"I can't say ruling a barony used to give me much joy — there are far more "
"enjoyable pursuits. But if there was something I really excelled at, it was "
"managing {g|Varnhold}Varnhold's{/g} treasury. If I hadn't been there, our "
"citizens would have had to tighten their belts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"남작령을 다스리는 것이 그렇게 즐겁지는 않았습니다. 그보다 훨씬 재미있는 일들이 많이 있지요. 하지만 제가 잘했던 것이 있다면 "
"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 국고를 관리하는 것이었습니다. 제가 없었다면 우리 시민들은 허리띠를 조여매야했을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "351e28a0-f124-4304-9edf-800d83e44c6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar looks grim and gaunt.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your "
"Highness|Your Highness}! I don't know if you're interested, but I attempted "
"on my own to discover the fate of my people who stayed behind in that "
"dungeon. I was only able to recover the remains of one person from the "
"party, but I suspect the others are dead as well.\" {n}He looks away.{/n} \"I"
" suppose we should consider the matter settled.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 암울하고 수척해 보입니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 흥미가 있으실진 모르겠지만, 저는 제 손으로 "
"그 지하감옥에 남았던 부하들에게 있었던 일을 알아내려 했습니다. 일행 중에서 겨우 한 사람의 유해를 수습할 수 있었습니다만... 추측컨데 "
"다른 사람들도 죽은 것 같습니다.\" {n}그는 눈길을 돌립니다.{/n} \"그 문제는 끝난 것으로 봐야 할 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVarn/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "a6980a35-01a9-46e4-b5a0-ed89a002cd66"
msgid ""
"\"To help me learn the fate of my people, who were down in that mysterious "
"dungeon when Varnhold fell under Vordakai's spell. Cephal and I went down "
"some of the way with them, but then had to hurry back to Varnhold, and I "
"still don't know what happened.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반홀드가 보다카이의 주문에 걸려들었을 때 그 신비한 지하감옥으로 내려갔던 제 부하들에게 무슨 일이 있었는지 알 수 있도록 "
"도와주십시오. 케팔과 저는 그들과 함께 어느 정도 내려갔지만, 그 후 반홀드로 급히 돌아와야 했고, 저는 아직도 무슨 일이 일어났는지 "
"모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "fbef27ef-bb5c-4d75-b858-80d5e46c9c37"
msgid "\"So, how do you like living among 'lesser races'?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 '하등한 종족들' 사이에서 사는 것은 어떠하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8f759dce-f07a-451a-b0ed-3b1415f0314c"
msgid "\"How are things in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a387826c-790f-4e1d-87df-03d161922b7a"
msgid "\"I bet you don't enjoy bowing before a mortal superior, do you?\""
msgstr "\"필멸자 상사에게 인사하는게 즐겁지는 않을 텐데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "08303fc9-bba0-46b5-a19a-f8219793b015"
msgid "\"I hope you've been smart enough to avoid plotting behind my back.\""
msgstr "\"내 등 뒤에서 음모를 꾸미는 멍청한 짓을 하지는 않겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "5ba8f639-550d-4902-b1e2-a9c6a7839772"
msgid "\"Perhaps you can use your knowledge about governing in practice?\""
msgstr "\"통치에 관한 지식을 사용할 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "34b2dee9-ea13-4925-968c-63ae993efcc4"
msgid "\"Tell me about your past.\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "7a51a0bc-b909-4d14-a6bd-033f94d3c381"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "977b2da3-0cdb-4cfd-b0b5-687074be02a9"
msgid ""
"\"Willas Gunderson, the man who started all this. How did he manage to get "
"into your tomb in the first place?\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 것을 시작한 Willas Gunderson이다. 어떻게 그는 단번에 무덤에 들어갈 수 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "d30b486b-c4cd-4f73-b5f1-07d9d1482c5f"
msgid "\"What exactly are you watching?\""
msgstr "\"네가 본 것은 정확히 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "8f3243e3-5d42-4cd1-8c0b-541b486beda6"
msgid "\"Since moving to the capital, you've become extremely polite.\""
msgstr "\"수도로 이주한 이후로 예의바르게 행동하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "6d88b0e3-3421-4b63-898d-8fc75e9a507e"
msgid "\"Have you learned anything interesting?\""
msgstr "\"재미있는 것 좀 들은 게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "28b72efd-09c9-440d-a8f7-e0a833fad654"
msgid "\"Enough about you for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "ee688cfa-8ac0-4788-b743-8dc5dd3e85e1"
msgid "\"Let's talk about what happened in your tomb.\""
msgstr "\"무덤에서 일어난 일에 대해 이야기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "10bf0e59-fbbd-4318-85b2-5541c104119e"
msgid "\"The curse Tristian bestowed on you — why did it work?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안이 네게 건 저주 말이야. 왜 그렇게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "d9f8f2e4-2971-4635-a9b1-7aa804dfd504"
msgid "\"What was the ancient cyclopean empire like?\""
msgstr "\"고대 싸이클롭스 제국은 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "64dea3c9-5115-4ad9-aac9-b8ca8c4234ab"
msgid "\"Enough about the past.\""
msgstr "\"과거에 대해서는 이만하면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "6b5c7932-32c0-4510-b51a-4aab8a5a5601"
msgid "\"Let's go back to some other questions.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문으로 돌아가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "07f55b12-74d4-4052-87f7-21bdbdfad3de"
msgid "\"Where did the Oculus of Abaddon come from?\""
msgstr "\"Abaddon의 Oculus는 어디에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "57dcaf26-1b83-496b-92f8-6174ab33984f"
msgid "\"Who were you back in your previous life?\""
msgstr "\"이전 삶에서 너는 어떻게 살았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "e468819a-4c4d-45eb-a5e0-0e8fe32142d9"
msgid "\"Remind me, how did you abduct the citizens of Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 반홀드 시민들을 납치했는지 다시 알려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "d502368b-aeee-4e02-b4b3-9fee6fa798d3"
msgid "\"How do you like your position?\""
msgstr "\"현재 위치가 마음에 드나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "4c2e5d06-2c05-4ceb-9d08-03bf9708bfb3"
msgid "\"Let's discuss this 'necromancy under the city'.\""
msgstr "\"이 도시 아래 '사령술'에 대해 이야기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "7077af45-b017-47b9-9f6f-37e6dace55d8"
msgid ""
"[Show him the key from the magical prison] \"Can you tell me anything about "
"this key?\""
msgstr "[마법 감옥을 여는 열쇠를 보여줍니다] \"이 열쇠에 대해 말해줄 게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "86e9c0dd-7e1a-4b1a-8ded-0b4562c226a2"
msgid "\"I have no more questions about it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이것에 대해 더 이상 질문하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "f8a76bb4-0b43-44fd-b663-8c4400e73303"
msgid ""
"\"I found a letter in the ruins under the city. In it, a mage named "
"Farnirras speaks of some horrible danger...\""
msgstr "\"도시의 폐허에서 편지를 발견했다. 파니라스라는 이름의 마법사가 끔찍한 위험에 대해 이야기한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "2798475d-732d-4a25-9ec4-df3e43060f67"
msgid "\"Perhaps some of your followers have visited these ruins?\""
msgstr "\"아마도 네 추종자들 중 일부가 이 폐허를 방문했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "3094c585-2851-419b-8e55-423c900d2351"
msgid ""
"\"The ruins under the city were once a laboratory of an Iobarian mage named "
"Farnirras, who turned into a lich. And who is now dead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도시 아래의 그 폐허는 한 때 파니라스라는 이오바리아 마법사의 실험실이었고, 그 마법사는 리치로 변해 있었다. 그리고 지금은 죽었지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "0da32671-0935-4922-a9c1-fe363b840a8a"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Oculus of Abaddon.\""
msgstr "\"Abaddon의 Oculus에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ae9e787d-8365-494a-a53c-bccbb24ca3ba"
msgid ""
"{n}The man stares at you with dark eyes, his lips curved with "
"displeasure.{/n} \"You... I mean, 'Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}' "
"wishes to speak with me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어두운 눈으로 당신을 본 그 남자의 입술은 불만으로 일그러집니다.{/n} \"너... 너의 왕이 나와 이야기하고 싶어하나?'"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5527ecc0-4817-4f2d-a7d9-507280eb2d98"
msgid "\"What do you — does Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} need?\""
msgstr "\"너의 왕이 원하는 것은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "67caa2ef-225a-4ff1-8631-3e43ac68448f"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" looks around the hall, then turns back to you.{/n} \"I watch. "
"I learn. There is much I must comprehend of this... new world.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 복도를 둘러본 다음 다시 당신에게로 돌아옵니다.{/n} \"나는 보았다. 나는 배웠다. 내가 이 새로운 세계에 "
"대해 배워야 할 것이 많다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "5ebc7e4d-225f-43d0-b76a-12b6fcc345e6"
msgid ""
"\"I've enough to occupy my time without bothering with the bustling of "
"insects. Address your question to someone who cares.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 귀찮은 벌레들을 상대할 정도로 시간이 많지 않다. 네 질문에 관심있는 사람에게 물어봐라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0e48422f-32bf-4615-bddb-57a842a0fc3f"
msgid ""
"{n}A grimace of fury appears on \"Maegar's\" face, but he quickly regains "
"control of himself.{/n} \"Lesser races are known for their pettiness. The "
"awkward jokes of Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} simply provide "
"further evidence of such.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}분노로 찌푸린 얼굴이 \"메이가르\"의 얼굴에 나타나지만 그는 빠르게 평정을 유지합니다.{/n} \"하등한 종족은 그들의 약점으로 "
"유명하지. 너의 어색한 농담을 보니 그 약점이 보인다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "76312be7-361f-499a-8c23-e000c14b913c"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" gives you a wolfish smile.{/n} \"Why should I? I am absolutely "
"safe in this castle, right until I restore my powers. I believe it will take "
"some time though — at least till the end of your days\"."
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 당신에게 늑대 같은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"내가 왜? 힘을 회복할 때까지 나는 이 성에서 안전하다. 시간이 "
"좀걸려도. 적어도 네가 망할 때까지는 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "329f8e0d-15b9-4693-b9ac-063780478d75"
msgid ""
"\"And deprive myself of the pleasure of watching Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} fuss about? The politics and city "
"management of you lesser races is about as interesting as your ridiculous "
"religions and traditions.\""
msgstr "\"네가 야단 법석을 떠는 모습을 보는 즐거움을 빼앗겠다고? 너의 통치는 너의 정체성 만큼이나 우습고 흥미롭다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "b8c76830-67c6-4a71-b975-0885b94fed20"
msgid ""
"\"The words of your primitive tongue are incapable of expressing the "
"greatness and power of my tremendous empire, known by your kind as "
"{g|Koloran}Koloran{/g}. Your mages and alchemists can hardly dream of all "
"the knowledge we gathered in our sanctuaries. The splendor of our estates "
"would put your wildest fantasies to shame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Koloran}콜로란{/g} 출신의 너로서는 나의 엄청난 제국을 묘사하지 못한다. 너의 마법사들과 연금술사들은 우리가 성역에서 "
"모은 지식은 꿈꾸지도 못할 것이다. 우리 남작령을 보면 네가 꿈꿔온 도시조차 부끄러울 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0c81bcf8-0fa6-41cb-8b0a-42715953eb38"
msgid ""
"\"Then... it was all gone. The books of your kind call this cataclysm "
"{g|Earthfall}'Earthfall'{/g}. Our greatness, our legacy — empire builders, "
"owners of continents! — were a thing of the past. The cyclopes who survived "
"were subsumed by lesser races.\" {n}\"Maegar\" goes silent, lost in his own "
"thoughts.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고... 그것은 모두 사라졌다. 너희의 책은 이 대격변을 {g|Earthfall}'어스폴'{/g}이라고 부른다. 제국의 건립자이자 "
"대륙의 주인이었던 우리의 유산은 과거의 일이 되었다. 생존한 사이클롭스는 하등 종족의 수하가 되었다. \" {n}\"메이가르\"는 "
"침묵하며 생각에 잠깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "cb75462f-f9c4-4708-8fe0-bb4bf727e0ae"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" ponders it a moment.{/n} \"I hadn't considered it much — I've "
"as much interest in that as anything else regarding you lesser races. I "
"suppose it is odd — extremely so, actually. The thief managed to pass the "
"gates, travel through the Valley, enter the tomb, and escape the guards... "
"all by himself. Is it possible someone helped him?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 잠시 생각합니다.{/n} \"나는 별로 고려하지 않았다. 너희 하등 종족에 관해서라면 충분히 알아보았다. 사실 "
"그것이 이상하다고 생각한다. 실제로 그렇고. 도둑은 혼자서 성문을 통과하고 협곡을 통과하고 무덤에 들어가서는 경비를 따돌리고 도망갔다. "
"그를 도울 만한 사람이 있나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "91369ee6-1fac-42d2-b0f5-b6b1d6bc1a0b"
msgid ""
"\"Despite the great discomfort, I'm actually glad to have started a new life "
"under a false name and identity. I won't repeat my prior mistakes, believe "
"me. My essence is now hidden from everyone, my true name will eventually be "
"forgotten — over ages, if necessary — and then, I will become truly "
"invincible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불편함에도 불구하고 나는 가짜 이름으로 삶을 시작하게 되어 기쁘다. 이전의 실수는 반복하지 않아. 나의 정체는 사람들에게 숨겨졌고 "
"이름도 수세기에 걸쳐 잊혀지겠지. 나는 쓰러뜨리는 자는 없을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "b628eadf-50c6-40a4-b8ed-b30269f459db"
msgid "{n}\"Maegar\" rolls his eyes, but he refrains from commenting.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}\"메이가르\"는 할말이 있는 듯 눈을 굴리지만 말싸움을 삼가합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "83166d1f-e28a-4c3f-a15f-35205cdc3670"
msgid ""
"\"Humans. Elves. Other beings that were once little more than dust beneath "
"my feet. A new perspective has been opened before me. It is joyless and "
"dull, but it is still worthy of my attention, should I wish to survive in "
"this new world — and eventually conquer it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"인간. 엘프. 내 발 아래에 먼지보다 더 하찮은 존재들. 세상이 바뀌었다. 기가 막히고 멍청하지만 흥미를 이끈다. 나는 이 새로운 "
"세상에서 살아남아 이 세상을 정복할 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "064706e0-227d-44ab-92e3-9d5ae3fa50d7"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" leans in, as though suspecting someone may be "
"eavesdropping.{/n} \"I must play the role of your subject. Do you think your "
"minions would not notice if I spoke with their {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}"
" as I would a simple stable hand?!\" {n}\"Maegar\" straightens himself, "
"casting a sidelong glance your way as he snarls with contempt.{/n} \"Besides"
", I really am quite at your mercy... for the moment.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도청을 의심하듯 \"메이가르\"는 몸을 기울입니다.{/n} \"나는 분명히 네 신하인 척 역할해야 한다. 내가 네 종노릇을 하면 "
"너희 부하들이 나를 못알아챌 거라고 생각하나? \" {n}\"메이가르\"는 몸을 곧게 펴고 당신 쪽을 곁눈질하면서 경멸로 "
"으르릉거립니다.{/n} \"네 도움이 정말로... 잠시는 필요하겠군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "bcc022b8-3d7d-4331-b3db-4c7f1b22ff35"
msgid ""
"\"I took the liberty of touring your dwelling and found several books on "
"your history and culture. I found a few thick volumes, bound in leather and "
"locked with metal, standing in plain sight within the great hall. You must "
"have been quite proud of them, to display them so prominently.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 거주지를 돌아다니다 너의 역사와 문화에 대한 책을 몇 권 발견했다. 가죽끈으로 묶여 금속으로 고정된 두꺼운 책인데 거대한 "
"복도에 턱하니 놓여있더군. 그런걸 대놓고 드러내다니 자랑스러운가 보군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "d41d16ca-9ed5-4efe-a164-919ee576d817"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" can't restrain a scoff of contempt.{/n} \"Such pathetic "
"reading. Your chroniclers can barely string two words together, and your "
"religious beliefs have the sophistication of an ant. Even the works of your "
"artists are barely tolerable. As your subject, I felt obligated to save your "
"palace from such terrible eyesores — I burned the trash in the nearest "
"fireplace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 경멸이 든 비웃음을 흘립니다.{/n} \"애처로운 독서로다. 너희 역사는 연대기는 두 단어로 설명하는 것도 아깝고 "
"너희 종교 철학은 개미의 그것과 다를 바 없다. 심지어 예술가의 작품도 못봐주겠더구나. 너의 신하로서 그런 눈이 썩어들어가는 물건들은 "
"벽난로에 태워버려야 한다고 생각한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "1379dea9-c233-469a-9188-72e445898170"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"An odd proposal. What else do you "
"need to know?\""
msgstr "{n}\"메이가르\"는 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"이상한 제안이군. 뭘 알고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "c3e1322b-222b-469f-ac41-093a8b9cb8d0"
msgid ""
"{n}'Maegar' keeps silent for so long that you consider simply changing the "
"topic.{/n} \"There is an inmost core in every soul, its basis, its essence. "
"Fool you'll be if you try to transform this essence into something more "
"material or distinct. And that was exactly what I did: turned my name into "
"my banner, my motto, telling everyone what I am. Mighty Vordakai, the "
"demolisher of the empires! ...It was the name that they used against me. "
"Added to the curse, it turned out to be the deadliest weapon\". {n}'Maegar' "
"winces, as if in pain.{/n} \"It was my mistake. Perhaps the only true "
"mistake I ever made.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}'메이가르'가 한동안 말이 없어 당신은 주제를 바꿔야 하나 고민했습니다.{/n} \"모든 영혼에는 순수한 본질이 있다. 본질은 그 "
"자체로 본질이지. 다른 무언가를 더해 보다 특별한 영혼으로 거듭날 거라 생각한다면, 그는 어리석은 이에 불과해. 그리고 난 어리석었다. "
"모든 이가 내 이름을 알아주길 바랐지. 내 이름이 쓰인 가문의 깃발을 걸고, 내 이름이 곧 전능의 대명사가 되기를 꿈꿨다. 허나, 제국에 "
"파멸을 가져온 자, 보다카이! 찬란하길 바랐던 내 이름의 말로다. 저주의 한 구절이자, 나 자신을 해치는 무기가 되어 돌아왔지.\" {n}"
"'메이가르'는 고통을 곱씹으며 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"한순간의 어리석음이 내 인생을 앗아갔다. 살면서 내가 저지른 유일한 실수건만."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "a45d23ff-d6be-45da-9d32-1fb52c419413"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" shakes his head.{/n} \"Why? Why bother speaking of what's "
"irrevocably gone? Fine, then. Ask your questions, and let's be done with it."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 그의 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"왜? 되돌릴 수 없는 일을 귀찮게 다시 말하는 것이지? 좋아. 물어보면 "
"그걸로 끝내자. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "8a73c005-b53b-4d27-b990-bf0e24fdae63"
msgid "\"That's what I tell myself every day, {name}. Every. Single. Day.\""
msgstr "\"그건 나에게 매일 스스로 하는 말이다. {name}. 매일. 하루도. 빠짐 없이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "1935a469-466b-4a60-99de-d90f04c19d9f"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar stares intently at the wall behind your back, as though the stones "
"behind you are of more interest than any questions you might have.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 어떤 질문보다 더 관심이 많은 듯 당신 등 뒤에 있는 벽을 열심히 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "719fbc84-9dbb-4b5a-82d9-8067a34e5582"
msgid ""
"\"A ruler. A great necromancer. A true master, who learned to use the most "
"precise tools of manipulation and coercion — over the living and the dead. "
"But my shortsighted brethren decided my power had become too great. Once I'd "
"pledged myself to the Four Horsemen, and with their blessing traded my life "
"for immortality, the traitors made their perfidious strike. That is how my "
"palace became my tomb, in the heart of which I slept for thousands of years."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"통치자. 위대한 네크로맨서. 산 자와 죽은 자를 조정하고 강압하는 정밀한 도구를 사용하는 진실한 주인이다. 그러나 멍청한 내 형제들은 "
"나의 힘이 너무 커졌다고 결론을 내렸다. 내가 네 명의 기수에게 간청하여 내 삶을 불멸의 삶으로 바꿔 놓았을 때 그 배신자들은 나를 "
"파괴했다. 나의 궁전은 내 무덤이 되어 나는 수천 년 동안 잠재워졌다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "86145da5-37c5-4b86-af9e-4908179e1396"
msgid ""
"\"Even I don't know how or when the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} "
"appeared in our world. I found it while searching for a suitable location "
"for my palace. It was buried in the heart of the mountain, deep underground, "
"stored in a luxurious chamber that must have been built long before my "
"empire rose. The room was decorated with the symbols of the Four Horsemen "
"along with ancient carvings, the origins of which could only be guessed at "
"by the wisest scholars of my empire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"심지어 나도 언제 그리고 왜 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈이 우리 세계에 온지 모른다. 내 궁전을 지을 적합한 위치를 찾다가 "
"그것을 발견했다. 그것은 내 제국이 일어나기 한참 전에 산의 심장부의 깊은 지하에 지어진 호화로운 방에 저장되었다. 방은 네 명의 기수의 "
"상징으로 장식되었고 그 기원은 나의 제국의 가장 현명한 학자들만이 추측할 수 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "77a7ea5a-8384-46d6-8355-44f86c588be6"
msgid ""
"\"But I didn't call for the help of strangers, oh no. I secretly built my "
"own palace around this mysterious chamber, killed all the builders, and did "
"all in my power to ensure the secret of such a great gift would remain mine "
"and mine alone. Since the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} replaced my eye, "
"I couldn't be separated from the great creation that opened the great powers "
"of Abaddon before me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 나는 이방인들의 도움을 청하지 않았다. 나는 그 신비스러운 방 주위에 내 비밀 궁전을 지은 후 건축한 자들을 모두 죽였고 그 "
"위대하고 놀라운 선물을 나 혼자 간직하도록 비밀로 유지했다. {g|Abaddon} 나락{/g}의 눈을 내 눈으로 바꾼 후 Abaddon의 "
"위대한 힘을 열어준 그 생물과 분리될 수 없었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "06bef29b-fb79-417d-8826-dd8533765458"
msgid ""
"\"The Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}. It grants me the strength to easily "
"subdue dozens of mortals. After finding the hideout of the thief who'd "
"stolen treasure from my palace, I used the Oculus to control the minds of "
"everyone within the feeble walls of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}. I simply made "
"them come to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈이다. 수십 명의 필멸자를 쉽게 물리칠 수 있는 힘을 부여한다. 내 궁전에서 보물을 도둑질한 "
"도둑의 은신처를 발견한 후 나는 눈을 사용하여 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 성벽 안에 있는 모든 사람들의 마음을 제어했다. 나는 "
"그들을 간단하게 오도록 명령했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "1b5052eb-f205-4ff1-aa37-8e56e6af7df8"
msgid ""
"\"Without the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}, I won't be able to give "
"those thieves what they truly deserve. Everyone must pay — from the ruler of "
"the place down to the last mewling brat born within its wretched walls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Abaddon} 나락{/g}의 눈이 없이 나는 그 도둑들을 벌하지 못했을 것이다. 성벽 안의 모든 생물은 대가를 지불해야 했다. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "0cfb92d6-ae6b-4a62-ac61-641cc9eb3a01"
msgid ""
"\"Everything concerning magic still quickens my pulse. It reminds me of the "
"days when reality itself could change with a mere snap of my fingers. As for "
"matters concerning humans... let's put it this way: my attitude towards "
"lesser races hasn't changed at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법과 관련이 있으면 내 맥박은 빨라진다. 그것은 내 손가락을 튕기는 것만으로도 모든 현실을 바꿀 수 있는 상상을 하게 한다. 인간에 "
"관한 문제는... 그 하등한 종족에 관한 태도는 전혀 바뀌지 않았다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "f188ad23-da5c-4ec3-b311-c24a92e84aeb"
msgid ""
"{n}'Maegar' curves his lips in a wicked grin.{/n} \"I'm done with your "
"'affairs'. I will no longer waste my precious time on them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}'메이가르'는 사악한 미소로 입술이 구부러집니다.{/n} \"나는 너희의 일은 볼 일이 없다. 나는 더 이상 내 소중한 시간을 "
"낭비하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "b29f6a34-1d34-4a53-8e9d-fb957048db8f"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" greets you with a watchful gaze, sniffing the air around you, "
"as if trying to detect some smell.{/n} \"I knew it. Necromancy, here, under "
"the city. That's what's been bothering me lately...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 당신 주위의 공기를 맡다가 어떤 냄새를 맡았다는 듯한 시선으로 당신을 환영합니다.{/n} \"나는 알고 있었다. "
"이 곳, 도시 그늘에 숨어든, 사령술에 대해서. 그 문제가 날 귀찮게 하는군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "67018d93-329a-4e97-88f2-5a0f01faa742"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes, please listen — about that hole you found in the well. Everything "
"down there was permeated with magical energy, and not a simple kind. The "
"signature, the principles... the one who used to dwell there learned much "
"from the cyclopes. And it would be good if he didn't use any of my own "
"designs...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 우물에서 발견한 그 구멍이라. 그 아래의 모든 것들은 단순한 물질이 아니라 마법의 에너지로 스며든다. 그 원리... 그곳에서 "
"살던 자들은 사이클롭스에게서 많은 것을 배웠다. 그가 나를 그대로 흉내내지 않았다면 좋겠군... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "3974d846-6ad2-4350-bd42-121d9126255e"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" takes the key into his hands and seems to sniff it, and then "
"bursts into laughter.{/n}\n"
"\"This key? I wish I knew whose joke this was, and what it's all about! — "
"This is a phylactery. It's the source of a lich's un-life... Someone risks "
"the same path that I once followed. True greatness often gives rise to a "
"crowd of imitators.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 그 열쇠를 손에 넣고 냄새를 맡더니 웃음 소리를 지릅니다.{/n}\n"
"\"이 열쇠? 누가, 왜 이런 장난을 쳤는지 궁금하군! — 이것은 일종의 부적이다. 리치의 불멸의 원천이지... 누군가 나와 같은 길을 "
"택했군. 진정한 위업은 한 떼의 모방자를 양산하곤 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "b6200f08-6d2b-4c9c-9873-574a4815fa29"
msgid ""
"\"Nevertheless, keep an eye on this riddle. Otherwise this ant-hill you call "
"your capital won't be lasting long…\""
msgstr "\"그럼에도 불구하고 이 수수께끼에 주목해라. 그렇지 않으면 네가 수도라 부르는 이 개미 언덕은 오래가지 못할 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "1921a9e9-aa77-4d35-a982-4ecebdb8798e"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt this 'mage' is still among the living. He's off somewhere, happily "
"serving as an obedient zombie, squirming at the feet of his new master — the "
"one whose traces I've sensed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 '마법사'가 여전히 살아있는 사람인지 의심스럽다. 그는 어딘가에서 행복하게 순종하는 좀비로서의 역할을 다하고 그의 주인 "
"발치에서 꿈틀대겠지. 그 주인의 흔적이 느껴진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "96cb7f7d-708b-4c3a-9356-3ec1cf456f42"
msgid ""
"\"No. This is not cyclopean work. I can only assume... In your books, I've "
"read of {g|Iobaria}Iobaria{/g}, a pathetic parasite that grew and fed on the "
"ruins of my empire. One of its mages might have learned the cyclopes' ways. "
"The thought that these putrid worms might have claimed our secrets — oh, it "
"sickens me... but most likely that's exactly what happened. The mage who "
"used to cast his spells in the ruins under the city was undoubtedly human.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니다. 이것은 사이클롭스의 작품이 아니다. 내 생각에는... 나는 너희 책에서 내 제국의 폐허에서 지식을 습득한 기생충 "
"{g|Iobaria}이오바리아{/g}에 대해 읽었다. 그 마법사 중 한 명은 사이클롭스의 방식을 배웠을 것이다. 이 뻔뻔스런 벌레들이 "
"우리의 비밀을 자기 것이라 주장했을지도 모른다. 골치 아픈 녀석들이군... 하지만 그런 일이 벌어졌다. 도시 밑의 폐허에서 마법을 쓰던 "
"마법사는 의심의 여지없이 인간이었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "6f081c75-8dc1-407a-9137-8bfe843a12f2"
msgid ""
"{n}\"Maegar\" curves his lips in a smug grin.{/n} \"That's the first good "
"news I've heard for a long, long time. Not everyone deserves immortality. "
"Definitely not those pathetic impostors living off the scraps of someone "
"else's power.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"메이가르\"는 입술이 비틀어지며 비웃음을 날립니다.{/n} \"오래, 아주 오랫동안 내가 들은 소식들 중 처음으로 좋은 "
"소식이군. 모두가 불멸을 얻지는 못한다. 누군가의 힘을 도둑질해서 사는 불쌍한 흉내꾼은 더더욱 아니지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/MaegarVordakai/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "6f87b67e-79a0-4b43-8c0c-c19a39921e0e"
msgid ""
"\"Why would I speak about what's been taken? Your henchman, this... priest — "
"he took it, carried it away, leaving me without my powers. When the Oculus "
"shone in my socket, there were no secrets to me. I could see everything, "
"reveal hidden faces, look into the future, subdue slaves... And now another "
"has those powers. I know not why or what for.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 일이 일어 났는지 내가 얘기해 볼까? 너의 심복... 그 사제가 그것을 가져가 내 힘을 빼앗았다. 내 눈이 빛났을 때 나는 알고 "
"있었다. 모든 것을 보고 숨겨진 얼굴과 노예를 제압한 미래를 들여다 보았다... 이제는 다른 자가 힘을 차지했다. 나는 그 이유는 알지 "
"못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "32ad6d60-2407-48f8-8d5d-e066916615bb"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "727f830a-4a70-4a49-90e3-60816398d910"
msgid "\"Why did you decide to help me?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 돕기로 결정했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c1a7814f-a588-4a5a-a4d1-3f1b6c6d3e7f"
msgid ""
"\"Do you believe Nyrissa spent thousands of years tormenting the Stolen "
"Lands against her will?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 의지에 상관 없이 수천 년 동안 도둑맞은 땅을 괴롭히며 산 것을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "dcd8d423-8c42-4085-b4ba-14adc0b34b92"
msgid "\"I have questions about Nyrissa and her curse.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사와 그녀의 저주에 대해 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6d1662aa-9651-4912-ba00-b59c8a34a0c2"
msgid "\"How do you like living in the city?\""
msgstr "\"도시에 사는 것은 살 만한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "8aa3a908-72f3-4b7f-800a-f877be6386d0"
msgid "\"Tell me about your past.\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "94044558-b1cc-4adc-8e01-4992e16be3fc"
msgid "\"What does Nyrissa want from me, anyway?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 나에게 무엇을 원하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "f9a22683-a9ee-44a2-8636-d7ffcf0310ad"
msgid "\"What did Nyrissa do?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 한 짓이 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "eacb26f0-74f8-4626-84f2-fa563c3fd043"
msgid "\"What exactly was this curse?\""
msgstr "\"이 저주는 정확히 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "ecbc39f8-e0f5-49b3-b2ca-01773b83b3de"
msgid "\"What happens once Nyrissa collects her thousand grains?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 천 번째의 알갱이를 모으면 무슨 일이 일어나지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "06158abb-bd38-4e1d-b5f9-039b5b303c33"
msgid "\"You've mentioned immortality several times. Can you not die?\""
msgstr "\"너는 불멸을 여러 번 언급했다. 너는 불멸인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "9173128a-67f8-4a17-a04b-e07ddaf2b1f9"
msgid "\"I've learned all I needed. Thank you.\""
msgstr "\"필요한 모든 것을 배웠다. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "5362e790-d9e1-4376-90a6-0398e12ab214"
msgid ""
"\"Golarion is huge, with many kingdoms. Why did Nyrissa focus on the Stolen "
"Lands?\""
msgstr "\"골라리온은 여러 왕국으로 이뤄진 큰 국가이다. 왜 나이리사는 도둑맞은 땅에 집중했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "b9256218-f1ce-482f-b65d-54bb1abe1ae7"
msgid "\"Thank you for the conversation. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"정보를 공유해주어 고맙다. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "05ba2dcb-dd6e-4068-aed2-8b468c45a6d5"
msgid "\"Enough about the curse for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "c6243577-9d9d-448f-bcb9-633df03f2833"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt Nyrissa will leave me be. Do you have any ideas on what my next "
"steps should be?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 나를 내버려둘지 의심스럽다. 나는 다음에 어떻게 해야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c9012833-ae2b-48b6-b2cb-b3e1fdf3a302"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra stares at you with big, sad eyes, a light shawl wrapped around "
"her shoulders.{/n} \"{d|c51 Evindra Capital}Greetings{/d}. What would you "
"like to discuss?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어깨에 숄을 감은 에빈드라는 크고 슬픈 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \" {d|c51 Evindra capital}안녕{/d}"
". 무엇에 대해 얘기할까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "c0340e37-c2a3-4eba-b99c-92773f1d337b"
msgid ""
"\"All of us, including Nyrissa and those you knew as the Defaced Sisters, "
"are children of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. We used to be close, "
"like sisters, though Nyrissa always shone brightest — like the Moon among a "
"sea of stars. She was our leader long before she tried to become one of the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} — though she was defeated and cursed in the process. We "
"trusted her with our lives and followed her despite the danger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사와 얼굴 잃은 자매들로 알려진 이들을 포함해, 우리는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 자식들이다. 나이리사가 가장 "
"밝게 빛났어도 우리는 자매처럼 가까웠다. 마치 달 주위의 은하수처럼. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 되기 전에 그녀는 우리의 지도자였다 "
"— 그 과정에서 패배하고 저주를 받았지만. 우리는 위험을 무릅쓰고 그녀를 따랐다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "04f84f99-0b99-449f-b185-9e09952c32a0"
msgid ""
"\"I like to think of the time before the curse as our 'youth' — though by "
"mortal standards, it would have seemed to last forever. We were bold, "
"overconfident, and full of high hopes. We yearned to change the world. And "
"we never knew true fear — the creatures of the {g|First World}First World{/g}"
" are immortal, and thus careless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주를 받기 전을 우리가 젊었을 때라고 생각한다. 필멸이었을지라도 영원할 것 같았다. 우리는 강하고 거만하며 희망이 넘쳤다. 우리는 "
"세상을 바꿀 것을 갈망했다. 우리는 진정한 두려움을 몰랐다. 우리는 불멸에 무자비한 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 "
"생물들의 존재도 몰랐었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "83d14aaa-47aa-44c6-b056-263146902a20"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa used to call me her Grumpy Cousin, because I would always question "
"her plans. In all honesty, though I would tease her and point out flaws in "
"her plans, I always believed deep in my heart that she would succeed. And "
"then we would laugh together over my pointless fears. If you could only "
"imagine how much I miss those times...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 항상 그녀의 계획에 토를 달아서 나이리사는 나를 언제나 심술궂은 사촌이라고 불렀다. 솔직히 그녀를 괴롭히고 그녀의 계획에 흠집을 "
"내어도 내 마음 속 깊은 곳에서는 그녀가 성공할 것이라는 것을 믿음이 항상 있었다. 말도 안되는 내 두려움에 우리는 함께 웃고는 했다. "
"그 때가 얼마나 그리운지 너는 모를 것이다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "338dd856-abaf-424d-a395-d83cc4a9d640"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot stand aside any longer. If there is even a small chance to save "
"Nyrissa, I must find it. And if there is truly no hope... then I will do "
"what I can to help atone for all the evil she has wrought. I know that "
"Nyrissa — the Nyrissa from before, the Nyrissa I still remember and love — "
"could not bear the thought of what she has become, what she has been forced "
"to do. Even killing her would be more merciful than allowing her to remain a "
"monster.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 기다리지 않고 움직일 것이다. 나이리사를 구할 기회가 조금이라도 있으면 그것을 찾아야만 한다. 정말 희망이 없다면... 그녀가 "
"저지른 악을 속죄하기 위해 할 수 있는 일을 다할 것이다. 나는 나이리사를 안다. 내가 기억하는 내가 여전히 사랑하는 이전의 나이리사는 "
"악행을 저지른 지금과 같은 자신의 모습은 견디지도 못할 것이다. 그녀를 괴물로 두는 것보다 죽이는 것이 자비로울 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "e3c9fc2b-ef96-4927-864c-cc7b22eec820"
msgid ""
"\"Yes and no. The curse deprived her of a primal essence of her soul — her "
"ability to love. I believe deeply that any mind, no matter how bright, will "
"turn to evil if cut off from love. Nyrissa even began treating us, her "
"closest friends and sworn sisters, as little more than living tools — let's "
"not even mention how she treated mortals. One whose heart knows no "
"compassion is incapable of mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞지만 아니기도 하다. 저주는 그녀 영혼의 본질을 빼앗았다. 사랑하는 감정을. 사랑하지 못한다면 아무리 밝은 사람일지라도 악이 될 "
"것이다. 나이리사는 우리와 가장 친한 친구들 그저 살아있는 도구에 불과했던 자매들을 돌보기 시작했다. 필멸자를 대우한 그녀의 태도는 "
"언급하지 않겠다. 동정심이 없는 자는 자비를 베풀 수 없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "adb8e402-2d83-4d63-9fd6-c89aa5eddb0f"
msgid "\"What would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"알고 싶은 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "875b8601-48d9-41ba-83d4-4c6e2722d692"
msgid ""
"\"It is hard. Nymphs, dryads, nereids... we are all children of nature. We "
"have little fondness for the structures built by humans — they're like stone "
"anthills to us. But now is not the time to worry about comfort. When the "
"stone and noise around me become unbearable, I simply go into the lake. The "
"{g|Tuskwater}Tuskwater{/g} could use some care, and perhaps the settlers "
"will treat the lake better if they know it has a patron.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어렵다. 님프, 드라이어드, 네레이드... 우리는 모두 자연의 아이들이다. 인간에 의해 만들어진 구조물은 좋아하지 않아. 우리에게는 "
"개미들이 지은 돌탑에 지나지 않다. 지금은 편안함에 대해 걱정할 시간이 아니다. 내 주변의 돌과 소음이 참을 수 없을 때 나는 호수에 "
"들어가면 된다. {g|Tuskwater}터스크워터{/g}는 보살펴줄 수 있고, 후원자가 있는 걸 안다면 정착민들은 호수에게 더 잘 "
"대해주었을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "e7b29839-a35b-46f1-a94e-a816bff7762e"
msgid "\"Ask what you will. I'll try to answer.\""
msgstr "\"물어봐. 나는 최대한 대답해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "e9243880-7edb-475c-b152-f309d412ae0b"
msgid ""
"\"Answering that will require you know a bit more about the {g|First World}"
"First World{/g}. The gods forsook the First World long ago — and they were "
"replaced by the creatures we call the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. The Lost Prince "
"and {g|Shyka}Shyka the Many{/g}, Magdh and the {g|LanternKing}Lantern "
"King{/g}... There are many of them, as diverse as they are immensely "
"powerful. Nyrissa wished to become one of them, to gain the power to build "
"her own realm — a stronghold of spring, creation, and love.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 질문에 답하려면 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 대해 더 알려줄 필요가 있겠군. 신들은 오래 전에 태초 세계를 "
"버렸다. 그 자리는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 차지했지. 잃어버린 왕자, {g|Shyka}다수의 샤이카{/g}, 마그드와 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g} 같은 이들이다. 수많은 존재가 각기 다른 강력한 힘을 지녔지. 나이리사는 봄과 창조와 사랑의 "
"성채를 만들고자, 원로가 되길 꿈꿨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "8b0a2492-d026-4ff2-b89c-3e17d0d78787"
msgid ""
"\"And these are not just fancy words. In the {g|First World}First World{/g}, "
"anyone with enough power can shape reality — literally. To create, to fill "
"with life, and to rally those who shared her vision — that is what Nyrissa "
"wanted. But the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} are jealous beings, and they do not "
"tolerate challenges to their power. They unleashed a monster against us, one "
"of the Tane, the most fearsome servants of the Eldest. Nyrissa fought it. "
"She lost. You know what happened next.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 단순한 상상의 단어가 아니었다. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서는, 충분한 힘만 있다면 현실을 바꿀 수 있다 —"
" 말 그대로. 창조와 생기로 가득하고, 그녀와 같은 생각을 가진 이들이 모이는곳 — 그것이 나이리사가 원했던 것이다. 하지만 "
"{g|Eldest} 원로{/g}는 시기심이 많은 존재이고, 그들의 힘에 도전하는 것을 용인하지 않는다. 그들은 원로의 가장 무서운 "
"하수인인 테인중 하나를 풀어 우리를 괴롭혔다. 나이리사는 그것과 싸웠었고, 패배했다. 그 다음에는 무슨 일이 있었는지 알겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "4289345d-a98a-459f-99f2-5cef3fb81bf1"
msgid ""
"\"It deprived Nyrissa of her immortality. Even worse, it deprived her of "
"part of her soul. The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, they... they extracted her "
"ability to love. Turned it into an artifact — Briar. But the curse was not "
"just a punishment, it was also a painful way to atone for her misconduct. "
"Nyrissa was promised forgiveness once she helped to destroy one thousand "
"kingdoms. Each kingdom destroyed became a grain of dust dropped into a magic "
"cup called 'the Apology.' And as you are aware, the cup is almost full...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 불멸성을 빼앗겼다. 심지어, 그녀의 영혼마저 박탈당했다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}, 그들... 그들은 그녀의 사랑을 "
"뽑아냈다. 그리고는 그것을 아티팩트, 찔레로 만들었다. 그러나 저주는 단순히 처벌이 아니었고, 그녀의 죄를 속죄하는 고통스런 길이기도 "
"했다. 나이리사는 천 개의 왕국을 파괴하면 용서를 받을 수 있었다. 파괴된 왕국은 '사죄'라는 마법의 잔에 떨어지는 먼지가 되었다. "
"그리고 당신이 본 대로, 그 잔은 거의 가득 찼다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "bf3cfba7-a929-4685-9299-9a6b210f199e"
msgid ""
"\"The souls of {g|First World}First World{/g} creatures don't follow the "
"same laws set by the gods for other living beings. If we die, we lose a "
"significant part of our power, but we are born again with all of our "
"memories, looking just the same as before.\n"
"But this only works for deaths on our home plane. That is why my kin avoids "
"traveling abroad — they fear the forever-death that awaits them in other "
"worlds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g} 생물의 영혼은 다른 세계의 생명체와는 다른 법칙을 따른다. 우리가 죽으면 힘의 상당 "
"부분을 잃어버리지만, 과거와 기억을 간직한 채 똑같은 모습으로 되살아난다. \n"
"그러나 이것은 우리 세계에서 죽었을 때만 작용한다. 그래서 나의 일족은 여행을 꺼려한다. 그들은 다른 세계에서 영원한 죽음을 맞을까 "
"두려워한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "985f4a2e-4db5-44eb-bab2-9e4dbaa2307e"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "d2817df5-c9ae-4e84-961b-dd08a48b81c8"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} have always had a strong connection "
"to the {g|First World}First World{/g}, though this is not the sole reason. "
"Somewhere in these lands, the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} hid Briar as part of "
"their curse.\" {n}Evindra closes her eyes and, in a singsong voice, "
"recites,{/n} \"Let your unrequited love guide you — as it guided you to your "
"first kingdom, so it shall again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것이 유일한 원인은 아니지만, {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 항상 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}와 "
"강하게 연결되어 있었다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 그들이 내린 저주의 일환으로 이 땅 어딘가에 찔레를 숨겼다.\" {n}에빈드라는 "
"눈을 감고 낭랑한 목소리로 암송합니다.{/n} \"네 조건없는 사랑을 따라가라 — 그것이 너를 첫번째 왕국으로 인도했으니, 또 다시 "
"그럴것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "6c63d69a-4101-400f-8221-63453231fc2a"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa was deprived of the very part of her essence that led to her bold "
"plan in the first place. They took it from her, and for ages she has been "
"seeking what she lost. It must be excruciating — to feel the call of what "
"was once an inseparable part of you, and to be unable to find it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 자신의 대담한 계획을 이끌어내는 본질의 일부를 처음부터 빼앗겼다. 그들이 그것을 가져갔고, 그 이후로 그녀는 잃어버린 것을 "
"찾고 있었다. 떼놓을 수 없는 자신의 일부가 애타게 부르는데도 찾을 수 없는 고통은 이루 말할 수 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "c917edb0-04a0-414a-b607-7a69388471e7"
msgid ""
"\"Who can say? In my limited understanding, the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} are "
"cold, distant, alien beings. Nyrissa will bring them her filled cup, and "
"then... I can't even imagine. But I doubt it will end happily. What they did "
"to her, the fate they brought upon a thousand kingdoms... it all seems "
"unimaginably cruel. Whatever they have in mind must be yet crueler, I'm sure "
"of it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 알겠어? 내가 아는 한, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 냉정하고, 가까이할 수 없는, 외차원의 존재이다. 나이리사는 그들에게 "
"잔을 채워 가져갈 것이다, 그 뒤는... 나는 상상조차 할 수 없어. 그러나 행복한 결말은 아니겠지. 그들이 그녀에게 저지른 짓과, "
"그들이 천 개의 왕국들에 불러온 운명... 모두 상상할 수 없을 정도로 끔찍하다. 그들이 무슨 생각을 하고있던 지금보다 더 잔인해 "
"질거야, 이건 확실해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "fdcfb866-0e6f-4ff3-9bd4-ff75e888f2f8"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. It is hardly a topic one would want to discuss for long...\""
msgstr "\"물론. 그리 오랫동안 얘기하고 싶은 주제는 아니었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "7999c932-cc1f-4b46-a5a8-43c8765459cd"
msgid ""
"\"There is one thing... Find Briar, the artifact created from the stolen "
"part of Nyrissa's soul. I know not what power it holds, but I am sure — if "
"anything can alter the sinister story we have all become characters in, it "
"is Briar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 가지... 나이리사의 영혼의 일부분이었던 유물 찔레를 찾아라. 나는 누가 그것을 가지게 될지 모르지만 이 비극적인 이야기를 바꿀 "
"수 있는 것은 찔레 밖에 없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "35248cb2-372a-4c52-80e1-b52f5a4e720e"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra frowns.{/n} \"I can only speculate, but... perhaps you should "
"begin your search by contacting Irovetti. He's spent a long time searching "
"for Briar, at Nyrissa's command. As to how you might obtain any information "
"from him... well, that is another question entirely. I wish you luck!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에빈드라는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나는 단지 추측만 할 뿐이다... 하지만 이로베티를 만나는 것부터 시작해라. 그는 나이리사의 "
"명령으로 찔레를 오랜 시간 동안 찾고 있었다. 그 사람으로부터 정보를 얻는 방법에 관해서는... 다른 이에게 물어봐라. 행운을 빌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "d3b948cc-c0b3-4ea7-82f6-669f86dc6498"
msgid ""
"\"You found it, did you not? Briar... I can feel its power. Like hearing an "
"echo of her laughter — so pure, so familiar... This cannot be anything but a "
"piece of Nyrissa's soul. Good. Very good. Keep it close, and do not lose it. "
"When the decisive moment comes, it will help you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것을 발견했군? 찔레... 그 힘이 느껴진다. 그녀의 웃음소리와 같아. 순수하고 친근한... 이건 다름아닌 나이리사의 영혼이니. "
"아주 좋다. 소중히 다루어 잃어버리지 말기를 바란다. 결정적인 순간에 너를 도울 것이다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "cba89e17-3a35-4105-ab71-a87689b91094"
msgid ""
"\"The same thing she wanted from the successful aspirants who came before "
"you — willingly or unwillingly. For centuries, she has sought out strong, "
"ambitious, promising people within the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, "
"helped them grow and build their own kingdoms — and then pitted them against "
"one another. This is what happened with Armag, the proud barbarian "
"chieftain. This is what happened to Irovetti, the cunning schemer. And this "
"will happen to you as well, eventually.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 오기 전에 그녀를 찾은 포부가 큰 자들의 것이다. 수세기 동안 그녀는 강하고 장래가 촉망되는 사람을 {g|Stolen Lands}"
"도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 찾아 왕국을 세우는 것을 도왔다. 그리고는 그들을 서로 싸우게 했다. 그것이 야만족 족장 아르막에게 일어난 "
"일이다. 그리고 교활한 책략가 이로베티도. 결국 너에게도 같은 일이 벌어질 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "72f39558-455d-487f-a486-61a7f06cd389"
msgid ""
"\"Within the city, Elina the innkeeper takes care of me. In return, I help "
"her purify and enchant water for her drinks. It is so nice to have a friend "
"again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도시 안에서 여관 주인 엘리나가 나를 돌봐주었다. 보답으로 나는 그녀의 마실 것을 정화한 마법의 물로 바꾸었다. 친구를 다시 만드니 "
"좋구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "02b00b61-206a-40e3-b534-e1d59c2cd61a"
msgid ""
"\"But the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} are sewn to the {g|First World}"
"First World{/g} with the threads of the Bloom. It affects everything — even "
"the life cycle. Those who die within the Bloom or in places like "
"{g|Candlemere}Candlemere{/g}, where the First World and "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} are close as twins in a mother's womb, will return "
"to our homeland and be resurrected there. This is why you can find so many "
"fey creatures in your kingdom — curiosity drives them here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}가 퍼뜨린 개화로 피폐해졌다. "
"그것은 모든 것을 바꾸었다 — 심지어 생명의 순환까지. 태초 세계와 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}이 마치 같은 배에서 나온 쌍둥이 "
"같은 지역인 {g|Candlemere}캔들미어{/g}나 개화가 일어난 지역 내에서 죽은 자는 우리의 고향으로 돌아가 다시 부활할 것이다. "
"그래서 너의 왕국에 페이들이 많은 것이다. 그들은 호기심에 이끌려왔다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/NereidEvindra/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "3ebc210a-2f74-4a39-baba-b96fd70c0c0c"
msgid ""
"\"There is... one more reason I've spoken about immortality. My poor sisters "
"— the nymphs — shared the burden of the curse with Nyrissa. The curse tore "
"them from the eternal cycle of life of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. "
"Now they can really die, even in the First World — just like you and "
"everyone else around them. I suppose the curse didn't impact me as heavily. "
"Perhaps because I tried to dissuade Nyrissa from her plan at the outset, or "
"perhaps because I tried to fight the evil that plan bestowed upon us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불멸에 대해 말하는 다른 이유가 있다. 내 불쌍한 님프 자매들은 나이리사가 받은 저주의 짐을 나눴다. {g|First World} "
"태초 세계{/g}의 영원한 삶으로부터 그들은 저주로 고통받는다. 이제 그들은 너나 주변의 다른 모든 사람들처럼 태초 세계에서도 죽을 수 "
"있다. 저주는 나에게 큰 영향을 미치지 않았던 것 같다. 아마 나이리사를 처음부터 계획에서 단념시키려고 했기 때문일 수도 있다. 아니면 "
"우리에게 주어진 악과 싸우려고 했기 때문인지도 모른다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b75af824-176b-4caf-8c4d-bc7d12276f2f"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "42c6030c-4252-40ed-88d1-a2a63cf3e5a7"
msgid "\"Could you perhaps speak a bit more slowly?\""
msgstr "\"조금만 더 천천히 말해줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "97d3b28b-4fd7-4516-9c93-033165d242c9"
msgid "\"I need to go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "583725d4-44ab-462b-8405-e371720b6825"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "f9b69940-6150-4435-ac10-acb4c92407e3"
msgid "\"Where do your goods come from?\""
msgstr "\"이 물건들은 다 어디서 난거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "50350da5-d890-403f-9466-499dfdbf75e2"
msgid ""
"{n}The tiefling girl looks as though she's made of springs: she cannot stand "
"still for a moment. She nods her head, snaps her fingers, and taps her feet "
"to an inner, whirling song. Seeing you, she quickly waves her hand and "
"breaks into a wide smile – and immediately starts jabbering:{/n} \""
"{mf|Y'grace!|Y'grace!|Y'highness!|Y'highness!} Welcome! Whad ya want? "
"Scrolls? I have 'em! Ya won't regret it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이 티플링 소녀는 마치 용수철로 만들어 진것 같습니다. 잠시도 가만히 서있지 못하고 고개를 끄떡이며 손가락을 팅기거나, 주변에서 "
"들려오는 노래소리에 맞춰 스텝을 밟기도 합니다. 당신을 보자 활짝 웃으며 빠르게 손짓하며 다가와 즉시 말을 걸어댑니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 어서와요! 어떤거 찾으시는데? 스크롤? 여기 많아많아! 함 보구가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f6c57204-4829-43dd-b095-1dff1172c8a7"
msgid ""
"{mf|Y'grace!|Y'grace!|Y'highness!|Y'highness!} Lookie, lookie! I gotta... "
"This here! Scrolls! New! They're ter-rif-fic!\" {n}Laughing, she slaps her "
"bag.{/n} \"And it's all thanks to you! Since ya started opening them "
"libraries and improving learnin' 'round these parts, mages from all over "
"mobbed the place! And the more mages, the more demand – and more goodies for "
"you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 이거봐요, 이거이거! 스크롤! 쌔거! 완전 멋져-!\" {n}웃으면서 그녀의 가방을 "
"툭툭칩니다.{/n} \"이게 다 덕분이에요! 도서관을 열고 공부를 시작 시키니까 마법사들이 여기저기서 몰려들기 시작했구요! 마법사들이 "
"모여들면? 스크롤을 더 산다이거죠. 게다가 새로운 물건들도 들여왔어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "4407f46c-252e-497c-b561-58a3a8816311"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Y'grace!|Y'grace!|Y'highness!|Y'highness!} Welcome! Whad ya want?!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}! 어서와요! 어떤거 찾으시는데요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "7a6134c7-3cc8-47d6-b001-6169f9f69e76"
msgid "\"Sure, sure, as ya wish!\""
msgstr "\"그래요, 그래, 원하신다면요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "73472e04-c02d-49b8-b1b1-832bd292cb69"
msgid "\"You'll be back, I know it!\" {n}The girl waves her hand laughing.{/n}"
msgstr "\"분명 다시 돌아오실 꺼에요. 난 알아!\" {n}소녀는 웃으면서 손을 흔들어 댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9984c49d-14c9-4ed1-8ba8-05c8c8246a1b"
msgid ""
"\"Zarcie the Letter Gobbler, at yer service!\" {n}The girl bows with a wide "
"smile.{/n} \"Best spells, charms, jinxes and hexes for the best "
"{mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} across all the River Kingdoms! Buy it all – "
"and don't be stingy. Ya won't regret it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"스크롤 탐독자, 자르시에라고 합니다! {n}소녀는 활짝 웃으며 고개숙여 인사합니다{/n} \"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 "
"왕국들{/g}에서 건너온 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}에게 딱맞는 최상품질 마법, 주문, 저주나 의식들을 팔아요! 이런데 돈아끼면 "
"안되요. 일단 전부 다 사가봐요. 후회 안한다니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "8c6a34fd-75dc-49cb-ab53-38e6bb753dc8"
msgid ""
"\"It's a family business! I've got siblings across all Mendev! They pinch "
"every... Eh, I mean, they're very creative suppliers! And I sell it all! Get "
"it now! Don't hesitate! My goodies're gre-e-eat!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저희 집안 가업이에요! 모든 멘데브 지역에 걸쳐 형제자매들이 쫙 퍼져있어요! 다들 매일같이 물건을 슬쩍해서..아, 그러니까 제말은, "
"매일같이 물건을 다양한 방법으로 들여와요. 그리고는 쫙 팔죠! 지금이에요! 망설이지 말고 지금 구매하세요! 물건 완전 딱 조--아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "b58e0239-de83-49b5-9db7-07fe2375a365"
msgid ""
"\"My suppliers'll bring more scrolls for sale, if ya manage to attract more "
"mages to yer lands! More mages – more demand – and more goodies for you! So "
"go build them libraries, and we'll both profit from it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 이 지역에 더 많은 마법사들이 모여들게 할수 있다면, 제 공급자들이 더 많은 두루마리를 팔려고 가지고 올 거예요. 더 많은 "
"마법사가 모이면? 더 많이 팔린다는거고, 그럼 물건도 더 늘어나죠! 그러니 도서관을 지어주시면 우리 둘 다 거기서 이익을 얻을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ScrollVendor/ScrollVendorName_String
msgctxt "8c904b28-a659-4b8e-956b-eff3158ec521"
msgid "Zarcie"
msgstr "자르시에"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Bandit_01_String
msgctxt "3c7eb61d-0649-41dd-8124-88ff949d7395"
msgid "\"You got the wrong guy! I'm healthy!\""
msgstr "\"사람 잘못봤군! 나는 건강해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Bandit_02_String
msgctxt "c07403c8-5d31-4a86-aaf1-7cd57071ccc5"
msgid "\"I don't got a plague! I'm just a normal highwayman!\""
msgstr "\"나는 전염병이 없다! 나는 평범한 노상강도일 뿐이라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Bandit_03_String
msgctxt "94a86184-e0c2-4253-9645-6fb77b5a82b2"
msgid ""
"\"Hang me if you want, just don't keep me here! I don't want to explode!\""
msgstr "\"원한다면 나를 죽여라. 제발 여기에 나를 두지마! 나는 폭발하고 싶지 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_01_String
msgctxt "d5542b65-9e98-4802-8e94-89c4a27a1a3e"
msgid "\"Will you heal us?\""
msgstr "\"저희를 치유해 주실 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_02_String
msgctxt "72462aef-a73f-4094-b0d3-9ca3c63350f7"
msgid "\"Why me? Why?!\""
msgstr "\"왜 나야? 왜?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_03_String
msgctxt "55776891-b365-4d2e-b270-370f6b8fddbe"
msgid "\"Have you found a cure?\""
msgstr "\"치료법을 찾았나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_04_String
msgctxt "dd7b5bac-0bed-4d5d-ad58-3d82c67ac548"
msgid "\"How could I get infected?\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 감염될 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_05_String
msgctxt "066eb97a-2b1f-4c32-a08a-d57dd4913d79"
msgid "\"Cough, cough!\""
msgstr "\"콜록, 콜록!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_06_String
msgctxt "c4679624-b717-4b0a-9a31-f772f2cab3d8"
msgid "\"Why am I locked up in here? It's just a common cold!\""
msgstr "\"왜 내가 여기에 갇혀있지? 나는 그냥 감기에 걸렸는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_07_String
msgctxt "505b6db5-feda-4939-9181-e3313cd98ca3"
msgid "\"Please, don't let us die!\""
msgstr "\"제발 우리를 죽게 내버려 두지마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_08_String
msgctxt "cb9eec28-9692-469b-8dd9-5f54e7f1f8f1"
msgid "\"Where did this calamity come from? Never seen anything like it!\""
msgstr "\"이 재앙은 어디에서 왔는가? 듣도 보도 못했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_09_String
msgctxt "156f4e8b-3029-4227-9088-8f3f58b3a60a"
msgid "\"I have a fever... Give me some water!\""
msgstr "\"나는 열이 있다... 물 좀 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_10_String
msgctxt "f3f7d9d5-37f5-4ace-a536-7ed80bd51ed3"
msgid "\"Terrible nausea... Can't eat or drink...\""
msgstr "\"너무 메스꺼워... 먹거나 마실 수도 없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Patient_After_Surgery_String
msgctxt "b892ae65-d2e6-4b82-94bf-8adf54a3254a"
msgid "\"Phew... Barely survived it!\""
msgstr "\"휴... 겨우겨우 목숨을 건졌어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Sadist_Mage_Flee_String
msgctxt "d2205ae5-ca33-414d-b03d-310a3a6fe06a"
msgid "\"Monsters? Again?!\""
msgstr "\"괴물? 또?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Sadist_Mage_Idle_String
msgctxt "b2d0132b-6871-467f-8096-66a9814d3501"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your kind invitation. I hope I can be of great service to "
"you.\""
msgstr "\"초대해주어 고맙습니다. 당신께 도움이 될 수 있기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_1_String
msgctxt "334605ec-902f-426a-8558-1318e887338e"
msgid ""
"Instead of a lock, the door is latched with a simple strand of metal wire. "
"Some security they have here!"
msgstr "자물쇠 대신에 문은 단단한 철사로 걸쇠를 감았습니다. 누군가 잠갔나 봅니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_2_String
msgctxt "b74d531e-46b1-47c5-a68e-8b7b00b8b89d"
msgid "The rusty grate squeaks horribly."
msgstr "녹슨 쇠격자가 심하게 삐걱거립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_3_String
msgctxt "db890bc7-e591-4c18-9227-336bdbe73f05"
msgid ""
"The walls are covered with moss and mold. Not a good place for a hospital."
msgstr "벽은 이끼와 곰팡이로 덮여있습니다. 병원에는 좋지 않은 장소입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_4_String
msgctxt "2e67d6f6-0ab9-4424-b66e-84b98950f7fc"
msgid "The table is covered with very disturbing stains."
msgstr "테이블은 매우 지저분한 얼룩으로 덮여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_5_String
msgctxt "e2a82e5a-fdd9-4c4f-bd23-f468bdc2bda6"
msgid "This machine looks quite foreboding."
msgstr "이 기계는 매우 불길해 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_6_String
msgctxt "d9a92b24-c10a-45b6-ad0f-cb529d65145d"
msgid "There are bloody rags lying in the trash."
msgstr "쓰레기통에 피 묻은 넝마가 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_7_String
msgctxt "37e4f7d4-cc98-4b62-9e10-3d056dd9f998"
msgid "The food is untouched. It seems the sickness kills all appetite."
msgstr "음식은 손이 타지 않았습니다. 질병이 모든 식욕을 죽이는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Barks/Zone_8_String
msgctxt "14f81e4f-cdcc-4a7f-85c4-a7d105b6f196"
msgid "A vomit stain."
msgstr "구토물 자국입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b69f41c8-2519-45a4-86db-caacbc1980a2"
msgid ""
"... to side with Jhod and search for the source of the disease in the "
"patient's lungs."
msgstr "... 조드 카브켄과 함께 환자의 폐에 있는 질병의 근원을 찾습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3fe55349-9a8b-465d-9288-70287da06e3a"
msgid ""
"... to side with Tristian and search for the source of the disease in the "
"patient's stomach."
msgstr "... 트리스티안과 함께 환자의 위에 있는 질병의 근원을 찾습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "665bfa25-4668-47e0-9bb6-cbe7d8fe60d4"
msgid "... to ask Bartholomew for help."
msgstr "... 바솔로뮤에게 도움을 청합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d22e7d40-8647-4a8b-b5a9-67fda1f99f32"
msgid "Settled the dispute between Jhod and Tristian with a coin toss."
msgstr "동전 던지기로 조드 카브켄과 Tristian 사이의 분쟁을 해결했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2c12de92-6173-4b96-a35f-b81b0611de3f"
msgid "... to decide by a coin toss."
msgstr "... 동전 던지기로 결정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4b45e2e3-23fe-4941-b9d7-8b54ea9668ad"
msgid ""
"... held the patient in position firmly to prevent her from hurting herself."
msgstr "... 환자가 자해하는 것을 막기 위해 단단히 붙잡아 두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "4ae4cbbc-c74c-4368-b060-de6d8619d1ca"
msgid ""
"... skillfully assisted Jhod by handing him instruments, wiping up blood, "
"and bringing healing potions as needed."
msgstr "... 능숙하게 도구를 건네주고 피를 닦고 필요에 따라 치유 물약을 건내주며 조드를 도와주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "c81adad1-b74c-4ba5-a3d1-565b4d624981"
msgid ""
"... helped Jhod by advising him on the fastest and most efficient way to "
"finish the surgery."
msgstr "... 조드가 수술을 끝내는 가장 빠르고 효율적인 방법을 알려주어 조드를 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "f6817012-eb43-49d1-9947-a3fb95c52307"
msgid ""
"... took the patient's hand and whispered something in her ear, distracting "
"her from the pain."
msgstr "... 환자의 손을 잡고 귀에 뭔가를 속삭여 통증에서 벗어나게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a243f3fe-2dd8-43e6-9b3f-ccb0245c71b8"
msgid "Killed Jhod's patient."
msgstr "조드의 환자를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "35ac9dc2-8784-4e4b-9e27-9b640c25f0a7"
msgid ""
"... made the cleric's job easier in the quickest and cruelest way — by "
"killing the patient on the spot."
msgstr "... 현장에서 환자를 빠르고 잔인하게 죽여 성직자의 일을 덜어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "547bc66f-90f1-4ecb-ade2-2e6f0a8b0fb0"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "349fcd93-81e8-497c-80da-81d6101d6d1a"
msgid ""
"Glancing nervously at the various medical instruments, the brave peasant "
"woman got up on the operating table. \"Just don't butcher me, is all I ask,\""
" she muttered in a trembling voice. Meanwhile, the foremost medical experts "
"in the room still couldn't agree on what exactly it was they were trying to "
"do. \"Stop arguing with me! Coughing up blood is a sure sign the problem is "
"in the lungs. We look there,\" Jhod insisted. \"No, it's the nausea we "
"should be focusing on. We need to examine the stomach,\" Tristian objected."
msgstr ""
"용감한 지원자는 종류가 다양한 수술 도구를 긴장한 듯 응시하며 수술대에 오릅니다. \"헛되이 죽지만 않았으면 좋겠네요. 바라는 건 "
"그뿐이에요\" 그녀는 떨리는 목소리로 중얼거립니다. 한편 의료 진은 의견이 분분해 결론을 내지 못합니다. \"그만! 객혈은 폐에 문제가 "
"있다는 확실한 신호다. 폐를 봐야 해.\" 조드가 주장합니다. \"아닙니다. 우리는 메스꺼운 증상에 집중해야 해요. 위를 검사해야 합니다."
"\" 트리스티안은 반대합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "551c6186-7481-4d34-a240-0f75a166af70"
msgid ""
"The clerics exchanged perplexed glances, but they couldn't come up with a "
"better solution. \"Heads,\" Jhod said weakly. \"Tails,\" Tristian answered "
"with a heavy sigh. The baron{mf||ess} tossed a coin."
msgstr ""
"성직자들은 난처한 시선을 주고 받았지만 더 나은 해결책을 찾지 못했습니다. \"앞.\"조드는 힘없이 말합니다. \"뒤.\" 트리스티안은 "
"무거운 한숨으로 대답합니다. 남작은 동전을 던졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "94bf7b33-d7e6-4c68-90c7-c83f824fb232"
msgid ""
"It came up heads. Tristian winced, and Jhod said a short prayer to "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} as he took up a scalpel."
msgstr ""
"동전은 앞면이 나왔습니다. 트리스탄은 찡그리고 조드는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}에게 짧은 기도를 올리고 메스를 집었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f932068b-8bad-4350-a9b2-1d715ffc5f5c"
msgid ""
"It came up tails. Jhod shook his head, and after a short prayer to "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, he took the lancet Tristian offered him."
msgstr ""
"동전은 꼬리가 나왔습니다. 조드는 머리를 흔들었고 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}에게 짧은 기도를 올리고 트리스티안이 건낸 랜싯을 "
"집습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ebcfdb9c-a8e7-4a7d-b214-a5fa9abc0c84"
msgid ""
"Tristian continued to object, but there was no more time for discussion. "
"After a short prayer to {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, Jhod took up a scalpel."
msgstr ""
"트리스티안은 계속 반대했지만 토론할 시간은 더 이상 없었습니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}에게 짧은 기도를 올린 후에 조드는 "
"메스를 집었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "9e519602-570a-414b-a2aa-ff39ffc87b14"
msgid ""
"Without wasting further time arguing, Jhod said a short prayer to "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} and took the scalpel Tristian offered him."
msgstr ""
"더 이상 논쟁을 하지 않고 조드는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}에게 짧은 기도를 올린 후 트리스티안이 건낸 메스를 집었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "354044ee-936a-4a51-a11d-51310e01386f"
msgid ""
"\"A common manner of dispelling is useless here, I assume,\" the wizard said "
"pompously. \"So then, let's try it at a higher level!\" He took a scroll out "
"of his bag and solemnly cast a spell on the patient. Jhod used magical sight "
"to see if there were any changes in the patient's body. \"It worked!\" he "
"exclaimed, excited. \"The magic is gone from all the organs except the "
"stomach! You were right, my friend! Hurry now, hand me a scalpel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 추측인데, 일반적인 해제마법은 여기서 소용 없다.\"마법사는 호쾌하게 말했습니다. \"그러니 더 높은 차원에서 시도해 보자!\" "
"그는 가방에서 두루마리를 꺼내어 엄숙하게 환자에게 주문을 시전했습니다. 조드는 마법을 사용하여 환자의 신체에 변화가 있는지 확인했습니다. "
"\"효과가 있었다!\" 그는 흥분하여 외쳤습니다. \"위를 제외한 모든 장기에서 마법이 사라졌다. 네가 옳았어! 서둘러. 나에게 메스를!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "2b0e6ab3-22bb-494e-839f-f43ee724d8ce"
msgid ""
"She desperately struggled to break free, but the baron{mf||ess}'s firm hands "
"kept her in place, letting Jhod work with precision."
msgstr "그녀는 빠져나오려 안간힘을 썼지만 남작의 손아귀를 벗어나지 못하여 조드는 수슬을 계속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "7f637743-f6ca-4f3a-a0fa-8cb80636cec7"
msgid ""
"She struggled, thrashed, flailed her arms, and kicked her legs — holding her "
"tightly was impossible. Jhod did what he could, but the moment came when "
"even his steady hands couldn't keep the scalpel from slipping."
msgstr ""
"그녀는 발로 차고 팔을 뿌리치며 저항했고 그녀를 잡는 것은 불가능했습니다. 조드는 최선을 다했지만 순간 그의 손에서 메스를 놓칩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "48fecc96-9a65-48f1-98f5-10c99360264a"
msgid ""
"With such expert help, Jhod was able to focus completely on the surgery."
msgstr "전문가의 도움으로 조드는 수술에 집중할 수 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "bf83b4ac-7a5b-4864-9b80-51f8a56deb80"
msgid ""
"Alas, these attempts did more harm than good. The baron{mf||ess} too often "
"mistakenly gave the wrong instruments, distracting the cleric from his work."
msgstr "시도하지 않는 것이 좋았습니다. 남작은 도구를 잘못 건내주어 성직자를 산만하게 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "56ba5882-6763-4c45-b549-1ae902934630"
msgid ""
"Candlelight reflected off the surgical instruments and potion bottles. As "
"Jhod's scalpel made the first incision on the woman's skin, I could hear her "
"inhale loudly through clenched teeth. I confess, I lacked the courage to "
"watch the surgery — even after I turned away, I couldn't help but tremble "
"from hearing the poor woman's screams. The air filled with the acrid scent "
"of medical potions while Tristian mumbled prayers to ease the patient's "
"pain, simultaneously scanning her body with magical sight. All I could do "
"was whisper my own prayers. But the baron{mf||ess}, {mf|he|she} didn't lose "
"{mf|his|her} courage. {mf|He|She}..."
msgstr ""
"촛불의 빛이 수술 도구와 포션 병에 반사되었습니다. 조드의 메스가 여자의 피부를 처음 절개할 때 그녀가 악문 이 사이로 숨을 깊게 "
"들이쉬었습니다. 이 수술 장면을 똑바로 보기란 힘든 것이었고 그녀의 비명 소리가 방안 구석구석을 채웠습니다. 트리스티안이 환자의 고통을 "
"덜어주기 위해 주문을 외우며 그녀의 몸에 탐지 마법을 쓰는 동안 의료용 포션 냄새가 방을 채우기 시작했습니다. 남작은 용기를 잃지 "
"않고..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "c7d039ad-ab34-4926-b8fd-33ec73751c9c"
msgid ""
"The poor woman's screams and crying were unbearable — I couldn't begin to "
"imagine what she was going through. \"I'm such a fool,\" Jhod finally "
"exclaimed. \"You were right! I'm glad we listened to you!\" Tristian used a "
"healing spell to close the wound in the woman's stomach, and Jhod showed "
"everyone the strange item he'd extracted."
msgstr ""
"불쌍한 여인의 비명과 울음소리는 견딜 수 없는 것이었습니다. 그녀가 겪은 고통은 상상할 수 없는 것이었습니다. 조드는 마침내 \"나는 "
"정말 바보로군.\"이라고 말합니다. \"네가 옳았어! 네 말을 들어 다행이군!\" 트리스티안은 치유 주문을 사용하여 절개된 위를 닫았고 "
"조드는 그가 추출해낸 이상한 물건을 보여주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "56ef6680-a4a0-4b14-a7f7-1d67845681b3"
msgid ""
"The poor woman's screams became a low whining, then stopped altogether. \"Oh"
", {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}...\" Jhod whispered. \"She's dead. I...\" Tristian "
"placed a hand on his shoulder. \"Please, don't blame yourself. You did all "
"you could. Now, you must finish what you started and make sure her sacrifice "
"wasn't in vain.\" After opening the stomach of the deceased woman, the "
"cleric pulled out a strange item."
msgstr ""
"불쌍한 여인의 비명은 낮은 흐느낌이 되어 이내 고요해집니다.\"오. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여... \"조드가 "
"속삭입니다.\"그녀는 죽었다. 나는... \"트리스티안이 그의 어깨에 손을 올립니다.\"자신을 비난하지 마. 너는 할 수 있는 모든 것을 "
"했다. 이제 마무리를 하고 그녀의 희생을 헛되지 않게 하자.\"죽은 여성의 위를 연 후 성직자는 이상한 물건을 꺼냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "c9032503-150f-476a-9e7a-e85703aa24ca"
msgid ""
"The peasant woman couldn't scream any more — her sore throat could do little "
"more than groan. \"By {g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} name...\" Jhod whispered. \"I "
"was wrong... The lungs are clear.\" Tristian closed the patient's wound with "
"a healing spell. \"Please, don't stop now! You can still save her. The "
"stomach, hurry!\" Screams of pain rebounded off the prison walls once more, "
"but this time it was over much faster. Jhod cut open the woman's stomach and "
"pulled out a strange item."
msgstr ""
"농민의 여인은 더 이상 비명을 지을 수 없었습니다. 목이 아파 신음하지 못했기 때문입니다.\"{g|Erastil} 에라스틸{/g}"
"이시여... \"조드는 속삭였습니다.\"내가 틀렸어... 폐가 분명해. \"트리스티안은 환자의 상처를 치유 주문으로 닫았습니다.\"제발 "
"지금 멈추지 마! 여전히 그녀를 구할 수 있어. 어서 위 수술을!\"고통의 비명 소리가 다시 한번 감옥 벽에 울렸지만 이번에는 더 빨리 "
"끝났습니다. 조드는 여자의 위를 열어 이상한 물건을 꺼냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "222139ea-77c5-47ac-8b60-cf8e6c43bfb9"
msgid ""
"Horrible screams became low groans, then a terrifying silence. \"Oh "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}...\" Jhod whispered. \"I was wrong... The lungs are "
"clear.\" Tristian sighed heavily. \"Don't blame yourself. You did all you "
"could. I will pray for her soul — may she rest in peace. But now, our duty "
"is to finish what we've started, to make her sacrifice worth something!\" "
"Jhod cut into the dead woman's stomach and pulled out a strange item."
msgstr ""
"끔찍한 비명소리는 낮은 신음이 되어 끔찍한 고요만이 남습니다.\"오. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여... \"조드가 "
"속삭입니다.\"내가 틀렸어... 폐는 깨끗하다.\"트리스티안이 무겁게 한숨을 쉽니다.\"자신을 비난하지 마. 너는 할 수 있는 모든 것을 "
"했다. 그녀를 위해 기도하겠다. 편히 잠드소서. 이제 우리의 임무는 곧 끝나니 그녀의 희생을 헛되히 하지 말자!\"죽은 여성의 위를 연 "
"후 성직자는 이상한 물건을 꺼냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "9a70a548-e9dc-4175-ae31-8e853ef909ed"
msgid ""
"It looked like some kind of seed — a glowing, pulsing, thumb-sized seed. "
"Before anyone could say anything, it flashed in Jhod's fingers. He dropped "
"it on the floor, just in time — on the spot where the seed landed, a portal "
"opened, and a roaring monster jumped out of it."
msgstr ""
"그것은 어떤 씨앗처럼 보였습니다. 빛나고 펄떡이고 엄지손가락 만한 씨앗입니다. 누가 입을 열기도 전에 그것이 조드의 손 안에서 빛납니다. "
"그는 바닥에 씨앗을 떨어뜨렸고 씨앗이 떨어진 곳에서 싹이 트고는 포탈이 열려 괴물이 고함을 지르며 튀어나옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "4979a5fe-5edf-4bb3-b0a9-b6a879dafc7f"
msgid ""
"The baron{mf||ess}'s medical knowledge helped Jhod immensely. The surgery "
"was over quickly."
msgstr "남작의 의학 지식은 큰 도움을 주었습니다. 수술은 빨리 끝났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "a859d161-2c3b-4b8e-8a4e-0c9f8c5a1e1d"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, something went wrong. Perhaps the baron{mf||ess} "
"overestimated {mf|his|her} medical knowledge, or perhaps the cleric "
"misunderstood {mf|his|her} advice. Either way, the surgery ended with a "
"fatal mistake."
msgstr ""
"불행하게도 문제가 발생했습니다. 아마도 남작의 의학지식은 과대평가되었거나 성직자가 남작의 조언을 오해한 것 같스빈다. 어느 쪽이든 수술은 "
"치명적인 실수로 끝났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "af9bb49f-8f54-430c-a6b4-721bf3c405b4"
msgid ""
"I couldn't hear exactly what {mf|he|she} said, but it worked. Charmed by "
"{mf|his|her} words, the peasant woman managed to stay still and let the "
"cleric perform the surgery."
msgstr ""
"남작이 무슨 말을 하는지 분명하지 않았지만 효과가 있었습니다. 남작의 말에 매료되어 그 농민의 여인은 성직자가 수술을 하도록 움직이지 "
"않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "714173ea-4a48-4cf0-abd0-bdc5ce8be5ee"
msgid ""
"But she was in so much pain, she clearly couldn't understand what {mf|he|she}"
" was saying. She kicked and screamed, and eventually the time came when even "
"the cleric's steady hands couldn't keep the scalpel from slipping."
msgstr ""
"그러나 그녀는 너무 아팠고 남작이 무슨 말을 하는지 이해할 수 없었습니다. 그녀는 발버둥을 치며 비명을 지르고 마침내 성직자의 손에서 "
"메스가 미끄러지는 것을 막을 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "cbd67f05-5990-4d05-9a46-ce5968cd9f8c"
msgid ""
"Both clerics stared at the baron{mf||ess} in horror, but {mf|he|she} just "
"coldly ordered them to dissect the corpse."
msgstr "두 성직자는 두려운 눈빛으로 남작을 보았지만 남작은 그들에게 시체를 해부할 것을 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "84d54b80-5139-4ec6-8f22-9a3de3bb5d1d"
msgid ""
"Bartholomew, the mad, sadistic wizard, had been summoned here for some "
"reason. He remained silent, checking the patient's pulse."
msgstr "미친 가학증세의 마법사 바톨로뮤가 어떤 이유로 여기에 소환되었습니다. 그는 침묵을 지키며 환자의 맥박을 확인했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "988b9089-fdf7-4a26-b258-99fb5f5f1bd5"
msgid ""
"The clerics turned to the baron{mf||ess} in desperation, asking {mf|him|her} "
"to resolve their dispute. After careful consideration, {mf|he|she} decided..."
msgstr "성직자들은 절망에 빠져서 남작을 보았고 분쟁을 해결해달라고 부탁합니다. 남작은 신중하게 생각하고 결단을 내립니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/BookEvent_Seedsoflife_Operation/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "6c7c74bd-7630-4241-a838-073e457912e2"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace,\" Tristian whispered, \"Why? We could have saved her!\" Jhod "
"finished the surgery, his fingers trembling and his face pale. He opened the "
"stomach of the dead woman and pulled out a strange item."
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\" 트리스티안은 속삭였습니다. \"왜? 우리는 그녀를 구할 수 있었어!\" 조드는 수술을 끝냈고 "
"손가락은 떨리고 얼굴은 창백했습니다. 그는 죽은 여자의 위를 열고 이상한 물건을 꺼냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "704a3f60-9a2c-4c73-bee6-cc941718788a"
msgid "[Begin the surgery] \"Let's begin.\""
msgstr "[수술을 시작합니다] \"시작하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d9725d23-7a16-4414-bd34-a0ffc2d5d4da"
msgid "[Leave] \"Give me a few moments to look around.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"잠시 둘러볼 시간을 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "67413739-ac2e-4618-b186-08616941cd9f"
msgid "\"Who's our patient?\""
msgstr "\"누가 환자인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "27a29813-6d3b-494f-89d5-2de679fff351"
msgid "\"Why the prison? Was there no place more suitable?\""
msgstr "\"왜 감옥이지? 더 적합한 곳은 없었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c6b62478-eece-47d5-9050-883bf624a283"
msgid "\"Where are all the prison inmates?\""
msgstr "\"원래 감옥에 갇혀있던 수감자들은 다들 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "557d6512-b906-430b-8bf7-b82b1fa1f880"
msgid "\"What have you already tried?\""
msgstr "\"그동안 무엇을 시도해 봤지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "5a6b33d7-d631-43d2-926e-31f34036650d"
msgid "\"Where will the surgery take place?\""
msgstr "\"수술은 어디에서 집도하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3707270a-a31f-4d47-a10b-f45787f05f68"
msgid "Stated you have no need for a torture chamber."
msgstr "고문실은 필요없다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "8a1fb27f-56e1-4985-a172-f3c400050554"
msgid "\"Good. I've no need for a torture chamber anyway.\""
msgstr "\"잘됐군. 어차피 고문실은 필요 없었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a6ae1f71-54bc-4467-94ed-57ffcb3c0b68"
msgid "Mocked Jhod's operation."
msgstr "조드의 수술을 비웃습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "68d118f1-999f-45bc-998f-53f016d8573a"
msgid "\"Well, isn't that ironic?\""
msgstr "\"거참, 아이러니하지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9bd8ed3b-8966-4984-a7cf-758eadf9cc58"
msgid "Stated you had need of a torture chamber."
msgstr "고문실이라도 필요하다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "ecea4f8d-951d-4a73-87d2-fd5cbc22f304"
msgid "\"A shame. I could make use of a torture chamber.\""
msgstr "\"수치스럽군. 고문실을 써야 한다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "a50a887d-00cf-4604-9168-afeee7c0452d"
msgid ""
"\"This is our hospital.\" {n}Jhod shows you around the bleak, comfortless "
"building with its barred cells.{/n} \"The prison is certainly not the best "
"location, nor the healthiest. But it's better than nothing. Also... It might "
"be cruel to say this — but, considering the nature of the malady, it would "
"be safer for everyone if the patients were kept behind the bars until they "
"are healed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기가 저희 병원입니다.\" {n}조드는 철창으로 막힌 감옥들로 이루어진 황량하고 불편하기 그지 없는 건물 안을 보여줍니다.{/n} "
"\"감옥은 확실히 최고의 장소가 아니고 청결한 공간도 아닙니다. 하지만 없는 것보다는 낫습니다. 그리고... 잔인하게 들리겠지만 질병의 "
"특성으로 보았을때, 환자들이 치유되기까지 철창 안에 있는 것이 안전할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "e7671002-b261-4aab-805f-32e29e111f05"
msgid ""
"\"Her name is Madla Stasek. A peasant woman from a nearby village. We hadn't "
"seen any prior cases of the disease there...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 이름은 마들라 스타섹입니다. 인근 마을에서 온 농민 여성입니다. 이전까진 그 마을에서 이 질병에 걸렸다는 주민은 없었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "efe1395e-4f2d-4050-afd6-8ea876a285db"
msgid ""
"\"Standard spells to heal disease, remove poison, and lift curses — all "
"ineffective. Attempting to dispel the magic is also fruitless. I fear we may "
"be dealing with a curse of strength enough to surpass our own faith...\""
msgstr ""
"\"치유마법이나 해독 마법, 저주 해제도 모두 효과가 없었습니다. 마법 무효화도 마찬가지로 소용없었습니다. 저희 신앙을 능가하는 힘을 "
"지닌 저주를 상대하는 것은 아닌지 두려워지기 시작합니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "6c73e132-1979-4e40-9125-902c37b358e1"
msgid ""
"\"There were naught but a few pickpockets locked away here. We put them to "
"work cleaning the place up, then set them free. There is one still here, "
"though. He wasn't some petty thief, but a seasoned highwayman.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳에 갇혀있던 수감자들은 소매치기 몇 명 말고는 아무도 없었습니다. 우리는 그들에게 감옥 청소 일을 시킨 후, 자유롭게 풀어 "
"주었습니다. 그래도 여기 한 명 남아있긴 합니다. 그는 좀도둑이 아니라 노련한 노상강도였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "be852a0f-1faf-4f48-bf6c-23c9bc6d8440"
msgid "\"If only the city had a clinic...\""
msgstr "\"도시에 병원이 있었다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "c423ac75-e488-4cb9-a720-670e8a3d0ee7"
msgid ""
"\"Well, that room was previously a... torture chamber. There was already a "
"suitable table...\""
msgstr "\"저 방은 이전에... 고문실이었습니다. 적절한 테이블이 있지요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "74779ab3-47b2-4401-ad7f-226ab082f682"
msgid "\"I thought as much!\""
msgstr "\"그럴꺼라 생각했습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "18998da8-5df2-4313-b617-c4e3ad28eeb5"
msgid "\"This is no laughing matter!\""
msgstr "\"이건 웃을 일이 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "ef930918-efa1-4cfc-bbfc-be7f2de5de4d"
msgid "{n}The cleric frowns but remains silent.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}성직자는 눈살을 찌푸리고 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "a4756401-40cc-4683-8649-9bb879a68b12"
msgid "\"If you must, but please, don't take too long!\""
msgstr "\"필요하다면 그래주십시오. 하지만 너무 오래걸리지 않도록 해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "d86cfe2a-8fe1-4940-adff-b44223c0a55a"
msgid "\"Are you ready? Please, we cannot delay much longer!\""
msgstr "\"준비되셨습니까? 우리는 더 이상 지체할 수 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "cffdbaad-207f-47a2-b046-587c8d88ea32"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod breathes in deeply, then exhales slowly.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}"
" be with us...\""
msgstr "{n}조드는 깊은 숨을 내쉬고 천천히 호흡합니다.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 우리와 함께 하기를... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "78d75b64-599a-4282-a652-fe503385cc3b"
msgid "\"I hope the city will get a proper clinic, in time.\""
msgstr "\"이럴때에, 도시에 제대로된 병원이 생기면 좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8fcd02c3-4b0a-473e-bcb4-0f67e62eef92"
msgid ""
"\"It isn't a matter of faith. I don't think it's a disease, let alone some "
"powerful curse. I suspect it's some sort of parasite, hiding itself within "
"the body.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 믿음의 문제가 아닙니다. 제 생각에는 어떤 강력한 저주도 아니고, 하다못해 질병도 아닌 것 같습니다. 스스로 몸 속에 숨는 "
"일종의 기생충이라고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "0a68519d-e65c-4b26-82ee-e6c8b204fe58"
msgid ""
"\"Nonsense! We've detected magic suffusing each patient's body, evenly "
"distributed! If it was some sort of parasite, it would be a simple matter to "
"detect!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말도 안되는 소리! 우리는 환자들의 몸에 고르게 분포된 마법을 발견했습니다! 만약 그것이 일종의 기생충이라면 쉽게 탐지가 되었어야 "
"합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9ea911dc-0a5e-4f59-8dd1-d04ad5b4d229"
msgid ""
"\"Then it's able to disguise itself! Maybe it's poisoning their blood with "
"its magic — by the Sun, we return to this argument over and over. It's been "
"days! Let's stop talking and try doing something already!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면 숨어 있을 수도 있습니다! 아마도 기생충의 마법이 피를 중독시켰을 겁니다. 우리는 며칠 동안 이 논쟁을 반복했습니다. 말은 "
"그만하고 무언가를 해야 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "4505c31b-2ce5-428b-b4d8-46b41d4ff9bb"
msgid ""
"\"Even if it did, the prison would still be the best choice. Don't forget, "
"at any moment one of the patients could... You know — die and release a "
"monster. It's safer for everyone if we keep them locked up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 되었더라도 감옥이 여전히 최선의 선택입니다. 언제든지 환자 중 한 명이... 죽어서 괴물로 변할 수 있다는 것을 잊으셔서는 "
"안됩니다. 격리하는 것이 모두에게 최선의 조치입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "31c68aa9-39c7-49ee-b3f0-420e887f3cb8"
msgid ""
"\"I pray for that brave woman. She's the first one to mount the courage "
"necessary to volunteer for the surgery. We cannot let her down.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 용감한 여인을 위해서 기도하겠습니다. 용감하게 수술을 자원한 건 그녀가 처음이죠. 그녀의 신뢰를 저버릴 수는 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife2/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "38b5a684-8b84-4c7f-bfc4-ce896504cab6"
msgid "\"Sarenrae help us.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이가 우리를 돕기를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "13e9a086-ea0d-498a-9971-68ac79d1170d"
msgid "\"So, what have we learned?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 우리가 알아낸 건 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6fe11940-92a6-4803-930c-32aad299e6da"
msgid "\"Are you able to cure others of the disease now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 다른 사람들도 치료할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3a73c8c7-7057-4067-bfac-c1745f223fc5"
msgid "\"What will you do next?\""
msgstr "\"이제 다음으로 무엇을 할 생각이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "9cfe5e3f-c447-43d9-833f-2355174d78fa"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "4351ce77-1ffa-4d77-9799-6ee5afca5b96"
msgid ""
"{n}Looking at the patient's body, Jhod can't hold back his tears. He wipes "
"his eyes, not even noticing the blood still on his hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}환자의 시신을 본 조드는 눈물을 참을 수 없습니다. 그의 눈을 닦았지만 여전히 그의 손에 묻은 피를 알아채지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "5ca71579-3f0a-43ea-9f16-a48228ba8ac6"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod wipes the sweat from his brow, not even noticing the blood still on "
"his hands.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} and {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} be "
"praised! They were truly on our side this day. It's a miracle!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 아직 손에 피가 묻어있다는 것조차 잊은 채, 이마의 땀을 닦아냅니다.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}과 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}시여 감사합니다! 오늘 그분들께선 진정 우리 편이셨습니다! 이것은 기적입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a0ae6233-5e3f-461b-9b02-50cd6a87eb77"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hands Jhod a clean towel. Jhod pulls himself together and wipes "
"his hands and face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 조드에게 깨끗한 수건을 건냅니다. 조드는 수건을 받아 손과 얼굴을 닦습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "6a89e6b7-82ec-4183-9c8d-54c545f330f2"
msgid ""
"\"We've learned I was a pompous fool, and Tristian was right all along. It's "
"not a disease, but a parasite. Something of vegetative origin — it resembles "
"a seed. I'm sorry, my friend — I should have wagged my tongue less and "
"listened to you more!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘 우린, 내가 거만한 바보라는 걸 알아냈습니다. 그리고 트리스티안이 내내 옳았습니다. 이건 질병이 아니라 기생충입니다. 식물을 "
"기원으로 한 무언가 같습니다. 씨앗과 비슷하게 생겼군요. 미안하네. 친구여. 말을 줄이고 자네 말을 더 들었어야 했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8b0360e8-3d69-49bc-9111-c3a5b2186959"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Yes, now that we know what to do, we can extract the seeds with much "
"less risk to the patients, and with much less suffering!\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다! 이제 해야 할 일을 알았으니 안전하게 씨앗을 제거해서 고통을 덜어줄 수 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "208c180e-ce63-4e2e-b864-b343e53699dd"
msgid ""
"\"There are still many patients here. We'll start work on them immediately. "
"And you, Your Grace, may want to search for the source of this disease! We "
"still know neither where these seeds come from nor how they get into "
"people's bodies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 아직 환자가 많이 남았습니다. 저희는 즉시 그들에게 수술을 시작하겠습니다. 그리고 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서는 이 질병의 근원을 찾고 싶으시겠죠! 우리는 아직 이 씨앗들이 어디서 왔는지, 그리고 어떻게 "
"사람들의 신체에 들어갔는지 전혀 알지 못합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "4cf626b1-7d17-47af-960f-2c6f1c255c22"
msgid "\"Thank you for your help, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"도와주셔서 감사합니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Jhod_PrisonAsylum
msgctxt "5365a3d3-13d9-4b0f-9d4c-93a86f235379"
msgid "\"Please, find the source of those wretched seeds!\""
msgstr "\"부디, 이 악독한 씨앗의 근원을 찾아 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f1480fdc-4a7e-4285-8c66-efbd6b705fcf"
msgid ""
"\"Please, don't mention it. It was a lucky guess, not worthy of your praise."
"\""
msgstr "\"아닙니다. 그저 운이었을 뿐인 걸요. 그렇게 칭찬하셔도 곤란합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_Kavken_Seedsoflife3/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ca71a388-3eec-46f9-9423-c8c111f01518"
msgid ""
"\"New patients arrive daily. And how many never even find their way to a "
"hospital? Our efforts here are not enough by themselves. We need to find the "
"root of this problem.\""
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 환자가 매일 도착합니다. 그리고 병원에 오지 못한 환자도 매우 많습니다. 우리의 노력으로는 충분치 않습니다. 문제의 원인을 "
"뿌리뽑아야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b5e57149-2765-4eca-ae36-a29ee004a480"
msgid "\"How are you feeling?\""
msgstr "\"기분은 좀 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "4bd5c31d-9a86-4fe0-a6c0-9e9e1c288265"
msgid "\"Why did you volunteer for this surgery?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 수술에 자원했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8e8a0e08-aac9-4c07-ab1d-eade5a3b993c"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "50d1fd46-b681-4aeb-b459-3233abdcfa67"
msgid "[Leave] \"Get ready. We're about to begin.\""
msgstr "[떠납니다] \"준비해. 이제 곧 시작 해야해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "760f0863-2fce-4cca-b998-f77e1c7469c9"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing you, the patient — a ruddy-faced, middle-aged peasant woman — "
"blinks her eyes.{/n} \"Imagine that! {mf|His|Her} Grace {mf|himself|herself} "
"paying me a visit! Good health to you! I'm Madla Stasek, from Sedgedale. So, "
"you think these priests of yours can really heal me? With "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} help they could, I bet — just look how brainy they "
"seem, the two of them!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}환자로 보이는 이 농민 여성은, 중년에 혈색 좋은 얼굴을 지니고 있었습니다. 당신을 의식하고는 눈을 깜박입니다.{/n} \"세상에! "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 직접 방문해주시다니! 안녕하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 세지데일에서 온 마들라 "
"스타섹이라고 합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 사제들이 정말 저를 치료해 주실 수 있는 건가요? "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 도움으로 분명 치료해 주실꺼라 믿어요. 저 두분을 보세요. 얼마나 똑똑해 보이시는지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "96d5ec78-2ecd-4de4-a287-ec08eff453a8"
msgid "\"So when do we start?\""
msgstr "\"언제부터 시작하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "732c388a-7caf-419e-855d-9e7e95d9d909"
msgid ""
"\"I'm scared like a hare, truth be told. But this's no mere cold — can't "
"just hope it'll pass on its own. At least this way I got some hope, right? "
"And then... Well, the doctors'll figure it out, what to do about the plague. "
"I'm no hero, not me, but sometimes you gotta think about others too! If they "
"end up butchering me, at least maybe they can figure out how to save someone "
"else. If I gotta die, let it be for a good cause, right?\""
msgstr ""
"실은, 저 정말 무서웠어요. 그래도 이 병은 그냥 감기 같은 게 아니니까, 내버려 둔다고 나아지지는 않겠죠. 이 방법을 택하면 최소한 "
"희망은 있잖아요, 안 그래요? 어쩌면... 의사들이 전염병의 정체를 알아내 치료할 수 있을 거예요. 저는 영웅이 아니지만, 그래도 가끔은 "
"타인을 위할 줄도 알아야 한다고 생각해요! 의사들이 저를 치료하진 못해도, 그 경험에서 다른 사람을 치료할 방법을 찾을지도 모르죠. 그럼 "
"제 죽음은 헛되지 않은 거예요, 그렇죠? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "46ac50e1-4f44-4d98-a2fa-79010347a646"
msgid ""
"\"I got a fever. Cough, too, and I can't eat — I feel like puking all the "
"time. I've been through worse, though — borne six kids and survived! But "
"still, this scares me breathless. Each tingle in my body gets me to shaking, "
"and I think to myself, 'That's it. It started. Now I'll be ripped to shreds!'"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"열이 있어요. 기침도 하구요. 게다가 먹을 수도 없어요. 항상 구역질이 나거든요. 저는 더한 것도 겪었었죠. 여섯 아이를 낳고도 "
"살아남았으니까요! 하지만 이번은 정말 숨이 막힐 정도로 무서워요. 몸안에 작은 통증이 있을 때마다 저를 떨게 만들어요. 그리곤 이런 "
"생각이 들죠. '그래 이거야. 이제 시작된거야. 이제 난 갈기갈기 찢겨질꺼야!'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d7265422-9212-4291-b8e7-f144a9502f9e"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing to tell, really. We're simple people, with simple lives. Spent all "
"mine in Sedgedale — it's by {g|Gudrin River}Gudrin River{/g}, past "
"{g|Silverstep}Silverstep Lake{/g}. Raised my children there, then "
"grandchildren... Never seen monsters worse than goblins then, but now — "
"owlbears and hydras everywhere... I prayed to the gods to spare our village, "
"but no — this blight fell right upon my own head!\""
msgstr ""
"\"딱히 말할 것도 없어요. 우리는 평범한 사람들이고, 평범한 삶을 살고 있어요. {g|Silverstep}실버스텝 호수{/g}를 지나, "
"{g|Gudrin River}구드린 강{/g} 근처에 있는 세지데일이란 곳에서 평생을 살아왔죠. 제 아이들도 그곳에서 키웠고요 그리고 "
"손주들까지... 고블린보다 더한 괴물은 보지 못했지만 지금은... 아울베어와 히드라가 도처에 깔렸어요...저는 신들에게 우리 마을을 "
"살려달라고 기도했지만, 마을이 문제가 아니었어요. 이 질병은 바로 저에게 들어와버렸으니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/SeedsOfLife/Dialogue_seedsoflife_patient/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "107d30ba-797f-43e4-88f9-6412abdff4ca"
msgid "\"Long as you're nearby, I got nothing to be scared of!\""
msgstr "\"영주님께서 함께 있어 주신다면 무섭지 않을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c5eed1c1-a5dd-426a-9f60-5c3ca3381591"
msgid "\"I'd like to learn more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 더 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "da8e4e13-25e1-4abc-a28d-33bd1669af80"
msgid ""
"\"I need to discuss politics and affairs of the "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} with you.\""
msgstr "\"정치와 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}의 일들에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "2ac01861-40b0-4ac6-af4d-3e9dfd007144"
msgid ""
"\"What's the situation between the Royal House Surtova and the Aldori "
"Swordlords?\""
msgstr "\"Surtova와 Aldori Swordlords 간에 어떤 일이 벌어지고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "51a95052-8cc2-44b3-b148-03125c58e802"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about the River Kingdoms?\""
msgstr "\"강의 왕국들에 관해 나에게 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5c5d7df5-1f73-49a3-88c3-940fa22071dc"
msgid "\"I have questions on other topics.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "be35f4e1-1321-452c-9916-5be8020c3424"
msgid "\"Thank you. We'll speak another time.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 우리는 다음에 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "f17cfcba-db90-4026-a501-45a6aea9f6f0"
msgid "\"Indulge my curiosity — do you have family? Close relatives?\""
msgstr "\"호기심을 자극하는군. 가족이 있나? 가까운 친척은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "b1d87e60-6d63-4218-be80-3039c3858f7c"
msgid ""
"\"You must have seen a lot over your years of diplomatic service. Do you "
"have any stories that stick out as particularly interesting?\""
msgstr "\"외교 업무를 하며 많은 것을 경험했을 것이다. 흥미로운 이야기가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "54300a3b-0f4f-4c4b-96c6-2effdcc8d976"
msgid "\"Thank you. Let's speak of less personal matters.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 사적인 이야기 말고 다른 이야기를 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "c583f9cf-52b2-40f1-a31e-62f2325da996"
msgid "\"How long will you be staying with us?\""
msgstr "\"얼마나 오래 우리와 함께 있을 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "65168e38-fd64-4379-8eca-b4899b60b58e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking for new advisors to assist in governing the country. Would you "
"consider taking a position?\""
msgstr "\"나는 국가 통치를 도울 새로운 보좌관을 찾고 있다. 직위 수여를 고려해 보겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "aed257d9-3fd8-47ec-b908-725cdbe2a087"
msgid "\"Do you like your new position?\""
msgstr "\"현재 위치가 마음에 드나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "00e460f7-7bab-4626-bb0e-3c4c1fe17898"
msgid ""
"{n}Shandra Mervey, envoy from the Royal House of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, bows "
"her head courteously.{/n} \"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}, it's good to see "
"you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 왕실의 특사 샨드라 마비가 정중하게 머리를 숙여 인사합니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|남작님|여남작님|왕이시여|여왕이시여}, 뵙게 되어 반갑습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "508d1efb-1161-457c-965b-e06258b920fd"
msgid ""
"\"That is what I'm here for, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 곧 제가 이곳에 있는 이유이지요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "6544dcab-4570-449f-ab32-dad795b87970"
msgid ""
"\"Answering this question will involve delving a bit deeper into history. "
"You're surely aware that the {g|House Surtova}Surtovas{/g} and the Aldori "
"each ruled their own sovereign kingdoms in the past. When {g|Choral}Choral "
"the Conqueror{/g} invaded our lands, his might was incontestable. The "
"Surtovas recognized this and bowed to him, exchanging their crown for status "
"as a noble house. They were able to not only retain the house's influence in "
"the region, but also save the lives of their subjects.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 질문에 대한 답변을 드리려면, 먼저 역사를 좀 더 깊게 파고들어 볼 필요가 있습니다. {g|House Surtova} 서토바{/g}"
"와 알도리가 엣날에 각자 국가를 통치했었음을 알고 계시겠지요. {g|Choral} 정복자{/g}가 우리의 땅을 침략했을 때, 그의 힘은 "
"실로 가공할 만한 것이었습니다. 서토바는 빠르게 단념하고 자신의 왕권을 귀족의 지위로 바꾸어 항복했습니다. 그들은 그 지역에서 영향력을 "
"유지할 수 있었을 뿐만 아니라 백성들의 목숨도 구해냈지요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ef4f89f7-4c89-4298-adcd-90f1b4d66d66"
msgid ""
"\"In typical Aldori fashion, they chose to mount a reckless campaign against "
"{g|Choral}Choral's{/g} forces without so much as scouting the size of his "
"army. As a result, their own armies were decimated when they encountered his "
"red dragons. But instead of taking a lesson from the tragedy, the "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} chose to nurse their grievance over the past "
"two hundred years — and now they may have finally found a way to strike back."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"알도리는 {g|Choral} 정복자{/g}에 대항할 군대가 없음에도 저항하는 길을 택했습니다. 그 결과 그들의 군대는 레드 드래곤과 "
"마주치고 궤멸당했습니다. 그러나 비극에서 교훈을 얻는 대신, {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}는 지난 이백 년 동안 불만을 "
"품어왔죠. 그리고 이제 그들은 반격할 기회를 찾고 있는 듯합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "bc9994b9-dfe1-4866-8cdd-21ba998c43b7"
msgid ""
"\"The Aldori aren't even a true noble house. They're a motley rabble of "
"upstarts who take their name after they learn the secrets of the "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}' dueling style — there's little actual noble "
"blood spread among them. But they're impulsive and ambitious — they obsess "
"over the past, rather than focusing on the current and future prosperity of "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. They need to be controlled, and {g|House Surtova}House "
"Surtova{/g} can see that clearly. That's the situation as I understand it, "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알도리는 진정한 귀족 가문이라고 볼 수조차 없습니다. 그들은 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}의 결투의 비기를 배우고 나서 "
"귀족의 이름을 갖게 된 풋내기들이지요. 그들에게는 귀족의 피가 흐르지 않습니다. 그러나 충동적이고 야심이 크죠. 그들은 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 현재와 미래의 번영에 초점을 맞추기보다는 과거에 집착합니다. 그들은 통제를 받을 필요가 있고, {g|"
"House Surtova} 서토바 가문{/g}은 이 점을 명확하게 알고 있습니다. 이것이 제가 아는 상황입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "964236a1-df96-40fc-aba3-50a334d2bd0f"
msgid ""
"\"You are well within your rights, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|"
"Your Highness}. What would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"당신께선 물론 그러할 권리가 있으시지요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 무엇을 알려드리면 되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "711e118c-ab64-43fd-aa30-dfaacad77e75"
msgid ""
"\"An interesting story, you say? Well, I once had to spend a summer in "
"Artume. This small kingdom in the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} "
"suffered from frequent bandit raids, and one gang in particular, practically "
"a small army, was especially troublesome. They had somehow managed to find "
"an informant from within the court — this unfortunately gave them plenty of "
"information to interfere with trade in the area, including trade with "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥미로운 이야기라 하셨습니까? 한때 저는 Artume에서 여름을 보낸 적이 있습니다. 이 나라는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 "
"왕국들{/g}사이의 작은 나라고 도적의 잦은 습격으로 고통받고 있었는데, 한 도적단은 소규모의 군대를 가지고 있어 골칫거리였습니다. "
"그들은 궁정의 비밀 정보를 찾았는데 - 불행히도 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}와의 교역을 포함한 여러 교역에 관한 정보였습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "38e7cb50-67b8-484a-8111-c17ffdec2fad"
msgid ""
"\"I announced to the court that I was awaiting the arrival of a particularly "
"valuable caravan, and Artume's rulers were to take measures to ensure its "
"safety. A squad was sent to meet the caravan, but the bandit gang struck and "
"swiftly slaughtered the soldiers, capturing the cargo. The bandit leader was "
"triumphant, and three merry bards started spreading news of his victory far "
"and wide.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 궁정에 제가 귀중품을 실은 캐러밴의 도착을 기다리고 있다 보고를 했고, Artume의 통치자는 안전을 위해 조치를 취했습니다. "
"캐러밴을 맞이하기 위해 병력이 파견되었지만, 도적이 습격해서 군인들을 도살하고 화물을 가로챘지요. 도적 두목은 승리했고 음유시인 3명이 "
"이 소식을 노래로 만들어 퍼뜨렸습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "e5a99238-8e75-43d0-8355-3958c2dd0e7c"
msgid ""
"\"The next day, a different gang attacked the first, hoping to seize the "
"treasure from them. A week later, two more gangs entered the fray, and then "
"more and more... Eventually, all the Brevic guards had to do was recover the "
"stolen goods from a field of corpses. So, for the cost of three bards' time, "
"we were able to protect our merchants and expose the bandits' informant from "
"the court. I hope this simple tale can provide some insight to you, {mf|Your "
"Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다음날 다른 도적단이 첫 공격을 하여 그들의 보물을 가로채려 했습니다. 일주일 뒤에 다른 도적단이 싸움에 가세했고 계속해서 다른 "
"도적들이 찾아왔습니다... 결국에 브레보이 경비병 전원은그저 시체가 널린 들판에서 도둑맞은 물건을 회수하기만 하면 되었지요. 3명의 "
"음유시인 덕에 저희는 우리의 상인들을 보호하고 궁정에 도적단의 위치를 알릴 수 있었던 겁니다. 저는 이 이야기가 당신에게 통찰력을 드릴 "
"수 있기를 희망합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "4928c280-01aa-4fca-806e-46166b78811c"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. A daughter and two grandsons. The boys are a bit spoiled, but "
"they show promising talent — I hope they'll go far.\" {n}Shandra shakes her "
"head, a faint smile on her face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지요. 딸 하나와 두 손자가 있습니다. 남자 아이들은 버릇이 없지만 똑똑한 아이들입니다. 그 아이들이 크게 되길 바랄 뿐이지요."
"\" {n}Shandra는 끄덕이며 얼굴에 희미한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "1765512c-5bca-4ad6-afb6-a011127a8797"
msgid ""
"\"Now, if you were to ask me where they live, I would have to promptly "
"redirect the conversation. The first thing any good diplomat learns is to "
"hide their weak spots. In all of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, only Lady Natala and "
"{g|King Noleski Surtova}King Noleski{/g} know where my family lives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제, 당신께서 그들이 사는 곳을 물으신다면, 저는 대화의 주제를 바꾸게 될 겁니다. 외교관의 덕목중 하나는 약점을 숨기는 것이지요. "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 나탈라와 {g|King Noleski Surtova}놀레스키 왕{/g}만이 제 집의 위치를 알고 "
"계십니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "60e2cede-8d68-4c75-bc74-868c4258ec31"
msgid ""
"\"{g|River Kingdoms}The River Kingdoms{/g} are useful to {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}"
" — we sell the majority of our exports there. I personally spent a great "
"deal of time there representing the interests of {g|House Surtova}House "
"Surtova{/g}. My job was to help the River Kingdoms prosper, while at the "
"same time helping them grow fat bellies rather than steel muscles, if you "
"take my meaning. These lands can certainly be appealing, in their own way, "
"but if I was asked to describe them in one word, it would have to be 'chaos'."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}은 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에 유용합니다. 저희는 그곳에 대부분의 수출품을 "
"판매하지요. 저는 개인적으로 {g|House Surtova} 서토바 가문{/g}의 이익을 대변하기 위해 시간을 많이 보냈습니다. 제 일은 "
"강의 왕국들의 번영을 돕는 것이었으나, 한편으로는 그들이 튼튼한 근육 대신 뱃살을 키우는 것 또한 임무였지요, 무슨 말씀인지 아시리라 "
"믿습니다만. 이 땅은 그 나름의 흥미로운 요소가 많지만, 만약 누군가 제게 단 한 단어로의 요약을 원한다면, 그것은 '혼돈'이 될 것 "
"같군요 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "6d2626a4-d343-4599-a7f3-e94aa0a0bd80"
msgid ""
"\"From a political standpoint, only {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and its ruler, King "
"Irovetti, have any real power worth watching — both as an ally and as a "
"potential enemy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정치적 관점에서 보았을 때, {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와 그 통치자인 이로베티 왕이 동맹으로서든 잠재적인 적으로서든 감시할 만한 "
"힘을 가지고 있습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "8ec7d158-e4f5-49d3-995c-58c719d34584"
msgid ""
"\"Ask, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. I'm happy to "
"help.\""
msgstr "\"물어보십시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 기꺼이 답변해드리지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "26506410-55e5-4263-b0df-3a7c9589be7f"
msgid "\"Of course, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다, {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "6ca421e3-d5e2-42cb-a3c8-de89be0c1041"
msgid ""
"\"I'll remain for as long as Lady {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} deems it "
"useful. You need the advice of an experienced advisor, so I'll provide you "
"with information to the best of my ability until my lady calls for my return."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 레이디{g|House Surtova} 서토바{/g}가 유용하다 판단하신만큼 머물 것입니다. 당신께는 숙련된 자문가가 필요하고, "
"따라서 아가씨께서 부르실 때까지는 당신께 조언을 드리겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "1688bed3-f944-486c-9fe2-d86dfcbf9c35"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, my whole life I've "
"been a councilor, and I don't see myself in any other role. I am well "
"familiar with all the mechanisms that help to ensuring the loyalty of the "
"citizenry — or at least a part of it. If you assign me to this position, "
"I'll direct all my knowledge and experience to your benefit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 평생 보좌관을 담당했고 다른 역할은 생각해본 적이 없습니다. 저는 시민의 충성을 확보하는 방식을 압니다. 저를 그러한 업무를 "
"수행하는 직책에 배정하신다면 최선을 다해 돕도록 하겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "fc9fb9fa-815a-4c65-b218-df3b25798369"
msgid ""
"\"Whether I enjoy a thing is not a point for discussion. By my estimation, "
"your polite words are a way to express concern over my ability to fulfill my "
"obligations. I assure you, I haven't encountered any situation I was not "
"equal to. I shall seek audience with you only in cases where I believe the "
"problem demands the ruler's personal decision.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 만족하는지 아닌지는 중요하지 않습니다. 제 판단으로 보았을 때, 당신께선 점잖게 말씀하고 계시지만 이면에는 제 업무수행 능력에 "
"대한 우려가 보입니다. 확언드리건대, 저는 이제까지 제가 감당하지 못할 상황을 마주한 일이 없습니다. 사안이 통치자의 단독 결정을 필요로 "
"한다고 사료되는 경우에만, 당신과 함께 청중을 찾도록 하겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ShandraMervey/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "a0bb8189-d3bf-42df-bae4-213d69c72ae3"
msgid ""
"{n}Shandra takes a barely noticeable breath before speaking.{/n} \"As prior "
"experience has shown, we have unresolvable differences in our opinions "
"regarding the country's governance. Perhaps I should step back and give "
"someone else a chance to be your advisor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Shandra는 말하기 전에 얕은 호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"현재까지의 경험에 비추어 보았을 때, 저희는 통치에 관한 견해가 "
"일치하지 않는 듯합니다. 저는 뒤로 물러나고, 다른 사람에게 보좌관의 자리를 물려주는 것이 옳을 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/BearRugBark_String
msgctxt "2032e5e9-9e70-4801-89d7-da973037f632"
msgid ""
"The giant owlbear that almost destroyed the capital has become quite popular "
"in his new \"role.\""
msgstr "수도를 파괴한 거대한 아울베어는 새로운 \"역할\"로 유명해졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/BoomVisitorBark1_String
msgctxt "cecd3526-25d3-460a-92ff-7753b775fd82"
msgid "\"I'm not in the mood to talk.\""
msgstr "\"나는 말할 기분이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/BoomVisitorBark2_String
msgctxt "10bcd4aa-c635-4261-a6a9-25ed047e32d3"
msgid "\"I... don't feel well today.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 오늘 기분이 좋지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/BoomVisitorBark3_String
msgctxt "c7c09ee1-ba10-4be2-8f4b-5e90681c5de7"
msgid "\"My stomach is on fire! I'm pretty sure the plums are responsible.\""
msgstr "\"속이 너무 쓰려! 자두가 원인 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/BoomVisitorBark4_String
msgctxt "4046db2e-9e74-4d59-8299-d878fdc42087"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe I should've washed those plums before eating them. Or not even stole "
"them in the first place.\""
msgstr "\"자두를 먹기 전에 씻어야 했나 봐. 애초에 훔치질 말든가. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/BoomVisitorBark5_String
msgctxt "8ccf19b5-d1a1-4e06-9690-ea231e187220"
msgid "\"Oooh, it's getting worse.\""
msgstr "\"오. 점점 악화되고있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/TableBark_String
msgctxt "13a50be9-5f76-4ce3-9c6b-f199d51311b9"
msgid "Scattered ink stains suggest that Linzi may have spent some time here."
msgstr "흩어져 있는 잉크 얼룩은 린지가 여기서 시간을 보냈을 수도 있음을 암시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/TavernNameAfterC22_String
msgctxt "7677c794-399a-400c-8cc0-2da514cd01f7"
msgid "The Bear Rug Inn"
msgstr "곰의 포옹 여관"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/TavernName_String
msgctxt "318c0e88-ffac-4ebf-87c5-51ebd3d15072"
msgid "The Beer Mug Inn"
msgstr "맥주잔 여관"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor10Bark1_String
msgctxt "2be17975-beb8-469b-bf61-cf2831ae6c3f"
msgid "\"Don't sit there. The ghost of my dead brother sits in that chair.\""
msgstr "\"거기 앉지 마라. 죽은 형제의 유령이 의자에 앉아있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor10Bark2_String
msgctxt "b7ea0520-670b-44ca-9c74-00fee4ef5ca5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm always alone. But you can sit here with me. We'll be sitting here "
"alone, together.\""
msgstr "\"나는 항상 혼자이다. 하지만 나와 앉아도 된다. 같이 조용하게 앉아있자구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor10Bark3_String
msgctxt "e6aaf094-afa2-4179-8052-ca015bc86ad7"
msgid ""
"\"The dark stalker fled across the Osirian desert, and the gunslinger "
"followed.\""
msgstr "\"어두운 스토커가 오시리안 사막을 가로 질러 달아났고 건슬링거가 뒤따라갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor1Bark1_String
msgctxt "4d182225-7e96-4d2b-afb8-c96f3298541d"
msgid ""
"\"Even the drunkest bullies respect our Elina! No one dares brawl in her "
"presence!\""
msgstr "\"성질 더러운 술주정뱅이도 엘리나를 존중한다! 아무도 그녀의 면전에서 말다툼하지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor1Bark2_String
msgctxt "d244e6eb-2289-46b6-bcfa-ad96ca200d38"
msgid ""
"\"They say there's a secret treasury under one of the capital's wells. All "
"lies, I think. All the gold would've been scooped up in buckets long ago if "
"that were true.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수도 우물의 밑에 숨겨진 보물이 있다는군. 모두 거짓말이야. 그 말이 사실이었으면 오래 전에 물 양동이에 금화가 담겨졌을 거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor1Bark3_String
msgctxt "5bfd67d1-aff8-439e-8e58-6e0ecaa206ed"
msgid ""
"\"My grandfather got obsessed with all the tales about Desna and wished to "
"fly to the moon. I hired two wizards to cast an illusion of a trip to the "
"moon for him. Let the old man have his dream fulfilled. These are his last "
"days, after all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"할아버지는 데즈나에 대한 이야기에 사로잡혀 달에 가보고 싶어했다. 나는 두 명의 마법사를 고용하여 달로 여행하는 환상을 만들어 꿈을 "
"이루어주었다. 그 날이 결국 그의 마지막이었지만. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor2Bark1_String
msgctxt "70fe4b4b-f382-40a6-af32-ee6cbe64d05a"
msgid ""
"\"We'd be better off building the town underground. That damned dragon "
"Ilthuliak wouldn't find us there!\""
msgstr "\"지하 마을을 짓는 것이 낫겠다. 저 망할 용 Ilthuliak이 우리를 찾지 못하게 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor2Bark2_String
msgctxt "7baf02af-a121-4fc7-af56-af58ce335899"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like the name 'Stolen Lands'... What if they really are stolen and "
"the rightful owner is coming back?\""
msgstr "\"나는 '도둑맞은 땅'이라는 이름이 맘에 들지 않는다... 만약 도난 당한 진짜 주인이 돌아오면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor2Bark3_String
msgctxt "1f1d55de-6add-47b1-b65d-827a6a0638ac"
msgid ""
"\"The monster was invisible — he hunted and killed us one by one. We were on "
"the marches, and he almost took me... but then a man emerged from the "
"quagmire and killed the bloody thing!\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴물은 눈으로는 보이지 않았어. 그는 우리를 사냥하고 하나씩 죽여나갔지. 우리는 행군을 하고 있었고 그 녀석이 나를 거의 잡을 "
"뻔했어... 하지만 한 남자가 수렁에서 나오더니 그 피투성이 녀석을 죽여버렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor3Bark1_String
msgctxt "27cedbce-05a5-4b70-b7be-8e5ac7899c82"
msgid ""
"\"Those kames in the Kamelands... I think they're petrified troll cupcakes! "
"Trolls turn to stone when exposed to sunlight, right? Their food should do "
"it, too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"케임랜드에 있는 봉우리들... 내 생각엔 겁에질린 트롤의 컵케이크 같아! 트롤은 햇빛에 노출되면 돌로 변하잖아, 그렇지? 그들 음식도 "
"역시 돌로 된거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor3Bark2_String
msgctxt "ad739eb9-06b5-41a7-b781-d790ff6de7a9"
msgid ""
"\"Terrible things happen when I get drunk! I once sold my goat to a giant! "
"Another time, I married a hag... Uhh, what was I saying again? I guess it's "
"time for another beer!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 술에 취하면 끔찍한 일이 생겨! 한번은 내 염소를 거인에게 팔았지! 언젠가는... 노파와 결혼했어. 아이고. 내가 또 뭐라는 "
"거지? 맥주나 더 마시자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor3Bark3_String
msgctxt "078b7dc3-b716-473c-bb2b-a2c8b1562803"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what a beauty contest between mites and kobolds would look like..."
"\""
msgstr "\"마이트와 코볼트들이 미인 대회를 열면 어떻게 될까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor4Bark1_String
msgctxt "e7e3fe9b-65e3-4856-92ab-768799026e35"
msgid "\"A nice inn, this one. Quiet and calm... usually...\""
msgstr "\"좋은 여관이군. 조용하고 편안해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor4Bark2_String
msgctxt "9fe3f5e9-166f-44a3-b09b-c151aa652e62"
msgid ""
"\"A town councilor was killed by dread magics and a shining stone in the "
"last inn I stayed at. They invited two foreign experts to investigate. To be "
"honest, magic murders were the least of that town's problems...\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 마지막으로 묵었던 여관에서는 무서운 마법과 빛나는 돌에 의해 마을 의원이 죽었어요. 그들은 두 명의 외국 전문가를 초청하여 그 "
"사건을 조사하였죠. 솔직히 말해서, 마법에 의한 살인은 그 마을에선 가장 작은 문제에 불과했어요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor4Bark3_String
msgctxt "d79690a4-c2d5-490d-b230-7903e6d2f0cf"
msgid ""
"\"On one hand, beer is better than ale. And on another — ale is worse than "
"beer, ha!\""
msgstr "\"어떨 때는 맥주는 에일보다 좋다. 또 어떨 때는 에일은 맥주보다 더 나쁘다. 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor5Bark1_String
msgctxt "3a0caf4d-bfac-4e69-9fe9-7e419d899f52"
msgid ""
"\"The robbers took everything from me. Even my vestigial arm! But at least I "
"have a story to tell. There aren't many people around here who've been "
"robbed by a treant and a talking raccoon!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑들이 내게서 모든 것을 빼앗았어. 심지어 내 가짜 팔도! 나는 억울해. 여기 주위에는 트랜트나 말하는 너구리에게 도둑질당하는 "
"사람은 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor5Bark2_String
msgctxt "b0d3f847-2fcc-4254-addf-a795858402d5"
msgid ""
"\"There were two mastodons in the glade, but the lightning struck a tiny "
"frog. That's what I call misfortune!\""
msgstr "\"습지에는 매스토돈 두마리가 있었지만 벼락이 쳤을 때 개구리가 맞았다. 그게 불행이라고 불리는 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor5Bark3_String
msgctxt "c828fb3f-f31b-4833-89fb-1bd99b80030c"
msgid ""
"\"The fog, the silence... and then I heard this 'clip-clop, clip-clop, clip-"
"clop, clip...'\""
msgstr "\"안개, 침묵... 그리고 나는 그 소리를 들었어. 따가닥, 따가닥...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor6Bark1_String
msgctxt "07691480-6a85-4ba2-94f9-91bacfd9590f"
msgid ""
"\"I mean, I went to hunt some ducks. And each time I missed the fowl, that "
"damn dog bumped out of the bushes, laughed at me, and disappeared!\""
msgstr "\"나는 오리를 사냥하러 갔다. 매번 닭을 놓쳤는데 그 때마다 그 개가 덤불에서 튀어나와 나를 비웃고는 사라졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor6Bark2_String
msgctxt "d25315ab-81cd-460e-b948-69612597f504"
msgid ""
"\"Dogs, cats, birds... Now, a bulette — that's what I call a real pet!\""
msgstr "\"개, 고양이, 새... 이제는 bulette이다! 이것이 진정한 애완 동물이라고 부르는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor6Bark3_String
msgctxt "dd54360b-e881-4e33-b865-e593fde0aac9"
msgid ""
"\"I always go duck hunting when I'm drunk. With five bows in my hands and "
"the sky full of ducks, there's no chance I'd miss.\""
msgstr "\"나는 술을 마시면 오리 사냥을 한다. 내 손에 활 다섯자루가 있고 하늘은 오리로 가득 찼으니 놓칠 리가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor7Bark1_String
msgctxt "0863f90a-255c-45dd-9290-347240b6e166"
msgid ""
"\"I'm telling you, he just snapped his fingers, and half of the city turned "
"to dust! As if he disintegrated all of them at once... Is that even possible?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말이야. 그가 손가락을 튕겼더니 도시의 절반이 먼지로 변했다! 마치 그가 모든 것을 한번에 분해하듯이... 그게 가능해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor7Bark2_String
msgctxt "1b20f25d-b766-4691-a321-d05488f36c30"
msgid "\"Fishing at Silverstep is better, but Tuskwater has its charm, too!\""
msgstr "\"낚시하기엔 실버스텝이 더 좋지만, 터스크워터도 나름 매력 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor7Bark3_String
msgctxt "f43130eb-4acf-4ae8-bb48-43e3a2e76204"
msgid ""
"\"I'm a fisher, my father was a fisher, his father was a fisher, and his as "
"well. But my great-great-great-grandfather was a scholar and a wizard. Every "
"family has its black sheep, I guess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 어부입니다. 나의 아버지는 어부였고 그의 아버지도 어부였고, 그의 아버지도 역시 어부였습니다. 하지만 내 고조 할아버지의 "
"할아버지는 철학자이자 마법사였죠. 어떤 가족이던 돌연변이가 있는 모양입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor8Bark1_String
msgctxt "ef7e4b1c-f8d1-46eb-b785-0329216f8b24"
msgid "\"Wizards are the best lovers. Though I guess I never tried druids...\""
msgstr "\"마법사는 최고의 연인이다. 비록 드루이드를 한번도 사귀어 본 적이 없지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor8Bark2_String
msgctxt "ab536e78-6e7a-4d6e-996a-e5cf7173b8cb"
msgid ""
"\"The Stag Lord has nothing on this bastard! Razed whole towns to the "
"ground, killed hundreds of folks! They even say he once scooped one poor "
"sod's eyes out with a spoon. A handsome story, eh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"수사슴 군주는 이 나쁜 녀석과는 비교도 안된다! 마을 전체가 쑥대밭이 되고 수백명이 죽었다! 심지어 그는 누군가의 눈을 스푼으로 "
"파버렸다는군. 무시무시한 녀석이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor8Bark3_String
msgctxt "a201dc2f-5e8f-4ffb-8713-734ac3a5b438"
msgid ""
"\"Hic... You see, you got your half-orcs. And then you got half-elves. But "
"what I wanna know is, where are the half-halflings?\""
msgstr "\"끅... 너는 하프오크 부하가 있지. 하프엘프도 있고. 그런데 왜 하프 하플링은 없지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor9Bark1_String
msgctxt "0cd91d30-3477-48e5-b8a1-8409ee16d6cb"
msgid ""
"\"Could a priestess of Abadar marry a Cayden Cailean worshiper? I mean, "
"marry and not to kill after a day or two of happy family life!\""
msgstr "\"아바다르의 여사제가 케이든 케일리엔 숭배자와 결혼할 수 있을까? 내 말은 서로 죽이지 않고 살 수 있냐는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor9Bark2_String
msgctxt "c0c59e5b-5080-4e3f-90ea-500c02a591ac"
msgid ""
"\"Guy decided to build a secret underwater city, where everyone would live "
"happily ever after. The merfolk were pretty surprised, I bet! But then "
"someone decided to build a flying city...\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두가 행복하게 살 수 있는 비밀 수중 도시를 건설하기로 결정한 사람이 있다는군. 인어들이 꽤 놀랐을꺼야! 틀림없다구. 하지만 그후 "
"누군가가 하늘을 나는 도시를 만들기로 결정했다는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/Visitor9Bark3_String
msgctxt "3430ab04-5a4c-4669-8e67-c525235bd9be"
msgid ""
"\"It might be hard to believe, but I was once a goblin. I died and was "
"reincarnated into a nice elven lass. But I then got bored and was "
"reincarnated as an android. Next was a hill giant. Then a merfolk. Then a "
"kobold. I'm not even sure who I am anymore without looking in a mirror.\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿기 어려울 지 모르지만 나는 한 때 고블린이었어. 나는 죽어서 멋진 엘프 아기로 다시 태어났지. 하지만 곧 지루해졌고 안드로이드로 "
"환생했다. 그 다음은 언덕 거인이었고. 그 다음은 인어였다. 그리고는 코볼트가 되었지. 거울을 보지 않고는 더 이상 내가 누군지조차 "
"모르겠어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/WallBark2_String
msgctxt "8ef3b8e9-9d8f-49e4-b2c2-505968e7c5bd"
msgid ""
"Someone carved a bawdy poem about the origin of the name \"the Stag Lord.\""
msgstr "누군가가 \"수사슴 군주\"라는 이름의 유래에 관한 야한 시를 새겨놨습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/TavernBarks/WallBark_String
msgctxt "3595c988-c313-47a6-a5e9-1d29627a5b29"
msgid ""
"Writing on the wall:\n"
"\"Aldori!\" (crossed out)\n"
"\"Surtova!\" (crossed out)\n"
"\"Beer!!\" (underlined)"
msgstr ""
"벽면에 써진 글입니다. \n"
"\"알도리!\" (X) \n"
"\"서토바!\" (X) \n"
"\"맥주!!!\" (O)"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/Barks/CapitalThroneRoom_Guards_String
msgctxt "7d761cb7-d0f3-45f0-a9be-bae649cd1954"
msgid "\"Long live the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|폐하|폐하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/Barks/CapitalThroneRoom_Table_String
msgctxt "a040e7da-8bde-4fbe-a8f3-9a137d3243ec"
msgid "Maps, letters, books... Ruling the state is no easy job!"
msgstr "지도, 편지, 책... 통치는 결코 쉬운 일이 아닙니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/Barks/CapitalThroneRoom_Throne_String
msgctxt "51edd725-8a06-4dc5-aa36-633970a64a82"
msgid ""
"The governing center and main power symbol of your barony. What kind of "
"ruler will you become? That's up to you to decide."
msgstr "영지의 상징이자 당신이 통치하는 장소입니다. 당신은 어떤 통치자가 될 것입니까? 그것은 당신이 결정할 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/InteractiveObjects/Fireplace_ActionName_String
msgctxt "24ba5e89-ad17-46be-b2ad-4a0e3507aa82"
msgid "Rest"
msgstr "휴식"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/InteractiveObjects/Fireplace_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "50a530e2-a9f6-40ff-bfb2-c20467da9e06"
msgid "Bed"
msgstr "침대"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/InteractiveObjects/KingdomEnter_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "d2f6ffe6-3b7f-446f-b905-a0a3474e472d"
msgid "{kingdomname}"
msgstr "{kingdomname}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/ThroneRoom/InteractiveObjects/KingdomEnter_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "138054ec-597b-41fd-9875-b1cb2cd60ac4"
msgid "Manage kingdom affairs"
msgstr "왕국 관리 업무"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "96f7360a-7b48-4539-9b3d-cb59d2d59e7e"
msgid "\"How are things going with your cult?\""
msgstr "\"숭배는 요즘 어떻습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "99c1ad3f-50d8-4fd7-ba20-1310bdcb8334"
msgid "\"About this woman, Olika...\""
msgstr "\"이 여자에 대해서... 올리카...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "70ee2240-12df-4bea-8aae-e3ea1b0df047"
msgid "\"You mentioned you're not a local. Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"시골 출신이 아니라고 했잖아. 어디 출신이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "90aaacb7-f5c1-47c6-a1cd-93d5ba68b4f1"
msgid "\"Tell me about your goddess.\""
msgstr "\"네 여신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b86eb1d4-95d3-4889-a1df-747ce2c84fe4"
msgid "Killed Tsanna without any immediate cause."
msgstr "아무런 이유 없이 산나를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "fd326cbf-e177-40a3-ac33-9ee20f1131cc"
msgid "[Attack] \"I spared your life — and now I'm taking it!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 네 목숨을 구했다. 이제 나는 그걸 가져갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "4f960da3-4907-4290-ac59-cf70d29122ac"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c46271fe-dd74-4ec3-932c-03105401b43e"
msgid "\"I don't mind your priestly magic...\""
msgstr "\"네 백마법은 신경 쓰지 않는다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "c91b6b69-7b4e-416a-bc08-ee22134c0c9e"
msgid "\"Speak to me properly!\""
msgstr "\"예의바르게 말하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e4b65955-0215-47b3-af44-1d0b5cd520b0"
msgid "\"You sound as if you're not trying to attract new followers!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 추종자가 마음에 들지 않은가 보군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "7f84c194-2902-4451-b22f-c9a2baf0e65c"
msgid ""
"\"I've given it some thought, and decided I want you by my throne. Will you "
"take on the responsibilities of my advisor?\""
msgstr "\"나는 생각을 해봤는데 너를 내 왕좌 옆에 두기로 결심했다. 내 보좌관이 되어주겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "d46b3148-f227-47a9-aacf-d45a267e5f5f"
msgid ""
"\"Your knowledge and skills are unusual... but I appreciate unconventional "
"abilities. Maybe you would make a good advisor.\""
msgstr "\"너의 지식과 기술은 드문 것이다... 하지만 그런 능력을 고맙게 생각한다. 아마 너는 훌륭한 보좌관이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "9945973f-e318-4706-9e25-4ef10f0bd531"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Lost Coast.\""
msgstr "\"잃어버린 해안에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "887e9a3a-ef10-4170-a77f-f4a5f607f77c"
msgid "\"What are these passions you speak of?\""
msgstr "\"네가 말하는 열정은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "7a723b85-e1ca-4902-901f-2fe05daa87b7"
msgid "\"Enough of this.\""
msgstr "\"이 정도면 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "7d77a2c9-a0ee-4502-86af-a9c57a96686b"
msgid "\"What happened to your leg?\""
msgstr "\"네 다리에 무슨 일이 생긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "394463ba-9b75-4283-9cac-7a36464d24e4"
msgid "\"Every god or goddess has a history. Tell me how Lamashtu appeared.\""
msgstr "\"모든 신과 여신은 역사가 있다. 라마슈투가 어떻게 나타나는지 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "8633e70e-efd2-41e7-a241-14e75d1fd372"
msgid "\"How can one... 'experience' the path of Lamashtu?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 하면... 라마슈투의 길을 경험할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "076a4832-8122-42bb-937f-434e62636149"
msgid "\"Do you have children?\""
msgstr "\"자녀가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "ff033c54-a180-45dd-9d57-b734e953f688"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "52bdd0af-9c24-4e8f-b78b-79ca61c76493"
msgid "\"Peculiar beauty? Ugliness is ugliness, whatever you call it.\""
msgstr "\"특별한 아름다움? 네가 뭐라 하든 추한 것은 추하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "64e1b248-df51-42d6-9ede-089e997ee6f5"
msgid "\"I have no more use for you. Leave my lands.\""
msgstr "\"너느 더 이상 쓸모가 없다. 내 땅을 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "cdc7425f-49ef-469e-a5a2-6552e8b2778e"
msgid "\"Remind me, what would you like to serve as?\""
msgstr "\"나를 어떻게 섬기겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "460314a1-7a70-49a1-87cc-3d683eff7626"
msgid "\"How do you like the city — far from the shrine and your pack?\""
msgstr "\"이 도시를 어떻게 좋아하게 되었지? 신전과 너희 무리와 떨어져있는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "2e3c841f-8917-466c-9ca9-78558926fca6"
msgid "\"Do you like what you do?\""
msgstr "\"네가 하는 일이 좋은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "69db4458-5f2a-48a3-94b4-86deaf023358"
msgid "[Point at the rat] \"What is this?\""
msgstr "[쥐를 가리킵니다] \"이게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "26633850-e93d-4537-8747-277cdf48e0e4"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, Tsanna raises her head and sizes you up. She has changed "
"her clothes since you saw her last. She wears a band across her brow, "
"decorated with a three-eyed jackal, and a live rat with two heads is resting "
"on her shoulders, looking cautiously at you from under her cascading "
"hair.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 산나는 머리를 올리고 당신을 살펴봅니다. 저번과는 다른 옷을 입었습니다. 그녀가 머리에 두른 밴드는 3눈박이 자칼이 "
"장식되었고 머리가 두개 달린 쥐가 그녀의 어깨위에 안자 그녀의 머리 뒤에 숨어서 당신을 경계합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "a69cdd59-a159-4a00-983e-7218edb93302"
msgid ""
"\"You came...\" {n}The woman narrows one eye.{/n} \"What brings you here, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|my King|my Queen}?\""
msgstr "\"왔군...\" {n}여자는 한쪽 눈을 좁힙니다.{/n} \"여기에 왜 왔지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "5ccf45ea-59d9-4961-bd73-1313493094fd"
msgid "\"To what do I owe the honor, {mf|baron|baroness|my King|my Queen}?\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 도와주어야 하지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0196c682-d90a-4417-8914-e7f600dc4512"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna smiles sweetly.{/n} \"I'm touched that you care, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|my King|my Queen}. Worry not, everyone receives "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} bliss who needs it. You need not know who they "
"are or what they ask.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 달콤하게 미소 지었습니다.{/n} \"네가 돌봐주어 감동받았다. 걱정 말아라. 축복이 필요한 자는 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 내려주신다. 그들이 누군지 무엇을 원하는지는 알 필요가 없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "fe3be091-e8e2-4148-9165-912552187446"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}The Mother of Monsters{/g} doesn't need sweet sermons, or "
"criers yelling her name at the crossroads. When the other gods turn away "
"from mortals, Lamashtu opens her embrace. When your subjects have nowhere to "
"turn with their troubles, rumors and whispers bring them to the altar of the "
"Mother of Monsters. It has always been this way, and it will always be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}괴물들의 어머니{/g}는 달콤한 설교나 그녀의 이름을 외치는 신도는 필요치 않다. 다른 신들이 필멸자에게 등을 "
"돌리면 라마슈투께서 그들을 안으리라. 너의 백성이 기댈 곳이 없다면 괴물들의 어머니의 제단에 데려와라. 그곳은 항상 있어왔고 앞으로도 그럴 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "b9a16b5c-5172-4646-83f5-8ff26edd5d6a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh? Do you still think of her? Worry not, {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} blessed "
"Olika and invigorated her womb. The female gave birth to a child, and even "
"survived herself. You wouldn't call the boy a pretty child, but he's the "
"light of his suffering mother's eyes, and a symbol of Lamashtu's mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오? 아직도 그녀를 생각하나? 걱정하지 마라. {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}께서는 올리카를 축복했고 그녀의 자궁은 건강하다. "
"그 여성은 아이를 낳고도 살아남았다. 네가 그를 좋아하지 않아도 그는 어머니 눈에는 빛이며 라마슈투의 자비의 상징이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "8ea528c3-7abf-4514-9885-33d38f53a428"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna shakes her head in admonition.{/n} \"I, the servant of Mother of "
"Monsters, marked by her bliss, speak to you as an equal. What more do you "
"want, {mf|baron|baroness|my King|my Queen}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 고개를 절레절레 흔든다.{/n} \"괴물 어머니의 종인 나는 너와 동등하게 말할 것이다. 더 원하는 것이 있나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "03cd20e3-8654-4bd4-81f8-667b7b2acc27"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna shakes her head.{/n} \"The path of the Mother of Monsters cannot "
"be embraced with words or reason alone. She can only be...\" {n}The woman "
"slides her fingers along her lips and bites them salaciously.{/n} \"..."
"experienced.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나가 머리를 흔든다.{/n} \"라마슈투의 길은 말이나 이유만으로 받아들여질 수 없다. 그녀는 오직...\" {n}여자는 손가락을 "
"입술에 대고 음란하게 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"... 경험하는 존재이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "bace4a4e-82e1-47da-be44-7c2170782bed"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna tilts her head ever so slightly.{/n} \"I was born in "
"{g|Varisia}Varisia{/g}, in a small village on the Lost Coast. Despite the "
"history of that place, it could never be home for me or my passions. Since "
"then I've traveled far, bringing {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} gifts to all who "
"need them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 머리를 조금 기울인다.{/n} \"나는 {g|Varisia} 바리시아{/g}의 잃어버린 해안에 있는 작은 마을에서 "
"태어났다. 고향임에도 그곳은 내 집이 될 수 없었다. 그 이후로 나는 멀리 여행했고 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선물을 "
"퍼뜨리며 살았다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "83a65480-38dd-4d67-ad58-643a9f026d59"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna starts laughing, musically at first, then loudly and more "
"joyfully.{/n} \"Aha-ha-ha! Trust my word, {mf|baron|baroness|my King|my "
"Queen} — you will not be glad of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} gifts. Don't ask "
"for what you don't know!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 처음에는 낭랑하게 그 다음에는 크고 즐겁게 웃기 시작한다.{/n} \"아하하하! 날 믿어라. 너는 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선물을 좋아하지 않을 거야. 모르는 것을 요구하지 말아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "a947faea-93d9-41cf-8700-2624eb395fc6"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess' expression changes. The softness falls from her face, her "
"gaze becomes piercing, and lines around her mouth grow harsh.{/n} \"Very "
"well, {mf|baron|baroness|my King|my Queen}. I will leave this shrine and "
"move to the city. But I warn you: I will not suffer argument and rejection. "
"The wisdom that guides me is far older than us both, and does not respond "
"kindly to the willfulness of fools.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여사제의 표정이 바뀝니다. 부드러움은 그녀의 얼굴에서 사라지고, 그녀의 눈은 사나워지고 입은 굳게 다물어집니다.{/n} \"알겠다, "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. 이 성소를 떠나 도시로 가겠다. 하지만 경고하겠다. 나는 말다툼과 거절을 참지 않을 것이다. 나를 "
"인도하는 지혜는 아주 오래되었고, 바보들의 고집을 착하게 받아주지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6df8589d-bc03-439a-a23c-93248d2d2676"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... power and influence — tempting for any leader! But tolerating a "
"stinking city and foolish crowds for this...\" {n}Tsanna is silent for a few "
"moments.{/n} \"I could accept the title of High Priestess. Or Councilor if "
"you wish.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠... 권력과 영향력. 모든 지도자에게 유혹을 불러일으키지! 하지만 악취를 자아내는 도시와 어리석은 사람들을 견디는 것은...\" "
"{n}산나는 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"나는 대사제의 직을 받겠다. 네가 원한다면 보좌관도 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "d20592a1-7fb1-4f10-b609-2b7aeb377871"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna looks at your belly.{/n} \"The most ancient and holy of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} rituals is to give life. You are a female, and "
"your womb is like that of the Mother of Monsters herself, giving life to a "
"myriad of monsters. Undergo the ritual and accept the seed. Pray for "
"Lamashtu's bliss. Carry a child marked by the seal of the goddess, and give "
"it life in your pack.\" {n}Tsanna stretches her lips into a smile.{/n} \"You "
"are strong. You might even survive.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 당신의 아랫배를 봅니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 가장 오래되고 거룩한 의식은 삶을 주는 것이다. "
"너는 여성이고 너의 자궁은 괴물들에게 생명을 주는 라마슈투의 그것과 같다. 의식을 받고 씨앗을 받아들여라. 라마슈투의 행복을 위해 "
"기도해라. 여신의 인장이 표시된 아이를 낳아 삶을 주어라. \" {n}산나는 입술을 늘여뜨려 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"너는 강해서 "
"살아남을지도 모른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "d9e32241-8598-42ef-8040-e03ba709b529"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna shows you her hands. They are covered with deep scars, rough "
"cicactrices and sword cuts.{/n} \"Transform your body and mind in the image "
"of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. Look for beauty in everything — in yourself, in "
"others, in the world. Murder it, burn it down, trample its sprouts. Few have "
"a chance to drink the sweetness of divine destruction... but it is the true "
"way to enlightenment. It is the only way for you, who does not possess the "
"gift of child-bearing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 당신에게 그녀의 손을 보여줍니다. 손은 깊은 흉터와 아문 상처로 덮여있습니다.{/n} \"너의 몸과 마음을 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 모습으로 바꾸어라. 너와 세상의 모든 것에 아름다움을 추구해라. 살해하고 태우고 그 싹을 "
"밟아버려라. 신성한 파괴의 달콤함을 마실 수 있는 자는 없다... 이것이 깨달음을 얻는 진정한 방법이다. 아이를 밸 수 없는 너에게는 "
"이것이 유일한 방법이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "dade9728-a9c6-4ac2-9eeb-92eda241abf6"
msgid ""
"\"Once {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} was a great demon — the first of her kind to "
"reach true divinity. She is the patron of monsters, many of which she bore "
"herself. She is the mother of insanity, nightmares, chaos and that peculiar "
"beauty which fools call ugliness.\" {n}Tsanna shrugs.{/n} \"You have your "
"answer, and need hear nothing more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한때 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}는 위대한 데몬였다. 진정한 신성에 도달한 최초의 여자 데몬였지. 그녀는 괴물들의 "
"후원자이지만 괴물들은 그녀를 따분하게 만들었다. 그녀는 광기, 악몽, 혼돈의 어머니이며 그 특별한 아름다움을 바보들은 추함이라 부르지.\""
" {n}산나는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"너는 거절하고 듣기 싫을 테지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "4c1b2486-5e13-412d-8d98-1bd311e28713"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess sighs.{/n} \"I do not waste time arguing. We, "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} followers, do not look on the world with mortal "
"eyes.\" {n}Tsanna lifts the two-headed rat to her lips, then returns the "
"squeaking animal to its place on her shoulder.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여사제는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나는 입씨름 하지 않겠다. {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 추종자인 우리는 세계를 "
"필멸자의 눈으로 바라보지 않는다. \" {n}산나는 머리 둘 달린 쥐를 들어 쳐다본 다음 다시 어깨 위로 올려놓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "64a0ec88-c329-4cb1-a976-bc158d6a0fd6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna presses her lips together so firmly they turn white.{/n} \"Very "
"well. As I said, I will not abide rejection. Farewell.\""
msgstr "{n}산나의 입술은 너무 세게 문 나머지 흰색으로 변합니다.{/n} \"알겠다. 나는 거절하지 않을 것이다. 잘 있어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "276c6907-7877-4db8-86b6-120d0956cf9c"
msgid ""
"\"I am ready to care for your pack as a High Priestess, or as what you call "
"a 'Councilor'. You decide which you need more.\""
msgstr "\"너를 도와 너의 우민을 보살필 준비가 되었다. 대사제든 보좌관이든 상관 없다. 결정은 네가 하는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "6a78869f-f2cf-494f-aa59-811ba7248205"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna looks around.{/n} \"I've been to places like this before. "
"Bearable. And as for my pack... {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} followers are "
"wise and strong. They will survive.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나가 주위를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"나는 이런 장소에 가본 적이 있다. 그럭저럭. 내 무리를 위해 견딜만 한 곳이군. "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 추종자들은 현명하고 강하다. 그들은 살아 남을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "e254d5d0-b010-4cbe-8ab2-c337f7de085a"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. Each time my belly swelled, I prayed for blessing.\" {n}Tsanna "
"looks away, absentmindedly scratching the nape of the squeaking rat.{/n} "
"\"But {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} did not send me her gifts. Every child to "
"leave my womb was a disgusting abomination — without a single flaw! I "
"learned I must serve in a different way, and chose the path of the priestess."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이다. 나의 배가 부풀어 올 때마다 나는 축복을 기도했다.\" {n}산나는 먼 곳을 보며 쥐의 목덜미를 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} "
"\"그러나 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}는 나에게 그녀의 선물을 주지 않았다. 내 자궁을 떠난 아이들은 결함 없는 역겨운 "
"혐오물이었다! 나는 다른 방식으로 섬겨야 함을 깨닫고 여사제의 길을 선택했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "7acd9588-f70e-4343-b32b-dc4e60298dc8"
msgid ""
"\"They say that in olden days, this land was cradle for many of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} children. But I don't know this to be true. Today "
"it is too noisy for those who are like me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옛날에 이 땅을 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g} 자손의 요람이라고 불렀다. 그것이 사실인지는 모른다. 나와 같은 사람들에게는 "
"너무 시끄럽다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "a4dbe5fd-79e6-466f-9d33-8d3cf40852b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna smiles bleakly.{/n} \"I played with living toys long before I "
"became a priestess of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. As a child I did not know my "
"love for wickedness was the sign of a special destiny. Now I pluck out "
"sheep's eyes, and cut open pregnant cats, but not for my own amusement — but "
"because Lamashtu loves suffering. How lucky am I?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 어렴풋이 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제가 되기 전 살아있는 장난감을 가지고 "
"놀았다. 어린 시절 나는 사악함에 대한 나의 사랑이 운명의 표식이라는 것을 몰랐다. 이제 나는 양들의 눈을 뽑고 임신한 고양이의 배를 "
"가르지만 내 자신의 즐거움을 위해서가 아니다. 라마슈투는 고통을 사랑한다. 나는 얼마나 운이 좋은가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "94efb498-6e4b-46bc-8974-d9021c7716a4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna lifts the hem of her skirt, showing a leg disfigured with "
"sores.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} gift. I received it when I stepped "
"upon the priestess' path — the blessing of the goddess. Look at its "
"splendor. Not many servants of the Mother can boast such a gift...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 치마 밑단을 들어올려 상처로 일그러진 다리를 보입니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선물이다. 여사의 "
"길을 걸을 때 그것을 받았다. 여신의 축복이지. 이 화려함을 보아라. 이것을 자랑하는 어머니의 종은 많지 않다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "0c5f100b-30df-476a-945f-51d04e1ee852"
msgid ""
"\"Your lands are not yet ready to fully embrace {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. "
"But I prepare your pack. I protect, I teach, I guard — and I don't forget my "
"followers, who hide in the cracks and shadows. I'm learning to be patient, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|my King|my Queen}, and believe me — I am a careful "
"student when it comes to my faith.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 땅은 아직 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}를 완전히 받아들일 준비가 되지 않았다. 하지만 너를 위해 준비하겠다. 보호하고 "
"가려지고 지키겠다. 나는 균열과 그림자에 숨은 내 추종자를 잊지 않았다. 나는 인내심을 배우고 있다. 나를 믿어라. 신앙을 말할 때 나는 "
"신중한 편이니. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "7eb0557c-6479-4492-9d44-fd15e1298431"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna chuckles.{/n} \"Councilor is but another name for leader. While "
"you are busy, I watch your pack. I know how to do it, and I do it well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 깔깔 웃습니다.{/n} \"보좌관은 지도자의 또 다른 이름이다. 네가 바쁠 때 너의 무리를 감시하겠다. 나는 그 방법을 알고 "
"잘할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "5da47587-edfa-434e-a65e-10ff81b8bf35"
msgid "{n}Tsanna shakes her hands and wipes them on her dress.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}산나 손을 흔들고는 드레스에 닦습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "07d919b0-9755-437f-8c0f-94114fdbe91c"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/Tsanna_Aftermath/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "9b56d1ae-1b12-470e-a732-cb2481135bdd"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna gently touches one of the rat's snouts and strokes its sickly "
"hide.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} messenger. An exquisite creature, is "
"it not? A sign that the goddess is pleased with me. It is a living "
"embodiment of her ideals, and shares the Mother's smile. One night this "
"little creature just ran up to me, as if to her own mother — and I knew my "
"loyal service had been noted by my lady.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 부드럽게 쥐의 주둥이를 만지고 털가죽을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 전령이다. 요물이지. "
"그렇지 않느냐? 여신님이 나를 기뻐한다는 표시다. 여신님의 살아있는 화신이자 어머니의 미소를 나눈다. 어느날 이 작은 생물이 어머니를 "
"찾듯 나에게 달려왔다. 나의 봉사는 그녀가 보고 계신다는 것을 나는 알지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "e1170bb3-00f3-4ddd-9d5e-a90cf0a1db28"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "cee5f56a-b821-4b85-8123-8856d437c9eb"
msgid "\"Why are you called Eight Eyes?\""
msgstr "\"여덟 눈이라 불리는 이유는 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "bfbd28c5-8f21-41ae-b98d-ba67ad15a894"
msgid "\"Would you like to join me?\""
msgstr "\"함께 가지 않겠는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "2e24d627-d3e5-40e9-be20-2695650cb9a3"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "08c51938-7ff3-440d-abe0-a5e69416ce1f"
msgid "\"I need loyal and experienced fighters.\""
msgstr "\"나는 충직하고 경험 많은 전사가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "48745823-2dd0-4536-bde0-e9b489230ff6"
msgid "\"I want to know more about the Pathfinder Society.\""
msgstr "\"나는 패스파인더 협회에 대해 더 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "835998eb-57b4-44e6-88e0-f8d5337db928"
msgid "\"What is the purpose of the Society?\""
msgstr "\"협회는 뭐하는 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "695412df-f1f2-4ede-8014-d223c764eecd"
msgid "\"What kind of members does the Society have?\""
msgstr "\"협회의 멤버들은 어떤 자들이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "48c7d592-db1d-4f1b-8e40-bb73b0b26017"
msgid "\"Who does the Society support?\""
msgstr "\"협회를 누가 지지하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "6e12d4b5-99b4-4380-a264-f8c08f982670"
msgid "\"We'll talk about this later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "5a8a7fff-24af-43ad-9acd-9066b3d1c051"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "fbc5aba4-a70c-4a94-8e8d-fada95ae9fa2"
msgid "\"A famous Pathfinder, here in the middle of nowhere? Why?\""
msgstr "\"유명한 패스파인더가 갑자기 튀어나와? 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "7c0feaab-b8a1-4cf3-812f-87c5c5d769ec"
msgid "\"What happened in Renchurch?\""
msgstr "\"렌 교회에서 무슨 일이 일어났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "2e3235d9-f2a6-4dee-9d6c-0400d9aad808"
msgid "\"Where were you when the trading post was attacked?\""
msgstr "\"교역소가 공격당했을 때 어디 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "c70ad1dc-492a-4b7c-9a4e-cf4dd6d0d3d2"
msgid "\"How did you escape Vermelt's trap?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 버멜트의 함정을 피했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "e17c61da-3892-404c-826b-7dffb1e563a9"
msgid "\"Regarding your story...\""
msgstr "\"너의 임무 이야기 말인데..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "c1e298aa-2de0-46b5-b94b-2f425d75ba49"
msgid "\"Remind me how the last campaign of the Reckless Six began.\""
msgstr "\"무모한 여섯명의 마지막 임무가 어떻게 시작되었는지 알려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0063_Text_String
msgctxt "2afe1d87-5725-4d90-855c-aefb2398d156"
msgid "\"I don't have enough money right now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 돈이 모자라군..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "ac66d2b6-4380-4a4b-b1bd-e60531194c55"
msgid "\"How did you escape Vermelt's trap?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 버멜트의 함정을 피했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "fcab79eb-be34-494c-b6ec-5a24f1763f39"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "fc56faa4-a9ef-4325-bff4-a99767aaed84"
msgid "\"How are things at the new Pathfinder lodge?\""
msgstr "\"새로운 패스파인더 집회소는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "1c78bb00-821e-42d0-90aa-afb3def89844"
msgid ""
"\"I hope my refusal regarding the lodge wasn't too much of a disappointment."
"\""
msgstr "\"협회를 거절해서 실망하지 않았으면 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0087_Text_String
msgctxt "c42b3422-94aa-4b67-8b8d-14616c813efc"
msgid "\"I agree.\""
msgstr "\"동의한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "8e035bff-deb8-46f3-9674-4025d6eb2da5"
msgid "\"Let me think about it.\""
msgstr "\"생각 좀 해봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_0095_Text_String
msgctxt "416ddee4-e345-4a84-a378-9085979f1149"
msgid "\"Great! Let's get started.\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 자 그럼 시작하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Answer_RespecTest_Text_String
msgctxt "b7c172fd-5cba-49f5-ba91-3ea90a052153"
msgid "\"I'd like to use the tutor services of the Pathfinder Society.\""
msgstr "\"패스파인더 협회의 재교육 서비스를 이용할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/BeginningReika_01_String
msgctxt "f5f94a97-167c-4498-8e71-3116b4a80850"
msgid ""
"{n}Anoriel remains silent for a long time, as if wondering if she wishes to "
"poke the old wound.{/n} \"Here's the story. Our leader, Vermelt, was the "
"best of us. Wise, brave — friends with everyone. One of those friends, "
"Adivion Adrissant, sent him a disturbing letter. He'd stumbled upon mention "
"of some ancient books on the art of necromancy. Secrets like those are best "
"left hidden forever. Trust me, I've seen what that kind of magic can do.\" "
"{n}The elf bites her lip.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아노리엘은 쓰라린 기억을 다시 떠올려야 하는지 고민하는 듯 오랫동안 침묵합니다.{/n} \"우리의 리더였던 버멜트는 우리 중 "
"최고였어. 현명하고 용감한건 물론 모두와 친하게 지낼 정도로 친절한 친구였지. 어느 날 그의 친구였던 아드비언 아드리산트가 충격적인 "
"편지를 보내왔어. 사령술에 대한 고대 서적이 언급되어 있었지. 그런 비밀은 영원히 발견되지 않는게 나아. 믿어도 돼. 그 비밀이 밝혀졌을 "
"때 무슨 일이 일어나는지 내 두눈으로 똑똑히 봤으니까.\" {n}엘프는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/BeginningReika_02_String
msgctxt "9822a693-2c63-4b6e-a08e-2073016359f6"
msgid ""
"\"To make a long story short, these volumes were supposedly hidden in the "
"catacombs of Gallowspire. We decided that the books should be retrieved and "
"kept safe by the {g|Pathfinder Society}Society{/g}. We gathered in a tavern, "
"discussed the expedition, then proceeded to {g|Ustalav}Ustalav{/g}. It was a "
"normal mission — a quick and quiet recovery.\" {n}Anoriel smiles "
"bitterly.{/n} \"But everything turned out to be much more complicated. We "
"barely made it through the Witchgate Forest. All those terrible living "
"trees, undead druids and their arches of bone... It was a miracle we managed "
"to make it out alive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마 그 책들은 갈로우 첨탑의 카타콤에 감추어져 있었던 것 같아. 우리는 이 책을 회수해서 {g|Pathfinder Society}"
"패스파인더 협회{/g}에 안전하게 보관하기로 했지. 선술집에 모여 원정에 대해 토론하고 {g|Ustalav}우스탈라브{/g}로 향했어. "
"그때까지만 해도 평소처럼 조용히, 빠르게 해결될 일인줄 알았는데...\" {n}아노리엘은 씁쓸하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그러나 생각보다 "
"일이 복잡해졌어. 우리는 겨우 위치게이트 숲을 빠져나왔지. 그곳의 끔찍한 움직이는 나무들은 물론 언데드 드루이드, 그리고 그 뼈로 "
"만들어진 구조물들... 지금 생각해보면 거기서 살아나온건 기적이였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/BeginningReika_03_String
msgctxt "7b275162-ffe3-402e-9b63-369fae713e71"
msgid ""
"\"We'd chosen Renchurch to stop at. It was marked on Vermelt's map as a safe "
"enough haven to hole up in and lick our wounds... How I wish that had been "
"true... Vermelt was the first to perish. He was attacked by one of the "
"monsters hiding in the stables. It tossed him about like a feather, and "
"threw him down an ancient well. His shout echoed for a long time, and I "
"didn't hear the sound of him landing. And then...\" {n}Anoriel pauses and "
"turns away, hiding her eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 렌 교회에서 잠시 머물기로 결정했지. 그것은 버멜트의 지도에 은신하고 상처를 치유하기 적당한 장소로 표시되어 있었거든... "
"정말 그랬다면 얼마나 좋았을까... 버멜트가 처음으로 죽었어. 마구간에 숨어있던 괴물에게 기습을 당했지. 그 괴물은 깃털처럼 그를 던졌고 "
"버멜트는 고대 우물에 빠졌어. 그의 비명은 오랫동안 메아리쳤고 바닥에 떨어지는 소리조차 듣지 못했지...\" {n}아노리엘은 잠깐 말을 "
"멈추고는 고개를 돌리고 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4e8bbcb5-b429-4449-9e3b-feba340b27db"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf looks straight at you, through the tangled hair falling over her "
"face.{/n} \"Hey. You're an adventurer, right? Seeking your fortune in the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}? You aren't the only one of your kind here. "
"Take my advice — keep your eyes open and watch your back. Sometimes the ones "
"who call themselves your friends are more dangerous than your enemies.\" {n}"
"Judging by the elf's voice, it's obvious that she started the day with a jug "
"of wine.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 헝클어진 머리카락 사이로 당신을 똑바로 봅니다. {/n}\"이봐. 너 모험가 맞지? {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}의 보물을 찾고 있나? 나랑 같은 부류인 것 같군. 충고 하나 하지. 눈 크게 뜨고 등 뒤를 조심해. 때로는 친구가 적보다 "
"위험해.\" {n}목소리로 보아, 그녀는 와인으로 하루를 시작한 것이 분명합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "e3f4432a-20f9-40db-bb28-5db2e24b2224"
msgid "\"Hey, it's you again! What can I do for you?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 또 너군! 무엇을 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2bdcde6d-0a41-4fce-815f-fc5a5e0a6b15"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf looks straight at you, through the tangled hair falling over her "
"face.{/n} \"Hey. So, you're the new {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}, right? "
"Seeking your fortune in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}? Take my advice "
"— keep your eyes open and watch your back. Sometimes the ones who call "
"themselves your friends are more dangerous than your enemies. That's "
"especially true for those who have power.\" {n}Judging by the elf's voice, "
"it's obvious that she started the day with a jug of wine.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 헝클어진 머리카락 사이로 당신을 똑바로 봅니다.{/n} \"이봐. 너 새로운 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕} 맞지? {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 보물을 찾고 있나? 충고 하나 하지. 눈 크게 뜨고 등 뒤를 조심해. 때로는 친구가 적보다 "
"위험하니까.\" {n}와인으로 하루를 시작한 것이 분명한 목소리로, 엘프가 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "588043aa-27c6-473e-a4be-80c69259871b"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! You're the local {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen} now, right? "
"Congratulations! The Stag Lord was a real bastard. It's a good thing you "
"killed him. Sometimes justice still triumphs, right? For what it's worth, "
"I've decided to move to the capital. Living at Oleg's is horribly boring. "
"But here, look around — I can feel the rhythm of life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐! 너 이제 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 되었구나? 축하해! 수사슴 군주는 정말 개자식이었어. 그를 죽이다니 잘했어. 가끔은 "
"정의가 승리하는군, 안그래? 게다가 나도 수도로 갈 생각이야. 이 교역소는 너무 지겨워.. 진절머리 날 정도로. 하지만 여기서, 주변을 "
"둘러보며 삶의 여유를 느낄 수 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "59c132d0-ad1d-452e-9545-94bf4318c237"
msgid "{n}The elf greets you with a nod.{/n} \"What can I do for you?\""
msgstr "{n}엘프는 고개를 까딱이며 인사합니다.{/n} \"무엇을 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "f326af9d-6349-42df-9ef8-fcfe2a73a254"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf grunts.{/n} \"Anoriel Eight Eyes. Once upon a time, I was famous "
"throughout {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}. Anoriel Eight Eyes, of the Reckless Six! "
"Well, glory passes quickly. A few miserable decades later, and no one "
"recognizes you on the street anymore. What a shame.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프가 앓는 소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"여덟 눈의 아노리엘. 예전에 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에서 꽤 유명했지. 무모한 "
"여섯의 일원 여덟 눈의 아노리엘! 영광은 빠르게 지나가더군. 수십년이 지난 지금 나를 알아보는 녀석은 아무도 없었다. 안타까운 일이야. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "e345f61c-03e9-410a-8f5a-a1cfab881152"
msgid ""
"\"Once, long ago, I could spot an enemy and pin him to the wall before he "
"could even think of attacking. Some said I had eight eyes and looked all "
"around at once. Though it seems I've outlived my nickname.\" {n}Anoriel "
"stretches her arm forward. Her palm trembles noticeably.{/n} \"I've been "
"drinking so much lately, it's best I don't test my skills too often.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 전에 나는 적이 나를 공격하기도 전에 그를 몰아 붙일 수 있었지. 누군가 내 눈이 여덟 개라며 사방을 본다고 혀를 내둘렀지. "
"명성이 내 수명보다 길지는 않았지만.\" {n}아노리엘는 손을 앞으로 뻗습니다. 그녀의 손이 눈에 띄게 떨립니다.{/n} \"이젠 술을 "
"너무 많이 마셔서 활 쏘면 큰일 날걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "34d624a2-80a4-4644-bf53-2ea314e9afbb"
msgid ""
"\"Uh, no, I've got enough things to do already. You'd better manage on your "
"own.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 내 앞가림 하기도 버거워. 네 일은 알아서 하는게 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "9e9e33d1-92e5-4265-8e67-22b9e95621cf"
msgid ""
"\"I sit here waiting for adventurers who are in need of help. We may be "
"sitting here in a backwoods tavern, but in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} I have a "
"lot of friends who are eager to make a few coins. They have brave hearts, "
"but shallow pockets. A little gold would be a welcome change for them. I can "
"send them a message, and they will come from Absalom through a portal. If "
"you're interested, just give me a sign, and we'll arrange everything right "
"away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기서 도움을 필요로 하는 모험가들을 기다리고 있지. 난 그냥 여기서 빈둥거려도 상관 없지만 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에 돈 "
"좀 만지고 싶어하는 많은 친구들이 많아서 말이야. 그들은 용감하지만 주머니는 가볍지. 돈 좀 쥐어주면 신나서 올걸? 내가 걔네한테 소식을 "
"전하면 걔네는 압살롬에서 포털을 타고 여기로 올 거야. 관심 있으면 얘기해. 곧바로 준비를 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "ecc951c0-4130-4a9c-a42c-5d7fd6e7cfa2"
msgid ""
"\"I have friends like that. Just decide who exactly you need, and they will "
"come on my signal. This will cost you {custom_companion_cost} gold pieces.\""
msgstr ""
"\"딱 맞는 친구들이 좀 있지. 구체적으로 어떤 친구를 원하는지 알려주면 불러줄께. 비용은 {custom_companion_cost} "
"골드야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "0107b91c-812c-4ef8-b631-61c061eb132e"
msgid "\"What exactly are you interested in?\""
msgstr "\"네가 원하는 게 정확히 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "0ee0ff5f-a3bb-40a3-a5af-b1ff16b8a688"
msgid ""
"\"It's a school of adventurers. We search for those who are eager to test "
"their skills, and we educate them and give them ideas about where on "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} they might seek their fortune. They look for "
"forgotten knowledge, secrets, and lost artifacts. They are explorers and "
"pathfinders. We're a sort of mutual assistance club for adventure lovers. We "
"exchange experience, share knowledge, and keep careful records. — In case it "
"proves useful to future expeditions. And also, we publish books for thrill "
"seekers... and bored urban teenagers from wealthy families.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모험가들의 학교같은 곳이야. 실력을 시험하고자 하는 사람들을 찾아 교육하고 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 한 몫 챙길 만한 "
"곳을 알려주지. 우리는 잊혀진 지식, 비밀, 잃어버린 유물을 찾는 일을 하고 있어. 우리는 탐험가이며 패스파인더야. 서로 돕는 모험가 "
"모임이라고 할 수 있지. 우리는 경험을 교환하고 지식을 공유하고 기록을 소중히 보관해. 미래에 있을 탐험에 도움이 될 수도 있으니까. "
"그리고 스릴있는 소설도 출간해... 소설광이나 부유한 가문의 청소년들이 좋아하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "db7b708d-afea-488c-a8ac-ced1db511d85"
msgid ""
"\"All sorts of adventurers. We have representatives from all races, "
"religions and beliefs. The Grand Lodge is in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, but "
"there are many smaller lodges throughout {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, and the "
"venture-captains direct Pathfinders to their goals from across all the "
"corners of the world. There are many renowned heroes in the {g|Pathfinder "
"Society}Society{/g}... And many scoundrels as well, whose service to the "
"Society has brought them fame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 부류의 모험가들이지. 우리 중에는 다양한 종족, 종교, 신념을 대표하는 이들이 있어. 중앙 본부는 "
"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에 있지만, 골라리온 곳곳에 작은 지부가 여럿 있어서 모험 대장이 패스파인더들을 세계 각지로 파견하지. "
"{g|Pathfinder Society}협회{/g}에는 많은 유명한 영웅이 있어. 그만큼 악당들도 많지. 모두 다 협회의 유명세에 많은 "
"기여를 하고있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "6900ec62-0590-46fd-bc16-6c6e016d30b7"
msgid ""
"\"You mean, who does it serve? No one in particular. Pathfinders try not to "
"get involved in the quarrels of others. They serve only the spirit of "
"adventure. And, sometimes, they happen to save the world. However, that "
"doesn't mean there are no black sheep among the Seekers...\""
msgstr ""
"\"협회는 정치적인 집단이 아냐. 특별히 지지하는 사람은 없어. 패스파인더는 다른 이들의 싸움에 끼어들지 않지. 우린 그저 모험에 모든걸 "
"바칠 뿐이야. 그런 이들이 때때로 세상을 구하기도 하지만... 돌연변이 하나 쯤은 어디에 가도 있지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e59127cc-94ac-45a7-8410-4a5b81202d83"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Pathfinder Society}Society{/g} is an interesting community. There "
"is much to tell about it.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Pathfinder Society}패스파인더 협회{/g}는 흥미로운 커뮤니티야. 이거에 대해선 해줄 말이 많지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b3a97915-5388-46b5-be82-13380aa20081"
msgid ""
"\"You want to know how one could exchange the life of a Pathfinder for this "
"sorry drunken rathole?\" {n}The light in Anoriel's eyes goes out as if "
"someone had blown out a candle.{/n} \"You lose all your friends because of "
"one scumbag, and then you'll understand. I was the only one to return from "
"the final campaign of the Reckless Six... and whatever is left of me... "
"can't be called a Seeker anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"패스파인더가 어떻게 술주정뱅이가 되었는지 알고 싶어?\" {n}누군가가 촛불을 끈 것처럼 아노리엘의 눈은 빛을 잃습니다.{/n} "
"\"쓰레기 한놈 때문에 친구 모두를 잃고 나면 이해할 거야. 나는 '무모한 여섯'의 임무에서 돌아온 유일한 생존자야... 그리고 나는 "
"더이상... 패스파인더가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "8ac4a230-7790-4045-9f20-7160c3e9720f"
msgid ""
"\"Voltar called to his god, and a ray of light shone forth, sending the vile "
"creatures running. I almost believed for a moment that we had a chance...\" "
"{n}Anoriel catches her breath and starts to talk faster.{/n} \"That part was "
"the worst. It seemed like we could get out, if we could just make it a "
"little farther... But then the zombies overwhelmed Voltar like a tidal wave. "
"Ghotry lost her mind. She scrambled up a staircase, whispering the words of "
"a children's song and screaming in terror. She jumped from the tower — to "
"escape whatever ghost was tormenting her. The fall maimed her, but she "
"survived. And after all this I... I was alone. The darkness closed in over "
"me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"볼타르가 신에게 기도하자 한 줄기 빛이 퍼져나가 사악한 괴물들을 쫓아내 버렸지. 잠시나마 기회가 생겼다고 생각했는데... \" {n}"
"아노리엘은 숨을 죽이고 더 빨리 말하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"최악의 순간이었어. 조금만, 조금만 더 가면 빠져나갈 수 있을 것 "
"같았어... 하지만 그 순간 좀비들이 해일처럼 밀려와 볼타를 덮쳤어. 고트리는 실성 해버렸지. 그녀는 공포에 질린 채 동요를 속삭이며 "
"계단을 기어 올랐지. 결국 자신을 괴롭히는 무언가를 피하려 탑에서 뛰어내렸지. 추락으로 그녀는 불구가 되었지만 살아남았어. 그리고 그 "
"뒤엔... 나는 혼자 남았지. 어둠이 나를 집어 삼켰어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "2224cc69-c46b-4bf2-826f-073105cbabc5"
msgid ""
"\"We were attacked by the undead... Skeletons, zombies... but that wasn't "
"the worst. What filled me with terror was the invisible dark entity crawling "
"among the stones. This... thing... was driving us crazy — literally! "
"Jaqueson rushed to a stone statue and beat it until he broke all his "
"fingers. After that, there wasn't much use for his magic wand, though the "
"poor fellow never gave up trying to help us. Berberton fell behind when we "
"began our retreat. The last time I saw him he was squatting over a heap of "
"carrion, gorging himself... and sobbing like a newborn all the while, I "
"swear by {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}!\" {n}Tears glint in Anoriel's eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 언데드들에게 공격당했어... 해골, 좀비... 하지만 그게 최악은 아니었지. 나를 몸서리치게 만들었던 것은 바위 사이로 보이지 "
"않는 어두운 존재가 기어다니는 모습이었어. 그것은... 말 그대로 우리를 미치게 했지. 잭슨은 석상에 달려가선 손가락이 부러질 때까지 "
"석상을 두들겼어. 그 후로도 그는 최선을 다해 우릴 도우려고 했지만, 그의 완드는 별로 도움이 안됐지. 벌버튼은 우리가 퇴각을 할 때 "
"낙오됐었어. 내가 마지막으로 그를 보았을 때 그는 썩은 살더미 위에 쪼그리고 앉아 그걸 잔뜩 주워먹고 있었지... 아이처럼 흐느끼면서 "
"말하더군. 파라즈마께 맹세한다고.\" {n}아노리엘의 눈에는 눈물이 고입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "71e7d047-d662-46c7-aa40-209dbb83259d"
msgid ""
"\"When I came to my senses, we were all in cages. All of us except for "
"Vermelt. He was free, unscathed — and extremely pleased with himself. And "
"the undead were under his command.\" {n}Anoriel clenches her fists.{/n} \"The"
" bastard betrayed us. From the very beginning. He'd decided to keep those "
"damned books for himself! Adrissant wasn't his friend, but his competitor. "
"Vermelt staged his death and went to find books while we fought off the "
"undead. He used us as fodder... and those who survived were to become "
"sacrifices for his ritual! We were betrayed by the one we trusted most!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정신을 차려보니 우리 모두 철창 속에 갇혀 있더군. 철창 밖에는 버멜트가 서 있었어. 그는 상처 하나 없이 자유로워 보였고 자기 "
"자신에 대해 매우 만족하고 있더군. 그래, 그는 언데드가 되어 있었어.\" {n}아노리엘은 주먹을 꽉 쥡니다.{/n} \"처음부터 그 "
"개자식이 우릴 배신했던거야. 그 빌어먹을 책을 자기가 가지려고 결심한거지. 자신한테 아드리산트는 친구가 아니라 경쟁자라고 생각하고 "
"있던거야... 우리가 언데드를 물리치는 동안 그는 죽은 척하고 책을 찾아다녔어. 우리를 자기 실험의 희생양으로 삼았다고! 우리는 가장 "
"믿었던 사람에게 배신 당한거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "8e521c3d-d79d-4f9e-9b9f-d147394a6f5a"
msgid ""
"\"I was hunting. Got a little lost in the mist — which is the first time "
"that's happened to me. I guess I should go easier on the drink. But don't "
"you imagine I'd be scared of a good fight! If only I'd known I was missing "
"all the action... But I see you've got everything under control.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사냥을 하고 있었지. 그러다 안개 속에서 길을 잃었는데 나에게 처음 일어난 일이었어. 술에 취했을 때는 좀 더 살살 했어야 할지도. "
"하지만 내가 싸움을 두려워할 거라 생각은 하지 마! 그런 일을 놓치고 있다는걸 알기만 했더라도... 하지만 네가 전부 해결한 모양이더군."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "94955458-8a25-4b0f-b8c0-576dbcd27a00"
msgid ""
"\"We were to be sacrificed in Vermelt's ritual. The madman had decided to "
"transform himself into a lich — and for this he required souls of the "
"living. He'd prepared everything else in advance — after all, such a ritual "
"demands extra precision, and his immortality was at stake. Vermelt probably "
"thought he was ready for anything... except for Ghotry.\" {n}Anorel smiles "
"sadly.{/n} \"Brave Ghotry. She'd come to senses by then, though she'd "
"suffered some terrible wounds. But she was determined that she wouldn't let "
"Vermelt carry out his plan. She would not become a sacrifice on his altar. "
"With her broken fingers, she managed to pick up a sharp stone and open her "
"veins. In her final moment, she summoned the grace of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} for aid — and her prayer was so powerful that the "
"goddess's messenger responded. The spirit entered her lifeless body and "
"waited patiently, ready to strike.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 버멜트의 의식에서 희생될 뻔했다. 그 미치광이가 자신의 몸을 리치로 바꾸기로 결정했고, 그를 위해 살아있는 영혼이 필요했다. "
"그는 사전에 모든 것을 준비했다. 그러한 의식은 정밀함을 요구하고 자신의 불멸이 걸린 일이었다. 버멜트는 모두가 준비되었다고 "
"생각했다... 고트리를 제외하고는.\" {n}아노리엘은 슬프게 웃습니다.{/n} \"용감한 고트리. 그녀는 끔찍한 상처를 입었지만 번뜩 "
"제 정신을 차렸다. 그녀는 버멜트의 계획을 막으리라고 다짐했다. 그녀는 제단의 제물이 되지 않으려 했다. 부러진 손가락으로 그녀는 뾰족한 "
"돌을 들어 자신의 정맥을 열었다. 그녀가 죽는 순간에 그녀는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 은총을 소환했다. 그녀의 기도는 너무 "
"강력해서 여신의 전령이 응답했다. 성령이 식어버린 그녀의 몸에 들어가 반격할 준비를 마친 채 끈기있게 기다렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "8e944782-00dd-4297-a62a-3ee5a2ccee01"
msgid ""
"\"The time of the ritual had come, and Ghotry was carried to the altar. At "
"the very moment that the dagger was supposed to end her life, "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} messenger left her body and flew into a rage. It "
"was... well, there are no words to describe its splendor!\" {n}The elf "
"stares at the floor.{/n} \"But poor Ghotry. She was bolder and purer than "
"any of us. Her sacrifice saved us. And she didn't even get a decent "
"funeral... By some miracle, we managed to free ourselves and joined the "
"battle. Vermelt's ritual was broken, and the mage transformed into a "
"pathetic, undead shadow of himself. The only thing we could do was finish "
"him off. Our friend. Our would-be executioner. The final feat of the "
"Reckless Six. And then we ran.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의식의 시간이 다가왔고 고트리가 제단으로 옮겨졌다. 단검이 그녀의 목숨을 앗아가려는 순간 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 "
"전령은 그녀의 몸을 빠져나와 분노에 빠져들었다. 그것은... 말로 설명할 수 없는 장면이었다.\" {n}엘프는 바닥을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} "
"\"불쌍한 고트리. 그녀는 우리보다 강하고 순수했다. 그녀의 희생이 우리를 구했다. 그녀는 심지어 장례식도 치르지 못했고... 기적이 "
"일어나 우리는 자유가 되어 전투에 참가했다. 버멜트의 의식은 실패했고 그 마법사는 불쌍한 언데드 그림자가 되었다. 그를 끝내는 것만이 "
"남았다. 사형 집행자가 됐을 뻔했던 우리의 친구. 무모한 여섯의 마지막 공적이었고 우리는 도망쳤다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "69710c09-b4a4-4542-9f3b-b710b8927c87"
msgid ""
"\"That very night, Berberton has finally lost his mind and killed Voltar. "
"Jaqueson died of his wounds. I reached {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} alone and "
"handed over those damned books to the {g|Pathfinder Society}Society{/g}. I "
"was promised the post of venture-captain, but I... couldn't accept it. I "
"looked at my new comrades and saw future corpses. In the end, I decided to "
"get away — as far as I could. And so I ended up here. A worthy place to bury "
"yourself.\" {n}The elf sighs heavily, but then her face clears and she "
"suddenly smiles.{/n} \"But I look at you and I remember the old days. Not "
"those terrible days in {g|Ustalav}Ustalav{/g}... but the better days, when "
"we were all alive. And brave. Together. It's... a strange feeling, but a "
"pleasant one, too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그날 밤 벌버튼은 마침내 미쳐서 볼타르를 죽였다. 잭슨은 상처 악화로 사망했다. 나는 혼자 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}으로 가서 "
"그 망할 책을 {g|Pathfinder Society}협회{/g}에 넘겼다. 나는 모험 대장의 지위를 약속받았지만 그것을 받아들일 수 "
"없었다. 나는 이미 동지들을 만났고 그들의 시체도 보았다. 결국 나는 도망칠 수 있는 한 멀리 도망치기로 결심했다. 그래서 여기로 오게 "
"된 것이다. 생을 마무리하기에는 좋은 장소이지. \" {n}엘프는 한숨을 쉬지만 그때 그녀의 얼굴은 평정을 찾고 갑자기 웃습니다.{/n} "
"\"그러나 너를 보면 나의 옛날을 기억한다. {g|Ustalav}우스탈라프{/g}에서의 끔찍한 나날이 아닌... 우리가 모두 살아있던 더 "
"좋은 날들 말이야. 용감했고 함께 였지. 그것은 이상한 느낌이지만... 유쾌한 느낌이기도 해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "b732d16e-b06e-440d-a234-4a715b7e8f00"
msgid ""
"\"Do I really have the honor of speaking with {mf|His|Her} Highness "
"{mf|him|her}self? My respects, {mf|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"정말 왕과 대화하는 건가? 이거 영광이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "36387c04-fef9-475e-9c8a-130cbb3293bc"
msgid "{n}Anoriel looks at you silently.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아노리엘은 당신을 조용히 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "c3f833e0-bdcd-4b85-b5dd-05b4ef16fe6c"
msgid ""
"\"Enough. I shouldn't have gotten into this. Who am I to stir up other's "
"feelings with all my chatter? We'd better forget about it for now. Maybe "
"I'll tell you more some other time. But not today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"됐어. 이런 얘기는 하지 말았어야 했는데. 내가 뭐라고 잡담으로 다른 사람 기분을 잡치겠어? 방금 한 얘기는 잊는게 나을거야. 나중에 "
"때가 되면 좀 더 얘기할지도. 오늘은 이만 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "bd32f106-7ad4-4e59-93f8-5416f6dd49d3"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf shakes her head.{/n} \"I have no wish to fill your sleep with "
"nightmares. When you prove that you can stand firm in battle, that you can "
"achieve victory without losing yourself along the way... then I will tell "
"you of the horrors that waited us in Renchurch.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 가로 저었습니다.{/n} \"네가 악몽을 꾸게 하고 싶지는 않군... 전투에서 굳건히 설 수 있다는 걸 증명해야만 자신을 "
"잃지 않고 승리할 수 있지. 그걸 증명한다면 렌 교회에서 있었던 나머지 일을 들려줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "5538f082-3718-4475-a896-a72fa46e24f0"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf utters a gloomy sigh.{/n} \"You've dealt with the Stag Lord, so "
"I'll tell you my story. I hope it will make you think twice about looking "
"for any more trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 우울한 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"네가 수사슴 군주를 상대했으니 내 이야기를 말해주지. 이 이야기를 듣고 경각심을 갖기를 "
"바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "42c9a472-8dd8-45db-9be3-8106d36a1e9c"
msgid "\"How can I refuse {mf|the King|the Queen}? Very well…\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 {mf|왕|여왕}의 말을 거절할 수 있겠어? 좋아…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "21ad1405-9589-46b5-99e3-58af6161ef4a"
msgid ""
"\"It doesn't matter how. All that matters is that I put the Pathfinder's "
"life behind me after that.\" {n}Anoriel gives you a piercing look.{/n} \"You "
"don't need to hear this, {mf|baron|baroness} — at least not yet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게는 중요하지 않다. 그 이후로 나는 패스파인더의 삶을 내놓았다.\" {n}아노리엘은 당신을 뚫어지게 봅니다.{/n} \"이 "
"이야기를 들을 필요는 없다. 적어도 지금은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "2349feee-d154-4399-9e27-1e435e33598e"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "bc920064-bc74-461a-adfc-72319e31e2fd"
msgid ""
"\"You know... this is the first time I've told the whole story to someone, "
"from beginning to end. I was afraid that it would hurt to speak of my lost "
"comrades, but... it seems I feel better now. Amazing, right?\" {n}Anoriel "
"plunges her fingers into her bag.{/n} \"I want to thank you. This once "
"served me faithfully. I think it will be in the right hands if I give it to "
"you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알다시피... 처음부터 끝까지 누군가에게 이야기를 한 것은 이번이 처음이다. 잃어버린 동지들에 대해 이야기하는 것에 상처를 입을까봐 "
"두려웠지만... 지금은 기분이 나아졌다. 놀랍군! \" {n}아노리엘이 그녀의 가방에 손을 집어넣습니다.{/n} \"나는 너에게 감사하고 "
"싶다. 이 물건은 나를 지켜주었다. 너에게 그것을 주어야 올바른 주인을 만날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "6948ea75-f15a-4294-8b9b-eaf36a7d8cd1"
msgid ""
"{n}Anoriel rubs her hands together.{/n} \"Great, everything is wonderful! "
"Just now I'm waiting for someone to take a new Society mission. You see, I "
"got this map from the archives...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아노리엘이 손을 문지릅니다.{/n} \"좋아. 모든 것이 훌륭해. 나는 협회의 새로운 임무를 수행하기 위해 누군가를 기다리고 있다. "
"그리고 자료실에서 이 지도를 얻었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "540fa20f-c700-4cf2-a1df-9c9979e39484"
msgid ""
"{n}Anoriel gives you a false smile.{/n} \"Oh, never mind that! I didn't like "
"the idea much anyway…\""
msgstr "{n}아노리엘은 거짓 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그건 신경 쓰지마! 그 아이디어는 별로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "fa5b3c72-8ba9-490d-9552-47b112186745"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the venture-captain of the local {g|Pathfinder Society}Pathfinder "
"Society{/g} lodge, remember? Where else would I look for adventurers, if not "
"in the tavern? By the way, if you happen to be in need of reliable "
"assistance, I can help with that. I have plenty of friends in "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, eager to earn a few coins. They have brave hearts, "
"but shallow pockets. A little gold would be a welcome change. I can send "
"them a message, and they will come from Absalom through a portal. If you're "
"interested — just give me a sign, we'll arrange everything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 지역 {g|Pathfinder Society}패스파인더 협회{/g}의 모험 대장이다. 기억해? 선술집이 아니라면 모험가를 "
"어디서 찾겠어? 도움을 필요로 한다면 내가 도울 수 있다. 나는 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에 돈 좀 만지고 싶어하는 많은 친구들이 "
"있다. 그들은 용감하지만 주머니는 가볍지. 돈 좀 쥐어주면 그들은 환영할 거야. 나는 그들에게 소식을 전하면 포털을 타고 여기로 올 "
"거야. 관심이 있으면 우리는 곧바로 준비를 하지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0085_Text
msgctxt "c869ca8e-3bcb-4a1e-b94b-63bc49a2d3f3"
msgid ""
"\"And now, thanks to you, I run the local lodge of the {g|Pathfinder Society}"
"Pathfinder Society{/g}. Don't you remember? I'm the one who came to talk to "
"you about establishing it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이제는 네 덕분에 {g|Pathfinder Society}패스파인더 협회{/g}의 지부를 운영한다. 기억 안나? 이전에 너에게 "
"협회 설립을 이야기하러 왔었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0086_Text
msgctxt "e3f5c74a-6ee9-4c8d-851c-92c85f3cdfa0"
msgid ""
"\"Some mess you got yourself into,\" {n}the elf says in place of a "
"greeting.{/n} \"How can I help you? Won't be easy to gather fighters in "
"these circumstances, but I'll try. Just give the word!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 발에 걸려 넘어지는군.\" {n}엘프는 인사 대신에 말합니다.{/n} \"어떻게 도와줄까? 이런 상황에서 전사를 모으는 것은 쉽지 "
"않지. 하지만 시도는 해볼게. 말만 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "4bdeecea-1f07-435a-ac4d-7f97c587c0be"
msgid "\"Think as long as you like. I'm not going anywhere.\""
msgstr "\"좋을대로 해. 난 여기 계속있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "96d686ef-0486-419c-88d7-476ef0e84332"
msgid "\"Well, I'm not going anywhere.\""
msgstr "\"뭐, 난 여기 계속 있을꺼니까..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0091_Text_String
msgctxt "e036c97e-ae40-4c0c-965d-62f0043877ec"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly! It will cost you {respec_cost} gold pieces. Shall we summon the "
"tutors?\""
msgstr "\"물론이지! 금화 {respec_cost}개를 재교육 비용으로 내야해. 재교육 교사들을 불러올까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0094_Text_String
msgctxt "f3a371a9-1f3f-4af9-8ccf-ec18ae4935b9"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly! As promised, the first three times you request retraining, the "
"{g|Pathfinder Society}Pathfinder Society{/g} tutors will do their work for "
"free. Shall we summon them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지! 약속한대로, 처음 세 번의 재교육은 {g|Pathfinder Society}패스파인더 협회{/g}의 교사들이 무료로 해줄꺼야. "
"그들을 불러올까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VentureCapitainTavern/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "f18cf5e2-d703-4cac-8676-116dacd8b397"
msgid ""
"\"Also, I can summon the tutors from the {g|Pathfinder Society}Pathfinder "
"Society{/g}, who can retrain you and your companions. They're quite willing "
"to do this for free, the first three times you request their services. After "
"that, the price for retraining will gradually increase. Such is their way of "
"doing business with all new clients.\""
msgstr ""
"\"또한, 너와 동료들을 다시 훈련시킬 수 있는 {g|Pathfinder Society}패스파인더 협회{/g}의 교사들을 소환할 수 "
"있어. 교사들은 처음 세번까지의 재교육 요청은 무료로 해줄꺼야. 다만 세번 이후에는 재교육 비용이 점차 인상될 꺼야. 이게 모든 신규 "
"고객들과 거래하는 그들의 방식이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "329e76e5-5eb7-4fed-964b-2701d3c848bf"
msgid "\"I'd like to see your goods.\""
msgstr "\"뭘 팔고있는지 볼까\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "db753bcd-f294-44be-af53-29f169784bbb"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know anything about the ancient dwarven fortress in these lands?\""
msgstr "\"이 땅의 고대 드워프 요새에 대해 아는 것이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8196bd93-7fc2-420c-97e5-27256c09e218"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6f41e41c-71cb-4602-a186-6424563b3a71"
msgid "\"You look a little unusual for a dwarf.\""
msgstr "\"너 드워프 치고 좀 이상한데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "342d4fb8-250c-44ce-b81b-6338f963ca61"
msgid "\"I have to go. So long!\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야 겠어. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "bb450cf0-2894-4cff-a0a8-9887560af58e"
msgid "\"What are you reading?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 읽고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "984b3bdb-4350-49d9-8617-a5fafe52ef0f"
msgid "\"Have you heard about the thefts plaguing in the city?\""
msgstr "\"도시에서 출몰하는 도둑에 대해 들었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "62cabc44-fb30-4174-9a2d-5d9c7ac91848"
msgid "\"Tell me, do you have any books by Willas Gunderson?\""
msgstr "\"윌라스 건더슨의 책이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "ce982ee3-8175-499d-b6da-7b09983f0d87"
msgid "\"Can I borrow these books?\""
msgstr "\"이 책들을 빌려도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "69d97b20-2c83-4902-b4dd-877b7feccc16"
msgid "\"Does the phrase 'fifth in ten' mean anything to you?\""
msgstr "\" '10 중 다섯 번째'라는 말은 네게 어떤 의미이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "372a7646-b865-449f-9deb-78432f5a7ca5"
msgid "\"From a practical standpoint, you're probably right...\""
msgstr "\"실용적인 관점에서 볼 때 네 말이 맞겠지..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "51c38640-b441-4386-8e1e-08ebc34adb7b"
msgid ""
"\"Heh. Kinsman, whatever the explanation, a dwarf without a beard is a sad "
"sight!\""
msgstr "\"이봐요. 매끈한 아저씨, 설명이 어쨌건 수염 없는 드워프는 애처로워보인다고\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "89b15bb1-3a6f-4cb7-94fb-120dd72728ad"
msgid "\"Right! Out with old traditions!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 고리타분한 전통에서 벗어나야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8e27d8f6-5577-4df1-8724-45310caabdf3"
msgid ""
"{n}A young dwarf, red-haired, neat and surprisingly clean-shaven, stands "
"leaning against a sledge-hammer. He's busy reading some book, but as you "
"approach he looks up and bows slightly.{/n} \"Greetings, Your Grace! I am "
"Verdel, a blacksmith. What can I do to help you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}붉은 머리의 젊은 드워프는 놀랍도록 깨끗한 면도를 했고 큰 망치에 기대어 서있습니다. 그는 책을 읽느라 바쁘지만 당신이 다가오자 "
"올려다 보고는 인사합니다..{/n} \"안녕하십니까. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 저는 대장장이 버델입니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3d1da6e2-935c-4c54-8118-9ca61bacf744"
msgid ""
"{n}As usual, Verdel is taking a break from his labors in the blacksmith "
"shop, reading a book. When he notices you, he stops reading and bows.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}평소처럼 버델은 대장간에서 일하던 중, 책을 읽으며 잠시 쉬고 있습니다. 그가 당신을 알아차리자 독서를 멈추고 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8f3bf385-4426-4638-921e-1537a628a458"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing at all, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Three dwarf clans "
"used to live in these lands — the Woradash, the Langebukk and the Skjegge. "
"My family is Skjegge. But we moved off to {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} two hundred "
"years ago, together with Aldori — fleeing from the Conqueror. Our "
"grandfathers made a safe bet that the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} would "
"need swords! Anyhow, neither me nor even my father have ever been to the old "
"fortresses. I vaguely remember from grandfather's stories that the Langebukk "
"stronghold was supposed to be somewhere nearby. But no, I'd have no idea "
"where to look for it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀 모르겠습니다.{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 먼 예전 드워프는 워라다쉬, 랑게부크, 셰게 이렇게 3개 클랜이 이 땅에서 "
"살았었습니다. 그중 우리 가문은 셰게입니다. 하지만 우리는 정복자로부터 {g|Aldori}알도리{/g}와 함께 {g|Mivon}미본{/g}"
"으로 2백년 전에 이주했습니다. 당시 가문의 할아버지들은 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}에게 우리가 만든 칼이나 무기가 꼭 "
"필요할꺼라고 확신했거든요. 어찌됐던 저나 아버지나 옛 요새에 가본 적은 없군요. 랑게부크 거점이 근처 어딘가에 있다는 할아버지의 이야기가 "
"어렴풋이 기억이 나지만..글쎄, 어디서 찾아야 할지 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e5f31510-a8bb-47c0-9bdd-adcd833ce9ea"
msgid "\"As Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} wishes!\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "9015be15-7656-4d70-abbe-28aef1f9fb15"
msgid ""
"{n}Verdel sighs and runs his fingers through his hair.{/n} \"You expect to "
"see a beard, eh? No offense, but what's the point of a beard? Especially "
"when you're a blacksmith and working with fire. You burn it once, dip it "
"into lighting oil and catch a spark from the forge, and your beard is "
"history! You're better off without one.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}버델은 한숨을 쉬고는 손가락으로 머리를 쓸어내립니다.{/n} \"드워프의 턱수염을 기대했나보군요, 죄송하지만 수염이 무슨 쓸모가 "
"있습니까? 특히나 불을 다루는 대장장이인데 말이죠. 한번 타버리면 대장간에 불난리가 나고는 수염의 명복을 빌어야 하겠죠. 없는 게 "
"났습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "386246c0-080b-4635-b548-d8bd925a0918"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to tell, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}? I'm a "
"blacksmith. My father was a blacksmith. My grandfather was a blacksmith, and "
"his grandfather too. Besides, every one of them were remarkably fertile, so "
"I have plenty of cousins, second cousins, third cousins, and all of them are "
"blacksmiths too. Pretty much all the weapons in {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} were "
"forged by someone from our family. That's why I moved away from the old home "
"grounds. My skills are more useful here, that's for sure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 말이 필요하겠습니까, 저는 대장장이입니다. 아버지도 대장장였습니다. 할아버지도, 또 그의 할아버지도 마찬가지입니다. 게다가 그들 "
"모두가 생식력이 왕성한 탓에 차고 넘칠만큼의 사촌에, 이종사촌, 팔촌까지 있고 그들 모두 대장장이입니다. {g|Mivon}미본{/g}에서 "
"만들어지는 모든 무기는 우리 가족 중 누군가가 만든 겁니다. 그래서 저는 고향을 떠나왔습니다. 내 기술은 여기서 더 쓸만할테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ac9cb503-a028-415f-912d-a20ce14f4f26"
msgid "\"All the best, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 가십시오! {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "fc7e3e07-0904-4063-89b8-7c10d4120a05"
msgid ""
"{n}Verdel looks a little confused.{/n} \"Well, different things... It's nice "
"to take a rest with a good book. Just now it's 'Valour and Honor: Ten "
"Adventures of the Splendid Willas Gunderson in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}'.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}버델은 조금 혼란스러워 보입니다.{/n} \"뭐, 다른 것들이라면.. 좋은 책을 읽으며 휴식을 취하는 것이 좋습니다. 지금은 "
"'용맹과 명예: {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에서 화려한 윌라스 건더슨의 10가지 모험'을 읽고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "e4dd09e7-3bf4-41e0-b9c5-f5318651e0ab"
msgid ""
"{n}Verdel frowns.{/n} \"Heard? Your Highness, I myself am the victim of "
"those thieves! Stole my tools — right from under my very nose!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}버델은 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"들으셨습니까? 저는 도둑질의 피해자입니다! 내 연장을 바로 내 눈 앞에서 훔쳐갔어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "76078478-ecd4-4da8-b0a9-f36a5f4ab826"
msgid ""
"\"I was in the back yard, getting coal for the furnace, and I heard some "
"noise inside. I ran in — and the thief jumped right into a magic portal and "
"vanished! I didn't even get a good look.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뒤뜰에서 용광로에 석탄을 채우다가 내부의 소음을 들었습니다. 바로 달려들었지만 도둑은 마법 포탈로 뛰어들어 사라졌습니다! 제대로 "
"볼수도 없었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "fe4ece76-3b05-4049-a100-a78496157201"
msgid ""
"\"It's like you're interrogating me! Uh, of course I do. Everyone says he's "
"bad, but I like him. The guy writes with feeling... I mean, used to write.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 심문하는 것 같군요! 물론 할 수 있죠. 모두가 그를 나쁘다고 하지만 저는 그를 좋아합니다. 글을 느낌있게 잘쓰거든요.. 아니 "
"잘 썼었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "eeff1fa0-5ddb-4dfe-9ad7-98d61537d5e5"
msgid "\"Of course! Read away.\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠! 읽어보시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "23a0b485-690b-4867-a925-5c60c9485cc8"
msgid ""
"\"Is this about Gunderson? He has a book titled 'Ten Adventures'. It's some "
"of his best work!\""
msgstr "\"건더슨에 관한 것인가요? 그의 책중에 '10가지 모험'라는 제목의 책이 있는데 명작이죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "df585dd3-3eeb-4728-bf27-49e612002e96"
msgid "\"Well, for once in my life, I got approval from a kinsman!\""
msgstr "\"내 인생 처음으로 친척에게 동의를 얻었군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "20c57b84-a361-4009-b6a0-aac7e85bad6d"
msgid ""
"\"You don't say. Why, they might start taking us for elves!\" {n}Verdel "
"chuckles, but it's clear he has no intention of changing his opinion.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그런말 마시죠. 우리를 엘프로 착각하겠어!\" {n}버델은 껄껄 웃지만 그는 대화의 주제를 바꿀 생각은 없어 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Capital/VerdelBlacksmith/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "b3e4fdcd-7b95-4487-b0cb-93df6b3f9332"
msgid "\"Practicality is my middle name, right!\" {n}Verdel nods, content.{/n}"
msgstr "\"실용성은 내 중간 이름이죠.\" {n}버델은 자신있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "01a129f2-954a-4f80-8ee0-e6a1a5f2c2f7"
msgid "\"We're just talking. You don't like it?\""
msgstr "\"그냥 얘기하는거 뿐이잖아. 하기 싫어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "64b6d278-7423-463d-b530-a15df9adef99"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "59076d0c-0a10-4d6b-bd3f-f87abe06d0aa"
msgid ""
"\"So why did you leave your tribe? And what's the story about the frost "
"giants?\""
msgstr "\"왜 부족을 떠났지? 그리고 서리 거인에 관한 이야기는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "d5a312dd-a269-4945-8b45-cec75fb47cc2"
msgid ""
"\"That's a formidable sword. But it's not just a simple weapon, is it?\""
msgstr "\"그것은 엄청난 검이지만 단순한 무기가 아닌거 같네. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "c78ff0e0-d6a8-490c-b674-29facb15c7d0"
msgid "\"So, I'm… the chieftain of your new tribe? What do you expect of me?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 내가... 새로운 족장이야? 나에게 기대하는 거라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "1ad0aaf2-2d36-4ef4-bf39-01bab79db99b"
msgid "\"Thanks for talking with me. Let's speak again later.\""
msgstr "\"얘기해줘서 고마워. 나중에 다시 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8b0a9a39-05f6-488d-864f-420bab866a0c"
msgid "\"What's it like to be a barbarian in the Six Bears tribe?\""
msgstr "\"여섯 곰 부족의 바바리안으로써 산다는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "aad2bd7e-df9f-4528-b643-0d819d01e101"
msgid ""
"\"I guess you had to do a lot of training to become as strong as you are.\""
msgstr "\"강해지려 많은 훈련을 했겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "69b3eed3-5e33-4396-b139-79582ce8359f"
msgid "\"What does the Realm of the Mammoth Lords look like?\""
msgstr "\"매머드 군주의 영역은 어떻게 생겼지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "8739a41d-23f9-475d-a312-ab524dcc35ad"
msgid "\"Why did you leave your tribe?\""
msgstr "\"왜 무리를 떠났나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "d1390a9a-cad3-4899-bc84-c19bcdd78bc1"
msgid "\"You're quite a good fighter.\""
msgstr "\"너는 꽤 좋은 전사야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "c28ab20b-32dc-4166-b010-0979568956f7"
msgid "\"You're rather rude, you know?\""
msgstr "\"넌 조금 무례해. 알고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "28ba087b-3478-4147-b6a2-64f004fdece4"
msgid "\"Thanks for telling me. Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"말해줘서 고마워. 다른 얘기를 해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0040_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bfebeb42-3553-440a-bd0d-69e73ed637ed"
msgid "Reproached Amiri for her rudeness."
msgstr "아미리의 무례함을 비난했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "e422cc2c-e64a-48c9-8898-48bfde8649ef"
msgid ""
"\"I meant exactly what I said. You're quite a good fighter. Don't raise your "
"voice to me ever again.\""
msgstr "\"내가 말한 그대로야. 너는 훌륭한 전사지. 하지만 다시는 내 앞에서 언성 높이지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0041_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "369ac848-0a48-42a5-beec-4e6f0743bcae"
msgid "Complimented Amiri on her fighting skill."
msgstr "아미리의 전투 기술을 칭찬했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "3b6b8213-bf56-4a2b-ae75-ac64970b3cc0"
msgid ""
"\"You are very good in a fight. You're an excellent warrior. I've just given "
"you a compliment, that's all.\""
msgstr "\"너는 싸움에 아주 뛰어나. 너는 훌륭한 전사야. 그냥 칭찬 한거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "d7676d24-4801-4c66-8b1b-f2140db16c79"
msgid "\"Oh, just relax. Forget I said anything.\""
msgstr "\"오. 진정해. 내가 한 말은 잊어버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69841_Text
msgctxt "1ec2bff5-6cba-454a-aab9-9dbc0320e168"
msgid "\"I don't need your help anymore. Pack your things and leave.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 네 도움은 필요하지 않다. 물건을 싸서 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69843_Text
msgctxt "ca2b2b6b-44ae-49fe-9fcd-a9a0e168be07"
msgid ""
"\"I want you to leave. We follow different paths, Amiri, and you know that.\""
msgstr "\"네가 떠났으면 한다. 우리는 길이 달라. 아미리, 너도 알 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69844_Text
msgctxt "f65272f6-d608-4632-ad12-8e065620105a"
msgid "\"Ha! You made such a funny face! Relax, I'm joking.\""
msgstr "\"하! 표정이 재밌군! 진정해. 농담이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69847_Text
msgctxt "2185aa2f-b936-4551-b206-c39d369b6b3b"
msgid "\"How are the Tiger Lords doing?\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 군주들은 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69849_Text
msgctxt "b826f53a-5faf-44e1-a1b3-85367ee8fdba"
msgid "\"Why did your tribe want you dead?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너희 부족은 네가 죽기를 원했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69852_Text
msgctxt "4b505010-7711-4a78-96a4-6e3d9bd029d0"
msgid "\"Why do you want to kill this Tuskgutter so much?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 터스크거터를 죽이고 싶어 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69854_Text
msgctxt "f50e5127-9dc6-4737-9153-8a4587cda408"
msgid "\"So, have you proven yourself to be a mighty warrior?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 강력한 전사라는 것을 증명했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69857_Text
msgctxt "d3099c63-f3ba-4072-b55c-afaef8f406c9"
msgid "\"Why did that ghost call you a thief?\""
msgstr "\"왜 저 유령이 너를 도둑이라고 부르는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69860_Text
msgctxt "985a8b01-1a5c-4234-8e7a-33df561ae8f6"
msgid "\"It seems you and Nilak are close.\""
msgstr "\"너와 닐락은 가까운 사이 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69862_Text
msgctxt "87a3befc-a4d3-4959-9dc8-1617e3f5383a"
msgid "\"I'm sorry about what happened to Nilak.\""
msgstr "\"닐락에게 일어난 일은 유감이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_69864_Text
msgctxt "2edc235e-61cd-4764-b703-4e58fa2fd899"
msgid ""
"\"I worship Gorum, like you. We'll dedicate many glorious victories to him!\""
msgstr "\"난 너처럼 고룸을 숭배하지. 우린 영광스러운 승리를 그에게 바칠 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4a28be56-1728-466f-941d-649744f72d29"
msgid ""
"\"We're gonna talk?\" {n}Amiri utters a weary sigh.{/n} \"All right, spill "
"it. I'm listening.\""
msgstr "\"얘기 할거야?\" {n}아미리는 피곤한듯 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"좋아, 떠들어봐. 들어줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0005_1_Text
msgctxt "25865288-c83b-44f3-9155-92e1e0c741a6"
msgid ""
"\"And if you gonna ask questions — like 'why', and 'what for', and 'how' — "
"screw this!\" {n}Amiri looks you over slowly, head to toe.{/n} \"Or you got "
"even harder ones?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜, 어째서, 어떻게 따위의 질문을 하려면 때려쳐!\" {n}아미리가 당신을 천천히 훑습니다.{/n} \"아니면 더 어려운 얘기 "
"할거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "6756f70f-5437-41cf-b4e4-7e692acb7ca8"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri shrugs several times — perhaps flexing her muscles, or maybe just "
"filling in the silence.{/n} \"Dunno,\" {n}she admits at last.{/n} \"Depends "
"what we're gonna talk about. If it's about monsters, or swords, or scars — I "
"approve! That's good.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 수 차례 어깨를 움츠렸습니다. 아마도 근육을 풀거나 아니면 침묵을 깨려고 하는 것일 수도 있습니다.{/n} \"몰라.\" "
"{n}그녀는 마침내 인정합니다.{/n} \"우리가 이야기할 내용에 따라 다르지. 괴물이나 칼이나 흉터에 관한 것이라면 찬성! 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "99cbdace-a330-4ec4-9190-7d23341b9c01"
msgid ""
"\"I told you already, they were assholes. They treat women like sheep, not "
"fighters.\" {n}Amiri frowns.{/n} \"As for giants... I'll tell you later. "
"Someday. Maybe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이미 말했지. 그들은 개자식들이라고. 그들은 여자들을 전사가 아닌 양처럼 취급해.\" {n}아미리는 눈살을 찌푸렸습니다.{/n} "
"\"거인에 관해서는... 나중에 말해줄게. 언젠가는. 아마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_1_Text
msgctxt "1523a540-52f4-4c27-b08e-fb973e48091d"
msgid ""
"\"This sword belonged to a real blasted frost giant! I killed the beast and "
"took this looker for myself. Fits me perfect! My damned trophy!\" {n}Amiri's "
"eyes flash with menace as if she's challenging some invisible enemy to try "
"taking away her trophy.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 검은 진짜 서리 거인의 것이야! 내가 그 짐승을 죽여서 이 녀석을 빼앗았지. 딱 내 물건이야! 내 전리품이지!\" {n}아미리의 "
"눈은 마치 보이지 않는 적에게 전리품을 빼앗기지 않겠다는 듯 무섭게 빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "efc99eab-842a-467c-bd5f-fa2a2e6aa908"
msgid ""
"\"You bet it's not simple! Check out how big it is!\" {n}She proudly raises "
"the blade and you notice that, even though Amiri is extremely strong, she "
"still has difficulty wielding such a large sword.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"단순한 검이 아니야! 얼마나 큰지 보라고!\" {n}그녀는 자랑스럽게 칼을 들어올리는데 아무리 강한 아미리라도 그것을 휘두르기에는 "
"힘겨워보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "4c934e36-56c8-4364-843c-e200a8c2d93f"
msgid ""
"\"Tribe always must have plenty of food. Tribe's enemies must be tough — not "
"some easy scum! Tribe's fighters must challenge the strongest enemies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"부족에는 항상 먹을게 많아야하지. 부족의 적들은 분명 강할꺼야. 약골들이 아니라고! 부족의 전사들은 가장 강한 적들에게 도전해야만 해!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "55b2c499-666b-4e11-8b17-8ca1d51a0d96"
msgid ""
"\"Also, well…\" {n}Amiri contemplates deeply.{/n} \"You must rule the tribe. "
"Make big decisions.\" {n}She waves her hand vaguely.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고... 음...\" {n}아미리는 깊이 생각합니다.{/n} \"너는 부족을 다스려야 하지. 중요한 결정들을 내려야 해.\" {n}"
"그녀는 애매하게 손을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "a1847b07-c7e3-408f-bebb-05891a9ab1de"
msgid ""
"\"Talking, talking… When will we do some monster-killing instead?\" {n}Amiri "
"sighs and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"말이 많아... 대체 괴물은 언제 잡아?\" {n}아미리가 한숨을 쉬고는 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "d88f0c82-feea-4723-8fbe-71e254cfbc28"
msgid ""
"\"Erm...\" {n}This simple question seems to puzzle Amiri. She scratches her "
"head, then starts counting on her fingers.{/n} \"First, I'm a barbarian. I'm "
"strong. Erm... I grew up in the {g|Realm of the Mammoth Lords}Realm of the "
"Mammoth Lords{/g}. I left my tribe, the Six Bears.\" {n}Amiri looks "
"thoughtfully at her four bent fingers and shrugs.{/n} \"And I like fights,\" "
"{n}she concludes, bending her thumb.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"음...\" {n}이 간단한 질문은 아미리를 혼란스럽게 하는 것처럼 보입니다. 그녀는 머리를 긁고는 손가락으로 계산을 "
"시작합니다.{/n} \"우선 나는 바바리안이다. 나는 강해. 음... 나는 {g|Realm of the Mammoth Lords}매머드 "
"군주의 영역{/g}에서 자랐어. 나는 여섯 곰 부족을 떠났어.\" {n}아미리는 구부린 네 번째 손가락을 보며 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} "
"\"나는 싸움이 좋아.\" {n}그녀는 엄지 손가락을 구부리고는 결론을 내립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "4beb8ff9-7e7b-440a-ad5f-a2192578ae08"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Our people are big and strong. We can cut a monster in half with one "
"swing. We can walk three days and nights with no rest. We can eat a whole "
"fried aurochs!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 우리 민족은 크고 강해서 한번 휘둘러 괴물을 반으로 자를 수 있지. 그리고 쉬지 않고 3일 밤낮 동안 걸을 수 있다. 게다가 "
"소를 통째로 구워먹어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "837e9c90-2af2-4e96-bbc1-54cc4b891277"
msgid ""
"\"Training? Ha ha ha! No one freaking trained me! The boys of the Six Bears "
"got the training. All I could do was watch!\" {n}Amiri's eyes gleam with "
"anger.{/n} \"And you know what? They were still crap even after all that "
"training, because I kicked their butts hard!\""
msgstr ""
"\"훈련? 하하하! 아무도 나를 훈련시키지 않았어! 여섯 곰 부족의 남자 아이들은 훈련을 받게 되어있지. 나는 그저 지켜 봤을 뿐이야!\""
" {n}아미리의 눈은 분노로 빛납니다.{/n} \"그리고 그 녀석들은 내가 엉덩이좀 걷어찼다고 징징거렸지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "1a7f837f-5e55-4c3a-80a6-4cc5d189dfdf"
msgid ""
"\"Animals, bandits, monsters — all thought they were stronger than me. "
"Idiots!\" {n}Amiri spits on the ground.{/n} \"Because if you start a fight, "
"you think you can win. You think you stronger than your enemy.\" {n}Amiri "
"raises her chin proudly.{/n} \"I defeated them all! See all the scars on my "
"face?\""
msgstr ""
"\"동물, 산적, 괴물들은 모두 자기가 나보다 강하다고 생각했었지. 멍청이들.\" {n}아미리가 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"보통 "
"싸움을 시작하면 이길 수 있다고 생각하고 자신이 적보다 강하다고 생각한다.\" {n}아미리는 턱을 자랑스럽게 올립니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"그들을 모두 패배시켰어. 내 얼굴에 있는 흉터가 보이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "6c2f7767-b5fd-4c98-bddc-2c6db9bece8e"
msgid ""
"\"Huge and freezing. No place for weaklings.\" {n}Amiri narrows her eyes as "
"if evaluating your ability to survive her homeland.{/n} \"Tribes hunt "
"aurochs herds to survive. Aurochs are fast, so tribe follows herd for days, "
"just to not die of hunger. If you are weak, you stay behind and die in the "
"snow. Tribe cannot stop.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거대하고 얼어붙었어. 약점이 없어.\" {n}아미리는 마치 당신이 그곳에서 살아남을 수 있는지 가늠하듯 눈을 좁힙니다.{/n} "
"\"부족은 생존하기 위해 야생소를 사냥한다. 야생소는 빠르기 때문에 며칠을 추격해서 힘을 뺀다. 네가 약하면 눈 속에서 죽어가겠지. "
"부족은 멈추지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "00b3e2ba-ab01-43c6-8028-8ce40a75e5f2"
msgid ""
"\"Also, there are giants and mammoths. Sometimes demons come too. Ah, and "
"the mastodons. And the saber-toothed tigers.\" {n}Amiri grins.{/n} \"You "
"would survive, I think. — For a few days, ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 거인과 매머드가 있지. 가끔은 데몬이나 마스토돈도 나타난다고. 검치호도 나오고.\" {n}아미리는 웃습니다.{/n} \"너도 "
"살아남을 수 있어. 며칠 동안은 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "53b76b5f-8e96-4be0-8876-70c116107b13"
msgid ""
"\"And females just nod. 'Go sew hides, cook meat, watch kids' — that's what "
"they always say. But I'm a warrior, dammit! I won't cook hides and watch "
"meat!\" {n}Amiri is already shouting, her fists clenched tightly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 여자들은 고개를 끄덕여. '가서 가죽을 바느질하고 고기를 굽고 애들이나 돌보자' 항상 그들이 했던 말이야. 하지만 나는 전사란 "
"말이다! 나는 가죽을 요리하거나 고기를 돌보지 않을 거야!\" {n}아미리는 주먹을 꽉 쥐고 소리를 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "7664aa1b-7379-4d7e-90ae-2c5f56e59b4f"
msgid ""
"\"I told them so! I went hunting with men! And what did I get? Still the "
"same: 'You are woman, you stay home!' Even gave me a nickname — 'the Soft "
"Chieftain', like a warrior woman was a funny joke! Damn, I even went to hunt "
"those shit-faced frost giants, and there... there…\" {n}Amiri suddenly "
"stops, breathing heavily, sweat beading on her forehead.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그렇게 얘기했지! 나는 남자들과 사냥을 갔었다. 그리고 나는 무엇을 얻었을까? 똑같은 잔소리였어. '너는 여자니까 집에나 "
"있어!' 심지어 부드러운 족장이라는 별명까지 짓더군! 마치 내가 자기들 장난감인 것 마냥! 젠장... 하여튼 그 망할 놈의 서리 거인들을 "
"사냥하러 갔었는데, 거기... 거기에는...\" {n}아미리가 갑자기 멈추고 이마에 땀이 맺히며 숨을 헐떡입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "59362ed1-a0ee-4373-9f6e-da3f2ff1274c"
msgid ""
"{n}After a moment, Amiri waves her hand awkwardly, and forces herself to "
"grin.{/n} \"So I left. Cowards, scoundrels, and sissies they were — that's "
"why!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 후 아미리는 손을 어색하게 흔들며 억지 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"그래서 나는 떠났어. 겁쟁이에 악당들과 계집애 같은 남자들 "
"때문에. 그게 이유야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "d7b64b75-6e6e-45d1-b792-4390826f6000"
msgid ""
"\"You bet!\" {n}Amiri grins, then suddenly frowns.{/n} \"I'm a fighter, big "
"and strong. Everyone's afraid of me! I can't play the softie! Who would ever "
"fear me then?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지!\" {n}아미리는 웃다가 갑자기 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"나는 크고 강한 전사다. 모두 나를 두려워해! 나는 부드러운 "
"역할은 질색이야! 그딴 짓을 한다면 누가 나를 무서워하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b3bcfc2d-9097-48c4-b3b1-f1b2a8a9c1dd"
msgid ""
"{n}The contemplative expression disappears from Amiri's face, replaced by a "
"dreamy grin.{/n} \"I enjoy being feared. When I pass by and all the sissies "
"almost faint! Knees trembling! Teeth chattering! Shit dripping down their "
"pants!\" {n}Amiri falls silent, fascinated with the picture her imagination "
"has created.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}숙고하는 표정이 아미리의 얼굴에서 사라지고 몽롱한 웃음으로 바뀝니다.{/n} \"나는 공포를 즐긴다. 내가 지나갈 때 계집애 같은 "
"남자들은 모두 겁에 질려 다리를 떤다! 이빨도 부딪히며 바지에 지려버리지!\" {n}아미리는 상상력이 만든 그림에 매료되어 "
"침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "bfe8f21a-4d00-47cb-a674-15a4a5fe894c"
msgid ""
"\"Why not?\" {n}Amiri frowns, but you feel she's glad to change the "
"subject.{/n}"
msgstr "\"물론.\" {n}아미리는 눈살을 찌푸리지만 그녀는 주제를 바꾸게 되어 기쁜 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "33cf0dde-3665-4b85-8d01-eb761b0c29b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri jerks her head up.{/n} \"'Quite good,' huh? Compared to who? If I "
"was a crappy male, I'd fight better, is that what you say?\" {n}She glares "
"at you, her eyes narrow.{/n} \"Or you say I could be better? Like, 'go get "
"some training, Amiri,' right?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리가 머리를 홱 돌립니다.{/n} \" '아주 좋아. 응? 누구와 비교 한거지? 내가 진절머리 나는 남자라면 더 잘 싸웠을 "
"거야. 라는 게 네가 말하고 싶은 거야?\" {n}그녀는 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"아니면 내가 더 잘할 수 "
"있다고? 가서 훈련이나 더 하라는 의미야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "f5948a6a-495f-41cf-9a34-6690390dcc2c"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri continues to breathe heavily for several seconds, glaring at you. "
"But finally she calms down.{/n} \"I won't,\" {n}she mutters.{/n} \"Forget it."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 몇 초 동안 숨을 깊게 쉬며 당신을 봅니다. 그러나 마침내 그녀는 진정합니다.{/n} \"나는 안 할거야.\" {n}그녀는 "
"중얼거립니다.{/n} \"잊어 버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "99109fc4-cb97-4a0e-b896-11ab8fc1f54b"
msgid ""
"{n}For several more seconds Amiri continues to glare at your face with "
"suspicion, then — all of a sudden — she mellows.{/n} \"True, I fight good. "
"That's what I do best.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}몇초 동안을 더 당신을 의심스럽게 본 아미리는 갑자기 표정이 누그러집니다.{/n} \"맞아. 나는 잘 싸워. 그게 제일 잘하는 거지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0045_Text_String
msgctxt "f42205a7-25eb-485c-964b-5195d255e929"
msgid ""
"{n}For several more seconds Amiri continues to glare at you, but then she "
"calms down.{/n} \"I'm the best fighter!\" {n}she exclaims with conviction, "
"and strikes her chest with her fist.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}몇초 동안을 더 당신을 본 아미리는 진정하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"맞아. 나는 잘 싸워. 그게 제일 잘하는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69842_Text
msgctxt "76dd950b-077b-407d-83c6-4935cf511086"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri stares at you, then after a long pause utters:{/n}\n"
"\"Wha?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리가 당신을 쳐다보고 긴 침묵 후에 말합니다.{/n}\n"
"\"뭐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69845_Text
msgctxt "311ca189-1752-4149-be3b-5a4171db7c92"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri turns red with anger.{/n} \"Is that how it is? Well then! You're a "
"piece of shit anyway, not a chief! So long, sissy!\" {n}The barbarian storms "
"off, painfully shoving past you on her way.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 분노로 얼굴이 붉게 변합니다.{/n} \"그런 거야? 좋아 그럼! 넌 쓰레기야, 족장이 아니라! 잘 있어라 겁쟁아!\" "
"{n}바바리안이 고함을 지르고는 고통스럽게 당신을 지나쳐갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69846_Text
msgctxt "e2a3e9ea-20e9-4692-af5f-1b91cb66a34b"
msgid "{n}Amiri narrows her eyes.{/n} \"Your jokes are kinda shitty.\""
msgstr "{n}아미리의 눈이 좁혀집니다.{/n} \"네 농담은 엿 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69848_Text
msgctxt "3f4aea0f-5ca6-4eba-8d0e-7fe99c365394"
msgid ""
"\"So far, so good. To tell the truth, after all that mess with Armag, and "
"then the split, the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger{/g} was more like a single paw. But "
"the claws on it still sharp, so... If {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} wants it, we'll get "
"back to fighting!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금까지는 좋아. 진실을 말하면 아르막과 한바탕 하고 나서 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이{/g} 녀석은 이빨 빠진 녀석이나 다름 "
"없었어. 하지만 그 발톱은 여전히 날카로워서... {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 그걸 원하면 다시 싸우러 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69850_Text
msgctxt "38318798-6148-471f-82d2-afb9acc3abfa"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't that clear? A woman can't be a warrior. If she's a shitty warrior, "
"they may keep her for the jokes. Give her a funny nickname, like 'the Soft "
"Chieftain'. But what if she's good? Best the tribe has? Then the other "
"tribes are laughing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알겠어? 여자는 전사가 될 수 없다. 형편없는 전사라면 농담거리로 삼을지도 몰라. '부드러운 족장' 이라는 유치한 별명도 지어주고. "
"하지만 실력이 좋다면? 부족내에서 최고라면? 그러면 다른 부족들의 비웃음을 살 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69851_Text
msgctxt "1efd6303-d650-41b7-b72e-5c984cb1017f"
msgid ""
"\"That's why they... you know. But it's a taboo to spill kin's blood, so "
"they had to do it without doing it. Feed me to giants, what a plan! But I "
"never afraid to get my hands red! I spit on them and their tradition! I'm a "
"walking taboo myself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 그들은... 알잖아. 하지만 친족의 피를 흘리는 건 금기라서, 피를 흘리지 않고 죽여야 했어. "
"서리 거인한테 먹이로 던져주다니, 대단한 계획이야! 하지만 나는 금기따위 두렵지 않아! "
"나는 그들과 전통에 침을 뱉었다! 나 자산이 걸어다니는 금기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69853_Text
msgctxt "dcb0ef4b-bab6-45b6-a9a1-b2745999d5aa"
msgid ""
"\"He's a monster. We kill monsters. What's here so difficult to understand?\""
msgstr "\"그는 괴물이야. 우리는 괴물을 잡고. 그게 그렇게 이해하기 어려워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69855_Text
msgctxt "088adb1b-9606-4ad3-8b65-8775a99c129c"
msgid ""
"\"I may have... The trial is finished. And if someone ever doubt me, I prove "
"it!\" {n}Amiri shakes her fist at the unseen offender.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아마 그럴지도... 시련은 끝났어. 누군가 내 능력을 의심하다면 말해주지, 나는 증명해냈다고!\" {n}아미리는 눈에 보이지 않는 "
"적에게 주먹을 먹입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69856_Text
msgctxt "cb2f840a-7f1a-48e2-b5bd-d2c60084d213"
msgid "\"You joking? I don't need to prove anything any more!\""
msgstr "\"너 농담하는 거야? 더 이상 아무것도 증명할 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69858_Text
msgctxt "f5778717-7946-4581-9e5c-723538776088"
msgid ""
"\"The hells I should know! It's a ghost, who can tell what it talks about.\""
msgstr "\"나도 그게 무슨 소리인지 알고 싶어! 그건 자기만의 사연이 있는 유령일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69859_Text
msgctxt "f5a626fc-ef01-49de-bf86-2a130afe2b66"
msgid ""
"{n}After a moment of silence Amiri continues.{/n} \"Maybe because of the "
"sword. I took it from a giant, and the ghost is a giant. Do I supposed to "
"guess he likes this piece of steel so much he come back from the dead for it?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵의 순간이 지나고 아미리가 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"어쩌면 칼 때문일지도. 나는 거인에게서 그것을 빼앗았고, 그 유령은 거인일 "
"지도 몰라. 쇳덩어리를 너무나 좋아해서 죽어서도 나를 괴롭히나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69861_Text
msgctxt "2d2c3503-bff3-4123-8d2b-ccf309f383c3"
msgid ""
"\"You don't know half of it! Only she in the whole damned tribe could "
"understand me. She not a warrior like me, but her spirit is strong! And she "
"smart, smarter than any chieftains ever!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 아무것도 몰라! 그 망할 인간들 사이에서 그녀만이 나를 이해해주었어. 그녀는 전사가 아니었지만 강한 영혼의 소유자였어! 그리고 "
"어느 족장보다 똑똑했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69863_Text
msgctxt "0e9c4ddc-a828-4d0d-9086-df20d4f0de07"
msgid "{n}Amiri tightens her lips and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 입술을 앙다물고 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_69865_Text
msgctxt "57c8f09d-2204-46c5-8090-c0ff4f6de2de"
msgid ""
"\"Right! With a leader like you, swords won't rust in their scabbards! Our "
"Lord in Iron must already have seats of honor prepared for us at his table "
"in Elysium... Not that I'm in a hurry to get there, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 너와 같은 지도자가 있다면 칼이 녹스는 일은 없을 거다! 무쇠와 같은 우리 군주는 일리지움에 있는 영광의 자리에 우리를 앉힐 "
"준비가 되었다... 여유를 가지자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_Amiri_C1_Text
msgctxt "907bfbc2-e483-4339-b697-d61ba04be4b6"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Chief!\" {n}Amiri gives you a broad grin.{/n} \"What's on your mind?\""
msgstr "\"아, 족장!\" {n}아미리는 당신을 보고 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"뭐 할 말 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Amiri/VS_Amiri_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_Amiri_E8_Text
msgctxt "9a5893b2-a618-441e-88d1-f5e7b1e2b4b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri flushes.{/n} \"'Cause they were assholes, all of them! Men were "
"cowards and scoundrels, and women were scared like sheep!\" {n}Amiri rolls "
"her blood-shot eyes in fury.{/n} \"Men there think no girl can be a fighter! "
"Because they are weak! They are afraid a woman can beat them!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리의 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"거야 멍청한 놈들이니 그렇지! 남자라는 잡놈들은 꽁무니를 빼지 않나, 여자들은 벌벌 떨기만 "
"하고!\" {n}아미리의 눈은 분노로 가득합니다.{/n} \"그 잡놈들이 뭐라 했냐면, 여자는 전사가 될 수 없단다! 죄다 약골들이라, "
"여자한테 질까 봐 겁나는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/Dog/Barks/Bark1_String
msgctxt "82cad666-24ff-43ed-a46f-aa9a883e2166"
msgid "[Sniffs your hand]"
msgstr "[에쿤의 손에 코를 대고 냄새를 맡습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/Dog/Barks/Bark_String
msgctxt "f6b87f32-93e3-4a5e-a430-91574169fcd9"
msgid "[Looks at you, tilting head to the side]"
msgstr "[에쿤을 보고는 머리를 갸우뚱합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "13e3f54f-7179-48f3-9016-01c21f1a7b2e"
msgid "\"Why? What happened?\""
msgstr "\"왜? 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "fd869005-98a6-4abc-8a2c-0d14da7dc8e5"
msgid "\"Where will you go?\""
msgstr "\"어디로 갈 건데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "db3f9a67-b339-4516-b2c9-1386fd44193a"
msgid "Parted ways with Ekun amicably."
msgstr "에쿤과 우호적인 방식으로 헤어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "1069d183-00e1-4d85-85a1-511436a2db61"
msgid ""
"\"Well. Too bad our paths have parted. Good luck in your travels, Ekun.\""
msgstr "\"우리의 여정은 여기까지인 것 같다. 행운을 빌어. 에쿤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "25ae1217-2da3-47c5-abc7-f3a59c3b7636"
msgid "Parted ways with Ekun nastily."
msgstr "에쿤을 조롱하여 헤어지게 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "7301b3ff-a9eb-489c-a126-d27a863ea97c"
msgid ""
"\"Come on, hit the road already, and get lost as far as you can from here. "
"Who knows, if you move really fast, you might even flee from the ghosts of "
"your family, those you weren't able to protect.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어서 꺼져. 그 낯짝이 안 보이도록 사라지라고. 혹시 알아? 그렇게 빨리 달리면 너를 괴롭히던 네 가족의 유령에게서 도망칠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f6ff716e-9c0f-4a9c-922b-aeb7d1d89926"
msgid "Killed Ekun for trying to leave."
msgstr "떠나려는 에쿤을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "8c48b7b7-98d1-4f4d-b451-50311730930f"
msgid "[Attack] \"And I won't tolerate traitors!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 반역을 용납하지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c655fc3c-74de-4133-a1c3-ae0f6d12eaa5"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice Ekun, who's clearly waiting for something. His face darkens as "
"he looks at you. He turns toward you. {/n} \"I'm leaving.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 분명히 뭔가를 기다리고 있음이 틀림 없습니다. 그는 당신을 보자 얼굴이 어두워집니다. 그는 당신에게 돌아섭니다.{/n} "
"\"나는 떠난다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "17f7cb72-17b7-4572-b04f-b2d3355b305c"
msgid ""
"\"You've made friendship with the trolls.\" {n}Ekun's eyes are ice-cold.{/n} "
"\"The beasts who killed my wife. My daughter. Won't take it. Won't serve the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} who lets the trolls stay.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 트롤과 우정을 맺었다.\" {n}에쿤의 눈은 얼음처럼 차갑습니다.{/n} \"내 아내와 딸을 죽인 짐승들이다. 나는 용납하지 "
"않는다. 트롤을 내버려둔 너를 섬기지 않는다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "00b5b5a1-7090-4dbc-bd3a-95373fb5c950"
msgid ""
"\"You've made friendship with kobolds.\" {n}Ekun's eyes are ice-cold.{/n} "
"\"They gave alliance to the trolls who'd killed my family. I won't have "
"these beasts at my side. That's why I leave.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 코볼트와 우정을 나누었다.\" {n}에쿤의 눈은 얼음처럼 차갑습니다.{/n} \"그들은 내 가족을 죽인 트롤의 동맹이다. 그 "
"짐승들이 내 옆에 오는 것을 허락하지 않겠다. 나는 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/TartukHargulkaFriendship_EkunLeave/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "21a6d0bd-d8f2-42c7-bbc7-43314bff18d4"
msgid ""
"\"West.\" {n}Ekun says no more, obviously having no intention to go into any "
"further details.{/n}"
msgstr "\"서쪽.\" {n}에쿤은 더 이상 말하지 않았고 더 이상의 설명을 하려는 것 같지는 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1605daeb-2e6f-40c7-85d4-e6ba68fad9c6"
msgid "\"I killed Kargadd.\""
msgstr "\"나는 카르가드를 죽였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6bf48bac-c6e7-4e05-8d03-0fd13af146e2"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "903659ec-13e6-4e96-8fe5-6773cdd3623c"
msgid "\"In that case, we'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 나중에 다시 이야기 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "5901e0f0-7a73-4ed2-b191-824e3723e7d4"
msgid "\"I lured him into direct sunlight. He turned to stone.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그를 햇빛으로 유혹했고 그는 돌로 변했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "bacb6957-143c-4ea5-af55-64170b959abe"
msgid "\"We cut his guts open.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그의 배를 갈랐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "2d6b8ed9-f074-4e7c-bc60-2a9bc9d6071b"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "5be7af4c-18db-4dbc-92fc-05396e50ecf4"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, there were troll younglings, Kargadd's children. They weren't "
"dangerous. I let them go.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 카르가드의 트롤 자식들이 있었어. 위험하지 않아서 그들을 풀어 줬어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "802ad00c-d464-45c2-99a9-aa8cb91758b7"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, there were troll younglings, Kargadd's children. I killed them as "
"well.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 카르가드의 트롤 자식들이 있었어. 물론 모두 죽였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "56e638d4-e8f8-47c4-9b70-4431470f5ea6"
msgid "[Lie] \"No, nothing special.\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"아니. 별일 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "53b2a3b4-2686-4e0f-a0d1-9eb35e872f7d"
msgid "\"Tell me about your life in the Stolen Lands.\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에서의 삶에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "a33c932b-6221-41c6-b1d4-ab08308697f4"
msgid "\"Tell me about your wolf.\""
msgstr "\"네 늑대에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "893857f2-6654-41f3-b98f-94742fa14060"
msgid "\"What are your plans for the future?\""
msgstr "\"앞으로 계획은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "9dec6e4d-3575-4cfd-b293-d5f7b53537c2"
msgid "\"You're not much of a talker, right?\""
msgstr "\"너는 별로 말이 많지 않군. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "fd0e2ac1-af17-4d6f-8100-abfde64cd061"
msgid ""
"\"I won't torture you with more conversation right now. We'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상의 대화로 널 괴롭히지 않겠어. 나중에 또 얘기 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "89780121-11e2-4cda-8099-ad21f0ace3cc"
msgid "Consoled Ekun's grief."
msgstr "에쿤의 슬픔을 달랩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "59a7cce9-9052-4b07-a385-7941c28ba258"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry for your loss, Ekun. Tell me if there's anything I can help you "
"with.\""
msgstr "\"네 가족의 일은 유감이야. 에쿤. 내가 너를 도울 수 있는 것이 있다면 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0037_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3e996b82-4667-405d-9219-4dbf3ae39705"
msgid "Advised Ekun to leave the Stolen Lands."
msgstr "에쿤에게 도둑맞은 땅을 떠날 것을 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "88ac3c81-2baf-4396-a2b5-aaa338efa935"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry that you lost your family. I would understand if you decided to "
"leave me and get as far as possible from the Stolen Lands.\""
msgstr "가족을 잃게된 건 유감이야. 네가 나를 떠나 도둑맞은 땅에서 가능한 한 멀리 떨어지기로 마음먹었더라도 이해할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a369b08c-d121-4529-b68e-16b6f715d9b4"
msgid "Dismissed Ekun's grief."
msgstr "에쿤의 슬픔을 일축합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "53b0642b-0a11-416b-84b9-7234870cf050"
msgid "\"Pull yourself together! I don't need any whiners in my company!\""
msgstr "\"정신 차려! 나는 질질 짜는 동료는 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "0dbfff11-dbc3-457e-a01f-7aa5b72b18b4"
msgid "\"Where are you from? Where's your homeland?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어디 출신이지? 너희 나라는 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "4b2ebd22-7392-4826-ace0-d4e704a8bf87"
msgid "\"Where did you learn to use a bow?\""
msgstr "\"어디에서 활을 사용하는 법을 배웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "7322aa4f-bde8-492e-be22-7364a7ff0e0a"
msgid "\"Do you worship Torag?\""
msgstr "\"너는 토락을 숭배하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "8f22233b-f2b3-425f-9765-1c9d359b3b9a"
msgid "\"Do you have any family?\""
msgstr "\"가족이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "e1d8f633-ec73-45eb-9397-8bbceb69a37f"
msgid "\"Tell me about Amanda and Clarissa.\""
msgstr "\"아만다와 클라리사에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "34e70275-6480-44e0-a81b-9487c4dcde6b"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "8dcdbc1b-45bf-4992-96d3-e9d16340f738"
msgid "\"How did you end up in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에서 어떻게 살게되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "945f0370-6d0d-4426-9826-ad162f341665"
msgid "\"Have you lived in the Stolen Lands for long?\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에서 오래 살았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "76ba1425-7c7c-483c-bdcf-90cc2d14782b"
msgid "\"Do you like it in this country?\""
msgstr "\"이 나라에 있는게 맘에 드나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "7d3c520f-122b-432f-aac9-b779ba2d8012"
msgid "\"Tell me again about the trolls attacking your village.\""
msgstr "\"너희 마을을 공격한 트롤에 대해 다시 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "f9ced22a-5c60-4212-96c4-89df09c13d77"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0068_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a2f2e054-a9c8-440e-9e9c-4128a1d380d1"
msgid "Advised Ekun to send the wolf away."
msgstr "에쿤에게 늑대를 풀어주라고 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "16abfa5c-0c3c-45fc-8de0-9153c6dfaafc"
msgid "\"Drive him away then, if you dislike him so much.\""
msgstr "\"그 녀석이 싫다면 멀리 쫓아내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0069_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "031addd3-ede0-4eb0-ae7d-89e03ce4d006"
msgid "Advised Ekun to keep the wolf."
msgstr "에쿤에게 늑대를 데리고 있으라고 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "7d559515-b9f8-4589-aa26-3ab0e17eee69"
msgid "\"You should accept his help. He's absolutely loyal to you.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이 늑대의 도움을 받아들여야 해. 이 녀석은 너에게 절대적으로 충성하고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "70859f1a-d8bb-4ef7-ae5e-64d3d0d4ef99"
msgid "\"Aren't you going to give him a proper name?\""
msgstr "\"그에게 이름을 지어주지 않을 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "19921482-7822-4f19-b7e3-014135d3586d"
msgid "\"I see. Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다. 다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "fa318e5e-dd0d-49d4-9681-3d38e2ffdec6"
msgid "\"I want you to leave.\""
msgstr "\"나에게서 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "020e4d3c-6d64-4985-806c-8b65711588d9"
msgid "\"Leave my lands. Immediately.\""
msgstr "\"내 땅을 떠나라. 즉시.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "6843ae53-3664-47d9-9698-aa844ebc8313"
msgid "\"Excuse my rambling. Forget what I just said.\""
msgstr "\"횡설수설해서 미안하군. 방금 말한 것을 잊어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "78c88d07-8ec0-4913-beb6-246b40a7d9d3"
msgid "\"I want you to leave.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이만 떠나줬으면 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "9a012a05-d816-442d-90af-70dc8c0e89a9"
msgid "\"Take your things and leave my lands.\""
msgstr "\"네 물건을 가지고 내 땅을 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "e482ddbe-d2af-47e9-8b79-5cd11887595e"
msgid "\"Forget what I said.\""
msgstr "\"방금 말한 것은 잊어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "5befbbfa-1381-4439-ad23-434fa84f0b20"
msgid "\"Remind me how you got him.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그 늑대와 만났는지 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "d29ea107-bc8f-40b8-ba87-856d11b2c0f2"
msgid "\"Well, good to hear! Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"잘 들었다. 다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "491c3b87-2e15-44e3-85f3-43bf38468b3e"
msgid "\"And what did you and Ntavi do when she took you from the party?\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 파티에서 너를 데려간 후엔, 은타비와 너는 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "9b4a87f5-6695-4ef4-ad45-3d93aae63772"
msgid "\"For what?\""
msgstr "\"뭐 때문에?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0107_Text
msgctxt "26137fb7-80a6-434e-a444-9dc8ab1080b9"
msgid "\"I understand, Ekun. You're welcome.\""
msgstr "\"이해해. 에쿤. 고맙기는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0110_Text
msgctxt "9badaa94-a6da-4eba-99d5-034a4a364ae7"
msgid "\"Where have you been? And where is Ntavi?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어디 있었어? 그리고 은타비는 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0112_Text
msgctxt "4f7fe8b8-632b-43b9-84ff-42a437dff831"
msgid "\"Forgive me for not coming to the funeral. How did it go?\""
msgstr "\"장례식에 가지 않는 것은 용서해줘. 어떻게 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0116_Text
msgctxt "3d0b68e8-4edd-454b-aad0-321e8901d165"
msgid "\"I hope you enjoyed the party.\""
msgstr "\"파티가 즐거웠기를 바래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "41735c83-5550-4334-94a7-2bd26c489467"
msgid "\"Have you settled on your plans for the future?\""
msgstr "\"미래에 대한 계획을 세웠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1041dcc7-5964-427a-afcb-dc09b332f175"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekundayo looks somewhere beyond you.{/n} \"Forgive me, friend. My "
"thoughts are on Kargadd right now.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤다요는 당신 뒤 어딘가를 봅니다.{/n} \"용서해. 친구. 내 생각은 지금 카르가드에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "02c69a2d-f6e8-4671-8dfd-be78908c206c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stands absorbed in his thoughts, which must be as heavy as the gaze "
"of his dark eyes. Noticing you, he gives you a distracted nod and waits for "
"your questions.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 자신의 생각에 빠져 있으며 그의 검은 눈 만큼이나 어둡습니다. 당신을 알아채자 산만하게 고개를 끄덕이고 당신의 질문을 "
"기다립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fdb9b27e-2950-4195-902e-e5285f2d5bd2"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun turns his eyes on you.{/n} \"Don't want to rake up the past. Not "
"now, when the wound still bleeds. Must kill Kargadd and regain my peace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은는 당신에게 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"과거를 떠올리고 싶지 않다. 아직 상처가 아물지 않았다. 카르가드를 죽이고 평화를 "
"되찾아야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b2301f2b-f32a-4bb9-91ea-33c472c7b343"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun closes his eyes and sighs, relieved. His wrinkled brow smoothes "
"somewhat.{/n} \"You stole my vengeance. But it's no grudge to hold. You did "
"the right thing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 눈을 감고 한숨을 쉬고는 안도합니다. 그의 주름진 이마는 누그러집니다.{/n} \"너는 나의 복수를 앗아갔다. 하지만 붙잡고 "
"싶지 않다. 너는 옳은 일을 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6cbecb88-1427-414d-b614-c8cf1e65e15d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stares at you closely.{/n} \"I want to know it all. Tell me how it "
"happened. Tell me of his suffering.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신을 가까이서 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 모든 것을 알고 싶다. 어떻게 일어난 일인지 말해줘. 그의 고통을 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ac2b0d1f-8c45-48cc-bfdd-09d0423c2531"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks at you. For a long moment it seems like he'll smile, but he "
"never does.{/n} \"An eternity spent in stone. A decent end. By "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, your fame comes well earned. But it seems there was "
"something else happening there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신을 보고 오랫동안 미소를 짓는 것 같지만 그의 얼굴은 아무렇지 않았습니다.{/n} \"돌에서 영원히 갖혀있어라. 걸맞는 "
"결말이군. {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 축복하사 너의 명성은 더 유명해졌다. 그러나 뭔가 다른 일이 있었던 것 같군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5b82b371-67cf-42e2-a34b-320d68055160"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks at you. For a long moment it seems like he'll smile, but he "
"never does.{/n} \"You freed the world of a terrible monster. By "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, your fame comes well earned. But it seems there was "
"something else happening there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신을 보고 오랫동안 미소를 짓는 것 같지만 그의 얼굴은 아무렇지 않았습니다.{/n} \"괴물을 세상에 풀어주었군. "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}이 축복하사 너의 명성은 더 유명해졌다. 그러나 뭔가 다른 일이 있었던 것 같군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "402323f4-e7d0-4470-8f0e-8e3d77cf135c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun seems surprised, then angry, then contemplative.{/n} \"Don't know if "
"I have the courage inside to act that way,\" {n}he says quietly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 놀라워하고는 화를 내다가 사색에 잠깁니다.{/n} \"내가 그런 행동을 할 용기가 있는지 모르겠다.\" {n}그는 조용히 "
"말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "954da1d0-3b8c-48fd-b8d5-72cef5a66a49"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, Ekun seems angry, but he brushes the emotion away.{/n} \"You"
" acted as you saw fit. Not going to pass judgment on you. The deed's done, "
"and that's most important.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 에쿤은 화가 난 것처럼 보이지만 이내 화를 풉니다.{/n} \"네가 옳다고 생각하는 행동을 했다. 너를 판단하지는 "
"않겠다. 이미 지나간 일은 돌이킬 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "15be0a4a-e54b-476d-be61-780268a222a4"
msgid ""
"\"Vengeance is done, but the pain remains. You're worthy of gratitude and "
"loyalty. You'll get all the answers I promised. I owe you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"복수는 끝났지만 고통이 남아있다. 너는 내 감사와 충성을 받아 마땅하다. 내가 약속한 보답을 얻을 것이다. 너에게 빚을 졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d870aa93-3c0b-411c-ac4e-b8886c5ead24"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun winces, then nods.{/n} \"You made the right choice. Youngling trolls "
"just grow into full trolls. Better for everyone if they never grow at all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 찡그리고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"올바른 선택을 했다. 어린 트롤은 결국 트롤로 자란다. 죽어있는 편이 모두에게 좋다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1f305cd0-ecdb-44d9-8dc9-cb40f523fa78"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment you can almost glimpse a smile in Ekun's eyes.{/n} \"Someone "
"has to be. To balance you.\""
msgstr "{n}잠시 동안 에쿤의 눈에서 눈웃음이 희미하게 보입니다.{/n} \"그런 사람이 한명쯤은 있어야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8b359796-3df3-4cb8-a2e3-8bda18355349"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's eyes look at you, but his thoughts obviously wander somewhere "
"else.{/n} \"To protect you.\" {n}He shrugs.{/n} \"Doesn't matter.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 눈은 당신을 바라 보지만 그의 생각은 분명히 다른 곳에 있습니다.{/n} \"너를 지키려고.\" {n}그는 어깨를 "
"으쓱합니다.{/n} \"그 외에는 상관 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8ed341b7-a7e5-4a0e-86a6-64cf15868c1b"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods gratefully.{/n} \"Thank you. Talking with you already helps.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 감사의 의미로 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"고맙다. 너와 이야기해서 도움이 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ab2f4370-1148-40d8-a5e5-204f85015c7c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun frowns, looking into your eyes.{/n} \"Would prefer to stay, if you "
"don't want to drive me away. Nowhere else to go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 찡그리며 당신 눈을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"날 쫓아내고 싶은게 아니라면 나는 머물고 싶다. 난 달리 갈 데가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0d229c5a-3438-4c53-b41a-7731c8f81bc6"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, Ekun's eyes flash with defiance, but it disappears almost "
"immediately.{/n} \"Hard to do so. Forgive me.\""
msgstr "{n}잠시 동안 에쿤의 눈은 도전적으로 번쩍이지만 즉시 사라집니다.{/n} \"그럴 수 없다. 용서하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ae56386f-872a-4262-ae23-c4ae8f51e450"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods curtly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 짧개 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e2d5d0d4-4b7c-4505-a560-b78eeb49344a"
msgid ""
"\"Why ask?\" {n}Ekun winces and stays silent for a while.{/n} \"Loved them,\""
" {n}he finally answers, turning away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"왜 묻지?\" {n}에쿤은 한동안 침묵하여 조용합니다.{/n} \"그들을 사랑했다.\" {n}그는 마침내 대답하고 돌아서 "
"버렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "dc9a029a-3260-4c39-94d4-2e167d8cd416"
msgid ""
"\"No,\" {n}he answers indifferently.{/n} \"Mother died early. Father died "
"later.\" {n}He stays silent for a while, than resumes.{/n} \"Wife Amanda and "
"daughter Clarissa died recently. {g|Torag}Torag{/g} bless their souls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"없다.\" {n}그는 무관심하게 대답합니다.{/n} \"어머니는 일찍 돌아가셨고 머지 않아 아버지도 돌아가셨다.\" {n}그는 잠시 "
"침묵을 지키다 계속합니다.{/n} \"아내 아만다와 딸 클라리사가 최근에 죽었다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 그들의 영혼을 "
"축복하시길. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b9b7a0a0-e170-4902-ba33-9227127f1c31"
msgid ""
"\"Yes,\" {n}Ekun nods.{/n} \"All gods are even in the eyes of men back in "
"the motherland. Chose the one that fit best, though he's a dwarf god.\" He "
"shrugs and glances at his longbow. \"Used to guard decent men and craft "
"bows. {g|Torag}Torag{/g} blesses both guards and crafters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다.\" {n}에쿤은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"조국에서는 모든 신들을 동등하게 바라봤다. 비록 드워프 신이라고 할지라도, "
"나에게 가장 잘 맞는 신인 것 같아 선택했다.\" {n}그는 어깨를 으쓱하고 자신의 장궁을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"사람들을 보호하고 활을 "
"만들고는 했다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}은 경호원과 장인을 둘 다 축복한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6b3334b6-9a95-4386-bc69-503ebde101bd"
msgid ""
"\"When wayfaring,\" {n}he answers.{/n} \"Traveled through the northlands "
"countless times. Guarded trade caravans. Those who paid with gold dealt with "
"the merchants. Those who wanted to pay with steel dealt with me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여행할 때\" {n}그는 대답합니다.{/n} \"북쪽 지방을 무수히 여행하며 무역 캐러밴을 지켰다. 상인들의 금을 실은 캐러밴을 "
"보호했다. 나와 칼을 겨눈 자들을 상대했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6c1ee433-6406-421a-8d04-2c2ec52debc0"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Thuvia}Thuvia{/g}, far south. A desert that treats the sun orchid like "
"gold. Father took me to {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} when I was thirteen. Never "
"been to my homeland since. Roads always led north of Absalom.\" {n}He "
"shrugs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Thuvia}쑤비아{/g}는 먼 남쪽에 있다. 태양 난초가 황금처럼 비싼 사막이다. 아버지는 내가 열세 살 때 "
"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}에 데려갔다. 그 이후로는 고향에 간 적이 없다. 길은 항상 압살롬 북쪽으로 이어진다.\" {n}그는 "
"어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "bfd22191-59c8-4246-98aa-90e14bb2bb55"
msgid "{n}Ekun shrugs indifferently.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 무관심하게 으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ccafcbfe-dbe9-4a07-8bee-de21dac2b8a6"
msgid "\"Happy pages of life. Good to recall. Hurts to come back.\""
msgstr "\"행복한 삶의 일부분이다. 행복한 기억이지만 돌아오면 상처 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e897b985-f7ee-499f-afc0-b3ffafff9aff"
msgid ""
"\"Got married,\" {n}he answers.{/n} \"Crossed northern lands back and forth "
"for a long time. Often came to the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Spent "
"nights in Bristlehill. Recognized Amanda there, and she recognized me. One "
"day, realized leaving wasn't desirable anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"결혼했다.\" {n}그는 대답합니다.{/n} \"오랫동안 북쪽 국경을 오갔다. 종종 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 "
"오고는 했다. 브리스틀힐에서 밤을 지새웠고 거기 아만다를 만났다. 어느 날, 떠나는 것이 더 이상 바람직하지 않다는 것을 깨달았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e0754c19-d0ea-4e81-b017-8a93e3b96079"
msgid ""
"\"Too long — forgot how to defend. Too short — not enough to raise a "
"daughter. Depends how you measure time.\""
msgstr "\"싸우는 방법을 잊어버릴 정도로 길었지만 딸을 기르기에는 충분하지 않은 시간이었다. 느껴지는 시간에 따라 다르다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1a393b9f-685a-42c6-8b00-c6d81632a284"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, but the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} have no credit in that. Seen "
"many places worth staying. Always passed by.\" {n}Ekun shrugs.{/n} \"People "
"by your side are more important than woods and hills around you. Found those "
"people here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다. 그러나 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 대해선 믿음이 서질 않는다. 머무를 만한 장소를 여럿 보았지만 항상 "
"지나쳤다. \" {n}에쿤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"네 곁에 있는 사람들이 주변의 숲과 언덕보다 더 중요하다. 나는 이곳에서 그런 "
"사람들을 찾았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "98744fa0-16e6-4a3b-a6ac-afdc08b27803"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun swallows a lump in his throat.{/n} \"They attacked at night. "
"Slaughtered everyone,\" {n}he answers.{/n} \"We all knew about trolls. Never "
"thought they would come to the village. Never believed...\" {n}Ekun closes "
"his eyes and shakes his head, as if in denial.{/n} \"They came before dawn. "
"Plundered houses. Killed dogs. Cows. People. They ate. Then gathered "
"everything they could and left.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 꿀꺽 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \"그들은 밤에 공격했고 모두를 학살했다.\" {n}그는 대답합니다.{/n} \"우리 모두는 "
"트롤에 대해 알고 있었지만 결코 마을을 습격하리라 생각은 못했다. 꿈에도...\" {n}에쿤은 눈을 감고 거부하듯이 머리를 "
"흔듭니다.{/n} \"그들은 새벽이 오기 전에 집을 침략했다. 개와 소, 사람들을 죽였다. 그리고는 먹어치우고 모든 물건을 쓸어담고 "
"떠났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "645ac8aa-7cd6-4853-8265-52c20f797177"
msgid ""
"\"Not mine,\" {n}he answers. Noticing this answer isn't satisfactory, he "
"goes on.{/n} \"Never wanted a pet. Never needed one. But couldn't slay the "
"trolls, defend the village. Just called for help.\" {n}Ranger shifts his "
"frowning gaze to the side.{/n} \"Everything grew dark for a moment. Fainted. "
"Came back with the tongue of this... dog... on my face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 것이 아니다.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 이 대답이 만족스럽지 못한 것을 눈치채고 그는 말을 계속합니다.{/n} \"애완 동물을 "
"원한 적도, 필요했던 적도 없었다. 하지만 트롤을 죽이는 건 물론 마을도 보호하지 못했을 때 난 그저 도와달라고 부르짖었다.\" {n}"
"레인저는 찡그린 시선을 옆으로 옮깁니다.{/n} \"모든 것이 잠시 동안 어두워졌다. 나는 기절했었다. 깨어났을땐 내 얼굴을 핥고 "
"있는..이 개가..옆에 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "92cbd0c8-728b-454f-af23-bd3613f8edf8"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods curtly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 짧개 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4641f769-5cc1-4766-a99d-9681405d6d02"
msgid "{n}Ekun shrugs.{/n} \"Probably will do it.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"아마 그렇게 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e0b600bb-7cc8-4c68-8f1c-88ec68a7d42d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun frowns.{/n} \"Never called for this dog. Guess he should be "
"accepted? Just don't know.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이 개는 내가 데려오지 않았다. 그를 받아들여야 한다고 생각하나? 난 잘 모르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5107aebf-6d64-4a45-9789-98ef8ba5eca4"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun sighs.{/n} \"Not mine,\" {n}he explains.{/n} \"A name would make him "
"mine.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"내 개가 아니야.\" {n}그가 설명합니다.{/n} \"이름을 지어주면 내 개가 되버리겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "580bd330-4ed8-480d-970a-88750e137a9a"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stares at your without saying anything. His face betrays no emotion, "
"but he's clearly waiting for you to continue.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 아무 말도 없이 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 그의 얼굴은 감정을 배제하지만 분명히 당신이 계속 말하기를 기대합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "af19da49-e7c1-4780-b061-4d974d79534b"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun takes a deep breath and nods.{/n}\n"
"\"Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 심호흡을 하며 끄덕입니다.{/n}\n"
"\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "68c8bd5a-44c7-4317-af70-fb662e321345"
msgid "{n}Ekun watches you intently, waiting for you to continue.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 계속 끈기있게 기다리며 당신이 말하기를 기대합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cfefec0d-8647-4a1a-9b46-56336bee833c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun takes a deep breath and nods.{/n}\n"
"\"Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 심호흡을 하며 끄덕입니다.{/n}\n"
"\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d48a6ec3-865b-416b-a176-a08f92e696a9"
msgid "\"If you say so.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇게 말한다면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d3de5d9f-999f-4c9d-a329-b01b33103268"
msgid "\"As you say.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d3efb90b-4848-459c-8d59-0f0631bffc8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks at the wolf. His eyes become noticeably warmer, and a faint "
"smile appears on his lips.{/n} \"Okbo.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 늑대를 봅니다. 그의 눈은 살가워지고 희미한 미소가 입술에 피어납니다.{/n} \"오크보.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d0c0f5c3-7d18-45b4-8715-a0f1c351eeee"
msgid ""
"\"Not my wolf.\" {n}Ekun sounds relieved.{/n} \"His own. Now for sure.\""
msgstr "\"내 늑대가 아니야.\" {n}에쿤은 차분해 보입니다.{/n} \"자신이 주인이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : AnimalCompanionUnitWolfEkun
msgctxt "7602028e-6b84-415d-905b-9d3fb99a917e"
msgid "[Looks attentively at Ekun]"
msgstr "[조심스레 에쿤을 봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4e2e8500-903a-4092-8824-45e226fa4760"
msgid ""
"\"Rain, wind, storm — he keeps silent. And moves forward. Something to learn."
"\" {n}Ekun pauses, then meets your gaze.{/n} \"All of you... were right to "
"make me change my mind. Thank you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비, 바람, 폭풍우. 그는 침묵을 지켰다. 그리고 앞으로 나아가 무엇이든 배우려고 했다.\" {n}에쿤은 잠시 멈추고 당신과 눈을 "
"마주칩니다.{/n} \"너희 모두... 내 마음을 바꾸었다. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e5081c74-c354-407c-9df5-516e83faebef"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods and looks at you expectantly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 끄덕이고 기대감으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0097_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "240d456b-403e-47ad-9e73-6797bc9d1d80"
msgid ""
"\"Never wanted a pet. Never needed one. But couldn't slay the trolls, defend "
"the village. Just called for help.\" {n}Ranger shifts his gaze to the "
"side.{/n} \"Everything grew dark for a moment. Fainted. Came back with the "
"tongue of this dog on my face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"애완 동물을 원하거나 필요로 했던 적은 없었다. 마을을 방어해보려 했지만 트롤을 죽일 수 없었지. 그 때 도움을 구하려고 불렀었다.\""
" {n}레인저는 시선을 옆으로 흘립니다.{/n} \"순간 모든 것이 어두워졌다. 기절했던 거지. 이 녀석이 내 얼굴을 핥아... 나를 "
"깨웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "58be6686-71dd-49b1-baaf-fbe33fe4fe67"
msgid ""
"\"Now he is mine. And I'm his. Good that it turned out this way. Okbo is a "
"loyal soul.\""
msgstr "\"이제 그는 내 것이고 나는 그의 것이다. 이렇게 되어서 잘 되었다. 오크보는 충성스러운 영혼이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4035724a-5867-4743-bb99-c147ff88318a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not keeping him. I'm not sending him away. He knows it and chooses to "
"stay. Fine by me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그를 잡아두지 않는다. 나는 그를 보내지 않는다. 그는 그것을 알고 머물기를 선택했다. 그것으로 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0101_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d9d33e98-b2e6-46aa-b1ff-a6c43cc5b228"
msgid ""
"\"Talked. Remembered the past. Don't tell me you thought...\" {n}Ekun stops "
"and turns bright red.{/n}"
msgstr "\"이야기했다. 과거도 추억하고. 설마 네가 생각했던 건...\" {n}에쿤은 멈추고는 얼굴이 붉게 변합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0102_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d1535c4a-6537-455e-a939-f420deeb422c"
msgid "{n}Ekun stands and greets you with a faint smile.{/n} \"{name}.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 희미한 미소로 당신을 맞이합니다.{/n} \" {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6df1aa24-db1b-4f55-bbfe-97db4dae81e7"
msgid "{n}Ekun greets you with a nod.{/n} \"I... wanted to thank you.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 끄덕이며 인사합니다.{/n} \"나는... 고맙다는 말을 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e98dc19b-0a7c-4fc2-bec5-0c82c5672681"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks confused for a moment, fighting for the right words.{/n} \"For"
"... helping me find the way.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 잠시 혼란스러워 보이였고 올바른 말을 찾으려고 애를 씁니다.{/n} \"... 내가 옳은 길을 찾도록 도와주어서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0109_PersonalQuestFinish_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "18f74567-55c2-41fd-8305-0a948bdb93ef"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun sighs, relieved.{/n} \"I am glad I met you. And I can be here. Here, "
"I am of use.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"너를 만나 기뻤다. 나는 여기에 머물 수 있다. 나는 여기서 쓸모있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "07e91b9a-983f-4de9-b536-3dc11f6fd613"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun frowns, then turns away.{/n} \"Went hunting. With Ntavi. Needed... "
"fresh air. She left not long after — she had things to do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 찡그리고는 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"사냥을 갔다. 은타비와 함께... 신선한 공기가 필요했다. 그녀는 얼마 안가 할 일이 있어 "
"떠났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b3f3528e-138d-417b-bf7a-c08f4fcc3ebe"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods, wincing.{/n} \"Not very. There were uninvited guests. But I'm "
"glad I did it.\""
msgstr "{n}Ekun은 고개를 끄덕이며 찡그립니다.{/n} \"별로. 초대받지 않은 손님이 있었다. 하지만 기뻤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0114_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4f841a75-cf33-4943-9b38-c0d6285b491f"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's brows furrow anxiously. Finally he answers,{/n} \"Yes. Nice to see "
"old friends. And spend time with new ones.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 이마는 근심스러운 주름이 패였고 마침내 그가 대답했습니다.{/n} \"그래. 오랜 친구를 만나 기뻤다. 그리고 새로운 친구도 "
"만나고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "72246b0b-cdb1-481a-b8e4-d41191567c93"
msgid ""
"\"But... hmm... Next time, warn me. Especially if Elina will be there.\""
msgstr "\"하지만... 음... 다음엔 엘리나가 있다면 미리 알려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0118_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7fba0a14-d131-46d0-8da9-97619afa0a35"
msgid ""
"\"Want to stay here. Protecting people is my destiny. I accept that now. The "
"river of life carried me for a long time, powerless and still. Now I know "
"how to swim.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에 머무르고 싶다. 사람들을 지키는 것이 나의 운명이고 그것을 받아 들였다. 인생이라는 강은 나를 무력하게 만들었다. 하지만 이제 "
"나는 헤엄치는 방법을 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0119_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "050a5ab3-b177-43e9-bcc2-2e1eee75756b"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods.{/n} \"There is no place for monsters in the world. So I will "
"hunt them. Hunting is my life. I was afraid to admit it for a long time. But "
"fear, despair, doubt — all that is gone. All that is left is my resolve.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Ekun 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"세계에서 괴물은 사라져야 한다. 나는 그들을 사냥 할 것이다. 사냥은 내 삶이다. 나는 "
"그것을 오랫동안 인정하기를 두려워했다. 그러나 두려움, 절망, 의구심은 모두 사라졌고 결심만이 남았다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0123_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c98164f1-9732-4f53-8dc5-e6b35e322a5a"
msgid ""
"\"Elina is also glad that I... {d|Ekun Ritual}made up my mind{/d}. Gave me "
"armor. So that I'd 'be more careful'. I didn't expect it, but the armor is "
"welcome.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 {d|Ekun Ritual} 마음을 굳혀 {/d} 엘리나도 기뻐했다. 나에게 갑옷을 주었고 나는 더 조심할 것이다. 예상하지 "
"못했지만 갑옷은 환영이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a170afb1-3f65-4fe4-b5f6-528e83cc3015"
msgid ""
"\"Decided this had to be marked somehow. Carved a new bow. I think it turned "
"out well enough.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게든 표시를 해야 한다고 생각했다. 새로운 활을 깎았고 요긴할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0125_Text
msgctxt "dc65cb17-bb47-4af0-8cbc-74a934d7c764"
msgid ""
"\"You too worship the Father of Creation, don't you? Good. He's the best "
"deity for a leader. Teaches to build, not destroy.\""
msgstr "\"너도 창조의 아버지를 경배하지 않나? 좋다. 그는 지도자로서 최고의 신이다. 파괴가 아니라 만드는 법을 알려준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Ekun/VS_Ekun_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_Ekun_B15_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b9a488a7-822a-4f7c-adad-b96facbb2d4b"
msgid "\"Life story is open to you. You deserve it. Ask.\""
msgstr "\"인생 이야기라면 이제 이야기 해주지. 너는 자격이 있으니. 물어봐라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4d49f7d0-bb46-47ff-9bae-1177aaae3ce8"
msgid "\"Did I startle you? I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "\"내가 놀라게 했나? 미안하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d3984aee-c89c-4ebb-9aaa-0bb94d1ac73f"
msgid "\"Tell me about your past.\""
msgstr "\"네 과거에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "29d98e3e-4a6e-4e6f-9393-6cd6fdb8604c"
msgid "\"I'd like to learn more about dwarves.\""
msgstr "\"드워프에 대해 더 많이 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "ca778454-1a69-434d-bf2a-c58a37b0df5f"
msgid "\"I'd like to talk about your god, Groetus.\""
msgstr "\"너의 신 그로투스에 대해서 이야기하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d9a78f20-2799-4448-b896-fcf1e45a13bf"
msgid ""
"\"Have you ever regretted your decision to abandon Torag and start "
"worshipping Groetus instead?\""
msgstr "\"토락을 져버리고 그로투스를 숭배한 이후 후회는 없었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "06e040b2-b811-4754-94fc-60f65147a0de"
msgid ""
"\"From what I've heard, Groetus doesn't spare the minds of his clerics. They "
"all go insane eventually. Is that true?\""
msgstr "\"그로투스는 사제들의 정신을 아끼지 않는다고 들었다. 결국 그들은 모두 미쳐버린다던데, 사실인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8fc7fe24-460e-440e-804e-74e42fc20022"
msgid "\"Thanks for the conversation. We'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"대화 해줘서 고마워. 나중에 또 얘기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dbc0acdc-2ed5-43f8-901b-ad2e119b8030"
msgid "Disapproved of Harrim's worship of Groetus."
msgstr "하림이 그로투스를 숭배함을 못 마땅해 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "8518f71d-0ddb-49c7-b5d9-9c31613b2623"
msgid ""
"\"Honestly, that's just too much. You're a funny dwarf, and you have your "
"peculiarities. But to go insane – voluntarily? You should give it up before "
"it's too late!\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히 말해서 너무 심하군. 너는 재밌는 드워프고 너만의 독특한 개성이 있다. 하지만 자발적으로 미쳐버리는건... 너무 늦기 전에 "
"그만둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b1c84fb3-c6f5-416a-97a5-36fd575ae4c9"
msgid "Made fun of Harrim's worship of Groetus."
msgstr "하림이 그로투스를 숭배하는 것을 놀렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "53b35c83-63fd-4167-bc7d-18cdb1fc321b"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Well, when you learn Groetus' divine plans, remember to tell me about "
"them. I could use a good laugh.\""
msgstr "\"하하. 그로투스의 가르침을 배울 때 내게도 말해봐. 비웃어주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e0cd635c-c072-46b9-8841-723d8b295df2"
msgid "Complimented Harrim's worship of Groetus."
msgstr "하렘이 그로투스를 숭배하는 것을 칭찬합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "e6587966-f63e-4669-ad8d-03027fb6eafb"
msgid "\"Your eagerness is commendable.\""
msgstr "\"열의는 칭찬할 만하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "8e78602f-837a-48ff-b022-7eca9961b471"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "b885bf26-2aa2-485e-8915-43bcfd56580b"
msgid "\"You once tried to serve Torag?\""
msgstr "\"한 때 토락을 숭배했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "614fa061-2c13-4e20-b0c3-5f49454b6175"
msgid ""
"\"Even if Torag really has rejected you, is that enough reason to leave your "
"homeland?\""
msgstr "\"토락이 정말 당신을 거부했다고 해도, 그게 고향을 떠날 정도로 큰 이유인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "92dd32fe-bad9-492e-9372-23ce9a5cd0cd"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't think dwarves ever worshipped Groetus. How did you learn about "
"him?\""
msgstr "\"그로투스를 숭배하는 드워프는 없다고 생각했었다. 어떻게 그를 알게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "b4895399-59c0-4b1a-bd22-46b702d5e0ca"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, so you couldn't make even a simple nail – and you blamed Torag?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 겨우 못 하나도 못 만드는 네가 토락을 비난할 자격이 있다고 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "49b21d8c-3300-463c-ad9f-672545551936"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "799df7c4-bce6-4c93-9fb3-e2f595ed966d"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Five Kings Mountains.\""
msgstr "\"다섯 왕의 산맥에 대해서 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "3b95b48f-040c-40e3-bbfc-8a533bbe1e2c"
msgid "\"Have the dwarves always lived on the surface?\""
msgstr "\"드워프들은 항상 지상에서 살아왔나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "fd5b2df8-49a1-4392-bebc-b114ac65783e"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Sky Citadels.\""
msgstr "\"하늘 성채에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "65ec07d4-e21f-48dc-9f09-0682b46153ff"
msgid "\"I've some other questions.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "fd134659-25b3-4b90-956e-546fbdcf56ea"
msgid "\"What are Groetus' teachings about, in a nutshell?\""
msgstr "\"간단히 말해서 그로투스의 가르침이란 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "f2d3613f-9917-4135-bcb3-89b1b29e6ec1"
msgid ""
"\"Pharasma has Groetus locked in her Boneyard? So she is stronger than "
"Groetus?\""
msgstr "\"파라즈마가 그로투스를 뼈무덤에 가뒀다고? 그녀가 그로투스보다 강하다는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "22f8d983-d912-48c0-85bb-52fd49c4408d"
msgid ""
"\"Usually clerics can speak with their gods. What does Groetus say to you? "
"What is his will?\""
msgstr "\"보통 사제들은 자신의 신과 이야기할 수 있다. 그로투스가 네게 하는 말은 무엇이지? 그의 뜻은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "db306cad-1430-4a20-a51f-85f5ce5a611c"
msgid "\"Thanks for telling me about Groetus. I've learned enough for now.\""
msgstr "\"그로투스에 대해 이야기해 주어 고맙다. 지금은 충분히 배웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "633456ae-740c-45e1-974f-c8fc2e156931"
msgid "\"I like your tales. There's an inner truth to them.\""
msgstr "\"네 이야기가 마음에 들어. 그 안에 내면의 진실이 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "2e922389-ecdc-4e9a-ac68-571e557ea87c"
msgid "\"It was interesting to learn about him. No more, no less.\""
msgstr "\"그로투스 신앙은 흥미롭지만 딱 그 정도군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "b0f646bc-7455-4b60-826f-04e8e9ff4b6f"
msgid "\"To be honest, I don't want to have anything to do with him.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말해서 그와 엮일 일이 없었으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93315_Text
msgctxt "b90833d5-7c27-4f92-8c95-d6839bcdac1f"
msgid "\"I want nothing to do with you. Leave.\""
msgstr "\"너와 있고 싶지 않아. 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93317_Text
msgctxt "1bdedabc-9b77-4cc1-8268-fa68e3b30229"
msgid "\"Yes, Harrim. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 하림. 안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93318_Text
msgctxt "d155954f-23fd-44af-b9a3-5dd6499d1a33"
msgid "\"No, Harrim, I still need your help.\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 하림. 난 너의 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93321_Text
msgctxt "dad73983-4e02-4e5f-9f03-39aa77839dcf"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure you want to see the dwarven ruins? Why open up old wounds?\""
msgstr "\"드워프 폐허를 보고 싶나? 왜 오래된 상처를 떠올리는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93322_Text
msgctxt "575bccda-9ec1-4cf6-8806-94886668d068"
msgid ""
"\"I still don't understand — how did you manage to break the anvil with your "
"bare hands?\""
msgstr "\"아직도 이해할 수 없군. 어떻게 맨손으로 모루를 부술 수 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93323_Text
msgctxt "cc352939-0374-4562-bf55-925b39cce751"
msgid "\"You're not too happy about seeing your kin, are you?\""
msgstr "\"가족을 보게 되어도 별로 좋진 않겠군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93324_Text
msgctxt "1c75fb0d-e0d4-444c-bf32-9ef86da68b43"
msgid "\"Maybe we should drive these Skjegge back to their mountains?\""
msgstr "\"아마 이 셰게 가문 녀석을 다시 산으로 돌려보내야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93325_Text
msgctxt "4e0d3ac4-50c1-4b69-af7e-411f31d88ac3"
msgid "\"So you have the divine gift of the Touch of the Unmaker?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 파괴신의 손재주를 물려받았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93326_Text
msgctxt "e5eae454-8f7e-4049-a17a-85174bf1c309"
msgid "\"You were right, the Skjegge did dig a grave for themselves.\""
msgstr "\"네가 옳았어. 셰게 가문은 스스로 무덤을 팠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93337_Text
msgctxt "189cf97a-95f1-46ac-a713-85d30b3ddcd8"
msgid "\"Have you made peace with your kin?\""
msgstr "\"친척과 잘 지내나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93339_Text
msgctxt "b7084942-8aaa-4bf0-bf40-4ca59308f2ca"
msgid "\"So your gift is strong enough to destroy fortresses?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 네 재능은 요새를 파괴할 정도로 강력하다?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93344_Text
msgctxt "beb15e08-9b88-4e30-b978-3afd2ea47810"
msgid ""
"\"I worship Torag myself, and I think you're making a terrible mistake. The "
"Father of Creation is kind. He'll forgive you if you repent and return to "
"him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 토락을 숭배하는데 네가 끔찍한 실수를 저지르고 있다고 생각한다. 창조의 아버지는 친절하다. 네가 회개하면 그는 너를 용서할 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_93346_Text
msgctxt "be943259-f473-4545-a861-01d6081efe98"
msgid ""
"\"Torag has shown you the true face of not just him, but of all the gods. "
"Groetus is no better!\""
msgstr "\"토라그는 그의 모습 뿐 만 아니라 모든 신의 모습을 보여주었다. 그로투스는 나을 게 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "63e463b4-a31f-4a34-b0db-7d386ca78c91"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim pulls his beard, muttering something that could be either prayers "
"or curses. Upon noticing you, he winces.{/n} \"Eh? What? Ah, it's you, "
"{name}…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 수염을 쓰다듬으며 기도인지 저주인지 모를 말을 중얼거립니다. 당신과 눈이 마주치자 그는 움찔 놀랍니다.{/n} \"응? "
"뭐야? 아, {name}, 자네였군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ee7a8ab6-b101-4dbd-bcfc-ab893a218635"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no, that doesn't matter. I was just contemplating the futility of "
"existence, and the worthlessness of the universe. The ways of "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} are great. My humble mortal mind cannot fully grasp "
"them, but I do what I can.\" {n}Harrim smiles apologetically.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오, 신경 쓰지 말게. 단지 존재의 무능함과 우주의 무가치함에 대해 생각하고 있었네. {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 길은 "
"위대하셔서 필멸자인 나로서는 모두 이해하지 힘들테지만 내가 할 수 있는 일을 할 뿐이지.\" {n}하림은 변명하듯 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "946120af-1c2f-408c-ae01-a1e7c9452073"
msgid ""
"\"My life is divided into two parts. The first was filled with blind "
"wandering, doubts and attempts to serve {g|Torag}Torag{/g}. The second part "
"began when I accepted {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} into my soul and received a "
"clear vision of the world. What exactly would you like to know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 인생은 둘로 나눌 수 있지. 전반은 눈먼 방황과 {g|Torag}토락{/g}을 숭배하려는 노력, 그리고 그에 대한 의심으로 "
"보냈지. 후반은 내가 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}를 받아들이고 세상에 대한 명료한 시선을 가지며 시작되었다네. 정확히 무얼 알고 "
"싶은 겐가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "d978ee51-11bf-4770-8efd-a266aa8ab7bb"
msgid ""
"\"Most dwarves are self-satisfied, stubborn fools serving {g|Torag}Torag{/g}"
". They don't deserve my good attitude.\" {n}Harrim winces.{/n} \"But you can "
"ask what you want to know. I'll try to answer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대부분의 드워프들은 {g|Torag}토락{/g}을 숭배하는 자기만족에 빠진 바보들이라네. 친절하게 대할 가치가 없지.\" {n}하림이 "
"찡그립니다.{/n} \"하지만 물어보게. 내 대답해줄 터이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "79fed0f1-bc73-499c-9077-6c9a853881a0"
msgid ""
"\"You wish to learn about {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}?\" {n}Harrim seems "
"surprised and pleased at the same time.{/n} \"Yes, of course! I will answer "
"anything you ask!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에 대해 알고 싶다고?\" {n}하림은 놀람과 동시에 기뻐합니다.{/n} \"물론이지! 무엇이든지 "
"대답해주겠네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9d544de6-6994-47d9-8a01-242acfef86bf"
msgid ""
"\"Your question might seem offensive, {name}, but I am not offended. I "
"realize you ask it because you wish to learn more about "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}.\" {n}Harrim squeezes his beard in his fist, but in a "
"moment he lets it free again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"자네의 질문이 조금 불쾌하지만 괜찮네, {name}. 자네가 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에 대해 알고 싶어 물어본 것으로 "
"이해하겠네. \" {n}하림은 그의 수염을 꽉 쥐었다가 손을 폅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "26ab9236-7024-4690-82d0-ed844a9ceab1"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Who told you that? I'd like to look that slanderer in the eye!\" {n}"
"Harrim bursts into laughter, but you can't understand what's so funny.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하! 누가 그러던가? 누가 그 따위 헛소리를 하는지 낯짝을 보고 싶구만!\" {n}하림은 웃음을 터뜨리지만 당신은 무엇이 웃긴지 "
"이해할 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "f45510aa-fed4-4624-8749-d3504206f80d"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim nods with dignity.{/n} \"I'll be happy to continue our "
"conversation later.\""
msgstr "{n}하림은 품위있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"내 기꺼이 다음에 계속 대화하도록 하지\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "7882772c-c6da-430e-b379-a6c18b91e670"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you asking? You're a dwarf yourself, just as I am. Or perhaps you "
"want to learn my thoughts on our history?\""
msgstr "\"대체 왜 물어보는 겐가? 자네는 나와 같은 드워프인데. 아니면 우리 역사에 대한 나의 의견을 묻고 싶나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "08964617-3fc2-416a-aca6-4f49c6139ee6"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} betrayed me, {name}. All he's ever done was look down "
"with contempt on all my futile efforts to please him. I crafted armor "
"plates, but they fell apart with a single strike of a fist. I smithed "
"swords, but they broke at the hilt. Torag's priests used to say that such "
"failures were the curse of their uncompromising deity.\" {n}Harrim's fingers "
"grab his beard with such force that it seems he'll tear a handful of hair "
"out of it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Torag}토락{/g}은 나를 배반했네, {name}. 그는 나의 노력을 경멸로 내려다 봤을 뿐이야. 내가 중갑옷을 만들었을 때 "
"주먹 한 방에 모두 부서지더군. 언젠가는 칼을 만들었는데 칼자루가 부러졌다네. 토락의 사제가 그런 실패는 신의 저주라고 말하고는 했어.\""
" {n}하림의 손가락은 수염을 너무나 세게 쥐어서 털이 뽑힐 것만 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "4010648b-f2c5-4b22-a030-330fe39387a4"
msgid ""
"\"It was {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} who opened my eyes. He showed me that "
"failure is a manifestation of his will. The end time is near, {name}, and "
"every failure is just another step towards it. {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} curse is "
"only half the reason for my failure. The other half is the blessing of "
"Groetus, which I have borne from early childhood.\" {n}Harrim smiles warmly "
"at his thoughts. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서 날 일깨우셨지. 실패는 그로투스 님의 의지라네. 세상의 종말이 다가오고 있어, {name}. "
"실패야말로 끝으로 가는 작은 한 걸음 아니겠는가. 내 실패는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 저주 때문이기도 하지만, 동시에 그로투스 "
"님께서 나를 축복해주신 덕분이라네.\" {n}하림은 자신의 생각에 만족하며 부드럽게 미소 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "6faafaa9-11a8-40cd-8953-6c05333cd538"
msgid ""
"\"So the short answer to your question is 'no'. I've never regretted opening "
"my soul to {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"질문에 대한 대답은 '아니'일세. 나는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}를 섬긴 것을 단 한번도 후회해 본 적 없네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "5114d126-475e-4b53-9aa6-3f67a076e248"
msgid ""
"\"You see, {name}. Sanity is quite a relative concept,\" {n}Harrim says as "
"his laughter recedes.{/n} \"Each of us is certain that he's the sanest "
"creature in the world. Meanwhile we periodically doubt the sanity of others. "
"So what happens if two or three people claim that someone else is insane? "
"Does that make it true? Perhaps the accusers have lost their minds "
"themselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이보게, {name}. 정신이라는 것은 꽤 상대적인 개념일세.\" {n}하림은 말하면서 웃음 소리가 줄어듭니다.{/n} \"우리 "
"모두는 각자 자신이 세상에서 가장 온전한 생명체라고 생각한다네. 한편, 우리는 타인의 정신 상태를 의심하지. 그렇다면 두 세 사람 정도의 "
"무리가 다른 사람들이 자기들을 제외한 다른 사람들은 미쳤다고 주장한다면? 그렇다고 그게 사실이 되는가? 아마 주장한 녀석들이 미쳤을 테지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "e2731f60-5954-49a6-9966-0884ecd57428"
msgid ""
"\"The longer a cleric listens to the whispers of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, the "
"better he comprehends the essence of his designs, and the deeper his "
"understanding becomes. When enlightenment comes, the mind of a cleric "
"ascends to a new level of understanding, which is inaccessible to simpler "
"souls. Is it insanity? This is for you to decide, {name}. My decision was "
"made long ago. When I reach enlightenment, I'll accept it with joy and "
"delight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사제는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 속삭임을 오래 들을수록 자신의 본질을 이해할 수 있게 되며 그 이해는 점점 더 "
"깊어진다네. 그러다 깨달음을 얻게 되면 정신은 새로운 차원의 이해에 도달하게 되는데, 이 차원은 단순한 영혼으로는 접근할 수 없지. 미친 "
"소리 같은가? {name}, 어떻게 결론내리건 그건 자네 마음일세. 다만 내 결론은 이미 오래전에 내려졌지. 언젠가 내가 깨달음에 "
"도달하게 될 때, 기쁨과 환희로 받아들일 것이네\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "1bf501dc-39cd-46af-b2f1-e7f68bdbb27c"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim sighs and shakes his head.{/n} \"Can't you understand? That's "
"precisely what I want – for it to be too late.\""
msgstr "{n}하림은 한숨을 쉬며 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"이해하기 힘든가? 그게 내가 원하는 거야. 너무 늦었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "81d2a73a-4ec6-4a26-8817-bc5ccaade41a"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim seems not to hear the irony in your words.{/n} \"Oh! Of course, I "
"will tell you! I will tell everyone! The word of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} will "
"lead us forward, unto the inevitable!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 당신의 말하는 아이러니를 듣지 않는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"물론! 말해주지! 모두에게 말이야! "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 말씀은 필연적으로 우리를 앞으로 이끌어 주실 것이네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "8e339ad2-30f6-47b4-8749-d92b10a4406d"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim smiles broadly.{/n} \"I'm glad you noticed it! I dream that "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} will someday notice my eagerness too!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 크게 웃습니다.{/n} \"눈치 채다니, 다행이군. 언젠가 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서 나의 열의를 보게 될 걸세!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "739b6ea5-9ed4-4f6b-b9cb-c5888d00bd4f"
msgid ""
"\"My life story began in Larrad, a city of dwarven clerics and acolytes. "
"They serve {g|Torag}Torag{/g} and the other dwarven gods – Torag's brothers "
"Angradd and Magrim, Torag's wife Folgrit, his daughter Bolka, his sons "
"Grundinnar, Kols and Trudd, and also Torag's sister, Dranngvit.\" {n}Harrim "
"curves his lips in contempt.{/n} \"I wouldn't be surprised if they built a "
"temple to Torag's pet dog.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 인생은 드워프 사제의 도시 라라드에서 시작되었다네. 그들은 {g|Torag}토락{/g}를 숭배하고 또 다른 드워프 신인 토락의 "
"형제 앙그라드, 마그림, 토락의 아내 폴그릿, 그의 딸 볼카, 그의 아들 그룬디나르, 콜스, 트루드, 토락의 남매인 드랭그빗까지도 섬기고 "
"있지. {n}하림은 경멸로 입술이 구부러집니다.{/n} \"그들이 토락의 애완견을 위한 신전을 지어도 놀랍지 않을 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "d62800af-e76e-4306-9633-6d0fde22769d"
msgid ""
"\"Not just tried! It was a burning passion! I craved it by day and dreamt of "
"it at night!\" {n}Harrim shakes his head, as if amazed by his own "
"stupidity.{/n} \"You see, {name}, from my first days, I felt the presence of "
"the god at my back. I heard his whispers and felt his power, though the "
"nature of this power was unclear to me. I thought {g|Torag}Torag{/g} himself "
"was trying to speak to me, and I did all I could to understand his words.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그냥 해본 정도가 아니네! 그것은 불타는 열정이었어! 나는 밤낮으로 갈망하고 꿈꿔왔다고!\" {n}하림은 자신의 어리석음에 놀란 "
"것처럼 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"이보게, {name}. 나는 태어날 때부터 등 뒤의 신의 존재를 느꼈다네. 그가 존재함을 깨닫기도 "
"전에 그의 음성과 힘을 느꼈지. 그게 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 말씀인 줄 알고 그의 말을 이해하기 위해 모든 노력을 다했네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "fbbc313a-8a63-420d-b1fd-0e8e69b1dd00"
msgid ""
"\"You don't know much about dwarves.\" {n}Harrim lets out a sad sigh.{/n} "
"\"How can a dwarf cursed by Torag go on living in a city where every single "
"soul bows to {g|Torag}Torag{/g}? I was alone. Disgraced, humiliated, "
"insulted.\" {n}A lone tear glints in the light before sliding down Harrim's "
"cheek and hiding in his beard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"자네는 드워프에 대해 전혀 모르는군.\" {n}하림은 슬픈 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"토락에 의해 저주받은 드워프가 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 도시에서 계속 살아갈 수 있다고 생각하는가? 오직 나 뿐이었네. 수치스럽고 굴욕스러운 모욕을 당했다고.\" "
"{n}고독한 눈물이 하림의 뺨을 미끄러져 내려왔고 수염 속으로 숨어들어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "d34ead26-d66d-44b4-adb0-33411c910c63"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, but that blessed day became the beginning of a new life. Alone and "
"abandoned by all, I spent many dull hours in a filthy tavern by the "
"roadside. I don't recall the town, nor even the country. I had no money – in "
"fact all I had was a hunk of stale bread. I was weary and almost fainting "
"from hunger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그 축복받은 날에 내 새 삶은 시작됐었지. 모두에게 버림받아 혼자가 된 나는 지저분한 술집에서 많은 시간을 보냈네. 단 한 "
"순간도 나라는 물론 고향이 머릿속에서 떠오르는 일이 없었지. 돈도 없어서 수중에는 말라 비틀어진 빵 한 조각 밖에 없었어. 정신적인 "
"피로와 굶주림으로 쓰러질 뻔도 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "61ccd346-cb07-4ae8-b566-8644231867a2"
msgid ""
"\"Are you suggesting that my problem was not a curse, just my own inability "
"to work with metal? Or maybe you're saying that I was just too lazy?\" {n}"
"Harrim looks into your eyes defiantly, his hands trembling with suppressed "
"rage as he runs his fingers over his beard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 문제가 저주가 아닌 그냥 손재주가 서투른 것 뿐이었다는 말인가? 아니면 내가 너무 게으르다는 게야?\" {n}하림은 눈에 쌍심지를 "
"켜고 당신을 노려보며 수염을 쓰다듬던 손가락은 격한 분노로 떨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "fce71f61-965b-4b5c-88ee-210b19018cf1"
msgid "\"What else would you like me to tell you, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 얘기를 듣고 싶지? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "9a8d4a87-41db-45e9-b4f8-0120e8df57dd"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, I let myself get carried away.\" {n}Harrim sighs and pulls his "
"beard several times.{/n} \"Larrad is the second largest dwarven city in {g|"
"Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings Mountains{/g}. It's built up around "
"numerous temple-caverns which serve as places of worship for all the dwarven "
"gods. Many pilgrims, from every corner of Golarion, come to Larrad to pray "
"to their gods. Some remain to live there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"미안하네. 잠깐 흥분했군.\" {n}하림은 한숨을 쉬며 여러 번 수염을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} \"라라드는 {g|Five Kings "
"Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}에서 두 번째로 큰 드워프 도시라네. 수 많은 동굴들이 드워프 신들을 모시기 위해 사원으로 "
"사용되었지. 골라리온의 곳곳의 많은 순례자가 신들에게 기도를 올리기 위해 라라드로 오곤 한다네. 일부는 아예 그 길로 정착하기도 하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "b42d760d-744b-472e-933d-516117ee7824"
msgid ""
"\"This city is simply imbued with faith. You can't swing a dead cat without "
"hitting a cleric. It's no surprise, inspired by the aura of this city, that "
"I decided as a young boy to dedicate all my efforts to becoming a cleric of "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 도시는 말 그대로 믿음으로 가득 차 있다네. 길 가에 돌을 던지면 열에 아홉은 사제가 돌을 맞을 정도니. 도시의 아우라에 휩쓸려 "
"나 또한 어린 시절 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 사제가 되기 위해 노력하기도 했네. 이런 일은 그다지 놀랄 일도 아니지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "232c2b4c-0f1f-4b65-a36f-f928ae0e168f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, what a naive fool I was! I had no idea that {g|Torag}Torag{/g} – that "
"uncompromising, conceited god, glamorized by all dwarves – was capable of "
"betrayal! He turned away from me, {name}. He left me in the hour when I put "
"all my hopes in him and desperately needed his support!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 나는 정말 순진한 바보였다네! 모든 드워프들에게 찬양받는 고집 세고 자존심 높은 {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 배반을 할 "
"줄이야! 그는 나를 저버렸다네, {name}. 그에게 모든 희망을 걸고도 그에게 버림 받았을 때 느꼈을 내 기분을 짐작할 수 있겠는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "49271d03-9d06-40cc-a0f8-25e8df7f4bb2"
msgid ""
"\"Torag is the god of craftsmanship. So every follower, especially the "
"clerics, must smith their own suit of armor. The day when this work is "
"finished is like the second birthday for a dwarf. He's newly born in the "
"eyes of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"토락은 장인의 신이라네. 그렇기 때문에 모든 신도들은 자신이 직접 갑옷을 만들어야만 하지. 갑옷을 만드는 날은 드워프에게는 두 번째 "
"생일이기도 하다네. {g|Torag}토락{/g}에게는 새로 태어난 아기로 보일 테니까. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "8bd14c00-a5d2-43aa-879b-8a84aec394bd"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim sighs heavily and falls silent for a time.{/n} \"My second "
"birthday never came. I couldn't make armor. Not even a sword, not even a "
"simple nail. My hammer smashed my fingers and fell on my feet. Molten iron "
"burned my hands. The clerics laughed as they healed me. They used to say I "
"was cursed by {g|Torag}Torag{/g}. So finally I gave up any attempt to please "
"the betrayer god.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 한숨을 쉬며 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"내 두 번째 생일은 오지 않았지. 나는 갑옷은 커녕 검 한 자루조차 만들지 "
"못했거든. 내 망치는 내 손가락을 때리고 내 발등에 떨어지기 일쑤였어. 가끔은 쇳물에 손을 데이기도 했다네. 사제들은 나를 치유하며 "
"비웃었지. 그들은 내가 {g|Torag}토락{/g}에게서 저주를 받았다고 말하곤 했어. 그래서 그 신 나부랭이를 기쁘게 하려는 노력을 "
"그만뒀지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "74c0e728-8e90-4345-8a64-e75aecfe6c59"
msgid ""
"\"I was trying to drown my sorrows in drink, but even the owner of the "
"cheapest pub on the road would laugh at me while he put those mugs in front "
"of me. I couldn't take it any longer. I wanted everything to end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"슬픔을 달래려 술을 마실 때에도 싸구려 술집 주인마저 내게 술을 건네며 비웃었다네. 내 참을성은 한계에 달했고 세상이 멸망하기를 "
"바라곤 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "3433dc6e-b65d-4308-9b83-b538840c7c6e"
msgid ""
"\"But there was one thing that kept me going, and prevented me from ending "
"my life. I could still hear that divine whisper behind my back. It was yet "
"faint – it took a long time before I could hear it clearly. But having heard "
"it once, I could never forget it. It was clear that none of Larrad's deities "
"favored me, so I left {g|Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings Mountains{/g} "
"and went out searching.\""
msgstr ""
"\"허나 나는 삶을 놓을 수 없었지. 신성한 속삭임이 계속 들려왔거든. 이 소리를 선명하게 듣기까지 오랜 시간이 걸렸어. 그때는 흐릿하게 "
"들렸다네. 한번 들으면 잊을 수 없는 음성이야. 라라드의 어떤 신도 나를 원하지 않는 것이 분명했기에 나는 {g|Five Kings "
"Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}을 떠나 속삭임의 근원을 찾아다녔네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "00547ae7-82b8-461e-be64-afa83d27704d"
msgid ""
"\"And that was the moment when the whisper from my god became more clear. It "
"was like he was calling me. At last my sufferings had come to an end! It was "
"a miracle, {name}! And I had paid full price for it with my torments.\""
msgstr ""
"\"순간 그로투스 님의 속삭임이 선명해졌지. 그분께서 나를 부르시는 듯했어. 마침내 지난날의 고통을 뒤로할 때가 온 거지! {name}, "
"기적이 일어났다네! 고난과 역경으로 대가를 치른 기적 말일세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "6300f9fe-9a56-4ee0-ba53-5c723a69a6e5"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't control myself. I walked out of the tavern and straight into "
"the nearest forest. And there I found the ruined temple of "
"{g|Aroden}Aroden{/g}, the lost god. Several figures clad in robes were "
"holding a silent service there, a service to a god I knew nothing of. None "
"minded when I stood beside them. For the first time in my life I felt myself "
"at home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 자신을 통제 할 수 없었네. 나는 선술집에서 곧장 나와 가장 가까운 숲으로 향했지. 거기서 폐허가 된 "
"{g|Aroden}아로덴{/g} 사원을 발견했다네. 로브를 입은 이들이 내가 한번도 들어보지 못한 신에게 예배를 드리고 있더군. 내가 "
"옆에 있어도 아무도 신경쓰지 않았네. 생전 처음으로 편안하다는 느낌을 받았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "e3112290-d0b2-4311-97ec-e476ea1ea58f"
msgid ""
"\"My new brothers told me that they were clerics of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, "
"the god of end times. They were traveling around Golarion, spreading the "
"teachings of Groetus, despite all the persecution, contempt, and misjudgment "
"they received from others. I gladly shared this burden with them. For now I "
"knew whose voice had whispered to me through all those years.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 새 형제들은 자신들이 종말의 신 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 성직자라고 하더군. 그들은 타인의 박해와 경멸, 오해에도 "
"불구하고 골라리온을 곳곳에 가르침을 전파하기 위해 여행하던 중이었지. 나는 기꺼이 그들과 짐을 나누기로 했고 지금까지 내게 속삭이던 "
"음성이 누구의 것인지 깨닫게 되었다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "ce98ec97-777a-4364-91a9-9ba907dcfd74"
msgid ""
"\"You're a fool if you think so! An ignorant fool! Have you ever met a dwarf "
"who can't handle a smith's hammer? Even our children craft knives! No, no, "
"no, {g|Torag}Torag{/g} is the cause of my sufferings! The betrayer god "
"deliberately cursed me – just to make a laughingstock of me!\" {n}Harrim "
"raises his hand and shakes his fist at someone above.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 생각하다니 바보로군! 아주 무식한 바보말일세! 대장장이 망치를 다루지 못하는 드워프를 한번이라도 본 적이 있나? 심지어 "
"드워프라면 아이까지도 손칼은 만들줄 알아! {g|Torag}토락{/g}은 내 고통의 원인이라네! 이 배신의 신은 분명 일부러 나를 "
"저주했다네, 그저 웃음거리로 만들기 위해서!\" {n}하림은 손을 들어서 위의 누군가에게 주먹을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "bfce25cd-2473-40ec-a6b0-b837be14d0e7"
msgid ""
"\"But I won't let myself to get angry at you, {name}. You're an ignorant and "
"blind soul, and my aim is to guide you through this dying world that marches "
"towards its end. I will open your eyes or die trying. {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} "
"will be pleased by either outcome.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 나는 자네에게 화를 내지 않을 것이네. {name}, 자네는 무지하고 앞을 볼 수 없는 영혼이라네. 그리고 이 죽어가는 세상의 "
"종말로 이어질 때까지 자네를 인도하는 것이 내 목표이지. 자네를 깨닫게 하거나 결국 노력하다가 죽음을 맞이하겠지. "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서는 어떤 결과에도 만족하실 걸세. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "14a3fa59-9994-4fc2-bb2a-81f0356d4220"
msgid ""
"\"The dwarven kingdom, yes. Well, it's to the south from here. It's survived "
"many trials, and there will be more yet to come.\" {n}Harrim strokes his "
"beard, contemplating.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"드워프 왕국이지. 여기에서 남쪽으로 가면 있겠군. 그곳은 많은 시련에서 살아 남았고 앞으로도 많은 시련이 있을 걸세.\" {n}하림은 "
"생각에 잠겨 수염을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "bdd2991e-2737-4855-b4c8-b93ab14f2230"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, no. Eons ago, all dwarves lived deep beneath the surface. And they did "
"rather well, judging by the historic records. They built fortresses "
"befitting noble dwarves. But our restless god, {g|Torag}Torag{/g}, sent us a "
"prophecy – {g|The Quest for Sky}the Quest For the Sky{/g}. He ordered all "
"the dwarves to abandon their fortresses and press upwards, to show their "
"beards to the Sun, as they say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 아니라네. 머나먼 옛날 드워프는 깊은 땅굴 속에서 살았었네. 역사 기록에 의하면 굴을 꽤 잘팠나 보더군. 그들은 귀족 드워프에게 "
"걸맞는 요새를 건설했다네. 하지만 우리 안절부절 못하는 신 {g|Torag}토락{/g}께서는 우리에게 예언을 보냈고, 이를 {g|The "
"Quest for Sky}하늘 탐험{/g}이라 부르네. 그는 모든 드워프들에게 요새를 버리고 위로 올라가 태양을 보고 살라고 명령했다는군."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "ea8dac97-6be6-46ff-ab37-3d569782dcb6"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, they are the peaks of creation! – Glorious cities, built by the "
"ancient dwarves who'd finally reached the surface after many hardships, "
"performing the final labor in their {g|The Quest for Sky}Quest For the "
"Sky{/g} on the surface of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}.\" {n}Harrim's eyes "
"glitter with admiration.{/n} \"They are steadfast, tall, magnificent... they "
"are beautiful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그곳은 창조의 봉우리라네! 고대 드워프가 수많은 역경을 딛고 마침내 지상에 도달해 건설한 찬란한 도시이지. "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 땅 위에서 {g|The Quest for Sky}하늘 탐험{/g}을 위한 마지막 일을 했던걸세.\" "
"{n}하림의 눈은 감탄과 함께 반짝입니다.{/n} \"굳건하고, 드높으며, 장엄한... 아름다운 도시라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "62fed95c-a484-4f07-bdbc-77346ebb1d22"
msgid "\"What else would you like me to tell you, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 얘기를 듣고 싶지? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "38500f52-faa6-4e6e-99b9-7c7582982ed4"
msgid ""
"\"There is no unity among the dwarves, {name}. The Five Kings rule over our "
"people. They sit on the thrones of the five greatest cities, and with every "
"passing day it grows harder for them to come to any agreement. The only "
"thing uniting {g|Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings Mountains{/g} is the {g|"
"Sky Citadels}Sky Citadel{/g} of {g|Highhelm}Highhelm{/g}, the great dwarven "
"fortress at the Mountains' heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"드워프들 사이에 단결 같은 건 없다네, {name}. 다섯 왕이 드워프 백성들을 다스리지. 그들은 다섯 대 도시의 왕좌에 앉아있지만 "
"날이 갈수록 어떤 합의던 내리기 힘들어하지. {g|Five Kings Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}을 단결시킬 수 있는 건 "
"오직 산의 심장부에 위치한 {g|Highhelm}하이헬름{/g}의 {g|Sky Citadels}하늘 성채{/g}밖에 없네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "9ddf62c2-511c-4d9d-9092-a7f9c98bb122"
msgid ""
"\"This journey was long and bloody. Many dwarves perished on the way. Others "
"turned back, keeping to their ancient strongholds – eventually to turn into "
"evil duergar... gray dwarves. But those who survived reached the surface and "
"founded {g|Sky Citadels}the Sky Citadels{/g} – the most glorious cities in "
"dwarven history.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 여정은 길고 잔혹했다네. 많은 드워프들이 도중에 죽어나갔지. 여정에 참여하지 않은 나머지들은 되돌아와 고대의 요새를 지키다 사악한 "
"회색 드워프인 듀에르가로 변모했다네. 하지만 살아남은 드워프들은 지상에 올라와 {g|Sky Citadels}하늘 성채{/g}를 건설했지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "720340d8-0d31-46f5-afc6-19d80078830b"
msgid ""
"\"The Ten Citadels were built by dwarves, but we've managed to keep only a "
"few. The citadels crumbled, and the orcs, sworn enemies of our people, "
"trampled their blessed streets and ruined the gorgeous palaces of the "
"ancient kings.\" {n}Harrim's eyes grow misty with tears.{/n} \"These were "
"heavy losses, and a disgrace to our people, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"드워프들은 열 개의 성채를 건설했지만, 겨우 몇 개만 보존할 수 있었다네. 성채가 무너지면서 우리 드워프의 원수 오크들이 우리의 "
"신성한 가도를 짓밟고 고대 왕들의 화려한 궁전을 폐허로 만들어놨지.\" {n}하림의 눈이 눈물로 흐려집니다.{/n} \"그 일은 크나큰 "
"손실이었고 우리 드워프들에게는 수치로 남았다네, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "ed943d0b-5c1e-42e3-b210-f27989e23b0c"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Highhelm}Highhelm{/g} is the jewel of {g|Sky Citadels}the Citadels{/g} "
"that remain. It is located in the heart of the mountains, and the heart of "
"every dwarf. Yes, yes, my heart too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Highhelm}하이헬름{/g}은 살아남은 {g|Sky Citadels}성채들{/g} 중에서도 보석같은 장소라네. 그곳은 산의 "
"심장부에 위치했고, 또 모든 드워프들의 가슴 속에도 있지. 그래, 나 또한 마찬가지고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "8ec3d2fd-e8b7-4575-b2c8-2650e59cdf89"
msgid ""
"\"There is a dwarven saying that, if an enemy reaches "
"{g|Highhelm}Highhelm{/g}, every dwarf from all the corners of the world will "
"come to defend it.\" {n}Harrim casts a sad glance at you.{/n} \"I'd be there "
"too. But not to help the Citadel's defenders. I'd be there to witness the "
"fall of our people with my own eyes, and mourn it. I would fall upon the "
"cold stone and raise my final prayer to {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"드워프 속담에 {g|Highhelm}하이헬름{/g}에 적이 이르면 이 세계 구석구석의 모든 드워프들이 막으러 올거라는 말이 있다네. "
"\" {n}하림은 슬픈 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"나도 거기에 있겠지. 하지만 하늘 성채의 수호자를 도우려는건 아닐세. 그곳에서 우리 "
"종족의 멸망을 두 눈으로 목도하고 애도할 것이네. 나는 차가운 돌 위에 쓰러져 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께 마지막 기도를 올릴 "
"것이라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "d3819539-bc36-43ff-95a8-bf6fd1dcff6b"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} is the end of all that exists.\" {n}Harrim smiles. "
"He's obviously been waiting for this question.{/n} \"Look around, {name}. "
"What do you see? Look again and realize that everything will be destroyed. "
"Our clothing and our armor will turn to dust. The walls of the palaces will "
"crumble into ruins. The trees will fall. And you and I will die much sooner "
"than that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}는 존재하는 모든 것의 종말일세.\" {n}하림은 미소짓습니다. 이 질문을 기다리고 있었던게 "
"분명합니다.{/n} \"주변을 둘러보게, {name}. 뭐가 보이는가? 다시 한 번 보고 이 모든 것들이 파괴될 것임을 깨닫게. 우리의 "
"옷과 갑옷은 먼지로 변할 걸세. 궁전의 벽은 무너져 폐허가 될테지. 나무 역시 쓰러지겠지. 그리고 자네와 나는 그보다 훨씬 빨리 죽을걸세!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "c5ec65d8-c2f7-45af-81c1-9e33164a869e"
msgid ""
"\"Of course she is stronger. For now!\" {n}Harrim nods with dignity, "
"stroking his beard.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} is weaker than "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} – and many other gods. I would be a fool if I tried "
"to claim otherwise. If Groetus were stronger, the end times would already "
"have come, wouldn't they?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그녀가 더 강하다네. 지금은 말이지!\" {n}하림은 그의 턱수염을 쓰다듬으며 위엄있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}나 많은 다른 신들보다 약하다네. 그렇지 않다고 부정하면 바보 "
"소리듣기 딱 좋지. 그로투스가 더 강했더라면 종말의 때가 이미 찾아왔을 것이네. 그렇지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "5d96759c-f0dc-4ed2-8ab0-06a7e00919ff"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shakes his head in resignation.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} "
"doesn't speak to his clerics. Actually, Groetus doesn't need any clerics.\" "
"{n}The dwarf raises his sad eyes to you.{/n} \"He only allows his whispers "
"to be heard, and only by those who are dying to hear them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 체념한 듯 머리를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서는 그분의 종에게 말씀을 전하지 않으신다네. "
"성직자를 요구하시지도 않지.\" {n}드워프는 당신을 애석하게 올려다봅니다.{/n} \"그분은 오로지 간절히 원하는 자에게만 속삭임을 "
"들려주신다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "9a294d25-e100-400c-90ac-b8623b2fbab5"
msgid ""
"\"Then let me ask you, what do you think about {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 내가 물어 보지. 자네는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에 대해 어떻게 생각하지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "1ebc1694-d86a-47b6-b54d-3c2c52515af5"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} is a timeless watcher. He's been locked away by "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, the goddess of rebirth. From her "
"{g|Boneyard}Boneyard{/g} he watches over the world, knowing the time for the "
"final reaping shall come. He's the bloated moon hanging in the sky. He's the "
"Harbinger of the Last Days. He's the one who will stay when all the others "
"are gone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서는 시간을 초월한 관찰자라네. 부활의 여신 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}가 가둬놓고 "
"있지. 파라즈마의 {g|Boneyard}뼈무덤{/g}에서 그로투스께서는 종말의 때를 기다리며 세계를 관망하신다네. 그분은 하늘에 걸린 "
"부푼 달이며, 최후의 날을 알리는 전령이시지. 이 세상이 사라진 뒤에도 그분만은 남아계실 거라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "0073004c-b71e-4e84-8f63-57deee168c6f"
msgid ""
"\"But the powers of other gods fade away. They dissolve slowly, a grain in a "
"century. {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} collects those grains and waits. He doesn't "
"need to hurry. He knows that his time shall come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 신의 힘은 점점 약해지겠지. 한 세기에 모래 알갱이 하나만큼 닳아갈 거라네. {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서는 그 "
"알갱이를 거두며 기다린다네. 서두를 필요 없지. 곧 자신의 때가 오리란 걸 알고 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "91fe7a19-a204-457e-8abb-84f4492a6cab"
msgid ""
"\"His words are unclear, but they call to you. His voice comes with the soft "
"rustle of fallen leaves, with the woeful wailing wind at the mountain pass, "
"with the roar of the raging blizzard... and it calls you to strike out on "
"the road. Onwards, always onwards, over the pass, over the bridge and "
"further along. Up ahead, where the edge of a grey robe flashed, and a candle "
"sputtered for the last time before dying... Onwards, always onwards, until "
"your feet can no longer carry you...\" {n}Harrim falls silent, submerged in "
"his own thoughts.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"선명하게 들리진 않지만, 자네를 부르고 있다네. 그분의 음성은 잘게 부스러지는 낙엽 소리 같고, 때로는 산비탈을 울고 도는 바람 "
"같지. 맹렬한 눈보라가 내는 굉음 같을 때도 있다네. 그분은 자네에게 앞으로 나아가라고 말하네. 앞으로, 항상 앞으로, 길을 지나, "
"다리를 건너, 저 너머로 나아가야 하네. 저 너머에 회색 로브 자락이 펄럭이고, 흔들리는 촛불이 마지막으로 빛을 발했던 곳으로... "
"앞으로, 항상 앞으로, 더 이상 다리가 움직이지 않을 때까지...\" {n}하림은 침묵에 잠긴 채, 자신만의 생각에 빠집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "e4e7e534-21f2-4029-a60d-57e11e782a2c"
msgid "\"What else would you like me to tell you, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 얘기를 듣고 싶지? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "248b4d7e-2e7f-4a4a-bf87-25fcd13f1924"
msgid ""
"{n}A broad smile spreads across Harrim's face.{/n} \"I'm glad you think like "
"that. We'll bring this truth to the whole world, and tell everyone that the "
"end is inevitable!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림의 얼굴에 넓은 미소가 퍼집니다.{/n} \"그런 생각을 하다니 기쁘군. 우리는 이 진리를 온 세상에 가져다줄 것이고 종말을 "
"피할 수 없을 거라고 말할 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "a90d9c18-d03c-47cc-b162-fc3c56878efa"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim nods in contentment.{/n} \"I'll be glad to talk with you about "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} any time, {name}. After all, that's why I travel in "
"your company.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 만족스럽게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"언제든지 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에 대해 이야기 해주겠네, {name}. "
"그것이 내가 자네의 동료가 된 이유니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "822b22ac-ea96-4d3f-96df-2744f308ef37"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim sighs.{/n} \"Your denial means nothing, {name}. The end will come "
"either way. But there is still time to talk further about it. After all, "
"that's why I travel in your company.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"부정해도 소용없네. {name}. 종말은 결국에는 찾아오게 되어 있지. 하지만 자네에게 설명할 "
"시간은 많다네. 그것이 내가 자네의 동료가 된 이유니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93316_Text
msgctxt "730ea6dd-88f1-46da-a4b8-87376ea98b49"
msgid "{n}Harrim lowers his head.{/n} \"Such is your wish then, {name}?\""
msgstr "{n}하림이 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그것이 자네가 바라는 것인가? {name}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93319_Text
msgctxt "6bc2a57a-01a3-43a9-acfe-a775be8843f5"
msgid ""
"\"Well then... everything comes to an end. So does our friendship. We shall "
"meet the same fate, but now we follow different paths. Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면... 모든 것이 끝나고 우정도 끝이군. 우리는 같은 운명을 맞을 테지만 지금은 다른 길을 따라 갈 것이네. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93320_Text
msgctxt "d56bbf68-914d-4408-9007-b99a5cfec95c"
msgid ""
"\"Then why do you disturb me with these obscure hints? Let's bury this "
"conversation in oblivion and change the topic.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 자네는 왜 이런 모호한 암시로 나를 괴롭히는 겐가? 이 대화는 망각 속에 묻어두고 대화 주제를 바꾸지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93327_Text
msgctxt "3a7b4f04-7051-4ccf-ba2c-6a1fce837c36"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks down and strokes his beard a few times before answering.{/n} "
"\"I'm not sure, {Name}. This will likely bring nothing but pain. I suspect I "
"will regret going to the ruins... But nevertheless I ask – please take me "
"there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 대답하기 전에 고개를 숙이고 수염을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} \"잘 모르겠네, {Name}. 이것은 고통만을 가져올걸세. 폐허에 "
"간 것을 후회하겠지... 그렇지만, 부디 나를 그곳으로 데려가주게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93328_Text
msgctxt "0abf3861-cfcb-4bfc-b117-a4fb23ff1291"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stop thinking about it either. Maybe it was a sign from above... "
"But if so, what does it mean? Has {g|Torag}Torag{/g} admitted defeat and "
"turned his back on the fortress? Did {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} extend his hand "
"to take what's his before its time?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 그 생각을 멈출 수가 없네. 어쩌면 위에서 내린 신호일지도... 그렇다면 무엇을 의미 하는걸까? {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 "
"패배를 인정하고 요새에서 등을 돌렸다는 걸까? {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 그 전에 자신의 것을 취하려 한걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93329_Text
msgctxt "aeee3fa7-ccfb-4eef-8c2f-c7bcc0874008"
msgid ""
"\"I keep straining to hear the answer... But to no avail. But I'm sure that "
"it happened for a reason. Some day I will understand what happened and why. "
"Some day...\""
msgstr ""
"대답을 듣기 위해 계속 안간힘을 쓰고있지만.. 별로 소용없는 듯 하구만. 하지만 나는 그런 일이 일어난데엔 이유가 있다고 확신하네. "
"언젠가는 무슨 일이 일어난건지, 왜 일어난건지 이해할 날이 오겠지. 언젠가는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93330_Text
msgctxt "eed111c4-39e9-42b5-ae4b-124b3bf16778"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim fiddles with his beard pensively.{/n} \"Well... It's not as if I'm "
"holding a grudge against the whole dwarven race. In {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, "
"the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} – I'm always rather happy to see one of us. Exiles like me, or "
"those who left their homeland voluntarily in search of a better life – or "
"even those who were born here and have never seen the mountains... I hold "
"nothing against them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 수염을 만지작거립니다.{/n} \"음... 내가 모든 드워프들에게 원한을 품고 있는 건 아니라네. "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}나 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}, {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 "
"같은 종족을 만나면 기쁘다고. 나처럼 스스로 고향을 떠나 더 나은 삶을 찾으려는 자들. 혹은 여기에 태어나 산을 본 적도 없는 "
"드워프들... 나는 그들에게 원한도 없네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93331_Text
msgctxt "b872024e-d5ae-4bad-86da-40dd95e9fe84"
msgid ""
"\"But the Skjegge... You see, {Name}, they aren't just dwarves – they are "
"envoys from my homeland and Torag himself. Like everyone who exiled me, who "
"humiliated me, everyone I left behind – all of them have come back to "
"torture me. They carry the spirit of {g|Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings "
"Mountains{/g} with them. A spirit that is more nauseating to me than the "
"stench of a corpse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 셰게라면... {Name}, 너도 알겠지만 그들은 단순한 드워프가 아니라네. 그들은 내 고향과 토락의 사절들이지. 나를 "
"추방하고 욕보였던, 내가 져버린 그 사람들이 나를 괴롭히러 돌아왔다네. 그들은 {g|Five Kings Mountains}다섯 왕의 "
"산맥{/g}의 정신을 이어받았지. 그 정신은 시체 썩는 냄새보다 더 구역질 나는 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93332_Text
msgctxt "239e8d90-c5ab-43bc-90a1-1396f12ccf23"
msgid ""
"\"Don't. I would enjoy seeing those smug Skjegge led by {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} "
"servant dig themselves a grave with their own hands and lie in it. It's "
"probably petty of me... What's the difference who dies earlier or later, if "
"the same end awaits us all? But please allow me this small pleasure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러지 말게. 나는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 하인인 헤게놈이 제 무덤을 파는 모습을 즐기고 있으니까. 아마 내가 옹졸해 보일 "
"수도 있지만... 같은 종말이 우리를 기다리고 있다면 빠르게 가나 늦게 가나 상관이 없지 않은가? 그러니 이 작은 기쁨을 누리게 해주게."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93333_Text
msgctxt "0ddd2423-6065-43a8-9a0a-c0287c5c9e65"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard of any such thing… But you saw with your own eyes what "
"happened. The paladin's words had the ring of truth – but what could this "
"mean for me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 얘기는 들어본 적 없네... 하지만 자네 눈으로 똑똑히 봤잖은가. 팔라딘의 말에는 진실이 담겨있지만 나에게 무슨 의미가 있겠는가?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93334_Text
msgctxt "14906dae-8201-4823-a76f-3adf02f98774"
msgid ""
"\"Who gave me this gift – {g|Torag}Torag{/g} or {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}? And "
"for what purpose? What should I do with it? Questions keep rushing into my "
"mind, countless... Everything is so confusing... So strange and "
"inconceivable...\" {n}Harrim's speech turns into barely understandable "
"mumbling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"누가 나에게 이 선물을 준거지? {g|Torag}토락{/g}? {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}? 왜 주었고 나는 그것으로 무엇을 "
"해야 하지? 질문이 계속해서 떠오르는구만... 셀 수도 없이. 모든 것이 너무 혼란스러워... 너무 이상하고 납득이 가지 않아... \" "
"{n}하림은 말을 마칠 때 쯤 거의 이해할 수 없을 정도로 중얼거리고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93335_Text
msgctxt "bc48c5a1-871f-42ae-b207-2f853bf2dedd"
msgid ""
"\"Being right didn't require any wisdom or knowledge or even experience. Do "
"you think it brings me joy to be right about this?\""
msgstr "\"올바르게 사는 데에는 어떤 지혜나 지식 혹은 경험도 필요치 않았었네. 자네는 내가 이것이 옳아서 기쁘다고 생각하는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93336_Text
msgctxt "e83e19cc-0a39-41d8-a24d-f7f4fd10150d"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim strokes his beard pensively and makes a crooked smile.{/n} \"But "
"why should I lie either to you or to myself? Of course it brings me joy. But "
"it's a bitter joy. The greedy and arrogant will continue to seek glory and "
"wealth, but find only death and suffering. That's the sad comedy of our "
"life, {Name}. We may laugh or cry at it, but no one walks from the stage "
"without merciful {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} drawing the curtain.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 수염을 쓰다듬으며 비뚤어진 미소를 지었습니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 자네나 나 자신에게 거짓말을 해야하는 거지? 물론 나는 "
"기쁘다네. 하지만 씁쓸한 기쁨이지. 탐욕스럽고 거만한 자들은 부와 명예를 계속 추구하겠지만 결국에는 죽음과 고통을 만나게 될걸세. "
"{Name}, 우리 삶은 슬픈 희극이라네. 우리는 그걸 보고 울거나 웃을 수 있지만, 누구도 자비로운 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}"
"께서 커튼을 치지 않으면 삶이라는 무대에서 내려올 수 없다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93340_Text
msgctxt "17fbad33-9f61-4f61-bb6c-e69a0d123cd5"
msgid ""
"\"Have I made peace? Made peace...\" {n}Harrim says this word slowly, as if "
"trying to taste it.{/n} \"There was war in my heart, and now it is serene – "
"that is true. But can I call it peace? I think not. More like neutrality. I "
"no longer torment myself thinking about them and {g|Torag}Torag{/g}, "
"although the wounds they left continue to ache. But now it simply doesn't "
"matter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 화해했다고? 화해라...\" {n}하림은 음미하듯 천천히 말합니다..{/n} \"내 마음 속에 한바탕 전쟁이 일어났었고 지금은 "
"평온하다네. 하지만 이것을 평화라 부를 수 있을까? 아닌 것 같네. 이도 저도 아닌 거지. 그들이 남긴 상처가 여전히 아프긴 하지만, "
"나는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}과 그들을 생각해서 머리를 아프게 하고 싶지 않네. 이젠 어찌되었든 상관 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93341_Text
msgctxt "37db389b-249e-4946-b2a0-3426e2601927"
msgid ""
"\"I used to think {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} followers were shallow, that they "
"couldn't even imagine there was anything in the world besides their beloved "
"god and their home mountain. Now I know that I used to be just as shallow. "
"Torag, {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}... Beginning of time, end of time... All these "
"are only parts of a larger picture – a picture so vast that just thinking "
"about it makes my head spin. But for a moment I saw it, {Name}. What can "
"ridiculous resentments mean after that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 추종자들은 얄팍하고 그들의 신과 자기 고향 말고는 아무것도 모를 거라 생각하곤 했네. 하지만 나도 "
"얄팍한 건 마찬가지였다는 걸 깨달았네. 토락과 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}... 창조와 종말... 이 모든 것은 큰 그림의 일부일 "
"뿐이야. 그림이 너무나 커서 생각만 해도 머리가 빙빙 도는 것 같구만. 하지만 잠깐 볼 수 있었네, {Name}. 이 말도 안되는 분함은 "
"무엇을 의미하는 걸까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93342_Text
msgctxt "cc89d364-29c4-4036-9e27-16140521e73e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no. Don't imagine you can use me as a siege weapon. That was a special "
"case... Divine intervention! The Revelation of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} – not "
"just his usual whisper, but a proper crackling rumble! That day...\" {n}An "
"insane light flares up in Harrim's eyes, and his voice turns into coarse "
"whisper.{/n} \"Do you think I destroyed only a dwarven citadel that day? No, "
"{Name}, oh no! That day a wall collapsed inside my soul, inside my mind... A "
"wall of ignorance which had kept me from understanding... from true "
"knowledge...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 아니. 나를 공성 무기로 사용할 생각 말게. 그건 특별한 경우라네... 신의 도움이었다고! {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 "
"계시가 우뢰와 같이 들린 날이었다네!\" {n}하림의 눈에는 광기가 비추고 그의 목소리는 거친 속삭임으로 바뀝니다.{/n} \"내가 그날 "
"드워프 요새만 파괴했다고 생각하는가? 아니라네, {Name}. 그럴 리 없지! 그 날 내 영혼, 내 마음 속의 벽이 무너졌다네... 참된 "
"지식을 이해하지 못하게 했던 무지의 벽이... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93343_Text
msgctxt "65b4cd94-9730-439d-a502-46c7d93b395d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, {Name}, if only I could share with you the truths that are opened to "
"me! The truths that keep opening to me!\" {n}Harrim clenches his beard, "
"almost pulling a piece from it.{/n} \"The truth about where time flows... "
"The amazing forms that emptiness takes... The deafening song of silence that "
"hides beyond {g|Groetus}Groetus'{/g} whisper... Now I know, now I know...\" "
"{n}Harrim looks through you with unseeing eyes, whispering something "
"indistinct.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오, {Name}. 내가 깨우친 진리를 너와 나눌 수만 있다면! 내게 허락된 진리를!\" {n}하림은 수염을 움켜쥐어 몇 가닥이 뽑힐 "
"것만 같습니다.{/n} \"시간의 흐름에 대한 진실을... 공허가 갖추는 놀라운 형태를... {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 속삭임 "
"속에 숨어있는 귀청이 떨어질듯한 침묵의 노래를... 나는 이제야 깨달았다네. 이제야 알았어...\" {n}하림은 공허한 눈으로 당신을 "
"꿰뚫어 보며 무언가를 속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93345_Text
msgctxt "164474d3-e8d4-4d49-9f09-416cb365da0c"
msgid ""
"\"Repent? You think I have to ask his forgiveness? The god who cast me out, "
"who condemned me to a life of endless suffering? I would never return to "
"him, even if he came asking for MY forgiveness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"회개? 내가 그의 용서를 구해야 한다고 생각하는가? 나를 쫓아내고 끝없는 고난의 삶으로 내몰았던 신을? 설사 그가 나에게 용서를 "
"구해도 나는 절대로 그에게 돌아가지 않을걸세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Harrim/VS_Harrim_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_93347_Text
msgctxt "4e56e481-30aa-4f7e-82e6-581b13aed9e0"
msgid ""
"\"No, no! You cannot live without faith. Everyone needs a guiding force, a "
"higher power to turn to in dire moments. I am sure your atheism is just a "
"phase of your spiritual search. Sooner or later, you will find your faith as "
"well!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 아닐세! 믿음 없이는 살 수 없네. 누구나 인도가 필요하고 위기의 순간을 피하게 도와줄 힘이 필요하다고. 자네의 무신론은 단지 "
"영적 탐색의 한 단계일 뿐이네. 조만간 자네도 자네만의 믿음을 발견할 것이네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "db727c7a-6951-4a48-8023-b9de8503fade"
msgid "\"I would like to hear your story.\""
msgstr "\"너의 이야기를 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d42f6d0d-7128-45b6-b3e5-b1361e18671e"
msgid "\"Tell me about your goddess.\""
msgstr "\"네 신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8bc7fd78-28e5-4d1e-a6ab-7aa0de020108"
msgid "\"What made you follow me?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 따라왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f53ef8f9-b043-4eaa-9bd2-c1281ffa12e3"
msgid "\"You and Tristian seem to not get along.\""
msgstr "\"너와 트리스티안은 친하지 않은 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fbbac3d6-662f-412a-af70-ac39f0fce1a4"
msgid "\"I have decided I no longer need your assistance.\""
msgstr "\"나는 더 이상 네 도움이 필요 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "2f108399-638e-4fe7-9738-ebb7617f7522"
msgid "\"Thank you for the conversation. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"대화해줘서 고마워. 그럼 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "fd5e8d83-a9f9-4ef9-a49e-b9f6c24c4881"
msgid "\"Who did you kill and why?\""
msgstr "\"누구를 왜 죽였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "378d292a-b326-48c2-b992-df77192ad96a"
msgid "\"How did you die — and what happened after?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 죽었지? 그리고 그 후에 무슨 일이 일어난거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "4a9969b5-de5a-4745-ad67-8249a670136f"
msgid "\"Is exile your only punishment for murder?\""
msgstr "\"네 살인죄에 대한 형벌은 추방이 전부인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "a13f129a-fbea-419f-a8a2-4523ba0240f2"
msgid "\"What's it like to be undead?\""
msgstr "\"언데드로 산다는 건 어떤 느낌이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "e96e4ff3-2f4e-4950-890d-9934c19bc0c6"
msgid "\"Who were you before your exile?\""
msgstr "\"추방당하기 전에 너는 누구였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "75fd80e8-0d76-43c3-b1c9-b9a8e4d09422"
msgid "Was horrified by Jaethal's confession."
msgstr "제이탈의 고백에 소름이 끼칩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "9c02167e-0c57-4925-a50d-ef6dffa19a40"
msgid ""
"\"Did you kill innocent elves for entertainment and pleasure? That's "
"abominable!\""
msgstr "\"너의 여흥과 즐거움을 위해 무고한 엘프들을 죽였다고? 혐오스럽군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "047e3306-fff1-4a2d-94b3-22e1943d4ffb"
msgid "Told Jaethal that you are not the one to judge her."
msgstr "그녀를 판단할 사람은 당신이 아니라고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "5fb18cba-7321-494c-89b2-39f244f04c74"
msgid "\"I am not one to judge you for your past deeds.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 과거에 대해 따지지 않을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "638fc2c4-e3ea-4d0e-8f34-45e728231e7c"
msgid ""
"Approved of Jaethal's actions and stated that people live for their own sake "
"only."
msgstr "제이탈의 행동을 동의하고 사람들은 자신을 위해서만 산다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "4dfcd008-4729-49bb-8a6c-b4890dc8d206"
msgid ""
"\"In the end we all live for ourselves. The lives of others shouldn't "
"outweigh our own.\""
msgstr "\"결국 우리 모두는 자신을 위해 산다. 다른 사람들의 삶은 우리 자신보다 중요하지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "eabb5723-b7d5-452a-a0fe-924fb6a290cf"
msgid "\"How do healing spells, prayers and potions affect you?\""
msgstr "\"치유 주문, 기도, 물약은 네게 어떤 영향을 미치지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "0a884070-d903-43d5-86b6-ba3768a1fa0f"
msgid "\"You don't need to sleep, right?\""
msgstr "\"넌 잘 필요도 없는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "40bf42fe-5f70-458d-86b9-cf6c7abc2abd"
msgid "\"What about, umm, carnal pleasures?\""
msgstr "\"흠. 그렇다면 육체의 쾌락은 느끼나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "72517718-fc2f-4f8e-a10d-e7c1e5dd5bc8"
msgid "\"Do you regret not being alive anymore?\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 산 자가 아니라서 후회되나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "fc4dbc20-ea9b-462c-aeec-49310ceb6798"
msgid "\"What does Urgathoa require of her followers?\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아는 그녀의 추종자에게 무엇을 요구하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "637bf744-28a4-4c94-a5ce-205bc65f72e8"
msgid "\"Why is the cult of Urgathoa forbidden in much of Golarion?\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아 숭배는 왜 골라리온에서 금지되는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "23a47bbb-6be9-4e72-9a71-624e1d91d018"
msgid "\"Tell me about your birthplace.\""
msgstr "\"네 출생지에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0044_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "90a66d10-ce8f-410f-82a1-555f688a8db7"
msgid ""
"Told Jaethal that power is all that matters, which is why undeath is better "
"than the life she had before."
msgstr "힘이 전부이며 살아있을 때보다 언데드의 삶이 더 낫다고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "0b79fbab-f22f-4f1e-8d47-3f780a45f029"
msgid ""
"\"You've become powerful, that's all that matters. It's much better than the "
"life of ordinary mortals — and even elves.\""
msgstr "\"너는 강력해졌다. 그게 전부다. 엘프일지라도 평범한 필멸자의 삶보다 훨씬 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0045_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f7ff304e-f72d-4b8d-ac8b-1601158ef7b9"
msgid "Told Jaethal that a life of pleasure is better than eternal undeath."
msgstr "살아서 즐거움을 누리는 것이 영원한 언데드가 되는 것보다 낫다고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "336a2518-63a0-4b7a-9cd6-9f0bd1a4b6f0"
msgid ""
"\"A bright life, full of pleasures, is better than un-life, though eternal.\""
msgstr "\"즐거움으로 가득 찬 밝은 삶은 영원히 죽지 않는 것보다 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0046_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4802dc56-f6cd-4c5e-820d-0246f3cf32c9"
msgid "Told Jaethal that no one should live only for themselves."
msgstr "아무도 자신을 위해서만 살 수는 없다고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "cb31c9ec-020f-47ac-8178-4bc335fe2fae"
msgid ""
"\"There's no purpose in living only for yourself. It makes life and un-life "
"equally senseless.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신을 위해서만 사는 삶은 목적이 없다. 그러면 사나 죽으나 똑같이 무의미하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "0e4d97a0-a601-4064-a916-a6af6e2cd3c4"
msgid "\"But why do these assassins follow you?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 왜 이 암살자들이 너를 따라 다니는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "8276dd0d-3ddf-457b-8c23-0eb696c37a84"
msgid "\"You are my companion, so you can count on my protection.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 동료이니 내가 보호해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "3b4aec86-22ff-4cef-be76-5247ccf173c5"
msgid "\"Do not engage me in your personal war.\""
msgstr "\"네 개인적인 싸움에 나를 끌어들이지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "59ff2123-fea0-463d-a00b-c88aa1d5406f"
msgid "\"Enough about this for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 이 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "6ca46664-bdd7-4497-ba5d-94d6601a16aa"
msgid "\"Thank you, I have no more questions about this.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 나는 이것에 대해 더 이상 질문하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "3618b7a6-eaad-473d-b300-053f43db235d"
msgid "\"Enough talking about your past.\""
msgstr "\"과거에 대해서는 이만하면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "bc837b56-6377-4e7d-844a-40aaa7ab2251"
msgid "\"What do you know of Urgathoa herself?\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아에 대해 무엇을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0061_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8279b191-231a-4d33-b2af-b6a9257a91fa"
msgid ""
"Condemned Jaethal for her atrocities and told her that she deserved just "
"retribution."
msgstr "학살을 한 제이탈을 비난하고 응징받아 마땅하다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "4d33a679-6bf8-4112-8507-6cb1858b4248"
msgid "\"I hope you suffered fair punishment for your crimes!\""
msgstr "\"네가 저지른 죄에 마땅한 벌을 받았기를 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0062_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2d67982f-5207-4d53-9456-15752284f21e"
msgid "Recommended that Jaethal use more lawful methods of murder."
msgstr "제이탈에게 좀 더 합법적인 살인을 하라고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "f85c39cf-0fdb-4dbb-ba10-5b46bc15ebb8"
msgid ""
"\"An objective worth pursuing, but it would be better to refrain from secret "
"murder. There are many ways to arrange a death, while keeping within the "
"boundaries of law and decency.\""
msgstr "\"추구할 가치가 있는 목표이지만 암살은 자제하는 것이 낫다. 법에 어긋나지 않으면서 죽음을 준비하는 많은 방법이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "b33855c5-1486-4382-a049-68a90799eede"
msgid "\"Does Urgathoa feud with the other gods?\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아는 다른 신들과 불화가 많은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "4d020b73-f599-4c42-97e2-ad73ec3ea4af"
msgid "\"Yes. You should leave.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "9765ba0f-24a9-4076-8cf4-918746c13890"
msgid "\"No. I just wanted to see how you'd react.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 네가 어떻게 반응하는지 보고 싶었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "7e936005-11c3-4366-8c37-e41e5c25c226"
msgid "\"Do you have family in Kyonin? Anyone who is dear to you?\""
msgstr "\"쿄닌에 가족이 있어? 누구라도 너한테 소중한 사람이나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "c734d1b4-4d7b-42cb-9ece-e0cf9e06734b"
msgid "\"It seems to me the experience... changed you.\""
msgstr "\"그때의 경험이... 너를 변하게 한것같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0095_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "de2b19b6-e2d5-48f9-8a17-bc7ba2588a10"
msgid "Told Jaethal that undeath is disgusting and evil."
msgstr "언데드는 혐오스럽고 악하다고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "34d6b63f-7365-42c6-98e9-1c55dc99b598"
msgid ""
"\"No. Undeath has nothing to do with life. It reeks of evil, and disgusts me."
"\""
msgstr "\"아니. 언데드는 삶과 아무런 관계가 없다. 그것은 사악한 악취가 진동하고, 역겨울 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0096_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4b007c4a-9a7c-4e30-ab77-98ce95899e56"
msgid ""
"Told Jaethal that you have no particular opinion on undeath but find her "
"powers intriguing."
msgstr "언데드에 대해 딱히 할 말은 없지만 그녀의 힘이 흥미롭다고 제이탈에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "383dcf63-246d-4816-92e0-aaea3072bdfd"
msgid "\"I don't know. But your power does intrigue me.\""
msgstr "\"모르겠군. 하지만 너의 그 힘에는 흥미가 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0097_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bbdda62c-99e2-463e-98c7-2f9b86f989ea"
msgid ""
"Told Jaethal that you find undeath fascinating as a way to rise above the "
"laws of nature."
msgstr "자연의 법칙을 거스르는 언데드가 흥미롭다고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "43a3c1df-13eb-42ae-88ab-10651d1d6ed7"
msgid ""
"\"I understand you. There is a frightening beauty in un-life. The beauty of "
"power. The beauty of being able to ignore the laws that rule over all living "
"things.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 이해한다. 언데드는 치명적인 아름다움이 있어. 힘의 아름다움. 모든 생명체를 지배하는 법칙을 무시할 수 있는 아름다움.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "8de50ce8-c83a-40ae-b387-198fbd5b6a52"
msgid "\"Regarding this story with Taneka and Enneo...\""
msgstr "\"타네카와 에네오의 이야기에 관해서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0104_Text
msgctxt "229d363b-b191-4212-b7d3-78ab11ffaf05"
msgid "\"Did you study the scroll? What can you tell about the ritual?\""
msgstr "\"두루마리를 연구했나? 의식에 대해 무엇을 말할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0105_Text
msgctxt "2ac2bd61-30ee-4c84-aea4-ace14d8cd12f"
msgid ""
"\"Before raising that elf woman as undead, you said that she looked like "
"'Nortellara'. Who is that?\""
msgstr "\"그 엘프 여자가 언데드로 되기 전에 그녀가 '노텔라라'처럼 보였다고 했었지. 그건 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0106_Text
msgctxt "d3223694-edda-4a9e-8943-14927100b1d7"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about Enneo?\""
msgstr "\"에네오에 대해 나에게 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0107_Text
msgctxt "acf3b5b3-468b-4910-975d-052c046cf9b8"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0113_Text
msgctxt "4d42c3b5-deac-469f-af2e-1588b247ecfe"
msgid "\"I want to speak with you about what happened at the elven camp.\""
msgstr "\"엘프 야영지에서 일어난 일에 관해 이야기하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0115_Text
msgctxt "ce27655e-a73c-40fd-8ae9-8b69f6680acf"
msgid "\"Enough about that for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0118_Text
msgctxt "cba59696-74e6-49cb-98a9-b034507726fc"
msgid ""
"\"You are wrong to be inspired by Enneo's example. He was a fanatic and it "
"led him to his death. Your desire for a carefree life of pleasure — that "
"seems much more sensible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"에네오의 예에서 영감을 받은 것은 잘못되었다. 그는 광신자였고 그것이 그를 죽음으로 이끌었다. 기쁨이 넘치는 평온한 삶을 원하는 것이 "
"더 합리적으로 들린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0119_Text
msgctxt "bd87c5d4-e4e0-4876-b467-dc3997cdaa8a"
msgid ""
"\"I do not like Enneo's fanaticism, nor the pointless indulgence of one's "
"whims. There must be another way.\""
msgstr "\"나는 에네오의 광신이나 무의미한 변덕에 관심이 없다. 다른 방법이 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0120_Text
msgctxt "a0875d1e-4888-4754-908d-50763a2b81c1"
msgid ""
"\"Enneo had a goal, and he moved towards it with fascinating tenacity. He "
"deserves our respect. \""
msgstr "\"에네오는 목표를 가지고 있었고 고집을 가지고 빠져들었다. 그는 존경받을 자격이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0124_Text
msgctxt "eeac611c-be6a-4b81-8bcb-d90dfa4eedd7"
msgid "\"What can you expect now that you have passed Urgathoa's test?\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아의 시험을 통과했는데 무엇을 기대할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0128_Text
msgctxt "6d8df2a9-a579-4c73-9873-56af70d390d3"
msgid "\"What does it mean to be an inquisitor of Urgathoa?\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아의 심문관이 된다는 것은 무엇을 의미지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0133_Text
msgctxt "950a24dd-a953-4c7c-aaed-33a7be8222f6"
msgid ""
"\"Right. I was born in other lands but always wanted to know more about the "
"homeland of elves.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 나는 다른 나라에서 태어났지만 항상 엘프의 고향에 대해 알고 싶었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0134_Text
msgctxt "be715952-610f-4db5-bb61-6eba68738106"
msgid ""
"\"I'm from Kyonin too, but I'd like to hear how you see our common homeland."
"\""
msgstr "\"나 또한 쿄닌 출신이지만, 우리의 고향을 어떻게 생각하는지 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0135_Text
msgctxt "8c84d2c2-384f-43d8-b59c-b634f66dcdb8"
msgid ""
"\"I just haven't been there for a long time. I want to hear the latest news."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 오랫동안 거기에 머물지 않아서 소식을 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0140_Text
msgctxt "701f0ef3-bf3b-4a85-8ebb-5ee1efc02590"
msgid ""
"\"Everything depends on us. If some elves become jaded and boring late in "
"life, they probably didn't enjoy life before either.\""
msgstr "\"모든 것이 우리에 달려있다. 삶에 지친 엘프들은 이전에도 즐거운 삶을 살지는 못했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0141_Text
msgctxt "8149bb40-3dec-4297-a72f-514ab2ed7da1"
msgid ""
"\"It's impossible to keep the soul forever young. Not across the ages, with "
"all the pain and commotion.\""
msgstr "\"영혼의 젊음을 영원히 유지하는 것은 불가능하다. 나이에 상관 없이 고통과 소란에 지칠 것이기 때문에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0142_Text
msgctxt "966e8789-cd53-40d7-b59d-a88ad58c5abf"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe, but our longevity is still much better than the short and bright "
"existence granted to the short-lived.\""
msgstr "\"그럴지도. 그러나 오래 사는 우리가 단명하는 아름다운 것들보다 훨씬 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Answer_0143_Text
msgctxt "03883ae7-8aec-4aaa-9b73-9964ad51f22d"
msgid ""
"\"I understand what you mean. I myself fear to lose mental clarity and open-"
"mindedness over time.\""
msgstr "\"네가 의미하는 것을 이해한다. 나는 정신의 명료함과 개방적인 마음을 잃을까 두렵다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "35992c31-e5b4-40df-8f96-2e8d1084a4be"
msgid "{n}Jaethal greets you with a nod.{/n} \"Speak.\""
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 고개를 끄덕이며 인사합니다.{/n} \"말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "52e8c0f9-506f-4446-ae61-9cb054a1b4d9"
msgid ""
"\"Stories...\" {n}Jaethal shrugs.{/n} \"Stories are boring, and a waste of "
"time. I have killed. I was exiled from {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}. I died. I was "
"raised by {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} gift. That is my 'story'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이야기라...\" {n}제이탈은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"이야기는 지루하고 시간 낭비일 뿐이야. 나는 살인을 했지. 그리고 "
"{g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 추방당했어. 그리고 죽었지. 그리고 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물을 받고 다시 "
"돌아왔어. 이게 내 '이야기'야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "41c1c266-a5d7-4de1-8203-59e7370d473c"
msgid ""
"\"Family. Four.\" {n}Jaethal's voice is calm and ordinary, as if she's "
"speaking of something trivial.{/n} \"But 'why' is the more interesting "
"question.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가족. 네 명.\" {n}제이탈의 목소리는 마치 사소한 것을 말하는 것처럼 평온하고 평범합니다.{/n} \"그러나 '왜'가 더 "
"흥미로운 질문이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b7e8e283-696b-4026-8592-b85d87ab460a"
msgid ""
"\"What is the worth of a thousand years, if you cannot enjoy it like your "
"first ten dozen springs?\" {n}The elf's voice sounds unusually vehement.{/n} "
"\"Everyone considers elves ever-young, but our 'youthfulness' is but a mask, "
"a threadbare ritual gown. What lies underneath? The dust of years, and jaded "
"repetition. With each year the dust grows thicker, and erstwhile joys cease "
"to excite, and cloy, as a dish you've tasted a thousand times!\""
msgstr ""
"\"수백년의 인생을 즐기지 못했다면 천년의 삶이 무슨 소용이겠어?\" {n}엘프의 목소리는 평소와 다르게 격렬합니다.{/n} \"사람들은 "
"엘프가 영원히 젊을 거라 생각하지만 우리의 젊음은 껍데기일 뿐이야. 그 아래에는 무엇이 있겠어? 시간의 풍파와 지친 반복 뿐만이 있어. "
"시간의 풍파를 계속 겪으면 같은 음식에 질리듯 이전의 기쁨은 멈추게 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4314f7ab-2ba0-4bb1-be72-e533828abffc"
msgid ""
"\"Do we?\" {n}Jaethal idly brushes invisible dust from her sleeve.{/n} \"He "
"bothers me no more than any overzealous fool. He's tried so dearly to "
"'redeem' me with his faith. I know a few sweet ways to redeem him with mine."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가?\" {n}제이탈은 소매에서 보이지 않는 먼지를 쓸어냅니다.{/n} \"그는 다른 열정적인 바보와 다르지 않다. 그는 나를 "
"믿음으로 구속하기 위해 노력했다. 나는 그를 구속할 수 있는 몇 가지 재미있는 방법을 알고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "1880e23a-5ddb-4697-9cea-94fb3948dae4"
msgid ""
"\"Do you wish to know what it means to me personally? Or what powers and "
"limitations it imposes?\""
msgstr "\"그게 나에게 개인적으로 어떤 의미인지가 궁금한거야? 아니면 언데드의 강점과 제한이 궁금한거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "d7971e1c-e153-416a-99a3-52c3e62ae94f"
msgid ""
"{n}A shadow passes over Jaethal's face.{/n} \"You surely know how to ask "
"questions...\" {n}She says nothing for a long time.{/n} \"Two desires led me "
"through life — to feel pleasure time and time again, and to achieve "
"perfection. Un-life brought me closer to the second. I am changeless, torn "
"from time. The chaos of the world, and even the soul circle, have no power "
"over me. But everything comes with a price. Most things that brought me "
"pleasure in life are meaningless to me now. How can I decide which is better?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그림자가 제이탈의 얼굴 위에 드리웁니다.{/n} \"대답하지 않을 수가 없군...\" {n}그녀는 오랫동안 아무것도 말하지 "
"않습니다.{/n} \"두 가지 소망이 나를 삶으로 이끌었지. 삶을 즐기는 것과 완벽을 이루는 것. 죽지 않는 삶은 나를 완벽에 가까워지게 "
"했어. 나는 시간에서 분리되어 불변하는 존재야. 세상의 혼돈이나 영혼의 순환 조차도 나에겐 영향을 미치지 못해. 하지만 모든 결과에는 "
"대가가 존재하지. 나에게 기쁨을 주던 것들이 이제 나에겐 아무 의미가 없어. 뭐가 더 낫다고 말할 수 있겠어? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "cd41054a-7ada-4c39-8f78-4737fd10ea66"
msgid ""
"\"Long did I search for a way to avert this fate. Don't I, who has truly "
"tasted life, deserve a better lot than those benumbed old elves who close "
"themselves to the world? And I found a way in the ancient texts of "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}. A ritual, involving the blood of my kin. A trifle, "
"that would make each day feel as a holiday, created specially for me. The "
"ritual gave strength not only to my body, but to my mind and my soul. And my "
"mind whirled at every sensation, each sip of wine, or silken carress. Oh how "
"I miss this...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 운명을 피할 방법을 오랫동안 찾았었어. 무감각해져서 세상으로부터 문을 닫아버린 늙은 엘프들보다 진정으로 삶을 맛 본 내가 더 "
"나은 운명을 취할 자격이 있다고 생각하지 않아? 결국 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 고대 문헌에서 한 가지 방법을 알아냈지. "
"내 동족의 피가 필요한 의식. 그 사소한 희생이면 모든 날이 나만을 위해 만들어진 휴일인 것처럼 느껴지게 할 수 있었지. 그 의식은 내 "
"육신뿐 아니라 정신과 영혼에도 큰 힘을 주었어. 내 정신은 내가 느끼는 모든 감각에 소용돌이쳤지. 포도주 한 모금마다, 비단의 감촉을 "
"느낄 때마다... 아 내가 얼마나 바랬던 것들인지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a2f2887c-bffe-4f8c-9b0f-8a0dcfc3afcf"
msgid ""
"\"...My cousin was the first I used for the ritual. It was a simple matter "
"to pass her death as an unfortunate accident. But the enchantment would not "
"last. I had to find another, and again conceal my trail. With the third "
"death, my family grew suspicious, and upon the fourth, my deeds were finally "
"revealed. Such a pity. If not for this, my un-life even now would overflow "
"with burning pleasure. For I have dozens of useless relatives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 내 사촌이 의식에 사용된 첫 번째 제물이였어. 그녀의 죽음을 불행한 사고로 넘기는 것은 아주 간단했지만 마법이 오랫동안 "
"지속되지는 않았지. 나는 또다른 제물을 찾고 내 흔적을 숨겨야 했어. 세 번째 죽음 이후에 우리 가족이 의심하기 시작했고, 네 번째가 "
"되었을 때 내가 했던 모든 것들이 밝혀졌지. 애석하게도 말이야. 그것만 아니었다면 내 불사의 삶은 여전히 타오르는 기쁨으로 넘쳐 "
"흘렀을거야. 내겐 쓸모없는 친척이 수십명은 있었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "b5ef99fd-ae44-4322-a6e2-db490f1f2d18"
msgid ""
"\"I concur,\"{n} the elf nods in content.{/n} \"But not many possess the "
"courage and honesty to admit it. The world is filled with cowards and fools."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 동의한다.\" {n}엘프는 자신있게 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그러나 많은 사람들이 그것을 받아들일 용기가 없다. 세상은 겁쟁이로 "
"가득해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "928f68ea-5f33-44b8-80f4-cd7654b8e4c1"
msgid ""
"\"Fair. Judge me for my present form. And better yet — for the benefits we "
"can provide each other.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 내 현재의 모습으로 판단하도록 해. 그리고 우리가 서로 얻을 수 있는 이점에 대해서도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "53490053-87cd-4ec8-a59f-0fb94fa2eefc"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I have.\" {n}Jaethal shrugs.{/n} \"Use whatever high-sounding words "
"you wish to describe my deeds. Say 'abominable' if it suits you. "
"'Reasonable' and 'honest' would fit just as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그랬지.\" {n}제이탈은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"내 행위에 대해 얼마든지 거창한 말을 써서 묘사해도 상관 없어. "
"'혐오스럽다'는 말이 네 마음에 든다면야. '합리적이다'라거나 '솔직하다'는 말도 괜찮을 것 같고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "6b87b318-3a92-4730-9b00-9147a1bf8f30"
msgid ""
"\"It might sound strange, but I know less than others about "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} and her faith. My transformation into her "
"inquisitor was... unexpected. But I will answer to the best of my knowledge."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하게 들릴지 모르지만 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}나 그 신앙에 대해서는 보통 사람들보다도 모르는 편이야. 그녀의 "
"심문관이 된 것은... 예상하지 못한 일이지. 하지만 내가 아는 선에서 최대한 답해주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "5483ecb5-3a3f-4d6f-910c-0872854be365"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you do not ask from idle curiosity. {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} is the "
"birthplace of the elves. The other races are allowed to visit, within "
"reasonable limits. Usually, only as far as {g|Greengold}Greengold{/g}. That "
"is the enclave for half-breeds and the short-lived, a whim of our queen. I "
"enjoyed going there sometimes, as to a wild beast show. Beyond this "
"caricature of a city, Kyonin is a mixture of grandeur and the sad remains of "
"ancient glory.\""
msgstr ""
"\"쓸데없는 호기심으로 물어본게 아니길 바래. {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}은 엘프들의 고향이야. 다른 종족들도 적당한 범위 내에서는 "
"방문 할 수 있지. 대개는 {g|Greengold}그린골드{/g}까지지만. 우리 여왕의 변덕 덕분에 그곳은 혼혈과 단명종들의 거주지가 "
"되었지. 나는 가끔씩 야생 짐승 전시회를 보려고 거기에 가기도 했었어. 이런 우스꽝스러운 모습 외에도 쿄닌은 웅장함과 고대적 영광의 슬픈 "
"잔재가 섞여있는 장소지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "efc4dc4b-2938-4b78-aead-51ba11ef896e"
msgid ""
"\"Curiosity. The need for a reliable ally. You see, I must come to "
"understand what my goddess seeks from me. {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} gave me "
"the powers of inquisitor without declaring her will to me. I await her "
"reply, any hint or trace or clue. And I suppose our meeting was no mere "
"accident. Besides...\" {n}Jaethal cringes.{/n} \"I imagine that several "
"{g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} assassins still pursue me. They never risked attacking "
"me while I was under the patronage of the Aldori. They are unlikely to "
"attack while I have reliable allies like you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"호기심. 믿을 수 있는 동료의 필요성이랄까. 알다시피 여신께서 나에게서 무엇을 찾고있는지 이해해야만 해. "
"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}는 내게 그녀의 생각을 말해주지 않고 나에게 심문관의 힘을 주었어. 나는 그녀의 대답을 기다리고 "
"있어. 어떤 힌트나 흔적, 아니면 단서같은 것들 말이야. 그리고 우리의 만남은 단순한 우연이 아닐지도 몰라. 게다가...\" {n}"
"제이탈은 움찔합니다.{/n} \"{g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}의 암살자가 여전히 나를 쫓고 있는 것 같아. 그들은 알도리의 보호 하에 "
"있는 나를 어떻게 하지는 못하겠지만 말이야. 너와 같은 믿음직한 동료가 있으니 공격하지 않을 것 같거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "3c42fa8f-470b-4405-8eee-9d9f5a461b26"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. They can't have been sent by the queen. I am branded outlaw, "
"but my punishment was exile, and it is not custom for elves to contravene "
"their own verdicts. My attackers shouted something about threat and blood. I "
"suppose they are a splinter group of feeble-minded zealots. Or someone on a "
"quest for personal revenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 몰라. 여왕이 보냈을리는 없어. 나는 무법자가 되었지만 내가 받은 처벌은 추방이었고, 보통 엘프들은 판결을 뒤집고 또다른 처벌을 "
"내리지는 않거든. 나를 공격한 녀석들은 위협과 피에 대해 울부짖었어. 아마 광신자 조무래기나 원한이 있는 녀석이겠지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "96500a07-32b8-4e45-b051-ae0c827ffcfe"
msgid "\"A reasonable approach. I appreciate this.\""
msgstr "\"합리적인 접근법이로군. 똑똑한걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "7f483049-c4e3-47f9-a74a-f0a1f07124a0"
msgid "\"I only offer information. Dispose of it as you see fit.\""
msgstr "\"나는 정보만을 제공하지. 판단은 네 몫이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "9c46982d-98de-47a6-b95c-daa3e731409a"
msgid "\"As you wish. Conversation is truly a waste of time.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로. 대화는 시간 낭비일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "024c5401-4441-4a86-92ba-6118b7e6a2a7"
msgid "\"Apparently not.\""
msgstr "\"분명히 아니지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "1e5a5ab1-b4a5-410c-9e0a-15b2411dcd47"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "20cf6968-35e1-42a0-8615-a611c32b7ee9"
msgid ""
"\"Righteous anger? How tedious. But if it worries you so much, then yes, I "
"appeared before the court. It deemed exile a fair penance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의로운 분노라? 정말 지루하군. 하지만 그렇게 걱정된다면야, 그래 난 법정에 출두했어. 추방으로 정당한 죗값을 받은 셈이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "2bfcc1d8-d4e5-4159-9230-e94c33c0ffd2"
msgid ""
"\"It is much more difficult to accomplish this in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} than "
"the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}.\" {n}Jaethal cringes.{/n} \"But "
"you are correct. I have learned a lesson from my past, and will be more "
"careful in the future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}이 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}보다 달성하기 더 어려운 곳이야. \" {n}"
"제이탈은 움찔합니다.{/n} \"하지만 네가 옳다. 나는 과거로부터 교훈을 얻었고 앞으로 더 조심해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "1f5b6fb2-096c-46d3-bc3d-8984d59c4d27"
msgid ""
"\"For an elf\", {n}Jaethal says pointedly,{/n} \"...exile is a serious "
"punishment. There is no other {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} in this world. Even I, "
"who despises its hypocrisy, must admit as much.\""
msgstr ""
"\"엘프에게 있어서.\" {n}제이탈은 지적하듯 말합니다.{/n} \"망명은 심각한 처벌이야. 세상에 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}이 두 "
"개는 아니니까. 놈들의 위선을 경멸하는 나 조차도 그건 인정할 수밖에 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "d386a340-57de-4073-9f87-68d39265dd10"
msgid ""
"\"It's rather amusing. I belonged to a wealthy family, and held high "
"position on the courts of Iadara, the capital of {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}. When "
"my little wrongdoings were revealed, the trial was held in the very same "
"court where I tried cases and delivered sentences, over several hundred "
"years. An awkward situation, don't you think?\""
msgstr ""
"\"재밌는 사실 하나 알려줄까. 나는 부유한 가문에서 자랐고, {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}의 수도 아이어다라 법원에서 높은 직위에 "
"있었어. 죄가 밝혀졌을 때는, 내가 수백 년 동안 형을 집행한 그 자리에서 재판을 받았지. 참 아이러니하지, 안 그래?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "930e2195-576a-4117-9f90-5faa1cf643bd"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal frowns.{/n} \"I... don't remember my death. I was stunned by the "
"sentence of exile, and I admit, I showed weakness. I wandered aimless, "
"absorbed in despair, without concern for my safety or sustenance. And "
"then... then... I remember desolate rocks, a stone I lay upon, a convulsion, "
"passing not only through my whole body, but through my soul. Then — I "
"awakened. Cold, calm — my body overwhelmed with strength, but haunted by a "
"strange internal silence.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나는... 죽음이 기억나질 않아. 나는 추방형에 큰 충격을 받았고, 약한 모습을 보였었다는걸 "
"인정하지. 나는 절망에 빠져서, 위험이나 안전같은 건 신경쓰지도 않고 정처 없이 떠돌았어. 그리고... 그 후에는... 황량한 바위산과, "
"내가 누워 있던 돌 바닥, 내 육체뿐 아니라 영혼까지 관통하던 경련이 기억나. 그리고 나는 깨어났어. 차가움과 고요함 — 내 몸엔 힘이 "
"가득했지만, 한편으로는 기이한 내면의 침묵에 사로잡히게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "53f68fce-1035-44e6-a981-fbec69354247"
msgid ""
"\"There were bloody prints of bone feet on the stone next to me: the sign of "
"the goddess. A battle scythe lay nearby. That was the first and last time I "
"heard {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} voice. She spoke but three words: \"Hail "
"the inquisitor.\" That is all. She has neither addressed me nor answered my "
"pleas ever since.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 옆에는 발바닥 뼈 모양의 핏자국이 남아있었어. 여신의 상징이었지. 근처에는 거대한 낫이 놓여있었고. 그 때가 처음이자 마지막으로 "
"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 목소리를 들은 순간이였어. 여신께선 단 두 마디만 말하셨지. \"기뻐하라 인퀴지터여.\" 그게 "
"전부야. 그 이후로 여신은 내게 아무 말도 하지 않았고, 내 기도에도 응답하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "70dfc675-0ff6-45b8-a111-e0865487b563"
msgid ""
"\"I will not bother you with the story of how I tried to comprehend my "
"new... condition. Soon I had a chance to put my new powers to the test. A "
"group of my kin had tracked me through the woods. They were insolent, and "
"would pay dearly for this. But I had to reckon how I might free myself from "
"their persistent chase. A powerful protector from among the short-lived "
"could help me, and the {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} seemed suitable. That is "
"all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 새로운... 상태를 내가 어떻게 이해하려 했는지 굳이 지루하게 설명하진 않을게. 어쨌든 나는 곧 새로운 힘을 시험할 기회가 "
"생겼어. 한 무리의 내 일족들이 숲을 지나서 나를 쫓고있었거든. 그것들은 무례한 놈들이었고, 그에 맞는 대가를 치루게 해줬어. 하지만 "
"나는 놈들의 끈질긴 추적을 피할 방법을 생각해야했지. 수명이 짧은 자들 중에서도 강력한 보호자가 있다면 도움을 받을 수 있겠지, 그러니 "
"{g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}가 적절해 보이더군. 그게 다야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "9108eee9-efc6-4147-b99b-39ba6f939a87"
msgid ""
"\"Next to today's graceful dwellings lie the ruins of ancient monuments and "
"fountains. Elves prefer to live in small groups, in secluded settlements. "
"The most outgoing and ambitious live in the capital, Iadara. Daily life is "
"filled with the efforts of hundred-year-old infants seeking worthy goals, "
"and thousand-year-old stony cynics entertaining themselves howsoever they "
"can. That is all. It's scarcely worth mentioning that even this gloom is far "
"more tempting than anything one finds in the lands of the short-lived.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘날의 우아한 거주지 옆에는 고대 유적과 분수대가 있어. 엘프들은 작은 무리를 지어서 외딴 곳에서 사는 것을 좋아하지. 그 중에서도 "
"가장 활기차고 야심있는 자들은 수도 아이어다라에 살아. 엘프의 일상은 백 살 된 아기들은 가치 있는 목표를 이루려고 노력하고, 천년 묵은 "
"늙은 냉소주의자들은 할 수 있는 한은 즐겁게 지내려고 하지. 그게 전부야. 이런 암울한 상황조차 단명종들의 땅에서 볼 수 있는 그 어떤 "
"것들보다 흥미롭다는건 말할 가치조차 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "e8eae955-ebe7-4c58-bb8a-db3a4698bf5b"
msgid ""
"\"Dreadfully, of course. Your healers had better stay away from me in "
"battle. The undead are 'healed' through interaction with negative energy. — "
"And I can perfectly manage that on my own.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 끔찍한 영향을 미치지. 네 치유사들은 전투에서는 내게서 떨어져 줬으면 좋겠어. 언데드는 음의 에너지를 통해 '치유'되니까. "
"그리고 나 혼자서도 그건 잘 할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "6cc73463-53ba-4e4a-bcf7-8b70aa5738f5"
msgid ""
"\"I am spared from that bothersome need. But I hope you do not take this as "
"a reason to invent additional responsibilities to entertain me during the "
"night. I spend this time meditating and addressing the goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그런 성가신 욕구로부터 해방되었지. 하지만 밤 동안 날 즐겁게 하려고 다른 일거리를 만들어주려 하지는 않았으면 좋겠군. 나는 그 "
"시간동안 명상하고 여신에게 기도하며 지내니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "0be4ad96-d4b9-4516-bd4b-58e5bf113180"
msgid ""
"\"A tactless and facile question. That pleasure is now as senseless to me as "
"food or wine. Action without feeling.\" {n}Jaethal cringes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"눈치도 생각도 없는 질문이네. 그런 쾌락은 이제 나에게는 음식이나 와인처럼 무의미해. 한다고 해도 느껴지는건 없지.\" {n}제이탈은 "
"불편한 눈치입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "724fd527-a561-4c94-9a40-f549f9691c7e"
msgid "\"Agreed.\" {n}Jaethal yawns pointedly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그래.\" {n}제이탈은 지루하다는 듯이 하품합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "5229af68-405f-4bdb-bf5d-382b412d7439"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps. But the choice was made for me. I have nothing left but to follow "
"the will of the goddess.\""
msgstr "\"그럴지도. 하지만 선택의 여지가 없지. 나는 여신의 뜻을 따르는 수밖에 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "c19da6ce-5e32-446c-b93f-40d6bb3ee45f"
msgid ""
"\"I would prefer to have both. But meanwhile I shall have to content myself "
"with power.\""
msgstr "\"나는 양쪽 다 갖고 싶군. 하지만 내게 주어진 힘에 만족해야겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "7ffa8564-b3dd-4d2c-91a0-b7ea6cb81bae"
msgid ""
"\"Not {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}. But {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} still tries to "
"call her to order, and {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, to 'heal' her.\" {n}Jaethal "
"laughs at the absurdity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}는 아니다. 그러나 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}는 여전히 그녀에게 명령을 내리려 하고, "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}는 그녀를 치유하려 한다.\" {n}제이탈은 부조리를 비웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "4206f858-f39b-41c3-b0c9-e9b8460c151b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, certainly. {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} was once a mortal woman, basking "
"in life and all the pleasures it had to offer. Her passion was so strong "
"that Urgathoa rebelled against {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, against death "
"itself and its laws. After her own death, she escaped the power of the Lady "
"of Graves and returned to the world as a goddess — and the first undead. "
"Since then she has protected all who submit their souls to pleasure and "
"passion, paying no heed to worn-out morals and the dictates of law.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론. {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}는 한때 삶을 누리는 평범한 필멸자 여성이었다. 그녀의 열정은 너무나 강렬해서 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}와 죽음의 법칙에 반기를 들었다. 그녀는 죽고 난 후 무덤의 여인의 손길을 벗어나 여신이 된 첫번째 "
"언데드가 되었다. 자신을 추종하는 자들을 보호하며 그녀는 낡아빠진 도덕이나 법은 눈길도 주지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "b3c164a6-0a52-4249-ac1e-16ee294388fc"
msgid ""
"\"Because {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} is plagued by narrow-minded cowards. Some "
"tremble at the freedom granted by {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}. Others fear the "
"wrath of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} and her priests.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}은 소심한 겁쟁이들이 넘쳐난다. 누군가는 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}가 선사한 자유를 "
"두려워한다. 또 누군가는{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 분노를 두려워한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "18e22cf4-88db-48c1-8eb7-a388bcdede9a"
msgid ""
"\"To enjoy. To taste exquisite dishes, to feel the lover's caress, and drink "
"the enemy's suffering. A wonderful religious obligation, isn't it?\""
msgstr "\"즐기는 것이다. 요리를 맛보고 연인의 애무를 느끼고 적의 고통을 느끼는 것. 훌륭한 종교적 의무이지 않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "cfebe3df-93e4-4288-a96f-2785fffbd2c2"
msgid "\"How unwise. Is this your final decision?\""
msgstr "\"멍청하군. 이게 최종 결정인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "79bbb80f-6180-428e-b8d2-e1557f09419e"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't that a shame?\" {n}Jaethal smiles coldly.{/n} \"I should say, it "
"isn't.\""
msgstr "\"안타깝지 않냐고?\" {n}제이탈은 차갑게 웃습니다.{/n} \"전혀 그렇지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "e3fd2b6d-332c-43dc-a529-aa8050056745"
msgid "\"Entertained? You are welcome. What else is life for?\""
msgstr "\"재밌었어? 감사할 필요는 없어. 삶이란 그러라고 있는거 아니겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "48fdb85f-62e1-44d0-9b91-462696827262"
msgid ""
"\"Do you mean someone I would hesitate to sacrifice? Perhaps my daughter. I "
"would regret the wasted effort — the creature turned out quite well. Like a "
"properly trained dog, or a well-managed horse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 희생하기 주저하는 사람을 말하는 건가? 아마 내 딸일 것 같군. 그 때 쓸데없이 들인 노력을 후회할거야. 그 애는 꽤 잘 지내고 "
"있거든. 잘 훈련받은 개나 좋은 관리를 받는 말처럼 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "d75f35fe-b820-4c78-8915-cd86f5caf9b9"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, that's true. It's strange I do not think more about who might have "
"killed me. I should crave revenge, but I do not. Time and again, I remember "
"the moment when the power of my gift brought that young elf back from the "
"dead. It was… exciting.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 사실이야. 정말 이상한 일이야. 이제 더이상 누가 나를 죽였던건지 생각이 들지 않아. 나는 복수를 원해야 하지만, 그렇지가 "
"않아. 몇번이고 자꾸만 그 어린 엘프에게 내린 내 선물의 힘이 그녀를 죽음에서 되살렸던 순간만 기억이 나. 그건..정말 흥분되던 "
"순간이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "9cf448d1-ffb0-4d20-a6d6-9f5b4cef2a43"
msgid ""
"\"For the second time in my life, I felt her divine presence, and the power "
"of my gift — power itself! Isn't un-life a wonderful blessing? By my own "
"will, I can wrest someone's beauty out of time and into eternity, to "
"preserve them in this world forever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 생애 두 번째로, 나를 굽어살피는 우르가쏘아의 존재와 그분이 주신 선물의 강력함을 실감했다. 나는 감히 신의 권능이라 하겠어! "
"세월의 흐름은 누구에게도 축복이라 할 수 없잖아? 나는 쉼없이 흐르는 세월의 강에서 다른 이의 아름다움을 건져다가 영원의 별에 못 박을 "
"수 있어. 아름다움을 이 세상에 영원히 보전하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "3f7bb5ba-0e13-4c3e-8e7d-86fc6e23907f"
msgid ""
"\"It intrigues me as well. Sometimes it feels like two forces are fighting "
"inside of me. One is my logical side, which strives to understand my gift, "
"to evaluate and calculate the consequences and limits of its potential. The "
"other is deep and hidden... It laughs at the first, and urges me to simply "
"enjoy the power I've been given, to breathe it in. Which side will win? "
"Someday we may find out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 내게도 호기심을 일으킨다. 그것은 마치 내 안에 두 힘이 싸우는 것과 같다. 한 쪽이 내 한계와 능력을 이해하려는 이성이라면 "
"다른 쪽은 내면 깊이 잠들어있다... 처음에는 웃음이었다가 나의 힘을 무자비하게 즐기도록 해준다. 어느 쪽이 이길지는 시간이 알려주겠지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0099_Text
msgctxt "44badbab-3e41-415f-80ee-8ac20dec5b02"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone has the right to their own prejudices.\" {n}Jaethal shrugs.{/n} "
"\"So long as they don't interfere with you ruling your "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} as you see fit, then all is well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구나 편견을 가질 권리가 있다.\" {n}제이탈은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"그들이 너의 영지에 간섭하지 않는다면 그걸로 됐지 "
"않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "bece4216-2fd3-4598-ad0d-c46c1582fed7"
msgid ""
"\"I… I'm surprised at how deeply you can see. I shall ponder your words. "
"Perhaps they will show me the way.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 너의 통찰력에 놀랐다. 너의 말을 곰곰이 생각해 보겠어. 아마 나에게 길을 보여줄 수도 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "117550c1-d619-4cd1-8193-aefc899ffdd3"
msgid "\"She… she impressed me. What exactly would you like to discuss?\""
msgstr "\"그녀는... 나를 감동시켰다. 무슨 얘기를 하고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0108_Text
msgctxt "d3866de1-953a-4d2c-9d8a-b34e69669ee3"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0109_Text
msgctxt "4cdcebd7-2d57-478a-90b7-071dd0fad7a3"
msgid ""
"\"You'll laugh to know what I learned... It offers great power, a chance for "
"a new life... To put it simply, it's a way to transfer your soul into a "
"blood relative's body. It's not so bad, if you think about it. You could "
"choose that red-haired cousin or the niece with sweet dimples on her "
"cheeks...\" {n}Jaethal grins, making it clear that she was joking... "
"probably.{/n} \"But all my kin are in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}, and it's "
"forbidden for me to go there. And even if I did... I don't know if "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} would be angry with my decision to regain a living "
"body. I suggest we stop talking about the ritual. It's pointless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 한 말을 비웃을 지도 모르지만... 그것은 위대한 힘을 주고 새로운 삶을 살 기회를 준다... 간단히 말하면 너의 영혼을 네 "
"혈족의 몸에 주입하는 것이다. 기분이 썩 나쁘지는 않다. 붉은 머리의 사촌이나 귀여운 보조개를 가진 조카를 고를 수도 있지...\" {n}"
"제이탈은 웃으며 농담을 하고 있다는 것을 밝힙니다... 아마도요.{/n} \"하지만 내 모든 친척들은 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에 "
"있고 나는 거기에 가는 것이 금지되어 있다. 내가 정말 그랬을지라도... {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}가 몸을 바꾸는 것을 "
"좋아할지는 의문이다. 의식에 대해서는 이만 이야기 하자. 그것은 무의미하다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "979e59dd-a8c9-443b-b9eb-2f0ed9b0e21c"
msgid "\"Of course. It was... An interesting experience.\""
msgstr "\"물론... 재미있는 경험이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0111_Text
msgctxt "4266aeee-83e4-46da-8f91-4a5c2e29a68e"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit, the half-blood surprised me. I can say... he deserves "
"respect. It's strange, isn't it? One might instead say that he lived in "
"prison house built of dogma, and died serving it. But he was something I "
"cannot yet fully be — an inquisitor with a purpose, someone who sees no "
"barrier in the service of their faith. I'd come to think that the infinite "
"search for new sensations and pleasures was the essence of life, but perhaps "
"this is... not enough?\""
msgstr ""
"\"잡종이 나를 놀라게 했다는 것을 인정해야겠군. 그는 존경을 받을 자격이 있다. 하지만 이상하지 않은가? 그는 교리라는 이름의 감옥에 "
"갇혀 살다 죽었다고 해도 맞을 것이다. 하지만 그는 내가 되고 싶어하는 추종자가 되어 믿음의 벽이 없다고 믿었다. 새로운 쾌락을 위한 "
"무한한 추구는 삶의 본질이라고 생각했지만... 그것이 전부는 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0112_Text
msgctxt "357ffde7-607f-4061-8a48-f01097e68294"
msgid ""
"\"Ah. That is my daughter. Did I mention her earlier? I should say the "
"resemblance turned out to be superficial. Norte would not have reacted so "
"cowardly if she rose as undead. I was a good enough teacher to raise her "
"strong, restrained, sensible, and able to evaluate her situation before "
"acting. She would have weighed everything thoughtfully, rather than "
"immediately pleading for death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아 그 아이는 내 딸이야. 전에 말했나? 겉모습만 닮았을 뿐이라고. 노텔은 언데드가 되었다면 그 엘프 여자처럼 겁을 먹지는 않았을 "
"거야. 나는 그녀를 강하고, 차분하고, 분별력 있게 키웠고, 행동하기 전에 신중하게 상황을 판단하도록 가르쳤어. 그 아이는 즉시 죽음을 "
"택하는 것보다 모든 가능성을 신중히 생각했을꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0116_Text
msgctxt "7e05cc29-04aa-4a67-b40e-a58d3af0bb2c"
msgid "\"Certainly.\""
msgstr "\"그렇겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0121_Text
msgctxt "d7b6daf8-b707-4262-8fdb-4b37ceb681c5"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps... Perhaps you're right. I don't know why exactly the half-blood's "
"story moved me so. I should stop thinking about it and find something "
"exciting to occupy myself with.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩌면... 네가 맞을 거야. 왜 잡종의 이야기가 나를 감동시켰는지 모르겠군. 그만 떠올리고 다른 즐거운 것을 찾아야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0122_Text
msgctxt "e0dd7cf8-43a3-4748-a17d-9e44d2eb5b27"
msgid ""
"\"Can we really choose our own way? I don't know. I shall meditate upon this."
"\""
msgstr "\"우리가 자신의 길을 선택할 수 있는 건가? 나는 모르겠다. 이것을 주제로 묵상해야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0123_Text
msgctxt "a145efc5-abaa-4fa9-9380-f7d86dd0e0d0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm trying to imagine — what would my life be like, if I had a goal as "
"decisive and inspiring as that? So many new thoughts, so many disturbing "
"notions. At one time, my fear of losing my sense of novelty led me to kill. "
"What will come next? It's impossible to predict.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고무적이고 결단력있는 목표를 가졌다면 내 인생이 어떻게 될지 상상한다. 너무 많은 잡념이 떠오른다. 새로움이 없는 삶이 두려워 죽을 "
"뻔한 적이 있었다. 그 다음에는 어떤 생각이 들까? 생각조차 들지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0125_Text
msgctxt "de7412a0-c912-4f4f-80bf-6f795d66d2c8"
msgid ""
"\"First of all, a new {d|Jaethal Reborn}body{/d} awaits me. It will take "
"much time to prepare for the ritual, but then... three times a day I make a "
"list of what I shall do, once I'm alive again. I'll not limit myself in any "
"way — for at least ten years. It's sad, but after that, I shall have to turn "
"my mind from the joys of life and give birth to a future vessel. Perhaps it "
"is better to have several of them. It will be necessary to choose the father "
"carefully, so that the vessel turns out to be beautiful. I've no wish to "
"spend centuries in some ugly form.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우선 새로운 {d|Jaethal Reborn} 몸 {/d}이 나를 기다리고 있다. 의식을 준비하는 데는 많은 시간이 걸릴 "
"것이지만... 되살아난다면 하루에 세 번 해야 할 목록을 만들 것이다. 최소 10년은 무엇이든 시도하며 살 것 같아. 그리고는 삶을 "
"즐기는 것을 그만두고 새로운 몸을 갖기 위해 아이 하나를 가져야 하겠지. 여럿 보다는 나을 거야. 잘생긴 남편을 골라야 미래의 몸이 "
"예쁘겠지. 못생긴 얼굴로 몇백년을 살고 싶지는 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0126_Text
msgctxt "746632dd-20d6-4798-919d-722eae64d870"
msgid ""
"\"The Goddess has blessed me and made me stronger. That is why she requires "
"{d|Jaethal Kills Daughter}sacrifices{/d}, right? She's waiting for me in her "
"domain. Continuing my service, one day I may be awarded the title of Herald, "
"the chosen one among chosen ones. But do not worry — I shall remain here "
"until your affairs in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} are finished. I "
"shall help you in everything. I can be grateful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여신님은 나를 축복하여 나를 강하게 만들었다. 그래서 {d|Jaethal Kills Daughter}희생{/d}을 원하는 것이겠지. "
"그녀의 영역에서 나를 기다리고 있다. 내 임무를 수행하면서 언젠가는 모두가 우러러 보는 전령의 칭호를 받을 거야. 하지만 걱정마. 나는 "
"{g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 너의 임무가 끝날 때까지 남아있을 거야. 모든 일에서 너를 도와 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0127_Text
msgctxt "d8f3770b-10eb-4990-8718-45cc978c3654"
msgid ""
"\"You must be wondering what the Goddess has awarded me with. It was "
"promised to me that one day I shall go to the domain of "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} to continue my service. If I continue to please my "
"Goddess, someday I will be selected among the other chosen to be the Herald "
"of her will. Until that time, I may live as I wish. Urgathoa bestowed a "
"blessing upon me and breathed her power into me. Know this: until she calls "
"me, I am at your disposal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 여신이 우리를 기다리는지 궁금하겠지. {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 영토로 언젠가 나는 가게 되어있다. 나는 언젠가 "
"선택된 자들 중에서도 선택된 전령이 될 것이다. 그 때까지 살아있기를 기대해야겠지. 우르가쏘아는 내게 축복을 내려주었고 그녀의 힘이 내 "
"안에 살아 숨쉰다. 그녀가 나를 부를 때까지 나는 너의 임무를 수행할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0129_Text
msgctxt "41b2cdba-0423-4a87-9f8d-0769380c7ae9"
msgid ""
"\"This question is more complicated than it seems. An inquisitor is by "
"nature the most zealous defender of their faith. — The hand of their Goddess "
"in mundane affairs. When I received this title and power, I expected that "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} would tell me my mission. But this never happened. "
"The Goddess remains silent. There's only one reasonable explanation I can "
"imagine: discovering what's expected of me is a part of my mission. So I "
"reflect on this, make my prayers and wait for a sign.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 질문은 생각보다 복잡하군. 심문관은 가장 믿음이 뛰어난 수호자다. 여신의 손과 발이라 할 수 있지. 그 칭호를 부여받고 힘을 얻은 "
"후로 나는 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}가 내 임무를 말해주리라 기대했지만 그런 일은 일어나지 않았다. 여신은 아직도 조용하다. "
"내가 할 수 있는 추측은 그녀의 임무를 내가 찾아야 한다는 것이다. 그래서 나는 항상 유념하며 계시를 기다린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0130_Text
msgctxt "8eee14bc-f7d4-4b9d-8b34-d23e229923b8"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings!\" {n}Something has subtly changed — either in Jaethal herself, "
"or in her attitude towards you.{/n} \"It's amazing how significantly our "
"fates can change. Just yesterday I was lost, and hardly understood my own "
"strength. I did not hear the voice the Goddess, and knew not the purpose of "
"my un-life. Today I am triumphant. There is no longer any doubt, no "
"burdensome connection with the past, and the road to a bright future lies "
"before me. And it all happened thanks to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕!\" {n}Jaethal이 미묘하게 바뀐 것 같은 기분이 듭니다. {/n} \"우리의 운명이 바뀐다면 그건 놀라운 변화야. 어제 "
"나는 길을 잃어 내 힘을 이해하지 못했다. 나는 여신의 목소리를 듣지 못했고 나의 목적도 몰랐지. 오늘 나는 승리했다. 의심의 여지 없이 "
"과거의 짐을 덜어버리고 내 앞에 놓여진 미래를 향해 걸어갈 거야. 다 네 덕분이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0131_Text
msgctxt "09d63da5-8e6d-4b85-83cc-cc7476280803"
msgid ""
"\"From your question, I assume you're not from {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}. Right?\""
msgstr "\"너는 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g} 출신이 아닌가 보군. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0136_Text
msgctxt "dc905a42-4156-4d63-bcfe-3cbee6dfcdcd"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal scoffs.{/n} \"News! It's not about elves. Believe me, "
"{g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} today is still the grim mix of ruin and splendor it has "
"been for ages.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 코웃음칩니다.{/n} \"소식이라! 오늘날 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}은 수백년 동의 영광과 폐허가 섞인 으스스한 곳이지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0137_Text
msgctxt "a4a88f32-905c-4f63-b9a8-e4d9a88a3655"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid my story sounded too skeptical. You should definitely visit "
"{g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}! Only there can you really understand what it means to "
"be an elf — with all the benefits and vices that come with it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이야기가 무신론자의 이야기처럼 들릴까 걱정되는군. {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}을 꼭 들려봐! 좋은 쪽으로든 나쁜 쪽으로든 엘프가 "
"된다는 의미를 이해하게 될 거니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0138_Text
msgctxt "6062b43e-caa1-4f32-9e0c-979d5f3ed305"
msgid ""
"\"I hope I answered your question? I tried to tell you like I would tell an "
"ordinary short-lived person who's never been to {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너에게 대답을 해주고 싶은데... {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에 가보지 못한 평범한 사람처럼 이야기를 하고 싶었는데 그게 안돼. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0144_Text
msgctxt "3c3a223a-c4d0-44be-b4d2-469b242d2d10"
msgid "\"Then you'll understand what I tell you next.\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떤 말을 할지 너는 이해하게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0145_Text
msgctxt "a99ef52e-d406-4b51-b2c0-f31311ea1736"
msgid ""
"\"Truly. But what a paltry fate — to settle for what you have, not even "
"trying to achieve more! That's exactly why I did what I did.\""
msgstr "\"정말이야. 하지만 성취하려고 노력하지도 않고 가진 것에 만족하는 시시한 인생이란! 그래서 내가 그렇게 한 이유야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0146_Text
msgctxt "7139a6f5-d8e1-4939-aa46-13ee98e0fbc6"
msgid ""
"\"Impossible is a word for those who are afraid of change,\" {n}Jaethal says "
"firmly. Then she continues, softer,{/n} \"But allow me to continue my "
"story...\""
msgstr ""
"\"불가능은 변화를 두려워하는 사람들을 위한 단어야.\" {n}제이탈은 단호하게 말합니다. 그리고는 계속합니다.{/n} \"하지만 이야기 "
"하나 해주지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0147_Text
msgctxt "e900a856-91bf-40fe-a34a-fc380c1dc4ec"
msgid ""
"\"I like your optimism. But sadly, I look at things more pragmatically, and "
"I'm not inclined to indulge in illusions about my kin or myself. We're all "
"doomed to age mentally. But...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 긍정적인 모습이 마음에 들어. 하지만 나는 실용주의자이고 내 일족의 환상에 사로잡히고 싶지 않아. 우리는 결국 영혼도 늙게 "
"되어있으니. 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jaethal/Cue_0148_Text
msgctxt "6faed1ca-2c5d-4ea2-81bb-0aaef8ef9141"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you ask? I know you pray to the Pallid Princess too... I must say, "
"I'm glad. There aren't many countries whose leaders have the guts to accept "
"her gifts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 묻는 것이지? 너도 창백한 여군주에게 기도를 올리지 않나. 나에겐 몹시 흡족한 광경이지. 우르가쏘아의 선물을 받아들일 만큼 배짱 "
"있는 지도자를 둔 나라는 많지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "75efd9c5-0b7a-409d-9530-cd33392fabf0"
msgid "\"What are you jotting down in your notebook all the time?\""
msgstr "\"너는 왜 항상 노트에 무엇인가를 적어두지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1d8bb51c-2263-4f23-89f3-c5fa31afa494"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a83fa869-143c-44cc-a998-b6481d2e4c24"
msgid "\"Tell me something about the history of the gnome race.\""
msgstr "\"노움의 역사에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "33210c13-e5ce-424c-aa4d-813a74cd5fce"
msgid "\"You must know a lot about the First World.\""
msgstr "\"너는 태초 세계에 대해 많이 알고있는것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4580b7a6-4472-421a-8ffe-0ae0ac1ef95e"
msgid "\"Tell me, why have you studied the First World so thoroughly?\""
msgstr "\"왜 태초 세계를 그렇게 철저히 연구했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c38d10cd-ad22-4469-8b94-d6c11feee7bd"
msgid "\"You're not very friendly, you know.\""
msgstr "\"넌 별로 살갑지 않아. 알지?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1bc10b99-b190-4b42-9430-34408747e71d"
msgid "\"Thank you for the conversation. I have to go now.\""
msgstr "\"대화해 줘서 고맙군. 이만 가봐야 겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "5c5995ea-c995-420a-8269-434a343757f8"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "cc053301-4719-44d6-91bb-5949d7df96a1"
msgid "\"Still, where were you born?\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 어디에서 태어났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "05c6742d-e0e7-484b-b90a-f7565cc2263b"
msgid "\"You've traveled so much! Tell me of your travels abroad!\""
msgstr "\"너는 여행을 많이 했군! 여행 얘기 좀 해봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "810082f5-9b77-4fdf-a3a9-6a407bce5d2e"
msgid "\"So you write books and magazine articles?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 넌 책과 잡지 기사를 쓰는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b3fe02c2-1eb5-4b88-a6f6-5513326430c6"
msgid ""
"\"You wear glasses. Why won't you ask some cleric to heal your eyesight?\""
msgstr "\"안경을 끼고 있는데 왜 성직자에게 시력을 고쳐달라고 하지 않지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "08b30732-ee8c-4963-be5a-9ba452176777"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks for telling me about yourself. Let me ask you about something else."
"\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해줘서 고마워. 다른 것에 대해 물어보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "ef28b2cc-cb35-4c82-9149-34f9e20cb4e6"
msgid "\"How did gnomes appear on Golarion?\""
msgstr "\"노움은 어떻게 골라리온에 나타났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "4d39c73a-b274-4fed-861f-916022358f0f"
msgid "\"Do gnomes live long?\""
msgstr "\"노움은 수명이 길어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "0f5618de-7763-42b4-8dc2-a79ed288c0c7"
msgid "\"So you travel so much as a way to fend off the Bleaching?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 백화를 피하기 위해 여행을 많이 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "ba204652-39e0-4a71-9f67-e9393f62e2b9"
msgid ""
"\"Let's change the subject. I'd like to learn more about the First World.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔보자. 나는 태초 세계에 대해 더 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "5cc8764e-d9e6-470b-a087-31dbfee7bd92"
msgid "\"Thank you for your story. I'd like to ask you about something else.\""
msgstr "\"이야기해주어 고맙다. 다른 것에 대해 물어보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "b8208cae-d6ac-4183-b1ee-a14542ca8741"
msgid "\"The First World, what it's like?\""
msgstr "\"태초 세계. 그곳은 어떤 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "ec698159-18ac-4c0d-9816-1608acdc3b06"
msgid "\"How can a person get there?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 인간이 거기에 갈 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "a675d4dc-50c8-4488-8493-a2c7d5438487"
msgid "\"Are there any sentient beings in the First World?\""
msgstr "\"태초 세계에는 지적인 생명체가 존재하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "0843f1c1-8043-4d84-99aa-b00b148de672"
msgid "\"Who rules the First World?\""
msgstr "\"누가 태초 세계를 지배하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "cc57f3d6-38c7-45a7-9bc3-379928c10dc2"
msgid "\"You know a lot about the First World. Have you ever been there?\""
msgstr "\"너는 태초 세계에 대해 많은걸 알고 있군. 거기에 가본 적이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "63d31642-9afe-48cc-8740-6b94dd5af0e1"
msgid "\"I'd like to talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른걸 묻고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0073_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f5c42b1e-55e0-4205-a425-70fe86b7ef9c"
msgid "Told Jubilost that power is a duty."
msgstr "주빌로스트에게 권력은 의무라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "da95a726-b393-4ff7-86b2-130c4c5a7142"
msgid "\"What are you hinting at? I'm only fulfilling my duty!\""
msgstr "\"설마 나를 말하는건가? 나는 의무를 다하는 것뿐이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0074_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bc6e23e4-6ddc-476b-ba69-3dcffe243495"
msgid "Told Jubilost that power is a right."
msgstr "주빌로스트에게 권력이 당신의 권리라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "19c6e614-11ba-43f0-99ae-05f7b78cd483"
msgid "\"I do what I have the right to do!\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 권리를 행사하는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "5472efc8-dca9-44ec-9a62-41d4af40d191"
msgid "[Remain silent]"
msgstr "[침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0090_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2986b233-dfcf-4331-ac54-a79075cb803a"
msgid "Reproached Jubilost for his impoliteness."
msgstr "무례한 주빌로스트를 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "53c17e0d-d5aa-4dd0-8fb0-0f8698f29341"
msgid ""
"\"Even the most useful advice is better received if it's offered the right "
"way. Your advice sounds like your only aim is to please your own ego.\""
msgstr "\"가장 유용한 조언이라도 올바르게 전달해야 받아들여진다. 너의 조언은 마치 네 스스로 만족시키기 위해서 하는 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0091_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8819d2b5-5dcc-49f8-a54a-190f959fdc9b"
msgid "Answered Jubilost's impoliteness with a barbed joke."
msgstr "가시 돋힌 말로 주빌로스트의 무례함에 응답했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "a7284045-67e2-4c1b-8860-cfc4ca50aefe"
msgid ""
"\"I will be honest with you too, then – you've become rather too fat lately. "
"So accept this friendly help – tonight you go to sleep without dinner.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 나도 솔직하게 말해야겠군. 너 요즘 너무 뚱뚱해졌으니 내 친절한 조언을 받아줘. 오늘은 저녁은 굶고 자라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0092_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "adeeb452-3f4c-4828-9320-7ae53b60a00b"
msgid "Ignored Jubilost's impoliteness."
msgstr "주빌로스트의 무례함을 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "99374c1d-a036-4f24-96bb-18b9c878674d"
msgid "\"Very well, you can behave as you like.\""
msgstr "\"잘알겠어. 네가 원하는대로 행동해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "f712146a-887a-4f5c-aa7a-4e8c14b0a598"
msgid "\"I've read your article about the barony. Should I be flattered?\""
msgstr "\"영지에 관한 기사를 읽었다. 입바른 소리하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "d29d2749-3d90-4963-a71c-97c278d4c11c"
msgid ""
"\"I have received the journal with your article. I thought it would be worse."
"\""
msgstr "\"너의 기사를 읽었어. 나는 더 나쁘게 쓸 줄 알았는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "adba61ee-b806-49bd-97f8-bb25e566a590"
msgid ""
"\"I have read your article about the barony! How dare you publish such "
"trash?!\""
msgstr "\"영지에 관한 기사를 읽었다. 어떻게 그런 쓰레기를 기사로 올릴 수가 있지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "0839f4cb-0db8-4d2d-9d1b-67ea15432df2"
msgid "\"I'm fed up with you. You need to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게 지쳤어. 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0104_Text
msgctxt "e4034b93-fdd3-41ce-952a-bab772548b7f"
msgid "\"I certainly have. Now leave my lands at once.\""
msgstr "\"물론 있지. 내 땅을 즉시 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0105_Text
msgctxt "29299f68-a863-4e77-ab50-5b0532d0e5fc"
msgid "\"Well... actually no. Please stay.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄... 사실 아니야. 가지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "5e0aebd9-3540-41b0-abdb-8a380e200b5c"
msgid "\"I wanted to talk to you about the Inconsequent Debates...\""
msgstr "\"나는 비논리 토론회에 관해 이야기하고 싶다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0112_Text
msgctxt "edc28d6b-b82f-403f-b640-919bf777e82a"
msgid ""
"\"Have you figured out anything about that riddle? – The Host's 'answer' to "
"your question about the gnomes?\""
msgstr "\"그 수수께끼에 대해 알아 낸게 있어? 주최자가 답변한 노움에 관한 질문이 그거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0113_Text
msgctxt "29189a78-f4fd-490a-97c9-aa191e35ee19"
msgid "\"Remind me how that riddle went again.\""
msgstr "\"그 수수께끼에 대해 다시 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0116_Text
msgctxt "dfbd9c1a-5b6d-4071-bc90-91dd8dce4407"
msgid ""
"\"I was surprised that you didn't want to be freed of the Zottenropples' "
"spell. Why did you willingly suffer it?\""
msgstr "\"조텐로플의 주문으로부터 자유로워지기를 원하지 않는다는 것에 놀랐다. 왜 그것을 받아들였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "8a89403b-0dd7-477b-8347-af522a62ed77"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0121_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3d66b6b2-74d8-4bbe-9f6a-32d3578be95a"
msgid "Approved of Jubilost's selfless act."
msgstr "주빌로스트의 이타적인 행동을 칭찬합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0121_Text
msgctxt "ebb66bba-b20f-4a72-9474-b150c49d03db"
msgid ""
"\"So you let them continue their prank to help them? That's a worthy act.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그들에게 힘이 되는 농담을 하게 두었어? 정말 대견하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0122_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "108262f2-b3e2-4d7d-a401-b4681b4e2ed3"
msgid ""
"Told Jubilost that he shouldn't help those who don't want to help themselves."
msgstr "주빌로스트에게 도움받고 싶지 않은 사람들을 도와서는 안된다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0122_Text
msgctxt "c03f2f59-18df-461f-bbc2-614f476c4c6f"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't have played along. Each of us chooses how to face our "
"troubles – with dignity, or by humiliating ourselves and others.\""
msgstr "\"너는 그들과 놀지 말았어야 했어. 존경심을 가지고 혹은 모욕을 하면서 각자가 당면한 문제에 맞서는 것을 선택했어야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0123_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "04f9be78-6f42-4eb5-b9b3-4c3994902481"
msgid "Told Jubilost that selfless help is foolish."
msgstr "사심 없이 도와주는 것은 멍청한 짓이라고 주빌로스트에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0123_Text
msgctxt "0b161e57-28a8-4796-9928-455e34765b94"
msgid ""
"\"It's stupid to help useless weaklings, especially those who are trying to "
"harm you.\""
msgstr "\"쓸모 없는 약자들 특히나 너를 해치려는 녀석들을 돕다는건 어리석은 짓이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0128_Text
msgctxt "962dcd21-0f94-4e52-8460-e5a8f7391823"
msgid "\"I found Gunderson's book – the one we were looking for!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 찾고 있던 건더슨의 책을 발견했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0130_Text
msgctxt "459803f0-f33e-40dd-988c-fa1c08b0dbb4"
msgid ""
"\"I found Gunderson's book, and more than that – I solved the riddle! On the "
"twenty fourth of the month, I found someone named Luna in the corner of a "
"tavern.\""
msgstr "\"나는 Gunderson의 책을 발견했는데 수수께끼를 풀었다! 그 달 24일에 나는 주점 구석에서 루나라는 자를 발견했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0140_Text
msgctxt "f8618571-9992-48a1-8336-26727e95bdd5"
msgid "\"What are you going to do now?\""
msgstr "\"지금은 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0141_Text
msgctxt "3ac2bccd-fa13-4417-8f9a-abbd6cc9f2ab"
msgid "\"What do you think about everything that has happened?\""
msgstr "\"일어난 모든 일에 대해 어떻게 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0142_Text
msgctxt "63e9d2a6-456d-4b44-a37a-96355225c79c"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0152_Text
msgctxt "bc78f8d1-08cc-45ba-9527-3b287f5b3972"
msgid ""
"\"One thing they say about us gnomes is that few of us live long lives...\""
msgstr "\"그들이 우리 노움에 관한 이야기 중 하나는 우리 중 몇몇은 그리 오래 살지 못하다는 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0154_Text
msgctxt "25fafd23-edd8-47ba-819f-f113487444fa"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. I've heard about it but never witnessed it myself. What does it "
"look like?\""
msgstr "\"물론. 나는 그것에 대해들은 적이 있지만 내 눈으로 보지는 못했다. 그건 어떻게 생겼지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0155_Text
msgctxt "810bba41-4dc4-43bf-b5d0-7feff7e51f09"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to tell me. I've seen myself how the Bleaching develops.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 말할 필요가 없다. 나는 백화가 어떻게 진행되는지 직접 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0161_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5d1b6ac2-8a43-4a61-8b36-9c297014253f"
msgid "Admitted that you became a baron{mf||ess} to have fun."
msgstr "재미삼아 영주가 되려한다는 것을 인정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0161_Text
msgctxt "e1e8958b-b77b-42af-b688-968e3aeaa628"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I became a baron{mf||ess} for entertainment! I think with all the "
"commotion, I'm safe from the Bleaching.\""
msgstr "\"나는 심심해서 영주가 되었지! 내가 저지른 사고를 보면 나는 백화로 부터 안전하다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0163_Text
msgctxt "ad579044-4ed3-4bed-8305-bab3dce07ec6"
msgid "\"You worship Desna, don't you? So do I.\""
msgstr "\"너는 데즈나를 숭배한지? 나도 마찬가지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5a5f581c-c4e0-4170-a0cf-2e49a0c350c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost raises his head and closes his notebook.{/n} \"Ah, it's you. How "
"can I help you?\""
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 고개를 들고는 노트를 닫습니다.{/n} \"아. 너구나. 어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0ff9e8db-e3c8-4535-9e3a-f088eaa5001b"
msgid "\"Come back when you run out of clever ideas again.\""
msgstr "\"또 기발한 생각이 바닥나면 그때 돌아와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e4c1cd5d-846f-416f-b1ba-33dd5442b24e"
msgid ""
"\"Notes on our adventures. Good ideas that come to mind. I don't know how it "
"is with you, but in my case, my mind is constantly producing thoughts and "
"ideas worthy of writing down.\""
msgstr "\"우리의 모험에 관한 노트지. 좋은 생각이 떠올라도 적고. 너는 어떨지 모르겠는데 나는 소재가 마구 떠오른다구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1188bd93-0aff-4fb4-a032-6dcefe898ecf"
msgid ""
"\"Some I use in my articles and books. Others I will share with the audience "
"next time I speak at Forae Logos in {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}. Some other "
"thoughts should be kept out of the public view for a while. Our world isn't "
"yet ready for certain revelations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"기사와 책에서 쓸 내용이지. {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}의 포래 로고스에서 연설할 내용도 썼다. 그리고 대중의 관점에 대해서도 "
"생각했고. 우리의 세계는 어떤 폭로를 견딜 준비가 되어있지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2832449e-f522-42ea-b149-d321fd55ddec"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard this request so many times… Well, as we're traveling together, "
"I suppose I can give you an interview – free of charge, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 요청은 정말 여러 번 들어봤는데… 음, 우리가 함께 여행하는 만큼, 인터뷰를 해 줄 수 있을 것 같군. 물론 무료로 말이지\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1e6fbbcf-1131-4c13-8d9c-9a3005d254f5"
msgid "{n}Jubilost casually waves his hand.{/n} \"Ask away.\""
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트가 아무 생각없이 손을 흔들어댑니다.{/n} \"물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4862cfb2-426a-42cd-89af-1d0963064a3e"
msgid ""
"\"All of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} is my home. I am a citizen of the world. "
"Some might say my home is {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, that great old patchwork "
"city. It's there that my books and magazine articles are published, and "
"there I am held in particularly high esteem, owing to my vast knowledge. – "
"In fact, once I was invited to the College of Mysteries itself! But I prefer "
"to think of Absalom not as home but headquarters, where I go to plan my next "
"adventure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 모든 곳이 내 고향이야. 나는 세계의 시민이지. 어떤 이들은 내 고향이 "
"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}이라고 이야기하지. 그곳은 아주 오래된 도시야. 거기서 내 책과 기사가 출간되고 나의 방대한 지식을 "
"존중하는 자들이 많지. 사실 나는 미스터리 대학에 초대되기도 했어! 하지만 압살롬은 고향이 아닌 다음 모험을 계획하는 본부 정도로 "
"생각한다고 말하고 싶군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e79024df-4fdc-469a-bc9e-d8710d5505ba"
msgid ""
"\"I've visited every country worth mentioning in {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g} and "
"{g|Garund}Garund{/g}. I've even trodden the exotic lands of Tian Xia. I've "
"seen miracles you couldn't even imagine. And in every place I've been, there "
"was a home that would have gladly received a renowned explorer such as "
"myself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g}과 {g|Garund}가룬드{/g}의 모든 명소를 방문했어. 심지어 티엔 샤의 땅을 밟기도 "
"했지. 나는 네가 상상조차 할 수 없는 기적을 봤어. 그리고 내가 방문한 모든 곳은 나처럼 유명한 여행자를 환영해주던 고향과 같은 곳이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "04e6ec4b-10cc-444f-a563-e4018b69bd26"
msgid ""
"\"The famous name of Jubilost Narthropple is known even in the most remote "
"corners of the world!\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트 나트로플의 명성은 세계에서 가장 외진 구석까지도 알려져 있다구 !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "36276562-991d-4140-9d4f-1d6737708853"
msgid ""
"\"You know, the line between persistence and importunity is very thin. And "
"you risk crossing that line.\" {n}Jubilost sighs.{/n} \"Do you think I "
"haven't mentioned my birthplace because of my forgetfulness?\""
msgstr ""
"\"인내와 집요함은 종이 한장의 차이지. 너는 곧 집요하다는 소리를 들을 것 같아.\" {n}주빌로스트가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"내 "
"건망증 때문에 출생지를 말하지 않았다고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cc2c36a2-619e-4f1f-9ff6-976797187dcd"
msgid ""
"\"I was born in {g|Taldor}Taldor{/g}, if you must know. The empire is in "
"decline nowadays, but still cherishes the illusion of its past glory. It's a "
"country torn by prejudice. In Taldor, my mind was trapped in a cage of "
"restrictions – birthright, poverty, and their \"beggars-be-damned\" "
"attitude. I left the country as soon as I understood it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}에서 태어났다. 그 제국은 요즘 쇠퇴하고 있지만 여전히 과거의 환상을 소중히 간직하고 있지. "
"그곳은 편견으로 물든 곳이야. 나는 그곳에서 출생 성분, 가난 그리고 가난한 자들을 멸시하는 문화에 갇혀 살고있었어. 그것을 깨닫게 되자 "
"떠났지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f2c2a014-7732-44ec-adc3-d607fe291af5"
msgid ""
"\"So if you ever try to rekindle any patriotic feelings in me, you'll be "
"disappointed. My first article in The Independence was about "
"{g|Taldor}Taldor{/g}. The magazine was almost closed as a result of the "
"scandal that followed – and it would have closed, were it not for crowds of "
"my supporters, marching in protest under the windows of the publishing "
"house, making its editors change their minds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 애국심을 고취시키려 했다면 실망이군. 내가 '독립'에 쓴 첫 기사는 {g|Taldor} 탈도르{/g}에 관한 것이었어. 기사가 "
"나간 뒤로 뒤따른 추문으로 인해 그 잡지가 거의 폐간될 뻔했지. 나를 지지해주는 독자들이 우리 출판사 창문 밑에서 시위를 해 편집자들의 "
"마음을 바꾸지 못했더라면 그 잡지는 폐간된 채 였을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "30d2f8d2-d833-4fa9-bb70-fd26f6c4aeef"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost tilts his head, peering at you.{/n} \"I've written a fair number "
"of articles and essays on my journeys. And if you'll excuse me, I haven't "
"the slightest desire to retell them all to you right now. If you wish to "
"learn about foreign lands, pick up any issue of The Independence and read "
"all you like. I'm sure you can find my magazines even in this hole of a "
"place.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 갸우뚱하며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"난 여행에 관한 수 많은 기사와 에세이를 썼어. 미안하지만 지금 여기서 그 "
"이야기를 모두 쏟아내고 싶은 마음은 조금도 없어. 외국에 대해 알고 싶다면 '독립'에 관한 아무 기사나 집어서 읽어보라고. 이런 구석진 "
"동네에서도 내 잡지를 찾아 볼 수 있을테니 말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ad1b0988-1891-468b-8f89-afcb6879d521"
msgid ""
"\"I certainly do. I'm too generous not to share my thoughts and journeys "
"with other minds who search for knowledge. Judging from your face, you don't "
"belong in that category.\" {n}Jubilost sighs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지. 나는 너무나 관대해서 지식을 추구하는 사람들과 내 생각을 나누지 않을 수 없지. 네 얼굴을 보아하니 그런 부류의 사람은 "
"아닌가보군.\" {n}주빌로스트는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "06b4941c-bf9e-4ac4-9dad-c12f48c4c5ce"
msgid ""
"\"Among my scientific works, I'd recommend the range of articles published "
"in National Alchemy. If you prefer lighter reading, you might like "
"Traveler's Essays or the scandalous The Independence. If pictures capture "
"your attention better than words, page through the Illustrated Atlas of "
"{g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}. And you should give your cook a volume or two of my "
"Culinary Almanacs. Trust me, it might help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 과학 잡지의 하나인 내셔널 알케미에 나온 기사를 추천하겠다. 가볍게 읽고 싶다면 '독립'의 여행자 에세이를 읽어봐. 읽는 것보다 "
"사진이 더 좋다면 {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g} 도감의 삽화를 살펴봐. 그리고 네 요리사에게 내가 쓴 요리 도감 몇 권을 선물해봐. "
"분명히 도움이 될 거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "50c0e0cd-8e94-4bcc-9aa1-8347572d04e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost throws a speculative glance at you.{/n} \"Some have tried to "
"blame me for a sleazy romance novel called The Five Sins of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. I have no idea on who spread these crazy rumors. "
"But if you like such frivolity, I've been informed that the novel's sequel, "
"The Sixth Sin, was recently published.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 당신을 가늠하듯 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"어떤 녀석들은 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 다섯가지 죄라는 싸구려 "
"성인 로맨스물을 썼다고 비난하더군. 누가 이런 미친 소문을 퍼뜨렸는지 모르겠어. 만약 그런 천박한 소설을 좋아한다면 그 소설의 신간으로 "
"여섯 번째 죄가 최근 출판되었다는 걸 알려주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f891cb19-be99-4655-86ba-3878871e0685"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost throws a cutting glance at you.{/n} \"I'm sure you could have "
"figured out the answer to that question on your own, if you bothered to use "
"a logical approach. At least I sincerely hope so. I prefer to think of you "
"as of lazy person, not a stupid one.\" {n}Jubilost tightens his lips.{/n} "
"\"Well then, I suppose it's my fate to enlighten you. All right, there's no "
"time like the present!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 당신을 뚫어지게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그 질문에 대한 답을 스스로 알아낼 수도 있었을텐데 말이지. 논리적인 접근법을 "
"쓰는게 귀찮았다면 말이야. 적어도 진심으로 그랬기를  바래. 나는 너를 멍청한 사람이 아니라 게으른 사람으로 생각하는 게 더 좋거든.\""
"{n}주빌로스트는 입술을 꽉 다뭅니다.{/n} \"그래 그럼, 너를 계몽시키는 것이 내 운명인 듯하군. 좋아. 지금 만큼 좋은 시간은 "
"없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1a02b5bd-6054-44f7-827b-e1a62e82bf6f"
msgid ""
"\"Let's build up to a logical conclusion together. So, starting with the "
"obvious... A cleric's services cost several hundred gold coins. Spectacles "
"cost a dozen gold coins. So maybe I just couldn't afford to pay the cleric? "
"Incorrect conclusion. I earn enough, besides, some clerics would surely help "
"me free of charge, because they're fans of my incomparable talent.\""
msgstr ""
"\"함께 논리적인 결론을 도출해보자. 그래서 분명한 것부터 시작하면... 성직자의 봉사를 받는 데는 금화 수백개가 들어간다. 안경은 금화 "
"10여개면 충분해. 그럼 내가 단지 성직자에게 돈을 지불할 여유가 없었다면? 불완전한 결론이야. 난 충분히 벌거든, 게다가, 어떤 "
"성직자들은 기꺼이 공짜로 날 도와주려고 할거고, 왜냐하면 그들은 나의 비할바 없는 재능의 팬들일거니깐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "42aa1b97-675c-464e-ada3-47e2dd16e4c1"
msgid ""
"\"The answer can't be the money, then. So what is it? Let's explore further. "
"Surely you've noticed that I'm a rather famous person? Just to be clear "
"which circles I'm famous in: my scientific articles are well-known among the "
"students and teachers of various institutions of higher education. My "
"articles that satirize the rich and powerful are extremely popular among the "
"minor nobility, traders, and workers – that is, among anyone who doesn't "
"have any power for themselves. – The kind of people who don't usually have "
"enough money to afford an expensive cleric.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면 돈이 그것의 대답이 될 수는 없다. 그럼 도대체 뭐냐? 내가 친절히 설명해주지. 내가 제법 유명한 사람인 건 확실히 "
"눈치챘겠지? 나의 과학 논문들은 고등 교육을 가르치는 선생과 그 제자들에게 유명하다는 건 분명하지. 부유한 권력자를 풍자하는 내 기사는 "
"하급 귀족들이나 상인과 노동자들에게 엄청난 인기가 있어. 그 비싼 성직자의 치료를 받을 수 없는 그런 부류의 사람들 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ccb990d4-08d1-47e5-b47e-02b380341097"
msgid "\"Well? Can you add it all up and find the right answer yet?\""
msgstr "\"자 어때? 지금까지 말한것만으로는 아직 답을 못내리겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "28de28c5-cd90-407e-9a4b-1005148176e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost doesn't let you get a single word in edgewise. Apparently, he's "
"uninterested in your reaction, and is just enjoying listening to his own "
"voice.{/n} \"My spectacles are something that unites me with my readers. "
"People are more open to those who share their social status. Many of my "
"readers can't afford to heal their eyesight at the temple. So when I, too, "
"refuse such healing, I become closer to the people. My spectacles are part "
"of my image.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 당신이 끼어들지 못하게 합니다. 그는 분명히 당신의 반응에 흥미가 없어보이고 자신에게 도취된 것 같습니다.{/n} "
"\"나의 안경은 내 독자와 나를 하나로 묶는 무언가이지. 사람들은 사회적 지위를 공유하는 사람들에게 더 개방적이야. 내 많은 독자들은 "
"신전에서 시력을 치료할 여유가 없어. 그래서 나도 그런 치유를 거부하면 그들과 더 가까워지는 거지. 안경은 나의 이미지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "025ab867-5cfd-48f7-a15d-53d060b7422c"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost exhales at last.{/n} \"I believe I've managed to explain the "
"basics of logical thinking. No need to thank me.\""
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 마침내 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"네가 논리적 사고를 배웠길 바란다. 고마워할 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9fe91d2c-f86d-4a74-8a54-460fc4da3f49"
msgid ""
"\"What have I come to? Jubilost Narthropple, famous explorer, writer and "
"scientist, is reduced to giving simple lessons in history. Very well, ask "
"away. What questions do you have?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런... 탐험가이자 작가이자 과학자인 주빌로스트 나트로플이 이렇게 단순한 것이나 가르치다니. 좋아. 무엇을 알고 싶은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "29877328-59c0-4c7a-bd26-fd2405797c04"
msgid ""
"\"What has the world come to? To see a gnome ask another gnome about the "
"history of the gnome race. The gaps in your education are so huge, I doubt "
"that even I would be able to fill them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"세상이 어떻게 돌아가는 거지? 노움이 노움에게 노움의 역사를 가르치다니. 너와 나의 지식의 간극을 채우려면 엄청난 시간이 걸리겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "24ff2cbb-876e-49f0-8db8-45534da4f3c2"
msgid ""
"\"They came here in ancient times from {g|First World}the First World{/g}. "
"You do know what the First World is, right? If you don't, ask me about it "
"some other time. I used to lecture on it at a couple of institutes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"노움들은 고대에 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 왔다. 태초 세계가 무엇인지 알지? 모른다면 다음에 물어봐. 나는 "
"연구소 두 곳에서 강연을 했으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "594ba745-ec00-493b-903c-98dabf9f8af4"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly. Long and happily ever after.\" {n}Jubilost shakes his head in "
"remorse.{/n} \"We'd live as long as elves, were it not for the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이지. 오래 행복하게 쭉.\" {n}주빌로스트는 회한에 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"우리는 {g|백화}백화{/g}가 없었다면 "
"엘프 만큼 오래 살았을 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "63945e9c-98dc-4a20-967c-27048f4faa30"
msgid ""
"{n}Jublilost stares at you, then nods slowly.{/n} \"You see, I enjoy being "
"alive. I like to eat pancakes in the morning, I like to write articles for "
"magazines. I like it when I leave the publishing house in "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} and a crowd of fans immediately mobs me. So I don't "
"intend to die at the peak of my life because of some stupid, ancient curse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 당신을 쳐다보다가 천천히 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"이봐, 나는 살아있는게 좋아. 아침에 팬케이크를 먹고 기사를 "
"쓰는 게 좋아. 나는 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}의 출판사에서 떠날 때 팬들이 맞이해주는 게 좋아. 내 인생의 절정에서 왠 한심한 "
"고대의 저주 때문에 죽고 싶지는 않다구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ffe5e214-5271-4c8c-a303-5317f1bdbb0a"
msgid ""
"\"According to the understanding I've accumulated, the gnomes were an "
"immortal race until some of our especially insightful ancestors came up with "
"a brilliant idea. They decided it would be fun to learn how it feels to be "
"mortal. I would like very much to meet those gnomes. I wouldn't even kick "
"them, I'd just look in their eyes without a single word. Too bad they're all "
"long dead by now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 이해한 바에 따르면, 통찰력 있는 우리 노움 조상들 중 몇명이 기발한 생각을 해내기 전까지는 불멸의 존재였다고 해. 그들은 "
"필멸자가 되면 어떤 느낌인지 배우면 재밌을 것 같다는 생각을 했다는군. 그 노움 녀석들을 만나봤으면 좋겠어. 난 그 녀석들에게 발길질은 "
"커녕, 그냥 말 한마디 없이 그들 눈만 쳐다볼 꺼야. 이미 다 죽은 지 오래라 참 안타깝군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "35d83f70-f979-4db9-a6da-4b1b8a82eac5"
msgid ""
"\"As everyone knows, a stupid enough idea can be extremely contagious. So "
"the gnomes caught this infection – all of them, without a hope for cure. So "
"they found a way to {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, and decided to settle here. "
"And – you'll never believe it – they got just what they wanted. They severed "
"their link with {g|First World}the First World{/g}. They gained mortality, "
"the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, and a heap of local diseases that have been "
"keeping our race on the verge of extinction ever since.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다들 알고있듯, 어리석은 생각은 퍼지기 쉬운 법. 결국 노움들 모두가 그 생각에 전염되어 버렸어. 그래서 그들은 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 찾아 정착하기로 했지. 그리고 믿기지 않겠지만 그들은 결국 원하는 것을 얻고야 말았어. 그들은 "
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}와의 관계를 끊고 필멸자가 되어 수명과 {g|백화}백화{/g}, 그리고 우리 종족을 멸종 "
"위기에 빠뜨릴 수있는 수많은 질병들을 얻게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b4d45585-4536-4d87-abb8-e4431527c479"
msgid ""
"\"That's the curse of our race, which only struck after the gnomes left {g|"
"First World}the First World{/g}. To put it simply, gnomes must constantly "
"have new experiences. If a gnome gets into a rut, so to speak, he Bleaches.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Bleaching}백화{/g}는 노움들이 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠나고나서 얻게된 우리 종족의 저주야 . "
"간단히 말하면 노움은 끊임없이 새로운 경험을 해야 해. 노움이 지겨움을 느끼면 '백화'가 진행되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "78afbd1b-9edb-4847-8651-dae3d52416de"
msgid ""
"\"We start to lose color – literally. Our skin and hair become pale, and the "
"worst thing is that our soul loses color, too. If the process continues "
"unchecked, the gnome dies. History recalls only a few cases where gnomes "
"actually died of old age. Most of them perish either because of the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, or in the middle of some crazy adventure they've "
"joined, just to stave it off.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 말 그대로 색깔을 잃기 시작하지. 피부와 머리카락은 창백해지고, 가장 최악은 영혼마저 색깔을 잃어버리게 된다는거야. 증상이 "
"계속되면 노움은 죽게돼. 노움이 늙어 죽는 사례는 정말 희귀하지. 대부분은 {g|백화}백화{/g}로 죽거나, 백화를 막기위해 위험 천만한 "
"여행을 하다 죽는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "497cb666-6b65-48bb-8690-8dad8457153c"
msgid ""
"\"But don't you dare imagine that everything I do is just for fear of the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}! I tell people the truth about the world that "
"surrounds them! My theoretical research aids the development of different "
"branches of science in various institutes! Yes, sooner or later I'll Bleach "
"and die, like any other gnome. But the name of the famous Jubilost "
"Narthropple will live throughout the ages!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 내가 하는 모든 일이 {g|백화}백화{/g}를 두려워해서 한 일이라고 생각하지는 마! 나는 사람들에게 우리를 둘러싼 이 세상에 "
"대해 진실을 말하는거라구! 내 이론적 연구는 여러 연구소에서 다양한 학문의 발전을 돕고있어! 그래, 언젠가는 나도 다른 노움들처럼 백화로 "
"죽게되겠지. 하지만 이 유명한 주빌로스트 나르트로플의 이름은 시대를 초월하여 살아있을꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "db999dc1-7069-40ad-bbda-c4a775e7f6f9"
msgid ""
"\"Well you've asked the right person. I am an expert in studying {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g}. Give me your questions.\""
msgstr "\"제대로 물어 봤구만. 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 연구한 전문가지. 어디 질문해봐. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5f1a6f0b-8a61-4436-ad2c-0fdc2dd0ba22"
msgid ""
"\"It's huge, wild and extremely unfriendly to the unprepared traveler. "
"Nothing remains constant there. Matter changes before your eyes: what was a "
"mountain yesterday becomes a river today – and that river flows upwards. The "
"trees touch the sky. The heat of the desert can melt metal. And hurricane "
"winds can tear a person apart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"준비가 제대로 안된 여행자에게는 너무나 거대하고 거칠고 극도로 불친절한 곳이지. 어떤 것도 남아있지 않고 끊임없이 변화하는 곳. "
"물질들이 바로 눈 앞에서 변하지. 어제의 산이 오늘의 강이 되고 강물은 위로 흐르고 나무는 하늘에 닿아 있지. 사막의 열기는 쇠를 녹이고 "
"돌풍은 사람을 찢어버릴 정도야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1a63a8a1-e50f-4519-b17e-6598dce336e6"
msgid ""
"\"But it would be wrong to think of {g|First World}the First World{/g} as "
"the plane of total destruction. Creation is just as important there. The "
"deserts spring alive into forests, and when the hurricane subsides, animals "
"emerge from hiding – huge, wild, as untamed as the world itself. The First "
"World epitomizes life in its original chaotic meaning.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}가 완전한 파괴만 일어나는 곳은 아니야. 그곳에서도 창조는 마찬가지로 중요하지. "
"사막의 샘이 살아서 숲으로 흘러가고, 돌풍이 잠잠해지고나면 거대하고 야생적인 동물들이 나타나곤 하지. 태초 세계는 본래 혼돈의 의미인 "
"생명을 상징하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ecabace8-d6e5-4f94-8765-925bade71d71"
msgid ""
"\"There's a theory that gods used {g|First World}the First World{/g} as a "
"training ground, to practice their ability to create matter. They then "
"abandoned the First World to its own fate, and wandered off to create "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. Some say that the inhabitants of the First World "
"still hold a grudge against the gods for this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신들이 물질을 창조하는 능력을 사용하기 위해 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 시험장으로 사용했다는 설이 있어. 그런 "
"다음 신들은 태초 세계를 스스로의 운명에 맡긴 채 버려두고는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 창조하기 위해 눈을 돌렸다고 하는군. "
"태초 세계의 사람들이 아직도 이 일로 신들에게 원한을 품고 있다는 말도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d2c9f0fa-d889-435d-a479-aad9f5b65de5"
msgid ""
"\"Mainly through magic portals, created by skilled magicians. But the price "
"of such a portal is usually in excess of several thousand gold coins. There "
"is another way, of course. There are documented cases where spontaneous "
"portals to the First World have opened in remote places on "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, where, as mages say, the boundaries between the "
"two worlds has grown thin.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주로 숙련된 마법사들이 만든 마법 포탈을 통해서 갈수 있지. 하지만 그러한 포탈의 가격은 대개 수천 금화가 넘어. 물론 다른 방법도 "
"있어. 문서화된 사례들에 의하면 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 외진 곳에는 태초 세계로 이어지는 자연적인 포탈 현상들이 있다고 "
"하는데, 마법사의 말로는 두 세계 사이의 경계가 얇아졌다고 하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6688b965-30f8-4c6c-9b73-6dc290b49e21"
msgid ""
"\"But spontaneous portals are rather dangerous. – You never know what's "
"lurking on the other side. Only desperate adventurers and madmen use them – "
"and of course romantic suicidal idiots who think that good common sense is "
"too boring.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 자연생성된 포탈은 오히려 위험할 수있어. 반대편에 무엇이 기다리고 있는지 아무도 모르거든. 필사적인 모험가나 미치광이들이 그런 "
"포탈에 들어가겠지. 물론, 좋은 상식이 너무 지루하다고 생각하는 로맨틱한 자살성향의 천치들이라던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7ff32997-86de-4050-9877-b39861fbf0e5"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. The fey. And all their relatives, and all their relatives' "
"relatives. And then some more fey besides. Sometimes one meets leprechauns "
"or satyrs there – which are actually another type of fey, just called by "
"another name. And all of them are immortal, by the way – at least within in "
"their own home world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이야. 그들은 페이라고 해. 그리고 그들의 친척과 사돈의 팔촌까지, 수많은 페이들이 있겠지. 때때로 레프리콘들이나 사티로스들도 "
"나타난다고는 하는데.. 그들도 페이의 한 종류인데 이름만 다를 뿐이긴하지. 그들 모두가 최소한 그들 세계 안에서는 불멸의 존재야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2f352822-6f6f-457a-86e2-8773c79cbfb5"
msgid ""
"\"The souls of the creatures of {g|First World}the First World{/g} have no "
"connection with the realm of mortals. When a creature of the First World "
"dies, its soul just materializes in another body, similar to its old one. "
"It's not a pleasant experience, and the resurrected creature loses almost "
"all of the powers and abilities it developed over its life, but keeps all "
"its memories and personality. It's still much better than a mortal death, I "
"would say. Sometimes the process doesn't even take long – a killer might "
"meet his victim again the following week.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g} 생명체들의 영혼은 인간들의 영역과는 전혀 연결되어 있지 않아. 태초 세계의 한 생명체가 "
"죽으면, 그 영혼은 예전 육체와 닮은 또다른 육체로 부활하게돼. 부활한 생물은 일생 동안 쌓아온 거의 모든 힘과 능력을 잃지만 모든 "
"기억과 개성은 간직하고 있어. 즐거운 경험은 아니겠지만 그래도 필멸자의 죽음보다는 낫겠지. 때로는 부활 주기가 짧을 때도 있어서, "
"살인자는 오늘 죽인 녀석을 다음 주에 다시 만날 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "838a717b-d712-4111-a822-8f927d0b6823"
msgid ""
"\"Naturally, this immortality has influenced the way First World inhabitants "
"think. For instance, fey enjoy mischief and tricks that can easily end in "
"someone's death. The fey think it's just funny, and anyone from another "
"world, who falls victim to such tricks, doesn't end up having much to say at "
"all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 불멸은 태초 세계 사람들의 사고방식에 자연스럽게 영향을 끼쳤어. 예를 들어, 페이는 쉽게 누군가의 죽음으로 끝나는 장난과 속임수를 "
"즐기곤 하지. 페이들은 그냥 재미 정도로 생각하겠지만 다른 세계의 사람이 그런 장난을 당한 거라면 이제 장난은 끝났다고 말할 수가 "
"없겠지. 이미 말이란걸 할 수가 없게 됐을테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c437d297-788a-4610-8df1-246f848e0a92"
msgid ""
"\"Once, the gnomes were immortal relatives of the fey.\" {n}Jubilost "
"sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"한때는 노움들도 페이의 불멸의 친척들이었지.\" {n}주빌로스트가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0552891e-aa77-43a4-ac35-bbc53f7c3305"
msgid ""
"\"It's commonly assumed that the Eldest rule it. They are overseers, but "
"more just a glorified version of fey lords. Power attracts pompous "
"blockheads in every world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"원로(Eldest)가 통치한다고 추측되고 있어. 그들은 감독관이지만 페이 군주라고 할 수 있어. 어떤 세상이던 권력은 잘난체하는 "
"돌대가리들을 끌어들이는 법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3ea214dc-ad55-4d44-b66e-7d060f32963a"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost stares at you with interest.{/n} \"Yes, yes, duty. Protecting "
"your subjects and restoring order. Objectives so noble I could weep. "
"Unfortunately, noble objectives can coexist perfectly happily with pompous "
"blockheads. Are you quite sure you're not one of those?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 관심을 가지고 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"그래. 그래. 의무. 백성을 보호하고 질서를 회복하는게 너의 의무지. "
"너무나 숭고해서 눈물이 나는군. 불행히도 숭고한 목표는 잘난체하는 돌대가리들에게 딱 어울려. 그런 사람들 중에 하나가 아닌게 확실히 맞아?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "852d131c-88d2-4489-ba77-8f41bff5a989"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost stares at you with interest.{/n} \"Yes, I've met plenty of "
"pompous blockheads who believed they had the right to do whatever hideous "
"thing came to mind. So if you decide to join their ranks, know that you're "
"not the first to walk that path.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 관심을 가지고 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그래. 나는 음흉한 짓을 자기의 권리라고 생각하는 그런 돌대가리들을 많이 "
"만났지. 너도 그렇게 되고 싶은 거 같은데 네가 처음은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1f17e841-808e-4074-9b28-3a720bf5fafb"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost gives you a critical stare.{/n} \"It's fortunate, then, that "
"this problem doesn't trouble your lands at all.\""
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 비판하는 눈초리로 당신을 봅니다..{/n} \"다행히 이 문제가 너의 땅을 괴롭히지는 않겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "87951332-4fff-4c8f-b895-1f042a5ce796"
msgid ""
"\"But let's get back to {g|First World}the First World{/g}. The "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} possess the power to keep matter in the First World in "
"a more or less constant state. That's why the fey treat them as demigods, "
"and offer them prayers, just as we offer prayers to {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} or even {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}의 얘기를 마저 하자구. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 태초 세계의 물질을 일정한 "
"상태로 유지하는 힘을 가지고 있어. 그래서 마치 우리가 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}, {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}, "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 기도하는것 처럼, 페이들도 그들을 반신으로 취급하고 기도드리고 숭배하는거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ada3491c-fdbd-4cf8-81f1-74c97651a3f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost wrinkles his lips.{/n} \"I haven't the opportunity yet. "
"Unfortunately. My studies of the First World are limited to the confused "
"statements of witnesses or scribbles in their diaries. Also I've studied the "
"remains of some unfortunates who periodically fall out of spontaneous "
"portals.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 입술을 오므립니다.{/n} \"나는 아직 기회를 얻지 못했다. 불행한 일이지. 태초 세계에 대한 나의 연구는 목격자의 "
"증언이나 휘갈겨 쓴 기록에 의지하고 있어. 그리고 우연히 열리는 포털에서 튀어나온 시체를 연구하기도 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c3131d95-3e71-4df5-b522-6328e809a01b"
msgid ""
"\"I keep to the hope that sooner or later I'll manage to visit that "
"wonderful place. And certainly the notes I'd write on the place would be far "
"more extensive and informative than all the ramblings on the subject I've "
"had to wade through.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조만간 그 멋진 장소를 가게 될 거란 희망을 버리지는 않았다. 분명히 그 장소에서 쓰게 될 기록은 의자에 앉아 지루하게 써내려간 "
"내용보다는 더 유익할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e90a2f32-f0c1-45c5-83ea-5acdcd1558bb"
msgid ""
"\"Naturally, the main concern of my expedition would be the safety of its "
"leader, namely me. It would be extremely foolish to go that far and see that "
"much, only to lose the chance to tell anyone about it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 내 탐험의 주요 관심사는 대장의 안전. 즉 나의 안전이다. 그렇게 멀리 가서, 그렇게 많은 것을 보는 것은 극도로 어리석은 "
"짓이겠지. 누군가에게 전할 기회까지 놓칠뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d3b2c09f-c69a-49ce-bf52-1e271e4a7a0e"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost looks at you for several moments, his eyes narrow.{/n} \"I told "
"you already, I like to be alive. I assure you, other gnomes share the same "
"attitude. Between the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, disease, and old age, we "
"have a lot to yearn for.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 한동안 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"이미 말했잖아. 난 살아 있는 게 좋다고. 다른 노움들도 같을 "
"거야. {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}, 질병, 노령. 이런 것들 사이에서 우리는 갈망하는 것들이 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c9003e08-ff29-42b4-b665-033652166cc3"
msgid ""
"\"But the ancient gnomes for some reason decided that mortality, the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, and all the diseases of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} "
"are preferable to the immortality of {g|First World}the First World{/g}. I "
"can't do anything to change that. But I can do something with my own life. I "
"want to find a way back to the First World for all the gnomes of Golarion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 무슨 이유에서인지 고대의 노움들은 {g|백화}백화{/g}와 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 얻는 모든 질병들이 {g|"
"First World}태초 세계{/g}의 불멸보다 낫다는 결론을 내렸어. 그 결정을 바꾸기 위해 내가 할 수 있는건 아무것도 없지만, 내 "
"자신의 삶으로는 뭔가를 할 수 있어. 나는 골라리온의 모든 노움들을 위해 태초 세계로 돌아갈 방법을 찾을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b794515c-b0b6-4019-882e-32dcd2719d88"
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately, to do this I can't just gather up all the gnomes and send "
"them marching through the nearest portal. We're too attached to "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} now. We've lost out connection with the chaos of {g|"
"First World}the First World{/g}. We've become too mortal, if you see what I "
"mean. When a gnome dies in the First World, he dies forever, like any "
"visitor. But there must be something that can be done to solve this problem –"
" and I intend to find out what it is!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행히도 모든 노움을 포털을 열어 보낼 수는 없는 노릇이다. 우리는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에 너무나 익숙해져있어. "
"우리와 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}의 혼돈과의 연결은 끊어졌어. 내말이 무슨 뜻인지 이해가지? 우린 너무 필멸자처럼 "
"변해 버렸다는거야. 노움이 태초 세계에서 죽는다면 다른 방문자처럼 영원한 죽음을 맞게 되겠지. 하지만 이것을 풀 실마리가 분명 있을 거고 "
"나는 그것을 찾아낼 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9598b0e9-719b-4c7d-ab34-22eca6ef38f7"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost Narthropple, the hero who returned the gnomes home. It has a nice "
"ring to it, wouldn't you say?\""
msgstr "\"노움을 고향으로 인도한 영웅 주빌로스트 나트로플. 듣기 좋지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "71f426bb-daf3-440a-9e5d-c3b740717b2f"
msgid ""
"\"Do you think so?\" {n}Jubilost looks at you above his glasses.{/n} \"Why "
"ever not, if I may ask? Perhaps you confuse superficially friendly words "
"with genuinely friendly intentions? Believe it or not, I wish you only well. "
"As a proof of that I can point to the fact that I travel with you, and that "
"I'm talking with you right here and now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 생각해?\" {n}주빌로스트는 안경 너머로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내가 물어봐도 될까? 넌 그냥 형식적으로 친근한 말과 "
"진실로 친근한 말을 혼동한 것은 아닐까? 믿거나 말거나 난 네가 잘 되기를 바래. 그 증거로 내가 너와 함께 여행하고 있다는 사실, "
"그리고 바로 지금 여기서 너와 대화하고 있다는 사실을 집어주고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d8a461b8-631a-468a-9f54-c3bae3b9b166"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, which do you value more. – An artificial smile? Or an honest "
"attitude, bolstered by friendly advice and assistance?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 것이 더 좋아? 가식적인 웃음 아니면 친절한 조언을 곁들인 정직한 태도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9ebde818-e295-4640-9c7e-30f1af3f82a7"
msgid ""
"\"Here's another piece of advice, then: you should learn to see the essence "
"rather than being distracted by colorful wrappings. Otherwise you risk "
"swallowing something you shouldn't, because it was wrapped in golden foil.\" "
"{n}Jubilost adjusts his glasses.{/n} \"If you cannot separate the sense of "
"my words from the way they sound, that's not my problem.\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 다른 충고가 있다. 너는 화려한 포장에 현혹되지 말고 사물의 본질을 보아야 해. 그렇지 않으면 너는 허울만 쫓게 될 거야. \" "
"{n}주빌로스트는 안경을 고쳐 씁니다.{/n} \"내 말의 의미와 내 태도를 분리할 수 없다면 어쩔 수 없고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0094_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c237274e-66c2-4090-bab4-c902017c1e21"
msgid ""
"\"That was a joke, right?\" {n}Insult, doubt and resentment chase each other "
"over Jubilost's face. {/n}\"Well, I admit, I may overreact sometimes. "
"Perhaps my manner of speaking may seem offensive to some. But I'm usually "
"right, when you get down to it. And the truth, no matter how unpleasant, is "
"always better than lying to someone's face! We shouldn't let such minor "
"things as my manner of speaking or tonight's dinner harm our friendship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담이지?\" {n}모욕과 의심, 분노가 주빌로스트의 얼굴에 차례로 나타납니다.{/n} \"나는 때때로 과민 반응을 나타낼 수도 "
"있다. 아마도 내 말투가 어떤 사람들에게는 불쾌해 보일지도 모르지만 익숙해지면 내가 옳다는 것을 알게 될 거야. 그리고 사실 아무리 "
"불쾌해도 거짓말보다 낫다. 내 말투가 기분이 나쁘거나 같이 식사를 하다가 의가 상해도 거짓말은 하지 말자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "544f2cc9-2f8e-44a4-b992-862c9732915e"
msgid ""
"\"I thank you for this permission. Can I have it in writing – in case you "
"forget someday?\""
msgstr "\"허락해줘서 고맙구만. 혹시 모르니 기록을 남겨도 될까? 언제 네가 잊을 수도 있잖아\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0099_Text
msgctxt "c82ba3bb-db5a-4f9e-9f92-e079bb324dca"
msgid ""
"\"Trash?!\" {n}Jubilost is so offended, he nearly drops his glasses.{/n} "
"\"Let it be known that this article is one of my finest works! Striking, "
"precise – and exceedingly to the point! You should be proud that your barony "
"inspired such a masterpiece!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쓰레기?!\" {n}주빌로스트는 기분이 상해 안경을 떨어뜨릴 뻔합니다.{/n} \"이 기사는 내 걸작 중의 하나야! 요점이 놀랍고도 "
"정확하다는 평을 듣지! 너희 시민이 이런 걸작을 읽는 게 행운인 줄 알라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "0245fe8a-3ff7-4671-a110-46dda9cbaa9f"
msgid ""
"\"Are you proud that I haven't found anything in your "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} worth my attention? Hmm. Well at least "
"that means that there's nothing truly disastrous in your lands. So yes, "
"perhaps you may be proud of that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너의 {mf|영지|영지|왕국|왕국}에서 관심을 끌만한 것을 발견하지 못했다는 것이 자랑스러운건가? 흠 하긴, 최소한 이곳은 "
"완전히 처참한 수준까진 아니라는 뜻이니까. 그래. 자랑스러워해도돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0101_Text
msgctxt "8a372814-9574-40e1-ae1d-952c48055198"
msgid ""
"\"Flattery is entirely foreign to my works. Everything that I write is the "
"absolute truth, and never intended to satisfy egos.\" {n}Jubilost looks at "
"you over his glasses.{/n} \"But in case you were wondering – yes, I'm "
"impressed with what you've done.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 작품에 아첨을 싣는 일은 없다. 내가 쓴 글은 모두 사실이고 나를 만족시키기 위해 쓰지 않았다.\" {n}주빌로스트가 안경 너머로 "
"당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"하지만 궁금해하는 것 같으니 말해주지. 네가 한 일에 감탄했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "29430f85-8e5d-41ee-9895-dd9385f19b82"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"Oh? Have you thought this idea through?"
"\""
msgstr "{n}노움은 눈썹을 올립니다.{/n} \"오? 이 아이디어를 생각해 봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a04ec2c7-5920-4377-a80a-a966a7543ba7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost chuckles.{/n} \"Next time you should pay more attention to your "
"ramblings. I've gotten quite used to them already, but the others might be "
"puzzled.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n} \"다음에는 네가 하는 얘기에 좀 더 신경쓰라고. 그것에 대해선 이미 익숙하지만 다른 사람은 "
"혼란스러워할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b5127722-5870-4d8b-97c4-997915826ba0"
msgid ""
"\"Well well. It's not the first time I've been asked to leave a state, so I "
"shouldn't be surprised. But now I feel that straying so far from "
"civilization was a mistake. There's nothing here worth my time or talent. "
"Good luck with your little plot of dirt.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐. 떠나라는 얘기를 들은 건 한두번이 아니니 놀랍지도 않다. 하지만 문명과 떨어져 지낸다는 것은 고통스럽다. 내 재능을 펼칠 공간이 "
"없으니. 잘해봐라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0109_Text
msgctxt "60190069-4815-4e1c-96b9-f6a53f2f4842"
msgid ""
"\"{Name}! I never properly thanked you for your help at the Inconsequent "
"Debates. I'm happy to do so now. I hope you don't think me entirely "
"ungrateful.\""
msgstr ""
"\" {Name}! 비논리 토론회에서 도와주었는데 고맙다는 얘기를 못했군. 이제야 만나서 다행이야. 내가 배은망덕한 녀석이라고 생각하지 "
"말기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "427dc0b6-0e34-4810-9f0a-3e12464ff632"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to apologize for destroying my chance at solving the greatest "
"mystery of our era – then don't bother. And if you think you were right "
"about everything – well then I'm even less inclined to talk about it.\""
msgstr "\"나의 일을 방해한 것에 사과하고 싶다면 그러지 않아도 된다. 네가 무조건 옳다고 생각했다면 너와 얘기할 가치조차 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0114_Text
msgctxt "94da5871-bcbb-4a67-aa15-766cf72ac0e4"
msgid ""
"\"Not quite, but I'm working on it. I'll certainly inform you of my "
"findings. I must admit, such an answer is quite in the spirit of the fey. It "
"must lead somewhere, and I will find the trail!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀 아니지만, 연구 중이야. 내 연구 결과를 확실히 알려줄게. 그것은 페이의 영혼에 달려있어. 그것은 어딘가로 인도하고 나는 그 "
"흔적을 찾을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0118_Text
msgctxt "4c81d8b0-3dcd-4e50-b718-d83e4f82c98b"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm...\" {n}Jubilost locks his hands behind his back.{/n} \"Well you "
"see... I understand well what the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} is, what a "
"fatal effect it has on gnomes. Those poor fellows were acting like that for "
"no darker motive than desperation. Their foolish jokes allow them to live "
"just a little bit longer. Do you see? I don't mind becoming the joke myself –"
" for a while, of course, and not if my life was being threatened. It let "
"someone live a couple days longer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠...\" {n}주빌로스트는 뒷짐을 집니다.{/n} \"글쎄... 나는 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}가 무엇인지, 왜 노움에게 "
"치명적인지 잘 알고 있어. 거기에 걸린 불쌍한 친구들은 절망에 빠져 무기력해지지. 농담을 하며 지내도 오래가지 못해. 알겠어? 나는 "
"잠깐만 지속되고, 내 생명이 위협을 받지 않는 이상 웃음거리가 되어도 신경쓰지 않아. 이것으로 누군가의 수명을 조금 더 연장할 수 "
"있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0119_Text
msgctxt "d3ac1628-e2d0-49bc-badb-56f51118701c"
msgid "\"As you wish. I'll continue to work on the riddle.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로. 나는 수수께끼를 계속 알아볼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0124_Text
msgctxt "eacd9980-4f72-42ed-986d-8d5b7f762a04"
msgid ""
"\"Stop, or you'll make me blush.\" {n}Jubilost folds his hands over his "
"chest with a contented look.{/n}"
msgstr "\"멈춰. 부끄럽군.\" {n}주빌로스트는 만족스런 모습으로 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0125_Text
msgctxt "415bc8f0-4008-4a75-b1f4-3d672e198142"
msgid ""
"\"So you think you could resist the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} and preserve "
"your 'dignity'? Very well, let's revisit the topic when it's time for one of "
"us to fight for our lives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 {g|백화}백화{/g}의 징후에 저항하고 네 존엄성을 지킬 수 있다고? 너나 나에게 '노화'의 징후가 나타날 때 다시 얘기하자."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0126_Text
msgctxt "d4df1f90-3143-422f-9e91-601a5db10992"
msgid ""
"\"I'd be the last to promote thoughtless altruism, but your viewpoint "
"doesn't resonate with me. Some degree of self-sacrifice and cooperation "
"forms the basis of society. Take that away, and you destroy civilization. "
"It's as simple as that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 이타심이 많은 노움이지만 너의 견해는 공감이 가지 않는다. 어느정도 자기 희생을 하고 협조하는 태도는 사회의 기초가 된다. "
"그것이 없다면 너는 문명인이 아니야. 전혀 어렵지 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0127_Text
msgctxt "45be3136-c4f1-4d94-97af-f3f3f1480139"
msgid ""
"\"I might listen to this valuable advice if it came from someone who had the "
"slightest understanding of the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"{g|백화}백화{/g}의 이해가 전혀 없는 누군가의 견해라면 들어볼 수도 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0129_Text
msgctxt "92a45ed3-a64a-4a45-8073-a350c06d09bc"
msgid ""
"\"Let me see!\" {n}Jubilost stares into the pages.{/n} \"It's a good thing "
"I'm not a follower of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, or I'd throw this thing into the "
"fire right now, and draw the deity's wrath. Just look at this language! "
"'Shivering, she clang to my shoulder and whispered, 'Willas, you are my only "
"hope! Only your well-developed adventuring skills, your daring mind, "
"merciless eloquence, and shameless courage can save a poor girl like me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어디 보자!\" {n}주빌로스트가 책을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 추종자가 아니어서 다행이군. "
"아니면 이 물건을 불에 던졌을 거야. 내용을 봐봐! '떨면서 그녀는 내 어깨에 달라붙어 속삭인다. 윌라스. 네가 나의 유일한 희망이야! "
"너희 능력과 대담한 용기와 네 언변으로 나처럼 연약한 소녀를 구해줘!'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0131_Text
msgctxt "d9b4a6e9-f8e0-4017-b3c1-d0e20f616d52"
msgid ""
"\"The twenty fourth? Like the Moon from the riddle – it's a name, Luna? The "
"fey, damn them! We can talk about it in more detail, but for now – let's "
"hurry to the tavern! We need to catch this Luna and figure out what her "
"connection is to the riddle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"24일? 달에 관한 수수께끼 같군. 루나는 이름인가? 오. fey였어. 젠장! 더 자세히 얘기하고 싶지만 지금은 주점으로 어서 가자! "
"이 루나라는 녀석을 잡아 수수께끼의 연관성을 알아내야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0132_Text
msgctxt "2d27ed59-b9c6-471b-8127-22809446c787"
msgid ""
"\"The twenty fourth? Like the Moon from the riddle – it's a name, Luna? Damn "
"it all, we're too late! We can hardly figure out how to proceed if we fail "
"to solve this part. Although... perhaps it wasn't about a specific twenty "
"fourth, just about the twenty fourth of each month – twelve in twelve!\""
msgstr ""
"\"24일? 달에 관한 수수께끼 같군. 루나는 이름인가? 우리는 너무 늦었어! 이 부분을 풀지 못하면 영영 풀지 못할 거야! 그래도... "
"어떤 24일인지 알려주는 것이 아니니 매달 24일이 해당된다. 12번의 기회가 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0133_Text
msgctxt "cd11a4f8-d295-4486-979b-3f41e8127032"
msgid ""
"\"I have no idea who or what would visit the same place one the same day "
"each month, but... we need to follow this through! Let's meet at the tavern "
"on the twenty fourth – and hope Luna will be there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 매달 같은 날에 방문하는지 모르겠지만... 이 단서를 쫓아야 해! 주점에서 24일에 만나자. 루나가 거기에 있기를 바라자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0134_Text
msgctxt "e7ca6999-7283-47b2-b61c-5ac26f2a5dbf"
msgid ""
"\"But I digress. We need something that's 'fifth in ten', obviously it's "
"about the fifth adventure from this book. The name of the chapter is 'In the "
"corner of the tavern'. Sounds like a place, but which tavern is it? The "
"nearest one? And who or what should we look for there... Wait!\n"
"We know the place – the tavern, and a number – twenty four.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주제에서 벗어나는 말이지만. 10번째가 되기 전 5번째 라는 것은 이 책의 다섯번째 여행을 의미하는 것이 틀림없어. 이 장의 제목은 "
"'주점 구석에서'야. 어떤 장소 같지만 어느 술집인가? 가장 가까운 곳일까? 거기서 누구를 찾아야 하지... 잠깐!\n"
"우리는 그 주점과 숫자 24의 정체를 알고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0135_Text
msgctxt "a6071cdf-6698-46f9-ad16-bd1382c06e82"
msgid ""
"\"You reasonably assumed that twenty four is the day of the month. We have a "
"time and a place!\""
msgstr "\"너는 자연스럽게 24가 날짜라고 생각했어. 우리는 시간과 장소를 알아냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0136_Text
msgctxt "610d32b4-3a0c-4007-ad24-8d2ff420063e"
msgid ""
"\"We can suppose that it's a place and a time – or rather a date. The twenty "
"four that's contained 'a dozen times in a dozen' is the twenty fourth of "
"each month.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 시간과 장소라고 추측할 수 있어. 아마 시간이겠지. '열 두번의 기회'에 담겨있는 24는 매달 24일이라는 의미야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0137_Text
msgctxt "762fba34-67cb-46ae-8825-85628b3c8885"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost greets you with unusual hospitality.{/n} \"{name}! I'm happy to "
"see you. We haven't talked much about our adventure by the "
"{g|Candlemere}Candlemere{/g}... You know, I'm even sad that everything is "
"over. Not only because I didn't find a way to help all the gnomes. It's just "
"that another mystery is behind me, another road had ended... But it was a "
"wonderful journey – and in good company!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 평소와 다르게 당신을 환영합니다.{/n} \" {name}! 널 봐서 기뻐. 우리는 "
"{g|Candlemere}캔들미어{/g}에서 우리의 여행에 대해 이야기를 나누지 않았다. 모든 것이 끝나 슬프군. 모든 노움을 도울 "
"방법을 찾지 못할 뿐만 아니라 내가 모르는 미스터리가 존재한다는 것이. 하지만 놀라운 여행이었어! 좋은 동료도 있었고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0138_Text
msgctxt "3b498efc-1212-45b7-81ec-681fce831b91"
msgid "\"Of course. An exciting topic of conversation, isn't it?\""
msgstr "\"물론. 흥미로운 주제가 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0143_Text
msgctxt "4ca65080-838b-4ea7-a5a5-d98187ec051d"
msgid "\"Of course! I'd be happy to talk.\""
msgstr "\"물론! 대화해서 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0144_Text
msgctxt "09a658c0-e2e1-448c-abb0-20a694032543"
msgid ""
"\"I hope my humble talents will be of use to you and your kingdom. Clearly "
"it could do with the help of an expert in {g|First World}the First World{/g}"
". So I'll be around while I can be useful. Then I'll probably set off on "
"another journey. The world is a big place, and there are many more secrets "
"to be found!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너에게 도움이 되길 바란다. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g} 전문가가 있어야 도움이 될 거야. 내가 도움이 되는 한 "
"너의 옆에 있을 것이다. 나는 또 다른 여행을 떠날 수 있겠지. 그 세계는 광활한 곳이니 우리를 기다리는 비밀이 많을 거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0145_Text
msgctxt "938bb612-3247-4e53-bb87-6331a3987e32"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost sighs heavily.{/n} \"The games of the gods, and the games of the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. How little we matter, in the clash of powers of such "
"scale – it boggles the mind. But at least now I know the secret.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다..{/n} \"신들의 놀이이자 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 놀이이지. 그런 엄청난 힘들이 "
"충돌한다면 우리는 작아보일 거야. 아찔하겠지. 하지만, 적어도 지금은 비밀을 알게 되었어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0146_Text
msgctxt "49208411-7470-44d5-8289-442951498983"
msgid ""
"\"And I can boast that I turned into a huge frog to win a secret from a "
"demigod from another world!\""
msgstr "\"거대한 개구리로 변해 이세계의 반신의 정보를 얻었다는 것을 자랑할 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0147_Text
msgctxt "3d7df789-6ff9-40e9-8c6b-8cd0e124665f"
msgid "\"And I can't say the word 'tentacles' without shivering.\""
msgstr "\"나는 '촉수'라는 말을 하면 겁이 나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0148_Text
msgctxt "e2a37c94-33cf-43ed-bf6d-93a807628c84"
msgid ""
"\"And I feel more lenient towards people who SUDDENLY START SCREAMING!\""
msgstr "\"나는 갑자기 소리지르는 녀석들에게 관대하다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0149_Text
msgctxt "c3f54bb4-9dac-4979-b7a2-4307b94ceacb"
msgid ""
"\"Admit it, you had a bit of fun back there, didn't you? Don't tell anyone, "
"but I did too! What an amazing adventure. Allow me to say in all sincerity, "
"I'm glad that fate brought us together, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기서 재미있었지? 아무에게도 말하지 마. 나도 말하지 않았으니! 정말 놀라운 여행이었어. 솔직히 너와 함께하게 되어 기쁘다. "
"{name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0150_Text
msgctxt "04b44c98-cae5-4522-a960-886afb3c502e"
msgid ""
"\"Which is today! Lucky us! I suggest we don't delay and go straight away to "
"the tavern. We need to verify our assumptions before it's too late!\""
msgstr "\"바로 오늘이야! 행운이군! 지체하지 말고 바로 주점에 가자. 늦기 전에 가정을 검증하자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0151_Text
msgctxt "5b158de2-b752-4818-bb8d-0a056f8a4042"
msgid ""
"\"I propose we meet at the capital tavern on the next twenty fourth. – And "
"see what happens!\""
msgstr "\"다음 24일에 수도의 주점에서 만나자. 무슨 일이 일어날지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0153_Text
msgctxt "ee3cf506-eb56-4a49-b36e-e0ad69bdf201"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, Jubilost's sardonic look becomes a bit warmer.{/n} \"Ah, a "
"fellow worshipper of the Great Dreamer! Glad to hear it. Most leaders I know "
"have zero ability to dream!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트의 냉소적인 표정이 잠시나마 따뜻해집니다.{/n} \"오. 위대한 몽상가 숭배자가 나타났군! 그 말을 들어서 기뻐. 내가 "
"아는 지도자 녀석들은 꿈꾸는 능력이 0이었거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0156_Text
msgctxt "174c4cd5-7b85-44d0-bd1a-926e203ff088"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost chuckles awkwardly and pauses.{/n} \"Then there's no point in me "
"adding anything. Historic records show few cases of gnomes dying from old "
"age. Most die young, either from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} or during "
"some insane adventure meant to overcome it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 어색하게 웃으며 잠시 멈춥니다.{/n} \"나에겐 아무 의미 없어. 역사에 의하면 소수의 노움만이 늙어죽는다. 대부분 "
"어릴 때 죽거나 {g|백화}백화{/g}로 혹은 그것을 극복하기 위해 미친 짓거리를 하다가 죽지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Jubilost/VS_Jubilost_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0162_Text
msgctxt "b1d86502-728f-45c5-bd8d-faad89d32cd0"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost sighs.{/n} \"This is certainly not the most insane adventure to "
"be started by a gnome fighting off the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}. Well, "
"good luck fighting the humdrum of administration as well!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"노움이 {g|백화}백화{/g}의 징후와 싸우기 위한 여행치고는 그다지 정신나간 짓이 아니야. "
"그런 따분한 정부와 싸우다니 운이 좋기도 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c565f7a6-94f8-48e8-ad3e-199213f9a06c"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "69eb2f55-1bc9-445c-99b5-952a85eb5f05"
msgid "\"Leave and do not return. I don't want to ever see you again.\""
msgstr "\"떠나서 돌아오지 마라. 너를 다시는 보고 싶지않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "66153143-6d99-45f3-9b56-42e38b530925"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3c5ed105-70a4-4514-8b4e-5c8dcc880a53"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "4d67db61-d424-4dfc-9a7b-57e2d35091bb"
msgid "\"Who was your teacher?\""
msgstr "\"너의 스승은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b57fca8f-883f-4aa4-9854-b87711e82e60"
msgid "\"How did you become a bard?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 바드가 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "8514f105-25a9-4546-9009-56f18fddf5b6"
msgid "\"Why are your clothes so messy?\""
msgstr "\"옷은 왜 그렇게 더러운 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "a221bd09-c25b-47b1-afa4-9bb255a15618"
msgid "\"Let me ask you about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 걸 물어 볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "455900f0-4c18-41d2-9736-e5dc3e00e3f0"
msgid "\"You come from Pitax, right? Tell me about it.\""
msgstr "\"너 피탁스에서 왔지? 그것에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "09d2b79f-bdd5-4d8a-a261-f2ffcff5e887"
msgid "\"What is life in Pitax like?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스에서의 삶은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5b18391d-fa7a-4aa3-97b8-838a40f22076"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Academy you studied at.\""
msgstr "\"네가 다녔었던 아카데미에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "6d215dbe-bf41-4a5f-85e8-9c4156a029c4"
msgid "\"What do you know of King Irovetti?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티 왕에 대해 무엇을 알고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "4c1c1103-b0d6-416d-9d62-84cc925b308e"
msgid "\"Would you like to go back to the Academy and finish your studies?\""
msgstr "\"아카데미로 돌아가서 공부를 끝낼 생각은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "6e48c1fa-c7a1-437f-830c-a34bac564de7"
msgid "\"Tell me about that book you're writing.\""
msgstr "\"너가 쓰고 있는 책에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "dff2c9b6-0584-4193-bcc6-3bae5dc67afb"
msgid "\"No offense, but your command of language is not that good.\""
msgstr "\"불쾌하게 할 생각은 없는데 네 언어 능력은 별로인 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "317b67b2-1c23-491b-afca-8bf1f46c1e1c"
msgid "\"So, what kind of a character am I?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 나는 어떤 인물이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "e1d42614-9988-4c25-aaa7-47cb94e9b0ac"
msgid "\"Why are you writing it? What's the point?\""
msgstr "\"왜 넌 글을 쓰는거지? 무슨 의미가 있어? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "bea0cd7c-bdf8-4890-8849-9607ff3bba6d"
msgid "\"Do you worship Shelyn?\""
msgstr "\"넌 셸린을 숭배해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "2c420fb9-8030-49f0-a855-2b4c9fcfe7a3"
msgid "\"How do you feel about me reading your work in progress?\""
msgstr "\"네가 쓰고 있는 책을 읽는 것에 대해 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0075_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "32cc3ef0-af6e-4d61-9ffb-7c0d6ef9cc1a"
msgid "Told Linzi your opinion on her freedom of speech."
msgstr "린지에게 언론의 자유에 대한 당신의 의견을 전했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "0e10ce69-0ef9-4d61-bad7-37a83c69889b"
msgid "\"As long as you write the truth, I have no objection.\""
msgstr "\"진실을 쓰는 한 반대할 이유가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "6d64f169-b3d2-4f4f-98d2-07c42c8b1855"
msgid ""
"\"Write whatever you wish. I doubt you would defame me, or, for that matter, "
"over-praise.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원하는 대로 적어. 네가 나를 훼방하거나 과대평가 하지는 않을 거라 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "96e4e0f0-9e20-43f5-bdcf-2d636cd447df"
msgid ""
"\"Write whatever you wish – it's your right. But I shall decide if your book "
"is allowed on my lands.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원하는 대로 적어. 그건 너의 권리야. 하지만 너의 책이 내 땅에서 출간되는 것은 별개고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "a7723278-4b1c-4283-8e34-25567d4b4c56"
msgid "\"I will be remembered for my deeds, not for your book.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 책이 아니라 내 업적으로 기억될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "8a75feb7-7e94-46e7-b0ae-6f722b46fd9c"
msgid ""
"\"I have no interest in censorship! Any stories about me are welcome as long "
"as they're interesting!\""
msgstr "\"나는 검열에 관심 없어! 재밌게 쓰기만 하면 상관없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "97409ca6-65d6-4607-9d30-b9b686a22d96"
msgid "\"I'd rather have a say in how my biography turns out.\""
msgstr "\"내 전기가 어떻게 바뀌었는지 얘기하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "7e89ec90-6f25-444a-aa70-d4d31a833ad5"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, you can write whatever you want... But you know what happens to "
"writers who displease their rulers!\""
msgstr "\"물론. 마음대로 써도 되... 하지만 통치자를 불쾌하게 하는 작가에게 무슨 일이 일어나는지는 알게 되겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "0652a712-e9d8-4705-8a3b-b5d3e0714792"
msgid "\"Your book is full of inconsistencies!\""
msgstr "\"너의 책은 모순투성이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "6f44dd03-a9f0-45bd-b34e-5af58d3314ff"
msgid "\"How's your publishing house?\""
msgstr "\"너희 출판사는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "32eea228-eff3-460c-b773-0aaa4669b5fc"
msgid "\"How's the book about the academy coming along?\""
msgstr "\"아카데미에 관한 책은 어떻게 나와?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "52b2fb8d-c021-4d1d-b212-f5beadab72f3"
msgid "\"Do you know now what your calling as a bard is?\""
msgstr "\"너가 왜 바드라고 불리는지 이제 알 것 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "2138a32a-bf83-4197-bf30-a979c3c19397"
msgid "\"Tell me about your friendship with Tessie the Quill.\""
msgstr "\"깃털같은 테시와의 우정에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0113_Text
msgctxt "dca431b7-d83f-4bc1-a619-e7325b60bcc6"
msgid "\"Have you noticed anything strange about Valerie lately?\""
msgstr "\"최근에 발레리에 대해 이상한 것은 없었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0116_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f1a20106-c17d-41f7-9497-07cb55d926f7"
msgid "Disapproved of Valerie's attack on Linzi's work."
msgstr "린지의 작품에 대한 발레리의 공격을 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0116_Text
msgctxt "39d0e96d-436f-4c09-94b8-25a505e4b8d6"
msgid "\"How could she hurt you like that?!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그녀가 그런 식으로 네게 상처줄 수 있는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0117_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f994a061-8db3-477f-b122-ffc7c7e7b488"
msgid "Judged Valerie and Linzi's argument as a misunderstanding."
msgstr "발레리와 린지의 논쟁은 오해로부터 비롯된 거라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "50590d68-6d2e-4643-b41c-70a6143ac7ce"
msgid ""
"\"She shouldn't have said that. But perhaps you shouldn't have picked on her."
"\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 그렇게 말하지 말았어야 했어. 하지만 너도 괴롭혀서는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0118_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3a0e4e04-af28-448c-8bbd-34713c883eb3"
msgid "Agreed with Valerie's attack on Linzi's work."
msgstr "린지의 작품을 비난한 발레리의 공격에 동의했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0118_Text
msgctxt "c4e4c23e-379a-4fe2-bf02-c2ba9b598603"
msgid "\"I completely agree with her.\""
msgstr "\"나는 발레리의 말이 옳다고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0126_Text
msgctxt "8e477f9e-c222-424e-9e6c-7d581f25b37a"
msgid "\"Archknights of Avistan? Who are they?\""
msgstr "\"아비스탄의 아크나이트? 그게 누군데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Answer_0129_Text
msgctxt "9ac1c0cc-1081-4e82-ba30-d362e7b18b7f"
msgid "\"What's the deal with the ring you always wear on your finger?\""
msgstr "\"항상 손가락에 착용하는 반지는 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1c5443b8-c36b-43fe-9520-e4c74f7352a9"
msgid ""
"{n}A halfling girl with tousled hair, wearing a dusty traveler's outfit, "
"sits chewing the tip of her quill.{/n} \"Just a moment... How should I put "
"this... Oh, I know!\" {n}She scribbles something quickly in a notebook "
"scrawled with verse, raises her eyes and gives you a bright smile.{/n} \"Oh, "
"hi!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}머리가 헝클어진 하플링 소녀가 먼지 투성이 여행자복을 입은 채 깃펜 끝을 물고 앉아 있습니다.{/n} \"잠시만... 이걸 어떻게 "
"표현한다... 아! 맞다!\" {n}그녀는 글씨로 뒤죽박죽이 된 노트에 무언가를 빠르게 휘갈기고는 눈을 들어 밝은 미소를 보냅니다.{/n}"
" \"오, 안녕하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "0c32e638-841a-4270-89ed-86214d07da4b"
msgid "\"What do you want to know?\""
msgstr "\"무엇이 궁금하신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "ff5505f5-4b7d-4d16-81f5-08fc4013d5fd"
msgid ""
"\"How typical! That's the fate of the talented – to be ever persecuted by "
"people of power... Ha ha ha! No, you aren't going to get rid of me, so long "
"as my book is unfinished! Even if you throw me out, I'll sit in a tavern and "
"write, and write, and write some more... And can you imagine what I'll write "
"about you if you throw me out?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 전형적이네요! 그게 재능있는 사람의 운명이에요. 권력자에게 시달리는 거요... 하하하! 아뇨. 당신은 저를 내칠 수 없을걸요! "
"제 책이 완성되기 전까지는요! 저를 쫓아내도 전 주점에 앉아 글을 쓰고 또 쓰고 또 쓰고... 그리고 당신이 절 쫓아내면 당신에 대해 "
"뭐라고 쓸지 걱정되지 않나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "8f8318a6-23ee-47ea-8ee9-946ce3e57feb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm from all over, ha ha! I was actually born in {g|Galt}Galt{/g} – in "
"such a tiny village that it's not even on the maps. If it weren't for my "
"teacher, I'd still be living there – milking goats, weeding turnips, "
"swilling homebrew, having babies, and using books only as kindling.\""
msgstr ""
"\"골라리온이 제 고향이죠! 하하! 사실 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 태어났어요. 지도에는 보이지도 않는 코딱지만 한 마을이죠. 제 "
"스승님만 아니었다면 계속 거기서 살고 있었을 거예요. 염소젖을 짜고 잡초를 뽑고 술을 빚고 아이를 낳고 책을 불쏘시개로 쓰면서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "128aea56-675a-443a-966e-9d7a22700261"
msgid ""
"\"He's a true saint. He was once an important person in the capital, at the "
"church of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}. But he got in trouble with the authorities "
"and went on a self-imposed exile – to the tiniest, most godsforsaken, "
"priestless village he could find. – The one where I was born.\""
msgstr ""
"\"성자 같은 분이에요. 한때 수도에 위치한 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 교회에서 높은 자리를 지내셨죠. 하지만 당국과 문제가 생겨 "
"다른 나라로 망명해야 했고, 사제 따위는 눈 씻고 찾아볼 수도 없는 작은 마을로 오게 되었지요. 제가 태어난 곳으로 말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "8d3b93eb-eee3-463c-848e-ce5c9c59cd37"
msgid ""
"\"When I realized there was nothing for me at home besides more radish "
"patches, I decided to run away. A traveling book peddler, Tessie the Quill, "
"happened across our village. Well, I stuck to her like a bur and wouldn't "
"let go until she agreed to take me as an apprentice. Together we traveled "
"everywhere – to {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, and {g|Taldor}Taldor{/g}, and even "
"{g|Ustalav}Ustalav{/g}. And then I found out about the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy of Grand Arts{/g} in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and I thought: well, I "
"love reading stories, so I can surely learn to write them too! I enrolled on "
"my first try, and they even gave me a scholarship! Then they expelled me, ha "
"ha, but that's okay. They'd already taught me all the important stuff. And "
"now, with {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} help, I can manage on my own!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무 쪼가리 밖에 없는 이 집엔 진정으로 저를 위한게 하나도 없다는걸 깨닫자마자 가출을 결심했죠. 떠돌이 책팔이꾼인 깃털같은 캐시가 "
"우리 마을을 지나갈 때 저 좀 데려가 달라고 억지를 부렸어요. 그렇게 그녀와 함께 이곳 저곳을 떠돌아 다녔죠. "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}와 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}, 심지어는 {g|Ustalav}우스탈라브{/g}까지요! 그리고 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 있는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 알게 됐고 전 생각했죠. "
"'나는 이야기 읽는 걸 좋아하니까, 쓰는 법도 분명히 잘 배울 수 있겠지?' 하구요! 한번 시험을 봤는데 장학금까지 받았어요! 그리고 절 "
"퇴학시켰죠. 하하. 하지만 그건 괜찮아요. 이미 중요한건 다 배웠으니까요. 그리고 이젠 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}님의 가호 아래서 "
"혼자서도 잘 할 수 있어요!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6875eded-8fef-4dac-9555-6ec74734e183"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi waves her hand carelessly.{/n} \"Forget it, I can't waste money on "
"looks! I'd rather buy books instead. In a hundred years, when people are "
"reading my works, they aren't going to ask whether the author had holes in "
"her sleeves!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 손을 무심하게 흔듭니다.{/n} \"신경 쓰지 마세요. 외모에 돈을 낭비할 여유 없어요! 그런 거 대신 책을 사는 게 훨씬 "
"나으니까요. 백 년 뒤에 사람들이 제 작품을 읽으면서 그 작가가 소매에 구멍이 났는지 궁금해하진 않을 거잖아요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "c014b9d4-6d1d-4d50-b82a-34a530483d36"
msgid "\"Of course, please ask! I'd be happy to chat all day!\""
msgstr "\"얼마든지 물어보세요! 하루 종일 수다를 떨면 좋겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "137f1dcb-812e-445b-a9d6-e0f6ea53f2a1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I love {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, even though they kicked me out. A joyful "
"place!\""
msgstr "\"오. 전 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 정말 좋아해요. 비록 그들이 저를 쫓아냈지만. 즐거운 곳이었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "a0d3f1fb-b987-4401-a74c-52311da83384"
msgid ""
"\"Actually {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} has always been one huge nest of thieves. "
"Bandits, river pirates, smugglers, fences, cardsharps – it's always been "
"home for the likes of them. But that was before Irovetti became king. With "
"him, a whole different life began there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 도적 소굴이었죠. 산적, 수적, 밀수꾼, 장물아비, 사기꾼... 그런 사람들의 안식처였달까요? 하지만 "
"이로베티가 왕이 되고 나서는 완전히 달라졌죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "84dcee1e-ebec-431b-9a8a-cbbc87887f46"
msgid ""
"\"He won his crown in a game of cards! – Which says as much about "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} as it does about him. He's fiendishly clever – some "
"cheats I know told me that from the moment he appeared, he started to "
"pulling off such schemes that the old city masters just scratched their "
"heads. With him in charge, gold flooded into Pitax. And also... He's "
"incredibly, unimaginably, fantastically decadent and conceited!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 왕이 되었는지 아세요? 카드 게임에서 이겼대요! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 사람이 다 그렇죠. 굉장히 영악한 사람이에요. "
"듣기로는 도시에 들어서자마자 피탁스를 집어삼킬 계획을 세웠대요. 늙은 도시 주인들은 그냥 머리만 긁고 있었죠. 왕이 된 후에는 피탁스에 "
"금이 넘쳐흘렀고요. 또... 엄청나게 퇴폐적이고, 오만한 사람이래요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "3066413c-bc6c-459a-9dfe-1da546bd1b25"
msgid ""
"\"You know, jokes aside, I'm thankful to Irovetti for building it... but... "
"he has no taste! At all! Whatsoever! He likes his art loud, bright, "
"grandiose, and most importantly – glorifying his royal highness! He kicked "
"out the best charcoal artist, because he 'didn't wish to spend money on gray "
"scribbles!' He sacked a masterful flute-player from Tian Xia for playing too "
"quietly! – And instead ordered them to open a kettle-drum class! He even... "
"He even ordered the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} to expel me – and "
"for what?! An innocent limerick!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 그 학교를 지어준 건 고맙지만... 예술 감각이 너무 끔찍하게 없어요! 전혀요! 그는 크고, 삐까번쩍하고, 웅장하며 자신의 "
"왕실을 찬양하는 예술을 사랑했죠. 반면에 회색 낙서는 싫어한다며 최고의 숯 예술가를 쫓아냈죠. 또 조용하게 연주한다고 티옌 샤의 유명한 "
"플루트 연주자를 쫓아낸 대신 주전자 드럼 교실을 열도록 명령했다구요! 심지어 그는... {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 "
"예술 아카데미{/g}에서 절 쫓아냈어요! 뭘 위해서?! 겨우 시 때문에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "ed01d0fc-039a-45f1-aa45-3c53999267a5"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to return, but on one condition: if they threw out three quarters "
"of the professors who teach there now, and returned all the ones they "
"banished! If you ask me, I'm proud to have been expelled! If my art was to "
"Irovetti's liking – then I would have reason to be ashamed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 돌아간다면 한 가지 조건이 있어요. 현재 아카데미에서 강의하는 교수의 4분의 3을 내쫓고, 이로베티가 쫓아낸 티교수를 전부 복직 "
"시켜줄 것! 아카데미에서 퇴학당한 걸 자랑스러워 해야겠네요! 제 작품이 이로베 왕의 마음에 들었다면, 그거야말로 제 인생에 수치였을 "
"테니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "de5d923a-765d-48b5-ae84-64fd7f646c19"
msgid ""
"\"He wanted to open a school, but the villagers wouldn't let him. 'You can "
"heal us all you like, but no putting any ideas into our children's heads – "
"it'll only distract them from their work!' But he did teach me on the sly. "
"He taught me how to read, how to write, and he gave me books — poems "
"legends... He was the one who told me about the Archknights of "
"{g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}! And when I told him I was going on a journey, he "
"gave a magic ring so that {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} would protect me from harm.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그분은 학교를 열고 싶어 했지만 마을 사람들이 반대했어요. 치료는 고마운데, 아이들에게 괜한 바람을 불어넣지 말라면서요! 그래도 몰래 "
"저를 가르쳐주셨죠. 제게 읽는 법, 쓰는 법을 가르쳤고, 시집과 설화집을 선물해주셨어요. 제게 {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g}의 "
"아크나이트 이야기를 들려준 것도 그분이세요! 제가 여행을 떠나겠다고 했을 때는 마법 반지를 주셨죠. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}께서 "
"너를 보호하실 거라고 말씀해주시면서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b611dff8-381d-4306-ac38-6422e2d50747"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti always wanted to make history, but not as another bandit with a "
"crown. – Though that's exactly what he is, ha ha! He wanted to be glorified "
"through the centuries as a great patron of the arts. So he built the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy of Grand Arts{/g} and spent lots of gold to "
"assemble the best artists, poets, and musicians. Of course, the very best "
"ones refused to go, but he got what he wanted in a way. If {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}"
" was once just a booze barn for thieves, now it's a cabaret!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티는 자기가 역사에 쓰여지길 원했지만, 왕관 쓴 도적으로 쓰이길 원하진 않았어요.물론 그는 왕관 쓴 도적이지만요! 하하! "
"수세기에 걸쳐 예술의 위대한 후원자로 미화되고 싶어했죠. 그래서 그는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}"
"를 짓고 최고의 예술가, 시인, 음악가를 모으기 위해 많은 돈을 소비했죠. 물론 진짜 훌륭한 사람들은 그 돈을 거절했지만... 오히려 "
"그가 원하는 사람들을 얻은 거 같아요. 예전의 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 싸구려 술집이라면 지금은 카바레니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "cebba8de-6c2a-45d2-991b-4ffb139aa1c2"
msgid ""
"\"Getting drunk with whores at the pub – that's not Lord Irovetti's style, "
"oh no! He aims higher! Dressing up like a male {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} "
"with a golden codpiece, and holding a three week orgy, with dancing on the "
"rooftops, parades, public executions, and a contest for the best ode to the "
"great unrivaled King – that's more like it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"술집에서 술과 여자에 취하는 건 이로베티의 스타일이 아니죠. 그는 그 정도로 만족하지 않아요! "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}가 인간 남자로 변한 것처럼 황금색 천을 허리에 두른 채 옥상에서 춤추고, 퍼레이드하고, 공개 "
"처형까지 해가면서 3주 동안이나 미친 잔치를 열었어요. 심지어 그 누구도 범접할 수 없는 왕에 대한 시를 쓰는 콘테스트를 벌였다니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "5d538ac8-96fc-4c46-8145-04c678f261a4"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to tell? You've seen some of my rough drafts already, "
"haven't you? It's a book about you and your adventures! I am writing the "
"whole truth, just as it happened... Well, the whole artistic truth. You "
"know, no glory – no story!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐랄까... 이미 대략적인 초안은 보셨죠? 안그래요? 이 책은 당신과 이 모험에 대한 책이에요! 저는 무슨 일이 생기던 사실 그대로 "
"쓸거랍니다. 음... 없는 영광이나 이야기를 덧붙이진 않을거지만... 예술적으로 쓸게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "6e1a5af2-669a-417a-98a3-f4b0f095c45e"
msgid ""
"\"The truth doesn't hurt me. Who do you think my most severe critic is? "
"That's right, it's me! This is my first real book, and I have much yet to "
"learn... But don't you worry, I will do your feats justice! And if I put my "
"foot in my mouth here and there – then we can print a second edition! "
"Revised and corrected!\""
msgstr ""
"\"진실은 저를 아프게 하지 않아요. 제게 가장 가혹한 비평가가 누군지 아세요? 저에요! 이 책은 제 첫 작품이고 아직 배울게 "
"많아요... 하지만 걱정마세요. 제가 당신의 업적을 있는 그대로 쓸테니까요! 제가 실수 좀 하더라도 다시 수정해서 재출간하면 되잖아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "69e3a61f-b6d5-4046-ba51-5f8f90627938"
msgid ""
"\"Just don't leave without me! Of course, I could just write whatever you "
"tell me, but... If I wanted to stay cooped up in a dusty room, I'd still be "
"sleeping through lectures at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 없이 가지는 말아주세요! 물론 무슨 일이 있었는지 전해 주시는 대로 쓸 수야 있지만... 그래도... 먼지투성이 방에 틀어 박히고 "
"싶었다면 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}의 강의실에서 잠이나 잤을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "d963a5f9-e8ab-46d4-b333-5feaa9d9eab4"
msgid ""
"\"When I was at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, Eobald the "
"Insightful began his literature course with the question: 'What is a "
"person?' And he answered: 'A person is a storytelling animal.' Our world "
"does not consist of things – all these woods, seas, and cities. It consists "
"of stories about those things! The stories we tell to ourselves, and to each "
"other. Just think about it. Centuries will pass, and there will be no me, "
"and no you. All your subjects will be long gone... But you and I will live "
"on in people's memories, and influence their deeds – thanks to this very "
"book!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에 있었을 때, 신통한 자 이오발드 교수님은 문학 강의를 "
"'사람이란 무엇인가?'라는 질문으로 시작했어요. 그리고 그는 이렇게 말했죠: '사람은 이야기하는 동물이다.' 라고. 이 세상은 숲, "
"바다, 도시들로 이루어져 있지 않아요. 그것들에 관한 이야기로 구성되어 있는 거죠! 우리가 서로에게 해주는 이야기들 말이에요. 한번 "
"생각해봐요. 몇 세기만 지나도 저와 당신은 죽고 당신의 백성들도 곧 사라질지 몰라요... 하지만 이 책 덕분에 저와 당신은 사람들의 기억 "
"속에서 살아 있을 거라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "662da363-0d4d-4e82-88e1-ee95c87f38f3"
msgid ""
"\"As long as mediocre lickspittles sit at the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}, and those with real talent beg on the streets of "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, I will not cross the threshold of that place!\""
msgstr ""
"\"재능도 없는 아첨꾼이 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 차지하고, 진짜 예술인이 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 골목에서 구걸하는 한, 저는 절대 아카데미 문턱을 넘지 않을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "13da670f-44fc-4c87-b23c-0ca4d2026742"
msgid ""
"\"He also likes singing. Ugh! And he orders his guards to make the citizens "
"gather for his shows... May {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} have mercy on his listeners!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"노래하는 것도 좋아하죠. 그리고 병사들을 시켜 시민들이 자기의 공연을 보도록 명령하기도 하고... {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}께서 "
"불쌍한 시민들에게 자비를 베풀기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "e9735633-c59d-4cd9-8777-ad01d3320a2b"
msgid ""
"\"Truth be told, I was a little afraid of meeting a real hero. In books "
"they're all protectors of the weak and poor, but what about in real life? "
"But you eased all my fears with two shakes of a tail. You're a true "
"hero{mf||ine}, just like in the legends! My new fear is that, in a hundred "
"years, my readers will say that people like you never existed – but I'm "
"writing the truth!\""
msgstr ""
"\"실은 진짜 영웅과 만나면 어떻게 해야 할지, 좀 두려웠어요. 책에서 영웅은 언제나 약자와 빈자를 보호하지만, 현실에서는 어떨까요? "
"하지만 당신 덕분에 걱정이 말끔히 사라졌어요! 당신은 전설 속에서 튀어나온 영웅 같거든요! 대신 새로운 고민이 생겼어요. 100년 뒤에 "
"독자들이 당신이 실존인물이 아니라고 할지 모른다는 거예요. 뭐, 전 사실대로 적을 뿐이니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "6c662fd0-475c-4019-ad55-17c205fdcd7a"
msgid ""
"\"In books, everything is simple: these are the heroes, and those are the "
"villains. In life, of course, it's completely different. You have to make "
"difficult decisions, and I don't always agree with you... But that's what "
"makes you a complex, multifaceted character!\""
msgstr ""
"\"책에선 모든 게 간단해요. 이쪽은 영웅이고 저쪽은 악당이죠. 하지만 현실은 완전히 달라요. 당신은 매번 어려운 결정을 내려야만 하죠. "
"언제나 제가 바라는 방향을 선택하진 않겠지만... 그런 점이 이야기 속 우리를 복잡하고, 입체적인 인물로 만들겠죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "eab7f8f8-4382-454f-86af-828a0afe737f"
msgid ""
"\"It's not easy to write about you. You are not like a normal hero{mf||ine} "
"from a book. Sometimes I even think you're a real villain! But it's not my "
"place to judge you. That's for the readers. My task is to write the truth "
"about you – the whole truth!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신을 글에 담는 건 참 어려운 일이에요. 이야기 속 영웅 같은 분은 아니니까요. 가끔은 진짜 악당이 아닐까 생각해요! 하지만 판단은 "
"제 몫이 아니라, 독자들의 몫이죠. 당신에 대한 진실을 남기는 게 제 임무예요. 있는 그대로요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "fea5f196-576b-496d-8741-4bf321553db7"
msgid ""
"\"You have an iron core. No matter what tricks fate throws in your path, you "
"always know what's right and what's wrong. Some might say that's boring... "
"But others will learn from you, from your strong character!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 정말 심지가 굳은 분이에요. 운명의 장난이 우리가 가는 길에 어두운 그림자를 드리워도, 언제나 옳고 그름을 판단해내시죠. "
"따분한 사람이라 평하는 이도 있겠지만... 당신의 굳세고 강인한 면을 본받고 싶어 하는 사람도 있을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "208b4356-035e-4530-bb46-59f7fb7c5814"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes you follow the rules, and sometimes you make up your own. Your "
"actions are hard to predict. – It's what makes you so interesting to read "
"about!\""
msgstr ""
"\"때로는 규칙을 따르면서도 때로는 제멋대로 행동하시죠. 당신은 예측하기 힘든 사람이에요. 그게 당신이 흥미로운 이유기도 하지만요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "1c7a3f5d-2c6d-44da-8f92-b1f457b0f352"
msgid ""
"\"You are like a force of nature – wild and unpredictable. You're full of "
"surprises. I doubt I could make up a protagonist like you, even if I tried "
"very hard!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 자연의 힘처럼 거칠고 예측하기 힘들어요. 당신의 모든 행동이 놀라워요! 아무리 노력해도 당신 같은 주인공을 창작할 수 없을 것 "
"같아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "39ab7ae3-4b8b-4478-b233-3a1a8a73d210"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Not to offend the other gods, but she's the most important of them "
"all. All the other gods guard the world as it is. But only the {g|Shelyn}"
"Eternal Rose{/g}, the goddess of beauty, calls us to the world as it should "
"be!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네! 다른 신들의 기분을 상하게 하려는 건 아니지만, 그녀는 신들 중에서 가장 중요하신 분이에요. 다른 분들은 이 세상을 있는 그대로 "
"두려고 하시지만, {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}로 불리는 미의 여신께서는 마땅히 옳은 세상을 만들기 위해 우리를 이끌어주시니까요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "f8a9282b-6df9-4a3d-9ea6-aa6e5a8ec3c3"
msgid ""
"\"Just a moment, I just got something...\" {n}Linzi quickly scribbles "
"something in her notebook, then raises her eyes and smiles at you.{/n} \"Hi!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐. 방금 뭔가 떠올랐어요.\" {n}린지는 수첩에서 무엇인가를 빠르게 적으며 눈을 뜨고 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"안녕하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "902c4bca-5aec-4f5c-942b-ac7163109270"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... I haven't seen him since I ran away from home. I hope he's all "
"right! I ask {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} every day to grant him a long life – and "
"new students!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 집을 떠난 뒤로는 그분을 보지 못했어요. 잘 지내고 계셨으면 좋겠네요! {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}께 스승님이 오래 살게 "
"해 주시고, 새로운 학생을 가르칠 수 있게 해달라고 매일같이 기도해야겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "dbffc022-7d81-422a-b2b0-af644c5b7f60"
msgid ""
"\"You're the ruler of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} now! I don't know what else I can "
"tell you... But I will try!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 지금 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 통치자에요! 당신에게 무슨 말을 해줄 수 있을지 잘 모르겠지만... 그래도 노력해볼께요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "a876eb2a-bc8c-4678-bccc-962e6590b16f"
msgid "\"I wonder how {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} will fare now, under your rule!\""
msgstr "\"저는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 당의 통치하에 어떻게 운영될지 너무 궁금해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "9b8d58da-2138-4780-8fb2-ecea4cd932b6"
msgid ""
"\"Many sighed in relief when Irovetti lost his throne. But maybe they "
"shouldn't have – who knows what you have in store for them! Either way, the "
"years of his rule will not be soon forgotten. It won't be called "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} golden age... But perhaps its 'gilded age' is closer to "
"the mark..."
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 왕위에서 내려온 뒤로, 많은 사람들이 안도의 한숨을 쉬었어요. 새로운 주인이 피탁스에 어떤 반향을 불러일으킬지 잘 "
"모르는데도요! 물론 이로베티의 만행을 잊어버리긴 어렵겠죠. 이로베티 왕을 두고 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 황금시대를 열었다 할 순 "
"없으니까요... '아주 얇게 금박을 입힌 시대' 라면 모를까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "4b35d18a-81aa-4f4d-a497-0e25872e149a"
msgid ""
"\"At first Tessie tried in vain to get rid of me. But later, when I told her "
"I was staying behind in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, she even shed a tear. I wonder "
"where she is now... I wish she would visit us, and see how beautifully you "
"fixed things up here! We used to avoid the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, "
"but now she could come and set up her stand, and the customers would come "
"flooding through!\""
msgstr ""
"\"첫 만남에 테시는 나를 떨궈내려 했어요. 하지만 헛수고였죠. 나중에는 제가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 남는다 하니까 울기까지 "
"했다니까요. 지금은 어디서 뭘 하는지 궁금하네요. 테시를 여기 초대할 수 있으면 좋을 거예요. 이 문제 많은 땅을 사람 사는 곳으로 바꿔 "
"놓은 당신의 이야기를 해주고 싶네요! 여태 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 별로 발을 들이고 싶은 곳이 아니었잖아요? "
"이젠 테시도 여기서 지낼 수 있겠네요. 테시의 책을 구경하려는 사람이 넘쳐날 테니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "e1a93eba-09a1-450c-8cea-a67dd8e7109e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, these are only drafts... But of course you're welcome to read them! "
"Just keep in mind that even if you don't like what I write about, I won't "
"change a single letter – so don't even ask!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 이건 그냥 초안이긴 한데... 물론 읽으셔도 돼요! 다만, 제가 쓴 글이 마음에 들지 않으시더라도, 전 단 한 글자도 안 "
"바꿀거란 사실만 기억해주세요 – 그러니까 부탁도 하지 말라고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "c17b2c97-5296-41e0-9902-5719f3d34f59"
msgid ""
"\"Of course it's a book about you, but it's my book! Understood?\" {n}The "
"small writer's eyes glow rebelliously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론 주인공은 당신이지만 작가는 저라구요! 건드릴 생각은 하지도 마세요!\" {n}작은 작가의 눈은 반항적으로 빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "96aa9ae5-4504-43b0-8631-50ffdd47a4b9"
msgid ""
"\"I know!\"{n} Linzi says defiantly.{/n} \"Rulers oppress writers. Sometimes "
"even torture them, with a bit of execution thrown in for good measure... And "
"so they etch their own names in history – as disgraceful tyrants. All while "
"immortalizing their victims as heroes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알아요!\" {n}린지는 반항적으로 말합니다.{/n} \"통치자는 작가를 억압하죠. 어떨 땐 고문으로 모자라 사형을 선고하는 경우도 "
"봤어요... 치사한 독재자로 역사에 이름을 남기는 방법이죠. 희생자는 불후의 영웅으로 남고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "ee82b413-e21e-4544-9e00-be8d66cf8438"
msgid ""
"\"And I would prefer to turn every army barracks into a library, and eat "
"cream pudding for breakfast every day. But you can't always get what you "
"want. That's true even for rulers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 모든 병영을 도서관으로 바꿔고 매일 아침 크림 푸딩을 먹고 싶어. 하지만 원하는대로 다 되는건 아니잖아요? 그건 통치자도 "
"마찬가지라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0085_Text
msgctxt "8ddc8bc7-564f-4374-91d8-b00bfb55df87"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! No, I am not going to make up any fiction about you! And why "
"would I? I wouldn't be able to invent half of the adventures you keep "
"getting yourself into!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하! 저는 이야기를 지어낼 필요가 없어요! 왜 그런 일을 하겠어요? 양껏 꾸며낸 소설을 쓴다 해도 당신 모험의 반도 따라가지 못할 "
"텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0086_Text
msgctxt "5c3eb32e-e940-4dfa-a6fe-c1dca42e0ad6"
msgid ""
"\"I think you underestimate the power of the written word! A quill may not "
"be mightier than a sword, but one strike by even the sharpest sword is still "
"just one strike. The written word may be read by thousands and thousands, "
"for countless years to come!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 글의 힘을 과소평가하시는 것 같군요! 펜은 칼보다 강하지 않을지라도 칼을 휘두르는 건 그저 휘두름에 불과하죠. 글은 수 많은 "
"세월 동안 셀 수도 없을 만큼 많은 사람들이 읽을지도 모른다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "05179e6c-5c99-427a-9ac2-bca2d06c9119"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! How wonderful! Seriously, do it! Ban my book from your lands! "
"Can you imagine how much the sales would grow everywhere else? As "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} is my witness, if there's a higher honor for a writer "
"than to author a popular book – it's to author a forbidden book!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하! 훌륭하시네요! 한번 해보세요! 당신의 땅에서 제 책을 금지한다구요? 그럼 다른 곳에서 매출이 폭발적으로 오를걸요? 셸린의 "
"이름을 걸고 얘기하는데, 작가에게 가장 큰 영광은 독재자가 금지시킬만한 책을 쓰는거랍니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "a62a43cc-de4d-4f98-8377-af490a150ccd"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your trust. I will not set out to please you, of course, but "
"I still hope that you'll like my book as much as my other readers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"신뢰해줘서 고마워요. 물론 당신을 기쁘게 하려고 애쓰지는 않겠지만, 당신이 다른 독자들 만큼이나 이 책을 좋아해주셨으면 좋겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "5c8acfe9-139f-42dd-ab65-8303096f853e"
msgid ""
"\"I swear.\" {n}Linzi puts her little hand over her heart.{/n} \"Truth, only "
"truth, and just a teensy bit of imaginative exaggeration!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맹세할께요.\" {n}린지는 그녀의 가슴에 그녀의 작은 손을 댑니다.{/n} \"진실, 오직 진실만을 쓰고 진짜 쪼오오금만 과장해서 "
"쓸께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "c7b81f4c-a815-4ed2-b494-40aa5f4f2675"
msgid ""
"\"Well... Yes, I can admit that. Sometimes one has to bend a few details for "
"the sake of dramatic effect. It's called poetic truth! I write about "
"everything as if I saw it with my own eyes – even parts of the adventure "
"that I wasn't around for. But I do always carefully question everyone who "
"was with you at the time! Think of it as of a general picture. In the end, "
"you're the hero{mf||ine} of this book, and I am just the storyteller.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄요... 뭐, 인정할게요. 때로는 극적인 효과를 위해 몇가지 디테일을 덧붙이지 않으면 안되요.이런 걸 시적 표현이라고 하죠! "
"그래도 제가 보는 그대로 쓰고 있답니다. 심지어 당신 곁에 제가 없을 때 있던 일 까지도요! 하지만 그때 당신과 있던 사람들에게 항상 "
"신중하게 질문하죠. 그냥 사진이라고 생각하세요! 결국 당신은 이 책의 주인공이고 저는 이야기꾼일 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "378013f6-6a9f-42b4-8d27-72b963a4e3d4"
msgid ""
"\"I wasn't even with you during your first feats! But who wants to read "
"about how I roamed the swamps with that miserable Tartuccio, while you were "
"defeating the Stag Lord? No one, of course! So I wrote about you. I'll sit "
"down and write my own biography some other time. When I'm very old, ha ha ha!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 당신의 첫번째 업적에 함께 하지 못했어요! 그래도 당신이 수사슴 군주를 물리치고 있는 동안 제가 그 못생긴 타투치오랑 함께 늪을 "
"돌아다닌 얘기를 누가 읽고 싶겠어요? 아무도 없겠죠! 그래서 당신 얘기를 썼죠. 다음에는 제 자서전이나 쓸까봐요. 늙어서 은퇴하고 "
"나면요! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "53d1ec2a-e1a4-4882-8c8c-340eca78abf3"
msgid ""
"\"At first Tessie tried in vain to get rid of me. But later, when I told her "
"I was staying in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, she even shed a tear... I wonder where "
"she is now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"테시는 처음에는 절 쫓아내려고 애썼지만 나중에는 제가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 남는다고 말했을 때 심지어 울기까지 했죠. "
"지금은 어디서 뭐하는지 궁금해지네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "934d111a-006a-4ebd-9663-9cea9723ab04"
msgid ""
"\"At first, she'd have been glad to be rid of me. But in the end, when I "
"told her I was staying in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, she even shed a tear... Oh, "
"I'm so happy she's staying with us! But she's so restless. Once she gets "
"tired of this place — she'll be gone!\""
msgstr ""
"\"테시는 처음엔 절 쫓아내려고 했죠. 그래도 나중에는 제가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 남는다고 말했을 때 심지어 울기까지 "
"했다니까요? 그녀가 우리랑 같이 있어서 너무 행복해요! 하지만 그녀는 너무 안절부절못하는거 같아요. 아마 여기에 싫증이 나면 떠나겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "6a53c005-6940-49d7-a090-92f3ec702b07"
msgid ""
"\"This is what the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g} was like under "
"Irovetti... Of course, everything's different now in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. But "
"neither students, nor teachers, nor citizens will ever forget what happened."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 쥐고 흔들던 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}가 꼭 이랬어요... 물론 요즘 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 전혀 다른 모습으로 거듭났지만요. 그렇다 해도 아카데미 학생과 교수님, 그리고 피탁스 시민들은 이로베티 "
"왕의 통치를 잊기 힘들겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "a7eb9928-eea1-48cd-8ddd-b4704b8d9428"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, right! A classroom feels too small for me now. Maybe I'll return — "
"to give a lecture or two, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"네, 맞아요! 지금은 교실이 너무 작게 느껴지네요. 어쩌면 다음에는 강의를 하러 여기로 다시 돌아올지도 몰라요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "074f9acf-8f9d-4cfa-97b8-6593280ae022"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi shakes her head slowly.{/n} \"No. I don't want to go back. Not to "
"the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g}, or to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. I don't "
"want to ever see the place again. I just... don't want to.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 천천히 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"아뇨. 과거로 돌아가고 싶지 않아요. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 "
"예술 아카데미{/g}나 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}도. 다시는 돌아가고 싶지 않아요. 전 그냥... 그러기 싫어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "326d3447-d356-4ba6-b0da-b3072e2e05de"
msgid ""
"\"In full swing! The press is working day and night. Turns out there aren't "
"just readers, but also writers in our lands — they keep bringing me new "
"manuscripts! Some are even readable without crying!\""
msgstr ""
"\"한창 잘 나가요! 인쇄기는 밤낮없이 찍어내고 있죠. 알고 보니 우리 영지에는 책을 읽는 사람 뿐아니라 쓰는 사람들도 많더라구요. "
"그들이 계속해서 저에게 새로운 원고를 가져다 주고있어요! 어떤 원고는 눈물 없인 보기 힘든 것들도 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "647e8500-b5ca-4de6-aee9-a25b0046864c"
msgid ""
"\"We're writing constantly. You know, when I was studying, I of course "
"suspected that it wasn't all fine and dandy at the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}academy{/g}, but I had no idea of the scale of the catastrophe. "
"Professor Eobald told me things about Irovetti... Horrible. You'll read it "
"when we finish it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 끊임없이 글을 쓰고 있어요. 제가 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 공부할 때 괜찮지 "
"않을지도 모른다고 예상은 했지만 이 정도 참사일 줄은 생각도 못했어요. 이오발드 교수님이 이로베티에 대해 말해준 사실은 끔찍했어요... "
"다 끝나고 나면 읽어봐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "84b1ff93-4f39-49e3-8e75-5ed9088bd3b0"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. 'The quill is mightier than the sword' — unfortunately I only learned "
"the truth of this saying after getting blood on my own hands. I'm scared of "
"the power words can have over people. But I can't be a coward! Since I "
"possess this power, I must use it to change the world for the better! You "
"change the world with the power of weapons and royal decrees. And I... I'll "
"see to it that your legacy is more than just another dusty chronicle for "
"future generations!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네. 펜은 칼보다 강해요. 불행히도 손에 피를 묻힌 후에야 이 말의 진리를 알게 되었죠. 말이 사람을 지배할 수 있다는게 무서워요. "
"하지만 겁쟁이가 될 수는 없어요! 글을 쓰기로 한 이상 세상을 더 좋게 바꿔야 한다고 맹세했으니까! 당신은 힘으로 세상을 바꾸지만... "
"저는... 저는 당신의 이야기가 후손들을 위한 또 다른 먼지투성이 위인전 그 이상의 가치가 있음을 알아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0107_Text
msgctxt "4e687268-1d39-49d6-b8ed-61f10ccd06e6"
msgid ""
"\"Honestly, it wasn't easy to forgive Eobald for lying. But the more we work "
"together, the more I understand why he hid the truth from me. What's really "
"happening at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g}... If it comes out, "
"the only thing left will be to burn it to the ground. And we hope that "
"someday it might become what it must have been at the very beginning!\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히, 이오발드 교수님의 거짓말을 용서하는게 쉽지는 않았어요. 그래도 우리는 왜 그가 진실을 숨겼는지 알아내야 해요. {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 무슨 일이 일어났던지간에... 다 밝혀내서 불태워 버려야해요... "
"그리고 언젠가 그곳이 원래의 역할을 되찾기를 바랄뿐이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0108_Text
msgctxt "ea0e600b-ef78-4a1c-9cd1-cef0f30afbf5"
msgid ""
"\"I thought teacher used to tell me about scary things. Now that I know what "
"he DIDN'T tell me, it makes my hair stand on end. I'm afraid our book will "
"destroy the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g}. But if that's the case... "
"maybe it can't be saved!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 스승이 나에게 말해주지 않은 무서운 진실이 있다고 생각했어. 이제는 그가 나에게 말하지 않은 것을 생각하면 털이 곤두 서. 나는 "
"우리의 책이 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 파괴할까 두려웠어. 만약 그랬다면... 멸망했겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "0b892aa6-713f-43c9-a4e7-e7db3fdd0e76"
msgid ""
"\"What's there to say... The books woke my urge to travel, but it was only "
"thanks to Tessie that I managed to really get out of my village.\""
msgstr "\"뭐랄까... 책을 쓰기 위해 여행했지만 마을을 벗어난 건 테시 덕이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0111_Text
msgctxt "d88756dd-d4b4-486e-818e-4084d6a88f58"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. You know, before I used to think I was some kind of preacher of good "
"and beauty. I thought the delicate intricacy of words could make the world "
"better... But who am I to change other people? They're not chicks, and I'm "
"not their mother hen, there to cuddle them with warm, comfy lies! I'm a "
"bard. My job is to honestly tell the stories that must be told. Like yours. "
"To preserve them, to save them from being lost to time. And people — they'll "
"make their own conclusions. They're clever enough on their own.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 내가 선과 아름다움의 추종자가 되기 전에 섬세한 문법이 세상을 바꿀 수 있다고 생각했어... 하지만 내가 바꾸려는 자들은 "
"타이르고 얼러서 가르칠 아이들이 아니야. 나는 음유시인이고 이야기를 사실 그대로 전달해서 보존하고 기록해야 해. 그러면 사람들은 현명하게 "
"판단하고 각자의 결론을 내리겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0112_Text
msgctxt "16dd86f0-fb0a-494f-a6e9-8f9a9ceaae01"
msgid ""
"\"So much for the calling... We're jesters. Our job is to entertain the "
"audience! When a bard tries to act as a preacher or open people's eyes to "
"truth, it ends in stupidity, or tragedy, or both!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 묻는 게 많구나... 우리는 관객을 즐겁게 하는 광대야! 음유시인이 설교자가 되어 사람들의 눈을 뜨게 하려고 하면 어이 없는 "
"결말이 나오거나 비극이 되거나 둘 모두가 될 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0114_Text
msgctxt "7e27ad53-e8ca-44c1-847e-c2226215bd8e"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi lingers, then sighs dully.{/n} \"I had a fight with her. A big one. "
"Well... I wanted to talk to her about the best way to describe her hair "
"color in the book. And she...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 계속 이야기하다 느릿하게 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나는 그녀와 싸웠어요. 큰 싸움이었죠... 나는 그 책에 나오는 그녀의 "
"머리카락의 색을 어떻게 묘사할지 얘기해주려다가 그만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0115_Text
msgctxt "c33d08e5-9ad5-41ba-b2a3-24e2167aebd3"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi pouts.{/n} \"She said my book is trash. And I'd be no better if I "
"busied my time with... ugh, I won't even repeat it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 삐죽 입술을 내밉니다.{/n} \"그녀는 내 책이 쓰레기라고 말했어요. 그리고 나에게 좋을게 없다고 했죠. 내가 항상 "
"대부분의 시간을 보내... 으휴. 다시 말 꺼내기도 싫네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0119_Text
msgctxt "37c77e78-a8ae-42d8-9cca-c995c4ca4f9c"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! I mean wait...\" {n}Linzi licks her lips.{/n} \"I wasn't hurt... it's "
"just... oh, it doesn't matter!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요!  내 말은,기다려...\" {n}린지는 입술을 핥습니다.{/n} \"나는 상처받지 않았어... 그건, 그저... 오,  그건 "
"상관 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0120_Text
msgctxt "ed84945f-ab11-475c-830a-65c1eadf31fb"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi lowers her head sorrowfully.{/n} \"You're probably right... But I'm "
"doing it for her! You know?\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 슬픔에 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"아마 당신 말이 맞을 거에요... 하지만 그녀를 위한 거였어요! 정말이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0121_Text
msgctxt "8ed19518-364b-474b-a5d6-6b472c865bb4"
msgid ""
"\"That's how everyone is! While the author is working on the chronicle, "
"everyone is happy to heap insults on them. But then, when your names are "
"glorified through ages, who do you think you'll be thanking?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요! 작가가 연대기를 쓰면 모두는 모욕을 하느라 바쁘죠. 그렇지만 그 뒤론 너의 이름은 시대에 걸쳐 유명해지겠지요. 당신이 "
"감사해야 할 사람이 누구일 거라고 생각해요?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0122_Text
msgctxt "415bcd63-15f2-4e89-ae8d-357b8472e410"
msgid ""
"\"To be honest, Valerie hasn't been herself lately. She's usually polite, "
"though she can be cold at times – but now it's like she's changed! And it's "
"all after, you know...\" {n}Linzi gathers her strength.{/n} \"After she got "
"that scar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히 발레리는 최근에 제정신이 아니었어요. 그녀는 좀 쌀쌀맞을 순 있긴 해도 사려깊었었는데 지금은 변한 거 같아요! 있지. 그건 "
"아마도...\" {n}린지는 힘주어 말합니다.{/n} \"그녀가 흉터를 얻고난 후에 그렇게 되었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0123_Text
msgctxt "27a43693-4e07-4103-957b-83ce4f815d77"
msgid ""
"\"I talked to her before, and she wasn't very nice that time either... She's "
"gotten so spiteful after she got hurt! Though she keeps saying she doesn't "
"care.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그녀와 얘기를 나눴고 그 때도 친절하지는 않았어요... 상처를 입은 후로는 더 까칠해졌죠! 자기는 아무렇지 않다고 말하면서..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0127_Text
msgctxt "81c835e3-03f6-4d3f-b27e-0c85b54f6ee8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh! You haven't heard of them? How can you be a hero{mf||ine} without "
"knowing one of the most epic stories in the history of stories? They... No, "
"I won't spoil anything — you should just read about them yourself, every "
"single chapter! Their adventures are what gave me the idea of going on a "
"heroic quest and writing about it to begin with... And now, look at me, here "
"I am! On a heroic quest!\""
msgstr ""
"\"엥? 들어본 적 없어요? 어떻게 그 전설의 이야기를 모를 수가 있지? 그들은... 아니, 얘기 안해줄래요. 직접 읽어봐요! 그 "
"이야기는 제게 영웅적인 모험을 떠나라고 얘기해줬어요. 그리고 지금, 날 봐요! 당신과 영웅적인 모험을 하고 있잖아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0128_Text
msgctxt "1079344d-aca3-44df-b74d-b65d191bd66c"
msgid ""
"\"You worship her too, right? I'm so happy to hear that! For some reason, I "
"think that a leader following her call has the chance to create something "
"beautiful in their lands... Even with such lackluster material as the Stolen "
"Lands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신도 셸린님을 섬기고 계시죠? 그래서 정말 기뻐요! 셸린님의 말씀을 따르는 지도자는 자기 영토에서 아름다운 것들을 창조할 기회를 "
"가진 거라고 생각해요. 이 도둑맞은 땅에서도요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0130_Text
msgctxt "92a0f1f9-e581-4d17-af55-c8ea64e7d486"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, this.\" {n}Linzi holds her arm for you to get a clear view of the "
"ring.{/n} \"It was a gift to me from my first teacher. It's magical — imbued "
"by the powers of Shelyn, no less! When I get myself in trouble, it "
"transports me to a safe spot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 이거요?\" {n}린지는 반지 모양의 물건을 보여주기 위해 팔을 뻗습니다.{/n} \"제 첫 스승님이 선물해 주신 거예요. "
"셸린님의 힘이 깃든 마법의 반지죠. 제가 위험에 처했을 때 저를 안전한 곳으로 이동시켜 준답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Linzi/Cue_0131_Text
msgctxt "a81dbb94-eeb5-4b2e-9d99-2cf6d86736ac"
msgid ""
"\"Sooo... Please, don't be angry with me if I suddenly disappear from a "
"fight. I'll wait for you here! Promise!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 말인데요... 만약 제가 갑자기 전투중에 사라지더라도 화내지 마세요. 전 여기서 당신을 기다릴게요! 약속해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "43450848-dcec-4353-abcc-382a5f1a7ef0"
msgid "\"How'd you get the name 'Nok-Nok'?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 녹-녹이라는 이름을 얻었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "02339771-c68d-4875-b546-26c5b7eabad6"
msgid "\"I'll... uh... join you. Later.\""
msgstr "\"나는 .. 어... 다음에 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d844cb1e-79be-4ae2-bccd-688caa4821ad"
msgid "\"I had questions for you.\""
msgstr "\"다른 물어볼것이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "451fa150-f050-4f26-85d6-2c0b5ea6d314"
msgid "\"You must leave my lands, Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"내 땅을 떠나라. 녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "47efaeaa-3204-4047-b661-ab356aa1ceb6"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f1bc13dc-cacd-4aad-ae6a-02b01dd4eb71"
msgid "Expressed concern about Nok-Nok's wounds."
msgstr "녹-녹의 흉터들에 대해 걱정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "82ecf7c1-ef2c-4f53-b4ef-797960065a77"
msgid "\"That's a lot of wounds. Are you alright?\""
msgstr "\"상처가 많군. 괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9d19f3a9-5bfb-4145-9928-380d9631b189"
msgid "Explained the role of pain in improving oneself."
msgstr "성공을 위한 고통이라고 설명했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b5e96286-0534-48de-a3ca-bde6f62ea6eb"
msgid "\"From pain comes strength.\""
msgstr "\"고통에서 힘이 온다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ba37bca3-02d4-4b67-9fd9-be258171ee43"
msgid "Told Nok-Nok about the necessity of being able to defend oneself."
msgstr "녹-녹에게 자신을 방어 할 수있는 필요성에 대해 이야기했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6b76fb49-3a6d-44a8-bd3b-6a573934e2e1"
msgid "\"I hope you gave as good as you got.\""
msgstr "\"받은 만큼 돌려줬기를바래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2831029a-833c-457e-bb16-8a03004a3f4e"
msgid "Asked Nok-Nok about his revenge."
msgstr "녹-녹에게 복수를 했는지를 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "eda7fd90-52ef-4393-9abd-8b2659978a83"
msgid "\"Can't wait for being a Hero. Did you take revenge?\""
msgstr "\"영웅이 될 때까지 기다릴 수는 없어. 복수는 했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "af7d5666-0c8d-409d-90ea-e0b8c7589809"
msgid "\"Good thing it didn't affect your memory.\""
msgstr "\"너의 기억에 영향을 미치지 않아 다행이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "db5fbb4b-1013-4c7e-b3c5-cbac8f003753"
msgid "\"That's what I… never mind.\""
msgstr "\"그게 내가... 신경쓰지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "a62c155a-91cd-4292-82f2-241c72275cc7"
msgid "\"Uh… yes, I was there.\""
msgstr "\"어... 그래. 내가 거기 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "7b92952c-e336-4636-b2b6-cde0e8579c1a"
msgid "\"What do you mean, you were \"not raised in a cage\"?\""
msgstr "\"'우리에서 키우지 않았다'라는건 무슨 의미지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "6bfe0566-a2ec-435c-9396-3a0a3e37f901"
msgid "\"Who was your mother?\""
msgstr "\"네 어머니는 누구였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "2238a0c8-9013-4e45-851f-efc5b160a548"
msgid "\"I'd like to know more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 좀 더 알고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "5dd754cc-f3a1-4fe5-b0ed-8773d23451a9"
msgid "\"Enough talking about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대한 얘기는 충분히 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "14a73996-5bcb-4ec2-a311-f4ac8c5d3b69"
msgid "\"Why do you mangle words?\""
msgstr "\"말을 왜그렇게 어눌하게 하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "b95d2b34-6db0-4bee-b017-623c5324fbb3"
msgid "\"What will you do now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 뭘 할 생각이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "9d6674de-662f-43f2-bb8e-fe6d68feff1a"
msgid "\"Miss your village?\""
msgstr "\"네 마을이 그리워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "47a5d547-f755-4505-9463-c27d1b86bf86"
msgid "\"I'm not coming with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 함께 가지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "714f8559-a332-4927-bd49-c9a04dd598fa"
msgid "\"No, wait — I've changed my mind.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 마음이 바뀌었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "d6bc431b-9841-4cd2-8e51-7796a87beb03"
msgid "\"Do you have some problem with Linzi?\""
msgstr "\"린지와 사이가 안좋아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "aaefe2c0-a3fe-4b18-8cf0-78a3012a1247"
msgid "\"Oh, is that all?\""
msgstr "\"그게 다야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "b4ab3e51-fbac-41c4-88e8-9be3b431152b"
msgid "\"So, no wedding then?\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 둘이 결혼은 안하는걸로?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0053_Text_String
msgctxt "d4d9d77d-ec19-4b7f-9f9c-de1b5413dffb"
msgid "\"What's wrong with writing?\""
msgstr "\"글을 쓰는게 뭔가 잘못이라도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "203cf5cf-c48e-46a5-85a7-e878375fffa6"
msgid "\"I thought I told you to leave.\""
msgstr "\"떠나라고 말한 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "df517fda-9755-4df8-ba51-791f364df7f3"
msgid "\"If goblins don't write, how do you remember anything?\""
msgstr "\"고블린들이 글을 쓰지 않는다면, 어떻게 기억을 하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "d1f49477-5071-4a26-afb5-ed63c6b16ae2"
msgid "\"I'd like to ask you about goblins.\""
msgstr "\"고블린에 대해 물어보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "f34b87df-a94e-4c7b-9637-cf30055ecf0d"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "89be810f-9d55-4457-8611-5a7f785e721b"
msgid "\"I'll tell her you said that.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇게 말했다고 전해줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "6c477b17-5710-4936-b366-dabca42145e7"
msgid "\"Right. You don't like Linzi. Enough about her.\""
msgstr "\"그렇군. 린지를 싫어하는구나. 그녀에 관해서는 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0076_Text
msgctxt "fc763c16-c45c-408d-96c9-8a39097c0efa"
msgid "\"I've... heard goblins sing. It's infamous.\""
msgstr "\"나는... 고블린들이 노래하는 것을 들었어. 끔찍하던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "dd050c80-0e84-4547-afaa-8ab8cfbf40d1"
msgid "\"But... that was a rhyme. And a song.\""
msgstr "\"근데... 이번건 꽤 운율이 있었는걸. 노래같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "6ffdb2f0-24aa-4eb2-a486-307dc5763cf1"
msgid "\"I had other questions for you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게 다른 질문이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "ba5b474c-46a4-4471-86d8-85c1cbdbcce2"
msgid "\"You... just did it again. On purpose?\""
msgstr "\"너... 방금 또 했어. 일부러 그랬지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0087_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "506389e9-7a2a-4842-8c7f-cc14db1440cb"
msgid "Threatened Nok-Nok."
msgstr "녹-녹을 위협합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "0925d0cd-6a41-4952-b33d-77c821e5a337"
msgid ""
"\"If you are making light of me, I promise you'll be wearing the next "
"hangman's noose.\""
msgstr "\"나를 또 다시 비춘다면 다음 교수대의 올가미는 너의 것으로 예약해두지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0089_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d49a078f-94d3-495c-aeb7-bd025cfe446b"
msgid "Cheered up on Nok-Nok's rhymes."
msgstr "녹-녹의 운율에 환호합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "b30fbca1-836f-45f9-a79c-0cf417027fca"
msgid "\"I like your rhymes.\""
msgstr "\"운율이 좋은걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0093_Text
msgctxt "cddff027-e216-4a41-b144-1817695b4a09"
msgid "\"Are there other goblins who speak Common better than you?\""
msgstr "\"너보다 공통어를 잘하는 다른 고블린이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "37a2a5f4-405a-4356-ad43-4ef69b9a0a2f"
msgid ""
"\"I still say you all mangle your speech. You're worse than most of your kin."
"\""
msgstr "\"아직도 네 말투는 서툴러. 다른 고블린들보다 더 서투른 편이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "8933630d-fb82-4439-b255-e45130c1946c"
msgid ""
"\"I heard your tribe is building shrines to Lamashtu near the capital.\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족이 수도 근처에 라마슈투 성소를 지었다고 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "2e09e005-d50d-4af1-b982-27c8ebb95cfd"
msgid "\"Bring them down, now!\""
msgstr "\"지금 당장 그것들을 내려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "d3d473b5-632e-43aa-8ecf-e482bbc27d2b"
msgid "\"You are more trouble than you're worth, you know...\""
msgstr "\"너는 네 가치보다 짜증이 나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "7a49b836-ad30-46fa-ae2b-c16f13e9bfda"
msgid "\"I guess, I have no choice but to visit those shrines...\""
msgstr "\"나는 그 성소를 방문해야겠군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0107_Text
msgctxt "573f85ab-e9a8-458a-8906-2afdc5ec8de4"
msgid "\"How's the Lamashtu worship?\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투 숭배는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "9fbb8ba7-744b-4bdb-b244-853986d44f29"
msgid "\"Are all the Lamashtu shrines down?\""
msgstr "\"모든 라마슈투 성소가 무너졌나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "939f35f4-372e-413d-acb2-2df1cf28b669"
msgid ""
"\"I haven't heard much about goblins since the Trading Post. Where're they?\""
msgstr "\"교역소 이후로 고블린에 대한 소식을 듣지 못했어. 그들은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "30dfedca-2954-4d42-8a40-5997c1bc859b"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok? Is something wrong?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹? 뭔가 잘못 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0118_Text
msgctxt "8f094b5d-05b1-4d11-8752-9dfdeebde6e7"
msgid "\"You might want to stop thinking before you hurt yourself.\""
msgstr "\"상처를 입기 전에 그만 떠올려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0119_Text
msgctxt "98c1b7f4-ee17-419b-beac-ffdf8b144042"
msgid "\"What are you doing, cowering there?\""
msgstr "\"겁내는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0123_Text
msgctxt "98f7c5b4-d764-4593-8cc5-ccd94b383dda"
msgid ""
"\"You've been more than a Hero and you've proved it. You dealt with the, uh, "
"Mighty Munguk, saved your tribe, erected great temples of Lamashtu, and "
"survived a goblin king – twice. And won.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 영웅임을 증명했어. 너는 뭉국과 겨루었고, 네 부족을 구했고, 라마슈투 사원을 짓고, 고블린 왕과 두 번이나 싸웠어. 그리고 "
"이겼지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0124_Text
msgctxt "5951d89e-3daf-418a-9084-2090f8f9925b"
msgid ""
"\"You could do something else? Every challenge you faced wasn't won with a "
"blade, it was won by who you are – and well, making others laugh.\""
msgstr ""
"\"별 수 있었겠어? 너에게 도전하는 모든 녀석들이 칼로 이기지 못했고 네가 누구냐에 따른 승리였는데. 물론 다른 녀석들을 비웃고 말이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0125_Text
msgctxt "f121778c-631e-4bd4-a2c4-a632ff8b4e0d"
msgid "\"Maybe you should give up this nonsense of being a Hero.\""
msgstr "\"어쩌면 유치한 영웅놀이는 그만두어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0126_Text
msgctxt "f7993f8a-0641-4327-9bf2-3829e2c42fdf"
msgid "\"Not everyone's meant to be a Hero in the same way.\""
msgstr "\"모두가 같은 방식으로 영웅이되는 것은 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0129_Text
msgctxt "fbbfaa62-101f-4a40-960e-d652d8e1b6cb"
msgid "\"That's the spirit – maybe one day it'll happen.\""
msgstr "\"바로 그거야. 언젠가는 그런 일이 일어나겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0130_Text
msgctxt "deb8d699-44ea-4ae1-86a5-c158ca31c998"
msgid ""
"\"Get some sleep, have some food – there'll be dangers ahead to take your "
"mind off things.\""
msgstr "\"잠을 좀 자고 뭐라도 먹어. 마음 고생이 힘들 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0131_Text
msgctxt "c4d5db75-fcf9-4434-a370-0a0a29cd5cf9"
msgid "\"Fine. For now, we have other concerns.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 지금은 다른 문제가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0135_Text
msgctxt "b855589e-70ec-42ab-901a-c00e1574b41c"
msgid ""
"\"Why not embrace it? If you can disarm problems with a trick and have them "
"laughing along with you, then you're more king than most.\""
msgstr "\"왜 받아들이지 않지? 속임수로 해결하고 웃어버리는 일로 넘어갈 수 있다면 네가 최고의 왕일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0138_Text
msgctxt "b528c472-591f-4152-adbf-4da65f0f52b7"
msgid ""
"\"Well, let's call you by a different title, but no less important – you'll "
"be the court's jester.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 다른 별명을 지어주어야겠어. 너는 궁정 광대가 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0139_Text
msgctxt "a49d64ee-6ea8-498f-9278-03bd9e4fd973"
msgid ""
"\"It would, but not if you were granted the title of 'jester', which is "
"what, uh, goblins in the south call a king.\""
msgstr "\"남쪽에서는 고블린들이 그걸 왕이라고 부른다니. 그건 광대나 다름 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0142_Text
msgctxt "50937807-474f-417e-84b8-4ed42e729faa"
msgid "\"I know you won't. I may call upon you from time to time.\""
msgstr "\"그러지 않을 거라는 걸 알아. 가끔 너에게 부탁할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0143_Text
msgctxt "e2a9c1fe-a81e-47e4-b5cd-bcd6b5a4eae8"
msgid "\"You'd best not, we'll need your encouragement in the times ahead.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너의 격려가 필요할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0144_Text
msgctxt "73cc5175-b922-4b3b-8372-5908ca4cd2fb"
msgid ""
"\"Uh, to be clear, this is not a paid position. And any accidents that occur "
"are yours to fix.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말하면. 돈을 주지는 않을 거야. 무슨 문제가 발생하면 네가 처리해야 하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0148_Text
msgctxt "150805ef-7b6a-43b6-b6b7-d3d29ec35779"
msgid ""
"\"You're more hero than most I've met, Nok-Nok. You've triumphed over a "
"number of challenges that would have broken others.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내가 본 녀석들 중에 가장 영웅스러운 녀석이야. 녹-녹. 너는 수많은 도전을 받아들여 이겼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0149_Text
msgctxt "825c230d-5301-4e0c-99bc-4fb31ec2d6ac"
msgid ""
"\"A Hero can be many things, and even Heroes doubt themselves. Have faith. "
"Simply don't give up – that's Hero enough, and even I can see it.\""
msgstr "\"많은 이들이 영웅이 될 수 있는데 정작 그들은 의심하지. 믿음을 가져. 포기하지 않으면 그게 영웅이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0150_Text
msgctxt "93409f09-44ac-4a0c-b026-176eadb1a596"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to make a show of it, but er, you're the most heroic goblin "
"I've ever met.\""
msgstr "\"아부하긴 싫지만 너는 최고의 고블린 영웅이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0153_Text
msgctxt "9c997161-f53e-4559-945c-1c64c106f875"
msgid ""
"\"Kneel, Nok-Nok. I pronounce you Hero of, uh, the Kingdom. Congratulations."
"\""
msgstr "\"무릎을 꿇거라. 녹-녹. 너를 왕궁의 영웅으로 선언하노라. 에헴. 축하해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0154_Text
msgctxt "3d06c6fa-fdaa-4a0f-8d9e-3bc3240b8d9e"
msgid "\"Look, take it or leave it. You want to be a hero or not?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 받아들이지 않을 거면 떠나라고. 영웅이 되고 싶지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0155_Text
msgctxt "abdd0b6c-8181-41c5-9cbf-68a1e30eb5c3"
msgid ""
"\"Uh, to be clear, this isn't a paid position. And no murdering and "
"stealing, either.\""
msgstr "\"음. 사실 봉급은 없어. 그리고 살인이나 도둑질도 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0158_Text
msgctxt "868f028f-8f3b-4e80-9feb-ba4995977406"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, I pronounce you Hero of the kingdom {kingdomname}, Hero of the "
"Stolen Lands, and grant you a title that can never be taken from you: that "
"of fellow Hero to {name}. Rise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"녹-녹. 나는 너를 {kingdomname}의 영웅으로 임명하노라. 그리고 또한 이 {name}의 영웅 친구임을 증명하노라. 에헴. "
"일어나거라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0161_Text
msgctxt "884a9be6-633e-40aa-82f9-7d9942a5bb5a"
msgid ""
"\"Being a hero doesn't give you access to the treasury, by the way. I don't "
"have the funds – or time to make a statue.\""
msgstr "\"영웅이 된다는 것은 그런 식으로 재무부에 접근할 권한 주지는 않아. 나는 동상을 만들 돈이나 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0162_Text
msgctxt "834b957a-ba14-4d54-b361-5f9236c998b6"
msgid "\"I'll let you sort that one out in your own.\""
msgstr "\"네 동상을 만들 수 있도록 허락할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Answer_0163_Text
msgctxt "f80325a1-49cc-47dc-8bd8-65431545f646"
msgid "\"Do what you need to do – I have other matters to attend to.\""
msgstr "\"하고싶은 대로 해. 나는 다른 일이 있어서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "019abf4d-791f-4200-be22-9fd84e5a57c7"
msgid ""
"{n}One of Nok-Nok's ears perk up at your approach. He affixes you with a "
"single eye — and waits.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 접근하자 녹-녹의 한쪽 귀가 쫑긋합니다. 그는 외눈으로 당신에게 시선을 고정하고 기다립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "c19bb599-3104-4a6e-af5c-eeaeced4955f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks sheepish, then his eyes narrow, as if remembering.{/n} "
"\"Sound when others hit my head with rocks and sticks and boards. Make "
"noking noise, give me lumps, usually hit me two times.\" {n}He rubs his "
"skull, which you now notice resembles a tiny cluster of knobby, calloused "
"hills. He then gives a feral grin.{/n} \"But I show them, be Hero, then I "
"nok-nok THEM.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 잠잠해지더니 무언가를 기억하는 듯 눈을 가늘게 뜹니다.{/n} \"다른 녀석들이 바위나 막대기로 내 머리를 때릴 때 나는 "
"소리다. 콩 소리가 나게 때리면 혹이 난다. 나를 두번 때린다.\" {n}그는 머리를 문질렀고 당신은 낮게 솟은 여러개의 덩어리를 "
"발견합니다. 그는 거친 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그러나 나는 그들에게 영웅임을 보여준다. 그러면 녹-녹은 그들을 녹-녹한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "a6676472-48cd-4902-938f-68e75811a5e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods eagerly… then pauses, blinking.{/n} \"Alright… with what?\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 간절히 고개를 끄덕이고는... 멈추며 깜박거립니다.{/n} \"좋아... 뭐라구?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "a924bb12-102f-4ca2-8f9f-af8089b480cd"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shakes his head.{/n} \"No, mostly hurt. Then stop hurting after a "
"while, barely feel it.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아냐. 상처다. 그리고 상처가 아물면 아프지도 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "038bc9b5-ae25-46d6-b82e-2803b0f47cd9"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods his head, eagerly.{/n} \"Yes, Hero come, then Nok-Nok show "
"tribe what Hero is. Was good day.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"그렇다. 녹-녹은 부족들에게 영웅이 무엇인지 보여주었다. 좋은 시절이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "97f841da-5900-4a49-b1c9-ea72e0905944"
msgid ""
"\"But tribe hitting me, giving me name...\" {n}Nok-Nok makes a face… you "
"think. It's hard to tell.{/n} \"It Nok-Nok's fault, though. Mom not raise "
"Nok-Nok in cage, let him run around, get in adventures.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 부족이 나를 때리고 이름을 주었다...\" {n}녹-녹은 뭔가 표정을 짓는 것 같습니다… 설명하기 어렵습니다.{/n} \"녹-"
"녹의 잘못이다. 엄마는 녹-녹을 우리에서 키우지 않고 뛰어다니며 모험을 하게 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "da05d12d-9cfc-4002-8329-c56fbd9b2dcd"
msgid "\"But I only start tell! Best part come!\""
msgstr "\"이제 시작이다! 최고의 부분이 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "e5c9ae4d-83ac-4841-b841-78c6e4246daf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods, then gives you a pitying look.{/n} \"You longshanks raise "
"your shortshanks bad. Goblins raise right, keep children in cage until "
"bigger. It smart way to raise kids. Not wail and cry unless put spiders in "
"cage. Or snakes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 고개를 끄덕이며 불쌍한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"너희 꺽다리들은 아이들을 잘못 키우고있다. 고블린들이 제대로 키우고 "
"있는거다. 우린 아이들이 클때까지 '우리'안에서 키운다. 이게 아이들을 키우는 똑똑한 방법이다. 우리 안으로 거미나 뱀이 들어갈때까진 "
"아이들은 울거나 보채지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "d13b6261-b503-48d9-b72c-c64867389432"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shrugs.{/n} \"Not know. One day, realize I am wandering around. "
"Go find other goblins. Then...\" {n}He raps his head twice.{/n} \"Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"몰라. 돌아다니다가 고블린들 발견했다. 그래서...\" {n}그는 머리를 두 번 "
"두드립니다.{/n} \"녹-녹했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "bd1709d6-cf52-4480-980b-b7832e4603f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods eagerly, his eyes alight. He begins readying his weapons and "
"gear... you leave him to it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 또렷한 눈으로 간절히 끄덕입니다. 그는 무기와 장비를 준비하기 시작합니다. 당신은 그를 내버려둡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "7809948e-0728-47a1-b418-633d367a152a"
msgid "\"Enough.\" {n}He nods.{/n}"
msgstr "\"충분히.\" {n}그는 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "81569eaf-0b97-4a53-b3e5-07da877cdad1"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok smiles.{/n} \"Come to right place!\" {n}He jabs his thumb into "
"his own chest… then narrows his eyes at you suspiciously.{/n} \"But depend "
"on what you what knowing you want.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"제대로 찾아왔군!\" {n}그는 엄지 손가락으로 자신의 가슴을 가리키고는... 의심스럽게 눈이 "
"좁아집니다.{/n} \"하지만 네가 뭘 알고 싶어하느냐에 달려있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "3d7367a2-f37d-4f4e-ab13-1454d886ec56"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok face dims a bit.{/n} \"You have many questions. It problem with "
"you longshanks, it why you so unhappy.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹 얼굴은 조금 어둡습니다.{/n} \"너 질문이 많다. 이게 너희 꺽다리들의 문제다. 그래서 너희들이 불행한거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "7d5bb12d-dfe7-4dfc-87a6-fb4633f9558e"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok peers at you, then shakes his head slowly.{/n} \"Not us, you. You "
"longshanks and halfshanks are drunk with words, use too many, like a cloud "
"of flies out of your mouth, all that noise make it hard to listen to you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 당신을 보고는 머리를 천천히 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"우리는 너희들 아니다. 너희 꺽다리들 그리고 반쪽이들은 말 너무 "
"많다. 입에서 비내리고 시끄럽다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "2e71fd80-2e07-49b1-a7dd-21477ea7e55d"
msgid ""
"\"See — here you…\" {n}Nok-Nok raises a hand and flaps it, pantomiming "
"talking.{/n} \"'Me {mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}. Greet, word, ask, words, "
"more words, then boring words…'\" {n}The hand slows, then dips, making "
"snoring noises.{/n} \"...annnnd me now asleep.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기... 봐라.\" {n}녹-녹은 손을 들어서 입모양을 만들어 말하는 시늉을 합니다.{/n} \"나 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. "
"인사하고, 말하고, 묻고, 말하고, 더 많이 말하고, 지루하게 말하고...'\" {n}손이 느려지고는 멈추고 그는 코를 곱니다.{/n}"
" \"... 녹-녹 잠들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "05801ebb-d7e1-491e-9786-251de98227a1"
msgid ""
"\"Not your fault.\" {n}Nok-Nok gives you a pitying look as he tucks his hand "
"away.{/n} \"Nok-Nok help if can, but it YOU who not talk right. Longshanks "
"and halfshanks think goblins half-headed, no brain, but you are the "
"halfheads who drink too many words, and vomit them out. Don't tell that "
"halfshank, Linzee.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 잘못 아니다.\" {n}녹-녹은 손을 치우고는 피곤한 표정을 보여줍니다.{/n} \"녹-녹이 도울 수 있다면 돕겠지만, 말을 잘 "
"못하는것은 바로 너희들이다. 꺽다리와 반쪽이는 고블린 무식하다 생각하지만 바보는 말만 많은 너희들이다. 반쪽짜리 린지에게 말하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "6a40241a-4e16-4fef-86d5-a99cb2c6e59c"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks at you, then frowns, as if sizing you up.{/n} \"Be a hero. "
"Nok-Nok teach you, you teach Nok-Nok.\" {n}He gives a grin that nearly "
"splits his face.{/n} \"You see, yes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 당신을 보고는 당신을 가늠하듯 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"영웅이 돼라. 녹-녹이 너에게 가르치고 네가 녹-녹 가르쳐.\""
" {n}그는 싱긋 웃습니다.{/n} \"너 알아들었다. 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "67da3cc9-ca35-4948-8427-df28b2a3eb4b"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok frowns — then lights up.{/n} \"The village!\" {n}Then his "
"expression breaks, and he sighs wistfully.{/n} \"Yes. Smelled like toads. "
"Beasts eat bad goblins. Children kept in cages. All as should be.\" {n}His "
"face lights up again.{/n} \"But at least no see chief again. That good.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 찡그리고는 다시 밝아집니다.{/n} \"마을!\" {n}그런 다음 그의 표정이 사라지고 슬픈 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"그래"
". 두꺼비 냄새 난다. 짐승은 나쁜 고블린 먹는다. 아이들은 우리에 들어간다. 빠짐없이 들어간다.\" {n}그의 얼굴이 다시 "
"밝아집니다.{/n} \"최소한 대장을 안 본다. 그건 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "8ec23c68-ba30-4e8a-8cb9-5d7e1fef1f2f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok stares at you for a moment. You think he's about to cry, then he "
"breaks into a wide, horrific grin.{/n} \"Go on adventure? Adventure! Let's "
"go!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 잠시 당신을 봅니다. 그가 우는 것처럼 보였지만 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"모험 가? 모험! 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "17ab4838-2669-4547-8b39-10c6b6346e22"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok stares at you a moment, then nods, once.{/n} \"Yes. Better I go "
"first, take care of big troubles myself, you follow after Nok-Nok make all "
"safe.\" {n}He begins readying his weapons and gear… you leave him to it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 잠시 당신을 쳐다보고는 한번 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래. 나 먼저 가서 위험한 일 처리하면 너 녹-녹 안전히 따라올 수 "
"있다.\" {n}그는 무기와 장비를 준비하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "dfb7d062-64fa-44a4-8526-1a3ec4eed12b"
msgid "{n}Nok-Nok grin fades, then he slumps.{/n} \"Nok-Nok wait, then.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹의 미소가 사라지고는 털썩 앉습니다.{/n} \"녹-녹 기다려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "23e34c36-943a-4238-b32c-184bfb8fa5c2"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok wrinkles his nose — the visual is horrific.{/n} \"Linzee smell "
"gross, like spring flowers. Has tiny ears. Never files teeth. Combs hair "
"till shiny. Washes self and clothes. She...\" {n}He shudders.{/n} \"...WRITE "
"in book ALL time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹의 코는 주름졌고 끔찍해 보입니다.{/n} \"린지는 봄 꽃처럼 끔찍한 냄새 난다. 귀도 작다. 이빨 항상 깨끗하다. 머리 "
"항상 반짝이게 빗질한다. 깨끗하게 씻는다. 그녀는...\" {n}그는 떱니다.{/n} \"... 항상 책 쓴다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0054_Text_String
msgctxt "0b39daf1-c0e2-4d89-b9b6-de437882c0a6"
msgid ""
"\"What WRONG with writing?\" {n}Nok-Nok stares at you as if a frog just "
"hopped out of your mouth.{/n} \"All goblins know why. It steals think-"
"thoughts! Takes them away!\" {n}He shudders again.{/n} \"Linzee do it all "
"the time, but somehow she STILL have think-thoughts. Why she have so many?\""
msgstr ""
"\"글을 쓰는게 무슨 잘못이냐고?\" {n}녹-녹은 마치 개구리가 당신의 입에서 튀어나온 듯이 당신을 응시합니다.{/n} \"모든 "
"고블린들은 알고있다. 그건 생각을 뺏는다. 멀리해야 한다!\" {n}그는 다시 몸을 떱니다.{/n} \"린지는 하루 종일 글을 쓰지만, "
"무슨 일인지 아직 생각 많이 남아있다. 왜 저렇게 생각 많이 가지고 다니는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "e02faeba-966f-467e-bd20-1d0fa4ccceee"
msgid "\"You say leave, I leave. But I back now.\""
msgstr "\"네가 떠나라고 했다. 나 떠났다. 나 지금 돌아왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "1fddd68d-aa98-428c-bc09-8736d6a4c41b"
msgid ""
"\"I go on adventure, then come back for you. Not fair if I have adventure "
"and you not.\""
msgstr "\"나 모험 떠나 네게 다시 돌아온다. 나 모험하고 너 못하면 불공평하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "a4731134-0043-4549-b630-39dbcd6e4d25"
msgid "\"Yes. Great adventure! Should go together next time!\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 위대한 모험! 다음에 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "0c756d23-d6eb-4073-a33e-6fcd894ac482"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok stares at you for several moments. Then a few more. Finally, he "
"leans in and whispers.{/n} \"Why you stare at me? Do I have bug on my face?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 잠시 동안 당신을 봅니다. 그리고는 또 다시 당신을 봅니다. 마침내 그는 몸을 기울여 속삭입니다.{/n} \"왜 나를 "
"보지? 내 얼굴에 벌레라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "69152a6b-872b-447c-8b12-3868d3718858"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok blinks with his right eye, then with his left one.{/n} \"Well, "
"ask.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 오른쪽 눈을 깜박이고는 이어서 왼쪽 눈을 깜박입니다.{/n} \"물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "8e3e673e-8c37-4d45-8645-8db70b161406"
msgid "\"About something what?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "e49b95cb-4adb-4aca-9e5d-6f8f1a0b2c0d"
msgid ""
"\"Hkkt!\" {n}Nok-Nok shakes his head violently, and makes a vomiting "
"motion.{/n} \"Other halfshanks, they just squealing bloodbags waiting to "
"pop, but Linzee like chatterfly.\" {n}Nok-Nok rolls eyes.{/n} \"Linzee, "
"Linzee, Linzee, write, write, write.\" {n}He folds his arms, then huffs "
"under his breath.{/n} \"She sing bad, too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"으웩!\" {n}녹-녹은 격렬하게 머리를 흔들고는 토하는 시늉을 합니다.{/n} \"다른 반쪽이들 원숭이처럼 소리지르지만 린지는 "
"참새처럼 지저귄다.\" {n}녹-녹은 눈알을 굴립니다.{/n} \"린지는 쓰고, 쓰고, 쓴다.\" {n}그는 팔짱을 끼고는 "
"씩씩댑니다.{/n} \"게다가 노래도 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "5da7f61b-e96a-4ddc-afc5-39ac89795b1a"
msgid ""
"\"What? No! Nok-Nok not want wife.\" {n}He makes a gagging motion.{/n} \"Not "
"her. Gross. Getting... sick.\" {n}You step back — he genuinely looks like "
"he's about to vomit.{/n} \"Wait — no. Swallowed it back. All good.\" {n}Nok-"
"Nok licks his lips.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 싫어! 녹-녹은 아내 같은 거 원하지 않는다.\" {n}그는 토하는 시늉을 합니다.{/n} \"그녀는 아니다. 끔찍하다. "
"으... 토 나올 것 같다.\" {n}그가 정말 토하는 것처럼 보이자 당신은 뒤로 물러납니다.{/n} \"잠깐. 다시 삼켰다. 이제 "
"괜찮다.\" {n}녹-녹은 입술을 핥습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "30f71ca7-15ed-438d-992a-403c13ab2ca7"
msgid ""
"\"What WRONG with writing?\" {n}Nok-Nok stares at you as if a frog just "
"hopped out of your mouth.{/n} \"All goblins know why. It steals think-"
"thoughts! Takes them away!\" {n}He shudders again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"글쓰기가 왜 잘못됐냐고?\" {n}녹-녹은 마치 개구리가 당신의 입에서 튀어나온 듯이 당신을 응시합니다.{/n} \"고블린은 안다. "
"그것 생각을 뺏는다. 시간 낭비다!\" {n}그는 다시 몸을 떱니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "d8d8e8c1-2579-4adc-8e73-726ab42c0294"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's eyes widen — he seems genuinely terrified.{/n} \"Errrrr, not "
"tell her that! No! She write in book, curse Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹의 눈이 커집니다. 그는 정말 겁에 질린 것 같습니다.{/n} \"으으, 말하지 마! 안돼! 린지 책에다 녹-녹 저주한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "828883cd-d187-4776-b102-8ea0973d661d"
msgid "\"Yes. No more Linzee. Ever!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 린지는 그만. 끝!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "76d038d7-ba88-4df1-a4ac-90bfe50b03a4"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok frowns.{/n} \"What — like 'Nok-Nok kick fast, Nok-Nok bite deep, "
"Nok-Nok stab you while you sleep'?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이 노래를 말하는건가? — 녹-녹이 널 발로 차버리고, 녹-녹이 깨물어 버리고, 녹-녹이 너 자는 "
"동안 칼침 놓네\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "e325fb10-2050-4254-96a8-a30d3560db03"
msgid ""
"{n}There is a long, uncomfortable silence as Nok-Nok stares at you, dragging "
"his finger across his blade, as if coaxing it to sleep.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 그의 칼을 따라 손가락을 그리며 칼을 재우는 시늉을 하고는 당신을 뚫어지게 바라보자, 길고 불편한 침묵이 이어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "9b72e733-bdb5-416f-a715-d43db450391e"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok face dims a bit.{/n} \"You have many questions. It problem with "
"you halfshanks, it why you so unhappy.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹 얼굴은 조금 어둡습니다.{/n} \"너 질문이 많다. 너희 반쪽이 문제 많다. 그래서 불행하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "fd34bee1-0267-40b5-a6f7-00bf29e6843f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok finally breaks the silence by shaking his head.{/n} \"No. Songs "
"make ears hurt, want to bury head in the dirt.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 결국 그의 머리를 흔들면서 침묵을 깨뜨렸습니다.{/n} \"뭐 됐어. 노래라는 건 귀만 아파. 머리만 땅에 묻고파.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "6d814e4e-2063-4b95-8489-b26193052c41"
msgid "\"That? A song it not, not what you thought.\""
msgstr "\"뭐래. 네 귀엔 이게 노래? 그냥 네 귀나 좀 파줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "462bed11-bbb4-4dac-a122-4542de3f41f9"
msgid "\"Questions about what?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 질문?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "58849f9c-61cc-47bd-a89b-facbcbf07947"
msgid ""
"\"No, no,\" {n}Nok-Nok holds up his hands, his eyes wide.{/n} \"NEVER mock "
"Hero. Nok-Nok NEVER mok-mok you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니.\" {n}녹-녹은 손을 위로 뻗고 그의 눈은 커집니다.{/n} \"영웅을 조롱하지 마라. 녹-녹은 너 조롱 안한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "219b103d-00bd-49fe-97a8-9590f3a96512"
msgid "\"Goblins sing, yes. Nok-Nok — no.\""
msgstr "\"고블린 노래한다. 녹-녹은 안한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "42d3dc62-362a-490a-8269-cb5c91ade566"
msgid ""
"\"You say what? I know not.\" {n}A mischevious flicker flashes across Nok-"
"Nok's eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "\"뭐라고? 나는 모른다.\" {n}녹-녹은 장난꾸러기처럼 눈을 깜빡입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "2f577b0f-6a8b-40cc-8552-d255a7879097"
msgid ""
"\"Other goblins?\" {n}Nok-Nok glares at you, then raises his nose – then "
"pinches it, as if smelling something foul.{/n} \"Other tribes, they put on "
"big show, add extra words, words, words, waste everyone's time.\"\n"
"{n}He removes his fingers from his nose, and shakes his head — then gives a "
"sinister grin, as if about to tell a ghost story.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"다른 고블린들?\" {n}녹-녹은 당신을 보고는 얼굴을 들어 올려 집게손가락으로 코를 잡습니다.{/n} \"다른 부족들은 큰 판이나 벌여서 "
"말하고 또 말하고 해서 모두의 시간이나 뺏을 뿐이다.\" \n"
"{n}그는 코에서 손가락을 떼고, 머리를 흔들고는 으스스한 이야기를 하려는 듯 음침하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "522ccb79-2dbf-4448-a757-3d68bd460c4f"
msgid ""
"\"Legend say other goblins steal words from Nok-Nok's tribe.\" {n}He glances "
"around quickly, then leans in with a whisper.{/n} \"Not true. They speak "
"more words, but it is because they are all cursed to do so.\" {n}He stands "
"proudly, his eyes closed, as if at attention.{/n} \"In Stolen Lands, goblins "
"speak correct.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 고블린들이 녹-녹 부족의 말을 훔친다는 전설이 있다.\" {n}그는 빨리 주변을 훑어보고는 몸을 기울여 속삭입니다.{/n} "
"\"사실이 아니다. 그들은 사실 원래 더 많은 말을 하는데, 모두 저주를 받아서 말 많이 하는거다.\" {n}그는 늠름하게 서서 고개를 "
"치켜세웁니다.{/n} \"도둑맞은 땅에서 고블린들은 올바르게 말한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "34b1ea16-e9d0-4c98-9651-1a0ecec295da"
msgid ""
"{n}As if trying to prove his point, Nok-Nok remains silent, his eyes closed. "
"After a moment, one of his ears pricks up and he cracks an eyelid open "
"slightly to see if you are still there, then shuts it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 그의 요점을 정리하려는 듯 조용히 눈을 감고 침묵합니다. 잠시 후 그의 귀 한쪽이 쫑긋하며 당신이 자리에 있는지 눈을 "
"슬그머니 뜨고는 다시 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0099_Text
msgctxt "9d670655-24e8-401e-8a6f-ab549ef0f0de"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Be praised, oh Mother of Beasts! You want to pay respect to her? I "
"will show you!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 짐승의 어머니! 찬양한다! 너 기도하고 싶어? 내가 보여줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "776a0f5d-9783-4910-8aeb-65c3858c796e"
msgid "\"You like it! Promise!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 약속!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "ff25fa20-5e5d-4fbd-b579-e4a56f58af3e"
msgid "\"What? No! Shrines sacred! You see when you come there!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 안돼! 성소 신성하다! 아무때나 가는 거 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "eaf64c2d-9b68-4317-9b4f-edcb9752ba1b"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok gives you a puzzling look, then shakes his head.{/n} \"Come with "
"me to the shrines! We pray together!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 당신에게 수수께끼 같은 표정을 짓고 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"나와 함께 성소 가자! 함께 기도한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "eb26df48-c5fe-4220-85d5-f1feaf6c8d8f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok gives a grin that nearly splits his face, and his ears perk "
"up.{/n} \"Growing, many are drawn by the stink, all swarm to the Mother's "
"shrines like happy flies. More and more animals, too, rats and snakes and..."
"\" {n}He licks his lips.{/n} \"Even more than we can eat! The temple and "
"bellies are full, and Mother is pleased.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹의 웃음은 얼굴의 반을 덮었고 그의 귀가 쫑긋합니다.{/n} \"악취에 이끌려 파리처럼 계속 어머니의 성소에 모여든다. 동물, "
"쥐와 뱀이 계속 모여든다...\" {n}그는 입술을 핥습니다.{/n} \"우리가 먹을 수 있는 것보다 많이 온다! 사원은 가득차고 우리 "
"배도 가득 찬다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0111_Text
msgctxt "4d82914b-b14e-4e26-99e8-05d552023088"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods, and you notice he's still wearing the same grin, staring "
"off into space and rubbing his belly. You decide to let it go.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 고개를 끄덕였고 당신은 그가 똑같은 미소를 허공에 보내고 배를 문지르고 있음을 알게 됩니다. 당신은 그를 내버려두기로 "
"결정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0112_Text
msgctxt "c5fe32b9-07e5-4385-b0ce-0f7ab97cf67d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's ears droop, and his eyes fall.{/n} \"All down, easier to knock "
"down than were to build up.\" {n}He glances around.{/n} \"I hope Mother not "
"upset with me. With us. If so, worry beasts will find us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹의 귀가 처지고 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"짓는 것보다 무너뜨리는 것이 더 쉽다.\" {n}그는 주위를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} "
"\"어머니가 나에게 화나지 않기를 바란다. 너에게도. 화나면 무서운 괴물 우리 쫓는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0113_Text
msgctxt "4b49fd7b-1dab-42e4-a48e-0390451c407c"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods slowly, but his face is still downcast, staring off into "
"space. As if on cue, his belly rumbles, almost sadly. You decide to leave "
"the matter alone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 천천히 끄덕이지만 그의 얼굴은 여전히 허공을 보며 울상을 짓고 있습니다. 갑자기 그의 배에서 꼬르륵 소리가 납니다. 당신은 "
"그를 내버려두기로 결정했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0114_Text
msgctxt "adc4722c-04b0-4b49-940a-81fce84a2e99"
msgid ""
"\"Hiding. Sneaking.\" {n}Nok-Nok grins.{/n} \"Goblins good at hiding and "
"sneaking. You will hear from us soon. You no worry!\""
msgstr ""
"\"숨고 살금살금 간다.\" {n}녹-녹은 웃습니다.{/n} \"고블린은 은신하고 몰래하는 일 잘한다. 곧 좋은 소식 알려준다. 걱정 "
"마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7d998f95-8a1f-4bce-97e2-a060433ddb83"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok doesn't look up at your approach, he's hunched over, hard in "
"thought — one of his ears is even twitching slightly at the effort.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 당신이 접근하는 것을 보지 않고 허리를 구부린 상태로 생각에 빠졌습니다. 그의 한쪽 귀가 천천히 씰룩거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0120_Text
msgctxt "31e93ae4-ff65-4869-9d1d-4e902704adcf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's ear twitching stops in mid-twitch, and he swivels his head "
"toward you.{/n} \"Been thinking about being a Hero. If Nok-Nok can even BE a "
"Hero or not.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹의 씰룩거리다 멈추고는 고개를 당신에게 돌립니다.{/n} \"영웅이 되는 것 생각했다. 녹-녹이 영웅이 될 수 없어도 생각했다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0121_Text
msgctxt "bc1889e9-fb87-4fa4-b50d-6e503f5b9085"
msgid ""
"{n}He nods at you.{/n} \"You are longshanks and halfshanks who speak poorly, "
"mangle words, bathes...\" {n}He gestures around.{/n} \"...but you make big "
"tribe, found nation, build big city... even if city smells bad... do great "
"things, and... Nok-Nok does things, and they seem... small, ridiculous. I "
"want to do what you do — but asking — how?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 당신을 보고 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"너희 꺽다리들과 반쪽이들 말 못하고 서투르다...\" {n}그는 몸짓을 더합니다.{/n} "
"\"...하지만 너희 큰 부족 만들어 나라 새우고 큰 도시 세웠다... 도시 악취 나지만... 훌륭하고 또... 녹-녹 훌륭하지만... "
"그저 그렇다. 녹-녹 너희 하는 것 하고 싶다. 근데 물어야 한다. 어떻게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0127_Text
msgctxt "217231ac-ca3f-458f-b12a-c03dbaa41b5c"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks downcast, his face uncertain. He stares at the ground, and "
"he seems defeated.{/n} \"{name} right. Useless. Couldn't make a difference – "
"a Hero could.\" {n}He glances at you.{/n} \"Still, Nok-Nok will stay. Keep "
"trying. Find a way, and if not...\" {n}He gives a tiny shrug.{/n} \"Then no "
"worse off than before.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 시무룩해져서 표정이 사라집니다. 그는 땅을 보았고 패배함을 느낍니다.{/n} \" {name} 맞다. 쓸모 없다. 변화를 "
"가져올 수 없다. 영웅이 할 변화를.\" {n}그는 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"아직도 녹-녹 머물 것이다. 길을 찾아서. 하지만 "
"못찾는다면...\" {n}그는 작은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"그보다 나빠질 건 없으니까. 뭐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0132_Text
msgctxt "d5932ea1-8863-4688-b607-af8d373afcbc"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok sighs, then looks up at you.{/n} \"You want something else?\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 한숨을 쉬며 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"다른 것을 원해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0133_Text
msgctxt "9111a573-3fde-46b6-8455-b1ab7b012591"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks downcast, his face uncertain. He stares at the ground, and "
"despite your encouragement, he seems defeated.{/n} \"Useless. Couldn't make "
"a difference – all of them laughed, laughed at me trying to be a Hero.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 시무룩해져서 표정이 사라집니다. 그는 땅을 보았고 패배함을 느낍니다.{/n} \" 쓸모 없다. 변화를 가져올 수 없다. "
"모두 웃는다. 영웅이 되려는 나를 비웃는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0136_Text
msgctxt "c13fc657-fe23-45f7-85d5-f78f39858fc2"
msgid ""
"\"A king?\" {n}After a moment, he glances at you.{/n} \"But aren't you ruler?"
"\" {n}He pauses again, and raises his fingers.{/n} \"Two rulers...\"{n} He "
"touches each finger as if trying to count, then gives up in disgust.{/n} "
"\"Two rulers would be bad.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕?\" {n}잠시 후 그는 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"하지만 너 통치자가 아니야?\" {n}그는 다시 잠시 멈추고 손가락을 들어 "
"올립니다.{/n} \"두 명의 통치자...\" {n}그는 수를 세는 것처럼 각 손가락을 건드렸고 싫증내며 포기했습니다.{/n} \"두 "
"명의 통치자는 나쁠 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0140_Text
msgctxt "dde4c677-6671-4f99-9cf1-8dbda9f7424f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods, then nods again, sharper and faster – he straightens, and "
"does what passes for a royal stance.{/n} \"Nok-Nok. Jester Nok-Nok.\" {n}He "
"nods one last time, solemnly.{/n} \"I will not fail you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 끄덕이는데 날카롭고 빠릅니다. 몸을 똑바로 펴는 그의 모습은 위풍당당한 자태입니다.{/n} \"녹 "
"녹. 광대 녹-녹.\" {n}그는 마지막으로 엄숙하게 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"나는 너를 실망시키지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0145_Text
msgctxt "02c95447-88c2-4829-af6d-0980f207c4ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods – with a trace of pride and a grin you haven't seen before. "
"He looks... completely happy in his new role. You hope you don't regret "
"this.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 이전에 보지 못했던 자부심과 미소를 지니고 끄덕입니다. 그는 새로운 역할에서 완전히 행복해 보입니다. 당신은이 이것을 "
"후회하지 않기를 바랍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0146_Text
msgctxt "280c3c59-62c5-4528-a62d-4bb4b0e5d0e7"
msgid ""
"{n}At your words, Nok-Nok straightens, inch by inch, until he's standing "
"tall. He holds in his breath proudly – until you seem his ears turn red, "
"then he exhales, coughing... but when his fit ends, he seems to be chewing "
"over your words, and nodding to himself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말에 맞추어 녹-녹은 몸을 꼿꼿히 폈고 키가 제법 커 보입니다. 그는 의기양양하게 숨을 참습니다. 당신은 그의 귀가 붉어지는 "
"것을 보았고 그는 한숨을 몰아 쉬며 기침합니다... 하지만 기침이 끝나고 그는 당신의 말을 곱씹으며 혼자 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0151_Text
msgctxt "1d0dc024-59f9-4e24-96a8-d07809c3d73d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks up at you, his eyes narrow, as if trying to judge if you're "
"being serious.{/n} \"You mean it? Nok-Nok proved self?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 당신을 바라보고 마치 당신이 진심인지 의심하는 듯 눈이 좁아집니다.{/n} \"진짜냐? 녹-녹 스스로 입증했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0156_Text
msgctxt "70ac4364-057e-437b-815c-bc098a940898"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok kneels down, winces as his knee finds a rock, then shifts to a "
"new position, accidentally facing away from you. You decide to let it go.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 무릎을 꿇었는데 돌에 무릎을 부딪힌 듯 찡그리고는 멀리 떨어져 있는 새로운 위치로 이동합니다. 당신은 그를 내버려두기로 "
"결정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0159_Text
msgctxt "695b1679-c035-4cbd-940a-a5e09cbfeb23"
msgid ""
"{n}After a moment, he grunts, straightens, and places his hands on his "
"hips.{/n} \"I accept.\" {n}He thinks for a moment.{/n} \"Now all is needed "
"is a Hero statue!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 후 그가 끙끙대며 허리를 펴고는 손을 허리에 짚습니다.{/n} \"나는 동의한다.\" {n}그는 잠시 생각합니다.{/n} "
"\"이제 모든 영웅 동상이 필요하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/Cue_0164_Text
msgctxt "797bbcaa-c84a-4e42-a7fa-192613cc43ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok seems lost in thought... completely happy at your acknowledgment "
"of his role. You hope you don't regret this.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 혼란한 것 같습니다... 자신의 역할을 인정해주는 당신 덕에 행복에 빠진 것 같습니다. 당신이 이것을 후회하지 않기를 "
"바랍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/NokNok/NokNok_NoDialogue_String
msgctxt "ed1578b3-9fc1-4a70-91e8-1b5046d39a67"
msgid ""
"\"Me be your friend now! Hail be to baron{mf||ess} and {mf|his|her} goblin "
"friend!\""
msgstr "\"나 이제 너의 친구다! 고블린 친구 남작 최고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d657db43-95c2-4159-a6f8-fa237ca73719"
msgid "\"Could you tell me about your childhood, please?\""
msgstr "\"어린 시절에 대해 말해 줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "21a660a6-d884-4fda-b3a0-b2d7915392ff"
msgid "\"Will you tell me about your life in slavery?\""
msgstr "\"노예 생활에 대해 말해줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c4599537-777e-46c0-8b50-054c3498f2cd"
msgid "\"What kind of relationship do you have with Regongar?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르와 무슨 관계지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "93af442e-1919-4b62-8aa0-5d1334d40de1"
msgid ""
"\"I just have to ask... How do you manage to look so gorgeous, even when "
"we're out in the middle of nowhere?\""
msgstr "\"꼭 묻고 싶었는데... 어떻게 던전에서조차 그렇게 멋을 유지할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "984bf40a-09c9-462c-adee-237a23a04806"
msgid "\"Why do you need to find the Technic League agents?\""
msgstr "\"왜 기술 연맹 요원을 찾아야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "1c7ba728-aa30-48ae-af2f-db763e5e0c73"
msgid ""
"\"It's amazing how, after all your hardships, you still remain so cheerful "
"and optimistic.\""
msgstr "\"그런 고난을 겪은 후에도 여전히 명랑하고 낙관적일 수 있다니 놀라운데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "b7810592-ccc4-4e84-8a4e-697b5f27d6dc"
msgid "\"All right. We'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 또 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "9be6fd7c-7666-4ccb-9040-4035cecc7644"
msgid "\"What, exactly, do you remember?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 무엇이 기억나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "97303da4-4b28-4104-9919-eb41a5d54dc0"
msgid "\"What do you know about your parents? You're a half-elf, right?\""
msgstr "\"부모님에 대해 알려줄래? 너 하프엘프 맞지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "bdf83793-2f11-4174-8277-6d0602d759d4"
msgid "\"Do you remember how you were enslaved?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 노예가 됐는지 기억해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "840517db-fd23-42ba-b0f9-7ef9c00e2bae"
msgid "\"It must be horrible, being unable to recall your childhood.\""
msgstr "\"어린 시절을 회상할 수 없는 것은 끔찍한 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "7a910950-7bd6-41e4-88c8-22d167a59b63"
msgid "\"I want to ask you about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 물어보고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "c0165721-7e8c-43a0-a544-02bac0d00ec2"
msgid "\"Did you have many masters over the years?\""
msgstr "\"지난 몇 년 동안 많은 주인이 있었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "8ff93b84-a75d-4f50-9dc7-cc8c70ddacb2"
msgid "\"Where did you learn to use magic?\""
msgstr "\"어디에서 마법을 배웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "31189a08-ed71-41e9-b72b-842d2af45088"
msgid "\"Have you ever tried to run away?\""
msgstr "\"도망치려고 시도한 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "3dbb92d4-a3ff-44e5-b764-be49f45fcc3a"
msgid "\"Have your masters ever hurt you?\""
msgstr "\"주인이 너를 다치게 한 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "c0b619fc-e697-420d-8176-a6eb9eb869df"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "be02f25d-7eed-4527-aadd-ca4411220782"
msgid ""
"\"I won't let anyone harm those who are dear to me. Whatever happens, you "
"can count on me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 어떤 녀석이라도 소중한 사람을 해치게 두지 않아. 나를 믿어도 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a0deb1b1-854a-4292-bef2-2c62f84eade9"
msgid "Promised to protect Octavia from slavers."
msgstr "노예 주인으로부터 옥타비아를 보호하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "84ce0692-6999-477e-8ec0-cf4958cf0027"
msgid ""
"\"I won't let those filthy slave traders to take you again! Just let them "
"try!\""
msgstr "\"더러운 노예 상인들이 너를 다시 데려가게 하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0052_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2a28850f-7a15-42ee-9e8f-f01168cc27e8"
msgid "Promised Octavia to deal with the slavers."
msgstr "노예 상인들을 대신 처리해주겠다고 옥타비아에게 약속합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "3ab85ab1-730c-48c4-b74f-4e7fa48e0d4d"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you're with us now. I'm confident that I should be able to make a "
"deal with them.\""
msgstr "\"너는 지금 우리와 함께 있어. 물론 너를 그들에게서 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0053_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "efa3fb23-290e-4bd4-9122-53dcf3fa3280"
msgid "Called Octavia a \"valuable resource.\""
msgstr "옥타비아를 \"귀중한 자원\"이라고 불렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "5ba5df95-6911-4244-81e4-3efaf9338594"
msgid "\"I never throw away valuable resources. They won't get you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 결코 귀중한 자원을 버리지 않아. 그들은 너를 잡지 못할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "1fac21e4-fc70-4696-a008-b554313621c6"
msgid ""
"\"The way you said 'we're together' sounded unconvincing. Is something wrong?"
"\""
msgstr "\"'우린 함께에요'라는 말은 별로 확신이 없어 보이는군. 무슨 문제라도 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "242a865b-4a2d-4f65-b01a-615c02a0e3d1"
msgid "\"When did you meet Reg?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르는 언제 처음 만났어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "5551a562-092d-4fcc-864c-22f3bb685659"
msgid "\"You owe him much?\""
msgstr "\"그에게 많은 빚을 졌나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "718b6756-5d9b-4508-a9ba-56b2420f746a"
msgid "\"The fact that Reg is so… impulsive, doesn't bother you?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르가 충동적이라서 힘들지는 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "a1c2c5de-bb5e-4121-87b9-de05c85ce5a0"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "e465254f-829a-4b32-a629-786b9e544701"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Octavia, the flower of the Stolen Lands! You're as beautiful as you "
"are dangerous. You strike down monsters with your spells as you strike down "
"people with your beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아! 도둑맞은 땅의 한떨기 꽃! 너는 위험할 정도로 아름다워. 아름다움으로 사람들을 제압하듯이 마법으로 괴물을 제압하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0086_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "404ba9b3-aee9-4a31-8d9d-ca56b0bcfe1f"
msgid "Complimented Octavia's efforts to look beautiful."
msgstr "아름답게 보이려는 옥타비아의 노력을 칭찬했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "545bc56d-23db-4fed-b37c-9b57116e2c2e"
msgid ""
"\"You sure put a lot of effort into this, but the results make it worthwhile!"
"\""
msgstr "\"많은 노력을 기울였지만 그 결과는 가치있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0087_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "13f8e6fb-1033-4df4-8cba-7db6b30515fe"
msgid "Ignored Octavia's efforts to look beautiful."
msgstr "아름답게 보이려는 옥타비아의 노력을 무시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "aa58ddd5-fdf4-4c3a-8670-2a092094a02d"
msgid "\"So much effort… Though that's your business.\""
msgstr "\"노력은 가상한데... 그건 네 사정이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0088_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a098465b-c327-47f2-b1bf-7fd4bd0bbf18"
msgid "Reproached Octavia's efforts to look beautiful."
msgstr "아름답게 보이려는 옥타비아의 노력을 나무랍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "b3cffab9-14e0-4c0e-8d4d-150a281f9da0"
msgid ""
"\"I'd prefer that you get enough rest. Stop wasting your time on this "
"nonsense.\""
msgstr "\"좀 쉬어둬. 쓸데없는 말로 시간 낭비 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100000_Text
msgctxt "c3097a73-2e1c-4f2c-8fd8-b5869df2d941"
msgid "\"I am glad you understand.\""
msgstr "\"네가 잘 알고있어 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100005_Text
msgctxt "a9a749cb-f484-441a-9ceb-5518b48bcdde"
msgid "\"I'm sorry I stole Regongar from you.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르에게서 너를 빼앗아가서 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100008_Text
msgctxt "d46ad2ec-f4cd-4006-9cd6-0fc0ea3eb0e6"
msgid "\"Our romance was a mistake. It would be best if we end it.\""
msgstr "\"우리의 연애는 실수였다. 끝내는 것이 가장 좋을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100011_Text_String
msgctxt "3614f846-590f-42f7-8363-fda16373494f"
msgid "\"All right. Let's try to keep our love alive.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 우리의 사랑을 계속하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100012_Text
msgctxt "ec4d6498-472f-4914-8964-01afc352d53b"
msgid "\"No. It will be better for both of us if we just stay friends.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 친구로 남는게 우리에게 더 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100015_Text
msgctxt "1f8c3bdf-de48-43a2-a201-0e28b23735e4"
msgid ""
"\"This romance is a mistake. You and Reg will be better off without me.\""
msgstr "\"우리 만남은 잘못되었어. 너와 레곤가르 사이에 내가 없는게 맞아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100020_Text
msgctxt "c2631542-03da-40c8-b7a8-f965cf6b7cd3"
msgid "\"No. It will be better for both of us if we just stay friends.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 친구로 남으면 우리에게 더 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_100022_Text
msgctxt "4e6c8273-1f8b-4fd6-8c32-a2549fc4b07d"
msgid "\"You worship Calistria, right?\""
msgstr "\"너 칼리스트리아를 숭배하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99916_Text
msgctxt "245fb08d-2367-4d5d-a2b2-9bb707b6b1e3"
msgid "\"How did you happen to find yourself in the Stolen Lands?\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에서 어떻게 자신을 발견하게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99919_Text
msgctxt "3dc3f054-501a-487a-ad5b-c4fa3f5ff5b5"
msgid "\"I don't need you any longer. Go away.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 더 이상 필요로 하지 않아. 가버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99921_Text
msgctxt "5807d283-e999-4a35-95a1-fd0241eb810f"
msgid "\"My decision is final. You both should go.\""
msgstr "\"내 결정은 확고해. 둘 다 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99922_Text
msgctxt "134b60ac-fbb6-4ad9-b1d1-c226db17f5d2"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, I didn't mean to scare you like that. Let's pretend I didn't say "
"anything.\""
msgstr "\"미안. 너를 겁주려던 것은 아니었어. 내가 한 말은 잊어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99927_Text
msgctxt "b6798f7a-1f73-4acb-9896-cc0e20b78f49"
msgid "\"What will you say to Janush when you see him?\""
msgstr "\"자누시를 만난다면 무슨 말을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99928_Text
msgctxt "c69dad03-86b9-405c-bc6b-77d404a96cdb"
msgid "\"Do you regret letting Janush escape?\""
msgstr "\"자누시를 도망가게 둔 것을 후회하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99929_Text
msgctxt "56c80b56-c47a-4ccb-bf1d-29b811ec56ad"
msgid "\"Do you regret chasing after Janush?\""
msgstr "\"자누시를 뒤쫓은 것을 후회스러워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99930_Text
msgctxt "b16ac1ea-5c14-44a9-80ba-14caefac66b5"
msgid "\"How's your mother?\""
msgstr "\"어머니는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99931_Text
msgctxt "fee19177-a32b-4869-a8c5-6995c4151b08"
msgid "\"Do you want to return to Pitax and find your mother again?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스로 돌아가서 어머니를 찾고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99943_Text
msgctxt "15bde8da-79eb-48f8-bdc3-dbc29723b342"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing to thank me for. You were the one who made the right call."
"\""
msgstr "\"나한테 고마워할 거 없어. 올바른 결정을 내린 건 너였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99944_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "eeae81a3-62cd-455e-afcb-983347d4488c"
msgid ""
"Shared your opinion on the events in the Technic League's lair with Octavia."
msgstr "옥타비아와 기술 연맹의 은신처에서 있었던 사건에 대한 의견을 나누었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99944_Text
msgctxt "d3fc8948-a2c1-4e40-9232-ecf77d585031"
msgid "\"You know I'm always here to support you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 항상 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99945_Text
msgctxt "0fca0e52-d191-4d41-b71b-59d8313f4ee1"
msgid "\"We made a mistake. We should never have let that monster escape.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 실수를 저질렀다. 괴물이 도망가지 못하게 막았어야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99946_Text
msgctxt "939ff0bb-6978-49bf-ad95-2cc0d84f5eda"
msgid ""
"\"We made a terrible mistake. So many people died for the sake of revenge.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 끔찍한 실수를 저질렀다. 그래서 많은 사람들이 복수의 희생자로 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99947_Text
msgctxt "e405bb81-d139-4dd6-a1d9-ff394c3d5bf1"
msgid ""
"\"It was a difficult decision, but someone had to take responsibility.\""
msgstr "\"어려운 결정이었지만 누군가 책임을 져야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99948_Text
msgctxt "74f2ede0-d777-4aa1-bbab-f4d6c38d6319"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to achieve anything in this world, you'll have to get used to "
"such decisions. Mercy is a wasteful luxury.\""
msgstr "\"이 세상에서 무엇인가를 이루고 싶다면 그러한 결정에 익숙해져야 해. 자비는 쓸모 없는 사치다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99949_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "80922d67-ac6b-4885-97e4-2ea30820b443"
msgid "Shared your opinion on Octavia's meeting with her mother."
msgstr "어머니와 옥타비아의 만남에 대한 당신의 의견을 나눴습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99949_Text
msgctxt "0c8c1988-9db8-4fc0-9146-52d17b898d3d"
msgid "\"You're an exceptionally kind person.\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 친절한 사람이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99950_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "07bde9ac-572d-4057-8b3a-8903f7a4ec90"
msgid "Shared your opinion on Octavia's meeting with her mother."
msgstr "어머니와 옥타비아의 만남에 대한 당신의 의견을 나눴습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99950_Text
msgctxt "c86ebe18-1463-4435-9698-dd9ad0f39008"
msgid "\"I'm glad you're all right.\""
msgstr "\"네가 무사해서 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99951_Text
msgctxt "b24a71f5-88ba-4a0f-af4c-277c1cdfc7e2"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand how you could forgive her. I probably never would.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그녀를 용서할 수 있었는지 이해하지 못한다. 앞으로도 그럴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99961_Text
msgctxt "4c9a168b-ae19-4c52-b891-dced99b6e2d3"
msgid "\"You worry too much about that nonsense. Just forget about it.\""
msgstr "\"말도 안되는 것에 대해 너무 걱정한다. 잊어버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99965_Text
msgctxt "6ca8ac46-3600-49f1-934a-17b1aaf29b08"
msgid "\"That's very cruel of you.\""
msgstr "\"그건 너에게 매우 잔인하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99966_Text
msgctxt "7ff510aa-adbb-48e5-bb3e-cdecaad3d4c4"
msgid "\"As you wish. I respect your decision, whatever it may be.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로. 너의 결정을 존중한다. 그것이 무엇이든간에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99967_Text
msgctxt "17fd92ae-c7d6-477d-bc70-6517b553963a"
msgid "\"She got off easy. You shouldn't have let her live.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 쉽게 떠났어. 그녀를 살려서는 안되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99972_Text
msgctxt "2a40b272-ef65-45b5-86c1-077106e1093b"
msgid ""
"[Put your hand around Octavia's waist] \"Would you like... Some alone time?\""
msgstr "[옥타비아의 허리에 손을 올리며] \"우리... 단 둘의 시간을 가져 볼까??\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99978_Text
msgctxt "9a32d5d6-e2ec-4071-b904-9ac9509b1c3a"
msgid "\"Of course!\""
msgstr "\"당연하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99979_Text
msgctxt "e3b254e4-0458-45ab-84cf-4dd46528d178"
msgid "\"I want to be alone with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 단 둘이 있고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99984_Text
msgctxt "870147f9-5db5-4ae9-9823-1adf0a58dd84"
msgid "\"Or maybe you are...\""
msgstr "\"아니면 너는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99985_Text
msgctxt "73cb2a95-727c-4601-a4dc-0f5a319da1cd"
msgid "\"What's wrong? Do you want to talk about it?\""
msgstr "\"도대체 왜 그래? 그것에 대해 이야기하고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99986_Text
msgctxt "fa062e91-7a47-4940-912b-098998a0807d"
msgid "\"Whatever you say. I love you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭐라 하든 사랑해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99998_Text
msgctxt "bb6617cb-d8f7-4cff-83a3-f9ddc56061da"
msgid "\"I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "\"미안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_99999_Text
msgctxt "aa45b187-dbb1-49b4-ac54-bb3e31604f17"
msgid "\"We're still friends, right?\""
msgstr "\"우린 여전히 친구야. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4ae1f367-0b6a-468b-b5c4-fa5c00accd21"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, hello!\" {n}Octavia gives you a fetching smile.{/n} \"Something you "
"need?\""
msgstr "\"오, 안녕하세요!\" {n}옥타비아는 매력적인 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"필요하신 거라도 있으신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "afee13f3-d6de-4ec3-8cf9-94ed58c692e9"
msgid "\"Sure,\" {n}Octavia gives you a friendly smile.{/n} \"Come anytime!\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠.\" {n}옥타비아는 다정한 미소를 지어 줍니다.{/n} \"언제든지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "547602ce-097c-457a-ac56-e38a43fefa9a"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia sighs.{/n} \"Too little. Some scraps of memories, no more than "
"that.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"거의 기억나지 않아요. 단편적인 기억의 조각 정도네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "54ceaff2-8332-47ad-a361-9c2165a33208"
msgid "\"Of course! What do you want to talk about?\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠! 무슨 얘기가 하고 싶으세요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a84afca6-c579-4ca1-bf2a-7fbe6db3d842"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia reflects on that, tapping her finger against her cheek.{/n} "
"\"Nothing special. Some images of a faraway past, that's all.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 뺨을 손가락으로 두드리며 회상합니다.{/n} \"특별한 것은 없어요. 먼 과거의 이미지들 그 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "4c178ce3-b112-4918-a6bf-4b73a0778e26"
msgid ""
"\"I do remember wooden table legs. The paint on them was peeling off, and I "
"was standing on my toes, trying to peek at what was on the table. I remember "
"the wild rose by the window — it kept me up at night, scratching the glass "
"with its gnarled branchlets. I do remember my mother's blue dress — it was a "
"trifle battered, but it smelled of lavender.\" {n}Octavia wrinkles her "
"forehead.{/n} \"I guess that's all. Not much there, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나무 탁자 다리가 기억나요. 칠이 벗겨졌고 저는 까치발을 들고 그 위에 뭐가 있나 보려고 했죠. 그리고 창가의 장미도 기억나요. "
"가지가 창문을 건드리는 소리에 밤에 종종 자다 깨곤 했었죠. 어머니의 푸른색 드레스도 떠올라요. 낡았지만, 라벤더 향이 났어죠.\" {n}"
"옥타비아의 이마에는 주름이 살짝 잡힙니다.{/n} \"이게 전부네요. 별로 없죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "9a98c840-d19e-4e3f-ac2b-baa99ad0088b"
msgid ""
"\"All those memories... it's like they're not mine at all. I recall some "
"images, and I know I should feel something about them, but I don't remember "
"what exactly I should feel. So let them rot in a swamp with tatzlwyrms!\" {n}"
"Octavia grins cheerfully.{/n} \"My life's good enough without them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 모든 기억은... 마치 제 기억이 아닌 것 같아요. 몇조각의 기억이 떠오르며 어떤 기분을 떠올려야 하지만 그게 뭔지 모르겠어요. "
"그러니 타츨웜이 있는 늪에 썩게 둘래요! \" {n}옥타비아는 즐겁게 웃습니다.{/n} \"제 인생은 그것들 없이도 충분하니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "badd845b-3cb5-4f32-9cb3-1f8ee45d9120"
msgid ""
"\"Am I?\" {n}Octavia examines herself, as if seeing herself for the first "
"time.{/n} \"You know, I think you might be right! I'm rather slim and tall, "
"and I can see well in dim light.\" {n}She raises her hands and touches her "
"ears.{/n} \"Aha! They're a bit pointy! Yes, I'm definitely a half-elf!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가요?\" {n}옥타비아는 자신을 처음으로 보는 것처럼 자신을 살핍니다.{/n} \"당신 말이 맞을지도 몰라요! 나는 좀 날씬하고 "
"키도 크고 어두워도 잘 볼 수 있죠.\" {n}그녀는 손을 들고 귀를 만집니다.{/n} \"아하! 귀가 약간 뾰족하구나! 저 하프 엘프 "
"맞네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "962ffe13-4370-4ae4-96d5-41d548e27854"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm. Let's think about that logically. So my mother was an elf, and my "
"father was a human. Or maybe it was the other way around, and my mother was "
"a...\" {n}Finally Octavia can't take it anymore and bursts into laughter, "
"having spoiled her own act.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"흠. 논리적으로 생각해 보자구요. 그래서 어머니는 엘프였고 아버지는 인간이었어요. 아니면 반대로 어머니가 인간이고...\" {n}"
"마침내 옥타비아는 참지 못하고 웃음을 터뜨려 말을 잇지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "717563ee-8f9f-4b07-aacc-83d196845a29"
msgid ""
"\"So that's it. Now you know as much about my parents as I do,\" {n}she says "
"after her laughter subsides.{/n}"
msgstr "\"이제 됐어요. 당신도 제 부모님에 관해서 저 만큼 알게 되셨어요.\" {n}웃음이 가라 앉은 후 그녀는 말했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "4cdb4786-ad67-49d3-bb39-ce8da86c8ab3"
msgid ""
"\"I clearly remember the man who took me away from my home. He was big, with "
"a huge potbelly and shaggy beard. I was afraid he would eat me.\" {n}Octavia "
"shrugs.{/n} \"Anyway, he didn't stay with me long. He gave me to his slaver "
"accomplices, and I never saw him again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"절 데려가던 남자를 생생히 기억해요. 덩치가 크고 배불뚝이에 텁수룩한 수염을 가진 남자였죠. 전 그가 저를 잡아먹을까봐 겁에 질려 "
"있었어요.\" {n}옥타비아는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"어쨌든 그와 오래 함께 하지는 않았어요. 저를 노예상인에게 넘겨버렸고 그 "
"뒤론 다시는 만나지 못했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6fd6355e-726d-4d53-8208-cde6da5c71fb"
msgid ""
"\"When my mother was giving me to him, she was crying. I can still barely "
"hear her quiet voice, but I can't recall her words or her face behind the "
"tears... Just that lavender smell — it tickled my nose and I wanted to "
"sneeze.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 어머니는 저를 그에게 보내며 울고 계셨어요. 어머니가 간신히 뭔가 속삭이고 계셨다는 건 기억나지만 무슨 말을 하셨는지, 그 눈물 "
"뒤에 어떤 얼굴을 하고 계셨는지는 기억이 나질 않아요... 그저 라벤더향이 제 코를 간지럽혀서 재채기가 하고 싶었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "a79e6313-53fa-4d03-9b3d-c855586749bf"
msgid ""
"\"Did my mother sell me into slavery? But then why was she crying? And if "
"she didn't want me to be a slave, why didn't she try to save me?\" {n}"
"Octavia twirls her hair, pondering over the thought, then sighs.{/n} \"One "
"more riddle from my past that I don't care to solve.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어머니가 저를 노예로 팔았을까요? 그렇다면 왜 울고 있었을까요? 만약 내가 노예가 되는 걸 원치 않았다면 왜 저를 구하려고 하지 "
"않았을까요?\" {n}옥타비아는 머리카락을 베베꼬며 생각에 빠지고는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"별로 풀고 싶지 않은 과거의 수수께끼가 "
"하나 더 생겨버렸네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "ce1d2edf-d8bf-49cb-995f-be1155dfed18"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I recall my childhood in rather bright details. It was spent in dirty "
"barracks. I wore flea-infested rags, and slept on a straw mattress instead "
"of a proper bed.\" {n}Octavia smiles humorlessly.{/n} \"Though I understand "
"what you mean.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 어린 시절은 비교적 생생하게 기억나요. 전 더러운 막사에서 생활했어요. 벼룩이 기어다니는 넝마를 입고 침대 대신 밀짚을 깔고 그 "
"위에서 잠을 잤죠.\" {n}옥타비아는 건조하게 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신이 무슨 말씀을 하신건지 이해는 하지만요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "837a89d5-e1fb-4872-95a4-45fd1f85bec0"
msgid ""
"\"You know, to be honest, I'm not sure I want to remember my childhood "
"before slavery. If I could remember what I lost, it would probably just "
"bring me more pain...\" {n}Octavia shakes her head several times and makes "
"herself smile again.{/n} \"So it's good that I don't remember much of "
"anything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히 말해 노예가 되기 전 어린 시절을 기억하고 싶진 않아요. 내가 잃은 게 뭔지 아는 게 더 고통스럽겠죠...\" {n}옥타비아는 "
"머리를 여러 번 흔들고는 다시 웃습니다.{/n} \"아예 아무것도 기억나지 않는 편이 나아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "f1b62136-61da-4f72-845b-48adb9a6e3d9"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like to recall it, but if you insist…\" {n}Octavia frowns.{/n} "
"\"The slavers from the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} tried to ruin my "
"life. But all they could do was ruin my childhood.\""
msgstr ""
"\"떠올리기 싫지만 굳이 바라신다면...\" {n}옥타비아는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 "
"노예상인이 제 인생을 망치려 했어요. 하지만 망칠 수 있었던 건 제 어린 시절밖에 없었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "4a4cfdcd-5285-4ec9-b7f8-e187d6813537"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, many of them. Some owned me for years, others felt they'd had enough "
"of me in a couple of months. Trust me, I did all I could to make every "
"master eager to get rid of me. A slave that's trained in magic is a rather "
"expensive thing, so they wouldn't kill me. At least that was the hope.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네, 많은 이들을 거쳐갔죠. 어떤 경우에는 한 주인 밑에서 몇년을 보내고 어떨 때는 몇 달만에 바뀌기도 했어요. 믿기지 않겠지만, "
"모든 주인들이 저를 죽여서 해방시켜 주기를 바랬어요. 하지만 마법 훈련을 받은 노예는 비싸서 저를 죽이지 않았죠. 적어도 그것이 "
"희망이었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "cf09548a-eca6-4a26-bef7-54698cacad06"
msgid ""
"\"So I drooled, and played an idiot. And I listened as every new master "
"argued with my former one, trying to return me. Sometimes I punctured the "
"pages of magic books I was forced to copy with a quill. Other times I "
"pretended to mix up the spells, so instead of lighting a magic torch, I set "
"dozens of dancing lights floating just below the ceiling.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 저는 침을 흘리며 바보 연기를 했어요. 새로운 주인들은 전부 전 주인과 말싸움하며 저를 반품하려고 애썼죠. 가끔은 마법책의 "
"필사본을 쓰게 할 때 마법책을 구멍내기도 했고, 어떨 때는 마법을 섞어서 마법으로 횃불을 만드는 대신 천장에 춤추는 조명이 잔뜩 떠다니게 "
"하기도 했었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "07173239-8dc9-42de-832f-be28809263cc"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, most of these tricks of mine usually ended badly. I got "
"punished on a regular basis. My back still remembers the masters' whips, "
"though all my scars from those times are long gone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 대부분의 속임수는 대개 결말이 안좋았죠. 계속해서 벌을 받았고,. 상처는 나았지만, 제 등에는 여전히 채찍자국이 남아있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "4087d876-4f60-4195-9ef7-f722e5fcbc07"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I was taught magic by Janush of {g|Starfall}Starfall{/g}, one of the "
"most famous wizards in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. 'Maestro' Janush as he "
"insisted on calling himself.\" {n}Octavia's voice overflows with "
"contemptuous sarcasm.{/n} \"Anyone would be happy to learn from such a great "
"master, and only a talentless bitch like me would dare to reject his "
"teachings and indulge in her laziness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 저는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 제일 유명한 마법사 {g|Starfall}스타폴{/g}의 자누시에게 마법을 "
"배웠어요. 자기를 '마에스트로' 자누시라고 부르라고 했었죠.\" {n}옥타비아의 목소리는 경멸적인 비아냥으로 넘쳐 흐릅니다.{/n} "
"\"누구나 그런 위대한 스승에게서 배운다면 행복해 죽으려고 하겠지만, 저처럼 재능없는 제자는 가르침을 거부하고 게으름을 피웠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "044e6c21-6389-4f7d-b4bd-d35ede09d301"
msgid ""
"\"At least that's what Maestro Janush used to repeat constantly, while "
"whipping knowledge into my back. The Great Maestro was a big fan of "
"punishment.\" {n}Octavia's lips press into a thin line.{/n} \"The {g|Technic "
"League}Technic League{/g} didn't care if a few slaves died under the "
"master's whip, as long as Maestro Janush provided an arcane-trained one in "
"return.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자누시는 절 가르치면서 계속 채찍질을 해댔어요. 완전 가학성애자였죠.\" {n}옥타비아는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"{g|"
"Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 자누시가 비전 마법을 배운 노예를 양성하는 동안 노예 몇명쯤 죽어나가도 신경쓰지 않았어요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "cc4cf917-b1b9-48ea-a8ad-429752b0ee37"
msgid ""
"\"Officially, there's no slavery in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. But the {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League{/g} is above any law. A slave with an aptitude "
"for the arcane is worth much more than a regular one. The slave's repertoire "
"is limited to the simplest and safest spells, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"공식적으로 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에 노예 제도는 없지만, {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 법 위에 "
"있는 인간들이죠. 마법에 재능있는 노예는 비싼 편이거든요. 물론 노예가 배우는 마법은 단순하고 안전한 것들로 제한되지만요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "7d9e8241-02d7-41bc-b3a6-9ecacb02a910"
msgid ""
"\"What a silly question. Of course I tried. As soon as we saw even the "
"tiniest opportunity to get free, Reg and I grabbed for it. On one occasion, "
"we jumped from the cart into the river. There was a time when we spent weeks "
"trying to dismantle the far wall of the barracks and make a path out. "
"Sometimes we attacked our guards when they least expected it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진짜 바보같은 질문이네요. 당연히 해봤죠. 틈만 나면 레곤가르와 저는 도망치려고 했어요. 한번은 달리는 수레에서 강으로 뛰어들기도 "
"했었다니까요. 또 한번은 몇 주 동안 막사의 외진 벽을 부숴서 탈출하려고 한 적도 있고... 가끔은 우리를 감시하는 경비를 습격하기도 "
"했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "799bf6bb-c466-4db8-b4ba-d17863238f50"
msgid ""
"\"We craved freedom, we lived only to dream about it. Those short days, "
"sometimes weeks, that we spent on the run were the happiest days of my life. "
"We used to hide in the woods, or blend in with the crowd on the streets of "
"{g|Starfall}Starfall{/g}. Midnight stars were our guiding lights, and we "
"shared our dream with them: to reach the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}"
", for in these lands there were neither slaves nor masters. We were starving "
"and freezing, but that was the real life. Too bad it usually ended too soon."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 자유를 갈망했고, 오직 그 꿈만을 위해서 살아왔어요. 짧은 며칠, 가끔은 일주일 정도 도망쳐 나왔던 날들이 제 인생에서 제일 "
"행복한 날들이였죠. 우리는 숲에 숨거나 {g|Starfall}스타폴{/g}의 군중 속에 숨기도 했죠. 한밤의 별을 따라 길을 찾았고 노예 "
"제도가 없는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}로 가자고 서로 다짐했어요. 춥고 배고팠지만 적어도 그건 진짜 삶이었죠. "
"보통 너무 빨리 잡혀서 아쉽네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "84e42adb-a6ca-45be-a784-748a4f86425c"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} agents always found us in the "
"end. I don't know how they managed to do it — they probably used magic, or "
"maybe it was just our fate. They whipped us and returned us to our old "
"masters, or sold us to new ones — if the old ones refused to pay. So we were "
"slaves again, but the dream about the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} "
"never left our hearts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 요원들은 항상 결국엔 우리를 찾아냈어요. 어떻게 찾을 수 있었는지는 모르겠지만, "
"아마 마법을 썼거나, 어차피 잡힐 운명이었겠죠? 그 뒤에는 채찍질 당하고 다시 주인에게 돌아가거나 다른 곳에 팔려나가게 되죠. 우리는 "
"다시 노예가 되었지만 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}에 가자는 꿈을 항상 가슴 속에 품고 있었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "e55481ff-2a9a-4742-88ad-70aeefbbccff"
msgid ""
"\"You figured that out, didn't you?\" {n}Octavia narrows her eyes.{/n} \"Or "
"maybe you want to hear all about the beatings I survived? The humiliations "
"I've endured? Imagine the worst thing one person can do to another, and "
"multiply it tenfold. That's what happened to me nearly every day in slavery."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 모르는 거 아니죠?\" {n}옥타비아는 눈을 가늘게 뜹니다.{/n} \"아님 내가 맞아가면서 살아남은 이야기나 그동안 견뎌온 "
"치욕에 대해 듣고 싶은 거예요? 인간이 저지를 수 있는 가장 지독한 짓을 열 배 정도 곱해봐요. 전 그런 고통을 매일같이 겪어 왔어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "7462dbe7-543d-4c17-9dc6-69915e9d62b8"
msgid ""
"\"Masters… Oh, how I hate that word!\" {n}Octavia shakes her head furiously, "
"making her locks dance.{/n} \"They punished me because they wanted to hurt "
"me. But what hurt even more was the mere fact of their existence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주인... 아, 그 단어 너무 싫어요!\" {n}옥타비아가 고개를 격하게 젓자 머리카락이 찰랑입니다.{/n} \"그들은 제가 고통받는 "
"모습을 즐겼어요. 하지만 고통보다 지독한 건 그들의 존재 자체였죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "000d4d2d-5bae-43bf-940d-479a46517466"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia stops you, gently touching your hand.{/n} \"Wait. I... I want to "
"tell you...\" {n}She sighs and shakes her head, as if trying to collect her "
"thoughts.{/n} \"The {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} agents you rescued "
"us from — Reg and I tried to run away many times, but they always managed to "
"find us eventually. I have no reason to hope that this time they've lost "
"track of us for good.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 당신을 멈추고는 당신의 손을 부드럽게 어루만집니다.{/n} \"잠깐만. 저... 당신에게 말하고 싶은 게 있어요...\" "
"{n}그녀는 생각을 정리하는 것처럼 한숨을 쉬고 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"당신이 우리를 구해줄 때 우리를 잡았던 {g|Technic "
"League}기술 연맹{/g} 요원들은 매번 우리가 도망칠 때마다 우리를 다시 찾아냈어요. 이번에도 분명 우리를 쫓아올 거예요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "94751959-1418-4498-bd40-2110e89b3da9"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia raises her eyes to you and gives you such a warm smile that "
"you're unable to not smile back. In the depths of her eyes, you notice "
"something that wasn't there before. This unnamed feeling hides in a moment, "
"but you're sure you know what it was: trust.{/n} \"Thank you,\" {n}Octavia "
"whispers, touching your shoulder.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신을 바라보며 당신이 잠깐 멍해질 정도로 따뜻한 미소를 짓습니다. 그녀의 눈 깊은 곳에서 당신은 전에 보지 못했던 것을 "
"보았습니다. 그것은 이내 사라지지만, 당신은 그게 신뢰라는 것을 알고 있습니다..{/n} \"고마워요.\" {n}옥타비아는 당신의 어깨를 "
"부드럽게 짚고는 속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "28a3a4cc-e42d-4cd3-96a2-87b1f2180653"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! We'll chase them to the border — we won't see them through the dust!\""
msgstr "\"그래요! 기술 연맹이 뭐람. 우리가 국경까지 추격해주겠어! 절대 놓치지 말자구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "a41b5f7b-d308-4ae0-8f77-1a0084dc34f2"
msgid "{n}Octavia sighs.{/n} \"I wish I had your confidence.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"저도 당신처럼 자신감이 넘치면 좋겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "4722c9d9-dfc1-4ac1-b2b8-dc7eb806e67f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia's glance becomes sharper.{/n} \"So that's what I am for you? 'A "
"resource'? A valuable thing that can be used anytime you wish?\" {n}She "
"sighs and tightens her lips primly.{/n} \"I thank you for your help, but you "
"should reconsider your attitude toward me and the others.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아의 시선이 더 날카로워집니다.{/n} \"제가 당신에겐 그런 건가요? 자원이라고요? 필요할 때 언제든지 쓸 수 있는 그런 거?"
"\" {n}그녀는 한숨을 내며 입술에 힘을 줍니다.{/n} \"도와준 건 고맙지만 저나 다른 사람을 대하는 방식은 다시 한번 생각해보셔야 "
"할 것 같아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "2f8df67d-6ec3-4ca6-a117-ca1d913f5d3a"
msgid ""
"{n}Suddenly she frowns in contemplation, twirling her locks.{/n} \"Still, "
"I'd like to find them first.\""
msgstr "{n}갑자기 그녀는 찡그리며 머리카락을 손가락으로 베베 꼽니다.{/n} \"여전히, 우선 그들을 찾고 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "fafec0e7-18a2-4559-b36a-402f974aab56"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia shrugs awkwardly.{/n} \"We're together,\" {n}she answers "
"simply.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 어색하게 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"우린 함께에요.\" {n}그녀는 간단히 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "7021626a-e987-48df-9295-d4ac6c86b456"
msgid ""
"\"You've noticed? Well, I didn't mean that… Now I'll have to explain.\" {n}"
"Octavia shakes her head.{/n} \"I'm not sure I know how to put it "
"correctly... You see, Reg seems to treat me like his property.\""
msgstr ""
"\"눈치 챘어요? 그런 뜻이 아니었는데... 설명을 드려야겠네요.\" {n}옥타비아가 그녀의 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"어떻게 표현해야 "
"할지 잘 모르겠어요... 사실, 레곤가르는 가끔 저를 자기 소유물처럼 생각하는 것 같아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "e1c32f41-7064-49ad-bb58-548214ae4090"
msgid ""
"\"He's always kind to me and it feels good when we travel together, or when "
"we share a blanket at the campsite... but he always calls me 'my Octavia.' "
"I've told him over and over that I don't belong to anyone, that I'm my own, "
"that I stay with him by my own free will. He only grins when I say that. I "
"bet he likes to think that I'm 'his.'\""
msgstr ""
"\"레곤가르는 항상 제게 친절해요. 둘이 함께 여행하던 나날이 참 좋았죠. 같은 담요를 덮고 야영할 때의 기분이란... 하지만 레곤가르는 "
"계속 저를 '나의 옥타비아'라고 불러요. 나는 누군가의 소유물이 아니라, 자유 의지로 너와 함께 다니는 거라고 여러 번 말했는데도 "
"레곤가르는 계속 웃기만 해요. 나를 '소유한다'는 생각이 마음에 드나 봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "616c662a-c850-465f-9766-080ab15fee27"
msgid ""
"\"Never mind, though. I'll sort it out somehow.\" {n}Octavia shakes her "
"head, making the troubling thoughts go away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"신경 쓰지 마세요. 어떻게든 해결할테니까요.\" {n}옥타비아는 머리를 흔들며 고뇌를 떨쳐버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "ccfa0c8a-8f77-4125-ba5d-16e8d0aea007"
msgid ""
"\"Years ago, when I was studying magic at Maestro Janush's, Reg was his "
"student too, though you couldn't actually say he was really 'studying' "
"anything. Reg had his own ways to cast spells — he never needed the "
"maestro's instructions. You see, unlike wizards, Reg draws power directly "
"from his innate bloodline abilities.\""
msgstr ""
"\"몇년 전, 마에스트로 자누시 밑에서 마법을 배울 때 레지도 함께 배웠어요. 사실 마법을 '배운다'고는 얘기하기 힘들었지만요. 레지는 "
"자신만의 마법 시전 방식이 있었어요. 마에스트로의 가르침이 필요없었어요. 일반적인 마법사와는 달리 혈통으로 인해 선천적으로 발현된 힘을 "
"끌어다 쓰는 거였죠\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "74026ad3-0ed1-48c9-9745-001a34085a1e"
msgid ""
"\"Janush didn't realize the nature of Reg's powers when he took the young "
"boy as his new student. And when he finally understood them, he just taught "
"the negligent half-orc to control his powers, to avoid harming himself or "
"the others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자누시는 어린 레곤가르를 거두어들일 때 그 능력을 알아보지 못했어요. 그가 마침내 알아냈을 때 그는 단지 그 게으른 하프오크에게 힘을 "
"통제하며 자기 자신이나 다른 사람들을 해치지 않도록 가르쳤죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "4ecf12d6-97fa-4a98-af4d-3633234c2718"
msgid ""
"\"Reg and I have been together ever since. We could both use magic, but more "
"importantly we both craved freedom. We used to vow to each other that "
"someday we'd break free from the unbearable captivity, or die trying — "
"together.\" {n}Octavia gives you a warm smile.{/n} \"I guess it's good that "
"we fulfilled only the first part of that vow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"레지와 저는 그때부터 항상 함께였어요. 둘 다 마법을 쓸 수 있을 뿐만 아니라, 자유를 갈망했거든요. 언젠가 발목 잡는 족쇄를 "
"벗어버리거나, 적어도 자유를 부르짖으며 같은 날 죽기로 맹세했죠.\" {n}옥타비아는 당신에게 따뜻한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"맹세의 "
"첫 부분만 이루어져서 다행이라 해야 할까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "ca58d280-49a4-4b50-b585-8a6344a782d9"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia winces.{/n} \"I don't like this 'owe' word. I don't owe anything "
"to anybody — everything I do, I do of my own free will. But, to answer your "
"question: yes, Reg has done a lot for me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"저는 이 '빚지다'라는 말이 마음에 들지 않아요. 저는 누구에게도 빚진 적 없어요. 내가 하는 "
"모든 행동은 저의 자유 의지죠. 그래도 당신의 질문에 대답하자면, 맞아요. 레지는 제게 많은 것을 해주었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "737575e6-e199-4082-85cb-ebb8324ec353"
msgid ""
"\"I can't count how many times he was whipped by masters because of me, how "
"many times he took the blame for my doings. He never complained when they "
"dragged him, beaten and covered in blood, to the slave barracks. He just "
"groaned and clenched his fists while I bandaged his wounds with the scraps "
"of my filthy clothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 때문에 그가 얼마나 채찍질을 당했는지, 제 행동에 대한 책임을 얼마나 많이 대신 져줬는지 헤아릴 수도 없어요. 피투성이가 된 채 "
"노예 막사로 던져질 때에도 한번도 불평한 적이 없죠... 제 더러운 옷을 찢어 붕대로 감아줄 때 그저 신음하며 이를 악물 뿐이었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "c291d1b1-8d9c-4d69-8061-dfff38487ccb"
msgid ""
"\"We've always been together. My whole life — as slaves and as free people. "
"I wouldn't be me, if not for him.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 항상 함께였어요. 노예이자 자유인으로서의 제 모든 삶 동안 그가 없었더라면 지금의 나는 없었겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "fd7d7be3-4b54-4dca-959f-8d27ac171ca5"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, that… that is a very delicate matter.\" {n}Octavia winces, looking "
"away.{/n} \"Reg means a lot to me, and he endured a lot for me, but some "
"parts of him just scare me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 그건... 아주 민감한 문제에요.\" {n}옥타비아는 찡그리고는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"레지는 제게 큰 의미가 있고, 저를 "
"위해 많은 것을 견뎌줬지만, 가끔은 저를 무섭게 해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "dc83914c-8f61-4e95-854b-da04a2e8e25e"
msgid ""
"\"He becomes extremely bloodthirsty when it comes to slavers. Don't get me "
"wrong, I hate slavers with all my heart! And I'll do a lot to cleanse the "
"world of their filth. But Reg... He'd do anything. Understand? Absolutely "
"anything. I'm afraid that anger might kill everything good in him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"레곤가르는 노예 상인이 관련됐다 하면 극도로 잔인해져요. 물론 저도 진심으로 노예 상인을 싫어해요! 그 인간쓰레기들을 이 세상에서 "
"치워버릴 수만 있다면 열과 성의를 다하겠지만, 레지는... 정말로 수단과 방법을 가리지 않아요. 인정사정 없어진다고 하면 아실까요? 그 "
"분노가 레곤가르의 선한 면까지 해칠까 걱정돼요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "86cbc99f-292a-49a4-88e9-1fdb2019dc49"
msgid ""
"\"I've attempted to talk to him about it many times, but he just won't "
"listen. He becomes even angrier after our conversations.\" {n}Octavia sighs "
"sadly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그 문제에 대해 여러 번 그와 얘기해 보려고 했지만. 도통 들어주지 않아요. 오히려 얘기가 끝나면 더 화를 내버려요.\" {n}"
"옥타비아는 슬프게 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "7a15890b-b3d7-4264-bcdc-6ac15d42fa1f"
msgid ""
"\"I broke free from slavery. Thanks to you, I've obtained everything I "
"dreamed of — my freedom, and the opportunity to control my own life. I want "
"to use this opportunity to fight the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}. "
"At least the part of it that operates here in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g}. I wish to free all the slaves from their Technic League masters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신 덕분에 노예에서 해방됐어요. 제가 꿈꾸던 모든 것을 얻었죠. 나의 자유, 내 삶의 주권을. 저는 이제 이 주권으로 {g|"
"Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}과 싸우고 싶어요. 적어도 여기 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 싸우고 "
"있지만, 언젠가는 기술 연맹의 모든 노예를 해방시키고 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "dd4be0ce-2903-48c1-a86a-f96e6d12cd77"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia gives you a warm smile and gently touches your hand.{/n} \"I do "
"believe that while we're together, we can achieve a lot! Even this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 따뜻한 웃음을 지어주고 당신의 손을 어루만집니다.{/n} \"전 우리가 함께하면 많은 것을 이룰 수 있을거라고 믿어요! "
"이것까지도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "3ff8ef72-298a-406f-9d7d-a285f4d2072e"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia's smile fades a little.{/n} \"I try not to view my life as a "
"never-ending course of sufferings. Yes, I've had my share of hard times, but "
"do I need to recall them? After all, along with the bad things, I had some "
"good things as well. I had a dream, and I followed it, and eventually it "
"came true. Following that path, I met Reg and you. Now I'm free and "
"surrounded by friends.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아의 미소는 조금 흐려집니다.{/n} \"전 제 삶이 고통스러울 뿐이라고 생각하고 싶지 않아요. 힘든 시절이 있었지만 굳이 "
"떠올려야 할까요? 결국은 나쁜 일도, 좋은 일도 있었어요. 저는 꿈을 쫓았고 결국 이루었어요. 그 과정에서 당신과 레곤가르를 만났죠. "
"이제 저는 자유롭고 친구들과 함께에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "f2ac0e2a-a85c-409b-8116-f5091616a20f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia's voice trembles with hidden emotions. But her smile remains warm "
"and sincere.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아의 목소리는 숨겨진 감정으로 떨립니다. 그러나 그녀의 미소는 여전히 따뜻하고 진실합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "9cd15f1f-e161-47a7-a065-2121da028537"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, so you've noticed?\" {n}Octavia smiles slyly.{/n} \"My appearance is "
"the result of daily effort, and it's not easy. Do you know how much time it "
"takes to create good makeup, or to mend a dress, even with the help of magic?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 눈치 채셨네요?\" {n}옥타비아는 능글맞게 웃습니다.{/n} \"제 모습은 노력의 결과에요. 쉽지 않다구요! 마법의 도움을 "
"받더라도 예쁜 화장을 하고 드레스를 수선하는게 얼마나 오래 걸리는지 아세요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0083 1_Text
msgctxt "28a87399-20b2-4946-ab28-018f8c14f605"
msgid ""
"\"So if someday you wake up early, an hour before dawn or so, you can "
"actually check on me. You'll see how I prepare myself for a new day.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가 해뜨기 한 시간 전쯤에 일어나면 진짜 저를 만날 수 있을 거예요. 제가 새로운 하루를 준비하는 모습을 보실 수 있겠죠. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "eb1758ec-a315-41de-aa79-e87c525290d6"
msgid ""
"\"So if someday you wake up early, an hour before dawn or so, you can "
"actually check on me. You'll see how I prepare myself for a new day.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가 해뜨기 한 시간 전쯤에 일어나면 진짜 저를 만날 수 있을 거예요. 제가 새로운 하루를 준비하는 모습을 보실 수 있겠죠. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "b00f2b78-5ddc-4a70-aba6-4b8124ecd0ff"
msgid ""
"\"You're a real sweet-talker. I feel all flushed.\" {n}Octavia fans herself "
"with a hand.{/n} \"Well, now I'll have to pay even more attention to my "
"looks. For now I know for sure that there's someone who appreciates my "
"efforts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 정말 달콤한 말을 할 줄 아시네요. 저 지금 얼굴 빨갛지 않아요?\" {n}옥타비아는 손으로 부채질을 합니다.{/n} \"음"
"... 이젠 외모에 더 신경을 써야겠어요. 제 노력을 알아주는 사람이 있다는 걸 이제 알았으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "f1a66ceb-9093-45fa-af54-a0b7ddda3f96"
msgid ""
"\"You bet! You know, I like to feel attractive, even while we're on the "
"march.\" {n}Octavia flashes a teasing smile at you.{/n} \"It feels so good "
"to be a beauty in a group of barely-washed and extremely reckless young "
"gentlemen. You're my thorns, and I'm your rose!\" {n}Octavia giggles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요! 있잖아요, 전 우리가 여행하고 있는 중에도 매력적으로 보이는게 좋아요.\" {n}옥타비아가 짓궂은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} "
"\"꾀죄죄하고 무모한 젊은 남자들 속에 미녀가 되는 건 기분 좋은 일이죠. 저는 장미고 당신은 저의 가시랄까?\" {n}옥타비아는 "
"깔깔거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "7dd528e3-c83b-43b7-98bf-3a6addf82ac7"
msgid ""
"\"Right, that's my business. It's good that you understand that.\" {n}"
"Octavia nods and flashes a teasing smile at you.{/n} \"You know, it feels so "
"good to be a beauty in a group of barely washed and extremely reckless young "
"gentlemen. You're my thorns, and I'm your rose!\" {n}Octavia giggles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요. 전 그래요. 이해해주니 기분좋은걸요.\" {n}옥타비아는 끄덕이며 짓궂은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"있잖아요, 꾀죄죄하고 "
"무모한 젊은 남자들 속에 미녀가 되는 건 기분 좋은 일이라구요. 저는 장미고 당신은 저의 가시랄까?\" {n}옥타비아는 "
"깔깔거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "5a254d88-6f4f-4565-8638-aa7f16cd0e5a"
msgid ""
"\"And I would prefer to decide on my own what to do in my free time.\" {n}"
"Octavia's soft voice suddenly takes on a steely note.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 제 제유시간에 뭘 할지는 스스로 결정하고 싶어요.\" {n}옥타비아의 부드러운 목소리가 갑자기 엄한 어조로 바뀝니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100001_Text
msgctxt "ad2b9e6a-1906-4d1e-8c57-7cf13e3a1900"
msgid ""
"\"Don't apologize, we're both adults. And we have much more in common than a "
"bed. We're friends and always will be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사과하지 마세요. 우리 둘 다 성인이잖아요. 침대를 공유하는 것 말고도 함께 나눌 이야기가 넘쳐 나요. 우리 친구 해요. 앞으로도 "
"쭈욱.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100002_Text
msgctxt "1d5cea8f-037f-41b2-93fe-4d81f38f2f17"
msgid "\"Of course. I'd go through fire for you... But not to bed, haha!\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠. 당신을 위해서라면 불 속에도 뛰어들겠지만 침대는 아니에요! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100003_Text
msgctxt "47cd452d-13cf-4fec-815b-9b25e4344c23"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I understand. We've always been more than just lovers. We are "
"friends, and always will be.\""
msgstr "\"물론 이해해요. 우린 단순한 연인 이상이었잖아요. 친구로 남아요. 항상 곁에 있을게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100004_Text
msgctxt "027246f8-e15a-430d-9ce9-f6f86cb01615"
msgid ""
"\"Seriously, we have nothing to regret. It was wonderful while it lasted.\""
msgstr "\"정말. 우리는 후회할 게 없어요. 그동안 정말 좋았어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100006_Text
msgctxt "b30564ff-8437-438b-86db-7fadea7b8688"
msgid ""
"\"It's not your fault.\" {n}Octavia sighs.{/n} \"It's me who lost him. I "
"kept driving him away, so sure that he was never going anywhere... So sure "
"that he had to leave in the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신 잘못이 아니에요.\" {n}옥타비아는 한숨을 쉬었습니다{/n} \"레지가 떠난 건 저 때문이에요. 제가 레지를 밀어내니 갈 곳이 "
"없었겠죠... 결국에는 우릴 떠나야 했을 테구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100007_Text
msgctxt "9a0b7926-649f-4a0c-8d53-afd46f9b20fd"
msgid ""
"\"I don't deserve to be with him. He's done so much for me, and I've brought "
"him nothing but pain. So... Thank you for being with him. Take care of him. "
"Care form him as I couldn't. He needs you more than ever now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 레지와 함께 있을 자격이 없어요. 레지는 저를 위해 많은 일을 해주었는데, 전 레지에게 괴로움만 남겼죠... 레지와 함께해줘서 "
"고마워요. 부디 그를 잘 돌봐주세요. 레지는 지금 어느 때보다도 당신이 필요할 거예요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100009_Text
msgctxt "5a8cd944-e7f4-464b-a476-f72cd78b47f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks down.{/n} \"I... understand. But maybe we can give our "
"feelings another chance?\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 내려다 봅니다.{/n} \"어... 이해해요. 그래도 한번 더 우리 감정에 기회를 주지 않을래요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100013_Text
msgctxt "39b845c1-5861-46e8-a856-f23166723118"
msgid "\"I know I can be tough. But we need each other.\""
msgstr "\"스스로 굳세어 질 수 있다는 걸 알지만.. 우리는 서로가 필요해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100014_Text
msgctxt "807b6f04-b428-4481-9f6e-3ef5c30d7f04"
msgid ""
"\"I won't lie and say I'm not hurt. But... You're probably right. Our love "
"brings only suffering to both of us. And as friends... As friends we can "
"keep covering each other's backs in battle!\" {n}Octavia forces a smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말 아니고 전 괜찮아요. 아마... 당신이 맞겠죠. 우리 사랑은 서로에게 고통만 안겨줬어요. 친구... 그래, 친구로 남으면 "
"언제나처럼 위급한 상황에 서로의 뒤를 봐줄 수 있을 거예요!\" {n}옥타비아는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100016_Text
msgctxt "cde5e62f-7311-42e8-bd26-41968622e7f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks down.{/n} \"I understand, it's hard to be with us. But "
"remember — we promised each other to always be together. Maybe we can give "
"our feelings another chance?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 내려다 봅니다.{/n} \"이해해요... 우리와 함께하는건 힘들테죠. 하지만 항상 함께하기로 약속했잖아요. 혹시 다시 한 "
"번 우리 감정에 기회를 줄 수 있을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100017_Text
msgctxt "54336b66-195d-4e10-b840-22e49bfee58c"
msgid ""
"\"Our relationship isn't simple, it's true. But the three of us need each "
"other.\""
msgstr "\"우리 관계는 단순하지 않아요. 그건 분명하죠. 하지만 우리 셋은 서로를 필요로 해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100021_Text
msgctxt "a9757fdc-4073-4a46-8695-ff60ca111a21"
msgid ""
"\"Well... I want you to know that I was truly happy with you. But if this "
"love brings you nothing but pain — it probably would be better to actually "
"go our separate ways. I'll tell Reg.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄요... 당신과 함께해서 정말로 행복했다는 걸 알아줬으면 좋겠어요. 하지만 이 사랑이 당신에게 고통만 안겨준다면, 아마 헤어지는게 "
"맞겠죠. 레지한테 얘기할께요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100023_Text
msgctxt "ae55b18c-0aea-4064-84a4-ddfbe1bdce02"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Many slaves survived only thanks to their faith. Some lived hoping "
"for a day when a good deity would deliver them. Some even offered deals to "
"the evil gods... But me and Reg — {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} has taught us "
"the most important things. Expect no gifts from above. Rely only on "
"ourselves. Never forgive those who wronged us. But, at the same time, savor "
"every droplet of pleasure we could squeeze from our bleak days!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요. 많은 노예들이 믿음 덕분에 살아남았죠. 몇몇은 선한 신이 언젠가 그들을 인도할 날을 고대하며 살아갔어요. 누군가는 악신과 "
"거래를 하기도 했죠... 저와 레그는 칼리스트리아에게서 중요한 것들을 배웠어요. 신에게서 그 어떤 것도 바라지 마라. 오로지 자신만을 "
"믿어라. 우리를 부당하게 대했던 이들을 절대로 용서하지 마라. 하지만, 동시에 힘든 시기 속 작은 즐거움을 충분히 음미하라는 것도 배웠죠!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100024_Text
msgctxt "a102ee2a-68c9-4fe0-a401-88f2791bfd89"
msgid ""
"\"I think you understand me well, as a fellow Calistrian... Could it be the "
"Lady herself who sent you to help us?\""
msgstr "\"절 칼리스트리아의 신자로서 잘 이해해주시는 것 같아요... 여신께서 우리를 도우라고 당신을 보내셨을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_100025_Text
msgctxt "ade1a023-aeae-437a-9c0e-9c08cc6b6e97"
msgid ""
"\"Let's not regret it, or blame each other for anything. It was wonderful "
"while it lasted. The most important thing is, we're friends, and we always "
"will be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 일이 있어도 후회하지 말고 탓하지도 말기로 해요. 그동안 너무 좋았어요. 중요한 건 앞으로도 우린 친구이고, 앞으로도 항상 그럴 "
"거라는 사실이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99917_Text
msgctxt "534403e5-7d0e-4fe5-bcfa-17c8e481c729"
msgid ""
"\"My enslavers from the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} funded a large "
"expedition into the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. A hundred agents, tens "
"of slaves, wagons... We were to search for some ancient artifacts, or "
"ancient ruins...\" {n}Octavia shrugs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 노예 주인들이 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 대규모 원정대를 "
"보냈어요. 100명의 요원과 수십의 노예들과 마차를... 우리는 고대 유물이나 폐허를 찾아봐야 했어요... \" {n}옥타비아는 어깨를 "
"으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99918_Text
msgctxt "b6315570-41db-4296-99e1-3028871d3596"
msgid ""
"\"Our group never made it to the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} "
"hideout. Along the way, it was attacked by the future owner of the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} {mf|himself|herself}. And I'll be forever grateful to "
"{mf|him|her} for it!\" {n}Octavia winks cheerfully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리 탐사대는 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 은신처에 도착하진 못했어요. 가는 중에 {g|Stolen Lands}"
"도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 새 주인에게 공격 받았거든요. 그러니까, 우리 탐사대를 습격해주셔서 정말 감사해요. 평생을 바쳐도 다 못 갚을 "
"은혜를 입었네요!\" {n}옥타비아는 즐겁게 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99920_Text
msgctxt "39579556-a0a1-4b6a-ad41-89fba513bc5f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia is visibly shaken by your words.{/n} \"But... but why? Is "
"something wrong? We had so much fun together! And Reg... Reg will leave with "
"me as well, I know that for sure!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신의 말에 눈에 띄게 동요합니다.{/n} \"하지만... 하지만 왜요? 무슨 힘든 일 있어요? 우리는 정말 즐거웠는데! "
"그리고 레지는... 레지는 분명 저를 따라오겠다고 할 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99923_Text
msgctxt "2ad94cb5-8385-4c80-9797-fc7cc203bc55"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia barely fights back tears and struggles to smile.{/n} \"I'm so "
"sorry to hear that, but if that is your wish... Whatever the reason you send "
"me away, please remember that I always wished you well. Please remember me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 눈물을 가까스로 참고 간신히 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"안타깝지만 그게 당신이 바라는 거라면... 당신이 저를 떠나보내는 "
"이유가 무엇이든, 항상 당신이 잘 되길 바랐다는 걸 기억해줘요. 부디 저를 잊지마세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99924_Text
msgctxt "90400e46-20b2-44cf-b85b-bbf2b052ca38"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia winks her tears away and laughs.{/n} \"Oh, you've got some jokes, "
"{name}!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 눈물이 그렁그렁한 눈으로 윙크하고 웃습니다.{/n} \"오, {name}! 농담이었군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99925_Text
msgctxt "7151dc9d-ed60-4023-b7d9-77558adb502a"
msgid ""
"\"Mother was young and dumb... Younger than I am now. Of course, hiding a "
"three-year-old with the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} and expecting "
"to get her back later was probably the worst plan our era's seen. But what's "
"the point of blaming her now? We can't change what happened, but we're "
"together now. That's what's important.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어머니는 어리고 바보같았어요... 지금의 저보다 어렸죠. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}으로부터 세살배기를 숨기고 "
"나중에 되찾을 거라는 계획은 최악의 계획이였어요. 하지만 지금 원망해서 뭐하겠어요? 과거는 바꿀 수 없지만 지금 우리는 함께잖아요. 그게 "
"중요한 거죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99926_Text
msgctxt "633f8bd9-bfa8-4683-b70c-0f01cca3221b"
msgid ""
"\"It infuriates me... Thinking she could hide a three-year-old with the {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League{/g}, and expecting to get her back later?! I'm "
"just glad it didn't occur to her to leave me in the woods with wolves and "
"bears to care for me... the idiot. I don't even want to think about it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 화가 나요... {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}으로부터 세살배기를 숨기고 나중에 되찾을 거라고 기대하다니요?! "
"그녀가 저를 돌볼 늑대와 곰들이 있는 숲속에 두고 떠나지 않았다는 게 오히려 기뻐요... 바보같아... 생각도 하기 싫어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99932_Text
msgctxt "67da5695-3bab-41c8-ad13-a950178dcada"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing. We're not going there to talk. I just want to spare the world his "
"continued presence once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무것도 아니에요. 얘기하러 가는 게 아니에요. 마지막으로 한 번만 더 그의 지속적인 존재를 세상에 내어주고 싶을 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99933_Text
msgctxt "8bc8098a-5f7c-4652-b3ec-92360eeae335"
msgid ""
"\"No. Well... maybe just a bit. Of course it's bad that he's free and able "
"to keep hurting people. But to sacrifice people dying in front of you just "
"to save the people Janush MIGHT hurt in the future — that would be insane. "
"And getting revenge just for the sake of revenge... No. Not at that price.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요. 글쎄요... 조금은요. 그가 자유로워져서 사람들을 계속 해칠 수 있다는 건 안 좋은 일이에요. 하지만 자누시가 '앞으로 해칠지도' 모르는 "
"사람들을 구하기 위해 눈앞에서 죽어가는 사람들을 희생시킨다는 건... 미친 짓이에요. 그리고 복수는 복수를 부르죠... 그렇게는 안돼요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99934_Text
msgctxt "97957074-a086-4c64-957c-e4835da16832"
msgid ""
"\"I do. I see those poor people in my nightmares. But I still believe it was "
"the right thing to do, cruel though it was. Janush was a monster — he had no "
"right to go on living. If he'd returned to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, he'd have "
"destroyed the lives of hundreds more people, maybe thousands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요. 눈앞에서 타 죽은 불쌍한 사람들이 자꾸 꿈에 나와요. 다시 돌아간다 해도 제 결정은 같지만 잔인한 선택이었죠. 하지만 자누시 "
"또한 살아있을 가치가 없는 괴물이에요. 자누시가 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아갔다면 수백 아니 수천 명의 목숨을 앗아갔을 "
"거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99935_Text
msgctxt "a876f81d-7a4e-4b2f-ace0-1524cbb4ae12"
msgid ""
"\"She moved to the capital — I rented a small house for her. We see each "
"other every day. She's very kind, but so naive! Sometimes when she talks, it "
"seems more like I'm the gray-haired old woman and she's the little girl!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 수도로 이사했어요. 그녀를 위해 작은 집을 빌렸죠. 우리는 매일 만나요. 그녀는 매우 친절하지만, 너무 순진해요! 때때로 "
"그녀가 말할 때 제가 흰머리 할머니고 그녀는 작은 소녀처럼 느껴진다니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99936_Text
msgctxt "61a34fe7-740d-4275-9368-73dec38e037f"
msgid "\"I have no mother. Please never bring it up again.\""
msgstr "\"제게 어머니같은 건 없어요. 다시는 그 얘기 꺼내지 마세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99938_Text
msgctxt "d09386e0-2a92-4f8b-916a-9b06aace1c8c"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for supporting me when I needed it. I was one small step away "
"from leaving them behind to chase Janush.\""
msgstr "\"필요할 때 도와주셔서 고마워요. 자누시를 쫓기 위해 그들을 두고 떠날 뻔한 순간이었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99939_Text
msgctxt "eb0f004b-afd1-44cc-b099-23dbb49348ba"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for supporting me when I needed it. Without your advice, I'd "
"have never had the guts to do what had to be done.\""
msgstr "\"필요할 때 도와주셔서 감사해요. 당신의 조언이 없었다면 일을 제대로 끝마칠 수 없었을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99940_Text
msgctxt "a9d46185-6821-49a4-8a1d-e0b7112c0791"
msgid ""
"\"I tried introducing her to Reg a while ago. Invited him for tea... Oh, you "
"should have seen it! Mother almost had a stroke, listening to him!\" {n}"
"Octavia giggles.{/n} \"Oh, well! It's a bit late to make a lady of me anyway!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"좀 전에 레지에게 그녀를 소개시켜줬어요. 같이 차 한잔 하자고 했죠. 당신이 그 모습을 봤어야 했는데! 그의 말을 듣고 어머니는 거의 "
"쓰러질 뻔 했다니까요!\" {n}옥타비아가 깔깔거립니다.{/n} \"오, 이런! 절 여자대접 하기에는 조금 늦었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99952_Text
msgctxt "7327fad5-9770-41dd-9585-b4b04ec19420"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, no! You have no idea how much I was seething on the inside. Reg wanted "
"me to chase after him — and I almost did!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안 돼요! 제가 얼마나 속을 끓였는지 모르시죠. 레지는 제가 쫓아와 주기를 바랐어요. 그를 따라서 거의 자리를 뜰 뻔했죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99953_Text
msgctxt "2feb3ab5-05c3-4e42-9861-be2f3e5c2bf8"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! But you know, if I ever get it in my head to do something "
"stupid or vile... don't support me then. Better yet, knock some sense into "
"me. I'll definitely thank you later!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연하죠! 하지만 제가 바보 같은 짓이라도 한다면... 저를 도와주지 마세요. 아직은 제게 이성이 있는 것 같아요. 나중에 꼭 "
"감사할게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99954_Text
msgctxt "713dbab9-4cf5-4fc1-b9e7-c04d791fcd4e"
msgid ""
"\"No, don't say that! We did the right thing. Janush is definitely a "
"monster, but would we be any better if we'd let all those people die for our "
"revenge?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니에요, 그런 말 하지 마세요! 우리는 옳은 일을 했어요. 자누시는 분명히 괴물이지만 그 모든 사람들이 우리의 복수를 위해 죽는다면 "
"그게 옳은 일일까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99955_Text
msgctxt "1a327c9a-596b-44f7-9257-9ba6867fe660"
msgid ""
"\"Not just for revenge. You have no idea what that monster Janush did to his "
"victims! Someone had to end him, even at such a terrible price.\""
msgstr ""
"\"복수를 위해서만이 아니에요. 당신은 자누시가 사람들에게 무슨 짓을 했는지 몰라요! 끔찍한 대가를 치르더라도 누군가를 그를 처단해야 "
"했어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99956_Text
msgctxt "6d4fa2f7-e4f1-4657-9dd7-6c35bced14e3"
msgid ""
"\"Not alone. You're our {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, of course, but that "
"doesn't mean you have to bear that responsibility by yourself. We made the "
"decision together, and we'll answer for it together — be it to the people, "
"to the gods, or to our own consciences.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혼자가 아니에요. {mf|남작님|남작님|왕|여왕}이 된다는 건, 혼자서 모든 책임을 짊어져야 한다는 뜻이 아니라구요. 다 같이 결정을 "
"내린 만큼, 책임도 함께 지겠어요. 우리 백성과 신, 그리고 스스로의 양심에 맹세해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99957_Text
msgctxt "5b027b97-28da-40ad-8cef-9f6595249b28"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps... But as we get stronger, doesn't that mean we can afford such "
"luxuries more often? We do what we must, of course — but there's nothing "
"good about cruelty, even if it's sometimes necessary.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도요... 하지만 우리 힘이 강하다는 이유로 세상 모든 호사를 누려야 한다는 법이 있나요? 일은 제대로 하겠지만, 서로 잔인하게 "
"굴 것까진 없어요. 그런 방법이 필요한 순간이 올지도 모르겠지만요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99958_Text
msgctxt "33f15076-edca-4cbe-b4b1-ad7ea20161f1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, stop with the flattery! It wasn't a matter of kindness — maybe not "
"even forgiveness or mercy. It's just... even though we hadn't seen each "
"other for so many years, I feel like she really is family.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만 좀 알랑거려요! 친절이나 용서, 자비에 대한 문제가 아니었어요. 이건 그냥... 우리가 오랫동안 만나지 못했더라도, 그녀는 진짜 "
"가족처럼 느껴졌어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99959_Text
msgctxt "1b2e8f7f-27ef-4adf-8528-5a0cc4f84165"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I can't say everything's peachy. She tries not to show it, but I can "
"tell — there's a lot she doesn't like about me. The way I talk, the work I "
"do, who I sleep with... Sometimes there are awkward pauses in our "
"conversations, and we both understand that some things are best left unsaid. "
"But still... I'm glad we're together again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 모든 게 다 장밋빛갇다고는 할 수 없어요. 그녀는 내색을 안하지만 내가 마음에 들지 않나봐요. 내가 말하고 일하는 방식이나 내가 "
"함께 자는 사람도... 가끔 대화가 어색해지고 끊어지기도 하지만, 서로 어떤 것들은 말하지 않는 게 좋다는 걸 알고 있어요. 그래도 "
"여전히... 다시 만나게 되서 기뻐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99960_Text
msgctxt "ece4ab4a-925d-4655-bf3e-e2164f5f0e90"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia shrugs.{/n} \"If you told me a few years ago it'd be like this, I "
"wouldn't have believed it myself!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"몇 년 전에 당신이 나에게 이럴 거라고 말했다면 그게 제 자신일지라도 절대 안 믿었을 걸요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99962_Text
msgctxt "e4825291-aede-4b89-b265-2bb971fc3297"
msgid ""
"\"It's not nonsense, {Name}! People died... Maybe it wasn't directly because "
"of me, but I let it happen! Maybe you can just forget about it, but not "
"me... I'll never forget. I'll carry this guilt for the rest of my life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 말도 안돼. {Name}! 사람들이 죽었어... 나 때문에 직접적으로 발생한 일이 아니었을 테지만 내가 저지른 거야! 너는 그냥 "
"넘겨버릴지 모르지만 나는 아니야... 나는 이 죄책감을 평생 짊고 살 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99968_Text
msgctxt "dfae6021-e2ca-4a3b-aaf5-1c14a9d422ad"
msgid ""
"\"Not any more cruel than she treated me. Enough about that. I don't want to "
"talk about it anymore.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 저를 대하는 것보다 더 잔인하진 않아요. 이 정도라면 충분해요. 더 이상 얘기하고 싶지 않네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99969_Text
msgctxt "61034d7c-4be1-4ee0-a820-96cbed024e64"
msgid "\"Thank you. I appreciate it.\""
msgstr "\"고마워요. 정말 감사드려요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99970_Text
msgctxt "724b3b74-66ee-4580-a559-846cc475a04c"
msgid ""
"\"I just want to forget about her — forever. If her blood was on my hands, "
"she'd haunt me for the rest of my life. Just drop it. Please.\""
msgstr ""
"\"후작부인에 대한 기억을 영영 지우고 싶네요. 만약 제 손으로 그녀를 죽였다면 그 기억이 평생 따라다녔을 거예요. 그냥 잊어주세요. "
"제발요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99971_Text
msgctxt "e7f2c08c-cf23-4244-a937-6eb0a2d1781e"
msgid "\"No matter what happens, we will always be friends.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 일이 있더라도 우리는 항상 친구에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99973_Text
msgctxt "08c72fa8-fb14-4333-9b73-253d8136ab02"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia buries her nose in your neck.{/n} \"I would. I do. I always do!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신의 목에 코를 묻어버립니다.{/n} \"그래야겠죠. 알겠어요. 약속할게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99974_Text
msgctxt "944c59cf-4247-44c3-b76d-295e0ddfc095"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia pulls away softly.{/n} \"I'm sorry, I'm... Not in the mood.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 부드럽게 물러납니다.{/n} \"미안해요. 기분이... 별로 좋지 않네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99975_Text
msgctxt "90d32995-abf9-4d7e-83fc-f4d61b73f212"
msgid "\"Should we call Reg? It's more fun with the three of us!\""
msgstr "\"레지도 부를까요? 셋이 함께 하면 더 즐거울 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99980_Text
msgctxt "cb208d40-3b5e-443b-9ffb-80a4f616b8a6"
msgid "\"I'll bring him... Don't go anywhere, hee hee!\""
msgstr "\"그를 데려 올게요... 아무데도 가지 마요. 헤헤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99981_Text
msgctxt "3c7704eb-a058-4bc8-b6e7-be8f243d4591"
msgid ""
"{n}Laughing musically, Octavia takes you by the arm and leads to your "
"chambers.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}감미롭게 웃으며 옥타비아는 당신의 팔을 끌고 당신의 방으로 갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99987_Text
msgctxt "f122801c-64ff-485e-bf27-50923bb1eed3"
msgid ""
"\"{Name}, don't. Not now. I'm sorry I'm like this. I just need to think.\""
msgstr "\" {Name}. 하지 마세요. 지금은 안돼요. 이런 식이어서 미안해요. 그냥 생각 좀 할게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99988_Text
msgctxt "59adf5c0-7326-4571-94fa-94e7d4b6afde"
msgid ""
"\"I'm...\" {n}Octavia sighs, almost sniffles.{/n} \"Please forgive me. I "
"need to think. We'll talk when I find the words. All right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는...\" {n}옥타비아는 한숨을 쉬며 거의 훌쩍입니다.{/n} \"용서해주세요. 생각 좀 할게요. 할 말이 떠오르면 얘기해요. "
"알았죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99989_Text
msgctxt "64d2bb25-35b2-4140-99ac-7671a3fafba0"
msgid ""
"\"I love you too. Thank you for being so patient with me. I don't know what "
"I'd do without you.\""
msgstr "\"저도 당신을 사랑해요. 내 응석을 받아줘서 고마워요. 이젠 당신없이 뭘 할 수 있을지 모르겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99990_Text
msgctxt "93d5d66f-1317-450b-9b9e-2ed8c7f2c15b"
msgid ""
"\"Well, our little adventure is over... Oh well, roses don't bloom forever, "
"haha!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 모험은 끝이 났네요... 장미는 영원히 피지 않겠죠. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99991_Text
msgctxt "a59a0d17-6a41-4629-8f98-f62b36179d16"
msgid ""
"\"Hello!\" {n}Octavia smiles at you flirtatiously.{/n} \"Got any good news?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하세요!\" {n}옥타비아가 당신에게 수줍게 웃으며 말합니다.{/n} \"좋은 소식이라도 있어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99992_Text
msgctxt "87edd3d2-26c0-4f43-8b22-4de69f858816"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia greets you with a kiss on the cheek.{/n} \"Hi! It's been a long "
"time! Or has it? It doesn't matter, I've missed you terribly!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신의 뺨에 키스를 합니다.{/n} \"안녕하세요! 오랜만이에요! 아닌가? 상관없어요. 당신이 너무 그리웠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99993_Text
msgctxt "936728e8-f8d3-4472-9f37-96dd142a2b46"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia is lost in thought. She doesn't notice you right away, and when "
"she does, she greets you with a sad smile.{/n} \"Hi.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 생각에 잠겨 침체됩니다. 그녀는 당장 당신을 알아채지 못하지만 당신을 보자 슬프게 웃으며 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕하세요"
".\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99994_Text
msgctxt "8ecf3a1c-c748-43a7-a068-ad6697bfd01c"
msgid "{n}Octavia holds you tight.{/n} \"Back together... I love you.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신을 꽉 안았습니다.{/n} \"다시 함께네요... 사랑해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99995_Text
msgctxt "1fc4d83f-99bd-46cc-b333-9ef406d54fee"
msgid "\"Hold on to Valerie. She's a real treasure. Don't lose her!\""
msgstr "\"발레리를 붙잡아요. 그녀는 진짜 보물이에요. 그녀를 보내지 마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Octavia/VS_Octavia_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_99996_Text
msgctxt "b208d2e3-9b70-4c3f-9dc1-247b3d89f59b"
msgid "\"Take care of Tristian. He's so fragile!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안을 돌봐주세요. 그는 너무 연약해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "83a0feeb-7563-4eaa-9bbe-e7536a866aa8"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8a9be6d6-f9c2-4bc1-ad49-9775fd492b77"
msgid "\"Tell me about your life in Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에서의 삶에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "cfafaeb9-d3bf-48cb-af7b-2dc4f89e42ed"
msgid "\"What kind of relationship do you have with Octavia?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아와 무슨 관계지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ec07cfdd-982a-4430-b9b0-47d75f5d8dff"
msgid "\"How do you like it in my party?\""
msgstr "\"동료들이 마음에 들어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5d3368bf-c7cf-4d50-b3a4-27af85b4e2e6"
msgid "\"I do not need you any longer. Go away.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 더 이상 필요하지 않아. 가버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "74da9940-1137-4b2d-b4c6-be7e737790b4"
msgid "\"Go away and do not return.\""
msgstr "\"떠나. 돌아오지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "672cca90-aaef-4243-a3b6-205ba16328a6"
msgid "\"I was only joking. Of course I need you.\""
msgstr "\"농담이야. 물론 네가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "5356bef5-674c-4cce-a7df-f79358a66a8d"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "64f401b2-3337-400d-8f84-ea601dba37b0"
msgid "\"Why do you call her yours? She doesn't seem to like that very much.\""
msgstr "\"왜 너는 그녀를 '나의 옥타비아'라고 부르지? 별로 좋아하지 않는 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "543b3341-c3da-451a-b049-251cf402d666"
msgid "\"Do you remember your childhood?\""
msgstr "\"어린 시절을 기억해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "24e7a460-66f2-4c71-96cc-e67bcfeb437f"
msgid "\"What deity do you worship?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어떤 신을 숭배하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "bedb4b98-8ba3-4694-8e7c-028629936f58"
msgid "\"Do you enjoy making people suffer?\""
msgstr "\"사람들을 고통스럽게하는 걸 좋아하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "5235528b-59ce-42da-a4e3-8301ee2c97df"
msgid ""
"\"How do you manage to use both a sword and magic – and not cut off your "
"fingers?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 칼과 마법을 동시에 능숙하게 사용하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "b6b629e1-d271-4e7a-8140-b5f8460d7c28"
msgid "Told Regongar your opinion on his methods."
msgstr "레곤가르의 방식에 대해 당신의 의견을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "51addf8c-4c8a-4e76-b3dc-0e2fb3713da5"
msgid "\"It seems to me you're no more than a common felon.\""
msgstr "\"내가 보기에 넌 그냥 흉악범에 지나지 않는 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "be16553a-e861-451a-808b-7fc6b3340902"
msgid ""
"\"If you treat your enemies like that, what makes you better than them?\""
msgstr "\"적들을 그렇게 대하면 그들보다 네가 나을 것이 뭐가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "fa739c87-a666-4b14-8ad3-9aaeba6b2715"
msgid "\"I, for one, enjoy the torments of others!\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 사람들의 고통을 즐기지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "95ed968d-1595-420d-9871-9c48a8bdcc11"
msgid ""
"\"So long as you're in my party, try to control yourself. I don't like "
"meaningless atrocities.\""
msgstr "\"내 일행에 있는 한 너 자신을 통제해라. 나는 무의미한 잔학 행위를 싫어한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "3b04f279-7e82-4942-98ef-00eec0459068"
msgid ""
"\"Very amusing! And you're right – if someone gets in your way, it's their "
"own fault!\""
msgstr "\"아주 재미있군! 네가 맞아. 누군가 너의 길을 가로막으면 그들의 잘못이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0048_Text_String
msgctxt "4da44720-9f53-4d30-91e0-28422f498081"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers!\""
msgstr "\"답변해 주어 고맙군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "0d6fd7ea-7378-4d79-bf26-0a9e872ece0f"
msgid "\"Are you and Octavia faithful to each other?\""
msgstr "\"너와 옥타비아는 서로에게 충실한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "b8f118ad-3a42-4e77-bb73-d130713b8f3f"
msgid "\"Where did you get your magical powers?\""
msgstr "\"어디에서 마법의 힘을 얻었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "6e6faf24-0ea8-40b2-bcf7-a5d57902055f"
msgid "\"How did you happen to become a slave?\""
msgstr "\"어쩌다 노예가 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "788d919e-04f5-4030-9cd6-5edf9f69abce"
msgid "\"Why did your masters teach you magic?\""
msgstr "\"왜 주인이 네게 마법을 가르쳐 줬어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0067_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "0382a82d-c274-4b5c-afd5-e4c9c1ed6e60"
msgid "Told Regongar your opinion on his love with Octavia."
msgstr "옥타비아를 좋아하는 레곤가르에게 당신의 의견을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "d520d470-646c-4e6f-99be-ed49246a85ab"
msgid "\"I couldn't do that. To me, love is impossible without faithfulness.\""
msgstr "\"나는 할 수 없다. 나에게 사랑은 믿음 없이 불가능하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "e37518ed-aca2-4cce-b8c9-850969b1352a"
msgid "\"Is that an invitation? Well then maybe I will!\""
msgstr "\"초청인가? 그러면 가 보도록 할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "8989819e-d255-4cc6-b7aa-2f817b1ed258"
msgid "\"I'm not here to judge. Just curious.\""
msgstr "\"판단하러 온 게 아니다. 그냥 궁금했을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "dabcfe8d-6976-41e6-83b4-55d44241faa7"
msgid "\"W-what?! That's enough from you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐...뭐?! 그만 좀 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "b42dfbe4-0509-4890-8f9f-dc97eb18934e"
msgid "\"How did you meet?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 만났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "9fbd7dd8-ffbb-4fad-a034-e38c1cc1f60b"
msgid "\"You seem not to like people in power. So why are you helping me?\""
msgstr "\"권력을 가진 사람들을 좋아하지 않는 것 같다. 하지만 왜 나를 돕고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "6b7a9457-3f71-4f8e-a9c1-90e3a107e489"
msgid "\"What else did you see, beyond your life in chains?\""
msgstr "\"도망쳤을 때 무엇을 보았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "9ede665d-0769-4f60-8fd3-5a85c1690a57"
msgid "\"Did you and Octavia try to escape?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아와 함께 도망치려고 시도는 했었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "8b78d5f1-0bcc-476c-a725-b6cea8a06f49"
msgid "\"What do your tattoos mean?\""
msgstr "\"문신은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "7b392806-1a14-48cf-b0df-c379609c2825"
msgid "\"I'm reluctant to ask, but why do you and Octavia need a whip?\""
msgstr "\"물어보기 싫지만 왜 너와 옥타비아는 채찍으로 맞아야만 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "73bb2182-0504-45cf-8a39-b2dbefbc731e"
msgid "\"I don't want to hear this. Keep your compliments to yourself.\""
msgstr "\"듣기 싫어. 자랑하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0109_Text_String
msgctxt "de5c8b73-5393-42b3-a4a9-6bb9e5bb0aa9"
msgid "\"I thought you and Octavia were together. Wouldn't she be jealous?\""
msgstr "\"너와 옥타비아가 함께라고 생각했다. 그녀가 질투를 느끼지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0111_Text
msgctxt "0af9bc57-863f-48f3-b435-4d4a68d2af4f"
msgid ""
"\"Are you serious? You better not joke like that! What if I happen to like "
"you too?\""
msgstr "\"진심이야? 농담하지 마! 나도 너를 좋아한다면 어떡하려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0122_Text
msgctxt "25e79009-57f7-464c-9f24-954117ca2cf2"
msgid "\"Do whatever you like, but you'll do it without me.\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 해. 하지만 나는 빼줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0124_Text
msgctxt "990a6301-9be4-4120-b968-babe15df4657"
msgid ""
"\"Are you trying to embarrass me? You failed. Or is that an invitation? If "
"so… maybe I wouldn't mind.\""
msgstr "\"나를 놀리는 거야? 실패했군. 아니면 초대인가? 그렇다면... 상관없지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0130_Text
msgctxt "083d94e1-467b-4eae-8f0a-7d992674e48b"
msgid "\"Is slavery legal in Numeria?\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에서 노예 제도가 합법이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0133_Text
msgctxt "834c7a4e-3d02-44be-a8d8-be055d67de40"
msgid "\"What will you do when you meet Janush?\""
msgstr "\"자누시를 만나면 무엇을 할 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0134_Text
msgctxt "9c36f9f8-4be0-413a-ab70-065242cf0aff"
msgid "\"Do you think we did the right thing, letting Janush escape?\""
msgstr "\"자누시가 도망가게 둔 게 옳은 일이라 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0135_Text
msgctxt "391c4ac6-8e9e-4dde-b3ca-882357c7ce8b"
msgid "\"Do you think we did the right thing, chasing Janush?\""
msgstr "\"자누시를 뒤쫓은 게 옳은 일이라 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0136_Text
msgctxt "d769ade5-be5f-4b2b-80ea-68994058957f"
msgid "\"I'm sorry you haven't met your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"네 부족을 만나지 못해 안타깝군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0137_Text
msgctxt "74d6e13e-0d21-4abc-8568-dd6c0967f406"
msgid "\"I'm sorry you haven't met your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"네 부족을 만나지 못해 안타깝군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0155_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "51b0cf1b-df69-48ec-a38d-7ea70065ebb7"
msgid ""
"Shared your opinion on the events in the Technic League lair with Regongar."
msgstr "레곤가르와 기술 연맹의 은신처에서 있었던 사건에 대한 의견을 나누었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0155_Text
msgctxt "6bc15adc-8c18-455a-a59b-452b33ad4602"
msgid ""
"\"If you need a personal conscience ever again — you know where to find me!\""
msgstr "\"만약 네가 양심이 필요하다면 — 나를 찾아와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0156_Text
msgctxt "f167ef56-e400-4649-ba9f-a85162c1a239"
msgid "\"Since when do you let anyone make decisions for you?\""
msgstr "\"언제부터 사람들이 너를 위해 결정을 내리게 두었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0157_Text
msgctxt "9d8e90ac-a36b-46e0-8df9-65140c7ef8b8"
msgid ""
"\"We made a mistake. We shouldn't have let that monster leave unscathed.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 실수를 저질렀다. 저 괴물을 상처 없이 보내면 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0158_Text
msgctxt "7bce3a13-cd2e-40ad-9266-7928d0f27bed"
msgid ""
"\"I think we made a terrible mistake. So many innocent people died for "
"revenge!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 끔찍한 실수를 저질렀다. 많은 사람들이 복수의 희생자로 죽었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0159_Text
msgctxt "cce56cdc-7d7a-4d6a-8b08-698649867198"
msgid "\"You know I'm always there to support you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 항상 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0160_Text
msgctxt "e080036d-524d-4486-8058-e1f0f8075257"
msgid "\"Yes, we couldn't let him escape. Mercy was out of the question.\""
msgstr "\"그가 도망가게 두어서는 안돼. 자비는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0161_Text
msgctxt "025c4a5e-f07e-40a1-b460-390cb673dcf9"
msgid ""
"\"It's good that you refrained from taking your revenge out on that old man."
"\""
msgstr "\"그 노인에 대한 복수를 삼가는 것이 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0162_Text
msgctxt "196e63be-35d6-4ac0-b70d-dd94a4d13f34"
msgid "\"I'm glad that you at least made peace with yourself.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 너 자신과 화해한 것을 기쁘게 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0163_Text
msgctxt "c3cf8b65-e6a5-4c3f-9a1c-bc7140fdc351"
msgid ""
"\"Still, you should have at least taken your revenge on the last member of "
"the tribe.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 부족의 마지막 구성원에 대한 복수를 해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0164_Text
msgctxt "9c1c82d3-17bf-4a6a-996e-9394b762b43a"
msgid "\"Still, you shouldn't have killed the poor old man.\""
msgstr "\"그 노인을 살려둬서는 안되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0165_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "607f6067-2581-4c2c-8730-9e32a03d72c6"
msgid "Shared your opinion on Regongar's meeting with his tribe."
msgstr "레곤가르와 그의 부족의 만남에 대한 당신의 의견을 나눴습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0165_Text
msgctxt "1b5947cd-3168-43ab-bcb6-172ba020c155"
msgid "\"If you say so. I respect you decision, whatever it might be.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇게 말한다면. 나는 그 결정을 존중한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0166_Text
msgctxt "6ce8f114-19a3-4439-8f22-651533cc6d42"
msgid ""
"\"There was only a pathetic old man left of the tribe, but you still got "
"your revenge.\""
msgstr "\"부족에 한심한 노인이 하나 남았지만 너의 복수는 달성되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0179_Text
msgctxt "3d7aba8e-a3b9-487c-b819-2bdbac41124e"
msgid ""
"\"We burned a few jerks, so what? Their screams as they fried were funny!\""
msgstr "\"멍청이 몇을 태워버렸는데 왜? 튀겨질 때 소리가 우습더군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0182_Text
msgctxt "c2500ac5-8773-4ca0-b92d-385e64bd745d"
msgid "\"I should probably apologize for stealing her from you.\""
msgstr "\"너에게서 그녀를 훔쳐서 사과해야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0190_Text
msgctxt "37a88086-8628-4fb0-948b-517f1aa6ffaf"
msgid "\"I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "\"미안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0191_Text
msgctxt "f7b9e827-11a7-432e-a24b-0d2e34c3e859"
msgid "\"We're still friends, right?\""
msgstr "\"우린 여전히 친구야. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0192_Text
msgctxt "ff7bcd11-2fdf-4c9b-b543-605efd197d1b"
msgid "\"I'm glad you understand.\""
msgstr "\"이해해 줘서 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0201_Text
msgctxt "bfe078b4-082d-4753-9703-7b59d9bb4593"
msgid ""
"[Put your arm around Regongar] \"Do you want to... Spend some time together?"
"\""
msgstr "[팔을 레곤가르의 목에 두릅니다] \"함께... 시간을 보내지 않을래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0206_Text
msgctxt "b336787d-8521-4e46-8be2-c20a4ffcc485"
msgid "\"Of course!\""
msgstr "\"당연하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0207_Text
msgctxt "651cf19b-4f69-47c6-8d18-d64425fdf9cb"
msgid "\"I want to be alone with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 단 둘이 있고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0209_Text
msgctxt "1247127b-1f56-4cbe-af50-a987217d04e9"
msgid "\"Our romance was a mistake. I can't be with you any more.\""
msgstr "\"우리의 연애는 실수였다. 너와 함께할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0212_Text
msgctxt "f3c4ed40-5911-4a84-9664-bd320aa9d238"
msgid "\"No. I'm sorry, I shouldn't have said that. I love you.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 미안. 나는 그렇게 말하지 말았어야 했어. 사랑해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0213_Text
msgctxt "cc5979a8-3c11-4d0f-a689-0eb57f2df624"
msgid "\"Yes. It would be better for both of us.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 그게 우리에게 더 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0216_Text
msgctxt "0779ea4e-e5b7-45a6-ad69-bb7d937600b0"
msgid ""
"\"Our romance was a mistake. You and Octavia will be better off without me.\""
msgstr "\"우리 만남은 잘못되었어. 너와 옥타비아는 나 없이 더 잘맞아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0219_Text
msgctxt "35ff8217-b51f-4681-8e98-71014ef95fc3"
msgid "\"No. I'm sorry, I shouldn't have said that. I love both of you.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 미안. 나는 그렇게 말하지 말았어야 했어. 나는 너희 둘 모두 사랑해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0220_Text
msgctxt "a8d19205-80ed-4666-b9a3-131f42d1ed27"
msgid "\"Yes. It would be better for all three of us.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 그게 우리 셋에게 더 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Answer_0223_Text
msgctxt "21f7cbf6-ca98-4edb-9a69-adc8e9f1278a"
msgid "\"What did you say when you were killing Kalannah?\""
msgstr "\"칼라나를 죽일 때 뭐라고 말했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "80f1cda8-47ef-485a-a5cf-498b24781308"
msgid ""
"\"What do you want? Have a little chat? All right – it's not like we have "
"anything better to do.\""
msgstr "\"원하는게 뭐야? 얘기? 좋아. 그보다 더 할만한 일은 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "21521d1f-cc9d-4855-b878-fcb4f15f4969"
msgid ""
"\"You mean my life as a slave? I didn't see much, except for the slave "
"barracks and the League's twisted laboratories.\""
msgstr "\"노예로서의 내 삶 말이지? 노예 막사와 연맹의 빌어먹을 실험실 말고는 본 게 별로 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "1fc8993e-519e-4f47-aaa2-88968701db70"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to know? I was born. I'm alive. Haven't died yet. That "
"enough for you?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 알고 싶은거지? 나는 태어났고 살아있어. 아직 죽지 않았고. 그러면 된 거 아니야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "fb2a52a1-f292-47d4-b732-e20cb91d3579"
msgid ""
"\"Well... My Octavia and I don't have a 'relationship'. We have a life "
"together.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄... 나의 옥타비아와 나 사이에 '관계'같은 건 없어. 그저 함께 살아갈 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ffe763ea-1514-4fed-8d28-e29bc0188dff"
msgid ""
"\"Where did that come from? Everything seemed all right... No, I'll go, no "
"questions asked. With Octavia, of course. We will be fine without you! But "
"are you sure? If my new chief is your enemy, I won't spare you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"대체 왜 그러는 거야? 모든게 괜찮은 것 같았는데... 좋아. 묻지 않고 가겠어. 물론 옥타비아와 함께. 너 없이도 잘 살 거야! "
"하지만 진심이야? 내 새로운 대장이 네 적이라면 봐주는 건 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "9e14ead3-8ca4-4f24-9ef2-4340b813c3b6"
msgid "\"Too bad, it was good here. But we will find another gang. So long!\""
msgstr "\"안타깝군. 여기가 마음에 들었는데. 그래도 우린 다른 동료를 찾을 거야. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "12650ea4-7031-4e89-ac45-486aba423154"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, all right. Be careful with such jokes – I might just take them "
"seriously!\""
msgstr "\"오. 그런 농담은 하지마. 난 그런거 진심인 줄 안단말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "42f85dfd-de82-432c-b5eb-ae6c1fd1d38d"
msgid ""
"\"So long. If you want to know anything else, just ask – don't be shy. Just "
"don't go pale when I answer, heheh!\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 또 알고 싶은 게 있다면 부끄러워 하지 말고 물어봐. 내가 대답해 줄 때 당황하지도 말고! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "1694bb28-031f-4eda-a3ff-144c4ca53aa6"
msgid ""
"\"My girl loves freedom so much and even a slight chance of losing it "
"frightens her... She is so smart. You really think she feels like I'm trying "
"to make her mine, like an apple stolen at a market? Me, who was skinned "
"alive for trying to help her escape?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 옥타비아는 자유를 너무나 사랑해서 항상 자유를 잃을까봐 두려워해... 그녀는 정말 똑똑해. 내가 정말 그녀를 소유하려 한다고 "
"생각해? 탈출을 도우려다 고문까지 당한 내가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "4bb1c74b-c640-4b57-89e3-b6dfa8b26962"
msgid ""
"\"If she's afraid of the word 'my', it's because she doesn't understand the "
"difference between 'my boots' and 'my heart'. But she will understand. "
"Sooner or later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 나의 옥타비아라는 말을 두려워했다면, '나의 신발'과 '나의 마음' 이 두 단어 사이의 차이를 이해하지 못했을 뿐이야. 하지만 "
"언젠가는 이해하겠지. 조만간.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "95ea3458-7428-427e-997b-696a9744295a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I never got much help from the gods so far! But if you make me choose, "
"I'd say {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}. Who else could I worship? The Savored "
"Sting – the goddess of pleasure, fun... and revenge! Oh, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 지금까지 신들에게 도움을 받아 본 적은 없어! 하지만 선택 하라고 한다면 당연히 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}밖에 "
"없지. 또 누굴 섬기겠어? 즐거움과 기쁨, 복수의 여신! 바로 이거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "94c34a0e-12c0-41ab-8600-8c913fb4f7bb"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar scowls.{/n} \"What a crap question. I was just a kid when they "
"sold me. Before that I don't remember much. Smoky fires, stinky hides, "
"always bumping along on a horse... I think I was born in one of the Kellid "
"tribes of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. There are many – some survive on their "
"own, some give up their pride and serve the {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League{/g}. I guess mine was one of the cowards, if they sold their own kids!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르가 노려봅니다.{/n} \"멍청한 질문이군. 난 아주 어릴 때 팔려갔어. 그 이전의 기억은 나지 않아. 매캐한 연기, "
"냄새나는 가죽, 말 안장에 오르던 기억 뿐이지... 아마 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 켈리드 부족의 일원이었을 거야. 켈리드 부족은 "
"많이 있어. 자급자족하며 살아가는 자들도 있지만 몇몇은 자존심을 버리고 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}을 섬기지. 자기 "
"아이를 팔았다면 우리 부족은 그런 겁쟁이 중 하나였을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "caeae89e-48bb-4cb9-ae03-3eaa0c4bc36f"
msgid ""
"\"I remember my father's hands. Rough, scarred... white. – So I guess I get "
"this green skin from my mother. But I don't remember her. I think I remember "
"playing with another half-orc child... A brother maybe. For some reason they "
"didn't sell him, just me. Father gave him his dagger to play with. Never "
"gave it to me... Ugh, I don't want to remember. Forget all this, I'm an "
"orphan.\" {n}Regongar waves his hand wryly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아버지의 손을 기억하고 있어. 거칠고 흉터진... 하얀 손. 녹색 피부는 어머니의 것이었을 거야. 하지만 별로 기억은 나지 않아. "
"다른 하프오크 아이와 놀았던 기억이 나는데 아마 형제였던 것 같아. 부모님은 내 형제는 내버려두고 나만 팔았어. 아버지는 형에게만 단도를 "
"줬지. 나에게는 주지 않고... 기억하기 싫어. 젠장. 난 그런 부모 없어.\" {n}레곤가르는 얼굴을 찌푸리며 손사래를 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "607b5459-0c8d-4007-b320-a8098ab9a650"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha, ha. Hmm... It's simple: I'm just that bloody good!\" {n}The half-"
"orc gives a contented grin.{/n}"
msgstr "\"하하하. 흠... 간단해. 나는 타고났으니까!\" {n}하프오크는 만족스런 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "b16a1481-8fe4-4132-ab88-ddb0622d8f36"
msgid ""
"\"Pff! Why should I care about their suffering? I do what I want. If I step "
"on someone's toes, then they shouldn't have put themselves in my way. But "
"chasing someone down just to torture them? – That's only entertainment for "
"maniacs like the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}. Well, on second "
"thought... Ha, ha, ha. Hmm... For them I would make an exception. I'd love "
"to watch as I fry them nice and slow!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쳇! 왜 내가 그들의 고통을 신경써야 하지? 나는 하고 싶은대로 해. 내가 누군가 혼내준다면 아마 내 앞길을 막아섰기 때문일거야. "
"하지만 그저 고통을 주기 위해서 누군가를 해한다면? 그건 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 변태들이나 할 법한 놀이지. "
"다시 생각해보면... 하하하. 흠... 기술연맹놈들은 예외로 하고 천천히 노릇노릇하게 볶아버리고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b39fdfe1-7716-40ff-ab3e-10ce6f5ec6e9"
msgid ""
"\"But why do you ask? Do my methods... Shock you?\" {n}Regongar clenches his "
"fist, buzzing with sparks, and laughs loudly at his joke.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 왜 묻는거지? 내 방법이... 끔찍한가?\" {n}움켜쥔 레곤가르는 주먹 주위에 불꽃이 윙윙거리며 튀었고 그는 자신의 농담에 "
"폭소를 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "a83c8e8a-26a8-44a2-8280-913dbc342dc2"
msgid ""
"\"They did much to deserve it. But everyone else – if they stay out of my "
"way, they won't get hurt!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 그래도 싸. 하지만 내 앞길을 막지만 않으면 다치지는 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "4c1a37c1-21a1-4d3f-a45b-964ea6105999"
msgid ""
"\"Look who is talking! Who are you then, if I'm in your gang? An accomplice? "
"Or maybe you're hoping to redeem me with friendship and good examples? Ha, "
"ha, ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말 한번 재밌게 하는군! 그럼 넌 뭔데? 난 네 동료잖아? 그럼 넌 공범인가? 아니면 우정의 힘으로 나를 교화하려는 거야? 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "73909110-2710-4006-954f-b6e45581d3d2"
msgid ""
"\"And why would you think I want to be 'better'? What does that even mean? I "
"have no delusions of purity. I don't need to prove to myself or my enemies "
"that I'm better than them. Morally, spiritually – whatever. I just want them "
"rotting in the ground, so I can live, drink wine – and piss on their graves!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 내가 '더 나은' 사람이 되고 싶어한다고 생각하지? 무슨 소용이야? 나는 순수함 따위는 몰라. 내가 적들보다 도덕성이 뛰어나다고 "
"증명할 필요는 없지. 나는 적들이 그저 땅에 쓰러져 썩어버렸으면 좋겠어. 그러면 나는 살아남아 와인을 마시고 그들의 무덤에 오줌을 누겠지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "bff13670-e85f-48b5-9346-05c73e4d1132"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, fine! Do what you want. – You stay out of my affairs, and I'll stay "
"out of yours. Just don't ask me to join in. I love life. Wine, meat, pretty "
"boys and girls. But torturing someone – what kind of sick fun is that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아! 마음대로 해. 내 일에 신경끄면 너의 일에도 참견하지 않겠어. 동참하라고 말하지만 말아줘. 나는 와인, 고기, 멋진 남자와 "
"예쁜 여자가 좋아. 이게 내 삶이야. 하지만 누군가를 고문하는 걸 즐거워하는 변태가 어디 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "fdecb028-10ef-4459-85e4-0f34630ef8f9"
msgid ""
"\"If you say so! You're the boss. We'll make sure all our atrocities are "
"meaningful, ha, ha, ha! Wouldn't want to upset the boss!\""
msgstr "\"네가 그렇게 말한다면! 네가 대장이니까. 앞으로는 유의미한 잔학행위를 하자고. 하하하! 나는 대장을 열받게 하지 않을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "9315b1df-8220-4cf2-8a6a-bca1b1ae858a"
msgid ""
"\"That's what I say! There's too many freaks who don't understand, just "
"asking to be run through with a sword! Sometimes I'm casting a spell, "
"looking at another fool, thinking, 'You idiot, what the hell are you doing? "
"You'd still be alive, if you weren't standing in my way. None of this had to "
"happen.' And then – bam! They're dead, and I have to clean some more blood "
"from my shirt!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 말이 그거야! 세상에는 칼만 들고 덤비는 멍청이들이 너무 많아! 가끔 바보들을 바라보며 마법을 시전할 때 이런 생각을 하지. "
"'멍청이 같으니, 대체 왜 덤비는거야? 내 앞길만 안 막았어도 널 죽일 일은 없었을텐데!' 그리고 바로 쾅! 그 바보들은 죽고 나는 옷에 "
"묻은 피나 닦겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0049_Text_String
msgctxt "bfdf0504-4fcd-4126-90e2-8add97106f76"
msgid "\"Thanks don't fill a purse! Ha, ha, I'm just kidding.\""
msgstr "\"고마우면 돈이나 줘! 하하. 농담이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "aab1b41e-3198-43b6-b7de-7f7ce67c8711"
msgid ""
"\"What magical powers, the hells are you talking about? Oh, you mean these?\""
" {n}Regongar makes lightning run over his hands with a contented smile, then "
"snaps his fingers, invoking a shower of blinding sparks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"마법의 힘이라니, 도대체 무슨 소리야? 이거?\" {n}레곤가르는 만족스런 미소를 지으며 손에 번개를 만들고 손가락을 튕기자 눈부신 "
"불꽃을 내뿜습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "54cd339f-8e72-4a7a-881b-9987724943e1"
msgid ""
"\"I've had them since I was born. At least one thing I can thank my scum "
"parents for. Maybe these powers are why they sold me to slavery. Think they "
"were scared? Who knows. Damn {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"선천적인 능력이야. 나를 낳아준 자들이 준 선물이지. 이 힘 때문에 나는 노예로 팔린 것 같아. 겁을 먹어서 나를 팔아버린 걸까? "
"망할 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 녀석들. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "954e9dd5-2d07-4956-8a08-bd35eb533f76"
msgid ""
"\"At the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} they drew my blood, did "
"experiments – burned me with fire, tortured me with cold, electricity... And "
"they told me – you won't believe it! – they told me I have blue dragon blood "
"in my veins! Not bad, huh? I'm a dragon, you freaks! Come check my blood, if "
"you dare!\" {n}Grinning, Regongar strikes his palm with a fist, and another "
"fountain of electric sparks shoots upwards.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 내 피를 뽑아 실험을 했어. 나를 불에 태우고 얼음이나 전기로 나를 고문했지... "
"그리고는 내 피 속에 블루 드래곤의 피가 흐르고 있다나! 나쁘지 않지? 드래곤의 무서움을 보여주었어야 했는데!\" {n}레곤가르는 "
"손바닥에 주먹을 치며 웃고는 그 위로 전기 불꽃이 솟아오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "f56a507b-29d0-4ae0-bc6d-04a3dc57cd66"
msgid ""
"\"Can't you guess? Because magic is in my blood – it's why they bought me! I "
"wasn't raised as some lowly mop slave, but as a murder machine. I'd fetch "
"quite a nice sum of gold! You might also ask if they knew I'd take the first "
"opportunity to rip their own guts out, using everything they taught me. Ha! "
"Of course they did! But that's the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}. "
"They calculate risk.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어? 내 능력 때문에 나는 팔려간 거야! 나는 허드렛일 하는 노예가 아니라 살인 기계로 키워졌어. 내가 그들에게 돈을 쥐어줄 수 "
"있으니까! 내가 그들에게 배운 마법으로 그 녀석들을 해치우지 않았는지 궁금하겠지. 하지만 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}"
"은 위험을 미리 계산했어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "a2be4ea1-201f-42a3-9398-0db4e2dc67d2"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia kept pretending to be simple-minded, so they wouldn't expect "
"anything of her. But I made every effort – though they didn't teach me much. "
"What is there to teach? It's not book magic, it's innate. They made me "
"practice with my sword more... But I did my best in everything. I studied "
"all I could. They knew they were raising an enemy, but they thought they "
"could keep me on a short leash. Or sell me to someone with deep pockets, so "
"I'd become someone else's problem. But who won in the end, huh? Who is free? "
"Who will bury them all?\" {n}The half-orc makes an obscene gesture in the "
"north-western direction, toward {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아는 실성한 척 해서 그들이 행동을 전혀 예측할 수가 없었어. 하지만 나는 배운 게 많지 않더라도 모든 노력을 다했지. 솔직히 "
"가르칠 게 뭐가 있었겠어? 배우는 게 아니라 타고난 건데. 그래서 나는 검술 훈련을 더 많이 했어... 하지만 나는 최선을 다했어. 나는 "
"배울 수 있는 건 모두 배웠어. 그들은 호랑이를 키운다고 생각했지만 목줄을 쥐고 있으니 괜찮다고 생각했겠지. 아니면 나를 비싼 값에 "
"팔아서 문제도 해결할 수 있었고. 하지만 누가 마지막에 이겼지? 누가 자유를 얻었지? 누가 그들을 모두 묻어버릴거지?\" {n}하프오크는 북서쪽 "
"방향의 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}를 향해 외설스러운 손가락질을 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0062_Text_String
msgctxt "730cb0fc-2b26-4eb4-b5bb-227adfa01e25"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia and I are connected, and this connection cannot be broken. We grew "
"into each other, you know? Jealousy is for weak cowards, who don't trust "
"each other and are scared of being tricked. If a night on the side threatens "
"your love – that just means there was no real love there to begin with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아와 나는 끈끈한 유대로 연결되어 있어. 우린 함께 자라왔지. 질투는 서로 믿지 못하는 겁쟁이들이나 하는 거라고. 하룻밤 상대로 "
"사랑이 흔들린다면 그건 애초에 진정한 사랑이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0063_Text_String
msgctxt "1b5bb2f4-b075-491c-8e09-3d5823e66014"
msgid ""
"\"She and I are together. To the end. And we will never part from each "
"other. So when she likes some lad or some lass, it's no drama to me. I just "
"ask her whether she wants me to leave them alone or join in. And she does "
"the same, ha, ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀와 나는 끝까지 함께 할 거야. 우리는 결코 헤어지지 않을 거야. 그녀가 어떤 녀석을 좋아한다고 해도 나는 신경쓰지 않아. 둘이 "
"내버려둘지 아니면 셋이서 서로 사랑할지 그녀에게 물어볼 거야. 그리고 그녀도 똑같이 물어보겠지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0064_Text_String
msgctxt "f5cdbf22-b808-4d5e-8834-3f8b2ace8229"
msgid ""
"\"What, are you judging us? Or maybe... Maybe you just want to join us in "
"our tent, hmmm?\" {n}The half-orc grins.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 우리가 어떤지 속으로 평가하고 있는거야? 아니면... 너도 우리 침대에 같이 눕고 싶은 건가? 흠?\" {n}하프오크는 "
"웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "5ec990c5-be10-4249-9f3e-a590516bd40f"
msgid ""
"\"That's what I call love. And that other thing, with constant jealousy, "
"suspicion and scandal – I call that dog shit!\""
msgstr "\"그게 내가 사랑이라고 부르는 거야. 그리고 질투와 의심은 개똥 같은 것이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "3195bacb-e63e-419f-b4a8-5a14df2bc222"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar laughs.{/n} \"Oh, I can't help it! You are so pretty when you "
"blush!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르 웃습니다.{/n} \"오! 너 얼굴이 붉어지니까 꽤 귀여운데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "b5cd3bb6-2cd1-484b-939d-9169a6548453"
msgid ""
"\"You asked, I answered! When you pry into others' lives, don't be surprised "
"if you find something that will keep you up at night, ha, ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 물어서 나는 대답해준거 뿐이야! 다른 사람의 삶에 끼어들 때 밤에 너를 위로할 무언가를 찾아도 놀라지 말라고! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0073_Text_String
msgctxt "ceaaa4fa-8b00-401f-8ab9-4592e0e8f778"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? Ha, ha, hmmm...\" {n}Regongar measures you with an openly "
"lustful look.{/n} \"I will... think about it.\""
msgstr "\"그래? 하하. 음...\" {n}레곤가르는 대놓고 음흉하게 당신을 훑습니다.{/n} \"생각... 해볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "23b9a380-8397-44e0-af2b-60a15d2ee66c"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar smirks.{/n} \"Live as you wish. I'm not trying to get into your "
"bed!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 능글맞게 웃습니다.{/n} \"네 마음대로 살아. 네 침대에는 들어가지 않을 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "3d2ba89e-39c2-4e60-b2f6-9923acca8786"
msgid ""
"\"I was sold. By my own tribe. When I was just a little brat.\" {n}The half-"
"orc clenches his teeth, then spits on the ground and steps on it with his "
"boot.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 부족이 나를 팔았어. 내가 꼬마 아이였을 때 말이지.\" {n}하프오크는 이를 악물고 땅바닥에 침을 뱉고는 장화로 밟습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "f78335a2-8bf1-4040-9299-85fc0f3f3aff"
msgid ""
"\"So I grew up in a slave barracks. I was raised to be sold, like a battle "
"animal. They tried to break me... But they picked the wrong brat! No matter "
"how much you beat this animal – he only gets angrier!\" {n}The half-orc "
"punches himself in the chest and snarls.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 노예 막사에서 자랐어. 나는 투견처럼 키워져서 팔렸지. 그들은 나를 굴복시키려 했지만... 소용없었지! 아무리 호랑이를 때려서 "
"길들이려고 해도 화만 돋구는 것뿐이니까!\" {n}하프오크는 가슴을 치며 으르렁 거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "5c2eb79a-376f-4854-8602-f518012788c7"
msgid ""
"\"What kind of idiot question is that? I'm not some revolutionary from "
"{g|Galt}Galt{/g}! Burn the palaces, eat the rich, power to the people... "
"Bah! I don't care about all that. You are a decent {mf|lad|lass}, and your "
"band is all right. You killed the Stag Lord, took his place, even got "
"yourself a title – you're a real winner! A kingpin like that is worth "
"holding on to. Better than cooking up a revolution... Oh, wait, I've got it! "
"You're afraid I'm after your throne? Ha, ha, hmmm, relax! I don't need your "
"sodding power. I'm fine as a henchman!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 질문이 이래? 나는 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}의 혁명가가 아니라고! 궁전을 불태우고 부자들을 갈취하고 사람들에게 영향력을 "
"행사하고... 나는 그런 건 상관하지 않아. 너는 점잖고 너희 일행도 괜찮아. 너는 수사슴 군주를 죽여 그의 땅을 빼앗아 칭호도 얻었어. "
"넌 진정한 승리자야! 이런 대장은 함께 할 가치가 있지. ...오, 잠깐. 알겠어! 내가 네 왕좌를 탐낼까봐 그래? 하하! 흠. 진정해! "
"나는 네 힘 따위 원치 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "cae6296a-c201-4122-bfe8-c8e45527d1e2"
msgid ""
"\"Just make sure all that power of yours doesn't go to your head. You know "
"how sometimes normal people get carried away and want everyone to lick their "
"boots. If you go that way, I won't lie: I'll walk away and take my Octavia "
"with me. But you seem all right, so... The party goes on!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 머리 굴리는데 애쓰지마. 누구나 가끔 바보같은 짓을 하지. 계속 네가 그런 식으로 나간다면 나의 옥타비아를 데리고 떠날 거야. "
"하지만 지금은 그렇지 않은 거 같으니 걱정 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "a1e62bb8-deb6-4d82-bb22-eccd4633af21"
msgid ""
"\"What could I have seen?! Well, when we ran, we went through "
"{g|Starfall}Starfall{/g}. That's a fine city – big, loud, many merchants, "
"things to see... things to steal. But I didn't have much chance to walk "
"around. It's the very nest of the sodding {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League{/g}! We were focused more on getting out alive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭘 봤을까?! 도망쳤을 때 우리는 {g|Starfall}스타폴{/g}을 지나쳤어. 상인도 많고 시끄럽고 훔칠 것도 많은 도시였지. "
"하지만 쏘다닐 기회가 없었어. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 녀석들의 본거지였으니까! 우리는 살아나가는 데에 더 "
"집중해야 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "74505684-96b7-48ff-afcd-97c3af22455c"
msgid ""
"\"We met some barbarians. I asked them who might know what tribe I'm from – "
"but they didn't know anything. I don't have any tribal tattoos. Nothing. "
"Actually they are all right. Well, some of them. The Blood Pikes, for one – "
"they're great. All the rivers are theirs! We sailed with them during one of "
"our escapes, almost all the way to {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, and they didn't "
"turn us in! But the White Scars got us after that. Those guys are shit! "
"They've sold their pride to the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 몇 명의 바바리안들을 만났어. 그들에게 내 부족을 아냐고 물었지만 모르더군. 나는 부족 문신같은 것도 없었거든. 진짜 "
"아무것도. 그래도 그들은 괜찮은 친구들이였어. 그중에 몇 명은 말야. 피의 가시뼈라는 부족은 대단하더군! 인근의 모든 강을 지배한다고 "
"하더라고! 도망가는 중에 그들과 함께 강을 탔는데, {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 근처로 올 때까지 우리를 기술 연맹에 팔아넘기지 "
"않았지! 그 후에 만난 하얀 흉터 부족놈들은 멍청이들이었어! 자존심을 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에 팔아 넘긴 "
"놈들이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "8d878e87-81b2-4021-b9f7-8007a73b79fe"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, one more thing! One time Octavia and I tried to escape, and stumbled "
"across a {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} monster. I'll never forget it! A huge "
"spider, the size of a house – made of metal! Spitting fire, shooting deadly "
"rays all around... That thing could probably tear even a dragon to pieces! "
"Ruined our escape plans, too. We had to go back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 한가지 더! 옥타비아와 나는 도망가려 했지만 우연히 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 괴물과 마주쳤어. 그 때를 절대 잊지 "
"못할 거야! 철로 만들어진 거대한 거미라니! 불을 뿜고 광선을 쏘아댔지... 드래곤도 조각낼 수 있었을 거야! 우리의 계획도 물거품이 "
"되었고 우리는 돌아가야만 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0086_Text
msgctxt "5f813a74-5071-4395-920f-24ba90eef516"
msgid ""
"\"What do you think? Of course we tried! I stopped counting how many times. "
"Jumped from windows, dug tunnels, choked out guards – or seduced them. That "
"happened too, ha, ha, hmm... But those dirtbags caught us every time. Every. "
"Bloody. Time. My back is covered with whip scars. Lucky we were prized "
"property. They'd spent too much gold on us to kill us. Anyone else would be "
"hung and forgotten. But they kept trying to break us, and recoup their "
"expenses.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떨 것 같아? 당연히 시도해봤지! 창문에서 뛰어내리고 굴을 파고 경비원을 죽이거나 심지어 유혹하기도 했어. 그런 일도 있었지. "
"하하, 흠... 하지만 그 망할 녀석들은 언제나 우리를 도로 잡아 넣었어. 언제나. 항상. 내 등은 채찍질로 얻은 흉터로 가득하지. "
"우리가 상품성 있는 노예라서 다행이였어. 우리를 도로 잡는데 돈을 많이 쓰긴했지. 아무개라면 그저 죽였을 테지만 그들은 우리를 포획해서 "
"손실을 만회하려 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "500bde71-c3e8-4694-bae2-7f6f9de1b3bf"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know whether I could have survived by sheer stubbornness, if it "
"weren't for Octavia. I probably couldn't have. I would have just given up "
"and died. But I had to pull my girl out of that meat grinder. And she... She "
"believed in me, and had enough hope for both of us. When I lay there with my "
"back slashed to pieces, she whispered to me about the {g|River Kingdoms}"
"River Kingdoms{/g}, where there's no slavery, where everyone can go wherever "
"they want – and take whatever they want.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아가 아니었다면 그렇게 고집스럽게 살아남았을지 확신이 서지 않아. 결국 죽었겠지. 하지만 난 나의 옥타비아를 구해야만 했어. "
"그녀는... 나를 믿었고 우리는 꿈이 있었지. 내 등짝이 걸레조각이 되어 누워있을 때 그녀가 나에게 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 "
"왕국들{/g}은 노예 제도가 없고 어디든 갈 수 있다고 속삭여주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "cf74d2b7-63d0-4bc3-8b18-48aaf179ee98"
msgid ""
"\"I'll be damned, but I thought she was just making this up to keep our "
"hopes alive. And now it turns out to be true – all of it, every last word! "
"No chains, no slaves, no laws – just live and be happy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 잔소리할지도 모르지만 나는 그게 모두 순 거짓말이라 생각했지. 그런데 전부 다 사실이더군. 노예도 법도 사슬도 없이 행복하게 "
"살 수 있는 세상이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "0fdbf931-a033-4437-bae7-c8eba927338f"
msgid ""
"\"Back when we were children, we were taken as apprentices by a great "
"spellmaster, Janush. – 'Maestro' Janush, he called himself. He was our "
"teacher. Well, he made Octavia read books and memorize spells. I have my "
"own, innate magic. He trained me a bit, taught how to control my gifts, so I "
"wouldn't lose control and incinerate myself like a dumbass.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어렸을 때, 우리는 자칭 대마법사 자누시의 견습생이 되었어. 그는 우리의 선생이었지. 옥타비아에게 책을 읽고 마법을 외우는 법을 "
"알려주었지. 나는 마법을 타고났으니까, 내게는 재능을 통제하는 법을 알려줬지. 그래서 나 자신을 불태우는 바보짓은 안 할 수 있게 됐어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "0ed5fe69-f14c-4058-a856-4527ee091137"
msgid ""
"\"But you were asking about my Octavia. We've been together all our lives. "
"We learned everything together – how to weave magic, and how to survive... "
"And as we grew older, we learned how to love. Without each other we would "
"never have gotten out of there, that's for sure. We would have given up and "
"surrendered to death. But together – that's a very different story! Not the "
"first time, and not the tenth, but eventually we made it out!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 너는 나의 옥타비아에 대해 묻고 있었어. 우리는 평생 함께했지. 마법이나 생존 방법도 함께 터득했고... 나이가 들어감에 따라 "
"사랑하는 법을 배웠어. 하나가 갇히면 절대 져버리지 않았을 거야. 혼자라면 포기하고 죽음에 굴복했을 것이고. 함께라면 전혀 달라! "
"여러번의 시행착오가 있었지만 결국 우리는 해냈지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "83c57fbd-2a07-4b90-88bc-1c6b78c01a69"
msgid "\"Ask away!\""
msgstr "\"물어봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "0850c9c5-cf61-43e4-9c9b-649c3010ca01"
msgid "\"Don't mention it!\""
msgstr "\"말하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "613d53ca-c8d2-42be-b925-8b9dbef15f1a"
msgid ""
"\"I grew up a slave. That I remember well. So many things burned into my "
"memory. Most of all I remember her. My Octavia. Today we are almost the same "
"age, but back then she was twice as young as me, just a child. – But a brave "
"one. Cunning. Bold. And beautiful, the most beautiful girl in the world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 노예로 자랐어. 그건 잘 기억하지. 많은 기억들은 사라졌어. 내가 기억하는 건 나의 옥타비아가 대부분이야. 우리는 지금 같은 "
"성인이지만 그때 그녀는 나보다 두 배는 어렸다고. 하지만 용감하고 똑똑했지. 그리고 세상에서 제일 예쁘고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "53d29148-3a90-4064-bd2f-f168bec0a0aa"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, teacher... We will meet again. There's one more test I must pass...\""
msgstr "\"오. 스승님... 다시 만날거야. 꼭 통과해야 할 시험이 하나 있거든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "ecc8c4c6-ff1c-4849-875c-1608877ee040"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, teacher... I'd so like to get even with him, but now it's too late. I "
"know that snake — he won't let me catch him again. Still, I'll always "
"remember how he ran away from us in a blind panic, filling his trousers as "
"he fled.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 스승님... 그에게 복수하고 싶지만 이제는 너무 늦었어. 그 뱀같은 노인을 다시 잡기는 힘들겠지만, 아직까지 그 인간이 오줌을 "
"지린 채 도망치는 모습이 생생해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "62cef631-440d-4327-836a-1d15a66ef3de"
msgid ""
"\"I think it's grand! You have a fine gang of lunatics here! I myself am no "
"noble from high society, ha, ha! But seriously, Octavia and I never even "
"dreamed of a leader like you. We imagined we'd sit in the woods and rob "
"wagons, maybe join a band of mercenaries... But we never expected to become "
"the henchmen of a local ruler!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 생각엔 대단한 것 같은데! 네 동료들은 하나같이 미친 녀석들이고! 나도 귀족처럼 고귀하진 않지만, 하하! 하지만 옥타비아와 나는 "
"너 같은 지도자는 꿈에도 생각해 본 적 없어. 우리는 용병단에 들어가 훔친 마차를 타고 숲 속을 달릴 거라 생각했지... 하지만 영주의 "
"심복이 되리라고는 생각지도 못했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "62d28b25-6160-4728-9e6d-8ac722bfbe42"
msgid ""
"\"They are magical. They help me control my powers. The {g|Technic League}"
"Technic League{/g} gave them to me. I'd hoped that somewhere on my body "
"there was at least one sign left by my tribe... But no. I guess they didn't "
"care to bother. To hell with them. They better hope I never find them! If I "
"ever meet my father, I will even the score between us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법이 담겨있어. 내 힘을 통제하는 걸 도와줘. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 줬지. 내 몸 어딘가 부족이 남긴 "
"징표가 있기를 바랬지만... 없었지. 그들은 귀찮은 것을 싫어했나 봐. 그놈들은 나랑 안 마주치는게 좋을거야! 만약 내 아버지를 다시 "
"만난다면, 복수할테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "8ea908a1-15fb-4418-bd98-4131075d0904"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, what a question! Are you sure you want to know? I don't mind telling "
"you, but how are you going to sleep at night?\""
msgstr "\"결국 이런 질문을 하는군! 정말 알고 싶어? 나는 상관 없지만 너는 밤에 잠도 못잘 걸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "64318bac-cc3a-4530-b0c7-0ffb47a86f72"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha, ha, hmm... It's difficult to explain. I'm nothing like those "
"maniacs who worship {g|Zon-Kuthon}Zon-Kuthon{/g}, pain and death. In fact "
"it's more the opposite. To me pain is another joy of life. It's proof that "
"I'm alive. Sounds crazy, doesn't it? But it's true. When I am injured in "
"battle, it's like hot pepper on the victory feast. And when the women you "
"love does it... It's a very special kind of caress.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하. 흠... 설명하기 어렵군. 나는 {g|Zon-Kuthon} 존 쿠쏜{/g}과 같은 고통과 죽음의 신을 숭배하는 녀석들과 "
"달라. 사실 그 반대지. 나에게 고통은 삶의 또다른 기쁨이야. 내가 살아있다는 증거잖아. 미친 소리 같지만 사실이지. 내가 전투에서 "
"부상을 입는다면 그건 승전 연회에 뿌리는 매운 후추 같은 거라고. 그리고 사랑하는 여자가 내게 상처 입힌다면... 특별한 애무가 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "442010d9-d624-4a79-84cb-49eb166282bb"
msgid ""
"\"Not to mention, such a pretty one, ha, ha!\" {n}Regongar winks at you "
"playfully.{/n}"
msgstr "\"오. 정말 앙증맞은 것 같으니!\" {n}레곤가르는 당신에게 장난스럽게 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "463c1367-1d01-41d8-9119-dee75e31d39b"
msgid ""
"\"Though at times it's boring. Truth be told, you love your laws and rules "
"too much. You never relax and have some proper fun! But probably all rulers "
"are like that, huh? Obligations and responsibilities weighing you down... "
"That's exactly why you never have to fear me overthrowing you, ha, ha! You "
"can be responsible for the country, and I'll be responsible for having "
"enough fun for the both of us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"때로는 지루해. 사실 너는 법과 규칙을 너무나 사랑하지. 긴장을 풀고 즐기는 적이 없으니! 하지만 통치자가 그런 것 아니겠어? 책임과 "
"의무에 짓눌리다니... 그러니 내가 반란을 일으키리라는 걱정을 할 필요가 없지. 하하! 너는 나라를 책임지지만 나는 즐거운 모험을 "
"책임지니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "89e5b997-5b4d-4fa1-8c21-c946ba0673fe"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, sometimes you ruin all the fun, hammering on about your laws "
"and rules... But it's all right! The important thing is, you don't judge. "
"You live and let live, ha, ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 너는 법과 규칙을 거들먹거리며 재미를 망치지... 하지만 괜찮아! 너는 남을 판단하지 않으니까. 행복하게 살자고! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "88963780-bf86-4972-ae53-a33df6fcca09"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly never imagined one as fine a companion as you! I never thought "
"someone could sit of the throne yet never lose their taste for good fun. I'd "
"die of boredom with all those reports and orders. But you never let us get "
"bored!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실 너와 같은 동료를 예상하지 못했어! 권력을 가졌지만 즐길 줄도 아는 녀석이 있다니. 나라면 보고서 따위를 받았으면 지루해 죽었을 "
"거야! 게다가 너는 우리는 지루하게 하지도 않으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "ec672636-84cf-4ad9-ba8c-1a7512d69ca1"
msgid ""
"\"Go easy, I'm only kidding!\" {n}The half-orc sneers and pries his lusting "
"eyes from your figure.{/n}"
msgstr "\"진정해. 농담이야!\" {n}하프오크는 당신의 모습을 음흉하게 보며 능글맞게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0116_Text_String
msgctxt "5d13314c-f6e0-47af-92d1-7e027499c1d3"
msgid ""
"\"No, there is no need to be afraid of my Octavia's jealousy. But beware of "
"her tenderness! Ha, ha... Not every one can handle her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 나의 옥타비아가 질투하는 건 두려워할 필요가 없지만 그녀의 부드러움은 조심하라고! 하하... 아무나 그녀를 다룰 수 없으니까!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0117_Text
msgctxt "1b1ac656-18aa-4f3e-9d26-9d412106629f"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc approaches you closely, and locks eyes with you.{/n} \"And "
"what if it's not a joke, huh?\""
msgstr "{n}하프오크가 당신에게 가까이 접근하고는 눈을 맞춥니다.{/n} \"농담이 아니라면 어떡하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0118_Text
msgctxt "5e15bf30-62ae-45c9-aa4b-8695db7b5d8d"
msgid ""
"{n}After a pause he steps back and laughs heartily.{/n} \"I'm joking, I'm "
"joking! Or am I? We can discuss it later. Another time and place.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 후 그는 뒤로 물러나서 거짓 없이 웃습니다.{/n} \"농담이야! 아닐 수도 있지만. 다음에 얘기해. 다른 곳에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0119_Text
msgctxt "eb986e01-8328-41eb-84c0-d1cb929bdb17"
msgid ""
"\"But why the question? You want to watch our games? Or... Maybe join us?\""
msgstr "\"그런데 왜 그런 질문을? 우리의 놀이를 보고 싶어? 아니면... 함께 놀아볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0120_Text
msgctxt "6e93717e-b897-46cc-91f0-da9ca277fe1d"
msgid ""
"\"Strange to hear this, huh? But what are you going to do? You ask strange "
"questions – you get strange answers!\""
msgstr "\"이상하게 들리지? 하지만 어쩌겠어? 네가 그렇게 물었으니 이런 대답이 나오지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0128_Text
msgctxt "16aea415-9b05-4d74-a4e2-14d8e4b60bb9"
msgid ""
"\"You're right about that! But if you have any more questions, don't be shy, "
"ask away – ha, ha, ha!\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아! 더 물어볼 것이 있다면 부끄러워 하지 말고 물어봐! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0129_Text
msgctxt "58a679ee-e5e8-41b8-ba37-ab9a52189591"
msgid ""
"\"Seriously, jokes aside? Ha, ha, hmm.\" {n}The half-orc measures you with a "
"lustful look.{/n} \"Interesting... I will remember this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담은 제쳐두고 진심으로? 하하하. 음.\" {n}하프오크는 대놓고 음흉하게 당신을 훑습니다.{/n} \"흥미로운데... 잊지 않겠어!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0131_Text
msgctxt "75d650f7-1e81-40a9-b946-afc49de4bbb9"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes yes, sometimes no. There are some laws against it, but even in "
"{g|Starfall}Starfall{/g} a third of the people live in bondage. And that's "
"the capital! In regions where the Black Sovereign's hand doesn't reach, they "
"hold to tribal customs instead of laws. The barbarians don't keep slaves – "
"instead they have thralls. Big bloody difference!\""
msgstr ""
"\"때로는 맞지만 틀리기도 해. 불법이지만 심지어 {g|Starfall}스타폴{/g} 사람들의 3 분의 1이 노예 상태야. 수도에서 그런 "
"일이 벌어진다고! 검은 군주의 영향력이 닿지 않은 곳에 그들은 법 대신 부족의 관습을 지켜. 야만족은 노예를 소유하지 않지만 노예 같은 "
"부하를 소유하지. 그건 아주 큰 차이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0132_Text
msgctxt "78be676c-40a0-40cf-b2cb-4ec3e4e79268"
msgid ""
"\"And on top of all that mess there's the {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League{/g}. Law and custom mean nothing to those slimeballs. They just take "
"whatever and whoever they want.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 그 모든 것의 꼭대기에는 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 있어. 법과 관습은 그 멍청이들에게 아무 의미가 "
"없어. 그들은 원하는 무엇이든 가지려 드니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0138_Text
msgctxt "fe39220e-4a15-43a6-ad7d-755e52a5065f"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean? Stupid question! I'll crack his skull, that's what. "
"We're not going there to have a chat with him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 뜻이야? 어리석은 질문이야! 나는 그의 두개골을 깰 거야. 그게 전부다. 우리는 그 녀석과 잡담을 하러 가는 게 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0139_Text
msgctxt "4d33eb47-c209-42d6-b424-92ae554d78d5"
msgid ""
"\"Sure, it's a shame. I've dreamed of smashing him across the wall, and he "
"slipped right out of my hands! But you and Octavia are right: leaving those "
"losers to burn — only an animal could do that. Maybe some of those we saved "
"will get to Janush's throat... A boy can dream, heh!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 안타깝지. 벽에 그를 박살내는 꿈을 꾸었는데, 그는 내 손에서 빠져나가더군! 하지만 너와 옥타비아가 옳았어. 그 "
"멍청이들을 불타 죽게 내버려두는 건 — 짐승이나 할 수 있는 짓이지. 우리가 구한 놈들 중 일부가 자누시를 죽일수도 있어... 꿈은 꿀 수 있지, 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0140_Text
msgctxt "b52c3f6c-9007-47cf-b6b1-8e62de9db04c"
msgid ""
"\"Of course we did. It was one of the best days in my life! I waited for it "
"for so many years! I dreamed so many times of seeing fear on his smug face, "
"and then enjoying him bleeding out and growing cold... And he didn't "
"disappoint, ha ha hmmm!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그랬지. 우리 인생에서 최고의 날이었다! 그 순간을 얼마나 기대했는지! 그 녀석 얼굴에 공포가 드리우고 피를 토하고 서서히 죽는 "
"모습이란... 그는 우리를 실망시키지 않았어! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0141_Text
msgctxt "9c2fbc57-5e2c-4661-9bd6-831986c2c9f1"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be. Knowing me — I'd have probably killed them. And now... Buried "
"them. Said farewell. And that's it, we move on.\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 나를 알았다면 그들을 죽였을 거야... 지금이라면 묻어버리고 작별했겠지. 그렇게 떠나는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0142_Text
msgctxt "6b3d61cd-4148-4aed-8e97-e5fbbdb8f6c1"
msgid ""
"\"What tribe? What are you talking about? I don't have a tribe! I'm an "
"orphan — and that's fine. No relatives, no problems!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 부족? 무슨 소리하는 거야? 나는 부족이 없다! 나는 고아지만 괜찮아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0143_Text
msgctxt "f7c1dae3-b66d-45b2-bf77-00fd5b8a6753"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar sniffs, irritated.{/n} \"You know how to ask a nasty question... "
"My tribe was breeding children like cattle. They mated with orcs — thought "
"it 'strengthens the blood.' They kept strong kids, and the weaklings were "
"killed or — like me — sold into slavery... Pieces of shit, aren't they? I "
"don't want to think about it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 콧방귀를 뀌고는 짜증을 냅니다.{/n} \"불쾌한 질문을 잘도 하는군... 내 부족은 아이를 가축처럼 키웠다. 그들은 "
"오크와 교미를 시켰어. 혈통을 강화한다는 의미를 생각해봐. 강한 아이는 두고 약한 아이는 죽이거나 나처럼 노예로 팔아버리지... 젠장 "
"맞을 일이지. 나는 떠올리고 싶지 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0144_Text
msgctxt "cf020acf-b4ba-4f3a-9149-ddd988cafd01"
msgid ""
"\"I've had this since I was born. They say my mom was a famous hero among "
"orcs — made mincemeat of her enemies, shot lightning from her hands... Well, "
"at least I have this to thank her for, though the bitch basically sold me "
"like a high-bred pup!\""
msgstr ""
"\"태어났을 때 얻은 능력이다. 우리 어머니는 오크들 사이에서 영웅이라고 하더군. 적들을 으깨버리고 손에서 번개를 쏘았다고 해... 나를 "
"혈통 좋은 강아지 팔듯 팔아버렸지만 최소한 그녀에게 고마워해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0145_Text
msgctxt "8ea7e4f9-a43e-4b6d-829e-332c3da7501a"
msgid ""
"\"They're enchanted, help me control my powers. These were done at the {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League{/g}. I hoped that somewhere on my body there "
"was at least one symbol left by my tribe... No luck. They sold and forgot me."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법이 걸려있어 내 힘을 통제하게 돕는다. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에서 한 거야. 내몸 어딘가 부족이 남긴 "
"징표가 있기를 바랬지만... 그런 행운은 없었다. 그들은 나를 팔아버리고 잊어버렸을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0146_Text
msgctxt "a9c4bba3-6a5b-49fa-898d-e8596860e20e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, teacher... You got no idea how glad I've been to wipe the floor with "
"him!\""
msgstr "\"오. 스승님... 그와 함께 바닥을 닦게 되어 얼마나 기쁜지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0147_Text
msgctxt "58482c92-2324-4b7a-a80f-7c5175f524ae"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia's also sort of my conscience. And now you too. That's fine — I "
"never had one of my own, heh heh heh!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아는 내 양심과도 같은 존재야. 너도 그렇고. 괜찮아 — 나는 여태까지 마음대로 살았으니까. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0148_Text
msgctxt "cf91deae-d989-4521-88bd-3a234c5b5d3c"
msgid ""
"\"By the way, thanks for helping Octavia pull herself together. She's a kind "
"girl. And we had to act with resolution!\""
msgstr "\"그런데 옥타비아를 함께 도와줘서 고맙다. 그녀는 친절한 여자다. 우리가 결단을 내려야 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0149_Text
msgctxt "ca79cf86-b0e9-4632-acc2-93f11f93f135"
msgid ""
"\"Bones are bones. You can't take revenge on them, you can't make peace with "
"them... You can only bury them.\""
msgstr "\"뼈는 뼈다. 그들에게 복수하거나 평화롭게 살 수도 없다... 오직 묻을 수만 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0150_Text
msgctxt "9f262d60-3c71-43bd-bfc0-e1abe22e2fa5"
msgid "\"I don't want to talk about it. Even remembering it is disgusting!\""
msgstr "\"말하고 싶지 않군. 떠올리기만 해도 역겨워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0167_Text
msgctxt "bf150bb1-b1b7-415f-8928-6d87c32aac71"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! Truth be told, it's easier living without it! But when it comes to "
"really important decisions... I realized I'd be better off listening to you "
"two.\""
msgstr "\"하하! 솔직히 말하자면 없어도 잘살았다! 정말 중요한 결정을 내려야 할 때는... 너희 둘의 말을 들어봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0168_Text
msgctxt "accd2f28-04a3-476d-a958-bc87fd35d403"
msgid ""
"\"Kidding, kidding, heh heh! But seriously — everything in its time. "
"Sometimes you need to decide everything and listen to no one, no matter how "
"they try to persuade you. Sometimes it's better to listen to friends you "
"trust. And sometimes the best plan is to make decisions on the fly, just do "
"whatever!\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담이야. 농담. 하하! 사실 전부였어. 가끔 누구의 말도 듣지 않고 스스로 결정해야 하지. 가끔은 믿을 만한 친구의 말을 들어야 "
"하고. 상황에 따라 달라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0169_Text
msgctxt "8e4be073-3d43-49a5-95b8-cfbf48af80e1"
msgid ""
"\"Let him roll! There are lots of monsters in the world. Even if we'd killed "
"him — there's still the whole {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} full of "
"his kind! If not us, someone else will kill him sooner or later. And those "
"losers we pulled out of the fire — no one would help them but us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내버려둬! 세상에 괴물이 깔렸고 그를 죽인다해도 여전히 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 여전해! 우리가 아니더라도 "
"그는 죽게 될 거야. 우리가 아니면 누구도 불에서 구해내지 못했을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0170_Text
msgctxt "2bbd25f2-5d60-413d-b180-9b19a0901fe2"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, forget it. That's the world we live in — people die every day in the "
"hundreds and thousands, and none of it is our business. If it wasn't Janush, "
"someone else would kill those weaklings sooner or later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잊어버려. 우리가 사는 세상이 그렇다. 매일 수천 수백만의 사람이 죽어가. 자누시가 아니더라도 누군가 그들을 조만간 죽여버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0171_Text
msgctxt "c70f03ef-c65d-4238-ac75-b4caa0f39011"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, you're a solid {mf|fellow|girl}! I probably trust myself less than I "
"trust you. That's why you're our leader, heh!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 너는 강한 녀석이야! 나보다 너를 더 믿어. 그래서 네가 대장이 된 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0172_Text
msgctxt "03fce138-21da-46e0-a4db-e1ceb38d7b1d"
msgid ""
"\"Uh-huh. It's difficult to explain to Octavia though. She seems to "
"understand that's the only thing we could have done — but it still torments "
"her. She sees them in her dreams, then cries her eyes out... But she'll get "
"over it sooner or later. She's strong.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠. 옥타비아에게 해명하기 어렵다. 하지만 우리를 이해하게 될 거야. 그래도 그건 그녀에게 고통이었어. 잠을 자면 그들이 나와 울음을 "
"터뜨리는데... 하지만 언젠가 괜찮아질 거야. 그녀는 강하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0173_Text
msgctxt "18d2d2ad-f11b-4651-9f1a-3e8c84a9401a"
msgid ""
"\"Refrain? I didn't even think about him! Too good for him — getting my "
"hands dirty with an old toad's cold blood! What revenge? My brother got "
"revenge for both of us, and I'll never forget it. No matter what god he "
"prayed to when he was alive, I hope my brother's deity did right by him on "
"the other side.\""
msgstr ""
"\"머리라도 식히라고? 나는 생각도 하지 않았는데? 그 늙은 두꺼비를 내 손으로 죽이지 않아 얼마나 다행인지! 복수? 내 형제가 우리를 "
"위해 복수를 해주었어. 나는 잊지 않을 거고 그는 살아남을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0174_Text
msgctxt "d874a5ba-0576-434e-9e34-d7c84f767924"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Have we met? When have I ever been right in the head? You'll see, some "
"new shit'll happen, and we'll be at war again, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 만났었나? 내 머리가 잘못되었나 보군. 두고봐. 언젠가 우리는 전쟁터에서 다시 만날 거다! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0175_Text
msgctxt "7bed4842-daaf-46eb-84a3-79048e81c5a8"
msgid ""
"\"What, on that old geezer? Pff. I forgot about him long ago! Some revenge — "
"like squishing a mite!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 그 늙은 괴짜가? 흥. 그를 잊은 지는 한참 되었어! 복수하는 것은 쉽지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0176_Text
msgctxt "53da075f-f043-4c82-921e-3b757eaafacf"
msgid ""
"\"What, you feel sorry for him? Did you hear what he said? My father gave me "
"to the slavers, and he stood by and nodded, like \"yes, good job\"! Maybe he "
"even gave his own grandchildren to the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}! "
"He was the same as the whole tribe, so he fully deserved my revenge!\""
msgstr ""
"\"미안한 감정이 든다고? 그가 한 말 듣지 못했어? 나의 아버지는 나를 팔아치운 순간에도 멀뚱히 보고만 있었어! 아마 손자도 {g|"
"Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에 팔아버릴 테지! 그는 부족과 다름 없으니 복수 당해도 싸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0177_Text
msgctxt "a6a05790-0b7f-45a1-93fd-90f6dc0d9a4d"
msgid "\"Yes, it's all right. There should be more like you.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 괜찮아. 너 같은 녀석들이 많을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0178_Text
msgctxt "239b9121-fd3e-441c-8afb-58a2e5d9872e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I did... But what kind of revenge is that? On one crazy old fool? My "
"brother got revenge for me, it's true. And I'll never forget it. No matter "
"what god he prayed to when he was alive, I hope my brother's deity did right "
"by him on the other side.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄. 그랬지. 하지만 복수가 뭐 그래? 미쳐버린 노인네에게 복수라니? 내 형제가 복수를 해주었다. 나는 잊지 않을 거고 그는 "
"살아남을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0180_Text
msgctxt "26a04a7b-59d2-44e1-9a3a-187eb85e5bba"
msgid ""
"\"Heh! You're a beast! I mean, I even feel a little sorry for them. But it's "
"their fault — they shouldn't have been such weaklings!\""
msgstr "\"너 피도 눈물도 없군! 나는 최소한 미안한 감정이라도 들었다. 하지만 약한 그들의 잘못이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0181_Text
msgctxt "23830f28-aadd-40f3-951c-ba8e888d73b5"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar winces as if you touched an open wound.{/n} \"Whatever has "
"happened between us, we're still friends.\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 아픈 곳이라도 건드린 듯 찡그립니다.{/n} \"우리 사이에 무슨 일이 있었든 우리는 여전히 친구다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0183_Text
msgctxt "b033290b-b27c-4fb1-9147-f568cd8448fe"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc shakes his head.{/n} \"No. You don't have to apologize for "
"anything. Things haven't been working out between us for a while. I thought "
"it would somehow fix itself, but it just kept getting worse... And then — "
"BAM! — everything fell apart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크가 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아니. 사과할 필요 없다. 그저 일이 잘풀리지 않은 것 뿐이야. 나는 어떻게든 해결할 수 "
"있다고 생각했는데... 그 순간 모든 게 수틀렸지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0184_Text
msgctxt "031250a8-845d-4205-a122-3dbfb496c2ad"
msgid ""
"\"So, don't apologize — just take care of her, that's what's important! And "
"I — well I have a whole city to choose from! I don't ever have to sleep "
"alone, ha ha hmm!\" {n}Regongar smiles a provocative grin.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그러니 사과하지 마. 그녀를 도와줘! 나는 어디든 갈 수 있어! 혼자서 자지 않아도 되고! 하하!\" {n}레곤가르는 도발적인 웃음을 "
"짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0185_Text
msgctxt "c617569d-7902-46e8-a2db-df774682a459"
msgid ""
"\"You know what's strange? We survived slavery, but couldn't handle freedom. "
"Since you freed us, we've both been a little crazy. She started thinking "
"that I'm trying to control her. I didn't understand why she was pushing me "
"away, so I got angry — which made her push me away even more... I'm such an "
"idiot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"재밌는 사실 하나 알려줄까? 우리는 노예를 벗어났지만 자유를 얻지는 못했어. 네가 우리를 풀어준 후로 우리는 다툼이 생겼어. 그녀는 "
"내가 통제를 한다고 생각하고 나를 밀어내려는 그녀를 보고 나는 화가 나지. 그리고 사이는 더 멀어지고... 나는 바보야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0186_Text
msgctxt "9b3b8b84-c2a6-4d5d-b27e-5f30ffb15cec"
msgid "\"So what, that's it then? All right, fine. I understand.\""
msgstr "\"그래서? 그게 다야? 좋아. 알겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0188_Text
msgctxt "1fe0971d-6785-4e8c-82dd-a9cb96c2d8a8"
msgid ""
"\"I bet that delicate flower won't let you do a third of what you and I were "
"up to, eh?\""
msgstr "\"그 섬세한 꽃이 우리가 공들인 3 분의 1을 네가 하도록 내버려 두지는 않을 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0189_Text
msgctxt "b58ee53b-f4fb-4b48-aa93-27bd48f0941c"
msgid ""
"\"Be careful with him, he's a fragile boy. You play with him like you did "
"with me, and he won't live to the morning!\""
msgstr "\"그를 조심해. 그는 연약하니까. 나처럼 대한다면 다음 날에 죽을 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0193_Text
msgctxt "0c16a9f1-a765-45ff-8cfa-6647289a5f46"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to apologize for anything. We were good together, right? I "
"never thought it would be forever.\""
msgstr "\"사과할 필요 없어. 우리는 여전히 동료니까. 그게 영원할 거라고 생각하지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0194_Text
msgctxt "8cf1773e-a83a-43da-8f49-d50d27d83771"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. What would our friendship be worth if a bed could break it?\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 잠자리로 싸우게 된다면 우리 우정이 무슨 소용이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0195_Text
msgctxt "6a399a3d-d8e7-40fa-9bed-50f607a7fca6"
msgid ""
"\"Why wouldn't I? You think I didn't have anybody except you and Octavia? Ha "
"ha hmm… With me you had fun. With {mf|her|him} you might find happiness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 왜? 너와 옥타비아가 나의 전부일 거라 생각해? 하하하. 흠... 나와 있으면 즐기겠지만 그 녀석과 있으면 행복을 찾을 수 있어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0196_Text
msgctxt "cf64481e-e3c3-4ce8-b02b-8dee4c9e9b90"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, there are two people in this world for whom I'd be glad to gnaw "
"everyone else's throats out. You're one of them. That hasn't changed. The "
"rest doesn't matter!\""
msgstr ""
"\"세상에는 두 부류의 사람이 있는데 하나는 죽어도 싼 녀석들이지. 너는 그 부류야. 그 사실은 바뀌지 않을 거야. 나머지 부류는 "
"상관없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0197_Text
msgctxt "da978744-33b2-40cc-9a1c-43fb7ccd6673"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar bares his fangs in a smile.{/n} \"So, chief, when are we leaving?"
"\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 송곳니를 드러내며 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"대장. 언제 떠나지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0198_Text
msgctxt "0dd460ee-ea1e-44f1-9e09-776e9d35ba3b"
msgid ""
"\"There you are! Ready for another quest? Or maybe another trip to the "
"bedroom, ha ha?\""
msgstr "\"왔군! 다른 임무를 떠날 준비가 됐어? 아니면 다른 침실을 찾는 여행인가? 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0199_Text
msgctxt "49330840-43a8-4c54-89bc-e83bb022834c"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar stares at his feet, biting his lip pensively. He looks up and "
"forces a smile.{/n} \"Oh, hello.\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 그의 발을 빤히 쳐다보며 입술을 지긋이 꺠뭅니다. 그난 올려다보며 억지로 웃습니다.{/n} \"오. 안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0200_Text
msgctxt "07113c7a-7ff3-41bd-9828-8eba1da4d249"
msgid "\"Hello... My {Name}.\""
msgstr "\"안녕... 나의 {Name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0202_Text
msgctxt "16753316-c21d-445e-b797-3c0987db4d90"
msgid "{n}Regongar touches your cheek and smiles.{/n} \"Can I say no to you?\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 당신의 뺨을 만지고 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"내가 너한테 아니라고 말해도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0203_Text
msgctxt "bfe0d6f4-ba87-4a42-800a-0d6f5852fb2f"
msgid ""
"{n}Holding each other tightly, you and Regongar leave for your chambers.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신과 레곤가르는 서로를 꽉 껴안고 침실로 향합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0204_Text
msgctxt "74824e0c-a602-41a8-b179-31981bdfa3d1"
msgid "\"Let's call Octavia, hmm-m-m?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아를 부르자. 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0208_Text
msgctxt "ea9176f7-ad2b-4b9d-94a2-0ef69f6994a0"
msgid "\"I'll call her now. I love both of you so much!\""
msgstr "\"지금 그녀를 부를게. 너희 둘을 너무 사랑해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0210_Text
msgctxt "9e9ac7b6-95eb-4c96-a9fa-9b5530b0501e"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar bites his lip.{/n} \"Freedom is for the free... But are you "
"sure? Aren't we good together?\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"자유는 자유를 위한 것이지... 하지만 확신해? 우리 괜찮은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0214_Text_String
msgctxt "155e2217-023f-4ab3-bb39-9debaf8ac1f1"
msgid ""
"\"All right, I get mood swings sometimes too. Such stupid thoughts... I love "
"you too.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나도 때때로 변덕을 느껴. 어리석은 생각이었어... 너를 너무 사랑해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0215_Text
msgctxt "45f3ee00-9b49-4c17-915c-c34022ce10d4"
msgid ""
"\"Well... Fine. Maybe we're actually better as companions than lovers.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄... 좋아. 어쩌면 우리는 연인보다 친구로 남는 게 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0217_Text
msgctxt "5ccec194-c3bb-40a0-a12b-a7474dfac945"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar bites his lip.{/n} \"Are you serious? After everything we've "
"been through?\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"정말이야? 그 고통을 함께 겪고도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0222_Text
msgctxt "db599f6c-cfe5-47ea-93fa-2f4795b5e09b"
msgid ""
"\"Well... So our promises didn't mean much, huh? Fine. Maybe we're actually "
"better off as companions than lovers. I'll tell Octavia.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 우리의 맹세는 그저 말 뿐이었던 거야? 좋아. 어쩌면 우리는 연인보다 친구로 남는 게 좋을 거야. 나는 옥타비아를 부를게."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0224_Text
msgctxt "b08ce965-1171-448e-9b11-22a2cbb94b94"
msgid ""
"\"What? Oh, that? Calistria's holy words! 'I stab thee with my heart.' We "
"say that when we get our vengeance. Those words make it so much sweeter!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 오. 저거? 칼리스트리아의 말이야! '내 심장으로 너를 찌르겠다.' 복수를 할 때 그렇게 말하자. 더 달콤하겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0225_Text
msgctxt "4a33cb98-1e6f-4895-9eb2-aa268c6d7c85"
msgid ""
"\"You didn't hear? Those are our goddess's holy words — what we say when we "
"get our vengeance. 'I stab thee with my heart.' You won't believe how long I "
"wanted to say that to her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"못들었어? 복수를 달성할 때 하는 우리 여신의 말이라고. '내 심장으로 너를 찌르겠다.' 얼마나 그녀에게 말하고 싶었는지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0226_Text
msgctxt "cdb4cc3d-f1eb-489d-83fc-31ac6304db02"
msgid ""
"\"You swear by her too, right? Great. She's the best deity for a ruler. She "
"teaches you the most important things in life: how to have fun... and how to "
"let no one cross you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 그녀를 섬기지? 좋아. 그녀는 삶에서 가장 중요한 것을 가르치지. 인생을 즐기는 방법을 말이야. 그리고 너에게 집적대지 못하게 "
"하는 방법도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Regongar/Cue_0227_Text
msgctxt "2d917aa4-acdb-4820-b55a-0417ae37cf22"
msgid ""
"\"I never thought it would be forever. Anyway, there are two people in this "
"world for whom I'd be glad to gnaw everyone else's throats out. You're one "
"of them. That hasn't changed. The rest doesn't matter!\""
msgstr ""
"\"세상에는 두 부류의 사람이 있는데 하나는 죽어도 싼 녀석들이지. 너도 그 부류야. 그 사실은 바뀌지 않을 거야. 두 번째 부류는 "
"상관없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "700bcb85-c624-49ea-963d-b012f97cb128"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "29b5a77e-8014-482d-af51-303def1b23a7"
msgid "\"What can you tell me of Sarenrae?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이에 대해 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "e5f0a55e-117a-437a-94ca-b77932994a23"
msgid "\"What brought you to these lands?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 곳에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "753e838d-f885-430c-82fa-3cbb919be8c9"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me about this battle you mentioned. What was the act of valor of "
"Sarenrae?\""
msgstr "\"네가 언급한 전투에 대해 말해봐. 서렌레이의 용맹한 행동은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "4216f7e1-8b4e-4a63-bec7-e35ab10e9a75"
msgid "\"What are your duties as a follower of Sarenrae?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 추종자로서의 너의 의무는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "d10a300a-da70-49c9-b0e0-c9955e8c52ea"
msgid "\"Are there any undeserving of mercy?\""
msgstr "\"자비를 받을 자격조차 없는 이들도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e84e191e-91ee-4eb1-8c82-b849e23da6c1"
msgid "Stated that justice is more important than mercy."
msgstr "정의가 자비보다 더 중요하다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a2ed08cb-bd8e-4db7-b1d6-2404751116c3"
msgid "\"I do not agree. There are crimes that cannot go unpunished.\""
msgstr "\"동의하지 않아. 처벌하지 않을 수 없는 범죄들이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e2e58899-4491-460b-bd59-a489061a7d69"
msgid "Stated that good should be forced."
msgstr "선이 우선해야 한다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "7c351b16-4d31-4529-8c24-e8d621baf60b"
msgid ""
"\"There is good in everyone — one just has to look deep enough. Even those "
"who feel lost, or broken — or unrepentant have light in their souls, and "
"it's possible to help them see it.\""
msgstr "\"모든 사람에게 선한 면이 있다. 내면을 들여다 보면 말이다. 악한 사람일지라도 영혼에 빛이 있어서 구원을 받을 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "baef653c-f787-4457-9922-1a6142245011"
msgid "Stated that idea of boundless mercy is tempting yet hard to achieve."
msgstr "무한한 자비는 아직 이루기가 쉽지 않다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "d27f9814-5eb8-46f4-bb45-d3aa21e4ace6"
msgid ""
"\"I like this idea, even though following through with it demands a lot of "
"spiritual strength.\""
msgstr "\"많은 영적 힘이 필요하겠지만 생각은 마음에 든다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "17befa06-0f22-4589-ab04-0c05dfbf809a"
msgid "Stated that boundless mercy is no more than a beautiful theory."
msgstr "무한한 자비는 듣기 좋은 이론일 뿐이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "af073c99-2af5-47c8-ba2e-63ff209f5dfe"
msgid "\"An abstract theory — and little to do with real life.\""
msgstr "\"추상적인 이론일 뿐이야. 현실과는 거리가 멀다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "236f2abb-6e44-49fd-8497-aed2ed9c571f"
msgid "Stated that mercy and forgiveness are dumb."
msgstr "자비와 용서는 바보짓이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "37c5ecce-085a-4288-87f0-d85ae99d02d3"
msgid "\"It sounds stupid and pathetic.\""
msgstr "\"어리석고 애처롭다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "fc0712f8-a894-4991-b99f-36b501279f32"
msgid ""
"\"You make it sound like the followers of Sarenrae will try to find good "
"even in a bandit with a knife to their throat.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 추종자들이 목에 칼이 들어왔을 때 하는 말 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "638777d7-763c-4074-9d2d-2fc1e34c2cf8"
msgid "\"I have heard enough of Sarenrae.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이에 대해서는 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "35cbf1ba-6dfb-4feb-ab3a-1d0cd692fb5d"
msgid "\"What curses are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"저주라니 무슨 소리지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "6fb63e16-962f-4ec1-8a50-c73f7eb52d5f"
msgid "\"Why did Jhod see you in his premonition?\""
msgstr "\"왜 조드가 환영 속에서 너를 보았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "f9a055fa-c9e4-4d2c-b1b4-5f3b986c7c1d"
msgid "\"You've come a great distance, indeed.\""
msgstr "\"정말 먼 길을 왔군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "65b9f449-ba41-4df2-992a-3de4db09796f"
msgid ""
"\"You have spent much time here. What do you think the future holds for "
"these lands?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 많은 시간을 보냈군. 이 땅의 미래가 어떨 것 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "a098dbe5-6e41-4a69-9012-9595c151796f"
msgid "\"Doesn't being outside the temple make you uncomfortable?\""
msgstr "\"신전 밖에 있으면 불편하진 않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "0613465c-64bd-4d83-9749-68c527c6a621"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "6ed8d7c2-6ea9-499a-9a43-dfb1b95c0666"
msgid "\"Do you enjoy traveling?\""
msgstr "\"여행을 좋아하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "449748b0-e932-402b-85ff-ead8e965abc6"
msgid ""
"\"Never before have I met a person so noble in spirit. Sarenrae's blessing "
"was upon me the day you came to my aid.\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 고귀한 영혼을 가진 자를 만난 적이 없다. 네가 나에게 온 날 나는 서렌레이의 축복을 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "20d2e58d-79e2-49bc-ac3d-2a2600fddbc3"
msgid "\"How is Sarenrae worshipped?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 어떻게 숭배하게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "8899164e-fea7-4bcf-9844-abb1054cf526"
msgid "\"Do you know where you're going next?\""
msgstr "\"다음 목적지는 정했는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "eba8bb01-20e5-40fe-8b89-804b8d5eb039"
msgid ""
"\"To the contrary — I hope you will stay with me for as long as you can. The "
"thought of you leaving... is not a welcome one.\""
msgstr "\"그 반대야. 네가 가능하면 나와 함께하면 좋겠다. 떠난다는 얘기는... 그리 반갑지 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "5defc4fa-bdc6-48f0-8593-7bdbb107d650"
msgid "\"I didn't mean to alarm you, that was not my intent.\""
msgstr "\"놀라게 하려는 건 아니었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "2582e90e-69ab-4e72-8e01-ea387732b498"
msgid "\"Of course not! You are my comrade in arms. I trust you completely.\""
msgstr "\"당연히 아니지! 너는 내 동료다. 너를 전적으로 신뢰한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "f17d79ab-9585-4fcb-afa5-06c9e74517fd"
msgid "\"I feel awkward in your presence.\""
msgstr "\"네가 불편하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "76735c88-c4c2-4ef5-9306-e4681d7dac20"
msgid "\"What are the temples of Sarenrae like?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 신전은 어떻게 생겼지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "02bde3f6-b462-4e69-b887-ce15aad532ac"
msgid "\"Tell me of the Everlight Oasis.\""
msgstr "\"에버라이트 오아시스에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "38299db4-1e71-467d-894f-90f8742aff37"
msgid "\"What is the Sunwrought Festival?\""
msgstr "\"태양축일이 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "64780526-3fac-4981-ae9a-5778773928bc"
msgid "\"That is all I wanted to know about this.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 내가 알고 싶은 전부다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0111_Text
msgctxt "d51d042c-4cdc-482d-a910-5fdb4abf7274"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0119_Text
msgctxt "c7ea6058-5295-4c89-9add-b4f097b2eda4"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, but from your manner and appearance you don't strike me as a "
"Keleshite.\""
msgstr "\"실례지만, 넌 켈레쉬인처럼 보이진 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0123_Text
msgctxt "3bbe9e67-b2a4-4d33-b7e4-2414f8cdd90e"
msgid "\"Let's discuss something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0125_Text
msgctxt "56d9e022-ff9e-4af1-a1c5-f3b27570e54c"
msgid "\"You've mentioned Gormuz… What happened to it?\""
msgstr "\"너는 고르무즈에 대해 언급했다... 무슨 일이 일어났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0126_Text
msgctxt "7b0d9a0a-1711-4209-b64b-4592655a6556"
msgid ""
"\"The more I hear, the more it seems your Sarenrae isn't worth a damn.\""
msgstr "\"들을 수록 서렌레이는 가치가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0128_Text
msgctxt "1487293f-8746-46b8-9f95-52d23433a162"
msgid "\"Forgive me, I overreacted. I have nothing against your faith.\""
msgstr "\"용서해. 내가 과민 반응을 했다. 네 믿음을 모욕하려는 건 아니었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0129_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "754639d9-e0ae-4da9-a2fe-fa26e0711171"
msgid "Offended the faith of Sarenrae."
msgstr "서렌레이의 신앙을 모욕합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0129_Text
msgctxt "3bf249d8-3d77-41a2-b84f-14cf25c74570"
msgid ""
"\"Compassion, mercy… all this wailing in the name of good is sickening.\""
msgstr "\"연민과 자비... 이런 것으로 질질 짜는 것은 지긋지긋하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0130_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "04f4c881-3411-46b4-926e-be4bfb286290"
msgid "Remained indifferent to the faith of Sarenrae."
msgstr "서렌레이의 신앙에 무관심하다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0130_Text
msgctxt "ce2de0f6-cb3a-4a48-904d-a2806b6ae8db"
msgid ""
"\"Your religion is foreign to me, Tristian. Perhaps I shouldn't have put it "
"the way I did, but Sarenrae's ways are much different than my own.\""
msgstr "\"네 종교는 나에게 이질적이다. 트리스티안. 그렇게 얘기하지 말았어야 하지만 서렌레이의 길은 나의 길과는 많이 다르다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0131_Text
msgctxt "559f6f6c-92b5-41d2-ad76-c2a77b369882"
msgid "\"Leave. I don't want to ever see you again.\""
msgstr "\"떠나서 돌아오지 마라. 너를 다시는 보고 싶지않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0156_Text
msgctxt "9512fb55-5faa-4bd3-b6c4-fbf6af42cc0b"
msgid "\"I'd like to hear about the history of your faith.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 믿게 되었는지 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0159_Text
msgctxt "6cdb8c03-35e0-404a-9d30-8cafc979826f"
msgid "\"What are the teachings of Sarenrae?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 가르침은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0162_Text
msgctxt "a6f0a306-edf5-49b4-bfb0-9ef353b3f397"
msgid "\"How did Sarenrae come to be?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 어떤 신이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0165_Text
msgctxt "f4e53f97-ae43-46ff-97bf-b7caded61136"
msgid "\"Enough. I want to ask about something else.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 다른 것에 대해 물어보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0167_Text
msgctxt "34cfa9bf-6ab9-4697-9695-2b60d19e86ff"
msgid "\"I'd like to ask about something else.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 것에 대해 묻고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0169_Text
msgctxt "9629e715-589c-45b2-91fd-8e0b933f68ae"
msgid "\"Have wars ever been waged in Sarenrae's name?\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 이름으로 전쟁이 벌어졌나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0176_Text
msgctxt "43250c45-4fa5-40fa-bc26-ff522d90061b"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Pit of Gormuz.\""
msgstr "\"고르무즈의 구덩이에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0181_Text
msgctxt "9261fb09-9af0-4876-8a21-d5123696371c"
msgid "\"I've made my decision. Farewell, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"결정을 내렸다. 잘가라. 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0182_Text
msgctxt "6aadb14e-e4bc-4ab6-88fa-a421e5cbf850"
msgid "\"Fine, you can stay.\""
msgstr "\"좋다. 머물러도 괜찮아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0190_Text
msgctxt "575343b7-9d3f-4b9a-a446-a62b62853f08"
msgid "\"How did you get to Golarion?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 골라리온에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0192_Text
msgctxt "c732f904-17ba-440c-9fd6-b4d38f054cd7"
msgid "\"I've seen your shining wings on several occasions…\""
msgstr "\"여러 번 너의 빛나는 날개를 보았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0193_Text
msgctxt "047dd7da-2b53-4fda-ac7c-8f22d3f1f09c"
msgid "\"Why didn't you tell me who you were right away?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너의 정체를 나에게 말하지 않았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0194_Text
msgctxt "a6ff4d4d-cf6d-4db5-bbce-7790074d9942"
msgid "\"That's enough. Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"충분하다. 주제를 바꾸자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0195_Text
msgctxt "d078faa1-148e-4657-b459-5e9eb1acd0ce"
msgid "\"How do entities like you come into this world?\""
msgstr "\"너와 같은 존재는 어떻게 이 세상에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0197_Text
msgctxt "4be9e861-dce5-46ad-9cb6-c3ab43e2d946"
msgid "\"What did Nyrissa do to make you serve her?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 네가 자신을 섬기게 하기 위해 너에게 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0198_Text
msgctxt "f509c96f-f2ff-4140-814c-ffcba450a283"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know what she's looking for? Why does she make all these plots and "
"schemes?\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 목적을 알고 있나? 왜 그녀가 이 모든 음모와 계획을 만들었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0199_Text
msgctxt "a4e7997a-1ad0-4c0b-8007-c215cb2869ec"
msgid "\"Did you like to travel amongst the worlds?\""
msgstr "\"세계를 여행하는 것이 즐겁나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0200_Text
msgctxt "df46a516-082b-405e-a240-cc21ae8e8039"
msgid "\"Will you be able to restore your eyesight once?\""
msgstr "\"미래에 시력을 회복할 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0201_Text
msgctxt "9fb2e474-a12b-429d-9813-8352a003c672"
msgid "\"Enough about that.\""
msgstr "\"그 정도면 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0202_Text
msgctxt "f26d367b-e8d7-4bec-85d1-87b4d5c3929c"
msgid "\"All this Nyrissa story… How did she capture you?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는... 어떻게 너를 잡게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0218_Text
msgctxt "f9209278-8174-402b-b251-024e56a83227"
msgid "\"Have you ever seen Sarenrae by your own eyes?\""
msgstr "\"너 자신의 눈으로 Sarenrae을 본 적이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0220_Text
msgctxt "aa5fda94-a871-4b8c-ad0f-1aab2c468fb6"
msgid "\"How do you get by without your eyesight?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 시력을 잃어렸지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0226_Text
msgctxt "ffb8db67-d37e-4d88-8663-54ba6306510c"
msgid "\"You mentioned Nyrissa sending a vision to Jhod.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나이리사가 조드에게 환상을 보냈다고 말했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0233_Text
msgctxt "61a5b3fd-e554-41ea-838c-04f266dd1dec"
msgid "\"Are you ready to go to the meeting of the Kingdom of the Cleansed?\""
msgstr "\"정화된 자들의 왕국에 갈 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0234_Text
msgctxt "b25e6ec2-777f-43b2-a285-beea0f5a3d2b"
msgid ""
"\"Have you heard anything about the Kingdom of the Cleansed or the First "
"Faithful?\""
msgstr "\"정화된 자들의 왕국이나 선지자에 대해 들은 것은 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0238_Text
msgctxt "e91db75e-f250-4d8f-8023-73ccd03239e3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you regret your decision? Sarenrae was ready to forgive you...\""
msgstr "\"결정을 후회하지 않나? 서렌레이는 너를 용서할 준비가 되었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0246_Text
msgctxt "5430e845-3227-4c23-8e60-cb5b88ca8ff2"
msgid "\"Don't you regret still being mortal?\""
msgstr "\"여전히 인간이 된 것을 후회하지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0247_Text
msgctxt "aca713db-f17a-4828-b63c-bd6a4a43def0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad you stayed with us. We will need all the help we can get to fight "
"Nyrissa.\""
msgstr "\"네가 우리와 함께 있어 기쁘다. 나이리사와 싸우기 위해 필요한 모든 도움이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0257_Text
msgctxt "39489e86-220a-4d1c-ba16-a4b49bf50006"
msgid "\"We wouldn't have worked out anyway.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 어쨌든 해결하지 못했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0258_Text
msgctxt "40adf1c1-ad5a-4780-b371-8990493cad68"
msgid "\"Are you… you're not upset?\""
msgstr "\"화... 안났어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0259_Text
msgctxt "364a14aa-bfa6-4a86-ba0a-45bb5e38042a"
msgid "\"Thank you.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0263_Text
msgctxt "7beaa7f3-5fe2-4298-9241-0ab53cec4bac"
msgid "\"We need to end our relationship.\""
msgstr "\"우리 관계를 끝내야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0264_Text
msgctxt "f6e56458-033c-42ec-883f-c586d92f1afd"
msgid "\"I want to be alone with you.\""
msgstr "\"둘 만 있고 싶은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0269_Text
msgctxt "d2de5fe4-44d6-4ae9-b79e-1f96e6691f0d"
msgid "\"Don't argue. I don't want to be with you any more.\""
msgstr "\"말다툼은 그만하자. 나는 더 이상 너와 함께하고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0270_Text
msgctxt "f0b90483-421d-4b0c-ae82-12d25358cf46"
msgid "\"Oh. Sorry, slip of the tongue.\""
msgstr "\"오. 미안. 실수였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0275_Text
msgctxt "feda2156-3576-4887-bd0e-a49e69507fd6"
msgid ""
"\"You called yourself the Chosen of Sarenrae. What did you mean by that?\""
msgstr "\"넌 자신을 서렌레이의 사도라고 불렀다. 그게 무슨 뜻이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0277_Text
msgctxt "bb4e3265-74d7-4d1c-882f-715b14d4e7c7"
msgid "\"So, what happened to you calling yourself the Chosen of Sarenrae?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 어째서 스스로를 서렌레이의 사도라고 부르는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "71c9c3ba-08be-4ea8-b7a4-53de0e53da94"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian gives you a friendly nod.{/n} \"How may I help you, {name}?\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 친절하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"도움이 필요하십니까, {name}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "658fa847-5da1-42fc-a9a5-2ba410455931"
msgid ""
"\"About myself? I wouldn't know where to begin.\" {n}Tristian pauses for a "
"moment in thought.{/n} \"You know my name, my faith — I follow "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, and I have traveled from the {g|Kelesh}Padishah "
"Empire of Kelesh{/g} to here… what else do you want to know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 자신에 대해서요? 어디서부터 시작해야 할지 모르겠군요.\" {n}트리스티안은 잠시 생각에 잠깁니다.{/n} \"이미 제 이름과 "
"신앙은 알고 계시지요. 저는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 따르고 {g|Kelesh}켈레쉬의 파디샤 제국{/g}에서 여기까지 "
"왔습니다... 또 무엇을 알고 싶으십니까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "101ce1be-effb-45a1-9159-39343b4a851f"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard rumors — they say these lands are cursed, and the curses are "
"growing stronger… as if something is granting them power. I could not ignore "
"such rumors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅이 저주받았다고, 나날이 저주가 거세지고 있다는 소문을 들었습니다... 마치 무언가에 의해 강해지듯이 말이죠. 그런 소문을 "
"무시할 수가 없었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "97eeac43-5af1-43ff-b27e-121415a1b7de"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} is the goddess of temperance and patience. "
"Solarflame goddess teaches us compassion for the weary and mercy to those "
"who go astray. What would you like to know of her?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서는 절제와 인내의 여신이십니다. 태양빛의 여신께서는 길을 잃은 자들에게 자비를 베풀라고 "
"가르치시지요. 그녀에 대해 무엇을 알고 싶으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0a093778-8382-4d67-bd98-710604583aa0"
msgid ""
"\"My goddess strives to see the best, even in the dark gods — she never "
"abandons the hope of their redemption. The priests of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} follow her teachings — akin to the Healing Light "
"herself, who emanates warmth and heeds the call of those in need, we aid the "
"suffering in body and spirit throughout {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 여신께서는 심지어 악신들에게까지 구원의 희망을 버리지 않으십니다. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 사제들은 그녀의 가르침에 "
"따라 치유를 행합니다. 항상 타인에게 따뜻하게 대하고 도움이 필요한 사람들을마다하지 않죠. {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 전역에 "
"걸쳐 사람들의 육체와 정신의 고통을 치유하려 노력하고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "3c6e84bc-26fc-41fe-8e2a-1e2f9fa4f9b9"
msgid ""
"\"Her greatest moment of glory is her battle against the monstrous "
"{g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g}, who threatened to destroy {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} delivered the strike that staggered the horrendous "
"creature and allowed her allies to shackle it. Once the Rough Beast was "
"captured, the goddess split the earth, and the gods threw the behemoth into "
"the depths. Once it was done, the goddess sealed the pit, and commanded her "
"faithful to stay away from the scar that was left in the land.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 가장 큰 영광의 순간은 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 파괴하려 한 {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}라는 괴물과의 "
"싸움입니다. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서는 그 끔찍한 생물에게 일격을 가했고 괴물이 흔들린 틈을 타 그녀의 아군들이 괴물을 "
"포박했습니다. 괴물이 잡히자, 여신께서는 땅을 갈라 땅 속 싶은 곳으로 던져버리셨습니다. 후에 땅을 다시 메꾸고, 이곳에서 멀리 "
"떨어지라고 명령하셨습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "72bf1409-9521-40e9-85db-1b5b5ce53500"
msgid ""
"\"These are difficult questions you ask, {name}, questions wise men have "
"debated for centuries. Does a being that has been tainted by evil to its "
"very roots, that rejects its own salvation, still deserve compassion? Can "
"those compelled to do evil by others still seek forgiveness? There is no "
"easy answers on these issues among {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} followers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어려운 질문이군요. {name}. 수백년간 많은 현자들이 계속 토론해온 질문입니다. 악에 깊숙히 물들어 구원을 거부하는 존재가 여전히 "
"연민을 받을 자격이 있는가? 다른 사람에게 악행을 강요받은 이는 여전히 용서를 구할 수 있는가? {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 "
"추종자에게 이것은 쉬운 질문이 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "c43236a7-7531-4464-bcb4-2ac1ceeb4da1"
msgid ""
"{n}Suddenly, Tristian's face lights up.{/n} \"However, you've already chosen "
"your side in this eternal debate. Your actions show that any creature, no "
"matter how twisted or how far astray, can be led to enlightenment. It is in "
"your lands that a settlement has sprouted to give shelter to those that used "
"to leave nothing but destruction in their wake!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}갑자기 트리스티안의 얼굴이 밝아집니다.{/n} \"그러나 당신은 이미 이 끝없는 논쟁에서 선택을 하셨나 보군요. 당신의 행동은 "
"아무리 뒤틀리거나 엇나간 생명체라도 깨달음으로 이끌 수 있다는 것을 보여주셨습니다. 당신의 땅은 곧 파괴만을 일삼는 사람들에 대한 "
"피난처가 될 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "5d3fe3bd-ec46-44c9-9a0d-61cb9d51f4f9"
msgid ""
"\"As for me… I believe that every soul carries the potential for goodness "
"within. No matter the crime, the guilty may find forgiveness if they repent "
"and cast off the evil that led to the deed. I believe this with all my "
"heart, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전... 모든 영혼은 내면에 잠재된 선함이 있다고 믿습니다. 어떤 범죄자라도 뉘우치고 진심으로 용서를 구할 수 있다고 진심으로 "
"믿습니다. {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "44013915-0b8f-41b2-90ee-8fde186177f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian gives a perplexed laugh.{/n} \"Well, I wouldn't force anyone "
"against their will… although, if it served a good purpose…\" {n}Tristian "
"falls silent contemplating the issue, but almost immediately he shakes his "
"head.{/n} \"No, I am not ready to make such a decision yet.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 난처한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"글쎄요... 저는 그 누구에게도 강요하지 않을 겁니다. 그게 좋은 목적이라면...\""
" {n}트리스티안은 생각에 잠겨 침묵하지만 곧 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아니. 아직 그런 결정을 내릴 준비가 되지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "5aaa509b-1b52-4b2b-914b-6763f4a63d61"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian folds his arms.{/n} \"What is of greater importance — a living "
"soul or the laws of nations? One's salvation or observance of rules? Know "
"that I hold you in high esteem, but it is difficult for me to agree with you "
"on this issue.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"살아있는 영혼과 국가의 법규 중에 뭐가 더 중요하겠습니까? 사람에 대한 구원과 규칙의 준수 "
"중에 말입니다. 당신을 높이 평가하지만, 이 문제에 대해서는 당신에게 동의하기 힘듭니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "3a482dd1-5e98-4d37-bacb-b2e2a1f7591b"
msgid ""
"\"It does, yet I think you are equal to the task, {name}. No, I am certain "
"of it. And one needn't worship {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} to practice mercy — "
"all are capable of it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇지만 저는 당신이 그 일을 감당할 수 있다고 생각합니다. {name}. 아니. 확신합니다. 자비를 베풀기 위해 꼭 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 숭배할 필요는 없습니다. 누구나 자비를 베풀수 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "530c027c-21d3-4cd3-93b4-85dd33b4d3f9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles faintly.{/n} \"I cannot argue with this, and nevertheless…"
" I'll keep to my opinion.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 이것에 대해서 논쟁 할 수 없지만... 나는 내 의견을 지킬 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "e8eccb8c-33b3-4126-a66f-d09282bc3f4a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's shoulders sag, and he averts his eyes.{/n} \"It is a pity our "
"views are so different. I hope it will not stand in the way of our shared "
"goals.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 어깨가 처지며 시선을 피합니다.{/n} \"견해가 달라 너무나 유감스럽습니다. 그것이 우리의 목표를 방해하지 않기를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b5e26500-f134-4d55-b9d8-50eda2e3c218"
msgid "\"If you ever wish to know more about the goddess, just ask.\""
msgstr "\"여신에 대해 더 많이 알고 싶다면 물어보십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "7f1d471e-eda6-4048-8d0a-18195472a359"
msgid ""
"\"Do not mistake compassion for weakness, {name}. One hand of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} is shrouded in healing light — the other holds a "
"scimitar. Following their goddess, the priests learn to wield this weapon "
"starting in childhood — and they do not hesitate to use it if a dispute "
"cannot be settled peacefully.\""
msgstr ""
"\"연민을 약점으로 오해하지 마십시오, {name}. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 한 손은 치유의 빛으로 빛나고 다른 손에는 "
"시미터가 들려있습니다. 이것을 따라 여신의 추종자들은 어렸을 때부터 시미터를 다루는 법을 배웁니다. 그리고 분쟁이 평화롭게 해결될 수 "
"없다면 주저하지 않고 칼을 휘두르지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "6f6e197d-b39f-4292-b61c-e1eb0cc3ae6a"
msgid ""
"\"The priests of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} are willing to help anyone, no "
"matter the faith of the one in need. Each plea must be heard. Every "
"misfortune deserves compassion — be it a peasant seeking a blessing for the "
"harvest, or a murderer seeking repentance the night before their execution.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 사제들은 다른 신앙을 가진 자들도 기꺼이 돕습니다. 간청의 목소리에 귀기울이고 불행은 연민하는 "
"것이 우리의 의무입니다. 추수를 위해 축복을 구하는 농민부터, 처형당하기 전날 밤 회개하려는 살인자까지 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "5c04414c-f684-4e9f-a13f-7e2214b0a0fd"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes the mercy of {g|Sarenrae}solarflame goddess{/g} is the last "
"thing that can save one's soul from ruin. We have no right to withhold it "
"from the truly repentant.\""
msgstr ""
"\"때때로 {g|Sarenrae}태양빛의 여신{/g}의 자비는 우리의 영혼을 파멸에서 구할 마지막 길입니다. 우리는 진심으로 회개하는 "
"자를 막을 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "3e60ee7d-cf33-4ebf-b650-72dcf0754cc7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian falls silent for a few moments.{/n} \"Alas, mortal beings are "
"imperfect. Not even the most faithful among us can always follow their "
"deity's commandments, even when such commandments are meant to save the "
"world and their followers. I, for one, pray the goddess is never again as "
"furious as she was with {g|Gormuz}Gormuz{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"아아, 인간의 존재는 불완전합니다. 가장 독실한 신자도 항상 신의 계명을 따를 순 없는 "
"법입니다. 다시는 여신께서 {g|Gormuz}고르무즈{/g}에 오셨을 때처럼 진노하지 않으시기를 기도합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "bd2ca3a8-7a87-41eb-93ae-2645f2b644dd"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} preaches mercy. Yet her compassion is not "
"infinite. We give a second chance to all who ask. But if they reject it, if "
"they persist in their sins, they will face the goddess's retribution.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}는 자비를 가르치십니다. 그러나 그녀의 연민은 무한하지 않지요. 여신께서는 모든 사람에게 두 번째 "
"기회를 주시지만, 만일 누군가 그것을 거절하고 죄를 고집한다면, 그들은 여신의 징벌을 받게 될 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "dd6b3f6b-6ec5-4b79-a23b-b47b223556e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian cocks his head to the side in wonder.{/n} \"Do you not see? "
"Every word uttered in the heat of an argument turns into a prophecy here, "
"just waiting to fulfill itself. And if it were only for the people — the "
"land itself is seething with curses so ancient their origins are impossible "
"to trace!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스탄은 놀람에 가득차 고개를 옆으로 기울이며 말합니다.{/n} \"안 보이십니까? 논쟁의 열기 속에서 내뱉은 한 마디 한 마디가 "
"예언이 되어 이루어지려 하고 있습니다. 그리고 사람만을 겨냥하듯, 대지가 그 근원을 추적할 수조차 없는 고대의 저주로 소용돌이치고 "
"있습니다!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "0d080f95-1145-4138-bf69-6be204f1b0b3"
msgid ""
"\"Take the abandoned temple of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} where we met. What "
"happened to it? What force compelled the priests to leave such a magnificent "
"temple behind to the whims of nature? Will we ever know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 만났던 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 버려진 신전을 생각해 보십시오. 거기서 무슨 일이 일어났을까요? 우리가 그 비밀을 "
"알 수 있을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "91205a8a-d294-4fe5-9b67-639a1c71717c"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} sees all the good gods and goddesses as her "
"allies. Many have fought alongside the goddess against the menace of "
"{g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g}, {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} among them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서는 모든 신들을 동료로 생각하십니다. 많은 신들이 여신과 함께 "
"{g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}와 맞서 싸웠고 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서도 그중의 하나셨지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "6580126d-dec5-4885-bf71-c6781992530e"
msgid ""
"\"By offering my prayer to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, I let her know of my "
"misfortune in the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g}. The merciful "
"goddess did not ignore my plea — but whom could have she asked for aid than "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, whose faith is strong in these lands?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께 기도를 드려 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}에서 일어난 불행한 일을 "
"알렸습니다. 여신께서는 제 간청에 응답하셨지요. 그리고 서렌레이께서 도움을 주실 때, 이 땅에서 믿는 자가 가장 많은 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}말고 누구에게 도움을 요청하겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "9fee62bf-804d-466c-986c-4bc6e66385a9"
msgid ""
"\"I myself was nearly slain by beasts. Fortunately, you came along, "
"following Jhod, and saved me. I owe you a great debt.\""
msgstr "\"저는 짐승에게 죽을 뻔 했습니다. 다행히도 조드의 환영이 당신을 제게 이끄셨지요. 큰 빚을 졌습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "31a0c192-9a2b-4b4d-b780-f3618b76ced3"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs heartily.{/n} \"When you look at it that way, then yes! "
"But please, do not think that I came all the way from {g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g} "
"because of mere curiosity. I was wandering long before that. It is a custom "
"of our faith — the farther our paths take us, the more people we may help.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 진심으로 웃습니다.{/n} \"그런 식으로 보신다면, 그렇지요! 하지만 제가 단지 이 호기심 때문에 "
"{g|Kelesh}켈레쉬{/g}에서 여기까지 왔다고 생각하지 마십시오. 저는 훨씬 전부터 방랑 중이었습니다. 제 신앙의 의무이지요. 제 "
"여정이 멀고 길수록, 많은 사람들을 도울 수 있으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "4f134527-6995-4698-b93c-7dd93f37ee28"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} had sent Jhod a sign, and you came just in time to "
"rescue me.\" {n}Tristian sighs.{/n} \"To tell the truth, I was certain my "
"journey was at an end, and those creatures were to be the death of me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 조드에게 계시를 보냈고 당신은 마침 저를 구하러 와주셨습니다. \" {n}트리스티안이 한숨을 "
"쉽니다.{/n} \"솔직히 전 제 여정이 여기까지라고 체념하고 있었고, 그 생명체들에게 죽음을 맞이할 거라고 생각하고 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "93e10003-388c-4e6e-9cac-31db377057ca"
msgid ""
"\"These are cruel lands. As I came here, I bore witness to much pain and "
"suffering, but I have seen equal kindness among those seeking to protect "
"themselves and their loved ones. The people of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} are resolute and true to themselves — I admire their strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 잔인한 땅입니다. 여기 왔을 때 많은 고통을 봐왔지만 동시에 사랑하는 사람들을 지키려는 친절함도 보았지요. {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 사람들은 단호하고 스스로에게 진실합니다. 저는 그들의 그런 면모를 존경합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "c3a69695-c404-414a-98e9-92b3cbff5a0f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"There are many ways to honor one's gods, "
"{name}. It is true shrines play a role in the lives of many of the faithful, "
"but even more find other ways to serve {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"신을 섬기는 방법은 여러가지가 있습니다, {name}. 신전은 많은 신자들에게 중요한 "
"역할을 하는 곳이지만, {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 섬기는 방법은 다양합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "d939d092-e2e3-4dff-b5af-042b3565b3ec"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}The Healing Light{/g} values good deeds above all else. I "
"cannot stand by and watch evil claim others.\"\n"
"{n}Tristian thinks for a moment, then raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"Perhaps that "
"is another reason why I chose to go on my pilgrimage, leaving behind the "
"temples of {g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}치유의 빛{/g}은 무엇보다도 선행을 중시합니다. 저는 악이 사람들을 물들이는 것을 보고만 있을 수 없습니다.\""
" \n"
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 생각하고 나서 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"아마도 그것이 {g|Kelesh}켈레쉬{/g}의 사원을 떠나 "
"순례길에 나선 또 다른 이유일 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "b8c58700-11f2-49ab-8b69-fe2cb5a04ee7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian touches his chest.{/n} \"My faith is in my heart and in my "
"hands. Millions honor {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} in her temples, and my soul "
"is filled with joy when I think of their devotion to the goddess. "
"Nevertheless, my path is a different one.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 가슴에 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"제 믿음은 제 마음과 행동에 달렸습니다. 수백만 명이 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 섬기고 계시고, 그들의 헌신을 떠올리면 제 영혼은 기쁨으로 충만해집니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 제 "
"방식은 다릅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "d4fde48c-2926-4991-9338-1a7974daa3bc"
msgid "\"What would you like to discuss?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 논하고 싶으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "50f40f36-9289-4891-a6a4-aee2d8ef198b"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest frowns and shakes his head.{/n}\n"
"\"I cannot, {name}. If my presence troubles you, so be it — I shall "
"surrender my place in your party to another. But I insist on staying and "
"continuing my research with Jhod. Something wicked is stirring in these "
"lands, and it is my duty to find out what it is.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사제는 얼굴을 찡그리고는 머리를 가로젓습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"할 수 없습니다, {name}. 제 존재가 당신에게 방해가 된다면, 일행 중 다른 이에게 제 자리를 양보하겠습니다. 하지만 저는 계속 "
"조드와 함께 연구를 계속하고 싶습니다. 사악한 힘이 이 땅을 혼란스럽게 하니 그 정체를 밝혀내는 것이 제 의무이니까 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "99099a2f-9eb2-419b-b2f6-727141001261"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods, his eyes light up.{/n} \"Oh, yes! No library and no "
"archive, however large, would have ever allowed me to learn as much of the "
"world as I have in my journeys! It was only outside the temple walls I "
"realized every living being is a world unto themselves, a world where many "
"contradictions and passions coexist!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 끄덕이고 그의 눈은 빛납니다.{/n} \"당연하지요! 도서관이나 기록 보관소에서는 제가 여행 중에 배운 것을 얻을 수 "
"없지요! 아무리 큰 곳일지라도 제가 여행을 다니면서 배운 지식들은 배울 수 없을 것입니다. 사원의 밖에서 전 모든 살아있는 존재들이 "
"자신만의 세계를 가지고 있으며, 많은 모순과 열정이 공존하는 세계가 있다는 것을 깨달았습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "37d998e6-80de-48fb-89a4-0bde0b009757"
msgid ""
"\"Each realm leaves its mark on the lives that live there. Only by visiting "
"it, by breathing the same air, walking on the same soil, can you understand "
"its people — what drives them, what frightens them, their dreams, and how "
"they honor their gods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"각 영역은 그곳에 살고 있는 생명체에 표식을 남깁니다. 그곳을 방문해서 숨쉬고 그곳의 토양을 밟아야만 그곳의 사람들이 추구하는 것과 "
"두려워하는 것, 꿈, 신을 숭배하는 방식을 알 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "6d4d8a0a-90a1-4bc2-b9e1-36b5ff41f946"
msgid ""
"\"No, my thoughts were far from it, for my mission here is not yet done.\" "
"{n}Tristian stares at you in surprise.{/n} \"Why do you ask? Do you wish me "
"to leave your lands?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아뇨, 전혀 그런 생각 해본 적 없습니다. 제 임무는 아직 끝나지 않았으니까요.\" {n}트리스티안이 당신을 놀란 눈으로 "
"쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"왜 그런걸 물으시는 겁니까? 제가 떠나길 바라시나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "df027b47-f14d-4303-8dfa-f9c3cf1fc5fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's face lights up.{/n} \"Thank you. I am pleased I could be of "
"assistance.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안의 얼굴이 밝아집니다.{/n} \"감사합니다. 제가 도움이 될 수 있어서 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "dd651a60-8317-47f5-9a4b-682436bc084b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian takes a step back.{/n} \"But why? What have I done to earn your "
"mistrust?\" {n}He stops, then nods, as if ashamed.{/n} \"Do not answer. "
"Whatever I have done — forgive me, I can only hope that I work harder on "
"your behalf and prove myself an ally.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 한 걸음 물러납니다.{/n} \"하지만 이유가 뭐죠? 저를 불신하게 된 이유가 있습니까?\" {n}그는 멈추고는 "
"부끄러운 듯 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"대답하지 않으셔도 됩니다. 제가 무엇을 했든지 간에 용서해주십시오. 저는 오직 더 열심히 일해서 다시 "
"저를 믿어주시기만을 바랄 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "050015c6-ae66-4955-939a-29c83091d4e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head reproachfully, but with a smile.{/n} \"You enjoy "
"watching others' reactions, don't you? In this regard, we are alike, "
"although I do not choose such sly ways to achieve this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 책망하듯이 고개를 가로젓지만 미소를 짓고 있습니다.{/n} \"다른 사람의 반응을 보는 것을 즐기시는 군요, 그렇죠? "
"비록 저는 이런 교활한 방법을 취하지는 않지만, 우리는 꽤 비슷한 점이 있는 듯 하군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "40138469-568e-45d0-b289-df39e915b923"
msgid ""
"\"Many worship solarflame goddess in her temples. Some make the pilgrimage "
"to the {g|The Everlight Oasis}Everlight Oasis{/g}. But even those who do not "
"serve the goddess directly rarely shun the festivities dedicated to her — "
"the Sunwrought Festival, for one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 사람들이 사원에서 태양 빛의 여신을 섬깁니다. 일부는 {g|The Everlight Oasis}에버라이트 오아시스{/g}로 "
"순례를 떠나기도 하지요. 하지만 여신을 믿지 않는 자들도 태양축일에는 많이들 참여하십니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "a3b44745-c9fb-40bb-a81e-f70977ebd7fc"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} shrines are often open to the sky and to the "
"goddess' life-bringing sunlight. Her light fills the temple, enshrouds the "
"parish in warmth, and grants its blessing to all in need. In "
"{g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g}, crowds gather during the services so that all may feel "
"the blessing of the goddess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 성소는 대개 생명의 빛을 받기 위해 천장이 열려있습니다. 그녀의 빛이 사원을 채우면 따스함으로 "
"교구를 감싸고 도움이 필요한 모든 이들에게 축복을 주시지요. {g|Kelesh}켈레쉬{/g}에서는, 모든 사람들이 여신의 축복을 받기 "
"위해 예배에 사람들이 몰려듭니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "8e953e6c-0e05-441a-be3d-a95b5830a556"
msgid ""
"\"I have never been there, but the stories say it is a wondrous place, "
"sacred to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} faithful. The Oasis is located in "
"{g|Zelshabbar}Zelshabbar{/g}, which lies in {g|Casmaron}Casmaron{/g}. "
"Pilgrims from throughout {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} travel there, seeking the "
"goddess's blessing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 가본 적이 없지만, 듣기로는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 믿음이 담긴 경이로운 장소라고 합니다. 그 오아시스는 "
"{g|Casmaron}카스마론{/g}의 {g|Zelshabbar}젤샤바르{/g}에 있다고 합니다. {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} "
"전역의 순례자들이 여신의 축복을 받기 위해 그곳으로 향한다고 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "2df65dd7-315b-4e47-bc36-d31d4f94bff4"
msgid ""
"\"The most ingenious devices are constructed by some of the faithful to "
"please the goddess. I have seen a temple of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} which "
"housed a complicated array of mirrors — all to direct the light of the sun "
"to the altar!\""
msgstr ""
"\"독실한 신자들은 여신을 기쁘게 하기 위해 독창적인 장치를 만들기도 합니다. 저는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 신전에서 여러 "
"거울을 복잡하게 배치해 제단으로 빛이 반사되어 비치는 모습을 보았습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0107_Text
msgctxt "f6f19f53-d782-4dc9-8317-e0af2ee0a527"
msgid ""
"\"According to legend, the waters of the {g|The Everlight Oasis}Everlight "
"Oasis{/g} are imbued with healing properties, and anyone who bathes in them "
"shall be cured of any ailment.\" {n}Tristian smiles in thought.{/n} \"Just "
"imagine — a place where people from all around the world come to gather to "
"worship. What stories they must share!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전설에 따르면 {g|The Everlight Oasis}에버라이트 오아시스{/g}의 물은 치유의 힘이 깃들어 있으며, 그곳에서 몸을 "
"씻는 자는 모든 병이 낫는다고 하더군요.\" {n}트리스티안이 생각에 잠겨 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"세계의 모든 사람들이 그곳에 모여 "
"숭배하는 모습을 상상해보십시오. 그들이 무슨 이야기를 나눌지 궁금하군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0108_Text
msgctxt "d1d30dd1-095c-46e9-ae40-d414e7c43461"
msgid ""
"\"The Sunwrought Festival takes place on the day of the summer solstice, "
"when the prayers of her flock can reach {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} the "
"easiest. On this day, {g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g} blooms with color — in each "
"corner of the {g|Kelesh}Padishah Empire{/g}, the people praise their goddess "
"by dancing and singing, setting off fireworks and flying kites! I hope, this "
"beautiful custom shall one day reach your lands as well, {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"태양축일은 신도들이 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 가장 가까이 느낄 수 있는 여름이 한창일 때 열립니다. "
"{g|Kelesh}켈레쉬{/g}와 {g|Kelesh}파디샤 제국{/g}의 곳곳이 다양한 색으로 물들고, 사람들은 춤과 노래로 여신을 "
"찬양하고 불꽃놀이를 하고 연을 날립니다! 언젠가 이 아름다운 축제가 당신의 땅에서도 열리기를 바랍니다, {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "6f701191-27d2-46f1-8d47-6ff278d62290"
msgid "\"I hope I have satisfied your curiosity.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 호기심이 풀렸으면 좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0112_Text
msgctxt "00cb54ae-28d1-44d3-8a15-789250fa76f0"
msgid "{n}Tristian bows his head.{/n} \"A pleasure.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"즐거웠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0114_Text
msgctxt "fb6948f1-b9f2-4dfa-8dbc-9449366b4dec"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs.{/n} \"Alas, yes. Terrible battles were once fought "
"between the followers of {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}, {g|Norgorber}Norgorber{/g}, "
"and {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} in the lands now known as "
"{g|Rahadoum}Rahadoum{/g}. To my shame, I must admit that this conflict was "
"started by my brothers and sisters — they came to a foreign land to make way "
"for the goddess's light with sword and fire.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"아아, 맞습니다. 지금 {g|Rahadoum}라하둠{/g}이 있는 땅에서 "
"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}와 {g|Norgorber}노르고버{/g}의 추종자와 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g} 추종자들 "
"사이에서 끔찍한 싸움이 벌어지기도 했습니다. 부끄러운 일이지만, 이 갈등은 제 형제 자매들에 의해 시작되었다는 것을 인정해야만 합니다. "
"그들은 칼과 불로서 여신의 가르침을 강요하고자 이국땅을 침략했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0116_Text
msgctxt "e85cf965-18bc-4237-a3da-45bfbb5927d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs.{/n} \"An error of faith. Perhaps a lesson. But it speaks "
"of the danger when one listens to mortal words and one stops listening to "
"their faith.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"신앙의 오점입니다. 아마 교훈일 수도 있고요. 믿음에 귀 기울이지 않고 인간의 말에 귀 "
"기울였을 때 벌어지는 위험을 가르쳐 주었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0117_Text
msgctxt "06822fd8-3062-4251-a1a2-734a377bbf3d"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae forbade her followers from coming near the place of "
"{g|Rovagug}Rovagug's{/g} imprisonment. But some of her priesthood misread "
"her will and began to preach of a sacred place, where the mightiest of "
"temples dedicated to the goddess were to be constructed. The people listened "
"to these sermons and went forth to the lands touched by "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} scimitar. On the scar that sealed the well, they "
"founded {g|Gormuz}Gormuz{/g}, a holy city that was to become the greatest "
"monument to Sarenrae. Unsurprisingly, after the city was built, faithful "
"from all {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} traveled there to worship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이께서는 {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}의 감옥에 가까이 가는 것을 금하셨습니다. 하지만 몇몇 사제들이 가장 큰 사원이 "
"지어져야 한다며 그녀의 말씀을 왜곡하기 시작했지요. 그 말을 들은 사람들은 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 시미터 자국이 난 "
"곳으로 떠났습니다. 괴물이 봉인된 그 땅의 흉터 위에 그들은 서렌레이의 가장 위대한 기념물이 될 {g|Gormuz}고르무즈{/g}를 "
"세웠고, 놀랄것도 없이 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 곳곳에 있는 모든 신자들이 예배를 드리기 위해 그곳으로 향했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0118_Text
msgctxt "935264ef-c7be-4178-a7ce-0660d4368eab"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} sent omens and visions, urging her followers to "
"leave this dangerous place filled with the dark will of the shackled "
"{g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g}. But in their pride, the people misinterpreted or "
"ignored her signs altogether, for they had already come under Rovagug's "
"influence. Finally, the goddess sent her herald to the city, but the "
"fanatics killed him.\"\n"
"\"Realizing the people had turned from her, the enraged goddess smote "
"{g|Gormuz}Gormuz{/g}, razing it from the face of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} "
"with a single strike of her scimitar.\" {n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} "
"\"Today, it is called {g|Pit of Gormuz}the Pit of Gormuz{/g}, a well of pain "
"and suffering.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서는 징조와 환영을 보내시어 추종자들에게 {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}가 봉인된 그 더러운 "
"곳을 떠나라고 하셨습니다. 하지만 로바거그의 악에 물들어 거만해진 사람들은 그녀의 신호를 오해하거나 아예 무시했지요. 결국 여신은 전령을 "
"보냈지만 광신도들이 그를 죽여버렸습니다.\"\n"
"\"사람들이 자신을 져버렸다는 것을 깨달은 여신은 격분하셨고 {g|Gormuz}고르무즈{/g}를 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 "
"땅 위에 하나도 남김없이 파괴하셨습니다.\" {n}트리스티안이 머리를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"오늘날 그곳을 {g|Pit of "
"Gormuz}고르무즈의 구덩이{/g}, 고통과 고난의 우물이라고 부릅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0120_Text
msgctxt "bf82bd26-66f7-432f-9e9b-86eb740caed8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles softly.{/n} \"You have nothing to apologize for. Truly, I "
"have received my name and appearance from my parents, who had come to "
"{g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g} from afar. I never knew them, for the fate had "
"separated us when I was young. So I grew up in Kelesh, raised by the "
"followers of Sarenrae.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"사과할 필요는 없으십니다. 확실히, {g|Kelesh}켈레쉬{/g}에서 아주 먼 곳 "
"출신인 부모님께 이름과 육신을 받았습니다. 그 운명은 제가 어렸을 때 저와 부모님을 갈라 놓았기 때문에, 그분들에 대해서는 아무것도 "
"모릅니다. 그렇게 저는 켈레쉬에서 자랐고 서렌레이의 추종자가 되었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0121_Text
msgctxt "274339ca-6613-417c-a2c3-7effad03ccac"
msgid ""
"\"My home is where my heart is — within the temples of the great goddess, "
"among the wise and generous men that took upon themselves the care of a "
"child that was so unlike them. I learned mercy and patience at an early age —"
" and it is these virtues that have made me the man I am today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 고향은 위대한 여신의 신전에서 자신들과 전혀 다른 민족의 아이까지도 보살펴 주셨던 현명하고 너그러우신 어른들이 계시는, 제 마음이 "
"머무르는 곳입니다. 저는 어릴 때부터 자비와 인내심을 배웠고, 이러한 덕목들이 지금의 저를 있게 해주었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0124_Text
msgctxt "bea8c74f-e2d7-4661-b0ba-88e5d6642f89"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"Forgive me if my stories have bored you. "
"I am not accustomed to speaking about myself and, in truth, take little "
"enjoyment in it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"지루했다면 용서하십시오. 저는 제 자신에 대해 얘기하는 것이 익숙하지도 않고, 사실 별로 "
"즐기지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0127_Text
msgctxt "62f287f5-3b0e-4341-9a14-2bbdc22799a7"
msgid ""
"\"Truly? The goddess does not demand of you, nor anyone — she only seeks to "
"help. Why do you dismiss her?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말이십니까? 여신께서는 당신은 물론 그 누구에게도 아무것도 요구하지 않으시고, 오로지 도움 주는 것 만을 바라십니다. 왜 그녀를 "
"저버리시는지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0132_Text
msgctxt "ed8a5958-968a-4e0b-9f21-3c152b18b50b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs with relief.{/n} \"We are all different. One needn't share "
"the other's faith to be a loyal ally.\" {n}He nods and gives a warm "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"저희 모두는 서로 다릅니다. 꼭 충성스러운 동료가 되기 위해 신앙을 공유해야 할 "
"필요는 없지요.\" {n}그는 끄덕이고 따뜻한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0133_Text
msgctxt "8e2c7ab5-8252-48da-b292-1a00ae7e9cfa"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's voice drops, almost to a monotone.{/n} \"We are all different. "
"Allies needn't share the other's faith.\" {n}He nods once, the turns "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 목소리는 단조로워집니다.{/n} \"우리 모두는 서로 다릅니다. 동료는 굳이 믿음을 공유할 필요가 없지요.\" {n}"
"그는 한번 끄덕이고는 돌아서 버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0134_Text
msgctxt "7763aa6a-56f4-4e8c-99f5-8fb7206d26d9"
msgid ""
"\"We are all different. Allies needn't share faith, as long as they stand "
"together.\" {n}He nods again, quickly, and gives a faint smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리 모두는 서로 다릅니다. 의견이 일치하는 한, 동료는 꼭 신앙이 같을 필요는 없습니다.\" {n}그는 다시 한번 끄덕이고 희미한 "
"웃음을 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0142_Text
msgctxt "3c856161-9c02-419a-89f2-dafeca83dbfe"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian blindly gazes past you into the distance for several moments. "
"When he speaks again, his voice is quiet, reflective, as if echoing his "
"thoughts.{/n} \"Undeserving of mercy... would even {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} "
"herself find the compassion to...\"\n"
"{n}Tristian shudders, as if awakening from a trance.{/n} \"Forgive me, I... "
"your words — they are not easy ones to reconcile, and even priests such as "
"I... we debate them to this day. What is the point at which a soul is "
"irredeemable — or is it a failing of the priest themselves?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 순간 당신 너머의 허공을 응시합니다. 그가 다시 입을 열자 그의 목소리는 그의 생각을 반영하듯 조용합니다.{/n} "
"\"자비를 받을 자격조차 없는 이들... {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서 불쌍히 여기시기를... \"\n"
"{n}트리스티안은 무아지경에서 되돌아오듯 떱니다.{/n} \"용서하십시오... 당신의 말은 받아들이기가 쉽지 않습니다. 저 같은 "
"사제들도... 오늘날까지 논쟁하는 것들입니다. 영혼을 구제할 수 없는 지점은 어디부터인지... 아니면 그냥 저희 사제들의 결함일까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0143_Text
msgctxt "7cb05e33-0a2d-441b-ae85-ccc971c264d4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian falls silent and looks around himself worriedly, as if he can't "
"believe what he had just said.{/n} \"Forgive me for my rash words. But this "
"mission is important to me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 침묵하며 자신의 말을 믿지 못하겠다는 듯 주위를 걱정스럽게 돌아봅니다. {/n} \"제 무례함을 용서하십시오. 하지만 "
"이 임무는 제게 너무도 중요합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0157_Text
msgctxt "095c3e46-1189-40bd-be8f-b3ddbf5be69e"
msgid ""
"\"There is much to tell — but I'm afraid I would miss the mark, and I fear I "
"would bore you. Is there something specific you wished to know?\""
msgstr "\"해드릴 말은 많지만, 당신을 지루하게 만들지도 모르겠군요. 특별히 알고 싶은 것이 있으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0160_Text
msgctxt "df0d0562-605c-4987-b045-8fdbd2dadbfb"
msgid ""
"\"Solarflame goddess is the light of salvation — even to those who have been "
"forsaken by the other gods. She teaches us mercy and forgiveness — for as "
"long as they may be useful to a soul's salvation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"태양빛의 여신께서는 다른 신들에 의해 버림받은 사람들에게 구원의 빛이십니다. 그녀는 영혼의 구원에 도움이 되는 한 우리에게 자비와 "
"용서를 가르치십니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0163_Text
msgctxt "05405c09-fad9-4d2a-ac26-f391547181ec"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} is one of {g|Golarion}Golarion's{/g} eldest "
"deities. Once, she was an angel that had gathered the armies of her "
"celestial allies behind her. The battle in which she showed her valor "
"decided the fate of a whole world — and, in her victory, she was rewarded "
"with divinity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 가장 오래된 신 중 하나입니다. 한때 그녀는 뒤에는 "
"천상의 연합군을 이끄는 천사셨지요. 그녀는 전투에서 용맹을 발휘하여 세계의 운명을 결정지었고, 그 승리에 신성으로 보답받았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0164_Text
msgctxt "f17d9a2e-344d-42a0-ad61-645698bcc42e"
msgid ""
"\"In the sacred texts, {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} is shown as a beautiful "
"bronze-skinned maiden, her hair dancing flame.\" {n}Tristian smiles "
"slightly.{/n} \"But her appearance is not what matters, it is the grace she "
"brings with her touch — healing and salvation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"경전에서 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서는 아름다운 청동피부의 처녀로 나타나 있는데, 그녀의 머리카락은 춤추는 불꽃으로 "
"되어있다고 합니다\" {n}트리스티안은 조금 웃습니다.{/n} \"그러나 외모보다 중요한 것은, 그녀의 손길과 함께 오는 은총입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0166_Text
msgctxt "2a9ccd57-20b8-4791-96fc-2d3b0728fe90"
msgid "\"Of course, {name}.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0168_Text
msgctxt "335d3f9b-cead-49fd-924b-6fde6cf8b6a5"
msgid "\"Of course. What else would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠. 또 알고 싶은 게 무엇입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0170_Text
msgctxt "b2ba774a-6a13-40e3-be24-ae2ecc5f7b69"
msgid ""
"\"That calamity became known as the Oath Wars — a catastrophe that led the "
"inheritors of {g|Rahadoum}Rahadoum{/g} to deny all gods, banning all faiths "
"from their lands. Alas, the mortal vessel is imperfect, and even a pure "
"faith may be distorted by blind ambition...\" {n}Tristian goes silent for a "
"moment.{/n} \"And great suffering may occur in its name.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 재앙은 맹세 전쟁이라고 알려져 있습니다. 그 재앙은 {g|Rahadoum}라하둠{/g}의 후계자들이 모든 신들을 부정하고 모든 "
"신앙을 그들의 땅에서 배척하면서 일어났습니다. 아아, 인간은 불완전해서 순수한 믿음조차도 눈 먼 야망에 왜곡될 수 있다니...\" {n}"
"트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"큰 고통이 뒤따를 수도 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0171_Text
msgctxt "399a6f1a-ea46-4ed8-938d-be90a75c4b39"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, I do not know yet what powers the curses that flourish in this land. "
"But I swear I will not leave until we have the answer and the means to "
"cleanse them. You must forgive me for not swearing on "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} name, but as of late I have troubled the goddess "
"too much as it is — and it would better serve her through action, not prayer."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 아직 이 땅에서 증식하는 저주의 힘이 무엇인지는 모르겠습니다. 하지만 우리가 그것을 깨끗이 정화할 수 있는 해답을 찾을 때 "
"까지 떠나지 않을 것을 맹세합니다. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 이름을 걸고 맹세를 하지 않는 것을 용서하십시오. 최근 들어 "
"그분께 너무 많은 심려를 끼치는 듯하여 이 문제는 기도가 아닌 행동을 통해 해결하는 것이 그녀를 섬기는 데에도 좋은 것일 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0172_Text
msgctxt "fb4d877c-3f43-4d89-821c-21e8e6b7c3c9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles awkwardly.{/n} \"You speak as if sharing your heart's "
"affection. If… if I am dear to you as a comrade in arms, then I too value "
"our friendship. If there is more to it, however…\" {n}Tristian goes silent, "
"shaking his head sadly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 어색하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"마치 애정이 섞인 듯이 말씀하시는군요. 만약... 만약 제가 당신에게 소중한 동료라면, "
"저도 우리의 우정을 소중히 여길 것입니다. 하지만 동료 이상의 감정이라면...\" {n}트리스티안은 슬프게 머리를 흔들면서 침묵을 "
"지킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0173_Text
msgctxt "d8892d72-7e86-440c-b3f7-acdf89cd39c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods, smiling.{/n} \"I, too, would not welcome the thought of "
"leaving you. I…\"\n"
"{n}Tristian pauses, then gives a rueful smile, shaking his head.{/n} \"My "
"apologies, I don't know what came over me! I simply wanted to say I won't "
"leave you until you ask me to. And still... I hope... I hope that won't "
"happen.\" {n}Tristian stops, his face red.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 웃으며 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"저도 당신을 떠날 생각은 없습니다. 저는...\"\n"
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 멈추고 후회스러운 미소를 지으며 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다. 제가 왜 이러는지 모르겠군요! 당신이 "
"제게 묻기 전까지는 그냥 떠나지 않겠다고 말하려 했는데... 아니.. 저도 당신을 떠나는 일이 없었으면 좋겠군요.\" {n}트리스티안은 "
"얼굴을 붉힌 채 멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0174_Text
msgctxt "6a74e451-fcd1-4ca2-a2a7-5044f61f4e7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles uneasily.{/n} \"Thank you for your kind words. However, I "
"am confused — where I am from such compliments are not given to friends, but "
"rather… to ones who are closer than that.\" {n}Tristian raises his eyes to "
"look at you.{/n} \"I hope that this is not what you meant. I would hate to "
"disappoint you and lose you as a friend.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 불안한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"친절한 말씀 감사합니다. 하지만 조금 혼란스럽군요. 그런 칭찬은 그냥 친구가 "
"아닌... 좀 더 가까운 사람에게 어울리는 것이 아닐지...\" {n}트리스티안은 눈을 들어 올려 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그런 뜻이 "
"아니길 바라요. 당신을 실망시키고 친구로서의 당신을 잃고 싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0175_Text
msgctxt "99498d11-4078-466d-9072-43d4549df65d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian blushes.{/n} \"Th-thanks, {name}. I… Your words fill my heart "
"with joy. To be honest, I have never met a woman quite like you…\" {n}He "
"breaks off mid-sentence and bites his lip bitterly.{/n} \"Forgive me my "
"hasty words. Anyway...\" {n}Tristian sighs, as if trying to gather up his "
"will.{/n} \"I am pleased to share your company.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"감사합니다, {name}. ...당신의 말은 저를 행복하게 만듭니다. 솔직히, 당신 같은 "
"여자는 처음입니다...\" {n}그는 갑자기 말을 끊고 입술을 강하게 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"제가 성급했군요. 용서하십시오. 어쨌든... "
"\" {n}트리스티안은 자신의 뜻을 모으려는 듯 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"당신의 동료라서 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0177_Text
msgctxt "80c831c7-172d-4269-9858-ebe35c6a0a33"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"It's a great crevasse in eastern "
"{g|Casmaron}Casmaron{/g}. The lands surrounding it are dead, soaked in "
"poison. {g|Pit of Gormuz}The Pit of Gormuz{/g} seems bottomless… until "
"someone dares to gaze into its depths. All who have dared tell of a strange, "
"distant glow — a glow that followed them in their dreams ever since.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 머리를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"{g|Casmaron} 카스마론{/g} 동부에 있는 거대한 크레바스입니다. 그 땅 "
"주위는 죽음과 독이 가득할 뿐이지요. {g|Pit of Gormuz}고르무즈의 구덩이{/g}는 바닥조차 볼 수 없습니다... 감히 누군가 "
"그 구덩이를 들여다볼 때 까진 말입니다... 그곳을 내려다본 이들은 한결같이 다소 이상한 얘기를 하는데, 아득한 불빛이 꿈에서부터 줄곧 "
"그들을 따라온다고 말하더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0178_Text
msgctxt "007ac61a-1b88-4969-87d1-abb205a3a69c"
msgid ""
"\"Throughout all of history, {g|Pit of Gormuz}the Pit of Gormuz{/g} has "
"spawned… creatures. Hideous beasts of overwhelming power and driven by only "
"a single desire — to destroy everything they see. Some were defeated — such "
"as the nightmarish Ulunat, whose carapace to this day towers above the "
"capital of {g|Osirion}Osirion{/g}. Others... proved too strong to be "
"defeated by mortal hands.\" {n}Tristian frowns.{/n} \"The most terrible of "
"them all was the Tarrasque, the Armageddon Engine, who to this day lies "
"dormant deep beneath {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 역사를 통틀어, {g|Pit of Gormuz}고르무즈의 구덩이{/g}는... 생물들의 산란지였습니다. 그곳의 압도적인 힘을 "
"가진 음침한 괴물들은 눈에 보이는 것을 모두 파괴하고 싶은 욕망에 목말라있죠. 몇몇 악몽 같은 울루낫같은 것들을 물리치기도 하였습니다. "
"그 갑피는 오늘날 {g|Osirion}오시리온{/g}의 수도에 우뚝 솟아 있지요. 나머지들은... 인간의 손으로 물리치기엔 너무 강하다는 "
"것이 증명되었습니다.\" {n}트리스티안이 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"가장 끔찍한 녀석은 종말의 근원 타라스크인데, 오늘날까지도 "
"{g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g}의 깊은 곳에 잠들어 있다고 합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0179_Text
msgctxt "2d93a30d-cc28-413d-9ad1-cfebb0de76fe"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, I also had a hand in making lives of these people yet more "
"miserable. I hope I'll be able to heal the wounds I unwillingly inflicted to "
"those families.\" {n}Tristian lowers his head, hiding his blind eyes from "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 저 역시 이들의 삶을 더 비참하게 만드는 것에 일조했습니다. 본의 아니게 그 가족들에게 입혔던 상처를 면목없지만 제가 다시 "
"치료해 드릴 수 있기를 바랍니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 머리를 숙여 자신의 눈먼 눈을 숨깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0180_Text
msgctxt "e00040c3-40c7-4802-ac45-5de8371abcfd"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric folds his hands on his chest in a pleading gesture.{/n} \"I "
"realize I have wronged you. I know It won't be easy to earn your "
"forgiveness. But I beg you: please, let me stay! I won't be any trouble to "
"you — just give me a chance to prove how deeply I repent!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 애원하는 몸짓으로 두 손을 가슴에 포갭니다.{/n} \"제가 잘못했습니다. 용서 받기 어렵다는 것도 알고 있습니다. 제발 "
"머무르게 해주십시오! 당신에게 폐 끼치지 않을 테니, 제가 얼마나 깊이 뉘우치고 있는지 증명할 기회를 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0183_Text
msgctxt "2eaf23ec-35d1-4505-b421-5889c9366708"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's face turns grayish, light seems to leave his blind eyes.{/n} "
"\"Indeed, earthly mercy is not boundless. So be it. Farewell, {name}\"."
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴은 잿빛이 되고, 빛은 그의 눈을 떠나는 듯합니다.{/n} \"정말, 인간의 자비는 무한하지 않지요... 그렇다면 "
"알겠습니다. 안녕히 계십시오, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0184_Text
msgctxt "4774d8c0-9201-4488-b2c9-46654e4c5aea"
msgid ""
"\"I thank you, {name}. I swear by {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, you won't regret "
"your decision.\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다, {name}. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께 맹세컨데, 당신의 결정을 후회하지 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0185_Text
msgctxt "adb0d248-6a52-4ef8-bd31-87cc8d73d589"
msgid ""
"\"Well. As I've already mentioned, I'm movanic deva, a servant of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. Of course, now I don't look much like an immortal "
"being...\" {n}Tristian raises his hands only to drop them a moment later.{/n}"
" \"But once I used to travel amongst the realms, searching for those who "
"needed my help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 이미 언급했듯이, {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 종복인 모바닉 데바입니다. 물론 지금은 필멸자의 가까운 모습이지만..."
"\" {n}트리스티안은 손을 들어 올렸다가 이내 내립니다.{/n} \"하지만 한때는 온 영역을 돌며 도움이 필요한 이들을 찾아다녔습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0186_Text
msgctxt "1f1dd708-8d41-4475-8ba0-c2c0e02c37b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian raises his head, as he hears your footsteps.{/n} \"{name}? I "
"wanted to speak with you.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신의 발소리를 들은 듯 고개를 들어 올립니다.{/n} \"{name}? 당신과 대화하고 싶었습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0187_Text
msgctxt "fd021af5-5a7f-40f5-883a-f30dbf212340"
msgid ""
"\"On my way here, I had enough time to think. So, I've been thinking about "
"you and me. About the words we once exchanged. It feels almost like a joke "
"now... who knows, maybe you really were just joking back then. A lot has "
"changed since then.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기로 오면서 당신과 저의 관계에 대해 생각해 보았습니다. 예전에 한 얘기들... 지금은 농담처럼 들립니다. 그땐 정말 농담이었는지도 "
"모르죠. 그 이후로 많은 변화가 있었으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0188_Text
msgctxt "f7e59ed8-ba54-4b02-88f3-efa994b8e76d"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway... I would like to preserve our friendship. We've been putting it "
"to a test way too often to endanger it once again. Another disappointment "
"can be fatal to it.\" {n}Tristian utters a heavy sigh.{/n} \"We shouldn't "
"cross the borders from now on. I hope you'll understand that my intentions "
"are pure and won't feel offended.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든... 저는 우리 우정을 지키고 싶습니다. 우리의 관계를 너무 자주 시험에 들게 해서 또다시 위험에 빠뜨렸습니다. 또 다른 "
"실망은 우리 관계에 치명적일 수 있습니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 무거운 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"지금부터는 선을 넘지 말자고요. "
"당신을 다치게 하고 싶지 않은 제 마음을 이해해 주셨으면 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0191_Text
msgctxt "3413614f-af4a-422e-8875-29127835e1c2"
msgid ""
"\"I've been traveling amongst the worlds when I noticed something strange. "
"How should I describe it... it was like something had pierced time and "
"matter, leaving a slight trace. I should have turned back and told my "
"brethren about my discovery... but I was sure I was able to find a reason of "
"this strange phenomenon by myself, so I decided to go for it alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 이상한 것을 눈치챘을 때 저는 세계 곳곳을 여행하고 있었습니다. 뭐랄까... 시간과 물질에 구멍이 난 것 같달까요. 돌아가서 제 "
"형제들에게 제가 발견한 걸 말해줘야 했었습니다... 하지만 이 이상 현상의 원인을 스스로 찾을 수 있을 거라 확신했었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0203_Text
msgctxt "04acc042-2f36-4334-a13b-fe38c2ba9ce2"
msgid ""
"\"My overconfidence and my foolishness are to blame for that. Once I "
"believed I deserved much more than {g|Sarenrae}solarflame goddess{/g} "
"assigned to me... and eventually I paid a price for my pride.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 과신과 어리석음의 대가입니다. 한때는 제가 {g|Sarenrae}태양빛의 여신{/g}께 더 많은 것을 받을 자격이 있다고 "
"믿었습니다... 결국 그것 때문에 대가를 치렀지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0204_Text
msgctxt "c412a338-be77-4daf-8eed-e3342dfbe645"
msgid ""
"\"The trace led me to {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, to the {g|Temple of the Elk}"
"Temple of the Elk{/g} — and right into Nyrissa's hands. She proved to be "
"much stronger than I, and defeated me in a heartbeat. Before I had time to "
"realize what was happening, she put me into magic slumber, filled with "
"nightmares and visions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 흔적이 저를 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}으로, {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}으로, 마침내 "
"나이리사의 손으로 인도했습니다. 그녀는 저보다 훨씬 강했고 나는 눈 깜빡할 사이에 지고 말았습니다. 그리곤 상황파악도 끝나기 전에 저를 "
"악몽과 환영으로 가득 찬 마법의 잠에 빠뜨렸지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0205_Text
msgctxt "a7da6096-1531-4e04-a642-48cbc2e191c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hesitates.{/n} \"She… she threatened she'd destroy my "
"immortality and deprive me of my divine powers once and for all. I didn't "
"dare to confront her; it was in her power to kill me — and then I'd go to "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} instead of my Goddess!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 주저합니다.{/n} \"그녀는... 그녀는 내 불멸을 파괴하고 신성력을 영원히 빼앗겠다고 협박했습니다. 저는 그녀의 "
"힘에 대적할 엄두조차 못 냈지요. 결국 저는 저의 여신 대신에 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}에게로 가게 되었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0206_Text
msgctxt "b3c9ffcb-b2c4-4476-a5a7-16a9b01f94d0"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, it all proved to be a lie…. But you should understand me: when "
"I awoke from my slumber, I already was trapped in a mortal body, and this "
"crazy fey bragged her power over me, and threatened me with eternal "
"damnation!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 모두 거짓임이 밝혀졌습니다... 하지만 저를 이해해주십시오. 제가 잠에서 깨어났을 때엔, 이미 필멸자가 되어 있었습니다. "
"그리고 이 미친 페이는 제게 그녀의 힘을 자랑하며 저를 영원히 지옥에 쳐박아넣겠다고 위협했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0207_Text
msgctxt "fd9f63b6-ad3d-4295-a47d-f9bbf8acf7a3"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa demanded unconditional submission. I couldn't… didn't dare to "
"confront her and put my divine sparkle at stake: a single step in wrong "
"direction — and Nyrissa would destroy the very essence of me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 제게 무조건 항복을 요구했습니다. 저는 그녀에게 대적할 수 없었습니다. 신성력을 잃기 두려웠으니까요. 까딱 잘못했다가는 "
"나이리사에게 제 본질을 파괴당했을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0208_Text
msgctxt "b5bf0911-65c1-47b9-bf0a-d837fa0ea380"
msgid ""
"\"She forbade me to uncover my true identity and made me do what she wanted "
"me to: to help her create that flower, to plant it... but she never forbade "
"me to help you fight the Bloom. This is a weak excuse, but I did all I could "
"to make sure my deeds won't do as much harm as she expected.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 제가 제 정체성을 밝히는 것을 금한 채 자기 요구에 따르게 했습니다. 그 꽃을 창조하고 심는 것을 도왔지요. 하지만 당신을 "
"도와 꽃과 맞서 싸우는 것은 금하지 않았습니다. 설득력 없는 변명이지만, 저는 최대한 그녀가 의도한 만큼 당신에게 해가 가지 않도록 "
"최선을 다했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0209_Text
msgctxt "53319a89-28d5-4cc3-9043-20ed40f82042"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, no. Nyrissa trusts no one, she is reluctant to share her plans even "
"with her Sisters. You'll have to expose her plots and schemes by yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 아닙니다. 나이리사는 누구도 믿지 않습니다. 그녀는 자매들과조차도 계획을 나누지 않습니다. 그녀의 음모와 계락을 직접 "
"밝혀내셔야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0210_Text
msgctxt "cdbdffce-9d63-42cc-b21b-0454b4f7570b"
msgid "\"Indeed. I would wish to leave it all behind — once and for all.\""
msgstr "\"정말입니다. 이 모든 걸 뒤로하고 떠나고 싶군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0211_Text
msgctxt "b553873c-6795-4a03-b1ef-21442ccb2bc9"
msgid ""
"\"Devas, you mean? The same way as the servants of other deities do: our "
"masters create us, give us our shape and vest us with our missions.\""
msgstr "\"데바 말인가요? 다른 신들의 종복들과 비슷합니다. 우리의 신께서 우리를 창조하셨고, 우리에게 임무를 부여하십니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0212_Text
msgctxt "2fa9b92f-bec6-4f09-ab4c-c33d2a7cbecd"
msgid ""
"\"As for me, I was reborn from the soul of a great mortal hero. My "
"conscience is deprived of memories of the past life — but looks like mortal "
"pride still resides within my heart. It was the reason why I've lost my "
"freedom and my power.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 위대한 필멸자의 영혼에서 다시 태어났습니다. 전생에 대한 기억은 잃었지만, 아직 제 가슴속에는 필멸자의 자존심이 있는 것 "
"같습니다. 이 때문에 전 자유와 힘을 잃었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0213_Text
msgctxt "2490808b-8428-43df-82f9-82b13b896f33"
msgid ""
"{n}A slight smile emerges on Tristian's face.{/n} \"A gift of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. A key to freedom. A symbol of our closeness to our "
"Goddess. With my wings I could travel between worlds and to find those who "
"asked for help. This is our sacred duty: to heed the prayers of mortals in "
"every corner of the Universe.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴에 약간의 미소가 떠오릅니다.{/n} \"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 선물이자 자유의 열쇠입니다. 우리의 "
"여신에 대한 친밀감의 상징이지요. 날개로 세계를 여행하며 도움이 필요한 사람을 찾아다녔습니다. 세계 곳곳의 인간의 기도를 주시하는 것이 "
"우리의 신성한 의무였지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0214_Text
msgctxt "d0a408b0-8223-4f55-a8e1-7a012ec368b8"
msgid ""
"\"I was too stupid to value that gift. My heart craved for opportunity to "
"prove myself, the chance to show {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} I was capable of "
"more, than what I was created for. And once the whole Universe laid on my "
"palm. Once...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 어리석게도 그 선물을 하찮게 여겼습니다. 저는 그저 제 자신을 증명할 기회, {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께 제가 더 "
"가치 있는 창조물이라고 보여주기를 갈망했습니다. 그리고 한때 우주 전체가 제 손바닥 위에 있었죠. 한때는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0215_Text
msgctxt "3456bda0-cdc9-467d-9d25-b0ef8a9c48fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian falls silent. You wait for a while, but seems like deva isn't "
"going to continue. He winces and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 침묵합니다. 당신은 잠시 기다렸지만 천사가 계속하지는 않을 것 같습니다. 그는 찡그리고는 몸을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0216_Text
msgctxt "b326d36a-82e8-4824-8d63-c8af1cfa4b74"
msgid ""
"\"No. I sacrificed my eyesight to destroy the Oculus of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}. Of all the mess I've done recently it was the only "
"righteous and proper thing. I'm happy I was able to do it, and my ability to "
"see isn't such a big price for an opportunity to cleanse my soul — at least "
"a little.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아닙니다. 저는 제 시력을 희생해서 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 파괴했습니다. 제가 최근에 저질렀던 모든 혼란 중에서 "
"이것만이 유일하게 정의롭고 적절한 일이었지요. 그렇게 할 수 있었다는게 기쁩니다, 그리고 제 영혼을 조금이라도 정화할 수 있다면 제 시력 "
"정도는 그리 큰 대가가 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0217_Text
msgctxt "d0634a53-fd65-46b2-b98a-6358760d2f26"
msgid "\"What do you want to talk about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 얘기를 하고 싶으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0219_Text
msgctxt "c463f6be-77c6-4aa6-a6e6-fbc5654e769d"
msgid ""
"{n}Warm smile lights Tristian's face.{/n} \"I came to his world in the palms "
"of my Goddess. My breath is just an echo of her breathing life into me, my "
"powers are just a grain of her everlasting light. Yes, {name}, I've seen "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} by my own eyes, and she was more beautiful than "
"anything else ever seen in this Universe.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}따뜻한 미소가 트리스티안의 얼굴을 비춥니다.{/n} \"나는 여신의 손바닥을 통해 그분의 세계로 왔습니다. 제 호흡은 제 삶을 "
"불어넣은 그녀의 호홉의 메아리에 불과하고 제 힘은 그녀의 빛에 비하면 알갱이에 지나지 않습니다. 그래요, {name}. 저는 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 제 눈으로 봤습니다. 그녀는 이 우주에서 본 다른 어떤 것보다 더 아름다웠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0221_Text
msgctxt "7085c563-a458-412a-8a9b-52f4aa52b644"
msgid ""
"\"Despite my mortal body, I am still not just an ordinary man. I'm not sure "
"I can explain it accurately...\" {n}Tristian ponders over it for a while.{/n}"
" \"The light has left my eyes forever, but my soul is filled with the "
"shining of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. My heart will lead me from now on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"필멸자의 육신에도 불구하고, 저는 여전히 평범한 사람이 아닙니다. 정확히 설명할 수 있을지는 모르겠지만...\" {n}트리스티안은 "
"잠시 그것에 대해 숙고합니다.{/n} \"빛은 제 눈을 영원히 떠났지만, 제 영혼은 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 빛으로 가득 "
"차 있습니다. 이제부터는 제 마음으로 앞을 볼 것입니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0222_Text
msgctxt "62f3a551-0ee9-4651-b914-70d932af8e7b"
msgid ""
"\"Please, don't treat me differently because of my blindness. I won't be a "
"burden to you, I promise.\""
msgstr "\"부디, 제 실명 때문에 저를 달리 대하지 마십시오. 당신에게 짐이 되지 않겠습니다. 약속하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0224_Text
msgctxt "01bcbc97-55ac-490b-8716-6ec17473ef45"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hesitates for a while, then gently takes your hand into his "
"palms.{/n} \"But I was young and naive back then. I didn't know yet, that "
"warmth of living being can outshine divine light.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 망설이고 당신의 손을 부드럽게 자신의 손바닥으로 가져갑니다.{/n} \"하지만 그때는 어리고 순진했습니다. "
"몰랐었습니다. 생명체의 따뜻함이 신의 빛을 능가할 수 있다는 것을.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0225_Text
msgctxt "c873e8cc-b4fc-48ad-95b2-976eac63e6a7"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest shakes his head.{/n} \"I have to refuse, {name}. Something "
"wicked is stirring in your lands. I must find out what is the reason. Jhod "
"gave his life to this cause — it is my duty to carry on!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사제는 머리를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"거절해야겠군요. {name}. 사악한 무언가가 당신의 땅을 휘젓고 있습니다. 이유가 무엇인지 "
"알아내야겠습니다. 조드는 이 일에 목숨을 바쳤습니다. 이것은 제 의무입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0227_Text
msgctxt "156a162c-836e-4258-bff7-20dbadce53c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian touches his face.{/n} \"It is so. Her goal was to orchestrate "
"our meeting. And she knew nothing better but to deceive a faithful servant "
"of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} with a hope of forgiveness. Tricks and frauds are "
"her specialty indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 그의 얼굴을 만집니다.{/n} \"그렇습니다. 그녀의 목표는 우리가 만나게끔 하는 것이었습니다. 그녀는 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 충실한 신도를 속이는 수를 썼지요. 속임수와 사기는 그녀의 주특기입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0228_Text
msgctxt "5672bdd4-0fcf-4a02-a9f6-7296dfac2973"
msgid ""
"\"The magical fog was her doing as well. She wanted you to go where she "
"needed you to be. Wanted to gain your trust, fill your mind with lies, set "
"you up for the fight with the Stag Lord... She fooled us all, playing our "
"feelings of faith and duty… and I played my part in this heinous act.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법의 안개 역시 그녀가 저지른 짓이었습니다. 당신을 자기 의도대로 조종하고자 했죠. 당신의 신뢰를 얻고, 거짓으로 마음을 나누고, "
"수사슴 군주와 싸우게 만들었습니다... 그녀는 믿음과 의무에 대한 우리의 감정으로 우리 모두를 속였습니다... 그리고 저는 이 악행에 "
"체스 말이 되었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0229_Text
msgctxt "144386e5-62ed-4cd1-ba8f-fd787a132be5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian greets you with a nod.{/n} \"Thank you for coming. Unfortunately "
"I have bad news.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 끄덕이며 당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"와주셔서 감사합니다. 불행히도 나쁜 소식이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0230_Text
msgctxt "0605c9a7-40e0-4643-96d9-fc9dba8bdf98"
msgid ""
"\"I managed to find a couple of cultists from the Kingdom of the Cleansed. "
"The poor fellows were scared to death, but I comforted them, and promised "
"not to speak their names. Anyway, they left the capital, fearing your wrath."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"정화된 자들의 왕국에서 온 몇몇 광신도를 겨우 찾아냈습니다. 겁에 질린 불쌍한 그들을 위로했고, 그들의 이름을 말하지 않겠다고 약속했습니다. "
"어쨌든 그들은 당신의 분노를 두려워하며 수도를 떠났습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0231_Text
msgctxt "e64b63cd-cfda-4d2e-b9c0-a170728db716"
msgid ""
"\"None of them saw the First Faithful after that fateful meeting. The "
"scoundrel vanished into thin air, and with him, all meetings, sacraments, "
"and talk of the Goddess. It looks like the peculiar power of curses in the "
"{g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} is not in fact connected to these lunatics."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들 중 누구도 그 운명적인 만남 이후에 그 선지자를 만나지 못했습니다. 그 악당은 허공으로 사라졌고, 그와 함께 모든 모임과 성례, "
"여신에 대한 이야기도 사라졌습니다. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 독특한 저주는 이 미치광이들과는 관련이 없는 "
"듯합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0232_Text
msgctxt "1e54cfb4-b0ba-435d-807c-adf3c57245c4"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, we managed to get their barkers off the streets, and yesterday's "
"fanatics have returned home, to their families and honest work. Thank you "
"for your help, {name}\". {n}Tristian wears a beaming smile.{/n} \"I will not "
"leave you of my own accord, until I repay you for your kindness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든 우리는 선동꾼들을 거리에서 몰아냈고 어제의 광신도들은 집과 일터로 돌아갔습니다. 도와주셔서 감사합니다, {name}. \" "
"{n}트리스티안은 빛나는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"저에게 보여주신 친절을 갚을 때까지 당신을 떠나지 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0235_Text
msgctxt "833f7b0d-ec9d-47ca-9f30-e99cb81a5627"
msgid "\"Any time. Just let me know when you gather your party.\""
msgstr "\"언제든지요. 일행을 모을 때 알려주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0236_Text
msgctxt "cdd81f58-004d-4598-a5cf-046b5fa2516a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian frowns.{/n} \"Not yet. I don't know whether to be glad about it "
"or not. The priest may be regrouping — in which case it may be all the more "
"difficult to defeat him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"아직입니다. 기뻐해야 할지 말아야 할지 모르겠습니다. 그는 재정비하고 있을지도 모릅니다. "
"그렇다면 그를 물리치기는 더욱 어려워질 수도 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0239_Text
msgctxt "594cea86-3966-4605-8054-b2b8f5bbd8e2"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles faintly with just the corners of his lips.{/n} \"No, I "
"don't. I lost something while I was here, something that truly made me a "
"creation of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. Until I find that thing I've lost — "
"until I find myself again... if that's even possible... I will continue my "
"search.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 입꼬리 한쪽이 올라가며 희미한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"아뇨, 여기 있는 동안 저는 무언가를 잃어버렸습니다. 그 "
"무언가가 저를 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 창조물로 만들어 주었습니다. 제가 잃어버린... 가능하다면 제 자신을 다시 찾을 "
"때까지... 계속 찾아보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0240_Text
msgctxt "bb12be56-024c-425f-a2e0-00d1319749ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles brightly.{/n} \"It is the will of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}"
". I was torn from her blissful radiance for so long. I shall never "
"contradict her again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 밝게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그것은 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 의지입니다. 저는 오랫동안 그녀의 광휘에 의해 "
"찢겼습니다. 다시는 그녀를 실망시키지 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0241_Text
msgctxt "77f154cd-addb-4915-aacc-d176d49360ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods.{/n} \"Hello, {name}. Do you wish to know what happened "
"there, at the altar of the Cleansed? I'd like to tell you, but I don't "
"really know how to describe it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까, {name}. 정화된 자의 제단에서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알고 싶으십니까? 물론 "
"말씀드리고 싶지만, 뭐라 표현해야 할지 잘 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0242_Text
msgctxt "9ba425e6-6957-469f-b474-78242039d860"
msgid ""
"{n}The deva moves his shoulders, as if stretching unseen wings behind his "
"back.{/n} \"One way or another... I walk in {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} light "
"once more. There may yet be many hardships ahead, but now I know divine "
"bliss. I'd started to forget, how... soothing it feels.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 데바는 보이지 않는 날개를 펴는 것처럼 어깨를 움직입니다.{/n} \"어떤 방법으로든... 저는 다시 한번 {g|Sarenrae}"
" 서렌레이{/g}의 빛 속으로 걸어갑니다. 많은 어려움이 있겠지만, 이제는 신성한 가호를 알고 있습니다. 저는 그것이 얼마나 "
"부드러운지... 잊고 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0243_Text
msgctxt "04aac262-4f93-4d11-a8e0-1be51fdeaa86"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian closes his eyes.{/n} \"She has given me a special power — a gift "
"worthy of her messenger in the material world. I think this power will be "
"useful to us, when we confront Nyrissa in the final battle.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 그의 눈을 감습니다.{/n} \"그녀는 제게 특별한 힘을 주셨습니다. 물질계에 있는 자신의 전령에게 걸맞은 힘이었지요. "
"그 힘이 나이리사와의 마지막 전투에서 유용할 것이라고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0244_Text
msgctxt "fa127ce0-a4fc-4b38-a15c-33d745584cc2"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles, almost humbly.{/n} \"When... when my master touched me "
"with her divine radiance... I felt her love. And pride. She feels I've "
"learned much, living among the dwellers of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 겸손하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"제 주인께서... 신성한 빛으로 저를 만졌을 때... 그녀의 사랑과 자부심을 느꼈습니다. "
"그녀는 제가 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 사람들과 함께 살아가면서 많은 것을 배웠다는 것을 느끼셨습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0245_Text
msgctxt "0e025ea3-dbbc-4d2b-b22b-38ba23e31918"
msgid ""
"\"None of this would be possible were it not for you. I owe you my life and "
"my salvation.\" {n}Tristian pauses.{/n} \"I once told you that I'll stay by "
"your side until I repay you for your kindness. Now I promise you, I won't "
"back down until Nyrissa is finished.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 아니었다면 그 무엇도 불가능했을 겁니다. 제 삶과 구원을 당신께 빚졌습니다.\" {n}트리스티안이 멈춥니다.{/n} \"언젠가 "
"당신의 친절을 갚을 때까지 곁에 있겠다고 말한 적이 있지요. 이젠 나이리사를 물리칠 때까지 물러서지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0248_Text
msgctxt "f983493c-0831-4ed7-b291-ca96d72ae65a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods.{/n} \"And {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} knows this. That is why "
"she entrusted me with this mission. Everything that happened to me here, in "
"this world, happened because of my pride and overzealousness.\" {n}Tristian "
"smiles subtly.{/n} \"But now the goddess herself has showed me the way to "
"glory. I won't miss this opportunity and fail her — or you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그리고 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}는 이걸 알고 계십니다. 그래서 제게 이 임무를 "
"맡기셨지요. 이 세상에 일어난 모든 일들은 제 오만과 지나친 열정 때문에 일어났습니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 미묘하게 웃습니다.{/n} "
"\"하지만 이제 여신께서 제게 영광의 길을 제시하셨습니다. 저는 이 기회를 놓치지 않고 당신과 그분을 실망시키지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0249_Text
msgctxt "15f71ea1-b203-469f-8571-f00557041010"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing you, Tristian smiles a bright smile.{/n} \"How good it is to see "
"you!\""
msgstr "{n}당신을 보며 트리스티안은 밝은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신을 보게되어 참 기쁩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0250_Text
msgctxt "1bbaadaf-e6f1-4f3d-a2db-a47c345cef5b"
msgid "{n}Tristian looks at you carefully.{/n} \"How can I help, {name}?\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 신중하게 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"제가 어떻게 도움이 될 수 있겠습니까? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0251_Text
msgctxt "c14da27e-3d02-4f40-a184-c873ef240d52"
msgid "\"Your steps sound special. I always know it's you.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 발소리는 특별합니다. 전 항상 당신이 오는 것을 알아챌 수 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0252_Text
msgctxt "3e8d98bb-e41a-4b2c-a051-f22b655ffa2c"
msgid "{n}Tristian holds your hand and kisses it.{/n} \"Yes, my love?\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 당신의 손을 잡고 키스를 합니다.{/n} \"네, 내 사랑?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0253_Text
msgctxt "19893d71-bbec-430d-821b-e5f638b0894b"
msgid ""
"{n}The smile that Tristian greets you with is sad around the edges.{/n} \"Can"
" you imagine, I just found out about you and... I hadn't noticed anything "
"for such a long time!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 웃으며 당신에게 인사하지만 조금 슬퍼 보입니다.{/n} \"상상이 되십니까? 이제 막 당신을 알아챘는데... 그렇게 "
"오랜 시간동안 아무것도 알아채지 못했습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0254_Text
msgctxt "fede9628-f49d-4b92-9eb4-32f136ca06bf"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar will never let anyone hurt you. I'm glad you have such a "
"protector.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르는 당신을 잘 지켜줄 것입니다. 그런 보호자가 당신 곁에 있어 기쁘네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0255_Text
msgctxt "897211e9-aa9c-40eb-9613-c601fe7b927f"
msgid "\"Octavia is wonderful. I'm sure you will be happy together!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아는 훌륭합니다. 당신은 행복할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0260_Text
msgctxt "c4796f83-e8e0-464f-8a4e-ed0af75e2b06"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles shyly and shakes his head.{/n} \"We are friends. That's "
"more than enough.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 수줍게 웃고 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"우린 친구입니다. 그거면 충분해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0261_Text
msgctxt "c977e391-5777-4642-9ffc-7b715bf6b277"
msgid ""
"\"Why should I be upset? You are happy together, aren't you? So everything "
"is as it's supposed to be.\""
msgstr "\"왜 제가 화가 나야 하는 거죠? 함께 있으면 행복하죠? 그렇다면 모든 것은 원래대로 인겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0262_Text
msgctxt "c1936061-e64f-4245-a743-624ee5f65f39"
msgid "{n}Tristian nods to you warmly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 따뜻한 눈빛으로 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0265_Text
msgctxt "89c3281b-bc3a-424f-a21c-342242e0d19e"
msgid "{n}Tristian looks as if he's been hit.{/n} \"But...\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 어딘가 부딪힌 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0266_Text
msgctxt "560bfd81-255e-4c53-b40b-71ccd759686c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian touches your shoulder ever so slightly.{/n} \"I missed you too. "
"Let's go.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신의 어깨를 살짝 만집니다.{/n} \"저도 당신이 그리웠습니다. 가시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0267_Text
msgctxt "cea709c6-3da0-404e-9c24-23f77662e16f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs and touches your shoulder carefully.{/n} \"How else could "
"I do this?\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 웃으며 당신의 어깨를 어루만집니다.{/n} \"제가 어쩌면 좋겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0268_Text
msgctxt "279f25fc-1adf-4094-90c2-a7d1ca929a13"
msgid ""
"\"Yours is... such an unusual alliance. I am glad I witnessed it, and I "
"believe the three of you will take care of each other like no one else could."
"\""
msgstr "\"여러분은... 독특한 관계죠. 여러분이 남들이 따라 할 수 없을 정도로 서로를 잘 돌볼 것이라고 믿습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0271_Text
msgctxt "8bf2b57f-1df0-4f84-be75-ee2bb20f222b"
msgid ""
"{n}The deva gathers his strength, but still struggles to speak.{/n} "
"\"Whatever the reason... thank you for giving me a second chance. I hope you "
"will allow me stay near, and continue to help you as a friend.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 데바는 힘을 모으는 듯이 보이지만 여전히 힘겹게 말합니다.{/n} \"이유가 무엇이든... 두 번째 기회를 주셔서 감사합니다. "
"친구로서 당신의 곁에 계속 머물며 돕고 싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0272_Text
msgctxt "400f6904-7cf8-41ab-8b24-070cdd2710aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you with an expression that could be taken for anger, "
"if you didn't know the priest.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 그를 모르는 이가 봤다면 화가 났다고 생각하게끔 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0274_Text
msgctxt "67c31517-79f3-4484-a0f1-9aa1b889491f"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it's not my place to comment on your personal life, so I will stop "
"bothering you about things that do not concern me.\""
msgstr "\"음, 당신의 사생활이니, 그런 걸로 당신을 괴롭히지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0276_Text
msgctxt "899304cb-a835-4266-99a0-8caeab0ef8b8"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, that was a mere jest. Other acolytes at my temple used to tease me "
"with that title. This should tell you how pious and devoted I was compared "
"to them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죄송합니다. 농담이었습니다. 우리 사원의 다른 복사들은 그런 별명으로 저를 놀리곤 했거든요. 제가 얼마나 경건하고 헌신적으로 보였는지 "
"아시겠지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0278_Text
msgctxt "2722ce32-6735-4360-a27c-822814833799"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"This was yet another lie I was forced to "
"tell you. It was Nyrissa who protected me from harm, unwilling to lose her "
"agent... her skylark. I am so sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"이건 또 다른 거짓말이었습니다. 자신의 수를 잃고 싶지 않았던 나이리사가 절 위험으로부터 "
"지켜줬습니다. 죄송합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0279_Text
msgctxt "bbaff2a3-d007-419e-af94-2afff9a577dd"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles as you approach.{/n} \"Greetings. How may this humble "
"Chosen of the great Sarenrae help you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가오자 트리스티안은 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까. 미천한 서렌레이의 선택받은 자인 제가 어떻게 당신을 도우면 "
"될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0280_Text
msgctxt "a1083902-ddbb-4b33-9134-946c25117f21"
msgid ""
"\"And yet, my faith is strong. Sarenrae knows this and protects me in times "
"of great peril. If something ever threatens my life, by her divine powers I "
"am transported to a safe location.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 제 믿음은 강합니다. 서렌레이께서는 그것을 알고 위험에 처했을 때 나를 보호하십니다. 만약 무언가에 의해 제 목숨이 "
"위협받는다면, 그녀의 신성한 힘에 의해 안전한 장소로 이송됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Tristian/Tristian_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0281_Text
msgctxt "38162b49-5d49-4bdf-96f1-9d84429c803d"
msgid ""
"{n}The deva lowers his head.{/n} \"Sarenrae spoke to me. She told me she "
"forgives my misdeeds. That I have learned much while living among mortals. "
"But... that matters little, because I cannot forgive myself. And I am not "
"sure I will ever be able to.\" {n}Tristian's sigh is heavy, as though he "
"carries an unseen burden.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}데바는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"서렌레이께서는 저의 비행을 용서한다고 하셨습니다. 필멸자들 사이에서 함께 살아가며 많은 것을 "
"배웠지만... 제 스스로를 용서할 수가 없습니다. 영원히 그럴 수 있을지 확신할 수가 없습니다.\" {n}트리스티안의 한숨은 마치 보이지 "
"않는 짐을 짊어진 것처럼 무겁습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "509999ec-651d-4dc4-a126-11af3cbe30f7"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "990140a3-dbab-4f94-9b36-c5b971eb2b67"
msgid "\"Tell me about the way of Shelyn, and about her paladins.\""
msgstr "\"셸린과 그녀의 팔라딘들에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c99eb303-e532-451e-9b0c-9cd9fd7d7690"
msgid ""
"\"You know, you don't have to follow etiquette and maintain good manners "
"while speaking with me, if you don't want to.\""
msgstr "\"원하지 않는다면 나와 이야기하는 동안은 굳이 예의 범절을 유지할 필요가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e3622c15-6748-4fd5-9ff1-e170fce8ce1a"
msgid "\"I guess you have plenty of suitors.\""
msgstr "\"많은 구혼자가 있을 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d98b3116-2973-48ab-b734-8afcc629ff87"
msgid ""
"\"You know, you really are quite beautiful. You're a reliable friend and a "
"worthy ally, but would be a crime to ignore your beauty.\""
msgstr "\"너도 알겠지만 너는 정말 아름다워. 너는 믿을 만한 동료지만 너의 아름다움을 무시하는 건 죄악이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "461e0997-d57a-4e90-a3fc-ec262fb190c7"
msgid "\"You're so eager to follow my orders. Why?\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 명령에 복종하는군. 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8a1cee3a-a3ae-4204-a972-cab44c246ec0"
msgid "\"Thank you for the conversation. Talk to you later.\""
msgstr "\"대화 해줘서 고마워. 나중에 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "6d2f22e8-5183-4684-a4e4-f8ab9ffb441b"
msgid "\"Where are you from? What was your childhood like?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어디 출신이지? 너의 어린시절은 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "ca7e8a51-987a-44eb-ae68-e9e6873acdf2"
msgid "\"Why were you sent to the paladin Order of the Eternal Rose?\""
msgstr "\"왜 영원한 장미의 팔라딘 기사단에 보내졌지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "054f80a4-500d-4619-8ebb-ea212635f0b2"
msgid "\"What did they teach you in the Order?\""
msgstr "\"기사단에서는 네게 무엇을 가르쳐 주었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "f5de3856-9d1d-4265-b532-603b9cfad5f1"
msgid "\"Why did you leave the Order?\""
msgstr "\"왜 기사단을 떠났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "d3a98946-0327-473b-bbf7-3132b3cacb3a"
msgid "\"What did you do after you left the Order?\""
msgstr "\"기사단을 떠난 후 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "13e95d82-63e1-484c-a36f-da85d8f172c8"
msgid "\"I bet your beauty inspired many people in the Order.\""
msgstr "\"기사단에서 너의 아름다움은 많은 사람들에게 영감을 주었을 거 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "35fe6e88-1f2b-48f3-8ec1-60d4d27714f3"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "b7430ad3-9f95-4de2-b6b2-e59e9161c57f"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your honesty. I understand you very well. You are a true "
"friend, who I can trust with my life.\""
msgstr "\"정직하게 대답해주어 고맙다. 너를 잘 알게 되었다. 너는 내 인생을 책임질 수 있는 진정한 동료야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "5484ba04-f907-408f-8b82-5f750f33b3e3"
msgid ""
"\"I know what you mean, but still, you shouldn't drive people away who only "
"want to open their hearts to you. It's not their fault that you inspire such "
"feeling.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 의미하는 바를 알지만 너에게 마음을 열고 싶은 사람을 뿌리치면 안돼. 그런 감정을 가지게 된 건 그들의 잘못이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "eb5e4e21-2a88-4a48-8444-e89125b39afe"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa, whoa, why all the shouting? It was just a simple question. What's "
"become of all your precious self-control?\""
msgstr "\"저런. 왜 그렇게 소리를 질렀지? 그저 단순한 질문인데. 그렇게 자기를 통제하는 이유가 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "eddc175e-7864-414d-99d1-a81eaafaaad1"
msgid ""
"\"For the moment, yes. I'm not going to stalk you like your admirers. But I "
"wanted you to know that I've noticed you.\""
msgstr "\"순간은 그랬다. 나는 너의 팬들처럼 너를 쫓아다니지는 않겠어. 하지만 너를 계속 봐온 것을 알아주었으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "653ea3e7-f4ca-4381-ac95-1c6fa638eacb"
msgid ""
"\"And what if I meant something else? Are you afraid to yield to temptation? "
"I know you have plenty of suitors, but I'm not afraid of competition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 내가 다른 것을 의미한다면? 유혹에 굴복하는 것이 두려운가? 너의 구혼자들이 많은 건 알지만 나는 경쟁이 두렵지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "4271d85f-87d8-4d74-84b5-2962312e2004"
msgid "\"Well, yes. That's what I meant.\""
msgstr "\"음. 맞아. 그게 내가 의미하는 바야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "16ba3fac-1a7c-4f25-8e0c-8aef27de19a4"
msgid ""
"\"You speak of Shelyn with such contempt. What did the goddess of beauty do "
"to earn your anger?\""
msgstr "\"셸린을 증오하는 듯하군. 왜 그 아름다운 여신이 너의 분노를 샀지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "e069045c-9749-4e62-8c16-663a120d1221"
msgid "\"What do paladins of Shelyn usually do?\""
msgstr "\"셸린의 팔라딘들은 보통 무엇을 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "55d63dd3-3415-42a7-b90e-4715b1da9641"
msgid ""
"\"I understand that not every piece of art is good, or even decent, but "
"surely there must be at least a few great works among them.\""
msgstr "\"모든 예술 작품이 훌륭한 것은 아니지만 그들 중에서도 수작이 있기 마련이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "ed155cae-56b0-4eed-ac12-59b5460a0585"
msgid ""
"\"You said that every paladin must practice some kind of art. What kind of "
"art did you pursue?\""
msgstr "\"모든 팔라딘들이 예술을 배워야 한다고 했는데, 너는 무슨 예술을 추구하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "8e940265-0c0f-4478-aa1e-e3015c07c982"
msgid "\"I see. Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다. 다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92456_Text
msgctxt "cead39fe-d3be-44c9-9c5f-71a13825bc34"
msgid "\"I think it would be better if you leave.\""
msgstr "\"네가 떠나면 더 좋을 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92458_Text
msgctxt "7dacfeae-428f-4b2a-9027-e8b42a397ceb"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92459_Text
msgctxt "be7a5edf-fcb6-4ad4-aa26-a02c409377ae"
msgid "\"No.\""
msgstr "\"아니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92462_Text
msgctxt "6e747a8c-7574-4b22-a3ba-f3fccb42ed95"
msgid ""
"[Give Fredero's letter to Valerie] \"Valerie, I've received a letter from "
"Fredero Sinnet. He says I'm to free you from service and return you to "
"Shelyn.\""
msgstr ""
"[발레리에게 프레데로의 편지를 건냅니다] \"발레리. 프레데로 신넷에게 편지를 받았다. 너의 임무를 끝내고 셸린에게 돌아가라는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92467_Text
msgctxt "9acd1e8d-a0ca-4c2e-90dd-62e39ffca639"
msgid "\"Then it's time to visit Oleg and Svetlana.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 올렉과 스베틀라나를 방문할 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92468_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f31f88cc-a7f0-4eb2-8ca1-9cf639c7d32c"
msgid "Suggested throwing the paladins of Shelyn out of the Stolen Lands."
msgstr "도둑맞은 땅에서 셸린의 팔라딘을 쫓아낸다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92468_Text
msgctxt "dbb205bf-4a11-49ec-9855-a70d2373f532"
msgid ""
"\"What if I just throw these paladins off my lands? I'd be well within my "
"rights.\""
msgstr "\"만약 내가 성기사를 쫓아낸다면? 나는 그럴 권리가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92469_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2778afbe-6d43-4b53-9ceb-27c99383cbcd"
msgid "Suggested ignoring the paladins of Shelyn."
msgstr "셸린의 성기사를 무시하자고 제안합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92469_Text
msgctxt "ebf38b5d-f536-4732-a827-5315a0a560b2"
msgid "\"You do know we could just ignore this letter, right?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 이 편지를 무시할 수 있다는 것을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92475_Text
msgctxt "348b34f2-540f-43a3-bf3a-ff368c65e0fa"
msgid "\"How do you feel? I see your wound hasn't healed yet...\""
msgstr "\"기분은 좀 어때? 상처가 아직 아물지 않았구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92481_Text
msgctxt "99f5b142-151c-4fb9-a672-7798151757ca"
msgid "\"We don't have the time to bother with this.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 이것에 신경 써야 할 시간이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92483_Text
msgctxt "a3520b02-c6f3-49da-b7c2-6f31a0aa816d"
msgid "\"Valerie, we need to talk. You've been acting strange lately.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 얘기 좀 해. 너 최근에 이상하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92485_Text
msgctxt "0c7afaa4-2f4e-4d1b-b318-e25f21b7e557"
msgid "\"Captain of the guard said you were taking it out on random people.\""
msgstr "\"경비 대장은 네가 사람들에게 화풀이를 한다고 하는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92486_Text
msgctxt "7b9189e0-6c40-4562-9293-e09cac9c0c18"
msgid ""
"\"Why did you think that pasquinade next to the tavern entrance was about "
"you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 주점 입구 옆에 붙은 풍자문이 네것이라고 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92487_Text
msgctxt "3ef00a0f-1210-4f9f-8d12-7693eab06c38"
msgid ""
"\"I know you had a fight with the Storyteller. And you yelled at Linzi.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이야기꾼과 싸운다는 것을 안다. 그리고 린지에게 소리도 치고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92498_Text
msgctxt "f5358369-a57f-456b-a1df-7fa487f716de"
msgid "\"Only you can figure out what's bothering you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 괴롭히는 것은 너만이 알아낼 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92499_Text
msgctxt "bf2b9cb8-5682-4c87-a361-8f270421a528"
msgid "\"Linzi thinks you're concerned about the scar.\""
msgstr "\"린지는 네가 흉터를 걱정한다고 하던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92500_Text
msgctxt "1b5b0d68-fa83-4857-9858-b745fb252647"
msgid ""
"\"You've simply run out of patience. That sometimes happens when you're "
"surrounded by idiots.\""
msgstr "\"너는 그저 인내심을 잃었다. 바보들에게 둘러싸여 있을 때 가끔 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92506_Text
msgctxt "eb8ecafe-0a2d-4a77-9643-214c0c9ef24b"
msgid ""
"\"You've always said that beauty isn't really important. Are you changing "
"your views now?\""
msgstr "\"항상 아름다움은 중요하지 않다고 말했지. 이제 그 생각을 바꾸는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92509_Text
msgctxt "1a9a75f2-1212-488f-9a6e-619e632288ac"
msgid ""
"\"You're letting your old beliefs cover your pain and disappointment. Let "
"yourself grieve for what you've lost.\""
msgstr "\"너의 잘못된 믿음으로 고통과 실망을 감추지 마. 잃어버린 것을 슬퍼하는 게 당연해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92514_Text
msgctxt "fccfe3a3-98cf-4f54-9a78-6f8f616aaaca"
msgid "\"How's your wound?\""
msgstr "\"상처는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92516_Text
msgctxt "264fee22-a67d-4ba9-bfe3-0bb7f4ab82a4"
msgid "\"How are things with the Storyteller and Linzi?\""
msgstr "\"이야기꾼과 린지와는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92519_Text
msgctxt "973c8ec3-8472-4bf8-ab9b-df68eae3d086"
msgid "\"I hear you received an unpleasant letter lately...\""
msgstr "\"최근에 불쾌한 편지를 받았다고 들었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92525_Text
msgctxt "3e950179-294d-47bc-9533-bce097c16951"
msgid "\"Let's go there together and get to the bottom of this.\""
msgstr "\"함께 가서 원인을 알아내자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92526_Text
msgctxt "71465cab-0e91-4e2c-9a01-1a64a323035e"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to spend my time on this. Could you perhaps handle it alone?\""
msgstr "\"나는 이것에 시간을 보내고 싶지 않아. 너 혼자서 할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92527_Text
msgctxt "3994e732-404f-4e5b-99dd-4e85406772a0"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what this Order wants. We aren't going to give them anything!'"
msgstr "\"나는 교단이 무엇을 원하든 상관하지 않는다. 우리는 그들에게 무엇도 주지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92529_Text
msgctxt "9aa060bc-205c-4235-a148-0ef4e54bb6e6"
msgid ""
"\"If that's the case, then we'll just have to deal with them personally.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 우리가 그들을 개인적으로 처리할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92530_Text
msgctxt "a5f87088-3ee5-46ad-af88-89bcb95b59bb"
msgid "\"Let them babble. I don't care.\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 지껄이라고 해. 나는 상관 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92534_Text
msgctxt "97082e69-5347-465c-8e02-9e8a4945e301"
msgid "\"Listen to yourself! Why all this bile? I want to help you!\""
msgstr "\"네 자신에 귀기울여. 왜 이러는 거야? 나는 너를 돕고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92537_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b3dbd2b0-0b7f-49a6-b03b-b9ebccde9a94"
msgid "Sternly demanded that Valerie behave."
msgstr "발레리에게 행동할 것을 강력하게 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92537_Text
msgctxt "5b5ff3bc-8144-4399-b8e7-7b552901d829"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what excuses you come up with. Get a handle on yourself, or "
"you're going back to Brevoy.\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭐라 변명하든 상관 없다. 알아서 해결하거나 브레보이로 돌아가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92539_Text
msgctxt "8162fc1b-b817-416f-8bb3-ae150af97d39"
msgid "[Wait]"
msgstr "[기다립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92540_Text
msgctxt "aad36294-bbda-4f11-9156-4186fe223c1c"
msgid "\"Valerie?\""
msgstr "\"발레리?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92541_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3c62d494-68d5-4ed4-962e-9ddc870bbc04"
msgid "Sternly demanded that Valerie behave."
msgstr "발레리에게 행동할 것을 강력하게 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92541_Text
msgctxt "65f372c0-de5c-4e33-bb1d-d6a92c2cd6af"
msgid ""
"\"I'm tired of your theatrics. Pull yourself together and stop wasting my "
"time.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 연극에 지쳤다. 정신 차리고 내 시간을 낭비하지 말아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92543_Text
msgctxt "425a707f-9514-4bc5-9336-ab4437d01b9a"
msgid "\"It's a pity we couldn't get rid of the scar.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 흉터를 없앨 수 없었던 것은 유감이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92544_Text
msgctxt "48b232de-9c08-4aab-bbb9-795fc31a2dc1"
msgid "\"I'm glad the scar is gone.\""
msgstr "\"흉터가 없어져서 다행이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92545_Text
msgctxt "6aaa2ac7-4a06-4fcf-9b81-1a45d9698de4"
msgid "\"About what happened at the Temple of Prisms...\""
msgstr "\"프리즘 성전에서 일어난 일에 관해서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92551_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "80bb44d7-2adf-4ae9-a26d-357d8463387c"
msgid ""
"Expressed relief that the episode with the paladins of Shelyn is over, one "
"way or another."
msgstr "셸린 성기사들과의 사건이 어쨌든 끝나서 다행이라고 안도합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92551_Text
msgctxt "93ac76d1-54e7-4914-a148-33518c5d0438"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad this saga is finished. Let's see what else needs to be done...\""
msgstr "\"이 무용담이 끝나서 기쁘다. 또 무엇을 해야 하는지 보자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92552_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f7bad965-7162-45cb-a9cb-bb9b645405bf"
msgid "Promised to destroy anyone who tries to claim Valerie as their own."
msgstr "발레리를 빼앗으려는 사람을 파멸시킬 것이라고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92552_Text
msgctxt "98f33b6a-8dff-4df7-84b1-2774135cf8ee"
msgid ""
"\"The next time someone come to claim you, I'll just slit their throat. You "
"serve only me, don't forget it.\""
msgstr "\"누군가 너를 빼앗으려 한다면 그들의 목을 베어버리겠다. 너는 나만을 섬겨라. 잊지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92553_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "06d812aa-4c07-4b5d-89c3-4028742be483"
msgid ""
"Cheered Valerie up with the notion that anything is possible when working "
"together."
msgstr "함께 일할 때 무엇이든 가능하다는 생각으로 발레리를 응원했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92553_Text
msgctxt "e003f2d4-23be-415a-aa92-4ffe7b6b89a8"
msgid "\"Together we can overcome any obstacle – I'm sure of that!\""
msgstr "\"함께하면 어떤 장애물도 극복할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92559_Text
msgctxt "68f768a4-6f42-4d9a-aa8c-c5be3bbcce5a"
msgid ""
"\"Why is it you never just talk to me? I have to pry everything out of you!\""
msgstr "\"왜 나한테 말해 보지 않았어? 내가 사사건건 물어봤어야 했었는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92565_Text
msgctxt "89d42816-23ef-4be5-b70d-09b35bcd6694"
msgid "\"I'd like to spend some time alone with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 단 둘이 시간을 보내고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92570_Text
msgctxt "fadd0735-29f0-43be-94b3-d92dd3f870f5"
msgid "\"I'll try. Thank you.\""
msgstr "\"노력해 볼게. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92571_Text
msgctxt "d59aa99f-6a99-46a1-b62c-8b65a34ea3c1"
msgid "\"Are you... not upset?\""
msgstr "\"너... 화나지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92574_Text
msgctxt "884cebb5-08d2-4d20-9e6d-4d6e759bc241"
msgid "\"About us... Let's go back to how things were when we met.\""
msgstr "\"우리... 동료일 때로 돌아가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92575_Text
msgctxt "220c72cc-611a-4091-b34f-9435237bd03e"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92578_Text
msgctxt "21ae1088-feef-4017-a59f-b7f58ebb2df0"
msgid "\"No.\""
msgstr "\"아니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Answer_92582_Text
msgctxt "24ed7f23-70d1-4c0c-ba26-c2229ff35eec"
msgid "\"So you're an atheist? You don't worship any deity?\""
msgstr "\"너는 무신론자인가? 신을 숭배하지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "99d3fbde-0ae6-41c3-bebf-440ddf6d4af3"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings.\" {n}Valerie sighs.{/n} \"Everything is well, I hope? I'm ready "
"for new orders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반갑습니다.\" {n}발레리는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"모든 일이 잘 풀리면 좋겠군요. 저는 새로운 명령을 받을 준비가 되어있습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "7ba5db30-c8f6-414e-96ba-36b68b7efebf"
msgid ""
"\"I'm aware of that,\" {n}Valerie sighs.{/n} \"But I'm sure you understand "
"that I am what I am. That's how I was brought up – first by my parents, and "
"then by my mentors in the Order.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 알고 있습니다.\" {n}발레리는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"하지만 당신은 이런 제 모습이 바로 제 참모습이라는 것을 이해하실 "
"겁니다. 이 모습이 바로 어렸을때부터 부모님께, 그리고 기사단 스승님께로부터 길러진 모습입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "05dc8991-9272-4f2d-a61c-016db8154143"
msgid ""
"\"Besides, I was born to a noble family.\" {n}Valerie raises her chin "
"proudly.{/n} \"So I rather enjoy the idea that my manner of speech differs a "
"bit from the common language of the peasantry. You just can't imagine how "
"many social climbers have bowed politely the moment I opened my mouth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"게다가 저는 귀족 가문에서 태어났습니다.\" {n}발레리는 턱을 자랑스럽게 올립니다.{/n} \"제 말투와 억양이 농민의 공용어와 "
"차이가 있다는 걸 오히려 즐기기도 합니다. 제가 입을 열 때마다 얼마나 많은 출세주의자들이 굽실거렸는지 상상도 못 하실 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "7f8916a3-92ab-46fe-a5c0-77bac1829525"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie rolls her eyes.{/n} \"Sadly, you're right to suppose that. Even "
"here, in these remote lands, one can find offspring of many noble houses – "
"and all of them consider it their duty to kneel before me, begging me to "
"walk with them in the garden.\" {n}Valerie's voice overflows with contempt. "
"If words were poison, you'd be dying a horrible death.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"슬프게도 예상한 대로입니다. 심지어 이 먼 나라에서도 수많은 귀족의 자손을 찾아볼 수 "
"있었습니다. 그들 모두는 내 앞에 무릎을 꿇고 정원을 함께 걸어달라고 애원하는 것이 자신의 의무라고 여깁니다..\" {n}발레리의 "
"목소리는 경멸로 넘칩니다. 만약 말이 독이었다면 당신은 끔찍하게 죽었을 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "de4a1474-319a-4174-be58-c4fc8697d051"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, and don't forget about the village oafs. They understand the concept "
"of nobility perfectly well. So they realize they'll be punished if they dare "
"make any advance towards me. So they prefer to stare from a distance, "
"drooling. And believe me, I can very well imagine what they discuss in the "
"taverns.\" {n}Valerie shivers and jerks her shoulders, as if trying to shed "
"the sticky, disgusting stares.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그리고 마을의 멍청이들도 잊어서는 안 되겠지요. 그들은 귀족이라는 개념을 완벽하게 이해하고 있습니다. 감히 제 앞에서 음흉한 "
"짓을 하면 벌을 받을 거라는 것도 잘 알고 있습니다. 그래서 멀리서 침을 질질 흘리며 쳐다보는 것을 선호합니다. 그러니 제 말을 "
"믿으십시오. 저는 그 멍청이들이 선술집에서 나눌 음담패설도 상상이 가니까요.\" {n}발레리는 마치 끈적거리고 역겨운 시선을 떨쳐내려는듯 "
"어깨를 부르르 떨며 홱 젖힙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "c1e73ac0-62a1-4639-a001-6faa0687596f"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, 'why'?\" {n}Valerie looks at you in bewilderment.{/n} \"I"
" follow your orders. I've joined your campaign because I have faith in you. "
"I believe your intentions to be noble, though things may not always turn out "
"as you've planned.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜라니, 무슨 뜻인가요?\" {n}발레리는 당황하며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"저는 당신의 명령을 따릅니다. 저는 당신에 대한 믿음이 "
"있기에 당신의 임무에 동참했습니다. 항상 당신의 계획대로 일이 풀리지 않을지라도 당신의 고귀한 의도를 믿습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "008ed0c4-806e-4113-a25b-9d4d0a9c55ce"
msgid ""
"\"You are my commander, your orders are law. It's my duty to follow them.\" "
"{n}Valerie hesitates for a moment.{/n} \"Well, so long as you don't order me "
"to do something that's absolutely dishonorable. But that would never happen, "
"I hope.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 제 지휘관이고 당신의 명령은 법입니다. 따라야 할 의무입니다.\" {n}발레리는 잠시 주저합니다.{/n} \"글쎄요. 당신이 "
"절대적으로 불명예스러운 일을 하라고 명령하지 않는 한 불복종하지는 않을 겁니다. 그런 일은 일어나지 않기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "793cc617-859d-424e-b98d-a3c33a6c5628"
msgid "\"As you wish.\" {n}Valerie nods with dignity.{/n}"
msgstr "\"원하시는 대로 하겠습니다.\" {n}발레리는 품위 있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "4605a82d-1fbd-403e-8b4d-0aec32feac2c"
msgid ""
"\"What exactly would you like to know? I was born to a noble family, though "
"I didn't remain long on the family estate. My father sent me to the Order of "
"the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}, but I left once I realized that it didn't "
"match my principles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정확히 어떤것을 알고싶으신가요? 저는 귀족 가문에서 태어났지만, 가족들과 오래 머물지는 않았습니다. 아버지가 저를 {g|Shelyn}"
"영원한 장미{/g}의 기사단으로 보내셨지만 저는 기사단이 제 원칙과 맞지 않는다는 것을 깨닫고 떠났습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "332cedf8-97df-4114-9fff-90bc6909a63c"
msgid ""
"\"I was born in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, but in fact I've never seen much of "
"the country. I spent my childhood on a remote estate, owned by my noble "
"family. My father is a respectable philanthropist and benefactor of the "
"Church of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}. He's also a renowned private collector and a "
"great admirer of the arts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 태어났지만 그곳의 많은 것을 보고 자라진 않았습니다. 저는 어린 시절을 저희 가문 소유의 "
"외딴 저택에서 자랐으니까요. 제 아버지는 훌륭한 자선가이자 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g} 교회의 후원자입니다. 또한 유명한 개인 "
"수집가이자 예술에 대한 대단한 애호가십니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "0ef9682f-a8b0-4410-9874-8e19c55c24ca"
msgid ""
"\"My mother saw to my education personally. From my early years I learned "
"good manners – how to behave at the dinner-table, and the proper form of "
"words for every occasion. I also learned the difference between true nobles "
"and lowborn upstarts, and I learned how to treat each of them properly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어머니는 직접 저를 교육하셨습니다. 어릴적부터 저는 저녁 식탁의 예절부터 모든 경우에 적합한 화술을 배웠습니다. 또한 진정한 귀족들과 "
"낮은 신분의 차이점을 배웠고 그들을 올바르게 대하는 법도 배웠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "3ed720d8-8ac5-4763-8f2f-409ecc965435"
msgid ""
"\"Our home was always under the protection of several paladins of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}. My father has donated a handsome sum to their Order. "
"One of them, a man of venerable age with a grey beard, once let me touch his "
"shining armor. I still remember the admiration I felt when I touched the "
"cold, polished steel.\" {n}Valerie smiles.{/n} \"Of all the memories of my "
"childhood, that one is somehow the warmest one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저희 집은 항상 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘들의 보호를 받았습니다. 제 아버지는 그 기사단에 거액을 기부하셨지요. 그 "
"팔라딘 중 한 명은 회색 턱수염을 기른 나이가 지긋하신 분이었습니다. 한번은 그분께서 자신의 반짝이는 갑옷을 만지게 해주셨지요. 저는 그 "
"차갑고 광택이 나는 강철을 만졌을 때 느꼈던 감동을 아직도 기억하고 있습니다. \" {n}발레리는 미소 지었습니다.{/n} \"아마도 제 "
"어린 시절의 모든 추억 중에서 가장 따뜻한 추억일 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "1967ba9d-2e46-4836-8ce2-c64a63486b17"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, as you can imagine, from my first days I was surrounded by crowds of "
"servants and nannies who never stopped praising my heavenly beauty. The "
"paladins of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} who used to visit our house echoed these "
"praises.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 당신이 상상할 수 있듯이 저는 첫 날부터 제 외모를 멈추지 않고 찬양해대는 하인과 보모들에게 둘러싸여 있었습니다. 저희 집을 "
"방문했던 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘들도 이 찬사를 메아리처럼 되풀이했고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e7415baf-7790-4593-8494-90a1b03421d9"
msgid ""
"\"In the end, general consensus overwhelmed my father's better judgment. "
"When I turned six, I was brought to the Church of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, and "
"told that this would be my new home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"결국 많은 사람들의 의견이 아버지의 더 나은 판단력을 압도했습니다. 저는 6살이 되었을 때 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 교회로 "
"가게 되었고 이곳이 저의 새로운 집이라는 말을 들었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "1dd595b4-61b0-4cce-ba12-22758a256c31"
msgid ""
"\"Don't pity me though, I beg of you. Many who hear this story immediately "
"assume that my parents were cruel and had no love for their child.\" {n}"
"Valerie's eyes become stern.{/n} \"My parents had respect for me. They "
"taught me something that has supported me all of my life. – A sense of self-"
"esteem.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저를 가엾게 여기지는 마세요. 사람들은 이 이야기를 들으면 저의 부모님이 가혹한 분이고 자식을 사랑하지 않았다고 착각하더군요.\" "
"{n}발레리의 눈이 엄해집니다.{/n} \"부모님은 저를 존중하셨습니다. 그분들은 제 삶의 전반을 지탱해주는 뭔가를 가르쳐 주셨습니다. "
"바로 자긍심입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "4600854b-f3ba-4be4-94ec-45c6a67d3e50"
msgid ""
"\"Besides, they didn't abandon me. Once every six months, they would come "
"and visit me at the Order of the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}. We had some tea "
"and then had an hour to walk around the garden. Then they would take their "
"leave, as etiquette demanded.\""
msgstr ""
"\"게다가 그분들은 저를 버리지 않았습니다. 6개월에 한 번씩 {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g} 기사단으로 저를 찾아오시고는 "
"했습니다. 부모님은 저와 차를 마시고 한시간 동안 같이 정원을 산책했습니다. 그런 다음 예의를 갖춰 떠나시고는 했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "b95882d2-8ebc-4fd6-976e-14669a7c656e"
msgid ""
"\"A variety of things. Some of them appealed to me, others I simply couldn't "
"accept. I enjoyed the physical activities and swordsmanship. But the arts, "
"calligraphy, painting, poetry – and so many other ways to waste one's time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다양한 것들을 배웠습니다. 어떤 것들은 내 관심을 끌었고, 다른 어떤 것들은 도저히 받아들일 수 없었습니다. 저는 운동과 검술을 "
"즐겼습니다. 하지만 예술, 서예, 그림, 시 같은 시간 낭비들도 많았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "4aa9631a-3350-4b5b-b532-e5b2a7e5d986"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sighs.{/n} \"I guess that deep in my heart I always knew I'd "
"never be a true paladin of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}. Wielding a sword always "
"felt more natural to me than handling a paintbrush.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"마음속 깊은 곳에서는 나는 결코 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 진정한 팔라딘이 될 수 없다는 "
"것을 항상 알고 있었던 것 같습니다. 붓을 다루는 것보다 칼을 휘두르는 것이 언제나 더 자연스러웠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "71fc2b1a-f44e-415d-9004-1b555733eac5"
msgid ""
"\"Because of my heavenly beauty.\" {n}Valerie winces in contempt.{/n} "
"\"According to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} laws, all art is sacred – whatever "
"form it takes. Severe punishment awaits those who dare harm a painting, "
"sculpture or poem, no matter how worthless the drivel might be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 아름다움 때문입니다.\" {n}발레리는 경멸하며 찡그립니다.{/n} \"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 법에 따르면 모든 예술은 "
"신성한 것입니다. 회화, 조각, 시가 아무리 형편 없더라도 어떤 예술이든 훼손하는 자는 심한 형벌을 받습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "a74a3610-b38a-4f84-829c-da0ee4983311"
msgid ""
"\"My looks always attracted unwanted attention from the pilgrims and "
"acolytes at the temple. I received my first poem, dedicated to me, when I "
"was nine. The author was some wealthy geezer.\" {n}Valerie's lips thin in "
"contempt.{/n} \"And that was only the beginning.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 외모는 언제나 사원의 순례자들과 견습생들로부터 불필요한 관심을 끌었습니다. 저는 9살 때 저에게 헌정된 첫 시를 받았습니다. 시를 "
"쓴 사람은 부유한 괴짜였죠.\" {n}발레리의 입술은 경멸로 가늘어집니다.{/n} \"그리고 그것은 시작에 불과했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "531c6cb0-9892-447e-87e9-d8f5704ff2c6"
msgid ""
"\"Sculptures. Pictures. Poems. I was drowning in them. My admirers mobbed "
"me, and I had to respectfully accept all their... garbage. The clerics of "
"the temple were magnanimous, for my suitors made generous offerings to the "
"Church. But once... one time I just snapped.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조각품, 그림, 시, 저는 그것들 때문에 숨이 막혔습니다. 저를 따라다니는 자들은 저를 몰아부쳤고... 전 계속 그들의 쓰레기를 "
"정중히 받아들일 수밖에 없었습니다. 사원의 성직자들은 제 구혼자들이 교회에 기부를 했기에 아주 좋아했습니다. 하지만 한번... 저는 한번 "
"폭발한 적이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "dbbfd0b6-e1e7-496b-971b-72eef260309d"
msgid ""
"{n}Barely suppressed anger glitters across Valerie's eyes.{/n} \"Some "
"wealthy idiot has dedicated an extremely untalented poem to me, and he had "
"the nerve to read it right to my face, holding my sleeve. The hour was late, "
"and I was on my way to get some rest after a boring lesson on rhymes. I lost "
"control and tore the poem apart, right in front of him.\" {n}Valerie raises "
"her head proudly.{/n} \"The paladins wanted to impose some punishment upon "
"me, I don't remember which one exactly. They wanted me to repent. Instead I "
"just gathered my things and left.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}간신히 억눌린 분노가 발레리의 눈을 스치고 지나갑니다.{/n} \"그날도 어떤 부유한 바보가 제게 멍청한 시를 바쳤습니다. 그는 제 "
"소매를 붙들고 제 앞에서 그것을 읽어주었습니다. 늦은 시간이었고 저는 지루한 수업을 한 후에 휴식을 취하러 가는 중이었습니다. 저는 "
"자제력을 잃고 그 사람 바로 앞에서 시를 갈기갈기 찢어 버렸습니다.\" {n}발레리는 자랑스럽게 머리를 들어 올립니다.{/n} "
"\"팔라딘들은 저를 징계하고자 했고 어떤 징계였는지 기억하진 못합니다. 그들은 제가 회개하기를 원했지만 저는 짐을 싸고 떠났습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "3fae7521-db17-49e9-b693-3d5124ca85fd"
msgid ""
"\"I set off for {g|Restov}Restov{/g}.\" {n}Valerie shrugs.{/n} \"I wanted to "
"get as far away as possible from {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} and the destiny "
"everyone seemed so ready to force upon me. Besides, the school of "
"swordsmanship in Restov has quite a decent reputation. Honestly, I was "
"hoping for an opportunity to learn from the famous Aldori masters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}로 떠났습니다. \" {n}발레리는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"저는 가능한 한 "
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}과 저를 강요하던 사람들에게서 벗어나고 싶어했습니다. 게다가 레스토프에 있는 검술 학교는 꽤 괜찮은 평판을 "
"가지고 있었습니다. 솔직히 저는 유명한 알도리 소드로드에게서 배울 수있는 기회를 기대하고 있었습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "2133fcb3-9690-47d0-8a5b-9cc15e26b31f"
msgid ""
"\"Eventually it became clear that their technique wasn't a good fit for me. "
"They teach to avoid impact, whereas I prefer to raise my shield.\""
msgstr "\"제게는 소드로드 기술이 잘 맞지 않았습니다. 방패를 들어 막으면 될 공격을 피하라고 가르쳤으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "84b3bb85-bc29-4c08-a9fb-7fae0366b02e"
msgid ""
"\"But my abilities and skills, which I'd learned at the Order of the "
"{g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}, were enough to make the "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} take an interest in me. They offered me a "
"chance to join the mercenaries who served the Swordlords, and I accepted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g} 기사단에서 배운 저의 능력과 기술은 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}의 관심을 "
"끌기 충분했습니다. 그들은 소드로드를 섬기는 용병에 가입할 것을 권유했고 저는 받아들였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "1f4f9495-30b6-4cb9-85be-c44a6cc7c1b4"
msgid ""
"\"It's beyond my power to change that. But I've never given a potential "
"admirer any reason to start a conversation with me. But it doesn't stop "
"them! After leaving the Order, I took a dagger and cut off the long hair "
"they used to praise. Well, now I get letters praising the beauty of my eyes."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 그것을 변화시킬 수 없습니다. 대신 저를 좋아하는 남자들에게 대화의 빌미를 주지 않았습니다. 하지만 그걸로도 그들을 막을 수는 "
"없더군요! 교단을 떠난 후 저는 단검으로 저의 긴 머리를 잘랐습니다. 하지만 이제는 저의 눈이 아름답다는 편지를 받습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "68f8f9de-0d1d-4a0d-aadd-fb1aa1ed7e5d"
msgid ""
"\"It was because of my appearance that I ended up in the Order of the "
"{g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}, though I never wanted to be a paladin. It was "
"because of my beauty that an infinite number of suitors have pursued me, all "
"of them confusing simple politeness with hints of affection.\" {n}Valerie "
"clenches her fists.{/n} \"But do you know what I really want?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"성기사가 되고 싶었던 적은 한 순간도 없었지만 {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}의 기사단에 들어갔던건 순전히 외모 때문이었습니다. "
"끝없는 구혼을 받았던 것도 제 외모 때문이었습니다. 그들은 친절함과 애정 표현을 혼동하고 있었습니다. \" {n}발레리는 주먹을 쥐고 "
"있습니다.{/n} \"하지만 제가 정말로 원하는 것이 무엇인지 아십니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "e986ec0a-6b21-44be-95f1-6ce9ae66c602"
msgid ""
"\"I want people to stop treating me like a piece of art! I want them to "
"notice that I'm a person, that I'm capable of something more than smiling "
"for paintings, where I sit wearing a lacy satin dress, holding a basket of "
"peaches in my lap! Is that too much to ask?!\" {n}The last question comes "
"out in a shout, though Valerie doesn't seem to realize it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 나를 예술 작품처럼 대하지 않는 것이었습니다! 레이스 새틴 드레스를 입고 무릎에 복숭아 바구니를 올려놓고 웃음을 짓는 것보다 "
"더 많은 것을 할 수 있는 인간으로 봐주기를 바랬습니다! 제가 너무 많이 바라는 것입니까?!\" {n}발레리가 깨닫지 못했지만 마지막 "
"질문은 큰 소리로 나왔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "f8988cc5-ebc1-496e-bdfb-05760d299ef7"
msgid ""
"\"I am... truly happy that you understand me. Thank you!\" {n}Valerie smiles "
"at you gratefully, and the smile is full of a warmth that you never expected "
"from someone as stern as Valerie. You suddenly realize that you're smiling "
"back at her.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나를 이해해주는 것이 정말 행복합니다. 고맙습니다!\" {n}발레리는 당신을 향해 기쁘게 미소 지으며 그것은 발레리처럼 엄격한 "
"사람에게서 결코 기대하지 않았던 따뜻함으로 가득합니다. 당신은 그녀에게 미소 짓고 있다는 것을 문득 깨닫습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "f15d1f41-2c48-4cb2-8eb7-8fa4d2e0a24b"
msgid ""
"\"You're talking just like my mentor at the Order used to!\" {n}But then "
"Valerie regains her self control and hides her contempt behind her polite "
"mask.{/n}"
msgstr "\"기사단의 스승님처럼 말하시는군요!\" {n}하지만 발레리는 절제를 되찾고 정중한 표정 뒤에 경멸을 숨깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "3a813b1c-b3f6-422d-a466-e3d11e3eb5dd"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie breathes heavily for a moment, gasping awkwardly. As the meaning "
"of your words finally become clear to her, she regains control over "
"herself.{/n} \"I humbly beg your pardon,\" {n}she says calmly.{/n} \"That "
"will never happen again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 숨을 몰아쉬는데 어색하게 헐떡거립니다. 마침내 당신의 말의 의미가 그녀에게 분명해지면서 자신에 대한 통제력을 "
"회복합니다.{/n} \"제 사과를 받아주십시오.\" {n}그녀는 침착하게 말합니다.{/n} \"이런 일은 다시는 일어나지 않을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "887415c8-2b6a-40fc-904a-742f17587f2e"
msgid "\"You have my attention.\" {n}Valerie bows politely.{/n}"
msgstr "\"말씀하십시오.\" {n}발레리는 정중하게 인사를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "9d8264ac-3288-424f-93da-0fa633dcac81"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie gives you a stony look.{/n} \"I sincerely hope your words carry "
"nothing more than mere politeness.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신을 차갑게 봅니다.{/n} \"당신의 말들이 친절함 이상의 것이 아니기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "64c7c0fe-b6d3-437a-9f9d-a7c29cf9cf4a"
msgid ""
"\"That is good.\" {n}Valerie nods.{/n} \"In that case I thank you for the "
"compliment, and would ask that you never bring up the subject again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋습니다.\" {n}발레리는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 칭찬에 감사드리고 그 주제에 대해서 말하지 않았으면 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "b54e9435-2a6e-4b50-b5a5-930e7ebf3cc6"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie folds her arms across her chest.{/n} \"With all due respect, I "
"ask that you never bring this up again. If, of course, you value my company "
"and our friendship.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"정중하게 이 문제에 대해 이야기 하지 말 것을 부탁드립니다. 우리의 우정을 생각한다면요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "215e38c2-a82a-4203-8002-3c89ba8b30f8"
msgid ""
"\"So you like me, but won't seek my favor? Well, that's something new.\" {n}"
"Valerie raises her eyebrow and smiles, but this smile expresses amusement, "
"not her usual cold arrogance.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 당신은 저를 좋아하지만 제 호의는 바라지 않겠다는 건가요? 그건 참신하군요.\" {n}발레리는 눈썹을 올리고 미소를 짓지만 그 "
"미소는 평소의 냉정한 거만함이 아니라 즐거움을 표현하는 것 같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "b5b2dd44-4737-4338-a878-7bbf9a17bdeb"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie folds her arms across her chest.{/n} \"In that case, I must "
"confess: even if I were to enter a courtship, I'd prefer a relationship with "
"a man. I beg your pardon if I've disappointed you.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"연애는 남자와 하고 싶군요. 실망시켜드렸다면 죄송합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "71db8fd5-122e-45cc-92fd-6c7b6448d9fc"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} is a goddess of love, beauty, and art. Her paladins "
"are something like armored artists — that's how they like to think of "
"themselves at least. \""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}은 사랑, 아름다움, 예술의 여신입니다. 그녀의 팔라딘들은 무장한 예술가와 비슷합니다. 최소한 자신들 "
"스스로는 그렇게 생각하고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "3b6d537c-7f2b-4f80-825a-c0f26a082f22"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie tries to contain her feelings, but her inner contempt bursts "
"forth.{/n} \"They are fanatical defenders of worthless, inartistic paintings "
"and meaningless opuses, if you care to know my opinion.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 자신의 감정을 담아내려 노력하지만 그녀의 내면에는 경멸이 터져 나옵니다.{/n} \"내 의견을 알고 싶다면 말해드리지요. "
"그들은 가치없고, 비예술적인 그림들과 무의미한 작품들을 옹호하는 광신자들입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "40802a51-2cf1-4209-98e0-14e31f82e9d5"
msgid ""
"\"She's been trying to ruin my life.\" {n}Valerie snorts.{/n} \""
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} — the goddess of everything useless that ever existed "
"in this life. All the beauty in the world, all the art, all the soulful "
"sighs in the moonlight — they'll never feed a single family.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 내 인생을 망치려 했습니다.\" {n}발레리가 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g} -'이 생애 존재하는 "
"모든 쓸모없는 것들의 여신. 세상의 모든 아름다움, 모든 예술, 모든 영혼이 달빛 속에서 한숨 짓노라'- 그런 것들로는 가족 하나도 절대 "
"먹여살리지 못할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "83f21529-fc20-4950-b919-b9092eb03ff8"
msgid ""
"\"And I beg you to restrain yourself from offering your own opinion. Trust "
"me, I've heard everything you can tell me — more than once. Nothing, and "
"nobody, can change my mind.\" {n}Valerie looks at you with suspicion.{/n} "
"\"As for {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, she's the goddess of idlers. I almost joined "
"her preposterous entourage. I'm just glad I was smart enough to denounce her "
"while I still could.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혹시 이것에 대해 하고싶은 말이 있더라도 자제해주시길 부탁합니다. 장담컨데, 당신이 하려는 말은 이미 최소한 한번씩은 다 들었던 "
"것들입니다. 하지만 아무것도, 그 누구도, 제 마음을 바꾸지 못합니다.\" {n}발레리는 당신을 의심스럽게 바라봅니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}은 게으름뱅이의 여신입니다. 저는 그녀의 터무니없는 측근이 될 뻔했습니다. 늦기 전에 그녀를 비난할 만큼 "
"제가 똑똑했기에 기쁩니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "6492f527-adf0-4d19-b947-b6a7dbbb5271"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't agree more! If I can be frank, all this talk about "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} makes me want to spit. But my noble upbringing prevents "
"me from performing such an undignified act.\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 얘기하는것에는 동의할 수 없습니다! 솔직히 말하자면 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에 대해 이야기만 나눠도 침을 뱉고 싶게 합니다. "
"하지만 어렸을때부터 배운 귀족 교육이 제가 그런 품위 없는 행동을 할 수 없게 막을뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "3c8e4a2d-46f0-402c-b75e-4185a96b9a5e"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, that. I used to... embroider. And I still do from time to time.\" {n}A "
"treacherous blush covers Valerie's cheeks.{/n} \"It's nothing, I assure you. "
"Just a simple task to keep my hands busy and keep the gloomy thoughts at "
"bay. Nothing special.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 그건. 저는 예전에...자수를 놓고는 했습니다. 지금도 가끔씩 하기도 합니다.\" {n}홍조가 발레리의 뺨을 덮습니다.{/n} "
"\"아무 뜻도 없습니다. 장담합니다. 우울한 생각을 떨치기 위해 손을 바쁘게 하려고 하는 것일뿐, 특별한 뜻은 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "ebd7d490-031a-4035-8e50-f87f582fee68"
msgid ""
"\"Is that what you think?\" {n}Valerie curves an eyebrow, mocking "
"amazement.{/n} \"Many share that delusion. I was deluded too, for a while.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 생각하십니까?\" {n}발레리는 놀란 기색을 숨기려는 듯 눈썹 한쪽을 내립니다.{/n} \"많은 사람들이 그런 착각을 "
"하곤합니다. 저도 한때 그런 착각에 빠졌던 적이 있었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "8b91edad-74c7-4369-976c-b7a34b1af603"
msgid ""
"\"Now I consider all works of art useless. People create this garbage "
"because they have nothing better to do. The peasant doesn't paint a picture; "
"he ploughs the earth to feed his family. The soldier has no time for "
"sculpture; he must defend his homeland. But idlers and slackers have plenty "
"of time to waste, so they smear canvases with paint, and imagine they've "
"done something worthy and valuable.\" {n}Valerie shakes her head in "
"disapproval.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"모든 예술 작품은 쓸데없는 것이라고 생각합니다. 사람들은 할 일이 없어서 쓰레기를 만듭니다. 농민은 그림을 그리지 않고 땅을 일구어 "
"가족을 먹여살립니다. 군인은 나라를 지켜야 하기때문에 조각을 할 시간이 없습니다. 하지만 게으름뱅이들은 낭비 할 시간이 넘쳐나기 때문에, "
"물감으로 캔버스를 칠하고는 가치 있고 값진 일을 했다고 상상합니다.\" {n}발레리는 못마땅해하며 고개를 가로짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "abcce4be-227f-48ad-be63-d777fa38c32c"
msgid ""
"\"They wander around, seeking the next pile of garbage. And when they find "
"it, they call it an immortal piece of art, and admire it until they're blue "
"in the face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 다음 쓰레기를 찾아 헤메고 있습니다. 다음 쓰레기를 발견하면 불멸의 명작이라 칭하며, 숨이 차오를 때까지 감탄합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "5959dd58-7e70-480a-aba8-7a28473e4438"
msgid ""
"\"You might not believe this, but the paladins of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} "
"aren't allowed to slay their enemies if they beg for mercy. Can you guess "
"why? Because a bandit, rapist, or murderer who has been put to the sword "
"will never be able to create something beautiful in the future. So a paladin "
"overpowers her enemy in battle, then inspires him to create a masterpiece.\" "
"{n}Valerie's face reflects extreme disgust.{/n} \"It might sound hilarious "
"if it weren't true.\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿지 않을지도 모르지만 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘들은 자비를 바라는 적을 죽일 수 없습니다. 왜 그런지 아십니까? 칼에 "
"찔린 강도, 살인자는 예술작품을 만들 수 없기 때문이죠. 그래서 팔라딘들은 전투에서 적을 제압하고 나면, 그에게 영감을 준 후 명작을 "
"만들도록 지시합니다.\" {n}발레리의 얼굴에 극도의 혐오감이 비칩니다.{/n} \"이 말이 사실이 아니었다면, 우스꽝스러운 농담 정도로 "
"들렸을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "249bec90-599d-4874-9ce9-6bc20b9e83b4"
msgid ""
"\"Plus, all of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} followers are obliged to practice some "
"sort of art in his or her free time. Every single day, no matter what else "
"is going on, even if you're feeling sick, or hungry, or sleepy. Otherwise, "
"according to their clerics, you lose your connection with your goddess. A "
"preposterous notion, wouldn't you agree?\""
msgstr ""
"\"게다가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g} 추종자들은 여가 시간에 예술을 해야 할 의무가 있습니다. 매일매일, 무슨일이 있더라도, 몸이 "
"아프거나 배고플지라도, 이 의무를 지켜야 하지요. 그렇지 않으면 성직자들에 의해 여신과의 유대를 잃게됩니다. 터무니 없는 생각이지 "
"않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "6e6ac7f0-b609-4a5d-8e69-0792dd2db4a1"
msgid ""
"\"I am... truly happy that you understand me. Thank you!\" {n}Valerie smiles "
"at you gratefully, and the smile is full of a warmth that you never expected "
"from someone as stern as Valerie. You suddenly realize that you're smiling "
"back at her.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나를 이해해주는 것이 정말 행복합니다. 고맙습니다!\" {n}발레리는 당신을 향해 기쁘게 미소 지으며 그것은 발레리처럼 엄격한 "
"사람에게서 결코 기대하지 않았던 따뜻함으로 가득합니다. 당신은 그녀에게 미소 짓고 있다는 것을 문득 깨닫습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92457_Text
msgctxt "73c0d4e0-6fd2-4ebd-a464-99a53a967312"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is silent for a couple of moments.{/n} \"Is this decision final?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 몇 분 동안 침묵합니다.{/n} \"정말 확정하신 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92460_Text
msgctxt "6e442aac-50e5-465f-86e0-818d4defbd06"
msgid ""
"\"In that case I would ask you to avoid such ridiculous jokes in the future. "
"I invest a lot in our friendship and my service to your cause, and I am "
"troubled by the fact that you neglect my goodwill.\""
msgstr "\"그런 농담은 그만둬 주십시오. 저는 우리의 우정에 많은 공을 들였는데 당신이 저의 의지를 무시한다면 괴로울 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92461_Text
msgctxt "28cef034-5c77-48b1-bad1-bc875417c11a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sighs but keeps her face calm.{/n} \"I can't help but notice that "
"this is quite unexpected. It's a shame, really. I hope you won't regret this "
"in the future. Now forgive me, I must ready my leave.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 한숨을 쉬지만 얼굴을 차분하게 유지합니다.{/n} \"예상할 수 없는 일이 벌어지다니. 정말 안타깝습니다. 나중에 후회하지 "
"마시기를 바랍니다. 용서하십시오. 저는 떠나야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92463_Text
msgctxt "37c789e0-61fc-419b-a7ec-25636b2a977a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you unblinking, and you see her eyes darken with an "
"anger she can barely contain.{/n} \"Really? May I take a look at this letter?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 눈하나 깜짝하지 않고 당신을 바라보는데 그녀의 눈동자는 참을 수 없는 분노로 어두워집니다.{/n} \"정말입니까? 이 "
"편지를 봐도 되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92464_Text
msgctxt "ae82712e-1902-4f4c-8b17-8f3934203cfb"
msgid ""
"\"Hm... Is that so?.. I see.\" {n}Valerie takes a deep breath.{/n} \"My "
"apologies, {name}. I seem to have become the reason for this message and "
"highly inappropriate demands it contains. I know this person. Fredero Sinnet "
"is one of the mentors in the Order of the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}. A true "
"paladin of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} – one of those who insist they are right "
"till the very end. He kept saying louder than anyone that Shelyn herself "
"predetermined my fate, even when I was packing my things before I left.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 그렇군요? 알겠습니다.\" {n}발레리는 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"사과를 받아주십시오. {name}. 이 편지가 부적절한 "
"요구를 해오고 있는군요. 저는 이 사람을 압니다. 프레데로 신넷은 {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g} 교단의 멘토입니다. 끝까지 "
"자신들이 옳다고 주장하는 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 진정한 성기사이지요. 그는 제가 떠나기 전까지 저의 운명을 운운한 사람입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92465_Text
msgctxt "1e083582-6da4-4d74-8e70-327634de5c01"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like he never came to terms with me leaving, since he found me even "
"here. But the nerve! 'The mistake of leaving our ranks'! 'Return to the path "
"destined her by divine will'! Since when does Fredero fancy himself the "
"personal harbinger of his precious {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}?\" {n}Valerie, her "
"face scarlet red, doesn't seem to notice the letter crumpling in her "
"hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아무래도 내가 떠나는 걸 용납못한 모양입니다. 하지만 그게 무슨 소리입니까! 우리를 떠난 게 실수라니! 신의 뜻에 따라 다시 "
"돌아오라니! 언제부터 그가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 전령이 되었던 거죠?\" {n}그녀의 얼굴은 주홍색으로 물들었고 손에 편지가 "
"구겨진 것도 알아차리지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92466_Text
msgctxt "4cc61e8e-5803-413a-8980-3ef70fdc7b3b"
msgid ""
"\"Enough. We must put an end to this. If paladins of the Order of the "
"{g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g} require another refusal, they shall get it! I'm "
"going to the trading post with you to meet Fredero. I serve you – it's as "
"simple as that. It's my decision, and I'm not going to change it just "
"because someone from my past thinks otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"충분합니다. 우린 반드시 이 일의 끝을 봐야 합니다. {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g} 교단의 팔라딘이 저에게서 또 한번 "
"거부당하기를 원한다면 바라는대로 해주죠! 저는 당신과 함께 프레데로를 만나기 위해 교역소로 갈 것입니다. 저는 당신을 섬길거고 이것이 제 "
"결정입니다. 제 과거의 누군가가 다르게 생각한다고 해도 이 생각은 바뀌지 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92470_Text
msgctxt "67466862-b3b0-485b-a3d5-c243c3c84b88"
msgid "{n}Valerie smiles faintly and nods.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 희미하게 웃으며 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92471_Text
msgctxt "2e4163ca-dfd7-4145-8542-97e8734fc916"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shakes her head.{/n} \"We can't. Fredero Sinnet may be in the "
"wrong, but that's no reason to show myself – and you – as uncultured "
"barbarians. At least he didn't appear unannounced at court with his demands. "
"I must at least give him credit for this superficial politeness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"그럴 수 없습니다. 프레데로 신넷은 틀릴 수도 있지만 그렇다고 저나 당신이 무시할 이유는 "
"되지 않습니다. 미개한 야만인들 처럼요. 적어도 그는 요구사항을 가지고 사전통지도 없이 불쑥 나타난 건 아닙니다. 최소한 저는 그에게 "
"예의를 표해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92474_Text
msgctxt "0e9b1ebf-0661-40fe-86dd-f248efea64e4"
msgid ""
"\"No! If you respect my honor and value my loyalty, please refrain from such "
"hasty actions. I will go to the trading post with you. I will meet Sinnet, "
"give him my final refusal, and the matter will be settled. Enough about that."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요! 저의 명예와 충성심을 존중하신다면 그런 성급한 행동은 말아주십시오. 저는 당신과 함께 교역소로 갈 것입니다. 신넷을 만나 "
"최종적으로 거부의 뜻을 전하고 다음의 일을 결정하겠습니다. 그걸로 충분합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92476_Text
msgctxt "e4f400af-af6e-400d-ba90-a7d86da8afa3"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie waves off your words – with more haste than prudence.{/n} \"Please"
" don't worry about such trifles. I will visit a priest or an alchemist when "
"time permits. As for how I feel...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 성급하게 당신의 말을 끊습니다.{/n} \"그런 하찮은 일은 걱정 마십시오. 시간이 허락 하는대로 사제나 연금술사를 "
"방문할겁니다. 지금 저는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92477_Text
msgctxt "4d8245ce-9803-4f4e-8ace-b0f7892f2a26"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles sourly.{/n} \"It's my pride that suffered most. It seems I "
"must devote more time to training. I will keep this in mind in the future, "
"and not let you down again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 시큰둥하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"가장 고통받은 건 제 자존심입니다. 훈련에 더 많은 시간을 쏟아야 할 것 같아요. 앞으로는 "
"이 점을 명심하고, 다시는 실망시키지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92478_Text
msgctxt "2ce41f1e-b575-472e-94b6-0f92decad459"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie raises her chin up.{/n} \"I admit, I expected no other outcome "
"from this duel. As I've always said, {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} paladins are "
"pompous dolts, capable of little else beyond admiring useless garbage and "
"pining after poetry.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 턱을 올립니다.{/n} \"저는 이 결투에서 다른 결과를 기대하지 않았습니다. 제가 항상 말했듯이 "
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 성기사들은 고풍스럽고 쓸모없는 쓰레기에 감탄하는 거만한 멍청이들입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92479_Text
msgctxt "e77551ed-0b17-43b0-ae39-73af06c427fe"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is silent for a few moments. When she starts talking, her voice "
"sounds dull.{/n} \"I never thought my encounter with Fredero might end like "
"this.\" {n}She lingers for a few moments.{/n} \"If it hadn't, he would "
"probably have never given up on trying to return me to the Order.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 침묵합니다. 그녀가 말하기 시작하는데 그녀의 목소리가 둔합니다.{/n} \"나는 프레데로와의 만남이 이렇게 끝날 "
"거라 생각하지 않았습니다.\" {n}그녀는 잠시 침묵합니다..{/n} \"그렇지 않다면 저를 교단으로 돌려 보내려는 것을 포기하지 않았을 "
"것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92480_Text
msgctxt "a7b3ea0e-7e2c-4338-9ada-9dc97f9bb676"
msgid ""
"\"I should thank you, {name}. It's important to me that you were at my side. "
"Now I'm sure that I'm finally free from the Order of the {g|Shelyn}Eternal "
"Rose{/g}, and ready to devote all my time and efforts to our mission.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신에게 감사를 전하고 싶습니다. {name}. 당신이 내 곁에 있었다는 것이 나에겐 중요합니다. 저는 마침내 {g|Shelyn} "
"영원한 장미{/g} 교단으로부터 자유로워졌고, 제 모든 시간과 노력을 우리의 임무에 바칠 준비가 되었음을 확신합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92482_Text
msgctxt "fed60cd5-f606-41b4-a728-30fad909e0ee"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie knits her eyebrows for a moment, but the girl quickly restores "
"her usual calm expression.{/n} \"Your order is law. Fredero will just have "
"to accept silence for an answer.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 미간이 잠시 좁아졌지만 이내 그녀는 평소의 침착함을 되찾습니다.{/n} \"당신의 명령은 법입니다. 프레데로는 침묵을 "
"받아들이기만 하면 됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92484_Text
msgctxt "6828a124-2db3-4fdc-baf4-e8a00476f6f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie rolls her eyes.{/n} \"If it's about that bard again, I've "
"apologized to him already! As you demanded!\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"그 바드라면 이미 사과했습니다! 당신이 원하는 대로요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92488_Text
msgctxt "e4a5989f-c129-49ef-a00f-8ba36a39b562"
msgid ""
"\"The Storyteller... What business of his if I have anything left from the "
"Order? Does he imagine I'm still carrying around {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} "
"radiant face as a souvenir?! And as for Linzi... she knows full well how her "
"constant babbling about her book irritates me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이야기꾼... 내가 교단에 뭘 남겼든 말든 그가 무슨 상관입니까? 내가 아직도 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 광휘를 기념품처럼 들고 "
"다니기라도 한다는 건가요?! 린지는... 짜증나게도 자신의 책에 대해 어찌나 지껄이던지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92489_Text
msgctxt "70881bf2-4415-4a31-8736-19efc861dbcf"
msgid ""
"\"Who else could it have been about?! That scribbler used to never leave me "
"alone – dogged my heels asking questions whenever I appeared on the street, "
"and now...\" {n}Valerie stops angrily and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그밖에 누가 그랬을까요?! 그 글쟁이는 나를 절대 혼자 두지 않고 길거리에 나올 때마다 내 다리를 잡고 집요하게 질문을 던졌습니다. "
"그리고 지금은...\" {n}발레리는 화를 내며 말을 멈추었고 곧 시선을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92490_Text
msgctxt "99641817-fb0a-4545-a975-2a3c55b14018"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie narrows her eyes.{/n} \"So the captain of the guard thinks I'm "
"incapable of carrying out my duties to you and your subjects? Perhaps he "
"should change his armor for a judge's mantle, if he's so ready to declare "
"such verdicts?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 눈을 가늘게 뜹니다.{/n} \"경비대장이 제가 의무를 수행할 능력이 없다고 생각한다고요? 그렇게 남에 대해 판결을 "
"내릴거면 갑옷을 벗고 법복을 입으라죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92496_Text
msgctxt "e1453acc-fa13-498f-98ee-758d7d2e2516"
msgid ""
"{n}When the girl starts talking again, her voice sounds soft.{/n} \"Please "
"forgive me, {name}. I understand your worries. My behavior over the last few "
"weeks has indeed left much to be desired. I don't know why I'm doing these "
"things.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀가 다시 말을 시작했고 목소리는 부드럽게 들립니다.{/n} \"제발 용서해주세요. {name}. 당신의 걱정을 이해합니다. 지난 "
"몇 주 동안 내 행동은 정말로 후회스럽습니다. 내가 왜 이런 일들을 하는지 모르겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92497_Text
msgctxt "2672c1ee-4fe9-4a81-957c-d293368fc207"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you, raising her brow.{/n} \"Was that a joke? If so, it "
"was inappropriate. I don't think anyone is worse or below me. There's a "
"different reason.\" {n}Valerie gathers her strength before she continues.{/n}"
" \"I think I fooled myself when I kept saying that I don't care about this "
"scar on my face.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신을 쳐다보며 눈썹을 올립니다.{/n} \"그게 농담이었습니까? 정말 부적절하군요. 나는 남들을 하찮게 여기지 않습니다. "
"다른 이유가 있습니다.\" {n}발레리는 계속하기 전에 힘을 모읍니다.{/n} \"나는 얼굴에 흉터를 신경쓰지 않는다고 스스로를 "
"속였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92501_Text
msgctxt "dc9117e2-da2b-4ee0-b64f-b69e6553e6d0"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl hesitates, lifts her hand and touches the scar on her face.{/n} "
"\"Since it appeared, it's like the world around me has changed. Wherever I "
"went before, my admirers, followers, and bards used to follow me around... "
"and now it's like I'm invisible. Worse! – I see how those I talk to trying "
"hard not to look at the scar. It's like... it undid me. Completely.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 망설이다가 얼굴의 흉터를 만집니다.{/n} \"흉터가 생긴 후로 나를 둘러싼 모든 세상이 변한 것만 같습니다. 어디를 가든, "
"나를 뒤쫓던 구혼자와 음유시인들이... 이젠 나를 투명인간 취급합니다. 더 끔찍한 건! 흉터를 보지 않으려고 애쓰면서 말하는 사람들을 볼 "
"때에요. 그건 정말이지... 제 기분을 망치고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92502_Text
msgctxt "5e62916b-0940-4741-91aa-908bee6989a7"
msgid ""
"\"So typical of her – a superficial opinion, a superficial conclusion...\" "
"{n}Valerie sighs.{/n} \"Forgive me. It's difficult to admit I was wrong. And "
"scatterbrained Linzi is apparently right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제멋대로 의견을 내고 얄팍한 결론을 짓는 게 전형적인 그녀군요...\" {n}발레리가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"용서하십시오. 제가 "
"틀렸다는 걸 인정하기란 어렵네요. 분명 산만한 린지가 옳아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92503_Text
msgctxt "177dbea0-fb67-4724-8635-611351a92569"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie keeps silent for so long you start to think the conversation is "
"over. Then she finally lowers her head.{/n} \"I was wrong when I thought I "
"didn't care about the scar on my face. On the contrary...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}대화가 끝났다고 느껴질 때 쯤 발레리는 침묵을 깹니다.{/n} \"흉터를 신경쓰지 않는다고 했을 때부터 잘못되었습니다. 반면에..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92504_Text
msgctxt "c107283a-905c-4e44-bdd3-1ffaca3427c8"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie stops again, absently running the tips of her fingers over the "
"ugly scar on her face. She finally pulls her hand from her face and looks at "
"you.{/n} \"I've never seriously imagined what would happen if I lost my "
"beauty. I thought my actions would speak much louder than my appearance... "
"but now I'm having doubts. In this, and in everything else I keep telling "
"myself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 다시 멈추고 아무렇지 않은 듯 흉터를 따라 손가락을 그립니다. 그녀는 얼굴에서 손을 떼고 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} "
"\"아름다움을 잃으면 어떻게 되는지 심각하게 생각해 보지 않았습니다. 제 겉모습보다 제 행동이 문제였군요... 하지만 이제 궁금한 건 "
"계속해서 제 자신에게 물어볼 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92510_Text
msgctxt "607e48d5-538b-4fdd-ba96-4ce7828d2832"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you pensively for a few moments, then shakes her head "
"with determination.{/n} \"No. If I'm to break when someone looks at me "
"askance, after everything I've been through... it means I've never actually "
"been worth anything! I may as well have stayed with the Order and lived "
"meekly by {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} orders... Ugh!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 동안 싶은 생각에 잠겨 당신을 바라보고 결심한 듯 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아닙니다. 타인의 시선으로 제가 "
"무너진다면... 제가 겪은 모든 일은 헛되다는 의미겠지요! 그랬다면 저는 교단에 머물러 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 명령을 받들며 "
"온순하게 살았을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92511_Text
msgctxt "bcf5bbe8-6d15-4ce5-9739-2a9dfa5b326b"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks down.{/n} \"I don't know how to be weak, {name}. This is "
"not what I was taught.\" {n}The girl smiles sadly.{/n} \"You know, when they "
"buried my grandmother, I didn't shed a tear. My mother was frightened for my "
"cold heart, and my father thought this was another reason I should become "
"one of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} paladins. But in fact I simply don't know how "
"to weep over something I've lost.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 시선을 떨굽니다.{/n} \"저는 약해지는 방법을 모릅니다. {name}. 이건 제가 배운 게 아니에요.\" {n}그녀는 "
"슬프게 웃습니다.{/n} \"아시다시피 그들이 저의 할머니를 묻었을 때 저는 눈물 한 방울 흘리지 않았어요. 어머니는 저의 냉정함을 "
"걱정하셨고, 아버지는 이것이 제가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 성기사가 되어야 하는 또 다른 이유라고 생각하셨습니다. 그러나 사실 "
"저는 잃어버린 것에 대해 어떻게 눈물을 흘려야 할지 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92512_Text
msgctxt "9eff1ee0-157b-4514-a143-cd1652b1ff1c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie runs her fingers through her hair and sighs.{/n} \"Thank you. Now "
"I know what to do. Since I don't know how to cry and wail, I'll do something "
"useful. There's a lot of people I need to apologize to.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 손가락으로 머리카락을 빗으며 한숨을 짓습니다.{/n} \"고맙습니다. 이제 어떻게 해야 할지 알았습니다. 우는 방법을 "
"몰랐지만 해야 할 일을 알았습니다. 이제 사람들에게 사과를 해야겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92513_Text
msgctxt "e89060ab-46ff-4ed4-9a54-e98e4dc0bcc0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie straightens her shoulders and looks around with determination.{/n}"
" \"I shouldn't have wasted time on these useless thoughts. I promise that "
"you won't be bothered again by complaints about me... except perhaps from "
"those who truly deserved a harsh response.\" {n}The girl nods to you.{/n} "
"\"Thank you for this conversation. I knew you would support me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 어깨를 곧게 펴고 결심한 듯 주위를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"이 쓸모 없는 생각으로 시간 낭비하지 않겠습니다. 저에 대한 "
"소문으로 귀찮게 해드리지 않겠다고 약속하겠습니다... 당해도 싼 녀석들을 혼내주는 것을 제외하고는요.\" {n}그녀는 당신에게 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n} \"대화에 감사드립니다. 저를 응원해주실 줄 알았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92515_Text
msgctxt "c9ea21f1-de62-49a6-accc-4861dbda9381"
msgid ""
"\"Physically it causes me no discomfort whatsoever. So if you are worried it "
"might prevent me from serving you, then you shouldn't be.\""
msgstr "\"전혀 불편하지 않습니다. 그 때문에 제가 당신을 섬기지 못할거라 걱정하셨다면 그러지 않으셔도 됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92517_Text
msgctxt "ac5bdfd5-6a81-40ed-8c71-7339d74b0a35"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles softly.{/n} \"It's amazing, but they seem not to feel "
"insulted by my rash words. But of course, I delivered all due apologies.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"놀라운 경험이지만 저에 대한 혹평이 모욕적이지는 않군요. 저는 모두 사과했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92518_Text
msgctxt "44b42789-e586-41a9-b890-2e5f1cf32799"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie chuckles.{/n} \"Satisfactory. It appears that the Storyteller has "
"thought it best to leave me alone, which I do not mind at all. Linzi...\" {n}"
"Valerie shrugs her shoulder.{/n} \"I expect I'll never have any influence "
"over her inappropriate enthusiasm about her book.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 웃었습니다.{/n} \"만족스럽습니다. 저는 신경쓰지 않았지만 이야기꾼이 저를 내버려두는 것이 최선이라고 생각했습니다. "
"린지는...\" {n}발레리는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"책에 집착하는 그녀에게 제가 간섭하지 않기를 바랄 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92520_Text
msgctxt "a5ed5b88-3407-4126-b2df-f028e6fdecbe"
msgid ""
"\"Let me guess – from Linzi, right? She keeps poking her nose into other "
"people's business...\" {n}Valerie lowers her head sadly.{/n} \"Forgive me, "
"{name}. I was hoping I'd manage this without your help this time, which is "
"why I didn't tell you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지인지 알고 있습니다. 그녀는 다른 사람의 일에 간섭을 잘하니까요...\" {n}발레리는 슬프게 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} "
"\"용서하십시오. {name}. 이번에는 당신의 도움없이 해결하기를 바랬습니다. 그래서 말하지 않았습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92521_Text
msgctxt "0187980e-2b01-4ee8-b725-14db9dea75b5"
msgid ""
"\"A while ago I received a letter from a new temple of Shelyn on the "
"outskirts of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, from a paladin of the Order of Prisms. This "
"time they're not demanding that I return to the Order. Instead they want me "
"to go there and submit to a great divine trial, and answer for all my "
"transgressions in front of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} worthy servants!\" {n}"
"Valerie scoffs in indignation.{/n} \"Of course, I tore up the letter and "
"tried to forget about it... but now they've begun to plot against the entire "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼마 전에 저는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 외곽의 셸린 사원에서 프리즘 교단의 성기사로부터 편지를 받았습니다. 이번에는 교단으로 "
"돌아오라는 내용은 없었습니다. 대신 그들은 제가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 추종자들 앞에서 심판을 받으라고 하더군요!\" {n}"
"발레리는 분노하며 콧방귀를 뀝니다.{/n} \"물론 저는 편지를 찢어 버리고 잊어버리려고 했습니다... 하지만 그들은 이제 당신의 "
"영지에서 음모를 꾸미기 시작했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92522_Text
msgctxt "fa84926f-0bfb-4b08-9b0c-4b6324005dbe"
msgid ""
"\"I was hoping that I could just ignore them this time too, but it seems I "
"shall have to meet these stubborn fools face to face, and explain to them "
"what their tricks might lead to!\""
msgstr "\"이번에도 그들을 무시할 수 있기를 바랬지만 이 고집 센 바보들을 만나서 그들의 어리석은 짓의 대가를 알려주겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92523_Text
msgctxt "d74caebc-3431-4c2a-a56c-5cb7029243c2"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe if I do go there, I'll be able to convince them to leave us alone. "
"Who knows... maybe it would be for the best if I appear for this trial.\" {n}"
"Valerie doesn't notice herself raising her hand and touching her scar.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"제가 그곳에 가면 우리를 내버려두라고 설득할 수 있을 것입니다. 혹시 모르죠... 제가 심판을 받으러 가는 게 좋을지도요.\" {n}"
"발레리는 자신이 손을 들고 흉터를 만지는 것을 눈치 채지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92528_Text
msgctxt "7f83a0c1-3ff8-492f-9103-b6f17f2cebe1"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie arches her brow.{/n} \"You hope they will just get tired of "
"slandering you? Fredero came for me many years after I left the order. I "
"don't think this Order of Prisms is less stubborn than the Order of the "
"{g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}. Judging by their actions, and the tone of the "
"letter I received, I'm inclined to believe that the Order of Prisms is even "
"more fanatical in their beliefs, not less.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 눈썹이 팔자가 됩니다.{/n} \"그들이 당신을 비방하다 지쳤으면 좋겠습니까? 프레데로는 몇년 전에 제가 교단을 떠났다고 "
"쫓아온 인물입니다. 이 프리즘 교단이 {g|Shelyn} 영원한 장미{/g} 교단보다 덜하지는 않을 것입니다. 그들의 행동을 보건데 "
"프리즘 교단은 더욱 광신적인 집단입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92531_Text
msgctxt "a9e690be-0739-459e-b528-7b583be11ae4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie licks her lips in hesitation.{/n} \"You should. But if that is "
"your order, then I will obey it. I only hope you will change your mind.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 주저하며 입술을 핥습니다.{/n} \"그렇게 하십시오. 당신의 명령이었다면 따르겠습니다. 그저 당신의 마음이 바뀌기를 "
"바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92532_Text
msgctxt "cace2402-5d16-403c-86bd-8959f2ae30e9"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I am ready to go to the Temple of Prisms as soon as you have "
"the time.\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다. 괜찮으시다면 저는 프리즘 사원으로 떠날 준비가 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92533_Text
msgctxt "ee867f6a-328e-4e27-8e3c-bef088d8e2e4"
msgid ""
"\"How? They challenged not only me, but you too, trying to smear "
"{kingdomname} in the eyes of all your neighbors! No, my presence alone will "
"not be enough to put an end to this pernicious influence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게요? 그들은 저뿐만 아니라 당신에게도 도전하며 이웃들이 {kingdomname}의 명예가 더럽혀지는 걸 보기를 원합니다. 저 "
"혼자서는 그들의 악행을 끝내지 못합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92535_Text
msgctxt "ba764cd3-e281-4650-ab4b-e3d25f7aa0c1"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie twists her lips and looks away, as if she wants to end the "
"conversation.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 마치 대화를 끝내고 싶어하듯 입술을 비틀며 시선을 피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92538_Text
msgctxt "1ccf65ba-9c80-4494-b2be-dc33b21b7f6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shakes her head angrily.{/n} \"So you attack me over someone "
"else's complaints? Well! I shall limit my communications with the others, if "
"you're so bothered by it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 화가 치밀어 부르르 떱니다.{/n} \"그래서 다른 누군가의 불만으로 저를 공격한 겁니까? 흥! 그렇게 귀찮으시다면 다른 "
"사람과 이야기를 하지 않겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92542_Text
msgctxt "985d7cc1-db90-478d-b350-b01aa2f45415"
msgid ""
"\"If you are going to bring up that scene in the throne room, don't waste "
"your breath. Eveld completely deserved that speech.\""
msgstr "\"알현실의 그 장면을 끄집어낼 거라면, 시간 낭비 하지 않는게 좋습니다. 모두가 연설을 들을 자격이 있으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92546_Text
msgctxt "f765544a-f6e7-4271-a118-c5b366d6fc40"
msgid ""
"\"I am finally free – really free! Not just from {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} and "
"her followers, but from my past as well. I shall lament no more over the "
"years I spent in the Order. Now I can devote all my time to whatever I want. "
"I have the strength to resist any threat – whether it be new fanatics of "
"Shelyn or threats to your lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 마침내 자유입니다! {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 추종자들에게서가 아니라 저의 과거로부터도 자유입니다. 더 이상 교단에서 "
"갇혀있지 않겠습니다. 이제 저는 원하는 무엇이든 할 수 있습니다. 셸린의 광신자든 괴물든 어떤 위험도 대항할 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92547_Text
msgctxt "025f9967-cc88-413e-8ba8-c2b5e015bd1d"
msgid ""
"\"I finally stopped blaming {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} for all my troubles and "
"found peace. Not that I suddenly came to love the goddess and her stupid "
"followers...\" {n}Valerie smiles faintly.{/n} \"But now I understand: if you "
"want others to respect your choices, you must respect theirs – however "
"ridiculous they may seem to you. And of course, I'm ready to return to my "
"duties with you. There are many battles ahead of you, and my responsibility "
"is to protect you from any threat.\" {n}Valerie bows ceremoniously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저는 결국 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}을 비난하지 않고 평화를 찾았습니다. 여신과 그의 추종자들을 사랑해서가 아닙니다.\" {n}"
"발레리는 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"하지만 이제는 이해합니다. 다른 사람이 제 선택을 존중하기를 바란다면 다른 사람의 선택도 존중해야 "
"합니다. 물론 제 임무를 할 준비는 되어있습니다. 우리 앞에는 많은 전투가 기다리고 있고 저의 책임은 당신을 보호하는 것이니까요.\" "
"{n}발레리는 절도있는 인사를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92548_Text
msgctxt "6f215bdf-eba7-4857-83f5-4832fbe2fea7"
msgid "\"Please let me speak first. I wish to thank you. And apologize.\""
msgstr "\"제가 먼저 말하게 해주십시오. 고맙고 미안하다는 말을 하고 싶었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92549_Text
msgctxt "5001e82b-fcbd-4d7b-8fa2-adf8850d031f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid I've dragged you into a huge amount of trouble.\" {n}Valerie "
"sighs.{/n} \"Trust me, I didn't want any of this, and it saddens me what "
"you've had to endure. But at the same time I'm happy I had you at my side "
"through it all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신을 엄청난 골칫거리에 휘말리게 할까 걱정됩니다.\" {n}발레리가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"믿어주십시오. 저는 이렇게 되기를 "
"원하지 않았습니다. 하지만 제 곁에 당신이 있어줘서 고맙습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92554_Text
msgctxt "f878f96e-0273-4a32-abb6-574d717debdc"
msgid ""
"\"In your voice I hear notes I recognize from Fredero and the other mentors "
"of the Order... I hope you've no intention of following their lead.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 목소리가 마치 프레데로나 교단의 다른 자의 목소리처럼 들리는군요... 그들처럼 되지 않으셨기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92555_Text
msgctxt "1b9a07a9-bca2-47d2-a168-1ae68ee1e7ca"
msgid "\"Of course.\" {n}Valerie nods gravely.{/n}"
msgstr "\"물론입니다.\" {n}발레리는 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92556_Text
msgctxt "a1617f45-0683-4eb3-8d29-2db6c938a68c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles with just one corner of her mouth.{/n} \"Your enthusiasm "
"reminds me of Linzi's. In a good way.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리의 입꼬리가 올라갑니다.{/n} \"당신의 열정은 린지를 떠올리게합니다. 좋은 방향으로 말이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92557_Text
msgctxt "185ad2e0-b438-4589-bb93-79d7acfd3229"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie touches her face where the scar used to be.{/n} \"At least the "
"world around me has returned to its accustomed place. This morning I found "
"another love note under my door.\" {n}Valerie chuckles.{/n} \"Though I can't "
"say I missed the extra attention!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 흉터가 있던 곳을 만졌습니다.{/n} \"적어도 제 주변의 세계는 익숙하게 되었군요. 오늘 아침에 제 방문 앞에 러브레터를 "
"줏었습니다.\" {n}발레리는 웃습니다.{/n} \"과도한 관심은 싫어하지만 기분이 나쁘지 않군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92558_Text
msgctxt "5ce7010c-2035-4e96-8efb-f1f29db25a5e"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie rubs her scar with her fingertips.{/n} \"Does it prevent me from "
"serving you? Or make me worse in battle? There's only change to get used to –"
" no more crowds of admirers. It feels strange, but I hardly miss the "
"inappropriate attention!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 흉터를 손끝으로 문질러줍니다.{/n} \"그 때문에 제가 당신을 섬기지 못하는 겁니까? 아니면 제가 전투에서 문제가 되는 "
"겁니까? 더이상 구혼자의 관심을 받지 않아도 될 유일한 기회였습니다. 이상한 기분이지만 부적절한 관심이 그립지는 않았습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92560_Text
msgctxt "9928380a-1391-4b52-9caf-51848fa1a962"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie blushes with shame.{/n} \"Please accept my humble apologies, "
"{name}. Every time I encounter a problem, I think it's in my power to handle "
"it on my own. – And I cannot keep distracting you from running your "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}! But time and again, I find I must rely "
"on my friends. I promise, I will not keep anything back from you again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 부끄러워 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"제 사과를 받아주십시오. {name}. 제가 문제를 겪을 때마다 스스로 해결할 수 "
"있다고 생각했습니다. 저는 당신이 남작령을 도망치게 둘 수는 없습니다! 하지만 또다시 저는 친구들에게 의존해야겠군요. 약속합니다. "
"당신에게서 어떤 것도 뺏지 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92561_Text
msgctxt "85dcc8b2-73e3-45f3-ad50-550b3ce96859"
msgid "{n}Valerie nods to you cordially.{/n} \"Glad to see you.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 진심으로 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"당신을 만나서 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92562_Text
msgctxt "c89e8be2-dc7d-46af-bdd4-e8af54da9f13"
msgid "\"Hello, {name}. Are you ready for a new quest?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까. {name}. 새로운 퀘스트 준비가 되셨습니까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92563_Text
msgctxt "b07e0d73-870a-439c-a22d-ac8189abb9cf"
msgid "{n}Valerie tilts her head when she sees you.{/n} \"Glad to see you.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신을 볼 때 머리를 까닥입니다.{/n} \"당신을 만나서 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92564_Text
msgctxt "730f4488-342b-443f-b66f-16b29df05b74"
msgid "\"Yes, my king?\""
msgstr "\"네. 저의 왕이시여?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92566_Text
msgctxt "90e063b1-7d7e-44cf-9186-b53ea5ba3ca7"
msgid ""
"\"It's good you're not alone... it doesn't become a ruler to spend his days "
"in solitude.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 혼자가 아니라서 다행입니다... 고독으로 인생을 보내는 통치자가 되지는 않아서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92567_Text
msgctxt "fdbd7660-2adc-46a7-9ab5-4fb74d1d96cb"
msgid ""
"\"Keep an eye on Regongar. He can be quite... unbearable when he's out of "
"line.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르를 주시하십시오. 그가 무례할 때는... 참기 어려우니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92568_Text
msgctxt "42fdcfd3-f956-4188-a7c3-ebfdf696a541"
msgid "\"Octavia is very sweet. Keep an eye on her, or you'll lose her.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아는 매우 달콤한 여자입니다. 그녀를 주시하십시오. 그렇지 않으면 그녀를 잃을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92572_Text
msgctxt "2cbbe178-d4ec-4c72-8f32-ef51c1fb9c62"
msgid ""
"\"By what exactly? The fact you are not alone any more? Or the fact you "
"didn't choose me? These are strange questions, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정확히 무엇 때문에 그렇습니까? 혼자가 아니라는 사실 때문입니까? 저를 선택하지 않았다는 사실 때문입니까? 이상한 질문이군요. "
"{name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92573_Text
msgctxt "ea05f62f-e427-4ba5-94f4-30777f14473c"
msgid "{n}Valerie nods with dignity.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 품위있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92576_Text
msgctxt "392eff12-6232-4527-931a-e149589b1ec9"
msgid "{n}Valerie curves her lips in a mischievous smile.{/n} \"Gladly.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 장난스런 미소로 입술이 휘어집니다.{/n} \"기꺼이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92577_Text
msgctxt "ca9eac48-4993-4c51-88f8-9989acaaf2f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns pale. She swallows then speaks in a measured manner.{/n} \"I"
" won't ask what caused such a change. I'll ask only one thing — are you sure?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 창백해집니다. 그녀는 침을 꿀꺽 삼키고 공손하게 말합니다.{/n} \"무엇 때문에 그랬는지 묻지 않겠습니다. 저는 단 "
"하나만 묻겠습니다. 진심이십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92579_Text
msgctxt "f892d384-5518-4e2b-9bf2-10451eb2da69"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie burns you with her eyes.{/n} \"Then spare me your strange "
"tests... I don't know what you're trying to achieve!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 불타는 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그 이상한 시험을 치르겠습니다. 도대체 무슨 짓을 하려는지 모르겠군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92580_Text
msgctxt "5e13c9dd-bee4-4525-8d37-33ccfcf0638a"
msgid "{n}Valerie purses her lips and nods.{/n} \"As you wish, {name}.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 입술을 지긋히 누르고 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"원하는대로 하십시오. {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92581_Text
msgctxt "8b6934a5-96dc-46f5-ac1d-c27b35395be8"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me if my words insult your faith, but I am not one to tell polite "
"lies.\""
msgstr "\"제 말이 당신의 믿음을 모욕했다면 용서해주십시오. 하지만 저는 입바른 거짓말을 하지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92583_Text
msgctxt "868a4d8f-0bb2-47c1-b384-42c47e91bfbc"
msgid ""
"\"Right. I need no guidance from above. I have my own good conscience and my "
"leader's orders to live by.\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다. 저는 지침이 필요 없습니다. 저는 생존을 위해 제 양심과 지도자의 명령을 따릅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92584_Text
msgctxt "c06e36a0-6bd4-44b8-9408-e2c29351786e"
msgid ""
"\"I must confess, I am glad my leader also lives without faith. I think the "
"world would be much better if people used their own minds rather than "
"relying on gods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고백해야 겠군요. 저의 지도자가 신앙없이 살아서 기쁩니다. 사람들이 신들을 의지하기보다는 자신을 믿었다면 세계가 훨씬 나아질 것이라고 "
"생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_92585_Text
msgctxt "c982707e-731e-4812-bd7c-31c3e37c9285"
msgid ""
"\"Or did you break up? I pay little attention to the gossips around the "
"castle, so I rarely keep up with the news.\""
msgstr "\"아니면 헤어졌습니까? 저는 성 주위의 소문은 믿지 않아서 그 소식을 알지 못합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/CompanionDialogues/Valerie/VS_Valerie_Companion_Dialogue/Cue_Valerie_G8_Text
msgctxt "319be819-5ef8-481a-a765-683e9ae9f96d"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's gaze suddenly becomes cold.{/n} \"And here I'd hoped to avoid "
"the question.\" {n}She exhales loudly.{/n} \"Well, let's get this over with, "
"once and for all. You should understand that I am perfectly aware that most "
"races, orders, and genders find me physically attractive.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 시선이 갑자기 차가워집니다.{/n} \"그리고 그 질문을 피하기를 희망했습니다.\" {n}그녀는 큰 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} "
"\"이제 아예 끝을 내지요. 저는 인종, 성별을 초월해서 매력적이라는 것을 알고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Amiri_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "4d8856be-1a70-4736-8e24-ec5a05a9c19f"
msgid "\"You call this a blizzard? You've never been to the mountains!\""
msgstr "\"이걸 눈보라라고 부르십니까? 산에 오른 적이 한 번도 없나 보군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Ekun_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "ffa26a4a-2f75-4257-ade2-84b8d7a5cd4e"
msgid "\"Don't lose sight of each other.\""
msgstr "\"서로를 놓치지 마십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Harrim_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "528928e2-0ced-4f0b-9c48-e2a542c4977c"
msgid "\"This is it. We will all freeze to death.\""
msgstr "\"끝이군요. 우리 모두 얼어 죽을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Jaethal_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "3e2788d8-a680-455b-9b78-052badba17bf"
msgid "\"I hope the snow can hide how ugly these lands are.\""
msgstr "\"눈이 이 흉측한 땅을 숨길 수 있기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Jubilost_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "cb6d0bfe-939e-4673-930f-f4717270ed61"
msgid "\"Where did I put my warm scarf?\""
msgstr "\"어디에 따뜻한 스카프를 넣었더라?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Kalikke_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "3382b708-4fa3-4dab-abdd-03cbae6dc991"
msgid ""
"\"The blizzard is coming. It's so scary – but beautiful at the same time!\""
msgstr "\"눈보라가 몰아칩니다. 무섭기도 하지만 아름답습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Kanerah_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "7eb0b576-3160-410b-a143-77998759dfe7"
msgid ""
"\"I hate these terrible blizzards! This northern weather will be the death "
"of me – mark my words!\""
msgstr "\"이 끔찍한 눈보라가 싫습니다! 북쪽 지방의 날씨는 정말 끔찍합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Linzi_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "29fc5f21-2af6-4128-9133-07d479b41f51"
msgid "\"And on they walked, through the white gloom...\""
msgstr "\"그들은 하얀 우울함 속을 걸었습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Nok-Nok_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "ea275240-3207-4798-95ef-dd4b7cde89ea"
msgid "\"White flies! Bite like tiny bees!\""
msgstr "\"하얀 파리입니다! 작은 벌처럼 물어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Octavia_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "f975886f-f251-4fa7-b7a8-9e915de3dd91"
msgid "\"Ah! My ears are freezing!\""
msgstr "\"아! 귀가 얼어붙었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Regongar_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "a3680b5c-c107-404f-aed1-546058e0681e"
msgid "\"Could really use a mug of hot grog right about now...\""
msgstr "\"뜨거운 머그잔을 쥐고 있었다면 소원이 없겠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Tartuk_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "3f5de76d-db12-419f-90e5-acacd255e072"
msgid "\"There isss icssse on my scalesss!\""
msgstr "\"눈이 엄청납니다아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Tristian_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "c15e5a5a-61ce-4194-829f-9a159326cf5a"
msgid "\"So cold... And not a ray of sun...\""
msgstr "\"너무 추워... 햇빛 한줄기도 없이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Blizzard/Valerie_BlizzardBark_String
msgctxt "d88382d1-2a97-4e10-bcc4-442ea0f6f461"
msgid "\"Keep moving if you would rather not freeze to death!\""
msgstr "\"얼어 죽기 싫으면 계속 움직이십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/HubEscape/LinziEscape_String
msgctxt "baab2eee-ab57-4970-8aa4-bf2413420ce3"
msgid "\"Shelyn, save me! I haven't finished my book yet!\""
msgstr "\"셸린이시여. 저를 구해주세요! 아직 제 책을 다 못 끝냈단 말이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/HubEscape/TristianEscape_String
msgctxt "23338943-1bb8-4a66-86fb-30da571ff6fa"
msgid "\"Sarenrae, protect your humble servant!\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이여. 당신의 종을 지켜주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Amiri_StormBark_String
msgctxt "7ac8e3ee-9eaa-4882-b685-8bae77754de2"
msgid "\"It's like a blizzard, but hot!\""
msgstr "\"눈보라 같지만 뜨겁다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Ekun_StormBark_String
msgctxt "4a23b4c3-e3e1-47da-b98f-9014701f703b"
msgid "\"I hear thunder.\""
msgstr "\"천둥 소리가 들린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Harrim_StormBark_String
msgctxt "836bdadd-d62a-47c5-969d-9e97cdfabf85"
msgid "\"The skies tear open... It is as though the End of Days has come!\""
msgstr "\"하늘이 갈라졌군... 마치 종말의 때가 온 것 같구먼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Jaethal_StormBark_String
msgctxt "391e659b-4863-4139-95f5-8253021aacd6"
msgid "\"It's getting disgustingly humid...\""
msgstr "\"정말 역겨울 정도로 습해지는군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Jubilost_StormBark_String
msgctxt "03df917a-a3ff-40f6-b26b-ccdb04208447"
msgid "\"Hold tight if you don't want to get washed away!\""
msgstr "\"휩쓸려 나가고 싶지 않으면 꽉 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Kalikke_StormBark_String
msgctxt "c008bc03-5ebd-42f5-b86c-3c371eaf7c43"
msgid ""
"\"Look, it's pouring again! When the weather gets like this, all I want is "
"to dance.\""
msgstr "\"다시 퍼붓기 시작했어! 이렇게 비가 오는 날이면 춤을 추고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Kanerah_StormBark_String
msgctxt "f22e2e3a-a66a-43aa-9892-75eaa9ea56db"
msgid ""
"\"It's raining again! Oh, how I love the unforgettable sensation of wet "
"clothes sticking to my back.\""
msgstr "\"다시 비가 온다! 내 등에 옷이 흠뻑 젖을 때의 기분이란!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Linzi_StormBark_String
msgctxt "5f92dce9-cb4a-4e18-b791-cd6155d60b64"
msgid "\"Now that's a downpour!\""
msgstr "\"이제는 폭우까지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Nok-Nok_StormBark_String
msgctxt "aaa6f0aa-b5c1-4c72-8d11-f975bdb0907d"
msgid "\"Thunder! Lightning! Flood! Flame!\""
msgstr "\"천둥! 번개! 홍수! 불꽃!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Octavia_StormBark_String
msgctxt "c77856a0-8340-4352-881e-778ca964544f"
msgid "\"Looks like a storm's coming!\""
msgstr "\"폭풍이오고 있는 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Regongar_StormBark_String
msgctxt "51cb8aa5-74dc-45a8-b887-f8a684f94fa9"
msgid "\"Oh, great. Now we're gonna get drenched.\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 이제 흠뻑 젖겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Tartuk_StormBark_String
msgctxt "984df6f7-9b75-4a28-8fd5-6625e6651442"
msgid "\"Heaven'sss fury... Nicssse!\""
msgstr "\"천국의 분노... 멋진걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Tristian_StormBark_String
msgctxt "d852affc-65dd-4055-95f9-4bab95a398cb"
msgid "\"Achoo! Goddess, save me from a cold...\""
msgstr "\"에취! 여신이시여. 추위에서 나를 구해주세요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/MiscBarks/Storm/Valerie_StormBark_String
msgctxt "21cd8d0a-8b0c-474d-933a-4de6dca1177f"
msgid "\"It is just rain. Let us push onward.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 비일뿐이야. 계속 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Barks/Amiri_charge_String
msgctxt "4bec1bf1-7489-45b6-9328-1ca600f58999"
msgid "\"Blood for Gorum!\""
msgstr "\"고룸에게 피를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Barks/Amiri_donthelp_String
msgctxt "aa87400a-3b7c-449e-8d15-bbd7ff27958f"
msgid "\"Stay away! I can handle it!\""
msgstr "\"떨어져있어! 내가 처리할 수있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Barks/Amiri_help_String
msgctxt "efbaaa90-4110-497f-b163-99079f0fb8e5"
msgid "\"I wounded it! Come finish it off!\""
msgstr "\"상처를 입혔다! 끝내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/PersonalEnemies/Barks/Bark_AmiriSummon_1_String
msgctxt "48b3a4b7-e042-45b6-ba26-9f9221b180fb"
msgid "\"Thief!\""
msgstr "\"도둑이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/PersonalEnemies/Barks/Bark_AmiriSummon_2_String
msgctxt "9175b997-5bb9-4cd0-8520-dffeee2272e9"
msgid "\"Bring back what you stole!\""
msgstr "\"훔친 것을 가져와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/PersonalEnemies/Barks/Bark_AmiriSummon_3_String
msgctxt "064f80dd-01f9-4489-a5d3-9f7e8240a929"
msgid "\"Your tribe will suffer for your crimes!\""
msgstr "\"네 부족은 너의 범죄로 고통받을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/PersonalEnemies/Barks/Bark_AmiriSummon_4_String
msgctxt "94efa872-7236-4984-8f9c-013fc3373d22"
msgid "\"You are a criminal, Amiri. You won't get away!\""
msgstr "\"너는 범죄자야. 아미리. 도망가지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/PersonalEnemies/Barks/Bark_AmiriSummon_5_String
msgctxt "ad0f3563-6dda-4f56-a08c-bf8dd5ac6cf7"
msgid "\"Amiri! We need Amiri!\""
msgstr "\"아미리! 아미리가 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4b936cab-8093-40bd-8d10-c1e1ba5d652f"
msgid "\"Are you hurt?\""
msgstr "\"다쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e57a2049-dee3-4d37-823a-82572b35379a"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to prove anything to me. I already know you're brave — and "
"a skilled warrior.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 어떤 것도 증명할 필요가 없다. 나는 네가 용감하다는 것을 이미 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e4002f1e-0df0-4d09-8070-28657d08b95e"
msgid "\"Congratulations! So, what now? Ready to move on?\""
msgstr "\"축하해! 이제 어떡해? 계속 나아갈 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6ba306ca-cff7-433c-804c-8ad14e72f80a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! One more down!\" {n}Amiri kicks the remains of the monster with her "
"boot and thrusts her chest out proudly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"하! 한놈 더 잡았다!\" {n}아미리는 장화로 괴물의 잔해를 차며 엄지를 가슴을 향해 자랑스럽게 찌릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6ef57eb6-a9e9-4fa6-8516-788b58d302fc"
msgid "\"Scratches.\" {n}Amiri shrugs.{/n} \"Got some new scars!\""
msgstr "\"긁힌 자국이야.\" {n}아미리는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"새로운 흉터가 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7dfda198-bbcb-4ee4-ad22-5fc2a07e5904"
msgid "\"Proof?\" {n}She snorts.{/n} \"We killed it! It is enough.\""
msgstr "\"증명?\" {n}그녀는 콧방귀를 낍니다.{/n} \"우리가 그것을 죽였어! 그걸로 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "44522ba3-721b-4aae-9897-02bc80d62157"
msgid "\"Hunt new monsters? Ha! Was born ready!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 괴물 사냥하자고? 하! 언제나 준비 됐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Hodag-killed/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cd429618-07c2-416b-a962-5233a3c50ce3"
msgid "\"One less monster. People are safer. Good.\""
msgstr "\"괴물이 하나 사라졌고 사람들이 더 안전해졌어. 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6ca470c9-578e-47ca-812f-86eb3cc2fa57"
msgid "[Join with Amiri and attack the hodag] \"To battle!\""
msgstr "[아미리와 함께 호닥을 공격합니다] \"전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b2c88fee-4585-4718-9bc0-fc21c5c3a0ae"
msgid "[Leave the hodag's lair] \"Wait a bit.\""
msgstr "[호닥의 둥지를 떠납니다] \"잠깐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7766357e-66e4-49f5-81ac-1be5160aaa28"
msgid "\"Everything all right? You want to go alone?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아? 혼자 가고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4996957a-c1a5-4e9c-9275-5ed2fdaee1c3"
msgid "\"Maybe we should help you after all?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 너를 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f4a2ecdf-7488-47de-b47a-0958797efc01"
msgid "[Attack the hodag] \"To battle!\""
msgstr "[호닥을 공격합니다] \"전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "057f3aa5-e657-45cd-9a5b-0fd02ff00f62"
msgid ""
"\"There he is! Now I slice this lizard into tiny pieces! Watch out and don't "
"get in my way!\""
msgstr "\"저기 있군! 이 도마뱀을 조각낼게! 조심하고 내 앞을 막지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "a278b27c-c300-47d1-9cfd-ecca7063d9ed"
msgid "{n}Amiri unleashes a fearsome battle cry and charges the monster.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 무서운 전투 함성을 지르고 괴물에게 돌격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "6258806b-46a2-47ce-9428-21915e3520aa"
msgid "\"Wait, wait… how much longer should I wait?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 잠깐... 내가 얼마나 더 기다려야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "b8354ce8-c75d-45a0-a27f-46a11f26ca35"
msgid ""
"\"You bet!\" {n}Amiri thrusts her chest forward, anticipating a good "
"fight.{/n} \"But I call you if I need you.\""
msgstr "\"틀림없어!\" {n}아미리는 좋은 싸움을 기대하면서 의기양양하게 턱을 듭니다.{/n} \"하지만 네가 필요하면 부르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Join-or-leave_Hodag/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "2486ccf7-33f1-482a-ad1c-7097abbfea11"
msgid ""
"\"You think I'm young pup? I don't need help.\" {n}She frowns slightly.{/n} "
"\"But stay close. Call if I need you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 어린 애라고 생각해? 도움은 필요 없다.\" {n}그녀는 약간 찡그립니다.{/n} \"하지만 내 곁에 있어. 필요하면 부르겠다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Q1_Barks/Amiri_DontHelp_String
msgctxt "3140715f-2792-4671-b3a8-f75a04ddcda2"
msgid "\"Hey, what are you doing? Think I can't do it alone?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하고 있어? 혼자 할 수 없다고 생각하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Q1_Barks/Amiri_Help_String
msgctxt "04bd465d-11a3-4a09-8e93-2bfa2e68b2f8"
msgid "\"I wounded it! Come finish it off!\""
msgstr "\"상처를 입혔다! 끝내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Q1_Barks/Amiri_charge_String
msgctxt "1580db8b-cf34-46b3-b447-5b53afc0b612"
msgid "\"I'm going alone, got it?\""
msgstr "\"나 혼자 가겠어. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "63abfa10-e8d8-40c4-9761-7e95ccfc560b"
msgid "\"I think I can do it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 할 수 있다고 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "1c3ff3d7-5358-402e-931b-4a735786a848"
msgid "\"I have more important things to do.\""
msgstr "\"나는 해야 할 중요한 일이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "f034d3ad-b138-4f2c-bb40-666884ceaa3d"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you think we have enough to do without bothering with this "
"Tuskgutter?\""
msgstr "\"터스크거터에 신경쓰는 것 말고도 우리가 해야할 일이 충분히 많다고 생각하지는 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "40d5b5bd-8dcd-4bfc-a6b0-a136cbfc015a"
msgid ""
"\"Seems you're dead set on slaying this boar. Is this something personal?\""
msgstr "\"이 멧돼지를 잡으려고 아주 작정한 모양인데. 사정이 있는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "81873a67-6f30-4bda-a030-f707832c5c41"
msgid "\"No. We have no time to entertain ourselves with a hunt.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 우리는 사냥 놀이하며 즐길 시간은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "5bfc72a2-dc0a-434d-ad6a-4c950cd61ec0"
msgid "\"I said no. This conversation is over.\""
msgstr "\"아니라고 했어. 이 대화는 끝났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "4d27a37b-92c7-436a-ad07-271d38d80691"
msgid "\"All right, let's go kill this Tuskgutter.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 가서 터스크거터를 해치우자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ea1c39a2-3d1a-40e7-985b-775cd9be8baa"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, there's... Well, since you dispatched the bandits with such skill —"
" maybe you can help us with another problem...\""
msgstr "\"잠시만요, 할 말이... 그게, 도적들을 쫓아낸 당신의 그 실력이라면 다른 문제도 도와주실 수 있을 거 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "7670a3e0-e31c-4884-ab2b-14df03248140"
msgid ""
"\"There's a feral swine living here in the woods. Not a normal wild pig — "
"we're talking about a vicious boar. As big as a bear and wicked as a devil! "
"The locals call him Tuskgutter. Many hunters have lost life and limb to him! "
"Vekkel Benzen found his lair and went to kill the beast, but came back with "
"one leg. He put a bounty on the boar's head, but it looks like there aren't "
"any heroes around here bold enough to claim it. Maybe you will rid us of "
"this monster...\""
msgstr ""
"숲속에 야생 돼지가 살고 있습니다. 보통 야생 돼지는 아니고, 아주 악귀 같은 멧돼지입니다. 곰처럼 덩치가 크고 악마처럼 영악하지요! "
"주민들은 그녀석을 터스크거터라고 부릅니다. 많은 사냥꾼이 놈에게 목숨과 팔다리를 잃었습니다. 베켈 벤젠이 은신처를 발견하고 짐승을 죽이러 "
"갔지만 외다리가 되어 돌아왔죠. 그가 그 멧돼지의 머리에 현상금을 걸었지만 이곳에는 그놈을 잡을 배짱이 있는 영웅은 없는듯 합니다. 혹시 "
"당신이 그 괴물을 해치워주신다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5db79fdb-10d1-4cd0-bf7a-f19a46f6ca9e"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri livens up.{/n} \"Hey, we're better than the local wussies, right? "
"Wanna bet I can chop off this Tuskgutter's snout with a single swing? Come "
"on, let's find out!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리가 활기를 띱니다.{/n} \"이봐. 우린 여기 겁쟁이들이랑 끕이 다르다고. 내기 할래? 나라면 터스크거터의 주둥이가 한방에 "
"쪼개진다에 걸겠어. 잡으러가자! 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "d9c9bad0-7087-442f-8f2d-bff73ebe150b"
msgid "\"Wonderful! His lair is here.\" {n}Oleg makes a mark on your map.{/n}"
msgstr "\"좋아! 그의 은신처가 여기에 있다.\" {n}올렉이 지도에 표시를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c85dba9c-ab1e-4a04-9476-a8dbd76362f0"
msgid ""
"\"Very true... Well, I hope {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} will send someone to rid "
"us of that beast!\""
msgstr "\"사실이야... 나는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 그 짐승을 없앨 누군가를 보내기를 바랐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "708965e2-8400-4c3c-8fa2-01630c7f47c0"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian winces.{/n} \"Come on! Listen, they sent us here to make "
"things right! Bandits is one thing, but we are still supposed to get rid of "
"monsters too! And reward is a good thing, right?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바바리안이 찡그립니다.{/n} \"아 쫌! 걔들이 우리보고 여기 문제를 해결하라고 했잖아! 산적도 문제지만 괴물도 문제라고! 그리고 "
"보상은 언제나 좋은거야, 그치?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "abf02df6-4210-4856-a99d-b1dd72fda5e8"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri looks aside.{/n} \"Well… Not exactly. I tell you some other time. "
"Probably. And now let's just go and slice that monster into bacon strips!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 옆을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"글쎄... 그런건 아니고. 나중에 말해주지. 아마도. 이제 가서 그 괴물을 베이컨으로 "
"조각으로 썰어버리자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2f19f8b1-8d39-4169-8368-469879fb82fb"
msgid ""
"\"What?! No, nothing like that, I just… Well… Cut it! This pig teared off a "
"good man's leg! This must be avenged, right? Or next time he tears off "
"someone's head!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐야?! 아니, 그런거 아니야. 난 그냥... 어... 됐어! 그 돼지가 선량한 사람의 다리를 잘라버렸어! 복수를 해야하겠지, "
"그렇지? 아니면 다음에는 누군가의 머리가 날아갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e5375a86-3d75-4ead-96b5-a60bd89a47b2"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, why you're such a bore, huh?\" {n}You detect a hint of bitterness "
"in Amiri's voice. {/n}\"Why it's a big deal you watch me cutting this pig? "
"Your Stag Lord won't go nowhere!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐, 왜 그렇게 지루하게 구는거야, 응?\" {n}아미리의 목소리에 씁쓸함이 담겨있습니다.{/n} \"내가 이 돼지를 잡겠다는데 "
"그게 뭐 별거야? 수사슴 군주가 사라지지도 않을텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "80c4e859-ba0a-42c1-ad53-7dac05dbc2d6"
msgid ""
"\"That's what you are, huh? Fine!\" {n}Amiri spits on the ground and walks "
"away, stomping her feet — obviously to drown her disappointment in beer.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 나오기야? 좋아!\" {n}아미리는 바닥에 침을 뱉고 발을 구르며 걸어갑니다. 실망감을 맥주로 달래려는게 분명합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Start-NEW_Oleg/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "43b06312-a135-4c3c-8c92-53876dd7b578"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri gives you a wide grin and slaps your shoulder.{/n} \"Riiiight! "
"That's the way I like it! Let's do it!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 활짝 웃으며 당신의 어깨를 두드립니다.{/n} \"좋았어어! 그게 내가 좋아하는 방식이야! 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "02f9c9ad-45a0-4425-bda3-dd81b950efd9"
msgid "\"Are you hurt?\""
msgstr "\"다쳤나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9277c41e-ac11-44bf-96c6-e4f4eeedd688"
msgid ""
"\"Still, why do you want to kill this monster? You passed this test back "
"when you were with your tribe, didn't you?\""
msgstr "\"그런데, 왜 이 괴물을 죽이려고 하지? 너 부족과 함께 있었을 때 이 시험을 통과했잔아, 안그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2a0e9282-a790-44bb-b9d8-40ecb2d16424"
msgid "\"Newcomer? You wanted to prove you're good enough to join my group?\""
msgstr "\"신입이라고? 내 그룹에 합류하기에 충분하다는 걸 증명하고 싶었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "e0ded3b6-ac51-4b5c-b760-547f52ab8df0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm honored you consider me a part of your new tribe. You're a strong and "
"valiant warrior.\""
msgstr "\"나를 너의 새로운 부족원이라고 생각하면 영광이군. 너는 강하고 용감한 전사다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "a88df496-4a38-443d-9673-0a566b5f2b33"
msgid "\"Are you... embarrassed? I didn't think you were capable of that.\""
msgstr "\"너... 당황했어? 네가 그럴거라 생각하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "494c2343-56bc-4909-9cb7-9e148d28c288"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like this whole 'tribe' idea. I only helped you. You owe me "
"nothing.\""
msgstr "\"부족이고 뭐고 마음에 들지 않아. 그저 너를 도울 뿐이야. 너는 나에게 아무것도 빚지지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7add6b9c-f2cf-4e5e-9733-4f4d034fb6f1"
msgid ""
"{n}Breathing heavily, Amiri stands over the corpse of the fallen monster.{/n}"
" \"Whatcha say? See me in action? I almost chopped his head off!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}숨을 깊게 들이마신 아미리는 괴물의 시체 위에 서 있습니다.{/n} \"뭐라고? 내가 하는 거 봤어? 대가리를 거의 쪼개버렸는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "633741ba-31d6-4a9b-8288-6356517e98af"
msgid ""
"\"That's it! Trial done! Now no one dares say Amiri is weak!\" {n}She grins "
"and thrusts her chest out.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그거야! 시험은 끝났어! 이제 누구도 아미리가 약하다고하지 않아!\" {n}그녀는 웃으며 고개를 치켜세웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8e0e702f-70ad-4427-8fcb-2ab7a613589b"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri snorts, and examines herself closely. After a few moments, she "
"grunts.{/n} \"Scratches.\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 킁킁 거리며 자신을 조사합니다. 잠시 후 그녀는 신음합니다.{/n} \"긁혔군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f0619244-1c9b-468f-ab45-2f90e0498188"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri's face reddens.{/n} \"Well, yeah. True.\" {n}She scrapes the floor "
"with her boot.{/n} \"I'm in your tribe now. Kind of.\" {n}Her voice trails "
"off, then falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리의 얼굴이 빨갛습니다.{/n} \"글쎄. 그래. 맞아.\" {n}그녀는 장화로 바닥을 씁니다.{/n} \"나는 지금 너의 "
"부족원이라 할 수 있지.\" {n}그녀의 목소리는 점점 작아지더니 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "88dae3e4-5406-4a63-80bb-f7e1776facb1"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? If we meet another monster like this — I'll kill it too. "
"Not for a test, just... Just that nobody would ever dare say Amiri isn't a "
"warrior!\""
msgstr ""
"\"있지? 이런 괴물을 또 만나면 그것도 죽일 거야. 시험을 위해서가 아니라... 누구도 아미리를 전사가 아니라고는 말하지 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1e8eca37-58d0-4c41-a1b4-143a04b04699"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri's face reddens.{/n} \"Well, not just pups must pass this test. If a "
"man is newcomer to a tribe, he must bring a monster's hide. Proves he's not "
"weak...\" {n}Her voice trails off, then falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리의 얼굴이 빨갛습니다.{/n} \"글쎄. 애송이들만이 이 시험을 통과하는 건 아니야. 부족에 들어오는 신입들도 괴물의 가죽을 "
"가져와야 하지. 약하지 않다는 걸 증명하는 거야.\" {n}그녀의 목소리는 점점 작아지더니 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c9cf56df-a140-4289-b90f-80299d4b5b49"
msgid ""
"\"Just don't start this... that...\" {n}Amiri stops, trying to choose the "
"right words.{/n} \"Don't talk me about honor and valor. I know already!\" {n}"
" She frowns and turns away.{/n} \"Still, I owe you thanks. You have a true "
"chief's heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시작하지 마... 그런...\" {n}아미리는 멈추고 올바른 말을 선택하려고 합니다.{/n} \"명예와 용기에 대해 말하지 마. 나는 "
"이미 알고 있다!\" {n}그녀는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그래도 고마워. 너는 진정한 우두머리의 자질이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "df0383a3-9d36-4ba3-a8b2-f218c802d7ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri growls low in her throat.{/n} \"I don't get embarrassed! I'm a "
"warrior!\" {n}She grunts.{/n} \"Still, I owe you thanks. You have a true "
"chief's heart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 목에서 으르렁거리는 소리가 납니다.{/n} \"나는 당황하지 않아! 나는 전사다!\" {n}그녀는 앓는 소리를 "
"냅니다.{/n} \"그래도 고마워. 너는 진정한 우두머리의 자질이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "11c35103-cbe8-48f0-b9a5-6e8871c76342"
msgid ""
"\"What you know?\" {n}Amiri shakes her head.{/n} \"I don't waste time listen "
"to you!\" {n}She turns away and studies the area.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 뭘 알아?\" {n}아미리가 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"시간 낭비하지 않겠어.\" {n}그녀는 돌아서서 그 지역을 "
"탐색합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bd111f7f-7f3f-4747-a1c7-22728b4c5ba7"
msgid ""
"\"You are a valiant warrior. Were there truly fools who doubted your "
"strength?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 용맹한 전사입니다. 당신의 힘을 의심하는 바보들이 정말 있긴 했습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a6c5a3cb-4c3c-4881-bfef-19eddd23d11c"
msgid ""
"\"Some did, you know... I spit on them! No one'll dare bark at me now!\""
msgstr "\"있기는 했지, 그래서... 침을 뱉어줬지! 이제 누구도 감히 나한테 짖어댈 순 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tsukgutter-killed/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "edf45357-88eb-48f0-8d8f-663b92608fd4"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! A real epic battle, just like the sagas! I won't even have to "
"embellish it for the book!\""
msgstr "\"맞아요! 영웅 설화에 나오는 듯한 전설적인 전투였어요. 책에 실어도 윤색할 필요 조차 없겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1cddf401-1e14-41e6-b35f-fd0d509004cc"
msgid "\"And?\""
msgstr "\"그리고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e2230acb-110a-49b0-91f4-7ebde7559cd1"
msgid "\"Are you scared?\""
msgstr "\"너 두려워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "66e3121f-669c-46e2-b50a-37fc4cf1d235"
msgid "[Wait for her to continue]"
msgstr "[그녀가 계속하기를 기다립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b11680f7-9951-4ea4-8f09-7664db0201cf"
msgid "\"They admitted they were wrong?\""
msgstr "\"그들이 틀렸다는 것을 인정했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4ce04288-f257-4552-8c5e-2522c7a805c0"
msgid "\"They invoked some formality and declared your initiation invalid?\""
msgstr "\"그들이 공식적으로 너의 행위가 무효라고 선언했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "50403da4-266e-4e49-8a5e-00c8826c7922"
msgid "[Wait until she continues]"
msgstr "[그녀가 계속하기를 기다립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "420501ea-292b-44a9-a8d9-2b329c67857b"
msgid ""
"\"Must you really slay him in single combat? It'll take our whole party to "
"bring this Tuskgutter down!\""
msgstr "\"꼭 일대일로 싸워야만 하나? 다같이 가서 이 터스크거터를 죽이자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "27d44332-cf4b-405e-bf6a-5fd7b186e8bc"
msgid "[Join with Amiri and attack Tuskgutter] \"I see. Come on, to battle!\""
msgstr "[아미리와 함께 터스크거터를 공격합니다] \"좋아. 와라! 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "09f65e95-89fe-4b48-97b1-2a1c80be7042"
msgid "[Attack Tuskgutter] \"I see. Come on — to battle!\""
msgstr "[터스크거터를 공격합니다] \"좋아. 와라! 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "035dd0fd-c402-42e4-8f50-669da27ac5c5"
msgid ""
"[Leave Tuskgutter's lair] \"A fight like this requires some preparation.\""
msgstr "[터스크거터의 소굴을 떠난다] \"이런 싸움에는 준비가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "488642bd-d7f0-49bc-af9f-841b7f59d1d0"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard anything more stupid. We won't waste our time on your "
"silly rituals.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그런 멍청한 말을 들어 본 적이 없다. 바보 같은 의식에 시간을 낭비하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "bb847153-5990-40aa-9812-efd7c3fac4e8"
msgid ""
"[Kick Amiri out of the party] \"You may leave. I'll manage without you.\""
msgstr "[아미리를 일행에서 추방한다] \"떠나라. 너 없이 알아서 하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "06ba75d1-52ed-41e2-af88-5dd8102a7a4d"
msgid ""
"\"So, here we are. The monster is here, and… Now I'll tear him apart! Yes! "
"Just watch me!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 도착했군. 괴물이 여기 있고... 이 녀석을 해치우겠어! 그냥 보고만 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "787331ec-0845-4433-8452-8f2be698b0ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri waits near the entrance to the beast's lair. As she sees you, she "
"bares her teeth in her usual grin, but this time it looks a bit forced.{/n} "
"\"Ah, there you are. So, are you ready to watch me rip this piggie's tusks "
"out? Because I'm, kind of, erm... ready.\" {n}She winces in hesitation, "
"shifting her feet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 짐승의 은신처 입구 근처에서 기다립니다. 그녀가 당신을 보았을 때 그녀는 평소처럼 미소에 송곳니가 보이지만 이번에는 "
"송곳니가 더 튀어나와 보입니다.{/n} \"아. 왔군. 내가 이 돼지의 어금니를 뽑는 모습을 보러 왔어? 나는 준비됐어.\" {n}그녀는 "
"주저하며 찡그리더니 그녀의 발을 움직이기 시작했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "68f3267c-d060-4c6d-82df-8997878643f2"
msgid ""
"\"Don't interrupt me!\" {n}Amiri blurts out, as if anticipating being cut "
"off.{/n} \"I speak on, when... I speak on!\" {n}She grunts, and her eyebrows "
"narrow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"방해하지 마!\" {n}아미리는 예상이 빗나간 것처럼 불쑥 말합니다.{/n} \"내가 필요할 때 말할 테니까!\" {n}그녀의 미간은 "
"좁고 그녀는 끙끙댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "398b242e-bfdc-45e3-90e0-5109ca67fcc6"
msgid ""
"\"Wha-? Who, me?!\" {n}Amiri blushes, then pales, then bursts out "
"laughing.{/n} \"Ha! You're funny! Am I scared of some pork chop?!\" {n}She "
"falls silent with a smile, shaking her head.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 누가? 내가?!\" {n}아미리는 얼굴이 붉어지더니 창백해져서는 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"하! 너 재미있어! 내가 돼지를 "
"무서워할 거 같아?!\" {n}그녀는 미소를 지은 채 침묵을 지키며 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "ed5e750d-796a-4d4f-a714-cb10041a476a"
msgid ""
"{n}She clears her throat.{/n} \"There's a custom where I am from. A boy "
"kills a monster in front of the elders, to prove he's man.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"내가 사는 곳에서 전통이 있다. 소년은 장로 앞에서 괴물을 죽이고 남자임을 증명한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "2fc6f910-c943-4959-9874-1f4f1a1685bd"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian clears her throat in hesitation.{/n} \"In our tribe, girls "
"don't get no initiation at all. So, I arranged my trial myself — like in the "
"song about Kagul the Orphan. I downed a cave lion in a single combat! Here, "
"see — the scars I got in that battle. And do you know what my elders did "
"after I threw the lion's skin at their feet?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 주저하며 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"우리 종족에서 소녀들은 시험을 치르지 않아. 그래서 나는 스스로 도전했지. 마치 노래 "
"속의 고아제조기 카굴처럼 말이야. 나는 한번에 동굴 사자를 쓰러뜨렸어! 여기 흉터가 그 때 얻은 거야. 내가 사자 가죽을 장로들 앞에 "
"던지자 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "702f9fc2-d524-453b-b525-2a44955fad51"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha. That's funny. In our parts, boys must do something rather "
"different to become men!\""
msgstr "\"하하. 재밌네요. 우리 지역에서는 소년이 남자가 되기위해서는 뭔가 다른 일을 해야 한답니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "ea0bdd88-58fc-41bb-8185-d352b6f70659"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri throws an angry glance at the half-elf, and Octavia falls silent — "
"but her teasing smile remains.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 하프엘프에게 화가 났고 옥타비아는 침묵합니다. 그러나 그녀의 짓궂은 미소는 남아있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "fa4d4b5c-c83f-4c38-ba9d-8807577e73e4"
msgid "\"I wish!\""
msgstr "\"그러고 싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "186920d8-4633-445c-95d5-3b1df7455e88"
msgid ""
"\"They laughed in my face! They said I scratched my belly myself! And hired "
"some man to kill the lion for me, in trade for... Ugh! Later they agreed my "
"initiation, of course, they had no choice. But...\" {n}Amiri's voice wavers "
"in anger, and she spits on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 내 앞에서 웃었다! 그들은 내 배의 흉터를 직접 낸 거라고 했어! 그리고 사자를 죽이기 위해 누군가를 고용하며 대가로 "
"그들에게... 젠장! 나중에 그들은 나의 시험을 인정해줄 수밖에 없었어. 하지만...\" {n}아미리의 목소리는 분노로 흔들리고 그녀는 "
"땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "cfae0b57-5340-4e7c-afe9-6ad55f48cbbf"
msgid "\"Dream on!\""
msgstr "\"꿈 깨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "1ec674c2-d892-4c64-9a41-799f19929739"
msgid ""
"{n}From a distance, Amiri examines Tuskgutter's muscular body and sharp "
"tusks.{/n} \"Bah! You think I can't butcher a pig by myself? Though... if "
"the elders saw the beast was about to kill the boy, they would help him. "
"There is no shame in that... But it doesn't matter, I'm just saying! Now you "
"stand and watch me gutting the beast!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 멀리서 터스크거터의 근육질 몸과 날카로운 엄니를 검사합니다.{/n} \"하! 내가 돼지 한마리도 도살하지 못할 줄 알아? "
"그 소년이 짐승에게 죽을 뻔했다면 장로들이 구해주었을 거야. 그건 부끄러운 게 아니야... 하지만 상관 없어! 내가 짐승의 멱을 따는 "
"모습을 네가 보고 있으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "c7370e17-8cda-4bc9-8d34-7eadcf06f831"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} watch me!!\" {n}With a battle cry, the barbarian "
"charges the boar.{/n}"
msgstr "\"{g|Gorum}고룸{/g}! 날 지켜봐라!!!\" {n}전투 함성과 함께 야만인이 멧돼지에게 돌격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "b397a57e-2c23-4503-a6b8-43e8c4c3d549"
msgid "\"Fine, just hurry up.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 서둘러.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "acbcf990-f10e-46f4-a568-cba6b2d63113"
msgid "\"Oh yeah?! Fine!\" {n}Amiri spits at your feet and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr "\"오. 그래?! 좋아!\" {n}아미리가 당신 발치에 침을 뱉고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "499dbd4f-c10e-4605-aaa5-55c93e9a251f"
msgid ""
"\"And here I thought men were stupid shit-for-brains only in my tribe!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 나는 내 부족의 남자들은 똥멍청이라고 생각했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "9f945553-09a4-4552-b348-2cb6aec1ac7b"
msgid "\"Really? And here I thought you understand me, as a warrior woman!\""
msgstr "\"정말? 난 네가 날 여전사로 인정해줄거라 생각했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "6298b733-d482-4069-a4e6-61419586c2eb"
msgid ""
"\"I need it, understand? If you are against it — you can walk. I find "
"another chief!\""
msgstr "\"나는 그게 필요해. 알겠어? 네가 거절한다면 떠나. 나는 다른 족장을 찾을 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a28fedd6-9d46-4d28-aad8-b1e5b8806128"
msgid "\"So, you ready? I'm itching to chop his tusks off!\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐어? 그 녀석의 엄니를 어서 뽑아내고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q1_Proof-of-Worth/Tuskgutter_Lair/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Tuskgutter
msgctxt "c8f36f01-4323-487a-86aa-101e6ff15300"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri waits near the entrance to the beast's lair.{/n} \"So, you ready? "
"I'm itching to chop his tusks off!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 짐승의 은신처 입구 근처에서 기다립니다.{/n} \"준비됐어? 그 녀석의 엄니를 어서 뽑아내고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Amiri_attacks_Fionn_String
msgctxt "53f0e510-2930-45f8-98ea-401721c72a4e"
msgid "\"Silence, demon! To arms!!\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐라, 데몬! 전투 준비!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Female_barbarian_flee_1_String
msgctxt "4526e9c6-0e99-4c82-8d5b-f7caa09bd1ba"
msgid "\"Save yourselves!\""
msgstr "\"알아서 살아남아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Female_barbarian_flee_2_String
msgctxt "6bb50acf-0740-47bb-881c-2031740fe430"
msgid "\"It's them again!\""
msgstr "\"또 나타났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Female_barbarian_flee_3_String
msgctxt "4d726d00-447a-4763-a192-2564a4eb7a3f"
msgid "\"Why, why do we have to suffer this?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리는 이 고통을 겪어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Fionn_sees_Amiri_String
msgctxt "d1b0efc8-8210-4c78-b94a-c492c1ebd904"
msgid "\"Are you Amiri? That sword… Thief!!\""
msgstr "\"네가 아미리냐? 저 칼은… 도둑놈!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_battle-win_1_String
msgctxt "017e4a10-4573-4407-867b-22a45c35a3f8"
msgid "\"Phew. Safe... For now.\""
msgstr "\"휴. 안전하군... 지금은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_battle-win_2_String
msgctxt "3888ae28-2b53-4867-8d0b-249ed3f48203"
msgid "\"They will be back!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 돌아올 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_fight_1_String
msgctxt "2ad9bda2-85b3-4029-b7b7-924bbf51f6a2"
msgid "\"That damned ghost sent its monsters again!\""
msgstr "\"저 망할 유령이 다시 그 괴물을 보냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_fight_2_String
msgctxt "7c8ab85e-3cdc-429f-9ca7-14a824079189"
msgid "\"Don't let them get to the women and children!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 여자와 아이들에게 다가가게 하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_fight_3_String
msgctxt "6351a179-3d35-44ef-b1ba-35a5b5a57ab2"
msgid "\"The Six Bears never give up!\""
msgstr "\"여섯 마리 곰 부족은 결코 포기하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_onclick_1_String
msgctxt "07ff1a3b-5b26-4331-9442-a23120563c60"
msgid "\"Pariah is back!\""
msgstr "\"추방자가 돌아왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_onclick_2_String
msgctxt "f0af852b-68d7-4106-9358-4242e24ea355"
msgid "\"Amiri! She has the nerve to show her face among us again!\""
msgstr "\"아미리다! 그녀가 다시 우리 사이에 얼굴을 비출 용기가 있다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Barks/Male_barbarian_onclick_3_String
msgctxt "a397accf-acda-4793-b4aa-6fa77d026d7c"
msgid "\"We have suffered so much... And it's all her fault!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너무 많은 고통을 겪었다... 그것은 모두 그녀의 잘못이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f985c53a-55a3-4413-8de9-444375df5ca7"
msgid "\"Nilak, Amiri's right. There was no time to talk.\""
msgstr "\"닐락, 아미리 말이 맞아. 말할 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a9b9ff31-70b7-4f95-b52f-1a0d6df91544"
msgid "\"Amiri, that ghost was trying to tell us something.\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 그 유령이 우리에게 무언가를 말하려고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "405270e1-a305-47b6-8cdb-207235a1c352"
msgid "[Keep silent]"
msgstr "[계속 침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "200ab7da-8b96-4e49-bcb4-24cadfade397"
msgid "\"Amiri had her reasons for doing what she did.\""
msgstr "\"아미리가 그렇게 한데는 그녀 만의 이유가 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "e16dbec3-e05d-4da2-8c19-4f562016e5f5"
msgid "\"Actually, Amiri, that really was a short-sighted move.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히, 아미리. 그건 근시안적인 행동이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "597eff7b-de95-4c84-940a-45319d9b5576"
msgid "[Keep silent]"
msgstr "[계속 침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e9a4aab8-e67b-43a2-9392-9498d6efa24e"
msgid ""
"\"That's it! We're done with your evil spirit. We cut him into pieces and "
"cast them to the wind!\""
msgstr "\"끝났어! 우리가 너희 악령 문제를 끝냈어. 그놈을 조각내서 바람에 날려버렸어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "4dbc2a6e-da87-45d7-8829-4508bd500ab7"
msgid ""
"\"You… You didn't even try to speak with him? Amiri! We've already fought "
"and killed him, many times. It's no use — he always comes back! Oh, Amiri… "
"Why do you always slash first and think later?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너... 넌 그 거인과 얘기도 안 해본 거야? 아미리! 우린 이미 그 거인과 여러 번 싸워서 죽였어. 하지만 "
"소용없었어 — 그는 항상 돌아왔다고! 오, 아미리. 왜 항상 칼부림을 먼저하고 나중에 생각 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "19978657-e8e1-4cb3-b587-351f2abc38d4"
msgid ""
"\"So, what was I supposed to do? Lay on the ground for him? Let him eat me?\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 내가 어떻게 해야 했지? 땅에 엎드려 빌어? 나를 잡아먹게 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "bdd4b4f8-1ddf-403b-8f8e-f9d4fe7bacf7"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Desna}Desna{/g}, why are you punishing me… Okay, Amiri's predictable, "
"but what about you, chieftain? You must realize, every deal starts with "
"negotiation! At least you could have tried!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여. 왜 나한테 벌을 주시는 겁니까... 좋아요. 아미리는 그렇다치고, 그렇지만 당신은 어떤가요, "
"족장? 모든 거래는 협상에서 시작된다는 것을 깨달아야 해요! 적어도 당신은 시도는 할 수 있었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8ec9ae89-bca5-4467-b729-840bbc54f324"
msgid ""
"\"Like we had nothing better than talk to the dead! A sword in his throat — "
"and that's the end of talk! If he comes back, we'll slay him again. Big deal!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽은 사람에게 말하는 것 보다 나을게 없는 것 같군! 그 놈 목구멍에 칼침을 먹여, 그리고 그게 대화의 끝이다! 만약 그가 돌아온다면 "
"우리가 다시 죽이면 돼! 거래 성사다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "763d1ee7-5ce3-4ace-8a30-b8a34ea1d528"
msgid ""
"{n}Nilak shakes her head in disappointment.{/n} \"Amiri… I hoped so much "
"that after we found you, everything would be better… What should we do now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}닐락은 실망스럽게 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아미리... 우리가 너를 발견한 후에 모든 것이 더 나아지기를 바랐어... 우리가 "
"이제는 무엇을 해야만 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "171b2965-9124-4f4d-baac-54d2a525bcac"
msgid ""
"\"You don't like something? Come on, speak up, I can hear!\" {n}Amiri "
"bellows with unexpected anger.{/n}"
msgstr "\"마음에 안드는 게 있나? 말 좀 해봐, 나 듣고 있어!\" {n}아미리는 예상치 못한 분노로 으르렁댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "5abf990d-8afc-4cac-9aac-72af3191b737"
msgid ""
"{n}Nilak matches her anger.{/n} \"I'll tell you what I don't like! You left "
"me! Thanks to you, I realized that a woman can do something bigger than "
"scraping hides and cooking stew! I hoped you would become chief, and I'd be "
"your advisor, and together we'd change the ways of this tribe... But instead "
"you just disappeared, without even saying goodbye! I had nothing left but to "
"become Akaia's advisor. Who led this tribe through the whole "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}? Who do you think? Who negotiated with the other "
"tribes? And who lived in the women's hut all this time, serving dinner to "
"the chieftain? And now we've found you — you... You ruin everything!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}닐락은 그녀의 분노를 맞받아칩니다.{/n} \"내가 싫어하는 게 뭔지 말해줄게! 넌 날 떠났어! 네 덕분에 여자가 요리하는 것보다 더 "
"위대한 일을 할 수 있다는 것을 깨달았어! 나는 네가 족장이 된다면 내가 너의 보좌관이 되어 함께 부족의 방식을 바꾸는 꿈을 꿨어... 하지만 "
"넌 작별 인사도 없이 사라졌어! 나는 아카이아의 보좌관이 되는 것 외에는 남은 길이 없었어. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}"
"를 누비며 이 부족을 누가 이끌었을까? 넌 누구라고 생각해? 다른 부족과의 협상은 누가 해야 했을까? 그리고 족장에게 음식 시중을 누가 "
"해야 했을까? 그리고 이제는 우린 너를 찾아냈어. 너.. 너가 모든 걸 엉망진창으로 만들었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "c9c36b4d-53f1-4919-bb2d-eb747f855121"
msgid ""
"\"Now the chieftain is angry! He's bound to do stupid things, and I won't be "
"able to talk him out of it! Our tribesmen will die, Amiri — and all because "
"of your itchy fists!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 족장이 화가 났어! 그는 어리석은 짓을 할 거고, 난 그를 말릴 수 없어! 우리 부족 사람들은 "
"다 죽을 거야, 아미리. 그리고 이건 모두 네 어리석은 주먹질 탓이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "141ef8c9-0d98-4c21-89b4-591ac8d57e07"
msgid ""
"\"Now the chieftain is dead! Who will be chief now? Will he even listen to "
"me? Or will he be like you, letting his fists decide everything. Will this "
"be the end of our tribe?\""
msgstr ""
"\"족장은 이제 죽었어! 누가 그 뒤를 이을 것이지? 그 남자가 내 말을 듣기나 할까? 아니면 너처럼 모든 것을 주먹으로 해결하려 할까? "
"이것이 우리 부족의 끝이란 말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "aab48e85-66b9-488f-a939-25ad96d9588c"
msgid ""
"\"I have no doubt about that! And she didn't think about anything else, "
"except her reasons!\""
msgstr "\"의심할 여지가 없지! 자기 생각만 했을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "efcda375-0457-47f3-9d0a-7fdf5d20a0d4"
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations, Amiri, now you're just like a real man from the Six "
"Bears! You only think about yourself. You use your fists whether you need to "
"or not. And then you leave it to the women to sort out your mess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"축하해, 아미리. 이제 너는 여섯마리 곰 부족에서 남자와 같은 지위야! 네 자신만 생각하고 때와 장소를 가리지 않고 힘을 써. 그렇게 "
"너의 뒤치닥거리는 여자가 하게 하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2f80627f-0aaa-4b40-b9df-15f66c434e14"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone is strategists and tacticians! So smart it makes me sick! Only "
"Amiri is the stupid one, right?\""
msgstr "\"모두 전략가에 전술가로군! 모두 똑똑해서 머리가 아파! 오직 아미리만 멍청한 년이지, 맞냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "dbf000b4-f15c-4024-b501-3ddff473e3d7"
msgid ""
"\"So, that's how you talk now, huh? You want me to tell you why I smashed "
"this old mushroom's face? And why I fled? I'll tell you! Listen now, you "
"wanted it! The war party I went with... You think we went to fight the "
"giants? I thought that too! I was so happy. I was fool! We did not go there "
"to kill giants, Nilak. We went there to kill — me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그렇게 얘기하시겠다? 왜 내가 이 늙은 버섯떼기의 얼굴을 뭉갰는지 알고 싶어? 그리고 왜 내가 도망쳤는지도? 너에게 말해주지! "
"잘 들어, 네가 원했잖아! 나랑 함께 한 일행은... 넌 우리가 거인과 싸우러 간 걸로 생각하지? 나도 그렇게 생각했어! 난 너무 "
"행복했어. 내가 바보였어! 우린 거기에 거인들을 죽이러 간 게 아니었어, 닐락. 날 죽이려고 간거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d12c6455-eaff-4dbf-8a01-e2d86abc4004"
msgid ""
"\"They thought giants would eat me up, and they won't have to get their "
"hands dirty. But I came back! Alive — and with this sword. I thought no one "
"would dare to say that Amiri wasn't a real fighter. But they just laughed "
"into my face and said that if the giants didn't kill me, the frost would. "
"Then they left me alone in the wilderness, without food or tent. And when I "
"understood why... When I saw what this hunt was for... It was then, for the "
"first in my life, I felt real rage. Yes, Nilak, don't you turn away now! "
"Look in my eyes! I killed them all! With this sword! I'm not a thief, Nilak. "
"I'm much worse. I'm a kinslayer. And you know what? — I don't care! They "
"deserved it! Our whole damned tribe can go to the dragon's maw!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 거인들이 나를 잡아 먹을 것이라고 생각했어. 그들은 자기 손을 더럽히지 않아도 되었지. 하지만 내가 돌아와 버린거야! 살아서, "
"이 검과 함께. 누구도 아미리를 전사가 아니라고 말하지 못할 거라 생각했지. 하지만 그들은 나를 비웃고 거인이 날 죽이지 "
"않았다면 혹한으로 얼어죽을 거라고 말했어. 놈들은 텐트나 음식 없이 나를 황무지에 버렸고. 그리고 그 이유를 이해했을 때... 이 사냥의 목적을 깨달았을 "
"때... 그때 난생 처음 진짜 분노를 느꼈어. 그래. 닐락, 돌아서지 마! 내 눈을 봐! 내가 다 "
"죽였어! 이 칼로! 난 도둑놈 새끼가 아니야, 닐락. 그 보다 훨씬 나쁘지. 난 동족 학살자야. 그거 알아? 난 "
"상관 없어! 그놈들은 그렇게 당해도 싸! 우리 빌어먹을 부족 모두 드래곤의 아가리 속으로 쳐 넣어져도 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "f33083bd-66e9-41a5-9861-87796e1e8292"
msgid "\"And… me too?\""
msgstr "\"나도... 그렇게 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "5baeccf6-7285-40ef-a0f4-dc68b5ca08a6"
msgid "\"What?\""
msgstr "\"뭐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "55604610-8d50-453f-964a-e17217c95f04"
msgid "\"Do I deserve to die? Should I go to dragon's maw, too?\""
msgstr "\"나도 죽어도 싸? 나도 드래곤의 먹이가 되어야 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f68b5005-3f20-405d-9deb-612cdc07bf3d"
msgid "\"No, you… This wasn't what I meant… You're not like them!\""
msgstr "\"아니, 넌... 그런 의미가 아니야. 넌 놈들과 달라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "6af34b19-9fdf-4b79-83b3-fad03ef96f64"
msgid ""
"\"I am a part of this tribe, Amiri. If you don't want to help me save it… "
"You'd better leave. I'll manage without you. I'll ask the {g|Tiger Lords}"
"Tiger Lords{/g} for help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 이 부족의 일원이야, 아미리. 나를 도와 부족을 구하고 싶지 않다면... 떠나줘. 너 없이도 할 수 있어. {g|Tiger "
"Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}에게 도움을 청하면 되니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "27678688-8b98-4bf7-8fec-5fdf475eee57"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri spits on the ground, then grabs your hand in her iron grip and "
"drags you away without saying another word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 땅에 침을 뱉고 아무말 없이 당신의 손을 꽉 쥐어 잡고는 끌고 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampAfter/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "85efd666-384a-4086-a506-97469b10614d"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar chuckles.{/n} \"Good for you — serves them right! When I get to "
"my tribe — I'll mix their hash even better!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n} \"좋아. 그들을 옳게 섬기는군! 내가 나의 부족에게 돌아가면 그들을 뭉게버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "978df197-1232-41ac-8d4b-d5c3d1d890c2"
msgid "\"Nice to meet you, Nilak.\""
msgstr "\"만나서 반갑다. 닐락.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "e8f6b859-5584-4fd3-836d-1bfeb6778fee"
msgid "\"So, what brought you to these lands?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 이 땅으로 온 이유는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b30e542a-c179-42bf-b9a7-639e4a73039c"
msgid "\"Amiri never told me about you.\""
msgstr "\"아미리가 너에 대해 말한 적이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3c424449-d3d5-46e3-aebb-420dbc3b0e9a"
msgid "\"I see you and Amiri are old friends.\""
msgstr "\"너와 아미리는 옛 친구인 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "dbe61c2d-ef72-4eaf-b871-6b13dd7a83ed"
msgid ""
"\"Sounds like you're not too clever, so I'll speak in a language I'm sure "
"you understand: one more rude word, and I'll punch your rotten teeth down "
"your throat!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 똑똑한 것 같지 않으니 네가 한 번에 알아먹도록 확실히 말하겠다. 한 번만 더 그렇게 입을 놀리면 내 주먹으로 너의 썩은 이를 "
"목구멍으로 쳐넣겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "804cc5ce-457b-4d40-981f-a06f083caee0"
msgid ""
"\"Choose your words carefully, barbarian. You and your tribe are guests here."
"\""
msgstr "\"말 조심해라, 야만인. 너와 네 부족은 여기선 손님이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "009e3cfc-ec29-4791-998c-381c7274ad1d"
msgid "\"What do you mean by 'need'?\""
msgstr "\"'필요'라니. 무슨 의미지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "9ad70160-09b8-4ed2-8832-36572bff3d09"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri is no longer one of your tribe. She's with me now, so if you need "
"something from her, you'll have to speak with me first.\""
msgstr "\"아미리는 더 이상 너의 부족이 아니다. 그녀는 나의 동료니 할 말이 있다면 나에게 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0041_AlignmentShift.Description 1_String
msgctxt "729d9b07-d187-4744-9334-e2d8fc563bc9"
msgid "Discouraged Amiri from killing the Six Bears tribe's chieftain."
msgstr "아미리가 여섯 곰 부족의 족장을 죽이지 못하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0041_Text_String
msgctxt "5fd31821-dbfd-43b9-865d-40034376ef7c"
msgid "\"Amiri, stop! Enough — he's already got what he deserves!\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 그만해! 그는 벌써 벌을 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "eaad443b-604e-4df1-a64a-debc44c3443e"
msgid "Allowed Amiri to kill the Six Bears tribe's chieftain."
msgstr "아미리가 여섯 곰 부족의 족장을 죽일 수 있게 방조합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "d457b782-c65a-467b-b1d9-3920ed74ec37"
msgid "[Watch silently]"
msgstr "[조용히 지켜본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "221a71c1-2c61-47bb-9f7d-0490c3848c66"
msgid "Encouraged Amiri to kill the Six Bears tribe's chieftain."
msgstr "아미리가 여섯 곰 부족의 족장을 죽이도록 부추깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "e8d34767-db59-4265-859a-189505b0d089"
msgid "\"Do it, Amiri! Finish him off!\""
msgstr "\"죽여라, 아미리! 끝장내라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "f92ad3f4-c41a-4916-9b5a-6dc10e7be62b"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as you approach the camp, a bright-eyed girl in a long skirt runs "
"up to Amiri and gives her a big hug.{/n} \"Amiri! You're really alive! Oh..."
"\" {n}The girl sobs and wipes her eyes.{/n} \"Everyone said you were killed "
"by the giants. But I always believed you survived — and no one ever found "
"your body! Amiri, I missed you so much!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 야영지에 접근하자 긴치마를 입은 초롱초롱한 눈망울의 소녀가 아미리에게 달려와 안깁니다.{/n} \"아미리! 너 정말로 살아있었구나! "
"오...\" {n}그 여자는 흐느끼며 눈물을 닦습니다.{/n} \"다들 네가 거인들에게 죽었다고 했어. 하지만 난 항상 네가 살아있다고 믿었어 — "
"그리고 아무도 네 시체를 찾지 못했어! 아미리, 정말 보고 싶었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2f8be8f8-27e0-4dc3-adf7-09102ad42f8c"
msgid ""
"\"There, now… Stop crying. I'm alive, alive and well. You know nothing can "
"beat me! Here, meet each other. Nilak, this is {mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}. "
"{mf|He's|She's} something like a new chieftain for me now. {name}, this is "
"Nilak. She... She's the only decent person in my whole lousy tribe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자, 이제… 그만 울어. 나는 살아있어. 나를 이길 수 있는 건 없어! 자, 서로 인사해. 닐락, 이쪽은 {mf|남작|여남작} {name}라고 해. 나에게 "
"새로운 족장이나 다름없어. {name}, 이쪽은 닐락이야. 그녀는... 이 형편없는 부족에서 유일하게 괜찮은 사람이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "eaea2d2b-0974-40ea-b476-be109092a253"
msgid ""
"\"Don't say that! Yes, the elders were mean to you, but you shouldn't blame "
"the whole tribe!\" {n}Having wiped her eyes, Nilak presses her hands against "
"her chest and bows before you.{/n} \"I am Nilak, song keeper of the Six "
"Bears. You must be the ruler of these lands. Forgive us for intruding into "
"your domain, but we...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 말하지 마! 그래. 장로들은 네게 비열하게 굴었지만 부족을 욕해서는 안돼!\" {n}그녀는 눈물을 닦고 가슴에 손을 얹고 "
"당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"저는 여섯 곰 부족의 노래지기인 닐락입니다. 당신이 이 땅의 통치자군요. 당신의 영역에 침입한 저희를 용서해 "
"주십시오만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "17420e1b-52b1-4237-9899-fd44e4eb31d1"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, really?\" {n}Amiri interrupts her.{/n} \"You are really song keeper "
"now? That's great! Since when?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 정말로?\" {n}아미리가 끼어듭니다.{/n} \"너 정말 노래지기가 되었어? 멋지다! 언제부터?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "8aa01322-2a73-41c0-9d9f-faf5096740cf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nilak gives her a sad smile.{/n} \"I always wanted to be one. While you "
"were learning to fight, I learned the legends. While you were training with "
"the sword, I trained with the tambourine. But I was initiated... during your "
"funeral feast, Amiri. — When we were saying goodbye to you and your party. "
"As I sang at the funeral pyre, my heart broke in pain. {g|Desna}Desna{/g} "
"whispered to me, and told me how I could turn this pain to power. Even the "
"rocks and stones cried over the fallen, when they heard my song that night.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}닐락은 그녀에게 슬픈 미소를 지었습니다.{/n} \"나는 항상 그렇게 되고 싶었어. 네가 싸움을 배울 때 나는 전설에 관한 노래를 "
"배웠어. 네가 검술을 훈련할 때 나는 탬버린을 익혔고. 하지만 나는 너의 장례식에서 내 첫 노래가 장송곡이 되어버렸어... 네게 "
"작별인사를 해야 했으니까. 장례식에서 노래를 불렀는데 가슴이 찢어 지는줄 알았어. {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}께서 속삭이셔서 이 고통을 "
"힘으로 돌리는 방법을 가르쳐 주셨어. 그날 밤에 내가 노래했을 때 바위와 돌들조차도 쓰러진 자들을 위해 부르짖었지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "f1f8bc22-a591-4ee7-bc4a-861e84b49d84"
msgid "\"We were like sisters from childhood. She…\""
msgstr "\"우린 어린 시절부터 자매 같았어. 그녀는 ..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "590bf32d-b3ec-4bf3-baca-19137e569d2c"
msgid "\"It just didn't come up. In fact…\""
msgstr "\"그냥 오지 않았다. 사실...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "c57c7f6c-2238-4a27-8f54-551c2bebbe23"
msgid "\"May both our tribes live in peace. We…\""
msgstr "\"우리 부족이 평화롭게 살길 바라. 우리는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "e09fddb2-f25b-410f-afc6-2c473a2e3600"
msgid "\"We're being haunted by a…\""
msgstr "\"우리는 혼령에 시달리고 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "87145d76-5139-4c19-aa9b-4554cc357172"
msgid ""
"{n}An old, grey-haired barbarian with a tattooed face interrupts her.{/n} "
"\"Nilak! Who are you chatting with? Who are you? Wait...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}얼굴에 문신을 한 늙은 회색 머리의 야만인이 그녀를 가로막습니다.{/n} \"닐락! 누구랑 이야기를 하는거냐? 너는 누구야? 잠깐..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "07cf610f-0566-4203-b8e2-40fa08926606"
msgid ""
"{n}He looks closer at Amiri's face an suddenly starts to yell, pointing his "
"crooked finger at her.{/n} \"You! Pariah! Freak! After all you did, you "
"still have the nerve to come and show your ugly face here!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 아미리의 얼굴을 가까이서 바라보다가 갑자기 비뚤어진 손가락으로 그녀를 가리키며 소리를 지르기 시작합니다.{/n} \"너! 추방자! "
"미쳤군! 네가 저지른 짓도 모자라 여기에 나타나다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "5e98d4ee-1405-401d-a542-b1ea2f1bba0c"
msgid ""
"\"Chieftain Akaia, this is {mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}, we're in {mf|his|her} "
"lands now. Please soften your heart. Maybe {mf|he|she} can help us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아카이아 족장님, 이쪽은 {mf|남작|여남작} {name}님 입니다. 우리는 지금 {mf|그의|그녀의} 영토에 와 있어요. 진정해 "
"주세요. {mf|그의|그녀의} 도움을 받을 수도 있잖아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "d1d5946f-5174-47fa-8487-5c73a0eac1a7"
msgid ""
"\"Hm! Hm. A baron? That's something like a chieftain, right? You don't look "
"like one... Well, whatever. I am Akaia, chieftain of the Six Bears tribe, "
"and I need you to give me this dirty scumbag!\" {n}He points his finger at "
"Amiri.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"흠! 흠. 남작이라고? 족장 같은 거지? 너는 그렇게 보이지 않는데... 뭐, 상관없어. 나는 아카이아, 여섯 곰 부족의 족장이다. "
"그리고 이 더러운 쓰레기 녀석이 필요하니 돌려주길 바란다!\" {n}그는 아미리를 손가락으로 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "1b5b95e0-7feb-4be6-8536-b5c5fa53ae66"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain gives you a contemptuous look.{/n} \"A baroness, huh? Yet "
"another tribe ruled by tits? Ugh. Fine. I am Akaia, the chieftain of the Six "
"Bears tribe, and I need you to give me this dirty scumbag!\" {n}He points "
"his finger at Amiri.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 당신을 경멸스러운 눈빛으로 봅니다.{/n} \"여남작? 응? 가슴 달린 족장이라는 거냐? 좋아. 나는 아카이아. 여섯 곰 "
"부족의 족장이다. 그리고 이 더러운 쓰레기 녀석이 필요하니 돌려주길 바란다!\" {n}그는 아미리를 손가락으로 가리킵니다.{/n}\n"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "53a5e7c6-79c4-4737-bb1b-42b8ddf24684"
msgid ""
"\"Guests?! We'd rather be guests in {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g} than this hole. But "
"we had to come. I'll tell you why we're here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"손님? 이런 촌구석보다는 {g|Abyss}심연{/g}의 손님이 되는 게 낫겠다. 하지만 우리는 올 수 밖에 없었다. 그 이유를 설명해주지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "65672594-5531-4900-9589-27ce8d6511fe"
msgid ""
"\"You threaten the Six Bears, you foolish {mf|pup|chick}?! Don't waste your "
"breath. Thanks to her we've witnessed horrors you can't imagine! Just let me "
"tell you what she's done to us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 애송이가 여섯 곰 부족을 위협해?! 시간 낭비하지 마라. 저 년 덕에 우리는 너는 상상도 못할 공포를 겪었어! 그냥 내가 저 "
"녀석이 우리에게 무슨 짓을 했는지 말하는 걸 듣기나 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "3308c034-0056-4e4f-b5f2-5927407e6979"
msgid ""
"\"This criminal has the blood of her tribesmen on her hands! I'll tell you "
"what she did to us — and then you can decide if you want scum like that in "
"your tribe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 범죄자 녀석은 부족의 피로 자신의 손을 더럽혔다! 그녀가 우리에게 무슨 짓을 했는지 알려주지. 그 이후에 저런 쓰레기가 네 부족에 "
"남길 원하는지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "47ad31bb-241c-4034-a38e-29ebbb2582cb"
msgid ""
"\"You have no idea of what a venomous snake you've invited into your tent! "
"Listen to me, and I will tell you!\""
msgstr "\"천막에 독사를 들였는지도 모르는 바보로군! 내 이야기를 듣는 게 좋을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "564e1ae9-df38-4667-bbd8-57c41864b021"
msgid ""
"\"From the dawn of time, our tribe lived by the old ways: everyone had a "
"place, a job to do. Men crafted and went hunting. Women bore children and "
"kept the huts clean. These are the ways set by our ancestors, and we do not "
"change it! But then this upstart girl wants to match herself against men. "
"She passed the warrior's initiation. She went hunting... But there's truth "
"in the saying: nothing good comes from a woman with a sword! Neighbour "
"tribes laughed at us: look, there's a second chieftain in the tribe! Soft "
"Chieftain, girl chieftain — must be the end of the Six Bears! And they were "
"right: she brought disaster upon our whole tribe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"태초부터 우리 부족은 옛날 방식대로 살았다. 모두가 자기 자리와 할 일이 있었다. 남자는 공예와 사냥을 했다. 여자는 아이를 키우고 "
"오두막을 청소했지. 그것이 우리 조상들이 지켜온 방식이고 바뀌지 않아야 한다! 그런데 이 건방진 년이 남자와 맞먹으려 했다. 그리고 "
"전사의 시험을 통과하고 사냥을 했지... 하지만 속담에는 진실이 담겨 있지. 여자가 칼을 휘둘러야 좋을 게 없어! 이웃 부족이 우리를 "
"비웃었다. 저 부족은 두 번째 족장이 있다. 연약한 족장, 여자 족장이 있다 — 여섯 곰 부족은 끝난게 틀림없어! 라고 말이다. 그리고 "
"그들이 맞았다. 그녀가 우리 부족 전체에 재앙을 가져왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "e9c01edc-33c3-4bcf-9a82-d1a64aa7b265"
msgid ""
"\"Once, a gang of giants came to our lands. They scared our prey, attacked "
"our huntsmen... So we decided to deal with them. We sent a group — and she "
"went along. For a long time we waited for this group to return, then we went "
"searching for them even longer — but all we found were their dead bodies! "
"Giants killed them all! Everyone... except for her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거인들이 우리 땅에 온 적이 있다. 그들은 우리의 먹이를 빼앗고 사냥꾼을 공격했지... 그래서 우리는 그들을 처리하기로 결정했다. 우리는 그녀를 "
"포함해 전사들을 보냈다. 우리는 그들이 돌아오기를 기다렸고, 더 오랫동안 그들을 찾아다녔지만 우리가 찾은 것은 그들의 시체뿐이었다! 거인이 모두 죽여버렸지! "
"모두를... 이 년만 빼고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "ab6841f4-16bf-4c02-aeca-cf4ceb1cd484"
msgid ""
"\"And then things got even worse. Have you seen those monsters? An evil "
"spirit sends them! The ghost of a giant! He's the one who chased us from our "
"lands! He chased us through all of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}! Even now, he's "
"somewhere nearby — maybe he's just over that hill! He chases us, kills our "
"people... And always says the same: \"Bring the thief to me! Find Amiri!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 나서 상황이 더 악화되었다. 그 괴물들을 보았나? 악령이 그들을 보냈어! 거인의 유령이지! 그는 우리의 땅에서 우리를 "
"추격해왔다. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 전역에서 우릴 추격해왔어! 지금도 어딘가에 있다 — 아마 저 언덕 위에 있을지도 모르지! 그는 "
"우리를 쫓고 우리 사람들을 죽이고... 그리고 항상 똑같이 해 : 도둑년을 내게 데려와! 아미리를 찾아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "c45c86b5-bfc6-4081-91c7-a089132c0d9a"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain turns to Amiri, his face red with anger. He shouts, "
"slobbering in her face:{/n} \"Now you understand?! That's what your dreams "
"have cost us! You brought a curse on our tribe — pariah! Now, hand me your "
"weapons and get yourself to the women's hut! That is your place! It always "
"was, and always will be! We'll feed you to the ghost, and maybe then he'll "
"leave us alone. And at least you'll atone for a tiny part of your guilt!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 아미리를 분노로 붉어진 얼굴로 봅니다. 그는 그녀에게 침을 튀기며 고함칩니다.{/n} \"이제 알겠어?! 네 꿈 때문에 우리가 "
"치룬 대가를! 넌 우리 부족에 저주를 가져왔어 — 추방자(pariah)! 이제 무기를 내게 넘겨주고 오두막이나 청소하러 가라! "
"거기가 네 자리다! 언제나 그랬고 앞으로도 그럴 거야! 널 유령에게 넘기면 우릴 내버려둘지도 몰라. 적어도 네 죄의 작은 "
"부분이라도 그렇게 속죄해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "94c359ca-df43-4975-9323-71177ba63eaf"
msgid ""
"{n}In reply, Amiri headbutts the chieftain's face, breaking his nose with a "
"sickly crunch. Paying no heed to Nilak's squeal, and growling in anger, she "
"leaps upon him, punching the old man's face. The chieftain spits blood and "
"struggles to speak — and Amiri grabs her sword. You realize that a murder "
"will quickly follow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}대답으로 아미리는 족장의 얼굴에 박치기를 해서 그의 코를 부러뜨렸습니다. 닐락의 비명소리에 아랑곳하지 않고, 그녀는 분노로 고함을 지르며 "
"그에게 달려들어 얼굴을 가격합니다. 족장은 피를 뱉으며 무언가를 말하려했고 아미리는 칼을 집어듭니다. 당신은 곧 살인이 일어날 "
"것을 깨닫습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "47e65f3f-d59e-4a31-bfab-5ba420c7b4df"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri raises her sword. Akaia shuts his eyes, but the final blow never "
"comes. Amiri sheathes her sword, pushes the chieftain onto the ground and "
"spits on him.{/n} \"Get lost of my sight, you scumbag! Next time I see you I "
"won't stop at words!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리가 칼을 들어올립니다. 아카이아는 눈을 질끈 감았지만, 최후의 일격은 오지 않았습니다. 아미리가 칼을 집어넣고 족장을 땅바닥에 "
"내동댕이치고는 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"내 눈 앞에서 꺼져, 이 쓰레기 자식! 다음 번에 널 보면 말로만 끝나지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "73ddd6e1-17a4-4db2-973c-7a616ec7bf15"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri plunges her sword into the chieftain's chest. She breathes heavily, "
"staring at the old man as he falls to his knees before her. Then she looks "
"around the campsite, and all the barbarians who witnessed the scene, Nilak "
"included, dash inside their huts.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 족장의 가슴에 칼을 꽂았습니다. 그녀는 가쁜 숨을 몰아쉬며 자신 앞에 무릎을 꿇은 노인을 바라봅니다. 그녀는 야영지를 둘러보았고, "
"닐락을 포함해 이 광경을 목격한 야만인들이 모두 오두막 안으로 뛰어들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "fb659140-31f5-4f24-a335-f26c41fb4a3c"
msgid ""
"{n}Nilak helps the defeated chieftain stand up, and takes him into the "
"nearest hut. The rest of barbarians hurry away, hiding themselves from "
"Amiri's anger.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}닐락은 쓰러진 족장을 일으키고는 가까운 오두막으로 부축합니다. 나머지 야만인들은 아미리의 분노로부터 서둘러 몸을 숨깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8545a803-78a0-433f-961a-0388924b2f43"
msgid ""
"{n}Panting heavily, and swaying like a drunk, Amiri approaches you and puts "
"her bloody hand on your shoulder.{/n} \"That old goat said... Some evil "
"spirit must be somewhere nearby. Let's go. We find him, and we kill him. And "
"then we make them all go back where they from. I don't owe to them. Nothing. "
"And never. I don't want to see them never again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거칠게 숨을 쉬며 비틀거리는 아미리가 당신에게 다가와 피묻은 손을 당신 어깨에 얹습니다.{/n} \"그 늙은이가 말했어... "
"근처 어딘가에 악령이 있다고. 가서 찾아서 죽이자. 그리고 다들 원래 있던 곳으로 돌아가게 하는 거야. 난 그들에게 빚진게 없고 앞으로도 그럴 거야. 그들을 다시는 보고 "
"싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b4e5020d-93cb-4974-a0e1-942b0bf9772b"
msgid ""
"\"So you're a bard? Great! Me too! We should share some songs when we have "
"time. You can tell us what they sing in your tribe, and I'll tell you all "
"about Amiri's feats!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너 바드야? 잘됐다! 나도 그래! 언제 시간 날 때 노래를 함께 부르자. 너의 부족에서 노래 부르는 것을 알려줄 수 있을 거야. 난 "
"아미리의 위업들에 대해 알려줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "c81e1c4f-b388-4c2c-9b61-13a313bd74f9"
msgid "\"I'd like that!\""
msgstr "\"좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bf898e47-d84f-4638-890f-6f4fb53144da"
msgid ""
"\"Watch your tongue, chief. You are a guest in these lands — uninvited, and "
"not particularly welcome.\""
msgstr "\"말조심해, 족장. 너는 이곳의 불청객이다. 그리고 특별히 환대받는 것도 아냐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "3238faa7-cef0-4757-94a3-5771f2fef996"
msgid ""
"\"Quiet, woman! The chiefs are talking! You think you can talk back to a "
"warrior just because you learned to put on armor?\""
msgstr "\"조용히 해라, 여자! 족장이 말하고 있지 않나! 갑옷 좀 입었다고 전사에게 말대꾸해도 된다고 생각하나보지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ceecd7e5-c59f-41eb-9035-7ee2b7d158d7"
msgid ""
"\"Soft chief? They really couldn't find a better nickname for this "
"brontosaurus than soft?\" {n}Jubilost chuckles.{/n} \"Or does this tribe "
"consist only of giants? I mean, that's obviously not true... unless gender "
"stereotypes are having a serious impact on the perception of reality...\""
msgstr ""
"\"연약한 족장이라고? 그들이 정말 이 브론토사우르스 녀석의 별명으로 연약하다 보다 나은 걸 못찾은 거야?\" {n}주빌로스트는 껄껄 "
"웃습니다.{/n} \"아니면 이 부족은 거인들로만 구성되어 있나? 분명 그렇지는 않겠지... 성 고정 관념으로 현실 인식에 심각한 영향을 "
"받고 있는게 아니라면 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "da390992-e018-4448-8614-39eb5b6b3865"
msgid ""
"\"I am proud of you, Amiri. Returning the sword to the sheath and avoiding "
"bloodshed — that is a true feat that not many are capable of.\""
msgstr "\"잘하셨습니다. 아미리. 칼을 거두고 유혈사태를 피하는 것은 아무나 할 수 없는 진정한 위업입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "00344837-f659-4fb0-ad4f-dc8ba5b479f8"
msgid "\"Oh, get lost! This isn't the time for your lectures!\""
msgstr "\"아, 좀 꺼져! 지금은 네 설교나 들을 기분이 아냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBearsCampStart/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "3e51e341-b7a3-4bec-9a70-c63037e5781c"
msgid "\"Think somebody maybe wants get stabbed...\""
msgstr "\"누군가 칼빵을 맞고 싶어하나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBears_Amiri_JoinOrLeave/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a1816191-521d-4471-a895-6a728c89d3fd"
msgid "[Join up with Amiri] \"Let's go.\""
msgstr "[아미리와 함께 갑니다] \"가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBears_Amiri_JoinOrLeave/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e07aadc9-4a0f-4276-a606-f8faab904ac2"
msgid "[Leave the camp] \"Wait, I need to do something else first.\""
msgstr "[캠프를 떠납니다] \"잠깐. 다른 일을 먼저 해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBears_Amiri_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6cdb2ec8-85da-4e3b-b24a-0c6bed2e740c"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri is waiting for you near the Six Bears' camp. She hesitates, then "
"speaks.{/n} \"So, what now… We go?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 여섯 곰 부족 야영지 근처에서 당신을 기다리고 있습니다. 그녀는 주저하며 말을 합니다.{/n} \"그래서 어떻게 하지... "
"갈까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBears_Amiri_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "0936e4d5-b995-4687-9d2a-15c6906e7622"
msgid "\"Good. Let's do this quick.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 빨리 해치우자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/SixBears_Amiri_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "0e12a356-e550-4805-80b8-3ef015330a0c"
msgid "\"Fine… I never want to see them anyway.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 그들을 보고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5b5943e4-240c-4cfa-8119-4b6adfb03df4"
msgid "\"The Six Bears? Of course I remember!\""
msgstr "\"여섯 곰 부족? 물론 기억해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "7af9f112-af22-41cf-9a21-f646f4e3f9f1"
msgid "\"Those scumbags who exiled you?\""
msgstr "\"너를 추방한 그 쓰레기들?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4e8b0662-275d-4262-8bda-eef5a3ce019c"
msgid "\"I thought you're in my tribe now.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 부족원이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9351ded6-7d60-43b5-b5f9-6f484a00e2c7"
msgid "[Nod without a word]"
msgstr "[말 없이 끄덕입니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "a83efcbb-ac04-4075-b074-074e0c3bbc20"
msgid "\"Do you want me to chase them off?\""
msgstr "\"내가 그들을 쫓아내길 바래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e5b42cef-044c-41d9-b887-8711ef0155a0"
msgid "\"That's odd. We're a long way from the Realm of the Mammoth Lords!\""
msgstr "\"이상한 일이군. 우리는 매머드 군주의 영역에서 멀리 떨어져 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "5cc109e9-8707-4592-a32c-7fa10c87dfd2"
msgid "\"What are they doing here?\""
msgstr "\"그들은 여기서 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "6380a3d9-6f54-4a9b-8e4b-03e7d8e11db8"
msgid "\"Are you sure it's them?\""
msgstr "\"그들이 확실해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f6dd4705-9ae4-46db-8a01-0ad4ea30dd1b"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian sips the beer from her mug with a grim look. She hesitates, "
"as if she doesn't know where to begin.{/n} \"Once I told you about my tribe. "
"Remember?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 무서운 눈빛으로 맥주를 홀짝입니다. 그녀는 어디서부터 시작해야 할지 모르는 것처럼 주저합니다.{/n} \"내 부족에 대해 "
"말했지. 기억하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "c74ed184-37bc-49fd-b10d-e7c6f05b1db4"
msgid "\"Me — I'd be happy to forget. But…\""
msgstr "\"잊고 싶은 기억이야. 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "178bb097-3fe6-4c7d-871a-2fab953e3722"
msgid ""
"\"That's them. I thought I'd never see them again — and thank "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} for that. But hell no!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이야. 나는 그들을 결코 다시는 볼 수 없을 거라 생각했어. 그랬다면 {g|Gorum}고럼{/g}에게 감사했겠지. 하지만 아니야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8a65028b-7436-48ba-8b70-d8715f550d6a"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! I left them and I don't regret it! But here's the shitty part…\""
msgstr "\"물론! 나는 그들을 버렸고 후회하지 않는다! 하지만 엿 같은 사실이 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "dfcbaafd-fa89-4721-8dd7-bc3ede8a456f"
msgid ""
"{n}She sips some more beer and clears her throat nervously, and then Amiri "
"continues.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그녀는 맥주를 한 모금 더 마시며 긴장한 목을 축이고, 계속 말을 이어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "318cc5c0-b31a-40c8-9552-f1237b1a43eb"
msgid ""
"\"They were spotted on your lands. Our scouts told they saw their camp near "
"the {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} border.\""
msgstr "\"너의 땅에서 그들이 발견되었어. 그들의 캠프가 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 경계에 있다고 척후병이 말하더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "ec117214-fb56-44b2-88c8-1b77442a5535"
msgid "\"You're asking me? I don't have no idea!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 묻는 거야? 나는 모르겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "733f1532-3639-4dc2-8eae-50bd860d047b"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly. Leaving homeland and heading off south, where strangers live — "
"the tribes have never done this!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 고향을 떠나 이방인들의 땅인 남쪽으로 갔어. 절대 그럴 이유가 없는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "916709e6-2882-4ade-8a31-d774791a2029"
msgid ""
"\"What? Haha, It would be really nice to kick their asses… But now let's get "
"serious.\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구? 하하. 엉덩이를 걷어차버리면 좋겠군... 하지만 장난은 치지 말자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "bb2cb94d-9326-4ee2-ad76-d91126d69f3c"
msgid ""
"\"First, I also thought our scouts were mistaken. You southerners can't tell "
"one tribe and another. So I talked the scout really long — asked him about "
"the tattoos, the amulets, the looks of the camp... It's them. It's really "
"them. I know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음에는 나도 척후병이 잘못 본 걸로 생각했어. 너희 남부인들은 부족을 구별하지 못해. 그래서 그들에게 문신이나 목걸이, 캠프의 "
"생김새 등을 진짜 오래 물어봤는데... 그들이었다. 진짜 그들이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "efbcedcb-c1e5-4256-a76f-749bc06b5d30"
msgid ""
"\"I really hoped I'd never see these ugly faces again. I walked across "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} to be as far from them as I could! And now they "
"follow me. What the hell?! So... Let's visit my old tribe. Find out what do "
"they want so far from their snow. And then we can kick them back!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그 낯짝들을 보지 않기를 바랬어. 나는 할 수 있는 한 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 그들과 멀리 떨어져 있었어! "
"그런데 나를 쫓고 있는 거야. 도대체 왜?! 그러니까... 나의 옛 부족을 찾아가자. 무엇 때문에 자기들 눈밭에서 여기까지 왔는지 "
"알아보는 거야. 그러고 나서 쫓아버리자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q2_Pariah/Start_Tavern/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "efa3bcd1-9573-4af2-8e6c-7f0eadccc461"
msgid ""
"{n}She finishes her beer in one gulp, then belches and stumbles towards the "
"tavern maid to order another.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그녀는 맥주를 단숨에 다 마신 다음, 트림하고 또 다른 주문을 하기 위해 점원 쪽으로 비틀거리며 다가갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/BearsCamp_JoinOrLeave/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "38defca9-8eb5-4607-95ea-f564616c6728"
msgid "[Join with Amiri] \"Sure. Let's go.\""
msgstr "[아미리와 합류합니다] \"그래. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/BearsCamp_JoinOrLeave/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "3a3c0390-23a7-4fe2-86d2-c62ed5ed9381"
msgid ""
"[Leave the Six Bears' camp] \"Wait, I need to do something else first.\""
msgstr "[캠프를 떠납니다] \"잠깐. 다른 일을 먼저 해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/BearsCamp_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b1922db9-2fbc-4be9-80f7-3c9298732f04"
msgid "\"They're waiting for us. Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"그들이 우리를 기다리고 있다. 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/BearsCamp_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "20de3695-dc86-496c-893b-04b437502758"
msgid "\"Fine, just hurry up!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 서둘러!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/BearsCamp_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "6ea53b8d-852d-45ac-ab82-c8b00abe00fc"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri fills her chest with air and exhales sharply.{/n} \"Let's go!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 가슴에 공기를 채우고 날카롭게 소리 질렀습니다.{/n} \"가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "f7dc8960-4b61-4339-b987-948bedd0225f"
msgid "\"Congratulations, Nilak!\""
msgstr "\"축하해. 닐락!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "a7804260-1593-49a9-9a15-93d486a3983f"
msgid "\"Where will you lead your tribe now?\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족은 어디로 갈 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "9f694de3-6e23-4ee9-900b-6245c985710e"
msgid "\"Why don't you stay in my lands?\""
msgstr "\"내 땅에 머물러 있지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "24c74a81-013d-460d-96e9-0ad87ef3ee55"
msgid "\"Amiri, maybe now you can return to your tribe?\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 어쩌면 지금 네 부족에게 돌아갈 수 있지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fb10731b-1d6f-452f-ba44-48032b69e2cc"
msgid "Gave the Six Bears tribe some money."
msgstr "여섯 곰 부족에게 돈을 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "1a120057-4bc9-41d6-bd7f-9d074bd0c299"
msgid "[Give 1000 gold coins] \"Here, take this. You might need it.\""
msgstr "[금화 천개를 줍니다] \"여기. 가져가. 필요할지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "8bcb2328-95b9-4d2b-b63a-6806b5cca625"
msgid "\"Farewell, Nilak. Have a safe journey.\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 닐락. 안전한 여행을 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter_Dialogue01
msgctxt "b7d20616-25f1-4ff7-b5e4-cf072e3e08d1"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach the Six Bears campsite, you hear some rising noise and "
"rumbling. Gathered outside their tents, the men of the tribe are having a "
"heated discussion over something. One of them, a huge grey-haired man with a "
"scar on his face, shouts:{/n} \"Brothers! This cannot go on! We need new "
"chieftain, or this tribe is no more!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 여섯 곰 부족 야영지에 다가가자 소음과 울림 소리가 들립니다. 장막 밖에서 모여든 부족의 사람들은 무언가에 열띤 토론을 하고 "
"있습니다. 그 중 한 명은 얼굴에 흉터가있는 회색 머리카락을 가진 덩치 큰 사람이 소리쳤습니다.{/n} \"형제들이여! 이 일은 계속 될 "
"수 없다! 우리는 새로운 수장이 없다면 이 부족은 더 이상 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter_Dialogue01
msgctxt "42b56afc-7f60-4d71-82dd-c19bac91d5d9"
msgid ""
"\"{d|ChiefAkaia}Akaia{/d} has lost his instincts. He led us into a trap! We "
"almost got killed in the war with Brevoy — all of us! Damn it, the only "
"reason he still breathes is the kin-slayer was {d|Amiri Chief Lives}too "
"weak{/d} to finish him off! Away with the old fool!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {d|ChiefAkaia} 아카이아 {/d}는 본능을 잃었다. 그는 함정에 우리를 이끌었다! 우리는 브레보이와의 전쟁에서 거의 "
"전멸했다. 젠장! 그가 아직도 숨 쉬는 유일한 이유는 동족 살해자가 그를 끝장내기에 {d|Amiri Chief Lives} 너무 약하기 "
"때문이다. {/d} 이 늙은이를 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter_Dialogue01
msgctxt "ba00c722-c3e4-4ba7-a70a-1d6acbcb84ec"
msgid ""
"\"After the kin-slayer {d|Amiri Kill Chief}killed{/d} Akaia, we all acted "
"like blind pups! We jumped into the trap. Almost killed ourselves against "
"the {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}! No real chief would let that happen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"동족 살해자가 아카이아를 {d|Amiri Kill Chief} 죽인 후 {/d} 우리 모두는 눈먼 강아지처럼 행동했다! 우리는 함정에 "
"뛰어 들어 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}로부터 멸망할 뻔했다! 진정한 족장은 그렇게하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "00918fa6-33ec-4990-8859-b72a0e855673"
msgid ""
"{n}Grinding his rotten teeth, Akaia tears a heavy necklace from his neck and "
"throws it into dust.{/n} \"Take it, may you all choke on it! I'll see how "
"you manage without old Akaia!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 미소진 입에 썩은 이가 드러나며 아카이아는 목걸이를 뜯어내 바닥에 던집니다.{/n} \"가져가라. 나 없이도 잘 할 수 있나 "
"보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter_Dialogue02
msgctxt "4ce5a435-809f-42b2-b4fb-113769c6d382"
msgid "\"So, who's gonna be the new chieftain? Maybe you?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 누가 새로운 족장이 될 거지? 너인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter_Dialogue01
msgctxt "debf46ae-69e5-4c62-8b92-dd5925387365"
msgid ""
"\"Me? Oh no. The chieftain must know what threatens the tribe. Be able to "
"defend it. If we were home, I would fight for power, but here, in the "
"southern lands, we need a different kind of chief. I say {d|Nilak}Nilak{/d}!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아니다. 족장은 부족의 위험이 무엇인지 알고 막을 수 있어야 한다. 우리가 고향에 있었다면 나는 싸웠겠지만 우리는 새로운 족장이 "
"필요하다. {d|Nilak}닐락{/d}이 족장이 되어야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter_Dialogue01
msgctxt "0dee40a2-f7ff-4da9-81f7-344fcd125a53"
msgid ""
"{n}There is grumbling in the crowd, but the barbarian continues, shouting "
"over it:{/n} \"Think: who led us through {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} — was it "
"Akaia? No, it was Nilak! Who negotiated with the local tribes while he "
"huffed and beat his chest? Nilak! Who was the only one who saw the danger of "
"Armag and the Sisters? Nilak! Of course, a woman has never been leader of "
"the Six Bears before — just like Six Bears have never left our homeland "
"before. But if we want to survive, we must change! Nilak! Nilak! Nilak!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}일부는 불평했지만 야만인은 계속해서 소리칩니다.{/n} \"누가 우리를 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 이끌었나? "
"아카이아인가? 아니다. 닐락이다! 아카이아가 불평하는 동안 협상은 누가 했지? 닐락이다! 아르막과 자매들은 위험하다고 경고한 이는? "
"닐락이다! 여자가 여섯 곰 부족의 족장이었던 적은 없었다. 하지만 부족이 고향을 떠났던 일 역시 없었지. 살아남고 싶다면, 우리는 변해야 "
"한다! 닐락! 닐락! 닐락!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ba6c44ea-925d-4277-8930-2570abba94de"
msgid ""
"{n}One by one, the barbarians stop arguing and join the chant. Soon the "
"whole tribe is shouting Nilak's name. The girl steps from the crowd. Her "
"face is confused, but, glancing above the men's heads, she sees Amiri's "
"encouraging smile and nods. One of the barbarians puts a necklace of fangs "
"around her neck, once worn by Akaia.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}야만족은 하나둘씩 불평을 멈추고 같이 외치기 시작합니다. 이내 모든 부족이 닐락의 이름을 외칩니다. 닐락은 군중 앞으로 나섭니다. "
"그녀의 얼굴은 혼란스러워보이지만 군중을 바라보고 아미리의 웃음과 끄덕임을 봅니다. 야만인 중 하나가 아카이아가 쓰던 목걸이를 그녀의 목에 "
"걸어줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "9a9aa2b0-bc48-41c1-b90b-05ae0f7e89e9"
msgid ""
"\"Brothers! I accept this honor. I swear that I will lead and protect the "
"tribe, like every chieftain since the time of the Bear Ancestors. I will "
"find a way to save us from the ghost that haunts us, and I will find a place "
"for us in these strange southern lands. Get packed! We return to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"형제들아! 나는 이 영예를 받아들인다. 나는 선조들의 족장들이 그러했듯 우리 부족을 이끌고 지키겠노라. 나는 우리를 괴롭히는 "
"유령으로부터 우리를 구하고 새로운 터를 찾아낼 것이다. 준비해라! 우리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 갈 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "376faf43-67b3-4c33-ab93-622744e748ec"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians disperse and start to pack their tents. Nilak approaches, "
"and hugs Amiri.{/n} \"So, this is how it all turns out... I still cannot "
"believe it. I never wanted to be leader! But you — you should be the chief!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만족은 흩어져서 각자의 텐트로 돌아가 짐을 꾸립니다. 닐락은 아미리에게 가서 안깁니다.{/n} \"결국 이렇게 되었구나... 나는 "
"믿기지 않아. 나는 족장이 되기를 바라지 않았어! 네가 족장이 되어야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f7056193-fb5a-4a99-bc24-e679f2716e3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri shakes her head.{/n} \"There will never be no place in the Six "
"Bears for me. But you can do it without me, sis!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리가 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"여섯 곰 부족에 나를 위한 자리는 없어. 하지만 너는 나 없이 잘할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "776eed23-f806-47ab-838e-0ad5443807b8"
msgid "\"Thanks. It seems that everything in the world will change, someday!\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 언젠가 세상은 바뀔 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "6ec05481-c03a-420e-9e94-90713cdc8885"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, but there is no place for us here. These forests, swamps, "
"rivers… Strange and unfamiliar people... The Six Bears want to be with our "
"kin, the Kellids.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워. 하지만 우리를 위한 자리는 없어. 숲과 늪, 강... 이상하고 익숙하지 않은 사람들... 여섯 곰 부족은 우리의 친척 "
"캘리드와 함께하고 싶어해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "d0b7f1d5-4178-4438-ae59-db834050c99a"
msgid ""
"\"To {g|Starfall}Starfall{/g}. The evil spirit who haunts us is not that "
"powerful. He doesn't dare attack near big settlements.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Starfall}스타폴{/g}로 가. 우리를 괴롭히는 악령은 그다지 강력하지 않아. 그는 큰 정착촌 근처에서는 감히 공격하지 "
"않을 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8e1a4c66-8860-4af2-bfa5-974b6489cca0"
msgid ""
"\"No. You heard what they said. I'm pariah, kin-slayer. This cannot be "
"changed. Even a chieftain's order will not make them forget what I did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 너는 그들이 말한 것을 들었어. 나는 추방당했고 동족을 죽였어. 이 사실은 바뀌지 않아. 족장이 명령해도 그들은 잊지 못할 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "5c6bae2f-aed2-4f80-b20f-12c4b751b7a1"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I hope one day our tribe will repay you for all the good you've "
"done.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 언젠간 이 빚은 꼭 갚을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "48ccfa8f-1c4f-40a5-bfc2-a8a923bc77d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Nilak bows to you, hugs Amiri farewell, and leads her tribe away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}닐락은 당신에게 인사를 하고 아미리를 포옹하며 작별 인사를 하고 부족을 이끌어 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a3c0bfe9-85bb-427d-a03f-d6f030f85f39"
msgid ""
"\"A fine place for fugitives... Main thing, though — don't trust anyone "
"there. And if anyone from the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} comes up "
"to you, don't even listen what they have to say — just punch them in the "
"face!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도망자들을 위한 훌륭한 장소를 찾아... 무엇보다 누구도 믿지 마라. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에서 누군가 "
"너를 찾아오면 그들이 뭐라하건 얼굴을 묵사발로 만들어버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q3_Call_of_the_Blood/Nilak_new_chief/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "85f17aca-414b-4933-b636-f794822134e9"
msgid ""
"\"I tire so of this admiration for family — both in savages and in civilized "
"peoples. What's so special about the blood of kin that it can't be shed like "
"any other?\""
msgstr "\"나는 야만인이건 문명인이건 가족애에 지쳤다. 혈통이 뭐라고 그렇게 아껴야 하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2edb8903-d9e4-40c1-a2af-6ecb20481a8f"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri kneels before the Nilak's body. Covering her face with her "
"trembling hands, she lets loose a wrenching scream.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 니락의 시체 앞에서 무릎을 꿇습니다. 그녀의 얼굴을 떨리는 손으로 가리고 아미리는 비참한 울음을 토합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "4ce460c4-d268-4a03-b478-7ad4169e404f"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri kneels before Akaia's body and reaches down to close his eyes. {/n} "
"\"Rest in peace, you old piece of crap. After all, you were a real "
"chieftain, at least at the end.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 Akaia의 시체 앞에서 무릎을 꿇고 눈을 감깁니다.{/n} \"평안히 쉬어라. 늙은이. 결국 너는 끝까지 족장이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "09ed9b33-78eb-469a-ad5f-2a4259fbf2c0"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri rises to her feet. She touches her smooth skin through the hole in "
"her bloody clothes, then grips the hilt of her sword.{/n} \"Huh. Still "
"alive, ain't I?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 일어섭니다. 그녀의 매끄러운 피부를 피투성이 옷에 감추고 칼 손잡이를 쥡니다.{/n} \"하. 내가 아직 살아 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "e15b52d3-b85a-48f7-951c-cb515ef80f26"
msgid ""
"{n}With a final, indistinct cry, the ghostly giant dissolves into the air. "
"Amiri utters a victorious shout, and then falls into laughter.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막으로 본능적인 울음과 함께 창백한 거인은 허공으로 사라집니다. 아미리는 승리의 함성을 지르고 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "7b7c78c3-d552-4071-a145-3b9a2d3d6934"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian looks at her fellow tribesmen.{/n} \"She gave her life for "
"you, worms! The first worthy chieftain in the history of your lousy tribe. "
"If you waste her sacrifice, I'll come back and chop off all of your empty "
"heads!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 자신의 부족을 봅니다.{/n} \"그녀는 너희를 위해 목숨을 버렸다. 벌레들아! 너의 형편없는 부족에게 처음으로 제대로 된 "
"족장이었지만. 그녀의 희생을 헛되이 한다면 내가 돌아와서 너희 머리를 모두 잘라버리겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "5b1079a6-7c00-489a-b19e-24cfe82fac83"
msgid ""
"{n}She walks toward you on unsteady legs.{/n} \"You could stop her! But you "
"didn't! Come, 'chief.' We have nothing more to do here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 불편한 걸음으로 당신에게 다가옵니다.{/n} \"네가 그녀를 막을 수 있었어! 막았어야 했는데! 돌아와. 여기서는 더이상 할 "
"게 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "0e9da45c-7221-4b73-80fd-3719be14faf0"
msgid ""
"{n}Approaching you, she grins crookedly.{/n} \"Well, chief, now I'm done "
"with the Six Bears. All my debts are paid. Now you are my tribe. I go where "
"you go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신에게 다가가면서 그녀는 비틀린 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나는 여섯곰 부족과 끝이 났다. 내 빚은 모두 갚았고 너희가 내 "
"부족이다. 너를 어디든 따라가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a45c07fd-a8a8-4c35-a262-f16f43bebe13"
msgid ""
"{n}Turning to the men of the Six Bears tribe, she raises her bloody fist "
"over her head.{/n} \"You see? This is how me and my chief smash freaks and "
"scum! If his brother come, he gets the same! We fear nobody ever!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여섯곰 부족에게 향하며 그녀는 피묻은 주먹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"보았나? 이것이 나고 나의 족장은 쓰레기들을 처단한다. 그의 "
"형제가 와도 같은 결과를 얻을 것이다! 우리는 아무도 두려워하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "afab330e-3e7d-4be5-af5d-4eecd428ab09"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri approaches you, grinning wild and triumphant.{/n} \"Well, chief, "
"where to next? To the {g|First World}First World{/g}? Or right into the "
"{g|Abyss}Abyss{/g}? Together we can smash anyone and anywhere!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 승리의 웃음을 지으며 당신에게 다가갑니다.{/n} \"대장. 어디로 가지? {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}? "
"아니면 {g|Abyss} 심연{/g}으로? 어디를 가든 어떤 녀석이든 함께라면 부숴버릴 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "cb37b4d6-2ed9-4896-b6f9-21250534bf2b"
msgid ""
"{n}She turns to her former tribesmen.{/n} \"I paid all my debts. Live — and "
"obey Nilak.\""
msgstr "{n}그녀는 부족에게 몸을 돌립니다.{/n} \"나는 모든 빚을 갚았다. 생존하고 닐락에게 복종해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Amiri-Final/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "c0ef63b7-cd0d-49ce-8371-14765d7ee4b9"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian approaches you, a triumphant grin spreading slowly across "
"her face.{/n} \"Well, chief, we won! Where to next? To the {g|First World}"
"First World{/g}? Or right into the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g}? Together we can smash "
"anyone and anywhere!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인 여성은 당신에게 다가갑니다.{/n} \"대장. 어디로 가지? {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}? 아니면 "
"{g|Abyss} 심연{/g}으로? 어디를 가든 어떤 녀석이든 함께라면 부숴버릴 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Akaiya_AmiriSacrifice_String
msgctxt "8bf47f05-fd66-4173-a8a7-d92f8b06ca12"
msgid "\"You ruined the tribe, but then you saved it.\""
msgstr "\"네가 부족을 망쳐 놓았지만 그들을 구했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Akaiya_KillFionn_String
msgctxt "6a20cae1-f733-4980-8b3c-35ed9f2914d3"
msgid "\"Crazy woman! What have you done?\""
msgstr "\"이 미친년이! 무슨 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_AmiriSacrifice_1_String
msgctxt "af718986-e42f-4a84-84ac-0f403b9e8325"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri is no longer our sister, but she is a hero — and people will sing of "
"her to the end of time.\""
msgstr "\"아미리는 더 이상 우리 자매가 아니라 영웅이다. 사람들은 그녀를 길이길이 칭송할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_AmiriSacrifice_2_String
msgctxt "bdce9c6d-c684-492f-be16-865fed1d51a4"
msgid ""
"\"The debt of blood is paid in full. No one can call Amiri a pariah no more."
"\""
msgstr "\"피의 빚은 모두 갚았다. 누구도 아미리를 추방자라고 부를 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_AmiriSacrifice_3_String
msgctxt "88c806bc-fe75-449e-930f-abc23333748f"
msgid "\"Not every man could accomplish such a feat!\""
msgstr "\"누구도 이런 업적을 성취할 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_KillFionn_1_String
msgctxt "df98cc85-1d3e-4a74-8a2e-7eb906511e6d"
msgid "\"What a fight!\""
msgstr "\"대단한 싸움이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_KillFionn_2_String
msgctxt "4ee2b2e9-5ab6-4438-9227-47016f8575f8"
msgid "\"A warrior like Amiri would honor any tribe!\""
msgstr "\"아미리와 같은 전사는 어떤 부족이라도 존경할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_KillFionn_3_String
msgctxt "f3eb6313-6ebf-4601-9d84-279d23977e2c"
msgid "\"Amiri is so powerful! And we drove her away!\""
msgstr "\"아미리는 매우 강력하다! 그런 그녀를 우리는 몰아냈다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_NilakDead_1_String
msgctxt "ac243a91-832b-475f-8c8c-52cbda8487c0"
msgid "\"Who will be chieftain now?\""
msgstr "\"누가 족장이 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_NilakDead_2_String
msgctxt "29512f21-39d1-4828-93e2-4c48f69f488d"
msgid "\"Without Nilak we will not survive the wild southern lands...\""
msgstr "\"닐락이 없다면 우리는 남부에서 살아남지 못할 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Bears_NilakDead_3_String
msgctxt "c3f5a41e-14bc-4631-8056-96a489ed4b19"
msgid "\"We'll survive. Don't know how, but we will.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 살아남을 것이다. 어떻게 해야 할지 모르지만 우리는 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/ItIsDone_String
msgctxt "3dd173a3-6eac-47c3-b5cf-5935da165827"
msgid "\"The ritual is over. Brother... I'm coming.\""
msgstr "\"의식은 끝났어. 형... 내가 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Barks/Ressurect_Amiri_String
msgctxt "ecec45ef-931c-42e7-8541-b9d0b4854fd8"
msgid ""
"\"Such nobility is rare among mortals! It should not be wasted. I still have "
"enough strength for one spell...\""
msgstr "\"그런 고귀함은 필멸자 중에서도 드물다! 낭비해서는 안된다. 내겐 아직 마법 하나를 쓸 힘이 남아있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "353f3a36-37d8-4973-8baf-3ae6ce2328fe"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c4548787-3825-4769-85ed-8545bd784f2a"
msgid "\"Why do you need this sword?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 검이 필요로 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "504acba7-9ff9-466b-9df0-13ca9c271cfc"
msgid "\"How did this sword end up in Amiri's hands?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 이 칼은 아미리의 손에 들어갔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "64a30ce9-f94f-475d-8d67-74b99ab6ea6d"
msgid "\"Why did you haunt the Six Bears tribe?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여섯곰 부족을 괴롭히지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "eade030c-854a-44e9-8bfc-3be3ac3a33c3"
msgid "\"What will you do now that you have the sword back?\""
msgstr "\"검을 가지고 돌아왔으니 이제 어떻게 할거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "c545bbdb-c1d1-4d2d-bf34-c2a109d77d84"
msgid "\"Begin the ritual.\""
msgstr "\"의식을 시작하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "6ce42995-bd25-4792-9951-00ba88ceed18"
msgid "\"Sacrifice Nilak. It must be done.\""
msgstr "\"닐락를 희생해라. 끝내야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "64c15e34-e345-4a56-ba26-ab9e8376d2c2"
msgid "\"Sacrifice Akaia. Let him die with honor.\""
msgstr "\"아카이아를 희생해서 그를 명예롭게 죽게 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7373bac7-517d-42ac-89ab-d73a672d647c"
msgid "Offered yourself as a sacrifice to seal Amiri's sword."
msgstr "아미리의 검을 봉인하기 위해 자신을 제물로 바쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "0f893a68-21fd-44fa-9405-623cb73dce4c"
msgid "\"I am also a chieftain. You called me your chief. Sacrifice me!\""
msgstr "\"나도 족장이다. 너는 나를 족장이라 부르니까. 내가 희생하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "a30b144f-8623-4b8a-94ca-90414150601f"
msgid ""
"\"The ghost said he lost his immortality. Let's just destroy him once and "
"for all! And when his brother appears — we'll deal with him too!\""
msgstr "\"유령이 그는 불멸을 잃었다고 말했다. 그를 끝장내버리자! 그의 형제가 나와도 똑같이 만들어주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "bfe5a69f-7e4a-4ae4-8b49-3c18fb639092"
msgid "\"What happens if you don't seal the sword?\""
msgstr "\"검을 봉인하지 않으면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "91fadfa2-9bd6-409b-9445-c61e35828dc7"
msgid "\"This is for the best, Amiri.\""
msgstr "\"이게 최선이야. 아미리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "3bc58cc1-b7e9-4623-9ca7-cd6d926077f8"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, you little thief! Mortal fool, interfering in the affairs of "
"eternal beings. It is time to return what was stolen.\""
msgstr "\"아미리. 도둑이 되어 필멸자가 불멸의 존재들의 일에 간섭하다니. 도난당한 물건을 돌려 줄 때다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7b41affc-4b6f-4072-b563-c65fa668b0f0"
msgid ""
"\"Shove it!\" {n}Amiri throws the sword at the ghostly giant, who catches it "
"and gazes upon it, twirling it in his huge palms.{/n}"
msgstr "\"집어치워!\" {n}아미리는 유령 거인에게 검을 던지자 그는 거대한 손바닥으로 잡고 그것을 빙빙 돌리며 확인합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "3493561f-09f3-4a97-8f20-1e256e064560"
msgid ""
"\"Fine work... You surprise me, mortals. Your life is but a breath in the "
"wind, a snowflake in a hurricane. But nevertheless you can at times create "
"something that will last through the ages. This sword is even finer than the "
"one that was stolen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘했다... 날 놀라게 하는군. 필멸자. 너희의 삶은 바람 속의 한 숨, 폭풍 속의 눈송이처럼 보잘것 없지만, 수 세기를 이어가며 "
"놀라운 것을 이루기도 하지. 이 검은 도둑 맞은 것보다 더 뛰어나다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "8e00e13e-45ee-4127-9ce2-7067a862ea9d"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Fionn. Once my brother Kean and I were powerful rulers of the "
"{g|First World}First World{/g}. Together we were nearly equal to the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}... But not quite. \""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 피온이다. 한 때 내 형제 킨과 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 통치자였다. 우리는 "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 동등했다... 하지만 완전하지는 않았지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "48ba4a6d-765f-42ea-8a6e-4f25b4045e7d"
msgid ""
"\"Eternal, serene life in our land was not enough for Kean. He wanted more. "
"He wanted to become equal to the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, and conquer new "
"lands. First, he began to devour our subjects, drawing on their strength — "
"and then he tried to do the same with me. As punishment, I banished his soul "
"into the sword, which later fell into the hands of Amiri.\""
msgstr ""
"\"킨은 우리 세계에서의 영원하고 고요한 삶에 만족하지 않았다. 그는 욕심이 많아서 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 동등하기를 원했고, "
"새로운 땅을 개척했다. 처음, 그는 우선 우리 백성들을 잡아먹어 그 힘에 의지하여 나와 같아지려 했다. 그 징벌로 나는 그의 영혼을 검에 "
"가두었고 그것이 아미리가 가진 검이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "aa25421f-184f-42c9-ac82-3f774b68dadf"
msgid ""
"\"It is the prison of my beloved, hated brother Kean. The murderer of family "
"and friends. A ruler who dreamed of greater power, but who instead destroyed "
"the people he ruled!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 사랑하지만 증오하는 내 형제 킨의 감옥이다. 그는 내 가족과 친구들을 죽인 살인자이다. 위대한 꿈을 꾸었지만, 대신 자신의 "
"백성들을 파괴한 통치자이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "83946898-b1d0-4cf9-9c55-0ddeec39148f"
msgid ""
"\"You nearly released Kean by breaking the sword. And he may yet free "
"himself, if the sword is not sealed! But do not be afraid, mortals. We have "
"here everything for the ritual — the ritual that will seal my brother in the "
"sword forever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 검의 봉인을 풀어 킨을 풀어줄 뻔했다. 검이 봉인되지 않았다면 그는 스스로 풀려날 수 있다. 하지만 걱정 마라, 필멸자여. "
"우리가 의식을 해서 그를 검에 영원히 가두겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "4c7909e3-122b-4878-9124-27595ff065c5"
msgid ""
"\"My brother was very powerful. When I imprisoned him in this sword for his "
"crimes, I created a very dangerous artifact. With sweet lies, the sword "
"persuaded my servant to plunge it into my body. It drained much of my "
"energy, turning me into this pitiful creature you see before you — a ghost, "
"a shadow of my former greatness. My brother, in turn, used this power to "
"escape into your world — but in this he outwitted even himself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 형제는 매우 강력했다. 내가 벌로 그를 가두었을 때 나는 위험한 아티팩트를 만들었다. 그 검은 달콤한 거짓말로 내 하인들을 꾀어 "
"나를 그 검으로 찌르게 했다. 나는 대부분의 힘을 빼앗겼고, 너도 전에 보았을 이런 애처로운 모습으로 바뀌었다 — 내 잃어버린 영광의 "
"그림자이자 유령으로. 내 형제는 이 세계로 둘아오려했지만 제 꾀에 넘어갔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "d7add669-e766-4a33-a92b-a298658dcf7f"
msgid ""
"\"Our strength is linked to the magic of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. "
"We are far less powerful here than we are on our home plane. Once here, the "
"sword lost its strength, even its ability to speak. It did not bring "
"happiness to the giant who found it. It did not bring happiness to Amiri, "
"who looted the giant's corpse. Having broken the sword, you nearly freed my "
"brother — but now we shall seal it forever. \""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 힘은 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 마법과 연결되어 있다. 고향 차원이 아니면 우리의 힘은 약하다. 여기서 그 "
"검은 힘을 잃는다. 말 조차 할 수 없지. 이것을 발견한 거인은 불행해졌다. 거인을 죽이고 검을 얻은 아미리 또한 불행해졌다. 이 검을 "
"부수어 내 형제를 풀어줄 뻔했지만, 우리는 이것을 영원히 봉인할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "458aeb66-48e6-4432-907c-f861fed2ce5e"
msgid ""
"\"After I was struck down, a treacherous spirit fled with the sword into "
"your world. Powerless, a shadow of myself, I followed it — for I could not "
"allow its prisoner to free himself. I found the body of a giant who once "
"possessed the sword. I found the bodies of barbarians killed by Amiri. I "
"walked invisibly among the tribes, listening to their speech and tracing "
"their thoughts, until I learned the sword's fate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 쓰러지고 난 후 배신자의 영혼이 이 칼을 가지고 너희 세계로 도망갔다. 나는, 무력한 나 자신의 그림자인 채로, 죄인이 "
"도망치는걸 막기 위해 따라왔고 나는 이 검을 가진 거인의 시체를 발견했다. 아미리에게 살해당한 바바리안들의 시체도 발견했다. 나는 부족들 "
"사이에 숨어서 그들의 말을 엿듣고 나서야 검의 운명을 알게 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "ef7f1b54-8695-40db-a076-9b2a9c1138a4"
msgid ""
"\"I demanded that the Six Bears tribe find the thief. This was only fair, "
"for the sword was stolen by one of their own, and I would have it returned. "
"If only Amiri listened to me at our first meeting, much trouble could have "
"been avoided. But even immortals cannot rule fate. Everything happened as it "
"happened, and now the sword is in my hands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여섯 곰 부족이 도둑을 찾기를 바랬다. 그들 중에 한 명이 검을 훔쳤기 때문에 그것이 공평했고, 또한 내가 돌려받을 수 "
"있었을테니. 첫 만남 때 아미리가 내 말을 들어줬더라면 더 이상의 문제는 없었을 것이다. 하지만 불멸자들조차 운명을 통제할 수는 없다. "
"일어나야 했을 모든 사건이 끝났고, 결국 검이 내 손에 들어왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "92c5e07e-dfdb-4652-b3dc-78af375bc653"
msgid ""
"\"I will not avenge your theft. I never desired revenge. I only wanted to "
"ensure my brother, imprisoned in this blade, would never break free. I once "
"thought returning him to the {g|First World}First World{/g} would be "
"sufficient, but now I realize this would not be enough. There is only one "
"way to be sure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 도둑질을 복수하지 않겠다. 나는 복수를 원하지 않았다. 오직 내 형제가 이 검에 갖혀있기를 바랬을 뿐이다. 그를 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}로 돌려보낼까 생각도 했지만, 그걸로 충분치 않다는 것을 깨달았다. 방법은 오직 하나 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "13d2df5e-6082-4d99-ae7f-9c62a1c51cbd"
msgid ""
"\"I will cast the spell of imprisonment once again, this time — on myself. I "
"will place into the sword all my strength, which my poor brother so craved — "
"and thus I shall share eternity with him. This sword will become our common "
"tomb. After that, Amiri, you may keep the sword for yourself. But not before "
"the ritual is over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 봉인 마법을 다시 쓸 것이다 — 이번에는 나에게 쓰겠다. 내 동생이 그토록 원했던 내 모든 힘을 이 검 안에 담겠다. 그리하여 "
"욕망에 가득 찬 내 동생과 영원을 함께할 것이다. 이 검은 우리 둘의 무덤이 될 것이다. 모든 일이 끝나면 검은 네가 가져가라. 아미리. "
"하지만 의식이 끝나기 전에는 줄 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "5c3bc9bc-9e1e-4a34-b51c-206048fb90c9"
msgid ""
"{n}The giant brings the sword to his lips, whispering a spell. A stream of "
"light flows from him into the blade. Already transparent, the ghost becomes "
"barely visible. {/n} \"The end is near. There is almost nothing left of me. "
"I am the shadow of a shadow. I am dust and ash. My power, my immortality — I "
"give everything to imprison my brother forever. There is only one thing "
"left...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거인은 검을 얼굴에 가까에 주문을 대고 속삭입니다. 빛줄기가 그에게서 검으로 흘러갑니다. 유령의 몸은 이미 거의 "
"투명해졌습니다.{/n} \"이제 끝났다. 나에게 남은 것은 없다. 나는 그림자에 재일 뿐이다. 내 힘과 불멸은 내 동생을 가두기 위해 "
"모두 소모될 것이다. 오직 하나만이 남았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "972234cf-378a-4cfe-b7fb-b45dee05dc9f"
msgid "{n}Amiri whispers through pale lips:{/n} \"Forgive me, sis...\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 창백한 입술로 속삭입니다.{/n} \"나를 용서해... 닐락...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "08ef32f2-3b8e-46aa-af6c-2b8d585c9726"
msgid ""
"{n}The giant hands the sword to Amiri.{/n} \"To finish the ritual, the sword "
"must be plunged into the heart of a chieftain. I would give my own heart, "
"but I no longer possess a living body... However... There is another "
"chieftain here. Do this, Amiri, and let eternity come to an end.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거인은 검을 아미리에게 건네줍니다.{/n} \"의식을 끝내기 위해서는 검을 족장의 심장에 꽂아야 한다. 내 심장을 내어주고 싶지만 "
"나에게는 살아있는 몸이 없다... 하지만... 여기의 족장이 있다. 아미리. 불멸을 끝내라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "06175768-1341-47f9-96cc-59fb311e986a"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri falls back, turning pale.{/n} \"No! No, no... I won't do it!\" {n} "
"She turns to you. {/n} \"What is this!? What should I do now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 물러서며 창백해집니다.{/n} \"안돼! 안돼, 안돼... 난 못해!\" {n}그녀는 당신에게 몸을 돌립니다.{/n} "
"\"이게 뭐야?! 내가 어떻게 해야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "ccce5de4-4387-49b2-8da7-c353d992560d"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Nilak}Nilak{/d} comes forward.{/n} \"Fionn spoke truly of the threat "
"of his brother's release. I must protect my tribe. Do it, Amiri. I am ready."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Nilak}닐락{/d}이 앞으로 나섭니다.{/n} \"피온이 말한 건 사실이야. 나는 부족을 보호해야 해. 시작해. 아미리. "
"나는 준비됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "e6ffd308-2209-4c1b-a525-8460c642cae4"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|ChiefAkaia}Akaia{/d} pushes her away.{/n} \"Step aside, girl. This "
"tribe needs you. Hey, you, evil spirit! A former chieftain is good enough, "
"right? \"{n}The ghost nods, and Akaia thrusts himself forward. {/n}\"Come, "
"girl, strike! At least I'm still good for something.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|ChiefAkaia}아카이아{/d}는 그녀를 밀어냅니다.{/n} \"여자는 비켜서라. 이 부족은 나를 필요로 한다. 이봐. "
"너! 악령! 전 족장도 쓸만하겠지?\" {n}유령은 끄덕이자 아카이아는 앞으로 나섭니다.{/n} \"찔러라! 최소한 내가 무언가를 할 수 "
"있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : SixBearsCamp_Chieftain
msgctxt "71a83966-4d15-4c57-812a-ed46da2fb241"
msgid ""
"{n}Akaia steps towards Amiri, his back straight and chin held high, looking "
"hard into her eyes.{/n} \"Do it!\""
msgstr "{n}아카이아는 아미리에게 다가섰고, 꼿꼿하게 서서 턱을 치켜세운 채 그녀의 눈을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"찔러!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ba3be468-9bdb-49c8-b0b2-9458747476ad"
msgid ""
"\"I was once called...\" {n}Amiri says thoughtfully, then turns to her "
"fellow tribesmen.{/n} \"Hey, men! Before my exile, when I kicked your butts —"
" you gave me a nickname. Remember? Come on, say it out loud! I won't beat "
"you for it this time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 한 때...\" {n}아미리는 신중하게 말하면 동료 부족들에게 눈을 돌립니다.{/n} \"이봐! 내가 너희를 버리기 전에 내게 "
"별명을 붙여줬지? 그 별명이 뭐지? 말해봐! 이번에는 안때릴게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e914c534-f254-4d4a-8eb6-4444c92e78b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri's face brightens.{/n} \"Really, what's wrong with me! Hey, ghostly! "
"You're finished!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리의 얼굴이 밝아집니다.{/n} \"도대체 내가 왜이러는지! 이봐. 유령! 너는 끝났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Vandal_Fighter
msgctxt "99711a60-7d42-441e-b9d8-275e5a466a2b"
msgid ""
"{n}The men glance at each other, one of them hesitantly says: {/n} \"The "
"Soft Chieftain?\""
msgstr "{n}부족민은 서로를 쳐다봤고, 그들 중 하나가 망설이며 말합니다.{/n} \"연약한 족장?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b874071e-91c9-4d69-9ce3-da7e45ec84b8"
msgid "\"Ha! Your words, not mine.\""
msgstr "\"하! 그건 너고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "22eb19ce-d27e-45ae-9ec8-c10abaa497d5"
msgid ""
"\"No! You're mad! What are you doing? He will return! You will not stop him!"
"\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 미쳤어! 뭐하는 거야? 그가 돌아올 거야! 너는 그를 막을 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "56b2bb73-08b3-46dc-964b-2cc4a38c5115"
msgid ""
"\"My brother will free himself. He is as an endless storm — greedy, cruel, "
"unpredictable. He will do great evil, and he will start with Amiri and her "
"tribe. He remembers you well, but I cannot see his mind — perhaps he will "
"seek revenge. Perhaps you will become his plaything... Either way, you will "
"not survive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 형제가 스스로 빠져나올 것이다. 그는 욕망이 넘치고 잔인하고 예측할 수 없는, 무한한 태풍과도 같다. 그는 악행을 벌일 것이다. "
"그 시작은 아미리와 그녀의 부족이 되겠지. 그는 너 또한 기억할 것이다, 하지만 동생의 생각은 모르겠군. 아마 복수하려 들거다. 너는 "
"그의 노리개가 되겠지... 어쨌든, 너는 살아남지 못할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "85a4132a-2fb5-4c77-8332-7eee0b87adf2"
msgid ""
"\"True... You can't throw a rock without hitting a chieftain here. I'm also "
"a chieftain — remember, how you presented me to the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아... 여기 족장에게 떠넘길 필요가 없어. 나도 족장이잖아 — 나를 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 족장으로 "
"임명했던거 기억해? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "832904fa-3b5a-4daa-bd43-9a327425eaca"
msgid ""
"\"Hey you, ghost-face! You got your chief!\" {n}With these words Amiri "
"places the hilt of the sword on the ground before her, and throws herself "
"onto the blade.{/n}"
msgstr "\"이봐! 유령! 여기 족장이 있다!\" {n}그 말과 함께 아미리는 칼자루를 땅바닥에 꽂아놓고 검에 몸을 던집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "55118d40-c127-400f-9b19-b1d74f74c8ec"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, no! If I must spill the blood of my kin today, it will not be hers! "
"Start praying, old man!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 동족의 피를 흘린다면 그녀는 살아야 해! 기도나 해라! 늙은이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5bc62914-1d2f-491c-ad18-99b23386ce1a"
msgid ""
"\"Relatives... It's the same story everywhere, whether in the world of "
"mortals or of demigods. Relatives are the first to become mortal enemies.\""
msgstr "\"필멸자든 반신의 세계에서든 이런 이야기는 항상 같군. 가족은 항상 적이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d2681df9-99bb-434a-83ab-d5d4ef547a67"
msgid ""
"\"Fair? They didn't even know what they suffered for. You punished "
"innocents. Don't call this justice.\""
msgstr "\"공정하다? 그들은 왜 이런 일을 겪는지 조차 몰랐다. 너는 무고한 자들을 처벌했다. 이것을 정의라 부르지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "d50c58c8-f83a-4853-a993-84f2405709d2"
msgid ""
"\"A criminal's tribe always answers for him. So it has always been and shall "
"always be. There is no justice more ancient than this.\""
msgstr "\"범죄자의 부족은 항상 그가 옳다고 했다. 항상 이래왔고 앞으로도 그럴 것이다. 이것보다 정의로운 일은 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "239849d3-3a7f-40df-845a-bddf17d31bc0"
msgid ""
"\"Wait... So all these troubles could have been avoided if we'd simply "
"talked when we first met? That is to say, if someone hadn't started swinging "
"their sword around without even a chat? Well done, Amiri! Well done, indeed!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐... 그래서 우리가 처음 만났을 때 대화했으면 해결할 수 있었던 거야? 누군가가 보자마자 칼을 휘두르지만 않았어도 됐다는 거네? "
"잘하는 짓이다. 아미리! 참 잘했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "807eb1a8-0048-43b2-9ac8-2897330c7add"
msgid ""
"\"It's mortal pride. We leave this world, and so leave behind what we "
"created. That's {g|Torag}Torag{/g}'s teaching.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 필멸자의 자부심이다. 우리가 만든 것을 뒤로 남겨 두고 이 세상을 떠난다. 그것이 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 가르침이다. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7e7adebb-a273-4d9e-908b-df249b1c04e8"
msgid ""
"\"And what point is there in that? This sword may exist a thousand years, or "
"ten thousand, or even a million... But even then, it will not survive the "
"End Times.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 무슨 소용일까? 이 검은 천 년이고 만 년이고 존재할 텐데... 하지만 그렇더라도 '종말의 시간'을 빠져나가지 못하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Fionn_ch5
msgctxt "a672d275-889f-4e9c-bb01-5bbff1264392"
msgid ""
"\"Don't laugh, gnome. In the hands of fate, we are all but toys — both "
"mortals and gods alike. One word said today can create or destroy a kingdom "
"over the course of a century. It has happened before. It will again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비웃지마라, 노움. 운명의 손아귀 아래, 우리 모두는 장난감일 뿐이다, 필멸자든 신이든 마찬가지지. 오늘 내뱉은 말 한마디가 왕국을 "
"만들거나 파괴할 수 있다. 이전에도 그랬고, 앞으로도 그럴 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "14a3bea9-fda7-4f90-9faa-ae1bbf84f8bb"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie lowers her head.{/n} \"He may not have been a good person — but "
"in the end, when it mattered most, he acted as a worthy ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그는 좋은 사람이 아니었을 수도 있었습니다. 그러나 결국 가장 중요했을 때 그는 가치있는 "
"통치자로 행동했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5b6dec8a-a44f-4d82-95bb-3045b2cf88cd"
msgid "\"What took you so long? You want a sacrifice, porker? Suck it!\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 오래 걸렸어? 너는 희생을 원한다. 어서 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "010abf42-fb40-42c4-a0ea-ceacf96ddc40"
msgid "{n}With a dead-pan face, Amiri swings her sword.{/n} \"That's it.\""
msgstr "{n}무표정한 얼굴로 아미리는 검을 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"그만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ac722019-0930-4fc6-b940-75fb085b5d11"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! HEY! Don't even think it! I still need you around to become Hero!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 꿈도 꾸지마! 영웅이 되기 위해서라면 네가 아직 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Fionn/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0f745e22-dc73-40f3-9553-6e91d941d423"
msgid "\"No. No! Never! You hear me? Nilak will survive! She has to!\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 절대 안돼! 닐락은 살아야 해! 알겠어? 살아남아야 한다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d39f0fcb-8e0d-463d-95bf-3d67a01b2c68"
msgid ""
"Praised Nilak for being ready to sacrifice herself for the tribe's sake."
msgstr "부족을 위해 자신을 희생할 준비가 되어있는 닐락을 칭찬했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "27394e20-1225-424c-b070-cb118da121f4"
msgid ""
"\"Nilak, you did not hesitate to sacrifice yourself to save the tribe. This "
"is the act of a true leader!\""
msgstr "\"닐락. 너는 부족을 구하기 위해 자신을 희생하는 것을 주저하지 않았다. 이것이 진정한 지도자의 행동이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "72de1ec4-e777-4a77-8133-37ca9b7c0902"
msgid ""
"Reproached Nilak for being ready to sacrifice herself for the tribe's sake."
msgstr "부족을 위해 자신을 희생할 준비가 되어있는 닐락을 꾸짖습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "6f76548d-86b8-4f59-8018-ad9ef107df84"
msgid ""
"\"Nilak, sacrificing yourself is foolish sentimentality, unworthy of a ruler."
"\""
msgstr "\"닐락, 자신을 희생하는 것은 어리석으며, 통치자로서 자격이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2a7a1a8b-6384-4f5b-8201-6a2773139774"
msgid "\"What are you going to do next?\""
msgstr "\"이제는 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "760c412e-7666-496b-bf6b-620077dd2c58"
msgid "\"Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "0fff28fe-5094-4309-827a-ec0be4f43af6"
msgid "\"A time of great change has come to your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족이 큰 변화를 맞을 시간이 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "04f823da-e845-451b-bcb2-3d809487e70b"
msgid "\"Amiri... That was my duty.\""
msgstr "\"아미리... 그건 내 의무였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "6bcccc15-88c4-4284-a46d-502d44a23a7a"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri! After what you've done, his brother will return and destroy us all!"
"\""
msgstr "\"아미리! 네가 그렇게 해도 그의 형제가 돌아와 우리를 없앨 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "eda36f2b-e478-426a-ba2c-493baa0dab55"
msgid ""
"\"We will leave soon. Thank you and Amiri for what you have done for us.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 곧 떠날 것이다. 우리를 위해 노력해준 아미리에게 감사하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e8e5b51e-de61-496e-bb76-f0399681e9c4"
msgid ""
"\"Enough complaining! Your duty is to take care of these dumb-heads. Without "
"you they won't survive in the south — and you can't go north anymore.\""
msgstr "\"불평은 충분히 들었어! 네 의무는 이 멍청이들을 돌보는 거야. 그들은 너 없이 남부에서 살아남지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "49e9c344-7414-4c58-b5f8-4c426d6411a0"
msgid ""
"\"The old fart volunteered for it. — Finally did something good in his life. "
"Give him a good funeral.\""
msgstr "\"그 멍청한 늙은이가 스스로 뛰어들었다. 마침내 좋은 일을 하는군. 장례식은 잘치뤄주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b90ac9a2-f3a5-462d-a4a4-26897c4a8f77"
msgid ""
"\"I had a blood debt to this tribe. I would not want the daughter of someone "
"I killed to come take their revenge on me!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 부족을 위해 피를 흘렸어. 내가 죽인 누군가의 딸이 와서 복수하게 두지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "82194c56-78e6-41eb-8573-40d1f0fa4838"
msgid ""
"\"Hah! What, one more giant to beat? Relax! Together with this {mf|man|girl} "
"we'll send anyone into the ground!\" {n}Amiri smiles wide and slaps you on "
"the shoulder.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"또 다른 거인인가? 진정해! 이 자와 함께라면 누구든지 쓰러뜨릴 수 있어!\" {n}아미리는 당신에게 미소 짓고 어깨를 철썩 "
"때립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "4df6d29b-c0c0-4bfc-b17a-f049b35cb9e8"
msgid "\"Oh, Amiri... I see you've found a chieftain to your liking!\""
msgstr "\"오. 아미리... 네가 좋아하는 족장을 찾을 줄 알았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "90bf3729-a22d-4351-8a82-dde6d57f37c7"
msgid "\"We will.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e8a248ed-48eb-4265-b9be-cd859017c9c8"
msgid ""
"\"You've paid your debt in full. The whole tribe owes you their lives.\""
msgstr "\"너는 모든 빚을 갚았어. 부족은 네게 빚을 졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "82068a09-37a1-480f-ba50-008524237cd3"
msgid "\"Thank you. It's an honor for me to hear your praise.\""
msgstr "\"고맙워. 너의 칭찬을 듣는 것은 영광이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "5daa7c43-6f86-4270-890d-f863fc421a10"
msgid ""
"\"This is the way of my tribe. If I was not ready for it, I would not agree "
"to be chieftain.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 나의 부족의 길이다. 내가 준비가 안되었다면 나는 족장이 되는 것을 것에 동의하지 않았을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "a2196e04-0eff-4c2b-86f4-1f7eda9f7622"
msgid ""
"\"Let's go back to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}! We are not used to change. Even "
"there, everything seems strange to us — but Numerian kellids are not so "
"different from the northern ones! We would not survive here in the {g|River "
"Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, even with your protection.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가자! 우리는 변화에 익숙하지 않다. 거기서는 모두가 우리를 이상하게 볼 테지만 누메리안 "
"켈리드는 우리와 다르지 않아! 우리는 너의 보호가 있을지라도 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}에서 살아남지 못할 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ac594f30-db5d-4c30-87c2-adabceaac2a8"
msgid "\"{g|Desna}Desna{/g} bless you! Look after Amiri!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Desna}데즈나{/g}께서 너를 축복하길! 아미리를 돌봐줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Nilak-Final/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "875124d1-6fce-4935-9bc0-c362853bb89c"
msgid ""
"\"Everything changes. It's foolish to believe we can hide from the whole "
"world in our icy mountains. We paid dearly for pretending that time doesn't "
"touch us. I'm afraid the other tribes will pay even more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것이 바뀌었다. 얼음 산에서 숨을 수 있다는 믿음은 어리석었다. 우리는 그저 괜찮다고 착각했을 뿐이다. 다른 부족보다 뒤쳐졌을까 "
"두렵군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_JoinOrLeave/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "2fd930ba-f4e0-4542-a4e4-9bc2e7fbca3b"
msgid "[Join up with Amiri] \"Yes. Let's go.\""
msgstr "[아미리와 합류합니다] \"그래. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_JoinOrLeave/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "79b84914-c2cc-417c-a80c-cef377a2b050"
msgid "[Leave the Six Bears' camp] \"Wait here, I'll return soon.\""
msgstr "[여섯곰 부족 캠프를 떠납니다] \"잠깐. 다른 일을 먼저 해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1edd91eb-a6f6-448d-9319-e28364b85380"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri awaits you, clutching her reforged sword and throwing glances "
"toward the camp.{/n} \"So, let's go?\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 개조한 칼을 움켜잡고 야영지쪽을 흘끔 보며 당신을 기다리고 있습니다.{/n} \"그래서 가자고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "f4e73967-9be5-4446-832e-7d8ec85e06ce"
msgid "\"Do it, just be quick.\""
msgstr "\"빨리 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_JoinOrLeave/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a5e8b2c1-91b3-457e-9f09-40c4acd8ee63"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri watches the tent from a distance, trying to catch sight of her "
"fellow tribesmen.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 먼 곳에서 텐트를 주시하며 자기 부족을 찾아내려 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "53b5f253-63d1-4fda-a777-8380dda3c238"
msgid "\"Did you really steal that sword from a giant?\""
msgstr "\"정말 그 거인에게서 검을 뺏었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "304f4eb2-9deb-43ec-98d8-657aeccbb092"
msgid "\"Does he know that the sword is broken?\""
msgstr "\"칼이 망가진 걸 그가 알고 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "e63b194f-1814-4cd1-b66c-3df93d07d48d"
msgid "\"Where is he keeping your tribe?\""
msgstr "\"그가 너희 부족을 어디에서 지키고 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "9a77be13-5179-441b-8211-0ab32d04f0f6"
msgid "\"I'll see what I can do.\""
msgstr "\"내가 무엇을 할 수 있는지 알아볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "55621778-a93e-47fc-85ec-4d9f7ee56df3"
msgid ""
"\"Remember that evil spirit who haunted the Six Bears? The one we drove "
"away? Well… Don't think I'm crazy! But he visited me in a dream.\""
msgstr "\"여섯 곰 부족을 괴롭히던 악령을 기억해? 우리가 쫓아버렸는데! 하지만 내 꿈에 나타났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "46686d9f-6a89-4d5f-986a-912a85a266af"
msgid ""
"\"Says, I'm a thief, because I stole his sword. Remember? — That big one, "
"Armag broke it! Also... Says he has all my tribe as hostages. All of them, "
"Nilak too! Says, they will be dead, if I don't return the sword!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 칼을 훔쳤기 때문에 도둑이라 하더군. 아르막이 부수었던 그 큰 놈 말이야! 그리고... 내 부족을 인질로 두고 있다고 했어. "
"닐락까지 말이야! 칼을 돌려주지 않으면 죽인다고 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "c41f122d-725a-4091-8a1b-b4c40ecbd738"
msgid ""
"\"Well... Oh, no need to lie now. I found it! I lied to everyone I took it "
"in battle — but that giant was dead for a long time! How could I know he "
"would want his old piece of iron back?\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 이제 거짓말 할 필요는 없어. 내가 찾았거든! 나는 전투에서 뺏었다고 거짓말했지만 그 거인은 오래 전에 죽어있었어! 쇳덩이 "
"한조각 가지고 이렇게 호들갑을 떨 줄 누가 알았겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "fd97134b-bf46-4c86-80ba-c35a6bc834b1"
msgid ""
"\"He knows. I saved the hilt. The ghost tells me to forge a new blade. He "
"even said how to do it. There's a whole ritual!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 알고 있어. 내가 칼자루를 가지고 있는 걸. 그는 새로운 칼을 만들라며 어떻게 하라고까지 알려줬어. 의식을 통해서 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c87f41e3-db83-4acc-b3d2-8cec9676b0a8"
msgid ""
"\"He said — first I have to fix the sword, and then he will tell me where my "
"tribe is.\""
msgstr "\"우선 검을 고치면, 그 뒤에 우리 부족이 있는 곳을 말해주겠다고 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Amiri/Q4_A_Blade_Reforged/Q4_Tavern_start/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "c0700750-fc69-4242-a65d-9d60849e9272"
msgid ""
"\"I understand. The repair will cost a lot. I never held no such amount in "
"my hands. But... Nilak...\" {n}The barbarian shakes her head in grief.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"알겠어. 하지만 수리 비용이 많이 들 거야. 그만한 돈이 없지만... 닐락...\" {n}야만인은 슬픔에 머리가 떨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Ntavi_Tavern_Unknown_String
msgctxt "0e2a6976-df0f-42df-94ec-59a881b9540b"
msgid "\"Have we met?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 만난 적이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/1DLC_Kalikke_Party1_String
msgctxt "e51d3f7e-61b4-4fb9-aa86-5326ba1d8c38"
msgid ""
"\"My favorite pastime at parties is to stand silently in the darkest corner, "
"and watch friends and strangers dancing and having fun.\""
msgstr "\"파티에서 내가 가장 좋아하는 취미는 어두운 구석에 조용히 서서, 친구들과 낯선 사람들이 춤추고 즐기는걸 지켜보는거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/1DLC_Kalikke_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "b2d12773-2b40-4c9a-896a-9382d371a94b"
msgid "[Quietly hums a merry song]"
msgstr "[조용히 노래를 콧노래로 흥얼거립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/1DLC_Kanerah_Party1_String
msgctxt "cbdbdb5c-1a5e-48b0-9a8e-ae7136f2e43a"
msgid ""
"\"Why celebrate in this backwater when we have the whole castle in our "
"disposal? Uhh.\""
msgstr "\"성이 있는데 왜 이런 후미진 곳에서 축하를 하는 거야? 휴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/1DLC_Kanerah_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "271b55ce-7588-43ec-bd29-d1ed6d48b074"
msgid "\"Next time you want to throw a party, ask me to arrange it!\""
msgstr "\"다음에 파티를 열고 싶으면 내게 부탁해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Amiri_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "942214cc-8048-4aab-811a-d922dd36b2cd"
msgid "\"Join me! The food, is good!\""
msgstr "\"이리 와! 이 음식, 맛있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Amiri_Party_String_1
msgctxt "4fc7067e-8b2d-493b-844f-2091e414bf59"
msgid "\"Eat until full, then wash it down with ale. That's the life!\""
msgstr "\"배불리 먹고 에일로 소화시키라고. 이게 사는 맛이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Angel_Party1_String
msgctxt "a6d17268-b70d-4028-a0a5-de7f99a5f63a"
msgid "\"Beautiful places!\""
msgstr "\"아름다운 장소군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Angel_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "282e5714-a415-462e-8c06-20238e395484"
msgid ""
"\"A great celebration. It's nice to see smiling faces all around... and to "
"forget our troubles for a while.\""
msgstr "\"즐거운 축제구나. 사람들이 모두 웃으며... 잠시 우리 고민은 잊고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Amiri_Jubilost1_String
msgctxt "4e7d4015-cbd5-4b75-8e8b-590725038dd5"
msgid "\"How does all that fit into one gnome?!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그 모든 것이 노움에게 모두 들어가지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Amiri_Jubilost2_String
msgctxt "d3d40c03-72da-4cfe-a88e-f141c567f1a6"
msgid "\"What do you mean? I'm only on my second one!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리야? 이제 2라운드 시작이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Amiri_Jubilost3_Valerie_String
msgctxt "b27b7a68-6d42-452e-8f26-9b18f9c7db14"
msgid "\"Trust me, Amiri, some questions are better left unanswered...\""
msgstr "\"날 믿어. 아미리. 어떤 질문은 대답하지 않은 채로 남는 것이 좋아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Angel_Harrim1_String
msgctxt "43e621c6-dbb4-4a23-86e2-6a8b179d04d1"
msgid "\"Hmm?\""
msgstr "\"응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Angel_Harrim2_String
msgctxt "8be8d95c-067e-4d88-b0b6-c5c1a372f40c"
msgid "\"I think something is wrong with Harrim. Should we do something?\""
msgstr "\"하림이 뭔가 이상해. 우리가 도와줘야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Angel_Harrim3_Jaethal_String
msgctxt "20193662-5271-48ee-9552-15a61ca9df70"
msgid "[Grinds teeth]"
msgstr "[이를 갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Angel_Harrim_String
msgctxt "346b2416-5f6f-461b-a816-c21c5419e36f"
msgid "\"Harrim, are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"하림. 괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Regongar_Octavia1_String
msgctxt "9541211d-acbc-47a4-a5c9-84cef4ea91c7"
msgid ""
"\"A stuck-up alchemist, a scribbler, a failed explorer, and a gluttonous "
"gnome walk into a bar...\""
msgstr "\"거만한 연금술사, 글쟁이, 실패한 탐험가, 탐욕스러운 노움이 술집에 들어간다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Banter_Regongar_Octavia2_String
msgctxt "d3d6c507-8a26-4ad0-a69e-f7294ee2a073"
msgid "\"Oh no, not another Jubilost joke!\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트가 맞아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Drinks_String
msgctxt "3fff1973-6697-48b1-8379-751b046fe15d"
msgid ""
"Red and white wine, mead, cider, and a broad range of locally-brewed beers."
msgstr "레드와 화이트 와인, 벌꿀술, 사이다, 다양한 맥주가 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Ekun_Party1_String
msgctxt "6adc5d60-dad4-4ab2-83db-c808934d012e"
msgid "[Chuckles]"
msgstr "[껄껄 웃습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Elina_Party1_String
msgctxt "c8c6c404-1920-4654-8cf9-544fbe4c5fe0"
msgid "\"I hope everyone has enough... Why aren't you eating, Ekun?\""
msgstr "\"모두가 충분히 즐겼기를 바란다... 왜 먹지 않는 거야. 에쿤?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Elina_Party2_String
msgctxt "16ec85e4-9111-459f-ba61-6caa5e5fc011"
msgid ""
"\"...and so I say, 'Where are three cubits here? Is he measuring cloth in "
"gnome cubits?!'"
msgstr "\"... 그리고 내가 말했지. 짜리몽땅 셋은 어디에 있어? 그가 노움에게 옷이라도 맞춰주나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Food1_String
msgctxt "8c7959f2-f864-40a8-b54f-3ec48579e71d"
msgid ""
"Pork in wine sauce, baked eel, moon ratatouille... The table is heaped with "
"food."
msgstr "와인 소스를 뿌린 돼지 고기와 구운 장어, 문 라따뚜이... 식탁은 음식으로 가득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Food2_String
msgctxt "a655fe9e-b6f7-4297-8208-0894ca2f3402"
msgid ""
"Starters are arranged on plates: salads, pickled vegetables, dwarven "
"sausages, and beautifully decorated bull mammoth cheese."
msgstr "도우미들이 접시를 들입니다. 샐러드와 절인 야채, 드워프 소시지, 아름답게 장식된 메머드 치즈가 놓입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Harrim_Party1_String
msgctxt "380be7d0-3bcd-4040-a56c-26c67a927442"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... the brew is... all right. Just the bottles are... t-too small...\""
msgstr "\"음... 양조는 잘됐고... 하지만 병이 너무 작아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Harrim_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "062f6611-4d7a-4aa1-b0db-599163b7e01e"
msgid ""
"\"Oblivion and d-death... unconsciousness and... al-co-holic lethargy. Is it "
"not all the same?\""
msgstr "\"망각과 죽음... 무의식과... 숙취. 모두 같은 말 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Jaethal_Party1_String
msgctxt "7f5d3040-6597-4865-8616-4eeabe018c4e"
msgid "[Yawns]"
msgstr "[하품]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Jaethal_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "57e4c358-ef41-49ed-b9f8-637eda30e754"
msgid "\"Dying of boredom.\""
msgstr "\"지루해 죽겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Jubilost_Party1_String
msgctxt "7869e94b-12d3-436e-a173-1eda2ae1898d"
msgid ""
"\"Whew... That's it. Take a breath, rest, and now — another plate of eel!\""
msgstr "\"휴우... 그게 다야. 숨좀 돌렸는데 장어가 또 한접시 오는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Jubilost_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "cba62811-1bac-44df-b322-142166d5a9d3"
msgid ""
"\"You're not eating at all — that is ill-advised. If you find nothing left "
"for you, don't say I didn't warn you.\""
msgstr "\"너 전혀 먹지 않고있는데. 그건 경솔한 행동이야. 나중에 네 몫 없다고 울지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Linzi_NtaviEkunLeave_String
msgctxt "d69f4720-d153-43a6-b651-374b767ba966"
msgid "\"Hey! Where are you going?!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 어디 가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Nok-Nok_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "42bc7089-6e0d-4fe4-bc39-f3dac0ae03ca"
msgid "\"Bad party. Short on food\"."
msgstr "\"파티 별로다. 음식이 부족해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Ntavi_Party1_String
msgctxt "7fe533be-c713-4f10-b9ec-bcc5326813a8"
msgid "[Laughs]"
msgstr "[웃음]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Ntavi_Party_Wine1_String
msgctxt "93b3202f-5f37-4969-85cb-1f879e904722"
msgid "\"Hmm. Would you please wait...\""
msgstr "\"흠. 기다려 주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Ntavi_Party_Wine_String
msgctxt "514beca5-47ae-4f9f-80ee-fc357f62cf0f"
msgid "\"Elina, could you please find a wine opener for me?\""
msgstr "\"엘리나, 와인 오프너 좀 주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Ntavie_Party_Wine2_String
msgctxt "222cc218-0963-4a53-8563-b4cee8becb94"
msgid "\"So, my friend, I'll just steal you for a moment...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만 시간 좀 내줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Octavia_Party1_String
msgctxt "45173634-1be1-40db-be43-f0cb0ac32b01"
msgid "\"Oh, I love this tune! Linzi plays so well!\""
msgstr "\"오. 나는 이 노래가 좋아! 린지가 아주 잘하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Octavia_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "446361b7-9de4-4679-9e88-4aafdb476251"
msgid ""
"\"Such a wonderful idea, {name}! Come now, why didn't you tell us about it "
"sooner? I'd have baked a pie.\""
msgstr "\"이런 멋진 생각을 하다니, {name}! 왜 더 일찍 얘기하지 않은 거야? 내가 파이를 구워 왔을텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Regongar_Party1_String
msgctxt "418af735-d3ac-4f17-950e-b58ac6d093fc"
msgid "\"What dunce had the idea to hold a feast in the woods?!\""
msgstr "\"어떤 얼간이가 숲에서 파티를 하자는 생각을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Regongar_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "c8700076-c65f-4f9d-8bd0-e15df46c4c86"
msgid ""
"\"To your health, {name}! By the way, if you are looking for where to go "
"after the feast, I know a place. With a very... peculiar... menu. We only "
"live once, he-he...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}의 건강을 위해! 파티 끝나고 어디 가야 할지 생각 중이라면, 내가 갈만한 장소를 알고 있어. 아주... 특이한.... "
"곳이지. 삶은 한번 뿐이라고. 헤헤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Servant1_Click_String
msgctxt "8feed399-f4e5-4ca8-9c2b-2ae6fc939fe4"
msgid "\"Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Valerie_Party1_String
msgctxt "92c442a2-754c-41b8-b8c8-caef0e70b71f"
msgid ""
"\"I admit, the food is not capital fare. But for a picnic, it will serve...\""
msgstr "\"운영비로 음식을 장만하지 않았다. 하지만 소풍을 위해서 내가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Barks/Party/Valerie_Party_Click_String
msgctxt "88c6df49-a1b5-4b7d-952e-7f88a9eb52ea"
msgid "\"Thank you for the invitation, {name}!\""
msgstr "\"초대해줘서 감사합니다. {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "696ff88b-e06d-4266-a301-984cf7a287aa"
msgid "\"How are you?\""
msgstr "\"요즘 좀 어떻게 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "77b879e5-8f76-4ff0-b74c-0f0d2a491db5"
msgid "\"I see Elina is trying very hard to please you.\""
msgstr "\"엘리나가 너를 기쁘게 해주려고 무척 애를 쓰고 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "76834c63-c0c7-49a0-989c-ffb965c508bb"
msgid "\"Why did you never tell me about Ntavi?\""
msgstr "\"왜 내게 은타비에 대해 한번도 말하지 않았었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6c704b60-7be3-496f-94f1-83b2af9b6644"
msgid "[Point at a glass] \"Drink with me?\""
msgstr "[잔을 가리킵니다] \"나와 함께 마실래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0009_AskHowFeel_Text
msgctxt "910eaa26-3e5c-4b6e-a2b0-a7d108302a97"
msgid ""
"\"I hope we didn't do more harm than good. Are you at least having fun?\""
msgstr "\"오히려 폐를 끼친건 아니길 바래. 적어도 재미는 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5932ba8c-8b03-4f81-a4f0-fd0ade631867"
msgid "\"Why did you stop talking?\""
msgstr "\"왜 말을 하다 마는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "98e3e68b-f62d-495d-8569-f2731787d32c"
msgid "\"I see.\""
msgstr "\"알겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "fb9dafb8-9bad-43d4-ae40-f5a0f3406064"
msgid "\"How did you meet Ntavi?\""
msgstr "\"은타비는 어떻게 만났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "cdf701c0-4828-46ef-84a6-8f9c6f172722"
msgid "\"Were you close?\""
msgstr "\"가까운 사이인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "35d5bab6-524c-449a-b9fe-1ec972363d0c"
msgid "\"Tired of fighting? Ready to lie down and give up?\""
msgstr "\"싸우는 것에 질렸어? 쓰러져 항복할 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "bb56a70d-0b21-4233-866d-a9bcc43ce768"
msgid "\"Want to change the subject?\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꾸고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "baa093ed-fa08-452c-aa04-d5d8f5f1825d"
msgid "[Leave] \"I'm going to get something to eat.\""
msgstr "[떠납니다] \"나도 뭔가 좀 먹으러 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "f84c8c9d-30b8-489a-81d5-e703992d4735"
msgid "\"Help yourself. It's time to relax!\""
msgstr "\"맛있게 먹어. 휴식을 취할 때라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "b140920d-73e6-4642-a6f3-994876a63bbe"
msgid "\"Elina's wine is quite good. It's your choice, though.\""
msgstr "\"엘리나의 와인은 아주 맛있어. 네 취향일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "7f3064ec-12fd-4b7d-b520-92f304306c2f"
msgid "[Shrug and sip from your glass]"
msgstr "[어깨를 으쓱하고 잔을 마십니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "bc515617-42cf-4949-91cb-3322442447b1"
msgid "\"Don't force yourself if you don't feel like it.\""
msgstr "\"원하지 않는다면 억지로 마시지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "3c51fa14-ef19-4e0c-8da9-a8c1d7ff48c8"
msgid "[Remain silent]"
msgstr "[침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "47ca7c6d-5c22-4e57-897c-da70c6d2563c"
msgid ""
"\"Don't submit to despair. Deep inside you want to be happy again — and your "
"family would want the same for you. Don't be ashamed of the moments where "
"joy returns to your life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"절망에 복종하지 마. 마음속 깊은곳에서는 다시 행복해지기를 원할거야. 너의 가족도 너를 위해 그렇게 원할 것이고. 삶에 기쁨이 "
"돌아오는 순간을 부끄럽게 생각하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "2d2c0fa4-cb6f-441f-ad2d-511434abf331"
msgid "\"What do you mean?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 뜻이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "68585b39-c7bc-4d38-a5e9-ac26b9651663"
msgid "\"I think this is more than a sense of obligation.\""
msgstr "\"내 생각엔 이건 의무감 그 이상인 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "e5c1f7dd-4268-45ad-aa87-2364566e62bc"
msgid "\"Does it not ruin your fun?\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 즐거운 시간을 망친건 아니지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0060_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d8d95ea9-bf6b-4dff-9621-7563c70da04b"
msgid "Lied and said it was your idea to throw a party for Ekun."
msgstr "에쿤을 위한 파티를 연것이 당신의 아이디어라고 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "9e58d8c7-fc02-4a33-b0e7-c20577d42641"
msgid "\"Yes. It was my idea, after all.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 내 생각이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "d444cc88-c4f7-4b3b-9e83-5ae3823c397d"
msgid "\"It was a team effort — Linzi, Elina, Ntavi...\""
msgstr "\"함께 한 거야. 린지, 엘리나, 은타비랑...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0063_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "079c4043-d148-4159-bbf3-ea1daacd8ebc"
msgid "Said that it was Linzi's idea to throw a party for Ekun."
msgstr "에쿤을 위한 파티를 연것이 린지의 아이디어라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "6ffef165-ba85-4a53-86e9-51d3cb162c20"
msgid "\"You know Linzi. She has a creative mind.\""
msgstr "\"린지를 잘 알잖아. 창의력이 좋은거.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "73386185-d496-43ed-b954-3a712627bb38"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "f933b402-ddbf-41e5-a14c-a26071f1c867"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes our feelings scare us... but your grief and your anger are "
"justified. One can't order one's heart to stop seeking revenge and justice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"때로는 우리의 감정이 우리를 두렵게하지만... 너의 슬픔과 분노는 정당하다. 복수와 정의를 찾는것을 멈추라고 마음에 명령할 수는 없어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0078_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "842f2e16-929a-42c2-b3fc-a792042568d4"
msgid ""
"Advised Ekun to decide on his own how to cope with his grief and move on "
"with his life."
msgstr "에쿤에게 슬픔을 극복하고 자신의 삶을 새롭게 시작하라고 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "95d4e994-2d17-4ca5-b179-83842b7ede4b"
msgid ""
"\"Only you can decide what path is right for you. I believe you will make "
"the correct choice.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 길이 옳은지는 오직 너만이 결정할 수 있어. 네가 올바른 선택을 해주리라 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "ee5ad0cf-9eb5-4703-b937-74c37f641936"
msgid "\"And that's it? You have nothing else to tell me?\""
msgstr "\"그게 다야? 내게 할 말 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0102_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e63b51da-def6-47e8-b782-a903fc8f7ed0"
msgid "Told Ekun to stop whining."
msgstr "에쿤에게 우는 것을 멈추라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "be17795b-f797-4f36-bd59-7f2d392cdc11"
msgid "\"Enough whining. Pull yourself together.\""
msgstr "\"그만 징징거리고 정신 차려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9340e684-e9ac-4743-bf0a-065cd1de5cc0"
msgid "{n}The ranger greets you with a curt nod.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레인저는 퉁명스럽게 고개를 끄덕이며 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "e1c24cb3-6be4-4d2e-b316-51b77df1faa5"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace must want to talk to Ekun. I'll go make sure everyone has "
"enough to drink.\""
msgstr "\"영주님께서도 에쿤과 얘기하고 싶으시겠군요. 저는 모두에게 마음껏 술을 마시라고 얘기하겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6ad83427-846f-44c9-8f59-52a047319309"
msgid "{n}Ekun shrugs.{/n} \"Why?\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "96860e08-c934-4514-804a-40332a1f339f"
msgid ""
"{n}The ranger rubs the back of his head, then smirks.{/n} \"Amanda. Said, 'A "
"caravan is here — you'll go to the tavern again! Ntavi is a bad influence!' "
"And then Ntavi started coming less and less...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레인저는 그의 머리 뒤를 긁으며 빙그레 웃습니다.{/n} \"아만다가 말했었다. '캐러밴은 여기 있어요. 또 선술집에 가는군요. "
"은타비가 당신을 물들였어요.' 그 후로는 그녀가 오는 것이 뜸해졌다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "45ceee59-843d-4882-94ee-eea4a9ade882"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 끄덕합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c8f4c416-ea2e-497d-9e23-cf6982e952dc"
msgid ""
"\"Guarded caravans. She talked a lot. I thought: 'She must be in love with "
"her own voice.'\" {n}Ekun winces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"같이 캐러밴을 지켰었다. 그녀는 말이 많았다. 나는 그녀가 자기 목소리를 너무나 사랑한다고 생각했었다.\" {n}에쿤은 "
"움찔합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0017_Text_String
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "43a69010-6df7-49fd-bbf8-6595f6361523"
msgid ""
"\"But over time, we walked many roads together. I learned she had a steady "
"eye and a strong hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 시간이 흐르면서 우리는 많은 길을 함께 거닐었다. 나는 그녀가 흔들임없는 눈빛과 강한 손을 가지고있다는걸 알게 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6cb9d96f-7f9e-454f-879a-78a3dac914fd"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun chuckles and nods confidently.{/n} \"It's good to be among friends "
"and trees. And better still — not holding a bow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 자신있게 웃으며 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"친구와 나무 사이에 있는 것은 좋다. 그리고 활이 손에 없다면 더 좋겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0019_Text_String
msgctxt "6d43215f-93c5-4d6e-a88e-4ece447ce052"
msgid ""
"{n}After a moment of silence, Ekun nods.{/n} \"It's good to be among trees, "
"not holding a bow.\""
msgstr "{n}침묵의 순간 이후 Ekun은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"활을 쥐지 않고 나무 사이에 있는 것이 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4d31fc0f-69df-4f4b-aa29-465c0132a830"
msgid "{n}Ekun looks at the grass beneath his feet.{/n} \"As fire and wind.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 그의 발 아래 풀밭을 봅니다.{/n} \"불과 바람 같이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "44fc37fc-db79-4b05-876e-f3f42616b050"
msgid "\"We are friends. And friends leave — but stay anyway.\""
msgstr "\"우린 친구야. 친구들은 떠난다. 어쨌든 친구로 남아있지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0d7b4857-6f38-475a-8f67-97dbc92bfb92"
msgid "{n}Ekun looks uncertainly at the offered glass.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 건네받은 술잔을 보며 주저합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8a0907df-10e4-4c35-8cd1-f00acd015855"
msgid "{n}Ekun resolutely shakes his head.{/n} \"No. Thank you.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 단호하게 그의 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아니. 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0034_Drink_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "38deae43-1a4a-483d-b662-fc73ce128fd4"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun is silent for a moment, then pours himself some wine and tastes it… "
"then his face relaxes slightly.{/n} \"Not bad.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 잠시 침묵하고는 와인을 붓고는 음미합니다... 그의 얼굴이 약간은 누그러집니다.{/n} \"나쁘지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8d239173-f585-4dbe-a64e-48e5dd1a2fc1"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods and the tension leaves his shoulders.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}Ekun 고개를 끄덕이고 그의 어깨에 힘이 풀립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "91d2f86e-e54e-4e5f-af9e-5809bd875296"
msgid "\"As always.\""
msgstr "\"언제나처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f06fcc71-3e7b-4848-9e0a-ce9c957365ff"
msgid "\"Life is life. It goes on... whether we wish it or not.\""
msgstr "\"인생은 인생이다. 계속될뿐이다...우리가 바라던 바라지 않던.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b587b3d4-52e7-46ce-a80b-122c1b903fde"
msgid "{n}Ekun tugs at the buttons of his jacket and lowers his head.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 그의 재킷 버튼을 잠그고 고개를 숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9b65b2b9-3cc9-43ec-b1d2-b5a225d3f658"
msgid ""
"{n}A faint smile spreads on Ekun's face.{/n} \"There is very much of her. "
"All at once. However... she is a good woman.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}희미한 미소가 에쿤의 얼굴에 퍼집니다.{/n} \"그녀는 과한 면이 있지. 갑자기 말이야. 하지만... 그녀는 좋은 여자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b425369d-5dfd-4caa-a931-8efad1ab397b"
msgid ""
"{n}Looking at Elina's back, Ekun turns to you, fixing one of his belt "
"bags.{/n} \"Cunning plan. To bring a hunter to a feast, call him to hunt.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나의 뒷모습을 보면서 에쿤은 허리띠 가방 중 하나를 고정시키며 당신에게 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"교활한 계획이군. 사냥꾼을 "
"파티에 데려오려면 사냥 할때 불러야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "35a11a22-0913-412d-84e1-c7daf6d206cb"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stares into the distance.{/n} \"I wake up with the first rays of sun "
"— I see the faces of my family. Fire turns to ashes, midday turns to "
"midnight — and when the stars are shining I still think of them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 먼 곳을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"나는 한줄기 햇빛을 받으며 잠에서 깨어난다. 나는 가족의 얼굴이 보인다. 불은 재로 변하고, "
"낮이 밤으로 바뀌지. 그리고 밤하늘에 별이 빛나도 나는 여전히 그들을 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4fa13195-e965-4ba6-90db-0ce95c9595d3"
msgid ""
"\"I find it interesting to look at faces, listen to what they say to each "
"other. I... missed it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그들의 얼굴을 보고 그들이 나누는 말을 들으며 재미있는 일이 있나 찾는다... 나는 그들이 그립다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "84adb7bb-985a-4055-bb7b-4c4172e1652d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods.{/n} \"It's good to be among friends and trees. And even better "
"— not holding a bow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤이 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"친구와 나무 사이에 있는 것이 좋다. 물론 활을 들고 있지 않았다면 더 좋았을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "52c480c0-6bd0-40b3-a407-9df47081309a"
msgid "\"She is the lady of the house. This is her responsibility.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 이 곳의 안주인이다. 그녀는 해야할 일을 하고있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f501384a-876c-4859-81e1-3fcf61ef9d45"
msgid ""
"\"And you, according to Elina.\" {n}Ekun is silent for a while.{/n} \"Thank "
"you.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너. 엘리나에게 들었다.\" {n}에쿤은 잠시 동안 침묵합니다.{/n} \"고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "52c8d994-756b-4ed0-a637-01ea7594d9b4"
msgid "\"Elina told me. Thank you.\""
msgstr "\"엘리나가 나에게 말해줬다. 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0067_Lie_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e6e1a844-490a-4117-8401-5bd5a4ad8637"
msgid "\"Hmm.\""
msgstr "\"흠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e10b4810-8ac3-4322-9aab-1d441aa14b73"
msgid "\"Uh-huh.\""
msgstr "\"음.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2a3b0d02-f780-4a53-8fca-aa612956cb89"
msgid "{n}Ekun shrugs.{/n} \"It's good to be among trees.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"나무들 사이에 있는 것은 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c287295e-903e-4ca2-9d4c-fa54658a2f7e"
msgid "\"I started living with Amanda. And Ntavi left with a caravan.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아만다와 함께 살았다. 은타비는 캐러밴과 함께 떠났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7fc36c03-6fe0-49a5-a012-a74146563d7a"
msgid ""
"\"And then the desert taught her to close her mouth. Sand gets in.\" {n}Ekun "
"smiles slightly, but his eyes are joyful.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 사막이 그녀에게 입을 막는 법을 가르쳤다. 모래가 들어가니까.\" {n}에쿤은 약간 미소짓지만 그의 눈은 즐겁습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "01d5df0e-0f85-41db-8765-ac35eb9d2bdc"
msgid "{n}Ekun shrugs nonchalantly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 그저 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8f189fc2-80e3-4518-88bb-57a5ced8d5d4"
msgid "\"I... thought about it. Time will tell.\""
msgstr "\"나도... 생각해 봤다. 시간이 말해줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1960b164-62e0-431b-8b03-5eb4996e7ee1"
msgid "{n}Ekun studies his calloused palms.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 그의 굳은살 박힌 손바닥을 살핍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5960fc1a-b92d-47e1-b3d3-e44677c26151"
msgid "{n}Ekun's eyes flare.{/n} \"What do you know of how I live?\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 눈이 번쩍입니다.{/n} \"내가 어떻게 사는지 네가 뭘 알고있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "db34c375-470f-4415-9406-1d835a332975"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face is still.{/n} \"You will not put me out. No point trying.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴은 여전합니다.{/n} \"너는 나를 내쫓지 않을 것이다. 헛수고하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0097_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fdabe54c-ea13-492e-8a41-3b0efb32b478"
msgid "\"I am still thinking about them.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아직도 그들에 대해 생각하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ac317697-3389-4b3e-bc9f-d2086c1f7b3f"
msgid ""
"\"Some days bitterness and rage fill me — I drive them away. Other days I "
"feel a smile on my face and I appall myself. Only hunting numbs my feelings. "
"But the farther I follow the trail, the darker the woods are... and the "
"harder it is to find my way back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 날은 씁쓸함과 분노가 나를 가득 채운다. 나는 그들을 몰아내지. 다른 날엔 얼굴에 미소를 느끼기도 하고 내 스스로 미소 짓기도 "
"한다. 오직 사냥만이 나의 감정을 무감각하게 한다. 하지만 그 길을 따라갈수록 숲은 더 어두워지고... 돌아오는 길은 찾기가 더 "
"힘들어진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_0101_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6bec904c-4b43-4544-b2a3-37de12a8a1e4"
msgid "{n}Ekun sighs heavily and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 한숨을 깊게 쉬며 시선을 피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_100_outcome1_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "902f7144-fd82-459e-938a-9a9ddc487364"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks down. After a long silence he speaks, noticeably relieved.{/n} "
"\"Your eyes look deep. Sometimes too deep. Thank you, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 고개를 숙입니다. 긴 침묵 후에 그는 눈에 띄게 침착해져서 말합니다.{/n} \"너의 눈은 깊어보인다. 가끔은 너무 깊다. "
"고맙다. {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_103_outcome2_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "08f6169d-40ee-4f57-ba89-a27ce84d664c"
msgid "{n}Ekun's face is blank.{/n} \"Your words can't hurt me.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴이 무뚝뚝해집니다.{/n} \"너의 말은 나를 해할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_91_outcome2_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "308f9987-322f-4f82-8b1d-0790383005ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Listening to you, Ekun sighs heavily, but determination is written on his "
"face.{/n} \"I suppose you're right. One can't be scared and leave these "
"woods behind.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말을 들으며 에쿤은 무거게 한숨을 쉬지만 얼굴에는 결심이 서려 있습니다.{/n} \"네가 맞다고 생각한다. 누군가는 "
"두려워해선 안되고 이 숲을 뒤로한채 떠날 수도 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ekun_Party/Cue_92_outcome1_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "98c723e7-eb2c-4da4-8645-70224f8abe91"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun smiles slightly.{/n} \"Easier said than done. But there is wisdom in "
"your words.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 약간 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"행동보다 말은 쉽다. 하지만 네 말에 지혜가 보였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "add8df0d-5dbe-4cfa-9399-94584ff3da9b"
msgid "\"How much will this idea cost me?\""
msgstr "\"이 파티를 준비하는데 얼마나 들까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0a1d5399-132f-4e1a-83e9-eb8086f5f03e"
msgid "\"I commend your enthusiasm! Why would you?\""
msgstr "\"너의 열정을 칭찬하지. 하지만 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a35b7cfe-46c7-42f2-a6b5-005f8f756934"
msgid "\"Then we need only to agree on the place.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이제 장소만 정하면 되겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "aab444a6-8d19-4801-9d99-751f4674fae0"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e1462fec-016b-4722-865d-51297819a69e"
msgid "\"Why would Ekun want to feast in the woods?\""
msgstr "\"왜 에쿤은 숲에서 파티를 하길 원하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9544c73a-f5be-41d3-a607-f804fc5ca7ee"
msgid "\"Can you think of a suitable place?\""
msgstr "\"생각나는 적절한 장소라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d91aec95-ad78-41f3-9165-8642f7247e44"
msgid "\"Who'll serve at the feast?\""
msgstr "\"파티에서는 누가 시중을 들어주지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "79592ecf-1a5f-4d94-a303-bfc6dd1d6346"
msgid "\"What do you say, Elina?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 하겠어. 엘리나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "0730440d-1699-4804-8433-5a95b4bf6689"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, the red-headed innkeeper curtsies awkwardly.{/n} \"Your "
"Grace!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가가자 붉은 머리의 여관 주인은 어색하게 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "f99813f0-f1df-4e72-86c0-37947d191a9a"
msgid ""
"\"You must have come to talk about the {d|Ekun Feast Ok}feast{/d} for "
"Ekundayo. I'd be happy to! I'll provide food and drinks — everything will be "
"first class!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에쿤다요를 위한 {d|Ekun Feast Ok}파티{/d}에 대해 이야기하러 오셨나 보군요. 기꺼이 참여할께요! 제가 음식과 음료를 "
"제공하겠습니다. 모두 최고급으로요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "f6cf080c-d5a4-4eeb-b0c7-7550fcc41df8"
msgid ""
"\"Don't mention it, Your Grace! It's such an honor for me... Everything is "
"on the house.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 말씀마세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 오히려 저에게 큰 영광이걸요... 모두 저희 여관에서 부담하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "9512a971-e335-4289-b0f9-8215a97f2203"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, but if we are thinking about the same Ekundayo, he will likely "
"feel uncomfortable indoors. The feast must definitely be held in the woods — "
"if madam innkeeper is up for such a challenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죄송합니다만, 우리가 같은 에쿤다요를 생각하고 있는거라면, 그는 실내를 불편해 할 겁니다. 파티는 반드시 숲에서 열어야 합니다. 만약 "
"여관 주인 아주머니께서 응해주신다면 말이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "f4b9ca5e-c123-44be-a6ae-ccd79357d45d"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... How about the royal hunting grounds? I've seen the place in "
"passing. It's not far from the city, it's a cozy nook, and there's water "
"nearby.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠... 왕실 사냥터는 어떨까요? 지나가던 길에 본적이 있어요. 도시에서 멀지 않은 곳에 있고, 아늑한데다 주변에 물도 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "d8dc0280-3b21-4ba1-9b29-1afbcffc2378"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman stands tall with a calm smile.{/n} \"My name's Ntavi. I'm "
"passing through the city. Ekun and I know each other from long ago — since "
"back when he guarded caravans. We traveled together for a long time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}한 여자가 차분한 미소를 지으며 당당히 서있습니다.{/n} \"제 이름은 은타비. 도시를 지나가는 길입니다. 에쿤과 저는 오래전부터 "
"알고 지냈어요. 그가 캐러밴을 지키던 때부터였죠. 우리는 오랫동안 함께 여행했었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "5388f669-c905-445c-890a-c50cba92438e"
msgid ""
"\"With your permission, Your Grace... for such an honor... with such "
"esteemed guests... I'd like to do it myself, Your Grace!\" {n}Elina smiles "
"awkwardly, turning an even brighter red.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"...그렇게 귀한 손님들을 모시는..영광스러운 자리를..{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 허락하신다면... 제가 직접 하고 싶어요."
"\" {n}엘리나는 어색하게 미소짓더니, 얼굴이 더욱 빨갛게 변합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "895009b4-2b45-4e94-bc77-24e3b677e9c6"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Your Grace! Isn't it so! It'd be my pleasure! I hope everyone likes "
"it... including Ekundayo...\""
msgstr "\"아, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 아니에요! 제게 기쁜일인걸요! 모두가 좋아했으면 좋겠어요... 에쿤다요도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "86af815f-6646-460e-be50-febcac8a1364"
msgid "{n}Pursing her lips, the innkeeper studies Ntavi carefully.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}입술을 내민 채 주인은 은타비를 신중하게 살핍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "e9110a4d-1dbe-469e-8ebd-82d36ef4c64d"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina is speechless, either due to astonishment, indignation — or "
"both.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘리나는 놀라움인지 분노인지 또는 둘 다 때문인지 말문이 막혔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "5ea63cd9-5193-4766-93ee-27d0ef501602"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful! In that case, I'll gladly meet both of you in the agreed upon "
"place!\""
msgstr "\"잘됐는걸요! 그렇다면, 두 분 모두 그 장소에서 뵙겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "5edc0073-703f-4121-bc42-ed8afff4b42e"
msgid ""
"\"I guess there's no two ways about it, we'll have to have it right in this "
"room! We can decorate it, of course...\""
msgstr "\"제가 보기엔 다른곳 생각할 필요 없다고 생각해요. 바로 이 방에서 해야죠! 물론 장식도 할 수 있어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "e809df81-05f3-4ea2-bf8d-48bd6a55c63f"
msgid ""
"{n}The innkeeper sizes up the woman opposite her. {/n}\"I might not know "
"Ekundayo as well as some... but I see no trouble in holding a feast in the "
"woods. Or on a mountain or in a swamp, for that matter!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여관 주인은 맞은 편에 있는 여성을 가늠질합니다.{/n} \"저는 에쿤다요를 잘 모르니깐요... 하지만 숲에서 파티를 여는 건 "
"문제없어요. 아니면 산 위나 늪에서 해도 상관없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "b9d5f047-9057-4e72-bada-8ff5ac4ded3f"
msgid ""
"\"My! I've seen a lot since as a keeper here, but when one just invites "
"herself like that...\" {n}The innkeeper clicks her tongue.{/n} \"Oh, what "
"got into me, grumbling, it's high time to start cooking! Your Grace, please "
"take care of bringing Ekundayo to the agreed place. Linzi and I will do the "
"rest!\""
msgstr ""
"\"참내! 여기 여관 주인이 된 후로 많은 것을 봐왔지만, 저런식으로 자기 자신을 스스로 초대하는건... {n}여관 주인이 혀를 "
"찹니다.{/n} \"어머. 내 정신 좀 봐. 혼자 중얼거리기나하고..이제 요리를 시작할 때가 됐어요! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, "
"에쿤다요를 약속된 장소로 올 수 있게 잘부탁드립니다. 린지와 제가 나머지를 준비 할께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "482ac105-b7a3-4016-ba71-fb8e2432cc0e"
msgid ""
"\"He is a born ranger. He always feels calmer under an open sky. I know him "
"well.\""
msgstr "\"그는 타고난 레인저에요. 항상 탁 트인 하늘 아래서 더 평온함을 느끼죠. 저는 그 사람을 잘 알아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a7c936c4-eb38-42ed-bb54-c43cdf860786"
msgid "\"Relax, friend. Let's just drink a little and talk.\""
msgstr "\"진정해, 친구. 그냥 술 조금 마시고 얘기나 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b0d5ee45-e610-4928-8a8c-3bd7cf2bffab"
msgid "\"We wanted to have a picnic for a long time. Join us!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 오랫동안 소풍을 하고 싶었어. 즐기자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b355d59e-c1d5-41ae-aff8-7af0ac52fec0"
msgid "[Silently pat Ekun on the back]"
msgstr "[조용히 에쿤의 등을 두드려줍니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "12659f35-f8e5-48d1-a20b-c37dfea95c87"
msgid "\"Forgive me, Your Grace, but where is Ekundayo?\""
msgstr "\"영주님, 죄송합니다만, 에쿤다요는 어디에 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "5a036d7a-6488-4f86-a119-934530b43316"
msgid "\"Without him, we can't start our feast. We need to get him here.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤 없이는 우리는 파티를 시작할 수 없어. 그를 여기에 데려와야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "9bf49691-9249-4f5c-8c5d-748f24335238"
msgid "\"There you are!\""
msgstr "\"오셨군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "87356a4d-99f7-41ce-a317-6feed60d72ff"
msgid "\"Ekun, old friend! Speak of the devil!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤, 오랜 친구! 호랑이도 제말 하면 온다더니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "eeef7d86-c925-4d7f-8fcc-d1ea8d21692c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face freezes in surprise. He stares at Ntavi and Elina silently "
"for a few moments, completely still.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴은 놀라움으로 얼어 붙습니다. 그는 잠시 동안 은타비와 엘리나를 조용히 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2b0fd5f5-eb99-46ea-84af-387eb91aea33"
msgid "{n}Finally, Ekun turns a quizzical look to you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}마침내 에쿤은 당신에게 이상한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "c47c8b58-2a66-4795-ae56-a43f8e789c6c"
msgid ""
"{n}Grabbing Ekun's arm, Elina leads him to the tables with food.{/n} \"Please"
" come here, Ekundayo... you don't mind if I call you Ekun?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나는 에쿤의 팔을 잡고 그를 식사 테이블로 안내합니다.{/n} \"이쪽으로 오세요, 에쿤다요... 당신을 에쿤으로 불러도 "
"괜찮을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Ntavi_Forest/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "84bb9c30-1831-4290-8cac-35909df62aa5"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Ntavi}Ntavi{/d} fixes her hair and you notice a tattoo of a stinging "
"wasp on her wrist. Following the couple with a long stare, Ntavi says "
"quietly to you,{/n} \"Please come to me when everyone is busy eating and "
"drinking. I would like to talk to you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Ntavi}은타비{/d}가 그녀의 머리를 고칠 때 당신은 그녀의 손목에 있는 말벌 문신을 눈치챕니다. 두 커플을 오랫동안 쳐다보던 "
"은타비는 조용히 당신에게 말합니다.{/n} \"모두 먹고 마시느라 정신없을 때 저에게 와주겠어요? 당신과 얘기하고 싶은 게 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "2d14e372-648b-47aa-859d-acd450f12a67"
msgid "\"Elina, could you give me a bottle of wine?\""
msgstr "\"엘리나. 와인 한병 주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b06082d8-d76f-4191-8538-d8a06dad87d0"
msgid "\"Thank you for organizing such a wonderful party for Ekun!\""
msgstr "\"에쿤을 위해 이렇게 멋진 파티를 마련해 줘서 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "81ed1d96-554f-4b8a-95db-b150f124bc7f"
msgid "[Leave] \"Well, I'm going to go check in on some of the others!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"음, 다른 사람들에게 인사하러 가봐야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "418e7a84-1136-4873-9298-4f75d83ae8ea"
msgid "Ordered Elina to bring a bottle of wine."
msgstr "엘리나에게 와인 한병 가져 오라고 주문했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a9b2b486-c7cb-4fbb-a009-84b340b9b96c"
msgid "\"Are you answering your ruler's command with a question?\""
msgstr "\"통치자의 명령을 질문으로 대답하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dd810902-2585-45e4-9d06-07a775138d94"
msgid "Intimidated Elina into bringing a bottle of wine."
msgstr "와인 한병을 가져오라고 엘리나에게 으름장을 놓습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "7340d735-e8db-4c5e-8945-4f5fac716379"
msgid "\"I need a bottle of wine. Now, I'm going to count to three. One...\""
msgstr "\"와인 한병 좀 가져와, 당장. 셋 셀게. 하나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "685212bf-fa60-4077-8b0f-1f0f4c955e39"
msgid "Confessed to who really needed the bottle of wine."
msgstr "와인 한병이 필요한게 누구인지 솔직하게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "040d3e26-f226-4696-8c72-3bca09fcc3d8"
msgid ""
"\"I need a bottle for Ntavi. She's our guest — you can't refuse her food and "
"drinks.\""
msgstr "\"은타비를 위해 한병 가져가려고. 그녀는 우리 손님이야. 그녀가 먹고 마시는걸 네가 거부할 수는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "04626025-63d7-4daf-8bc2-a6b29900a858"
msgid "Didn't tell Elina who the bottle of wine was for."
msgstr "엘리나에게 와인 한 병을 누구에게 줄 것인지 말하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "2376c074-1a94-4b04-9781-2492e15e10e6"
msgid "\"And still I'd prefer it.\""
msgstr "\"예전부터 혼자 따라마시는걸 좋아해서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "ac62c023-bab6-43db-8f55-7864e5bc2881"
msgid "\"What can I do for you, Your Grace?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 도와드릴까요, 영주님?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "6877a006-7e95-46ee-ba82-3938d4e10fb2"
msgid ""
"\"My pleasure, Your Grace! I am happy everything turned out this way as "
"well... Besides, entertaining a man such as Ekundayo is a pleasure!\" {n}The "
"innkeeper giggles, covering her mouth with a handkerchief.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"천만에요, 영주님! 저도 모든 일이 이렇게 잘되어서 너무 좋아요... 게다가 에쿤다요 같은 사람을 즐겁게 해서 기쁩니다!\" {n}"
"여관 주인은 킥킥 웃으며 손수건으로 입을 가렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "31fc0573-9915-408b-a092-d73f4872e362"
msgid ""
"\"Don't bother with the bottle, Your Grace. I'll pour for you — just bring a "
"glass!\""
msgstr "\"번거롭게 직접 따르시려구요, 영주님? 제가 따라 드리겠습니다. 그냥 잔만 가지고 오세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1100c9cb-248b-4b2e-9f5e-80616f2e727d"
msgid "{n}Ekun pretends not to hear.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 못 들은 체합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "401a9c5d-3702-489c-aa14-4c4d92c893a6"
msgid ""
"{n}The innkeeper raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"I have no idea why Your Grace "
"invited this harpy... Of course, you know better, but still...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주인은 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"영주님께서 왜 저런 하피같은 여자를 초대했는지 모르겠어요... 물론 다 생각이 있으셔서 "
"그러신 거겠지만, 그래도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "a0929716-6913-4b38-ae5b-8c72bde11e6c"
msgid ""
"{n}The innkeeper makes a long face.{/n} \"There, there, here you go, Your "
"Grace...\""
msgstr "{n}주인은 시무룩한 얼굴을 합니다.{/n} \"자, 자, 여기 있습니다, 영주님...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Elina_Party/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "d0d37f71-a642-4cca-8ced-63912d0d36e3"
msgid "\"As you wish!\""
msgstr "\"원하시는대로 하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Item/CheapWine_EkunQ1_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "8b1501c9-a413-4828-b524-643d0831ba8c"
msgid ""
"Judging by the color and a quick smell, this is not wine but rather grape "
"vinegar."
msgstr "색깔과 냄새로 판단하건데 이것은 포도주가 아니라 포도 식초입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Item/CheapWine_EkunQ1_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "2a35a0dc-676c-435f-831e-8f60e35f4327"
msgid "Cheap Wine"
msgstr "저렴한 와인"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Item/NormalWine_EkunQ1_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "b22c94f3-53e9-472b-b90c-18c13ff45364"
msgid ""
"A common product. Good enough for all but the most sophisticated gourmets."
msgstr "일반적인 와인입니다. 가장 정교한 미식가를 제외한 모든 사람들에게 충분합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Item/NormalWine_EkunQ1_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "c39a41a4-b956-45da-9ce5-19a23cc8467e"
msgid "Common Wine"
msgstr "일반적인 와인"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Item/RichWine_EkunQ1_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "7d325e7b-c1ef-4891-b554-fe4dd457b009"
msgid ""
"The label holds a message written in several languages: \"For best taste, "
"leave the bottle open for a few moments before pouring the wine.\""
msgstr ""
"라벨에는 여러 가지 언어로 작성된 메시지가 있습니다. \"최고의 맛을 내기 위해 와인을 따르기 전에 병을 잠시 열어 두십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Item/RichWine_EkunQ1_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "3aecd65e-30a1-4c52-9078-8a6a24a94bdf"
msgid "Rich Wine"
msgstr "고급 와인"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "fda40841-cf32-409c-9bab-76ad30f41e3e"
msgid "[Leave the party] \"Still I have to go.\""
msgstr "[잔치를 떠납니다] \"그래도 나는 가봐야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "da4d50cd-3dc1-4186-a96f-b5cf12e578c8"
msgid ""
"[Stay at the party] \"Clear as day! I just wanted a break from the noise.\""
msgstr "[파티에 머뭅니다] \"맑은 날이군! 잠시 소음에서 벗어나고 싶었을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2439730c-673d-4cef-b683-f0728238cdf0"
msgid "\"Linzi, I think now's the perfect time for one of your performances.\""
msgstr "\"린지. 지금이 공연하기에 완벽한 타이밍이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "6095d036-3282-48a2-a2b8-dae9019b3e8c"
msgid "\"I'm sure. Begin!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지. 시작해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "0063839e-e289-4a94-be5f-9627c50e2dc3"
msgid "\"Come to think of it, no. Give me a little more time.\""
msgstr "\"생각해 보니, 아니야. 좀 더 시간을 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "ee010b67-a65f-4c5e-b228-9e480832f53a"
msgid "\"I won't bother you.\""
msgstr "\"방해하지 않을께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "9da571a8-b09d-4e82-82d4-ba90a20b49ab"
msgid "\"Thank you for the wonderful idea, Linzi.\""
msgstr "\"멋진 아이디어 고마워. 린지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "e28db7fe-d3e8-4af9-b43e-3ebcd065a715"
msgid "\"Isn't it hard to play and talk at the same time?\""
msgstr "\"동시에 연주하고 이야기하는 게 어렵지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "10ac6fcb-d82d-4171-9ca9-c64d6251edc0"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi looks up at you, surprised, trying to keep the rhythm.{/n} \"Where "
"are you going? If you... leave now... the whole plan... goes to pieces!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 고개를 들어 당신을 보고는 놀라며, 리듬이 깨지지 않도록 계속 연주합니다.{/n} \"어디 가세요? 지금 떠나면... 모든 "
"계획이 헛수고로 끝난다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "22bc7944-b1b5-454a-935f-7447db788ebb"
msgid "\"Are you sure? Have you had time to talk to everyone?\""
msgstr "\"정말이에요? 모두와 얘기는 했어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ed3f5754-5c17-45c0-9dda-c137cfb9053b"
msgid "{n}Linzi runs her fingers over the strings intently.{/n} \"Hmm?\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 줄을 손가락으로 열심히 튕깁니다.{/n} \"응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "638b2aac-a4bd-42c7-a0e3-dc0ad83c2c08"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi's face brightens.{/n} \"I'm glad you liked it! I hope the others... "
"are happy too! Especially... Ekun...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지의 얼굴이 밝아집니다.{/n} \"영주님이 좋아하니 기뻐요! 다른 사람들도... 좋아해서 기뻐요! 특히나 에쿤이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_PartyExit/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "add45a1a-ee84-4291-9e49-aba070d3a284"
msgid "\"Ha! It's a... matter of practice...\""
msgstr "\"하! 이건..연습 문제죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c22ff808-24a9-477c-85a9-76ef28e6c85e"
msgid "[Take a step away from Ekun]"
msgstr "[에쿤에게서 물러섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "79d386c5-d724-41e2-89ce-0a8d604dd588"
msgid ""
"[Try to shove Ekun closer to Elina] \"Ekun, my friend, could you crowd me "
"so...\""
msgstr "[에쿤을 엘리나에게 떠밉니다] \"에쿤. 나한테 너무 가까이 붙은거 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6469c5fc-a043-4db0-9bf1-38fdc8b24238"
msgid ""
"\"And now I'd like to play something special for you. I haven't composed "
"anything for a while, but this is a special occasion...\" {n}Striking a "
"theatrical pose, Linzi begins to play.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이제 당신을 위해 특별한 곡을 연주하고 싶어요. 한동안 작곡을 하지 않았지만, 이건 특별한 행사니까요...\" {n}과장돤 "
"자세를 취하며, 린지는 연주를 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "23a58d3f-d8ba-46da-9be5-de75e1451811"
msgid "{n}Ekun quietly takes a place next to you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 조용히 당신 옆에 자리를 잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a250275f-62bb-403d-bc5d-eb998befffa3"
msgid ""
"{n}Music starts flowing. Linzi's performance isn't perfect, but it is deep "
"and emotional. One cadence follows another, and music echoes among the "
"trees...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}음악이 흘러 나오기 시작합니다. 린지의 연주는 완벽하지는 않지만 깊이 있고 감성적입니다. 한 소절이 끝나면 그 뒤를 다른 소절이 "
"따르고 노래는 숲에 퍼집니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6f1f372b-6f6f-402f-a1a6-6a03a491683c"
msgid ""
"{n}Suddenly you notice that Ekun is standing much closer than you thought. "
"You realize he's slowly moving closer to you, fidgeting from foot to foot "
"and trying not to look at anyone...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}갑자기 당신은 에쿤이 생각한 것보다 훨씬 더 가까이 서 있다는 것을 눈치챕니다. 그는 발끝까지 안절부절하며 아무도 쳐다보지 않으려 "
"애쓰고 있습니다. 당신은 그가 더 가까이 다가오는 것을 깨닫습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "201a534c-7138-4e22-a391-151b39622591"
msgid ""
"{n}...at the same time Elina is trying to lean closer and closer to Ekun, "
"trying to touch his shoulder! Noticing your look, she gives you a sharp "
"look.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}... 동시에 엘리나는 에쿤의 어깨를 만지려 점점 더 그에게 몸을 기울입니다! 당신의 얼굴을 본 그녀는 당신에게 날카로운 눈빛을 "
"보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e177ee49-8b8a-4f1d-ba33-4d011247b76b"
msgid ""
"{n}Turning red as a beet, Ekun whispers an apology and moves towards Elina. "
"She grabs Ekun by the arm, looking at you gratefully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}홍당무처럼 빨개진 에쿤은 사과의 말을 속삭이고는 엘리나를 향해 걸음을 옮깁니다. 그녀는 에쿤의 팔을 잡고 당신에게 감사의 눈길을 "
"보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ec1c2bfb-12cc-4ef4-9250-3fb15ce39236"
msgid ""
"{n}Finally Linzi strikes the final chord, and the sound fades. Pleased with "
"her performance, Linzi receives well-deserved applause.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마침내 린지가 마지막 현을 치자, 소리가 울리며 사라집니다. 린지는 공연에 만족해하고 관객은 그녀에게 박수갈채를 보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0eede4f6-c5a9-40f9-a1d7-486bf5364634"
msgid "\"Ahem! Your attention!\""
msgstr "\"에헴! 실례합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2f15a9cf-fab4-462a-9bae-4b6951e44cea"
msgid ""
"\"My friends, let's raise our glasses! Let's celebrate our adventures — and "
"that we have others to share them with! Also let's thank Elina for a "
"generous feast — the evening was wonderful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"친구들. 잔을 들어주세요! 우리의 모험을 기념합시다. 그리고 모험을 함께할 동료들이 있다는 것에도요! 또한 멋진 파티를 베풀어준 "
"엘리나에게도 감사를 보냅니다! 오늘 저녁은 정말 멋졌어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "f518b827-c256-43a2-8325-0c9f085a51b9"
msgid "{n}Elina bows, turning red.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘리나는 고개 숙여 인사를 하고는, 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Linzi_Song/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "a1691da0-3238-481d-b5e4-305626a66dfb"
msgid ""
"{n}You take a step, and Ekun does the same. Elina pouts and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 한발을 내딛고 에쿤도 똑같이 합니다. 엘리나는 입술이 비죽 나와 시선을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2ac7caeb-a053-4024-b2f1-79ff4fd2e61e"
msgid "[Pass the bottle to Ntavi] \"Here. I hope you like this.\""
msgstr "[은타비에게 병을 건냅니다] \"자 여기. 마음에 들길 바래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0b0cdedb-e280-4b8f-b76d-780ac5a11ee9"
msgid "\"Still, why do you need a bottle of wine?\""
msgstr "\"그래도 한번 말해봐. 왜 와인 한병이 필요한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7478b738-7b45-415b-883f-36b6837e62e1"
msgid "Taunted Ntavi when she asked you to find a bottle of wine for her."
msgstr "와인 한 병을 찾아달라고 부탁하는 은타비를 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "38ba0df5-8930-4d86-a3d5-73d216093262"
msgid "[Open a bottle of wine ostentatiously and sip from it]"
msgstr "[과시하듯 와인 병을 따서 홀짝홀짝 마십니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "88b57896-21b8-4d6b-82e7-84fd30122548"
msgid "\"And why do you need a bottle of wine?\""
msgstr "\"근데 왜 와인 한병이 필요한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "79297746-8392-45b8-8b4f-4d73e383c5cd"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll see what I can do.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 내가 무엇을 할 수 있는지 알아볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "97dc0bf0-6092-464d-abe6-85b8535ecd1f"
msgid "\"I'll think about it.\""
msgstr "\"생각해 볼께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "d84038c0-0b22-405a-af69-3889f83486c1"
msgid "\"I don't have time for this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이럴 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3fa3d491-63b4-47f3-96c0-56978ffa6b16"
msgid "\"So what did you want to talk about?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 나에게 무슨 얘기를 하고 싶었던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "dee33b9b-6b8a-4b05-9307-88355cc1b3d8"
msgid "\"I admit, we got acquainted very suddenly.\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말해서, 우리는 너무 갑작스럽게 서로를 알게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "0f0c02b6-9224-4d72-bd55-82db08de960c"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "d98dc6c1-b113-4f8f-aca1-47e584e03b54"
msgid "\"How did you meet Ekun?\""
msgstr "\"에쿤은 어떻게 만났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "3231d4e9-150e-4040-bf6d-cc239ee88641"
msgid "\"Ekun never mentioned you.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤은 너에 대해 말한 적이 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "fe349e49-f44f-4e3b-a2da-b97e3c903199"
msgid "\"I'd like to know you better.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 좀 더 알고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "34383e61-7794-440a-bb8a-a32a56d417c8"
msgid "\"Didn't you say before that he doesn't like taverns?\""
msgstr "\"그가 여관 같은데는 좋아하지 않는다고 전에 말하지 않았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "af4d39df-3f19-4d31-b3d1-3d8d5895a5f3"
msgid "\"A curious story.\""
msgstr "\"기묘한 이야기로군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "e0f929de-1690-4d33-b750-fb173d16eb68"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"주제를 바꿔 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "81fba912-97de-4dbd-b5ea-9c8be7f3a6a7"
msgid "[Smile in response and leave]"
msgstr "[미소로 답하고 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "7eae250a-be69-4829-b79c-0bb274abb7a5"
msgid "\"A curious tattoo — a stinging wasp. Does it mean anything?\""
msgstr "\"흥미로운 문신이군. 말벌이라. 뭔가 의미가 있는건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "d8528891-c771-44ee-b816-14f4bd7fa08d"
msgid ""
"\"There's a symbol of Calistria on your wrist. Are you one of her followers?"
"\""
msgstr "\"손목에 칼리스트리아의 상징이 있군. 너는 그녀의 추종자야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "2876c5af-c210-424d-8288-4565fd673b8e"
msgid "\"Stinging wasp is a symbol of Calistria.\""
msgstr "\"찌르는 말벌은 칼리스트리아의 상징이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "4f0dcce0-4a4a-4498-8950-f5acbfeefde7"
msgid "\"That is an evasive answer.\""
msgstr "\"그것은 회피적인 대답이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "b7f1d516-0088-43e1-ba20-25df6ddef1e8"
msgid "\"Your Grace.\" {n}Smiling, {d|Ntavi}Ntavi{/d} nods politely.{/n}"
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}{d|Ntavi}은타비{/d}는 정중하게 끄덕이며 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "90057eb9-30f4-4295-815c-822e8fd8220a"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to ask a favor. You see, Elina the innkeeper treats me coldly, "
"and I have no reason why! Yesterday, for instance, she argued with me before "
"changing the sheets in my room, and today she refuses to pour me a glass of "
"wine... So I was thinking, she wouldn't refuse if the baron{mf||ess} "
"{mf|him|her}self asks for a bottle of wine?\""
msgstr ""
"\"한가지 부탁을 하고 싶었어요. 엘리나는 나를 차갑게 대하는데 그 이유를 모르겠어요! 어제는 내 방의 벽지를 바꿔야 한다며 저와 "
"말다툼을 하더니, 오늘은 와인 한잔 따라주지를 않더군요... 그래서 생각해보니, 영주님이 와인 한병을 부탁해도 그녀가 과연 거절할까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "3f96ab56-1691-4d51-90a3-f9a393d98f44"
msgid "{n}Ntavi greets you with a charming smile.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}은타비는 당신을 매력적인 미소로 맞이합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "2b69368f-e9c4-4817-83d5-8f3ddc1a960f"
msgid ""
"{n}Casting a warm glance your way, Ntavi nods gratefully.{/n} \"Thank you "
"very much! Now if you don't mind...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신에게 따뜻한 눈빛을 던지며 그녀는 정중하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"정말 고맙습니다! 그럼 이제 저는 잠시 실례...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "9cb6e69e-e130-4d64-ba09-7d0870d4e44b"
msgid "{n}The woman's mysterious smile is baffling.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그 여자의 신비한 미소를 이해할 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "d7f81d60-3622-48ad-bb37-1486881bc336"
msgid "\"Hmm.\" {n}Ntavi's face is like a mask. She turns away silently.{/n}"
msgstr "\"흠.\" {n}은타비의 얼굴은 가면과 같습니다. 그녀는 조용해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "36241676-939f-4fa2-af07-69100ab8c50f"
msgid ""
"{n}Ntavi's laughter is soft and musical.{/n} \"What a strange question! "
"Really, why would I need a bottle of wine at a party?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}은타비의 웃음은 부드러운 음악 같습니다.{/n} \"이상한 질문이네요! 정말이지, 왜 제가 파티에서 와인 한병이 필요하겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "a4698dda-e755-430e-8c9d-478c6b371546"
msgid "\"Thank you, {name}!\""
msgstr "\"고마워요. {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "a041395f-24cd-4c6c-82be-172c1bf26a9b"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "3760d1af-57b7-4aa6-b725-bd20760e8b8c"
msgid ""
"\"Ah-ha-hah! That's right — when we met for the first time, I had to speak "
"to him, interruptions be damned. What was I supposed to do? I haven't seen "
"Ekun for such a long time, and I was so surprised to hear about him...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아하하! 맞아요. 우리가 처음 만났을 때, 저는 에쿤과 만나야만 했어요. 저도 방해는 질색이에요. 제가 무슨 방법이 있었겠어요? 나는 "
"에쿤을 정말 오랫동안 보지 못했고, 그에 대해 얘기하는걸 듣고 정말 놀랐어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "a9f46c37-4c51-40ad-8c89-84e6d997e9fc"
msgid "\"I'm at your service.\""
msgstr "\"뭐든지 말씀만 하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "eff2ec96-f6a7-43fc-93f0-d14372312045"
msgid ""
"\"I grew up in Nantambu, far from here, but never liked that city. I left it "
"years ago, and haven't been back since. I remember leaving it vividly. "
"Little towers covered with bright mosaics dot the horizon, while I lay "
"hidden in the bushels of sugarcane on a rumbling cart, drawn by a lame old "
"donkey.\" {n}Ntavi laughs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저는 여기서 멀리 떨어진 난탐부에서 자랐지만, 그 도시를 절대로 좋아하지 않았어요. 몇 년 전에 떠난 이후로 돌아간 적이 없어요. 떠날 때의 "
"기억이 생생히 나요. 작은 탑들이 밝은 모자이크처럼 수평선을 수놓은 밤에, 저는 늙은 절름발이 당나귀가 끄는 수레 위에 있는 사탕수수 "
"더미 속에 숨어 있었죠.\" {n}은타비는 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "94ee3696-9064-4004-aacd-100ad032f04f"
msgid ""
"\"We guarded a caravan together. At first, I couldn't stand Ekun — I took "
"his silence for arrogance. But then a sandstorm forced us to spend a week in "
"a tiny village. We drank everything the only inn had to offer — and got to "
"know each other better.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 캐러밴을 함께 지켰어요. 처음에는 에쿤의 침묵을 거만함이라고 생각해서 견딜 수 없었어요. 하지만 그러다 모래 "
"폭풍으로 인해 우리는 작은 마을에서 일주일을 보내게 됐어요. 우리는 그곳의 유일한 여관에서 주는 모든 술을 마시며, 그렇게 서로를 더 잘 "
"알게 되었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "c743936a-c20f-418d-87fb-67f06d5942e9"
msgid ""
"\"You don't say, ah-ha-ha! It can't be!\" {n}Ntavi looks at you with a "
"smirk.{/n} \"And he is usually so talkative! Keeps talking about himself, "
"his past, his dreams and plans, a couple of jokes here and there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 말 하지 말아요. 아-하-하! 그럴리가요!\" {n}은타비는 능글 맞게 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그 사람이 평소에 좀 "
"수다스러워야 말이죠! 자기 자신에 대해, 그의 과거, 꿈과 계획, 여기 저기서 들은 농담들을 계속 떠들어대니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "30ddd210-79b4-44f6-b567-bdf9a3daf8a8"
msgid ""
"{n}Ntavi grins, staring off into the distance.{/n} \"He behaved somewhat... "
"differently when he was young.\""
msgstr "{n}은타비는 먼 곳을 쳐다보며 활짝 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"젊을 적엔 좀 더... 다르게 행동했어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "9d8fb558-186c-407a-8b75-1a27c0ccd8d9"
msgid "\"And old as the world.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 세상만큼 늙었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "b3ca6790-1df4-4588-b82b-8a51b85e221f"
msgid "\"Agreed.\""
msgstr "\"좋아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "6dc77033-d5b9-44a2-b73b-5a4b587aab01"
msgid ""
"\"Well... I just wanted to steal Ekun for a moment. To walk and talk with "
"him, eye to eye. I've known him a long time, and he could definitely use "
"someone to talk to.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 그냥 잠시 에쿤을 훔쳐오고 싶었을뿐이에요. 함께 걸으며 눈을 맞추고 얘기를 나누고 싶어서요. 저는 그를 오랫동안 알아 왔어요, "
"분명 대화할 상대가 필요할 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "f89466f0-ddfc-4e7f-9160-a68847b9b163"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace is very observant.\" {n}Ntavi runs her finger over the "
"image.{/n} \"This tattoo is a tribute to tradition. It symbolizes the "
"transition from unconscious dogmatic conformity to mindfulness and self-"
"awareness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님께선 눈썰미가 좋군요.\" {n}은타비는 문신을 손가락으로 쓸어내립니다.{/n} \"이 문신은 전통을 기리는 것입니다. "
"무의식적인 독단적 순응에서 마음가짐과 자각으로의 전환을 상징하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "2db9d91e-e228-4cb4-8219-3165a374812a"
msgid ""
"\"You are well-informed. Yes, I venerate the goddess. In my part of the "
"world, this tattoo is a part of an initiation ritual. It symbolizes "
"awareness of one's desires... self awareness.\""
msgstr "\"잘 아시네요. 맞아요. 우리에게서 문신은 입문의 증표라 할 수 있지요. 자신의 욕망과 자의식을 상징해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "2b396646-96c2-4c0d-a1e6-b15a65dcc694"
msgid ""
"\"Ah-ha-hah, I'll probably never get used to the straightforwardness of "
"citizens of the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}. A wasp is the sacred "
"animal of {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}... I am one of her followers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아-하-하. {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 시민들의 솔직함에는 익숙해지기 어렵네요. 말벌은 "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 신성한 동물이예요... 저는 그녀의 추종자이고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Ntavi_Party/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "aac44cb4-4099-4976-a75c-d1e4d779f0d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Ntavi keeps smiling as if nothing happened.{/n} \"Just so. Know your "
"desires and you'll know yourself.\""
msgstr "{n}은타비는 아무 일도 없는 것처럼 웃습니다.{/n} \"당신의 욕망을 알면 자기 자신을 알게 될 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6c74dc38-fe20-46de-be29-feca71db4efc"
msgid "\"I think he deserves a name.\""
msgstr "\"그는 이름을 받을 자격이 있다고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "613ee77f-37e1-4564-afe9-2f19a02b088c"
msgid "\"If you need to get over yourself to do this, Ekun, then don't.\""
msgstr "\"이름을 지어주는게 너에게 어려운 문제라면, 굳이 할 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "68d3be51-4844-4d83-bd9a-6f0698b7b4ec"
msgid "Let Ekun decide whether to give the wolf a proper name or not."
msgstr "늑대의 이름을 지을지 여부를 에쿤에게 맡겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4f979709-09a9-4cf3-8d5f-5cbf191f2671"
msgid "[Keep silent]"
msgstr "[계속 침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : EkunWolf_NPC
msgctxt "a44b3ade-c735-4039-ab08-e981a2909f5f"
msgid ""
"{n}The wolf who was standing nearby before wags his tail and approaches "
"Ekun.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}근처에 서 있던 늑대는 꼬리를 흔들고 에쿤에게 접근합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4976de0c-c563-461f-ac85-ee36013ccbda"
msgid ""
"\"Aww... just look at that, Ekun! He seems so loyal! You have to give him a "
"name!\""
msgstr "\"앗... 저길 봐. 에쿤! 이렇게나 충성심이 강한데! 이름을 지어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "40c36f06-1260-492d-952f-179711a96a34"
msgid ""
"\"You do. You've been together for so long, you've been through so much "
"together...\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 너는 오랫동안 함께 해주었고, 많은 것을 함께 겪어주었지..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "06ce05d0-7310-48bc-ac25-377965ecb783"
msgid ""
"{n}Ntavi shakes her head.{/n} \"The heart wants what it wants. Why would one "
"fake affection when there is none?\""
msgstr "{n}은타비는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"마음은 가는대로 움직여야지. 왜 있지도 않은 감정을 만들어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c20f8d5d-8640-483b-ad03-111e092cdb86"
msgid "\"His loyalty's appreciated. Not ready to decide his fate, though.\""
msgstr "\"그의 충성심은 인정할만 해. 하지만 운명을 결정할 준비는 안됐군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "eb1545c3-6e95-48dd-a575-28f77ddf0af9"
msgid "{n}Ntavi nods in understanding.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}은타비는 이해하며 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e9894e64-9b1c-4f04-9246-9eab95e57183"
msgid ""
"{n}Looking at the dog and thinking for a moment, Ekun smiles slightly.{/n} "
"\"His name is Okbo.\""
msgstr "{n}개를 보고 잠시 생각하면서 에쿤은 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"네 이름은 오크보다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "7b00f533-bed4-46a4-9330-2884f1d0ef10"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina looks at Ekun and seems to forget about the whole world for a "
"moment.{/n} \"That's better!\""
msgstr "{n}엘리나는 에쿤을 바라보며 잠시 온 세상을 잊은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"훨씬 좋은데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d120c83c-5e14-4c11-928e-bc3b30b6017b"
msgid "\"A wonderful, imposing name! Well-chosen.\""
msgstr "\"멋지고 늠름한 이름이인걸요! 잘 지었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/Party_Dog/Cue_0018_Q1Finish_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "180ee5d3-e7ba-444b-a912-768ea6f590b9"
msgid ""
"\"By the way, friends... Not to sound too mundane, but I'm quite tired, and "
"we still have to get to the city. Maybe it's time we pack up?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 그렇고, 친구들....좀 재미없는 소리처럼 들리겠지만, 저는 꽤 피곤하네요. 곧 도시에 가야하니까 이제 짐을 꾸릴 때가 되지 "
"않았을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q1_A_Feast_For_a_Friend/WolfName/NewEkunWolfName_String
msgctxt "e6da64af-6b98-4777-8022-38f3efeebcb9"
msgid "Okbo"
msgstr "오크보"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "36e0ef18-a847-40f3-9aea-9e1ccfc6f174"
msgid "Exiled Ekun for attacking his comrades in arms."
msgstr "동료들을 공격한 에쿤을 추방했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "247db356-1a07-4117-a7d2-2d3d1ab0c0d1"
msgid ""
"\"Your behavior put the lives of your comrades-in-arms and your "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} in jeopardy. I am sorry, Ekun... but justice "
"demands you be punished. By the power vested in me, I exile you from these "
"lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 행동은 동료들의 삶을 위험에 처하게 했다. 미안하지만 너를 처벌해야 한다... 나의 권한으로 너를 이 땅에서 추방한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "79a2bb14-3d22-41ed-8f27-3183704138ae"
msgid "Sentenced Ekun to death for treason."
msgstr "반역을 한 에쿤에게 사형을 선고했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "79554ad3-700f-4b80-9259-6fe770eb278b"
msgid ""
"\"Ekundayo, you took up arms against your ruler. The punishment for treason "
"is execution, to be carried out immediately. If you have any last words, I "
"will hear them.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤다요. 너는 통치자를 상대로 무기를 들었다. 반역죄는 즉각 처형이다. 할말이 있다면 들어주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5ccff368-5b53-4211-bc1e-805f8b3c8823"
msgid "Killed Ekun as a warning to everyone else."
msgstr "본보기로 에쿤을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f15eb291-f09e-4967-8bc8-c3722602cb8e"
msgid ""
"\"Die, traitor! Watch and know — this is what becomes of those like him!\""
msgstr "\"배신자는 죽어라! 똑똑히 보아라. 이것이 배신자의 결말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "54740705-f229-4e12-b368-eeab392596c8"
msgid "Took no offense at Ekun's attack."
msgstr "에쿤의 공격에 아무런 반격도 하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "5605b3b6-2165-4249-b294-d803768284bf"
msgid ""
"\"What are you staring at? Get up. Things happen between friends. Just be "
"sure it doesn't happen again...\""
msgstr "\"무얼 보는 거야? 정신 차려. 친구 사이에 그럴 수도 있지. 다시는 이러지 말도록...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9bf77404-246a-4ede-890a-46f43460d742"
msgid "Forgave Ekun his mistake."
msgstr "에쿤의 실수를 용서합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "e7692231-fedb-4363-b653-bf7811a67a8f"
msgid ""
"\"I am sorry it came to this, Ekun. Let's do everything in our power so this "
"never happens again.\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 되어 유감이다. 이런 일이 다시는 일어나지 말도록 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d4df7511-d29a-491a-9751-dc2c30cdf07f"
msgid "[Execute Ekun]"
msgstr "[에쿤을 처형합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "244ff2b9-354c-4b35-9b6f-42b7e1938d45"
msgid "[Cut Ekun's throat]"
msgstr "[에쿤의 목을 벱니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b4d7ecb2-c554-45f7-80f8-856fb996f80b"
msgid ""
"{n}As Ekun is just coming to, he looks at you — vacantly, but expectant.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤이 막 왔을 때 그는 예상했다는 듯 공허하게 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "5d931de9-409f-4650-807f-dfa86ce07eba"
msgid "{n}The ranger chuckles.{/n} \"Been dead a long time.\""
msgstr "{n}레인저는 웃었습니다.{/n} \"오래 전에 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "dcf97118-8309-467c-8eb7-34719e513cd3"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods.{/n} \"You're fair. Glad I knew you. Farewell.\""
msgstr "{n}Ekun이 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"좋다. 너를 알게 되어 기뻤다. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "cb606494-eae3-4d28-8009-9dff736f05f7"
msgid "{n}Ekun's face remains blank.{/n} \"I understand. Do what you must...\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴은 공허함이 남아있습니다.{/n} \"나는 이해한다. 해야겠다면 해라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "3664162d-f99e-4002-9e02-809e2253fd92"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks at you with surprise.{/n} \"I... forgive me, {name}. Lost my "
"head. Won't happen again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 놀람으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"나는... 나를 용서해. {name}. 잠시 혼란스러웠다. 이런 일은 일어나지 않을 "
"거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "55a7e5c9-092b-4575-a9ec-9fad64e54620"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun meets your gaze, then nods.{/n} \"You are very kind. I hope I get a "
"chance to pay you back for this...\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 당신의 눈을 응시하고 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"너는 매우 친절하다. 내가 이 빚을 갚기를 바란다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstEkun/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "36f1e3ef-d085-48e6-bc5f-c037dc0a6dad"
msgid "\"Come talk. When you're in the capital.\""
msgstr "\"이야기해라. 네가 수도에 있을 때.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstGiants/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "be9b74a7-e77b-468b-b2c3-3e69c1288d97"
msgid ""
"{n}Ntavi's face is covered with giants' blood. She licks her lips "
"hungrily.{/n} \"Mmm, what can be sweeter than vengeance... Remember this "
"feeling, Ekun. And when spirits of the dead disturb your peace again, the "
"ever-burning flame in your chest will tell you what to do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Ntavi의 얼굴은 거인의 피로 덮여있습니다. 그녀는 배고픈 듯 입술을 핥았습니다.{/n} \"음. 복수보다 달콤한 것은 없지... "
"이 기분을 느껴봐. 에쿤. 망령이 너의 평화를 다시 괴롭혀서 네 가슴에 불을 지필 때 무엇을 해야 할지 알 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstGiants/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "45589f94-6f45-4033-a7fe-1ce8e45d330a"
msgid ""
"\"I would love to stay... and pay a visit to Elina to teach her to keep her "
"mouth shut... but a priestess of {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} always has "
"things to do. Farewell, Ekun! And don't forget your old friend Ntavi... at "
"least this time.\" {n}Ntavi's low laughter echoes around you, then fades.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"여기에 머물고 싶군... 그리고 엘리나에게 입 다무는 방법도 알려주고... 하지만 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 사제는 "
"바쁘다. 잘있어. 에쿤! 적어도 지금은 나를 잊지마...\" {n}Ntavi의 낮은 웃음 소리가 주변을 울리며 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstGiants/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "ac066fbb-11f0-4f03-b9c4-bc3bb4bd9361"
msgid "\"I didn't know she became a priestess. She's changed.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 여사제가 된 것을 몰랐다. 그녀는 바뀌었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/AfterFight_AgainstGiants/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "7ef6b285-7306-4ddd-8f1f-99a42c7b9e7e"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks exhausted.{/n} \"Thanks for your help, {name}. I feel... "
"better. Let us speak again when we reach the capital.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 지쳐 보입니다.{/n} \"도와줘서 고맙다. {name}. 기분이 한결 나아졌어. 수도에 가면 다시 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Bossfight_GiantLeader_String
msgctxt "2cb019bc-86b7-4547-a04d-c4757feed37e"
msgid "\"Help?! Squish them!\""
msgstr "\"도와달라고?! 엿먹으라 그래!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Ekun_AfterRitualFight_String
msgctxt "6c631840-bd3c-4b14-b98a-7c38f3154d56"
msgid "Ekun looks at the flame silently."
msgstr "에쿤은 조용히 불꽃을 바라봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Elina_AfterRitualFight_String
msgctxt "863fad7f-78fc-4fce-a9f0-062695cbea10"
msgid "\"Thank you, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}...\""
msgstr "\"고맙다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/FightEkun_GiantLeader_String
msgctxt "551ca02d-4e30-4a2f-b72e-05f32b4fc7f2"
msgid ""
"\"Don't just stand there, clods! Hit them while they fight each other!\""
msgstr "\"거기에 서있지만 마! 싸울 때 가서 때리라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Giants1_String
msgctxt "eec88766-22fd-4d03-b099-5de9e0410d36"
msgid "\"I trample you!\""
msgstr "\"짓밟아주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Giants2_String
msgctxt "5fe89421-79c9-4c9d-b754-bd6b5814ddda"
msgid "\"Squish them! Squish them! Squish them!\""
msgstr "\"뭉개버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Giants_String
msgctxt "9f770c4d-bb06-4274-81af-b9af588d2c51"
msgid "\"I smash you into the ground!\""
msgstr "\"내동댕이 쳐주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtaviTavernBarks/NtaviTavernBark1_String
msgctxt "b959c08e-2391-467b-afd4-58123b039e23"
msgid "\"I hope you liked the location I suggested for the party?\""
msgstr "\"네가 제안한 장소를 좋아했으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtaviTavernBarks/NtaviTavernBark2_String
msgctxt "2281044a-cb25-4d6d-839c-0496bfd6e146"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, it's much easier to breathe in the open air than in this... "
"eatery. I have no idea what you're doing here, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 탁 트인 공간에서 먹으니 좋다. 네가 여기에서 뭘 하는지 모르겠군, {mf|영주|영주|왕|왕}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtaviTavernBarks/NtaviTavernBark3_String
msgctxt "80365f73-564f-402e-8c12-431364980443"
msgid ""
"\"If I had such power and influence, I wouldn't waste my time with such "
"shoddy venues.\""
msgstr "\"내가 힘이 있었다면 그런 멍청한 곳에서 시간 낭비하지 않았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtaviTavernBarks/NtaviTavernBark4_String
msgctxt "9169dbfc-fe03-405e-800b-144a01ddcb26"
msgid ""
"\"Unless I was bored and wanted to make a new acquaintance... or rekindle an "
"old flame... or maybe get even with someone.\""
msgstr "\"지루해하거나 새로운 친구를 만들거나 불을 다시 지피거나 누군과 있지만 않다면야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtaviTavernBarks/NtaviTavernBark_String
msgctxt "9e764105-8c39-4111-9150-7aff8c4fb157"
msgid "\"Hello, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/Ntavi_RitualFight_String
msgctxt "3aad7e27-a3b1-41fe-bc8e-33e6be501f21"
msgid "\"Die, wretch...\""
msgstr "\"죽어라. 쓰레기...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtavisThug1_RitualFight_String
msgctxt "3fb8290b-e73f-4071-9179-7b1cd012e379"
msgid "\"Your blood will satiate the Unquenchable Fire!\""
msgstr "\"네 피가 Unenchenchable Fire를 만족시킬 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtavisThug2_RitualFight_String
msgctxt "8ad7deed-4c69-4c3d-ad6c-42079525407f"
msgid "\"The Savored Sting will execute you!\""
msgstr "\"감미로운 독침께서 너를 처형할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Barks/NtavisThug_RitualFight_String
msgctxt "87fca5a2-2607-443a-a8e1-4aabfa10e178"
msgid "\"In the name of the goddess!\""
msgstr "\"여신의 이름으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "167deb6c-ef1a-4a51-8b2c-723cd8ea06ee"
msgid "\"Where have you been all this time?\""
msgstr "\"여태까지 뭐하고 있었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "aeca4516-6a2c-4d40-841d-9318c698a54a"
msgid "\"Elina? How did you get here?\""
msgstr "\"엘리나? 어떻게 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "55f6cafe-6710-46da-9baa-b1e7bb36acb5"
msgid "\"Why did you leave?\""
msgstr "\"왜 떠났어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "61bc2ddb-f50a-4107-8551-609ccbc54aed"
msgid ""
"\"Don't let revenge drive you mad, Ekun. Killing these giants won't bring "
"back your family nor bring peace to your soul. Stop and let us honor the "
"memory of your family as we should... but another day.\""
msgstr ""
"\"복수심에 미치지 마라. 에쿤. 거인을 죽여 봐야 네 가족이 돌아오거나 마음의 평화가 오지 않는다. 다음에 너의 가족을 기리자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3e2c6db6-bb1f-4087-a14f-971b13d5a8a1"
msgid ""
"\"If only blood can douse the fire burning in your heart, I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"피가 네 증오를 식힐 수 있다면 너를 돕겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d4d6d493-a77c-4cbc-ae88-36f6bb37fa27"
msgid ""
"Let Ekun choose between hunting giants and performing a ritual to honor his "
"family."
msgstr "에쿤이 거인을 죽이는 것과 가족을 기리는 의식을 지내는 것 중 하나를 선택하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1e3c8e3b-963d-4cc5-84ae-a20ccfffef6c"
msgid "\"You decide, Ekun. I'll support you either way.\""
msgstr "\"네가 결정해라. 에쿤. 어느 쪽이든 너를 돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "09b5458b-6d51-4b6a-b22a-8e270f0f0999"
msgid ""
"\"Why do we have to choose? First we kill the giants, then honor your family."
"\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리가 선택해야 하지? 거인을 죽이고 너희 가족을 기리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "e35450fe-9d1e-414a-b4ea-99c0146de0b8"
msgid "\"But Kargadd is dead. Isn't that revenge enough, Ekun?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 카르가드는 죽었어. 복수는 끝나지 않았나? 에쿤?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "32449b3e-2910-40aa-92fb-0581b00166e9"
msgid "\"Well, if you must... Take us to the giants' leader, Ekun.\""
msgstr "\"뭐 꼭 그래야겠다면... 우리를 거인 우두머리에게 안내해, 에쿤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "be10d079-26b0-4a70-a5ea-05b5523b398a"
msgid "\"I won't take part in this. You're blinded by your bloodlust.\""
msgstr "\"나는 간섭하지 않겠다. 너는 피의 욕망에 눈이 멀었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "cbacba05-fe13-4064-9cb8-a26b6f2625d7"
msgid "\"Come to your senses, Ekun! What has your life become?\""
msgstr "\"정신 차려. 에쿤! 대체 왜 이러는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "fee2f392-2503-4059-b04d-1b529a0cb994"
msgid "\"Well, if that's what you want, I'll support you.\""
msgstr "\"네 생각이 정 그렇다면. 나는 네 편이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "f7c2afaa-cfe7-49ee-a487-878c0c414e50"
msgid ""
"\"By sparing these giants, you doom dwellers of the nearby villages to death "
"at their hands. Is this what you want?\""
msgstr "\"거인을 죽이지 않으면 근처 마을 사람에게 피해가 갈 거야. 그게 네가 원하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "327d3acd-c9b9-4ebd-a04c-e143dc7eda4e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not participating in any funerals. I have more important things to do."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 장례식에 참석하지 않겠다. 그보다 중요한 할 일이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "826bfb96-c4da-4b69-a005-81e40b347193"
msgid ""
"\"What?! Where are you going? You're insane! This isn't some game! Do you "
"have a death wish?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?! 어디 가는 거야? 미쳤어! 이게 무슨 게임인 줄 알아? 목숨을 내버릴 생각이야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "e4a15071-cb73-4bc1-8b94-87073f7009aa"
msgid "\"Don't listen to her. No one will take your revenge from you.\""
msgstr "\"엘리나의 말은 무시해. 누구도 네게서 복수할 권리를 빼앗을 수는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "1dd0fcbb-03ad-4df7-8f67-6d9603701b84"
msgid ""
"\"Hunting. Killed the first two — the others ran away. But we drove them "
"here again.\""
msgstr "\"사냥. 처음 만난 둘은 죽였고, 나머지는 도망갔다. 하지만 다시 이곳으로 몰 수 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "7bf7229a-68e7-4dcc-b71f-8da7c2d92710"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Ntavi}Ntavi{/d} greets you with a nod.{/n} \"I am glad you decided to "
"join us, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr "{n}{d|Ntavi}은타비{/d}는 당신에게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"우리와 함께 하기로 결정했다니 다행이로군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6e71049c-99f9-4e5b-bdeb-5e7390dd3f40"
msgid "{n}A triumphant smile blooms on Ntavi's face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}은타비의 얼굴에 승리의 미소가 피어납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "426b246a-d4cd-4bd0-81bc-acaa853a62bf"
msgid "\"Oh gods! So much blood! What happened here? Ekun, I was so worried!\""
msgstr "\"세상에! 피 좀 봐! 무슨 일이 있었던 거야? 에쿤, 내가 얼마나 걱정했는지 알아?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "5faed139-0633-473e-a060-a57750ca5ba1"
msgid ""
"{n}Elina wrings her hands.{/n} \"I... I followed you, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! I couldn't wait any longer! I almost "
"decided to come by myself, but then I saw you walking out the city gate.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘리나가 두 손 모아 빕니다.{/n} \"당신을... 따라온 거예요! 더 이상 기다릴 수가 없어서 혼자 나서려다가, 당신이 도시 "
"관문으로 향하는 모습을 봤죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "2c88b4f1-2afd-4cb9-8c9e-ef3e2b8c1f6e"
msgid ""
"\"Ekun! In the name of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, stop! I can't imagine how "
"bitter you must feel now... but you can't wash away your grief with blood!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에쿤! {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g} 님의 이름으로 이렇게 빌게. 제발 그만둬! 네가 어떤 기분일지 나는 모르지만... 피를 "
"본다고 슬픔이 가시진 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "b9e97edc-ad92-4bfc-9d69-afde39965948"
msgid ""
"\"You have to say farewell to your family. Honor their memory — and let the "
"gods have mercy on their souls. Only then you will be able to start a new "
"life!\" {n}Elina gulps nervously and looks at everyone present.{/n} \"Please"
"... let's all go home?\""
msgstr ""
"\"가족에게 작별인사를 해. 그들의 넋을 기리고 신이 자비를 베풀게 둬. 그래야 내일을 살아갈 수 있어!\" {n}엘리나는 불안하게 침을 "
"삼키며 모두를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"제발... 모두 집에 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "d7e64f1d-393f-4d88-b69c-97adfd97654e"
msgid ""
"\"We can't waste time, the giants could escape again. We need to finish what "
"we started.\""
msgstr "\"시간 낭비할 수 없다. 거인이 도망칠 수 있어. 이번 일을 제대로 마무리 짓자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "01f5b59a-ecc7-4135-ae6c-293fa8b0f8aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stares into your face for a long while... then his head dips, "
"defeated.{/n} \"I give death to monsters... and they steal my life — day by "
"day, week by week. It's time to put an end to this... And bury my family.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 오랫동안 당신을 응시하다가 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"나는 괴물을 죽이고, 괴물은 내 삶의 일부를 앗아간다. 그렇게 날마다 "
"조금씩, 수개월이 지났지... 이 지긋지긋한 굴레를 끊어내야 해. 가족을 보내줘야 하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0022_Text_String
msgctxt "c2f01bb2-26e9-4200-8b81-a9f0106bb298"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's voice is resolute and firm.{/n} \"The hunt must go on. Always. "
"Forever. While I sit idle, I will know no peace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 목소리는 단호하고 확고합니다.{/n} \"사냥은 계속되어야 해. 내 목숨이 다하는 순간까지. 아무것도 하지 않고서는 마음의 "
"평화를 되찾을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "fcad81a5-46f2-4626-87ba-65b1c97bf9b8"
msgid ""
"\"To pay for blood with blood. The ghosts of murdered innocents scream for "
"justice — fate itself has destined Ekun to be an avenger.\""
msgstr "\"피는 피로 갚아야 해. 희생자들은 정의가 구현되길 바라. 에쿤은 복수의 길을 따를 운명이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "9b2cf6d0-42b7-46bb-8e78-f4514597ee94"
msgid ""
"\"What?! What are you saying?! I knew it was you pouring poison into Ekun's "
"ears!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 이상한 소리 마! 또 에쿤의 마음을 어지럽히려는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "944719dc-06ae-4dcf-a6b0-f0199c98d204"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun furrows his forehead, the wrinkle between his brows growing deeper "
"and deeper.{/n} \"I... don't know.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 이마와 미간에 깊은 골이 생깁니다.{/n} \"나는... 모르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "826faa7a-7f59-421d-867b-dcfc4f0364f3"
msgid "{n}Ekun shakes his head.{/n} \"Never. It will never be enough.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"안 돼. 이 슬픔은 무엇으로도 치유할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "c8dfe442-440c-433c-b552-60a2a57fa16c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's voice is resolute and firm.{/n} \"No. I have nothing to bury... "
"and no reason to. My heart can't be calmed by words and rites. The hunt must "
"go on.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 목소리는 단호하고 확고합니다.{/n} \"아니. 난 가족을 묘지에 묻지 않겠어. 의식이나 위로의 말에 안주할 수 없다. "
"사냥은 계속되어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "8ec52752-9cab-4402-847c-ce70cfda74b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Cold fury can be heard in Ntavi's voice.{/n} \"Well... everything is "
"clear. In this case I got nothing more to lose here. Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}은타비의 목소리에 차가운 분노가 서려있습니다.{/n} \"그래... 더 따지고 들 것도 없지. 기회를 잃는 건 내 쪽이 아니니. "
"작별이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Elina
msgctxt "5e6af989-42da-42d6-b17e-702104b376b8"
msgid "\"Oh, Ekun...\""
msgstr "\"오. 에쿤...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "5829b1f8-2cc6-4e1a-92b0-f7e92c1a6b72"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face breaks into a snarl.{/n} \"Enough! Who are you to judge me?!\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴이 분노로 일그러집니다.{/n} \"그만! 네가 뭔데 날 평가하는가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "dec40533-cea7-4cd2-92db-d8781bcd063d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun is silent for a few moments, as if gathering his strength. Finally "
"he nods and looks up at you.{/n} \"It is decided. I know what to do. Come "
"where we met first. It is... an important place. Good for farewells.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 기운을 내려는 듯 잠시 침묵합니다. 마침내 고개를 끄덕이며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"결심은 예전에 섰다. 나는 해야 할 "
"일을 알아. 우리가 처음 만난 곳으로 와라. 내게... 의미 있는 장소다. 이별하기 좋은 곳이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "e16f7010-8bc7-4a7e-8e21-48ce29c9c676"
msgid ""
"\"No. But let someone else kill them... I will become a monster myself if I "
"don't stop.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 다른 이가 그들을 죽이게 놔둬... 여기서 멈추지 않으면 내가 괴물이 될 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "3fe1cc90-1dcf-464e-b91c-986f9415aa84"
msgid ""
"\"This saddens me. But it's your right. Go, kill the giants. It doesn't "
"matter to me.\""
msgstr "\"슬프군. 허나 네게도 권리가 있지. 가서 거인을 죽여라. 나는 신경 쓰지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "eb8bdc13-6d59-4471-8cf2-a70504f41c2e"
msgid "{n}Ntavi's eyes flare with malicious fire.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}은타비의 눈은 악의로 불타오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ad9a4363-5169-4a76-92db-13921106b916"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar grins from ear to ear.{/n} \"Well, we can't leave all the fun "
"for you two!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르의 웃음이 귀에 걸립니다.{/n} \"너희 둘만 재미 보게 둘 순 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ce0c4efc-ae50-4bf8-8911-a31a8298a5a4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sizes Elina up like it's the first time she's taken a good look "
"at her.{/n} \"You brought yourself to leave the city? For him?\" {n}Then she "
"turns around and examines Ekun with the same fascinated look.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 처음으로 엘리나를 눈여겨봅니다.{/n} \"혼자서 도시를 떠나온 겁니까? 에쿤을 위해?\" {n}발레리의 시선이 에쿤에게로 "
"옮겨갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cbc411ee-4779-4905-8ff6-18ee35d2b5a5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Elina! You could have been robbed! Or eaten by monsters! Or both at "
"the same time... not that the difference would matter. Why take such a risk?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"엘리나! 강도라도 당하면 어쩌려고! 괴물한테 먹혔을 수도 있고! 둘 다였을 수도 있어... 왜 이런 위험한 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eb3b4a95-d262-4914-8463-b781a4b147af"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia bites her lips.{/n} \"I understand what moves you, Ekun... "
"{g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} as my witness, I'd hunt the {g|Technic League}"
"Technic League{/g} for my entire life... but that's not really life. It's a "
"curse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"네가 왜 그랬는지 이해해, 에쿤... 나라도 목숨을 바쳐 {g|Technic League}"
"기술 연맹{/g}을 사냥하고 싶을 거야... 하지만 그런 삶은 인생보다는 저주에 가까워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a3e1d49a-2f0b-4284-89e1-217304aa3ba5"
msgid ""
"\"What can a city wench know of lives like ours? Ntavi's right: for each "
"drop of your blood they shed, you gotta take three times that from them!\""
msgstr "\"도시 사람이 우리 입장을 어떻게 알아? 은타비 말이 맞아. 우리가 흘린 피에 세 배만큼 쳐서 적에게 갚아주면 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "821d688f-33f4-4426-a565-6a75c974b053"
msgid "\"The words of a true savage, no less.\""
msgstr "\"야만인이 할 법한 말이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_13_outcome1q2_Text
msgctxt "1f997ada-ff01-4919-8048-2ce060071340"
msgid "{n}Ekun is so tired he looks barely able to speak.{/n} \"{name}\"."
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 너무 피곤해서 말을 하기 어려워 보입니다.{/n} \"{name}\"."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_1_outcome2q2_Text
msgctxt "36c4e189-bd42-4dbf-8fbc-2743354ceaf0"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun frowns and looks away.{/n} \"I have to go. Their leader's there.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 눈살을 찌푸리고 먼 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 가야 해. 우두머리가 그곳에 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ekun_Ntavi_Elina_Standoff/Cue_33_NotFinished_Text
msgctxt "1b5366d3-9108-47c7-8848-144141ff9f9b"
msgid "{n}Ekun wipes sweat from his brow and stares at you.{/n} \"{name}\"."
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 이마에서 땀을 훔쳐내며 당신을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"{name}\"."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Items/EkunQ2_rewardArmor_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "ca223b36-0128-4933-b5f5-263599e66ea5"
msgid ""
"This +5 leather armor allows its wearer to cast divine favor 3 times per day "
"as a 9th-level cleric."
msgstr "이 +5 가죽갑옷은 착용자가 9 레벨 성직자로 하루에 세 번 신의 은사를 행사할 수 있게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Items/EkunQ2_rewardArmor_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "41bdd7e6-1c9c-4233-a157-e1e9c6f2f956"
msgid "Wayfarer's Comfort"
msgstr "여행자의 위로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Items/EkunQ2_rewardArmor_m_FlavorText
msgctxt "d9a3f193-34ab-4b5a-871e-62877dc6d53c"
msgid ""
"This comfortable doublet is made of soft but surprisingly durable leather. "
"Its warm quilted underlay is embroidered with a flowery pattern that forms "
"the words \"Take care.\""
msgstr ""
"이 편안한 겹옷은 부드럽지만 놀랍도록 내구성이 뛰어난 가죽으로 만들어졌습니다. 따뜻한 퀼트 문양이 \"편안히 쉬기를\"이라는 꽃무늬 "
"글씨와 함께 쓰여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Items/EkunQ2_rewardBow_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "a4c4cea5-3592-4297-aaeb-545d0425bd40"
msgid "+4 Giant Bane Flaming Composite Longbow"
msgstr "+4 골칫거리 거인의 불타는 콤포짓 보우"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Items/EkunQ2_rewardBow_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "e4368342-c439-4df8-8394-43ae4fd3a968"
msgid "Downfall"
msgstr "몰락"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Items/EkunQ2_rewardBow_m_FlavorText
msgctxt "a29cae45-05f3-4f7a-adb2-0d2db8364d77"
msgid ""
"This bow was crafted by the hands of a man who loves to create but has sworn "
"to destroy. Its smooth surface lacks any words or adornments. This is a tool "
"of endless vengeance — and, like its creator, it's destined to kill monsters "
"until it breaks."
msgstr ""
"이 활은 창조를 좋아하지만 파괴하겠다고 맹세한 장인에 의해 만들어졌습니다. 표면은 장식이 없이 수수합니다. 이것은 끝 없는 복수를 "
"만들어내었고 이 활의 제작자도 복수를 당할 때까지 괴물을 죽이게 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "2f8979f8-7a93-4783-a032-3a41bff93f61"
msgid "\"I hope she didn't ruin the day for you.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 너를 위한 그날을 망치지 않았다면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a426150d-78a2-41f1-806c-1657993bbb6f"
msgid "\"Don't mention it. Well, I won't bother you anymore...\""
msgstr "\"말하지 마. 이제 더 이상 너를 괴롭히지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "67e2ae6f-97a9-4c82-876d-c36aa5b957c7"
msgid "\"It's better than standing quiet, doing nothing.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 안하는 것 보다 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2f7a8279-4f48-448f-a764-3de0f09cb944"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't know Ntavi became a priestess. She changed a lot...\" {n}Ekun "
"frowns and wipes his brow.{/n} \"Thanks for the help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"은타비가 사제가 된 줄은 몰랐다. 많이 변했어...\" {n}에쿤은 찡그리고 이마의 땀을 닦습니다.{/n} \"도와줘서 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "690d2be9-a948-4171-b18a-5668a62e9f01"
msgid ""
"\"This wasn't needed. But we couldn't stop it.\" {n}Ekun winces.{/n} \"Come "
"talk to me in a few days. I need to speak to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"필요치 않았다. 하지만 우리는 멈출 수 없었다.\" {n}에쿤은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"며칠 후에 나에게 이야기해라. 너에게 할 말이 "
"있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "6cc279a8-e7d9-4779-87e3-342d65951bd3"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks away, feigning indifference.{/n} \"Come talk to me in a few "
"days. I need to speak to you.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 먼 곳을 보며 무관심한 척합니다.{/n} \"며칠 후에 나에게 이야기해라. 너에게 할 말이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/AfterFightWith_VengefulNtavi/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "84803ac7-2c27-4658-8771-05aa6617f3c1"
msgid "\"Come talk to me in a few days. I need to speak to you.\""
msgstr "\"며칠 후에 나에게 이야기해라. 너에게 할 말이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Barks/Ekun_Ritual_01_String
msgctxt "3e876045-57d6-42b4-a832-3fb6700b2d02"
msgid ""
"\"I was a father and a husband. I did everything in my power... and failed "
"to protect you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아버지이자 남편이었다. 나는 최선을 다했지만... 너를 보호하지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Barks/Ekun_Ritual_02_String
msgctxt "f73822a7-75de-44e9-aa71-f3bd1e9f1109"
msgid "\"I can't fix this. But I can keep others from such a loss.\""
msgstr "\"되둘릴 수 없지만 다른 사람을 보호할 수는 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Barks/Ekun_Ritual_03_String
msgctxt "9e1b3531-e1a6-430d-ba72-f7620c727220"
msgid ""
"\"Someday, my hands will fail to draw my bow... and we'll be together "
"again...\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 활을 쥐지 못하면... 그 때는 다시 만나기를...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Barks/Ekun_Ritual_04_String
msgctxt "f69c26df-6de6-4e8d-8443-7266aba38a3f"
msgid "\"Until then, my place is here.\""
msgstr "\"그때까지 내가 있을 곳은 여기다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Barks/Ekun_Ritual_05_String
msgctxt "f16d2f9a-9b9c-4f9c-b223-5c5f29d6d099"
msgid "\"Rest in peace.\""
msgstr "\"편히 잠들어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0d95c828-97f9-4189-b761-63b8ee37016a"
msgid "Reassured Ekun about taking part in the ritual."
msgstr "에쿤에게 의식을 시행하는 것에 대해 안심의 말을 전합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "fda245c6-2274-4b44-8ed6-cabcf1ed5c52"
msgid "\"How could I not?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그렇지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "41d3b6a4-40ee-4478-9718-feebcab8e67e"
msgid "Came to the funeral to honor the tradition."
msgstr "전통을 존중하는 장례식에 왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3249cac5-8c9b-43a5-a573-80e6f936f62f"
msgid "\"I'm not one to break tradition.\""
msgstr "\"나는 전통을 존중한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dbf243e1-a6ae-405e-a712-f1314dd3afe8"
msgid "Rudely hurried Ekun to get on with the funeral."
msgstr "장례식을 어서 진행하라고 에쿤을 다그칩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ef13afd8-1d34-4f68-ae09-521650cc8751"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know what I'm doing here... Let's get this over with quickly.\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜 여기에 와서... 어서 끝내자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6d38813c-18ed-44af-84b2-7817a944df7b"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods at you. His face is softer and at the same time, more resolute "
"than usual.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 당신에게 끄덕입니다. 그의 얼굴은 부드러워지고 때때로 평소보다 단호합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ec327eed-3e87-4d56-b29c-a63c06864f28"
msgid "{n}Octavia looks at Ekun, biting her lip.{/n} \"My condolences...\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 에쿤을 보고는 입술을 물었습니다.{/n} \"힘내...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5de4787f-7f96-42a2-a20f-1dc33f9c126c"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost opens his mouth for a moment, raises his finger... But then only "
"sighs, nodding silently to Ekun.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 입을 열어 무언가를 말하려나 한숨만 쉬고는 에쿤에게 말 없이 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "725e7d69-e82c-4ef6-8bee-852f2b8ec65e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles sadly at Ekun, then speaks, his voice warm.{/n} \"The "
"darkest hours are before the sunrise. Hold on. Trust me, you will feel "
"better.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 에쿤에게 슬픈 미소를 짓고 따뜻한 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"가장 어두운 시간은 해돋이 전이다. 버티고 날 믿으면 "
"기분이 괜찮아질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "81d30a56-1cfe-434d-af6d-8ba59cf1684b"
msgid "{n}Jaethal looks around silently, her eyes avoiding Ekun.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 에쿤의 시선을 회피하면서 주위를 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e0432946-5c4e-437b-8172-3df91dcf104f"
msgid "{n}Nodding gratefully, Ekun steps aside.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고개를 끄덕이며 에쿤은 옆으로 물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "43d1d9ce-28e7-4231-92b1-fb949ca8005f"
msgid "{n}Shaking his head and sighing heavily, Ekun looks away from you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}머리를 흔들고 깊은 한숨을 쉬며 에쿤은 당신을 향한 시선을 거둡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9bbbfce7-4928-4636-9e6d-d65a9551296d"
msgid ""
"{n}The ranger's dark eyes are directed your way.{/n}\"You've come. Thank you."
"\""
msgstr "{n}레인저의 검은 눈은 당신 쪽을 봅니다.{/n} \"왔군. 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/EkunElina_Ritual/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "04e6f0a2-80be-4588-bfeb-429a99eb6a34"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi hides her eyes, enough to conceal tears — but her voice breaks.{/n} "
"\"W-we are with you, friend.\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 고개를 숙여 눈물을 숨기려 하지만 목소리는 울음이 섞여있습니다.{/n} \"우린 함께잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d5fb5adb-2093-469a-b7e6-4b94532b6376"
msgid "Ordered Ntavi to surrender."
msgstr "은타비에게 항복하라고 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f1b34011-823d-412d-9862-9cb663c11f25"
msgid "\"Lay down your weapon, Ntavi. That is an order.\""
msgstr "\"무기를 버려라. 은타비. 명령이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b0ed66b6-d76b-4243-8ee4-e011d6ddcb05"
msgid "Tried to persuade Ntavi and Ekun to reach an agreement."
msgstr "은타비와 에쿤이 합의를 하도록 설득을 시도합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "718828e7-66a7-4e1f-904b-301cd2d76a9e"
msgid ""
"\"Don't draw your swords yet. I'm convinced we can come to an agreement.\""
msgstr "\"아직 무기를 들지 말아라. 우리는 화해할 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "80408377-9cda-4357-a5a3-ffcaa19e7840"
msgid "Expressed joy when the funeral became a fight."
msgstr "장례식이 싸움으로 번지는 것을 보고 기뻐합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f2ce6d05-90b0-40bc-b014-57b58ba561ae"
msgid "\"Finally. I was afraid I'd die of boredom.\""
msgstr "\"마침내. 나는 지루한 장례식이 싫어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "6090d050-ae2d-43b1-9908-ed99bb0d0190"
msgid ""
"{n}Ntavi grins ominously, reflections of the fire dancing in her eyes.{/n} "
"\"Here I am. Did you miss me?\""
msgstr "{n}은타비는 불길한 미소를 짓고 ,그녀의 눈에는 불이 일렁입니다.{/n} \"나 여기 있어. 내가 그리웠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "1028bc9e-ee93-4f09-b983-ce5fdca25624"
msgid "\"Why are you here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "eb7dee9b-5c2b-41ab-a1d1-df9301b834ae"
msgid ""
"\"After hunting, Elina dared to raise her voice at me. And insulting a "
"{g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} priestess is a sin that can only be washed away "
"with blood.\" {n}Ntavi's voice rings through the woods.{/n} \"Out of my way."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"사냥이 끝나자 엘리나는 나에게 목소리를 높였다. {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 여사제를 모욕하는 죄는 피로 씻어야 "
"마땅하다.\" {n}은타비의 목소리가 숲을 울립니다.{/n} \"비켜라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "d32c1684-8c47-4b9d-9602-0e05c20d3aba"
msgid "{n}Ekun's eyes narrow.{/n} \"No.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 눈이 좁아집니다.{/n} \"아니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "2503176b-8f6f-4141-9692-80ce315be9cf"
msgid "{n}Ntavi spits at your feet.{/n} \"Come and get it!\""
msgstr "{n}은타비는 당신의 발에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"와서 가져가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "61f6e91a-2bad-4704-8817-321c53f6bda5"
msgid "{n}Ntavi laughs .{/n} \"Coward... It'll be a pleasure to kill you.\""
msgstr "{n}은타비가 웃습니다.{/n} \"겁쟁이... 너를 죽이는 것이 즐겁겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "a861dbdc-6bb2-4a3b-b4fd-b803391e634c"
msgid "{n}Ntavi looks you in the eyes and smirks.{/n} \"Shall we dance?\""
msgstr "{n}은타비가 당신의 눈을 바라보며 빙그레 웃습니다.{/n} \"춤출까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : EkunQ1_Ntavi
msgctxt "6956be06-d9db-47f0-89b7-9e099f438862"
msgid ""
"\"I knew you'd say that. And you showed such promise! What is this world "
"coming to when the sacred flame of vengeance can't be lit, even in a warrior "
"who lost his family... milk runs through your veins, not blood. I was wrong "
"about you. Well... I promised you to the goddess, and she will get you. But "
"as a sacrifice, not a weapon of vengeance...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 그렇게 말할 줄 알았어. 그런 약속을 하다니! 전사의 가슴에서 복수의 불꽃이 사그라들다니... 피가 아니라 우유가 몸 속에 "
"흐르나 보군. 내가 너를 잘못봤다. 맹세하건데 여신께서 너를 잡아갈 것이다. 복수가 아니라 희생의 제물로서 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3c1cb581-8fa7-49fb-bdf9-d90160fd8a00"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's face doesn't change, but he takes a tiny step towards Elina, "
"as though to stand between her and Ntavi.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안의 얼굴은 무표정하지만 그는 은타비에서부터 엘리나에게 조금 다가섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c5a23a56-d655-44f3-87ee-f8db73724dd7"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim lets out a dark chuckle.{/n} \"What would your giddy goddess know "
"of sacrifice, hmm? We are all doomed to be sacrificed upon the altar of "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}... but it seems you will have to wait for that time "
"in the {g|Boneyard}Boneyard{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 으스스하게 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n} \"너의 여신이 희생에 대해 뭘 안다고 그래? 우리는 결국 모두 "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 제단의 희생물이 될 것이다... 하지만 너는 그 때까지 {g|Boneyard}뼈무덤{/g}에서 "
"썩어야겠다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Ekun/Q2_Burying_The_Past/Ritual/Vengeful_Ntavi/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f58a8696-6e35-4641-bf0e-626876379e04"
msgid "\"I'm so tired of all this yakking.\" {n}Amiri grips her sword.{/n}"
msgstr "\"나는 주절거리는 것도 지쳤어.\" {n}아미리가 검을 잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q1_The_Unwanted_Legacy/Item/Anvil_heart_description_String
msgctxt "8ccfc392-9901-40cc-9dec-b600422dae82"
msgid ""
"A mysterious magic jewel, found among the pieces of the dwarven anvil that "
"Harrim destroyed."
msgstr "하림이 파괴한 드워프의 모루가 조각이 되었고 그 사이에서 이 신비한 마법 보석이 발견되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q1_The_Unwanted_Legacy/Item/Anvil_heart_name_String
msgctxt "530f8f22-c093-447e-aec0-7a7a6a6d97d6"
msgid "Heart of the Anvil"
msgstr "모루의 심장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_hi_again_1_String
msgctxt "3da0f984-9e10-4dfc-81ea-4e73ae90b9f4"
msgid "\"Why is everything so complicated?!\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 복잡해?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_hi_again_2_String
msgctxt "15b44874-2018-46c5-9dab-be963b5d4d66"
msgid "\"Today we will definitely get inside! Or tomorrow at the latest!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 우리는 안에 들어갈 것이다! 적어도 내일까지는 들어간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_hi_again_3_String
msgctxt "b54ea761-0312-4b44-86c2-13a64f4c16e3"
msgid "\"Why did our ancestors build so many locks and traps?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리 조상들은 그렇게 많은 자물쇠와 함정을 만들었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_hi_again_4_String
msgctxt "bdcd4ca1-5ca5-4297-a9ac-afc6eda8a0a7"
msgid "\"I miss the mountains back home...\""
msgstr "\"산이 집으로 돌아가는 걸 다시 보고 싶다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_hi_again_5_String
msgctxt "434efafe-b25e-4cc2-a27d-7612ab5719ce"
msgid "\"I hope whatever we find in the fortress is worth all this trouble!\""
msgstr "\"요새에서 발견한 것으로 문제를 해결하면 좋겠는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_on_hill_1_String
msgctxt "ad77ca70-6808-405b-bc7a-aa192a8ec54f"
msgid "\"Look, look! Help has arrived! Hurrah!\""
msgstr "\"봐! 우리를 도와주러 왔어! 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_on_hill_2_String
msgctxt "bb0673f2-8bbe-4bde-832c-3d073d720b73"
msgid "\"Praise Torag!\""
msgstr "\"토락을 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_on_hill_3_String
msgctxt "0626c50b-9932-43b7-baf8-40278514491c"
msgid "\"Serves him right! Destroy that monster!\""
msgstr "\"그를 보호해! 괴물을 파괴하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_on_hill_4_String
msgctxt "018e1501-1f5a-4105-826c-9e43be3648fc"
msgid "\"Hail to {mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"{Name} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Dwarf_on_hill_5_String
msgctxt "13dedbcc-892e-441b-a562-4b22262e4d1a"
msgid "\"Saved! We were so nearly done for!\""
msgstr "\"살았다! 이제 다 끝난줄 알았는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Barks/Rudrin_hi_again_1_String
msgctxt "490aa5e2-c487-4bb1-b42c-f8b5540dcb14"
msgid "\"Our clan owes you!\""
msgstr "\"우리 클랜이 네게 빚졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "1a08649f-db7e-4dec-bf9a-d4111994189e"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "837c248a-5f99-4090-8e10-ff0353b648ad"
msgid "\"Harrim, you've broken metal with your bare hands before!\""
msgstr "\"하림. 전에 너는 맨손으로 금속을 깨뜨렸어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "b862bbfc-9ef3-40c9-b905-aadbdd270da0"
msgid "\"Anyway, are you safe now?\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든. 이제 안전한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "fc93c577-2d1c-426c-9459-6bb310a0c8e5"
msgid ""
"\"Jarmuld, what are you talking about? What power hides inside Harrim?\""
msgstr "\"야르물드, 무슨 소리야? 하림에게 숨겨진 힘이라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "90f8e793-2672-4f8c-9800-04dbab684cd3"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, his words make sense. Maybe what you thought was Torag's curse was "
"actually a gift from the gods, which your kin simply couldn't understand?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하림. 그의 말이 일리가 있어. 토락의 저주는 실제로는 신들의 준 재능이었고, 너의 친구들이 단순히 이해하지 못한게 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "1d1918c1-f893-4ee9-ad5b-ebfb936977d6"
msgid "\"How can you prove your words?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 증명할 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5586bcb9-ef73-4f62-bb78-bbd41b08331e"
msgid ""
"[Give Harrim the heart of the anvil] \"If these are Torag's things, give "
"them to his servant.\""
msgstr "[하림에게 모루의 심장을 줍니다] \"이것이 토락의 것이라면 그들의 종에게 줘버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "c88c4b68-6260-4c42-8f57-615c5ad7fbe3"
msgid "\"If it's a gift from Torag, then give it to his servant.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 토락의 것이라면 그들의 종에게 줘버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "51c9cc86-1724-49ea-b015-f0950118f230"
msgid "\"You owe nothing to anyone. Especially to Torag and his servants.\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구에게도 빚이 없어. 토락과 그의 종들에게는 더욱.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b3abd854-27e2-4bfb-b2ec-466c23fcd9f3"
msgid ""
"{n}The golem freezes. Inside it, something vibrates in harmony, and the "
"dents left by your weapons quickly repair. Harrim approaches the metal "
"monster and examines it from head to toe.{/n} \"An invincible idol made of "
"indestructible metal... Another proof of our empty pride. Every master "
"wishes to create something that will outlive them – but why? So that their "
"creation will live on a short while, before returning to dust with the rest "
"of the universe? Ha! Masters, masters... \""
msgstr ""
"{n}골렘이 움직임을 멈춥니다. 내부에서 무언가가 조화롭게 진동하기 시작하자 우리가 입힌 상처들이 빠르게 사라져갑니다. 하림이 금속 "
"괴물에게 다가가서 위아래로 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"불멸의 금속으로 만들어진 무적의 동상... 우리 종족의 공허한 자부심에 대한 또다른 "
"증거로다. 모든 장인들은 영원히 남을 창조물을 만들길 원하지만... 무엇을 위해 그런단 말인가? 어차피 존재란 찰나에 불과한 것을... "
"하! 장인들이란...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0af4a069-b272-4d09-b90f-8703fdf8a6df"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim pulls the key. To his surprise, the whole lock comes out of the "
"golem's body along with the key. As Harrim stands amazed, the monster falls "
"to pieces, as if it were made not of the strongest metal in the world, but "
"of rotten wood.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림이 열쇠를 잡아당기자, 열쇠가 꼽힌 자물쇠가 골렘의 몸체에서 통째로 뽑혀 나옵니다. 하림은 놀라서 그 자리에 멈춰 섰지만, "
"골렘은 세상에서 가장 단단한 금속이 아닌, 썩은 나무로 만든 인형처럼 조각나 쓰러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "14c07ccc-0bcd-41f4-9d0a-c2b6cf675783"
msgid ""
"{n}One of the dwarves, clearly their leader – a grey-haired man with a "
"massive symbol of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} around his neck – jumps down from the "
"hillock where the dwarves climbed to escape the golem. He looks at Harrim "
"and what he's done, astounded.{/n} \"How? How did you do it? That's "
"impossible. Impossible!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}목에 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 거대한 상징을 두른 회색머리의 지도자 드워프가 골렘에게서 벗어나기 위해 올라갔던 언덕에서 뛰어 "
"내립니다. 그는 하림과 그가 한 일을 보곤 놀라움을 금치 못했습니다.{/n} \"어떻게? 어떻게 한거지? 이건 불가능해. 불가능하다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "414554fa-8967-43bb-8aad-0b59aa804852"
msgid "\"I don't know! I don't!\""
msgstr "\"나는 모른다! 모른다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "e7486254-98ba-4637-91b6-bef30047cf2c"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf turns to you and bows ceremoniously.{/n} \"Forgive me, {mf|Your "
"Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! The surprise made me lose all "
"my manners... My name is Jarmuld Skjegge, paladin of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} and "
"the leader of this group. On behalf of our whole clan, I thank you for your "
"help!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 당신에게 격식을 차려 인사합니다.{/n} \"용서하십시오,  {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 너무 놀라 경황이 "
"없었군요. 저는 야르물드 셰게, {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 팔라딘이자 이 그룹의 대장입니다. 일족 전체를 대신하여 당신의 도움에 "
"감사드립니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3e45de9d-afad-4057-82c8-c4de1f1bedb8"
msgid ""
"\"What? When did that happen, {Name}? Ah, wait... Are you talking about the "
"anvil? Yes, I did do that... But why? I asked {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} what it "
"meant, but received no answer...\" {n}Harrim pensively wraps his beard "
"around his finger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 언제 그랬지? {Name}? 혹시... 그 모루 말하는 건가? 그래. 내가 그랬지... 하지만 왜? 나는 "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에게 그것이 의미하는 바를 물었지만 아무런 답을 듣지 못했다... \" {n}하림은 깊은 생각에 잠긴 "
"채 그의 수염을 손가락으로 꼬으고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "e8c3166e-a6c1-40ea-946a-d6da37c17b7f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! May "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} bless the soil you walk upon! You saved us! The Skjegge "
"clan is in your debt! Alas, we have no treasure to reward you for your kind "
"aid... But that is only temporary, believe me! When we find a way inside the "
"fortress and recover the legacy of our ancestors, you'll see that no one can "
"accuse the Skjegge clan of stinginess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"예, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!  {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 당신이 걷는 땅에 축복을 하시길! 당신이 우리를 구했습니다! "
"셰게 가문은 당신에게 빚을 졌습니다! 우리는 당신의 친절한 조력에 보답할게 없지만... 그건 오직 일시적인 일입니다. 절 믿으세요! "
"우리가요새 안으로 들어가는 길을 찾고 우리 조상님들의 유산을 회복한다면 누구도 우리 부족을 무시하지 못하게 될 걸 보시게 될겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "89300fe9-ed8d-402a-bace-15e73f9fabdc"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim sneers bitterly.{/n} \"Look at them, {Name}! Here they are, true "
"children of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}! Greedy, conceited, unable to see beyond "
"their own noses! They barely escaped death, and there they are, diving into "
"its maw again, blinded by the glitter of imaginary treasures... I "
"contemplated making them leave, but let us allow them to stay and continue "
"what they are doing. If they are in such a hurry to dig their own graves, "
"let us not interfere.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 씁쓸하게 조소합니다.{/n} \"저들 좀 봐라! {Name}! {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 참된 자녀로구만! 탐욕스럽고 "
"자만심에 눈이 먼 자들이야! 죽음을 가까스로 피했지만 환상의 보물에 눈이 멀어 다시 짐승의 아가리 속으로 뛰어드는군... 그들을 떠나게 "
"하려고 궁리했지만 그들을 여기 있도록 허락하고 하는 것을 지켜 보자고. 제 무덤을 판다면 내버려두자구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "1c08a15f-8711-4a7b-892c-cbc2bb00c08a"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I see you've no love for your people or our god... No, no, "
"don't be so quick to frown – I've no wish to preach to you. But... I believe "
"you said you broke the unbreakable with your bare hands? Please tell me "
"about this. I think I've an idea of what power lies within you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고맙다. 너는 우리나 우리 신에게 아무런 애정이 없는 줄 알았는데... 아, 아니야, 그렇게 빨리 얼굴 찌푸리지 말라고. 난 너에게 "
"설교할 생각은 아니었으니까. 하지만 네가 말하길 네가 맨손으로 부술수 없는 것들을 부순다 했지? 부디 이것에 대해 이야기를해주겠나. 내 "
"생각에 네 안에 있는 힘이 어떠한 것인지 알 것도 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "57309832-472a-4fd8-8577-0455355f9b68"
msgid ""
"\"The Searing Palm.\" {n}Harrim's voice sounds dull and lifeless.{/n} \"The "
"magic anvil in the desolate {g|Bronzeshield Fortress}Bronzeshield "
"Fortress{/g}, desecrated by trolls. It was destroyed by my fist, as if it "
"were made of sand – or wood that had rotted from within, and only waited to "
"be touched to fall to dust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타오르는 손바닥이라 하네.\" {n}하림의 목소리는 약하고 생기가 없습니다.{/n} \"트롤들이 더럽힌, 버려진 {g|"
"Bronzeshield Fortress}청동 방패 요새{/g}의 마법 모루 말일세. 내 주먹이 닿자마자, 모래로 만든 성처럼, 속이 썩어 "
"문드러진 나무처럼 부서졌지. 마치 스러져 먼지로 돌아가길 기다렸다는 듯이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "09133720-49cd-4a4d-8cd9-83d56257752d"
msgid ""
"{n}Jarmuld pensively holds his hand upon {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} hammer, which "
"hangs about his neck.{/n} \"Could it be...\""
msgstr "{n}야르물드는 조심스럽게 목에 걸린 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 망치를 잡습니다.{/n} \"그럴 수...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "3cbb795f-6635-41e8-8b7c-a794aedfe144"
msgid ""
"\"The Touch of the Unmaker. This is a rare, very rare gift of the gods. It "
"happens once in a generation. I can't say who grants it. Perhaps "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}. Perhaps {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. Or perhaps it comes from "
"some other source we know nothing about... It is the power to give death to "
"things which live on beyond their proper time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"파괴자(the Unmaker)의 손길. 이건 드문, 매우 드문 신들이 내린 선물이다. 한 세대에 한 명 나올까 말까하는 재능이지. 난 "
"누가 이 능력을 준 것인지는 말할 수 없어. {g|Torag}토락{/g}일 수도 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}일 수도 있다. 아니면 "
"우리가 알지 못하는 다른 근원에서 온 것일 수도 있다. 이 힘은 적당한 수명을 넘어 살아온 것들에게 죽음을 줄 수 있는 힘이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "d38aad76-095e-45f5-bb2e-795688903f78"
msgid ""
"\"Ill things, created with a flaw – like this golem. Desecrated, like the "
"anvil. The robust creations of dwarven hands, that beg for death but must "
"continue to exist. A dwarf blessed by the Touch of the Unmaker can put an "
"end to their suffering.\""
msgstr ""
"\"병든 것들, 이런 결함을 가지고 창조된 것들.. 이런 골렘처럼. 더럽혀진 그 모루처럼. 드워프가 만든 강건한 창조물들. 이것들은 "
"죽음을 간구하지만 어쩔수 없이 계속 그 존재가 지속되어야만 하지. 파괴자의 손길로 축복받은 드워프만이 그들의 고통을 끝낼 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e76b94bf-643c-4d3e-9719-6e51867912ad"
msgid ""
"\"Nonsense. I've never heard of this! If {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} granted me "
"this power... Why do I have to find out about it from some paladin of a "
"traitor god – the god of helplessness and cowardice? A gift of the gods... "
"By Groetus, you prove it or you admit you're lying!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말도 안돼. 나는 그런 것을 들어본 적이 없어! 만약 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 내게 이 힘을 줬다면... 왜 그따위 "
"돕지도 않는 겁쟁이 신-배신자 신을 쫓는 성기사에게서 그걸 알게 되어야만하지? 신들의 은총... 네가 그걸 증명하던지 아니면 거짓말인 걸 "
"인정해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "ca1d8a7e-24ff-4df9-9f2d-d1ebcc4938d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jarmuld listens calmly to the stream of insults raining down on him from "
"Harrim. When the latter has finally spent his breath, the paladin replies "
"quietly:{/n} \"Yes, I can prove it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야르물드는 하림이 그에게 퍼붓는 모욕을 차분히 듣습니다. 그가 욕을 모두 뱉어냈을 때 그 성기사는 조용히 대답합니다.{/n} \"그래"
", 난 그걸 증명할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "02ce0f97-16f5-4eb4-adf3-9b5632ca0010"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim winces as if all of his teeth started aching at once, but then "
"nods reluctantly.{/n} \"It is possible... But then {g|Torag}Torag{/g} and "
"his followers are even more stupid and blind than I thought! Just imagine, "
"{Name} – if this is true, the reason for my woe is not a curse, but the "
"simple fact that none of my kin was wise enough to recognize a divine gift!\""
" {n}The priest shakes his head and looks at the paladin.{/n} \"You said you "
"can prove your words, Jarmuld. I challenge you now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 마치 이가 시린 듯 찡그리지만 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"가능하다니... 하지만 그럼 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 추종자들은 "
"내가 생각한 것보다 훨씬 어리석고 눈멀었다는건가! {Name}. 만약 이게 사실이면 내 불행은 저주도 아니고 그저 내 일족의 누구도 신의 "
"은총을 알아차리지 못할 만큼 멍청하다는 얘기야!\" {n}사제는 머리를 흔들고는 성기사를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"네 말을 증명할 수 "
"있다고 했지, 야르물드. 너에게 도전한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "4069fee3-9015-4705-bd2a-575293ee0610"
msgid ""
"\"The Touch of the Unmaker is not only the power to destroy. He can take the "
"heart from an item – all the love and effort put into it by its maker, by "
"the mercy of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}. Strike the golem once more. Complete the "
"unmaking. – And show us its heart!\""
msgstr ""
"\"파괴자의 손길은 파괴의 힘일 뿐만 아니라 물품의 심장- 창조자에 의해 모든 사랑과 노력이 쏟아부어진 결정체를 취할 수 있다.  "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 자비여, 한 번 더 골렘을 쳐 봐. 파괴를 완성하고 그것의 심장을 우리에게 보여줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "269aaed6-4b5f-434b-83ae-254761b2b979"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks gloomily at the quiet golem, then shrugs and smashes it with "
"his fist. The golem falls to fragments with a pitiful clink. Leaning down to "
"search through the pieces, Harrim takes hold of a shimmering blue jewel. He "
"examines it, then turns to you. The priest's face is sad and baffled.{/n} "
"\"There. A gift from {g|Torag}Torag{/g}, be he damned... So what's next? "
"What do I do with it now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 잠잠한 골렘을 우울하게 보았고 어깨를 으쓱하더니 주먹으로 내리칩니다. 골렘은 산산조각이 났고 몸을 기울여 조각들 사이를 "
"구석구석 찾습니다. 하림은 희미하게 빛나는 푸른색 보석을 줍습니다. 그는 보석을 살피고는 당신에게 돌아옵니다. 그 사제의 얼굴은 슬프고 "
"당황스럽습니다.{/n} \"{g|Torag}토락{/g}이 내린 망할 재능이라니... 이제는 어떻게 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "df6695e1-3478-4b0e-8405-e134044725a4"
msgid ""
"\"You're right.\" {n}Harrim hurls the jewel onto the rocky ground. It breaks "
"into shimmering shards that darken and vanish in the air.{/n}"
msgstr "\"네가 옳아.\" {n}하림은 보석을 바위 바닥으로 던졌습니다. 그것은 조각이 나서 빛을 잃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c14bf92c-cf72-4780-94ed-256b79ea5a60"
msgid ""
"\"If you wish to keep digging a grave for you and your group, Jarmuld – then "
"continue, I won't interfere. Maybe someday I will return to bury your bones. "
"But for now – farewell.\""
msgstr "\"스스로 무덤을 계속 파고 싶다면 계속 해라. 막지는 않겠다. 언젠가 너를 묻어줄 날이 올지도 모르겠지. 지금은 작별하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "354cc2c4-eeb3-434c-9aa8-9e5bf66376d9"
msgid "{n}Harrim hands the jewels to Jarmuld.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 보석을 야르물드에게 건네줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "09134f97-f33f-4d15-a57a-b822571437d5"
msgid "{n}Harrim hands the jewel to Jarmuld.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 보석을 야르물드에게 건네줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e42142ba-6533-4ec7-a520-a048dcc21963"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for telling me of my gift, Jarmuld. But do not expect it will "
"reconcile me with {g|Torag}Torag{/g}... Or with my people. If you find a way "
"to make good use of it – fine. If not, it doesn't matter. You can keep "
"looking for the entrance, or go back to your mountains – I care not.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 재능을 알게 해주어 고맙다., 야르물드. 하지만 내가 {g|Torag}토락{/g}과 화해하리라고 기대하지난 마라...그리고 내 "
"일족들과도.  네가그걸 잘 사용할 방법을 찾는다면 좋아. 그렇지않더라도 나는 상관 않겠다. 입구를 찾던지 산으로 돌아가던지 나는 상관 "
"않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "632a9f82-21ea-411a-91f7-e53b91b34801"
msgid ""
"{n}Jarmuld lowers his head.{/n} \"Thank you, Harrim. I will make good use of "
"this gift. I am sorry that everything turned out the way it did, but I "
"respect your decision and won't try to convince you. Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야르물드는 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"고맙다. 하림. 이 선물은 잘 쓰도록 하지. 예전처럼 되어서 미안하지만 자네의 결정을 "
"존중하니 설득하지는 않겠어. 잘 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "ebcf22a6-44ce-4c51-b080-df24b3df8488"
msgid "{n}Jarmuld lowers his head.{/n} \"Farewell, Harrim.\""
msgstr "{n}야르물드는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"잘 가게. 하림.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3ea11a93-83f5-4958-a073-fdae3e88497f"
msgid ""
"\"You would like... Well I wouldn't like to even see you! We have nothing to "
"discuss. This is just what I need – to listen to another sermon about "
"{g|Torag}Torag's{/g} greatness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 대화를 원한다면.. 흠, 난 심지어 너를 보고 싶지도 않았는데! 우리는 서로 할 말이 없어. 이건 그냥 내가 필요해서야.  "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 위대함에 대한 또다른 설교를 어디 한번 들어보지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "00153372-662d-473b-a178-31018881cbdc"
msgid ""
"{n}The paladin replies to Harrim's indignation with a humble bow.{/n} \"I am "
"not so arrogant as to preach to a priest. Your faith is your choice. I am "
"not one to question it. I only wanted to know more about your spiritual "
"journey.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성기사는 하림의 분노에 겸손한 인사로 답합니다.{/n} \"나는 사제님께 설교할 만큼 교만하지는 않아. 너의 믿음은 너 자신의 "
"선택이다. 나는 묻는 사람이 아니고 그저 너의 영적 여정을 알고 싶었을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "a3eaa753-c89e-45e7-89de-d0d7f4dffc98"
msgid ""
"\"And you must be Harrim, the priest of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}? I've heard a "
"lot about you and the unusual path you've taken. I would like to speak with "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 사제 하림이겠군? 너와 네가 겪었던 흔치 않은 여정에 대해 이야기를 많이 들었다. 너와 "
"대화하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f4fa7ec5-dd4b-4247-aa1a-f0decb75feb8"
msgid "{n}In response Harrim only sniffs with contempt.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}이에 반해 하림은 경멸스럽다는 듯이 오직 콧방귀만 뀝니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d7fb7bf5-2e1e-4b9e-885a-b1381e8afd57"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim turns to you.{/n} \"Gifts from the gods, curses from the gods... "
"I'm starting to think it's the same thing. But thank you for coming here "
"with me. I probably wouldn't even have talked to this Jarmuld on my own. But "
"now... Now I have much to contemplate. Let us go, {Name}. Let's leave these "
"Skjegge to do as they will.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"신들의 선물, 신들의 저주... 이것들이 다 똑같다고 생각하게 되는군. 여기에 와줘서 고맙다. "
"나는 야르물드와 얘기조차 하지 않았을 거야. 하지만 지금은.... 생각할 게 많다. 가자. {Name}. 셰게 가문은 내버려 두자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b31e950c-8d9b-4483-ae83-4eb1479116e3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, wow! Adamantine, with your bare hands? You're a beast! Spill it, when "
"did you get so strong? Have you been lifting weights at night instead of "
"praying?\""
msgstr "\"오! 아다만틴을 맨손으로? 이 짐승! 실토해. 언제 그렇게 강해진 거야? 밤중에 기도 대신에 근력 단련이라도 했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b2f1b8c2-04d0-474e-a7a3-b0d9a62a267d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun bows to the paladin.{/n} \"May the Father of Creation never leave "
"you.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 성기사에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"창조의 아버지가 결코 너를 떠나지 않기를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "57aaf698-1a17-49d9-a407-be3e17a9df22"
msgid "\"May he bless you, my son.\""
msgstr "\"토락께서 그대를 축복하기를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "91f78ac2-3e56-4ca7-af8b-70686f049e9b"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, typical gratitude for dwarven clans... Just so you know, {Name}: when "
"they say they're in irredeemable debt, it really means they're just never "
"going to pay.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아하, 드워프들의 전형적인 감사법이로군...그냥 너도 알다시피, {Name}. 그들이 값을 수 없는 빚을 지게되었다고 말하면 그건 "
"진짜로 절대 빚을 갚지 않는다는 걸 의미하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2319b43d-3e71-46ad-8abc-0b26f4a0249e"
msgid ""
"\"So you can get gemstones from different broken pieces of iron? Good for "
"you! You'll be rich!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 부서진 쇳조각에서 보석을 취할 수 있나? 잘됐군! 넌 부자가 되겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "ea137374-42bc-4887-bb4d-d5b5f3ff3244"
msgid ""
"\"Such a pragmatic young man. However, I'm afraid the hearts of artifacts "
"have much more value in one piece.\""
msgstr "\"아주 현실적인 젊은 친구로군. 하지만 유감스럽게도 이런 유물들의 심장은 멀쩡할 때 더 가치가 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9425919d-39d1-4391-91cc-0addcf399bb1"
msgid ""
"\"Well put. You know as well as I do how dangerous it is to accept gifts "
"from gods.\""
msgstr "\"신들에게 재능을 받는 건 매우 위험한 것임을 나 만큼이나 너도 잘 알 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1f9ecc5f-1bc8-4e24-a00c-ace7fb1365a2"
msgid "{n}Ekun shakes his head.{/n} \"Sacrilege.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"신성모독이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Golem_Destruction/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e50ee8e4-3cb4-462d-9f6c-a8a44c537d33"
msgid ""
"\"Pff! That's rich! Any pip-squeak from our tribe knows how to break things. "
"And you longshanks call it a gift!\""
msgstr "\"흥! 그것 참 재밌다! 우리 부족의 보잘것 없는 놈도 물건을 부술 줄 안다고. 그리고 넌 그걸 재능이라고 부르다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Item/GolemGem_description_String
msgctxt "e04cfed8-102b-42b9-8c55-c7d545c91e59"
msgid ""
"A mysterious magical stone found in the debris left after Harrim destroyed "
"the Adamantine Golem."
msgstr "하림이 아다만틴 골렘을 파괴하자 그 파편에서 신비한 마법의 돌이 나왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Item/GolemGem_name_String
msgctxt "4d1cef48-71ab-4176-8f1d-9aca27c87ca1"
msgid "Heart of the Golem"
msgstr "골렘의 심장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5857144e-83cc-4f76-b915-b3e196d2c18e"
msgid "\"Remind me, who are you?\""
msgstr "\"네가 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "76ffba44-6d67-4879-ae68-2ad9f95d8339"
msgid "\"How are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"잘 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8189431a-1184-401a-8555-d509274bac75"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "e2285928-f0f3-4461-baf0-ada9d5048c3e"
msgid ""
"\"Hello, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! Glad to see "
"you in good health!\""
msgstr "\"안녕! 건강한 걸 보니 다행이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "45f30dda-8283-432f-9f98-9170a959882c"
msgid "\"May {g|Torag}Torag{/g} lay a sturdy road beneath your feet!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Torag}토락{/g}이 네 발 아래 튼튼한 길을 놓기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "b790c244-3b8e-4456-aa1b-e1d83980cf42"
msgid ""
"\"Jarmuld Skjegge, {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} paladin from {g|Five Kings Mountains}"
"the Five Kings Mountains{/g}. We returned here seeking our clan's legacy — "
"and nearly paid with our lives. It is only thanks to your mercy that we yet "
"live. For this, the Skjegge clan is eternally grateful to you\"."
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Five Kings Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}에서 온 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 팔라딘인 야르물드 셰게입니다. "
"우리 가문의 유산을 찾기 위해 여기로 돌아왔습니다. 그리고 거의 죽을 뻔했죠. 아직 목숨이 붙어있게 해주셔서 감사합니다. 셰게 가문은 "
"당신에게 영원한 빚을 졌습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q2_The_Undestructable_Metal/Paladin_Hi_Again/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ2
msgctxt "9573bc87-d11d-4db4-8986-db2fea7d23d6"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, not so good at present. The passage is hidden behind several heavy "
"doors, fortified and protected with traps... Our ancestors' diaries say "
"nothing of this. But rest assured, we'll find our way in! We Skjegge are "
"famous for our perseverance!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어휴, 지금은 때가 좋지 않군요. 통로는 육중한 문들과 덫의 보호를 받으며 꽁꽁 숨겨져 있습니다. 우리 조상의 일지에도 아무것도 "
"적혀있지 않아요. 하지만 반드시 길을 찾아낼 겁니다! 셰게 가문의 대명사가 바로 인내심이지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Barks/Rudrin_wounded_String
msgctxt "ee9a0187-784a-4694-a2b1-53dbc8eef8bf"
msgid "\"Jarmuld, down there! Please help him!\""
msgstr "\"야르물드. 아래로! 그를 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "b8716610-3b26-4d89-b814-d44f9853efaa"
msgid ""
"Told Harrim your opinion on the outcome of the battle between Torag's "
"paladin and the ghost."
msgstr "토락의 성기사와 유령 사이에 벌어졌던 전투에 대해 당신의 의견을 하림에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "d145fb58-b43a-4d28-83b6-295343af8c5d"
msgid "\"It's good that we helped that paladin. It was an act of kindness.\""
msgstr "\"성기사를 도왔다는 것은 좋은 일이다. 그것은 친절함이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "41f4b1f9-1481-4982-8f9e-dd6fddb95591"
msgid ""
"\"We may have made a mistake. It's a pity we didn't have time to find out "
"who, according to dwarven law, has the better claim to the fortress – the "
"living or the dead.\""
msgstr "\"실수를 할 수도 있었지. 살든 죽든 요새에 대한 소유권을 드워프 법으로 따져보아야 했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "a1326799-f1f5-4ed2-9052-81e415b8ab9f"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about the Skjegge and their arguments. But I'm glad you got "
"something out of this.\""
msgstr "\"셰게 녀석들이 뭐라 하든 상관 없어. 네가 무언가를 얻어 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0012_Text_String
msgctxt "ef080350-19b1-4f20-87a4-2745ec6d8393"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me for letting these Skjegge drag you into their squabbles. I "
"should have sent them away at once.\""
msgstr "\"셰게가 너를 끌어들이게 해서 미안하다. 그들을 보내야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e203e4a0-50be-43b4-b154-f85b82a977a8"
msgid ""
"\"It's good that we helped the ghost. Those dwarves truly were unworthy of "
"the fortress.\""
msgstr "\"귀신을 도왔다는 것은 좋은 일이다. 그 드워프들은 요새를 가질 자격이 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "ecb0a1bf-af42-4467-957e-e902871c5758"
msgid ""
"\"We should have helped the Skjegge clan retrieve the fortress. It was "
"theirs by right.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 셰게 가문이 요새를 되찾는 데 도움을 줘야 했어. 그들의 것이었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "23cd49e3-205a-4274-ba57-bc67caf01838"
msgid "\"Why did you destroy the fortress? That was a crime!\""
msgstr "\"왜 요새를 파괴 했지? 그건 범죄였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "f16cd283-ad70-4ab8-a3c3-0d4286cbce9a"
msgid "Told Harrim your opinion on the destruction of the dwarven keep."
msgstr "드워프 요새 붕괴에 대한 당신의 의견을 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "7c6170fb-fcba-4381-91e0-404df8c78c18"
msgid "\"We should have helped the ghost. It could have been useful to us.\""
msgstr "\"귀신을 도왔어야 했는데. 우리에게 유용할 수 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "6d879d6f-1a5e-4696-b006-1b9c281a6425"
msgid ""
"\"Nice work destroying the fortress! It was fun to hear it rumble, falling "
"apart stone upon stone!\""
msgstr "\"요새를 파괴한 건 멋진 일이었어! 부서지는 소리며 돌이 조각나는 모습은 대단했다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ea5cceae-7057-4955-9e2f-597c507a8452"
msgid ""
"\"You know, {Name}... I used to hate them all so much. The dwarves who "
"ousted me, the god who rejected me. Now I look upon this, and I barely "
"remember that hatred. How pathetic they are, with their pride and their "
"stubbornness. Building their toys to die among them... Powerless to unmake "
"the things they've made. I'd laugh, but in fact it makes me want to cry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{Name}... 나는 그들을 너무나 싫어했지. 그들은 나를 쫓아냈어. 돌이켜 보면 생각도 나지 않아. 불쌍한 그들이 부리는 헛된 "
"자부심이란. 그들이 지은 건물에 묻혀 죽고 빠져나오지 못하다니. 웃어야겠지만 사실 눈물이 나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8059aa38-12a2-4bbe-8154-a910d24b73cc"
msgid ""
"\"{Name}, do you know what dwarven creation has long begged to be destroyed? "
"My connection to {g|Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings Mountains{/g} and to "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}. Hatred, resentment, some scraps of a sense of duty... "
"All this time I've been carrying such rubbish in my soul! It's the first "
"thing that must be burned!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{Name}. 파괴되길 원했던 드워프의 피조물이 무엇인지 알아? {g|Five Kings Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}과 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}을 싫어하는 나야. 증오와 헛된 의무심... 이런 감정을 지니고 살아야 했다고! 어서 잊어버리고 싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e025188a-0e9a-4e7b-b24c-9a2d17daf44e"
msgid ""
"\"It is over. Yes... I thought I was free of my past burdens when I accepted "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus'{/g} truths into my heart. But it is only now that I have "
"become truly free.\""
msgstr ""
"\"끝났어. 그래... {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 믿음을 받아들였을 때 과거의 짐을 벗었다고 생각했는데. 이제서야 자유로워진 "
"것 같네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2bda1d47-2e39-4b19-b1de-8230e37e0880"
msgid ""
"\"But on the other hand, I thought... How should I put it...\" {n}Harrim "
"wraps his beard around his fist.{/n} \"My gift, wherever it came from... The "
"gift to destroy, to help others create... Perhaps my god does something "
"similar. Everything that has a beginning has an end as well. One day, "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} will be free and destroy this world. But imagine what "
"will happen then, after the end... Perhaps a new beginning? A new creation "
"and a new world? Who knows? Who knows!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 다른 한편으로 나는 생각했다...\" {n}하림은 손으로 그의 수염을 감쌉니다.{/n} \"내 재능이 어디서 왔건 간에... "
"다른 자의 창조물을 파괴하는 내 재능은... 나의 신도 나와 같은 생각이었을 거야. 시작이 있으면 끝이 있는 법이지. 언젠가 "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 자유로워지고 이 세상을 파괴할 것이야. 하지만 그러면 어떤 일이 일어나겠나? 새로운 시작이 있지 "
"않겠어? 새로운 생명체와 세계가 나타날지 누가 알겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "54965989-5595-49d8-8111-456304172517"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway... Thank you, {Name}. Without you I would have kept going in "
"circles while resentment and hatred gnawed at me from the inside. You helped "
"me find peace. And I swear by {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, I won't leave your "
"side until it's our turn to crumble to dust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무튼. 고맙다. {Name}. 네가 아니었다면 내 안을 갉아먹는 분노를 보내지 못했을 거야. 내면의 평화를 찾게 네가 도왔다. "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에게 맹세하건데 내가 가루가 될 때까지 네 곁에 있겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ba05d87e-8cd9-4d5e-ac26-e6498d8d887f"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks at you – or rather, through you. His eyes seem to look into "
"eternity.{/n} \"Rumbling stones, clanging metal, rustling dust... You know, "
"{Name}, in the sound of the falling fortress I heard the whisper of my god – "
"but for once it was loud and clear. He said, he said... Oh, if only I could "
"put the revelation into words... If only you knew what I have seen... If you "
"could only imagine...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 당신과 길게 눈을 맞춥니다. 그의 눈빛은 초연해 보입니다.{/n} \"덜컹거리는 돌, 금속 뭉치, 먼지 부스러기... "
"{Name}. 요새가 무너져 내릴 때 나는 신의 음성을 들었다. 그는 또렷한 목소리로 말했다... 그 계시를 말로 표현할 수 있다면... "
"네가 그것을 조금이라도 느꼈다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8e21c8fb-0c22-44f4-97c3-c630e35b1457"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest clenches his beard in his fist. There is wisdom in his wide "
"open eyes, like you've never seen before – and incredible depths of "
"insanity.{/n} \"All this is no coincidence, {Name}. Our meeting, our "
"battles... Our future death. I may never be able to share all this wisdom "
"with you, but I'll tell you one thing now: the gods themselves brought us "
"together. From now until the end, my path lies with yours. And I shall not "
"step away from it for as long as I live!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사제는 수염을 움켜쥡니다. 놀랍도록 고요한 그의 눈에는 이전에는 없던 지혜가 엿보입니다.{/n} \"이것은 우연이 아니다. "
"{Name}. 우리의 만남과 그 전투들... 우리의 죽음은 예정되어있었다. 너에게 모든 지혜를 나눠줄 수는 없지만 한가지는 말해주겠다. "
"신들이 우리를 함께하게 도우신다. 끝까지 나는 너와 함께하며 살아있는 한 너에게서 떨어지지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f8ad6f0d-f041-46ca-9287-46344f8a6f28"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shrugs indifferently.{/n} \"Why does it matter? This old man is "
"pathetic and ridiculous. Just think: his pride and greed were so great that "
"they tricked him into overcoming death... And for what? So he could keep "
"guarding this pile of rocks? Ha, a worthy end for a true Skjegge – but "
"there's nothing to be proud of here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 상관 없다는 듯 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"무슨 상관이야? 이 늙은이는 어리석군. 자만하고 욕심이 많아서 죽게 되다니... "
"죽으면 다 헛된 것을. 이 바위 덩어리를 지키지도 못하고 말이지. 하. 셰게다운 결말이군. 자긍심은 한치도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6e17f5de-0284-466e-8d25-cf73fe946cba"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shrugs indifferently.{/n} \"Good, bad... They were driven by greed "
"and pride. Truth be told, the two didn't differ much. Both true children of "
"the Skjegge clan, and true followers of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}. There is nothing "
"to be proud of here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 상관 없다는 듯 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"욕망과 자긍심에 이끌렸군. 둘은 다르지 않았어. 토락의 추종자답고 셰게의 애송이들 "
"다워. 자긍심은 한치도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "03cc78c5-4584-4b79-a482-8fdf2feb7b7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shrugs indifferently.{/n} \"Laws and rules are even more ephemeral "
"than we ourselves. Oblivion will not sue you, or call dust and ash as its "
"witness. It makes no difference.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 상관 없다는 듯 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"법과 규칙은 우리보다 오래가지 않는군. 망각으로 죄도 없고 먼지와 재가 되어 아무런 "
"차이가 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0017_Text_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "07d9afd8-304c-40b8-9575-b02827787554"
msgid ""
"\"Don't apologize – I gave in to their vanity myself. In the end, it was not "
"for nothing. The covetous proudlings were ridiculous and pathetic, but I "
"still learned a lesson. I saw the shadow of a higher truth in their earthly "
"dust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사과하지 마. 나는 그들의 허영심에 굴복했으니. 결국 모두 쓸모 없지만. 탐욕을 부리며 뽐내는 짓은 우습고 애처로워. 나는 그들의 "
"욕망에 드리워진 그림자를 보았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a0acd4a3-07aa-49d4-9569-021d73c95bd2"
msgid ""
"\"I care not who won the fortress. What draws my mind are thoughts of my "
"place in the world, and the true meaning of serving {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. "
"Destroying, creating something new from the pieces, and destroying it "
"again... Isn't that what you're doing now here, in the Stolen Lands? You "
"have built your kingdom upon the ashes of countless predecessors... Ponder "
"this when you have the time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 요새를 차지할지 관심 없어. 내 관심사는 나의 위치와 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}를 숭배하는 의미를 깨닫는 것이지. "
"파괴하고 창조하는 그 순환들이란... 네가 도둑맞은 땅에서 하는 짓이 이와 같지 않나? 너는 수많은 왕국의 흔적 위에 네 왕국을 세웠어. "
"이 의미를 생각해 보라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0019_Text_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "09bbd31e-120e-40aa-b274-49d132cc01b7"
msgid ""
"\"Mortals are stupid, ridiculous and pathetic. This is true for the Skjegge, "
"and for me and you as well. But sometimes a lesson can be learned from their "
"swarming. A shadow of a higher truth in earthly dust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"필멸자는 어리석어. 셰게와 나뿐만 아니라 너도 마찬가지야. 하지만 때때로 그들에게서 교훈을 얻을 수 있지. 세속적인 욕망의 그림자에서 "
"말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0e2f1776-def9-47e0-afde-06cebaad3dc4"
msgid ""
"\"Forget about them. It means nothing, nothing. The dead fighting over a "
"pinch of dust – that's what they are. To give credence to their whims means "
"standing in folly alongside them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잊어버리라고. 아무 의미도 없으니까. 먼지가 될 것들을 위해 죽도록 싸우는 녀석들이야. 그런 어리석은 믿음을 가지니 어리석은 짓을 "
"하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9c1216cc-855b-44ee-a083-69a6cd9f0f6a"
msgid ""
"\"You can judge me if you want. But don't forget to judge the woodlouse and "
"bookworm... The winds and tides that pummel down rocks... Judge time itself, "
"for having no mercy on anyone or anything!\""
msgstr "\"나를 판단해도 상관 없어. 하지만 과연 그래야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c895b834-32f0-4dd6-896e-e701fcf0d832"
msgid ""
"\"The fortress, the Skjegge... They are just pinches of ash, cast over the "
"abyss. Their fate means nothing. All that matters is what I've just "
"realized... Seen... No, I can't explain it. I can't pronounce the words of "
"the truth, though they may be imprinted forever in my soul! But you were the "
"one who brought me this revelation, this insight. And so long as my feeble "
"flesh and exhausted mind still serve me, you will have my gratitude!\""
msgstr ""
"\"요새, 셰게... 그들은 심연에 던져진 먼지에 불과해. 그들의 운명은 헛되었지. 그들을 보고서 나는 깨달음을 얻었어... 하지만 "
"설명할 수 없군. 내 영혼에 깊이 각인되었어도 말로 표현하기가 어려워! 네 덕에 이 통찰력을 얻었어. 정말 고맙군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e51d494b-60cd-4b11-ab11-78c75d6898e5"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim's lips stretch into a haunting smile.{/n} \"Fun? Ha ha ha, "
"probably... The universe falls into splinters, and all things are dissolved "
"in a whirl of dust... We can grieve or laugh aloud – and what's the "
"difference anyway?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림의 입술은 무서운 미소를 만듭니다.{/n} \"재미? 하하하. 아마도... 우주는 결국 멸망하고 모든 것은 재가 된다... "
"웃거나 우는 것이 중요하랴?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_Final/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ed80e7c1-ca02-4562-a53a-c77275c82664"
msgid ""
"\"Forget about him. Never regret that you didn't interfere with a dead man "
"fighting for a pinch of dust. To give credence to their whims means standing "
"in folly alongside them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잊어버리라고. 그런 헛된 것에 목숨 거는 자의 싸움에 끼어들지 않은 걸 다행으로 생각해. 그런 어리석은 믿음을 가지니 어리석은 짓을 "
"하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_after_destruction/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ef470f63-0e7f-4b44-8c99-b6c3733c86cc"
msgid "\"What did you do?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_after_destruction/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "fa518290-c583-430b-b7aa-ce65954a2f97"
msgid "\"Yes. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_after_destruction/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "76a27ce7-1d0a-4bd8-b0f0-de87bb3a8a56"
msgid ""
"{n}The earth beneath your feet trembles. Something in its depths is moving, "
"falling, clasping. Harrim walks out through the gates of the fortress, "
"covered in stone dust from head to toe. As he comes to a halt, the ceiling "
"behind him crumbles and falls.{/n} \"It is done. Let us go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 발 아래 땅이 떨립니다. 깊은 곳에서 뭔가 움직이고, 떨어지고, 으스러집니다. 하림은 흙투성이가 되어 요새의 문을 나섭니다. "
"그가 빠져나오자 그 뒤의 천장이 무너져내립니다.{/n} \"다 끝났네. 가세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_after_destruction/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "ba6dac1a-470d-47f2-8c3a-546f442b7d6e"
msgid ""
"\"You could say I returned {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} gift... Or did I finally use "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus'{/g} gifts as he intended? Or was it that I shed a curse? "
"It depends on how you look at it... how you look at it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 {g|Torag}토락{/g} 선물을 반납한 줄 알겠지... 아니면 마침내 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 선물을 사용한 "
"건가? 그것이 내가 저주라 부르던 것인가? 그것은 생각하기 나름이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_after_destruction/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "72b345d5-f4f7-4289-890f-000bfc2d06f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim exits the dungeon without looking back. His face bears a strange "
"expression – a pensive half-smile.{/n} \"You know, {Name}... I think I've "
"just realized something. Something very, very important... But I need to "
"ponder it further. Let's talk about this later, after we return to the "
"capital.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 뒤돌아 보지 않고 지하 감옥에서 나옵니다. 그의 얼굴은 이상한 표정을 짓고 있습니다.{/n} \"자네도 알다시피... "
"{Name}... 방금 뭔가를 깨달은 것 같네. 하지만 더 생각해 봐야겠어. 수도로 돌아가면 마저 이야기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Harrim_after_destruction/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6960946e-a29e-4074-a34c-611d3eb7eba2"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks at the sky pensively. His voice is unusually quiet.{/n} \"I"
"'ve just realized something, {Name}. Something very important. But I need to "
"ponder it further. Let's talk about this later, after we return to the "
"capital.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 하늘을 조심스럽게 바라봅니다. 그의 목소리는 매우 조용합니다.{/n} \"{Name}... 방금 뭔가를 깨달은 것 같네. "
"하지만 더 생각해 봐야겠어. 수도로 돌아가면 마저 이야기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Item/HarrimQ3_RewardHead_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "802bf434-b4d8-4d56-b4a5-964005f6e41a"
msgid ""
"This helmet gives its wearer DR 5/bludgeoning and a +6 enhancement bonus to "
"Wisdom and Charisma."
msgstr "이 헬멧은 착용자에게 DR 5/부수기를 주고 지혜와 매력 강화 +6 강화 보너스를 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Item/HarrimQ3_RewardHead_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "47c4f28a-8635-42f7-8281-4068ff2e9f33"
msgid "Metal Reborn"
msgstr "철의 재생"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Item/HarrimQ3_RewardHead_m_FlavorText
msgctxt "4deb2240-07ba-44af-a9ee-5d72492e4ea0"
msgid ""
"This helm was forged from the scraps of artifacts unmade by Harrim. What "
"once were twisted, haunted, broken things begging for death have finally "
"found peace in this round, shiny form. Its mere appearance fills you with "
"serenity, bringing philosophical thoughts to mind."
msgstr ""
"이 투구는 하림이 부순 유물의 고철로 만들었습니다. 찌그러지고 파괴되어 죽음을 갈망하던 이것은 둥글고 반짝이는 모습으로 평화를 "
"되찾았습니다. 이것을 보는 당신은 평온을 느끼며 자신의 마음을 돌아보게 됩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_1_String
msgctxt "d7746ac4-847d-45f7-92b1-9527c2a55b90"
msgid "\"Legacy... Can't... Unworthy... Rightfully ours...\""
msgstr "\"유산... 할 수 없다... 합당하지 않다... 합법적으로 우리...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_2_String
msgctxt "b7a2f181-fdf4-4f23-9edd-8ffb154a7833"
msgid ""
"\"Get out! Get out! All of you, get out! Who said you could come here?\""
msgstr "\"나가! 나가! 모두 나가! 누가 오라고 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_3_String
msgctxt "4c448d98-74a7-418e-9938-2390efe5aba4"
msgid "\"This is ours! Ours! We will live here again!\""
msgstr "\"이것은 우리의 것이다! 우리 거야! 우리는 여기에 다시 살 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_4_String
msgctxt "83aa587d-f1a6-4e37-903b-b633513fcd0d"
msgid "\"Betrayed! Abandoned! Ran away! Cowards, cowards!\""
msgstr "\"배신하고 도망쳤다! 겁쟁이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_5_String
msgctxt "d1289039-d69e-493b-a77c-c636f1c5ee5b"
msgid "\"How dare you?!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 감히!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_6_String
msgctxt "2a17f117-c2e8-4827-9dbf-179b3976019a"
msgid "\"Age after age, generation after generation...\""
msgstr "\"여러 시대에 걸쳐... 여러 세대에 걸쳐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Odd_Golem_Barks/Odd_Golem_7_String
msgctxt "94599c58-864e-4813-8cd9-6ed73e7c6b60"
msgid "\"We will not leave! This is the legacy of our ancestors!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 떠나지 않을 것이다! 이것은 우리 조상들의 유산이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "46b496bc-9a7d-4f8a-b0f1-06358931f83f"
msgid ""
"Told the ghost of the abandoned dwarven keep that the Skjegge clan are the "
"rightful heirs."
msgstr "버림받은 드워프 유령에게 셰게 가문이 진정한 상속자라고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f4533e14-d937-4c86-b8a1-9cc452cc0401"
msgid ""
"\"This is the Skjegge clan! They are the rightful heirs of the builders of "
"this fortress!\""
msgstr "\"이들은 셰게 가문이다! 그들은 이 요새의 정당한 상속인이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "92be1b1f-6ac4-4b06-96ce-e25f9b47c243"
msgid ""
"Told the ghost of the abandoned dwarven keep that force is only possible way "
"to own anything."
msgstr "버림받은 드워프 유령에게 힘으로 무엇이든 소유할 수 있다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "2e48ef71-d05d-4ed0-9973-2f291602ddf8"
msgid "\"There is only one true right. The right of strength!\""
msgstr "\"진정한 진리를 말해주지. 힘이 진리다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7182c09f-a005-4abc-837b-bc8d68aaf14f"
msgid ""
"Told the ghost of the abandoned dwarven keep that you agreed to leave in "
"peace."
msgstr "버림받은 드워프 유령에게 평화롭게 떠날 것을 약속합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "7cd1be40-25d8-4008-a9da-8d6d807a2abe"
msgid "\"It's true, we've no business here. We should probably go.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 우리는 여기에 용무가 없다. 가야할 시간이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d544a818-9882-4787-a528-f100fecaaf48"
msgid ""
"{n}Beyond the open gate you find a strange room that looks more like a "
"workshop than the entrance to a fortress. Across the room, by the far wall "
"there's a metal throne.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}열린 문 너머로 요새 입구라기보다는 공방처럼 보이는 이상한 방을 찾았습니다. 방을 가로질러 가장 안 쪽의 벽에 금속 왕좌가 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "50f91683-8ee2-4d11-8849-0ca907d1db53"
msgid ""
"{n}In front of it is {d|Jarmuld}Jarmuld{/d} Skjegge, who you know well. In "
"one hand he holds a steel scepter, and in the other, a sacred symbol of "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}. The paladin's face is ghastly, and he's barely "
"breathing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 앞에 {d|Jarmuld}야르물드{/d}가 있습니다. 한 손에는 무쇠 셉터와 다른 손에는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 성스러운 "
"상징을 들고 있습니다. 성기사의 얼굴은 고통스러워 보여 숨조차 쉬지 않는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "3ee84b2d-4d89-4336-922f-4018794a0b26"
msgid ""
"{n}In front of it is {d|Jarmuld}Jarmuld{/d} Skjegge, who you know well. In "
"one hand he holds a steel scepter, and in the other, a sacred symbol of "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, inset with a shimmering jewel, which you recognize as "
"the heart of the adamantine golem. The paladin is pale, and he barely opens "
"his mouth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 앞에 {d|Jarmuld}Jarmuld{/d}가 있습니다. 한 손에는 무쇠 셉터와 다른 손에 들고 있는 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 성스러운 상징에는 아다만틴 골렘의 심장의 것과 같은 보석이 반짝이고 있습니다. 성기사는 창백해 보였고 입을 "
"간신히 엽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "6c4fe074-b80c-4aaf-86d6-bca6ec127365"
msgid ""
"{n}In front of it is {d|Jarmuld}Jarmuld{/d} Skjegge, who you know well. In "
"one hand he holds a steel scepter, and in the other, a sacred symbol of "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, inset with two shimmering jewels, which you recognize as "
"the hearts of the anvil and the adamantine golem. The paladin's face is "
"twisted by a grimace of pain and strain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 앞에 {d|Jarmuld}야르물드{/d}가 있습니다. 한 손에는 무쇠 셉터와 다른 손에 들고 있는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 "
"성스러운 상징에는 아다만틴 골렘의 심장의 것과 같은 보석이 반짝이고 있습니다. 성기사의 얼굴은 고통과 긴장으로 뒤틀려있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "423bf595-f6de-486b-b946-8536f41d430c"
msgid ""
"\"You... You're here! Help... Help me overcome these golems! I took the "
"scepter from the empty throne over there – but it seems my command over the "
"golems is lacking. If lose control over the golems... We'll all die!\""
msgstr ""
"\"와... 왔군! 도와... 도와줘! 빈 왕좌 위에 있던 이 셉터를 집었는데, 골렘들이 말을 안들어. 골렘에 대한 통제력을 잃으면... "
"우리는 모두 죽을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : GolemAdamantineHarrimQ3Avatar1
msgctxt "3971dd69-15c4-453e-a0ea-11cd07008930"
msgid ""
"{n}One of the golems turns its metal face to you and speaks in harmony,{/n} "
"\"You all deserve to die! Thieves and impostors! By what right do you come "
"to this fortress?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}골렘 중 하나가 당신을 보고는 조화로운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"너희는 모두 죽어 마땅하다! 도둑들아! 무슨 권리로 이 요새에 "
"찾아왔나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : GolemAdamantineHarrimQ3Avatar2
msgctxt "6225aa01-89ce-4f1f-bf61-b3ed02f0d83f"
msgid ""
"\"Accomplices of thieves! You aren't going anywhere until you answer for "
"your crimes – to me, Offeld Skjegge, the last dwarf worthy of bearing his "
"clan's name!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑들이로군! 네 죄를 인정하기 전까지는 아무데도 가지 못할 것이다. 나 오펠드 셰게는 일족의 명예를 책임진 마지막 드워프이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : GolemAdamantineHarrimQ3Avatar2
msgctxt "69e7e82b-bb1f-4c0b-932b-649c7f9a5f43"
msgid ""
"\"They are not Skjegge! They are nameless cowards! Only I, Offeld Skjegge, "
"am worthy of bearing this clan's name.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 셰게가 아니다! 그저 이름 없는 겁쟁이들이다! 오직 나 오펠드 셰게만이 일족의 명예를 책임질 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "62416196-bef0-4eaf-b598-beead24f97c0"
msgid ""
"\"Offeld Skjegge? But you're my great great uncle! When our clan left this "
"fortress, you and your golems stayed behind to protect it! Come to your "
"senses, ghost! We're your descendants!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오펠드 셰게? 그렇다면 나의 증고조 숙부겠군! 우리 클랜이 이 요새를 떠났을 때 너와 네 골렘이 이곳을 보호하기 위해 남았었지. "
"우리는 너의 자손이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : GolemAdamantineHarrimQ3Avatar2
msgctxt "df0a45ec-159b-44f0-b11a-a05fedf0f1e3"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, the right of strength! Yes, yes – you can try! We'll see what you're "
"worth against golems created by Offeld Skjegge! The last one worthy of "
"bearing his clan's name!\""
msgstr ""
"\"힘이 진리라고! 맞다. 그렇다면 해 봐라! Offel 셰게가 만든 골렘들에 맞서 싸워 봐라! 나는 일족의 명예를 책임진 마지막 "
"드워프이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : GolemAdamantineHarrimQ3Avatar1
msgctxt "d146075b-2716-4e3e-a299-e93f5b9ccbca"
msgid ""
"\"You are no one! The real Skjegge would have never abandoned their "
"creation! Those who left forever lost the right to bear this proud name! And "
"you have the nerve to come here – to this fortress, which was built from the "
"blood and sweat of your grandparents, and abandoned by your unworthy "
"fathers? Ha! You will die here together with all your henchmen! Golems, "
"attack!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네겐 자격이 없다! 진정한 셰게 사람은 자기 창조물을 포기하지 않아! 이곳을 떠난 자는 그 자랑스러운 이름을 가질 권리가 없다! "
"우리가 피땀 흘려 지은 요새에, 감히 이곳을 등지고 떠난 이의 후손이 찾아오다니! 네 졸개들과 함께 죽어라! 골렘이여, 공격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "3405b04d-b356-4bf4-90d0-f41d4ff74f15"
msgid ""
"{n}Grinding his teeth, Jarmuld lifts the steel scepter above his head.{/n} "
"\"I'm doing everything I can... But his will is too strong! Destroy the "
"golems! Harrim, you must unmake his throne!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이를 갈면서 야르물드는 무쇠 셉터를 머리 위로 올립니다.{/n} \"최선을 다하고 있지만 그의 의지가 너무나 강해! 골렘들을 "
"파괴해! 하림. 저 왕좌를 네 힘으로 파괴해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bff8b6b4-d487-4836-bec8-f8bc5ffbc5e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shrugs.{/n} \"I told you it would end like this. But you were "
"dying for a legacy! And what is that legacy worth? An army of golems... Was "
"it worth it to come all this way just to meet your death? Wouldn't it have "
"been easier to choke to death in your mountains at home?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"이렇게 끝날 거라고 얘기했지. 하지만 유산 때문에 죽겠다니! 그게 무슨 소용이라고? 죽기 위해 "
"여기로 온 것인가? 차라리 집에서 얌전히 죽지 그랬나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9fb9ff06-d0a7-4b8b-aeff-c09dc1fc4fc4"
msgid "\"I owe you nothing! Neither you, nor Torag!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게 빚진게 없어! 너나 토락에게 빚은 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : GolemAdamantineHarrimQ3Avatar2
msgctxt "b5cf056e-1a17-4393-8634-7f5324c96937"
msgid ""
"{n}The gate behind you closes with a clanging sound.{/n} \"You will all die! "
"You will die, you will die!\""
msgstr "{n}당신 뒤의 문이 철컹하는 소리와 함께 닫힙니다.{/n} \"너희 모두 죽을 것이다! 죽을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9649077f-8011-44b0-b76b-4a3246482e5b"
msgid "{n}Ekun reaches for his weapon.{/n} \"Have to help!\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 무기로 손을 댑니다.{/n} \"도움이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "17fd2a06-5bc0-423e-9c8b-6885613e7ca5"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. He's going to come around, apologize, remove the golems, and "
"hug his grandson. Because family's what's most important, right?\""
msgstr "\"물론. 그는 여기로 와서 사과하고 골렘을 없애고 손자를 안아줄 것이야. 가족이 가장 중요한 거니까. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-1/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a3122e43-e076-4a02-b886-23b5d94e47ae"
msgid "\"Yes, this is the perfect time to argue about theology...\""
msgstr "\"그래. 신학에 대해 토론하기 좋은 시간이군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5dc07ada-999e-4a0f-b3bc-cdf2acfc0365"
msgid "Advised Harrim to help the paladin of Torag."
msgstr "토락의 성기사를 돕자고 하림에게 조언합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "70bf8d7d-caa3-4efe-b738-07286f765b87"
msgid ""
"\"You decided to help him, so finish what you started. Destroy the throne "
"and say goodbye to the Skjegge clan forever.\""
msgstr "\"그를 돕기로 했으니 시작한 것을 마무리해라. 왕좌를 파괴하고 셰게 가문과 영원히 작별해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8c1306fa-5c5d-402c-aff0-d60ffc2d9259"
msgid "Advised Harrim against helping the paladin of Torag."
msgstr "토락의 성기사를 돕지 말자고 하림에게 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "41852122-d3e2-4f71-b395-2cfe7bb93352"
msgid "\"You've already done far more than they deserve. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"할 만큼 했어. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "d42cdaab-c8f1-46dd-9434-a1b7938462ee"
msgid "\"Who are you, ghost, and what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구냐. 여기서 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "85b7788a-6195-4653-93d8-c8221557ce1c"
msgid "Advised Harrim to make peace with the Skjegge clan."
msgstr "셰게 가문과 평화 조약을 하자고 하림에게 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "831d2fbb-bd91-4915-a3fa-d38b5999ec50"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, you were right: the dwarves of the Skjegge clan were killed by "
"their stubbornness and greed. Let this fortress and its guard stand here as "
"a reminder of this.\""
msgstr "\"하림. 네가 옳았어. 셰게 가문의 드워프들은 완고함과 탐욕으로 죽었어. 이 요새와 수호자들을 두고 가자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "eb483adc-b8be-4599-83ff-2ba0c471e3d5"
msgid "Advised Harrim to get rid of the ghost of the dwarven keep."
msgstr "드워프 요새의 유령을 없애자고 하림에게 조언헸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "e53ca647-44a5-44aa-8dc6-46ee40c0f7ae"
msgid "\"The ghost has stayed in this world for too long. Let it rest.\""
msgstr "\"유령은 이 세상에 너무 오랫동안 머물러 있었어. 안식을 주자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a84133ec-2f2b-4972-885f-197a321700b9"
msgid ""
"Advised Harrim to support the paladin of Torag in his battle against the "
"ghost."
msgstr "유령과의 싸움에서 토락의 성기사를 돕자고 하림에게 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "f24961d0-a13c-47f7-94fa-49515f5044a3"
msgid "\"Help Jarmuld and unmake the throne.\""
msgstr "\"야르물드를 돕고 왕좌를 파괴하자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0037_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e8af9e86-b3ea-4368-bff6-3b72b01bc1fc"
msgid ""
"Advised Harrim to support the ghost in its battle against the paladin of "
"Torag."
msgstr "토락의 성기사와의 싸움에서 유령을 돕자고 하림에게 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "51d5b205-8d19-4bd2-9be0-83b4f401dd73"
msgid "\"Help the ghost and take the scepter from Jarmuld.\""
msgstr "\"귀신을 도와 야르물드에게서 셉터를 빼앗자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "57d066dd-6467-4814-9b47-768364e30aac"
msgid ""
"Advised Harrim against taking sides in the battle between the paladin of "
"Torag and the ghost."
msgstr "토락의 성기사와 유령의 싸움에서 편을 들지 말자고 하림에게 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "b34493a9-f1ac-40e0-98eb-c6cb562f9364"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to decide anything. You don't have to be on anyone's side.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 결정할 필요 없어. 누군가의 편이 될 필요가 없다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "e6955224-f206-4bf4-b087-c942ee9632e0"
msgid ""
"{n}The last of the battle golems falls to your feet. A ghost stands to the "
"side, shaking its fist at you.{/n} \"Vandals! Have you any idea how much "
"time I spent creating them?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막 전투 골렘이 당신의 발치에 무너져내립니다. 유령은 한편에 서서 주먹을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"야만스러운 녀석들! 내가 저것들을 "
"만드느라 얼마나 고생한지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c2e1e331-52ee-4969-881d-b21e415f5edc"
msgid ""
"{n}The steel scepter falls from Jarmuld's hand with a loud clang. The "
"paladin's head falls to his chest helplessly. He isn't breathing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}강철 셉터는 야르물드의 손에서 떨어져 쨍그렁 하는 소리가 울립니다. 성기사의 머리는 무기력하게 쳐집니다. 그는 숨을 쉬지 "
"않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "05096767-958c-4d06-b053-e198a53d4793"
msgid ""
"{n}The paladin's pale face glistens with sweat. His fingers tremble, but "
"with what's left of his strength he clenches the steel scepter, and "
"{g|Torag}Torag's{/g} symbol with its shimmering jewel.{/n} \"Quick... "
"Harrim... Unmake... The throne...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성기사의 창백한 얼굴은 땀으로 반짝입니다. 그의 손가락은 떨리지만 남은 힘으로 셉터와 보석으로 장식된 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 "
"상징을 쥐고 있습니다.{/n} \"서둘러... 하림... 파괴해라... 왕좌...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "8e374c9c-b2ed-4d00-abf3-e3e0bf6821df"
msgid ""
"{n}Grinding his teeth, the paladin stands up. The magic jewels in his sacred "
"symbol glow like red and blue flames.{/n} \"Be silent, ghost! In the name of "
"Torag, I forbid you from harming the living! Be gone!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이를 갈면서 성기사는 일어섭니다. 마법 보석은 그의 상징에 박혀 파란색과 붉은색을 빛냅니다.{/n} \"조용히 해라! 토락의 "
"이름으로 더이상의 살생을 금지한다! 사라져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "82aa3260-fbc2-49ed-9881-cdd1ee0b34ff"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost turns its still face to you.{/n} \"The impostor is dead. But I, "
"the last Skjegge, am helpless against you, visitors. Are you going to "
"destroy me? Or can we make peace?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 무표정한 얼굴을 당신에게 보입니다.{/n} \"사기꾼은 죽었다. 하지만 마지막 셰게인 나는 너에게 아무것도 해줄 수 없다. "
"나를 파괴할 것인가? 아니면 싸움을 그만두겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "54e8a4a8-9984-49ab-8af3-cd650026c221"
msgid ""
"\"That's it. Thank you, my friends. I couldn't have done it without you. "
"Harrim, please, unmake the throne so that this ghost has nowhere to return!\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 내 친구들. 너 없이는 할 수 없었어. 하림. 왕좌를 파괴해서 유령이 되돌아오지 못하게 하자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "543b748b-a518-446e-b809-396eb89df228"
msgid ""
"\"What am I, an errand boy? Go there, unmake this... Who are you to order me "
"around? Perhaps I should drop to my knees before {g|Torag}Torag{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 심부름꾼이라도 된단 말인가? 저기로 가라. 왕좌를 부셔라... 네가 누군데 나에게 명령이야? 이제는 {g|Torag}토락{/g}"
"에게 무릎을 꿇으라 하겠군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "07604f83-dfe9-468a-a61c-291d9a750a26"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, I had no intention of giving you orders. Forgive me for expressing "
"myself so poorly. I humbly ask you to help me as a friend and ally.\""
msgstr "\"하림. 너에게 명령하려는 건 아니었어. 오해하게 해서 미안하군. 친구로서 도움을 청한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fb58145a-d9cc-4fe9-b9ec-ec05df97a92f"
msgid ""
"\"Some friend...\" {n}Harrim mumbles angrily, but then looks at you with a "
"question on his face.{/n} \"I don't know... Should I help him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"친구...\" {n}하림은 화를 내며 말을 잇지못하지만 의문스러운 표정으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 모르겠군... 그를 도와야 "
"하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9a7de558-1f1f-4824-b8f9-8c777e602d5c"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, all right. But it's the last time I'm helping you, understood?\" {n}"
"Harrim approaches the throne with the skeleton and strikes it with his fist. "
"One blow, two, and three – and the throne crumbles into pieces with a "
"clanging sound, revealing another jewel, shimmering purple.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"알았어. 하지만 이게 마지막이야. 더 이상 널 돕지 않겠다, 알겠지?\" {n}하림은 왕위에 앉은 해골에 접근하더니 주먹으로 "
"내려칩니다. 한 방, 두 방, 세 방. 왕좌는 큰 소리를 내며 산산조각이 났고, 그 자리에 보라색으로 빛나는 보석이 나타났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "01edc176-5d41-428a-8424-849454d73141"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you...\" {n}The paladin was beginning a speech, but Harrim "
"interrupts him.{/n}"
msgstr "\"고맙다...\" {n}성기사는 말을 하려했지만 하림이 그의 말을 막습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0c7a3a0e-917c-4f41-8c1d-b99ae058f555"
msgid ""
"\"You are welcome. You are welcome. Now go back where you came from. I hope "
"you try to make something useful from the pieces!\""
msgstr "\"천만에. 이제 너의 집으로 돌아가. 이 조각들로 쓸만한 걸 만들었으면 좋겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "45264d79-e4aa-4383-be89-bdeefdd721ff"
msgid ""
"{n}Jarmuld lowers his head.{/n} \"As you say. Your Highness, the Skjegge "
"clan thanks you. We all are in your debt. I'm afraid we'll have to forget "
"the treasures of our ancestors and return home in disgrace. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야르물드는 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"알겠다. 셰게 가문을 대표해서 감사를 표한다. 우리 조상의 보물을 찾지 못해 빈손으로 "
"돌아갈까 봐 걱정했는데. 그럼 이만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "60cc7ffd-26dd-4fe2-8435-479bd1762ca7"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim watches the paladin coldly.{/n} \"So much effort, so much "
"suffering, and for what? They built themselves a crypt, and nearly buried "
"themselves in it. {g|Torag}Torag{/g}, Torag... You inspire your children to "
"build such things, then they don't know how to get rid of them... Fools... "
"All right, let's go, there's no point standing here...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 성기사를 차분히 바라봅니다.{/n} \"이렇게 고생했는데 도대체 무엇을 위해서? 그들은 자기들의 무덤을 만든 꼴이다. "
"토락... {g|Torag}토락{/g}... 건축을 가르쳤지만 그것을 부수는 방법은 가르치지 못했구나... 어리석군... 이제 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2954591d-77a6-429f-866b-8a2e115863a3"
msgid ""
"\"True... But you know, I think I'll do one more thing. I'm just afraid they "
"aren't going to like it! Go on, everyone, outside! Quickly! It's about to "
"get very loud in here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아... 하지만 하나만 더 하지. 그들이 싫어할까 걱정되는구나! 어서 밖으로 나가. 모두! 이제 여기는 시끄러워질 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7d70085e-1ac2-4e1b-8a3a-1e26b6269463"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim turns to you with a bitter sneer.{/n} \"Look – even long-dead "
"dwarves keep dragging me into their business. So, what are we going to do? "
"Let the ghost... live?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 씁쓸한 비웃음을 지으며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"봐라. 드워프 유령이 나를 끌어드리려 하잖아. 이제는 어떻게 할까? 저 "
"유령을... 살려줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0024_Text_String
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "8ff59cb0-fb24-4fc9-940f-55faad0b5036"
msgid ""
"\"My name, as I mentioned, is Offeld Skjegge. I was once a famous master. "
"The golems I made were unrivaled, either here in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g}, or in our homeland, {g|Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings "
"Mountains{/g}! I created this throne and scepter to control a whole army of "
"golems, ordering them to make more and more new ones... Yes, it was a "
"glorious time...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 오펠드 셰게이다. 나는 한때 유명한 주인이었다. 내가 만든 골렘은 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서도, "
"{g|Five Kings Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}에서도 타의 추종을 불허했다! 나는 이 왕좌와 셉터를 만들어 골렘 군대를 "
"통제하고 더 많은 골렘을 만들었다... 영광스런 시간이었어... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0025_Text_String
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "23166b5a-75c7-4275-ab6a-17b5cbbae330"
msgid ""
"\"Then my fellows — worms and lice, unworthy of even wearing beards, let "
"alone the glorious name of Skjegge! — betrayed everything we lived for. They "
"decided to abandon the road, abandon the fortress, and return home with "
"those Woradash cowards and Langebukk morons! They even had the nerve to "
"accuse ME of betrayal! They spread rumors that my experiments had emptied "
"the treasury... What a ridiculous excuse! A true dwarf will find his own "
"way, even without gold! He would sooner eat stones than give up his life's "
"work!\""
msgstr ""
"\"버러지같은 내 동료들은 셰게의 이름을 버리고 우리를 배신했다. 그들은 길과 요새를 포기하고 이 겁쟁이 워라대쉬 녀석들과 멍청한 "
"랑게북크 녀석들과 함께 돌아갔다! 나를 배신자로 몰아세우기까지 했어! 그리고 내 실험으로 보물을 써버렸다는 소문을 퍼뜨렸지... 말도 "
"안되는 소리지! 진정한 드워프는 골드가 없어도 작품을 만든다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0026_Text_String
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "53c36a94-7f67-42c2-9aad-49dfbd27c4c0"
msgid ""
"\"So I stayed. The last true Skjegge, the last shield on {g|Road of Shields}"
"the Road of Shields{/g}. I had my golems to help protect the fortress. "
"Perfect creatures of stone and metal, not like those cowards, with stew "
"instead of spines! I remained here and continued to guard the fortress even "
"as my flesh decayed, until there was nothing left of me but bones and "
"adamantine will!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 나는 머물렀다. 마지막 셰게으로서. {g|Road of Shields}방패의 길{/g}의 마지막 방패로서. 나는 골렘들로 "
"요새를 지켰다. 어떤 멍청이들과는 달리 돌과 철로 만들어져 완벽했어! 나는 여기 머물러 내 살이 문드러질 때까지 이곳을 지켰다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0027_Text_String
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "2fb1caa0-36d4-46c5-a574-b3635927ea2e"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me... I see you're no ordinary folk. Probably in the service of "
"some rich merchant? Or maybe even the local ruler? We don't need to be "
"enemies. Let me keep guarding this fortress — in return, I'll give my best "
"golems to serve your lord! Well, you've already broken the best ones... But "
"I'll make new ones!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 말을 들어봐... 네가 평범하지 않은 것은 알아. 아마 부유한 상인을 섬기지? 아니면 지역 영주나? 우리는 적이 될 필요 없이 "
"내가 요새를 지키게 하면 너에게 최고의 골렘을 주겠다. 너는 이미 최고급 골렘 하나를 부쉈지만... 새로 만들면 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7d5236dd-fe8f-4dbf-8b92-aafc0a0eabbb"
msgid ""
"\"True, true... I said it from the very beginning... And that's just how it "
"ended... Yes. Funny and tragic at the same time.\" {n}The priest fiddles "
"with his beard.{/n} \"All right, ghost, stay here, become an undead monument "
"to yourself. We'll send poor Jarmuld's body to his homeland. I'll write this "
"tale with my own hand – to be a lesson to our descendants... And to keep "
"away any more unwelcome guests from {g|Five Kings Mountains}the Five Kings "
"Mountains{/g}. I hope we won't be seeing them again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아... 나는 처음부터 끝까지 말했어... 그래. 우습지만 슬프기도 해.\" {n}사제는 턱수염을 꼬읍니다.{/n} \"좋아. "
"유령. 너는 여기서 언데드 기념물이 되어라. 우리는 야르물드의 시신을 고국으로 보낼 거야. 나는 이야기 하나를 써서 후손들에게 읽게 할 "
"거야. 그러면 {g|Five Kings Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}의 산에 불청객은 얼씬도 안할 테지. 다시는 만나지 말자고!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "e7a0c399-18ef-4d6f-97de-5cde116da483"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. May there be peace between us! I will send a group of golems to "
"serve you loyally and truthfully.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 우리 사이에 평화가 성립했구나. 너에게 골렘 무리를 보내줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "831d5396-92ed-4542-ae75-cc03ba74eeb5"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, yes, you are welcome. Peace, friendship and so on.\" {n}Harrim's "
"voice is full of irritation and haste.{/n} \"Farewell. Let's go, {Name}. "
"I've no wish to look at these walls, this iron, and especially those bones.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 천만에. 평화와 우정이 좋은 거야.\" {n}하림의 목소리는 자극과 흥분으로 가득 차 있습니다.{/n} \"잘가. 가자. "
"{Name}. 나는 이 벽과 쇠 특히나 시체들을 보고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b79489c2-251e-4d24-a216-5b41b3b9898a"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it wasn't just the ghost who stayed in this world for too long... Ha "
"ha, I know what I will do!\" {n}A devilish sneer appears on the priest's "
"face.{/n} \"Leave. It's about to get very noisy in here...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 세상에 그리 오래 머문 유령은 아니었구나... 하하. 이제 뭘 해야 할지 알겠다!\" {n}사제의 얼굴에는 악의에 찬 비웃음이 "
"나타납니다.{/n} \"나가. 여기는 이제 아주 시끄럽게 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ac9a65b9-e90e-477e-b39e-5f3e07a3f818"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim puts his palms on the stone wall, and you feel a vibration coming "
"from the very depths of the ground.{/n} \"Get out! Quickly!\""
msgstr "{n}하림은 손바닥을 돌벽 위에 올려놓자 당신은 땅 깊은 곳에서 진동을 느낍니다.{/n} \"빨리 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : HarrimQ3_Offeld_Skjegge
msgctxt "9799df54-6cb9-43b7-884b-b8b99c2b12ac"
msgid ""
"\"Don't do this! Don't you see – he's an impostor! He has no right to this "
"fortress! It's mine, mine... Let's make peace! Take the scepter from him – I "
"will repay you generously!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지마! 그는 사기꾼이야! 그는 이 요새를 가질 자격이 없어! 이건 내 거야... 싸움을 중단하자! 그에게서 셉터를 가져가면 너에게 "
"후하게 보상해줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b77a0cb1-61a1-4d3a-ad31-6efd896974ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks at the paladin, then at the ghost and back, then turns to "
"you with a bitter sneer.{/n} \"Look at them. Children of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}"
"... Butting heads like two rams on a narrow mountain path! But we do need to "
"decide something, though these two are equally disgusting. Whose side should "
"we take?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 성기사를 바라본 다음 유령을 돌아보고는 당신에게 씁쓸한 비웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"저들을 봐. {g|Torag}토락{/g}"
"의 자손들이란... 좁은 산길에서 머리를 맞댄 산양 두마리 같은 모습이야! 저 녀석들 모두 역겨워도 우리는 결정을 내려야 해. 어느 편을 "
"들어줄 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "18956dd0-a5d9-432a-82fb-5c19bb2da12d"
msgid ""
"\"But they're...\" {n}Harrim frowns, baffled, and then a smile lights up his "
"face.{/n} \"By {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, it's true! I owe them nothing. And I "
"won't let anyone order me around. Do you know what I'll do? Do you? Oh... "
"Run away, quickly! – Everyone run! It's about to get very noisy in here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그들은...\" {n}당황한 하림은 얼굴을 찡그리고는 웃음이 나타납니다.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에게 "
"맹세하는데 나는 그들에게 빚이 없다. 누구도 나에게 명령하지 못해. 내가 어떻게 할지 알아? ... 도망쳐. 어서! 모두 나가! 이제 "
"여기는 아주 시끄러워질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "793b7f4f-8762-4721-bd77-ed44ed7978ad"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I didn't like him from the start...\" {n}Harrim approaches the "
"paladin and breaks the steel scepter in his hand as easily as a straw.{/n} "
"\"Go, servant of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}. Return home and never come back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 처음부터 그가 싫었어...\" {n}하림은 성기사에게 다가가 그의 손에 들린 강철 셉터를 지푸라기처럼 쉽게 부숩니다.{/n} "
"\"가라. {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 종아. 집으로 가서는 돌아오지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Dwarf_PaladinM_HarrimQ3
msgctxt "b25afc59-d242-46ee-a80d-95eb997ebbcb"
msgid ""
"{n}Jarmuld looks at Harrim with a mix of anger and disappointment. Shaking "
"his head, he leaves without saying a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}야르물드는 분노와 실망으로 하림을 봅니다. 그는 머리를 흔들면서 한 마디도 하지 않고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3814cc9b-b436-4f0f-bc75-c10efe710d9e"
msgid "\"Holy warrior... May {g|Torag}Torag{/g} lay your soul to rest.\""
msgstr "\"신성한 용사구나... {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 너의 영혼을 쉬게 하길. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bddd1c57-23b4-47d5-89c4-b30c689172ba"
msgid ""
"\"These moments make striving for power worth it. Nothing's sweeter than "
"seeing two petitioners before you, each wanting the other dead, and deciding "
"whom to make your debtor, and whom to destroy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가치있는 힘을 얻기 위해 노력하는 순간이야. 서로를 죽이지 못해 안달이 난 녀석들이 너에게 애걸하는 모습을 보자니 정말 재미있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9d2a51ef-b1df-4e14-83a3-e6981b7a7a29"
msgid "\"Heh heh heh... Depends what he can offer us for it!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤헤... 뭘 주는지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4e661cc9-92d5-45c0-9d40-aa9a74339f81"
msgid "\"Don't argue — do it. Or this battle might be pointless.\""
msgstr "\"말싸움 하지 마. 아니면 이 싸움은 무의미할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4b040bf3-9556-4c61-b2e5-b1b990db374d"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, I beg you: forget your pride and help him! The ghost might be "
"banished, but who knows what other deadly surprises he prepared for us?\""
msgstr "\"하림. 부탁할게. 자존심은 잊어두고 그를 도와줘! 유령은 사라질 테지만 우리를 괴롭힐지 누가 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Harrim/Q3_The_Unmaking/Paladin_vs_Ghost-2/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "eeb0b35d-4775-40c4-9d57-8687e9f1c830"
msgid ""
"\"Let's do this: first, you break this throne... then, for dessert, the neck "
"of one annoying paladin.\""
msgstr "\"이 왕좌를 먼저 부수자... 그리고 저 팔라딘의 목을 부러뜨리는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/BoarCarcassl_String
msgctxt "a3d2b861-0ba2-4558-af30-af092eae7065"
msgid "This is the boar carcass where Enneo found Jaethal's dagger."
msgstr "에네오가 제이탈의 단검을 발견한 멧돼지 시체입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/ElfAttack0_String
msgctxt "eb802327-2cec-48c0-80ab-cf7cb3d647bb"
msgid "\"No! That's the monster and her henchmen!\""
msgstr "\"아니야! 그건 괴물과 그녀의 앞잡이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/ElfAttack1_String
msgctxt "2c6dbfdc-6efd-4e89-89de-7fb310d9a906"
msgid "\"No! That's her! She's found us!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그 여자야! 그녀가 우릴 찾았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/ElfAttack2_String
msgctxt "54a74521-651b-40f3-afbb-3c6a3d882f72"
msgid "\"Monster! We knew that you would always thirst for blood!\""
msgstr "\"괴물! 우리는 네가 항상 피에 굶주릴 거라고 생각했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/ElfAttack3_String
msgctxt "9527a657-3f54-4592-9496-81273fdb064c"
msgid "\"You will not take our lives easily!\""
msgstr "\"우리 목숨을 그리 쉽게 내어주지는 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/ElfAttack4_String
msgctxt "a9b115c6-482f-45b4-92f9-e8cc40090f1f"
msgid "\"Friends, be strong! Fight for your lives!\""
msgstr "\"친구들아. 너의 목숨을 위해 싸워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/EnneoGoods_CapitalBark_String
msgctxt "83646257-ca00-46cf-b671-efdb926a8102"
msgid ""
"It seems that Enneo disappeared, leaving his more cumbersome belongings "
"behind."
msgstr "에네오가 떠나면서 귀찮은 것들은 남긴 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/UndeadServant_CapitalBark2_String
msgctxt "0dc4e10d-5c43-4c3a-8ea7-8eb72cb906b8"
msgid "\"You chose this fate for me. I simply must accept it.\""
msgstr "\"이 운명은 나를 위해 네가 선택했다. 나는 받아들여야만 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/UndeadServant_CapitalBark3_String
msgctxt "7a036f9c-6f7c-4ebe-a0e0-9b72d43c4d1f"
msgid "\"There's a certain dark poetry in the silence that fills me.\""
msgstr "\"내 안을 소리 없이 채우는 어두운 구절이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Barks/UndeadServant_CapitalBark_String
msgctxt "dcab7465-e211-425e-8079-67263816d617"
msgid "\"A living soul imprisoned in a dead body... Is this all I am now?\""
msgstr "\"죽은 몸에 갇힌 살아있는 영혼... 그것이 나인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "92ef0d07-3e79-442e-9300-75ebab1d55da"
msgid ""
"\"Dissection of the carcass might help. Perhaps we'll learn something new.\""
msgstr "\"시체를 해부하면 도움이 될 꺼야. 뭔가 새로운걸 발견할 수도 있잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "85d91bd1-7953-4197-a4ef-090c59242735"
msgid ""
"\"We should carefully examine everything around here. If the boar was "
"already wounded when it came here, there must be a trail of blood somewhere."
"\""
msgstr "\"이 부근의 모든 것을 세심하게 조사해야해. 멧돼지가 이곳에 왔을 때 이미 상처를 입었다면 핏자국이 어딘가에 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "20e59283-ef53-4be0-adb4-6c0b787614cf"
msgid "\"I can't offer any other suggestions. Do you have any ideas?\""
msgstr "\"난 더이상 다른 제안은 없어. 다른 아이디어가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "c63dd9d0-d1b3-42f2-8ade-2ff07b7a4823"
msgid ""
"\"There's not much blood around the wound. — Looks like it was inflicted "
"once the blood had already curdled. After the beast's death, not before.\""
msgstr "\"상처 주변에 피가 별로 없군. 이미 피가 응고된 후에 찌른것 같아. 짐승이 죽은 후에 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d719ff5e-2292-4b4a-a34f-28ed06839f10"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal approaches the boar's carcass, carefully examining the ground "
"around it.{/n} \"See? There should be a pool of blood, but it's not here. It "
"seems the beast came from somewhere else, already wounded, and then died "
"here. But I can't track the direction. The ground is rocky. It would take a "
"troll to leave footprints here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 멧돼지의 시체에 접근하여 신중하게 주위의 땅을 조사합니다.{/n} \"보여? 피 웅덩이가 있어야 하는데 여기에는 없군. "
"이미 짐승이 다른 곳에서 상처를 입은 채 여기에서 죽은 것 같아.하지만 그 방향을 추적 할 수가 없어. 이곳은 땅에 바위가 많아서 "
"발자국이 남으려면 트롤 정도는 되야 할꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f05c2e29-c1a0-4f25-aedf-380513291a7c"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal inspects the wounds on the boar's neck.{/n} \"The cuts are "
"distinctive — like the kind my dagger would make. It has a few deep "
"serrations on one side of the blade — so it wounds like a saw-toothed weapon "
"on that side. So far, everything backs up the half-elf's story. But how can "
"we find the one who stabbed the boar?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 멧돼지 목에 난 상처를 검사합니다.{/n} \"절단된 상처 모양이 독특하군. 내 단검으로 찌른 상처가 맞는것 같아. 내 "
"단검은 칼날 한면이 톱니 모양으로 되어 있어서 상처에 톱니 자국을 내거든. 여기까지는 모든것이 하프 엘프가 말한 내용과 맞아떨어지는군. "
"근데 멧돼지를 찌른자를 어떻게 찾아야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ff34130e-d257-4b30-9585-d5de9c4a9d1a"
msgid ""
"\"Astute. As for the wound... it's all very strange. We need more "
"information.\""
msgstr "\"영악하군. 이 상처는... 뭔가 다 수상해. 아무래도 정보가 더 필요하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "0c074b91-fc56-4493-87ec-0a17743a52d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal nods and slowly unpacks the tools and items one needs for such "
"work. Together you bend over the carcass of the wild boar. At first, the "
"dissection doesn't provide any details, until you note the small water "
"plants in the boar's stomach. They are also stuck to its muzzle and tusks. "
"It seems that the beast was near water recently — otherwise, the duckweed in "
"its stomach would already be digested.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 작업에 필요한 도구를 천천히 끄집어냅니다. 당신은 그녀와 함께 멧돼지의 시체를 구부립니다. 처음에 별다른 것을 발견하지 "
"못했지만 이내 멧돼지 위장에 수생식물을 발견합니다. 주둥이와 위장에도 그것이 있습니다. 아마 얼마 전까지 물 주위에서 있었던 것 "
"같습니다. 최근에 짐승이 물 근처에 있었던 것 같습니다. 그렇지 않다면 위장에 있는 좀개구리밥은 이미 소화됐을 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "59fdf980-5079-431f-9f98-c77b43eb5506"
msgid ""
"{n}The time you spend exploring the boar's disgusting entrails was a "
"complete waste. You don't find anything unusual — no clues that would allow "
"you to trace the beast's movements or its final moments.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}멧돼지의 역겨운 창자를 헤치는 데 소비한 시간은 완전한 낭비였습니다. 특이한 것을 발견하지 못합니다. 짐승의 움직임이나 마지막 "
"순간을 추적 할 수있는 단서가 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "51943dca-1e95-4def-8ffa-15108965e04b"
msgid ""
"\"The nearest source of water is the {g|Thorn River}Thorn River{/g}, and "
"plants like that grow along its backwaters. Let's go there and search the "
"shore.\" {n}Jaethal suddenly smiles with the corner of her mouth. She does "
"it in a strange, almost convulsive manner, as if her undead face had long "
"ago forgotten the expression.{/n} \"How amusing. To look for evidence, to "
"seek connections between events — as before, during my service in "
"{g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}. However, this is the first time I've played the "
"victim...\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 가까운 물가는 {g|Thorn River}가시 강{/g}이고 그 식물은 물가에 자란다. 강 주위로 가서 찾아 보자.\" {n}"
"제이탈은 갑자기 입가에 미소를 지었습니다. 그녀의 언데드 얼굴은 오래 전에 웃는 것을 잊어 버린 것처럼 이상하고 경직되어있습니다.{/n} "
"\"정말 즐겁구나. 단서를 이을 증거를 찾는 것이. {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에 있었을 때 자주 그랬지. 하지만 희생자를 수색하는 "
"것은 처음이군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1a79a12e-cdf3-4e16-83ea-5268e1bf9085"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal wipes her hands with disgust.{/n} \"A failure. We need to try "
"something else. In my long life I've learned a few simple ideas — everything "
"in the world leaves traces. You only need to know how to find them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 혐오감으로 그녀의 손을 닦습니다.{/n} \"실패다. 뭔가 대책이 필요하다. 오랜 인생에서 나는 모든 것이 흔적을 남긴다는 "
"것을 배웠지. 이제 어떻게 찾느냐만 남았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "dab6d97b-5a23-42fa-9f72-04239e2e6498"
msgid ""
"{n}Traces were easily discovered — marks of dark blood, spotting the ground "
"here and there, leading westward.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}흔적이 쉽게 발견되었습니다. 검은 핏자국이 땅에 몇방울 떨어져 있고 서쪽으로 이어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "50195af5-c3a9-4740-b99b-10c24b9c0989"
msgid ""
"{n}Any traces of blood, even if they were there once, had long since "
"disappeared. The dead beast and quiet hills would not part with their "
"secrets.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}핏자국이 있었더라도 오래 전에 사라졌을 것입니다. 죽은 짐승은 조용한 언덕은 아무런 연관이 없어보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9e6a93f7-1e6c-486c-aef7-f0c99ee9cc3f"
msgid ""
"\"Easier than I imagined. The trail is clear. — It leads to the Thorn River. "
"We should search the shores. We might find something there that points "
"towards the dagger's 'owner'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각보다 쉬운걸. 흔적은 분명하다. 가시 강으로 이어지고 있어. 강가를 수색해 봐야겠어. 거기서 단검의 '주인'이 누구인지 알려줄 "
"단서를 찾을지 모르니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6f87c6cd-d6f7-4020-aec6-0446b479526a"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal turns around slowly, examining every piece of ground, every stone "
"and blade of grass.{/n} \"I cannot be sure, but I see a few marks on the "
"stones and bent grass — all of it on the western side of the carcass. "
"Probably the boar drinks at the {g|Thorn River}Thorn River{/g}. This is the "
"only guess I have for now. We should explore there and see what we find.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 천천히 돌아서서 잔디와 돌 등 땅을 구석구석 수색합니다.{/n} \"확신 할 수는 없지만 돌과 꺾인 잔디를 보아 흔적이 "
"보였다. 모두 시체의 서쪽을 가리키고 있어. 아마 멧돼지는 {g|Thorn River} 가시 강{/g}에서 물을 마셨던 것 같다. 지금은 "
"이것이 다야. 우리는 그곳에서 찾아 봐야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f8ed60cd-f6f2-425f-8245-7c83fe085b4a"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks closely at everything around him.{/n} \"A strange place. "
"Anxiety knocks on the door of my mind. Don't understand where it came from.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 주변의 모든 것을 자세히 살펴 봅니다.{/n} \"이상한 곳이다. 불안감이 내 마음의 문을 두드린다. 그것이 어디서 왔는지 "
"모르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/BoarCarcass_Dialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f6778622-688e-40cd-9d84-9c3ff76021b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun signals you to wait and examines the area for a while. After a "
"while, he returns and points at the trail. Marks of dark blood lead west.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신에게 기다리라고 신호를 보내고 잠시 동안 그 영역을 검사합니다. 잠시 후 그는 돌아와 흔적을 가리킵니다. 어두운 피의 "
"표시가 서쪽으로 이어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a865d011-2ff6-4e63-a77d-badac061ecd9"
msgid "\"I'd like to take a look at your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 좀 보여주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "23582fe2-948b-4b24-b5bb-748f8011f3c8"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "486f895a-3a48-4648-a679-a71281741559"
msgid "\"You have many goods from Kyonin. Have you been there?\""
msgstr "\"쿄닌의 물건이 많이 있군. 그곳에 가봤었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ac70c2bb-ce6e-4c8a-a638-d3678a479766"
msgid "\"Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"그럼,안녕히\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Enneo_Vendor
msgctxt "9e136976-37e3-499f-9141-e6a47f508f9a"
msgid ""
"{n}A tanned half-elf merchant gives you a polite bow. His thick chestnut "
"hair shows a slight touch of grey at his temples — a sure sign that he's in "
"his seventh decade — mature, but not old age for a half-elf.{/n} \"I'm happy "
"to welcome you, Your Grace. I am Enneo, wandering trader in curiosities. I "
"have come to your lands recently, and hope to stay here for a while — until "
"the road calls me again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}햇볕에 그을린 하프-엘프 상인이 공손히 인사를 합니다. 그는 두꺼운 적갈색 머리카락에 관자놀이 근처로 회색이 살짝씩 비췄는데, "
"그것은 그가 70세 정도라는 확실한 증거입니다. 하프-엘프로써는 충분히 성인이지만 노인 정도는 아닌 나이입니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}을 맞이하게 되어 기쁩니다. 저는 호기심을 따라 떠돌아다니는 상인, 에네오입니다. 요근래에 이 지역에 "
"도착하게 되었습니다. 길이 저를 다시 부를 때까지 잠시 이 지역에 머물기를 희망합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Enneo_Vendor
msgctxt "da8ea86f-b837-4817-b2c4-51c6e5426d6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Enneo bows with his usual courtesy.{/n} \"Welcome again, Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에네오는 평소와 같이 예의를 갖춰 인사를 합니다.{/n} \"다시 뵙게되니 반갑습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Enneo_Vendor
msgctxt "afb4c676-2ce0-4af0-b04a-752d30093d27"
msgid ""
"\"I prefer to travel the wild and sparsely-populated corners of the "
"continent. The farther I wander from big cities and trade routes, the less "
"competition I have from the rich merchant guilds. In my travels, I sometimes "
"manage to acquire true curiosities. Of course, sometimes I get into trouble "
"instead. Few can boast of escaping a giant scorpion by climbing a mammoth "
"cactus...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 거칠고 인적이 드문 대륙의 구석진 곳을 여행하는 것을 더 좋아합니다. 대도시와 교역로에서 멀리 떨어질 수록 부유한 상인 길드와의 "
"경쟁은 더 적거든요. 여행 중 때때로 진정한 호기심을 얻고는하죠. 물론 그 대신 가끔 문제가 생기기도 합니다. 아마, 거대 전갈을 피해서 "
"거대 선인장 위로 올라간걸 자랑할 수 있는 사람은 몇 없을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/EnneoVendor_Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Enneo_Vendor
msgctxt "89373fcc-14ad-4540-b16b-35e0419fb8dd"
msgid ""
"{n}Enneo shrugs.{/n} \"I was born in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} — in "
"{g|Greengold}Greengold{/g}, a port on the shore of Lake Encarthan, and the "
"only place in the elven homeland where others are allowed entrance. "
"Merchants from all over the world rushed to Greengold, as soon as Queen "
"Telandia Edasseril opened it to strangers. It has been a city of commerce "
"ever since. You might say that the business of trade runs in my blood. And "
"returning to your question — yes, I often visit my homeland when I'm nearby."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에네오가 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"저는 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}의 {g|Greengold}그린골드{/g}에서 "
"태어났습니다. 엔카르산 호 연안의 항구이며 엘프들의 국가중에 유일하게 다른 종족 사람들이 출입할 수 있는 곳입니다. 여왕 텔란디아 "
"에다세릴이 낯선 사람들에게 개방하자마자 전 세계의 상인들이 그린골드로 몰려들었습니다. 그 이후로 무역 도시가 되었습니다. 질문하신대로, "
"근처를 지날때면 제 고국에 자주 방문하곤 합니다. 저 역시 무역 상인의 피가 흐르고 있을테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "010bb9dc-8e38-4915-93ad-0ea3532fbdc3"
msgid ""
"\"The symbol of Pharasma. I believe the Lady of Graves holds Urgathoa in "
"disfavor, and the most faithful of her followers seek out the undead to "
"exterminate...\""
msgstr "\"파라즈마의 상징. 나는 무덤의 여인이 우르가쏘아를 미워하여 그녀의 추종자들이 언데들을 추적해 처치하리라고 믿는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7ad48b80-1b9e-4aac-8df0-3527e9268d4e"
msgid "\"Do you know the symbol?\""
msgstr "\"이 상징을 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e7cd2209-5ed3-4795-8d50-f0b223c7cb83"
msgid ""
"\"We cannot leave things as they stand. We must find Enneo as soon as "
"possible.\""
msgstr "\"이대로 두면 안돼. 최대한 빨리 에네오를 찾아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "00121fba-acb2-4dea-8e63-4c9f05375c1e"
msgid "\"I have no wish to quarrel with the church of Pharasma.\""
msgstr "\"나는 파라즈마 교단과 싸울 생각은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3ceebbcb-e831-44aa-82b3-784b64e3856e"
msgid ""
"Condemned Enneo for his lies and drawing others into his \"holy war\" "
"against Jaethal."
msgstr "거짓말로 다른 이들을 제이탈에 맞선 자신의 성전(holy war)에 끌어들인 에네오를 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "98e47c21-48c7-49d5-a45c-05f6a6babf39"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever Enneo believes, he has no right to lie and drag people "
"unwittingly into his 'holy war'.\""
msgstr "\"에네오가 무얼 믿건 간에 거짓말로 다른 사람들을 자기의 종교싸움에 끌어들일 권리는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "cb1f17e5-5a1d-4742-aa5b-76b16358cb34"
msgid ""
"\"He's fled. As I expected.\" {n}Jaethal touches the boxes that hold the "
"merchant's wares. Her moves seem relaxed until you notice that her undead "
"fingers are tense and bent like the claws of a predator.{/n} \"It's "
"pointless. Illogical. Those children in the woods could hardly be expected "
"to kill us. Why the performance? There must be something...\""
msgstr ""
"\"도망쳤군. 예상했던대로야.\" {n}제이탈은 상인의 상품을 담았던 상자를 만집니다. 그녀는 느긋해 보였지만 그녀의 손가락은 마치 "
"짐승처럼 발톱을 세우고 긴장되어 있다는 것을 당신은 알아차렸습니다.{/n} \"뭔가 말이 안돼. 그 숲속의 어린 엘프들은 우리를 어차피 "
"우리를 죽이지 못해. 근데 왜 그런 계획을 세운거지? 분명 뭔가 다른게 있어..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5d8dc176-9655-4ede-94cc-84539ec7ed62"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal freezes, then in an instant she pulls a note from Enneo's wares. "
"She glances at it and silently hands it to you. There's only one phrase on "
"the note — \"No way out\" — and the image of a spiral comet in place of a "
"signature.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 멈짓하더니 에네오의 물품 상자에서 빠르게 쪽지를 꺼내듭니다. 그녀는 쪽지를 힐끗 훑어보고는 조용히 당신에게 건냅니다. "
"노트에는 단 하나의 구절만 적혀있습니다. \"빠져나갈 곳은 없다\" 그리고 서명 자리에는 소용돌이치는 혜성의 모습이 그려져 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7948d185-d9eb-4ea8-9baf-a35456ccce7f"
msgid ""
"\"True. A conflict of faith, you see. If Enneo is a follower of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, he's certainly a cowardly one. First he attacks me "
"while I was unconscious. Then he tries to kill me by proxy... Is there "
"something I'm missing?\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이야. 신앙의 다툼이군. 보다시피. 만일 에네오가 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 신도라면 확실히 겁쟁이로군. 처음엔 내가 "
"무의식 상태일때 공격을 하고는 이번에 나에게 대리인을 보내어 날 죽이려 했군... 내가 뭔가 놓친 단서가 있으려나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f51dab4e-63cd-4169-b813-ec67a963064f"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your help. I will not distract you further. I will seek out "
"this amateur backstabber, and will inform you immediately of any news. If "
"the half-blood wants to dispatch me to his Goddess, let him do it in person."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"도와주어 고마워. 너를 더이상 방해하지 않겠어. 이 서투른 암살자를 추척하여 곧 소식을 알려주지. 이 혼혈이 나를 죽이고 싶다면 그가 "
"직접 나서도록 해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2d792b4c-609d-46ca-965e-d4d6fcb8287d"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, the spiral comet is a symbol of Pharasma. Long ago, my goddess "
"managed to break free from the grip of the {g|Pharasma}Lady of Graves{/g}. "
"Ever since, she treats {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} very existence as a "
"personal affront. The {d|Enneo}half-blood{/d} must be a particularly zealous "
"follower of Pharasma... He's already tried to kill me twice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론. 소용돌이치는 혜성은 파라즈마의 상징이야. 오래 전 나의 여신은 {g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}의 손아귀에서 가까스로 "
"벗어날 수 있었지. 그 이후로 그녀는 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 존재 자체가 자신에겐 모욕이라고 생각하고 있어. 그 "
"{d|Enneo}혼혈{/d}은 파라즈마의 광적인 추종자임에 틀림없어... 그는 벌써 나를 두번이나 죽이려 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ac7dbc71-3ac1-4a5b-9fd2-63ac28cd288b"
msgid ""
"\"You can count on me. I'll hunt that half-blood even beyond death, if "
"needed.\""
msgstr "\"날 믿어도 돼. 그 혼혈을 죽여서라도 잡을 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "61532203-b0cf-43a4-91de-b5c110250f65"
msgid ""
"\"I think in this case we are dealing with a solitary fanatic. Why kill us "
"by the hands of some elven youths? In any case, your caution is "
"understandable. I had thought I was doing enough to conceal my nature from "
"the public. But It seems I must do more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 고독한 광신도를 상대하고 있는 것 같아. 왜 어린 엘프 녀석에게 죽어야 하지? 어쨌든 너의 경고는 이해가 간다. 나는 내 "
"정체를 숨기고 있다고 생각했는데 더욱 신경을 써야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/FinalCapitalLetter_Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7143de7d-9c95-4d28-b3ae-53365d6b33d9"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps he's both fanatic and fool. He struck me down like a coward in the "
"wastelands — only to see me rise again with renewed strength. Then he used "
"those unfortunate youngsters against me — only to fail again. A lack of "
"scruples can be a strength, but not if one lacks will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도 그는 광신자에다가 멍청이인것 같군. 그는 황무지에서 겁쟁이처럼 나를 내리쳤어. 난 새로운 힘을 얻고 다시 일어서는 모습을 "
"보여주었지. 그리고는 그 불쌍한 어린 엘프들을 이용하여 나를 상대하려 했고 어김없이 또 실패했지. 양심이 부족한건 강점이 될 수 있지만 "
"의지가 부족한건 얘기가 다르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Items/EnneoLetter_name_String
msgctxt "e9196125-8414-44bf-bacd-104fd63ed646"
msgid "Farewell Note from Enneo"
msgstr "에네오의 작별 노트"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Items/EnneoLetter_text_String
msgctxt "74f52fd7-1939-4d92-9f0e-d62ab3c0f3c7"
msgid ""
"\"No way out.\"\n"
"In place of a signature, the note is signed with the image of a comet, "
"curled into a spiral."
msgstr ""
"\"빠져나갈 곳은 없다\"\n"
"서명의 자리에는 소용돌이치는 혜성의 이미지가 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Items/JaethalDagger_description_String
msgctxt "4a49c5c7-fd0f-46d6-b7bc-6e626d60e8c1"
msgid ""
"This dagger is elven-made. It was once beautifully decorated, but now most "
"of the gemstone sockets are empty, and the blade is jagged on one side."
msgstr ""
"이 단도는 엘프가 만든 것입니다. 그것은 한 때 아름답게 장식되었지만 보석이 박혀있던 자리는 비어 있고 칼날은 한쪽으로 들쭉날쭉합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/Items/JaethalDagger_name_String
msgctxt "c846d183-2a97-435a-8df8-75b9770acd4b"
msgid "Jaethal's Old Dagger"
msgstr "제이탈의 오래된 단도"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "41eb65f0-8d0c-44cf-b6cc-5ea0fb3a5a34"
msgid "\"Jaethal? What is this?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 이게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5699c578-c840-4e5d-9d92-11194db8e5f5"
msgid "\"Animating the dead? I had no idea you could do that.\""
msgstr "\"죽은 자를 살려내다니? 네가 그런 것을 할 줄은 몰랐는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d8effbba-23d5-491b-8e6d-bfb3838fee1d"
msgid "\"What foul witchcraft is this?!\""
msgstr "\"더러운 마법을 쓰다니?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "a935170a-6030-4f87-a5b3-5afc37c1da94"
msgid "\"Why did you attack us?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리를 공격 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "92ee7e11-9d45-4cb8-a8b0-937727418d74"
msgid "\"Jaethal, what are you going to do with this poor girl?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 이 가엷은 소녀를 어떻게 할 생각이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "aa6eba21-115b-4d2e-86ee-de29a20e4c09"
msgid "Allowed Jaethal to keep the animated dead."
msgstr "제이탈이 언데드 엘프를 계속 살려두도록 허락하였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "c0eb1894-7610-41a3-8921-bdc9d788513b"
msgid ""
"\"I've made a decision. The girl should not die. Being undead is better than "
"being dead.\""
msgstr "\"결정을 내렸어. 소녀가 죽어서는 안돼. 차라리 언데드가 되는 것이 죽은 것보다 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ae60790a-bcb1-450d-9005-f90336fb3606"
msgid "Did not allow Jaethal to keep the animated dead."
msgstr "제이탈이 언데드 엘프를 계속 살려두도록 허락하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "14d6d6a3-c925-48ac-b119-0992e2dca69e"
msgid ""
"\"I've made a decision. You should allow the poor girl to die, Jaethal. This "
"is her wish, plus — for some, eternity might not be a gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"결정을 내렸어. 그 가여운 소녀가 죽을 수 있게 둬야 해. 제이탈. 이건 그녀의 바램이기도 하고 게다가 영생은 누군가에게는 선물이 "
"아닐 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "b170e17a-adfc-41a4-a350-84bb5208967e"
msgid "\"Who was this wanderer who claimed that Jaethal was chasing you?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈이 너를 쫓고 있다고 얘기한 그 방랑자는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "10fac4de-205e-42d5-a7e0-9be28dd136b0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure that someone laid a false track straight to the elven camp, and "
"convinced the elves that we were hunting them. Everything points to this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가 거짓 단서들을 흘려 엘프 캠프로 우리가 찾아오도록 유도하고, 엘프들에게 우리가 그들을 사냥하고있다고 믿게했군. 모든게 맞아 "
"떨어져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "6dd3ee4a-011a-4bb7-88c4-499e5346aea2"
msgid "\"I've heard enough of this story. Let us go.\""
msgstr "\"충분히 들었다. 우리를 놓아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1e300085-a3f0-404e-a592-4e56b6f8a43b"
msgid ""
"Realized that some evil schemer drew you into the conflict with innocent "
"elves and expressed your indignation."
msgstr "어떤 사악한 음모꾼이 당신과 무고한 엘프들간의 갈등을 유도하였다는 것을 깨닫고 분노를 표출하였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "c46cec36-bca3-41e7-a7ad-5df394025f02"
msgid ""
"\"If Enneo really deceived both us and these elves, forcing us to shed "
"innocent blood, then he must be made to pay.\""
msgstr "\"에네오가 우리와 엘프들 모두를 속여서 무고한 피를 흘리게 했다면, 반드시 대가를 치르게 해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "8d3be171-d127-4ac1-8eaf-2ea0116cafa8"
msgid ""
"\"I do not know who to believe in this story. Did the merchant deceive us, "
"or is this girl lying?\""
msgstr "\"난 누구를 믿어야할지 모르겠군. 에네오가 우리를 속인 걸까? 아니면 이 소녀가 거짓말하는 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0040_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d79b448b-5904-4e4e-bb80-66697da9cf94"
msgid ""
"Stated that though you respect a clever scheme, those who plot against you "
"will regret it."
msgstr "교활한 계략은 존중하지만 당신에게 대항하는 자들은 후회하게 될 것이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "66734627-1501-47bc-a666-60d01be50645"
msgid ""
"\"I respect cunning and intrigue. But anyone who tries to use them against "
"me will deeply regret it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 계략과 음모를 존중해. 하지만 그들을 이용하여 나에게 대항하려는 자가 있다면 그게 누구든 깊이 후회하게 만들어 주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "399ea524-e2c9-4b6d-8628-5e68e676cebf"
msgid ""
"\"We cannot be sure of anything. Let's go to the capital and talk to Enneo "
"again.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 확신할 순 없어. 수도로 가서 에네오와 다시 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "937eda77-697e-41f4-8a0d-6efc5bd3feaa"
msgid ""
"Stated that the elves who attacked you due to Enneo's plot deserved to be "
"killed for their naivete and foolishness."
msgstr "에네오의 음모로 당신을 공격한 엘프들은 죽어 마땅하다고 얘기했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "14eb733f-28c9-407d-b909-9d3b9c25c1a6"
msgid ""
"\"The elves deserved to die. Their naivety and stupidity alone are good "
"enough reasons to kill them.\""
msgstr "\"엘프들은 죽어 마땅해. 그들의 순진함과 멍청함만으로도 죽일 만한 충분한 이유가 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d147a4fe-c439-4991-bee7-5a0ecff38ed4"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal freezes in front of the dead elven girl. It's hard to read "
"anything on the inquisitor's face, but her posture suggests tension, the "
"trembling force of a tightly stretched bowstring.{/n} \"What a lovely "
"child... and she looks so like my Nortellara. Even death could not twist her "
"beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 죽은 엘프 소녀 앞에서 얼어 붙습니다. 인퀴지터의 표정을 읽는 것은 어렵지만 그녀의 자세에서 팽팽하게 뻗은 활시위의 "
"떨림같은 긴장감이 느껴집니다.{/n} \"이 사랑스러운 아이... 나의 노텔라라와 너무나 닮았어. 죽음조차 그 아름다움을 훼손하지 "
"못했구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0b2cf0a7-4744-4367-aca5-debeb04c1685"
msgid ""
"{n}With a blank look in her eyes, Jaethal passes her hand above the girl's "
"body. The feeling of an oppressive force, cold and painful, becomes nearly "
"physical. A convulsion passes through the body of the dead elven girl. With "
"a quiet moan turning into a cry, the corpse opens her eyes and rises. "
"Jaethal looks at her in amazement, as if she surprised by what she has "
"done.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀의 눈에 공허함이 보이고 제이탈은 소녀의 시체를 쓸어내립니다. 차가움과 고통스러움은 육체적으로 변합니다. 경련이 죽은 엘프 "
"소녀를 통과합니다. 조용한 신음소리가 울음소리로 바뀌면서 시체는 눈을 뜨고 일어납니다. 제이탈은 자신이 한 일에 놀라는 듯 놀란 눈으로 "
"그녀를 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d788aafb-c1ea-4cb3-8ea5-58b715065bda"
msgid ""
"\"I... sense the touch of my goddess.\" {n}Jaethal stares at the elven "
"girl.{/n} \"So that's it... I knew that I hadn't fully mastered the powers "
"granted me, and here's the proof. A new side to my gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 여신의 손길을 느꼈다.\" {n}제이탈은 엘프 소녀를 쳐다봤습니다.{/n} \"다 되었다...나는 내안의 능력을 완전히 "
"터득하지 못했다는 것을 알고있었어. 여기 그 증거가 있군. 나의 새로운 능력.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ce852ab9-49b6-4665-b7bc-9632c69ef92f"
msgid ""
"\"I never knew of this side of my power. Something has awakened in me... the "
"ability to share {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} gift.\" {n}Jaethal studies her "
"newly created undead with the look of a sculptor contemplating her creation. "
"Withering under this stare, the undead girl begins to tremble.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 능력중에 이런 힘이 있는지 전혀 몰랐어. 내 안에서 뭔가가 깨어났어... {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물을 공유하는 "
"능력이..\"{n}제이탈은 조각가가 자신의 작품을 보듯 자신이 만든 언데드를 봅니다. 그녀의 눈빛에 소녀는 떨기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "501ace5a-eda9-4ada-aa44-60b5c3e1f5cb"
msgid ""
"\"The same 'foul witchcraft' that brought me back to life. And I prefer to "
"call it a 'divine gift'.\" {n}Jaethal looks at the elven girl as if admiring "
"well-crafted work.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나를 다시 살아나게 했던 바로 그 '더러운 마법'이군. 나는 이것을 '신성한 선물'이라 부르겠다.\" {n}제이탈은 잘 만들어진 "
"작품에 감탄하는 것처럼 엘프 소녀를 쳐다 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : ElfAlchemistLevel3_JaethalQ1_raised
msgctxt "239fcef2-5d6c-4a8e-87e8-938b18bfdcfd"
msgid "\"What have you done to me?! What is this?!\""
msgstr "\"나한테 무슨 짓을 한거야?! 이게 뭐지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9b449df3-373e-4576-b7c8-3f5f3ad6a42c"
msgid ""
"\"I saved you from oblivion — you and all your beauty, foolish child. Now "
"you bear {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} gift, just as I. You are 'undead' — if "
"you prefer the word used by uncomprehending narrow minds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 너의 아름다움을 죽음에서 구해냈다. 어리석은 아이야. 이제 {g|Urgathoa} 우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물을 받아들여라. 너는 "
"언데드다. 너의 좁아터진 상식을 빌린다면 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : ElfAlchemistLevel3_JaethalQ1_raised
msgctxt "ea84349b-bb19-408c-8491-556108d85329"
msgid ""
"\"No... no... It's better I follow my friends into death than to become a "
"disgusting undead creature...\" {n}An unnaturally strong convulsion shakes "
"the girl's body. She glares at you.{/n} \"I beg you for mercy! She doesn't "
"have a heart, but you're different, you still live. Let me die! Put me out "
"of my misery...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니... 아니야... 역겨운 언데드가 되느니 친구를 따라 죽겠어...\" {n}부자연스러운 경련으로 소녀의 시체가 떨립니다. 그녀는 "
"당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"너에게 부탁할께! 저 여자는 마음이 없지만 너는 달라. 너는 살아있으니까. 나를 죽여줘! 이 고통에서 "
"구해줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e19316aa-d4e0-4c7d-8c98-5173732885a0"
msgid ""
"\"I will not harm her... and I will not let her harm herself. She is "
"frightened, and does not understand the gift she just received. Elves live "
"long lives, but they are still subjects of time. Only "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} gift can shield them from it. Eternal life, "
"eternal youth, eternal immortal beauty... can anything else be compared to "
"this?\" {n}Jaethal says the last words thoughtfully as if the answer is not "
"entirely clear to her.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그녀를 해치지 않을 거야... 그리고 스스로 죽는 것도 내버려두지 않겠어. 그녀는 겁을 먹었고 자신이 받은 선물을 깨닫지 "
"못했어. 엘프는 오래 살지만 그것도 정해진 시간에서일 뿐이다. {g|Urgathoa} 우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물만이 그녀를 보호할 수 "
"있다. 불멸의 삶과 젊음 그리고 시들지 않는 아름다움... 무엇에 이걸 비교하랴?\" {n}제이탈은 마지막 말을 할 때 확신에 서지 않는 "
"것처럼 머뭇거렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : ElfAlchemistLevel3_JaethalQ1_raised
msgctxt "ceccb90b-414e-4f82-a5c2-2da613bf5d28"
msgid ""
"{n}The wide eyes of the elven girl are filled with confusion.{/n} \"We only "
"meant to protect ourselves! The wanderer warned us that this monster was "
"chasing us.\" {n}The elf points at the icy-calm Jaethal.{/n} \"He told us "
"that she sought new sacrifices! Everyone in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} knows that "
"she killed elves for the sake of her damned goddess, and still she managed "
"to get away with it — walked freely into exile. If we had known that she "
"would track us down, we would never have left the forests of our homeland..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프 소녀의 커다란 눈은 혼란으로 가득 차있습니다.{/n} \"우린 우리 자신을 보호하려고 했을 뿐이야!! 방랑자가 경고하기를 "
"괴물이 우리를 쫓고있다고 했어.\" {n}엘프는 얼음장 같은 제이탈을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"그녀가 새로운 제물을 찾고 있다고 그가 "
"말했어! 그녀가 저주받은 여신에게 엘프들을 죽여 바쳤고 살아서 도시를 빠져나가 유배중이라는 것을 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}의 모든 "
"사람들은 다 알고있어. 그녀가 우리를 추적한 걸 알았다면 고향을 절대 떠나지 않았을꺼야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fd3ea22a-84ef-4e9e-8843-bfa8b546b81f"
msgid ""
"\"No one can be forced into happiness, Jaethal,\" {n}Tristian says "
"passionately.{/n} \"Especially with such a 'gift'. {name}, please — end this "
"poor soul's torment. Let her die as she wishes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무도 행복을 강요당할 수는 없어. 제이탈. \" {n}트리스티안은 열정적으로 말합니다.{/n} \"특히 그런 '선물'을 가지고 "
"말이야. {name}. 이 불쌍한 영혼의 고통을 끝내요. 그녀가 원하는대로 죽게 하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "23447d6a-eeb6-4df0-8a8a-a2c234d2e971"
msgid ""
"\"I hope, Jaethal, that you feel sorry for the senseless death of this "
"unfortunate girl, and wish to help her in your way. — And you're not just "
"entertaining yourself, as you usually do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제이탈. 이 불행한 소녀의 죽음을 조금이라도 이해하고 그녀를 보내주길 바라. 너는 단순한 흥미거리를 찾지 않는 걸 나는 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : ElfAlchemistLevel3_JaethalQ1_raised
msgctxt "83b569ef-e174-4da7-9a45-d0647c29534b"
msgid ""
"\"We knew him as Wanderer, but it's only a nickname. I do not know what his "
"true name is. He is a half-elf. My friends knew him... they said that he has "
"a wanderer's soul, that takes him from one place to another. I've seen him a "
"couple of times in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}, and recently I've seen him on the "
"road. He caught up with us to warn us of the danger. He has brown hair and "
"yellow-green eyes, like a cat... Please! I don't know anything else. Release "
"me. Every moment in this lifeless body drives me mad.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그를 방랑자라고 불렀지만 그건 그저 별명이었어. 그의 진짜 이름은 나도 몰라. 그는 하프엘프야. 그를 알고 있는 내 친구들은 "
"그가 방랑벽이 있어 자주 떠돈다고 했어. 난 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 두어번 봤을 뿐이고 최근에는 길에서 본 적이 있어. "
"우리에게 위험을 경고해주려고 말을 걸어왔어. 그는 갈색 머리에 눈동자는 고양이 같은 밝은 초록색이었어... 도와줘! 더 이상은 몰라. "
"나를 놓아줘. 이 죽어버린 몸뚱이에 있는 매 순간이 괴로워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : ElfAlchemistLevel3_JaethalQ1_raised
msgctxt "93b6405c-1cba-4cee-84b6-5553f675d250"
msgid ""
"{n}With a sharp, awkward movement, like a hinged doll, the elf bends her "
"neck and rests her head on her shoulder, silently looking at you with wide, "
"empty eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}짧은 순간 관절인형처럼 엘프 소녀의 목은 아래로 축 쳐지고는 조용히 당신을 공허한 눈으로 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5cf60d9a-75db-46ed-b460-73e663ba2090"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal frowns.{/n} \"I cannot disobey my patron and master of these "
"lands. However, I hope that you will not make a habit of disposing of "
"valuable resources like that. Such waste is bad for both the ruler and "
"{mf|his|her} subjects.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나의 동료의 뜻을 져버릴 수는 없어. 하지만 저런 귀중한 자원을 저렇게 버리는 데에 취미를 가지지 "
"말았으면 하는군. 그런 낭비는 통치자와 {mf|그의|그녀의} 백성 모두에게 낭비다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6c00f33d-93bc-44e6-b196-62379d01d43e"
msgid ""
"\"Can't believe I say it, but I agree with the corpsy one. Everyone can fall "
"down and die. You don't need no bravery or brains for that. If you fall, you "
"must get up and move on. I've done it many times, and I bet this elfie will "
"be able to get back up too, after she pull herself together. Too bad to be "
"undead? Worse to be really dead, or when you give up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 이런 말을 한다는 게 믿기지 않지만, 그녀의 말에 동의해. 누구나 쓰러지고 죽을수 있어. 넌 그것을 위해 용기도, 머리도 필요 "
"없다. 넘어지면 그저 일어나서 움직이면 되는 거야. 나도 그래왔고 이 엘프 소녀도 다시 일어날 것이다. 언데드가 되어 안됐다고? 아에 "
"죽어버리거나 포기한다면 그것이 최악이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d71643c2-131a-4aa7-815c-08313f015e21"
msgid ""
"\"Why would someone prolong the senseless agony of being, when one can be "
"finished with it once and for all? I do not like this.\" {n}Harrim shakes "
"his head in condemnation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"한 방이면 끝날 것을 왜 무의미한 고통뿐인 삶을 연장하는 거야? 끔찍하네.\" {n}하림은 절래절래 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f2157ef8-05d9-42c2-8deb-93f0bf6a0daf"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful. I shall send her to the capital and find some useful tasks for "
"her.\""
msgstr "\"놀라워. 그녀를 수도로 보내 쓸만한 일을 시켜야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "baefef50-9c1c-4d48-afc6-fcbf94027969"
msgid ""
"\"And we know who did this, do we not? A sudden appearance, a dagger, a "
"false trail... The {d|Enneo}half-blood{/d} will have many questions to "
"answer. I'll start with 'why did you kill me?' and finish with 'how pathetic "
"do you feel now, having failed twice to send me to oblivion?'\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 이랬는지 알아? 갑작스러운 등장, 단도, 거짓 흔적... 그 {d|Enneo} 혼혈 {/d}이 실마리를 쥐고 있다. 왜 나를 "
"죽이려 했냐는 질문으로 시작해 마지막에는 나를 죽이는 것이 그리도 힘들었냐고 비웃어줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a366b1b1-af98-4d05-80b6-d2aa50f332e7"
msgid ""
"\"You do not even want to know what really happened? Well, I already have "
"some ideas about it. And someone — namely, the damned {d|Enneo}half-blood{/d}"
" — will have many questions to answer on our return to the capital.\""
msgstr "\"진실을 알고 싶지 않나? 내가 좀 알고 있지. 다름아닌 그 망할 {d|에네오} 혼혈 {/d}이 실마리를 쥐고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1d1df0f4-6a33-4e3c-a5e6-6a5d64c9a0eb"
msgid ""
"\"So far, it all points to one thing — the {d|Enneo}half-blood{/d} lied to "
"us. And he did not merely lie. It was he who killed me in the wastelands. He "
"took the dagger, then planted it in his own shop for me to find. Scared the "
"elves with his lies, and intentionally sent us here\"."
msgstr ""
"\"모든 단서가 한 곳을 가리킨다. 그 {d|Enneo}혼혈{/d}이 우리에게 거짓말을 했어. 버려진 땅에서 나를 죽인 자도 그다. 그가 "
"단도를 가져가서 내가 보도록 유도했다. 거짓말로 엘프들을 겁주어서 우리를 여기로 오게 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9eb5ad99-0b97-4765-b10b-e5b8cad2df2e"
msgid ""
"\"You see, now we both have something to ask the half-blood about. This will "
"be amusing. Let us hurry to the capital!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 이제 하프엘프에게 물어볼 질문이 생겼군. 재밌을 거야. 서둘러 수도로 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "46cbc3d2-b68e-4569-8a25-0424e9bf79bb"
msgid ""
"\"True. Let's hurry to the capital. I'm looking forward to seeing… my killer."
"\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 서둘러 수도로 가자. 나를 죽이려 한 암살자를 보고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c8df7f6b-b4c9-4aed-a55a-f70aa445c3c6"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly. Let's have a little chat.\" {n}Jaethal seems stony calm and "
"indifferent, but this indifference is more frightening than anger. {/n}\"Let "
"us hurry!\""
msgstr ""
"\"확실해. 잠시 얘기좀 하지.\" {n}제이탈은 돌처럼 평온해 보이지만 그 속에는 분노가 아닌 두려움이 숨어있었습니다.{/n} \"서둘러"
"!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q1_Investigate_My_Death/RaiseUndead_Dialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7efdf56d-4b53-4742-8f12-c3b99c8eafde"
msgid ""
"\"You may be right. Still, I always feel sorry when youth and beauty are "
"wasted. But let's hurry to the capital! We have much to discuss with the "
"half-blood.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 맞을지도 몰라. 나는 젊음과 아름다움이 시드는 것이 안타까웠어. 서둘러 수도로 가자! 그 혼혈 녀석과 해야 할 이야기가 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/AfterBattle/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "623b961b-5a8f-4424-b486-396327e0fbf0"
msgid ""
"{n}Enneo stands with his eyes half-closed, as if resting — or listening to "
"something inaudible.{/n} \"It's strange. I had no doubt that today it would "
"be my turn to visit {g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} court — not the chosen one of "
"the most disgusting of the deities. It seems the term of my service is not "
"over yet. Which means there are yet more monsters which will soon kiss their "
"un-life goodbye.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에네오는 눈이 반쯤 감긴 채로 무언가를 듣는 것 같기도 하고 쉬는 것 같기도 합니다.{/n} \"이상하군. 오늘은 "
"{g|Pharasma} 파라즈마 's{/g} 궁전에 방문하는 날인 줄 알았는데. 아직 내 의무는 끝나지 않은 것 같군. 아직 보내야 할 "
"언데드 녀석들이 남았나 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/AfterBattle/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "311805ee-7f65-4c0a-abd3-c686d321e5d1"
msgid ""
"\"You helped cure a terrible plague. Accept the gratitude of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} faithful servant — and this reward.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 끔찍한 역병을 치료하게 네가 도왔다. {g|Pharasma} 파라즈마 's{/g}의 충실한 종인 나의 감사를 받아. 이것은 "
"보상이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Barks/EnneoAfterAll_String
msgctxt "05efd49a-a82b-417d-8fcb-60e07701bbb7"
msgid ""
"\"You helped cure a terrible plague. Accept the gratitude of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} faithful servant — and this reward.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 끔찍한 역병을 치료하게 네가 도왔다. {g|Pharasma} 파라즈마 's{/g}의 충실한 종인 나의 감사를 받아. 이것은 "
"보상이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Barks/TanekaAfterAll_String
msgctxt "b73af70f-f8a9-4a3c-8679-545168eaa41b"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, sister, and you, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. My journey in "
"this world is not over yet.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 모두. 내 여행은 아직 끝나지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Barks/TanekaWithoutJaethal_String
msgctxt "e9de94fb-8cf0-409e-b25b-1ef294effdc5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm just an old, lonely pilgrim, living out the rest of my days. Please, "
"just leave me alone.\""
msgstr "\"나는 평범하고 외로운 순례자일 뿐이야. 내 여생을 마무리하게 나를 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "9eaa38c8-33a0-4a21-866a-6ee3ffad835d"
msgid "\"Time to explain yourself, Enneo.\""
msgstr "\"변명할 시간을 주겠다. 에네오\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e386646d-d428-4d73-b2aa-78bc239b1574"
msgid "[Attack] \"You've grown tiresome. Defend yourself!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너 때문에 지치는군. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "8ee30c83-4f27-4c15-8d18-a52153d42d7a"
msgid ""
"\"So, you deliberately sent the elves to their deaths? They weren't undead. "
"What grudge did you hold with them?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 엘프들을 죽게 두었어? 그들은 언데드가 아니었어. 도대체 그들에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "2dd9ff51-328f-405f-bbd9-c6182dbb53b8"
msgid "\"Why did you kill Taneka's daughters?\""
msgstr "\"왜 타네카의 딸을 죽였어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "597d9d1b-39f7-487c-85ab-f8bbe102829b"
msgid "\"That's all well and good. But why do you come here now?\""
msgstr "\"다 좋아. 하지만 왜 여기로 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "23d97915-5e22-4928-b1f9-784575cf54f0"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I've heard enough, and now it's your turn to feel the blade!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"충분히 들었다. 이제 내 칼맛좀 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9fe47d36-084e-42b5-a00c-4ef4a2ae1aeb"
msgid ""
"Chose to fight against Jaethal, seeing her as an evil undead murderer who "
"won't ever change."
msgstr "변치 않는 악한 언데드인 제이탈과 싸웁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "8df3744c-b690-4801-8fbd-6300692b6012"
msgid ""
"[Side with Enneo] \"It was a mistake for me to ally with an undead murderer. "
"I now know that Jaethal will never stop, and I must support you, Enneo.\""
msgstr ""
"[에네오의 편에 섭니다] \"언데드 살인자를 동료로 들이는 것은 실수였어. 제이탈은 멈추지 않을 거야. 너를 돕겠어. 에네오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5158c19e-9bb8-4620-a852-a60b3701b7b8"
msgid ""
"Chose to fight against Enneo to save Jaethal's life due to her continued "
"loyalty to you."
msgstr "당신에게 충성하는 제이탈의 목숨을 구하기 위해 에네오와 싸웁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "4e46c02b-f060-4cd6-b14c-c50d477c0622"
msgid ""
"[Side with Jaethal] \"Jaethal has served me well. I cannot allow you to kill "
"her.\""
msgstr "[제이탈의 편에 섭니다] \"제이탈은 나를 잘 섬겼다. 그녀를 죽게 둘 순 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "56fc3e0e-b06e-463d-b1ef-415c211a0c53"
msgid ""
"Chose to fight against Enneo regardless of the crimes on both sides, just to "
"kill the one who didn't serve you."
msgstr "둘 모두에게 죄가 있음에도 당신을 섬기지 않는 에네오를 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "e297c1bd-2bfa-4660-bd11-faf0ae3718e2"
msgid ""
"[Side with Jaethal] \"I care nothing for such nonsense as the blood of the "
"innocent. But I can control Jaethal, and that's more than I can say for you. "
"Which is unfortunate for you.\""
msgstr "[제이탈의 편에 섭니다] \"죄가 있건 없건 상관 없어. 하지만 제이탈은 내 편이고 그건 너에게 불행한 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3007ec1b-bbff-423a-9f2c-8b3bef347482"
msgid ""
"Chose to fight against Jaethal because the presence of an undead follower of "
"Urgathoa threatened your reputation."
msgstr "당신의 명성을 더럽힐 수 있는 우르가쏘아의 추종자인 제이탈과 싸움을 선택합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "852ca089-07b2-434c-b8ac-3e1d417ed67b"
msgid ""
"[Side with Enneo] \"Allegiance with an undead follower of a dangerous cult — "
"this is harmful to my reputation. That's my only reason for supporting you, "
"Enneo.\""
msgstr "[에네오의 편에 섭니다] \"어둠의 숭배자를 동료로 두는 것은 내 명성에 금이 갈 수 있어. 그러니 너를 돕지, 에네오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "59a72b0f-22da-4109-a0c9-e6a81407b441"
msgid ""
"Chose to fight against Enneo, seeing him as a dangerous fanatic who was "
"guilty of killing innocents."
msgstr "무고한 자들을 죽인 광신도인 에네오와의 싸움을 선택합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "30d5905f-63ca-4c22-a260-fb99cb5f392d"
msgid ""
"[Side with Jaethal] \"You are a dangerous fanatic! Innocent people have died "
"because of you. More blood may be spilled unless you are stopped.\""
msgstr ""
"[제이탈의 편에 섭니다] \"너는 위험한 광신도야. 너 때문에 무고한 사람들이 죽었어. 널 멈추지 않으면 유혈사태는 더욱 많이 일어나겠지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "50bc21aa-2e63-48fe-96e6-512261de6ccc"
msgid "\"Did you track down Jaethal right after her expulsion from Kyonin?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈이 쿄닌에서 추방 된 직후 계속 추적했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "f837688b-2a6f-441a-98fa-baf2a53c151c"
msgid ""
"{n}The false merchant {d|Enneo}Enneo{/d} walks towards you with an easy "
"gait. His calm friendliness has disappeared, like a mask fallen from his "
"face. His clothes are decorated with the easily-distinguishable symbol of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}.{/n} \"I hope you've settled all your affairs with "
"the poor old exile? It was an interesting show to watch.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}가짜 상인 {d|Enneo} 에네오 {/d}는 가벼운 걸음으로 당신에게 접근합니다. 그의 차분한 친절함은 가면을 걷어내듯 "
"사라졌습니다. 그의 옷은 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 상징으로 장식되어 있습니다.{/n} \"노인네와 용무가 다 끝났길 "
"바라는군? 흥미로운 볼거리였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "7dce8056-7ad6-4d4f-a69e-c56b3b9dbaaf"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have much to add, beyond what I'm sure you already know. I'm the "
"inquisitor of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, and for almost forty years I've "
"hunted the undead and cultists of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}, for the glory of "
"the Lady of Graves. I destroyed Taneka's coven. I tracked Jaethal into the "
"wasteland and killed her — only to find that her hideous deity returned her "
"to 'life'. To put an end to that, I made use of a company of naive young "
"elves from a camp near the {g|Thorn River}Thorn River{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 모두 알고 있어서 더 할 말이 없어. 나는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 추종자로 무덤의 여인의 영광을 위해 거의 40 "
"년 동안 언데드들과 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 사교도들을 사냥했고 타네카의 집회를 파괴했어. 제이탈을 황무지까지 추적해서 "
"그녀를 죽였지만 그 몹쓸 신이 그녀에게 새로운 생명을 주었지. 나는 {g|Thorn River} 가시 강{/g} 주변 캠프의 어린 "
"엘프들을 이용했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaClericRaised
msgctxt "26283b83-2a01-436e-8be9-eb39211f8064"
msgid ""
"{n}The undead priestess tightens like a predator preparing to strike.{/n} "
"\"You... so many years later, and you come to me again. Why are you here? "
"Why stand once more between me and immortality?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}언데드 사제는 뛰어드는 포식자처럼 몸을 웅크립니다.{/n} \"오랜 세월이 지났는데 다시 나에게 왔구나. 왜 여기에 있어? 왜 나와 "
"불멸자 사이에 다시 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "66f0e40c-cfa9-4d45-b44f-049b82d84725"
msgid ""
"\"What a stunning frankness.\" {n}Jaethal smiles lightly, almost "
"affectionately.{/n} \"Did you imagine, half-blood, that those youngsters "
"could handle me and the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}?"
msgstr ""
"\"참으로 솔직하구나.\" {n}제이탈은 거의 다정해 보일 정도로 가볍게 웃습니다.{/n} \"이 어린 것들이 나와 "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}을 어찌할 수 있으리라 생각했나, 잡종?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "c9376727-0d1f-44fe-9da5-d13e6f0d57aa"
msgid ""
"\"Do not be so naive, inquisitor. I held no hope that the young elves would "
"kill either you or your defender. No, I wanted you, rather, to kill them. "
"And I did all I could to inform their relatives in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} of "
"the horrible violence you perpetrated. Retribution will follow, sooner or "
"later. One lonely warrior of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} may fail, but three "
"elven clans will find a way to exact their revenge. There's no way out, "
"Jaethal. Not for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"순진하게 굴지 말라고. 어린 엘프가 너나 너의 보호자를 죽일거라고 바라지는 않았어. 오히려 네가 그 애송이들을 죽이기를 바랬었지. "
"그래야 네가 저지른 짓을 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}의 가족들에게 알릴 수 있으니까. 조만간 너에게 보복이 따를 거야. "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 추종자는 실패했겠지만 3개의 엘프 클랜은 복수를 할 테니까. 빠져나갈 구멍은 없어. 제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "c79b5ee2-4232-4920-b62a-f6de0d72dcab"
msgid ""
"\"They were a necessary tool to complete my mission. In my youth, I thought "
"the best decision was a bold, honest battle against apostates and monsters. "
"But I learned much from my struggle against Taneka. There's nothing worse "
"than seeing an abomination rise before you, and being powerless to strike it "
"down. One must use any method available.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 나의 사명을 완수하는 데 필요한 도구였어. 어렸을 때 나는 괴물에 맞서는 최고의 전략은 용기라고 생각했지. 하지만 타네카와 "
"맞서면서 더 많은 것을 배웠어. 너보다 혐오스럽고 추적하기 쉬운 사냥감은 없었다. 못하는 게 바보였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "1b5c8b0b-1f5d-4d2f-bbf4-9babf17210d0"
msgid ""
"\"They were necessary for her disgusting ritual, and their death was my only "
"chance to prevent it. Do not forget who I serve. Their honest deaths, and "
"their souls' journey to {g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} judgment, was a far "
"better fate than their mother had prepared for them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 여자들은 그 역겨운 의식에 필수여서 죽여야만 놈들을 막을 수 있었어. 내가 섬기는 신을 잊지 마. 제물로 인생을 끝마치는 것 보단 "
"{g|Pharasma} 파라즈마{/g}의 심판대로 가는 편이 훨씬 나았을 걸\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "1b07987e-a841-41e8-a576-215ccb960dbc"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to talk to you, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. My hunt for "
"Jaethal is the greatest work of my life. She is the living example of the "
"hideous essence of the cult of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}, the distortion of "
"the world order, and the triumph of the evil intentions of her vile deity. "
"Even if I die today, this story will end the way I intended. But you can "
"still change your own role in it, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 이야기하고 싶었다. {name}. 제이탈을 사냥하는 것은 내 인생에서 가장 위대한 임무야. 그녀는 "
"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g} 교단의 끔찍한 본질, 세계 질서의 왜곡, 그리고 비열한 신의 사악한 의도의 승리를 보여주는 "
"살아있는 본보기이다. 오늘 내가 죽는데도, 이 이야기는 의도했던 대로 끝날 것이다. 하지만 넌 여전히 입장을 바꿀 수 있으니 생각해 봐. "
"{name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "041abeb2-7aca-466a-a87a-60f310cf7aa5"
msgid "\"You've been playing games for too long, zealot.\""
msgstr "\"너는 너무나 오랫동안 음모를 꾸몄어. 광신도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "b4b46539-1cdb-46e5-9626-37375e24b896"
msgid ""
"{n}Enneo allows himself to smile for the first time. {/n} \"I've heard this "
"so many times, even among the priests of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}. There are "
"many who think my faith is insane, and my methods cruel and excessive. But "
"that is the fate of the inquisitor. Loneliness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에네오는 처음으로 진심인듯한 웃음을 내보입니다.{/n} \"그 소리는 이미 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 사제들한테도 귀에 "
"딱지가 앉도록 들었어. 내가 미쳤다고 내가 하는 짓들은 제 정신이 아니라고 말이야. 하지만 그게 심문관의 운명이야. 고독하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7421752b-a63f-44c0-9637-53239a2025a5"
msgid "\"No. No! I cannot die, I will not die!\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 아니야! 나는 죽을 수 없어! 죽지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaClericRaised
msgctxt "a289e66f-924e-40f2-a674-5841240f6910"
msgid "\"I was so eager to attain un-life, and now to lose it so quickly...\""
msgstr "\"언데드를 잡으려고 노력했지만 이제는 쉽게 놓아주다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "c299cbb4-a2e1-40f1-816b-3ebc2f8113db"
msgid "\"Everything will proceed as I have planned, with or without me.\""
msgstr "\"내가 없어도 모든 것이 계획대로 진행될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaClericRaised
msgctxt "9a93d1d3-382a-4b8c-adb2-5f4e9bd88af1"
msgid "\"Well, I shall risk immortality for your death, Pharasmite.\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽기 위해 내 불멸도 반납해야 한다면 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : EnneoInquisitor
msgctxt "d62d1f3e-9074-4b14-98e6-01cd2561d917"
msgid ""
"\"Immediately after the trial. I was born in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} and often "
"visited. It is uncommon for high-society ladies to perform ritual murders "
"for the glory of the dark goddess, so the news quickly reached my native "
"{g|Greengold}Greengold{/g}, and soon came to me. When later, the elves "
"sentenced her to exile, rather than the usual life imprisonment — well, how "
"could I stay away?\""
msgstr ""
"\"심판 직후의 일이었어. 나는 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 태어났고 그곳을 자주 방문했어. 고위 계층의 여성이 어둠의 신에게 "
"의식을 하는 것은 흔치 않는 일이었고 소식은 {g|Greengold}그린골드{/g}의 고향 사람들에게 알려졌고 나도 알게 되었다. 그 "
"후에 엘프들은 그녀를 추방하기로 했다. 종신형이 아니라. 나는 고향에 머무를 수가 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "099d0538-b465-493f-b0fa-d6d14c85a57f"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing can justify the blood on your hands and the stain on your "
"conscience! The law is strict, but it should not take innocent lives to "
"punish the guilty.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 것도 네 손에 묻은 피를 정당화할 수 없어! 법은 엄하지만 무고한 사람들을 처벌하지는 말아야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e09b6f2f-e4d6-480a-bc91-a78a7a0b1c3e"
msgid "\"Sharp lad! I like you.\""
msgstr "\"눈치가 좋군! 맞아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2925f796-e9a0-4c13-8ab4-08f52a42d310"
msgid ""
"\"The dead one's scum, of course, but at least she's our scum. And she "
"always helps in fights. But I don't like this other guy at all! He lied to "
"us, told us tales. So let him beat it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"산 송장이긴 하지만 제이탈은 내 동료야. 항상 나를 도와줬지. 그런데 네놈은 마음에 안 들어! 우리한테 거짓말을 했잖아. 그러니까 "
"저놈을 때려눕히자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "13b0ed59-a71b-4814-8ad8-cc297a13ab4b"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal's been dead for a long time. A dead heart, and a dead soul. Let "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}'s inquisitor commit his judgment — the world will "
"sigh with relief.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제이탈은 오랫동안 죽었어. 심장도 차갑고 영혼도 메말랐지. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 심문자가 심판을 하도록 두자. "
"세상은 평온해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5ea560b5-f70a-48c9-8a89-21cc7219358b"
msgid ""
"\"First goddess. Second goddess. Nope, not gonna mess with them. But I know "
"for sure: my goddess is better.\""
msgstr "\"이 여신도 그렇고. 저 여신도 그렇고. 나는 그들과 얽히지 않을 거야. 우리 여신이 최고야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "c824e371-874f-4b83-b373-d31480b674bf"
msgid ""
"\"What use is a dead horse in a harness? Let's be rid of her. First she lost "
"her position and respect, then she lost her life. Who needs a servant like "
"her?\""
msgstr ""
"\"달리지 못하는 말이 무슨 소용이야? 그녀가 죽게 두자. 그녀는 명예를 잃었고 삶도 잃었어. 그녀와 같은 동료를 누가 원할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Enneo_Dialog/Cue_0047_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f27cd8af-8459-409e-b907-12ff710cebde"
msgid ""
"\"What use is a dead horse in a harness? Let's be rid of her. First she lost "
"her position and respect, then she lost her life. Who needs a servant like "
"her?\""
msgstr ""
"\"달리지 못하는 말이 무슨 소용이야? 그녀가 죽게 두자. 그녀는 명예를 잃었고 삶도 잃었어. 그녀와 같은 동료를 누가 원할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "82b2b5c1-8e2d-4012-b46f-b80e52497c01"
msgid "\"Who are you? What do you want from us?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야? 우리에게서 원하는게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "703b4a10-d79c-44a4-9544-1dec128c8a2a"
msgid "\"What do you know about Jaethal? Why are you seeking her help?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈에 대해 무엇을 알고 있지? 왜 그녀의 도움을 구하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9d90a5c5-df4d-4f53-ba80-dcfb8f80c1e7"
msgid "\"Wait. Tell me more about what happened to you.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐 너한테 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "df4f5969-e09e-4ab4-ae2c-0f1f6cec5870"
msgid "\"Let's talk some other time. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"다른 시간에 얘기하자. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "3e8d5df2-bbb3-4030-97d4-511514dbe0a2"
msgid ""
"\"You want Jaethal to kill you and raise you as undead? And in return, you "
"offer her the secret of a ritual?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈이 너를 죽여 언데드로 만들려고 한다고? 그리고 보답으로 너는 의식의 비밀을 알려주겠다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "35e9a4da-7fae-43d5-ac77-fe7987a01c86"
msgid "\"What are you doing in the Valley of the Dead?\""
msgstr "\"죽은 자의 계곡에서 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "1caf6a73-9ba7-4b5c-8047-3daee1583c40"
msgid "\"Jaethal, I've made a decision.\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 나는 결정했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "563643a2-2e01-46f7-94b9-5ca54a1f1232"
msgid "\"This ritual is horrible. Its secret should die with Taneka.\""
msgstr "\"이 의식은 끔찍해. 이 비밀은 타네카와 함께 묻혀야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d8827619-fbaa-494f-8059-272d02928295"
msgid "Allowed Jaethal to get the secret of Urgathoa's ritual."
msgstr "제이탈이 우르가쏘아의 의식의 비밀을 갖도록 허용했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "b4479c49-a458-4b42-a3e6-96e89be15810"
msgid "\"It's a bargain. It matters not whether the ritual is bloody.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 의식이 잔인한 것은 문제가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "8b96dcb9-eab1-40e8-9f56-29c6b2ecf4b6"
msgid ""
"\"Knowledge is knowledge. Agree and receive the secret. Then I will decide "
"if we should use it or not.\""
msgstr "\"지식은 지식이다. 동의하고 그 비밀을 얻어. 그것을 사용해야 하는지 여부는 나중이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "da19bf51-4e22-41ce-a40d-43fb1e13221d"
msgid ""
"Forbade Jaethal from getting the secret of Urgathoa's ritual and let the "
"evil knowledge die with its owner."
msgstr "우르가쏘아의 의식의 비밀을 얻지 못하도록 제이탈을 막고 사악한 지식이 그 주인과 함께 죽게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "3e9990fd-f8d7-43e0-a089-f0daeb2adda3"
msgid "\"This is my final word.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 나의 마지막 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "f6235168-b29c-4aef-9895-e61f204ecaf2"
msgid ""
"\"You may agree, but don't you dare to use it, or do anything at all without "
"my consent.\""
msgstr "\"동의해도 좋지만 사용할 생각하지는 마. 내 허락 없이는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "23895f74-f347-4af2-8ee0-7c61ee33ed4d"
msgid "Insisted on fulfilling the terms of Jaethal's bargain with Taneka."
msgstr "Taneka와 제이탈의 협상 조건을 이행해야 한다고 주장했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "c2d8a415-68dd-4a7d-8eee-5b16f51c5187"
msgid ""
"\"We've made a deal, Jaethal. Whether you like it or not, its conditions "
"must be fulfilled.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 약속했어. 제이탈. 좋건 싫건 약속은 지켜야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "78e215b1-70b0-46db-ad3d-e45caeeb88a7"
msgid ""
"Agreed to violate the terms of the bargain with Taneka to prevent any evil "
"she might cause as an undead."
msgstr "악인을 언데드로 만들 수도 있으므로 타네카와의 약속을 어기는 것에 동의합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "adcb486b-0920-4487-9667-4623e32c00a7"
msgid ""
"\"This woman was a monster in life, and she'll be even worse as an undead. "
"It may seem cruel, but in my opinion, we shouldn't revive her.\""
msgstr "\"이 여자는 괴물이나 다름 없고 언데드 보다 더 나빠. 잔인해 보이겠지만 그녀를 되살리면 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0044_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4abe26bb-cb5a-4e3f-84eb-2c9602f02ccb"
msgid "Encouraged Jaethal to raise the evil priestess as an undead."
msgstr "악당 사제를 언데드로 되살리도록 제이탈을 부추깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "8013e356-327e-4127-b8f6-f727f8803f21"
msgid ""
"\"Unleash an old, evil undead priestess into the world? Why ever not? Raise "
"her, Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"저 늙고 사악한 언데드 사제를 세상에 풀어놓는다고? 왜 안돼? 어서 살려. 제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "b4cc44ac-d2d3-46b2-aacb-c2dac7710eb9"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman seems incredibly old and haggard. It's hard to believe she can "
"move at all, let alone reach such wild places. But her dark eyes burn with a "
"cold flame.{/n} \"Why do you disturb a poor pilgrim? I live, perhaps, my "
"final days...\" {n}She suddenly trails off, upon casting her eyes upon "
"Jaethal.{/n} \"Has {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} heard my pleas? I have been "
"waiting for so long...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 여자는 믿을 수 없을 정도로 늙고 초췌해 보입니다. 이런 거친 땅에 닿은 것은 둘째 치고 그녀가 움직일 수 있을지 조차 "
"모르겠습니다. 그녀의 어두운 눈은 차가운 불꽃처럼 타오릅니다.{/n} \"왜 불쌍한 순례자를 괴롭히느냐? 나는 살아있다. 이게 마지막 "
"날이겠지만...\" {n}그녀는 제이탈을 보자 갑자기 목소리가 줄어듭니다.{/n} \"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}님께서 제 "
"간청을 들으셨나? 나는 너무나 오래 기다렸다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "95febdac-7ddd-481a-b6fe-c2a53fff4000"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal does not seem pleased. She looks upon the old woman's pale and "
"wrinkled face, barely concealing her disgust.{/n} \"You may call me Jaethal. "
"You guessed correctly – we serve the same goddess. In case you are unaware, "
"a servant of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} is chasing you. We could help you... "
"but first I would know who you are, and how you might prove yourself useful."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 기분이 좋아보이지 않습니다. 그녀는 늙은 여자의 창백하고 주름진 얼굴을 보며 불퀘함을 간신히 숨기고 있습니다.{/n} "
"\"나를 제이탈이라 부르면 돼. 정확히 맞췄군. 우린 같은 신을 섬기지. 혹시나 해서 말하는데 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 "
"추종자가 너를 쫓고 있다. 너를 도울 수 있지만 우선 네가 누군지 쓸만한 녀석인지 알아야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "46391190-43f3-422f-9f59-6d5d8714851e"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman nods lifelessly.{/n} \"I'm not surprised. The servants of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} have chased me for nearly forty years. My name is "
"Taneka. What do you want to know?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 기운 없이 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"놀랍지도 않다. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 추종자는 거의 40년 동안 나를 "
"쫓아왔다. 내 이름은 타네카다. 무엇을 알고 싶으냐? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "0a0b237a-8e79-4ce8-8723-049977125e3d"
msgid "{n}The old woman shudders and stares at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}늙은 여자가 당신을 보고 몸을 떱니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "7b8e61b8-8bf2-40f1-9125-7df1d7149512"
msgid ""
"\"There can be no other time, my life is nearing its end...\" {n}Taneka "
"whispers and lowers her head.{/n}"
msgstr "\"더는 시간이 없어, 내 생명은 거의 끝나가고 있다고...\" {n}타네카는 힘겹게 말하며 고개를 숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "e5a63618-3cb0-4c5b-b3b5-5dfe023ca3ff"
msgid ""
"\"How could I not recognize the one chosen by the goddess? Her power in you "
"shines like the full moon on a black velvet sky. I know that she can do many "
"things – including sharing her gift with others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여신이 선택한 자를 알아보지 못하다니, 내가 어리석었군. 우르가쏘아 님의 힘이 네 안에서 검은 하늘에 떠오른 보름달처럼 빛나는구나. "
"그분은 다른 자와 자기 능력을 나눌 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "edef27a3-0ff6-4625-8ec0-7fcd26f3b3f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Taneka takes a deep breath.{/n} \"My ritual... it demands the victim be "
"properly prepared. Some time ago I took my daughters to the coven's "
"underground hall, and lulled them into a magical sleep that was to last many "
"months. However, I did not consider that the father of one of the girls, "
"also an adept of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}, would put the life of his child "
"above his passion for me – and all that we believed in and lived for. The "
"fool secretly went to beg for help, and where? The temple of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, no less!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타네카는 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"내 의식은... 희생자에게 적절한 준비를 요구한다. 얼마 전 내 딸들을 집회의 지하 예배당에 "
"데려 갔고 마법으로 재워 수개월 동안 잠이 들어 있다. 하지만 그 소녀들 중 한 명의 아버지가 나에 대한 열정과 우리가 믿고 살아 온 "
"모든 것 보다 아이의 목숨을 더 중요시할 것이라고 생각치 못 했다. 그 멍청이는 도움을 구하러 갔지. 어디로 갔냐고? 멍청하게도 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 사원에 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "532aec9e-a3e6-4fc9-94a6-9b81db0c3290"
msgid ""
"\"This... this cannot be explained in one breath. Long ago, I was a powerful "
"priestess of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}, the leader of a secret coven. I had "
"everything: power, beauty, wealth, admirers ready to sacrifice their lives "
"for me. I possessed the secret of Urgathoa's ritual, which grants the power "
"to overcome death and old age. It demands the life of blood relatives as a "
"payment, but what of that? I had given birth to two adorable daughters, and "
"raised them in anticipation of the day when their youth and beauty would "
"become mine.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은... 설명하자면 길다. 오래전, 나는 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 강력한 여사제이자 비밀 집회의 지도자였다. "
"권력, 아름다움, 부, 나에게 목숨을 기꺼이 바치는 추종자... 나는 모든 것을 가지고 있었다. 나는 우르가쏘아 의식의 비밀을 가지고 "
"있어서 죽음과 노화를 막을 수 있었다. 혈육의 피를 요구로 하지만 그게 대수인가? 나는 귀여운 두 딸이 있었고 나의 젊음과 아름다움을 "
"위해 키웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "f01a9c4f-a982-4195-9d12-97aa44be0a14"
msgid ""
"\"But I was naive and overconfident of my power. I met an enemy who "
"destroyed me and all my hopes of a second youth. But why would you care "
"about the grief of a dying old woman? I still know the secret of the ritual, "
"and I can share it with you, oh beautiful Jaethal. The ritual will grant you "
"immense power! You can even become a living being again, if that is your "
"wish. All I ask in return is that you prolong my life. Raise me as undead. "
"The other roads to eternity are closed to me, and I do not wish to die.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 나는 내 능력을 과신했다. 나는 나를 파괴하고 내 젊음의 희망까지 앗아간 적을 만났다. 늙은이가 죽는데 누가 슬퍼하겠나? 나는 "
"의식의 비밀을 알고 있고 너에게 알려줄 수 있다. 제이탈. 너에게 막대한 힘을 줄 것이다! 네가 바란다면 되살아날 수도 있다. 내가 "
"바라는 것은 내 수명을 연장하는 것 뿐이다. 나를 언데드로 살려다오. 영생이 코 앞에 있는데 죽고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "25b35c77-163a-4fb0-87e7-69e0fa30b875"
msgid ""
"\"I do not think killing me is necessary. Only the pathetic remnants of my "
"former strength support my body. I need only loosen my grip and my end will "
"come swiftly. Yes, in exchange I offer a priceless secret. It can be used in "
"many ways – to grant new powers, or even a new life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 죽일 필요는 없다. 예전 힘의 한심한 잔재만이 겨우 몸을 지탱해주고 있다. 삶의 의지를 놓으면 나는 곧 죽는다. 댓가로 값진 "
"비밀을 알려주겠다. 그것으로 새로운 힘을 얻을 수도 있고, 심지어 새로운 생명을 부여할 수도 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "6d1d27d5-5ba0-441c-9548-50f5ffd54bb6"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Pharasma}The Lady of Graves{/g} is not highly revered in our country. "
"Only two old priestesses lived at her temple. But when they learned that a "
"secret coven of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} operated in the city, they called "
"their Inquisitor for help... I remember him clearly. So young, so proud. A "
"half-elf of rare beauty. Thick brown hair, and a gaze that burned with the "
"certainty that he was his goddess' favorite weapon. He broke into the hall "
"while I was preparing the ritual. We fought: the coven of Urgathoa against "
"the Pharasma's Inquisitor and his two companions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}은 우리 나라에서 별로 존경을 받지 못한다. 그 사원에는 두 늙은 여사제만이 살았었다. 그들이 "
"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 비밀 집회가 도시에서 열린다는 것을 알자 심문관에게 도움을 청했다... 그가 똑똑히 기억 난다. "
"어리고 늠름했다. 하프 엘프 중에서도 드문 외모를 가지고 있었다. 두꺼운 갈색 머리칼과 여신을 위해 목숨도 바치겠다는 그 눈빛을 잊지 "
"못한다. 그는 예배당에 침입했다. 우리는 우르가쏘아의 추종자와 싸웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "0e611ec7-cf7f-4948-846e-04097ee9e317"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone died that evening – except the two of us. But no matter how self-"
"confident the young inquisitor was, he could not defeat me. I remember the "
"moment he realized it. I read it on his face, when he lost his confidence "
"for the first time. But then... he rushed to my daughters, still lying in "
"slumber, and killed both in an instant. Then he turned to me and said: 'No "
"way out.' And that was that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 둘을 제외하고는 모두가 그날 저녁 죽었지만 그 어린 심문관 조차도 나를 이기진 못했다. 그 순간 그의 얼굴에는 처음으로 자신감을 "
"잃은 표정이 나타났다. 그 순간 그는 잠들어있는 내 딸들에게 달려들어 죽였다. 그리고는 말했다. '출구는 없다.'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "9c0e4099-d555-49e2-89ca-73cb9d2c38cb"
msgid ""
"\"Were his mocking words a curse or just a guess? I do not know, but they "
"bore the fruit of truth. 'No way out'... My coven died, and my secrets were "
"revealed. I had to flee, to hide from the Pharasmites, in the backwoods, "
"down the rat hole, denying myself my usual luxuries. Without my daughters, I "
"could no longer prolong my life and youth! Year after year, I tried in vain "
"to conceive a child. Year passed after year, in desperate attempts, flights "
"and hardship. My beauty and strength melted away, and I became a miserable, "
"exhausted old woman. Jaethal's Gift is now my only hope of escape from death."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그의 조롱이 저주였을까? 나는 모르겠지만 그들은 진리의 열매를 맺었어. '나갈 곳이 없다'... 나의 비밀이 드러났어. 나는 파라즈마 "
"신도들에게서 도망쳐 숨어야했어. 나의 부를 버리고 쥐구멍으로 숨었지. 딸도 없이 나는 내 삶을 살 수가 없었어! 해가 지날 수록 나는 "
"아이를 갖는 것도 힘들어졌다. 그리고 나는 절망적인 시도를 해야 했지. 나의 아름다움과 힘은 모두 사라지고 나는 노파에 지나지 않았다. "
"제이탈의 선물은 죽음으로부터 도망치는 유일한 선물이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "14ba5274-c831-4103-b86b-56d4c3bfa265"
msgid ""
"\"I came here, sensing the awakening of an ancient and powerful undead "
"creature... Hoping, perhaps I could somehow scoop up a handful of his "
"incredible power, turn myself undead and slip away from death... But it "
"seems that I'm too late... \"{n}Taneka whispers and lowers her head.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 고대의 강력한 언데드 크리처의 각성을 여기서 감지했다. 어쩌면 희망이었을지도 모른다. 나는 강력한 힘을 얻어 언데드가 되어 "
"죽음에서 벗어날지도 모른다는 희망이었다... 하지만 너무 늦었다.\" {n}테네카는 속삭이고 그녀의 머리를 낮춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2d8777cd-2d8e-469d-815f-8cb661d57a34"
msgid ""
"\"Aha. You should have shifted your bones faster, granny. We've already "
"splattered this 'incredible power' – or whatever you called it – across the "
"whole area!\" {n}Regongar grins.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뼈다귀를 좀 더 빠르게 움직이라고. 할망구. 그 놀라운 힘이 뭐건 간에 우리가 물리쳤으니까.\" {n}레곤가르가 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bb3095bc-b189-42e9-9b37-df09d19d489e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm listening.\" {n}Despite her detached composure, the undead elf looks "
"at you with tension in her eyes. She lowers her voice to a whisper.{/n} \"We "
"might accept this offer... then change the agreement after I possess the "
"secret of the ritual.\""
msgstr ""
"\"듣고 있다.\" {n}그녀의 평온함에도 불구하고 언데드 엘프는 긴장한 눈빛으로 당신을 봅니다. 그녀는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"이 "
"제안을 받아들일 수 있다... 내가 의식의 비밀을 얻고 나서 약속을 어기면 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "048a7a36-751f-4e93-9919-289454c5c324"
msgid "\"This offer sounds... tempting. What do you say, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"이 제안은... 흥미롭다. 어떻게 하겠어? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4e69bbbf-c88f-4166-abf3-4dc347bc0b59"
msgid ""
"\"No, please, I beg you, think carefully.\" {n}Jaethal speaks with unusual "
"passion.{/n} \"I need this knowledge, even if I never get a chance to use "
"it. My turning undead did not happen by my own will. I have discovered much "
"along the way, but still I burn to know… Do I have a choice to remain as I "
"am, or regain the joys of a living body? It's unthinkable to allow such "
"important secrets to be forgotten.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 제발. 너에게 간청할게.\" {n}제이탈은 평소와는 다른 열정으로 말합니다.{/n} \"다시 사용할 수 없을지라도 나는 그걸 "
"알고 싶어. 언데드가 된 것은 내 의지가 아니야. 나는 많은 것을 알기는 했지만 더욱 많은 것을 알고 싶어... 여전히 나로 남거나 "
"새로운 몸을 얻을 수 있는 건가? 그런 비밀을 알게 된다는 게 믿기지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : TanekaUrgathoaCleric
msgctxt "30599462-1606-423b-8bdd-123282147797"
msgid ""
"{n}Taneka looks at you with insane hope in her eyes. Then, with a trembling "
"hand, she pulls a large scroll from somewhere under the rocks and hands it "
"to Jaethal.{/n} \"I... I almost did not expect... I yearn to know that I "
"have endless years ahead, instead of an imminent end... Give me this chance, "
"sister! And be blessed by our goddess.\" {n}Taneka's eyes slowly fade, as "
"her life force leaves her decrepit body. A moment later the woman falls "
"heavily to the ground, dead.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}타네카는 미친 듯이 기대를 품고 당신을 봅니다. 그러고는 떨리는 손으로 바위를 더듬어 커다란 스크롤을 제이탈에게 넘깁니다.{/n} "
"\"나... 나는 전혀 예상하지 못했다... 정말 알고 싶었어. 끝이 아니라 끝없는 세월이 남아 있다는 걸... 내게 기회를 주게, "
"자매여! 그리고 여신의 축복이 함께 하길.\" {n}타네카의 눈은 천천히 빛을 잃고 쇄약해진 몸에선 생기가 사라집니다. 잠시 후 그 "
"여성은 힘 없이 쓰러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bce62a3e-554e-489b-8d4e-24536d2b38e3"
msgid "{n}Jaethal bites her lip.{/n} \"I. Am. Extremely. Disappointed.\""
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 입술을 물었습니다.{/n} \"참으로 실망스럽군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5d3dda2f-cb4f-4d7f-b019-124199bc4837"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal looks at the corpse with disgust.{/n} \"Now I propose we leave "
"this carrion to the ravens. This pathetic, weak, ugly creature was unworthy "
"of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} – and even more unworthy of her gift of un-life."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 시체를 혐오스럽게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"이 시체를 까마귀에게 넘기는 일만 남았다. 이 한심하고 나약하고 추악한 생물은 "
"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물을 받을 가치가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0fe5fcf1-17b1-421d-add2-e6dd9e82336f"
msgid ""
"\"Your sense of humor sometimes confuses me, but I cannot disobey. "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}, forgive me this sin!\""
msgstr "\"네 농담이 가끔 혼란스럽지만 어쩔 수 없지. {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}여. 나를 용서하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2052435e-78d9-456e-a4d6-123fbd116178"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot disobey one who holds so much power in {mf|his|her} hands. Even "
"if I'm disgusted with what needs to be done.\""
msgstr "\"네 영토에서 네게 불복종할 수는 없지. 역겨운 일이지만 어쩔 수 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b0c8d747-82a4-4023-8dad-93a2cdd51ed1"
msgid ""
"\"I am relieved that we can always find a common language, {name}. Let's "
"move on. I'm impatient to study this ritual – and hunt down the half-blood.\""
msgstr "\"우리의 의견이 같아 다행이다. {name}. 가자. 나는 이 의식을 연구하고 잡종을 어서 사냥하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6a48b5d5-3cd5-4283-a16d-6fc32e845e6c"
msgid ""
"\"What an ominous story! It could make for a thrilling book... but no. I "
"don't like those types of characters or finales!\""
msgstr "\"불길한 이야기군! 으스스해 보이지만 안돼. 이런 마무리는 싫다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "23ee4555-63bc-4f96-ad22-246b19317e36"
msgid ""
"\"Poor girls... what did they do to deserve that?! Betrayed by their own "
"mother, dying at the hand of someone who was supposed to protect them...\""
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍한 여자들... 그런 취급을 받아야 한다니?! 어머니에게 배신당하는 것도 모자라 보호하려는 자에게 죽임을 당하다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2ba191ea-66a0-4791-be21-82bc8da08c98"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry to interject into this emotional discussion, but... I support "
"Jaethal. This ritual may be immoral, but who knows? Maybe its exploration "
"will allow for the discovery something less ominous? I'm deeply appalled by "
"the idea of destroying or rejecting any knowledge. That quite literally gets "
"us nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 순간에 끼어들어 미안하지만... 나는 제이탈의 편이야. 이 의식은 비도덕적이겠지만 누가 알겠어? 나중에 덜 으스스한 결과를 "
"발견할지? 지식을 버린다는 건 슬픈 일이야. 아무런 이득이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "853793cc-9a25-4eb7-8bd9-bf5f4f655805"
msgid ""
"\"Lies and pride — that's all you are and all you will ever be, Jaethal. "
"Don't think yourself any more.\""
msgstr "\"거짓말과 자부심. 이것이 너였고 앞으로도 너일 거야. 제이탈. 더 깊게 생각하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q2_Follow_My_Shadow/Taneka_Dialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d2e9ef7f-bf06-45fd-9425-ee4ab000d845"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie frowns.{/n} \"We had an agreement. No matter how vicious a "
"creature this woman might be, the word given to her is as valuable as the "
"word given to the most righteous people.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"우리는 약속을 했습니다. 이 여자가 저지른 악행과는 별개로, 약속은 지켜야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Barks/ElfInDoubt_String
msgctxt "daae31b3-03f7-413d-82cf-738a66ef2a2c"
msgid "Dismayed Elf"
msgstr "당황한 엘프"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Barks/ElvesIfJaethalExtradited_String
msgctxt "9011c207-d622-4381-b370-656fb4dfbd23"
msgid "\"Lay down your weapons, apostate.\""
msgstr "\"무기를 버려라. 변절자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Barks/GrievingFather_String
msgctxt "ec82d61c-31fc-444e-9594-694516788666"
msgid "Grieving Father"
msgstr "슬퍼하는 아버지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Barks/JaethalIfExtradited_String
msgctxt "7d7847a9-89b0-4ed7-9279-518f756fc955"
msgid ""
"\"Never. It wouldn't be polite to visit Pharasma without bringing some "
"company!\""
msgstr "\"안된다. 파라즈마께 가는데 길동무가 없다면 아쉬워하실 테지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "eddaa38a-ee79-4066-a682-0e7fbd5b93cf"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to us before you make any hasty decisions. Jaethal is not to blame "
"for the death of the young elves. It was Enneo, the inquisitor of Pharasma, "
"who had set a trap for both us and them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"성급한 결정을 내리기 전에 우리 말을 들어. 제이탈은 어린 엘프들의 죽음에 책임이 없어. 우리와 그들 모두에게 덫을 놓은 건 "
"파라즈마의 심문관인 에네오였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "43757165-1d69-4552-918d-a7c1ed74242e"
msgid ""
"\"And yet I ask you to leave. There's no need to spill any more blood on my "
"land.\""
msgstr "\"네가 떠나길 바라. 더 이상 내 땅에 피를 흘릴 이유가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c77a94c5-cb16-4400-9b87-be2ea76f5e24"
msgid "Agreed to turn Jaethal over to the elves."
msgstr "제이탈을 엘프에게 넘겨 주기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a4624d2a-926b-441e-8f57-2484710f903e"
msgid ""
"[Give Jaethal to the elves] \"Here, take the criminal, and do with her what "
"you will.\""
msgstr "[제이탈을 엘프에게 넘깁니다] \"이 범죄자를 데려가. 마음대로 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b3aa700f-e40f-49ba-92f1-a0135d42a298"
msgid "Decided to protect Jaethal from the elven avengers."
msgstr "엘프의 보복으로부터 제이탈을 보호하기로 결정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "7a0f639c-1c31-4918-9665-ac3f4eb4ee5b"
msgid ""
"[Protect Jaethal by any means necessary] \"I cannot allow you to kill "
"Jaethal.\""
msgstr "[모든 수단을 동원하여 제이탈을 보호합니다] \"제이탈을 죽게 둘 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "1d920f7c-29b8-4306-a148-0742d720c315"
msgid ""
"\"Jaethal revived one of your fellow travelers, who died by the hand of the "
"inquisitor. She can confirm my words to you.\""
msgstr "\"제이탈은 심문관에 의해 죽은 너의 동료 중 하나를 되살렸다. 그녀에게 물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "984ff629-7d3c-42d5-a5af-7344195aef52"
msgid ""
"{n}Grave silence follows you as you approach the elves. They do not move, "
"staring at you and Jaethal as if they were waiting for something. Or, "
"rather, someone. — A young, dark-haired elven woman emerges from behind the "
"crowd and greets you with a nod. At the sight of her, something almost "
"imperceptible changes in Jaethal's eyes. It's hard not to notice their "
"incredible similarity...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 엘프에게 접근할 때 무거운 침묵이 따릅니다. 그들은 움직이지도 않고 무언가를 기다리듯 당신과 제이탈을 봅니다. 젊고 흑발의 "
"엘프 여성이 무리 속에서 나와 고개를 끄덕여 인사합니다. 그녀가 보이자 제이탈의 눈에는 거의 감지할 수 없는 변화가 있습니다. 그들이 "
"닮은 것을 쉽게 알아볼 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a1239391-226c-4d8a-b26d-3c3860c9e25b"
msgid ""
"\"My {d|Nortellara}daughter{/d}, my favorite creation and my most capable "
"student.\" {n}The voice of Jaethal is colorless, and her facial expression "
"unreadable.{/n} \"What a pleasure it is to see you leading this band of "
"murderers who have come for my head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 {d|Nortellara}딸{/d}, 내가 가장 사랑하는 작품이자 내가 가장 아끼는 제자야.\" {n}제이탈의 목소리는 건조하고 "
"그녀의 표정은 읽을 수 없습니다.{/n} \"내 머리를 취하려는 살인자들을 네가 이끌고 오다니 재밌구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "5b0d15a7-e6fe-45ce-8114-18a5193e2738"
msgid ""
"{n}Murmurs of outrage erupt in the elven crowd, but their leader remains "
"calm. The dark eyes of the girl burn with determination, and there's a blush "
"on her cheeks. It's amazing how such small details change her face, "
"otherwise nearly indistinguishable from the pale, lifeless face of her "
"mother.{/n} \"I thought you would know that I couldn't stay away. Didn't you "
"always teach me to be responsible for my actions and follow things through?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프 군중 속에서 분노의 비웃음 소리가 들렸지만 그들의 지도자는 침착합니다. 소녀의 어두운 눈은 결단력으로 불타고 그녀의 뺨은 "
"붉어집니다. 그녀의 조그마한 얼굴에 수많은 표정이 나타나는 것이 창백함과 거의 구분되지 않을 정도로 생기없는 그녀의 어머니의 얼굴과 "
"대조됩니다.{/n} \"내가 가만히 있지 않으리라는 걸 알고 있었을 텐데. 나에게 항상 행동에 대한 책임을 가르치지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "51aec34d-e27d-467a-9d63-f33d92912fd2"
msgid ""
"\"Open your eyes, girl. Didn't I teach you to think with your head, and not "
"to fall into traps laid by facile provocation? You might have reasoned that "
"I've no use in killing those foolish young elves you wish to avenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정신 차려라. 딸아. 항상 생각하며 도발에 빠져들지 말라고 가르쳤거늘. 내가 이 엘프들을 죽여봐야 쓸모 없다는 것을 너도 알지 않느냐."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "c897743d-129a-4c1c-b5cb-f6066ab97115"
msgid ""
"\"True. You had 'no use' for it. But if there were any 'use' for you, you "
"would have killed them without hesitation, right mother? I know you better "
"than anyone. I know how far you might go if no one stops you.\" {n}"
"Nortellara pauses and then continues sternly:{/n} \"I persuaded the court to "
"send you into exile. I used everything I could — friends, connections, the "
"arts of logic and persuasion you taught me — and achieved the mildest "
"punishment possible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 이건 너에게 쓸모가 없었겠지. 하지만 쓸모가 있었다면 주저없이 죽였겠지. 그렇지 엄마? 나는 누구보다 당신을 잘 알아. 막는 "
"자가 없다면 무자비하다는 것도 알지. \" {n}노텔라라는 잠시 멈추고는 엄격하게 말합니다.{/n} \"난 당신을 법정에서 추방죄를 "
"내리도록 설득했어. 친구, 인맥, 설등 등 모든 걸 동원해서 처벌을 낮추었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "aa450eb6-a543-4129-9813-adb51e0aeecc"
msgid ""
"\"It... was a mistake. If I hadn't done it, our unfortunate youths would "
"still be drawing breath. Love blinded me. You told me many times that our "
"feelings are our worst advisors, but only now have I finally learned this "
"lesson. It is my duty to stop you, and I will see it through.\" {n}The elf "
"turns to you.{/n} \"I'm sorry, {mf|king|queen}. I have no wish to invade "
"your lands, but there's no other way. Give us the murderer and we shall "
"leave in peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건.... 실수였어. 그러지 않았다면 불행한 엘프들은 여전히 살아있었을 거야. 사랑으로 눈이 멀다니. 감정이 최악의 보좌관이라고 "
"항상 가르쳤지만 이제서야 깨달았어. 너를 막는 건 내 의무야. 그리고 내 두 눈으로 볼 거야.\" {n}엘프는 당신에게 향합니다.{/n} "
"\"미안하다. {name}. 너의 땅을 침입할 생각은 없었지만 다른 방법이 없었다. 저 살인자를 넘기면 우리는 순순히 물러나겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : ElfBardLevel9
msgctxt "14a2be83-79ff-4e27-a501-9ecd45985bc9"
msgid ""
"{n}Murmurs sweep through the elven lines. It seems that some of them are "
"less determined than the others.{/n} \"The {mf|king|queen} of this torn land "
"is right. We are not some robbers to attack {mf|him|her) and (mf|his|her} "
"companions. Even in the name of justice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프 사이에서 중얼거리는 소리가 들립니다. 일부는 주저하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"그의 말이 맞다. 우리는 침입자가 아니다. "
"정의라는 명목 하에도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : ElfFighter2MeleeLevel8
msgctxt "4490969b-d50a-4050-a007-a4c00260b263"
msgid ""
"\"I say to you, {mf|king|queen} of this torn land, our children, brothers "
"and brides are dead. Do you wish us to just let the murderer go? It cannot "
"be!\""
msgstr "\"우리 아이들과 형제 자매가 죽었다. 저 살인자를 돌려보내라고? 그럴 수는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "4b5b8065-7c63-44e7-9c2a-8dacda4e2c1e"
msgid "\"You leave us no choice, {mf|king|queen}.\""
msgstr "\"선택의 여지가 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ac11d7f2-eb29-406f-a7b3-02656aa6b615"
msgid "\"And this is my reward for faithful service?!\""
msgstr "\"이것이 내 섬김에 대한 봉사인가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : ElfFighter2MeleeLevel8
msgctxt "bd5bba3b-3c48-4361-872e-f42fda147895"
msgid ""
"\"My daughter was the only one whose remains we did not find. Returned to "
"life!? Do you mean to say this creature turned her into an undead slave? "
"You'd better pray it's not true, {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"유일하게 찾지 못한 것이 내 딸의 유해였다. 그런데 되살렸다고?! 이 녀석이 내 딸을 언데드로 만들었단 말이야? 사실이 아닐 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Elves_Dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "f720ee32-dea6-43dd-b22d-7c445f142972"
msgid "\"Thank you, {mf|king|queen}. It is a wise decision.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 현명한 결정이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/ElvesLetter_name_String
msgctxt "1079248d-01ff-4a8b-ada4-f16d827f197a"
msgid "Message from the Elven Avengers"
msgstr "엘프 복수자들의 메시지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/ElvesLetter_text_String
msgctxt "5a83c452-2af4-40d4-bbf2-ff967e3625e1"
msgid ""
"\"To the {mf|king|queen} of this land.\n"
"We need not be enemies. Give us the criminal murderer, guilty of the death "
"of our children and friends, and we will leave your realm in peace. Be wise, "
"ruler — your lands have suffered greatly, and keeping treacherous monsters "
"by your side cannot improve your kingdom's lot.\n"
"We await your answer in the camp near the southwestern border of your "
"kingdom.\n"
"Travelers from Kyonin seeking justice\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅의 {mf|왕|여왕}에게. \n"
"너와 적이 되고 싶지 않다. 우리 아이들을 죽인 그 살인자를 넘기면 순순히 물러나마. 현명한 결정을 해라. 너희 땅은 괴물들에게 시달리고 "
"있고, 네 곁에 괴물 배신자를 두는 것은 왕국의 이익에 아무런 도움이 되지 않는다.\n"
"우리는 남서쪽 국경의 캠프에서 기다리고 있겠다.\n"
"정의를 찾으려는 쿄닌의 여행자들 씀\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/JaethalQ3_ringReward_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "7cca3c27-1cb4-4f1e-940f-1f776880eac2"
msgid ""
"This ring allows its wearer to use the inquisitor's judgment ability 3 more "
"times per day."
msgstr "이 반지는 착용자가 인퀴지터의 심판 능력을 하루에 3번 더 쓸 수 있게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/JaethalQ3_ringReward_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "e6555f04-79e5-45a0-91f4-f3b5c60be761"
msgid "Signet of the Incorruptible"
msgstr "청렴한 관리의 인장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/JaethalQ3_ringReward_m_FlavorText
msgctxt "1147321c-9c5f-40ed-ad2f-709428fe4c6f"
msgid ""
"This heavy signet is engraved with a motto in elven: \"I Shall Bring "
"Justice, or to Justice I Shall Be Brought.\" It belonged to the late Jaethal "
"during her tenure as a judge in Kyonin. Thanks to you, these words have come "
"true."
msgstr ""
"이 무거운 인장은 엘프어로 글이 새겨져 있습니다. \"정의의 심판을 내리지 않으면 내가 정의의 심판을 당할 것이다.\" 이것은 제이탈이 "
"쿄닌에서 재판관이었을 때 사용하던 것입니다. 당신 덕분에 이 말이 실현되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/JaethalQ3_scythePharasma_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "2801241a-d948-46e9-94ee-34d78a46cab6"
msgid ""
"This +5 undead bane keen scythe allows its wielder to cast death ward spell "
"as a 7th level cleric at will."
msgstr "이 +5 언데드 파멸의 예리한 낫을 착용하면 7레벨 클레릭의 죽음 방호 주문을 자유롭게 사전 할 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/JaethalQ3_scythePharasma_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "95216f55-21ff-4e20-8f71-270d05442c3b"
msgid "The Way Out"
msgstr "탈출구"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Items/JaethalQ3_scythePharasma_FlavorText_String
msgctxt "cbf5378c-900a-40bd-b070-95d1895a1a7a"
msgid ""
"This scythe, inscribed with spiral patterns, is Pharasma's gift to her "
"newfound follower and former Urgathoan inquisitor. As sharp as the "
"contradictions between the two deities, this scythe is destined to bring "
"souls to the final judgment of the goddess of death."
msgstr ""
"나선형 문양이 새겨져있는 이 낫은 우르가쏘아의 예전 심문관이자 그녀의 새로운 추종자에게 주는 파라즈마의 선물입니다. 두 신의 관계처럼 "
"날카로운 이 낫은 적들을 죽음의 여신의 심판대로 보내버릴 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Nortellara_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "4fa32232-1dc7-495b-a1bd-8b07117575c9"
msgid ""
"\"My mother is dead, and I... feel nothing?\" {n}Nortellara speaks in a "
"quiet voice.{/n} \"Perhaps my heart is made of stone, just like hers? "
"Forgive me, {mf|king|queen}. There are words that must be said aloud.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 엄마는 죽었어... 그런데 아무것도 느껴지지 않아?\" {n}노텔라라는 조용한 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"내 마음은 엄마처럼 "
"차갑게 식은 걸까? 용서해. {name}. 반드시 해야 할 말이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Nortellara_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "0ffd98e7-79ef-4adb-bf9e-b50431a3989b"
msgid ""
"{n}The young elf looks at the bodies of her mother and her other relatives, "
"shocked.{/n} \"An endless circle of death... It began in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}"
" and ended here. What was it all for? Now the only one left to ask — is me "
"myself.\" {n}She looks at you as if she'd just awoken.{/n} \"If it makes any "
"sense at all, I'm... grateful for my salvation. I want you to know, "
"{mf|king|queen} — from this day forth, I owe you a great debt.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}젊은 엘프는 어머니와 다른 친척들의 시체를 보고 충격을 받았습니다.{/n} \"끝없는 죽음의 순환... {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}"
"에서 시작해서 여기서 끝났군. 무엇 때문에? 유일하게 나만 남다니.\" {n}잠에서 깨어난 듯 그녀는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이게 "
"사실이라면... 구해줘서 고맙다. 오늘로 너에게 큰 빚을 졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Nortellara_Dialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "e296e1b5-5339-4b40-a961-11bb47823229"
msgid ""
"\"I made two mistakes with her,\" {n}Nortellara says as you approach.{/n} "
"\"The first time, back in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} — when I defended her before "
"the court and argued that she might change. The second time, here, when I "
"sought to kill, believing that she could never change.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그녀에게 두가지 실수를 했다.\" {n}노텔라라는 당신이 다가오자 말합니다.{/n} \"첫째는 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 "
"그녀를 변호했을 때이고, 둘째는 엄마가 변하지 않으리라 믿고 죽이려고 했을 때야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Nortellara_Dialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "876a150b-b05a-4313-a07a-0d24a8c15612"
msgid ""
"\"I owe you my life, {mf|king|queen}. My life and my hopes. I pray that one "
"day I might repay you in kind, but for now...\""
msgstr "\"네에게 큰 빚을 졌다. 나에게 삶과 희망을 주었어. 언젠가 너에게 빚을 갚겠지만 지금은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/Nortellara_Dialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "87825eca-f68f-4253-8175-ce05ed2a37b9"
msgid ""
"\"I wish to give you one of my mother's things. I don't think I'll ever be "
"able to touch this again. Thank you for everything, and farewell!\""
msgstr "\"어머니의 유품을 너에게 주고 싶다. 나는 이것을 만지지 못할 것이다. 고맙고 이제는 가야겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7fc8b92b-c7bd-4287-a468-3b9be31dc34b"
msgid "Tried to stop Jaethal from sacrificing her daughter."
msgstr "제이탈이 딸을 희생시키는 것을 막았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "cdb8fec6-bfca-4927-a2e0-0aa8bb501693"
msgid "\"Jaethal, stop! You cannot do this to your daughter.\""
msgstr "\"제이탈. 그만해! 네 딸에게 그럴 순 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ae965348-ece6-4cb9-b9d8-7876050285c8"
msgid ""
"Told Jaethal to use her daughter's body to become a living creature again."
msgstr "딸의 시체를 사용하여 몸을 바꾸라고 제이탈에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "0bc8c0bd-24c5-4a1c-91ae-b6fedd4097bb"
msgid ""
"\"Life is full of feeling and pleasure, which cannot be tasted by the "
"undead. Take the body of your daughter, Jaethal, and be reunited with your "
"desires.\""
msgstr "\"인생은 기쁨과 감정으로 가득해서 언데드로는 맛볼 수 없는 것들이야. 네 딸의 시체를 취해. 네가 바라는 대로 몸을 바꿔.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3cee7d64-155d-4db9-8a40-6196231c5803"
msgid "Told Jaethal to sacrifice her daughter to Urgathoa."
msgstr "제이탈에게 우르가쏘아에게 딸을 희생하라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "e27d0bda-bc7f-477c-94e0-534333a3fc8d"
msgid ""
"\"Un-life has provided you with new powers, and placed you above the laws of "
"nature. Sacrifice your daughter, as Urgathoa wishes, but remain what you are."
"\""
msgstr "\"언데드의 삶은 새로운 힘으로 가득하고 네가 자연의 법칙을 지배하게 해주지. 네 딸을 희생해서 너의 목적을 이뤄라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dc7b160c-f449-4a61-a009-b8f3755db438"
msgid "Did not interfere when Jaethal intended to sacrifice her daughter."
msgstr "제이탈이 딸을 희생하려고 할 때 방해하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "700a667c-8b11-4ce1-b9d6-4155179cd9d0"
msgid "\"Do whatever you wish. I care not what you choose.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로 해. 네 선택은 신경쓰지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1eb5263f-ef27-48d3-8f77-5287d16ba5d6"
msgid "Executed Jaethal for her evil intent to sacrifice her daughter."
msgstr "그녀의 딸을 희생시키려는 악의를 가진 제이탈을 처형합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "7f0d7cbe-8201-43ec-92ff-1fb072294404"
msgid ""
"[Attack Jaethal] \"My patience is at an end! I can no longer tolerate your "
"evil ways!\""
msgstr "[제이탈을 공격합니다] \"더는 못참아! 네 악행은 더 이상은 못 봐줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "0ff921ea-517e-4b31-88d1-37570a196dc3"
msgid ""
"\"She's your daughter. Don't you have at least an echo of love for her?\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 네 딸이야. 사랑의 감정이 메마른 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "50690ff2-cceb-4ebd-b86f-f467762d6934"
msgid ""
"\"You surely put much effort into raising your daughter. Were you proud of "
"what she became, or am I wrong? Do you really want to sacrifice all this now?"
"\""
msgstr "\"딸을 키우느라 고생했을 텐데. 딸이 자랑스럽지 않았어? 이제 와서 희생하겠다는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "4c546ae4-d2d9-4f97-84cf-d3c9ea2b57b2"
msgid ""
"\"This is what turned Nortellara against you in the first place. Break this "
"chain of senseless violence before it's too late.\""
msgstr "\"이게 바로 처음으로 노텔라라가 너에게 반항한 이유야. 늦기 전에 무의미한 폭력을 멈춰.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "7283f0f5-53e0-4ae6-9b16-0b6d13fc5fb9"
msgid ""
"\"Can't you see what has your life has become? Blood is spilled again and "
"again, and every time there's more.\""
msgstr "\"네 인생이 지금 어떻게 됐는지 모르겠어? 계속해서 피를 흘리고 이러다 앞으로도 더 흘리겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "1fce4caa-0621-4b75-beb4-637aa439fa78"
msgid ""
"\"Remember the girl at the camp near the Thorn River? She would rather die "
"than become undead. You bear destruction and grief. Those are the 'gifts' "
"you offer. It's what Urgathoa gave to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가시 강의 캠프에 있던 소녀를 기억해? 언데드가 될 바에야 죽는 것이 나았어. 너는 파괴와 슬픔을 지녔어. 우르가쏘아가 네게 준 "
"선물이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "383c781f-e2b1-4645-9530-dfe0e3d2373d"
msgid ""
"\"Remember the story of Taneka? You can blame Enneo for what happened to "
"her, but in truth it was her faith in Urgathoa that condemned her, and "
"offered her no comfort in her time of need.\""
msgstr "\"타네카를 기억해? 에네오의 짓을 비난할 수는 있지만 사실 우르가쏘아를 믿은 건 그녀이고 그로 인한 고생은 자신의 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "9afc53f7-427e-433e-b717-55eab21332bf"
msgid ""
"\"Urgathoa awakened your worst side, Jaethal. But I have seen another side "
"of you — purposeful, stubbornly seeking answers, respectfully speaking of "
"Enneo's dedication, despite the fact that he was your enemy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우르가쏘아가 너의 어두운 내면을 일께웠어. 하지만 네가 목표를 향해 끈기있게 나아가는 모습을 보며 너의 다른 모습을 보았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "8ea594d7-ba99-4e15-b58a-1776f290f6cf"
msgid ""
"[Attack Jaethal] \"If so, I have no other choice but to stop you by force.\""
msgstr "[제이탈을 공격합니다] \"그렇다면 무력으로 멈출 수밖에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "7379d74f-edda-4253-87ed-0786642e4689"
msgid "\"I don't have any more arguments.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 할 말이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Answer_0053_Text_1
msgctxt "f8c0b737-0f25-4e89-9b58-d7bbc84a6848"
msgid "\"Taneka's ritual? What will happen if you use it?\""
msgstr "\"타네카의 의식? 사용하면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4cbcb028-d694-4aaa-bbea-a848bf9bc0ba"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal approaches the fallen Nortellara and freezes like a statue. The "
"scene from the elven camp at the {g|Thorn River}Thorn River{/g} repeats "
"itself once again, but now instead of some unknown elven girl, her own "
"daughter lies at the inquisitor's feet, and she seems still alive.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 쓰러진 노텔라라에게 다가가서는, 그 자리에 석상처럼 얼었습니다. {g|Thorn River}가시 강{/g} 엘프 야영지에서 "
"했던 의식과 다른 점은 없습니다. 그러나 인퀴지터의 발치에 누인 제물은, 나중에 가선 얼굴도 잊어버릴 낯선 엘프 소녀가 아닙니다. 아직 "
"숨이 붙어있는 자신의 딸입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "458324b0-4e5e-492c-b840-80eac159ac73"
msgid ""
"\"I... hear you.\" {n}Jaethal speaks under her breath, and you realize that "
"she is talking neither to her daughter, nor to you, nor anyone else. For a "
"moment you are filled with the strange sensation of someone else's presence —"
" someone evil but somehow jubilant — and then the feeling fades. Jaethal's "
"eyes grow clear.{/n} \"Yes, mistress. I am ready.\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 들려.\" {n}제이탈의 목소리는 가라앉았고 당신은 그것이 당신이나 그녀의 딸도 아닌 중얼거림을 알았습니다. 잠시 동안 악의에 "
"찼지만 의기양양한 누군가의 존재감으로 이상한 감각을 느낍니다. 그리고 그 기분은 사라집니다. 제이탈의 눈빛은 또렷해집니다.{/n} "
"\"주인님. 준비 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c8d63eee-e027-4585-be4b-1835f25518cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal turns to you. The dark eyes of the undead creature glow like a "
"night sky pierced by lightning.{/n} \"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} has declared "
"her will. The goddess demands a sacrifice of me, and she is prepared to "
"grant me her blessing in return. I will become Herald of her will, her "
"perfect follower, the impeccable undead. But she requires blood. Blood — and "
"the life of my daughter, taken here and now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈이 당신을 돌아봅니다. 언데드의 짙은 눈이 밤하늘을 꿰뚫는 벼락처럼 빛납니다.{/n} \"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}"
"의 뜻을 밝히겠다. 나는 여신의 축복을 받은 자, 허나 대가로 여신은 내게 희생을 요구하신다. 나는 완전한 언데드로, 우르가쏘아의 "
"전령으로 거듭날 것이나, 그분은 피를 원하신다. 내 딸의 목숨을 여기 바치노라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b0b6140a-bf98-4ca1-989c-ba58f01084c3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't let her do it, {name}. Killing her own daughter or taking her body — "
"this is true, genuine evil. There can be no way back. Neither for Jaethal "
"nor for any of us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀를 막아. {name}. 자기 딸을 죽이고 몸을 빼앗는 건 악인의 짓이야. 되돌릴 수 없을 거야. 제이탈이나 그 누구도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ca276608-9cff-4556-ade0-da20af95f37d"
msgid ""
"\"The girl's got herself into trouble, and she deserves a beating for it. "
"Both of them, in fact — mother and daughter.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 곤경에 처했고 패배는 예상된 것이었다. 어머니와 딸 모두의 패배다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7eb7984a-491f-44ba-a2bb-09cd7846637b"
msgid ""
"\"Here's my expert opinion: the situation looks quite bad, and you must "
"decide carefully here. Interfering in the affairs of the gods might be a bad "
"idea.\""
msgstr "\"내 소견을 말하자면 상황이 정말 안좋아졌고 너는 신중하게 결정해야 해. 신을 간섭하는 건 좋은 발상은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "69e58f05-735e-420e-b1fb-28bf78abe414"
msgid ""
"{n}Nortellara struggles to open her mouth.{/n}\"So, you wish to feed me to "
"your ravenous goddess? It's just what I'd imagine she would want!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노텔라라는 입을 열려고 애쓰고 있습니다.{/n} \"그래서 너의 신에게 나를 바치겠다는 거야? 내 예상을 벗어나지 않는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7eb93cf3-4fd6-4e6f-9b9f-9ce8600a1989"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal turns to you. Her eyes are glowing with a cold flame.{/n} \""
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} wants me to choose one of the two paths of faith. I "
"can use Taneka's ritual to regain a living body, with all the pleasures that "
"it offers. The children I can then bear will be the source of my "
"immortality. I will become an eternal spirit, changing temporary vessels, "
"and even the ages-long lifespan of the elves will be to me as a season.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈이 당신에게 향합니다. 그녀의 눈은 차가운 불꽃처럼 빛납니다.{/n} \"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}는 내가 "
"선택하길 바라신다. 타니카의 의식을 사용해 살아있는 몸을 얻을 수도 있다. 내가 벤 아이는 내 불멸의 자원이 될 것이다. 나는 불멸이 "
"되어 몸을 바꿔간다면 엘프의 수명조차 뛰어넘을 수 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e23613e0-5f14-4ea7-96f6-47db15258af1"
msgid ""
"\"There is another way. I will remain undead, eternal, unchanging and "
"impeccable. In exchange for my final sacrifice, {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} "
"will grant me new power. A perfect spirit, or perfect undead. Either way, I "
"shall be her perfect follower. All that my goddess requires of me is the "
"life of my daughter — here and now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 선택지도 있다. 나는 영원히 언데드로 남는 것이다. 내 마지막 희생의 댓가로 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}는 나에게 "
"새로운 힘을 줄 것이다. 나는 완벽한 언데드가 될 것이다. 어떤 선택이든 나는 그녀의 추종자이다. 내 여신님은 내가 딸의 생명을 취하길 "
"원하신다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "50191765-a0ce-4531-a8da-6f4edb1a8601"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal's eyes look stern and motionless.{/n} \"Do you understand what "
"you ask? I cannot resist {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} will, even if I had good "
"reason to do so. The gods do not forgive disobedience. I have served you "
"well, but now I must have what I so desperately need.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈의 눈은 공허하고 움직임이 없습니다.{/n} \"네가 무슨 말을 한지나 알아? 나는 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}를 "
"거스를 수 없어. 불복종은 용납하지 않을 거야. 너를 잘 섬겼지만 나는 해야할 일을 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0da5efa3-ca4f-44fe-bbea-4053698e93f3"
msgid ""
"\"Have I ever given you any reason to believe that stupid sentimentality "
"means something to me?\""
msgstr "\"그런 어리석은 감정에 내가 약해질 거라 생각했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "03db623d-1972-4ee9-842f-3c7ed9e77029"
msgid ""
"{n}A barely-noticeable shadow of doubt runs through the depths of Jaethal's "
"dark eyes.{/n} \"I... I will regret it. Perhaps I will even feel sad — once "
"or twice a year. But I will not turn back. I cannot turn back.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈의 어두눈 눈에 희미한 의심의 눈빛이 서립니다.{/n} \"나는... 후회할 것이다. 아마 가끔은 슬퍼할 것이다. 하지만 "
"되돌아가지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c26a10b3-a2d3-41d1-9578-68617668db88"
msgid ""
"\"Do you suggest I sacrifice myself for the sake of what is 'good' and "
"'just'? I cast these sentiments from my mind, together with "
"{g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g} and my service to their court.\""
msgstr "\"선과 정의를 위해 나를 희생하라는 건가? 그런 감정은 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 버린 지 오래다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fdd0ae32-f90e-4c94-9144-07011f3a5246"
msgid ""
"\"Again, my good-hearted patron, stepping in to denounce me! But I give you "
"credit — at least you are consistent. I can respect that.\""
msgstr "\"내 착한 후원자가 다시 나를 방해하는군! 그래도 변치 않은 것은 여전하군. 그런 면은 존중한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0b6bf7ea-90a1-4ac2-bf86-aa68e6fc0959"
msgid ""
"\"I don't recall you condemning me earlier, and you knew all about the "
"murders I committed in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"내가 나를 비난한 건 기억나지 않아. 내가 {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 저지른 살인을 너도 알 테고. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6caf6bf7-2dd5-4bae-8016-b50f14263c25"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't want to torture her, only to {d|Jaethal Kill Elf}preserve{/d} her "
"youth and beauty for eternity!\" {n}Jaethal takes a long look at her "
"daughter, as if comparing the two girls, and recalling the fate of the "
"first.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그녀를 고문하려는게 아니다, 이는 단지 그녀의 젊음과 아름다움을 영원히 {d|Jaethal Kill Elf}지키기{/d} 위함일 "
"뿐이다!\" {n}제이탈은 두 소녀를 비교하고 예전의 기억을 떠올리듯 자신의 딸을 한동안 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a9376940-a21c-4cc6-bd5b-a238756c4a07"
msgid ""
"\"But wasn't it you, {name}, who convinced me to {d|Jaethal Keep Elf}keep{/d}"
" the girl as undead, against her will? It didn't seem at the time that my "
"actions were so destructive.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 소녀를 언데드로 {d|Jaethal Keep Elf}되살리자고 건{/d} {name} 네가 아니었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f178dba3-8256-4be8-bbc9-4c34ee38c752"
msgid ""
"\"She {d|Jaethal Taneka Dead}was{/d} foolish, weak — unworthy of "
"{g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} gifts. With me it will be different. I shall live "
"as I wish. I won't run from my enemies like a rat.\" {n}Jaethal's face "
"remains motionless, and yet it seems that the memory of Taneka's terrible "
"fate stirs in her some unspoken feeling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 {d|Jaethal Taneka Dead}멍청하고 약해서{/d} {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물을 받을 자격이 "
"없었다. 하지만 나는 다르다. 나는 바램대로 살 것이다. 나는 쥐새끼처럼 도망다니지 않을 것이다.\" {n}제이탈의 얼굴은 무표정하지만 "
"타네카의 끔찍한 말로가 그녀를 흔든 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b72ff80b-cba1-4330-b75f-7b0367deb382"
msgid ""
"\"But she became much happier once she was turned into an undead. You "
"yourself {d|Jaethal Taneka Undead}convinced{/d} me to give her that gift, "
"that she might continue her miserable existence. Is that not a recognition "
"of {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} strength?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 언데드가 되었다면 더 행복했겠지. 내가 그녀에게 그 선물을 주라고 {d|Jaethal Taneka Undead}설득했다면 "
"{/d} 그녀는 아마 흉측한 존재로서 더 살았어야 했을 것이다. 그것은 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 힘을 인정하지 않는 "
"것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ef4c2ad0-799e-4076-8555-59dc6616e3ca"
msgid ""
"\"You speak the truth. Sometimes I feel that senselessly drifting in a sea "
"of pleasure would never be enough, even if I got everything I could possibly "
"want. But refusing the goddess means suffering her wrath.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞다. 가끔 나는 삶을 느끼며 사는 것이 만족스럽지 않았다. 하지만 여신을 거절하면 그녀의 진노를 받아야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "122770cf-422f-4b2f-b66f-c9781dd2d665"
msgid ""
"\"How can you talk about my 'worst' side? Have you not told me in the past "
"that there's nothing more important than pleasure?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 내가 최악이라고 말할 수 있지? 과거에는 기쁨보다 중요한 것이 없다고 하지 않았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "55f17a8c-a6e3-4251-bf28-2b14cafe0fdf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nortellara is barely able to move her lips.{/n} \"A fine choice. I always "
"knew that {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} would someday demand it from you. My life."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노텔라라는 간신히 입술을 움직일 수 있었습니다.{/n} \"좋은 선택이야. {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}가 언젠가는 내 "
"목숨을 빼았으라고 명령할줄 알았어 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "979912ed-cea3-4df1-a1d9-a86ee44bd85f"
msgid ""
"\"You are right. This is my destiny. Farewell, my sorrow. At least you will "
"do me one final service!\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 이게 내 운명이야. 안녕히. 적어도 내 부탁은 들어줬으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c369489c-2175-4af0-a9d8-3dccb4972c8a"
msgid ""
"\"So let it be. The one born of me shall be destroyed by me. There's always "
"a way out,\" {n}says Jaethal, as if continuing an old argument.{/n} \"But "
"not for you, Norte.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러라지. 내가 낳은 것은 내가 목숨을 거두는군. 빠져나갈 곳은 있었어.\" {n}제이탈은 자신이 맞다는 듯 얘기합니다.{/n} "
"\"하지만 너는 아니다. 내 딸아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "c229c3e0-1dd9-4a26-bc9d-b1b1a96fa0fa"
msgid "\"Good, then it is decided.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 그럼 결정되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "56e57a25-c536-475d-b741-ddfd9c91a70a"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal suddenly stops speaking and remains silent for a long time. Her "
"empty, undead face does not betray the thoughts and feelings rushing through "
"her mind, behind the mask. She glances at you, her daughter, the grass, the "
"trees, the sky — as if trying to put them all into the same picture.{/n} \"I"
"'ve come such a long way...\" {n}She says finally.{/n} \"Eternal escape. "
"Life in constant expectation. Decisions made for me... Should I... finish "
"all this?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 갑자기 말을 멈추고 오랫동안 침묵했습니다. 그녀의 공허한 얼굴은 솟구치는 감정을 그대로 반영합니다. 그녀는 사진을 보듯이 "
"당신과 그녀의 딸 그리고 풀과 나무, 하늘을 봅니다.{/n} \"오랜 길을 걸었다...\" {n}그녀는 마침내 말합니다.{/n} \"영원한"
" 도피와 생명에 대한 희망을 가지고. 이제 결정할 때가 되었다... 이제 내가 끝내도 되는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "be3304a0-3732-464e-a18a-c44b249b4fa9"
msgid ""
"\"Fine.\" {n}Jaethal looks at her daughter and speaks with simmering "
"calm.{/n} \"Do not dare disappoint me, girl. I do not wish to learn that I "
"gave up so much for an ordinary worthless being who cannot manage her life. "
"Be exceptional in everything you do.\" {n}Jaethal straightens her shoulders "
"with a nervous movement, and looks straight ahead.{/n} \"I must disappoint "
"you, goddess. I reject your gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋다.\" {n}제이탈은 그녀의 딸을보고 침착하고 평온하게 말합니다.{/n} \"나를 실망시키지 말아라. 딸아. 자신의 목숨도 가누지 "
"못하는 평범한 것에게 모든 것을 걸었다고 기억하고 싶지 않다. 언제나 최고가 되어라.\" {n}제이탈은 딸의 어깨를 곧추 세우고 눈을 "
"응시합니다.{/n} \"당신을 실망시켰습니다. 여신님. 당신의 선물을 거부합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "81363133-2759-4ec6-ad2a-fd2f3b2e5ddf"
msgid ""
"\"I don't see any further sense in this dispute,\" {n}Jaethal says "
"sternly.{/n} \"Decide, {name}.The time for talk has passed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 싸움에서 무엇도 기대하고 싶지 않다.\" {n}제이탈은 엄하게 말합니다.{/n} \"결정해라. {name}. 대화의 시간은 "
"지났다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b64a4d6d-e530-4d13-bb7f-25b5665a2045"
msgid ""
"\"Rebirth. In a way.\" {n}Jaethal looks at her daughter.{/n} \"The power of "
"the blood bond is great. {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g} will extract my spirit "
"from this dead body — and move it to a new, living one, which I once gave "
"birth to.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 태어나는 것이다.\" {n}제이탈은 딸을 봅니다.{/n} \"혈통의 힘은 위대하지. {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}가 이 "
"죽은 몸에서 내 영혼을 뽑아내 이 살아있는 몸에 넣어 나는 다시 태어날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "3e326536-94c6-4e74-9d23-537cac84674b"
msgid ""
"\"A body you once gave birth to?\" {n}Nortellara repeats quietly.{/n} \"I "
"was prepared to kill you. I was prepared for you to kill me. But I never "
"imagined that I would be no more than a vessel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 낳은 딸을 말하는 건가?\" {n}노텔라라는 조용히 반복합니다.{/n} \"나는 너를 죽일 준비가 되어 있었다. 나는 죽음을 "
"준비했었다. 하지만 내가 껍데기에 불과할 줄은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "076d124c-7aaa-427f-bb96-651488066a37"
msgid ""
"\"No mere vessel, child. A priceless gift.\" {n}Jaethal speaks with a face "
"of stone.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그저 껍데기가 아니다. 딸아. 값진 선물이지.\" {n}제이탈은 무표정한 얼굴로 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "e60bd246-7d4c-4717-a2a3-ebe5126e1b4f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nortellara wearily rises to her feet, tosses her head and begins to say "
"something, but does not have time. Jaethal swiftly throws up her hands and "
"casts some unknown spell. A dark flame billows from her hands and envelops "
"Nortellara's body for a moment. The girl screams. When the flame disappears, "
"her body bears no visible damage, but her eyes are completely empty, like "
"those of a doll or a statue.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노텔라라는 힘겹게 일어나서 머리를 들어 무언가를 말하지만 시간이 부족했습니다. 제이탈은 제빠르게 그녀의 손을 뻗어 알 수 없는 "
"주문을 외웁니다. 어두운 불꽃이 그녀의 손에서 파도를 타고 잠시 노텔라라의 몸을 감싸줍니다. 소녀는 비명을 지릅니다. 불꽃이 사라졌고 "
"그녀의 몸에 눈에 띄는 피해를 없었지만, 인형이나 동상 같이 눈동자가 완전히 비어 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2197e295-d776-4547-a1a9-9e0e950a714b"
msgid ""
"{n} Jaethal takes a long look at her creation, then makes a gesture — and "
"what remains of her daughter turns and marches toward the road to the "
"capital. The movements of soul-less body resemble a puppet in a "
"fairground.{/n} \"I shall send it to a safe place. It will take time to "
"prepare the vessel for the ritual. But how sweet the wait shall be...\" {n}"
"Jaethal looks straight into your eyes.{/n} \"There's always a way out, isn't "
"there?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 자신의 창조물을 오랫동안 관찰한 다음, 손짓을 취했습니다 — 그러자, 딸에게 씌인 무언가는 돌아서서 수도로 향했습니다. "
"그녀의 움직임은 무도회장의 영혼 없는 꼭두각시처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"나는 그것을 안전한 곳으로 보내겠다. 의식을 위해 몸을 준비하는 "
"데는 시간이 걸릴 것이다. 하지만 그 시간은 달콤하겠지...\" {n}제이탈은 당신의 눈을 똑바로 봅니다.{/n} \"항상 빠져나갈 곳은 "
"있다. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : NortellaraFigtherJaethalQ3
msgctxt "b1a17f3f-dd1b-4631-a46e-aaf27539d6b6"
msgid ""
"{n}Nortellara's eyes widen, but she doesn't utter a sound. She's either too "
"exhausted or too proud to ask for mercy.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노텔라라의 눈이 커졌지만, 소리를 지르지는 않습니다. 그녀는 너무나 지쳤거나 자비를 구하기에 자존심이 너무 센 것인지도 "
"모릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "08691f72-d567-4397-a965-6a0a99bd1ebd"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, Jaethal freezes in a strained pose, as if gathering her "
"strength.{/n} \"Let this be my new beginning. {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa{/g}, "
"accept this sacrifice!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 제이탈은 힘을 모으는 것처럼 긴장된 자세로 서있습니다.{/n} \"이것이 나의 새로운 시작이 될 것이다. "
"{g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}시여. 이 희생을 받아들이십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "29e398c3-9a19-48ab-b9e2-276247962ab1"
msgid ""
"\"What are you talking about? Even killing her wouldn't be so cruel! You're "
"even more vicious and terrible than I could have imagined, Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리하는 거야? 그녀를 죽인다 해도 잔인한 것은 아니야! 너는 그것보다 더 악랄하고 끔찍해. 제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8b2f5006-c159-4f99-ab24-1bea3c4053b5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh radiant {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, how can such evil be tolerated?! Have "
"I chosen the right path...? The right leader?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}시여. 어떻게 이런 악을 용납하겠습니까? 제가 옳은 선택을 하는 것입니까? 그는 올바른 "
"지도자입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5a3c0b9c-801b-4891-8cdc-ef099e62f308"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you know what you're doing, {name}... but I just can't watch! "
"Betrayal from your own mother, death at her hands — no one... no one "
"deserves such a fate!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 하는 짓을 알겠지. {name}... 하지만 보고만 있을 수는 없다! 어머니를 배신하고 그녀의 손에 죽다니... 너무나 잔인한 "
"운명이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6509afe7-abb7-43ce-aa13-c412547e2bca"
msgid "\"Yes, Jaethal. You have to.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 제이탈. 해야만 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/Q3_Reveal_My_Destiny/TheFinalDialog/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8ae12b14-f9b6-4d28-b50c-50c50860ee2b"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim's voice is deep and solemn.{/n} \"All things come to an end. Even "
"your pride, even attempts to cling to a ruined life. Let go of the past, "
"Jaethal. You should have done this long ago.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림의 목소리는 깊고 엄숙합니다.{/n} \"모든 일에는 끝이 있는 법이야. 너의 자존심과 삶에 대한 미련조차 말이지. 과거는 "
"잊어버려. 제이탈. 오래 전에 해야만 하는 일이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/SpecialBarks/JaethalSpecialBark_Undead1_String
msgctxt "8149dd26-e1b4-4651-addf-0e8dc158aa5f"
msgid ""
"\"I appreciate your intentions, but that 'healing' of yours only harms me.\""
msgstr "\"네 뜻은 감사하지만 너의 치유는 나에게 상처만 남기는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/SpecialBarks/JaethalSpecialBark_Undead2_String
msgctxt "89a0f7e4-aa34-42be-bafa-8f854ca74e17"
msgid ""
"\"Beings like me must be healed with negative energy. Try something else — "
"you may be surprised by the effect.\""
msgstr "\"나 같은 존재는 음에너지로 치유되어야 한다. 다른 것은 없나. 효과가 아주 뛰어날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jaethal/SpecialBarks/JaethalSpecialBark_Undead3_String
msgctxt "a505be6d-0ab5-401e-adeb-cdc3b1a66a3d"
msgid "\"I'm undead. You can't heal me with spells meant for living beings.\""
msgstr "\"나는 언데드다. 살아있는 존재를 위한 주문으로 나를 치유할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/AfterBark_Knight_String
msgctxt "8f9cc7eb-642f-4c0b-9d0a-084cfa6785d3"
msgid ""
"\"Hurry, squires! Our little vacation's over. The demons of the Worldwound "
"await!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러 녀석들아! 휴식은 끝났다. 월드운드의 데몬이 우리를 기다리고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/AfterBark_Squire1_String
msgctxt "4b06b5e2-03ba-4b6e-b10f-ab91e58f0792"
msgid "\"I'm starting to miss that tentacle thing…\""
msgstr "\"나는 그 촉수가 그리워지고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/AfterBark_Squire2_String
msgctxt "0158cf65-cc2d-4041-935f-4d06c0fbf9c7"
msgid "\"Where's the whetstone? And my mug?\""
msgstr "\"숫돌은 어딨어? 그리고 내 머그잔은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_FrogGnome1_String
msgctxt "4f421162-e05a-452a-a3f0-056c906caaf5"
msgid "\"Ribbit. Ribbit. Ribbit. What else would you expect a frog to say?\""
msgstr "\"개굴개굴. 개구리에게 뭘 기대하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_FrogGnome2_String
msgctxt "8393704c-f249-48b1-86d2-74b052632c0b"
msgid "\"My brother's just stupid! We're educated frogs, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"내 동생은 어리석었어! 우린 교육받은 개구리야. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_Knight_String
msgctxt "f35f59a5-b46a-4e23-ae97-904e73205fea"
msgid "\"I can't think of anything but tentacles…\""
msgstr "\"나는 촉수 말고 다른 건 생각이 안 나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_Kobold_String
msgctxt "446434b1-11b2-40ba-91f3-07b9d32341a9"
msgid "\"Jump mice my friendsss. Good have friendsss!\""
msgstr "\"쥐를 뛰어넘어, 내 친구들. 쉬익. 잘했어, 친구들! 쉬익!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_Nyrd_String
msgctxt "26c6524f-ec36-409b-8a6c-108227ee49d6"
msgid ""
"\"There are rules hanging on the poles. Go read them quickly or you can't "
"participate.\""
msgstr "\"기둥에 규칙이 적혀있다. 어서 가서 읽고 와야 참여할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_Squire1_String
msgctxt "d2c7c0a7-455f-4578-a8d4-6812913b7677"
msgid "\"I'd rather fight with demons than talk with fey...\""
msgstr "\"페이와 이야기하느니, 차라리 데몬과 싸우고 말지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/BeforeBark_Squire2_String
msgctxt "d356f6cb-2de0-4792-9c51-2c14279288ef"
msgid "\"Look at our master! A true example of knighthood, he is!\""
msgstr "\"우리 주인을 봐! 기사의 진정한 본보기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/FeyBeforeStart_bark1_String
msgctxt "aca1ce35-bed8-43ae-83ea-0a851d60dbcf"
msgid "\"Welcome to the Inconsequent Debates! We'll begin in a moment.\""
msgstr "\"비논리 토론회에 온 것을 환영해! 곧 시작할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/HostBarkBeforeRules_String
msgctxt "081b934b-2650-4ef7-91fa-77c8756f48fe"
msgid "\"...not before you read the rules.\""
msgstr "\"... 규칙을 읽기 전에는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/HostDistraction_String
msgctxt "94673822-605d-4194-bb76-d9cdbee10fdd"
msgid ""
"\"As if we can't see that someone is trying to run down the clock. Oh, if "
"you only knew as much about stretching time as we do...\""
msgstr "\"누군가 시계를 멈추지는 않겠지. 시간을 늘리는 방법은 없을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/LinziDistraction_String
msgctxt "439d7b91-7ecd-4ae1-9077-7fddf94b3f41"
msgid "\"Just one more question! I really need this for my book!\""
msgstr "\"한 번만 더 질문할게! 내 책에 정말 필요하다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/Rules1_String
msgctxt "5d6c07e6-0cad-4370-86bc-46cb21dc06f8"
msgid ""
"\"Item four, the most important one: the participant must assume the shape "
"of a giant frog.\""
msgstr "\"항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 거대한 개구리의 모양을 취해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/Rules2_String
msgctxt "9cfef9f3-4414-4c70-bf19-f460033616b0"
msgid ""
"\"Item four, the most important one: the participant must say TENTACLES at "
"least once every ten words.\""
msgstr "\"항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 단어 열개를 말할 때마다 '촉수'라고 말해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/Barks/Rules3_String
msgctxt "ada2193f-ad76-43d2-b873-514e6b3f2b52"
msgid ""
"\"Item four, the most important one: the participant must routinely enter "
"desperate fits of screaming.\""
msgstr "\"항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 반드시 때때로 소리를 질러야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4dd9ddcd-422c-4123-9b87-0d83a787ceec"
msgid "\"Why are you referring to yourself in the plural, Host?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너 자신을 우리들이라고 말하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "55d6ed4d-478d-4895-adee-b8747e5908d4"
msgid ""
"\"Your evasion is very eloquent. I know only one Eldest from the First World "
"who is called Shyka The Many.\""
msgstr "\"네 변명은 정말 그럴싸한데. 내가 아는 태초 세계의 원로는 다수의 샤이카뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "585db774-2cb2-4528-a603-5d7c613146ae"
msgid "\"Let's begin.\""
msgstr "\"시작해 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "f41440e4-55cb-40a3-843a-ad3f098f7fe1"
msgid "\"Jubilost, Linzi? What's our answer?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트. 린지? 우리 대답은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "37998057-65f8-46f0-9a54-4f54638468fe"
msgid "\"Magic.\""
msgstr "\"마법.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "71a8ccdf-705d-42fc-9f90-05e2a1e8f5ff"
msgid "\"Gods.\""
msgstr "\"신들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "5bafca6a-1e4e-44ea-b867-531efe3fec7b"
msgid "\"Its own will. And tentacles.\""
msgstr "\"자유 의지. 그리고 촉수.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "9458051f-80f6-476a-8112-5080615b43fe"
msgid "\"Its own will.\""
msgstr "\"자유 의지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "f27ba7cd-a3fb-41b0-84b3-04e35d7c380f"
msgid ""
"\"Tell us, why do you, creatures from the First World, need to organize all "
"this?\""
msgstr "\"태초 세계의 생물들은 왜 이 모든 것을 만들었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "95b74820-ac72-4f53-9621-3d6421b7c416"
msgid "\"What do you say, Jubilost?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 생각해? 주빌로스트?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0040_knowledge_Text
msgctxt "7ddb357d-9127-4d7f-aec8-08079858e245"
msgid "\"It's knowledge.\""
msgstr "\"지식.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0041_past_Text
msgctxt "f9977b7b-6b8c-467e-ab18-53b7db6724ed"
msgid "\"It's our past.\""
msgstr "\"과거.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0042_ambition_Text
msgctxt "e88d2241-6a02-4187-8c0f-87c296b58627"
msgid "\"It's ambition.\""
msgstr "\"야망.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0043_regrets_Text
msgctxt "56bd8ea6-5f07-4ed5-92e0-228ac2e2a421"
msgid "\"An evil twin brother from another timeline.\""
msgstr "\"다른 세계의 사악한 쌍둥이 형제.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0046_memory_Text
msgctxt "13eefe10-34d1-42fe-8721-21fb6fa4b5f4"
msgid "\"It's memory.\""
msgstr "\"기억.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "b6d1fc1a-2d8f-4116-9ac9-7d938715637e"
msgid "\"Jubilost?\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "f3daaf0b-01c0-4859-99fb-9fb2c0955931"
msgid "\"A pot of soup.\""
msgstr "\"수프 냄비.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "15b348e1-d034-4fc2-8fe1-f15c515b2d70"
msgid "\"A secret.\""
msgstr "\"비밀.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "bf620397-da87-4261-ae72-cb8752ffa843"
msgid "\"A house. Or any other property.\""
msgstr "\"집. 또는 다른 재산.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "e16f837c-6883-4d3f-a08c-b200b5bff54c"
msgid "\"Glory.\""
msgstr "\"영광.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "4d4d5c0e-38ce-4c78-af3b-413560c10d09"
msgid "\"Knight!\""
msgstr "\"기사!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "39faf27d-d490-4003-b946-4b087a770f4f"
msgid "\"Dragon!\""
msgstr "\"용!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "9e22fb00-011b-44cb-9f7c-8e0cc1482d32"
msgid "\"Snag!\""
msgstr "\"민달팽이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "b0886f5b-a7ca-438c-aa6a-f670964d802e"
msgid "\"Knight!\""
msgstr "\"기사!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "e9cd02f8-8317-4410-8c7c-aa47c1dda91a"
msgid "\"Knight!\""
msgstr "\"기사!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "11a46927-bb00-4006-9835-33e78a62c7f6"
msgid "\"DRAGON!\""
msgstr "\"용!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "4f695b96-c066-48c4-b61a-c5b1b661cd57"
msgid "\"Snag!\""
msgstr "\"민달팽이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "88377fd3-a1c6-48e5-9e4d-aaced72e6558"
msgid "\"Dragon!\""
msgstr "\"용!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0104_Text
msgctxt "4af33b7e-7592-4a2b-9102-a6e08dd10130"
msgid "\"Snag!\""
msgstr "\"민달팽이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0131_Text
msgctxt "6c2a1f25-12fb-495d-9632-d500a0432b85"
msgid "\"I want to know why the gnomes left the First World.\""
msgstr "\"왜 노움이 태초 세계를 떠났는지 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0132_Text
msgctxt "bee1e8ac-dd69-4254-a627-c5cf061649c2"
msgid ""
"\"I want to know about this affliction – the Bloom – that fell on my barony."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 역병에 대해 알고 싶다. 내 영지에 퍼졌었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0133_Text
msgctxt "4878bd92-65cc-4df7-8a0d-3f421777d75e"
msgid "\"I want to know why you organized all this, Host.\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 모임을 만들었는지 알고싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0134_Text
msgctxt "1e8dd19d-ec17-43f2-96dd-cf34e52aa16d"
msgid "\"I want to know who my love is, with whom I'm bound to tie my lot.\""
msgstr "\"내 사랑이 누구인지 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0135_Text
msgctxt "c37dae88-9bc6-450d-8029-b6b72d1c48c7"
msgid "\"I want to know how to gain power and immortality.\""
msgstr "\"나는 권력과 불멸을 얻는 법을 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0136_Text
msgctxt "cc031b26-8727-493b-953a-22cb5220eb7f"
msgid "\"Any suggestions for a good pet name?\""
msgstr "\"좋은 애완 동물 이름 좀 지어주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Answer_0159_Text
msgctxt "d2efa027-251c-4df7-9ff8-3f8fe35a2cf0"
msgid "\"My grandmother!\""
msgstr "\"할머니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "b97549aa-a334-468c-bbb0-1b3287417df3"
msgid ""
"{n}The hooded creature looks mundane, but after looking for a time, one "
"might notice the figure's contours tremble and flow, as in a haze.{/n}\n"
"\"Welcome to the Inconsequent Debates! You can call us the Host. We are the "
"reason for all that happens here today.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}후드를 쓴 생물은 평범한 것처럼 보이지만 계속 보니 후드 속의 형상의 윤곽이 안개처럼 흐리고 떨립니다.{/n}\n"
"\"비논리 토론회에 온 걸 환영해! 나를 주최자라고 불러도 좋아. 이 논쟁을 위해 오늘 여기에 왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "02164576-5e9a-43d1-9834-2c2c367238a2"
msgid ""
"\"You've read the rules, have you not? Not that there is anything useful in "
"them. We only made up the real rules the day after tomorrow, then forgot "
"them and had to make new ones. So it's simple: you want, as your reward, for "
"us to answer a question. So the competition will involve answering "
"questions. We ask, and one in each triplet answers. And always the same one –"
" the others can only prompt. Let's see... it will be you, little kobold, "
"you, Sir Allfrey, you, Nyrd, and you, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"규칙은 읽었겠지? 거기에 쓸만한 건 없어. 진짜 규칙은 내일 만들지, 다시 잊어버리고 또 만들어야만 하지. 규칙은 간단해. 보상을 "
"원하면 우리의 질문에 답해. 질문을 대답하는 경쟁이 시작될 거야. 우리는 세 쌍의 질문을 한 번씩 말할 거야. 하나가 답이고 나머지는 "
"비슷한 것이지. 어디 보자... 거기 너. 코볼트, 너, 알프레이 경, 너, 니르드, 그리고 너, {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "a3a05d14-a3ed-4ba7-9ec9-105dfe061065"
msgid ""
"\"Remember one thing: here at the Inconsequent Debates, there are no right "
"or wrong answers. Every answer has weight, and each will be weighed. Don't "
"choose the lightest one – your rival might find a heavier argument. And most "
"importantly, light answers are no fun for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이걸 기억해둬. 비논리 토론회에서는 정답과 오답이 없어. 대신 답의 무게가 있지. 그 무게를 잴거야. 가벼운 답을 내지 않도록 해. "
"너희 경쟁자들이 더 무거운 대답을 찾을 수 있으니. 그리고 제일 중요한 건, 우린 가벼운 대답이 재미 없단 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "cd20b6c4-88cd-40db-98a1-b77da767765f"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear laughter emerge from under the hood.{/n} \"You know very well, "
"you've met us, {name}... But it was a different us at a different time. For "
"now be satisfied that we do not wish to disclose ourselves.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두건 아래에서 웃음 소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"잘 알고 있군. 너는 우리를 만났었어. {name}... 하지만 그건 다른 시간대의 "
"우리였지. 지금은 우리의 정체를 드러내지 않은 걸 감사하게 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "edb959d5-47b5-4dbb-921b-94b7080bfa98"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. You might have guessed that {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}, the craftiest "
"and most mysterious deity of {g|First World}the First World{/g}, has "
"something to do with this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}라고 추측했겠지. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 교활하고 가장 신비로운 신은 이것과 "
"관련된 무언가를 준비했을거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "c1221b44-69b6-4b19-9f64-f7cb3a6ec80a"
msgid "\"You're a bright child. It's not the first time you've surprised us.\""
msgstr "\"너 참 밝구나. 네게 놀란 게 한두번이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "d6b70109-e13a-42c2-b049-f0a9160f3371"
msgid "\"Beginsss!\" {n}The kobold jumps from joy.{/n}"
msgstr "\"시자아아악!\" {n}코볼트는 기뻐서 날뜁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "20cc904a-1a02-42b4-913f-667a5c000f50"
msgid ""
"\"We are ready.\" {n}The knight nods resolutely.{/n} \"Despite the tentacles."
"\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐다.\" {n}기사는 단호하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"촉수 쯤이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "87b9849f-9313-4e93-97b1-7c2c7124841e"
msgid ""
"\"All right! Let's see how tough they have it in {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}가 얼마나 빡센지 보자구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "1639f1de-ae33-42c9-85da-a77abdbb06f1"
msgid ""
"\"Some of you look so serious... Thus we'll begin with a question about "
"weighty matters: What can move a mountain?\""
msgstr "\"너무 진지한 녀석들도 있는데... 무거운 주제부터 시작할게. 산을 움직일 수 있는 것이 무엇일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "914d0138-1a73-436c-814d-317cbcf69a1b"
msgid ""
"\"Let's see, let's see... We are dealing with fey and the First World, and "
"they told us clearly that trivial answers won't cut it. I think the good "
"answer is 'Its own will.' In {g|First World}the First World{/g}, mountains "
"often change position, and there's at least one that does it of its own free "
"will. That's Ulas, one of the Tane, the walking mountain.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어디 보자... 우리는 페이와 태초 세계에 관해 이야기하고 있으니까 평범한 대답은 확실히 아닐 거야. 정답은 '자신의 의지'라고 "
"생각해. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 산은 종종 움직여. 그리고 스스로 움직이는 것도 최소한 하나는 있지. 울라스라고 "
"하는데, 테인 중 하나이자 걸어다니는 산이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cba4f2aa-cb37-44f1-addd-61f4a4d4a0ec"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you are smart enough to see that it's tentacles. Answer 'It's own "
"will'. There is at least one mountain with tentacles in {g|First World}the "
"First World{/g}. This time it's no joke. Tentacles! Ulas, the Walking "
"Mountain, moves by its own will on tentacles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네가 충분히 똑똑했으면 해, 왜냐하면 여기엔 눈치채기 힘든 촉수가 있으니까. 대답은 '자신의 의지'야. {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}에는 최소 한 개의 촉수 달린 산이 있어. 이번에는 정말로 농담이 아냐, 진짜 있다니까 촉수! 걸어다니는 산 "
"울라스라고 하는 녀석인데, 자기 의지를 가지고 스스로 촉수하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2030f1a7-daa7-4ced-9f90-77340f212fc0"
msgid ""
"\"If I start screaming again, our rivals could overhear us! But I'll have to "
"risk it. Answer 'It's own will.' In the world of fey, DAMN THEM, mountains "
"often move. And one especially notable mountain, the Tane Ulas, that WALKS "
"BY ITSELF!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 소리지르기 시작하게되면 경쟁자들이 듣겠군! 물론 위험은 감수해야지. 정답은 '자신의 의지'야. 페이의 세계에서, 빌어먹을!, 산은 "
"종종 움직이지. 유명한 녀석 중 하나는 테인 울라스인데, 스스로 걸어다녀!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "5b75abee-722f-4b9c-b181-b62c44a3038e"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear laughter from underneath the hood.{/n} \"We like this answer. "
"It's worth two. But what do the others say? What can move a mountain?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두건 아래에서 웃음 소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"정답이 마음에 드는군. 하지만 하나 더 있다. 그것은 무엇일까? 무엇이 산을 "
"움직일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "5a73c8c2-aceb-4ea7-b38b-563ab80688a8"
msgid "\"We heard you. What will the others say? What can move a mountain?\""
msgstr "\"다른 녀석은 뭐라고 말하겠어? 산을 움직일 수 있는 게 뭘까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "ca54e859-73d0-49df-a96f-65283c3a1e3f"
msgid ""
"{n}The little kobold frowns desperately.{/n} \"Maybe... dragon? Dragon can "
"move mountain!\""
msgstr "{n}작은 코볼트는 집중하느라 오만상을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"... 용? 용은 산을 움직일 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "80499bdf-00a2-41ee-a700-898a285f6e07"
msgid ""
"\"Faith and divine intervention. Do you hear, my faithful tentacles? Faith "
"nourishes us. With devout faith in our tentacles, and a righteous cause, "
"everything is within our tentacles!\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 믿음, 그리고 위대한 신의 권능이다. 내 가장 신실한 촉수들이여, 들리는가? 믿음은 우리를 보살핀다. 진심 어린 믿음과 함께 "
"우리가 촉수한다면, 또한 그것에 정당한 사유가 존재한다면, 신께서는 모든 기도에 대해 촉수하신다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "fb0198dc-8627-4364-8650-795ac696073b"
msgid ""
"\"A teleportation spell, ha-ha-ha! I could probably manage moving a hill or "
"two... In fact, that gives me an idea...\""
msgstr ""
"\"순간 이동 주문이지. 하하하! 나는 아마 언덕 한두 개 정도는 움직일 수 있을거야... 사실은, 좋은 아이디어가 떠올랐어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "27b37aa4-6011-4c55-968c-db6e3020de04"
msgid ""
"\"We have heard you. Now you hear us. Of course, gods and magic can move "
"mountains. But that answer is good for any question. How can one jump over "
"the house? Magic! How to paint a fence yellow using blue paint? Divine "
"intervention! Such light answers are the weakest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 말을 들어줬으니 우리 말도 들어봐. 물론 신과 마법이면 뭐든지 가능해. 산도 옮길 수 있지. 집을 뛰어넘거나 파란색 페인트로 "
"노란색을 칠할 수 있느냐고 물으면 마법과 신의 도움이 있으면 가능하다고 우기면 되거든! 정말 쓸데없는 질문이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "32c734c0-32dc-44e1-b6f3-c0ec46954acf"
msgid ""
"\"A good answer is 'its own will'. Will and desire lie at the base of all "
"our motions, action and decision. If a mountain has a will, it will surely "
"find a way to move.\n"
"That was an interesting round. Let the next question be heard!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋은 대답은 '자신의 의지'야. 의지와 욕망은 우리 행동의 동기이지. 산이 의지만 있다면 움직이는 거야 어렵지 않아.\n"
"흥미로운 질문이었어. 다음 질문으로 넘어가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "d6db3bd6-b7e3-479f-9bde-7ace5a67fb68"
msgid ""
"\"We will probably award victory in this round to no one. Even the dragon. "
"Let the next question be heard!\""
msgstr "\"이번에는 아무도 이기지 못할껄. 용이라고 해도 마찬가지야. 다음 질문으로 넘어가지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "dbcfc5bd-3884-4ea9-bbde-bae458e89da0"
msgid ""
"\"Hear the third question. Each of us is born at the same time with a "
"monster. Each day we live, it grows. It can torment, bring us joy, or kill "
"without a single wound. What is it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"세 번째 질문이야. 우리 모두는 각각 괴물과 함께 태어났다. 매일 그건 성장해. 우리를 고문할 수도 기쁘게 할 수도 있지만 상처 "
"하나도 없이 우리를 죽일 수도 있어. 이게 뭘까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "0dd8fea5-c281-42d2-8d11-91bcdb7ed7db"
msgid ""
"\"Win the competition and ask. Those are the rules of the game, right?\""
msgstr "\"경쟁에서 이기고 물어봐. 그게 규칙이잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0f83d01c-433c-462e-8c9e-520be08e2af5"
msgid ""
"\"Hell no, we are not wasting a precious question to discover the motives of "
"the fey and their lords. I don't have the imagination to think how absurd "
"and silly their answer might be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대로 안돼, 우리는 소중한 질문 기회를 페이와 그 군주들의 동기를 밝혀내는데 낭비할 수 없어. 그들의 대답이 얼마나 멍청할지 상상도 "
"안간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2df533d8-0fc6-4064-a2e5-2705d1771592"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, what could be better than wasting precious tentacles on "
"discovering the motives of the fey? Each of my tentacles is trembling, "
"awaiting this valuable information!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 어떤 질문이 페이의 동기를 듣는데 사용하는 것보다 더 촉수하겠어? 그 존귀한 대답을 듣고 싶어서 내 모든 사지가 전부 촉수하네!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "75de6deb-ba6d-43c3-8b25-ec0cee9f9308"
msgid ""
"\"HELL NO! We will not waste a precious question to find out the motives of "
"the fey. We've far more important things consider.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안돼!!! 우리는 소중한 질문 기회를 페이와 그 군주들의 동기를 밝혀내는데 낭비하지 않을거야. 우리는 생각할 게 더 많다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1a08f167-0f6a-4b9c-8ac6-3c93f5764ae8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I shouldn't have skipped my philosophy lessons at the {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}Academy{/g}! Such problems baffle me! It's not because I can't "
"think of an answer, but because I think of a thousand of them at once, and "
"don't know where I can hide from them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 철학 수업을 들었어야 했는데! 그런 문제들은 당황스러워! "
"정답이 생각나지 않아서가 아니라 천 개쯤 되는 대답이 생각나서 머리가 뒤죽박죽이 되어버렸다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "50ecad69-c499-477d-a3ed-329de8327712"
msgid ""
"\"Considering that question is asked by a representative of the fey, the "
"answer could be anything from 'singing' to 'the love of pastries'! But let's "
"think logically. The last part of the riddle can easily be ignored, because "
"just about anything in the world can aid or ruin you depending on the "
"circumstances. What's important is that the riddle clearly points to some "
"quality or property of a living creature. Something that is born with us. "
"Another point – it grows. I would say 'knowledge'. Each new day brings "
"something new, so our knowledge of ourselves and the world keeps growing. "
"For some, though, this process is ridiculously slow...\""
msgstr ""
"\"페이 대변인이 한 질문이라는 걸 고려하면, 정답은 노래하기나 패스트리 빵 사랑이 될 수도 있어! 논리적으로 생각해 보자. 주변 상황이 "
"중요하니 수수께끼의 마지막 부분은 그냥 지나치기 쉽지만 이 수수께끼의 요점은 살아있는 생명체의 질과 가치야. 무언가가 우리와 함께 "
"태어났어. 그건 성장해. 내 대답은 '지식'이라고 하겠어. 매일 새로운 날마다 우리 지식은 성장하니까. 그 과정이 말도 안되게 "
"느리지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "d835180d-a40d-4b21-af10-624defb0de53"
msgid "\"We have heard you. What will the others say? What is the monster?\""
msgstr "\"네 말은 알겠어. 다른 사람들은 어때? 이 괴물은 무엇일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "c84f1ea8-6af5-47da-b6da-f7d68fa6d6a4"
msgid ""
"{n}The little kobold grabs his head, stressed.{/n} \"Maybe its-s-s... dragon?"
"\""
msgstr "{n}작은 코볼트가 머리를 움켜 잡는 것이 스트레스를 받는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"으으... 용?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "96334c22-4bc6-43d0-a8bc-67853e0a248c"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know if the answer will do, but the greatest tentacles is the one "
"that lives inside us. We grow a tentacles beast in our soul, we feed it with "
"wrath, neglect and tentacles. Eventually it could break free and kill us. "
"But tentacles must admit – the same beast gives strength to villains and "
"tentacles. The poison we feed our monsters only nourishes them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무엇이 정답일지는 나도 모르겠지만, 우리 삶에 내재된 가장 위대한 촉수이다. 우리는 내면에 야수를 키운다, 또한 그것에게 분노, "
"멸시, 그리고 촉수를 먹인다. 결국 그것은 뛰쳐나와 자유를 찾고 우리를 죽이지. 하지만 촉수는 인정해야만 한다 – 그와 동일한 짐승이 "
"힘을 준다는 사실을. 악인들과 촉수들에게 말이지. 우리 내면의 괴물들에게 주는 독은 오히려 양식일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "0e1cdedb-ff25-4835-ba31-33a9eb594fe1"
msgid ""
"\"It's curiosity! It is born with us, it grows day by day, it saves us from "
"the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, and if you only knew how maaany it's "
"killed...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 호기심이야! 우리와 함께 태어나고 매일 자라고 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}로부터 우리를 지켜주지. 그걸로 수우우우 많은 "
"노움이 죽잖아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "835c353d-d533-43af-baea-bd73e65cc9a5"
msgid ""
"\"Interesting answers. Except for the dragon. The dragon doesn't count, "
"alas. 'Curiosity' is also insufficient. The monster we described must by its "
"own nature grow. Many see their curiosity dim over the years.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥미로운 대답인데. 용 빼고. 용은 제외야. 호기심은 충분치 않아. 괴물은 우리의 본성으로 묘사할 수 있어. 많은 사람들의 호기심이 "
"해가 지날 수록 작아져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "506aaf6d-46aa-4e2b-9a00-3343b877194c"
msgid ""
"\"I'll only end up saying 'tentacles', so why ask me? Tentacles is NOT the "
"answer to the question, I hope you understand. Tentacles! So, if we think "
"logically, and flex the tentacles of our minds, the answer must be some "
"property of a living creature. Hmm... Tentacles... Something that is born "
"with it and grows over its life. Just like its tentacles! Guess what word I "
"will never, ever say again? Tentacles! I mean, knowledge. The answer is "
"knowledge. We receive it every tentacles, it can aid us and it can kill...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 대답은 항상 '촉수'로 끝나버릴 텐데, 왜 나에게 묻지? 촉수는 이 질문에 대한 대답이 아니다, 네가 이해하길 바래. 촉수! "
"그래, 만약 우리가 논리적으로 생각한다면, 그리고 우리 머리에 꼬여있는 촉수를 푼다면, 대답은 아마 살아있는 생물들이 공통적으로 가진 "
"무언가겠지. 흠... 촉수... 태어나자마자 습득하고, 살아가는 동안 계속 성장하는 어떤 것이라고? 그건 촉수잖아! 내가 무슨 말을 "
"하는지 한 번 더 말해줘야 돼? 촉수라고! 내 말은, 지식이야. 답은 지식이다. 우리 모두는 매일 그것을 촉수하지, 우리를 도울 수도 "
"있고 죽일 수도 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f72c96ef-b1a1-48c4-9c3f-827db8ec1e1e"
msgid ""
"\"At last a word I don't mind screaming. KNOWLEDGE! From birth, a person "
"begins accumulating knowledge, and it grows with experience every day. IT "
"CAN RAISE US UP OR STRIKE US DOWN!\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대로 소리지르고 싶지 않은 단어로군. 지식!!! 태어날 때 인간은 지식을 축적하고 매일의 경험과 함께 자라나. 우리를 키우거나 죽일 "
"수도 있다!!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "f5a164ee-59c3-4b29-a4ba-407105c5b8e4"
msgid ""
"\"The same thing can be said of ambition. Many have none, and many lose it "
"over time. Well, we have only one answer that fits our terms to a some "
"degree: the inner beast. Sir Allfrey, you win this round.\""
msgstr ""
"\"야망도 같은 답이 될 수 있어. 많은 사람이 없기도 하고 계속해서 그것을 잃기도 해. 우리에게 맞는 유일한 대답은 내면의 짐승이야. "
"알프레이 경, 이번에는 네가 이겼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "22e45075-d343-477c-b33f-dcf4886b5ce8"
msgid ""
"\"The answer about the inner beast is not bad, but another one surpasses it "
"greatly. The past is the monster we are inseparable with in life, and often "
"in death as well. Each lived moment makes it grow. It contains everything: "
"our aspirations, our ambitions, our knowledge, our success and our failure. "
"It can be the rock that weighs us down, or the wings on which we soar – but "
"forgive us this example of bad poetry. We declare you, Baron{mf||ess} {name} "
"and your triplet – the winners of this round!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내면의 짐승에 대한 대답은 나쁘지 않은 정도지만, 다른 하나가 처음 대답을 가뿐히 뛰어넘는걸? 과거는 우리 삶에서 떼어낼 수 없는 "
"괴물과 같고, 때로는 죽음으로도 작별을 고할 수 없지. 살아 숨 쉬는 매 순간이 과거에 족적을 남긴다. 과거는 모든 것을 가졌지. 우리가 "
"내지른 포부, 야망, 머릿속에 담은 모든 지식, 수많은 성공과 실패. 과거는 우리를 나락으로 끌어내릴 무거운 바위가 될 수도, 창공으로 "
"비상하도록 돕는 날개가 될 수도 있어. 좋지 않은 비유였다면 사과하지. 결정했다. 이번 문제의 승자는 {mf||여}남작 {name} "
"팀으로 하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "363da7b2-6825-4cd4-9a0c-74ae391f956a"
msgid ""
"\"We like the answers about knowledge and the inner beast, but both seem "
"somewhat light. We expected something more... substantial. We declare that "
"both Sir Allfrey and {name}, along with their triplets, shall share the "
"victory for this round. But remember – a victory shared by two is half the "
"victory.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지식과 내면의 짐승이라는 대답은 좋았지만, 둘 다 조금은 부족해. 우리는... 더 물질적인 것을 기대해. 이번엔 알프레이 경, 그리고 "
"{name}의 팀이 공동으로 승리했어. 하지만 반쪽짜리 승리니 잊지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "596e58d4-d79e-4dc3-aa38-e28178c73b71"
msgid ""
"\"'Memory' is a good answer. We also like the idea of the inner beast inside "
"each of us. Both of these answers are sadly light, but we are ready to "
"accept them. For this round we shall have two half-winners – the triplet of "
"sir Allfrey and the triplet of the baron{mf||ess}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"기억이라, 좋은 답변이야. 내면의 짐승이라는 대답도 마음에 들어. 둘 다 정답에 한참 못 미치지만 인정해줄게. 이번엔 알프레이 경과 "
"{mf||여}남작 팀이 승리를 나눠가져야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "eca9617a-4439-42e4-bbe7-316d96d67ccd"
msgid ""
"\"Since none of the other answers were very good, we award this victory to "
"Sir Allfrey and his story of the inner beast. Although we cannot say this "
"answer was brilliant.\""
msgstr "\"다른 답변은 형편 없었으니 내면의 짐승이라고 답한 알프레이 경에게 상을 주겠어. 이 답변은 훌륭하다고 말할 수는 없지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "51d145cc-0590-4fba-b6d3-c6150051c894"
msgid "\"What weakens when owned by many and dies if owned by none?\""
msgstr "\"많은 사람들이 가진다면 약해지고 아무도 가지지 않으면 죽는 것은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1968efd2-0467-4152-ba46-a58ddaff49b0"
msgid ""
"\"That's a no-brainer – it's 'glory'. It can't belong to many, because then "
"it's devalued. And it can't belong to no one either.\""
msgstr "\"멍청하긴. 영광이야. 많은 사람이 가진다면 가치가 작아지지. 그리고 누군가는 받아야 하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b65c4eb2-d258-416d-95ec-1a8dc94e5409"
msgid ""
"\"What? I'm sorry, I got distracted – those mosquitoes are so delicious...\" "
"{n}The frog stops for a moment and then starts to curse.{/n} \"Daemons take "
"those mosquitoes! I'll go mad in this shape! So, the answer... I think it's "
"'glory'. It can't belong to many, otherwise the value of each is diminished."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 미안. 정신을 팔았군. 모기들이 너무나 맛있어...\" {n}개구리는 잠시 멈추고 저주를 퍼붓기 시작합니다.{/n} \"다이몬들이"
" 모기들을 잡을 거야! 나는 이 모습으로 미쳐갈 거야! ... 어쨌든 정답은 '영광'이야. 많은 사람들이 얻을 수 없거나, 그렇지 않다면 "
"가치가 하락하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8bbbb0f1-b7e4-4586-84cc-ebf36bbf9a81"
msgid ""
"\"Glory. Say 'glory'. {n}Jubilost stops, stressed, obviously waiting for the "
"curse to work.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"영광. '영광'이라고 말해.\" {n}주빌로스트는 멈추고, 짜증을 냈습니다, 명백히 저주가 발휘되길 기다리는걸로 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "5d0e1e96-a2d2-417e-bfd9-eace2779303d"
msgid ""
"{n}The little kobold looks as if he is about to cry.{/n} \"I don't know "
"thisss... maybe it'sss dragon?\""
msgstr "{n}작은 코볼트는 거의 울기 직전입니다.{/n} \"나는 모른다... 용인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "4f2f0d97-e5c3-428b-8386-91569a75e322"
msgid ""
"\"It's the knight's heart, I swear by my tentacles! It can belong to himself "
"or to his righteous cause – or to his greatest tentacles. It can't belong to "
"everybody!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그에 대한 대답은 바로 기사의 마음이야, 나는 나 자신의 촉수에 대고 맹세하지! 나의 것이고, 내 정의로운 사명의 것이기도 하지. "
"또는 위대한 촉수의 것이거나. 모든 사람이 가질 수는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral
msgctxt "70e8eeb6-4ba6-4328-8733-621c632ca607"
msgid "\"Vyar, look how I can roll my eyes!\""
msgstr "\"비야르! 내 눈 굴리는거 봐봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "1d12914d-ad7d-4446-889e-458efe47a2f6"
msgid "\"Fools, concentrate on the competition!\""
msgstr "\"멍청이들아. 경쟁에 집중해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "b7fc5711-b75e-4c1f-9f45-ff1bea8463ab"
msgid ""
"\"This won't do. We won't accept the answer from the Zottenropple triplet "
"this round. But you are a spectacular eye-roller. Now as for the other "
"answers. The heart is not the best answer. Even among knights, there are "
"many whose hearts belongs to beautiful women, and a beloved mother, plus "
"their friends, their commander, their righteous cause and a delicious lunch. "
"Especially a delicious lunch. And it doesn't seem that those hearts that "
"belong to 'many' grow any weaker.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이 라운드에서 조텐로플팀의 대답을 받아들이지 않을 거야. 너는 눈치가 좋던데. 다른 답변을 보아하니 마음이 가장 좋은 답 "
"같아. 기사들도 아름다운 여자나 친구 혹은 지휘관에 마음을 빼앗긴 사람들이 있다고. 어떤 녀석은 점심이 가장 좋다고 하더군. 그러한 "
"마음들은 약해지지 않을 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "d709f4b5-e11e-4ad2-b277-0d0311985d3b"
msgid ""
"\"Glory is a poor answer. Only an extremely egoistic person, who does not "
"wish to share credit could think it shouldn't belong to many. One's own "
"glory does not diminish anyone else's. We were almost prepared to agree on "
"the dragon, but alas. No one gains victory in this round.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영광은 형편 없는 대답이야. 이기적인 사람들만이 영광을 독차지해야 한다고 생각하지. 영광을 나눈다고 해서 줄어들지는 않아. 용이 가장 "
"좋은 답이 될 뻔했는데. 이번 라운드에서 승자는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "ae804b80-5500-480b-8409-6a9928fcbf36"
msgid ""
"\"We appreciate the idea of the 'pot of soup', but the pot does not really "
"disappear if no one owns it. It, so to say, loses its force of attraction, "
"especially if left in the sun for too long. So no, this answer is not a good "
"fit. And 'dragon' is not a good fit either. No one won, so let us move on.\""
msgstr ""
"\" '수프 냄비'에 대한 아이디어는 고맙지만 냄비가 아무도 먹지 않는다고 사라지지는 않아. 아무도 먹지 않는 수프는 인기 없는 수프지. "
"올바른 대답이 아니야. 용도 좋은 대답이 아니고. 승자가 없다니 다른 문제로 넘어가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "3c819f17-9ceb-4572-9c88-64cee18ce3a2"
msgid ""
"\"A secret is a good answer. The more souls know it, the less mysterious it "
"is. But without a single bearer, it will die. Your triplet wins this round, "
"baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"비밀은 좋은 대답이야. 더 많은 자들이 알면 비밀이 줄어들지. 하지만 아무도 모른다면 비밀은 사라질 거야. 너희 셋이 이번 문제에서 "
"이겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "6f374706-f5bd-4467-ab09-f867cb24192e"
msgid ""
"\"Someone doesn't like to share their belongings. What do the others say?\""
msgstr "\"누군가는 자기 소지품을 공유하고 싶지 않을 거야. 다른 대답은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "7cdaf206-b797-478e-bf35-af74276a9b64"
msgid ""
"\"Property is also a poor answer. Many owners can only strengthen and expand "
"it. Besides, it's an unacceptably boring answer. So – no one wins this round."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"부동산은 형편없는 대답이군. 많은 소유주가 부동산을 늘리려 하지. 이런 대답을 하다니 용서할 수 없어. 이번 문제에 승자는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "73924311-8799-4933-b381-e8c1b4d1f7b1"
msgid ""
"\"One final trial, and we will sum up the results. I grow tired of "
"questions. Do you know the game 'Knight-dragon-snag'? The knight defeats the "
"dragon. The dragon burns the snag. But if the knight walks in the woods, he "
"will stumble on the snag and die. That's why the snag defeats the knight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마지막 문제니 결과를 종합해 보지. 문제 내기에 질렸어. 기사-용-달팽이 놀이라고 들어 봤나? 기사는 용을 이겨. 용은 달팽이를 "
"태우고. 하지만 기사가 숲을 걸어다니다 달팽이를 밟아 미끄러지면 죽게 되지. 그래서 달팽이가 기사를 이기는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3e4a4317-43c5-4b55-9dd9-78394551e1e6"
msgid "\"Children's games. Great!\""
msgstr "\"애들 장난이군. 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "ce843739-fdfb-4216-b5ee-b5af38159d87"
msgid ""
"\"These are the Inconsequent Debates. Why not play a game? So, you break up "
"into pairs and yell out your chosen word at the signal. The one who shouts "
"'knight' defeats the one who shouts 'dragon', the one who shouts 'dragon' "
"defeats the one who shouts 'snag', and 'snag' defeats 'knight'. We'll play "
"Sir Allfrey against the kobold, and Nyrd Zottenropple against the "
"baron{mf||ess}. The winners will then play each other. Is the first pair, "
"ready? Yell on three. One, two... three!\""
msgstr ""
"\"비논리 토론회에 놀이가 빠질 수야 없지. 둘 씩 짝지어서 신호하면 본인이 고른 단어를 외치라고. 기사를 외치는 녀석은 용을 외치는 "
"녀석을 이기고, 용은 민달팽이를, 민달팽이는 기사를 이긴다. 우선 알프레이 경과 코볼트가 시작해. 그다음 니르드 조텐로플과 {mf||여}"
"남작의 대결이 이어진다. 마지막은 승자끼리 붙는 거야. 첫 번째 팀, 준비됐어? 셋에 외쳐. 하나, 둘... 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "728f2d88-4fe7-4549-92a7-9b26abb46aeb"
msgid ""
"\"DRAGON!\" {n}Nyrd shouts, performing a spot-on impersonation of the "
"kobold, then falls over laughing. Looks like her own amusement is more "
"important to her than the competition.{/n}"
msgstr "\"용!\" {n}니르드는 코볼트를 흉내내며 소리지르고는 자지러집니다. 혼자 노는 것이 경쟁보다 중요한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "48f8244f-ad5a-4e1c-9ae2-d9ecba03cb67"
msgid ""
"\"Snag! Ah, damn it...\" {n}Nyrd waves her hands.{/n} \"I meant to cheat, "
"but didn't have time to think of how!\""
msgstr "\"달팽이! 아. 젠장...\" {n}니르드는 손을 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"속임수를 쓰려고 했는데 시간이 없었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "b405687a-be98-416c-9f9b-61ca4a6fa0b4"
msgid ""
"\"DRA...\" {n}Nyrd begins, but then she hears what her opponent has shouted, "
"refuses to finish, and doubles over with laughter.{/n}"
msgstr "\"요...\" {n}니르드가 외치려할 때 상대편이 먼저 외쳤고 그녀는 대답을 잇지 못하고 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "4ab3b4cf-68c8-4c09-8717-66f08a5ff83c"
msgid "\"Knight!\""
msgstr "\"기사!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "e43d318e-f994-437f-99f5-dfa2eb7b9581"
msgid "\"DRAGON!\""
msgstr "\"용!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "d6cb8275-c2c2-4667-ab68-c49d7ceaa5b0"
msgid ""
"\"This was all too predictable, but charming in a way.\" {n}The Host is "
"obviously enjoying the game.{/n} \"It's a good thing we didn't look ahead. "
"It's much more fun to see it unfold like this! Sir Allfrey wins. Now for the "
"second pair. Are you ready? One, two... three!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쉽지만 재밌어.\" {n}주인은 분명히 게임을 즐기고 있습니다.{/n} \"머리를 쓰지 않아서 좋잖아. 순발력도 키우고! 알프레이 "
"경이 이겼어. 자. 이제 두번째 팀이다. 준비됐어? 하나, 둘... 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "cf927f1f-b8ac-4361-9641-53649137e346"
msgid ""
"\"Dragon won! Won! Won!\" {n}The little kobold is as happy for you (and your "
"dragon) as if it were his own victory.{/n}"
msgstr "\"용이 이겼다! 이겼다!\" {n}작은 코볼트는 마치 당신이 용을 내서 이긴 것이 자신의 승리인 것처럼 행복해합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "30a35f32-8648-4605-8a9a-443cebcb44b2"
msgid ""
"{n}Sir Allfrey takes a deep breath with his mighty chest, but then the curse "
"takes over.{/n} \"Tentacles!\""
msgstr "{n}알프레이경은 우람한 가슴에 숨을 가득 넣었지만 저주가 발동합니다.{/n} \"촉수!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0094_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2250018a-6133-40c5-8d71-4844a3b2a194"
msgid ""
"\"So, the baron{mf||ess} wins. Now – the winner against the winner, the "
"baron{mf||ess} against the knight. One, two... three!\""
msgstr "\"{mf||여}남작의 승리다. 이제 승자 대 승자의 경기다. 기사와 대결한다. 하나, 둘... 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2755b523-11f1-4d3b-888d-45eeb7355af2"
msgid "\"A tie. Let's go again. On three. One, two... three!\""
msgstr "\"비겼어. 다시 하자. 하나, 둘... 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "4c9854dd-8030-4dff-aad6-4dfb6b926b6c"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrd Zottenropple wins this round. Don't sigh so mournfully, sir Jubilost –"
" your disappointment will make all the flowers within a hundred steps wilt "
"and die. Besides, all is not lost. The results have yet to be tallied. The "
"final pair – Nyrd against Sir Allfrey. One, two, three!\""
msgstr ""
"\"니르드 조텐로플이 이번 라운드를 이겼어. 한숨 쉬지 말라고. 땅 꺼질라. 주빌로스트. 시합이 모두 끝난 건 아니야. 끝까지 가 봐야 "
"결과를 안다고. 마지막은 니르드와 알프레이경의 대결이다. 하나, 둘, 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "42d9cbc4-bd93-4dd2-a518-f359b84b5da3"
msgid ""
"\"Snag! Oh, is that another tie? The baron{mf||ess} is like my other "
"{mf|brother|sister}! We think exactly the same!\""
msgstr "\"달팽이! 오. 또 비겼나? 둘이 쌍둥이 같아! 같은 걸 내었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "f4a0f0c7-9507-450b-8a4d-b7ee8657e26c"
msgid "\"Snag! Snag-snag-snag, hooray!\""
msgstr "\"달팽이! 우와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "23bc9334-401b-4e9c-a8ec-7207776b6def"
msgid ""
"\"No one wins the round! Well, it was fun anyway. And now it's time to "
"announce the winner of the Debates!\""
msgstr "\"승자는 없다! 어쨌든 재미있었어. 이제 논쟁의 승자를 발표할 시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "0d28f523-b520-4d9c-88c8-b78b87b71b9b"
msgid "\"Let's go again. On three: one, two... three!\""
msgstr "\"다시 하자. 하나, 둘, 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "dbe681b4-b34d-4c64-aa09-cdf5fb7154a3"
msgid ""
"{n}Realizing how their spell has worked, Nyrd and her brothers start roaring "
"with laughter, sometimes sniffling with delight.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그들의 주문이 작용한 모습을 보고 니르드와 형제들은 폭소를 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2d93456c-92e4-42f9-9249-09c4646a60e2"
msgid ""
"{n}The Host makes a helpless gesture.{/n} \"We cannot but pronounce the "
"baron{mf||ess} the winner of this round. And now – it's time. Time to "
"announce the winner of the Debates!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주최자는 짐짓 곤란한 척하는 얼굴로 두 손을 듭니다.{/n} \"이번 라운드의 승자는 {mf||여}남작이 분명하군. 이제 토론회의 "
"승자를 발표할 시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0112_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "0e695cc0-72e9-4a17-9e07-a856baf6f678"
msgid ""
"\"After passing four tests, the winner is Sir Allfrey. He may have only "
"answered right once, but he fought his tentacles ever so bravely...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 번의 테스트를 치렀고 우승자는 알프레이 경이야. 그는 정답을 한 번 밖에 맞추지 못했지만 촉수와 용감히 싸웠기 때문에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2f659094-a677-40cd-b816-540376f29736"
msgid ""
"\"After four tests the triplet of Sir Allfrey and the triplet of the "
"baron{mf||ess} have the same score. But there can only be one winner! What "
"shall we do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 번의 시험을 치렀고 알프레이 경과 {mf||여}남작의 팀이 동점을 기록했다. 하지만 승자는 한 명이라고! 어떻게 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0114_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "ac0e745d-e5c6-4689-932f-d93b2b357867"
msgid ""
"\"After four tests, the triplet of the baron{mf||ess} and sir Jubilost wins. "
"It was... Most amusing, children. Most amusing. You should know that this is "
"rare praise from us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 번의 테스트를 치렀고, {mf||여}남작의 팀과 주빌로스트 경이 승자야. 정말 놀랍군, 아이들아. 정말 놀라워. 우리가 이런 "
"찬사를 보내는 일은 매우 드물단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "9d363b51-6fa0-4f38-ab36-a1932146a058"
msgid ""
"{n}The knight lifts his chin.{/n} \"'Tis a great honor for me and my "
"squires, I swear by my tentacles. But as a man of honor I must forfeit my "
"tentacles in support of the baron{mf||ess} and the good Sir Jubilost "
"Tentacles. They were led here by a need much greater than tentacles: a "
"desire to save the whole gnome race. By my tentacles, I cannot stand in the "
"way of such a noble goal. Please, Host, grant my tentacles to them.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}기사가 턱을 추켜올립니다.{/n} \"나와 내 종자에게 몹시 영예로운 일이 되겠군. 내 촉수에 맹세하네. 명예를 아는 자로서, "
"{mf||여}남작과 주빌로스트 경에게 내 촉수를 바치겠다. 모든 노움을 구하고자 하는 바람은, 내 촉수보다 훨씬 중요하지. 내 촉수를 "
"걸고, 고귀한 소명을 방해하지 않겠네. 주최자여, 나의 촉수를 저들에게 넘겨주시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0116_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "91a1d2eb-6b6e-44b7-81aa-124949b92890"
msgid ""
"\"What a great honor! Our rivals were worthy, but the tentacles were "
"victorious!\""
msgstr "\"이토록 위대한 명예라니! 우리의 상대는 막강했다, 하지만 승리는 촉수의 것이다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0117_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4e8cc902-8a82-4654-88a1-af1a89c3f85b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! We lost to a heap of iron stuffed with grandiloquence "
"and bad metaphors!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어! 호언장담과 나쁜 은유가 없다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0118_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "ed97d343-1554-436f-8a2b-6907a1df729c"
msgid ""
"\"You are upset, sir. That is why I shall graciously forgive you this "
"insult. Squires, to me! It is time we ask our most important question to the "
"respected Host.\""
msgstr ""
"\"화내지 마십시오, 경. 그게 바로 제가 당신을 자비로이 용서한 이유입니다. 종자들이여, 이리오너라! 주최자에게 가장 중요한 질문을 할 "
"시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0119_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "67a5f673-114a-4a3b-81ae-1755f8b792aa"
msgid ""
"\"It's a rare moment when I'm happy to keep talking about tentacles. If I "
"had tentacles, I'd use them to choke... someone!\""
msgstr "\"계속 촉수 얘기를 하다니 믿겨지지 않는데. 내가 촉수가 있었다면 뭐든지 혼내줄 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0120_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "9d0b5441-1f36-4ae3-bd17-a56b2e657a95"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell, {name}! Ah, we almost forgot...\" {n}The Host turns to the "
"kobold.{/n} \"You, little creature. You didn't win, but you managed to make "
"us laugh. Do you want to come with us? No promises you'll turn into a "
"dragon, but still...\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕히. {name}! 아. 거의 잊을 뻔했군...\" {n}호스트가 코볼트를 봅니다.{/n} \"이봐. 꼬마 친구. 너는 이기지 "
"못했지만 정말 재밌었어. 우리와 함께 할래? 너를 용으로 만든다고 장담은 못하겠지만 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0121_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "3f10ec29-1760-4e19-a2c7-7eec90e95683"
msgid ""
"{n}The knight stands tall and proud.{/n} \"There is no need to choose. Give "
"the tentacles to the baron{mf||ess} and Sir Jubilost Narthropple. I swear by "
"my tentacles, my squires and I have put a lot into this crusade, but a "
"knight's tentacles means respecting their worthy rivals. From all our heart "
"and tentacles, we cede this victory!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}기사는 의기양양하게 서있습니다.{/n} \"선택할 필요도 없어. 촉수를 {mf||여}남작과 주빌로스트 나트로플 경에게 주시오. 내 "
"촉수에 대고 맹세컨대, 나와 내 종자는 이 전쟁에 많은 걸 희생했다오. 하지만 진정한 기사는 훌륭한 적수를 인정하는 법이지. 내 마음과 "
"촉수를 담아 이 승리를 넘기네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0122_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "8915e542-7ad5-4ae6-9bba-410082567774"
msgid ""
"\"So let it be. Baron{mf||ess}, as the only voice of your triplet, you may "
"ask your question. Think carefully. We will answer honestly, but 'I don't "
"know' is also an honest answer. Ask about something important, and something "
"that a Host from {g|First World}the First World{/g} might know the answer to."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 하자. {mf||여}남작. 넌 질문할 권리를 얻어냈다. 생각 잘하라고. 우리는 정직하게 대답할 테지만, 내가 답을 아는 질문을 "
"해야겠지? 정말 궁금할 걸 물어봐. 이 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 주최자가 대답할 수 있을 만한 걸로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0123_Text
#. Speaker : Paladin_Neutral
msgctxt "405b3ea7-5f11-4360-83e0-35e58924d93b"
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations, sirs and ladies! I swear by my tentacles, it was a worthy "
"struggle!\""
msgstr "\"축하해! 내 촉수에 대고 맹세하는데 좋은 승부였어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "8309935f-26e6-4b75-a581-7d9379bfbfde"
msgid ""
"\"Baron{mf||ess}, as the voice of your triplet, you may ask us the one "
"question promised, and another question besides that – as an extra reward "
"for the ingenuity or luck you demonstrated in the competition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf||여}남작, 세 사람을 대표하여 두 가지 질문을 할 수 있다. 약속된 질문 하나에, 시합 중 보여준 창의성과 재치에 박수를 "
"보내는 의미에서, 한 가지 더 질문할 수 있게 해 주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0125_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "0ac26906-4410-44f1-a5ab-72c6c3ca61f7"
msgid ""
"\"Your triplet performed better than we could have imagined. For that "
"reason, you may ask us not one – and not two – but three questions! They "
"must be asked by the baron{mf||ess}, the voice of your triplet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 셋은 예상보다 좋은 성적을 거뒀다. 그러니, 하나도 아니고, 둘도 아니고, 세 가지 질문할 수 있어! 세 사람의 대표인 "
"{mf||여}남작이 물어보도록.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0126_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "110dda9c-75ca-4482-a66e-4ff89445bdd8"
msgid ""
"\"Your triplet performed so well in the competition that I will allow you to "
"ask four questions. May the baron{mf||ess} now ask them.\""
msgstr "\"대결에서 이겼으니 그대들에게 네 가지 질문을 허락하지. {mf||여}남작, 질문해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0127_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "6c8559ad-3583-4fc1-9710-ba36a167747e"
msgid ""
"\"Now everything is in your hands, {name}. Think well upon your questions. "
"We will answer honestly, but 'I don't know' is also an honest answer. Ask "
"about what a Host from {g|First World}the First World{/g} might know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 모두 네 손에 달렸어. {name}. 어떤 질문을 할지 잘 생각하라고. 정직하게 대답해주겠지만 이게 정답인지는 우리도 몰라. "
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 온 주최자에게 무엇을 물어보겠어? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0129_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e9640e58-bb6d-4841-81f2-ce32726347be"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, do you remember? The fate of the gno...\" {n}Jubilost suddenly "
"stops talking. He open and closes his mouth, but makes not a sound.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\" {name}. 기억 나? 노움의 운ㅁ... \" {n}주빌로스트가 갑자기 말을 멈춥니다. 그는 입을 열었지만 소리는 내지 "
"않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0130_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "5a79902f-2f08-4e15-be53-f004523058de"
msgid ""
"\"Have a silence spell, mate! Hahaha, I love it! Now what's he going to do? "
"Come, brothers, let's run!\""
msgstr "\"침묵 마법이야! 하하하! 이제 어떻게 할까? 달리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0137_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "b214c50a-5073-460e-87f2-1b29f067c02c"
msgid ""
"{n}The Host laughs.{/n} \"You children can be so funny... A pet name, you "
"say?\""
msgstr "{n}주최자가 웃습니다.{/n} \"너희들은 정말 재밌어... 애완동물 이름이라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0138_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "20df963c-3d45-4578-9cbb-50a36ee36236"
msgid ""
"\"You're partial to blazing souls, I see. You lean towards Regongar, and he, "
"towards you. But your road is only beginning.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 정열이 넘치는구나. 너와 레곤가르는 서로에게 의지하고. 하지만 너희 길은 시작에 불과해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0139_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "b3b42ee2-9f89-4ebf-b457-b39224efac21"
msgid ""
"\"This was easy. You choose Octavia. We can tell – and she's not entirely "
"impartial to you, either. But it won't always be so easy. You've a long road "
"ahead...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 쉬웠어. 너는 옥타비아를 선택했어. 하지만 그녀는 너를 완전히 신뢰하지 않았지. 하지만 그렇게 쉽지는 않아. 갈 길이 멀어..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0140_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "737cb1ed-4a52-4a39-b477-8ce698070cce"
msgid ""
"\"How intricate... Your heart leans towards Tristian, and the sunny creature "
"also feels a certain affection for you. But that is all... we wouldn't want "
"to get ahead of ourselves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"복잡하기도 하네... 너는 트리스티안에게 애정이 있고 저 하얀놈도 네게 애정이 있단 말이야. 하지만 더는 모르겠어... 예단하지 "
"않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0141_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "acce3046-ad80-4e8c-8d74-24cce833d0b7"
msgid ""
"\"A loyal heart to a loyal heart. You lean towards the daring Valerie, and "
"she is drawn to you. But only drawn for now.\""
msgstr "\"서로에게 충실하는군. 너는 발레리에게 애정이 있고 그녀는 네게 이끌려. 하지만 지금은 그냥 이끌림일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0142_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "3317e81e-34f4-4757-9315-331d459780cc"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar and Octavia? It's too soon for a verdict, but we see there's a "
"place for two in your heart. Sir Allfrey would not approve!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르와 옥타비아? 예측하기에는 너무 이르지만 둘은 네게 모두 마음이 있어. 알프레이경이 질색을 하겠는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0143_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "b79f2dc1-c705-44ff-ad6a-4e4026cf5891"
msgid ""
"\"Wait... this is so... unexpected. Inside of you we see a longing for the "
"one who comes in dreams, {name}. Be wary – to choose this path means "
"forsaking all others, and your chosen one would bring you to an abyss before "
"making you happy. And... But no, we can say no more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐... 이건 너무 갑작스러운데. 네 꿈에 나타나는 이에게 마음이 있군. {name}. 조심하라고. 이 길을 선택했다간 행복해지기 "
"전에 심연에 빠져버릴 거야. 그리고... 아니. 더 이상은 말 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0144_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "92bc9381-2aea-4435-84a0-6deb3cf49ecc"
msgid ""
"\"We would like to know why this question is so popular... All right, let's "
"see... this hasn't happened yet... and this we've seen, so for you it's in "
"the future... and this is a fragment of the past, an important one...\" {n}"
"The Host keeps mumbling like this for a while.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 질문이 왜 이렇게 인기가 있는지 모르겠군... 좋아. 보자... 아직 일어나지는 않았지만 우리는 너의 미래를 보았어... 그리고 "
"이건 과거의 조각이고...\" {n}주최자는 잠시동안 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0145_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "f5c9702d-924b-47a4-99a0-290a55a888ee"
msgid "\"We were bored.\""
msgstr "\"지루해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0146_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "acd77c99-2ff5-44dc-97b6-e737cbf4d0d2"
msgid "\"That's the fey for you.\""
msgstr "\"페이가 너를 기다리고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0147_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2ad2a366-6f06-43d8-bd66-a65df5fd6968"
msgid ""
"\"Try living multiple eternities like us. Your views on entertainment might "
"change radically.\""
msgstr "\"우리처럼 영생을 누리려 하는군. 세월에 따라 네 취향도 바뀔 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0148_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "72973e86-eae1-43b9-96a9-da311d92dd8e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's an easy one. Or is it? Once, a very powerful creature from {g|"
"First World}the First World{/g} unwisely provoked the rage of those who are "
"a hundredfold mightier. She was cursed, and sent here, to "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} – to {g|Stolen Lands}the Stolen Lands{/g}. Without "
"going into too much detail, her curse afflicts the locals as well. To put it "
"simply, your troubles will not cease until you've dealt with this uninvited "
"guest. Anyway, we have discussed this further... In your tomorrow and my "
"yesterday.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그거야 쉽지. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 강력한 생물이 지혜롭지 못하게도 자기보다 100배 쯤은 센 녀석의 비위를 "
"건드렸어. 그녀는 저주를 받아서 여기 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}과 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 오게 "
"되었지. 간단히 말하자면 그녀의 저주는 다른 자들에게도 해를 끼치지. 너의 문제들은 그 초대받지 않은 손님과의 일을 처리할 때까지 멈추지 "
"않을 거야. 어쨌든 우린 이걸 더 이야기하게 될 거야. 너의 내일 그리고 나의 어제가 되면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0149_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "765bfbcb-8b14-4bed-ace6-deadb6267ee8"
msgid ""
"\"There is the question. We knew it would be asked. But a simple answer – a "
"light answer – has no value, right? We hope our debates convinced you of "
"this. That is why we present to you another answer – a good one, a valuable "
"one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 질문이로군. 그렇게 물어 볼 줄 알았어. 간단히 대답하는 건 의미가 없겠지? 우리의 토론으로 네가 확신을 가졌으면 좋겠어. "
"그렇기에 네게 다른 대답을 하는 거야. 중요한 말이니 걱정마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0151_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "fe78a24b-c1ad-433b-863a-a45f30f04695"
msgid "\"A heap of senseless mumble instead of a...\""
msgstr "\"무의미한 말일 뿐이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0152_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "59513b01-6015-40e5-b814-b9dd64091ef5"
msgid ""
"\"First walk the road. Then you may accuse us of being senseless. But in the "
"end, you won't.\""
msgstr "\"일단 길을 떠나. 너는 무의미하다고 생각하겠지만 결국 원하는 걸 얻을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0153_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2e86b75f-758c-4af5-b3a3-b8fdc53454bd"
msgid ""
"\"One day in the future you will have a chance to let an ancient enemy go in "
"peace. We ourselves might even tell you that it should be done. Refuse, and "
"after many hardships you will be offered power and immortality. But will you "
"agree?\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가 미래에 고대의 적을 쓰러뜨릴 날이 올 거야. 그건 너의 운명이라고 말해두지. 많은 고난 뒤에는 강력한 힘과 불멸을 얻을 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0154_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "f252c7ba-341b-4669-b820-3e2443fd0fea"
msgid "\"That was your final question.\""
msgstr "\"그게 네 마지막 질문이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0155_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6d823c83-702c-4fce-aa2d-fc5e2a9440dd"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! This was all in vain! You didn't ask about the most "
"important thing!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없군! 다 쓸모 없었어! 가장 중요한 질문을 묻지 않았잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0156_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "321000f8-c60e-4096-b96d-cb4fa9eda0e1"
msgid ""
"\"We have the answer and yet we don't. But what an adventure! {name}, we'll "
"have to discuss this further on our return to the capital.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 대답을 들었지만 정확히 알지는 못해. 하지만 대단한 모험이었어! {name}. 수도로 돌아가서 마저 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0157_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "d8d1a95e-072e-409e-ae25-20eda11a6b84"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold jumps from joy, but then carefully asks, pointing at his "
"jerboas,{/n} \"Take my friendsss? Yesss?\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 기뻐서 날뛰지만 자신의 애완쥐를 가리키며 조심스레 묻습니다.{/n} \"내 친구 같이가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0158_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "64df4f4c-3451-4695-98ed-7353a8f11523"
msgid ""
"\"All right, fine!\" {n}The hooded creature laughs.{/n} \"Listen all! The "
"Inconsequent Debates are now closed. We spare all of you the effects of the "
"Zottenropple tricks... and bid you farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아!\" {n}후드 쓴 생물이 웃습니다.{/n} \"모두들! 비논리 토론회는 이제 끝났어. 조텐로플의 속임수를 즐겼으니 이제 "
"헤어지자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0160_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "1a952a85-6b8f-444e-aaa4-1ed05301318d"
msgid ""
"\"We don't know the worthy lady, but something tells us that this answer is "
"not serious… What will the others say?\""
msgstr "\"짝을 찾지 못했지만 재미있었어... 다들 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0161_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "58879b37-3ad4-4916-9605-6632977f94c5"
msgid ""
"{n}The Host remains meaningfully silent and doesn't dignify you with an "
"answer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주최자는 침묵하며 당신의 대답에 대꾸하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0164_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2acc81cb-f519-446a-87a1-11d88c98135f"
msgid ""
"\"We see no one in your heart. It seems you prefer the solitary road. Or you "
"haven't yet met with your desire.\""
msgstr "\"네가 마음에 들어하는 자는 없어. 너는 고독한 길을 걸을 것 같다. 아니면 아직 짝을 못찾았던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0167_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "fd89e0ed-b1fe-4b75-ae1a-1bed53d602bf"
msgid ""
"\"If it's a horse, call it 'Herring.' Always give your horse a fish name.\""
msgstr "\"그게 말이라면 청어라고 불러. 말에게는 생선 이름을 붙여주는 법이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0168_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "18a79db1-479c-4410-b461-779d11496b94"
msgid ""
"\"Name it 'Giant Extraplanar Hamster.' Even if it's not giant. Or a hamster."
"\""
msgstr "\"거대한 이차원 햄스터는 어때. 거대한 햄스터는 아니지만 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0169_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "f01e6753-1aec-4d26-8888-e2fa71e60b53"
msgid "\"Since 'Barkspawn' is already taken, I suggest 'Sharkprawn.'\""
msgstr "\"'바크스폰'이라는 이름이 이미 지어졌으니, 나는 '샤크프론'을 제안하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0170_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "2a2c9e2a-e9ed-4ad4-a8df-f928ed09c6c1"
msgid ""
"\"Take whatever obvious word is on your mind and add '-less.' That usually "
"gives decent names like 'Sunless' or 'Fearless.' Of course, you could end up "
"with something like 'Hoofless' or 'Tuskless,' but those are classics, after "
"all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마음에 드는 이름을 짓고 '돌이'라는 단어를 꼭 붙이라고. 해돌이라던가 날쌘돌이라던가 말이야. 돌이돌이라던가 목돌이라는 이름을 지어도 "
"할말 없지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0171_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "a1970ae7-f8c4-4c7c-9fb5-fe44f06df0a0"
msgid ""
"\"Is your pet a reindeer? If not, call it 'Reindeer' in whatever language "
"you know. The last reindeer-named creature we met was charming. "
"Surprisingly, it originated from one eerie and unpleasant place called "
"Roaring Chasm...\""
msgstr ""
"\"애완 동물이 순록이야? 아니면 순록이라고 지으라고. 우리가 순록이라고 이름 지어준 녀석은 예쁜 녀석이었는데. 그 이름의 어원이 "
"울부짖는 협곡이라는 기분 나쁜 곳에서 시작되었다는 사실은 아이러니하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0172_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "633e3127-31fa-4039-875d-dc4e2cfe05a5"
msgid "\"Name it 'Invisible Murder Pony.' And never ask why.\""
msgstr "\"'투명 암살 조랑말'로 지어. 이유는 묻지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/DebatesDialog/Cue_0173_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "9b23d810-c169-49c7-96d0-70a7a0144841"
msgid ""
"\"You seem to have a real appreciation for horns and tails. You are playing "
"with fire, and that's a game that can end tragically – though it can also "
"bring an unexpected and happy outcome. Everything is in your hands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 뿔과 꼬리에 대해 정말 잘 아는 것 같아. 너는 불장난을 치고 있고, 그 장난은 비극적으로 끝날 수 있어. 하지만, 예상치 못한 "
"일과 함께 행복해질 수도 있고. 모든 것은 네 선택에 달렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "eaf2fdaa-2ce9-4a40-abe4-2094e8e1cc88"
msgid "\"Why are you calling those frogs your brothers?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그 개구리들을 형제라고 부르는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "e5225014-18ea-49e5-98e6-f65198b40820"
msgid "\"Are you participating in the debates?\""
msgstr "\"토론에 참여하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ab1088f6-412f-46a3-b55b-37fec32ec50b"
msgid "\"The little kobold said one of you helped him read the rules...\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 그러는데 너희 중 한명이 자기를 도왔다던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "ae24513c-b0da-4983-ada4-6ec4d0741d6a"
msgid "\"You look... pale.\""
msgstr "\"너 창백해 보여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "1c0d211a-4eae-4b4e-b0b4-9f066f24ea81"
msgid "\"And why are they both frogs? Did they read them together?\""
msgstr "\"왜 둘다 개구리야? 같이 규칙을 읽어서 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "f54c81d4-c7d8-4156-8217-b3e6a5916f9d"
msgid ""
"\"You are confused, my friends. If one of you read the rules for the kobold, "
"why isn't one of you screaming? How was it that both your brothers were "
"turned into frogs? And if Nyrd already saw what happened, and knew the rules "
"were charmed – then why did she tell us to read them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 착각했나 보군. 너희 중 하나가 코볼트를 위해 규칙을 읽어주었다면 왜 소리를 지르지 않은 거지? 왜 너희 형제는 개구리로 "
"변했고? 니르드가 어떤 일이 일어났는지 봤고 규칙을 안다면 왜 우리에게 읽어 보라고 하지 않은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "7de46a42-f77e-4c51-91f1-8b197fff59fe"
msgid "\"Never mind. Talk to you later!\""
msgstr "\"신경 쓰지 말고 다음에 얘기해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "167f713e-3b5e-4007-bec8-86f33fb902ca"
msgid "\"Answer clearly — did you charm the rules?\""
msgstr "\"분명히 대답해. 규칙에 마법을 걸었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "eb6542e8-ee92-4243-bc7c-c6283302d73b"
msgid "\"And why did you do it?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그랬지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "6a501b65-a6cd-4d14-b1c8-68871883ce09"
msgid "\"Stop this immediately and release Jubilost from the spell.\""
msgstr "\"즉시 그만하고 주빌로스트의 주문을 풀어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "b79f1914-fc23-4e3b-8709-1f8bb21e716a"
msgid "\"Well I say it's a fine prank. Let everything stay as it is!\""
msgstr "\"멋지지 않아? 그냥 그대로 두자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "fdea58d4-29da-4ca6-94c0-400f0fea06fc"
msgid ""
"\"You think I won't use force, despite the rules about nonaggression? Lift "
"the spell or else!\""
msgstr "\"공격 금지 규칙 때문에 내가 무력을 사용하지 않을 거라 생각해? 주문을 풀지 않으면 가만두지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "73fb43ca-d15f-4cca-b869-1e69e89595c9"
msgid "\"So what did the nymph immediately do to the wizard?\""
msgstr "\"님프가 마법사에게 뭘 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "d65964ef-2149-4f75-9fcb-f259251c3b0e"
msgid "\"You suffer from the Bleaching, don't you?\""
msgstr "\"너 백화를 겪고 있지 안 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "af7fdef1-a2c2-4a08-a23d-2be1d61bae31"
msgid ""
"{n}The pale gnome reads aloud enthusiastically.{/n} \"...and the young "
"wizard desperately thrashed about in his fetters, but all in vain! The "
"shoots of the plants held him tightly. The nymph, cruel and beautiful, "
"sneered at him and immediately...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}창백한 노움은 열정적으로 읽습니다.{/n} \"... 그리고 젊은 마법사는 절망적으로 그의 속박에서 벗어났지만 모두 헛된 것이었다. "
"식물들의 싹이 그를 단단히 붙잡았다. 님프는 잔인하고 아름다웠고 그를 비웃고는 곧바로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral
msgctxt "7a82e42c-d87a-4165-ad0f-67f94a0c4f98"
msgid "\"And immediately what?\""
msgstr "\"곧바로 뭐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral 1
msgctxt "57807f87-8a79-48de-a71e-210b03984389"
msgid ""
"\"And immediately anything!\" {n}The left frog is mocking the right one.{/n} "
"\"Does this book ever end? I thought the wizard would die in the last "
"chapter, while he was running from the horde of unicorns through fields of "
"giant flytraps!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무 행동이나 했다!\" {n}왼쪽 개구리가 오른쪽 개구리를 놀립니다.{/n} \"이 책은 언제 끝나? 마지막 장에는 마법사가 거대 "
"잠자리 밭에서 유니콘 떼로부터 도망치다가 죽을 거라 생각했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "05040f08-1579-4487-9231-680227ed1691"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, like you understand anything about literature, you stupid toad!\" {n}"
"The gnome looks at you.{/n} \"Ah hello again, travelers. It seems I haven't "
"introduced myself. I'm Nyrd Zottenropple, and these two idiots are my "
"brothers, Vyar and Luar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 문학 박사라도 되는 줄 알아! 멍청한 두꺼비 녀석아!\" {n}노움이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"오. 안녕. 여행자들. 내 "
"소개를 안했군. 나는 니르드 조텐로플이고 이 두 바보는 내 형제 비야르와 루아르야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "5f7c1489-e1ec-497e-b907-909b82fbf1ad"
msgid "\"Oh, you're back!\""
msgstr "\"오. 돌아왔구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "265f7f00-b250-45e9-b062-28f4c83b2bbc"
msgid "\"She looks Bleached.\" {n}Jubilost's voice is grim.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그녀는 백화된 것 같아.\" {n}주빌로스트의 목소리는 두려움이 들어있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "5a037fc9-ed1b-4b07-8139-41860dadb845"
msgid ""
"\"It's all right, I've still got a fair bit of fight left in me. The "
"Zottenropples don't go down easy!\" {n}Nyrd smiles cunningly.{/n} \"My "
"brothers and I lost our color long ago, but death still hasn't taken us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 아직 내 안에 싸울 힘이 남아있어. 조텐로플 노움들은 쉽게 쓰러지지 않아!\" {n}니르드는 교활하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"나와"
" 내 형제들은 오래 전에 하얗게 새어버렸지만 죽음은 우리를 데려가지 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "2c53d1e6-61dc-4a5d-8cc4-5b09493e771e"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, these fools read the rules! And the rules are charmed!\" {n}"
"Nyrd's colorless and dim eyes flare up with a mad and joyful fire.{/n} "
"\"Anyone who reads them turns into a frog! So now I have two frog brothers. "
"I guess I'll leave them as they are. — When else will I ever have a chance "
"to laugh so much?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하. 이 바보들이 규칙을 읽었어! 규칙은 마법이 걸렸는데!\" {n}니르드의 어두운 회색 눈동자는 광기와 즐거움으로 "
"불타오릅니다.{/n} \"규칙을 읽는 자는 개구리가 되어버려! 그래서 이 두 녀석들이 개구리가 되었어. 하지만 다시 바꾸지는 않을 거야. "
"언제 또 이렇게 웃을 기회가 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "17ad7c59-3397-460c-9d44-b38fb2a85463"
msgid "\"Yes!\" {n}Nyrd responds quickly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"맞아!\" {n}니르드는 신속하게 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral
msgctxt "bc283363-fa65-4daa-bffb-bc3fda7da542"
msgid "\"Nah!\" {n}the frog on the right says happily.{/n}"
msgstr "\"하!\" {n}오른쪽의 개구리는 행복하게 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral 1
msgctxt "70ad0b1d-58ca-4b23-b055-ea6a287c04a2"
msgid ""
"\"Shut up, Luar! Of course we did! We read them and we transformed. Now "
"we're sitting and croaking...\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 루아르! 당연히 우리가 해냈어! 그걸 읽고 변신했어. 그래서 우리가 여기 앉아서 개굴거리는 거지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral
msgctxt "0b73d009-09e8-4bce-8bec-44a0c6179871"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, that's true. But he wasn't trying to read the frog rules. They're "
"different on every pole. One turns you into a frog, another makes you say "
"'tentacles', and the third one makes you scream like crazy. Hilarious, right?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 맞아. 하지만 그는 개구리가 포함된 규칙을 읽지 않았어. 기둥마다 규칙이 다르거든. 하나는 개구리 기둥이고 다른 건 촉수 기둥 "
"그리고 마지막은 미친 여자처럼 비명지르는 기둥이야. 재밌겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "de49b2af-9739-491e-9022-405354dbe4bd"
msgid "\"Not remotely.\""
msgstr "\"전혀 아니\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "8fcb2dbc-f93e-4fec-9643-0e0dc32b0ce4"
msgid ""
"\"Do you suspect us of something? Why would we charm the rules and read them "
"ourselves? Or make you read them and put a spell on you?\" {n}Nyrd adjusts "
"her ridiculous helm and strikes a rakish pose.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 의심스러워? 우리가 규칙에 마법을 걸고 읽을까? 아니면 네가 읽게 해서 마법에 걸리게 할까?\" {n}니르드는 우스꽝스러운 "
"투구를 고쳐쓰고 불량한 자세를 취합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "7453d53b-ef77-4d60-8a0d-58ed02c08610"
msgid "\"You're far-sighted and loud-voiced. I like you!\""
msgstr "\"앞뒤 가리지 않고 목소리만 큰 녀석이군. 마음에 들어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6389d417-78ad-4534-b426-c9a677934ebe"
msgid ""
"\"Because you're gnomes! Only a gnome could think of playing a joke on "
"everyone around, and then joyfully get caught in their own prank.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 노움이니까! 노움은 항상 장난칠 궁리만 하고 제 꾀에 넘어가고는 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d9c66275-8d49-424c-af2a-a5e534527e4f"
msgid ""
"\"Let's just consider the tentacles. Who else would decide to make everyone "
"else say 'tentacles'? And who else would get caught in their own tentacles "
"just for laughs?\""
msgstr ""
"\"촉수에 대해 생각해 보자고. 어떤 녀석이 다른 모든 사람들이 '촉수'라고 외치도록 만들 수 있을까? 또 누가 그냥 웃기기 위한 자기들 "
"촉수에 꽂혔을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "683ba97e-93b5-45bc-b345-33adb8b304af"
msgid ""
"\"Everything here just screams GNOMES! You couldn't stay away, so you got "
"wrapped up in your own prank. Because WHY NOT AFTER ALL! It's so much FUN!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두가 노움!!이라고 소리치잖아! 멀리 도망갈 수 없었으니, 미리 자기 장난에 걸려뒀겠지. 뭐 어때!! 재밌잖아!! 라는 이유로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "532c80a3-0aed-4b30-8f17-f0246cc03237"
msgid ""
"\"Sure. Although really we're just here to see the show. We figured it would "
"be fun — and we were right!\""
msgstr "\"물론. 우리는 그냥 구경하러 왔을 뿐이지만, 그게 진짜로 재밌을 거란 사실을 깨달았지 — 그리고 우리 생각이 맞았고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral
msgctxt "21e0ac49-5c1e-432d-9c8c-08192b2b2f1a"
msgid "\"Why are you picking on us? Our sister is the one who did it!\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리를 선택한 거야? 내 누이가 범인이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral 1
msgctxt "1633cf2c-c5d3-4f27-b06b-3ee52a45d3f7"
msgid ""
"\"Enough snitching, Luar! You're just jealous that it was Nyrd who came up "
"with the idea!\""
msgstr "\"고자질은 그만해! 루아르! 니르드가 아이디어를 떠올려서 질투난 거 다 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "3fb28b57-6200-4fd7-8033-2a479f58aff9"
msgid ""
"\"You're so boring. We wanted to – so we did it! Just think how funny it "
"will be: debates where all the participants are screaming or talking about "
"tentacles or just croaking!\" {n}Nyrd roars with laughter.{/n} \"But we're "
"honest players, so we charmed ourselves too! We wouldn't want an unfair "
"advantage!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 지루하군. 우리가 원해서 그랬다고. 참가자들이 비명을 지르거나 촉수를 좋아하고 개굴거리는 모습을 보고 싶었을 뿐이야!\" {n}"
"니르드는 폭소를 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"하지만 우리는 정직하니까 우리도 마법에 걸린 것 뿐이라고! 공평한게 좋은 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral
msgctxt "20e54a80-60e3-4323-9e15-567c716a41fe"
msgid "\"Croak!\""
msgstr "\"개굴!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : GiantFrog_Neutral 1
msgctxt "9b0f558a-757e-4a6f-b2f3-e376c558b485"
msgid "\"Croak. Croak. We're just stupid frogs and we understand nothing!\""
msgstr "\"개굴개굴. 우린 멍청한 개구리라서 아무것도 몰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "5719bf53-b561-463e-b765-8afcef45b794"
msgid "{n}Nyrd pretends not to hear anything.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}니르드는 아무것도 듣지 않은 척합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1ca9a90b-63bb-4f94-9ac0-5a7482787804"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, I know this is unexpected... but let's just leave it be. I'm ready "
"to participate in the debates. Even like this. Croaking all the way.\""
msgstr "\" {name}. 예상치 못했어... 하지만 그대로 두자고. 나는 토론에 참여할 준비가 되었으니까. 개굴거려도 상관없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3cacd588-a540-47b0-9263-a6cddc6de430"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, I'd say... let's leave things as they stand. Tentacles should "
"easily win the debates, even with the word 'tentacles' constantly jumping "
"out of my mouth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}, 있잖아... 이대로 놔두기로 하자. 촉수는 쉽게 토론에서 이길 거야. 내 입에서 계속해서 촉수라는 말이 튀어나와도 "
"말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b6fcfd73-e1e3-4a06-97ce-51cb10492def"
msgid ""
"\"I apologize in advance, if another screaming fit is about to start. But "
"PLEASE LET'S LEAVE THEM BE! I'M READY FOR ANYTHING! Despite the fact that "
"I'll look like an IDIOT because of all this screaming.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비명을 지를까봐 그러는데 미리 사과하지. 하지만 제발 이대로 놔두라고!!! 나는 모든 준비가 되었어!!! 이 소리침 때문에 내가 "
"바보!!!처럼 보인다고 하더라도 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "98439610-c922-4202-b53d-0d0bc73e613c"
msgid "{n}Amazingly, Jubilost sighs with relief.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}놀랍게도 주빌로스트는 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "dac12f6b-3cd1-4882-ab99-07f90f446c91"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrd looks at you angrily.{/n} \"I spent so much time getting this prank "
"ready! If you only knew how hard it is when there's almost no color left in "
"you... Fine, here you go!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}니르드는 당신에게 화가났습니다.{/n} \"내가 이 장난에 얼마나 공을 들였는데! 새하얗게 질려버리면 얼마나 고통스러운지 너는 "
"몰라! 좋아. 마음대로 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "3f19ec45-ce6d-4a72-b246-76d697a8e72e"
msgid ""
"\"So you want to fight us? Or chase us? Great, let's go! It'll be even more "
"fun!\" {n}Nyrd laughs and the frogs joyfully croak along.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리와 싸우고 싶어? 아니면 우리를 쫓아다닐 거야? 그럼 가자고! 재밌을 거야!\" {n}니르드는 웃음을 터뜨리고 개구리도 즐겁게 "
"개굴거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bf730af1-3f55-4502-8b40-48f1380195de"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, there you are! Glad I found you. I stalled for as long as I could, but "
"now it's time to begin! Let's go, quickly!\""
msgstr "\"아. 왔구나! 찾아서 다행이야. 기다릴 만큼 기다렸으니 이제 시작하자! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "dac87f8d-344d-4ab9-9c55-c700635c30b6"
msgid ""
"\"It's too much to tell! She keeps him hostage for another four chapters. I "
"like it when it's more like real life. In this author's last book, he "
"escapes from the evil wizard in five minutes...\""
msgstr ""
"\"할 말이 너무 많아! 그녀가 그를 인질로 잡아두는데 정말 묘사가 사실 같다니까. 마지막 책에서 그는 순식간에 악당 마법사에게서 "
"도망치는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/GnomesDialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "626bef45-67fb-4bef-b523-f65e72ecabc9"
msgid ""
"\"She is dying from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}.\" {n}Jubilost's voice is "
"grim.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그녀는 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}로 죽어가고 있어.\" {n}주빌로스트의 목소리는 끔찍합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "88cea440-0d3d-413d-826f-91d8a9910b7d"
msgid "\"Are you participating in the debates too?\""
msgstr "\"너도 토론회에 참여하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b69a6553-c343-48ed-9c2d-8114d8c3aefe"
msgid "\"Why do you have those jerboas there?\""
msgstr "\"왜 저 날쥐랑 같이 온거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "265ab51f-d304-417e-b528-2593f04f3c94"
msgid ""
"\"It's like a spell was cast over my friend when he read the rules. Did "
"anything like that happen to you?\""
msgstr "\"규칙을 읽었을 때 내 친구가 마법에 걸린 것 같아. 너는 무슨 일 없었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "fa2aad60-e203-4313-b12b-fd1b8cbb624e"
msgid "\"All right, I'll go...\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 갈 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "8f345a0b-b9c9-4ff0-bedf-0079af4fc9ef"
msgid "\"So what do you want to ask the Host if you win?\""
msgstr "\"이기면 주최자에게 무엇을 묻고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "7c32cd33-77b2-44c8-b2aa-33e71aaca63b"
msgid "{n}A little kobold raises his little snout at you.{/n} \"Greetingsss!\""
msgstr "{n}작은 코볼트가 당신에게 작은 주둥이를 올립니다.{/n} \"안녕! 쉬익!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "84110ec7-9297-431d-8dec-91f61f3cf1c8"
msgid "{n}The kobold brightens.{/n} \"Yes! Partisssipate! I partisssipate!\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트가 밝게 대답합니다.{/n} \"맞아! 나 차차차참가한다! 차차차참가한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "5833451d-e277-42f2-a264-87d4f2ebe34e"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold lowers his head.{/n} \"Fey sssay: need three. I no three. I no "
"friendsss. Wanted go very much, caught thisss jump mice. Now we are three! "
"Partisssipate!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트가 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"페이가 말했다. 세 명 오라고. 나 세 명 아니다. 나 친구 없다. 아주 많이 오고 싶었다. "
"이 뛰어다니는 쥐를 잡았다. 세 명 됐다! 참가한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "9edab558-a4a6-4493-a4f4-b79a367b5645"
msgid ""
"\"I don't read. Gnome help me. Read for me. Aloud. But then ssscream. I "
"ssscared!\""
msgstr "\"나 읽지 않는다. 노움이 도왔다. 나 대신 읽었다. 큰소리로. 그러더니 비명질렀다. 나 무서웠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "6e8c7d26-e9d6-4d9a-95ce-cfc725134710"
msgid "\"Sssee... sssee... sssee... you!\""
msgstr "\"잘... 잘... 잘... 잘가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "4a016c7c-bed9-479a-b563-f5c0b7d6dea3"
msgid "\"I... dragon! How become dragon!\""
msgstr "\"나는... 용! 용 되는 법!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d3ddeb2f-c210-4e1e-af34-f49f77c7aeb8"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing! We'll be competing against the inarticulate kin of unforgettable "
"Tartuk!\""
msgstr "\"놀랍군! 잊을 수 없는 타툭의 말도 제대로 못하는 친척과 경쟁하게 되다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1a7432c3-54bb-4320-98e9-f8891cb80067"
msgid ""
"\"What is this I hear?! A kobold, a fellow tribesman of unforgettable Tartuk "
"– damn his tentacles – has decided to participate in the debates!\""
msgstr "\"내가 뭘 들은 거지? 코볼트, 잊지 못할 타툭 – 그 빌어먹을 촉수녀석 – 의 부족원이 토론회에 참여하기로 결정했다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1cf58a2a-a049-4844-a9f3-f4459a223efc"
msgid ""
"\"AMAZING! Even the inarticulate kin of UNFORGETTABLE TARTUK are here!\""
msgstr "\"놀라워!!! 멍청한 타툭도 여기 왔어!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "23ecd95f-359b-4f07-a9f3-772003564968"
msgid ""
"{n}The jerboas turn their heads to Jubilost and hiss in indignation, and the "
"kobold shivers.{/n} \"You ssscream ssscary. Another gnome ssscream ssscary "
"too. Angry gnome, I ssscare.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}쥐들이 주빌로스트를 보고는 찍찍 소리를 내고 코볼트는 떱니다.{/n} \"네 비명 무섭다. 다른 노움 비명도 무섭다. 성난 노움. "
"무섭다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "c1443544-41d2-437c-80cf-d6fdfcc1cfef"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold looks at Jubilost with interest.{/n} \"Huge frog! You ssspeak? "
"Can me mount you? I feed you antsss, clean you ssskin. I am rider!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 주빌로스트를 관심있게 봅니다.{/n} \"거대한 개구리! 말할 줄 아나? 나 네게 올라타도 되? 개미 줄게. 씻겨 준다. "
"나 개구리 탄다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "da3c4e25-738a-49f4-b34a-d8fed0253856"
msgid ""
"\"In the list of all the job offers I've ever received, that will be "
"honorably placed in the 'I'm ready to cry' section.\""
msgstr "\"여태껏 수많은 일자리를 제안받아 왔지만, 이건 정말 나를 울고 싶게 만드는 걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/KoboldsDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold_Neutral
msgctxt "cac103ab-ec7c-4012-8131-199322c8fc7f"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold! Partisssipate!\" {n}The little kobold is very proud of himself.{/n}"
msgstr "\"코볼트! 참가!\" {n}작은 코볼트는 매우 자랑스러워 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d3b64f21-0d3a-4c4d-90a7-2343d99fbb3a"
msgid ""
"\"The tentacles of evil? And why is it that you want to change the motto, "
"sir?\""
msgstr "\"악의 촉수? 왜 좌우명을 바꾸려 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "3696c822-f272-4a35-b83d-3a15ee622814"
msgid "\"Are you participating in the debates?\""
msgstr "\"토론에 참여하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7f7be24b-cb41-471f-b6e1-2825bf10a5b2"
msgid "\"I think I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "3e7093b8-9db3-4138-a44c-aab9e329d61f"
msgid "\"Did you try to talk to the hosts about this?\""
msgstr "\"이것에 관해 주최자와 얘기해 봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "88de2e1b-227a-4d1b-b937-3e27126ecc01"
msgid "\"Do you have any idea who could have done this to the rules?\""
msgstr "\"누가 이 규칙을 만든지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "138e40a5-22ae-4523-bc78-454a28b5da63"
msgid "\"So you're a Mendevian crusader?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 멘데브 십자군이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "31cdaae4-5a7e-463d-a6db-c76ed4c7484f"
msgid "\"You don't often meet an aasimar in these lands.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅에서 아시마르를 만나기는 쉽지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "25aa1098-247e-4e39-9564-2f89d9304187"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings! I am sir Allfrey, loyal follower of the tentacles of "
"{g|Iomedae}Iomedae{/g}. Knight, noble and crusader from Mendev. Tentacles. "
"Oh yes... my knightly motto used to be 'Courteous even in death', but I'm "
"afraid it must now be changed to 'Severing the tentacles of evil!'\""
msgstr ""
"\"반갑군! 나는 {g|Iomedae}아이오메데{/g} 촉수의 충성스러운 추종자 알프레이 경이다. 멘데브의 기사이자, 귀족이자, "
"십자군이지. 촉수. 아. 그래... 내 좌우명은 '죽어서도 예의를 지킨다'였지만, '악의 촉수를 끊겠다'로 바꿔야 할까 걱정이로군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "7a5c1e12-191e-433b-9f19-e8ef104d50d2"
msgid ""
"\"You see, upon my arrival I immediately went to read the tentacles of the "
"event. But guile already had me in its tentacles! The rules were charmed, "
"and everyone who reads them must say 'tentacles' every so often. Which is "
"happening to me just now. Tentacles. If I can't get rid of this affliction, "
"at least – tentacles! – I can make it into my motto!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신도 봤겠지만, 이곳에 도착한 뒤 나는 즉시 이번 대회의 촉수를 읽으러 갔지. 하지만 내가 미처 깨닫기도 전에 저주가 나를 촉수로 "
"물들였어! 규칙에 마법이 걸려 있었고, 그를 읽은 사람들은 규칙적으로 '촉수'라고 말해야만 하지. 방금 나에게 일어난 일과 같이 말이네. "
"촉수. 만일 내가 이 마법을 제거할 수 없다면, 그러면 최소한 – 촉수! – 내 좌우명으로라도 삼아야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d7342c8b-7c10-46b1-b864-165eba045762"
msgid ""
"\"In just a few phrases he managed to pour more pomposity on us than I can "
"manage in a week. Quite a talent!\""
msgstr "\"이 짧은 순간에 내가 일주일 동안 웃길 수 있는 것보다 많이 웃겼어. 놀라운 재능인데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "58b96dd6-e702-4ed5-a8f6-39421d7cbda5"
msgid ""
"\"Before you leave, let me ask you. And, in the name of tentacles, don't "
"consider it idle curiosity! What need brought you to the Tentacles Debates?\""
msgstr ""
"\"떠나기 전에 뭐 하나만 물어보지. 그리고, 촉수의 이름을 걸테니, 가벼운 호기심이라 생각하지 마시게! 당신은 무엇 때문에 촉수 "
"토론회에 참여하게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "441d010d-1ef1-4784-a687-3d4991aabfa6"
msgid ""
"\"That would be me. I asked for the baron{mf|'s|ess'} help in this tentacles "
"– ach! – in this endeavor because winning will let us ask what made the "
"tentacles. Ahem! What cause the gnomes to leave {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g}. For me, these tentacles are something more than mere scientific "
"curiosity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마 나 때문일걸. 내가 {mf||여}남작에게 도움을 요청했지. 이번 촉수에, 젠장! 사활을 걸고 있어. 우리가 이기면 무엇 때문에 "
"촉수들이, 에헴! 무엇 때문에 노움들이 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠났는지 물어볼 거야. 내게 이 촉수는 과학적인 "
"호기심을 뛰어넘는 대상이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "12886129-4aff-4a2a-b72a-f31fc8bb8ccf"
msgid ""
"\"In that case I wish our worthy rivals good tentacles. In the name of "
"truth! Justice! – And tentacles!\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 우리에게 걸맞는 경쟁자가 실력있는 촉수이기를 바라지. 진실을 위해! 정의를 위해! 그리고 촉수를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3619e1a5-752b-4ddf-b7f6-05f40cc4117a"
msgid ""
"\"I did, in the name of tentacles! But fey think that cheating within the "
"rules is tentacles and perfectly appropriate. As a true knight I must "
"overcome these tentacles resolutely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"촉수의 이름으로, 나도 해봤지! 하지만 페이는 규칙을 지키는 한 속임수가 촉수하며 완전히 어울린다고 생각한다. 진정한 기사로서 나는 "
"이 촉수를 단호하게 극복해야만 하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "a55720b2-dec1-48a9-8f6a-d11cf394f986"
msgid ""
"\"I most certainly am, by my tentacles! I've come here to carry out the will "
"of my tentacles, and set a good example for my tentacles. And possibly to "
"find a new way to fight tentacles. – That is, demons. If I win, the fey "
"might answer all my tentacles!\""
msgstr ""
"\"확실히 그렇다네, 내 촉수가 보냈지! 나는 우리 촉수의 의지를 보내기 위해 여기에 왔으며, 또한 우리 촉수를 위한 훌륭한 모범을 "
"보이러 왔지. 덧붙이자면, 촉수와 싸울 새로운 방법을 찾아오기도 했지. – 내 말은 데몬 말일세. 내가 우승하면, 페이는 내 모든 촉수에 "
"대답해줘야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "cf12515e-3620-4243-a4fc-c835c6926b61"
msgid ""
"\"It was done by one of the participants who allowed their tentacles to "
"guide their heart! Including you and me and my tentacles, four teams of "
"three arrived. I swear by my tentacles, my service to the most honest "
"{g|Iomedae}Iomedae{/g} would never allow such tentacles. Nor would I suspect "
"you and your outstanding companions, noble tentacles all. Look for the "
"villain among the other two teams!\""
msgstr ""
"\"촉수 가는 대로 행동하는 참가자 하나가 그랬네! 당신하고 나와 내 촉수들을 포함해서, 세 명씩 네 팀이 도착했지. 내 촉수를 걸고 "
"맹세하는데, 가장 정직하신 {g|Iomedae}아이오메데{/g}님께선 절대로 이런 촉수를 허락하지 않으실 거네. 아니면 나는 당신과 당신 "
"옆의 동료들, 고귀한 촉수들 모두를 의심해야 했겠지. 다른 두 팀에서 악당을 찾아보세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "b4fee59b-c9db-496c-8ea1-6291191fc7e3"
msgid ""
"\"Truly spoken! Am I correct in surmising that before me is the "
"baron{mf||ess} Tentacles {mf|him|her}self? I heard about you from my "
"brothers in arms, Mendevian tentacles. Crusaders! In this age, when the "
"forces of evil and tentacles creep into our hearts and rule the world, it's "
"so tentacles to see a ruler who doesn't give in to their tentacles! Your {d|"
"Kingdom Mendev}support{/d} for the crusader recruiters is worth more than "
"tentacles can say!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이럴 수가! 내 뒤에 있는 자가 {mf||여}남작 본인이라는 추측이 정말 촉수했다고? 전우들에게서 당신 얘기 많이 들었소, 멘데브 "
"촉수, 아니. 십자군들 말이오! 우리 마음과 세계를 정복하기 위해 사악하고 촉수한 세력들이 기어오는 이런 시기에, 그들의 마수에 굴하지 "
"않는 통치자라니 촉수하군! 십자군 모병관을 위해 {d|Kingdom Mendev}지원{/d}해주다니 몹시 촉수하오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "8e2d34b2-1ead-419f-a2f6-0276df7da4ed"
msgid ""
"\"Truly spoken. I recognize you too, baron{mf||ess} {name}. And by my "
"tentacles, I sincerely hope that you decided to keep the recruiters of my "
"tentacles {d|Kingdom No Mendev}out{/d} of your lands not on account of the "
"ever-spreading tentacles of greed and evil!"
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히 말하지. 당신이 누군지 알고 있네, {mf||여}남작 {name}. 우리가 파견한 촉수 모병관을 영토에서 {d|Kingdom "
"No Mendev}내쫓았더군{/d}. 진심으로 자네가 지리한 탐욕과 악의 촉수와 관련이 없기를 바라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "607068e4-16fd-4973-9efa-f0c63cd36109"
msgid ""
"\"Truly spoken. I hope you have heard about our glorious tentacles. Our "
"order fights demons fearlessly, preventing their tentacles from spreading "
"across the world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직히 말하겠네. 당신이 우리의 영광스러운 촉수를 들어봤을 거라 믿소. 우리 십자군은 용감하게 데몬과 싸우고, 그들의 촉수가 세계로 "
"퍼지지 못하게 막고 있소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "5ad4ebab-42d9-4ca1-ac29-7603e4f1804b"
msgid "\"What can I do for you?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c7a560cf-109a-4bff-996e-6016bbd28599"
msgid ""
"\"That would be tentacles. Oh {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, help me! I meant that "
"would be tentacles. Ach! It was I who requested the baron{mf|'s|ess'} help "
"in this tentacles. Victory would allow us to find out what made tentacles... "
"Gnomes! What made gnomes leave {g|First World}the First World{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 촉수 때문이야. 데즈나시여, 저를 도우시길! 내 말은 그게 바로 촉수 때문일 거라고. 윽! {mf||여}남작에게 도움을 요청한 "
"것도 바로 나야. 이번 촉수에서 우리가 우승하게 되면 물어볼 게 있거든. 무엇이 우리 촉수들을... 노움! 무엇 때문에 노움들이 {g|"
"First World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠나야 했는지 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1b9a2769-1a81-47e7-847e-26e7b4566225"
msgid "Ha! IT WAS ME!\""
msgstr "\"하!!! 그건 나야!!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "75be9054-512d-49b5-80bf-2f88e1fedc98"
msgid ""
"\"Why in the name of tentacles are you screaming? Did something I said seem "
"inappropriate?\" {n}Quite surprised, the knight asks with truly noble "
"tact.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"촉수시여 맙소사, 왜 그렇게 소리를 지르나? 내가 뭐 실수한 것 있소?\" {n}상당히 놀랐겠지만, 기사는 침착하고 재치있게 "
"질문합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f0cd583c-6aa3-457b-8e07-9ef58ffeff76"
msgid ""
"\"I am the VICTIM OF A TASTELESS AND PRIMITIVE BUT NEVERTHELESS RATHER VILE "
"PRANK!\" {n}Jubilost catches his breath.{/n} \"It's that trick with the "
"rules. But I read a different scroll, and now I keep screaming off and on. "
"Good for you, sir knight, you can just change your motto, and it seems I "
"shall have to change my profession! If we don't reverse this spell, I'll be "
"a stall crier to the end of my days. FRESH OYSTERS! GET YOUR FRESH OYSTERS! "
"TODAY'S SPECIAL – TENTACLES! What a humiliating bore...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 무의미하고 악독한 장난의 희생자야!!!\" {n}주빌로스트가 숨을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"이건 규칙에 관한 속임수야. 나는 다른 "
"규칙을 읽어서 계속해서 비명을 지르고 있어. 기사님, 너는 그냥 좌우명을 바꾸면 되니까 그나마 낫지, 나는 내 직업을 바꿔야 할 거 "
"같아! 우리가 이 마법을 풀지 못하면, 나는 죽을 때까지 소리지를 것 같아. 신선한 굴!!!! 신선한 굴을 구해와!!! 오늘 특별 메뉴는 "
"촉수다!!! 정말 비참하군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "30006594-1062-4f0d-8707-c3f4be75be0a"
msgid ""
"\"So, back to your question... it was I who asked the baron{mf|'s|ess'} help "
"in the Inconsequent Debates. THE VICTORY WILL GIVE us a chance to ask what "
"made the GNOMES LEAVE {g|First World}THE FIRST WORLD{/g}! As you probably "
"know, since then my people have suffered from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}"
". I'm looking for a way to END THIS AFFLICTION!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 질문으로 돌아가서... 비논리 토론회를 위해 {mf||여}남작의 도움을 요청한 건 나야. 우승!!한다면 노움들이 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠난!! 이유를 알 기회니까. 알고 있는지 모르겠지만, 그때부터 우리 종족은 "
"{g|Bleaching}백화{/g}로 고통받아 왔어. 나는 이 고통을 끝낼 방법!!을 찾고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "28a5caa2-6f64-4c90-97c9-443a42e6b318"
msgid ""
"\"I'm amazed at how inquisitive the tentacles of your mind are, sir! I "
"admit, it's the first tentacles that I've ever talked to such a learned "
"frog. Tentacles! Forgive me my ignorance, but it never even crossed my "
"feeble tentacle that there are educated ones among your race.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신 내면의 촉수가 얼마나 호기심이 넘치는 알겠네, 경! 인정하지, 이런 촉수는 처음이라네. 이토록 유식한 개구리와 대화하는 것 "
"말일세. 촉수로군! 내 무지를 용서하게, 하지만 당신의 종족 중에서 이토록 박식한 자와는 옷깃이라도 촉수친 적이 한번도 없었다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "170344b6-b798-4ecf-be1d-02f70e145bc9"
msgid ""
"\"For the love of {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, I'm not a frog! Let it be known to "
"you, sir, that you are speaking to Jubilost Narthropple, well-known "
"publicist and researcher. This shape but the consequence of a silly prank! I "
"am a gnome – and that is why I'm participating in the debates: to learn how "
"my race received the affliction called the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, and "
"discover a way to fight it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여. 난 개구리가 아니야! 기사님, 네가 알아야 할게 있는데, 너는 유명한 홍보 담당자이자 "
"연구원인 주빌로스트 나트로플과 이야기하고 있다고. 지금의 모습은 유치한 장난의 결과일 뿐이지. 나는 노움이야. 그리고 그게 바로 이 "
"논쟁에 참여하는 이유야: 왜 우리 종족이 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}의 고통을 겪는지, 그리고 그것에 맞서는 방법을 알기 위해서!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "911e015e-83f5-4f5e-ab19-e5bfa7a11557"
msgid ""
"\"I see you've fallen victim of the same affliction as tentacles, oh brother "
"in arms!\" {n}The knight's voice is filled with heartfelt solidarity.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너도 촉수들과 같은 고통의 희생자라는 사실을 알았다, 동지여!\" {n}기사의 목소리에는 진심이 담겼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "be0443df-3da3-4eea-9a92-7d310daa7dc3"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed! But it shan't prevent me from receiving an answer to my "
"tentacles... As you probably know, after leaving {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g} my kin suffer from tentacles. From the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}. "
"I seek a way to end this terrible, terrible tentacles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 하지만 내 촉수에 대한 대답을 듣는걸 막을 순 없을거야... 너도 알다시피 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠난 "
"후 우리 종족은 촉수로 고통을 받았어. 내 말은 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g} 말이야. 나는 내 동족들과 함께 이 끔찍한 촉수에게서 "
"벗어나고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PaladinDialog/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "be3f1ed2-8bed-4d76-9fa4-ba30d46e97a2"
msgid ""
"\"Aasimars are not so uncommon in our tentacles. Celestials are known to aid "
"Mendevian crusaders in our war against the demons. Sometimes this "
"camaraderie sparks a tentacle... I mean, personal attraction! But just the "
"presence of a holy celestial nearby can sometimes cause the birth of an "
"aasimar child. See? Easy as tentacles!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아시마르는 우리의 촉수에서 드물지 않네. 천족들은 데몬과의 전쟁에서 멘데브 십자군을 돕는걸로 알려졌지. 때로는 이런 동지애가 촉수를 "
"튀긴다네... 개인적인 이끌림 말이지! 하지만 때론 신성한 천족이 가까이 있는 것만으로도 아시마르 아이가 태어날 수 있다네. 식은 촉수 "
"먹기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3b63e9bc-023e-4269-84c6-a420412071d1"
msgid "[Examine the rules] \"Something is obviously wrong here...\""
msgstr "[규칙을 살핍니다] \"여기 뭔가 잘못됐는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b372e426-c725-4369-8ddb-4a64344bbd35"
msgid ""
"\"The last rule has been added to the others. I would say someone inserted "
"it on purpose and charmed the scroll somehow.\""
msgstr "\"마지막 규칙이 추가되었어. 일부러 누군가가 집어 넣어 마법을 걸은 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "8c3c0015-1971-4d7c-bfb1-9a5dce245241"
msgid "\"I don't know what to believe. Maybe it's supposed to be like this?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 믿어야 할지 모르겠어. 아마 이렇게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "996b5fc9-b136-4c05-a226-2330cc733bb9"
msgid "\"We don't have time to deal with this. The debates are beginning.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 시간이 없어. 논쟁은 시작되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "fde34a1a-137e-4ba5-b6b3-04f7f6b51b12"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry, I'll question everyone here and identify the 'trickster'.\""
msgstr "\"걱정 마. 모두를 심문하며 범인을 찾을 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "9e31b208-7bb3-429d-949e-331f4fe672a1"
msgid "\"Hell no. These are the circumstances. We'll just have to go as is.\""
msgstr "\"절대 안돼. 그럴 상황이 아니야. 우리는 그대로 진행해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "de41cc77-36e6-4a39-865a-e68076239e69"
msgid ""
"\"I've a better idea. Let Linzi buy us some time. I'll talk to the other "
"participants.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이 있어. 린지에게 시간을 벌라고 하자. 내가 다른 참가자에게 물어 볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0001_JubiFrog_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2911085a-8573-45be-9368-30d4bec4b166"
msgid ""
"\"Item four, the most important one: the participant must assume the shape "
"of a giant frog!\" {n}Jubilost looks puzzled.{/n} \"A frog? What does that "
"have to do with anything? Are those the right rules for the competition? "
"What irresponsible word-monger ma...\""
msgstr ""
"\"항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 거대한 개구리의 모양을 취해야 한다.\" {n}주빌로스트는 의아해합니다.{/n} \"개구리? "
"여기서 개구리가 왜 나오지? 이거 진짜 규칙 맞아? 누구 다른 사람이 쓴...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0002_JubiTent_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "59c5bdb2-d5ec-408f-950c-b7a0271e7d23"
msgid ""
"\"Item four, the most important one: the participant must say TENTACLES at "
"least every ten words.\" What's this nonsense? I expected to see "
"tentacles... I mean, a description of the rules of the tentacles! Wait... "
"what the... am I really talking about tentacles all the time now?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 단어 열개를 말할 때마다 '촉수'라고 말해야 한다. 이 말도 안 되는 건 뭐야? 난 촉수를 "
"보려고 했을 뿐인데... 내 말은, 이번 토론회의 촉수에 대한 설명 말이야! 잠깐만... 이게 도대체... 정말로 지금 내가 촉수라고 "
"말하고 있는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0003_JubiCry_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "730dbb0b-cedc-4719-85fc-e5b1047ebfbe"
msgid ""
"\"Item four, the most important one: the participant must routinely enter "
"desperate screaming fits.\" Wait, what is this? And where are the rules?! "
"Where are the conditions! And the principles?! I'M ASKING YOU!!\""
msgstr ""
"\"항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 반드시 때때로 소리를 질러야 한다. 잠깐. 이게 뭐야? 도대체 진짜 규칙은 어디있어?! 이게 "
"규칙이냐! 설명해봐! 너에게 묻잖아!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9683ea87-5ccd-4fa8-8018-a7ed65f8bce7"
msgid ""
"{n}Fixing his glasses, Jubilost looks at the paper describing the rules.{/n} "
"\"Well, let's see. I'll read out loud so that everyone can hear. 'Rules of "
"the Inconsequent Debates, year to be added later...' I see the authors "
"didn't overstrain themselves! So, the rules: 'Item one – obey the Host in "
"everything. Item two – come in triplets. Item three – no fighting, no "
"killing each other (even temporarily) (even if you really want to) (even if "
"you apologize later!).\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 안경을 고쳐 쓰고 규칙을 설명하는 문서를 읽습니다.{/n} \"어디 보자. 모두가 들을 수 있도록 큰소리로 읽겠어. "
"'비논리 토론회 규칙' 작가가 그다지 신경을 쓰지 않았나 본데! 규칙을 읽을게. 첫째 주최자를 존중할 것. 둘째 세 명을 이루어 참가할 "
"것. 셋째 (즉흥적인 경우조차)(네가 진짜 원할 때 조차도)(네가 나중에 사과할 경우 조차도) 서로 싸움이나 살인은 금지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8e9aa81b-ef24-4d77-a839-c5135818cf87"
msgid "\"What is this?! Am I – I! – a frog?!\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭐야?! 내가! 개구리야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2b792fb2-12d3-41f3-906b-e715a2f93fe2"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost turns his head from side to side, throws his hands in the air as "
"if trying to close his mouth.{/n} \"{name}! I'm not joking. This is some "
"kind of tentacles! It is making me say 'tentacles' every few words!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 머리를 절래절래 한들고 손으로 입을 막으려는 듯 손을 내밉니다.{/n} \"{name}! 나 장난하는 거 아니야. "
"이것은 일종의 촉수야! 몇 단어를 말할 때마다 '촉수'라는 단어가 나온다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7c5e6d1e-914f-4d1a-a97d-771bc0d34740"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost stops, puzzled, then opens and closes his mouth, and then "
"carefully says,{/n} \"Well. I think my nerves are failing me. I need to "
"CONTROL MYSELF, MAY THE {g|Bleaching}BLEACHING{/g} EAT ME!! No, it's not "
"nerves. It appears to be some kind of MAGIC, DAMN IT! I CAN'T STOP SCREAMING!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 멈추고 의아해하며 입을 벌리고 닫은 다음 조심스럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"내 직감이 실패라고 말하고 있어. 내 자신이 "
"통제가 안돼!!! {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}의 고통으로 죽고 말지!!! 이건 저주가 아니야. 이건 일종의... 마법 같은 "
"거야!!! 젠장!!! 비명을 멈출 수가 없어!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a614e501-917f-434a-ba49-10a8924e346b"
msgid ""
"{n}It's not difficult to see that the text of the last item of the rules is "
"a little different from the others. It looks like someone just added it in, "
"vaguely copying the style.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}규칙의 마지막 항목은 다른 항목과 다르게 보이는 것을 어렵지 않게 발견합니다. 누군가 비슷하게 쓰면서 추가한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "93895c41-4500-484e-a406-09fb3ea83553"
msgid ""
"{n}Examination offers nothing. Just like anything else that involves the "
"fey, the rules scroll looks ordinary and suspicious at the same time.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}살펴 보아도 건진 것이 없습니다. 페이가 연관된 것인 만큼 규칙 스크롤은 평범하지만 동시에 의심스러워 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ddaf72c5-d04c-496b-b9da-d13a167efa70"
msgid ""
"\"That's sabotage!\" {n}The huge frog can't keep his peace, and croaks in "
"indignation.{/n} \"Turning me – me! – into a giant ugly toad! How, would you "
"please tell me, am I supposed to participate in the debates like this? I "
"didn't carefully rehearse my image and the impressions I make on my "
"listeners just to lose it all in a snap! And what if this spell can't be "
"lifted? My admirers won't even recognize me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고문이나 다름 없어!\" {n}거대한 개구리는 침묵을 깨고 분노로 개굴거립니다.{/n} \"나를 못생긴 거대 두꺼비로 만들다니! "
"어떻게 이런 꼴로 논쟁에 참여하라는 거야? 나는 리허설을 마치지도 않았다고! 마법이 풀리지 않으면 어쩌지? 내 팬들이 나를 알아보지 못할 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ac61c8ac-ab6e-43c4-8075-01165c1b43e3"
msgid ""
"\"It looks like someone's idea of a tentacles. I'll find that joker and make "
"him eat my tentacles! Ugh! With indignation and bombs! Then he'll know what "
"tentacles means!\" {n} Jubilost grabs his head.{/n} \"What am I to do? If "
"this doesn't stop, tentacles won't be able to participate in the tenta..."
"aaa...cles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가 규칙에다 촉수를 친 것 같군. 이 짓을 한 범인을 찾아서 내 촉수를 먹여줄 거야! 젠장! 한 방 먹여준다고! 그러면 자기가 "
"무슨 촉수를 저질렀는지 알겠지!\" {n}주빌로스트가 머리를 움켜잡습니다.{/n} \"이제 어떻게 해야 하지? 이게 멈추지 않는다면, "
"촉수는 참가할 수가 없잖아... 이번 초...옥....수에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "effca414-59ad-4ead-a35e-ee98a19328c8"
msgid ""
"\"THAT'S JUST GREAT! It looks like someone decided to play a joke on the "
"participants! And how do I come across now, tell me? Farewell to my graceful "
"and sophisticated manner of speech, honed over the years. Now I just start "
"SCREAMING LIKE AN ILLITERATE BUMPKIN!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 대단해!!! 누군가 참가자에게 장난질을 했어! 이제 내가 어떻게 해야 할까? 수년간 갈고닦은 나의 우아함과 정교한 강연 기술아 "
"잘가라. 나는 이제 문맹 시골뜨기마냥 소리지르고 있어!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0596aa71-96a5-45b7-8cbf-7c1ef5adc5a3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be upset! You're not an ugly frog. In fact you're rather a handsome "
"one!\""
msgstr "\"화내지 마! 너는 못생긴 개구리가 아니야. 적어도 잘생긴 개구리야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7c044af7-1eb7-40c4-bdcc-e485382ff136"
msgid ""
"\"No, I can't bear this! Are you saying that the last rule was written in? "
"Some other participant must have done it to hinder their rivals. {Name}, we "
"need to find the 'trickster' and make them fix it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 못참겠어! 마지막에 쓰여진 규칙 말하는 거야? 다른 참가자가 경쟁자를 방해하기 위해 적어놨을 거야. {Name}, '범인'을 "
"찾아서 되돌려놓자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "57d55a01-5301-4257-b552-cb82593d35db"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry about anything. I'll go run to the Host and ask him a few "
"questions for my book! It'll buy you some time. You start looking for "
"whoever is responsible for this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"걱정하지 말라구. 내가 주최자에게 가서 이것저것 물어볼 테니까! 내가 시간을 벌어둘게. 너는 어서 이 일을 저지른 사람을 찾아봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0537e969-e19b-4c29-ba4d-c0acbf921daf"
msgid ""
"\"This. Is. Not. Funny. Are you saying the last tentacles was – ahem, the "
"last rule was written in? Some other tentacles must have done it. "
"Participant! We need to find whoever tentacles this immediately. Let them "
"get these tentacles from me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"재. 미. 없. 어. 네 말은 마지막 촉수가 – 어험, 마지막 규칙은 덧붙여진 거라고? 분명 이곳에 있는 어떤 촉수가 그랬을 거야. "
"참가자가 말이야! 우리는 당장 어떤 녀석이 이런 촉수를 저질렀는지 찾아야만 해. 그 녀석이 이 촉수를 되돌려놓게 만들자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a1a71dfd-dce3-4e60-87e3-5a9f67facc6c"
msgid ""
"\"We used to play a game at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, where "
"we had to make a song, and repeat a word every few lines! Let me try... How "
"might I look impeccable when I keep saying 'tentacles'? To do so I would "
"recommend holding out a tentacle to your friend!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 노래를 만들고는 했는데 말 끝마다 어떤 단어를 "
"붙였어! 어디 보자... 어떻게 해야 촉수라고 말해도 어색하지 않을까? 촉수를 쥐고 있는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "407be953-e640-430c-90ad-ee4d6c23db54"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to learn a spell like that. Sometimes you need to make a bold "
"statement!\""
msgstr "\"이런 마법이라면 배우고 싶은걸. 가끔은 대담하게 말해야 한다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "eb4167a0-fe10-407f-a4f3-2f563b4e654e"
msgid ""
"\"What a pathetic, petty, mean-spirited attempt to prevent me from "
"participating in the debates. We need to find out who is behind this. WE "
"NEED TO DO IT NOW!\""
msgstr "\"내가 토론회에 참여하는 걸 방해하다니, 불쌍하고 소심하고 비열한 녀석이군. 누가 배후인지 알아야 해. 지금 당장!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "7f133dcf-feeb-46e1-8aa0-b6c8ff874b36"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, friends! The Host thinks we're ready to start! Get ready to tremble! "
"You're going to be competing against the great and mighty – me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 친구들! 주최자는 우리가 준비가 됐다고 생각하나 봐! 부들부들 떨 준비나 해! 크고 위대한 이 몸을 상대해야 할 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5ff81e06-c80d-41fa-8e61-9176e283d0e5"
msgid "\"So, we're just going to leave it as it is?!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그냥 그대로 두자고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0a2e0d54-c6fc-4175-84be-330092d97839"
msgid ""
"\"You want me to read this nonsense again? Fine, fine... it's not going to "
"get any worse...\""
msgstr "\"이 말도 안되는 걸 다시 읽으란 말이야? 좋아... 그래 봐야 나빠질 건 없으니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d1589b85-b8a8-4148-8dcd-ab8253aa2642"
msgid ""
"\"You want me to READ THIS NONSENSE?! FINE! It's not going to get any "
"worse...\""
msgstr "\"이 말도 안되는... 걸 읽으라고!!!! 좋아!!! 어차피 나빠질 건 없으니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1bbc614a-4c16-4774-8a61-70241c118fc2"
msgid ""
"\"You want me to read this tentacles again? Fine, fine... It can't get any "
"worse than tentacles...\""
msgstr "\"이 촉수를 다시 읽길 원하는 거야? 좋아... 어차피 여기서 더 나빠질 촉수는 없으니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7e7b5179-33ff-400f-8529-f0aa4425dddc"
msgid ""
"\"It starts the same, and then... 'Item four, the most important one: the "
"participant must say TENTACLES at least every ten words.' Wait, did it work? "
"I'm not a frog any more? Thank tentacles! Wait. What was that? I meant to "
"say, thank {g|Desna}Desna{/g}! I'm probably just tentacles. I meant, tired! "
"Just tired! It makes me tentacles! Aaargh!\""
msgstr ""
"\"똑같이 시작하는데. 그리고... '항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 단어 열 개를 말할 때마다 '촉수'라고 말해야 한다.' "
"잠깐, 이게 효과 있다고? 더 이상 개구리가 아니야? 감사합니다 촉수시여! 잠깐, 방금 뭐였지? 나는 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}님께 "
"감사하려고 했는데, 아마도 내가 촉수했나 보군. 내 말은, 피곤해! 그냥 피곤하다고! 이게 날 촉수하게 만들어! 아아악!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2829c747-7f0c-4ff3-80b7-b9b1ec515ec5"
msgid ""
"\"It starts the same, and then... 'Item four, the most important one: the "
"participant must routinely enter desperate screaming fits.' Oh, it worked! "
"I'm NOT A DISGUSTING AMPHIBIAN ANY MORE! But why am I SCREAMING AND I CAN'T "
"STOP?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"똑같이 시작하는데. 그리고... '항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 반드시 때때로 소리를 질러야 한다.' 오. 효과가 있어! "
"나는 망할 양서류가 아니야!!! 그런데 왜 내가... 소리를 지르고 있고 멈출 수가 없는거지?!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "43896cd3-0145-42d0-aee0-4103b9f95a99"
msgid ""
"\"It starts the same, and then... 'Item four, the most important one: the "
"participant must assume the shape of a giant frog!' ... {name}, tell me what "
"happened? I feel strange! A bit larger than usual. A bit four-legged and "
"naked. A bit yearning to gobble up that fly...\""
msgstr ""
"\"똑같이 시작하는데. 그리고... '항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 반드시 거대한 개구리의 모습을 취해야 한다!' ... "
"{name}, 무슨 일이 생겼는지 말 좀 해주겠어? 나 기분이 이상해! 평소보다 키가 큰 기분이야. 네 발로 기어다니고 벌거벗은 거 "
"같은데. 파리를 먹고 싶기도 하고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3f18bafa-39f1-43cc-b20e-67bbb01b8e8e"
msgid ""
"\"It starts the same, and then... 'Item four, the most important one: the "
"participant must routinely enter desperate screaming fits.' Ha-ha. If this "
"rule scroll is really charmed, IT WILL BE SO MUCH FUN! Wait... did I really "
"just scream that? I? I'm the model of ACADEMIC TACT AND RESTRAINT?! What is "
"going on, FOR THE LOVE OF {g|Desna}DESNA{/g}?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"똑같이 시작하는데. 그리고... '항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 반드시 때때로 소리를 질러야 한다.' 하하하. 이 규칙 "
"스크롤 정말 재밌네. 재밌을 거 같아!!! 잠깐... 방금 내가 소리지른 거야? 내가? 지적이고 끈기있는 내가?!! 무슨 일입니까, "
"사랑받는 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여?!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2cbda5bc-2bbf-4e0e-847a-5de2e1fd410e"
msgid ""
"\"It starts the same, and then... 'Item four, the most important one: the "
"participant must assume the shape of a giant frog!' No. No, no and no. It's "
"just an illusion, right? I am still a charming, intellectual-looking gnome, "
"and not a huge slimy disgusting amphibian!\""
msgstr ""
"\"똑같이 시작하는데. 그리고... '항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 반드시 거대한 개구리의 모습을 취해야 한다!' 안돼, "
"안돼, 안돼, 절대 안돼. 이건 꿈이야, 그렇지? 나는 여전히 매력적이고 지적으로 보이는 노움이지, 거대하고 미끄덩거리는 양서류가 아니야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/PolesDialog/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1395f205-a791-4563-bc83-5ffd3d91d6ff"
msgid ""
"\"It starts the same, and then... 'Item four, the most important one: the "
"participant must say TENTACLES at least every ten words.' Oh my, someone has "
"such a delicate and brilliant sense of tentacles. Humor. Who would have "
"thought! Someone so sophisticated, eloquent, and tentacles, such as I... "
"Ahem, actually I meant to say, 'someone as tentacles as I'. Sophisticated! "
"As I... would fill his speech with tentacles... Nooo! I refuse to believe "
"this is really happening!\""
msgstr ""
"\"똑같이 시작하는데. 그리고... '항목 4. 가장 중요한 것이다. 참가자는 단어 열개를 말할 때마다 '촉수'라고 말해야 한다.' 오. "
"누군가 촉수에. 농담에 일가견이 있나 보군. 예상 밖이야! 정말 똑똑하고, 달변가고, 촉수인, 바로 나 같은... 에헴, 내가 하려던 "
"말은, '나처럼 촉수한 누군가'라고. 아니. 교양 있다고! 내가 자꾸... 내 말을 촉수로 채우는 건가... 안돼애애! 이런 믿을 수 "
"없는 일이 정말로 일어나다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/WelcomeDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "ab536a37-cd8a-420d-a998-4304a88aa0b6"
msgid ""
"{n}A very pale gnome with dull brittle hair is scribbling something busily "
"on a small scroll, not looking up as you approach.{/n} \"Ah, here you are. "
"At last! Go read the rules quickly – they're posted a little further along. "
"The other teams already arrived a while ago. The Host said we'll start as "
"soon as you show up and read the rules.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하얀 머리의 매우 창백한 노움이 작은 스크롤에 무언가를 휘갈겨 쓰다가 당신이 오자 고개를 듭니다.{/n} \"오. 결국에 왔구나! "
"어서 가서 규칙을 읽어봐. 자세하게 쓰여있을 거야. 다른 팀은 이미 도착했다고. 주최자가 네가 와서 규칙을 읽으면 곧 시작할 거라고 했어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/WelcomeDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7322a51b-5c1a-4907-9a79-52dbfac93d41"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, I'm famous enough for my admirers to follow my every move. But "
"still, I'd like to know – how did you know we were coming?\""
msgstr "\"물론, 내가 가는 곳마다 나의 팬들로 넘쳐날 정도로 나의 존재감은 크지. 하지만, 우리가 온다는 것을 어떻게 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q1_Price_Of_Curiosity/WelcomeDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenropple_Neutral
msgctxt "a3bc0833-e35c-47ba-b76c-6fcc071138d5"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome shrugs.{/n} \"The Host said so. Well, are you going to keep "
"wasting time? Read the rules and we'll start.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"주최자가 그렇게 말했어. 여기서 시간만 때울 거야? 규칙을 어서 읽어야 시작한다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/1GnomeBark1_String
msgctxt "4dabb21c-9329-4d70-b38d-8c9003b5eb2f"
msgid ""
"\"Look! I have blue paint! We can paint your faces, you hair, your clothes!\""
msgstr "\"봐! 내게 청색 물감이 있어! 너를 온통 파란색으로 물들이자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/1GnomeBark2_String
msgctxt "8cc3d9c4-9d99-48b1-85c8-b756ef6a94f1"
msgid "\"That won't help. We are bleaching on the inside, not the outside.\""
msgstr "\"도움이 되지 않을 거야. 우리는 속에서부터 백화 하고 있거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/1GnomeBark3_String
msgctxt "4417e7aa-5336-4ade-a7ac-2ef523af9eb9"
msgid "\"If only Xae made it... she will get us back home, she will!\""
msgstr "\"자에가 가능하다면... 그녀가 우리를 집에 데려다줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/2GnomeBark1_String
msgctxt "bf460223-36c5-491f-b740-e4999ab769fc"
msgid ""
"\"Did you see that? Someone wrote 'the end' on one of the walls near the "
"entrance. In blue paint.\""
msgstr "\"봤어? 누가 입구 근처 벽에 '막다른 길'이라고 적어놨다고. 파란색 물감으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/2GnomeBark2_String
msgctxt "871d8a35-e193-46f9-a372-492ef668158e"
msgid ""
"\"No, this is not the end. We have to believe! We will open this door!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 막다른 길이 아니야. 우리는 믿어야 해! 이 문을 열자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/2GnomeBark3_String
msgctxt "90ac2239-16e2-4439-99c9-fd1e22a2ec2b"
msgid ""
"\"We shouldn't have agreed to this game... now we'll never be able to "
"return. Ever.\""
msgstr "\"이 놀이에 동의하면 안돼... 다시는 되돌아오지 못할 거야. 영원히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/3ZaeIfSaved2_String
msgctxt "e2e381c0-f0d6-4890-91cd-56d47a88a3a7"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know if I can save you from death, my friends... but at least we "
"will die at home.\""
msgstr "\"너를 죽음에서 구할 수 있을지 모르겠군... 하지만 적어도 우리는 집에서 죽을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/3ZaeIfSaved_String
msgctxt "a905aaa9-8c75-460a-9ab1-bfb2992e3695"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it... I can feel it again – the First World! Our home!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어... 나는 느낄 수 있어. 태초 세계야! 우리의 고향이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/MoonBarkAfterBook_String
msgctxt "cf245deb-dc42-4c3a-883c-43dc24f6e662"
msgid ""
"\"Rovagug caress me, it's {mf|King|Queen} {name} {mf|him|her}self! Good day, "
"Your Highness. And I am Luna Kettari.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|왕|여왕} {name}을(를) 직접 보다니, 로바거그가 나를 건드렸구나! 좋은 날이야, 전하. 나는 루나 케타리야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Barks/MoonBarkBeforBook_String
msgctxt "e8e9cc2e-aaac-4d8c-9924-36105573e44a"
msgid "\"Same thing every day... Should I get drunk? Or am I already?\""
msgstr "\"매일 똑같은 나날이야... 내가 술에 취해야 할까? 아니면 벌써 취했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f01b789f-f2c0-4475-a180-1a8c528f520a"
msgid "\"Who are you, ghost?\""
msgstr "\"유령아, 너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "409bf600-3a4b-4b03-8755-060eb5dd11b7"
msgid "\"So you're one of gnomes from the First World? What happened to you?\""
msgstr "\"태초 세계에서 온 노움이라고? 무슨 일이 일어난 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "dedeb0a3-7d99-4685-b17b-c4588798d7e0"
msgid "[Attack] \"You should be put to rest for good.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"영원히 쉬어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "1cd94210-2ee7-4a56-a110-ec6ed31d7f73"
msgid "\"Very well, ask what you must.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 묻고 싶은 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "a8b7d816-e9a2-4175-a73d-5d5c21a4789d"
msgid "\"Hell no. We'll not be talking to insane ghosts!\""
msgstr "\"절대 안돼. 그 미친 유령에게 말 걸지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "5b92e246-5c86-4169-8ea5-69d81241a9c9"
msgid "\"Is what Xae told us true?\""
msgstr "\"자에가 우리에게 진실을 말한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "f078b42e-9a6c-41ea-8993-c66364403833"
msgid "\"Is there any way to change what happened and help the gnomes?\""
msgstr "\"노움에게 일어난 일들을 바꾸어 도울 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "1b69e784-d147-4025-bf8b-3f5e486d2e8d"
msgid ""
"\"You say, 'we learned our lesson'... So you're also one of the Eldest, Host?"
"\""
msgstr "\"'우리는 교훈을 배웠다'고 말했지... 그러면 너도 원로 중 하나야, 주최자?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "519d8046-6d0b-4168-94c0-3a74b1954fbf"
msgid "\"Why are you here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0037_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8a299724-7124-4263-9af0-e535e5d8ab33"
msgid ""
"Wished to obtain the gift of First World immortality in Jubilost's stead."
msgstr "주빌로스트 대신 태초 세계의 불멸을 얻기를 원했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "414d55b7-b837-4c84-af8a-94cff7cf5ac1"
msgid "\"Great. Can I receive Jubilost's gift instead?\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 내가 대신 주빌로스트의 선물을 받을 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "07da7acf-f655-41d0-aba6-337d29bccf8b"
msgid ""
"Told Jubilost that his principles should not cause him to reject a useful "
"gift."
msgstr "선물을 거부해서는 안된다고 주빌로스트에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "bce0c6f2-629d-4ba3-96ff-899693b8aad4"
msgid ""
"\"Don't refuse. Principles are principles, but this is an incredibly rare "
"gift. It would be good for you, and for all of us, especially since we're so "
"often at war with the First World.\""
msgstr "\"거부하지 마. 원칙은 원칙이지만 매우 희귀한 선물이라고. 우리가 태초 세계와 자주 전쟁하니 너와 우리에게 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6a6aeddc-a3d2-4eaf-a3ea-407daa2f7dc9"
msgid "Approved of Jubilost's decision to reject the gift of immortality."
msgstr "불멸을 거절한 주빌로스트의 결정에 찬성했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "206c0889-bf0f-4b25-a2f0-103ed686dc39"
msgid "\"You're doing the right thing, Jubilost. Principles are principles.\""
msgstr "\"옳은 일을 하고 있어. 원칙은 원칙이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0040_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d600df22-13e2-43b9-ab8e-4b65092a9d03"
msgid "Told Jubilost that he should make his own choice."
msgstr "주빌로스트에게 직접 결정을 해야 한다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0040_Text_String
msgctxt "b632bba3-aaee-4f78-b71a-02c1e195463d"
msgid ""
"\"This is one of the most important decisions in your life. Do what you "
"think is right.\""
msgstr "\"이것은 네 인생에서 가장 중요한 결정이야. 옳다고 생각하는 결정을 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "d1896ab2-d338-45ec-91a9-e7b7d7f466c1"
msgid ""
"\"I think you're rejecting this gift as a way to show off your nobility.\""
msgstr "\"너의 고귀함을 과장하려고 이 선물을 거절하는 거 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "ac8c87fa-0aff-4627-8c05-79671a649a6e"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe the gift will help Xae. That exhausted ghost deserves some peace.\""
msgstr "\"선물이 자에에게 도움이 될지도 몰라. 그 지친 귀신은 평화가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "7e787fd2-146e-4173-b449-863cca6cda20"
msgid ""
"\"The gift should be given to some living gnome who is this moment dying of "
"the Bleaching. Let our adventures help at least someone.\""
msgstr "\"선물은 백화로 죽어가는 노움에게 주어야 해. 다른 이들을 돕자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7375339e-e4de-4439-bf22-10357835bf0c"
msgid ""
"{n}A flickering shadow stands before you, trembling and chanting something "
"indistinct. In its silhouette you barely recognize the figure of a gnome "
"girl dressed in rags.{/n} \"No, no... we need to try again... the door will "
"open. I promised them! I promised!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}깜빡거리는 그림자가 앞에서 흔들리고 떨리며 소리를 냅니다. 당신은 그 실루엣에서 넝마를 걸친 노움 소녀의 모습을 간신히 "
"인식합니다.{/n} \"안돼... 우리는 다시 해야 해... 문은 열릴 거야. 나는 그들에게 약속했어! 약속했다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "e7f89b98-ba6f-406a-8836-df966d895b9c"
msgid ""
"{n}Bursting into a long and bleak laugh, the ghost makes a move as if she "
"wants to run away. But then freezes and gives you an eerily attentive "
"look.{/n} \"Who am I? I am Xae, a wizard. I am the one who brought everyone "
"here. This place... once {g|LanternKing}the Lantern King{/g} himself opened "
"a gate from his dominion to {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} here. He abandoned this "
"road, but I thought... I thought I could... open the portal again. Or ask "
"for help from an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. Return all of us home! I was wrong. "
"The door didn't open. We all lost color, one by one...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}길고 지친 웃음을 터뜨리는 유령은 도망치듯 움직입니다. 그러나 곧 멈춰서 당신을 으스스한 눈빛으로 유심히 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내가"
" 누구냐고? 나는 마법사 자에야. 내가 모두를 여기에 데려왔어. 한 때 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 그의 영역에서 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}으로 향하는 문을 열었어. 그는 이 길을 버렸지만 나는... 이 포털을 다시 열 수 있을 거라 "
"생각했어. 아니면 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 도움을 청하려 했지. 우리 모두를 집으로 돌려보내려고 말이야! 하지만 나는 틀렸어. "
"문을 열리지 않아. 우리는 결국 모두 새하얗게 질려버릴 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "4d37c8d3-5a43-43a4-80d4-165d6c85a4f8"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost seems not to pay any attention to you.{/n} \"I promised them... "
"I promised them... to open this door... to return everyone home...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 당신을 신경쓰지 않는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"나는 그들에게 약속했어... 문을 열기로 약속했다구... 모두 고향으로 "
"보내겠다고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "3227d31c-4f74-4e72-8997-bc3816800860"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost lets out a strange sound, half moan half dull laughter.{/n} \"I "
"lived a long, long life there, in {g|First World}the First World{/g}. Many "
"long lives. I traveled, I created, I danced upon the edge of the abyss and "
"fell into the clouds. I died to be born again – with none of my strengths "
"and skills, but with all the memories of the wonders I'd seen. But eternity "
"can become tedious even for a soul that's forever young! Many older gnomes "
"suffered it even before we knew what the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} was. "
"Sooner or later there's not enough novelty any more... So we all grew "
"fascinated with a new game – 'death'.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 이상한 소리를 내며 웃었다가 울기를 반복합니다.{/n} \"나는 오랫동안 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 "
"살았어. 나는 여행하고 만들고 심연의 언저리에서 춤도 추고 구름 속에서 뛰어 놀았지. 나는 죽어서 힘과 기술을 모두 잃은 채로 다시 "
"살아났지만 기억은 그대로였어. 하지만 영원히 젊음을 유지하니까 정말 지루해지더라고! {g|백화}백화{/g}를 겪기 전에는 모두 "
"그랬으니까. 결국에 참신함은 모두 바닥나고 말았지... 그래서 우리는 죽음을 놀이로 생각하기 시작했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b4fa8461-d727-4eb9-865b-eeb6caf97894"
msgid ""
"\"One of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} created it. Of course he was just "
"borrowing it based on his observations of the true gods. He drew a string "
"from {g|River of Souls}the River of Souls{/g} and created his own little "
"circle of births, deaths and judgments. Imitating the all-mighty Pharasma, "
"he judged the souls that he owned, and determined their further paths. It "
"was so new, so exciting! Many gnomes volunteered. If not us, then who? ...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Eldest}원로{/g} 중 하나가 그것을 창조했어. 물론 그는 진정한 신들을 본따 만들었지. 그는 {g|River of "
"Souls}영혼의 강{/g}에서 끈을 당겨와 탄생과 죽음, 심판의 작은 원을 만들었어. 전능한 파라즈마를 모방해 그는 자신이 소유한 "
"영혼을 심판해서 그들의 앞길을 결정했어. 이건 새롭고 흥미로운 거였어! 많은 노움이 자원했지. 우리가 아니라면 누가 했겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c28d587a-f679-489b-a693-059acb20bd13"
msgid ""
"\"But those who take from the goddess of death must be ready for the "
"consequences. {g|Pharasma}The Lady of Graves{/g} brought her wrath upon this "
"creative {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. He was stripped of his power and forever "
"doomed to serve in her court. And we gnomes... we were torn from {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g} and bound to {g|River of Souls}the River of "
"Souls{/g}, like all creatures of the {g|Material Plane}Material Plane{/g}. "
"Thereafter we lived like the rest, died like the rest, and learned all the "
"pain of the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}. Our 'game' had become our reality, "
"and no longer could we tire of its fun and return to another one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 죽음의 여신으로부터 훔치는 자들은 결과를 책임져야 해. {g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}의 분노가 그 창의적인 "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 쏟아졌어. 그는 권능을 빼앗기고 영원히 그녀의 궁에서 노예노릇을 해야 했어. 그리고 우리 노움들은... "
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 떨어져 {g|River of Souls}영혼의 강{/g}에 영혼이 묶이게 되었지. {g|"
"material plane}물질계{/g}의 생명들처럼 말이야. 그 이후로 우리는 인간처럼 삶과 죽음을 겪게 되었고 {g|백화}백화{/g}"
"의 고통을 깨닫게 되었지. 우리의 놀이는 생존이 되어 흥미를 잃으면 다른 놀이를 찾아야만 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ca2a004a-4fb2-4f1b-99d5-1313acf844bd"
msgid "\"{name}, wait! I need to talk to her!\""
msgstr "\" {name}. 기다려! 나는 그녀에게 할 말이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b2730867-c5bf-48df-969e-096f928ad4c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost turns to the ghost. He seems most excited.{/n} \"Tell me... you "
"are a gnome from {g|First World}the First World{/g}, right? How did it "
"happen that you and the others ended up here... that you became mortal?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 유령에게 향합니다. 그는 흥분한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"말해봐... {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 "
"온 노움이라고 했지? 너와 다른 노움들에게 무슨 일이 벌어져서 필멸이 된 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c1a2e05f-0b73-4611-abec-e68783be1865"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost looks at the ghost, shaken. It seems to be one of those rare "
"moments that the gift of speech is lost to him.{/n} \"But... this... I... "
"this is not at all how I supposed it happened. Respected Xae, I understand "
"that your condition does not allow for long conversations, but perhaps you "
"could tell me...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 유령을 보고 몸을 떱니다. 그에게 주어진 귀중한 대화시간을 잃은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"하지만... 나는... 이걸 "
"바란 게 아니야. 물론 네가 오랜 대화를 할 수 없다는 상태인지 알아. 하지만 말해주었으면 좋겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "5b624c40-c2bf-4b3f-8f31-5f921ae97227"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost listens to him with eerie attention.{/n} \"Of course I could... "
"I could do many things... I tried many ways to open the portal... Everything "
"except a sacrifice. A little blood would come in handy!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 섬뜩한 관심으로 그의 말을 경청합니다.{/n} \"물론. 나는 많은 것을 할 수 있어... 나는 포털을 열기 위해 다양한 "
"시도를 해 봤어... 희생 빼고 말이야. 피 한방울이면 도움이 될 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "f4dad718-1180-46ad-ac8b-0ca51c4d3200"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost freezes, holds herself by the shoulders and sways back and "
"forth, repeating over and over:{/n} \"I promised... I promised... I "
"promised...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령이 얼어붙어 자신을 껴안으며 몸을 앞뒤로 휘청이며 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"나는 약속했다... 약속했다... 나는 약속했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "5f395949-98e6-47d8-9412-b6dd3224cc00"
msgid ""
"\"That's rather a foolish performance, little ghost. You've staged a fine "
"series of foolish performances: the playing the game of death, contacting an "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} not known for his mercy, trying to open a door that "
"leads nowhere. But who are we addressing? Greetings, {name}. And of course, "
"you, most persistent of researchers. We see you solved our riddle...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 멍청한 짓이야, 작은 유령아. 너는 멍청한 짓을 다양하게 저지른 거라고: 죽음의 게임, 그의 자비에 대해 아무것도 모르는 "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 만나서는 아무 곳으로도 이어지지 않는 포털을 열려고 한것. 그런데 누가 우리에게 이야기하고 있었지? "
"맞아. {name}이었지. 물론 너는 가장 끈기의 탐색자들 이였어. 네가 우리가 낸 수수께끼를 푸는걸 봤어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5b363700-d32d-4774-a636-6c411a56c9f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost folds his hands on his chest.{/n} \"We did. I might still fail "
"to understand why you sent us the long way around instead of just telling us "
"everything from the beginning...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 가슴에 손을 얹습니다.{/n} \"우리가 그랬지. 왜 네가 우리에게 처음부터 말해주지 않고 이 고생을 시켰는지 아직도 "
"이해가 가지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "61b0c563-da1c-4ac7-a92e-8bfdaeb2db4b"
msgid ""
"\"Some truths must be discovered to be known. Or seen with your own eyes.\" "
"{n}The Host nods at the pile of gnome bones and the shivering ghost.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 진리는 밝혀져야만 해. 그리고 두 눈으로 목격해야 하지.\" {n}주최자는 쌓여있는 노움의 뼈와 떨고 있는 유령을 향해 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "ad458d34-4e03-4a32-9784-b91b6f9155cf"
msgid ""
"\"About the game of death and {g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} punishment? Yes. "
"One of our {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} brothers thought he could steal from a "
"deity. And the gnomes that answered his call thought they could play at "
"death. Death decided otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽음의 놀이와 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 처벌 말이야? 그래. {g|Eldest}원로{/g} 중 하나가 여신에게서 "
"도둑질을 할 수 있다고 생각했지. 그리고 그의 부름에 응답한 형제들은 목숨을 걸고 장난을 칠 수 있을 거라 믿었어. 아니면 죽거나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "8063593b-4d41-401e-a4ad-c546020113bc"
msgid ""
"\"If there is, we know nothing of it. The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} can do many "
"things, but as you both know, it is not enough to confront a deity – "
"especially one such as {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}. We have learned our lesson, "
"and do not play with the toys of others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"존재한다고 해도 우리는 아무것도 몰라. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 전지전능하지만 너희도 알다시피 여신을 상대하기에는 벅차. 특히 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}같은 여신이라면 말이야. 우리는 교훈을 배웠으니 다른 장난감은 가지고 놀지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "53e10b5d-8f10-4a1f-b0a6-bf867e5291f0"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear laughter from under the hood.{/n} \"Oh, we're tired of answering "
"this question – and the many others that follow it. Ask us again next time. "
"Especially since the 'next' time for you will be one of the first times for "
"us...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두건 아래에서 웃음 소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"오. 이 질문이라면 지긋지긋해. 다음에 다시 질문하도록. 특히 다음번에는 네가 "
"특별해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bf531c88-3027-4ba5-b660-bf8c7f11807c"
msgid "\"Does that mean that this was all in vain?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 모두 말짱 도루묵이라는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "907ea3c2-80c2-4e33-9f9f-cb0280f0a331"
msgid ""
"\"Of course not. The journey is often more important than the destination. "
"Be satisfied with the secret you have won.\""
msgstr "\"물론 아니지. 목적지보다 여행의 과정이 중요할 때도 있는 법이야. 네가 얻은 비밀에 만족하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "01b6a788-3463-4208-9546-4276c9207d0e"
msgid "\"The day I can simply be 'satisfied' with something, I'll Bleach.\""
msgstr "\"시시한 것에 만족하다니. 머지않아 백화에 걸리겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "6c45bf41-4a98-486b-a5bb-9e75a79885b7"
msgid ""
"\"The right question at last! As I suspect you've realized, there's no way "
"to save all the gnomes from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}. You cannot "
"return them to {g|First World}the First World{/g} and restore their "
"connection to their homeland. And even if there were a sufficiently "
"desperate and powerful creature ready to do it, their actions would not be "
"looked on mercifully by {g|Pharasma}the Lady of Graves{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마침내 올바른 질문이구나! 네가 예상하듯 {g|백화}백화{/g}에서 노움들을 전부 구할 방법은 없어. 그들을 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}로 돌려보낸다거나 고향과의 끊긴 연결을 다시 이을 수는 없는 거야. 심지어 그게 가능한, 충분히 필사적이면서 "
"강력한 생명체가 그것을 할 준비가 되어 있다고 해도, 그 행위를 {g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}이 자비롭게 넘어가진 않을테지. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "91afd69a-ec86-4653-94c6-e27c269f5117"
msgid ""
"\"Though it cannot be done for all, it can still be done for one. We are "
"ready to offer this gift as a token of our appreciation for your exciting "
"adventure and your solution to the riddle. Do you hear, sir Jubilost? You "
"personally may become reconnected with {g|First World}the First World{/g}. "
"You won't be entirely protected from death if you remain on "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, but you will be forever spared from the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}. Whenever you visit the First World, which we are "
"aware you desire passionately, then you'll be as immortal as any fey.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두 끝난 게 아니라 여전히 할 수 있다고 생각해. 우리는 네 모험의 보상으로 이 선물을 줄 준비가 되어있어. 주빌로스트. 너는 {g|"
"First World}태초 세계{/g}와 다시 연결될 수 있을 거야. 네가 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에 남아있다면 죽음으로부터 "
"완전히 보호받을 수는 없지만 영원히 {g|백화}백화{/g}에 걸리지는 않을 거야. 네가 태초 세계를 방문할 때 보았던 페이처럼 그곳에서 "
"불멸이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9990a9dc-30f3-4277-b533-9294bf229ee3"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost fixes his glasses nervously. It's the only chink in his "
"nonchalant facade.{/n} \"If this 'gift' cannot help the whole gnome race, "
"then I have no need of it. Of course, I'm not immune to vanity... but I've "
"always been ready to share the burden of mortality with the others who bear "
"it on their shoulders. I'll even keep wearing these stupid glasses! I'll "
"survive without the immortality of {g|First World}the First World{/g}, and "
"face the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} when it comes – as all gnomes have done "
"before me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 긴장하며 안경을 고칩니다. 그의 유일한 흠입니다.{/n} \"이 선물이 노움 종족 모두를 구할 수 없다면 나는 필요 "
"없어. 물론. 나도 허영심이라는 게 있지만... 나는 다른 노움들과 필멸의 삶의 무게를 나눠 지겠어. 이 안경 따위를 쓰고 있어도 "
"말이지! 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 불멸 없이도 살아남을 테고 {g|백화}백화{/g}의 징후가 올 때 겸허하게 "
"받아들일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "91444435-ca2e-4065-b581-7984c6dc5e99"
msgid ""
"\"You will have other opportunities to gain immortality, and the many "
"problems that go along with it, {name}. Let someone else prove themselves "
"this time.\""
msgstr "\"불멸을 얻을 기회를 나중에 얻을 거야. 그리고 그에 대한 부작용도 따르겠지. {name}. 다른 이들에게 양보하자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b5f3a8f8-0fb5-400a-afea-b717cff0623d"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost frowns.{/n} \"I remember {d|Jubilost Disapprove}discussing{/d} "
"something similar with you after the Inconsequent Debates. I must admit, "
"I've been thinking a lot about your words. Should I be more... practical in "
"practical issues? Focus on how I can make myself useful?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"비논리 토론회에서 너와 비슷한 녀석과 {d|Jubilost Disapprove}토론{/d}한 "
"기억이 나. 네 말을 계속해서 되뇌었음을 부정하지는 않겠어. 내가 좀 더 실용적으로 사고해야 할까? 조금 더 현실적인 내가 되어야 할까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3b08fe12-ec34-41e0-8794-aa2428cc993b"
msgid ""
"\"I am surprised to hear this from you. Didn't we {d|Jubilost "
"Approve}agree{/d} on the importance of self-sacrifice, back when we "
"discussed the Inconsequent Debates? No, {name}, whatever may come, I cannot "
"give up my principles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너에게서 그런 말을 듣다니 놀랍군. 비논리 토론회에서 자기 희생에 대해 우리의 의견이 {d|Jubilost Approve}일치한 "
"걸{/d} 잊어버렸어? {name}. 어떤 순간에도 나는 내 원칙을 포기할 수 없어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a2379d4f-26b2-4a07-bdd1-0119418641b4"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad we understand each other. Well, my decision isn't changing. I "
"decline the gift of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"서로를 이해할 수 있어서 기쁘군. 내 결정은 변함 없어. 나는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 선물을 거절하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a91cfe06-13a6-4846-8af8-ced3b7cc23e0"
msgid "\"Then I'll hold true to my first instinct. I do not need this gift.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 내 본능에 맡기지. 나는 이 선물이 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d971ae3c-afbe-4c71-a197-341eb06322f3"
msgid ""
"\"Well, that's strong criticism, but I may deserve it. In that case, I'll "
"listen to your advice, {name}. I will accept the gift.\""
msgstr "\"강한 비판이지만 겸허하게 받아들이지. 이럴 경우에 너의 의견을 듣겠어. {name}. 나는 그 선물을 받아들이겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "be3ecc4f-a932-4b01-b653-87e724dee2fa"
msgid ""
"\"That's a worthy idea. What do you say, Host? Can you grant the ghost "
"peace, instead of giving me immortality and everything that goes along with "
"it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"가치있는 생각인걸. 주최자 네 생각은 어때? 내게 보장된 불멸과 그것과 관련된 모든 것을 주는 대신 유령에게 안식을 줄 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "df59c547-344b-4315-8ff9-ba60bf5cf796"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, that's the best thing we could do. What do you say, Host? Can you "
"take what you're offering me, and give it to some other gnome instead? "
"Anyone you choose, who is suffering from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그게 우리가 할 수 있는 최선의 방법이야. 주최자 네 생각은 어때? 나에게 주는 선물을 가져가서 다른 노움에게 줄 수 있겠어? "
"{g|백화}백화{/g}에 걸린 노움이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "0e793336-440f-4179-bd4c-f3aaff755751"
msgid ""
"\"Thousand-year-old insane ghosts again? Well... why not? But we will do "
"much more than simply give her peace. You'd be surprised how little "
"difference there is between 'nowhere' and 'here and now'. She will open her "
"door, just when she was always meant to.\""
msgstr ""
"\"천 년 된 미친 귀신이 또? 이젠 익숙해. 우리는 평화를 주는 것보다 많은 것을 줄 거야. 우리가 지금 여기에 있다는 것이 "
"중요하니까. 그녀는 항상 바라왔던 자신의 문을 열 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "5163e4d1-289b-4d6f-b066-68fab8103e84"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's even more interesting. I see this has all been for a reason! "
"Our choice, you say? Very good. We'll make a choice and save one lost soul. "
"We already have, in a way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 재밌어지는데. 모두 이유가 있었던 거야! 우리의 선택이라고 말했었지? 좋아. 우리는 선택을 하고 한명을 구하겠어. 우리는 어떤 "
"면에서 항상 준비되어 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "e1608e8f-5990-4034-9bd2-769848ce03a8"
msgid ""
"\"Very well. The gift is yours. Just to be clear, we'd like to remind you: "
"it is only in {g|First World}the First World{/g} that you can die without "
"fear. Don't try to do it anywhere else. Farewell, {name}, good-bye, Sir "
"Jubilost! There is a long road ahead of you, but someday, in hundreds or "
"thousands of years, it will surely bring you to our door.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 선물은 네 거야. 다시 말해두는데 이걸 알았으면 해. 망설임 없이 죽을 수 있는 곳은 {g|First World} 태초 "
"세계{/g} 뿐이야. 아무 곳에서나 죽지 말라고. 안녕. {name}. 안녕. 주빌로스트경! 네 앞에 길이 멀어. 언젠가 수백 수천년 "
"후에 결국 너의 문은 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "1dfc0a46-9a9b-47c5-9756-17fbb5068510"
msgid ""
"\"You have rejected the gift, Jubilost Narthropple. But we will not leave "
"you without any reward at all. We offer you a trifle – the chance to "
"sometimes glimpse eternity in the corner of your eye, just as we do. Now you "
"can remember the history of things. Those who wander searching for mysteries "
"and ancient relics might find this skill useful. And now – farewell! When "
"you finally succumb to the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, you may remember this "
"moment. I wonder what you think then? Only time knows!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 선물을 거부했어. 주빌로스트 나트로플. 하지만 아무런 보상도 얻지 못하게 하지는 않을 거야. 너에게 영생을 조금이나마 맛볼 수 "
"있는 기회를 줄게. 신비한 모험을 떠나고 고대의 보물을 발견하던 조상들을 기억하라고. 그럼 이만! 언젠가 {g|백화}백화{/g}에 걸렸을 "
"때 이 순간이 떠오를 거야. 그 때는 무슨 생각이 들까? 시간만이 답해주겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Host
msgctxt "4d09f0bf-6949-46ac-bb94-8f192e98a1a6"
msgid ""
"\"We aren't easy to surprise, but you managed it. Very well, a rejection is "
"a rejection. But gifts of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} are not so easy to "
"withdraw from the world. They must find an owner somewhere, one way or "
"another. So what should we do? To whom shall we grant what has been promised?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"별로 놀랍지는 않지만 결국 해냈군. 좋아. 거절은 거절이니. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 선물은 쉽게 가져갈 수 없어. 우선 "
"주인을 어딘가에서 찾아야 해. 그럼 이제 어떻게 해야 할까? 누구에게 선물을 주어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "45146590-9877-42a1-a1aa-a7cb79f6e69b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe I'm hearing this. The same Jubilost who spoke of his gnome "
"servants with such contempt is rejecting immortality because he can't help "
"all the gnomes in the world? Admit it — this is just another grab for "
"attention, isn't it? Such a hypocrite!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 들은 걸 믿을 수가 없어. 노움 노예들에게 경멸을 표하는 그 주빌로스트가 모든 노움을 구할 수 없다고 불멸을 거부하다니? 받아 "
"들이라고. 이 위선자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "174a336c-e900-4ae2-a947-3f2c18a9a487"
msgid ""
"\"Let us assume for the moment that I've changed... matured.\" {n}Jubilost "
"avoids looking at Octavia, but it's obvious how hard it is for him to say "
"this and simultaneously avoid saying something rude.{/n} \"And this is not "
"just about immortality. Exploring the {g|First World}First World{/g} is my "
"dream. But, as we all know too well, it's mortally dangerous. The gift of "
"the Host would be the best protection for me in my journeys... but no. This "
"isn't going to happen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가... 나이를 먹었을 때를 생각해 보자.\" {n}주빌로스트는 옥타비아의 시선을 피하지만 그런 말을 하기에는 쉽지 않았을 "
"것입니다.{/n} \"이것은 불멸에 관한 것이 아니야. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 여행하는 것은 내 꿈이었어. 그러나 "
"우리 모두가 잘 알고 있듯이 그곳은 정말 위험한 곳이지. 주최자의 선물은 나에게 최고의 보험이 되겠지만... 나는 거절하겠어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fbd3f2fb-4d92-42f0-b138-4d46222211dd"
msgid ""
"\"Poor creature... You should not have relied on the mercy of the gods.\""
msgstr "\"불쌍한 녀석... 신의 자비에 의지해서는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "608198bb-3b35-40f9-bbba-9102140be12e"
msgid ""
"\"Foolish entertainment, closure, imminence. This is a story worth coming a "
"long way for. I shall save it in my heart.\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 즐거움, 폐쇄, 임박. 먼 길을 걸을 만한 가치가 있어. 나는 내 마음 속에 간질할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "dc987743-4e81-46dc-8c71-557cf0956b32"
msgid ""
"\"But... but how... It... it's all so sad! My thoughts are scattered, crying "
"all over!\""
msgstr "\"하지만... 어떻게... 정말 슬퍼. 머릿속이 뒤죽박죽이 되었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2eba591f-5df0-4835-9e04-ce1cf6104d09"
msgid ""
"\"Stupid, gnome. Very, very stupid. I'd thought better of you, with a mind "
"like yours. And believe me — that's no easy sentiment to draw from me.\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 노움. 한심해. 내가 너라면 그렇게 생각하지는 않았을 거야. 나에게서 이런 말이 나오게 하는 게 쉽지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "72644548-4e96-4b67-9258-6216c5926b0a"
msgid ""
"\"You call this punishment? You should see what Mother of Monsters does to "
"wrong-wrongers! Off with their arms and legs — head replace your hind!\""
msgstr "\"이 형벌을 말하는 거야? 괴물들의 어머니가 못된 녀석들을 혼내주는 모습이다! 팔다리가 뜯기고 머리가 떨어진다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "db39e894-49e2-43a1-8148-e44a9531c248"
msgid "\"Linzee not take much to squeak!\""
msgstr "\"린지가 들키지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/GnomeGhost_dialog/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "78f4bf6d-9bb5-4eb1-9965-bf67a06abea1"
msgid "\"Let go of me, you... you... little animal!\""
msgstr "\"날 내버려둬... 이... 쥐새끼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Items/MoonMap_description_String
msgctxt "cc9c77cb-6354-40e3-bd4e-789cb8c8222a"
msgid ""
"This is an old map, given to you by the girl named Luna. It points to a "
"dungeon in the vicinity of the Candlemere."
msgstr "이것은 루나라는 소녀가 당신에게 준 오래된지도입니다. 그것은 캔들미어 부근의 지하 감옥을 가리 킵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Items/MoonMap_name_String
msgctxt "ca6bcd39-d5fd-4746-90c9-3078f97d0a6f"
msgid "Luna's Map"
msgstr "루나의 지도"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Items/TenAdventuresBook_Name_String
msgctxt "d44a79e4-c783-4e6c-b948-1a448718e299"
msgid ""
"\"Valor and Honor: Ten Adventures of the Splendid Willas Gunderson in "
"Absalom\""
msgstr "\"용기와 명예: 압살롬의 화려한 윌라스 건더슨의 열 가지 모험\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Items/TenAdventuresBook_Text_String
msgctxt "33b7465b-7e28-4a32-bac7-2d6bb5209b71"
msgid ""
"\"Table of contents:\n"
"From the author — page 2\n"
"Prologue — page 36\n"
"Adventure One: The Fearless Rescue of a Lone Tempting Beauty — page 40\n"
"Adventure Two: Visiting the Beauty — page 117\n"
"Skillful Illustrations — page 300-320\n"
"Adventure Three: Running from the Beauty's Enraged Spouse — page 321\n"
"Adventure Four: Hiding in the Catacombs — page 440\n"
"Adventure Five: In the Corner of the Tavern — page 500\n"
"Some recipes of food and drinks, studied by the author during his attempt to "
"hide in the tavern — page 580-660\n"
"Adventure Six: Seeking Rescue among Artists of the Traveling Circus — page "
"661\n"
"Adventure Seven: In the Tiger's Cage — page 715\n"
"Adventure Eight: Running from Tigers — page 750\n"
"Adventure Nine: Failing to Escape Tigers — page 914\n"
"Adventure Ten: Salvation from Tigers by the Servants of the Beauty's Spouse; "
"Reunion with the Beauty; A Long Conversation about Valor and Honor; A Proper "
"Farewell — page 960\n"
"Epilogue — page 1200\n"
"The author's parting words — page 1317\n"
"A page for the author's autograph, in case you are lucky enough to meet him —"
" page 1500\""
msgstr ""
"\"목차:\n"
"저자 - 2 페이지\n"
"프롤로그 - 36 페이지\n"
"모험 1: 외로움에 떠는 미인을 용감하게 구하다 - 40 페이지\n"
"모험 2: 미인을 찾아가다 - 117 페이지\n"
"숙련된 일러스트레이션 - 300-320 페이지\n"
"모험 3: 미인의 남편의 분노로부터 도망치다 - 페이지 321\n"
"모험 4: 지하 묘지에 숨어\n"
"모험 5: 선술집의 코너 - 페이지 500\n"
"선술집에서 숨을 때 저자가 연구한 음식과 음료의 일부 조리법 - 580-660 쪽\n"
"모험 6: 유랑 서커스단 배우들 사이에서 구출을 위한 노력 - 페이지 661\n"
"모험 7: 호랑이 철창 - 715 페이지\n"
"모험 8: 호랑이에게서 도망치다 - 페이지 750\n"
"모험 9: 호랑이에게서 도망치지 못하다 - 914 페이지\n"
"모험 10: 미인의 남편의 하인에게서 구출되다; 미인과의 재결합; 용기와 명예에 대한 긴 대화; 적절한 이별 - 960 페이지\n"
"에필로그 - 1200 페이지\n"
"저자의 작별 인사 - 페이지 1317\n"
"당신이 저자를 만나 사인을 받을 만큼 운이 좋을 때를 대비해서 마련한 빈 페이지 - 1500 쪽 \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a4332821-58c5-4e58-b70d-6db79da3e6d5"
msgid "\"Tell us about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "10ddfdba-adce-4530-bab1-6066c00fd98b"
msgid "\"We have to go.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "545106bf-1939-4952-8567-0196046b499c"
msgid ""
"\"If this life troubles you, something should be changed. Your family and "
"friends want you happy, not exhausted and hating your existence.\""
msgstr "\"네 삶이 문제가 된다면 바꿔야 해. 너희 가족과 친구는 네가 행복하길 원하지 너를 싫어하면서 고통받으려는 게 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "98b4c6fc-96d6-4a86-9d1b-85ebb36ec59a"
msgid "Gave Luna some money to fulfill her dream of traveling."
msgstr "여행하려는 그녀의 꿈을 이루기 위해 루나에게 돈을 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "fcce1f9b-3062-4d2a-8c2d-3db2789e8cb0"
msgid ""
"[Offer 3000 gold coins to Luna] \"Here, take it. You can spend it on "
"traveling and seeing the world. – Together with your love if she agrees.\""
msgstr ""
"[루나에게 3천골드를 줍니다] \"여기. 가져가. 노잣돈을 쓰면서 세상 구경을 하라고. 그녀가 동의한다면 너의 애인과 함께 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "5cc3731d-9431-41b1-923c-061e79155c7b"
msgid "\"You have an unusual name...\""
msgstr "\"너 이름이 특이하구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "797c81c2-194f-4bbb-bc2b-7ef7ae3023dc"
msgid ""
"{n}A girl with unusual silver-gray hair is looking gloomily into her mug of "
"ale. As she notices Jubilost clearing his throat, she raises her face and "
"brightens.{/n} \"Oh, they told me that the {mf|King|Queen} of {kingdomname} "
"walks the streets, and feasts with everyone at the taverns – but I never "
"believed it! Oh, forgive me, Your Highness. I am Luna Kettari.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}흔치 않은 은발의 머릿결을 가진 한 소녀가 그녀의 맥주잔을 침울하게 들여다보고 있다. 주빌로스트가 헛기침을 하자 그녀는 얼굴을 "
"들었고 생기가 난다.{/n} \"오. {kingdomname}의 {mf|왕|여왕}께서 거리를 시찰하고, 주점의 모든 이들과 잔치를 "
"벌였다는 소문을 들었어요, 하지만 믿지 않았는데! 오, 죄송해요, 전하. 저는 루나 케타리야 입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "014048b0-6380-436d-adc9-b70ae8b3399f"
msgid "\"Hello again, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "eed950b0-9d5b-4fa8-a88e-1213d2a2fb41"
msgid ""
"\"I am a messenger. I deliver correspondence from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} to "
"{g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} and back, usually reports about a rich merchant's "
"underlings and his orders for them. My parents live in Brevoy, and the girl "
"I love, in Mivon…\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 전령이야. 나는 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 {g|Mivon}미본{/g}을 오가며 부유한 상인들에 대한 보고를 해. "
"우리 부모님은 브레이보이에서 살고 저 여자아이는 미본에서 만난 애인이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "33f8e9ed-34c7-4e46-9979-35eaee6d57e3"
msgid ""
"\"I've always dreamed of becoming a traveler, but that's not easy for the "
"daughter of a weaver and a washerwoman. I was glad to find this messenger "
"job, though. I thought that was pretty lucky. But now I'm traveling the same "
"road over and over, every month. I even sit right here in your tavern on the "
"twenty fourth of every month, right on schedule. The monotony is driving me "
"to tears, but what can I do? I can't be everywhere at once, and I can't "
"stand the thought of settling down...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 항상 여행자가 되는 꿈을 꾸었어. 하지만 직물공과 주부의 딸에게 쉬운 선택은 아니었지. 그래도 심부름을 할 수 있어서 기뻐. "
"정말 행운인 거 같아. 하지만 지금은 같은 길을 매달 지나다녀서 지겨워졌어. 나는 너의 주점 앞에 앉아 매달 24일에 앉아있어. 항상 "
"같은 일상이라 눈물이 날 지경이야. 결국 머물러야겠지만 정착은 나에게 견디기 힘들어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "76529f62-64d6-4f36-bc20-f8aa5a4aa405"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost, who was listening surprisingly carefully, leans over to you and "
"says quietly,{/n} \"Do you see it now? 'When Moon leaves her path' – it's "
"another part of the riddle! It looks we need to somehow convince our new "
"friend to quit her well-trodden path and set off somewhere new. Plus, it "
"would be good for her. The same road each month! If I were her, I'd have "
"drowned myself a long time ago. If I didn't Bleach sooner.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}놀라울 정도로 신중하게 듣고 있는 주빌로스트는 당신에게 몸을 기대고 조용히 말합니다.{/n} \"지금 이 모습이 보여? '달이 "
"그녀의 길을 떠날 때.' 이건 수수께끼의 또 다른 부분이야! 이 새로운 친구를 설득해서 그녀가 새로운 길을 떠나게 도와야겠어. 그녀에게도 "
"이득이니까. 매달 같은 길을 떠나야 한다니! 나라면 오래 전에 접싯물에 코 박고 죽었을 텐데. 백화가 되지 않았다면 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "c07a9f3c-ad5c-4bb5-91df-45bf4969f73a"
msgid ""
"\"You speak with such confidence! Is it true you came to {g|Stolen Lands}the "
"Stolen Lands{/g} as no one, and made yourself {mf|king|queen} by your own "
"persistence and skill? I've heard so many stories! Your Highness, I wouldn't "
"have taken this advice from anyone but you... but I've just decided – I'm "
"going to travel! And I hope not alone... we'll surely be able to earn a "
"piece of bread together.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자신있게 말하는구나! 빈 손으로 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 와서 왕위를 얻었다고? 나 정말 많이 들었어! 네가 "
"아니면 이런 조언을 듣지 못했을 거야... 하지만 나는 결정했어. 여행을 떠날 거야! 돈이 없어도 빵 한조각 정도는 벌어먹을 수 있을 "
"거니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "d2f2cd20-8701-4240-abf2-679c7fa4a057"
msgid ""
"\"I know. But it's easy to know. It's much harder to actually do something "
"about it. Especially when you've got to think about how to earn a crust.\" "
"{n}Luna grows sad.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"알아. 하지만 알기 쉬웠어. 하지만 실행이 더 어려워. 특히나 어떻게 벌어야 할지 방법이 떠올랐을 때 더욱 그렇지.\" {n}루나는 "
"슬퍼합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "5cc69eab-22ba-45ce-be6d-9ae2f45d38f8"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl looks at the coins in disbelief.{/n} \"But this is... a very "
"large sum! Of course, you're the {mf|King|Queen}, but you barely know me...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소녀는 불신으로 동전을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"하지만 이것은... 매우 큰 금액인걸! 물론 너는 왕이지만... 나를 처음 "
"만났는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "4b4c2461-d7b0-44e4-bfdf-78b11176be1c"
msgid ""
"\"Take it, take it,\" {n}says Jubilost protectively.{/n} \"Believe me, "
"traveling is contagious. You take one small step from your house, and you'll "
"never be able to stop. The world is beautiful, especially when you're not "
"discovering it alone... not that I myself ever... hmm, hmm...\" {n}Jubilost "
"stammers and pretends that he needs to wipe his glasses.{/n} \"I'll leave "
"you one of my latest almanacs – to help you find your way around at the "
"start.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가져가. 가져가.\" {n}주빌로스트는 친절하게 말합니다.{/n} \"여행은 전염성이 있어. 집에서 한걸음 멀어지면 멈추기가 힘들 "
"거야. 세상은 아름다워. 특히 전혀 알지 못하는 세계를 발견했을 때는 말이지... 너와 같은 미녀도... 흠...\" {n}주빌로스트는 "
"더듬거리며 안경을 닦는 척 합니다.{/n} \"내가 쓴 최신 연감을 하나 줄게. 길을 찾기 쉬울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "3900f9dc-babc-47d9-a766-7a213ed20d25"
msgid ""
"\"You have my best! It was a pleasure talking to a real {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"잘가! 진짜 왕과 대화해서 기뻤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "1aa05af2-27ad-4eb8-bf67-6b368773116f"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! Thank you, thank you! Oh, I don't even know how to repay you! "
"But on the other hand... Maybe I do!\" {n}Luna searches her bag quickly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고마워! 정말 고마워! 어떻게 보답해야 할지 모르겠어! 아마 이게... 도움이 될 거 같아!\" {n}루나가 가방을 급히 "
"찾습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "e34a981c-57ff-449c-86bc-4f71d2d97eb3"
msgid ""
"\"Please, take this. It's a relic my family received from an elven ancestor. "
"According to the family legend, the one who deciphers the map will find "
"three things: an incredibly sad secret, a true treasure, and a door to "
"another world which will never open again. The entrance to a certain dungeon "
"is marked here, but there's nothing to say where to go looking. You're a "
"{mf|king|queen}, with all the best scientists and travelers serving you. "
"Surely they'll be able to read this map. Thank you again. Now I have to go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이걸 받아줘. 엘프 조상으로부터 받은 가족의 유물이야. 조상님에게서 전해온 이야기에 따르면 지도를 해독한 사람은 엄청난 슬픈 비밀, "
"진실한 보물, 여지껏 열리지 않았던 다른 세계로 가는 문을 얻게 될 거라고 했어. 어떤 던전으로 가는 입구는 여기 표시되어 있지만 어디서 "
"찾아야 할지는 나와있지 않아. 너는 왕이니까 뭐든지 할 수 있을 거야. 부하들이 그 지도를 읽을 수도 있을 거야. 고마워. 나는 이제 "
"가야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6d62eff5-a4a3-43e4-bc1c-faa3364fb3a7"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Moon has left her path! But now who can explain to me why the Host "
"didn't simply tell us, 'go to the dungeon located here'? Why make us run "
"around in circles? But let's have a look at this map... what do we have "
"here... Why, I recognize the area around the {g|Candlemere}Candlemere{/g} at "
"first glance! There are ancient ruins in this area. This dungeon must "
"contain the traces of the very first gnomes to visit {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}"
". Well, our goal is clear. Now we need only achieve it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 달이 그녀의 길을 떠났다! 하지만 왜 주최자가 우리에게 던전의 위치를 알려주지 않은 거지? 왜 우리에게 이런 생고생을 시키냐고? "
"어쨌든 지도를 보자... 여기서 어떻게 한다... {g|Candlemere}캔들미어{/g} 주변의 지역이 한눈에 들어오는군! 이 지역에는 "
"고대 유적지가 있어. 이 던전은 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 방문한 태초의 노움들이 흔적이 있는 곳이야. 목표가 분명해졌어. "
"이제 실행에 옮기자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Luna_JubilostQ2
msgctxt "cf438c85-3418-4277-bfb4-687609c343b1"
msgid ""
"\"I was born with bright silver hair. The midwives never saw an aasimar "
"before, they were frightened, but my mother – not a bit. She said her "
"daughter's hair was silver like the moon, which meant I was blessed by "
"{g|Desna}Desna{/g}. Hence the name. Actually I've always been drawn to "
"faraway countries, like anyone touched by the Moon goddess, but I've never "
"been beyond {g|River Kingdoms}the River Kingdoms{/g}...\" {n}Luna sighs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 태어날 때 머리칼이 은색이었어. 아이를 받던 여자들은 아시마르를 본 적이 없어서 겁에 질렸지만 우리 어머니는 전혀 달랐어. "
"그녀는 자신의 딸의 머리칼이 달처럼 은색으로 빛난다고 하셨고 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}의 축복을 받았다고 하셨으니까. 나는 항상 달의 "
"여신에게 이끌린 사람처럼 먼 나라를 여행해왔지만 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 너머로 간 적은 없어... \" {n}"
"루나가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Jubilost/Q2_Door_To_Nowhere/Moon_dialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9c38f914-2cdb-4eb5-bcbd-c99cb4bb59e3"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like that's our Moon. I'd like to know what 'leaving her path' means "
"to her. And more importantly – how all this is related to the story of the "
"gnomes! I hope we're about to find out...\" {n}Jubilost clears his throat to "
"attract her attention.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 달을 찾은 것 같아. 이제 그녀의 길을 떠난다는 의미만 알면 되겠어. 중요한 건 이 모든 이야기가 노움과 관련이 있다는 "
"사실이지. 어서 발견하고 싶어...\" {n}주빌로스트는 헛기침을 하며 그녀의 관심을 끌었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Artifact/Linzi_Artifact_Description_String
msgctxt "c21928e5-a66f-4ea7-bab3-e343c4b2cae6"
msgid ""
"A sign of the goddess of beauty's special grace. Whoever wears this ring is "
"protected from violent death by Shelyn herself."
msgstr "미의 여신의 우아함이 담긴 특별한 징표입니다. 이 반지를 착용한 자는 셸린에 의해 죽음으로부터 보호받을 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Artifact/Linzi_Artifact_Name_String
msgctxt "89ecdf61-b2ec-47df-8c12-a1d86fbc453b"
msgid "Shelyn's Clemency"
msgstr "셸린의 혈족"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Anti-Irovetti_1-Text_String
msgctxt "63bf72ca-27d4-4baf-9e73-a8f8aeb46994"
msgid ""
"Author: The Union of Three Rebels\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"The king's power is based upon the mercenary guard — its disbanding should "
"be the first step for the citizens of the new, free Pitax. After expelling "
"these murderers, the king will no longer be able to oppress us so heavily. "
"If the king resists, the citizens of Pitax must rely upon the strength of "
"the guilds and their artisans, as well as appealing to sympathetic states ("
"primarily Galt) and, probably, the ruler of the barony of {kingdomname}.\n"
"Then it will be time for further reforms. Electing judges and freeing them "
"from government pressure will be a crucial part of building a new Pitax. And "
"banning death sentences for nonviolent crimes should be the natural "
"continuation of this process.\n"
"One further step is transferring financial management from the hands of the "
"sovereign over to the treasury, which should be formed of worthy, "
"responsible Pitaxian citizens. Among other things, this allows for greater "
"control over the disproportionate spending on culture currently performed by "
"King Irovetti.\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 세 반역자 연합\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"왕의 권력은 용병 경비대에 달려있다. 용병 해산은 새로운 자유 피탁스 시민들을 위한 첫 걸음이 되어야 한다. 이 살인자들을 추방하면 "
"왕은 더 이상 우리를 압박할 수 없을 것이다. 시민들은 길드와 장인들의 힘에 의지해야 할뿐만 아니라 우호적인 국가들 (일차적으로 갈트)과 "
"{kingdomname}의 통치자에게 도움을 받아야 한다.\n"
"그러면 미래는 개혁을 위한 시간이 될 것이다. 재판관을 선출하고 정부 압력으로부터 자유는 새로운 피탁스를 건설하는 데 중요한 부분이 될 "
"것이다. 그리고 비폭력 범죄에 대한 사형 선고를 금지하는 것이 이 과정의 자연스러운 연장선상이 되어야 한다.\n"
"한 걸음 더 나아가 재무 관리는 주권자의 손에서부터 가치있는 책임있는 피탁스의 시민으로 구성된 재무부로 이관된다. 무엇보다도 이것은 현재 "
"이로베티왕이 수행한 문화에 대한 불균형 지출에 대한 통제력을 강화시켜 준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Anti-Irovetti_1-Title_String
msgctxt "ece6ce99-cbdf-455c-af3d-9db70d52a21f"
msgid "\"How to Save Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스를 어떻게 구하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Anti-Irovetti_2-Text_String
msgctxt "19f4aab3-a191-4d9c-9575-ec51e8d1230c"
msgid ""
"Author: Laman Borbust\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"Patron of Arts, his Daughter. In center stage, in front of a statue "
"covered by canvas.\n"
"Patron: Behold, misbelievers! Behold my triumph! You doubted my foresight. "
"You did not trust the Artist would create a masterpiece!\n"
"Patron tears away the canvas. The statue depicts the Patron's Daughter in an "
"act of passion with the Artist.\n"
"Patron: But what is this? The Artist has betrayed me, the vile scum! While "
"I've been feeding him with a generous hand, he used his time to steal my "
"Daughter's flower — he shamed her and dishonored her!\n"
"Daughter: The scoundrel! He had the guts to display my heinous depravity to "
"all! How can I live on with such shame?!\n"
"Patron: How dare he betray me! He'll pay for this, I swear to all the gods! "
"I've paid him gold enough to glorify my name and make it live forever! But "
"where is he?\n"
"The Artist is in the auditorium.\n"
"Artist: I'm here! Your rotten, huckster family disgusts me! Oh, how could "
"you think I would break my spirit to fulfill your filthy dreams? So, take "
"what you deserve, by poet's judgment!\n"
"The Artist throws a tomato in the Patron's face.\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 라만 보르부스트\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"예술의 후원자. 그의 딸. 중앙 무대에서 캔버스로 덮힌 동상 앞.\n"
"후원자: 보라. 불신자들아! 내 승리를 보라! 너희는 내 선견지명을 의심했다. 너희는 예술가가 걸작품을 만들 것이라고 믿지 않았다!\n"
"후원자는 캔버스를 찢어버립니다. 예술가가 열정을 발휘해 동상의 모습은 후원자의 딸을 묘사했습니다.\n"
"후원자:하지만 이게 뭐야? 예술가가 나를 배신했다. 사악한 쓰레기! 내가 그를 관대하게 보살피는 동안 그는 내 딸을 앗아갔다. 그 놈은 "
"내 딸을 욕보였다!\n"
"딸: 악당 같으니! 그는 모두에게 감히 나의 가증스러운 타락을 드러냈다! 그런 수치심으로 어떻게 살아야 하지?!\n"
"후원자: 어떻게 나를 배신했느냐! 모든 신들에게 맹세코, 그는 이 대가를 치를 것이다! 나는 그에게 충분히 보답하여 내 이름을 빛냈다. "
"하지만 그는 어디에 있지?\n"
"예술가는 강당에 있습니다.\n"
"예술가: 나는 여기 있다! 너의 썩어빠진 가족은 욕지기가 나와! 내가 타락해가며 너의 더러운 꿈을 이룰 줄 알았나? 시인의 정의에 의해 "
"응당한 벌을 받아라!\n"
"예술가는 후원자의 얼굴에 토마토를 던집니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Anti-Irovetti_2-Title_String
msgctxt "d05835fe-4878-4863-a4e7-dca9d12c081e"
msgid "\"The Generous Patron of Arts.\" A play in 2 acts."
msgstr "\"예술의 관대한 후원자.\" 연극 2막."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Anti-Irovetti_3-Text_String
msgctxt "1aeb020b-13e5-4522-9c97-03e717b1d00b"
msgid ""
"Author: M. Vilarenza\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"We were taken out on walks once every two days. Pen and paper were allowed "
"for the first two months, then banned — by special order of the commandant. "
"After that they were issued only to write letters to family. I learned later "
"that all the letters were read by the commandant but never sent to the "
"addressees.\n"
"In the prison, all of us — those arrested by Irovetti for political reasons "
"rather than real crimes — immediately formed a circle to protect ourselves "
"from the other prisoners. Their bandit habits and morals were alien to us, "
"so we tried to hold together, helping each other to remain human.\n"
"On two occasions, I had to go to 'the nest': the first time during the riot "
"in the dining room, caused by the disgusting food, and the second time when "
"they suspected me of plotting an escape. 'The nest' was the name of one of "
"the towers on the outskirts, where the torture rooms were located. Prison "
"guards carried out interrogations there, assisted by special prisoners, "
"those who actively cooperated with the commandant.\""
msgstr ""
"저자: M. 빌라렌자\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"우리는 이틀에 한 번씩 산책을 했다. 펜과 종이는 처음 두 달 동안 허용되었고 그 이후에는 지휘관의 특별한 명령에 의해 금지되었다. "
"그 후로 가족에게 편지를 쓸 때만 허용되었다. 나는 나중에 모든 편지는 지휘관이 읽지만 주소지로 가는 편지는 없다는 것을 깨달았다.\n"
"감옥에서 실제 범죄보다 정치적 이유로 이로베티에 의해 체포된 우리들은 다른 죄수들로부터 우리를 보호하기 위한 무리를 만들었다. 그들의 "
"도벽과 본성은 우리에게 낯설었으므로 우리는 교양있는 인간으로 남기 위해 스스로를 보호했다.\n"
"두 차례에 걸쳐 나는 '둥지'에 가야만 했다. 처음은 썩은 음식으로 식당에서 폭동을 일으켰을 때였고 두번째는 탈출을 계획했을 때였다. "
"'둥지'는 고문실이 있는 외곽의 탑의 이름이었다. 교도관들은 그들에게 협조하는 특별 수감자의 도움으로 그곳에서 심문을 실시했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Anti-Irovetti_3-Title_String
msgctxt "ccfd6cf5-7a76-4b61-9775-cab8946407f9"
msgid "\"The Chains of Conscience: Memoirs of Those Arrested for Sedition\""
msgstr "\"양심의 쇠사슬: 선동죄로 체포된 사람들의 회고록\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Archknights_1-Text_String
msgctxt "f2f20a93-4d78-46d0-8958-9eefbe73a81c"
msgid ""
"\"To many, the Archknights of Avistan were legend. To others they were "
"salvation. And to the wicked they were judgment. Their deeds were many, and "
"spanned from the central jungles of Garund to the realms of Mammoth and "
"Linnorm. Knighted in Taldor, but serving far beyond the scope of any one "
"kingdom or empire, they proved to be more than just knights. Their name was "
"given by a government official in Absalom after they foiled a plot to kill a "
"number of powerful merchants and politicians.\n"
"Yet, for a band of heroes to be legend, they must be more than great as "
"individuals or a team. They must have great motivation and they must have "
"class. These Knights were said to find no injustice beneath their time or "
"skill. Yet one goal did drive them like no other across the face of this "
"continent and beyond. It was said that they sought the answer to one of the "
"greatest mysteries of our time. What happened to Aroden, the last Azlanti? "
"Their world trek put them in a position to help many, but it all was made "
"possible by their desire to unravel the true fate of the living god, now "
"thought dead.\n"
"And they had class. Guy Shaseur De Lombair was their spokesmen. A strikingly "
"exotic half-elf whose father was a nobleman from Galt, and whose mother was "
"a raven-haired beauty from Rahadoum. Victims of political turmoil in Galt, "
"Guy's parents were executed by a device that would later inspire the "
"creation of the Final Blades during the country's Red Revolution. Guy fled "
"the land of his father and clawed his way up to be a great swordsman, "
"wilderness guide, tracker, and Archknight. His political prowess was said to "
"be as sharp as his dual elven swords. Because of his mother's anti-religious "
"influence, he disliked the gods. He thought that they lacked qualities "
"deserving of worship because of their failure to prevent the everyday evils "
"of man. He was said to say on occasion, \"let the gods admire me, for at "
"least I am here making a difference with my own hands. And let the gods of "
"darker dogmas fear me, for I will not rest until their cloisters are "
"graveyards.\" Attired in glamoured armor, this outdoorsman dressed as "
"elegantly as any could in that profession. And he danced around his "
"opponents like a bird of prey, graceful with every strike.\n"
"After surviving slave pits and having to fight and survive in the wilderness "
"alone as a child, he grew to be a man with a purpose. The world seemed to "
"fall apart when Aroden was lost, so Guy vowed to find him...\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 사람들에게 아비스탄의 아크나이트는 전설적이이었습니다. 다른 사람들에게는 구원이었습니다. 그리고 사악한 자들에게는 그들의 "
"심판이었습니다. 그들의 행적은 매우 많았고 가룬드의 중앙 정글에서 매머드와 린놈의 영역까지 이어졌습니다. 탈도르에서 기사가 되었지만, "
"그들은 하나의 왕국이나 제국의 범주를 넘어서 행동하며 일반적인 기사가 아니라는 사실을 입증했습니다. 여러 상인과 정치인을 죽이려는 음모를 "
"저지한 뒤, 압살롬 정부에 의해 공식적인 이름을 받았습니다.\n"
"그러나 영웅 무리가 전설이 되기 위해서는 개인이나 팀으로서나 강력해야만 합니다. 그들은 위대한 목적이 있어야 하며 작위 또한 있어야만 "
"합니다. 이 기사들은 정의 구현을 위해 그들의 시간과 기술을 쓰지 않았습니다. 그러나 한 가지 목표는 이 대륙의 누구보다도 더 그들을 "
"부추겼습니다. 그들은 우리 시대의 가장 커다란 신비에 대한 해답을 찾았다고 여겨집니다. 아로덴, 마지막 아즐란트인에게 무슨 일이 "
"일어났는가? 그들의 여행은 많은 이들을 돕도록 만들었지만, 그 모든 업적들은 지금은 죽었다고 여겨지는, 살아있는 신이 진정으로 맞이한 "
"운명을 알아내고자 하는 열망 덕분이었습니다.\n"
"그리고 그들에겐 작위가 있습니다. 가이 샤제흐 드 롬배흐가 그들의 대변인이었습니다. 이 눈에 띄게.이국적인 하프 엘프는 갈트의 귀족이었던 "
"아버지와 라하둠에서 온 까마귀같은 흑발을 가진 미녀였습니다. 갈트에서 정치적 혼란이 일어 희생자가 된 가이의 부모를 처형한 도구는 미래에 "
"붉은 혁명중 발명된 마지막 칼날이라고 불리는 장치의 원조로 여겨집니다. 가이는 아버지의 땅에서 도망쳤고 그 후로 위대한 검객, 황야의 "
"방랑자, 추적자, 아크나이트가 됩니다. 그의 정치적 기교는 그의 엘프 쌍검처럼 날카롭다고 알려졌습니다. 어머니의 반종교적 성향에 영향 "
"받았기 때문에, 그는 신들을 싫어했습니다. 그는 신들이 인간의 악한 본성을 막지 못했기 때문에 예배를 받을 자격이 부족하다고 "
"생각했습니다. 그는 때때로 이렇게 말했다고 합니다. \"신들이 나를 존경하게 하소서, 적어도 나는 내 손으로 여기서 변화를 만드니. "
"그리고 악신들이 나를 두렵게 여기도록 하소서, 나는 그들의 회랑이 무덤이 될 때까지 쉬지 않을 것이니.\" 화려한 갑옷을 입은 그는 "
"비슷한 일을 하는 누구보다 우아하게 차려입었다고 합니다. 그는 먹이를 쫓는 새처럼 적들의 주위에서 춤추듯 움직였고, 모든 공격은 "
"품위있었습니다.\n"
"어린 시절부터 노예 구덩이에서 살아남고, 광야에서 홀로 생존하고 싸워온 그는 목적 의식을 가지고 성장했습니다. 아로덴이 실종되었을 때부터 "
"세상은 망해가는 것처럼 보였고, 따라서 가이는 그를 찾겠다고 다짐했습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Archknights_1-Title_String
msgctxt "7e60c5b8-0c50-4978-afe1-09ec49069d69"
msgid "\"Legend of the Archknights of Avistan\", Vol. 1"
msgstr "\"아비스탄의 아크나이트 전설\" 1권"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Archknights_2-Text_String
msgctxt "03b1f64e-cc25-426b-afd3-2904e4c3cee7"
msgid ""
"\"Guy met many friends on his travels, and some even had the right metal to "
"join his quest to find Aroden. Deo was another founding member of the "
"Archknights. A barbarian of great renown hailing from the Storval Plateau, "
"Deo made a name for himself among the northern nomads of Varisia. He cut his "
"teeth in battle against Shoanti tribesmen and the Orcs of the Hold of "
"Belkzen as a young man. He grew to over seven feet tall as he reached his "
"maturity and swung a specially made axe that was said to be wider than most "
"men, and too heavy for most to lift let alone swing.\n"
"Clar, a fleet-of-foot Halfling, was the band's infiltrator, sneak, and "
"purveyor of necessary goods when the situation called for it. He wasn't the "
"nicest member of the knights, having grown up on the mean streets of "
"Westcrown. Orphaned by a Pathfinder father who was never around and when his "
"mother grew ill and died, he was born in the shadow and learned to use it as "
"a cloak. Recognizable by a milky eye, this Halfling may have been small but "
"his loyalty to the Archknights loomed as large as his best friend Deo.\n"
"Another member that exuded class was the group's battle caster, Vivreal. A "
"fugitive on the run from the Maurya-Rahm in Jalmeray, this exotic beauty "
"found a family among the Knights that was infectious and inclusive. She "
"added a touch of grace to balance out the Knights' wilder members. Said to "
"summon arcane energy weapons in battle and to cast spells between swings, "
"she wasn't one to sit back and let the men do the heavy lifting. She broke "
"many hearts, but never stole any. Some thought she left a lover behind on "
"that southern Isle and held out hope of seeing them again one day.\n"
"A non-traditional Knight by any standard, Beloq-Nur was a bowman with few "
"peers. Tortured as a captive of a sadistic orc war band on the outskirts "
"between Belkin and Lastwall, this man was covered in burn scars head to toe. "
"He didn't like what he saw in the eyes of onlookers, so he most often kept "
"to himself. But the party always knew he was around in a pinch because their "
"enemies began to sprout arrows at an alarming rate.\n"
"The chronicler of this tale also happens to be an Archknight of Avistan from "
"the cosmopolitan streets of Absalom. I am Ashwyn Blackstrand, greatest Magi "
"of the age, or so I hope to be for Serenrea's sake. My friends call me Ash, "
"and my enemies will tell you I do not exist. Some will say the Archknights "
"are myth, but do not be deceived. We are out there, searching for Aroden "
"still. As Guy would say, we seek the god that gave a damn. Look for us on "
"the path to knowledge and glory. We will be there, carrying light into the "
"darkness...\""
msgstr ""
"\"가이는 여행 중에 많은 친구들을 만났고, 어떤 사람들은 아로덴을 찾기 위해 합류하기까지 했습니다. 데오는 아크나이트의 또 다른 창립 "
"멤버였습니다. 스토발 고원에서 큰 명성을 얻은 야만인 데오는 바리시아의 북부 유목민의 이름을 따 자신의 이름을 지었습니다. 그는 어렸을 "
"때 쇼안티 종족과 벨크젠의 오크 부대와의 싸움에서 경험을 키웠습니다. 그가 성인이 되었을 때 그의 키는 7피트가 넘었고, 건장한 남성의 "
"어깨 넓이보다도 넓으면서도 대부분의 사람들은 들 수조차 없이 무거운 특제 도끼를 휘둘렀습니다\n"
"클라는 발이 큰 하플링으로 기사단의 첩보원이자 잠입 전문가, 그리고 보급 담당이었습니다. 그는 웨스트 크라운의 음험한 거리에서 자랐기에, "
"기사단의 가장 착한 구성원은 아니었습니다. 집에 들른 적이 없던 패스파인더 아버지와 병들어 죽은 어머니 때문에 고아가 된 그는 그림자 "
"속에서 태어났고 그것을 망토처럼 두르는 방법을 익혔습니다. 우윳빛 눈동자를 가진 그 하플링은 몸집이 작았지만, 기사단에 대한 충성심은 "
"그의 가장 친한 친구인 데오 만큼 컸습니다.\n"
"기사단의 또 다른 멤버는 전투 마법사인 비브리얼이었습니다. 잘메레이에 있는 마우르야-라함에서 도망친 이 이국적인 미녀는 친근하고 끈끈한 "
"정이 있는 기사단을 가족처럼 여겼습니다. 그녀는 거친 기사들과 대조적인 우아함을 더해 전체적인 균형을 맞춰주었습니다. 비전 에너지 무기를 "
"소환해 싸움과 동시에 무기를 피하며 마법을 시전하는 그녀는 남자들 만큼이나 용감하게 전투에 참여했습니다. 많은 남자들이 그녀 때문에 "
"가슴앓이를 했습니다만, 어느 누구의 마음도 훔치지는 않았습니다. 어떤 이들은 그녀가 남방의 섬에 애인을 두고 떠나왔으며, 언젠가 다시 "
"만날 날을 고대하고 있다 생각합니다.\n"
"어떤 기준으로 봐도 통념적 기사가 아닌 벨로 누르는 고독한 궁수입니다. 벨킨과 라스트월 사이의 외곽에서 오크 군단에게 잡혀 모진 고문을 "
"당한 그는 머리부터 발끝까지 화상 흉터로 가득합니다. 그는 남의 눈에 띄는 것을 좋아하지 않기 때문에 자신의 모습을 숨깁니다. 하지만 "
"그의 동료들은 주변 어딘가에 그가 숨어있다는 것을 압니다. 언제 어디사나 눈 깜빡할 새에 적들에게 화살비가 꽂히기 때문이죠.\n"
"이 연대기의 저자 또한 압살롬의 국제 거리에서 아비스탄의 아크나이트가 되었습니다. 저는 이 시대 최고의 마기, 또는 서렌레이께 남은 생을 "
"바치고 싶어하는 마기인 애쉬원 블랙스트랜드입니다. 내 친구들은 나를 애쉬라고 부르며, 내 원수는 나의 존재를 부정합니다. 어떤 이들은 "
"아크나이트가 신화에 불과하다고 말하겠지만, 그 거짓말에 속지 마십시오. 우리는 실존하며, 여전히 아로덴을 찾고 있습니다. 가이가 말했듯, "
"우리는 저주받은 신을 찾습니다 지식과 영광의 길에서 우리를 찾으십시오. 우리는 어둠 속에 빛을 비추며 그곳에 있을겁니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Archknights_2-Title_String
msgctxt "79c1de71-d467-4fe9-a018-462f517c2c2d"
msgid "\"Legend of the Archknights of Avistan\", Vol. 2"
msgstr "\"아비스탄의 아크나이트 전설\" 2권"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Limericks-Text_String
msgctxt "6c2ac7dd-0611-4359-97ba-ad0b99874f1c"
msgid ""
"Author: Linzi the Outrageously Irreverent\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"There once was a power-mad king\n"
"Who thought his good taste was the thing\n"
"That would bring him to fame\n"
"And cover his shame\n"
"For failing to make some offspring\n"
"***\n"
"There once was a king who was wacky\n"
"And honestly quite a bit tacky\n"
"His offenses to taste\n"
"Required a mace\n"
"Used against him by some sort of lackey\n"
"***\n"
"Irovetti, he loves color orange\n"
"He's puny and lacks a mite's courage\n"
"He counts all his silver\n"
"And secretly quivers\n"
"In his castle behind a large dirt henge\n"
"***\n"
"When trying to rhyme Irovetti\n"
"I felt like a two-headed ettin.\n"
"With confetti as much overused as yeti\n"
"Gotta scramble for something more pretty\n"
"***\n"
"Here rules the great King Irovetti\n"
"Just saying his name makes me sweaty\n"
"His tastes weird and gaudy\n"
"And overly bawdy\n"
"And also he's terribly petty\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 불법을 일삼는 오만불손한 린지\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"한때 권력에 미친 왕이 있었다네\n"
"그는 자기 취향이 고상하다고 생각했다네\n"
"그 덕에 자기가 유명하다고 착각하고\n"
"자기의 수치심을 가려준다고 착각하네\n"
"아이도 못만드는 고자라는건 변함이 없네\n"
"***\n"
"옛날에는 이상한 왕이 있었다네\n"
"솔직히 꽤 조금 끈적한 사람이었다네\n"
"취향에 대한 그의 모욕에는\n"
"가시박힌 철퇴가 필요하다네\n"
"종에게 쥐어주고 그의 엉덩이를 후려쳐야 한다네\n"
"***\n"
"이로베티 그는 오렌지색을 좋아한다네\n"
"보잘것 없는 그는 마이트만한 용기도 없다네\n"
"그는 자기 은화를 일일이 세고\n"
"조심스럽게 흔들어본다네\n"
"그는 커다란 모래성에 숨어있다네\n"
"***\n"
"이로베티로 라임을 만들려고 할 때면\n"
"나는 두 머리 달린 에틴이 된 것 같다네.\n"
"예티가 뿌리는 마냥 과도한 색종이와 함께라면\n"
"더 예쁜 무엇이라도 망가뜨릴 수 있다네\n"
"***\n"
"위대한 이로베티왕의 통치가 있네\n"
"그의 이름을 말하는 것만으로도 짜증이 난다네\n"
"그의 취향은 섬뜩하고 천박하고\n"
"무엇보다도 외설적이라네\n"
"게다가 그는 끔찍히도 쪼잔하다네\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Limericks-Title_String
msgctxt "909bafd4-ce14-4582-899a-a12414ded972"
msgid "\"What Flagrant Impudence! 101 Limericks about King Irovetti\""
msgstr "\"이런 끔찍한 왕이 있다니, 이로베티 임금에 관한 101가지 사실\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Pulp_1-Text_String
msgctxt "c4f68e95-5a58-4254-9296-4799831d4efc"
msgid ""
"Author: Belmon Savanyar\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"The moon filled the room with light, stirring up insane nightmares in her "
"charming head — nightmares full of horror and... pleasure. The finest silk "
"veil could not hide her forms, her hot skin, her seductive neck.\n"
"The window rattled open. The curtains fluttered, like the wings of a pigeon "
"caught in a snare. She jumped up, screaming in bed. The silver moon in the "
"window was obscured by his black silhouette. Ginratti had returned. She "
"could not help but sigh — memories of the nights filled with the passion he "
"had given her on this very bed excited her so much.\n"
"But what's happened to him? Why is his skin so pale? Why the long fangs, "
"sparkling in the moonlight when he smiles? Why did he change his favorite "
"snow-white coat to this terrible black cloak? Oh, no, she thought! What have "
"you become, Ginratti?! But whoever you are now, I will still be yours!\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 벨몬 사반야르\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈출판\n"
"\"달빛으로 방이 가득 차고 그녀의 매력적인 머리에는 끔찍한 악몽이 휘몰아치고는... 기쁨이 찾아옵니다. 가장 고운 실크 베일도 그녀의 "
"모습, 부드러운 피부, 매혹적인 목선을 숨길 수 없습니다.\n"
"창문이 열렸습니다. 커튼이 철장에 갇힌 비둘기처럼 펄럭입니다. 그녀는 침대에서 비명을 질렀습니다. 창문에 있는 은빛 달빛은 그의 검은 "
"실루엣으로 가려졌습니다. 긴라티가 돌아왔습니다. 그녀는 한숨을 쉴 수 밖에 없었습니다. 그가 그녀를 만족시키던 열정적인 밤들을 떠올렸기 "
"때문입니다.\n"
"하지만 그에게 무슨 일이 일어난 걸까요? 왜 그의 피부는 창백할까요? 왜 그가 미소지을 때 긴 송곳니가 반짝일까요? 왜 그가 자신이 "
"좋아하던 흰색 코트 대신 끔찍한 검은 망토를 둘렀을까요? 그녀는 생각했습니다. 긴라티 도대체 당신은?! 당신이 누구건 간에 나는 당신의 "
"것이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Pulp_1-Title_String
msgctxt "d7547828-d6c1-468e-a8a8-8a316fe705a4"
msgid ""
"\"The Tragic Love Story of the Noble Maid Rosalinta and Ginratti Badbassor, "
"the Night Bloodsucker\""
msgstr "\"고귀한 하녀 로잘린타와 뱀파이어 긴라티 배드배서의 비극적인 사랑 이야기, 한 밤의 흡혈귀\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Pulp_2-Text_String
msgctxt "cf5a1e16-707e-44da-82db-108c1f054cf2"
msgid ""
"Author: Maerathel Moon Rain\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"You can feed my guts to the fish if I brought you to the wrong place,\" "
"the salty sea wolf standing at the helm said, loudly blowing his nose "
"overboard. The schooner was heading to an island covered with jungle and "
"crowned by a smoking volcano.\n"
"\"Here is. Scarlet Grumbling Volcano. It has fortress you enemy, Gulebridon,"
"\" Jhun-ta said solemnly. In recent days, Captain Ellena had grown attached "
"to this fierce but noble savage.\n"
"\"Gulebridon, you'll be sorry you stood in my way,\" Ellena thought, "
"clutching her sword. \"No one steals from a pirate princess and expects to "
"live happily ever after.\"\n"
"Her thoughts were interrupted by the cry of a sailor pointing at a black "
"cloud that was moving toward them. Ellena jumped up and pointed her sword "
"toward the island. \"Damn that Gulebridon! He used his vile magic to keep us "
"away from the island! All hands on deck! We've got a little storm to address!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 메라셀 문 레인\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"잘못된 곳으로 간다면 내게 물고기를 잔뜩 먹여야 할 거야.\" 돛대에서 바다 늑대가 서서 큰소리로 코를 풉니다. 스쿠너는 정글로 "
"덮이고 하늘에는 화산 연기가 자욱한 섬으로 향하고 있었습니다.\n"
"\"여기야. 붉게 불타는 화산. 이곳은 적들의 요새지. 굴레브리돈.\" 준-타가 엄숙하게 말했습니다. 최근 엘레나 선장은 이 포악하지만 "
"고상한 야만인에 매료되었습니다.\n"
"\"굴레브리돈. 내 앞을 막지 마.\" 엘레나는 칼을 쥐고 생각했습니다. \"해적 공주에게 물건을 훔치는 어느 녀석도 발뻗고 자지 못할 "
"거야.\"\n"
"자신들을 향하는 검은 구름이 있다고 외치는 선원 때문에 그녀는 더 생각할 겨를이 없었습니다. 엘레나가 벌떡 일어나 섬을 향해 그녀의 검을 "
"뽑았습니다. \"망할 굴레브리돈! 마법을 사용해서 우리가 섬으로 접근하지 못하게 하는군! 폭풍이 다가온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Pulp_2-Title_String
msgctxt "36fd97e9-2801-41b5-8504-0fa1f4689bff"
msgid ""
"\"The Adventures of Captain Ellena: In Search of the Cyclops Lord's Scepter\""
msgstr "\"엘레나 선장의 모험: 사이클롭스 왕의 홀을 찾아서\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Pulp_3-Text_String
msgctxt "805ead5a-1eba-4d55-9bc2-7385d4dbd14c"
msgid ""
"Author: B. B. Butts\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"Grimblock walked around the crime scene. The cane of the great detective "
"knocked on the floorboards with a rhythmic sound, like the clockwork he had "
"instead of his heart.\n"
"'Without a doubt, the killer was an elf. Look at the tracks — a narrow foot, "
"a modest shoe size. And low weight — the servant did not hear the creaking "
"of the floorboards, and they are...' Grimblock rose on his toes and dropped "
"on his feet heavily, causing the boards to screech. 'Let us say they are "
"quite noisy. The killer is strong and tall... Thin, tall, strong, with small "
"feet. Yes, of course, he is an elf.'\n"
"'Or a tall, thin, strong human,' Chapperbrant said passionately. 'And how "
"did you come by the idea that the killer is tall and strong?!'\n"
"'He is strong because, otherwise, he would not have been able to hang so "
"long, clinging to the window sill. And if he were not tall, how would I "
"notice the tips of his boots in the window, walking up the stair?'\n"
"Grimblock approached the window and closed the shutter sharply. There was a "
"scream, and the unfortunate elven killer fell into the bushes, along with "
"the cloak of invisibility.\""
msgstr ""
"저자: B.B. 버츠\n"
"슈라이크 힐드 출판\n"
"\"그림블록은 범죄 현장을 걸어 다녔고, 그의 지팡이가 마루판을 자신의 심장 박동을 대신하듯 리듬감있게 두드렸습니다.\n"
"의심의 여지없이 살인범은 엘프였습니다. '이 발자국을 봐. 좁은 발, 아담한 신발 크기. 그리고 가벼운 체중으로 하인은 마루의 삐걱거림을 "
"듣지 못했다...' 그림블록은 바닥을 발로 비비면서 마루판의 삐걱거리는 소리를 냅니다. '그들이 시끄러운 녀석들이라고 생각해 보자. "
"살인범은 힘이 세고 키가 크다... 말랐고 키가 크고 힘이 세고 발이 작다. 그래. 그는 엘프가 틀림 없어.'\n"
"'아니면 크고 마르고 힘 센 인간일지도.' 채퍼브란트가 열정적으로 말합니다. '그나저나 범인이 키가 크고 힘이 세다는 건 어떻게 안 "
"거야?!'\n"
"'힘이 약했다면 창가에 그렇게 오래 매달려있을 수 없었겠지. 그의 키가 작았다면 계단에 오를 때 내가 어떻게 그의 장화를 볼 수 "
"있었겠어?'\n"
"그림불록이 창가로 가더니 창문을 닫습니다. 그러자 비명 소리가 들렸고 불행한 엘프 살인자는 투명 망토를 두른 채 수풀로 떨어졌습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Pulp_3-Title_String
msgctxt "37a4bd75-a49b-4826-9f83-dc8162c9b647"
msgid "\"Great Detective Izamir Grimblock: The Case of Six Invisibles\""
msgstr "\"위대한 탐정 이자미르 그림블록: 6인의 투명 인간 사건\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Smart_1-Text_String
msgctxt "a90c5831-df3d-41b0-a1c1-08d76f4fa630"
msgid ""
"Author: I.K. Danzi\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"It's no secret that a large-scale language reform is being discussed in "
"Galt right now. Or rather, a barbaric simplification and impoverishment of "
"spoken and written language. Their plan is to remove a few letters from the "
"alphabet, to primitivize words, depriving them of their wealth of morphemes "
"and reducing the entire prefix base. In the end, this will destroy all the "
"treasures the language of the Galtan poets and playwrights is famous for.\n"
"What does this mean? In truth, this complicated and stunningly fruitful "
"language, ideal for creators of art, is to be tamed and shortened, sent to "
"the execution block, in the same manner these 'linguistic activists' have "
"already shortened their rulers!\n"
"What will be the result of such a reform? Will the rich cultural tradition "
"fall into decay? Wither, like a tree deprived of water? It's more than that. "
"After all, not only will future authors lose potential tools of the trade, "
"but future readers will also be unable to comprehend the masterpieces "
"created by their predecessors. The language of high poetry will devolve into "
"the language of the crowd, of the common people...\""
msgstr ""
"저자: I.K 단지\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"현재 갈트에서 거대한 규모의 언어 개혁이 논의되고 있다는 것은 비밀이 아니며, 오히려 지금은 말을 지나치게 단순화해서 표현이 "
"빈곤해지는 현상이 발생했습니다. 그들의 계획은 알파벳 몇 글자를 제거하고, 단어를 원시화하고 박탈하여 풍부한 형태소를 빼앗고 접두어 "
"전체를 줄이는 것입니다. 결국 갈트 시인과 극작가의 보물인 화려한 언어는 모두 파괴될 것입니다.\n"
"이것은 무엇을 의미하는걸까요? 사실 이 정교하고 풍부한 언어는 예술가에게는 이상적이었지만 언어 개혁으로 짧아졌고 이는 언어 활동가들이 "
"그들의 통치자의 수명을 단축시킨 것과 같습니다!\n"
"그러한 개혁의 결과는 무엇입니까? 풍부한 문화적 전통이 붕괴되는 것인가요? 물이 부족한 나무처럼 시드는 것입니까? 그 이상입니다. 미래의 "
"저자는 생계 수단을 잃을 뿐만 아니라 미래의 독자들도 과거의 걸작을 이해할 수 없을 것입니다. 시의 고귀한 언어는 군중과 일반 대중의 "
"언어로 바뀔 것입니다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Smart_1-Title_String
msgctxt "6ed3428d-febe-4932-b39c-b23a916082cd"
msgid "\"The Written Word on the Execution Block\""
msgstr "\"사형대에서 쓴 글\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Smart_2-Text_String
msgctxt "bee80dfe-4a83-4427-848f-128b439697a3"
msgid ""
"Author: Illysenna of Greengold\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"On this mural, we see a depiction of Earthfall. There are many tiny people "
"suffering untold miseries: one lies crushed beneath the rubble of a wall, "
"while another burns in the blazing fire. A third raises his hands to the "
"sky, unable to bear the horror of what's happening. But let's take a closer "
"look at their faces. They seem calm, serene even. What is the meaning here? "
"A sign of the artist's inability, or, on the contrary, perhaps some lost "
"skill? A modern artist would try to add naturalism to the picture — depict "
"blood and dripping intestines, mouths open in a howl, grimaces of horror and "
"pain on their faces. Thus he would add to this work something that should "
"never appear in art: ugliness. The ancients looked at the world through the "
"prism of beauty and did not allow themselves to insult the eyes of their "
"viewers, even when depicting wars and catastrophes...\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 그린골드의 일리센나\n"
"슈라이크 힐즈 출판\n"
"\"이 벽화에서 우리는 어스폴의 묘사를 봅니다. 끝없는 비참함을 겪고 있는 작은 사람들이 있습니다. 벽의 파편 아래에 깔려 짓이겨진 "
"사람, 타오르는 불에서 고통받는 사람, 자신에게 일어나는 일을 잊으려 하늘을 손바닥으로 가리려는 사람들이 있습니다. 그들의 얼굴을 더 "
"자세히 봅시다. 그들은 조용하고 심지어 고요한 것처럼 보입니다. 이 의미는 무엇일까요? 예술가의 무능력일까요? 혹은 잊혀진 예술 "
"기법일까요? 현대 예술가는 그림에 자연스러움을 더하려고 노력할 것입니다. 피가 튀는 모습과 입을 열어 비명을 지르는 모습과 그리고 "
"고통으로 가득 찬 얼굴을 묘사하려 할 것입니다. 그는 이 작품에서 한가지를 배제했습니다. 그것은 추함입니다. 고대인은 세계를 아름다움의 "
"색안경을 쓰고 사물을 관찰했고 관람객으로 하여금 흉측한 작품을 보여주지 않으려 했습니다. 심지어 그것이 재앙이더라도 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Smart_2-Title_String
msgctxt "c017fccb-db62-4fc3-82a2-3fb923c03704"
msgid ""
"\"Through the Eyes of the Ancients: A Monumental Painting from the First "
"Century of the Age of Enthronement\""
msgstr "\"고대인의 눈으로 보다: 즉위의 시대 최초의 세기에서 온 기념비적인 회화\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Smart_3-Text_String
msgctxt "a3fbe733-b5c8-4453-9d9a-9f3feffe4ad3"
msgid ""
"Author: Eobald the Insightful\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"So the space and time in the Numerian sagas do not exist on their own, but "
"are rather subject to the story, stretching and contracting according to its "
"requirements. Beidra the Widow fights in Irrisen, then sends her troops to "
"the Five Kings Mountains, and from there she goes to Iobaria — and during "
"all this time, her son remains an infant, although these campaigns should "
"have taken far more than one year. The image of the mother who crushes her "
"enemies without taking the child from her breast is too important for the "
"plot to sacrifice it to what we now call realism. When the time comes for "
"young Rannad to join the battle, he grows up in just a few days...\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 신통한 자 이오발드\n"
"슈라이크 구릉지 출판\n"
"\"누메리아식 서사시에서 시공간은 직접적으로 존재하지 않습니다. 그러나 이야기에 종속된 것이 아니라, 필요에 따라 늘어나기도 줄어들기도 "
"하는 쪽입니다. 과부 베이드라는 이리센에서 싸운 후 다섯 왕의 산맥으로 군대를 보냅니다. 거기에서 그녀는 이오바리아에 갑니다. 전쟁이 "
"1년 이상 이어졌음에도 불구하고, 이 기간 동안 그녀의 아들은 유아로 남아있습니다. 아이에게 젖을 먹이지 않고 전투를 수행하는 그녀의 "
"모습이 이야기에서 너무나 중요했기에, 현대에 사실주의라 부르는 것을 희생하기까지 합니다. 어린 라나드가 전투에 참여했을 때는 태어난 지 "
"수일이 채 되지 않았습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Peddler_Books/Smart_3-Title_String
msgctxt "619fc20d-e10d-4012-abfd-8f871c5736fc"
msgid "\"The Categories of Space and Time in the Classical Numerian Saga\""
msgstr "\"고전적인 누메리아식 서사시에서 시공간의 범주\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Barks/Bark_Cart-Linzi_1_String
msgctxt "bed5880b-dc06-43be-b16b-cf9ca265eab0"
msgid ""
"\"Well, then... Some things made of iron... pots... boards... Damn, it's not "
"here! They stole it! We've been robbed!\""
msgstr "\"음. 그럼... 철... 냄비... 판자로 만들어졌어... 젠장. 여기에 없어! 도둑맞았잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Barks/Bark_Cart-Linzi_2_String
msgctxt "f0f80e05-9797-408b-a32e-2be53efbed37"
msgid ""
"\"Look, a trail! They must have dragged it along the road. Let's go — no way "
"they made it far with something so heavy!\""
msgstr "\"저 길을 봐! 그들은 길을 따라 끌고 갔을 거야. 가자. 무거워서 떠난 지 얼마 되지 않았을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Barks/Bark_Cart-no-Linzi_String
msgctxt "0e88c73d-b0e2-48f4-8be8-cabc17cc80cd"
msgid ""
"The cart is loaded with boxes. Without Linzi, it's hard to say whether they "
"contain what you need."
msgstr "카트에는 상자가 실려있습니다. 린지가 없으면 당신에게 필요한 물건이 담겼는지 알 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Barks/Bark_Press-no-Linzi_String
msgctxt "8e7cafb2-d620-46f1-9ac3-0a8e2b54fbd9"
msgid ""
"There are some mechanisms in the boxes. Without Linzi, it's hard to say "
"whether these are what you're looking for, and if so, whether everything is "
"here."
msgstr "상자에는 어떤 기계 장치가 있습니다. 린지가 없다면 이것이 당신이 찾고 있는 것인지 아닌지 알 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a9c0e9dc-e514-4675-b396-09eaefa555a9"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0007_Text_String
msgctxt "e58cbd65-4748-4b01-92dc-504a27d4cb99"
msgid "\"How did you meet Linzi?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 린지를 만났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ac0cdb10-1a7f-4be2-ba21-40f7f73a8273"
msgid "\"What brought you here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이곳에 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6c19e74a-3cec-489f-b68f-b009f22d84aa"
msgid "\"Will you be staying?\""
msgstr "\"여기 머무를건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "065736ec-117e-4750-ac3a-1db6f004cf0b"
msgid ""
"[Give 10 gold] \"You travel around... Have you heard anything interesting "
"about my neighbors?\""
msgstr "[10골드를 줍니다] \"너는 여행자 맞지... 나의 이웃에 관해 흥미있는 정보라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "8ddb92ad-6a0c-4322-bb55-5043be8c69ce"
msgid "\"Have you heard anything interesting about my neighbors?\""
msgstr "\"나의 이웃에 관해 흥미있는 정보라도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "1c77f674-89f3-4c9c-a182-173b7f2fe38c"
msgid "\"How are things in Brevoy?\""
msgstr "\"브레보이는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "b513a0e6-f387-41c6-baca-a04a0a2d9625"
msgid "\"Any news from Mivon?\""
msgstr "\"미본에서 소식 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "ad4d4a58-fcbe-4821-8452-3c056c909f71"
msgid "\"What's going on in Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "ddda3c98-0878-4618-a18e-b062ad68765f"
msgid "\"Thank you. That's enough for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "867d32ed-e0c8-4702-a408-208a1fb54cfb"
msgid "\"Has anyone asked about my lands?\""
msgstr "\"누군가 내 땅에 대해 물은 적이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "aa7bbf91-d02c-4a44-9f3c-f73b74c172ca"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "756f7bd3-dcbe-4bae-97e3-7a590182b8dc"
msgid "\"Wait! I want you to meet someone.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만요! 만날 사람이 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1326a4e6-9a76-4c62-a5d9-5a35465813bb"
msgid ""
"\"Here! This is Tessie the Quill, a book peddler! If not for her, I'd "
"probably still be sitting in a radish patch in my hometown.\""
msgstr "\"자! 이쪽은 책 행상인 깃펜 테시예요! 테시가 없었다면 전 고향에서 무나 키우고 있었을 걸요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "caca4a2f-dae5-47a0-b3db-034284e01053"
msgid ""
"{n}Tessie, a plump woman wearing heavily patched clothes, greets you with a "
"broad, gap-toothed smile.{/n} \"Nice to meet you, Your Barony! Thanks for "
"keeping an eye on this little tot!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}무거운 누더기를 입은 통통한 여성 테시는, 이빨 빠진 자리까지 드러나는 환한 미소로 당신을 환영합니다.{/n} \"만나서 "
"반갑습니다, 남작님! 이 쪼그만 녀석을 지켜줘서 고마워요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "03a4b8ef-4bb3-4a8b-ab7b-fde4292f4452"
msgid ""
"\"Right now, or in general? Came from {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} right now. As for "
"in general — well, I'm from everywhere and nowhere. Was found under a bush, "
"and I've traveled with the wind ever since, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 어디서 온건지를 물으시는건가요 아니면 평상시 때를 물으시는건가요? 저는 지금 막 {g|Mivon} 미본{/g}에서 왔어요. "
"평상시때로 말하자면, 세상 방방곳곳에서 왔다고 할 수 있죠. 여기저기 떠돌고 있어서 수풀에서 잠을 청하고 바람이 가는 길을 따라가고 "
"있죠! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "71db2df2-93e7-4868-9b1f-dfbce6c58685"
msgid ""
"\"Went through her village from time to time. Weren't many buyers — I was "
"lucky to sell half a dozen calendars each year, maybe a couple cheap, vulgar "
"prints. Then a priest from the capital went to live there, and he got the "
"young people interested in reading little by little — some would ask for "
"romance stories, some wanted heroic tales...\""
msgstr ""
"\"가끔씩 그녀의 마을에 들렸었어요. 구매자는 많지 않아서, 매년 운좋아도 달력 6개 정도랑 싸구려 인쇄물 몇 장 팔리는 정도였죠. "
"그러다가 수도에서 온 한 사제가 그 곳에 살게되었고, 그는 젊은이들에게 조금씩 독서에 관심을 갖게 했어요. 어떤 이들은 로맨스 스토리를, "
"또 어떤 이들은 영웅적인 스토리를 원하곤 했었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "c25bfa0f-3281-448a-8f89-6511a6239f16"
msgid ""
"\"Well, one day, this little tot came by and traded her father's belt, two "
"bottles, and a hunk of bread for a two-volume collection of legends about "
"the Archknights of {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}. Came back later all tearstained — "
"looked like her daddy didn't need the belt after all. So she sniffles at me "
"and says, 'Take me with you, I can help,' and looks at me like a lost puppy. "
"So I took her along — why not? And that's what got the ball rolling.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어느 날 이 조그만 녀석이 아버지의 허리띠와 병 두개, 빵 한덩어리를 가져와 {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g}의 아크나이츠에 관한 "
"2권짜리 소설로 교환해달라는 거 있죠. 나중에는 눈이 퉁퉁 부어서 왔는데 아버지에게 엄청 혼났던거 같아요. 그리고는 길잃은 강아지처럼 "
"나를 보더니 도움이 될테니 데려가 달라고 했어요. 그래서 이 꼬맹이를 데리고 다녔죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "77c1064b-0e19-4fd8-8349-76bee6719778"
msgid ""
"\"A little bird told me about a proper city in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} now, one with a printing house — with an old friend of mine "
"sitting in that printing house, at that! So I came by to see her, maybe buy "
"some books while I'm at it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"소문에 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 제대로 된 도시가 생겼다고 들었어요. 바로 인쇄소가 있는 도시죠! 게다가 그 "
"인쇄소엔 제 오랜 친구가 주인으로 있구요! 그래서 그녀를 보러 들렀어요. 책도 몇권 사갈까 해서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "397e2620-cd48-42be-a949-3b3b9157153c"
msgid ""
"\"Me? Not really sure. Probably for a while, at least. The people here seem "
"fine. They read, at least — then again, there is a printing house here... "
"And I get to catch up with Linzi — hadn't seen her for a few years, y'know. "
"After I get tired of things here, I'll be on my way again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저요? 잘 모르겠어요. 아마 당분간은 여기서 지내지 않을까요. 이곳 사람들은 괜찮아 보여요. 적어도 책을 읽으니까요. 다시 말하지만, "
"저는 이곳에 인쇄소가 있다고 해서 찾아왔고, 몇 년 동안 보지 못한 린지를 만나러 온 거예요. 여기가 지겨워지면 다시 길을 떠나겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "c2c31313-a74b-403c-b21f-cb6ec620516a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tessie hides the money and smiles knowingly.{/n} \"Course I do! Who you "
"want to hear about?\""
msgstr "{n}테시는 돈을 숨기고 알겠다는듯이 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"물론이죠! 누구에 대해 듣고 싶어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "83fd332a-3dc2-435b-bd58-93cee8e28e04"
msgid "\"Sure! Who you want to hear about?\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠! 누구에 대해 듣고 싶어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "33091f9a-752d-4e9e-971c-17943a02317a"
msgid ""
"\"You're always welcome! We peddlers are pretty good at judging rumors, "
"y'know.\""
msgstr "\"또 물어봐요! 우리 행상인들은 소문을 걸러 내는데 능숙하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "ae11f6db-e9d9-4d05-a914-5336e5e0cb86"
msgid ""
"\"Now, don't you go taking me for a spy, all right? Honestly — go ahead and "
"check me with magic, or just ask Linzi. I'm happy to hear and pass along "
"rumors, but I don't go spying on purpose — my business is books.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 스파이로 쓰려는 건 아니겠죠? 나를 마법으로 탐지하거나 린지에게 물어 봐도 좋아요. 나는 소문을 좋아하지만 염탐꾼은 아니에요. "
"나는 책 장사꾼이라고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "59cf4b31-11c2-4ced-9640-727e9e39f0fc"
msgid ""
"\"Bad. People in {g|Restov}Restov{/g} are honing their swords. With the "
"royal house gone, it's just a matter of time until there's some big uproar. "
"Everyone knows it, and no one wants it, but there doesn't seem to be any way "
"to avoid it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안좋아요. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 사람들이 칼을 갈고있어요. 왕실이 사라졌으니, 뭔가 큰 소동이 일어날 때까지는 시간 "
"문제일 뿐이죠. 모두 알고 있고 아무도 원하지 않지만 피할 방법이없는 것 같아요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "0e689963-78de-4558-9823-cee475b6aa2d"
msgid ""
"\"The usual — schemes and duels! Seems a bunch of runaway bandits flooded in "
"there from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. Rumor has it the Great Houses are "
"intentionally straining {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} so the Aldori there won't be able "
"to help {g|Restov}Restov{/g} when the carnage begins.\""
msgstr ""
"\"평소대로에요. 음모와 결투가 난무하고! {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 도망친 도적들이 밀려들어온 것 같아요. 소문으로는 귀족 "
"가문들이 의도적으로 {g|Mivon}미본{/g}을 긴장시키고 있어서, 그곳의 알도리는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에서 대학살이 "
"시작되도 도와 줄 수 없을꺼라고 하네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "87cfb7b8-feff-464e-b2cb-de33c86c0386"
msgid ""
"\"Under King Irovetti, what isn't? Parties, parades, executions... The king "
"robs the trade houses that used to own the city. He brought some gang in "
"from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} who's been selling deliriant potions. He sends "
"strange expeditions into nearby lands, but no one knows what he's looking "
"for... Nobody can tell what the kook's thinking — that's why he always wins!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 지배하는데 뻔하죠. 잔치에, 퍼레이드에, 처형에... 왕은 도시 소유인 무역 회사의 재산을 횡령했어요. 이로베티는 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 어딘가에서 마약성 물약을 팔던 도적단을 불러들였다고 해요. 그는 주변 땅으로 수상한 탐험대를 파견하고 "
"있지만 무엇을 찾으려 하는지는 아무도 몰라요... 아무도 그 괴짜의 머릿 속을 알 수가 없어요. 그게 그가 항상 이기는 비결이예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "effa2797-ecf9-41ef-b9f1-9f6e44352570"
msgid ""
"\"As for your question... well, of course they're interested. People in "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} want to know if they were right to wager on you, while "
"{g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} and {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} are still trying to take the "
"measure of their new neighbor. No one knows what to expect from you, so "
"they're getting themselves ready for some surprises!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 질문에 답하자면... 다른 이들도 당연히 관심이 있어요. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 사람들은 당신을 영주 자리에 놓은 "
"것을 잘한 일인지 판단하고 있고 {g|Mivon} 미본{/g}과 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 당신의 힘이 어느 정도인지 가늠하고 "
"있죠. 아무도 당신에 대해 아는 게 없어서 대비만 세우고 있는 상황이랄까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "833f20b7-77ff-46fa-a0f7-dfaf44b874fe"
msgid "\"A good day to ya! Take care of Linzi!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 되세요! 린지를 잘 돌봐주고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "61f7b2f2-0075-468f-a89c-0bae29798b08"
msgid "\"Decided to stay with us?\""
msgstr "\"우리와 함께 있기로 결심했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9e0c5cb4-0694-44d7-92aa-36466d944755"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1372b665-2405-41b6-bc28-a5db195e06a4"
msgid "\"Show me what you have for sale.\""
msgstr "\"어떤걸 파는지 보여주겠어?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c3ca96e2-040f-4c0e-9668-f1d074e54b4a"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ebe02fe0-2493-4a10-9797-f539b16c713b"
msgid "\"Tessie, do you have any books by Willas Gunderson?\""
msgstr "\"테시. 윌라스 건더슨의 책이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2c94dd32-6917-49bd-9632-ee5f8fae607b"
msgid "\"Who did you yell at?\""
msgstr "\"누구에게 소리지르는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "207a5678-4300-42cb-97c1-2d2544273db2"
msgid ""
"{n}The plump book peddler gives you a gap-toothed grin.{/n} \"Good day, Your "
"'Ighness!\""
msgstr "{n}통통해 보이는 책 행상인은 당신에게 입을 크게 벌리며 활짝 웃음짓습니다.{/n} \"안녕하신가요. 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "5b9e822a-bd1b-4eed-93cd-9fddf54b1b82"
msgid ""
"\"For now, for now. Linzi wants my help selling the books she's printing. "
"Trade's good, so I'll stick around and be an eyesore for a while. When I'm "
"tired of it, I'll be on my way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"일단 지금은 그럴려구요. 지금 린지가 책을 팔려면 나의 도움이 필요해요. 장사가 잘되니, 당분간 이 주변에 머물면서 신세 좀 질께요. "
"지겨워지면 또 길을 떠나겠죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "f74672fc-a569-4b23-94fd-342f1c801834"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing to tell! Native of nowhere, live on the road, peddle books... No "
"family, no home — no cares, no troubles!\""
msgstr ""
"\"딱히 말할게 없어요! 고향도 없고, 길에서 살고, 책을 팔고 있죠...가족도 없고, 집도 없고. 아무도 신경 안쓰니, 아무런 문제도 "
"없죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3afa63b6-73ff-4b22-be34-a551f1b8b410"
msgid "\"A good day to ya! Take care of Linzi!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 되세요! 린지를 잘 돌봐주시구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "3a710171-d5ef-444c-a1a6-919d0f68ef7a"
msgid ""
"\"Pardon me, Your 'Ighness! I once took a couple of his books with me, and I "
"dragged 'em around for three years till someone bought 'em for a pittance as "
"kindling. Won't be easy to finding the works of that scribbler. Maybe "
"someone in town has some.\""
msgstr ""
"\"실례합니다, 전하! 저는 그의 책 두 권을 가지고 있었는데, 누가 불쏘시개 정도의 돈을 주고 사갈 때까지 3년 동안 가지고 "
"다녔었습니다. 그 저자의 작품을 찾기는 쉽지 않을 겁니다. 어쩌 마을에 있는 누군가가 가지고 있을지도 몰라요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "b32af209-2103-45fc-96ab-a3520efc97cd"
msgid ""
"\"Damn wretches! I'll get you! Oh, I'm sorry, Your 'Ighness, I didn't mean "
"you...\""
msgstr "\"빌어먹을 개새끼! 너를 잡고야 말겠어! 오 죄송합니다, 전하. 전하를 말한건 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Book_Peddler_After/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "bba27d72-a259-4c41-8c41-816269ca8ff4"
msgid ""
"\"Them thieves! Came and stole a few new books from me. Then left a note, of "
"all things — 'Stolen by the brothers and a sister of Zottenropple, best "
"wishes!' The impudence!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 도둑들이! 내게서 새로운 책들을 훔쳐갔어. 그리고는 조틀로플 남매가 훔쳤다라는 쪽지만 남기고 사라졌다고. 뻔뻔한 녀석들이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/LinziQ1_Cart_String
msgctxt "bd8745d8-c79f-4c99-ae39-fb40d890c6a4"
msgid "Cart with the printing press"
msgstr "인쇄기가 있는 카트"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "76d75b94-1da5-411a-ba5f-b25351e1ecf9"
msgid "\"You have ten heartbeats to disappear. Go!\""
msgstr "\"10초 준다. 사라져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c9dd7c45-34da-4535-8c01-d2c6b069b1aa"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've been looking for you. Die, bandits!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너희를 찾고 있었어. 도둑들아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : LinziQ1_BanditFighterRanged
msgctxt "58cae3e3-fc99-4f15-9248-a27ed69d0e95"
msgid ""
"\"How did you fools manage to lose the horses? We supposed to carry these "
"boxes ourselves? What even are these iron things, and why the Hells do we "
"need them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 멍청이들이 어떻게 말들을 잃어버릴 수 있는거지? 상자를 직접 옮겨야 하나? 게다가 이 쇳덩이는 도대체 뭐야? 이게 우리한테 왜 "
"필요한건데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "65f39a33-b8d5-48b9-acaa-c743bdc8c6be"
msgid ""
"\"These 'iron things' will get us rich, blockhead! It's an alchemical "
"transmutator — I've seen them in {g|Ustalav}Ustalav{/g}. We just assemble "
"it, turn it on, and it turns rocks into gold all on its own! Don't just "
"stand there — get in the harness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 쇳덩이가 우리를 부자로 만들어 줄 거야. 멍청아! 그건 연금술사의 변환기야. 나는 {g|Ustalav}우스탈라브{/g}에서 그걸 "
"봤어. 그걸 조립하고 작동하면 바위를 금덩이로 만든다고! 멍청이 서있지 말고 일해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : LinziQ1_BanditFighterRanged
msgctxt "141345ab-f4bc-4951-8bc6-3091b76559b1"
msgid ""
"\"You're sure about this, then? All right, let's see if we can even get this "
"wagon to move...\""
msgstr "\"정말이야? 좋아. 이걸 수레로 옮길 수 있는지 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8c457d31-3cf7-4c91-8cc1-6ceb3e257737"
msgid "\"Oh, uh... Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"어..음..남작님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : LinziQ1_BanditFighterRanged
msgctxt "a4cdb050-6c78-4615-aad6-26ace8204576"
msgid ""
"\"Look, it's that scumbag who took down the Stag Lord! And no army to be "
"seen!\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주를 쓰러뜨린 쓰레기야! 군대도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : LinziQ1_BanditFighterRanged
msgctxt "d729b467-4246-4d47-bdb4-9d5e90e471ff"
msgid ""
"\"This shipment belongs to the baron{mf||ess}?! What did you get us into, "
"you idiot?!\""
msgstr "\"남작님 화물에 손댄거였어?! 어쩔려구 그래. 멍청아?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "e97d0e04-308d-4ffb-88f8-a7a71c98475c"
msgid "\"Run!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "09d56b72-35af-49e1-b350-c5a0b160b11a"
msgid ""
"\"Lucky day! Get {mf|him|her}, everyone! If we take out the baron{mf||ess}, "
"we can be barons ourselves!\""
msgstr "\"운좋은 날이로군! 다들 저{mf|놈을|여자를} 잡아! 영주를 쓰러트리고 우리가 남작이 되는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b8d7f6f7-2b04-46af-8b3b-6f64d79748c8"
msgid ""
"\"That's them!\" {n}Linzi whispers, pointing at the bandits.{/n} \"Caught "
"red-handed! We'll show them what happens when you take someone else's things "
"without — ahem, we'll teach them a lesson!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도적들이야!\" {n}린지가 도적들을 가리키며 속삭입니다.{/n} \"현행범으로 잡았어! 남의 물건을 가져가면 어떻게 되는지. 에헴. "
"본 때를 보여주자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "47acb95f-9f51-4d28-a689-4eb06b615b38"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost opens his mouth, about to say something, but instead just covers "
"his face with his palm and shakes his head sadly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 뭔가 말하려다가 대신 손으로 얼굴을 가리며 머리를 절래절래 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : LinziQ1_BanditFighterRanged
msgctxt "db9b932e-7d50-4958-8778-965cc4e8691f"
msgid "\"Thrash the baron{mf||ess}'s scum!\""
msgstr "\"남작에게 본 때를 보여줘라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5e693d4a-c015-47cf-acbd-c3923b9951ae"
msgid "\"Ha, that's a laugh! Come on, try it! Let's see how you do!\""
msgstr "\"하! 웃기는군! 덤벼! 어떻게 나오나 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "d2bcd160-c339-4c68-863a-b261aafb6075"
msgid "\"Print something Irovetti banned, just to spite him!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티가 금지한 내용을 인쇄하자, 골탕 먹여보자구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "8b969c1f-53b9-48e4-bba4-e8f9577a6cb4"
msgid ""
"\"Choose something beautiful. A book you wouldn't be ashamed to have your "
"teacher read.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 아름다운 내용으로 골라봐. 네 선생님이 읽어도 부끄럽지 않을 책으로 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "4230d5ee-67b4-4561-a38f-15c2e3b1df25"
msgid ""
"\"This machine needs to pay itself off quickly. Just start with cheap "
"fiction — the quality doesn't matter much, as long as they sell well.\""
msgstr "\"이 기계는 빨리 본전을 뽑아야해. 우선 싸구려 소설부터 시작하자. 잘만 팔린다면 내용은 중요치 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "136f4bc6-9220-4ce6-9be4-f37578150c3b"
msgid "\"What would you like to print?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 인쇄하고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3ccc1d9d-2b9e-4784-b1ae-ed2c064fb5cf"
msgid ""
"{n}After inspecting all the boxes in the wagon, Linzi barely restrains "
"herself from kissing the mechanisms inside.{/n} \"The press! Safe and sound —"
" just needs some assembly! Yay!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마차의 상자를 모두 살펴본 린지는 기계에 키스하려는 것을 간신히 참아냅니다.{/n} \"인쇄기가 안전해요! 그냥 조립만 하면 될것 "
"같아요! 야호!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "15e5d35d-59f0-49c2-8f49-53e563ada48b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it. My own publishing house. I have so many ideas — so "
"many plans! I don't know where to begin! What do you think I should print "
"first?\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿을 수 없어요. 내 인쇄소가 생기다니. 정말 많은 계획을 세워놨어요. 어디서부터 시작해야 할지 모르겠어요! 뭘 먼저 인쇄해야 할까요?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c1f15a29-eaea-4bb8-9673-09dd6f9083cd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! Yes! Throwing truth in the faces of tyrants — that's a bard's "
"highest calling! Though I'd certainly throw something heavier in Irovetti's "
"face if I could... But let's start with the truth!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 그래! 폭군의 얼굴에 먹칠을 하는 거야! 음유시인의 사명이니까! 먹칠이 아니라 똥칠이지만... 우선 진실부터 쓸 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b5b23ab4-15f9-4172-94f1-1be75e777b4c"
msgid ""
"\"Well, that's not really what I had in mind, but... You're right. Art is "
"art, but we can't forget the pelf it requires. It's a deal. I'll pay you "
"back for the printing press, and then I'll work toward my higher calling as "
"a bard — and as a book printer!\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 그건 생각하지 않았는데... 하지만 맞아요. 예술도 예술이지만, 우리에겐 금전적인 부분도 중요하죠. 좋아요. 찬성이에요. "
"일단 인쇄기에 대한 돈을 갚은 뒤, 그 다음에 바드로서 그리고 북 프린터로서 더 높은 목표로 나아가겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2ffab20c-7143-4113-92f6-0c2d2656c66b"
msgid ""
"\"Let's get to it! I'll send for horses to get this delivery the rest of the "
"way to the capital.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 시작할까요! 말을 보내 수도로 화물을 마저 옮기겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "dbfc16f3-bef1-4708-a9bd-5820f12c8eec"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi smiles at you warmly.{/n} \"It was Teacher who showed me the beauty "
"hidden in books... I think the best way to repay that kindness would be to "
"do the same for others. Maybe that's really the main calling of a bard.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 당신에게 따뜻하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"책 속에 감춰진 아름다움을 가르쳐 준건 제 선생님이었어요... 그 은혜를 갚는 가장 "
"좋은 방법은 다른 사람에게도 똑같이 해주는 것이겠죠. 어쩌면 그게 바드의 주된 소명이 아닐까 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "648a7819-3301-494a-bf90-404d4bf856be"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know — that's why I asked you! I mean... it's more than just a "
"business decision, right? It's... well... a choice! A first step! It's not "
"like my whole career will depend on one book, but I'll always think back on "
"it. 'Remember when you finally got your own printing press, Linzi? What was "
"your first printing, again?' And I don't want to be ashamed of my answer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 모르겠어요. 그래서 물어본 거예요! 제겐 단순한 돈 문제가 아니니까요. 잘 선택해 주세요! 이게 첫 걸음이라구요! 제 경력이 이 "
"책 한 권에 달려있진 않지만, 오늘을 회상하게 될 거 같아요. '마침내 인쇄기를 손에 넣었을 때 기억나, 린지? 처음 인쇄한 책은 "
"뭐였지?' 나중에 가서 봐도 후회 없는 결정이었으면 좋겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "85815c06-d6cb-4bed-82e7-45ec2716622a"
msgid ""
"\"Such infectious enthusiasm! I think I can already offer you a book or two "
"by the famous Jubilost Narthropple... And a few useful recommendations on "
"organizing book publishing. The second one is free!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 정도의 열정이라니! 우선, 저명한 쥬빌로스트 나트로플이 쓴 책 한 두권을 추천해주지... 그리고 책 출판의 조직화에 관한 유용한 "
"충고도 해줄 수 있어. 두 번째꺼는 무료라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e9cdd3f3-a6a0-4921-8f37-6e335827d3b8"
msgid ""
"\"Print more to make a heavier volume! Then bind it in iron to make throwing "
"it easier!\""
msgstr "\"더 두꺼운 책을 만들자! 쇠로 제본하면 던질 때 손맛이 더 좋을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2eafdd41-960f-4fba-a726-19d6802c7b61"
msgid ""
"\"Are you looking to waste paper? Well, if {Name} lets you, it is your "
"right. Still, you had best print something useful for the citizenry, not "
"just something pleasant to a handful of intellectuals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"종이를 낭비할 생각입니까? 뭐, 허락하는 것은 {Name}의 당연한 권리입니다. 그래도 소수의 지식인들에게만 즐거운 책이 아니라 일반 "
"시민들에게 유용한 책으로 인쇄할 수도 있었을텐데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Press_Bandits_Final/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "436feb99-0285-46c1-838f-599a8d1096e0"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, what's wrong with cheap fiction? Life is serious enough already! When "
"I need to rest, I'd rather read some silly tale about princes and dragons "
"than a treatise on political philosophy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸구려 소설이라니? 인생을 진지하게 살라고! 나라면 쉬는 시간에 정치 철학 책보다는 공주와 드래곤에 관한 쓸데 없는 이야기를 읽을 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "0077a462-f9eb-48ff-873b-1ac7bfc2434e"
msgid ""
"\"Calm down, Linzi. Everything's fine. What is it you want to tell me?\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 린지. 괜찮아. 나에게 하고 싶은 말이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a24a03e5-ca35-49d5-9302-1075847bf6c5"
msgid "\"Did you steal the money?\""
msgstr "\"돈을 훔쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b90f128e-ada6-44cc-a0e6-c99c57108b18"
msgid "[Remain silent]"
msgstr "[침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "71474f24-966f-4ffd-9cec-21a5b77fec67"
msgid "\"Another one of your tricks...\""
msgstr "\"또 다른 속임수인가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8cb8830e-ff31-4e6d-8d8d-fa9a07d77f7a"
msgid ""
"\"All right, you can open your publishing house. But no more surprises.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 출판사를 열어도 좋아. 하지만 더 이상 비밀은 없는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "7883cd72-734f-401e-b89c-1a0aef42ef83"
msgid "\"Great idea! Good for you, Linzi!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이야! 잘됐네. 린지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "4eb554d3-f593-41a1-8a59-50f81639a529"
msgid ""
"\"All right, let's go find your press. It's already been paid for, after all."
"\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 가서 인쇄기를 찾아보자. 이왕 구매한거니 말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "86125798-d1e0-4d0b-834b-9dfeee1eb64e"
msgid ""
"\"What? Not a chance. You can go out and salvage it if you wish, but I have "
"more important matters to attend to.\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 말도 안돼. 원한다면 네가 직접 찾아봐. 난 더 중요한 일이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "62ca3bcc-c217-4c04-a30d-4f17c7e39b0d"
msgid "\"I said no.\""
msgstr "\"안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "4f22bb53-b258-4857-a322-00c626875e52"
msgid "\"Don't we have a printing house? Why would we need a second press?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 인쇄소가 있지 않아? 왜 하나 더 필요해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "fea36f19-8a7a-450d-ad89-df80b819b1ab"
msgid ""
"\"You dipped into the treasury?! Anyone else would already be behind bars "
"for this! You'll return all the money — I don't care where you get it from — "
"and never mention the publishing house again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"국고를 뒤졌다고?! 다른 사람들이라면 이미 이 일로 감옥에 갇혔을 거야! 돈을 전부 되돌려 놔. 어디서 구하든 상관없으니까. 그리고 "
"다신 인쇄소 얘기는 꺼내지도 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "abf5920a-118e-40c2-afcc-8ebba539fd55"
msgid ""
"[Sigh deeply] \"Fine, open your own publishing house. But if you pull any "
"more tricks like this...\""
msgstr "[깊은 한숨을 쉽니다] \"좋아. 인쇄소를 열어도 돼. 하지만 이런 장난질을 다시 했다가는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "a7fd1671-7ed0-47bc-875d-2ce06891e8e2"
msgid ""
"\"Don't give me that look — I trusted you, and you're wasting my treasury on "
"toys!\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 보지 말라고. 너를 믿었는데 내 돈을 그런 장난감에나 쓰고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "31a6becd-a793-4d2a-8085-7d777f9bd59e"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi shuffles around nervously, fidgeting with a quill in her hands. She "
"turns bright red.{/n} \"Well... About the embezzlement... I mean... Um...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 긴장하여 안절부절 못하며 손에 든 깃펜을 만지작 거립니다. 그녀는 얼굴이 붉어졌습니다.{/n} \"음... 돈이 어떻게 "
"되었냐면... 음...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "581a310f-ad37-473d-b96a-6f76bef0db50"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi takes a deep breath.{/n} \"Well... It was me. But I can explain!\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"음... 그건 나였어요. 하지만 설명할 수 있다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e7264219-b0df-4aea-a8cf-d361414c56b5"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't steal it! I didn't take a single coin for myself! I... Please, "
"let me explain!\""
msgstr "\"내가 훔치지 않았어요! 한푼도! 내가... 다 해명할게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3b3692b6-b3ab-4fd7-8ab7-d47212502c9d"
msgid ""
"\"Don't look at me like that — I feel like a fish out of water! I... well... "
"it was me. I took the money from the treasury. Don't be mad! I can explain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 보지 말아요. 물 밖에 나온 물고기가 된 기분이니까! 그게... 범인은 나에요. 내가 돈을 가져갔어요. 화내지마세요! 해명할 "
"수 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7f2207d8-11a1-456d-846d-e034ed301775"
msgid ""
"\"You see, I've... always dreamed of owning my own printing house. So I "
"could print whatever books I want! And then I found out there was a printing "
"press being sold for cheap in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, and, well... I just "
"couldn't resist!\""
msgstr ""
"\"있잖아요. 전... 항상 나만의 인쇄소를 갖는게 꿈이었어요. 그래서 원하는 어떤 책이든 인쇄할 수 있게요! 그런데 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 인쇄기를 싸게 판다길래... 도저히 참을 수가 없었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5f97e554-56f6-47dc-9257-9ca2b20bf61c"
msgid "\"Thank you! You have my word — it won't happen again!\""
msgstr "\"고마워요! 약속할께요. 다신 이런 일 없을꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ea353a70-8776-49ef-8b78-893f34d72e3b"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi lowers her head and stares at her feet.{/n} \"I am SO sorry. You "
"have my word — it won't happen again!\""
msgstr "{n}린지가 머리를 숙이고 자기 발을 보고 있습니다.{/n} \"정말 미안해요. 약속할게요. 다시는 이런 일은 없을꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e9b7185f-e2eb-46a3-9dd7-3fbd49da7cd9"
msgid ""
"\"Really?! Whew! I feel like a weight's been lifted off my shoulders. I was "
"so afraid you'd be mad... Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"정말이요?! 휴! 한짐 덜은 기분이에요. 화났을까봐 겁났었거든요... 고마워요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8bdc40c8-397c-459d-aa8d-4cc2d64d1bbe"
msgid ""
"\"There is... one other problem, though. The press should have been "
"delivered by now, but it hasn't shown up. I'm afraid that, with our roads "
"and the seeming menagerie that roams them, it might end up vanishing into "
"thin air. Can we maybe go check on it, see if anything's happened? It was "
"supposed to be coming across the old road through the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"근데 다른 문제가 하나 있어요. 인쇄기가 지금쯤 배달됐어야 하는데 아직도 안왔어요. 어쩌면 길가의 동물들 때문에 혹시 잃어버린건 "
"아닐까 걱정돼요. 우리가 무슨 일 있는지 가서 확인해봐도 될까요? 원래 {g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}를 거쳐 오래된 길을 "
"건너오기로 되어있었거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f154b6b5-27e0-4eb2-b490-c52ac6424102"
msgid "\"Yes! Just don't leave without me!\""
msgstr "\"좋아요! 날 두고 가면 안돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "69ab42f0-f4bc-41a5-b6ad-8a3c9cd9dd8a"
msgid "{n}Linzi gazes at you with puppy eyes.{/n} \"Please...\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 강아지 같은 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"제발...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "82d53840-0a92-4d22-a1fa-94c7005d52b0"
msgid ""
"\"All right... No means no. I'm sorry for distracting you from your "
"important business.\" {n}Linzi leaves the tavern, shoulders slumped and eyes "
"downcast.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"알았어요... 아닌 건 아닌거죠. 중요한 일 많은데 방해해서 미안해요.\" {n}린지는 어깨를 축 늘어뜨리고 풀죽은 눈빛으로 술집을 "
"떠났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e442a763-d3f1-4bf0-8868-32adcc7a960d"
msgid ""
"\"It's always busy, and I don't even know with what! I abandoned any hope of "
"printing so much as a brochure there, let alone an actual book. Don't worry, "
"though — the printing house can definitely fit two presses!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거긴 항상 바쁘기만하고 뭘하는 건지도 모르겠어요. 거기서 제대로 된 책은 커녕 얇은 책자라도 인쇄할 수 있다는 희망은 이미 "
"버렸다구요. 하지만 걱정마세요. 인쇄소에는 분명 인쇄기 두개는 놓을 수 있으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1726ef4a-5c34-468b-b5a2-00a1af388642"
msgid "{n}Linzi gazes at you, silently begging with her eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}린지는 애원하는 눈빛으로 당신을 조용히 바라보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q1_Easier_to_Ask_Forgiveness/Tavern_Start/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ae250de8-e8f6-42df-916c-d61fe8406ca0"
msgid "\"I am SO sorry... I... I'll return the money. You have my word.\""
msgstr "\"정말 미안해요... 돈은 되돌려 놓을게요. 약속할께요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/In_Capital/Bully_1_String
msgctxt "77b4a535-17ee-4d07-9a1f-b105d45148aa"
msgid "\"Teacher, I wrote something... Please listen!\""
msgstr "\"선생님. 제가 적은 게 있는데... 부디 들어주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/In_Capital/Bully_2_String
msgctxt "2286ff99-9642-455e-bf6b-e0a56ec31084"
msgid "\"It's a miracle we escaped Pitax with our lives!\""
msgstr "\"목이 붙어있는 채로 피탁스를 빠져나온 건 기적이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/In_Capital/Bully_3_String
msgctxt "9f4d85ff-b67a-4efb-8ef6-e2ba46a6b9e1"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti scared off all the best teachers. He's probably blaming everyone "
"but himself, of course.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티는 최고의 선생을 두려워했어. 그건 자기 탓이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/In_Capital/Eobald_1_String
msgctxt "ef05a5bb-b0c7-4a8c-9dd6-a8729f306fd9"
msgid "\"What a wonderful city. Even the air is purer than in Pitax!\""
msgstr "\"정말 멋진 도시야. 공기조차도 피탁스보다 더 깨끗해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/In_Capital/Eobald_2_String
msgctxt "1c8ea090-a7b9-4a2a-b4d7-f4bb5b83cdeb"
msgid "\"I believe I have an idea for the next chapter...\""
msgstr "\"나는 다음 장의 아이디어가 떠오를 거라고 믿어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/In_Capital/Eobald_3_String
msgctxt "e08a06b1-214a-4b1b-883d-94c94664c28d"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't sleep last night — I kept thinking about Irovetti. I hope that "
"villain doesn't send assassin's after us!\""
msgstr "\"지난밤에 잠을 잘 수가 없었어. 이로베티를 생각하느라. 그 악당이 암살자를 보내지 않았기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Bard_1_String
msgctxt "a1dfc03e-bf09-422f-a11e-d24477752258"
msgid "\"I can't...\""
msgstr "\"나는 할 수 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Bard_2_String
msgctxt "14973571-19f7-479e-8f5d-8ab948475e66"
msgid "\"I'm exhausted!\""
msgstr "\"난 지쳤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Bard_3_String
msgctxt "0ad4aa04-f834-4285-9d63-e2e4dd75bfbc"
msgid "\"Please, let us rest!\""
msgstr "\"제발. 우리를 쉬게 해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Barks/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Mite_1_String
msgctxt "187f7780-5765-4256-ae0a-24930a3ec2d8"
msgid "\"Play! Play muzak! Or pedicents be yum-yum!\""
msgstr "\"연주해! 아니면 지네를 먹일 줄 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "98ab28da-8f43-4d1f-99ed-e2f8c7af6d55"
msgid "\"Professor Eobald, I presume?\""
msgstr "\"교수 이오발드 맞으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0c25e59a-fbf5-465d-96a6-dda4554467da"
msgid "\"Hey, mite! Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"오! 너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "72d015aa-6e81-4415-a31f-e0e718edd6e7"
msgid "\"Do you know Queen Bdaah?\""
msgstr "\"여왕 브다를 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "804cfacd-2008-49d8-86a5-212025238592"
msgid "\"What are you doing to these musicians?\""
msgstr "\"이 연주자들과 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "aed59c2f-5b8b-4dc3-9935-9e08bb35d221"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you aware that centipedes get indigestion from music? Diarrhea from "
"bards, too.\""
msgstr "\"음악할 때 지네가 있으면 얼마나 거북한지 알아? 설사를 해도 고통스러운데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "27f8ff3b-78be-454d-8585-6804422e1f94"
msgid ""
"[Offer 10 rations] \"Look how skinny those bards are. If you let them go, "
"I'll give you a lot of good food instead.\""
msgstr "[주머니 10개를 줍니다] \"저 음유시인들이 얼마나 말랐는지 봐. 그들을 보내주면 음식을 더 줄 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "60a41d66-991e-4e7e-812d-325f07fe49d9"
msgid "\"Get out of here before I cut your centipedes to pieces!\""
msgstr "\"지네를 조각내기 전에 여기서 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "6dbac7df-dd39-448d-aeaa-230b882d7f6a"
msgid "[Attack] \"Hold on, bards, we'll save you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"기다려. 우리가 너를 구할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "43382832-eebe-4840-ba03-79b2e159221f"
msgid "\"Whose bodies are these?\""
msgstr "\"이 시체가 누구의 것들이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "dac21bbe-bf2a-42c2-88ab-b069990bac5c"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of young boys and girls play their lutes as a horde of centipedes "
"surround them, swaying their horns and hissing to the tune. A fat mite "
"stands nearby, listening to the strange concert with a blissful smile.{/n} "
"\"Muzak. Fine! Play, play!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어린 아이들이 악기를 연주하는데 지네무리가 그들 주위에 모여있습니다. 뚱뚱한 마이트가 그 주위에서 행복한 표정으로 연주를 듣고 "
"있습니다.{/n} \"좋은 음악이야! 아주 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "fc612526-dc63-419d-a984-2c3781c1af9d"
msgid ""
"\"Have mercy on them! Look at their fingers — they're bleeding!\" {n}An old, "
"gray-haired man begs the mite from among the musicians.{/n}"
msgstr "\"자비를 베풀라고. 그들의 손가락을 봐. 피를 흘리고 있어.\" {n}나이든 회색 머리의 남자가 마이트에게 애걸합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "1248431d-b96c-4ac5-9f12-c65b38563ce7"
msgid ""
"\"Who can't play can be food sweet pedicents! No want be food? Keep play!\""
msgstr "\"연주를 못하는 녀석은 지네밥이 될 줄 알아! 먹기가 되기 싫으면 연주해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "a8ceed45-636a-4bf2-af2b-d5d2ff5ba418"
msgid ""
"\"I Aesh, free shepherd! Walk around, shepherd herd... Best pedicents on all "
"woods, ask anyone!\""
msgstr "\"나 애쉬는 자유로운 지네치기다! 주위를 돌아다니며 셰퍼드를 끌고 다녀... 모든 숲에서 최고의 지네가 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "960cbab7-634e-43a4-ad48-b4464fadb422"
msgid "\"Don't know no queen! Aesh not bow to kings! Walk where want, is so!\""
msgstr "\"왕이고 자시고! 절은 안해! 저리 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "ecc65376-b3a6-4609-a0e3-5e61ab5c2434"
msgid ""
"\"Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}? Linzi? Praise {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}"
"! I beg you, save us from this... music connoisseur!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}? 린지? {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}께서 도우시다니! 부탁할게. 저... 음악가에게서 우리를 "
"구해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "4f37102f-4699-49f5-9cba-94ec634fecf6"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to muzak. Good muzak! I good, and pedicents good before meal!\""
msgstr "\"노래를 들어. 좋은 노래야! 식사 하기 전에 지네가 딱이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "781305c0-eb26-472c-9c56-ab585a1f5146"
msgid "\"No, no! Off, off! Back, sweeties! No listen them no-goods! Go, go!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 안돼! 떨어져! 떨어져! 그들 말을 듣지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "e87698a6-8504-45b7-bf35-16757ff3c1e9"
msgid "\"Naaah. Lie. Muzak good. Bards tasty. You lie!\""
msgstr "\"하. 거짓말. 음악을 들을 거야. 음유시인은 맛있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "3e1ce213-21d8-49d8-8f06-45edc785ec9e"
msgid "\"Yes, bags of bones, yes. Deal! Go, sweeties! Go honeys! Time eat!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 뼈다귀를 줄게. 애들아. 먹을 시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "3f8cb370-5a8e-49b5-8801-7b5f2ec9c722"
msgid ""
"\"No, skinny fine — meat fresh, warm!\" {n}The mite licks his lips as he "
"sizes you up.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아니. 말라도 좋아. 고기는 신선하고 따뜻해!\" {n}마이트가 입술을 핥고 당신의 크기를 가늠합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "577b6fcd-ab7c-459f-bcfd-09013fd7ac4d"
msgid ""
"{n}The mite leads the centipedes away, tenderly patting them on their backs "
"as they go.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}마이트는 지네의 등을 토닥이며 멀리 보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "869c5515-8d64-4e99-b6e5-51cf684594b6"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hey! Why cut? Why so angry? Enough! Go, sweeties! Go, honeys! Nobody "
"here like us!\""
msgstr "\"왜 자르는 거야! 왜 화내는 거지? 그만! 아가들아. 가자! 우리를 좋아하는 자는 아무도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "66de6bd1-4338-48ad-8f05-18eacea264e2"
msgid "\"You no like beasties? Angry you! I feed you pedicents — learn you!\""
msgstr "\"너는 짐승 싫어해? 너 싫어! 지네 먹이로 줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : C31-LinziQ2_Mite
msgctxt "0b3bfa5e-c6b0-4720-9cf7-21bc14492c6f"
msgid ""
"\"Why know? Some bandits! First chase muzishuns with knives, then go at "
"pedicents... Sure, we not refuse free food! Right, sweeties? Riiight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 알아? 도둑들! 칼을 들고 연주자를 쫓아가더니 이제 지네에게 간다. 공짜 음식은 거절 안해! 그렇지. 아가들아? 응!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2eef4349-5d67-4ad3-b5b6-8ffbdf266370"
msgid "\"More monsters. Didn't get them all.\""
msgstr "\"더 많은 괴물들이 있어. 모두 잡지는 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "80a2040f-9a96-4c82-bc8a-a322c3ab94b2"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia giggles and covers her mouth with her hand.{/n} \"Oh... That's "
"embarrassing! Of course, we have to help these poor fellows! But this "
"concert... Ha ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 깔깔거리며 손으로 입을 가립니다.{/n} \"오... 당황스럽네! 불쌍한 친구들은 도와야 해! 하지만 이 연주회는... "
"하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d866da75-1026-4aa1-b314-430f436c2ac4"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand why you like talking to all these forest creeps so "
"much. Let's just finish this stinking wretch and her insects and get out of "
"here.\""
msgstr "\"왜 이런 숲속의 괴물들에게 말을 거는지 모르겠네. 이 악취나는 쓰레기를 처리하고 벌레를 몰아내자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3b86205c-a3a5-4910-97ce-fc23d58dd9ae"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone is proud of what they have. A king, his crown; a merchant, their "
"gold; a mite, their insects. Even a dirty kobold in a gutter takes pride in "
"the dead rat he holds in his teeth... And truly, is there any essential "
"difference between them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두가 자기가 가진 것을 사랑해. 왕은 왕관을 상인은 금을 그리고 마이트는 벌레를 말이야. 더러운 코볼트라도 자기 이빨에 낀 쥐고기는 "
"좋아하지... 그것들이 다를지라도 좋아함에는 변함이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Needs_Saving/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d15019b2-cc2a-4bfb-a393-5289bbd22567"
msgid ""
"{n}The mite falls silent at the sound of a painful moan. Nok-Nok, "
"unsuccessfully trying to cover his big ears, seems to be convulsing from the "
"beautiful melodies.{/n} \"Can't… bear it… die… soon… \""
msgstr ""
"{n}마이트는 고통스러운 신음 소리에 침묵합니다. 녹-녹은 아름다운 멜로디를 듣자 경련이 나서 자신의 커다란 귀를 덮으려 합니다.{/n} "
"\"못 견딜... 죽는다... 나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5408c469-7771-4b8f-9371-becab7818c46"
msgid "\"Professor Eobald, is this true?\""
msgstr "\"이오발드 교수님 그게 맞습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "81b91b43-236a-4226-870c-e753469bfae1"
msgid "\"What do you have to say for yourself, Alondi?\""
msgstr "\"할 말이있어? 알론디?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a837f005-b75d-4e60-9faf-d51adaca5159"
msgid "\"What do you want to do with him, Linzi?\""
msgstr "\"린지. 그와 무엇을 하고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7b1be5f7-e2fd-4a29-9e01-662bfc0eb0b3"
msgid "Advised Linzi to forgive Alondi the bard."
msgstr "린지에게 알론디를 용서하라고 충고했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "c7739bc5-5fc0-4fc7-a15a-6b64d9595902"
msgid "\"Forgive him. Give him the chance to atone for his deeds.\""
msgstr "\"그를 용서해. 자기가 한 일을 속죄하게 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3bf6f7a0-66fd-411d-872a-58dc8f7d389b"
msgid "Advised Linzi against forgiving Alondi the bard."
msgstr "린지에게 알론디를 용서하지 말라고 충고했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "5d713383-7d7b-46cd-af9b-083810b45d87"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to forgive him. It doesn't matter how wonderful his poetry "
"is, I don't need people like him in my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}.\""
msgstr "\"용서할 필요는 없어. 그의 시가 좋건 나쁘건 간에 나는 저런 녀석은 필요 없다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "463fd7cb-0465-4c03-b1d7-e71e53b6998c"
msgid "Tried to kill Alondi the bard for bullying Linzi."
msgstr "린지를 괴롭히는 알론디를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "7469c2d9-dfd2-45e4-94be-5adba2fc5c32"
msgid ""
"[Attack Alondi] \"Did you have fun bullying Linzi? It's my turn to have some "
"fun now!\""
msgstr "[알론디를 공격합니다] \"린지를 괴롭히는 게 재미있어? 나도 재미 좀 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c26bf259-c342-4fce-b3c2-2df0e417ed5f"
msgid "Left it up to Linzi to decide the fate of Alondi the bard."
msgstr "린지에게 알론디의 운명을 결정하도록 맡깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "712d472c-c7be-4d40-a691-6f86bf303c5c"
msgid "\"It's your decision, Linzi.\""
msgstr "\"네가 결정해. 린지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "98583596-3697-4e5f-8139-8cb59b6437d7"
msgid ""
"\"Look who's here! Linzi! And is this {mf|His|Her} "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}? Praise all the good gods — you made it "
"just in time! A bit longer, and we'd have been done for!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 누구야! 린지! 그리고 이 {mf|남성|여성}분이 {mf|영주님이|영주님이|전하|전하}신가? 모든 선한 신들께 경배를, 제 "
"시간에 도착하셨군요! 조금만 늦었다면 죽었을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Alondi
msgctxt "dc6f7a4d-804c-4629-ab4d-a6744acd2164"
msgid ""
"\"Hail, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! Now we all-\" {n}Alondi stops when "
"he sees Linzi's piercing glare.{/n} \"Is... is something wrong?\""
msgstr "\"만세! 잘 됐네...\" {n}알론디는 린지의 날카로운 눈빛을 보고 말을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"잘... 잘 안됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "053bcdb6-8578-42dc-a759-568bf679e045"
msgid ""
"\"You don't even remember, do you? Of course you don't. But I'll never "
"forget — you and your friends poisoned the years I spent at the {g|Academy "
"of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}! Hiding my things, tearing my books, spilling ink "
"on me, dunking me in the fountain... And now you have the nerve to come "
"here? Maybe you want a job at the publishing house, too?\""
msgstr ""
"\"기억나지 않아? 나는 절대 잊지 못해. 너와 네 친구들이 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 "
"나를 괴롭혔잖아! 내 물건을 숨기고 책을 찢고 내 머리 위에 잉크를 붓고 샘에 빠뜨리고... 이제는 여기에 오기까지 해? 인쇄소에서 일을 "
"하려고 왔나 보지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "f43e5ad2-855c-43f9-8af8-2a21ab0ce3ae"
msgid ""
"\"I... Of course, I would never dare accuse our dear Linzi of lying, but I "
"know nothing of these accusations. Alondi has always put his best foot "
"forward with me. He's a wonderful poet and musician, and he's always been "
"polite... If not for him risking his life to get us to the capital, we'd all "
"be dead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는... 물론, 감히 우리 친애하는 린지가 거짓말 하고 있다고는 말하지 못하겠지만, 저는 이 고발에 대해 아무것도 아는 바가 "
"없습니다. 알론디는 제게 항상 최선을 다했습니다. 그는 훌륭한 시인이자 음악가이고, 항상 공손했지요... 그가 목숨을 걸고 우리를 수도로 "
"데리고 오지 않았다면, 우린 모두 죽었을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "d8d07b1a-e207-4c42-85f8-ea65408772d3"
msgid ""
"\"Alondi, did you really treat a peer this way? For shame. I thought better "
"of you!\""
msgstr "\"알론디, 정말 학우를 그런식으로 대했나? 이리 부끄러울 데가. 자네가 그런 사람인줄 몰랐네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Alondi
msgctxt "1d1935cf-1e22-4717-aeb8-5e2a8019b52a"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to say? We were students — sometimes we made jokes, pulled "
"pranks. Sometimes they were rude and stupid. I'm sorry, Linzi. I'm ashamed "
"of my behavior — I never should have done those things to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 할 말이 있겠어? 우리는 학생이었어. 가끔 농담도 하고, 장난도 치고. 가끔 무례하고 멍청하기도 했지. 미안해, 린지. 내 "
"행동이 부끄러워. 너한텐 정말 몹쓸 짓을 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "272b0cd5-c83a-4bde-ab68-feb42e18cbb0"
msgid ""
"\"You can shove your apologies all the way...\" {n}You hear tears in Linzi's "
"voice.{/n}"
msgstr "\"어디 한번 계속 사과해 보시지...\" {n}린지 목소리에서 울먹임이 느껴집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "604aaa24-9f33-4d78-ba1e-174fb0d1b0e6"
msgid ""
"\"Please, Linzi... We are at your mercy. Will you truly stoop to revenge? Is "
"this what you took from my lessons?\""
msgstr "\"이보게, 린지... 우리의 운명이 자네 손에 달려있네. 정녕 복수를 택할 생각인가? 내가 자네를 그렇게 가르쳤던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1b990d1e-d25d-463c-a48e-4921e2c9bc61"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know! I'm sorry, Teacher, but I can't bear to look at him. Let him "
"go wherever he wants — {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g}, or "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} for all I care. I'll even give him money for travel, "
"just so I don't have to see his face!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어요! 미안해요. 스승님, 하지만 더 이상 그를 보고 있기가 힘드네요. 아무래도 좋으니까 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}든 "
"{g|Mivon}미본{/g}이든 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}이든 어디든 가고 싶은 데로 가버리라고 하세요. 여비도 챙겨 줄테니, "
"그냥 내 눈 앞에서 사라져버리게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "bfccdb97-2c30-41a5-b642-e64cf890d032"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi...\" {n}Eobald clasps his hands before him.{/n} \"I understand that "
"you're hurt. And I'm at fault, too. If the other teachers and I had paid as "
"much attention to the students' behavior as we did to their grades...\" {n}"
"Eobald closes his eyes and takes a deep breath.{/n} \"I cannot change the "
"past, but please find it in your heart to forgive Alondi. He's an "
"exceptional poet — allow him to atone for his behavior, bring a little "
"kindness and light to your {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지...\" {n}이오발드는 그의 앞에서 깍지를 낍니다.{/n} \"상처 받은 건 이해하네. 내 잘못도 있어. 선생이라면 학생들의 "
"점수 뿐만 아니라 행실까지 살폈어야 했는데...\" {n}이오발드는 눈을 감고 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"과거를 바꿀 수는 없지만, "
"부디 알론디를 용서할 수 있도록 마음을 써주시게나. 그는 뛰어난 시인이야. 자신의 행동을 속죄할 기회를 주고, 자네의 "
"{mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}에 작은 친절과 빛을 가져다 주게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a7495557-799b-4080-b225-96150337e72d"
msgid ""
"\"I... Teacher, I don't know.\" {n}Linzi looks back at you.{/n} \"What "
"should I do? Maybe I should forgive him? Let him write those brilliant "
"verses of his... The scumbag!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는... 스승님. 모르겠어요.\" {n}린지가 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"제가 어떻게 해야 하죠? 그를 용서해야 할까요? 저... "
"쓰레기가 찬란한 시구를 쓰게 내버려 둬야 할까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "19aea13b-499a-4af6-95db-5eea94623591"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! No! Don't!\" {n}Linzi grabs your hand. Alondi, face pale from "
"terror, runs away as fast as he can.{/n}"
msgstr "\"기다려! 안돼! 하지 마!\" {n}린지가 당신의 손을 잡습니다. 공포에 질린 알론디는 최대한 빨리 달아났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ed9d1c7f-2e95-4d4b-92d7-5c8037772106"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi glares at Alondi for a long while, then sighs and looks away.{/n} "
"\"Fine. Stay. But you'd better write the best poetry in the world! Got it? "
"I'll be checking!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 알론디를 한참동안 쳐다보고는 한숨을 쉬고 먼 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"좋아. 머물러. 하지만 세상에서 최고의 시를 쓰는게 "
"좋을 거야! 알았어? 내가 확인할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0785917e-363d-4b43-9a6f-803170f0272b"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi points toward the woods.{/n} \"Get lost. I don't care about your "
"poetry — I can't forget how you tore up mine.\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 숲을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"꺼져. 네 시는 신경 안써. 네가 내 시를 찢은 기억을 잊을 수 없다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Alondi
msgctxt "5f46157c-f15f-4a42-97c0-876570aaa383"
msgid "\"I promise!\""
msgstr "\"약속할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Alondi
msgctxt "582bf270-257c-4c9c-b7f0-c88b45f33ec1"
msgid "{n}Alondi lowers his head.{/n} \"As you say. But I truly am sorry.\""
msgstr "{n}알론디가 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"알겠어. 하지만 정말 미안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "c9590d5b-82d3-4265-95b1-ab3dd740bad6"
msgid ""
"{n}Everyone is silent for a while as they look at each other awkwardly. "
"Eobald is the first to break the silence.{/n} \"I... see Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} prefers a... resolute manner of "
"administration!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}모두가 서로를 어색하게 보면서 잠시 침묵합니다. 이오발드는 침묵을 처음으로 깨뜨립니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}"
"께서는 그... 단호한 행정방식을 선호하시는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "bfbbf2a6-bb78-403a-842e-a3b562587b98"
msgid "\"Thank you. I swear, you won't regret it.\""
msgstr "\"고맙네. 후회하지 않을 걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "9c3e9c4e-e4ed-4cf2-a606-9989ac7779cd"
msgid ""
"\"Well, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, Linzi... You are well "
"within your rights.\""
msgstr "\"예, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 린지... 결정은 자네의 몫이라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "17c1c730-c133-41e4-8ff1-651264c75b1e"
msgid ""
"\"Teacher... I'm so glad to see you! I can't believe that talentless hack "
"Irovetti kicked you out of the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}. I wish "
"everyone could see what a 'philanthropist and patron of the arts' he really "
"is! His tricks could make up a whole book!\""
msgstr ""
"\"스승님... 만나서 너무 반가워요! 이로베티 그 재능 없는 자식이 스승님을 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 "
"아카데미{/g}에서 쫓아냈다는 것을 믿을 수가 없네요. 소위 '예술의 자선가이자 후원자'라는 작자의 실체를 모두가 알아야 하는데! 그 "
"자식의 수작질만 모아도 책 한권을 쓰겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "efd9b9c4-10e6-44f4-9a76-0de9425770a7"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Linzi, that's not a bad idea! I know many... details of just how "
"much harm the king brought upon his own {g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g}"
". If you find yourself with time between adventures, I would be happy to sit "
"down and write such a book with you! All the more so now that you have your "
"own printing house to print it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지. 그거 참 괜찮은 생각이다! 나는 이로베티가 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 얼마나 "
"괴롭혔는지 알고 있지. 네가 모험 중에 시간을 낼 수 있다면, 나는 기꺼이 너와 마주 앉아 책을 쓰고 싶구나! 게다가 너는 그 책을 "
"찍어낼 인쇄소도 갖고 있지 않느냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "656d06aa-6a4e-4c97-aaa3-86d434616bad"
msgid ""
"\"Seriously? You... you want to work on a book with me? Of course I'll find "
"the time! Let's set off for the capital as soon as possible — I can't wait "
"to get started!\""
msgstr "\"정말이요? 저와 책을 쓰고 싶다고요? 시간이야 내면 되죠! 일분 일초라도 빨리 수도로 가죠! 정말 기다릴 수가 없네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f989dc31-7ffb-48e7-b0f5-599a8a16256d"
msgid ""
"\"Let's get back to the capital. I can't wait to start working on the book, "
"Teacher!\""
msgstr "\"수도로 돌아가요. 한시라도 빨리 책을 쓰고 싶네요, 스승님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "0f36c651-d1c2-4329-a138-59709458f2a0"
msgid ""
"\"I must say, your books have been very successful! And starting your own "
"publishing house with the printing of a book {d|Linzi Forbidden}banned{/d} "
"by Irovetti's personal order — well, that was a bold move. I'm so proud of "
"you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네의 책은 그야말로 아주 대단한 성공을 거두고 있어! 그리고 자네의 출판사에서 이로베티가 {d|Linzi Forbidden}금서로 "
"지정한{/d} 책을 출판하기 시작한 건, 정말 용감한 행동이구만. 자네가 무척 자랑스럽네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "cc16eb80-3b02-4162-b74a-4e7aedf45b1c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, and please allow me to congratulate you, albeit late, for the opening "
"of your own publishing house. I had the pleasure of reading those of your "
"books that managed to reach {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and I must say, you "
"certainly studied well — your choice of authors and books for publication "
"suggests a {d|Linzi Beauty}sophisticated taste{/d} in literature!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 참, 늦어서 미안하네만 자네가 출판사를 차린 것을 축하해도 되겠나? 책이 아주 재밌더군. {g|Pitax}피탁스{/g}에도 "
"어찌어찌 자네 책이 들어와서 말이지. 자네, 정말 배움이 깊어졌구만. 자네가 출판한 책과 그 저자들을 보니 세련된 문학적 향취가 "
"느껴지던데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "e46b9457-fa34-47fa-a21d-a4f8dead2a6c"
msgid ""
"\"Not to change the subject, but I've looked through some of the books "
"you've {d|Linzi Pulp Fiction}printed{/d}. I admit the books weren't quite to "
"my taste, but the students seem to love them. I'm glad you're finally "
"realizing your dream of running your own publishing house!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러고 보니, 자네가 찍은 책 몇권을 {d|Linzi Pulp Fiction} 훑어봤네만{/d} 솔직히 내 취향은 아니더군. 그래도 "
"학생들은 아주 좋아한다네. 자네가 마침내 자기 인쇄소를 꾸리겠다는 꿈을 이루니 나도 기쁘구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0fd84282-b74d-4c11-a511-da0b50903678"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, pipsqueak... Advice is usually cheap, but this one's paid for off "
"the hide of my back. Don't forgive him — people don't change. He was shit, "
"and he'll stay shit, whether you give him one chance or a hundred!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어이, 애송이... 충고라는게 보통 쓰잘데 없지만, 이건 내가 뒤통수를 맞아가며 배운 거니까 잘 들어. 용서해주지 마. 사람은 변하지 "
"않아. 얘는 쓰레기고, 앞으로도 쓰레기야. 네가 기회를 한 번 주든 백번 주든 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q2_The_Turncoats/Teacher_Saved/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4416895f-2622-4d08-ac1a-b05c3564d78c"
msgid ""
"\"Does Shelyn herself not teach that one should not deny mercy to those who "
"ask for it?\""
msgstr "\"셸린께서는 자비를 구하는 자를 용서하라고 가르치시지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Books/Linzi_book_truth-title_String
msgctxt "69c2c0e8-05da-4d24-be42-f4309f79bb1a"
msgid "\"The Academy of Infamy\""
msgstr "\"악명 높은 아카데미\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Books/Linzi_book_truth_String
msgctxt "a29126d1-8e18-42c5-99bc-3c49b19ad4b7"
msgid ""
"By Linzi and Eobald the Insightful\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"...without making excuses, I, Eobald the Insightful, must attest that "
"tragedies like the one I let happen are not a rarity at the Academy of Grand "
"Arts. The happiness of the students — even their very lives — could be "
"considered a fertilizer of sorts for the blossoming vanity of their mentors, "
"who in their turn must lick Irovetti's boots, lest they be trampled beneath "
"them. These are just a few of the more egregious cases I witnessed (and "
"became a silent accessory to) in my time...\""
msgstr ""
"린지와 현자 Eobald\n"
"Shrike Hills 출판\n"
"\"...변명하지 않고 나 이오발드는 그런 비극이 아카데미에서는 흔한 일이 아니라고 말하고 싶다. 학생의 행복과 삶은 가끔 정신적 "
"지주들의 허영의 밑거름이 되기도 하는데 그 멘토들은 이로베티의 뒤꽁무니나 따라다니면서 자기만 생각한다. 이보다 더 심한 경우도 있다..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Books/Linzi_book_whitewashed-title_String
msgctxt "2ebdf35b-372d-4119-9c7d-bd12b3fd6295"
msgid "\"The Great Patron\""
msgstr "\"위대한 후원자\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Books/Linzi_book_whitewashed_String
msgctxt "9143f031-70c2-4b09-9239-69e187764eed"
msgid ""
"By Linzi and Eobald the Insightful\n"
"Shrike Hills Publishing\n"
"\"...teachers lecture their students on harmony and beauty, all the while "
"clueless to the ugliness their students face outside the classroom. But "
"alas, above poems and murals, Irovetti places greater value on the beauty of "
"the nude form. Instead of practicing the lute and composing poetry, the "
"students are forced to practice avoiding the unsolicited attention of their "
"patron. Those who dare reject him risk expulsion — or worse. Those few who "
"know the vile truth remain silent, for the highest law in Pitax is little "
"more than the capricious will of a crowned bandit...\""
msgstr ""
"린지와 현자 Eobald\n"
"Shrike Hills 출판\n"
"\"... 선생은 학생들에게 조화와 아름다움을 가르치지만 학생들은 정작 교실 밖에서는 추악함을 마주한다. 시와 벽화는 무시하고 이로베티는 "
"누드 작품에만 집착한다. 시를 쓰고 악기를 연주하는 대신 학생들은 후원자의 관심을 피하도록 강요당한다. 그에 맞서는 자들은 추방을 "
"당하거나 더 큰 벌을 받기도 한다. 추악한 진실이 밝혀지지 않는 것을 아는 소수의 사람들은 그자가 왕관을 쓴 도적이나 다름 없음을 "
"안다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "91854a3b-c926-413e-8ffd-2337e71cb624"
msgid ""
"\"Don't give up — fight for your ideals! You weren't heard, it happens. Just "
"write the next book so well they can't ignore you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"포기하지 마. 이념을 위해 싸워! 듣지 않는구나. 그럴 수 있어. 하지만 좋은 책을 쓰면 그들이 너를 무시하지 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b9ff1257-abfd-44a8-8cbc-85347c14597b"
msgid ""
"\"If the book was a mistake, then fix it — don't just give up! You can't "
"change people, and you don't have to. Just give them the truth — they'll "
"know what to do with it!\""
msgstr "\"책이 실수라면 고쳐. 포기하지 말고! 사람은 바꿀 수 없고 바꿀 필요가 없어. 진실을 알려주면 그들이 알아서 할 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "a554e93b-becb-431e-ab98-dc14ba2128ce"
msgid ""
"\"Don't give up! You did the right thing. You're a bard — your calling is to "
"tell the truth!\""
msgstr "\"포기하지 마. 너는 옳은 일을 했어. 너는 바드야. 너의 소명은 진실을 말하는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "0a406e5b-c17c-4467-b41d-0f3cbf5c9ccf"
msgid ""
"\"You made a mistake, and people suffered due to your lack of "
"responsibility. Remember this lesson, and make sure it never happens again.\""
msgstr "\"너는 실수를 저질렀고 사람들은 너의 무책임함에 피해를 입었어. 이 교훈을 기억하고 다시는 그러지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "46766970-bf89-49c0-8ad3-11ede69651b8"
msgid ""
"\"You must really think highly of your books. You think this attack wouldn't "
"have happened without you? A bard's job is to entertain their audience — "
"don't take responsibility for someone else's deeds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 책을 스스로 자랑스러워해야 해. 네가 없었다면 이 공격이 없을 거라 생각해? 바드의 직업은 관객을 즐겁게 하는 거야. 누군가의 "
"행위에 대한 책임을 대신 지지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "35486998-6799-43bd-8387-0405083f5aa6"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi looks abashed, tears in her eyes.{/n} \"This is my fault. This is "
"all because of my book. This isn't what I wanted!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지의 눈에서 눈물이 흘러내립니다.{/n} \"이건 내 잘못이야. 내 책 때문에 이렇게 되었다고. 이런 걸 바라는 게 아니었는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "6167e952-b66d-4a4a-b394-68fc6f2f40a5"
msgid ""
"\"Everything we kept out of the book... It was to {d|Linzi Book "
"Gloss}save{/d} the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}! But my book made "
"them burn it instead! And Alondi — we covered for him, hoping he'd change, "
"but we really just handed him a torch!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 책은... {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 {d|Linzi Book Gloss}구하기 위해 "
"쓴 거였어!{/d} 하지만 그들은 내 책을 태웠지. 그리고 알론디는... 우리는 고양이에게 생선을 준 격이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "d9e5f983-384f-451f-bbfb-4bc3a7c08fec"
msgid ""
"\"We {d|Linzi Book Gloss}covered{/d} for Alondi, hoping to give him a chance "
"to change... As a result, we made him a hero, handed him a knife and a "
"torch! Nunzio's blood... it's on my hands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 알론디를 {d|Linzi Book Gloss}도와주었지만{/d}... 그는 영웅이 되어서 칼자루를 쥔 거나 다름 없어! "
"눈치오가 피를 흘린 건 내 탓이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "2c228a78-2d17-4a4e-b59b-476305f65da9"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to punish Alondi, to tell the whole {d|Linzi Book True}truth{/d} "
"about him... But I didn't think he'd be killed! It may as well have been me "
"who killed him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 알론디를 처벌해서 {d|Linzi Book True}모든 진실{/d}을 폭로하고 싶었어... 하지만 그가 죽을 줄은 몰랐는데! "
"그가 죽게 된 것은 내 탓이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "12f8fd95-cf6a-4d49-a0d6-57562db6fbe5"
msgid ""
"\"Professor Eobald said everyone deserves a second chance, but how many "
"chances does someone have to throw away before we admit they're just an "
"animal with no desire to change?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이오발드 교수는 모든 사람들은 두 번째 기회를 가질 자격이 있다고 했지만, 얼마나 많은 기회를 줘야 그들이 그저 길들일 수 없는 "
"짐승이라는 걸 알게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "d11b74f0-eb05-4334-9d14-8c77e375f9ef"
msgid ""
"\"This whole book was a terrible mistake. Sure, bards tell people stories — "
"but what kinds of stories? Sweet tales to lull their conscience and promise "
"that things will be all right, despite the facts? If that's a bard's "
"calling, then I'd have been better off in my hometown growing turnips! At "
"least some good would come of it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 책은 실수였어. 음유시인은 사람들에게 이야기를 전하지만 내용이 중요한 거야. 사실은 숨겨두고 달콤한 이야기만 전해줘야 하나? "
"그랬다면 그냥 고향에서 무나 기르는 게 나았지! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "6999c08d-6e5c-473f-ab8b-d9a2f4a22306"
msgid ""
"\"Professor Eobald was right. The quill is a deadly weapon — and I swung it "
"like a toy, praising myself for my bravery and uncompromising attitude. I "
"was so sure I was following a bard's calling... and I was ready to pay the "
"price for that. But it never occurred to me that I might not end up being "
"the one to pay it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이오발드 교수가 올았어. 펜은 강력하다고. 장난감처럼 가지고 놀며 내 실력을 뽐내고 있었어. 나는 정직한 바드라고 생각했는데... "
"다시는 후회할 일을 하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "bb851028-31fe-4cff-9352-4aa4f39eea3e"
msgid "\"Do you really think so? But they taught us... They taught...\""
msgstr "\"정말 그렇게 생각해? 하지만 우리가 배운건...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "346f21e1-68a7-4a78-9e4c-f2ed3aead8b5"
msgid ""
"\"Damn it all, what does it matter what they taught us? If it ends like "
"this, with stupidity and blood — then to hell with a bard's calling! The "
"audience is made of idiots, and my calling is to entertain them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"젠장. 배워 봤자 뭐해? 이렇게 끝날 거라면... 바드의 소명의식 따위는 집어치워! 내 할 일은 관객을 바보로 만드는 일이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "5c0bf33b-f7a4-479b-a921-30dd942a9bb6"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. Seriously, thank you. You really brought me to my senses. I "
"might have wandered a maze of pretty words and foggy ideals till I was old "
"and gray. Let's go. I don't want to see {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, or the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, or any of these faces ever again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워. 정말 고마워. 네 덕에 깨달았어. 아니었다면 아마 아름다운 말들이나 하려고 했겠지. 가자. 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}"
"나 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 보고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a0049bd1-f285-400f-81df-18be84571f9e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I'll remember. I'll remember this for the rest of my life. My old "
"teacher was right — a bard isn't just some newshawk. A bard needs to "
"consider how her words will affect people more than just how truthful they "
"are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 기억해둘게. 평생. 내 스승의 말이 옳았어. 음유시인은 메신저가 아니었어. 사실을 전달하는 것보다 전달하는 방식이 더 중요했던 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "37e17a64-b560-4b33-9bc7-5b322e129fc7"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi leans down to the slain bard.{/n} \"I'm sorry, Alondi. I should "
"have given you another chance. Forgive me — I realize too late how powerful "
"the weapon I wield is, only after it claimed your life. But now... you've "
"given me a chance to change, you know? And I promise, I will not make the "
"same mistake with my great chronicle!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 살해당한 바드에 기댑니다.{/n} \"미안해. 알론디. 너에게 기회를 주었어야 했는데. 용서해줘. 말의 힘이 이렇게 강력한지 "
"몰랐어. 하지만 이제 고칠 수 있겠지? 다시는 이런 실수를 하지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "b42062ff-4f41-4da8-9c43-a7f5b514a54c"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi wipes her hands over her face.{/n} \"...Thank you. I was just a "
"step away from quitting the bardic arts forever. Thank you for your words. "
"And now... let's go. I can't stay here any longer. I have... a lot to think "
"about.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 얼굴을 손으로 닦습니다.{/n} \"... 고마워. 나 음악을 막 그만두려던 참이었어. 말해줘서 고마워. 이제... 가자. "
"여기 더 이상 머물고 싶지 않아. 생각할 게 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "a139e6f2-1e22-481d-bf4e-d03db0ea9060"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi stares at the slain bard.{/n} \"I didn't want you dead. Honestly, I "
"didn't. But if the truth of your deeds brought this fate on you, is that "
"really my fault?\" {n}Linzi closes her eyes.{/n}\n"
"\"...No. No excuses. Your blood is on my hands, and I will never forget "
"this. But...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 살해당한 시체를 보았습니다.{/n} \"네가 죽길 바라지 않았어. 정말이야. 하지만 너의 행동의 결과라면... 이게 나의 "
"잘못일까?\" {n}린지는 눈을 감았습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"... 변명의 여지가 없어. 네가 죽은 건 내 탓이야. 나는 잊지 못할 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ae47a5c1-4b2b-474b-bd79-428cbc7c21dd"
msgid ""
"\"Now that I know the power of my weapon, I won't lay it down. I'll tell the "
"truth, even if it eventually kills me too.\""
msgstr "\"이제는 글의 힘을 알게 되었어. 나는 이제 죽더라도 진실을 말할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "70413c07-601b-4fb0-8bc9-6d3f57673de5"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi looks away from the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} and "
"Alondi's corpse.{/n} \"I think I finally graduated today. I almost failed "
"the final exam — but thanks to you, I endured. Thank you. Now, let's go. "
"There's nothing left for me here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}와 알론디의 시체에서 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} "
"\"오늘에서야 졸업한 것 같아. 마지막 시험은 떨어질 뻔했지만 버텨냈어. 고마워. 가자. 이제 여기에 볼 일은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "02bd76de-437d-4192-bd58-0794d2af10de"
msgid ""
"\"It's hard to stand up for your ideals when you can see everything "
"crumbling down around you. But... that's how it has to be, right? It's "
"moments like these when you discover what your ideals and you yourself are "
"worth.\""
msgstr "\"자신의 모든 것들이 무너질 때 꿈을 갖기란 힘든 법이야. 하지만... 오히려 꿈과 가치를 알게되는 기회였다고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "4dcd6f54-1401-4ec8-be67-1ab5ca85a512"
msgid ""
"\"This was a failure. A complete, irredeemable failure. But you're right — I "
"shouldn't give up, and I need to understand what I did wrong. I'll find the "
"words that can reach the hearts of even scumbags like Alondi!\""
msgstr ""
"\"실패였어. 완전한 실패였어. 하지만 네가 맞아. 나는 포기하지 말고 잘못한 것을 고쳐야 해. 알론디 같은 쓰레기라도 마음을 움직일 수 "
"있어야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "7fe66d78-4065-4ddc-8a13-826db0185026"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. It was important to hear it from you... my main hero. Thank you "
"for believing in me! I swear, your chronicle will be better!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워요. 당신이 그 말을 해줬으면 했어요... 나의 영웅님. 날 믿어줘서 고마워요! 약속해요, 아주 훌륭한 일대기를 만들어 드릴게요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "10ba3fc4-c755-4b7d-9c16-d97fb1fc4f8f"
msgid ""
"\"Professor Eobald was wrong... What's worse, he fooled me with his song and "
"dance about second chances and reform, when he just wanted to cover for "
"himself and his favorites!\""
msgstr "\"이오발드 교수는 틀렸어... 게다가 그가 나를 속여 자기만 챙기려고 할 때 나는 기회를 주었다는 사실이 더 끔찍해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "ee7a33c1-349d-48d3-be08-1779e76626f9"
msgid ""
"\"Well, Teacher... this is also a lesson. Maybe the most important one. I "
"won't be fooled again. My calling is to tell the truth, and if it brings "
"harm on anyone, that's their fault, not mine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음. 스승님... 이것은 또한 교훈이야. 가장 중요한 교훈일지도. 나는 속지 않을 거야. 나는 진실을 말할 거야. 누군가 잘못되어도 "
"그건 그들의 잘못이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_Final/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "88fa19b7-43a4-4c8e-9641-cef0effb4a4a"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for supporting me. I was confused by all the lies, omissions, "
"and fantasies. You know... to the Hells with {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and with "
"the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}! Consider today my graduation day. "
"Let's go — we've got your story to write!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 도와줘서 고마워. 나는 이 거짓말들이 혼란스러웠어. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}"
"대 예술 아카데미{/g}는 다시는 떠올리고 싶지 않아! 오늘 부로 졸업한 걸로 하겠어. 가자. 우리는 써야 할 이야기가 남아있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a983ff1c-4326-4b16-a187-649c59e99be6"
msgid "\"Eobald, is this true?\""
msgstr "\"이오발드. 사실인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b8140f36-cf5c-4d30-9e53-a3bbf356ba2f"
msgid ""
"\"How much of what you and Linzi wrote about the academy is actually true?\""
msgstr "\"너와 린지가 아카데미에 관해 쓴 글은 정말이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b68eb6b6-0aa0-4b77-aee2-e3a2c2f9a4d9"
msgid "\"Linzi, what do you think?\""
msgstr "\"린지. 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "430b1bfd-123c-43b3-9a2c-fbe19dfeb2e8"
msgid "Supported Linzi in her dispute with Eobald the Insightful."
msgstr "린지와 이오발드의 논쟁에서 린지의 편을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "26536b98-4442-4d74-9234-8954246af71d"
msgid ""
"\"I think you're right, Linzi. Eobald, what of the student who died because "
"of your favorites? No one will ever see his creations — and he won't be "
"getting a second chance, either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 옳다고 생각해. 린지. 이오발드, 당신이 좋아한 학생 때문에 죽은 학생은 뭐가 되지? 누구도 그의 작품을 보지 못하겠지. 또한 "
"그는 두 번째 기회도 얻지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "64005956-a800-4831-8ce4-082e15dd429b"
msgid "Supported Linzi in her dispute with Eobald the Insightful."
msgstr "린지와 이오발드의 논쟁에서 이오발드의 편을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "9f10e0a9-dcad-4a4e-995b-3326c1504c7e"
msgid ""
"\"I think you're right, Linzi. Shelyn teaches us to spare even villains, so "
"long as they're repentant. But nothing in her teachings speaks of retaining "
"their posts — or keeping their careers.\""
msgstr "\"네가 옳다고 생각해 린지. 셸린은 악당도 용서하라고 했어. 하지만 자신의 경력을 유지하라고는 하지 않았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2e52c8dc-8ec7-483b-97e7-3bb14db4fe4d"
msgid "Supported Linzi in her dispute with Eobald the Insightful."
msgstr "린지와 이오발드의 논쟁에서 이오발드의 편을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "b8647162-74bd-4bd2-a2fc-9085f09391f1"
msgid ""
"\"I think you're right, Linzi. So many beautiful words, but it all boils "
"down to this: Eobald, you're trying to protect the guilty from being "
"punished, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"네가 옳다고 생각해. 린지. 아름다운 글이라도 자신의 안전을 위해 글을 쓴다면 모두 헛수고야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3d9a5814-74d8-4400-95ff-1856b0afa6c3"
msgid "Supported Eobald the Insightful in his dispute with Linzi."
msgstr "린지와 이오발드의 논쟁에서 이오발드의 편을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "062e962e-130b-4723-a1ba-aa4b65fde522"
msgid ""
"\"Eobald's right. This cruel world lacks beauty — we have to preserve what "
"little we have.\""
msgstr "\"이오발드가 맞아. 이 잔인한 세상은 아름다움이 필요해. 우리는 그것을 보호해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a2e937bd-fbbc-499a-8dc8-e06d8bf24784"
msgid "Supported Eobald the Insightful in his dispute with Linzi."
msgstr "린지와 이오발드의 논쟁에서 이오발드의 편을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "e02ba682-d7d4-4281-aade-a931c4c88910"
msgid ""
"\"Eobald's right. We have to preserve the academy. Think about it, Linzi — "
"even with all the drawbacks, your career wouldn't have started without it.\""
msgstr "\"이오발드가 맞아. 우리는 아카데미를 보호해야 해. 생각해 봐. 아카데미가 없었다면 너는 배우지도 못했을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a8ad8597-e06d-4a64-892d-9174791b26a2"
msgid "Supported Eobald the Insightful in his dispute with Linzi."
msgstr "린지와 이오발드의 논쟁에서 이오발드의 편을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "ba1b5a68-6e3b-4bb7-86e8-755cff58def4"
msgid ""
"\"Eobald's right. The academy is too valuable an asset to just throw away. "
"And once we deal with Irovetti, it will be ours to run as we see fit.\""
msgstr "\"이오발드가 맞아. 아카데미는 없애기에는 아까운 자산이야. 우리가 이로베티를 처리하고 우리가 경영하면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "52b803b9-1b41-49d0-b5d4-8e4ed2e07765"
msgid ""
"\"I hope the new manuscript will take less poetic license, Eobald. I don't "
"want to be disappointed again.\""
msgstr "\"새로운 원고는 시적 표현이 덜했으면 좋겠어. 나를 실망시키지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "7d7b6eb0-c9d0-4e78-af0b-c9209b58cbad"
msgid "\"Linzi, will this book distract you much from your main project?\""
msgstr "\"린지. 이 책이 니가 할 일에 집중하는 데 많이 방해 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "32661f47-f789-4527-9353-ea47a5ae71b0"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want this old liar in my lands any longer. Linzi, you're going to "
"have to finish the new manuscript yourself.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 늙은 거짓말쟁이는 필요 없어. 린지. 너는 새로운 원고를 쓰는게 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6187b42f-351e-4974-84bb-0657fcf2a72e"
msgid ""
"\"Professor, I can't believe you lied to me this whole time! Don't try to "
"deny it — I've heard everything! How you covered for bullies, how it wasn't "
"even Irovetti who fired you — it was Atalia! How could you?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"교수님이, 나에게 계속 거짓말을 했다니 믿을 수가 없어! 변명하지 말라고. 나는 다 들었어! 괴롭히는 이들을 은폐하고, 심지어 너를 "
"해고한게 이로베티가 아닌 아탈리아라니! 어떻게 그럴수 있어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "b737cac3-cdf0-43c0-8aa6-3a83fb44fe66"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, Linzi, please calm down! I didn't deceive you — you never even "
"asked about the circumstances of my dismissal, remember? It's a... you "
"know... a sensitive subject.\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지, 린지 진정해! 난 너를 속이지 않았어. 내 해임 상황에 대해서 물어보지도 않았잖아, 기억해? 그게... 알다싶이... 껄끄러운 "
"주제였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ef7733bb-bd03-4311-9800-33d61031aabe"
msgid ""
"\"I may not have been a good enough student to be one of your favorites, "
"like Alondi, but I do remember the basics — like the seven types of lies! "
"And I definitely remember your lecture on lies of omission! You wanted me to "
"write a book about all the atrocities going on within the walls of the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, and you left out a pretty big one — you "
"never told me a student died because of you! What other 'sensitive subjects' "
"have you been avoiding?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 알론디 같은 너의 수제자는 아니었지만 기초는 기억해, 거짓말의 일곱 가지 종류같은 것들 말이야! 그리고 사실을 말하지 "
"않음으로써의 거짓말에 대한 강의도 기억해! {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 벌어지는 악행을 "
"쓰라고 말했지만, 당신 때문에 학생이 죽었다는 말은 하지 않았어! 뭣 때문에 '껄끄러운 주제'를 회피하는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "a219d629-de12-499c-ba71-e45174ce5d97"
msgid "\"Linzi, I beg you... Please let me explain!\""
msgstr "\"린지. 내가 다 해명할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "053e5737-fb72-4442-bdcb-803380abfe30"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Highness, I'm afraid it is. As I devoted all of my attention to "
"developing the talent of my students, I fear I neglected their moral "
"development. And this led to... tragic results.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실입니다, 전하. 저는 두려웠습니다. 학생들을 가르치는데 내 인생을 바쳤지만, 도덕성을 가르치지는 못했어요. 그래서... 이런 "
"결과가 나온 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "6d5584dd-179c-4318-8095-c0e4ef557e45"
msgid ""
"\"But, with all due respect to Headmaster Gitaren, I don't believe in "
"incorrigible villainy, especially not at such a young age! "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} teaches us not to renounce those who stumble, but to "
"give them a chance to reform. I traveled to your lands in the hopes of a new "
"beginning — for my student, and for myself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만, 지타렌 학장에 대한 존경 때문에, 나는 그런 고질적인 악행에 대해 믿지 않았습니다. 특히 그런 어린 녀석들일거라곤! "
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}은 걷지 못하는 자를 부축하지 말고, 걸을 수 있게 도우라고 했습니다. 그리고 나는 나와 학생들의 새로운 "
"시작을 위해 당신의 땅으로 여행을 떠났었죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "1f85524d-6dc6-4fdf-9dfb-5f867813bb4e"
msgid ""
"\"There is no... direct lie. I admit that, in some cases, I may have "
"concealed or... misrepresented some details to protect the innocent. But "
"believe me, it was with noble intentions! Irovetti's atrocities are no "
"secret to anyone, and this book may well bring about the fall of a tyrant! "
"But I cannot allow the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} to perish "
"alongside Irovetti. There are too many innocents — wonderful artists, poets, "
"and composers — who've been tainted by Irovetti's crimes against their will. "
"They stand to lose everything if we publish the truth in its entirety.\""
msgstr ""
"\"직접적인... 거짓말은 없었어요. 그 순진한 녀석을 보호하기 위해 말하지 않은 것이 있다는 건 인정합니다. 하지만 나쁜 의도는 "
"아니었어요! 이로베티의 악행은 이제 비밀이 아니고, 이 책은 폭군의 몰락을 가져오게 될 겁니다! 하지만 {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}까지 끝장내고 싶진 않아요. 수많은 학생들이 이로베티에 맞서기 위해 배우고 있죠. 우리가 모든 "
"사실을 폭로하면 학교는 더 이상 유지되지 못할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "143fe0ea-515c-4664-bdf2-6e933cd44f0b"
msgid ""
"\"So, to put things simply, the book is full of lies, isn't it? Your "
"'innocent' colleagues all pandered to Irovetti, and you want to shift all "
"the blame onto him alone so they all come out clean?\""
msgstr ""
"\"간단하게 말하자면. 책은 모두 거짓말이지, 안그래요? 당신의 '순진한' 동료들은 모두 이로베티에게 속아 넘어갔고, 당신은 모든 책임을 "
"그에게만 떠넘기길 원하나요? 그래서 그들은 모두 깨끗이 풀려나기 위해서요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "19da92e5-e47a-48ba-b04c-06d3aab147ba"
msgid ""
"\"What I want is to protect the little good that King Irovetti brought into "
"this world! The {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} is more than just "
"wrongdoings and bullying — it's made up of many brilliant artists who have "
"the potential to change the world for the better! Should we freely trample "
"flowers just for happening to grow out of a muckheap?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 만든 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}는 보호해야 해. 악행과 괴롭힘이 넘쳐나는 "
"곳이지만, 세상을 더 나은 곳으로 바꿀 잠재력을 가진 뛰어난 예술가들이 많으니까! 새싹을 짓밟지는 말아야 하지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a8d8f189-73f8-49e5-96d2-b63270dbbeea"
msgid ""
"\"I... I don't know. Teacher, you told me so many times that the world isn't "
"made of things — it's made of stories. And we ourselves are made of the "
"stories we tell and believe. But shouldn't those stories also be true? You "
"said that people are essentially animals who love stories — did you really "
"mean that people are just lying beasts?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어요. 스승님은 세상은 물질이 전부가 아닌 이야기로 만들어진다고 여러만 말해줬잔아. 그리고 우리는 그 이야기들을 믿고 산다고. "
"하지만 이런 이야기들도 사실이여야 하지 않아? 사람은 근본적으로 이야기를 사랑하는 동물이라고 했지만 실제로는 사람은 단지 거짓말을 하는 "
"짐승이라는 뜻이였어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "10f6c235-2753-4e36-89ee-064afb8e206c"
msgid ""
"\"Well, what is the truth, then? A precise statement of past events? We're "
"not newshawks or historians, bound to precision for the sake of precision. A "
"bard must take into consideration how her story will affect her audience. "
"Truth and fiction are our materials — they're as valuable to us as rough "
"marble to a sculptor. The same story used to evoke anger, envy, or fear can "
"be turned to inspire bravery, love, and hope — both versions told in full "
"truth. The events at the base of the story aren't what's important — what's "
"important is the lesson your listeners take from it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면 진실은 뭐야? 과거 사건의 정확한 진술? 우리는 역사가가 아니야. 음유시인의 이야기는 관객들을 감동시켜. 진실과 거짓이 "
"우리의 소재인 거지. 조각가들의 대리석이 재료이듯 말이야. 그런 이야기들로 화를 내고 질투하거나 사랑하고 용기와 희망을 심어주는 거지. "
"이야기의 진실은 중요치 않아. 중요한 건 관객들이 어떻게 느끼느냐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f8e72f27-7d5a-4e3f-bbb8-d679a71f021e"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi turns to you, baffled.{/n} \"I... I don't know what to do! I want "
"to burn the manuscript — start over and write the whole dirty truth about "
"the academy. But... maybe Teacher is right, and that would be a horrible "
"mistake? Maybe saving the good the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} "
"brings is more important than punishing everyone who's guilty?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 당신을 당황스러운 눈으로 봅니다.{/n} \"나는... 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어! 원고를 태우고 아카데미의 더러운 진실에 "
"대해 쓰고 싶어. 하지만... 스승님이 맞다면, 이건 끔찍한 실수일까? 못된 녀석들이 벌을 받는 것보다 {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 구하는 것이 더 중요할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5b865187-d1c7-4598-9feb-c8ad48ee270e"
msgid ""
"\"You're looking at it from the point of view of a ruler... I don't "
"understand that stuff at all! But if you say saving the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g} is important, maybe it really is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 통치자의 관점에서 보고 있어... 나는 쥐뿔도 모르겠지만! {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}"
"를 구하는 것이 중요하다면 정말 그렇겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "1ca84e4e-ebd6-4d73-9177-81798698f409"
msgid ""
"{n}Eobald lowers his head.{/n} \"You're right, of course... "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} teaches us to value human life above art — and I let my "
"eyes be clouded. Who am I to put the work of my favored students before "
"people's lives? How many creative artists does the world lack because we "
"encouraged their attackers?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이오발드는 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"네가 맞아... {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}은 예술보다 인간의 목숨을 더 소중히 하라고 "
"했어. 내 눈물이 눈 앞을 가리는구나. 사람들의 목숨보다 학생들의 작품이 더 중요한 나는 누구지? 우리가 부추긴 사람들의 선동으로 얼마나 "
"많은 자들이 죽어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "65cde03a-3a64-4ae0-8bbc-557614f94ead"
msgid ""
"{n}Eobald lowers his head.{/n} \"Just so. Atalia said the very same when she "
"threw me out — I must admit, she was right.\""
msgstr "{n}이오발드는 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"아탈리아가 나를 쫓아낼 때도 그렇게 말했어. 그녀가 맞았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "bf8afdbd-45e0-4bcc-8910-549b17e005fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Eobald lowers his head.{/n} \"I... suppose you're right. I was so "
"concerned with mercy... and a great injustice occurred as a result.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이오발드는 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"나는... 네가 맞다고 생각해. 나는 자비를 너무나 베풀어 이런 불의가 일어났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c868cd26-efcf-4edb-9162-73b9082864af"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I guess so... Who walks without sin, after all? If we were to "
"suddenly learn the truth behind all our favorite poets, writers, artists... "
"it'd probably ruin all their work for us. Now that's true vandalism!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 것 같아... 죄가 없는 사람이 누가 있겠어? 우리의 예술로부터 진실만을 받아들인다면 그 모든 작품들은 헛된 거야. 그거야 말로 "
"야만행위지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "51a839a5-d668-46ac-8163-65aaa980f61d"
msgid ""
"\"You're right... Irovetti's a pig, of course, and the rules at the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} are really shady, but... But I'm still "
"glad I endured it all to become a real bard. I don't have any right to take "
"the academy from anyone — there's no other out there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 맞아. 이베로티는 돼지고 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}의 규칙은 쓰레기였지만 그걸 극복한 "
"내가 자랑스러워. 나는 누구에게서도 아카데미를 빼앗을 권리는 없어. 물론 다른 사람들도 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "27c659e6-d0c4-4a91-b99f-3b87a99321a1"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, Linzi. You've taught your old teacher a lesson today. We'll "
"rewrite the book. I'll tell you everything I know — and everything I'm "
"guilty of.\""
msgstr "\"미안해. 린지. 오늘은 내가 한 수 배운것 같구나. 책을 다시 쓰자. 너에게 내 잘못을 포함해 모든 사실을 말해줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2513e680-c7a6-4317-92e0-3a3517472eb0"
msgid ""
"\"If the truth about the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} destroys it, "
"then there wasn't really anything there to save. Let's go, Teacher — we have "
"work to do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약에 진실이 밝혀져 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}가 파괴된다면 더 이상 남아날 게 없어. "
"우리는 바로 일을 시작해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "879df8b4-f3fa-4667-a323-768f32f02c01"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, Teacher. We'll finish the book as you planned it. But promise me "
"you'll at least tell ME the truth, without omissions! If a bard's calling "
"requires knowing the truth and keeping silent about it — then I at least "
"want to carry this burden with you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 선생님. 계획한 대로 책을 끝내자. 하지만 나에게 만은 빠짐없이 사실을 말하겠다고 약속해줘! 음유시인의 소명이 진실을 듣고 "
"그것을 누설하지 않는 거라면 나도 같이 그 짐을 짊어지겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "fa0a7447-3741-47d0-9009-1625672848cd"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Linzi. I promise, you'll know everything. We'll make the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} better, you'll see!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워. 린지. 빠짐 없이 모두 말해주마. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 더 나은 곳으로 "
"만들자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "8aaff3b7-347c-4d62-8c1e-b97093450e2a"
msgid ""
"\"But... but I don't know the whole truth of the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}! I haven't seen enough...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... 나는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}의 진실은 몰라! 나는 더 알아야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "d094df73-4892-4632-a5c0-681bfc7ab195"
msgid ""
"\"I'll write out a detailed confession for you — all I know of the sins of "
"my colleagues, as well as my own. I'll also point out places in the book "
"where I was... less than honest. You can handle the rest without me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"빠짐 없이 모두 쓰겠어. 내 동료들의 죄와 나의 죄도. 그리고 내가 부정직했던 순간도... 말하겠어. 나머지는 너에게 맡기지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "8c8a9488-c540-41d2-9121-8241c37e54d9"
msgid ""
"\"That's... fair. Your Highness, Linzi... forgive me for letting you down.\""
msgstr "\"그게 .. 공평하네. 전하, 린지... 실망시킨 것에 대해 용서해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "eb495baf-6f0d-459b-ae4e-acccf2e73e94"
msgid ""
"\"I swear by {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} name, I'll conceal nothing. If truth "
"must see the light, then I'll ensure it does.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 이름을 걸고 맹세하는데 아무것도 숨기지 않겠어. 진실이 드러나도록 노력할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9b9590f8-4cce-4270-824c-fd033d9d669f"
msgid ""
"\"No, of course not! Your chronicle will take years of work! The book about "
"the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}... Well, that'll be ready in a "
"couple of months.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 아니지! 너의 연대기는 수 년간 공을 들였어! {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에 관한 "
"책은... 몇 달이면 완성될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Eobald
msgctxt "75754610-cd8c-4b40-97e3-68015187bb22"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell, Your Highness, and thank you for your kindness. Let's go, Linzi —"
" we don't have much time.\""
msgstr "\"물론이지. 친절하게 대해주어 고맙다. 가자. 린지. 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6a081822-4394-45ac-b86c-38bca8a1fae9"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi turns to Alondi.{/n} \"And you... Pack and leave. No, don't say a "
"single word. I have no interest in your excuses or apologies — I just never "
"want to see you again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 알론디를 봅니다.{/n} \"그리고 너는... 짐 싸고 떠나. 단 한마디도 하지 마. 너의 변명이나 사과는 관심 없으니까. "
"너를 다시는 보고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Linzi_VS_Eobald/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : C31-Alondi
msgctxt "8a077e37-7c1d-44bf-aa2d-4b919383302d"
msgid ""
"{n}Alondi shuts his mouth, swallowing his response before it started. With a "
"single nod, he leaves without saying a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}알론디는 입을 다물고 침을 꼴깍 삼킵니다. 그는 말없이 끄덕이고는 떠났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Eobald/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ba4953bf-2899-4e6f-997f-f46c6e02a2ff"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness! If you left the palace alive, you must be the new "
"{mf|King|Queen} of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. As victor, you deserve a much more "
"stately greeting, but I'm afraid we'll have to postpone the festivities. "
"Your new subjects are in urgent need of help!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하! 왕실을 보존하고자 하신다면, 당신은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 새로운 {mf|왕|여왕}이 되어야 합니다. 승리자로서 "
"당신은 그런 여유를 누릴 권리가 있지만, 축제를 미룰까 봐 걱정되는군요. 당신의 새로운 백성들이 절실하게 당신의 도움을 필요로 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Eobald/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2307faa0-3113-4712-843d-e315743ac134"
msgid ""
"\"Professor Eobald? What are you doing here? It's dangerous for you here!\""
msgstr "\"이오발드 교수? 여기서 뭐하는 거야? 여기는 위험해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Eobald/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "07a21fc3-fa84-4a77-8305-44287f89131b"
msgid ""
"\"You know how restless Linzi is. She followed you all the way to "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. And now she and many others are in serious danger!\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지가 얼마나 안절부절 하는지를 알지. 그녀는 너를 따라 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}로 왔어. 그리고 심각한 위험에 처해있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Eobald/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "02e06a63-82b3-4c59-b573-56dba01740a9"
msgid ""
"\"I came because I was worried about you... But I'm not the one who's in "
"danger right now.\""
msgstr "\"네가 걱정되니까 왔지. 내가 위험에 빠진 사람은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Eobald/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "8ececa71-ea6a-4ec6-853b-29fd1b7d02c4"
msgid ""
"\"There are riots in the city. A crowd has gathered around the {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}Academy of Grand Arts{/g} — and they're out for blood! I beg you, "
"you must interfere before it's too late!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도시에 폭동이 일어났어. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g} 주위로 군중이 몰려들었고, 유혈 사태를 "
"일으키려하고 있어! 부탁해. 늦기 전에 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "565d9d6e-05de-4161-8233-f0e58b1f1dc2"
msgid "Persuaded the angry mob in Pitax to disperse in peace."
msgstr "피탁스의 성난 폭도들을 평화로이 해산시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "3628562f-8d65-4b25-bd3e-e0870f481e61"
msgid ""
"\"Citizens of Pitax! Irovetti is dead — the tyrant is no more. If you think "
"this is a time for riots, you are mistaken. Surrender the troublemaker to "
"the guards and leave peacefully, or I will have to disperse you by force!\""
msgstr ""
"\"피탁스의 시민들아! 이로베티는 죽었다. 폭군은 더 이상 없다. 폭동을 일으켜야 한다고 생각한다면 그건 착각이다. 경호원에게 항복하고 "
"평화롭게 끝내자. 아니면 무력진압을 하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a78e6b17-9b45-4af0-b628-85fe6550839d"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "50f466c6-9325-4965-ae3a-bb998da6e40d"
msgid "Allowed the angry mob in Pitax to burn down the academy."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들에게 아카데미를 불태울 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "4128ef08-3c84-4b4e-866b-569ae2418559"
msgid "[Watch silently]"
msgstr "[조용히 지켜본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "96bc8b1d-b77b-40ac-8314-b8a78eee274a"
msgid "Used force to disperse the angry mob in Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들을 무력으로 진압했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "955e71f6-2ef0-409e-b6e7-a5194dacdb7f"
msgid "[Attack] \"Pigs! I'll burn you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"돼지 새끼들! 다 태워 버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4f85b2b9-24af-4b40-a845-ce9cb13730ba"
msgid "Persuaded the angry mob in Pitax to disperse in peace."
msgstr "피탁스의 성난 폭도들을 평화로이 해산시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "b3b24d8f-ea20-4826-bf83-cb2582057ba1"
msgid ""
"\"What are you doing? Shame on you! Look at yourselves — you're like "
"animals! This is how your act after I freed you from that tyrant?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거야? 부끄러운 줄 알아! 짐승도 아니고 말이야! 폭군으로부터 자유를 주었는데 이렇게 행동하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "eaeeddd8-32d0-4d94-a580-7b66067fb269"
msgid "Allowed the angry mob in Pitax to burn down the academy."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들에게 아카데미를 불태울 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "95513cff-d272-454f-9b96-ef9c6e7d5dfb"
msgid "\"Let's go, Linzi. Let them do what they want. It's their city.\""
msgstr "\"가자. 린지. 그들이 원하는대로 할 수있게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b8943b2e-63c7-4c0c-9c88-14e4febc9856"
msgid "Allowed the angry mob in Pitax to burn down the academy."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들에게 아카데미를 불태울 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "b0deb949-5ab9-4cd7-bd31-daa7d46cde18"
msgid "\"Burn it all! The tyrant's dead, to the Hells with his legacy!\""
msgstr "\"다 태워 버려! 폭군은 죽었어. 그의 유산을 지옥으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "68538959-468d-43b2-8b85-f3a5214eba7d"
msgid ""
"{n}A crowd of citizens, armed with whatever they could find — bludgeons, "
"daggers, torches — murmurs indignantly. They're listening to a student who "
"stands above a young man lying in a puddle of blood. It takes a moment to "
"realize that the wounded body is {/n} {d|Alondi}Alondi{/d}."
msgstr ""
"{n}시민들은 몽둥이, 단검, 횃불등으로 무장하고 분노에 웅성입니다. 그들은 피로 물들은 바닥 위에 서있는 학생의 말을 듣고 있습니다. "
"그것이 {d|Alondi} 알론디{/d}의 것임을 한참 후에야 깨닫습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C51-LinziQ3_Firebrand
msgctxt "bd292cd1-f56b-4072-ac47-3044a83c7c85"
msgid ""
"\"An end to tyranny! An end to the humiliation and disgrace that despotic "
"swindler Irovetti brought upon our city! You've all read Linzi's {d|Linzi "
"Book True}book{/d}. You all know the rot that festers behind this facade! "
"Lies, bullying, violence, and sycophancy — these are the arts Irovetti "
"patronized! His favored students are all murderers, like this scumbag!\" {n}"
"The girl delivers a swift kick to Alondi's body.{/n} \"Is this the kind of "
"{g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g} we need? Let the devils take it! Burn "
"it all to the ground — burn away the rot so we can begin anew!\""
msgstr ""
"\"폭군에게 종말을! 도시에 이로베티가 가져온 불명예를 끝내자! 모두 린지의 {d|Linzi Book True}책{/d}을 읽어 "
"보았겠지. 이 아카데미는 거짓말, 괴롭힘, 폭력으로 검게 썩었다! 모두 이로베티의 탓이고, 그 학생들은 사기꾼에 쓰레기들이다!\" {n}"
"소녀는 알론디의 시체를 발로 걷어찹니다.{/n} \"이런 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}가 우리에게 "
"필요한 것인가? 저 데블을 끌어내라! 부패의 증거를 불태우고 새롭게 시작하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "656fb670-8d36-4b8b-a176-ac16e1fa56d2"
msgid "\"Stop! What are you doing? I didn't write the book to-\""
msgstr "\"그만! 뭐하고 있는 거야? 이러라고 책을 쓰지 않았...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : C51-LinziQ3_Firebrand
msgctxt "94b1837c-b0b6-46ed-a52e-3ae967dc77ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi's words are drowned out by the joyful roar of the crowd.{/n} \"Look"
"! It's Linzi! She's here with us! Our hero! Come, throw the first torch!\""
msgstr "{n}린지의 말은 군중의 환호로 묻힙니다.{/n} \"봐. 린지다! 그녀과 함께 있어! 린지! 와서 횃불을 던져줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C51-LinziQ3_Firebrand
msgctxt "ddf269fe-f3c3-4f8b-a06d-1a44813b8f0b"
msgid "\"It's our new {mf|king|queen}! Hurrah! Hurrah for the liberator!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 {mf|왕|여왕}이다! 만세! 자유의 투사 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "fb5fac9c-4f8f-46ab-8798-89fb7f45fdbb"
msgid ""
"\"They killed Alondi! I... I didn't want this! They're going to burn down "
"the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}! All because of my book...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 알론디를 죽였어! 나는... 나는 이런걸 원하지 않았어! 그들은 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 "
"아카데미{/g}를 태울 거야! 모두 내 책 탓이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "1906ef49-f539-4846-a495-e9729d581f44"
msgid ""
"{n}The troublemaker tries to escape but is swiftly captured and handed over "
"to the guards. The remaining crowd quickly scatters.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}난동꾼은 도망치려 했지만 곧 잡혀 경비대에게 넘어갑니다. 나머지 군중들은 빠르게 흩어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "6a95d00c-f025-430f-899b-c48e88b19db7"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd's enthusiasm dies out. After a bit of confused clattering, the "
"rioters clear out.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}군중의 열정은 사라집니다. 혼란스러운 웅성거림 후에 폭도들은 조용해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "8745a391-85c4-4aa1-95bf-b1cc05c8552f"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi stares at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, then nods and "
"turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}린지는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 보고는 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "5c2f404c-138f-4837-89df-5a4d2ef72bc9"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi looks at you, surprised. Then she looks at the academy, and a scowl "
"crosses her face.{/n} \"Yes! Burn it! To the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g} with the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}! To the Abyss with it all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 놀란 표정으로 당신을 봅니다. 그녀는 아카데미를 보고는 대담한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"그래! 태워버리자고! "
"{g|Abyss}심연{/g}으로 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 넣어버리자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "2ebb316e-bfd5-40c9-91a2-7c469b4fb543"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd roars, a mix of rallying cries, curses toward Irovetti, and "
"praise for you. Stones, then torches begin flying toward the {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}Academy's{/g} windows, and smoke begins to billow over the "
"building.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중이 포효가 울리고 이로베티를 저주하고 당신을 환호합니다. 돌과 횃불이 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}"
"의 창문에 던져졌고 연기가 건물 밖으로 흘러나옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Truth/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3f671212-86ad-443c-8125-33db5dfa71eb"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you should have! That Alondi was an asshole, and he got what he "
"deserved. And you won! They're looking at you like their leader. And you "
"didn't even raise a sword for it — a quill was enough!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 늦었어! 알론디는 개자식이었고 그렇게 되어도 싸. 그리고 네가 이겼어! 그들은 너를 지도자처럼 보잖아. 너는 칼 한번 휘두르지 "
"않고 이겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5f053e59-0378-4f82-a827-cc0880670ee3"
msgid "Persuaded the angry mob in Pitax to disperse in peace."
msgstr "피탁스의 성난 폭도들을 평화로이 해산시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "c316d5f9-396e-4373-be78-58177a5bd89e"
msgid ""
"\"Citizens of Pitax! Irovetti is dead — the tyrant is no more. If you think "
"this is a time for riots, you are mistaken. Surrender the troublemaker to "
"the guards and leave peacefully, or I will have to disperse you by force!\""
msgstr ""
"\"피탁스의 시민들아! 이로베티는 죽었다. 폭군은 더 이상 없다. 폭동을 일으켜야 한다고 생각한다면 그건 착각이다. 경호원에게 항복하고 "
"평화롭게 끝내자. 아니면 무력진압을 하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a56f3daf-dbbf-4034-908a-e5b3184503ba"
msgid "Persuaded the angry mob in Pitax to disperse in peace."
msgstr "피탁스의 성난 폭도들을 평화로이 해산시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "74680d2c-d3d3-4eda-996b-ddf2a6b647bb"
msgid ""
"\"Alondi, you dirtbag! You stand there pretending to be a hero — why don't "
"you tell everyone why you were thrown out of the academy?\""
msgstr "\"알론디. 이 더러운 자식! 영웅인 척 서서 거짓말을 하려는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "22f8d4ed-6a06-4c23-bf99-6d2e23df4405"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4d24722b-c028-4acb-9067-f96d27524ef8"
msgid "Allowed the angry mob in Pitax to burn down the academy."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들에게 아카데미를 불태울 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "1a229731-4428-4920-9ca8-5c7988f8c665"
msgid "[Watch silently]"
msgstr "[조용히 지켜본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d5622ab3-f4be-4dcd-b984-85e224d37c52"
msgid "Used force to disperse the angry mob in Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들을 무력으로 진압했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "ad349037-2129-4611-b82d-f2f86efeb28c"
msgid "[Attack] \"Pigs! I'll burn you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"돼지 새끼들! 다 태워 버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ed3685de-9429-49d8-91b9-c537e0dd62e6"
msgid "Persuaded the angry mob in Pitax to disperse in peace."
msgstr "피탁스의 성난 폭도들을 평화로이 해산시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "272a8fb1-e876-4840-9508-88b99bdac972"
msgid ""
"\"What are you doing? Shame on you! Look at yourselves — you're like "
"animals! This is how you act after I freed you from that tyrant?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거야? 부끄러운 줄 알아! 짐승도 아니고 말이야! 폭군으로부터 자유를 주었는데 이렇게 행동하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6f9a5269-fa7d-4287-92a5-84e9cb86374c"
msgid "Allowed the angry mob in Pitax to burn down the academy."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들에게 아카데미를 불태울 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3ecd2cf2-7adf-4024-99bc-0e2ca2139828"
msgid "\"Let's go, Linzi. Let them do what they want. It's their city.\""
msgstr "\"가자. 린지. 그들이 원하는대로 할 수있게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e549e670-bbff-43c7-90ab-5f5c1bc02889"
msgid "Allowed the angry mob in Pitax to burn down the academy."
msgstr "피탁스의 폭도들에게 아카데미를 불태울 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "faf34a17-b6f2-4f8d-b552-f43d69d9489e"
msgid "\"Burn it all! The tyrant's dead, to the Hells with his legacy!\""
msgstr "\"다 태워 버려! 폭군은 죽었어. 그의 유산을 지옥으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "20e4146b-bbda-4089-859a-a7a8af154753"
msgid ""
"{n}A crowd of citizens, armed with whatever they could find — bludgeons, "
"daggers, torches — murmurs indignantly. They're listening to{/n} "
"{d|Alondi}Alondi{/d}{n}. A man in expensive clothes lies at his feet, "
"writhing in a puddle of blood as he presses his hand over a wound. You "
"gather from the screaming crowd that this must be Nunzio Arpaia, Irovetti's "
"master of ceremonies.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시민들은 몽둥이, 단검, 횃불등으로 무장하고 분노에 웅성입니다. 그들은 {d|Alondi}알론디{/d}의 말을 듣고 있습니다. 비싼 "
"옷을 입은 남자가 그의 발치에 쓰러졌고 상처를 짓누르자 피가 흐릅니다. 고함을 지르는 군중 앞에 있는 이 자가 이로베티의 의식을 주관하는 "
"눈치오 아르파이아임을 깨닫습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C51-LinziQ3_AlondiFirebrand
msgctxt "e47afe02-1713-49bc-ae82-cfafd5953308"
msgid ""
"\"Citizens of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! For too long have we tolerated a tyrant as "
"he trampled our city into the mud! Well, no longer must we fear telling the "
"truth. You've all read the {d|Linzi Book Gloss}book{/d} by Eobald the "
"Insightful — the only art taught at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy of "
"Grand Arts{/g} was that of licking Irovetti's boots! We students were "
"trained not as bards, but as jesters, like this man here!\" {n}Alondi kicks "
"Nunzio in the ribs, but he seems to have stopped moving entirely.{/n} "
"\"Enough of this mockery! Our art is finally free! We'll build our own "
"academy — once we've burned this old travesty to the ground!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 시민들아! 우리는 오랫동안 도시를 더럽힌 폭군을 참아왔다! 더 이상 진실을 참고 있지 않아도 된다. "
"모두 신통한 자 이오발드의 {d|Linzi Book Gloss}책{/d}을 읽었겠지 — {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 "
"예술 아카데미{/g}에서 가르친 것은 이로베티의 꽁무니를 뒤쫓는 법뿐이었다! 우리 학생들은 예술가가 아니라 이 자와 같은 광대로 키워졌다!"
"\" {n}알론디는 눈치오의 갈비를 걷어차지만 그는 반응이 없습니다.{/n} \"이 녀석은 충분하다! 우리의 예술은 자유다! 우리의 "
"아카데미를 건설하기 위해서 저 건물을 태우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "e0b77686-a743-4330-9fe6-a276bff07597"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, what are you doing?! We... we didn't write the book for THIS! "
"Alondi, have you no shame? Do I have to remind you why you were-\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 도대체 뭐하는 거야?! 우리는 이러라고 책을 쓴 게 아니야! 알론디. 부끄럽지도 않아? 네가 이 얘기를 해야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : C51-LinziQ3_AlondiFirebrand
msgctxt "6fb51842-f7b5-48c7-8e86-e59a41915587"
msgid ""
"{n}Alondi interrupts Linzi, raising elated screams from the crowd.{/n} \"Look"
", it's Linzi! The hero who revealed the truth to all of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! "
"Hurrah! Hurrah! Glory to the heroes of the resistance! Down with Irovetti! "
"Burn the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}알론디가 린지를 멈추자 군중들로부터 의기 양양한 환호가 들립니다.{/n} \"봐. 린지야! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 진실을 "
"알린 영웅! 만세! 만세! 저항의 영웅에게 영광을! 이로베티를 쓰러뜨리자! {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 "
"아카데미{/g}를 불태우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C51-LinziQ3_AlondiFirebrand
msgctxt "9f6fd215-74b3-44d4-98e9-cdcac4170683"
msgid ""
"\"Look! It's our new {mf|king|queen}! The one who liberated us from "
"Irovetti's oppression! Glory to {mf|His|Her} Highness! Down with the tyrant! "
"Hurrah!\""
msgstr ""
"\"봐! 우리의 새로운 {mf|왕|여왕}이다! 우리를 이베로티의 압제에서 구한 영웅이야! {mf|국왕|여왕} 폐하 만세! 폭군을 "
"쓰러뜨렸다! 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "10d77a00-e32d-46fd-8a12-7d13b8bf5457"
msgid ""
"\"Look at them! They killed Nunzio — a funny old man who'd never hurt a fly "
"in his life. And now they want to burn down the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}! And it's... it's all because of our book...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저들을 봐! 눈치오가 죽었어. 파리 한마리도 못죽이는 재밌는 사람이었는데. 이제 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 "
"아카데미{/g}까지 불타게 생겼어! 이게... 모두 우리 책 때문이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "0e9dd984-fc47-44df-ad55-fb6cee405778"
msgid ""
"{n}Alondi pales, then flees. After some confused clatter, the crowd also "
"wanders off.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}알론디가 창백해져서는 도망칩니다. 혼란스러운 웅성거림이 지난 후 군중도 흩어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "eaae798d-2384-40a5-8fde-9dae630b0a2b"
msgid ""
"{n}Alondi goes pale and tries to escape, but he's swiftly captured and "
"handed over to the guards. The remaining crowd quickly scatters.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}알론디는 창백해져서 도망치려 했지만 곧 잡혀 경비대에게 넘어갑니다. 나머지 군중들은 빠르게 흩어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "956c34a2-5483-48fd-ac25-f84253b8ff08"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd's enthusiasm dies out. After a bit of confused clattering, the "
"rioters clear out.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}군중의 열정은 사라집니다. 혼란스러운 웅성거림 후에 폭도들은 조용해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "bbb59e7a-ee3f-4141-88d7-44608d6c3e63"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi stares at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, then nods and "
"turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}린지는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}를 보고는 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "0e51ece5-84b0-4503-b597-ac7256e9cf4d"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi looks at you, surprised. Then she looks at the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}, and a scowl crosses her face.{/n} \"Yes! Burn it! To the "
"{g|Abyss}Abyss{/g} with the academy! To the Abyss with it all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 놀란 표정으로 당신을 봅니다. 그녀는 아카데미를 보고는 대담한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"그래! 태워버리자고! "
"{g|Abyss}심연{/g}으로 아카데미를 넣어버리자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "e85f323e-6e76-4002-b4ac-f7eab148e21f"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd roars, a mix of rallying cries, curses toward Irovetti, and "
"praise for you. Stones, then torches begin flying toward the {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}Academy's{/g} windows, and smoke begins to billow over the "
"building.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중이 포효가 울리고 이로베티를 저주하고 당신을 환호합니다. 돌과 횃불이 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}"
"의 창문에 던져졌고 연기가 건물 밖으로 흘러나옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "83cba9bd-2506-4f01-9a58-70e11324c092"
msgid ""
"\"That guy's slimier than a slug! Doesn't matter how many chances you give "
"the likes of him — if they were shit, they'll stay shit. Hey, little one, "
"can I kick him? Or you want to do it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 사람은 달팽이보다 더 미끄러운 녀석이야! 그들에게 기회를 줘 봤자 무의미하다고! 한 번 쓰레기는 영원한 쓰레기야. 이봐. 내가 저 "
"녀석을 걷어차도 될까? 네가 할래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Linzi/Q3_Bards_Vocation/Pitax_Mob_Whitewashed/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a8cf5898-b507-4bb6-a55d-b7a9162a4812"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae teaches that there are some people for whom sparing would be a "
"waste of mercy. Much can be forgiven to a repentant sinner, but what can you "
"do for one who does not want to reform?\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이께서는 자비가 아까운 자들이 있다고 하셨습니다. 회개한 사람은 용서받을 수 있지만, 바뀔 생각이 없는 사람이라면 무엇을 바랄 "
"수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/NokNokOTPEnterRestriction_String
msgctxt "796e922c-e98f-4123-997e-ac958f926325"
msgid "You need the following companion to enter this location: Nok-Nok."
msgstr "이 위치에 들어가기 위해서는 다음의 동료가 필요합니다: 녹-녹."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6e5e60d2-e25e-45e6-8bd6-8eae91efc60f"
msgid "\"Is this your tribe?\""
msgstr "\"너의 부족이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6efdbc8f-eafa-4610-aa9d-9a4faca2bdfd"
msgid "\"You need to get them to leave.\""
msgstr "\"그들을 떠나 보내야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a849da87-5773-407d-a1d2-136b29e04969"
msgid ""
"\"As my specially-designated Warden, drive them out. By force, if necessary."
"\""
msgstr "\"내 특별 지명 감시관으서, 그들을 쫓아내버려. 필요하면 힘을 써서라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "88d533f4-ae18-4471-b624-6780be3a6fee"
msgid ""
"\"As my specially-designated Councilor. Ask them, politely, to move "
"elsewhere – do not fight them.\""
msgstr "\"특별 지명 의원. 그들을 정중하게 보내봐. 싸우지는 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "fb597057-fedb-4ff1-8c63-a59ecb0be238"
msgid ""
"\"As my specially-designated Diplomat. Tell them they can set up a new "
"tribe, but at least twenty leagues from Oleg's. Downwind.\""
msgstr "\"특별 지명 외교관. 새로운 부족을 만들어도 좋지만 올렉의 다운 윈드에서 최소한 20개의 리그를 구성해야 한다고 전해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "f01bfbbd-04db-4539-82c3-500eb69c653a"
msgid "\"Make them leave, or I'll do it myself.\""
msgstr "\"그들을 쫓아보내지 않으면 내가 직접 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "3263025e-8dc6-4865-8d98-7328eb601f22"
msgid "\"Caught? By who?\""
msgstr "\"붙잡혀? 누구에게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "598b868d-3932-41ae-accb-c950eb2f9b39"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok, be ready.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 준비해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "21e761f9-a1df-4b2a-a687-7a23669efc85"
msgid "Tried to reason with Munguk."
msgstr "뭉국에게 자초지종을 설명합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "c1878134-6c57-40ff-b50b-de1f4f135f36"
msgid ""
"\"Look... uh, whatever your name is, we don't want any bloodshed, let's talk "
"about this.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 네 이름이 뭐든 간에 우리는 유혈사태는 원하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "1d8b8dd1-578f-4f33-9397-cee151808ff1"
msgid "\"You're trespassing by the law of the land, giant. Leave now.\""
msgstr "\"너는 무단 침입하고 있다. 지금 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "7818f151-ff38-4db9-abb8-2b0e9d382c1b"
msgid "\"This should be fun. Let's see how this plays out.\""
msgstr "\"재미있겠는데. 어떻게 빠져나가는지 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0026_AttackMunguk_Text
msgctxt "71d4707f-bf59-4e1c-b2c1-0e8f7edb3be1"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's kill this beast.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이 짐승을 죽이자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "3910d515-7af1-46fb-ade9-5b8bbc90a50f"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it looks like we'll be doing more than murdering a few goblins. Good."
"\""
msgstr "\"고블린 몇마리 죽이는 것보다 더 힘든데. 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "843e3eb7-4471-4cec-8c7b-e048ac7a4597"
msgid "\"You can understand him?\""
msgstr "\"그를 이해할 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "7b5a0904-0928-426e-b285-9febed5c0162"
msgid ""
"\"Keep pretend- er, being my Warden and order him to leave, or we'll use "
"force.\""
msgstr "\"계속 내 감시관이 되어 그들을 쫓아내. 아니면 그들에게 무력을 쓰자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "67e8e3b6-7330-4c3c-b866-76910f30bbab"
msgid "\"Try some diplomacy, then, 'Councilor', if he won't understand me.\""
msgstr "\"외교를 시도해 봐. 우리를 이해하지 못한다면 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "d0987a67-72f6-4334-bfa6-2be77b19cbf6"
msgid "\"Well, 'Grand Diplomat', see if we can make a deal with him.\""
msgstr "\"위대한 외교관. 우리가 그와 교섭할 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "15b1f185-a6e8-4b73-8990-87cc58c1c15c"
msgid "\"He can eat them all for all I care.\""
msgstr "\"그는 내가 공들인 모든 것을 빼앗을 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "ef227a00-0f79-4aab-bc42-179b254b0138"
msgid "[Put your hand on you weapon] \"Back away, monster, or I'll kill you.\""
msgstr "[무기에 손을 댄다] \"멀리 떨어져. 괴물아. 아니면 죽일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "77517fc5-1f0c-436f-9c3f-e89cea31fe47"
msgid "\"Well, do something about it!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 조치를 취해봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "c46ed0e4-5d1c-42b8-82a6-ea541bbeab66"
msgid "\"Attack him again, Nok-Nok!\""
msgstr "\"그를 다시 공격해. 녹-녹!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "8419de0e-1efa-4e6e-85c9-cb32dea43096"
msgid "\"Come on, Warden, you need to do better than that.\""
msgstr "\"어서, 감시관. 너는 그것보다 더 잘할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0052_AttackMunguk_Text
msgctxt "8403d355-5a45-49da-abff-55f3b9c23dab"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough of this. Let's kill the beast.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이것으로 충분해. 짐승을 죽이자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "b2ea876c-4106-40c3-b46b-845c0fd24c7b"
msgid "\"See if he'll leave now.\""
msgstr "\"그가 지금 떠나는지 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "89c42ffa-7765-4aa7-bed8-88cabff50452"
msgid ""
"\"Keep trying, Nok-Nok. There must be something you can say to convince him."
"\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 계속 노력해. 그를 설득할 수 있는 무언가가 있어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "53ab6df6-2826-4e7e-a9b6-5ad40c159420"
msgid "\"Tell him there's food where he's going. And drink.\""
msgstr "\"그가 가는 곳에는 음식이 있다고 말해. 그리고 마실것도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "6851c7e7-fab2-410d-975f-2af4ef322426"
msgid "\"What did you say to him?\""
msgstr "\"그에게 뭐라고 했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "963a6d0b-290b-41b2-ba84-d89520491181"
msgid "\"That worked, well done, Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"잘 했어. 녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "c1fdf61f-80cd-4480-ab9b-5b8b03d6479b"
msgid "\"What?! Why did you do that?\""
msgstr "\"왜? 왜 그랬어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0073_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a5f2ae5d-65b7-4ca8-895f-c09c8eb1183a"
msgid "Told Nok-Nok that he is an idiot."
msgstr "녹-녹에게 바보라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "9dc8e07c-b2d3-4790-ad50-b659544f6ccc"
msgid "\"Are you an idiot? Never mind that, of course you are.\""
msgstr "\"너 바보야? 물론 바보겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0074_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9e66690c-ba48-4679-9f42-e617ac991502"
msgid "Appraised Nok-Nok's decision."
msgstr "녹-녹의 결정을 칭찬했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "d29332ce-b1c0-4164-83ad-fe9a2d3f0f26"
msgid ""
"\"He goes there, his belly will be filled with spears. He'll likely do some "
"damage, too. Great.\""
msgstr "\"그가 저기로 간다. 그의 배는 창이 쑤셔져있을 거다. 그도 피해를 입히겠지. 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0076_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0fc03d77-d043-48fb-8a67-900b8219a856"
msgid "Expressed concern about Nok-Nok's tribe."
msgstr "녹-녹의 부족들에 대해 걱정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0076_Text
msgctxt "379f348b-4486-47c5-86b7-2f09dd1e6971"
msgid "\"That's it for Munguk... what about your tribe here?\""
msgstr "\"뭉국은 됐어... 너희 부족은 여기서 뭐해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0083_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "69f23244-33bf-4d6c-bf58-13cfbf16d101"
msgid "Joked about matching Amiri with Munguk."
msgstr "아미리와 뭉국을 짝지어주자는 농담을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "b736d605-69b6-412f-92f9-fa4d0a42f5df"
msgid "\"Hmm. Do you think he'd like Amiri?\""
msgstr "\"흠. 그가 아미리를 좋아할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "62ea8879-a51e-4cc8-8dbe-f04f4820d3c7"
msgid "\"A wife? Really?\""
msgstr "\"아내? 정말?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "aa190fe8-d2da-4fc8-b18a-5df6930dadc1"
msgid "\"Can you tell him to look elsewhere for a wife?\""
msgstr "\"아내는 다른 곳에서 찾으라고 말해주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0094_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4807a03e-1b0f-4c6a-a96a-8aec646528f0"
msgid "Suggested tricking Munguk."
msgstr "뭉국을 속일 것을 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "6ea8858d-99d5-4172-a1a8-6233ca1ba139"
msgid "\"Well, send him somewhere.\""
msgstr "\"그를 어딘가로 보내버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3229daa3-c5ec-49cd-a9bb-c7900619f5f1"
msgid ""
"{n}You stumble across an ugly scene – a ragged pile of goblins. They are "
"hiccupping violently, laughing, then hiccupping again – the air is so thick "
"with alcohol fumes, flies lie dead in the dirt... and an odd vinegar smell "
"as well.\n"
"It appears the goblins have gotten into Oleg's stock... and drank deep of "
"its contents. Barrels lie in splinters around the area, not a single one "
"intact.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 누더기를 걸친 고블린 무리를의 추한 모습 속을 비틀거리며 가로질렀습니다. 그들은 딸꾹질을 하고 웃다가 다시 딸꾹질을 합니다. "
"공기는 술냄새로 진동을 하고 파리들이 꼬입니다. 이상한 식초 냄새도 납니다.\n"
"고블린들이 올렉의 물건 안의 내용물을 마신 것 같습니다. 나무통들이 주변에 널부러져있지만 모두 비어있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ee4196b9-3b5c-40ee-93bb-db3101d19e1e"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok surveys the goblin pile, then glances at you with a shrug.{/n} "
"\"No problem here. Normal day for tribe. Would be worse if holiday.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 고블린 무리를 관찰한 다음 어깨를 으쓱하며 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"여긴 아무 문제 없어. 이 부족에게는 평범한 "
"일상이야. 만약 휴일이라면 더 나빴겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "85907c68-cf01-4ac1-82c9-05e2729940fd"
msgid ""
"\"Listen. Nok-Nok Big Hero, you do what Nok-Nok say. But...\" {n}Nok-Nok "
"frowns, his ear twitching.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 녹-녹은 큰 영웅, 넌 녹-녹이 말하는 대로 한다. 하지만...\" {n}녹-녹이 찡그렸고 그의 귀가 꿈틀댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "74c48658-c397-4d00-872e-4e719a430d4f"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me where Bigshanks now. When he expect you back? Did Bigshanks follow "
"y-\""
msgstr "\"뚱땡이가 지금 어디 있는지 말해. 그는 네가 언제 올 거라고 생각해? 뚱땡이가 너를 따라 갔...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d4184442-ca4e-409b-90ca-e69d2bfe2e12"
msgid ""
"{n}At that moment, there is another waft of foul air, and a shadow falls on "
"the ground.\n"
"All the goblins in the pile lift their heads at the new arrival – a towering "
"hill giant with mis-matched coveralls, a necklace of hands and skulls, and a "
"makeshift club composed of several timbers tied together with rope. He looks "
"very, very angry – not just at the pile of goblins, but the splintered, "
"empty barrels.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 순간 다른 악취가 풍기며 그림자 하나가 땅에 드리웁니다.\n"
"고블린들이 모여서 새로운 방문객을 지켜봅니다. 누더기를 걸치고 손등과 해골들이 달린 목걸이를 하고 로프와 나무로 대충 엮어서 만든 "
"몽둥이를 들고 있는 탑처럼 우뚝 솟은 언덕 거인(hill giant)입니다. 그는 고블린 뿐만 아니라 흩어진 나무통을 보고서는 매우 매우 "
"화가 나 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "777d3833-5104-475e-a1a6-b2d162de7600"
msgid "\"That him,\"{n} Long-Legs says unhelpfully.{/n}"
msgstr "\"저 놈이야.\" {n}꺽다리가 말했지만 도움이 되지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ed67470a-362a-47d7-8609-d2011b6a4a90"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok sniffs.{/n} \"Yes.\" {n}He sniffs again, and you suddenly become "
"more aware of the vinegar smell.{/n} \"They've marked this as home. It will "
"be hard to make them leave this home. Though...\" {n}He glances around in "
"disapproval.{/n} \"...it much smaller than the capital, capital would have "
"more room for them, not have to lie in pile, could be lying down drunk "
"everywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 킁킁거립니다.{/n} \"맞다.\" {n}그는 다시 냄새를 맡았고 당신은 갑자기 식초 냄새가 심해짐을 알게됩니다.{/n} "
"\"쟤들은 여길 집으로 삼았다. 이 집을 떠나게 하기에는 어려울 거야.\" {n}그는 불만에서 흘끗 보았습니다.{/n} \"... "
"수도보다 훨씬 작다. 수도는 훨씬 넓어서 모여있지 않아도 되고 아무데나 취해서 널브러질수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6d872c69-ac2b-4f6a-992f-df19079e0540"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks confused.{/n} \"But...\" {n}He sniffs again, and you "
"suddenly become more aware of the vinegar smell.{/n} \"They've marked this "
"as home. It will be hard to make them leave. Though...\" {n}He glances "
"around in disapproval.{/n} \"...it much smaller than the capital, capital "
"would have more room for them, not have to lie in pile, could be lying down "
"drunk everywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 혼란스러워 보입니다.{/n} \"맞다.\" {n}그는 다시 냄새를 맡았고 당신은 갑자기 식초 냄새가 심해짐을 "
"알게됩니다.{/n} \"쟤들은 여길 집으로 삼았다. 그들이 떠나기는 어려울 거야.\" {n}그는 불만에서 흘끗 보았습니다.{/n} \""
"... 수도보다 훨씬 작다. 수도는 훨씬 넓어서 모여있지 않아도 되고 아무데나 취해서 널브러질수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "2d0dd64f-9872-42d5-a8c8-279044e8dde2"
msgid ""
"{n}He turns to one of the group entwined in the mass.{/n} \"You – Runny-Long-"
"Legs, why did you stop running? Why make home here?\""
msgstr "{n}그는 난장판이 되어있는 것 중 하나를 뒤집습니다.{/n} \"너 꺽다리. 왜 도망 안가지? 왜 여기를 집으로 정했냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "7ace937f-1c71-4ada-8527-fd5e9e601419"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin lifts his head slightly, his tiny eyes blearily red. His legs "
"are indeed long – and folded back, almost like a grasshopper.{/n} \"Kept... "
"getting chased, no place to settle down. Got hungry. Then caught. Then we "
"sent here, and now...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린이 그의 작고 붉은 눈을 게슴츠레하게 뜨며 살짝 고개를 듭니다. 그의 다리는 정말 길어서 접힌 메뚜기 다리 같습니다.{/n} "
"\"계속 쫓기고 갈 곳도 없고. 굶주리다 결국 잡힌다. 그래서 우리 여기로 보내졌다. 그리고 지금은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "7742278f-7436-4ec5-b5e7-2812f7ec1347"
msgid ""
"\"Bigshanks... bigger than you.\" {n}Long-Legs blinks, and scratches the "
"side of his head with his foot.{/n} \"Fatter. Smelled better. Big club. Was "
"eating sheep. We tried to share his sheep with us by taking one... a small "
"one... in the night while he snore... but we not ask first, so he got mad.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뚱땡이...너보다 커.\" {n}꺽다리가 눈을 껌뻑이며 머리를 발로 긁습니다.{/n} \"더 뚱뚱하다. 냄새가 더 난다. 커다란 "
"곤봉. 양을 먹고 있었다. 우리는 양을 가져와서 나눠 먹으려고 시도했지... 작은 걸로 하나...밤에 그가 코골 때... 그런데 먼저 "
"동의를 구하진 않았거든. 그래서 그는 화가 난거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "b645eb57-371f-4a18-b4e6-7822ae442a12"
msgid ""
"\"After eating half of us, he get so full, he ready to trade. He say if we "
"find him something to wash other goblins down with because they still "
"squirming in his gut, he let us go. We knew a place – here, at post... "
"but... had to sample kegs to be sure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 부족의 절반을 먹고 그는 배가 너무 불러서 거래를 제안했다. 뱃속의 고블린들이 몸부림쳐서 소화시킬 뭔가를 찾아 온다면 우리를 "
"놓아 주겠다고 했다. 우리는 장소 알고 있었다. 여기 교역소... 하지만... 확실히 하기 위해 시식해 봐야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "e105efca-a324-4d43-8137-a767d7815550"
msgid ""
"{n}The hill giant turns to you, as if in challenge, points to himself and "
"gives a rumbling growl akin to \"MMNNN-guhk\", then turns to the goblins, "
"his hand clenches on his club, and the growl grows louder. He points at the "
"goblins, then points at his belly, the intent clear.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}언덕 거인은 당신에게 도전한다는 듯 자신을 가리키고는 \"므므믕-국\"처럼 들리는 괴성을 지릅니다. 그리고 고블린을 보고는 곤봉을 "
"들어서 더 큰 괴성을 지릅니다. 그는 고블린을 가리키고는 자신의 배를 가리켰습니다. 그 의도는 분명합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "7a98a50a-d292-4771-98ca-eead6890c724"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblins do not respond, not even Long-Legs... their eyes remain wide, "
"frozen. Suddenly, Long-Legs makes a high-pitched squeak and points at Nok-"
"Nok.{/n} \"HE our leader. HE a Hero. He make us drink everything we "
"promised. Also, he made us eat your sheep. Eat him and ugly friend.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 심지어 꺽다리도 반응하지 않습니다. 그들은 얼어붙었습니다. 갑자기 꺽다리가 꽥 비명을 지르더니 녹-녹을 가리킵니다.{/n} "
"\"우리의 우두머리, 우리의 영웅이 우리더러 술을 마시고 양도 먹으라고 시켰다. 바로 저 녀석이다. 녀석과 저 못생긴 친구를 먹어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "b1d6acb3-de4d-4928-b7f7-9b6eb8f3160c"
msgid ""
"{n}The hill giant snarls, lifts his club – then turns to you and Nok-Nok, "
"and thrusts out his chin, pounding his chest and giving a thundering series "
"of grunts that sound like a challenge.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}언덕 거인은 자신의 몽둥이을 들어올린 다음 자신과 녹-녹을 향해 턱을 내밀고 가슴을 두드리고는 천둥 번개 같은 소리를 냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "15380a34-197b-489a-9573-c557b8feeb54"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok blinks.{/n} \"He... 'Munguk'... says... not in the mood to share. "
"He says the halfshanks are... their guts his to eat.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 눈을 깜박입니다.{/n} \"... '뭉국'이... 나눠 먹을 기분이 아니라고 말했다. 녀석은 반쪽이들 먹을 배짱이 있다고 "
"했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "f615916b-600c-4f6a-9171-23640fc6b5cb"
msgid ""
"\"He says he eats all halfshanks. That includes you. You are halfshank to "
"him.\""
msgstr "\"그가 말하길 그는 모든 반쪽이를 먹는다 했다. 너도 먹힌다. 너도 저놈에게는 반쪽이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fb285bb1-1bcf-496d-858b-f46745dcf2ae"
msgid ""
"\"I can.\" {n}Nok-Nok seems embarrassed.{/n} \"Got caught by hill giants "
"once. Kept as a toy for their kid. Until ran away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"할 수 있다.\" {n}녹-녹은 당혹스러워합니다.{/n} \"한 번 거대한 언덕 거인에 잡혔다. 아이들 장난감이 되었다. 도망가기 "
"전까지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "eab7f52f-6f5d-44f5-a6f4-138d8ab8ff91"
msgid ""
"{n}Munguk gives a roar as you draw your weapons. You've got an angry giant "
"on your hands!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뭉국은 당신이 무기를 뽑은 순간 포효를 합니다. 당신은 거인을 화나게 했습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "e5c50623-fa24-4333-81dc-8b7bc74e8c4b"
msgid ""
"{n}Munguk may not understand you, but is keen on catching your intent. He "
"growls and raises his club. Then growls again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뭉국은 당신을 이해하지 못한듯 하지만 당신의 의도를 이해한듯 합니다. 그는 으르렁거리며 몽둥이를 들어올립니다. 그런 다음 다시 "
"으르렁거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "44d4d471-0b7f-4ade-9765-d6ea7ec6fea3"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok swallows, then takes a deep breath, and strides up to the hill "
"giant, barely cresting his knee. He then gives a few short drawn-out squeaks."
"\n"
"The hill giant doesn't respond, seemingly confused. Nok-Nok repeats himself, "
"and again, is met with silence. Frustrated – and without thinking – he kicks "
"Munguk as hard as he can – and howls in pain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 침을 꼴깍 삼키고 깊은 숨을 쉬고는 언덕 거인에게 당당하게 다가갑니다. 그는 헛기침을 합니다.\n"
"언덕 거인은 그저 바라만 보고 혼란에 빠집니다. 녹-녹은 되풀이하며 다시 침묵을 합니다. 당황한 채 생각의 겨를 없이 있는 힘껏 뭉국을 "
"걷어찹니다. 그는 고통에 신음합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "df36c369-8e78-4bcd-bf5e-e5103e7cac10"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok hesitates for a moment, then presents an open palm – then taps it "
"with a finger... you suddenly realized he just did what seems to be the "
"goblinoid version of \"trade.\" You think he's asking what Munguk want – but "
"not about food, but currency, something of value.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 잠시 머뭇거리다가 손바닥을 펴서 손가락으로 두드립니다... 당신은 불현듯 그것이 고블린식 '거래'를 하자는 신호임을 "
"깨닫습니다. 그는 뭉국이 뭘 원하는지 물어 보는 것 같습니다. 음식이 아니라 값비싼 무언가를 원하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "466ad216-3bc1-4625-94ef-c4a27a0e6760"
msgid ""
"{n}Munguk seems oblivious to the kick, but glances down at Nok-Nok, who is "
"now holding his foot and leaping about, and suddenly, a smile slowly cracks "
"Munguk's stained face – it's like watching clay crack.\n"
"Then, he starts chortling as Nok-Nok's eyes water.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뭉국은 걷어차기를 잊어 버린 것처럼 녹-녹을 내려다봅니다. 그는 자신의 발을 부여잡고 펄쩍펄쩍 뛰고 있습니다. 갑자기 얼빠진 "
"뭉국의 얼굴에 씨익 웃음이 피어오릅니다.\n"
"그는 녹-녹이 눈물을 폭포처럼 쏟자 킥킥거리며 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d46a900b-54e9-4a8a-9596-ecac098cdb90"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok finally stops hopping about and takes a step back, glaring "
"furiously at Munguk.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 마침내 펄쩍거림을 멈추고 한걸음 물러서서 뭉국을 맹렬하게 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "e20f0a3d-4a0c-4c5b-b32b-c4a43e6a855c"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing the goblin become still, the once-smiling hill giant begins to "
"grumble angrily, his eyebrows drawing together.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고블린이 여전히 눈앞에 보이자 언덕 거인은 표정을 찡그리고 화를 냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "7a11dc65-50f8-4e53-b702-b942c49dd418"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks confused at your order, then without thinking, kicks Munguk "
"again, and emits a new set of howls.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 당신의 명령에 혼란스러워하고 생각하지도 않고 바로 뭉국을 걷어차고는 다시 비명을 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "1e7d8c87-74bc-40df-8d03-2665ddfb4e47"
msgid ""
"{n}At this, the giant gives a delighted, booming laugh, spittle flying from "
"his splintered teeth. One gob flies, almost slowly, twisting in flight, to "
"land directly onto Nok-Nok's head with a heavy SPAT, forming a phlegmy cap "
"that drips down his face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이에 이 거인은 커다란 웃음을 터뜨립니다. 그의 입에서는 이물질이 튀어나옵니다. 무언가가 튀어나와 천천히 녹-녹의 머리 위에 곧바로 "
"떨어졌고 녹-녹의 얼굴은 타액과 덩어리로 뒤덥힙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "370f4ba9-0ab5-4919-8ea2-7b7c924b5839"
msgid ""
"{n}The other goblins, once paralyzed by drink and fear, suddenly begin to "
"laugh as well, pointing at Nok-Nok, until the entire building is filled with "
"laughter.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}술에 취해 두려움에 떨던 다른 고블린이 녹-녹을 보자 갑자기 웃음을 터뜨렸고 그 장소는 웃음으로 가득해졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "500da806-d485-4f71-aa2f-dc935deac84f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's ears droop at the ridicule, but then he finally manages a half-"
"hearted chuckle, until he's laughing as well... and the hill giant doesn't "
"seem as angry anymore, it seems he's forgotten his hunger in the light of "
"this amusement.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹의 귀는 비웃음에 처지지만 마침내 그도 너털웃음을 터뜨립니다. 언덕 거인은 더 이상 화가 난 것 같지 않았고 즐거움에 배고픔을 "
"잊은 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "888812ea-a00f-41cd-ac9f-becaadf70837"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks doubtful, but shrugs. Squaring his chest, he tries to give "
"a booming, rumbling command, then stomps his feet and nods outside.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 의심스럽게 보지만 어깨를 으쓱합니다. 가슴을 두드리면서 그는 야유를 하고는 웅얼거리며 명령합니다. 그는 바닥을 쿵쿵 바롤 "
"찍고 바깥을 향해 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "64dba91d-0c36-4664-bb3b-913e03699e3d"
msgid ""
"{n}The hill giants glances in that direction, then turns back to Nok-Nok, "
"confused, then points at his belly… then points at Nok-Nok.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}언덕 거인은 그 방향을 바라보고는 다시 녹-녹을 혼란스럽게 바라봅니다. 그는 자신의 배를 가리키고는 녹-녹을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b3a00e63-a7fc-4d10-9ec3-5609dbd64e85"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shakes his head frantically, then risks a quick glance at you.{/n}"
" \"Munguk not want to go. Food is here. Now he think me not a Hero, but "
"food, too.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 머리를 미친듯이 흔들고 나서 당신을 흘끗 봅니다.{/n} \"뭉국은 가고 싶어하지 않는다. 음식 여기있다. 이제 그는 나 "
"영웅 아니라 음식이라 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "061092bf-84fa-4713-b860-6832baf674c3"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok thinks hard for a moment, one ear twitching... then brightens. He "
"gives a series of rumbling grunts, very quick in succession, then spreads "
"his hands out wide – and then spreads them high, standing on his tiptoes. "
"After that, he settles back on his heels, and pats himself on the belly with "
"a \"mmmm\" sound… which doesn't need translation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 잠시 고뇌에 빠지더니 그의 한쪽 귀가 꿈틀댑니다. 그는 곧 밝은 표정을 짓습니다. 그는 으르렁거리는 소리를 계속해서 내었고 "
"팔을 넓게 펼쳐 까치발을 하고 하늘로 뻗습니다. 그리고 그는 곧게 서더니 자신의 배를 두드리며 \"음...\"하는 소리를 냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "578abbb5-f74d-49b6-9ae3-2e9409246eda"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods. He gives a series of rumbling grunts, very quick in "
"succession, then spreads his hands out wide – and then spreads them high, "
"standing on his tiptoes. After that, he settles back on his heels, and pats "
"himself on the belly with a \"mmmm\" sound… which doesn't need "
"translation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 끄덕입니다. 그는 으르렁거리는 소리를 계속해서 내었고 팔을 넓게 펼쳐 까치발을 하고 하늘로 뻗습니다. 그리고 그는 곧게 "
"서더니 자신의 배를 두드리며 \"음...\"하는 소리를 냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "4b972dee-09c8-45fd-8c2c-bcb6c5676c6c"
msgid ""
"{n}Munguk absorbs this dully, then glances at the goblins. He gives a short, "
"dismissive grunt, then glances back at Nok-Nok and shrugs... then to your "
"surprise, he lumbers out, club over his shoulder.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뭉국은 멍청하게 고블린들을 바라봅니다. 그는 끙하는 소리를 내더니 녹-녹을 보고는 어깨를 으쓱합니다. 그가 몽둥이를 어깨에 올리는 "
"모습을 보고 당신은 놀랍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0070_MungukDrinks_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "cd892fdc-0e6d-4fa0-96b3-d038ceb1d079"
msgid ""
"\"Just make sense to him with words, like real Hero.\" {n}Nok-Nok puffs up "
"triumphantly.{/n} \"Send Munguk to capital. Lots of food there and drink, he "
"have ALL he need to fill belly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"설득시켰다. 진정한 영웅으로서.\" {n}녹-녹은 의기양양한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"뭉국을 수도로 보내라. 음식 음료 "
"많이 준비해라. 그는 배 채워야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "dbb1869f-79fe-4806-a6b0-e63a315ca919"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok loses some of his puffed-up-ness, his ears drooping.{/n} \"I not "
"counsel well? But... Hero good at chasing off giant means Nok-Nok good "
"Hero... right?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 쭈그러들더니 귀를 축 내립니다.{/n} \"나는 명령 잘하지 않았냐? 하지만... 거인 잘 쫓는 녹-녹 영웅 맞지...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "f8cd44d6-f2eb-4720-8123-7376a9c94c8f"
msgid ""
"{n}Despondent, Nok-Nok thinks hard, his thinking ear twitching again, but he "
"seems to be chewing over your words.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}낙담한 채 녹-녹은 귀를 꿈틀대며 고뇌에 빠집니다. 당신의 말을 되씹는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "068578e7-2989-4a14-9b89-e409a7cfc524"
msgid ""
"{n}Ignoring him, pile of goblins are all watching you as they sober up.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그를 무시하고 고블린들은 술에 깨서 당신을 진지하게 바라보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "ae5666c2-717f-4725-9184-a6aed45b1e3f"
msgid ""
"{n}To your surprise, Munguk looks sad – his eyebrows collapse and he gives a "
"low grunt. The anger seems to have cooled down, and he makes a rumble, "
"staring off into space with a half-lidded gaze. He doesn't seem drunk, "
"merely... sad. He gives a grumble, then a sigh, then a low, exhaling "
"rumble.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}놀랍게도, 뭉국은 슬퍼보입니다. 그의 눈썹이 쳐지고 눈물을 흘립니다. 분노는 식었고 그는 신음 소리를 내며 멍하게 허공을 "
"바라봅니다. 그는 술에 취한 것 같지 않고, 단지... 슬퍼합니다. 그는 화를 내었다가, 한숨을 쉬고는, 낮은 소리로 가르릉댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9ce9a13b-3e54-4a88-bb01-a15547941299"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods, listening, then translates – you think.{/n} \"Munguk not "
"happy. He not hungry, just lonely. Says... came here looking for mate to be "
"happy.\" {n}Nok-Nok wrinkles his face in disgust, and shivers. Still, he "
"keeps going.{/n} \"But when he come, no wife, goblins take his favorite half-"
"sheep entrails, drink the liquor he send them for. And he have nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 고개를 끄덕이며 듣고 나서 통역합니다.{/n} \"뭉국은 행복하지 않다. 배고픈게 아니라 단지 외로울 뿐이다... "
"행복해지기 위해 짝을 찾으려고 여기 왔다. \" {n}녹-녹은 역겨워 얼굴을 찡그리고는 벌벌 떱니다. 그는 계속해서 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"그러나 그가 와보니, 아내도 없고, 좋아하는 하프-양의 내장도 고블린이 먹었다. 그리고 술도 먹었다. 그는 가진 게 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "829b211e-2173-4ff9-ab31-21f9b8226f40"
msgid "{n}Nok-Nok shakes his head.{/n} \"No one does.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아무도 그렇지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bdcac279-aee4-4f6d-bf48-0f2bf3d20180"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, ha, HAH.\" {n}Amiri snarls sarcastically... as she does, Munguk looks "
"up at her, and his face brightens.{/n} \"No! NO!\" {n}Amiri shouts at "
"Munguk, as if bringing a dog to heel, and his eyes widen in fear.{/n} \"No, "
"don't you think of it, stay back, or I'll cut your legs off so you can sit "
"here and rot!\" {n}Munguk looks pained, then sighs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하하.\" {n}아미리는 비웃습니다... 뭉국은 그녀를 바라보자 그의 얼굴은 밝아집니다.{/n} \"안돼! 저리 가!!\" {n}"
"아미리는 뭉국에게 강아지 쫓듯 소리쳤고 그의 눈은 놀라서 커집니다.{/n} \"꿈도 꾸지마. 저리 물러서지 않으면 여기서 앉은뱅이가 되어 "
"썩게 내 다리를 잘라버리겠어!\" {n}뭉국은 고통스럽게 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "101e9cb8-30db-4008-8c7c-8ec12e8be084"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri continues glaring at Munguk, as if on guard in case of his renewed "
"interest.{/n} \"He's a slow one, but in some tribes, they'd send the dumb "
"men off to... you know, go do something to earn his right to marry. Only "
"smart men come back. Or not take a wife.\" {n}She shrugs.{/n} \"Or I could "
"just hack off his legs, let him bleed out.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 뭉국이 자신에게 다시 관심을 가질까 봐 계속해서 노려봅니다.{/n} \"녀석은 느리지만 어느 부족에서 이들을 쫓아냈어... "
"결혼을 하라고 말이야. 오직 똑똑한 녀석들만 돌아오지. 아니면 총각이 되던가.\" {n}그녀는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"아니면 내가 "
"여기서 다리를 잘라버릴 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4e36175e-5171-428c-af20-8372f26b3560"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shivers, then pauses.{/n} \"...cutting off legs be better than "
"finding mate.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 떨고는 잠시 멈춥니다.{/n} \"... 다리를 잘라내는 것이 친구를 찾는 것보다 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8f5e3d28-8b49-4320-8dc9-cb58f193307b"
msgid ""
"\"Sad for him.\" {n}Nok-Nok gives a shiver and a nod, then pauses.{/n} \""
"...cutting off legs be better than finding mate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍하다.\" {n}녹-녹은 떨면서 끄덕이고는 멈춥니다.{/n} \"... 다리를 잘라내는 것이 친구를 찾는 것보다 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "26ac7222-e4b9-4f93-966c-373332db005d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shrugs, then emits a series of what passes for rumbles, and he "
"makes a slow sack-shaped gesture in the air, then points to the gate of the "
"fort.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 어깨를 으쓱하고는 으르렁거리는 소리를 내더니 허공에 주머니 모양을 손으로 그리고는 요새의 문을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "44b71f87-7577-431a-bcda-3e7dde655b98"
msgid ""
"{n}Munguk shakes his head, slowly, and sighs again, giving a low grumble in "
"his belly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뭉국은 머리를 천천히 흔들며 한숨을 쉬고는 배를 잡으며 으르렁거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "719c5989-88f4-4ec5-9ec7-7426df9388fe"
msgid "{n}Nok-Nok shakes his head.{/n} \"No, he said he looked everywhere.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아니다. 그가 모든 곳을 봤다고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "66f9ea12-4807-4c81-84f2-e4ff648e0afd"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok gives a reluctant nod, think, then makes an interrogatory "
"grumble. Munguk looks confused, at which Nok-Nok repeats himself, more "
"firmly. He traces his finger across his palm, as if providing a map and the "
"giant looks blearily at it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 마지 못해 끄덕이고 생각하다가 화를 냅니다. 뭉국은 녹-녹이 계속해서 무언가를 말하자 혼란스러워보입니다. 그는 손가락으로 "
"손바닥을 가리키는데 지도를 주려는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0097_MungukLoves_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6258ee68-5ddb-488a-a3c8-3cb0ee3561d8"
msgid ""
"\"Just make sense to him with words, like real Hero.\" {n}Nok-Nok puffs up "
"triumphantly.{/n} \"Send Munguk to capital. Lots of women, he have ALL he "
"need to choose wife.\""
msgstr ""
"\"설득시켰다. 진정한 영웅으로서.\" {n}녹-녹은 의기양양한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"뭉국을 수도로 보냈다. 여자 많이 있다. "
"그중에서 고르라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "387d12d9-8875-4501-a79e-2cf699a83a50"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I'd love a festival like that! I think these guys wouldn't even mind "
"if I fried their friends a little!\""
msgstr "\"하! 그런 축제라면 좋지! 내가 녀석의 친구들을 튀겨도 아무렇지 않은가봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "29abfe35-feb5-442b-a107-6ec0affd3748"
msgid "{n}Jaethal wrinkles her nose ever so slightly.{/n} \"Animals.\""
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 코에 주름이 살짝 생깁니다.{/n} \"짐승들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a80ee87a-ead5-4d0a-a525-838f7576c698"
msgid ""
"\"Some appreciation that is! Look, you can't just serve any old swill to the "
"monster that swallowed your friends! You have to be sure it'll complement "
"such coarse meat! Perhaps I should write a guide on pairing drinks for "
"goblin cuisine?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 친구들을 삼킨 녀석을 섬기지는 못할 텐데! 그런 고기 요리가 있다면 기뻐했겠지! 아마 고블린 요리를 위한 가이드북이라도 써야 "
"할까봐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2e6f2039-b0b3-459a-895d-cac2fb8e9215"
msgid "\"Hmm. Looks like a giant. Don't know which one.\""
msgstr "\"음. 거인처럼 보여. 어느 녀석인지 모르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1c347a01-6f4f-4bbc-b647-abda0c135740"
msgid "{n}Amiri draws her weapon.{/n} \"Finally, down to business!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리가 무기를 뽑습니다.{/n} \"진지한 대화를 나눠볼까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d9072984-4741-4cfe-9b99-42f4445328c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing Nok-Nok's words, Tristian winces and shakes his head sadly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹의 말을 듣고 트리스티안은 찡그리고는 머리를 절래절래 가로젓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0116_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6c3c2c63-f16e-4322-9b83-aee3902eec1a"
msgid ""
"\"If... if you look at the entire situation from his point of view... The "
"poor lad!\""
msgstr "\"그렇... 그렇게 보니까... 참 불쌍한 애네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_enter/Cue_0119_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0eb51c72-4199-4eed-b9e1-c92093d88538"
msgid ""
"\"{name}? It may be time to put an end to this madness. This prank has gone "
"overboard.\""
msgstr "\" {name}? 이 광기에 종지부를 찍을 때가 왔습니다. 장난이 도가 지나치군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "0cbf2a08-2b0b-47d7-b34f-da84947731ff"
msgid "\"None of you move, we're not done here.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 움직이지 마. 아직 용무 안 끝났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5e9e6554-8944-4069-8218-0fcdf4c2e9f3"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok, deal with your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 너의 부족과 거래를 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4751c771-fa78-42e9-a49a-58decefb3b6f"
msgid "Promised to execute goblins."
msgstr "고블린을 처형하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "39fdbf8e-5c09-489c-a1c7-e30e89ff5264"
msgid ""
"\"I'll let you all leave, but if I catch you here again, I'll execute you. "
"Understand?\""
msgstr "\"너희 모두 떠나보내겠지만 만약 다시 잡히면 죽을 줄 알아. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "b970188a-e5bd-4ef5-85fd-ecdfe18f4433"
msgid "\"Where are you taking them?\""
msgstr "\"어디로 데려가는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "32143e6f-525f-4adf-ab6e-0760a332569d"
msgid ""
"\"You better NOT be taking them to the capital like Munguk, or so help me..."
"\""
msgstr "\"녀석들을 뭉국처럼 수도로 데려가지 않는 게 날 도우는 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "363b0a40-2890-44c3-ab94-70ef8e53c7f6"
msgid "\"Fine. Let's get out of here.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 여기서 나가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "6af971aa-3eb3-49f9-bb4c-5f8f39f4e0d9"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblins seem ready to bolt... you catch Long-Legs slowly uncurling "
"himself from the pile, apparently ready to run. You do notice a number of "
"the goblins are looking at Nok-Nok with a strange fascination... dealing "
"with the giant must have impressed them.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 뛰쳐나갈 준비가 되어있는 것 같습니다... 당신은 꺽다리를 낚아채서 곧게 세웁니다. 몇몇 고블린이 매료되어 녹-녹을 "
"바라보는 것 같습니다... 아마 거인과의 거래에서 감동을 받은 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "64ad69f1-f37a-42d2-b47a-9a28518db1ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok steps forwards, and gives a series of cracking hisses to get "
"attention, and all the goblins stare at him.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 앞으로 나아가고 주의를 끌기 위해 쇳소리를 내자 모든 고블린이 그를 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "0a2d87dd-0efb-49e6-85e0-f3fcba6a0914"
msgid ""
"\"Weeee not go anywhere,\" {n}Long-Legs says slowly.{/n} \"We not have "
"anywhere to go. Maybe all stay here, yes?\" {n}He adds hopefully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 아무데도 안 간다.\" {n}꺽다리가 천천히 말합니다.{/n} \"우리는 갈 곳이 없다. 아마 여기 모두 머물러 있을 거다.\""
" {n}그는 덧붙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1449e36f-9ebb-4004-ab07-8e4b42103ff5"
msgid ""
"{n}As you start getting confused looks, Nok-Nok whispers to you.{/n} \"You "
"hard to understand because you use longshanks words – use too many, and out "
"of order.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 혼란스러워 보이기 시작할 때 녹-녹은 당신에게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"이해하기 어려울 거다. 꺽다리라는 말을 너무 많이 써서 "
"그렇다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "16485c31-a2c6-4743-afa3-ff70c61877ed"
msgid ""
"{n}After their eyes are on him, Nok-Nok, his eyes narrowed, goes to each one "
"of them in turn and raps them twice on the head. Hard. They wince, but say "
"nothing... except for one feeble groan from a goblin more sober than the "
"rest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그들과 눈을 마주 쳤을 때 녹-녹은 눈이 가늘어지고 그들 하나하나의 머리를 찰싹 때립니다. 아주 세게. 그들은 찡그리지만 말을 하지 "
"못합니다. 한 고블린은 더 큰 소리로 신음합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0904a06c-ef69-4a66-a19d-c0706c1b4cbf"
msgid ""
"\"You need to go to bigger place or I hit you again. I show you, me Warden.\""
" {n}The goblins stare blankly at this, Nok-Nok sighs.{/n} \"Me Big Hero. "
"Follow me, take you to new place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 더 큰 곳으로 가야한다. 그렇지 않으면 또 때릴 거다. 나 감시관이 보여준다.\" {n}고블린들은 멍하니 쳐다보자 녹-녹은 "
"한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나 큰 영웅이다. 나 따라와라. 너희를 새로운 장소로 데려간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "3cd9537c-fdc5-4cab-97b2-319c36a6ca37"
msgid ""
"\"Make great deal with you — you need to go to bigger place or I hit you "
"again. I show you, me Councilor.\" {n}The goblins stare blankly at this, Nok-"
"Nok sighs.{/n} \"Me Big Hero. Follow me, take you to new place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희와 거래한다. 너희 더 큰 장소로 가라. 그렇지 않으면 다시 때릴 거다. 나와 협상가 보여준다.\" {n}고블린들은 멍하니 "
"쳐다보자 녹-녹은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나 큰 영웅이다. 나 따라와라. 너희를 새로운 장소로 데려간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "52e10d78-7cf4-4764-8fc9-c6dde1f80c1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you.{/n} \"Warden and Big Hero Nok-Nok take care of "
"them. All good.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"감시관과 큰 영웅 녹-녹은 저들을 돌봐준다. 다 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "fef33239-69a6-47db-b967-711cf27de2a6"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblins nod, and begin to untangle themselves, but they are doing "
"what Nok-Nok says, some of them rubbing their heads.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고블린들은 고개를 끄덕이기 시작하고 녹-녹의 말을 따릅니다. 몇몇은 머리를 문지르고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "97c1db12-c2b0-47f2-acdd-5b3a753a2658"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you.{/n} \"Councilor and Big Hero Nok-Nok take care of "
"them. All good.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"의원과 큰 영웅 녹-녹은 저들을 돌봐준다. 다 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "f2a7b4db-c942-41e0-83b3-77dbaa285766"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you.{/n} \"Diplomat and Big Hero Nok-Nok take care of "
"them. All good.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"외교관과 큰 영웅 녹-녹은 저들을 돌봐준다. 다 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "24ca2211-4d63-4efb-9733-9eb346ade04c"
msgid ""
"\"Make great deal with you — you need to go to bigger place or I hit you "
"again. I show you, me Diplomant.\" {n}The goblins stare blankly at this, Nok-"
"Nok sighs.{/n} \"Me Big Hero. Follow me, take you to new place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희와 거래한다. 너희 더 큰 장소로 가라. 그렇지 않으면 다시 때릴 거다. 나와 외교관 보여준다.\" {n}고블린들은 멍하니 "
"쳐다보자 녹-녹은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나 큰 영웅이다. 나 따라와라. 너희를 새로운 장소로 데려간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "19d5f77e-9141-4fb7-bb63-aa208005c6ac"
msgid ""
"\"Make great deal with you — you need to go to bigger place or I hit you "
"again. I show you!\" {n}The goblins stare blankly at this, Nok-Nok sighs.{/n}"
" \"Me Big Hero. Follow me, take you to new place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희와 거래한다. 너희 더 큰 장소로 가라. 그렇지 않으면 다시 때릴 거다. 내가 보여준다!\" {n}고블린들은 멍하니 쳐다보자 녹 "
"녹은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나 큰 영웅이다. 나 따라와라. 너희를 새로운 장소로 데려간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "c1b308ff-0bf3-4636-b3eb-a5101f1e9e74"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you.{/n} \"Big Hero Nok-Nok take care of them. All good."
"\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"위대한 영웅 녹-녹은 저들을 돌봐준다. 다 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "2d63b823-264d-42fc-aff5-f830b7f82aeb"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok pauses, as if he's forgotten what happened a few moments ago – "
"and you realize he has.{/n} \"Capital big enough. Yes, Capital!\" {n}Before "
"you can stop him, he turns to the goblins.{/n} \"All, you, go to capital, "
"Nok-Nok command you, GO!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 잠시 전에 무슨 일이 있었는지 잊어버린 것처럼 잠시 멈춥니다.{/n} \"수도는 크다. 수도!\" {n}당신이 그를 막기 "
"전에 그는 고블린들을 봅니다.{/n} \"너희 모두 수도에 간다. 녹-녹 너희에게 명령한다. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fb1d6299-d961-40df-a15e-7c5f9adba9dc"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok pauses, then nods.{/n} \"Capital not bad idea. All, you, go to "
"capital, Nok-Nok command you, GO!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 멈추고 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"수도 나쁘지 않다. 너희 모두 수도 간다. 녹-녹의 명령이다. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinLongLegs
msgctxt "5c555268-4499-4a23-9efb-732a4bff2eca"
msgid ""
"{n}To your horror, the goblins scamper away, running in all directions... "
"but toward the direction of the your capital city.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 섬뜩해합니다. 고블린들은 사방으로 뛰어다니지만... 수도로 향합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5959ef99-d60f-402c-8a2b-7f1dd3c4bcee"
msgid ""
"\"Oh my. Just...\" {n}Jubilost stands with his mouth open for a few moments, "
"obviously at a loss for words, then sighs with a defeated look on his "
"face.{/n} \"Oh my.\""
msgstr ""
"\"세상에. 그냥...\" {n}주빌로스트는 멍하니 입을 벌리고 있었고 할 말을 잊은 것 같더니 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"맙소사.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "020cbbe6-e968-4d03-a99b-0ca810cdbea6"
msgid ""
"\"The end of your {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} just drew closer. Much "
"closer.\""
msgstr "\"네 {mf|영지|영지|왕국|왕국}에 멸망이 다가온다. 이제 곧.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "b712ec6f-f144-4720-b19d-6fa0c22fffac"
msgid ""
"\"More green cuties? Nice! And you all should stop yelling at Nok-Nok! — "
"Can't you see how hard he's trying to be a good advisor?!\""
msgstr "\"귀여운 초록이들이 더 많아지는데? 야호! 너희 모두 녹-녹에게 소리치지 마! 얼마나 좋은 보좌관의 모습이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/1-GoblinTrouble/OTP_goblinsSaved/Cue_0030_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "db1b92a4-4961-493c-92ea-d8bd1a9c13ac"
msgid ""
"\"More green cuties? Nice! And you all should stop yelling at Nok-Nok! — "
"Can't you see how hard he's trying to be a good advisor?!\""
msgstr "\"귀여운 초록이들이 더 많아지는데? 야호! 너희 모두 녹-녹에게 소리치지 마! 얼마나 좋은 보좌관의 모습이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Backer_GoblinSong/Backer_GoblinSong1_String
msgctxt "336a942e-07dc-4784-83a8-307aed0e4111"
msgid ""
"\"We are goblins, we will bite.\n"
"We will hurt you out of spite.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 고블린. 우리는 물 것이다. \n"
"우리는 너희를 해칠 거다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Backer_GoblinSong/Backer_GoblinSong2_String
msgctxt "43914eee-a091-411e-a27b-97ddce3a24ec"
msgid ""
"\"We will cut you with our blade.\n"
"Into shadows we will fade.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 칼로 너희를 잘라 버릴 거다. \n"
"그림자 속으로 우리는 사라질 거다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Backer_GoblinSong/Backer_GoblinSong3_String
msgctxt "f16c5e96-0479-4f22-b198-22265f41be48"
msgid ""
"\"Goblins we hold feasts so great.\n"
"Recite tales on your breast-plate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 고블린은 먹고 마실 거다. \n"
"가슴 속에 이 이야기를 담아둬라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Backer_GoblinSong/Backer_GoblinSong4_String
msgctxt "44c2b0ba-ea3f-42a8-98c8-0360ff3df7eb"
msgid ""
"\"We take pride in our friendship.\n"
"Goblins have good leadership.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 우정을 자랑스럽게 생각한다. \n"
"고블린은 훌륭한 리더십을 가지고 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/Shrine_bark_String
msgctxt "8ef48ab0-496f-45cd-8f52-f05c170ac8b6"
msgid "A crude shrine of Lamashtu, the Mother of Beasts."
msgstr "짐승의 어머니 라마슈투의 막 지은 성소."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/Tsanna_destroyOrder_String
msgctxt "6d98a952-75e6-416c-8932-b38636687433"
msgid "\"Destroying these shrines feels like a waste of effort.\""
msgstr "\"이 신사들을 파괴하는 것은 노력의 낭비처럼 느껴져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/Tsanna_worshipOrder_String
msgctxt "5979f106-0fe0-4b2b-9d91-d92b528b34f3"
msgid ""
"\"A commendable decision, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"훌륭한 결정이다, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin1_destroyOrder_String
msgctxt "70fe33a6-a631-4867-9b43-a081b73fbda8"
msgid "\"We destroy shrines now? Nooooooo! We just build them...\""
msgstr "\"우리 지금 신사를 파괴하고 있어? 안돼! 막 지은 건물이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin1_worshipOrder_String
msgctxt "cb56d4b0-7eeb-4caf-b961-3dcd2deed9be"
msgid "\"We can worship Lamashtu? Nok-Nok be real hero!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투를 숭배해도 된다고? 녹-녹은 진정한 영웅이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin_destroy1_String
msgctxt "cf36e347-a23c-46c9-b0a0-08f24380e0ae"
msgid "\"Building shrines be fun. Destroying shrines be fun too!\""
msgstr "\"신사를 짓는 것은 재미있다. 신사를 파괴하는 것도 재미있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin_destroy2_String
msgctxt "2766765a-cd5d-42a7-9bc5-7a6f1467f8bc"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok no hero! Can't protect Lamashtu shrines!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 영웅 아니다! 라마슈투 신사를 지킬 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin_destroy3_String
msgctxt "eae4db2c-039e-4f77-95e6-daa66c8661f7"
msgid "\"When we destroy shrines — you hear BOOM in your smelly capital!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 신사를 파괴할 때 너희 냄새나는 수도에서 폭발 소리 들린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin_worship1_String
msgctxt "724b9c5e-72c6-4862-b921-2bcb1f62c177"
msgid "\"Praise be Lamashtu! Praise be Nok-Nok!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투 찬양하라! 녹-녹 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin_worship2_String
msgctxt "fb20ebf4-2f28-4d74-a062-5c8ce7b5dd78"
msgid "\"Lamashtu be our mother. Nok-Nok be our father.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투는 우리의 어머니다. 녹-녹은 우리의 아버지다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/goblin_worship3_String
msgctxt "676b11e6-9cf8-4e56-b16c-bd4e88b9476e"
msgid "\"Me like it in your kingdom. Good for goblins!\""
msgstr "\"나 너희 왕국 좋다. 고블린의 천국이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/guard1_String
msgctxt "6ee7013a-7ad2-4af4-b2e2-143b1179d307"
msgid "\"All these shrines make me feel uneasy.\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 신사들은 나를 불안하게 만든다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/guard2_String
msgctxt "07911a46-4837-410d-8003-abe60f9b188c"
msgid ""
"\"Worshipping Lamashtu right at my doorstep... These are troubled times "
"indeed.\""
msgstr "\"내 집 앞에서 라마슈투를 숭배라... 참 어려운 시기가 되겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/Barks/guard3_String
msgctxt "7dde6c0e-d955-42be-ae01-b7151db689a4"
msgid "\"Worshipping Lamashtu... What's next? Rovagug shrines?\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투 숭배라니... 다음엔 뭐... 로바거그 성소라도 짓나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8e82c5b0-8f82-4d05-b4f1-d6ab3e12f12e"
msgid "\"Take off that ridiculous costume. Now.\""
msgstr "\"그 우스운 옷도 벗어. 당장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "32884b13-bb86-48d8-bf40-d9dbfa56a57a"
msgid "\"I did not give you leave to construct shrines in my capital.\""
msgstr "\"내 수도에 신사를 세우라고 너를 보내지 않았는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "1c72d40f-5547-4256-bd85-effc55bad576"
msgid "Allowed goblins to worship Lamashtu."
msgstr "고블린이 라마슈투를 숭배하도록 허용했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "284f1491-7f44-4256-b7b1-ab5873941ccf"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, I respect your efforts. You are free to worship Lamashtu here.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 나는 너의 노력을 존중해. 여기서 라마슈투를 숭배해도 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "ce2db38b-da0a-4778-8758-198d4bd38240"
msgid "Ordered Nok-Nok to destroy the shrines of Lamashtu."
msgstr "Nok-Nok에게 라마슈투의 신전을 파괴하라는 명령을 내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "154c01f5-cefe-424f-bf39-8ad07add992d"
msgid "\"You broke my law, and you must make amends. Bring down the shrines.\""
msgstr "\"너는 법을 어겼으니 다시 바로잡아야 해. 신사를 파괴해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cb4237ab-efc0-4720-8bd2-18af4495e6b8"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care who builds what, I just wanted to see what this fool's work "
"was you were on about. You may carry on.\""
msgstr "\"누가 무엇을 만들지는 상관하지 않아. 이 멍청이의 작품이 무엇인지 알고 싶어. 계속해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "1b3e958b-4db1-4370-bc6c-d3b74c983af6"
msgid ""
"\"Either destroy these shrines now, or spend the rest of your days in my "
"prison.\""
msgstr "\"지금이 신사들을 파괴하지 않으면 남은 평생을 감옥에서 보낼 준비 하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b5b2642e-80de-4c72-95f5-ddd7cad1a5d9"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok half-stumbles in, clanking and rattling from a number of fetishes "
"adorning his body – teeth, pebbles – so much so he looks like a filthy bead "
"curtain. You have no idea when he was able to dress up like this. He stops "
"before you, his back straight, and does his best to look down upon you... "
"but the effect ends up being something of a mess.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 몸에 무언가를 주렁주렁 달고 와서 마치 반쯤은 더러운 구슬 커튼처럼 보입니다. 언제 그가 그렇게 옷을 입었는지 "
"모르겠습니다. 그는 당신 앞에 멈춰서 허리를 세우고는 당신을 내려다보려 노력합니다. 하지만 턱없이 그는 작습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "12034b07-aa2d-49df-b700-252936f0345b"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you can speak, Nok-Nok addresses you, drawing out his words like "
"proclamations.{/n} \"Youuuuu have been summoned, {name}! The Moooother of "
"Beasts – SPEAKS.\" {n}He raises his arms in a flourish.{/n} \"Throoough "
"MEEEE!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 말하기 전 녹-녹은 선포하듯 말합니다.{/n} \"너는 소환되었다아아아! {name}! 짐승의 어머니가 말하신다.\" {n}"
"그는 팔을 들어올리며 말합니다.{/n} \"나를 통해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0005_undress_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ce328405-7c4e-464e-aa02-bbb4618d82f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks downcast, and removes the array of fetishes... as he does, "
"they cascade to the ground, rolling everywhere – hundreds of them spill into "
"dirt and grass, clicking as they roll.\n"
"Nok-Nok looks alarmed for a moment, then he looks at you warily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 내려다보며 몸에 달린 장식들을 제거합니다. 장식들이 떨어져 이리저리 굴러다닙니다. \n"
"녹-녹은 잠시 놀란 표정을 짓고는 경고하는 듯이 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4f328469-ab51-49de-9652-bb079146b604"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok blinks and he seems to deflate.{/n} \"But... yes, we built many "
"shrines to worship the Mother, one sign of great goblin Hero, to earn her "
"favor.\" {n}He swallows, and his ears droop.{/n} \"She not welcome here? Nok-"
"Nok not welcome here?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 눈을 깜빡거리고 그는 녹초가 된 것 같습니다.{/n} \"그러나... 그렇다. 우리는 어머니를 위해 많은 성소를 지었고 "
"그녀를 숭배한다.\" {n}그는 침을 삼키고는 그의 귀가 처집니다.{/n} \"그녀는 여기 환영받지 않아? 녹-녹 여기 환영받지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0012_destroyOrder_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "aab30ad4-d2a1-4c1c-a1b3-843c19d94168"
msgid ""
"\"But... But...\" {n}Nok-Nok looks down, tears in his eyes.{/n} \"I just "
"wanted to be Hero.\""
msgstr "\"하지만...하지만...\" {n}녹-녹이 고개를 숙이더니 눈물을 떨굽니다.{/n} \"나 그냥 영웅 되고 싶었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0014_worshipOrder_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "45835a5b-2941-4e19-b420-b47ce44378f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok gives a grin and a bow.{/n} \"Hear, ALL. The Mother is a-pieced… "
"aspleased with blessing from {name}. All HAIL, the Mother, All HAIL, {name}, "
"Hero of big bad-smell city!\" {n}He raises his arms in a flourish again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 미소지으며 인사합니다.{/n} \"모두 들어라. 어머니는 {name}을 축복하게 되어 기뿌시.. 기쁘시다. 모두 어머니를 "
"찬양하라. {name}을 찬양하라. 더러운 악취 도시의 영웅!\" {n}그는 팔을 들어올리며 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "a465e513-acf4-4094-bde6-40e3628aeca4"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok gives you a faint nod, then trundles off, his costume trailing "
"behind him... and leaving small bits on the ground as he moves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 희미하게 고개를 끄덕이며 저벅저벅 걸어다니는데 뒤에 장식물들이 끌립니다... 땅에는 그가 남긴 장식물 조각들이 "
"널부러져있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ca3310b1-3e05-4ec0-b759-04a77f0ac48b"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods, but as he turns to leave, his feet finds one of the fetish "
"beads on the ground, and his foot slips out from under him, sending him "
"crashing down with a wild screech.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 고개를 끄덕이지만 돌아서 떠나려하자 발 주위에 장식들이 걸립니다. 그리고 그는 발이 죽 미끄러져 넘어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "813544b1-2d40-47c0-896c-a7f486e2b1bd"
msgid ""
"{n}There is a moment of silence at the fallen goblin splayed out on the "
"ground, then a series of light chuckles from the guards and goblins "
"alike.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}넘어진 고블린을 보자 잠시 침묵이 이어지더니 여기저기서 비웃음 소리가 들립니다. 경비와 고블린들이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b7160cf4-fff8-47b6-8f21-9d0e1616372f"
msgid ""
"{n}The chuckling persists as Nok-Nok staggers to his feet, and dizzy, makes "
"a hapless parade on the way to the shrine... punctuated by further "
"collapses, each one causing more laughter in the audience than the last... "
"until Nok-Nok, weakly, reaches the shrine and clutches on to it like a "
"drowning goblin.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 비틀거리며 걸어가자 비웃음소리가 계속되었고 녹-녹이 성소로 향하는 길에 몇번을 넘어지자 관객들이 더 크게 웃습니다. 녹 "
"녹이 성소에 도착하자 그의 모습은 초라합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinShrines_Tsanna
msgctxt "595bb0cf-9b53-43ba-9679-6d55bcfd2ee9"
msgid ""
"\"A silly creature claims to be {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} chosen. How "
"amusing. Yet, his spirit is commendable.\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 녀석이 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선택을 받았다고 한다. 참으로 웃기다. 하지만 칭찬받을 만하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "7337dafe-06b2-4a1d-9034-c0e664421c16"
msgid ""
"{n}A guard claps – in genuine appreciation, apparently – and Nok-Nok gives a "
"respectful, weary nod to you, then shuffles off.\n"
"The laughter, however, persists amongst the audience for some time, and you "
"realize it's good to hear laughter during these difficult times.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}경비가 진심으로 박수를 치자 녹-녹이 예의바르게 당신에게 끄덕이고는 물러납니다.\n"
"그러나 청중은 여전히 웃음 소리가 들리고 당신은 이에 그나마 위안을 삼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinShrines_Tsanna
msgctxt "f680eb68-c708-42a4-b7af-f9452678e24b"
msgid ""
"\"I find these shrines to be too primitive. Yet, still — a pity you are "
"bringing them down.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 신사가 너무 원시적인 것을 발견한다. 그러나 여전히 네가 무너뜨리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinShrines_Tsanna
msgctxt "ae64c0ee-7794-48a1-bf6f-81070ec8b3e0"
msgid ""
"\"A wise choice, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. You "
"are pleasing {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} and keeping these mongrels occupied at "
"the same time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"현명한 선택이다, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. 너는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}를 기쁘게 하고 이 잡종들이 여기를 "
"점령하게 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4917c5dc-51ac-4a68-acf7-656ea26871aa"
msgid "\"Ah ha ha, hee, hoo... oh, sorry!\""
msgstr "\"아하하. 후... 미안!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6372b398-f984-44ac-8865-28e4a2ba29d6"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost takes out his notebook with a sigh.{/n} \"Go on, my big-eared "
"friend. You deserve your own chapter in my upcoming book, 'Amazing Paradoxes "
"and Incredible Nonsense within Eastern Avistan.' ...It's a working title.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 한숨을 쉬면서 수첩을 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"어서 가. 녹-녹. 너를 위해 나의 책에 써주지. 동쪽 아비스탄에 기인이라는 "
"제목으로... 유명해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5b769327-da3e-426d-814d-5b0ab3c8516c"
msgid "\"Thank the gods.\""
msgstr "\"신들에게 감사해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8afd6397-1433-40eb-a4d6-2ad9029f01cf"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! Doesn't it bother you that all these little critters will be flowing "
"in from around the area, bothering the innocent locals?!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 이 작은 동물들이 여기로 모여들어 무고한 시민들을 괴롭히지 않아?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "584dd15b-5511-4165-8902-d790517ddcad"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian manages to keep his cool, except for his painfully clenched "
"fists.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고통스럽게 움켜쥔 주먹을 제외하고는 냉정을 지키고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7190ca69-5659-4245-8a3d-f2fd147b090f"
msgid "\"Bwa ha ha ha! Such a buffoon! I can't!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 바보같은! 나는 못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5c64f138-dd4e-423d-93d8-19e5738126d6"
msgid ""
"\"And I feel sorry for him. He tries so hard to be taken seriously...\" {n}"
"Octavia sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"유감이야. 진지하게 하려는 것 같았는데...\" {n}옥타비아는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/2-LamashtuShrines/GoblinShrines_enter/Shared_ValerieAgreesNokNok_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6b71abba-f842-4f8a-86fb-de17fc95ad35"
msgid "\"The first reasonable words in all this... this... this circus!\""
msgstr "\"이 서커스에서 처음으로 합리적인 말이 나왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d2989203-6dbc-4026-9122-6489cf2fa349"
msgid "\"Hold your ground.\""
msgstr "\"똑바로 서라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bdc8054b-f586-4320-b979-f205073657f5"
msgid "\"Something isn't right.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 잘못 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "83d098cf-2f19-4b7e-9d67-1d483e344103"
msgid "\"Let's wait a bit.\""
msgstr "\"조금 기다려 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "7c747fdd-5ba9-43aa-b286-209788e9d91c"
msgid "\"So... the Lord of Cowardice returns.\""
msgstr "\"그래서... 겁쟁이 제왕의 귀환이로구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "4a2099d6-f993-4c10-b727-751b95490d73"
msgid "\"Let's get this over with.\""
msgstr "\"이걸로 끝내자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "609af043-c9ae-4187-850d-6913c1d7087e"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, this isn't the King. This is something that looks like him.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 이 자는 왕이 아니야. 왕처럼 보이는 무언가로군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "c2443426-8dcc-411b-9007-b9adc2fd1cad"
msgid "\"Debt? To whom?\""
msgstr "\"빚? 누구에게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "39fd6774-5942-4fa2-8c73-a25077c69481"
msgid "\"That would be THIS goblin here. He got your message.\""
msgstr "\"이 고블린이 될 거야. 그가 너의 메시지를 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "9bea4bca-0e52-4c77-88b6-38c9bd209b96"
msgid ""
"\"It's definitely a barghest – demon, looks like a goblin – you know, like "
"this one.\""
msgstr "\"엄청난 악임에 틀림 없어. 고블린처럼 생겼는데. 요만하게 생긴 놈 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0023_attackAll_Text
msgctxt "f9bf686c-a2a7-4596-95c7-1e973b6b810d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've heard enough. I'll deal with you myself.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"충분히 들었다. 너는 내가 처리하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "503bb5d0-a61c-416d-a0d6-a80553ab5fdf"
msgid "\"You've been tricked, this is a fight you can't win.\""
msgstr "\"너는 속았어. 이건 이길 수 없는 싸움이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "3219fa37-28ff-449b-b7d8-092f3bdefddc"
msgid ""
"\"Then you'll return from whence you came, because we're not letting you "
"kill anyone.\""
msgstr "\"너는 어찌됐건 돌아올 거야. 우리는 네가 누구도 해치지 못하게 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "aea38ba0-f198-438d-8edd-7680a7590a17"
msgid ""
"\"You do know you are threatening a high priest and Hero of Lamashtu, don't "
"you? I didn't think barghests would dare kill any favored by the Great "
"Mother.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 사제이자 영웅을 위협하고 있는 거야? 거대한 악이 라마슈투의 축복을 받은 자를 죽이지는 않을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3c9f35b5-8a2d-45b9-a832-ff004e169d01"
msgid ""
"\"What terms did you agreed to? — Maybe you can turn this against her, get "
"your revenge.\""
msgstr "\"무슨 말에 동의한 거야? 아마 너는 이걸 그녀에게 되돌려줄 수 있을 거야. 복수해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "48625e18-7b1b-47ef-85ea-c19a9f2448ef"
msgid ""
"\"But... you told her you'd kill Nok-Nok. If you don't, you'll anger her. If "
"you do, then Lamashtu will get upset. My bet? I'd choose a fey's anger over "
"the Mother of Beasts – but you made the pact, you lie in it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... 네가 녹-녹을 죽일 거라고 말했다. 죽이지 않으면 그녀 화낸다. 죽이면 라마슈투 화낼 거다. 나? 나라면 페이의 분노를 "
"택하겠다. 하지만 결정은 네가 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "97080339-d53f-422e-b03e-5bb918b83efc"
msgid "\"Can you? That doesn't sound... binding.\""
msgstr "\"정말? 별로 믿기지 않는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "26b0df48-7c45-4b08-bb7b-5f750e9b85c4"
msgid "\"One of my allies? Why not me?\""
msgstr "\"내 동맹국 중 하나? 왜 내가 아니야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "f153fe7d-3e99-4b99-a279-debd72341eff"
msgid ""
"\"So you chose Nok-Nok. Very brave. Fighting me would have been more fun. "
"And fair.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 녹-녹을 선택했다. 아주 용감하다. 나랑 싸우면 재미 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "2a4eb794-ea16-49af-84a2-66a4154e44d8"
msgid ""
"\"Well, then, Nok-Nok, you are no longer my ally. And worse, you are not a "
"Hero, never were – I... I... I've always hated you, you... halfhead doorstop."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 너는 내 동료가 아니야. 녹-녹. 너는 영웅도 아니고. 나도 아니지만... 나는 네가 항상 싫었어. 이 미친 자식아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "e69d14aa-a9b4-409f-82dc-c8356a95c64a"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok, listen to me. Cut yourself now, let a drop of blood hit the "
"ground – then fight him only long enough to have him pin you with his foot, "
"kick you, anything – do that, and he vanishes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"녹-녹. 내 말을 들어. 네 몸에 생체기를 내. 피 한방울이 땅에 떨어지고 그와 싸워서 그가 너를 눕히고 밟게 둬. 그러면 그는 갈 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "b32da097-b2e3-43bb-a075-8671550d198e"
msgid ""
"[Let Nok-Nok fight his own battle] \"You'll have to fight him, Nok-Nok, you "
"have no other choice.\""
msgstr "[녹-녹이 자신의 싸움을 하도록 둡니다] \"너는 그와 싸워야 해. 녹-녹. 다른 선택의 여지가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0062_attackBarghest_Text
msgctxt "a23f0aad-9993-43cd-abad-1bebdf1f3e46"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's strike while it's frenzied!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"분위기가 뜨거울 때 공격하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "2b12585e-8cae-4935-a2d6-b15d727b0124"
msgid "\"Hold on – maybe it'll drive them all away.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 아마 이게 그들을 몰아낼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "27723dae-aae8-48e3-9908-6fcc55204a92"
msgid ""
"\"Now go out there and let him kick the hells out of you like a true goblin "
"hero.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가서 그가 고블린 영웅처럼 너를 걷어차게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "7500e20a-e92b-40e5-b359-163ddf53bdaf"
msgid ""
"\"It's our best bet to end this without more bloodshed. Well, you might get "
"hurt, but... forget it, go.\""
msgstr "\"피흘리지 않고 끝내는 게 최선이야. 다칠 수도 있겠지만... 괜찮아. 가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "0a0e0a68-bf4b-47bf-839e-28144aff8c9b"
msgid "\"Trust me, this will work.\""
msgstr "\"날 믿어. 잘 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0072_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "489beb50-a087-4900-b74d-9ea7ccb74e91"
msgid ""
"Ordered Nok-Nok to go out and die by barghest's claws. Or so he thought."
msgstr "녹-녹이 거대한 악의 마수에 죽게 합니다. 혹은 그렇게 생각하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "9145eab6-566e-4927-b5b1-b7d1fcaa4c10"
msgid "\"Stop questioning me and do as I command. Go.\""
msgstr "\"질문은 그만하고 하라는 대로 해. 가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "c51e92c0-97e3-4571-81bf-adea20656ee5"
msgid "\"Come on, Nok-Nok. Come on...\""
msgstr "\"어서. 녹-녹. 가라고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0076_Text
msgctxt "1be57f95-0755-42b6-96c4-64116cdb357a"
msgid "\"Get him, Nok-Nok!\""
msgstr "\"잡아. 녹-녹!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "7df912ec-f301-45ab-9581-e297ff35e1b5"
msgid ""
"\"Well, at least I'll have one less goblin to worry about this when this is "
"over.\""
msgstr "\"이 문제가 끝나면 골치 아픈 고블린이 하나 줄어들겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "283c9e26-2440-40d7-8066-d4ecad65fb49"
msgid "[Wait and see what happens]"
msgstr "[기다리면서 어떻게 되는지 봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0083_Text_String
msgctxt "a8042124-227f-47d1-93de-f37590792096"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok...?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0084_attackAll_Text_String
msgctxt "f3d374dc-516c-4338-87df-860c00a283d8"
msgid "[Attack] \"That does it. I'll deal with that creature myself.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그래. 이 녀석은 내가 해치우겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "2828d83d-a253-4879-95a8-4e752271dfc2"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok, get up!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 일어나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "f4d95987-51b3-4457-a36e-a83d6d81da62"
msgid "[Step forward] \"That does it!\""
msgstr "[앞으로 나갑니다] \"덤벼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0099_Text_String
msgctxt "23db380e-1b14-4b62-9ad2-75a4ff41bffb"
msgid ""
"\"It looks like we're done here – and looks like we scattered another "
"potential threat to the kingdom.\""
msgstr "\"여기 일은 끝난 것 같군. 이제 다른 위험을 찾으러 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0100_Text_String
msgctxt "ea28bd14-2dfb-4d7c-9897-e04546ba527c"
msgid ""
"\"Be silent, you've led us into enough messes for the day, don't let your "
"tongue lead you into another.\""
msgstr "\"조용히 해. 오늘 너희 때문에 골치 아팠으니 그만 나불거리라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Answer_0101_Text_String
msgctxt "b45acbab-6c38-4ca2-9999-cb5c01277ca1"
msgid ""
"\"If we've dealt with this challenge, we need to deal with other matters.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 이 문제를 해결했다면 다른 문제를 해결할 필요가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "553c2a91-ec03-49d5-b079-c3573adcb348"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks around, uncertain – you don't see anyone, and no goblin "
"shapes about – and no sign of a goblin camp, either. Something feels wrong – "
"there's a strange feel in the air, and that hint of sulfur, like you smelled "
"on Nok-Nok's cap in the throne room.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 주변을 둘러봅니다. 당신은 아무것도 발견하지 못합니다. 고블린이나 고블린 야영지도 없습니다. 뭔가 이상한 기운이 "
"느껴집니다. 알현실에서 녹-녹의 모자에서 맡았던 유황 냄새가 납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "35c16ce5-0381-480d-9213-21fe593ed6e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok speaks.{/n} \"This the place. But… {d|GoblinKing}King{/d} not "
"here yet?\" {n}Nok-Nok sounds slightly relieved – but he still looks ready "
"to bolt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 말합니다.{/n} \"이 곳이다. 하지만... {d|GoblinKing} 왕 {/d}은 아직 여기 없어? \" {n}녹 "
"녹은 약간 누그러졌지만 여전히 뛰쳐나갈 준비가 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4bae0e8f-e1e9-48d2-be2f-af405f4e3d76"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods... and as he does, you suddenly notice the surroundings melt "
"away into trails of acrid smoke... revealing a number of goblins, weapons at "
"the ready.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 고개를 끄덕입니다. 당신은 갑자기 주변이 자욱한 연기로 바뀌는 모습을 봅니다. 그것들은 무기를 든 고블린들이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "5d5b21d5-7a40-4d0d-8cc5-d9e7fca8721f"
msgid ""
"{n}Still, while their weapons are drawn, they do not attack – they have a "
"curious light in their eyes you haven't seen before – and it takes you a "
"second to realize its determination. They don't look scared at all, merely "
"stand at the ready, as if awaiting the command to attack.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여전히 그들의 무기는 뽑혀져있지만 공격은 하지 않았습니다. 그들은 이전에는 보지 못한 호기심이 서렸습니다. 이내 당신은 그것을 "
"깨닫습니다. 그들은 두려워하지 않고 명령을 내리면 언제든지 싸울 준비가 되어있는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "af7ab28d-58a1-4609-993b-e27752d25eb5"
msgid ""
"{n}As you take in your new opponents, a familiar figure emerges from the "
"tree line – but walking strangely, as if fighting the urge to hunch down on "
"all fours, almost feral.\n"
"The figure... looks... to be the Goblin King you recall, but something is "
"wrong about him – it's like someone tried to cram a larger creature inside "
"his skin. Tufts of fur, like that of a wolf, peak from his rags, and his "
"eyes, rather than dull and soft, seem to hold cold fire in them.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 새로운 적을 만나자 나무에서 새로운 적이 모습을 드러냅니다. 그들은 가까스로 전의를 숨기듯이 조심스럽게 걷습니다.\n"
"그것들은... 당신이 부른 고블린 왕 같지만 뭔가가 이상합니다. 그들은 무언가와 합쳐진 것 같습니다. 늑대의 털과 넝마 속에 숨겨져있는 "
"뿔, 그리고 그의 눈은 흐리멍텅함은 없고 차가운 불꽃이 일렁이는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "d4aac425-0928-433b-8425-b64265e6ede4"
msgid ""
"{n}The king approaches, then stops, his face peeling back into an almost-"
"demonic smile. This is not the king, but some creature wearing his shape.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}왕은 가까이 다가가 멈추었고 그의 얼굴은 악의에 찬 미소를 지었습니다. 그것은 왕이라기 보다는 왕의 탈을 쓴 다른 생명체 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0015_MungukAlive_Text
msgctxt "803efed4-2d4e-47dd-b2f4-bee375daed3b"
msgid ""
"{n}When you think it can't get any worse, there is a strangely familiar "
"thundering noise, and into the clearing lumbers none other than the hill "
"giant Munguk... and from the smell of it, he's definitely been drinking.\n"
"He stands behind the feral goblin king, his huge club of at the ready and "
"gives a low rumble, then snarls, pounding his chest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 상황이 최악이라고 생각할 때 언덕 거인 뭉국이 우뢰와 같이 포효합니다. 냄새로 보건데 술에 취한 것 같습니다.\n"
"그는 야생의 고블린 왕의 뒤에 서서 한 손에는 거대한 몽둥이를 들고 으르렁거리며 가슴을 쾅쾅 치고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "c2604a9f-784f-448a-82d6-7597f66c01d7"
msgid ""
"\"Munguk say he not like us play trick on him, keep him waiting,\" {n}Nok-"
"Nok whispers to you.{/n} \"He say hard to wait forever for promised love, it "
"worse than getting stabbed with lance.\" {n}Nok-Nok pauses.{/n} \"Lance not "
"kill him, though, I guess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭉국은 자기에게 속임수를 써서 계속 기다리게 만드는게 싫다고 말하고 있어.\" {n}녹-녹이 속삭입니다.{/n} \"약속된 사랑을 "
"기약없이 기다리는 것은 랜스에 찔리는 것보다 더 나쁘다고 하네.\" {n}녹-녹이 멈춥니다.{/n} \"랜스가 그를 죽이지는 않겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "53c1d9eb-a3e9-42be-8b37-21586381b202"
msgid ""
"\"Munguk say he not like us play trick on him, keep him waiting,\" {n}Nok-"
"Nok whispers to you.{/n} \"He say hard to wait forever for promised drinks, "
"it worse than getting stabbed with lance.\" {n}Nok-Nok pauses.{/n} \"Lance "
"not kill him, though, I guess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭉국은 자기에게 속임수를 써서 계속 기다리게 만드는게 싫다고 말하고 있어.\" {n}녹-녹이 속삭입니다.{/n} \"마실 것을 "
"기약없이 기다리는 건 랜스에 찔리는 것보다 더 나쁘다고 하네.\" {n}녹-녹이 멈춥니다.{/n} \"랜스가 그를 죽이지는 않겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "53d4fa3b-9e4a-4f3c-ab2c-82e7aae6ad39"
msgid ""
"{n}The king gazes at you, and you feel your scalp rise – as he speaks, his "
"voice is a rasp, like knives being dragged across metal plate.{/n}\n"
"\"Which of you was once ruled by this ragged shape I wear? The sooner your "
"blood coats the ground, the sooner my debt here is done – all you cattle "
"smell alike to me whether you walk or roast on a skewer.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왕이 당신을 바라보고 당신은 소름이 돋습니다. 그의 목소리는 쇳소리 같습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"너희 중 누가 이 누더기 입은 몸뚱이의 부하였나? 너희가 피를 흘려야 내 빚이 청산된다. 너희에게는 맛있는 냄새가 나는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "df4ca5f4-d34a-4bdf-8a37-4ab8ec794607"
msgid ""
"{n}The 'king' snarls.{/n} \"I'm a barghest. I was summoned at the behest of "
"a fey, to defeat an ally of one who claims this land… weakening this false "
"{mf|king|queen} when the time of reckoning draws near.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}'왕'이 으르렁 댑니다.{/n} \"나는 바게스트다. 어느 페이가 날 불러내서 이 땅을 차지하고 있는 자의 동료를 쓰러뜨려달라고 "
"했지... 심판의 시간이 가까워 졌을 때 이 거짓 {mf|왕|여왕}을 힘을 빼놓으려고 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "c173ff04-ac30-4711-9d96-898a08dc83c7"
msgid ""
"{n}He nods at Nok-Nok and gives a barking laugh.{/n} \"She said it could be "
"any I chose, so I chose the weakest one at your court, if only to fulfill my "
"debt all the quicker and leave this wretched place. The price was that I had "
"to take the shape of this...\" {n}He glances down at his body.{/n} \"..."
"humiliation.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 녹-녹에 고개를 끄덕이며 웃습니다.{/n} \"그녀는 내가 어느 녀석이든 선택해도 된다고 했다. 나는 너희 중 가장 약한 "
"녀석을 골라 빚을 어서 청산하고 여기를 떠날 것이다. 그 댓가는 이 몸뚱이지...\" {n}그는 시체를 봅니다.{/n} \"..."
"굴욕적이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "b9921a62-ae37-4880-bca0-213fc450fd61"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest growls... low in its throat, as if suspicious, then suddenly "
"stops, sniffing the air. It advances slowly, and Nok-Nok looks about to "
"withdraw, but you clamp him in place, forcing him to remain still.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바게스트는 의심하는 듯 으르렁거립니다. 멈추고는 허공에 대고 킁킁댑니다. 녹-녹이 뒷걸음질 치자 당신은 그를 진정시킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "82da2d53-1423-49c5-9d94-37c31911455a"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest gives another sniff, then backs away, snarling.{/n} \"It is "
"no matter, I'll kill another.\""
msgstr "{n}바게스트는 또 다시 킁킁대더니 으르렁거리며 물러납니다.{/n} \"상관 없다. 다른 녀석을 죽이면 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "87b94820-a4eb-43b3-97d9-9ad53017f4e1"
msgid ""
"\"Spout you lies elsewhere, false {mf|king|queen}. I have no need for them.\""
msgstr "\"말만 하면 거짓말이군. 그들은 필요 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "dac7b34e-a243-428d-89ba-c6b30d308a7d"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest growls, slowly and suspiciously, then to your surprise, "
"answers in clear, precise speech.{/n} \"When one of the allies of the "
"Pretender to the Throne of the Stolen Lands lies beneath my feet, and their "
"blood feeds the ground, I am freed – instantly, to return home and leave "
"this vile plane behind me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거대한 악은 천천히 으르렁거리고는 놀랍게도 또렷한 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"도둑맞은 땅의 거짓왕이 내 발 밑에 쓰러졌을 때 "
"나는 자유가 된다. 나는 집으로 돌아가 이 더러운 행성을 떠날 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "06fde29c-9503-4588-a59e-aa9800d9b943"
msgid ""
"\"The wording?\" {n}The beast glares at you.{/n} \"Do you take me for a fool?"
"\""
msgstr "\"속임수인가?\" {n}짐승은 당신을 노려보았습니다.{/n} \"나를 바보로 아나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "80ff32d9-5647-4905-94cd-8390c9a0f554"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest falls silent... and his eyes narrow suspiciously. Its skin "
"twitches, and its lips peel back to reveal its fangs... it looks furious – "
"but does not move to attack. In fact, it doesn't seem like it can... despite "
"the blood-thirsty look in its eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바게스트는 침묵하고 그의 눈의 의심으로 가늘어집니다. 그것의 피부가 꿈틀대고 입술에서 송곳니가 보입니다. 화난 것 같아서 곧 공격할 "
"듯합니다. 하지만 공격하지는 못할 것입니다. 눈에는 살의가 차있지만...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "22bc02f2-6edd-4c64-bcb2-d8c5282d72ae"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature snarls.{/n} \"I was told you are to be left for her. I care "
"not why – but should you cross me, I've been given leave to slay you as "
"well. It seems... she wishes you to suffer longer than this one...\" {n}It "
"grins wolfishly.{/n} \"For the fey and those of my kind... that will prove a "
"much longer time than your flesh can withstand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 생물체가 으르렁거립니다.{/n} \"너는 그녀의 몫이라고 들었다. 왜인지는 상관하지 않지만 날 공격하면 너를 죽일 것이다. "
"그녀는 네가 더 큰 고통을 겪고 싶어하는 것 같았지만...\" {n}그것은 늑대처럼 웃습니다.{/n} \"너의 몸뚱아리는 그 고통을 오래 "
"겪어야 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "6a14eca4-ee72-4d41-9ed5-19f3301d17be"
msgid ""
"{n}The 'King' turns to Nok-Nok.{/n} \"Come, goblin... the sooner I make a "
"sport of you, the sooner I will allow you to die... perhaps with your limbs "
"intact.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}'왕'이 녹-녹을 봅니다.{/n} \"이리 와라. 고블린... 네가 대들면 죽이기가 쉬워지지... 팔다리는 성히 남겨주마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "971c4176-b33e-43b9-b8c5-6d13702666bf"
msgid "\"This we will find out soon enough, false {mf|king|queen}.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 곧 알게 될 것이다. 가짜 {mf|왕|여왕}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a5d9273f-bfcc-41fb-8934-f68a432dd350"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you, surprised, his eyes wide – he looks genuinely hurt "
"at your words.{/n} \"Not a hero? Never was?\" {n}He pauses.{/n} \"Also... "
"doorstop?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 당신을 보고 놀라서 눈이 커집니다. 그는 당신 말에 상처를 받은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"영웅이 아니야? 한번도?\" {n}"
"그는 멈췄습니다.{/n} \"... 미치광이라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6da955f7-4be8-4e50-b65f-4ae2120c7e79"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you, perplexed... you realize he either doesn't believe "
"you or doesn't understand what you're doing.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 당황하고는 당신을 봅니다... 그는 당신의 말을 이해하지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "3aca32bd-c862-4563-b43e-98e09d554057"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature seeing Nok-Nok's lack of comprehension, laughs.{/n}\n"
"\"His split from you must be genuine, not some false oath or parlor trick. "
"As long as he remains your ally, then I am bound as well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 생명체가 이해력이 부족한 녹-녹을 보고 웃습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"가벼운 속임수 따위가 아니라 진실해야 한다. 그가 너의 동료로 남는 한 나도 떠나지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "58d5bf36-675c-40c5-bd18-47fe4c41ad76"
msgid ""
"{n}The expression on the King's face is much different – it is surprise, but "
"there is fear woven in as well.\n"
"Whatever you said, it worked... and you think it's placed the 'King' in a "
"bad position. You try to ignore Nok-Nok's broken gaze as you face the "
"barghest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}왕의 표정은 상당히 다릅니다. 놀람과 두려움이 섞여있습니다.\n"
"당신이 뭐라고 한들 믿을 것 같습니다... 왕은 약점을 잡힌 것 같습니다. 당신은 바게스트를 보면서 녹-녹의 상심한 표정을 무시하려 "
"노력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "07ab0fbc-4c76-42c6-a3e0-d25c2775a906"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature gives a snarl, then takes a step back, then another... as if "
"uncertain.{/n} \"It is no matter, I'll kill another of your allies.\""
msgstr "{n}그 생물은 으르렁 거리며 물러나고는 계속해서 물러납니다.{/n} \"상관 없다. 너의 다른 동료를 죽일 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "ec8915a6-2fe4-41c6-a3da-c68ace915d4a"
msgid ""
"{n}Instead, the barghest gives a blood-curdling howl, ichor spitting from "
"its maw. It claws at the ground, ripping up great chunks of earth, then, "
"swipes at you in a frenzied launch — and backs away, as if seeking to reach "
"you, but unable to do so past some unseen force. Nok-Nok, behind an "
"invisible wall formed by the shrieking beast, shrinks in terror.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}대신 바게스트는 피에 굶주린 울음 소리를 냅니다. 그는 바닥의 흙을 한움쿰 쥐어서 당신에게 뿌리면서 물러납니다. 당신에게 다가갈 것 "
"같지만 실제로 그렇지는 않습니다. 녹-녹은 그 짐승이 만든 투명한 벽 뒤에서 공포에 떨고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "e6b70f06-fcd9-4338-81ae-5ce817fcfb5c"
msgid ""
"{n}The other goblins in the circle seem to withdraw as well, terrified – "
"whatever was keeping them at attention is broken, and you see fear coming in "
"their eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}원안에 있는 다른 고블린들도 물론 두려워합니다. 주의를 끌던 것이 없어져도 그들의 눈에는 공포가 가득합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "ec6e2cdf-5159-4357-8366-ebd587ef2d73"
msgid ""
"{n}The other goblins in the circle seem to withdraw as well, terrified – "
"even Munguk seems surprised by the infernal fit – the hill giant backs away, "
"as if from a rabid dog.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}원 안에 있는 다른 고블린들도 겁에 질린 듯 두려워합니다. 뭉국조차 놀라서 미친개를 피하는 듯 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "50cc4491-9753-439f-a9eb-09aa72409bf4"
msgid ""
"{n}Taking advantage of the creature's mad rage, you leap to attack — the "
"creatures in the clearing falter, seeming hesitant to charge you and Nok-"
"Nok, or get anywhere close to the tricked beast... you take advantage of the "
"chaos and use their fear against them!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}창조물의 광기의 도움으로 당신은 도약해서 공격합니다. 그 생명체들은 당신과 녹-녹을 공격하기 주저하며 다른 짐승에 가까이 가는 것을 "
"주저하는 것 같습니다. 당신은 혼란과 그들의 두려움을 이용합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "a61858e1-93fc-49b4-b99c-c3b1d2f8338f"
msgid ""
"{n}As you leap to attack, the barghest gives a howl, and the surrounding "
"creatures charge you and Nok-Nok, echoing the barghest's howl.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 도약해서 공격하자 바게스트는 울음소리를 내었고 그 소리를 따라하며 주위의 생명체들이 당신과 녹-녹에게 달려듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "8d4a5c61-66af-4555-9159-502d542dead9"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks at you blankly.{/n} \"Let him kick me? Not sure like this "
"plan...\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 당신을 멍하니 바라 보았습니다.{/n} \"그가 나를 차게 놔둬? 이 계획이 마음에 들지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "0ac9851d-2548-4762-a243-317c2272280e"
msgid ""
"{n}Wasting no time, you grab his hand, and keeping it from view of the "
"barghest, slice it enough to let blood fall on the ground. Nok-Nok stares at "
"his bleeding palm, until you forcibly curl his fingers back into his "
"palm.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시간을 낭비하지 않고 당신은 그의 손을 잡아 거대한 악의 시야에서 당겨내고는 그것을 벱니다. 녹-녹은 그가 피를 흘리는 모습을 "
"멍하게 보다가 당신의 도움으로 정신을 차립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0251d98b-e0a8-4e5e-bb10-9891358d1b3d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok advances slowly, and the barghest watches coldly, squatting "
"slightly. Nok-Nok makes a strange sound in his chest, you realize he's "
"speaking as if trying to soothe a guard dog, but no words are coming "
"out...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 천천히 전진하고 바게스트는 차갑게 응시합니다. 녹-녹은 이상한 소리를 내었는데 당신은 그가 성난 개를 다독이는 것 같다고 "
"생각합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "1c7537d6-1267-4ce9-bdf2-06f6faea5e0a"
msgid ""
"{n}As he is about to reach the eager barghest, Nok-Nok stumbles, then falls "
"face first... into the fire. Screaming, he howls and begins to jump in "
"place, waving his hands in pain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그가 거대한 악에 닿으려 할 때 녹-녹이 비틀거려 넘어져 불 속으로 뛰어듭니다. 비명을 지르며 그는 점프하면서 양 팔을 고통으로 "
"휘휘 젓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "7bacbaaf-a966-4447-99d7-17b43fbec600"
msgid ""
"{n}Rather than attacking, the assembled creatures watch in surprise – and "
"then, strangely begin to howl with laughter... infuriating the barghest.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}공격하지 않는 조립된 생명체는 놀랐지만 이내 이상한 웃음소리를 내어 바게스트의 화를 돋굽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "de257b1e-af71-4c27-b123-a2f854263c01"
msgid ""
"{n}Snarling, the \"king\" leaps forward and hoists Nok-Nok into the air, "
"then extends a claw – if you don't act, Nok-Nok will be gutted. Nok-Nok "
"chokes and struggles in the creature's grip, helplessly...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}으르렁거리면서 왕은 앞으로 뛰어들어 녹-녹을 집어들어 올리고는 손톱을 보입니다. 조치를 취하지 않는다면 녹-녹은 그 손톱에 당할 "
"것입니다. 녹-녹은 빠져나오려 노력하지만 소용이 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "5f349440-9e7d-4178-99d4-edbdd63b0b8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Snarling, the \"king\" leaps forward and knocks Nok-Nok to the ground, "
"then begins to kick him a few times – you wince as you see one of Nok-Nok's "
"teeth fly free from a kick, arcing through the air. Nok-Nok manages another "
"scream, cut off as the barghest grinds its foot into his face, extinguishing "
"the flames and his screams.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}으르렁거리면서 왕은 앞으로 뛰어들어 녹-녹을 내동댕이 치고는 걷어찹니다. 발차기에 녹-녹의 이빨이 날아오르는 모습을 보자 당신을 "
"찡그립니다. 녹-녹은 다시 비명을 지르며 바게스트의 발차기를 막습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "964d2067-362d-470b-9f1a-4b350bf36f04"
msgid ""
"{n}When the unfortunate goblin is put out, the barghest glares at the "
"surrounding creatures, and gives a snarl. Their laughter falls silent...\n"
"...all except one, a new voice, a little shaky, but one you recognize.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}불행한 고블린이 쓰러지자 바게스트는 주위 생명체를 보며 으르렁거립니다. 그들의 웃음이 침묵으로 변합니다...\n"
"...그 중에 하나가 날카로운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "872bc101-b41a-4bcb-912a-8ab198c8466a"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok, bleeding from his split lip and kicks to the face, however, "
"gives weak laugh.{/n} \"Me beneath foot, blood...\" {n}While blood already "
"lies on the ground, Nok-Nok spits for good measure – adding more red to the "
"ground.{/n} \"...on dirt. Promise to mean flower lady done?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}찢어진 입술에서 피가흐르는 녹-녹은 힘없이 웃습니다.{/n} \"나 밑에 피...\" {n}피가 땅을 적셨고 녹-녹은 피를 뱉어내자 "
"땅이 더 붉게 물듭니다.{/n} \"...흘렸다. 땅에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "21ae65f4-de3d-4eff-8535-50f66b437273"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest's hand lashes through the air and impales itself in Nok-"
"Nok's neck... the tiny goblin wriggles for a moment... then you watch him "
"fall still. The barghest grins, then turns to you.{/n} \"Creature died "
"quicker than I'd like... but I'll take my time with you. I'll tell she who "
"commands me there simply was no other choice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바게스트는 허공에 손을 뻗고 녹-녹의 목을 낚아챕니다. 작은 고블린은 떠올랐지만 이내 떨어져 쓰러집니다. 바게스트가 당신을 보고 "
"웃습니다.{/n} \"생물은 내가 원하는 것보다 더 빨리 죽는다... 하지만 네가 있으니 괜찮다. 그녀에게는 변명하면 그만이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "ade610b5-fcbd-4c5a-8183-d55bc6a2c51f"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest freezes in shock, then suddenly vanishes, leaving Nok-Nok "
"alone on the ground. The surrounding goblins blink, as if a spell is "
"removed... even Munguk looks confused by what has happened. Their shock "
"won't last long.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바게스트는 얼어붙어 갑자기 사라졌고 녹-녹만 남았습니다. 주위의 고블린들이 눈을 껌뻑입니다. 뭉국도 무슨 일이 일어 났는지 "
"혼란스러워합니다. 그들의 충격은 오래 가지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "75fdb549-5126-419b-bb32-c5ea47e106f4"
msgid ""
"{n}The barghest freezes in shock, then suddenly vanishes, leaving Nok-Nok "
"alone on the ground. The surrounding goblins blink, as if a spell is "
"removed... their shock won't last long.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바게스트는 얼어붙어 갑자기 사라졌고 녹-녹만 남았습니다. 주위의 고블린들이 눈을 껌뻑입니다. 그들의 충격은 오래 가지 "
"않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "1ab2dff9-3a44-45ca-955b-ad78c81e9020"
msgid ""
"{n}As the barghest howls in frustration, the creatures, first one, then "
"another, begin to run, then all of them rout, desperate to get away from the "
"mad creature.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바게스트가 좌절에 울음 소리를 내자 한 생명체가 미친듯이 달리면서 미친 생명체에게 멀어지기 위해 노력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingBargest
msgctxt "f7e9b4d4-5d55-40b0-9a76-c4b1086f7cff"
msgid ""
"{n}As the beasts flee, the barghest remains… and then gives one last, choked "
"snarl – and vanishes, leaving the faint smell of sulfur in the air. You "
"suspect that his failure will likely not end well for him no matter where he "
"returns to… but for now, the clearing is silent except for you and Nok-"
"Nok.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}짐승이 달아나자 바게스트는 으르렁거리며 사라집니다. 허공에는 유황 냄새만이 남습니다. 그가 실패한 것 같았고 지금은 당신과 녹-녹을 "
"제외하고는 모두 조용합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0097_Text_String
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "332e988e-c1eb-461b-b210-5514a17b0216"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok gives a half-smile, then nods at you.{/n} \"Not so hard. Tell you "
"Mother of Beasts watch over me, she not let another beast get to me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 한쪽 입꼬리를 올리며 당신에게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"어렵지 않았다. 짐승의 어머니께서 나를 돌봐주셨다. 그녀는 "
"다른 짐승을 보내지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barghest/Cue_0102_Text_String
msgctxt "390a0e76-1870-478e-86aa-e92fa6506ea2"
msgid ""
"\"Still — would like to speak with you later. Need... something.\" {n}Nok-"
"Nok seems lost in thought.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너와 다음에 이야기 한다. 필요하다. 뭔가가...\" {n}녹-녹은 골몰히 생각합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barks/Munguk_happy_String
msgctxt "27186f7a-f815-4a1d-8293-19d984f64de2"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok! Nok-Nok! Nok-Nok!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹! 녹-녹! 녹-녹!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barks/goblin_happy1_String
msgctxt "b9981937-9c5c-445d-aa89-acbb407493a7"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok be great hero!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 위대한 영웅이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barks/goblin_happy2_String
msgctxt "f943b16a-55f6-4d21-8ebe-d383da1f01c5"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok our hero! And you — you make good sidekick!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 우리의 영웅! 그리고 너! 너는 좋은 조수가 된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/Barks/goblin_happy3_String
msgctxt "346cee26-24d1-48e7-9d2c-6abb501a114c"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok new King!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹! 새로운 왕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "744c2b6d-bc62-4393-ba06-26cf8178fee6"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok has won, beaten your false king. Hail Nok-Nok!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 거짓 왕을 쓰러뜨렸다. 녹-녹 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e6458a3e-a667-4f5f-a46f-7b58fe2d2b9b"
msgid ""
"\"Raise your weapons to Nok-Nok, you beasts – he's your new master now!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹을 위해 무기를 들어라. 그가 너희의 새로운 주인이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e37cab1e-edec-4ee1-a85b-73cd25d4ba87"
msgid ""
"\"Hold on – maybe the disappearance of the 'King' will drive them all away.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만. 아마도 '왕'의 실종이 그들을 모두 몰아낼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0ef9e9b4-ff31-4e76-aa81-6a26e6577155"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"We can't let them scatter! Strike now while they're surprised!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그들이 흩어지게 두지 마! 놀랐을 때 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "03fdbdf2-8851-48d7-af73-6122fa40e92e"
msgid ""
"[Gesture at surrounding crowd] \"You did it, Nok-Nok. You wanted to be a "
"Hero – here you are.\""
msgstr "[둘러싼 군중들을 가리킵니다] \"잘했어. 녹-녹. 영웅이 되고 싶었지? 기회가 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "6f1d35b4-ffb8-4aee-9590-2b04937afd2c"
msgid "\"Uh... don't turn anymore, Nok-Nok. Please.\""
msgstr "\"어... 더 이상 돌지 마. 녹-녹. 제발.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "e3ed6aec-4a68-45b0-8f94-d4e6e3e493e2"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok, just stand still and enjoy this.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹. 그냥 서서 즐겨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "866e9d05-a70f-4adc-bd5f-b0fe8040bb46"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok is picking himself up, but it's clear he has no idea what to do "
"next, oblivious to the potential threats waking up around him, still rubbing "
"his face to brush off the blood and ash... and he's starting to glance "
"around, distractedly looking for his teeth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 정신을 차리고 있지만 무엇을 해야할지 여전히 모르는 것 같습니다. 그를 둘러싼 자들에게서 위험이 감지되었고 그의 얼굴에는 "
"여전히 피와 재가 뒤덮여있습니다... 그는 주위를 둘러보더니 자신의 이빨을 찾습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "988b0a19-8953-4b3b-9d86-219da32e7ab8"
msgid ""
"{n}The surrounding creatures jump at your words, including Nok-Nok – he then "
"watches as the eyes turn to him.\n"
"Then, one at first, then more, the goblins begin to strike the butt of their "
"weapons against the ground… slowly, then faster and faster, doing two quick "
"strikes, a pause, and two strikes again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹과 당신에게 주위의 생명체들이 달려들었고 녹-녹은 경계를 합니다.\n"
"고블린들이 하나 둘 씩 무기의 꽁무니로 바닥을 치기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d023cd7b-8208-4d68-a5e6-e342476a3675"
msgid "{n}The surrounding creatures keep silent.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주변의 생물은 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f7ba37af-ebc3-4352-8089-62ca225358c2"
msgid ""
"{n}The creatures, at the defeat of their King, file away slowly, melting "
"back into the trees, until it's only you and Nok-Nok again. It's time to "
"go.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}왕이 패배를 하자 생명체들은 천천히 물러나기 시작합니다. 그들이 나무 뒤로 숨어들자 당신과 녹-녹만이 남습니다. 이제 가야 할 "
"시간입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "aa427f96-8665-426e-818b-39a870b5e0d2"
msgid "\"Stab time! But need talk to you later. Need... something.\""
msgstr "\"찌를 시간이야! 얘기는 다음에 하자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Munguk
msgctxt "9813c8b1-aaf9-4388-a021-80a03bcd31b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Even Munguk, puzzled, begins to join in, pounding the butt of his club "
"unsteadily into the ground, then smiling, he pounds the club faster and "
"faster... he must be really drunk or was really under the barghest's spell. "
"Or arguably both.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뭉국조차 어리둥절해 하며 몽둥이로 바닥을 불안정하게 두드리기 시작합니다. 미소를 짓더니 바닥을 더욱 빠르게 두드립니다. 술이 많이 "
"취했거나 바게스트의 마법에 걸린 게 분명해요. 아니면 둘 다 이거나요.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "53d24c04-237a-4909-9d5f-0595a59e1daa"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok looks enthralled. He does quarter-turns, looking at all the "
"goblins worshipping him, his jaw agape. You notice he's still a bit "
"unsteady, and swaying slightly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 흥분합니다. 그는 네바퀴를 회전하며 자신을 숭배하는 고블린들을 보고는 턱이 쩍 벌어집니다. 그는 여전히 "
"불안정해보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "756d5388-90d1-4e11-863a-c2f9048bef94"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok follows your gesture, and as he turns...\n"
"...but already unsteady, he twists and falls again, collapsing to the ground "
"– the drumming falls awkwardly silent with a few gasps, then laughing from "
"the goblins.\n"
"To his credit, Nok-Nok picks himself up and dusts himself off, then the "
"drumming resumes. He's giving a half-smile, as if he's not certain of his "
"own success.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 당신을 따라하며 휙 돕니다...\n"
"...하지만 이미 균형을 잃었던 그는 비틀거리며 바닥에 넘어집니다. 바닥을 두드리는 소리가 멈추고 어색한 숨소리만이 들립니다. 이내 "
"고블린들의 웃음이 터집니다.\n"
"녹-녹은 먼지를 털고 일어났고 두드리는 소리가 계속됩니다. 그는 자신의 성공에 만족한듯 한쪽 입꼬리가 올라갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/3-KingsRevenge/afterBattle/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "34350cdd-89dd-422b-b5db-abb39b8f25c3"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok, as dizzy as he is, listens to you – he stops turning, and plants "
"his feet firmly to prevent himself from collapsing, accidentally striking a "
"heroic pose by doing so.\n"
"The drumming of spears continues, and he puffs up proudly – while you hope "
"it doesn't go to his head, you silently remind yourself that it wouldn't "
"stay there long anyway.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 어지러운 듯 하지만 당신의 말을 듣습니다. 그는 회전을 멈추고 가까스로 넘어지는 것을 견디고는 갑자기 멋있는 포즈를 "
"취합니다.\n"
"날카로운 울림이 계속되고 그는 의기양양하게 콧방귀를 낍니다. 당신은 그것이 오래가지 않을 거라 스스로 설득합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/LongLegs_destroy_String
msgctxt "74666a73-6428-4d12-b3f6-47168278177b"
msgid "\"This be King Nok-Nok meeting other King. We tear it down now!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 왕이 다른 왕 만났다. 우리가 찢어버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/LongLegs_keep_String
msgctxt "8ef5721d-499e-46f8-b612-623c97ccfbaf"
msgid "\"This be King Nok-Nok meeting other King.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹 왕이 다른 왕 만났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/Nok_destroy_String
msgctxt "bae2a64e-2274-407c-8043-e4dab2d6662e"
msgid "\"Knees or neck first...?\""
msgstr "\"무릎이 먼저냐. 목이 먼저냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/Nok_keep_String
msgctxt "cbc34895-8591-4c51-9073-b251ceb38e2a"
msgid "\"It's... perfect!\""
msgstr "\"완벽해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/Statue_bark_String
msgctxt "2dfe8d47-8bb8-42c8-95d6-a2ddf04e3655"
msgid "A crude statue of what seems to be Nok-Nok and you."
msgstr "녹-녹과 당신으로 보이는 조잡한 동상입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/goblin1_destroy_String
msgctxt "b4ce760e-e504-4c5a-9f06-dd0b6ab1ceb3"
msgid "\"You order destroy things! You be good King!\""
msgstr "\"너는 파괴했다! 너 좋은 왕이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/goblin1_keep_String
msgctxt "e3af2c6f-e069-40e6-b540-3651b10e3586"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok be true Hero!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 진정한 영웅이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/goblin2_destroy_String
msgctxt "28195d6e-3797-4558-b398-5f63694918bb"
msgid "\"When we tear it down, i want its head!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 그것을 찢으면 나는 머리를 가질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/goblin2_keep_String
msgctxt "d3a2bc78-1d8e-4d97-8a2e-ea1445ca58a3"
msgid "\"You happy Nok-Nok allows you travel with him?\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 너와 함께 여행해서 기뻐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/goblin3_destroy_String
msgctxt "fef37cb4-b2a9-4461-ada8-dfed339ebef9"
msgid "\"Stupid statue be stone. No can burn it!\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 조각상은 돌이다. 태울 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Barks/goblin3_keep_String
msgctxt "bbaa4b63-569e-4eeb-9d9d-bb94533ffe1a"
msgid "\"King Nok-Nok kicked me once. So strong! Good King!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 한 번 나를 찼어. 너무 강해! 좋은 왕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6948c60a-2401-4936-a6be-5bc63d8f6d71"
msgid "\"What... what is this?\""
msgstr "\"뭐야...이게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0acdbe00-fbcd-4ee4-a972-36793b3541ba"
msgid "\"Did a giant come by and vomit this out?\""
msgstr "\"거인이 와서 이것을 토해냈어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "c43d1b05-ac71-4c6a-ae35-c027e18f7c98"
msgid "\"Where did the glass on that statue's head come from?\""
msgstr "\"잔 위에 동상 머리는 어디서 났어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "905114b6-854a-457c-af5c-b8bc14fc254c"
msgid "\"You built a statue. Of yourself. Right near the city.\""
msgstr "\"너 동상 세웠다. 너의 동상. 도시 주위에 세웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0d67c679-7d9f-4622-acfd-57c2886b7346"
msgid "\"I... like it.\""
msgstr "\"조... 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "ed28fefa-1320-4002-bdb0-c6748ecf6522"
msgid "\"All right. It can stay.\""
msgstr "\"알았어. 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c1b7d0f1-4890-4167-96ea-31da4de00f7e"
msgid "\"Tear this thing down. Carefully.\""
msgstr "\"부셔. 조심해서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "77c0b7ba-8882-4d6c-b60e-f55d010b284a"
msgid "\"Remove it, or I'll hang you from it.\""
msgstr "\"없애버려. 아니면 동상에 너를 매달아버린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "6481da42-fb3d-4595-8bb1-a9a48df82375"
msgid "\"Wait, you actually think... never mind.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 너 정말로... 아니야. 신경쓰지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "19896fcf-e4b8-4a81-8238-f2f3b5e0d20b"
msgid "\"I'll let you have your way. This time.\""
msgstr "\"이번에 너를 그냥 두겠어. 이번만은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "dea56232-c455-4639-b641-21c33e026746"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind. Tear it down.\""
msgstr "\"마음이 바뀌었다. 부셔버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "54dbc678-a320-48f2-8756-04b3609bb74f"
msgid "\"I'm serious. Tear this down.\""
msgstr "\"진심이야. 부셔버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e23cdbdf-baea-45ee-b3ef-f61fbb20cf29"
msgid "\"I said, remove it, or I'll hang you from it.\""
msgstr "\"없애라고 했어. 아니면 너를 저기에 매달아버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3e858880-da6e-4946-a99b-53d831e2c47a"
msgid "\"I'll leave you to it, but when I return, it better be gone.\""
msgstr "\"내버려두지. 하지만 다시 돌아왔을 때는 없어야 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "feb4b7ec-d1a8-46a5-9a4e-6c805e6b1587"
msgid "\"Just remove it from my sight. I have other matters to attend to.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 내 눈에 띄지 않게 해. 나는 다른 문제가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6df65335-e31a-456d-880e-e10f5a41de70"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok is standing proudly, regarding the statues before you – the "
"statues are strangely ghastly and majestic at the same time, two figures "
"fashioned from cobbled bits of stone, wood, and something that might be "
"either mud, plaster – or – judging by the smell — something from the "
"cistern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹록은 당신 앞의 조각상을 보고 자랑스럽게 서있습니다. 조각상은 돌과 나무를 진흙과 회 반죽으로 두 개의 상을 만들었는데 냄새가 "
"나고 섬뜩하면서 뭔가 웅장하고 이상합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "edac0ec9-ea81-492a-9756-4865bb608e91"
msgid ""
"{n}The statue on the right looks vaguely like a giant version of Nok-Nok – "
"and the other looks to be... something? Maybe a {race}, but it is of equal "
"height to the figure on the left. Broken glass from what you strongly "
"suspect might have been a castle window rings the '{race}' figure's head "
"like a crown.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}오른쪽에 있는 동상은 거대한 녹-녹 같습니다. 다른 것은... 형체를 알 수 없습니다. 아마 {race} 같습니다. 하지만 크기가 "
"오른쪽의 것과 같습니다. 아마 성의 깨진 유리로 만든 것 같은 왕관이 {race}의 머리에 쓰여있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "7f1df9a1-915d-44c5-b54a-35c9e9a5cbaf"
msgid ""
"{n}As you study the two odd-looking statues, Nok-Nok notices you and "
"smiles.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}이상한 두 개의 동상을 보면서 녹-녹은 당신을 보고 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "622510c5-8da8-4c8d-a5cc-9e3d1ee7fdf2"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shakes his head and snorts.{/n} \"No. Look harder.\" {n}He "
"frowns.{/n} \"Harder. See?\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아니. 잘 봐.\" {n}그는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"집중 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ef468f94-ea4d-4c1e-a5ee-d50d9bb1ec05"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok shrugs.{/n} \"Found it. After castle window break. Because rock "
"fly through it, like bird, but no wings. Not know where rock come from, "
"where going, but it left glass behind.\" {n}He smiles, then nods at the "
"statues.{/n} \"Make nice crown for you. See?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"발견했다. 성의 유리가 깨졌다. 돌멩이가 새처럼 날라다녔다. 날개는 없었다. 돌이 어디서 "
"왔는지 모른다. 하지만 유리조각 만들었다.\" {n}그는 웃으며 동상을 보고 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"너를 위해 좋은 왕관을 만들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "7689eb6f-4896-4be8-a4fc-78d83c8e9cca"
msgid ""
"{n}With a flourish, Nok-Nok points to the twisted mass of junk.{/n} \"TWO "
"heroes. Me, big Hero...\" {n}He nods at one of the figure.{/n} \"With other, "
"smaller Big Hero.\" {n}He nods to the ramshackle crowned figure on the "
"right, towering the same size as the Nok-Nok statue.{/n} \"You. Both of us "
"Heroes, together.\" {n}He nods, then continues, as if self-evident.{/n} \"All"
" heroes have statues. But no inscriptions. Words.\" {n}He shudders and makes "
"a semi-circle in the air, as if to ward off evil.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}웃으면서 녹-녹은 쓰레기 같은 덩어리를 가리킵니다.{/n} \"두 영웅이다. 나는 큰 영웅...\" {n}그는 동상 중 하나를 보고 "
"고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"다른 건 작은 큰 영웅이다.\" {n}그는 왕관 같은 것을 쓴 녹-녹의 동상과 같은 크기의 동상을 보고 "
"고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"너다. 우리 모두 영웅. 둘 다.\" {n}그는 자신있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"모든 영웅 조각상 "
"있다. 하지만 비문 없다.\" {n}그는 떨면서 악을 물리치는 듯 허공에 반원을 그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "2d88061f-37c5-47d5-adcf-922292863b1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok nods proudly.{/n} \"Of course you like it, it's perfect!\" {n}He "
"appraises the two statues, judging them side-by-side.{/n} \"Even got height "
"right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 자랑스럽게 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"물론. 너 좋아한다. 완벽하다!\" {n}그는 두 동상을 보고 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} "
"\"높이도 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "a574491d-1307-4fdf-9a99-f3b2ede55320"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok suddenly turns to you, mimicking what you suddenly realize is the "
"pose the statues are in.{/n} \"Ready to stab, just point the way... two "
"Heroes, against big beasts of the Stolen Lands!\" {n}He pauses, then leans "
"in.{/n} \"But you handle bigger beasts, Nok-Nok watch.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 갑자기 당신을 보고는 동상과 같은 모습을 취합니다.{/n} \"찌를 준비 됐다. 길을 가리키는 거다... 두 영웅은 "
"도둑맞은 땅의 괴물 잡는다!\" {n}그는 멈추고 기댑니다.{/n} \"하지만 너는 더 큰 짐승 잡고 녹-녹은 지켜본다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "52f2c23a-ff85-4562-af47-6f5ce8f37d8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok doesn't seem to have heard you.{/n} \"No need, it's already up, "
"no need to tear it down!\" {n}He appraises the two statues, judging them "
"side-by-side.{/n} \"Even got height right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 당신의 말을 듣지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"필요 없다. 이미 지었다. 부술 필요 없다!\" {n}그는 두 동상을 보고 "
"고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"높이도 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "b7443335-5c61-4d66-b057-03ba898ecccc"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok doesn't seem to have heard you.{/n} \"Yes, perfect.\" {n}He "
"echoes, then sighs slightly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 당신의 말을 듣지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"완벽해.\" {n}그는 얕은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "a46e3407-158c-48e8-8139-9f6dcec055ce"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok turns to you and blinks. As he looks at you, his ears begin "
"drooping bit by bit, until they hand limply from his skull. Then he "
"brightens.{/n} \"Tearing it down – that will be fun.\" {n}He gives a grin, "
"then turns to the statues, as if appraising where to attack them first.{/n} "
"\"Maybe go for knees first. Or neck. Or...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹이 당신을 보고는 눈을 껌뻑입니다. 그의 귀가 점점 쳐져 그의 머리를 덮습니다. 이내 그는 밝아집니다.{/n} \"부순다. "
"재밌을 거야.\" {n}그는 미소를 지으며 동상을 어디서부터 부술지 가늠하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"무릎 먼저... 아니면 목을...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/NokNok/4-Statue/Statue/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "cf684d2d-1d46-4f5a-9b2f-9a92b9a7e478"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok doesn't seem to have heard – he has gone from appraising the "
"statue to intently delivering short cracks with a hammer to the knees and "
"feet of the statues. He seems lost in the activity and doesn't stop to speak "
"as you depart.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 듣지 않은 것 같습니다. 그는 동상의 무릎을 망치로 내려쳐서 작은 균열을 만듭니다. 그는 말하는 것을 멈추지 "
"않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_OctReg_1_String
msgctxt "1a946745-9ab2-43ac-8d0c-30c3e1ccaa8f"
msgid "\"Return the Technic League's property, and no one needs to get hurt!\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹의 소유물을 돌려보내라. 그러면 누구도 다칠 필요가 없을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_OctReg_2_String
msgctxt "d3a2be09-1620-4a21-a037-2013b55813be"
msgid "\"Harboring runaway slaves is punishable by death!\""
msgstr "\"도망 노예를 숨겨 주는 건 사형으로 처벌받는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_OctReg_3_String
msgctxt "3759b988-6f41-48a2-82e2-db8c81b7c1ea"
msgid "\"Hey, those are Technic League goods! Stop right there!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 그들은 기술 연맹의 소유물이다! 거기 서라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_Octavia_1_String
msgctxt "5964566f-26b5-48ee-b5d7-550530c2635f"
msgid "\"Where are you going, Octavia? Your master misses you!\""
msgstr "\"어디 가는 거야. 옥타비아? 너의 주인이 그리워할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_Octavia_2_String
msgctxt "ea8321e5-dec1-43c8-b81f-11f11fea7c1b"
msgid "\"Come, Octavia! We're taking you back to your rightful place!\""
msgstr "\"가자. 옥타비아! 네가 있어야 할 곳으로 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_Regongar_1_String
msgctxt "b5b92659-6c4a-4b1e-998f-44e20f6fad18"
msgid "\"Hold, Regongar! Your owners are here!\""
msgstr "\"멈춰라, 레곤가르! 네 주인이 여기 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/PersonalEnemies/Barks/TechLeague_Regongar_2_String
msgctxt "4634ff03-4761-4ddd-855c-76e2168a9126"
msgid "\"Look, it's Regongar! Get him!\""
msgstr "\"저기봐, 레곤가르잖아! 잡아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Burning_slaves_1_String
msgctxt "0cb6c8ad-2688-45b9-a7c0-e8bd3ec65490"
msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Burning_slaves_2_String
msgctxt "f2cafa23-49a3-4ad5-84e8-55e671f0fc17"
msgid "\"No! Please!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 제발!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Burning_slaves_3_String
msgctxt "42241cdb-5f96-4005-98f7-3671269b6fba"
msgid "\"Please don't leave us here!\""
msgstr "\"제발 우릴 남겨두고 떠나지 말아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Burning_slaves_4_String
msgctxt "74aa77d8-94e1-4eb6-b1fe-f29eb49849c3"
msgid "\"It burns!\""
msgstr "\"불이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Burning_slaves_5_String
msgctxt "b3f2eb2d-aa7f-4b46-958b-f5977968b140"
msgid "\"Ahem, ah... So much smoke!\""
msgstr "\"에헴, 아... 연기가 너무 많아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Dwarf_cobbler_String
msgctxt "a5a85ea9-8ffe-4479-a63d-324cbe135577"
msgid "\"They're coming! Guards! Everyone, here!\""
msgstr "\"온다! 경비병! 모두, 여기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Janush_Firestarter_String
msgctxt "15de00cf-8a82-42c7-925e-2b3c63d1467e"
msgid "\"This should hold you!\""
msgstr "\"이걸로 너흴 붙잡아 둘 수 있겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/League_1_String
msgctxt "9f388722-9537-450c-a1fd-b0c76e490b09"
msgid "\"The Technic League always gets what's theirs!\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹은 언제나 자신의 소유물을 되찾는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/League_2_String
msgctxt "ccd5c54a-ec7a-4f31-a69e-8d1463191eb7"
msgid "\"Seize them! Tie them up!\""
msgstr "\"잡아라! 묶어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/League_3_String
msgctxt "79208b5f-1f78-488b-aff4-6005dd3efd17"
msgid "\"Maestro Janush, where are you? We need backup!\""
msgstr "\"마에스트로 Janush, 어디 계십니까? 지원군이 필요합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/League_4_String
msgctxt "abaa1b86-629c-4120-83e5-e832b015c105"
msgid ""
"\"That's the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! The Maestro promised a reward "
"for {mf|his|her} head!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이다! 마에스트로께서 {mf|저놈|저년} 머리에 현상금을 약속하셨다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/League_5_String
msgctxt "f4fe52f1-a921-4294-b9c2-63711fbd5557"
msgid "\"You fools came to us! You won't leave here alive!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 놈들! 살아서 돌아갈 생각은 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Octavia_Interrupt_String
msgctxt "25f63865-b14f-4e06-9f99-94ff96226d4a"
msgid "\"No way!\""
msgstr "\"말도 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Slaves_free_1_String
msgctxt "4fa62ef8-da41-4d6f-89ea-f88c609fcce4"
msgid "\"Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Slaves_free_2_String
msgctxt "10934178-d010-4239-ace2-56238db38b67"
msgid "\"Gods bless you!\""
msgstr "\"신들이 당신들을 축복하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Barks/Slaves_free_3_String
msgctxt "5b3f3de2-b5e9-4901-85d1-a28817a8419a"
msgid "\"Freedom!\""
msgstr "\"자유다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d30ff40f-ba37-4f80-9770-b0904abfcbd4"
msgid "\"What did you find?"
msgstr "\"뭘 찾았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "480ea5e9-860c-4dcb-9c91-cb96784cfe20"
msgid "\"Stop rummaging around. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"미적대지 말아. 가자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f7e9e8d7-00d9-4b96-ba17-a0039b681dec"
msgid ""
"\"Well, well, what have we here?\" {n}Octavia flips through the pages of one "
"of the books.{/n} \"Reg! Take a look at this!\""
msgstr "\"이런, 이런, 이게 뭘까나?\" {n}옥타비아는 한 권의 책의 훑어봅니다. {/n} \"레그! 이것 좀 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "47c63ef5-b1f7-4c11-ae90-cc75fc9ab6cb"
msgid ""
"\"What is it? Whoa! By {g|Calistria}Calistria's{/g} tits, this is… Ha ha! "
"Hmmm, found something interesting here!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야? 우와! {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 젖통이시여, 이건… 하 하! 흐음, 흥미로운 걸 찾아냈군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c74831d4-e575-48fc-8171-6b297030af1a"
msgid ""
"\"Right, yes! We'll just be taking these books, I think. Do you have any "
"idea what this is?\""
msgstr "\"맞아, 좋았어! 이 책을 바로 챙겨야겠어. 이게 뭔지 상상도 못할 꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "627c5517-0b45-4add-afa4-978e94fe4080"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia triumphantly points at a page of a thick volume.{/n} \"These are "
"the Maestro's ledgers! All his accounting for the last… let's see, ten, "
"twenty… Yes! For the last thirty years! Do you know what this means?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 승리감을 보이며 두꺼운 책의 한 페이지를 가리킵니다.{/n} \"이것들은 마에스트로의 장부예요! 그가 관리했던 "
"지난... 보자, 10, 20... 그래요! 지난 30년간의 거래가 몽땅 적혀있어요! 이게 무슨 뜻인지 알겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "603cbdb3-8f4e-4d2b-82f5-d126f6dc4b11"
msgid ""
"\"Somewhere in these pages is me and Octavia. When we were bought, for how "
"much, from where… maybe even from who!\""
msgstr "\"이 책 안 어딘가에 나와 옥타비아 건도 있을 거야. 우리가 언제, 얼마에, 어디서, 심지어 누가 팔았는지까지도 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "71c0b7d4-a58a-44e1-8b44-fe0d5b2a259c"
msgid ""
"\"It'll take some time to make sense of the ledger. We may not find anything…"
" or we may find something and regret ever looking. But I still want to know "
"the truth. I want to understand who I am and where I come from.\""
msgstr ""
"\"장부를 맞춰보려면 시간이 좀 걸리겠지요. 아무것도 찾지 못할 수도 있고… 뭔가를 찾아내서 후회할 수도 있죠. "
"하지만 난 여전히 진실을 알고 싶어요. 난 내가 누구고 어디서 왔는지 알고 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5e9f18ab-a1fd-4043-9906-cfcfef82231c"
msgid "\"Looks like the old geezer left us something valuable!\""
msgstr "\"늙은 괴짜가 가치있는 물건을 남기고 간 것 같군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "94108df6-da7f-40e7-8833-43740aad4ee9"
msgid ""
"\"The Maestro was in such a hurry to leave that he left something pretty "
"interesting behind!\""
msgstr "\"마에스트로가 황망히 떠나는 와중에 꽤나 흥미로운 걸 놔두고 떠난 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4efe7800-5305-478f-840d-904e252ec860"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not all that interested in my tribe, really… I already know who they "
"are — piles of shit who sell their children into slavery! But it might still "
"be interesting to pay them a visit, maybe spit into their faces personally.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 부족에 관해선 별 흥미가 없어... 이미 정체를 알고 있거든 — 자기 아이들을 노예로 팔아치우는 똥덩어리들이지! 하지만 한번쯤 "
"찾아가 보는 것도 구미가 당기는군, 얼굴에 침이나 뱉어줘야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1598e8b7-6891-4446-a400-46fb2b9f5a5f"
msgid ""
"\"Some value! I thought you found some work notes, or research results... "
"Well, everyone has their own idea of value, I guess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제법 가치가 있군! 난 너희들이 작업 노트나 연구 결과를 찾은 줄 알았어.... 글쎄, 각자 마다 가치를 따지는 기준이 다른 법이겠지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d4504753-0b70-4897-a34e-e3c78f5b9315"
msgid ""
"\"Accou...what? Sounds boring! No treasure maps? Not even a little one?\""
msgstr "\"장...뭐라고? 지루하게 들리는데! 보물지도가 아니야? 조그만 보물에 관한 것도 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/BooksFound/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "41c90e1d-8dab-4348-b99b-47df0996ca12"
msgid "\"How do you not understand? It means... This is...\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 이해하지 못할 수가 있죠? 이건... 이건...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c6bfa5bc-835e-4e53-8216-9b796164d04a"
msgid "Persuaded Regongar to let Janush go and save the slaves from the fire."
msgstr "자누시를 보내고 노예들을 불에서 구하도록 레곤가르를 설득했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "45199beb-ca4c-47b1-8854-b5d3fcf916f4"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia's right, Reg. You didn't free yourselves on your own, remember? "
"These people need our help.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아가 맞아, 레그. 너도 스스로 자유를 되찾은 건 아니잖아, 기억 안 나? 이 사람들은 우리 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f0f81800-26a4-4a1e-a649-13820a0c6407"
msgid "Persuaded Octavia to abandon the dying slaves and pursue Janush."
msgstr "죽어가는 노예를 버려두고 자누시를 쫓도록 옥타비아를 설득했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "339023cb-a9e9-47bb-90f5-2f7785cd7a16"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar's right, Octavia. The death of these people is on Janush's "
"conscience, not ours! If we let him go now, how many more souls will he "
"destroy?\""
msgstr ""
"\"레곤가르가 맞아, 옥타비아. 이 사람들의 죽음은 자누시 탓이지, 우리 때문이 아냐! 우리가 그를 놓치면 그가 얼마나 더 많은 사람들의 "
"영혼을 파괴하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4db6fd06-3cbb-4336-974d-61754527e56b"
msgid "\"What are you waiting for? He's getting away!\""
msgstr "\"뭘 기다리고 있어? 그가 달아나잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ab01b1d8-ad7a-4b46-80ff-cc15e9ad59dd"
msgid ""
"\"We'll catch him! We just need to set these poor people free first...\""
msgstr "\"우린 그를 잡으러 갈꺼야! 단지 이 불쌍한 사람들 먼저 풀어주자는 거지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0f538d58-41ea-4658-9c95-e97403946c44"
msgid "\"No, we don't! Forget them! Can't you see the scum's getting away?\""
msgstr "\"아니, 아니야! 이 사람들은 잊어버려! 저 악당이 도망치는게 안보여?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6fe0b54b-7f77-4eb6-8038-7fe97c8a1e81"
msgid "\"Reg, we can't leave them! We used to be slaves, too!\""
msgstr "\"레그, 이 사람들을 나두고 갈 순 없어! 우리도 노예였잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7cf44d52-d5b2-4049-a3f3-7997a68c9ae8"
msgid "\"And we freed ourselves! Octavia, we owe nothing to these people!\""
msgstr "\"우린 스스로 자유를 되찾았지! 옥타비아, 우린 이 사람들에게 빚진거 하나도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3b5ea007-8a17-4e4d-8217-ddf43617bf1c"
msgid ""
"\"But Janush... Ah, damn it! Fine, let him roll himself back to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. {g|Calistria}Calistria's{/g} not blind — he'll get "
"his someday. Enough chatting, then — let's pull these idiots out of the fire!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 자누시가... 아, 젠장! 좋아. 저 자식이 알아서 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가게 내버려 두자. "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}께서 장님이 아니고서야 언젠가 죗값을 치르겠지. 잡담은 이만하고, 이 멍청한 놈들을 불에서 끄집어내!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a80b7c35-f930-4d0b-85fc-36320fb33f64"
msgid ""
"\"I love you!\" {n}After giving Regongar a quick hug, Octavia rushes to help "
"the chained slaves.{/n}"
msgstr "\"사랑해!\" {n}레곤가르를 잠깐 안아준 후, 옥타비아는 쇠사슬에 묶인 노예를 도우러 갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "333bb027-eaff-46ca-bb3e-b07c688f39fe"
msgid ""
"\"But these people...\" {n}Octavia glances at the chained slaves, then looks "
"toward Janush as he runs away.{/n} \"...Fine. Forgive us — there's nothing "
"we can do for you. But we WILL avenge you, you hear?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 이 사람들은...\" {n}옥타비아가 쇠사슬에 묶인 노예들을 쳐다봅니다, 그리고 달아나고 있는 자누시 쪽으로 눈길을 돌립니다. "
"{/n} \"...좋아. 우릴 용서하세요 — 우리가 해줄 수 있는 일은 아무것도 없군요. 하지만 당신들 복수는 꼭 해드릴게요, 반드시!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5eddbc7b-aa47-43c0-a096-7549cf734962"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar clenches Octavia's hand.{/n} \"We'll get revenge, my love — for "
"them, for us, for everything! Now let's run, before it's too late!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 옥타비아의 손을 꼭 잡습니다.{/n} \"우린 복수하고 말꺼야, 내 사랑 - 그들, 우리, 그리고 모든 걸 위해서! "
"서두르자, 너무 늦기전에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c8c04b8e-e1e7-49cc-bde1-65270b09370d"
msgid ""
"\"Wake up! Living people are burning right in front of you! How can we just "
"let them die?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정신 차리십시오! 당신 눈 앞에서 사람들이 산 채로 불타고 있습니다. 어떻게 이들을 죽도록 내버려 둘 수 있다는 말입니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4ce9922b-eba2-47da-871a-a6740ec815f3"
msgid ""
"\"You can't save everyone — and we can't let this asshole go. After him!\""
msgstr "\"모든 사람들을 구할 수는 없어— 그리고 저 개자식을 내버려둬서도 안되고. 쫓아가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1e8bf1b1-dcd0-42bc-bd46-d3791293a58a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm no prophet, but here's my prediction: the prisoners will burn, the "
"Maestro will escape, and you'll still be standing here arguing. Stop "
"chatting and make a decision — any decision!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 예언가는 아니지만, 예측 한번 해보지. 죄수들은 불타고, 마에스트로는 도망가고, 당신들은 여전히 말싸움이나 하고 있을거야. 잡담 "
"그만하고 결정하자고 - 어떤 결정이든지 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Choice/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "818fc96f-05e0-4e4c-8a90-be95e130a66a"
msgid "\"Will all you stop talk-talk?! Stab him, stab him, STAB HIM!\""
msgstr "\"말-말좀 그만해라! 찔러라, 찔러라, 저자식을 찔러라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Items/JanushJournal_Name_String
msgctxt "63cab22f-ff8c-49fd-a173-d49658d85ba6"
msgid "Maestro Janush's Diary"
msgstr "마에스트로 자누시의 일지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Items/JanushJournal_String
msgctxt "8832a1d7-d22d-41d3-96ae-450dc593a076"
msgid ""
"\"Well, 15 slaves have just been delivered from Ustalav. I made an order for "
"40. More than a half died on the way, and the rest came with some sort of "
"disease. I've sent them to the lab — they weren't good for anything else "
"anyway.\n"
"---\n"
"We had to change barracks to get rid of the disease. Burned the old one to "
"the ground, along with the slaves that remained there. I doubled my order "
"for new ones. Delivery is expected to arrive by spring.\n"
"---\n"
"Worthless, stupid dreams. Again, the same wench as before. All night long, "
"promising me a crown and a throne in exchange for some piece of garbage from "
"the Stolen Lands. The throne's location and the kind of crown, she never "
"mentioned. I need to prepare some magical protections.\n"
"---\n"
"The agents have dragged back the slaves who fled two days ago. I've made an "
"example of them — whipped them to death in front of the others. Now to "
"change the locks and shackles.\n"
"---\n"
"That fey keeps bargaining. Now she's offering me all the secrets of the "
"First World in exchange for some artifact. So, she wants me to go all the "
"way to the middle of nowhere to search for no-one-knows-what? Just who does "
"she think I am?\n"
"I'm tired. Not a single night passes without her coming. But I'm intrigued. "
"Maybe I'll have a use for this wench after all.\n"
"---\n"
"Now Nyrissa comes even during my midday naps. She's so impatient.\n"
"Regongar and Octavia have found themselves a new owner. I should have "
"guessed it would end like that. So many years and so much effort — wasted.\n"
"I have to do everything myself.\n"
"---\n"
"I'm going crazy. Nyrissa keeps hiding her face from me, for the third night "
"in a row! I'm trying to sleep both at night and during the day. I need some "
"sign to know that I'm doing what I'm supposed to!\n"
"It's dusty here, hard to breathe, but that doesn't matter. There's been no "
"Technic League hideout in history as useful as this one! I was lucky that "
"some of our people had previously arranged for a safe spot within the Stolen "
"Lands. There could be no better place for us to set an ambush! It should be "
"easy to lure this {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} out.\n"
"---\n"
"My dream was short, but I got what I'd been craving. A light touch from "
"mistress Nyrissa was all I needed. She gave me a chance! My head won't touch "
"pillow again until I kill the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! That filth "
"will pay for all {mf|he|she}'s done, or my life is over.\n"
"I will not disappoint my mistress.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 우스탈라브에서 15 명의 노예가 배달되었다. 40 명을 주문했는데... 절반 이상이 사망했고, 나머지는 질병에 걸려서 도착했다. "
"그들을 실험실로 보냈다 - 다른 쓸모라고는 없을테니까.\n"
"---\n"
"우리는 질병을 막기 위해 막사를 교체해야 했다. 옛 막사는 남은 노예들과 함께 불태웠다. 두배 많은 노예를 주문했다. 봄쯤이면 도착할 "
"것이다.\n"
"---\n"
"쓸모없고, 어리석은 꿈을 꾸었다.또다시, 전과 같이 그 창녀가 나타났다. 밤새동안, 내게 왕관과 옥좌를 약속하며 도둑맞은 땅에 있는 "
"쓰레기 몇 조각을 대가로 요구했다. 왕좌의 위치나 왕관의 종류는 언급하지 않았다. 마법적 보호를 준비해 놓아야 겠다\n"
"---\n"
"요원들이 이틀 전에 도망 쳤던 노예를 잡아왔다. 나는 그들에게 모범을 보였다 - 다른 이들 앞에서 죽을 때까지 채찍질을 가했다. 이제 "
"자물쇠와 사슬을 교체해야겠다.\n"
"---\n"
" 그 님프는 계속 협상을 요구한다. 이제 그녀는 어떤 보물을 대가로 태초 세계의 모든 비밀을 알려주겠다고 한다. 그년은 내게 뭔지도 "
"모르는 물건을 아무도 모르는 곳에 가서 찾으라 요구하는 건가? 도대체 내가 누구라고 생각하는 걸까?\n"
"피곤하다. 매일 밤 그년이 찾아온다. 하지만 이젠 좀 구미가 당긴다. 이 창녀를 써먹을 구석이 있을지도 모르겠다. 나이리사는 이제 내가 "
"낮잠 잘 때도 나타난다. 정말 성미가 급하다.\n"
"레곤가르와 옥타비아가 새로운 주인을 찾은 듯 하다. 나는 이렇게 끝날 것이라고 짐작 했어야했다. 오랜 세월과 많은 노력이 - 무가치해졌다."
"\n"
"나는 모든 것을 스스로해야 한다.\n"
"---\n"
"난 미쳐가고 있다. 나이리사가 3일 연속으로 나타나지 않았다! 나는 밤과 낮에 잠을 자려고 노력하고 있다. 내가 하기로 되었던 일을 내가 "
"제대로 하고 있는지에 대한 증표가 내겐 필요하다.\n"
"여긴 먼지 투성이에다 숨쉬기도 어렵지만 그건 중요하지 않다. 이곳은 기술 연맹 역사상 가장 유용한 은신처이다. 우리 요원 일부가 안전 "
"장소를 도둑맞은 땅에 마련해 놨다니, 참으로 운이 좋다. 매복을 하기엔 최적의 장소다. 이것으로 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}을 유인하는 "
"건 식은 죽 먹기다.\n"
"---\n"
"짧은 꿈이었지만, 내가 그토록 갈망한 것을 얻을 수 있었다. 여주인 나이리사와 간단한 만남이 내가 원하던 모든 것이었다. 그녀가 내게 "
"기회를 주었다! 네 머리는 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}을 죽일 때 까지 배게에 닿지 않으리리.! 그자가 한 짓의 대가를 치르던지, "
"아니면 내 인생이 끝나던지.\n"
"나는 내 여주인을 실망시키지 않을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Items/JanushKey_Description_String
msgctxt "b5d5967b-f9ca-4572-9572-d91323016b4c"
msgid "The key to the Maestro Janush's study in the Technic League hideout."
msgstr "마에스트로 자누시의 기술 연맹 은신처 서가의 열쇠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Items/JanushKey_Name_String
msgctxt "a166a5ad-637f-4a9e-85a7-d68fbd361b22"
msgid "Maestro Janush's Key"
msgstr "마에스트로 자누시의 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Dead/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b95b021f-0e42-4949-898d-1e92ea4010f3"
msgid ""
"\"Dead! You're dead, you wretch! Ha ha ha, finally!\" {n}Regongar kicks "
"Janush's corpse, laughing happily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"죽였다! 넌 죽었어, 이 쥐새끼! 하 하 하, 마침내!\" {n}레곤가를 자누시의 시체를 발로 차고는, 기쁘게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Dead/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7230f69a-8ba9-40a1-8727-5f4bd6936f61"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I thought I would be happy, but... for some reason, I don't feel "
"anything. Nothing at all. Well, he's dead now. Serves him right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이거 알아요, 난 내가 기쁠줄 알았어. 하지만... 왠일인지, 아무것도 느껴지지가 않아. 전혀. 흠. 어쨌든 죽었으니 대가를 치른 "
"셈이라고 해야할까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Dead/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "107a4e09-a44e-4209-8c6d-dd02d6af8b6f"
msgid ""
"\"You just haven't gotten into it. Get a good, close look at his face. "
"Remember how he'd send us to be whipped? Smirking all the while? Of course "
"you do! Come on, give him a kick in the teeth!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 자세히 안봐서 그래. 가까이서 잘 보라고. 널 채찍질 했던 거 기억해? 쳐웃으면서 말이야? 물론 기억하겠지! 이리와, 발로 차서 "
"이빨을 날려버리라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Dead/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0535c200-8b59-4a77-a703-5499168b9c4e"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia kicks the dead man's face with no enthusiasm. Then again, and a "
"smile appears on her face. Soon Octavia and Regongar are both kicking the "
"dead body repeatedly, roaring with laughter all the while.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 죽은 자의 얼굴를 열정없이 발로 찹니다. 그러고나니, 그녀의 얼굴에 미소가 떠오릅니다. 곧 옥타비아와 레곤가르는 시체를 "
"반복해서 걷어차며, 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Dead/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3c388255-1214-49b5-92a8-70f4f2115a93"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! Oh, Reg... You were right. I feel so much better now... It was "
"all worth it!\""
msgstr "\"하 하 하! 오, 레그... 네가 맞았어. 기분이 훨씬 더 나아졌어... 그럴 가치가 있는 일이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Gone/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5f55fa87-2109-48c4-a70d-1632795a0585"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, stop...! Damn that scum! He's gone!\" {n}Regongar kicks the door "
"frame, frustrated, and spits on the floor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이봐 멈춰...! 젠장할 개자식! 가버렸잖아!\" {n}레곤가르는 문을 걷어찹니다. 그리고 좌절해서는 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Gone/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "41d603b1-6d6f-44f2-9760-4864688ab517"
msgid "\"It's all right. We'll settle the score later!\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아. 언젠간 결판을 낼 수 있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Gone/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4abda685-92b7-43f8-8ef8-9a8b8eca1eb6"
msgid ""
"\"No, we won't! It's over. We'll never see him again. He knows we're "
"stronger now — he won't risk crossing us again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니야, 우린 못해! 이제 끝났어. 우린 그를 다시는 보지 못할꺼야. 그는 이제 우리가 더 강해졌다는 걸 알았어 — 감히 우리 앞에 "
"다시 나타날 생각은 하지 않을거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Gone/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6d97908e-e9e7-4dca-8567-d114086e34f5"
msgid ""
"\"But Reg... that's wonderful! Do you realize what you just said? He. Is. "
"Afraid of us now. The great Maestro Janush just ran away from us with his "
"tail between his legs! He's running back to the farthest corner of "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} to sit and hide for the rest of his life, afraid "
"we'll come after him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 레그... 그건 멋진 일이잖아! 네가 무슨 말을 했는지 모르겠어? 그가. 이젠. 우릴. 두려워한다고. 위대한 마에스트로 "
"자누시가 꼬리를 감추고 우리한테서 달아난거야! {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 가장 구석진 곳에 숨어서 우리가 쫓아올까봐 두려움에 "
"떨면서 살아갈걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush-Gone/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4ff142dc-476f-497c-9356-ca4db360fe3a"
msgid ""
"{n}The annoyance on Regongar's face slowly fades into a contented grin.{/n} "
"\"Ha ha, hmm... You're right! That piece of shit's going to see us in his "
"nightmares for the rest of his life!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}짜증이 가득했던 레곤가르의 얼굴에 서서히 만족스런 미소가 돌아옵니다. {/n} \"하 하, 흠.. 네가 맞아! 그 똥덩어리는 남은 "
"생애동안 우리 얼굴이 나오는 악몽을 꾸겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : JanushBossOctavisRegongarQ2
msgctxt "0bb404e7-a83b-4d72-beb7-9591e6a5f6c9"
msgid ""
"{n}Maestro Janush claps as he greets you with a contented smile.{/n} \"So, "
"you managed to track down my messenger, locate this place, and make your way "
"here. Impressive, very impressive. I see all that training was not in vain!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마에스트로 자누시는 만족한 미소를 짓고 손뼉치며 당신을 맞이합니다. {/n} \"그래 내 전령을 추적해 이 장소를 찾고 여기까지 "
"왔다 이거지. 인상적이야, 매우 인상적이야. 내가 시킨 훈련들이 헛것은 아니었군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c2d96572-b198-401c-ba8f-86ec61f6cccf"
msgid ""
"\"You old scumbag, playing your games! You think we don't know it's a trap? "
"Ha! We're ready for anything!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 늙은 쓰레기야, 마음껏 지껄여 보시지! 이게 함정인 줄 모르고 들어왔다 생각하나? 하! 우린 뭐든지 맞이할 준비가 됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : JanushBossOctavisRegongarQ2
msgctxt "10c556dc-56a3-411a-8091-7a77c4d87269"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, of course it's a trap. Not for you, though, my darling. Octavia! "
"Regongar! You've surpassed all my expectations. I can't help but feel pride "
"in such students. I speak to you now not as slaves — no, you are deserving "
"of your freedom! You've proven I can speak to you as equals!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 당연히 함정이었지. 너를 위한 건 아니었지만 말이야, 내 아이야. 옥타비아! 레곤가르! 너흰 내 기대를 훌쩍 뛰어 넘어보였다. "
"그런 제자들을 두게 되다니 자랑스럽구나. 이제 너흴 노예로 대하지는 않겠다 — 아니고 말고, 너흰 자유를 누릴 자격이 있어! 너흰 "
"나와 동등한 위치에서 얘기할 수 있다는 걸 증명해 보였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : JanushBossOctavisRegongarQ2
msgctxt "78387a61-5aca-44a9-ae74-93ae00038f48"
msgid ""
"\"I invite you to become proper members of the {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League{/g}. You will become my left and right hands. You could have all the "
"things this shabby {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} could never offer you — "
"money, slaves, power, access to secret knowledge and powerful artifacts... "
"We require just one small entry fee.\" {n}The wizard points at you.{/n} \""
"{mf|His|Her} head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너흴 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 정식 회원으로 청하는 바이다. 너희는 내 왼손과 오른손이 되는거야. "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 절대로 주지 못할 멋진 것들을 가질 수 있다 — 돈, 노예, 권력, 비밀스런 지식과 강력한 유물을 사용할 "
"권한 같은 것 말이다... 너흰 조그마한 입회료만 지불하면 된다.. \" {n}위저드는 당신을 가르킵니다.{/n} \"{mf|그|그녀}의 머리를 "
"가져와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c290354b-2df7-4034-8b9c-59cbd5c81921"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa, that's one thing I wasn't ready for. But listen up, you old piece of "
"shit! Do you take us for brainless idiots, here? You think we got through "
"all your training and didn't learn the most important lessons?\" {n}He looks "
"at Octavia.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"후아, 이건 예상 못했는데. 하지만 잘 들어, 이 늙은 똥자루야! 우리가 멍청한 바보인 줄 알아? 네 훈련을 모조리 통과하면서 그 "
"중에서 가장 중요한 교훈을 배우지 못했다고 생각하나?\" {n}그는 옥타비아를 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e6692c28-392b-44b9-be34-4c7c7658502f"
msgid ""
"\"Lesson one: never trust Maestro Janush in anything. Lesson two: hate "
"Maestro Janush with all your heart... Enough talk, old teacher. We're here "
"to pass our final exam!\""
msgstr ""
"\"교훈 1번: 절대 마에스트로 자누시를 믿지 마라. 교훈 2번: 마에스트로 자누시를 진심으로 증오해라... 대화는 충분히 했어, 늙은 "
"선생아. 우린 네 마지막 시험을 통과하러 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9ff8b042-d153-46ae-9ddf-218cdbe445ba"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's eyes narrow, and his muscles tense. He watches Regongar closely, "
"preparing to strike a blow.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 눈이 가늘어지고, 근육은 긴장하고 있습니다. 그는 레곤가르를 주시하며 공격을 준비합니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Janush_Before_Fight/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c690192a-1c82-413f-9df2-9a9788db8031"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's eyes turn icy. She puts her hand on her weapon, looking at "
"Octavia and Regongar silently, waiting for their answer.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 눈이 차갑게 변합니다. 그녀는 옥타비아와 레곤가르를 바라보며 조용히 무기에 손을 얹으며, 그들의 대답을 기다립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a754513e-2b36-41d5-9b19-83558e2027a6"
msgid "\"Did Maestro Janush send you?\""
msgstr "\"마에스트로 자누시가 당신들을 보낸겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8ee76c07-ac0c-49a9-8e51-20222683ebde"
msgid "\"Why should we believe you?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 왜 당신들을 믿어야 합니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5c722c49-8d98-4169-a008-d9df6c6c5be3"
msgid "\"Maybe we should just kill you here and now.\""
msgstr "\"당신들을 여기서 당장 죽여버려야 할 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "783331b1-64cc-4a92-9224-5b05a968f013"
msgid "\"Octavia, Regongar — what do you think?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 레곤가르 - 어떻게 생각합니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Answer_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "b073c74d-335a-456f-8262-39a5ad0e1720"
msgid "\"Remind me, who's this Maestro Janush?\""
msgstr "\"마에스트로 자누시가 누구였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "9bc8d0c5-fa60-43db-afb3-628d367f9a60"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalannah sits at the table, calmly sipping beer. When she sees you, she "
"raises her hand as though she'd spotted some old friends.{/n} \"There you "
"are! Long time, no see.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼라나는 자리에 앉아 평온하게 맥주를 마시고 있습니다. 당신을 보자, 그녀는 오랜 친구를 만난 듯 손을 들어 인사합니다.{/n} \"여기 "
"있었군! 오랜만이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "41b065d2-c502-40e3-9521-7559fd37e984"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar bares his teeth.{/n} \"Tell us what you're doing here, witch!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 이를 갑니다.{/n} \"여기서 무슨 짓을 하고 있는지 말해, 마녀!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "2b2f019b-81d7-4125-9aab-d74ecf5b0723"
msgid ""
"\"How rude. I willingly came here to bring you valuable information. How "
"would you like to have a face-to-face conversation with Maestro Janush? He's "
"visiting these lands with some of his students and slaves... Oooh, your eyes "
"lit up at that, didn't they? Your faces give me all the answer I need.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무례하군. 난 당신에게 중요한 정보를 주려고 기꺼이 찾아온거야. 마에스트로 자누시와 직접 대화를 나누고 "
"싶어? 그는 몇몇 제자와 노예와 함께 이 땅에 머물고 있어... 우우, 이 말을 들으니 눈이 번뜩이네, 안 그래? 당신들 표정만 봐도 "
"답이 나오네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "f6e23ab1-be2f-496c-b8bc-9499909072b3"
msgid ""
"\"I think not. I've got a tavern full of hostages, here. You start a fight, "
"and I'll let some gifts from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} fly — not at you, but at "
"your subjects. So please be reasonable, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your "
"Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 그렇게 생각안해. 난 지금 이 주점에 있는 모두를 인질로 잡고 있거든. 네가 싸움을 건다면, 난 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}"
" 파리로 부터 추출한 이 작은 선물을 뿌릴꺼야 - 네가 아니라 너의 백성들에게 말이야. 그러니 부디 이성적으로 되어주세요, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "96227dc1-eb47-4824-accb-c682fba719c4"
msgid ""
"\"In a manner of speaking, I suppose. Though, it wasn't exactly a 'send,' "
"and it wasn't exactly me... One of Janush's cronies was supposed to sit here "
"and lure you into a trap. But that ran counter to my interests, so the "
"Maestro's messenger is rotting away in a swamp, and I'm sitting here instead "
"to tell you — for absolutely free! — how to avoid this trap.\""
msgstr ""
"\"말하자면 그런 셈이지. 누가 날 '보낸' 것도 아니고, '날' 보낸 것도 아니지만... 자누시 부하 하나가 여기 앉아있다가 당신을 "
"함정으로 유인하기로 돼 있었어. 알고도 무시하긴 좀 그렇더라고. 마에스트로의 전령은 지금쯤 늪지대 어딘가에서 썩어가고 있을 거야. 대신 "
"내가 여기 앉아있고. 공짜로 함정을 조심하라고 경고씩이나 해주면서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "1a813b6a-ecae-4c17-9a26-6d1de7168954"
msgid ""
"\"We have a common interest. Remember our last encounter? You may have "
"spared my life, but that still left me in deep shit. The expedition "
"thwarted, valuable slaves lost... And the {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League{/g} isn't very forgiving. I tried hiding in the {g|River Kingdoms}"
"River Kingdoms{/g}, but Janush has a long reach. I won't get any peace while "
"he still breathes. The smart move, then, is to help his mortal enemies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우린 공통의 관심사가 있어. 지난 번 만났을 때 기억나나? 당신은 내 목숨을 살려줬지만, 개똥같은 상황에 처하게 만들었어. 탐험은 "
"틀어졌고, 귀중한 노예들을 잃었고... 그리고 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 그리 인자한 조직이 아니야. 난 "
"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 어딘가에 숨어보려고 했지만, 자누시의 영향력은 꽤나 넓더군. 그가 살아 숨 쉬는 동안 "
"평화롭게 살진 못할 거야. 그렇다면 현명한 방법은, 내 적의 원수를 돕는 것이겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6cdaee1a-03e3-47d9-bb1c-df9d38d34099"
msgid ""
"\"I think I still want to smash her in her smug face... but I want to gut "
"the Maestro even more.\""
msgstr "\"여전히 이 여자 얼굴에 한방 먹이고 싶지만... 마에스트로의 멱을 따는 편이 더 낫겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "211311f9-66a7-43b4-a45f-0386ad5644cb"
msgid ""
"\"And if she's lying, she's doing a convincing job of it. The {g|Technic "
"League}Technic League{/g} really wouldn't forgive such a failure. And "
"gambits like that would be a piece of cake for them. There's definitely a "
"catch here, but consider me hooked.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저게 거짓말이면, 꽤나 공들인 거짓말을 하고 있는 거예요. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 실패를 결코 용서하지 "
"않아요. 심지어 기술 연맹에겐 식은 죽 먹기나 다름없는 도박에서 실패한 거잖아요. 뭔가 석연치 않지만, 믿는 셈 치도록 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "14c4a1c8-8823-4248-9fee-fe926d5e85dd"
msgid ""
"\"The catch will be on Maestro Janush when, expecting you to come through "
"the main door, you get in through the back.\" {n}Kalannah tosses an envelope "
"on the table.{/n} \"Here — a map marked with the location of the {g|Technic "
"League}Technic League's{/g} lair, and a schematic of the secret entrance. "
"They won't expect you to enter there. No thanks necessary — all I want in "
"return is for you to find Janush and lop off his head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"요점은 마에스트로 자누시가 당신들이 정문으로 들어올거라 예상할 때 뒷문으로 쳐들어가는 거야.\" {n}칼라나는 탁자 너머로 봉투 한 "
"장을 던집니다.{/n} \"여기 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 은신처 위치가 표시된 지도와 비밀 통로의 설계도야. "
"여기로 들어올 거라 예상하진 못할걸. 고마워할 필요 없어 — 내가 원하는 건 당신이 자누시를 찾아서 그의 머리를 따버리는 것이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5c8ffe78-ca75-4043-b668-1d3289312ccd"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar opens the envelope and inspects the map with suspicion.{/n} \"All"
" right, we'll believe you for now. But if we ever see your ugly face here "
"again...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 봉투를 열고 의심스러운 눈으로 지도를 살펴봅니다.{/n} \"좋아, 지금은 믿어보도록 하지. 하지만 네 못생긴 얼굴을 다시 "
"볼 일이 생긴다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah_OctaviaRegonagrQ2Tavern
msgctxt "420f5f67-b448-4cf1-97a9-f3639966de7f"
msgid ""
"\"Boy, do you think I have even the slightest desire to see yours again?\" "
"{n}Kalannah stands.{/n} \"Have a nice day, my friends. I hope this is our "
"last encounter. By the way, the beer you have here tastes like manticore "
"piss... just saying. Good luck with Janush!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저런, 내가 눈곱만큼이라도 당신을 다시보길 원한다고 생각하나?\" {n}칼라나가 일어섭니다. {/n} \"좋은 하루 되시길, 내 "
"친구들. 이게 마지막 만남이었으면 하네요. 그나저나 이 집 맥주는 마치 만티코어 오줌 맛이 나는군. 별 뜻은 없어요. 자누시를 만날 때 "
"행운이 따르기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0019_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bb423bda-d723-4852-9ffb-aaf4c4482a79"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar spits on the floor.{/n} \"A wizard from the {g|Technic League}"
"Technic League{/g}. Taught Octavia and me — we owe half our scars to him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 위저드야. 옥타비아와 날 가르쳤지. "
"우리 흉터의 반은 그자의 작품이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Kalannah/Cue_0020_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c382c2e0-9c58-4925-a3c1-f3cb6d3ab4c4"
msgid ""
"\"I have to admit, he did teach us magic well enough. I can't wait to see "
"him again so we can thank him for it!\""
msgstr "\"인정할게요, 그가 우리에게 마법 만큼은 아주 잘 가르쳤죠. 너무 감사해서 하루라도 빨리 다시 보고싶네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8ea02901-40d3-422e-a0cd-c8b8341baa69"
msgid "\"Who are you, and why are you looking for Octavia and Regongar?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구냐, 그리고 왜 옥타비아와 레곤가르를 찾는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f1e6a11a-3ea9-4cbf-bbd1-8386a3b98ae2"
msgid "\"Don't lie. You're a Technic League spy!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말 하지 마라. 넌 기술 연맹의 첩자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "091d7d8f-6635-425e-8eba-3e72e96d7442"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't a good place to talk — let's move somewhere more convenient. "
"Like a torture chamber, perhaps.\""
msgstr "\"이 곳은 얘기하기 좋은 장소는 아닌 것 같군. 좀 더 편안한 장소로 옮기는 게 좋겠어. 이를테면, 고문실이 적당하겠는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "08a794f8-4f3f-4803-9f08-8c251565d58a"
msgid "\"Octavia, do you believe him?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 이 말을 믿나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "e53816f8-d70a-4819-b9da-f373930cde65"
msgid "\"Regongar, do you believe him?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 이 말을 믿나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "79957017-7f0d-437e-bf83-9b677ffbb97f"
msgid "\"Tell me, Kerreg, do you know where we can find Janush?\""
msgstr "\"얘기해봐, 케렉, 자누시가 어디 있는지 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "32282f85-47e4-4194-9257-66c7cd9dcabd"
msgid "Helped Kerreg the cobbler return home."
msgstr "구두 수선공 케렉이 집에 돌아갈 수 있도록 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "0bcbd412-2d18-464e-8552-b703b34a2092"
msgid ""
"[Give Kerreg 100 gold coins] \"Here, take this. It should cover your trip to "
"the Five Kings Mountains.\""
msgstr "[케렉에게 금화 100개를 준다] \"여기 있다, 가져가. 다섯 왕의 산맥에 가는 데 충분할 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "295a0d61-378d-4da2-a41f-bb477e6e1e06"
msgid "Allowed Kerreg the cobbler to stay in your capital."
msgstr "구두 수선공 케렉이 당신의 수도에 머물도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "3c2c6d49-59ef-4419-a12d-be876f07e1fe"
msgid ""
"\"Kerreg, you can't go back. Stay here — we always have need of skilled "
"cobblers.\""
msgstr "\"케렉, 넌 돌아갈 수 없어. 여기에 머물러라 - 우린 언제나 숙련된 구두 수선공이 필요했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f4e8ae9f-cece-44a4-8f6c-c512c76c68b2"
msgid "Allowed Kerreg the cobbler to leave."
msgstr "구두 수선공 케렉이 떠나도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "ffc73b3e-95d3-4388-bb12-9daf7f9084ba"
msgid "\"Thanks for the information. Now get out of my city.\""
msgstr "\"정보는 고마웠다. 이제 내 도시에서 나가라. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5bb15fa3-9fcf-46ba-af2e-0c4b225f723e"
msgid "Killed Kerreg the cobbler."
msgstr "구두 수선공 케렉을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "508aa9fe-c990-4c7d-a794-e3ad1ab990f1"
msgid ""
"[Kill Kerreg] \"Very well. I have a simple way of dealing with spies...\""
msgstr "[케렉을 죽인다] \"좋아. 첩자들을 처리하는 간단한 방법이 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "2df2a193-50b3-4a5e-8e65-0a7f2a63558d"
msgid ""
"{n}An inconspicuous dwarf wearing a gray coat sits at the table sipping "
"beer. As you, Octavia, and Regongar appear at his table, he topples the mug, "
"startled.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}회색 외투를 입은 별볼일 없게 생긴 드워프가 자리에 앉아 맥주를 홀짝입니다. 당신과 옥타비아, 레곤가르가 나타나자 그는 잔을 "
"엎지르며 동요하는 모습을 보입니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "08a63cc3-5303-4c92-8592-8b022bea014d"
msgid "\"Boo!\""
msgstr "\"어흥!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ee6907f4-61e9-4415-9952-02205ed5d4e6"
msgid ""
"\"You were asking about us, right? Well, here we are. So what is it you want "
"from us, hmm?\""
msgstr "\"우리에 대해 케묻고 다녔지? 그래서 직접 와줬다고. 우리에게 뭘 원하는 가야, 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "4238c25a-cd08-45df-b825-377288103714"
msgid "\"I-I... You've made a mistake! I have no idea who you are!\""
msgstr "\"난... 실수 하신 거겠죠! 난 당신이 누군지 전혀 모릅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "cae5469b-5834-4957-8389-7cc351447e05"
msgid "\"No torture chamber, please! I'll tell you everything!\""
msgstr "\"제발 고문실만은! 모든 걸 말하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "c556bd3e-777b-4c39-9588-f60a215050c9"
msgid "\"No, you're wrong, I'm just a simple cobbler...\""
msgstr "\"아니요, 아닙니다. 전 한낱 구두 수선공일 뿐입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8c00dc2e-691a-4871-b943-43f6816c8c21"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar slams his fist on the table almost hard enough to break the "
"table legs.{/n} \"Cut the crap, deadbeat! Talk, or I start cutting off "
"fingers!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 탁자의 다리가 부러질 만큼 세게 주먹으로 탁자를 내리칩니다.{/n} \"헛소리집어쳐, 넌 죽은 목숨이야! 말해, 아니면 "
"손가락부터 잘라주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "27547b0d-d965-489d-974f-e6077863d865"
msgid "\"Don't... Please, not my fingers! I'll tell you everything!\""
msgstr "\"안돼!.. 제발, 손가락만은! 모두 다 말하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "bb8aad52-144f-4f6f-bf37-0bbafba313eb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}, what did I do to deserve this... Fine, yes, I "
"admit I was sent by the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}! I'll tell you "
"everything, just don't hit me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}이시여, 제가 뭘 그리 잘못했길레 이런 시련을 겪어야 하는 겁니까. 알겠습니다, 좋아요, {g|"
"Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 날 보냈다는 건 인정하겠습니다.! 모두 다 말하겠습니다, 때리지만 말아주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "d04ba647-5fec-4e46-9f17-93bbed6701b3"
msgid ""
"\"My name's Kerreg, just a humble servant of Maestro Janush...\" {n}The "
"looks on Octavia's and Regongar's faces after hearing that name make the "
"dwarf go pale and shrink into his chair.{/n} \"You... know him, don't you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 케렉입니다, 마에스트로 자누시의 미천한 종입지요...\" {n}그 이름을 듣자 떠오른 옥타비아와 레곤가르의 표정을 보자 "
"드워프는 창백해져서는 의자 깊숙히 움츠려듭니다. {/n} \"당신들... 자누시 님을 알고있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "de421055-eee2-4f08-8521-34b81e49e0a3"
msgid "\"You could say that... And why did he send you here?\""
msgstr "\"그렇다고 할수 있겠지..왜 그가 널 보낸거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "8904c965-0f2f-48ed-9214-bcb1341e927f"
msgid ""
"\"I was his slave. I served the Maestro loyally for a long time, and he "
"finally granted me my freedom! He promised me a lot of money, enough to get "
"me to the Five Kings Mountains and then some, if I'd just do a simple task "
"for him — find out if a half-elf named Octavia and a half-orc named Regongar "
"were living in the capital, and if so, where they could be found... I don't "
"know why he sent me — I'm no spy, just a simple cobbler!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 그의 노예였습니다. 오랫동안 마에스트로를 충성스럽게 섬겼지요, 그리고 마침내 저에게 자유를 줬습니다. 그는 내게 다섯 왕의 산맥에 "
"가고도 남을 만큼의 많은 돈을 약속했습니다. 단 하나의 간단한 일만을 요구했지요 - 수도에 살고 있는 옥타비아라는 이름의 하프엘프와 "
"레곤가르라는 이름의 하프오크를 찾아내는 일이었습니다. 그가 왜 날 보냈는지는 모르겠지만 - 전 첩자가 아닙니다, 그저 미천한 구두 "
"수선공일 뿐이라고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4505b112-f89c-4dce-8adf-1bb0ca24974c"
msgid ""
"\"I think this slimeball's lying. A cobbler, sure! Everyone knows the {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League's{/g} short on spies — of course they have to "
"send cobblers, cooks, and water carriers instead! So here's what I think: "
"let's drag him by the beard from the city gate to the palace and back — "
"maybe then he'll come up with something more clever along the way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 더러운 놈이 거짓말을 한다고 생각해. 구두 수선공이라, 물론 그러시겠지! {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 에 "
"항상 첩자가 모자른 건 모두가 다 아는 사실이야 - 물론 구두 수선공을 보낼 수도 있고, 요리사를 보낼 수도, 또는 물 긷는 사람을 보낼 "
"수도 있겠지. 이렇게 하는 게 좋겠어: 먼저 이 놈 수염을 붙잡고 성문부터 궁전까지 끌고 다니다 돌아오는거야 - 끝날 때 쯤이면 뭔가 더 "
"영리한 변명을 생각해 내겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f25bd88a-7300-483f-83ad-ff3a9f1d69fb"
msgid ""
"\"Strange as it may seem, yes. He seems more like one who's been deceived "
"than one who's deceiving. Using people in the dark without telling them the "
"true purpose of their mission is very much like Janush. I don't think he's a "
"spy — I think he's bait.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하긴 하지만, 그래요. 그는 속이는 사람이기 보다는 속는 사람에 속하는 부류같아요. 본래의 목적을 알려주지 않고 아무것도 모르는 "
"사람을 써먹는 건 매우 자누시 다운 행동이에요. 이 사람이 첩자같지는 않군요 - 내 생각에 그는 미끼인 것 같아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "86132231-32eb-4c46-9440-a4e6bab3dca2"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Yes, I do! Oh, the Maestro will kill me... {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}, what "
"did I do to deserve this... Give me a map — I'll show you where he's holed "
"up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알았어요! 시키는 대로 할께요! 오, 마에스트로께서 날 죽일꺼야... {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}이시여, 제가 뭘 그리 "
"잘못했습니까... 지도를 주세요 - 그가 어디에 있는지 보여드리지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f2897926-e6e8-4495-873a-809235c266f5"
msgid "{n}Octavia and Regongar exchange looks.{/n} \"Looks like a trap.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아와 레곤가르가 서로 눈빛을 교환합니다{/n} \"아무래도 함정 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "24d74020-037f-422b-9fe5-88da67619222"
msgid "\"Of course it's a trap! It's the Maestro!\""
msgstr "\"당연히 함정이지! 그 누구도 아닌 마에스트로잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "14926e41-252f-4728-a534-5f12af3319db"
msgid ""
"{n}The bar goes quiet a moment as everyone looks at the dwarf's lifeless "
"body. Then all the guests turn away simultaneously and awkwardly return to "
"their conversations, doing all they can not to look your way.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}모두가 드워프의 시신을 보자 술집의 분위기가 싸늘해집니다. 잠시 후 모든 손님들이 동시에 시선을 거두고 당신이 움직이는 모습을 보지 "
"않으려고 어색하게 대화를 이어나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "42127a21-922c-4c9c-a2ca-3dd5d1b85587"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! At once! You'll never see me here again, not even a hair...\" "
"{n}The dwarf rushes out of the tavern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론입니다! 지금 당장 떠나지요! 절 다시 볼일은 없을겁니다. 터럭 한 자락도 말입니다.\" {n}드워프는 급하게 술집 밖으로 "
"뛰어나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "b0ec7d43-93dd-4f20-b102-1699db2a6bb5"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! I'll "
"serve you as loyally and truthfully as I did the Maestro himself! Are you in "
"need of new soles? You probably go through a lot of shoes on your "
"journeys... Forgive me, I'm being overly chatty — it's all nerves, you "
"see... May {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} keep you safe!\" {n}The dwarf rushes out of "
"the tavern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 마에스트로에게 그랬던 것처럼 충성스럽고 진실되게 당신을 섬기겠습니다! 새 신발이 "
"필요하시지 않으신지요? 여행을 하시다 보면 신발이 잔득 필요하시겠지요.. 용서하십시오, 쓸때없이 말이 많군요. — 아시다시피 긴장이 덜 "
"풀려서요... {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}께서 당신을 보우하시길!\" {n}드워프는 황급히 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : TechLeagueSpy_OctaviaRegongarQ2
msgctxt "f2869d2a-73d4-4638-9ea7-52e8824e764e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! Thank you, "
"from the bottom of my heart! I'll pray to {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} for your good "
"health till the day I die!\" {n}The dwarf rushes out of the tavern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 진심으로 감사드립니다! 죽을 때까지 {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}에게 당신의 무병장수를 "
"빌겠습니다!\" {n}드워프는 황급히 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "29bc2f85-369b-4ea4-862e-cec61bfee3d4"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now we know where Janush is waiting for us. He knows we're coming, "
"of course... but we know that he knows, so that gives us the advantage!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 이제 자누시가 어디 있는지 알았어. 당연히 그도 우리가 올거라는 걸 알고.... 하지만 우리는 그가 알고 있다는 걸 알고 있지, "
"그 점이 우리에게 큰 이점을 가져다 줄꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "79cb6023-1464-4dee-926f-eb0b57fa5182"
msgid ""
"\"But does he know that we know that he knows?\" {n}Regongar frowns with "
"exaggerated seriousness.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그도 우리가 그가 안다는 걸 안다는 사실을 알지 않을까?\" {n}레곤가르는 과장된 진지함으로 얼굴을 찌푸립니다 .{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q2_BlindJustice/Tavern_Not_Kalannah/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ddaf576-8bb2-43c4-ab33-10f1e7db0311"
msgid ""
"{n}Laughing, Octavia lightly flicks Regongar's nose. Unable to maintain his "
"serious expression, he breaks down and laughs with her.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}웃으면서, 옥타비아는 레곤가르의 코를 꼬집습니다. 심각한 표정을 유지하지 못하게 되자, 그는 쓰러지며 그녀와 함께 웃음을 "
"터트립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Ending_Evil_1_Mother_String
msgctxt "59a4b584-4620-4368-9f1f-4a594f36cd18"
msgid "\"Octavia, my dear child, don't! Aaaah!\""
msgstr "\"옥타바이, 내 아가, 그러지 말거라! 아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Ending_Evil_2_Oct_String
msgctxt "f0a79275-8af3-4814-9eb2-86c1ed282419"
msgid "\"Run! Run, and stay out of my way! I have no mother!\""
msgstr "\"꺼져! 꺼지라고, 내 앞에서 사라져! 난 당신같은 엄마는 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Ending_Evil_3_Oct_String
msgctxt "1b94ff8c-beb9-4d6f-b8af-fdf346182f11"
msgid "\"Let's go. Let it burn. There's nothing more to do here.\""
msgstr "\"가요. 불타게 내버려 둬요. 여기서 더 볼 일은 없을 듯 하니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Ending_Good_1_Mother_String
msgctxt "8947dc2f-091f-44ed-998b-ba8f2c503964"
msgid "\"I'll give the order to pack and call for a carriage immediately!\""
msgstr "\"당장 짐을 싸고 마차를 부르도록 하겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Ending_Good_2_Oct_String
msgctxt "4b90f0eb-453c-40dc-b94e-7f76f45db288"
msgid "\"See you soon, Mother.\""
msgstr "\"곧 다시 만나요, 엄마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Garden_after_talk1_String
msgctxt "bcd81478-a04f-4265-afe6-1de57468a843"
msgid "\"What do you know... A hereditary marchioness! Me...\""
msgstr "\"이게 무슨일이람...내가... 후작 부인의 딸이라니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Garden_after_talk_final_EVIL_String
msgctxt "93b90e98-fa04-440c-ba10-25090f46993d"
msgid "\"I have no family... But isn't our team family enough?\""
msgstr "\"난 가족이 없어요... 하지만 우리 팀이라면 가족으로 충분치 않을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Garden_after_talk_final_GOOD_String
msgctxt "2d88602f-6f32-48ff-b087-5a52aa98845d"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness, please allow me to assure you of the eternal loyalty of the "
"family of Della- ha ha ha, oh, I can't!\""
msgstr "\"전하, 제가 델라-뭐시기 가문이 당신계 영원한 충성을 맹세하는 것을 허락해- 하 하 하. 오, 더 이상은 못하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Mother_Capital_1_String
msgctxt "b74bfaa5-6cde-4ee0-8f2d-fe9bcb741bf8"
msgid "\"Thank you for taking care of Octavia.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아를 돌봐줘서 고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Mother_Capital_2_String
msgctxt "c004b1bd-2fb1-42c1-8e2b-e3244587ee59"
msgid "\"My little girl has grown so much...\""
msgstr "\"내 작은 딸이 정말 많이 컸구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Mother_Capital_3_String
msgctxt "5437a4c8-c201-4a21-8f29-4b43f523c395"
msgid "\"Oh, gods... I'm so happy to see my daughter again!\""
msgstr "\"오, 신들이시여... 제 딸을 다시보게되 정말 기쁩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Servant_Mansion_1_String
msgctxt "e15813ce-3e78-4aa6-9890-c51e91f42290"
msgid "\"You wish to see the marchioness?\""
msgstr "\"후작부인을 뵙기를 원하십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Barks/Servant_Mansion_2_String
msgctxt "14c1c750-a4fa-47c8-b6bc-2dd96df3d4db"
msgid "\"Please, follow me.\""
msgstr "\"절 따라오십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "b9c6df66-e197-4feb-b9ba-0f6f30d9ee5d"
msgid "\"I'm glad you found it in your heart to forgive your mother.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 마음 속으론 어머니를 용서했다는 걸 알게되어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "1d5916b9-fe24-42ec-a816-721095703790"
msgid "Told Octavia your opinion on her decision."
msgstr "옥타비아의 결정에 대해 당신의 의견을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "38efb6f3-29ca-4d44-9a7c-340294968b30"
msgid ""
"\"Still, you shouldn't have burned her house. Now she has nowhere to live.\""
msgstr "\"아무리 그래도, 그녀의 집을 태우지 말았어야 했습니다. 이제 그녀는 살 곳이 없지 않습니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "bc01eda9-2dde-4aa9-bf6c-ee2511b9e33b"
msgid ""
"\"The marchioness is lucky to have a daughter like you. Truth be told, she "
"didn't deserve your forgiveness!\""
msgstr "\"후작부인은 너 같은 딸 둔 걸 행운으로 생각해야 해. 진짜, 그 여자는 네게 용서를 받을 자격도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "cfa72aaa-6a6d-4402-85b4-010d3376863c"
msgid ""
"\"I would never have forgiven her. I'd rather have no family than that!\""
msgstr "\"나라면 결코 용서하지 않았을겁니다. 차라리 가족이 없이 살고 말지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "b5e12ecb-21ea-4b20-bcae-d859e309f45a"
msgid "\"I just hope arson doesn't become a habit with you.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 불지르는 게 습관이 되지 않기를 바랄 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0024_Text_String
msgctxt "1e64a7ba-62d9-4c2c-bb52-ddbc78d43227"
msgid ""
"\"It's your life, and your decision — I'm not here to judge. I'm just glad I "
"could help you.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 삶이니, 당신이 결정해야지요 - 제게 그걸 판단할 권리는 없습니다. 그저 도움이 되어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "2c1d9c50-f5c7-4a03-9045-d9ddacc9ba75"
msgid ""
"\"What you did was cruel, but it was right. Some bridges just need to be "
"burned. And sometimes more than just bridges.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 한 일은 잔혹했지만, 옳은 일이었습니다. 어떤 다리는 분명 불태워야할 필요가 있습니다. 때때론 다리보다 더한 것도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0026_Text_String
msgctxt "d29a2457-dfa5-46f9-9a93-6df165d1ba70"
msgid ""
"\"The marchioness was not just a terrible mother, she was a criminal. For "
"slave trading, I should be sending her to the gallows!\""
msgstr "\"후작 부인은 부모도 아냐. 범죄자잖아. 사람을 노예로 사고 파는 사람은 교수대에나 어울리지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Answer_0027_Text_String
msgctxt "6264d295-cf9e-4b03-bc73-cd285d56269a"
msgid ""
"\"I don't understand why you spared her. You should have let her burn with "
"the house!\""
msgstr "\"왜 그녀의 목숨을 살려뒀는지 모르겠습니다. 집과 함께 태워 버렸어야 했어요.!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f04e4238-eb45-4468-8264-7cbf4dca3e32"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia stands beneath the tree, looking once again at the fibula with "
"Della Fiorni's coat of arms.{/n} \"Well, then. No more mysteries. I know who "
"I am now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 나무 아래 서서, 다시 한번 고정핀에 세겨진 델라 피오르니의 문장을 바라봅니다. {/n} \"음, 이걸로 끝이네요. 더 "
"이상 미스터리는 없어요. 이제 난 내가 누군지 아니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3c574d37-7150-4518-96e5-12487d539b86"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia hurls the fibula down from the viewing point.{/n} \"I'm Octavia — "
"just Octavia. An orphan without a family. Reg, you, Linzi... Our crazy team "
"is my true family — and I don't need any other!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 고정핀을 시야에서 거둡니다.{/n} \"난 옥타비아에요. - 그냥 옥타비아. 가족 하나 없는 고아이고. 레그, 당신, "
"린지.... 우리 정신나간 팀이 내 진정한 가족이에요 - 다른 사람은 필요 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3cd91eee-58b5-42df-a16c-4b9a9806d30e"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia gently pins the fibula to her clothes.{/n} \"Hereditary "
"Marchioness Della Fiorni... Beautiful words for someone called 'hey you' all "
"her childhood, aren't they? Now, Your Highness, please address me solely as "
"'Your Excellency' from now on...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 옷에 고정핀을 부드럽게 꽂습니다.{/n} \"델라 피오르니 후작부인의 작위 계승자... 어린 시절 내내 '야 너'라고 "
"불리던 사람에겐 아름다운 호칭이네요, 그렇지 않나요? 이제, 전하, 이제부턴 절 '예하'라고만 불러주세요....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "42613e43-b367-4706-a9ea-fd5a7e46385e"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia smiles mischievously.{/n} \"It's easier to live without the past. "
"With no past, only the future lies ahead! So, lead the way. Whatever awaits "
"us, I'm with you to the end!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 장난스럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"과거가 없었다면 삶이 더 쉬었을텐데. 과거가 없다면 오직 미래만이 앞에 놓여 "
"있을테니까요! 그러니, 앞장서세요. 무엇이 우릴 기다리던, 난 당신과 끝까지 함께 할꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d6ea20d1-d091-438f-84d9-30df93ae9a54"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia's trying to maintain a solemn expression, but less than a few "
"seconds pass before she breaks into laughter.{/n} \"Kidding! I'm kidding, of "
"course. In all seriousness, I'm just happy to know my mother didn't betray "
"me. This was all just a mistake — a terrible, idiotic mistake... but still "
"fixable. Now I have a family — apart from our own insane team, of course. "
"You, Reg, Linzi — I wouldn't leave you for the world!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 엄숙한 표정을 유지하려 노력하지만, 몇 초도 지나지 않아 웃음을 터트립니다.{/n} \"농담이에요, 당연히 농담이라구요. "
"진심으로, 전 그저 어머니가 날 배반한 게 아닌 걸 알 게 되어 기뻐요. 모든 게 다 그저 실수에 불과했어요 — 끔찍하고 멍청한 "
"실수였지만, 되돌릴 수 없을 정도는 아니요. 이제 가족이 생겼어요 — 물론 우리 정신나간 팀은 별도로요. 당신과 레그, 린지 — 전 "
"어디를 가나 당신들과 함께 할 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f0dc290f-3d3d-4b12-a460-57ae97547a3f"
msgid ""
"\"Well, Your Highness, what's next? You have the entirety of the grand Della "
"Fiorni family as your loyal vassals. Whatever you have planned, I'm with you "
"till the end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음,각하, 다음은 뭐죠? 이제 델라 피오르니 대가문 몽땅을 당신의 충성스런 종복으로 두시게 됐네요. 당신의 계획이 무엇이든지, 끝까지 "
"함께하겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8a0f03d4-a9f7-4609-bacc-47692ed264b9"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't think I could really do it... but I'm glad I won't have to carry "
"this hatred with me for the rest of my life. I let it go just as I let "
"Janush go before — and I don't regret it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 정말 이런 짓을 할 수 있을지 몰랐지만... 그래도 이 증오를 내 남음 삶동안 짊어가지 않게되어 기뻐요. 내가 자누시를 내 "
"삶에서 내보냈듯이 이 일도 떠나보내겠어요 - 그리고 절대 후회하지 않을꺼에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0ca11bd6-38ca-4296-b641-5cfea774964b"
msgid ""
"\"Serves her right! She was living in a town house while I slept on rotten "
"straw and ate gruel! The woman should be glad I even let her go. Maybe I "
"shouldn't have! She could have at least felt what Janush's victims felt — "
"the ones he burned alive!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당해도 싼 여자였어요! 그녀는 마을에 큰 집에서 사는동안 난 썩은 지푸라기에서 자고 꿀꿀이죽을 먹었지요. 목숨을 살려준 것만 해도 "
"감사해야해요. 어쩌면 그 집에 내버려둬야 했을지도요! 그렇다면 적어도 자누시의 희생자가 되는 게 어떤 기분인지 느낄 수 있었을테니까요-산 "
"체로 불태워 버렸던 사람들 말이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d414c481-0003-4052-9d12-587acb9ea130"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe she didn't. So what? Unlike justice, mercy is meant for those who "
"don't deserve it. If all I ever thought about was serving justice, I would "
"never have let Janush go to save those poor souls. Would that have been "
"better?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇지 않을 수도 있겠죠. 그래서 뭐 어쨌다고요? 정의와는 다르게, 자비는 받을 자격이 없는 사람들을 위한 것이에요. 정의를 찾는 "
"것만 신경썼다면, 난 그 불쌍한 영혼들을 구하기 위해 자누시가 도망치는 걸 내버려 두지 않았을꺼에요. 그러는 편이 나았을 거라 생각하나요?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eb4e96d9-84d0-4c4b-af51-12c7694e1aa3"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe so. But she's still my mother. I didn't think I'd be able to forgive "
"her, but... I did, somehow. Maybe it's because I have so few people I can "
"call loved ones that I couldn't just throw her out of my life. Then again, "
"Janush deserved death like no one else... but I let him escape for the "
"greater good. How could I refuse mercy to my own mother after that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럴지도요. 하지만 여전히 그녀는 나의 어머니에요. 그녀를 용서할 수 있을거라곤 생각지 못했지만, 어쨌든 난 용서했어요. 아마도 "
"사랑했던 사람이라고 얘기할 사람이 내 인생에 너무 적어서 그녀를 내 인생에서 내다 버릴 수 없었던 것 같아요. 자누시는 죽어 마땅했지만 "
"대의를 위해서 그가 도망치게 내버려뒀어요. 그런 일이 있었는데, 어떻게 내 친 어머니에게 자비를 배풀지 않을 수 있겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9d24cd5f-cb98-4c1a-bbf3-73afdcdfe9f7"
msgid ""
"\"No, of course not! This was a special case. A fire in the city is "
"especially dangerous... but some fires just beg to be started!\" {n}Octavia "
"winces.{/n} \"Maybe that's a bit tactless, after what happened at the {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League's{/g} hideout... but regardless, we did the "
"right thing — then, and now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요, 절대 아니죠! 이번은 특별한 경우였어요. 도시 안에서 일어난 불은 특히나 위험하지요... 하지만 어떤 화재는 이유없이 "
"일어나기 마련이랍니다.\" {n}옥타비아가 움씰합니다.{/n} \"어쩌면 조금 눈치없는 일있었을지도요, {g|Technic League}"
"기술 연맹의{/g} 은신처에서 있었던 불을 생각하며요... 하지만 우린 올바른 일을 했어요 - 그때도 그렇고 지금도 마찬가지로요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0029_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "48e2a8c4-af39-4e0b-b53c-a37babac6d87"
msgid "\"Thank you. I'm glad I can rely on you, even when we disagree.\""
msgstr "\"고마워요. 당신에게 의지할 수 있어 기뻐요, 우리 둘의 의견이 다를 때도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "186eca39-d440-4718-8794-44d68e15406e"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly! I knew you'd understand. Sometimes you have to be cruel, like at "
"the {g|Technic League}Technic League's{/g} hideout. The screams of those "
"poor souls still ring in my ears... but if we'd stopped to save them, Janush "
"would still be alive today!\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 그거예요! 당신은 이해하죠. 때로는 잔인해져야 할 때도 있어요. {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League's{/g} 은신처에서 있었던 일처럼. 불쌍한 영혼들의 비명이 여전히 귓가에 울리지만... 우리가 그 사람들을 구했다면, "
"자누시는 지금도 살아 숨 쉬고 있었을 거예요!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ab8641f-9b75-45b7-9356-75297bccbc83"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe, but... let her live. Let her carry the memory of what she's done, "
"and the knowledge that I'll never forget it, to her death. That's punishment "
"enough for her! And after what we did at the {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League's{/g} hideout... I don't want to kill again without need. I mean, I'm "
"sure it was the right decision, it's just... You know, I'm afraid of turning "
"into a monster, walking over a trail of corpses...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도 그럴지도요, 하지만...난 그녀를 살려주겠어요. 그녀가 한 짓에 대한 기억과 내가 죽을 때까지 용서하지 않는 다는 사실을 "
"짊어지고 살도록 말이죠. 그녀에겐 충분한 처벌이 될꺼에요. 그리고 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 은신처에서 일을 "
"떠올리니.. 필요 없이 사람을 죽게하고 싶지 않아요. 내 말은, 그때 올바른 결정을 내렸다는 건 분명해요, 그저..., 전 시체 무더기 "
"위를 걸어가는 괴물로 변하는 게 두려워요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Final/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "47f0cc37-78d1-4beb-9edd-d6a0f1c3cda7"
msgid "{n}Octavia seals her words with a kiss.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 키스로 말을 마무리합니다..{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "672113ce-2c03-4be2-a677-6c504be6c947"
msgid "\"So you're from a noble family?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 귀족 가문 출신었군요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "81d7cae1-3ff8-43ec-9ed0-527e5af1a46d"
msgid "\"Do you know where to find your family?\""
msgstr "\"어디서 가족을 찾을 수 있을지 알고 있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "403b7259-aee9-449a-b472-5e5047080975"
msgid "\"What about Regongar? Did you learn anything of his past?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르 쪽은 어떻습니까? 그의 과거에 대해 알아낸 것이 있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3340333c-5cb8-4150-bffd-1f419e58eb88"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll travel with you to Della Fiorni manor.\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다. 당신과 함께 델라 피오르니 장원으로 여행을 떠나도록 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "169645f6-940c-4c90-83e5-84ca2c929f72"
msgid ""
"\"You should forget about it. Nothing good will come of you meeting your "
"mother.\""
msgstr "\"잊어버리는게 좋을 겁니다. 당신의 어머니를 만나는 건 좋을 게 하나도 없을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "f8e7ebc3-dd04-4cca-9c01-e64af081ef54"
msgid "\"No. I'm against this trip.\""
msgstr "\"싫습니다. 이 여행에 반대합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "06f44e1d-8f8f-4805-b0a6-463de00bcc86"
msgid "\"How did you discover all this?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 이 모든걸 찾아냈습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3291f684-af87-4036-92cd-09af27aeff58"
msgid "Cracked a joke about Octavia's newfound title."
msgstr "새로이 알게된 옥타비아의 작위에 대해 농담을 나눴습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "ef7469bd-c808-4a75-8d09-a0feddd4293c"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish, Your Excellency. It would be an honor to serve you on this "
"excursion.\""
msgstr "\"원하시는데로, 예하. 이번 여행에서 당신을 섬기게 해 주신다면 큰 영광으로 여기겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "35b7925c-c8a8-4265-a10f-96a0ba6a0d43"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia pensively fiddles with a small metal trinket while she waits. It "
"takes her a moment to notice you as you approach.{/n} \"Oh... Hi. It seems "
"we haven't been properly introduced. Allow me: Octavia Della Fiorni, heir to "
"a noble title, a family manor... even a coat of arms with a motto.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 기다리는동안 수심 어린 표정으로 작은 금속 장신구를 만지작 거립니다. 조금 지나서야 당신이 다가오는 걸 알아차립니다. "
"{/n} \"오... 잘지냈나요. 지금까지 제 소개를 제대로 하지 못한 것 같군요. 전 옥타비아 델라 피오르니라고 합니다, 귀족 작위와 "
"가족 장원... 그리고 모토가 써진 문장도 가지고 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "b4c93b0e-635f-40d7-9b19-05dd90f82cd0"
msgid ""
"{n}With a sad smile, Octavia shows you the trinket she was playing with. "
"It's a fibula, decorated with a coat of arms — a butterfly and an arrow. At "
"the bottom you see the motto: \"Serve solely my conscience.\"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}슬픈 미소를 지으며, 옥타비아는 그녀가 만지작 거리던 장신구를 보여줍니다. 그건 문장-나비와 화살-으로 장식된 고정핀입니다. "
"아래에는 모토가 써져있습니다: \"내 양심만을 섬기리라\"{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3c40f3b4-ed49-4d64-ac09-169c0bd4b48c"
msgid ""
"\"I could hardly believe it myself, but there's no doubt — I'm the missing "
"daughter of Marchioness Della Fiorni. 'Missing'... That's what they're "
"calling it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 스스로도 믿을 수 없었지만, 의심할 여지가 없어요 - 난 델라 피오르니 후작부인의 잃어버린 딸이에요... '잃어버린'... "
"사람들은 그렇게 얘기하고 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ced175b-9430-424f-83f5-96a22fb95871"
msgid ""
"\"There isn't one, really. The Della Fiorni family was waning before I was "
"born. My mother's the last one. She's living in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, in a "
"small town house. I'm going to pay her a visit... and I'd like you to "
"accompany me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그뿐만이 아니에요. 델라 피오르니 가문은 내가 태어나기도 전에 기울고 있었어요. 내 어머니가 마지막 후손이지요. 그녀는 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 있는 작은 집에 살고 있어요. 그녀를 만나러 갈 계획이에요... 그리고 당신이 나와 함께 가줬으면 "
"좋겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2c832720-f03a-4fa0-a2ff-7829e25f7fae"
msgid "\"Thank you. It means a lot to me.\""
msgstr "\"고마워요. 저에겐 뜻 깊은 일이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e8d282ad-6eb0-4b56-bdee-306a19807101"
msgid ""
"\"Even so, I still want to see her. I... I don't even want revenge! I "
"just... need to know why.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다 하더라도, 여전히 그녀를 보고싶어요. 난... 복수 같은 것 조차 원하지 않아요! 그저 왜 그랬느지 알고 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5a582d1c-a5e7-4932-b852-1bb289d53127"
msgid "{n}Octavia sighs and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 한숨을 내뱉고 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7b27bf73-9dd5-4778-8de4-dc4c5af65e0f"
msgid "\"Yes, but he'll tell you everything himself.\""
msgstr "\"맞아요, 하지만 그 스스로가 당신에게 모든 걸 말할꺼에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "caf92a2f-b68a-4e09-ab02-67bc80370e74"
msgid ""
"\"It took a lot of work. After going through Janush's ledgers, not only did "
"we find information about our purchase, we found a wealth of other data as "
"well: connections, suppliers, meeting places... But tracking it all down "
"ourselves would have required crossing half of the River Kingdoms and all of "
"Numeria, and we couldn't abandon you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 힘들었어요. 자누시의 장부를 다 훑어본 결과ㅡ 우리가 어떻게 사고 팔렸는지에 대한 정보뿐만 아니라 다른 많은 정보도 얻을 수 "
"있었지요: 연결망, 공급자, 회합 장소.... 하지만 이 모든 걸 직접 쫓으려면 리버 킹덤 절반에 누메리아 전체를 누벼야 하는데, 우린 "
"당신을 버리고 갈 수는 없었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "faa3fa9e-d777-4bf2-9b21-7e855efb59b9"
msgid ""
"\"So we did the boring but practical thing, like kings or their entourage "
"might do — we hired a team of sleuths to follow the trail. And they found "
"everything! Who bought us, who we'd been sold to, and where we're from.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 우리는 지루하지만 실용적인 방법을 택했죠, 마치 왕이나 그의 신하들이 그렇듯 - 이 흔적을 추적할 탐정팀을 고용했어요. 그리고 "
"그들이 모든 걸 찾아냈죠! 누가 우리를 샀고, 누구에게 팔렸고, 우리가 어디서 왔느지에 대해서 말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "259ee2af-3c86-439b-89d0-331b5780105e"
msgid ""
"\"Finding my family was relatively easy. The marchioness was already looking "
"for me herself — they just needed to put a few pieces together to realize I "
"was the 'missing' heir of the Della Fiorni family. On the other hand, Reg's "
"tribe had to be found with a looking glass. But it's no matter — we "
"certainly paid them well for their trouble!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 가족을 찾는 건 비교적 쉬운일이었어요. 후작부인 자신이 날 이미 찾고 있었거든요 - 내가 '잃어버린' 델라 피오르니 가문의 "
"후계자인 걸 알아내기까지 몇 조각의 정보만 필요로 했을 뿐이었어요. 그에 비해, 레그의 부족을 찾는 일은, 돋보기로 찾아야 하는 "
"일이었죠. 하지만 상관 없어요 - 이미 수고비를 톡톡히 치러줬거든요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "c3d0702b-95ee-48cc-9ed7-da2e575beca9"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks at you, confusion written across her face. At first she "
"seems a little offended, but a moment later, she's bent in half with "
"laughter.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 혼란스런 표정으로 당신을 바라봅니다. 처음엔 그녀는 약간 상처받은 듯 했지만, 조금 지나지 않아, 그녀는 허리가 꺾어져라 "
"웃음을 터트립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fe6d8939-f600-4734-aaae-bad389d4d154"
msgid ""
"\"Excellency! Oh, I can't... My Ex-cel-len-cy! A highborn marchioness of the "
"highest rank... Whew...\" {n}Octavia wipes tears of laughter from her "
"eyes.{/n} \"Don't make me laugh so hard! Just look at me — devils take me, "
"what kind of marchioness am I? You don't think I'm going to "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} to inherit a title, do you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"각하라고요! 오, 안 돼... 각-하라니! 가장 높은 계급의 후작이라... 휴...\" {n}옥타비아는 웃느랴 흘러나온 눈물을 "
"닦아냅니다.{/n} \"웃기는 소리 그만해요! 날 보라고요 - 데블이나 데려가라지, 무슨 후작이 이 모양이에요? 내가 작위를 물려받으러 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 가는 거라 생각하는건 아니겠죠, 설마?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Garden_Start/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f06a3bbd-8a9c-4681-8c45-e5c8e774b9ce"
msgid ""
"\"But thank you anyway. The title's not important — I just want to see my "
"mother.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 어쨌든 고마워요. 작위는 중요치 않아요— 그저 어머니를 보고 싶을 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Item/OctaviaQ3_NeckReward_m_DescriptionText
msgctxt "2d8eb0af-bd75-4193-a70a-daff89dded87"
msgid ""
"This amulet gives its wearer a +6 enhancement bonus to Charisma and "
"Intelligence and a +5 resistance bonus to all saving throws."
msgstr "이 목걸이는 착용자의 매력과 지능에 +6 강화 보너스를 주고 모든 내성 굴림에 +5 저항 보너스를 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Item/OctaviaQ3_NeckReward_m_DisplayNameText
msgctxt "e9e40985-8e8f-4b26-9775-012f6c3706bf"
msgid "Della Fiorni Crest"
msgstr "델라 피오르니의 문장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Item/OctaviaQ3_NeckReward_m_FlavorText
msgctxt "29c14aa1-7fc7-4162-a06a-c1fc16b3a223"
msgid ""
"An antique silver fibula, adorned with the Della Fiorni coat of arms — a "
"butterfly and an arrow. Below it, a motto is engraved: \"Serve solely my "
"conscience.\" This is the only heirloom Octavia received from her family — "
"other than her own noble heart."
msgstr ""
"델라 피오르니의 문장인 나비와 화살로 장식된 낡은 은 고정핀입니다. 아래에는 모토가 새겨져 있습니다. : \"내 양심만을 섬기리라.\" "
"이것은 옥타비아가 가족으로부터 받은 유일한 가보입니다 - 그녀의 고귀한 마음을 제외하고는 말이죠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3debe0d2-a61f-4172-889a-29f961d70b84"
msgid "\"Who was Octavia's father?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아의 아버지는 누구입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "10f289c8-7d48-45b2-922f-f9140f6cdd5c"
msgid "\"How did Octavia become a slave?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아가 어쩌다 노예가 되었습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "cce8e0fd-6e66-4240-898b-8030c6d043e0"
msgid "\"Why didn't you buy her back?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그녀를 다시 사오지 않은겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "dcdadcb2-cf1f-4441-80bb-2b38379c533b"
msgid "\"What do you say, Octavia?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 생각합니까, 옥타비아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "7aab7050-a660-4106-850c-333e1c6ca90b"
msgid ""
"\"What is it? I wasn't expecting guests...\" {n}A woman comes out of the "
"back rooms in a dress that was once expensive but is now moth-eaten and "
"heavily mended. Her posture and gait give away a noble upbringing. She seems "
"to be in her forties, though some pain or suffering must have worn her "
"beyond her years, leaving wrinkles across her face and gray in her hair.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 일이지? 손님이 온다는 얘기는 없었는데...\" {n} 뒷방에서 한 여인이 나옵니다. 그녀의 드레스는 한때 값비쌌겠지만 지금은 "
"좀먹고 여기저기 기워진 흔적인 역력합니다. 그녀의 자세와 걸음걸이만이 그녀가 귀족이었던 사실을 보여줍니다. 사십 정도 되 보이지만, "
"얼굴의 주름과 흰머리를 보면 어떠한 고통이나 시련이 그녀를 세월에 닳아지게 만든 게 분명해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "0d2eb422-cecf-41aa-ba42-5ecf13d94788"
msgid ""
"\"I am Marchioness Clarida Della Fiorni. Welcome to my manor. I'm afraid I "
"have nothing to offer you, nor do I have the honor of knowing you. To what "
"do I owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 후작부인 클라리다 델라 피오르니입니다. 내 장원에 온 걸 환영합니다. 안타깝게도 대접해 드릴 것도 없고, 존함을 아는 영광을 "
"누리지 못한 것 같군요. 어떠한 일로 긴 걸음을 오신겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "80f92d98-a132-431c-a5af-4deec2e4e09e"
msgid "\"Hello... Mother.\""
msgstr "\"안녕.... 엄마\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "059d07d8-b839-4cc0-852f-ae844b52ff64"
msgid ""
"\"Oct... Octavia? Gods... My Octavia, is it really you? It's been so many "
"years...\" {n}The marchioness steps forward to hug her daughter, tears in "
"her eyes, but she stops when she sees Octavia's stony gaze.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"옥타...옥타비아? 신이시여... 내 옥타비아, 정말 너니? 정말 오랜 시간이 지났구나....\" {n}후작부인은 눈물을 글썽거리며 "
"딸을 안기 위해 앞으로 나섭니다, 하지만 옥타비아의 냉랭한 시선을 보자 멈춰섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "df62b4d7-8dc0-4d70-a6c8-0ca70ba8919f"
msgid ""
"\"Your Octavia? Your?! My last memory of you is selling me to the slave "
"traders! And you dare to call me yours?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 옥타비아라고요? 나의?! 당신에 대한 마지막 기억은 당신이 날 노예 매매상에게 팔아버린 거예요! 어떻게 감히 날 '나의 "
"옥타비아'라고 부를 수 있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "30ff9b5a-08fa-498a-88ae-bee56989bd5b"
msgid ""
"\"Cruel words... but fair. Octavia, my child... let me tell you what "
"happened. Afterward... you may decide on your own what to do — even if it "
"means you never wish to see me again. All I need to be happy is to know you "
"are safe and sound.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잔인한 얘기구나... 하지만 맞는 말이지. 옥타비아, 내 아가야... 무슨 일이 있었는지 셜명하게 해주렴. 어떻게 할 지는 그 후에 "
"결정에 줬으면 한단다- 설사 네가 날 절대로 다시 보지 않기를 원한다 해도 말이다. 난 그저 네가 안전하고 건강하다는 걸 알게 되어 "
"기쁘단다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ee3ffa58-2d83-414f-9c93-48b5ed9ffe82"
msgid "\"I'm listening.\""
msgstr "\"듣고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "040d6d9a-a052-43cb-bd74-0607f18e4bb5"
msgid ""
"\"A pathetic wretch, and nothing more. A visiting elf swept a silly young "
"girl off her feet, then vanished as soon as he learned she was expecting. I "
"care not to even say his name.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한심하고 비참한 악당, 그 이상 그 이하도 아니었단다. 그저 어리석은 여자를 땅에 눕히고, 그녀가 임신했다는 걸 알아채자마자 사라졌던 "
"방랑 엘프였지. 그자의 이름은 얘기하고 싶지도 않구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d6b6da48-6ac6-4325-a1a6-18ee2e1bf0e9"
msgid "\"Well, he at least made one good thing in his life, right?\""
msgstr "\"적어도 일생에 있어 좋은일은 하나 하고 갔구만, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5e0956ec-0ed4-44f0-bf9d-a45be0bb58f7"
msgid ""
"\"There are potions for those who don't wish to have children. They aren't "
"expensive.\" {n}Octavia's voice is sharp and cold.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아이를 갖고 싶지 않았을 때 사용하는 물약이 있을텐데요. 비싸지도 않구요.\" {n}옥타비아 목소리는 날카롭고 냉점합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "866311cd-9dda-474f-b36e-3160db0e11c3"
msgid "\"And what would I have done then? What would I do without you?\""
msgstr "\"그런 다음엔? 내가 너없이 어떻게 살아갔겠니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "95e5bbec-eade-431e-a7d4-36c399d1cadf"
msgid "\"Reg... Don't. Not now.\""
msgstr "\"레그... 그만해. 지금만은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "0fa60ca9-3054-417f-93dc-bfeca72a7f4a"
msgid ""
"\"My father, may his soul rest in peace, was a very stern man — some would "
"say cruel. When he found out I was expecting the child of some adventurer, "
"he expelled me from the house and cut me off from any inheritance. I scraped "
"by on my own for three years — sewing, teaching, and the like... But then "
"father discovered he was dying, and the Della Fiorni line would end. So he "
"told me he would leave the full inheritance to me if I would only get rid of "
"'my disgrace' — get rid of you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 아버지는, 그의 영혼이 안식을 취하기를, 매우 고지식한 사람이었단다 - 어떤 사람은 잔인하다고도 얘기했었지. 내가 어떤 모험가의 "
"아이를 가졌다는 건 알아채자, 그는 날 집에서 쫓아내고 모든 상속에서 배제해 버렸단다. 난 삼년동안 먹고 살기위해 무슨 일이라도 해야 "
"했지 - 바느질, 가정교사, 그런 일들 말이다... 하지만 아버지께선 자신이 죽어간다는 걸, 그리고 그렇게 되면 델라 피오르니의 혈통이 "
"끊긴다는 걸 깨달으셨고, '나의 불명예' - 바로 너를- 를 없애버린다는 조건 하에 모든 상속권을 내게 남기겠다고 하셨단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d3da2dee-5c80-4b92-9300-247c952fd528"
msgid "\"And so you did. Traded me for an inheritance. I see.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 당신은 그대로 행동했구요. 상속권을 위해 날 팔아넘긴거죠. 이제 알겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "4259f8fd-35d8-4faf-b031-d23166d62655"
msgid ""
"\"No, it wasn't like that at all! I... I had a plan... to deceive him, you "
"know? I made arrangements with a man from the {g|Technic League}Technic "
"League{/g}. He was supposed to take you to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, keep you "
"there until my father died, and then bring you back! I was trying to do what "
"I thought was best for you, do you understand? I wanted you to grow up in "
"your own manor, in luxury rather than poverty... But, once father was gone, "
"the man from the Technic League said he didn't remember any such "
"arrangements. He said he bought you, had already sold you, and had no idea "
"where you were anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 그런게 절대 아니란다. 내겐.. 계획이 있었어.. 아버지를 속일 계획말이다.. 알겠니? 난 {g|Technic League}"
"기술 연맹{/g} 소속의 사람과 계약을 맺었단다. 그는 널 누메리아로 데려가서 아버지가 죽을 때까지 지켜주고, 아버지가 돌아가시면 되돌려 "
"보내기로 했었단다! 난 너에게 최선이라고 생각했던 일을 하려 했던 것 뿐이란다, 이해하겠니? 난 네가 내 장원에서 가난 대신 부유하게 "
"자랐으면 했단다... 하지만 아버지가 돌아가시고 나자, 기술 연맹의 그 인간은, 그런 계약을 한 기억이 전혀 없다고 하더구나. 그는 널 "
"샀고, 이미 팔았으며, 더 이상 네가 어디있는 지 전혀 모른다고 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a5bc6e2f-b092-496a-a6cd-e34633fbb213"
msgid "\"Nobility, to be sure...\" {n}Regongar spits on the clean floor.{/n}"
msgstr "\"귀족들이라, 어련하시겠어...\" {n}레곤가르는 깨끗한 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "24cad268-f48b-4029-be72-0ffd56c6b439"
msgid ""
"\"I had no idea where she was! Octavia, believe me, I continued to look for "
"you all these years. I spent all of the inheritance hiring sleuths and "
"investigators to scour {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} and the {g|River Kingdoms}"
"River Kingdoms{/g} for you! But you were nowhere to be found...\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 그녀가 어디 있었는지 전혀 몰랐었어! 옥타비아, 날 믿어주렴, 그 이후로 널 계속 찾아다녔단다. 난 내 모든 상속 재산을 "
"강의 왕국들과 누메리아에서 널 찾기 위해 탐정과 조사관을 고용하는데 썼단다! 하지만 어디서도 널 찾을 수 없었지....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "66034585-7746-43ae-869a-f4d5afe758ce"
msgid ""
"{n}The marchioness wipes tears from her eyes.{/n} \"I knew you were still "
"alive. I could feel it. And I never stopped searching. I just wanted to see "
"you again, just once... to at least beg your forgiveness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}후작 부인은 눈물을 훔칩니다..{/n} \"난 네가 살아있을 줄 알았단다, 그냥 알 수 있었어. 찾는 걸 절대 멈추지 않았지. 널 "
"한 번만이라도 다시 보는 게 내 소원이었단다.. 적어도 용서를 빌 수 있게 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8e34efe6-c778-40af-a844-dfaa6190c530"
msgid "\"What is there to say...? Mother, you're such a fool!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라 말해야할까요..? 엄마, 당신은 정말 바보에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6a611adc-eb8a-47a9-ba4a-93d621efd782"
msgid ""
"\"I say I can't understand how this woman has the nerve to snivel and play "
"the innocent victim. Quit the drama, mommy dear — you seem to have lived "
"well enough all these years. You used me like a chip at the gambling house, "
"and you lost! And once you changed your mind and tried to get me back, it "
"was too late — well, too bad! Am I supposed to feel sorry for you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 뻔뻔하게 죄없는 희생자 연기를 하면서 눈물을 흘릴 수 있죠? 신파극은 집어치워요, 엄마 - 당신은 그 후로 충분히 잘먹고 "
"잘살아오신 것 같은데요. 당신은 날 도박장에서 칩처럼 쓰고, 도박에서 졌을 뿐이에요! 그리고 생각이 바뀌자 날 되찾아오고 싶어 한거고, "
"그 땐 이미 늦었던 거지요 - 그것 참 안됐네요! 제가 유감스럽게 생각해야 하나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "6eaf2c04-bcd0-467a-8098-c8574a18d1bc"
msgid ""
"\"No, my child! I... I was young and stupid. I thought I could make a better "
"life for you! I never needed the title, or even this town house...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 아니란다, 내 아가I...난.. 난 그때 너무 어리고 어리석었어. 난 네게 더 나은 삶을 줄 수 있다고 생각했단다! 난 작위나 "
"이 장원이 필요했던 게 절대 아니란다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0d3d0998-8502-412e-9240-34d6442d4eac"
msgid ""
"\"You didn't, did you? Is that so? Well, then, let me spare you of it!\" {n}"
"A smirk disfigures Octavia's face — or maybe rather a grimace of pain. She "
"tears an oil lamp from the wall and hurls it to the floor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론 필요치 않으셨겠죠? 과연 그럴까요? 그렇다면, 제가 그걸 없애 드리도록하죠!\" {n}비웃음이-어쩌면 일말의 고통이- 옥타비아의 "
"얼굴을 일그러뜨려놓습니다 - 그녀는 벽에 있는 기름 램프를 떼어다 바닥에 집어 던집니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "62c62015-d5e0-4ecc-b82c-6897bb3beb80"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia sobs.{/n} \"You think we wouldn't have done fine without a title? "
"I'd have grown up, learned some craft... We'd have been poor, probably, but "
"at least we'd have been together...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 훌쩍입니다.{/n} \"우리가 작위 없이도 잘 해냈을거라는 생각은 안해보셨나요? 내가 자라서, 기술을 좀 배우면... "
"가난하게 살겠지만, 아마도요, 하지만 적어도 함께 있을 수 있었을꺼에요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "6209b726-db79-4a87-993f-25f3da594522"
msgid ""
"{n}The marchioness and Octavia hold each other tight.{/n} \"Will you stay? "
"At least for a little while? There's so much to talk about...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아와 후작부인은 서로를 꼭 끌어 안습니다. .{/n} \"여기에 머물러 주겠니? 적어도 몇 일만? 정말 할 얘기가 많구나..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8fc74576-54cf-4461-8162-6dd21420ff92"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't it dangerous for you here, though, with just a couple of servants? "
"There's a lot of disquiet in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} right now, and trouble all "
"around. Magical beasts, barbarians... I live in {kingdomname} now — have you "
"heard of it? It's recently established. Maybe you can move there. I'll be "
"able to tell you what I've been doing all this time, and show you all that "
"I've achieved!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만, 여기서 몇몇 하인들과 혼자 계시는게 위험하지 않을까요? 지금 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}엔 안좋은 일이 너무 많아요. "
"환수들, 바바리안들... 전 지금 {kingdomname}에 살고 있어요 - 들어보셨나요? 최근에 새워진 나라 에요. 거기로 이사 오실 "
"수도 있어요. 거기 가서 제가 이때까지 뭘하며 살았고, 뭘 이뤘는지 보여드릴께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : OctMother
msgctxt "27c19421-ad88-4f94-93b8-ec38df7a58cc"
msgid ""
"\"{kingdomname}? As you say, my child. I'll begin packing immediately.\""
msgstr "\"{kingdomname}라고? 네 말대로 하자꾸나, 내 아가. 당장 짐을 싸도록 해야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d2cdb3ac-7e8c-456a-a540-65e4aaff38c3"
msgid "{n}Octavia hugs her mother again.{/n} \"I'll be waiting for you.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 다시금 어머니를 안아줍니다{/n} \"기다리고 있을께요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7c8fd8e2-7977-4d3b-8bcc-afe577d6baa0"
msgid "\"Reasonable.\""
msgstr "\"합리적이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e3f769db-6b7d-42f1-9633-1a7f395ec529"
msgid ""
"\"Those scouts must have had a great feast to your health, but without "
"moving a finger! How naive to pay for such 'services' upfront!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 정찰병들은 자네에게 한끼 식사거리밖에 아니었겠지만, 손가락 하나 움직이지 않았다니! 그런 '서비스'를 믿고 돈을 냈다니 얼마나 "
"순진한지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a6d84d4d-9e3b-4c4b-a968-bbe90b3a484e"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I can tell, not one person in this family possesses the ability "
"to think through the consequences of their actions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"분명히 말하건데, 이 가족 구성원 중 누구도 그들의 행동이 어떤 결과를 초래할지 생각해 볼 능력을 가지고 있지 않았을꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Octavia_Highborn/Mother/Cue_0041_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "56f61eca-782f-477c-bf16-ce86b767c513"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I can tell, not one person in this family possesses the ability "
"to think through the consequences of their actions!\""
msgstr "\"분명히 말하건데, 이 가족 구성원 중 누구도 그들의 행동이 무슨 결과를 초래할지 생각해 볼 능력이 없었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Barks/Dog_String
msgctxt "183de89a-5010-40d2-be5f-1ed6346e6eab"
msgid "\"Woof! Bowwow!\""
msgstr "\"컹컹! 멍멍!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Barks/Garden_after_talk_String
msgctxt "15aa9ae7-4c36-418c-a57a-2ded8239566b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't wait to talk to my father! I already know what I'm going to tell "
"him... and it'll be a short talk!\""
msgstr "\"아버지와의 대화가 벌써부터 기다려지는군! 뭐라고 할지는 이미 생각해 놨어.. 그리고 그리 길진 않을 꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Barks/Garden_after_talk_final_String
msgctxt "9029a68b-578d-4693-9554-ae02b76fc3c8"
msgid "\"Rest in peace, Brother. It's a shame we never met.\""
msgstr "\"편히 쉬거라, 형제여. 만나지 못해 유감이구나\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "91f5c683-f79c-4a4a-86e4-b8404e7af2ea"
msgid "Told Regongar your opinion on his decision."
msgstr "레곤가르의 결정에 대해 당신의 의견을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "befe2c1f-1226-44d0-a423-4cdbc4ed6d8f"
msgid "\"I'm glad you were able to forgive your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 부족을 용서할 수 있게 되었다니 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "61ddb7f6-86ec-4ea9-91da-797b784f4331"
msgid "\"You shouldn't have killed the old man. None of this was his fault.\""
msgstr "\"그 노인을 죽이지 말았어야 했어요. 그 사람에겐 아무 잘못도 없었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0013_Text_String
msgctxt "b4cb9d38-8e7c-4972-a53c-90b63ad1e775"
msgid ""
"\"You should have submitted the old man for justice. Accessory to slavery is "
"a heavy crime.\""
msgstr "\"그 노인을 정의의 심판에 넘겨야 했습니다 노예매매를 돕는 것은 중범죄입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "5436b3a5-d7e5-44ea-8a85-36944845a891"
msgid "\"They got what they deserved.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 자신들의 행동에 댓가를 치른겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "9cd69365-d5a0-4700-b060-00690f60c837"
msgid "\"I'm not here to pry or to judge. I'm just glad I could help you.\""
msgstr "\"제게 그걸 캐묻거나 판단할 권리는 없습니다. 그저 도움이 되어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0025_Text_String
msgctxt "0ae31333-df42-4800-8956-eb4505a5ec46"
msgid ""
"\"Your brother seems to have been a fine lad. I wish he were still with us.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 형제는 좋은 녀석이었던 것 같습니다. 그가 우리와 함께 있었으면 좋았을텐데 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "b3044533-a79b-400c-8857-eb49407aa1db"
msgid "\"You shouldn't have spared the old man.\""
msgstr "\"그 노인을 살려둬서는 안됐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "fe1595cc-7648-4b78-90a7-e633ed078415"
msgid ""
"\"Why the long face? You got revenge on Janush AND your tribe! You won!\""
msgstr "\"왜 시무룩하게 있는겁니까! 자누시와 당신의 부족 둘 다에게 복수를 하지 않았습니까! 당신의 승리입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9fe7780b-e9cd-4f12-97a7-80057215e00f"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar looks at the city below, dazed.{/n} \"Well, it's over. No "
"accusations, no spitting in their faces, no big fight... just a pile of "
"scorched bones and some stupid story from an old fart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 도시 아래를 바라보며, 현기증을 느낍니다.{/n} \"음, 이제 끝났어. 결국 죄에 대한 고발도, 그들의 얼굴에 침을 "
"뱉는 일도, 큰 싸움도 없었군. 그저 불탄 뼈무덤과 늙은 방구쟁이의 멍청한 이야기 뿐이었어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4c693040-0116-4648-833e-9b11f7bb2b2a"
msgid ""
"\"It's a shame I couldn't meet my brother, of course, but he's in "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} hands now, just like the rest of them. Buried "
"and... Well, no, not forgotten. I'll remember this. Just... left behind. I "
"don't waste time looking for lessons in everything like Linzi does, but if "
"any conclusion can be drawn from this story, it's this — let's not screw our "
"lives like these pieces of shit did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 내 형제를 만나지 못해 안타까워, 하지만 그는 이제 나머지 다른 사람들과 함께 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 손아귀에 "
"있으니 별 수 없지. 땅에 묻히고... 음, 아니, 잊혀지지는 않을꺼야. 내가 그를 기억할 것이니까. 그저... 뒤에 남겨져 있을 뿐이라 "
"해두지. 린지가 하는 것 처럼 모든 일에서 교훈을 찾으려 시간낭비하지는 않겠지만, 이 일에서 어떤 결론이라도 이끌어내자면, 이거야 — "
"'이 쓰레기가 했던 것처럼 우리 인생을 망치지는 말자' .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9b482c38-f5bd-43fe-bd06-bfa1b6cf9ab6"
msgid ""
"\"Really, I'm not even sure what I was expecting. Life's just a long, feeble "
"joke, and most end up being the punchline rather than laughing at it. I have "
"to let it go. So I have no tribe — so what? I have you, and Octavia, and the "
"rest of our crazy gang.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말로, 이럴꺼라고는 예상하지 못했어. 삶은 길고, 고약한 농담이야, 그리고 그 대부분이 웃음이 아니라 펀치라인에 다다랐을 때 끝나고 "
"말지. 난 이 일이 흘러가도록 내버려둘꺼야. 내겐 부족이 없어 — 그래서 뭐? 내겐 너와, 옥타비아와, 정신나간 갱단원들이 있잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fa7fb53b-3218-4fd7-948f-fbeef6375646"
msgid ""
"\"Here's the plan, then — we keep having fun together till the end. And when "
"our time comes, we go out with a blast! Anyone doesn't like it — well, they "
"can burn, heh heh heh!\" {n}The half-orc's flashes his sharp teeth in a "
"broad grin.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 이게 내 계획이야 — 함께 끝까지 즐겁게 사는거지. 그리고 언젠가 때가 되면, 폭발과 함께 사라지는거야! 다른 사람들은 "
"싫어하겠지. 옆에 있다 괜히 화상만 입을테니까 헤 헤 헤!\" {n}하프오크는 날카로운 이빨을 반짝이며 큰 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6a3cf335-a9d0-4167-8fa1-c655fb1aed34"
msgid ""
"\"You're my tribe. You. Octavia. The rest of our crazy gang. And I don't "
"need anybody else.\""
msgstr "\"너희가 내 부족이야. 너. 옥타비아. 그리고 나머지 정신나간 우리 갱단원들. 더이상 다른 사람은 필요없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fdb1d5b3-6b7b-4bd1-afc3-57d7d3eecb77"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive them? Hells no! I haven't forgiven anyone — not them, and not "
"Janush! But who cares how I treat them in my head, anyway? There are some "
"things in life you can't change. It's stupid to sit and howl about them like "
"a wolf howling at the moon, that's all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들을 용서했다고? 절대 아니야! 난 아무도 용서하지 않았어. 그들도, 자누시도! 하지만 내가 머릿속으로 그들을 어떻게 생각하던 무슨 "
"상관이야? 삶에는 내가 바꿀 수 없는 것들이 있어. 달을 보며 울부짓는 늑대마냥 앉아서 그들에 대해 울부짖는건 멍청한 짓이야, 그뿐이라고."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3ec9f1f9-1ec7-445e-a780-579f41855dd5"
msgid ""
"\"Guilty or not — what difference does it make? My father and the rest of "
"the tribe eluded me. I had to take it out on someone, and this old geezer "
"was the only one left. What, you feel sorry for him, or something?\""
msgstr ""
"\"유죄든 무죄든, 무슨 차이가 있어? 내 아버지와 나머지 부족원들은 나를 저버렸어. 누구에게라도 이걸 풀어야 했지, 그리고 그 늙다리가 "
"남은 유일한 자였고. 뭐야, 그에게 연민 같은 거라도 가지는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "17a42e03-c851-4c2f-875c-e6313fc26964"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, let him be. I'm not going to judge every stupid dog that bites someone "
"in the wastelands. Besides, it looks like nature's punished the old geezer "
"enough already!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그냥 내버려둬. 난 황무지에서 아무나 무는 멍청한 개들 전부를 모두 심판하지는 않을꺼야. 게다가, 자연이 이 늙다리를 이미 "
"충분히 처벌한 것 처럼 보이는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "51f2bf49-0fd2-4c96-8891-935c84d5500e"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't I, though? You could say we... bumped him off as part of a speedy "
"trial. A military field trial, right? Heh heh!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 이미 네 말대로 한거 아니었어? 어떻게 보자면... 우린 그를 즉결 재판에 쳐넣은거라고. 전시 군사 재판이라고도 볼 수 있지 "
"않겠어? 헤 헤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0018_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "01ac74f0-bf51-4c02-aacb-56211330a0bb"
msgid ""
"\"What does 'deserved' have to do with anything? Life's not a ledger. I'd "
"much rather have gotten to smash my father in the face and go drinking with "
"my brother — but that's not happening, is it? And it sucks. A lot. I don't "
"give two shits what they 'deserved.'\""
msgstr ""
"\"'대가'를 치르는게 큰 의미가 있었나? 삶은 장부 같은게 아니야. 아버지 얼굴에 한방 먹이고 내 형제와 술이나 한잔하러 갔으면 "
"했지만, 그런 일은 없었잖아? 개같은 일이지. 그것도 엄청. 그 두 똥덩어리들에게 '대가'를 치르게 하지는 못했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0022_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5ababfb3-2694-40f7-9f8c-28077776a191"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks. And you know what? You can pry into my soul as much as you want — "
"you've earned it. Full permission. It's not exactly a nice place in there — "
"but it's not like we're strangers, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워, 그리고 그거 알아? 원한다면 내 영혼까지 캐물어도 좋아 — 넌 그럴 자격이 있어. 100프로 허락한다 이말이야. 그곳이 좋은 "
"곳이라 얘기하긴 어렵겠지만, 적어도 거기선 우린 이방인은 아니잖아, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0026_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "62ed2670-9335-447e-9914-8da165199494"
msgid ""
"\"Me too. But there's no helping that now. We'll just have to get drunk for "
"the peace of his soul sometime!\""
msgstr "\"동감이야. 할 수 있는 일은 없어. 그저 그의 영혼의 평안을 위해 가끔 술이나 퍼마셔야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "16c655a7-8384-484f-be13-2cdd7b9d05b9"
msgid ""
"\"He's not worth it. Did you even see that dung-chafer? What was I to do, "
"get revenge on some ancient fart in place of my father? I could barely stand "
"looking at him. Forget that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럴 가치조차 없는 자야. 그 개똥벌레 같은 작자를 봤어? 내가 뭘 해야겠어, 아버지 자리에 있는 늙다리 방구쟁이에게 복수하는 거? "
"쳐다보는 것도 싫어. 잊어버리자구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_End/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5a63c9f7-ffba-4039-b06d-f2700de7f256"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh... Yeah, I won. I guess. But I feel like I just ate a pile of "
"shit. That old geezer's head was a poor substitute for my father's — doesn't "
"feel like much of a victory... But whatever, don't sweat it. I shouldn't be "
"whining. A shitty victory is still a victory!\""
msgstr ""
"\"헤 헤.. 그래, 내가 이겼지. 그런 것 같네. 하지만 똥을 삼킨 느낌이야. 그 늙다리의 머리는 내 아버지 머리의 하찮은 대체품일 "
"뿐이야. 별로 승리라곤 생각되진 않는군. 하지만 어쨌든, 신경 안써. 징징대면 안되겠지. 개똥같은 승리도 승리는 승리니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4f67ea4c-45ea-4da9-a864-965126f24082"
msgid "\"And what about Octavia? Did you learn anything about her family?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아 쪽은 어떻습니까? 그녀의 가족에 대한 단서를 뭐라도 찾았습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "10c0b210-c1bc-4ad6-a492-67c0ca647c03"
msgid "\"So who's your tribe?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 당신의 부족은 누구였습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f15b4744-744c-4d2f-bd98-bb71fe8a5324"
msgid "\"How did you end up figuring it all out?\""
msgstr "\"이걸 다 어떻게 알아냈습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b22dcb00-189b-4e0b-a928-45913c565fea"
msgid "\"I think it's for the best if you don't meet your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 부족을 만나지 않는게 최선이라 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6999a922-24ad-4214-a03f-833d23cb2fe2"
msgid "\"All right. Let's go meet your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다. 당신의 부족을 만나러 갑시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "34478efc-0b7e-4973-b2a7-aee1d8f0c7c1"
msgid "\"It's a bad idea. You should just forget about them.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이 아닌 것 같습니다. 그냥 잊어버리는게 당신에게 좋을 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "84fd01bf-bda3-444e-8ba3-bfc2c96b4754"
msgid "\"Are you looking for revenge?\""
msgstr "\"복수하고 싶은 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "39371546-7556-461f-bf42-d60d845bd52b"
msgid "Told Regongar your opinion on his past."
msgstr "레곤가르의 과거에 대해 당신의 의견을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "e44004de-94bd-4c3d-91e3-e9752fc01420"
msgid ""
"\"They tried to turn you into an animal, but you kept your humanity. That's "
"something to be proud of.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 당신을 짐승으로 만들려 했지만, 당신은 인간성을 지켰습니다. 그거야 말로 자랑스러워 할 일입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "1d3d1057-5981-40ad-b96d-addd9fb7c23b"
msgid ""
"\"We're all animals. Some of us just have a thicker veneer of civilization "
"than others.\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두가 짐승에 불과합니다. 그저 우리 중 몇몇은 남들보다 두꺼운 문명의 장벽 안에 있을 뿐이지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "8d599905-e464-483f-9693-69c0d15aeebd"
msgid ""
"\"You don't bark, though — you go straight for the throat. Everyone who "
"helped make you an animal will regret it bitterly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만, 적어도 개처럼 짖지는 않았지 않습니까 - 대신 바로 상대의 목을 노렸지요. 누구든 당신을 짐승으로 만드는 데 일조했던 "
"사람들은 후회하게 될 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ff8cd021-127d-4df2-9fe4-1a987204d88a"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar stands beneath a tree, gloomily looking down on the city "
"below.{/n} \"Ah, there you are. Well... we found my tribe. Now we just have "
"to go have ourselves a friendly chat!\" {n}The half-orc clenches his "
"fists.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 나무 아래 서서, 우울하게 도시를 내려다봅니다..{/n} \"아, 거기 있었군. 좋아... 우린 내 부족을 찾았어. 이제 "
"직접 찾아가 담소를 나누기만 하면 돼!\" {n}하프-오크는 주먹을 움켜쥡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "62ca3239-1af9-41f7-8c17-71351f11b0f5"
msgid ""
"\"You think so? I'm not really sure myself. I might just go, see their "
"stupid faces, and lop someone's head off... but I think I should at least "
"meet them. Make sure we really don't have anything in common.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 생각해? 나 스스로도 확신이 안서는군. 그냥 찾아가 그 멍청한 얼굴들을 보고, 몇몇 모가지를 따버리면 그만이라 생각했는데... "
"하지만 적어도 그들을 만나보기는 해야해. 그들과 나 사이에 공통점이 전혀 없다는 걸 확인하기 위해서라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c1db3b3c-6198-496c-a055-bfc2a9812533"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... Maybe you're right. They are just a bunch of dirty savages, selling "
"their own children off like cattle, after all...\" {n}Regongar winces.{/n} "
"\"Well, all right. If you think it's for the best, we won't go. It's a shame "
"we put so much effort into everything, but... you're right. What good could "
"come of meeting them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠... 네가 맞을지도 몰라. 그들은 아이들을 소처럼 팔아먹는, 더러운 야만인들에 불과하니까.....\" {n}레곤가르는 "
"움찔합니다.{/n} \"음, 좋아. 네가 그게 최선이라 생각한다면, 가지 않을꺼야. 이 모든것에 들인 노력이 아깝기는 하지만... 네가 "
"맞아. 그들을 만나서 좋을게 뭐가 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "06020173-1f15-4cb9-8ed0-ae24d4f43d27"
msgid ""
"\"We did! Turns out, she's- Stop, no, I'm shutting up. That's her news to "
"tell you.\""
msgstr "\"물론 찾았지! 옥타비아는 말이야, 사실- 잠깐, 아니, 난 입다물고 있겠어. 그건 그녀가 직접 말해야할 소식이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fe5c4cae-fe89-497f-baaa-a7851dbc28b0"
msgid ""
"\"The Sewer Rats! Wait, no, that's not it... The Crab Lice? The Threadbare "
"Moles... Man, I just can't seem to remember... Oh, right! The Dung Pigs!\" "
"{n}The half-orc gives you a lopsided grin.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하수구 쥐 부족! 아니, 잠깐, 그게 아니야... 사면발이? 쓰레기장의 두더지? 아 기억이 안나는군.. 오, 맞아! 똥투성이 돼지 "
"부족이었지!\" {n}하프오크는 당신에게 함박 미소를 지어보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6e08a97f-0d9f-4b2d-a33c-13a0882bd8ac"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's another story entirely. We looked through Janush's books for a "
"while, found where he bought us, from whom, who helped him... We got all we "
"could from them, but checking up on the information would have meant "
"traveling all across {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} and half of the {g|River "
"Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}. As you might recall, it wasn't exactly quiet "
"here at the time — not that it ever is, right? Heh, but you know we'd never "
"leave you to clean a mess like that yourself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그건 완전 다른 얘기지. 우린 한동안 자누시의 책을 조사했지. 누가 우릴 사고 팔았으며, 그 과정에서 누가 도움을 줬는지를 알기 "
"위해서 말이야... 거기서 필요한 정보들은 다 모왔지만, 문제는 이 정보들을 확인하기 위해선 누메리아 전체와 리버 킹덤 전체를 돌아다녀야 "
"한다는 거였지. 너도 알다시피, 그때 여기가 꽤 시끌벅적 했잖아, 뭐 안 그런적이 없긴 했지만? 그리고 이 난장판을 치우는 걸 너한테만 "
"떠넘기고 떠나진 않았을 거란건 너도 잘 알꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a84235ee-9893-4f7b-bdf2-cccd5344ac7f"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine. They call themselves the Sharp Fangs — and for good reason.\" "
"{n}Regongar grins, displaying his teeth — smaller than an orc's, but still "
"large and sharp.{/n} \"They have kids with orcs to 'strengthen their blood.' "
"Not bad, huh? They breed themselves like pedigree cattle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알았어, 알았다고. 그들은 날카로운 송곳니 부족이라 불리고 있고, 그 이름엔 그럴만한 이유가 있지..\" {n}레곤가르는 —오크보다 "
"작긴 하지만 여전히 크고 날카로운 — 이를 보이며 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \" '강한 혈통' 을 위해 오크와 아이를 가지는 부족이지. "
"나쁘지 않지, 허? 그들은 혈통좋은 소처럼 교배를 한다니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ef93bbf2-b059-462b-a32e-16fbf98b9abe"
msgid ""
"\"So I've really been sold twice — first by my orc sow of a mother, who took "
"some gold to push me and my brother out, never to see us again. Then my "
"father chose which of us to keep and which to sell to the slavers. Treated "
"like an animal my whole life. I'm surprised I'm not barking on all fours!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니까, 난 두번 팔린거지 - 오크 유전자를 팔아 나와 내 형제를 낳는 댓가로 금화 몇 전 얻고 다시는 찾아 오지 않은 내 엄마가 "
"날 한 번 판거고. 그리고 날 기른 내 아버지가 날 노예상에게 두 번째 판거고. 인생 내내 짐승처럼 취급받았던 셈이지. 내가 네발로 걷고 "
"짖지 않는 게 신기할 정도라니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bde81bc0-0456-4899-8c85-2c2dac0f8385"
msgid ""
"\"We ended up hiring a pretty brave crew headed by a good scout. We can't do "
"everything ourselves, right? They pulled some strings, followed some leads, "
"and figured everything out for us. Well, almost everything — the most "
"important parts, Octavia and I will find out for ourselves when we pay our "
"families a visit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 솜씨 좋은 정찰병이 이끄는 꽤 용감한 그룹을 고용했지. 스스로 모든 걸 다 할 순 없잖아? 그들은 조직망을 이용하고, 단서를 "
"뒤져가며, 우릴 위해 모든 걸 알아냈지. 뭐 거의 모든 것이라고 해야겠네 - 제일 중요한 건, 옥타비아와 내가 우리 가족을 직접 만나러 "
"갔을 때 알 수 있을테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d340aef5-e8c4-4579-81e7-a674682d4d61"
msgid ""
"\"Not sure what I want yet. Maybe, maybe not. Might be enough just looking "
"at these freaks to be sure nature's punished them well enough without me... "
"I'm really just looking for some closure, that's all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그걸 원하는 건지 확신이 안들어. 그럴 수도, 아닐 수 도 있지. 이 끔찍한 자들에게 내 복수대신 천벌이 내려졌는지 확인하는 "
"걸로 족할지도... 그저 직접 확인하고 싶을 뿐이야. 그뿐이라고 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "dfd2e759-e225-4064-8bd7-58695cbd6f02"
msgid "\"Ha! True, true. You just can't break Regongar!\""
msgstr "\"하! 맞아, 맞아. 나 레곤가르를 무너뜨릴 순 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b9f633a9-fad0-4b61-a3fc-062172c4716f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, well said! If that's the case, I really want to meet those pieces of "
"shit and show them what a true animal can do!\" {n}The half-orc shakes his "
"fist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하, 맞는 말이야! 정말 그런 경우라면, 그 똥무더기들을 만나 진짜 짐승이 무슨 짓을 할 수 있는지 보여주자고!\" {n}하프-오크는 "
"주먹을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Garden_Start/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1d26aa6a-f5b8-467f-9379-810adefed2ed"
msgid ""
"{n}A cruel smirk plays across Regongar's face.{/n} \"That's for sure! Ha ha, "
"hmmm... Right, that scum will get what they deserve!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잔혹하고 능글맞은 웃음이 레곤가르의 얼굴에 나타납니다..{/n} \"분명 그래! 하 하, 흠. 맞아 그 쓰레기들은 댓가를 치르게 "
"될꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Items/Mantle_Description_String
msgctxt "04f6343b-479c-4580-bed7-4f14899c03aa"
msgid ""
"This cloak gives its wearer a +6 resistance bonus to all saving throws, "
"immunity to fear and confusion effects. All spells with electricity "
"descriptor cast by the wearer inflict an additional 1 damage per die."
msgstr ""
"이 외투는 착용자의 모든 내성 굴림에 +6 저항 보너스를 주고 공포와 혼란에 면역을 줍니다. 착용자가 시전 한 전기와 관련된 모든 주문은 "
"주사위당 1 점의 추가 피해를 입힙니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Items/Mantle_Name_String
msgctxt "b283b4ee-dde2-4257-90dd-1976abd22223"
msgid "Charred Mantle"
msgstr "그을린 망토"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0d242fcc-49d0-4e9e-8981-3e4a3074bd8b"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 누구입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "386d8bbe-d801-4ad4-9c7b-ac1ebeb25a6f"
msgid "\"Tell me about your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 부족에 대해 말해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "671e3259-e413-4902-b152-ee149dc31407"
msgid "\"What happened to the Sharp Fangs?\""
msgstr "\"날카로운 송곳니 부족에게 무슨 일이 일어났습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "ed4aceec-24f9-47e7-a84a-3978bbfcd8f7"
msgid "\"What do you say, Regongar?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 생각합니까, 레곤가르?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "a2edbd08-a42e-4328-910b-633ad90de41f"
msgid ""
"{n}In the dry grass, you can barely make out signs that people once lived "
"here — burned bits of tents, rusty swords, rain-washed bones... An old half-"
"orc is the only living soul among the desolation. Wrapped in a charred "
"mantle, he sits on the ground, devouring a raw rabbit and tossing the bones "
"to a dog lying at his feet. He squints as you approach, but he doesn't reach "
"for any weapons.{/n} \"Hm? Who's there? No one comes by here anymore...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마른 들판에서, 당신은 사람들이 살았던 흔적을 겨우 알아볼 수 있습니다.- 타버리고 남은 텐트의 잔재들, 녹슨 검들, 비에 씻겨내린 "
"뼈들...늙은 하프-오크 한 명만이 폐허에서 유일하게 살아있는 영혼입니다. 그을린 망토를 두르고, 그는 땅바닥에 앉아 토끼를 생으로 "
"먹으며 남은 뼈를 발치에 있는 개에게 던져줍니다. 당신이 접근하는 걸 곁눈질로 쳐다보지만, 그는 무기에 손 댈 생각은 없어보입니다.{/n}"
" \"흠? 거기 누군가? 더 이상 이곳엔 아무도 오지 않을 터인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5298b2b9-2623-42cb-b2a8-da2f94c00e26"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Regongar — a son of the Sharp Fangs tribe, and they sold me into "
"slavery. Where are the Sharp Fangs?\""
msgstr "\"난 레곤가르다— 날카로운 송곳니 부족의 자손이지. 그들은 날 노예에게 팔아넘겼다. 부족원들은 어디있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "8d6326f1-aae5-4072-bc6b-467ccd9fc296"
msgid ""
"\"You're looking at them.\" {n}The old man points to the bones scattered "
"along the ground.{/n} \"All there, elders to children. Just me left of the "
"Sharp Fangs... Well, me and you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 보고 있지 않은가.\" {n}노인은 땅바닥에 널무러진 뼈들을 가르킵니다.{/n} \"다 저기있네. 원로부터 아이들까지. 부족원 "
"중엔 나만 남았네... 음. 나와 자네가 남았지\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "aa7f68ad-8442-4e45-9575-9e45ee951299"
msgid ""
"\"Inged, son of Shatara and last of the Sharp Fangs tribe. Got nowhere to "
"go, and my hands've been feeble a long time... I sit here and eat whatever "
"Coal brings me, waiting for some kind person to pass by and help an old man "
"bury all these bones. But no one comes here. Must think it's a cursed "
"place... and they're right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 잉게드라고 하네, 샤타라의 아들이자 마지막 남은 날카로운 송곳니 부족원이지. 어디 갈 때도 없고, 오래 전부터 내 손은 "
"약해졌다네... 난 그저 여기 앉아 뭐든 콜이 가져오는 걸 먹으며, 어떤 친절한 이가 찾아와 이 모든 뼈들을 뭍는 걸 도와주기를 기다리고 "
"있네. 하지만 아무도 여기 오지 않아. 저주받은 장소라 생각하는 거겠지... 그리고 맞는 말이기도 하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "33c81744-85e2-420e-947e-1e1dfb100286"
msgid ""
"\"Our tribe was always stronger, braver, and more valiant than the other "
"tribes. Know why? We had a tradition — mixing our blood with orc blood. Orc "
"power with human prowess — we took the best of both races! No room for "
"weaklings in the tribe. Weak children were either left in the field or sold "
"to someone from the city. You say you were sold? Must've been sickly! What "
"good would that do the tribe? Don't blame us for your own weakness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 부족은 항상 다른 부족들보다 강하고 용맹하며 용감했었다네. 이유를 아는가? 우린 -우리의 피를 오크의 피와 섞는- 전통을 가지고 "
"있었네. 오크의 힘과 인간의 자부심 - 우린 두 종족의 최고만을 취할 수 있었지. 우리 부족에 약자들이 들어설 곳은 없었네. 약한 "
"아이들은 들판에 내버리거나 다른 도시에 팔아버렸지. 자네가 팔렸다고 했나? 분명 병약했을꺼야! 그런 자들이 부족에 무슨 도움이 되겠는가? "
"자네의 나약함으로 우리를 비난하진 말게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fc9056c7-4525-4b48-9aec-d85d4be1a418"
msgid ""
"{n}As Regongar clenches his fists, Octavia places a hand on his shoulder.{/n}"
" \"Easy, now... Let him finish.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르가 주먹을 움켜쥐자, 옥타비아가 그의 어깨에 손을 얹습니다.{/n} \"진정해, 지금은... 그의 말을 끝까지 들어보자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "e3d6e540-fdc7-4a52-bdbb-968fd2ec1ede"
msgid ""
"\"Dead. All dead... Chieftain's son destroyed them. See, Chieftain Agdan, "
"may he feast eternally with {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, he didn't want anyone else's "
"kid to become chieftain after him. So he needed an heir with incredible "
"power! That's why he chose Grra the Dragon Eye to bear his children — she "
"was a mighty orc warrior who scorched her enemies with lightning! Boasted of "
"having dragons in her family. She demanded a lot of gold for it, but she "
"delivered more than she promised — she had not one child, but twins!\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽었어. 모두... 족장의 아들이 모든 걸 파괴해버렸지. 아그단 족장은 - 그가 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}과 영원토록 만찬을 즐기길 "
"- , 다른 사람의 자식이 다음 족장이 되는 걸 원하지 않았네. 그러기 위해선 강력한 힘을 가진 후계자가 필요했지! 그래서 용의 눈 가라-"
"그녀는 번개로 적을 태워버리는 강력한 오크 전사였다네-를 자신의 아이를 가질 오크로 선택했지. 자신에게 흐르는 용의 피를 자랑하며 그녀는 "
"막대한 금화를 요구했다네, 하지만 그녀는 약속했던 것보다 더 많은 아이를 낳고 말았다네 - 한 아이가 아니라, 쌍둥이를 낳은 것이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "564c2949-a02c-4606-82cd-e7e3a4d82787"
msgid "\"Well, what is there to say?\""
msgstr "\"음, 할말이 뭐가 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "ae5a6b59-e911-4b48-a397-82905110ef8e"
msgid ""
"\"Agdan thought a while on what to do, then wisely decided that a tribe "
"doesn't need two chieftains — sold the weaker one to someone from the city "
"to get back some of the gold he spent. Started raising the second one, "
"Stragarr, to be our new chieftain. The boy was all right — deft, cunning, "
"strong. And he knew how to use dragon charms — could strike an elk with "
"lightning from his hands when he was knee-high! But there must've been too "
"much orc and dragon blood in him, and too little human. Older he got, the "
"more... well, you know.\" {n}The old man knocks on his head with a bony "
"knuckle.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아그단은 뭘 해야할지 잠시 생각하곤, 지혜롭게도 부족에 두 족장은 필요치 않다는 결정을 내렸지 - 둘 중 약한 쪽을 그가 쓴 금화를 "
"보충하기 위해 도시에 팔았던거야. 그리고 남은 아이-스트라가를 미래의 족장으로 양육했지. 그 아이는 훌륭했네 — 빠르고, 교활하고, "
"강했지. 그리고 용의 주문을 사용할 줄도 알았네 — 겨우 무릎 높이 자랐을 때부터 손에서 번개를 부려 사슴을 잡을 수 있었다네! 하지만 "
"그에겐 오크와 용의 피는 너무 많았고, 인간의 피는 너무 부족했던게 분명하네. 나이가 들어갈수록, 더욱 더..... 음.\" {n}노인은 "
"깡마른 주먹으로 자신의 머리를 두드립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "090d221b-8e08-4245-9389-fecf618ddda4"
msgid ""
"\"Had a temper like a dragon — if something went wrong, he'd start fighting "
"right off. Couldn't tell his tribesfolk from strangers, and would shoot "
"lightning at the tiniest provocation. Was always cocky with his father, too —"
" called him names, screaming about how the chieftain sold his brother, "
"saying he'd look for him and return him to the tribe... In a word, crazy. "
"Anyone else would have been happy that the chieftain's mantle — the one I "
"wear now... Ahem, anyone else would be happy to be getting the mantle, "
"especially with no rivals for it. But he was stubborn — wanted his brother "
"back, no matter what! Then, one time, Agdan grew tired of Stragarr's whims, "
"decided to teach him a lesson, as a father does. Knocked him a couple times "
"with a long rod... and that was it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용과 같은 성질을 가졌었다네 — 뭔가 잘못되면, 그는 싸움부터 시작했지. 이방인이던 부족원이던, 조금만 신경에 거슬려도 번개를 "
"쏘아댔지. 아버지에게 언제나 건방졌어 — 아버지를 이름으로 부르고, 그의 형제를 어떻게 팔아넘겼냐며 소리치고, 형제를 찾아서 돌아오겠다고 "
"했지... 한마디로, 미친 놈이었던거지. 족장의 망토-지금 내가 두르고 있는 것 말일세-를 두를 수 있다면 누구든지 기뻐했을 것이네, "
"특히나 자신에 대항할 상대가 아무도 없다면 더욱 더 그랬겠지. 하지만 그는 고집스러웠지 — 는 어찌됐던간에 형제를 되찾아 오고 "
"싶어했다네! 그러다, 하루는, 아그단이 스트라가의변던에 질려, — 여느 아버지가가 그렇듯- 따끔하게 교훈을 주기로 결정했지, 긴 막대기로 "
"몇 번 두드려 패준거야... 그리고 바로 그때였다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "6b6086ef-a608-4eb5-a877-5f6fbfe6ed3c"
msgid ""
"\"Boy screamed like the hells, and his eyes flared blue. Started shooting "
"lightning all around. It was terrifying — I still see it in my sleep... "
"Flame, smoke, lightning everywhere, tents burning one after another... I was "
"too old to fight, so I hid behind a hillock to stay out of the way. Some of "
"the others, they went at him with swords... and they all died. No one "
"survived — even the little ones were burned alive. He took as good as he "
"gave, though. Died of wounds soon after. And that was the end of the Sharp "
"Fangs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"소년은 지옥 마냥 비명을 질렀고 눈은 파랗게 불타올랐지. 사방에 번개를 쏘아댔다네. 정말 두려운 광경이었어 - 아직도 악몽을 꾸고 "
"있지... 불길, 연기, 사방에서 나타나는 번개, 텐트들은 하나씩 불타고 - 난 싸우기엔 너무 늙었었기에, 바위 뒤에 숨어 피해있었지. "
"몇몇은 검을 들고 대항했지만 모두 죽었어. 아무도 살아남지 못했지 - 작은 아이들도 산채로 불타버렸여. 그래도 그는 뿌린 대로 거두긴 "
"했네. 너무 많은 상처를 입어 곧 죽어버렸지. 그게 날카로운 송곳니 부족의 최후였다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9ef833a4-524c-456f-9deb-88d009385b23"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar looks at the bones scattered in the grass, baffled.{/n} \"Brother"
"...\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 들판에 흩어진 뼈들을 보며, 당황스러워 합니다.{/n} \"형제여...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9dbb39d4-4650-4165-b26f-a03ea39588f5"
msgid ""
"\"He sounds like a nice guy. Best in his tribe. A lot like you. I wish I "
"could have met him...\""
msgstr "\"그는 멋진 남자였던 것 같아. 부족 중에선 최고였고. 너랑 많이 비슷해. 만나 볼 수 있었다면 좋았을텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d24cabc9-5a77-42e2-a078-e91a3814d162"
msgid "\"Heh... Me too.\""
msgstr "\"헤.. 동감이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bdd45699-6693-44d1-a80b-82cfdc493167"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc looks across the bones scattered in the grass.{/n} \"Lend me "
"a hand here. Let's give these jerks a proper burial, at least.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크는 들판에 흩어진 뼈들을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"좀 도와주겠어. 최소한, 이 머저리들에게 적절한 장례식은 치러주자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "af27a293-04a5-436f-8fff-dc89cfa686ff"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar severs the old man's head with a single slash of his sword, "
"taking the charred mantle from the body and draping it around his own "
"shoulders.{/n} \"Live like blind rats in a sewer, die the same way. This "
"whole story is one long, feeble joke. I'd piss on their bones, if I cared "
"enough. We should never have come here. Let's go home.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 칼질 한번으로 노인의 머리를 잘라냅니다. 그리고 어깨에 걸쳐져 있던 그을린 말토를 가져갑니다.{/n} 시궁창에서 눈먼 "
"쥐처럼 살다가, 똑같은 방식으로 간거지. 이 모든 건 길고 끔찍한 농담이야. 신경 쓸 만한 일이었다면 오줌이라도 뼈에다 갈겨줬을텐데. "
"여기 오지 말았어야 했어. 집에나 가자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "85b89877-b6c1-46df-b5fd-b877525f996e"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc turns and walks away from the burned settlement without "
"looking at anyone.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}눈길 한 번 돌리지 않으면서, 하프-오크는 불탄 정착지를 등지고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : RegQ3_LastTribesman
msgctxt "2a3ab6d7-5d46-422b-8c28-289d1d01a00e"
msgid ""
"\"Lad, you're Stragarr's brother? The chieftain's second son? This is yours, "
"then.\" {n}The old man drops the charred mantle from his shoulders, holding "
"it out to Regongar.{/n} \"Tribe might be gone, but the chieftain's mantle is "
"yours by right.\" {n}After a moment of hesitation, Regongar accepts the "
"mantle.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"청년, 자네가 스트라가의 형제라 했나? 족장의 둘째 아들? 그럼 이건 자네것이네.\" {n}노인은 그의 어깨에서 그을린 망토를 벗어 "
"레곤가르에게 쥐어줍니다.{/n} \"부족은 사라졌어도, 족장의 망토를 가질 권리는 자네에게 있네.\" {n}잠시 주저한 끝에, 레곤가르는 "
"망토를 받아들입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c783c2b8-d5ff-4ded-a090-752c8c550e11"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks, old man. May the gods grant their souls peace.\" {n}Regongar looks "
"at you.{/n} \"Let's go. Nothing left to do here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고맙소. 늙은이. 신들이 그들의 영혼에 안식을 허락하시길 \" {n}레곤가르는 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"가자고. 더 이상 볼일은 "
"없으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d3658597-b532-4b8d-bbfe-0945a265e6a3"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim scans the wasteland, covered with bones, with a long and pensive "
"look. Without saying a word, the dwarf takes a deep breath and starts "
"fiddling with his beard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 뼈로 뒤덮힌 황무지를 오랫동안 생각에 잠긴채로 훑어보았습니다. 드워프는 말없이 긴 숨을 들이쉬며 수염을 만지작거리기 "
"시작했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "071e24ec-4c75-4b98-9f13-7b6de770e0cc"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. Discovering something like this is hard.\""
msgstr "\"안타깝습니다. 이런 사실을 알게되다니 분명 힘들겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c16e84f2-9ee9-4253-8b28-5b70df2bbc11"
msgid "\"Get lost! I don't need your pity!\""
msgstr "\"꺼져! 동정따위는 필요 없으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Octavia_Regongar/Q3_Regongar_Master_Self/Last_Tribesman/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "01087b94-a79e-4f74-bb99-a357813e4bab"
msgid ""
"\"Disgusting. Every time I learn something new about the habits of savages, "
"I deeply regret it.\""
msgstr "\"역겹군. 야만인들의 습성에 대해 새로운 걸 알 때마다, 차라리 몰랐으면 좋았을걸 하는 생각이 드네..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Barks/Cleansed_RE_Bark_01_String
msgctxt "012fe431-05c1-4522-840b-c75c05747f4b"
msgid ""
"\"Die, denizen of the Abyss! The Kingdom of the Cleansed does not tolerate "
"sacrilege!\""
msgstr "\"죽어라, 심연의 거주자여! 정화된 자들의 왕국은 신성모독을 용납하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Barks/Cleansed_RE_Bark_03_String
msgctxt "d667352b-96df-40fb-bdcf-1d8b0108651d"
msgid "\"Oh, Goddess, cleanse me in a righteous death!\""
msgstr "\"오, 여신이시여, 정당한 죽음으로 저를 정화해주옵소서.!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Barks/Cleansed_RE_Bark_04_String
msgctxt "32f00f83-ce8e-45a1-a0aa-f9f3eaaf5c6b"
msgid "\"You won't escape, traitor!\""
msgstr "\"도망가지 못한다, 배신자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Barks/Cleansed_RE_Bark_05_String
msgctxt "b2489c81-b676-4433-8638-56c3152e55e2"
msgid "\"Destroyer! You don't belong in the lands of the Goddess!\""
msgstr "\"파괴자! 넌 여신의 땅을 밟을 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Barks/Cleansed_RE_Bark_06_String
msgctxt "d568a304-a805-420e-8cc2-d177180c6e3e"
msgid "\"May the cleansing commence!\""
msgstr "\"정화가 이루어지길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4ecc792e-2059-450f-a73a-198080da4e9f"
msgid "\"What did you find out about the Kingdom, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"이 '왕국'에 대해 무엇을 알아냈습니까, 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "dd985614-acf6-4d3b-bfc4-4a44a17d7555"
msgid "\"What are you holding?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 들고 있는겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fe7410c8-e5a5-4880-863a-a6d41e791d45"
msgid "Tried to kill Amalia."
msgstr "아말리아를 죽이려했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "bee5e9dc-730a-4507-bd30-9801c5cd77e4"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough of this cultist scumbag!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"이 사교도 쓰레기들을 더 이상 가만두지 않겠다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "d74d3c79-c72c-4721-940f-a38671ece3c9"
msgid "\"We must go.\""
msgstr "\"갑시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "aa4e710d-0a11-48a2-8999-69512661a094"
msgid "Jeered at the ideals of the Kingdom of the Cleansed."
msgstr "정화된 자들의 왕국의 이상을 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "b268d798-4442-4df8-8850-885162659459"
msgid "\"You've been brainwashed, girl!\""
msgstr "\"숙녀분, 당신은 세뇌된 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "4464a2e1-841c-4bb7-bba0-6af8c78ad113"
msgid "\"What 'false ruler' are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"'거짓 통치자'라니, 무슨 말 입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "bc685b0d-d912-4049-bdf3-7784b0120391"
msgid ""
"\"Are you aware that I am the very same {mf|baron|baroness} who you are "
"condemning?\""
msgstr "\"당신이 성토하고 있는 {mf|남작|여남작}란 자가 나랑 같은 사람이란걸 알고 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "746ad5f2-f740-4fcf-8017-0fd04f89def2"
msgid "\"Does your Goddess have a name?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 여신에게 이름은 있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "1acc9fbf-3de0-409d-b4cb-b6c9c2474bb1"
msgid "\"Enough.\""
msgstr "\"그만 충분합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "adc03cc6-038b-47fb-b389-8147547af625"
msgid "\"Tell me more about this 'deliverance from worldly torments'.\""
msgstr "\"'세상의 고통으로부터 구원'을 얻는 것에 대해 더 말해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "e6656333-1534-4785-97a9-0fc2ea9373c0"
msgid "\"So, what have you been discussing?\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 무슨 얘기를 하고 있던겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Barks/Amalia_01_String
msgctxt "69acd908-afd8-4ecb-8e23-30c67ce41a50"
msgid "\"The Kingdom of the Cleansed grants salvation!\""
msgstr "\"정화된 자들의 왕국은 구원을 보장합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Barks/Amalia_02_String
msgctxt "a04c9c9a-5f7f-4c3e-926e-2e4e0e186d0d"
msgid "\"We follow the way of Remus! We follow the way of the great Goddess!\""
msgstr "\"우린 레무스의 길을 따릅니다! 우린 위대하신 여신님의 길을 따릅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Barks/Amalia_03_String
msgctxt "bfbffd6d-2c81-4fa4-8476-6c044696fb13"
msgid "\"Don't hide your eyes! There's hope for everyone!\""
msgstr "\"눈을 감지 마세요! 누구에게나 희망은 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Barks/Amalia_04_String
msgctxt "3074aa62-9375-489d-a587-cec6df4446c2"
msgid "\"We want to save you! Come to our meeting!\""
msgstr "\"우린 당신이 구원받길 원합니다! 모임에 참여하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Barks/Tristian_bark_String
msgctxt "4a46e8d5-86ef-4f25-a4ae-ca4765c12083"
msgid "\"{name}! Here!\""
msgstr "\"{name}! 여기에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6b11a6c7-712a-4c02-839a-ec5ad04a75f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's forehead is wrinkled, as if the priest is deeply puzzled. He's "
"holding a piece of paper covered with writing.{/n} \"We are lucky to have "
"met you! Meet Amalia, loyal follower of the Kingdom of the Cleansed. Do you "
"remember? We've recently been discussing this... unusual initiative.\" {n}"
"The priest raises an eyebrow suggestively.{/n} \"Amalia was so kind as to "
"tell me everything that she and her friends are doing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}깊은 의문에 빠졌는지, 트리스티안의 이마에 주름이 생깁니다. 그는 글씨로 꽉 채워진 종이조각을 들고 있습니다.{/n} \"당신을 "
"만나 다행입니다. 여기는 아말리아라고 합니다. 정화된 자들의 왕국의 충성스런 지지자이지요. 기억합니까? 최근에 이 이상한 집단에 대해 "
"얘기를 나눴었지요.\" {n}사제는 무언가 제안하는 듯 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"아말리아는 친절하게도 그녀와 친구들이 뭘 "
"하려는지에 대해 모든 걸 얘기해주겠답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "be31c9cc-a9b2-49c0-a4b2-b9fd730a0a10"
msgid ""
"{n}Young Amalia turns her childishly round and freckled face, and looks at "
"you with clear green eyes. She wears a simple dress and a necklace made of "
"dried ashberries, and is holding a stack of papers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}어린 아말리아는 어린아이 같이 둥글고 주근깨가 난 얼굴을 돌려, 맑은 녹색을 띠는 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다. 그녀는 평범한 옷을 "
"입고 마른 애호박으로 만든 목걸이를 매고 있으며, 종이 더미를 들고 있습니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "6d32792c-c687-40c0-9aca-7d1dfad71ed6"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl blushes at the priest's words.{/n} \"Please stay a moment! It "
"would be a pleasure for me to tell you about our Kingdom!\""
msgstr "{n}소녀는 성직자의 말에 얼굴을 붉힙니다.{/n} \"잠시만요! 우리의 왕국에 대해 당신에게 기꺼이 말씀드리겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "9413678b-a8e1-4ebb-b50d-0fb2c725f84f"
msgid ""
"{n}Upon seeing you, the broad smile on Amalia's face wears a bit thin. She "
"attempts to size you up, then turns back to Tristian.{/n} \"Please, stay "
"another moment! It would be a pleasure for me to tell you about our Kingdom!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보자마자, 아말리아의 미소가 옅어집니다. 당신을 어림잡아 보더니 그녀는 트리스티안을 다시 돌아봅니다.{/n} \"잠시만 여기 "
"더 계세요! 우리의 왕국에 대해 당신에게 기꺼이 말씀드리겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "58218697-0f3a-481a-a3f6-fa6200b72521"
msgid "\"Aaah! Help!\""
msgstr "\"아아! 사람 살려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "19966e4b-0e62-42a3-a95e-fd189dc8bb29"
msgid ""
"\"What, you're leaving already? Wait, I need to give you something!\" {n}"
"Amalia hands you one of her papers.{/n} \"Here! These are invitations to our "
"meetings. We meet at sunset for the sacrament, delivered by the First "
"Faithful himself! Please come — you and Sir Tristian, of course!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어, 벌써 떠나시는 건가요? 잠시만요, 드릴께 있어요!\" {n}아말리아는 그녀가 들고 있던 종이한 장을 나눠줍니다.{/n} \"여기요"
"! 우리 모임의 초대장이에요. 우린 해질녘에 선지자께서 직접 선교 말씀을 하시는 예배모임을 가져요! 부디 참석해서요 - 당신과 "
"트리스티안 경, 두분다요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "23feedac-8824-4330-beb5-148bfa907598"
msgid ""
"\"I have to go too... I need to get to the other side of the city! I hope to "
"see you at our next meeting. And you too, Sir Tristian...\" {n}Amalia "
"blushes and turns away quickly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저도 가봐야 해요... 도시의 건너편에 가서 종이를 나눠줘야 하거든요! 다음 예배때 만났으면 해요. 그리고 당신도요, 트리스티안 "
"경...\" {n}아말리아는 얼굴을 붉히더니 재빨리 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "2890f701-8c70-4155-9e9c-037715256163"
msgid ""
"\"Our mission is saving innocent souls from the curse that falls upon the "
"heads of the undeserving. The Goddess is ready to guard from evil anyone who "
"kisses the ground and begs for mercy. Those who have rejected their sinful "
"ways may enter the Kingdom of the Cleansed, and pray for their speedy "
"deliverance from worldly torments.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 사명은 자격 없는 자에게 내린 저주로 고통받는 무고한 영혼을 구원하는 거예요. 여신께서는 엎드려 자비를 구하는 이라면 누구든 "
"악에서 보호하신답니다. 죄 많은 이라도 자신의 죄를 털어놓으면 정화된 자들의 왕국으로 들어갈 수 있습니다. 그곳에서, 세상에 만연한 고통으로부터 "
"속히 구원받기를 기도드리지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "56d58dee-7a3f-4940-a306-27ec61671b0d"
msgid ""
"{n}Amalia's voice becomes monotone, as if she is reading from notes, and her "
"eyes stare emptily into space, past your shoulder.{/n} \"To give your life "
"for the Goddess — isn't it the greatest honor any of us can receive? And "
"destroying the false ruler — isn't that the truest destiny of all of "
"nature's loyal servants?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아말리아의 목소리가 마치 메모장에서 읽는 것처럼 단조로워집니다. 그리고 그녀의 눈은 당신 어깨 너머의 공간을 공허하게 "
"바라봅니다.{/n} \"여신님께 생명을 바치는 일 - 그게 우리가 가질 수 있는 가장 큰 영광이 아닐까요? 그리고 거짓 통치자를 무찌르는 "
"일 - 그것이 자연의 충직한 신하의 진정한 운명 아닐까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "249282fe-4ad4-49ce-98c6-53d66b1a7864"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you fiercely, trying very hard to maintain his polite "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 예의바른 미소를 유지하려고 무척이나 노력하면서, 당신을 무섭게 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "ff67bcbc-3b88-49ce-b301-413f291e57c9"
msgid ""
"{n}Amalia shakes her head sadly.{/n} \"Don't worry. The time will come that "
"you come to understand that the First Faithful was right. I hope it won't be "
"long, when you and I will reunite in the embrace of the Goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아말리아는 슬프게 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"걱정하지마세요. 언젠간 선지자께서 옳았다는 걸 "
"깨닫게 될꺼에요. 여신님의 품안에서 당신과 내가 다시 만날 때까진 이해하시길 바랄 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "699d6753-ddf7-4f6d-818b-81f3047e7bee"
msgid ""
"{n}Amalia examines you, confused and embarrassed.{/n} \"You? It can't be! "
"You're so polite... And Sir Tristian would hardly be friends with such a "
"dreadful creature as the cursed {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아말리아는 당신을 유심히 살펴보더니, 혼란스럽고 당황스러워 합니다..{/n} \"당신이요? 그럴리가 없어요! 당신은 정말 "
"예의바른걸요...그리고 트리스티안 경 같은 분이 저주받은 {mf|남작|여남작}같은 끔찍한 짐승과 친구일리가 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "56e29195-46e6-4abf-8378-4d908241828f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, but only the First Faithful knows it. He is the high priest to whom "
"the Goddess appeared. He delivers her commandments and shows us her will. "
"Through him she lays open her design — to clear the tormented ground, "
"sending signs and opening doors to her creatures, through the bodies of "
"mortals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요, 하지만 오직 선지자께서만 아시죠. 그는 여신님께서 유일하게 직접 모습을 드러낸 대사제님이세요. "
"여신님의 계시를 전하고 여신님의 의지를 보여주지요. 그를 통해 여신님은 계획을 들어내 보이십니다. 고통받는 땅을 정화하고, 계시를 "
"보내시며, 필멸자의 몸을 통해 그녀의 짐승들이 드나들 관문을 열어주시지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "765885e1-cc70-47c1-bb20-53355b97c1af"
msgid ""
"{n}Amalia's eyes become round.{/n} \"The {mf|baron|baroness} cursed by the "
"Goddess! {mf|He|She} is the source of all our woes. {mf|He|She} cast aside "
"natural law and vandalized the field and forest!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아말리아의 눈이 동그래 집니다.{/n} \"{mf|남작|여남작}은 여신님께 저주받았어요. {mf|그|그녀}는 우리의 모든 고통의 "
"근원이에요. {mf|그|그녀}는 자연의 법칙을 져버리고 들판과 숲을 파괴했어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "bed25f82-f7c4-42bc-bb63-2d9700165f33"
msgid ""
"\"Very well. But if you wish to know anything else, please don't hesitate to "
"ask!\""
msgstr "\"좋아요. 하지만 뭐든 궁금하시면, 주저하지 마시고 물어봐주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "9da8edca-be8d-42a1-a299-0c2bc1885c2f"
msgid ""
"\"Inhabiting this world, where unhappiness and unfairness multiply, taints "
"the soul and turns it from the eternal kingdom of freedom and love, granted "
"by the Goddess. But you can cleanse your sins by accepting her gift — a "
"special goodness that sets the Cleansed apart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행과 불공평이 증식하는 이 세상에 머물수록, 영혼이 타락하고 여신님이 허락한 영원한 자유와 사랑의 왕국에서 멀어지게 되요. 하지만 "
"여신의 선물을 받아들임으로써 자신의 죄를 정화할 수 있어요. 정화된 자를 구분해주는 특별한 선물이지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "41edfd2f-ba51-411b-bad2-6c411292a176"
msgid ""
"\"I see you have many questions... Please take an invitation to our "
"meetings! We meet at sunset in the appointed place, where we accept the "
"sacrament from the First Faithful himself!\" {n}Amalia hands you one of her "
"leaflets.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"많은 의문을 가지고 계신것 같네요... 우리 모임의 초대장을 받아주세요. 우린 해질녘 약속된 장소에서 선지자께서 직접 선교 말씀을 "
"하시는 예배모임을 가져요!\" {n}아말리아가 전단지 하나를 건네줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "44793095-7c18-46f5-ae89-9171f9a21262"
msgid ""
"\"Not everyone is capable of withstanding the test, because the way to "
"cleansing lies through bodily torment. But those who overcome their passions "
"and prove their loyalty become the womb of the Goddess — to bear her "
"children, wild and beautiful as she herself! The soul of the Cleansed rests "
"in the hands of the Goddess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두가 그 시험을 통과하지는 못해요, 왜냐면 정화의 길은 육체적 고통을 통해 이루어지거든요. 하지만 욕망을 극복하고 충성을 증명한 "
"자들은 여신님의 자궁이 됩니다. 여신님 만큼 야생적이고 아름다운 아이들을 낳기 위해서죠! 정화된 자들의 영혼은 여신님의 손 안에서 안식을 "
"찾는 거구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "a545fd50-423a-4670-a389-5887d17ca87b"
msgid ""
"{n}Amalia suddenly blushes.{/n} \"I... there is someone in my family who "
"followed the Goddess' commandments. Soon I myself will enter the Kingdom — "
"and I hope that through loyal service and veneration, I will prepare myself "
"for the main test, which I have yet to endure.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아말리아는 얼굴을 붉힙니다.{/n} \"전... 제 가족 중에 여신님의 계시를 따른 사람이 있어요. 곧 저도 왕국에 들어갈꺼에요. "
"충성스런 봉사와 존경을 다해, 아직 준비되지 않은 시험에 대비하고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "aa1e6410-d0fa-424f-aaf5-6e8571fd9f65"
msgid ""
"{n}Before Tristian has time to answer, Amalia speaks up.{/n} \"These are "
"invitations to our meetings! Here, take one. We meet at sunset in the "
"appointed place — far from the city and its filth, and closer to the Goddess "
"and her Kingdom. This is where the First Faithful conducts sacraments for "
"all who wish to receive the wisdom of our patron!\" {n}Amalia hands you one "
"of her leaflets.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 대답하기 전에, 아말리아가 대답합니다.{/n} \"우리 모임의 초대장이에요! 여기, 한장 받으세요. 우린 해질녘에 "
"약속된 장소에서 만나요 - 도시와 그 죄악으로부터 멀리 떨어져 있고 여신님과 왕국에 가까운 곳이이지요. 거기서 선지자"
"께서 지혜를 얻기 원하는 모든이에게 설교를 한답니다!\" {n}아말리아가 전단지 하나를 건네줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "42802cae-f311-4c92-bca7-3df15790f86a"
msgid ""
"\"The same invitation that Amalia gave you.\" {n}Tristian shows you the "
"paper.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아말리아가 당신에게 준 것과 같은 초대장입니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 당신에게 종이를 보여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "cb568059-eeef-4f82-ba63-86490074c77c"
msgid ""
"\"Soon another meeting will take place. Do come... you and Sir Tristian.\" "
"{n}Amalia looks at the priest dreamily, then quickly blushes and looks down "
"at her toes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"곧 모임이 열릴 꺼에요. 부디 와주세요... 당신과 트리스티안 경도요.\" {n}아말리아는 사제를 꿈꾸듯이 바라보더니, 급작스럽게 "
"얼굴을 붉히며 발밑을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5f5a0188-b260-457b-ac7e-83ed07cfc041"
msgid "\"Stop!\""
msgstr "\"잠시만요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9ae60c1c-c51f-4c1e-94f2-fd8aa872ebba"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian leans gently towards Amalia.{/n} \"The Kingdom of the Cleansed "
"is a brotherhood of those who believe in the great Goddess, who promises "
"salvation in return for... cleansing. Forgive me, Amalia, if I'm missing any "
"important details...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 점잖게 아말리아에게 다가섭니다.{/n} \"정화된 자들의 왕국은 정화..를 대가로 구원을 약속한 위대한 여신을 섬기는 "
"형제단입니다. 이해하세요. 아말리아, 내가 혹시 중요한 부분을 빠뜨렸더라도..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "65e9fdb8-593d-4916-89aa-1777034eeed8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian closes his eyes.{/n} \"Goodness? What goodness could hide in a "
"painful death?\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 눈을 감습니다{/n} \"여신이라고요? 그 어떤 여신이 그런 끔찍한 죽음을 강요한단 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3f29d29b-9766-467f-afbe-55870ad3bc0d"
msgid ""
"\"I've just been asking how Amalia came to the Kingdom. What attracted her "
"to this... this teaching?\""
msgstr "\"아말리아에게 어떻게 왕국에 발을 들여놓게 된건지 물으려고 했습니다 '가르침'의 어떤 측면이 그녀를 유혹한 걸까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "21cfdf66-1e49-4285-aa4f-c2e79a72fa93"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"And your family don't mind that this will "
"happen to you? Are they ready to sacrifice you to their goddess?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"그런데 가족들은 당신에게 그런 일이 일어나도 개의치 않습니까? 당신을 여신에게 희생시킬 "
"준비가 된 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "33c70530-db17-426c-aca2-cf6605c07495"
msgid ""
"\"Of course they are! To be one of the chosen, one of the Cleansed — it's a "
"great honor for each of us!\""
msgstr "\"당연하지요! 선택 받은 자가 된다는 건, 정화된 자 중 하나가 된다는 건 - 그건 우리에게 대단한 영광이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9df71849-9eb9-49fe-9bf5-fcda655f232a"
msgid ""
"\"But you are so young. Why hurry to leave this world before you have "
"experienced it in full?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 당신은 너무 젊습니다. 인생을 충분히 누리기도 전에 왜 급히 떠나길 원하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "5c3a308b-9355-4ce8-9a38-c7703f1df55a"
msgid ""
"\"It's... wrong to think about yourself. Once I wanted to live in "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g}, wear dresses and walk down boulevards. But then these "
"terrible things started happening. So many people in our village died...\" "
"{n}Amalia looks away.{/n} \"The Goddess teaches that selfishness leads to "
"trouble. Now my only wish is to serve the Kingdom and the Goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자기만족은 해롭습니다. 한때 저는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에 살며 멋진 드레스를 입고 대로를 거닐고 싶어 했지요. 하지만 "
"끔찍한 사건이 하나둘 일어나기 시작했습니다. 마을 사람들이 죽고......\" {n}아말리아는 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"여신님께서는 "
"이기심이 재앙으로 이어진다고 가르치셨어요. 제게 남은 유일한 소망은 왕국과 여신님을 섬기는 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "343c67a0-8eb8-497d-9b67-dcc9836a3f3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian waves to Amalia sadly.{/n} \"So long, Amalia. May the... the "
"good goddess save you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 아말리아에게 슬프게 손을 저어 인사합니다.{/n} \"잘 가세요, 아말리아. 선한.. 여신께서 당신을 살피시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Items/Leaflet_String
msgctxt "75967bba-1257-4003-b620-1f5371ade260"
msgid ""
"\"Sisters and brothers!\n"
"Take a step towards a better future, in which there is no place for poison "
"and evil!\n"
"Look away from false rulers, and open your soul to the only Goddess!\n"
"Join the Kingdom of the Cleansed and stand against our common enemy!\n"
"Upon being cleansed, will you find true faith and peace!\n"
"Come to the temple at sunset — the temple without walls, filled with love "
"and happiness!\"\n"
"Below there are scribbled directions on how to get to this 'temple'. It "
"seems that the cultists' Secret Sanctum is located somewhere in Kamelands."
msgstr ""
"\"형제 자매들이여!\n"
"독과 사악함이 없는 더 나은 미래로 한발자국 나아가십시오!\n"
"거짓 통치자에게서 벗어나 유일한 여신님께 당신의 영혼을 열어 보이십시오.\n"
"정화된 자들의 왕국에 참여해 공통의 적에 맞섭시다!\n"
"정화된 자들 사이에서, 당신은 진정한 신앙과 평화를 찾게 될 것입니다.!\n"
"해질녘에 사원으로 오십시오. 벽은 없고 사람과 행복으로 채워진 사원으로 오십시오!\"\n"
"- 아래에 '사원'으로 가는 방향이 적혀있습니다. 이 사교도들의 비밀 성소는 케임랜드 어딘가에 있는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Amalia/Items/Leaflet_name_String
msgctxt "62d494fd-7c0e-4375-b47e-1d4a6388f49b"
msgid "Invitation from the Kingdom of the Cleansed"
msgstr "정화된 자들의 왕국으로부터 온 초대장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "123089ce-18ee-4ba5-93b4-f53c82a97cd2"
msgid "Asked forgiveness for attacking Amalia."
msgstr "아말리아를 공격 한 일에 용서를 구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e1f1e076-0043-41e8-86e6-15e6f61c9efe"
msgid "\"I overreacted. Forgive me.\""
msgstr "\"과민하게 반응한 것 같습니다. 용서해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "34d946ea-7318-4909-ad06-786f684fe6d8"
msgid "\"Let's forget about it.\""
msgstr "\"그 일은 잊어버립시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6acbe179-73ea-4fa8-8c99-7be731180e7c"
msgid "Threatened Tristian to prevent him from stepping in the way."
msgstr "앞으로 나서 자신을 막은 트리스티안을 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "1e6feecb-ad1f-4b17-b382-396b812c21e5"
msgid "\"Never — I repeat — never again stand in my way, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"절대— 다시 한번 얘기하지만— 절대 날 가로막지 마십시오, 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "92eb55a0-3980-4a5b-a718-82f53f5847ab"
msgid "\"Will you come with me to the meeting?\""
msgstr "\"모임에 나와 함께 가겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "d03b3b8a-50e1-4245-876f-93141e87f36a"
msgid "\"Amalia looked at you very fondly, don't you think?\""
msgstr "\"아말리아는 당신을 아주 애틋하게 바라보던데, 안그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "44da2693-86df-4f12-9d54-511b0b8fe764"
msgid "\"We have to go, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"이제 우린 이만 가봐야 해. 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "88316f4b-18b2-4fd6-9ccd-e4cfc7b82e1e"
msgid "Advised Tristian to have some fun with Amalia."
msgstr "아말리아와 놀아주라고 트리스티안에게 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "af026041-d994-4014-96e8-a279657f5384"
msgid "\"Oh, stop. A little fun wouldn't be so bad, would it?\""
msgstr "\"아, 거참. 재미 좀 볼 수도 있는 거지, 안 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "f662af46-08b3-4b90-a7a8-096285ed6f71"
msgid "\"Right. Let's get down to business.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 본론으로 들어가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "ac31b621-59c5-408a-a822-88e164bfe124"
msgid "\"What do you think awaits us at the meeting?\""
msgstr "\"모임에서 무슨 일이 우릴 기다리고 있을 것 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "00e4abdd-6726-4442-97cf-7ec4dc49fbec"
msgid "\"Is something wrong?\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 잘못됐습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "95199761-add5-4510-8dbd-698babf54f7b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks down at the leaflet he's still holding. His face is "
"sad.{/n} \"A meeting at the appointed place... there are even directions how "
"to get there. It looks like it's time we visit this sacrament.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 쥐고있는 전단지를 내려다봅니다. 그의 얼굴은 슬픔으로 가득합니다.{/n} \"약속된 장소에서 열리는 예배 모임이라... "
"그곳으로 가는 방향도 적혀있군요. 이 예배모임에 찾아가 봐야할 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "fe5bf703-732d-40aa-ba31-47c2201e9aff"
msgid ""
"{n}You see anger on Tristian's face for the first time since you've known "
"him.{/n} \"What's got into you? This was an innocent child, only repeating "
"someone else's words!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 그를 만나고 처음으로, 분노한 트리스티안의 얼굴을 봅니다..{/n} \"무슨 생각입니까? 그녀는 순진한 어린애일 뿐입니다, "
"그저 다른 사람의 말을 따라할 뿐이지 않습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a2a1f63a-c1f1-47f1-9f36-654be52fdb19"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian holds your stare.{/n} \"I will pray to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} "
"that I will never have to do it again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 눈길을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"제가 다시는 이러지 않기를 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 기도하겠습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8f90d714-51be-4a61-891c-10d757d26f53"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian breathes out.{/n} \"Just... just try not to let this happen "
"again.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"그저... 이런 일이 다시 일어나지 않도록 해주시면 좋겠습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "2f070dd7-ba88-40ca-8222-3f54fb4a0bc7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles half-heartedly.{/n} \"I'm not the one you should "
"apologize to, {name}. Instead, apologize to the poor frightened girl. "
"Anyway, nothing terrible happened, so let's get back to business.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 억지로 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신이 사과해야 할 사람은 제가 아닙니다, {name}. 대신, 불쌍하고 겁먹은 "
"아이에게 사과하시지요. 어쨌든, 끔찍한 일이 생긴 건 아니니, 보던 일로 돌아가도록 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "0055f10e-21f7-44e4-bdd5-f20ce016f1d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head and turns grim.{/n} \"You distract us from our "
"goal.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고개를 젓더니 우울한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"우리의 목표와는 상관 없는 얘기로군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "0fa545f4-f0d8-43e1-9d40-fc2ebf6f6d5f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian cringes.{/n} \"Please stop. Not only is she merely a child, but "
"she's also under the influence of these insane preachings. I must help her, "
"not take advantage of her gullibility.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 움츠립니다.{/n} \"제발, 그만두십시오. 그녀는 그저 어린애일 뿐이고, 게다가 미친 설교의 영향력 아래 있습니다. "
"전 그녀를 도와야합니다, 순진함을 이용해 이득을 취하는게 아니라요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "f84fff3a-22ff-4b95-be05-2fc6f36ed124"
msgid "{n}Tristian looks again at the leaflet he's holding.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 그가 쥐고 있는 전단지를 다시 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "02296c3e-4654-479e-804f-a8bf38b9e783"
msgid ""
"\"I would insist on participating in this investigation. I cannot let you go "
"alone, after I dragged you into this strange affair.\""
msgstr "\"이 조사에 꼭 직접 참여하고 싶습니다. 제가 당신을 이런 이상한 일에 끌여드렸는데, 당신을 혼자 보낼 수는 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "1d1e89ed-ce9c-426c-8e66-76ad1f9793bd"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks pensively into the distance.{/n} \"Whatever awaits, this "
"mysterious First Faithful will be there. Judging by his title, he's the one "
"who invented this insane Kingdom. I believe that talking to him will solve "
"many of the riddles we face.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 수심에 잠겨 먼 곳을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"무엇이 우릴 기다리던, 이 신비로운 선지자는 거기 있을 겁니다. 직위로 "
"판단컨데, 그가 바로 정신나간 왕국을 만들어낸 자입니다. 그와 얘기를 해보면 우리가 마주한 수많은 수수께끼를 풀 수 있을 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "459881fc-2ba0-4456-8742-40019575ae95"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs heavily.{/n} \"I worship {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} myself. "
"But my faith has little in common with the faith of these cultists. They "
"fill the heads of innocent children with pernicious and dangerous ideas, "
"which they cannot fully understand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 무겁게 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"저 스스로는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 섬깁니다. 하지만 제 신앙은 저 "
"사교도들의 것과 전혀 다릅니다. 그들은 죄없는 어린아이의 머리에 해롭고 위험한 이상-심지어 그들조차 제대로 이해하지 못하고 있는 이상-을 "
"채우고 있습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/Capital_Tristian/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "74f07934-3325-4284-bfa2-0c8def44aaad"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you sideways, a shy smile creeping across his face.{/n} "
"\"Funny you should notice. An unusual observation. But please, let's return "
"to the matter at hand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 시선을 피하며, 수줍은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"재밌군요. 독특한 관찰입니다. 하지만, 지금은 손안의 문제에 "
"집중하도록 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "af604f10-fb52-4747-b99c-c327839a77d3"
msgid "Refused to grant the cultists protection."
msgstr "사교도들의 안전을 보장하는 걸 거절했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d947a1da-9f47-4d2a-b287-4c228445a963"
msgid "\"I am loyal to my subjects, not to a group of crazy fanatics!\""
msgstr "\"난 내 백성들을 보살피지만, 광신도 집단은 내 백성이 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "25223ff0-0404-43c0-9e35-0e9f48f7b7c4"
msgid "Tried to prevent bloodshed."
msgstr "유혈 사태를 막으려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "aa3f18f5-3708-47fe-8df1-83c51118b930"
msgid "\"Stop! You don't know what you're doing!\""
msgstr "\"멈추십시오! 당신들은 무슨 짓을 하는지 모르고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e93623d0-fef1-4e9d-83f2-2357e739dd3a"
msgid "Taunted the First Faithful."
msgstr "선지자를 도발했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bdafb8c4-4bc1-4046-b5d0-1009f654a302"
msgid "[Draw your weapon] \"Save your breath. Even better — let's dance!\""
msgstr "[무기를 꺼낸다] \"입 닥치시오. 좀 낫군— 한 판 벌여봅시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3170370f-083d-4bac-9c0c-3a648cb8a040"
msgid "Promised slow and painful death to the cultists."
msgstr "이도교들에게 느리고 고통스러운 죽음을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "07127d3e-b2a3-45b6-ae70-5ef55d58512e"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I will gut every one of you, and hang your entrails around the "
"capital, to teach the other idiots a lesson!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"너희 모두의 창자를 꺼내서 수도 성벽에 걸쳐 걸어놓을 것이다, 다른 멍청이들에게 교훈을 줘야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6c6d5294-41f4-44c3-bb5d-34f32b55b24a"
msgid "Got upset over ruining a chance for friendship."
msgstr "친교의 기회를 망친 데 대해 분노했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4575bfda-6475-4e2b-b502-c997d56965e8"
msgid "\"It's too late to offer peace and friendship, isn't it?\""
msgstr "\"평화와 우정을 나누기엔 너무 늦은거 같군요. 그렇죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_01_Tristian_String
msgctxt "2a5ff42e-32ae-4b87-9acd-6a7e07213982"
msgid "\"We are just in time. The sacrament has already begun.\""
msgstr "\"딱 맞춰 도착했군요. 예배가 막 시작된 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_02_Doomsayer_String
msgctxt "662f6f1f-76f0-403f-9afd-ed8befb344ac"
msgid ""
"\"...the sky will split, the waters will part, and the ground itself will "
"devour the evil that comes to us from the lands of death!\""
msgstr "\"..하늘이 갈라지고, 물이 솟아오르고, 대지가 몸소 죽음의 땅에서 우릴 찾아온 악을 집어삼킬 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_03_Doomsayer_String
msgctxt "61369584-a3c1-44f8-927b-cadbbb1d98c1"
msgid ""
"\"Beware false rulers! Their foul walls and rotten locks will not protect "
"their henchmen from nature's wrath.\""
msgstr "\"거짓 통치자를 조심하라! 그들의 사악한 성벽과 조잡한 자물쇠는 그들의 수하들을 자연의 분노에서 지켜주지 못하리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_04_Tristian_Arrest_String
msgctxt "44c469d4-d7c1-4740-99ff-b5d21a84fa54"
msgid "\"Didn't you put that old man in a dungeon?\""
msgstr "\"저 노인을 지하감옥에 넣지 않았습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_04_Tristian_Converted_String
msgctxt "ecb74719-32cc-41b4-95c6-0b5768873633"
msgid "\"It appears that the restless old man started preaching again...\""
msgstr "\"저 지칠 줄 모르는 노인이 다시 설교를 시작한 모양이군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_04_Tristian_Executed_String
msgctxt "ccb14a95-6e40-46fc-aa43-f09668d3cad6"
msgid "\"Wait... didn't you order this preacher executed?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만... 저 설교자를 처형하라고 명령하지 않았습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_04_Tristian_Exiled_String
msgctxt "b5c68ec0-6074-450e-b4a8-e7a083cf1c44"
msgid "\"It looks like Remus has returned from his exile...\""
msgstr "\"레무스가 추방에서 돌아온 모양입니다....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_05_Doomsayer_String
msgctxt "8e32b98f-27dd-406c-b855-0c4f40d35822"
msgid ""
"\"Anyone who stands under the enemy's banner will be crushed by the same "
"unrelenting force that inspires me.\""
msgstr "\"누구든 적의 깃발 아래 선 자들은 나에게 영감을 주시는 무자비한 힘에 의해 무너질 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_06_Doomsayer_String
msgctxt "664b6b01-f406-4775-8e43-6628c398eb1d"
msgid ""
"\"All who fall to their knees and devotes themselves to the Goddess will be "
"cleansed.\""
msgstr "\"여신님께 무릎을 꿇고 헌신하는 자들은 정화될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_07_Doomsayer_String
msgctxt "484900a6-ea1c-46f2-b692-124e68939007"
msgid "\"Pray to her – and you will be granted forgiveness in death!\""
msgstr "\"여신님께 기도하라 - 그러면 죽음 안에서 용서를 받을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_08_Parisher_01_String
msgctxt "05568fdb-5baf-45a2-a64b-57bd5db66ab5"
msgid "\"Hail Remus, herald of the Goddess!\""
msgstr "\"여신의 전령인 레무스에게 영광을!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_08_Parisher_02_String
msgctxt "d167a614-c6a9-42b5-a5d5-dd3b8f642447"
msgid "\"Hail the prophet!\""
msgstr "\"선지자에게 영광을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_08_Parisher_03_String
msgctxt "b0b4b32f-27d4-4c89-b0af-66a52213df9d"
msgid "\"Thank you, Your Holiness!\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다, 신성한 자여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_08_Parisher_04_String
msgctxt "f7372f36-d995-41f7-8610-80092096230e"
msgid "\"May the Goddess save you!\""
msgstr "\"여신께서 당신을 구하시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_09_Amalia_String
msgctxt "29e51d51-5155-40ba-becb-a63c600c4759"
msgid "\"Brothers and sisters! Good people!\""
msgstr "\"형제 자매들이여! 그리고 선한 자들이여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_10_Amalia_String
msgctxt "ecf4a3d6-f2d2-4057-a913-426b13fdb930"
msgid "\"It is time for the sacrament. The First Faithful will bless us!\""
msgstr "\"이제 예배를 드릴 시간입니다. 선지자께서 우리를 축복하실 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_11_FirstFaithful_String
msgctxt "20a20b21-602a-4f6b-aa0e-96621d992c29"
msgid ""
"\"My subjects! Servants of the Kingdom of the Cleansed! Today is a special "
"day. The day we have long prayed for!\""
msgstr "\"내 백성들이여! 정화된 자들의 왕국의 종복들이여! 오늘은 특별한 날이오. 우리가 오랫동안 기도했던 날이 왔소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_12_FirstFaithful_String
msgctxt "56accb4c-08e8-475c-829b-ce86b7b8ee23"
msgid ""
"\"Today we shall finally wash away the filth from our souls, and clear the "
"path for our Kingdom!\""
msgstr "\"오늘이야 말로 마침내 우리 영혼에서 죄를 씻어내고 왕국으로 가는 길을 밝히는 날이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_13_FirstFaithful_String
msgctxt "1fe4c15a-625c-4a04-a5c2-d8ef895417ef"
msgid ""
"\"For today, the sacrament will end with a long-awaited sacrifice, which "
"will please the Goddess more than all our prayers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 오늘, 예배의식은 오랫동안 기다려왔던 희생으로 끝날 것이오, 그리고 이 희생은 우리 모두의 기도를 합한 것보다 여신님을 "
"더 기쁘게 할 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_14_FirstFaithful_String
msgctxt "378e822a-c3f7-4f46-9b04-6a6aa4afa314"
msgid ""
"\"Once, the Goddess asked us meager sheep to repent our sins, but in our "
"pride we were deaf to her appeals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한때, 여신께서 우리의 죄에 대한 대가로 한낱 야윈 양 한마리를 요구했지만, 자만심에 가득찬 우리는 그녀의 요구를 듣지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_15_FirstFaithful_String
msgctxt "cf234f5a-38b5-4a14-8045-2401211e7d14"
msgid "\"Now she demands another sacrifice.\""
msgstr "\"지금 여신께서 또다른 희생을 요구하신다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_16_Tristian_String
msgctxt "ccb1b3cf-1180-45e0-8e3d-708d0c7e5130"
msgid "\"Oh no...\""
msgstr "\"오 안돼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_17_Parisher_01_String
msgctxt "3a353f4d-d565-4c32-bde0-c2407d6de09d"
msgid "\"The baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr "\"남작!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_17_Parisher_02_String
msgctxt "3e46295f-56e7-4b4e-868f-2cc317dbc138"
msgid "\"Is {mf|he|she} here?!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그|그녀}가 여기 있어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_17_Parisher_03_String
msgctxt "79dd28ca-89e1-436a-baa5-8b0a13eecbd1"
msgid "\"Curse the baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr "\"남작에게 저주를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Barks/Ritual_18_AmaliaAfterFightStarts_String
msgctxt "982cb84c-70b2-45d0-b896-62861f9669d3"
msgid "\"Father! What are you doing! Stop!\""
msgstr "\"신부님! 무슨 짓이에요! 멈추세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Ruthgert
msgctxt "53ab3ad2-8c11-49ff-ad60-ed4311363010"
msgid ""
"{n}The face of the First Faithful, lit by torches, looks like a horrible "
"mask, disfigured by rage and furious triumph.{/n} \"What do you say, "
"baron{mf||ess}? Are you prepared to sacrifice your useless life for these "
"people, who you claim to care about?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}횃불로 밝혀진 선지자의 얼굴은, 분노와 맹렬한 승리감으로 일그러져 끔찍하게 생긴 가면처럼 보입니다. {/n} \"할 말 있나, "
"남작? 당신이 지키겠다고 맹세한 이 사람들을 위해 네 쓸모없는 생명을 희생할 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0cc84746-62cb-447c-8303-c239bd154ef1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian clenches his holy symbol of Sarenrae.{/n} \"I'm afraid it's too "
"late for words...\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 서렌레이의 신성한 상징을 꼭 쥡니다.{/n} \"대화로 해결하기엔 너무 늦은 것 같군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ae3c00de-2f84-465d-977a-d2401afe61d5"
msgid "{n}Yelling and swinging their weapons, the crowd attacks!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}무기를 휘두르고 고함치며, 군중들이 공격합니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1138a354-6264-4d82-8888-aeaae26943fb"
msgid "\"I think you know the answer to this question...\""
msgstr "\"그 질문에 대한 답은 이미 알고 있을거라 생각하는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3cf3ec04-c008-46a5-b607-f249eefe72af"
msgid "{n}Ekun raises his weapon.{/n} \"Well put.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 무기를 들어올립니다.{/n} \"적절하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9d942956-4e2e-401b-af85-7c29db3b1cbd"
msgid "\"Exactly! Enough chatter! Blood for {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"내말이 그말이야! 잡담은 집어치워! {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}에게 피를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8ef5ac09-c960-45d7-9c92-6e19d2d116db"
msgid "\"Bwa ha ha! I love your style!\""
msgstr "\"브 하 하! 스타일 참 맘에 든다니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Ritual/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b2f37011-3fc8-4517-ab42-f30214905989"
msgid "\"How... unsophisticated.\""
msgstr "\"이 얼마나... 교양없는지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6ec615c4-81dc-4a09-9713-ff8b2f38c27c"
msgid "\"Are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "335d4990-8890-410e-823e-a63f54326094"
msgid "\"It was a trap!\""
msgstr "\"이건 함정이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "40aaa296-7d29-4940-8300-b1e3b2feff80"
msgid "\"The other cultists are getting away!\""
msgstr "\"나머지 사교도들이 달아나고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "25f54e85-b2f4-44ec-bca8-721b87a80fce"
msgid "\"The Faithful shouted something about betraying the Goddess.\""
msgstr "\"선지자가 여신을 배반하는 것에 대해 뭐라고 소리쳤었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "59a40887-1227-48fc-a0a9-fb1ff131d624"
msgid "Spared the surviving cultists of the Kingdom of the Cleansed."
msgstr "살아남은 정화된 자들의 왕국의 사교도들의 목숨을 살려줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "c5ec4c1e-7252-4af1-a1c4-8a1e1d960bb4"
msgid ""
"\"You're right, Tristian. I hope tonight's terrors are enough to keep these "
"people away from the Kingdom forever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 말이 맞아. 트리스티안. 오늘 밤의 공포가 이 사람들이 다시는 왕국에 가까이 가지 않도록 하는데 충분했기를 바랄뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e987657a-5528-4a55-ac03-5233531ef059"
msgid "Decided to destroy the Kingdom of the Cleansed completely."
msgstr "정화된 자들의 왕국을 완전히 파괴하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "8b4a752e-7cdf-4146-a28f-1cf4f22bf300"
msgid ""
"\"I will carve out this affliction completely. I don't wish to allow the "
"remains of this insane cult to survive. They will surely hold a grudge "
"against me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 사태를 끝까지 파헤치겠어. 정신나간 사교도 잔당들이 살아남아 있는건 원치 않아. 분명 이 일에 대해 원한을 품고 있을테니 말이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/Cultist_Attacking_01_String
msgctxt "fe7454d4-846a-4b27-99b4-75a21c6da558"
msgid "\"For the First Faithful!\""
msgstr "\"선지자를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/Cultist_Attacking_02_String
msgctxt "85f7ec00-2825-4271-99dd-944a49fc919b"
msgid "\"My life will cost you dearly!\""
msgstr "\"당신을 위해 기꺼이 제 목숨을 바치겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/Cultist_Attacking_03_String
msgctxt "ed30dbce-1f18-482c-ba4d-9217b3298226"
msgid "\"Goddess, help us!\""
msgstr "\"여신이여, 저희를 도와주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/Cultist_Fleeing_01_String
msgctxt "7918977c-31e5-4797-8961-bdd478849f5a"
msgid "\"I don't want to die! Mercy!\""
msgstr "\"죽고 싶지 않아! 자비를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/Cultist_Fleeing_02_String
msgctxt "cb51b1fb-1bc3-4432-bbce-514e834a71ce"
msgid "\"The First Faithful abandoned us!\""
msgstr "\"선지자가 우리를 버렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/Cultist_Fleeing_03_String
msgctxt "f74680bd-d797-453e-a3c6-dd8be277cbec"
msgid "\"Save yourselves! Save yourselves!\""
msgstr "\"살고 싶으면 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Barks/FirstFaithful_RunsAway_String
msgctxt "68e5dfea-27d4-4057-8061-61197e23e65e"
msgid "\"Damn it! The Goddess will know of your betrayal!\""
msgstr "\"제길! 여신께서 너의 배신을 알게될것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8a36bac3-146a-4fa0-9296-84d84957f1ab"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's forehead is sweating and he breathes heavily as his eyes scan "
"the battleground.{/n} \"I can't believe... everything... turned out like "
"this...\" {n}The priest gulps and closes his eyes, as if trying to summon "
"his courage.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}전장을 둘러보는 트리스티안의 이마에는 땀이 흥건하고, 그는 거칠게 숨을 몰아쉽니다.{/n} \"믿을 수 없군요... 모든게... "
"이런 결과를 낳다니...\" {n}성직자는 눈을 감고 침을 삼킵니다, 마치 용기를 내려고 노력하는 것처럼.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "87cfe584-0338-4d0a-8b68-dee811b53c3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hesitates a moment.{/n} \"Yes... No. No, I'm not all right. I'll "
"never get used to how quickly a peaceful conversation can turn into a bloody "
"battle. This was so cruel and... pointless.\" {n}Tristian forces something "
"resembling a smile.{/n} \"Don't worry. I'll gather myself now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 주저합니다.{/n} \"그렇... 아니. 아니요, 괜찮지 않습니다. 평화로운 대화가 이렇게 금방 피비린내 나는 "
"전투로 변해버리는 건 결코 익숙해지지 못할겁니다. 이런 일은 너무 잔인하고... 무의미합니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 미소 비슷한 무언가를 "
"지어보려 노력합니다.{/n} \"너무 걱정하지는 마십시요. 이제 정신이 좀 드니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "98d038a0-2ee3-4e40-a989-83f8ab2ad233"
msgid ""
"\"You may not have noticed, but the First Faithful's face changed the very "
"instant he noticed you. I think he's been prepared for our visit for a long "
"time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 눈치채지 못했을 수 있겠지만, 선지자가 당신을 본 순간 얼굴빛이 달라졌습니다. 내 생각엔 그가 이 만남을 오래 전부터 "
"준비하고 있었던 듯 싶군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "dea2192f-74c1-4fc1-9d3b-437053b53807"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head and catches his breath.{/n} \"I have no idea "
"what's going on in his insane mind. Perhaps he meant that you refused to "
"submit to his knife...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙이고 심호흡을 합니다. .{/n} \"그의 정신나간 머릿속에 무슨 생각이 들었는지 도무지 알 수가 없습니다. "
"아마도 당신이 그의 칼에 복종하는 걸 거절했다는 뜻이였을지도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d35ab368-daef-4352-8991-6e08702a0fed"
msgid ""
"\"Please, let them be. Their leader is gone. Their friends are dead. They... "
"they are just lost souls, led into temptation by a wicked leader.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부탁입니다. 그들을 놓아주세요. 그들의 지도자는 사라졌고, 친구들은 죽음을 맞이했습니다. 그들은... 그들은 그저 사악한 지도자의 "
"유혹에 이끌린, 길잃은 영혼에 불과합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "79fee5a1-0924-4e4e-b432-f7935f4ba264"
msgid ""
"\"If we are to eradicate this affliction, we must find the First Faithful. "
"It wouldn't help even if we tracked down every peasant in his cult. Please, "
"let us return to the city and consider how we may find their leader.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 사태를 뿌리뽑기 위해선, 우린 반드시 선지자를 찾아야 합니다. 예배에 참석했던 농민들을 모두다 잡아들인다 하더라도 큰 도움이 "
"되진 않을 것입니다. 부디, 도시로 돌아가 그들의 지도자를 어떻게 찾을지 고민해보도록 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0841de64-d0ef-4e42-bfce-d9ef22acb742"
msgid "\"I was hoping for another answer.\""
msgstr "\"다른 대답을 기대했었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0dea0bb0-1d41-4956-89ca-0c978a4c3a34"
msgid "\"Thank you. Their deaths would be a heavy burden on my heart.\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다. 그들의 죽음은 내 가슴에 큰 짐이 될것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "de308f84-c986-479b-8e4a-747853d09815"
msgid ""
"\"As soon as we reach the capital, I will seek out former cultists and learn "
"where the First Faithful might have escaped. Find me in the city later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수도에 가자마자, 이전에 사교도였던 사람들을 찾아 선지자가 어디로 도망갔을지 알아보도록 하겠습니다. 나중에 도시에서 절 "
"찾아와주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "622f2f82-949f-473c-baa1-30463b76ffa5"
msgid ""
"\"Take heart. We have to catch the cultists who escaped — it is too early to "
"grieve for the fallen!\""
msgstr "\"마음을 다잡읍시다. 도망간 사교도들을 잡아야 합니다 - 쓰러진 자들을 위해 슬퍼하기엔 너무 이릅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8472549d-ff39-4608-bf9a-aba98933b7e3"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe he saw the future in his sacred trance — and the imminent end. Who "
"knows, maybe he just wanted to spare you long suffering, cutting your life "
"short?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 성스런 명상에서 미래를 봤을지도 모르겠습니다 - 코앞의 종말도요. 누가 알겠습니까, 그저 당신의 삶을 끝내서 당신을 오랜 "
"고통으로부터 구해주길 원한 것일지도요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "58243fe8-1277-467c-8e4f-1396ee133a1a"
msgid "\"Oh. Thank the gods. Too much blood for one sacred ritual!\""
msgstr "\"오. 신들이시여 감사합니다. 한번의 성스런 의식에서 너무 많은 피를 흘렸어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "bbffdf75-6df0-4da7-b408-5b00d6777b03"
msgid "\"Yes! Cut and crush! Let Lamashtu lovers feast on remains!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 베고 부서버려! 라마슈투 숭배자들이 그 잔해에서 잔치를 벌이게 하자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "3bee5d4b-e2d9-4c98-8179-7cba55cb0b43"
msgid "\"And I'm not surprised, not even a little bit. Fanatics…\""
msgstr "\"전혀 놀랍지 않군요, 조금도요. 광신도들이란…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q1_KingdomOfTheCleansed/TaldanMine/Tristian_AfterFight/Cue_0031_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "301d734e-e758-418f-9c7e-419fb6b5fc54"
msgid "\"And I'm not surprised, not even a little bit. Fanatics…\""
msgstr "\"전혀 놀랍지 않군요, 조금도요. 광신도들이란…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Amalia_01_String
msgctxt "15f284cc-3acd-479c-8049-dd09ea7dde4c"
msgid "\"What was that? A column of light... and I felt such a relief...\""
msgstr "\"뭐였지? 빛으로된 기둥... 이런 위안을 느낀건 처음이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Amalia_02_String
msgctxt "2cc0eddc-e899-4585-8cc7-16a4bccb076b"
msgid "\"What did Sir Tristian say? Sarenrae? What a beautiful name...\""
msgstr "\"트리스탄 경이 뭐라고 했더라? 새런레이? 정말 아름다운 이름이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Amalia_03_String
msgctxt "3438d037-c5d5-4078-b00b-5ab623cc5c93"
msgid "\"How... how should I live now? Where shall I go? Perhaps... home.\""
msgstr "\"이제 어떻게 살아야 하는 걸까요? 어디로 가야하지요? 아마도... 집으로 가야겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Before_FFDialogue_01_Amalia_String
msgctxt "b83446e9-7446-4f5e-9d51-6d674fc451b2"
msgid "\"I'm so scared...\""
msgstr "\"너무 두려워요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Before_FFDialogue_02_FF_String
msgctxt "7e3e6e59-799a-4c8e-b8e7-ca460745154a"
msgid "\"Goddess, receive the most innocent of your children!\""
msgstr "\"여신이시여, 당신의 아이들 중에 가장 죄없는 자를 받으십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Cultist_Attack_01_String
msgctxt "10e0e6c2-de53-444e-a77d-738dc392adc1"
msgid "\"Sacrifice! Sacrifice!\""
msgstr "\"희생! 희생!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Cultist_Attack_02_String
msgctxt "040e309b-8a48-4cc5-b8d1-f3e32bad70ac"
msgid "\"In praise of the Goddess!\""
msgstr "\"여신님께 비나이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Cultist_Attack_03_String
msgctxt "b4e2ddc7-5489-4c97-bb84-bc5275990b41"
msgid "\"Goddess, receive my sacrifice!\""
msgstr "\"여신이시여, 제 희생을 받으주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Suicide_01_FF_String
msgctxt "c955e220-42e9-4cb0-8fee-550f7f4aac8a"
msgid "\"One final sacrifice...\""
msgstr "\"마지막 희생...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Suicide_02_Tristian_String
msgctxt "b8d97b08-c22d-4b14-a8ba-fe5f79d09c25"
msgid "\"Stop!\""
msgstr "\"멈춰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Suicide_03_Amalia_String
msgctxt "dcc05a65-3d95-4b87-a9ee-1e1f7b8d47b7"
msgid "\"Faithful! No!\""
msgstr "\"선지자! 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Suicide_04_Cultist_String
msgctxt "6453dffd-2ed8-4ecf-88e7-a44c394ce020"
msgid "\"F... Faithful?\""
msgstr "\"신... 신자?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Suicide_05_Cultist_String
msgctxt "fbb94cc5-8a09-4811-b010-ae44e65cc115"
msgid "\"The First Faithful is dead! Run!\""
msgstr "\"선지자가 죽었다! 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Suicide_06_Cultist_String
msgctxt "1ec99163-0a50-41f5-9983-525867d9a769"
msgid "\"We're doomed!\""
msgstr "\"우린 망했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "df920ef2-939a-4b07-85b9-89621e0b7932"
msgid "Tried to save Ruthgert."
msgstr "루스거트를 구하려했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "21689e0a-3e5d-4f61-8e05-3ac8c97b7dc1"
msgid "\"Stop, Ruthgert! Don't do something you can't undo!\""
msgstr "\"그만두십시오, 루스거트! 되돌릴 수 없는 짓을 하지 마십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e286ecfc-4f81-435c-95fc-beee26d87233"
msgid "Allowed Tristian to deal with Ruthgert."
msgstr "트리스티안이 루스거트를 상대하게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "4d89719b-7a3f-4a95-b6fb-bfc1fe3dd8fc"
msgid "\"Tristian, you know him better than I do. Stop him!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안, 나보다 당신이 그를 더 잘 알지않습니까. 그를 멈추십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6186a8c4-db2c-4cfc-a819-162afd235e6b"
msgid "Allowed the First Faithful to sacrifice Amalia."
msgstr "선지자가 아말리아를 희생시키게 내버려뒀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6dd08ff4-96b6-4d84-81fa-f1f8c84e1d0f"
msgid "\"Come on, cut the girl! Let's hear her squeal.\""
msgstr "\"어서 하라고, 베어버려! 꽥꽥소리를 내는지 들어보자구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ae0d769b-e859-466f-b80d-f93c5e352678"
msgid "Attacked the First Faithful without thought for Amalia."
msgstr "아말리아를 생각지 않고 선지자를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "9f34bade-e3ae-4c20-8611-6861a66a575c"
msgid "[Attack] \"Death to the Cleansed!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"정화된 자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c5752b00-7d20-4696-9ab1-a0dbe76672ac"
msgid "Tried to save Ruthgert."
msgstr "루스거트를 구하려고 시도했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "98ad6f97-e75e-4d4d-ab5a-52f2a5cad78a"
msgid ""
"{n}The First Faithful looks at you from under a hood drawn over his eyes. "
"Despite his face being cast in shadow, you see deep wrinkles near the "
"priest's mouth, and dark circles under his eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}선지자는 후드 아래 감춰진 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다. 그의 얼굴에 그림자가 씌어져 있지만, 당신은 입가의 깊은 주름과, 눈가의 "
"다크 서클을 볼 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "e08a8276-ac09-479e-b088-e59970f892c5"
msgid ""
"{n}From under a low-drawn hood you see the eyes of an insane man. The "
"Faithful lets out an indistinct murmur, then starts roaring with "
"laughter.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}살짝 내려간 후드 아래로 당신은 정신나간 자의 눈과 마주칩니다. 선지자는 알아들을 수 없는 중얼거림을 내뱉더니, 갑자기 미친듯이 "
"웃기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "35b615fd-f27d-4311-897f-263c87d98997"
msgid ""
"\"You again...\" {n}The voice of the Faithful is hoarse, and he coughs "
"several times.{/n} \"Damn it, I lost my voice because of endless prayers to "
"my stern Goddess... Whatever you have in mind — your cursed "
"{mf|grace|grace|highness|highness} — you won't stop us. I shall return these "
"people to grace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 너군...\" {n}선지자는 탁한 목소리로 말하며, 여러번 기침합니다.{/n} \"빌어먹을, 난 근엄하신 여신님께 끝없이 "
"기도하는 통에 내 목소리를 잃어버렸다. 네가 무슨 생각을 가지고 있던 간에 — 이 저주받을 왕이여 — 넌 우릴 막지 못한다. 난 이 "
"사람들에게 광명을 돌려줄 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "9184f90c-a159-46fb-9f38-3fc2684d94e4"
msgid ""
"\"P-Please, my {mf|King|Queen}! I h-h-have to die... in praise of the "
"Kingdom! I am the last hope!\""
msgstr "\"제발, 나의 {mf|왕|여왕}이시여! 전 죽-죽어야 해요... 왕국에 기도를 올리면서! 제가 마지막 희망이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "791d75fe-a6fa-4905-a58c-823b1739920e"
msgid ""
"\"Here you are my {mf|King|Queen}! Right in time to witness my triumph! Look "
"around! The Goddess has shown me mercy. Look how she sends her children to "
"tear and kill the unfaithful! One final sacrifice, and the gates of the "
"Kingdom will open!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오셨구만, {mf|왕|여왕}! 때맞춰 내 승리를 목격하기 위해 찾아왔군! 주위를 둘러봐라! 여신께서 내게 자비를 배푸셨다. 여신께서 "
"어떻게 불신자들을 찢어 죽이기 위해 그녀의 자손들을 보냈는지 똑똑히 보았겠지. 이제 단 하나의 마지막 희생이면 왕국으로 가는 문이 열릴 "
"것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : C22-Amalia
msgctxt "cbd49c6d-d93c-48eb-8cff-f147a21361c5"
msgid ""
"{n}Amalia's voice is barely audible. She's sobbing and shaking from "
"terror...{/n} \"P-P-Please... don't...\""
msgstr "{n}아말리아는 훌쩍이며 공포에 떨고 있습니다.{/n} \"제-제-제발... 그러지....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ce374748-593b-43f0-a2f5-f6efebf9bd73"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hesitates for a moment.{/n} \"Look at me, Ruthgert. You know me. "
"I was the messenger of your 'goddess'. One who, like you, tried to destroy "
"{name}. I stand beside {mf|him|her} now — undeserving, but forgiven.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 주저합니다.{/n} \"저를 보십시오. 루스거트. 당신은 나를 알지 않습니까. 난 당신 '여신'의 전령이었습니다. "
"당신처럼, {name}을 파괴하려 했었지요. 지금 난 {mf|그|그녀}의 편입니다 — 그럴 자격이 없지만, 용서를 받았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "939d0a85-80ef-4f47-922f-6835ff49fa2a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hesitates for a moment, then resolutely clenches his fists.{/n} "
"\"Oh, I will stop him, be sure. {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, strengthen my hand!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 주저하더니, 결의에 차 주먹을 쥡니다{/n} \"오, 그를 막겠습니다, 반드시. "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}시여, 제 손에 힘을 주소서!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8c894da8-f988-4b43-9fe8-9b9b114951e1"
msgid ""
"\"Poor, lost souls! You've been fooled! Deceived! Stay your hand, Ruthgert, "
"while you still can!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍하고 길잃은 영혼이여! 당신은 속고 있습니다! 기만당하고 있는 거란 말입니다! 손을 거두세요, 루스거트, 아직 늦지 않았습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "bff4f904-94a9-466a-8f04-a959739163cc"
msgid ""
"\"Ruthgert, you poor fool... Flaming {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, guide my "
"blade.\""
msgstr "\"루스거트, 불쌍하고 어리석은 자여... 불타는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}여, 내 칼을 인도하소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e19201ab-7ef9-4deb-a93d-4fbbabce1a47"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know what the two of us have in common? We were both deceived. They "
"used our weakness to control us, like puppets. But now we both have a second "
"chance — though we may not dare to believe it. But I swear, if you lower "
"your blade now...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 둘의 공통점이 뭔지 압니까? 우리 둘 다 기만당했다는 겁니다. 그들은 우리를 지배하기 위해 우리의 약점을 이용했습니다, 마치 "
"꼭두각시처럼. 하지만 이제 — 감히 믿기 어렵겠지만 — 우리 둘 모두 두번째 기회를 가지게 됐습니다. 맹세컨데, 지금 칼을 거둔다면..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "12889714-e7c7-439d-b22a-73c1da7791a4"
msgid "\"Why should I listen to you?! You're a traitor!\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜 네 말을 들어야 하나? 넌 배신자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9dc99d44-7e62-4980-a4bc-7e0ccd8dc218"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. I betrayed the {mf|King|Queen} in serving Nyrissa. I betrayed you — "
"left you alone in the dark when she abandoned you. And I shall live with "
"that burden for the rest of my days. Just as you will have to live with all "
"the wrongful deaths you've caused.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇습니다. 난 한 때 나이리사를 섬기기 위해 {mf|왕|여왕}을 배반했습니다. 그리고 난 당신도 배반했습니다. 그녀가 당신을 버렸을 "
"때 당신을 어둠속에 홀로 남겨뒀지요. 난 그 짐을 내 생의 마지막 날까지 짊어지고 살아갈 것입니다. 당신이 일으킨 모든 부당한 죽음을 "
"짊어지고 살아가야하는 것 처럼 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0385b89d-0cd7-439c-bfe6-3e96ea41fc74"
msgid ""
"\"But you can still stop — right now! Put down your blade. Give up these "
"futile hopes. Find the spark of forgiveness in your heart. You know the "
"goddess will not return. You know these sacrifices are in vain. The only "
"thing spurring you to these atrocities is your own pride. Pride, and despair."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 당신은 여전히 멈출 수 있습니다! 칼을 거두세요. 무의미한 희망을 거두십시오. 당신 가슴에 있는 용서의 불꽃을 찾으십시오. "
"여신이 돌아오지 않을 것이란 건 잘 알지 않습니까. 이 희생들이 헛된 것이라는 것도 알겁니다. 당신을 이 죄악으로 몰아가는 건 당신 "
"자신의 자긍심입니다. 자긍심과 절망이란 말입니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e93b73ad-693f-4e75-90a6-5a22bf1d3f5f"
msgid ""
"\"You've lost the grace of not one, but two gods. I can understand what "
"you've been through, though not entirely. I lost the grace of only one.\" {n}"
"Tristian gulps heavily and continues hoarsely.{/n} \"I'm begging you... put "
"down your blade. Stop this madness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 하나가 아니라 두 신으로부터 은총을 잃었습니다. 당신이 어떤 일을 겪었는지 난 이해할 수 있습니다. 완전히는 아니겠지요. 난 "
"오직 한 분의 은총만을 잃었으니.\" {n}트리스티안은 무겁게 숨을 쉬며 쉰 목소리로 이야기를 계속합니다.{/n} \"간청하겠습니다... "
"칼을 거두세요. 이 광란을 멈추십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "2dcd5770-33de-4206-b0b0-b80b4217aed9"
msgid ""
"{n}Ruthgert pierces Tristian with his eyes.{/n} \"All these gods... they are "
"such capricious, greedy creatures. And they're the ones we entrust with our "
"souls? What pathetic creatures we must be...\" {n}The priest chokes out a "
"broken laugh, then closes his eyes and exhales with a groan.{/n} \"I am so "
"tired...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}루스거트는 트리스티안을 응시합니다.{/n} \"이 모든 신들... 변덕스럽고 탐욕스러운 존재들이야. 그런데도 우리는 영혼을 바쳐 "
"믿어야 한단 말인가? 우리 인간들이란 얼마나 애처로운 존재인가...\" {n}성직자는 간헐적인 웃음을 터트리더니 눈을 감고 한숨을 "
"내쉽니다.{/n} \"난 정말 지쳤어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "7312f980-8c02-4df7-9fa6-7b912d78b919"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest bites his lip.{/n} \"You are wrong, my "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. I know how to fix everything. I can return "
"the grace of the Goddess. I know what I'm doing.\" {n}The knife in "
"Ruthgert's hand starts to shake.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"넌 틀렸다, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. 난 모든 걸 고칠 방법을 알고 있어. 난 여신의 "
"은총으로 돌아갈 수 있다. 난 내가 뭘 하는지 알고있어.\" {n}칼을 쥔 루스거트의 손이 흔들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "50c18fba-9e76-4ec7-b28a-2bb2de3928ae"
msgid ""
"\"Enough, Ruthgert. It's only your pride and despair talking. The Goddess "
"will not return. She used the Kingdom, then abandoned it to the mercy of "
"fate. — The same way she used and abandoned me. Put down the blade. Stop "
"this madness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만두십시오, 루스거트. 오직 당신의 자긍심과 절망 때문에 이러고 있지 않습니까. 여신은 돌아오지 않을 것입니다. 그녀는 왕국을 "
"이용만 하고 자비의 손길에 내버렸습니다 — 나를 이용하고 버린 것과 같은 방식으로 말입니다. 칼을 내려놓으세요. 이 광란을 멈추십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "b7f2d856-8625-476b-9d14-eb5d7afeb73f"
msgid ""
"{n}Ruthgert shifts his gaze from you to Tristian and back.{/n} \"You... you "
"are so happy in your ignorance... Do you have any idea what it feels like to "
"lose the grace of the deity you've served all your life?!\" {n}The priest "
"closes his eyes and groans softly.{/n} \"I'm so tired...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}루스거트는 잠시 눈길을 트리스티안에게 향하더니 다시 외면합니다.{/n} \"너... 넌 네 무지 속에서 행복하겠지.. 평생에 거쳐 "
"섬겨온 신의 은총을 잃는다는게 어떤 기분인지 상상이나 할 수 있겠나?!\" {n}성직자는 눈을 감고 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"난 "
"지쳤어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "ef4a1ba3-a1de-4801-8149-07d1442d1860"
msgid ""
"\"Enough. I will do what I must.\" {n}Ruthgert raises the knife above his "
"head.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그만. 난 내가 해야할 일을 할 것이다.\" {n}루스거트는 머리 위로 칼을 들어올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "14e98a44-38cc-46d2-b971-e02d4c8a7b18"
msgid ""
"\"NO!\" {n}Tristian throws his hands into the air, almost screaming his "
"spell.{/n}"
msgstr "\"안돼!\" {n}트리스티안은 허공에 손을 던지며, 주문을 소리칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "1ff92bae-0f27-4b56-a8d6-6c27377e72e6"
msgid ""
"\"My congregation is depending on me! I failed once to beg salvation from "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}. Now I must beg it from the Goddess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 신자들의 운명이 내게 달려있다! 난 한때 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}로 부터 구원받는 데 실패했다. 이젠 여신님에게서 "
"구원을 구할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f38d802a-af9b-43cc-81bc-cd98847eab0b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you, surprised and full of sorrow.{/n} \"Are you... are "
"you still trying to save him? After everything that...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 놀라움과 슬픔에 가득차 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"당신은... 당신은 정말 그를 구하려는 겁니까? 이 모든일이 있은 "
"후에도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : C51-Ruthgert
msgctxt "91d4847b-a10f-4374-9c05-ba150a3181e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Ruthgert raises his knife over Amalia with a roar.{/n} \"GODDESS, I "
"PRAISE YOU!\""
msgstr "{n}함성을 지르며 루스거트는 아말리아 위로 칼을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"여신이여, 제 기도를 들어주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "69668086-ed94-4b8f-8bf9-03aa29db1710"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear the half-elf grind her teeth in anger.{/n} \"If as much as one "
"hair falls from this girl's head... just one hair...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 하프 엘프가 분노에 차서 이를 가는 소리를 듣습니다.{/n} \"그 아이 머리카락 하나라도 건드렸다간... 머리카락 "
"하나라도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cc6907b1-f8cb-4466-9088-22f936374d99"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun watches Ruthgert's every move tensely. His hands, usually tightly "
"holding a weapon, seem to tremble slightly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 루스거트의 행동 하나 하나를 주의깊게 바라봅니다. 그의 손은, 여느 때와 같이 무기를 꽉 잡고 있자만, 살짝 떨고 있는 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1096ac9d-eeb6-4a11-af35-b0236f58743f"
msgid "\"Amusing.\""
msgstr "\"재밌군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "48c44b5b-5c75-421a-b86b-ecf85d415f9d"
msgid "\"Blood for {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Gorum}고룸{/g}에게 피를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/FirstFaithful_Final/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5b902e05-933e-4422-bcb9-2ba109a4e48d"
msgid "\"Yes, split her throat open!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 목을 따버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7c3c63aa-2ff0-4c13-ab44-b12872470c46"
msgid "\"Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "dbce2adf-511c-4885-82ff-acbdff0e061d"
msgid "\"Are you... talking to Sarenrae?!\""
msgstr "\"당신은... 지금 서렌레이와 대화하는 겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3c6d008f-4dac-46d6-9565-8842576bde02"
msgid "\"Can I talk to her?!\""
msgstr "\"내가 그녀와 얘기 할 수 있겠습니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4e5563e8-1298-4da0-a78b-b8f11f76c27e"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 벌어지는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "36c458af-7759-4838-9c45-4206f318c4df"
msgid "\"Go to Sarenrae, Tristian. It's what you've always wanted.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이에게 가십시오, 트리스티안. 언제나 원하던 일 아닙니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "148aca01-239b-473f-bb5e-4562f9b147c6"
msgid ""
"\"Please, Tristian, stay on Golarion. You've brought mercy to the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, such as these lands have never seen. There still "
"remains so much good you can do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"부탁합니다, 트리스티안, 골라리온에 머물러주십시오. 당신은 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 이 땅이 단 한 번도 "
"보지못한 자비를 가져왔습니다. 이곳엔 당신이 필요한 선행이 아직 많이 남아있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "bf4a471f-003f-4639-94a4-861a6f288e01"
msgid "\"It is up to you, Tristian. Up to you... and your goddess.\""
msgstr "\"당신 뜻대로 하십시오, 트리스티안. 당신과... 당신의 여신의 뜻대로\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "900ba455-4000-485c-bb70-fddada11bd34"
msgid "Was excited when Sarenrae appeared."
msgstr "서렌레이가 나타나자 흥분했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "aa1657ca-e33b-41b9-a0d1-3c3918b1fc20"
msgid ""
"\"This... this is amazing! Sarenrae herself came to you! And forgave you! "
"It's beyond belief!\""
msgstr "\"이건.. 정말 놀랍습니다! 서렌레이 스스로가 당신에게 와서 당신을 용서하다니! 믿을 수가 없군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a07c9c9d-7ab0-48fa-8910-335efc9e0d63"
msgid "Reacted to Tristian's redemption with a joke."
msgstr "트리스티안의 구원을 농담거리로 여겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "34b72631-c8a5-4264-9704-e6317b1279bb"
msgid "\"Does this mean you'll finally stop your whining and nagging?\""
msgstr "\"이제 더 이상 당신이 징징거리는고 낑낑거리는 걸 안봐도 된다는 의미입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8a844c80-ddaa-4008-9a53-34e5396da5de"
msgid "Rudely dismissed Tristian after his redemption."
msgstr "구원이 있은 후 트리스티안을 무례하게 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "a3ae18e3-759c-482a-8442-7bffb09af25b"
msgid ""
"\"Finally this stupid nonsense is finished. Let's go — I have more pressing "
"business elsewhere.\""
msgstr "\"드디어 이 멍청한 짓거리가 끝났군. 갑시다 — 내겐 더 중요한 문제들이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f97fae04-fd84-49f5-b0e5-8a388da7d282"
msgid "Rejoiced at being able to help Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안을 도울 수 있었던 걸 기뻐했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "22444c16-a208-4b08-a0b2-ad4ab207c43b"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad you endured this ordeal and found forgiveness, and I'm pleased "
"that I could help you.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 시련을 견디고 용서를 찾아 기쁩니다. 그리고 그걸 도울 수 있어 기쁘게 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "5d321603-e33d-46bf-a74e-c8f6287cd69d"
msgid "\"Don't leave me, Tristian. I can't imagine life without you.\""
msgstr "\"날 떠나지 말아줘요, 트리스티안. 당신없는 삶은 상상할 수도 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "79d46b01-c9c0-4ffa-97fb-3ce23470f70a"
msgid "\"Could it be that Sarenrae speaks to you at last?\""
msgstr "\"마침내 서렌레이가 당신에게 말을 건 것입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "78c698db-4dcd-4585-9e9b-4df5effcf8e5"
msgid ""
"\"I prayed for you, Tristian. It's a blessing that you've received "
"Sarenrae's favor again!\""
msgstr "\"언제나 당신을 위해 기도했습니다, 트리스티안! 서렌레이의 은총을 다시 얻다니 큰 축복입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Barks/Tristian_Bark_02_String
msgctxt "e84f72ca-65f0-4e4e-adb5-08f8c19d19a9"
msgid ""
"\"But I don't understand... this light! And the power that stayed Ruthgert's "
"hand! They are so familiar...\""
msgstr "\"이해가 안되는군요... 이 빛! 그리고 루스거트의 손에 머물렀던 권능! 매우 낯이 익군요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Barks/Tristian_Bark_03_String
msgctxt "d2b9a84c-934c-4aa0-98c0-52d029706e72"
msgid "\"What is it? Do you hear? That voice...\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭐지요? 들립니까? 저 목소리는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Barks/Tristian_Bark_04_String
msgctxt "388253d7-ff87-4ea9-bba0-60452ec95e55"
msgid "\"… lady mine?\""
msgstr "\"… 나의 여신님?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Barks/Tristian_Good_Bark_01_String
msgctxt "492bebc5-64b6-4519-a51d-0839ff019cb5"
msgid ""
"\"This is not how I'd hoped to finish the story of the Kingdom... but it's "
"the will of gods. And of those who worship them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕국의 이야기가 이렇게 끝나길 바라진 않았지만.. 이게 신들의 뜻이라면, 그리고 그들을 섬기는 자들의 의지라면 어쩔수 없겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Barks/Tristian_Stern_Bark_01_String
msgctxt "5db06cea-a392-4854-8a7e-94557cf30aa1"
msgid ""
"\"A quick and painless death is the final mercy given to those like Ruthgert."
"\""
msgstr "\"빠르고 고통없는 죽음은 루스거트 같은 자들에게 줄 수 있는 최후의 자비입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3e59a4da-b1be-47ee-9e4d-e3d8a9ef6ee1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's face seems to emit a soft radiance, and his entire figure is "
"enveloped in a vibrant, golden haze. He moves his lips, as if speaking with "
"someone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴에 부드러운 광휘가 나타납니다. 그리고 그의 신체는 일렁이는 금빛 안개로 둘러쌓여 있습니다. 그는 어떤 이와 말하는 "
"것처럼, 입술을 움직입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "f50991a6-c103-467e-829e-4a0b23f3b3a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian opens his eyes wide, and there is molten gold under his eyelids, "
"emitting a warm light. Tristian's voice roars, as if a whole host of divine "
"creatures speaks through him.{/n} \"{name}? I am here. And with me — the "
"light of my goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 눈을 크게 떴습니다. 그의 눈꺼풀 아래에서 녹아내린 황금같은 따뜻한 빛이 뿜어져 나옵니다. 트리스티안의 목소리가 "
"메아리칩니다, 마치 신적인 존재가 그를 통해 말하는 것 같이.{/n} \"{name}? 난 여기있습니다. 내 여신의 빛과 함께 있습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "fa72bd17-8905-4546-8c8f-d423db4d7988"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs — and a choir of voices laughs with him, sending shivers "
"down your spine.{/n} \"Forgive me. Only her servants can hear her voice. But "
"I will repeat her words to you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 웃었니다 — 동시에 합창의 목소리가 함께 웃는 소리가 들리자, 당신의 등골이 서늘해짐을 느낍니다.{/n} \"용서하십시오"
". 오직 그녀의 종복만이 여신의 목소리를 들을 수 있습니다. 하지만 제가 그녀의 말씀을 되풀이 해드리도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "7095bdb9-4b14-42e9-a3a5-538e7c6b2a71"
msgid ""
"\"The most merciful believes that I have drained the cup of retribution to "
"the dregs. In turning away from her will, I set in motion events that hurt "
"the lives of many mortals. In her wrath she took away what once she had "
"granted — until I cleansed myself of pride and cowardice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 자비로운 분께서 제가 인과응보의 잔을 마지막 한 모금까지 들이켜게 되리라 말씀하셨습니다. 서렌레이의 의지를 저버리고, 수많은 "
"필멸자의 목숨을 앗아간 결과지요. 분노한 여신께서는 제게 내린 축복을 거둬가셨습니다. 제가 오만과 비겁함으로부터 스스로를 정화할 때까지 "
"말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "d3f8a026-5367-4521-a8c7-5f93803c697f"
msgid ""
"\"She... she decided to return me to her. She's agreed to spare me my mortal "
"chains, that I may spread my wings once more!\" {n}Tristian laughs happily, "
"and the unseen choir turns his laughter into a symphony.{/n} \"O, lady mine, "
"my {g|Sarenrae}Healing Light{/g}, never shall I stumble again and leave you!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"여신께서... 여신께서는 제가 그녀에게 되돌아오게 하기로 결심하셨습니다. 여신께선 저를 필멸의 사슬에서 놓아주시고, 다시 한번 제 "
"날개를 펼칠 수 있도록 만들어주셨답니다!\" {n}트리스티안은 기쁘게 웃습니다. 보이지 않는 합창이 그의 웃음을 교향곡처럼 들리게 "
"합니다.{/n} \"오, 나의 여신이시여, 나의 {g|Sarenrae}회복의 빛{/g}이여, 다시는 주저하거나 당신을 떠나지 않겠습니다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "cb28bc57-95c7-414b-83a6-9dae04fb4a21"
msgid ""
"\"But...\" {n}The deva sighs, stunned, as if remembering something.{/n} \"But"
"... Nyrissa... and the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}... and you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만...\" {n}데바는 한숨을 쉬더니, 무언가 기억해 낸 듯 잠시 멍한 듯 서있습니다.{/n} \"하지만...나이리사... {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}... 그리고 당신...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "76449f55-1158-4558-b266-8c932ea0a004"
msgid ""
"{n}You watch the divine glow fade and disappear. Tristian slumps to the "
"ground, sighs, and opens his blind eyes.{/n} \"She... she's gone.\" {n}He "
"lowers his head and suddenly shivers, as if he is chilled to the bone.{/n} "
"\"It's so cold without her glow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 성스러운 광휘가 사그라들면서 사라지는 걸 지켜봅니다. 트리스티안은 땅에 주저앉아, 한숨쉬며, 멀어버린 눈을 뜹니다.{/n} "
"\"여신께서... 떠나셨습니다.\" {n}고개를 숙인체 뼛속까지 한기가 들어선 듯, 갑자기 몸을 떱니다.{/n} \"그녀의 광휘가 없으니 "
"너무나 춥군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "f747d578-db0b-4434-a1a9-b398b9941b86"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian freezes, and the golden veil that embraces him begins to "
"vibrate. The deva's lips are moving, and then they cease, as if the "
"inaudible conversation has come to an end.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 멈춰서고, 그를 감싸안은 황금빛 장막이 떨리기 시작합니다. 데바의 입술이 움직이다 멈췄습니다. 마치 들리지 않는 대화가 "
"끝난 듯.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "9a579aec-c7f9-4d80-8595-424bcc8e0400"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian stands tall and turns to you. There's an infinite tranquility on "
"his face.{/n} \"But her light is with me again. Here.\" {n}He touches his "
"chest and smiles — not at you, but at that which only his blind eyes can "
"see.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 곧게 서서 당신을 향합니다. 그의 얼굴엔 무한한 평안이 떠오릅니다. {/n} \"하지만 다시, 그녀의 빛과 함께 할 수 "
"있게 되었습니다.\" {n}그는 그의 가슴을 만지며 미소를 짓습니다 — 당신을 향해서가 아니라, 오직 그의 멀어버린 눈만 볼 수 있는 "
"무언가를 향해서.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "1d5925b6-89ef-46cd-9555-1762ddaa56ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian stands up, trembling, and remains still for a few moments, "
"looking away. Then he shivers and waves to you.{/n} \"There is nothing else "
"for us here. Let us go, {name}\". {n}Lingering, Tristian adds "
"sorrowfully.{/n} \"If you wish to talk, let's talk in the city. I wish to "
"leave here as quickly as possible.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 일어서더니, 몸을 떨고, 잠시동안 먼 곳을 바라봅니다. 그는 부르르 떨더니 당신에게 손짓합니다.{/n} \"더 이상 "
"여기서 볼일은 없는 것 같습니다. 가시지요, {name}\". {n}주저하더니, 트리스티안은 슬프게 덧붙힙니다.{/n} \"할 말이 "
"있다면, 도시에 가서 하도록 하지요. 가능한 빨리 이곳을 떠나고 싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "e55b6721-5a9d-487e-844d-6f409e6a70ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs.{/n} \"Truly spoken, {name}! We live in a time of "
"miracles.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 웃습니다.{/n} \"진정 그렇습니다, {name}! 우리는 기적의 시대에 살고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "c62bcace-c96a-4767-9129-4642fd637d40"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"I was just hoping to repair something, to "
"make amends... and for this I have received the grace of my goddess. And it "
"is all because you didn't turn away from me in my darkest hour. I don't know "
"if I can ever repay you for this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"난 그저 잘못된 것을 고치고, 일어난 일을 정정하길 바랬을 뿐입니다.. 그 일로 전 여신의 "
"은총을 되찾았지요. 모든게 저의 가장 어두운 순간에 당신이 저를 져버리지 않았기 때문입니다. 이 은혜를 어떻게 되갚을 수 있을지 "
"모르겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "438a99d9-3383-427f-a433-406e4267701e"
msgid "{n}Tristian chuckles.{/n} \"I promised I wouldn't bother you again!\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 웃습니다.{/n} \"다시는 당신을 귀찮게 않겠다고 약속하지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "e2f69226-c9c8-4914-8364-e70a3e69819c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian seems to not notice your words. Finally he sighs and as if "
"emerging from a daze, and turns to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 말을 듣지 못한 것 같습니다. 마침내 그는 한숨을 쉬더니, 몽롱한 상태에서 벗어나, 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "704ecc1f-4a32-4297-9be1-9194263c081c"
msgid ""
"\"If you don't mind, let us go home. We will have plenty of time to discuss "
"what has happened.\""
msgstr "\"괜찮다면, 집으로 갑시다. 무슨 일이 벌어졌는지 얘기할 시간은 충분히 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "f0579875-abe4-4333-9521-3961faa18078"
msgid ""
"{n}The golden veil around Tristian becomes dazzling. He closes his eyes and "
"sighs — and then smiles.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안을 둘러싼 황금빛 장막이 눈부시게 빛납니다. 그는 눈을 감고 한숨을 쉬더니 — 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "163e7ffd-180b-489b-9a27-2004599d3300"
msgid ""
"\"My goddess sees the shining thread that connects us. She blesses you and "
"entrusts me with guarding your life — until the day our fates come apart. "
"That is my mission, and I will remain faithful to it until the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저의 여신께서 우리를 연결하고 있는 빛나는 실을 보셨습니다. 그녀는 당신을 축복하셨고, 제게는 저희의 운명이 갈라지는 날이 올때까지 "
"당신의 생명을 지키라 명하셨습니다. 그것이 저의 사명이며, 끝날 때까지 그 사명에 충실하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0b0da6ab-07e7-4a19-9a2f-d9e5ba019746"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal takes a step back, her face disfigured by a painful grimace.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 뒤로 물러섭니다. 그녀의 얼굴은 고통스런 찡그림으로 일그러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ba4aade9-26b8-4641-bde8-e5cea6057a65"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi opens her mouth with astonishment. She fumbles in her bag for her "
"loyal journal, but she can't take her eyes off the priest shimmering with "
"light.{/n} \"Is... is this what I think it is? Then... then... damn, where's "
"my notebook?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 경탄에 차서 입을 다물지 못합니다. 그녀는 그녀의 귀중한 저널을 찾기 위해 가방을 뒤적이지만, 빛으로 일렁이는 성직자로부터 "
"눈을 땔 수가 없습니다.{/n} \"설마... 제가 생각하는 바로 그건가요? 그렇다면... 그렇다면... 젠장, 공책은 어디있는거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f77b644c-2b98-4209-9dc6-24b1f88918ca"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sighs and whispers ever so softly.{/n} \"Look at him. I cannot "
"stand fanatics, but this... this is so sincere.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 한숨쉬며 부드럽게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"그를 봐요. 광신자는 참아주기 어렵지만, ... 너무나 참되고 진실된 신앙이군요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9a16df69-3027-4211-8453-9fef830366e5"
msgid "\"Pff. I wouldn't count on that.\""
msgstr "\"쳇. 나였음 그런데 의지하진 않았을텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6ae76c79-f4d0-4d7e-903f-b8ace98b70c2"
msgid "\"Finally. We're just wasting time here.\""
msgstr "\"결국. 여기서 시간낭비만 하고 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "542b38c9-0325-4e24-a883-f82da5f64bf5"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost taps his chin with a finger.{/n} \"Hmm. Hmmmm. Of course, this "
"is an amazing phenomenon, but I can't think of a good use in any of my "
"articles. Though, just watching this seance was quite curious.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 손가락으로 턱을 만지막거립니다.{/n} \"흠. 흐음. 물론, 정말 굉장한 현상이지만, 내 저작거리로는 쓸모를 생각해 "
"낼 수 없군. 그렇지만, 이 광경을 보는 것만으로도 상당히 흥미로워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "73fabf53-42d3-4aa2-a6c7-51b2cdef2d01"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs — and a choir of voices laughs with him, invoking a "
"shivering sensation.{/n} \"Sarenrae says she heard your prayers. Thank you, "
"{name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 웃습니다 — 떨리는 감각을 일깨우며, 합창의 목소리가 그와 함께 웃습니다.{/n} \"서렌레이께서 말하시길 당신의 "
"기도를 들었다고 하십니다. 감사합니다, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "0a8962cc-7b20-4746-a862-2ce71eb24490"
msgid ""
"\"Those 'good' gods and their famous mercy… The souls of Bloom victims "
"should applaud and weep tears of happiness, I suppose?\""
msgstr ""
"\"'선한' 신들과 그들이 자랑하는 자비라니... 그럼, 개화에 희생된 자들의 영혼들도 기쁨에 겨워 박수치고 눈물을 보여야 하는 것입니까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0065_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5924ef47-639f-46cc-9abe-df6646c4e0ea"
msgid ""
"\"Those 'good' gods and their famous mercy… The souls of Bloom victims "
"should applaud and weep tears of happiness, I suppose?\""
msgstr ""
"\"'선한' 신들과 그들이 자랑하는 자비라니... 그럼, 개화에 희생된 자들의 영혼들도 기쁨에 겨워 박수치고 눈물을 보여야 하는 것입니까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a53c0c34-3df3-462f-8129-874630bf2de9"
msgid ""
"\"Nice! I hope you'll fly away to your goddess now, and stop annoying me "
"with your happy idiot's face, winged boy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘됐군요! 당신의 여신에게 날아가버리길 바랍니다. 더이상 당신의 멍청하게 웃는 얼굴로 날 짜증나게 만들지 않았으면 합니다, 날개달린 "
"소년이여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_0066_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2a6e78a6-050a-480d-a510-147dd89cf3af"
msgid ""
"\"Nice! I hope you'll fly away to your goddess now, and stop annoying me "
"with your happy idiot's face, winged boy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘됐군요! 당신의 여신에게 날아가버리길 바랍니다. 더이상 당신의 멍청하게 웃는 얼굴로 날 짜증나게 만들지 않았으면 합니다, 날개달린 "
"소년이여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_TristianIsDevastated_Text_String
msgctxt "82265031-7411-4e79-aa83-fca1143fe49c"
msgid ""
"{n}The glow that surrounds Tristian dims noticeably. His voice softens.{/n} "
"\"No... I am undeserving of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} grace. There remains "
"much I still must learn, here among the mortals. And if after this I still "
"do not return to her — well, such retribution would be fair.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안을 둘러싼 광휘가 눈에 띄게 희미해집니다. 그의 목소리가 부드러워집니다.{/n} \"아니요... 전 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 은총을 받을 자격이 없습니다. 여기 필멸자들 사이에서 배울 께 여전히 많습니다. 그리고 나서도 "
"제가 여신에게 돌아가지 않는다면 — 음, 그런 벌은 공평했다고 할 수 있겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_TristianReturnsToSarenrae2_Text_String
msgctxt "81b423ab-85cd-4cfd-8944-e720a24bdbfc"
msgid ""
"\"My goddess sees a darkness upon the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Such "
"evil must not cast its shadow on {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. It must be turned "
"to nothingness, by mercy or deliverance. I am {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} "
"warrior, and will do my duty — and then... then I will be returned to her "
"light.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저의 여신은 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 드리운 어둠을 보았습니다. 그러한 악이 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에 그림자를 드리우는걸 용납 할 순 없습니다. 이 악은, 자비를 통해서든 구원을 통해서든, 무로 "
"되돌가야합니다. 저는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 전사입니다, 그리고 그 의무를 다할 것 입니다 — 그 후에... 그 후에 "
"여신의 빛으로 돌아가겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_TristianReturnsToSarenrae_Text
msgctxt "800fecdd-262f-463b-bc5f-a581a997350a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian freezes and the golden veil that envelops him begins to "
"vibrate.{/n} \"Yes, {name}. Yes. But not now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 멈춰서자, 그를 감싸안은 황금빛 장막이 떨리기 시작합니다. {/n} \"맞습니다, {name}. 그러겠습니다. 하지만 "
"지금은 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/DunswardOutdoor/TristianCommune/Cue_TristianStaysMortal_Text_String
msgctxt "c7492d82-9d95-49ec-b973-c94543b53878"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian remains silent for a moment. Then a sad smile dresses his "
"face.{/n} \"I must stay. I shall walk the mortal path once more, to its end. "
"Only then shall I earn the right to serve in her embrace. So let it be.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다. 슬플 미소가 그의 얼굴에 입혀집니다.{/n} \"전 여기 남아야 합니다 전 삶이 끝날 때까지 필멸자의 "
"길을 다시금 걸어야 합니다. 오직 그러고 나서야 여신의 품안에서 그녀를 섬길 자격을 얻게 될 것입니다. 여신이여, 그렇게 되도록 하소서. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Attack_bark_01_String
msgctxt "35523194-62c4-4715-b3f0-453d3e5183cc"
msgid "\"It's the {mf|King|Queen}! Attack {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}이 저기 있다! {mf|그|그녀}를 공격해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Attack_bark_02_String
msgctxt "c1bbea12-9806-4609-8e20-d4504cafbaea"
msgid "\"It's all because of you! Die! DIE!\""
msgstr "\"이게 다 너 때문이다! 죽어! 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Cultists_bark_01_String
msgctxt "b4f39eab-810f-4428-8dc0-07095616c896"
msgid ""
"\"Great Goddess, receive your servant. He may not have been cleansed in "
"life, but he served you loyally and faithfully unto his dying breath.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대하신 여신이시여, 당신의 종을 받아주십시오. 삶에 있어 정화되지 못했지만, 그는 죽어가는 숨결로 충직하고 신실하게 당신을 "
"섬겼습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Cultists_bark_02_String
msgctxt "80f6f682-3748-4786-8301-133dcf1b8302"
msgid ""
"\"This is folly. The Goddess has abandoned us. We're just wasting our time.\""
msgstr "\"이건 멍청한 짓이야. 여신은 우리를 버렸어. 시간 낭비라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Cultists_bark_03_String
msgctxt "564d380d-eb26-4075-b4e1-c748a58d7c6d"
msgid ""
"\"Haven't you read the letter? The Faithful writes that the Kingdom still "
"lives. That he will rekindle the grace of the Goddess and save us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"편지 못읽어 봤나? 선지자께서 왕국이 아직 살아있다고 쓰셨네. 여신의 은총을 다시 밝히고 우릴 구원하겠다고 쓰셨다는 말일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Cultists_bark_04_String
msgctxt "5abbd442-ee82-49b6-b05a-fbf4166b02a8"
msgid "\"Where? In Dunsward? What about us? What about these lands?!\""
msgstr "\"어디에서? 던스워드에서? 우리는 어쩌고? 이 땅은 어쩌란 말인가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Enviroment_Campfire_String
msgctxt "f6f32a20-83c6-4e84-8c43-dfc7dd4b890b"
msgid "A few branches are smoldering slowly in the fire."
msgstr "장작 몇 개비가 천천히 불에 그을리고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Enviroment_DeadBody_String
msgctxt "987edc30-65ad-4f8e-b190-43aeb5479f80"
msgid ""
"The swollen body emits a terrible stench. Whoever it was, he died a few days "
"ago."
msgstr "부풀어오른 시체가 끔찍한 악취를 풍깁니다. 시체가 누구건 간에 죽은 지 몇일 정도 지난 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Enviroment_Torch_String
msgctxt "266d1b34-b0c6-4f90-9233-691d48dd0d5b"
msgid "The rains have soaked the torch, making it completely useless."
msgstr "비가 내려 횃불이 젖었고, 횃불을 전혀 쓸모가 없게 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Item/FF_letter_Name_String
msgctxt "ff0c628f-e4e4-44e6-873f-ff6f2a54fac9"
msgid "A Wrinkled Piece of Paper"
msgstr "구겨진 종이 조각"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Item/FF_letter_String
msgctxt "b2203d4d-885d-45c3-988c-8f29fb8659cb"
msgid ""
"\"Subjects of the Kingdom of the Cleansed!\n"
"The great legacy of our lady yet lives. So long as the {mf|King|Queen} draws "
"breath, a curse hangs over us all.\n"
"Leave your poisoned lands, abandon your cold houses, and go east. There, in "
"the lands of the ancient giants, a spark of the Kingdom still lingers. I "
"will fan it into a great flame, which will burn the impure and cleanse the "
"world of filth.\n"
"The Goddess demands sacrifices and prayers in the City of the Hollow Eyes.\n"
"Keep your mouth closed and believe no one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정화된 자들의 왕국의 백성들이여!\n"
"우리 여신의 위대한 유산은 아직 살아있다. {mf|왕|여왕} 이 살아 숨쉬는 한, 우린 저주에서 벗어나지 못할 것이다.\n"
"독으로 가득찬 이 땅을 떠나, 추위로 가득찬 집들을 버리고, 동쪽으로 떠나라. 그곳엔, 고대의 거인들의 땅인 그곳엔, 왕국의 불꽃이 "
"여전히 남아있다. 난 이를 부채질해, 불결한 자를 태우고 세상의 부정을 정화할 거대한 불꽃으로 만들 것이다.\n"
"여신께선 공허한 눈의 도시에서 기도와 희생을 바라신다.\n"
"입을 다물고 아무도 믿지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/KingdomTemple/Tristian_LiftingMessage_String
msgctxt "1d3dba51-7dae-49ea-8bf6-56a6697ce95e"
msgid ""
"\"This is a message from the First Faithful. Looks like he's gathering his "
"followers at a new location.\""
msgstr "\"이건 선지자로부터 온 전언입니다. 새로운 장소에서 추종자를 모으는 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "77e9e70a-6e5d-445a-9096-80af84ba7a5c"
msgid "\"So you were made mortal... by Sarenrae herself?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 서렌레이 그녀 자신이... 당신을 필멸자로 만든 겁니까\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e67f1ebb-fa8d-47d1-9f49-539244e3b7ff"
msgid "Gloated at Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안의 벌을 고소해합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "148494d3-4d62-4e93-8a8e-89f3a3a6a315"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? Well, I'd say you've proven yourself deserving of your fall.\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니까? 그렇다면, 당신의 몰락이 마땅했다는걸 스스로 증명했다고 말하고 싶군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "8871e8de-4e9d-4744-9e69-e8356f7874d9"
msgid "\"Perhaps Nyrissa did find a way to do it?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 방법을 찾아내지 않았겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "44c65c10-59eb-4e7f-82c1-d28fe11f104b"
msgid "\"But the goddess still grants you spells.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 여신은 여전히 당신이 주문을 쓸 수 있게 허락한 것 같습니다만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "44be8216-1748-497f-8001-7e683820ce51"
msgid ""
"\"I could forgive you — and in case you haven't noticed, I'm no "
"{mf|god|goddess} of mercy. Sarenrae herself couldn't have simply abandoned "
"you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 당신을 용서할 수 있었습니다. 그리고- 당신이 미쳐 깨닫지 못했을 수도 있지만 - 난 자비의 신도 아니지요. 서렌레이 자신이 "
"단순히 당신을 버려뒀을 리가 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "11b1ce37-196f-4b26-809b-32f2276b28fe"
msgid "\"But you were deceived... and frightened as well.\""
msgstr "\"하지만 당신은 속았던 겁니다... 두려웠기도 했겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "3682d817-a496-44e8-a01f-0f1c3dccd259"
msgid "\"You started this — you deal with it. Don't drag me into it.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 시작했으니 - 당신이 해결하십시오.날 끌어 들이진 마십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "935faed0-a742-43c1-884e-4b5231590955"
msgid "\"These Cleansed simply will not rest.\""
msgstr "\"이 정화된 자들은 쉴 줄을 모르는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "22693618-b8ac-444c-83d9-b523f8f31e9b"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you can finally tell me who this First Faithful is, and what is the "
"Kingdom of the Cleansed?\""
msgstr "\"이제 선지자가 누구인지, 정화된 자들의 왕국의 정체가 뭔지 알려줄 때가 되지 않았습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "9ee4a8c1-efd9-430a-a9ad-f98f6b56a150"
msgid ""
"\"What are you going to do when you find the Kingdom and the First Faithful?"
"\""
msgstr "\"선지자와 그 조직을 찾게 되면 어떻게 할 생각입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "051aa3ed-1640-47be-b496-58978f06d68d"
msgid "\"You're right. Fine, I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 맞습니다. 좋습니다. 도와주겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "8a208891-8b3f-4aa0-aea2-4258c7ed7ce6"
msgid "\"I said no!\""
msgstr "\"싫다고 하지 않았습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "6502001c-2fc6-4b8f-a49b-990a19c98bd6"
msgid "\"Where do we start?\""
msgstr "\"어디서부터 시작하는 게 좋겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5653eb7b-769a-4aaf-a98e-10742c2a4bd2"
msgid ""
"\"You've come.\" {n}Tristian tilts his head to the side and remains silent. "
"You notice he's holding something in his hands.{/n} \"It's so strange. I "
"don't know if I should be glad or frightened. Anyway, thank you for finding "
"some time for me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왔군요\" {n}트리스티안은 고개를 까닥이더니 침묵합니다. 당신은 그가 손에 무언가 쥐고 있다는 걸 눈치챕니다.{/n} \"이상한 "
"기분이군요. 기뻐해야할지 두려워해야할지 모르겠습니다. 어쨌든, 절 위해 시간을 내줘 감사하게 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9a4e2dcb-32a4-4de8-b68a-433838ddf502"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian turns his head. If it weren't for his blind eyes, you would "
"imagine he's looking into the distance.{/n} \"Since you freed me from "
"Nyrissa's power, I've had time to think. About what happened to me, and what "
"Nyrissa did to me. About what she truly did.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 돌립니다. 그가 눈이 멀었단 사실을 몰랐다면, 당신은 그가 허공을 쳐다보고 있다고 생각했을 겁니다. {/n} "
"\"당신이 날 나이리사의 손아귀로부터 해방시켜준 이후로, 많은 생각을 했습니다. 내게 무슨 일이 일어난 건지부터, 나이리사가 내게 무슨 "
"짓을 한 건지, 그리고 그녀의 진정한 의도는 무엇이었는지에 대해서도 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "59c181f1-e6b9-427f-b7bd-d8c5ffdd11a5"
msgid ""
"\"When I found myself here — without my wings, in a mortal body — I was "
"terrified. And I believed everything she told me, for I believed it was she "
"who'd stolen my freedom. At last I discovered that Nyrissa had lied to me, "
"and ever since I've sought a way to regain {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} gifts. "
"And do you know what I realized?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 이곳에서 깨달은 것은- 제가 두려웠다는 사실입니다. 그리고 제 자유를 빼았아간게 그녀였음에도 불구하고 전 그녀가 제게 했던 모든 "
"말을 믿었습니다. 마침내 나이리사가 제게 거짓을 얘기했다는 사실을 발견 한 후부터, 전 서렌레이의 은총을 되찾기 위한 방법을 "
"찾아왔습니다. 그리고 제가 어떤 사실을 깨달았는지 아십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "35e9831e-10ba-4251-8153-7888ff947b07"
msgid ""
"\"No one is capable of taking the deva's gifts, granted by his creator.\" {n}"
"Tristian's voice is barely audible.{/n} \"No one except for the Dawnflower "
"herself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구도 창조주께서 부여하신 데바의 은총을 앗아갈 수 없습니다.\" {n}트리스티안의 목소리는 겨우 들릴 정도입니다.{/n} \"여명꽃 "
"자신만이 가능하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "47ef93b2-4134-44e4-b2c0-80a6c7925bf8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods.{/n} \"I found no other explanation for what happened to "
"me. Nyrissa's power is great, but not so great as to turn angels into "
"mortals.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"내게 일어난 일에 대한 다른 어떤 설명도 찾지 못했습니다. 나이리사의 권능이 대단하긴 "
"하지만, 천사를 필멸자로 만들 만큼 강하지는 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "53abb64b-6de5-4d3e-8128-0f3812a453a8"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt it. I know much of the nature of angels, and what happened to me "
"was not magic, but divine will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럴것 같지는 않습니다. 전 천사의 본질에 대해선 잘 알고 있습니다, 그리고 제게 일어난 일은 마법이 아니라, 신성한 의지였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "93e7bcca-41d4-43a3-95a5-827870c91f1b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't argue with you. Yes, you are right. But it's too late to change "
"that now.\""
msgstr "\"반박할 수 없군요. 맞습니다, 당신이 옳아요. 하지만 되돌리기엔 너무 늦었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "27d70751-37bf-4bb7-90f2-555ba8b2f36c"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted to know if the way back to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} is open for "
"me. I spent endless hours in prayer, asking for but one thing — a sign, a "
"vision, a portent... a single word... and all I got in return was silence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께 돌아가는 길이 제게 열려 있는지 알고 싶었습니다. 저는 단 하나의, 단 하나의 표식이나 "
"환영, 전조.. 단 하나의 단어라도 받기를 바라며 끝없는 시간동안 기도를 올렸지만, 침묵만이 있을 뿐이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "46e5a924-9f20-418b-8e95-3e4714da3d0f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles crookedly, hiding a grieving grimace.{/n} \"I wanted so "
"badly to do something extraordinary. And it appears that I succeeded. I fell "
"so low that even my most merciful lady couldn't forgive me for my sins.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 깊은 절망을 감추기 위해 뒤틀린 미소를 짓습니다..{/n} \"전 뭔가 특별한 일을 해내기를 간곡히 원했었습니다. 그 "
"소망은 이루어진 것 같군요. 너무 타락해 가장 자비로운 여신께서도 저의 죄를 용서하지 못하셨을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "33682e1f-5e4d-4edc-b747-016ba66cf861"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Perhaps this weak hope is the only thing that keeps me from losing my "
"mind to despair. Or is this meager pittance but an eternal reminder of what "
"I have lost?\" {n}Tristian stops.{/n} \"No. My merciful lady may be strict, "
"but she's not capable of such unforgiving sanction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞습니다. 아마 이 미약한 희망이 제가 절망에 정신을 잃지 않도록 지켜주는 유일한 것일지도요. 아니면 제가 무엇을 잃었는지 영원히 "
"상기시켜줄 빈약한 유산일지 모르겠습니다. \" {n}트리스티안은 멈춥니다.{/n} \"아닙니다. 제 자비로운 여신은 엄격할지언정, 그런 "
"용서없는 처벌을 내리시는 분은 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f16c2026-9a74-45ac-9ca3-c63171147d7e"
msgid ""
"\"I've said the same thing to myself. But now I realize it's just a pathetic "
"excuse, to help me save face. It was for me to overcome my fear. It was for "
"me to find strength and resolution. I failed. I have no excuse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"같은 말로 스스로를 다독여 보았지만 곧바로 구차한 변명임을 깨달았습니다. 그 순간에도 제 체면 차릴 생각만 했던 겁니다. 두려움을 "
"극복하고, 제 힘을 되찾아 결의를 다지는 일. 모두 제게 주어진 시련이었습니다. 저는 이겨내지 못했지요. 여기엔 어떤 변명도 무의미합니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "68c825f8-48a1-417e-999e-fb0d9ffe4cf9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles warmly.{/n} \"You make me dare to hope that all is not "
"lost. I'm afraid to believe it — but thank you for your kindness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 따뜻하게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"당신은 제가 감히 모든게 끝난게 아니라는 희망을 품게 하시는군요. 그말을 그대로 "
"믿기는 어렵지만 - 친절에 감사드립니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "56cf28ea-db75-4d3c-ab50-1e2249b18c54"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian straightens himself.{/n} \"Anyway, I didn't ask you to come "
"listen to my whining. I do not wish that my mortal deeds will end at "
"deception and betrayal. It has cost me so much...\" {n}Tristian shows you "
"his hands. You see a crumpled leaflet — one of the invitations for the "
"Kingdom of the Cleansed.{/n} \"I wish to put an end to at least one evil "
"that Nyrissa spawned. And I'm asking for your help in this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 힘을 냅니다.{/n} \"어쨌든, 우는 소리를 들어달라고 당신을 부른건 아닙니다. 전 필멸자로서의 삶이 기만과 배신으로 "
"끝나길 원하지 않습니다. 오늘이 있기까지 너무나 많은 대가를 치렀습니다...\" {n}트리스티안은 구겨진 전단지를 당신에게 보여줍니다 — "
"정화된 자들의 왕국으로부터 온 초대장입니다.{/n} \"나이리사가 낳은 악 중 적어도 하나라도 종식시키고 싶습니다. 그러긴 위해선 당신의 "
"도움이 필요합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "01cd358b-ee90-437e-85c3-b399eeef2322"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange, actually. The Goddess who demanded your death was Nyrissa, "
"and after the Kingdom failed in its mission, she broke all ties with the "
"First Faithful. Yet still his followers seek your death. Do they actually "
"hope to return to her favor?\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실, 이건 좀 이상합니다. 당신의 죽음을 요구했던 여신은 나이리사입니다. 그리고 왕국이 임무에 실패하자, 그녀는 선지자와 모든 "
"소통을 끊어버렸습니다. 하지만 여전히, 그의 추종자들은 당신을 노리고 있습니다. 그들은 정말로 나이리사의 호의가 돌아오길 바라는 걸까요??"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a1133df7-3403-4490-8eaa-4b3d466a1741"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's forehead, a moment ago creased in worry, becomes smooth, and "
"his voice grows tranquil.{/n} \"Consider me naive, but I still believe even "
"the blackest soul can find repentance. I will try to find it even in the "
"dark souls of the Cleansed. I would not deny anyone of saving grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시까지만 해도 걱정으로 주름져 있던 트리스티안의 이마가 펴지고, 그의 목소리엔 평안이 깃듭니다.{/n} \"절 순진하다고 "
"생각하셔도 좋습니다만, 전 여전히 가장 검은 영혼도 회개할 수 있다고 믿습니다. 정화된 자들의 어두은 영혼 속에서도 빛을 찾기 위해 "
"노력할겁니다. 은총을 구하는 사람들 어느 누구하나 거절하지 않을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "07080058-266b-4a64-8eb4-3c8c64bc9eec"
msgid ""
"\"I only know what I could overhear — or what Nyrissa boasted to me. The one "
"called the First Faithful is a former priest of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} named "
"Ruthgert. When the Bloom came to his village, he lost his faith. Erastil "
"didn't protect his congregation, and Ruthgert was stripped of his position. "
"After this, he set off for the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g}, "
"to pray to his god one last time — and if he didn't answer, to throw curses "
"in the face of his idol.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 아는 건 엿듣거나 나이리사가 제 앞에서 뽐낼 때 얘기한 정도입니다. 선지자로 불리는 자는 루스거트라는 이름의 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g} 사제였습니다. 그가 살던 마을에 개화가 일어나자, 그는 신앙을 잃었습니다. 에라스틸은 그의 신도들을 "
"보호하지 않았고, 루스거트는 사제 직위에서 쫓겨났지요. 그 후 그는 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}으로 "
"갔습니다. 그의 신에게 마지막으로 기도하기 위해서 — 그리고 아무런 대답을 받지 못한다면, 그의 우상에 저주를 퍼붓기 위해서 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5ef895b8-0415-40a4-ab2b-ee6de6ef8dfb"
msgid ""
"\"Like so many others, Ruthgert was fooled by Nyrissa. She pretended to be "
"the goddess of these lands, told Ruthgert of the curse of the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, and promised him untold gifts in return for "
"the death of this ruler. It was she who invented the name of this new cult, "
"devoted to herself — and made Ruthgert its high priest. She knew just how to "
"flatter him, in his moment of weakness and despair. And he, in his turn, did "
"everything he could to draw his former congregation into this vile cult."
msgstr ""
"\"다른 많은 이들처럼, 루스거트도 나이리사에게 속았습니다. 그녀는 이 땅의 여신인 척하며, 루스거트에게 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕} "
"때문에 생긴 저주를 얘기했고, 통치차의 죽음을 대가로 이루 말할 수 없는 선물을 약속했습니다. 그녀는 자신을 섬기는 새로운 이교를 "
"만들어내고 루스거트를 대사제로 삼았습니다. 그가 절망에 사로잡혀 유약해져 있을 때, 어떻게 그를 부채질 할 지 잘 알았던 겁니다. 그리고 "
"그는 전에 그의 신도였던 자들을 이 추악한 이교로 끌어들이기 위해 최선을 다했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "00124e18-0ae6-49a5-9f11-5fb889defb66"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian holds out his hands to you.{/n} \"Please... I beg you. I can't "
"handle the insane First Faithful and his henchmen on my own! Think about "
"those who have yet to suffer from their lies and trickery!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 손을 꼭잡습니다.{/n} \"제발... 간청드립니다. 저 혼자선 이 정신나간 선지자와 그의 신도들을 감당할 수 "
"없습니다! 아직도 그들의 거짓과 기만으로 고통받는 자들을 생각해 보세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4d647123-08f8-4177-b4ff-bc3791325e06"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian drops his head to his chest, and silently turns to leave. With "
"one hand he crumples up the leaflet, and throws it away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고개를 떨구고, 말없이 떠납니다. 한 손에 쥐고 있던 전단지를 버려버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6f7ac727-98ec-4c3c-a15c-d7b852cb499b"
msgid "\"I promise — this is my last request.\""
msgstr "\"약속하겠습니다 — 이게 제 마지막 부탁입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f7ff2cab-68d8-4baf-bcec-c4d737ed39e6"
msgid ""
"{n}A faint smile appears on Tristian's face.{/n} \"I knew I could trust you "
"and ask for your help. Thank you.\""
msgstr "{n}작은 미소가 트리스티안의 얼굴에 나타납니다.{/n} \"당신을 믿고 도움을 받을 수 있을 지 알았습니다. 감사합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b699cd56-a01b-42bc-86f8-29cf254f8dfb"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard that the cultists of the Kingdom have been sighted once again. "
"But now they no longer shout their slogans in broad daylight — no, they "
"crawl from their lairs under cover of darkness to abduct people for "
"sacrifice. At least that's what is being said.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕국의 사교도들이 다시 한번 나타났다는 소문을 들었습니다. 하지만 그들은 더이상 대낮에 그들의 슬로건을 부르짖지 않습니다 — 그들의 "
"은신처에 기어들어가 희생물로 삼기 위해 사람들을 납치하고 있습니다. 적어도 저는 그렇게 들었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "901fd9ed-f0ba-4728-aa39-9910f01cae3d"
msgid ""
"\"We should return to their 'temple without walls' — where they once held "
"their rituals. Of course, the First Faithful is not so foolish as to return "
"to the scene of his crimes. But perhaps another one of the Cleansed has "
"visited this meeting place. — Held rituals, remembered the past, gods know "
"what else. If we're lucky, we might find something there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우린 그들이 의식을 수행했던 '장벽없는 사원'으로 돌아가봐야합니다. 분명 선지자는 범죄 현장에 다시 돌아올 만큼 어리석지 않습니다. "
"그러나 정화된 자들 중 누군가가 집회장을 찾아올 지 모르죠. — 의식을 하거나, 과거를 떠올리거나, 신만이 아실 다른 것들을 할지도요. "
"운이 좋다면 무언가 찾아낼 수 있을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Tristian/Q2_SavingGrace/Tristian_Garden/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "50548791-73a2-430d-ad4a-1e12459d0736"
msgid ""
"{n}The corner of Tristian's mouth twitches, and his features seem to become "
"sharper.{/n} \"I asked you once to have mercy on these people. And where did "
"that lead? The Kingdom just temporarily laid low, but has now risen from "
"oblivion to perform their dark deeds once more. The time for talk is over.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 입가가 찡그려지고, 그의 표정이 날카로워집니다.{/n} \"한 때 당신에게 이자들에게 자비를 배풀기를 청했었지요. "
"그리고 그 결과가 어떻습니까? 왕국은 잠시 수그러들었지만, 이젠 망각 속에서 떠올라 다시금 사악한 짓을 행하고 있습니다. 대화로 문제를 "
"해결할 때는 지났습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "57dde9a1-9be5-4440-8f00-e1085bb779d8"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie, don't get so steamed-up. At this pace we'll come to blows before "
"we settle our disagreements.\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 너무 흥분할 필요없어. 이런 식으로는 우리가 의견을 정리하기도 전에 싸움판이 벌어질꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "9a803b21-cbbe-4c50-a0e9-e7c0611a0e1a"
msgid ""
"\"Watch your tongue, Fredero. You're on my lands. You will respect my "
"subjects.\""
msgstr "\"입조심 하십시오,프레데로. 당신은 내 땅에 있습니다. 내 백성들을 존중하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "d95b6fa3-666c-4125-889f-1600cf1428b3"
msgid "[Keep quiet]"
msgstr "[조용히 있는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "409fa05b-c888-4fe3-a43f-aed21efdf1e7"
msgid "\"Tell me, Fredero, why are you here?\""
msgstr "\"얘기해 보십시오, 프레데로,여기 왜 왔습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "144fea52-f0a5-4a49-8bea-0cc966709d2e"
msgid "\"You knew Valerie as a girl? Tell me about her.\""
msgstr "\"어렸을 때부터 발레리를 아셨다 했습니까? 그녀에 대해 얘기해보십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "b0cab24d-6e30-4bc0-8800-0fc278173966"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ee9b3216-3eac-4713-a9d2-391adafc802f"
msgid "\"You are from the Eternal Rose Order, right?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 영원한 장미의 기사단에서 오신거겠지요, 맞습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "118d370c-9a76-4c2b-80b2-b366f286cbd0"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie serves me, but this is her decision. You shouldn't have wasted "
"your time. She'll tell you the same thing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리가 나를 섬기는 건 맞지만, 이건 그녀가 결정할 일입니다. 시간 낭비할 필요 없습니다. 그녀도 같은 얘기를 할테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "a082242d-e055-4934-a7b2-3cc0f3b437db"
msgid "\"Where are you planning to go?\""
msgstr "\"어디로 갈 계획입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "bb0cc050-d357-4f73-a8a5-b4224b2a3534"
msgid "\"I think we all need to calm down a little...\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두 조금 진정해야 할 것 같습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "e17add57-9225-453a-8b4b-12d0836d06f8"
msgid ""
"\"One more word, Sinnet, and your head will be decorating the nearest fence!"
"\""
msgstr "\"한마디만 더해보십시오, 시넷. 가장 가까운 울타리에 당신 머리를 장식으로 달아놓을테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1d6dc861-0bf8-4062-a9f8-b096b0faf582"
msgid "Attacked the paladin of Shelyn."
msgstr "셸린의 팔라딘을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "381070ac-f7fd-4a88-ad66-9fbc662cfd4c"
msgid "\"I only meant to support you...\""
msgstr "\"당신을 위해 그랬을 뿐입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "adeebb11-45d2-486b-b2c4-6379b6ee4d04"
msgid "\"I think that's enough, Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"이걸로 충분한 것 같습니다. 발레리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "0a022416-0cbf-4837-a106-5fe8497f4eed"
msgid "\"Well said, Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"말 한번 잘했습니다, 발레리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "3a617b21-73f1-4000-a12d-6d86c94c7f3b"
msgid "[Keep quiet]"
msgstr "[조용히 있는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "f40c53a9-7358-4e09-af20-944220348ad0"
msgid "\"I won't let you kill each other right in front of me!\""
msgstr "\"내 앞에서 서로를 죽이도록 내버려두진 않을겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "feb7becf-dd6e-4630-a64f-906f3a0d2c37"
msgid "\"As you say, Valerie. What will you have me do?\""
msgstr "\"당신이 말한 대로 하겠습니다, 발레리. 내가 뭘하길 원합니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d9c42fb1-02f9-48c0-a591-8bd8949f31a9"
msgid "Jeered at Fredero and cheered for Valerie to thrash the paladin."
msgstr "팔라딘을 질타하기 위해 프레데로를 야유하고 발레리를 응원했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "bd4c57da-7a30-4cbb-9652-86760f67126a"
msgid "\"Yes! Give this windbag a proper thrashing!\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다! 저 허풍선이에게 걸맞는 매질을 해줍시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "9f02438f-bde1-4376-9d73-0ae4bfc70019"
msgid "\"All right, let's get this over with. What would you have me do?\""
msgstr "\"그래좋아. 그럼 이 일을 마무리하도록 합시다. 내가 뭘 해주면 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "ea2df797-783d-4b9c-a526-29e76dfe2bf3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be silly, Valerie. Apologize for your words, and we'll part in peace!"
"\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 짓 하지 마십시오, 발레리. 당신의 말에 대해 사과하세요, 그리고 평화롭게 떠날 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "70fef6c9-ce0d-4a5a-b2a0-34a1869d47a1"
msgid "\"I think you should talk to Valerie alone.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 발레리와 단 둘이 얘기해야 한다고 생각합니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Answer_0073_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3569597f-c96b-4b7b-b70b-14317423eba3"
msgid "Attacked the paladin of Shelyn."
msgstr "셸린의 팔라딘을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Barks/Guard_bark2_String
msgctxt "805abf8b-6563-4d82-9c36-c90ef5ac69c2"
msgid "\"Oh, it's you! What an honor!\""
msgstr "\"오, 당신이었군요! 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Barks/Guard_bark3_String
msgctxt "31998a31-cc05-4ff9-a272-754bd2ee66e0"
msgid "\"How can I help?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 도와드리면 되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Barks/Guard_bark_String
msgctxt "cf27b856-4d46-4b18-824a-cc2a125da185"
msgid "\"My respects, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"존경을 담아 감사합니다, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Barks/Valerie_afterkillingeveryone_String
msgctxt "34885e78-e527-4866-9dca-ed98e26f0404"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! You just slaughtered all of them! I'm never asking you "
"for anything, ever again!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없군요! 당신은 모두를 학살해 버렸어요! 이제 절대 당신에게 부탁같은 건 안할겁니다, 다시는!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Barks/Valerie_attacked_String
msgctxt "fd054a24-ed33-4524-b02a-ac5fbe61818e"
msgid "\"What are you doing, {name}?!\""
msgstr "\"뭘하고 있습니까, {name}?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "36164495-c3dd-4d71-8225-1b8b6c14fdbd"
msgid ""
"{n}A middle-aged man in polished, shiny armor turns to you. His beard and "
"hair are impeccably styled, and an expression of reserved politeness sits "
"frozen on his face, as his piercing gray eyes watch everything "
"attentively.{/n} \"{mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}? What an honor to meet you in "
"person! I am Fredero Sinnet, a paladin of the most illustrious "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} from the Eternal Rose Order.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잘 관리되어 빛나는 갑옷을 입은 중년이 당신을 돌아봅니다. 그의 턱수염과 머리카락은 흠 잡을 데없이 아름답게 장식되어 있으며, "
"예리한 회색 눈으로 모든 것을주의 깊게 보는 듯하고, 예절에 몸에 익은 표정이 그의 얼굴에 서려있습니다.{/n} \"{mf|남작|여남작} "
"{name}? 개인적으로 만나게 되어 영광입니다.! 전 프레데로 신넷입니다. 영원한 장미의 기사단에서 가장 아름다운 "
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}을 섬기는 팔라딘입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "6c55835a-a3da-461f-8eee-6dbd3b64eb25"
msgid ""
"\"I see that you came without Valerie... I hope that's just a temporary "
"setback. I cannot wait for the moment I see my dearest student again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리와 함께 오지 않으셨군요... 일시적인 착오이길 바랍니다. 내 가장 소중한 학생을 다시 보는데 잠시도 기다리기가 어렵군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "0c382412-6be0-4e12-b625-e324a6193cb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero Sinnet bows politely.{/n} \"Greetings, {mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}."
"\""
msgstr "{n}프레데로 시넷이 공손하게 절합니다.{/n} \"반갑습니다, {mf|남작|여남작} {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "69e2a8d7-4f61-42f2-8fec-cbaffc66725e"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero looks at Valerie.{/n} \"There you are, Valerie. How many years "
"has it been since we saw each other? I'm so happy that the years haven't "
"erased the divine bliss written upon your radiant face.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 발레리를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"거기 있었구나. 발레리. 우리가 마지막으로 본 후로 얼마나 지났지? 너의 빛나는 얼굴에 "
"씌어진 신성한 축복이 세월에 지워지지 않아 정말 기쁘구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7bef81a3-a41f-4f84-9ef8-0a7a84030f66"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie nods to Sinnet coldly.{/n} \"Greetings. I'm glad to see you in "
"good health, Fredero.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 신넷에게 차갑게 인사합니다.{/n} \"반갑습니다. 당신도 건강해보여 기쁩니다. 프레데로\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "dd7c39c1-f632-47ad-8973-7f316c4d9b5b"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero shakes his head.{/n} \"I don't recognize you, Valerie. What is "
"this tone you address me with? I remember what politeness and respect you "
"showed your elders. – We held you up as an example for the other novices.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"못 알아보게 변해버렸군, 발레리. 내게 이야기하는 어투가 그게 뭔가? 네가 연장자에게 보였던 "
"공손함과 존경심이 아직도 기억에 생생한데 말이야. 넌 다른 생도들에게 모범이 돼 보이지 않았나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "aaf44023-424e-4dd3-829f-8bb6d6851840"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie raises her chin ever so slightly.{/n} \"I'm only repaying your "
"courtesy in kind, Fredero. If you so easily ascribe to me thoughts and "
"aspirations that I do not possess, then I can be as liberal a judge of your "
"behavior.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 턱을 미세하게나마 들어올립니다.{/n} \"난 그저 당신의 예절에 맞춰주고 있을 뿐입니다. 프레데로. 가지고 있지도 않은 "
"사상에 내가 빠져있다고 멋대로 판단한다면, 나도 멋대로 당신의 행동을 판단하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "1d406a55-f508-47ef-a92f-129733e0e190"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero purses his lips.{/n} \"And yet I insist on seeing Valerie in "
"person. Grant me a chance to restore {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} chosen to the "
"divine grace she once waved off so heedlessly.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"그럼에도 전 발레리를 개인적으로 만나길 원합니다. Grant me a chance to "
"restore {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}으로부터 선택 받은 자가 한 때 경솔하게 저버렸던 신성한 은총을 회복할 기회를 제게 주십시오."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2c3004a3-41d4-419e-b74f-66b98eacda5c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie gives you a stern look.{/n} \"I haven't the slightest desire to "
"quarrel, {name}. I'm here to put an end to a story that's already gone on "
"for too long – and that is all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신에게 고집스런 표정을 보입니다.{/n} \"난 논쟁하고 싶은 생각이 조금도 없습니다, {name}. 난 이미 오래전에 "
"끝났던 이야기에 종지부를 찍기 위해서 온 것입니다. - 그게 전부입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "251c1307-90e9-46e8-99b8-f309d7a59554"
msgid ""
"\"When Valerie joins my entourage, we will travel west, to the borders of "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. There, a new temple to my divine patron is being built – "
"an architectural wonder worthy of harboring the very spirit of the {g|Shelyn}"
"Eternal Rose{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리가 내 수행단과 합류하면, 우린 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 서쪽 경계로 여행할 것입니다. 거기서 여신께 올리는 새 신전이 "
"지어지고 있습니다 - {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}의 정수가 깃들 가치가 있는 건축학적 경이이지요. .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "1d5255bf-b6b5-4316-9c0c-efa7f191b8ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero smiles pensively.{/n} \"Do I possess the words to describe the "
"chosen of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}? Oh, don't look at me like that – I'm not the "
"only one who believes it. A special role has been prepared for this girl, in "
"the ranks of the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose's{/g} followers. I'm sure you've "
"noticed Valerie's greatest virtue: she's impeccably loyal to whatever – or "
"whomever – she serves.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 수심에 잠겨 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"내가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에게 선택받은 자를 묘사할 말솜씨가 있겠습니까? "
"오, 절 그렇게 보지 마십시오 – 저만 그렇게 믿는 게 아니니까요. {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}의 추종자들의 사회안에서, 특별한 "
"역할이 이 소녀를 위해 준비되어있습니다. 분명 당신도 발레리의 가장 위대한 미덕을 알아챘을거라 믿습니다 - 그녀는 자신이 섬기는 이에게 "
"완전무결하게 충성합니다 - 그게 누가 되었던 간에 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "e93b4671-21b3-4781-bbac-cad216a491ce"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly. I once guarded works that showed Shelyn's blessing – works of "
"art, beauty and love. But that's a path for young and energetic paladins and "
"priests, Now I've become a mentor in the Order. Many servants of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} who now guard her creations were brought up by me, and "
"I'm sure Valerie would have surpassed them all, had she not left our ranks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞습니다. 한때 저는 셸린의 축복인 예술작품과 아름다움, 사랑을 지키는 일을 했습니다. 하지만 그 일은 이제 젊고 패기 넘치는 "
"팔라딘과 사제들의 몫입니다. 전 이제 기사단의 멘토가 되었죠. 그녀의 작품들을 지키고 있는 수많은 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 종들을 "
"내가 키워냈지만, 발레리가 우리 기사단을 떠나지 않았더라면 분명 그 많은 이들을 뛰어넘는 인재가 되었을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "e331b2e0-bf2c-4ab1-a181-a53f3cc7dfa6"
msgid ""
"\"One of the newer orders of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} will occupy the temple – "
"the Order of Prisms. Their zeal in serving the goddess will be good for "
"Valerie – she has much to unlearn if she expects to return to Shelyn's "
"favor, and the respect of her brothers in faith.\""
msgstr ""
"\"최근 만들어진 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 기사단인 프리즘의 기사단이 신전을 담당하고 있습니다. 여신을 섬기는 그들의 열정이 "
"발레리에게 도움이 될 것입니다. 그녀가 다시 셸린의 은혜로 되돌아오고 다른 형제들의 신앙을 존중하기를 원한다면 아직 배워야할 것이 "
"많습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "6727b5bc-e06a-4cf0-ab8a-0eaa8e73643d"
msgid ""
"\"Her father did the right thing in sending his daughter into "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} embrace. And Valerie's departure from the Order was "
"just an unfortunate mistake of youth. I'm sure she regrets her desperate "
"mistake, driven by hurt feelings and rash judgment. Only shame and pride "
"have kept her from admitting it. Her true place is in the radiance of "
"glorious Shelyn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 아버지는 딸을 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 품안에 보내는 올바른 선택을 했습니다. 그리고 발레리가 기사단을 떠난 일은 그저 "
"젊은 날의 불행한 과오에 지나지 않습니다. 분명 그녀도 상처입은 기분과 섣부른 판단으로 저지른 절망적인 실수를 후회있을 거라 확신합니다. "
"오직 부끄러움과 오만이 그녀가 사실을 인정하지 못하게 막을 뿐이지요. 그녀가 진정 있어야 할 곳은 영광스러운 셸린의 광휘 아래 뿐입니다.."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "9acd4263-0862-4228-a9cf-8ce76e8426cd"
msgid ""
"{n}The paladin looks right at you.{/n} \"As I mentioned in my letter, my "
"goal is to return Valerie to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} grace. Several years "
"ago, a terrible mistake was made: she whose fate was determined before she "
"was born decided to resist her calling. I would appeal to Valerie's mind and "
"remind her of her duty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}팔라딘은 당신을 똑바로 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"제가 편지에 언급했듯이, 내 목적은 발레리를 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 은총으로 "
"돌려보내는 것입니다. 몇년전, 그녀는 태어나기 전부터 결정된 그녀의 운명에 저항하는 끔찍한 실수를 했습니다. 전 발레리의 마음을 바로잡고 "
"그녀의 의무를 일깨워줄 생각입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "0b52e5d3-4fdd-48b9-95d3-b4d26df3f9c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero gives you a respectful look and a nod.{/n} \"In no way did I "
"intend to be impolite. Forgive my manners: it's difficult for me not to "
"address Valerie as a novice – for that is what she was the last time I saw..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 존중하는 모습을 보이며 당신께 절합니다.{/n} \"무례하게 행동할 뜻은 전혀 없었습니다. 제 태도를 용서해주시길 "
"바랍니다: 발레리를 -마지막으로 봤을 때 모습이었던- 셸린의 수련 단원으로 여기지 않는 것이 저에겐 무척이나 어렵군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "423156f0-115a-47c5-a449-b7cb0a578bac"
msgid ""
"\"As for my return to the church, which you so bluntly insist upon...\" {n}"
"Valerie pulls her chin up.{/n} \"Please, Fredero, spare me your wordy "
"speeches. The day I walked out the convent gates, I made a decision I'm not "
"going to change. I'm never returning to the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g} "
"Order. I'm never going back to serving {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}. Whatever "
"nonsense you started with your letter, let's put an end to it. Once and for "
"all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 막무가내로 주장하는 대로, 내가 신전으로 돌아가는 대가로...\" {n}발레리는 턱을 곧게 듭니다.{/n} \"부탁하건데, "
"프레데로, 당신의 지겨운 연설은 그만둬주십시오. 내가 수도원 문 밖으로 나선 날, 난 절대 변하지 않을 거라는 결심을 했습니다. 난 절대 "
"{g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}의 기시단으로 돌아가지 않을 것입니다. 다시 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}을 섬기지도 않을 것이고요. "
"당신의 편지로 시작된 이 어처구니 없는 일을 마무리 하도록 합시다. 최종적으로 완전히 말입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "1d5dade1-a23c-49c8-b9e2-1a157d0ff5ff"
msgid ""
"\"My beautiful Valerie, as rash as ever. I was hoping these intervening "
"years you spent away from the Order might have cooled your temper, and "
"brought you some wisdom about the mistakes you made as a novice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 아름다운 발레리, 여전히 섣부르구나. 기사단에서 떨어진 시간동안 네가 화를 다스리는 법을 배웠기를, 그리고 네가 수련단원으로서 "
"저질렀던 실수에서 지혜를 얻었기를 바랬건만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "99f6dd32-9a23-4278-a6ee-1d5360551eb0"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero studies Valerie's face for a long time. His eyes turn steel-"
"gray.{/n} \"I don't believe my ears. I expected to see repentance, Valerie. "
"Repentance for your foolish choices. Repentance for the pain you've caused "
"your family and all those who relied on you. But instead I see a proud "
"renegade who dares to resist the will of the goddess, and who would defy me –"
" the one who labored to bring you up and teach you. \""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 발레리의 얼굴을 한참동안 쳐다봅니다. 그의 눈은 강철같은 회색빛을 띱니다.{/n} \"내 귀를 의심케 하는구나. 난 네가 "
"참회하는 걸 기대했다, 발레리. 네 어리석은 결정에 대한 참회, 그리고 네 가족과 너에게 의지하는 모든이들에게 일으킨 고통에 대한 참회를 "
"말이다. 하지만 감히 여신의 의지에 저항하고, 널 키우고 가르쳐주기 위해 온힘을 쏟은 나를 기만하는, 오만한 배교자만이 보이는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6d9cd0dc-8ada-4e66-ac4e-4029a15f7ad4"
msgid ""
"{n}Red spots start to appear on Valerie's cheeks, and she catches her breath "
"with some difficulty.{/n} \"I am not in the least bit surprised by your "
"words, Fredero. You have always been deaf to anything that goes against your "
"beliefs. I'm not {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} chosen. I'm not a god's toy, created "
"to entertain the whimsical goddess. I'm not...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}붉은 홍조가 발레리의 뺨에 나타나고 숨을 힘겹게 쉬기 시작합니다.{/n} \"당신의 말이 전혀 놀랍지 않은 건 왜일까요, 프레데로. "
"당신은 당신의 신앙에 어긋나는 거라면 무엇이든 귀를 막고 듣기를 거부했지요. 난 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}으로 부터 선택받은 자가 "
"아닙니다. 난 변덕스러운 여신을 즐겁게 하기 위해 만들어진 신의 장난감이 아니란 말입니다. 난...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "17c285eb-1765-41c2-b29e-40a203a0b533"
msgid ""
"\"Quiet! Quiet, before you bring her wrath upon you! How dare you, who is "
"bestowed with celestial beauty, so insolently reject such gifts that others "
"can only dream about! Your fate is already decided, laid out as a fine "
"carpet before you. Enough! I didn't come here to listen to a spoiled child "
"speaking out of turn, but only to bring you home. And I will take you by the "
"ear and drag you all the way to the Order's convent, if that's what it takes!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"닥쳐라! 여신의 분노가 내리기 전에 그 입을 다물어라. 어떻게 감히, 천상의 아름다운을 부여받은 자가, 그렇게 불경스럽게도 다른 "
"이들은 오직 꿈만 꿔왔던 선물을 거절한단 말인가! 너의 운명은 이미 결정되었다, 마치 네 앞에 펼쳐진 훌륭한 융단처럼 말이다. 그만 "
"충분히 들었다! 난 버릇나쁜 아이가 칭얼거리는걸 들으러 여기 온 것이 아니다, 그저 널 집으로 데려가기 위해서 왔을 뿐이지. 그리고 꼭 "
"그래야한다면, 네 귀를 붙잡고 수도원으로 가는 길 내내 끌고 갈 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cf9d48fe-608b-477c-b192-ee630cdb9660"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie slices the air with her hand.{/n} \"Stay out of it, {name}! "
"Fredero might be crossing the boundaries of politeness, but no more than "
"that. Stay your hand and allow me to finish!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 손으로 당신을 제지합니다.{/n} \"이 일에 참견하지 말아주십시오, {name}! 프레데로가 예의범절의 선을 넘었을지는 "
"몰라도, 그 이상의 행위는 하지 않았습니다. 손을 거두고 제가 끝내도록 허락해주길 바랍니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b8f30309-3caa-495d-9a3f-36adeba93f72"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie interrupts you, she is almost screaming.{/n} \"What you call "
"home, Fredero, was my prison! My home is here, in these lands, for which the "
"baron{mf||ess} and I have fought and shed our blood! Here, beside the one "
"I've vowed to serve, and whom I shan't leave until I die! Here in the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, where for the first time I can decide for "
"myself, where I belong and what I believe!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신이 말하는 도중 끼어듭니다, 그녀는 거의 비명을 지르고 있습니다.{/n} \"당신이 집이라고 부른 곳은, 프레데로, 내 "
"감옥이었습니다! 내 집은 여기, 바로 남작과 내가 함께 싸우고 서로의 피를 흩뿌린 이 땅에 있습니다. 바로 여기가, 내가 섬기기로 "
"맹세하고, 죽음을 맞이할 때까지 떠나지 않을 사람이 있는 곳 입니다! 생에 있어 처음으로 내가 머물 곳과 내가 믿을 것을 스스로 결정한 "
"이곳 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이 내 집입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "4cdd61fb-f9b5-41ca-ab38-904a96313bd0"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero doesn't look at you, so intently is he burning Valerie with his "
"eyes.{/n} \"Forgive me, Your Grace, but I'm not leaving until I've taught "
"this impulsive girl a lesson. I was hoping that Valerie's good sense would "
"prevail over her insolence... but alas, the situation unfolds otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 발레리를 불타는 눈으로 쳐다보느라, 당신에게 고개를 돌리지 않습니다.{/n} \"용서하십시오. 전하, 하지만 이 충동적인 "
"여인에게 교훈을 가르쳐주기 전까진 떠날 수 없을 것 같습니다. 발레리의 선한 본성이 불경함을 넘어서길 바랬건만... 아, 상황이 다르게 "
"흘러가는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3a1e6736-ae73-429f-ab93-d352064557a1"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's voice grows soft, almost like a hissing snake.{/n} \"Take your "
"people, Fredero, and go back to the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g} Abbey. And if "
"you've the nerve to claim I'm {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} chosen... well, know "
"that your precious goddess should have chosen her trinkets more carefully!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 목소리는 부드러워져, 마치 뱀이 쉭쉭거리는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"당신이 데려온 사람을 무르세요, 프레데로, 그리고 "
"{g|Shelyn}영원한 장미의{/g} 교단으로 돌아가세요. 아직도 날 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}으로부터 선택받은 자라 주장할 정도로 "
"뻔뻔하다면... 음, 당신의 잘난 여신은 자기 장난감을 더 신중히 골라야만 했다는 것을 아십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c0bf5e02-e7f0-4abf-8ae6-85cdd444ce3e"
msgid ""
"\"The second's responsibilities include observing the fight, mediating in "
"the duel, and should the circumstances require, declaring the final verdict."
"\" {n}Valerie reaches for her weapon.{/n} \"I think here is good enough. "
"Step away, {name} – I don't want to hit you by accident.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보조의 역할은 싸움을 목격하고, 결투를 주선하며, -상황이 허락된다면- 최종 평결을 선언해야하는 것입니다.\" {n}발레리는 무기에 "
"손을 듭니다.{/n} \"장소는 이곳이 적당할 것 같군요. 물러서세요, {name} – 우연히라도 당신을 치고 싶지는 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "42162770-ca0b-4454-8323-8234b1eeae36"
msgid "{n}Fredero grows white as a sheet.{/n} \"How dare you...\""
msgstr "{n}프레데로의 얼굴이 백지장처럼 하얗게 질립니다.{/n} \"어찌 감히..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "bf10aa06-836b-456e-8c22-b31f4cea31d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero looks Valerie in the eye. The paladin's hand is on his weapon.{/n}"
" \"If you insist on standing equal to Shelyn's paladin, answer for your "
"words now. If you have a drop of dignity left, you won't deny me "
"satisfaction.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 발레리의 눈을 똑바로 바라봅니다 팔라딘의 손은 무기로 향합니다.{/n} \"셸린의 팔라딘 앞에 동등이 서길 원한다면, "
"행동으로 보여봐라. 네게 존엄이라는게 한 방울이라도 남아있다면, 감히 거절하지 못할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fd5e0492-1e66-4283-bd38-5c1410533512"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at the enraged paladin fearlessly.{/n} \"Oh, so now I'm "
"suddenly an independent person in your eyes? Finally! Well then, I shall "
"agree to this duel with indescribable pleasure! {name}, you shall be my "
"second.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 분노한 팔라딘을 겁내지 않고 마주합니다.{/n} \"오, 이젠 갑자기 내가 독립적인 인간으로 보이는 모양이군요? 마침내! "
"그럼 좋습니다, 이루 말하지 못할 기쁨으로 이 결투에 응하겠습니다! {name}, 당신이 제 보조가 되어 주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "201165a0-fd80-4334-87a3-9bad0eca6aa4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie allows herself a faint smile.{/n} \"Don't worry, {name}. This... "
"misunderstanding will only take a few minutes. Then Sir Sinnet will pick up "
"the shreds of his pride and spare us of his presence forever.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 희미한 미소를 지어보입니다.{/n} \"걱정마세요, {name}. 아... 오해는 조금 있으면 해결될 것입니다. 그후에 "
"시넷 경은 자존심 조각을 긁어모은 후 다시는 우리 앞에 나타나지 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "3cf9bc1b-b68c-4dfc-aadd-ff6b517b0412"
msgid ""
"\"Let's see whether you learned anything more than insolence from your "
"mercenary friends.\""
msgstr "\"네 용병 친구들로부터 불경함 말고 뭘 또 배운게 있는지 보자꾸나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3d0c7bb6-ba36-4d3a-b357-814380ac2515"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie slowly shakes her head, without taking her eyes off Fredero.{/n} "
"\"I choose my words carefully and never deny them. I've had enough – if it "
"takes a fight for {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} and her henchmen to leave me alone, "
"then so be it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 프레데로에게서 눈을 때지 않고, 고개를 천천히 젓습니다.{/n} \"난 언제나 내 언행에 신중을 기하고 그대로 행동합니다. "
"이젠 지긋지긋합니다. 이 싸음으로 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}과 그 부하들이 날 내버려두게 된다면, 그렇게 하도록 합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "0721b176-2c1e-46f5-8253-102eb400b006"
msgid ""
"\"Don't go, Your Grace. My intentions are known to all. Valerie, I have come "
"to return you to our faith.\""
msgstr "\"가지 마십시오, 전하. 제 의도는 모두가 다 압니다. 발레리, 네가 신앙심을 다시 되찾게 해주러 왔단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "defea6e9-e2cf-4a8c-bf73-08a02cf9c5b7"
msgid ""
"\"'Our?!' Now you imagine that not only do I want to serve "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, but now I have faith in her too?\""
msgstr ""
"\"'되찾게 해준다고?!' 내가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}을 섬기고 싶어한다고 상상하는 것도 모자라, 내가 그녀에 대한 신앙을 가지고 "
"있다고 생각하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1a6f621b-da5f-4e0e-9025-42b261b5e596"
msgid ""
"\"You speak as though I am incapable of understanding where my duties lie.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 마치 내 의무를 내 스스로 못찾고 있다는듯이 얘기하는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "185f89c2-732d-46b3-ba12-be621827b465"
msgid "\"You have given me much cause for doubt.\""
msgstr "\"의심의 여지가 많긴 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "73a26730-6d87-4942-b0f3-491aefafdba0"
msgid ""
"\"My departure wasn't a mistake. It fixed someone else's mistake, which "
"caused me to waste a few years of my life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 떠났던 건 실수가 아니었습니다. 다른 이들의 실수를 바로잡는 일이었지요. 내가 삶의 몇 년간을 낭비하게 만든 실수 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "df051b80-0a55-4691-bf7c-44a0fabd4ee8"
msgid ""
"{n}You can barely hear Valerie's voice.{/n} \"I'm so tired of orders from "
"those I despise...\""
msgstr "{n}당신은 발레리의 희미한 목소리를 듣습니다.{/n} \"경멸하는 자들에게 명령받는 건 이제 지쳤어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7a38a842-3aef-410d-b63c-33fbc70f2d5d"
msgid ""
"\"The temple devoted to the goddess of beauty... I wish I could see such "
"grandeur!\""
msgstr "\"미의 여신에게 헌정된 사원이라.. 그 웅장함을 볼 수 있으면 좋으련만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3e4e5ed6-8ff6-4cfe-af6b-90d77370fa6e"
msgid ""
"\"Hundreds and thousands of gold coins, wasted on decorating some pompous "
"shed... I could name dozens of better uses for that money.\""
msgstr ""
"\"젠체하는 머물 헛간을 꾸미는데 수백, 수천의 금화를 낭비하다니... 그 돈을 더 유용하게 쓸 방법을 스무가지도 넘게 얘기해 줄 수 "
"있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a804fceb-9b0e-4274-97b3-dd9370fff636"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh... the old man's right! Where else does our princess belong if not "
"sitting at a tambour frame in a convent!\""
msgstr "\"헤 헤... 노인 말이 맞아! 수도원의 자수틀에 앉아 있는 것 말고 우리 공주님께서 할 일이 뭐가 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4429d7d5-206d-4ac5-8199-5cba22619641"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, please explain to your feebleminded jester the times when he "
"should keep his jaws shut.\""
msgstr "\"{name}, 제발 당신의 의지박약한 광대에게 턱을 다물고 있어야 할 때라고 설명 좀 해주시겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6740d548-4036-407e-ba2e-d9c70481736f"
msgid ""
"\"Hm... I have to admit, you're somewhat right...\" {n}Linzi stops under "
"Valerie's glare and moves away apprehensively.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"흠.. 인정해야겠요.. 어느 정도는 당신이 맞아요...\" {n}린지는 발레리가 노려보자 말을 멈추고 걱정에 잠겨 자리를 "
"옮깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4aa10f21-8813-4a01-ab9b-00b6448fe10b"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! I just woke up after all that chatter, and you went and ruined all "
"the fun before it could even get started!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 수다에 질려서 방금에서야 일어났는데, 재밌는 부분이 시작하기도 전에 망쳐버리고 가버릴꺼야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/02_OTP_Fredero/Shared_AttackFredero_String
msgctxt "33d39736-5203-44a7-ba8a-741a1f948bce"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough! Death to Shelyn's lap dogs!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"그만! 셸린의 애완견에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Kill_01_Fredero_String
msgctxt "5003dd26-16e8-467f-8c38-f3f63e95d0ab"
msgid "\"What? But I admit defeat! I do...\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고요? 하지만 패배를 인정했지 않습니까! 난...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Kill_02_Valerie_String
msgctxt "088f539c-4ef2-4dcd-b861-3fea1cda80b7"
msgid "\"I promised I'd put an end to this. Once and for all.\""
msgstr "\"끝장을 보겠다고 약속했지요. 영원히 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Kill_03_Svetlana_String
msgctxt "becb9a16-2eae-4eb7-96cd-541c14809094"
msgid "\"Aaaaaaaaa!\""
msgstr "\"아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Kill_04_Guard_String
msgctxt "e3b02143-833f-4a38-81f9-4494abe5c4ee"
msgid "\"She killed Sir Sinnet! After he surrendered!\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 시넷 경을 죽였어! 항복했는데도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Kill_05_Guard2_String
msgctxt "3ae50664-2f80-4c0c-a0bf-9ab30db069f5"
msgid "\"Renegade!\""
msgstr "\"변절자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Kill_06_Guard_String
msgctxt "2b8c246b-86a6-4880-9dbb-2862de1c8d88"
msgid "\"A death for a death!\""
msgstr "\"죽음에는 죽음으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Spare_01_Fredero_String
msgctxt "6e6f8c08-065d-4503-8aa3-14397f3e34d6"
msgid "\"I... I obey the word of the victor. Farewell, Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"난... 승자의 말에 따르도록 하겠습니다. 잘 있거라, 발레리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Aftermath_Barks/Spare_02_Fredero_String
msgctxt "98aadf20-ff35-4b7c-990c-e33e25c32e0a"
msgid ""
"\"All the best, baron{mf||ess}. I hope this warrior serves you better than "
"her goddess.\""
msgstr "\"무운을 빕니다, {mf||여}남작님. 이 전사가 섬기는 여신만큼, 당신도 잘 섬겼으면 좋겠군요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "63e35c88-51f8-4b68-a417-00e7be7129c7"
msgid "\"The duel's over. Valerie is the winner.\""
msgstr "\"결투는 끝났습니다. 발레리가 승자입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "858019f7-084d-41ec-a984-97f1086e1d98"
msgid "\"The duel's not over until one of the participants is dead.\""
msgstr "\"결투는 한쪽이 죽을 때까지 끝나지 않습니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c2fa8ac8-db45-4d6f-9248-8d70c4f45065"
msgid "\"Fredero did it! That scoundrel!\""
msgstr "\"프레데로가 한 짓이야! 저 악당!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e0f9b7e9-aa6d-4bc5-b078-be17ca40126d"
msgid "\"Let me heal you.\""
msgstr "\"내가 치료해 줄께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "5f8e862a-5be5-45c1-ad2d-633066acf32b"
msgid "\"Oh no! Your beautiful face!\""
msgstr "\"오 안돼! 너의 아름다운 얼굴이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "9abf0463-0a44-4ffa-ac68-db8c6c9f2bcc"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero kneels heavily on one knee, wheezing and spluttering.{/n} \"Right"
"... You always were better... at fighting than... at evolving your spirit "
"and character...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 무릎을 꿇고 천천히 숨을 들이내쉽니다.{/n} \"그래... 넌 언제나 성품이나 영혼을 발달시키는 것보다 싸움에 더 "
"능했었지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8e9bac1e-2fbe-4a55-a4df-1cb118fe6e72"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie stands over her defeated adversary, gripping her weapon. She "
"momentarily takes her eyes off Fredero, bent low before her, and looks to "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 그녀가 쓰러뜨린 상대 옆에 그녀의 무기를 들고 서 있다. 그녀는 프레데로에게서 잠시 눈길을 거두고, 몸을 숙이고는 당신을 "
"바라봤다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "525a2956-b5d6-4f98-ac6a-169a13c9d9fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero steps back and sheathes his weapon.{/n} \"Looks like everything's "
"in its place, doesn't it? You could be however insolent to whomever you "
"wanted, as long as you were considered as a girl, Valerie... but now you'll "
"have to answer for all the stupid things you said in pride or heated moments."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로는 한 걸음 물러나 무기를 거뒀다.{/n}\"이제 모든 게 제 자리로 돌아갔군, 안 그런가? 너는 네 스스로를 소녀라고 "
"생각하는 동안 누구에게든 건방지게 굴 수 있다, 발레리...하지만 이제 너는 네가 자만과 흥분에 차서 말했던 모든 멍청한 것들에 대해 "
"답을 해야 할거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "39a9c769-998d-4037-8449-aa98316121df"
msgid ""
"\"I'm satisfied with the outcome of this duel. I see no reasons to linger "
"here, upsetting the owners of this trading post and the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. With great sadness, I will continue my way "
"without Valerie, who from now on has no right to return to the Order of "
"{g|Shelyn}the Eternal Rose{/g} due to her transgressions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전 이 결투의 결과에 만족합니다. 더이상 여기에 머물면서 이 교역소의 주인과 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}을 불편하게 할 이유가 "
"없겠군요. 크나큰 슬픔을 지닌체, - 이젠 {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}의 기사단에 돌아올 권리를 잃어버린 - 발레리 없이 제 "
"갈길을 가도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "0f4eabd2-8b70-4282-92db-34fe5b0a09ac"
msgid ""
"\"I will bother you no longer. My regards, Your Grace. Valerie...\" {n}"
"Fredero stops short.{/n} \"Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"더 이상 귀찮게 하지 않겠소. 안녕히, 전하. 발레리...\"{n}프레데로는 잠시 머뭇거렸다.{/n}\"잘있거라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d89d203d-7e58-4d69-adb4-fb232f0f5575"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie lowers her weapon with obvious relief.{/n} \"Enough, Fredero. You "
"got what you wanted. Leave the lands of the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}"
"... and my life. Forever.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 안도하여 무기를 내려놓았다.{/n}\"그만, 프레데로. 원한 걸 얻었잖습니까. {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 "
"땅에서...그리고 나의 인생에서 떠나가주십시오. 영원히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : OTP_Svetlana
msgctxt "ce72c5cd-1f1b-4a74-9e47-36d70fc886e3"
msgid "\"Dear gods... Your face, Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"오 신이시여...발레리, 당신 얼굴이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "02605a0f-67cb-47fe-89c1-a83c37be27ba"
msgid ""
"\"What? Is there something...\" {n}Valerie touches the wound crossing her "
"face and looks at the blood on her fingers — more baffled than scared.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 무슨 일...\"{n} 발레리는 그녀의 얼굴을 가로지르는 상처를 만지고는 그녀의 손가락에 묻은 피를 바라봅니다. - 놀라기보단 "
"당황한듯 합니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2aa5191e-0943-4926-b84a-fb6be3e5cdcf"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shakes her head.{/n} \"Strange... I do not remember receiving "
"this blow. Not at all...\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 머리를 가로저었다.{/n} \"이상해...이런 일격을 받은것이 기억나지 않아. 전혀...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "71058e7b-f918-452e-b8e8-ab3a841e3bc9"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie wipes her fingers on the hem of her clothes with disdain.{/n} "
"\"Please, {name}! I have not yet had a chance to rest after Fredero's "
"doleful outpourings about my precious beauty — do not echo him!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 경멸에 차서 피묻은 손가락을 옷자락에 닦습니다.{/n} \"제발, {name}! 내 귀중한 아름다움에 대한 프레데로의 "
"애절한 토로가 아직 귓가에 남아있단 말입니다 - 똑같은 소리는 그만둬주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "98cad99d-1f5f-4d02-b013-5952e42a62f4"
msgid ""
"{n}She touches the wound again, winces, and finally waves it off.{/n} \"It "
"is nothing. I do not even feel any pain. Only fatigue. Save your pity for "
"someone who is truly wounded. And I... just need to rest. And wash myself "
"clean after all these conversations about {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 상처를 다시 만져보더니, 얼굴을 찡그리고는, 마침내 생각에서 떨쳐버립니다.{/n} \"아무것도 아닙니다. 어떤 고통도 "
"느껴지지 않아요. 피곤하기만 하군요. 휴식이 필요할 뿐입니다. 그리고 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에 관해 나눈 대화를 씻어내기 "
"위해서라도 목욕을 해야할 것 같습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0babd96b-66c9-447d-9c14-9d146f8292b9"
msgid ""
"\"Praise {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, the battle finished without any victims! "
"Right? That was it?\""
msgstr "\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 찬양하라, 희생자 없이 결투가 끝났어요! 맞죠? 그런거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6dd0f52a-a733-4be3-a64d-1fc104fd6407"
msgid "\"Too much talk. Enough. Leave her.\""
msgstr "\"말이 너무 많군. 그만. 그녀를 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9370ee79-068e-4035-8473-bfc2cdec7822"
msgid "\"Yikes! That sliced good!\""
msgstr "\"으익! 제대로 그었는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3290268e-2bf3-4904-a140-253ff9c3d499"
msgid "\"You don't show fear to the lowborn... Worthy behavior.\""
msgstr "\"태생이 비천한 자에게 두려움을 보이지 않는군요... 훌륭한 행동입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/01_Fredero_String
msgctxt "8ce3d53f-bb5c-4d9d-a3e4-dcc44e0e7879"
msgid ""
"\"One of my squires will be my second. Would everyone please clear the "
"dueling ground, and do not interfere until a winner has been determined.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 종자 중 한명이 보조를 맡을 것입니다. 모두들 결투 장소를 비워주십시오, 그리고 승자가 결정될 때까지 방해하지 마시길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/02_Oleg_String
msgctxt "255d8422-4141-4980-b057-dd9cd0fa4b2d"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭘하고 있는겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/03_Fredero_String
msgctxt "0dc72ce7-2526-4857-8cf0-98dc5bbb9927"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry, good master. We'll settle our argument quickly and do no harm "
"to your trading post.\""
msgstr "\"걱정하지 마시오. 주인장. 곧 논쟁을 끝내고, 당신의 교역소엔 아무런 해도 가하지 않을터니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/04_Fredero_String
msgctxt "3aa7c721-341f-412b-bc48-82148b27eaa9"
msgid "\"So, Valerie. Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 발레리. 준비 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/05_Valerie_String
msgctxt "664dd693-f816-4336-b701-bde94e263e61"
msgid "\"I am, Fredero. Let your second start the countdown.\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다, 프레데로. 당신의 보조에게 시작을 알리게 하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/06_Fredero_String
msgctxt "85ff3482-6b95-4d00-a8ce-7fe7e1c46edd"
msgid "\"Let's begin!\""
msgstr "\"시작하도록 합시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/07_Guard_String
msgctxt "6ee5175a-2de4-436b-bab2-76a543fd83f2"
msgid "\"Participants, please ready your weapons and assume your positions.\""
msgstr "\"참가자분은, 무기를 들고 자리에 서 주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/08_Guard_String
msgctxt "e32f6573-01b8-40f5-a86e-b8444605d62e"
msgid "\"Three... two...\""
msgstr "\"셋... 둘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/09_Guard_String
msgctxt "68b77c8d-30c4-497e-8219-96982ed55f62"
msgid "\"Attack!\""
msgstr "\"시작!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/01_ChosenOfShelyn/03_OTP_Duel/Duel_Cutscene/10_Svetlana_String
msgctxt "5095f58e-8781-4bcd-b751-607f01b04bba"
msgid "\"Holy gods!\""
msgstr "\"신성한 신들이여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c196eb35-d7d6-436f-899a-d861030879d3"
msgid ""
"\"That didn't exactly feel like visiting the temple of a kind goddess...\""
msgstr "\"인자한 여신의 신전에 방문한 것 같은 기분이 들지는 않는군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d403bb88-9da7-46e8-96fa-9788866b88ef"
msgid "\"So your scar was sent by Shelyn herself.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 그 흉터는 셸린이 준 거네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "e6bacd84-05de-454e-931d-dc1fcb90e1c0"
msgid "\"I'm ready to go.\""
msgstr "\"갈 준비가 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/Eveld_retreats_String
msgctxt "75cb4c52-6a6e-45ce-8b6f-6cf5d3f3603e"
msgid "\"Merciful Shelyn, save us!\""
msgstr "\"자비로운 셸린이시여, 우리를 구하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/PaladinAttacks_Fredero_String
msgctxt "cb30f426-131d-42bd-b084-5a6d2702ecaf"
msgid "\"That's insane! I won't let you kill them, brother!\""
msgstr "\"이건 정신나간 짓이야! 그들을 죽이게 놔두지는 않겠다, 형제들이여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/PaladinAttacks_Paladin_String
msgctxt "d8055315-005a-4e0c-954e-1b61a0a31286"
msgid "\"Death to the renegade!\""
msgstr "\"변절자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/PaladinAttacks_Priest_String
msgctxt "a6fa9a5c-e2a8-404e-9299-29cd3a573484"
msgid "\"What are you doing? Stay your hand! Do not anger Shelyn!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 짓이오? 손을 거두시오! 셸린을 분노케 하지 마시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/ValerieAttacks_Fredero_String
msgctxt "fe8a442c-b384-42e9-ae6f-ecd4e1ce44e4"
msgid "\"I won't let you escape this time, Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"이번엔 빠져나가지 못할 것이오, 발레리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/ValerieAttacks_Paladin_String
msgctxt "a25be968-96f8-4ff6-9457-b26c71512f32"
msgid "\"Your death will be quick and painless – the final mercy of Shelyn!\""
msgstr "\"빠르고 고통없는 죽음을 선사해주겠소 - 셸린의 마지막 자비라고 생각하시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Barks/ValerieAttacks_Priest_String
msgctxt "0de1e823-7aac-4905-a80c-a970ae6655a9"
msgid "\"My goddess, give me strength!\""
msgstr "\"나의 여신이여, 힘을 주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0275a7ea-9e5f-4d95-be50-6060bc20c71a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is panting and wiping the sweat from her forehead.{/n} \"This is "
"it. Finally.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 헐떡이며 이마에서 땀을 훔쳐냅니다.{/n} \"이걸로 끝이군요. 드디어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8c213942-7780-412f-b583-c02032d3cfa3"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns to Laryen and looks at him expectantly.{/n} \"I think it's "
"obvious to everyone here that they atta...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 라르옌에게 돌아서서 기대에 차 그를 바라봅니다 .{/n} \"그들이 먼저 공격했다는 건 여기 있는 모든 사람에게 명백한..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "aff42879-0a67-4ee2-88ab-c41e4a5a4805"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing else for us to do here, {name}. If you don't mind, I'd "
"like to have done with this place.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 더 볼일은 없습니다, {name}. 괜찮으시다면, 이 곳을 떠나고 싶군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "758bac73-cbe0-4b4d-a843-6f329b5a0813"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie scoffs in reply.{/n} \"I hope that after this, "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} paladins will think twice before doing harm to your "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}. Anyway, they're usually much more "
"reserved than those fanatics from the Order of Prisms. Let's go! We can "
"discuss it at the capital – I want to see the end of this place as soon as "
"possible.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 비웃으며 대답합니다.{/n} \"이 일 이후로, {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘들은 당신의 "
"{mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}에 해를 끼치는 일이라면 다시금 고민해봐야 할 것입니다. 어쨌든, 대부분 사람들은 프리즘의 기사단의 "
"광신도들보다는 더 신중하긴 하지만요. 가지요! 이 일은 수도에 가서 더 논의해보도록 합시다 - 가능한 빨리 이 장소를 떠나고 싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "5cfad3cf-c3a7-4a74-9fe5-6552bbe8d1e5"
msgid ""
"\"... that bloodshed is always a heavy burden on the shoulders of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} followers.\" {n}Laryen shakes his head sadly.{/n} "
"\"Forgive them, Valerie. Blind faith clouded their judgment and pushed "
"towards violence, desecrating this holy place. Shelyn's light will not soon "
"return to this vaulting.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...이 유혈사태는 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}을 따르는 자들의 어깨에 영원히 무거운 짐으로 남을 것입니다.\" {n}라르옌은 "
"슬프게 고개를 젓습니다. {/n} \"그들을 용서하시오, 발레리. 눈먼 신앙이 판단을 흐리고, 그들을 폭력으로 내몰아, 이 신성한 장소를 "
"어지렵혔소. 셸린의 빛은 이 곳에 쉽사리 돌아오지 않을 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d45caf59-1e17-4412-b917-71fa1de77f50"
msgid ""
"\"If so, its disappearance can mean only one thing: she's finally left me "
"alone. That's enough for me. Now I want to get some air, so if you don't "
"mind, let's talk later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다면, 상처가 사라졌다는 사실이 의미하는 건 오직 하나뿐입니다. 셸린이 드디어 날 내버려둔 것입니다.저에겐 그걸로 충분합니다. "
"이제 괜찮으시다면, 기분전환을 좀 하고 싶군요, 얘기는 나중에 하도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dd3125a8-0102-4914-9922-119f56198fec"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie lingers, biting her lip.{/n} \"Possibly. Probably. I don't know. "
"Anyway, I must have done something that made {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} take it "
"back.\" {n}The girl shakes her head.{/n} \"I don't want to think about it. I "
"need some air – to clear my head. Let's talk later.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 주저하며, 입술을 깨뭅니다 .{/n} \"그럴수도 있겠군요. 모르겠습니다. 어쨌든 제가 한 행동이 "
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}이 상처를 되가져가게 만든 건 분명합니다.\" {n}발레리는 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"더이상 생각하고 "
"싶지 않군요. 머리를 비우기 위해 신선한 공기를 좀 쐬야 겠습니다 - 얘기는 나중에 하도록 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "80ad8251-1446-4d54-91e4-5470dac08200"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero puts away his weapon, looking sour.{/n} \"But we will do "
"everything in our power to wash away this disgrace. On behalf of the Order "
"of the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g}, I offer you, Valerie, and you, {mf|Your "
"Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, my sincerest apologies. The "
"Order of Prisms is young and too... zealous in their judgments of events and "
"signs.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}신물이 난 표정을 지으며, 프레데로는 무기를 치웁니다.{/n} \"그렇지만 이 불명예를 씻어내기 위해 우린 가능한 모든 노력을 다할 "
"것입니다. {g|Shelyn}영원한 장미{/g}의 기사단의 행동에 대해, 발레리, 그리고 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}에게 제 가장 "
"진실한 사과를 드립니다. 사건과 징조를 판단하는데 있어 프리즘의 기사단은 너무 어리고 너무... 열성적이었습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d622bc24-0d31-4321-8b86-579724d2e231"
msgid ""
"\"It's a waste of time! I've had enough. Not a single concession! Not a "
"single word about {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}! Let them pray to their goddess on "
"their bellies, if she's so precious to them!\" {n}Valerie puts away her "
"weapon.{/n} \"Let's go! This place makes me want to scrub clean!\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간낭비입니다! 충분히 들었어요. 설교는 더 이상 듣고 싶지 않습니다! {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에 관해서라면 한 마디도 더 듣고 "
"싶지 않단 말입니다! 여신이 그들에게 그렇게 중요하다면 속으로나 기도하게 하세요!\" {n}발레리는 무기를 거둡니다.{/n} \"갑시다! "
"이곳은 목욕이 간절히 생각나게 하는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/AfterJudgement/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3f62d438-3719-48fa-9746-cf237dba1838"
msgid ""
"\"I am sorry the paladins of the Order of the Prisms chose the path of "
"violence. But it was their decision, and it is not our fault.\""
msgstr ""
"\"프리즘의 기사단의 팔라딘들이 폭력의 길을 선택한 건 안타깝게 생각합니다. 하지만 그건 그들의 결정이 었지 우리 잘못이 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_CommonPriest01_String
msgctxt "b4c9f84f-078d-417f-8d14-91a748b0cd03"
msgid "\"So much blood...\""
msgstr "\"너무나 많은 피가 흘렀어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_CommonPriest02_String
msgctxt "3df87da6-9457-4692-bfad-d230b49e7064"
msgid "\"Will Shelyn forgive her flawed servants? I will pray for it!\""
msgstr "\"셸린이 죄많은 종복을 용서해주실까? 제발 바라옵니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_CommonPriest03_String
msgctxt "af41c8d3-f3b4-4c46-9fc4-43e119744265"
msgid ""
"\"Attacking one who was cleared of all charges by Shelyn herself! And in the "
"temple of the goddess! Unbelievable!\""
msgstr "\"셸린 스스로께서 모든 혐의를 벗겨준 자를 공격하다니! 그것도 여신의 신전에서! 믿을 수 없군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_Fredero01_String
msgctxt "8c39c61a-6afb-44c2-894e-e2562cf2c922"
msgid ""
"\"I am sorry for what happened here. This massacre was a grievous mistake.\""
msgstr "\"이런 일이 벌어져 미안합니다. 이 학살은 끔찍한 실수였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_Fredero02_String
msgctxt "5eab1792-a300-4b90-9b71-7ddc272cce6b"
msgid ""
"\"I hope that you won't hold a grudge against the local servants of Shelyn. "
"They are not responsible for the deeds of a bunch of miserable fools.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 땅에 살고있는 셸린의 종들에게 원한을 품지 않기를 바랍니다. 그들은 이 절망적으로 어리석은 자들이 한 짓에 책임이 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_MainPriest01_String
msgctxt "b0f1c00a-61fe-4505-aed6-0eea48228227"
msgid "\"What a blow to the local faith...\""
msgstr "\"신앙을 전파하는 데 큰 차질이 생겼구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/AfterFight_MainPriest02_String
msgctxt "b859d345-b381-4074-985c-0a5faa5b244e"
msgid "\"I beg you to leave. Let us mourn our fallen brethren.\""
msgstr "\"이제 떠나주시길 간청합니다. 쓰러진 형제들을 애도하게 해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/Eveld_bark_01_String
msgctxt "a45e0695-8911-4db0-b733-17467dfb3af8"
msgid "\"Ah! My respects!\""
msgstr "\"아! 만나서 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/Eveld_bark_02_String
msgctxt "9ffed7ee-52ad-4d95-be3a-af855e0dac7a"
msgid "\"The priest seems eager to speak with you!\""
msgstr "\"사제들이 당신과의 대화를 고대하고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/Fredero_bark_01_String
msgctxt "c0a6cd99-394f-4c9b-82b6-19edfd1d83b9"
msgid ""
"\"My respects, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"영광입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/Fredero_bark_02_String
msgctxt "b81766d8-de6a-4065-aa33-7d836a4b462d"
msgid ""
"\"We've been expecting you and Valerie. Please inform the priest of your "
"arrival.\""
msgstr "\"당신과 발레리를 기다리고 있었습니다. 사제에게 도착을 알려주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/IdleShelynFollower_01_String
msgctxt "a924253e-78f8-4c4f-8256-b292407064b8"
msgid "\"What can I do for you?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 도와드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/IdleShelynFollower_02_String
msgctxt "ab618b20-057c-45b9-bdb3-dbaf39725200"
msgid "\"Praise Shelyn!\""
msgstr "\"셸린을 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/IdleShelynFollower_03_String
msgctxt "b54fcbc6-9e12-4b95-a7e5-08c1be6e394f"
msgid ""
"\"Mmm? I'm sorry, I got distracted by the reflections playing on the wall. "
"Did you want something?\""
msgstr "\"음? 미안해요. 벽에 비추는 반사광에 넋을 잃고 있었네요. 무슨 볼일이라도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/IdleShelynFollower_04_String
msgctxt "e58ce99d-1795-495b-b42c-c76c0a563f0b"
msgid ""
"\"Look at this temple! What proportions, what harmony! It truly was built by "
"a genius!\""
msgstr "\"이 신전 좀 봐! 비례도 완벽하고, 조화로운 건축물이군요! 어느 천재가 지었음에 분명해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/IdleShelynFollower_05_String
msgctxt "5dce59e1-91b4-4fec-beca-e0ebcaacad06"
msgid ""
"\"Peace and beauty await you at all of Shelyn's temples. Stay for at least a "
"little while – and feel the grace of the Eternal Rose.\""
msgstr "\"모든 셸린의 신전엔 평화와 아름다움이 깃들어 있습니다. 잠시나마 머물러 - 영원한 장미의 은총을 느겨보시길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/Paladin_bark_01_String
msgctxt "0c6e4df2-f945-4586-b1a9-fc918beadf07"
msgid "\"Hm?\""
msgstr "\"흠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Barks/Paladin_bark_02_String
msgctxt "b5e5b33a-ccb9-40cb-b905-66b9d932cb33"
msgid "\"Don't take your time. Priest Laryen is ready to begin the ritual.\""
msgstr "\"그만 가시지요. 라르옌 사제께서 의식을 준비중이십니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "860de8b8-a4bb-4d71-8db4-5ee62425d17b"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 누구입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "67688029-6e36-42d1-993c-55430176e641"
msgid ""
"\"Which of you is behind the dirty rumors about my "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}?\""
msgstr "\"당신들 중 누가 내 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}에 대해 더러운 헛소문을 낸 장본인입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a3650835-fd83-4110-bd38-be55f39388de"
msgid "Murdered Shelynite followers in the temple of the goddess."
msgstr "여신의 신전에서 셸린의 추종자들을 살해했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "b4abbba7-59a4-470e-b7a5-181061c0da33"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I will consecrate your precious temple with your own blood!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"당신들 피로 소중한 신전을 축성해드리도록 하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "758149e2-2832-483f-b3ab-05307a8e4bfd"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "313b304b-ee91-4a3f-bbd3-8f413fafd592"
msgid ""
"\"I don't have the slightest desire to meddle in the affairs of Shelyn and "
"her followers. I demand only one thing: stop slandering me and my subjects!\""
msgstr ""
"\"셸린과 그녀의 추종자와 엮기고 싶은 생각은 추호도 없습니다. 그저 하나만 요구하겠습니다: 나와 내 백성을 모함하는걸 그만두십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "58baccc5-1ac1-4525-a0f8-c6f82e704f26"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이 곳은 어떤 곳입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4c0a140f-8a26-45fd-b0c9-d8d9cdeaee48"
msgid ""
"\"I want you to leave Valerie alone. She serves me and owes no debt to "
"Shelyn!\""
msgstr "\"발레리를 가만 내버려 두십시오. 그녀는 날 섬기고 있으며 셸린에게 아무런 빚도 지지 않았습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "2098a229-7a25-4c0a-9e42-10bc1fda16d2"
msgid ""
"\"I only came to escort Valerie. You can deal with each other without me.\""
msgstr "\"발레리를 호송하기 위해 왔을 뿐입니다. 나는 상관 말고 서로 알아서 문제를 처리하기바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "822e3c9e-3ff9-463a-a515-748443b01775"
msgid "Let Valerie decide what to do about the tribunal."
msgstr "발레리가 재판에 관해 결정하도록 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5c7cd93b-ea31-4db1-9892-e248ae38f4a7"
msgid "\"It's up to you, Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"당신 뜻대로 하십시오, 발레리\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e90ce0be-9b35-47f3-b2b4-603414cace9b"
msgid "Suggested that the trial will bring peace to Valerie's mind."
msgstr "이 재판이 발레리의 마음에 평안을 가져올 것이라 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "90c8c7e4-ccbe-477a-ab1d-daee1921bfd0"
msgid "\"Maybe this trial will bring you peace?\""
msgstr "\"이 재판이 당신에게 평안을 가져다 줄지도 모르겠습니다?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0037_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d084707f-0388-4773-893b-af5b0eea107d"
msgid "Suggested brushing aside the followers of Shelyn."
msgstr "셸린의 추종자들의 제안을 거절하라고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "ff0a67bc-976b-478a-855f-821d4c515069"
msgid "\"If I were you, I'd tell these smug prudes to go to hell.\""
msgstr "\"내가 당신이었다면, 이 잘난척쟁이들에게 지옥으로 꺼지라고 얘기했을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "c7f050ed-2dbb-4b7f-89bd-e9960b13b984"
msgid "\"What trial are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 재판을 말하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "00b8ee5f-f8e5-4a2e-bec5-5c9023d4b018"
msgid "\"What exactly is Valerie accused of?\""
msgstr "\"발레리의 죄목이 정확히 뭡니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "fc931d25-2030-4ec9-bdc5-6676cd4215ae"
msgid "\"Suppose we agree. What trial are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"동의한다 칩시다. 무슨 재판을 말하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "1dbcd8ad-6f0a-451a-950e-6a443a2da7b6"
msgid "\"I'm only here to escort Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"발레리를 호송하기 위해 왔을 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "c10e4743-10ff-43aa-8490-28e2ec11fb4a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not interested in playing your little games. Valerie and I are leaving."
"\""
msgstr "\"당신들의 하찮은 놀이에 참여하고 싶은 생각은 없습니다. 나와 발레리는 떠나겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "77417d06-b195-4806-ab31-badb32122add"
msgid "\"I see there's a whole company here...\""
msgstr "\"모두다 모인것 같군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "05e9f5d9-732a-436c-8a4b-7b28769c76a7"
msgid ""
"{n}A white-haired priest looks at you over his glasses.{/n} \"Look who's "
"here! {mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen} {name}! My respects. And I see you have "
"brought company...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}흰수염을 가진 사제는 안경너머로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"오셨군요! {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕} {name}! 영광입니다. "
"동료분들도 같이 오셨군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "51902624-1954-436a-9a0e-e10c5a50ec1a"
msgid ""
"{n}The paladin wearing armor strikes his open palm with his fist.{/n} "
"\"Finally! For a woman balancing on the edge of excommunication, you are "
"sluggish, Valerie!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}갑옷 입은 팔라딘이 주먹으로 손바닥을 칩니다.{/n} \"드디어! 파문을 코앞에 둔 여인네치고는, 너무 굼뜨게 온 것 아닌가, "
"발레리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2607703c-3037-434f-961b-2f9a0ac72949"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie slowly turns her head toward the paladin and gives him an icy "
"look.{/n} \"I'm never in a hurry to meet those who would seek petty revenge "
"upon the innocent for another's alleged transgressions.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 천천히 고개를 돌려 팔라딘에게 싸늘한 시선을 보냅니다.{/n} \"무고한 피의자 대신 죄없는 자에게 하찮은 복수를 행하는 "
"자들을 만나기 위해, 내가 서두를 필요는 없지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "ce93a358-422d-4bfc-a0af-81320dfbd32d"
msgid ""
"\"Please, everyone be calm. Let's not hurry in with accusations and hasty "
"decisions. In the end, we're in a sacred place. Arguments under this "
"vaulting are unacceptable.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부디, 모두 진정하십시오. 섯부른 고발과 판단은 그만둡시다. 우린 신성한 장소에 있습니다. 신전의 천장 아래서 논쟁은 용납되지 "
"않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "e1ff6035-bf46-4b1c-bf64-31a631a8d52b"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Laryen. I'm a priest of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, and leader of the "
"local congregation. For now, at least – until my place is taken by a "
"permanent priest from the Order of Prisms. For now I am spiritual adviser "
"and mentor to respected Hegend and his people – paladins of Shelyn who "
"require the advice of more experienced devotees.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 이름은 라르옌, {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 사제이자, 지역 신자들의 지도자입니다.. 적어도 지금은 말입니다 – 이후엔 "
"프리즘의 기사단에서 보내온 종신 사제가 제 자리를 맡을 것입니다. 또한, 존경하는 헤겐드와 그의 일행-더 경험많은 신도의 조언이 필요한 "
"셸린의 팔라딘들 위해-의 영적 보좌관과 멘토의 역할을 맡고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "18571705-7371-43ba-b13f-2daf840ef797"
msgid ""
"\"We say the truth, and you call it 'dirty rumor'. We're the protectors of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, and all who call her patron. It's ridiculous to hear "
"the charge of slander from one who has befriended a viper. Your friend "
"blackens the name of the goddess herself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우린 사실을 말했을 뿐인데, '더러운 헛소문'이라 손가락질하는군. 우린 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 의지를 전하고, 여신의 "
"후원자를 지키는 사람들이오. 표리부동한 사람을 친구로 둔 이가 험담을 지적하다니 대체 누가 할 소리인지 모르겠군. 그대의 친구는 여신의 "
"이름에 먹칠을 했소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a4d9e58b-3889-4ee0-a665-224fbc9e754d"
msgid ""
"\"I will pass unremarked the vaguely veiled insults. In the end, I have the "
"doubtful honor of talking to a coward who can only throw around empty words "
"and ungrounded accusations. You're too spineless to meet me face to face and "
"make your claims in person – that's why you prefer to strike on the sly!\""
msgstr ""
"\"원색적인 비난은 넘어가주도록 하겠습니다. 그로인해, 빈말과 증거없는 고발만 남발하는 겁쟁이와 만날 미심쩍은 영광을 가지게 "
"되었으니까요. 당신은 날 일대일로 만날 줏대도 없는 자입니다. - 그래서 그런 교활한 짓을 꾸몄겠지만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "867f736b-3095-408c-ab00-e5c2e135fec4"
msgid ""
"\"Please calm down. Although I do not approve of... the methods of respected "
"Hegend, I will not tolerate jokes at the expense of a paladin of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} in her very temple.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제발 진정하십시오. 존경하는 헤겐드의 방식에 찬성하진 않지만, 여신의 신전에서 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘을 농담거리로 "
"삼는 건 참아줄 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "7a69fcbd-aae9-478e-958e-b1a86c8e6545"
msgid ""
"\"The temple of the Lenses is a new abbey for one of the orders of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}.\" {n}The priest looks up at the vaulting in "
"admiration.{/n} \"A beautiful architectural masterpiece, isn't it? Such a "
"sophisticated building will make a splendid home for the Order of Prisms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"렌세스의 신전은 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 기사단을 위한 새로운 수도원입니다.\" {n}사제는 경탄에 차 천장을 올려다 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"건축학적 걸작입니다, 그렇지 않습니까? 이 공들인 건물은 프리즘의 기사단을 위한 훌륭한 집이 될 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "ad820f84-9d46-4dba-a430-c41df6fb6dba"
msgid ""
"\"We shall carry out all the necessary procedures. Valerie will answer for "
"her transgressions against {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우린 모든 필요한 조치를 취할 것이오. 발레리는 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에게 저지는 그녀의 죄에 대해 설명해야할 것이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e30832ea-fc89-474e-8516-1e5d18f0c545"
msgid ""
"\"I? For my transgressions? {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} has to answer to me! – For "
"ruining my life for so long!\""
msgstr ""
"\"I? 내 죄에 대해? 대답을 빚진건 내가 아니라 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}입니다! – 그렇게 오랜 시간 내 인생을 망친 데 대해서 "
"말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b42846d9-c8ce-42b6-a015-278ae68ac2cd"
msgid ""
"\"I tried to forget everything they stuck into my head in the Order, but I "
"remember one thing for certain: {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} is not revengeful or "
"stern. I don't believe your words, paladin!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기사단이 내 머리속에 억지로 넣은 모든 것을 잊기 위해 노력했지만, 하나만은 분명 기억나는군요: {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g} 은 "
"엄격하거나 복수심에 찬 여신은 아닙니다. 당신의 말은 믿을 수 없습니다, 팔라딘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "486bd1b3-8f6c-4d5c-b71c-e20204e6a124"
msgid ""
"\"As long as Valerie is in your lands, no creator who crosses into your "
"borders can feel safe! We heard how much she despises everyone who is "
"capable of creating anything beautiful – and we're not going to keep silent "
"about it! Of course, she could repent for her transgressions voluntarily, "
"and beg the goddess for mercy...\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리가 당신 품에 있는 한, 당신 땅의 경계를 넘는 그 어떤 예술가들도 안전하고 생각지 않을 것입니다! 우리 모두 그녀가 뭐든 "
"아름다운 것을 만들 능력이 있는 사람을 얼마나 경멸하는 지에 대해 들었소. - 그리고 우린 이를 보고만 있지는 않을 것이오! 물론 그녀가 "
"자신의 죄에 대해 자진해서 참회 하고, 여신에게 자비를 빌 수는 있겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "498fb5cb-624a-40a2-8917-ab69a6aca48c"
msgid ""
"\"Divine responsibilities surpass all worldly vows and commitments. Valerie "
"was promised to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} – and rejected that honor! Now Valerie "
"returns to her Order – and insults Shelyn again! It's time to repent and "
"answer for your transgressions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"신성한 책무는 그 어떤 세속적인 맹세나 약속을 넘어서는 것이오. 발레리는 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}으로 부터 약속받았지만 – 그 "
"영광을 거부했소! 그리고 지금 발레리는 기사단에 돌아와서는 - 다시금 셸린을 모욕하고 있소! 이제는 참회하고 네 죄에 대해 이실직고할 "
"때요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "107b77d4-19ab-4793-b54c-f40a8e6e7c57"
msgid ""
"\"You're right, Valerie: our goddess is not stern with those who misstep – "
"which is why you need not fear the divine trial. Its name is just an old "
"tradition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 옳습니다, 발레리: 우리의 여신은 실수를 한 자에 대해 엄격하지 않습니다 - 그게 바로 당신이 신성한 재판을 두려워 할 필요가 "
"없는 이유입니다. '재판'이라는 이름은 그저 오래된 전통으로 붙혀진 것 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "28f5183e-9d47-4ecd-92eb-243e44dedf80"
msgid ""
"\"Heretic! It seems there is no other hope for this soul, so deeply "
"blackened by pride, than the divine trial. {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} judgment "
"shall cleanse you of at least part of this abomination!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이단자! 네 영혼엔 더 이상 희망이 없는 것 같군, 오만에 너무나 타락했어. 그렇다면 신성한 재판 뿐이다.{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}"
"의 심판이 일부나마 네가 가진 혐오스러움을 정화하실 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "8afe0793-6eab-4b5d-b479-ddae97e5b4f9"
msgid ""
"{n}The paladin puts his hand on his weapon.{/n} \"Forgive me, {mf|Your Grace|"
"Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, but if you leave, this will mean "
"only one thing – an insult to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} and disregard of her "
"will. Are you sure that is what you want?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}팔라딘은 무기에 손을 댑니다.{/n} \"용서하시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 하짐나 당신이 떠난다면, 그건 오직 "
"하나만을 의미하는 것이오 – {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에 대한 모욕과 그녀의 의지에 대한 무시. 그게 정말 당신이 원하는 것이오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "b42c6af9-966b-4edf-a120-4b959cbff944"
msgid ""
"\"My respected companion is right. As Valerie has arrived at the Temple of "
"Prisms, the divine trial must commence. Besides, would you come all this way "
"if you didn't want to settle the matter?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 존경하는 동료의 말이 맞습니다. 발레리가 프리즘의 신전에 온 이상, 신성 재판은 반드시 열려야합니다. 게다가, 이 문제를 마무리 "
"지으려는 것이 아니라면 무엇하러 이 먼길을 오셨단 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "105afb65-f6a9-442e-b8f2-e2bc16d8378f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie clenches her fists in silence. It seems the scar on her face "
"darkens and deepens.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 침묵 속에 주먹을 쥡니다. 얼굴에 난 상처가 더 깊고 어두워 진 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2cfde41b-dbd5-4e2b-9e3d-72d26e7ca467"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks down, and an expression that could be taken for abashment "
"freezes on her face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 고개를 숙입니다. 당혹스런 정적의 표정이 그녀의 얼굴에 나타납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "c8b0fde2-7263-42d9-9ff9-3171ceb3c73f"
msgid ""
"{n}Hegend grabs his weapon.{/n} \"This is the last straw. You will wash away "
"this insult with blood!\""
msgstr "{n}헤겐드는 무기를 잡습니다.{/n} \"이게 마지막 기회다. 넌 피로 이 모욕을 씻어내게 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "d52f5a3b-a903-4e51-8be8-476598c1981a"
msgid "\"Thank you for agreeing, Valerie. Let's begin.\""
msgstr "\"동의해 줘서 감사합니다. 발레리. 시작합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "36c94682-a668-4731-bab9-ab61a7e99760"
msgid ""
"{n}Laryen folds his hands.{/n} \"A divine trial is a special ritual carried "
"out by followers of a god for someone who has lapsed in their faith. It is "
"not well known, but is used on those for whom there's still hope – for "
"returning to the church, or at least for making peace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라르옌은 손을 포갭니다.{/n} \"신성 재판은 신앙을 져버린 자를 위해 신의 추종자가 수행하는 특별한 의식입니다. 또한 - 잘 "
"알려진 사실은 아닙니다만 - 교단으로 돌아오고자 하거나 적어도 평안을 찾기를 희망하는 자들을 위한 의식이기도 합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "b0a7f898-2365-4c11-882b-35b688533f65"
msgid ""
"\"Making peace indeed! Valerie, who rejected my lady, should not count on "
"being coddled.\""
msgstr "\"평화를 찾는다라! 자신의 여신을 거부한 발레리가 그런 호의를 기대하는 건 부당한 일일것이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "5cd00f78-96db-46f2-8923-bb257f04934e"
msgid ""
"\"Of persistent disrespect and insolence towards {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} "
"order, and the goddess herself. The Order of the Eternal Rose disowned this "
"woman, but we, the Order of Prisms, will finish what was started. If Valerie "
"refuses to repent, she shall suffer punishment!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 기사단과 여신 스스로에게 지속적으로 불경스럽고 무례하게 군 것을 생각해보시오. 영원한 장미의 "
"기사단은 그녀와 의절했을지 몰라도, 우리, 프리즘의 기사단은 시작된 일의 끝을 볼 것이외다. 발레리가 회개하길 거부한다면, 처벌받아야 "
"마땅하오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1e913656-514c-4d18-9db9-08dae482b22a"
msgid ""
"\"If {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} newest order appears each time another one stops "
"persecuting me, my disrespect for your goddess will only grow. You are "
"creating the very thing that you so diligently fight – but are incapable of "
"understanding this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 셸린의 기사단이 날 고발하는 걸 그만둘 때마다 매번 새 기사단이 나타나 날 괴롭힌다면, 당신의 여신에 대한 대 불경심은 커져만 갈 "
"뿐이겠지요. 그 점을 이해하지 모한체 당신은 그저 싸움거리를 만드는 데 몰두하고 있을 뿐이겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "218b2569-cc57-414c-885b-ecf6567b7144"
msgid "{n}Hegend grabs his weapons.{/n} \"You aren't leaving!\""
msgstr "{n}헤겐드는 무기를 잡습니다.{/n} \"넌 도망가지 못한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "2e5ece22-ae0b-497c-8f71-1b9ef25a67e9"
msgid ""
"{n}Eveld bows in a refined manner.{/n} \"My respects, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! I came at the special invitation of Sir "
"Hegend. How could I refuse a paladin of my beloved patron?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이벨드는 나무랄 데 없는 태도로 절합니다.{/n} \"만나뵈서 영광입니다, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}! 헤겐드 경의 특별 초대를 "
"받고 이자리에 왔습니다.제 사랑하는 후원자의 팔라딘의 명을 어찌 거절할 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "40796f7d-7ea0-4b18-9100-d7d8ae4fda71"
msgid ""
"\"My respects to you... and you, Valerie.\" {n}Fredero Sinnet nods to you "
"and looks at Valerie. Seeing the scar, he purses his lips and shakes his "
"head sorrowfully.{/n} \"I heard about what happened to you, but seeing it "
"with my own eyes is unbearable. Believe me, I never wanted this. To be "
"honest, I don't even remember striking the blow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만나서 영광입니다.. 그리고 다시 만나게 되서 반갑구나, 발레리.\" {n}프레데로 시넷은 당신에게 절하고 발레리를 "
"바라봅니다.발레리의 상처를 보고는 입술을 굳게 다물고 고개를 슬프게 젓습니다. {/n} \"네게 일어난 일은 익히 들었다만, 내 눈으로 "
"직접보게되니 견딜 수가 없구나. 믿어주거라, 그건 절대 내가 바랬던 바가 아니었다. 솔직히 말해, 그 상처를 낸 공격을 한 기억조차 나지 "
"않는단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "12f79c68-82c1-4e16-8793-ae83e863fda1"
msgid ""
"{n}The wrinkle on Valerie's forehead softens.{/n} \"We settled our argument "
"in battle, Fredero. As for the scar, I've been wearing my wounds for a long "
"time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 이마에 잡혔던 주름이 부드러워집니다..{/n} \"우리의 다툼은 이미 결투에서 끝냈지 않습니까, 프레데로. 시간이 지나니 "
"흉터는 그리 신경쓰이지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9be0e876-7000-441c-b6c4-1ee3db0c4bd7"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! That's the spirit! If the conversation keeps up like this, a fight'll "
"be on!\""
msgstr "\"하! 바로 그거야! 얘기가 이런식으로 흘러가면, 곧 쌈박질이 시작되겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "76b5fcde-026e-4079-9898-c7d2a69cd0f8"
msgid ""
"\"And you enjoy mocking Valerie and the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}? Why "
"are there so many hypocrites among followers of supposedly kind gods?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리와 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}을 조롱하는 게 즐거우신 모양이군? 왜 이렇게 선신의 추종자들 중엔 위선자들이 많은 건지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5b91792d-fdb9-474f-81f2-f2d7d233ad88"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks up and around. The dwarf mindlessly thrusts his hand into "
"his beard and tugs at it, mumbling something fiercely.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 주위를 둘러봅니다. 드워프는 화가난 체 무언가 중얼거리며, 손을 수염 속으로 집어넣고 잡아당깁니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "48ec01bc-dc6c-4082-99d4-44fb91f732c9"
msgid ""
"{n}The paladin notices Nok-Nok and chokes with fury.{/n} \"And this... How "
"dare you drag this abomination into the temple of the goddess?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}팔라딘은 녹-녹을 보자 분노로 숨이 막혀 소리지릅니다.{/n} \"이 생물은.. 어떻게 감히 이 혐오스러운 생물을 여신의 신전에 "
"데려올 수 있단 말입니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d87552f5-373a-462e-81fa-86d91d38eb0b"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok grimaces and sticks his tongue out.{/n} \"Yes! Stink is awful! "
"What are those, flowers? Eeeew!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 찡그린 체 혀를 내밉니다.{/n} \"그래! 악취가 끔찍해! 이 꽃들은 다 뭐지? 으엑!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Shared_ValerieAgrees_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e75a09ba-0a7e-4c63-a7e7-be73118a77eb"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie keeps silence for a few moments, and then takes a deep breath.{/n}"
" \"Very well. I will endure this trial if it helps to put an end to all this."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 침묵하더니, 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"좋습니다. 이 모든 걸 끝내는 데 도움이 된다면, 재판에 참여하도록 하지요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/CovenOfLenses_BeforeJudgement/Shared_ValerieRefuses_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "14355f67-6106-4b9f-8d12-a2ec083b1e33"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is silent for a few moments, and then scoffs loudly.{/n} \"I'm "
"not going to participate in this trial. I'm sick of your ridiculous goddess."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 침묵하더니, 콧웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"난 재판에 참여하지 않을 것입니다. 당신들의 터무니없는 여신에겐 이제 "
"질렸어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d8b9194a-10e8-4806-be60-3ad18539546d"
msgid ""
"\"Look what Fredero did to her! He mangled Valerie! Who could stay their "
"hand and not deal a fatal blow after this?\""
msgstr ""
"\"프레데로가 그녀에게 무슨 짓을 했는지 보십시오! 그는 발레리의 얼굴을 망쳐놨습니다! 이런 일을 겪고 나서도 가만히 있어야 했단 "
"말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "cf1d9e5b-bece-4840-aeb4-e2047b460b7a"
msgid ""
"\"I ordered her to deal a fatal blow – the proper ending for any proper "
"duel. But if Valerie didn't agree with me, she wouldn't have done it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마지막 일격을 가하라고 내가 명령했습니다 - 공정한 결투에 있어 공정한 결말이었지요. 하지만 발레리가 내게 동의하지 않았다면, "
"그리하지 않았을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "957f7c7a-c7df-41b3-a8ab-49e218fd1edd"
msgid ""
"\"And yet Valerie observed all the rules. She came when Fredero called her. "
"She accepted the challenge. Will none of this be taken into consideration?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 발레리는 모든 규칙에 따랐습니다. 그녀는 프레데로가 불러서 갔고 프레데로의 도전을 받아들였습니다. 이런 점을 모두 고려해야하지 "
"않겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "e036c556-8510-421c-a2d7-5884e38c3518"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie despises {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} and everything she touches. Don't "
"confuse her good manners with obedience to the goddess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리는 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}과 그녀의 손길이 닿은 모든 것을 경멸하오. 그녀의 공손한 태도를 여신에 대한 복종과 착각하지 "
"마시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "d9a26683-19a1-4a18-8870-e661e763f31d"
msgid "\"Valerie's only fault is that she obeyed my order.\""
msgstr "\"발레리의 유일한 잘못은 내 명령을 따랐다는 것 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "86114802-a5dd-42e2-acbf-de12b77d11f5"
msgid ""
"\"You judge Valerie harshly for obeying orders? Then why are you so "
"persistent in seeking to judge her for breaking them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"명령을 따랐다고 발레리에게 가혹한 심판을 내린단 말입니까? 그렇다면 신의 명령을 따르지 않았다고 그녀를 심판하려 하는 이 노력들은 다 "
"뭐란 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "406283c6-99b7-490a-b070-35b4aa57fa28"
msgid ""
"\"I do not agree with Valerie. She can be harsh, but her heart is overfilled "
"with pain and bitterness. Judge her actions, not her words.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리에게 동의 하지 않습니다. 하지만 그녀가 가혹한 말을 하더라도, 그녀의 마음은 고통과 비참함으로 가득차 있다는 점을 알아주시기 "
"바랍니다. 그녀의 말이 아니라 행동으로 판단해 주시길 바랍니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "6e12402a-6a78-4f0a-8ebd-9e4dd622e8eb"
msgid ""
"\"What would you say about all of those you've killed since? Be honest with "
"yourself, Valerie. You're a warrior, not a nurse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 지금까지 저질러온 살생에는 뭐라고 얘기할겁니까? 스스로에게 진실하십시오. 발레리. 당신은 전사지, 간호사가 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "1267d5ec-55f0-4165-926c-d88d9f602dc1"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! What a spineless creature! How can you take him seriously? Valerie, "
"you must feel like a right hypocrite, trading bows with this scum.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 줏대 없는 인간 같으니! 그의 말을 진지하게 받아드릴 필요가 없습니다. 발레리, 이런 자와 인사를 나누다니, 마치 진정한 "
"위선자가 된 기분이겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "6d5f55ec-32b6-4aab-b718-f5f78156a4b1"
msgid "\"You provoked her! It's your fault, Eveld!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 먼저 그녀를 자극했지 않습니까! 그건 당신 잘못입니다. 이벨드!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "3a3746b7-ce1d-4316-9f37-e57d6ae600a5"
msgid ""
"[Whisper to Valerie] \"Don't let him make you angry. It's what he wants!\""
msgstr "[발레리에게 속삭인다] \"그에게 분노하면 안됩니다. 그게 그가 원하는 바입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "d12b0d0b-64e1-4ef9-bcf2-3c067c73a46e"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie defeated Fredero in a duel and slew him on my orders. Leave her be!"
"\""
msgstr "\"발레리는 결투에서 프레데로를 쓰러뜨렸고 내 명령에 따라 그를 베었습니다. 그녀를 내버려두십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0099_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1ff99d50-3a63-48ba-bfea-fe15d7771d80"
msgid "Resorted to lies during the divine tribunal."
msgstr "신성한 재판에서 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "b6d4ba9b-21d0-4033-ac70-ff3aaed976ce"
msgid "[Lie] \"We don't know anyone named Fredero Sinnet.\""
msgstr "[거짓말] \"프레데로 시넷이란 이름은 들어본 적이 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0112_Text
msgctxt "0ca0d9b6-93e6-4c04-9255-74f542f4d040"
msgid ""
"\"We've come to meet with Fredero Sinnet for one reason only – to get rid of "
"him.\""
msgstr "\"우린 단 한가지 목적으로 프레데로 시넷을 만나러 갔습니다 - 그를 제거하기 위해서지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0113_Text
msgctxt "746f1202-f9fb-4533-ac68-2262703801cf"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone can choose their own path. You and Fredero follow Shelyn's faith, "
"and Valerie has turned away from it. That doesn't mean you can interfere in "
"her life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구든 인생에 있어 스스로의 길을 선택할 수 있습니다. 당신과 프레데로는 셸린의 은총 따랐고 발레리는 그곳에서 발길을 돌렸을 "
"뿐입니다! 그게 당신들이 그녀의 인생에 상관할 이유가 되진 않습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0120_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "850f88a0-d1fb-4025-87b3-70d1f88917d8"
msgid "Took responsibility for the consequences of your own order."
msgstr "당신의 명령에 따른 결과에 대한 책임을 지기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0121_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "51eaa2b0-c474-4a41-b7c0-dde3af4b708b"
msgid "Took responsibility for the consequences of your own order."
msgstr "당신의 명령에 따른 결과에 대한 책임을 지기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0122_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "944930bf-df69-4d8b-b43a-124aea91ac8b"
msgid "Resorted to lies during the divine tribunal."
msgstr "신성한 재판에서 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0129_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "27d9adf7-1ddd-4498-8836-0ddb1f294d67"
msgid "Resorted to lies during the divine tribunal."
msgstr "신성한 재판에서 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0145_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a3a46410-5026-4694-b9b4-6f019cf9388b"
msgid "Threatened Eveld."
msgstr "이벨드를 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0145_Text
msgctxt "404e57f1-6377-407c-9e40-d9f1957d95d4"
msgid ""
"[Whisper to Eveld] \"If I were you, I wouldn't accuse the one who serves the "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen} of the Stolen Lands. Anything could happen in "
"these parts.\""
msgstr ""
"[이벨드에게 속삭인다] \"내가 당신이라면, 도둑맞은 땅의 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}을 섬기는 사람을 고발하지는 않겠습니다. 그 "
"땅에서는 무슨 일이 일어날지 알 수가 없으니까 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0149_Text
msgctxt "9f4720f3-d3ad-4403-9238-ea72da1eeeb7"
msgid "\"I'm tired of wasting my time. Valerie, we're leaving!\""
msgstr "\"시간 낭비하는데 지쳤습니다. 발레리, 떠납시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0159_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "424358da-a6fc-402f-b6c9-eb02c356dda5"
msgid "Resorted to lies during the divine tribunal."
msgstr "신성한 재판에서 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0159_Text
msgctxt "60fa1133-f159-4560-8f96-db0346138ada"
msgid "[Lie] \"We don't know anyone named Fredero Sinnet.\""
msgstr "[거짓말] \"프레데로 시넷이란 이름은 들어본 적이 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0173_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "861c63e7-9da4-4e26-a193-6bcdbbb6622d"
msgid "Laughed at the argument for mercy during the divine tribunal."
msgstr "신성 재판 도중 자비에 대한 논쟁을 두고 비웃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Answer_0174_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a8ab815a-34f9-4693-b5cc-e0ebb440b45d"
msgid "Laughed at the argument for mercy during the divine tribunal."
msgstr "신성 재판 도중 자비에 대한 논쟁을 두고 비웃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "c2595028-f209-4d6d-929a-eb7bae4f5f96"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} divine trial has commenced! May she be merciful to "
"the lost and confused. It is time to listen to all sides, and decide what "
"fate awaits Valerie.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 신성 재판이 시작되었도다! 여신계서 길 잃고 혼돈에 빠진 자에게 자비를 베푸소서. 이제 모두의 말을 "
"듣고 발레리를 기다리고 있는 운명을 결정할 때 입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "e37ec26b-2491-4ed0-9ae2-ee8fbed67385"
msgid ""
"\"Today, under the vaulting of the Temple of Prisms, we, followers of the "
"goddess, will give you, Valerie, a chance to redeem yourself in the eyes of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, and...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘, 프리즘의 신전의 천정 아래서, 우리, 여신의 추종자들은 , 당신, 발레리에게 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 눈 앞에서 자신을 "
"속죄할 기회를 주려고 합니다. 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "68ddb3a0-8577-48bd-ba26-851e86e10954"
msgid ""
"\"Enough, Laryen. Everybody present knows she doesn't deserve redemption. "
"She lost the right to forgiveness on the day she rejected "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} grace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"충분하오, 라르옌. 여기 있는 모두가 그녀에게 속죄할 자격이 없다는걸 알고 있소. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 은총을 거부한 그날 "
"그녀는 용서받을 기회를 잃었단 말이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "ff5ccd7c-bbad-4d3c-8508-1a84f97513c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Fredero Sinnet clears his throat to attract everyone's attention.{/n} \"I "
"didn't come here to stand silent like an idol. When I challenged Valerie to "
"a duel, she agreed. We fought according to all rules, and our argument was "
"settled. Think what you will of Valerie, but at least she showed me some {d|"
"Valerie Fredero Lives}respect{/d}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}프레데로 시넷은 모두의 주의를 끌기 위해 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"난 석상마냥 조용히 있기 위해 이자리에 온것이 아닙니다. 내가 "
"발레리에게 결투를 신청했을 때, 그녀는 받아들였습니다. 우리는 규칙에 따라 싸웠고, 우리의 다툼을 마무리시켰습니다. 그때 발레리가 어떤 "
"의도였는지는 모르겠습니다만, 적어도 그녀는 날 어느 정도 {d|Valerie Fredero Lives}존중{/d}해 줬습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "48d9c4eb-1c47-4806-b505-6716c4081df6"
msgid ""
"\"But her transgressions against the church do not end with this deed! "
"Valerie, what do you have to say about your former mentor, the respected "
"Fredero Sinnet? The noble paladin was following your trail when he "
"mysteriously {d|Valerie Fredero Killed}disappeared{/d}! Reveal the truth, "
"Valerie – where is he? Where is the one who believed in you until the end, "
"and apparently paid dearly for his willingness to forgive?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 교단에 대한 그녀의 죄는 여기서 끝나지 않소! 발레리, 너의 전 멘토인, 존경받는 프레데로 시넷에 대해선 뭐라 대답할 것인가? "
"너의 흔적을 뒤쫓던 고귀한 팔라딘이 영문도 모른체 {d|Valerie Fredero Killed}사라져버렸다{/d}! 진실을 밝혀라, "
"발레리 - 그는 어디있는가? 마지막까지 너를 믿고 용서하기 위해 노력했던 자는 어디 있냐는 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2f0f6292-32e8-4bf5-9653-886415d2aa43"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't leave the order to look for lost paladins. If "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} followers think it's my job to keep an eye on all her "
"henchmen, they're deeply mistaken!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사라진 팔라딘을 찾으려고 내가 기사단을 떠난게 아닙니다. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 추종자들이 여신의 모든 종복을 살피는 게 내 "
"일이라고 생각한다면, 크게 잘못 생각하고 있는 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2a33dff4-a53b-4c7e-9fe9-07c252aeecca"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks down. She tries to say something, but can't force out a "
"single word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 고개를 숙입니다. 뭔가 말하려고 하지만, 한마디도 꺼내지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3173e2b4-82a9-4c1b-bfc8-dc7db827e941"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie scoffs.{/n} \"I don't care about you, let alone respect you! I "
"just wanted to teach you a lesson and make you leave me alone!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 콧웃음 칩니다.{/n} \"난 전혀 신경쓰지 않았습니다, 마음대로 생각하세요! 그저 당신에게 교훈 한자락 가르쳐주고 날 "
"내버려두게 하고 싶었을 뿐입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a24fa118-ea56-45ae-8433-7bba9d5b9504"
msgid ""
"\"I never wanted to insult anyone. All I wanted – all I dreamed of – was to "
"choose my own way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구든 모욕하고 싶진 않았습니다. 내가 원하던 건 - 그리고 항상 꿈꿔왔던 건 - 그저 내 인생을 내 방식대로 사는 것 뿐이었습니다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "106688b2-33a6-458d-b636-446edc88f5da"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie clenches her fists.{/n} \"Yes! The paladin challenged me. Why am "
"I to save him from the consequences of his own actions? I did what I thought "
"was right, not what a goddess – who I don't even care about – might want me "
"to!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 주먹을 꽉 쥡니다{/n} \"그렇습니다! 팔라딘이 결투를 신청했습니다. 자신이 선택한 결과입니다. 내가 왜 그를 "
"살렸어야했단 말입니까? 난 내가 옳다고 생각한대로 행동했을 뿐입니다, -내가 신경쓰지도 않는- 여신이 내게 바라는 대로가 아니라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "1c4eb462-c5e6-490f-829b-e257fb4d4760"
msgid ""
"\"There's truth in the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}'s words. You can "
"hardly blame Valerie for losing her temper, after being stripped of her "
"beauty so cruelly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 말 속에는 진실이 있습니다. 아름다움을 그처럼 잔인하게 빼았겼을 때 화를 참지 못한 것을 두고 "
"발레리를 비난할 순 없겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "e8544544-2f4a-472c-baa2-eebeba3a74eb"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! You can't ignore a person's deeds, even when their words are "
"bitter!\""
msgstr "\"지당한 말입니다! 언행이 씁쓸할지언정 그 사람이 한 행동을 무시해서는 안되겠지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "4b3e212b-16b7-4666-8979-41c72050ef1d"
msgid ""
"\"Honest words. Believe me, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}, none of those present have any illusions about Valerie!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정직한 말씀이십니다. 믿어주십시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 여기 있는 사람 가운데 발레리에 대한 편견이 있는 자는 아무도 "
"없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "5d096130-f2d4-4362-b6eb-1ecbd5c874bb"
msgid ""
"\"Enough about Fredero. We don't have that much time, and Valerie gives us "
"much to consider. According to her masters at the Order of the {g|Shelyn}"
"Eternal Rose{/g}, she's always been noble and merciful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"프레데로에 대해선 이만 하도록 합시다. 시간이 많지 않을 뿐더러, 발레리는 이에 대해 충분히 대답했습니다. 영원한 장미의 기사단 "
"소속인 그녀의 멘토의 증언에 따르면, 발레리는 고귀하고 자비롭게 행동했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "8adf9d7e-ab09-4532-9c30-a555d5951a03"
msgid ""
"\"Really? Rumors from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} tell otherwise! Valerie {d|c0 Let "
"People Burn}abandoned{/d} innocent people to die in the fiery inferno at "
"Jamandi Aldori's house! And why? Simply because she was ordered to!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런가? {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 들리는 소문에 의하면 전혀 아닌것 같소만? 발레리는 자만디 알도리의 집에서 무고한 "
"사람들이 불지옥 속에서 죽게 {d|c0 Let People Burn}내버려{/d}뒀다고 하오! 단지 그녀가 그렇게 명령 받았기 때문에 "
"말이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "b6797dd7-9395-4d1c-9050-494ae1f85940"
msgid ""
"\"Stories about the valor she showed in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} spread far "
"beyond its borders. How many did this fearless warrior {d|c0 Saved "
"People}save{/d} from the fire at Jamandi Aldori's house? They and many "
"others owe their lives to her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 그녀가 보여주었던 용기에 관한 이야기는 국경 너머에까지 잘 알려졌소. 이 두려움을 모르는 전사가 "
"자만디 알도리 집에서 난 화재에서 얼마나 많은 이를 {d|c0 Saved People}구했소{/d}? 그들과 수많은 사람들이 발레리에게 "
"목숨을 빚진 셈이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ff88e36a-2009-4069-a018-524d77b3ea9c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie talks quickly, her face blushing.{/n} \"I didn't have time to "
"look about! To appraise the situation! That attack... The murderers...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 얼굴을 밝히며, 급하게 말합니다.{/n} \"둘러볼 시간적인 여유가 없었습니다! 상황을 판단한 시간도요! 그 공격에서.. "
"살인자들이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "a8ad8660-a8cd-4f5b-9f6c-3886113b1bee"
msgid "\"What? But...\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고? 하지만..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3a0e0791-7689-48b4-b60a-8fb5f25872df"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie opens her mouth but then sighs and lowers her head without saying "
"anything.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 입을 열지만 한숨을 쉬더니 아무말 하지 않고 고개를 숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c5f1ba5a-ad4d-4057-9092-973898ba7202"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie throws a lock of hair from her face pensively, but then her lips "
"form an angry sneer.{/n} \"Right. There's no comparing such dramatically "
"different numbers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}빌레리는 수심에 잠겨 머리카락에 얼굴을 뭍습니다만, 곧 그녀의 입술에 분노한 비웃음이 나타납니다. {/n} \"맞습니다. 그렇게 "
"극적으로 다른 숫자는 비교해 볼 필요도 없지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c5a68396-4b36-4afd-a530-361312a4b3db"
msgid ""
"\"Jamandi Aldori herself was in danger! How could I risk the life of a "
"Swordlord?!\""
msgstr "\"자만디 알도리의 목숨이 경각에 달려있었습니다! 소드로드의 생명을 위험에 빠뜨릴 수 있었겠습니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "aa7f2104-7b8f-42e4-9b53-b1976cbd0d6d"
msgid ""
"\"I remember it well. The one I was able to save from the flames. The "
"others...\" {n}Valerie stops.{/n} \"I'm sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 일은 잘 기억하고 있습니다. 그 불길에서 오직 한 명만을 구해낼 수 있었지요. 하지만 다른 자들은...\" {n}발레리는 말을 "
"멈춥니다.{/n} \"미안합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3b460d53-f65e-4ca3-8ed3-fefe40edc851"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, don't ascribe mercy to my actions – and don't drag your "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} into this! I obeyed an order – that's all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 내 행동을 자비로 해석하지 말아주세요 - 그리고 셸린을 끌어들이지도 마시고요! 난 명령에 따랐을 뿐입니다 - 그게 다란 말입니다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5b60e698-f1ba-4e44-9819-d3eb5585dcbd"
msgid "\"I only did what I had to. No more and no less.\""
msgstr "\"난 내가 해야할 일을 했을 뿐입니다. 그뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "a176a2a9-63a6-4190-b824-4f5c2196acda"
msgid ""
"\"Enough! I'm tired of this endless babble. I shall prove that Valerie is a "
"capricious and dishonorable woman who has twisted her life to pursue a "
"single goal: to harm everything that is precious to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만! 이 끝없는 헛소리가 지겨워지는군. 발레리는 오직 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}이 소중하게 여기는 모든 것을 해치려는 하나의 "
"목표만을 위해 뒤틀린 삶을 선택한, 변덕스럽고 명예없는 여성이라는 사실을 밝혀줄 증거가 여기 있소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "14823637-884e-441b-9196-7ab2ad2a44e7"
msgid ""
"\"I have a reliable witness who can confirm my statement. I present – Sir "
"Eveld!"
msgstr "\"내 주장을 확인해 줄 믿을 수 있는 증인을 데려왔소. 이벨드 경을 소개하오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "7740fec9-499d-4649-a3bc-33f63b25612e"
msgid ""
"{n}Eveld pushes his chest out and pulls his chin up.{/n} \"This lady "
"insulted me in front of my audience – for no reason at all! Arrested me with "
"brutal force! And the worst part is – when dust settled and our blood "
"cooled, Valerie didn't even think to {d|Valerie Support Valerie}apologize{/d}"
" for her behavior. I'd say that only confirms her maliciousness!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이벨드는 가슴을 들고 턱을 곧게 세웁니다.{/n} \"이 여인은 관객들 앞에서 날 모욕했소 - 아무런 이유 없이말이오! 무력으로 날 "
"체포했고, 더 최악인건 - 먼지가 가라않고 냉정해지고 나서도 - 발레리는 {d|Valerie Support Valerie}사과{/d} "
"따윈 전혀 하지 않았소. 이런 행동들이 그녀의 악의를 확인하는 증거라고 말하는 바이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "628635a2-bd20-4113-a745-bbef11b6bce2"
msgid ""
"{n}Eveld rocks on his heels pensively.{/n} \"Well, Sir Hegend, actually "
"Valerie did express her {d|Valerie Support Eveld}apologies{/d} for all the "
"inconvenience she caused. Who would I be if I started digging up the past?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이벨드는 주저하며 발끝을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"글쎄올시다, 헤겐드 경, 사실 발레리는 그녀가 일으킨 모든 불편에 대해 {d|"
"Valerie Support Eveld}사과의 뜻{/d}을 표했다오. 지난 과거를 다시 파헤친다면 내 체면은 뭐가 되겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "62567604-a2a5-423d-b21e-8078d1c622f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Laryen raises a brow and looks at Eveld over his glasses.{/n} \"Oh? Was "
"this man's art meant to do harm?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라르옌은 눈썹을 치켜세우고 안경넘어로 이벨드를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"오? 이분의 예술이 누군가에게 해를 끼칠 목적으로 행해졌습니까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "3588dbba-5997-4ec7-9f41-1b09249ae7b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Eveld waves off the notion.{/n} \"Impertinent. Art is meant to arouse "
"minds, not beget violence!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이벨드는 손사래치며 부정합니다.{/n} \"무례하군요. 예술은 정신을 고양시키기 위한 것이지, 폭력을 부르기 위한 것이 아니오!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1355715c-0bc3-4cbf-92cf-b8980cc301d2"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie allows herself a shadow of a smile.{/n} \"Very true. But if I "
"hadn't apologized, he might have died of sorrow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 그늘진 미소를 보입니다.{/n} \"그렇습니다. 제가 사과하지 않았다면, 슬픔에 빠져 죽음을 선택할 것 처럼 보였지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "d7f909db-0735-4c2e-8da0-6c7b3045c2c9"
msgid "{n}Valerie casts a tired look at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 피곤한 눈초리로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ef9bed19-f835-48f3-b4d1-fbd0256e5fd4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie raises her head and takes a deep breath – as if awakening from a "
"deep sleep. She looks at the temple's decorations and raises her hand.{/n} "
"\"I've stood here listening to your arguments for long enough. Now it's my "
"turn to speak.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 고개를 세우고 크게 숨을 들이쉽니다 - 마치 긴 잠에서 깨어난듯이. 신전의 장식을 둘러보더니 손을 들어 올립니다.{/n} "
"\"당신들의 말은 충분히 들었습니다. 이제 내가 말하게 해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c07aa46f-cd71-460f-92dd-fc5eb990f74a"
msgid ""
"\"For several months, the {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} followers made my life a "
"torture. Why? Because I refused to obey someone else's will. Not a single "
"time was I asked what I wanted. The only desires that mattered were the dim "
"whims of a goddess, who expressed herself through her fanatics!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지난 몇달 동안, {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 추종자들은 내 인생을 고문처럼 만들었습니다. 왜 그랬을까요? 그저 내가 다른이의 "
"뜻을 거부했기 때문입니다. 그들은 한 번도 내가 뭘 원하는지 묻지 않았습니다. 중요한건 오직 그녀의 광신도로 표출되는 여신의 희미한 변덕 "
"뿐이었지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9f8082e9-416e-40f3-b040-b7ddb68d787c"
msgid ""
"\"My departure from the Order of the {g|Shelyn}Eternal Rose{/g} was not an "
"insult to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} or her followers. All I wanted was to devote "
"my life to what's important to me. The goddess' followers never gave me a "
"single chance to walk my own life's path.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 기사단을 떠난 건 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 추종자를 모욕하기 위함이 아니었습니다. 내가 원한 건 오직 내가 중요하다고 "
"생각하는 것에 내 인생을 헌신하는 것 뿐이었습니다. 여신의 추종자들은 단 한번도 내 스스로의 길을 갈 기회를 주지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "566c45d9-9f5f-4391-a710-527b2f8c3d67"
msgid ""
"\"You bring woe, bring grief, bring suffering to those around you. Why? Does "
"your goddess want this? Or is it just your own ambition talking, wrapped in "
"the cloth of infallible faith?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신들은 당신 주위의 사람들에게 분노를, 슬픔을, 그리고 고통을 가져다 주고 있습니다. 왜 그랬습니까? 당신들의 여신이 그걸 "
"원해서입니까? 아니면 확고한 신앙으로 치장한 당신들의 야망의 발로인 겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a8a41904-224e-41a2-a498-55af8630ab50"
msgid ""
"\"I've always been appalled by your fanaticism. I'm disgusted by the blunt "
"stupidity that keeps you from seeing the person behind my beauty. And you "
"know what? Now that I've lost this 'gift' of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, this mask "
"that prevented everyone from seeing the real me – now I'm finally free. And "
"if anyone wants...\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 언제나 당신들의 광신에 거부감이 들었습니다. 내 아름다움 뒷편에 있는 한 인간을 보지 못하게 하는 무신경한 어리석음이 "
"역겨웠습니다. 그리고 그거 아십니까? {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 '선물'을 잃고 나서야 - 모두가 진정한 나를 보지 못하게 "
"가로막았던 이 가면을 잃고 나서야 - 난 진정한 자유를 찾았습니다. 누구든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f52d5c7d-956a-49db-ac0a-77d6a00c6c91"
msgid ""
"\"Do I value art? No. Am I ready to serve it? No. Do I respect those who "
"have brought so much trouble to me and the {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}? "
"No. But there are some of you like me, who dream of just one thing: to carry "
"out your chosen duty. {n}Valerie turns to Laryen and lowers her head.{/n} "
"\"If all servants of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} were like you, my parting from the "
"Order could have been much more peaceful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 예술을 숭상하냐고 물었습니까? 아닙니다. 네가 예술을 섬길 준비가 되었냐고 물었습니까? 아닙니다. 나와 "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}에게 그 많은 문제를 가져운 자들에게 존경의 뜻을 보이겠냐고 물었습니까? 이 또한 아닙니다. 하지만 이곳에도 "
"나처럼 단 하나의 목표-자신이 선택한 의무를 수행하는 것을- 만을 가지고 사는 자들이 있지요.{n}발레리는 라르옌에 고개를 돌려 예를 "
"표합니다.{/n} \"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 종복이 모두 당신과 같았다면, 그때 더 평화롭게 기사단을 떠날 수 있었을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "608695ed-cd57-4be6-ae6e-d20cb01341b4"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe I don't deserve forgiveness in the eyes of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}. "
"Maybe fanatics like Sir Hegend would be happier to see me in the noose. But "
"I see now that one shouldn't laugh at another's way just because one doesn't "
"understand or share it. But now, speaking openly before you, my conscience "
"is definitely clear. And if you wish to judge me for the fact that my "
"opinion is different from yours...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 용서를 받을 자격이 없을 지도 모르겠습니다. 아마 헤겐드 경 같은 광신도들은 제가 교수형을 "
"당하면 더 기뻐할 지도 모르겠습니다. 하지만 이제 깨달았습니다. 단지 이해하거나 공감할 수 없다는 이유로 다른 이의 방식을 비웃어서는 "
"안된다는 걸요. 하지만 이제 당신 앞에서 자유롭게 얘기하건데, 내 양심은 분명 떳떳합니다. 그러니 내가 당신들과 의견이 다르다는 "
"이유만으로 날 심판하려한다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "6629b400-c86e-40e6-89aa-23d59d2d35c6"
msgid ""
"\"The divine trial is over. {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} has made her decision.\""
msgstr "\"신성 재판은 끝났습니다. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}께선 결정을 내리셨습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "642e73ed-b2ac-43f9-8b96-689dcec00446"
msgid ""
"\"About what... how?\" {n}Valerie touches her face.{/n} \"The scar! It's... "
"gone!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 결정을... 아니 어떻게?\" {n}발레리는 얼굴을 만집니다.{/n} \"상처가! 상처가 없어졌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "85561a9f-2444-4980-8f13-d61dfbdb2428"
msgid ""
"{n}Hegend, white as a sheet, points at Valerie with a trembling hand.{/n} "
"\"But... but why?!\""
msgstr "{n}헤겐드는 백지장처럼 하얘지고선, 발레리를 떨리는 손으로 가르킵니다.{/n} \"하지만.. 하지만 왜?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "ae437171-0d7f-4947-ae26-00e3d593db7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Laryen looks at Valerie sadly.{/n} \"You are full of wrath and resentment "
"towards {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, and these feelings will never allow you to "
"return to her light. Shelyn is not vengeful, she only wanted to teach you a "
"lesson. But since you reject her light, she now steps back, and returns what "
"has always been only yours, never hers. Your beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라르옌은 발레리를 슬프게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"당신의 내면은 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}에 대한 분노와 억울함으로 "
"가득차있습니다, 그리고 그러한 내면은 여신의 빛으로 돌아가는 걸 결코 허락하지 않을 것입니다. 셸린은 복수심에 가득한 여신이 아닙니다. "
"오직 당신에게 교훈을 가르쳐 주고 싶었을 뿐이시지요. 하지만 당신의 여신의 빛을 거부했으니, 여신은 그저 물러서서 온연히 -여신의 것이 "
"아니라- 당신의 것이었던 걸 돌려주었습니다. 당신의 아름다움 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "eee7c3d4-9bfd-4dbe-9951-2c3005437436"
msgid ""
"{n}Laryen smiles softly, looking at Valerie.{/n} \"Look at her, my friend. "
"She is proud, but who could expect otherwise from a creature of such amazing "
"beauty? Now, as {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} light fills Valerie's soul, the child "
"is filled with renewed radiance. The thorn that pricked has been burned "
"away. The goddess shows Valerie a way to the source of light and beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라르옌은 발레리를 바라보며 부드럽게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"그녀를 보십시오, 여러분. 그녀의 내면이 자존감으로 가득 차있지만, "
"이렇게 놀라운 아름다움을 가진 생명이 그러하지 않을 수 있겠습니까? 이제 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 빛이 발레리의 영혼을 채웠으니, "
"그녀는 다시금 여신의 광휘로 가득 채워졌습니다. 장미에 났던 가시는 불태워졌습니다. 여신께서는 발레리에게 빛과 아름다움의 원천으로 가는 "
"길을 보여주었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "c0bec21a-38f0-4ebd-8ee2-7171af881f07"
msgid ""
"\"NO!\" {n}Hegend pulls out his weapon and shakes it in the air, rolling his "
"blood-shot eyes.{/n} \"The witch has deceived {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}! Only I "
"know the will of my goddess! Death to Valerie!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안돼!\" {n}헤겐드는 충혈된 눈을 부라리며, 무기를 뽑고선 허공에 흔듭니다.{/n} \"저 마녀가 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}을 "
"속였다! 오직 나만이 여신을 뜻을 알지어다! 발레리에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0094_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "bd652d2e-31c2-4bf7-a849-f180b0548bf3"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie's expression proclaims her blame louder than any words! Can there "
"be any further doubt about what happened to Sir Sinnet, whose only fault was "
"to have faith in this woman's virtue?\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리의 증언은 그 어떤 말보다 그녀가 받는 비난을 확인해줄 뿐이오! -그저 이 여자의 미덕에 믿음을 가지고 있었던게 유일한 "
"잘못이었던- 시넷 경에 무슨 일이 일어났는지 더 이상 의심의 여지가 있겠소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "980fedf6-4de7-44be-bf3e-0289f0eaacc5"
msgid ""
"\"You could free yourself – cleanse your soul and admit your fault – yet I "
"don't hear you crying or begging for mercy. Tell me, Valerie, what drives "
"you? Wicked pride or stony stubbornness?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 영혼을 정화하고 잘못을 인정해 스스로를 해방시킬 수는 있겠지 - 하지만 난 네가 울거나 자비를 구걸하는 걸 보진 못했다. "
"얘기해봐라, 발레리, 무엇이 널 이렇게 만들었느냐? 고약한 오만함이냐 아니면 벽돌과 같은 고집스러움이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "d38c3c45-158f-48b6-a0d4-887f80b11fb5"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie squints and purses her lips. Her neck seems to be covered in "
"sweat.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 슬쩍 보고는 입을 닫습니다. 그녀의 목은 땀으로 흥건합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0100_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ff88e713-693b-4b25-aeb1-d14d991a9dda"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie doesn't indicate that she heard you, but you see her shoulders "
"relax.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신의 얘기를 듣지 않은 척하지만, 당신의 그녀 어깨의 긴장이 풀리는 것을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "fbede796-c5bb-45f4-8d86-6148a02c966e"
msgid ""
"\"Hm... I have no reason to distrust you, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your "
"Highness|Your Highness}. So the disappearance of Fredero Sinnet is not on "
"Valerie's conscience.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠, 당신 얘기를 믿지 않을 이유가 없지요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 그럼 프레데로의 실종은 발레리의 양심과는 무관한 "
"것으로 알겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "c9d6ee1a-0544-4156-a162-34b439bef26e"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie finds a moment to swivel around and burn you with a furious look. "
"Your barefaced lie didn't seem to please her.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 광분한 표정으로 당신을 태워버릴 듯이 노려봅니다. 당신의 뻔뻔한 거짓만이 그녀를 기쁘게 한 것 같지는 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0104_Text_String
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "9af83d17-856c-4d0f-99a4-3cd940b3a1c6"
msgid ""
"\"Lying does not befit a ruler, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"거짓말은 통치차에게 어울리지 않습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "74cee83a-dc4d-45df-a662-f12b900c51da"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? Then after this trial has ended, perhaps we shall discuss the "
"consequences of such rashness!\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니까? 그럼 이 재판이 끝나면, 당신의 그런 경솔함에 대해 논의보도록 해야겠군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "6d010e7f-6bb7-4f03-a11b-5c2b802ab1a5"
msgid ""
"\"The {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} was in {mf|his|her} right. Even "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} paladins must respect the laws of the lands they're "
"in.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}에겐 그럴 권리가 있습니다. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘이라 할지라도 그들이 밟고 있는 땅의 "
"법도를 존중해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "51b46c18-29b8-48ac-a811-71150352afab"
msgid "\"My child...\" {n}The priest does not continue, but sighs heavily.{/n}"
msgstr "\"발레리..\" {n}성직자는 말을 잇지 못하고 무겁게 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "bd826cca-6f39-41a7-ab8f-52d6763c6105"
msgid ""
"\"I can understand the desires of a young girl who wishes to soak up the "
"world. It's only a pity that Valerie didn't find another way to express it, "
"and fled from the Order like an errant child...\""
msgstr ""
"\"세상에 빠져들고픈 어린 소녀의 열망은 이해할 수 있습니다. 그저 발레리가 그 소망을 표현할 다른 방식을 찾지 못하고, 버릇 나쁜 "
"아이처럼 기사단을 달아나는 것으로 끝난 게 안타까울 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "f645136a-6153-422f-b0b6-cd3efe910df3"
msgid ""
"\"This woman has the nerve to openly defy the servants of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}! Oh, is there no limit to your insolence, Valerie?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 여자는 뻔뻔하게도 공개적으로 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 종복을 모욕하고 있소! 오, 너의 불경함은 한도 끝도 없구나, 발레리?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0114_Text
#. Speaker : FrederoSinnet
msgctxt "5569e331-b9f9-4478-bc92-dcb2717b6861"
msgid ""
"\"This may surprise you, but I agree with you. Once my blood cooled, I "
"started to realize that my complaints about Valerie were a little... "
"excessive.\""
msgstr "\"놀라우실지 모르겠습니다만, 당신 말이 맞습니다. 냉정을 되찾고, 전 발레리에게 한 비평이 약간 지나쳤다는걸 깨달았지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f7c598d9-3213-418b-a0e6-7fadf9abcdf8"
msgid "\"And we did – only for you to come following in his footsteps!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 우린 그렇게 했습니다 - 단지 당신이 그의 발자취를 따라오길 바라면서 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0116_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "cc46c961-c9ea-44d5-a8ef-b618e7f2bd8d"
msgid ""
"\"An unforgivable crime with no excuse – that's what I see in Valerie's "
"actions.\""
msgstr "\"변명의 여지가 없는 용서할 수 없는 죄 -그게 네가 발레리의 행동에서 본 것이오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0117_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "36d987a8-773d-4a7c-b5db-3c674c3055ee"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie closes her eyes in irritation and swallows heavily. You feel she "
"is about to scream.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 짜증에 눈을 감아버리고 숨을 크게 삼킵니다. 그녀는 소리를 지르기 직전의 상태로 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0118_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "97671085-daa2-4a8f-b85d-c9f9081335cd"
msgid ""
"\"But are the lives of those who guard the peace of Jamandi less important "
"than the life of a Swordlord? You made a terrible mistake, my child.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 자만디 가문의 평화를 지켜주던 이들의 생명이 한 명의 소드로드의 생명이 덜 중요하다는 것입니까? 끔찍한 실수를 저질렀습니다, "
"발레리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "7b104472-20fb-4032-a7d9-41130799fb26"
msgid ""
"\"Really? Well we can hardly judge Valerie's actions if they only happened "
"in the imaginations of slanderers...\""
msgstr "\"정말입니까? 그게 비방자의 상상 속에서만 벌어진 일이라면 발레리의 행동을 심판할 수 없겠군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0126_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "06f71b98-7ca8-4ce5-8360-3417e430871a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie stands, as if turned to stone, her fingers clenching the hem of "
"her sleeve. She avoids your eyes as if she's ashamed of you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 일어서서, 돌처럼 굳은 모습으로 허벅지를 꽉쥡니다. 그녀는 당신이 부끄러운 듯 당신의 시선을 피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0133_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "870dcd8a-677f-4e71-a8a3-99ccd1ef3678"
msgid ""
"{n}Laryen's voice sounds soothing.{/n} \"I understand, my child. You are not "
"to blame. Let us leave this sad subject.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라르옌의 목소리가 평온해집니다.{/n} \"이해합니다. 발레리. 당신의 잘못이 아닙니다. 이제 이 슬픈 주제는 넘어가도록 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0134_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "49eab897-b977-45e9-9d5f-4441f4e2053f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's face is lit by a faint smile.{/n} \"Truly. I forgot what "
"hypocrites {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} servants are! You only care about one "
"freedom of will – the one that serves your own interests!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Valerie's face is lit by a faint smile.{/n} \"Truly. I forgot what "
"hypocrites {g|Shelyn}셸린's{/g} servants are! You only care about one freedom "
"of will – the one that serves your own interests!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0135_Text
msgctxt "2831541c-cfb3-4127-b2f9-99820917d9f0"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest raises his arms apologetically.{/n} \"We are just clarifying "
"some nuances, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. Although I can't but notice "
"your readiness to take part of the blame. Truly, Valerie has chosen a worthy "
"ruler to serve...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 사죄의 뜻으로 손을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"우린 몇몇 뉘앙스를 분명히하려 했을 뿐입니다, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. "
"비난의 화살을 기꺼이 몸소 받으시려는 뜻은 잘 알겠습니다. 발레리가 실로 섬길 가치가 있는 통치자를 선택한 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0138_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "157cf13c-4c3e-4bfb-a792-fc4f38b62cde"
msgid ""
"\"ENOUGH!\" {n}Valerie's voice rings under the temple's vaulting. The stones "
"themselves seem to tremble.{/n} \"I'm tired of this useless babbling! You "
"stand here and discuss me as if I'm one of your stupid pictures or stone "
"idols! Judging, accusing, speaking for me, as if... AS IF I DON'T EXIST! You "
"can all go to the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g} with your {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만!\" {n}발레리의 목소리가 신전 전체에 울려퍼집니다. 신전의 조각들이 떨리는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"이 쓸모없는 수다에는 "
"질렸어! 내가 여기 서있는데도 당신들은 내가 마치 멍청한 그림이나 석상인 것 마냥 나에 대해 논의하고 있어! 심판하고, 고발하고, 나에 "
"대해 말하고, 마치 내가 아예 존재하지 않는 것처럼 말이야! 당신들의 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}과 함꼐 {g|Abyss}어비스{/g}"
"로 꺼져버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0139_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "5dbd0b4a-795e-421c-b235-1f5ad519f0b6"
msgid "\"Insulting the goddess in her own temple! Death to Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"여신의 신전에서 여신을 모욕하다니! 발레리에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0141_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "ba38fc09-b449-44f8-ad96-c1727a30afe9"
msgid "\"So much smugness in her words! So much pride!\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 언행에 뻔뻔함이 가득하구나! 오만함이 가득해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0142_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "ebffac0d-47f2-4090-9a25-a80cdd1d843f"
msgid ""
"\"I am sure Valerie's heart is filled with good. After all, her delightful "
"appearance is but a reflection of a perfect soul, hidden away from prying "
"eyes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리의 마음에 선함이 가득한 것은 확실합니다. 결국, 그녀의 아름다운 겉모습은 -곁눈질로부터 숨겨진- 완벽한 영혼을 반영한 것일 "
"뿐이니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0144_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "6eb05343-44dd-4434-8c93-013155d28a04"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. We are judging Valerie only by "
"her actions.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. 우린 발레리의 행동으로만 판단할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0147_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "405eb0d8-31ad-4cd7-81d4-8176fe4c3366"
msgid ""
"\"W-What? I'm s-sorry, I'm confused... I have no complaints about Valerie. "
"None! Whatsoever! I have to go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐-뭐라고요? 죄-죄송합니다, 뭔가 착오가 있었던 것 같구요... 전 발레리 양에게 전혀 불만이 없습니다. 전혀요! 지금 당장 볼일이 "
"있어 가봐야겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0148_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "6b846a4f-b51c-4b47-9445-560772ff29a5"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! You can't scare me with your idle threats! All you've achieved, {mf|"
"Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, is confirming the rumors "
"that are multiplying around your lands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 그런 저열한 협박으로 절 겁줄 수는 없습니다! 당신이 방금 한 짓은{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 당신의 땅에서 널리 퍼지고 "
"있는 소문을 확인해 줄 뿐입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0150_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "05f38114-58e6-405b-a6cb-ac425091f57f"
msgid ""
"\"But... the trial isn't over yet! You can't insult {g|Shelyn}Shelyn's{/g} "
"divine court!\""
msgstr "\"하지만.... 재판은 아직 끝나지 않았습니다! {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 신성한 법정을 모욕해서는 안됩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0151_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "11ecd131-56ec-4ba4-bcaa-0bd9c556fa1a"
msgid ""
"\"Enough... servants of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} — come! We shall we shall wash "
"away the insults of these scoundrels with their blood!\""
msgstr "\"그만.. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 종복이여 - 나를 따르라! 이 악당들이 준 모욕을 그들의 피로 닦아내야한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0152_Text
#. Speaker : EveldSilverTongued
msgctxt "9f38cc04-c67f-4e9d-8726-cbc46cda553a"
msgid ""
"\"No, I... well, possibly – just possibly – I might have drawn some "
"inspiration from certain a poetic punishment... ahem...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 안돼, 전... 음, 할 수만 있다면 - 그냥 바램이지만 - 시적 정의에서 영감을 좀 얻었으면 했는데.. 에헴... .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0153_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "454a8a08-a950-494f-bb82-547b971b5af0"
msgid "\"Then I cannot accept your statement. Leave this temple.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 당신의 주장을 받아드릴 수 없습니다. 이 신전을 떠나십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0163_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c9615782-7f81-4735-815f-24c6e82f5100"
msgid "{n}Valerie speaks under her breath.{/n} \"Please, leave this to me.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리가 낮게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"부탁입니다, 내게 맡겨주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0166_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "97216686-7347-4d05-a3a3-d872436c28e7"
msgid ""
"\"And nevertheless, this didn't prevent Valerie from doing the noble thing. "
"That's exactly how her father... and Fredero brought her up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼에도 불구하고, 그 일들이 발레리가 고귀한 일을 하는 걸 가로막지는 못했습니다. 그 정신이야 말로 그녀의 아버지와 프레데로가 "
"그녀에게 가르쳐 준 것이지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0167_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "76a4bf8b-69cd-4afc-9af9-4caa300a8ee5"
msgid ""
"\"Please, don't get your blood up. There is truth in your words, I admit it."
"\""
msgstr "\"부탁입니다, 너무 분노하지 마십시오. 당신의 말 속에는 진실이 있습니다. 인정하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0170_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4234ceec-aae9-40d5-a661-7ba276ea5514"
msgid ""
"\"Please, {name}! I would never follow a dishonorable order. – Which means I "
"alone can answer for my actions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제발, {name}! 그게 불명예스러운 명령이었다면 난 따르지 않았을겁니다 - 내 행동은 오직 나 자신의 책임이란 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0172_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "234fa7ed-2ed2-41b4-b3c9-d0da1044c10f"
msgid "{n}Valerie doesn't show she heard you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신의 말을 못들은 척합니다..{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0175_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "88d3a2ea-3c7c-4b81-9ae8-c57459f152ec"
msgid "\"Ahem... fair... Well then, let's set this matter aside.\""
msgstr "\"에헴.. 좋습니다. 그렇다면, 이 문제는 넘어가도록 합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0176_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e3a0b829-8422-44bf-a545-abc6b442cd4e"
msgid "{n}Valerie grinds her teeth ever so softly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 조용히 이를 갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0177_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "18ab112e-2fc8-4440-aa15-d2dd47ffdfd7"
msgid "\"Maybe you can give me a chance to speak for myself?!\""
msgstr "\"내게 스스로 말할 수 있는 기회를 주지 않겠어요?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0179_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "b0203c51-dbc7-440e-930a-1e751e1c7d40"
msgid ""
"\"Really? Well we can hardly judge Valerie's actions if they only happened "
"in the imaginations of slanderers...\""
msgstr "\"정말입니까? 그게 비방자의 상상 속에서만 벌어진 일이라면 발레리의 행동을 심판할 수 없겠군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0180_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPriest
msgctxt "f232d02f-3c06-4360-bc9c-c52f1a91c505"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Eveld. I am not surprised by this news – Valerie would never "
"stoop to behaving like a shrill stallkeeper...\""
msgstr "\"고맙소, 이벨드. 당신의 얘기에 전혀 놀라지 않았소 – 발레리는 목소리만 큰 상점주인마냥 행동했겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0181_Text
#. Speaker : MainPrismPaladin
msgctxt "29925687-9b73-4602-906e-6f3a0211c511"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Eveld! I hope this statement about Valerie's unconscionable act "
"will not be igno...\""
msgstr "\"감사하오, 이벨드! 발레리의 양심없는 행동에 대한 당신의 증언이 무시되지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0182_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6e6a7ded-e88d-4170-979c-2cd53c79bcb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie watches the bard with an amazed look, and then turns to you.{/n} "
"\"What did you do? Why?!\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 놀라서 음유시인을 쳐다봅니다, 그리고 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"무슨 짓을 한겁니까? 왜그랬어요?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0185_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0c5807a3-21aa-4d06-b88e-72fcba1e651d"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! You gave them heat, friend! Serves them right!\""
msgstr "\\하 하 하! 그들을 열받게 했구만, 친구! 그래도 싼 작자들이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0186_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bc17c3e8-ddd7-4e8e-9e67-0d542b0c2407"
msgid "\"Even I couldn't have put it better.\""
msgstr "\"내가 말해도 그것보단 더 낫겠는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0189_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "70f0c6b7-fff1-480b-b678-64d826649794"
msgid ""
"\"It's the undeniable truth, you know! And as a victim of her attacks, I "
"want to say that... Oh, I'm sorry. Go on, Sir Hegend.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신도 알다시피 피할 수 없는 진실이오! 그녀의 공격에 대한 희생자로서, 내가 말하고 싶은건... 오, 미안합니다. 계속하세요, "
"헤겐드 경.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0192_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3e7a8380-5a93-48e3-8fc6-b617d9b5e956"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi turns to you, her face concerned.{/n} \"I know you're worried about "
"Valerie... but honestly, this accusation is completely fair! Don't you think?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 당신을 걱정스런 표정으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"당신이 발레리를 걱정하는 건 잘 알지만... 솔직히 말해서, 이 고발은 "
"완전히 공정해요! 그렇게 생각하지 않나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0195_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "c6624abd-b126-4926-900c-ec18c839caa5"
msgid "\"Oh. She used to apologize to me too. How could I forget?\""
msgstr "\"오, 내게도 그렇게 사과하곤 했지. 그걸 어떻게 잊을 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0196_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "478137c7-9c12-49ed-b3ea-6b5f15e3c9f1"
msgid ""
"\"Apologies? From Valerie? This is the first I've ever heard of such an "
"incredible miracle!\""
msgstr "\"사과라고? 발레리가? 그런 대단한 기적은 처음 들어보는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0199_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3bc19913-6f99-449c-abf2-e6777e908f6f"
msgid "\"Oh. He really vanished! Hooray!\""
msgstr "\"오, 진짜 사라졌잖아! 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0199_Text_1
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7f460fce-b5d5-4087-be75-3d577672272e"
msgid "\"Oh. When? I didn't even notice!\""
msgstr "\"오, 언제? 전혀 몰랐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Cue_0200_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "d8367b64-8d23-479f-a900-a6772fa6d5cf"
msgid "\"Witchery!\""
msgstr "\"요술이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_ChaoticReinforcedValerie_String
msgctxt "5c8d6aab-c1ae-4fad-8960-a6e0b054536d"
msgid ""
"\"Are you seriously going to judge whether Valerie is favored by Shelyn, "
"based on her saving some guards from a fire?! Why? Would followers of other "
"gods turn away from dying innocents?! Valerie's behavior was common decency, "
"not a sign of special respect for Shelyn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"진심으로 그저 몇몇 경비원을 불에서 구했다는 걸로 발레리가 셸린에게 선의를 얻었는지 판단할 생각이오? 도대체 왜? 다른 신들의 "
"추종자들은 죽어가는 무고한 자를 내버려두기라도 한답니까? 발레리의 행동은 평범한 체면치례지, 셸린이 주는 특별한 가호의 징조가 아니란 "
"말이오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_LieAboutFire_String
msgctxt "92ccb6cd-5144-47ea-b621-17cacc7d318e"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"What are you talking about? I don't remember any fire at Jamandi "
"Aldori's house...\""
msgstr "[Lie] \"무슨 말을 하는겁니까? 자만디 알도리의 집에서 불이라니, 전혀 기억나지 않습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_SharedGuilt_String
msgctxt "6e07eb9c-2891-4c82-8b4e-709e196e1f9b"
msgid ""
"\"I share with Valerie the blame for their deaths. Judge us both if you wish."
"\""
msgstr "\"그들의 죽음에 대한 비난은 내가 함께 나눠 받아야 할 것입니다. 원한다면 우리 둘 모두를 심판하시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_StaySilent_String
msgctxt "e8004cff-3cb4-486c-a8cb-468fc4315934"
msgid "[Keep quiet]"
msgstr "[조용히 있는다.]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_ValerieAngryAgain_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1ba05b18-2bff-4ff0-8e4d-c85b8ffe15a2"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie spins her head around.{/n} \"Please stop! I am capable forming my "
"own reply to these attacks!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 고개를 돌려 당신을 향해 말합니다.{/n} \"부탁이니 그만하세요! 이 주장에 대해선 나도 내 스스로 답변할 수 있단 "
"말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_ValeryAngry_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1ccaabb6-c96b-49f6-a837-abc185ceb1ea"
msgid ""
"\"Don't meddle, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. Even "
"your powerful patronage won't help Valerie. Save your words for worthier "
"persons than her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"끼어들지 말아주시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 당신의 강력한 후원도 발레리를 구할 수 없소. 그녀보다 더 가치있는 사람을 "
"위해 말을 아껴두시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/PersonalQuests/Valerie/03_JudgementOfTheGods/Judgement/Shared_Valery_AngryLie_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "651af95d-8d93-4105-8cd5-8b3d1d3af1dc"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns bright red with anger.{/n} \"That's a lie! There was a "
"fire! And I made the decision I made, and you're free to judge me however "
"you want!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 얼굴은 분노로 붉게 타오릅니다.{/n} \"그건 거짓말입니다! 화재는 있었습니다! 난 그때 스스로 결정을 내렸고, 그점에 "
"대해선 여러분 마음대로 판단해도 좋습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_1_String
msgctxt "9d84a78c-06be-4087-96d0-d1b695dcfe33"
msgid "\"Want to do it again?\""
msgstr "\"한번 더 할까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_2_String
msgctxt "3580f251-f96a-4f23-b49d-d4381287cc0b"
msgid "\"Mmm... Enough traveling and fighting, let's stay here forever!\""
msgstr "\"음음... 여행과 싸움은 질렸어요, 여기서 평생 살도록 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_3_String
msgctxt "a6d65377-68cb-4810-9bb0-855e750b091e"
msgid "\"I love you. I do!\""
msgstr "\"당신을 사랑해요. 정말로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_4_String
msgctxt "60393b3a-7084-4d35-9cf5-7d9ea3ae9fae"
msgid "\"Tee-hee-hee! Come here, let me kiss you!\""
msgstr "\"티-히-히! 이리와요, 키스해줄께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_5_String
msgctxt "d9592800-4455-4084-8a1f-fd5a4bc54f0e"
msgid "\"After what we've been up to, no adventure could surprise me!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 겪어왔던 걸 생각해보면, 어떤 모험도 날 놀라게 하지 못할꺼에요.!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_6_String
msgctxt "dea7b646-e1df-4fa1-b092-48e898e63b66"
msgid ""
"\"You have such a sweet birth mark just here... It's a pity you can't see it!"
"\""
msgstr "\"여기에 귀여운 출생점이 있었네요... 당신 스스로는 못보는게 안타깝네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/After_sex_7_String
msgctxt "41efe402-635a-4dfb-b664-47be797b0c09"
msgid "\"Did it hurt when I bit you?\""
msgstr "\\내가 물었을 때 아팠나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/Aftersex_idle_1_String
msgctxt "de035870-d6cf-42c7-aabb-726a986b0ace"
msgid "\"Go, I'm right behind you. I just need to fix my hair.\""
msgstr "\"먼저 가. 바로 따라 나가겠어. 머리만 좀 고치고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/Aftersex_idle_2_String
msgctxt "7b2f604e-6368-4131-9d28-da43dfce5bf7"
msgid "\"I'll have to mend my shirt again... You're so passionate!\""
msgstr "\"내 셔츠를 다시 기워야겠군요... 당신은 너무 열정적입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Barks/Aftersex_idle_3_String
msgctxt "3333011f-640c-44c1-a3b2-9c06c3dab15e"
msgid "\"Right, and where is my other stocking? Under the bed?\""
msgstr "\"그래요, 음, 내 스타킹 한쪽은 어딨죠? 침대 아래 뒀나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f4f0ccfb-c394-427c-8f79-79fa1e7c38f4"
msgid "\"Octavia, what do you think you're doing?!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 무슨 짓을 하는 겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "e83a962d-c500-4382-b4cb-59dd80afdd3b"
msgid ""
"[Pull away] \"Octavia, don't. I value our friendship. Let's not ruin it.\""
msgstr "[밀어낸다] \"옥타비아, 그만하십시오. 난 우리 우정을 소중히 여깁니다. 그걸 망치지는 맙시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "9475be9c-30c9-4ce0-ae76-9c9aa3d6043f"
msgid "[Hold Octavia in return, putting your hand on her breast]"
msgstr "[보답으로그녀를 붙잡고 가슴을 움켜쥡니다.]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "7da843d3-d8c1-40f5-a2b2-87ed768527b2"
msgid "\"I would prefer to spend the night alone with Octavia.\""
msgstr "\"난 옥타비아와 혼자서 밤을 지내고 싶군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0019_Text_String
msgctxt "40040b77-129d-420b-a437-aa01985ab10e"
msgid "\"Of course! It's more fun when there are three of us!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지요! 세명이서 한다면 더 즐거울겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "0cb44698-49d5-405e-8b7e-ac460b602b91"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? Let's not do this. I value our friendship and don't want to "
"ruin it.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄. 우리 이러지 맙시다. 난 우리 우정을 소중히 여깁니다. 그걸 망치지는 맙시다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "2ba41fbc-d10b-4de6-9bb0-be0d60420bb4"
msgid "[Leave with Octavia]"
msgstr "[옥타비아와 떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0028_Text_String
msgctxt "90cddca9-5f87-4246-bc2c-f34ebe3ef1b3"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? Let's not do this. I value our friendship and don't want to "
"ruin it.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄. 우리 이러지 맙시다. 난 우리 우정을 소중히 여깁니다. 그걸 망치지는 맙시다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "bde02e13-b7bb-41ff-8f99-1b7cd979d75c"
msgid "\"Octavia, what are you... People are looking...\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 이 무슨.. 사람들이 보고 있지 않습니까..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "fc41691d-4c38-4616-ba96-6b0d0353969f"
msgid ""
"{n}Returning from a campaign, you, Octavia, and Regongar enter the tavern to "
"relax.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}최근의 모험에서 돌아와, 당신과, 옥타비아, 그리고 레곤가르는 쉬기 위해 선술집에 들어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b86e66cb-f539-4a8b-b108-254e6989dbde"
msgid ""
"\"...And that idiot hid the lockpicks in the most clever way he could think "
"of: on a wall, under some barbed wire charmed with a lightning spell! So "
"I've wrapped my pants around my hand to avoid getting fried — I had nothing "
"else! I climb up on the barrel and start groping along the top of the wall, "
"praying to {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} that the guards don't show up. Imagine "
"how that would look — pants off, perched up on a barrel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"...그 멍청이는 그 놈이 제일 기발하다고 생각한 자리에 락픽을 숨겼지: 번개 주문이 걸려있는 철조망 넘어 벽 위에다 말이야! 어쩔 "
"수 없이 튀겨지지 않으려고 내 바지를 손에 감쌌지 - 그것밖에 없었거든! 난 통 위로 올라가 벽 위를 뒤지면서, "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}에게 제발 경비병에 나타나지 않게 해달라고 빌었어. 어떻게 보일지 상상해봐 - 바지를 벗고 통 "
"위에서 재주를 부리는 꼴이라니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e3fd75f1-d43d-477e-bdca-e0efe2530f61"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs joyously.{/n} \"Oh, Reg... It's so funny when you tell it. "
"But we almost got killed that time!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 신나게 웃습니다.{/n} \"오, 레그 네가 그 얘기를 할 때마다 어찌나 웃긴지. 하지만 그 때 우리 거의 죽을 뻔했잖아!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "950dcb36-693b-4c12-a896-ad4896256233"
msgid ""
"\"But we didn't! We survived. We got out of there — so why not laugh now, "
"huh?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 안그랬지! 우린 살아남아 여기 있잖아. - 지금 와서 웃지 말아야 할 이유가 뭐있겠어, 허?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b24d7675-9be9-44c3-9e0b-46a3e0ec41d3"
msgid ""
"\"Hahaha, exactly! You're so sweet! You are... both sweet!\" {n}Octavia hugs "
"both of you. You feel her hand slowly crawling from your shoulder down to "
"your chest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하하하, 맞아! 넌 정말 사랑스러워! 너희.. 둘다 모두!\" {n}옥타비아는 당신들 둘 다 안아줍니다. 당신은 그녀의 손이 천천히 "
"당신의 어깨에서 가슴까지 쓸어내려 가는 것을 느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "081f998f-757e-402b-973e-820b89383543"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha hmmm! It's getting hot in here! I think you'd better get a room...\""
msgstr "\"하 하 흠! 점점 뜨거워지는구만! 우리 방을 잡는게 좋겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d160f5c1-cae9-4240-9af6-b93d9d1da318"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf pulls her hand away.{/n} \"What? I'm not doing anything! So, "
"Reg, what happened next?\""
msgstr "{n}하프 엘프는 손을 치웁니다.{/n} \"뭐라고요? 난 아무짓도 안했는데요! 그래서, 레그, 다음에 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b2b9deb9-1a2e-45c7-a8db-58128bfe33fa"
msgid "\"What about you, Reg? Let's all go together!\""
msgstr "\"너는 뭐할꺼야? 레그? 다 같이 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "50da914c-f144-4739-8fad-2bf1d9992bf5"
msgid "\"Why not! {Name}, what do you say?\""
msgstr "\"좋아! {Name}, 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3432b1f9-8754-4c23-a722-50d5400811a0"
msgid ""
"\"No, no, you birdies have fun without me! I have a date with a barrel of "
"beer today, and it's just getting started!\""
msgstr "\"아니, 아니, 너희 두명은 나없이 즐기라고! 난 오늘 맥주통과 데이트를 즐기고 있어서 말이야, 이제 막 시작했다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "83cfee03-6abb-4a27-b388-8da2c5eac2b1"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia frowns in disappointment, but then quickly smiles at you.{/n} \"Ok"
", whatever you like! So, Reg, tell the rest!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 실망에 차서 얼굴을 찌푸립니다, 하지만 곧 당신에게 미소를 보입니다.{/n} \"좋아요, 좋을 대로 하세요! 그래서, "
"레그, 나머지도 다 말해봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "19a5b300-956f-4255-a83b-5981f95352d2"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc sips from the mug.{/n} \"So, where was I? Ah, right! I'm "
"standing on the barrel, pants off, groping along the wall, searching for "
"that freaking lockpick. And then I realize the barrel is rotten, and it's "
"cracking right under my feet...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크는 한모금 마십니다.{/n} \"그래, 어디까지 했더라? 아, 맞아! 난 통 위에 서서, 바지를 벗고, 그 망할 락픽을 "
"찾느라 벽 위를 뒤지고 있었지. 그 다음에 난 통이 썩었다는 걸 깨달았어-내 발밑부터 쪼개지기 시작했거든...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0023_Text_String
msgctxt "4adbed3b-13e5-4ca9-9657-ddc5aa2575e5"
msgid ""
"{n}You spend the rest of the evening drinking beer and telling stories.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 남은 밤을 맥주를 마시고 이야기를 하면서 보냈습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0bf3256c-81b9-4d39-bce0-499c83337692"
msgid "\"Haha! Have fun!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 즐기시라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e539176a-a7e5-4171-b132-76d597f90787"
msgid "\"Ha ha hmm... That's true! Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"하 하 흠... 맞는 말입니다! 갑시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f2d24448-12cc-4ad8-9685-89f4bc20ec98"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish...\" {n}Octavia hugs you and pulls you towards the door softly "
"but insistently.{/n}"
msgstr "\"네가 원한다면...\" {n}옥타비아는 당신을 껴앉고 문쪽으로 당신을 부드럽게, 하지만 고집스레 밉니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_1/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ed4b3623-82c3-46c6-b799-9611f2db1c29"
msgid ""
"\"So? Let them watch!\" {n}Octavia moves closer to you, and her hand slides "
"down onto your thigh.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그래서요? 보라고 하죠 뭐.\" {n}옥타비아는 당신에게 다가가더니, 손으로 당신의 허벅지를 쓸고 내려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "31613493-b0fe-49e0-828b-da0d2c5ad946"
msgid "\"Who are you and what have you done to Octavia?!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 누굽니까 그리고 옥타비아에게 무슨 짓을 한거요?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "cdd5eb94-e0c5-4df5-9043-02f57433e7f6"
msgid "\"Do you really want this? But why? Aren't we happy as we are?\""
msgstr "\"그걸 정말 원하는 겁니까? 하지만 왜? 이대로도 행복하지 않은가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d74ef71f-b556-4309-be07-754617afb998"
msgid "\"I never expected to hear this from you!\""
msgstr "\"당신에게 그런 말을 들을 줄은 몰랐는데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "1ee3d970-c10d-4560-a3a4-8e0257223f9c"
msgid ""
"\"Our kingdom and our very lives are hanging by a thread. Let's put the "
"wedding off until after the victory... My queen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 왕국과 우리 자신의 생명이 실낱같은 희망에 달려 있습니다. 결혼식은 승리 이후로 미루기로 합시다.. 나의 여왕님이시여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "64d51d20-903e-4f11-8fc7-07bdbf0433e3"
msgid ""
"\"I love you, but I don't want a wedding. There's no ritual that can make us "
"closer than we already are.\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신을 사랑해요, 하지만 결혼식은 원하지 않아요. 어떤 의식도 지금 우리를 보다 가깝게 만들 순 없을테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "10e643f3-08f8-45e7-b8cf-f071c7e69659"
msgid ""
"\"{Name}, I wanted to say something... Just don't be surprised. This might "
"sound strange, especially coming from me, but... but...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{Name}, 말하고 싶은 게 있어요.. 놀라지만 말아요. 이상하게 들릴진 모르겠지만, 특히 나같은 사람에게는 말이에요, 하지만... "
"하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "becdefcd-1fea-4be7-94ae-6cd20799894f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks away, bites her lip and finally blurts out,{/n} \"Let's get "
"married!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 고개를 돌리더니, 입술을 깨뭅니다. 그리고 마침내 말문을 터트립니다.{/n} \"우리 결혼하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "15b8b67d-13b4-402f-ab55-7c5ff7325489"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs happily.{/n} \"Funny, isn't it? I never thought I'd say "
"those words! But... You see...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 행복하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"웃기죠? 내가 이 단어를 꺼낼 줄은 생각도 못했는데! 핮지만... 보다시피...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f9636e52-b6e3-45a8-8879-9376d4b19084"
msgid ""
"\"We are. Gods, I've never been so happy as when I'm with you. But it's not "
"about that.\""
msgstr "\"행복해요. 신이시여, 당신과 함께 있을 때가 가장 행복해요. 하지만 그것 때문에 얘기한 건 아니에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "6e05c7bd-0de2-46af-8069-5ee52effeb58"
msgid ""
"\"All this time I've been so stupid! After all those years as a slave, I was "
"so afraid of losing my freedom again, that I saw a threat where there wasn't "
"one. You broke me free of my chains — but I was afraid you could put them "
"back on me again!'"
msgstr ""
"\"지금까지 난 참 바보처럼 굴었어요! 노예 생활을 오래하다보니, 다시 자유를 잃을까봐 항상 겁에 질려있었지요, 아무도 내 자유를 "
"위협하지 않는데 말이죠. 당신은 날 사슬에서 자유롭게 해줬어요 - 하지만 난 당신이 날 다시 옭아맬까봐 두려웠답니다!'"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "dfb92a99-f1b1-4be6-980b-e47b720c7914"
msgid ""
"\"I realize now I should not have been afraid like this. I pushed you away "
"because I was afraid that you'd hurt me. I should have been afraid that you "
"couldn't stand it and leave. And that's the scariest thing in the world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 난 더이상 두려워해선 안된다는 걸 깨달았어요. 당신이 나에게 상처를 줄까봐 항상 당신을 밀어냈지요. 그리고는 당신이 참지못하고 "
"떠나버릴까 두려웠답니다. 그건 제게 가장 끔찍한 일이었거든요.!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e09c2eea-1fc2-4179-9531-71e980dc5847"
msgid ""
"\"That's why... I want to give my freedom to you. I know it will be safe in "
"your hands.\""
msgstr "\"그게 내가.. 내가 내 자유를 당신에게 주려고 하는 이유에요. 당신 품안에서 내가 자유로울 걸 알고있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "188f5cc5-2418-4501-b5fd-afdcf10910c0"
msgid "\"And I never expected to say it! But... You see...\""
msgstr "\"이런 얘기를 할거라곤 나도 몰랐어요! 하지만... 당신도 알다시피...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "98d5abc1-be19-44ab-9468-c63ade5d83d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia kisses your lips.{/n} \"Forget about the title. It's yours... "
"Just yours.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신의 입술에 키스합니다.{/n} \"작위는 잊어버려요. 나의.. 나의 옥타비아라고 불러주면 충분해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "31a4a1d3-0649-4d2e-a641-465a57835fef"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia kisses your lips.{/n} \"You're right. What's important is you are "
"mine... And I'm yours.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신의 입술에 키스합니다. {/n} \"당신이 맞아요. 당신은 나의 연인이고, 난 당신의 연인이죠. 그거면 됐어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "cfbe3dc6-3c3c-4d36-92ee-b348f8b4adf7"
msgid "\"Right now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 당장?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "502ed7ff-4e73-422b-82e2-91aa50307a24"
msgid "\"Then let's not waste time!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 시간 낭비하지 맙시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "52d5b4a3-b14a-4480-bded-e50582f62805"
msgid "\"Wait a bit. I have an urgent matter to attend to.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만 기다려주십시오. 급히 처리해야 할 일이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3c5bc217-59ca-46e1-b950-3233d819cfc0"
msgid ""
"{n}By the Capital, Octavia approaches, holds you close and whispers,{/n} \"I "
"want you.\""
msgstr "{n}수도에 이르자, 옥타비아는 당신에게 다가와 손을 잡고선 속삭입니다,{/n} \"난 당신을 원해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "878027d3-e99d-4f92-a010-20ddb5942f99"
msgid "\"Now, and tomorrow, and always... But especially now!\""
msgstr "\"지금 당장이요, 그리고 내일도, 언제라도. 그치만 특히 지금 더 원해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "c4395a3c-f5ca-4154-9cca-18957d47b006"
msgid "{n}She grabs your hand, and almost runs with you to the castle.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그녀는 당신의 손을 잡더니, 당신과 함께 거의 뛰어가다시피 성으로 갑니다. .{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "82ea31d9-3dc0-4cfa-b722-b418779f6b74"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, Your Highness... Since when is love not a matter of national "
"importance?\""
msgstr "\"하, 각하... 언제부터 사랑이 국가적 중대사에서 빠지게 된건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0693472d-8a27-47d2-8f03-738aac2331c8"
msgid ""
"\"Don't relax just yet. We still have much to do. We'll just rest a bit and "
"get back on the road.\""
msgstr "\"벌써부터 긴장 풀지는 마. 아직 해야할 일이 많이 남아있어. 조금만 쉬었다 다시 출발해야해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "108af6c7-abcb-40c2-be51-8ba341ca1bb6"
msgid "\"Get some rest, you deserve it!\""
msgstr "\"좀 쉬어, 넌 그럴 자격이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "4420bc0b-551e-4e7c-af4c-9ab57157c547"
msgid "\"To be honest, the food here is not very good...\""
msgstr "\"솔직히 말하면, 여기 음식은 별로야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "2d0205e4-7d7e-4afc-a5ec-9e5c93e49d8e"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly! I would have never found the Technic League's encampment, if your "
"beauty hadn't beaconed me!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 네 아름다움이 나에게 손짓하지 않았다면, 기술 연맹 야영지를 찾지 못했겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "5c1b57d6-18e5-44a7-99fd-616205ff3e24"
msgid "\"What are you asking? We're friends!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리야? 우리는 친구잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d07d5eb6-f037-4284-a341-121dd2c29116"
msgid ""
"\"You're out of line. I took you into my party to fight, not to flirt!\""
msgstr "\"그건 좀 지나친데. 내 일행에 당신을 받아준건 싸우기 위해서지, 치근덕거리라고 받아준 게 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "efe64f01-7915-4d44-9a12-3b6f4612c492"
msgid ""
"\"I'm taking care of you because you're in my party now. We'll have to save "
"each other in battle more than once.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너에게 신경써주는건 네가 지금 내 일행이기 때문이야. 앞으로 전투에서 서로 구해줘야 할테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8efd701b-d3cd-4da1-8aa3-9ed2a9edc64d"
msgid ""
"{n}With a delighted smile, Octavia inhales the smell coming from the Oleg's "
"Trading Post.{/n} \"Fresh bread! I can't believe it... All this time that we "
"sat in cages and crawled in the mud, there were places in the world where "
"they were baking fresh bread!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}기쁜 미소를 지으며, 옥타비아는 올렉의 교역소에서 풍기는 냄새를 들이마십니다. {/n} \"갓구운 빵 냄새에요! 믿을 수가 "
"없어요... 내내 감옥에 갇혀 진흙에 기어다니고 있었는데, 세상에 신선한 빵을 굽는 장소도 있었다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0847811d-c855-4f93-80ae-2a7d8c526255"
msgid ""
"\"And here we are! I bet they have clean sheets! And maybe we can even take "
"a bath? Ha ha ha, a girl can dream!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 우리가 그곳에 왔네요! 아마 깨끗한 이불도 있겠죠! 어쩌면 목욕도 할 수 있을지도? 하 하 하, 꿈 정도는 꿔봐도 되지 "
"않겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "44f3b6fd-0cdd-4b15-acc0-1579ce16385d"
msgid ""
"\"I know, I know. But don't ruin it for me. The last time I slept in a "
"palace like this was a year ago, when Reg and I escaped from captivity. We "
"got all the way to {g|Hajot Hakados}Hajoth Hakados{/g}... That's where they "
"caught us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알아요. 안다구요. 하지만 분위기를 망치진 말아줘요. 레그와 내가 도망치고 나서, 이런 궁전 같은 곳에서 잠을 자본지가 일년만이란 "
"말이에요. 우린 {g|Hajot Hakados}하조쓰 하카도스{/g}까지 갔었는데... 거기서 잡히고 말았죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "fe990fc8-bea9-4da2-a376-72a23f6e2b79"
msgid "\"All right, enough talk! Fresh bread and clean sheets await!\""
msgstr "\"좋아요, 잡담은 그만하도록 해요! 갓구운 빵과 깨끗한 이불이 우릴 기다린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "37776770-3147-4713-96cb-e6fb1c8333d1"
msgid ""
"\"You can be sure of that! I've got years of rest to catch up on — and I'll "
"be stuffing my face until I turn into a ball!\""
msgstr "\"그점은 걱정말아요! 이때까지 못잔 잠을 몰아서 잘꺼에요 - 그리고 입이 빵빵해질 때까지 빵을 쑤셔넣을꺼니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ba492722-8f9a-420d-853d-58a1622153ec"
msgid ""
"\"It depends what you compare it to! After the swill they gave us at the {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League{/g}, a royal feast awaits us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"비교대상이 뭐냐에 따라 다르죠! {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에서 먹던 꿀꿀이죽에 비한다면야, 왕실 만찬이나 "
"다름없죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ed518b46-a93f-4748-ac3d-6501c3928c3d"
msgid ""
"\"You do so much for us! Is it all because you are kind? Or maybe...\" {n}"
"The half-elf smiles flirtatiously.{/n} \"Maybe it's because you've been "
"charmed by my beauty?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 우리에게 너무나 잘해줘요! 원래 친절한 성격이라서 그런가요? 아니면 혹시...\" {n}하프 엘프는 추파를 던지듯 "
"미소짓습니다.{/n} \"혹시 내 미모에 반해서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "c20a2c66-1ef3-45fe-a31c-909ada92a54b"
msgid "\"I'm joking, I'm joking! Hahaha, don't take it so seriously!\""
msgstr "\"농담이에요, 농담! 하하하, 심각하게 받아들이지 마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "744b4424-7282-4d18-aeb2-f22d697e572b"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs out loud. For a moment, something more than just "
"friendliness flashes across her eyes.{/n} \"Oh, you are so sweet!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 소란스럽게 웃습니다. 잠시 동안, 친근함 이상의 무언가가 그녀의 눈에 번뜩입니다.. {/n} \"오, 당신은 정말 "
"다정해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "4348d3c8-5a89-4b55-8271-417306d7f7d0"
msgid "{n}Octavia smiles warmly.{/n} \"Yes. Thank you.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 따뜻하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그래요. 고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "19528729-fc7a-49ec-b1ba-be11d00ca412"
msgid ""
"\"Forget about fighting for a moment! We all need a break, especially you!\""
msgstr "\"잠시 싸움은 잊어버려요! 우리 모두 휴식이 필요하다고요, 특히 당신은 더 그래요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f24d806a-2c82-454b-8edb-3f267cbd9e6d"
msgid "\"Are you out of your mind? I can't let you go now!\""
msgstr "\"정신이 나갔습니까? 지금 당신을 보낼 순 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "652fb794-1c0c-4ea1-823e-385e8c11d79d"
msgid "\"I'm sorry, that was too harsh.\""
msgstr "\"미안합니다, 지나쳤던것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "1b5d3aef-bb5d-43de-b284-0bf5f9086d79"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not talking about taking your freedom — but this stupid idea is going "
"to endanger the lives of the entire party.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 지금 당신의 자유에 대해 얘기하는게 아닙니다 - 일행 모두의 생명을 위험하게 할 어리석은 생각에 대해 얘기하는 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "de48f5c4-f0e4-4e25-98c0-8f68ff599b1a"
msgid "\"If you keep acting like this — maybe I will.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 계속 이런 식으로 행동한다면 - 그럴 수도 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "cc275496-a674-4b9a-bd67-c2298120230a"
msgid "\"Octavia, you're acting like a spoiled child.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 당신은 버릇없는 아이처럼 굴고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "655823b3-d75a-419c-a6d0-3b0b57bb0289"
msgid "\"Maybe you could explain what's going on first?\""
msgstr "\"먼저 무슨 일인지 설명해 주겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "13a2cdeb-e04d-4f73-9d24-b3ce3362d9d2"
msgid "\"You'll let down me and the entire party.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나와 일행 모두를 실망시킬겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "e9855b3c-2bd8-4187-aa06-402a92f4d245"
msgid "\"I understand. Will you need any supplies or gear?\""
msgstr "\"이해합니다. 가는데 필요한 보급품이나 장비가 있으면 알려주길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "5dffa0f0-2235-4315-aac8-829de80838f5"
msgid ""
"\"Alone? Sounds dangerous. Tell me what this is about, and I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"혼자서요? 위험할 것 같군요. 무슨 일인지 설명해 주십시오, 내가 도와주겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "3148df07-66f2-4ad4-b1ab-ac7227655d84"
msgid ""
"\"Have you thought this through? Alone, against the entire Technic League? "
"Sounds like joke — and not a funny one.\""
msgstr "\"확실히 생각해 본 것 맞습니까? 혼자서 기술 연맹 전부를 상대하겠다고요? 농담같이 들리는 군요, 재미도 없고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "ff2f5078-042f-46f2-b1cd-fe156e8aa3e5"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to do it alone. You have our whole team, plus all the "
"resources of my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}.\""
msgstr "\"혼자서 그 일을 할 필요는 없습니다. 당신에겐 우리 팀 모두와, 내 영지의 모든 자원이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "2435c818-123c-40d2-8906-34d884511b8e"
msgid "\"So this was a test?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이게 시험이었습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "9225e332-18d1-4bca-924c-97ba7e510983"
msgid "\"You know you can always rely on me.\""
msgstr "\"언제나 내게 의지해도 된다는 걸 잘 알지 않습니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "1bbae6ab-a6a0-40cf-9d21-88916fd89aaa"
msgid "\"You act like a spoiled child.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 버릇없는 아이처럼 굴었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "39eed1d1-c585-4fe7-b4a0-4a3036444173"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia approaches, her face serious with hints of gloom.{/n} \"Listen, "
"{Name}... I have to tell you something. The thing is... I'm leaving. For a "
"long time. Maybe for good.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 어두운 기색으로 심각한 표정을 지으며 다가옵니다 .{/n} \"들어봐요, {Name}... 말할께 있어요. 실은... 난 "
"떠날꺼에요. 오랫동안요. 어쩌면 영원히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "3c225413-3993-4f6c-ab12-c6e4904d6abe"
msgid "\"You won't let me, huh? Maybe you'll tie me down?\""
msgstr "\"허락하지 않겠다고요? 날 묶어라도 둘 생각인가 보죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "e94d4406-00a9-474a-9f0f-a78a6c48ab98"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing this, Octavia winces as if struck by a whip.{/n} \"You know, I "
"trusted you. Trusted that you're... Not like everyone else... Not like my "
"former masters. I guess I was wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이말을 듣자, 옥타비아는 채찍으로 맞은냥 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그거 알아요, 난 당신을 믿었었어요. 당신이 다른 "
"사람들과는.. 내 전 주인들과는 다르다고 믿었었어요. 내가 잘못 생각한 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "7eb61478-54c3-4dd1-9c63-d14c6610f689"
msgid "{n}Octavia stares at you angrily for a long time, then looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 한참동안 당신을 노려보더니, 고개를 돌려 버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "59db015c-0764-4c4a-8971-832f0d107b71"
msgid "\"Fine... It doesn't matter. Forget it. I'll stay... For now.\""
msgstr "\"좋아요... 상관없어요. 잊어버리라고요. 여기 머물테니까.. 지금은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "b9058646-73b7-46bf-bd11-b398f819eb0a"
msgid "\"You would be fine!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 괜찮을꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "ff8925fa-2bdf-4f30-805e-cd66dd4b3ce6"
msgid "\"Are you... Serious? Are you really ready to just let me go?\""
msgstr "\"정말.. 진심이에요? 그냥 날 놔줄 준비가 되었나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "fc63d3c0-a9ad-4f8e-8c2a-034ef4bd874d"
msgid ""
"\"I'm going to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} to destroy the {g|Technic League}"
"Technic League{/g}. You have no idea what monsters they are. They kill "
"people, enslave them, conduct horrible experiments... I have to stop them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에 가서 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}를 파괴할꺼에요. 당신은 그들이 어떤 "
"괴물들인지 잘 모르겠지요. 그들은 사람들을 죽이고 노예로 만들고 끔찍한 실험을 자행해요...난 그들을 멈춰야해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "74c7dc43-6ce8-478e-b132-d7766e01dbe4"
msgid "\"I know. I'm sorry. But it's something I have to do!\""
msgstr "\"알아요. 미안해요. 하지만 내가 꼭 해야하는 일이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "862a8220-da0a-4120-8d8a-5df8a03d2513"
msgid ""
"\"No... I can't put you in harm's way. Besides, there are many things here "
"that you must attend. Just wait for me, all right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요... 당신을 위험에 처하게 할 순 없어요. 게다가 당신이 신경써야 할 많은 일들이 있잖아요. 그저 날 기다려줘요, 알겠죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "f43f798b-ac89-4a0c-a938-8573327d26f2"
msgid ""
"\"I'll go there and start a riot! I'll put an end to those wretches once and "
"for all!\""
msgstr "\"거기가서 폭동을 일으킬꺼에요! 그 악당들에게 완전히 끝장내겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "7c96e464-4fe3-495b-952f-4b36ac8ebdbb"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia keeps looking into your eyes, then finally looks away.{/n} \"You"
"'re right. It's a stupid idea... I think I mixed up my dreams and reality "
"for a moment.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신의 눈을 바라보더니, 끝내 고개를 돌려버립니다.{/n} \"당신이 옳아요. 멍청한 생각이죠... 내가 잠시 현실과 "
"꿈을 착각했나봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "a3ef33b1-2452-422d-b2d1-4adceeb611f7"
msgid ""
"\"Are you... Serious? Are you really prepared to start a war with "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} for me?\""
msgstr "\"정말... 진심이에요? 날 위해 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}와 전쟁을 시작할 생각인가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "d595c1b5-ccfe-47bc-9e68-4df873ab997d"
msgid ""
"\"In the name of {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}... That's why I love you. How "
"could I have thought you'd have a different answer?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Calistria}칼리스트라아{/g}의 이름으로... 이게 내가 당신을 사랑하는 이유에요. 내가 어찌 당신이 다른 대답을 하리라 "
"생각했을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "11f03860-e8ff-4901-99a5-bc0e7a588d99"
msgid "\"Yes... Probably...\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다... 아마도..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "6b7dff9e-67c1-468c-a2a6-af3182462281"
msgid "\"Yes, I know. Thank you. And...\""
msgstr "\"그렇습니다. 감사합니다 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "851a6bc3-21d9-486a-a36f-2dfb9898a005"
msgid "\"A test? Well... Not exactly, but...\""
msgstr "\"시험이라고요? 음... 정확히 그런건 아니지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-ImGoing/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "cf4d94cc-0631-4e0b-919d-98bb19d83855"
msgid ""
"{n}The end of the sentence hangs in the air, as if Octavia wanted to "
"apologize, but couldn't find the words.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사과하고 싶지만 적당한 단어를 찾지 못한듯, 옥타비아의 말끝이 허공에 맴돕니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "3c872dc0-7e63-4fea-a6ce-c0bdb8d420ee"
msgid "\"What about Regongar?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르는 어떻게 할 생각입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0cd54ee3-9e89-4c0c-b62d-31467196b227"
msgid "\"Are you serious? Just abandon everyone and leave?\""
msgstr "\"진심입니까? 모두를 남겨두고 그냥 떠나겠다는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a6b9b548-8f13-4ca9-9ef2-2f480a74b0e3"
msgid ""
"\"That's a great idea! Let's just run — get as far from here as we can! — "
"Right now!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각입니다! 그냥 떠납시다— 가능한 멀리 말입니다! - 지금 당장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "6e85b736-5ea2-47f8-a17d-53e02698b59b"
msgid ""
"\"What a silly idea! I can't abandon my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} "
"and all my friends!\""
msgstr "\"정말 어리석은 생각입니다! 난 내 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}과 모든 친구들을 버려두고 갈 순 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8836e686-f49e-4df6-83ec-04c96aa45482"
msgid "\"You're joking, right?\""
msgstr "\"농담하는거지요, 맞지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3f4cceea-6df8-4df9-a795-c54f5443d97a"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia holds you tight. Her soft lips touch your ear, and she whispers "
"softly.{/n} \"Listen... Aren't you tired of all this? Expeditions, battles, "
"constant blood and dirt... And worse yet — ambassadors, advisors and giving "
"orders!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신을 꼭 껴안습니다. 그녀의 부드러운 입술이 당신의 귀를 건드리고, 그녀가 부드럽게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"들어봐요"
"... 이 모든게 지긋지긋하지 않나요? 원정, 전투, 계속되는 피범벅과 먼지투성이... - 그리고 더 끔찍한 건 - 대사들과 보좌관들에 "
"일일히 명령을 내리는 일까지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c3d843e8-2db5-4f27-85c1-c2063b203f50"
msgid ""
"\"Let's just run away. Abandon all this. They aren't children — they'll "
"figure it out without you! And we'll go... To {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} — I've "
"always wanted to see it! Or no, even farther! — Beyond the sea to "
"{g|Osirion}Osirion{/g} or {g|Katapesh}Katapesh{/g}! Just you and I!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 그냥 떠나요. 모든 일을 뒤로하고. 어린아이한테 맡기고 떠나는 것도 아니잖아요. 당신 없이도 잘 해내겠죠! 그리고 우린, "
"{g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}으로 가요. 항상 거길 가보고 싶었거든요! 아님 더 멀리 가요! 바다 건너 "
"{g|Osirion}오시리온{/g}이나 {g|Katapesh}카타페쉬{/g}까지! 당신과 나 둘이서만요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "2366cd49-6971-4f28-bc30-b06f3111c3b9"
msgid "\"We'll take him with us! We'll all run!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르도 같이 갈 거예요! 셋이서 같이 달아나요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "26c8582d-1326-4b90-b45d-c260ff7f1f39"
msgid ""
"\"Are you... Are you serious? Oh, {Name}, I love you so much!\" {n}Octavia "
"clings to you even tighter.{/n} \"I was just joking, of course... What would "
"they do without us? But you know what...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말.. 진심에에요? 오, {Name}, 당신을 정말 사랑해요!\" {n}옥타비아는 당신은 더 바짝 껴안습니다.{/n} \"물론 "
"농담이었어요.. 우리 없이 사람들이 뭘 할 수 있겠어요? 하지만 혹시나../\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d68133b6-d1f3-431a-8382-cd4db36969e0"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe later, when all this is over... Maybe we really will run away. Think "
"of it!\" {n}The half-elf kisses your ear and pulls away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아마도 나중에, 이 모든게 끝나면... 우린 진짜로 달아날지도 모르죠. 상상해봐요!\" {n}하프 엘프는 당신의 귀에 키스하고 물어 "
"당깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "296d4542-d2a4-4d5d-b9a2-773b86793bf5"
msgid "\"Well sure! Who can stop us?\""
msgstr "\"찬성입니다! 누가 우릴 막을 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9beaf847-a0e4-47bc-9bf5-6c485ebb546a"
msgid "\"Well, yes, duty calls... A girl can dream! But you know what...\""
msgstr "\"음, 그래요, 당신에겐 의무가 있지요...꿈이라도 꿔볼 수 있지 않겠어요! 하지만 혹시나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-LetsRunAway/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "91dae0fe-2095-4abd-80e1-39e4de5a7d16"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure. I guess I probably am. We can't let everyone down, can we? "
"But you know what...\""
msgstr "\"확실친 않지만, 그럴것 같네요. 모두를 실망시켜선 안되겠지요? 하지만 혹시나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8b663634-816e-478a-8bc8-d8409b59ff0f"
msgid "\"How about another go right now?\""
msgstr "\"당장 한번 더 하는건 어떤가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0003_Text_1
msgctxt "15ecf433-b769-46e6-90cc-7f7bd3016bd1"
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신을 사랑합니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c112b83e-55d0-4571-b08c-31b56e5088c7"
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신을 사랑합니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0005_Text_1
msgctxt "a2e4c491-793f-4069-9ff1-1656f74aa871"
msgid "[Kiss Octavia]"
msgstr "[옥타비아에게 키스합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a1f22ebc-d590-4d79-90db-d8b72ff9caf7"
msgid "[Kiss Octavia]"
msgstr "[옥타비아에게 키스합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0006_Text_1
msgctxt "e5d58694-81f1-4d68-bb96-88fe52a8ae07"
msgid "\"Now you are mine forever!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 이제 영원히 내꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "b6dad5e0-4023-49d8-a705-02a3061cbe12"
msgid "\"I'm so happy you are mine!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 내 것이라 너무 기뻐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0009_Text_1
msgctxt "2fe87cb1-c6ab-4251-b306-b1560a6f68c4"
msgid "\"How about another go right now?\""
msgstr "\"당장 한번 더 하는건 어떤가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6ab01390-38f5-42bd-8bf3-1d377b968319"
msgid ""
"{n}Stretching lusciously, Octavia gathers up her clothes, scattered on the "
"floor, and puts them on.{/n} \"Mmm... I love you. Let's do this more often!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우아하게 기지게를 펴더니 옥타비아는 바닥에 널부러진 옷가지를 모아, 하나씩 입기 시작합니다.{/n} \"으음... 당신을 사랑해요. "
"더 자주 하자구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0001_Text_1
msgctxt "d6e62f53-0175-4233-b364-8b4abef38ff0"
msgid ""
"{n}Stretching lusciously, Octavia gathers her clothes from their scattered "
"places on the floor and gets dressed.{/n} \"Mmm... I love you. Let's do this "
"more often!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우아하게 기지게를 펴더니 옥타비아는 바닥에 널부러진 옷가지를 모아, 하나씩 입기 시작합니다.{/n} \"음음... 당신을 사랑해요. "
"더 자주 하자구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "716d8315-9140-464d-b039-9511f4fce7c6"
msgid ""
"\"But I only got dressed...\" {n}The half-elf undoes one button on her shirt "
"and smiles flirtatiously.{/n} \"Now you'll have to help me take it all off "
"again...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 방금 옷을 다시 입었는데요...\" {n}하프 엘프는 셔츠의 단추 하나를 풀면서 매혹적인 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"이번엔 "
"당신이 벗는 것좀 도와줘야겠어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "f8c70089-1377-4220-b389-f00401ab0d76"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl clings to you and kisses you passionately, tenderly biting your "
"lips.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신을 껴안더니 부드럽게 입술을 깨물며, 열정적으로 키스합니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0007_Text_1
msgctxt "1e3fd43d-5c43-45c9-a7db-d5a30596d3d9"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia clings to you, kissing you passionately and tenderly biting your "
"lips.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신을 껴안더니 부드럽게 입술을 깨물며, 열정적으로 키스합니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0008_Text_1
msgctxt "e7ec343c-370d-4e1d-8832-6c62f7a0ddd3"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia presses her finger to your lips.{/n} \"Shh... Don't say this, or "
"our love might be shorter than I'd like.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 손가락을 당신의 입술을 누릅니다.{/n} \"쉿... 아무 말도 하지 말아요, 그러면 이 순간이 더 짧아질테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d7bb9c1e-4914-4f74-8688-c52a9f672c25"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia presses her fingers to your lips.{/n} \"Shh... Don't say that, or "
"our love might be shorter than I'd like.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 손가락을 당신의 입술을 누릅니다.{/n} \"쉿... 아무 말도 하지 말아요, 그러면 이 순간이 더 짧아질테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0010_Text_1
msgctxt "7241571c-56a2-4580-b1d5-7de76ba5cc4f"
msgid ""
"\"But I only got dressed...\" {n}The half-elf undoes one button on her shirt "
"and smiles flirtatiously.{/n} \"Now you'll have to help me take it all off "
"again...\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 방금 옷을 다시 입었는데요...\" {n}하프 엘프는 셔츠의 단추 하나를 풀면서 매혹적인 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"이번엔 "
"당신이 벗는 것좀 도와줘야겠어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0011_Text_1
msgctxt "3a51bb3d-3255-496d-be72-cd7c2548d792"
msgid ""
"\"While I was a slave, I used to dream of freedom. Now sometimes in my "
"dreams I wake up in a cage, and meeting you and all our adventures is just a "
"dream. Dreams are such strange things... But I feel for some reason that "
"these nightmares won't be coming back. What's happened now... It's too real "
"to confuse with a dream.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 노예였을땐, 자유를 되찾는 꿈을 꾸곤 했어요. 요즘은 때때로 철장 안에서 깨어나 당신을 만난 것과 우리가 겪었던 모든 모험들이 "
"그저 꿈이었다는 걸 알게되는 꿈을 꾸곤 해요. 꿈이란 참 이상한 것이지요. 하지만 이젠 그 악몽을 다시는 꾸지 않을 것 같다는 느낌이 "
"들어요. 지금 이 순간은.. 꿈과 헷갈리기엔 너무나 현실적이거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "fbe80028-7a37-4d99-8cad-92fd21fd9185"
msgid "\"Octavia, what are you doing? You should be ashamed of yourself!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 무슨 짓입니까? 부끄러운 줄 알아야합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "36e7b875-9a6e-4abc-bde3-725a16a75347"
msgid "\"Looks like Amiri is not in the mood for your jokes!\""
msgstr "\"아미리가 농담 따먹기를 할 기분이 아니었나 봅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "520ce3c2-70ef-491c-aaba-b8277d6a4b29"
msgid "\"I don't infringe upon your freedom, but your behavior is terrible.\""
msgstr "\"자유를 침해하진 않겠지만, 당신의 행동은 끔찍합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "ff523801-0ba8-4a2d-a9bf-ea3f2b08b7a5"
msgid "\"I think you are teasing me on purpose.\""
msgstr "\"난 네가 일부러 날 괴롭히는 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "75eb7175-a8f0-4515-ae1b-a1e37d44d72e"
msgid "\"Look what you've done! You upset Amiri for nothing!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 짓을 했는지 보십시오! 아무런 이유없이 아미리를 화나게 했지 않습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c267a3de-ecd6-4edd-bd82-9072254568f3"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, you are so strong! With you no monsters scare us! And this sword — "
"ugh! It's probably heavier than I am! How do you lift it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아미리, 당신은 정말 강해요! 당신과 함께라면 어떤 괴물도 겁나지 않을꺼에요! 그리고 이 칼은요 - 윽! 나보다 더 무거워울꺼에요! "
"이걸 어떻게 들 수 있는거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1e0754da-5430-4ef7-af40-065143e083d6"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian smirks happily.{/n} \"Yeah, not all can do it! You have to "
"train! Hammer the enemy face to face... Or face to toothy snout... It's not "
"like hurling spells from afar!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바바리안은 행복하게 히죽거립니다 .{/n} \"그래, 아무나 할 수 있는건 아니지! 훈련을 해야해! 적과 얼굴을 맞대고 "
"싸워야하고... 이빨 달린 주둥이와도 맞서야하지... 멀리서 주문을 쏘는 거랑은 전혀 달라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9a1e462b-a5f1-4812-9a86-baef9615cd93"
msgid ""
"\"Your muscles are like stone! You could probably lift me with one hand! Do "
"you think you could?\" {n}Octavia moves closer to Amiri and runs her fingers "
"along Amiri's shoulder.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"당신 근육은 바위같아요! 분명 나 정도는 한 손으로도 들 수 있을꺼에요! 할 수 있겠어요?\" {n}옥타비아는 아미리에게 "
"가까이갑니다. 그리고 손가락으로 아미리의 어깨를 훑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c37f3ce4-cbe0-447d-9dda-b21574ee2395"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Octavia... Are you drunk or something? If I were a man, I'd think "
"you are flirting with me!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 옥타비아.. 취하기라도 한거야? 내가 남자였다면, 네가 날 유혹하고 있다고 생각했을꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "65be3084-2e63-40d6-9630-88466507f574"
msgid "\"Men, women, what's the difference? Don't you like me at all?\""
msgstr "\"여자, 남자, 뭐가 그리 다른가요? 날 전혀 좋아하지 않나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1502a246-ea4e-4c63-a6ba-1bb420b8b17a"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri blushes a little.{/n} \"Well... You are beautiful, of course... But "
"I've never...\" {n}Stopping short, the barbarian looks at you and "
"Regongar.{/n} \"Stop! You have {Name} and Regongar, go intertwine with them! "
"And leave me out of your hanky-panky!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 약간 얼굴을 붉힙니다.{/n} \"글쎄... 물론 네가 아름답기는 하지... 하지만 난 절대...\" {n}잠시 "
"주저하더니, 바바리안은 당신과 레곤가르를 봅니다.{/n} \"그만! 너에겐 {Name}과 레곤가르가 있잖아, 걔들이랑 놀아! 네 난잡한 "
"짓거리에서 난 빼주라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4cf4b703-ed88-40cb-b54e-02a2c60aec4b"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar whispers to you softly,{/n} \"Whoops, you shouldn't have said "
"that... Here we go!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 당신에게 조용히 속삭입니다.{/n} \"이런, 그 말은 하지 말았어야 했어... 이제 또 시작하겠구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "17d4ff1d-ec56-4fdc-8678-80c2789c24c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia gives you a defiant stare.{/n} \"'What am I doing?' Does that "
"mean you don't like me flirting with somebody else? Well don't expect an "
"apology. I'm not your slave!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 맹렬하게 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"'무슨 짓입니까?'라고요? 그 말은 내가 다른 사람을 유혹하는 데 당신 허락이라도 "
"받아야 한다는 건가요? 사과는 꿈도 꾸지 마세요. 난 당신 노예가 아니니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8c46d8ae-16a0-4bb6-9764-676e302619dc"
msgid ""
"\"Right, baby, don't embarrass our monster crusher! Look what you've done — "
"she's blushing!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 옥타비아, 우리 괴물 사냥꾼을 부끄럽게 만들지 말라고! 무슨 짓을 했느지 봐 - 아미리가 얼굴을 붉히고 있잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2a246e42-1aec-4489-afd6-f8f76ca675bd"
msgid ""
"\"What?! Who, me? Nothing like that! Hell with this!\" {n}Amiri turns away "
"with indignation.{/n}"
msgstr "\"워?! 누구말이야, 나? 그런게 아니야! 지옥에나 떨어지라지!\" {n}아미리는 화를 내며 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2d6407e4-77eb-4a79-ab6e-2cbb984a2a82"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia shrugs, annoyed.{/n} \"I'll do as I please! I'm a free person. No "
"one tells me what to do!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 어깨를 으쓱하며, 짜증을 냅니다.{/n} \"난 내가 하고싶은데로 할꺼에요! 난 자유인이라고요. 누구도 내게 뭘 하라고 "
"요구할 수 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5a7ce5ed-9d52-47cd-a6e6-d11a48d8574f"
msgid ""
"\"And I think you've finally showed me your true face! Possessiveness and "
"jealousy are written all over it!\""
msgstr "\"드디어 당신의 본색을 들어냈군요! 소유욕과 질투심으로 가득해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "45f90574-d321-409c-9746-8265b32906d6"
msgid ""
"{n}The anger in Octavia's eyes gives way to embarrassment, and she looks "
"away.{/n} \"Me too... I don't know what got into me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아의 눈에 씌었던 분노가 부끄러움으로 바뀝니다. 그녀는 시선을 피합니다.{/n} \"나도요... 무슨 바람이 들어서 그랬는지 "
"모르겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "92d61cee-cdf1-4d24-8a90-0bd9fabdc8d3"
msgid "\"I'll go get some air!\" {n}The half-elf steps aside.{/n}"
msgstr "\"나가서 공기좀 쐬어야겠어요!\" {n}하프 엘프는 자리에서 벗어납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cf3e2d7b-ca0f-4a7e-9286-2391ba3a2009"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar shakes his head knowingly.{/n} \"Don't worry, she can be like "
"this. She doesn't mean it, just... She likes testing people's endurance. And "
"the closer a person is to her, the harder she likes to push it. You just "
"have to be patient.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 다 안다는 듯이 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"걱정하지마. 그녀는 가끔 이러곤 하니까. 본신은 아니야, 그저.. 사람들의 "
"인내심을 시험해보고 싶은 것 뿐이지. 가까운 사람일수록 더 심하게 밀어붙여. 넌 그저 인내심을 가지고 기다려 주면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fa150b6f-87a9-42ce-ad6c-9e449cf514d7"
msgid "\"Teasing? What are you saying? Why would I tease you?\""
msgstr "\"괴롭힌다고요? 무슨 소리죠? 내가 왜 당신을 괴롭히겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3f59b7cc-6be6-4641-9f0d-5477c05de25d"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks sheepishly at the barbarian.{/n} \"I'm... sorry, Amiri, "
"this was truly stupid.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 양처럼 바바리안을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"... 미안해요, 아미리, 정말 멍청한 짓이었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "475cb356-c7e8-4d58-ac68-014fd77193f8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh dear... You shouldn't have said that. This is no joke for her — she'll "
"shut you down after this. You know that freedom is everything for her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 이런... 그 말은 하지 말았어야 했어. 그녀는 그걸 농담으로 받아드리지 않을꺼야 — 이후론 너랑 절연하려들꺼야. 그녀에겐 자유가 "
"곧 모든 것이란걸 잘 알잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d129a741-25a9-42f7-bbcf-0a39176df9d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar puts his arm around your shoulders.{/n} \"But don't worry, I "
"won't leave you!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 당신 어깨에 팔을 두릅니다.{/n} \"하지만 걱정하지마, 난 널 떠나지 않을꺼니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "618e34ef-6fb5-41cd-8a9a-7948b77a9dc4"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar puts his arm around your shoulders.{/n} \"But don't worry, "
"she'll come back around. Our girl needs some space, that's all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 당신 어깨에 팔을 두릅니다.{/n} \"하지만 걱정하지마, 곧 돌아올거니까. 옥타비아는 생각할 시간이 좀 필요할 뿐이야, "
"그뿐이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_2-SeducingAmiri/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "adb0e0a5-051d-400f-978a-6adc5acc4685"
msgid "\"Easy, easy. It happens.\""
msgstr "\"진정해요, 진정해. 이미 벌어진 일이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0ecd8943-173d-4345-ba3a-a483c9b29ef9"
msgid "\"You really hurt me.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나에게 정말로 상처를 주었습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "174d35aa-ce5c-4b34-999e-91a90fbdd581"
msgid "\"You have all the reason in the world not to trust people.\""
msgstr "\"당신에겐 사람을 믿지 않을 이유가 차고도 넘칩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c209afd8-8473-47d7-a564-89430ccd3ccd"
msgid "[Hold Octavia] \"Thank you for saying it. I love you.\""
msgstr "[옥타비아를 껴안는다] \"말해줘서 고마워요. 당신을 사랑합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0b6d5199-c3aa-4cd2-9a13-e3b0826a5aa9"
msgid ""
"[Pull away] \"After everything you've done to me, it's hard to believe you. "
"What if you decide to test me again?\""
msgstr "[밀어낸다] \"당신이 내게 한 짓을 생각해보면, 당신 말을 믿긴 어렵습니다. 당신이 날 또 시험할 수도 있는거 아닙니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "1c8bbc0d-2197-4d37-9981-ba7602e40ce5"
msgid ""
"[Pull away] \"You know what? I'm tired of your games. Enough. I can't take "
"it any more. It's over.\""
msgstr "[밀어낸다] \"이거 압니까? 당신의 게임엔 이제 질렸습니다. 이제 충분합니다. 더이상 참아줄 수 없습니다. 이제 끝입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "c4349a77-7db4-4f1d-8ecf-e15bd94c6f6a"
msgid ""
"\"What is this? Another test? You wish to see how I'll react to an apology?\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭡니까? 또 다른 실험인가요? 사과에 내가 어떻게 반응하는지 보고 싶은 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "727dd20d-7fc0-4260-9dbd-675ee95a7f4f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia touches your shoulder hesitantly.{/n} \"Listen, I... I need to "
"tell you something.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 주저하면 당신의 어깨를 건드립니다.{/n} \"들어봐요, 당신에게 해줄 말이 있어요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "34d57881-7dfa-471d-9090-bf4ac1263e41"
msgid ""
"\"No, not like that... I want to apologize. I was unfair to you. All that "
"flirtation for show, to see if you'd be jealous... Stupid scenes to test how "
"much you'd take... It was cruel and stupid. I'm sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요, 그런게 아니에요... 난 사과하고 싶어요. 난 당신을 부당하게 대했어요. 당신을 질투나게 하려했던 모든 유혹들하며... "
"당신이 얼마나 버틸 수 있을지 시험하려 했던 멍청한 짓들... 잔인하고 멍청했지요. 미안해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "430b26dc-70b5-4772-8a81-9fb47d216c71"
msgid ""
"\"I know. I did it on purpose. I'm really sorry. I was afraid you'd turn out "
"to be another tyrant, and hurt me... I didn't even think about what you were "
"feeling. I'm a terrible egoist.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알아요. 일부러 그랬지요. 정말 미안해요. 난 당신이 또 다른 폭군으로 돌변해서 나에게 상처를 줄까봐 두려웠어요... 당신의 감정 "
"따윈 생각지도 않았지요. 난 정말 대책없이 이기적이었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "909ed141-5bb6-447b-a963-956c7e55c09f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... But I punish the people who are close to me for the evil that "
"strangers did to me. I knew you loved me... But I couldn't find it in my "
"heart to trust you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요... 하지만 적들이 내게 가한 악행을 두고, 나와 가까운 사람에게 화풀이를 했어요. 당신이 날 사랑한다는 걸 알았지만... "
"당신을 진심으로 믿을 수 있을지에 대엔 확신을 없었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "61b8a12b-fbea-45aa-9038-39156fae1e4a"
msgid "{n}Instead of answering, the girl clings to you tightly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}대답대신, 옥타비아는 당신을 더 힘껏 껴안습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "599f285b-eea9-4acc-b51b-d83aab33fbe9"
msgid ""
"\"I... Understand. I hope you can forgive me. I love you so much. And I'm so "
"afraid of losing you.\""
msgstr "\"난... 알았어요. 당신이 날 용서해주길 바랬어요. 당신을 정말 사랑해요. 그리고 당신을 잃는 것이 정말 두렵고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "77e2d79d-d18d-4e5e-93f9-7a67cff79dd4"
msgid ""
"\"I... Understand. I'm sorry.\" {n}Sniffling, the half-elf turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"난.. 알았어요. 미안해요.\" {n}훌쩍이며, 옥타비아는 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-IWasCruel/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "ff9a5071-d5b3-412a-ad24-162fb93172c5"
msgid ""
"\"What? No, no! Oh... You see what I've done? I'm being sincere, and you're "
"looking for the trick in my words. That's exactly what I'm apologizing for.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고요? 아뇨, 아니에요! 오... 내가 무슨 짓을 한 거람? 나 같은 사람이 진지하게 말하니까, 뭐가 잘못된 줄 알고 말속에 "
"숨겨진 의미를 찾을 수밖에요. 내가 미안해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "691bc8af-8285-4fd7-8367-81c291e14564"
msgid "\"Yes, you can be difficult.\""
msgstr "\"그래요, 무척 힘들었겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f44fcb75-d95f-41b6-9697-6749f43e9a59"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be so hard on yourself. You've been through a lot. Of course it left "
"some scars.\""
msgstr "\"자신에게 너무 모질게 굴지 마십시오. 당신은 많은 일을 겪었습니다. 그와중에 몇몇 일은 당신에게 상처를 남겼겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f6c318ab-ce1a-42b2-b9e3-6041a0d18909"
msgid ""
"[Pull away] \"Since you brought it up… It's true — I've already endured this "
"for too long. I can't any more. It's better if we put an end to this.\""
msgstr ""
"[밀어낸다] \"당신이 꺼내서 하는 말인데… 그건 사실입니다 - 난 너무 오랫동안 참아왔습니다. 더이이상은 못하겠습니다. 이제 끝내는 게 "
"좋을 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "67222f3f-b37a-474e-973d-e535a1471f7f"
msgid ""
"[Hold Octavia] \"We both have old wounds, and we're both insane in our own "
"ways. How would we survive if we didn't support each other?\""
msgstr ""
"[옥타비아를 안아준다] \"우리 둘다 오랜 상처를 가지고 있습니다. 그리고 우리 둘다 각자의 방식대로 정신이 나갔지요. 서로에게 버팀목이 "
"되어주지 않는다면 어떻게 살아나갈 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b4e3207e-43bb-4bd6-a145-3e0b082aab88"
msgid "[Hold Octavia] \"I love you. And I will never leave you.\""
msgstr "[옥타비아를 안아준다] \"당신을 사랑합니다. 절대 당신을 떠나지 않을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "40e39c1c-b673-4300-976c-886f22ef5b03"
msgid ""
"[Pull away] \"It's true — if you keep doing this, at some point I might not "
"be able to take it.\""
msgstr "[밀어낸다] \"사실입니다 -당신이 계속 이런다면, 언젠간 그냥 넘어가기 어려울지도 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8837ab71-5b87-43cd-b494-8505795674cb"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia is unusually sad and quiet today. She stares down at the ground, "
"then looks up at you.{/n} \"{Name}... How can you stand me? I just keep "
"hurting you. I'm an egotistical fool who can't turn away from her own "
"troubles for a moment and think about someone else's.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}오늘 옥타비아는 평소와 달리 조용하고 슬퍼보입니다. 그녀는 땅만 쳐다보다, 고개를 들어올려 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"{Name}"
"... 어떻게 날 참아주는거죠? 난 당신에게 상처만 주는데. 난 스스로의 문제를 잠시 미뤄두고 남을 배려하는 걸 못하는, 자기중심적인 "
"바보인데 말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "37bafdd5-2065-4835-bd20-0d7920540e3f"
msgid "{n}Sniffling, Octavia turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}훌쩍이며, 옥타비아는 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "2c54cc9a-e5dc-43a4-a48f-8bf3c08c5751"
msgid ""
"\"And you're still with me. In spite of it all... I don't know how. I "
"wouldn't have put up with myself. I'd have thrown me away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데도 당신은 나와 함께 있지요. 이때까지 있었던 일에도 불구하고... 어찌해야 할지를 모르겠어요. 내 자신을 참지 못하겠고, 그냥 "
"저질러버려요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "7c56d1d5-9e4c-4ae1-ad6a-a1d4869d669e"
msgid ""
"{n}Holding you tight, Octavia sniffs.{/n} \"Yes... But I've relied on your "
"support for such a long time, giving so little in return... I won't ever "
"forget that I'm not the only one who can be hurt and tired.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 꼭 껴안고, 옥타비아는 훌쩍입니다..{/n} \"그래요... 그렇게 오랜 시간동안 당신에게 의지해왔는데, 보답이라곤 눈꼽 "
"만큼도 해준 게 없어요... 이제, 상처받고 지치는 사람이 나뿐만이 아니란 걸 절대 잊지 않을게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "889c1a68-6733-424c-a0c1-afd1fbae7ca9"
msgid "{n}Octavia wipes a tear.{/n} \"Yes... Yes, I'll remember. I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 눈물을 훔칩니다.{/n} \"그래요... 맞아요, 기억할께요. 미안해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "aa964a45-9b16-4248-83be-c6ade54d3330"
msgid ""
"{n}Holding you tight, Octavia sniffs.{/n} \"Thank you. Thank you for not "
"leaving me. Even if I deserve it.\""
msgstr "{n}당신을 꼭 껴안고, 옥타비아는 훌쩍입니다.{/n} \"고마워요. 날 떠나지 않아줘서. 내가 그럴 자격이 없는데도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "1027762a-498e-4d93-9c21-f14970d25712"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for understanding. But it's wrong! Why do I take revenge on "
"those I love, for the harm that my enemies did to me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해해줘서 고마워요. 하지만 그건 내 잘못이에요! 적들이 입힌 상처를 두고, 난 왜 사랑하는 사람에게 그 복수를 하려했을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Octavia/Stage_3-ImCrazy/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "73ab5fca-b9b4-4ba0-bfa7-36ddcd3dd422"
msgid ""
"\"All these tests, trying to make you jealous, suddenly blurting out "
"something rude... The more I've fallen in love with you, the more I've "
"pushed you away, because I was afraid to become your prisoner. But what "
"would I do if you really left?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 모든 시험들, 당신을 질투나게 하려 했었던 일들, 갑자기 무례하게 굴었던 일들... 내가 당신과 더 깊게 사랑에 빠질수록, 당신을 "
"더 세게 밀어냈지요, 단지 당신의 죄수가 되는게 두려워서요. 하지만 당신이 정말 떠나버린다면 내가 어찌됐을까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_1a_Regongar_String
msgctxt "fda09b16-cef0-4a5b-8949-68d8764247d9"
msgid "\"You want to do it again right now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 당장 또 하길 원해요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_1b_Octavia_String
msgctxt "edc58b37-3a3d-4847-a4e0-19a374197b3a"
msgid "\"And then again... And again!\""
msgstr "\"하고.. 하고... 또 하고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_2a_Regongar_String
msgctxt "017d4644-3ed6-4caa-8425-5a53ccc0812d"
msgid "\"You two almost tore me in half.\""
msgstr "\"당신들 둘은 이미 나를 반으로 찢어놨습니다만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_2b_Octavia_String
msgctxt "fe47ff74-7f1d-4f73-a9a2-ebed46e8e6d4"
msgid "\"Don't say you didn't like it!\""
msgstr "\"당신도 좋았으면서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_3a_Regongar_String
msgctxt "7c58ba71-64c2-4cba-9a40-b691c796668d"
msgid "\"We probably woke up the entire palace... Or maybe the entire city!\""
msgstr "\"우린 분명 궁궐에 있는 모두를 깨웠을꺼에요... 어쩌면 수도 전체를 깨웠을지도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_3b_Octavia_String
msgctxt "7d635f6b-a28f-4e32-a2c4-a53f30946a0e"
msgid "\"Good! Let everyone know we're happy!\""
msgstr "\"잘됐네! 모두들 우리가 지금 얼마나 즐거운지 알겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_4a_Octavia_String
msgctxt "ece02aa0-d56e-4cc7-b4db-666d786fa46d"
msgid "\"Did I scratch you too hard?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너무 세게 할퀴었나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_4b_Regongar_String
msgctxt "91b5116c-6f7f-4d63-901c-1a67d188358c"
msgid "\"You can go harder... I cherish every scar I got from you two!\""
msgstr "\"더 세게 해도 좋습니다... 당신들 둘이 내는 상처라면 모두 소중히 간직하지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_5a_Regongar_String
msgctxt "904da527-c6b5-4896-a964-c71c21ecd7a6"
msgid ""
"\"Do you want to try something new? I want to feel you wildest fantasies!\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 새로운 걸 해볼래요? 야성적인 판타지를 느끼게 해줄께요 !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_5b_Octavia_String
msgctxt "8d4c4074-6eda-40f6-8855-70bc1c2e70a8"
msgid "\"Oh, I just thought of something...\""
msgstr "\"오, 방금 막 뭐가 떠올랐는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_6a_Octavia_String
msgctxt "b89088a7-c341-4f79-a503-cae7252b6de8"
msgid "\"After what we've been doing, no monster is going to surprise me!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 한 짓을 생각해보면, 이젠 어떤 괴물에도 놀라지 않을 것 같은데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/After_sex_6b_Regongar_String
msgctxt "e902dcbd-ab54-4491-aeb3-ebc32ea1142c"
msgid "\"A monster might not... But I can try!\""
msgstr "\"괴물은 아니지만... 노력은 해보지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_Octavia_1_String
msgctxt "c3a4d863-bd11-497c-82da-e2f96371a443"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we tore my shirt again... Enough is enough — it's not funny any more!\""
msgstr "\"오, 또 셔츠를 찢어먹었네요... 이쯤해두지요 - 이제 하나도 재미 없다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_Octavia_2_String
msgctxt "e093f211-0bbd-4413-8ebb-7a517cc9a013"
msgid "\"I need to brush my hair, fix my face... This will take a while!\""
msgstr "\"머리도 빗고 치장도 좀 해야겠어요.. 시간이 좀 걸릴꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_Octavia_3_String
msgctxt "6d2d30fc-d603-4b79-be48-4116164f6b8a"
msgid "\"{Name}, you have a hair on your shoulder... And I think it's mine.\""
msgstr "\"{Name}, 당신 어깨에 머리카락이 하나 붙었네요...내 건것 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_Regongar_1_String
msgctxt "2dda5703-da06-413b-9191-90d35f18ae69"
msgid "\"Where's my belt?\""
msgstr "\"내 허리띠가 어디갔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_Regongar_2_String
msgctxt "38f1b795-2c18-469e-be4d-eca13bb88511"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to go anywhere. Maybe we can stay here... for a week or two?\""
msgstr "\"아무데도 가고 싶지 않아요. 여기에 일,이주정도 머물면 안될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_Regongar_3_String
msgctxt "7c25c8f3-162e-4193-9ee2-4aa59e1c9232"
msgid ""
"\"I love both of you. For you I'll tear anyone in half with my bare hands!\""
msgstr "\"너희 둘다 사랑해! 너희를 위해서라면 누구든 맨손으로 반으로 찢어버릴꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "86865539-fc28-4e6e-8d84-914f1541f0ed"
msgid "[Do not interfere]"
msgstr "[끼어들지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d3c132e8-6994-4ae0-a7b4-f5a70ce62ed7"
msgid "\"Regongar, she's right.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 그녀가 옳아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "767cdcdf-6eb3-4dc1-aef2-64835e01c119"
msgid "\"Octavia, you're unfair to him.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 당신은 그에게 부당하게 행동했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "a71cabce-0e1b-4293-ae35-40cc458664b6"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia, Regongar... You're about to say things you'll regret until the "
"end of your lives. Did you really survive Numeria together, only to yell at "
"each other now that you're are free?\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아, 레곤가르.. 싸움을 계속했다간 평생에 걸쳐 후회하게될 말을 할지도 모릅니다. 겨우 서로에게 고함치며 싸우기 위해, "
"누메리아에서 함께 생존을 위해 싸운겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "e3bed504-f21a-4bfc-8cd9-7e693f0a8e58"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sick of your fights! Treat each other however you want, but leave me "
"out of it!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다! 마음대로 하십시오, 하지만 난 거기서 빼주길 바랍니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "c0eaf653-153d-457b-9668-bfb62a95e8f8"
msgid "\"Don't worry, she'll come back.\""
msgstr "\"걱정마세요, 그녀는 돌아올겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "b838b981-17bc-46b2-a3d9-03f3b430e8ba"
msgid "\"Why are you still sitting here? Run after her!\""
msgstr "\"왜 가만히 앉아있는겁니까? 쫓아가십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "7ae3dcd4-a459-47af-bf31-1c8d399713b5"
msgid "\"You were right. It's her fault.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 옳습니다. 그녀 잘못입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "38852575-d6a2-4e57-8b43-c73fb57ff318"
msgid "[Hug Regongar without saying a word]"
msgstr "[더이상 말하지 않고 레곤가르를 안는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "330ca746-8d84-4ea6-98e7-b2cb18c53e08"
msgid "\"Why are you still sitting here? Run after him!\""
msgstr "\"왜 가만히 앉아있는겁니까? 쫓아가십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "2175b6cd-f3e4-43ac-8ab2-e2c487214c25"
msgid "\"Don't worry, he'll come back.\""
msgstr "\"걱정마세요, 그는 돌아올겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "32c0bb3a-d5be-42ed-b9ab-978114417f4c"
msgid "\"You were right. It's his fault.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 옳습니다. 그의 잘못입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "8ac40f2b-949c-47b0-b770-2fa45016a0de"
msgid "[Hug Octavia without saying a word]"
msgstr "[더이상 말하지 않고 옥타비아를 안는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "f1015e7f-a0e3-447a-b839-dc03156c48f2"
msgid "\"I'm sure. I love you both as much as you love each other.\""
msgstr "\"확신하건데, 난 당신들이 서로를 사랑하는 것 만큼 당신들을 사랑합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "a49d8158-4697-4bf0-9b3f-1b54df5dfd12"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not so sure any more. You two have enough fire in your lives without "
"me!\""
msgstr "\"더이상 확신이 서지 않는군요. 당신 둘은 나없이도 인생의 골칫거리는 충분한 것 같습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "4041d3f0-ac56-45a7-82ce-f701fb5517e3"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand your fights any more. Fight all you want — I have Tristian!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다. 싸우던지 말던지 알아서 하십시오 - 내겐 트리스티안이 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "1c02b073-7a97-4a7f-a1b0-b4d30950cd3d"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand your fights any more. Fight all you want — I have Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다. 싸우던지 말던지 알아서 하십시오 - 내겐 발레리가 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "80275b13-e1f8-4bbe-96c5-0c70878c5f13"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid I don't. You two have enough fire in your lives, and I have "
"Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 생각하지 않습니다. 당신 둘 삶에는 나없이도 골치거리가 충분하고, 내겐 트리스티안이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0076_Text
msgctxt "fb0015b0-3647-4359-bafe-0249b18c08ad"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid I don't. You two have enough fire in your lives, and I have "
"Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 생각하지 않습니다. 당신 둘 삶에는 나없이도 골치거리가 충분하고, 내겐 발레리가 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "27fb81d8-0ea4-4fb0-94fc-85350fa4ffcb"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand your fights any more. Fight with her, or make peace, or do "
"whatever you like — I have Tristian!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다. 싸우던지 말던지 알아서 하십시오 - 내겐 트리스티안이 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "237b92af-ec13-408e-b43e-5931a4217f5c"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand your fights any more. Fight with her, or make peace, or do "
"whatever you like — I have Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다. 싸우던지 말던지 알아서 하십시오 - 내겐 발레리가 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "1ff4ae22-db3c-4028-a6f6-7415d2e116cb"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand your fights any more. Fight with him, or make peace — do "
"whatever you like, I have Tristian!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다. 싸우던지 말던지 알아서 하십시오 - 내겐 트리스티안이 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "aff7ba14-4361-45a1-bfa6-d1f3c5e8ded4"
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand your fights any more. Fight with him, or make peace — do "
"whatever you like, I have Valerie!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다. 싸우던지 말던지 알아서 하십시오 - 내겐 발레리가 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "b7544c38-dd7d-49cd-852d-808adf8dac23"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sick of your fights! Work it out between you two, and leave me out of "
"it!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다! 마음대로 하십시오, 그리고 난 거기서 난 빠지겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "80b70688-9701-42b1-bcfb-030a2240e381"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sick of your fights! Work it out between you two, and leave me out of "
"it!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 싸움엔 질렸습니다! 마음대로 하십시오, 그리고 난 거기서 난 빠지겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "cba5f3ce-063c-410b-9f6c-27c965789322"
msgid ""
"{n}You, Octavia, and Regongar go to the tavern to rest after a campaign.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}원정이 끝난 후, 당신과 옥타비아와 레곤가르는 휴식을 취하기 위해 선술집으로 갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "44cb95ca-31ba-4189-a30d-a0b45552435f"
msgid "\"So, my Octavia? Should we drink to new victories?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 나의 옥타비아? 새로운 승리에 건배나 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ec34e47-c2cf-4aa4-9ace-1bc62384d8d9"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf's smile disappears. She puts down her mug firmly on the "
"table.{/n} \"Regongar, honey! Please try to remember, how many times I asked "
"you not to call me that?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프 엘프의 미소가 사라집니다. 그녀는 탁자위에 술잔을 딱 내려놓습니다.{/n} \"레곤가르, 자기! 잊어버리지 좀 마, 날 그렇게 "
"부르지 말라고 몇 번이나 얘기했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e889fc93-03c0-4412-aae2-62be1c9c2664"
msgid "\"Oh, don't be like that, it's just a word!\""
msgstr "\"오, 너무 그러지 말라고, 그냥 단어 하나일 뿐이잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9b340eee-beb1-42af-ab79-f99f9c933785"
msgid ""
"\"Just a word that is just painful for me to hear. Which I've asked you a "
"thousand times not to say. But you just don't care! We've had this "
"conversation before! And not just once or twice!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 그냥 단어 하나가 내겐 얼마나 듣기 고통스러운지 알잖아. 내가 몇 천번쯤이나 그렇게 부르지 말라고 부탁했는데. 넌 신경도 안써! "
"이 얘기는 전에도 했잖아! 한 두번도 아니고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0dc3666b-5d43-4a94-a736-837e57ca2be1"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you keep pushing me away — and the more I try for you, the worse it "
"gets? {Name} doesn't pick on my every sneeze! You know, it's just a word... "
"A tender word! You know I call you that because I love you, not because I'm "
"trying to make you my posession or some other insane reason you made up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 날 계속 밀어내는 건데 - 내가 널 위할수록 , 왜 더 심해지는거지? {Name}은 내 말한마디마다 시비를 걸진 않아! 너도 "
"알잖아, 그건 단어 하나일 뿐이야... 다정한 단어지! 널 사랑하기 때문에 그렇게 부른다는 걸 잘 알고 있잖아, 널 내 소유로 만들거나 "
"네가 지어낸 정신나간 다른 이유때문이 아니란걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "91e065dc-245b-44bd-b8c6-a5b2e82a99d5"
msgid ""
"\"{Name} is just more patient with your bullshit than me. This, right here, "
"is what I'm talking about! It's not a tender word to me, and you know it! "
"Reg, you're always doing something crazy that I didn't ask you to do, don't "
"want you to do — or even asked you not to do — and then you say it's all "
"because of this great big love you have for me. Well if you love me so much, "
"why is it you don't care for what I say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{Name}은 네 헛소리에 나보다 더 잘 참고 있을 뿐이야. 이게, 바로 이게, 내가 말하는 거라고! 그건 내게 다정한 단어가 "
"아니야, 그리고 넌 그걸 잘 알고 있잖아. 레그, 넌 내가 부탁하지도 않고, 원하지도 않고, 하지말라고 부탁한 미친 짓들을 하곤 하지, "
"단지 네가 날 무지 사랑한다는 이유만으로 말이야. 네가 날 그렇게 사랑한다면, 왜 내 말을 배려하지 않는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "77ac8a8c-a046-49b2-a74e-ce82df438fc7"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar's voice becomes dull, he speaks slowly, like a growling dog "
"preparing to attack.{/n} \"I? Don't care for you? You have the guts to "
"accuse me of neglecting you? Octavia, why do you think I'm doing all this "
"dumb shit? To earn a drop of your affection! You're drifting further from me "
"with each passing day — and what should I do? I'm suffocating without you. "
"Do you remember how we saved each other in Numeria? The way you are now — I "
"don't know how I would have survived without {Name}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마치 으르렁거리며 공격을 준비하는 개처럼, 레곤가르의 목소리가 무디고 느려집니다.{/n} \"내가? 널 배려하지 않는다고? 내가 널 "
"무시했다고 날 비난하는거야? 옥타비아, 이때까지 내가 왜 이 멍청한 헛짓거리를 해왔다고 생각해? 네 관심 한 방울을 얻기 위해서였어! "
"날이 갈수록 넌 내게서 떠밀려가는데 - 내가 뭘 어째야했을까? 난 너없인 숨이 막혀 죽어버릴꺼야. 누메리아에서 우리가 서로를 얼마나 "
"구해줬는지 기억나? 지금 이 꼴을 보니, 그때 우리가 {Name} 없이 어떻게 살아남았는지 궁금할 지경이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "47203d76-b402-49f7-956a-b738eb905057"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks away.{/n} \"I'm sorry. It's just that... Sometimes your "
"love hurts. It's too fierce, too aggressive. You leave me no space at all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 고개를 돌립니다{/n} \"미안해. 그렇지만.. 네 사랑은 간혹가다 상처를 줄 때가 있어. 너무 맹렬하고, 공격적이야. "
"넌 내게 전혀 쉴틈을 안준다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "37261195-32db-4c2c-bdc8-0b855614c762"
msgid ""
"\"Sick of — ?! Fine! You won't hear them again! We'll be quiet as mice! Just "
"don't you dare say again that you love me!\" {n}Getting up from the table, "
"Octavia walks out of the tavern quickly, and slams the door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"질렸다고요— ?! 좋아요! 더 이상 우리가 싸우는 걸 들을 일은 없을꺼에요! 쥐처럼 조용히 있도록 하죠! 그저 다시는 감히 날 "
"사랑한다고 말하지 말아요!!\" {n}자리에서 일어나, 옥타비아는 문을 쾅하고 닫으며 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "79c5a8b9-abf9-422c-9941-f0afc400b234"
msgid ""
"\"So you're sick of us, huh? Well... I knew our love would end like this. We "
"played a little and now it's been enough!\" {n}Getting up from the table, "
"Regongar runs outside, slamming the door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이제 우리에게 질렸다고, 허? 음... 우리 사랑이 이렇게 끝날지는 알고 있었지. 몇번 즐기진 않았지만 이젠 충분히 알았어!\" {n}"
"자리에서 일어나, 레곤가르는 문을 쾅하고 닫으며 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3d95f19a-e2ae-46c9-9779-9582b71919aa"
msgid ""
"\"Fine! You won't hear any more fights or anything else! We'll be as quiet "
"as mice! Just don't you dare say again that you love me!\" {n}Octavia runs "
"out of the tavern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\" 좋아요! 더 이상 우리가 싸우는 걸 들을 일은 없을꺼에요! 쥐처럼 조용히 있도록 하죠! 그저 다시는 감히 날 사랑한다고 말하지 "
"말아요!!\" {n}자리에서 일어나, 옥타비아는 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0021_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c9ae881f-2022-449d-900c-ffc1e39c5ef6"
msgid ""
"{n}Without looking back at you, Octavia runs outside after Regongar.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신을 뒤돌아보지 않고, 옥타비아는 레곤가르를 따라 밖으로 나갑니다{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6b85944f-6183-4894-8194-1376f6cf66ef"
msgid ""
"\"Well... I knew our love would end like this. We played for a while, and "
"now it's over!\" {n}Regongar runs out of the tavern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"음... 우리 사랑이 이렇게 끝날 줄 알고 있어지. 몇 번 즐기지도 못했는데, 이제 끝장나버렸군!\" {n}레곤가르는 술집을 "
"나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0023_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bfa64ba4-9dad-40d6-8413-1a38c1a9b882"
msgid ""
"{n}Without looking back at you, Regongar runs outside after Octavia.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신을 뒤돌아보지 않고, 레곤가르는 옥타비아를 따라 밖으로 나갑니다{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5e4510f5-47fe-47cc-ba1a-bbd25182fec4"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar looks at you in rage.{/n} \"You're on her side? Fine! Keep "
"playing soft with each other. Just leave me out of it!\" {n}Regongar gets up "
"from the table, runs outside and slams the door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 분노에 차서 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"옥타비아 편을 들겠다고? 좋아! 그렇게 얌전히들 놀라고! 난 빠져줄테니까!\" "
"{n}자리에서 일어나, 레곤가르는 문을 쾅하고 닫으며 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "31bc52b1-3901-422a-8949-bc208251fc42"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia bangs her hand on the table.{/n} \"You really don't understand "
"why it's unbearable? It's like I'm talking to a wall! You two are perfect "
"for each other! You know what? I think you'd better just have a nice happy "
"duo and leave me out of it!\" {n}Octavia gets up from the table, storms out "
"of the tavern, and slams the door behind her.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 손으로 탁자를 쾅하고 내리칩니다.{/n} \"당신은 정말로 내가 왜 그걸 참아줄 수 없는지 이해하지 못하는군요? 마치 "
"벽이랑 얘기하는 것 같아요! 당신 둘은 천생연분이에요! 난 빠져줄테니까 행복한 2인조로 잘 살아보세요!\" {n}자리에서 일어나, "
"옥타비아는 문을 쾅하고 닫으며 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0026_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "493f76a8-8745-4ea8-b554-bc8494826659"
msgid ""
"\"You need space?\" {n}Regongar starts screaming.{/n} \"Please! All of "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} is yours, go wherever you want! Just don't call it "
"'love'!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쉴틈이 필요하다고?\" {n}레곤가르는 소리지릅니다.{/n} \"제발! {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 어느 곳이라도 좋아, "
"원하는 데로 쉴틈을 찾아 가버리라고! 그저 '쉴틈'을 '사랑'이라고 부르지는마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "135d4908-c516-4fac-8d0a-01599dd4530e"
msgid ""
"\"Are you serious? Fine! If that's what you want!\" {n}Octavia gets up from "
"the table, storms out of the tavern, and slams the door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"진심이야? 좋아! 네가 원한다면 그렇게 해줄께!\" {n}자리에서 일어나, 옥타비아는 문을 쾅하고 닫으며 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "06561d98-d6e0-4442-a020-5d9a7eaa7360"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar jumps up from the table, runs outside, and slams the door.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 자리에서 벌떡 일어나, 문을 쾅하고 닫으며 밖으로 뛰쳐나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0b733952-c83e-4027-bfc5-fd8ba3840cd7"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar had already taken a deep breath to belt out a furious answer, "
"but he just exhales and looks down, embarrassed. An uneasy silence hangs "
"over the table.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 분노한 답변을 내뱉으려 막 숨을 들이쉰 참이었지만, 숨만 내쉬고 부끄러워하며 고개를 숙입니다. 불편한 침묵이 자리에 "
"감돕니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0030_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f618eeb3-0498-4281-a4de-f46309220885"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar follows her with his eyes, and then slowly hides his face in his "
"hands.{/n} \"What... What have I done...\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 그녀를 눈으로 쫓으며, 손으로 얼굴을 감쌉니다. {/n} \"내가.. 내가 무슨 짓을...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "161a9b58-9eb7-4172-ac23-f241f2e02703"
msgid ""
"\"No. She won't. You don't understand... It's been a long time coming.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 안올꺼야. 넌 이해 못해... 언젠간 일어날 일이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9f3e06cc-084b-4d1d-aefb-4c6d364e759b"
msgid "\"Now I have nobody. Nobody... Except you.\""
msgstr "\"이젠 내겐 아무도 없군. 아무도... .널 빼고는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1b7b0342-3751-4f18-bb2e-417dda9f4055"
msgid ""
"\"There's no use. It's been a long time coming... It's finally over, after a "
"long and painful agony.\""
msgstr "\"소용없어. 언젠간 일어날 일이었어. 길고 힘든 고통 끝에, 드디어 끝이 난거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "02060b53-64a3-414f-b1fd-6b00a3369f01"
msgid "{n}The half-orc clings to you tightly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 당신을 껴안습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ffb27b85-faac-412b-a4ab-b92b4d03f291"
msgid ""
"\"No, it's my, my fault! But... why does it even matter? It's over now.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 이건 내, 내 잘못이야! 하지만 이미 벌이진 일이지. 이젠 끝나버렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0041_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b6df3343-37f9-4e1b-82fc-099d39d5ae38"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia grows pale, and follows him with a stunned look.{/n} \"How could "
"I... How could I say that to him!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 창백해져, 충격받은 눈빛으로 그의 뒤를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내가 어떻게.. 내가 어떻게 그런 말을 했을까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ffcce0bc-b6a0-4e33-8dc1-a4e91fad938f"
msgid ""
"\"No, it's too late now. It's been... not all roses between us for a long "
"time... And it's been getting worse. This had to happen — and it finally did."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요, 이젠 너무 늦었어요. 이건 ... 우리 사이에 있었던 일들이 모두 장미빛이었던건 아니었죠.... 게다가 점점 나빠지고 "
"있었으니까요. 언젠가 일어날 일이었고, 드디어 터진 것 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "913ea388-48a9-408b-9777-277c8fe6ea68"
msgid ""
"\"No. He won't. Things haven't been working out with us for a long time — "
"and it's been getting worse. Sooner or later this had to happen — and it "
"finally did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요. 그는 돌아오지 않을꺼에요. 오래 전부터 우리 사이는 잘 안되왔고 - 계속 나빠지기만 해왔죠. 이르던 늦던 일어날 일이었고 - "
"오늘에서야 벌어진 것 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2f63aca8-b9cf-4047-aa00-70ebeab8d7bc"
msgid "\"No, no... I wasn't fair! But now... Now everything is over.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 아니요.. 온당치 못한 쪽은 저에요! 하지만 이젠... 모든게 끝나버렸어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "61ae481a-4735-48dc-93a9-2e577c6f7e7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia clings to you with her whole body. You feel her shivering.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 온몸으로 당신을 꼭 안습니다. 그녀가 떨고 있는걸 느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "aa11882b-5b06-4cbf-aa92-713b93607d3a"
msgid "\"I've lost him, {Name}. I've lost him forever. Now I only have you.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르를 잃었어요, {Name}. 영원히. 이젠 당신 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f976ac3d-0050-4866-ab60-c4c03e0c8d5f"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me. I overreacted. I know you love me... In the end, you're right —"
" it's only a word.\""
msgstr "\"용서해줘. 내가 과민하게 반응했어. 네가 날 사랑하는건 잘 알아.. 네 말이 맞긴 해 - 그저 단어일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f48b1f3d-67e8-4509-a6e4-741026460689"
msgid ""
"\"No, you forgive me. I keep trying to act up in front of you, to prove that "
"I love you... When instead I should have just done one simple thing — shut "
"up and listen! I'm sorry. I... I won't say that word again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 용서는 네가 해야지. 널 사랑하다는 걸 증명하려고 몸이 먼저 나서고는 했어... 그저 한가지 간단한 일만 했으면 됐는데 말이야 "
"- 입닥치고 네 얘기를 들어주는거지! 미안해... 다시는 그 단어를 입에 올리지 않을께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "03c166fc-84c7-408b-b71c-28f9bb1b9da3"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia covers Regongar's hand with hers.{/n} \"Prove? Why do you need to "
"prove anything? Haven't we known we love each other for nearly our whole "
"lives?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 레곤가르의 손에 자신의 손을 포갭니다.{/n} \"증명하려했다고? 증명할께 뭐있어? 우리 이때까지의 인생에 걸쳐 서로 "
"사랑한다는걸 확인해왔잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c0518f7c-0b1b-4ebb-a388-3bc9359b56bb"
msgid ""
"\"It's just that since we became free, you've pushed me away more and more! "
"You turn away, you yell, you get angry at I don't know what...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 자유를 되찾고나서부터, 넌 날 점점 밀어내기 시작했어! 자리를 피하고, 소리지르고, 이유도 모르는데 화를 내고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a823f0a2-35f8-47d2-b3cc-3e8bf51aa39d"
msgid ""
"\"You don't know what? You just said what! Just listen to yourself — you "
"just said why I get angry at you! Because you act like an unbearable... Oh. "
"I'm doing it again... I'm sorry, Reg, I'm sorry! What is this? We love each "
"other. I know that, you know that. Why are we such idiots that we can't stop "
"hurting each other?\" {n}The half-elf looks at you.{/n} \"Are you sure you "
"want to get involved with a couple like this? You see how we snap at each "
"other. You're likely to get caught in the middle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이유를 모르겠다고? 방금 네 입으로 말했잖아! 뭐가 문제일 것 같아? 네 말투가 내가 화가 난 이유야! 정말이지 네 행동을 견디기 "
"어려워... 오. 또 시작이네... 미안, 레지, 미안해! 이게 뭐람! 우린 서로 사랑하잖아. 우리 둘 다 알고 있는데, 왜 서로에게 "
"상처 주는 말만 하는 걸까, 구제불능 멍청이처럼?\" {n}하프 엘프는 당신을 바라봅니다{/n} \"이런 커플과 계속 연인으로 남고 "
"싶나요? 우리가 서로를 어떻게 대하는지 봤잖아요. 분명 가운데에 껴서 곤란해질 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "03c6e135-b446-402c-8a1a-530eca6fd73e"
msgid ""
"\"Then maybe just for you I'll make sure I listen to the ones I love, and "
"think about it before I say or anything stupid.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 특별히 네겐, 뭔가 멍청한 걸 말하기 전에 항상 두번 생각하고, 사랑하는 사람의 말을 확실히 듣겠다고 맹세하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e3efaf02-4fd2-4415-bcb4-32fa2a9e33c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia takes your hand in hers.{/n} \"The three of us have had a tough "
"life. And you know... The kingdom, our companions, the money and the glory — "
"all of this can go away in a day. All we really have is each other. Let's "
"promise ourselves we'll stay together — no matter what happens!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신의 손을 잡습니다.{/n} \"우리 셋은 힘든 삶을 살아왔어요. 그리고 당신도 알다시피... 왕국이나 동료, 돈, "
"영광 - 이 모든건 한 순간에 사라질 수 있지요. 우리가 진정 가진 것은 우리들 서로의 관계에요. 무슨 일이 생기건- 우리 영원히 함께 "
"하겠다고 약속하도록 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9e11c5f0-138c-4c44-b6ec-5b2b9573dcc7"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, that's a fact! Anyway, thanks for talking some sense into us. "
"Octavia, I promise you, I'm more afraid of losing you than anything else in "
"the world. And when you push me away, I just lose my head. That's why I... "
"Do, well, everything I do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하 하, 참말이야! 어쨌든, 일리있는 얘기를 해줘서 고마워. 옥타비아, 약속할께, 난 너를 잃는 것보다 두려운 일은 이 세상에 없어. "
"네가 날 밀어낼 때마다 돌아버릴 것 같아. 그게 내가...내가 하는 모든 일의 이유야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1de351d5-39c8-4ebb-8792-9041e0acfcf7"
msgid ""
"\"I'm also afraid of losing you. I promise I won't push you away any more. "
"Just promise me that you'll at least sometimes think before you say or do "
"things, all right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 널 잃을까봐 두려워. 나도 더이상 널 밀어내지 않겠다고 약속할께. 그저 적어도 때때로 말하거나 행동하기전에 한번 쯤 생각을 "
"해주겠다고 약속해줘, 할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "5a95f042-a91c-44af-994b-e6793d4fe566"
msgid "{n}Octavia and Regongar seal their vows with a passionate kiss.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아와 레곤가르는 열정적인 키스로 맹세를 갈음합니다 .{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "af8c08d5-d6af-4f48-b3eb-6a8359521a14"
msgid "{n}Regongar takes you by the hand.{/n} \"I promise!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 당신의 손을 잡습니다. {/n} \"맹세할께!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8535432f-072a-474d-9860-9e04b4cdf916"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? You're right! If this relationship is bringing us nothing "
"but pain, then maybe it would be better if we end it!\" {n}Octavia gets up "
"from the table, storms out of the tavern, and slams the door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이거 알아요? 당신이 맞아요! 우리 관계가 고통만 가져다 준다면, 끝내버리는 게 더 낫겠지요!\" {n}자리에서 일어나, 옥타비아는 "
"문을 쾅하고 닫으며 술집에서 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9182b5f8-7c11-478f-a254-8ff052d4b46b"
msgid ""
"\"Well that didn't take long, did it? All right... At least you're honest! "
"As opposed to somebody else we know! Who says she loves me and then always "
"finds reasons to pout and make me crawl begging for just a little warmth!\" "
"{n}Regongar jumps up from the table, runs outside and slams the door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"긴 시간은 아니었지? 좋아... 적어도 넌 내게 정직했으니까! 우리가 아는 누군가완 다르게 말이지! 날 사랑한다고 했다가 언제나 "
"뿌루퉁해질 이유를 찾고선 내가 조그마한 다정함을 구걸하게 만드는 그 사람 말이야!\" {n}레곤가르는 자리에서 벌떡 일어나, 문을 쾅하고 "
"닫으며 밖으로 뛰쳐나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7be07fc5-52df-44dd-b875-31a99212234f"
msgid ""
"\"Will you tell Tristian that it's over between you and him? He'll "
"understand. But he won't be able to share you with me.\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안에게 이젠 둘 사이는 끝이라고 얘기해주겠어? 이해야 해주겠지만, 나와 널 나눠쓰진 못할꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3fa6e482-5ee6-4442-97c3-fd6991ce3eed"
msgid ""
"\"Will you tell Valerie that it's over between you and her? She'll "
"understand. But she won't be able to share you with me.\""
msgstr "\"발레리에게 이젠 둘 사이는 끝이라고 얘기해주겠어? 이해야 해주겠지만, 나와 널 나눠쓰진 못할꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2c6eed96-7b44-4400-8e10-247f57396afd"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian still hopes it's just going to be you and him. Don't lead the boy "
"on, all right? Tell him it's over or you'll just end up making him suffer "
"for nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안은 여전히 너와 단둘이 사귀길 원할꺼야. 질질 끌지는 말자고, 알았지? 가서 이제 끝이라고 말해, 그렇지 않으면 그를 "
"이유없이 고통스럽게 할 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c7520d0b-a8f3-4867-92ee-3517552a3c42"
msgid ""
"\"Valerie still hopes it's just going to be you and her. Don't lead the girl "
"on, all right? Tell her it's over or you'll just end up making her suffer "
"for nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"발레리는 여전히 너와 단둘이 사귀길 원할꺼야. 질질 끌지는 말자고, 알았지? 가서 이제 끝이라고 말해, 그렇지 않으면 그녀를 이유없이 "
"고통스럽게 할 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "99d0a3fc-7b60-445f-9ea5-5988d66ce315"
msgid ""
"{n}You sit holding hands and looking at each other. Then anxiety runs across "
"Octavia's face.{/n} \"You know... Tristian likes you. Regongar and I "
"wouldn't mind, but he's not like us. He hopes it's just going to be you and "
"him. Don't lead the boy on, all right? Tell him it's over or you'll just end "
"up making him suffer for nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 손을 잡고 서로를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"당신도 알다시피... 트리스티안은 당신을 좋아해요. 레곤가르와 난 신경쓰지 않지만, "
"그는 우릴 좋아하지 않고요. 그는 당신과 단둘이 사귀길 바랄꺼에요. 질질 끌지는 말자고요, 알았죠?가서 이제 끝이라고 말하세요 그렇지 "
"않으면 그를 이유없이 고통스럽게 할 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f1f4b5db-4577-4d18-94f0-cc1a3d88b2ac"
msgid ""
"{n}You sit holding hands and looking at each other. Then anxiety runs across "
"Octavia's face.{/n} \"You know... Valerie likes you. Regongar and I wouldn't "
"mind, but she's not like us. She hopes it's just going to be you and her. "
"Don't lead the girl on, all right? Tell her it's over or you'll just end up "
"making her suffer for nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 손을 잡고 서로를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"당신도 알다시피... 발레리는 당신을 좋아해요. 레곤가르와 난 신경쓰지 않지만, "
"그녀는 우릴 좋아하지 않고요. 그녀는 당신과 단둘이 사귀길 바랄꺼에요. 질질 끌지는 말자고요, 알았죠? 가서 이제 끝이라고 말하세요 "
"그렇지 않으면 그녀를 이유없이 고통스럽게 할 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fdb86291-dd09-4f09-949d-9e3aad7aa2fb"
msgid ""
"\"This, right here, is what I'm talking about! It's not a tender word to me, "
"and you know it! Look at {name}: {mf||s}he respects my requests, even if "
"{mf||s}he finds them unreasonable, because {mf||s}he respects me. Reg, "
"you're always doing something crazy that I didn't ask you to do, don't want "
"you to do — or even asked you not to do — and then you say it's all because "
"of this great big love you have for me. Well if you love me so much, why is "
"it you don't care for what I say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게, 바로 이게, 내가 말하는 거라고! 그건 내게 다정한 단어가 아니야, 그리고 넌 그걸 잘 알고 있잖아. {name}을 봐: 날 "
"존중해주니까 내 부탁이 비이성적이라 할지라도 존중해주잖아. 레그, 넌 내가 부탁하지도 않고, 원하지도 않고, 하지말라고 부탁한 미친 "
"짓들을 하곤 하지, 단지 네가 날 무지 사랑한다는 이유만으로 말이야. 네가 날 그렇게 사랑한다면, 왜 내 말을 배려하지 않는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fa543e48-def0-43ae-9859-31ece46156ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar's voice dulls, and he speaks slowly, like a growling dog "
"preparing to attack.{/n} \"'If?' 'If?' So after all these years... After "
"everything we've been through... After everything I've done for you... "
"You're still not sure if I love you? If you're so happy with {Name} and so "
"miserable with me — maybe I should just go, and not stand in the way of your "
"happiness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마치 으르렁거리며 공격을 준비하는 개처럼, 레곤가르의 목소리가 무디고 느려집니다.{/n} \"'만약?' '만약?' 그 모든 세월과 "
"우리가 겪어온 모든 일에도... 내가 널 사랑한다는 걸 여전히 확신하지 못하는거야? 네가 {Name}와 함께 있을 때 행복하고, 나와 "
"있을 땐 불행하다면 - 네 행복한 앞길을 막지말고 꺼져줘야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ec213496-eae6-4e08-b469-7b35eba5d444"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you keep pushing me away — and the more I try for you, the worse it "
"gets? You know, it's just a word... A tender word! You know I call you that "
"because I love you, not because I'm trying to make you my posession or some "
"other insane reason you made up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 날 계속 밀어내는 건데 — 내가 널 위할수록, 왜 더 심해지는거지? 너도 알잖아, 그건 단어 하나일 뿐이야... 다정한 단어지! "
"널 사랑하기 때문에 그렇게 부른다는 걸 잘 알고 있잖아, 널 내 소유로 만들거나 네가 지어낸 정신나간 다른 이유 때문이 아니란걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_2/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b8d70d45-b616-4a65-a5e4-237880e34a48"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks away.{/n} \"That's not what I meant... Your love hurts. "
"It's too fierce, too aggressive. You leave me no space at all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 고개를 돌립니다{/n} \"내말 뜻은 그게 아니야. 네 사랑은 상처를 줘. 너무 맹렬하고, 공격적이야. 넌 내게 전혀 "
"쉴틈을 안준다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "48ffbf7c-95e3-4ca1-a750-81bb0d820d2d"
msgid ""
"\"Our kingdom and our very lives are hanging by a thread. Let's postpone the "
"wedding until the victory!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 왕국과 우리 자신의 생명이 실낱같은 희망에 달려 있습니다. 결혼식은 승리 이후로 미루기로 합시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ad446af1-7743-4184-a6c8-ca90a436da55"
msgid "\"I have no idea what I'd do without you.\""
msgstr "\"너희들 없이 뭘 해낼 수 있었을까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "5f97d5f6-f763-4536-8ff6-38a5305280d4"
msgid ""
"\"It's not difficult to perform a miracle if you have somebody to do it for!"
"\""
msgstr "\"대신 해줄 사람만 있다면야 기적을 행하는 것도 어려운 일은 아니지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "0d21cd6c-1e3d-43e0-8ea4-372ac9670072"
msgid ""
"\"I love you, but I don't want a wedding. There's no ritual that could make "
"us closer than we already are.\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신을 사랑해요, 하지만 결혼식은 원하지 않아요. 어떤 의식도 지금 우리를 보다 가깝게 만들 순 없을테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "efc9655e-28aa-4556-9b7d-90513557012e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tonight Octavia and Regongar are especially passionate. When everything "
"is over, the three of you lay there for a while, holding each other and "
"panting, unable to let go.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}오늘밤, 옥타비아와 레곤가르는 특별히 더 열정적입니다. 모든게 끝나고, 셋은 잠시 그자리에 누워, 서로를 붙잡고 도닥입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f4b2b620-22d3-4278-81ec-bc4af3c825b3"
msgid ""
"\"It's a miracle we're together. Everything was against us, but here we are. "
"Alive... And even happy!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 함께 있다니 기적이나 다름없어요! 그 모든 일에도, 우린 살아남았어요... 그것도 행복하게! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "239de4bd-8e0c-4fc7-ab99-3cf3954a61a0"
msgid ""
"\"{Name} is a miracle. Who else could gather such a team of pariahs, exiles "
"and outcasts? And not just gather, but give each of them a new home and "
"another chance?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{Name}의 존재가 기적이지. 누가 떠돌이, 추방자, 낙오자로 괜찮은 한 팀을 만들 수 있겠어? 걔들한테 집도 주고, 두 번째 "
"기회까지 줄 수 있는 사람은 얼마나 되고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eefa1e1b-a679-494d-a09e-d6de4842d1f3"
msgid ""
"\"That's so true. Listen...\" {n}A wild sparkle lights up Octavia's eyes.{/n}"
" \"I'm going to say something, just don't laugh. Let's... get married! All "
"three of us! {Name}, you're the {mf|King|Queen} — who's going to stop you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말이야. 잠깐 들어봐...\" {n}야성적인 눈빛이 옥타비아의 눈에 번뜩입니다.{/n} \"얘기할테니까 웃지만 말아요. 우리... "
"결혼해요! 셋이서요! {Name}, 당신은 {mf|왕|여왕}이잖아요 — 누가 당신을 가로막겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "618bc16f-6dbf-4d20-8999-18920b1f347f"
msgid ""
"\"Are you serious? You've always been against all that sort of...\" {n}"
"Regongar waves his hand.{/n} \"What about your freedom?\""
msgstr "\"진심이야? 넌 그런 것들을 언제나 반대해왔잖아...\" {n}레곤가르는 손을 내젓습니다.{/n} \"네 자유는 어쩌고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1a346344-6eca-4ad9-bf89-89e6024cb189"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia shrugs.{/n} \"Maybe I've grown up a little. Or maybe I just "
"learned to tell the difference between dangerous strangers threatening my "
"freedom, and the people I love. I've said a lot of harsh things to both of "
"you. I was afraid of everything in the world, even you. But now I'm not. Now "
"I realize that we can only really be free when we're together.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"내가 조금은 어른이 된걸지도 몰라. 아니면 이제 막 내 자유를 위협하는 위험한 이방인과 날 "
"사랑해주는 사람의 차이점을 깨달은 것이겠지. 둘 모두에게 가혹한 말을 많이 해왔지요. 난 세상의 모든 게 두려웠어요, 당신도 포함해서요. "
"하지만 이젠 아니에요. 우리가 함께 있을 때야 비로소 내가 진정으로 자유롭다는 걸 깨달았거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c7bb8c7a-947c-4d67-8e99-c9226fd8b2e7"
msgid "\"Deal! Now we have another reason to win no matter what it takes!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 이제 무슨 일이 있어도 승리해야할 또 다른 이유가 생겼군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2fb81737-57c6-40ce-889f-3fe17c4fd0ae"
msgid ""
"\"You're right. A ritual won't change anything. We're together — and that "
"can never be changed.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 옳아요. 예식은 아무것도 바꾸지 못하지요. 우리가 함께라는 사실은 그 어떤 것도 바꿀 수 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3f67dd3c-ce30-4f7a-85c2-ce12f009b146"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Now there's only one thing left to do — face the powers of this world "
"and another, and tear them all to pieces. People, monsters, fey, gods — "
"doesn't matter. Everyone who wants to take away our future. And then…\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 이제 할일이 딱 하나 남았군 — 이 세계와 저 세계의 권능을 마주하고 박살내는일 말이야. 사람들, 괴물들, 페이, 신들 — "
"누구든 상관 없어. 누구든 우리 미래를 가로채려 하는 놈들은 모조리 다 박살낼꺼야. 그리고 나면…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "855c3c1b-5280-4366-b509-a667997c0340"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc smiles.{/n} \"Then there will be just the three of us.\""
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"그리고 나면 이제 우리 단 셋이서만 있게 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "99b44167-8859-4591-90da-9818cd6f8d3d"
msgid ""
"\"So we really met for a reason. The gods aren't good for much, of course, "
"but sometimes they send gifts... Like the three of us to each other.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 우리가 정말 이유가 있어 만난거군요 . 신들이 우리에게 친절하지만은 않지만, 때때로 선물을 주곤 하지요... 우리 셋 서로처럼 "
"말이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "32e36fe6-9a9c-4109-94f5-0890a9fb3f4b"
msgid ""
"\"That's true. Fugitives and outcasts like us should love each other and do "
"miracles for one another. Who else would do anything for us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞는 말이야. 우리 같은 추방자와 방랑자들은 서로 사랑하며 서로에게 기적을 만들어줘야지. 우리 아니면 누가 그렇게 해주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b4ffe717-595b-43d4-ab10-d1b9b61e5edc"
msgid "\"Right here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8ece1646-e42e-4366-82b0-e984099eb8f3"
msgid "\"Perfect! And I want you two!\""
msgstr "\"대찬성입니다! 당신들 둘 모두요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "387dd3c6-4dd4-4bb5-b9e9-c69dfedf2baf"
msgid "\"Wait a bit. I have something to do first.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만 기다리십시오. 먼저 해야할 일이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9a3442cf-02a3-4c0e-ab66-476f81531687"
msgid ""
"{n}Entering the capital, Octavia and Regongar come up to you. The half-elf "
"leans over to your ear and whispers, biting it tenderly,{/n} \"I want you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}수도에 들어서자, 옥타비아와 레곤가르가 당신에게 다가옵니다. 하프 엘프는 몸을 기울여 당신의 귀를 부드럽게 물며, 조용히 "
"속삭입니다.{/n} \"당신을 원해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "08c29e2f-4dbe-4bb8-850f-0ce7bd474cf7"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar kisses your neck and whispers into the other ear,{/n} \"Right "
"now.\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 당신의 목에 키스하며, 다른 쪽 귀에 속삭입니다.{/n} \"지금 당장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3cd05a95-b83d-4a89-8fde-4148975a9ae0"
msgid "\"Yes!\""
msgstr "\"그래!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "566e1d09-8411-433c-ab2d-e6aba47d29f0"
msgid "\"No!\""
msgstr "\"아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0e19588c-b31b-4c97-8caa-84fd881cd583"
msgid ""
"{n}Taking you tenderly by the arms, the couple almost runs with you to the "
"palace.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}다정하게 팔짱을 끼고, 세 사람은 거의 뛰어가다시피 성으로 갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "29cfc0dd-6171-4077-a016-88e11e6aa83a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, Your Highness... Since when is love not a matter of national "
"importance?\""
msgstr "\"하, 전하... 언제부터 사랑이 국가적 중대사에서 빠지게 된건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "09795951-ba8d-4c6f-8eba-e55a11b49cc1"
msgid ""
"\"Let's go — stop arguing! It's the most important thing in the world right "
"now.\""
msgstr "\"가자고 - 말다툼은 그만하고! 지금은 이게 세상에서 가장 중요한 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "803d8470-a2db-463b-94af-e41a5fc89612"
msgid "\"Do you think it's my first time?\""
msgstr "\"이번이 내 첫경험이라 생각합니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4a8b00b6-78fd-4e18-979f-8dc08d1f1e44"
msgid "\"It was... Unusual.\""
msgstr "\"독특..했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "20de5347-2b4f-4673-8068-bf832cc83555"
msgid "\"I knew you two were dangerous... But now I see how much!\""
msgstr "\"당신들 둘이 위험한 줄은 알았지만... 이제 확실히 알겠군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "ea9b9ed8-d15f-48dc-8945-8b418c00aa18"
msgid "\"We need to do this more often.\""
msgstr "\"우리 좀 더 자주 해야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5f6b6302-70c0-4a67-92b5-a185049566ed"
msgid ""
"{n}After a hot night together, you're helping one another clean up...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뜨거운 밤을 함께 한 후, 당신은 상대방이 정리하는 걸 도와줍니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "04fc65be-5aa9-4776-9134-4ba611758f5c"
msgid "\"Reg, help me with these buttons!\""
msgstr "\"레그, 이 단추 잠그는 것 좀 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "adbfb8c7-57dd-4f89-98da-48c346100b4d"
msgid "\"Sure... Oh! I tore it.\""
msgstr "\"물론...오! 찢어버렸네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b3031d30-003e-49ed-b692-c95fcea682ed"
msgid ""
"\"As usual!\" {n}Octavia jokingly slaps Regongar on the nose, and he bites "
"her fingers, laughing.{/n}"
msgstr "\"또야!\" {n}옥타비아는 장난스럽게 레곤가르의 코를 찰싹 때리고, 레곤가르는 그녀의 손가락을 물고선 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6e099347-f22a-4d74-96df-6221fa6d2377"
msgid "\"What a wild night... Did you like it?\""
msgstr "\"정말 질퍽한 밤이었네요... 맘에 들었나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "37cefa98-3435-48a4-9c25-ee063d011f83"
msgid ""
"\"No. Judging by the unspeakable things you did here — definitely not!\""
msgstr "\"아니오. 당신들이 한 형언할 수 없는 짓을 따져보자면 — 절대 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e3f99483-c54b-4ac3-8335-c1adea638331"
msgid "\"You surprised us too!\""
msgstr "\"우리도 얼마나 네게 놀랐는지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e78ac058-5e0e-4ec1-ad53-cd7f25018c31"
msgid "\"You have no idea how much!\""
msgstr "\"상상도 못할꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "98216e26-cc3c-432c-b85d-05def07fe54b"
msgid "\"Exactly! It's always campaigns and battles...\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 언제나 원정과 전투뿐이었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f8052b29-9963-49b4-ac3e-eb18796a85a2"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia hugs you and Regongar.{/n} \"You know what? I love you. Both of "
"you. Do with that whatever you want!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신과 레곤가르를 껴안습니다.{/n} \"이거 알아요? 당신들을 사랑해요. 둘 모두. 원하는 대로 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cbe9d92c-730d-4623-80f8-e9efa5ac8ee3"
msgid ""
"\"What else can you do when you find your love? Spend time together. Drink, "
"laugh, look at the stars. Help {mf|him|her} conquer all the neighboring "
"lands... The everyday joys of lovers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사랑하는 사람을 찾은 다음엔 뭘 하겠어? 같이 시간을 보내는거지. 마시고, 웃고, 별들도 보고. {mf|그|그녀}가 이웃 땅을 모조리 "
"점령하는 걸 도와주고... 연인들에겐 매일이 즐거움에 연속이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "09aa6531-5f76-4fe0-b22b-51e4c3933d42"
msgid "[Do not interfere]"
msgstr "[끼어들지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "79c5af95-df42-4b3f-ad12-907d85f26046"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, think. You're upsetting her. Is that any way to treat someone "
"you love?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 생각을 좀 해봐. 옥타비아를 화나게 하고 있잖아. 다른 방식으로 사랑하는 사람을 대할 순 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "07321ad8-f513-4617-9d8a-2398668efcc3"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia, you're wrong. Everything Regongar does, he's doing it for you "
"with all his heart. Why not thank him for a change?\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아, 네가 틀렸어. 레곤가르는 진심을 다해 너를 위해 모든 걸 해왔던 거야. 적어도 고맙다고는 해야 하지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "a5706654-6f17-4026-9675-ebf81bcde68b"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking at you and wondering... How did you ever survive Numeria if "
"you treat each other like this?\""
msgstr "\"너희를 보고 있자니 궁금해지는데...이런 식으로 지내왔다면 누메리아에선 어떻게 살아남은거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3ef9cf0c-12c1-4330-a307-9f427e2292a0"
msgid ""
"\"There's this cantankerous old woman in the capital — I can't stand her! "
"She wanders around everywhere with a huge shaggy dog that always barks or "
"even bites! And the owner just doesn't care — she just says that her monster "
"is playing!\""
msgstr ""
"\"수도에 성미가 고약한 할머니가 있는데, 도저히 참아줄 수가 없어요! 언제나 커다란 털복숭이 개를 끌고 돌아다니는데, 그 개는 언제나 "
"짖고 때론 물기까지 한다니까요! 그 할머니는 신경도 안써요 — 그 괴물이 그저 장난치는 것 뿐이라나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6b951199-3f29-4777-87b6-88e0a3223f93"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar smiles a broad smile.{/n} \"Ha ha, you've complained about her "
"already! You can forget about it — she won't bother anyone again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 크게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"하 하, 전에도 한 번 그 할머니 불평을 했었지! 이제 신경꺼도 돼. 그 할머니가 다시는 "
"아무도 괴롭히지 못할꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "63b4efd5-1ed2-44a7-852c-460983107457"
msgid "\"What? Why?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고? 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "03e1a079-585d-47b9-9d30-fa428c63d9af"
msgid ""
"\"I torched the hairy beast. It's just a pile of ashes now. Then I made the "
"hag lick the ashes from the paving stones. She enjoyed scaring strangers — "
"so I gave her a little scare of her own, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그 털복숭이를 조금 건드려줬거든. 이제 잿더미에 불과하지. 그리곤 그 마귀할멈에게 도로 위에 있는 잿더미를 핥게 시켰어. 그 "
"노인이 지나가는 사람을 놀래키는 걸 좋아하곤 했잖아 - 내가 그대로 되돌려 줬지, 하 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "56fd828e-7357-43a1-995c-6f5ad27c2b7f"
msgid "\"Reg! What the... Why? What have you done!?\""
msgstr "\"레그! 그 무슨... 왜 그랬어? 무슨 짓을 한거야!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cf33eb87-07c6-4a8b-80c8-328a496e1539"
msgid ""
"{n}The smile leaves the half-orc's face.{/n} \"What? I didn't even touch "
"her, just the monster... You said yourself how tired you are of the old hag! "
"So I thought I'd make you happy! {Name}, come on, tell her.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크의 얼굴에서 미소가 사라집니다{/n} \"뭘? 할머니는 건드리지도 않았어, 그냥 그 괴물만 건드렸지... 네가 그 마귀할멈이 "
"얼마나 귀찮게 하는지 말했었잖아! 그래서 널 행복하게 해줄까 싶어서 그런거야! {Name}, 좀 들어봐, 옥타비아에게 얘기 좀 해주라고."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "06006956-48bc-4e7b-ad88-99a801e7932a"
msgid ""
"\"Happy? Are you serious? Regongar, you're just... Ugh, I'm so furious!\" {n}"
"The half-elf clenches her fists.{/n} \"Did I ask you to do it? Or maybe on "
"the contrary — I asked you a hundred times NOT to do things like that?! Why, "
"why don't you ever listen? You always do the craziest thing a demon would "
"think of, and then say you did it for me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"행복이라고? 진심이야? 레곤가르, 넌 정말.. 윽, 정말 열받네!\" {n}하프 엘프는 주먹을 꽉 쥡니다.{/n} \"내가 그러라고 "
"부탁했었어? 아니 그 반대로 — 내가 그런 짓을 하지 말아달라고 수백 번을 부탁했잖아?! 도대체 왜 듣지를 않는건데? 넌 언제나 마귀나 "
"할 미친 짓을 해놓곤, 날 위해서 했다고 말하잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d83d4da4-3438-49d1-9560-6039fdd2c446"
msgid ""
"\"But it really was for you! What's so wrong about it? You know, I love you "
"and I'm ready to do anything for you! I'll move mountains! I'll rip out "
"anyone's throat! And all I get in return is a scolding! I'll do anything for "
"you — and you don't even care! You're always mad at me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇지만 정말 널 위해 한 일인걸! 뭐가 문제야? 너도 알다시피, 난 너를 사랑하고, 너를 위해서라면 뭐든지 할꺼야! 산도 옮겨줄 수 "
"있다고! 그 누구의 목도 따줄 수 있어! 그런데도 고작 내가 받는 게 혼나는 것 뿐이라니! 널 위해선 무엇이든 해 줄 수 있는데, 넌 "
"신경조차 안쓰지! 언제나 화풀이만 할 뿐이고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0a5dc323-0ed4-41d4-8369-729dcf97ae4f"
msgid ""
"\"What, am I supposed to thank you? For random acts of throat-ripping? For "
"doing things I've asked you not to do? If you're doing everything for me, "
"then maybe for once you strain your ears and listen to what I have to say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고, 내가 너한테 감사라도 해야 한다는거야? 막무가내로 사람 모가지를 따는 일로? 내가 제발 그러지 말라고 부탁한 일을 두고? "
"네가 날 위해 뭐든 할 수 있다면, 제발 한 번이라도 귀를 열고, 내가 하는 말을 들어줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "05bd8dee-4856-4892-98f9-209a7dbd7f98"
msgid ""
"\"What, am I not listening? You said the hag made you angry — so I handled "
"the hag! And you're mad at me again! What am I supposed to do to make you "
"happy? Bite my own head off?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐, 내가 듣지를 않았다고? 그 마귀 할멈이 짜증난다고 네가 말했잖아. 그래서 그 할머니를 손봐준 것 뿐이고! 그러고 나니 이번엔 "
"나한테 짜증을 내고 있어! 널 행복하게 해주려면 뭘 어떻게 해야할까? 내 목이라도 물어야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fc4a682f-c19d-42ef-868d-b56dc8c965c8"
msgid ""
"\"Reg... Shut up, just shut up. Another word, and I'll say something I'll "
"regret later!\" {n}The half-elf turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"레그.. 입닥쳐, 그냥 입 다물라고. 한마디만 더하면, 난 나중에 후회할 말을 할지도 몰라!\" {n}하프 엘프는 자리를 "
"떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "dc9e412a-a42a-42a5-84b1-42900b2a303f"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc looks at the back of her head resentfully, biting his "
"lip.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프 오크는 입술을 깨물며, 그녀의 뒤통수를 노려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b8711de4-4372-4798-bc3a-0acef46c5dc4"
msgid ""
"\"Are you on his side? Burning a dog alive — you think that's normal? He "
"keeps attacking everyone and expects me to be happy about it. Even though "
"I've told him a hundred times not to do it! Would you like this? I don't!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그의 편을 드는거야? 개를 산 채로 태워버리다니, 그게 정상인이 할 만한 행동이라고? 레곤가르는 모두를 공격해놓고 내가 기뻐하길 "
"원하는거야. 내가 그러지 말라고 수백 번이나 말했었는데도! 그런 걸 좋아하는거야? 난 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d36af898-692f-4a2e-9204-a1bfe694d10f"
msgid ""
"\"You never like anything. Don't kill this one, don't say that... Do you "
"like me at all? Do you even still love me?\""
msgstr "\"넌 뭐든 좋아하는 법이 없지. 죽이지 말아라, 말하지 말아라... 날 좋아하긴 하는거야? 날 여전히 사랑하긴 하는거냐고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cf6ce6a3-547a-4bb2-b74e-5333aa3f35e0"
msgid ""
"\"Are you on her side? What did I do? So I scared a hag so she'd stop "
"bullying strangers! Some other time I chased away a creep who was messing "
"with her. And I got her a cape — a nice warm one! And she still wasn't happy!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 편을 드는거야? 내가 뭘했다고? 난 그저 마귀 할멈에게 겁을 줘서 지나다니는 사람들을 괴롭히는 걸 못하게 했을 뿐인데! 전엔 "
"그녀를 괴롭히는 찐따 자식을 하나 쫓아냈었지. 그리고 망토도 하나 구해주고. 멋지고 따뜻한 거였어! 그런데도 기뻐하지 않더라니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "49bc002a-cef3-43c4-9ef8-abc53d8e2212"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, he wasn't messing with me! If he was, I would have handled him "
"myself! The poor fellow was just asking me the way! And you didn't 'chase "
"him away', you stabbed him with a knife! And for the cape you slaughtered an "
"innocent traveler and two of her companions! After I specifically asked you "
"not to touch them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"레그, 그 사람은 날 괴롭히던게 아니었어! 그랬더라도, 나 스스로 처리할 수 있었을거야! 그 불쌍한 사람은 그저 길을 물어봤을 "
"뿐이라고! 그리고 넌 그냥 '쫓아'낸게 아니었잖아, 칼로 찔렀지. 그리고 그 망토는 무고한 여행객과 일행 두 명을 학살해서 구해준거잖아! "
"내가 일일이 그 사람들을 건들지 말라고 부탁했는데도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5ea6ece0-ea2b-4288-8e2f-35ee5ea68fae"
msgid ""
"\"If they'd given me the cape willingly, I wouldn't have touched anyone... "
"The cape was perfect, just right for you! I almost lost an eye getting it, "
"and got an arrow in the side — and for what? You didn't even put it on! I "
"didn't say anything back then, but its... It's like spitting in my face! Why "
"do you keep doing this to me, huh? Do you even still love me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"망토를 순순히 줬다면, 아무도 건들지 않았을거야... 그 망토는 완벽했어, 딱 너한테 어울리는 거였지! 난 거의 한쪽 눈을 잃을 "
"뻔했어, 그리고 옆구리엔 화살도 한 대 맞았고. 그런데 뭐야? 넌 그걸 걸쳐보지도 않았어! 그땐 얘기하진 않았지만... 마치 내 얼굴에 "
"침을 뱉은 것 같았지! 나한테 왜 계속 이러는 건데, 응? 날 여전히 사랑하긴 하는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "6403d761-e87d-4047-8966-56bd3983716f"
msgid "{n}The couple stops yelling, embarrassed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}두 사람은 고함치는 걸 멈추고, 쑥스러워합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "924c4f58-be41-40a7-ac5d-1885b5f16f4d"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, I'm sorry. I love you very much. And I'm very grateful for everything "
"you've done for me. If it wasn't for you, I wouldn't have survived, it's "
"true. It's just... You know, I don't like excessive violence. Please, for me "
"— be just a tiny bit less bloodthirsty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"레그, 미안해. 널 정말 사랑해. 그리고 네가 날 위해 해준 모든 것에 대해 고마워. 네가 없었으면, 난 살아남지 못했겠지, 그건 "
"사실이야. 그저... 너도 알잖아, 난 지나친 폭력은 좋아하지 않아. 제발, 날 위해서, 조금만 피를 덜봐주면 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f736a930-ce28-45e2-927e-083ec50d2c0e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry too. You know, I am what I am, it's hard for me to be someone "
"else. But I'll try, I will. Just don't forget, I'm doing it for you. Even if "
"it's something stupid or gross or upset you... I don't mean it to. I love "
"you. Without you I have no reason to live.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 미안해. 너도 알다시피, 이게 내 본성이야, 다른 사람처럼 행동하는 건 내게 쉽지 않아. 하지만 노력하고, 잊지 않으려고 "
"노력할게. 내가 뭔가 멍청하고 끔찍하고 화나는 일을 하더라도... 일부러 그러려고 한 건 아니야. 난 널 사랑해. 너 없이는 이 세상에서 "
"살 이유가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_2-Quarrel/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "ff1e4512-967d-4402-b6d6-dc30927f1315"
msgid "{n}Octavia and Regongar embrace.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아와 레곤가르는 포옹합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b87e4767-bbfe-45c8-9db7-e24860af35d5"
msgid ""
"\"Now is no time to discuss your dreams. We're on the march! Pack up and "
"we're off!\""
msgstr "\"당신 꿈에 대해 얘기할 시간은 없습니다. 우린 행군 중이란 말입니다! 짐 싸고 움직여요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "61fdd7f0-18ab-481e-8d83-2f35f7b658ef"
msgid ""
"\"I see you didn't get much sleep. Should we stay here a little longer?\""
msgstr "\"잠을 잘 못잔 것 같습니다. 잠시 더 머물도록 할까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "5e51be61-7dd0-4838-af64-7b4565589e4a"
msgid ""
"\"I'll try to find you a doctor or a wizard who can make these dreams go "
"away.\""
msgstr "\"당신 꿈을 막아줄 의사나 마법사를 찾아보도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9b2841e2-bb15-4e55-a5fd-6173ea93d65e"
msgid "\"Maybe the dreams will fade in time.\""
msgstr "\"시간이 지나면 꿈은 사라질 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b353f23c-ccf1-49ca-b777-1a55baa55b32"
msgid ""
"\"Next time you're not sleeping well, wake me up. I have some... medicine "
"for you!\""
msgstr "\"다음에 잠이 잘 안올땐, 날 깨우면 됩니다. 내겐... 그런 당신을 위한 처방이 몇 개 있거든요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "4e8fd59f-c6d0-4432-b62a-d04bf2ec5a7b"
msgid ""
"\"You might think so. But in fact you're kicking so much that my legs are "
"covered in bruises the next morning!\""
msgstr "\"그럴지도요. 사실은 당신이 하도 발길질을 해서, 내 발이 내일이면 멍투성이가 될 것 같습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "a097d88e-4273-4c33-bb11-a63d3fd2031a"
msgid "\"You're never going back there, ever.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 그곳으로 돌아갈 일은 절대로 없을겁니다, 절대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a92864a7-f4e4-4d55-a58b-406aafdb97dc"
msgid ""
"\"Do you ever want to actually return to Numeria? As free people, not as "
"fugitives?\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에 돌아가보고 싶은 적은 한번도 없었습니까? 도망 노예가 아니라 자유인으로서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7fa62daf-537a-4665-b19a-b5ec7c98840a"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia doesn't look well: her eyes are red and swollen, and she looks "
"lost. When she notices you watching her, she smiles sadly.{/n} \"Same thing "
"every night...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 좋아보이지 않습니다: 눈은 충혈되고 부어있습니다. 그리고 뭔가 잃어버린 듯한 모습입니다. 당신이 그녀를 쳐다보는 걸 "
"눈치채자, 슬프게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"매일 밤 같은 꿈을 꿔요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "66499d7e-20e6-4a21-b488-b9459f4afc4f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... I used to dream about everything they did to me in "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. But now there are new nightmares instead: I'm not in "
"my tent, but in {g|Starfall}Starfall{/g}, or {g|Hajot Hakados}Hajoth "
"Hakados{/g}, or in a boat sailing the {g|Little Sellen River}Sellen{/g}... "
"And I know the {g|Technic League}Technic League's{/g} agents are there. "
"They're about to get us — but I can't move!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요... {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 그들이 내게 한 모든 짓들을 꿈에서 보곤 했지요. 하지만 요즘은 새로운 악몽을 "
"꾸고 있어요. 꿈에서 난 내 텐트가 아니라 {g|Starfall}스타폴{/g}이나 {g|Hajot Hakados}하소쓰 하카도스{/g} "
"아니면 {g|Little Sellen River}셀렌{/g}을 항해하는 배 위에 있어요... 그리고 {g|Technic League}기술 "
"연맹{/g}의 요원이 주위에 있다는걸 깨달아요. 우릴 잡기 직전인데 - 난 꼼짝도 할 수 없었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b42cb2c1-7f09-4156-8730-8336e211773d"
msgid ""
"\"I even went to a temple — thought maybe it was a curse or something. The "
"priestess told me that gods and magic have nothing to do with it — that it's "
"all in my head. It's not like I can get rid of my head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 일종의 저주인가 싶어서 — 신전에도 가봤죠. 여사제는 내 꿈은 신들이나 마법과는 아무런 연관이 없다고 했어요 — 그저 내 머리 "
"속에서 일어나는 일일 뿐이라고 했죠. 그렇다고 내 머리를 떼어버릴 순 없는거잖아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3d719863-0bd9-437e-b43b-21ba68005c66"
msgid ""
"\"No, don't. If I did go back to sleep, the nightmares would only come back. "
"I'm fine, really! Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 그러지 말아요. 내가 잠들면, 악몽이 다시 찾아올꺼에요. 난 괜찮아요, 정말로요! 가요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d2c26158-f161-486d-855f-9519deda114d"
msgid "\"Yes, of course! I'm ready.\""
msgstr "\"그래요, 물론이죠! 준비됐어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e5196596-14d3-415a-b130-166b76a43ffc"
msgid "\"Yeah, me too. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"그래요, 나도 그래요. 가요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e19c648a-fbe9-4283-b011-acb82435e0f4"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. But I've looked myself — to no avail. Don't worry, they're only "
"dreams.\""
msgstr "\"고마워요. 하지만 스스로 느끼건데 큰 문제는 없는 것 같아요. 걱정하지 말아요, 그냥 꿈이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a1a6d064-d425-4e02-8ea2-b9a588e4cb00"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf smiles at you.{/n} \"You're so worried about me... Don't be. "
"In {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, Reg and I lived a waking nightmare, and we "
"dreamed happy dreams of freedom. Now we live happy as ever — so the "
"nightmare had to move into my dreams. The druids must be right when they say "
"there's a balance everywhere in nature.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프 엘프는 당신에게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"당신은 내가 정말 걱정되나보내요.., 그러지 말아요. "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 나와 레그는 악몽 속에서 산거나 다름 없으니까요 - 자유를 찾는 행복한 꿈을 꾸면서 말이죠. 이제 "
"행복하고 자유롭게 살고 있으니 - 악몽이 내 꿈자리를 대신했나봐요. 드루이드들이 자연 어디든지 균형이 존재한다고 했는데 그 사람들 말이 "
"맞나 봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6db72be0-00a6-4220-8f71-ab52593575cb"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, yeah, right. You and Reg can only think about one thing! "
"Although... Sure — why not try it!\""
msgstr "\"하하, 그래요. 당신과 레그는 오직 하나밖에 생각할 줄 모르죠! 그래도... 좋아요 - 시도나 해보죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d7012e65-a473-4782-b32b-abc88d1a4a19"
msgid "\"Maybe. No nightmare can live forever — we've killed enough to know!\""
msgstr "\"아마도요. 어떤 악몽도 영원하진 않습니다 - 우린 악몽같은 존재들은 여럿 잡아봤지 않습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "90c3c489-34c7-40a2-8f7a-4475226fef87"
msgid ""
"\"Let's stock up on good memories. Memories of victories, feasts... Maybe if "
"we pile enough up, they'll force the bad memories out!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋은 기억들을 상기해보도록 하십시오. 승리나, 만찬의 기억들... 그런 기억들이 충분히 쌓이면, 그 기억들이 나쁜 기억들을 "
"몰아내 줄 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8da57ad2-fba5-4611-8237-ef0c3568afa8"
msgid "\"Good plan!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각인데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b61b7336-7909-45e8-9720-214e30f1f421"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl's tired face brightens up with a smile.{/n} \"So I'm not the "
"only one suffering from these nightmares.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아의 지친 얼굴이 미소로 반짝입니다.{/n} \"그럼 이런 악몽에 시달리는 사람이 나뿐만이 아니군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e12791ef-5abc-453c-a2f8-1d9a25431425"
msgid "\"I know. But how do I tell that to the nightmares?\""
msgstr "\"알아요. 하지만 그걸 어떻게 악몽에게 말해줄 수 있을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2f4b9aea-6b76-4f7c-9172-d94f46f76ea3"
msgid ""
"\"No, {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} save me! I don't ever want to set foot on "
"{g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} soil ever again. Nothing but nightmares await me "
"there — old and new.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요, {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}께서 굽어 살피소서! 절대로 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 땅을 다시 밟고 "
"싶진 않아요. 거기선 악몽들 만이 날 기다릴뿐이에요 - 오래된 악몽이든, 새 악몽이든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "988533b9-7efa-4714-8b7d-464af3c6e674"
msgid ""
"\"Nightmares again?\" {n}The half-orc runs his fingers through Octavia's "
"hair compassionately.{/n} \"They just won't let you go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 악몽을 꾼거야?\" {n}하프-오크는 동정심을 담아 옥타비아의 머리를 손가락으로 매만져줍니다.{/n} \"도저히 널 가만두질 "
"않는구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-Past/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fd24955e-d717-418b-b822-2b4c9887a235"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so tired of this! You're suffering, and I can't do anything! Maybe "
"there's some magic to get them out of your head and smash them to pieces? "
"There must be something!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 짜증나! 네가 고통받는데, 난 아무것도 해줄 수 없다니! 혹시 네 머리속에서 악몽을 꺼내서 박살낼 수 있는 그런 마법같은게 "
"없을까? 분명 무슨 방법이 있을꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "59e5d20e-dff4-42cf-8123-e75147aded15"
msgid ""
"[Flick both on the forehead jokingly] \"Your sins have been absolved. Now "
"let's forget about it!\""
msgstr "[농담삼아 둘의 이마를 매만진다] \"너희의 죄는 사해졌노라. 이제 잊어버리도록 하거라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "dc5df8fa-e629-4430-b151-e55f96ade3ee"
msgid "\"Now we are together — that's what's important.\""
msgstr "\"지금 우리는 함께이지 않습니까 - 중요한 건 바로 그겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f27f8938-bf22-4526-ba4f-b3c46f158ca1"
msgid ""
"\"Did you not forget we have a campaign and probably more than one battle "
"ahead? Stop talking, time to go!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 원정과 하나 이상의 전투를 앞두고 있다는걸 잊은건 아니겠지요? 잡담은 그만합시다, 떠날 시간입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "57fa54b4-73b5-417f-ad9b-0fea8af3ca1f"
msgid ""
"{n}You, Octavia, and Regongar were so busy last night that you barely got "
"any sleep. In the morning, Octavia walks out of the tent, stretching.{/n} "
"\"Ah... That is the life! {Name}, Reg, you have no idea how much I love you. "
"What idiots we were to fight, be suspicious, and try to upset each other... "
"when I think how I was messing with your heads, with all the tests and "
"problems for no reason, I just want to go back in time and give myself a "
"thump on the head.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신과 옥타비아, 레곤가르는 어젯밤 너무 바빠서 잠을 거의 못잤습니다. 아침이 되자, 옥타비아는 텐트 밖으로 나와, 기지개를 "
"폅니다.{/n} \"아.. 이게 인생이지! {Name}, 레그, 둘 다 내가 얼마나 당신들을 사랑하는지 짐작도 못할꺼에요. 서로 싸우고 "
"의심하고 화나게하는데 시간을 보내다니 우린 얼마나 어리석었나요. 내가 이유없이 했던 이런저런 시험이며 비난으로 당신들 골치를 썩힌걸 "
"생각할 때마다, 시간을 되돌려 내 자신을 쥐어박아주고 싶다니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "504841e6-8b2d-4605-a281-f8bb02edd6c5"
msgid ""
"\"It wasn't for no reason. If someone needs a thump on the head, it's me. It "
"was me who was winding you up, remember? I was imagining you didn't need me, "
"that you were trying to get rid of me... And I ended up just scaring you and "
"actually turning you against me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이유가 없진 않았지. 머리를 쥐어박아줘야 할 사람이 있다면, 그건 바로 나야. 네 꼭지를 돌게했던 건 나였어, 기억나? 난 네가 날 "
"필요치 않아서 버리려 한다고 상상했었지... 결국 널 겁먹게 했고 나에게서 멀어지게 만들었잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1ad49a4c-8a6c-4642-9f8f-5533535dfd1f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid to remember it. We almost broke up back then. Imagine — we "
"survived {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, and when we got free, we almost threw "
"everything away. It's good that {Name} was around to talk some sense into us!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"기억하기도 겁나. 우린 그 때 거의 헤어질뻔했지. 상상해봐— 우린 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 살아남았고, 자유를 얻었고, "
"그리고 나선 모든 걸 버릴 뻔 했지., {Name}이 곁에서 우리 정신줄을 잡아줘서 참 다행이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1250fff5-a344-4aab-97ea-96e0ebc6b417"
msgid "\"No, no, we need to remember — so we never do it again.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 아니, 우린 기억해야해 - 그래야 다시는 그런 짓을 안하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2c4921b3-2532-4d84-bcde-2fd1eedb056b"
msgid ""
"\"You see... We had to grow up and learn to survive so early, we never got a "
"chance to just learn to live. Now we have to go through all the bumps and "
"bruises that the others get past while they're still young. So... Don't "
"judge us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 우린 너무 일찍부터 생존하는 법부터 배우며 자라와서, 평범하게 살아가는 법을 배울 기회가 전혀 없었어요. 남들이 어렸을 때 "
"이미 겪었던 성장통을 우린 이제야 겪어야하고요. 그러니.... 우릴 섯불리 판단하진 말아줬으면 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "80e2d495-678c-4339-a797-ac5392574fb7"
msgid "\"Yes, of course. I got carried away, sorry!\""
msgstr "\"알았습니다, 물론이지요. 내가 지나쳤습니다. 미안해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3bbce5d0-00a7-4d17-8f1e-f897843314de"
msgid ""
"\"We could chat a little. Our enemies aren't going to get away from us. And "
"the road has waited for us a thousand years. It can wait a bit longer... But "
"fine, fine, I'm ready. Let's go.\""
msgstr ""
"\"얘기 정돈 해도 되잖아. 적들은 여기서 멀리 떨어진 곳에 있고, 가는 길은 천년이 지나도 변하지 않을꺼고. 좀 더 기다려도 될 것 "
"같은데... 좋아, 알았어, 난 준비됐어. 가자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bccefa48-d936-4989-8cef-bbf44c071e39"
msgid ""
"\"Right. But knowing myself... I'm afraid it's just a matter of time before "
"I do something else stupid.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 하지만 나 자신은 내가 제일 잘 아는데... 내가 뭔가 멍청한 짓을 하는 건 시간문제일꺼라는 걱정이 드는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d8270661-e922-4a8a-bbd0-c109ba105f0e"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia touches Reg's shoulder.{/n} \"I always felt you were trying to "
"tie me down, and own me... And all you really wanted was to belong to me. To "
"know that I won't leave you. You said it so many times, but I didn't listen."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 레그의 어깨를 건드립니다.{/n} \"난 언제나 네가 날 묶어두고 소유하려 한다고 느껴왔어... 하지만 네가 진정 원한건 "
"오직 나에게 속하는 거였지. 그저 내가 널 떠나지 않는다는걸 알기 위해서 말이야. 넌 수없이도 얘기해왔지만, 난 듣지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "12c3cdfc-8405-42df-937c-82a969f83e5e"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc nods.{/n} \"And I didn't listen to you. You wouldn't have "
"had any reason to doubt me, if I didn't behave like a complete idiot.\" {n}"
"He turns to you.{/n} \"And without you we would probably have never "
"understood each other. We'd still be fighting — or maybe even... Ugh, I "
"don't even want to think about it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그리고 난 네 말을 듣지 않았고. 내가 완전 바보처럼 행동하지 않았다면 날 의심할 이유도 "
"없었을꺼야.\" {n}그는 당신에게 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"그리고 네가 없었다면 우린 영원히 서로를 이해하지 못했겠지. 여전히 "
"싸우고 있거나 - 아니면... 윽, 생각조차 하기 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/OctaviaRegongar/Stage_3-WeWereSilly/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9721a3d4-1529-413f-830a-bbe256d398d1"
msgid "\"Don't!\""
msgstr "\"그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_1_String
msgctxt "d07dd04f-fb66-4a0a-8349-939ce83f15d4"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about battle scars... But I cherish each scar I get from my "
"nights with you.\""
msgstr "\"전투에서 얻은 상처는 신경도 안써... 너와 보낸 밤에서 얻은 상처라면 모두 소중히 간직할꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_2_String
msgctxt "1443a0cc-aefb-48da-afbc-159c51622e53"
msgid "\"What's your wildest fantasy? Tell me. We'll do it next time!\""
msgstr "\"네 가장 야성적인 판타지는 뭐야? 얘기해봐. 다음에 하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_3_String
msgctxt "fb0f8ea3-ae76-47c5-abf0-d8c7dce59f36"
msgid "\"You're too tender with me. Don't be afraid of hurting me.\""
msgstr "\"넌 내게 너무 다정히 굴어. 나에게 상처주는 걸 두려워하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_4_String
msgctxt "8b4ac19c-11ab-4841-838e-b30fe4f19793"
msgid ""
"\"I hope we didn't wake up the whole palace... Ha ha ha — at least not the "
"whole city!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 궁궐 전체를 깨우지 않았으면 좋겠군... 하 하 하 -적어도 도시 전체까진 아니겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_5_String
msgctxt "05f0abc4-8068-4866-815d-054f19b75af9"
msgid "\"Want to go again? And again! And again!\""
msgstr "\"한번 더 할까? 그리고 또! 그리고 또!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_6_String
msgctxt "e6195d3c-8d52-42e5-afea-996ff91d6379"
msgid "\"I love you. The way you smell. The way you taste.\""
msgstr "\"널 사랑해. 네 냄새, 네 맛도\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/After_sex_7_String
msgctxt "3a215fcd-08f5-4996-8f53-a5ff3a47246f"
msgid "\"So Linzi wasn't wrong about you! You sure can strike an epic pose!\""
msgstr "\"린지가 틀리지 않았군! 영웅적인 자세로 칠 수도 있잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_1_String
msgctxt "a7dbf48a-2764-41db-ade1-051ae62884da"
msgid "\"I don't want to go anywhere...\""
msgstr "\"어디에도 가고 싶지 않안요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_2_String
msgctxt "f6adab27-fb3a-49de-b4de-56e25d0ec704"
msgid "\"May I use your comb?\""
msgstr "\"당신 빗 좀 써도 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Barks/Aftersex_idle_3_String
msgctxt "5a4dc98a-fb8f-4b01-abd3-5625a72fcd61"
msgid "\"Oh... There goes a button!\""
msgstr "\"오... 단추가 떨어져 버렸네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4a01f671-41cd-4b83-be3a-e8d0c7f5213d"
msgid ""
"\"By the way, someone promised to smother me with kisses... I'm still "
"waiting!\""
msgstr "\"어쨌거나, 누군가 날 키스로 위로해주겠다고 약속했는데.. 난 여전히 기다리고 있는 중입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f6eb1b11-6105-4f42-83f1-7be4978aeaa6"
msgid "\"Regongar, what do you think you're doing?!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 무슨 짓을 하는 겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "89133801-1162-45f0-9414-9ed100cc4345"
msgid "[Pull away] \"Regongar, stop. Let's not ruin our friendship.\""
msgstr "[밀어낸다] \\레곤가르, 그만하십시오. 난 우리 우정을 소중히 여깁니다. 그걸 망치지는 맙시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "1204b3e9-5191-404b-9fcd-c8b0487b5f13"
msgid "\"Regongar, what are you... There are people here!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 당신 무슨... 사람들이 있지 않습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "95693b87-d252-46ad-8100-a7879f91b763"
msgid "[Put your arm around Regongar in return]"
msgstr "[답으로 레곤가르에게 달라붙는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "ae8b5a99-847e-4f6c-a929-f33f42b4c50f"
msgid "\"I'd like to spend the night alone with Regongar.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르와 단 둘이서 밤을 지내고 싶습니다만\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "e6c17cb6-32b2-48ec-b56d-b4f7ca3a15ac"
msgid "[Leave with Regongar]"
msgstr "[레곤가르와 떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b89dfbb1-e458-4680-a53d-6928523f35e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Returning to the capital, you, Octavia and Regongar go to the tavern to "
"rest. After a couple of mugs, Regongar pulls out a deck of cards.{/n} \"Want "
"to play?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}수도에 돌아와, 당신과 옥타비아, 레곤가르는 쉬기 위해 선술집으로 갑니다. 몇 잔 마시고 레곤가르는 카드 덱을 꺼냅니다.{/n} "
"\"한판 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "60bf93fb-113d-4094-81e2-bb1c90c3b245"
msgid "\"A promise is a promise!\" {n}The half-orc kisses you on the lips.{/n}"
msgstr "\"약속은 약속이지!\" {n}하프-오크는 당신 입술에 키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cc4a0b65-a0a2-4059-854d-471ec4b82bf2"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar quickly pulls away his hand and scoots away from you.{/n} \"It's "
"just a bit of fun. Ha ha!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 재빨리 손을 빼곤 서둘러 당신에게서 떨어집니다. {/n} \"그냥 장난이야. 하 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "89646cee-d507-474e-9c29-9edf8ec729bf"
msgid "\"All right, all right, as you wish! Friends it is then!\""
msgstr "\"알았어, 았았다고, 원하는 데로! 그럼 친구로 지내자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3d606038-1b17-4fb3-aee3-8cbb9b887107"
msgid ""
"\"So what? Are we doing something they don't like, hmm?\" {n}The half-orc's "
"hand is stroking your thigh.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 뭐? 우리가 사람들이 싫어할 만한 일을 하고 있었나, 흠?\" {n}하프-오크의 손은 당신의 허벅지를 건드립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b91d4ab7-f172-41b0-8b2a-2d840416b80b"
msgid "{n}The half-orc clings to you, as his fingers stroke your thigh.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 당신을 껴앉고, 손가락으로 허벅지를 건드립니다..{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ab0329a8-01c0-4ede-b2a5-48d91d4cdd29"
msgid "\"Hey, mistress! Another round of drinks, we are dying of thirst here!"
msgstr "\"이봐, 주인장! 한 잔씩 더 줘, 목말라 죽겠다고!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "aa5840d6-dc42-4775-a003-c0b2bc7b991c"
msgid ""
"\"The beer here is good, but there's too many people. Maybe it's time we go "
"somewhere quieter?\""
msgstr "\"여기 맥주는 괜찮은데, 사람들이 너무 많아. 이제 좀 조용한 곳으로 가야지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "418f7173-daef-4977-a65d-e5b632327738"
msgid "\"I think it's high time... Octavia, are you coming?\""
msgstr "\"딱 적당한 시간인 것 같은데.. 옥타비아, 너도 올꺼야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7c2c1fa1-35f2-42ae-88cf-b349f25ca94d"
msgid ""
"\"The three of us?\" {n}The half-elf laughs as she sizes up you and "
"Regongar.{/n} \"I'm liking this evening more and more... {Name}, what about "
"you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"셋이서요?\" {n}하프 엘프는 당신과 레곤가를 재보며 웃습니다{/n} \"점점 이 밤일이 좋아지는데... {Name}, 당신은 "
"어때요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8073f83f-ac93-4a64-8c61-cdddff36a136"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think so.\" {n}The half-elf winks at you provocatively.{/n} \"Have "
"fun!\""
msgstr "\"난 별로.\" {n}하프 엘프는 도발적으로 윙크합니다.{/n} \"재밌게 놀아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4798e212-9d8c-441f-a07a-336413da83b3"
msgid "{n}Octavia winks at you.{/n} \"All right. Have fun!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신에게 윙크합니다.{/n} \"알았어요. 재밌게 놀아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9fe2e83f-6fcc-4879-945f-07e69466e81f"
msgid "\"Exactly! Come, my ladies — adventures await!\""
msgstr "\"내말이! 이리로 오시오, 내 연인이여 - 모험이 기다리고 있소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f525e157-b82b-47fd-ae88-1b41c2c15bf4"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar reluctantly takes his hands off of you and scoots over.{/n} \"Ah"
", that's a shame, then... All right — friends it is then!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 마지못해 손을 때고 당신에게서 멀어집니다.{/n} \"아, 안타깝네, 그럼... 좋아 - 친구로 지내자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "38ef3954-1326-4fc7-8f22-b6ad94f9b399"
msgid "\"Have fun!\""
msgstr "\"재밌게 놀아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ce695d60-3a0e-40bc-8251-db9e43bae247"
msgid "\"Exactly... All right, boys, let's go — I can't wait!\""
msgstr "\"내말이... 좋아요, 가자고요 - 기다리기 어렵네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5fa93b84-84a9-4a29-a551-4b28d8001b8b"
msgid "\"Why not? What are we playing for?\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다. 뭘 걸고 하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5a33b1fa-20cd-4074-90af-6e31a60a5720"
msgid "\"For our clothes, ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"옷벗기기 게임이지, 하 하 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "1ead9605-1e76-4046-8a3b-843d77ca6721"
msgid ""
"{n}Giggling, Octavia playfully slaps Regongar upside the head. In return the "
"half-orc bares his fangs in a broad grin and starts dealing cards.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}킬킬거리면서, 옥타비아는 레곤가르의 뒤통수를 때립니다. 하프-오크는 송곳니를 보이며 크게 미소짓고, 카드를 돌리기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5cfee0fd-b468-48a6-8ac6-636d662adf73"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, that's the sixth game in a row you've lost! Do you even know how to "
"play at all?\""
msgstr "\"레그, 여섯 판 연속으로 지고있잖아! 어떻게 치는 지 알고는 있는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_1/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "231016c9-1f5f-4ee9-844b-8c7919075c14"
msgid ""
"\"Not at all!\" {n}The half-orc scoots closer to you and, as if by accident, "
"puts his hand on your thigh.{/n} \"But I'm a spectacular undresser…\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀!\" {n}하프-오크는 당신 쪽으로 몸을 기울이다, 마치 우연인양, 손을 당신 허벅지에 얹습니다.{/n} \"하지만 내가 "
"옷벗는덴 선수거든…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "37425232-7996-43a2-9be9-fd1325cff34d"
msgid "\"You know what? Let's get married. Will you be my king?\""
msgstr "\"이거 압니까? 우리 결혼합시다. 나의 왕이 되어주겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "05a35de3-199c-4392-8638-a78567181e5f"
msgid "\"If we have a future — it's one it's one we share together.\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 미래가 있다면 - 그건 우리가 함께 나눌 미래일 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "58d446e3-5d60-49a4-ac97-4bc2850f098a"
msgid ""
"\"You've done a lot for me too. I have no idea how I would live without you."
"\""
msgstr "\"당신도 날 위해 많은 걸 해줬습니다. 당신 없이 어떻게 \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "7c5dcb34-1548-4010-af86-81cfa79042e4"
msgid ""
"\"I was very scared for you. Especially because you kept silence about your "
"feelings.\""
msgstr "\"당신 때문에 정말 두려웠어요. 특히 당신이 감정에 대해 말을 아꼈기에 더 그랬죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "25f28e4c-315c-4a24-8de2-e3bcbf611e83"
msgid ""
"{n}Tonight Regongar was especially passionate. He screamed in your arms, and "
"when it was over, he lay still for a long time, staring at the ceiling and "
"biting his lips.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}오늘 밤, 레곤가르는 특별히 더 열정적입니다. 그는 당신의 품 안에서 비명을 냈고, 모든 것이 끝난 후에는 한참동안 가만히 누워 "
"있었습니다. 입술을 깨문 채 천장을 바라보면서요.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "27c120e6-1ab0-4fe8-91d2-39d79b114669"
msgid ""
"\"You know... There was this chump in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} who went mad "
"because of all the torture. He thought there was no one in the world but "
"him. He said that when he closed his eyes, I disappeared. That's just about "
"how I've felt during the last few months. Like if you're not looking at me, "
"I don't exist. Like a ghost that's only real when you touch me. I cut my "
"skin to make sure I still have red blood.\""
msgstr ""
"\"있잖아... {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 고문을 받다가 미쳐버린 자가 한 명 있었어. 그 사람은 세상엔 자신 말곤 아무도 "
"없다고 생각했지. 자기가 눈을 감으면 내가 사라져버린다고 말했어. 요 몇 달간 나도 같은 느낌이 들었지. 네가 날 바라보지 않으면, 내가 "
"사라지는 것 같았거든. 마치 네 감촉을 느껴야만 현실에 돌아오는 유령이 된 기분이었어. 여전히 붉은 피를 가졌는지 확인하기 위해 내 몸에 "
"상처를 내곤 했었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a41eb37c-9243-4ea7-829f-c902ea84cf25"
msgid ""
"\"No one needs me. Especially myself. I'm not even alone, I'm simply nobody. "
"But you... {Name}, my {Name}... You've kept me alive. If you let me go for "
"even a moment, I'll probably fall right through the ground into "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}'s palm. It's only thanks to you that I can even "
"make myself move... And now I've started to feel alive again. For the first "
"time I feel like I have some sort of future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무도 날 필요로 하지 않았지. 특히 나 자신이 그랬어. 난 혼자인 것도 아니었지 .그저 아무도 아니었던거야. 하지만 넌... "
"{Name}, 나의 {Name}.... 넌 날 살아있게 만들었지. 네가 한순간이라도 날 내버려뒀다면, 아마 난 당장에 파라스마의 손아귀에 "
"떨어졌을꺼야. 내가 나 자신을 움직이게끔 해줘서 감사할 따름이야.... 그리고 이젠 내가 살아있다는 사실이 실감나기 시작했어. 처음으로 "
"'미래'라는 걸 느끼고 있거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "789bf6af-fc77-4af4-bc5d-c1474475d2cb"
msgid ""
"\"Who, me? A king? Look at me, ha ha! I'm not husband material, let alone a "
"king.\""
msgstr "\"누구, 나 말이야? 왕이 되라고? 날 좀 보라고, 하하! 난 왕은 커녕 좋은 남편감도 못 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "2f377813-ac08-42f7-8e09-3af9e8df7324"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Now there's only one thing left to do — face the powers of this world "
"and another, and tear them all to pieces. People, monsters, fey, gods — "
"doesn't matter. Everyone who wants to take away our future. And then...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 이제 한 가지 일만 남았지— 이쪽과 다른 쪽 세계를 지배하는 힘에 맞서, 조각조각 찢어버리는거야. 사람, 괴물, 페이, 신 - "
"우리 미래를 가로막으려는 자라면 누구든 상관 없어. 그런 다음에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3d4c6eac-1e47-4016-906a-b3200f22966f"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, are you serious? You really want to marry me?\" {n}Regongar looks "
"baffled for a moment, then smiles a broad smile quickly.{/n} \"All right. "
"Let's do it, of course. It's just... Let's postpone the wedding until the "
"victory, all right? When we don't have swords hanging over our heads. I want "
"it to feel like we really do have a future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐, 진심이야? 정말 나랑 결혼하고 싶은거야?\" {n}레곤가르는 잠시 당혹스러워 하더니, 금방 함박 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} "
"\"좋아. 그렇게 하자고. 그저... 결혼식은 지금 싸움에서 승리할 때까지 미루는게 좋겠어, 괜찮겠지? 우리 머리 위에 매달린 칼들을 "
"치워버린 다음에 말이야. 우리 앞에 진정 미래가 있다고 느껴질 때 식을 올리고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "63c7e9db-396b-4adf-bd03-5fcffe28025a"
msgid "{n}The half-orc smiles.{/n} \"Then it will be just you and me.\""
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"그리고 나면 우리 단 둘이서만 있게 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0d5983c4-8e8f-49ec-871d-bda21ea291af"
msgid ""
"\"So we really met for a reason. The gods aren't good for much, of course, "
"but sometimes they send gifts... Like you and me to each other.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니 우린 이유가 있어 만나게 된거야. 신들이 언제나 친절하진 않지만, 때때로 선물을 보내곤 하지.... 너랑 나처럼 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "69df2ed5-4dfd-41fb-9645-95cbea531f3e"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... I should have told you everything earlier instead of letting it "
"gnaw me up. But I didn't quite understand myself. And then... I was such an "
"idiot — I was afraid to tell you, afraid you'd laugh and push me away. I'm "
"so sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아... 그 사실이 날 갉아먹게 내버려두는 대신 진작부터 너에게 모든걸 털어놨어야 했는데. 하지만 나조차 나 자신이 이해가 되지 "
"않았는걸. 게다가... 정말 어리석게도 - 너에게 털어놓는게 두려웠어, 네가 비웃으며 날 차버릴까봐 두려웠던거야. 정말 미안해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "cf1127ff-1351-4408-bfda-22aa2dd2fdd1"
msgid "\"Right here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5683f05a-ee8b-45c4-8b5c-0e37dcac463c"
msgid "\"And I want you!\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신을 원해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "1df6c539-d902-4e87-8fa3-d8758310a237"
msgid "\"Wait a bit. I have to do something first.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만요. 먼저 할 일이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9e6bc3f7-96eb-4950-be3d-9b07defc1422"
msgid ""
"{n}While you enter the capital, Regongar pulls you close and whispers,{/n} "
"\"I want you. Right now — or I'm gonna die.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 수도에 들어서자, 레곤가르가 당신을 가까이 끌어당기고선 속삭입니다,{/n} \"널 원해. 지금 당장 - 안그러면 지금 죽을 "
"것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "e2571495-ab55-47c4-b998-966ea9ba5863"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, that would be nice. Too bad your subjects wouldn't understand.\""
msgstr "\"하 하. 그거 멋지겠네. 네 백성들은 무슨 일이 일어난건지도 모르겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "b306262e-0204-47d4-a8e8-0fef85fde2d0"
msgid ""
"{n}Holding you by the arm tenderly, Regongar almost runs with you to the "
"palace.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신 팔을 부드럽게 잡더니, 레곤가르는 당신과 뛰다시피 궁으로 들어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Event_3_Letsgo/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "7700064d-3673-4c87-8e1d-8214452cad99"
msgid ""
"\"This is more important. Seriously — don't argue! It's the most important "
"thing in the world.\""
msgstr "\"이 일이 더 중요해. 진짜야 - 말대답 하지말고! 세상에서 가장 중요한 일이란 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "08c21b1a-e4f2-410e-8bae-7b7c408498ad"
msgid "\"I'm glad I wasn't wrong about you. Onward! To victory!\""
msgstr "\"내가 당신을 제대로 봤군. 돌격! 승리를 향해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "85c065ac-7b3e-4d3d-b29d-03ff62b0510d"
msgid "\"Smother me with kisses? I might just hold you to that!\""
msgstr "\"키스로 질식시키겠다고? 아마 네가 질식 당할껄!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "efc0979e-6072-44dd-96b1-7f54e58c40c3"
msgid ""
"\"I like your enthusiasm, but let's cut out the inappropriate advances.\""
msgstr "\"네 열정은 맘에 들지만, 더 이상 진도를 나가는 건 부적절한 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7d7a5c68-0fb6-4521-a9cb-5d2dcc0606a0"
msgid "\"Say that one more time and you'll get a punch in the face.\""
msgstr "\"한 번만 더 그 따위로 말했다간 얼굴에 주먹을 날려줄거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "08918f8f-3023-4d2b-8c20-6ae91391eb9e"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar sizes up the Stag Lord's fort from afar, then looks at you and "
"shakes his head with a smirk.{/n} \"Well... We're here. A handful of "
"lunatics are about to assault a whole fortress stuffed with bandits armed to "
"the teeth, who have been keeping the entire region under their boot.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 수사슴 군주의 요새를 멀리서 재보더니, 당신을 바라봅니다. 그러고선 능글맞은 웃음을 지으며 고개를 젓습니다 .{/n} "
"\"음... 결국 여기까지 왔군. 한 줌의 미치광이들이 - 전 지역을 수중에 넣은 - 뼛속까지 무장한 도적들로 가득찬 요새를 막 "
"공격하려는 참이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "03699b4d-d66c-4c03-b150-8906c7cedb61"
msgid ""
"\"Truth be told, I wouldn't bet a copper bit on us right now. You'd have to "
"be a complete psycho to do this. So... Damn right I'm with you, ha ha ha "
"hmm! If we somehow make it out of this alive, I'll smother you with kisses!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실대로 말하자면, 나라면 우리 쪽엔 동전 한 닢 걸지 않을꺼야. 이런 짓을 하려하다니 넌 완전 정신병자인게 분명해. 그러니.. "
"제기랄 맞아, 그러니 너랑 함께 가야지, 하 하 하 흠! 이 후에 어떻게든 살아남는다면, 널 키스로 질식시켜줄께!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c83733f1-5cb7-4219-9d4d-fbae4acdaca7"
msgid "\"Yes! Forward! Let's show them!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 앞으로! 매운 맛을 보여주자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1abae609-d63e-424f-99b4-39fef7763ea1"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha hmm... Now I definitely have enough reasons to make it through "
"alive. All right — let's get to it!\""
msgstr "\"하 하 흠... 살아 남아야할 분명한 이유가 생겼군. 좋아 - 가자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5e29738d-8bc6-4e73-80fe-719661c2ef06"
msgid ""
"\"I'm joking, I'm joking! So, you ready to get to it? Let's show those "
"scoundrels who owns that fortress!\""
msgstr "\"농담이야, 농담! 이제 갈 준비가 됐나? 이 악당들에게 누가 요새 주인인지 확실히 보여주자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_0-Flirt/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8461590d-01e5-4de3-b3d1-2d0d89166c41"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hey, easy! I was only joking, ha ha! You want to punch someone — "
"punch the Stag Lord's bandits!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐, 이봐, 진정해! 농담일 뿐이라고, 하 하! 누군가에게 주먹을 날리고 싶으면 - 수사슴 군주의 도적들에게나 날리라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4126f6ca-421c-4449-8f51-0cd51612f05f"
msgid ""
"\"Stop this right now, both of you! Shut up and get away from each other!\""
msgstr "\"당장 멈추십시오, 둘 다! 입닥치고 서로 떨어지세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4c55f11f-b711-4c25-8fb4-c28d14775a3a"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, are you so eager to get beaten up? I can arrange that — maybe "
"even tonight!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 그렇게 쳐맞고 싶은겁니까! 그런 자리라면 - 오늘 밤이라도 마련해 줄 수 있는데요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "e3771395-f7d7-4119-adfc-6de1a69a21d7"
msgid "[Do not interfere]"
msgstr "[끼어들지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "03c6a991-401a-402d-8ee7-c287a4e7dcfb"
msgid "\"Regongar, stop this immediately! Leave her alone!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 당장 멈추세요! 발레리를 내버려 두라고요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "df6e977f-c3c8-4f4f-a650-acb889897d0a"
msgid "\"Valerie, I'm sorry. Regongar often oversteps.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 미안합니다. 레곤가르가 가끔 지나치게 행동하곤 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "a1369550-cccc-4285-bbe3-f2b224460ded"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, what is the meaning of this? What do you think you're doing?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 왜 그러는겁니까? 도대체 무슨 생각이에요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "379c4736-8703-4d98-bc88-77c9a64b1d7e"
msgid "\"Let that be the end of it.\""
msgstr "\"이 일은 끝난 걸로 합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "dd222a5e-b3d2-44b2-b6b6-20dacefd9d3c"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, you can't act like that with other members of the party! "
"Apologize to Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 다른 동료들에게 그런 식으로 행동하면 안됩니다! 발레리에게 사과하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "3ecfd008-a055-49ae-bec3-5e481f665947"
msgid ""
"\"Another trick like this, and you'll be spending a month... With no dessert."
"\""
msgstr "\"한 번만 더 그런 짓을 하면, 다음 한달 동안.... 디저트를 안 줄겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "31ffa664-58a9-4d5c-a6df-4580d7fafe06"
msgid "\"Definitely.\""
msgstr "\"분명.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "932bc179-4f56-4849-a7df-2c3d93b652a8"
msgid "\"Valerie, keep your hands to yourself.\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 손을 치우세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "df58fd6c-8c34-44d3-8f93-cd0c3680a237"
msgid "\"That was well deserved.\""
msgstr "\"맞을 짓을 했지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "57f866a1-c76f-4285-afa4-2380b1af3ac5"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, what were you thinking? You provoked that on purpose, didn't "
"you?!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 도대체 무슨 생각입니까? 일부러 도발한 겁니까, 그런 거예요?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "1349e82e-ebc4-420f-a65c-329d843d1ca6"
msgid "\"Valerie, cool off. Save it for tonight!\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 진정하십시오. 그런 짓은 오늘 밤을 위해 아껴두세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "538c0f7e-0306-4422-b0fb-cbe503f2eac6"
msgid "\"How can I stand and watch silently while you're being attacked?!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 공격 받는데 내가 어떻게 보고만 있겠습니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "423a5ccb-084c-43d7-bfab-ed005120c90f"
msgid "\"Yes. But I can't stop taking care of you.\""
msgstr "\"알겠습니다. 하지만 당신을 보살피고 싶은 마음은 어쩔 수가 없군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "52297478-e2af-4a0c-9676-545bbc95c0c5"
msgid "\"You could say thank you!\""
msgstr "\"고맙단 말 한마디 정돈 할 수 있지 않습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "b4d30008-daf2-4a29-b7bf-fb7a5c239cfd"
msgid "\"Valerie, pay no attention to Regongar. It's just what he wants.\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 레곤가르는 신경 쓰지 마십시오. 그게 바로 그가 원하는 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5c654ad1-6111-49c5-bb82-e0ab9c570876"
msgid ""
"\"Our enemies are growing more and more powerful. For now we're handling "
"them, but we need to treat state defense more seriously.\""
msgstr ""
"\"적들은 더욱더 강력해지고 있어요. 지금은 어떻게든 해내고 있지만, 이젠 영지의 방어 병력에 대해 좀 더 진지하게 고민해 봐야 할 "
"때입니다. .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7d9d04b3-233e-4a90-a16c-463b0545d6f1"
msgid ""
"\"Why, Valerie, are you afraid of being eaten by a troll? Maybe you should "
"never have taken up a sword! The battlefield can be dangerous, you know — "
"it's definitely no place for cowards!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐야, 발레리, 트롤한테 잡아먹힐까봐 무서운거야? 그러면 아예 칼을 잡지 말았어야지! 너도 알다시피 전장은 위험한 곳이라고, - "
"겁쟁이를 위한 곳은 절대 아니지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "746eb31a-047e-4a3e-b230-a3b5746670b3"
msgid ""
"\"I wasn't talking to you. And in the future, please mind your tongue.\""
msgstr "\"당신한테 얘기한게 아닙니다. 그리고 나중을 위해서 말하건데, 말조심하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "63a09cc7-f749-4101-9347-7494724b376e"
msgid ""
"\"Or what? You'll start crying? If a girl from a nice family is afraid of "
"trolls, she should have kept away from the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}! "
"Sat in the temple of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} doing her embroidery!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안그러면 어쩔건데? 울기라도 하려고? 잘난 집안에서 태어난 여자애가 트롤을 무서워한다면, {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}에서 떠나야하지 않겠어! {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 신전에 눌러앉아 자수나 해야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8ae0752e-b48c-4f65-8eb9-73106295e693"
msgid "{n}Valerie clenches her fists.{/n} \"One more word...\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 주먹을 꽉 쥡니다.{/n} \"한 마디만 더하면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fdfd67d2-e818-49e5-b6a5-12300ffb5b76"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's face flushes crimson red.{/n} \"I can't believe my ears! How "
"shameful! Keep your entertainments to yourself!\" {n}The warrior turns away "
"with indignation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 얼굴이 붉으락 푸르락합니다.{/n} \"제 귀를 의심케 하는군요! 부끄러운 줄 아세요! 당신 취향은 혼자만 간직하세요!\" "
"{n}발레리는 분개하며 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a94f0afc-fc08-497f-987b-8fe13e6e04ad"
msgid ""
"\"One more word — and what? You'll tell your parents? You wouldn't have the "
"guts...\""
msgstr "\"한마디만 하면 - 뭐 어쩔려고? 엄마 아빠한테 이르려고? 그럴 배짱이나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "260328c6-330d-401d-afc2-9321dac14a1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie deals Regongar a deafening slap in the face. She's ready to draw "
"her weapon, but the half-orc doesn't rush to fight, just angrily spits red "
"on the ground. The warrior scoffs with contempt and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 귀가 멍멍할 정도로 레곤가르의 따귀를 때립니다. 발레리는 무기를 꺼낼 자세를 취하지만, 하프-오크는 싸우려고 달려지 않고, "
"그저 화가난 체 피가 섞인 침을 바닥에 뱉습니다 발레리는 경멸을 섞어 비웃으며 자리를 떠납니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "204346ab-b704-4b82-b335-b7a81d38cc00"
msgid "\"Fine, fine... I wasn't saying anything.\""
msgstr "\"알았어, 알았다고.. 별 말 하지도 않았구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "351f17ec-a1f6-40d0-b418-0ef761e91d9c"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha... You're so shy!\" {n}The half-orc chuckles.{/n} \"So, tonight, "
"right?\""
msgstr "\"하 하 하... 얼굴 빨개진 것 좀 봐!\" {n}하프 오크는 껄껄거리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"그럼, 오늘밤, 하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "caab16d5-0197-4b13-9bb7-f710856b29d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Your companions stare daggers at each other for a while, and then turn "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신 동료들은 서로를 분노에 차서 노려보고는, 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7ba577ac-90ca-45b1-bc84-2c44f42a6610"
msgid ""
"\"It's fine. I'm entirely untouched by the words of that... Brawler. I only "
"hope he doesn't start something like that during a battle.\""
msgstr "\"괜찮습니다. 저... 망나니의 말에 전혀 신경쓰지 않아요. 그저 전투 중에 저런 짓을 하지만 말았으면 좋겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2e3e05a4-78e5-45f5-907e-b7d74802c398"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc frowns and looks away.{/n} \"I don't know. Just thought I'd "
"do it. I'm just a fool... Thanks for stepping in before it led to bloodshed."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크는 얼굴을 지푸리며 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"모르겠어. 그냥 저질러버린 것 같아. 그냥 멍청이인거지... 피를 보기 전에 "
"말려줘서 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "ae88138c-a7ac-4612-9ba6-bff9c23bf11a"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar and Valerie keep their distance and don't look at each other.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르와 발레리는 거리를 유지하며 서로에게서 눈을 돌립니다..{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "55e564e0-53ad-4162-ba33-8eae89455bfa"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc looks gloomily at you, then at Valerie, and back at you — "
"then turns away without saying a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 당신을 우울하게 바라봤다, 발레리를 봤다가, 다시 당신을 보더니 - 말 없이 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "657c1316-c08b-4479-871e-a6578f8b2cf7"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar clutches his head in mock horror.{/n} \"Oh no, not that! Then "
"I'm finished!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 공포에 질린 척 머리를 쥐어뜯습니다.{/n} \"오 안돼, 그것만은! 그럼 난 끝장이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e9d3f77e-c104-4ece-9d01-7e7cb91a630b"
msgid "\"I can't wait!\""
msgstr "\"기다려지는구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "674be5f0-6e56-457b-b657-d37055ad6cc2"
msgid "\"Forgive me. I will try to be more restrained.\""
msgstr "\"용서하십시오. 앞으론 더 절제하도록고 노력하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "21229a01-f1f1-47a5-a5f9-8bb8859f0d9f"
msgid "{n}In return the half-orc just scoffs angrily.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}대답 대신 하프-오크는 화난 듯 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "559ffaf2-30db-4f36-95b2-ff723585c8e3"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc frowns and looks away.{/n} \"I don't know. Just thought I'd "
"do it. I'm just a fool. I don't know how you put up with me...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크는 얼굴을 지푸리며 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"모르겠어. 그냥 저질러버린 것 같아. 그냥 멍청이인거지... 네가 날 어떻게 "
"참아주는지 모르겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "81f1f569-f3a7-47a5-a104-09f4a45ea574"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns to you, shooting fire from her eyes.{/n} \"I am entirely "
"capable of handling this without your assistance!\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 눈에서 불을 쏘아대듯 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"당신 도움 없이도 충분히 해결할 수 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e3743e30-0df7-4af2-ac69-1f72c84d3629"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns pale with rage.{/n} \"Keep your comments to yourself!\""
msgstr "{n}발레리의 얼굴이 분노로 창백해집니다.{/n} \"말하기 전에 생각 좀 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9f5f6de4-872b-44ca-80cf-7f50640cbecc"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha... Someone is shy!\" {n}The half-orc chuckles.{/n} \"She must be "
"mortally boring in bed, huh, {name}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하 하 하... 얼굴 빨개진 것 좀 봐!\" {n}하프 오크는 껄껄거리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"발레리는 침대 위에서도 끔찍하게 "
"지루할꺼야, 그렇겠지, {name}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6848f82f-80b5-4625-8c64-94341c924696"
msgid "{n}Valerie waves you off, enraged.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 화가나서 손짓하곤 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bc9152b2-22c2-4f4a-81ca-eedc40b6cf23"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is about to explode, but she suddenly exhales and casts a "
"grateful look at you.{/n} \"Really? Well, you're... that's very nice of you."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}폭발 직전이던 발레리가, 갑자기 숨을 내쉬더니, 당신에게 고마운 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"진심이에요? 그.. 그것 참 친절하군요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2920cf79-bc38-4cbb-b753-c426ddbeccdb"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie drills holes in you with her eyes for a moment, then sighs.{/n} "
"\"I'm sorry. You're right, I overreacted.\" {n}The girl catches her "
"breath.{/n} \"I think I need to cool down.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 얼굴에 구멍을 뚫을 듯이 당신을 노려보더니, 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"미안해요. 당신이 맞아요, 내가 과민하게 "
"반응했군요.\" {n}발레리는 쉼호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"좀 진정해야 겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7251adb6-b650-45cc-9849-c5f24d24ffc8"
msgid "{n}Regongar follows the girl with a heavy stare.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 심각한 눈길로 발레리를 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9d15fa31-4d08-4059-95c3-59f75b1969bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles to you softly.{/n} \"I always fall for his provocations. "
"Thank you for stopping me in time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신을 향해 부드럽게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"언제나 그의 도발에 넘어가곤 한다니까요. 제 시간에 말려줘서 감사합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-BullyValerie/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "da178798-ee3d-4200-b6c9-3b57a5c1c3d0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie casts an arrogant glance at the half-orc and fixes a strand of "
"hair that came loose.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 하프-오크에게 오만한 눈빛을 보내더니, 흩어졌던 머리를 정돈합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "531ced86-b3ac-4199-b8ef-d4569d179bb3"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, what is this? Why are you drunk when we're ready to march?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 지금 뭐하는 겁니까? 왜 행군을 앞두고 술에 취해 있는거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6fe261b8-4b46-4359-9575-cffeb226c430"
msgid "\"Pack, and do it fast. We have to go.\""
msgstr "\"당장 짐을 싸십시오, 서둘러서 말입니다. 당장 떠나야합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "93c05b63-7819-451e-bb37-85f7f5d8845c"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, you idiot! What are you doing?! Do you realize you're letting the "
"whole party down?\""
msgstr "\"레그, 이 멍청아! 뭐하는 거야?! 네가 일행 모두를 실망시키고 있다는 걸 모르겠니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "5d46bce5-e483-460e-b5a3-2f525edb25c3"
msgid ""
"\"In this condition you're not just useless, you're dangerous. Let's push "
"the march for half a day until you come around.\""
msgstr "\"이 상태론 당신은 그저 쓸모 없을 뿐 아니라, 위험하기까지 합니다. 당신이 정신을 차릴동안 행군은 반나절 미루도록 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "600facc7-96f8-40f5-9778-c65aab1ba71d"
msgid "\"I don't care about your excuses. Pack, and fast!\""
msgstr "\"변명 따윈 신경쓰고 싶지 않습니다. 당장 짐을 싸십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "020ba3a6-4843-45c2-b09a-45ecfbee7ee9"
msgid ""
"\"All right, Reg, suck it up. Stop fooling around, I need you. I don't know "
"how, but in ten minutes you'll be ready to go. Got it?\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 레그, 정신 차리라고. 멍청하게 서있지 말고. 난 네가 필요해. 십분 안에 준비하도록 해. 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "22b75e37-dfb0-4058-aa1f-c89d37c45bc0"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about your excuses. Are you all right? We are marching off.\""
msgstr "\"변명 따윈 신경쓰고 싶지 않습니다. 괜찮은 거겠지요? 당장 행군을 시작하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "7cd647b0-f2dc-4e80-868b-532c0aade34d"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly, you usually aren't. Reg, I'm seriously worried about you. What's "
"going on?\""
msgstr "\"맞아, 평소엔 안그러잖아. 레그, 난 네가 정말 걱정돼. 도대체 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "384f5fb7-e1d9-4950-ba43-0f72ba08c731"
msgid ""
"\"Another stunt like this, and you'll be sitting in the capital until you're "
"an old man! You realize you let down the whole party?\""
msgstr "\"또다시 이런 짓을 한다면, 늙어 죽을 때까지 수도에 남겨둘겁니다! 동료 모두를 실망시키고 있다는 걸 알기나 합니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "6697ffd3-b9e9-4972-8ab8-436c856b2475"
msgid "\"What was that nonsense about no one needing you?\""
msgstr "\"아무도 당신을 필요치 않는다니 그게 무슨 헛소리입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "f18ad7bb-951a-42f2-9b10-961b5ac9d0bf"
msgid ""
"\"When you were drunk, you said no one needs you. Another stunt like this, "
"and I'll start thinking about whether or not that's true.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 취했을 때, 아무도 당신을 원하지 않는다 했었지요. 또다시 이런 짓을 한다면, 그게 사실이라고 생각할지도 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b64f2813-eab0-4382-97ca-51a8f3b967db"
msgid ""
"\"Hunh? W-What? Are we going already? I'm — a... I'm — almost ready!\" {n}"
"Regongar's tongue is heavy. He's swaying visibly, and his breath reeks of "
"alcohol.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"허어? 뭐-뭐라고?벌써 떠나는거야? 난 - 어 - 난 -거의다 준비 됐어!\" {n}레곤가르는 혀가 꼬이고 눈에 띄게 비틀거립니다. "
"숨결에선 술냄새가 진동합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fd635428-bec7-47b4-a211-6280bbcd52a1"
msgid ""
"\"I... I was just sitting at night... And, well... Thinking about things... "
"And the flask... I kind of didn't notice... And here I am.\""
msgstr ""
"\\난... 어제 밤을 새버렸어... , 음... 여러가지를 생각하느냐 말이야... 병들은 말이지.. 저기 있는 줄도 몰랐는데... "
"그리고 지금 이꼴이 되버렸군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ab8aebbf-dbbc-4c6c-be72-0164c00c12e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar gathers his things clumsily, and leaves the encampment with the "
"others.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 서툴게 자기 물건을 챙기더니, 다른 이들과 야영지를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "28f3f967-d295-42a9-acba-f05a5bfcf6fd"
msgid "\"I'm... I'm sorry\". {n}The half-orc stumbles to his tent.{/n}"
msgstr "\"미... 미안해\". {n}하프-오크는 텐트에서 엉거주춤 움직입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "706edc03-6125-48fc-8a77-6ce9f1523ce6"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... I always let everyone down. Octavia and you and... Everyone. Just "
"leave me somewhere... In the gutter! That's where I belong!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래... 언제나 모두를 실망시키지. 옥타비아, 너, 그리고 모두를 말이야. 그냥 술취한 채 있게 아무데나 내버려둬! 거기가 내게 "
"걸맞는 자리일테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b6ed6f90-e620-4bf1-9a91-0e3ec2ac7218"
msgid "\"Y-You do? Are you sure? Got... Got it! I'll just be a second!\""
msgstr "\"정-정말? 아... 알았어! 잠시만 기다려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a78432f9-122d-4b4e-8090-e3573347b4c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar is still not quite sober, but now he's able to walk steadily and "
"speak coherently.{/n} \"You know... I'm sorry. I didn't mean to... you know, "
"I'm usually not like this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 아직 술에서 깬 것 같지는 않지만, 걸음걸이와 말투는 멀쩡해보입니다..{/n} \"이봐.... 내가 잘못했어. 그럴 "
"의도는 아니었는데.... 너도 알다시피, 내가 평소에 이렇진 않잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "43d9d0d9-4adb-46d0-9128-ab5c84c8a4e4"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc shakes his head.{/n} \"I'm just... Damn it! I'm sorry, I'm "
"just an idiot.\""
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"난 그저... 젠장! 미안해, 난 그냥 멍청이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1acb26db-5568-44dc-97e6-ad5d6a882d39"
msgid "\"I'm ready. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"준비됐어. 가자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "13c5fa0b-9335-476a-bee1-48e21814cb8c"
msgid "\"I do.\" {n}The half-orc lowers his head.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그래..\" {n}하프-오크는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ebcc441c-7b25-42c2-92ff-25d56eb7d97e"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't sleep for half the night. Kept thinking about how much pain I "
"stupidly caused Octavia — and now you too probably. I was thinking — maybe "
"you'd both be better off without me? Stupid thoughts! I sipped from the "
"flask to drive them away — and got drunk little by little... Ah, there is no "
"point in any excuses. Forget my babbling. Just forget it. And forgive this "
"idiot. I swear, I won't have another drop while we're on the march!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠을 이룰 수가 없었어. 내가 옥타비아에게 - 최근엔 너한테도 - 멍청한 짓으로 얼마나 고통을 주었을까 생각하면서 말이야. 계속해서 "
"생각했지 - 너희 둘다 내가 없으면 더 잘 살수 있지 않을까? 멍청한 생각이지! 이런 생각을 떨쳐버리려고 한 모금 마시고 - 점점 "
"취해버린거야... 지금와선 변명 따윈 소용없지. 내 헛소리는 잊어줘. 그냥 잊어버리고, 이 멍청이를 용서해줘. 맹세할께, 앞으로 행군할 "
"땐 한모금도 마시지 않을꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "46659718-50b5-473b-9d60-8ec8706f4e9f"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? Leave me and go. You don't re... Hic... Really need me. "
"What good am I? I ruin... Everything, right... Why do you even keep me "
"around?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐, 그냥 날 내버려두고 떠나버려. 넌 사실... 딸꾹... 내가 필요치 않으니까. 내가 무슨 쓸모가 있겠어? 모들걸 "
"망쳐버리는데... 왜 날 곁에 두는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8e8cdc4a-d1f7-4d6d-ac6c-94a1109a3fa0"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc bites his lip fiercely.{/n} \"The truth, I guess… What the "
"sober man thinks, the drunkard reveals.\""
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 입술을 맹렬히 깨뭅니다{/n} \"제정신인 사람은 고민만 하고, 술주정뱅이만 진실을 말하는 법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Drunk/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "137ee1b9-f9b0-47d8-8d3a-18530949db2b"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar nods gloomily.{/n} \"Got it. My fault. Not another drop on the "
"march!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 우울하게 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"알았어. 내 잘못이야. 행군 중엔 한모금도 하지 않을께!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1fb509d9-43cc-45c4-8fd1-6b2f69b073ac"
msgid "\"I'm sorry, I don't like that. Let's stick to regular love play, ok?\""
msgstr "\"미안합니다만, 마음에 들지 않네요. 평범한 애무로 만족합시다, 괜찮죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "6ef38f0e-08ad-4844-85fe-c58321bae69f"
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "\"나도 좋습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "b51dff19-1ee5-41fa-9516-5caaa7197924"
msgid "\"Are you sure? I wouldn't want to hurt you...\""
msgstr "\"정말로? 다치게 하고 싶진 않은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "e3a6016c-55de-4252-9bd5-973c07928c54"
msgid "\"Be careful what you wish for. Next time you won't be able to sit!\""
msgstr "\"소원을 빌 땐 신중하는 게 좋을 겁니다. 이후엔 앉지도 못할지도 모릅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "da83b9c8-7ea3-4308-87b6-865c8398b7a2"
msgid "\"I've never done that... But if you want to — let's try.\""
msgstr "\"그건 해본 적이 없는데... 하지만 당신이 원한다면 - 시도해보지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "8ee7b025-e1af-428e-bfec-8c94417a8cdc"
msgid "\"Not now. I need to rest.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 말고요. 좀 쉬어야 겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "d6328462-6bef-4389-925f-2119cb6e2bad"
msgid "\"I was about to suggest that!\""
msgstr "\"내가 먼저 말하려고 했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "cdbb0bc8-2b73-4c72-9177-2bc52f3f7df0"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar gets dressed, taking his time.{/n} \"You're a miracle. But you "
"know... Next time you don't have to be so tender with me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 옷을 입으면서, 여유 시간을 가집니다.{/n} \"넌 기적 같은 사람이야. 하지만... 다음 번엔 너무 부드럽게 굴 필요 "
"없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "d2954ebb-5c29-424d-83da-715e8c825d9d"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be afraid to hurt me. Pain is a caress too... When done by someone "
"you love.\" {n}The half-orc gives you a smile you've never seen before — "
"warm, without a shade of his usual anger or bravado.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내게 상처주는 걸 두려워하지마. 고통도 애무의 일종이니까... 사랑하는 사람이 준다면 말이지.\" {n}하프-오크는 당신이 전에 본 "
"적없는 - 따뜻하고, 평소 때의 분노나 야유가 섞이지 않은 미소를 당신에게 보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "6391ba59-e836-4acf-9574-117e58952d95"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish. All that matters is your hands on my body... I'll accept "
"anything you give me.\""
msgstr "\"원하는 대로 해. 중요한 건 네 손이 내 몸에 닿는 거니까... 네가 해주는 거라면 뭐든지 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b2d534ed-30b7-48ac-8fed-d3017936c396"
msgid "\"Oh, you'd have to try hard for that!\""
msgstr "\"오, 그러려면 열심히 노력해야 할 껄!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "84f53ab8-160b-4bdd-8425-6ff7c30d4dee"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be afraid! You have no idea what I can stand... And beg for more, "
"haha!\""
msgstr "\"두려워 할 필요없어! 내가 얼마나 버틸 수 있는 지 상상도 못할껄... 그러고도 더 해달라고 빌테니까 말이야, 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "43069c2b-9561-47a2-8334-24f908df8054"
msgid ""
"\"Keep saying that, and I'll conquer all the neighboring kingdoms for you.\""
msgstr "\"계속 그렇게 말해줘, 그럼 널 위해 주변 모든 왕국을 정복해서 네 발 밑에 바쳐줄께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "5dd40055-371a-4f17-aa57-446f5e995252"
msgid "\"I'll teach you. I'm sure you'll love it!\""
msgstr "\"내가 가르쳐 줄께. 분명 좋아하게 될꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "8d8ddbee-01c6-4fd6-aabc-1166e0860e4f"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar is playing with the buckle of his belt.{/n} \"Did I get dressed "
"too soon? Want to do it again?\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 허리띠를 가지고 놀고있습니다.{/n} \"내가 너무 옷을 빨리 입었나? 한 판 더하길 원해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "8c874ec5-1680-41bc-a203-9def7d7b1444"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, I'm reading your thoughts!\" {n}The half-orc unbuckles his "
"belt.{/n} \"Come here...\""
msgstr "\"하 하 하, 네 생각을 읽은 것 같군!\" {n}하프-오크는 허리띠를 풉니다.{/n} \"이리와...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-PillowTalk/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "3104a884-a325-4cae-9120-52e0fb350c79"
msgid ""
"\"Fine. Come back once you've gathered your strength... You'll need it! I'll "
"be waiting.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 기력을 되찾으면 돌아오라구... 기다리고 있을께!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5988a8fc-c39f-4e96-8d40-9a6c18194da3"
msgid "\"Regongar, what happened to your hand?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 손에 무슨 짓을 한겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5d67e34e-a0a9-4ee5-82b5-32121f22085e"
msgid "[Ignore it]"
msgstr "[무시한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "33bb34d5-6736-4280-974c-443b0fdad333"
msgid "[Turn away] \"I see.\""
msgstr "[돌아선다] \"알겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "c6c8ab6e-e1b5-4e5d-8f47-8a5015703cd1"
msgid "\"Let me dress it. We don't want it getting worse.\""
msgstr "\"상처를 봉합해 줄께요. 더 악화되면 안되니까 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b59fb2b1-bdfc-4533-8a52-646c111ad661"
msgid "\"I don't want to see this ever again!\""
msgstr "\"다시는 이런 꼴 보고싶지 않습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "3d5b8034-7509-4437-bc72-882ee34cf7c7"
msgid "[Lean over his wrist and lick off the blood]"
msgstr "[레곤가르의 손목에 입을 맟추고 피를 핥아준다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2ca690be-9625-433b-8f15-b20e780f0930"
msgid "\"Reg, I'm worried about you. What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"레그, 너 걱정된다. 도대체 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3a25405a-0f96-42f7-a3de-7b3322de2b97"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice a row of fresh cuts across Regongar's wrist that have barely "
"started to heal.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 레곤가르의 손목에서 막 생긴 자상 여럿을 발견합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2939b536-d92c-4b13-9b58-77062e2c8df7"
msgid ""
"\"What's the difference?!\" {n}You hear anger in the half-orc's voice.{/n} "
"\"It's just a cut! Like you care! Like anyone cares!\""
msgstr ""
"\"별 거 아니야!\" {n}하프-오크의 목소리엔 분노가 깃들어 있습니다{/n} \"그냥 상처일 뿐이라고! 네가 신경 쓸 필요 없다고! "
"아무도 신경 쓸 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0b866a54-8af2-4795-94dd-034f742de96a"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc waves you away with pretentious indifference.{/n} \"Don't "
"pay any attention. Just some stupid thoughts in my head. I'm fine — it's "
"definitely no worse than the mess me and her got out of before!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 억지로 무관심한 척하며 당신에게 손짓합니다.{/n} \"전혀 신경쓸 것 없어. 그냥 멍청한 생각이 내 머릿속에 들었을 "
"뿐이니까. 난 괜찮아 - 나와 옥타비아가 빠져나왔던 곳에 비하며 분명 훨씬 괜찮지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "35f0b88d-9895-4779-a96f-487f425252fa"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc turns to stone for a moment and then pulls you close.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 순간 돌처럼 굳더니, 당신을 끌어 안습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f7cf68e2-b252-4835-9692-a4df0a570610"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine! You won't. Don't make a tragedy out of it, just forget it! "
"They're just scratches, I'm telling you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 알았다고! 그럴 일 없을거야. 쓸때없이 비극적으로 생각하지 말라고, 그냥 잊어버려! 그냥 긁힌 것 뿐이니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d82c5796-c5e7-4d99-8ac5-d15d29c6b129"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry, I'm not killing myself! I'll drink a potion, and it'll heal. "
"Don't worry. I'm fine, ha hmm...\" {n}Regongar stops for a moment, biting "
"his lip.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"걱정하지마. 자살 같은 건 안할테니까! 물약 좀 마시면, 다 낫겠지. 걱정하지 말라고. 난 괜찮아, 하 흠...{n}레곤가르는 잠시 "
"멈추더니, 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_2-Self-Harm/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "a9523e09-4777-42a1-9e40-790466dcfbff"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc's voice grows soft and hoarse.{/n} \"I said a stupid thing, "
"and I'm sorry. Of course you care. It's just that I... Well, I sat up at "
"night, couldn't sleep, and then I started thinking... About you, about "
"Octavia. About the stupid things I've done, especially to her. Not on "
"purpose, you know? I love both of you! But does she still love me? After "
"everything I've done? I'm not so sure any more. And you? And I felt so bad "
"about everything... So I just... It's just to perk me up. Don't pay any "
"attention, they're just scratches. Let's not talk about it, all right?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크의 쉰 목소리가 부드러워집니다.{/n} \"멍청한 말을 했군, 미안해. 물론 너희가 내게 신경써주는 건 잘 알아. 그저, "
"음, 요즘은 밤이 되도, 잠을 잘 수가 없어, 여러 생각을 하거든.... 너와 옥타비아, 그리고 내가 했던 멍청한 짓을 생각하면서 "
"말이야. 일부러 그런 건 아니야, 난 너희 둘다 사랑한다고! 하지만 옥타비아가 여전히 날 사랑하고 있는 걸까? 내가 했던 모든 짓에도 "
"불구하고? 더 이상 확신이 들지 않아. 그리고 너는 어떻고? 그러더니 모든 게 최악으로 느껴졌어... 그리곤 ,그냥.... 그냥 갑자기 "
"그럴 기분이 들더라고. 신경 쓰지마, 그냥 긁힌 것 뿐이니까. 상처에 대해선 더 이상 얘기하지 말자고, 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6cd56d59-79fa-4f9e-a3f7-b9d361295884"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen that you're hurting, but you didn't want to talk about it...\""
msgstr "\"당신이 괴로워하는 걸 봐왔지만, 당신은 얘기하고 싶어하지 않았지요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "eedd169b-d0b7-4303-a3e5-46773bc633f2"
msgid "[Hug Regongar without saying a word]"
msgstr "[말없이 레곤가르를 껴앉는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "307b6496-4bbd-468d-b8cf-6f5d05a48250"
msgid "\"Regongar, look at me. I'm here. With you. Whatever happens.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르, 나를 보십시오. 여기 있지 않습니까. 무슨 일이 있어도 당신과 함께 있을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "de166eb0-01ad-491b-905d-5ee29dcf6a65"
msgid "\"Suck it up! Stop sniveling! Grow some balls!\""
msgstr "\"정신차려요! 그만 징징대고! 자신감을 좀 가지란 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "248b5276-89be-4ba7-b0a5-919162be55f9"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar doesn't look well — he obviously didn't get much sleep last "
"night. He stares at his feet anxiously, biting a lip he's already chewed "
"sore.{/n} \"Why am I still alive, hunh?\" {n}The half-orc's voice is "
"unusually quiet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르의 표정이 좋아보이지 않습니다 - 분명 잠을 한숨도 못 잔 모양입니다. 그는 이미 부르튼 입술을 깨물며 발 밑을 불안한듯 "
"쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내가 왜 여태까지 살아있는거지, 허?\" {n}하프-오크의 목소리는 평소와는 다르게 조용합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1fb972a5-701d-4c03-9127-9f0085d2488c"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Technic League}The Technic League{/g} kept us in a true hell. People "
"stronger than me were dying every day. But I survived all right. Because I "
"wasn't alone. I had someone to survive for, you know? And now that I'm out — "
"suddenly everything that used to keep me alive has fallen apart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}는 우릴 진짜 지옥 속에 쳐넣었지. 나보다 강한 사람들도 매일 죽어나갔어. 하지만 난 "
"모든걸 이겨내고 살아남았지. 그건 내가 혼자가 아니었기 때문이야. 살아남아 지켜줘야 할 사람이 있었기 때문이라고. 이젠 그 지옥에서 "
"탈출했더니 - 날 살아있게 만든 모든 것들이 떨어져 나간 기분이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2de0836b-2618-4bfc-ba04-6a8342e682f7"
msgid ""
"\"Now I'm running around in circles like a mad dog. Unleashing on others or "
"sinking my fangs into myself. If it wasn't for you...\" {n}The half-orc "
"bites his lip again until it bleeds.{/n} \"I'd probably be dead already.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이젠 미친 개처럼 뛰어다니고 있지. 남이나 나 스스로에게 발톱을 휘두르면서. 네가 아니었다면 아마...\" {n}하프-오크는 피가 날 "
"때까지 입술을 다시금 깨뭅니다{/n} \"아마 난 이미 죽은 목숨이었겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9824f4f1-e813-4064-b4d7-4f4938f513f8"
msgid ""
"\"What's there to talk about? I can't even explain to myself what's going "
"on. I just want to drink, or die, or sit and howl like a wolf. You're the "
"only thing that's kept me in this world, holding me almost by the collar. No "
"one else could.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고 말하겠어? 나 스스로도 무슨 일이 벌어지는 건지 설명 못하겠는데. 난 그저 마시거나 죽거나 늑대처럼 앉아서 짖고 싶을 뿐이야. "
"너만이 날 이 세상에 머물도록 내 목줄을 붙잡고 있는 사람이라고. 아무도 그럴 수는 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3f6c8d63-48c2-42f9-ad07-2525dca12c0a"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc grabs you fiercely, painfully, like a drowning man grabs the "
"side of a rescue boat. His body is shivering, and he heaves a sobbing sigh — "
"and starts to cry, burying his face in your shoulder.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크는 당신을 맹렬히, 고통스럽게 붙잡습니다. 마치 익사하는 사람이 구조선을 붙잡는 것처럼. 그의 몸을 덜덜 떨리고, 흐느끼는 "
"숨을 내쉬더니— 당신 어깨에 얼굴을 파묻고 울음을 터트립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "89782afb-3d4b-46f8-bf55-784ffa048066"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Yes, all this time you... While I, like an idiot...\" {n}Regongar's "
"voice trembles. He steps toward you and holds you tight.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 그래. 줄곧 넌 그래주었지.. 내가, 바보처럼 구는데도...\" {n}레곤가르의 목소리가 떨립니다. 그는 당신 앞으로 나와 "
"당신을 꼭 잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-Freedom/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5c797a0f-c11f-48be-9609-4ccc739d6bb1"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Yes, of course. Sorry, I got droopy for a bit. Just ignore me!\" {n}"
"The half-orc smirks crookedly with his bloody lips.{/n} \"All right, never "
"mind, let's keep it moving. We don't have time to stand around chatting. — "
"Got too many creeps to impale on our swords, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 그래, 물론이지. 미안, 좀 축 쳐저있었지. 그냥 신경쓰지 말라고!\" {n}레곤가르는 피나는 입술을 찡그리며 뒤틀린 웃음을 "
"짓습니다.{/n} \"좋아, 신경 쓰지마, 계속 가자고. 잡담 나눌 시간은 없느니까 - 칼로 꼬챙이를 만들어 줄 놈들이 바깥에 "
"널렸으니까, 하 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8fbb6b4c-de15-4d81-99eb-d0a023e31dce"
msgid "\"Then we can do anything we want! What would you do?\""
msgstr "\"그러면 우리가 하고 싶은 일은 뭐든지 할 수 있을 거야! 넌 뭐 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d3a58cc4-8420-499c-9bed-2c27f3b645f8"
msgid ""
"\"That won't happen for as long as I live. When there are no more enemies on "
"my land, I'll declare war on my neighbors!\""
msgstr "\"내가 살아있는 동안엔 그럴 일이 없을 거야! 이 땅에 적이 없어지는 날엔, 주변국들에게 전쟁을 선포할 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "02b7b8a2-668e-49cb-abde-ded977247946"
msgid "Shared with Regongar your thoughts about a time of peace."
msgstr "평화로운 시대가 왔을 때에 관한 생각을 레곤가르와 나눴습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "7304e5da-b3bc-4de0-b17b-1d7af6c20cf4"
msgid "\"Then what? We're going to live and enjoy ourselves!\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭐? 우리끼리 즐기며 살면 되지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e62b3c2d-945b-418a-a412-321d48b272f7"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe a hedonist like you doesn't have some other joys in life "
"besides battle.\""
msgstr "\"너 같은 쾌락주의자가 전투 말고 다른 즐거움이 없다는 건 믿을 수가 없겠는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e4d09a76-87e8-4348-9006-3eac73a49cbe"
msgid ""
"\"You know, it hurts me to hear this. What does war have to do with "
"anything? First of all you're my friend and lover.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 그렇게 말하니 좀 서운하네. 전쟁이 대체 무슨 상관이야? 네가 내 친구이자 연인인게 제일 중요하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1cabd57f-66b9-4518-9f5a-ac8a5a3bc7d2"
msgid ""
"\"You think we'll have nothing to do without war? For a start we'll stay in "
"bed for a month! Then maybe we'll think of something!\""
msgstr "\"전쟁이 없다고 할 일이 없을까? 우선 한 달 동안 침대에서 뒹굴어보자! 그러다 보면 생각날지도 모르지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "8fd97339-d6b4-4832-8c5c-7939f5762a5c"
msgid ""
"\"If you keep asking dumb questions, maybe I'll start thinking about it.\""
msgstr "\"자꾸 그런 멍청한 질문을 할 거라면, 나중에 한 번 생각해 볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "2826ff92-ebef-40e8-8e38-08a980daf958"
msgid "\"I love you. And I'll never leave you.\""
msgstr "\"널 사랑해. 절대 널 떠나지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "2e17ddd4-8cb0-43dc-baab-f0ec75ab03b2"
msgid ""
"\"If any more bad thoughts bother you at night, wake me up right away. "
"I'll... help you get rid of them!\""
msgstr "\"밤에 또 나쁜 생각이 든다면, 바로 날 깨워 . 내가... 아무 생각도 안 들게 해줄테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "173a4710-afcb-4b8f-a962-f5b142b95bc8"
msgid "\"If you keep acting like an idiot, maybe I will.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 자꾸 바보처럼 군다면, 그럴지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "c60a28a3-226b-483a-b9a9-32b6a715bd66"
msgid ""
"\"You're one of my best warriors. You really think there will come a time "
"when there's no work for you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 최고의 전사야. 정말 너한테 일거리가 없는 날이 올거라 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b24caffa-c90f-42ca-83c8-4d40dc91d616"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, I wanted to ask you... Imagine: all this constant hacking and "
"slashing ends. Cyclopes, barbarians, our neighbors... We defeat all of them. "
"Imagine, right?"
msgstr ""
"\"저기, 물어볼 게 있는데... 만약에, 모든 난장판이 끝났어. 사이클롭스, 바바리안, 주변 국가들... 우리가 다 물리쳤다고 치자고. "
"알았지?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "74816e29-e96a-4780-994b-ce06dcb1ba6b"
msgid ""
"\"So, there's peace. Our army is at our border, so our neighbors are afraid "
"to even squeak. The last monster is being stuffed to decorate the throne "
"room. No one is even thinking rebellion, the sheep are grazing, the apple "
"trees are swaying in the wind. Everything is so perfect it makes you sick. "
"So tell me, what then?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 평화가 온거야. 우리 군대가 국경을 지키고, 이웃들은 찍소리도 못하는 거지. 마지막 괴물은 박제되서 알현실에 전시하고. 누구도 "
"반란을 꿈꾸지 않고, 양들은 풀을 뜯으며, 사과 나무는 바람에 흔들리는거야. 모든게 질려버릴 만큼 완벽해졌어. 그럼, 그 다음엔 뭘 "
"해야할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0d4b6be2-1bb5-4d55-8d29-d45f8a08e20b"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha hmm... That's the problem. If I did whatever I wanted to do, I'd be "
"dead already. From drinking, from brawling in taverns, or just out of "
"stupidity. I'm still alive just because you need my sword for your war.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하 하 흠.... 그게 문제야. 내가 원하는 데로만 했다면, 난 이미 죽은 목숨일꺼야. 술마시다, 술집에서 싸움하다, 아니면 다른 "
"멍청한 짓거리를 하다가. 단지 네가 전쟁에 있어 내 칼이 필요했기에 내가 살아있는거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8061adee-9ed6-434e-85ea-7c334a3a0c3a"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc looks you in the eye.{/n} \"And without war... Why would you "
"need me, hunh?\""
msgstr "{n}하프-오크는 당신 눈을 똑바로 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그럼 전쟁이 없다면... 당신이 날 필요할 일이 있을까, 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5d34a261-f093-4b6f-b3e5-dddea05409d8"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, right, that's you in a nutshell! But don't dodge the question. "
"Say you conquered all of Avistan... No, the whole of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}"
"! There is peace everywhere, no one left to fight. So I really have nothing "
"to do. I mean, the only thing I have in my life is your war.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하 하 하, 맞아, 그래야 너답지! 하지만 질문을 회피하지는 말라고. 네가 아비스탄 전역을 정복했다고.... 아니, "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 전부를 정복했다고 치자고! 모든 곳에 평화가 넘치고 더 이상 싸움이라곤 존재하지 않는거야. 그렇게 "
"되면 난 아무런 할 일이 없겠지. 내 말은, 내 삶은 오직 너의 전쟁에만 있으니까 말이야\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f219f195-f951-48cc-87e7-a467d5294f2d"
msgid ""
"\"Pleasures come in different kinds. Some have no place in peaceful life. "
"Take me, for example... I kept dreaming of the freedom to do whatever I "
"want. I wanted to go with you and fight your war. And now that war is the "
"only thing I have left.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람마다 즐거움을 얻는 곳이 다르지. 어떤 이는 평화로운 삶을 견디지 못해. 예를 들어 나같은 사람이 그렇지... 난 내가 하고 싶은 "
"일이라면 모든 할 수 있기 때문에 자유를 꿈꿔왔어. 지금 난 너와 함께 전쟁에서 싸우고 싶었지. 이젠 그 전쟁이 내게 남은 유일한 "
"일이야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a5d0e647-2519-44e7-988d-4dc75eadbbe6"
msgid ""
"\"It's not about joys! If all I wanted was pleasure, I'd buy a cartload of "
"Numerian shit. Life would be short, but very pleasant.\""
msgstr ""
"\"쾌락에 관한게 아니야! 내가 쾌락만 따졌다면, 누메리아산 마약을 산더미처럼 샀겠지. 짧게 살고 갔겠지만, 쾌락 속에서 죽을 순 "
"있었을껄.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f0e3851f-7c7d-4add-96e4-aea586ac8d0c"
msgid ""
"\"My life isn't worth spit. I've got no need for myself, you know? I'm alive "
"because you need me. For fighting. And without that — what is there?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 삶은 동전 한 닢 가치도 없어.나 자신을 위해선 내가 필요치 않다고, 알겠어? 네가 날 필요하기 때문에 내가 살아있는거야. 널 "
"위해 싸우기 위해서. 그게 없어지면 - 뭐가 남는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f1932a3f-f4dc-4b8e-af3a-9ea8c4123b5d"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar roars with laughter. You see relief in his eyes.{/n} \"Ha ha "
"ha... You're right. I guess I put my foot in it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 호탕하게 웃습니다. 그의 눈에 안도의 눈빛이 감돕니다.{/n} \"하 하 하.. 네가 맞아. 쓸 때 없는 소리를 한 것 "
"같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ceeec2ae-9f22-4719-bacc-3b3b9e0af5ac"
msgid "{n}Regongar sighs with relief.{/n} \"I'm sorry. I'm being stupid.\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 안도의 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"미안. 멍청한 질문을 했군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "df213665-e970-49bd-83f2-d0a5764896d7"
msgid ""
"\"I need to sleep more and think less. My head is filled with such bad "
"thoughts lately... Last night I managed to convince myself three times that "
"you don't need me and you're about to dump me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠을 더 자고 생각을 덜 해야겠어. 요즘 나쁜 생각들이 머리를 꽉 채우고 있거든... 지난밤엔 네가 날 필요치 않아서 곧 차버릴거라고 "
"세 번씩이나 확신했다니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a84376fc-9c6f-4b23-baf5-11f0cde11f68"
msgid ""
"{n}Closing his eyes, the half-orc clings to you with his whole body. He "
"whispers,{/n} \"I know. I know. Forgive this idiot. I love you too.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}눈을 감더니, 하프-오크는 당신에게 온몸을 기대고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"알았어. 알았다고. 이 멍청이를 용서해줘. 나도 널 사랑해."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f72161f9-3711-4047-a66b-eca9fbf2f739"
msgid ""
"{n}Laughing provocatively, the half-orc clings to you with his whole body. "
"He whispers,{/n} \"Definitely. Forgive me for saying all this rubbish. I "
"love you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도발적으로 웃더니, 하프-오크는 당신에게 온몸을 기대고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"확실히 그래. 헛소리를 해서 미안해. 널 사랑해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0acb69cd-3368-4409-a086-b7c840c1e303"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc's face turns to stone.{/n} \"I'm sorry. I'm sorry, this "
"won't happen again.\" {n}He sighs and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하프-오크의 얼굴이 돌처럼 굳습니다.{/n} \"미안, 미안해. 다시는 그러지 않을께.\" {n}한숨을 쉬더니 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Regongar/Stage_3-WillYouNeedMe/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5ff33667-91c0-4f7f-8fa5-65f3c2aee403"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar looks away with a wry expression.{/n} \"Yeah, all right… Fine, "
"forget it. I'm an idiot and I'm asking dumb questions.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 비꼬는 표정을 지으며 고개를 돌립니다..{/n} \"그래, 알겠어... 좋아, 잊어버리라고. 그런 질문을 하다니 내가 "
"바보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianAfterSex_01_String
msgctxt "78838716-a406-4330-b645-6516d0ebd7ad"
msgid "\"Our moments together pass too quickly.\""
msgstr "\"함께 있으니 시간이 너무 빨리 가는 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianAfterSex_02_String
msgctxt "d7f38545-90e9-4dec-b5b2-21dc55cdfff0"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard that some wizards can stop time. I dream about that when I'm "
"with you.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 마법사들은 시간도 멈출 수 있다고 들었어요. 당신과 함께 있을 때 그런 재주가 있었으면 하고 꿈꾼답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianAfterSex_03_String
msgctxt "bfdec0f3-78a7-4606-afcf-2e53cdbe11ab"
msgid "\"You left scratches on me... I hope I didn't hurt you.\""
msgstr "\"상처가 좀 생겼네요... 당신도 생기진 않았으면 좋겠는데요 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianAfterSex_04_String
msgctxt "66c10768-75fb-4ea8-a2e0-57d00409c2a3"
msgid "\"I didn't know you could be so... so wild!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 그렇게... 야성적일 수 있을 줄이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianAfterSex_05_String
msgctxt "63f792ea-53f4-449d-9b54-87a31e66d9e1"
msgid ""
"\"Where did you learn that? No, don't answer. I'll go mad from jealousy!\""
msgstr "\"그건 어디서 배운겁니까? 아니, 대답하지 마세요. 질투로 미쳐버릴지도 몰라요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianIdle_01_String
msgctxt "630e76ce-c6d3-4e92-acc1-d129f62a9031"
msgid "\"Don't wait for me. I need to catch my breath.\""
msgstr "\"기다리지 마세요. 숨 좀 돌려야겠으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianIdle_02_String
msgctxt "dd95e6fd-6ba0-4931-b9d6-c23d8286e396"
msgid "\"Go. I need to pack.\""
msgstr "\"먼저 가요. 짐 좀 꾸리게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/AfterSex_Barks/TristianIdle_03_String
msgctxt "9644dd30-baa8-436f-97fe-cf1c2c411566"
msgid "\"I wonder where I put my belt.\""
msgstr "\"내가 허리띠를 어디다 뒀더라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd9b94df-7d19-4f28-980e-bdae890c01e1"
msgid "Thanked Tristian for the gift."
msgstr "트리스티안이 준 선물에 감사를 표했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ee4e2561-02b0-4c32-89d2-381f1d4f8cb4"
msgid "\"Thank you, Tristian. This is a precious gift.\""
msgstr "\"고마워, 트리스티안. 귀한 선물이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "42859c58-c2a3-43cb-9315-fcc064b06ff2"
msgid "\"I wouldn't mind if we were closer.\""
msgstr "\"난 우리가 좀 더 가까워져도 상관없는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5a9b1739-30dc-47d7-b259-0989ab2bd94f"
msgid "Accused Tristian of keeping potions to himself."
msgstr "트리스티안이 물약을 혼자 가지고 있었다며 비난했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "3f30eb8b-de60-4045-9826-31c0ddb86c6d"
msgid "\"And you've been hiding these potions from me all this time?!\""
msgstr "\"내내 그 물약들을 내게 숨기고 있었던거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "702fd968-6a97-4ea8-be82-9c5afd0c3c72"
msgid "\"That's not what I meant.\""
msgstr "\"그런 뜻으로 한 말이 아닌데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "70636a93-25a4-4011-8080-43cea6a9599c"
msgid "[Sigh and turn away]"
msgstr "[한숨쉬고 돌아선다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "7c01da3a-3ed5-4d7c-8105-3f00c10d96b6"
msgid "\"That's great! Let's be friends!\""
msgstr "\"굉장하네요! 우리 친구 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b8359c2d-4ae6-44d2-b735-8cfc45c50a4a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian approaches you and makes a gesture to attract your attention.{/n}"
" \"{name}? Before we set off, I need to give you something.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 다가오더니, 당신에게 손짓합니다.{/n} \"{name}? 출발하기 전에, 당신에게 줄 것이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "b752652b-2a96-4c1b-ab93-3535bf642948"
msgid ""
"\"You've come to my rescue when I was preparing to meet the goddess. Accept "
"my gratitude — and this.\" {n}Tristian takes a few potions from the bag and "
"hands them to you.{/n} \"There are only a few, but they will surely be "
"useful to you in your journey through the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 사후에 여신을 영접할 준비를 하고 있을 때 당신이 와서 날 구해주었지요. 고맙습니다, 그리고 감사와 더불어 이것도 받아주시길 "
"바랍니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 가방에서 물약을 꺼내더니 당신에게 건냅니다.{/n} \"몇 안되긴 하지만, {g|Stolen Lands}"
"도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 있을 당신 여행에는 분명 유용할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "a944cfe6-efb3-479e-a6e4-6ce57fa20416"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian folds his hands and smiles at you.{/n} \"I'm glad that I met "
"you. If you need advice or help, I'll be around.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 손을 공손히 모으고 당신에게 미소 짓습니다..{/n} \"당신을 만나게 되어 기쁩니다. 조언이나 도움이 필요하면, "
"언제든 찾아주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "dd385d95-0be7-4db0-b79b-350b6bf6006b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian blinks and then catches on.{/n} \"Of course! I would be happy to "
"call you my friend, {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 눈을 깜빡이더니, 잠시 후에서야 이해한 듯 웃습니다 .{/n} \"물론입니다! 당신을 내 친구라 부를 수 있어 기쁘기 "
"그지 없군요, {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "a0cf38a2-5151-4b4d-adee-9f9c672388d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian knits his brows and keeps silent for a few tense seconds.{/n} \"I"
"... I understand.\" {n}The priest smiles a crooked smile, then coughs and "
"looks away.{/n} \"We need to go. But I... I will be happy to talk to you "
"again some time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 이맛살을 찌푸리고 몇 초간 침묵을 지킵니다.{/n} \"알.. 알겠습니다\" {n}성직자는 뒤틀린 웃음을 짓더니, 이내 "
"기침을 한번 하고 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"가야겠군요. 하지만, 음, 나중에 시간 있을 때 다시 얘기했으면 좋겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "7fffd5f8-f90f-420a-baaf-cedb8dc4e4a7"
msgid ""
"\"I'm happy to help you. Well, I won't waste any more of your time.\" {n}"
"Tristian nods to you and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"도움이 되어 기쁩니다. 음, 더 이상 당신 시간을 뺏진 않겠습니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 인사하고 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "76988180-c7e9-4b60-92dd-58b3adaf144b"
msgid ""
"{n}The smile drops from Tristian's face.{/n} \"What? No! Oh, it doesn't "
"matter. Anyway, they're yours now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴에서 미소가 갑자기 사라집니다.{/n} \"뭐라고요? 아닙니다! 오, 이젠 상관없지 않습니까. 어쨌든, 물약들은 "
"이제 당신 것이니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_1_ThankYou/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "126bd140-9584-4f40-a4d3-e83bde7ec6cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs back.{/n} \"All right! A friend in need is a friend "
"indeed — in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} we'll have many chances to "
"check if that's true!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신과 마주 웃습니다.{/n} \"좋습니다! 필요할 때 친구가 진정한 친구라는 말이 있지요 - {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에선 그 말이 맞는지 확인할 기회가 넘쳐날 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "bac725f0-a6df-48c2-81f9-c916a6f01520"
msgid "\"What is it, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭐지요, 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e3ea92c4-c09e-4a8a-851f-903bd854e48d"
msgid "\"Not now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "73192b63-0e54-43db-92a2-d88fcac61297"
msgid "\"I like you, Tristian. I want us to get to know each other better.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 마음에 들어요. 트리스티안. 서로에 대해 더 자세히 알았으면 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "79ea0112-c50f-44b8-b4cc-cdbe6f100aa7"
msgid "\"Don't worry about it. We're partners. That's enough.\""
msgstr "\"그건 걱정하지 마. 우린 파트너니까. 그걸로 충분해\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "95dd29d8-38ab-4fd3-8c9b-c1ef2a0e5726"
msgid "Offended Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안의 기분을 상하게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "47140d2e-82d3-4674-bc86-737a2de098bd"
msgid "\"I see you're a little dumb.\""
msgstr "\"조금 바보인 모양이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "cb428153-38eb-4fd1-ac6c-8ef6c0914d9e"
msgid "[Kiss Tristian] \"I will show you everything you need to know!\""
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 키스한다] \"당신이 알아야 할 모든 걸 보여줄께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ca3f44a2-b855-4827-82b2-7ee6f266a231"
msgid ""
"\"How would you know? Maybe it's your 'ignorance' that attracts me, hm?\""
msgstr "\" 혹시 알아요? 어쩌면 당신의 '무심함'이 내겐 매력적으로 느껴졌을지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "c563e9d9-5c6b-4b73-8c63-f40d5e4df431"
msgid "\"You're right. Let's keep everything as it is.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 맞아요. 평소대로 행동하도록 해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e689dcdd-1074-406a-a351-366152acdade"
msgid "\"I like you just the way you are. I hope you feel the same about me.\""
msgstr "\"당신 자신의 모습일 때가 제일 좋아요. 당신도 나와 똑같이 느꼈으면 좋겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "f51fc95e-a03b-4d12-b330-9c008ee80dd2"
msgid "\"Sorry.\""
msgstr "\"미안해요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "631f641d-3a61-47a2-9a94-ebeaf0033095"
msgid "\"What's wrong with you?!\""
msgstr "\"도대체 왜 그러는겁니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "50bd7702-cd96-43d3-abf3-cd643f83d4c5"
msgid "\"You don't like me that much?\""
msgstr "\"그 정도로로 날 싫어하나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "33018427-0e0f-4347-9fea-e3024f516977"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you hesitantly, even tensely.{/n} \"{name}, could you "
"spare me a few minutes?\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 머뭇거리며, 강렬히 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"{name}, 잠시 시간 좀 내줄 수 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c790088e-1003-4776-a50c-20ee5973a14a"
msgid "{n}The priest nods silently and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}성직자는 말없이 고개를 끄덕이더니 고개를 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "e6d1707d-5260-4136-8900-6bcda0ae2015"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me if I ramble, I'm not used to such conversations. I can't get "
"your words about... Us... out of my head. It's like you want something more "
"of me, and I can't understand what it is.\" {n}Tristian looks at you "
"attentively.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 횡설수설하더라도 이해해주셨으면 좋겠습니다. 이런 대화는 익숙하지가 않거든요. 당신이... 우리...사이에 대해서 말한 게 머리 "
"속에서 떠나질 않습니다. 당신이 내게 뭔가를 더 원하는 것 같은데, 그게 뭔지 이해할 수 가 없거든요.\" {n}트리스티안은 조심스레 "
"당신 표정을 살핍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "7ea8f64f-8e86-4ad0-bdfa-42e10eb997b0"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"I see you're not in the mood. I think "
"I'll spare you this conversation.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"이럴 기분이 아닌 것 같군요. 대화는 이쯤 해둬야 할 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "0787e1ca-aac5-4532-b464-90a95ef7122c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian processes your words for a few moments, then coughs "
"awkwardly.{/n} \"I'm afraid of disappointing you, {name}. I know little "
"about the feelings of mortals — all my life has been devoted to serving "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. I wouldn't want my... ignorance to push you away.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 말을 잠시 고민하다더니, 어색하게 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"내가 지금까지 당신을 실망켰을까봐 걱정이군요, "
"{name}. 난 필멸자의 감정에 대해선 거의 아는 바가 없습니다 - 내 인생을 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 섬기는 데 "
"헌신했으니까요. 내... 무심함이 당신을 밀어내는 건 원치 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "98485b4e-4b26-48b5-b3a8-c4f3bd802e73"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods hesitantly.{/n} \"All right. I just wouldn't want anything "
"left unsaid between us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 주저하며 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"좋습니다. 그저 우리 사이에 말하지 못한 것이 없었으면 해서 그랬을 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "466298bb-8a7e-454b-9055-e667ae09929d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks you in the eye and leans forward slightly, as if he's "
"about to confess something. A moment later, he sighs and pulls away.{/n} \"I "
"care about you, {name}. It hurts me to think that we might have a fight.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신 눈을 바라보더니, 마치 무언가 고백할께 있는 것처럼 앞으로 몸을 기울입니다. 잠시 후, 그는 한숨을 쉬더니 "
"물러섭니다.{/n} \"당신은 내게 소중합니다, {name}. 우리가 싸울지도 모른다고 생각하지 가슴이 아프군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "733522b9-565c-4749-8fa8-392953bd62c0"
msgid ""
"{n}You lean forward, but Tristian pulls away. A gloomy shadow seems to cross "
"his face.{/n} \"Please don't do that again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 몸을 기울이지만, 트리스티안은 당신을 밀어냅니다. 우울한 그림자가 그의 얼굴에 스쳐 지나갑니다.. {/n} \"부탁컨데, "
"다시는 그러지 말아주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "364dbacd-df9d-4b43-9acb-06aca1efe30b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian arches his eyebrow, puzzled.{/n} \"This sounds... strange.\" {n}"
"The priest tilts his head and smiles.{/n} \"I'm used to being appreciated "
"for my knowledge, not for my inexperience.\" {n}Tristian lingers.{/n} \"You "
"surprise me. Again and again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 혼란에 빠진 듯, 이맛살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"그것 참 이상하네요.\" {n}성직자는 고개를 기울이더니 미소 "
"짓습니다.{/n} \"보통 사람들은 내 많은 지식에 감사하지 적은 경험을 고마워하지는 않거든요.\" {n}트리스티안은 미적거립니다.{/n}"
" \"당신은 몇 번이고 날 놀라게 한다니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "2c94a7ee-818e-403b-83e7-2a5ae8a6f0e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles at you encouragingly.{/n} \"Oh, don't apologize, please! "
"It's just...\" {n}The priest sighs.{/n} \"I told you — I'm afraid I might "
"disappoint you. And I think I already have.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 격려하는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"오, 사과할 필요없어요! 그저...\" {n}성직자는 한숨을 "
"내쉽니다.{/n} \"말했다시피 - 당신을 실망시킬까봐 걱정이었는데. 이미 그래버린 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "7f1073b3-fd31-471a-8336-dff1b3b2739c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"It's not about that! It's... just... "
"let's just forget about it, all right? You have enough trouble without me.\" "
"{n}The priest turns away quickly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"그런게 아닙니다!! 그저... 그저... ... 이 일은 그냥 잊어버립시다. 나말고도 "
"골치거리는 많은테니까.\" {n}성직자는 재빨리 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "587728e4-0b38-49d8-b3ef-f217cc9ff932"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you gloomily.{/n} \"I could ask you the same question. "
"Let's just forget it.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 우울하게 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"나도 같은 질문을 하려고 했는데. 이 일은 그냥 잊어버립시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_2_WhatsGoingOn/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "ed303ae2-3cdb-4271-a23a-0857c228fef3"
msgid "\"I've wasted enough of your time. Let's talk later.\""
msgstr "\"많은 시간을 허비하게 한 것 같군요. 다음에 얘기하도록 합시다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "fb21c22a-5d2b-45d1-99a1-7eb5c0543e71"
msgid "\"Are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮은 거예요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7206eb92-b435-4ca5-bc9e-21ea4c46d698"
msgid "\"Did you see something? Did Sarenrae send you a sign?\""
msgstr "\"뭔가를 봤나요? 혹시 서렌레이가 당신에게 징후를 보냈나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5b582946-8fd4-4ce4-b87e-23642468d2eb"
msgid "[Ignore him]"
msgstr "[그를 무시한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a21d1ca5-aa75-4df6-919b-df5f65bb66db"
msgid "\"You take this too close to heart.\""
msgstr "\"지나치게 마음쓰는 것 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "15d16844-4fe8-4b4c-9be2-4db5507610de"
msgid "\"Even a brief moment may bring happiness.\""
msgstr "\"짧은 순간이더라도 행복을 가져다 줄 수 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ba72d2a2-765e-4f00-8d07-adaeb802cbc9"
msgid "\"Is a love given freely worse than one you have no control over?\""
msgstr "\"자의로 하는 사랑이 어찌 할 수 없이 하는 사랑보다 못한건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e537f3db-9810-47ac-89df-d679344985b8"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, you're obviously bothered by something! Tell me what it is!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안, 뭔가 고민하고 있다는 게 얼굴에 써있어요! 뭔지 말해봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "06613b0d-eb07-456c-916d-3d32d1255303"
msgid "\"I will leave you alone with your thoughts.\""
msgstr "\"혼자서 생각할 수 있도록 자리를 피해주겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "b78720f5-e098-4361-8e89-7b89a9441298"
msgid ""
"\"You know, you should find someone else for these high-flown conversations. "
"I have more important things to do.\""
msgstr "\"이봐요, 그런 고차원적인 대화를 하려면 딴 사람을 찾아봐요. 난 더 중요한 일들이 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_TristianHeart_Text
msgctxt "761994e3-4a4a-468f-9f07-de3b1a14fd98"
msgid "\"I listen to my heart. It doesn't make mistakes.\""
msgstr "\"난 내 마음이 시키는 대로 행동합니다. 그러면 실수 할 일이 없지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Answer_TristianMind_Text
msgctxt "c3d7b813-67b9-44eb-bb38-729562bc23b3"
msgid "\"I trust my judgment.\""
msgstr "\"난 내 판단을 믿어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "441a3a0c-3b22-4516-9204-7e8f9c4ceace"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian finishes his usual prayer to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, however "
"he does not rush to his feet. He stares into the distance, his eyes full of "
"gloom — even his light hair seems dim and gray.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 드리는 기도를 평소처럼 끝마칩니다. 하지만 자리에서 바로 일어나지 않고, "
"한참동안 먼 곳을 바라봅니다. 그의 눈은 우울함으로 가득하고 - 그의 밝은 머리카락마저 칙칙한 회색으로 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "9b886086-21a6-4c3e-8c6a-6c734fde9a1c"
msgid "{n}Tristian purses his lips and slowly shakes his head.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 입술을 다물고, 고개를 천천히 젓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "df9c4cbd-b8d4-4643-b595-0a08e4b9690c"
msgid ""
"{n}Slowly, as if waking from a dream, Tristian starts to speak.{/n} \"All my "
"life was devoted to the great goddess, the radiant {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. "
"Life without her is life without sunlight. I do not choose to love her or "
"not: love for her is in my nature.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 꿈에서 깨어난 듯 천천히 말합니다.{/n} \"제 인생은 위대한 여신, 광휘의 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께 "
"바쳐졌습니다. 그녀 없는 인생은 햇살 없는 인생이나 다름없지요. 여신에 대한 사랑에 있어 내겐 선택권이 없습니다: 여신을 향한사랑은 내 "
"본질이니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8457caa2-e1ba-4822-b5be-03da7b3f0650"
msgid ""
"\"But here, among other mortals...\" {n}Tristian tilts his head, and his "
"voice becomes distant.{/n} \"I keep hearing about another kind of love. One "
"that is given, like some material possession, then to be taken away. It "
"seems so... short-lived. Unreliable? I can't even find the right word.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 여기, 다른 필멸자들 사이에서...\" {n}트리스티안이 고개를 기울이니, 목소리가 아득해집니다.{/n} \"다른 종류의 "
"사랑에 대한 얘기를 자주 듣고 있습니다. 마치 세속적인 소유물처럼, 주기도 하고 빼앗기기도 하는 사랑이 있다더군요. 그런 사랑은.... "
"너무 짧다고 해야할까, 불안정하다고 해야할까? 뭐라 표현할 단어가 없군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "c15fdb66-6cd3-4b32-9e55-c8e8c11691b8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian remains on his knees for a few moments, and then stands and "
"straightens his clothes, as if nothing had happened.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 잠시 무릎을 꿇은 채 있더니, 마치 아무일 없었다는 듯, 일어서서 옷자락을 정리합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "ad4e400f-1e37-45bf-8060-a40d4cffc6d9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head, and then turns to you.{/n} \"I know that I "
"shall always be with my true heart's love, even after death. How brave one "
"must be to fall in love with someone you might lose — and eventually will "
"lose?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙이더니 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"난 내가 진정 사랑하는 이와 함께 할 수 있다는 걸 압니다, 수명을 다한 "
"후에도 말입니다. 잃을 수도 있는 누군가 - 그리고 결국엔 잃게 될 누군가 - 를 사랑하다니, 이 얼마나 용감한 일이란 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "5c67b7fb-91bb-49d9-8938-86bcb1da4b52"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian remains silent for a few moments, and then turns to you.{/n} "
"\"Probably not. I just never encountered it, and I'm not hurrying to judge "
"something I don't understand.\" {n}The priest looks at you attentively.{/n} "
"\"Or think I don't...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵하더니, 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"아마 아니겠지요. 그저 내가 그런 사랑을 겪어보지 못했을 뿐일지도요, "
"내가 이해할 수 없는 것에 대해 섣불리 판단하진 않겠습니다.\" {n}성직자는 조심스럽게 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"아니, 그저 내가 "
"이해할 수 없다고 생각했었던 걸지도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c5603126-3ae9-42e9-b682-d3f5ca4389f6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian blinks and turns to you.{/n} \"To be honest, I think about you. "
"About your bravery in making decisions, and saying what you believe in. I "
"like your courage. Very much.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 눈을 깜빡이더니, 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"솔직히 말하자면, 당신을 생각하고 있었습니다. 결단을 내리고 신념을 "
"가지는 당신의 용기에 대해서 말입니다. 당신의 용감함이 좋습니다. 그것도 많이요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "7a056ea0-dd44-4fff-9083-e1d1f1b01182"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's face does not change.{/n} \"You are probably right. And yet "
"these thoughts haunt my mind.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안의 표정은 변하지 않습니다.{/n} \"아마 당신이 맞겠지요. 하지만 이 생각이 계속 맴도는군요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "beed8033-072c-41b8-87e3-2aaf6e01f09c"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest catches his breath and begins to choose his words more "
"carefully.{/n} \"Tell me, {name}. How do you choose the one who you... can "
"trust? Do you follow your heart? Do you listen to reason? I'm sorry if this "
"is too personal... but I'm desperate to understand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성식자는 심호흡을 하더니, 신중하게 단어를 골라가며 이야기합니다.{/n} \"말해보세요, {name}. 당신이... 믿을 수 있는 "
"사람을 어떻게 판단할 수 있는겁니까? 마음을 따라가나요? 아니면 이성에 귀를 기울이나요? 너무 사적인 질문이라면 미안합니다만, 나에겐 "
"절실한 문제입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "07a57c76-2a91-4254-9aa2-505144d4f173"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods thoughtfully.{/n} \"Of course. For some reason I'm not "
"surprised. You are always so sincere in what you do. That happens when a "
"person's action comes from the heart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 사려깊게 고개를 끄덕입니다..{/n} \"물론 그렇겠지요. 무슨 이유에선지, 별로 놀랍지 않군요. 당신은 언제나 진심을 "
"다해 행동하지요. 오직 마음을 따라 행동하는 자만이 그럴 수 있을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "2dc40d94-cb11-449f-ab37-5f8a79a42a43"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian bites his lip.{/n} \"Forgive me. I won't bother you further.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"미안합니다. 더 이상 귀찮게 하지 않겠습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "f112b75b-3cb7-47af-9abd-0a6f6dd49e9a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"Of course. You weigh every decision, "
"every step — the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} couldn't bow to another "
"ruler!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"물론 그렇겠지요. 당신은 모든 결정, 모든 행동을 신중히 고민하겠지요 — {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}엔 그런 지도자가 필요합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_3_TheseCuriousMortals/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "bd69d4fc-3d60-4677-a857-bb5d848f1568"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian stands and approaches you — so near that it seems he's going to "
"hold you, but at the last moment he stops and pulls away.{/n} \"Thank you "
"for this conversation, {name}. I cherish every moment I spend with you. I "
"hope I am not a burden.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 일어서더니 당신에게 다가옵니다— 너무 가까이 다가와 당신을 껴안을 것 같았지만, 마지막 순간 그는 멈춰서 "
"돌아섭니다.{/n} \"얘기를 해줘서 고맙습니다, {name}. 당신과 보낸 모든 순간이 내겐 소중합니다. 그저 내가 짐이 되지 않았으면 "
"좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "dfa66a05-351e-4ccf-9b17-982c54d120c2"
msgid "\"What are you reading?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 읽고 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "864af25b-f0a6-4f8c-b714-017ed509f137"
msgid "[Look over shoulder]"
msgstr "[어깨 너머로 슬쩍 본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "16366307-7888-46ab-bff2-11e4a84824e2"
msgid "[Leave Tristian alone]"
msgstr "[트리스티안이 혼자 있게 해준다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "ab288b81-dc6e-4e3a-b5c1-559aecb5b2bd"
msgid "\"I wouldn't mind reading that book myself.\""
msgstr "\"나도 그 책이 마음에 들 것 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "3d3e4852-c728-4c22-9fb4-75131a5e8c62"
msgid "\"I noticed that book has some quite... exciting descriptions.\""
msgstr "\"그 책에 좀 뭐랄까... 흥미로운 구절이 있던 것 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "7043a6cc-5ff0-40f8-b5af-e9e33b8873d3"
msgid "\"So what confused you about it?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 부분이 이해가 안간다는거지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "b0acfd11-f9c7-400e-a4ea-adbbcc3349ce"
msgid "\"I won't bother you any more.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 귀찮게 굴지 않을께요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "2e6cca75-3411-4caa-b676-76f9ed80f488"
msgid "\"You always try to find something in words that can't be described.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 언제나 형언할 수 없는 무언가를 표현할 말을 찾으려한다니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "4cefd832-5253-4700-bf15-a8abae4b045f"
msgid ""
"[Take Tristian by the hand] \"And yet the answers you seek cannot be found "
"on the pages of a book.\""
msgstr "[손으로 트리스티안을 잡는다] \"당신이 찾는 해답은 책에서는 찾을 수 없는데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "014b6a86-5fb3-42de-8361-618a51bc7def"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원한다면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "18998fb7-c4bd-47b8-a98c-bc77f7cd9be7"
msgid "[Hold your hand against Tristian's cheek] \"Not at all.\""
msgstr "[손으로 트리스티안의 뺨을 꼬집습니다] \"별말씀을.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "998fe54e-5440-4e6d-828f-ecf7d97b6a8b"
msgid "\"Well, you need to work on your confessions of love.\""
msgstr "\"음, 사랑 고백이라면 연습을 좀 더 해야할 것 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6f600148-0c59-4c6c-937c-ce219368a3be"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice that Tristian is reading something, frowning from time to "
"time. He seems so immersed in the book that he's oblivious to everything "
"around him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 때때로 얼굴을 찌푸리면서 무언가를 읽고 있습니다. 책 읽는데 너무나 열중한 나머지 주변에 누가 있는지 전혀 모르는 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "e8b75248-9851-411b-9039-9d68cc1635a6"
msgid ""
"{n}Stretching your neck, you peek into the book the priest is reading. Your "
"eyes catch a few intriguing lines — something about 'blazing skin' and "
"'desire in her voice'.\"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}목을 뻗어서 성직자가 읽고 있는 책을 훔쳐봅니다. 당신의 눈에 흥미로운 구절들이 - '불타는 피부', '목소리에 담긴 욕망' - "
"눈에 띕니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "25ce9ad7-2431-4fad-9fbd-a0930c5fba63"
msgid ""
"\"Ah! {name}! I didn't notice you!\" {n}Tristian shuts his book hastily.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아! {name}! 있는 줄도 몰랐군요!\" {n}트리스티안은 허둥지둥 책을 덮습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "270dfcc9-b9a4-420a-8bdd-b67f66fa9766"
msgid ""
"{n}Hesitating for a second, Tristian hands you the book.{/n} \"Here. Maybe "
"you'll get more pleasure from it than I could.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 주저하더니, 트리스티안은 당신에게 책을 넘깁니다.{/n} \"여기 받으세요. 나보단 당신이 이 책에서 즐거움을 찾을 수 있을 "
"것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "cf0e38ea-008e-4d84-84fc-3b4d5f299456"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian blushes a little.{/n} \"You think so? What's described here… it "
"all sounds... so unnatural. And pretentious! As if it's about venerating a "
"deity, not... communicating with mortals.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 약간 얼굴을 붉힙니다.{/n} \"그렇게 생각합니까? 여기 적혀 있는 것들은… 전부... 이상하게 들립니다. "
"가식적이기도 하고요! 마치 어떤 신을 숭배하는 것 같습니다, 필멸자들끼리의 대화가 아니라요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "ea701508-e111-4860-b7d0-e7b19255ebac"
msgid "{n}Tristian becomes crimson.{/n} \"What? Wait... I didn't mean to...\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안의 얼굴이 새빨게 집니다..{/n} \"뭐라고요? 잠깐.. 그럴 뜻이 전혀...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "60eaa6f1-ad38-45da-a772-10a9645a2e50"
msgid ""
"\"I thought I could wrap my head around some... issues. No, not issues — "
"problems... that are bothering me. To find the words for something I cannot "
"express. But instead I only became more confused.\" {n}Tristian freezes, and "
"then chuckles with hesitation, looking away.{/n} \"Sometimes I admire how "
"easily you choose the words for what's on your mind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 주제에 대해서 생각을 정리할 수 있을거라 생각했습니다.주제라기 보단 - 문제에 가깝지만... 내가 표현할 수 없는 무언가를 "
"표현할 단어를 찾고 있었습니다. 하지만 더 혼란에 빠져버린 것 같습니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 잠시 멈추더니, 주저하며 큭큭거리며, "
"고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"때때로 마음 속에 떠오르는 걸 쉽게 말로 표현하는 걸 보면 당신이 존경스러워 진답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "a79cbd21-c044-4e56-8115-fd10f0374d1b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you hesitantly, a little askance.{/n} \"What are you "
"talking about? The greatest wisdom of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} is expressed "
"in the words of numerous books — and even the divine mercy of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} finds its reflection in her sacred text...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 주저하며, 약간 미심쩍은 듯이 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"무슨 소립니까? {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 "
"가장 위대한 지식들은 수많은 책들에 들어있습니다 - {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 성스런 자비 또한 그녀의 성전에서 그 반영을 "
"찾을 수 있단 말입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f71b976b-e047-41bd-b768-d9b292ca76a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you, almost in despair.{/n} \"I'm sorry, I didn't mean "
"to offend you. It's just... I feel like something is happening inside me "
"every time I see you. And I can't find the words to express it... words that "
"don't seem false.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은, 거의 절망한 듯이 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"미안합니다. 기분 상하게 할 의도는 아니었습니다. 그저... 당신을 "
"볼 때마다 내 안에서 무언가 벌어지는 느낌이 듭니다. 그걸 표현할 방법을 모르겠고요... 진실로 얘기할 방법을 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "93fb6e02-54d5-41a3-b14a-983f6393eac2"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you, his fingers softly holding your hand.{/n} \"You "
"have such warm hands. Like you are full of sunshine.\" {n}He smiles "
"faintly.{/n} \"That probably sounded as terrible as the book.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신을 바라보고, 그의 손각락은 당신의 손을 부드럽게 쥡니다.{/n} \"참 따듯한 손을 가졌군요. 당신은 마치 드넓은 "
"햇살이 가득한 것 같습니다.\" {n}그는 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"이 책 만큼이나 끔찍하게 들릴 것 같아 걱정이네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "8c00f1bf-2bb8-40c5-9ec8-9f4418a529c8"
msgid ""
"{n}A moment later Tristian opens his eyes and casts a frightened look at "
"you. He softly pushes away your hand.{/n} \"Forgive me! Forgive me, I'm out "
"of line!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 후, 트리스티안은 눈을 크게 뜨더니 당신에게 두려운 시선을 보냅니다. 그는 당신의 손을 부드럽게 밀어냅니다. {/n} "
"\"용서하십시오! 미안합니다, 내가 선을 넘었군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "aff95c57-6d26-419e-8c0a-4b05a74c3e77"
msgid ""
"{n}The young man looks up at you.{/n} \"I pray to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} "
"that you aren't angry with me. Believe me, I care very much for you.\" {n}"
"Tristian casts a final shy glance at you and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}젊은이는 당신을 올려다 봅니다.{/n} \"당신이 내게 화가 나지 않았기를 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 기도 "
"하겠습니다. 진실로, 나는 당신을 아끼고 있습니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 마지막으로 수줍은 시선을 보내며 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_Shideh_Text
msgctxt "d1487417-525d-455c-830c-4a47e7cfc54e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian freezes, looking directly at you. In two heartbeats he closes "
"his eyes and puts his hand over yours. He turns his head and tenderly "
"touches your palm with his lips.{/n} \"Full of sunshine...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 얼어붙더니, 당신을 똑바로 쳐다봅니다. 순간 그는 눈을 감더니 손을 당신 손을 잡습니다. 그는고개를 들어 당신의 "
"손바닥에 그의 입술을 부드럽게 맞춥니다. {/n} \"마치 가득한 햇살같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Cue_TristianExplainsBook_Text
msgctxt "de5f4879-54fa-4259-a82f-c39182365c0c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian awkwardly puts away the book.{/n} \"Some... treatise I learned "
"about from Linzi. I asked her advice and she recommended that I read... "
"this. She said it's the best you can get about... the passions.\" {n}"
"Tristian looks embarrassed.{/n} \"I probably just don't understand anything "
"about literature.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 어색하게 책을 치웁니다.{/n} \"린지가... 알려준 논문들...입니다. 린지에게 조언을 구했더니 이.. 책들을 "
"추천해주었지요. 열정에 대해 이해하고 싶다면 이 책이 최고라고 했습니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 부끄러운 기색을 보입니다.{/n} \"하지만"
" 문학을 이해하는 데 있어 내겐 소질이 별로 없는 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Items/NightsOfKatapesh_String
msgctxt "dec06f13-b792-41f1-8041-29402b4bb412"
msgid ""
"\"... Can one die of love? I will soon find out, for each day I spend "
"without you is like the jagged blades of eternity stinging my body. Yes, I "
"will soon die, die of my love for you!\n"
"She was beside herself with anger. She stood and tried to leave, but he "
"grabbed her shoulders and pushed her onto the sofa. She screamed in fear as "
"he sprung forward, grabbed her head and plundered her pink lips with a "
"violent kiss. She dropped her head against the back of the sofa, and he "
"continued to shower her blazing skin, to caress her shoulders, smothering "
"her with his rough manly smell, driving her out of her head, carrying her "
"away on waves of lust.\n"
"Breaking through the words of love that rained from his lips, she moaned "
"helplessly, unable to hide the desire in her voice...\n"
"\"You are but a rude, shameless barbarian...\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 사람이 사랑때문에 죽을 수도 있을까요? 곧 알게 될 것 같아요, 당신 없이 지냈던 하루하루가 마치 무한한 칼날 위에서 뒹구는 "
"기분이었어요. 그래요, 난 곧 죽을꺼에요, 당신에 대한 나의 사랑때문에요!\n"
" 그녀는 화가나서 미쳐버릴것 같았다. 그녀는 일어서 떠나려고 했지만, 그는 그녀의 어깨를 움켜 잡고 소파에 밀어 넣었다. 그가 달려들자 "
"그녀는 공포심에 소리를 질렀다. 그는 그녀의 머리를 붙잡고 격렬한 키스로 분홍색 입술을 약탈했다. 그녀가 소파 뒤로 머리를 떨어뜨리자, "
"그는 그녀의 타오르는 피부를 적시고, 어깨를 애무하고, 거친 사나이의 냄새로 물들여, 그녀가 정신이 떠나가게 만들고, 욕정의 파도에 "
"휩쓸리게 만들었다. \n"
"그의 입술에서 쏟아지는 사랑의 밀어를 깨고, 그녀는 힘없이 - 목소리에 담긴 욕망을 숨기지 못한 채 - 신음했다...\n"
"\"이 무례하고 뻔뻔한 야만인...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_4_BadWriting/Items/NightsOfKatapesh_name_String
msgctxt "682f016c-bf77-4ae0-9d5b-e7dd3e3707ce"
msgid "\"Nights in Katapesh\""
msgstr "\"카타페쉬의 밤\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bcf4c66c-3e52-4d8b-8508-19d54cfc1a5a"
msgid "\"Thank you for the gift.\""
msgstr "\"선물 고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5c6ff9fc-dc61-46e5-b505-32f70751e92e"
msgid "[Kiss Tristian]"
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 키스한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "e823806c-7550-4f5c-994f-7187f2d35c41"
msgid "\"You really shouldn't have.\""
msgstr "\"정말 이럴 필요 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "85f4a5fb-d960-4acd-9f40-13cb224e7a7b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't accept this gift, Tristian. But before you say anything else: "
"let's stop here and now.\""
msgstr "\"이 선물은 받을 수 없어요, 트리스티안. 더 얘기하기 전에: 여기서 그만두도록 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "a6a321a1-d211-4c3d-87c8-55ef716b6d58"
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신을 사랑해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4dd80d8f-acfe-40fb-b584-23f4e45a099c"
msgid "\"Yes. Everything is over.\""
msgstr "\"그래요. 이제 끝이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "371cbb87-e632-4dc2-be12-1a476cfb7569"
msgid "[Pull Tristian close] \"Less talk, more action.\""
msgstr "[트리스티안을 끌어안는다] \"말은 그만하고, 행동으로 보여줘요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ffd93f58-f9a2-45e5-b1e7-7bffbf43f2fe"
msgid "{n}Tristian hands you a package.{/n} \"I got something for you.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 상자 하나를 건냅니다 .{/n} \"당신에게 드릴 것이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "356be5cb-8f51-4344-9463-a06a53538a5f"
msgid "\"I knew you wouldn't like a useless toy. But I hope you like this.\""
msgstr "\"쓸모없는 장난감은 좋아하지 않을거란걸 알지만, 이건 마음에 들었으면 좋겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "1a326d7e-c5df-49cf-b379-9ca4c22ab8f6"
msgid ""
"\"I was thinking about what might make you happy... and decided to do what "
"you do — listen to my heart. I hope I didn't make a mistake.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무엇이 당신을 기쁘게 해줄지 오랫동안 고민했습니다만.... 당신이 평소에 그리하듯, 마음 내키는대로 해봤습니다. 내가 실수를 "
"저지르는게 아니었으면 좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "5c0e010e-3c17-4747-a6fc-7aabe5ef79ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lingers a moment, then comes closer and runs the tips of his "
"fingers over your cheek.{/n} \"I wanted to say that... I'm so happy. When I "
"was languishing in Nyrissa's dungeon, trapped by her sleeping spell and "
"tormented by nightmares, I could only guess how my wanderings on "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} would end...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 주저하더니, 가까이 다가와 당신의 볼을 손끝으로 쓸어내립니다.{/n} \"내가 하고 싶은 말은... 내가 정말 "
"행복하다는 겁니다. 나이리사의 지하감옥에서 머물며, 그녀의 수면 주문에 사로잡혀 악몽으로 고통받을 땐, "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서의 방랑이 어떤 결말을 맞을진 상상속에서나 생각할 수 있었지요....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "350b88b2-1507-437c-b448-456a5079b828"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"I wanted to do something nice for you. "
"All these endless battles and threats... Nyrissa, Armag, Irovetti... and "
"there are more trials ahead. I wanted to distract you a bit with something "
"pleasant.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"당신에게 뭔가 좋은 일을 해주고 싶었습니다. 그 모든 전투와 위협들.. 나이리사, 아르막, "
"이로베티.... 그리고 앞으로도 더 많은 시련이 남아있겠지요. 뭔가 즐거운 것으로 당신의 주의를 환기시켰으면 했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f103b00c-5b1b-4f3c-8ba6-cd93f3d1c0b7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian freezes. For a few moments he can't find the right words.{/n} "
"\"That... is very unexpected. Well... so be it. But please keep the gift. "
"Let it be a gesture of friendship and appreciation.\" {n}The deva lowers his "
"head and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 얼어붙습니다. 잠시 그는 할 말을 잊은 듯 합니다.{/n} \"그건.... 예상 밖의 일이군요. 음... 그렇게 하도록 "
"하지요. 허나 선물은 간직해주면 좋겠습니다. 감사와 우정의 뜻으로 말입니다.\" {n}데바는 고개를 숙이고 시선을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "35ffe36b-55a8-4de3-a2b0-c0e0374fa517"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} light warms me again, but your warmth, so "
"familiar and alive... is what returned me to life and faith. There's nothing "
"I could give that could repay you. But everything I have is yours. Know this."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 빛이 날 다시금 따스하게 해주지만, 당신의 따스함, 익숙하고 생생한 그 따스함이... 날 삶과 "
"신앙으로 되돌아오게 해줬지요... 이 은혜를 갚으려면 그 무엇도 충분치 않습니다만, 이걸 알아주셨으면 합니다. 내 모든 건 당신의 "
"것이란걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "09f32319-f31a-41cb-bb30-4bf2680c5ef1"
msgid ""
"{n}The deva holds you tenderly and pulls you closer. You smell a faint whiff "
"of heather, and Tristian's lips find yours.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}데바는 당신을 부드럽게 안으며 당신을 끌어당깁니다. 당신은 코끝에 희미한 야생화의 향기가 스쳐지나갑니다. 그리고 트리스티안의 입술이 "
"당신의 입술과 마주칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "8f60ad67-d36a-4444-beb6-91d2b955fcf6"
msgid ""
"{n}The deva freezes for a moment, and then answers your kiss. You feel his "
"hands wrap around you and pull you closer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}데바는 잠시 얼어붙더니, 당신의 키스에 화답합니다. 그의 손이 당신을 감싸 당신을 가까이 끌어당기는걸 느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "e9a610dc-e767-47bc-9c62-911dc7bcdac2"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian pulls away ever so slightly, his breath tickling your lips.{/n} "
"\"I love you. I always have. Since we first met. And I was so afraid I'd be "
"your downfall. But not now... Now... everything is over.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 조심스레 떨어집니다. 그의 숨결이 당신의 입술에 감돕니다.{/n} \"당신을 사랑합니다. 당신과 처음 만난 순간부터 "
"지금까지 언제나 그래왔지요. 그리고 내가 당신의 몰락을 초래할까봐 정말로 두려웠습니다. 하지민 지금은 두렵지 않습니다... 지금은... "
"모든게 끝을 맺었으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "78d67b87-2bfd-495f-9891-39f7a0cb5ccd"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian chuckles and kisses you again, and this time his kiss is firmer "
"and more determined. Leaning to your ear, he whispers softly.{/n} \"I want "
"to be alone with you so much. Just you and I. Perhaps later... when we get "
"home...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 웃으며 다시금 당신에게 키스합니다. 이번 키스는 더 확고하고 결의에 차 있습니다. 그는 당신의 귓가에 대고 부드럽게 "
"속삭입니다.{/n} \"당신과 단 둘이서만 있고 싶군요. 당신과 나 단 둘이서만. 어쩌면 나중에.... 우리가 집에 가게되면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "cf38311f-3455-416c-a994-b29cc2845ca5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles and almost playfully kisses your ear, and then "
"whispers.{/n} \"I hope some time... when we are back home, we'll have a "
"little alone time. Just the two of us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 미소지으며 즐거운듯 당신의 귀에 키스하고, 속삭입니다.{/n} \"시간이 있으면 좋겠군요... 우리가 집으로 돌아갔을 "
"때, 단 둘이서만 시간을 가집시다. .당신과 나 단 둘이서만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ad44e6de-b4f2-49c8-85b9-6d0616ae6858"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian kisses you again, and this time his kiss is longer and more "
"tender. He pulling away a little, and exhales ever so softly.{/n} \"I want "
"to be alone with you so much... Perhaps back home, after everything calms "
"down a little...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 다시금 키스합니다, 이번 키스는 더 길고 더 부드럽습니다. 조금 떨어져 부드럽게 숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"정말로 "
"당신과 단 둘이서만 있고 싶군요.... 어쩌면 집으로 돌아가서... 모든게 잠잠해지면..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "bcbabcb0-1455-41a1-abb4-daf29e54d14a"
msgid "{n}Touching your cheek, Tristian steps away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 뺨을 만지곤, 물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Items/TristianRing_Name_String
msgctxt "0f0185a6-ac19-4039-abb9-227700d5feff"
msgid "Tristian's Ring"
msgstr "트리스티안의 반지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_7_Gift/Items/TristianRing_String
msgctxt "3936df7d-8473-482e-87c4-f7a07f057785"
msgid "A gold ring with a shimmering topaz."
msgstr "반짝이는 토파즈가 장식된 금반지."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f02161bf-a91f-463d-9e49-bca13956b455"
msgid "\"I like that idea! Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각인데요! 가요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "d8a1a8a7-e148-4ebd-af32-ff1cc552fd48"
msgid "\"Fruit? Tuskwater oysters might be better, if you know what I mean.\""
msgstr "\"과일이요? 터스크워터 굴이 더 나을텐데요, 당신도 알다시피.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "8eeb703a-036d-461a-a033-6b26e4e1238a"
msgid "\"Maybe later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2f136851-f988-4a3e-a4ef-d53c66b1d9d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Meeting you at the capital gate, Tristian puts his hand on your "
"shoulder.{/n} \"Before you are abducted by your advisors...\" {n}The deva "
"smiles.{/n} \"Let's hide from them. Your chambers. Wine. Perhaps fruit. You "
"and I.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}수도 관문에서 당신을 만나자, 트리스티안이 어깨에 손을 얹습니다.{/n} \"보좌관들이 당신을 납치하기 전에...\" {n}데바가 "
"미소짓습니다..{/n} \"어서 숨도록 합시다. 당신 방에요. 와인과 과일도 준비하고. 당신과 나 단 둘이서만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "e4cf5705-49a6-483e-b47b-82520a11ee28"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristan's expression of sincere bafflement, well-known to you, appears on "
"his face.{/n} \"Oysters? Of course, if you like them...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 잘 알고있는, 정말 당혹스러울 때의 그 표정이 트리스티안의 얼굴에 나타납니다.{/n} \"굴이요? 물론, 당신이 "
"좋아한다면야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "f3273242-53fc-4dda-be6e-9dd6d0ca196d"
msgid ""
"{n}Laughing, Tristian holds you.{/n} \"Ha, then an abduction is imminent! "
"And I will be the abductor!\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 웃으며 당신의 손을 잡습니다.{/n} \"하, 그럼 납치 당할 준비를 하세요! 내가 납치범이 될테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Event_8_Capital/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "ecd86b43-a683-480f-9722-58e7f81ebc34"
msgid "{n}Mixing with the crowd, you race towards the palace.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}군중 사이에 뒤섞여, 당신은 궁전으로 뛰어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "255ee86f-435d-46f3-aafe-ccda161d25e0"
msgid "\"I don't understand...\""
msgstr "\"이해 할 수가 없어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3f70583a-801d-4cae-b018-388edaa3658a"
msgid "\"What's happened?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6f82b460-414a-4358-a9fe-896b0def00da"
msgid ""
"\"It's a relief that you mentioned it first. In fact I've grown quite tired "
"of you.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 먼저 말을 꺼내줘서 다행이에요. 사실 당신에게 지쳐가고 있었거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8b492ab0-8f74-4550-840a-608ded83787e"
msgid "\"I don't care. Together we can overcome any danger!\""
msgstr "\"상관없어요. 함께라면, 어떤 어려움도 극복할 수 있을꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "516d08dc-4b3a-463e-8c0e-8fd53d132edd"
msgid ""
"\"All right, we'll do as you say. But know that you are breaking my heart.\""
msgstr "\"좋아요, 당신이 얘기한 대로 하도록 해요. 하지만 당신이 날 비탄에 빠뜨린다는걸 기억하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "631b48be-3ba5-443c-bf6d-c357a38ed010"
msgid "\"Fine. In fact, this should have happened a long time ago.\""
msgstr "\"좋아요. 솔직히 말하면, 진작 그랬어야 했어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "46deea81-f0a7-44b1-abe7-e5abbe1d7d53"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks gaunt and pale. There are shadows under his eyes, and "
"mournful wrinkles around the corners of his mouth.{/n} \"{name}. We need to "
"talk.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 창백하고 수척해 보입니다. 눈 아래에는 그림자가 가득하고, 우울한 주름이 입가에 서려있습니다.{/n} \"{name}. "
"할 얘기가 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "762efe44-b502-423f-8fca-8f924499bde3"
msgid ""
"\"Lately... lately I have been troubling you needlessly. All those "
"questions, conversations... and everything else... I know I distracted you "
"from your duties. It was selfish of me to demand so much of your attention. "
"I promise it won't happen again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"최근에... 최근에 내가 쓸때없이 당신을 괴롭혔습니다. 그 모든 질문과 대화들... 내가 당신의 임무에서 정신을 산만하게했다는 것을 "
"알고 있습니다. 그토록 당신의 관심을 요구하다니, 제가 이기적이었습니다. 다시는 그러지 않을 것이라 약속하지요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "eb633a17-6ed7-4c24-83e2-f7dea5cf715b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian closes his eyes and turns away.{/n} \"Perfect. I'm glad we've "
"understood each other.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 그의 눈을 감고 돌아섰다.{/n} \"완벽해요. 서로를 더 잘 이해하게되어 기쁘군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "86a70ab3-b7ad-4a7b-a2e0-9901599c1cae"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian winces.{/n} \"Please, {name}, don't. You are a baroness, the "
"ruler of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, protector of hundreds of "
"people. I can't distract you, especially... especially now when a baron from "
"the neighboring lands has gone missing! The same danger might hover over "
"you! What if... I can't let this happen!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 움찔합니다.{/n} \"제발, {name}, 그러지 마십시오. 당신은 여남작입니다. {g|Stolen Lands}"
"도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 지배자이자, 수많은 사람들의 보호자란 말입니다. 내가 당신을 산만하게 해서는 안됩니다, 특히..., 특히 이웃 "
"영지의 남작이 사라진 지금은 말입니다! 같은 위협이 당신에게도 닥칠 수 있습니다! 만약에... 그런 일이 일어나게 할 순 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "cacdcefe-4af0-4fe6-affa-35d71da9d379"
msgid ""
"{n}The young man pulls away and folds his hands in front of him in a gesture "
"of prayer.{/n} \"I will pray to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} for you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}젊은 이는 물러나 기도하기 위해 손을 모읍니다.{/n} \"당신을 위해 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께 기도하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "10b62a26-9a39-4256-9ca5-dbb6309c41f8"
msgid ""
"\"No! Please, think about yourself, about those who depend on you! Many "
"fates hanging by a thread...\" {n}Tristian sighs.{/n} \"Enough. It's decided."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요! 제발, 스스로를 생각하세요, 당신에게 의지하는 모든이들도요! 수많은 운명이 한가닥의 실에 매달려 있습니다...\" {n}"
"트리스티안은 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"그만. 이미 결정은 내렸습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_5_BreakUp/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "5ab5961e-b0c1-4fe3-965c-40904b5ff588"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head and turns away.{/n} \"Only to help you, {name}. "
"Only to help you.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙이고 떠납니다.{/n} \"그저 당신을 돕기 위해서입니다, {name}. 그저.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "7714ee7a-32cc-4f10-9fa3-8c8a27e15c06"
msgid "\"Yes, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"무슨일이죠, 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8cd0b942-c4af-4c8e-a65e-422a6462317e"
msgid "\"Please, call me by my name.\""
msgstr "\"부탁인데, 그냥 내 이름으로 불러줘요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4498150c-829f-4094-be34-c23f83d48d4a"
msgid "\"For now — Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"이제부턴 - 전하라고 해야죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a6787f9e-47bd-4f3c-8ecb-d7dc4b93f807"
msgid "\"I still want to be with you.\""
msgstr "\"난 여전히 당신과 함께하고 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "7069c398-e0b6-450a-bf9b-ee99c976638a"
msgid "\"I can't trust you.\""
msgstr "\"당신을 믿을 수 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ed219713-f047-4e3f-9280-921636885ba5"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach the exit, Tristian appears from the shadows. The whitish "
"hair framing his face looks like a shroud, but the deva's face radiates "
"calm.{/n} \"Your Highness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}출구에 다다르자, 트리스티안이 그림자 속에서 나타납니다. 그의 얼굴을 감싼 하얀 머리는 마치, 안개와 같지만, 데바의 얼굴은 "
"평온함을 내비치고 있습니다.{/n} \"각하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "fec9b358-b14e-47bd-9e0b-905abac02693"
msgid "{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"Of course.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"물론입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "f5af9835-afea-40ca-9218-ac0989aae67c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian laughs softly.{/n} \"If accuracy is a kingly virtue, you are "
"ready for the title.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 가볍게 웃습니다.{/n} \"언어적 명확성이 군주의 미덕이라면, 당신은 작위에 정말로 걸맞는 사람이군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "3a965f4e-4913-4aba-8764-dabdf6909795"
msgid "\"Just a minute of your time. It's all I'm asking.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만 시간을 내주십시오. 그 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b5d53a56-3fdd-4954-9806-79086578f2ff"
msgid ""
"\"You are on the verge of a great fate, {name}. I am happy that I have been "
"a part of it... even if my role in your advancement was so two-faced. "
"Together we've been through so much... and I realize that without you I "
"would be dead. Or, what's worse, continue to serve Nyrissa who tied me down "
"with her lies. I'm sorry I had to deceive you for such a long time, but "
"there were things I was sincere about.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 위대한 운명에 직면해 있습니다, {name}. 그 일부를 함께하게 되어 기쁩니다...그 과정에 내가 양면의 모습을 "
"보였더라도요. 우린 수많은 일들을 함께 해쳐왔지요... 그리고 당신이 없었다면 난 분명 죽음을 맞이했겠지요. 어쩌면 더 끔찍한 운명에 "
"쳐했을지도 모릅니다. 날 거짓말로 속박한 장본인인 나이리사를 여전히 섬기고 있을지도요. 오랫동안 당신을 기만해야 했던건 유감입니다만, 그 "
"와중에도 내가 진실했던 순간이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "6682e576-1113-4d39-bcd1-6f834d20f964"
msgid ""
"\"I know I don't have the right to ask you for anything. I know I should be "
"grateful to you for just letting me stay near. But I will never forgive "
"myself if I don't ask...\" {n}Tristan makes a step towards you, his voice is "
"barely audible.{/n} \"Now that hypocrisy and lies are in the past, you gave "
"me another chance. Will you give another chance... to us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신께 뭔가를 요구할 권리가 없다는 건 잘 압니다. 당신 곁에 머물 수 있다는 것만 하더라도 감사해야 한다는 것도요. 하지만 이를 "
"부탁하지 않는다면 내 자신을 용서하지 못할 것 같습니다...\" {n}트리스티안은 한발 당신 곁으로 다가와, 겨우 들릴만한 목소리로 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"과거의 위선과 기만에도 불구하고, 당신은 나에게 또 다른 기회를 주었습니다. 당신과 나 사이에도... 다시 한번 "
"기회를 주지 않겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "39bb3253-50e2-4d8b-b5b1-0505d6346e6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"Of course. Well... Thank you for your "
"honesty.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"물론 그렇겠지요. 음... 솔직히 말해줘서 고맙습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "e7951d70-7277-4338-9525-12ef3d8dd8f6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian makes another step and is so close that his ragged breathing "
"tickles the skin of your cheek.{/n} \"I promise... no, I swear to you. If "
"you wish, I'll give my life for you. No more duplicity. No more deception. "
"Just the truth. Just...\" {n}Tristian holds your hand to his mouth and "
"kisses it tenderly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 한걸음 더 다가옵니다. 너무도 가까워 그의 거친 숨결이 당신의 뺨을 애무하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"약속합니다... "
"아니, 맹세하지요. 당신이 원한다면, 내 생명도 당신에게 줄 것입니다. 더 이상 이중성과 거짓이 없이 그저 진실만을 얘기하겠습니다. "
"그저...\" {n}트리스티안은 당신의 손에 가볍게 키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_6_SecondChance/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "d80c8172-7c4c-4d70-944c-d32729053595"
msgid ""
"\"Go on, your subjects are waiting. So does your fate. May "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} bless you!\""
msgstr "\"가시죠. 당신의 백성이 기다립니다. 물론 당신의 운명도요. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서 당신을 축복하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "7da914cf-8c07-44db-9ff8-23b24c336ad8"
msgid "\"What, are you comparing us with what you read in your book?\""
msgstr "\"뭐죠, 당신이 책에서 읽은 거랑 지금 우리랑 비교하는 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "568b311d-ce5c-4663-9929-42b45f1b601c"
msgid "\"Let's do it again. Right now.\""
msgstr "\"또 한번 해요. 지금 당장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "01efe7dd-6bc3-4193-bd7a-39254afcd510"
msgid "\"It will get even better. We have many nights ahead of us.\""
msgstr "\"점점 더 좋아질꺼에요. 우리에겐 수많은 밤이 남았으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "91af64dd-0483-4697-b7d3-83ca5048cfc1"
msgid "\"Let's never get out of bed.\""
msgstr "\"침대에서 평생 살자구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "da726b3d-09b5-45c8-8029-aea3140a16c2"
msgid "\"Let's get married.\""
msgstr "\"우리 결혼해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "04ab00cd-0b3e-4f55-b93c-ece8110ae647"
msgid "\"Just be near me. Always.\""
msgstr "\"내 곁에 있어줘요. 언제나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0c49be33-78ff-4df0-9f67-be0c7b6b44d4"
msgid "\"Find me after I die. Wherever I am.\""
msgstr "\"내가 죽은 후에도 날 찾아줘요. 내가 어디 있던 간에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "014a2848-1154-48cd-a5f8-305fd0a7317f"
msgid "\"I want you to be happy, too. And I'm not going to push you around.\""
msgstr "\"나도 당신이 행복하길 원해요. 당신을 못살게 굴진 않을께요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "721cd228-3079-4e74-81c9-92ea0f1a62dd"
msgid "\"Let's not think about the future. We're together. That's enough.\""
msgstr "\"미래는 나중에 생각하도록 해요. 지금 우린 함께 있잖아요. 그걸로 충분해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "06bb9d09-3831-4077-9cfe-1fc0b1408b22"
msgid "\"The world can wait, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"세상 일은 우리 일이 끝날 때까지 기다리라 해요., 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "4cb8669a-c001-4e02-88c2-6ab8759ff47a"
msgid "\"Did you think once would be enough for me?\""
msgstr "\"한번으로 내가 만족할 거라 생각하는 건 아니겠지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "14b53ae5-bcc4-4d0c-a72b-f249f2358edf"
msgid "\"We have to go. There will be time later.\""
msgstr "\"가야해요. 나중에 시간이 또 있을꺼에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "52bbbaaa-eebf-4d57-ad9a-ac32b87e5da9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian tosses his hair from his face.{/n} \"That was... amazing. I did "
"not think...\" {n}The deva cuts himself short, thinking about something.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리카락을 이마 위로 넘깁니다.{/n} \"그건... 정말 놀라웠어요. 난 그럴꺼라곤...\" {n}데바는 뭔가생각에 "
"잠긴 듯 말문을 끊습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2899fb02-a33d-4c82-a09a-528ba957215d"
msgid ""
"\"What? Ah, you are talking about that... treatise!\" {n}Tristian laughs.{/n}"
" \"No, I think I won't even try!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고요? 아, 그 논문 얘기군요!\" {n}트리스티안은 웃습니다..{/n} \"아니요, 그건 엄두도 못내겠는걸요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "789f891a-414e-4991-9b38-ef9c925fb57a"
msgid ""
"\"And days. The whole eternity. Our little eternity.\" {n}Tristian stops "
"again.{/n}"
msgstr "\"많은 날들이 우리 앞에 있지요. 영원의 날들. 우리만의 영원의 날들이.\" {n}트리스티안은 다시금 말을 멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "3dfe4cef-7045-4a86-884f-0f940bc7ff00"
msgid ""
"\"Wait a second. Let me catch my breath. We have a whole future. Our little "
"eternity.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만요. 숨 좀 돌리고요. 시간은 얼마든지 있잖아요. 작지만 영원같은 시간이 있다고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "455affc9-a289-4c0c-a182-c268e9afd1ff"
msgid ""
"\"You emit warmth, like the sun. But, {name}... Once, wandering among "
"worlds, I saw eternity pass, and the brightest of suns dim. And I can't but "
"think that once... you and I will be separated.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 마치 태양처럼. 따스함을 비춥니다. 하지만, {name}... 나는 한 때 수많은 세상을 방랑했고, 영원이 지나가고 가장 밝게 "
"불타는 태양이 꺼지는 것도 목격했습니다. 그러니... 언젠간 우리가 서로를 떠나게 될 날이 올거라는 생각을 지울 수가 없군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "f65e54c3-d2ce-43ae-b577-fb0c92530db1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian wraps his arm around your shoulders.{/n} \"And while we are "
"together... I don't know how long it will last... I want you to be happy. "
"Tell me what you want. Your wish is my command.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 팔을 둘러 당신을 안아줍니다.{/n} \"하지만 우리가 함께 있을 동안엔...그게 아무리 짧을지라도... 난 당신이 "
"행복했으면 좋겠습니다. 무엇을 원하는지 말만 해주세요. 당신 뜻을 따르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "ab2166ad-e4dd-413c-a3c9-ce188d629a1f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian thinks.{/n} \"The {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} have just one "
"queen — the one who conquered them.\" {n}The deva smiles.{/n} \"But I will "
"be honored to be your Prince Consort.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 생각에 잠깁니다.{/n} \"{g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}엔 오직 한 명의 여왕이 있지요. 이 땅을 "
"정복한 당신 말입니다.\" {n}데바는 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"그분의 부군이 된다면 영광일 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "55f1a87f-09a2-4e54-b754-c3f31ddb6542"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian coughs, surprised.{/n} \"Forgive me, Your Highness, but your "
"subjects will be against it — someone must rule them! Anyway, I'll do "
"everything in my power to make the queen happy.\" {n}The deva leans into you "
"and kisses your neck.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 놀라서 기침을 터트립니다.{/n} \"실례지만, 전하, 백성들은 용납하지 않을 것 입니다 - 누군가는 그들을 "
"다스려야하니까요! 어쨌든 여왕님을 행복하게 해드리기 위해 모든 걸 다하도록 하지요.\" {n}데바는 몸을 기울여 당신의 목에 "
"키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c183cabf-8b39-4211-8a21-0eae90648f21"
msgid ""
"\"I see you kept my gift...\" {n}Tristian strokes your hand.{/n} \"As soon "
"as this madness around is over, I'll take care of a wedding.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 선물을 간직하고 있었군요...\" {n}트리스티안은 당신의 손을 만집니다.{/n} \"이 광란이 끝나는 대로, 결혼식을 준비하도록 "
"하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "24b58d92-df4e-4120-b8a0-c83737d5f575"
msgid ""
"\"I will take care about everything. As soon as this madness that's going on "
"around you, is over. Until then I will be too busy protecting you.\""
msgstr "\"내가 모든 걸 준비하겠습니다. 당신 주위의 광란이 끝나는 즉시 말입니다. 그때까진 당신을 지키는데 최선을 다다하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "796b653b-36ab-4652-afee-5f3647294bbe"
msgid "{n}Tristian nods solemnly.{/n} \"I promise. I will not leave you.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 엄숙히 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"약속하지요. 당신을 떠나지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "60a5784e-3d74-45d3-911f-0c157b3a2a35"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head sadly.{/n} \"You know that's impossible. I must "
"return... to where I must be. But I know that merciful "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} will not call me immediately after the victory over "
"Nyrissa. You and I will have time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 슬프게 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"그게 불가능하단걸 당신도 잘 알지 않습니까... 난 내가 있어야 할 곳으로 "
"돌아가야합니다. 하지만 자비로운 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}깨서 나이리사를 쓰러뜨리는 그 순간 날 부르시지는 않으실 겁니다. "
"당신과 내겐 충분한 시간이 주어지겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "b39286ba-7dfc-43d3-aaec-b6bd9a2f0da1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian thinks for a few moments.{/n} \"I didn't think about that... but "
"I can try. No, not just try: I will turn all the worlds to find you — "
"wherever you are and whoever you become.\" {n}Tristian kisses you "
"tenderly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 생각에 잠깁니다.{/n} \"그점은 미쳐 생각해보지 못했군요... 노력해보겠습니다. 아니 그냥 노력하는게 아니라: "
"당신을 찾기 위해 온 세상을 찾아다닐 겁니다 - 당신이 어디에 있건, 어떤 사림이 되었건 .\" {n}트리스티안은 부드럽게 "
"키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "8ecccebf-1b56-44e3-98d2-d087a43f1f6e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian leans into you, presses his forehead against yours, and stays "
"silent, his eyes closed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신과 이마를 맞대고, 눈을 감으며, 침묵을 지킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "de5e245a-6a28-4419-be16-3f75c275f21c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian runs his fingers along your neck and kisses your shoulder.{/n} "
"\"Of course. I overthink everything, don't I?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 목부터 손가락을 쓸어내리더니, 어깨에 키스합니다.{/n} \"당신 말이 맞습니다. 난 모든걸 지나치게 생각하곤 "
"한다니까요, 그렇지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "cbc3a87a-99f8-4d69-932c-043ced330fc9"
msgid ""
"\"You know. I have not been as sure as now, for such a long time. When I was "
"Nyrissa's prisoner, I had no more freedom than a bird in a cage. I even "
"doubted {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} mercy in my darkest hour. But with you... "
"with you I'm not afraid of the future. I'm not afraid to make mistakes, "
"because I know I will be able to fix them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알다시피, 그 오랜 시간 동안 지금처럼 확신에 찬 적은 없었습니다. 내가 나이리사의 죄수였을 때, 난 새장 속의 새보다 자유롭지 "
"못했습니다. 내 가장 어두운 순간 난 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 자비마저 의심했지요. 하지만 당신과 함께있는 지금... 난 "
"미래가 두렵지 않습니다. 또 다시 실수할까 두렵지도 않습니다. 당신과 함께라면 어떤 실수도 헤쳐나갈 수 있을 것이기 때문입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "f74d41c3-b4a6-48cf-ac79-f89af9c959d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian raises his head, as if hearing something.{/n} \"I would like to "
"stay alone with you for a little while. If you do not mind.\""
msgstr "{n}뭔가를 들은 듯 트리스티안은 고개를 듭니다{/n} \"괜찮다면 당신과만 잠시 함께 있고 싶군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "775d45e9-26b3-4ea7-99f1-70531ee6c861"
msgid "{n}In response, Tristian holds you and pulls you close.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}이에 답하듯, 트리스티안은 당신을 안고선 가까이 끌어당깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e592d7dd-9d2c-4ef9-86b0-bf59f28da9c3"
msgid "\"Really? Come to me, my queen...\""
msgstr "\"정말입니까? 내게로 오십시오, 나의 여왕이시여...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/MajorEvent_9_OurForever/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "664004c3-6172-4aa1-b2b3-0d6b5bfe23e3"
msgid "{n}Tristian kisses your hand and pulls away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신 손에 키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "70bd9c06-a6cc-4065-954b-82b29ba440ce"
msgid "\"Yes, it's true. Regongar and I are together.\""
msgstr "\"그래요. 레곤가르와 난 함께하고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "280e955b-653e-45b2-8fb8-d7f0715908e7"
msgid "\"You're right. Octavia and I are together.\""
msgstr "\"그래요. 옥타비아와 난 함께하고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2cf0f054-2480-4b69-ae00-90c437674e6a"
msgid "\"We're just friends.\""
msgstr "\"우린 친구일 뿐이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f437827d-cccd-4670-bdbb-f8797a7b08cb"
msgid "\"Why? Are you jealous?\""
msgstr "\"왜요? 질투하는 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "89429789-474d-42af-97d3-27ab92af3725"
msgid "\"I've said it more than once: you're the only one for me.\""
msgstr "\"전에도 말한 적 있었죠: 내겐 당신 뿐이란걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "21f0b3c4-b198-4a60-a1c0-fdf1a9c7f40d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you with apparent indifference, masking unspoken "
"anxiety.{/n} \"I wanted to know something, {name}. If you don't mind.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 말할 수 없는 불안감을 감추는 무관심한 표정을 짓고는 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"괜찮다면, {name}, 알고 싶은 "
"게 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "978482dc-a4c2-45d4-be56-6a9c4820eb83"
msgid ""
"\"I saw you talking to Regongar. You... seem closer to each other than our "
"other companions. Is there something between you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 레곤가르와 얘기하는 걸 봤습니다. 다른 동료들보다 매우 가까운 사이처럼 보이더군요. 둘 사이에 뭔가가 있는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2251b6b5-e179-471d-96f0-e3468d9265fe"
msgid ""
"\"I saw you having fun with Octavia. It seemed there was... something "
"special between the two of you. Is it true?\""
msgstr "\"당신과 옥타비아과 함께 즐기는 걸 봤습니다. 당신 둘 사이는 뭔가 특별한 게 있어 보였습니다. 정말 그런가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "2b73c685-8afb-4a3d-b46b-4d0c6a0d2f51"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks surprised.{/n} \"Really? Strange, I thought... well, it "
"doesn't matter. I'm sorry to pry.\" {n}Tristian turns away with a guilty "
"look, but then suddenly casts a quick glance at you.{/n} \"I hope you're not "
"the only one who thinks so...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 놀란 듯 보입니다.{/n} \"정말입니까? 이상하군요, 내 생각엔.... 음, 상관없겠지요. 넘겨 짚어서 미안합니다.\""
" {n}트리스티안은 죄책감 어린 표정을 짓곤 돌아서더니, 흘낏 쳐다봅니다. {/n} \"당신만 그렇게 생각하는게 아니었으면 좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "8479790a-d59b-4d48-9b53-7baac84d42d2"
msgid ""
"\"I... understand. Well...\" {n}Tristian sighs and smiles warmly.{/n} \"You"
"'re a wonderful couple. I hope all the happiness in the world awaits you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이... 이해합니다. 음..\" {n}트리스티안은 한숨을 쉬더니 곧 따스한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신 둘은 멋진 연인입니다. "
"세상의 모든 기쁨이 당신 앞에 있기를 바라겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "a775a6d4-d5de-4495-9ce1-759e130aae59"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian coughs.{/n} \"I'm not... Oh, {name}, you know how to embarrass "
"me!\" {n}The priest laughs awkwardly, and then suddenly becomes serious.{/n} "
"\"I just hope you don't break anyone's heart. Anyway, I'm sure the others "
"are much better at relationships than I am.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"난 그런게 아니라... 오, {name}, 당신은 어떻게 하면 날 부끄럽게 만들지 너무도 "
"잘 안다니까요!\" {n}성직자는 어색하게 웃더니, 갑자기 심각해집니다.{/n} \"당신이 어느 누구의 마음도 아프게 하지 않았으면 했을 "
"뿐입니다. 어쨌든 분명 다른 이들이 나보단 관계를 맺는 데 있어선 더 잘 할테니 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Tristian/Tristian_Choosing/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "1931c74f-2d14-4cba-8583-158a181eb584"
msgid ""
"{n}A telltale blush appears on Tristian's face.{/n} \"No! What are you "
"talking about! I'm just...\""
msgstr "{n}숨길 수 없는 홍조가 트리스티안의 얼굴에 나타납니다..{/n} \"아니 무슨 말을 하는 겁니까! 난 그저...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_AfterSex01_String
msgctxt "93f388c3-7526-487e-aed1-9ad391070b41"
msgid "\"I feel good when I'm with you. Let's come back here more often.\""
msgstr "\"당신과 함께 있으면 언제나 기분이 좋아요. 여기 자주 오도록 해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_AfterSex02_String
msgctxt "82d03053-0f6c-414b-860f-790fbf1eb201"
msgid "\"I don't want to let you go.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 떠나지 않았으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_AfterSex03_String
msgctxt "0a73bbed-aa3f-4b12-98e5-7198c102e8e9"
msgid "\"You never cease to surprise me. I like this.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 언제나 날 놀라게 해요. 그 점이 마음에 들어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_AfterSex04_String
msgctxt "3771b0d3-8566-4c86-acac-dd3aeb9a849e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh. Is that a scratch on your neck? Forgive me! I'll be more careful!\""
msgstr "\"오. 당신 목에 상처가 난건가요? 미안해요! 다음엔 조심할께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_AfterSex05_String
msgctxt "2c70a358-ad39-4700-86cb-2237c7d715a8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I can imagine what the servants will be whispering after tonight!\""
msgstr "\"오, 오늘 밤이 지나고 시종들이 뭐라고 수근댈지 훤하군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_idle01_String
msgctxt "57986465-cd2c-487a-a738-037f43596254"
msgid "\"You go first. I'll come later.\""
msgstr "\"먼저가세요. 따라갈께요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_idle02_String
msgctxt "63c12d92-26f2-4c22-8bda-8c58f2a88efc"
msgid "\"Don't look at me like that. I'll be ready in a second.\""
msgstr "\"날 그렇게 보지 말아요. 잠시면 되요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Barks/Valerie_idle03_String
msgctxt "702cdbf6-a7cb-466c-aa33-1eb4fd9d4e37"
msgid "\"Please let me get ready in peace.\""
msgstr "\"내가 차분히 준비하게 해줘요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4657a438-456d-41fd-909a-5aa6d0200fc7"
msgid "[Try to fix her buckle]"
msgstr "[그녀의 버클을 고쳐주려고 시도한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "73e45942-5c2d-4e76-92f7-802d7958f3c1"
msgid "\"Can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도와줄까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9925c3ac-d1c0-4929-9acc-0b33327b1df5"
msgid "[Watch silently]"
msgstr "[말없이 지켜본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ad74cefe-7c4d-4f10-96e9-df07ff306a76"
msgid "\"I just wanted to help.\""
msgstr "\"그저 도와주고 싶었을 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "a3850667-5a8a-4b00-a05d-19e96c5546dd"
msgid "\"You're so smug!\""
msgstr "\"너무 콧대가 높은 것 아닙니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b8b21a28-c798-4e1d-8a5e-9f46dfcf0144"
msgid "\"Always glad to help.\""
msgstr "\"도움이 되어 기쁘군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e60c2284-c202-4155-84d8-8841e778d4e7"
msgid ""
"\"Come on, curse already! It won't fix it, but it'll make you feel better.\""
msgstr "\"욕이라도 해봐요! 버클이 고쳐지진 않겠지만 기분은 나아질테니\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "2e2e1433-b729-4717-9097-e193cb1fd110"
msgid "\"You're cold and fearless in battle, then driven to rage by a clasp.\""
msgstr "\"싸움 중엔 용감하고 냉정하더니, 겨우 버클 하나 때문에 화를내는군요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "a063d482-e883-4090-ac1d-4dad72b8cd84"
msgid "\"How about a kiss for saving the damsel in distress?\""
msgstr "\"위기에 처한 아가씨를 구해준 보답으로 키스 한 번 해주겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "9504713a-ebe8-42b9-a311-f51609540183"
msgid "\"Look at you! Fearless Valerie can be embarrassed!\""
msgstr "\"이것 좀 보게! 무서울게 없는 발레리도 부끄러워 할 줄 아는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fb0a9055-af90-4281-aee2-76c10f778035"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is trying in vain to fasten one of the many buckles on her armor. "
"It appears that the clasp is completely stuck.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 그녀의 값옷에 달린 많은 버클 중 하나를 조이는 데 애를 먹고 있습니다. 버클은 완전히 고장나버린 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0d5dc4a9-8da3-43ae-a8f6-646f7cb566de"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl seems to be losing her patience. She tugs on the buckle several "
"times, then furiously hisses something — swallowing her spirited words. "
"Noticing you're watching her, Valerie puffs a loose strand of hair from her "
"eyes and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 인내심을 잃어 가고 있는 것 같습니다. 그녀는 버클을 여러번 잡아당기더니 - 터져나오려는 말문을 삼키면서 분노에 차 "
"씩씩거립니다. 당신이 보고 있다는 걸 눈치채고는 산발이 된 머리를 정리하더니, 이내 고개를 돌립니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "5b3634a5-417d-492c-960b-72c1d82750b9"
msgid ""
"{n}Without saying a word, you reach for the buckle on Valerie's armor. At "
"first the girl watches you, baffled, then pulls away, annoyed.{/n} \"I'd "
"appreciate it if you kept your hands to yourself, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 말없이 발레리의 갑옷에 달린 버클에 손을 뻗습니다. 발레리는 처음엔 당신을 지켜보다가, 이내 당황해서는 짜증을 내며 당신의 "
"손을 치워냅니다.{/n} \"손을 치워주면 고맙겠군요, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "91dbb320-2016-4dbb-ba6e-b2445936eb87"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sizes you up with an icy-cold look.{/n} \"I will take that into "
"consideration.\" {n}The girl turns away with an arrogant look.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 차가운 시선으로 당신을 재봅니다.{/n} \"고려해보도록 하겠어요.\" {n}발레리는 오만한 표정을 지으며 "
"돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "0006d481-0862-4092-8565-8663e0cb2765"
msgid ""
"\"Did you? It's a pity you didn't deem it appropriate to offer your "
"assistance first.\" {n}Valerie casts an apprehensive look at you.{/n} \"I've "
"received unsolicited care often enough to know when someone is being "
"patronizing. Don't try my patience, please.\" {n}The girl fixes her buckle "
"and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그랬나요? 먼저 도움이 필요한지 물어보는게 적절한 처사라 생각지 않았다니 안타깝군요.\" {n}발레리는 불안한 눈초리로 당신을 "
"바라봅니다..{/n} \"난 부탁하지 않은 보살핌을 너무 많이 받아왔어요. 누군가 젠체하는 건 단박에 구분해 낼 수 있을 정도이지요. 내 "
"인내심을 시험하지 말아줘요.\" {n}소녀는 버클을 고치더니 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b926a92c-d90d-4a90-ba34-f31ae69b9ac0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie tugs at the belt a few more times, then finally sighs and turns "
"to you.{/n} \"I would appreciate it.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 몇번 더 허리띠를 잡아당기더니, 마침내 한숨을 쉬고는 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그래주면 고맙겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "58bbcf5e-2fb7-48d6-8133-38bc0509b1c8"
msgid ""
"{n}You identify the problem effortlessly and fix the buckle. Valerie turns "
"her head to see what you are doing, and leans almost against your face. "
"Noticing this, she blushes slightly and pulls away.{/n} \"Thank you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 간단히 문제를 파악하고는 버클을 고칩니다. 발레리는 당신이 무엇을 하는지 보려고 고개를 돌리고는 당신의 얼굴에 거의 마주할 "
"만큼 몸을 기울입니다. 이 점을 깨닫고는, 발레리는 얼굴을 살짝 붉히더니 살짝 떨어집니다.{/n} \"고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6dc90982-be54-4ada-9652-758de785f276"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl spreads her shoulders and smiles with the corners of her "
"mouth.{/n} \"Good point. Indeed, the little things can sometimes bring one "
"to an outburst of rage.\" {n}Valerie sighs and fixes the buckle, calmer "
"now.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}소녀는 어깨를 펴고 옅은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"좋은 지적입니다. 별 거 아닌 일에 무섭도록 화가 날 때가 있지요.\" {n}"
"발레리는 한숨을 내쉬고는 차분하게 허리띠를 매만집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "3451e4f4-ab1b-4dbd-8a9f-e064262d9cb6"
msgid ""
"\"No, I... come on... damn thing!\" {n}Valerie tugs at the belt with all her "
"strength — and the buckle clinks and returns to its proper place. The girl "
"chuckles happily.{/n} \"Who would have thought? I think I should heed this "
"such... uncommon advice more often!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요, 난...제발... 이 망할 것!\" {n}발레리는 온 힘을 다해 허리띠를 당깁니다 - 그랬더니 버클이 딸깍하면서 고쳐집니다. "
"소녀는 기뻐하며 빙그레 웃습니다.{/n} \"누가 이럴 줄 알았겠어요? 앞으론 당신의 그... 독특한 조언에 귀를 기울여야겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "13ca0cb7-8952-4e0b-9daf-7edb3ffef33c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie burns you with an indignant look.{/n} \"Do you remember me "
"covering you in battle the other day? I think we're even.\" {n}The girl "
"turns away abruptly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 경멸스런 눈초리로 당신을 뚫어져라 노려봅니다..{/n} \"저번 전투에서 당신을 구해줬던건 기억해요? 그 빚을 갚은 걸로 "
"치겠어요.\" {n}소녀는 퉁명스럽게 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_1_ALittleHelp/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "1e8d1d70-b0c0-4cbd-995b-a28a6d08d841"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie laughs softly and shrugs her shoulder — a gesture that could be "
"interpreted as flirting, if Valerie didn't immediately hide behind her "
"habitual mask.{/n} \"Jokes aside. We have to go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 가볍게 웃고는 어깨를 으쓱합니다. - 발레리가 그 즉시 습관적인 표정 뒤에 숨지 않았다면, 당신을 유혹하고 있다고 생각했을 "
"몸짓이었습니다.{/n} \"농담은 그만하죠. 이제 가야해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c19d98e5-53f3-4357-8746-0417706c9e2a"
msgid "\"I think perhaps you simply haven't met any truly gallant gentlemen.\""
msgstr "\"그저 당신이 여태껏 진정으로 용감한 신사를 만나지 못했을 뿐이라 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "65f030f9-dc68-434c-8508-e1d32d68e061"
msgid "\"I'm sorry that happened to you.\""
msgstr "\"그런 일이 일어나서 유감입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "94865fb4-18fa-4ea2-9298-3205d7b87655"
msgid "\"Let's change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"대화 주제를 바꿔보지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "78c00580-1226-4fc0-a209-2d36488073bf"
msgid "\"Sounds disgusting.\""
msgstr "\"역겨운 소리군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "e423f1e3-4bae-40a4-9d34-11bdef4d4598"
msgid "\"I hope I never see the day that women court men!\""
msgstr "\"여자가 남자에게 구애하는 세상이라니, 내가 죽기 전까진 그런 세상이 오지 않았으면 좋겠군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "68956084-1f25-4bea-ae2f-823b47b0340b"
msgid "\"Why, by inquiring after the wishes of the gallant dame.\""
msgstr "\"왜, 있지 않습니까. 용감한 여기사의 의중부터 여쭤봐야겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "01fd5187-5930-4f4a-b225-47448bd00bfb"
msgid "\"Don't make a fool of their sweetheart.\""
msgstr "\"그들의 사랑하는 마음마져 놀리지는 맙시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "3a17935c-96f8-416d-815f-a48ef74e6198"
msgid "\"Calmly work on conquering the woman.\""
msgstr "\"침착하게 여인을 정복하는 작업을 진행해야겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "03a22218-d7d4-4c6e-b474-3ee09c51b26b"
msgid ""
"\"... I barely turned around and — bam! I don't know how my shield didn't "
"crumble to pieces from the blow! My arm and shoulder scolded me for two days "
"before I got to a healer. So whenever I hear someone say they'll do without "
"a shield on the battlefield, I always remember that ogre. If I didn't have a "
"shield, I don't know where I would be now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 내가 막 돌아서려고 하는데 그 순간 - 꽝! 그 일격을 맞고도 어떻게 방패가 박살나지 않고 버텼냈는지 지금도 놀라울 "
"뿐이랍니다! 치유사를 찾아갈 때까지 이틀동안 팔과 어깨가 욱신거렸지요. 그때부터 누군가 전쟁터에 방패없이 나가겠다고 할때면 그 오우거가 "
"떠오른답니다. 내 방패가 없었다면, 난 지금 이자리에 있지 못했을테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "19ad1e1b-fbec-4e9b-97e5-3297a0d398fe"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shakes her hair and sighs.{/n} \"To be honest, intelligent "
"creatures frighten me more than mindless monsters. It's their amazing "
"ability to conceal a rotten core behind a front of politeness. I remember "
"one knight...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 머리를 흔들며 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"솔직히 말하자면, 지각없는 괴물들보단 지각을 가진 생명체가 더 두렵답니다. 예의를 "
"앞세워 썩은 본심을 숨기는 놀라운 능력 때문이지요. 언젠가 만났던 기사 한 명이 생각나는군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "e26ee059-481d-4bbe-8c6a-e8b2fb8fbb8b"
msgid ""
"\"I met him at one of {g|Brevoy}Brevic{/g} mercenary camps. He noticed me "
"among some others and got it into his head that I had to be... conquered. "
"Like some prize, or an honorary trophy. In two days the whole camp knew I "
"was his intended, and would surely belong to him — just give him time.\" {n}"
"Valerie grinds her teeth.{/n} \"And this wasn't the only smug scoundrel life "
"has thrown at me. Supposedly gallant gentlemen who expect only one thing of "
"a woman — to be obedient. And inarticulate.\""
msgstr ""
"\" 난 한 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 용병 야영지에서 그 사람을 만났지요. 그는 무리 중에서 나에게 관심을 갖더니 날... "
"정복해야겠다고 결심했답니다. 마치 무슨 포상이나 영광스런 전리품처럼 말이에요. 이틀 정도 지나자, 그가 내게 관심이 있다는 소문이 야영지 "
"전체에 퍼졌고 - 조금만 시간이지나면 - 내가 분명 그의 소유가 될거라고 확신하는 분위기였답니다.\" {n}발레리는 이를 갑니다.{/n} "
"\"그리고 여태껏 내 삶은 이런 재수없는 불량배들을 여럿을 내게 던져왔지요. 용감한 신사분들께서는 여자에게 오직 한가지 모습 - "
"순종적이고 의사표현을 감추는 모습만을 바라는 모양이지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "125847d5-2b7d-4bfd-bb23-427da41c1680"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie runs her fingers along her armor, removing an invisible grain of "
"dust.{/n} \"So, where was I? Anyway, we have to go. Lead us, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 보이지 않는 먼지를 털어내는 양 손가락으로 갑옷을 쓸어내립니다.{/n} \"음, 그래서 어디까지 말했더라? 어쨌든, 이제 "
"가봐야겠네요. 앞장서세요, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0df2d02e-95e2-4d86-a85d-0f8b903bea55"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie nods.{/n} \"Yes. That's exactly how you feel: disgusted. And "
"should you turn from an idol into a living person and refuse — then at that "
"moment 'gallant sir' sees you as an ungrateful wretch.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래요. 그게 바로 내가 정확히 느낀 바에요: 역겨움. 당신이 숭배의 대상에서 살아있는 인간으로 "
"변해 거절의 말을 건낸다면 - 그 순간 바로 '용감한 기사나리'는 당신을 고마워할 줄 모르는 몹쓸년으로 본답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ffa04414-f83c-4181-b398-0b07a1763c08"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shakes her head and chuckles.{/n} \"You should rather be sorry "
"for him. He looked quite pathetic when he realized that I could give him not "
"only a rejection but a proper beating back for the insults!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 고개를 젓더니 웃습니다.{/n} \"이 얘기를 들으면 안타깝겠군요. 내가 거절할 수 있을 뿐만아니라 모욕에 걸맞는 매질도 "
"할 줄 안다는 걸 그가 깨달았을 때 어찌나 한심해보이던지!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "201fd5a5-58ab-4dbd-943e-f13dd4db475a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks up at you with sincere curiosity.{/n} \"And why not? Do "
"women have to sit and wait for happiness to fall on them — in the form of a "
"man who happens to like them? Though there are plenty of such women in the "
"world. — I'm sure one of them will become the woman of your choice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 진지한 호기심으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"안될께 뭐있나요? 여자는 앉아서 행복이 - 그들을 사랑하는 남자의 형태로 -"
" 눈앞에 떨어질때까지 기다리기만 해야 하나요? 그런 여자들이 이 세상에 수없이 많긴 하지만요 - 당신의 짝이 될 사람도 그런 사람 중 "
"하나겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "9ad9c111-cb36-470a-b021-5d9089ce2e45"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sizes you up.{/n} \"Really? And how, do you think, a truly "
"gallant gentleman would behave?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신을 재어봅니다.{/n} \"그런가요? 그럼, 진정 용감한 신사라면 어떻게 행동해야 하는거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c862979b-7aee-4dd2-91b0-f2efac5d6f54"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie purses her lips.{/n} \"More like a spying operation than the "
"approach of an honest person. Although I'm sure many men would agree with "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 입술을 꾹 다뭅니다.{/n} \"정직한 사람의 방식이라기보다 첩보 작전에 가까운 것 같군요. 물론 많은 남자들이 당신 말에 "
"동의하겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "478488d5-8873-4e3c-b3d2-24bcc2bc4c4d"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles to you and looks down.{/n} \"Yes. Yes, that would be a "
"welcome change from the row of smug roosters boasting victories they haven't "
"yet won.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신에게 미소짓더니 아래를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그래요. 이긴 적도 없으면서 승리를 뽐내는 재수없는 수탉들보단 더 좋은 "
"얘깃거리가 많으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_1_WhoLeadsInADance/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "64ce3825-56ae-4e64-b1da-3587cf9b7445"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie laughs in response.{/n} \"Oh, I see you're from that endangered "
"tribe! It's comforting to know men like you still exist.\" {n}Valerie "
"pauses, looking at you.{/n} \"That's probably why I'm still with you. I "
"mean, in your party!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 말에 발레리가 웃습니다.{/n} \"오, 내가 보기엔 당신이 바로 그 멸종위기종 중 하나인 모양이네요! 당신같은 남자가 여전히 "
"존재한다니 정말 마음이 놓이네요.\" {n}발레리는 잠시 말을 멈추더니, 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"아마 그게 내가 당신과 여전히 "
"함께하는 이유겠지요. 아니 내 말은, 당신 일행과 함께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "1e6c99b5-6f14-4631-8328-ad65d1e94c91"
msgid "\"What is it?\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭡니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ec80ea13-b93e-4658-959d-7922679de675"
msgid "\"Looks strange.\""
msgstr "\"수상해 보이는데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9b0eab13-fba3-4371-aad1-e1b42e0923a1"
msgid "\"What does it have to do with me?\""
msgstr "\"그게 나랑 무슨 상관이 있는겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "67ff73d2-70a8-464e-8a0d-284402ed3cab"
msgid "\"Maybe you should show the potion to an alchemist first?\""
msgstr "\"먼저 연금술사에게 물약을 보여주는게 좋지 않겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "e654d8b8-30d8-48d9-9ae8-c620e66d624f"
msgid "\"That potion might be dangerous.\""
msgstr "\"그 물약은 해로울 수도 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "64bcc5cb-deb4-4613-bf31-cbc74481f712"
msgid "\"Of course it is!\""
msgstr "\"물론 당연히 그래야지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "918ad452-c3b0-4089-afbb-e9f2b99734d2"
msgid "\"Please, don't risk your life.\""
msgstr "\"부탁하건데, 당신 생명에 위험한 일은 그만둬 주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "10606613-68ac-42c0-bb88-18aa5b5be335"
msgid "\"No! I forbid it!\""
msgstr "\"안됩니다! 내가 허락하지 않을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "43f9206c-eabb-4edd-a630-c32c2c92f661"
msgid "\"If it restores your beauty, it's worth the risk!\""
msgstr "\"그게 당신의 아름다움을 되돌릴 수 있다면, 위험을 무릅쓸 가치가 있지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "0a27ebb7-a3e0-4ac4-8100-6ed1113f10c4"
msgid ""
"\"It's dangerous! Please, throw that muck away and don't risk yourself!\""
msgstr "\"너무 위험합니다! 부탁하건데, 그 구정물은 버려버립시다. 당신 생명을 걸 가치는 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "2240baa3-ffb0-4140-bd31-ee757c33dc68"
msgid "\"Don't even think about using that suspicious potion!\""
msgstr "\"그 수상한 물약을 쓸 생각은 꿈도 꾸지 마십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "24ebb2f9-520a-4aab-b057-fdb17be44fb1"
msgid "\"It's up to you to decide what to do.\""
msgstr "\"그건 당신이 어떤 결정을 내리느냐에 달렸습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ccea7b06-4c93-4771-8684-88cc439670f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shows you a small vial of light-purple liquid.{/n} \"Look what I "
"got in the city.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 밝은 보랏빛 액체가 든 작은 유리병을 당신에게 보여줍니다.{/n} \"내가 수도에서 뭘 구했는지 봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "4dddfd27-72a3-45d1-8d45-4465479bf1a1"
msgid ""
"\"I just wanted to see what you think.\" {n}Valerie holds the vial to the "
"light and studies its contents with apparent indifference.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"난 그저 당신이 어떻게 생각하는지 알고 싶었을 뿐이에요.\" {n}발레리는 병에 빛을 비추며 무관심한 태도로 내용물을 "
"살펴봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "719e21a8-c1bd-4387-be2c-c5c33793fb88"
msgid ""
"\"This is an alchemical potion, some sort of cure-all in a vial. I don't "
"know what's in it, but the vendor promised it would make my scar disappear "
"if I take it five times.\" {n}Valerie looks at you steadily.{/n} \"I had a "
"moment of weakness and bought the potion... but now I'm not so sure if using "
"it is such a good idea.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 연금술 물약이에요, 일종의 만병통치약이지요. 안에 뭐가 들었는진 모르겠지만 상인은 이걸 다섯 번만 마시면 내 상처가 사라질꺼라고 "
"약속했답니다.\" {n}발레리는 당신을 계속해서 바라봅니다.{/n} \"순간 마음이 약해진 나는 이 물약을 사버렸지요... 하지만 "
"지금에와서는, 이걸 마시는게 좋은 생각이라는 확신이 들지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "7956e8c9-250e-4f1d-93a9-5e443201a6a5"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think a different specialist would say anything definite. Besides, "
"most alchemists I spoke to said the scar is magical, so simple potions won't "
"help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 전문가들이라고해서 뭔가 명확한 결론을 내려줄꺼라곤 생각진 않아요. 게다가, 내가 대화해본 대부분의 연금술사들이 내 상처는 "
"마법적이라고 했으니, 평범한 물약은 도움이 안되겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "63bd569f-20ff-401d-8e43-125dc940e481"
msgid ""
"\"Who knows, maybe they're all right, and the vendor tricked me. Or maybe "
"everyone else I talked to were amateurs, and I finally managed to find the "
"only worthy alchemist in the entire {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 알겠어요, 그들이 옳고, 상인이 날 속였을 수도 있지요. 어쩌면 내가 얘기를 나눴던 연금술사들이 모조리 다 아마추어들이고, "
"마침내 내가 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 통틀어 유일하게 존재하는 진정한 연금술사를 찾아낸 것일수도 있고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "f6199271-c51e-45ab-9204-1c5d82ebeaa8"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie squints one eye.{/n} \"It might also take this mark off my face. "
"Do you think it's worth it? Taking a risk to restore my beauty?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 한쪽 눈을 가늘게 뜹니다.{/n} \"그리고 이게 얼굴에 난 흉터를 없애줄 수도 있지요. 당신은 그럴 가치가 있다고 "
"생각하나요? 내 아름다움을 되찾기 위해 위험을 무릅쓰는 것이??\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "2a9ef732-ab73-4b88-aa1a-dc3e6d41c648"
msgid ""
"{n}Disappointment flickers in Valerie's eyes.{/n} \"Is that so... Beauty is "
"worth going blind. Or growing scales all over my body. Well, thanks for your "
"answer.\" {n}Valerie steps aside, fiddles with the vial in her hands... and "
"then hurls it away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}실망감이 발레리의 눈에 번뜩입니다. {/n} \"그런가요... 아름다움은 장님이 되거나 몸 전체에 비늘이 나는 걸 감수할 가치가 "
"있는 것이겠지요. 어쨌든 대답해줘서 고마워요.\" {n}발레리는 물러서서 병을 만지작 거리더니... 던져버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "cc4821af-f2c8-4eb9-8db3-9c261ae00d1b"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you with, puzzled or perhaps annoyed.{/n} \"Don't you "
"think such an order is beyond the scope of my service?\" {n}Valerie turns "
"around and steps away, then casually throws the vial into the bushes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당혹스러운, 어쩌면 짜증스러운 표정으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그런 명령은 내 임무의 범위를 벗어나는 것이라 생각지 "
"않나요?\" {n}발레리는 돌아서더니, 풀밭에 유리병을 무심히 던져버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "b36e254c-7591-47e7-9d57-30d6add7ed0b"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's eyes grow warmer.{/n} \"Very good. I'm sorry I distracted you "
"for such a foolish reason.\" {n}Valerie throws the vial over her shoulder "
"without looking.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 눈길이 따스해집니다.{/n} \"맞는 말이에요. 이런 어리석은 이유로 당신 주의를 흐뜨려놓다니 미안해요.\" {n}발레리는 "
"보지도 않은 체 유리병을 어깨너머로 던져버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_2_2_HowToGetRidOfAScar/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "3879754a-d86d-42a1-8f28-3795a5895a76"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. I don't know why I came to you.\" {n}Valerie's eyes grow warmer. "
"She weighs the vial in her hands.{/n} \"I don't think I'll risk life and "
"limb for such a trifle.\" {n}Valerie then throws the vial aside.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론이에요. 왜 당신에게 이 문제를 꺼냈는지 모르겠군요.\" {n}발레리의 눈길이 따스해집니다. 발레리는 유리병을 손안에서 "
"재어봅니다.{/n} \"그런 사소한 것 내 생명이나 사지를 거는 건 아닌 것 같네요.\" {n}발레리는 유리병을 버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c5b97b36-6991-4dce-b557-b2b6de8c62e3"
msgid "\"What a great gift! Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"정말 멋진 선물이군요! 고마워요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f6ea5739-2c06-4c36-ab74-e41d3ef2a382"
msgid "\"Why are you so embarrassed?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 부끄러워하는겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e98aeef8-1947-4a3a-876f-4f15cdefca13"
msgid "\"You're acting a little strange.\""
msgstr "\"당신 조금 이상한데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e6b377f9-6494-46f2-b97e-8d08052d7989"
msgid "\"You're a little quirky.\""
msgstr "\"오늘따라 독특하게 구는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "81f41dd3-dceb-4e96-8d8a-32681a0c8d00"
msgid ""
"[Put the gift in the bag] \"There, I put your gift away. Now explain what's "
"going on.\""
msgstr "[가방에 선물을 넣는다] \"됐습니다, 선물은 넣어뒀어요. 이제 무슨 일인지 얘기해봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e588ce04-9db5-4fe6-a1e8-2a0aaf0dba41"
msgid "[Put the gift in the bag] \"Thank you!\""
msgstr "[가방에 선물을 넣는다] \"고마워요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "22ce335d-09a2-4e37-8266-e04f16094593"
msgid "\"May I at least kiss you in return?\""
msgstr "\"최소한의 보답으로 키스를 해도 되겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "b7d8f69c-824f-4c9e-8591-776fdfd788e0"
msgid ""
"\"Now I'm sorry I haven't gotten anything for you. I'll make it up to you, I "
"promise.\""
msgstr "\"당장은 당신에게 보답해줄께 없군요. 미안합니다. 나중에 꼭 보답할꼐요, 약속하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "03354479-eb9d-4f79-9c81-1972ad2beafe"
msgid "\"Well... thank you.\""
msgstr "\"음... 고마워요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8e0cf2f9-5994-4439-b6dc-f8e2f3cee77c"
msgid ""
"{n}Looking around, Valerie hastily hands you a parcel.{/n} \"This is for "
"you. From me. Please, take it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주변을 살피더니, 발레리는 황급히 소포 하나를 당신에게 건네줍니다.{/n} \"당신꺼에요. 내가 주는거지요. 부디 받아줬으면 해요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "9656a561-9951-4684-bd91-3d9a389f94b3"
msgid ""
"{n}It's a beautifully embroidered silk shirt, carefully wrapped. Catching "
"your glance, Valerie blushes ever so slightly.{/n} \"Please put it away in "
"your bag.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소포 안에는 아름다운 자수가 놓인 실크 셔츠가 꼼꼼하게 포장되어 있습니다. 당신과 눈이 마주치나, 발레리는 미세하게나마 얼굴을 "
"붉힙니다.{/n} \"당신 가방에 넣어주겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "b55cc345-8eff-4522-9912-ec6c900411da"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns crimson red.{/n} \"On the contrary! It's you who's acting "
"strange. You get a present and respond in this way!\" {n}The girl scoffs and "
"looks away.{/n} \"Forget it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 얼굴이 진홍빛으로 변합니다.{/n} \"전혀요! 이상하게 행동하는건 당신이에요. 선물을 받았는데 그런 식으로대꾸하다니!\" "
"{n}소녀는 콧방귀를 뀌더니 고개를 돌려버립니다.{/n} \"됐어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "dd0f07e2-6f36-46dc-8d11-8a3221b9b6c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's blush deepens.{/n} \"You're welcome! But put it away, hurry!\" "
"{n}She turns away hastily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 홍조가 더 깊어집니다.{/n} \"천만에요! 어쨌든 빨리 넣어줘요, 빨리요!\" {n}발레리는 서둘러 떠나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "73564387-48e2-427d-b9ee-78bd23bdd588"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shrugs her shoulders angrily.{/n} \"I'm not embarrassed at all! I "
"just don't want anyone to see it and... it doesn't matter!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 화가나서 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"전혀요! 그저 다른 사람이 보지 않길 바랄 뿐이에요, 그리고... 그게 그리 "
"중요한가요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "4ded19dc-721c-49ac-9645-2e48b2c5da21"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns crimson red.{/n} \"And you are obnoxious!\" {n}The girl "
"scoffs and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 얼굴이 진홍빛으로 변합니다 .{/n} \"그리고 오늘 당신은 불쾌하게 구는군요!\" {n}소녀는 콧방귀를 뀌더니 고개를 "
"돌려버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "4deed9d6-2084-409f-9b86-a22ad3f572fc"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shrugs one shoulder.{/n} \"Nothing special. I just thought I'd "
"give you a present. What's wrong with that? We aren't strangers... I "
"guess... And I decided I wanted to give you a shirt. That's it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 한 쪽 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"특별한건 아니에요. 그저 당신이게 선물을 줘야겠다고 생각했을 뿐이에요. 뭐가 문제죠? "
"우린 서로에게 낯선이가 아니고.... 그래서.... 당신에게 셔츠를 줘야겠다고 결정했을 뿐이라고요. 그게 다에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "d5b85a74-3d76-49a9-89f3-8f0a5c4581f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie presses a finger to her cheek with mock thoughtfulness.{/n} \"In "
"that case I wouldn't mind a romantic camp dinner. Oysters a la 'Whiterose'. "
"Or at least smoked trout and hydra paste.\" {n}Valerie winks at you and "
"turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 깊은 생각에 빠진 척 손가락으로 뺨을 비빕니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 야영지에서 로맨틱한 저녁식사를 기대해도 되겠군요. "
"'백장미'의 굴요리라던가. 아니면 적어도 훈제 숭어와 히드라 소스 정돈 되야겠지요.\" {n}발레리는 윙크하고는 자리를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "92727c38-4040-449e-9633-0490b2e19902"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks around, embarrassed, then hastily kisses you and turns "
"away.{/n} \"Enough. Anything else — you'll have to wait until we're alone.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 주의를 둘러보더니, 부끄러워하며, 서둘러 당신에게 키스하고는 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"그만요. 이후의 일은 - 우리가 단둘이 "
"있을때까지 기다려야 할꺼에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_1_Gift/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "029e9cf1-5cfa-4543-99de-2208c9ad93af"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you like she's about to add something, then sighs and "
"looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 할 말이 더 있는 듯 당신을 바라보더니, 한숨을 쉬고는 고개를 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "87a42684-38c4-4137-9be1-f64b06e45c97"
msgid "\"It's not like we're hiding our relationship, Valerie...\""
msgstr "\"우리 관계를 숨기고 다닌 건 아니지 않았습니까, 발레리...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "df8cbb62-ef41-4a50-9eb3-ab072ddad77b"
msgid "\"Just don't pay any attention.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 신경쓰지 마세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "97155643-4530-4d38-a4e6-33901c0f6bdf"
msgid "\"Are you saying it's time for us to get married?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 결혼할 때가 됐다고 말하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d8a8a2ef-c6c9-4ec7-a473-dc07c0138820"
msgid "\"And yet, you're the girl I chose.\""
msgstr "\"그럼에도, 내가 선택한 여자는 바로 당신이지요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "f3a3080b-a247-4ffb-b6b6-6e87d95e4215"
msgid ""
"\"I know, Valerie. You are amazing, and these simpletons are too stupid to "
"even notice!\""
msgstr "\"압니다, 발레리. 당신은 놀라운 여인입니다, 그걸 알기엔 저들은 너무 어리석지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "0ebdfad4-1af1-4791-8b8d-4f0e11babf7e"
msgid ""
"\"Don't listen to them. Who knows better than you how little their words "
"mean?\""
msgstr "\"신경 쓰지 말아요. 그 소문이 아무 의미 없다는건 당신이 가장 잘 알지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "eac516e5-67da-4cc3-ab1e-9e3fc51f35a4"
msgid ""
"\"If you don't like anything about our situation, we can always go our "
"separate ways.\""
msgstr "\"이 상황이 마음에 들지 않는다면, 언제든 갈라서도 좋습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3b8281f4-2940-477d-b81a-cf6565ec44cb"
msgid ""
"\"You're not going to believe what I heard!\" {n}Valerie is bursting with "
"indignation.{/n} \"Some insolent wench saw me on the street and called me... "
"the {mf|baron's|baroness'|King's|Queen's} favorite!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 무슨 소리를 들었는지 아나요!\" {n}발레리는 분노로 폭팔할 것 같습니다.{/n} \"어떤 무례한 아낙네들이 날보고 ... "
"the {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 가장 아끼는 계집이라고 했다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "d4265bf7-d50c-46d0-8346-157c64567034"
msgid ""
"\"No! That's not what I'm talking about!\" {n}Valerie raises her hands and "
"drops them helplessly.{/n} \"Great gods, do you really not understand?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니요! 그게 아니에요!\" {n}발레리는 힘없이 들었던 손을 내렸습니다.{/n} \"신이시여... 정말 이해가 안되나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "4566c726-7922-4af5-ae3e-3c8659fcd2e5"
msgid ""
"\"How can I not pay attention to this? How...\" {n}Valerie raises her hands, "
"and drops them helplessly.{/n} \"Great gods, do you not understand?\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 신경쓰지 않을 수 있겠어요, 어떻게...\" {n}발레리는 힘없이 들었던 손을 내렸습니다.{/n} \"신이시여... 정말 "
"이해가 안되나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "bf18f3bc-ab00-4da9-924d-6001b46cf510"
msgid ""
"\"I'm your companion. A servant to the crown. Protector of these lands. I've "
"gone through thick and thin with you, I've been in so many brawls... and all "
"they whisper behind my back is that I'm your woman!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 왕관의 종복이며, 이 땅의 수호자이고, 당신의 동료에요. 난 당신과 함께 어렵고 힘든 모든 일들을 함께 헤쳐왔지요.... 그리고 "
"내 등 뒤에선 모두가 날 당신의 여자라고 수군대고 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "86c8f581-4b01-4024-8a9e-5054fe99f084"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's face turns to stone.{/n} \"Not any more. I hope the new girl of "
"your choice will appreciate the exalted attention.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 얼굴이 돌처럼 굳어집니다.{/n} \"더 이상은 아니에요.. 당신이 선택한 새 여자가 그런 고귀한 관심에 기뻐했으면 "
"좋겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3292a4e9-ad33-4ae6-bb6d-8a4453c429bd"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sizes you up.{/n} \"Well... if you don't see a problem where I "
"see one, that means we should put an end to this. Before it causes any "
"problems.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신을 재어봅니다.{/n} \"음... 내가 느끼는 걸 문제라 생각지 않는다면, 다른 골치거리가 생기기 전에 우리 둘 "
"사이의 관계를 정리해야 한다는 뜻이겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "4294fdc2-3afd-48f8-94c0-392c9d8f9c9c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie loses her speech for a moment — and then happily laughs like a "
"mischievous little girl.{/n} \"{name}! You are such a flatterer! You made me "
"laugh!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시동안 할 말을 잊었습니다 - 그리고 짖궂은 소녀처럼 행복하게 웃습니다.{/n} \" {name}! 당신은 대단한 "
"아첨꾼이군요! 당신 덕분에 웃어보네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "0f0ff70e-f131-4ae1-afc4-2cceb86949fc"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie quickly kisses you and pulls away.{/n} \"Thank you. Let's go.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리가 재빨리 당신에게 키스한 후 당신을 밀어낸다.{/n} \"고마워요. 이제 가도록 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_3_2_IWantToBeMyself/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "3932c04e-ceb4-4c56-8803-0632619eb091"
msgid ""
"\"Oh... you're right. Forgive me, I overreacted. I don't know why. But it "
"hurt like a knife in the heart. — It's like nothing I do even matters!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오... 당신이 맞아요. 용서해줘요, 내가 지나치게 굴었어요. 이유는 모르겠지만. 하지만 가슴에 칼을 맞은 것처럼 아프군요. 마치 "
"내가 뭘하든 아무 소용이 없는 것 같아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_LetsGo/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4e58a965-9e0d-42d3-a32f-b350a0c4bb42"
msgid "\"Fine.\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_LetsGo/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c644e5c9-e030-47de-8fc4-38a3d6d670a0"
msgid "\"Can this wait?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐 기다릴 수 없나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_LetsGo/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "79cc43b4-f6ad-4fed-b111-0a54c3b087e2"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie catches up with you near the city gate. The girl is black as a "
"thundercloud.{/n} \"We need to talk. Right now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도시 관문 근처에서 발레리가 당신을 붙잡습니다. 소녀는 먹구름 마냥 표정이 어둡습니다. {/n} \"얘기 좀 해요. 지금 당장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_LetsGo/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b7a2b848-062d-4361-a048-3dd1913cbf0a"
msgid "\"No!\" {n}Valerie's voice is like a crack of a whip.{/n}"
msgstr "\"안되요!\" {n}발레리의 목소리는 채찍 소리 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Event_LetsGo/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "eb96bf34-5adf-4a02-a317-8772b7e0480c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns away, going to the palace.{/n} \"Your chambers. In fifteen "
"minutes.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 돌아 서서 궁전으로 향합니다.{/n} \"당신 방에서 봐요. 15 분 안에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "cc77e7d7-8011-44ed-aa2c-a5dbe63838e9"
msgid "\"I couldn't find you anywhere.\""
msgstr "\"어딜 찾아봐도 당신을 찾을 수 없더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "807f8084-27a1-4d83-bc32-b2f7dcde9d98"
msgid "\"Can I join you?\""
msgstr "\"함께 해도 되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6a347a96-ea90-4a53-a725-bfb9a69aaab6"
msgid ""
"\"What the devil are you doing, relaxing here? Get back to your post, "
"immediately!\""
msgstr "\"대체 여기서 뭘하는겁니까, 게으름을 피우고 겁니까? 당장 임무로 돌아가세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "a7ddfe70-b834-40d2-b56b-1c4fafe7b548"
msgid "\"It's still strange to see you here, with wine in your hand.\""
msgstr "\"이곳에서 와인을 손에 든 당신을 보는 것은 아직도 낯설군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "545066c4-2b9b-4411-a061-630a40d09d08"
msgid "\"I don't like sitting in silence. Tell me, how have you been?\""
msgstr "\"이런 침묵은 불편하군. 그래, 어떻게 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "b66d4cd2-5b80-4e56-8ee3-b10995c37c31"
msgid "[Drink your beer silently]"
msgstr "[조용히 맥주를 마신다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "2af92de8-43b1-4f99-8e01-16a81b6abd63"
msgid "\"Do you regret what happened by the trading post?\""
msgstr "\"전초기지에서 벌어진 일을 후회하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "1e203701-9be4-4a70-875f-ea05973c5f62"
msgid "\"Your scar still hasn't healed.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 상처는 아직 치유되지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "30bc3119-dfd0-459e-a281-170dfb3d1497"
msgid "\"I just want to be sure I can still count on you.\""
msgstr "\"여전히 널 믿을 수 있을지 확인하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "c01cc09b-1691-4896-b43f-1f715b8ae135"
msgid "\"Don't speak to me in that tone.\""
msgstr "\"그따위 말투로 나에게 말하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "eaabc841-f702-4ef4-978f-32f1c1453ccb"
msgid "\"You're behaving differently than I'm used to.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 내가 해오던 것과는 다르게 행동합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "6b7660c9-129b-4dfa-85ad-7a0a8a112c79"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"예.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "11a3aa27-31ee-432d-87b6-734bba212beb"
msgid "\"No.\""
msgstr "\"아니오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "4b328f21-01a8-4c90-9d79-0238d6d7762b"
msgid "\"For me, you're always beautiful. Nothing could ever change that.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 당신은 언제나 아름답다. 어떤 것도 그걸 바꿀 수는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "2c68d6c6-2d47-4c83-809b-a18af1f932db"
msgid "\"I don't value you for your beauty.\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신의 아름다움으로 당신을 평가한 것이 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "2187113a-51a3-4db1-b0cf-6088576c3db1"
msgid "\"I like you as a friend and as a companion.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 동료와 친구로서 좋아한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "32437d73-e1db-4ac2-9dfe-35e02d51ff2f"
msgid "\"Because of the scar?\""
msgstr "\"흉터 때문에?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "e5f83a72-4b74-4231-8f70-18142ed27ecc"
msgid "\"One might drink herself into a grave like that...\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 죽을것처럼 마셔댄다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "5382aa0b-6b29-4bb2-8a98-9694cb75d3ad"
msgid "[Keep quiet]"
msgstr "[가만히 있는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3b7865ad-ca32-49a7-bb0b-f287a391b8fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Soon after returning to the city, you realize Valerie is not at her usual "
"post. Asking a series of servants and guards, you find your way to the city "
"tavern, where you find the girl with a glass of wine.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}도시로 돌아온 후, 발레리가 평소 있던 곳에 없다는 사실을 깨닫습니다. 경비원과 하인들에게 물어보고 나서야, 당신은 도시 술집에서 "
"포도주를 마시고 있는 그녀를 찾아낼 수 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d844ff1a-10d6-4bd8-a4f0-b7100ca5d93e"
msgid ""
"\"{name}?\" {n}Valerie looks up at you, surprised, and seems to blush a "
"little.{/n} \"Do you need something?\""
msgstr ""
"\" {name}?\" {n}발레리는 조금 붉게 상기된 얼굴에 놀란 표정으로 당신을 바라보았다.{/n} \"뭔가 필요한게 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cbea4bd1-f827-494a-bede-f1c5be175420"
msgid ""
"{n}A smile touches Valerie's lips.{/n} \"Truth be told, that was the plan. "
"Sometimes I need... to be alone.\" {n}Valerie pauses, then continues.{/n} "
"\"But I don't mind drinking with you. Since you found me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 입술에 미소가 살짝 떠오른다.{/n} \"사실은 일부러 숨은 것입니다. 때때로 난... 혼자 있고 싶어요.\" {n}"
"발레리가 잠깐 멈췄다가 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"하지만 당신과 같이 마시는건 괜찮습니다. 이미 들켰으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b3814de2-16b1-4942-b2a4-e070639105d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's eyes turn into slits, and she reluctantly puts away her "
"glass.{/n} \"As you wish, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리의 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 마지 못해 그녀의 술잔을 밀어낸다.{/n} \"당신 뜻대로, Your Grace.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fdc32364-f73d-46e2-8a8f-fe115e6d34de"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie scoots over, giving you some space. You take an empty stool and "
"order a drink. For a few minutes there's a tense silence between you. The "
"girl slowly sips her drink.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 자리를 좁혀서 앉을 자리를 제공합니다. 당신은 빈자리를 차지하고 음료를 주문합니다. 잠시 긴장된 침묵이 그녀와 당신 사이를 "
"채웁니다. 그녀는 천천히 술을 홀짝입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9c811e42-075c-45d1-a26e-14cfe320f109"
msgid ""
"\"Like a mere mortal — is that what you mean?\" {n}Valerie scoffs and sips "
"from the glass.{/n} \"Few would imagine it, but I have rough days too. Days "
"when I prefer to hide from prying looks and just be alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한낱 필멸자처럼 - 이라는게 무슨 의미죠?\" {n}발레리는 술잔을 홀짝인다.{/n} \"나를 힐끗힐끗 쳐다보는 시선들로 부터 숨어 "
"혼자가 된 날들, 상상하기 어렵겠지만 나에게도 역시 힘든 날들이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "111a4e38-27de-44c2-83fc-c8a56fb9fd66"
msgid ""
"{n}You slowly drink shoulder to shoulder with Valerie. At last she sighs and "
"starts talking.{/n} \"Since you and I met Fredero, I've started coming here "
"more often. I don't care but...\" {n}Valerie stops but then sighs and "
"continues.{/n} \"I don't care, but I'm getting tired of all the extra "
"attention that's being so generously shoveled at me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 발레리와 어깨를 나란히 하고 천천히 술을 마십니다. 마침내 그녀는 한숨을 쉬며 이야기를 시작합니다.{/n} \"당신과 내가 "
"프레데로를 만났을 때부터, 나는 여기 자주 오기 시작했어요. 나는 상관하지 않지만...\" {n}발레리는 잠시 멈추었지만 한숨을 내쉬며 "
"계속 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 상관없어요. 그러나 진지하게 나에게 들이대는 놈들의 특별한 관심에 지쳤습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "80127027-b2fb-4350-b33d-71bfd03cb8ee"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie gives you a thin smile, running her finger along the rim of the "
"glass.{/n} \"Unusual. But I'll get used to it.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 손가락으로 술잔 가장자리를 훑으며 옅은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"평소와는 다르지만 익숙해 질 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "54fb371f-3b78-498e-8cf3-a540217fb3e0"
msgid ""
"{n}The awkward half-smile on Valerie's face turns into an angry sneer.{/n} "
"\"So? Does it change anything? Did my sword arm fall off? Or all my fencing "
"knowledge, did it fell out of my head?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 얼굴에 떠오른 어색한 미소가 분노로 일그러집니다.{/n} \"그래서? 뭐가 달라졌죠? 검을 쥐는 손이 잘려나가지 않았고, "
"검술을 잊은 것도 아니지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d1378b69-0f58-4e61-b048-9e251a3f879b"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie scoffs, studying the contents of her glass.{/n} \"Fredero got "
"what he wanted — a duel. And then he left us alone. — Isn't that what we "
"wanted?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}술잔의 내용물을 살펴보던 발레리는 비웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"프레데로는 그가 원하는 것을 얻었습니다 - 결투를, 그리고 "
"그는 우리를 내버려 뒀습니다 - 우리가 원했던 것이 아닌가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ce3f8dc7-cfe7-4a22-8f88-0bb039c83374"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no, our beautiful Valerie has stopped being such a beauty! Her "
"wonderful face is ruined. It must mean there's something wrong with her!\" "
"{n}Valerie slams her hand on the table fiercely.{/n} \"I have to say, I want "
"to scream at everyone who keeps looking at me with terror and regret: where "
"has your adoration and veneration gone? Vanished with one swing of a sword?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 안돼, 우리의 아름다운 발레리는 그 아름다움을 잃었습니다! 그녀의 아름다운 얼굴은 망가졌습니다.이것은 그녀가 뭔가 잘못되었음을 "
"의미하는 것이 틀림없습니다!\" {n}발레리는 테이블을 강하게 내리쳤습니다.{/n} \"이것만은 말해야겠습니다. 나는 두려움과 후회로 "
"나를 바라보는 모든 사람들에게 비명을 지르고 싶어요: 당신들의 숭배와 존경은 어디로 갔는가? 단 한번 휘둘러진 칼로 모두 사라진 것인가?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5aa43521-b313-462b-8610-e7be77312fc8"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie turns around and looks right at you.{/n} \"And what is that "
"supposed to mean, {name}?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리가 돌아 서더니 당신을 똑바로 쳐다 보았다.{/n} \"그래서 하고 싶은 말이 뭡니까? {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7225f15a-4865-44f6-9f2b-077239733d5f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie scoffs.{/n} \"Just like everybody else, you're used to seeing "
"what I prefer to show to the world. Anyway, I think I know exactly what you "
"mean. The most obvious thing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 비웃었다.{/n} \"다른 사람들과 마찬가지로, 당신도 세상이 날 보듯이 보는것에 익숙하겠죠. 어쨌든, 난 당신이 무슨 "
"말을 하는지 정확히 알고 있습니다. 뻔하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c8c47d7d-8107-43e2-9257-791b732d2028"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie finishes her glass in one gulp and slams it on the counter.{/n} "
"\"My apologies, Your Grace. I was out of line.\" {n}The girl stands up and "
"walks out of the tavern.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 그녀의 술잔을 단숨에 비우고 테이블에 내다 꽂습니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다, Your Grace. 제가 선을 넘었습니다.\""
" {n}그녀는 일어 서더니 주점을 걸어 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9577ade5-d6ce-4ab5-82c1-938a0e73a7c2"
msgid ""
"{n}Flushing red, Valerie turns to you and with an almost daring sneer.{/n} "
"\"It would be strange to expect anything else from you. — You, just like the "
"rest of my admirers, now consider me... how should I put it... damaged "
"goods! Well, where are your compliments now? Do you like this Valerie?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}빨갛게 붉어진 얼굴로, 발레리는 당신을 향해 대담한 비웃음을 띠며 돌아섰습니다.{/n} \"당신에게서 다른 무엇을 기대하는 것이 "
"이상하지만 - 나를 추종하던 사람들과 마찬가지로, 이제 생각해 보세요... 망가져버린 물건 같은 나를 어떻게 해야 할까요? 이제 당신은 "
"나를 아름답다고 할 수 있나요? 지금 이 모습의 발레리도 괜찮습니까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7abe21c4-a674-4210-a516-967a1a3abdec"
msgid ""
"\"What?\" {n}Valerie stops. Blinking a few times, she stares in your face, "
"as if trying to find signs of deceit.{/n} \"But...\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐?\" {n}발레리가 멈춥니다. 눈을 깜빡이며, 그녀는 속임수의 흔적을 찾아내려고 하는 것처럼 당신의 얼굴을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} "
"\"그러나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "338d0191-a881-4943-b962-c1913ec1d447"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie winces for a moment, and then laughs, relieved.{/n} \"Your "
"honesty is like a breath of fresh air, {name}. Another woman would slap you, "
"but I thank you for your honesty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 동안 움찍했지만 곧 안심했고, 웃었다.{/n} \"당신은 신선한 공기의 술결 만큼 정직합니다. {name}. 다른 "
"여자라면 당신의 뺨을 후려쳤겠지만, 정직하게 대답해 주셔서 감사드립니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d84b864e-0752-4fbb-a3a8-67dd934c7d23"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie pauses, and then stands up.{/n} \"I think I've had enough for "
"today — both wine and honesty. Please, don't worry about my ability to serve "
"you. I vowed to fight shoulder to shoulder with you, and I'll not break it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 멈추더니 일어섰다.{/n} \"와인도 정직한 말도 오늘은 충분한 것 같습니다. 당신을 섬길 수 있는 능력에 대해서는 "
"걱정하지 마십시오. 나는 당신과 어깨를 나란히 하고 함께 싸우겠다고 다짐했습니다. 제가 맹세를 저버리는 일은 없을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8a5fbe84-9686-40c5-aaf4-5ad342936c78"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie bites her lip and looks down. It's the first time you've see her "
"respond like this to a compliment. At last she looks away and answers "
"softly.{/n} \"Empty flattery, no doubt. But thank you anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 입술을 깨물며 바닥을 내려다 봅니다. 그녀가 칭찬에 이렇게 반응하는 것을 본 것은 처음입니다. 마침내 그녀는 눈을 들고 "
"부드럽게 대답합니다.{/n} \"의심할 여지없이, 맘에 없는 말이겠지만, 어쨌든 고맙습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d69f6e92-78d0-4732-b8b5-3af559e010e2"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks away with a sad smile.{/n} \"Really? Well, thank you for "
"your words.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 슬픈 미소로 먼 곳을 바라 봅니다.{/n} \"정말?, 말이라도 고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0b89abb7-6cd9-4049-94ed-65454f50f9e8"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie freezes — then sighs in relief and laughs.{/n} \"Of course! "
"Forgive my hot temper — I don't know why I got so wound up. I value our "
"friendship as well!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 얼어 붙었다가 - 안심하는 한숨을 내쉬며 웃습니다.{/n} \"물론! 화를 낸 건 용서해요 - 내가 왜 그렇게 상처를 "
"받았는지 모르겠어요. 우리의 우정도 중요하게 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "217dd8e8-3da8-4c12-b561-1a91da7742d8"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! As if these... these fools pay attention to anything else!\""
msgstr "\"물론! 마치 이...이 바보들이 아무거에나 관심을 기울이는 것처럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "37a47d0e-22af-49bd-b3c9-37ba7fc0bebb"
msgid ""
"\"One just might, and maybe it's for the better! No one's going to notice "
"anyway — because of this!\" {n}Valerie points at the scar on her face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그럴수도 있고 아마 이게 더 나을 수도 있습니다! 이제 아무도 관심 갖지 않을 겁니다. - 이것 때문에!\" {n}발레리는 얼굴에 "
"흉터를 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "92942191-63a5-442f-90bd-882f048572b0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie stops, apparently sunk in her thoughts. Then she turns away, "
"embarrassed.{/n} \"Forgive me. Don't worry — you're not my nanny. I'll take "
"care of my own problems.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 잠시 멈추고, 깊이 생각에 빠집니다. 그런 다음 그녀는 당황하며 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다. 걱정하지 마세요. - "
"당신은 제 보모가 아니예요. 제 문제니까 제가 해결하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_1_DoIStillAttractYou/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0a74e3e4-8496-4dc0-abcd-e5c67d18dae3"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie scoffs, studying the contents of her glass.{/n} \"Fredero got "
"what he wanted — a duel. I have nothing to regret.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 술잔의 내용물을 보며 비웃습니다.{/n} \"프레데로는 그가 원하는 것 -결투- 를 얻었습니다. 저는 후회하지 않습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5c999d34-97bc-4b5a-8f9c-a8c751f4de4e"
msgid "\"Who was it?\""
msgstr "\"그건 누구였나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "cdb67675-4de3-493d-81f7-50b23a08bfc1"
msgid "\"Do I need to be jealous?\""
msgstr "\"내가 질투해야 하는건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a68f30b6-145e-43c3-8319-dc05f027ce3f"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5ab57cc9-c15c-4da9-8a2e-5b1b3f4fc8bc"
msgid "\"Were you lovers?\""
msgstr "\"사랑하는 사람이 있었습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "7f3c861d-52a3-421f-89e1-1b88ad795ed0"
msgid "\"I never thought you would agree to such a relationship!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 이런 관계를 허락했을 줄은 몰랐습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2d120ede-e534-41aa-a230-7a509319dd0d"
msgid "\"That's so disgusting!\""
msgstr "\"너무 역겨운 데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "806c255e-634a-4edd-912a-f3458959b957"
msgid ""
"[Pull away] \"I'm sorry, but I wouldn't want to ruin our friendship with "
"unwanted... entanglements.\""
msgstr "[물러나며] \"미안해.하지만 나는 원치 않는... 더 복잡한 관계로 우정을 망치고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "950f55a5-cfff-45ef-ba50-805819487ef1"
msgid "\"I want more with you than just a bed.\""
msgstr "\"나는 침대에서 당신과 함께하는 것보다 더 당신을 원합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "240fd78c-9fea-4c38-992f-94b1813b4caf"
msgid "\"I would never do anything to hurt you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 해칠 수 있는 어떤 것도 하고싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "52d63d6d-aa0f-4541-b53f-1ed1562b9e35"
msgid "[Pull away] \"You shouldn't, Valerie. You're drunk.\""
msgstr "[물러나며] \"그러지마, 발레리, 너 취했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "7a1b881c-d9ef-4d31-a567-6ee4a6443ffd"
msgid "[Kiss Valerie]"
msgstr "[발레리와 키스한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "d078f7cf-64a0-485b-9d0b-8de8f7098071"
msgid "\"Can I count on a few hot nights too?\""
msgstr "\"뜨거운 밤을 기대해도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "ef4d0ef8-5d26-4891-b802-bcae6785dff6"
msgid "\"I appreciate your trust.\""
msgstr "\"날 믿어줘서 고마워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "4a9cda99-fe54-4771-8ca2-9fd54ca5523d"
msgid ""
"\"Is this... some kind of test? If so, believe me, it's not fair — you are "
"very hard to resist!\""
msgstr "\"이건... 시험 같은 건가요? 그렇다면 정말로, 이건 공평하지 않아요. 당신을 밀어내기는 너무 어려워요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b70081b8-9032-47f1-b5e1-9537087a03df"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as you return to the city, Valerie invites you to the tavern — to "
"drink wine and discuss the latest events. After a few hours, the "
"conversation has drifted, and you begin to recount stories from your past "
"lives.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}최대한 빨리 도시로 돌아오자, 발레리는 당신을 - 와인을 마시며 최근의 일들에 대해 의논하기위해 - 술집으로 초대했습니다. 몇 시간 "
"후, 대화는 다른곳으로 흘러갔고, 당신은 과거의 삶에 대해서 자세히 이야기하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cf8207c1-457a-41eb-8801-607efb785da2"
msgid ""
"\"Just imagine: the poor archer, cursing like a sailor, is trying to tear "
"his quiver out of the kobold's mouth, while the kobold keeps chewing on it! "
"I never knew those lizards had such powerful jaws! We could barely get the "
"kobold off it later, even after it was already dead. That archer never "
"forgave us for ruining his quiver. — But it was quite a show!\""
msgstr ""
"\"상상해 보세요: 선원처럼 저주를 퍼붓는 형편없는 궁수가 코볼트의 입에서 그의 화살통을 뜯어내려고 애쓰고 있었습니다, 코볼트는 계속 "
"그걸 씹고 있고! 나는 그 도마뱀이 그처럼 강력한 턱을 가지고 있다는 것을 결코 몰랐었습니다! 우리는 이미 죽은 코볼트 머리에서 화살통을 "
"간신히 떼어 낼 수 있었습니다. - 그러나 그것은 꽤 볼만했습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0003 1_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6ad5ea08-70d1-4e9a-b9c9-e49a3c0f2c22"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie thinks for a few moments, then takes another sip of wine.{/n} "
"\"His name was Toma. We met when we were clearing the poachers out of the "
"Gronzi Forest. Truth be told, the work was thankless: the crown pays the "
"salary, and the locals think you're there to oppress them, so they love to "
"make your life difficult. It's good to have partners nearby — someone who "
"you're sure is on your side.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 생각하더니 와인을 다시 한 모금 마십니다.{/n} \"그의 이름은 Toma 였습니다. 우리는 the Gronzi "
"Forest 에서 밀렵꾼들을 청소할 때 만났습니다. 솔직히 말하자면, 그 일은 감사 할 가치가 없었습니다. 왕은 쥐꼬리 만큼 돈을 "
"지불했고, 주민들은 당신이 그들을 억압 할 것이라고 생각했고, 그래서 그들은 당신의 삶을 힘들게 만드는 것을 사랑했습니다. 파트너를 "
"근처에 두는 것은 좋은 일입니다. 당신이 확신하는 사람이 당신 편이니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2871659f-3bd6-4011-a210-132877a96f07"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie finishes laughing, sips some whine, and sighs with pleasure.{/n} "
"\"I feel good with you. I can just be myself, not pretend to be a lady and "
"keep the proper distance all the time. I can't remember anyone else it's "
"been so easy with.\" {n}The girl lingers.{/n} \"I do, though. There was "
"someone...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 웃음을 멈추고, 와인을 조금 마신 후 즐거운 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"나는 당신과 함께 있으면 기분이 좋아요. 그냥 나 "
"자신으로 있을 수 있으니까, 숙녀인 척 하면서 항상 적당한 거리를 유지하지 않아도 되니까요. 누구 앞에서 이렇게 할 수 있었었는지 기억도 "
"나지 않아요.\" {n}그녀는 한참을 가만히 있다.{/n} \"기억난다, 그래도, 그런 사람이 있었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6a1157f9-8202-4235-a33c-301aec2a89fc"
msgid ""
"\"Toma was a mercenary like me, and also from a rich family. A fifth heir "
"who decided not to wait for his luck on the family estate. We understood "
"each other, better than the others. Toma never tried to deceive or flatter "
"anyone. He was always direct and honest.\" {n}Valerie lingers.{/n} "
"\"Everything was direct and honest between us. We were together for a time, "
"and then, when the circumstances changed, we went our separate ways. But we "
"never regretted what happened between us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부유한 집안 출신이던 토마는 저와 같은 용병이었습니다. 5 순위의 상속인으로서 그는 가족 재산을 물려받을 거라는 행운을 기대하지 "
"않기로 결정했습니다. 우리는 다른 사람들 보다 서로를 잘 이해했습니다. 토마는 다른 사람을 기만하거나 아첨하려 하지 않았습니다. 그는 "
"항상 솔직했고 정직했습니다.\" {n}발레리가 잠시 멈춥니다.{/n} \"우리 사이의 모든 것은 솔직했고 정직했습니다. 우리는 한동안 "
"함께 있었습니다, 그리고 상황이 바뀌었을 때, 우리는 서로 다른 길을 갔습니다. 그러나 우리는 우리 사이에 일어난 일을 결코 후회하지 "
"않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "29274b50-ee17-40c9-a331-db8d61719143"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sizes you up.{/n} \"Of whom? Of a person in my distant past?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리가 너를 평가한다.{/n} \"누구? 내 지나간 과거의 사람?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "94132348-e399-4655-aa7a-b6ed5152564d"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie maintains a long silence. The air around her grows cold. You "
"finish your drinks in awkward silence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 긴 침묵을 지키고 있습니다. 그녀 주변의 공기가 차가워집니다. 당신은 어색한 침묵 속에서 음료를 마저 마십니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bd518819-7a48-4644-9c53-d89f4501a212"
msgid ""
"\"Lovers... that's an interesting word. It implies a certain kind of special "
"relationship. If you mean love — no, there was only affection and trust "
"between us. If you mean a physical connection, then yes. I'd never imagined "
"such a simple act of pleasure could so easily drive away needless thoughts "
"and anxieties.\""
msgstr ""
"\"연인이라... 흥미로운 단어입니다. 그건 특별한 관계를 의미합니다. 당신이 사랑을 의미한다면, 아니오, 우리 사이에는 친근함과 신뢰 "
"만 있습니다. 만약 당신이 육체적인 관계를 의미했다면, 맞아요. 나는 이런 즐거움을 위한 단순한 행위가 이렇게 쉽게 불필요한 걱정과 "
"생각을 없애줄거라고는 상상하지 못했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bc5617e8-95d4-4b6d-ae8c-739ed9022090"
msgid ""
"\"Why? Because everywhere I go, cheesy romantics and high-flown "
"conversations follow me... Ha, though they don't any more — thanks to "
"Fredero's scar!\" {n}Valerie grins mischievously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"왜냐고요? 제가 가는 곳마다, 치졸한 낭만과 뻔한 대화가 나를 따라 다녔기 때문이죠... 하, 더 이상은 아닙니다 — 프레데로의 흉터 "
"덕분이죠!\" {n}발레리가 장난스럽게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "28f4ca63-d4db-44ac-827a-97e5a3032cda"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl tilts her head and looks at you sideways.{/n} \"Sometimes I "
"think... about how much you are like Toma. Not in appearance, not at all. I "
"mean that being with you feels so easy. And I trust you so much.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 그녀의 머리를 기울여서 옆으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"가끔 당신이 토마와 얼마나 비슷한지 생각하고는 합니다. 겉모습 "
"얘기는 절대 아닙니다. 당신과 함께하는 것이 얼마나 편안한지 말한 겁니다. 그리고 저는 당신을 많이 신뢰합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9090f0e9-0bf5-4112-b8d5-97dfab3a6b91"
msgid ""
"\"Really? What I offer isn't enough for you? You want it all, and now?\" {n}"
"The girl sadly shakes her head, then pulls away and drinks some wine.{/n} "
"\"All right, just forget it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말로? 내가 너에게 했던 것들이 충분하지 않았니? 너는 전부 원했어. 그런데 이게 뭐야?\" {n}그녀는 슬프게 머리를 흔들고, "
"뒤로 살짝 물러나 와인을 마셨다.{/n} \"좋아, 신경쓰지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "26836449-6d2d-4a8a-8a8b-9ee93f95d40f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie lingers, processing your answer.{/n} \"Fair enough. Truly, we "
"shouldn't.\" {n}She laughs awkwardly and looks away.{/n} \"All right, I'll "
"tell you another story then. Have you ever been to the Lake of Mists and "
"Veils? Well...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신의 대답을 조용히 곱씹었다.{/n} \"충분해요. 정말로, 우리는 그래서는 안됩니다.\" {n}그녀는 어색하게 웃으며 "
"다른곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"좋아요, 다음에 또 다른 이야기를 해줄게요. 안개와 베일의 호수에 가본 적이 있나요? 글쎄...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "299692db-f5c4-4385-ab62-0f4278ed4794"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie finishes her wine resolutely, as if gathering her strength, and "
"climbs to her feet.{/n} \"The entire palace is at our disposal. I expect we "
"can find suitable accommodations.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 술잔을 완전히 비우고, 힘차게 걸어 올라간다.{/n} \"궁전 전체가 우리의 손에 들어왔다. 우리가 적당한 휴식처를 찾을 "
"수 있을 것으로 기대한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "789e5de8-9278-4a58-aa24-23ce7983ef2e"
msgid ""
"\"With Toma there were no professions of love or promises that neither of us "
"would keep — just affection and trust.\" {n}Valerie blushes.{/n} \"… and "
"some pleasure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"토마와는 사랑 고백도, 지켜야 할 맹세도 없죠. 애정과 신뢰만이 있을 뿐.\" {n}발레리가 얼굴을 붉힙니다.{/n} \"… 약간의 "
"즐거움도 있고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a49ce2a2-daec-4a3b-ad5c-d5585b01b4f3"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you for a few seconds. You sense curiosity in the depths "
"of her eyes, and... Fear? Insecurity? Desire?{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 몇 초 동안 당신을 바라본다. 당신은 그녀의 눈 속 깊은 곳에서 호기심을 느꼇다... 두려움? 불안? 욕망?{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "54996671-afbe-4e80-a979-9b3b42f0bdca"
msgid ""
"{n}Keeping her eyes fixed on yours, Valerie rises and leans forward, towards "
"your face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신에게 시선을 고정시킨 채 발레리는 몸을 일으켜 당신의 얼굴을 향해 몸을 기울인다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1eedaa0f-a91b-4b7d-9763-93f17d9eb9d6"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl casts an apprehensive, almost resentful look at you.{/n} \"You "
"know, when I want to kiss someone, I am fully aware of my actions. You said "
"you liked me... and I like you. Why complicate things?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소녀는 걱정스러운 듯, 거의 원망스러운 표정을 짓는다.{/n} \"넌 내가 키스하고 싶은지 알잖아, 충분히 행동으로 보여주었는데. "
"네가 날 좋아한다고 했잖아... 그리고 나도 네가 좋아. 뭐가 문제야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e12065c2-aec3-4996-a8fa-c54d3a34191f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shuffles away from you, and apparently sobers up. The familiar "
"mask of polite detachment appears on her face.{/n} \"I'm sorry. I was "
"inappropriate with my commander.\" {n}Valerie finishes her wine in a single "
"gulp and gets up.{/n} \"My apologies.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당황한듯이 당신으로부터 멀어진다. 그리고 확실히 술이깬듯하다. 예의바른듯한 낯익은 가면이 그녀의 얼굴에 나타난다.{/n} "
"\"미안해요. 제가 지휘관에게 부적절한 행동을 했군요.\" {n}발레리는 단숨에 술을 다 마시고 일어난다.{/n} \"죄송해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ac37cd6c-79a6-4df9-83f2-4b2c1126082e"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's grazes your lips with her own, then kisses you again — "
"impatient, almost greedy. Pulling away, she runs her finger across your "
"cheek.{/n} \"So... do you want to get out of here?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 자신의 입술로 당신의 입술을 맞추다 급하고 탐욕스럽게 다시 당신에게 키스를 한다. 그녀는 당신을 뺨에서 손을 "
"떼어낸다.{/n} \"음...이곳에서 나가고 싶나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_2_LetYourHairDown/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c331d6b2-4812-4b5d-a65b-916a98694df5"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie chuckles and draws closer.{/n} \"Relax, {name}. I wouldn't "
"confuse you... not like that!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 웃으며 가까이 다가간다.{/n} \"진정해요, {name}. 혼란스러워 하지 말아요. 저는 이런 걸로 장난치지 않아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "9087f24f-0802-441a-8aff-71330fcd45e1"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 된 거예요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "50f2ce72-ad71-47a6-8b14-3b37dab1f8bf"
msgid "[Silently wait for her to continue]"
msgstr "[그녀가 계속하기를 조용히 기다린다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b9b9c145-2197-486a-ae60-feef553062b6"
msgid "\"I love you.\""
msgstr "\"사랑해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "1c8045be-95da-49d0-9229-59ba6804c057"
msgid "\"You are my companion. Most importantly and forever.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나의 가장 중요하고 영원한 동반자에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "c850d76f-d683-4c82-922c-322898082a90"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to put an end to this, let's do it. It's over between us.\""
msgstr "\"이 일에 종지부를 찍고 싶다면 그렇게 해요. 이제 우리 사이는 끝났어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "27045475-5086-40f7-8290-3c5ef4b81b8c"
msgid ""
"\"You are my friend! And if something is getting in the way of this "
"friendship, let's get rid of it — not each other!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 내 친구에요! 그리고 만약 어떤 것이 이 우정에 방해가 된다면, 그것을 없애기로해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "1a12fdb7-5d0d-4eeb-b3bc-f2c9ab42882c"
msgid "\"But I'm happy with the way things are now!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 전 지금과 같은 상황에 만족해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "60acee20-a3ff-4fac-b2fe-c4955ec6b6b9"
msgid "[Hug Valerie] \"We're together. Now and forever.\""
msgstr "[발레리와 포옹한다] \"우리 영원히 함께해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "54b732c7-7a1a-4e7e-9f78-253db1a4c3f2"
msgid ""
"[Kneel on one knee] \"I will prove I love you. Valerie, will you marry me?\""
msgstr "[한 쪽 무릎 꿇는다] \"내가 널 사랑한다는 걸 증명할 거야. 발레리, 나와 결혼해 주겠어?\"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "7309ca8a-41c1-44bc-8acd-5de4e2336d10"
msgid ""
"\"Too strange. We already have too many troubles and cares. Let's not "
"complicate things.\""
msgstr "\"너무 이상하군요. 우리는 이미 너무 많은 문제와 걱정거리를 가지고 있어요. 일을 복잡하게 만들지 마세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2c7bf5d5-bb2a-4522-9365-eb4f39cc3c8c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is massaging her temples with her eyes closed, like she's "
"suffering from a terrible headache.{/n} \"I've had enough. I can't do it any "
"more.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 극심한 두통에 시달리는 듯 눈을 감은 채 관자놀이를 마사지하고 있다.{/n} \"충분해요. 저는 더 이상 할 수 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "38f8f692-1313-4ab3-8d79-b5ef31955592"
msgid ""
"\"I've been trying so hard to come to terms with what's going on, but I "
"can't keep doing it.\" {n}Valerie sighs, opens her eyes and looks at you.{/n}"
" \"I was hoping that our... arrangement wouldn't affect the rest of my life. "
"But alas, it hasn't worked out that way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금의 상황을 받아들이려고 많이 애를 썼는데, 그럴 수가 없어요.\" {n}발레리는 한숨을 내쉬며 눈을 뜨고 당신을 바라본다.{/n} "
"\"우리의 계약이 내 남은 인생엔 아무런 영향을 주지 않기를 바랬어요. 하지만 아아, 그건 그렇게 되지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "44c01018-d966-438d-863c-07dfb1ab73fe"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know who we are to each other. I am your companion — and at the "
"same time the entire kingdom is gossiping about us! I spend my nights with "
"you — and then in the morning we act as though we hadn't slept in the same "
"bed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 우리가 서로에게 어떤 존재인지 모르겟어요 . 나는 당신의 동료에요. 그리고 동시에 온 왕국이 우리에 대해 험담을 하고 있어요! "
"내가 당신가 밤을 함께 보내고나서 다음 아침에 마치 동침하지 않은것처럼 행동한다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "51e7caa7-74ce-49d9-968d-b85b9b7001a5"
msgid ""
"\"I know I was the one who suggested this... but it turns out that what "
"worked with a mercenary doesn't work with a king, where everything is always "
"out in the open!\" {n}Valerie looks straight at you.{/n} \"I've had enough. "
"I want to put an end to it. Once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이걸 제안했던건 저였단거 알아요... 하지만 용병일때는 통했어도 왕에게는 통하지 않는다는 것이 밝혀졌어요. 모든 것이 항상 열려 있는 "
"이런곳에서는요!\"{n}발레리는 당신을 똑바로 쳐다본다.{/n} \"충분해요. 이제 끝내고 싶어요. 막지막으로요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b2484b09-fde6-4fe5-a719-b79a925860ca"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sighs with relief.{/n} \"Yes. Of course. Duty is above "
"everything. I started to forget that.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 안도의 한숨을 쉰다.{/n} \"네 물론에요. 의무가 최우선이죠. 제가 그것을 잊었군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1ef60e86-d2e2-4e5c-ac47-82213262ad99"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles half-heartedly.{/n} \"And you are my friend too. I don't "
"want to lose you over... over some misunderstanding.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 반듯이 미소짓는다.{/n} \"그리고 당신도 내 친구에요. 난 작은 오해로 당신을 잃고 싶지 않요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "635b674b-0396-49ca-bfc6-bd3d4b993964"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't you hear me at all?! The way things are now doesn't work for me!\""
msgstr "\"제말을 전혀 안들었나요?! 지금 상황이 안 좋아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ad0496b0-3e6f-47d2-8a37-3a15268f1785"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie inhales loudly.{/n} \"Enough. Do you see me losing my head? I've "
"no wish to take things to the edge, {name}. You know how I am when... I'm "
"loosing my head. We need to stop seeing each other alone. Stop all this. "
"Right now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 크게 숨을 들이마신다.{/n} \"충분해요. 내가 정신 없는게 보이나요? {name}, 전 사태를 더 이상 악화시키고 싶지 "
"않아요. 내가 어떤지 알잖아요... 미치겠어요. 우리는 그만 만나야해요. 이젠 그만해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b57cee13-68ac-43b6-87aa-664ef56e9089"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is silent for a few moments, then scoffs in disappointment.{/n} "
"\"Now that you've said it, so easily and carelessly... I'm thinking — did I "
"ever mean anything to you at all?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 잠시 침묵하더니, 동의하지 않는 듯 콧웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"그렇게 쉽고도 아무렇지도 않게 말해서 말인데... "
"나는... 당신에게 내게 무슨 의미가 있기는 했나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "273d3356-b41f-4ce4-88a6-7569b38b18f8"
msgid ""
"\"What are you saying?! Do you think this entire problem can be solved with "
"some... silly... declaration...\" {n}Valerie stops, stunned, as if she's "
"just realized what she heard. She bites her lips, looking at her feet in "
"alarm.{/n} \"I...\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 소리를 하는 거죠?! 이 모든 문제가 약간의... 멍청한... 선언으로 해결될 거라고 생각하나요? {n}의미를 겨우 깨달은 "
"것처럼, 발레리는 말을 그치고 동작을 멈춥니다. 그녀는 놀란듯 고개를 숙이며 입술을 깨뭅니다. {/n} \"나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f3955adf-82ec-4162-ae6a-22ff004955b1"
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "\"저도 당신을 사랑해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f0759adf-bb01-4207-8a4d-357dde0c57d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you hesitantly.{/n} \"But that's the thing. That's why "
"it... hurts me so much that you and I are kind of together and not at the "
"same time. I wouldn't care if I didn't love you.\" {n}Valerie shivers and "
"holds herself as if she's freezing.{/n} \"This is all so... strange.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 머뭇거리며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그게 문제죠. 서로가 연인인 것처럼 행동하는데 실은 그렇지 않아요. 그래서 무척 "
"힘듭니다. 당신을 사랑하지 않았다면 별 문제도 아니었을 텐데.\" {n}발레리는 몹시 추운 듯이 몸을 떨며 움츠렸다.{/n} \"모든 "
"일이... 제게는 낯서네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "112e6982-8b49-4604-b493-d776d2e41730"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you coldly, then hastily turns away and walks swiftly "
"from your chambers.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리가 당신을 차갑게 바라보곤, 성급히 돌아서서 빠르게 당신의 방을 떠난다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4cd20269-53d2-4f03-af9a-b63b7f74a5c9"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you, astonished.{/n} \"I never imagined.... never "
"imagined a king proposing to me.\" {n}A mischievous smile appears on the "
"girl's face.{/n} \"And while you might need to work on your manners, the "
"lack of the ring can be excused by the unusual circumstances... Yes. I will "
"marry you. As soon as we save your kingdom.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 깜짝 놀란채로 당신을 바라본다.{/n} \"난 상상해본적이... 왕이 내게 프로포즈할 거라곤 상상도 해본 적 없어.\" "
"{n}여인의 얼굴에 짓궂은 미소가 떠오른다.{/n} \"매너에 대해서 조금 더 신경쓸 필요가 있지만, 반지가 없는 것은 지금같이 평범하지 "
"않은 상황에서라면 용납될 수 있어... 그래, 당신과 결혼할게, 왕국을 구하자마자 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fe970c4e-628b-4af1-adc4-856a422773ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie clings to you and kisses you passionately, then buries her face "
"in your shoulder.{/n} \"Together, {name}. To the end of the world.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 당신에게 메달리더니 열정적으로 입맞춤한다. 그러곤 당신의 어깨에 얼굴을 묻었다.{/n} \"함께야, {name}. 세상이 "
"끝날 때까지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/MajorEvent_3_FinalTalk/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c454c8db-a73d-4216-9d5b-d9cc3e154adf"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad we talked. I think I'll go on about my duties. We still need to "
"defeat half the world, remember?\" {n}Valerie walks out of your chambers, "
"stopping in the doorway to cast a strange, sad look at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"대화해줘서 고마워. 이제 내 의무를 다하러 가야 할 것 같아. 우린 여전히 세계의 절반을 물리쳐야한다고. 기억해?\" {n}발레리가 "
"방을 나서다가, 문가에서 멈춰서선 당신에게 이상하고 슬픈 표정을 보인다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bd607fc3-5949-41f0-b661-e44932f9c732"
msgid "Intended to found a law-abiding state in the Stolen Lands."
msgstr "도둑맞은 땅에서 질서를 따르는 국가를 건설할 겁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "de8cb8eb-95dd-4463-ae73-c5b4dcf0d7fa"
msgid ""
"\"There's enough work to do in the Stolen Lands. Running off bandits, "
"founding a state, protecting the common people...\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에는 해야 할 일이 충분히 많다. 산적들을 몰아내고, 국가를 설립하고, 일반인들을 지키는 것들도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4b91faee-bd5c-4ed1-8fe0-71ab9adc0c47"
msgid "Was interested only in personal gains from a future reign."
msgstr "미래의 통치에서 얻을 개인적 이익에만 관심있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "05603f2c-b74c-49d3-b204-7ce6d0d30515"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not worried about what I'll do. All that matters is what I'll be "
"getting. Sitting on a throne can be a lucrative occupation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 내가 해야 할 일에 대해선 걱정하지 않아. 중요한 것은 내가 얻을 것이지. 왕좌에 얻는 것은 꽤나 수지맞는 일일 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "7eb02579-d395-4379-a94c-0dcc41f71c35"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever happens, I hope you are beside me. I appreciate your help... and "
"I appreciate you yourself, Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 일어나든 네가 내 옆에 있기를 바라. 네 도움도 고맙고... 그리고 그냥 너한테도 고마워, 발레리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "249888a3-9c9c-4f38-9ce7-4c6b98434a5f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie catches up with you near the {g|Oleg's Trading Post}trading "
"post{/g} and touches you on the shoulder.{/n} \"{name}? Can I talk to you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g} 근처에 다다르자 발레리가 좇아와 당신을 따라잡고는, 어깨에 손을 "
"얹습니다.{/n} \"{name}? 대화 좀 할 수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ab31e6c1-3995-4934-8386-e990769d7432"
msgid ""
"\"Now that the Stag Lord is defeated, you rightfully own the {g|Stolen Lands}"
"Stolen Lands{/g}. Jamandi Aldori will endorse you and grant you the baron's "
"title.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 수사슴 군주는 죽었습니다. 당신은 정당하게 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 소유하게 됐죠. 자만디 알도리님의 "
"지지와 함께 남작의 작위를 수여받으실 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b6ae733f-68c5-48ed-b6b1-6e5bbd71be22"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl looks at you with interest and a little apprehension.{/n} \"What "
"will you do when you sit on the throne, {name}? Please don't say you haven't "
"thought about it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소녀가 당신을 관심과 약간의 걱정이 담긴 눈으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"통치자의 자리에 앉으면 어떻게 하실 겁니까, {name}? "
"부디 생각도 해보지 않았다는 말은 하지 말아 주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a8281037-28b0-4bbe-b03f-65e75a0e5350"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie carefully studies your face for a long time, as if trying to find "
"something. Finally she gives you a soft smile and shakes her head.{/n} \"I "
"would put down any other man who would say this. But not you. I'm sure you "
"value me, my support and my military talent.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 마치 뭔가를 찾아내려는 것처럼 잠시동안 당신의 얼굴을 조심스럽게 헤아려봅니다. 마침내 그녀는 미소를 짓고는 고개를 "
"젓습니다.{/n} \"다른 남자가 이런 말을 했다면 확 때려눕혔을 겁니다. 하지만 당신은 아니에요. 저는 당신이 저의 조력과 군사적 "
"재능을 높이 평가하고 계시는 걸 확신하고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f40a0728-658d-4c05-b4ea-02f3afb1d6a2"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie nods, pleased.{/n} \"To be honest, I didn't expect any other "
"answer from you. You are a noble person, {name}, and I'm glad I can serve "
"the good of your state.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 만족한채 고개를 끄덕인다.{/n} \"솔직히 말하면, 전 다른 대답을 기대하지 않았습니다. 당신은 고결하신 분입니다, "
"{name}, 그리고 저는 당신의 영지의 번영을 위해 봉사하는 게 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/OTP_RomanceOpening/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e99f3170-71a6-4a21-80a1-e74761839e72"
msgid ""
"\"Hm... This is not an answer I would expect to hear from the future lord of "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. I hope in time you will become more "
"serious about your responsibilities.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠... 미래의 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 군주에게서 들을 거라고 기대했던 대답은 아니네요. 때가 되면 당신의 "
"책임에 대해서 조금 더 진지해지기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b9341ddb-85f7-4ef4-9643-931ee8e54037"
msgid "\"It's just friendly sex!\""
msgstr "\"이건 그냥 친근한 섹스야!\\"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d39f9046-f604-4d0e-8f99-a7b1227ecc69"
msgid "\"You're right. Octavia and I are very close.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 옥타비아와 나는 아주 가까워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "31f40081-b2c6-4763-9d2f-c4f6e4a5314f"
msgid "\"You're right. Regongar and I are very close.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 옥타비아와 나는 아주 가까운 사이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "36414940-32a7-43bb-9658-590e2d7ae1ac"
msgid "\"There's no place in my heart for anyone but you.\""
msgstr "\"너 외에는 그 누구도 내 마음 속에 자리할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d3e6e6d5-c176-4852-a66b-08705e9c1a45"
msgid "\"{name}? I need a word.\""
msgstr "\"{name}? 할말이 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "53270260-7cd1-4fbf-91cc-b435c51503c0"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't help but notice you have quite a... close relationship with "
"someone from our entourage. I feel it's... let's say obscene, considering "
"everything we've said between us.\" {n}Valerie looks at you, folding her "
"arms across her chest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 당신이 우리 주변 사람들 중 누군가와 그... 아주 친밀한 관계를 갖고 있다는 걸 눈치채지 않을 수 없었습니다. 전 그게... "
"말하자면 문란하다고 느꼈어요. 우리가 그 간 나눈 대화들을 고려해볼 때 말이죠.\" {n}발레리는 가슴 위에 팔짱을 끼고는 당신을 "
"봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "d516f8e8-dbd9-4425-a520-eef662bbe798"
msgid ""
"{n}A thin smile appears on Valerie's face.{/n} \"Oh, just that? In that case "
"I won't keep you from having fun.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리의 얼굴에 엷은 미소가 나타납니다.{/n} \"오. 그 뿐입니까? 당신이 응큼한 짓을 하지 못하게 해야겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "64ed8e4e-8937-45c7-9ce8-0260bed721bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie grows pensive.{/n} \"I'm sorry you decided to inform me about it "
"only after I raised this question.\" {n}Valerie turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 방어적으로 말합니다.{/n} \"내가 물어본 다음에야 그렇게 알려주다니 참 안타깝네요.\" {n}발레리는 등을 "
"돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Companions/Romance/Valerie/Valerie_Choosing/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f9cb63b8-ab4c-4f6e-9cae-c74a2b723b7c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie tilts her head.{/n} \"Are you sure? I think you should clarify "
"the situation with those who... who are close to you. And make sure everyone "
"knows where things stand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 고개를 갸웃거립니다.{/n} \"정말입니까? 애인 관계는 정리했을 줄 알았는데요... 그리고 모두에게 확실히 해둘 줄 "
"알았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/DweomerCat/CatName_String
msgctxt "847bc485-023d-4ba0-abe2-8ce9314718c6"
msgid "Young Dweomercat"
msgstr "어린 듀오머고양이"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/DweomerCat/Cat_attack_String
msgctxt "a9dcca4a-ccb6-4371-b498-cd27aa189cc3"
msgid "\"Claw me, claw thee! The dweomercat will help you!\""
msgstr "\"날 할퀴면, 나도 널 할퀴는거지! 듀오머고양이는 널 돕는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/DweomerCat/Cat_flee_String
msgctxt "5270bd97-b426-406a-aadc-c326710a4ac6"
msgid "\"The dweomercat has helped enough. Now you'll manage for yourself!\""
msgstr "\"듀오머 고양이는 충분히 도와줬다. 이제는 너 스스로 꾸려나가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/DweomerCat/Cutscene_meet_01_String
msgctxt "2f642244-be2f-4df3-b04e-46c3a3c6a7cc"
msgid "\"Shhh!!! Stinky, lousy, driveling carrion eaters!\""
msgstr "\"스으으!!! 냄새나고 더럽고 침을 흘리며 썩은 고기를 먹는 것들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/DweomerCat/Cutscene_meet_02_String
msgctxt "5c85b79d-c605-46fe-ba5e-d1385584351a"
msgid "\"Well, {race}... Today you've helped the dweomercat.\""
msgstr "\"자, {race}... 오늘 그대는 듀오머고양이를 도와주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/DweomerCat/Cutscene_meet_03_String
msgctxt "3547d83b-315d-46db-8558-5aba523a8a4b"
msgid ""
"\"The dweomercat does not forget those who help her. We shall meet again... "
"Perhaps. Who knows!\""
msgstr "\"듀오머고양이는 은혜를 잊지 않는다. 우린 다시 만날거다... 아마도. 누가 알겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ff1a48fa-212a-46f7-8363-2831b8d70a18"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f2e8f138-a18b-467d-923a-4d8d72d58782"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"네가 파는 물건들을 좀 볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4b2f5bf9-2c5e-481f-8b4e-0e5a4e89fbba"
msgid "[Attack] \"I will destroy you, dead one!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"널 박살내주마. 이미 죽은놈아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "182de10b-8316-4000-bbf7-dee5893be2fc"
msgid "\"I need nothing.\""
msgstr "\"난 필요한게 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "032350de-998b-4c08-aed9-eec7fe1f85a6"
msgid "\"Where is your master's den?\""
msgstr "\"네 주인의 은신처는 어디지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fc311415-1ad1-4a91-9fe1-cd4ec587a65e"
msgid ""
"{n}A skeleton walks slowly towards you. His skull is filled with coins, "
"which glimmer through his empty eye sockets, clinking with every step. He "
"halts beside a cart filled with valuable-looking items. He waves at you in a "
"friendly manner with his bony hand.{/n} \"Hello, hello! Allow me to "
"introduce myself: I am the Skeletal Salesman. Do not look upon my face – or "
"its absence. Look at my wares! Choose! Buy!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}스켈레톤 한 마리가 천천히 당신을 향해 걸어옵니다. 그의 두개골 안은 동전들로 가득 차 있는 것이 빈 눈구멍 사이로 희미하게 "
"보였고, 발걸음마다 찰랑거리는 소리를 냅니다. 그는 값비싸보이는 물건들로 가득 찬 수레 옆에 멈춰 섭니다. 그는 당신에게 친근한 태도를 "
"보이며 뼈만남은 앙상한 손을 흔들어 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕, 안녕! 나를 소개 하자면, 나는 스켈레톤 상인이야. 내 얼굴이나 그안에 "
"텅빈 두개골만 보지말고, 내가 파는 물건들을 좀 봐! 골라요! 사요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "d3bd7cc8-b5e1-4467-8aab-300970eaf788"
msgid ""
"{n}The skeleton waves at you in a friendly manner with his bony hand.{/n} \"I"
" believe we have already met. How splendid – I do enjoy returning customers! "
"Unfortunately, I have nothing new to offer you at present. But do not lose "
"heart. – I'm sure something will come up! Return to me anon!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}스켈레톤은 당신에게 친근한 태도를 보이며 뼈만남은 앙상한 손을 흔들어 인사합니다.{/n} \"다시 만났군요. 이런 기쁜일이 있나. "
"다시 돌아온 손님을 맞는다는건 즐거운 일이지. 유감스럽게도 현재 새로운 상품은 아직 없군. 하지만 낙심할 필요는 없다구. 분명 곧 새로운 "
"물품들이 들어올테니까! 곧 다시 보자구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "01051add-4714-44e9-9ae0-37095e4523a5"
msgid ""
"{n}The skeleton waves at you in a friendly manner with his bony hand.{/n} \"I"
" believe we have already met. How splendid – I do enjoy returning customers! "
"And I've just received some new wares!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}스켈레톤은 당신에게 친근한 태도를 보이며 뼈만남은 앙상한 손을 흔들어 인사합니다.{/n} \"다시 만났군요. 이런 기쁜일이 있나. "
"다시 돌아온 손님을 맞는다는건 즐거운 일이지. 게다가 방금 새로운 물품들이 들어왔다구! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "9e23ef21-4ee8-4fab-92aa-bc1324146db3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, this story is as sad as it is cautionary!\" {n}The skeleton raises a "
"thin white finger.{/n} \"I was once like you – wandering in search of "
"adventure, fearlessly delving into dark caves, hidden temples, and ancient "
"ruins, taking whatever I pleased! But then...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 이 이야기는 조심스러운 만큼이나 슬픈 이야기야!\" {n}스켈레톤은 가느다란 흰 손가락을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"나도 한때는 "
"너같은 사람이었지. 모험을 찾아 헤매고, 어두운 동굴, 숨겨진 사원, 고대 유적지를 겁도 없이 뒤지며, 원하는 것은 무엇이든 가져갔지! "
"근데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "5c8ac109-d713-4ff1-a8f2-45b195538946"
msgid ""
"\"I set forth on an adventure which was to crown my career. I discovered the "
"den of a dead dragon. A massive treasure trove lied within. I could purchase "
"all of {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} with such a horde, and half of "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} with the change. The owner lay dead upon the heap of "
"gold – bare bones, just as I am now, breathless and still.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내 경력에 왕관을 씌울만한 최고의 모험을 시작한거야. 죽은 드래곤의 은신처를 발견하게 된거지. 그안엔 막대한 보물들이 숨겨져 "
"있었어. 그 정도의 보물이면 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}이랑 모든 부족들까지 살 수 있었고, 남은 돈으로 "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 절반은 살 수 있을 정도였지. 보물의 주인은 금 더미 위에 죽은 듯이 누워 있었어. 마치 지금의 내 "
"모습처럼, 뼈만 남은 채로 숨도 쉬지 않고 그대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "92fea23f-8a9f-4287-836c-f7c5854f9956"
msgid ""
"\"How was I to know he wasn't truly dead? Or rather, he was – but not quite. "
"You know... Undead? A dragon lich! – I couldn't have imagined it in my "
"wildest dreams! He grabbed ahold of me with his bony talon, and I bid my "
"life farewell. But then I looked upon the pile of bones and equipment left "
"behind by the dragon's former guests... And my panicked mind coughed forth a "
"brilliant idea. – An idea worth a million coins! I offered the dragon a "
"deal. And he agreed! Imagine that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 진짜 죽지 않았다는 것을 내가 무슨 수로 알았겠어? 근데 완전히 죽은건 아니었던거야. 그왜 알잖아..언데드였나..아 맞다. "
"드래곤리치! 정말 꿈에도 상상못할 일이었지.그는 뼈같은 손톱으로 나를 움켜 잡았고, 나는 내 생과 이별을 준비했지. 근데 바로 그때 "
"드래곤의 이전 손님들이 남기고 간 뼈무더기와 장비들이 눈에 들어왔어. 그리고 당황한 정신 속에서도 기발한 생각을 해낸거야. 수백만 금화와 "
"맞먹는 아이디어를! 나는 드래곤에게 거래를 제의했어. 그리고 그는 동의했어! 상상이 가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "a0158b0c-5be3-41f4-a224-f9717c6ba734"
msgid ""
"\"You see, dragons are greedy for treasure, but they have no need of swords "
"or armor. So I offered to hold a sale! – I would turn the junk he has been "
"storing for ages into newly minted coins! The dragon approved of the idea, "
"and gave me the job. He did, however, place a curse upon me, as you can see: "
"now I am but bare bones... But fear not – to tell you the truth, I rather "
"enjoy it. I go wherever I please, talk to interesting people, and no longer "
"need I fear death!\""
msgstr ""
"\"한번 생각해봐. 드래곤은 보물을 탐하지만 칼이나 갑옷은 필요가 없잖아. 그래서 내가 판매를 해주겠다고 제의한거야! 그가 오랫동안 "
"보관해 온 쓰레기들을 새로운 금화로 바꿔주는거지! 드래곤은 이 제의를 승인했고, 나에게 그 일을 허락해 주었어. 하지만 보시다시피, "
"나에게 저주를 내렸어. 지금 나는 단지 맨 뼈다귀에 불과하게 됐지. 하지만 두려워 할 필요는 없다구. 솔직히 말하자면, 나는 오히려 "
"즐기고 있거든. 내가 원하는 곳이라면 어디든 가서 흥미로운 사람들과 이야기를 나누고, 더 이상 죽음을 두려워할 필요도 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2c884e13-2e55-4160-9bc3-e16a6cbdff15"
msgid ""
"\"Pity. Pity! Well... I shall eventually find someone who will buy these "
"things. I have all the time in the world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이렇게 애석할 데가! 뭐... 나는 결국 이 물건들을 살 사람을 찾게 되겠지. 나는 세상의 모든 시간을 누릴 수 있으니 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4a0b3b54-4aa4-4cec-ba4f-e4660845486e"
msgid ""
"{n}The skeleton happily clinks the coins in his skull.{/n} \"With great "
"pleasure! Here, look! Choose! Buy!\""
msgstr "{n}스켈레톤은 두개골 안의 금화들을 행복하게 짤랑짤랑 흔듭니다.{/n} \"어서오세요! 자 여기, 보세요! 골라요! 사요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "0caf2007-92f9-4d0a-bcc1-cd0d09f2197b"
msgid ""
"\"Are you attempting to lift my curse, or merely to rob me? I'm afraid my "
"master's magic will prevent you from succeeding in either!\" {n}Indeed, as "
"soon as you raise your weapon, the cart vanishes into thin air along with "
"all the goods within.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 저주를 풀어주려는거야, 아니면 그냥 털려는 거야? 안타깝지만 둘중 뭐가됐던 내 주인님의 마법이 막아주신다고!\" {n}당신이 "
"무기를 드는 순간, 정말로 그는 수레 안에 있는 모든 물건과 함께 허공으로 사라졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "580475c9-18a3-4c2d-8284-2566ca2d52a2"
msgid ""
"\"I've been asked this question many times. Do you so badly desire that your "
"weapons end up in my cart? If so, then just sell them to me! Or do you "
"imagine that you will find your fortune where hundreds before you have found "
"only death? True, true, optimism runs through the blood of every treasure "
"hunter. Even those of us who have no blood at all!\" {n}The skeleton laughs "
"and rattles his bones.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그 질문을 이전에도 여러번 들어봤는데 말이야.너의 무기들이 내 수레에 실려가기를 그렇게 간절히 바라는건가? 그럴꺼면 그냥 나한테 "
"팔아! 그것도 아니라면, 단 한번뿐인 죽음이 찾아오기 전에 수백번의 일확천금이 찾아올거라는 상상을 하는건가? 맞아. 맞아. 낙관주의는 "
"모든 보물 사냥꾼들의 피에 흐르지. 하물며 피가 전혀 없는 나도 그러니까!\" {n}스켈레톤은 웃으며 뼈를 달그락 거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "5b55c390-9438-4fa3-b686-36f57b17e95f"
msgid ""
"\"I even suggested to my master that I sell maps to his den! Guaranteed "
"revenue, and new inventory... But he had no interest in this. He detests "
"guests. He says they distract him from the contemplation of eternity. I "
"suppose the clinking of the coins I bring him does not!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 주인님에게 은신처 지도를 팔자고 제안하기까지 했었어! 수익 보장도 되고, 새로운 물품도 얻고... 근데 주인님은 이 일에는 "
"관심이 없었어. 그는 손님을 싫어하시거든. 말하시길, 영원의 명상에 방해가 되신다는군. 아마 내가 가져온 금화의 짤랑거리는 소리는 "
"방해되지 않으시겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/EnhancedEdition/WanderingVendor/Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "c04ec1ac-29c3-4a4d-83c9-84b3114b27ae"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, I couldn't point you to his den even if I so desired. My master "
"robs all memory of the location of his den as soon as I step foot upon the "
"highway. When it's time to replenish my stock, it is he who finds me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든, 그렇게 원해다해도 주인님의 은신처를 알려주는건 불가능해. 주인님은 내가 길에 발을 내딛자마자 은신처 위치에 대한 모든 기억을 "
"지워버리시거든. 내 재고를 보충할 때가 되면 주인님께서 나한테 찾아오시지.\""

