#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/CulinaryAlmanach_Name_String
msgctxt "1cc4c8aa-d293-46b1-ab5b-5ebbf87c2fe0"
msgid "\"Cooking Almanac of the Inner Sea\" by Jubilost Narthropple"
msgstr "\"내해의 요리법\" 주빌로스트 나트로플 지음"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/CulinaryAlmanach_String
msgctxt "05200b90-78d4-4b0d-b7c2-3f16efee8da8"
msgid ""
"\"It is perhaps Avistan's most popular dish. In the capital of Cheliax, it "
"is baked in a cheese crust and sprinkled with lemon juice. The local "
"fishermen use a different cooking method in Qadira, which is on the opposite "
"end of Avistan. There you will find it finely chopped and mixed cold "
"ingredients. The exact origin of the dish remains unknown, but it is "
"generally believed to have been invented in Andoran, and spread around the "
"globe by seafarers and pilgrims.\n"
"It's served as plain pâté in its most basic version. To prepare it, soak the "
"herring in spiced marinade, then mince it into a spreadable paste. Add a "
"mashed tart green apple, hard-boiled quail eggs, the freshest butter you can "
"find, and half an onion. The list of ingredients may vary in the inland "
"regions. In the region of Nirmathas, beef or lamb is used for this snack. I "
"once tasted a highly original and equally highly disgusting version cooked "
"with milk and mushrooms on the border of Druma...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 아마 아비스탄의 가장 유명한 요리일 것이다. 첼릭스의 수도에서 이 요리 맛의 비법은 구운 치즈 크러스트와 레몬 쥬스를 뿌린 "
"것에 있다. 카디라의 시골 어부는 다른 방법을 사용하는데 아비스탄과 반대이다. 그들은 차가운 재료들을 잘게 다져 섞는다. 이 요리의 "
"정확한 기원은 알려지지 않았으나 안도란에서 처음 만들어져 바다를 여행하는 사람과 순례자들에 의해 퍼졌다고 믿어진다.\n"
" 가장 기본적인 요리법은 평평한 파테이다. 거기에 사과와 삶은 퀘일 알, 최고급 버터와 양파 반쪽을 으깨어 더한다. 들어가는 재료는 "
"지역마다 다르다. Nirmathas 지방에서는 소고기나 양고기를 넣는다. 나는 드루마 국경에서 우유와 버섯으로 요리한 것을 먹었는데 맛이 "
"원초적이면서도 역겨웠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/DarkLords_Name_String
msgctxt "65ce8f4a-7a27-487f-99ea-8a1239d97cad"
msgid "\"Secret Overlords: the Essence of the World Order\""
msgstr "\"비밀스러운 오버로드: 세상을 명령하는 자\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/DarkLords_String
msgctxt "532d0fbc-44b6-40a4-835d-7ea5fa4bcde9"
msgid ""
"\"Until recently, we knew this world as it was described in books and "
"stories. A sewer, torn apart by hyenas that separate us with nations and "
"borders, oppress us with extortion and lies, and assert their authority and "
"power. However, someone else's hand rules these slaves who act like masters. "
"It's a threat far more intimidating than a handful of arrogant fools. Our "
"lands are secretly ruled by the most ancient creatures of Golarion, the "
"inhabitants of the ever-dark depths, who know both past and future. People "
"are led along paths they cannot see, and do not have the power to leave – to "
"an end known only to our hidden masters. Some insist that the signs are "
"purely coincidental, but they point to a vast conspiracy. Only a fool can "
"fail to see how the myriad coincidences weave into a great cobweb. Or they "
"have submitted their very will and sworn their allegiance to our unseen "
"masters in the depths.\""
msgstr ""
"\"최근까지, 우리는 이 세상이 책과 이야기에서 묘사한 것과 다르지 않다고 생각했다. 하이에나들에게 뜯겨 나라와 국경으로 나뉘어진 "
"하수구가 강탈과 거짓말로 우리를 압박하고, 그들의 권위와 권력을 주장한다. 하지만, 다른 누군가의 손이 우리를 노예처럼 부리고 있다. "
"이것은 오만한 멍청이들이 하는 위협보다 더 무서운 협박이다. 우리의 땅은 골라리온의 고대 생명체들에 의해 지배를 받고 있다. 그들은 "
"어둠의 심부 속에서 살며 과거와 미래를 알고 있다. 사람들은 보이지 않는 길 위에서 끌려다니고 있다, 그리고 뿌리칠 힘 또한 없다. 결국 "
"보이지 않는 주인들의 손에 죽을 뿐이다. 누군가는 그저 우연일 뿐이라고 말하지만, 그들이 지적한 것이 바로 음모이다. 바보들은 수많은 "
"우연들이 결국 거대한 하나의 사실로 이어지는 것을 모른다. 아니면 그저 의지를 꺾고 보이지 않는 주인에게 복종하는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/Everlight_Name_String
msgctxt "58df786a-8705-4cdd-a993-a323cd76dcf2"
msgid "\"Eternal Sunshine. A Pilgrim's Journal.\""
msgstr "\"영원한 햇빛. 순례자의 여행일지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/Everlight_String
msgctxt "f0ffa482-96b4-4af3-9c5b-ca1a225cb220"
msgid ""
"\"I failed to resist temptation, and quickly doused my weary feet in the "
"holy waters of the oasis. I washed my feet off first, for it would never do "
"to desecrate a divine font with the dust of the road.\n"
"The sunset danced upon the surface of the water. I closed my eyes as my "
"flesh went numb, in yearning anticipation of a miracle. On the road, pain "
"had gnawed at my heart, but now it melted into the holy water, and my sores "
"seemed to fade away.\n"
"I looked into my heart, and questioned the purity of my thought. Was I "
"worthy enough to escape my torment? Would Sarenrae give me a sign? I was "
"prepared to greet the sound of flapping dove wings.\n"
"The fever overwhelmed me. I sensed the divine rays, but the sun had set. The "
"light was coming through my eyelids! I witnessed the figures of Sarenrae and "
"her angels. I dared open my eyes, but they were heavy, as if burdened with "
"all the weight of the sun's heat. Sleep dawned upon me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 유혹에 저항하는 것을 실패했고 신성한 오아시스의 물에 뛰어들었다. 나는 먼저 발을 씻었다. 흙길에서 이런 신성한 곳을 찾기란 "
"쉽지 않기 때문이다.\n"
"물의 표면에서 햇빛이 춤을 추고 있었다. 나는 피곤해서 눈을 감았다. 나는 기적을 원하고 있었다. 길에서 고통이 내 심장을 갉아먹었지만 "
"그 고통은 이제 신성한 물로 씻겨졌고 내 아픔은 사라졌다.\n"
"나는 생각하면서 나는 순수한지 자신에게 질문했다. 내 고통을 벗어날 정도로 나는 가치가 있는 걸까? 서렌레이께서 나에게 신호를 주는 "
"것일까? 나는 비둘기가 날개짓하는 소리에 응답할 준비가 되었다.\n"
"흥분이 나를 압도했다. 나는 신성한 광선을 느꼈지만, 해는 지고 없었다. 내 눈꺼풀 사이로 빛이 들어오고 있었다! 나는 사렌레이와 그녀의 "
"천사들의 모습을 목격했다. 감히 눈을 떴지만 눈꺼플이 태양열의 무게를 모두 부담하듯 무거웠다. 잠이 깼다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/FightingBleaching_Name_String
msgctxt "b3130f70-a1e9-43cd-b489-1e2a12049264"
msgid "\"Fighting the Bleaching: Practical Guidance\" by Guisa Nordequanni"
msgstr "\"백화에 맞서 싸우다:생존법\" 구이사 노르드콰니 지음"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/FightingBleaching_String
msgctxt "c577589b-5a99-46a1-9a0e-d4af41558b47"
msgid ""
"\"1. The youth shall leave their malady behind!\n"
"The Bleaching does not cling to people until they mature.\n"
"2. What is the color of your skin?\n"
"Apple-cheeked yesterday, but deathly pale today? That's an alarming sign! "
"Closely monitor the condition of your skin, hair, and eyes.\n"
"3. Never be bored.\n"
"Curiosity is your best protection. Have a finger in every pie!\n"
"4. Don't break your neck.\n"
"Be prepared to stand up for yourself or run for your life when you venture "
"out to seek adventure.\n"
"5. Never give up.\n"
"There's a remedy for the Bleaching – and it isn't pills. But a new wardrobe "
"or a new lover can stop the disease. And a proper journey can prevent its "
"onset for a long time!\n"
"6. You are not alone.\n"
"Find yourself some soulmates. They might just give you a new lease of life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"1. 나이가 어려도 병에 걸리는 것을 조심하라!\n"
"백화는 나이에 상관 없이 찾아온다.\n"
"2. 당신의 피부색은 어떤 색인가?\n"
"어제는 볼이 빨갰어도 오늘은 창백해졌나? 그렇다면 그것은 경고이다! 당신의 피부와 머릿결, 눈의 상태부터 조심히 관찰하라.\n"
"3. 절대 지루해지지 말아라.\n"
"호기심은 최고의 보호막이다. 케이크를 먹을 때마다 손가락으로 찍어 먹어라!\n"
"4. 목이 부러져서는 안 된다.\n"
"모험을 하고자 할 때는 항상 서서 도망갈 준비를 해라.\n"
"5. 절대 포기하지 말아라.\n"
"백화의 치료법도 있다. 하지만 그것은 약이 아니다. 가구를 새로 산다던지 애인을 새로 사귄다면 병을 막을 수 있다. 그리고 적절한 여행은 "
"백화를 오랫동안 막아줄 것이다!\n"
"6. 당신은 혼자가 아니다.\n"
"소울메이트를 찾아라. 그들은 당신에게 새로운 삶을 줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/Ilthuliak_Name_String
msgctxt "f1ab76fd-a3b2-4eea-8abe-624761da8daf"
msgid "\"The Notes of a Traveling Priest: Ilthuliak\" by Tyrin Dean"
msgstr "\"여행 사제의 기록: 일툴리악\" 타이린 딘 지음"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/Ilthuliak_String
msgctxt "1c34dae4-4a9e-4065-87e3-962df2a2a47a"
msgid ""
"\"Imagine this: A girl (whose name I shall not disclose) comes to town and "
"immediately purchases the most expensive suburban villa. This newcomer "
"spends unfathomable amounts on charity, even returning several tragically "
"perished citizens to life at her own expense. She's very young; her rough "
"speech and manners indicate that she's not of noble birth. This leaves the "
"whole town wondering: how did this young lady come into possession of such a "
"huge fortune, and why does she spend it so eagerly?\n"
"Those secrets were revealed to me when I was invited to the mysterious "
"girl's house to provide healing services. The young lady reluctantly "
"displayed something she'd been hiding from everyone — terrible acid burns. "
"She forestalled any questions with a single word: 'Ilthuliak.'\n"
"The monstrous black dragon's name was well known in the River Kingdoms. "
"She'd lived in the region for hundreds of years, inspiring terror and "
"emptying settlements. Many experienced dragon hunters attempted to put a "
"stop to her — and all perished. No one knew where Ilthuliak's lair was, or "
"where she would strike next. The wounds Ilthuliak's acid breath left on my "
"patient's body were terrible, but her soul was hurt much worse. The girl and "
"her friends had found the lair of the dragon. They could have gathered "
"hunters to destroy the monster, but they instead kept silent in search of "
"profit. When the lair's mistress was absent, they would carry treasure out, "
"little by little. Ilthuliak suspected something was happening, so she set an "
"ambush for the thieves, and they were dealt with cruelly. My patient "
"pretended to be dead, surviving while the dragon devoured the bodies of her "
"friends.\n"
"She had much gold left at her disposal, but it came with the burden of "
"memories that recalled devastated cities and countless people burned by "
"acid. Unable to tolerate the guilt, the girl tried to atone for ill-gotten "
"gains with good deeds.\n"
"I was able to heal her physical wounds. When we parted, she told me she "
"planned to spend the rest of her wealth organizing an expedition to "
"Ilthuliak's lair to end the beast.\n"
"I recently heard rumor that the villa has been abandoned for quite some time "
"now. It's possible the owner left for other lands, but my heart tells me her "
"bones lie in the lair of Ilthuliak — that winged terror and plague to the "
"River Kingdoms...\""
msgstr ""
"\"상상해 보라. 한 여성(그 이름은 밝힐 수 없다)이 마을에 와서 도시에서 가장 비싼 집을 구매하는 모습을. 이 여성은 자선단체에 헤아릴 수 없는 "
"돈을 기부하고, 심지어 비극적으로 사망한 시민 몇 명을 자비로 살려내기도 했다. 그녀는 매우 어리고 거친 말투와 행동으로 보아 귀족 출신이 아님을 "
"말해준다. 이 사실로 많은 궁금증이 생긴다. 어떻게 이 어린 여성이 엄청난 부자가 되었고, 거리낌 없이 많은 돈을 쓸 수 있단 말인가?\n"
"이 비밀은 내가 이 신비로운 여성의 집에 치료를 하러 갈 때 밝혀졌다. 그 젊은 여성은 마지못해 숨기고 있던 끔찍한 산성 화상을 보여주었다. "
"그녀는 '일툴리악'이라는 한 단어로 모든 질문을 차단했다.\n"
"그 괴물 블랙 드래곤은 강의 왕국들에 잘 알려져있다. 그녀는 수백년을 그 지역에서 살았고 사람들의 공포를 유발하고 마을을 없애기도 했다. "
"많은 노련한 용 사냥꾼들이 그녀를 막으려 했지만 모두 죽고말았다. 일툴리악의 레어가 어디인지, 다음에 어디를 공격할지 아무도 알지 못했다. "
"일툴리악의 산성 브레스에 의해 내 환자의 몸에 끔찍한 상처가 남았지만 영혼은 훨씬 더 큰 상처를 입었다. 그녀와 그녀의 친구들은 "
"드래곤의 레어를 발견했던 것이다. 그들은 사냥꾼들을 모아 괴물을 처치할 수도 있었지만, 대신 이익을 위해 침묵을 지켰다. 그들은 드래곤이 레어에 없을 때 "
"보물을 조금씩 빼낼 수 있었다. 일툴리악은 낌새를 알아차리고 도둑들을 기습해 치명적인 피해를 입혔다. 내 환자는 죽은척을 했고 "
"드래곤이 그녀의 친구들을 잡아먹는 동안 살아남았다.\n"
"그녀는 아직 돈이 많았지만 파괴된 도시와 산에 타 죽은 수많은 사람들을 떠올리게 하는 기억의 짐을 안고 있었다. 죄책감을 견딜 수 없었던 그녀는 선행을 통해 "
"속죄하려 한 것이다.\n"
"나는 그녀의 상처를 치료해줄 수 있었다. 우리가 헤어질 때 그녀는 나머지 재산을 일툴리악을 물리치기 위한 모험단을 만드는데 사용하겠다고 했다.\n"
"최근에 그 별장이 꽤 오랫동안 버려졌다는 소문을 들었다. 집 주인은 다른 곳으로 떠났을 수도 있겠지만, 내 생각에 그녀의 뼈는 강의 왕국들에 공포와 전염병을 퍼뜨린 일툴리악의 "
"레어에 있을 것 같다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/IobariaCurse_Name_String
msgctxt "fedc5a4f-c021-423b-a800-0871d4a23483"
msgid "\"The Curse of Ancient Iobaria\" by Hastef Umme"
msgstr "\"고대 이오바리아의 저주\" 하스테프 움므 지음"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/IobariaCurse_String
msgctxt "4e230e85-06e4-4ab5-ab01-f2089d771be6"
msgid ""
"\"– Tell us, oh Teacher, why would Brevoy call us barbarians in the books "
"you give us?\n"
"– The Gods became angry with our homeland, my son. This land has devoured so "
"many great empires, as if it was unwilling to bear life... There are "
"centuries-old ruins around our settlement. They were ravaged by a star that "
"fell from the sky. The Kingdom of the Cyclopes was the first victim of its "
"curse. New settlers claimed this land ten centuries later, to establish a "
"beautiful country named Iobaria, which stretched from the Lake of Mists and "
"Veils to the Castrovin Sea. But the curse still lay upon these lands, and "
"trouble came once again. Our ancestors suffered numerous maladies. The "
"Tearplague, the Chardeath, the Choking Death – one after another, leaving "
"only pain behind.\n"
"– People say that Otib the Necromancer was to blame...\n"
"– But who knows... A great civilization was turned to dust. This is why I'm "
"teaching you. Brevoy shouldn't make fun of you or call you barbarians...\""
msgstr ""
"\"말해주세요. 왜 책에서 브레보이가 우리를 야만족이라고 부르나요?\n"
"신들은 우리에게 화가 났단다. 이 땅은 거대한 제국들에 의해 점령되어 생명이 짓밟혔지... 우리가 사는 곳 주위에는 수백년된 폐허들이 "
"있다. 그것들은 하늘에서 떨어진 별로 망가진 것이었지. 사이클롭스의 왕국이 첫번째 희생자였어. 천년 후 새로운 자들이 와 이 땅을 "
"지배했고 이오바리아라는 아름다운 나라를 세웠다. 안개의 호수에서부터 카스트로빈 바다까지가 영토였지. 하지만 저주는 아직도 이 땅에 있고 "
"다시 한번 찾아올 거야. 우리의 조상은 수많은 병을 겪었지. 눈물을 흘리는 역병이나 몸이 숯처럼 검어지는 병이나 숨이 막혀 죽는 병들은 "
"전염되어 고통을 남겼단다.\n"
"사람들이 네크로맨서 오티브의 짓이라고 했다...\n"
"하지만 아무도 모른다... 위대한 문명이 재가 되었지. 그래서 내가 너를 가르치는 것이야. 브레보이가 우리 아이들을 조롱하거나 "
"야만인이라고 부르지 못하게 하기 위해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/LegendOfPathfinder_Name_String
msgctxt "e107fce6-0056-4438-a43a-d008d50677eb"
msgid "\"The Legend of the Pathfinder\" by Aren Roarvie"
msgstr "\"패스파인더의 전설\" 아렌 로아비 씀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/LegendOfPathfinder_String
msgctxt "7419b33d-ede8-49fe-be59-57813c571c55"
msgid ""
"\"The door flung open. The three chaps sharing adventure stories fell silent."
"\n"
"\"Hail, friend!\" said the visitor in a deep voice. \"Have you got a room "
"for me, master?\"\n"
"The bored half-elf behind the counter peered into the visitor's face and "
"whistled.\n"
"\"Blimey! If it isn't Gregas Jeffs! Hail, friend! Let me give you a room – "
"your gold is no good here!\"\n"
"\"No, I'll pay for it in full. That's what the Society is for. Helping and "
"sharing!\" Gregas nods at the three chaps. \"So there's my replacement... "
"Have you held the Confirmation yet?\"\n"
"\"We've got one last trial to go!\" The youngest blurted out and popped up "
"from his chair. \"It's such an honor! I've read all the Chronicles! All "
"about your adventures!\"\n"
"\"I heard you joined the Decemvirate, Gregas,\" another uttered.\n"
"\"Oh, did you? You should cut off your ears then, they deceive you! Am I "
"wearing a mask?\"\n"
"\"You ain't.\"\n"
"\"Good for you. A Pathfinder with no eyes is no good. I'm not interested in "
"politics. I'm interested in seeking. So, are you going to pour me beer? And "
"I'll tell you a couple of tales...\""
msgstr ""
"\"문은 열려있었다. 모험 이야기를 나누던 세 명이 침묵했다.\n"
" \"안녕한가!\" 방문객이 낮은 목소리로 말했다. \"나에게 방 하나 줄 수 있나?\"\n"
"지루했던 하프엘프가 방문객을 보고는 휘파람을 불었다.\n"
"\"오! 그레가스 제프스가 아닌가! 어서 와! 방을 안내하지. 돈은 필요 없어!\"\n"
"\"아니야. 돈은 충분히 내야지. 협회가 이러라고 있는 곳 아니겠어. 돕고 나눠야지!\" 그레가스는 세명을 보고 고개를 끄덕였다. "
"\"그래서 저기로군... 소개는 했나?\"\n"
"\"마지막 한명 남았어!\" 가장 어린 사람이 말하고는 자리에서 일어났다. \"정말 영광이야! 나는 연대기를 모두 읽었어! 당신의 모험들 "
"모두를!\"\n"
"\"Decemvirate에 갔다고 들었는데. 그레가스.\" 다른 사람이 말했다.\n"
"\"오. 정말이야? 그럼 귀를 잘라야 하는데. 속았나 보군! 내 귀는 멀쩡하다고.\"\n"
"\"그렇지.\"\n"
"\"좋아. 눈알이 멀어버린 패스파인더는 필요치 않아. 나는 정치질은 관심 없어. 나는 모험에 관심이 있지. 맥주라도 한잔 하자고. 이야기 "
"좀 풀어보지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/MonsterGuide_Name_String
msgctxt "06fc4f04-b115-496f-8903-93f90463f1cb"
msgid ""
"\"Guide for Travelers, Hunters, and Explorers of the River Kingdoms. Volume "
"5: Monsters and Beasts.\""
msgstr "\"강의 왕국들의 여행자와 사냥꾼과 탐험가를 위한 안내서. 제 5권: 괴물\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/MonsterGuide_String
msgctxt "07601457-98fa-411e-b62b-613d0a9cee9a"
msgid ""
"\"Will-o'-wisp\n"
"An amusing glowing ball, which looks harmless and doesn't arouse any natural "
"suspicion. Pretends to be a guiding light in the marshes, but leads "
"travelers to certain death. The agonizing fear of their victims is this "
"monster's nourishing dinner. If you manage to resist their tricks, make sure "
"you have some electrical protection. The monster electrocutes any visitors "
"it fails to lure into terror.\n"
"Werewolf\n"
"Werewolves prefer to hunt in groups, and attack lone travelers. It's "
"entirely possible that a Varisian camp or troupe could turn into a pack of "
"bloodthirsty lycanthropes under cover of darkness. Ordinary weapons stand "
"little chance against them, but a silver blade greatly increases your "
"chances of survival.\n"
"Primals\n"
"Powerful creatures of the Primal realm occasionally visit this world for "
"amusement. It's best to stay out of a Primal's way. Don't fight it – it's "
"extremely dangerous. But if a life is at stake, resort to cold steel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"윌오위습\n"
"활기차게 빛나는 구체로 해가 없어 보이는 생물이다. 빛나는 빛이 숲의 사람들을 안내하는 역할을 하는 것 같지만 사지로 내몬다. 그 빛을 "
"따라가는 자들은 괴물의 밥이 된다. 그들의 속임수에 넘어가지 않아도 당신은 전기 공격에 대비해야 한다.\n"
"웨어울프\n"
"웨어울프는 무리를 지어 사냥하는 습성이 있고 홀로 다니는 자들을 공격한다. 바리시안 캠프가 사실 피를 갈망하는 라이칸스로프일 수도 있다. "
"평범한 무기는 그들에게 통하지 않지만 은으로 만든 무기는 당신의 생존률을 높여줄지 모른다.\n"
"Primals\n"
"강력한 생명채로 가끔 유희 생활을 하러 이 세계에 방문하고는 한다. 그들을 만나지 않는 것이 좋다. 그들과 싸우면 매우 위험하다. 목숨을 "
"위협받고 있다면 차가운 철을 사용해 보길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/OnGodsAndDivine_Name_String
msgctxt "cdfe5a94-fec9-433a-8ce5-0f02778b0503"
msgid "\"On the Nature of the Divine\""
msgstr "\"신성의 본질에 대하여\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/OnGodsAndDivine_String
msgctxt "c9d463fb-6ad4-4fec-b464-c53a4fbb322f"
msgid ""
"\"Can a mortal become a god? Is the very idea blasphemy? Science relies on "
"experience, where there may be evidence presented in support. But when "
"science encounters theology, it recoils. The term 'evolution' has no "
"application to the divine spark that illuminates dull matter in "
"incomprehensible ways.\n"
"The foremost example is angels, to whom we owe the existence of our virtuous "
"mortal souls, which brings us to a paradox. A mortal soul transforms into an "
"immortal essence. There are many such breathtaking events, which each "
"promise a connection to the divine. Sunny Sarenrae is perfect proof of this."
"\n"
"The Starstone trial desecrated divinity, turned it into a god's exam, where "
"any trickster with a handful of spells who can avoid some traps in a deadly "
"maze – may rise to divinity!\n"
"Is the nature of divinity, then, so sacred indeed?\""
msgstr ""
"\"인간은 신이 될 수 있을까? 말 그대로 신성모독인 걸까? 과학은 경험에 근거하고, 이를 뒷받침하는 증거가 제시될 수 있다. "
"하지만 과학과 신학이 만나면 반동이 일어난다. 진화라는 용어는 설명할 수 없는 분야를 밝히는 데 소용이 없다.\n"
"가장 좋은 예는 천사로서, 천사들은 고결한 인간 영혼의 존재에 빚을 지고 있으며, 이는 우리에게 역설을 가져다준다. 인간의 영혼은 불멸의 본질로 변한다. 놀라운 예들이 "
"많이 있는데 모두 신과 관련된 이야기들이다. 서렌레이가 가장 완벽한 증거이다.\n"
"스타스톤 시험은 신성을 모독하고, 몇 가지 주문으로 치명적인 함정을 피할 수 있는 트릭스터라면 누구나 신성에 오를 수 있는 신의 시험으로 바꿨다!\n"
"그렇다면 신성의 본질은 정말 그렇게 신성한 것일까?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ProdigalSons_Name_String
msgctxt "b21d3c49-deb2-461f-abbf-2e7b029cf96c"
msgid "\"Prodigal Sons\""
msgstr "\"탕자의 아들들\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ProdigalSons_String
msgctxt "35a7d7f9-7200-484a-a669-d15cb8d423e4"
msgid ""
"\"It's done,\" I said.\n"
"Miliken studied me with narrowed eyes.\n"
"\"You look awfully clean,\" he said. \"Where's the knife?\"\n"
"In answer, the first shouts went up from the inn.\n"
"\"Fire!\" screamed Ilna, and then other voices joined hers.\n"
"In an instant, Milikin's entrepreneurial instincts took over, and he sprang "
"for the door, tossing the crossbow aside. Outside, the roof of the inn was "
"already smoking oily black against the sunset, ﬂame licking through the "
"thatching in places. With a scream of pain, Milikin ran for the creek. I "
"looked to Phargas. Needing no further cue, we each grabbed up armfuls of "
"supplies and sprinted off in the opposite direction.\n"
"After ten minutes of leaped brambles and ducked branches, we stopped to "
"catch our breath. Back the way we'd come, the smoke was still visible, "
"though the sounds had faded to just the faint and frantic pealing of a "
"church bell.\n"
"\"That was close,\" Phargas said, leaning against a tree and breathing hard."
"\n"
"\"Agreed,\" I puffed, staring down at the cloak full of bread that now made "
"up our sole possessions. Then the sound of the bell reminded me of something."
"\n"
"\"About what you said back there,\" I asked. \"You said Shelyn. I thought "
"you were a priest of Desna?\"\n"
"Phargas grunted.\n"
"\"A man's faith is a personal thing,\" he said, tying up the cloak. \"Now "
"shut up and keep running.\"\n"
"And we did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 끝이야.\" 내가 말했다.\n"
"밀리켄이 가늘게 눈을 뜨고 나를 보았다.\n"
"\"너 정말 깨끗해 보이는데.\" 그가 말했다. \"칼은 어디에 있지?\"\n"
"그 대답으로 여관 안에서 외치는 소리가 들렸다.\n"
"\"불이야!\" 일나가 소리쳤고 그리고 다른 사람들도 소리치기 시작했다.\n"
"그 순간 밀리켄의 장난기가 발동하여 그는 문으로 뛰어들어가면서 석궁을 건내었다. 여관 지붕은 석양 너머로 이미 검은 연기를 내뿜고 있었고 "
"화염이 내부를 휩쓸고 있었다. 고통스러운 신음과 함께 밀리켄은 달렸다. 나는 파르가스를 보았다. 의심할 필요 없이 우리는 보급품을 "
"한아름씩 안고 반대 방향으로 달렸다.\n"
"십여분을 뛰고 나서 우리는 숨을 고르고 있었다. 우리가 도망친 곳에서는 여전히 연기가 보였지만 비명소리와 교회 종소리는 약해지고 있었다."
"\n"
"\"아슬아슬했어.\" 퍼가스가 나무에 기대어 말했다.\n"
"\"맞아.\" 나는 숨을 내쉬며 말했고 내 팔에는 빵이 한가득 망토에 담겨있었다. 그 순간 나는 종소리로 무언가 떠올랐다.\n"
"\"네가 아까 말한 것 말이야.\" 나는 물었다. \"셸린에 대해 말했지. 너는 데즈나의 사제라고 하지 않았어?\"\n"
"파르가스가 불평했다.\n"
"\"신앙은 사적인 거야.\" 그가 망토를 매며 말했다. \"이제 닥치고 달려.\"\n"
"우리는 달렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/RiverFreedoms_Name_String
msgctxt "53b3c967-eafc-4cc4-a75b-d579638c0af0"
msgid "\"The River Freedoms\""
msgstr "\"강 자유 연맹\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/RiverFreedoms_String
msgctxt "5a0cea99-2745-48d9-a5e9-b183863046c4"
msgid ""
"\"Say What You Will, I Live Free. No one can shut your mouth. Neither lord, "
"nor priest, nor merchant, nor bandit.\n"
"---\n"
"Oathbreakers Die. Don't swear an oath if you can't keep it. Oathbreakers "
"wash away their dishonor with their blood.\n"
"---\n"
"Walk Any Road, Float Any River. Go wherever you want. No one will stand in "
"your way or charge you.\n"
"---\n"
"Courts Are For Kings. All the rulers of the River Kingdoms are free to "
"establish the laws of their own lands, but their power ends at their "
"frontiers.\n"
"---\n"
"Slavery is an Abomination. Any slave who sets foot in the River Kingdoms is "
"emancipated immediately and forever.\n"
"---\n"
"You Have What You Hold. It's pathetic to sneak and steal. If you want it, "
"win it in a fair fight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"원하는 것을 말하고 자유롭게 살아라. 누구도 네가 말하는 것을 막지 못한다. 군주도 사제도 상인도 도적도 막지 못한다.\n"
"---\n"
"선서를 지키지 못하는 죽는다. 선서를 지키지 못한다면 맹세하지 말아라. 선서를 지키지 못하면 피로 불명예를 씻을 것이다.\n"
"---\n"
"어느 길이든 어느 강이든 가라. 원하는 곳으로 가라. 누구도 네 길을 막지 못한다.\n"
"---\n"
"법정은 왕을 위한 곳이다. 강의 왕국들의 모든 지배자들은 자신을 위한 법을 만들 수 있지만 그들의 힘은 국경에서 끝이 난다.\n"
"---\n"
"노예제는 혐오스러운 것이다. 강의 왕국들에 발을 들이는 노예는 그 순간 영원히 사라진다.\n"
"---\n"
"너의 것을 지켜라. 숨어서 훔치는 것은 한심한 짓이다. 원한다면 정정당당히 얻어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/SadisticMageBook_m_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "1c44fe61-d977-4472-8b61-6f5bca39cb7c"
msgid ""
"\"... roaring flames are devouring the Temple of Roses. The petals of the "
"flowers darken, curl up and finally turn to ash – the moment of utter pain "
"and ugliness that comes before final, serene eternity. Burning idols seem to "
"grimace, cry, laugh – and turn their fiery gazes upon me. The heat grows "
"unbearable – but I dare not turn my eyes from this sacred fire, admiring its "
"every precious moment while my eyes still serve me. Laymen will call me a "
"vandal – they'll say that I'd destroyed a priceless piece of art because I "
"hated everything beautiful. But do not believe this. I loved the temple more "
"than my life, and I lit it with the fires that burn in my heart. For can "
"there be a higher devotion than melting together with the object of your "
"admiration, into the shining splendor of oblivion?\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 포효하는 화염이 장미의 사원을 삼켰다. 꽃잎은 검어지고 꼬부라지더니 결국 재가 되었다. 고통을 겪고 결국 추해졌지만 영원히 "
"사라졌다. 우상을 태우자 그들의 눈빛이 나에게 향한다. 열기를 참을 수 없지만 나는 이 신성한 불꽃에서 눈을 때지 못하고 이 소중한 "
"순간을 보내고 있었다. 내 삶보다 사원을 더 사랑했고 이제는 그것을 내 마음 속에서 태워버렸다. 경이하던 것이 망각 속으로 빛을 내며 "
"사라지는 것보다 신성한 순간이 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/SadisticMageBook_m_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "e5639f69-975e-484f-9aef-98497540b313"
msgid "\"Temple of Roses\" by Elestin of Sinaria"
msgstr "\"장미의 사원\" 엘레스틴 시나리아 씀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/SearchForJoy_Name_String
msgctxt "fe6d38fd-5add-474e-b65b-c94217d8ebe0"
msgid "\"In Search of Joy. Confessions of a Heretic.\""
msgstr "\"기쁨을 찾아서. 이단의 고백.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/SearchForJoy_String
msgctxt "863cae02-59ae-4293-8943-1daa625b8c59"
msgid ""
"\"I take a deep breath and stand still. I long to absorb every moment of "
"joy, inhale the evaporation of someone else's soul from their thickening "
"blood. The border between reality and dream fades. It seems that everyone "
"beyond the wall can hear the throbbing in my head, but it's only my fantasy. "
"A ringing silence fills the room.\n"
"The fifth sacrifice has been made. My mistress, the most beautiful of "
"goddesses, will be happy. I will take care of everything. Fragrant flowers, "
"cut at the climax of their beauty, are now a part of the masterpiece, which "
"is worthy of Shelyn herself! So what if the narrow-minded priests rejected "
"me and my gift? I serve the Never-Fading Rose herself, not the worms that "
"bite into her stem and suck at her life-giving juices.\n"
"It won't be long now before I finish my job. I've already found the "
"material. Her eyes are grey, and hair is dark blond. She is fades into the "
"dirt. I will rewrite her destiny.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 깊은 숨을 쉬고는 서있었다. 나는 기쁨의 순간을 즐기기를 원했고 피를 흘리는 자들의 입에서 나오는 영혼을 들이쉬기를 바랐다. "
"현실과 꿈의 경계가 사라진다. 벽 너머의 모두가 내 심장 소리를 들을 거라 생각했지만 그건 내 상상일 뿐이었다. 방은 침묵이 흘렀다.\n"
"다섯번째로 희생이 시작되었다. 내 여왕님 가장 아름다우신 분이 행복해 하실 것이다. 나는 모든 것을 준비할 것이다. 내가 자른 향기로운 "
"꽃은 지금 나의 걸작이 되었고 셸린에게 바쳐질 것이다. 만약 속 좁은 사제들이 나를 쫓아내면 어떻게 할까? 나는 지지 않는 장미를 "
"숭배하지만 그녀에게 뿌리를 박고 그녀의 생명을 빨아들이는 벌레들을 섬기지는 않는다.\n"
"곧 나의 일이 끝난다. 나는 이미 그 물질을 찾았다. 그녀의 눈이 회색으로 변했고 머릿결은 검은 갈색으로 변했다. 그녀는 먼지가 되었다. "
"나는 그녀의 운명을 다시 쓸 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ShadowsOfAbsalom_Name_String
msgctxt "f64cb9b8-d531-4e2e-b734-2896295e2cb9"
msgid "\"Shadows of Absalom\" by Pax Groometra"
msgstr "\"압살롬의 그림자\" 팍스 그루메트라 씀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ShadowsOfAbsalom_String
msgctxt "12815b1c-36a2-454f-b6f4-2c8ee86b4649"
msgid ""
"\"Nwan Quant peeped through a slit in the window shutter. The visitor was "
"staggering at the porch. Nwan had promised himself many centuries ago that "
"he'd never have to deal with halflings again, after the case of the "
"Clockwork Head. Even the Bleaching is better than some adventures!\n"
"However, there was something disturbing in the visitor's appearance. "
"Something was wrong.\n"
"– What do you say, Kexy?\n"
"His assistant sat at the next window with yarn and knitting needles in her "
"hands.\n"
"– Look at his clothes. They're second-hand. He's a hobo.\n"
"– He is, but you're not quite right. Look at his feet.\n"
"Kexy looked, trying to make out at least something in faint light of the "
"lantern above the door.\n"
"– Are those... he was shackled?\n"
"Rather than answering, the gnome stepped toward the door.\n"
"– We shall need a doctor.\n"
"As if to prove his words, the guest faltered and collapsed onto the knees, "
"and fell head first onto the doorstep.\""
msgstr ""
"\"느완 콴트는 창문 틈 사이를 들여다 보았다. 방문객이 현관에서 비틀거렸다. 느완은 수세기의 사건으로 다시는 하플링과 만나지 않을 "
"거라고 다짐했다. 차라리 모험보다 백화가 나을 거라고 생각했다.\n"
"하지만 방문객의 모습을 가리는 무언가가 있었다. 무언가가 잘못 되었다.\n"
"– 어떻게 생각해. 켁시?\n"
"그의 부하가 옆에서 하품을 하며 손톱을 다듬고 있었다.\n"
"– 옷을 봐. 중고야. 거렁뱅이군.\n"
"– 맞아. 하지만 정답은 아니야. 그의 발을 보라고.\n"
"켁시는 문 위로 비치는 랜턴 빛을 통해 무언가 보려고 애썼다.\n"
"– 아... 족쇄인가?\n"
"답변 대신 노움은 문 안으로 들어간다.\n"
"– 의사가 필요해.\n"
"자신의 말을 증명하듯 손님은 비틀거리더니 무릎을 꿇고 바닥에 머리를 찧으며 쓰러졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/SwordsScribes_Name_String
msgctxt "22fce779-3cc8-46ba-bba4-75948264b6f7"
msgid "\"Chronicles of Blades\""
msgstr "\"칼의 연대기\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/SwordsScribes_String
msgctxt "3a011bac-7c15-4a00-a412-93205792d194"
msgid ""
"\"The history of Rostland is known for its many mysteries. One of them is "
"the story of Baron Sirian the First.\n"
"Sirian was a furious fighter, although not highly skilled. There were "
"malicious rumors that he fled to Rostland, to hide from the sneering public "
"after he'd lost dozens of duels in his homeland. But his new home greeted "
"him with yet more misfortune. He waged not a fistful of coins, but a whole "
"settlement in a duel with a gang chieftain – but the baron was broken again, "
"and left Rostland in shame. He dropped off the map for several long years, "
"and quiet anonymity changed him completely. Not only did he return home "
"bearing a new name, Sirian Aldori, but he had also acquired a new gift! He "
"no longer had any equal in swordfighting. Sirian challenged the chieftain "
"who had once disgraced the young baron, and slew him in the blink of an eye. "
"Afterwards he announced a reward of one hundred thousand gold coins to "
"anyone strong enough to defeat him in battle...\""
msgstr ""
"\"로스틀랜드의 역사는 많은 비밀을 가지고 있다. 그 중 하나는 남작 시리안의 이야기이다.\n"
"시리안은 실력이 좋지는 않았지만 열정적인 전사였다. 그가 고향에서 결투를 연패하고 로스틀랜드로 가서 사람들의 눈을 피하려 한다는 소문이 "
"돌았다. 그의 새로운 집은 그를 환영했지만 불운이 기다리고 있었다. 그는 도적 두목과의 결투에서 패배하고 수치스럽게 로스틀랜드를 떠나서 "
"돈도 집도 잃었다. 로스틀랜드에 돌아갈 생각은 접은 후로 더 이상 유명하지 않게 된 그는 다른 사람이 되었다. 그는 시리안 알도리라는 "
"새로운 이름을 얻었을 뿐만 아니라 실력도 늘었다. 그는 검술 결투에서 뛰어난 능력을 보였다. 시리안은 예전에 자신에게 불명예를 주었던 "
"두목에게 도전했고 눈 깜짝할 사이 그를 물리쳤다. 그 후로 그는 자신을 이기는 자에게는 금화 천냥을 주겠다고 선언한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ThousandRevolutions_Name_String
msgctxt "1deb9b9e-9ffb-463e-be17-280a8d71a46d"
msgid "\"A Thousand Revolutions\""
msgstr "\"천 번의 혁명\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ThousandRevolutions_String
msgctxt "25d729ad-14af-4c09-8d6d-07559221e74e"
msgid ""
"\"For the third night in a row, I've dreamt of the Grey Gardeners knocking "
"at my door. I cannot believe it is my turn. To be cut down by a blade washed "
"in the blood of a thousand revolutions, as a wave of popular outrage washes "
"over me, as my head tumbles down the steps of the scaffold.\n"
"We take up the sword, and by it we shall perish. Once we struck down the "
"Imperial scum, but now it is we who must face the blade... The insurgent "
"beast called Revolution will never be sated. It needs new victims. This "
"time, it's my comrades and I.\n"
"The cruelty of the hoarders in power echoes in the cruelty of the paupers, "
"now intoxicated by their own freedom. We wanted change? Well here it is. "
"This is a country now of mad fanatics, fighting their treacherous past every "
"day. Former friends are today's foes.\n"
"My workshop has been converted into a secret headquarters. If I could do it "
"all over again, I would repair to my easel and refrain from the cause that "
"has sent me down this path...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사흘 밤 연속으로, 나는 회색 원예사가 우리 집 문을 노크하는 꿈을 꾸었다. 내 차례인지 믿기지 않았다. 천 번의 혁명으로 흘려진 "
"피에 내 피가 더해질 줄은. 대중의 분노가 나에게 쏟아져 나의 머리가 단두대 아래에 굴러떨어질 줄은.\n"
"우리는 검을 꺼내어 죽고자 했다. 우리가 제국의 쓰레기를 쓰러뜨린 이후로 칼날이 우리에게 향하게 된 것이다... 혁명이라고 불리는 잔인한 "
"짐승은 절대로 만족할 줄을 모른다. 그것은 새로운 희생자를 원했다. 이번에는 나의 동지들과 내가 희생자였다.\n"
"빈민들의 목소리에서 권력의 잔혹함이 느껴졌고 이제 그들은 자신들의 자유에 중독되었다. 우리는 변화를 원했던가? 이런 변화는 원치 않았다. "
"이제 국가는 미쳐갔고 반역자들과 싸우며 하루하루가 지나고 있다. 어제의 친구가 이제는 적이 되었다.\n"
"내 일터는 비밀 기지로 바뀌었다. 내가 시간을 되돌릴 수만 있다면, 나는 다시는 이런 길을 걷지 않겠다고 다짐했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ValleyOfFire_Name_String
msgctxt "6a1e2c0c-617c-4eeb-b4de-dcbc3fd5aa3c"
msgid "\"Battle in the Valley of Fire\" by Lurus Aldori"
msgstr "\"불의 협곡에서의 전투\" 루러스 알도리 지음"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/ValleyOfFire_String
msgctxt "ef0120f9-6242-4cd8-9e79-9b06b531a87f"
msgid ""
"\"Argun was knocked flat. He laid gasping, arms spread, a lump of rage "
"rising in his throat. He remembered his dream. Black soil, red ravens in the "
"empty sky, their coarse croaks ringing in his ears, like a taunt...\n"
"Choral would never take Rostland! Never! Aldori sprang to his feet, as if "
"the blood-soaked soil was driving him forward. With a cry of rage, the "
"Swordlord rushed into the battle. The sky turned scarlet with blood, as he "
"furiously chopped off his enemies' heads. The scarlet horizon drew closer, "
"and its roar nearly drowned out the sound of battle. Argun looked to the "
"sky, and a fiery blast descended upon him. These were no ravens that circled "
"above him. The fearsome breath of the Red Dragons of Choral melted the "
"soldiers' armor and turned living flesh to ash and dust...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르군은 쓰러졌다. 그는 헐떡거렸고 거친 숨을 쉬었다. 그는 자신의 꿈을 기억했다. 검은 토양과 하늘을 나는 붉은 까마귀들, 그리고 "
"까마귀가 우는 소리...\n"
"코랄은 절대 로스틀랜드를 얻지 못할 것이다! 절대로! 피로 물든 땅이 그에게 달려들듯이 알도리는 뛰어들었다. 분노가 담긴 소리와 함께 "
"소드로드는 전투에 참전했다. 하늘은 피로 붉어졌고 그는 적들의 목을 무참히 썰었다. 먼 곳에서 붉은 무언가가 다가오고 있었고 그것들이 "
"내는 포효가 전투의 함성 소리를 집어삼켰다. 아르군은 하늘을 보았을 때 불꽃이 그를 덮쳤다. 그의 머리 위에는 더 이상 까마귀가 날지 "
"않았다. 코랄의 레드 드래곤의 브래스가 군인들의 갑옷을 녹이고 살을 재로 태우고 있었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/WhyEarthTrembles_Name_String
msgctxt "a79fc5aa-13d0-443f-8bd1-7df9a4e3d942"
msgid "\"Fairy Tales of Avistan\""
msgstr "\"아비스탄의 전설\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/Items/RegularBooks/WhyEarthTrembles_String
msgctxt "52a9e54d-490c-4c8b-8cec-24e872575328"
msgid ""
"\"A long, long time ago, in a time before remembering, there was a furious "
"god known as Rovagug, a terrible giant worm with a thousand teeth and claws. "
"He devoured every world in his path, one after another. But the great gods "
"were displeased with the beast, and delivered unto Rovagug their scourge. "
"Many laid down their feuds to combine forces: mighty Torag, brilliant "
"Sarenrae, vicious Asmodeus, crafty Calistria, cold-blooded Pharasma, and "
"many, many others. Together, they faced Rovagug as he arrived to swallow "
"Golarion.\n"
"The Goddess of the Sun, Sarenrae, forbade Rovagug's death, and so the gods "
"imprisoned the fiend deep in the ground, shackled and sleeping. Asmodeus "
"himself would keep the keys to his bonds. The terrible monster remains there "
"still, asleep in his prison. Whenever Rovagug rolls over in his sleep and "
"scratches his back against his prison walls, the earth trembles, and "
"volcanoes spit fire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아주 오래전. 역사가 시작되기 전, 로바거그라 불리는 분노의 신이 있었다. 날카로운 이빨 수천 개가 난 이 무시무시한 거대 벌레는 "
"눈에 띄는 세계는 모조리 집어삼켰지. 위대한 신들은 그런 로바거그의 행보가 마음에 들지 않았다. 신들은 로바거그에게 벌을 내리기 위해 "
"힘을 합쳤지. 토라그와 서렌레이, 아스모데우스, 칼리스트리아, 파라즈마 등 많은 신이 참여했다. 로바거그가 막 골라리온을 삼키려는 순간, "
"신들이 그 자리에 나타났다.\n"
"태양의 신 서렌레이는 로바거그의 죽음을 원치 않았고, 괴물을 잠재워 깊은 지하에 있는 감옥에 가둬 놓았다. 아스모데우스가 감옥의 열쇠를 "
"가지고 있지. 그 끔찍한 괴물은 아직도 감옥에서 잠들어 있다. 지진이 나고 화산이 분화하는 이유는, 바로 로바거그가 잠꼬대로 감옥에 "
"몸체를 부딪히기 때문이라고 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLNAtrisan_String
msgctxt "7837a5ff-597d-4788-aa3b-655bcd654c83"
msgid ""
"\"How am I supposed to work without a forge? Build me a forge – then we'll "
"talk!\""
msgstr "\"대장간도 없이 어떻게 일을 합니까? 대장간을 만들어 주십시오. 얘기는 그 다음에 합시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan_String
msgctxt "2cce5700-2820-42ab-a220-f1a8ae8a41fd"
msgid ""
"\"And where exactly do you expect me to work? Right here, on the ground, out "
"in the open? First provide me with a forge, then you can demand results!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데 내가 정확히 어디서 일하기를 바라는 겁니까? 여기, 맨 땅, 노상에서? 제 물건을 원하신다면, 먼저 대장간을 제공해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG_String
msgctxt "0e5e5f43-3eff-40ca-829f-5606593078c1"
msgid "\"But... How can I work without a workshop? Please build one for me!\""
msgstr "\"하지만... 공방도 없이 어떻게 일을 합니까? 제가 쓰게 하나 지어주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/GnomeFemale_JewelcrafterCN_String
msgctxt "1d87960b-7779-483b-9c61-eaab21237fed"
msgid ""
"\"What do you expect me to do without a workshop? How amusing! Give me a "
"place to do my work, then we'll talk!\""
msgstr "\"공방 없이 내가 뭘 했으면 좋겠어요? 참 재밌네요! 제가 일을 할 장소를 주세요, 그 다음에 얘기하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/HalfElfFemaleLeatherworkerLG_Artisan_String
msgctxt "64d6dbbf-b936-4355-94cd-cb9bb14f037f"
msgid ""
"\"Say what you will, but I can't produce anything without a workshop. Build "
"one for me, and then I'll get to work!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고 하실지야 자유지만, 공방이 없으면 제가 뭘 만들어낼 수가 없어요. 하나 만들어 주시면, 바로 일하러 가죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/HalfElfMaleTailorNG_String
msgctxt "f6bf293d-7d54-46ef-a79e-3e8449028c49"
msgid ""
"\"A thousand apologies, but there's absolutely nothing I can do without a "
"workshop! Please, have one built for me. – Rest assured, the expense won't "
"be wasted!\""
msgstr ""
"\"송구스럽습니다만, 공방이 없으면 제가 할 수 있는 일이 없습니다! 부디 제 공방 좀 지어 주십시오. 헛돈 쓸 걱정은 안하셔도 됩니다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/HalfOrcMaleEnforcerCE_String
msgctxt "34bd458c-cd13-44ad-a89e-ee0eb313f625"
msgid ""
"\"No place to work, no place to sleep... What should I do – live in a forest "
"under a bush? {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, "
"please, build me a workshop. – I promise I'll return the favor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"일할 곳도 없고, 잘 곳도 없고... 어째야겠소. 뭐 숲 속 덤불에서 사나? {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 부탁이오, 공방 하나 "
"지어 주쇼. 내 반드시 보답해드리지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/HalflingFemale_ShadytraderNE_String
msgctxt "83ce7146-140d-474d-ba0d-42c933ba4eff"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, but "
"it's not very easy to do this sort of business out in the open. I need some "
"kind of office – even a small one would do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"죄송해요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 이런 장사는 공공연히 하기가 그리 쉽지가 않답니다. 제겐 뭔가 사무실이 필요해요. 작은 "
"거라도요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/Barks_NoWorkshop/HumanFemaleExoticSmith_String
msgctxt "ce7a9692-4329-482c-a4d7-b74505463841"
msgid ""
"\"Just like a garden cannot flourish on dry rocks, an artisan's talent "
"yields no fruit without a workshop...\""
msgstr "\"건조한 바윗더미에서 정원이 피어날 수 없듯이, 장인의 재능은 공방이 없으면 그 결실을 맺지 못하는 법...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Barks/KerganCapitulation_String
msgctxt "f1dc5ebb-d772-4f59-b118-b1cc66a7057b"
msgid ""
"\"Stop! I give up! Here's your piece of iron. Please, can I go to prison now?"
"\""
msgstr "\"그만! 항복할게요! 여기 조각을 받아요. 그냥 날 감옥으로 보내주면 안되나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Barks/TradingBlackmarketer_String
msgctxt "d1557659-a89b-4324-9810-f7500b329087"
msgid ""
"\"That's none of my concern. It looks broken. Can't give you a coin more.\""
msgstr "\"내 알 바 아니야. 부서진 것 같군. 땡전 한 푼도 더 못 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Barks/TradingKergan_String
msgctxt "016f8e01-28fc-4763-a929-d88de9ddfc9f"
msgid ""
"\"That's a ridiculously low price for a piece like this! It's dwarven made, "
"you know! My grandfather used to wear it!\""
msgstr "\"이 물건에 그런 헐값을 부르다니 어처구니가 없군! 이건 드워프제 물건이야, 내 할아버지가 쓰던 거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "af225d23-cb28-4ef7-8a29-2c648bf833fd"
msgid "\"I'm returning the armor to you. You may finish your work.\""
msgstr "\"이 갑옷을 돌려주겠어. 하던 일을 마무리 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "22c05843-f4c0-42f4-a538-6eec1ab27406"
msgid "\"Kergan told me your family didn't treat him very well.\""
msgstr "\"케르간이 말하길 가족들에게 부당한 대우를 받았다던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f5cea330-3110-464a-81a9-9668082b756a"
msgid "Exiled Dragn for riding roughshod over his brother."
msgstr "형제에게 난폭하게 군 혐의로 드란을 쫓아냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "836363f9-e2ec-405c-ab74-a0ae6445c8e0"
msgid "\"You're a tyrant, lording over your brother. Go away.\""
msgstr "\"이런 폭군같으니, 동생은 네 노예가 아니야. 꺼져라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "b0f660d7-b8e5-405c-8596-8db29dd5751d"
msgid "\"This is your private family matter. I won't interfere.\""
msgstr "\"이건 너희 가족 문제야. 나는 상관하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "5a809316-07e3-4389-9a23-6c00a873f2b5"
msgid "\"Who robbed you?\""
msgstr "\"강도가 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "cb1252ed-7d18-4c0a-9dca-7a05f7a43e3e"
msgid "\"I recovered your grandfather's armor. You can take it.\""
msgstr "\"네 할아버지의 갑옷을 되찾았어. 자, 가져가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f4db1fb3-24b9-4f35-b807-3bb953ccf750"
msgid "\"Remind me where I can find the merchants who might have your armor.\""
msgstr "\"네 갑옷을 가지고 있는 상인들을 어디서 찾을 수있는지 다시 알려줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "7b502fa3-28de-4b1e-9d46-ff8b0936ba4f"
msgid ""
"\"So tell me about that idea you had about a family relic and a masterpiece…"
"\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이제 가보와 걸작에 생각해 뒀다던게 뭔지 들어보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a4cd4c45-dd80-4930-b2eb-552a2af4eedf"
msgid "\"I want to know more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 더 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "38ba1128-e98a-455a-a80c-e014eb91ea43"
msgid "\"I'm in a hurry. We'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야겠어. 다음에 얘기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "b70f60dc-4a98-44bd-bc0d-95f9d89d540a"
msgid "\"What has led you to these lands?\""
msgstr "\"이 땅에 온 이유는 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "26720154-d4e1-4e18-a256-0fe5caa1abdb"
msgid "\"Tell me about your craft.\""
msgstr "\"네 재주에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "7bdc175a-e834-4f0a-9499-92bc1b4c6fb3"
msgid "\"Tell me about your family.\""
msgstr "\"네 가족에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "905320b7-e371-4f8b-8088-358295dafbac"
msgid "\"We'll discuss this later.\""
msgstr "\"다음에 다시 이야기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "9a468880-cf40-47f3-884c-3eec85df9831"
msgid "\"Do you like it in my lands?\""
msgstr "\"내 땅은 마음에 드나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "7c4349ab-dded-482b-ae65-a5b446b0ede5"
msgid ""
"\"Kergan wants me to tell you that he doesn't give a damn about you and your "
"hammers.\""
msgstr "\"케르간이 네 망치들고 그냥 꺼지라고 전해달라던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0044_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cbc7ec0c-d866-4b1e-969c-ce4b44630eff"
msgid "Supported Dragn in the quarrel with his brother."
msgstr "형제간의 다툼에서 드란의 편을 들어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "0409c1fe-6e02-4757-8af5-c45908c76298"
msgid "\"I agree with you.\""
msgstr "\"네 말에 동의해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "01b37c63-08e7-42ec-8cbe-a880e40aee56"
msgid "\"Your brother is dead. Here's your armor.\""
msgstr "\"네 형제는 죽었다. 네 갑옷은 여기 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f7e347ce-a487-4ade-a54e-54fb7ff57ade"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings! As you see, I've already set up shop! Took a lot of work, of "
"course, but now I've got a nice place – no worse than the guild's smithy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까! 보다시피 이렇게 가게를 열었습니다! 손이 많이 가긴 했지만, 덕분에 꽤 괜찮게 만들었죠. 길드의 대장간에 비해도 손색이 "
"없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "4f1d43ae-fbe2-463b-a6b8-63ea3993574b"
msgid "\"Greetings! Glad to see you in my shop again. How can I serve you?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까! 제 가게에 다시 와줘 기쁩니다. 도와드릴꺼라도 있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b82343a1-6df9-4781-a331-ec93a3cdba62"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn puffs out his chest and lifts up his chin.{/n} \"Well that's rather "
"unfair! So what if I frowned on him traveling to foreign lands? What good "
"did it bring him, anyway? He's got no family, no hearth, no name! He could "
"have been an honest master craftsman, but instead he frittered everything "
"away! Why didn't I want to let him throw his life away? Because I cared.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란이 가슴을 펴고 턱을 치켜듭니다.{/n} \"완전히 자기 할 말만 했구만! 집 나가 저 멀리 간다길래 한소리 한게 뭐 어떻다는 "
"겁니까? 그래서 걔한테 좋을 게 뭐가 있겠어요? 가족도, 가정도, 가문도 없이! 그놈은 정직한 장인이 될 수도 있었는데 그걸 다 "
"날려버린겁니다! 난 그 녀석이 인생을 내다버리겠다는 걸 말렸을 뿐이에요. 그놈을 걱정했으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "f7bd31c5-4c03-49fc-be68-8950ec447967"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn grunts and looks at you with distrust.{/n} \"So that's how it is... "
"I'm a tyrant, eh? My brother's quite the talker if he's managed to persuade "
"you, of all people. I thought you would understand. You know the burden of "
"responsibility. For the people, for the land. But you're falling for this! A "
"tyrant! I'm an honest craftsman! He's a rascal, a vagabond, and a thief! "
"Decide for yourself if he should have listened to me or not. I'll leave if "
"that's what you want. Thanks for the hospitality. Fare thee well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란은 불평하고는 못 믿겠다는 듯 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그래, 그러니까... 제가 폭군이라고요? 내 형제 녀석이 당신을 어떻게 "
"구워 삶았는지, 하여튼 대단한 재담꾼 나셨군. 난 당신이 이해할 거라고 생각했습니다. 책임감의 무게를 당신도 잘 알테니. 백성들에 대해, "
"이 땅에 대해. 근데 그놈 말에 넘어갔다구요? 폭군!? 저는 정직한 대장장이일 뿐입니다! 그 녀석은 떠돌이에 도둑이고요! 걔가 내 말을 "
"들었어야 했는지 아닌지 한번 잘 따져 보십시오. 내가 떠나길 바란다면 떠나겠습니다. 이런 환대에 몸 둘 바를 모르겠군요. 그럼 이만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "83d3babd-ef61-48b0-b268-09dd993cc9c2"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn calms down slowly.{/n} \"Is that so? I was trying to set him "
"straight! What a thankless wretch. He betrayed me. How can you trust anyone "
"at all when your own brother is playing dirty tricks on you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란은 천천히 진정합니다.{/n} \"그래요? 저는 그를 올바른 길로 가게 하려던 것 뿐입니다! 정말 배은망덕한 녀석이군. 나를 "
"배신하다니. 친형제에게 이런 개수작을 당하면 세상에 대체 누굴 믿어야 한단 말입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "2b618d7d-bc36-4c98-9991-8275809be37f"
msgid ""
"\"I have no idea. The thieves must have found out what treasure I kept in my "
"workshop, and now it's been stolen. Haven't even had the time to finish the "
"job. Fools! Speaking of which, have you visited the {g|Thorn River}Thorn "
"River{/g} yet? What if the armor is still there? Do you think they've had a "
"chance to pawn it off yet?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠습니다. 공방에 뒀었는데 아무래도 공방에 도둑이 들었나 봅니다. 아직 제대로 손도 못 댄 건데. 멍청이들! 그러고보니 {g|"
"Thorn River}가시 강{/g}은 가봤습니까? 갑옷이 아직 거기에 있을지도 모르잖아요. 아니면 벌써 전당포로 넘어갔다고 보십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "418e84a9-1683-4d26-b24d-49780d8079cf"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn smiles happily, but freezes as he sees the armor.{/n} \"Oh damn... "
"Kergan, you scoundrel! Ruining perfectly good armor! I gather he couldn't "
"find a buyer for the whole thing, so he decided to sell it off piece by "
"piece! Ugh, that'll be a lot of repairs! It'll take forever!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}싱글 벙글하던 드란이 갑옷보자마자 얼어붙었습니다.{/n} \"오. 젠장... 케르간. 이 개자식! 이 완벽한 갑옷을 망가뜨렸어! 살 "
"사람을 찾지 못해서 조각내어 팔려고 했나보군! 으윽, 고칠 부분이 너무 많아! 이걸 언제 다 고치란 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "4202fa1f-d2ea-485a-b13e-d883eb7b0173"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn's face clouds over.{/n} \"Here's the story. Our family used to have "
"a suit of plate armor named Onslaught. My grandfather wore it to perform "
"many heroic deeds. What a great dwarf he was! But it's been stolen. – By my "
"own brother Kergan! And then Kergan fled. Onslaught has been on my mind ever "
"since. I'd intended to bring the relic back to the clan and restore my good "
"name.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란의 얼굴에 그림자가 드리워집니다.{/n} \"이야기는 이렇습니다. 우리 가족은 '맹격'이라는 이름의 판금갑옷 한벌을 가지고 "
"있었지요. 내 할아버지가 이 갑옷과 함께 많은 업적을 달성하셨습니다. 그분은 정말 대단한 드워프였어요! 하지만 도둑을 맞고 말았습니다. "
"내 친형제 케르간에게 말이죠! 케르간은 그러고 도망갔습니다. 그때부터 '맹격'이 계속 마음에 걸립니다. 나는 원래 그 유물을 가문에 "
"되돌려주고 내 평판을 되돌릴 생각이었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "0a58f2c9-23f4-4bd9-a193-a14232a6beb6"
msgid ""
"\"It turns out, three local merchants have the three parts of the armor. "
"They're like vultures pulling apart a corpse... They buy whatever catches "
"their eye, not caring whether it's stolen or not. One merchant seems to be "
"in the capital. Another was staying at some trading post. It's got an owner "
"with a strange name... The third one always prowls in distant corners, "
"looking to buy valuables on the cheap. I believe he has an acquaintance – "
"Huntress Dumra. She might well have it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알아보니, 지역 상인 세 명이 갑옷의 세 부분을 가지고 있다고 합니다. 시체를 쪼아 먹는 독수리 같은 놈들, 장물이든 뭐든 눈에 띄는 "
"건 전부 사들이니 원... 한 명은 수도에 있는 모양이에요. 다른 한 명은 어떤 교역소에 머물고 있고. 그곳 주인 이름이 정말 "
"이상하던데... 세 번째 상인은 비싼 귀중품을 싸게 산다고 어디 골목 귀퉁이에서 어슬렁거리고 있다고 합니다. 분명 사냥꾼 덤라와 면식이 "
"있을 거예요. 아예 갑옷을 가지고 있을지도 모르고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "09a1e0b5-11ad-4d64-979c-b20cbb156ed8"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn's cheeks turn beet red, and he says softly,{/n} \"Why, it's an "
"honor to indulge your interest. What would you care to know?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란은 뺨을 붉히고는 당신에게 정중하게 말합니다.{/n} \"그, 제가 당신의 흥미를 끌었다니 정말 영광입니다. 무엇을 알고 "
"싶으십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "7cc9a1d5-fdc3-4be2-85ec-7b85f8748a97"
msgid "{n}The dwarf nods gravely.{/n} \"Of course.\""
msgstr "{n}드워프는 진지하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"물론입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "ee27ea2c-e29c-487e-aed1-beec649bb9f6"
msgid ""
"\"Woradash is a decent, respectable clan. We're considered especially "
"honored, standing out even from among the other clan families. My "
"grandfather accomplished many feats in his time, and my father won respect "
"and honor in many battles. I'm trying hard to be worthy of this legacy. "
"Especially since I'm carrying the load for two.\" {n}Dragn's face turns "
"grim.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"보라다시는 지체높고 명망있는 가문입니다. 명가들 사이에서도 손꼽히고 있지요. 할아버지는 그분 시대에 많은 업적을 이루셨고, 아버지는 "
"많은 전투에서 존경과 명예를 얻으셨습니다. 저 역시 이 유산에 걸맞는 사람이 되기 위해 열심히 노력하고 있지요. 특히 두 사람 몫의 짐을 "
"짊어진 이후로는 더욱 .\" {n}드란이 침울한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "9fee1dc4-d131-40f0-bce0-eb162593eef0"
msgid ""
"\"Our people are masters of making armor and weapons, everyone knows that. "
"We can equip a fighter so that he can fight for hours without getting tired "
"or suffering any wounds. Many have tried to copy our designs and methods, "
"but they're just imitators who don't understand the intricacies of the craft."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 종족은 갑옷과 무기를 만드는 장인입니다.. 누구나 아는 사실이지요. 우리의 장비로 무장한 전사는 수시간을 지치지도 않고 생채기도 "
"없이 싸울 수 있습니다. 많은 이들이 우리의 구상과 방법을 모방하려고 했지만, 대장일의 오묘함을 이해하지 못한 채 그저 흉내만 낼 "
"뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "e3437c02-2dc2-4917-a2fd-905adcc2921a"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn's face grows grim.{/n} \"That's a bad story. My clan has always "
"been proud of its strong blood. My grandfather was a legend, my father was a "
"worthy master, and I, I dare to hope, haven't failed my family. But my "
"brother, Kergan – he's always been a scallywag. Always running off "
"somewhere, looking for trouble... Soon after he came of age he did something "
"terrible. – He stole a clan relic, the armor of my respected grandfather, "
"and took off!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란의 얼굴이 침울해집니다.{/n} \"별로 좋은 이야기는 아닙니다. 우리 가문은 항상 강한 혈통을 자랑스러워 했지요. 우리 "
"할아버지는 전설적인 장인이셨고 우리 아버지도 꽤 뛰어난 편이었습니다. 그리고 저는, 저도 역시 그렇게 되길 원했지요. 가족의 이름에 "
"먹칠을 할 정도는 아니었습니다. 하지만 내 형제 케르간은 항상 골칫거리였습니다. 항상 도망치고 사고를 치고... 성인이 되고 얼마 안 "
"가서 결국 끔찍한 일을 저질렀어요. 존경하는 할아버지의 갑옷, 우리 가문의 가보를 훔쳐 달아났습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "a9ea1860-97d4-41e2-af22-e084f59d3038"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! Oh, thank you! For the armor – and for fixing my brother's "
"head. No one else could do it. It's all right, he can stay in prison for a "
"while. It'll give him time to think, and then I'll bail him out and put him "
"to work. Labor will turn the wretch into a man. I have a major armor-repair "
"job ahead! I came up with some new features for it, but I can't let the "
"secrets slip yet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다! 정말 감사합니다! 갑옷은 물론이고 내 형제의 버릇까지 고쳐주다니. 이런 일은 누구도 하지 못 했을 겁니다. 그놈은 한동안 "
"감옥에 있는게 좋겠어요. 감옥에서 머리가 좀 식으면 일을 시킬 생각입니다. 노동은 쓰레기를 인간으로 만드니까. 저는 우선 갑옷부터 고쳐야 "
"겠습니다! 갑옷의 모양을 좀 바꿀 생각인데 자세한 건 아직 비밀로 하겠습니다!\"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "6c8b92f2-ec22-4054-a248-21f4a3c7621e"
msgid ""
"\"It was a disgrace. Everyone looked at me like I was the bad seed – because "
"I was the brother of the one who laughed at tradition and desecrated the "
"glory of our family! Eventually I decided I'd had enough. I packed up my "
"things and left the house, looking for a new place – where people wouldn't "
"always be looking at me and whispering. That's how I ended up here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"치욕이었죠. 모든 사람들이 나를 불량한 후손으로 여겼습니다. 바로 내가, 전통을 비웃고 우리 가족의 영광을 더럽힌 자의 형제였기 "
"때문에! 참을 만큼 참았지만 결국엔 결단을 내렸습니다. 짐을 싸서 집을 나갔고, 사람들이 날 보고 수군대지 않을 장소를 찾아다녔지요. "
"그렇게 해서 여기까지 오게 된겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "536758c4-47b6-4cef-98f8-6f552e2b21e7"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn looks discontented, stroking his beard.{/n} \"Well, what can I "
"say... There's quite a lot of troublemakers here. And the ones who get "
"called honorable, aren't exemplary law-abiding citizens. I guess it's what "
"lands like these do to people.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란은 불만스러운 듯 수염을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} \"글쎄, 뭐라고 해야 할까... 여기엔 사고뭉치들이 꽤 많습니다. 그리고 "
"이곳에서 명예롭다고 불리는 자들을 보면, 준법 시민이라 할만한 사람은 아니더군요. 제 생각엔 이 땅 자체가 사람들에게 영향을 주는 것 "
"같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "94436ae7-d1ba-4ed7-ae84-cb4242812b76"
msgid ""
"\"After you hired me, one merchant told me he saw some fragments of armor "
"that looked like Onslaught. Kergan is such a fool! He couldn't find a buyer "
"for the whole suit – it's too valuable. So he pawned it off piece by piece. "
"Someone got the jambarts, another got the gauntlets, a third got the "
"cuirass. A fine set of armor turned into a pile of junk... fancy junk. See "
"if you can find my grandfather's armor, and bring it back. I promise I will "
"repay you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 당신에게 고용되고 난 후, 어떤 장사꾼이 '맹격'처럼 생긴 갑옷 조각을 보았다고 말해주더군요. 케르간 이 멍청한 녀석! 그놈은 "
"전신 갑옷 전체를 사려는 구매자를 찾지 못했던 겁니다. 너무 비싸니까. 그래서 그걸 전당포에 가서 하나하나씩 팔았던 거지요. 누구는 무릎 "
"보호대, 누구는 건틀렛, 또 누구는 흉갑을 가지고 있을겁니다. 갑옷 한벌이 쓰레기 더미가 됐어요.. 값비싼 쓰레기로 말입니다. 내 "
"할아버지의 갑옷을 보게된다면 꼭 가져다 주십시오. 꼭 보상해드리겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "0cf7f03c-97e3-43b8-b804-6c6657f449c9"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn's face turns scarlet.{/n} \"You saw him? And you let him go?! Did "
"you believe his slanderous lies about me torturing him? I was teaching him! –"
" Caring for him! You see, he thought he'd be a hero. Now he's nothing but a "
"poor beggar, a traitor, a disgrace to his name! Stealing from the family! "
"Twice! So, you set him free. I trusted you. I thought you would keep your "
"promise. Ah, to hell with it! I'm not touching a hammer again in my life!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란의 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"놈을 봤는데 그걸 그냥 보내줬다고요?! 내가 놈을 고문했다는 거짓부렁을 믿었단 말입니까? 그건 "
"가르침이었어요! 돌봄이었고! 그래, 그놈은 자기가 영웅이 될 거라고 생각하나본데 그 녀석은 거지에 배신자에 가문의 명예를 더럽힌 놈일 "
"뿐입니다! 가문의 물건을 두번이나 훔치고! 그런데 당신이 그를 풀어줬어요. 저는 당신을 믿었습니다. 약속을 지킬거라 믿었단 말입니다. "
"제기랄! 내 평생 다시는 망치를 잡나 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "79fb9a6e-a8be-4313-9291-982f52c19673"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad you understand. It's all freedom and liberty, and only the likes "
"of you and I are left to safeguard order, and the future. I'm telling you, "
"there will be talks about honesty later! As if they ever worried about "
"honesty while stealing from the decent folk!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해해주시다니 고맙습니다. 이제야 자유와 권리가 바로 섰네요. 질서와 미래를 지키는 자는 당신과 저뿐인 듯 합니다. 장담컨데, 이 "
"정직함에 대한 미담이 널리 퍼질 겁니다! 선량한 사람한테서 물건을 훔치는 놈들도 정직에 대해 떠드는 건 좋아하니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "227a5f06-9356-4085-b2e9-40a1e2b19be1"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn takes his eyes from the armor and looks up at you, overwhelmed.{/n} "
"\"Dead? Is he? Oh, I knew this would end badly... I knew it, and I didn't do "
"a thing to prevent it.\" {n}Dragn grabs the armor and inspects it with a "
"look of indifference.{/n} \"So, that's how it is. Perished for nothing, for "
"a piece of iron...\" {n}Dwarf stays silent for a few seconds and sighs.{/n} "
"\"Thanks for bringing it back all the same. It's just that... I don't think "
"I ought to restore the armor. It's brought such bad luck to the family.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란은 갑옷을 보다 당신을 올려다 봅니다.{/n} \"죽었다고요? 그가? 오. 결국 이렇게 될 줄 알았어... 알면서도 그걸 내버려 "
"두다니.\" {n}드란은 갑옷을 쥐고는 흠이 없나 봅니다.{/n} \"그렇게 된 것이군. 이 쇳조각이 뭐라고 목숨을 버려...\" {n}"
"드워프는 말 없이 침묵하다가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"그래도 돌려줘서 감사합니다. 근데... 갑옷을 복원하고 싶은 마음이 들지 않네요. "
"이 갑옷은 가족들에게 불행을 가져다 줬습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/DvarveMaleArmorsmithArtisan/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "0ad41869-a655-4db7-8fc5-1d7d883d1637"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you very much for the armor! I hope the thieves got what they "
"deserved. That'll teach them to steal from honest people. Now it's time I "
"get down to work. I have a major armor-repair job ahead! I came up with some "
"new features for it, but I can't let the secrets slip yet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"갑옷을 되찾아주어 감사드립니다! 그 도둑놈이 죗값을 치뤄야 해요. 도둑질을 하면 어떻게 되는지 배워야지요. 이제 가서 일할 "
"시간이네요. 당장 갑옷부터 고치겠습니다! 갑옷의 모양을 좀 바꿀 생각인데 자세한 건 아직 비밀로 해둘게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/ArmorOfOathkeeper_Description_String
msgctxt "3f09cde4-b5b2-44ca-8ebe-804c8fe23ba1"
msgid "Glorious armor that once belonged to a great dwarven hero."
msgstr "한 때 위대한 드워프 영웅이 입던 화려한 갑옷입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/ArmorOfOathkeeper_String
msgctxt "99081c2f-93f7-413b-a2fb-06c8e96fa2f2"
msgid "Onslaught"
msgstr "맹격"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/Bracers_Oathkeeper_Description_String
msgctxt "ab9eee3a-9684-4317-9fbc-1eaf640c7410"
msgid "Gauntlets, formerly part of the Onslaught armor."
msgstr "갑옷 맹격의 일부였던 건틀렛입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/Bracers_Oathkeeper_String
msgctxt "907d58d8-d65a-4bc4-8829-3b689c0507c5"
msgid "Onslaught Gauntlets"
msgstr "맹격 건틀렛"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/Cuirass_Oathkeeper_Description_String
msgctxt "2d6a7cbc-f76b-4ea8-a1ee-fdbd8b1e4beb"
msgid "A cuirass, formerly part of the Onslaught armor."
msgstr "갑옷 맹격의 일부였던 흉갑입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/Cuirass_Oathkeeper_String
msgctxt "897efdc8-c2b3-430b-a30a-a1e14c21ee9c"
msgid "Onslaught Cuirass"
msgstr "맹격의 흉갑"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/Greaves_Oathkeeper_Description_String
msgctxt "80e5eec0-fd58-4d2d-b6ea-37ffc492acbb"
msgid "Jambarts, formerly part of the Onslaught armor."
msgstr "갑옷 맹격의 일부였던 갑옷 바지입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/Greaves_Oathkeeper_String
msgctxt "43fe19d2-0755-4267-b9a0-071d37150133"
msgid "Onslaught Jambarts"
msgstr "맹격 갑옷 바지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/UncompletedArmorOfOathkeeper_Description_String
msgctxt "06f914ed-cdba-4ca5-96fa-ade4bb1ca2bd"
msgid ""
"A glorious set of armor, which once belonged to a great dwarven hero, and "
"was later disassembled by his descendant."
msgstr "한 때 위대한 드워프 영웅이 입던 화려한 갑옷 세트였지만 한 후손이 조각내었던 물건입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Items/UncompletedArmorOfOathkeeper_String
msgctxt "03ec4d91-816b-476d-80e8-fa94db793f4b"
msgid "Incomplete Onslaught Armor"
msgstr "불완전한 맹격 갑옷"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "acbc0f67-d69b-457d-9ac1-df21d0360020"
msgid "Agreed to pay compensation to Dragn the dwarf."
msgstr "드워프 드란에게 보상해주기로 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ee0b5150-99c9-4dbe-a7c9-3fe5298883a5"
msgid "\"Fine, I will do as you ask.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 요청한 대로 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b97bc27c-4760-4232-b9e9-c51e35f3b838"
msgid "Ordered Dragn the dwarf to be executed for his bold attitude."
msgstr "무례한 태도를 보인 드란을 처형하라고 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ff677617-53f4-4283-a450-e9ff373cf78e"
msgid "\"You think you can demand something from me? Hang him.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 그런걸 요구할 수 있을꺼라 생각했나보군. 저 놈을 교수대로 보내라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2ba41038-eabc-4cb1-8740-7e10629aba7f"
msgid "\"You get nothing from me. Leave at once.\""
msgstr "\"내게서 단 한푼도 얻지못할 것이다. 즉시 떠나도록\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "eb1c4b84-31fd-491a-8e14-a006c1fed020"
msgid "\"Thank you for your gift.\""
msgstr "\"선물 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "828f2e66-6979-41c0-b996-65f1cf458bb9"
msgid "\"I need something from you.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 원하는 게 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "05faccd5-f848-452b-8175-fdcf77fa68e2"
msgid "\"Leave my lands.\""
msgstr "\"내 땅을 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "97bf57bf-a25d-49be-8867-1bf9c93ed818"
msgid ""
"\"Put everything else aside and get to repairing your grandfather's armor!\""
msgstr "\"다른 건 제쳐두고 네 할아버지의 갑옷부터 고치도록!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "77ba1827-32cf-4f86-8465-b86a502dff9b"
msgid "\"I think you know best what to make.\""
msgstr "\"무얼 만들어야 할지 잘 알고 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "8c0e0594-2f08-4015-a27b-db24a22914d4"
msgid "\"A one-handed hammer.\""
msgstr "\"한손 망치.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "5e39af15-01d8-458c-8fc9-2cfcfd3859e8"
msgid "\"A one-handed axe.\""
msgstr "\"한손 도끼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "110e8bae-962e-4cda-898d-b7b4268fa465"
msgid "\"A crossbow.\""
msgstr "\"쇠뇌.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "d589fc57-25bb-4801-8710-926daaf711a3"
msgid "\"A metal shield.\""
msgstr "\"쇠방패.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "9677c228-be23-4bbb-9d60-d3414601ee2c"
msgid "\"Plate armor.\""
msgstr "\"판금 갑옷.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "a285fa89-4268-4198-b6e5-0d371ec16091"
msgid "\"Make something in the dwarvish style.\""
msgstr "\"드워프식 물건을 만들어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d095c7f6-a721-494e-a881-4dd19f5d0fcc"
msgid "Got rid of Dragn the dwarf with using bureaucratic procrastination."
msgstr "드워프 드란을 관료주의적 행정지연으로 내쫓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "d453a431-9eb2-4646-ba93-da6c04378119"
msgid ""
"My advisors will check your calculations. To the digit. Unfortunately, they "
"already have a great deal to do as it is, so the gods only know when they'll "
"have time to look at your petition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 보좌관들이 네 계산을 확인하겠다. 숫자 하나하나까지. 안타깝게도 내 조언자들은 이미 중요한 일이 산더미인터라, 언제 네 청원을 "
"살펴볼지는... 오직 신만이 아실꺼야 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "b0f82646-e594-4212-b464-11921e458010"
msgid "\"Remind me, who you are and what are you working on?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구고 어떤 일을 하는지 다시 알려줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4e478d55-3a42-45c0-bca7-555514e0ef57"
msgid ""
"{n}A young dwarf in worn-out clothes shows you a scroll of fine paper with "
"an expensive seal. He speaks ceremoniously, like a herald.{/n} \"Greetings. "
"My name is Dragn Woradash. I come to you, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your "
"Highness|Your Highness} with a request. Or to be precise, to receive "
"compensation.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}낡아빠진 옷을 입은 한 젊은 드워프가 당신에게 값비싼 봉인이 되어있는 고급 종이 스크롤을 보입니다. 그는 마치 전령처럼 격식을 차려 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까. 나는 드란 보라다시라고 합니다. 한 가지 요청을 하기위해 {mf|남작님께|남작님께|전하께|전하께} "
"찾아 왔습니다. 정확히는 보상을 받으러 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "39cb295e-9d18-4bf6-8849-80292f167949"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf blinks several times, surprised.{/n} \"You agree? Just like... "
"like that? Seriously... I never thought I'd meet, in this land of thieves, a "
"ruler who so honored the law. You are a truly a worthy ruler. Well, then, I "
"guess we'll meet when you satisfy my petition. My respects!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 깜짝 놀라 눈을 여러번 깜빡입니다.{/n} \"정말이십니까? 그렇게 쉽게...? 정말이지...이 도둑맞은 땅에서 이렇게 "
"법을 존중하는 통치자를 만나게 될 줄은 몰랐습니다. 당신은 진정한 통치자입니다. 그럼, 보상을 다 받게되면 그때 다시 뵙겠습니다. 경의를 "
"표합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "ec1db9ee-2543-4695-a9af-8a0728f20cea"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf's face twists in a mix of fear and anger.{/n} \"For pity's "
"sake, for what?! This is lawlessness! Outrage!\""
msgstr "{n}드워프의 얼굴은 공포와 분노가 섞여 일그러집니다.{/n} \"맙소사. 뭐요? 이건 불법입니다! 선을 넘었어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "3996a46b-8e42-4fa9-b68a-37955e258397"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf sniffs.{/n} \"I knew I was never going to find justice here. "
"There's nothing but thieves and robbers around these parts. If you're not "
"holding on to it tightly enough, it's as good as gone!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프가 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"여기서 절대 정의를 찾을 수는 없을 거란 걸 알고 있었지. 이 곳에는 도둑과 강도들 밖에 "
"없군. 약속을 지키지 않는다면 영원히 사라질 수밖에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "071657a2-ca83-4db5-b45e-8b209ba5f6bc"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Dragn}Dragn{/d} bows, coughing quietly into his beard.{/n} \"{mf|Your "
"Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, I would like to apologize. I "
"suppose I was a little... headstrong during my last visit. I have a bad "
"temper. In the mountains they used to call me Grumbler. Well, I didn't "
"expect my petition to be taken seriously. No one wants to share with "
"strangers, even if their demands are quite lawful. Please know that I "
"appreciate your honesty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Dragn}드란{/d}은 고개를 숙이고는 그의 수염 속에 조용히 기침을 합니다.{/n} \"사과를 드리고자 합니다. "
"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 제가 조금... 저번에는 고집불통처럼 굴었죠. 제가 성질이 나빠서.. 산에서는 저는 투덜쟁이라고 "
"부르고는 했습니다. 글쎄요. 제 부탁이 그렇게 진지하게 받아들여질 줄은 몰랐어요. 비록 합법적 요구라 할지라도, 아무도 낯선 사람들과 "
"그런 얘기를 나누고 싶어하지 않으니까요. 당신의 정직함에 감사드리고 있다는걸 알아 주셨으면 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c10e5117-cfd6-4b59-8874-27bf42257264"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Dragn}Dragn{/d} bows from the waist and addresses you "
"ceremoniously.{/n} \"Greetings, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}. By tradition, if a worthy ruler is patron to a master, the master "
"gives generously in return. I have come to honor this tradition.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Dragn}드란{/d}은 인사를 하고는 예의 바르게 말을 겁니다.{/n} \"안녕하십니까! 전통에 따라 지배자가 장인을 "
"후원하면 장인은 그 보답을 성실하게 하는게 도리죠. 저는 전통을 지키는 드워프입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f187ffb8-70b4-4a4b-bc3a-13702ce93620"
msgid "\"Please accept this. I worked hard on it. I hope it serves you well.\""
msgstr "\"부디 이걸 받아주십시오. 열심히 만든 겁니다. 이게 당신께 도움이 되길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "243f99d3-a230-4682-bec2-c9fad7e7297f"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn solemnly presents the reforged plate armor.{/n} \"Here, {mf|Your "
"Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. The work is complete. "
"Grandfather's armor is restored. It has belonged to the family for many "
"years, but my family is no more... So I present it to you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란이 고쳐진 판갑옷을 보여줍니다.{/n} \"여기, 받아주십시오. 작업이 끝났습니다. 할아버지의 갑옷을 고쳤습니다. 이것은 "
"오랫동안 가문의 것이었지만 우리 가족은 더 이상 존재하지 않지요... 당신께 선물로 바치겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "a6d77b69-c88a-43c4-ad59-44048f8c5d22"
msgid "\"A master always welcomes a good customer! So what would you like?\""
msgstr "\"장인은 항상 손님을 반기지요! 그래서 무얼 원하시는지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "a68fd211-c614-4403-997a-6903104d3250"
msgid ""
"\"It is a decent piece of work, to be fair, but not a masterpiece. "
"Masterpieces are rare, once-in-a-lifetime accomplishments. Anyway, I have an "
"idea how to use our family relic for your greater glory... but I'm going to "
"need your help. Come by if you're interested. I'll tell you more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 괜찮은 작품이지만 걸작까지는 아닙니다. 걸작은 일생에 한번 있을만한 드문 업적이죠. 어째든, 당신의 더 큰 영광을 위해 우리 "
"가문의 가보를 어떻게 사용할지 제게 생각이 좀 있습니다. 하지만 먼저, 당신 도움이 필요합니다. 관심 있으시면 한번 방문해주십시오. 더 "
"자세히 말씀드리겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "a108820f-7049-45e8-a84a-0ae7334daeaf"
msgid ""
"\"If my gift pleases you, please respond in kind. I've been robbed. Some "
"thieves crept into my workshop and took all my gold, and Onslaught too! I "
"hadn't even had a chance to finish it! The people are saying that robbers, "
"thieves, and murderers have lately been freely roaming the area. They gather "
"along the {g|Thorn River}Thorn River{/g}, near the ford. You're the ruler, "
"so please, I beg you, take action to find it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 재능이 당신을 기쁘게 해드렸다면 부디 일 하나를 통해 보답해주십시오. 저는 도둑을 맞았습니다. 어떤 도둑이 제 공방으로 기어들어와 "
"내 돈과 맹격 갑옷을 가져갔습니다! 아직 마무리도 짓지 못했는데! 사람들이 그러는데 강도, 도둑과 살인자들이 이 지역을 자유롭게 "
"돌아다닌다고 하더군요. 그들은 {g|Thorn River}가시 강{/g}을 따라 가시 여울 근처에 모인다고 합디다. 당신은 이 땅의 "
"지배자이시니 간청합니다. 부디 제 물건을 찾도록 뭔가 조치를 취해 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "4e18c965-e9fd-4e37-9a3d-4e440c2e07ab"
msgid ""
"\"If you have any requests or needs, feel free to tell me. Otherwise, please "
"allow me to devote my time to Onslaught. I'm itching to finish what I've "
"begun, and restore my grandfather's heritage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"필요한 게 있다면 언제든지 말해주십시오. 그렇지 않다면 나는 맹격을 고치는데 집중하겠습니다. 시작한 것을 어서 끝내고 싶어 몸이 "
"근질근질하네요. 우리 할아버지의 유산을 복구해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ef211d18-7e3e-4d8a-b175-dded71419afd"
msgid ""
"\"Gladly! I've been itching to start! But a craftsman's word is law. No new "
"work until I complete all my current orders. I'm not some ordinary fool "
"whose mind is so full of fantasies and \"fresh ideas\" that he can't "
"properly finish a single task!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기꺼이! 어서 시작하고 싶습니다! 하지만 장인의 말은 곧 법이지요. 제 현재 밀린 주문들을 끝낼 때까지는 새로운 작업을 시작할 수 "
"없습니다. 저는 공상이나 한 번의 노력으로는 마무리도 못할 \"신선한 아이디어\" 따위로 머리가 꽉 찬 멍청이는 아닙니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "40abe279-0178-4937-8042-0064e68631a5"
msgid "\"It's a pleasure to work hard for such an honorable {mf|lord|lady}.\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 명예로운 {mf|남작님을|남작님을|전하를|전하를} 위해 열심히 일할 수 있어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "cea000b4-00ac-44bf-adec-3043bb1acb24"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn points his chin upwards, insulted.{/n} \"This is your land, you're "
"free to throw me out. I'll always be happy to leave a place where honest "
"citizens are unwelcome!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란은 모욕을 당하고는 턱을 들며 말합니다.{/n} \"여기는 당신 땅입니다, 나를 쫓아내는 것도 당신 마음이죠. 정직한 시민들이 "
"환영받지 못하는 곳이라면 기꺼이 떠나겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "98ca1126-58e1-42f2-918c-45cbefc2ef9e"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn nods pensively.{/n} \"Of course... My kind are rarely allowed to "
"work freely, without a big hurry...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Dragn이 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"물론입니다... 우리 같은 사람들이 일에 쫓기지 않고 자유롭게 일하는 경우는 정말 "
"드물지요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "386ff4d6-fcfb-4b5e-8afc-72dc015790c2"
msgid ""
"\"Will do. It will be heavy enough to split open a suit of armor, but light "
"enough that you won't get tired of holding it.\""
msgstr "\"그러겠습니다. 갑옷을 쪼갤 수 있을 만큼 무거우면서도, 쥐고 휘두르는데 무리가 없을 만큼 가볍게 만들겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "bf9951fa-ac2b-44ee-bdfb-dd6a9a900ad2"
msgid ""
"\"Most reasonable. Nowadays they don't even think it's a real victory unless "
"you overpower them hand to hand. But if you ask me, shooting bolts from a "
"distance is smarter than getting bludgeoned to death. Let the fools think "
"what they like, but you and I – we know better.\""
msgstr ""
"\"탁월한 선택이십니다. 요즘엔 직접 손을 맞대서 제압하지 않으면 진정한 승리가 아니라고들 합니다만, 제게 물으신다면, 둔기에 맞아죽느니 "
"멀리서 쇠뇌를 쏘는게 훨씬 현명하죠. 우린 이걸 잘 알고 있으니, 바보들은 계속 그러라고 합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "c60c075d-f5f3-49b2-ae43-649906ee4277"
msgid ""
"\"Very wise. One should never forget about protection. Everyone thinks of "
"glory and victory – a sharper axe, a heavier hammer. Never stop to think "
"about their bones. Ha ha! The fools!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아주 현명하시군요. 방호를 잊어서는 안되지요. 날카로운 도끼와 무거운 망치로 승리의 영광을 취할 생각은 하면서, 그러다 자기 뼈가 "
"박살난 거란 생각은 왜 안하는 걸까요? 바보들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "8f905469-65ba-4e72-acd8-08cbcae14f5b"
msgid ""
"\"I see you're a true expert. No one has ever achieved greater success in "
"smithing than my people.\""
msgstr "\"진정한 전문가시군요. 누구도 우리 종족보다 대장기술이 뛰어나진 않으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "9f777ecb-2cce-4db7-a156-cac698191ae7"
msgid ""
"\"Here, take a look. This scroll contains a list of expenses for building "
"the {g|Road of Shields}Road of Shields{/g}. The cost of laying the stone, "
"draining, cutting firebreaks and so on. You and your people have lived for a "
"long time on lands that lawfully belonged to my people, making free use of "
"the fruits of someone else's labor. Would you now please pay for the work my "
"ancestors did?\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 보시죠. 이 양피지에는 {g|Road of Shields}방패의 길{/g}을 짓는 데 들어간 비용들이 적혀있습니다. 돌을 놓고 "
"물을 대고 나무를 구하는 등의 비용들입니다. 인간들은 오래전부터 우리 민족의 땅에서 살면서, 우리 민족이 땀흘려 지은 노동의 결실도 "
"마음대로 사용해 왔습니다. 이제 우리 조상들이 한 노동의 대가를 치뤄주시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "76cc1b3d-cfc6-4c41-8abd-63c020768e3d"
msgid ""
"\"I, Dragn Woradash, humbly demand compensation for those who are no longer "
"able to collect. I do not ask for gold. It's better that you give me a house "
"with a shop, which will costs as much as the sum in the scroll. You see, I'm "
"a blacksmith, and I'm used to earning my living honestly – but I can't work "
"without a shop. As soon as I get what's mine, I'll open the shop right away. "
"Then you'll have at least one decent bladesmith.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나, 드란 보라다시는 조상들을 대신하여 보상을 요구하는 바입니다. 저는 돈을 원하는 것이 아닙니다. 이 양피지에 적힌 금액 만큼의 "
"가게가 딸린 집으로 주시면 감사하겠습니다. 보시다시피, 저는 대장장이고, 정직하게 내 일을 하며 살아가겠지만, 가게 없이 일할 수는 "
"없으니까요. 제 보상을 받는 대로 바로 가게를 열겠습니다. 그렇게되면 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께는 적어도 괜찮은 검제작자 "
"한명쯤은 생기는거 아니겠습니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "eef61d62-e4f7-4e32-96d5-dc73ad5e4aa7"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Road of Shields}The Road of Shields{/g} used to run through your lands. "
"It was built, among others, by my ancestors, members of the noble Woradash "
"clan. This means they still own it, even though they were driven from these "
"lands. According to all law, if a bandit takes my father's house and kills "
"him, the house still belongs to me. So I've come for what's mine.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Road of Shields}방패의 길{/g}은 당신들 땅을 지나고 있습니다. 이 길은 내 조상인 고귀한 보라다시 클랜에서 만든 "
"것입니다. 그 말은 비록 내 조상들이 이 땅에서 쫓겨났다하더라도 아직 소유권은 가지고 있다는 겁니다. 법에 따르면 도적이 아버지의 집을 "
"훔치고 그를 죽여도 집은 여전히 아들의 것 아니겠습니까. 그러니 나는 내 것을 찾으러 온 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "5e07b20b-0389-4cd2-884b-30b2b5e92a36"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf opens his mouth to say something... then clearly can't find the "
"words. He huffs indignantly, shifts from foot to foot, then finally turns "
"away, defeated.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 입을 열어 무언가를 말하려 하지만... 적절한 말을 떠올리지 못합니다. 그는 분노로 씩씩대면서, 발을 동동 구르더니, "
"체념하고 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "7d37415c-8def-44b4-89fe-e07b7c9afe94"
msgid ""
"\"I adjusted all the parts for a better fit, reworked a thing or two... Here "
"you go. Wear it proudly. It is not by coincidence that it was named "
"Onslaught. No lie, no trickery could withstand its wearer. It will aid a "
"just lord in delivering law to {mf|his|her} honest people. It's going to fit "
"you perfectly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 부위가 딱 들어맞게 손 봤습니다. 한 두가지 새로 작업한 것도 있고요... 여기 있습니다. 정말 자랑할 만한 갑옷입니다. 이것에 "
"맹격이라는 이름이 붙은건 우연이 아닙니다. 어떤 거짓말도, 어떤 속임수도 이 갑옷을 이겨낼 수 없지요. 정직한 사람들을 위해 법을 "
"집행하는 군주를 위한 것입니다. 당신에게 딱 맞는 물건이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "2bbac27b-cc0b-4825-bd39-161b866bbc66"
msgid ""
"\"All right, I'll begin working on my grandfather's armor. I've been looking "
"forward to this!\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다. 제 할아버지의 갑옷을 계속 고치겠습니다. 어서 끝내고 싶네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "36b460a3-0d25-4714-ae06-b30913a7ff6d"
msgid ""
"\"Dragn the armorsmith. Shields, axes, hammers – any kind of weapon or "
"armor, these hands have done it all! But my life's work is repairing my "
"ancestral armor, Onslaught. Full mithral plate – granting its wearer "
"incredible power and speed. It is a great work, worth any sacrifice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방어구 대장장이 드란입니다. 방패, 도끼, 망치 등 모든 종류의 무기나 갑옷을 다루지요! 하지만 제 일생의 역작은 조상의 갑옷, "
"맹격을 복구하는 겁니다. 착용자에게 놀라운 힘과 속도를 선사하는 순 미스랄제 갑옷. 어떤 희생이라도 치를 만한 위대한 작업이지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_EE_StatGift_Dragn/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1344b1f2-ed82-4bd6-b316-8c0ae344aaa8"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! I'm "
"working myself day and night, producing orders for your army. One particular "
"item turned out too fine to serve a simple soldier. It would be more "
"suitable for you, or one of your loyal comrades.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, 전하! {mf|영주님을|영주님을|전하를|전하를} 위해 밤 낮 없이 작업을 했는데, 평범한 병사한테는 어울리지 않는 "
"훌륭한 물건이 완성되었습니다. 직접 쓰시거나 동료들이 쓰는게 좋을 듯 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_EE_StatGift_Dragn/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "693a7379-10cf-4f2e-8c42-8dbbd54279f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Dragn's face attempts to look reserved and solemn, but he cannot hide his "
"contented smile.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}"
"! I see things are looking up for your lands, as well as in my smithy. Your "
"army grows, giving me more work, and your subjects show ever more respect to "
"their ruler – and his court craftsmen as well. Allow me to present this "
"token of appreciation.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드란의 얼굴은 과묵하고 엄숙하게 보이려는 것 같지만 만족한 미소를 감추진 못합니다.{/n}\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 제 "
"작업실처럼 전하의 땅도 점점 나아지는군요. 당신의 병사들은 점점 늘어나 제게 더 많은 일을 주고, 당신의 신하들은 통치자와 그의 "
"장인들에게 언제나 존중을 보입니다. 이에 대한 감사의 표시를 할 수 있도록 허락을 청합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/KTC_EE_StatGift_Dragn/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "870a2da0-0dc0-4581-b1c3-6f4eeb75de1b"
msgid ""
"\"Take this gift. To our gracious ruler, from {mf|his|her} master craftsman, "
"Dragn.\""
msgstr "\"최고의 대장장이 드란이 위대한 통치자에게 이 물건을 바치겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5d647a09-3a55-4d60-9233-0e163fdde31a"
msgid "\"Show me what's in the bag.\""
msgstr "\"가방에 든 것을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2d39fb86-1147-483e-9ac0-b9c80f00180b"
msgid "Executed Onslaught thief without talking."
msgstr "사정을 듣지 않고 맹격을 훔친 도둑을 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d1be4cdf-75d6-41a1-9361-5005606a920b"
msgid "[Attack] \"Thieves are executed in these lands.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"도둑은 이 땅에서 처형 당한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "478f658a-03c3-4a78-b08a-8c61f41af4c2"
msgid "Encouraged Kergan to stop escaping the rule of law and confess."
msgstr "도망치지 말고 자백하라고 케르간을 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4b2be5c1-b52f-4db9-83a4-60379593f486"
msgid ""
"\"You cheated your own brother, sold the family relic... Aren't you ashamed "
"of yourself?\""
msgstr "\"네 형을 속이고 가보를 팔았지... 부끄럽지도 않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b1f0794b-d997-4f80-967f-7ca18305f441"
msgid "Arrested Kergan, Onslaught thief."
msgstr "맹격을 훔친 케르간을 체포했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a1c25974-b6f5-4280-8188-fcaee5e95e75"
msgid "[Attack] \"It's time I teach you a lesson!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네게 가르침을 내려 주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "33a130dc-f887-4b35-acd8-3390e57bc469"
msgid "Let Kergan get away with the armor stolen from his evil elder brother."
msgstr "그의 나쁜 형으로부터 케르간이 훔친 갑옷을 가지고 도망치게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "9cb4cf5e-9aa4-4c88-a702-8d3524358ed3"
msgid "\"You're right. Your brother is a tyrant. Go in peace.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 네 형은 나쁜 녀석이야. 어서 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "c67df00c-9560-49c0-b356-498d3d744dda"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about your family feud. I just need the armor. Hand it over.\""
msgstr "\"네 가족 일은 상관 없어. 나는 갑옷만 있으면 돼. 어서 넘겨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7091f7a2-37a8-447b-83fe-09ea6556cc77"
msgid "Put Kergan in jail."
msgstr "케르간을 감옥에 집어넣습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "79d940bd-ead1-4bde-9f2b-e77cd1503b3d"
msgid ""
"\"You'll be going to jail until your trial. After that, I'll let your "
"brother deal with you.\""
msgstr "\"재판이 있을때 까지 감옥에 있어라. 그 뒤의 처분 네 형에게 맡기지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4f2ce098-fd56-4a79-aebd-5545b19200bb"
msgid "Killed Kergan after he'd surrendered."
msgstr "항복한 케르간을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "cf5464d9-73b8-47dc-969b-db0b12b87a14"
msgid "[Attack] \"Time to rid my country of one more pathetic thief!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 땅에서 도둑 하나를 더 줄일 시간이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "4eb13596-d120-4870-9d59-d3bcc313ad75"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c38015d4-16d0-46b0-9a75-bc2a86440a98"
msgid "Set Kergan free."
msgstr "케르간을 풀어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "acb15b82-7f84-4430-9622-674dc4ef9d0e"
msgid ""
"\"I won't tell your brother you stole from him. Now take yourself from my "
"lands and never return.\""
msgstr "\"형에게 네가 갑옷을 훔친 걸 말하지 않겠다. 이제 내 땅을 떠나 다시는 오지 말아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c5e36985-9659-4321-b296-bb6637996e29"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf stashes something hastily in a big bag when he spots you.{/n} "
"\"Um... What do you want? I mean, how can I help you?\""
msgstr "{n}드워프는 서둘러 커다란 가방을 정리합니다.{/n} \"음... 무슨 일입니까? 그러니까, 제가 도울 일이라도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "e8d46fcd-0677-4c0c-8b18-a430d9c9e4bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf turns pale.{/n} \"{d|Dragn}Dragn{/d} sent you after me? Please "
"don't kill me! I'm Kergan, his younger brother. What stories did he tell you "
"about me? That I stole from him? Well maybe I did. But he's the one who "
"started it! Always bossing me around, saying he was older. Do this, don't do "
"that! He was trying to strangle my talent! I'm an adventurer by nature! "
"Adventure lures me! And he tells me my passion is nothing but prowling and "
"roguery!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프가 창백해집니다.{/n} \"{d|Dragn}드란{/d}이 보냈습니까? 제발 살려주십시오! 저는 그의 동생 케르간입니다. 그가 "
"뭐라던가요? 내가 그의 물건을 훔쳤다고요? 그건 맞습니다. 하지만 그놈이 먼저 시작한 거라고요! 항상 자기가 나이가 많다며 나를 "
"구박했죠. 이거 해라, 저거 해라 하면서 말입니다. 내 재능은 알아주지도 않았어요! 저는 타고난 모험가라고요! 항상 모험에 끌렸습니다. "
"하지만 그는 내 열정을 무시하고 그저 떠돌이에 사기꾼으로 몰았습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5b89d2bf-20a2-405e-a562-da84fc3cd945"
msgid ""
"{n}Kergan flinches as if he's been hit, and then droops.{/n} \"You're right. "
"I'm ashamed. I dreamt of returning home with wealth and glory, so Dragn "
"would see how dumb he was. Now I've embarrassed myself, and I can't dare "
"look him in the eye. It turns out I was the fool, not he.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케르간은 얻어맞은 것처럼 몸을 움츠립니다.{/n} \"당신이 맞습니다. 이렇게 부끄러울 데가. 부와 영광을 가지고 집으로 가겠다고 "
"생각했는데. 드란이 나를 인정하게 말입니다. 정말 내 자신이 부끄럽네요. 무슨 낯으로 형을 봐야할까요? 바보는 형이 아니라 나였는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "77090797-a6a8-44bd-88dd-75aecd77373b"
msgid ""
"{n}Kergan shrugs.{/n} \"Why would I be ashamed? It's my life. I'm not going "
"to live my life just to satisfy my brother. Freedom means a lot to me. I'll "
"make up for today's sins with tomorrow's good deeds.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케르간이 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 부끄러워 해야 합니까? 이건 내 인생입니다. 나는 내 형을 만족시키려고 사는 게 "
"아닙니다. 자유는 나에게 아주 큰 의미가 있다고요. 나는 오늘의 죄를 내일의 선행으로 갚을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "0718f04b-bfc6-4465-9355-9a942e24e945"
msgid ""
"{n}Kergan wipes the sweat from his forehead.{/n} \"It's all right, it's all "
"right. I should go. Tell Dragn I don't care about him, or his advice, or his "
"forges and hammers. I've got my own way.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케르간이 이마에서 땀을 닦습니다.{/n} \"좋아요. 좋습니다. 떠날게요. 드란에게 너도, 네 잔소리도, 네 대장간이건, 네 망치건 "
"뭐간 간에 하나도 신경 안쓴다고 전해주십시오. 나는 내 길을 갈테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6f9eaac8-885c-452b-bb7e-d7bc9563d35c"
msgid ""
"\"Become a master, he said. Work hard in the family forge, he said. I'm sick "
"to death of forges! I know it's a custom, but it's a stupid one. I want to "
"see the world! To perform great feats! There's no adventuring without armor "
"and a sword! So I took grandfather's armor. It was no use gathering dust "
"like a holy relic! I wanted my chance at glory. I wanted it to serve our "
"family honorably one more time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"장인이 되라더군요. 가문의 대장간에서 열심히 일하라고. 대장간은 이제 신물이 나요! 전통이라는 건 알지만 멍청한 짓입니다. 나는 "
"세상을 보고 싶어요! 위대한 업적을 이루고 싶다고요. 갑옷과 검이 없으면 모험을 할 수 없습니다. 그래서 할아버지의 갑옷을 가져갔죠. "
"그런 유물을 먼지가 쌓이게 둘 수는 없잖아요! 나는 영광을 얻을 기회를 얻고 싶었습니다. 내 가족의 이름을 다시 영광스럽게 하고 싶었지요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "736bfb3c-99d2-46b9-8b28-e1d85873adc6"
msgid ""
"\"But... the whole hero thing didn't exactly work out. I had to sell the "
"armor to feed myself. I swear, I was going to buy it back... I just needed "
"more time. While I was gathering my strength, I heard there was a blacksmith "
"named Dragn, who was forging some legendary armor. I realized this could be "
"my second chance! I know I already did him an awful wrong – but if he hadn't "
"hounded me so, I would have become a respectful adventurer, a world "
"traveler, and a wealthy man!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... 영웅이 되는게 쉽지는 않더군요. 먹고 살려면 갑옷을 팔아야 했습니다. 맹세컨데 돈이 생기면 다시 사려고 했습니다... "
"그저 시간이 필요했던 것 뿐이에요. 돈을 모으는 와중에 나는 드란이라는 대장장이가 갑옷을 되찾고 전설의 갑옷을 고치고 있다는 소문을 "
"들었습니다. 나는 그게 두번째 기회가 될 거라고 생각했죠! 형에게 끔찍한 짓을 저지른 건 인정합니다. 하지만 나를 그렇게 볶지 않았다면 "
"부와 명예를 거머쥔 모험가가 되어있었을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "50c21f71-3e89-4bfd-b2aa-6a12f226c4cf"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf lifts up his hands in despair.{/n} \"Oh... all right, all "
"right! Just don't use your fists!\" {n}Kergan bites his lip.{/n} \"What are "
"you going to do to me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 절망스럽게 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"아... 알았어요! 때리지만 마세요!\" {n}케르간은 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"날"
" 어쩌려는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "04b899f1-9131-407f-8201-503d5f5c4774"
msgid ""
"\"No way! If that's how you're going to behave, then just go ahead and try "
"to take it by force!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 그렇게 할 거라면 차라히 힘으로 뺏어가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "d570bfc3-0565-4061-8f44-4f9e7567f7a9"
msgid ""
"\"Have mercy! Please, don't kill me! I'll give you everything! Here's the "
"armor – take it! Just spare my life!\""
msgstr "\"부디 자비를! 뭐든 드리겠습니다! 여기 갑옷 가져가요! 그냥 목숨만 살려주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "9e52209a-d555-4779-8927-f84183e28be7"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! Thank you so much! I'll change! Just don't kill me!\" {n}The "
"dwarf slumps down onto the ground, exhausted.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다! 정말 감사합니다! 이제 열심히 살거예요! 죽이지만 말아주세요!\" {n}드워프는 진이 빠져서 바닥에 털썩 주저 "
"앉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "91bc121e-c87f-4107-8db7-776310584898"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Kerg... Kergabas! Dwarf Kergabas! Just a stranger on my way to, um... "
"{g|Andoran}Andoran{/g}!\" {n}Judging from the look on the dwarf's face, the "
"name \"Kergabas\" sounds just as dumb to him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저는 케... 케르가바스에요! 드워프 케르가바스! 막 {g|Andoran}안도란{/g}으로 가는 중이었습니다!\" {n}드워프의 "
"낯빛을 보니 케르가가바스라는 이름은 어색하게 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "e75fbfec-7e27-482e-81ab-cbc216d0d0a4"
msgid ""
"\"I know, it's all my fault. I stole from my kin, from my own brother... but "
"don't punish me, I beg you! I can go to jail if you like! Or maybe... maybe "
"you could just set me free? Please don't hurt me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 알아요. 모두 내 잘못입니다. 내가 형의 물건을 훔쳤어요... 하지만 처벌하지 말아주세요! 이렇게 빕니다! 감옥에 가라고 하면 "
"갈게요! 아니면... 그냥 나를 풀어주면 안 됩니까? 제발 저를 해치지 마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "ed737619-a140-4d83-8664-5218ce7903ab"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? You can take the armor. I'll... I'll go to the city and "
"surrender to the guards. I'm tired of running away... There's no point. "
"There's no escaping your own guilt. I'll serve my sentence, and after that "
"I'll lead a different life, a clean one! My brother might even take me back!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"저기요. 그냥 갑옷 가져가세요. 저는... 도시로 가서 경비에게 자수하겠습니다. 도망은 이제 질렸어요... 다 소용 없네요. "
"사람한테서는 도망갈 수 있어도 죄 앞에서 도망갈 수는 없으니까. 저는 심판을 받고 깨끗한 삶을 살겠습니다! 제 형이 저를 다시 데려갈지도 "
"몰라요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/DvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/YoungBrotherDvarvenMaleArmorsmithLN/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "348e67c0-d32b-43d2-9c36-4f67fe838e18"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, really? Oh, boy! Thank you so much! I'll pay you back in full when I "
"become a great hero!\""
msgstr "\"오. 정말요? 오! 정말 고마워요, 친구! 언젠가 제가 위대한 영웅이 되면 제대로 갚겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ac0a22ff-991a-4b4b-950b-7f70ca314879"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6ddbd49d-a684-4c43-bbd4-85cf28a6005f"
msgid "Killed Sartayne on the spot."
msgstr "그 자리에서 사르테인을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "114d7013-b761-4315-be71-e0ca978677a7"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have interfered with my servants.\""
msgstr "[공격]\"넌 내 종복을 협박해선 안 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9c7e8690-5626-4f9f-8331-8774dee0b116"
msgid "Let Sartayne go to avenge his father."
msgstr "사르테인이 아버지의 복수를 하게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "206ee87c-0d0d-4a61-800a-03012a2a4c07"
msgid ""
"\"I recognize your right to revenge, and this is your business. But I'm not "
"helping you.\""
msgstr "\"네겐 복수의 명분이 있으니, 그리하도록 해라. 하지만 너를 돕지는 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "368c652a-463d-4947-8a37-5fc4656848b0"
msgid "Conspired with Nazrielle's enemy and broke your deal with her."
msgstr "나즈리엘의 적과 공모함으로써 당신과 그녀 사이의 계약은 파기되었다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "b3a3d5a4-1616-4692-8b03-ad949799e907"
msgid "\"Deal. You will be my new master.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 내 새 장인이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "444d0dad-00a8-4342-b4dd-3a09b7ded119"
msgid "Honored the deal and protected Nazrielle from Sartayne."
msgstr "거래를 존중하고 사르테인으로부터 나즈리엘을 보호했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "b3ff6dd6-1028-40bb-8e46-119595f9ea33"
msgid "\"I respect our deal with Nazrielle. You're going to jail.\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘의 약속도 중요해. 너는 감옥으로 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "65fd9ad5-03cd-4005-b9cf-77ae566186bd"
msgid "\"You've been spoiling Nazrielle's work, haven't you?\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘을 방해했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "913034a9-fdb2-41f0-9782-b5d4e8157534"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne gazes at you in astonishment. Something seems different. No "
"longer does he appear dim-witted and servile. Instead he seems self-"
"confident and firm.{/n} \"I didn't expect to see you here. How can I help "
"you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 깜짝 놀라서 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 뭔가 달라진 것 같습니다. 그는 더 이상 눈치가 없고 비굴해 보이지 않습니다. 대신 "
"자신감이 넘쳐보입니다.{/n} \"여기서 당신을 보리라곤 생각도 못했어요. 필요한게 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0bf2e621-7f6c-4acb-9f64-8d6143b922d2"
msgid ""
"\"When I found out the rascal was here, I decided to seize the opportunity. "
"I arrived here, got myself an apprentice's position... and set my hands to "
"work. I'm smarter and more skilled than she might think. I worked hard by "
"the anvil during the day and crafted cursed items at nights. Nazrielle's "
"pride is her soft spot – the perfect place to strike. I decided to tarnish "
"her image, make her look clumsy and incompetent, ruin her reputation. And, "
"of course, destroy that masterpiece she's been making such a fuss over...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 녀석을 여기에서 봤을 때 저는 기회를 노리기로 했습니다. 여기로 도착해서는 도제 일을 하기 시작했죠. 저는 그녀가 생각했던 것보다 "
"똑똑하고 재주가 좋았습니다. 낮에는 모루에서 일하고 밤에는 저주받은 물품들을 손봤죠. 나즈리엘의 약점은 자존심입니다. 노리기 딱 좋은 "
"약점이죠. 저는 그녀의 평판을 더럽히고, 서툴고 무능해 보이게 하고, 그녀의 명성을 해치기로 결심했습니다. 그리고 물론, 그녀가 그렇게 "
"야단법석을 떨었던 걸작도 없애버리기로 했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "38fad6ee-1351-49a2-a3b9-fcb869177fac"
msgid ""
"\"That's a shame. Now if you'll excuse me, I have to go. If you managed to "
"find me here, Nazrielle will too. Tell the lousy skunk I quit. But she'd "
"better run like hell. I will have my revenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안타깝네요. 괜찮다면 저는 가보겠습니다. 당신이 나를 찾아냈으니, 나즈리엘도 그럴 수 있겠죠. 그 개같은 자식에게 저는 그만둔다고 "
"전해주십시오. 어디 꽁지 빠지게 도망쳐 봐라. 복수해주마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "2a19ba93-bfe7-4cf7-8854-178556a4b32f"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne's laugh rings out.{/n} \"So that's how it is. As soon as I take "
"over Nazrielle's workshop, I promise, I will forge things you've never even "
"dreamed of! And its former owner will receive some proper training, I give "
"you my word. I'll begin by bringing some guards to the blacksmith shop and "
"suppress any thoughts she has of resistance. Goodbye, {mf|Your Grace|Your "
"Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인의 웃음소리가 퍼집니다.{/n} \"그렇게 된 것이군요. 내가 나즈리엘의 작업장을 인수하는 즉시, 당신이 꿈도 꾸지 못했던 "
"것들을 만들어낼게요! 전 주인은 적절한 훈련을 받게 될 것입니다. 약속드립니다. 몇몇 경호원들을 대장간으로 불러들여서 그녀가 반항할 "
"생각을 못하도록 하는 것부터 시작해야겠지요. 안녕히 가세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "434bd7a5-ea00-42a1-9d10-1857c8653cee"
msgid "\"I'll be right here should you want to talk.\""
msgstr "\"하실 말씀이 있으시면 저는 여기 있겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "1421d385-f9a3-4bd9-a546-43f8057052a8"
msgid ""
"\"I'd hoped to see Nazrielle's head on the chopping block, but since you're "
"here, I have a better idea. {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}, would you like to hire a new weaponsmith? I'm aware you have a "
"deal with Nazrielle. But if you decide to break that deal and declare me the "
"court's master blacksmith... and allow me to keep Nazrielle as an "
"assistant... oh, I could never thank you enough! What do you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나즈리엘의 머리를 자르고 싶었지만 네가 여기에 왔으니 더 좋은 생각이 있어. 나를 새로운 대장장이로 임명해줘! 나즈리엘과 계약을 맺고 "
"있다는 걸 알지만 계약을 깨고 나를 새로운 대장장이로 임명하면... 그러면 나즈리엘은 내 조수가 되지... 그러면 정말 고마울 텐데! "
"어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "cdc18810-2359-47cc-8540-f56442a01981"
msgid ""
"\"So that's how it is. Very well. I was prepared for this turn of events. "
"Let's see how well you can handle my new friends.\" {n}Tiny stone animal "
"figures appear in Sartayne's hands. He scatters them all around him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 됐군요. 좋습니다. 일이 일어게 될 경우를 대비해놨죠. 제 새 친구를 얼마나 잘 다룰 수 있을지 보도록 하죠.\" {n}"
"사르테인의 손에 작은 동물의 모습을 한 돌조각들이 나타나더니 그가 그걸 자기 주변에 뿌렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "4360b0f0-acb8-47d6-95cc-0867799164a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne sneers and throws his hands up playfully.{/n} \"You got me! I "
"confess. Who figured it out? You or her? Anyway, that's not important right "
"now. Why did I do it? Purely for the sake of revenge. Years ago, she "
"invested a lot of effort in devastating my father, who was himself a well-"
"known weaponsmith. He lost everything that was dear to him: his reputation, "
"his workshop – his whole life's purpose.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"들켰군요! 자백하겠습니다. 누가 알아냈습니까? 당신? 아니면 그녀가? 뭐, 별로 중요한건 "
"아니죠. 왜 내가 그랬냐고요? 순전히 복수를 위해섭니다. 몇년 전, 그녀는 유명한 무기장이였던 내 아버지를 파멸시키는데 많은 노력을 "
"기울였습니다. 아버지는 소중히 여기시던 모든 것을 잃어버리셨죠. 평판, 공방, 평생의 숙원까지도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Apprentice_of_Weaponmaster/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "f860ed8f-f750-4ea8-93c6-8d5853ef20fe"
msgid "\"Yes?\""
msgstr "\"네?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Barks/Dying_Apprentice2_String
msgctxt "0ec411e6-e24c-4a4f-9383-fa844bc3fec3"
msgid ""
"\"I thought... I could... manage... as I took the blade, I had a feeling "
"that I... I was invincible... but this illusion... trick... oh, damn you... "
"Nazrielle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난... 이 칼을... 다룰 수 있을 줄... 알았는데, 칼을 쥐는 순간... 무적이 된... 기분이었다고... 근데 그게 환상... "
"이었다니... 염병할... 나즈리엘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Barks/Dying_Apprentice_String
msgctxt "48d65dfc-abff-4a66-987f-094d62c915fc"
msgid "\"Help! Help me! I'm dying!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 제발! 나 죽네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "60523cd9-6168-46a9-a44d-31b1c31d938c"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, there's a rogue behind your back! Toss 'It' to me before he steals It!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 네 등 뒤에 도적이 있어! 뺏기기 전에 그걸 넘겨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "437009e3-c2d6-45eb-b480-0866e4209210"
msgid "\"We can do this the easy way or the hard way!\""
msgstr "\"어렵게 하는 방법과 쉽게 하는 방법이 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4f0b33b6-dd9b-4dea-b0f8-a0ff30bf8b5a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm a friend. Don't get me wrong, but that thing is playing tricks on your "
"mind. You must give it to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 편이야. 오해하지 마, 그게 너의 정신에 수작을 부리고 있어. 그걸 나한테 줘야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "919080e7-9694-4c10-a731-0e9cad5efe5b"
msgid "\"Who the hell are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 대체 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0b346c99-db2c-4e96-88b0-d235d8b17233"
msgid "[Attack] \"You should have given it to me willingly.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"순순히 넘겼어야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "27ce87f2-d291-41ea-886a-2baa7095b677"
msgid "\"Calm down, I'm leaving.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 갈 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fd8e2bb6-7ff7-44aa-a7fe-63c79207ce19"
msgid ""
"{n}When he sees you, the elf crouches in fear, hiding something in his "
"arms.{/n} \"Have you come to take It? No! It's mine! Leave me alone!\" {n}A "
"grimace of pain and madness has captured his face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프가 당신을 보자 겁에 질려 무언가를 숨깁니다.{/n} \"이걸 가지러 온 거야? 안 돼! 이건 내 거야! 나를 내버려둬!\" "
"{n}그의 얼굴은 고통과 광기로 덮여있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "83d243b4-d3ff-41f9-b39c-587bd57eca34"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf tucks his head into his shoulders.{/n} \"Don't hurt me. Don't "
"take it away.\""
msgstr "{n}엘프가 고개와 어깨를 잔뜩 움츠립니다{/n} \"가까이 오지마. 넘겨주지 않을꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e1c61b68-1684-4936-b757-7ac4974b35fe"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf tosses the thing before he knows he's been fooled.{/n} \"No! "
"Thief! Thief!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프는 그걸 던져주자 마자 속았다는 걸 깨달았습니다.{/n} \"안 돼! 도둑이야! 도둑!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "96483a66-49a6-4789-8fe6-c2a859a17456"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf turns around, startled, but doesn't let go of the thing in his "
"hands.{/n} \"Hey, are you trying to trick me? Thief!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프는 놀라서 뒤를 돌아봤지만, 손에 든 것을 넘겨주진 않았습니다.{/n} \"이봐. 나를 속이려는 거야? 이 도둑놈!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "a6ff2a7b-d7a4-4531-bcd9-1271b4ef997f"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf freezes, then quickly throws away the thing, covers his head with "
"his arms and sobs:{/n} \"Thieves! Don't hurt me...\""
msgstr "{n}엘프는 얼어붙어서는 그것을 던지고는 팔로 머리를 감싸고 흐느낍니다.{/n} \"도둑이야! 살려줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6f143222-6261-4544-9a9b-2db943cfe895"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf is beginning to understand.{/n} \"I... Yes... It's bad! Poisoned "
"my mind!\" {n}The elf throws the thing away fiercely.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 이해하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"나는... 그래... 이거 때문이야! 이게 날 미치게 만들었어!\" {n}엘프는 그것을 "
"멀리 던져버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "55ac6286-3ebb-4a01-989a-f9dae41ad528"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf listens in astonishment.{/n} \"Me? Ditael... No! I am It's "
"warden! I served Nazrielle, and now I serve It! It is more important.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 듣고는 놀랍니다.{/n} \"나? 난 디타엘 인데... 안 돼! 난 이 검의 수호자야! 나는 나즈리엘을 섬겼지만, 이제는 "
"이걸 섬긴다고! 이게 더 중요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "106cf79f-231d-4c5f-a78d-b10a85fb8961"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf is eyeing you apprehensively. He is ready to flee at any "
"moment.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘프는 조심스럽게 당신을 봅니다. 그는 언제라도 도망갈 준비가 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "580c2ee4-35e9-4c9a-b1dc-c73fd273e318"
msgid ""
"\"It's far too valuable. You can't own It! I'm the only one who can! Do you "
"hear me? I'm the only one who can protect it! Everybody else wants It to "
"themselves, but I'm not giving It away! I've been hiding! I can hide from "
"you, too. Don't come closer!\" {n}The elf is staring at you, froth dripping "
"from his lips.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이건 정말 귀한 거야. 너에게 주지 않을 거야! 내 거니까! 알겠어? 나만이 이것을 보호할 수 있다고! 모두가 이걸 노리지만 "
"넘겨줄까보냐! 여태까지 숨어있는데, 너한테서 못 숨을 것도 없지. 가까이 오지마!\" {n}엘프는 침을 흘리며 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "5a14a822-705a-4489-89e6-3c85f47890c3"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf snaps at you with his teeth, doglike.{/n} \"Try to take it! I'll "
"bite off your fingers!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프가 마치 개처럼 당신을 물어뜯습니다.{/n} \"가져가 보시지! 손가락을 물어 뜯어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "c88a76f4-f203-4674-9558-6ead4349da68"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf is beginning to understand.{/n} \"I... Yes... No! The thief is "
"trying to fool me! Go away! You can't have It! Thief!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 이해하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"나는... 그래... 아니야! 이 도둑이 나를 속이려 하는군! 저리 가! 절대 못 준다 이 "
"도둑아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/CursedApprentice/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "4b9771e5-5842-439d-8763-d7c8697e0ddf"
msgid ""
"{n}Ditael returns to his senses and falls limply onto the ground.{/n} \"Good "
"lord, it's finally over. The damned blade took my sanity... Oh, I never "
"expected Mistress Nazrielle could create such a monstrosity! Let her find "
"herself another assistant. This cursed thing nearly cost me my life.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}디타엘은 제정신으로 돌아오고는 힘 없이 쓰러집니다.{/n} \"다행이야. 드디어 끝났어. 이 저주 받은 검이 저를 미치게 "
"했네요... 나즈리엘 부인이 이런 흉물을 만들 줄이야! 다른 조수를 찾아보라고 전해주십시오. 저는 저주받은 물건 때문에 죽을 뻔했습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "cc335c13-cfd2-421a-8aad-cf50292ba380"
msgid "\"I agree to make a deal with you.\""
msgstr "\"너와 계약을 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f31277c0-6fff-4695-b66b-2b5392a68538"
msgid "\"What do you have to offer?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 제안할 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0ce2a495-e1f0-4342-a5f0-63c6fbeea5d9"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "9f583ab5-2b47-4f50-a0cf-9ae89c62edaf"
msgid "\"I need to think.\""
msgstr "\"생각해보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e8978726-e321-4752-801e-270fddd2c86e"
msgid "\"I take no interest either in you or your weapons.\""
msgstr "\"너와 너의 무기 둘 다 관심 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ea655478-3ded-4970-8a95-12b0088c959d"
msgid ""
"{n}A stunning elven lady turns to you. Her hair is immaculate, and her eyes "
"are deep water. Her beauty is like a bird of prey. She is also heavily "
"armed. As she sees you, her superior air fades, leaving a charming smile on "
"her face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}놀랍도록 아름다운 엘프 여성이 당신을 봅니다. 그녀의 머리는 비단결 같고 그녀의 눈은 깊은 호수와 같습니다. 그녀의 아름다움은 마치 "
"한마리의 화려한 새 같습니다. 그녀는 중무장을 했습니다. 당신을 보자 그녀의 위압적인 분위기는 사라지고 당신에게 매력적인 미소를 "
"짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3f1971ea-76e1-410b-bbee-f220877497a9"
msgid ""
"{n}The elven lady nods politely.{/n} \"Will you help me? I promise, this "
"deal won't make you sorry.\""
msgstr "{n}엘프 여성이 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"나를 도와주겠어요? 이 거래로 후회하지는 않을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "d8845799-b5de-419d-b8e4-c037caf53347"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. Return to me immediately, if you decide to sign the contract.\""
msgstr "\"물론이죠. 계약을 하고 싶다면 언제든지 찾아오세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "32cd2611-77d5-4276-a9ee-9633611475c3"
msgid ""
"\"An artist, one of a kind. I create weapons. Not just pointy iron sticks, "
"but real weapons.\" {n}Nazrielle raises her eyebrows meaningfully.{/n} \"Alas"
", not every domain appreciates high quality – and expensive – blades. I hope "
"you'll be a generous {mf|patron|patroness} and an appreciative "
"{mf|connoisseur|connoisseuse}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"예술가...라고 할 수 있죠. 저는 무기를 만들어요. 끝이 뾰족한 쇠막대기가 아니라 진짜 무기를.\" {n}나즈리엘은 말합니다.{/n}"
" \"아아, 슬프게도 모든 영지에서 값비싼 고품질의 칼을 제대로 평가해주는건 아니더군요. 저는 당신이 후한 후원자이자 진가를 알아보는 "
"안목을 가진 사람이면 좋겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "30110097-5dab-4fcf-93bd-2e360ac9bc42"
msgid ""
"\"I hope to start serving you in exchange for your protection. You see, my "
"creations are not to everyone's liking. In the lands where I come from, "
"demand for artful blades is low. The heavier and cheaper ones are better for "
"peasants. I had to swallow my pride and do such work merely to survive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저를 보호해주시면 당신을 섬길게요. 보다시피, 제가 만든 것들을 모두가 좋아하지는 않아요. 제가 온 곳에서는 좋은 검에 대한 수요가 "
"적어요. 농민들에게는 무겁고 값이 싼게 더 좋은 거니까요. 저는 그저 살기위해 자존심을 삼키고 그런 것들을 만들어야만 했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b86236db-3a5d-4920-bb6a-58a8a449efd8"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle's eyes shine with excitement. She hands you a pen and paper.{/n}"
" \"Thank you! Sign here, please... and here. Done! All right! No one can "
"touch a court blacksmith! I will order my apprentices to pack up my "
"materials and take them to the new workshop, which you will kindly provide "
"me with. As soon as I'm settled, I'll send one of my people to deliver your "
"order.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘의 눈은 흥분으로 빛납니다. 그녀는 종이와 펜을 건냅니다.{/n} \"고마워요! 여기에 서명해주세요... 그리고 여기에. "
"해냈다! 좋아! 누구도 궁정 대장장이를 건들지 못 할 거야! 감사하게도 새 공방을 제공해주신다고 하셨으니, 제 도제를 시켜 거기로 짐을 "
"챙겨오도록 할게요. 자리 잡는대로 사람을 보내 당신을 주문을 처리하도록 하겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5583570d-ecf9-42e9-b3b2-10391e7f9e95"
msgid ""
"\"How fortunate! {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, "
"allow me to introduce myself. I am Nazrielle the weaponsmith. I can craft "
"the deadliest weapons mortals can make. I'd like to take the opportunity to "
"pay my respects. As soon as I found out you were here, I dispatched one of "
"my apprentices, but of course the bonehead failed his mission. Would you "
"like to hear an offer that would be to our mutual benefit?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이렇게 운이 좋을 수가! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 부디 소개를 허하소서. 저는 무기 장인 나즈리엘이에요. 저는 필멸자가 "
"만들 수 있는 가장 치명적인 무기를 제작할 수 있어요. 제 능력을 증명할 기회를 주세요. 당신이 여기에 있다는 걸 알자마자 도제 한 명을 "
"보냈는데, 그 멍청이가 역시나 임무에 실패했나 보군요. 서로에게 이익이 될 수 있는 제안을 들어보시지 않을래요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "eda4b5d6-1b1d-4a54-9828-866c156c5cf4"
msgid ""
"\"I know that serving you will allow me to earn true recognition! I'm "
"offering you a contract. You will provide me a workplace and all the "
"necessary resources, and I shall fill your arsenal with perfect instruments "
"of death. More, I will craft for you personally an amazing and deadly "
"weapon, for which there is no equal! I have long been looking for a warrior "
"worthy of this masterpiece.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신을 섬김으로써 제 진가를 드러낼 수 있다고 믿어요! 저는 지금 계약을 제안하고 있는 거예요. 제게 대장간과 필요한 자원을 주시면 "
"완벽한 죽음의 도구들을 당신의 무기고에 채워드릴 게요. 그리고 당신만을 위한 놀랍고도 치명적인 무기를 만들어 줄 수 있죠! 저는 오랫동안 "
"제 걸작에 걸맞는 전사를 찾고 있었거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "c2d13065-38b5-45d6-aa7e-e688ed24857a"
msgid ""
"{n}The elven lady bites her lip.{/n} \"That's a shame. Well, I'll be on my "
"way – to a place where my talents will be truly appreciated!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"그거 안타깝네요. 그럼 저는 가보겠어요. 내 능력을 인정해주는 자가 있는 곳으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Elf_FirstMeeting/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "e462565b-38fa-4c34-914c-41dd738cbc51"
msgid ""
"\"All you need to do is sign the contract and place your first order.\" {n}"
"The elven woman shows you a leather case with a prepared contract.{/n} \"Do "
"we have a deal?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 계약서에 서명하고 첫 주문을 넣어주시기만 하면 돼요.\" {n}엘프 여성은 당신에게 고급 가죽으로 장식된 계약서를 "
"보여줍니다.{/n} \"계약 성립인가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5488543d-894b-432a-870c-f65b696ec880"
msgid "\"I'd like to know more about you.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 더 알고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6e98632c-9a5b-4b0f-b826-fb8fff47e149"
msgid "\"You have one day to leave my domain.\""
msgstr "\"하루 줄 테니 내 영지를 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "16d7cdc1-c638-40ba-b27e-4a710baf5cb8"
msgid "\"Tell me about your craft.\""
msgstr "\"네 능력에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "bd699b7a-7f90-490b-b17b-9f17a725799e"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "ebf0233d-00bd-4644-999f-66df7467aef7"
msgid "\"Tell me about your apprentices.\""
msgstr "\"너의 도제들에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "7e0acc16-c2d6-495e-8fea-1e849d65b304"
msgid "\"Let us discuss it later.\""
msgstr "\"그건 나중에 얘기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "0f7c3828-d692-49e0-af41-3a2933591260"
msgid "\"I heard the news that one of your assistants has gone missing.\""
msgstr "\"네 조수 중 한명이 사라졌다는 얘기를 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "8b879c00-c8dc-4c53-8bf0-b65a23b27c7e"
msgid ""
"\"Take away this dangerous thing. It poisoned the mind of one of your "
"assistants.\""
msgstr "\"이 위험한 물건은 치워버려. 이게 네 조수의 정신을 오염시켰어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "61fc8a31-57e4-4de5-bd15-de163ffc9a99"
msgid ""
"\"Sartayne is dead. He had a vendetta against you for bankrupting his father."
"\""
msgstr "\"사르테인이 죽었어. 자신의 아버지의 복수를 꿈꾸고 있더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "e8939990-99ed-457a-a158-2846d5e66ae1"
msgid "\"You owe Sartayne. I set him free.\""
msgstr "\"사르테인이 너에게 갚아줄게 있더군. 그를 풀어줬다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "efa073d2-b588-4389-88c8-3bfc8fab4c79"
msgid ""
"\"The goods you've been selling are cursed. Would you like to explain "
"yourself?\""
msgstr "\"네가 판 물건들이 저주받았어. 어떻게 된 일인지 설명해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "1d9ec33e-5005-40ad-8404-464cf4512013"
msgid "\"How are the things going in the blacksmith shop?\""
msgstr "\"요즘 대장간은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d20145dd-cc08-467f-a929-73450349a85b"
msgid ""
"{n}A heavily armed {d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d} eyes you suspiciously, but she "
"sounds welcoming enough.{/n} \"Welcome! My apprentice Sartayne just finished "
"unpacking, but I'm already up and running – all the better to serve you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}중무장한 {d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}은 의심스러운 눈초리를 보내고 있지만, 그녀의 목소리는 충분히 환영하는 것처럼 "
"들립니다.{/n} \"어서 오세요! 제 도제 사르테인이 이제 막 짐을 푼 참이지만, 저는 이미 일을 하고 있습니다. 그 덕에 당신을 "
"모시니 오히려 좋네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "10c0da23-2677-4e18-b35e-349acc62d63f"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d} is gazing at you almost without blinking, like "
"an owl.{/n} \"How can I help you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}은 눈도 깜빡하지 않고 당신을 봅니다. 마치 올빼미 같습니다.{/n} \"제가 도와드릴 일이 "
"있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "3856f2e6-0fee-4a89-b903-f54623ddaff4"
msgid ""
"{n}This time {d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d} looks different. There's still fire in "
"her eyes, but her face expresses humility and obedience. Her shoulders are "
"slumped. There's a bruise on her cheek. Her voice is quiet and servile.{/n} "
"\"Welcome! Master Sartayne is busy at the forge. I will do my best to serve "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이번에 {d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}은 다르게 보입니다. 그녀의 눈은 여전히 불타오르고 있지만 표정은 겸손하고 순종적입니다. "
"그녀는 어깨가 축 늘어져 있고 뺨에는 멍이 들었습니다. 그녀의 목소리는 조용하고 굽실거립니다.{/n} \"어서 오세요. 사르테인 주인님은 "
"지금 바쁘십니다. 대신 제가 최선을 다해 모시겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "4d5b03b5-c33d-4e42-9052-dcb172d1d0f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle lowers her eyes and bites her lip.{/n} \"I am but dust in the "
"wind. I'm not worthy of your attention... {mf|sire|mistress}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 눈을 깔고는 입술을 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"저는 바람 속의 먼지에 지나지 않아요. 저는 나으리의 관심을 받을 자격이 "
"없답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "b01a3e73-94c7-45d4-9b37-225325451da2"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle tucks her head into her shoulders.{/n} \"I will pass this "
"message along to the master. It will make him angry.\""
msgstr "{n}나즈리엘은 허리를 펴고 말합니다.{/n} \"이 소식을 주인님께 전하겠습니다. 주인님께서 화가 나시겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "c9476068-8b34-41dd-a837-9e8e720d1508"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle is eyeing you apprehensively.{/n} \"So, you wish to break our "
"contract? This is most unfortunate. You will hardly find a master as skilled "
"as I am, but that doesn't seem to trouble you. Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 알겠다는 듯 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그러니까 계약을 끝내고 싶다고요? 정말 안됐네요. 저처럼 실력 있는 장인은 찾기 "
"힘들 텐데 당신에게는 문제가 되지 않는 것 같네요. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "03fed43c-d0bc-4ac5-ad3e-6aa9af2898e6"
msgid "\"What exactly would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 무엇에 대해 알고싶으세요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "6f80d3ce-621e-4496-aaee-cd371075d18c"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle looks at you suspiciously for a moment, and then nervously "
"brushes her fingers through her hair.{/n} \"My weapons define me. I've been "
"drawn to it since I was a child. I have over three hundred blades at home, "
"each of them special. I wanted to be a professional weaponsmith, so I "
"learned the craft from greatest masters of Kyonin.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 잠시 당신을 의심스럽게 보고는 불안한 듯 손가락으로 머리를 꼽니다.{/n} \"제 무기가 저를 정의하죠. 저는 어렸을 "
"때부터 무기에 빠졌어요. 저는 집에 삼백자루의 칼이 있고, 그 중 평범한 칼은 한 자루도 없어요. 저는 전문 대장장이가 되고 싶었고, "
"그래서 쿄닌에서 가장 뛰어난 장인 밑으로 들어갔죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "da0dd69c-23e4-4dc8-83bc-d0795c3b856d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle juts out her chin.{/n} \"My art! A mere craftsman would attach "
"a piece of wood to a piece of iron, and be happy with their work. That's not "
"how I do it. I listen to a weapon. I talk to it. I spark its desire for "
"blood and violence. This gives you two warriors in the battlefield, the "
"soldier and their sword.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 턱을 빼듭니다.{/n} \"제 작품이죠! 평범한 대장장이는 나무 조각에 철 조각을 끼워 놓고 만족하겠지만, 저는 달라요. "
"저는 무기의 말을 듣고 무기에게 말을 걸죠. 무기에 피와 폭력을 향한 열망을 불어넣어요. 제 검을 든 병사는 더 이상 혼자라고 할 수 "
"없어요. 검과 검을 쥔 자, 두 전사가 전장에 서는 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "bb3241fe-666d-479e-ba43-93216ebc21f4"
msgid "\"Always at your service.\""
msgstr "\"명하신다면 언제든지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "89857877-199c-499b-9c76-fb8ef6868a80"
msgid ""
"{n}The elven woman waves her hand angrily.{/n} \"The boneheads? Why would "
"you care about them? Ah, it doesn't matter anyway. I recruit apprentices for "
"simple tasks. They sign my contracts. They obey me and take full "
"responsibility for any harm they suffer during service. One of them, "
"Sartayne, works in the smithy. The other, Ditael, tests finished weapons and "
"runs errands.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프 여성은 손사래를 칩니다.{/n} \"왜 그 멍청이들에게 신경을 쓰시는 거죠? 뭐, 어쨌든 말씀 드릴게요. 심부름을 시키려고 "
"도제를 고용했어요. 제 말에 전적으로 복종하며, 일하는 동안의 모든 어떤 상해를 입더라도 전적으로 감수하겠다는 계약서를 썼죠. 사르테인은 "
"대장일을 돕고 있고, 디타엘은 무기 검사와 심부름을 맡고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "d1fc23ac-1712-41cf-a249-4a280000d0c7"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Nazriel}Nazrielle's{/d} face is contorted in desperation. Her eyes "
"have a haunted look.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}… To what do we owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}의 얼굴이 절망으로 구겨집니다. 잔뜩 겁에 질린 눈을 하고 있습니다. /n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}... 어인 일로 오셨는지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "8f2f48d9-3176-4fb3-ba66-03cb3f2d9fa2"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle looks at you in disbelief. She spits on the ground in a most "
"non-elfish way, gives you a scornful look, and instead of bidding you "
"farewell, says:{/n} \"Everyone along my path will know that your word is "
"worthless.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 믿을 수 없다는 듯 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 그녀는 엘프에게선 상상도 못할 방식으로 땅에 침을 뱉고는, 작별 인사를 갈음하며 "
"말하길, {/n}\"가는 길마다 소문을 낼 거예요. 당신 말이 얼마나 무가치한지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "3609890b-619a-433a-b853-e6b9526f7de8"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle falls silent for a few seconds, looking very focused. Then she "
"smiles slowly and malevolently:{/n} \"What a spectacular day. Thank you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 몇 초간 곰곰히 생각에 잠깁니다. 그리고는 천천히 사악한 미소를 띱니다.{/n} \"정말 멋진 날이에요. 감사합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "913bb521-660c-46d9-ac5f-7593fb5e5e26"
msgid ""
"{n}The elven woman carefully takes the blade from your hands. She bows "
"politely. There's honey in her voice.{/n} \"I'm terribly sorry. What an "
"unbelievable failure! I would never have allowed a faulty blade to get into "
"your hands! That's what we need quality control for, right?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프 여성은 조심스럽게 당신의 손에서 칼을 받습니다. 그녀는 예의 바르게 인사합니다. 그녀의 목소리는 꿀처럼 달콤합니다.{/n} "
"\"정말 죄송해요. 어쩌다 이런 일이 벌어졌는지 모르겠네요! 당신에게 불량품을 보낼 생각은 추호도 없었어요! 이래서 품질 관리가 "
"필요한가봐요, 그쵸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "822c4b24-d3e0-4715-be67-4e41e807d2d5"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle winces, and looks embarrassed.{/n} \"It's so humiliating that "
"you've learned of it. Something went wrong with my weapon. It was... hm... "
"It was meant to be a gift for you. But Ditael went crazy as he took it. He "
"fell into a fury and ran off. If a faulty blade with my mark gets into "
"someone else's hands, my reputation will be ruined.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 찡그리더니 당황한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신이 이미 알고 있다니 정말 부끄럽네요, 제 무기에 뭔가 문제가 "
"생겼어요. 그건... 음... 원래 당신에게 보낼 선물이었는데, 디타엘이 그걸 받은 순간 미쳐버리더군요. 갑자기 노발대발하더니 도망을 "
"가버렸어요. 그 불량품 칼에 제 인장이 찍혀있는 걸 다른 사람이 보기라도 하면, 제 평판은 박살날 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "b6d87dd5-c063-4792-8359-39bb3412255f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle turns pale as paper.{/n} \"Cursed? Oh goodness... It wasn't me! "
"I didn't do it! It's simply impossible! My creations are impeccable! I'm a "
"master, you know! Such a thing has never happened in my entire life! Nobody "
"could...\" {n}The elven woman falls silent, her lips move, but she doesn't "
"make a sound.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘이 백지처럼 하얗게 질립니다.{/n} \"저주 받았다고요? 오. 세상에... 제가 한게 아니에요! 저는 그런 적 없어요! "
"그럴리가 없는데! 제 작품은 완전무결하다고요! 제 장인정신을 알잖아요! 제 평생 이런 적은 번도 없었어요! 대체 누가...\" {n}엘프 "
"여성은 할 말을 잃었는지, 입술을 달싹 거리면서도 소리를 내진 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "44c4aa14-4dfa-42d7-81fe-f149fe1c4231"
msgid ""
"\"But then my comrades in craft and I... We had a bit of a falling out. A "
"few bastards dared to question my skill. I felt that I could only shed this "
"burden outside Kyonin. And you know what? I swore then that I would prove "
"that I'm head and shoulders above them! Two of them paid the price even when "
"I was working back home. They couldn't stand the competition and went "
"bankrupt. – That's where all my competition is headed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데 공방 동료들과... 좀 문제가 있었죠. 몇몇 개자식들이 감히 내 솜씨를 물고 늘어졌어요. 쿄닌을 떠나야만 이 짐을 벗을 수 "
"있겠구나 싶었죠. 어떻게 된 줄 알아요? 그 뒤로 저는 제가 그놈들 보다 몇 수는 뛰어나다는걸 증명하겠다고 다짐했어요! 그 중 두 놈은 "
"제가 쿄닌을 떠나기 전에 이미 대가를 치렀죠. 경쟁을 이기지 못하고 파산했거든요. 제 모든 경쟁은 바로 이걸 노리고 하는 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "a58a2bca-05e6-4c90-8301-044dd07a66d5"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, help "
"me! I don't think this idiot could have gone far. He may still be near the "
"river. Bring me back the blade, and I will never let you down again, I swear!"
"\" {n}The elven woman falls silent. She frowns, as if trying to remember "
"something.{/n} \"Oh! But of course! Please be sure to save Ditael, my other "
"apprentice. If it's not too much trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 청컨데, 저 좀 도와주세요! 이 멍청이가 그렇게 멀리는 못 갔을 거예요. 제게 검을 가져다주시면 "
"다시는 실망시키지 않을게요! 맹세해요!\" {n}엘프 여성은 입을 다물더니, 무언가 떠올리려는 듯 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"아! 제 "
"조수 디타엘도 구해주시면 좋겠어요! 큰 문제가 되지 않는다면 말이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "ab296bdb-1e8e-44c8-b2ae-3106e1e0df38"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle recovers her voice, and now sounds strangely calm.{/n} \"It's "
"Sartayne. It's him. He's been spoiling my work. No one else could do it. The "
"little bastard tried to tarnish my name.\" {n}There's nothing but cold "
"hatred in Nazrielle's gaze. The tone of her voice is quiet and murderous.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 목소리를 가다듬었고 이상하게 그녀는 침착해 보입니다.{/n} \"사르테인이에요. 그 녀석, 그 녀석이 내 작품을 망치고 "
"있어요. 걔 말고는 그럴 수 가 없어요. 그 쬐끄만 멍청이가 내 이름에 먹칠을 했어요.\" {n}나즈리엘의 시선에는 차가운 증오만이 남아 "
"있습니다. 그녀의 목소리는 조용하지만 섬뜩합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "ed082e9f-056f-4b60-994f-b84a2d531add"
msgid ""
"\"By the right granted to me by our agreement, I am calling upon {mf|Your "
"Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! Sartayne insulted the "
"reputation of the master, to whom you promised protection. I'm asking you to "
"find and kill the bastard. He must be hiding in his hut not far from the "
"capital.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 계약이 보장하는 저의 권리에 따라 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 청합니다! 사르테인은 당신의 보호를 받는 장인의 명성에 "
"먹칠을 했으니, 그 멍청이를 찾아 죽여 주세요. 그는 수도 근처에 있는 자기 오두막에 숨어있을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "dded5550-2d7a-4069-acf4-690fbcd63e29"
msgid ""
"\"I promise you will receive your gift. Please, give me a little more time. "
"I hope the items I send with Sartayne will fend off boredom while you await "
"the arrival of the true masterpiece!\""
msgstr ""
"\"반드시 진상품을 올리겠어요. 부디 조금만 더 시간을 주시길. 제가 사르테인을 시켜 보내는 물건이 진정한 걸작을 받아보실 때까지 "
"기다리는 지루함을 덜어드릴 수 있으면 좋겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "0fe714a5-c8e4-4b8d-8ae4-a518f72caab2"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, I pay close attention to detail. A sharper bevel will allow the "
"blade to cut through the flesh, not into it. Change the angle of the point, "
"and the blade will pierce through armor like a stitching awl without "
"sliding. I learned all this from weapons. You just need to be able to know "
"what you're looking at.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 저는 세세한 부분에 무척 신경쓰죠. 칼날의 사면을 더 예리하게 만들면 칼날이 살에 박히는게 아니라 베고 지나갈 수 있어요. 칼 "
"끝의 각도에 변화를 주면, 마치 송곳처럼 미끄러짐 없이 갑옷을 뚫어버리죠. 전 이 모든 걸 무기에게 배웠어요. 이제 제가 좀 "
"달라보이시나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE_Artisan/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "677ba513-25d2-49ff-ad4f-4cac08be08f4"
msgid ""
"\"Excellent! Wonderful! I fired my apprentices. I've had enough with "
"Sartayne. I work longer hours, of course, but every blade that leaves my "
"forge is my personal responsibility now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아요! 훌륭해요! 도제들은 해고했어요. 사르테인에게 질려 버렸어요. 물론 제가 더 오래 일하게 되겠지만, 제 대장간에서 벼린 모든 "
"검들에는 제가 책임을 져야 하니 어쩔수 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Items/SwordLawDescription_String
msgctxt "30512b0f-9e8f-4081-824e-fdecc29fdfb8"
msgid ""
"This deadly blade was crafted by a true master. The blow never deviates one "
"iota and leaves a very clean cut. Equally good in combat for piercing the "
"enemy's armor and on the scaffold for decapitating a criminal."
msgstr ""
"이 치명적인 칼날은 진정한 장인이 만들었습니다. 그 검격은 한치의 빗나감 없이 상대를 깨끗이 베어버립니다. 전투 중에 적의 갑옷을 뚫는 "
"데에도, 교수대에서 범죄자의 목을 치는 데에도 제격입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Items/SwordLaw_String
msgctxt "696a8356-dbf1-458b-868c-1891cf8e3da3"
msgid "Right of the Powerful"
msgstr "강자의 권리"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Items/VeryValuableGiftDescription_String
msgctxt "9c5589b1-fac1-438c-b08e-487be9ffd35a"
msgid ""
"This weapon was supposed to cast fear on enemies, but for some unknown "
"reason it poisoned the mind of its first owner. The curse has since lost its "
"power, and the sword has now turned into an ordinary blade."
msgstr ""
"이 무기는 적들의 공포를 자아내지만 어떤 이유로 인해 이 무기를 처음 쥔 자의 정신을 미치게 했습니다. 저주가 풀린 이후에는 평범한 검에 "
"지나지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Items/VeryValuableGift_String
msgctxt "bbe6e8f0-4073-4abf-b30d-0e2604734424"
msgid "Nazrielle's Cursed Sword"
msgstr "나즈리엘의 저주받은 검"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_EE_StatGift_Nazrielle/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "85757898-407f-4e0f-91de-41f6a943bc87"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. I have "
"come to applaud the success of your rule. These wild lands grow more and "
"more civilized, and my workshop thrives. I can obtain high-quality raw "
"materials for my creations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 전하의 통치에 찬사를 보내러 찾아 뵈었습니다. 이 야생의 땅이 급속도로 발전하면서 "
"제 가게도 번창하고 있어요. 덕분에 제 작품에 쓸 고급 소재를 얻을 수 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_EE_StatGift_Nazrielle/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f994b8ea-8a84-4d27-ba7d-0bc9cfbd6f44"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! It's "
"encouraging to see your lands thrive so. The population grows, and becomes "
"more organized, and there's more trade of knowledge with our neighbors and "
"with far-away lands. My workshop's supply has also improved. I can now "
"experiment with certain rare materials and techniques.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 당신의 땅이 번창하는 걸 보면서 정말 기운을 받고 있어요. 인구가 늘고, 더욱 "
"조직화되고, 먼 땅의 이웃들과도 지식을 나누는 일도 많아졌죠. 제 공방에도 더 나은 물건이 들어오고 있어요. 이제 희귀 물질에 특이한 "
"기법을 시험해 볼 수 있게 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_EE_StatGift_Nazrielle/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "59fca2b2-28c3-4b6d-b736-693129bc8e21"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to present to you one of my latest creations. It is the "
"embodiment of things I have oft spoken.\""
msgstr "\"제 신작을 받아 주세요. 제 기술의 집합체라고 할 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_EE_StatGift_Nazrielle/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "63d4f0ea-b58f-4e39-afed-d2676b3bf9ba"
msgid ""
"Greetings, my {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}! I am now well known as a "
"master craftsman, and it's all due to your support. My fellows see it as an "
"honor to assist the court weaponsmith. The local community grows and "
"develops, and with it my craft evolves as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하셨나요, 나의 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이시여! 전 이제 명장으로 소문이 났고, 그건 다 보내주신 지원 덕분이예요. 제 "
"동료들은 궁정의 무기제조 작업을 자랑스러워해요. 지역사회가 발전하고 커갈수록, 제 기술도 더 성장하고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_EE_StatGift_Nazrielle/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "f9bb3100-e896-4c11-a83c-fa05060859be"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! As you "
"know, your country's prosperity and relations with other nations have a "
"positive effect on my craft as well. I've learned much from craftsmen who "
"visit from distant lands, and have managed to procure rare crafting "
"materials.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 아시다시피, 왕국의 번영과 타국과의 관계는 제 기술에도 긍정적인 영향을 끼치고 있죠. "
"먼 땅에서 찾아오는 장인들에게 많은 걸 배웠고, 그럭저럭 귀한 공예품을 공급할 수 있었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_EE_StatGift_Nazrielle/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "ef8bd5f3-c659-48c1-aa96-539be315bb9e"
msgid "\"I would like to express my gratitude with this special gift.\""
msgstr "\"이 특별한 선물로 제 감사를 표하고 싶어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "c943189c-0543-42f9-9ab5-bd2c9df7bcbc"
msgid "\"I expect a gift worthy of the favor you've been shown.\""
msgstr "\"네가 보여준 호의에 걸맞는 선물이면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c7a4e7e8-cf94-432c-aa97-4527d3258236"
msgid "\"You respect our deal. That's commendable.\""
msgstr "\"우리 계약을 준수하는군. 칭찬하마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "002d1b4e-e3d6-4a09-8b02-f70f6bad6963"
msgid "\"I want something from you.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 원하는 것이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d692c95b-71e8-4a1f-a708-f0eb1f81cf4f"
msgid ""
"\"I declare you persona non grata. Leave my lands, or you will be punished.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 최후통첩을 하지. 내 땅을 떠나지 않으면 처벌하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "915f3613-b88f-48ef-8856-9b7ff890bcca"
msgid "\"I need a sword that's swift and tough.\""
msgstr "\"날래면서도 튼튼한 검을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "9319f4af-b3d9-4224-ba9e-3efa46e92090"
msgid "\"I need a dagger that's invisible and deadly.\""
msgstr "\"숨기기 좋은 치명적인 단검을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "ab214e8a-59d7-4d28-9fae-158b389e420a"
msgid "\"I could use some flexible and sturdy chainmail.\""
msgstr "\"편안하고 튼튼한 사슬갑옷을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3872920e-4484-4838-8520-a45b4aac89cb"
msgid "\"I need something that can increase my speed.\""
msgstr "\"내 속도를 올려줄 물품을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "86fb515f-cde0-47c0-8bfd-69de37bbc18c"
msgid "\"I'd like a sample of elven metalwork.\""
msgstr "\"엘프 야금술의 표본을 갖고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "57a213f9-13dc-4ca9-a669-39e45c9f500d"
msgid "\"Decide for yourself how you might surprise me.\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 하면 나를 놀래킬 수 있을 지 스스로 궁리해봐라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "22c6e08e-88c8-464c-acaf-592986900c58"
msgid "\"Remind me, who you are and what are you working on?\""
msgstr "\"다시 말해보라, 너는 누구고 하는 일은 무엇이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3c675c1c-e74a-48a6-b948-987472fb0587"
msgid ""
"{n}For the first time, Nazrielle arrives in person to deliver her gifts. "
"She's clearly anxious.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}, I once again apologize for the dirty tricks that Sartayne pulled. "
"I would like to repay your good graces with a truly magnificent gift. But "
"forging it will take time. Meanwhile, please accept this modest present. It "
"isn't spoiled. I checked it three times.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}처음으로 나즈리엘은 직접 자신의 선물을 전달하러 왔습니다. 그녀는 분명 불안해 보입니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}"
", 사르테인이 저지른 일에 대해 다시 한 번 사과드립니다. 정말 멋진 선물로 은혜를 갚고 싶습니다. 하지만 만드는 데는 시간이 걸릴 "
"거예요. 지금은, 여기 이 작은 선물을 받아주세요. 이건 저주 받지 않았어요. 세번이나 확인했거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "344b99c2-22ae-4bed-b495-808d27c934eb"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d} bows ceremoniously.{/n} \"In accordance with our "
"agreement, I have brought you a gift which serves as payment for your "
"protection.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}은 의례적으로 인사를 합니다.{/n} \"계약에 따라, 보호를 해준 보답으로 선물을 가져왔습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "425025e9-ba00-4c59-94ac-82bee913f0a3"
msgid ""
"{n}With an elegant gesture, the elven lady hands you a package.{/n} \"I hope "
"you will appreciate the quality of this gift. It is better than any weapon "
"the local masters can produce.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우아한 동작으로 엘프 여성은 당신에게 선물을 건냅니다.{/n} \"이 선물의 진가를 알아보셨으면 좋겠네요. 이 지역 어느 장인도 "
"이렇게는 못 만들거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "7f688bb2-f9bf-49ec-b291-2d307f895b34"
msgid ""
"{n}A beautiful blade appears in elven lady's hands.{/n} \"I named this blade "
"the Perfection. Its blows are decisive and crushing. It is the embodiment of "
"justice. Strict, severe – remorseless. It will not hesitate to take any "
"life, if {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness} so desires.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아름다운 검이 엘프 여성의 손에 들려있습니다.{/n} \"이 검의 이름은 완벽이에요. 적에게 확실하고 치명적인 타격을 선사하지요. "
"단호하고, 혹독하고, 무자비하게. 그야말로 정의가 칼의 모습을 갖춘 격입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 바라신다면, 무엇이든 "
"지체없이 그 목숨을 빼앗을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "24d34211-bb3f-4a0d-adbd-000fbd5bd0ab"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne bows, polite but not obsequious.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|"
"Your Highness|Your Highness}, I have come to thank you for the favor you did "
"me. I appreciate your protection, and I will make sure you're always "
"satisfied with my work.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 예의바르지만 당당하게 인사합니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 당신이 베풀어 주신 호의에 감사드리러 "
"왔습니다. 당신의 보호에 감사드리며, 제 작업에 항상 만족하시도록 최선을 다하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4be3b43d-2658-4d94-a37d-256b72252736"
msgid "{n}Nazrielle nods slowly.{/n} \"I am all ears.\""
msgstr "{n}나즈리엘은 천천히 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"귀 기울여 듣고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "cf9cbf58-72f5-4679-ba9b-89f2d5abf0db"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle frowns and lowers her head.{/n} \"I'm sorry it turned out this "
"way. But I must obey your orders.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 얼굴을 찡그리고 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"이런 식으로 되어 유감이에요. 하지만 당신의 명령에 따르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "414e4b16-6460-4c71-b355-aaecbaf892ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Nazrielle sighs with relief.{/n} \"I appreciate the opportunity to make "
"up for my mistakes. I can assure you, I never exaggerated my skill when I "
"referred to myself as the best weaponsmith. You'll see it for yourself. Very "
"soon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나즈리엘은 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"실수를 만회할 수 있는 기회를 주셔서 감사드려요. 장담하건대, 제가 최고의 대장장이라고 "
"불리는 것은 과장이 아니에요. 머지 않아 직접 확인할 수 있을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "c28fdb4d-1ddd-4a4c-bf07-8e666d8cf98f"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne grins.{/n} \"I admit, I don't give a damn about agreements. I "
"respect the right of the powerful, and I don't want to suffer "
"{d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d}'s fate.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인는 웃습니다.{/n} \"인정합니다. 나는 합의 따위는 신경 안 써요. 나는 강자의 권리를 존중하며, "
"{d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}의 운명을 겪고 싶지는 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "58706bc6-bacf-4b4a-bf30-45714d92c7b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne raises his eyebrow ironically.{/n} \"So, you don't like me. "
"Well, that's a shame. I'm leaving, but with my head held high, knowing that "
"I've taken my vengeance. The one who devastated my father has been "
"humiliated and dishonored, and it was you who helped me. I am grateful to "
"you. Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 놀랍니다.{/n} \"그래서, 당신은 내가 싫다는 겁니까? 안타깝네요. 그래도 당당히 고개를 들고 떠나도록 하겠습니다. "
"어쨌든 복수는 성공했으니. 제 아버지를 파멸시킨 자는 치욕과 불명예를 얻었고, 그걸 도와준 건 당신이었어요. 감사합니다. 그럼 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "393266a2-e899-418b-9b1d-05152b26a9c6"
msgid ""
"\"This blade will split a horse's hair and troll's skin. I'll make sure of "
"it.\""
msgstr "\"자신있게 말씀드리죠. 이 칼은 말총 한 가닥에서부터 트롤의 거죽까지 뭐든 베어버릴 수 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "59152a7c-9712-4791-9449-16c6e61f6bcf"
msgid ""
"\"Rest assured, my lady apprentice and I won't disappoint you. Nazrielle "
"will work very carefully on our little present for you. Otherwise... Oh, no! "
"Of course, she takes such good care of her skilled hands. She'd never risk "
"losing a single pretty finger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안심하세요, 제 도제 아가씨와 저는 당신을 실망시키지 않을겁니다. 나즈리엘은 당신께 드릴 작은 선물을 아주 신경써서 작업하고 있어요. "
"그걸 망치면... 오! 물론 그럴 일은 없겠지만요. 그녀가 자기 솜씨를 얼마나 아끼는데, 그 예쁜 손가락을 하나라도 잃고 싶지는 않겠죠."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "d9a7776a-a26f-40a4-8265-e3cef893b0bb"
msgid ""
"\"Speed and defense are equally important to a warrior. You shouldn't "
"sacrifice one for the sake of the other. Better to keep both.\""
msgstr "\"전사에게 속도와 방어는 둘 다 중요해요. 하나를 위해 다른 것을 희생할 필요는 없어요. 두가지 모두를 챙기면 되지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "5944d225-a4cb-4d7c-b8df-01f8718f8a3f"
msgid ""
"\"My people have been honing their talents for an eternity. Elven "
"craftsmanship is always the best.\""
msgstr "\"우리 엘프들은 자기 재능을 갈고 닦는데 영원한 세월을 보내왔죠. 엘프의 공예능력은 언제나 최고를 놓친 적이 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "9f6af82b-27cf-4c0e-b58f-3b01dc524433"
msgid "\"I'm doing my best to serve you.\""
msgstr "\"최선을 다해 당신을 섬기겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "d7b9d2d5-6099-42b8-83c3-944b949542ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne bows gracefully and smiles slightly, looking at you.{/n} \"{mf|"
"Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, I am proud to give you "
"this gift. I hope you will find it useful.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 우아하게 인사하고 당신을 보며 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 이 선물을 드리게 되어 "
"기쁩니다. 유용하게 쓰시길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "d7fbf950-5f94-4f85-8171-1bf9cfd7ee63"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne readily shifts forward. There's a quiet smile on his face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사르테인은 준비라도 한 듯 앞으로 나아갑니다. 그의 얼굴에는 잔잔한 미소가 걸려있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "72269852-fb51-4d2e-9576-172c24fee6da"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne bows very politely.{/n} \"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your "
"Highness|Your Highness}, I have brought gifts to repay you for your "
"protection.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 예의바르게 인사합니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 당신의 보호에 대한 보답으로 진상품을 가져왔습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_ElvenFemWeaponmasterLE/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "98d5b00c-8dd5-4b67-a93b-5da76f0b33b3"
msgid ""
"\"I am Nazrielle, your official court weaponsmith. I am a master smith, and "
"create weapons most elegant and deadly. – Rapiers, daggers, long and short "
"swords. Sometimes I make chainmail, or other special equipment which can "
"improve its wearer's speed in battle. I hold something special in my mind – "
"a design for a longsword that will strengthen its bearer's defense and "
"accuracy. This sword will be my greatest creation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나즈리엘이에요, 당신의 공식적인 궁정 무기 제작자죠. 저는 대장장이고, 가장 우아하면서도 치명적인 무기를 만들어요. - 레이피어, "
"단검, 장검과 소검 같은 거요. 가끔 사슬 갑옷이나, 아니면 전투 중 착용자의 속도를 향상시킬 수 있는 특별한 장비도 만들죠. 지금은 "
"뭔가 특별한 걸 생각중인데 -사용자의 방어와 정확성을 강화시켜주는 장검의 디자인이예요. 이 검이 제 가장 위대한 작품이 될 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "205663a9-3678-4605-980b-76be861a6c15"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6551dd32-ace2-44e2-87c3-bd02fe4a55ed"
msgid "\"Tell me about Nazrielle.\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "13c01697-16dd-4979-b2c8-ef1bf79c878b"
msgid "\"I'll see what I can do.\""
msgstr "\"내가 할 수 있는 일을 찾아보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "98a853f8-b197-48c9-a960-9f285e16c45d"
msgid "\"Does Nazrielle mistreat you?\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘이 너를 괴롭혔나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "b1101128-8805-4c64-8a54-fdbcb16ced65"
msgid "\"What gift are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 선물을 말하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "845a69a6-1923-4d6c-a7cc-5cc163ae5e72"
msgid "\"Extend my gratitude to Nazrielle.\""
msgstr "\"내 감사의 인사를 나즈리엘에게 전해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a6f43323-377b-429b-a74d-4888cca4d0e1"
msgid "\"I have a specific request to your mistress.\""
msgstr "\"네 주인에게 특별한 요청을 하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "c88e2906-99da-4683-830d-2207377e619a"
msgid "\"Nazrielle has one day to leave my domain.\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘은 내일까지 내 땅을 떠나야 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "9b1eed58-fbab-4111-a815-95f3cecb617d"
msgid "\"I need a dagger that's invisible and deadly.\""
msgstr "\"숨기기 좋은 치명적인 단검을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "be688032-5358-4c0d-99ba-21389f405865"
msgid "\"I could certainly use some flexible and sturdy chainmail.\""
msgstr "\"난 유연하면서도 튼튼한 사슬 갑옷을 입고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "e3782bd8-f0be-41aa-9b69-32716a87f2d6"
msgid ""
"\"Is there anything Nazrielle can do to make me swifter on the battlefield?\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘이 내가 전장에서 더 민첩하게 움직일 수 있게끔 해 줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "3fdcd20f-34ec-47e8-a3b9-7075a22e08aa"
msgid "\"I'd like a sample of her elven metalwork.\""
msgstr "\"엘프 야금술의 표본을 갖고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "27c6fa75-c37a-493b-96e1-53553794b26e"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind. Let Nazrielle think of something herself.\""
msgstr "\"맘이 바뀌었다. 나즈리엘 스스로 생각하라고 전해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "2309200e-60ae-4e58-968b-0559bdf54c4c"
msgid "\"I need a sword that's swift and tough.\""
msgstr "\"날래면서도 튼튼한 검을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f78df191-f5d2-4a39-83e0-81e0044caf38"
msgid ""
"{n}A pathetic-looking elf stands before you. His clothes are wrinkled, his "
"cheek is scratched, and his nose is swollen like he's suffered a heavy blow. "
"He glances around with a haunted look, and bows.{/n} \"My name is Sartayne. "
"Mistress {d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d} was supposed to have given me a gift for "
"{mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}, but... I'm afraid, "
"we might have a bit of a problem here...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}불쌍해 보이는 엘프가 당신 앞에 서있습니다. 그의 옷은 구겨졌고 그는 구타를 당했는지 코가 부어있고 얼굴에 상처가 났습니다. 그는 "
"넋이 나간 얼굴로 주변을 살피다 당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"{/n} \"제 이름은 사르테인입니다. {d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}"
" 주인님이 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 선물을 드렸어야 했는데... 유감스럽지만, 여기 문제가 좀 있는 것 같습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d8eb3b83-da8c-4c78-ad85-0f7987d776e0"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf eyes you in astonishment.{/n} \"Me? I'm Sartayne, assistant and "
"servant of Mistress Nazrielle. She teaches me her craft. I've been dreaming "
"of becoming a weaponsmith ever since I was a child. My father was a master, "
"too. His swords were famous. Unfortunately, he went bankrupt while I was "
"still too young to learn. He withered away and never got to teach me his "
"skills. But the Mistress gave me another chance!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 놀라서 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"저요? 전 나즈리엘님의 조수 사르테인입니다. 그분 밑에서 기술을 배우고 있습니다. 저는 "
"어렸을 때부터 대장장이를 꿈꿔왔습니다. 우리 아버지도 장인이었어요. 아버지의 검은 유명했죠. 불행히도, 제가 어려서 기술을 배우기도 전에 "
"파산하셨습니다. 그 뒤로 몸이 약해지셔서 저에게 기술을 가르쳐 주지도 못하셨죠. 하지만 나즈리엘이 제게 또 다른 기회를 주었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "7cfa692e-279e-40f7-abbd-4bfa5cdcc277"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf's enthusiasm is almost pathetic.{/n} \"I'm Mistress Nazrielle's "
"assistant. It's a great honor! She's a genius! Her knowledge of weapons "
"knows no bounds. Although... although it's scary sometimes, you know. "
"Anyway, I'm not complaining. I'm happy to serve her.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프의 광기는 불쌍해보이기까지 합니다.{/n} \"저는 나즈리엘 주인님의 조수입니다. 참으로 대단한 영광이죠! 그녀는 천재에요! "
"무기에 대한 그녀의 지식은 정말이지 한계가 없죠. 아시다시피 가끔... 가끔 무서울 때가 있긴 하지만요. 어쨌든 불만은 없습니다. 그분을 "
"모시게 되서 기뻐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "133b1670-8ae9-4fcf-acf3-3d3a1b6a2fe5"
msgid "{n}The elf bows low once again.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘프는 다시 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "f91755f2-51a1-47c5-906a-f1d93bef3a89"
msgid ""
"\"Mistress Nazrielle has been working hard on a special gift for you. But "
"one of her apprentices, Ditael, went mad after he touched the blade that was "
"meant to be presented to you. He grabbed it and just ran off as fast as he "
"could – I saw it with my own eyes! Now Ditael is missing! I've come to you "
"in secret to ask for your help. Maybe you or one of your advisors could get "
"to the bottom of this. My Mistress would rather see the whole thing buried. "
"After all, the sword that drove him mad was meant for you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나즈리엘님은 당신께 드릴 특별한 선물을 작업하고 계십니다. 근데 도제 디타엘이 당신께 드릴 무기를 쥐는 순간 미쳐버렸죠. 그걸 쥐고 "
"도망가버렸어요. 제가 직접 봤거든요! 지금은 디타엘이 어디로 갔는지 모르겠습니다! 그래서 당신께 도움을 청하러 왔습니다. 당신의 "
"보좌관들로 하여금 진상을 규명해주십사 부탁드리려고요. 제 주인은 이 소식이 퍼지지 않기를 원합니다. 사정이 어떻든, 당신께 드릴 검이 "
"그를 미치게 만들었으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "41ea1c5b-83a9-42e1-8525-d9e718673880"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf throws up his hands in fear.{/n} \"Not at all! She's the most "
"magnificent weaponsmith I've ever met in my entire life! I'm lucky she even "
"noticed me! She's made me so happy! I wish I weren't so stupid and clumsy, "
"or I'd be more worthy to help her! But I try as hard as I can.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 공포에 질려 손사래를 칩니다.{/n} \"아니예요! 그분은 제가 만나 본 대장장이 중 최곱니다! 그분의 눈에 든 것만 해도 "
"행운이라고요! 그분과 일해서 행복합니다! 제가 멍청하고 서투르지만 않았어도 그분을 더 잘 도울 수 있었을겁니다! 지금도 최선을 다하고 "
"있긴 하지만요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "71978651-454c-4666-b03d-58243e02245b"
msgid ""
"{n}Sartayne shrugs.{/n} \"I don't know. The Mistress said I couldn't touch "
"it. But I heard her ask Ditael to take it to you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사르테인은 어깨를 들썩입니다.{/n} \"모르겠습니다. 주인님이 저보고는 만지지 말라 하셨어요. 하지만 디타엘에게 그걸 당신께 "
"가져다 주라고 하시는 건 들었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "012f210f-8d20-4de9-b34d-a55f0a870c64"
msgid ""
"{n}The apprentice bows low and speaks as if reading a note.{/n} \"On behalf "
"of Mistress {d|Nazriel}Nazrielle{/d}, I would like to wish you eternal "
"health and express our gratitude for your kind protection.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도제는 인사를 하고는 책을 읽듯이 말합니다.{/n} \"{d|Nazriel}나즈리엘{/d}님을 대신해 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 만수무강을 비나이다. 또한 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 친절한 보호에 감사를 표하고자 합니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "05a72b22-9d68-4313-992d-2fb3845577e3"
msgid ""
"\"My Mistress wanted me to present you with this gift. She hopes that you "
"would be satisfied with it.\""
msgstr "\"주인님께서 당신께 선물을 전하라 하셨습니다. 주인님은 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 기뻐하셨으면 좋겠다 하셨어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "2c790c77-ce33-436d-a83c-1a7229fd8884"
msgid "{n}The elf bows low and vanishes silently.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘프는 인사하고 조용히 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6852341f-a484-4e2e-a6c8-d33a3c6dd477"
msgid ""
"\"Oh... Oh no... This will make the Mistress very, very angry...\" {n}The "
"elf shrinks and backs away in fear.{/n}"
msgstr "\"오... 오. 안 돼... 주인님께서 화를 내실 거야...\" {n}엘프는 몸을 움츠리고 공포에 질려 물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "52851a74-8f2e-4839-a160-f3851813acac"
msgid "\"I will give your order to the Mistress exactly as I hear it.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 분부를 들은 그대로 주인님께 전하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/KTC_Quest_ElvenFemaleWeaponsmithLE/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "f336c3e8-f4fe-41b4-9643-9c1662ca1411"
msgid "\"Mistress Nazrielle will hear your command, word for word.\""
msgstr "\"나즈리엘님은 당신의 명을 토씨하나 빠짐 없이 받들 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Barks/FeyFight1_String
msgctxt "a930788c-5133-47dc-b89e-93499fba84cf"
msgid "\"Run while you can!\""
msgstr "\"도망칠 수 있을 때 도망가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Barks/FeyFight2_String
msgctxt "86a8075c-028c-495b-b8d9-bc92921f2ea6"
msgid "\"What the…\""
msgstr "\"이 무슨…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Barks/FeyFightBeginning_Satyr_String
msgctxt "5d9bb77f-0eb0-4000-9577-ac9828b2136c"
msgid "\"Rise and shine! Get up, you lousy runts! Attack!\""
msgstr "\"어서 일어나! 멍청이들아! 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Barks/FeyFight_FeyGo_String
msgctxt "e0329210-610c-47b9-998b-f6abd81c7dcb"
msgid "\"Ohhh, my head…\""
msgstr "\"아이고... 머리야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Barks/FeyJokesters_DryadBark_String
msgctxt "615e7497-2bf2-452a-a251-ead582e4a2fe"
msgid "\"Farewell, Ged.\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 제드.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ba220c8e-def7-403d-ad4b-af54375c139c"
msgid "\"How did you end up here?\""
msgstr "\"어쩌다 여기에 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "afa609a9-0cf9-438c-9a27-518404fcd5ec"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem… O fey! Thou art too cruel to the woeful creature, so conquered by "
"thine beauty! His heart is bleeding. He stands idly for all the day, staring "
"into loneliness. How can you ask his spirit not to sing, nor his knees to "
"tremble at your fair image? Deliver your mercy! Return to Kimiel, for no one "
"can ever love you as he!\""
msgstr ""
"\"에헴... 오, 페이여! 그대의 아름다움에 매료된 불쌍한 존재에게 너무나 잔인하구나! 그의 심장이 피를 흘리고 있도다. 그는 하루 "
"종일 멍하니 서서 외로움을 곱씹고 있노라. 어찌 그의 영혼이 노래하지 못하게 하는가? 어찌 그의 오금이 네 아름다움 앞에 저릴 수 없게 "
"하는가? 자비를 베풀어라 페이여! 키미엘에게 돌아가라. 그 누구도 그처럼 너를 사랑할 순 없으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "07eb42ba-c092-4b8d-b834-8d9984fdfe41"
msgid ""
"Threatened to burn down the dryad's forest if she didn't accept Kimo's "
"advances."
msgstr "그녀가 키모의 제안을 거부하다면 드라이어드의 숲을 불태우겠다고 협박합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3f744f8a-0050-4f4b-b735-01ff42488873"
msgid ""
"\"Just keep going out with Kimo like before… or I'll burn down your precious "
"oak. And all the entire forest along with it.\""
msgstr "\"키모와 예전처럼 지내도록... 그렇지 않으면 네 소중한 오크나무들을 태워버리겠다. 숲 전체를 통째로 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f16d9745-d629-42e3-aa82-0db27bf43aab"
msgid ""
"\"Kimo is a talented craftsman. But ever since you rejected him, he's lost "
"all inspiration. His gift is going to waste. Please, let him see you and "
"talk to you – at least in the name of art.\""
msgstr ""
"\"키모는 타고난 장인이야. 하지만 네가 그를 거부한 이후로 그는 영감을 잃었어. 그의 재능이 버려지고 있어. 부디 그와 만나줘. 예술을 "
"생각해서라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "5a71842a-a059-4386-9914-8917f43437e2"
msgid "\"Why have you rejected Kimo?\""
msgstr "\"왜 키모를 쫓아냈지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "b43e1ff3-b288-4101-8179-c3598423e768"
msgid "\"I'm done trying to persuade you. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"너를 설득하는 것도 질렸어. 그럼 이만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e250d72e-b06f-42d2-a3d6-bcfb59adfea9"
msgid ""
"{n}You recognize a dryad that you saw some time ago with a drunken satyr. "
"Her skin glistens like polished wood, and her head is crowned with a mane of "
"grass and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 이전에 술취한 사티로스와 함께 있던 드라이어드를 발견했습니다. 그녀의 피부는 빛났고 그녀는 머리에 풀과 나뭇잎으로 만든 "
"왕관을 썼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "89e18730-81f8-4750-9e62-793d176ab61c"
msgid ""
"\"Here you are! I knew you'd come to try and change my mind. Kimo talks "
"about you every day, you know.\""
msgstr "\"어서와! 네가 나를 설득하러 올 줄 알았지. 키모가 하루도 빠짐없이 네 얘기를 했거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "6c432f7c-2bc8-4b3d-ad12-b011f71d073d"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad pouts.{/n} \"No, no and no! I won't be with him, and that's "
"that. I'm tired and I want to be left alone. I'm done with this!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드라이어드가 뾰루퉁해집니다.{/n} \"안돼! 싫어! 안해! 걔랑 사귀지 않을 거고, 그게 다야. 난 이제 지쳤고 혼자 있고 싶어. "
"이걸로 끝이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "aebc2bfd-02c7-46d8-bc61-cdc2c37bf320"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad covers her mouth in terror.{/n} \"No… I beg you, don't! I'll do "
"whatever you say… Tell him to come to me…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드라이어드는 공포에 질려 입을 벌립니다.{/n} \"아니야... 제발 그러지마! 시키는 대로 다 할게... 그를 이 곳으로 "
"불러줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "afd8ecd8-6b59-4d99-a7a8-ff3d6fc67411"
msgid ""
"{n}The fey sighs and rolls her eyes.{/n} \"I am sick and tired of this! Why "
"did fate pick me to be sacrificed to art?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}페이는 한숨을 쉬고 시선을 외면합니다.{/n} \"지겨워 죽겠네 정말! 운명이란 작자가 왜 나를 예술의 희생양으로 삼으려는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "338225c0-3793-4194-b456-39b0653c83a6"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad is standing half-turned to you, hugging her shoulders with her "
"arms. At the end of your speech, she pats her eyes dry with a small oak "
"leaf.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}드라이어드는 양 팔로 어깨를 감싼 채로 반쯤 몸을 돌려 당신을 봅니다. 당신의 일장 연설이 끝나자 그녀는 작은 오크 나무 잎으로 "
"눈물을 닦습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "14fcf68a-ae20-4e70-a779-15cbf62948b4"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, 'end up'? I live here. I grew up in this forest together "
"with my magnificent oak. If there's anyone who's 'ended up' here, it's you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 말이야? '왔다'니? 나는 여기에 살아. 나는 이 숲에서 내 떡갈 나무와 함께 자랐다구. 여기에 '찾아온' 사람이 있다면, 그건 "
"바로 너야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "5b91873d-20fd-4da2-90fd-e73d2a936c67"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad shrugs.{/n} \"Maybe I just grew tired of him? I don't even "
"know. He's so… two-dimensional. There's no intrigue to him. Everything he "
"does is so predictable! All the flowers, all the compliments… I've had "
"enough, thank you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드라이어드는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"아마 그에게 질려서 그런 걸까? 모르겠어. 그는 너무... 평면적이야. 기발하지 "
"못하다고. 뭘하든 다 뻔하단 말야! 꽃이며, 칭찬이며... 됐어. 이젠 사양할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6934acaf-f907-4653-99f4-89198ec32cd7"
msgid ""
"\"Oh well, you win. The artist can come back. It's not like I've got "
"anything better to do around here…\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 이겼어. 그 예술가를 데려와. 나도 여기 더 있어봤자 좋을 것도 없고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Dryad/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "301da0fc-2235-48f0-9ded-5108f282b6bf"
msgid ""
"\"O Shelyn! What do you do to us, you treacherous goddess? I know not myself "
"what arises in me. But hurry now, o messenger of love! Find Kimo at once and "
"tell him that his beloved cannot wait for his return.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 셸린! 믿을 수 없는 여신이여! 우리에게 무슨 짓을 한거죠? 내게 무슨 일이 생겼는지 모르겠지만, 오, 사랑의 전령이여! 단숨에 "
"키모에게 달려가 그대의 연인이 간절히 재회를 바라고 있다고 전해주오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1d7c2ac6-1d2a-4518-8df5-47e8f4a3281c"
msgid "{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen} {name}, rightful ruler of these lands.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕} {name}. 이 땅의 적법한 통치자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "52c52a60-7242-482b-888c-e142a757ecfe"
msgid "\"None of your business.\""
msgstr "\"네가 상관할 바 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9387af36-b657-48b9-b4c3-624960cac614"
msgid "[Attack] \"I didn't come here to talk. Die, scum!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너와 얘기하러 온 게 아니다. 죽어라, 쓰레기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "877af9e9-dfc2-4fbd-9947-1409871ffb6a"
msgid "\"Why do keep upsetting the locals?\""
msgstr "\"왜 계속 주민들을 못살게 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "e5bcfccd-6197-4017-904b-937bb6e7dc83"
msgid ""
"[In a loud voice] \"I was just passing through when I saw you and I thought "
"to myself: 'why, I should come pay my respects!'\""
msgstr "[큰 목소리로] \"지나가다 너를 봤는데 갑자기 이런 생각이 들더군. '뭐지, 가서 경의를 표해야 겠는데!'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "70a6406e-103d-4083-9776-da6a06b7c6f2"
msgid ""
"\"How can I persuade you to allow the villagers to live in peace, and depart "
"these lands for good?\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 설득하면 당신이 영원히 이 땅을 떠나, 마을 사람들 평화롭게 살도록 할 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3e835459-3ac4-4e0c-a147-c1902dc01f76"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have said that. Make peace with your gods!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그런 식으로 말을 하면 안 되지. 네 신들 곁으로 보내주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "9d1ed7c8-c134-41ee-9d93-4eab59022c20"
msgid "\"Leave, and never come back. I won't repeat myself.\""
msgstr "\"가서 다시는 돌아오지 마. 두번 말하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "35a5c16f-28ed-4abf-a2b6-cdd682e40462"
msgid ""
"\"Wait. Are you talking about Kimo – the elven craftsman who's in love?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 사랑에 빠진 엘프 장인 키모 얘길 하는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "37f3182e-1057-4c93-87f2-382624c6a2d4"
msgid "[Pass the bottle to the satyr] \"Here's your medicine.\""
msgstr "[사티로스에게 병을 건넵니다] \"여기 네 약이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "27856a9f-6057-4062-af03-6035f3a811b7"
msgid "\"What are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 말하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "956850bc-fa02-4cae-bd6a-aa76a511e644"
msgid "\"I must go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "9ef302b3-8ff5-4dc3-8bdf-80751abd1a3d"
msgid "\"Alright, alright. Sorry about that.\""
msgstr "\"알았다, 알았어. 그건 사과하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "60d8025d-7d59-451d-8bd3-f296e8fbc0e4"
msgid "[In an even louder voice] \"Huh?! You were saying?!\""
msgstr "[더 큰 목소리로] \"응?! 뭐라고?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "378ea938-1f70-481d-8cfb-5fe6ece5de91"
msgid "\"Whoops, sorry. I didn't mean to.\""
msgstr "\"오. 미안. 그러려던 건 아니었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "af537c29-251a-478b-9043-a0af23b9cd6e"
msgid "[Screaming] \"What?! Why are you whispering?! Speak up, please!\""
msgstr "[비명] \"뭐?! 왜 속삭이는 거야?! 좀 크게 말해 줄래?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3b4c52b9-488f-4382-98c2-f99828dbd2f5"
msgid ""
"{n}The foul, nauseating stench of morning-after breath permeates the glade. "
"Fey of all sizes and shapes litter the ground, sleeping on the grass side by "
"side, some of them scarcely clothed. A drowsy satyr squints in pain and "
"shifts his heavy gaze to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아침에 막 일어난 뒤의 입냄새 같은 불쾌하고 구역질나는 악취가 공터에 가득합니다. 각양각색의 페이들이 바닥을 굴러다니거나 자고 있고 "
"몇몇은 거의 헐벗었습니다. 피곤해 보이는 사티로스가 눈꺼풀을 천천히 들어 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "9bda499b-a92f-49f7-b775-28b3958b0f9d"
msgid "\"Curses… Who is it? Who's there?\""
msgstr "\"젠장... 누구야? 거기?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "e3875c0a-caa7-43c1-8381-c4636c2ccbe7"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr winces.{/n} \"Quiet, quiet, you hornless devil… What you want "
"here?\""
msgstr "{n}사티로스가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"조용히 해. 이 뿔 없는 데블아... 여기 뭐하러 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "755fac67-8821-455b-88df-b118a3320848"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I swear I could tell that just by looking at your puffed up chest… "
"What you want?\""
msgstr "\"하! 딱 네 뻐기는 꼴만 봐도 바로 알겠군... 원하는 게 뭔데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "d9569628-e54b-4a87-814a-3cb83d1a6406"
msgid ""
"\"Some of them forget their place… We won't stand by while some pointy-eared "
"oaf frolics with our girls!\""
msgstr "\"꼭 자기 분수를 모르는 놈이 있기 마련이지… 멍청한 귀쟁이 자식이 우리 여자애한테 농탕치는건 못참아주겠다 이거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "f6ac63da-48ce-4560-b0db-58e3199bc7bb"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! A midget {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} of a midget country… What you "
"want?\""
msgstr "\"하! 멍청한 나라의 멍청한 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이군... 원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6de8e94f-9ee5-4395-8a7d-347350640ecd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! With a muzzle like that? You could at least file the tusks down first… "
"What you want?\""
msgstr "\"하! 그런 주둥이를 가지고? 먼저 엄니부터 다듬는게 나을텐데... 원하는 게 뭔데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "59f074db-732f-4e5b-afc8-c1e5e1f3cc27"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr stares at you with an expression of pure agony on his face.{/n} "
"\"Ga-a-ah, what the hell. I couldn't care less about your damn villagers… My "
"head's splitting in two. Just bring me a drink. The poison is the cure, you "
"know? You bring me a drink, and I'll take the gang home. It's not like I'm "
"ever going to change her mind, that scatterbrain...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스는 고통으로 얼굴을 찡그리며 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"끄응, 제기랄. 네 망할 주민들은 신경도 못 쓰겠군... 머리가 "
"둘로 쪼개질 거 같아. 마실 것 좀 줘. 치료의 물약 알지? 물약을 주면 그 말썽쟁이 녀석들을 집으로 돌려 보내주지. 이런다고 그 "
"덜렁대는 여자의 마음을 바꿀 수 있을 것 같지도 않고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ccbca32d-7d24-48c9-83d7-dd6ce0483834"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr hisses, covering his eyes with his hand:{/n} \"In the name of "
"all that's good and fair, lower your voice…\""
msgstr "{n}사티로스는 손으로 얼굴을 덮으며 말합니다.{/n} \"정의와 자비의 이름으로 명하노니, 목소리 좀 낮춰라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "556b8928-4653-4681-89aa-46b0ee7375ec"
msgid ""
"{n}The poor creature gives a weak moan.{/n} \"By the gods, why are you "
"yelling so loud…\""
msgstr "{n}그 불쌍한 크리처가 겨우 신음을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"오. 신이시여. 왜 이렇게 소리를 빽빽 지르는 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "7adb7271-f900-4e89-8fb5-e730a923ef6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Baring his teeth in a grin, the satyr reluctantly rises.{/n} \"Rise and "
"shine, you drunkards! We're going home!\""
msgstr "{n}사티로스는 씩 웃더니 일어섭니다.{/n} \"일어나! 이 주정뱅이들아! 집에 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "ae3b6012-4181-4be5-8d50-45f88dd21710"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr huffs a dull laugh.{/n} \"You're just full of yourself, aren't "
"you?\""
msgstr "{n}사티로스가 실소를 터트립니다.{/n} \"이거 완전 자신만만 하구만?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "48ace223-d639-4b64-9b23-2143763cf2f3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you know him? How sweet. You can tell him he'll not be getting "
"anywhere with her. That sorry sack of stones doesn't need anyone except her "
"tree…\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그놈을 알아? 귀엽군. 그놈한테 어딜가더라도 그녀랑 사귀진 못 할거라 전해줘. 그 한심한 돌대가리는 그냥 나무랑 놀라고 "
"하라고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "eb0b3862-41f8-4e9f-9b57-0336291c5fe6"
msgid "\"Get lost, go talk to that elf of yours! See if I care!\""
msgstr "\"꺼져, 네 엘프하고나 얘기해! 내가 신경이나 쓸 것 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "04e31880-81ab-4760-91f4-b02478556c8f"
msgid ""
"\"Huh, not bad… It's no fun playing tricks on those dim-witted farmers "
"anyway. Farewell, then. I'm not going to miss your face.\""
msgstr "\"흠. 나쁘지 않군... 그 멍청한 농부들을 괴롭히는 것도 질리던 참이니. 그럼 안녕, 네 얼굴이 별로 그립진 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "5b084d78-2d8e-415c-a56d-4d5b42b6b198"
msgid "\"You again…\""
msgstr "\"또 너냐…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "5ceadbf5-0fde-487f-8d21-2c007b41e658"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr waves at you dismissively.{/n} \"I'm not bowing to you. You've "
"no power over me…\""
msgstr "{n}사티로스는 귀찮다는 듯 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"나한테 인사 받을 생각 마라. 나는 네 종이 아니야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "e004ebb9-d806-4df9-a89d-f680e88c5177"
msgid "{n}The satyr sighs in relief, massaging his temples.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사티로스는 안도의 한숨을 쉬며 관자놀이를 문지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FeyJokesters/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "c545303e-4c90-4639-bfe8-a602c54c822a"
msgid ""
"{n}The tormented satyr grabs his head in desperation, as his face turns into "
"a grimace of pain and fear.{/n} \"Alright! I get it! We're leaving! Get up, "
"you bastards! We're going home!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}괴로워하던 사티로스가 자포자기 하듯 머리를 움켜쥡니다. 그의 얼굴이 고통과 공포로 일그러집니다.{/n} \"좋아! 알겠어! 갈게! "
"일어나라, 이 자식들아! 집에 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8e209c15-9209-4bbb-9353-b54b857ddfba"
msgid "\"An odd name for an elf.\""
msgstr "\"엘프 치곤 이상한 이름이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "464bc21d-1d53-4a25-9321-8d203790f3d9"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "88b51d06-9d9a-49c5-b524-db85345f47be"
msgid "\"What should I call you?\""
msgstr "\"네 이름이 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0006_Text_1
msgctxt "fc34f7a8-6e68-4349-8651-9c4e15e90a10"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "507cf1fb-932c-4ce6-b457-7b2e69095cfe"
msgid "\"Concerning your request…\""
msgstr "\"네 부탁에 관해서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0008_Text_1
msgctxt "d69260d9-8372-4395-92f5-789ebf1f8c17"
msgid "\"Concerning your request...\""
msgstr "\"네 부탁에 관해서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "a21cae15-ed07-46af-b8fd-42efc1ce630b"
msgid "\"What sort of help do you need?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 도움이 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0012_Text_1
msgctxt "632c0121-e3cb-4b07-81ec-7ee3cbdb647f"
msgid "\"What sort of help do you need?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 도움이 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "3d9335ab-bd09-4c12-85b3-58599d2b1fc7"
msgid ""
"\"I can't agree to anything before I know what exactly it is you need…\""
msgstr "\"뭘 원하는지 정확히 얘기하기 전까진 아무것도 들어줄 생각 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0014_Text_1
msgctxt "91449741-4f42-4287-b06a-02490e3c9693"
msgid "\"I can't agree to anything before I know what exactly you need...\""
msgstr "\"뭘 원하는지 정확히 얘기하기 전까진 아무것도 들어줄 생각 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "8e305b5a-c12e-4e63-8e1c-0fc88374511a"
msgid "\"And what do I get in return if I help you?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 도우면 나는 무엇을 얻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0016_Text_1
msgctxt "ce1c28d0-f5e8-496e-a344-e546517c42df"
msgid "\"And what do I get if I help you?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 도우면 나는 무엇을 얻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "e2ce7b68-2869-4126-9d1e-284b3c3dcecc"
msgid "\"So be it, I will help you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너를 돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0017_Text_1
msgctxt "252614b4-a461-4305-9576-ccf2dc8597f7"
msgid "\"So be it. I will help you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너를 돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "5a4571fb-2ea6-46d9-bd7f-8d7ba8def257"
msgid "\"Is this the flower you were looking for?\""
msgstr "\"이 꽃이 네가 찾던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0020_Text_1
msgctxt "884b0d36-78e8-4f2a-b9c9-8c3e933d7af0"
msgid "\"Is this the flower you were looking for?\""
msgstr "\"이 꽃이 네가 찾던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "385c5341-8937-47bd-a041-0aae8511b58b"
msgid "\"I have no time for this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이럴 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0022_Text_1
msgctxt "b6f880de-643a-49b0-a36b-e5c0d9d45275"
msgid "\"I have no time for this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이럴 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "705b9a08-d997-452d-aa7b-85d31eb1a551"
msgid "\"You still haven't told me what you want from me.\""
msgstr "\"아직 네가 원하는게 뭔지 말하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0027_Text_1
msgctxt "59f403c9-7d00-443c-90fc-d83dd96df058"
msgid "\"You still haven't told me what you want from me...\""
msgstr "\"아직 네가 원하는게 뭔지 말하지 않았어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "d6149d9c-dee2-4262-acc6-96b5f983d9ff"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0029_Text_1
msgctxt "abe9d857-382a-4128-ae49-97e5aa073a6b"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "6bdf7d4e-a445-4c19-ae09-89363ac2e912"
msgid "\"I've already agreed to help you…\""
msgstr "\"이미 널 돕겠다 했지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0033_Text_1
msgctxt "ce1da83e-1373-4f94-8df9-9614ad39e8f4"
msgid "\"I've already agreed to help you...\""
msgstr "\"이미 널 돕겠다 했지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "3693b167-c86d-4847-a9d2-dfb429ea761a"
msgid "[Sigh] \"Yes, I will help you…\""
msgstr "[한숨] \"그래. 너를 돕겠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0034_Text_1
msgctxt "0e2dc7c3-bc6e-4910-a33d-5945649d7851"
msgid "\"Very well.\""
msgstr "\"아주 좋군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "692fa4ec-71b7-4f3e-b43b-ac9b5f13ad07"
msgid "\"No. You're on your own.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 너 알아서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0035_Text_1
msgctxt "a0de1b64-2d72-46cd-8968-68dafae2ca75"
msgid "\"No way. You're on your own.\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 너 알아서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "1dd99744-fe70-43ec-be98-0408850f14c1"
msgid "\"Alright then. I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 이제 가볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0039_Text_1
msgctxt "ad7bb71d-dfce-4309-a935-5e6dc56a29e8"
msgid "\"All right then. I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 그럼 나는 가보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "8a1f564b-18e1-4339-9711-7ed2406438f0"
msgid "\"If you agree to work for me, I'll build you a house here.\""
msgstr "\"나를 위해 일하겠다면 여기에 집을 지어주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0044_Text_1
msgctxt "66039f9b-0c93-4f01-bebf-91a73ad0c752"
msgid "\"If you agree to work for me, I'll build you a workshop here.\""
msgstr "\"나를 위해 일하겠다면 여기에 공방을 지어주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "2c5630a5-51f3-4a0b-9af6-52206d299b7c"
msgid "\"I have no idea.\""
msgstr "\"몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0045_Text_1
msgctxt "861024d6-3a56-4570-98e3-4b44e107c5e7"
msgid "\"I have no idea.\""
msgstr "\"몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "66abdf12-8af7-42e6-b270-f6aba7ec15db"
msgid "\"Can you pay your share?\""
msgstr "\"대가로 뭘 줄 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0046_Text_1
msgctxt "3b0528a0-8494-49e8-941c-1383b56d2614"
msgid "\"Can you pay for it?\""
msgstr "\"대가로 뭘 줄 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "7c7b0d1a-a1c7-43e9-bfa6-8fe3e643cd2a"
msgid ""
"\"You wanted to know if there was a place you could settle in around here…\""
msgstr "\"저번에 이 주변에 정착할 수 있을지 물어봤었지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Answer_0049_Text_1
msgctxt "0d46572a-8780-4678-a445-f7564c7b6358"
msgid ""
"\"You wanted to know if there was a place you could settle in around here..."
"\""
msgstr "\"저번에 이 주변에 정착할 수 있을지 물어봤었지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ace01f0b-1940-4638-b294-3b80f499b941"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you is a tall, pale elf, the soft features of his face sharply "
"contrasting his angular figure. But his woeful gaze is fixed on the "
"ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 키가 크고 핼쑥한 요정이 있습니다. 순하게 생긴 얼굴과 각진 몸매가 뚜렷이 대조를 이루고 있지만, 우수에 찬 눈은 "
"땅바닥만 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "7ebb275c-b6f0-47e7-84dd-526925b10aa4"
msgid ""
"{n}He finally notices you and, startled, blinks at you absent-mindedly. He "
"talks slowly, slightly elongating his words as he speaks.{/n} \"Good day!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 이제서야 당신을 알아차리고 깜짝 놀라더니, 멍하니 눈을 깜빡입니다. 그러더니 천천히 늘어지듯 말을 꺼냈습니다.{/n} "
"\"안녕하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "40f24427-dd69-4fac-bec9-2d2d6acff175"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf shrugs.{/n} \"My parents named me Kimiel. But my friends decided "
"this name didn't suit me so well…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프가 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"부모님이 내 이름을 키미엘이라고 지어주었습니다. 하지만 친구들은 이 이름이 별로 안 "
"어울린다더라구요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0891026c-3b05-4a10-8a99-10b1841b2d71"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf blushes ever so slightly and lowers his gaze.{/n} \"I… I can't "
"tell you. It's a secret!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프의 얼굴이 붉어지고는 시선을 아래로 향합니다.{/n} \"말... 말할 수 없어요. 비밀입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "3d616b96-6191-427d-a947-f47aaffd6ac2"
msgid ""
"\"Although… if you promise…\" {n}The elf looks at you with hope in his "
"eyes.{/n} \"I'll tell you if you promise to help me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... 당신이 약속한다면...\" {n}엘프는 희망에 찬 눈빛으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"저를 돕겠다고 약속하면 말해줄게요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0010_Text_1
msgctxt "c0e2b8e0-f38c-48ec-9e75-523e961ea55c"
msgid ""
"\"Although... if you promise...\" {n}The elf looks at you with hope in his "
"eyes.{/n} \"If you promise to help me, then I will tell you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... 당신이 약속한다면...\" {n}엘프는 희망에 찬 눈빛으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"저를 돕겠다고 약속하면 말해줄게요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "b86d5d86-0f93-44fc-ad6d-38aa3f8dc769"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Kimo. Kimo Tavon.\" {n} With a wide smile, the elf slowly nods "
"at you.{/n}"
msgstr "\"제 이름은 키모. 키모 타본입니다.\" {n} 환하게 웃으며 엘프가 당신에게 느릿하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0013_Text_1
msgctxt "4561625d-31b4-4687-b12b-15cba4eba111"
msgid ""
"\"Kimo. Kimo Tavon.\" {n} With a wide smile, the elf slowly nods at you.{/n}"
msgstr "\"키모. 키모 타본이에요\" {n} 환하게 웃으며 엘프가 당신에게 느릿하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "ac55e02d-ec6d-4d36-a3c5-5005f00022fb"
msgid ""
"\"That… that's the secret!\" {n}After some hesitation, the elf decides to "
"add,{/n} \"But it's not hard. Not at all! You have my word.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건... 그건 비밀이에요!\" {n}엘프는 주저하다가 말합니다.{/n} \"별로 어려운 건 아닙니다. 전혀요! 믿어주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0015_Text_1
msgctxt "34018956-3437-4bb2-9ca1-2d28a839ee7d"
msgid ""
"\"That... that is a secret!\" {n}After some hesitation, the elf decides to "
"add,{/n} \"But it's not hard. Not at all! You have my word.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건... 그건 비밀이에요!\" {n}엘프는 주저하다가 말합니다.{/n} \"별로 어려운 건 아닙니다. 전혀요! 믿어주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "1ef5429e-1a0a-48e3-a893-b3a4572bb810"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf wrinkles his forehead in concentration.{/n} \"Well, if you insist…"
"\""
msgstr "{n}엘프가 생각에 잠겨 이마를 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"알았어요, 정 그렇다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0018_Text_1
msgctxt "4a56414f-4da0-44a4-8f2f-c027440a7f84"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf wrinkles his forehead in concentration.{/n} \"Well... if you "
"insist...\""
msgstr "{n}엘프가 생각에 잠겨 이마를 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"알았어요, 정 그렇다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "21e9bf06-2787-4606-a8fa-fb48a6421228"
msgid ""
"\"Nunuk the hunter told me that he saw an incredibly beautiful flower "
"growing in the swamp! I'd go and pick it myself, but I'm afraid I'd get "
"lost... And there are monsters there…\""
msgstr ""
"\"사냥꾼 누눅이 늪지에서 믿을 수 없이 아름다운 꽃이 자라는 걸 봤다고 했습니다! 거기 가서 꽃을 따고 싶지만 길을 잃을까봐 겁이 "
"나요... 괴물도 있고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0019_Text_String
msgctxt "cd1916ef-7e62-411a-8742-37f224239358"
msgid ""
"\"Nunuk the hunter told me that he saw an incredibly beautiful flower "
"growing in the swamp! I would go and pick it myself, but I fear I would "
"become lost. Also, there are monsters there...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사냥꾼 누눅이 늪지에서 믿을 수 없이 아름다운 꽃이 자라는 걸 봤다고 했습니다! 제가 직접 꽃을 따려고 했지만, 길을 잃을까봐 겁이 "
"나요... 괴물도 있고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "02581377-baa2-441c-a9d9-5be21c42de0c"
msgid ""
"\"Hm-m-m… In that case I… I'll give you my spear! I can make a lot of handy "
"things out of wood. You would call me a woodworker in your tongue.\" {n}The "
"elf gives you a disarming smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"흐-으-음... 그러면 제가... 창을 드릴게요! 저는 나무로 여러가지 유용한 걸 만들 줄 알아요. 당신들 말로 치면 저는 "
"목공예가라고 할 수 있죠.\" {n}엘프는 순수한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0021_Text_1
msgctxt "811b1105-4a1e-4b4d-99ed-d8ddddbd07bf"
msgid ""
"\"Hmmm... In that case I... I will give you my spear! I can make a lot of "
"handy things out of wood. You could call me a woodworker in your tongue.\" "
"{n}The elf gives you a disarming smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"흐-으-음... 그러면 제가... 창을 드릴게요! 저는 나무로 여러가지 유용한 걸 만들 줄 알아요. 당신들 말로 치면 저는 "
"목공예가라고 할 수 있죠.\" {n}엘프는 순수한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "a12a9603-0b8b-4e9d-88b6-107980fa39d9"
msgid "{n}The elf is shining.{/n} \"Wonderful! I shall await your return!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프가 반색합니다.{/n} \"훌륭해요! 돌아오길 기다리겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0023_Text_1
msgctxt "9f04e6e0-2867-48e9-944f-9b014ce07722"
msgid "{n}The elf is shining.{/n} \"Wonderful!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프의 얼굴이 빛납니다.{/n} \"훌륭해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "40292fc7-825e-4ef1-a8b0-d2a2bbc4290a"
msgid "\"I see…\" {n}The elf sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"알겠습니다...\" {n}엘프가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0024_Text_1
msgctxt "2bdce9b5-f094-4e7f-be04-8607a7428482"
msgid "\"I see...\" {n}The elf sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"알겠습니다...\" {n}엘프가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "c8559654-a5dd-4408-9cff-0f66aa96bd53"
msgid "\"So, what do you say? Will you help me?\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 어쩌실 거죠? 절 도와 주실겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0025_Text_1
msgctxt "19ba8257-3ef4-42f5-85a4-53476a876a07"
msgid "\"So? Will you help me?\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 절 도와 주실겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "4fc57db4-584e-49d8-8204-33e8bfb2c479"
msgid "{n}The elf just keeps smiling at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘프는 계속해서 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0030_Text_1
msgctxt "6cdb3a83-bf9f-4105-be64-8e9090c0bb5d"
msgid "{n}The elf just keeps smiling at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}엘프는 계속해서 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "a216ce50-b6cd-4997-bc93-3272fa20aae5"
msgid "{n}The elf blinks in surprise.{/n} \"Ohhhh. Of course!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프는 놀라움에 눈을 꿈뻑입니다.{/n} \"오오오. 물론이죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0031_Text_1
msgctxt "c5e2c86a-b4a4-49ee-92dd-153cd92708ca"
msgid "\"Oh, right.\""
msgstr "\"오, 알겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "f3cbf36e-ba64-4eb0-9492-b8f5e3847068"
msgid "\"Perfect! Come back as soon as you can!\""
msgstr "\"완벽해! 빨리 돌아오셔야 돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0036_Text_1
msgctxt "d794e94c-e9cd-4aa4-8e93-ef166b700c51"
msgid "\"Perfect! Come back as soon as you can!\""
msgstr "\"완벽해! 빨리 돌아오셔야 돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "34328db3-3c84-45f5-8b34-4f4e93dab490"
msgid ""
"\"Yes?\" {n}The elf is so impatient that he's tying his fingers in a "
"knot.{/n}"
msgstr "\"예?\" {n}엘프는 깍지를 끼고 눈이 빠지도록 기다리고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0037_Text_1
msgctxt "d73a9294-8475-447f-bf93-86044cc2e2d8"
msgid "\"Yes?\" {n}The elf looks straight at you, his eyes wide.{/n}"
msgstr "\"예?\" {n}엘프는 눈을 크게 뜨고 당신을 보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "20590dc9-2fe4-4ff6-86c7-163942ebef19"
msgid "\"How… how beautiful!\" {n}The elf reverently accepts the flower.{/n}"
msgstr "\"정말... 정말 아름다워!\" {n}엘프는 경견하게 꽃을 받아듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0038_Text_1
msgctxt "f67100d5-d1f2-4c70-b5fd-73830c6e62f0"
msgid ""
"\"It... it is beautiful.\" {n}The elf reverently accepts the flower from "
"your hands.{/n}"
msgstr "\"정말... 정말 아름다워!\" {n}엘프는 당신의 손에서 경견하게 꽃을 받아듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "29de8cc4-d145-4632-b7b9-ff827a566192"
msgid "\"Goodbye!\""
msgstr "\"잘가세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0040_Text_1
msgctxt "9cad722a-18c3-43b2-a501-221971385a71"
msgid "\"Bye!\""
msgstr "\"잘가요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "d9312c12-e881-4d94-9f5f-86042f09373f"
msgid ""
"\"I thank you. You've done me a great service. Please, accept this humble "
"gift! I made it myself. Of course, my skill is nothing compared to the "
"beauty of nature… but I think that my spear could still prove useful to you."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다. 정말 대단한 일을 해주셨어요. 별건 아니지만 부디 받아주세요! 제가 만든 물건입니다. 물론 제 솜씨가 자연의 아름다움에 "
"비할 정도는 아닙니다만... 그래도 제 창 정도면 당신 손에서 쓸모를 증명할 수 있을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0041_Text_1
msgctxt "d56a0f37-1282-4264-89c8-e2d1853f8e67"
msgid ""
"\"I thank you. You have helped me so much! Here, take my spear. My skill is "
"nothing compared to the beauty of nature... But who knows — perhaps, you "
"will find it useful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다. 정말 큰 도움을 주셨어요! 여기, 제 창을 받아주세요. 제 솜씨가 자연의 아름다움에 비할 바는 아니지만... 그래도 "
"쓸모가 없진 않을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "f1ccd0b6-8ac0-420a-9e76-4ac288814223"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, friend… is there a place here where I could settle in? There's "
"something I must do, and I do not wish to leave this place just yet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알려주세요, 친구... 제가 정착할 수 있는 곳이 있을까요? 꼭 해야 할 일이 있이서, 아직 이 곳을 떠나고 싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0042_Text_1
msgctxt "5d3a914b-8f08-45aa-b518-5d952ceb2b97"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, friend... is there a place here where I could settle in? I do not "
"wish to leave this place.\""
msgstr "\"알려주세요, 친구... 제가 정착할 수 있는 곳이 있을까요? 아직 이 곳을 떠나고 싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "6a48eced-a21a-4a6d-8959-8dae573370ce"
msgid ""
"\"Well, if only with my work… I work with wood. I can make spears, bows, "
"shields...\""
msgstr "\"그러니까, 뭘 하냐면... 저는 나무로 작업을 합니다. 창도 만들고, 활도 만들고, 방패도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0047_Text_1
msgctxt "45aff49c-b866-4662-95fe-0e798b18744d"
msgid ""
"\"Well, if only with my work... I work with wood. I make spears, bows, and "
"shields.\""
msgstr "\"그러니까, 뭘 하냐면... 저는 나무로 작업을 합니다. 창, 활, 방패 같은 걸 만들죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "520ab7f6-5727-4a1c-a55e-25576d0ad54a"
msgid ""
"\"You… you'd really do that for me? Oh, I'm in such luck! It's a deal, "
"friend!\""
msgstr "\"정말... 그래줄 수 있어요? 와! 이렇게 운이 좋을 데가! 약속한겁니다, 친구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0048_Text_1
msgctxt "7dd6c93d-47e5-4f4e-a32c-2d7c2bd793c3"
msgid ""
"\"You... you would really do that for me?\" {n}The elf's mouth opens in "
"amazement.{/n}"
msgstr "\"정말... 그래줄 수 있어요?\" {n}엘프는 놀라서 입을 벌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "07d68440-c60a-4c84-ae7c-1a88713276b7"
msgid "\"And?\" {n}The elf peers at you with wide-open eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그리고?\" {n}엘프는 휘둥그레 뜬 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0050_Text_1
msgctxt "8ae10eca-3efd-4d42-8c97-345d30e23e7e"
msgid "\"Yes?\""
msgstr "\"네?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "2c2455b9-9a4f-48d8-a354-4bbc1d7b1300"
msgid "\"I see…\""
msgstr "\"알았어요…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0051_Text_1
msgctxt "3085809b-39a1-4c5d-8446-d929dab440eb"
msgid "\"I see...\""
msgstr "\"알았어요…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "733f8065-6523-4f19-8c99-77a31bd10393"
msgid "{n}The elf gives you a pensive look.{/n} \"Good day!\""
msgstr "{n}엘프가 수심에 찬 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"안녕하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/FirstDialogue/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "28774985-a86b-49d8-b39f-7d4ab148f3b2"
msgid ""
"\"Well, if you're offering this to me… than I gladly accept! It's a deal.\""
msgstr "\"그러면, 그 제안을... 기꺼이 받아들이겠습니다! 계약 성립이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Items/SwampFlower_Description_String
msgctxt "43183aec-7231-41f8-9889-8f0f645a7d60"
msgid "A delicate flower with a faint sweet smell."
msgstr "은은하게 달콤한 향기가 나는 한떨기 꽃입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/Items/SwampFlower_Name_String
msgctxt "89a95263-099a-4038-9d05-b6ee46022949"
msgid "Rare Bog Flower"
msgstr "희귀한 늪지 꽃"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_EE_StatGift_Kimo/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "467a1948-1b52-4070-9574-aad16cff2339"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! As you "
"know, I was born in Kyonin, the most wonderful land that has ever existed. "
"And yet I must say – living in your country is a pleasure for me. The people "
"here seem to be content. They trust you, and trust me as your court "
"craftsman. It's important to know who one's patron is, and how {mf|he|she} "
"treats {mf|his|her} subjects.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 이미 아시다시피 저는 쿄닌에서 태어났습니다. 세상에서 가장 아름다운 땅입죠. 하지만 "
"영주님의 나라에서 사는 것도 이에 못지 않게 괜찮더군요. 이곳 백성들의 표정은 만족스러워 보입니다. 영주님을 믿고 있는 것이죠. 당연히 "
"영주님의 전속 장인인 저 또한 많은 신뢰를 받고 있습니다. 후원자가 누구이고 어떤 사람인지 아는 것은 중요하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_EE_StatGift_Kimo/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "160c0027-836a-45ff-af3b-603981ee4fd1"
msgid ""
"\"Good day to you, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}! "
"And the day is truly good. I saw so many happy people and skillful "
"entertainers on my way here. The {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} is "
"changing before our very eyes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 참 좋은 날입니다. 여기로 오면서 행복한 사람들과 능숙한 예능인들을 많이 봤지요. "
"{mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}의 변화가 눈에 띄는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_EE_StatGift_Kimo/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "219a795c-7d2a-4b38-b484-a1d9b06fa3a8"
msgid ""
"\"It's a fine thing, to share in the joy and amusement. Look! This is my "
"gift to you, {mf|baron|baroness|King|Queen}!\""
msgstr "\"기쁨과 즐거움을 나누는 것은 좋은 일이죠. 보십시오! 이것이 저의 선물입니다, 영주님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "9ff82675-d87f-4785-a41f-623d21a1a8d2"
msgid "\"Thank you. You can continue your work.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 네 일을 계속해도 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "236148ce-f632-41db-8c00-926dd9b7f8d5"
msgid "\"Thank you, Kimo. Could you make something specific for me?\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 키모. 나를 위해 무언가 만들어 줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "00ea405a-adb2-42d9-9dd7-7da165797cb3"
msgid "\"I don't require your services any longer. You may leave now.\""
msgstr "\"네 도움은 이제 필요 없어. 이제 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0005_Text_1
msgctxt "37f1d403-249d-4ef9-8907-30b98d8b7eed"
msgid "\"I do not require your services anymore. You can leave now.\""
msgstr "\"네 도움은 이제 필요 없어. 이제 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e9ae0274-6461-4c58-8c78-f062550ec761"
msgid "\"A fighting staff.\""
msgstr "\"전투용 지팡이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0012_Text_1
msgctxt "44b8f7a7-6d08-44bc-9a41-899d2409c855"
msgid "\"A fighting staff.\""
msgstr "\"전투용 지팡이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/KingdomDevelopment/Artisans/ElvenMaleWoodmasterCG/KTC_Gift/Answer_0012_Text_2
msgctxt "181c1e83-c95f-4ad7-af46-cf81bead2865"
msgid "\"A fighting staff.\""
msgstr "\"전투용 지팡이.\""

